\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is beautifully situated near the centre of the largest  village on the island, 400m from the sea, with interesting views above the  roofs to the sea&nbsp;and to the mainland.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is on the top floor of 4 floors  of a modern ''purpose built'' block and it consists of 2 bedrooms, one  bathroom, a large open plan living area with&nbsp;kitchen, dining area and lounge  leading to large windows and a balcony with great views.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The total floor  area is 42m sq.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is ready for immediate dwelling, and has sat TV and  aircon/heating.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There is a designated parking place.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The center of the  village has many shops, coffee shops and bars, bank and clinic, as well as  the ferry terminal so there is good access to the&nbsp;mainland, and  Split.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact our office for more information and to arrange to  visit the property.</p>', '', '776_Apartment_0.jpg', '776_Apartment_1.jpg', '776_Apartment_2.jpg', '776_Apartment_3.jpg', '776_Apartment_4.jpg', '776_Apartment_5.jpg', '776_Apartment_6.jpg', '', ''),
(777, 'Boris', 'Tomiæ', '', '', '', 'Brac', 'Supetar', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '400', '0', '50', 1, '83000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 2, 1, 'July 18, 2014', '<p>Apartman s pogledom na more, smje&scaron;ten na prvom katu vi&scaron;estambene zgrade. Apartman je povr&scaron;ine 50 m2, a sastoji se od dnevnog boravka s pridru¾enom loggiom, blagovaonice, kuhinje, kupaonice, 2 spavaæe sobe + parking mjesto. Apartman je sjeveroistoène orijentacije. Kvalitetno graðeno, solidno opremljen, ukusno namje&scaron;ten i u funkciji.</p>', '<p>We are pleased to offer this attractive and comfortable apartment in Supetar on Brac island. It is beautifully situated near the center of the largest village on the island, with interesting views above the roofs to the sea and to the&nbsp;mainland. The total floor area is 50 m2. It is on the first floor of a modern ''purpose built'' block.</p>', '', '<p>Apartman s pogledom na more, smje&scaron;ten na prvom katu vi&scaron;estambene zgrade.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartman je povr&scaron;ine 50 m2, a sastoji se od dnevnog boravka s pridru¾enom loggiom, blagovaonice, kuhinje, kupaonice, 2 spavaæe sobe + parking mjesto.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Zgrada je smje&scaron;tena iznad samog centra mjesta, svega deset minuta hoda od centra, gdje su svi potrebni sadr¾aji - restorani, barovi, tr¾nica, banka, po&scaron;tanski ured, ambulanta, trajektna luka.&nbsp;Spektakularan pogled na more i mjesto.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartman je sjeveroistoène orijentacije.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sva infrastruktura. Antenski sustav za prijem TV signala. Klimatiziran be&scaron;umnim klima ureðajem s moguæno&scaron;æu grijanja zimi, PVC fasadna stolarija, podovi keramika.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kvalitetno graðeno, solidno opremljen, ukusno namje&scaron;ten i u funkciji.</p>', '<p>We are pleased to offer this attractive and comfortable apartment in Supetar  on Brac island.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is beautifully situated near the center of the largest  village on the island, with interesting views above the roofs to the sea and  to the&nbsp;mainland.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is on the first floor of a modern ''purpose built''  block and it consists of 2 bedrooms, one bathroom, a large open plan living  area with kitchen,&nbsp;dining area and lounge leading to large windows and a  balcony with great views.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is ready for immediate dwelling, and has sat  TV and aircon/heating.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There is a designated parking place.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The center of  the village has many shops, coffee shops and bars, bank and clinic, as well  as the ferry terminal so there is good access to the&nbsp;mainland, and  Split.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact our office for more information and to arrange to  visit the property.</p>', '', '777_Apartment_0.jpg', '777_Apartment_1.jpg', '777_Apartment_2.jpg', '777_Apartment_3.jpg', '777_Apartment_4.jpg', '777_Apartment_5.jpg', '777_Apartment_6.jpg', '', ''),
(778, 'Boris', 'Tomiæ', '', '', '', 'Brac', 'Supetar', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '300', '0', '49', 2, '89000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 2, 1, 'July 18, 2014', '<p>Apartman s pogledom na more, smje&scaron;ten na drugom katu vi&scaron;estambene zgrade. Apartman je povr&scaron;ine 49 m2, a sastoji se od dnevnog boravka s pridru¾enom loggiom, blagovaonice, kuhinje, kupaonice, 2 spavaæe sobe + parking mjesto. Apartman je sjeverozapadne orijentacije. Kvalitetno graðeno, solidno opremljen, ukusno namje&scaron;ten i u funkciji.</p>', '<p>We are pleased to offer this comfortable holiday apartment in the village of Supetar on Brac island. It is a 2 bedroom apartment, situated on the 4th floor of a modern, purpose built block in the heart of the village, 300m from the sea, 300m from the&nbsp;countryside, and about the same from the main ferry terminal with easy access to the mainland. The total floor area is 49m sq.</p>', '', '<p>Apartman s pogledom na more, smje&scaron;ten na drugom katu vi&scaron;estambene zgrade.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartman je povr&scaron;ine 49 m2, a sastoji se od dnevnog boravka s pridru¾enom loggiom, blagovaonice, kuhinje, kupaonice, 2 spavaæe sobe + parking mjesto.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Zgrada je smje&scaron;tena iznad samog centra mjesta, svega pet minuta hoda od centra, gdje su svi potrebni sadr¾aji - restorani, barovi, tr¾nica, banka, po&scaron;tanski ured, ambulanta, trajektna luka.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartman je sjeverozapadne orijentacije. Odlièan pristup.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sva infrastruktura. Antenski sustav za prijem TV signala. Klimatiziran be&scaron;umnim klima ureðajem s moguæno&scaron;æu grijanja zimi, PVC fasadna stolarija, podovi keramika.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kvalitetno graðeno, solidno opremljen, ukusno namje&scaron;ten i u funkciji.</p>', '<p>We are pleased to offer this comfortable holiday apartment in the village of  Supetar on Brac island.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is a 2 bedroom apartment, situated on the 4th  floor of a modern, purpose built block in the heart of the village, 300m  from the sea, 300m from the&nbsp;countryside, and about the same from the main  ferry terminal with easy access to the mainland.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The total floor area is  49m sq.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It has a modern layout internally, with an open plan kitchen, lounge  and dining area, leading onto a substantial balcony with superb and  interesting&nbsp;views across the town and the sea. It has 2 bedrooms, both of a  good size, and 2 bathrooms.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The internal decorations are of a good  standard and the property is suitable for moving straight in.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The  property has designated parking and is on a quiet road.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Within a short  walk are many small shops, bars and restaurants catering for tourists and  the local population throughout the whole year.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact our office  to arrange a viewing of this property.</p>', '', '778_Apartment_0.jpg', '778_Apartment_1.jpg', '778_Apartment_2.jpg', '778_Apartment_3.jpg', '778_Apartment_4.jpg', '778_Apartment_5.jpg', '778_Apartment_6.jpg', '', ''),
(779, 'Martina', 'Nikoliæ', '', '098336559', 'martina.nikolic84@gmail.com', 'Trogir', 'Planikovica, 1504/1  k.è.', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '10', '0', '0', 1, '138000', '', 2, 1, 2, 1, 1, 2, 2, 2, 'July 18, 2014', '<p>Apartmani u novogradnji u 1.redu do mora, u prekrasnoj uvali na sjevernoj strani otoka Èiova. Na prodaji je ukupno 5 apartmana iz kojih se pru¾a prekrasan pogled na more. Svi apartmani su potpuno namje&scaron;teni i klimatizirani, te su trenutno u funkciji turistièkog iznajmljivanja. <span style="text-decoration: underline;">Povr&scaron;ina apartmana od 46 - 70 m2, a cijene od 138.000 - 280.000 Eura!</span></p>', '<p>We are pleased to be the agent to sell these last 5 amazing waterside apartments near Okrug, on Ciovo island. They are situated a few meters from the water&rsquo;s edge at the end of the most popular beach on the island and one of the most popular beaches along the whole coast. <span style="text-decoration: underline;">Apartments are measuring 46 - 70 m sq. Price from 138.000 - 280.000 Euro!</span></p>', '', '<p>Apartmani u novogradnji u 1.redu do mora, u prekrasnoj uvali na sjevernoj strani otoka Èiova.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na prodaji je ukupno 5 apartmana iz kojih se pru¾a prekrasan pogled na more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Svi apartmani su potpuno namje&scaron;teni i klimatizirani, te su trenutno u funkciji turistièkog iznajmljivanja. Apartmani su takoðer idealni i za vlastiti boravak.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ispred zgrade se nalazi 1 parking mjesto za svaki apartman koje je ukljuèeno u cijenu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>S obzirom da je na Èiovu ogranièena ponuda apartmana u 1.redu do mora ovo je izuzetna prilika za ulaganje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>APARTMAN S4</strong>: <strong>PRIZEMLJE, 46 M2 &ndash; 138.000 Eura</strong></p>\r\n<p><strong>&nbsp;</strong>Sastoji se od dnevnog boravka + blagovaonice + kuhinje, 1 kupaonice, 1 spavaæe sobe i terase.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>APARTMAN S8: 1. KAT, 60 M2 &ndash; 180.000 Eura</strong></p>\r\n<p><strong>&nbsp;</strong>Sastoji se od dnevnog boravka + blagovaonice + kuhinje, 2 kupaonice, 2 spavaæe sobe i terase.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>APARTMAN S11: 2. KAT, 70 M2 &ndash; 280.000 Eura</strong></p>\r\n<p>Sastoji se od dnevnog boravka + blagovaonice + kuhinje, 2 kupaonice, 2 spavaæe sobe i terase.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>APARTMAN S12: 2. KAT, 60 M2 &ndash; 180.000 Eura</strong></p>\r\n<p><strong>&nbsp;</strong>Sastoji se od dnevnog boravka + blagovaonice + kuhinje, 2 kupaonice, 2 spavaæe sobe i terase.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>APARTMAN S16: 3.KAT, 60 M2 &ndash; 180.000 Eura</strong></p>\r\n<p><strong>&nbsp;</strong>Sastoji se od dnevnog boravka + blagovaonice + kuhinje, 2 kupaonice, 2 spavaæe sobe, galerije i terase.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Centar mjesta sa svim sar¾ajima udaljen je 3 min. vo¾nje, dok je meðunarodni aerodrom udaljen 15 min. vo¾nje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za sve dodatne informacije stojimo vam na raspolaganju.</p>', '<p>We are pleased to be the agent to sell these last 5 amazing waterside apartments  near Okrug, on Ciovo island.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ciovo island is connected to the mainland by  a bridge and is just 10 minutes from the airport in Split.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>They are situated  a few meters from the water&rsquo;s edge at the end of the most popular beach on the  island and one of the most popular beaches along the whole coast.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is a  modern purpose built block, built to the highest standards, with stylish and  modern fittings, attractive and practical wooden floors, and practical  decorating schemes.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>All of them have air-con systems throughout, modern  kitchens and open plan living areas, leading onto large balcony&rsquo;s with great  views.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>They are currently&nbsp; rented to tourists throughout the season, and are  some of the&nbsp; most &lsquo;in demand&rsquo; properties around, due to the superb location and  superior fittings.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>APARTMENT S4: Ground floor, 46 m2 - 138,000 Euro</strong></p>\r\n<p>It  consists of a living room + dining room and kitchen, one bathroom, one bedroom  and a terrace.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>APARTMENT S8: 1st floor, 60 m2 - 180.000 Euro</strong></p>\r\n<p><strong>&nbsp;</strong>It consists  of a living room + dining room and kitchen, two bathrooms, two bedrooms and a  terrace.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>APARTMENT S11: 2nd floor, 70 m2 - 280,000 Euro</strong></p>\r\n<p><strong>&nbsp;</strong>It consists of a living room + dining room and kitchen, two bathrooms, two bedrooms and a terrace.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>APARTMENT S12: 2nd floor, 60 m2 - 180.000 Euro</strong></p>\r\n<p>It consists of a  living room + dining room and kitchen, two bathrooms, two bedrooms and a  terrace.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>APARTMENT S16: 3rd floor, 60 m2 - 180.000 Euro</strong></p>\r\n<p>It consists of a  living room + dining room and kitchen, two bathrooms, two bedrooms, galleries  and terraces.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The village shops are a short walk away from here, but  there are beach bars and coffee bars even closer.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Each property has its own  parking space.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact the office to arrange to visit these  apartments.</p>', '', '779_Apartment_0.jpg', '779_Apartment_1.jpg', '779_Apartment_2.jpg', '779_Apartment_3.jpg', '779_Apartment_4.jpg', '779_Apartment_5.jpg', '779_Apartment_6.jpg', '779_Apartment_7.jpg', '779_Apartment_8.jpg'),
(780, 'Armando', 'Plexus Nekretnine', '', '', '', 'Sibenik', 'Prviæ', 'For sale', 'Old stone house', '5', '0', '75', 1, '200000', '', 2, 2, 2, 1, 1, 2, 2, 1, 'July 18, 2014', '<p>U potpunosti renovirana stara kamena kuæa na otoku Prviæ, u prvom redu do mora i s prekrasnim pogledom na more! Kuæa ima ukupnu povr&scaron;inu 75 m2 podijeljenih na 3 eta¾e (3x25) s terasom i malom spremom sa sjeverne strane kuæe. Krajem 2010. godine kuæa je u potpunosti renovirana na naèin da se "ogolila" do samih zidova i praktièki nanovo napravila. Kuæa je redovito odr¾avana te ne zahtijeva apsolutno nikakvo ulaganje.</p>', '<p>We are offering this completely renovated seafront old stone house on the island of Prvic! Living space of 75m2 is divided into 3 floors (3x25m2) plus the terrace and little pantry on the north side of the house. In the end of 2010. the house was completely renovated, the walls were practically stripped down and built from scratch. No investment is required, because the house was maintained properly.</p>', '', '<p>U potpunosti renovirana stara kamena kuæa na otoku Prviæ, u prvom redu do mora i s prekrasnim pogledom na more!</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa ima ukupnu povr&scaron;inu 75 m2 podijeljenih na 3 eta¾e (3x25) s terasom i malom spremom sa sjeverne strane kuæe.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U prizemlju se nalazi konoba, te odvojena manja ostava. Kako se vanjskim stepenicama penjemo na kat dolazimo do verande i glavnog ulaza u kuæu. Cijela kuæa je potpuno opremljena (kuhinja, perilica suða, inverterska klima).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Krajem 2010. godine kuæa je u potpunosti renovirana na naèin da se "ogolila" do samih zidova i praktièki nanovo napravila.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Iako je prvi red do mora, nema nikakvih problema s vlagom i sliènim stvarima jer je prilikom samog nalijevanja betonskih ploèa i renoviranja zidova te mijenjanja vanjskih kamenih fuga, ulo¾ena golema kolièina kvalitetnog tekuæeg hidroizolatora.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je redovito odr¾avana te ne zahtijeva apsolutno nikakvo ulaganje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Pogodna je za ¾ivot, vikend kuæu ili pak za iznajmljivanje kao kuæa za odmor (ista je i klasificirana kao kuæa za odmor s 3 zvjezdice).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa ima svoje brojilo za struju i vodu.</p>', '<p>We are offering this completely renovated seafront old stone house on the island of Prvic!</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Living space of 75m2 is divided into 3 floors (3x25m2) plus the terrace and little pantry on the north side of the house.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ground floor features a tavern. We climb with outer steps and reach the first floor, the porch and the main entrance are here.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The whole house is completely equipped (kitchen, dishwasher, inverter air conditioner).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>In the end of 2010. the house was completely renovated, the walls were practically stripped down and built from scratch.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Although it is a first row by the sea, there is no problem with moisture or anything similar due to high quality materials used in building of the house.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>No investment is required, because the house was maintained properly.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is suitable for living or renting (there is a 3 star categorization licence).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house has its own water and electricity counter.</p>', '', '780_Old-stone-house_0.jpg', '780_Old-stone-house_1.jpg', '780_Old-stone-house_2.jpg', '780_Old-stone-house_3.jpg', '780_Old-stone-house_4.jpg', '780_Old-stone-house_5.jpg', '780_Old-stone-house_6.jpg', '780_Old-stone-house_7.jpg', '780_Old-stone-house_8.jpg'),
(1131, 'Mili', 'Pavièiæ', '', '', '', 'Hvar', 'Uvala Mudri Dolac - Basina', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '30', '360', '117', 1, '210000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 3, 1, 'April 16, 2015', '<p>Samostojeæa kuæa drugi red do mora, smje&scaron;tena u lijepoj uvali, samo 30 m od mora, na sjevernoj strani otoka Hvara.&nbsp;Ova prizemnica smje&scaron;tena je u mirnoj lokaciji, te je okru¾ena &scaron;umom.&nbsp;Ima bruto povr&scaron;inu 117 m2, dok samo zemlji&scaron;te ima 360 m2. Postoji moguænost dogradnje jo&scaron; dvije eta¾e za &scaron;to je potrebno ishoditi graðevinsku dozvolu.</p>', '<p>We are offering this detached house in the second row to the sea, in a beautiful bay, only 30 m from the sea, on the north side of Hvar island. This house is situated in a quiet location, with very few other houses in the area, and is surrounded by woods. It has a gross living area of 117 m2, while the land itself is 360 m2. The property has the potential to be improved as two more floors can be added and still meet the standards laid down to obtain a building permit.</p>', '', '<p>Samostojeæa kuæa drugi red do mora, smje&scaron;tena u lijepoj uvali, samo 30 m od mora, na sjevernoj strani otoka Hvara.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ova prizemnica smje&scaron;tena je u mirnoj lokaciji, te je okru¾ena &scaron;umom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ima bruto povr&scaron;inu 117 m2, dok samo zemlji&scaron;te ima 360 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sastoji se od dva jednosobna apartmana (oba u funkciji turistièkog najma), velike terase, parkinga i dvije manje ostave u suterenu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ima pristup vozilom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Postoji moguænost dogradnje jo&scaron; dvije eta¾e za &scaron;to je potrebno ishoditi graðevinsku dozvolu.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Uvala je smje&scaron;tena izmeðu Starog Grad i Jelse, na sjevernoj strani otoka, u blizini Vrboske.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Vrboska je povezana sa Starim Gradom autobusnom linijom, dok je Stari Grad povezan svakodnevnom trajektnom linijom sa Splitom.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>We are offering this detached house in the second row to the sea, in a beautiful bay, only 30 m from the sea, on the north side of Hvar island.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>This house is situated in a quiet location, with very few other houses in the area, and is surrounded by woods.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It has a gross living area of 117 m2, while the land itself is 360 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It consists of two x one-bedroom apartments (both in function of tourist lease), a large terrace, parking for each flat and two small storage rooms in the basement.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There is vehicle access.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property has the potential to be improved as two more floors can be added and still meet the standards laid down to obtain a building permit.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The bay is located between the Hvar Old Town and Jelsa, on the north side of the island, near Vrboska.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Vrboska is connected with Old Town by bus, while the Old Town by daily ferry lines to Split.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The new sea plane from Split lands in Jelsa harbour and this exciting trip last only a few minutes.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact our office for more details and to arrange to visit this property.</p>', '', '1131_House-Villa_0.JPG', '1131_House-Villa_1.JPG', '1131_House-Villa_2.JPG', '1131_House-Villa_3.JPG', '1131_House-Villa_4.JPG', '1131_House-Villa_5.JPG', '1131_House-Villa_6.JPG', '1131_House-Villa_7.JPG', '1131_House-Villa_8.jpg'),
(781, 'Boris', 'Tomiæ', '', '', '', 'Brac', 'Splitska', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '300', '440', '200', 2, '460000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 4, 4, 'July 22, 2014', '<p>Ova nekretnina je smje&scaron;tena iznad samog centra mjesta, sa preksrasnim pogledom na more. Glavni objekt ima 160 m2 ukupne povr&scaron;ine. Uz glavnu kuæu nalaze se jo&scaron; dva apartmanska objekta (bungalova) svaki povr&scaron;ine 20 m2. Sve je kompletno opremljeno i u funkciji, te klimatizirano.</p>', '<p>We are very pleased to offer this modern and well located large family&nbsp;villa on Brac island. The property is situated about 300m from the sea, and is elevated by the&nbsp;natural geography of the coast to give long and interesting views over the village and sea, towards the mainland. The building is a 4 bedroom villa, and it has 4 bathrooms.</p>', '', '<p>Ova nekretnina je smje&scaron;tena iznad samog centra mjesta, sa preksrasnim pogledom na more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Glavni objekt ima 160 m2 ukupne povr&scaron;ine.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sastoji se od 2 spavaæe sobe, 2 kupatila, veliki dnevni boravak s kaminom, kuhinjom, blagovaonicom otvorenog tipa s 2 izlaza na terase i vrt, 2 verande, 3 balkona.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Velika kuæa je dakle graðena s dnevnim dijelom otvorenog tipa, &scaron;irokim stepeni&scaron;tem i sa puno prirodnog osvjetljenja.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Uz glavnu kuæu nalaze se jo&scaron; dva apartmanska objekta (bungalova) svaki povr&scaron;ine 20 m2. Svaki bungalov se sastoji od 1 spavaæe soba, kupatila i prostrane terase.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sve je kompletno opremljeno i u funkciji, te klimatizirano.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Dvori&scaron;te je u nekoliko nivoa, &scaron;to omoguæava da svatko ima svoj kutak.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Vrt je kultiviran mediteranskim raslinjem.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Parking za dva vozila.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kompletna infrastruktura je prisutna.</p>', '<p>We are very pleased to offer this modern and well located property on Brac island.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is situated above the centre of the attractive village of  Splitska, an unspoilt traditional Dalmatian fishing village only a few minute''s  drive from Supetar (the island''s main ferry terminal). The village has shops,  a few bars and coffee shops as well as several restaurants.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property  is situated about 300m from the sea, and is elevated by the natural geography of  the coast to give long and interesting views over the village and sea, towards  the mainland.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property has a main building of 160m sq living area,  with wide staircase and plenty of daylight.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is consist of 2 large  bedrooms, 2 bathrooms, an ''open plan'' designed lounge with fireplace, a kitchen  and open dining area, leading to large windows and access to the terrace and  garden area. From here there are excellent views.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>In the grounds of the  property are additional 2 smaller bungalows. Each bungalow is 20m sq with a  bedroom, bathroom and large terrace.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The whole property is well decorated  /air-con included/ and furnished and is ready for immediate occupation.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The garden is on few levels, has many Mediterranean plants and is well  maintained, and the peacefulness of the area makes adds to the  attractiveness.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Parking for two cars.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact our office to  arrange to view this property.</p>', '', '781_House-Villa_0.jpg', '781_House-Villa_1.jpg', '781_House-Villa_2.jpg', '781_House-Villa_3.jpg', '781_House-Villa_4.jpg', '781_House-Villa_5.jpg', '781_House-Villa_6.jpg', '781_House-Villa_7.jpg', '781_House-Villa_8.jpg');
INSERT INTO `nekretnina` (`id`, `ime`, `prezime`, `telefon`, `mobitel`, `e_mail`, `lokacija_id`, `adresa`, `status_id`, `vrsta_id`, `udaljenost`, `povrsina`, `stambenapovrsina`, `display`, `cijena`, `cijenatocka`, `ponuda_tjedna`, `new_built`, `must_sell`, `prvi_red_do_mora`, `pogled_na_more`, `bazen`, `broj_soba`, `broj_kupatila`, `datum`, `title_hr`, `title_en`, `title_ge`, `opis_hr`, `opis_en`, `opis_ge`, `PropertyImageURL0`, `PropertyImageURL1`, `PropertyImageURL2`, `PropertyImageURL3`, `PropertyImageURL4`, `PropertyImageURL5`, `PropertyImageURL6`, `PropertyImageURL7`, `PropertyImageURL8`) VALUES
(783, 'Jana Janosik', 'Martin Horvath', '00421 905 964 506', '00385 99 597 8467', 'info@vis-more.com', 'Vis', 'Vis, uvala ®enka &#8211; ju¾na strana, 3928/5 K.O. Vis', 'For sale', 'Land plot', '5', '628', '0', 1, '219000', '', 2, 2, 2, 1, 1, 2, 0, 0, 'July 26, 2014', '<p>Graðevinsko zemlji&scaron;te u prvom redu do mora u prekrasnoj i mirnoj uvali na ju¾noj strani otoka Visa. Zemlji&scaron;te se nalazi svega 5 metara od mora. Postoji veæ gotov projekt za gradnju moderne vile i investitori su veæ pokrenuli postupak ishoðenja graðevinske dozvole. Kompletna infrastruktura je prisutna.</p>', '<p>Fantastic sea front building plot on the island of Vis! The building plot is 628 m sqm and it''s located only 5 meters from the sea in a very quite place, nearby to a sandy beach. The plot is large enough to build a villa with a pool, and leave enough space for boat storage, parking and a garden.&nbsp;Asfalted car access and infrastructure.</p>', '', '<p>Graðevinsko zemlji&scaron;te u prvom redu do mora u prekrasnoj i mirnoj uvali na ju¾noj strani otoka Visa.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Zemlji&scaron;te se nalazi svega 5 metara od mora.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Urbanistièki plan dozvoljava gradnju vile maksimalne katnosti Po+P+2. Postoji veæ gotov projekt za gradnju moderne vile i investitori su veæ pokrenuli postupak ishoðenja graðevinske dozvole.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ukoliko se ¾elite dr¾ati ovog projekta, vila æe biti na 2 kata te bi trebala imati 3 spavaæe sobe, dnevni boravak s kuhinjom i blagovaonicom, 3 kupaonice, spremi&scaron;te, velike terase i bazen.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Postupak ishoðenja dozvole je u zavr&scaron;noj fazi te je moguæe kupiti zemlji&scaron;te s veæ ishoðenom dozvolom. Ali isto tako, ukoliko Vam se ne bi svidio dizajn projektirane kuæe, moguæe je predati novi zahtjev za kuæu po Va&scaron;im ¾eljama.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Takoðer, postoji èak i moguænost gradnje dvije odvojene kuæe na ovom zemlji&scaron;tu (jednu iza druge).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Zemlji&scaron;te ima &scaron;irinu od toèno 11 metara uz more. &Scaron;irina gornjeg dijela zemlji&scaron;ta (uz cestu) iznosi 14,6 m. Ukupna du¾ina zemlji&scaron;ta je cca 47 metara. U poziciji gdje je predviðena pozicija kuæe, parcela ima &scaron;irinu cca 13-14 metara.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kompletna infrastruktura je prisutna.</p>', '<p>Fantastic sea front building plot on the island of Vis!</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The building plot is 628 m sqm and it''s located only 5 meters from the sea in a very quite place, nearby to a sandy beach.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The plot is large enough to build a villa with a pool, and leave enough space for boat storage, parking and a garden.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Asfalted car access and infrastructure.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sellers have initiated the process of obtaining a building permit for a modern villa. The process is in the final stage so it is possible to purchase the land with the permit already issued.&nbsp;The villa will be on two floors and will have three bedrooms, a living room with kitchen and dining room, 3 bathrooms, storage room, large terraces and a pool.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Of course, if the buyer does not appreciate the design of the projected house, he is welcome to submit a new application for a house designed according to his preferences.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The land is exactly 11 meters wide on the sea side, while it is 14.6 m wide on the upper border (where the access road is). The total length of the land plot is approximately 47 meters.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The entire infrastructure is present.</p>', '', '783_Land-plot_0.jpg', '783_Land-plot_1.jpg', '783_Land-plot_2.jpg', '783_Land-plot_3.jpg', '783_Land-plot_4.jpg', '783_Land-plot_5.jpg', '783_Land-plot_6.jpg', '783_Land-plot_7.jpg', '783_Land-plot_8.jpg'),
(784, '', 'Irming', '', '', 'irming@irming.eu', 'Hvar', 'Sv.Nedelja', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '20', '830', '270', 1, '1200000', '', 2, 2, 2, 1, 1, 1, 9, 7, 'July 27, 2014', '<p>VILA SA BAZENOM OKRU®ENA BOROVOM &Scaron;UMOM U PRVOM REDU DO MORA SA OTVORENIM POGLEDOM NA MORE!! Vila je smje&scaron;tena na ju¾noj strani otoka Hvara, u jednoj od najljep&scaron;ih uvala na otoku, uz samo more, sa spektakularnim pogledom. Povr&scaron;ina zemlji&scaron;ta je 830m2, dok je ukupna stambena povr&scaron;ina vile 270 m2.</p>', '<p>Villa with swimming pool surrounded by pine woods on the very seaside with sweeping sea views! The villa is located on the South side of Hvar island, in one of the most beautiful bays, by the sea, with a spectacular view. Land plot area is 830sq m, while the total residential area of the villa is 270sq m. The villa is consist of three apartments, each with three bedrooms and two bathrooms.</p>', '', '<p>VILLA SA BAZENOM OKRU®ENA BOROVOM &Scaron;UMOM U PRVOM REDU DO MORA SA OTVORENIM  POGLEDOM NA MORE!!</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Vila je smje&scaron;tena na ju¾noj strani otoka Hvara, u jednoj od  najljep&scaron;ih uvala na otoku, uz samo more, sa spektakularnim pogledom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Povr&scaron;ina zemlji&scaron;ta je 830m2, dok je ukupna stambena povr&scaron;ina vile 270  m2, a sastoji se od tri trosobna apartmana. Svaki apartman ima dvije kupaonice.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Posjed je okru¾en borovom &scaron;umom, ima brojne terase, te dvori&scaron;te u hladovini borova.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Pla¾a su kamene i &scaron;ljunèane, te su od vile udaljene svega  20 metara.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Vila posjeduje svoj lukobran sa vezom za brod.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Gara¾a za 6  vozila ili brod.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ova nekretnina pru¾a jedinstveni do¾ivljaj Mediterana,  garantira mir i privatnost, okru¾ena harmonjiom kristalnog èistog mora,  zelenilom borove &scaron;ume i èistih prirodnih pla¾a jednog od najsunèanijih i  naljep&scaron;ih otoka na Jadranu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za dodatne informacije Croatia Property Sales - Hvar office vam stoji na usluzi.</p>', '<p><strong>Villa with swimming pool surrounded by pine woods on the very seaside with  sweeping sea views!</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The villa is located on the South side of Hvar  island, in one of the most beautiful bays, by the sea, with a spectacular  view.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Land plot area is 830sq m, while the total residential area of the  villa is 270sq m.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The villa is consist of three apartments, each with three  bedrooms and two bathrooms.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property is surrounded by pine trees, has  numerous terraces, and beautiful courtyard in the shade of pine  trees.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Natural stone and pebble beaches are only 20 meters distant.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>In  front of the villa is a pier with boat landing.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Garage is suitable for 6 cars  and can be used <span id="result_box" lang="en">for a dry  dock</span>.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>This property provides a unique experience of the  Mediterranean, guarantees peace and privacy, surrounded by the harmony of  crystal clear sea, lush pine forests and clean natural beaches on&nbsp; one of the  sunniest and most beautiful island on the Adriatic.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For more information, Croatia Property Sales - Hvar office team is at your service.</p>', '', '784_House-Villa_0.jpg', '784_House-Villa_1.jpg', '784_House-Villa_2.jpg', '784_House-Villa_3.jpg', '784_House-Villa_4.jpg', '784_House-Villa_5.jpg', '784_House-Villa_6.jpg', '784_House-Villa_7.jpg', '784_House-Villa_8.jpg'),
(786, 'Zeljko', 'Sancin', '', '', '', 'Hvar', 'Stari Grad, Boriæi', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '25', '130', '75', 1, '210000', '', 2, 2, 2, 1, 1, 2, 2, 1, 'July 27, 2014', '<p>Bungalow 1. red do mora, s vrtom i odliènim pogledom na more i zalazak sunca  u more.&nbsp;Kuæa se nalazi na mirnoj lokaciji, u blizini pla¾e, nedaleko od  centra mjesta.&nbsp;Èista romantika!<br /><br /></p>', '<p>Bungalow in the 1st line from the sea, with nice garden and excellent views  of the sea and sunset.&nbsp;Land plot area is 120sq m, while the total residential  area is 70sq m.&nbsp;The house is located on the North side of the island, in  a quiet <br />location, near the beach, not far from the town center.&nbsp;Pure  romance!</p>', '', '<p>Bungalow 1. red do mora, s vrtom i odliènim pogledom na more i zalazak&nbsp;sunca u more.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa se nalazi na mirnoj lokaciji, u blizini pla¾e, nedaleko od centra&nbsp;mjesta.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Èista romantika!</p>', '<p>Bungalow in the 1st line from the sea, with nice garden and excellent views  of the sea and sunset.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Land plot area is 120sq m, while the total residential  area is 70sq m.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house is located on the North side of the island, in  a quiet location, near the beach, not far from the town center.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Pure  romance!</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For more information please contact Croatia Property Sales HVAR  office.</p>', '', '786_House-Villa_0.jpg', '786_House-Villa_1.jpg', '786_House-Villa_2.jpg', '786_House-Villa_3.jpg', '786_House-Villa_4.jpg', '786_House-Villa_5.jpg', '', '', ''),
(785, 'Vlado', 'Vrankoviæ', '', '', '', 'Hvar', 'Pitve, Jelsa', 'For sale', 'Old stone house', '2000', '130', '80', 2, '120000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 2, 1, 'July 27, 2014', '<p>Kamena kuæa na otoku Hvaru, u pitoresknom selu, s otvorenim pogledom na more! Kuæa je smje&scaron;tena u malom pitoresknom selu koji je prepoznato kao povijesno kulturno nasljeðe otoka Hvara koje je od mora udaljeno 2 kilometra. Kuæa ima ukupnu stambenu povr&scaron;inu 80 m2, te okuænicu povr&scaron;ine 120 m2.</p>', '<p>Croatia Property Sales are offering this beautiful stone house located in one of the most romantic villages in the inland of the island of Hvar, with garden and amazing sea view! The house is located in a small picturesque village, which is recognized as a historical- cultural heritage of Hvar island.&nbsp;The village is 2 km distant from the sea shore. The house is measuring 80m sq, and it consists of a ground floor and first floor.</p>', '', '<p>Kamena kuæa na otoku Hvaru, u pitoresknom selu, s otvorenim pogledom na more!</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je smje&scaron;tena u malom pitoresknom selu koji je prepoznato kao povijesno kulturno nasljeðe otoka Hvara koje je od mora udaljeno 2 kilometra.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa se sastoji od prizemlja u kojem su kuhinja s  terasom i pogledom na more, te dnevnog boravka s kupaonicom i stubi&scaron;tem koje  vodi na prvi kat.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na katu su dvije spavaæe sobe i wc, te takoðer velika  terasa sa jo&scaron;&nbsp;boljim i otvorenijim pogledom na more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa ima ukupnu  stambenu povr&scaron;inu 80 m2, te okuænicu povr&scaron;ine 120 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ispred kuæe ima  dovoljno mjesta za izgradnju bazena.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Uz malu dodatnu investiciju mo¾e  postati lijepa kuæa za odmor i u¾ivanje na ovom svjetski poznatom  otoku!</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Najbli¾e veæe mjesto je Jelsa, dok je trajektna luka  udaljena 10 km. Od grada Hvara je udaljena 25 km.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za dodatne  informacije Croatia Property Sales - Hvar office vam stoji na  usluzi.</p>', '<p>Croatia Property Sales are offering this beautiful stone house located in  one of the most romantic villages in the inland of the island of Hvar, with  garden and amazing sea view!</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house is located in a small picturesque  village, which is recognized as a historical- cultural heritage of Hvar  island.&nbsp;The village is 2 km distant from the sea shore.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house is  measuring 80m sq, and it consists of a ground floor and first floor.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On  the ground floor there is a kitchen, terrace with a sea view, living room  with a bathroom, and a staircase leading to the first floor.&nbsp;On the first  floor there are two bedrooms and a bathroom, and another large terrace which  offers a sea view.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The garden is measuring 120m sq, and there is a  possibility of building a smaller size swimming pool.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>This is very  attractive and quiet location that offers peace, privacy and a beautiful sea  views.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The closest larger village Jelsa is 2 km distant, while the  ferry port is only 15 mins driving. Hvar town is 25 km distant.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The closest international airport is Split airport.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For more  information, Croatia Property Sales - Hvar office team is at your service.</p>', '', '785_Old-stone-house_0.jpg', '785_Old-stone-house_1.jpg', '785_Old-stone-house_2.jpg', '785_Old-stone-house_3.jpg', '785_Old-stone-house_4.jpg', '785_Old-stone-house_5.jpg', '785_Old-stone-house_6.jpg', '785_Old-stone-house_7.jpg', ''),
(787, 'Igor', '®unkoviæ', '', '', '', 'Hvar', 'Gromin Dolac, Zavala, Hvar', 'For sale', 'Old stone house', '400', '300', '100', 1, '100000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 0, 0, 'July 27, 2014', '<p>Stare kamene kuæe s prekrasnim pogledom na more na ju¾noj strani otoka Hvara.&nbsp;Ukupna povr&scaron;ina kuæica je 100 m2. Povr&scaron;ina zemlji&scaron;ta je 300  m2.&nbsp;Pristupni put je 50 metara od parcele. Struja je na  zemlji&scaron;tu.&nbsp;Selo nema vodu ali se oèekuje kroz 2015-tu godinu.</p>', '<p>Croatia Property Sales are offering this traditional old stone houses/RUINS on the South side of the island of Hvar, with amazing sea view! It''s a secluded location surrounded by a beautiful nature, 400 m from the sea and beautiful bays with pebble beaches. Land plot area is 300m sq, while total area of the existing houses is 100m sq. The houses are in a very bad condition and complete renovation is required.</p>', '', '<p>Stare kamene kuæe s prekrasnim pogledom na more na ju¾noj strani otoka&nbsp;Hvara.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ukupna povr&scaron;ina kuæica je 100 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Povr&scaron;ina zemlji&scaron;ta je 300 m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Pristupni put je 50 metara od parcele.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Struja je na zemlji&scaron;tu.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Selo nema vodu ali se oèekuje kroz 2015-tu godinu.</p>', '<p>Croatia Property Sales are offering this traditional old stone houses/RUINS  on the South side of the island of Hvar, with amazing sea view!</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It''s a  secluded location surrounded by a beautiful nature, 400 m from the sea and  beautiful bays with pebble beaches.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Land plot area is 300m sq, while  total area of the existing houses is 100m sq.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The houses are in a very  bad condition and complete renovation is required.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The access road is 50  meters away from the plot.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Electricity is on the land.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The village has no  water but is expected sometime next year.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For more information please  contact Croatia Property Sales HVAR office.</p>', '', '787_Old-stone-house_0.jpg', '787_Old-stone-house_1.jpg', '787_Old-stone-house_2.jpg', '787_Old-stone-house_3.jpg', '787_Old-stone-house_4.jpg', '', '', '', ''),
(788, 'Fred i Margaret', 'Schott', '', '', '', 'Hvar', 'Stari Grad - Ivanje Gomile', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '300', '400', '150', 1, '150000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 4, 2, 'July 27, 2014', '<p>Obiteljska kuæa u mjestu na sjevernoj strani otoka Hvara, okru¾ena vrtom sa starim stablima maslina, kaktusa, agava i drugog mediteranskog bilja. Povr&scaron;ina zemlji&scaron;ta je 400 m2, dok je ukupna stambena povr&scaron;ina kuæe 150 m2. Kuæa je svega 5 min &scaron;etnje udaljena od centra mjesta.</p>', '<p>Family house in a quite area of the small town on the North side of the Hvar island, with spacious garden with barbecue, surrounded by olive trees, agaves and other Mediterranean plants. The house is in a good condition, has a parking and it is very close to the sea, beaches and the old town centre. Land plot area is measuring 400m sq, and the total residential area of the house is 150m sq.</p>', '', '<p>Obiteljska kuæa u mjestu na sjevernoj strani otoka Hvara, okru¾ena vrtom sa  starim stablima maslina, kaktusa, agava i drugog mediteranskog  bilja.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Povr&scaron;ina zemlji&scaron;ta je 400 m2, dok je ukupna stambena povr&scaron;ina kuæe  150 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U prizemlju se nalazi kuhinja, dnevni boravak,kupaona i jedna soba  koja ima izlaz na terasu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Unutra&scaron;nje stepenicame vode na gornji kat gdje  se nalaze jo&scaron; tri spavaæe sobe /dvije sa balkonima/ , kupaonica, te mala  sprema.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa se nalazi na lijepom mjestu u obiteljskom dijelu ¾ivljenja, nedaleko od mora i prekrasnih pla¾a.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je svega 5 min &scaron;etnje udaljena  od centra mjesta.</p>', '<p>Family house in a quite area of the small town on the North side of the Hvar  island, with spacious garden with barbecue, surrounded by olive trees,  agaves and other Mediterranean plants.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house is in a good condition, has  a parking and it is very close to the sea, beaches and the old town  centre.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Land plot area is measuring 400m sq, and the total residential  area of the house is 150m sq.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ground floor is consist of kitchen, living  room, bathroom and one bedroom with access to the large terrace.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Internal  stairs leads to the first floor where there are three bedrooms / two with  balconies /, bathroom and a small pantry.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house is located in a quite  residential part of the village, not far from the sea and the beach.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The  house is only 5 min walking from the old town center.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For more  information please contact Croatia Property Sales HVAR office.</p>', '', '788_House-Villa_0.jpg', '788_House-Villa_1.jpg', '788_House-Villa_2.jpg', '788_House-Villa_3.jpg', '788_House-Villa_4.jpg', '788_House-Villa_5.jpg', '788_House-Villa_6.jpg', '', ''),
(789, 'Pavel', 'Pisaroviæ', '', '', '', 'Hvar', 'Ivan Dolac, 3226/19 K.O.Vrisnik', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '30', '504', '50', 2, '260000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 1, 4, 1, 'August 2, 2014', '<p>Moderna vikend kuæa sa pogledom na more, u blizini lijepih i èistih pla¾a,  na ju¾noj strani otoka Hvara.&nbsp;Povr&scaron;ina parcele je 504m2.&nbsp;Ukupna  stambena povr&scaron;ina kuæe je 50m2 + 30m2 natkrivene terase.&nbsp;Kuæa se nalazi u drugom redu od mora, udaljena svega 30  metara.&nbsp;Nalazi se u zelenilu borova i izgraðene je u modernom dizajnu.&nbsp;Ima pravo  nadogradnje za jo&scaron; jedan kat ili visoko potkrovlje.&nbsp;Moguæa izgradnja bazena  na parceli.</p>', '<p>We are offering this modern holiday villa overlooking the sea, in a great location on the South side of the island. It is situated on the second row of houses and 30m from the clear water in this beautiful bay. The size of the plot is a spacious 504m sq and the living area is 50m sq plus 30m of covered terrace. The property has plenty of opportunity for improvements, with options to build an extra floor for more bedrooms, or a swimming pool in the large garden.</p>', '', '<p>Moderna vikend kuæa sa pogledom na more, u blizini lijepih i èistih pla¾a,  na ju¾noj strani otoka Hvara.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Povr&scaron;ina parcele je 504 m2. Ukupna  stambena povr&scaron;ina kuæe je 50 m2 + 30 m2 natkrivene terase.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa se  sastoji od prizemlja u kojom je konoba u funkciji manje sobe, te velike  natkrivene terase, dijela za odmor i komina.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na katu su 3 spavaæe sobe,  kuhinja, dnevni boravak i kupatilo, te takoðer natkrivene i otkrivene  terase.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa se nalazi u drugom redu od mora, udaljena svega 30  metara.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nalazi se u zelenilu borova i izgraðena je u modernom  dizajnu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ima pravo nadogradnje za jo&scaron; jedan kat ili visoko  potkrovlje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Moguæa izgradnja bazena na parceli.</p>', '<p>We are offering this modern holiday villa overlooking the sea, in a great  location on the South side of the island.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is situated on the second  row of houses and 30m from the clear water in this beautiful bay, close to a  popular but uncrowded village where there are shops, bars and other  services.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Close to the rear of the property are pine woods and old olive  groves.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The size of the plot is a spacious 504m sq and the living area is  50m sq plus 30m of covered terrace.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house consists of a ground  floor which is currently set out as a private bar/function room, with a  large covered terrace, and barbeque.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Upstairs are three bedrooms, bathroom  kitchen, and living room leading onto a partially covered balcony with  superb views.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property is of a modern design with an open plan style, and  built with good quality materials. It is well decorated and habitable  straight away.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property has plenty of opportunity for  improvements, with options to build an extra floor for more bedrooms, or a  swimming pool in the large garden.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact our Hvar office to  arrange a viewing.</p>', '', '789_House-Villa_0.jpg', '789_House-Villa_1.jpg', '789_House-Villa_2.jpg', '789_House-Villa_3.jpg', '789_House-Villa_4.jpg', '789_House-Villa_5.jpg', '789_House-Villa_6.jpg', '789_House-Villa_7.jpg', ''),
(790, 'Daniel', 'Moller', '+46 513 22503', '+46 702 29 58 16', 'daniel.moller@stayhard.se', 'Rogoznica', 'Ljoljinica, Ra¾anj, 7873/17 K.O. Vini¹æe', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '5', '500', '230', 1, '995000', '', 2, 2, 2, 1, 1, 1, 4, 5, 'August 3, 2014', '<p>Zadovoljstvo nam je ponuditi Vam ovu luksuznu, nedavno renoviranu vilu s bazenom smje&scaron;tenu u prvom redu do mora. Vila je na Rogoznièkom podruèju, i samo 20 minuta vo¾nje od Trogira. Kuæa ima ukupno 230 m2, te se prostire na 3 eta¾e. Vila posjeduje podno grijanje. Bazen se takoðer mo¾e zagrijavati ili hladiti te se stoga mo¾e koristiti cijele godine. Èetiri spavaæe sobe (3 en suite), &scaron;to omoguæava istovremeni boravak nekoliko obitelji bez da jedni druge ometaju.</p>', '<p>We are pleased to offer this exquisite and newly renovated seafront villa with swimming pool. It''s located on the coastline north of Trogir, near Rogoznica which is only 20 mins driving from Trogir, and the airport. The house has total 230 square meters, on 3 floors. This property has been restored to an unusually high ''spec'' and&nbsp;enquiries to visit it should come through our office in Split.</p>', '', '<p>Zadovoljstvo nam je ponuditi Vam ovu luksuznu, nedavno renoviranu vilu s bazenom smje&scaron;tenu u prvom redu do mora.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Vila je na Rogoznièkom podruèju, i samo 20 minuta vo¾nje od Trogira.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Okuænica je povr&scaron;ine 500 m2, dok stambena povr&scaron;ina iznosi 230 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ova izuzetna vila ima mnoge izvrsne znaèajke. Potpuno klimatiziran, ovaj objekt je obnovljen 2014. godine, materijalima vrhunske klase.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa ima ukupno 230 èetvornih metara, te se prostire na 3 eta¾e. Vila posjeduje podno grijanje. Bazen se takoðer mo¾e zagrijavati ili hladiti te se stoga mo¾e koristiti cijele godine.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Vila ima i videonadzor (8 kamere), 5 kupaonica / wc, vinski podrum, potpuno opremljenu luksuznu kuhinju, CCTV, vanjski zvuènici, vanjski tu&scaron; / bazen s tu&scaron;em, svijetla na fasadi, velike aluminijske prozore, 3 parkirna mjesta, 2 balkona, 2 terase, umjetna trava, toplinske pumpe koje rade na principu solarnih panela i zraka za energetski uèinkovito grijanje i hlaðenje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Èetiri spavaæe sobe (3 en suite), &scaron;to omoguæava istovremeni boravak nekoliko obitelji bez da jedni druge ometaju.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Takoðer, ovakva vila omoguæava i veliku zaradu ukoliko bi se odluèili baviti iznajmljivanjem.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za eventualna pitanja, stojimo Vam na usluzi.</p>', '<p>We are pleased to offer this exquisite and newly renovated seafront villa  with swimming pool.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It''s located on the coastline north of Trogir, near  Rogoznica which is only 20 mins driving from Trogir, and the airport.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The  plot area is 500 m2 and the building area 230 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>This beautifully  designed villa has many outstanding features.&nbsp;Among other features it has air  conditioning throughout and was completely renovated with top quality and  tasteful materials in 2014.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house has total 230 square meters, on 3  floors.&nbsp;It has under floor heating and the swimming pool can be heated  allowing it to be used throughout the whole year.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>This is a first  line villa, just yards from the water''s edge and has elaborate cctv system  for enhanced security.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Inside the property it has 5 bathrooms, wine cellar,  fully equipped luxury kitchen, exterior speakers, outside shower / pool  shower, lavish facade lighting, wide and fabulous wide&nbsp;windows which lead  onto the terrace.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Four bedrooms (3 en suite), makes it easy for several  families to share the house at the same time without disturbing each  other.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Outside the building are 3 parking spaces, 2 balconies, 2 terraces, artificial turf, solar panels and air source heat pump for energy efficient heating and cooling.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>This property has been restored to an  unusually high ''spec'' and enquiries to visit it should come through our  office in Split.</p>', '', '790_House-Villa_0.jpg', '790_House-Villa_1.jpg', '790_House-Villa_2.jpg', '790_House-Villa_3.jpg', '790_House-Villa_4.jpg', '790_House-Villa_5.jpg', '790_House-Villa_6.jpg', '790_House-Villa_7.jpg', '790_House-Villa_8.jpg'),
(791, 'Lucy', 'Moloney', '+447768232070', 'Kljuè Dragica   0989253213', 'Lucy.Moloney@alcoa.com', 'Trogir', 'Ante Starèeviæa 27B, O. Gornji, 150/3 k.è.', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '230', '0', '38', 2, '55000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 1, 'August 4, 2014', '<p>Potpuno namje&scaron;teni apartman u prizemlju zgrade smje&scaron;tene na otoku Èiovu, u mirnom okru¾enju, trenutno u funkciji turistièkog iznajmljivanja. Ukupna stambena povr&scaron;ina apartmana iznosi 38,5 m2, a sastoji se od dnevnog boravka + blagovaonice + kuhinje, 1 spavaæe sobe, 1 kupaonice i terase.</p>', '<p>Croatia Property Sales are selling this one bedroom apartment on the ground floor on Ciovo island. The apartment is consist of an open plan lounge, dining room and kitchen, with one bathroom, one bedroom, and a good sized terrace. It is well decorated inside and has always been well maintained by the owner. There is 38.5m sq of living space.</p>', '', '<p>Potpuno namje&scaron;teni apartman u prizemlju zgrade smje&scaron;tene na otoku Èiovu, u mirnom okru¾enju, trenutno u funkciji turistièkog iznajmljivanja.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Udaljenost od mora i pla¾e je cca. 250 m, dok je centar mjesta gdje se nalaze svi sadr¾aji udaljen 3 minute vo¾nje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ukupna stambena povr&scaron;ina apartmana iznosi 38,5 m2, a sastoji se od dnevnog boravka + blagovaonice + kuhinje, 1 spavaæe sobe, 1 kupaonice i terase.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartman je kao i za turistièko iznajmljivanje idealan i za vlastiti boravak i u¾ivanje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U cijenu je ukljuèeno i 1 parking mjesto koje se nalazi ispred zgrade.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Zgrada je izgraðena 2007. godine.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Grad Trogir udaljen je 10 min., dok je meðunarodni aerodrom udaljen 15 min. vo¾nje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Cijeli otok prepun je lijepim pla¾ama, skrivenim uvalama i mnogim drugim prirodnim ljepotama.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za sve dodatne informacije stojimo vam na raspolaganju.</p>', '<p>Croatia Property Sales are selling this one bedroom apartment on the ground  floor on Ciovo island.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The apartment is consist of an open plan lounge,  dining room and kitchen, with one bathroom, one bedroom, and a good sized  terrace.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is well decorated inside and has always been well maintained by  the owner. There is 38.5m sq of living space.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property is currently  used by the owner to rent to tourists on a short term basis.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property is  on a quiet road with little through traffic, and is ideal for tourists and  holiday lettings.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The building was completed in 2007, and there is one car  parking space.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The beach is 250m away and the centre of the local village  is 3 minutes.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The island is popular with tourists with the famous beach  at Okrug and the quiet nature found inland where there are extensive pine  forests and old olive groves. The coast has many hidden coves and small  beaches, suitable for private family picnics and swimming.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact  our office in Split for more information about this property.</p>', '', '791_Apartment_0.jpg', '791_Apartment_1.jpg', '791_Apartment_2.jpg', '791_Apartment_3.jpg', '791_Apartment_4.jpg', '791_Apartment_5.jpg', '791_Apartment_6.jpg', '791_Apartment_7.jpg', '791_Apartment_8.jpg'),
(792, 'Teubl projects', 'Werinos i Werinos do', '+43 664 609 154 420 (Reinhard Werinos)', '43 3332 60915 4430 (Sanja Baljak)', 'baljak.s@teubl.at', 'Trogir', 'Ljubljeva, Vini¹æe, 17981/19, 20, 21, 22; 17981/14, 17921/13 K.O. Vini¹æe', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '10', '550', '162', 1, '825000', '', 2, 1, 2, 1, 1, 1, 3, 3, 'August 4, 2014', '<p>Èetiri moderne vile vrhunske kvalitete s vlastitim bazenom, smje&scaron;tene u prvom redu do mora, na zemlji&scaron;tu povr&scaron;ine 3.790 m2.&nbsp;Svaka vila ima 3 spavaæe sobe, 3 kupaonice te veliki dnevni boravak s kuhinjom i blagovaonicom.&nbsp;Vile su ju¾ne orijentacije te pru¾aju mir, privatnost i izvanredan pogled na more!</p>', '<p>Croatia Property Sales are pleased to offer these 4 ''new build'' projects, all  part of the same exciting complex.&nbsp;The plans allow the building of 4 top  quality modern villas, each with a private swimming pool.&nbsp;The villas are south facing and offer peace, privacy and outstanding  views of the sea!<br /><br /></p>', '', '<p>Èetiri moderne vile vrhunske kvalitete s vlastitim bazenom, smje&scaron;tene u prvom redu do mora, na zemlji&scaron;tu povr&scaron;ine 3.790 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Vile æe imati dvije eta¾e, ukupne stambene povr&scaron;ine 162 m2, a okuænicu æe saèinjavati veliki vrt, bazen te prostrane terase.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Svaka vila ima 3 spavaæe sobe, 3 kupaonice te veliki dnevni boravak s kuhinjom i blagovaonicom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Svaka od vila æe imati osigurana 2 parkirna mjesta.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U cijenu je ukljuèena i kuhinja te kompletan klimatizacijski sistem.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Investitori su ishodili svu potrebnu dokumentaciju za graðenje, te se uskoro oèekuje poèetak gradnje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong><span style="text-decoration: underline;">VILA "A" = 825.000 Eura</span></strong></p>\r\n<p>Drugi red od mora, povr&scaron;ina zemlji&scaron;ta 540,75 m2</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong><span style="text-decoration: underline;">VILA "B" = 832.000 Eura</span></strong></p>\r\n<p>Drugi red od mora, povr&scaron;ina zemlji&scaron;ta 550,75 m2</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong><span style="text-decoration: underline;">VILA "C" = 1.045.000 Eura</span></strong></p>\r\n<p>Prvi red od mora, povr&scaron;ina zemlji&scaron;ta 579,75 m2</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong><span style="text-decoration: underline;">VILA "D" = 1.000.000 Eura</span><span style="text-decoration: underline;">&nbsp;- <span style="color: #ff0000;">PRODANO!!!</span></span></strong></p>\r\n<p>Prvi red od mora, povr&scaron;ina zemlji&scaron;ta 548,75 m2</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Vile su ju¾ne orijentacije te pru¾aju mir, privatnost i izvanredan pogled na more!</p>', '<p>Croatia Property Sales are pleased to offer these 4 ''new build'' projects, all  part of the same exciting complex.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The plans allow the building of 4 top  quality modern villas, each with a private swimming pool.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The villas are south facing and offer peace, privacy and outstanding  views of the sea!</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The area is beautiful and natural and the sloping hill  means that all the buildings will have equally great views.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Large plot  measures 3.790m sq in total and each plot is situated either first in line to the sea shore or 1  plot behind.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Either way, they have superb views across the Adriatic to the  islands and beyond.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The villas will have two floors, with a total  living area of 162 m2 and will include a large garden, swimming pool and  spacious terrace.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Each villa has 3 bedrooms, 3 bathrooms and a large living  room with kitchen and dining room, with giant glazed doors leading onto the  terrace.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Each villa has two secured parking spaces on the plot.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The  price includes a modern designer kitchen and air-conditioning  system.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Investors have already obtained all the necessary documents and  permission for construction, and the building work will start soon.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;"><strong>VILLA  "A" = 825,000 Euros</strong></span></p>\r\n<p>Second row from the sea, land area 540.75 m2</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;"><strong>VILLA  "B" = 832.000 Euros</strong></span></p>\r\n<p>Second row from the sea, land area 550.75 m2</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;"><strong>VILLA  "C" = 1.045.000 Euro</strong></span></p>\r\n<p>First row from the sea, land area 579.75 m2</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;"><strong>VILLA  "D" = 1.000.000 Euros</strong></span><strong>&nbsp;- <span style="color: #ff0000;">SOLD!!!</span></strong></p>\r\n<p>First row from the sea, land area 548.75 m2</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Trogir  is 15 mins driving.&nbsp;Airport is 20 mins drive.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact our  office to find out more.</p>', '', '792_House-Villa_0.jpg', '792_House-Villa_1.jpg', '792_House-Villa_2.jpg', '792_House-Villa_3.jpg', '792_House-Villa_4.jpg', '792_House-Villa_5.jpg', '792_House-Villa_6.jpg', '', ''),
(793, 'Teubl projects', 'Werinos i Werinos do', '+43 664 609 154 420 (Reinhard Werinos)', '43 3332 60915 4430 (Sanja Baljak)', 'baljak.s@teubl.at', 'Trogir', 'Ljubljeva, Vini¹æe, 17981/19, 20, 21, 22; 17981/14, 17921/13 K.O. Vini¹æe', 'For sale', 'Land plot', '10', '3790', '0', 2, '1300000', '', 2, 2, 2, 1, 1, 2, 0, 0, 'August 4, 2014', '<p>Zemlji&scaron;te u prvom redu do mora s pravomoænom graðevinskom dozvolom za gradnju 4 luksuzne vile s bazenom. Zemlji&scaron;te je povr&scaron;ine 3.790 m2, ju¾ne je orijentacije te nudi mir, privatnost i izvanredan pogled na more! Vile æe imati dvije eta¾e, ukupne stambene povr&scaron;ine 162 m2, a okuænicu æe saèinjavati veliki vrt, bazen te prostrane terase.</p>', '<p>We are pleased to be able to offer this exciting land plot with permission for a viable project that includes 4 separate villas with swimming pools. The plot is situated on the south facing coast, on the mainland, 20k from Trogir and 40k from Split. The land plot is 3.790 m2, which allows every house to enjoy a large garden and privacy.</p>', '', '<p>Zemlji&scaron;te u prvom redu do mora s pravomoænom graðevinskom dozvolom za gradnju 4 luksuzne vile s bazenom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Zemlji&scaron;te je povr&scaron;ine 3.790 m2, ju¾ne je orijentacije te nudi mir, privatnost i izvanredan pogled na more!</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Vile æe imati dvije eta¾e, ukupne stambene povr&scaron;ine 162 m2, a okuænicu æe saèinjavati veliki vrt, bazen te prostrane terase.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Svaka vila ima 3 spavaæe sobe, 3 kupaonice te veliki dnevni boravak s kuhinjom i blagovaonicom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>S obzirom da su sve dozvole ishoðene i pravomoæne, novi vlasnik mo¾e odmah zapoèeti s gradnjom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za sva eventualna pitanja, stojimo Vam na usluzi.</p>', '<p>We are pleased to be able to offer this exciting land plot with permission  for a viable project that includes 4 separate villas with swimming  pools.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The plot is situated on the south facing coast, on the mainland,  20k from Trogir and 40k from Split.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The geography here is beautifully wild, and the slope of the rocky  shore ensures that all the buildings have outstanding views of the nearest islands and the wider sea.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>A private track gives access to the  plot.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The plot and the permission already obtained allows for 4 stylish  luxury villas, each with a swimming pool.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The land plot is 3.790 m2, which  allows every house to enjoy a large garden and privacy.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The buildings are  designed with 2 floors and with a total living area of 162m sq, which  doesn''t include the large terrace. They have 3 bedrooms, 3 bathrooms and a  modern ''open plan'' lounge with a dining and kitchen area leading out through  giant glazed doors onto the terrace.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>All the permits have been  approved and the project is ready to start.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>''Shovel ready'' as the Americans  would say!</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact the office of Croatia Property Sales for more  information on this exciting opportunity.</p>', '', '793_Land-plot_0.jpg', '793_Land-plot_1.jpg', '793_Land-plot_2.jpg', '793_Land-plot_3.jpg', '793_Land-plot_4.jpg', '', '', '', ''),
(794, 'Miljenko', 'Radi¹iæ', '', '', '', 'Hvar', 'Gromin Dolac, Z.U.2999 Ko Jelsa', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '50', '662', '100', 2, '110000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 0, 0, 'August 5, 2014', '<p>Legalizirani objekt &ndash; kuæa sa prostranim zemlji&scaron;tem i otvorenim pogledom, svega 50 metara udaljena od mora i prekrasnih pla¾a na ju¾noj strani otoka Hvara. Povr&scaron;ina zemlji&scaron;ta je 662m2, dok je stambena povr&scaron;ina postojeæeg objekta 100 m2. Idealno za Hacijendu,oaza mira!!</p>', '<p>We are pleased to offer this rare opportunity to buy a small villa on a large plot on the south side of Hvar island. The building is 100m sq but the plot is 662m sq. The plot is reached at the end of a private gravel road, and the property has been described as ''an oasis of peace''. It is 50m from the sea, where there is beautiful clear water for swimming, boating etc.</p>', '', '<p>Legalizirani objekt &ndash; kuæa sa prostranim zemlji&scaron;tem i otvorenim pogledom, svega 50 metara udaljena od mora i prekrasnih pla¾a na ju¾noj strani otoka Hvara.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Povr&scaron;ina zemlji&scaron;ta je 662m2, dok je stambena povr&scaron;ina postojeæeg objekta 100 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Do parcele jo&scaron; nije spojena ni struja ni voda ali je u planu izrada projekta od strane Hrvatskih voda u skoroj buduænosti.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Do parcele vodi makadamski put.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Idealno za Hacijendu,oaza mira!!</p>', '<p>We are pleased to offer this rare opportunity to buy a small villa on a large plot on the south side of Hvar island.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The building is 100m sq  but the plot is 662m sq.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It has no water or electricity at the moment, but  the island water connection is planned for the near future.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The plot  is reached at the end of a private gravel road, and the property has been  described as ''an oasis of peace''.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>A nice tribute, especially as many people  would suggest the whole of Hvar deserves the same compliment!</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is  50m from the sea, where there is beautiful clear water for swimming, boating  etc.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact the office in Hvar for more details.</p>', '', '794_House-Villa_0.jpg', '794_House-Villa_1.jpg', '794_House-Villa_2.jpg', '794_House-Villa_3.jpg', '794_House-Villa_4.jpg', '794_House-Villa_5.jpg', '794_House-Villa_6.jpg', '', ''),
(795, 'Branko/Nikolina', 'Makijaniæ', '', '091/2404936', '', 'Hvar', 'Hvar ,Ivan Dolac', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '20', '535', '115', 2, '500000', '', 2, 2, 2, 1, 1, 2, 3, 2, 'August 5, 2014', '<p>Kuæa na ju¾noj strani otoka Hvara, sa prekrasnim pogledom, prvi red od mora!! Prodajemo kuæu na predivnoj lokaciji na otoku Hvaru, prvi red do mora. Povr&scaron;ina zemlji&scaron;ta je 535m2, dok je ukupna stambena povr&scaron;ina kuæe 115m2. Kuæa ima dvije eta¾e. Postoji moguænost gradnje bazena. Parking je na parceli.</p>', '<p>Croatia Property sales are pleased to offer this excellent villa, next to the sea on the South side of Hvar island. It is situated on the first line of properties, just a few yards from the clear water, on a large plot of 535m sq. The building is a typical villa style property with 2 floors. The house is in good condition and it has been well decorated and maintained. There would be plenty of space to build a swimming pool, and the plot has parking off the road.</p>', '', '<p>Kuæa na ju¾noj strani otoka Hvara, sa prekrasnim pogledom, prvi red od mora!!</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Prodajemo kuæu na predivnoj lokaciji na otoku Hvaru, prvi red  do mora.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Povr&scaron;ina zemlji&scaron;ta je 535m2, dok je ukupna stambena povr&scaron;ina kuæe  115m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa ima dvije eta¾e. U prizemlju se nalazi terasa, kuhinja, dnevni boravak, ostava i kupaonica.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Unutra&scaron;nje stepenice vode na na gornji kat  gdje su tri spavaæe sobe, kupaonica i terasa.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa ima prostrani lijepi  vrt s vanjskim kaminom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Postoji moguænost gradnje bazena.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Parking je  na parceli.</p>', '<p>Croatia Property sales are pleased to offer this excellent villa, next to  the sea on the South side of Hvar island.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is situated on the first line of  properties, just a few yards from the clear water, on a large plot of 535m  sq.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The building is a typical villa style property with 2 floors.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The  ground floor has a large kitchen and pantry, with doors leading out onto the  terrace which merges into the garden.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There is also a bathroom on the ground  floor and internal stairs leading up to the first floor where there are 3 bedrooms, a bathroom and balcony.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house is in good condition and it has  been well decorated and maintained.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The garden has several mature  pine trees which gives much needed shade in high summer, and many other Mediterranean plants, as well as a large covered bbq grill.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There would  be plenty of space to build a swimming pool, and the plot has parking off  the road.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact the Hvar office to arrange to visit this  property.</p>', '', '795_House-Villa_0.jpg', '795_House-Villa_1.jpg', '795_House-Villa_2.jpg', '795_House-Villa_3.jpg', '795_House-Villa_4.jpg', '795_House-Villa_5.jpg', '795_House-Villa_6.jpg', '795_House-Villa_7.jpg', '795_House-Villa_8.jpg'),
(796, 'Svetin', 'Milat', '001 604 946 2139 021/ 887 507', '021/887068 Vid i Vesna Kljuè Brat-021/625209', 'ssmilat@hotmail.com Brat- 021/531383 ', 'Trogir', 'O.Gornji, Put Diruna 55', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '230', '329', '90', 1, '285000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 3, 2, 'August 5, 2014', '<p>Simpatièna kuæa unikatnog ureðenja, potpuno namje&scaron;tena i opremljena, sa prekrasnim vrtom i predivnim pogledom na more i cijelu uvalu. Smje&scaron;tena je na ju¾noj strani otoka Èiova u jednoj od najljep&scaron;ih i najpopularnijih uvala. Ukupna povr&scaron;ina zemlji&scaron;ta iznosi 329 m2, dok je stambena povr&scaron;ina 90 m2.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>We are pleased to offer this attractive house of unique design, fully furnished and ready for living, with great sea views. The property is situated on the popular south side of Ciovo island, elevated by the geography of the sloping land near the shore, to give interesting views of the bay and&nbsp; beautiful views out to sea. The land plot is 329m sq and the residential floor in the building is 90m sq.</p>', '', '<p>Simpatièna kuæa unikatnog ureðenja, potpuno namje&scaron;tena i opremljena, sa prekrasnim vrtom i predivnim pogledom na more i cijelu uvalu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Smje&scaron;tena je na ju¾noj strani otoka Èiova u jednoj od najljep&scaron;ih i najpopularnijih uvala.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ukupna povr&scaron;ina zemlji&scaron;ta iznosi 329 m2, dok je stambena povr&scaron;ina 90 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa se sastoji od suterena i visokog prizemlja koje ima 2 manje kaskadne eta¾e.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U suterenu se nalazi spremi&scaron;te (konoba) i spremnik za vodu. U visokom prizemlju se nalazi prostrani studio apartman sa posebnim vanjskim ulazom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U glavnom dijelu se nalazi hodnik, kuhinja, prostrani dnevni boravak koji je dijelom u staklu i u kojem se nalazi kamin, 2 spavaæe sobe i kupaonica. Cijeli ovaj dio je kaskadno izveden te dnevni boravak dijeli 6 stepenica od ostatka.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U dvori&scaron;tu se nalaze 2 terase i ureðeni vrt u kojem je moguæa izgradnja bazena.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ispred kuæe nalazi se parking za 2 automobila.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Centar mjesta gdje se nalaze svi sadr¾aji udaljen je 5 min. vo¾nje, dok je meðunarodni aerodrom udaljen 15 min. vo¾nje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za sve dodatne informacije stojimo vam na raspolaganju.</p>', '<p>We are pleased to offer this attractive house of unique design, fully furnished  and ready for living, with great sea views.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property is situated on the  popular south side of Ciovo island, elevated by the geography of the sloping  land near the shore, to give interesting views of the bay and&nbsp; beautiful views  out to sea.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The land plot is 329m sq and the residential floor in the  building is 90m sq.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house consists of a basement and ground floor, and  the ground floor has two levels. The basement is a water storage tank and  storage area.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The ground floor is a separate studio apartment, that has its  own entrance. The first floor is the main living area, and it has a hall,  kitchen, living room and two bedrooms and a bathroom. The main living room is  on two different levels, with a height difference of 6 steps.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The  courtyard, or patio would be large enough for a swimming pool, and has an  outdoor bbq grill.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There are many mature trees in the garden, which give the  property character and much needed shade in high summer.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The inside of  the building is well decorated and the furnishings are part of the sale. It has  many interesting design features such as the fire place in the lounge.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There  are places for two cars.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The centre of the local village Okrug is 5 minutes  away and here are bakery, chemist, Dr&rsquo;s, supermarket, as well as bars, coffee  bars and restaurants.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There is a boat taxi service to Trogir in the summer,  where there are many historical and cultural activities taking place. This is 10  minutes by car.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Split is 30 minutes driving, and the airport is less than  15 minutes.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact our office to arrange to visit this property.</p>', '', '796_House-Villa_0.jpg', '796_House-Villa_1.jpg', '796_House-Villa_2.jpg', '796_House-Villa_3.jpg', '796_House-Villa_4.jpg', '796_House-Villa_5.jpg', '796_House-Villa_6.jpg', '796_House-Villa_7.jpg', '796_House-Villa_8.jpg');
INSERT INTO `nekretnina` (`id`, `ime`, `prezime`, `telefon`, `mobitel`, `e_mail`, `lokacija_id`, `adresa`, `status_id`, `vrsta_id`, `udaljenost`, `povrsina`, `stambenapovrsina`, `display`, `cijena`, `cijenatocka`, `ponuda_tjedna`, `new_built`, `must_sell`, `prvi_red_do_mora`, `pogled_na_more`, `bazen`, `broj_soba`, `broj_kupatila`, `datum`, `title_hr`, `title_en`, `title_ge`, `opis_hr`, `opis_en`, `opis_ge`, `PropertyImageURL0`, `PropertyImageURL1`, `PropertyImageURL2`, `PropertyImageURL3`, `PropertyImageURL4`, `PropertyImageURL5`, `PropertyImageURL6`, `PropertyImageURL7`, `PropertyImageURL8`) VALUES
(797, 'Tomislav', 'Keliæ', '091/ 751 5034', '', 'apartmani.kelic@gmail.com', 'Trogir', 'O.Gornji, Planikovica IV/ 16A', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '90', '0', '70', 1, '140000', '', 2, 1, 2, 2, 1, 2, 0, 0, 'August 5, 2014', '<p>Apartmani u novogradnji, potpuno namje&scaron;teni i klimatizirani, sa prekrasnim pogledom na more i cijelu uvalu. Zgrada je smje&scaron;tena na sjevernoj strani otoka Èiova u mirnom dijelu bez puno buke i prometa.&nbsp;90 m od zgrade nalazi se prekrasna pje&scaron;èana pla¾a. <span style="text-decoration: underline;">Na prodaji su apartmani povr&scaron;ine 70 - 90m2; cijene od 140.000 - 225.000 Eura!</span></p>', '<p>We are pleased to offer these 5 newly built apartments, in new condition and fully furnished, on the north side of Ciovo island, just 90m from an attractive beach with clear water.&nbsp;They are all ready for &lsquo;letting &lsquo; or &lsquo;living&rsquo;. For sale are a total of 5 apartments. <span style="text-decoration: underline;">Size of the apartments 70 - 90 m2; prices are from 140.000 - 225.000 Euro!</span></p>', '', '<p>Apartmani u novogradnji, potpuno namje&scaron;teni i klimatizirani, sa prekrasnim pogledom na more i cijelu uvalu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Zgrada je smje&scaron;tena na sjevernoj strani otoka Èiova u mirnom dijelu bez puno buke i prometa.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Centar mjesta sa svim sadr¾ajima udaljen je svega 3 min. vo¾nje, dok je meðunarodni aerodrom udaljen 15 min. vo¾nje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>90 m od zgrade nalazi se prekrasna pje&scaron;èana pla¾a. U blizini se takoðer nalaze i prirodno kamenite pla¾e i mnogobrojne skrivene uvale.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;">***U prodaji je ukupno 5 apartmana.</span></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>APARTMAN 1 (Prizemlje): 70M2 &ndash; 140.000 Eura</strong></p>\r\n<p><strong>&nbsp;</strong>Sastoji se od dnevnog b.+ blagovaonice + kuhinje, 1 spavaæe sobe,&nbsp; 1 kupaonice i terase sa pogledom na more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>APARTMAN 2 (Prizemlje): 70M2 &ndash; 140.000 Eura</strong></p>\r\n<p><strong>&nbsp;</strong>Sastoji se od dnevnog b.+ blagovaonice + kuhinje, 1 spavaæe sobe,&nbsp; 1 kupaonice i terase sa pogledom na more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>APARTMAN 3 (1.kat): 70M2 &ndash; 154.000 Eura</strong></p>\r\n<p><strong>&nbsp;</strong>Sastoji se od dnevnog b.+ blagovaonice + kuhinje, 1 spavaæe sobe,&nbsp; 1 kupaonice i terase sa pogledom na more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>APARTMAN 4 (1.kat): 70M2 &ndash; 154.000 Eura</strong></p>\r\n<p><strong>&nbsp;</strong>Sastoji se od dnevnog b.+ blagovaonice + kuhinje, 1 spavaæe sobe,&nbsp; 1 kupaonice i terase sa pogledom na more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>APARTMAN 5 (penthouse): 90M2 &ndash; 225.000&nbsp; &euro;</strong></p>\r\n<p>Sastoji se od dnevnog b.+ blagovaonice + kuhinje, 2 spavaæe sobe,&nbsp; 1 kupaonice i&nbsp; prostrane terase sa prekrasnim pogledom na more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ispred zgrade nalazi se po 1 parking mjesto za svaki apartman koji je ukljuèeno u cijenu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>***Postoji moguænost kupnje cijele zgrade po cijeni od 600.000 &euro;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za sve dodatne informacije stojimo vam na raspolaganju.</p>', '<p>We are pleased to offer these 5 newly built apartments, in new condition and  fully furnished, on the north side of Ciovo island, just 90m from an attractive  beach with clear water.&nbsp;They are all ready for &lsquo;letting &lsquo; or  &lsquo;living&rsquo;.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For sale are a total of 5 apartments.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong><span style="text-decoration: underline;">APARTMENT 1  (ground floor): 70m2 - 140.000 Euro</span></strong></p>\r\n<p>It consists of a living room + dining +  kitchen, 1 bedroom, 1 bathroom and terrace overlooking the sea.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong><span style="text-decoration: underline;">APARTMENT  2 (ground floor): 70m2 - 140.000 Euro</span></strong></p>\r\n<p>It consists of a living room + dining +  kitchen, 1 bedroom, 1 bathroom and terrace overlooking the sea.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong><span style="text-decoration: underline;">APARTMENT  3 (1st): 70m2 - 154,000 Euro</span></strong></p>\r\n<p>It consists of a living room + dining + kitchen, 1  bedroom, 1 bathroom and terrace overlooking the sea.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong><span style="text-decoration: underline;">APARTMENT 4 (1st):  70m2 - 154,000 Euro</span></strong></p>\r\n<p>It consists of a living&nbsp; + dining + kitchen, 1 bedroom, 1  bathroom and terrace overlooking the sea.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong><span style="text-decoration: underline;">APARTMENT 5 (penthouse): 90m2 - 225,000 Euro</span></strong></p>\r\n<p>It consists of a living&nbsp; + dining + kitchen, two bedrooms, one  bathroom and a spacious terrace overlooking the sea.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>In front of the  building there is a parking space for each apartment, which is included in the  price.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There is very little noise or traffic around the building, and within  walking distance there are old olive groves and pine forests, a beach or the  centre of the local village with a selection of shops and coffee bars  etc.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;">A guide price for investors who might wish to purchase the entire  block is 600k Euro.</span></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The airport is 15 minutes driving and the  historical centre of Trogir only 10 minutes from here.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact the  Croatian Property sales office in Split to arrange a viewing of these  properties.</p>', '', '797_Apartment_0.jpg', '797_Apartment_1.jpg', '797_Apartment_2.jpg', '797_Apartment_3.jpg', '797_Apartment_4.jpg', '797_Apartment_5.jpg', '797_Apartment_6.jpg', '797_Apartment_7.jpg', '797_Apartment_8.jpg'),
(798, 'Boris', 'Tomiæ', '', '', '', 'Brac', 'Sutivan', 'For sale', 'Old stone house', '300', '150', '70', 2, '76000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 2, 1, 'August 10, 2014', '<p>Stara kamena, dvojna kuæa u malom mjestu na sjevernoj strani otoka Braè&nbsp;sa  pogledom na more!&nbsp;Kuæi je potrebno kompletno renoviranje.&nbsp;Objekt se nalazi u neposrednoj blizini sredi&scaron;ta naselja, 300 m od mora, u  blizini lijepih pla¾a i luèice za manje brodove.&nbsp;Kuæa se satoji od prizemlja (konobe), prvog kata i niskog potkrovlja, ukupne  stambene povr&scaron;ine 70 m2.<br /><br /></p>', '<p>Fabulous renovation project on Brac Island.&nbsp;We have this 3 floor, 2 bedroom  traditional old stone house requiring a&nbsp;complete internal renovation, on the  island of Brac, with great views towards the mainland.&nbsp;The property is  situated near the centre of the village, 300m from the sea where there is a  good beach for swimming and a small harbour for&nbsp;local boats.</p>', '', '<p>Stara kamena, dvojna kuæa u malom mjestu na sjevernoj strani otoka Braè sa  pogledom na more!</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæi je potrebno kompletno renoviranje. Vanjski kameni  zidovi i krovi&scaron;te su u dobrom stanju, iako je isto potrebno temeljito  provjeriti.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa se satoji od prizemlja (konobe), prvog kata i niskog  potkrovlja, ukupne stambene povr&scaron;ine 70 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Povr&scaron;ina parcele je 150 m2  &scaron;to ostavlja dovoljno mjesta za vanjski kamin, ljetnu kuhinju, vrt i  ostalo.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Struja, voda, kanalizacija prisutni.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Objekt se nalazi u  neposrednoj blizini sredi&scaron;ta naselja, 300 m od mora, u blizini lijepih pla¾a  i luèice za manje brodove.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Parking je na ulici u susjedstvu zgrade.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U  mjestu potoji sva infrastruktura, nekoliko malih trgovina, barova, kafiæa i  restorana.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Cijena je sni¾ena radi brze prodaje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Molimo kontaktirajte  na&scaron; ured sa pitanjima i dogovora oko obilaska nekretnine.</p>', '<p>Fabulous renovation project on Brac Island.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>We have this 3 floor, 2 bedroom  traditional old stone house requiring a complete internal renovation, on the  island of Brac, with great views towards the mainland.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property is  situated near the centre of the village, 300m from the sea where there is a  good beach for swimming and a small harbour for local boats. There are also  several small shops and bars and coffee shops.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The building itself is semi  detached, and has become in need of a complete renovation, but the external  walls appear sound, and probably the roof, but this needs to be thoroughly  checked. It has a living area of 70m sq.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>This property is in a great  location in the village, but unusually it sits on a relatively large plot,  150m sq which could become a wonderful sanctuary once the building has been  properly restored.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Parking is on the street adjacent to the  building.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact our office to arrange to visit this property and  with any questions.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>This property has been priced to ensure a quick  sale.</p>', '', '798_Old-stone-house_0.jpg', '798_Old-stone-house_1.jpg', '798_Old-stone-house_2.jpg', '798_Old-stone-house_3.jpg', '798_Old-stone-house_4.jpg', '798_Old-stone-house_5.jpg', '798_Old-stone-house_6.jpg', '798_Old-stone-house_7.jpg', '798_Old-stone-house_8.jpg'),
(799, 'Boris', 'Tomiæ', '', '', '', 'Brac', 'Osibova', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '20', '882', '170', 2, '690000', '', 2, 2, 2, 1, 1, 2, 6, 5, 'August 10, 2014', '<p>Villa u prvom redu do mora sa prekrasnim otvorenim pogledom, na prostranom zemlji&scaron;tu, sa direktnim izlazom na pla¾u. Villa se nalazi na jugozapadnoj strani otoka Braca, iznad èiste smaragdno zelene uvale zaklonjene od vjetrova. Ukupna stambena povr&scaron;ina je 170 m2, dok je povr&scaron;ina parcele 882 m2.&nbsp;Pristup na pla¾u je direktno sa parcele do zaravnatog platoa za sunèanje.</p>', '<p>Fabulous first line property, just a few yards from the sea, in a sheltered bay, on a large land plot, with a stunning sea view! The land plot is unusually large, measuring 882m sq and the total residential space is 170m sq. It is situated in a quiet and sought after cove, a short drive from the nearest main village where there are plenty of shops, bars and restaurants etc.</p>', '', '<p>Villa u prvom redu do mora sa prekrasnim otvorenim pogledom, na prostranom zemlji&scaron;tu, sa direktnim izlazom na pla¾u.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Villa se nalazi na jugozapadnoj strani otoka Braca, iznad èiste smaragdno zelene uvale zaklonjene od vjetrova.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ukupna stambena povr&scaron;ina je 170 m2, dok je povr&scaron;ina parcele 882 m2.&nbsp;Pristup na pla¾u je direktno sa parcele do zaravnatog platoa za sunèanje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa se sastoji se od 1 dvosobnog i 4 jednosobna apartmana, natkrivene terase s ljetnom kuhinjom i vanjskim kaminima.&nbsp;Radi se o eko kuæi sa solarnim sistemom koji daje dovoljno el.energije i tople vode, te ima veliku cisternu za vodu.&nbsp;Takoðer, kuæa je nedavno spojena na struju i vodu!</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Parking za 5 vozila.&nbsp;Kuæa ima uporabnu dozvolu, te je sva ostala dokumentacija uredna.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Trajektna luka u Supetru je udaljena 20 minuta vo¾nje.</p>', '<p>Fabulous first line property, just a few yards from the sea, in a sheltered bay, on a large land plot, with a stunning sea view!</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The land plot is unusually large, measuring 882m sq and the total residential space is 170m sq.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is situated in a quiet and sought after cove, a short drive from the nearest main village where there are plenty of shops, bars and restaurants etc.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>This village also has one of the best equipped marina''s in the region, and a direct fast passenger ferry link to the mainland.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The building is a large villa style property, with 5 apartments. Main living area is a 2 bedrooms apartment with a large open plan lounge kitchen, with access to the terrace overlooking the water. Four other apartments are one bedroom each.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The terrace has a bbq grill and shade from the high sun.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The access to the sea here is quite private, and the sea is protected by the shape of the cove. It is a great place to have a small boat.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Parking for 5 cars.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house is recently connected on mains electric and water supply!</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Also, as alternative it has a power coming from solar panels as well as large water tank with the underground collection system.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There are fewer properties of this quality available, and its value went up sharply with the recent water and electric connection.&nbsp;So, we recommend contacting our office to arrange to visit this house at the first opportunity.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property is 20 minutes drive from the ferry port in Supetar.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>All papers are in order.</p>', '', '799_House-Villa_0.jpg', '799_House-Villa_1.jpg', '799_House-Villa_2.jpg', '799_House-Villa_3.jpg', '799_House-Villa_4.jpg', '799_House-Villa_5.jpg', '799_House-Villa_6.jpg', '799_House-Villa_7.jpg', '799_House-Villa_8.jpg'),
(804, 'Ante', 'Biliæ', '534-415', '098/361-840', 'bilic_davorka@yahoo.com', 'Rogoznica', 'Stiva¹nica, 10385/2, 10385/3, 10382/2 K.O. Sevid', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '20', '525', '340', 2, '650000', '', 2, 1, 2, 1, 1, 2, 4, 6, 'August 13, 2014', '<p>Prekrasna novosagraðena kuæa u prvom redu do mora, smje&scaron;tana u mirnoj uvali nedaleko od Rogoznice. Kuæa je jugozapadne orijentacije te ima prekrasan pogled na otvoreno more i zalazak sunca. Izgraðena je na parceli povr&scaron;ine 525 m2 i sastoji se od tri eta¾e, ukupne stambene povr&scaron;ine 340 m2.&nbsp;Kuæa je raðena vrlo kvalitetno i kori&scaron;teni su samo visoko kvalitetni materijali.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>We have this superb modern holiday villa in a superb bay location on the mainland.&nbsp;It is just a few yards from the water, close enough to hear the sea, in  a calm and quiet bay near Rogoznica, 20 driving away from Trogir.&nbsp;It is  in the first row of houses and facing west, which allows the late afternoon sun  and sunset to be fully enjoyed from the terrace.&nbsp;The plot is 525m sq and  the house has 340m sq of residential space.</p>', '', '<p>Prekrasna novosagraðena kuæa u prvom redu do mora, smje&scaron;tana u mirnoj uvali nedaleko od Rogoznice.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je jugozapadne orijentacije te ima prekrasan pogled na otvoreno more i zalazak sunca.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Izgraðena je na parceli povr&scaron;ine 525 m2 i sastoji se od tri eta¾e, ukupne stambene povr&scaron;ine 340 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U suterenu kuæe se nalazi velika gara¾a u koju je moguæe smjestiti dva auta.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U prizemlju se nalazi jedan veliki prostrani stan koji se sastoji od kuhinje i dnevnog boravka, 1 spavaæe sobe, 2 kupaonice i ostave. Ova eta¾a ima izlaz na veliku natkrivenu terasu na kojoj je vanjski kamin s ljetnom kuhinjom i veliki stol.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na 1. katu se nalazi jedan dvosobni stan koji se sastoji od kuhinje s dnevnim boravkom, 2 sobe i 2 kupaonice.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na 2. katu se nalazi dnevni boravak s kuhinjom, 2 kupaonice i 1 soba.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sve eta¾e su povezane unutra&scaron;njim stepeni&scaron;tem, ali ostavljena je i moguænost fizièkog razdvajanje ove kuæe na nekoliko zasebnih apartmana (za zasebnim ulazima).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sve eta¾e imaju terase s prekrasnim pogledom na more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je raðena vrlo kvalitetno i kori&scaron;teni su samo visoko kvalitetni materijali. U prizemlju i na prvom katu je sprovedeno i podno grijanje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Vlasnik ove kuæe je i vlasnik graðevinske parcele iza kuæe (povr&scaron;ine 435 m2) te postoji moguænost i kupnje kuæe zajedno s parcelom povi&scaron;e. U tom sluèaju bi ukupna povr&scaron;ina parcele iznosila 960 m2, a cijena za kuæu s dodatnom parcelom 800.000 Eura.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za eventualna pitanja, molim Vas da nam se obratite.</p>', '<p>We have this superb modern holiday villa in a superb bay location on the mainland.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is just a few yards from the water, close enough to hear the sea, in  a calm and quiet bay near Rogoznica, 20 driving away from Trogir.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is  in the first row of houses and facing west, which allows the late afternoon sun  and sunset to be fully enjoyed from the terrace.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The plot is 525m sq and  the house has 340m sq of residential space.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The basement is a garage for 2  cars, and some storage space.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the ground floor there is a large spacious  apartment consisting of kitchen, living room, 1 bedroom, 2 bathrooms and  storage, with an entrance independent of the main part of the house. This floor  has a large covered terrace where the outdoor bbq grill with a summer kitchen  and a large table.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the first floor there is a two-bedroom apartment  consisting of a kitchen, living room, 2 bedrooms and 2 bathrooms.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the  second floor there is a living room with kitchen, 2 bathrooms and 1  bedroom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>All floors are connected by an internal staircase, but anyone  interested in using the property for commercial lettings can easily reorganise  the staircase so each apartment is more independent.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>All floors have  terraces overlooking the sea.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house was well constructed using modern and  high quality materials.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>NOTE:<br />The owner is also selling the  building lot behind the house (435 m2) and there is the possibility of buying a  house together with the plot above.</p>\r\n<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;">In this case, the total area of the  plot is 960 m2, and the price for the house with the additional parcel of land  is 800,000 Euro.</span></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact the officeof Croatia Property Sales  for more information and to arrange a visit to the property.</p>', '', '804_House-Villa_0.jpg', '804_House-Villa_1.jpg', '804_House-Villa_2.jpg', '804_House-Villa_3.jpg', '804_House-Villa_4.jpg', '804_House-Villa_5.jpg', '804_House-Villa_6.jpg', '804_House-Villa_7.jpg', '804_House-Villa_8.jpg'),
(800, 'Jak¹a', 'Matuliæ', 'kontakt Boris', '', '', 'Brac', 'Dol', 'For sale', 'Old stone house', '2000', '200', '180', 1, '250000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 4, 3, 'August 10, 2014', '<p>Kompletno renovirana stara kamena kuæa sa pogledom, smje&scaron;tena u malom mjestu  2 km od mora!&nbsp;Cijelo mjesto predstavlja za&scaron;tiæeni spomenik kulture. U mjestu  je nekoliko tipiènih dalmatinskih konoba-restorana i ku&scaron;aonica  vina.&nbsp;Kuæa ima ukupnu stambenu povr&scaron;inu 165m2, tj. 3 ata¾e svaka po 55  m2. Povr&scaron;ina parcele je 200 m2.</p>', '<p>We are very pleased to offer this beautifully renovated stone house in&nbsp;a stunning location. It is a large, renovated, 4 bedroom house of 165m sq and on a garden plot of 200m sq with a sea view!&nbsp;It is situated in a small village, so  historically and culturally interesting that the authorities have declared  the entire village a protected area.&nbsp;A few tourists find their way here but there is an unspoilt peace and charm  that dominates the area.</p>', '', '<p>Kompletno renovirana kamena kuæa u mjestu 2 km od mora. Smje&scaron;tena je na sjevernoj strani otoka Braèa u mirnom mjestu koje je za&scaron;tiæeno kao spomenik kulture.<br /><br /><br />Na prodaji je dvojna stara kamena kuæa koja se sastoji od niskog prizemlja, visokog prizemlja i 1.kata.<br /><br /><br />Stambena povr&scaron;ina iznosi 180 m2, dok je ukupno zemlji&scaron;te na kojem se nalazi kuæa 200 m2.<br /><br /><br />-nisko prizemlje: konoba , gustirna i gara¾a</p>\r\n<p>-visoko prizemlje: terasa 30 m2, apartman 55 m2, dvor 40 m2</p>\r\n<p>- 1.kat &nbsp;apartman 55 m2 + 12 m2( 2 kupaonice) + &nbsp;terasa 16 m2<br /><br /><br />Kuæa ima ukupno 4 spavaæe sobe i 3 kupaonice. Trenutno je u turistièkom najmu stoga je moguæe nastaviti uhodani posao iznajmljivanja.<br /><br /><br />Iz kuæe se pru¾a djelomièan pogled na more dok je do pla¾e potrebno 10 minuta vo¾nje.<br /><br /><br />Ispred se nalazi parking mjesto za 1 automobil.<br /><br /><br />U mjestu ima nekoliko tipiènih dalmatinskih konoba-restorana i ku&scaron;aonica vina.<br /><br /><br />Do veæeg mjesta ima 2km gdje su trgovine, restorani, hoteli, autobusna stanica,...</p>\r\n<p>Do trajektne luke je potrebno 7km.</p>', '<p>We are very pleased to offer this beautifully renovated stone house in a  stunning location.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is a large, renovated, 4 bedroom house of 165m sq and on a garden plot of 200m sq with a sea view!</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is situated in a small village, so  historically and culturally interesting that the authorities have declared  the entire village a protected area.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>A few tourists find their way here  but there is an unspoilt peace and charm that dominates the area.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The  house itself has been completely restored to a high standard with many  modern features both designed and installed.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The building is on several  levels, which makes it interesting, but still practical and it has a current  ''tourist lettings'' certificate.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It has 4 bedrooms, 3 bathrooms, an open plan  kitchen and lounge, leading onto a terrace of 30m sq with a great bbq  grill.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Lower ground floor is 55m sq and consists of: tavern, water tank  and garage&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Higher Ground floor is: 2 bedrooms apartment of 55m sq + large 30m  sq terrace + 40 m2 courtyard</p>\r\n<p>First floor is: an apartment of 55m sq + 12m  sq (2 bathrooms) + 16m sq terrace</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property has an interesting  view down the valley, over vine groves and olive trees to the nearest  village and the sea.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>To fully appreciate the location and character of this property we urge you  to come and visit it.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The village is inland from the sea, and is set at the  top of a steep valley.&nbsp;The entire village is a protected monument, but like  all inland villages on the island, it is off most tourist radar screens, so  is wonderfully peaceful at all times, being visited by only those coming to  the typical Dalmatian ''Konoba'' restaurants for the wine tasting and famous home cooking.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is 2k to the nearest larger town with shops, hotels and  more facilities.</p>\r\n<p>Ferry port in Supetar is 7 km distant.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact our  office to arrange to visit this property and similar ones in the local  area.</p>', '', '800_Old-stone-house_0.jpg', '800_Old-stone-house_1.jpg', '800_Old-stone-house_2.jpg', '800_Old-stone-house_3.jpg', '800_Old-stone-house_4.jpg', '800_Old-stone-house_5.jpg', '800_Old-stone-house_6.jpg', '800_Old-stone-house_7.jpg', '800_Old-stone-house_8.jpg'),
(801, 'Boris', 'Tomiæ', '', '', '', 'Brac', 'Mirca', 'For sale', 'Old stone house', '500', '100', '100', 2, '79000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 2, 1, 'August 10, 2014', '<p>Stara dalmatinska kamena kuæa /dvojna kuæa/ u malom i mirnom mjestu sa djelomiènim pogledom na more. Potrebna adaptacija!&nbsp;Kuæa ima ukupnu  stambenu povr&scaron;inu 100 m2, dok je parcela povr&scaron;ine 100 m2.&nbsp;Prilaz do kuæe je uskom kaletom. Okuænicu èini dvori&scaron;te s palmom i pomoæni  objekt.&nbsp;Svi prikljuèci postoje: struja, voda, telefon.</p>', '<p>We have this excellent refurbishment project on Brac island.&nbsp;The property is  a semi detached old stone house with plenty of character and charm, situated  near the centre of a small village, and 500m from the sea.&nbsp;The village has a small port and plenty of excellent clean beaches around  for private swimming.&nbsp;The building is currently habited but we all agree it is in need of complete  renovation.<br /><br /></p>', '', '<p>Stara dalmatinska kamena kuæa /dvojna kuæa/ u malom i mirnom mjestu sa djelomiènim pogledom na more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Potrebna adaptacija!</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa ima ukupnu  stambenu povr&scaron;inu 100 m2, dok je parcela povr&scaron;ine 100 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Prizemlje: velika  konoba, kuhinja, soba, hodnik</p>\r\n<p>1.kat : 2 sobe, hodnik</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Prilaz do kuæe je  uskom kaletom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Okuænicu èini dvori&scaron;te s palmom i pomoæni objekt.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Svi  prikljuèci postoje: struja, voda, telefon</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Parking je na ulici.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za sva  pitanja Croatia Property Sales vam stoji na usluzi.</p>', '<p>We have this excellent refurbishment project on Brac island.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property is  a semi detached old stone house with plenty of character and charm, situated  near the centre of a small village, and 500m from the sea.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The village  has a small port and plenty of excellent clean beaches around for private  swimming.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The building is currently habited but we all agree it is in  need of complete renovation.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The external walls of the building appear sound  and the lay out inside is that at the top of the house are 2 bedrooms and the ground floor has a traditional small kitchen, lounge, an extra bedroom and a storage area.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There is a garden with established trees and  bushes.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property has water, electric, telephone and drain  connections.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Access to the house is through narrow alleys. Parking is along  the road.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The village has some small shops, bars and coffee shops, and  caters well for tourists without being too busy.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact  Croatia Property Sales for more information and for a guided tour of the  property.</p>', '', '801_Old-stone-house_0.jpg', '801_Old-stone-house_1.jpg', '801_Old-stone-house_2.jpg', '801_Old-stone-house_3.jpg', '801_Old-stone-house_4.jpg', '801_Old-stone-house_5.jpg', '801_Old-stone-house_6.jpg', '801_Old-stone-house_7.jpg', '801_Old-stone-house_8.jpg'),
(802, 'Ante', 'Luk¹iæ', '', '', '', 'Brac', 'Sutivan', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '270', '615', '154', 1, '450000', '', 2, 1, 2, 2, 1, 1, 3, 4, 'August 10, 2014', '<p>Ville u izgradnji sa izvanrednim pogledom na more, smje&scaron;tene u malom mjestu  na sjevernoj strani otoka Braèa.&nbsp;Povr&scaron;ina svake parcele je 615 m2, dok je  stambena povr&scaron;ina svake ville 154 m2.&nbsp;Villa je od mora i obale  udaljena 270 m.&nbsp;Svaka villa posjeduje sve sadr¾aje koji je èine villom :zatvorena gara¾a,  bazen, penthouse terasa, velike prostorije, prostorna intima i dr.</p>', '<p>Great opportunity to buy ''discounted'' modern villa.&nbsp;These 3 minimalistic villas, on the north shore of Brac, are being offered at a reduced price  while under construction.&nbsp;They are situated just 250m from the sea and 15  minutes driving from Supetar, the main ferry terminal on Brac.&nbsp;The properties consist of 154 m of residential space inside and sit on large land plots of 615m sq.</p>', '', '<p><strong><span style="text-decoration: underline;">Samo jedna vila ostala na prodaju!</span></strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ville u izgradnji sa izvanrednim pogledom na more, smje&scaron;tene u malom mjestu  na sjevernoj strani otoka Braèa.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Povr&scaron;ina svake parcele je 615 m2, dok je  stambena povr&scaron;ina svake ville 154 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Villa je od mora i obale  udaljena 270 m.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Svaka je zami&scaron;ljena i koncipirana kao moderna i  minimalistièki ureðena vila na zemlji&scaron;tu od 615 m2.&nbsp;Svaka villa posjeduje  sve sadr¾aje koji je èine villom: zatvorena gara¾a, bazen, penthouse terasa,  velike prostorije, prostorna intima i dr.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>PRIZEMLJE je povr&scaron;ine 70.00m2 i  sastoji se od:</p>\r\n<p>- KUHINJA I BLAGOVAONICA 21.00m2</p>\r\n<p>- DNEVNI BORAVAK 21.00m2</p>\r\n<p>- WC  2.20m2</p>\r\n<p>- VANJSKA SPREMA 5.00m2</p>\r\n<p>- TERASA 112.00m2</p>\r\n<p>- BAZEN 24.00m2</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>KAT  je povr&scaron;ine 84.00m2:</p>\r\n<p>- SOBA 1 + WC 20.00m2</p>\r\n<p>- SOBA 2 + WC 18.50m2</p>\r\n<p>- SOBA 3 +  WC +LOÐA 28.00m2</p>\r\n<p>- TERASA 30.00m2</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Cijena je atraktivna i kao takva  formirana radi brze prodaje po sistemu "kljuè u ruke"!</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za dodatne  informacije Croatia Property Sales vam stoji na usluzi.</p>', '<div class="WordSection1">\r\n<p><strong><span style="text-decoration: underline;">Only one villa left for sale!</span></strong></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Great opportunity to buy ''discounted'' modern villa.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>These 3 minimalistic  villas, on the north shore of Brac, are being offered at a reduced price  while under construction.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>They are situated just 250m from the sea and 15  minutes driving from Supetar, the main ferry terminal on Brac.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The centre of  the local village is just a short walk away and here are many facilities  required by tourists. There are a range of shops, bars and  restaurants.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The properties consist of 154 m of residential space inside and  sit on large land plots of 615m sq.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The conception and design of each  villa has been carefully considered to ensure privacy, safety, the best use  of space internally and externally.&nbsp;Each has a garage, a 24m sq swimming  pool, a large terrace with bbq grill facilities, and extra parking, while  inside the building they have exciting open plan designs and spacious  bedrooms, as shown below.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>GROUND FLOOR of 70m sq consists:</p>\r\n<p>- kitchen and  dinning 21.00m sq</p>\r\n<p>-&nbsp;living room 21.00m sq</p>\r\n<p>- bathroom 2,20m sq</p>\r\n<p>- storage room  5,00m sq</p>\r\n<p>- terrace 112m sq</p>\r\n<p>- swimming pool 24m sq</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>FIRST FLOOR of 84,00m  sq consists:</p>\r\n<p>- bedroom 1 + bathroom 20.00m sq</p>\r\n<p>- bedroom 2 + bathroom 18.50m  sq</p>\r\n<p>- bedroom 3 + toilet + loggia 28.00m sq</p>\r\n<p>- Terrace 30m sq</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The price  is for ''turn key'' completion. I.e. you move in and everything is ready for  you, but buying before completion guarantees a discount on the final, and  also a say in the style and quality of furnishing and fittings.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact our office for more information and to  arrange to visit the location.</p>', '', '802_House-Villa_0.jpg', '802_House-Villa_1.jpg', '802_House-Villa_2.jpg', '802_House-Villa_3.jpg', '802_House-Villa_4.jpg', '802_House-Villa_5.jpg', '802_House-Villa_6.jpg', '802_House-Villa_7.jpg', '802_House-Villa_8.jpg'),
(803, 'Mirko', '®ivkoviæ', 'Mirko ®ivkoviæ 091/739-9028', '098/317-886 ®ana ®ivkoviæ', 'zana.zivkovic@zg.t-com.hr', 'Solta', 'Riva Pelegrin 75, Stomorska, k.è. 892/3 i 892/2 K.O. Gornje Selo', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '20', '1166', '200', 1, '350000', '', 2, 2, 2, 1, 1, 2, 3, 2, 'August 10, 2014', '<p>Samostojeæa kuæa u prvom redu do mora s panoramskim pogledom na more! Kuæa je smje&scaron;tena na velikoj parceli (povr&scaron;ine 1.166 m2) na kojoj je moguæa gradnja jo&scaron; jedne kuæe, bazena te dodatnih pomoænih objekata. Prostrana vila je moderno i kvalitetno projektirana i izgraðena, a sastoji se od prizemlja, kata i potkrovlja.</p>\r\n<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;">CIJENA SNI®ENA s 640.000 Eura na 350.000 Eura zbog hitne prodaje!!!</span></p>', '<p>We have this great house, designed for modern holiday life, on the water''s edge  on Solta island.&nbsp;The property is situated on a land plot of 1.166m sq!&nbsp;The house is on 3 floors.&nbsp;There is so much space on this large plot that an owner can enjoy extra privacy,  or build a swimming pool, or even an extra dwelling without impacting on this  house.</p>\r\n<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;">PRICE REDUCED from 640.000 Euro to 350.000 Euro to ensure a quick sale!!!</span></p>', '', '<p>Samostojeæa kuæa u prvom redu do mora s panoramskim pogledom na more!</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;"><strong>CIJENA SNI®ENA s 640.000 Eura na 350.000 Eura zbog hitne prodaje!!!</strong></span></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je smje&scaron;tena na velikoj parceli (povr&scaron;ine 1.166 m2) na kojoj je moguæa gradnja jo&scaron; jedne kuæe, bazena te dodatnih pomoænih objekata.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Prostrana vila je moderno i kvalitetno projektirana i izgraðena, a sastoji se od prizemlja, kata i potkrovlja.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U prizemlju se nalazi zasebna kupaonica sa tu&scaron;em, umivaonikom, wc-om, prostrano parkirali&scaron;te, vanjski tu&scaron; sa toplom i hladnom vodom, te konoba prostrana i cijelom tlocrtnom povr&scaron;inom namijenjena da se uredi u kvalitetan stambeni prostor.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na 1. katu se nalazi dnevni boravak, kuhinja i blagovaonica koje su odijeljene mramornim pultom sa velikim staklenim stolom za 6 do 8 osoba. U kuhinji se nalazi sav kuhinjski pribor, elektrièni &scaron;tednjak sa staklo-keramièkom ploèom + peænica, dvostruki sudoper, kuhinjska napa, prostrana smoènica sa policama, gostinjski WC sa umivaonikom, veliki ugraðeni klizni ormar. Kaljeva peæ-kamin odvaja dnevni dio od kuhinje i blagovaone u kojem se nalazi velika kutna aluminijska stijena 3,0 x 2,3 m za panoramski pogled, sa vanjskim kliznim &scaron;kurama, te izlazom na terasu prema moru odakle se pru¾a predivan pogled na more i zalaz sunca.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Terasa je protoèna i povezana oko kuæe tako da se njome dolazi do njenog prostranog intimnog dijela usred zelenog vrta na jugu, a ispod pergole od divlje zelene loze koja pru¾a ugodnu hladovinu za boravljenje tokom dana, ugodu i romantiku tokom noæi.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U potkrovlju se nalaze 3 spavaæe sobe; jedna braèna sa terasom i dvije sobe sa jednostrukim krevetom i loðama, te velikim ugradbenim ormarima. U hodniku se nalazi veliki ugradbeni ormar, odvojeni WC i kupaona sa kadom i dvostrukim umivaonikom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Udaljenost kuæe od centra mjesta iznosi 800 m, tj. svega 10-tak minuta laganog hoda. Udaljenost od trgovina i po&scaron;te je 800 m, od restorana-pizzeria 800-900 m.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Trajektni terminal Rogaè, odakle plove linije do Splita udaljen je 13 km, a povezan je prateæom autobusnom linijom ili taksijem.</p>', '<p>We have this great house, designed for modern holiday life, on the water''s edge  on Solta island.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;"><strong>PRICE REDUCED from 640.000 Euro to 350.000 Euro to ensure a quick sale!!!</strong></span></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property is situated on a land plot of 1.166m sq!</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><br />The house is on 3 floors with a bathroom, garage and spacious  cellar on the ground floor, a first floor with a large well equipped kitchen,  lounge and dining area, easily spacious enough for 8 people to live comfortably.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>From the lounge, double glass doors lead to a terrace with spectacular sea  views, west facing to also fully enjoy the sunsets.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The upstairs has 3  bedrooms, one with a double bed and private terrace, while the other two have a  single bed and small private balconies.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There is plenty of built in storage  space with closets and wardrobes in almost all the rooms, and a family bathroom  on the top floor.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Outside, the gardens have been designed so there is  shade from a vine in high summer, and a bbq grill on the terrace.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There is so  much space on this large plot that an owner can enjoy extra privacy, or build a  swimming pool, or even an extra dwelling without impacting on this  house.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house is 800m from the village center, ie only 10 minutes  walk and the distance from the shops and post office is also 800 m. The nearest  restaurant is a pizzeria style 800-900 m.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ferry Terminal, with line to  Split is 13 km, and is connected to the supporting bus or taxi.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please  contact our office for more information.</p>', '', '803_House-Villa_0.jpg', '803_House-Villa_1.jpg', '803_House-Villa_2.jpg', '803_House-Villa_3.jpg', '803_House-Villa_4.jpg', '803_House-Villa_5.jpg', '803_House-Villa_6.jpg', '803_House-Villa_7.jpg', '803_House-Villa_8.jpg'),
(805, 'Boris', 'Tomiæ', '', '', '', 'Brac', 'Milna', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '5', '0', '100', 1, '198000', '', 2, 2, 2, 1, 1, 2, 3, 1, 'August 19, 2014', '<p>Apartman u prvom redu do mora! Stan je povr&scaron;ine 100 m2 i smje&scaron;ten je na 1.katu stare kamene kuæe. Sastoji se od: 3 spavaæe sobe, dnevnog boravka s blagovaonom i kuhinjom,&nbsp;kupaonice, hodnika. Apartman ima veliku natkrivenu terasu sa pogledom na more! Kompletno je renoviran i namje&scaron;ten.</p>', '<p>Fabulous harbour side apartment in historic building. We are pleased to offer this large, modernised apartment, which is situated just a few yards from the water on the edge of harbour. The apartment itself is on the first floor of an old property, built in the distinctive style typical of the area. It''s 100m sq, has 3 bedrooms, and an open plan living room, kitchen and dining room, a covered balcony with views across the harbour.</p>', '', '<p>Apartman u prvom redu do mora!</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Stan je povr&scaron;ine 100 m2 i smje&scaron;ten je na 1.katu stare kamene kuæe.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sastoji se od: 3 spavaæe sobe, dnevnog boravka s blagovaonom i kuhinjom,&nbsp;kupaonice, hodnika.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartman ima veliku natkrivenu terasu sa pogledom na more!</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kompletno je renoviran i namje&scaron;ten.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Prilaz vozilom do same kuæe.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sva infrastruktura postoji.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Vlasni&scaron;tvo je uredno.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Katamaranska redovna veza sa Splitom. Trajektna luka je udaljena 20 minuta vo¾nje.</p>', '<p>Fabulous harbour side apartment in historic building.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>We are pleased to  offer this large, modernised apartment, which is situated just a few yards  from the water on the edge of harbour.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>This wonderfully preserved village,  with a historic port full of character, is one of the most photogenic  settings along the coast.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The apartment itself is on the first floor of  an old property, built in the distinctive style typical of the area.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It''s  100m sq, has 3 bedrooms, and an open plan living room, kitchen and dining  room, a covered balcony with views across the harbour.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property has  been renovated and modernised, and has been thoughtfully  furnished.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There is vehicle access to the house, and the main ferry port  with ferries to Split is just over 20 minutes driving.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The village  has several shops, bars and restaurants which cater well for tourists and  the local islanders.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact our office in Split to arrange to view  this property.</p>', '', '805_Apartment_0.jpg', '805_Apartment_1.jpg', '805_Apartment_2.jpg', '805_Apartment_3.jpg', '805_Apartment_4.jpg', '805_Apartment_5.jpg', '805_Apartment_6.jpg', '805_Apartment_7.jpg', '805_Apartment_8.jpg'),
(806, 'Danica', 'Jandras', '', '', '', 'Hvar', 'Hvar, Vrboska, ', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '20', '420', '123', 1, '680000', '', 2, 2, 2, 1, 1, 2, 5, 2, 'August 19, 2014', '<p>Prekrasna kuæa na odliènoj lokaciji u prvom redu do mora, sa divnim pogledom!&nbsp;Od pla¾e je udaljena 20 metara.&nbsp;Kuæa ima ukupnu stambenu  povr&scaron;inu 123 m2. Povr&scaron;ina parcele je 420 m2.&nbsp;Ukupno ima 5 soba i 2  kupaonice.&nbsp;Ispred kuæe postoji moguænost parkiranja broda u za&scaron;tiæenoj uvali.&nbsp;Kuæa ima  dvije gara¾e i lijepo ureðeni vrt sa ro&scaron;tiljem.</p>', '<p>This is a beautiful house, right on the sea shore with boat mooring in front of the property. It is situated on the north side of Hvar island, facing west, with the sea at the bottom of the garden in a quiet and sheltered cove. The plot is 420m sq and the living area of the property has 123m sq. This house enjoys the peace, quiet and privacy of an idyllic island location.</p>', '', '<p>Prekrasna kuæa na odliènoj lokaciji u prvom redu do mora, sa divnim pogledom!</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Od pla¾e je udaljena 20 metara.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa ima ukupnu stambenu  povr&scaron;inu 123 m2. Povr&scaron;ina parcele je 420 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ukupno ima 5 soba i 2  kupaonice. Kuæa se sastoji od prizemlja i kata.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U prizemlju je jedan  veliki apartman i dvije gara¾e.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na prvom katu se nalazi veliki obiteljski  stan okru¾en balkonima i terasama.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ispred kuæe postoji moguænost  parkiranja broda u za&scaron;tiæenoj uvali.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa ima dvije gara¾e i lijepo ureðeni  vrt sa ro&scaron;tiljem.</p>', '<p>This is a beautiful house, right on the sea shore with boat mooring in front  of the property.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is situated on the north side of Hvar island, facing  west, with the sea at the bottom of the garden in a quiet and sheltered  cove.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is 15 minutes drive from the nearest main village, where there are shops, bars and other facilities for tourists and islanders  alike.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The plot is 420m sq and the living area of the property has 123m  sq.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Inside the property it has a garage on the ground floor and a  separate small 1 bedroom apartment, but above, on the first floor there is a  4 bedroom apartment, with a large open kitchen lounge and access through glass doors onto a balcony, designed to enjoy the prime location looking over the sea.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house has a total of 2 garages, and a boat can be  moored in the sheltered bay, just in front of the property.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The terrace  has an attractive bbq grill and plenty of space to enjoy the sun.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>This house enjoys the peace, quiet and privacy of an idyllic  island location.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact our office in Hvar town for more  information.</p>', '', '806_House-Villa_0.jpg', '806_House-Villa_1.jpg', '806_House-Villa_2.jpg', '806_House-Villa_3.jpg', '806_House-Villa_4.jpg', '806_House-Villa_5.jpg', '806_House-Villa_6.jpg', '806_House-Villa_7.jpg', '806_House-Villa_8.jpg'),
(807, 'Boris', 'Tomiæ', '', '', '', 'Brac', 'Supetar', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '300', '560', '300', 1, '298000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 8, 4, 'August 19, 2014', '<p>Samostojeæa kuæa na dvije eta¾e u Supetru sa lijepim pogledom, svega 300 metara udaljena od mora!&nbsp;Ukupna stambena povr&scaron;ina je 300 m2, dok je  ukupna povr&scaron;ina parcele 560 m2.&nbsp;Sastoji se od 2 dvosobna i 2 jednosobna  apartmana.&nbsp;Sjeverozapadna orijentacija. Odlièan pristup. Sva infrastruktura postoji.<br /><br /></p>', '<p>We are pleased to offer this modern, detached 2 story house with a sea view, in Supetar on Brac island. The total living area is 300 m2, while the total area of &#8203;&#8203;the plot is 560 m2. It consists of 1 x two bedroom apartment and 2 x one bedroom apartments. The centre of the village is 400m away, and here are many shops, bars restaurants and the ferry terminal to Split.</p>', '', '<p>Samostojeæa kuæa na dvije eta¾e u Supetru sa lijepim pogledom, svega 300 metara udaljena od mora!</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ukupne stambena povr&scaron;ina je 300 m2, dok je  ukupna povr&scaron;ina parcele 560 m2. Sastoji se od 2 dvosobna (svaki povr&scaron;ine 60 m2) i 2 jednosobna  apartmana (svaki povr&scaron;ine 45 m2).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Moguæe je prenamjeniti unutra&scaron;nji raspored, uz dovr&scaron;enje  zidnih i podnih obloga u nekim prostorijama.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Okuænica je prostrano  prednje donje dvori&scaron;te, te stra¾nje sjenovito zatvoreno dvori&scaron;te s kaminom  koje se da oplemeniti ureðenjem i sadnjom dodatnog raslinja.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je  u blizini ureðenih pla¾a, s prateæim sadr¾ajima za odmor i rekreaciju, ali  i nedirnutih djelova obale za one koji preferiraju mir i  osamu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sjeverozapadna orijentacija. Odlièan pristup. Sva infrastruktura  postoji.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Parking za 3 vozila.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Centar mjesta je udaljen 400  metara.</p>', '<p>We are pleased to offer this modern, detached 2 story house with a sea view,  in Supetar on Brac island.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The total living area is 300 m2, while the  total area of &#8203;&#8203;the plot is 560 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property is on a northwest  orientation, with easy access and parking. The house has all the modern  features you would expect (aircon, sat tv etc).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It consists of 1 x two  bedroom apartment and 2 x one bedroom apartments.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It would be easily  possible to re-design the internal space but the current owner was using it  this way to rent to tourists in the holiday season.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The courtyard is  a spacious area with a bbq grill and it has been landscaped and planted with  attractive native plants.&nbsp;Parking for 3 cars.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house is near the  excellent beaches, with plenty of activities for rest and recreation, but it  is also close to many untouched parts of the coast suited to all those who  like a discreet area for swimming.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The centre of the village is 400m away,  and here are many shops, bars restaurants and the ferry terminal to  Split.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact our office in Split for more information and to  arrange a viewing.</p>', '', '807_House-Villa_0.jpg', '807_House-Villa_1.jpg', '807_House-Villa_2.jpg', '807_House-Villa_3.jpg', '807_House-Villa_4.jpg', '807_House-Villa_5.jpg', '', '', '');
INSERT INTO `nekretnina` (`id`, `ime`, `prezime`, `telefon`, `mobitel`, `e_mail`, `lokacija_id`, `adresa`, `status_id`, `vrsta_id`, `udaljenost`, `povrsina`, `stambenapovrsina`, `display`, `cijena`, `cijenatocka`, `ponuda_tjedna`, `new_built`, `must_sell`, `prvi_red_do_mora`, `pogled_na_more`, `bazen`, `broj_soba`, `broj_kupatila`, `datum`, `title_hr`, `title_en`, `title_ge`, `opis_hr`, `opis_en`, `opis_ge`, `PropertyImageURL0`, `PropertyImageURL1`, `PropertyImageURL2`, `PropertyImageURL3`, `PropertyImageURL4`, `PropertyImageURL5`, `PropertyImageURL6`, `PropertyImageURL7`, `PropertyImageURL8`) VALUES
(808, 'Boris', 'Tomiæ', '', '', '', 'Brac', 'Supetar', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '300', '560', '330', 2, '295000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 6, 5, 'August 19, 2014', '<p>Samostojeæa kuæa na èetiri eta¾e u Supetru sa pogledom na more! Kuæa ima 330 m2 ukupne stambene povr&scaron;ine, dok je parcela je povr&scaron;ine 560 m2. Kuæa se sastoji od 4 apartmana i 1 velikog stana. Sjeverozapadna orijentacija. Odlièan pristup. Sva infrastruktura postoji. Kuæa je od mora udaljena 300 metara.</p>', '<p>Large detached house in Supetar, split into apartments and used by tourists. This 4 floor house has been subdivided into 4 apartments with a penthouse above. The total floor area is 330m sq and the building sits on a plot of 560m sq. The building is on a northwest orientation, 300m from the sea and with parking for 3 vehicles.</p>', '', '<p>Samostojeæa kuæa na èetiri eta¾e u Supetru sa pogledom na more!</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa ima  330 m2 ukupne stambene povr&scaron;ine, dok je parcela je povr&scaron;ine 560 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa  se sastoji od 4 apartmana i 1 velikog stana.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Prizemlje: 2 gara¾e, 1 apartman  od 45 m2</p>\r\n<p>I kat: 1 stan od 80 m2</p>\r\n<p>II Kat: 2 apartmana svaki 40  m2</p>\r\n<p>Potkrovlje: 1 apartman od 35 m2 plus terasa 30m2</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ukupno ima 6  spavaæih soba i 5 kupatila. Postojeæi unutra&scaron;nji raspored moguæe je  prenamjeniti.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Okuænica je prostrano prednje dvori&scaron;te sa ro&scaron;tilj  kuæicom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sjeverozapadna orijentacija. Odlièan pristup. Sva infrastruktura  postoji.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je od mora udaljena 300 metara.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U blizini ureðenih pla¾a, sa  prateæim sadr¾ajima za odmor i rekreaciju.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Parking za 3 vozila.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Od  centra mjesta je udaljena 400 metara.</p>', '<p>Large detached house in Supetar, split into apartments and used by  tourists.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>This 4 floor house has been subdivided into 4 apartments with a penthouse above.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The total floor area is 330m sq and the building  sits on a plot of 560m sq.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The ground floor of the building is&nbsp; 2  garages, 1 apartment of 45 m2</p>\r\n<p>The first floor: 1 bedroom apartment of 80  m2</p>\r\n<p>The second floor: 2 apartments, each 40 m2</p>\r\n<p>Top floor: 1 apartment of 35  m2 plus 30m2 terrace.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The balcony at the top has lovely views across the  town and out to sea.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>In total there are 6 bedrooms, 5 bathrooms, but the  layout can be easily altered to meet the needs of the owner.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The terrace  in front of the property has a large bbq grill.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The building is on a  northwest orientation, 300m from the sea and with parking for 3  vehicles.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The centre of the village is no more than few minutes  walk.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The nearest beach has plenty of facilities and entertainments, especially for youngsters, but close by there are many discreet swimming areas for those who enjoy calm, and quiet.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please call our office to  arrange to visit this property.</p>', '', '808_House-Villa_0.jpg', '808_House-Villa_1.jpg', '808_House-Villa_2.jpg', '808_House-Villa_3.jpg', '808_House-Villa_4.jpg', '808_House-Villa_5.jpg', '808_House-Villa_6.jpg', '', ''),
(809, 'Boris', 'Tomiæ', '', '', '', 'Brac', 'Supetar', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '100', '0', '70', 2, '89000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 3, 1, 'August 19, 2014', '<p>Stan u samoj gradskoj jezgri, 100 m od mora i centra, 2.kat i potkrovlje. Sve namje&scaron;teno, u funkciji trajnog stanovanja. Klimatizirano, rije&scaron;eno grijanje i hlaðenje prostora. Kvalitetno graðeno, prije 10 godina. Prilaz vozilom na 20 m od stana.</p>', '<p>Great value apartment in the centre of Supetar village.&nbsp;This property is  on the second and third floor, and is ready for <br />residence  immediately.&nbsp;It is placed on the 2nd floor, with 70m sq residential  area.&nbsp;There is vehicle access to within a few yards of the  building.&nbsp;It is a well built property with modcons such as aircon, sat tv etc and well finished, with wooden floors or ceramic tiles and top quality bathroom fittings.<br /><br /></p>', '', '<p>Stan u samoj gradskoj jezgri, 100 m od mora i centra, 2.kat i potkrovlje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na 2. katu se nalazi dnevni boravak s blagovaonom i kuhinjom, kupaonica i 1 spavaæa soba.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Meðueta¾a - stepeni&scaron;te i 1 mala soba.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Potkrovlje - 1 spavaæa soba.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sve je namje&scaron;teno i u funkciji trajnog stanovanja.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Klimatizirano, rije&scaron;eno grijanje i hlaðenje prostora.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kvalitetno graðeno - prije 10 godina.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sobe s parketom, ostale prostorije pokrivene ploèicama, stepeni&scaron;te kombinacija kamen-drvo.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nema balkona, ali moguæe otvoriti terasu u potkrovlju.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Prilaz vozilom na 20 m od stana.</p>', '<p>Great value apartment in the centre of Supetar village.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>This property is  on the second and third floor, and is ready for residence  immediately.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is placed on the 2nd floor, with 70m sq residential  area.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is an open plan living room, kitchen and dining area, a bathroom and a bedroom. Internal stairs lead up to the loft where there is&nbsp;another  bedroom and even space to expand out to create a terrace.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is a well built  property with modcons such as aircon, sat tv etc and well finished, with  wooden floors or ceramic tiles and top quality bathroom  fittings.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There is vehicle access to within a few yards of the  building.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The village has the ferry terminal, many shops, bars and  restaurants as well as other facilities useful for the tourists and  islanders alike.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The sea has a popular beach near the harbour or a few  minute''s walk away there are many discreet coves and areas for those who  like quieter pastimes.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Maybe fishing, sun bathing etc.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please  contact our office in Split to arrange to visit this property.</p>', '', '809_Apartment_0.jpg', '809_Apartment_1.jpg', '809_Apartment_2.jpg', '809_Apartment_3.jpg', '809_Apartment_4.jpg', '', '', '', ''),
(824, 'Zdravko', 'Bojaniæ', '', '', '', 'Hvar', 'è.z. 3273/3, zgr. 280', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '300', '233', '170', 1, '208000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 4, 2, 'August 26, 2014', '<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;">KUÆA SA PREKRASNIM POGLEDOM NA MORE NA JU®NOJ STRANI OTOKA HVARA!&nbsp;</span>Udaljenost od mora je 300 metara. Kuæa ima ukupnu stambenu povr&scaron;inu od 170 m2. Povr&scaron;ina parcele je 233 m2. Sve je novo i useljivo, novi namje&scaron;taj, bijela tehnika (dvije kuhinje, dvije kupaonice/WC). Èeka vas novi dom sa prekrasnim pogledom, nedaleko od mora i prekrasnih&nbsp;pla¾a na ju¾noj strani otoka Hvara.</p>\r\n<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;">CIJENA SNI®ENA SA 235.000 EUR!!</span></p>', '<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;"><strong>REDUCED PRICE TO ENSURE A QUICK SALE - from 235.000 to 208.000 Euro!</strong></span></p>\r\n<p>We are offering this modern style villa on the south side of Hvar island, used as two apartments. This attractive property is situated 300m from the sea among similar and appropriate buildings which ensure that the house is private but not isolated. It is on the south side of the island, walking distance from the attractive beach and nearest coffee bar.</p>', '', '<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;"><strong>CIJENA SNI®ENA SA 235.000 EUR!!</strong></span></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>KUÆA SA PREKRASNIM POGLEDOM NA MORE NA JU®NOJ STRANI OTOKA  HVARA!</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Udaljenost od mora je 300 metara.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa ima ukupnu stambenu  povr&scaron;inu od 170 m2. Povr&scaron;ina parcele je 233 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa se sastoji od 2 trosobna  stana sa 2 kuhinje i 2 kupaonice, 2 balkona, 4 parkirna mjesta.</p>\r\n<p>Svaki kat  ima povr&scaron;inu 85m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sve je novo i useljivo, novi namje&scaron;taj, bijela tehnika  (dvije kuhinje, dvije kupaonice/WC).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Èeka vas novi dom sa prekrasnim  pogledom, nedaleko od mora i prekrasnih pla¾a na ju¾noj strani otoka  Hvara.</p>', '<p>We are offering this modern style villa on the south side of Hvar island,  used as two apartments.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;"><strong>REDUCED PRICE TO ENSURE A QUICK SALE - from 235.000 to 208.000 Euro!</strong></span></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>This attractive property is situated 300m from  the sea among similar and appropriate buildings which ensure that the house  is private but not isolated.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is on the south side of the island,  walking distance from the attractive beach and nearest coffee  bar.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The building is divided into two apartments, both 85m sq and they consist of 2 bedrooms, kitchen, lounge, dining area and bathroom and each has a balcony/ private terrace.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>They are well maintained and are  being sold ''ready to move in''.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There are a total of 4 parking spaces on a  land plot of 233m sq.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It would be a lovely family holiday villa with  plenty of space inside, outside, and with long and unobstructed views across  the bay and out to sea.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact our office for more  information.</p>', '', '824_House-Villa_0.jpg', '824_House-Villa_1.jpg', '824_House-Villa_2.jpg', '824_House-Villa_3.jpg', '824_House-Villa_4.jpg', '824_House-Villa_5.jpg', '824_House-Villa_6.jpg', '824_House-Villa_7.jpg', '824_House-Villa_8.jpg'),
(810, 'Boris', 'Tomiæ', '', '', '', 'Brac', 'Milna', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '70', '0', '63', 2, '99000', '', 2, 2, 2, 1, 1, 2, 2, 1, 'August 20, 2014', '<p>Apartman u prvom redu do mora sa spektakularnim pogledom, u malom mjestu na  ju¾noj strani otoka Braèa.&nbsp;Apartman je povr&scaron;ine 53.10 m2 plus terasa povr&scaron;ine  10.70 m2.&nbsp;Radi se o dvoeta¾nom apartmanu koji se sastoji od: dvije  spavaæe sobe, kupaonice, kuhinje i dnevnog dijela sa izlazom na  terasu.&nbsp;Ima otvoren pogled na more!</p>', '<p>Seafront apartment with spectacular sea view, in the centre of a small village on the South side of Brac island. The apartment is on 2 levels, on the 2nd floor of a modern block. It has barely been used by the current owners, so is in pristine condition. Apartment is 53,10 m2 living area + 10.70 m2 terrace.</p>', '', '<p>Apartman u prvom redu do mora sa spektakularnim pogledom, u malom mjestu na  ju¾noj strani otoka Braèa.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartman je povr&scaron;ine 53.10 m2 plus terasa povr&scaron;ine  10.70 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Radi se o dvoeta¾nom apartmanu koji se sastoji od: dvije  spavaæe sobe, kupaonice, kuhinje i dnevnog dijela sa izlazom na  terasu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ima otvoren pogled na more!</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>1 parking mjesto ulazi u  cijenu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartman je potpuno nov, kompletno namje&scaron;ten i gotovo da nije  kori&scaron;ten.</p>', '<p>Seafront apartment with spectacular sea view, in the centre of a small village on the South side of Brac island.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The apartment is on 2  levels, on the 2nd floor of a modern block.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It has barely been used by the  current owners, so is in pristine condition.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartment is 53,10 m2 living  area + 10.70 m2 terrace.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is consist of: two bedrooms, bathroom,  kitchen and living room with glass doors leading onto the large  balcony.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Not only is it new and spacious but the views from the balcony make  this apartment very special, especially at this price.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It looks down to the harbour where the activity of the visiting summer sailors and local fisherman make it constantly interesting.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The village is small and  the harbour is very much in the centre of the village, close to this  apartment, and it has bars, restaurant, a few shops and other services  catering for visitors and locals alike.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There is a parking place with this  property, and the distance to Supetar, the main port on the island, is about  20 minutes drive.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact our office in Split to arrange to visit  this property.</p>', '', '810_Apartment_0.jpg', '810_Apartment_1.jpg', '810_Apartment_2.jpg', '810_Apartment_3.jpg', '810_Apartment_4.jpg', '810_Apartment_5.jpg', '810_Apartment_6.jpg', '810_Apartment_7.jpg', '810_Apartment_8.jpg'),
(811, 'Boris', 'Tomiæ', '', '', '', 'Brac', 'Mirca', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '70', '280', '150', 1, '248000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 4, 2, 'August 20, 2014', '<p>Kuæa u nizu u malom mirnom mjestu uz more na sjevernoj strani otoka Braèa. Ima ukupnu stambenu povr&scaron;inu 150 m2, dok je povr&scaron;ina parcele 280 m2.&nbsp;Kuæa se sastoji od prizemlja i kata. Kuæa je na dobroj lokaciji i od mora je udaljena svega 70 m. Odmah je useljiva, ima uporabnu dozvolu i moguænost pro&scaron;irenja.</p>', '<p>We have this attractive terraced house on the north side of the island with a large garden. The property is 70m from the sea shore, and a few minute''s walk from the centre of the small village where it is situated. The house consists of two floors. It was built in 1992 and has 152m sq of living area, and a garden of 280m sq. It is well decorated and habitable immediately.</p>', '', '<p>Kuæa u nizu u malom mirnom mjestu uz more na sjevernoj strani otoka  Braèa.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ima ukupnu stambenu povr&scaron;inu 150 m2, dok je povr&scaron;ina parcele 280  m2.&nbsp;Kuæa se sastoji od prizemlja i kata.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Prizemlje: kuhinja,  blagavaonica, dnevni boravak i kupaonica, jedna spavaæa soba, dvije  terase.</p>\r\n<p>Unutarnjim stubi&scaron;tem se ide na kat na kojem se nalaze 3 spavaæe sobe, kupaonica, kuhinja i veliki balkon.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Moguæe i bavljenje "turistièkom  djelatno&scaron;æu", s obzirom da se pokraj kuæe mo¾e postaviti bazen.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa  je na dobroj lokaciji i od mora je udaljena svega 70 m.&nbsp;Kao takva je i  svojevrsna oaza mira u blizini ureðene pla¾e.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Pogled na more je  djelomièan, jer iako je smje&scaron;tena u drugom redu od mora,&nbsp;dijelom je zaklonjena kuæom  ispred.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je izgraðena 1992. godine i spojena je na svu  infrastrukturu.&nbsp;Odmah je useljiva, ima uporabnu dozvolu i moguænost  pro&scaron;irenja.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Od centra mjesta je udaljena 200 metara.</p>\r\n<p>Od trajektne luke  u Supetru udaljena je svega 2 km.</p>', '<p>We have this attractive terraced house on the north side of the island with  a large garden.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property is 70m from the sea shore, and a few  minute''s walk from the centre of the small village where it is situated.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The village is close to Supetar, the main village on the island,  and the ferry terminal.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house consists of two floors.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ground  floor: kitchen, dining room, living room and bathroom with toilet, one  bedroom, two terraces.</p>\r\n<p>An inner staircase leads to the first floor where  there are three bedrooms, bathroom, kitchen and a large balcony.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It  was built in 1992 and has 152m sq of living area, and a garden of 280m sq.  It is well decorated and habitable immediately.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>When not used for private  purposes it would be possible to use the property to rent to tourists, and  improvements could be made such as the addition of a swimming pool in the  large garden, or an extension.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>This house is offered at a price to  encourage a quick sale, so please contact our office in Split to arrange to  view here.</p>', '', '811_House-Villa_0.jpg', '811_House-Villa_1.jpg', '811_House-Villa_2.jpg', '811_House-Villa_3.jpg', '811_House-Villa_4.jpg', '811_House-Villa_5.jpg', '811_House-Villa_6.jpg', '811_House-Villa_7.jpg', '811_House-Villa_8.jpg'),
(812, 'Zvonimir', 'Kiriðija', '', '091 57664442', '', 'Hvar', 'Jelsa, Vitarnja', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '10', '738', '280', 1, '1000000', '', 2, 2, 2, 1, 1, 2, 12, 9, 'August 20, 2014', '<p>Kuæa sa 6 apartmana, odmah do mora sa prekrasnim pogledom, u malom mjestu na sjevernoj strani otoka Hvara! Povr&scaron;ina parcele je 738 m2, dok je ukupna stambena povr&scaron;ina objekta 280 m2. Kuæa/ Villa se sastoji od 6 samostalnih apartmana koji su od mora udaljeni svega 15 metara. Pristupna cesta se nalazi iza kuæe, dok ispred prema moru nema puta, te je privatnost zagarantirana!!</p>', '<p>Superb, first line holiday apartment''s house on Hvar island! We are pleased to offer this modern style house which is divided into 6 apartments in a beautiful location. Plot area is 738 m2, and the total living area is 280 m2 building. The access road is located behind the house, and in front of the sea there is no right of way, so privacy is guaranteed!</p>', '', '<p>Kuæa sa 6 apartmana, odmah do mora sa prekrasnim pogledom, u malom mjestu na  sjevernoj strani otoka Hvara!</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Povr&scaron;ina parcele je 738 m2, dok je ukupna  stambena povr&scaron;ina objekta 280 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa/ Villa se sastoji od 6 samostalnih  apartmana koji su od mora udaljeni svega 15 metara.&nbsp;Ima ukupno 12 soba, 7  dnevnih boravka, 9 kupaonica, prostorija za pranje rublja i 3 sobice ispod  parkinga za servisne usluge.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Svi apartmani imaju balkone i otvoreni  pogled na more!&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Postoji moguènost gradnje bazena u okviru  parcele.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Radi se o vrhunskoj lokaciji na ovom dijelu  otoka!</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Pristupna cesta se nalazi iza kuæe, dok ispred prema moru nema  puta, te je privatnost zagarantirana!!</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa posjeduje 8 parkirnih mjesta  te pomoæni prostor.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Objekat je sagraðen 2003 godine i u odliènom je  stanju.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Udaljenost od centra mjesta je 900 m, dok je marina za jahte  udaljena 2 km.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Povezanost trajekta sa kopnom je vi&scaron;e puta dnevno.&nbsp;Najbli¾i  aerodrom nalazi se u Splitu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Moguænost kori&scaron;tenja:</p>\r\n<p>a) nepromjenjeno  kao 6 (+1) apartmana za turistièko iznajmljivanje</p>\r\n<p>b) Rekonstrukcija: 1 velika  vila sa bazenom i vrtom.</p>\r\n<p>c) Rekonstrukcija: 2 vile sa bazenom i vrtom.</p>', '<p>Superb, first line holiday apartment''s house on Hvar island!</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>We are pleased  to offer this modern style house which is divided into 6 apartments in a  beautiful location.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is situated just a few yards from the water''s  edge, in a small and historic fishing village on the northern side of the  island.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Plot area is 738 m2, and the total living area is  280 m2 building.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>House / Villa consists of 6 independent apartments, all  with sea views.&nbsp;There are a total of 12 rooms, 7 dining rooms, 9 bathrooms,  laundry room and three small rooms under the parking lot for  servicing.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>All apartments have balconies and there is scope to improve the property, and therefore rental income, by building a swimming pool within the plot.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The access road is located behind the house, and in  front of the sea there is no right of way, so privacy is guaranteed!</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The  house has 8 parking spaces and extra spaces if required.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The building was  built in 2003 and has been maintained to a high standard. It is still in  excellent condition.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Distance from the town center is 900 m, while the  yacht marina 2 km away.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There are ferry connections to the mainland  several times a day.</p>\r\n<p>The nearest airport is in Split.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>As well as being  used as a premises generating an income from the apartments in the tourist  season there is potential to reconstruct the building into one first class  villa, or maybe 2 family sized properties, with a pool etc.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please  contact our office to arrange to visit this property.</p>', '', '812_House-Villa_0.jpg', '812_House-Villa_1.jpg', '812_House-Villa_2.jpg', '812_House-Villa_3.jpg', '812_House-Villa_4.jpg', '812_House-Villa_5.jpg', '812_House-Villa_6.jpg', '812_House-Villa_7.jpg', '812_House-Villa_8.jpg'),
(813, '', 'dr. Cariæ', '', '', '', 'Hvar', 'Ivan Dolac', 'For sale', 'Old stone house', '300', '100', '65', 1, '65000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 0, 0, 'August 20, 2014', '<p>Kamena kuæa za renovaciju na ju¾noj strani otoka Hvara, sa lijepim pogledom na more! Kuæa se sastoji od prizemlja, kata i potkrovlja, ukupne stambene povr&scaron;ine 65 m2. Povr&scaron;ina zemlji&scaron;ta je 100 m2. Ima odlièan pogled na more a do &scaron;ljiunèanih pla¾a je svega par minuta &scaron;etnje. Prikljuèci struje i vode su u neposrednoj blizini. Od mora je udaljena svega 300 metara.</p>', '<p>An interesting renovation project on Hvar island. This traditional old stone house is in need of complete renovation, but its great location on the south side of Hvar island, and on the slope giving views across the sea, means that it will become a superb house. The house is on 3 floors, with a total living area of 65 m2 with 100 m2 of garden. The house is located 300 meters from the sea near one of the most beautiful beaches on the south side of Hvar.</p>', '', '<p>Kamena kuæa za renovaciju na ju¾noj strani otoka Hvara, sa lijepim pogledom  na more!</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa se sastoji od prizemlja, kata i potkrovlja, ukupne stambene povr&scaron;ine 65 m2. Povr&scaron;ina zemlji&scaron;ta je 100 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ispred kuæe je terasa koja  je i stara kamena gusterna koja bi se u prizemlju dala pripojiti kuæi i tako  dobiti veæi prostor.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ima odlièan pogled na more a do &scaron;ljiunèanih pla¾a je  svega par minuta &scaron;etnje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa ima potencijal da sa relativno malom  investicijom moze postati odlièna vikendica za uzivanje ili najam, na jednom  od lijep&scaron;ih lokacija u Dalmaciji.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Prikljuèci struje i vode su u  neposrednoj blizini.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Od mora je udaljena svega 300 metara.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za dodatne  informacije kontaktirajte Croatia Property Sales ured u Hvaru!</p>', '<p>An interesting renovation project on Hvar island.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>This traditional old  stone house is in need of complete renovation, but its great location on the  south side of Hvar island, and on the slope giving views across the sea,  means that it will become a superb house.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house is on 3 floors, with  a total living area of 65 m2 with 100 m2 of garden.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is also  possible to extend the house for 20m2 on each floor, which ultimately gives  the potential to have up to 125m2 of living space, or slightly less  internal space and a roof terrace!&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house is located 300 meters from  the sea near one of the most beautiful beaches on the south side of Hvar,  near the restaurants with a beautiful view of the sea.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house has road  access, NO connections of electricity and water which are by the  house.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>With the necessary renovation and improvement potential, this  house represents an exceptional opportunity for investment for tourism and  for a beautiful holiday house.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact our Hvar office for  more information.</p>', '', '813_Old-stone-house_0.jpg', '813_Old-stone-house_1.jpg', '813_Old-stone-house_2.jpg', '813_Old-stone-house_3.jpg', '', '', '', '', ''),
(814, 'Boris', 'Tomiæ', '', '', '', 'Brac', 'Sutivan', 'For sale', 'Old stone house', '50', '0', '150', 2, '490000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 5, 4, 'August 21, 2014', '<p>Tradicionalna kamena kuæa na sjevernoj strani otoka Braèa, od mora i pla¾a  udaljena samo 50 metera. Kuæa je smje&scaron;tena u starom dijelu mjesta koje je  poznato po starinskoj arhitekturi i èistim pla¾ama od sitnog  &scaron;ljunka!&nbsp;Nalazi se u mirnoj i tihoj ulici, pola minute &scaron;etnje do  pla¾e.&nbsp;Kuæa je renovirana 2008 godine, te je potpuno spremna za komforni  <br />boravak i stanovanje.&nbsp;Kuæa je ukupne stambene povr&scaron;ine 150 m2 + dvor 30 m2.</p>', '<p>This is a very attractive, refurbished house in a small village on the north side of Brac. It is situated in the centre of this quaint and charming village, just 50m from the sea, known for its clean beaches with small pebbles. The house itself was renovated inside and outside in 2008 and is being sold ready for an immediate stay, with bedding, towels and furniture all included. The house has a living area of 150m sq and a small yard of 30m sq.</p>', '', '<p>Tradicionalna kamena kuæa na sjevernoj strani otoka Braèa, od mora i pla¾a  udaljena samo 50 metera.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je smje&scaron;tena u starom dijelu mjesta koje je  poznato po starinskoj arhitekturi i èistim pla¾ama od sitnog  &scaron;ljunka!<br />Nalazi se u mirnoj i tihoj ulici, pola minute &scaron;etnje do  pla¾e.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je renovirana 2008 godine, te je potpuno spremna za komforni boravak i stanovanje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Opremljena namje&scaron;tajem, kuhinjskim aparatima,  kompletnom posteljinom, ruènicima i slièno.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je ukupne stambene  povr&scaron;ine 150 m2 + dvor 30 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Prizemlje: partman sa velikom kuhinjom i  izlazom u dvori&scaron;te (spavaæa&nbsp;soba- dopunska soba- dvori&scaron;te u talijanskom  stilu- kupaonica).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>I kat: spavaæa soba sa wc-om i tu&scaron;em - balkon - djeèja  soba sa kupatilom</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>II kat: dnevni boravak sa kuhinjom (iz dnevnog boravka  postoji izlaz na terasu s pogledom na starinski vrt), spavaæa  soba, kupaonica.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Djelomièan pogled na more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Parking je na  ulici.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Centar mjesta je udaljen 50 metara.</p>\r\n<p>Trajektna luka u Supetru je  udaljena 15 min vo¾nje.</p>', '<p>This is a very attractive, refurbished house in a small village on the north  side of Brac.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is situated in the centre of this quaint and charming  village, just 50m from the sea, known for its clean beaches with small  pebbles.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house itself was renovated inside and outside in 2008 and is  being sold ready for an immediate stay, with bedding, towels and furniture  all included.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house has a living area of 150m sq and a small yard  of 30m sq.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>When it was reconstructed special care was made to ensure the  balcony is accessible to give the best possible use of the space, and  enhance the features of this old house.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house is well decorated, well  maintained and well furnished.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ground floor: apartment with a large  kitchen and access to the garden (sleeping room or an additional room or  garden in the Italian style-bathroom)</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>First floor: bedroom with toilet  and shower - balcony - children''s room with bathroom</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Second floor: living  room with kitchen (from the living room there is access to the terrace overlooking the old garden), bedroom,&nbsp;bathroom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There is  nearby street parking and a partial view of the sea, and an interesting view  across the old town.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The main ferry port of Supetar is 15 minutes drive  away.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact the Croatia Property sales office for more information  on this house.</p>', '', '814_Old-stone-house_0.jpg', '814_Old-stone-house_1.jpg', '814_Old-stone-house_2.jpg', '814_Old-stone-house_3.jpg', '814_Old-stone-house_4.jpg', '814_Old-stone-house_5.jpg', '814_Old-stone-house_6.jpg', '814_Old-stone-house_7.jpg', '814_Old-stone-house_8.jpg'),
(815, 'Boris', 'Tomiæ', '', '', '', 'Brac', 'Sutivan', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '300', '642', '120', 2, '295000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 3, 3, 'August 21, 2014', '<p>Samostojeæa kuæa u malom lijepom mjestu na sjevernoj strani otoka Braèa,&nbsp;300 metara do prekrasne ureðene &scaron;ljunèane pla¾e. Kuæa je ukupne stambene povr&scaron;ine 90 m2 + 30 m2 natkrivena terasa.&nbsp;Parcela je povr&scaron;ine 642m2. Okuænicu èini mediteranski vrt èije je odr¾avanje vrlo jednostavno. Trajektna luka u Supetru je udaljena 15 minuta vo¾nje.</p>', '<p>This is a modern style detached house on the northern side of Brac island. It is situated 300m from the beach, up the gently sloping side of the island to give elevated views towards the mainland and out to sea. The plot is 642m sq, and the garden has been designed for ease of maintenance, with established olive and fig trees giving shade and privacy. The house has total living area of 90m sq plus 30m sq of cowered terrace.</p>', '', '<p>Samostojeæa kuæa u malom lijepom mjestu na sjevernoj strani otoka Braèa,&nbsp;300  metara do prekrasne ureðene &scaron;ljunèane pla¾e.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je ukupne stambene  povr&scaron;ine 90 m2 + 30 m2 natkrivena terasa.&nbsp;Parcela je povr&scaron;ine  642m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>70 m2: 3 spavaæe sobe , dnevni boravak, kuhinja, 2 kupaonice i  hodnik s povi&scaron;enim stropom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>20 m2: studio apartman pod terasom s  kupaonicom i tu&scaron;em.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>30 m2: natkrivena terasa u kamenu s prekrasnim pogledom  na more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>16 m2: gara¾a</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Okuænicu èini mediteranski vrt èije je  odr¾avanje vrlo jednostavno. Vrt èine uglavnom masline i smokve Izdvojenost  nudi dosta privatnosti.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Trajektna luka u Supetru je udaljena 15 minuta  vo¾nje.</p>', '<p>This is a modern style detached house on the northern side of Brac island.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It  is situated 300m from the beach, up the gently sloping side of the island to  give elevated views towards the mainland and out to sea.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The plot is 642m  sq, and the garden has been designed for ease of maintenance, with  established olive and fig trees giving shade and privacy.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house has  total living area of 90m sq plus 30m sq of cowered terrace.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is consist  of:</p>\r\n<p>70 m2: 3 bedrooms, living room, kitchen, 2 bathrooms and a hallway with high ceilings.</p>\r\n<p>20 m2: studio apartment floor terrace with a bathroom and  shower.</p>\r\n<p>30 m2: covered stone terrace overlooking the sea.</p>\r\n<p>16 m2: garage.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property is well decorated and ready for living  immediately.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The main ferry port of Supetar is just over 10 minutes  drive.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact our main office for more information and to arrange to  visit.</p>', '', '815_House-Villa_0.jpg', '815_House-Villa_1.jpg', '815_House-Villa_2.jpg', '815_House-Villa_3.jpg', '815_House-Villa_4.jpg', '815_House-Villa_5.jpg', '815_House-Villa_6.jpg', '815_House-Villa_7.jpg', '815_House-Villa_8.jpg'),
(816, 'Boris', 'Tomiæ', '', '', '', 'Brac', 'Milna', 'For sale', 'Land plot', '10', '45000', '0', 1, '360000', '', 2, 2, 2, 1, 1, 2, 0, 0, 'August 21, 2014', '<p>Poljoprivredno zemlji&scaron;te povr&scaron;ine 45.000 m2 u 1 redu do mora, na ju¾noj strani otoka Braèa.&nbsp;Cijena 8 &euro;/m2! Sa zemlji&scaron;ta se pru¾a izvanredan pogleda na more! Radi se o poljoprivrednom opo¾arenom zemlji&scaron;tu odmah do mora. Sastoji se od vi&scaron;e parcela ukupne kvadrature 45.000 m2. Do zemlji&scaron;ta vodi makadamski put koji presjeca zemlji&scaron;te.</p>', '<p>We are pleased to offer the opportunity to purchase a substantial agricultural area of land stretching from the coast to the road on the south side of Brac island.&nbsp;Price &euro; 8 / m2! The land measures 45k m2 and is sloping from the water up to the access gravel road, and from everywhere are superb views over the island and sea.</p>', '', '<p>Poljoprivredno zemlji&scaron;te povr&scaron;ine 45.000 m2 u 1 redu do mora, na ju¾noj strani otoka Braèa.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;">Cijena 8 &euro;/m2!</span></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sa zemlji&scaron;ta se pru¾a izvanredan pogleda na more!</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Radi se o poljoprivrednom opo¾arenom zemlji&scaron;tu odmah do mora. Sastoji se od vi&scaron;e parcela ukupne kvadrature 45.000 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Do zemlji&scaron;ta vodi makadamski put koji presjeca zemlji&scaron;te.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Iako strmo, u gornjem dijelu je bla¾e polo¾eno i ima spektakularan pogled.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Struja i voda nisu na zemlji&scaron;tu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Acy marina u blizini.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Trajektna luka 20 minuta vo¾nje.</p>', '<p>We are pleased to offer the opportunity to purchase a  substantial agricultural area of land stretching from the coast to the road  on the south side of Brac island.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;">Price &euro; 8 / m2!</span></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The land measures 45k m2 and is sloping  from the water up to the access gravel road, and from everywhere are superb  views over the island and sea.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There are no water and electric on the  land.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The ACI marina is close by, and the port is 20 minutes, with ferry access to Split.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact our office for more information.</p>', '', '816_Land-plot_0.jpg', '816_Land-plot_1.jpg', '816_Land-plot_2.jpg', '816_Land-plot_3.jpg', '', '', '', '', ''),
(817, 'Dalmat i Hormus', 'Maletiæ', '', '', '', 'Sibenik', 'Tribunj', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '350', '200', '100', 1, '145000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 2, 2, 'August 21, 2014', '<p>U malom turistièkom mjestu Tribunj na prodaju su novoizgraðeni dvoeta¾ni stanovi. Radi se o projektu 4 ville (svaka villa ima 2 dvoeta¾na stana). Ukupna stambena povr&scaron;ina stana iznosi 100m2 na dvije eta¾e, a svaki stan ima i moguænost postavljanja bazena/ jacuzzija na krovnoj terasi ili u vrtu. Svaki stan se sastoji od prizemlja, kata i krovne terase. Udaljenost do mora i pla¾e iznosi 350 metara.</p>', '<p>New modern duplex apartments for sale in Tribunj! This is a project with 4 villas (each villa has a two duplex apartments). Total living area of each apartment is approx 100m2 on two floors. Each apartment has the option to set the pool / jacuzzi on the roof terrace or in the garden which belongs to the apartment. Proximity to the beach is 350 meters.</p>', '', '<p>U malom turistièkom mjestu Tribunj na prodaju su novoizgraðeni dvoeta¾ni stanovi.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Radi se o projektu 4 ville (svaka villa ima 2 dvoeta¾na stana).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ukupna stambena povr&scaron;ina stana iznosi 100m2 na dvije eta¾e, a svaki stan ima i moguænost postavljanja bazena/ jacuzzija na krovnoj terasi ili u vrtu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Svakom stanu pripada i okuænica èija velièina ovisi o poziciji kuæe (od 100m2 do 200m2) kao i jedno parkirno mjesto.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Svaka kuæa vertikalno je podijeljena na dva stana, a svaki se sastoji od prizemlja, kata i krovne terase.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U prizemlju se nalazi dnevni boravak s blagovaonicom i kuhinjom, odvojeni wc, stepeni&scaron;te i terasa. Na katu su smje&scaron;tene dvije spavaæe sobe s kupaonicom i terasa.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Krovna terasa opremljena je instalacijama struje i vode te su napravljene pripreme za ugradnju bazena/jacuzzija po ¾eljama kupca.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Takoðer postoji i moguænost postavljanja sjenice na krovnoj terasi za na to predviðenom mjestu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Udaljenost do mora i pla¾e iznosi 350 metara.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Izgradnja je zapoèela 2014. godine, a planirani rok zavr&scaron;etka je poèetkom 2015. godine.</p>', '<p>New modern duplex apartments for sale in Tribunj!</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>This is a project with 4 villas (each villa has a two duplex apartments).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Total living area of each apartment is approx 100m2 on two floors. Each apartment has the option to set the pool / jacuzzi on the roof terrace or in the garden which belongs to the apartment.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Size of the garden depends on the position of the house (from 100m2 up to 200m2).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Each house is vertically divided into two apartments, each consisting of a ground floor, first floor and roof terrace.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The ground floor has a living room, dining room and kitchen, separate bathroom, staircase and terrace. On the first floor there are two bedrooms ( each with a bathroom) and a terrace.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The roof terrace is equipped with the installation for electricity and water, and preparations are made for the installation of the pool / jacuzzi upon the wishes of the customer.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There is also a possibility of setting up a wooden pergola on the roof terrace.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Proximity to the beach is 350 meters.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>One parking space is included in the price.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Construction began in 2014 th and planned completion date is till the end of 2014.</p>', '', '817_House-Villa_0.jpg', '817_House-Villa_1.jpg', '817_House-Villa_2.jpg', '817_House-Villa_3.jpg', '817_House-Villa_4.jpg', '817_House-Villa_5.jpg', '817_House-Villa_6.jpg', '817_House-Villa_7.jpg', '817_House-Villa_8.jpg'),
(818, 'Ozana (Inga)', '©ustiæ', '091 209 8634 Ozana', '091 415 9296 Inga', 'susticozana@gmail.com', 'Rogoznica', 'Miline Donje 31, Sevid, 20176/5 K.O. Vini¹æe', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '70', '323', '215', 2, '186750', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 4, 3, 'August 25, 2014', '<p>Djelomièno renovirana samostojeæa kuæa u Sevidu, udaljena 70 metara od mora! Kuæa ima neto korisnu povr&scaron;inu 215,88 m2, a sagraðena je na parceli povr&scaron;ine 323 m2. Sastoji se od prizemlja i kata; svaka eta¾a je zasebna stambena jedinica s zasebnim vanjskim ulazom. Postoji moguænost izgradnje bazena na parceli.</p>', '<p>We are offering this well located building project, on the mainland near Sevid. It is situated 70m from the sea, and within a few minutes from the centre of the attractive village of Sevid. The house has a usable area 215.88 m2 and was built on a plot of 323 m2. There is off road parking within the boundary of the property, and there is plenty of garden area, even enough for a swimming pool.</p>', '', '<p>Djelomièno renovirana samostojeæa kuæa u Sevidu, udaljena 70 metara od mora!</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa ima neto korisnu povr&scaron;inu 215,88 m2, a sagraðena je na parceli povr&scaron;ine 323 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sastoji se od prizemlja i kata; svaka eta¾a je zasebna stambena jedinica s zasebnim vanjskim ulazom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Prizemlje kuæe je u potpunosti zavr&scaron;eno i namje&scaron;teno, dok je stan na katu u roh-bau fazi.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Stan na katu ima i izlaz na veliku krovnu terasu s koje se pru¾a prekrasan panoramski pogled na more i okolne kuæe.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa ima kolni pristup i privatan parking unutar granica parcele.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Postoji moguænost izgradnje bazena na parceli.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Struja je prisutna, dok se dolazak vode oèekuje u roku od godinu dana &ndash; trenutno je kuæa spojena na gustirnu.</p>', '<p>We are offering this well located building project, on the mainland near Sevid.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is situated 70m from the sea, and within a few minutes from the centre of the attractive village of Sevid.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The building was a one  floor bungalow on a large plot of land, but the owners got permission to  extend the property and have done the majority of&nbsp;the ''heavy'' work.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>They  have created a large family villa, or two apartments, which are always  popular with owners looking to rent part of the house in the tourism  season.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house has a usable area 215.88 m2 and was built on a plot of 323  m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The original part of the house has been well looked after and decorated for many years, and help with the remainder of the building works,  including&nbsp;costs, is available by contacting the Croatia Property Sales  office.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>One attractive feature of the building works, is that it has  allowed a superb roof terrace with breathtaking panoramic views across the  village and&nbsp;to the sea.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>This is an area of the coast that did not have  electricity until recently, and water the supply is expected to be connected  very soon.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house is connected to its own water tank, and the price  reflects this.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There is off road parking within the boundary of the  property, and there is plenty of garden area, even enough for a swimming  pool.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The local village has several shops catering for tourists, as well  as a selection of bars, coffee shops, and restaurants. The main town is  Trogir,&nbsp;20 minute''s down the coast.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact our office for more  information.</p>', '', '818_House-Villa_0.jpg', '818_House-Villa_1.jpg', '818_House-Villa_2.jpg', '818_House-Villa_3.jpg', '818_House-Villa_4.jpg', '818_House-Villa_5.jpg', '818_House-Villa_6.jpg', '818_House-Villa_7.jpg', '818_House-Villa_8.jpg'),
(819, 'Boris', 'Tomiæ', '', '', '', 'Brac', 'Postira', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '100', '300', '150', 2, '185000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 3, 3, 'August 26, 2014', '<p>Samostojeæa obiteljska kuæa na sjevernoj strani Braèa, povr&scaron;ine 150 m2, smje&scaron;tena na parceli povr&scaron;ine 300 m2! Kuæa je smje&scaron;tena svega 100 metara od mora i ima prekrasan pogled na more. Sastoji se od prizemlja, dva kata i potkrovlja. Kuæa se prodaje u potpunosti namje&scaron;tena.</p>', '<p>Croatia Property Sales are pleased to offer this very attractive property in  the heart of Brac island''s most attractive village.&nbsp;The house has 150m sq  of living space, and the plot is 300m sq.&nbsp;It is a property on 4 floors.&nbsp;The house has only recently been completed and it is being sold  with the furniture.&nbsp;The beach and harbour are about 100m  away.</p>', '', '<p>Samostojeæa obiteljska kuæa na sjevernoj strani Braèa, povr&scaron;ine 150 m2, smje&scaron;tena na parceli povr&scaron;ine 300 m2!</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je smje&scaron;tena svega 100 metara od mora i ima prekrasan pogled na more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sastoji se od prizemlja, dva kata i potkrovlja.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U prizemlju se nalazi velika gara¾a, iznad koje se nalazi terasa povr&scaron;ine 30 m2</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na 1. katu se nalazi jedan apartman koji se sastoji od 1 spavaæe sobe, kuhinje i kupaonice, te manje terase.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na 2. katu se nalazi dnevni boravak, kuhinja i blagovaonica, kupaonica, stepenice za potkrovlje te velika terasa velièine donjeg apartmana s pogledom na more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U potkrovlju su 2 spavaæe sobe i kupaonica.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa se prodaje u potpunosti namje&scaron;tena.</p>', '<p>Croatia Property Sales are pleased to offer this very attractive property in  the heart of Brac island''s most attractive village.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house has 150m sq  of living space, and the plot is 300m sq.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is a property on 4 floors.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>At  ground level there is a large garage, and on the roof of the garage is a  good sized terrace of 30m sq.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Above this is an apartment with one bedroom,  kitchen and lounge, and an extra balcony.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The first floor has a living  room, kitchen and dining area, bathroom and stairs leading up to the top  floor, where there are 2 bedrooms&nbsp;and a bathroom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There is a terrace with  superb views over this wonderful village and across the sea to the  mainland.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house has only recently been completed and it is being sold  with the furniture.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The beach and harbour are about 100m  away.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The village is 10 minutes drive from the ferry terminal and there  is a range of shops, bars and restaurants to choose from, as well as gallery''s and artist studios.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact the office for more  information.</p>', '', '819_House-Villa_0.jpg', '819_House-Villa_1.jpg', '819_House-Villa_2.jpg', '819_House-Villa_3.jpg', '819_House-Villa_4.jpg', '819_House-Villa_5.jpg', '819_House-Villa_6.jpg', '819_House-Villa_7.jpg', '819_House-Villa_8.jpg');
INSERT INTO `nekretnina` (`id`, `ime`, `prezime`, `telefon`, `mobitel`, `e_mail`, `lokacija_id`, `adresa`, `status_id`, `vrsta_id`, `udaljenost`, `povrsina`, `stambenapovrsina`, `display`, `cijena`, `cijenatocka`, `ponuda_tjedna`, `new_built`, `must_sell`, `prvi_red_do_mora`, `pogled_na_more`, `bazen`, `broj_soba`, `broj_kupatila`, `datum`, `title_hr`, `title_en`, `title_ge`, `opis_hr`, `opis_en`, `opis_ge`, `PropertyImageURL0`, `PropertyImageURL1`, `PropertyImageURL2`, `PropertyImageURL3`, `PropertyImageURL4`, `PropertyImageURL5`, `PropertyImageURL6`, `PropertyImageURL7`, `PropertyImageURL8`) VALUES
(820, 'Slobodan', 'Rajèiæ', '098/ 997 6980', '', '', 'Split', 'Dominisova 3, 10742/1 arkod/kat,   Zgr 2128, z.u. 1316', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '160', '0', '82', 1, '210000', '', 1, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 3, 1, 'August 26, 2014', '<p style="color: #f31d0b;">***CIJENA SNI®ENA SA 245.000 &euro;</p>\r\n<p style="color: #f31d0b;"><span style="color: #000000;">Apartman smje&scaron;ten u starogradskoj zgradi u centru Splita u Dioklecijanovoj palaèi sa prekrasnim pogledom na zvonik Sv. Duje, Marjan i ostatak starog dijela grada. Smje&scaron;ten je na 4.katu (potkrovlje), te mu je potrebno potpuno renoviranje. Apartman ima potencijal za ureðenje u prekrasnu vlastitu oazu u srcu vi&scaron;estoljetnog grada.&nbsp;Ukupna netto povr&scaron;ina iznosi 82 m2 dok je brutto 100 m2.</span></p>', '<p><span style="color: #fc0220;">***PRICE REDUCED FROM 245.000 &euro;</span></p>\r\n<p>We are pleased to offer this top floor apartment in need of complete renovation  near the centre of the old roman palace in Split.&nbsp;It is situated on the  top floor (4th floor). &nbsp;The best feature of this property is that  it enjoys a substantial roof terrace with views over the city to the sea and  mountains behind.&nbsp;It is  very large, with 3 bedrooms, hall, open plan kitchen, lounge etc. bathroom, and  of course the terrace.</p>', '', '<p><span style="color: #f2310c;">***CIJENA SNI®ENA SA 245.000 &euro;</span></p>\r\n<div><span><br /></span></div>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartman smje&scaron;ten u starogradskoj zgradi u centru Splita u Dioklecijanovoj palaèi sa prekrasnim pogledom na zvonik Sv. Duje, Marjan i ostatak starog dijela grada.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Smje&scaron;ten je na 4.katu (potkrovlje) te mu je potrebno potpuno renoviranje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartman ima potencijal za ureðenje u prekrasnu vlastitu oazu u srcu vi&scaron;estoljetnog grada. Zbog odliènog polo¾aja i sve veæe popularnosti grada Splita moguæe ga je koristiti i u svrhu iznajmljivanja.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ukupna netto povr&scaron;ina iznosi 82 m2 <strong>(brutto podna iznosi 100 m2)</strong> i sastoji se od 2 hodnika, kuhinje + dnevnog boravka + blagovaonice, 3 spavaæe sobe i prostrane terase.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Orjentacija apartmana je sjever-jug-istok.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Posebnost ovog apartmana je upravo vlastita terasa jer je u samoj palaèi ogranièena prodaja ovakvih nekretnina.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Udaljenost od popularne Rive je 160 m, dok je najbli¾i parking udaljen 50 m od zgrade.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U blizini se nalaze mnogobrojni restorani, kafiæi, trgovine i svi ostali tradicionalni i moderni sadr¾aji.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Meðunarodni aerodrom udaljen je 40 min. vo¾nje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za sve dodatne informacije stojimo vam na raspolaganju.</p>', '<p><span style="color: #f0290e;">***PRICE REDUCED FROM 245.000 &euro;</span></p>\r\n<div><br style="color: #f90527;" /></div>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>We are pleased to offer this top floor apartment in need of complete renovation  near the centre of the old roman palace in Split.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is situated on the  top floor (4th floor) and although is habitable at the moment it is clearly in  need of a complete refurbishment. While doing this the internal space can be  redesigned to the owners wish.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The best feature of this property is that  it enjoys a substantial roof terrace with views over the city to the sea and  mountains behind.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>With its superb location in the town, it could become a  stunning property, either to rent out or for totally private use.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is  very large, with 3 bedrooms, hall, open plan kitchen, lounge etc. bathroom, and  of course the terrace.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is on a north west to south east  orientation.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The location is almost in the middle of the palace so the  riva, peristil, cathederal, etc are all just a few minute&rsquo;s walk from  here.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There are dozens of restaurants and bars nearby, as well as shops  and other facilities and the ferry port is 10 minutes walk.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please  contact the office to arrange to visit this property.</p>', '', '820_Apartment_0.jpg', '820_Apartment_1.jpg', '820_Apartment_2.jpg', '820_Apartment_3.jpg', '820_Apartment_4.jpg', '820_Apartment_5.jpg', '820_Apartment_6.jpg', '820_Apartment_7.jpg', '820_Apartment_8.jpg'),
(821, 'Erica', 'Miklos', '', '', '', 'Hvar', 'Stari Grad', 'For sale', 'Old stone house', '50', '45', '100', 1, '142000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 3, 2, 'August 26, 2014', '<p>Prilika!! Kompletno renovirana kamena kuæa u centru mjesta s zatvorenim dvori&scaron;tem. Kuæa se sastoji od 4 kata, ukupne stambene povr&scaron;ine 100 m2. Povr&scaron;ina parcele iznosi 45 m2. Kuæa je kompletno restauirana,ureðena, namje&scaron;tena i nalazi se na odliènoj lokaciji u centru mjesta gdje su restorani i svi sadr¾aji na dohvat ruke. Kuæa je od mora udaljena 50 metara.</p>', '<p>Excellent opportunity !! We are very pleased to offer this recently renovated old stone house and closed private courtyard, in the village centre on the North side of Hvar island. The house consists of 4 floors with a total living area of &#8203;&#8203;100 m2. The house has recently been completely repaired, decorated, furnished, both inside and outside. House is 50 meters from the sea and harbour and is one of very few such properties in the centre of the village to be available to buy.</p>', '', '<p>Kompletno renovirana kamena kuæa u centru mjesta s zatvorenim dvori&scaron;tem.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa  se sastoji od 4 kata, ukupne stambene povr&scaron;ine 100 m2. Povr&scaron;ina parcele iznosi 45 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U prizemlju je kuhinja i izlaz na dvori&scaron;te gde je veliki stol za  8 ljudi i vanjski prostor.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na prvom katu koji je povezan s unutarnjim  stepenicama je soba sa vratima za terasu i kupaonica.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na drugom katu je jo&scaron;  jedna spavaæa soba s kupaonicom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na treæem katu je potkrovlje koje ima velux  krovni prozor te mo¾e predstavljati dodatnu sobu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ima svu  infrastrukturu te TV satelitki prijemnik.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je kompletno  restauirana,ureðena, namje&scaron;tena i nalazi se na odliènoj lokaciji u centru  mjesta gdje su restorani i svi sadr¾aji na dohvat ruke.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Dvori&scaron;te je  povr&scaron;ine ca.18 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je od mora udaljena 50  metara.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Prilika!!</p>', '<p>We are very pleased to offer this recently renovated old stone house and closed private courtyard, in the village centre on the North side of Hvar island.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house consists of 4 floors with a total living area  of &#8203;&#8203;100 m2. The plot is 45 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The ground floor has a kitchen and  access to the courtyard where there is a large table accommodating up to 8  people for ''alfresco'' eating.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The yard has an area of about 18 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the  first floor, which is connected by internal stairs, has a bedroom with  ensuite bathroom and access to the terrace.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the second floor there is  another bedroom with bathroom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the third floor is a loft that has a velux  roof window.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It has all the infrastructure and TV -satellite  receiver.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house has recently been completely repaired, decorated,  furnished, both inside and outside.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is situated in a prime  location in the village centre where there are restaurants, bars and many  other facilities used by the islanders and tourists alike.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>House is 50  meters from the sea and harbour and is one of very few such properties in  the centre of the village to be available to buy.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Excellent opportunity  !!</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact Croatia Property sales to arrange to view this  property.</p>', '', '821_Old-stone-house_0.jpg', '821_Old-stone-house_1.jpg', '821_Old-stone-house_2.jpg', '821_Old-stone-house_3.jpg', '821_Old-stone-house_4.jpg', '821_Old-stone-house_5.jpg', '821_Old-stone-house_6.jpg', '821_Old-stone-house_7.jpg', '821_Old-stone-house_8.jpg'),
(883, 'Sanda', 'Bo¹koviæ', '', '095 913 04 25', 'sanda.boskovic@gmail.com', 'Omis', 'Lokva Rogoznica', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '500', '687', '230', 2, '270000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 4, 4, 'September 28, 2014', '<p>Kuæa na omi&scaron;koj rivijeri na izuzetno mirnoj lokaciji s prekrasnim otvorenim pogledom na more. U naravi prizemnica, koja se sastoji od dva stana: jednog komfornog trosobnog stana s tri spavaæe sobe i jednog komfornog jednosobnog stana povr&scaron;ine 50 m2 s zasebnim ulazom, te podruma povr&scaron;ine 79 m2. Ovakve nekretnine na izuzetnoj lokaciji is a velikom povr&scaron;inom zemlji&scaron;ta su rijetkost na tr¾i&scaron;tu!</p>', '<p>This is a very reasonably priced property near Omis, with two superb features. It sits on a large land plot, and is in a beautiful and quiet location by the sea.&nbsp;The total living area is 150 m2 with terraces of 50 m2 + a basement of 79 m2. The land area is 687 m2. Such property in an exceptional location with a large surface area are rare on the market!</p>', '', '<p>Kuæa na omi&scaron;koj rivijeri na izuzetno mirnoj lokaciji, s prekrasnim otvorenim pogledom na more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ukupna stambena povr&scaron;ina kuæe je 150 m2 + terasa povr&scaron;ine 50 m2 + podrum 79 m2. Povr&scaron;ina zemlji&scaron;ta je 687 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U naravi je prizemnica, koja se sastoji od dva stana:&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>- jednog komfornog trosobnog stana s tri spavaæe sobe, svaka soba ima kupaonicu, prostrane kuhinje i dnevnog boravka, terase&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>- jednog komfornog jednosobnog stana povr&scaron;ine 50 m2 s zasebnim ulazom</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>- podruma povr&scaron;ine 79 m2</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ispred kuæe je vrt s moguæno&scaron;æu izgradnje bazena.&nbsp;Sa sjeverne strane kuæe nalazi se parking za min. 6 auta.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Postoji moguænost nadogradnje jo&scaron; jednog kata, te potkrovlja.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ima odlièan pristup.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ima struju, vodu, telefon, septièku jamu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Graðena je 1990 &ndash;ih godina,te su joj potrebna ulaganja.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ovakve nekretnine na izuzetnoj lokaciji is a velikom povr&scaron;inom zemlji&scaron;ta su rijetkost na tr¾i&scaron;tu!</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za dogovor oko razgledavanja CPS - Split ured vam stoji na usluzi.</p>', '<p>This is a very reasonably priced property near Omis, with two superb features. It sits on a large land plot, and is in a beautiful and quiet location by the sea.<br /><br /><br />The total living area is 150 m2 with terraces of 50 m2 + a basement of 79 m2.</p>\r\n<p>The land area is 687 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is a ground floor building which consists of two units:</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>- One comfortable three-bedroom apartment all ensuite, a spacious kitchen and living room, and a substantial terrace.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>- Comfortable one bedroom apartment of 50 m2 with a separate entrance</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>- Basement area of 79 m2</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house has a garden large enough to consider the possibility of building a swimming pool, in a large terrace.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the north side of the house there is parking for min. 6 cars.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There is even the possibility to build another floor and add a penthouse apartment.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It has excellent access.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It has electricity, water, telephone, and a private septic tank.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It was built in the 1990''s and it needs redecorating, for its potential to be fully realised.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Such property in an exceptional location with a large surface area are rare on the market!</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>To arrange to view this property please contact the office in Split.</p>', '', '883_House-Villa_0.jpg', '883_House-Villa_1.jpg', '883_House-Villa_2.jpg', '883_House-Villa_3.jpg', '883_House-Villa_4.jpg', '883_House-Villa_5.jpg', '883_House-Villa_6.jpg', '883_House-Villa_7.jpg', '883_House-Villa_8.jpg'),
(822, 'Maristella', 'Ronchi', '', '', 'stelit51@yahoo.it', 'Hvar', 'Jelsa, Vitarnja', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '10', '600', '400', 1, '1600000', '', 2, 2, 2, 1, 1, 2, 8, 8, 'August 26, 2014', '<p>Kuæa, Vila apartmanskog tipa na izvanrednoj lokaciji uz samo more, na sjevernoj strani otoka Hvara. Prvi red bez puta ispod kuæe, privatna pla¾a, nesmetan pogled na more! Ukupna stambena povr&scaron;ina kuæe je 400 m2. Kuæa je jako ukusno opremljena i prodaje se s namje&scaron;tajem tj.kompletan namje&scaron;taj je u cijeni kuæe. Moguænost preureðenja sa jako malim preinakama u obiteljsku vilu za privatno kori&scaron;tenje.</p>', '<p>We are pleased to offer this superb house, in a beach location on the popular north side of the island. It is a first line property, with clear views out to sea across and has access from the bottom of the garden straight into the sea. The total living area is 400m sq and the land plot is 600m sq. The condition of the building is good throughout, and the current owner is including the furniture and contents as part of the price.</p>', '', '<p>Kuæa, Vila apartmanskog tipa na izvanrednoj lokaciji uz samo more, na sjevernoj strani otoka Hvara.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Prvi red bez puta ispod kuæe, privatna  pla¾a, nesmetan pogled na more!</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ukupna stambena povr&scaron;ina kuæe je 400  m2.&nbsp;Povr&scaron;ina zemlji&scaron;ta je 600 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U prizemlju kuæe su tri apartmana,  dva su veæa sa strana kuæe, te u sredini studio apartman.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na prvom katu  je veliki komforni obiteljski stan gdje ¾ivi vlasnik plus jo&scaron; jedan apartman  sa posebnim ulazom sa druge strane kuæe.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U potkrovlju su takoðer dva  apartmana sa posebnim ulazima.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je jako ukusno opremljena i prodaje  se s namje&scaron;tajem tj.kompletan namje&scaron;taj je u cijeni kuæe.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Svaka soba ima  kupatilo i velike terase s pogledom na more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Moguænost preureðenja sa jako  malim preinakama u obiteljsku vilu za privatno kori&scaron;tenje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Parking za  7 vozila.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Dovoljno mjesta za izgradnju bazena.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ima kategorizaciju i  licencu za iznajmljivanje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Lokacija vrhunska!</p>', '<p>We are pleased to offer this superb house, in a beach location on the popular north side of the island.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is a first line property, with clear  views out to sea across and has access from the bottom of the garden  straight into the sea.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>At this point the water is beautifully clear and safe  and for swimming.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The total living area is 400m sq and the land plot is  600m sq.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The ground floor has three apartments, two on each side of the  house, and one in the middle which is a studio apartment.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the first  floor is a large comfortable family apartment where the owner lives plus  another apartment with a separate entrance on the other side of the  house.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the top floor are two more apartments, each with separate  entrances.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Every apartment has a terrace or balcony and each one enjoys views  over the water.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The current owner has enjoyed a good living by  renting these apartments throughout the holiday season, but with a few  alterations this building could be redesigned to become a superb and  substantial family villa.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The condition of the building is good  throughout, and the current owner is including the furniture and contents as  part of the price.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It has parking for 7 cars, and the garden has enough space  to include a swimming pool and patio.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The nearest shops and village  is 10 minutes away, and the ferry to the mainland is just 20 minutes drive  from here.</p>', '', '822_House-Villa_0.jpg', '822_House-Villa_1.jpg', '822_House-Villa_2.jpg', '822_House-Villa_3.jpg', '822_House-Villa_4.jpg', '822_House-Villa_5.jpg', '822_House-Villa_6.jpg', '822_House-Villa_7.jpg', '822_House-Villa_8.jpg'),
(823, 'Pero', 'Bureèiæ', '', '095/906 5781', '380/34 k.è.', 'Trogir', 'Rastiæi, ', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '250', '0', '50', 2, '92500', '', 2, 1, 2, 2, 1, 2, 2, 1, 'August 26, 2014', '<p>Zgrada u novogradnji u kojoj je od ukupno 6 apartmana na prodaji ostao jo&scaron; samo 1 !!! Apartmani su smje&scaron;teni na ju¾noj strani otoka Èiova na jednom od najpopularnijih dijelova otoka. Udaljenost od prekrasne uvale i prirodno kamenite pla¾e je 250 m. <span style="text-decoration: underline;">Apartmani su povr&scaron;ine 50 m2, a cijene od 80.000 - 92.500 Eura!</span></p>', '<p>We have the last three remaining apartments (five already sold) from this newly built block of six apartments on Ciovo island. They are situated&nbsp; in the most sought after part of this popular island, 250m from the clear water and rocky shore. <span style="text-decoration: underline;">Apartments are measuring 50 m2, and the prices are from 80.000 - 92.500 Euro!</span></p>', '', '<p>Zgrada u novogradnji u kojoj je od ukupno 6 apartmana na prodaji je jo&scaron; samo 1 !!!</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartmani su smje&scaron;teni na ju¾noj strani otoka Èiova na jednom od najpopularnijih dijelova otoka.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Udaljenost od prekrasne uvale i prirodno kamenite pla¾e je 250 m, dok je centar mjesta sa svim potrebnim sadr¾ajima udaljen 2 min. vo¾nje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Svi apartmani æe biti potpuno zavr&scaron;eni i klimatizirani.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Okoli&scaron; i vrt oko zgrade je ureðen, dok svakom apartmanu pripada po 1 vanjsko parking mjesto koje je ukljuèeno u cijenu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>APARTMAN 1: 50 M2 - 80.000 Eura - P &nbsp; R &nbsp; O &nbsp; D &nbsp; A &nbsp; N &nbsp; O !!!</strong></p>\r\n<p><strong>&nbsp;</strong>Nalazi se u prizemlju (zapad), a sastoji se od kuhinje + blagovaonice + dnevnog boravka, 2 spavaæe sobe, 1 kupaonice i terase.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>APARTMAN 2: 50 M2&nbsp; - 87.500 Eura -&nbsp;<strong>P &nbsp; R &nbsp; O &nbsp; D &nbsp; A &nbsp; N &nbsp; O !!!</strong></strong></p>\r\n<p><strong>&nbsp;</strong>Nalazi se na 1.katu (istok), a sastoji se od kuhinje + blagovaonice + dnevnog boravka, 2 spavaæe sobe, 1 kupaonice i terase sa djelomiènim pogledom na more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>APARTMAN 3: 50 M2 -&nbsp; 92.500 Eura</strong></p>\r\n<p><strong>&nbsp;</strong>Nalazi se na 2.katu (zapad), a sastoji se od kuhinje + blagovaonice + dnevnog boravka, 2 spavaæe sobe, 1 kupaonice i terase sa pogledom na more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ovo je idealna investicija za vas ¾elite li ulo¾iti u mjesto za odmor koje se ujedno mo¾e koristiti i u svrhu turistièkog iznajmljivanja.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Meðunarodni aerodrom udaljen je 20 min. vo¾nje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za sve dodatne informacije stojimo vam na raspolaganju.</p>', '<p>We have the last three remaining apartments (five already sold) from this newly  built block of six apartments on Ciovo island.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>They are situated&nbsp; in the  most sought after part of this popular island, 250m from the clear water and  rocky shore.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The centre of the local village is 2 minute&rsquo;s  driving.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The apartments will all be completed and ready for moving in by  the time they are handed over, the garden will be landscaped and each owner will  have a designated parking space.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>APARTMENT 1 DETAILS: 50 m2 - 80.000 Euro - &nbsp; S &nbsp; &nbsp;O &nbsp; &nbsp;L &nbsp; &nbsp;D !!!!</strong></p>\r\n<p>Located on the ground floor (west), and consists of a kitchen + dining +  living room, 2 bedroom, 1 bathroom and terrace.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>APARTMENT 2: 50 M2 - 87,500 Euro &nbsp;<strong>- &nbsp; S &nbsp; &nbsp;O &nbsp; &nbsp;L &nbsp; &nbsp;D !!!!</strong><br /></strong>Located on the 1st floor (east), and consists of a kitchen + dining +  living room, 2 bedroom, 1 bathroom and a terrace with partial sea  views.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>APARTMENT 3: 50 M2 - 92,500 Euro</strong></p>\r\n<p>Located on the 2nd floor (west),  and consists of a kitchen + dining + living room, 2 bedroom, 1 bathroom and a  terrace overlooking the sea.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>They will always be popular with tourists in  this location. The airport is only 20 minutes away, and the major town of Trogir  is just 10 minutes by car.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact our office to arrange to  visit.</p>', '', '823_Apartment_0.jpg', '823_Apartment_1.jpg', '823_Apartment_2.jpg', '823_Apartment_3.jpg', '823_Apartment_4.jpg', '823_Apartment_5.jpg', '823_Apartment_6.jpg', '823_Apartment_7.jpg', ''),
(825, 'Vanja', 'Duzeviæ', '', '', '', 'Hvar', 'Priko, Stari Grad', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '250', '370', '80', 1, '140000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 3, 1, 'August 26, 2014', '<p>Obiteljska kuæa okru¾ena lijepim vrtom u blizini centra mjesta i pla¾a. Ukupna stambena povr&scaron;ina kuæe je 80 m2, dok je povr&scaron;ina parcele 370 m2. Sastoji se od prizemlja u kojem je hodnik, kuhinja i dnevni boravak te tri spavaæe sobe i kupaonica. Potrebna manja renovacija. Dozvoljena je dogradnja i nadogradnja objekta. Udaljenost od mora je 250 metara.</p>', '<p>We are offering this three bedroom family villa on the north side of Hvar  island.&nbsp;It is near the centre of a small village, and a few minute''s walk  to the sea and harbour.&nbsp;The total living area in the property is 80m  sq and the land around is 370m sq. It has a hall, kitchen, living room and 3  bedrooms. It''s 250&nbsp;</p>', '', '<p>Obiteljska kuæa okru¾ena lijepim vrtom u blizini centra mjesta i pla¾a.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa  se nalazi na dobroj lokaciji,pogodnoj za ¾ivljenje i bavljenje turizmom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Pogled na more je djelomièan.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ukupna stambena povr&scaron;ina  kuæe je 80 m2, dok je povr&scaron;ina parcele 370 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sastoji se od prizemlja u  kojem je hodnik, kuhinja i dnevni boravak te tri spavaæe sobe i  kupaonica.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Potrebna manja renovacija.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Dozvoljena je dogradnja i nadogradnja  objekta.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Udaljenost od mora je 250 metara.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa ima pristup  vozilom i parking.</p>', '<p>We are offering this well positioned and affordable family villa near the town centre.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>This house is near the centre of the village, within walking distance of the harbour, the rest of the village and the beaches.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house itself is spacious, with separate kitchen, lounge and dining area, and upstairs are 3 bedrooms and bathrooms.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property could do with redecorating, but it is sound and habitable, so this is more DIY than renovation.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The living space inside is 80m sq and the garden/plot is 370m sq.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>This is a large garden and could be enough room for a superb patio, even a swimming pool, but at the moment it is attractively planted with Mediterranean flowers, shrubs and trees.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There is parking on the premises and enough space for storing a small boat over the winter months.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It''s possible to upgrade the house if wanted.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact our office for more information.</p>', '', '825_House-Villa_0.jpg', '825_House-Villa_1.jpg', '825_House-Villa_2.jpg', '825_House-Villa_3.jpg', '825_House-Villa_4.jpg', '825_House-Villa_5.jpg', '', '', ''),
(826, 'Jozo', 'Marinoviæ', '', '091/ 5096 331', '', 'Trogir', 'Planikovica VII/9a, 1562/46', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '95', '414', '42', 1, '250000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 1, 1, 'August 26, 2014', '<p>Simpatièna prizemna kuæa smje&scaron;tena na zemlji&scaron;tu ukupne povr&scaron;ine 414 m2. Nalazi se na sjevernoj strani otoka Èiova udaljena 95 m od mora i prekrasne pla¾e gdje je moguæe privezati manji brod. Povr&scaron;ina kuæe iznosi 42 m2 (30 m2 + terasa 12 m2).&nbsp;Postoji moguænost nadogradnje i pro&scaron;irenja veæ postojeæeg prizemlja.</p>', '<p>We have this attractive single-storey house which is on the north side of Ciovo island. The area of the building is 42m sq and the plot is 414m sq. It consists of one bedroom, bathroom with a lounge, kitchen with access to the terrace. There is plenty of opportunity to expand the footprint of this property or add floors. There are sea views from the property.</p>', '', '<p>Simpatièna prizemna kuæa smje&scaron;tena na zemlji&scaron;tu ukupne povr&scaron;ine 414 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nalazi se na sjevernoj strani otoka Èiova udaljena 95 m od mora i prekrasne pla¾e gdje je moguæe privezati manji brod.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Povr&scaron;ina kuæe iznosi 42 m2 (30 m2 + terasa 12 m2). Sastoji se od kuhinje + dnevnog boravka, kupaonice, 1 spavaæe sobe i terase.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sa terase se pru¾a djelomièan pogled na more dok bi se sa vi&scaron;ih eta¾a pru¾ao potpuni pogled.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Postoji moguænost nadogradnje i pro&scaron;irenja veæ postojeæeg prizemlja.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Zemlji&scaron;te je smje&scaron;teno na prekrasnom polo¾aju u samoj &scaron;umi te je idealno za izgradnju vile sa bazenom gdje vam je takoðer i privatnost zagarantirana.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ispred kuæe nalazi se parking za vi&scaron;e automobila.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Centar mjesta udaljen je 3 min. vo¾nje, dok je meðunarodni aerodrom udaljen 20 min. vo¾nje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za sve dodatne informacije stojimo vam na raspolaganju.</p>', '<p>We have this attractive single-storey house which is on the north side of Ciovo  island.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The area of the building is 42m sq and the plot is 414m sq. It  consists of one bedroom, bathroom with a lounge, kitchen with access to the  terrace.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The building and decorations are in good condition.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There  is plenty of opportunity to expand the footprint of this property or add floors.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is located amongst pine trees which add to the quietness and privacy of this  property, and it would also be an ideal place for a very private swimming  pool.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There is parking for several vehicles and boats in front of the  building. It is less than 100m from the sea, and the beach in front is safe and  clean for swimming and also where you can moor a small boat.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There are  sea views from the property.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The village has shops, restaurants and bars  all a short drive from the property, and the nearest larger town is Trogir, the  world heritage site, where many cultural exhibitions and concerts take place.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The village center is 3 min driving, while the international airport is  20 minutes driving.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact our office for more information and to  arrange to visit this property.</p>', '', '826_House-Villa_0.jpg', '826_House-Villa_1.jpg', '826_House-Villa_2.jpg', '826_House-Villa_3.jpg', '826_House-Villa_4.jpg', '826_House-Villa_5.jpg', '826_House-Villa_6.jpg', '826_House-Villa_7.jpg', '826_House-Villa_8.jpg'),
(827, 'Andja', 'Reinke', '', '0981952801', '', 'Hvar', 'Zavala', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '30', '157', '100', 2, '175000', '', 2, 1, 2, 1, 1, 2, 2, 2, 'August 29, 2014', '<p>Lijepi dvosobni dvoeta¾ni apartman na ju¾noj strani otoka Hvara, neposredno uz more, sa pogledom i velikom terasom! Apartman je ukupne stambene povr&scaron;ine 100 m2 (Maisonette). Jedini apartman na dva kata koncipiran je kao kuc&#769;a u kuc&#769;i.&nbsp;Apartman nudi pristupac&#780;an luksuz i udobnost, te zbog visoke kvalitete, ekolos&#780;ke gradnje i najboljeg poloz&#780;aja takoðer nudi dobar porast vrijednosti.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>Stylish two bedroom duplex apartment on the south side of the island, next to the sea, with a view and a large terrace! The apartment has a total floor area of &#8203;&#8203;100 m2 (Maisonette) and faces west. This is the only apartment in the block designed over two floors intended as a holiday home. This is a superb property, and the photographs don''t do it justice.</p>', '', '<p>Lijepi dvosobni dvoeta¾ni apartman na ju¾noj strani otoka Hvara, neposredno  uz more, sa pogledom i velikom terasom!</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartman je ukupne stambene  povr&scaron;ine 100 m2 (Maisonette). Jedini apartman na dva kata koncipiran je  kao kuc&#769;a u kuc&#769;i.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartman je dostupan putem ulaznog dijela ili direktno  izvana preko terase. Orijentiran je prema zapadu i djelomic&#780;no prema  sjeveru.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na razini 1 nalaze se ogromna terasa, dnevni boravak, zatvorena  kuhinja te kupaona s tus&#780;em. Iz kuhinje i preko pripadajuc&#769;ih zavojitih  stepenica dolazi se na razinu 2. Na razini 2 nalaze se spavac&#769;a soba te  dodatna kupaona s kadom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Iako ovaj apartman na dva kata uglavnom ima  pogled na vrt, nudi prednost velike prekrivene terase od 32 m2, velike  kuhinje s prozorom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartman nudi pristupac&#780;an luksuz i udobnost, te zbog  visoke kvalitete, ekolos&#780;ke gradnje i najboljeg poloz&#780;aja takoðer nudi dobar  porast vrijednosti. Ukoliko z&#780;elite, putem iznajmljivanja moz&#780;ete postic&#769;i  visok povrat investicije.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartmani u ovom objektu se od 2008. godine  uspjes&#780;no iznajmljuju. Potraz&#780;nja gostiju vrlo je visoka i stoga su apartmani  vec&#769; vrlo rano u potpunosti rezervirani.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Zemljis&#780;te je okruz&#780;eno  maslinicima, vinogradima i borovima jamc&#780;i savrs&#780;eno opus&#780;tanje i  odmor. Uz&#780;ivat c&#769;ete u zdravom z&#780;ivotu na Mediteranu, maksimalnom trajanju sunc&#780;anih razdoblja na Hvaru, u kristalno c&#780;istom moru i c&#780;istim s&#780;ljunc&#780;anim plaz&#780;ama.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Brodom se moz&#780;ete voziti do osamljenih plaz&#780;a  i ribljih restorana na obli¾njem otoèiæu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartman se sastoji od:</p>\r\n<p>- vrlo velika terasa s pogledom na more</p>\r\n<p>- potpuno ureðena kuhinja s  visokokvalitetnim ureðajima</p>\r\n<p>- potpuno ureðene dvije spavaæe sobe</p>\r\n<p>- potpuno  ureðene kupaone</p>\r\n<p>- mnos&#780;tvo rasvjete</p>\r\n<p>- elegantan namjes&#780;taj za terasu</p>\r\n<p>- klima  ureðaj, podno grijanje SAT-TV, WLAN-pristup</p>\r\n<p>- centralni usisavac&#780;,  portafon</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Dodatno:</p>\r\n<p>- parkirno mjesto u hladu</p>\r\n<p>- kuc&#780;ica za  ros&#780;tilj</p>\r\n<p>- veliki ulazni prostor</p>\r\n<p>- mjesto u podrumu i centralna perilica  rublja, solarni ureðaj i pumpa za zrak i toplu vodu energetski s&#780;tedljiva  gradnja s termo opekama cisterna za vodu u vrtu.</p>', '<p>Stylish two bedroom duplex apartment on the south side of the island, next  to the sea, with a view and a large terrace!</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The apartment has a total  floor area of &#8203;&#8203;100 m2 (Maisonette) and faces west.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>This is the only  apartment in the block designed over two floors intended as a holiday  home.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Access to the apartment is through the front foyer, or directly  from outside through the terrace.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartment is on two floors and it has  superb views over the garden, and has a large covered terrace of 32  m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>At level 1 there is a living room with large windows facing the sea, and access to the terrace, as well as a kitchen and bathroom with shower. A  modern staircase leads from the kitchen up to the first floor where there  are two bedrooms and additional bathroom with bath.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The kitchen is fitted  with high quality appliances, and the entire property has been finished  stylishly and with the most modern designs. It has modern variable lighting  system, under-floor heating TV sat, intercom and a central vacuum system.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>These apartments offer affordable luxury and comfort,  designed for modern holidays with every thought given to fully exploit the  available space, and because of the high quality construction and the best position, it also offers a good opportunity to increase in value.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>If you  wish, by renting, you can achieve a high return on investment. The  apartments were built in 2008 and have always been very popular with tourists. Demand is very high and booked early.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The land is surrounded by  pine woodland, established olive groves and vineyards and the area is so  peaceful it is perfect for rest and relaxation. You will enjoy the healthy  Mediterranean lifestyle here as Hvar happens to be the location of the  maximum sunshine in all of Croatia!</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The beach is at the bottom of the  garden and the crystal clear water is perfect for swimming and relaxing  in.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>By boat you can easily visit any of the secluded beaches and seafood restaurants on the small islands nearby.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Outside there is shaded  parking, a large terrace overlooking the sea, with bbq grill, a communal  laundry facility, solar unit and hot water energy saving with thermal brick  water tank in the garden.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>This is a superb property, and the photographs  don''t do it justice.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>To visit please call our office and meet our  representative on Hvar island.</p>', '', '827_Apartment_0.jpg', '827_Apartment_1.jpg', '827_Apartment_2.jpg', '827_Apartment_3.jpg', '827_Apartment_4.jpg', '827_Apartment_5.jpg', '827_Apartment_6.jpg', '827_Apartment_7.jpg', '827_Apartment_8.jpg'),
(828, 'Zlatan', 'Èièak', '092 253 0561', '004917696870386', 'kljuè Tomiæ- 092/243 3254', 'Kastela', 'Ka¹tel Luk¹iæ, povi¹e dvorca', 'For sale', 'Old stone house', '75', '0', '37', 2, '45000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 2, 1, 'August 29, 2014', '<p>Stara kamena kuæa u nizu, potpuno renovirana 2012. god., u mirnom dijelu prekrasnog mjesta Ka&scaron;tela, smje&scaron;tena u blizini povijesnog dvorca. Kuæa ima ukupnu stambenu povr&scaron;inu 37 m2 + krovna terasa 2 m2 sa koje se pru¾a djelomièan pogled na more. Kuæa je potpuno renovirana i namje&scaron;tena te nisu potrebna nikakva dodatna ulaganja.</p>', '<p>This two bedroom old stone house was completely renovated in 2012 and is situated in a quiet part of the beautiful Kastela village, near the historic castle. The house has a total living area of 37 m2&nbsp; with access to a&nbsp; 2 m2 roof terrace offering a partial sea views. The house has been completely renovated and furnished, and does not require any additional investment.</p>', '', '<p style="color: #f10d28;">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Stara kamena kuæa u nizu, potpuno renovirana 2012. god., u mirnom dijelu prekrasnog mjesta Ka&scaron;tela, smje&scaron;tena u blizini povijesnog dvorca.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ka&scaron;tela su 7 malih mjesta koja se nalaze izmeðu Trogira i Splita i bilje¾e sve veæa turistièka noæenja i popularnost.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa ima ukupnu stambenu povr&scaron;inu 37 m2 + krovna terasa 2 m2 sa koje se pru¾a djelomièan pogled na more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U prizemlju se nalazi kuhinja i kupaonica. Na 1. i 2. katu se nalazi po 1 spavaæa soba. Postoji moguænost instalacije dizala.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je potpuno renovirana, te nisu potrebni nikakvi dodatni radovi.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>*** Kuhinja je ukljuèena u cijenu</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Najbli¾i parking udaljen je 15 m od kuæe, dok se u blizini takoðer nalazi manja marina za brodove.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je idealna za vlastiti odmor, ali i za svrhu turistièkog iznajmljivanja zbog sve veæe popularnosti mjesta.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Svi potrebni sadr¾aji nalaze se u blizini, dok je meðunarodni aerodrom udaljen 15 min. vo¾nje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za sve dodatne informacije stojimo vam na raspolaganju.</p>', '<p style="color: #fa0413;">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>This two bedroom old stone house was completely renovated in 2012 and is  situated in a quiet part of the beautiful Kastela village, near the historic  castle.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kastela is the Croatian word for &lsquo;Castle&rsquo; and the village is made  from 7 small villages that grew up around a line of castles built by the  Venetians between Trogir and Split.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>This village has the fastest growing  numbers of tourists and increased numbers of enquiries.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house has a  total living area of 37 m2&nbsp; with access to a&nbsp; 2 m2 roof terrace offering a  partial sea views.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the ground floor there is a kitchen and bathroom.&nbsp;On  the 1st floor is one bedroom.&nbsp;2nd floor has 1 bedroom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Both the inside  and outside of this property have been completely refurbished, and redecorated  stylishly to a good standard.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house has been completely renovated.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>***The kitchen is included in the price.</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The nearest  parking is 15 yards away, while there is also a small marina for yachts  nearby.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>All facilities such as shops, bars, and restaurants are located  nearby, while the international airport is 10 minutes driving.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house  is ideal for your own private home, but can also be used for the purpose of  renting to tourists.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For people looking for a property that is also a good  investment, this location is one we would recommend.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For further  information we are at your disposal.</p>', '', '828_Old-stone-house_0.jpg', '828_Old-stone-house_1.jpg', '828_Old-stone-house_2.jpg', '828_Old-stone-house_3.jpg', '828_Old-stone-house_4.jpg', '828_Old-stone-house_5.jpg', '828_Old-stone-house_6.jpg', '828_Old-stone-house_7.jpg', '828_Old-stone-house_8.jpg'),
(829, 'Ana', 'Pletikosa', '091/735-2147 Ana', 'Helena +447809694933', 'helenapletikosa@icloud.com', 'Sibenik', 'Greba¹tica donja bb, Greba¹tica, 204/7 i 207', 'For sale', 'Land plot', '10', '386', '0', 2, '154500', '', 2, 2, 2, 1, 1, 2, 0, 0, 'August 29, 2014', '<p>Graðevinsko zemlji&scaron;te u prvom redu do mora u mirnoj uvali u blizini &Scaron;ibenika! Zemlji&scaron;te je od mora i pje&scaron;èane pla¾e udaljeno svega 10 metara! Povr&scaron;ina zemlji&scaron;ta iznosi 386 m2, a na zemlji&scaron;tu je moguæa gradnja obiteljske kuæe ili vi&scaron;estambenog objekta. Zemlji&scaron;te je ju¾ne orijentacije!</p>', '<p>Rare opportunity to buy a sea front building plot on the mainland.&nbsp;It is situated on the coast near Sibenik, in a tranquil and quiet cove, with a perfect beach, just yards from the waters edge.&nbsp;The plot is a good size, 386m sq, and it would be permissible to build either an apartment block or a large family villa.&nbsp;The plot is south facing.</p>', '', '<p>Graðevinsko zemlji&scaron;te u prvom redu do mora u mirnoj uvali u blizini &Scaron;ibenika!</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Zemlji&scaron;te je od mora i pje&scaron;èane pla¾e udaljeno svega 10 metara!</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Povr&scaron;ina zemlji&scaron;ta iznosi 386 m2, a na zemlji&scaron;tu je moguæa gradnja obiteljske kuæe ili vi&scaron;estambenog objekta.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Zemlji&scaron;te je ju¾ne orijentacije!</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Tik do zemlji&scaron;ta se nalazi pristupni put te prikljuèci za vodu i struju.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ovo je jedno od posljednjih neizgraðenih zemlji&scaron;ta u prvom redu do mora na ovom dijelu obale!</p>', '<p>Rare opportunity to buy a sea front building plot on the mainland.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is situated on the coast near Sibenik, in a tranquil and quiet cove, with a perfect beach, just yards from  the waters edge.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The plot is a good size, 386m sq, and it would be  permissible to build either an apartment block or a large family  villa.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The plot is south facing. There  are connections for water and electricity adjacent to the plot.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Any  property here is very salable, especially on the sea front.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>This plot is  the one of the last unbuilt plot on the water&rsquo;s edge, along this part of the  coast.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact the office.</p>', '', '829_Land-plot_0.jpg', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(830, 'Damir', 'Radanoviæ', '', '', '', 'Split', 'Kamenita 4, 11417/1  zgr 374/1', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '200', '0', '53', 1, '135000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 'August 29, 2014', '<p>Apartman u staroj kamenoj zgradi u srcu starog dijela Splita, udaljen od Rive i Dioklecijanove palaèe svega 3 min. hodanja. Nalazi se na 3.katu (potkrovlje), ukupne stambene povr&scaron;ine 53 m2. Sastoji se od kuhinje + dnevnog boravka, 2 spavaæe sobe i 1 kupaonice. Apartmanu je potrebno kompletno renoviranje.</p>', '<p>Apartment, in need of refurbishment, in the centre of Split. The property is a 3rd floor apartment of 53m sq, 2 bedrooms, in a superb old stone building just a few minutes away from the Riva and Diocletian palace. It needs complete renovation, which is reflected in the sale price, and it could become a very stylish and luxurious oasis either for private use or tourism.</p>', '', '<p>Apartman u staroj kamenoj zgradi u srcu starog dijela Splita, udaljen od Rive i Dioklecijanove palaèe svega 3 min. hodanja.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Smje&scaron;ten je u mirnom dijelu koji je idealan za vlastiti odmor, ali isto tako i za turistièko iznajmljivanje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nalazi se na 3.katu (potkrovlje), ukupne stambene povr&scaron;ine 53 m2. Sastoji se od kuhinje + dnevnog boravka, 2 spavaæe sobe i 1 kupaonice.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartmanu je potrebno kompletno renoviranje te se uz dodatno ulaganje mo¾e pretvoriti u luksuznu oazu u jednom od najpopularnijih gradova u Dalmaciji.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Visina stropova u apartmanu je 190 m, ali to ne umanjuje njegovu vrijednost koliko bi se zapravo dobilo sa daljnim ulaganjem.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Najbli¾i parking udaljen je svega 20 m od kuæe, &scaron;to je jo&scaron; jedna prednost ovog apartmana.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Mnogobrojne trgovine, kafiæi, barovi i svi ostali tradicionalni i moderni sadr¾aji nalaze se u blizini.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Najbli¾e pla¾e nalaze se u park &scaron;umi Marjan udaljenoj 5 min. vo¾nje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Meðunarodni aerodorm udaljen je 40 min. vo¾nje.</p>', '<p>Apartment, in need of refurbishment, in the centre of Split.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property  is a 3rd floor apartment of 53m sq, 2 bedrooms, in a superb old stone building  just a few minutes away from the Riva and Diocletian palace.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The current  layout of the apartment is 2 bedrooms, one bathroom and a kitchen/  lounge.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It needs complete renovation, which is reflected in the sale  price, and it could become a very stylish and luxurious oasis either for private  use or tourism.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is situated in a quiet street, with parking nearby,  and its central location makes it easy to walk to any of Split&rsquo;s bars, shops and  restaurants or the ferry terminal with access to the islands.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact our office to arrange to visit this apartment.</p>', '', '830_Apartment_0.jpg', '830_Apartment_1.jpg', '830_Apartment_2.jpg', '830_Apartment_3.jpg', '830_Apartment_4.jpg', '', '', '', ''),
(831, 'Rukija', 'Peniæ', '', '098559908', 'rukija.penic@gmail.com', 'Kastela', 'K.Stari, Obala Kralja Tomislava 35, ', 'For sale', 'Old stone house', '20', '0', '75', 1, '88000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 1, 1, 'August 29, 2014', '<p>Stara kamena kuæa u 2.redu od mora, potpuno renovirana i namje&scaron;tena, u centru starog dijela jednog od 7 prekrasnih Ka&scaron;tela. Kuæa ima prizemlje, 1.kat, 2.kat i potkrovlje koje trenutno nije u funkciji stanovanja, ali se mo¾e preurediti u galeriju. Ukupna brutto stambena povr&scaron;ina iznosi 75 m2. Namje&scaron;taj je ukljuèen u cijenu.</p>', '<p>We are pleased to present this stylishly restored traditional Dalmatian cottage,  close to the sea in the historic part of Kastela.&nbsp;It is situated on the  second row of property, close to one of the seven Castles which make up the  focal point of this short part of the coast- between Trogir and  Split.The house consists of 3 floors, and an attic which could be used  by the occupants as a gallery, bedroom, etc. The living area is a total of  75m sq.</p>', '', '<p>Stara kamena kuæa u 2.redu od mora, potpuno renovirana i namje&scaron;tena, u centru starog dijela jednog od 7 prekrasnih Ka&scaron;tela.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa ima prizemlje, 1.kat, 2.kat i potkrovlje koje trenutno nije u funkciji stanovanja, ali se mo¾e preurediti u galeriju.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ukupna brutto stambena povr&scaron;ina iznosi 75 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U prizemlju se nalazi kuhinja + blagovaonica i kupaonica. Na 1.katu se nalazi dnevni boravak, dok se na 2.katu nalazi spavaæa soba.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Krov i sve instalacije vode i struje su promjenjeni prije nekoliko godina, dok je unutarnji dio potpuno renoviran 2014. godine.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Namje&scaron;taj je ukljuèen u cijenu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ovo je idealna prilika ¾elite li kuæu spremnu za useljenje u svrhu vlastitog boravka ili turistièko iznajmljivanje s obzirom da su Ka&scaron;tela iz godine u godinu sve popularnija destinacija.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Svi potrebni sadr¾aji nalaze se u blizini dok je meðunarodni aerodrom udaljen svega 10 min. vo¾nje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za sve dodatne informacije stojimo vam na raspolaganju.</p>', '<p>We are pleased to present this stylishly restored traditional Dalmatian cottage,  close to the sea in the historic part of Kastela.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is situated on the  second row of property, close to one of the seven Castles which make up the  focal point of this short part of the coast- between Trogir and  Split.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house consists of 3 floors, and an attic which could be used  by the occupants as a gallery, bedroom, etc.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The living area is a total of  75m sq.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The ground floor has a kitchen, dining room and bathroom. The  first floor is a large living room.&nbsp;The second floor is a bedroom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The  exterior of the building was renovated several years ago, and the internal work  was completed only in 2014.&nbsp;The internal work and decorating has been done to  a high standard and this property represents excellent value for money.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The furniture is not included in the price but can be purchased  separately.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>This is one area where we expect prices to increase over the  next few years, based on its increasing popularity with tourists and the  proximity to the airport and Split town.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact our office for  more information and to arrange to visit the property.</p>', '', '831_Old-stone-house_0.jpg', '831_Old-stone-house_1.jpg', '831_Old-stone-house_2.jpg', '831_Old-stone-house_3.jpg', '831_Old-stone-house_4.jpg', '831_Old-stone-house_5.jpg', '831_Old-stone-house_6.jpg', '831_Old-stone-house_7.jpg', '831_Old-stone-house_8.jpg');
INSERT INTO `nekretnina` (`id`, `ime`, `prezime`, `telefon`, `mobitel`, `e_mail`, `lokacija_id`, `adresa`, `status_id`, `vrsta_id`, `udaljenost`, `povrsina`, `stambenapovrsina`, `display`, `cijena`, `cijenatocka`, `ponuda_tjedna`, `new_built`, `must_sell`, `prvi_red_do_mora`, `pogled_na_more`, `bazen`, `broj_soba`, `broj_kupatila`, `datum`, `title_hr`, `title_en`, `title_ge`, `opis_hr`, `opis_en`, `opis_ge`, `PropertyImageURL0`, `PropertyImageURL1`, `PropertyImageURL2`, `PropertyImageURL3`, `PropertyImageURL4`, `PropertyImageURL5`, `PropertyImageURL6`, `PropertyImageURL7`, `PropertyImageURL8`) VALUES
(832, '®eljko', 'Katunariæ', '®eljko 091/ 582 9850', '095/ 916 1616', '', 'Split', 'Vijugasta 37, zgr 108, 11833 arkod-kat.', 'For sale', 'Old stone house', '400', '150', '140', 2, '300000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 3, 2, 'August 29, 2014', '<p>Stara kamena kuæa sa prostranim dvori&scaron;tem i izvrsnim turistièkim potencijalom, u starom dijelu grada Splita udaljena od Rive i Dioklecijanove palaèe svega 5 min. hodanja. Dvori&scaron;te ima cca. 90 m2 gdje je moguæe parkirati 2 automobila ali i napraviti bazen. Kuæa se sastoji od prizemlja, 1. i 2.kata ukupne stambene povr&scaron;ine 140 m2.</p>', '<p>Old stone house in need of complete internal renovation in the centre of Split,  with large yard and parking.&nbsp;The house is on a large plot of 150m sq, of which 90m sq  is the yard, and the remainder is the &lsquo;footprint&rsquo; of the house.&nbsp;It currently  consists of three floors, with a total of 140m sq of residential living space. The yard is big enough for 2 cars to park, very much a rarity  in Split, or could be used as a large patio, even with a pool.</p>', '', '<p>Stara kamena kuæa sa prostranim dvori&scaron;tem i izvrsnim turistièkim potencijalom, u starom dijelu grada Splita udaljena od Rive i Dioklecijanove palaèe svega 5 min. hodanja.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Najbli¾e prekrasne pla¾e nalaze se u park &scaron;umi Marjan koja se nalazi nedaleko od kuæe.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Smje&scaron;tena je na zemlji&scaron;tu ukupne povr&scaron;ine 150 m2. Dvori&scaron;te ima cca. 90 m2 gdje je moguæe parkirati 2 automobila ali i napraviti bazen.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa se sastoji od prizemlja, 1. i 2.kata ukupne stambene povr&scaron;ine 140 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Prizemlje ima 2 vanjska ulaza i povezano je unutarnjim stepenicama sa 1.katom. 2.kat ima vanjski ulaz ali je moguæe napraviti i unutarnje stepenice.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U prizemlju je smje&scaron;tena kuhinja + blagovaonica + dnevni boravak, kupaonica i 1 radna soba.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na 1.katu su 2 spavaæe sobe i terasa iz koje se pru¾aju stepenice za 2.kat.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na 2.katu se nalazi kuhinja + blagovaonica + dnevni boravak, 1 spavaæa soba i kupaonica.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je u funkciji stanovanja ali joj je potrebno renoviranje. Sa dodatnim ulaganjem se mo¾e dobiti prava luksuzna stara kamena kuæa u samom centru.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Svi potrebni sadr¾aji nalazi se u blizini, dok je meðunarodni aerodrom udaljen 40 min. vo¾nje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za sva dodatna pitanja stojimo vam na raspolaganju.</p>', '<p>Old stone house in need of complete internal renovation in the centre of Split,  with large yard and parking.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is situated 3 minutes walking distance from  the Roman Palace and the famous Riva, and 5 minutes from the Marjan forest park  and ACI marina.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house is on a large plot of 150m sq, of which 90m sq  is the yard, and the remainder is the &lsquo;footprint&rsquo; of the house.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It currently  consists of three floors, with a total of 140m sq of residential living space (Ground, first and second).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The ground floor has two entrances. One goes  directly up to the second floor, and the other goes into the ground floor, which  is connected to the first floor by an internal staircase.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The ground floor  has kitchen, dining room, lounge, study and bathroom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The first floor has 2  bedrooms and a terrace, and from the terrace there is also access to stairs and  the 2nd floor.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The second floor is almost an independent apartment, at the  moment, that has a kitchen with a dining area, lounge, 1 bedroom and  bathroom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house is habitable, but needs modernising and refurbishing  completely.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The yard is big enough for 2 cars to park, very much a rarity  in Split, or could be used as a large patio, even with a pool.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Renovation  projects like this one are becoming harder to find, and are always popular, so  please contact the office here in Split to arrange a viewing.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Croatia  Property Sales can advise and assist with the project management of the  restoration work.</p>', '', '832_Old-stone-house_0.jpg', '832_Old-stone-house_1.jpg', '832_Old-stone-house_2.jpg', '832_Old-stone-house_3.jpg', '832_Old-stone-house_4.jpg', '832_Old-stone-house_5.jpg', '832_Old-stone-house_6.jpg', '832_Old-stone-house_7.jpg', '832_Old-stone-house_8.jpg'),
(834, 'Vi¹nja', 'Lokas', '', '091/597 9774', '', 'Split', 'Makarska 18 (®njan)', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '1300', '0', '78', 1, '210000', '', 2, 1, 2, 2, 1, 2, 3, 2, 'August 29, 2014', '<p>Apartman u novogradnji u jako kvalitetnoj zgradi i mirnom okru¾enju na jugoistoènoj strani Splita. Smje&scaron;ten je na 2. katu sa pogledom na more i ureðeno dvori&scaron;te. Ukupna stambena povr&scaron;ina iznosi 78 m2, a sastoji se od hodnika,&nbsp; kuhinje + blagovaonice + dnevnog boravka, 3 spavaæe sobe, kupaonice, wc-a i terase. Zgrada je potpuno zavr&scaron;ena 2010. godine, ali se i dalje nastoji odr¾avanjem ostati na istom nivou ureðenja i kvalitete.</p>', '<p>We are very pleased to offer this large and well built apartment just outside Split. It is newly built and the environment has been carefully landscaped, making it a popular and sought after block. It is situated on the south east side of the city of Split, 1.3km from the coast, and 10 minutes from the centre of Split. The apartment is 78m sq and it consists of a hallway, kitchen with dining area, a lounge and 3 bedrooms, bathroom and a good sized balcony.</p>', '', '<p>Apartman u novogradnji u jako kvalitetnoj zgradi i mirnom okru¾enju na jugoistoènoj strani Splita. Smje&scaron;ten je na 2. katu sa pogledom na more i ureðeno dvori&scaron;te.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>More i prekrasna pje&scaron;èana pla¾a su udaljeni 1,3 km.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ukupna stambena povr&scaron;ina iznosi 78 m2, a sastoji se od hodnika,&nbsp; kuhinje + blagovaonice + dnevnog boravka, 3 spavaæe sobe, kupaonice, wc-a i terase.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Zgrada je potpuno zavr&scaron;ena 2010. godine, ali se i dalje nastoji odr¾avanjem ostati na istom nivou ureðenja i kvalitete.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Namje&scaron;taj nije ukljuèen u cijenu ali postoji moguænost dogovora sa vlasnicima.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ispred zgrade se nalaze javna parking mjesta ali postoji moguænost kupnje u podzemnoj gara¾i u istoj zgradi.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Trgovina, pekara, banka, ljekarna i svi ostali sadr¾aji se nalaze u blizini.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Centar Splita udaljen je 20 min., dok je do meðunarodnog aerodroma potrebno 40 min. vo¾nje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za sve dodatne informacije stojimo vam na raspolaganju.</p>', '<p>We are very pleased to offer this large and well built apartment just outside  Split.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is newly built and the environment has been carefully  landscaped, making it a popular and sought after block.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is situated on  the south east side of the city of Split, 1.3km from the coast, and 10 minutes  from the centre of Split.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The apartment is 78m sq and it consists of a  hallway, kitchen with dining area, a lounge and 3 bedrooms, bathroom and a good  sized balcony.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The building was completed in 2010, but it is one which is  well maintained and the quality of the construction has ensured that it does not  show signs of ageing.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The purchase of the stylish furniture can be made  separately.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There is public parking in front of the property, or garages  in the underground car-park are available for purchase.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The building is  well placed for the occupants to enjoy the many options for shops, bars, coffee  bars, bakers, restaurants and other services and the airport is just 30 minutes  drive from here.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact our office to arrange to visit this  apartment.</p>', '', '834_Apartment_0.jpg', '834_Apartment_1.jpg', '834_Apartment_2.jpg', '834_Apartment_3.jpg', '834_Apartment_4.jpg', '834_Apartment_5.jpg', '834_Apartment_6.jpg', '834_Apartment_7.jpg', '834_Apartment_8.jpg'),
(835, 'Jadranka', 'Èabov', '01/49 21 222 (9-17.00 h)', '091/49 21 101, Ana Begiæ (kljuè) - 098 934  22 11', 'Jadranka.cabov@gfk.com', 'Primosten', '22202 Primo¹ten; Varo¹ 6, È.zgr. 954 KO Primo¹ten', 'For sale', 'Old stone house', '50', '270', '500', 1, '1000000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 11, 3, 'August 29, 2014', '<p>Ekskluzivna lokacija! Stara kamena kuæa s prekrasnim pogledom na more u samom centru Primo&scaron;tena udaljena svega 50 metara od mora! Kuæa se sastoji od prizemlja, dva kata i potkrovlja, ukupne stambene povr&scaron;ine 500 m2. Ovo je jedinstvena nekretnina u Primo&scaron;tenu koja nudi brojne investicijske moguænosti (hotel, hostel, luksuzna kame vila s pogledom na more i slièno.)</p>', '<p>Fabulous property!&nbsp;We are pleased to offer this historic old stone house, built in 1918 at the end of the Austria-Hungary empire, in the centre of the beautiful village of Primosten, 50 m from the sea. It consists internally of a ground floor, and three upper floors, one of which is the attic, totaling 500m sq. This is a unique property in Primosten, and since it will always be the dominant building in the old part of the village, would be a superb building to be a Hotel, Spa, Hostel etc.</p>', '', '<p>Ekskluzivna lokacija! Stara kamena kuæa s prekrasnim pogledom na more u samom centru Primo&scaron;tena udaljena svega 50 metara od mora!</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa se sastoji od prizemlja, dva kata i potkrovlja, ukupne stambene povr&scaron;ine 500 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Graðena je 1918.&nbsp; godine - austrougarska gradnja bez ikakvih naknadnih zahvata. Tlocrtna povr&scaron;ina kuæe iznosi cca 150 m2 (18 x 8,5 metara).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U prizemlju kuæe se nalaze tri velike prostorije, 2 sanitarna èvora te ulazni prostor.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na prvom katu se nalazi pet soba, svaka za zasebnim ulazom iz hodnika (prvotno je bilo&nbsp; &scaron;est soba, ali dvije sobe su spojene u jednu veliku sa èetiri prozora) te sanitarni èvor. Prvi kat ima izlaz na veliku terasu ( 100-ak m2) s koje se pru¾a prekrasan pogled na more i staru gradsku jezgru). Autentièno drveno stubi&scaron;te vodi na drugi kat.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na drugom katu je &scaron;est soba, svaka sa zasebnim ulazom te sanitarni èvor.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Tavanski prostor je vrlo interesantan jer nudi prekrasan pogled na otvoreno more i otoke. Njega je takoðer moguæe preurediti u stambeni prostor.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Okuænicu saèinjava vrt i velika stara cisterna koja je puna vode. Cisterna je prekrivena betonskom ploèom te je uz manju investiciju moguæe pretvoriti u bazen.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ovo je jedinstvena nekretnina u Primo&scaron;tenu koja nudi brojne investicijske moguænosti (hotel, hostel, luksuzna kamena vila s pogledom na more i slièno).</p>', '<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;">Fabulous property!</span></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>We are pleased to offer this historic old stone house,  built in 1918 at the end of the Austria-Hungary empire, in the centre of the  beautiful village of Primosten, 50 m from the sea.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It consists internally  of a ground floor, and three upper floors, one of which is the attic, totaling  500m sq. Each floor is about 150m sq. (18 x 8.5m).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The current  layout, which has been untouched since it was built is:</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ground floor: 3 large  reception rooms, 2 bathrooms and the main entrance foyer.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>First floor: 5  bedrooms plus toilet. (originally 6 bedroom, but two have had their internal  walls removed to make it double size. This has 4 windows. The first floor  also has the spectacular terrace, 100m sq with spectacular views over the town  and to sea.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The original &lsquo;feature&rsquo; staircase leads up to the 2nd floor  where are 6 more rooms and a toilet.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The attic has never been part of the  residential space, but it could easily be incorporated into the property as  extra bedrooms etc, and would of course, have the most spectacular and  unobstructed views.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There is a large courtyard, which is in the garden,  and this is mostly the giant water tank used to store water before the mains  supply was connected, which could easily be converted to become a swimming  pool.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>This is a unique property in Primosten, and since it will always be  the dominant building in the old part of the village, would be a superb building  to be a Hotel, Spa, Hostel etc.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Primosten is a small, unspoilt and  popular village North along the coast from Trogir, easily accessible from the  airport, and close to several National Parks.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact the Croatia  Property Sales office in Split for more information.</p>', '', '835_Old-stone-house_0.jpg', '835_Old-stone-house_1.jpg', '835_Old-stone-house_2.jpg', '835_Old-stone-house_3.jpg', '835_Old-stone-house_4.jpg', '', '', '', ''),
(843, 'Andja', 'Reinke', '', '', 'info@nautilus-bay.com', 'Hvar', 'Zavala', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '30', '0', '0', 1, '190000', '', 2, 1, 2, 1, 1, 2, 0, 0, 'September 6, 2014', '<p>Nudimo na prodaju devet apartmana vrhunske kvalitete u prvom redu do mora na ju¾noj strani otoka Hvara! Apartmani su smje&scaron;teni na jednom od deset najljep&scaron;ih otoka na svijetu, na samoj obali s prekrasnim pogledom na more.</p>\r\n<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;">Raspon cijene 190,000 do 245,000 eura. Apartmani 77-88 m2.</span></p>\r\n<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;">Jo&scaron; samo 3 apartmana na prodaju !</span></p>', '<p>Croatia Property Sales is offering for sale 9 high-quality one and two-bedroom sea front apartments on Hvar island/South side! The apartments are located on one of the ten most beautiful islands in the world, right on the sea front with fantastic sea views.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;">Price range from 190.000 to 245.000 Euro. Apartments from 77 to 88 m2.</span></p>\r\n<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;">Only 3 apartments still available!</span></p>', '', '<p>Nudimo na prodaju devet apartmana vrhunske kvalitete u prvom redu do mora na ju¾noj strani otoka Hvara!&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartmani su smje&scaron;teni na jednom od deset najljep&scaron;ih otoka na svijetu, na samoj obali s prekrasnim pogledom na more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;">Raspon cijene 85,000 do 245,000 eura. Apartmani 44-100 m2.</span></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;"><strong>Apartman 10 - 105,000 Eura </strong></span><strong>- <span style="color: #ff0000;">PRODANO!</span></strong></p>\r\n<p>1-sobni stan, u prizemlju, 50,7 m2, orijentacija jug / istok&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;"><strong>Apartman 11 - 215,000 Eura</strong></span>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>2-sobni stan, u prizemlju, 99,2 m2, orijentacija&nb