m2&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>- 742 m&sup2; stambenog prostora</p>\r\n<p>- Prvi red do mora</p>\r\n<p>- Natkriveni parking</p>\r\n<p>- Kuæica s ro&scaron;tiljem</p>\r\n<p>- Prostrani ulaz / predsoblje</p>\r\n<p>- Podrum i zajednièka perilica rublja</p>\r\n<p>- Solarni paneli</p>\r\n<p>- Energetski uèinkovita gradnja</p>\r\n<p>- Cisterna za navodnjavanje vrtova</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong><span style="text-decoration: underline;">Apartmani imaju:</span></strong></p>\r\n<p>- Izuzetno prostrane terase s pogledom na more</p>\r\n<p>- Potpuno opremljene kuhinje s kvalitetnim aparatima</p>\r\n<p>- Potpuno namje&scaron;tene sobe</p>\r\n<p>- Potpuno opremljene kupaonice</p>\r\n<p>- Kvalitetna rasvjetna tijela</p>\r\n<p>- Elegantan vrtni namje&scaron;taj</p>\r\n<p>- Klima</p>\r\n<p>- Podno grijanje</p>\r\n<p>- Satelitska televizija</p>\r\n<p>- WIFI</p>\r\n<p>- Intercom&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ovi apartmani nude luksuz i komfor, a istovremeno su cijenom vrlo pristupaèni. Izgraðeni su 2008. godine!</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Zemlji&scaron;te je okru¾eno borovom &scaron;umom, maslinicima i vinogradima, a podruèje je vrlo mirno, tako da je pogodno za odmor i opu&scaron;tanje.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Pla¾a se nalazi na dnu vrta te nudi kristalno èisto more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Brodom mo¾ete lako posjetiti bilo koji od skrovitih pla¾a i ribljih restorana na malim otocima u blizini.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Zajednièke dijelove kuæe èini: natkriveni parking, velika terasa s pogledom na more i kuæicom s ro&scaron;tiljem, zajednièka praonica rublja, sustav solarnih æelija te sustav za pripremu priprema tople vode.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za razgledavanje nazovite na&scaron; ured na otoku Hvaru.</p>', '<p>Croatia Property Sales is offering for sale nine high-quality one and two-bedroom sea front apartments on Hvar island/South side!</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The apartments are located on one of the ten most beautiful islands in the world, right on the sea front with fantastic sea views.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;">Price range from 85.000 to 245.000 Euro. Apartments from 44 to 100 m2.</span></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong><span style="text-decoration: underline;">Apartment 10 - 105.000 Euro</span> - <span style="color: #ff0000;">SOLD!</span></strong></p>\r\n<p>1-bedroom apartment, ground floor, 50.7 m2, south/east orientation</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong><span style="text-decoration: underline;">Apartment 11 - 215.000 Euro</span></strong></p>\r\n<p>2-bedroom apartment, ground floor, 99.2 m2, south/west orientation</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong><span style="text-decoration: underline;">Apartment 12 - 85.000 Euro</span><strong>&nbsp;-&nbsp;<span style="color: #ff0000;">SOLD!</span></strong></strong></p>\r\n<p>studio apartment, ground floor, 44.2 m2, east orientation</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><span style="color: #000000;"><strong><span style="text-decoration: underline;">Apartment 20</span> - <span style="color: #ff0000;">SOLD!</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p>2-bedroom apartment, first floor, 79.2 m2, south/east orientation</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;"><strong>Apartment 21 - 190.000 Euro</strong></span></p>\r\n<p>2-bedroom apartment, first floor, 77.9 m2, south/west orientation</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><span style="color: #000000;"><strong><span style="text-decoration: underline;">Apartment 22</span> - <span style="color: #ff0000;">SOLD!</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p>2-bedroom apartment, ground and first floor, 100.3 m2, north/west orientation</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><span style="color: #000000;"><strong><span style="text-decoration: underline;">Apartment 30</span> - <span style="color: #ff0000;">SOLD!</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p>2-bedroom apartment, second floor, 79.2 m2, south/east orientation</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><span style="color: #000000;"><strong><span style="text-decoration: underline;">Apartment 31</span> - <span style="color: #ff0000;">SOLD!</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p>2-bedroom apartment, second floor, 77.9 m2, south/west orientation</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong><span style="text-decoration: underline;">Apartment 40 - 245.000 Euro</span></strong></p>\r\n<p>2-bedroom suite, third floor, 87.2 m2, south/east/west orientation</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;"><strong>The house offers:</strong></span></p>\r\n<p>- plot with 1.358 m2</p>\r\n<p>- 742 m&sup2; residential area</p>\r\n<p>- Beach/seafront location</p>\r\n<p>- Shaded parking</p>\r\n<p>- Barbecue house</p>\r\n<p>- Spacious entrance hall</p>\r\n<p>- Basement and central washing machine</p>\r\n<p>- Solar panels</p>\r\n<p>- Energy-saving construction using thermal bricks</p>\r\n<p>- Cistern for garden irrigation</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;"><strong>The apartments offer:</strong></span></p>\r\n<p>- Extremely spacious terraces with sea views</p>\r\n<p>- Fully equipped kitchens with high quality appliances</p>\r\n<p>- Fully furnished rooms</p>\r\n<p>- Fully equipped bathrooms</p>\r\n<p>- Extensive lighting fixtures</p>\r\n<p>- Elegant patio furniture</p>\r\n<p>- Air conditioning</p>\r\n<p>- Underfloor heating</p>\r\n<p>- Satellite television</p>\r\n<p>- WIFI reception</p>\r\n<p>- Central vacuum cleaner</p>\r\n<p>- Intercom</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>These apartments offer affordable luxury and comfort, designed for modern holidays with every thought given to fully exploit the available space, and because of the high quality construction and the best position, it also offers a good opportunity to increase in value.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>If you wish, by renting, you can achieve a high return on investment. The apartments were built in 2008 and have always been very popular with tourists. Demand is very high and booked early.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The land is surrounded by pine woodland, established olive groves and vineyards and the area is so peaceful it is perfect for rest and relaxation. You will enjoy the healthy Mediterranean lifestyle here as Hvar happens to be the location of the maximum sunshine in all of Croatia!</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The beach is at the bottom of the garden and the crystal clear water is perfect for swimming and relaxing in.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>By boat you can easily visit any of the secluded beaches and seafood restaurants on the small islands nearby.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Outside there is shaded parking, a large terrace overlooking the sea, with bbq grill, a communal laundry facility, solar unit and hot water energy saving with thermal brick water tank in the garden.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>This is a superb property, and the photographs don''t do it justice.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>To visit please call our office and meet our representative on Hvar island.</p>', '', '843_Apartment_0.jpg', '843_Apartment_1.jpg', '843_Apartment_2.jpg', '843_Apartment_3.jpg', '843_Apartment_4.jpg', '843_Apartment_5.jpg', '843_Apartment_6.jpg', '843_Apartment_7.jpg', '843_Apartment_8.jpg'),
(836, 'Nik¹a', 'Regoviæ', '', '', '', 'Hvar', '', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '4000', '600', '185', 1, '290000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 5, 2, 'August 29, 2014', '<p>Vila na rubu lijepog otoèkog sela, 4 km od mora! Vila se nalazi na mirnoj lokaciji i orjentirana je ju¾no tako da je cijeli dan izlo¾ena suncu. Oko kuæe se nalazi prekrasan vrt s velikim drveæem i lijepom palmom ispred same kuæe. Kuæa ima stambenu povr&scaron;inu 185 m2 i okuænicu od cca. 600 m2 okru¾ena borom &scaron;umom i mirom. Izvrsna lokacija!</p>', '<p>Villa at the edge of a charming old village! The house is located in a  quiet area, south oriented where you can enjoy the sun all the day long with  fantastic views of the village.&nbsp;The  house is surrounded by a cultivated garden full of mediterranean plants and a  palm tree in front of the house, giving much needed shade in high summer. The house has 185m sq. of the living area and the land plot is 600m sq.</p>', '', '<p>Vila na rubu lijepog otoèkog sela,4 km od mora!&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Vila se nalazi na mirnoj lokaciji i orjentirana je ju¾no tako da je cijeli dan izlo¾ena suncu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sastoji se od prizemlja koje je sa unutarnjim stepenicama povezano sa prvim katom na kojem su tri spavaæe sobe s balkonima i velika kupaonica.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U prizemlju je kuhinja sa blagavaonicom, dnevni boravak s kaminom i jo&scaron; jedna spavaæa soba s terasom i WC-om.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Oko kuæe se nalazi prekrasan vrt s velikim drveæem i lijepom palmom ispred same kuæe.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na ulazu u dvoriste nalazi se gara¾a na kojoj je jo&scaron; jedna lijepa terasa koja slu¾i kao krasno mjesto za ljetni popodnevni odmor u hladu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa ima okuænicu od cca. 600 m2 okru¾ena borom &scaron;umom i mirom. Izvrsna lokacija!</p>', '<p>Villa at the edge of a charming old village !</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house is located in a  quiet area, south oriented where you can enjoy the sun all the day long with  fantastic views of the village.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the ground floor there is a kitchen  and dinning-room, living room with fireplace, one bedroom with toilet and a  terrace.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Internal stairs lead you to the first floor which consists of  three bedrooms, each with a balcony and a large family bathroom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The  house is surrounded by a cultivated garden full of mediterranean plants and a  palm tree in front of the house, giving much needed shade in high summer.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the right side of the house there is a garage with a terrace on top,  which is a great place to relax.</p>', '', '836_House-Villa_0.jpg', '836_House-Villa_1.jpg', '836_House-Villa_2.jpg', '836_House-Villa_3.jpg', '836_House-Villa_4.jpg', '836_House-Villa_5.jpg', '836_House-Villa_6.jpg', '836_House-Villa_7.jpg', '836_House-Villa_8.jpg'),
(837, '', 'Dalmat i Hormus doo', '', '', '', 'Sibenik', 'Brodarica', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '230', '0', '65', 2, '87500', '', 2, 1, 2, 2, 1, 2, 2, 1, 'August 31, 2014', '<p>Novi apartmani pod imenom &ldquo;Projekt Brodarica&rdquo;, 3 km ju¾no od &Scaron;ibenika.&nbsp;Zgrada je moderne arhitekture, s naglaskom na kvalitetne i trajne materijale. Unutra&scaron;njost objekta èini ukupno 6 dvosobnih apartmana (po dva apartmana na svakom katu) èija povr&scaron;ina iznosi 49m2 + 16m2 balkon. Svaki stan ima vrt povr&scaron;ine 45-50 m2. Do najbli¾e pla¾e ima cca 200m.</p>', '<p>New apartments called the &ldquo;Brodarica Project&rdquo;, 3 km south from Sibenik.&nbsp;Building itself has 6 two-bedroom apartments (two apartments on each flour), and the size of the units is 50m2 + 16m2 balcony. Each apartment has its own part of garden, approx 45-50 m2 each. Distance to the nearest beach is 200m.</p>', '', '<p>Novi apartmani pod imenom &ldquo;Projekt Brodarica&rdquo;, 3 km ju¾no od &Scaron;ibenika. Svi potrebni sadr¾aji kao &scaron;to su trgovaèki centri, pumpne stanice, marina, &scaron;kola, itd., nalaze se u krugu od 5 km, a najbli¾a zraèna luka koja je povezana sa svim va¾nijim Europskim destinacijama locirana je u Ka&scaron;telima (cca 55 km udaljen od &Scaron;ibenika, 35 min vo¾nje automobilom).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Zgrada je moderne arhitekture, s naglaskom na kvalitetne i trajne materijale. Unutra&scaron;njost objekta èini ukupno 6 dvosobnih apartmana (po dva apartmana na svakom katu) èija povr&scaron;ina iznosi 49m2+ 16m2 balkon. Svaki stan ima vrt povr&scaron;ine 45-50 m2. Do najbli¾e pla¾e ima cca 200m.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Gradnja je poèela u veljaèi 2014., a predviðeni rok zavr&scaron;etka radova je koncem 2014. godine.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartmani æe biti prozraèni i puni svjetla (velike staklene povr&scaron;ine) opremljeni sigurnosnim vratima, klimatizacijom s moguæno&scaron;æu grijanja, telefonskim i satelitskim linijama, talijanskom keramikom 1. klase, sobnim parketima od drveta, PVC i aluminijskom stolarijom, dok æe kupaonice biti opremljene tu&scaron; kadama. Moguæa je izrada kuhinje po mjeri (bez elektriènih aparata) kao i ugradbenih ormara u sobama.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Naravno, svakom apartmanu pripada po jedno parkirno mjesto, koje je ukljuèeno u cijenu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na 1.katu imamo dva raspolo¾iva apartmana:</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong><span style="text-decoration: underline;">APARTMAN 3</span></strong> &ndash; 65m2, jugoistoène orijentacije, sastoji se od: dvije spavaæe sobe, kuhinje s dnevnim boravkom, kupaonice, parkinga i cca 50m2 dvori&scaron;ta. <strong><span style="text-decoration: underline;">Cijena: 87.500,00 EUR&nbsp;</span>&nbsp; <span style="color: #ff0000;">PRODANO!</span><span style="text-decoration: underline;"><br /></span></strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong><span style="text-decoration: underline;">APARTMAN 4</span></strong>&ndash; 65m2, jugozapadne orijentacije, sastoji se od: dvije spavaæe sobe, kuhinje s dnevnim boravkom, kupaonice, parkinga i cca 50m2 dvori&scaron;ta. <strong><span style="text-decoration: underline;">Cijena: 87.500,00 EUR</span>&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style="color: #ff0000;"> PRODANO!</span><span style="text-decoration: underline;"><br /></span></strong></p>', '<p>New apartments called the &ldquo;Brodarica Project&rdquo;, 3 km south from Sibenik. All the shopping centers, gas station, hotels, spa&rsquo;s, marina...everything within 5 km radius ! The main Dalmatian Split airport is situated in Kastela, some 55 km away (35 min drive).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Building itself has 6 two-bedroom apartments (two apartments on each flour), and the size of the units is 50m2 +16m2 balcony. Each apartment has a terrace or loggia spacious enough to place the table with four chairs and the and all apartments have their own parts of garden, approx 45-50 m2 each.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Distance to the nearest beach is 200m.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Inner changes are possible if somebody wants to order them during the construction. It is possible to manufacture custom made kitchen (no electrical appliances) as well as built-in wardrobes in the rooms.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Construction started in February 2014. and building is scheduled for completion till the end of 2014.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartment units will have security doors, air conditioning with heating, telephone connections, satellite TV connections, high quality Italian tiles and ceramics, real wood floors, bathroom with a shower cabins, PVC high grade windows, lots of light, sea-view for all the apartments, except for the ground floor.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Of course, each apartment has a parking lot next to the building of minimum 12 m2. Parking lot is included in the price.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>We have two available apartments on the first floor:</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong><span style="text-decoration: underline;">APARTMENT 3</span></strong> &ndash; 65m2, it consists of two bedrooms, kitchen with dining and living room (all in one), bathroom + parking + garden of 50m2. <strong><span style="text-decoration: underline;">Price: 87.500,00 EUR&nbsp;</span>&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style="color: #ff0000;"> SOLD!</span><span style="text-decoration: underline;"><br /></span></strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong><span style="text-decoration: underline;">APARTMENT 4</span></strong> &ndash; 65m2, it consists of two bedrooms, kitchen with dining and living room (all in one), bathroom + parking + garden of 50m2. <strong><span style="text-decoration: underline;">Price: 87.500,00 EUR&nbsp;</span>&nbsp;&nbsp; <span style="color: #ff0000;">SOLD!</span><span style="text-decoration: underline;"><br /></span></strong></p>', '', '837_Apartment_0.jpg', '837_Apartment_1.jpg', '837_Apartment_2.jpg', '837_Apartment_3.jpg', '837_Apartment_4.jpg', '837_Apartment_5.jpg', '837_Apartment_6.jpg', '837_Apartment_7.jpg', '837_Apartment_8.jpg'),
(838, '', 'Dalmat i Hormus', '', '', '', 'Rogoznica', 'Rogoznica', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '10', '0', '85', 2, '190000', '', 2, 2, 2, 1, 1, 2, 2, 2, 'August 31, 2014', '<p>Apartman u samostojeæoj kuæi u Rogoznici, na ekskluzivnoj lokaciji u prvom redu do mora i pla¾e! Ukupna stambena povr&scaron;ina iznosi 85m2, &scaron;to ukljuèuje dvije spavaæe sobe, 2 kupaonice, kuhinju, dnevni boravak, blagovaonicu i veliku terasu s pogledom na more. Apartman je kompletno namje&scaron;ten i prodaje se sa svim namje&scaron;tajem. Udaljenost do mora i pla¾e iznosi svega 10-ak metara, a jedna od svjetski poznatih marina - Marina Frapa nalazi se u neposrednoj blizini apartmana.</p>', '<p>Apartment in a family house in Rogoznica, in an exclusive location next to the sea and the beach! Total living area is 85m2, which includes two bedrooms, two bathrooms, kitchen, living room, dining room and a large terrace overlooking the sea. The apartment is fully furnished and all furniture is included in the price. Proximity to the beach is only 10 meters away, and one of the world famous marina - Marina Frapa is located close to the apartment.</p>', '', '<p>Apartman u samostojeæoj kuæi u Rogoznici, na ekskluzivnoj lokaciji u prvom redu do mora i pla¾e!</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ukupna stambena povr&scaron;ina iznosi 85m2, &scaron;to ukljuèuje dvije spavaæe sobe, 2 kupaonice, kuhinju, dnevni boravak, blagovaonicu i veliku terasu s pogledom na more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartman je kompletno namje&scaron;ten i prodaje se sa svim namje&scaron;tajem. Klima ureðaji su takoðer ukljuèeni u cijenu apartmana.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Jedno parkirno mjesto nalazi se u ograðenom dvori&scaron;tu koje pripada apartmanu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Vlasnik æe raditi kompletnu renovaciju kuæe i nadogradnju kata, te eta¾iranje objekta (gdje æe po zavr&scaron;etku eta¾iranja biti 3 odvojene stambene jedinice).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Planirani rok za useljenje u apartman na prvom katu je 1.2.2015. godine.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Udaljenost do mora i pla¾e iznosi svega 10-ak metara, a jedna od svjetski poznatih marina - Marina Frapa nalazi se u neposrednoj blizini apartmana.</p>', '<p>Apartment in a family house in Rogoznica, in an exclusive location next to the sea and the beach!</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Total living area is 85m2, which includes two bedrooms, two bathrooms, kitchen, living room, dining room and a large terrace overlooking the sea.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The apartment is fully furnished and all furniture is included in the price. Air conditioners are also included in the price.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>One parking space is located in a fenced yard which belongs to the apartment.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Owner will do a complete renovation and upgrading floors (there will be three separate units when the renovation is finished).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Planned deadline for moving into the apartment on the first floor is 01/02/2015.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Proximity to the beach is only 10 meters away, and one of the world famous marina - Marina Frapa is located close to the apartment.</p>', '', '838_Apartment_0.jpg', '838_Apartment_1.jpg', '838_Apartment_2.jpg', '838_Apartment_3.jpg', '838_Apartment_4.jpg', '838_Apartment_5.jpg', '838_Apartment_6.jpg', '838_Apartment_7.jpg', '838_Apartment_8.jpg'),
(839, '', 'Dalmat i Hormus', '', '', '', 'Sibenik', 'Vodice', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '10', '1550', '298', 1, '1150000', '', 2, 2, 2, 1, 1, 2, 10, 5, 'August 31, 2014', '<p>Dvije samostojeæe kuæe smje&scaron;tene u Vodicama u prvom redu do mora i pla¾e! Ukupno se prodaje 5 odvojenih stambenih jedinica (manja kuæa ima 2 apartmana i ukupnu povr&scaron;inu 128m2, a veæa kuæa 3 apartmana i ukupnu povr&scaron;inu od 170m2). Povr&scaron;ina zemlji&scaron;ta na kojoj se nekretnine nalaze iznosi 1550m2, a sve je ureðivano, kultivirano i odr¾avano tokom cijele godine.</p>', '<p>Two detached houses located in Vodice in the first row to the sea! There are 5 separate residential units (smaller house has two apartments, and a total area 128m2, and larger house has three apartments and a total area of 170m2). Land area is 1550m2, cultivated and maintained throughout the year. The nearest beach is only 10 meters away.</p>', '', '<p>Dvije samostojeæe kuæe smje&scaron;tene u Vodicama u prvom redu do mora i pla¾e!</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ukupno se prodaje 5 odvojenih stambenih jedinica (manja kuæa ima 2 apartmana i ukupnu povr&scaron;inu 128m2, a veæa kuæa 3 apartmana i ukupnu povr&scaron;inu od 170m2).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Povr&scaron;ina zemlji&scaron;ta na kojoj se nekretnine nalaze iznosi 1550m2, a sve je ureðivano, kultivirano i odr¾avano tokom cijele godine.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U prizemlju manje kuæe (128m2) nalazi se dvosoban apartman povr&scaron;ine 64m2 i sastoji se od: kuhinje, dnevnog boravka, blagovaonice, 2 spavaæe sobe, kupaonice i velike terase s pogledom na more. Unutra&scaron;nje stepeni&scaron;te vodi na kat gdje se nalazi apartman identiène stambene pov&scaron;ine (64m2) kao i rasporeda.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Veæa kuæa (170m2) sastoji se od 3 odvojena apartmana - u prizemlju je stan od 90m2, dok su na katu 2 stana pov&scaron;ine 50m2 i 30m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Stan povr&scaron;ine 90m2 sastoji se od 3 spavaæe sobe, kuhinje, dnevnog boravka s blagovaonicom, kupaonice i hodnika te terase s pogledom na more.&nbsp;Vanjsko stepeni&scaron;te vodi na kat gdje su se smjestila 2 stana (jedan dvosobni i jedan jednosobni).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Svi apartmani su kompletno opremljeni i klimatizirani, a objekt je kategoriziran za iznajmljivanje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Postoji dovoljan broj parkirnih mjesta obzirom na velièinu okuænice, a pristup kuæama moguæ je sa dvije strane.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U sklopu se nalazi i vanjski tu&scaron; i ro&scaron;tilj.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Udaljenost do prve pla¾e iznosi svega 10-ak metara.</p>', '<p>Two detached houses located in Vodice in the first row to the sea!</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There are 5 separate residential units (smaller house has two apartments, and a total area 128m2, and larger house has three apartments and a total area of 170m2). Land area is 1550m2, cultivated and maintained throughout the year.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the ground floor of the house (128m2) there is a two bedroom apartment of 64m2 and consists of a kitchen, living room, dining room, two bedrooms, bathroom and a large terrace overlooking the sea. Interior stairs lead to the first floor where there is an apartment with identical living area (64m2) and schedule as the apartment on the ground floor.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The larger house (170m2) consists of three separate apartments - on the ground floor an apartment of 90m2, while the first floor has two apartments (50m2 and 30m2).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The apartment of 90m2 consisting of 3 bedrooms, kitchen, living room, dining room, hallway, bathroom and a terrace overlooking the sea.&nbsp;External staircase leads to the first floor where there are two apartments (one double and one single bedroom, 50m2 and 30m2).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>All apartments are fully equiped and air conditioned, and the hous is categorized for renting.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There are a sufficient number of parking spaces due to the size of the yard, and access to houses is possible from two sides.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The nearest beach is only 10 meters away.</p>', '', '839_House-Villa_0.jpg', '839_House-Villa_1.jpg', '839_House-Villa_2.jpg', '839_House-Villa_3.jpg', '839_House-Villa_4.jpg', '839_House-Villa_5.jpg', '839_House-Villa_6.jpg', '839_House-Villa_7.jpg', '839_House-Villa_8.jpg'),
(840, '', 'Dalmat i Hormus doo', '', '', '', 'Sibenik', 'Tribunj', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '70', '289', '180', 2, '250000', '', 2, 2, 2, 1, 1, 2, 2, 2, 'August 31, 2014', '<p>Prodaje se lijepa obiteljska kuæa u Tribunju na odliènoj lokaciji. Sastoji se od prizemlja, kata i potkrovlja.&nbsp;Kuæa se nalazi u prvom redu do mora, s prekrasnim pogledom na staro mjesto i more.&nbsp;Svi potrebni sadr¾aji su u blizini kuæe (trgovine, ambulanta, marina, javni paking, pla¾e...).</p>', '<p>Beautiful family house in Tribunj, in an excellent location! The house is located in the first row from the sea, with an excellent view on the old city and the sea. It&nbsp;consists of a ground floor, first floor and attic. All necessary facilities are close to the house (shopping, health care services, the marina, a public parking lot, beaches..).</p>', '', '<p>Prodaje se lijepa obiteljska kuæa u Tribunju na odliènoj lokaciji.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sastoji se od prizemlja, kata i potkrovlja. U dvori&scaron;tu je smje&scaron;ten ro&scaron;tilj.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Svi potrebni sadr¾aji su u blizini kuæe (trgovine, ambulanta, marina, javni paking, pla¾e...).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa se nalazi u prvom redu do mora, s prekrasnim pogledom na staro mjesto i more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U prizemlju kuæe je predsoblje, spremi&scaron;te, gostinjska soba, kupaonica, te kuhinja i blagovaonica.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U sklopu blagovaonice je i kamin. Unutarnje stubi&scaron;te vodi na kat, gdje se nalazi glavna spavaæa soba s kupaonicom, te dnevni boravak iz kojeg se izlazi na veliku terasu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U dnevnom boravku su velike staklene stijene, visoki strop s galerijskim prostorom koji se mo¾e koristiti kao spavaæa ili radna soba.</p>', '<p>Beautiful family house in Tribunj, in an excellent location!</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house consists of a ground floor, first floor and attic. There is a barbeque in the courtyard.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>All necessary facilities are close to the house (shopping, health care services, the marina, a public parking lot, beaches..).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house is located in the first row from the sea, with an excellent view on the old city and the sea.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the ground floor of the house there is a hallway, storage room, guest room, washroom, and kitchen with dining room. The dining room also has a fireplace.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The internal staircase leads to the upper floor where there is a master bedroom with washroom, a living room which leads to the terrace.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>In the living room there are large glass walls, a high ceiling with space for a gallery which can be used as a bedroom or a study.</p>', '', '840_House-Villa_0.jpg', '840_House-Villa_1.jpg', '840_House-Villa_2.jpg', '840_House-Villa_3.jpg', '840_House-Villa_4.jpg', '840_House-Villa_5.jpg', '840_House-Villa_6.jpg', '840_House-Villa_7.jpg', '840_House-Villa_8.jpg'),
(841, 'Boris', 'Tomiæ (Trevor)', '', '', '', 'Brac', 'Splitska', 'For sale', 'Land plot', '10', '590', '0', 2, '350000', '', 2, 2, 2, 1, 1, 2, 0, 0, 'September 1, 2014', '<p>Graðevinsko zemlji&scaron;te povr&scaron;ine 590 m2 u prvom redu do mora, smje&scaron;teno na sjevernoj strani otoka Braèa, svega 15-ak minuta udaljeno od Supetra.&nbsp;Zemlji&scaron;te se nalazi na samom moru s direktnim izlazom na pla¾u, te je u potpunosti ograðeno.&nbsp;Zemlji&scaron;te ima i pravomoænu graðevinsku dozvolu za&nbsp;gradnju vile s gara¾om i bazenom.</p>', '<p>Building plot with a valid building permit for luxury villa, on sea front! We are pleased to offer this rare opportunity which is situated on the northern side of Brac island, 15 minute''s from Supetar, the ferry terminal and largest town on the island. It is probably the last remaining available plot along this part of the coast. The plot is 590m sq and the architect design includes a villa suitable for a large family, a garage and a swimming pool.</p>', '', '<p>Graðevinsko zemlji&scaron;te povr&scaron;ine 590 m2 u prvom redu do mora, smje&scaron;teno na sjevernoj strani otoka Braèa, svega 15-ak minuta udaljeno od Supetra.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Zemlji&scaron;te se nalazi na samom moru s direktnim izlazom na pla¾u, te je u potpunosti ograðeno. Svi prikljuèci su u neposrednoj blizini.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Zemlji&scaron;te ima i pravomoænu graðevinsku dozvolu, &scaron;to znaèi da novi vlasnik odmah mo¾e zapoèeti s gradnjom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Graðevinska dozvola dozvoljava gradnju vile tlocrtne povr&scaron;ine 156 m2 s gara¾om povr&scaron;ine 27 m2 i bazenom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Vila mo¾e imati prizemlje, kat i potkrovlje, a ukupna brutto razvijena povr&scaron;ina kuæe s gara¾om iznosi 373 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ovo je jedna od posljednjih neizgraðenih graðevinskih parcela na ovom dijelu Braèa, &scaron;to ovu parcelu èini izuzetno atraktivnom!</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za eventualna pitanja, stojimo Vam na usluzi.</p>', '<p>Building plot with a valid building permit for luxury villa, on sea front!</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>We are pleased to offer this  rare opportunity which is situated on the northern side of Brac island, 15  minute''s from Supetar, the ferry terminal and largest town on the island.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It  is probably the last remaining available plot along this part of the coast, and  the land has been fenced off, with all necessary services nearby, ready for an  immediate start.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The plot is 590m sq and the architect design includes a  villa suitable for a large family, a garage and a swimming pool.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The  residential ''footprint'' is 156m sq and the garage 27m sq. The design is for a  ground, first and second floor, with a total of 373m sq.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The sea is at the  bottom of the garden, and the beach here is beautiful for swimming, with clear  water and slight tides.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact our office if you are serious about  being involved in this building project.</p>', '', '841_Land-plot_0.jpg', '841_Land-plot_1.jpg', '841_Land-plot_2.jpg', '', '', '', '', '', '');
INSERT INTO `nekretnina` (`id`, `ime`, `prezime`, `telefon`, `mobitel`, `e_mail`, `lokacija_id`, `adresa`, `status_id`, `vrsta_id`, `udaljenost`, `povrsina`, `stambenapovrsina`, `display`, `cijena`, `cijenatocka`, `ponuda_tjedna`, `new_built`, `must_sell`, `prvi_red_do_mora`, `pogled_na_more`, `bazen`, `broj_soba`, `broj_kupatila`, `datum`, `title_hr`, `title_en`, `title_ge`, `opis_hr`, `opis_en`, `opis_ge`, `PropertyImageURL0`, `PropertyImageURL1`, `PropertyImageURL2`, `PropertyImageURL3`, `PropertyImageURL4`, `PropertyImageURL5`, `PropertyImageURL6`, `PropertyImageURL7`, `PropertyImageURL8`) VALUES
(842, '', 'Marco Polo', '', '', '', 'Korcula', 'Tankaraca, Vela Luka', 'For sale', 'Land plot', '10', '5227', '0', 1, '889000', '', 2, 2, 2, 1, 1, 2, 0, 0, 'September 1, 2014', '<p>U predivnoj, mirnoj uvali na sjevernoj strani otoka Korèule na prodaju je velika èestica unutar graðevinske zone. Ukupna povr&scaron;ina èestice je 5227m2, a prostire se skroz od dna uvale prema unutra&scaron;njosti. Na parceli se nalazi i stara kamena ribarska kuæica, na samo par koraka od predivne pla¾e. Ima direktni kolni prilaz i struju dovedenu do parcele.</p>', '<p>We are offering one of the largest seafront building land plots on the island of Korcula. The land plot of 5.227 m2 is located on the beautiful, quiet north-coast bay near Vela Luka. The front of the property borders the sea for approx. 20 meters. There is direct road access and the electrical service is already on the property border. There is also an old-stone fisherman&rsquo;s house. It&rsquo;s quite charming but needs renovation.</p>', '', '<p>U predivnoj, mirnoj uvali na sjevernoj strani otoka Korèule na prodaju je velika èestica unutar graðevinske zone.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ukupna povr&scaron;ina èestice je 5227m2, a prostire se skroz od dna uvale prema unutra&scaron;njosti.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na parceli se nalazi i stara kamena ribarska kuæica, na samo par koraka od predivne pla¾e.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ima direktni kolni prilaz i struju dovedenu do parcele.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Vlasnièki papiri uredni.</p>', '<p>We are offering one of the largest seafront building land plots on the island of Korcula.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The land plot of 5.227 m2 is located on the beautiful, quiet north-coast bay near Vela Luka.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The front of the property borders the sea for approx. 20 meters.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There is direct road access and the electrical service is already on the property border.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There is also an old-stone fisherman&rsquo;s house. It&rsquo;s quite charming but needs renovation.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>This building land is the perfect place to build your year-round dream house.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact us for more details.</p>', '', '842_Land-plot_0.jpg', '842_Land-plot_1.jpg', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(1156, 'Tomislav', 'Guduljeviæ', '', '091 6608220', '', 'Rogoznica', 'Ra¾anj, Kalebova luka', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '10', '1600', '400', 1, '1650000', '', 2, 1, 2, 1, 1, 1, 3, 3, 'April 30, 2015', '<p>Luksuzna novoizgraðena vila s bazenom nalazi se u prvom redu do mora u prekrasnoj mirnoj uvali. Ispred vile je ureðena pla¾a. Vila je izgraðena u minimalistièkom stilu, vrlo visoke kvalitete, s luksuzno ureðenim interijerom. Na parceli povr&scaron;ine 1 600 m2, nalazi se vila stambene povr&scaron;ine 400 m2. Parcela je u potpunosti kultivirana, ureðena mediteranskim biljem i poploèana kamenom. Vila se sastoji od prizemlja, prvog i drugog kata.</p>', '<p>We are pleased to offer this superb luxury villa with swimming pool located in the first row to the sea in beautiful quiet bay.&nbsp;It is situated just a few yards from the well maintained shore, 3 km down the coast from the nearest small village where there are shops, cafes, bakery and other useful services and facilities. The plot is 1600 m2 and the villa has 400 m2 of internal living space. The villa consists of three floors: ground floor, first floor and second floor.&nbsp;</p>', '', '<p>Luksuzna novoizgraðena vila s bazenom nalazi se u prvom redu do mora u prekrasnoj mirnoj uvali.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ispred vile je ureðena pla¾a.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Vila je izgraðena u minimalistièkom stilu, vrlo visoke kvalitete, s luksuzno ureðenim interijerom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na parceli povr&scaron;ine 1 600 m2, nalazi se vila stambene povr&scaron;ine 400 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Parcela je u potpunosti kultivirana, ureðena mediteranskim biljem i poploèana kamenom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Vila se sastoji od prizemlja, prvog i drugog kata.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U prizemlju je prostrana gara¾a za pet automobila.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na prvom katu je prostrani dnevni boravak s luksuzno ureðenom kuhinjom, wc te spavaæa soba s vlastitom kupaonicom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sve prostorije imaju izlaz na prostranu natkrivenu terasu s prostorom za komin.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Stepenice od terase vode do bazena.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Postoji i moguænost grijanja vode u bazenu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Prekrasan pogled na more pru¾a se iz bilo kojeg kutka ove vile.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na katu su dvije spavaæe sobe, svaka s vlastitom kupaonicom, s tim da jedna ima i veliku garderobu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Svaka soba ima izlaz na vlastitu terasu s koje se pru¾a prekrasan panoramski pogled na more i uvalu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Vila ima svu potrebnu infrastrukturu, a izgraðena je od vrlo kvalitetnih materijala koji zadovoljavaju sve potrebne standarde gradnje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Cijela vila je klimatizirana, ima ugraðeno podno grijanje, solarni sustav za grijanje vode, protuprovalna vrata, videonadzor te rolete na elektrièni pogon.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>S obzirom na velièinu parcele, u drugom redu moguæe je izgraditi jo&scaron; jednu vilu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Od malog ribarskog mjesta vila je udaljena svega 3 km, kao i od restorana i trgovina.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Aerodrom je udaljen 25 km.</p>', '<p>We are pleased to offer this superb luxury villa with swimming pool located in the first row to the sea in beautiful quiet bay.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is situated just a few yards from the well maintained shore, 3 km down the coast from the nearest small village where there are shops, cafes, bakery and other useful services and facilities.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The villa is built in a minimalist style, very high quality, with a luxurious interior.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The plot is 1600 m2 and the villa has 400 m2 of internal living space.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The plot has been landscaped and is entirely cultivated with suitable Mediterranean plants among the stone-paved terraces and paths.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The villa consists of three floors: ground floor, first floor and second floor.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the ground floor is a spacious garage which can accommodate five cars.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the first floor is a spacious living room with luxury fitted kitchen, toilet, bedroom with private bathroom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>From all the rooms there is access to the spacious covered terrace where there is a bbq/fireplace.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>From the terrace there are stairs leading down to the swimming pool and sunbathing area around.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There is also the possibility of heating water in the pool.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Everywhere on the terrace has views overlooking the sea and shores.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Upstairs are two bedrooms each with their own private bathroom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The master bedroom also has a large walk-in closet.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Each room opens to a private balconies offering a breathtaking panoramic view.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The villa has all the necessary infrastructure and is built with high quality materials and fittings that meet all required standards of construction.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The whole villa is air conditioned, has underfloor heating, solar water heating systems, security doors, video surveillance, shutters electric drive.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Given the size of the plot it would be possible to build another villa behind this property.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The airport is 25 km away.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact the office to see the full portfolio of photographs and to arrange to visit this property.&nbsp;</p>', '', '1156_House-Villa_0.jpg', '1156_House-Villa_1.jpg', '1156_House-Villa_2.jpg', '1156_House-Villa_3.jpg', '1156_House-Villa_4.jpg', '1156_House-Villa_5.jpg', '1156_House-Villa_6.jpg', '1156_House-Villa_7.jpg', '1156_House-Villa_8.jpg'),
(844, 'Mick', 'Connor', '', '', 'chrisaconnor@me.com', 'Hvar', 'Vrbanj, Hvar', 'For sale', 'Old stone house', '3000', '253', '144', 2, '530000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 1, 4, 4, 'September 7, 2014', '<p>NOVA SNI®ENA CIJENA!</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kamena renovirana kuæa sa velikim poploèanim dvori&scaron;tem i bazenom, s&nbsp;pogledom na more! Nalazi se na rubu autohtonog sela na sjevernoj strani otoka Hvara, od mora udaljena 3 km. Kuæa ima ukupnu stambenu povr&scaron;inu 144 m2, povr&scaron;ina parcele je 253 m2. Kuæa se sastoji od sklopa kamenih kuæa, tj. tri kuæe koje su ukomponirane u jedan objekt sa prekrasnim terasama, zelenilom, vinovom lozom i bazenom koji nudi jedan poseban ugoðaj.</p>', '<p>NEW REDUCED PRICE!!</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Beautifully restored group of old stone built cottages, with a swimming pool, and with great views, to create one beautiful house. It is situated 3 k from either coast, elevated by the geography of the location to give long views over the fields and woods nearby. The house has a total living area of 144 m2, and is situated on a land plot of 253 m2.</p>', '', '<p>Kamena renovirana kuæa sa velikim poploèanim dvori&scaron;tem i bazenom, s&nbsp;pogledom na more!</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nalazi se na rubu autohtonog sela na sjevernoj strani  otoka Hvara, od mora udaljena 3 km.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa ima ukupnu stambenu povr&scaron;inu  144 m2, povr&scaron;ina parcele je 253 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa se sastoji od sklopa kamenih  kuæa, tj. tri kuæe koje su ukomponirane u jedan objekt sa prekrasnim terasama, zelenilom, vinovom lozom i bazenom koji nudi jedan poseban  ugoðaj.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa ima lijepi pogled na more.</p>', '<p>Beautifully restored group of old stone built cottages, with a swimming pool, and with great views, to create one beautiful house.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is  situated 3 k from either coast, elevated by the geography of the location to  give long views over the fields and woods nearby.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property for sale  consists of 3 old animal houses converted to holiday cottages and one main house over three  floors.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house has a total living area of 144 m2, and is  situated on a land plot of 253 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The design also includes terraces,  trailing vines, and the swimming pool which offers a special and luxurious  atmosphere.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The modernisation has been completed to a high standard, at  great expense, with top quality fittings and the decorating has been done to give the house a wonderful spacious and comfortable feel. Part of the furniture is included in the sale.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The local village has small shops, and bars,  despite being off the normal route of tourists who stick to the coast, and  the nearest larger village is not far away (3k).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>An interesting point  to note, is that the new sea plane service to Hvar from the mainland (Near  the airport in Split) stops quite close to this property so a short taxi  route from the port could see you at the front door of the property within  half an hour of your plane arriving at Split airport!</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact  our office for more information.</p>', '', '844_Old-stone-house_0.jpg', '844_Old-stone-house_1.jpg', '844_Old-stone-house_2.jpg', '844_Old-stone-house_3.jpg', '844_Old-stone-house_4.jpg', '844_Old-stone-house_5.jpg', '844_Old-stone-house_6.jpg', '844_Old-stone-house_7.jpg', '844_Old-stone-house_8.jpg'),
(845, 'Betty', 'Pierre', '0033662657849', '0033685426113', 'pearlnorma@gmail.com', 'Trogir', 'Slatine, Bana Jelaèiæa 44, 1530/1, 910/4, zu.1897 ', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '5', '945', '230', 1, '1500000', '', 2, 2, 2, 1, 1, 1, 5, 7, 'September 7, 2014', '<p>Prostrana kuæa na prekrasnoj lokaciji u 1.redu uz samo more i pje&scaron;èanu pla¾u. Kuæa je smje&scaron;tena na zemlji&scaron;tu ukupne povr&scaron;ine 945 m2 dok stambena povr&scaron;ina iznosi 230 m2 + 2 velike podzemne gara¾e od kojih je jedna za brod sa direktnim izlazom u more. U dvori&scaron;tu se nalazi prostrana terasa sa manjim bazenom dok je zapoèeta izgradnja veæeg bazena.</p>', '<p>Spacious house in a beautiful location in the 1st row by the sea and the pebble beach. The house is situated on a land total area of &#8203;&#8203;945 m2, while the living area is 230 m2 + 2 large underground garage of which is to ship with direct access to the sea. The yard is a spacious terrace with a small swimming pool while started building a larger pool.</p>', '', '<p>Prostrana kuæa na prekrasnoj lokaciji u 1.redu uz samo more i pje&scaron;èanu pla¾u.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Iz cijele kuæe pru¾a se pogled na more i grad Split koji je sa ovim mjestom povezan ljetnom brodskom linijom, te putovanje traje svega 20 min.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je smje&scaron;tena na zemlji&scaron;tu ukupne povr&scaron;ine 945 m2 dok stambena povr&scaron;ina iznosi 230 m2 + 2 velike podzemne gara¾e od kojih je jedna za brod sa direktnim izlazom u more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U suterenu se nalaze 2 gara¾e i 3 manje prostorije.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na 1.katu se nalazi prostrani dnevni boravak + kuhinja + blagovaonica, manja kuhinja i wc.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na 2. katu, koji je sa 1.katom povezan stepenicama na dva mjesta, sastoji se od hodnika, 4 spavaæe sobe sa vlastitim kupaonicama i terasama sa pogledom na more, 1 manje spavaæe sobe sa balkonom, 2 wc-a i garderobe.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na svakom katu nalazi se po 1 klimatizacijski ureðaj, dok je u spavaæim sobama instalirana stropna ventilacija.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa takoðer ima i solarno grijanje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U dvori&scaron;tu se nalazi prostrana terasa sa manjim bazenom dok je zapoèeta izgradnja veæeg bazena.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ispred kuæe nalazi se vanjski parking za 3 automobila.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ovo je izuzetna prilika ¾elite li vlastitu oazu mira uz samo more sa prekrasnim pogledom i veæ potpuno zavr&scaron;enu kuæu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>***U 2.redu od mora, iznad kuæe nalazi se zemlji&scaron;te koje je takoðer na prodaji. Povr&scaron;ina iznosi 780 m2, dok je cijena 500.000 Eura</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za sve dodatne informacije stojimo vam na raspolaganju.</p>', '<p>Spacious house in a beautiful location in the 1st row by the sea and the pebble  beach.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>From the whole house overlooks the sea and the city of Split,  which is associated with this place summer ferry lines, and the trip takes only  20 minutes.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house is situated on a land total area of &#8203;&#8203;945 m2, while  the living area is 230 m2 + 2 large underground garage of which is to ship with  direct access to the sea.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>In the basement there are two garages and three  smaller rooms.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the 1st floor there is a spacious living room + kitchen  + dining room, small kitchen and bathroom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the second floor, which is  associated with the 1st floor stairs in two places, consists of hallway, four  bedrooms with private bathrooms and terraces overlooking the sea, 1 small  bedroom with balcony, 2 toilets and cloakrooms.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On each floor there is  one air conditioning, while the bedrooms installed ceiling ventilation.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The  house also has solar heating.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The yard is a spacious terrace with a small  swimming pool while started building a larger pool.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house has outdoor  parking for 3 cars.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>This is a great opportunity if you want to own an  oasis of tranquility by the sea with stunning views and is already fully  completed house.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>*** The 2nd row from the sea, above the house is a land  that is also on sale.&nbsp;The area is 780 m2, price is of Euro 00,000.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Trogir is 10 mins drive.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For  further information we are at your disposal.</p>', '', '845_House-Villa_0.jpg', '845_House-Villa_1.jpg', '845_House-Villa_2.jpg', '845_House-Villa_3.jpg', '845_House-Villa_4.jpg', '845_House-Villa_5.jpg', '845_House-Villa_6.jpg', '845_House-Villa_7.jpg', '845_House-Villa_8.jpg'),
(846, 'Gordana', 'Muslim', '021/ 493 495, 095/ 853 7018', '', 'tanjamuslim@gmail.com', 'Trogir', 'Drvenik mali, Doliæi, 39/1 kuæa, 39/2 kuæica, 39/3 dvori¹te, 40/1 sru¹ena kuæa, 591/2 oranica', 'For sale', 'Old stone house', '300', '110', '50', 2, '33000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 0, 'September 7, 2014', '<p>Nekretnina se nalazi na otoku Drvenik Mali i sastoji se od dvije cjeline. Dvije kamene kuæe sa dvori&scaron;tem (1. cjelina) i malo udaljena sru&scaron;ena kuæica sa livadom (2. cjelina). Otok je povezan sa kopnom sa trajektnom linijom koja je udaljena 15 min. hodanja od kuæe.</p>\r\n<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;">CIJENA SNI®ENA S &euro;42.000 NA &euro;33.000!</span></p>', '<p>We are offering this superb building and renovation project on the island of Drvenik Mali. It is 5 minutes walk to the beach. The sale consists of 2 small cottages, around a court yard, and a demolished house which can be rebuilt, in an adjoining plot. The island is rarely visited by tourists, and is utterly charming, and completely practical. It has regular ferry visits to the local harbour, which is only 15 minutes walk from the property, shops, bars etc.</p>\r\n<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;">PRICE REDUCED FROM 42.000 EURO TO 33.000 EURO!</span></p>', '', '<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;"><strong>CIJENA SNI®ENA S &euro;42.000 NA &euro;33.000!</strong></span></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nekretnina se nalazi na otoku Drvenik Mali i sastoji se od dvije cjeline. Dvije kamene kuæe sa dvori&scaron;tem (1. cjelina) i malo udaljena sru&scaron;ena kuæica sa livadom (2. cjelina).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Prva cjelina:</p>\r\n<p>Veæa kuæa ima 34m2 potkrovlje s obnovljenim kupama. Ulaganjem u potkrovlje dobilo bi se cca 20m2 i pogled na more! U dvori&scaron;tu 18m2 ima jo&scaron; jedna mala samostojeæa kuæica 16m2 koja se sada koristi kao kuhinja. Krov je takoðer u dobrom stanju. Strujne instalacije su razvedene do utiènica u obe kuæe. Nad dvori&scaron;tem su postavljeni ¾eljezni nosaèi za tendu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Druga cjelina:</p>\r\n<p>Izvan dvori&scaron;ta, 10m ni¾e od navedenih kuæa nalazi se sru&scaron;ena kuæica 11m2 sa livadom 20m2. Na ovom mjestu planirana je septièka jama i apartman 11m2. Druga cjelina povezana je putem sa prvom cjelinom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Obe kuæe trenutno imaju spremnik za vodu i mali vanjski wc.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na otoku ima struje, te je sagraðen vodospremnik sa hidrantskom mre¾om. Jedan hidrant se nalazi u blizini kuæa.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Cijeli otok se laganom &scaron;etnjom mo¾e obiæi za dva sata. Na zapadnoj strani otoka obala je oblo¾ena prirodnim kamenim ploèama sa pliæakom te je idealna za one koji ¾ele mir i osamu na pla¾i. Od kuæa do te pla¾e mo¾e se doæi pje&scaron;ice za cca 5-10min. Na ju¾noj strani otoka nalazi se pje&scaron;æana pla¾a i apartmansko naselje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Otok je povezan sa kopnom sa trajektnom linijom koja je udaljena 15 min. hodanja od kuæe.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za sve dodatne informacije stojimo vam na raspolaganju.</p>', '<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;"><strong>PRICE REDUCED FROM 42.000 EURO TO 33.000 EURO!</strong></span></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>We are offering this superb building and renovation project on the island of Drvenik Mali.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>This property is situated on one of the smaller inhabited islands, off the shore of Trogir, easy to walk around in 2 hours, but with regular ferries from the mainland. ( <a href="http://www.trogironline.com/locations/drvenik.html" target="_blank">http://www.trogironline.com/locations/drvenik.html</a> ).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is 5 minutes walk to the beach.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The sale consists of 2 small cottages, around a court yard, and a demolished house which can be rebuilt, in an adjoining plot.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The larger of the houses is 34m sq, and building work could expand this by 20m sq. The court yard is 20m sq and the smaller cottage is 16m sq. This is currently being used as the kitchen to the main part.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The second part of the property &nbsp;is just in front of the yard, and it is a patch of land that used to have the small house that was demolished.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The island has water and electricity, but the water pipe does not connect to the house, as yet.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The island is rarely visited by tourists, and is utterly charming, and completely practical. It has regular ferry visits to the local harbour, which is only 15 minutes walk from the property, shops, bars etc, attractive beaches and historic family owned olive groves dominating the centre of the island.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact the office for more information.</p>', '', '846_Old-stone-house_0.jpg', '846_Old-stone-house_1.jpg', '846_Old-stone-house_2.jpg', '846_Old-stone-house_3.jpg', '846_Old-stone-house_4.jpg', '846_Old-stone-house_5.jpg', '846_Old-stone-house_6.jpg', '846_Old-stone-house_7.jpg', ''),
(847, 'Stefani', 'Kupre¹anin', '092/1822070', '0049 15233 673 154', '', 'Trogir', 'Osoje, odma ispod po¹te, 2113/77', 'For sale', 'Land plot', '40', '400', '0', 1, '100000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 0, 0, 'September 7, 2014', '<p>Graðevinsko zemlji&scaron;te u 2.redu od mora, udaljeno svega 40 m od prekrasne prirodno kamenite pla¾e. Smje&scaron;teno je u malom turistièkom mjestu na zapadnoj strani otoka Èiova, udaljeno 15 min. od povijesnog grada Trogira. Zemlji&scaron;te je sjeverne orjentacije, te bi se sa gornjih eta¾a pru¾ao prekrasan pogled na more.</p>', '<p>We are offering this building plot in the 2nd row of houses from the sea, only 40 m from the beautiful natural rocky beaches. It is situated in a small village on the western side of the island Ciovo, 15 min. from the historic town of Trogir. The land has a northern orientation, and the upper floors will have breathtaking views across the sea.</p>', '', '<p>Graðevinsko zemlji&scaron;te u 2.redu od mora, udaljeno svega 40 m od prekrasne prirodno kamenite pla¾e.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Smje&scaron;teno je u malom turistièkom mjestu na zapadnoj strani otoka Èiova, udaljeno 15 min. od povijesnog grada Trogira, dok je meðunarodni aerodrom udaljen 20 min. vo¾nje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Zemlji&scaron;te je sjeverne orjentacije, te bi se sa gornjih eta¾a pru¾ao prekrasan pogled na more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ima direktan pristup automobilom, dok se sva infrastruktura nalazi odmah do zemlji&scaron;ta.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U blizini se nalazi pje&scaron;èana pla¾a i &scaron;uma idealna za &scaron;etnju i rekreaciju.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ovo je izuzetna prilika ¾elite li izgraditi nekretninu po vlastitoj ¾elji na podruèju gdje gotovo pa i nema slobodno graðevinskog zemlji&scaron;ta.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U blizini se nalazi trgovina, kafiæ i restoran, dok su svi ostali sadr¾aji u susjednom mjestu koje je udaljeno 10 min. vo¾nje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za sve dodatne informacije slobodno nas kontaktirajte.</p>', '<p>We are offering this building plot in the 2nd row of houses from the sea, only  40 m from the beautiful natural rocky beaches.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is situated in a small  village on the western side of the island Ciovo, 15 min. from the historic town  of Trogir, while the international airport is 20 minutes driving.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The land  has a northern orientation, and the upper floors will have breathtaking views  across the sea.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It has direct access by car, and all the necessary  infrastructure (water, electric etc) is located next to the plot.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nearby is  a sandy beach and forest, ideal for walking and recreation, and the other  direction goes to the centre of the village with several shops, bars  etc.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There are many more options, and some of the best restaurants in the  area, just 15 minutes driving, in Trogir.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The airport is 20 minutes from  here.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>This is a great opportunity if you want to build your own villa, to  your own design, from the ground up, as there are very few opportunities  left.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For additional information, please contact us.</p>', '', '847_Land-plot_0.jpg', '847_Land-plot_1.jpg', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(848, 'Matko', 'Vojkoviæ', '', '0913343535', 'matko.vojkovic@gmail.com', 'Vis', 'Rukavac 17, Vis, 2467/24, 2467/27 k.o. Vis', 'For sale', 'Land plot', '350', '650', '0', 2, '65000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 0, 0, 'September 7, 2014', '<p>Graðevinsko zemlji&scaron;te na otoku Visu, sa prekrasnim pogledom na more, udaljeno od mora i pla¾e cca. 350 m. Smje&scaron;teno je u malom mjestu na ju¾noj strani otoka. Pristupni put je odmah do zemlji&scaron;ta, dok se sva infrastruktura nalazi u blizini.</p>', '<p>Building land on the island of Vis, 650 m sq size, with a beautiful view of the sea, away from the beach approx. 350 m. It is situated in a small village on the south side of the island. The ferry port is 10 km away from the property. The access road is right next to the land, while all the infrastructure is nearby.</p>', '', '<p>Graðevinsko zemlji&scaron;te na otoku Visu, sa prekrasnim pogledom na more, udaljeno od mora i pla¾e cca. 350 m.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Smje&scaron;teno je u malom mjestu na ju¾noj strani otoka.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Trajektno pristani&scaron;te je udaljeno 10 km od zemlji&scaron;ta.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Pristupni put je odmah do zemlji&scaron;ta, dok se sva infrastruktura nalazi u blizini.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Cijeli otok prepun je skrivenih uvala i prekrasnih pla¾a, stoga je ovo izuzetna prilika ¾elite li izgraditi vlastitu nekretninu gdje je privatnost zagarantirana.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Trajektnom linijom povezan je sa gradom Splitom i ostalim otocima.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Meðunarodni aerodrom od Splita je udaljen cca. 40 min.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za sve dodatne informacije slobodno nas kontaktirajte.</p>', '<p>Building land on the island of Vis, 650 m sq size, with a beautiful view of the  sea, away from the beach approx. 350 m.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is situated in a small village  on the south side of the island.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The ferry port is 10 km away from the  property.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The access road is right next to the land, while all the  infrastructure is nearby.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The whole island is full of hidden coves and  beautiful beaches, so this is an excellent opportunity if you want to build your  own property where privacy is guaranteed.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Connected by ferry from Split  and the other islands.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The international airport of Split is located approx.  40 min.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For additional information, please contact us.</p>', '', '848_Land-plot_0.jpg', '848_Land-plot_1.jpg', '848_Land-plot_2.jpg', '848_Land-plot_3.jpg', '848_Land-plot_4.jpg', '848_Land-plot_5.jpg', '', '', ''),
(849, 'George', 'Vukadin', 'George &#8211; 095/ 5051 376', 'Supruga &#8211; 098/ 954 7865', '', 'Trogir', 'Seget Donji, Put Jakova Rotonde 24, Kat.1989     793/4 ZGR, 3122/2, 3122/7', 'For sale', 'Old stone house', '1000', '579', '165', 2, '140000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 5, 2, 'September 7, 2014', '<p>Stara kamena kuæa sa odliènim turistièkim potencijalom, u mirnom okru¾enju smje&scaron;tena nekoliko minuta vo¾nje zapadno od povijesnog grada Trogira. Kuæi je potrebno renoviranje, te se mo¾e pretvoriti u prekrasnu kuæu za odmor ali i za svrhu turistièkog iznajmljivanja. Smje&scaron;tena je na zemlji&scaron;tu ukupne povr&scaron;ine 579 m2 koje je dovoljno prostrano za izgradnju bazena. Iz dvori&scaron;ta se pru¾a djelomièan pogled na more.</p>', '<p>Old stone house in need of modernisation and renovation, in a quiet environment, situated a few minutes drive west of the historic town of Trogir. The house is in need of renovation, and can easily be converted into a beautiful home. It has a total land area of 579 m2, which would be big enough to include a swimming pool while renovation work was being carried out. The total living area is 165 m2.</p>', '', '<p>Stara kamena kuæa sa odliènim turistièkim potencijalom, u mirnom okru¾enju smje&scaron;tena nekoliko minuta vo¾nje zapadno od povijesnog grada Trogira.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæi je potrebno renoviranje, te se mo¾e pretvoriti u prekrasnu kuæu za odmor ali i za svrhu turistièkog iznajmljivanja.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Centar mjesta sa svim sadr¾ajima je udaljen 1 km gdje se takoðer nalazi more i prekrasna pje&scaron;èana pla¾a.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Smje&scaron;tena je na zemlji&scaron;tu ukupne povr&scaron;ine 579 m2 koje je dovoljno prostrano za izgradnju bazena. Iz dvori&scaron;ta se pru¾a djelomièan pogled na more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Brutto stambena povr&scaron;ina iznosi 165 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U prizemlju se nalazi hodnik, kuhinja + blagovaonica, 2 spavaæe sobe, kupaonica i terasa (30 m2). Na 1.katu se nalazi hodnik, 3 prostrane spavaæe sobe, kupaonica i terasa (20 m2) sa pogledom na more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U prizemlju se nalaze 2 ulaza te je moguæe potpuno odvojiti prizemlje i 1.kat.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Postoji moguænost nadogradnje jo&scaron; jedne eta¾e.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U dvori&scaron;tu se nalazi i jedna manja vrta kuæica (12 m2).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Meðunarodni aerodrom udaljen je 10 min. vo¾nje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za sve dodatne informacije stojimo vam na raspolaganju.</p>', '<p>Old stone house in need of modernisation and renovation, in a quiet environment,  situated a few minutes drive west of the historic town of Trogir.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The  house is in need of renovation, and can easily be converted into a beautiful  home for private family holidays, or split into two apartments to enjoy a good  income from tourist rental.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The nearest town centre with all amenities is 1  km away, and here there is also the sea with beautiful sandy beaches.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It  has a total land area of 579 m2, which would be big enough to include a  swimming pool while renovation work was being carried out.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There are some  great views including a view of the sea, from the courtyard.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The total  living area is 165 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The ground floor has an entrance hall, kitchen, dining  room, 2 bedrooms, bathroom and terrace (30 m2).&nbsp;The 1st floor has a hall, 3  spacious bedrooms, a bathroom and a terrace (20 m2) with sea views.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The  ground floor has two entrances and it is possible to completely separate the  ground floor and 1st floor.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There is a possibility of building another  floor.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>In the backyard there is a small garden cottage (12  m2).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Everything needs modernising, and the garden needs a severe  &lsquo;makeover&rsquo;, but this could be a great house.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The international airport is  10 minutes. driving.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact the office for more  information.</p>', '', '849_Old-stone-house_0.jpg', '849_Old-stone-house_1.jpg', '849_Old-stone-house_2.jpg', '849_Old-stone-house_3.jpg', '849_Old-stone-house_4.jpg', '849_Old-stone-house_5.jpg', '849_Old-stone-house_6.jpg', '849_Old-stone-house_7.jpg', '849_Old-stone-house_8.jpg'),
(850, 'Damir', 'Lela', '', '098/ 315 977', 'mario970101@gmail.com', 'Makarska', 'Brela, Put Luke, 3858/18 k.o. Brela', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '70', '0', '120', 2, '440000', '', 2, 1, 2, 2, 1, 2, 3, 2, 'September 7, 2014', '<p>Ekskluzivni apartmani u novogradnji u 2.redu od mora, sa prekrasnim pogledom na more, udaljeni od pje&scaron;èane pla¾e 80 m. Apartmani su jako kvalitetno graðeni, ali nisu u potpunosti zavr&scaron;eni veæ æe buduæi kupac ostatak materijala izabrati prema vlastitim ¾eljama. Samo su dva apartmana jo&scaron; na prodaji - apartman povr&scaron;ine 120m2 po cijeni od 440.000 Eura i apartman povr&scaron;ine 163 m2 po cijeni od 600.000 Eura!</p>', '<p>We are offering these two exclusive apartments in a new building in the 2nd row from the sea, overlooking the sea, 80 m away from the sandy beach. The apartments are very well built, but not fully completed and the buyer will have the opportunity to help design and choose the fittings and finished decorations for their property. Only two apartments are still available - apartment of 120 m2 priced at 440.000 Euro and apartment of 163 m2 priced at 600.000 Euro!</p>', '', '<p>Ekskluzivni apartmani u novogradnji u 2.redu od mora, sa prekrasnim pogledom na more, udaljeni od pje&scaron;èane pla¾e 80 m.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Smje&scaron;teni su u malom turistièkom mjestu udaljenom 1h vo¾nje zapadno od grada Splita, dok je meðunarodni aerodrom udaljen 1,5 h vo¾nje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartmani su jako kvalitetno graðeni, ali nisu u potpunosti zavr&scaron;eni veæ æe buduæi kupac ostatak materijala izabrati prema vlastitim ¾eljama.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U suterenu se nalazi po 1 gara¾a i 1 vanjsko parking mjesto za svaki apartman.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;"><strong>APARTMAN 1: 120 m2 &ndash; 440.000 &euro;</strong></span></p>\r\n<p><strong>&nbsp;</strong>Smje&scaron;ten je u visokom prizemlju, a sastoji se od blagovaonice + kuhinje, dnevnog boravka, hodnika, 2 kupaonice, saune, 2 spavaæe sobe, 1 natkrivene i 1 nenatkrivene terase sa pogledom na more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;"><strong>APARTMAN 2: 163 m2 &ndash; 600.000 &euro;</strong></span></p>\r\n<p>Dvoeta¾ni apartman smje&scaron;ten na 2.katu i potkrovlju, sa sastoji se od:</p>\r\n<p><strong>1. eta¾a</strong>- dnevni boravak + blagovaonica + kuhinja, hodnika, kupaonice, 2 spavaæe sobe , 1 natkrivene i 1 nenatkrivene terase sa prekrasnim pogledom na more.</p>\r\n<p><strong>2. eta¾a</strong>-&nbsp; predsoblje, 1 velika spavaæa soba, kupaonica i balkon sa pogledom na more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Svi potrebni sadr¾aji nalaze se u blizini.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za sve dodatne informacije stojimo vam na raspolaganju.</p>', '<p>We are offering these two exclusive apartments in a new building in the 2nd row  from the sea, overlooking the sea, 80 m away from the sandy beach.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>They  are located in the small village distant 1h drive west of the major town, on the  mainland, south of Split and 1.5 hours drive from the airport.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The apartments  are very well built, but not fully completed and the buyer will have the  opportunity to help design and choose the fittings and finished decorations for  their property.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The basement has a one garage for each property, and there is  an additional space outside, for each property.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong><span style="text-decoration: underline;">APARTMENT 1: 120 m2 - &euro;  440,000</span></strong></p>\r\n<p>This is located on the ground floor and consists of a dining room and  kitchen, living room, hall, 2 bathrooms, sauna, 2 bedrooms, 1 covered and 1  uncovered terrace.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;"><strong>APARTMENT 2: 163 m2 - 600.000 &euro;</strong></span></p>\r\n<p>This is a duplex  apartment located on the 2nd floor and top floor and comprises of:- living room  + dining + kitchen, hallway, bathroom, two bedrooms, one covered and one  uncovered terrace, and with stairs leading up, where there is a landing, 1 large  bedroom, bathroom and balcony with sea view.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>All the terraces and  balconies have superb views, and are elevated from sea level by the steep  geography on this part of the coast.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The local scenery and nature is  natural pine forests.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The local area has many shops, restaurants, tourist  activities.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact the office for more information about these  apartments.</p>', '', '850_Apartment_0.jpg', '850_Apartment_1.jpg', '850_Apartment_2.jpg', '850_Apartment_3.jpg', '850_Apartment_4.jpg', '850_Apartment_5.jpg', '850_Apartment_6.jpg', '850_Apartment_7.jpg', '850_Apartment_8.jpg'),
(851, 'Freddy', 'van Kalsbeek', 'kljuc 0915209038  0917619329   021886943', '+31 650 368834', 'trendkip@hotmail.com', 'Trogir', 'O.Gornji, Boèiæ 36, 1541 zgr, 757/20', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '10', '445', '300', 1, '850000', '', 2, 2, 2, 1, 1, 2, 7, 6, 'September 7, 2014', '<p>Apartmanska vila u 1.redu do mora, potpuno namje&scaron;tena, sa prekrasnim pogledom na more, smje&scaron;tena u jednoj od najljep&scaron;im uvala na ju¾noj strani otoka Èiova. Brutto stambena povr&scaron;ina sa svim terasama iznosi 300 m2. Sa svih eta¾a pru¾a se prekrasan pogled na more i cijelu uvalu.</p>', '<p>This building is on the water&rsquo;s edge, the 1st row of property to the sea, fully furnished, with beautiful sea views, located in one of the most beautiful bays on the south side of Ciovo. Gross living area with all the terraces of 300 m2. Each floor offers a breathtaking view of the sea and the bay. They are all spacious and well designed, well built and decorated to a high standard. The furniture is included in the sale.</p>', '', '<p>Apartmanska vila u 1.redu do mora, potpuno namje&scaron;tena, sa prekrasnim pogledom na more, smje&scaron;tena u jednoj od najljep&scaron;im uvala na ju¾noj strani otoka Èiova.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Trenutno je u funkciji turistièkog iznajmljivanja ali je idealna i za vlastiti boravak i u¾ivanje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ukupno zemlji&scaron;te iznosi 450 m2, dok se u dvori&scaron;tu nalaze 3 vanjska parking mjesta i kamin.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U dvori&scaron;tu je takoðer moguæa izgradnja manjeg bazena.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>More i prekrasna prirodno kamenita pla¾a udaljeni su svega 10 m od vile. Centar mjesta gdje se nalaze trgovine, kafiæi, restorani, ljekarna i svi ostali sadr¾aji je udaljen 5 min. vo¾nje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Brutto stambena povr&scaron;ina sa svim terasama iznosi 300 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na svakom katu se nalazi po 1 apartman sa odvojenim vanjskim ulazima.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U prizemlju i 1.katu se nalazi po jedan 2-sobni apartman, dok se na 2.katu nalazi 3-sobni apartman.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sa svih eta¾a pru¾a se prekrasan pogled na more i cijelu uvalu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Meðunarodni aerodrom udaljen je 20 min. vo¾nje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za sve dodatne informacije stojimo vam na raspolaganju.</p>', '<p>This building is on the water&rsquo;s edge, the 1st row of property to the sea, fully furnished, with beautiful sea views, located in one of the most beautiful bays on the south side of Ciovo.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is licensed to rent to tourists, but can equally be enjoyed privately.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Total land is 450 m2, and it includes 3 outdoor parking spaces. The yard has a superb bbq grill, and is large enough to incorporate a small pool.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The sea and beautiful natural rocky beach are only 10 yards from the front of the villa, and the centre of the local village is 5 minutes driving, and here there are shops, cafes, restaurants, a pharmacy and other facilities.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Gross living area with all the terraces of 300 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On each floor is one apartment with separate outside entrances. The ground floor and the 1st floor there is one 2-bedroom apartment, while on the 2nd floor is a 3-bedroom apartment.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Each floor offers a breathtaking view of the sea and the bay.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>They are all spacious and well designed, well built and decorated to a high standard. The furniture is included in the sale.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The international airport is 20 minutes driving.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact the office for more information about this property.</p>', '', '851_House-Villa_0.jpg', '851_House-Villa_1.jpg', '851_House-Villa_2.jpg', '851_House-Villa_3.jpg', '851_House-Villa_4.jpg', '851_House-Villa_5.jpg', '851_House-Villa_6.jpg', '851_House-Villa_7.jpg', '851_House-Villa_8.jpg'),
(852, 'Tonèi', 'Borovac', '021 461 539', '091 524 57 87', '', 'Primosten', 'Bilo, 15696/252 i dio 15696/35 K.O. Primo¹ten', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '20', '786', '200', 1, '690000', '', 2, 2, 2, 1, 1, 2, 6, 4, 'September 10, 2014', '<p>Samostojeæa kuæa na primo&scaron;tenskoj rivijeri, 1. red do mora s direktnim pristupom na prirodnu pla¾u. Ju¾na orijentacija kuæe omoguæava pogled na otvoreno more. Posebnost ove nekretnine je kaskadno ureðeni vrt koji se prote¾e od kuæe sve do samog mora. Prekrasan pogled na otvoreno more pru¾a se iz bilo kojeg kutka ovog vrta. S obzirom na velièinu parcele moguæa je izgradnja bazena ili jo&scaron; jednog objekta.</p>', '<p>We are pleased to offer this opportunity to purchase a first line villa, next to the sea, on the beautiful shore near Primosten. The living space inside the property is 200m sq. This property is on a superb plot, on a large garden of 786 m sq, most of it on a gentle slope between the house and the sea. There is enough space here to create a patio area and swimming pool, boat store or even another small building. The location is superb!</p>', '', '<p>Samostojeæa kuæa na primo&scaron;tenskoj rivijeri, 1. red do mora s direktnim pristupom na prirodnu pla¾u.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ju¾na orijentacija kuæe omoguæava pogled na otvoreno more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Posebnost ove nekretnine je kaskadno ureðeni vrt koji se prote¾e od kuæe sve do samog mora.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Loza, masline i borovina pru¾aju izuzetan mir, privatnost i hladovinu. Prekrasan pogled na otvoreno more pru¾a se iz bilo kojeg kutka ovog vrta.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>S obzirom na velièinu parcele moguæa je izgradnja bazena ili jo&scaron; jednog objekta.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa zahtjeva renoviranje s obzirom da je trenutni raspored namijenjen turistièkoj djelatnosti iznajmljivanja apartmana.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U prizemlju se nalazi konoba od 15 m2 i jednosoban stan s terasom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na prvom katu su dva apartmana: jednosoban i dvosoban&nbsp; svaki s vlastitom terasom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na drugom katu u visokom prizemlju se nalazi dvosoban apartman.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa ima prikljuèak za vodu i struju.</p>', '<p>We are pleased to offer this opportunity to purchase a first line villa, next to the sea, on the beautiful shore near Primosten.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The building  is currently being used for tourist holidays and is on 3 floors.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The  ground floor is a one bedroom apartment.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The first floor is two apartments,  one has one bedroom, and the other two bedrooms.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The top floor has a  large two bedroom apartment.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>All the rooms and even the garden have  superb sea views.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It would be easy to change the design of the property  so it becomes a large family villa, but any internal alterations can be done  at the owners wish, without asking for further permission.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The living  space inside the property is 200m sq.</p>\r\n<p>This property is on a superb plot, on a  large garden of 786 m sq, most of it on a gentle slope between the house and  the sea. At the moment the land is used as a garden, with herbs, olives, and  vines all prominent.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There is enough space here to create a patio area and  swimming pool, boat store or even another small building.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There is  parking on the plot behind the building, for two cars.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The location is  superb. The sea is at the bottom of the garden, and this part of the coast  is very popular because of the clean and safe beaches.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The nearest shops and  bars are a short walk from here, and the larger towns are 20 minutes by  car.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact our office for more information about the property or potential building works.</p>', '', '852_House-Villa_0.jpg', '852_House-Villa_1.jpg', '852_House-Villa_2.jpg', '852_House-Villa_3.jpg', '852_House-Villa_4.jpg', '852_House-Villa_5.jpg', '852_House-Villa_6.jpg', '852_House-Villa_7.jpg', '852_House-Villa_8.jpg');
INSERT INTO `nekretnina` (`id`, `ime`, `prezime`, `telefon`, `mobitel`, `e_mail`, `lokacija_id`, `adresa`, `status_id`, `vrsta_id`, `udaljenost`, `povrsina`, `stambenapovrsina`, `display`, `cijena`, `cijenatocka`, `ponuda_tjedna`, `new_built`, `must_sell`, `prvi_red_do_mora`, `pogled_na_more`, `bazen`, `broj_soba`, `broj_kupatila`, `datum`, `title_hr`, `title_en`, `title_ge`, `opis_hr`, `opis_en`, `opis_ge`, `PropertyImageURL0`, `PropertyImageURL1`, `PropertyImageURL2`, `PropertyImageURL3`, `PropertyImageURL4`, `PropertyImageURL5`, `PropertyImageURL6`, `PropertyImageURL7`, `PropertyImageURL8`) VALUES
(854, 'Stjepan', 'Bero¹', 'Stipan- 098/968 5788     ', 'Bernard Budiæ- 099/ 814 9616', ' letka.zagreb@gmail.com', 'Trogir', 'Bok, 1797 ZGR , 746/23   746/24   746/25   746/28   746/29   746/30   uredna', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '10', '510', '520', 1, '1950000', '', 2, 2, 2, 1, 1, 1, 11, 11, 'September 13, 2014', '<p>Apartmanska kuæa u 1.redu na ju¾noj strani otoka Èiova. Nalazi se u jednoj od najljep&scaron;im uvala na otoku sa prekrasnim pogledom na more. Udaljena je svega 10 m od prirodne stjenovite pla¾e. Sastoji od podruma, visokog prizemlja, 1. i 2. kata ukupne stambene povr&scaron;ine 520 m2. Ispred kuæe nalazi se bazen, koji je potrebno dovr&scaron;iti. Predviðeno je punjenje morskom vodom.</p>', '<p>We are offering this modern style sea side villa designed with 6 bedrooms with 5 x one bedroom apartments for tourists.It is situated on the first row of property from the sea, just 10 m from the water''s edge, on the south side of the island. The house consists of a basement, ground, first, and second floor, and the total living area is 520 m sq.</p>', '', '<p>Apartmanska kuæa u 1.redu na ju¾noj strani otoka Èiova. Nalazi se u jednoj od najljep&scaron;im uvala na otoku sa prekrasnim pogledom na more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Udaljena je svega 10 m od prirodne stjenovite pla¾e.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Centar mjesta, gdje se ujedno nalaze svi potrebni sadr¾aji, udaljen je 5 min. vo¾nje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa se nalazi na zemlji&scaron;tu ukupne povr&scaron;ine 510 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sastoji od podruma, visokog prizemlja, 1. i 2. kata ukupne stambene povr&scaron;ine 520 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa se sastoji od 6 soba + kupaonica i 5 jednosobnih apartmana. Sve sobe i apartmani imaju svoj balkon sa pogledom na more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U prizemlju se nalazi profesionalna kuhinja. Ispred kuæe nalazi se bazen, koji je potrebno dovr&scaron;iti. Predviðeno je punjenje morskom vodom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ispred se nalazi parking za 4 automobila.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa posjeduje licencu za iznajmljivanje te je idealna tko se ¾eli nastaviti baviti uhodanim poslom iznajmljivanja.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>***Zapadno od kuæe u 1. redu nalaze se 2 zemlji&scaron;ta ukupne povr&scaron;ine 900 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sjeverozadapno od kuæe u 2. redu nalaze se 3 zemlji&scaron;ta ukupne povr&scaron;ine 1132 m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>***Ukupna cijena za navedena dodatna zemlji&scaron;ta iznosi 1.560.000 &euro;.</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Meðunarodni aerodrom udaljen je 20 min. vo¾nje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za sve dodatne informacije slobodno nas kontaktirajte.</p>', '<p>We are offering this modern style sea side villa designed with 6 bedrooms with 5  x one bedroom apartments for tourists.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is situated on the first row of  property from the sea, just 10 m from the water''s edge, on the south side of the  island.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The nearest village is just 5 minutes away, and here are a range of  bars and restaurant, as well as shops and other services for the local  population and tourists alike.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The coast here is naturally rocky, but clean  and safe and very popular with tourists.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house consists of a  basement, ground, first, and second floor, and the total living area is 520 m  sq.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>In the house are 6 bedrooms, plus the 5 x 1 bedroom apartments. Each  apartment has balconies facing the sea.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is well decorated and ready to be  continued in it''s current use as rental apartments for tourists and this good  and established business can be carried on by new owners.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There is a  possibility of making improvements, by using the grounds, (which measures 510 m  sq) and the current owners have planned a swimming pool, and work has already  started on this project.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There is parking for 4 vehicles in the  property.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact the Croatia property sales office for more  information.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>"""We also have 5 building plots for sale near this  property. Total price of these plots is 1.560.000 euro<br /></strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Two are rare opportunities to build in the first row from the sea,  each plot is 450 m sq, and the other three are in the second row. The total area  of these three is over 1100 m sq.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please call for more  information.</p>', '', '854_House-Villa_0.jpg', '854_House-Villa_1.jpg', '854_House-Villa_2.jpg', '854_House-Villa_3.jpg', '854_House-Villa_4.jpg', '854_House-Villa_5.jpg', '854_House-Villa_6.jpg', '854_House-Villa_7.jpg', '854_House-Villa_8.jpg'),
(1705, 'Èedo', 'Sovulj', '', '095 400 5085', 'Gordana Sovulj gsovulj@gmail.com', 'Brac', 'Put Zlatnog Rata 23  Bol, Kc 808/2 ko Bol', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '400', '2000', '140', 1, '400000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 0, 0, 'June 3, 2016', '<p>U ponudi nudimo kuæu na dvije eta¾e smje&scaron;tenu u atraktivnom dijelu popularnog mjesta sa ju¾ne strane otoka Braèa.&nbsp;Zemlji&scaron;te se nalazi izvan graðevinske zone, no objekt je legaliziran i u roh-bau stanju.&nbsp;Sa prvog kata kuæe pru¾a se lijepi pogled na more, a prekasne pla¾e udaljene su svega nekoliko minuta hoda.&nbsp;Kuæa ima 140 m2 bruto razvijene povr&scaron;ine.&nbsp;<br /><br /></p>', '<p>For sale we have this interesting property located in a very popular area nearby the tourist hotspot on the south side of Brac island.&nbsp;The land is out of the building zone, therefore foreigners can buy it only by setting up Croatian limited liability company.&nbsp;The house has 140 sqm of gross developed area and it is fully legalized, but yet to be finished (raw works are completed).&nbsp;Property features lovely sea views from the first floor and it is only a few minutes walk from amazing beaches.&nbsp;</p>', '', '<p>U ponudi nudimo kuæu na dvije eta¾e smje&scaron;tenu u atraktivnom dijelu popularnog mjesta sa ju¾ne strane otoka Braèa.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Zemlji&scaron;te se nalazi izvan graðevinske zone, no objekt je legaliziran i u roh-bau stanju.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sa prvog kata kuæe pru¾a se lijepi pogled na more, a prekasne pla¾e udaljene su svega nekoliko minuta hoda.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa ima 140 m2 bruto razvijene povr&scaron;ine.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za detalje molimo kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured u Splitu.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>For sale we have this interesting property located in a very popular area nearby the tourist hotspot on the south side of Brac island.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The land is out of the building zone, therefore foreigners can buy it only by setting up Croatian limited liability company.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house has 140 sqm of gross developed area and it is fully legalized, but yet to be finished (raw works are completed).&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Property features lovely sea views from the first floor and it is only a few minutes walk from amazing beaches.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For more information please contact our Split office.&nbsp;</p>', '', '1705_House-Villa_0.jpg', '1705_House-Villa_1.JPG', '1705_House-Villa_2.JPG', '1705_House-Villa_3.JPG', '1705_House-Villa_4.JPG', '', '', '', ''),
(855, 'Stipe', 'Kuvaè', '', '091 201 75 80', '', 'Primosten', 'Dolac - Primo¹ten, È. zgr. 1297 K.O. Primo¹ten', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '10', '470', '238', 1, '1200000', '', 2, 2, 2, 1, 1, 2, 6, 4, 'September 17, 2014', '<p>Prekrasna vila u 1. redu do mora u neposrednoj blizini Primo&scaron;tena, u centru zelene oaze borova, na svega par metara od prirodne kamenite pla¾e. Kuæa ima direktan izlaz na pla¾u te u potpunosti ograðenu okuænicu. Nalazi se u zelenom pojasu gdje nije moguæa daljnja gradnja &scaron;to ovoj vili daje ekskluzivnost i jedinstvenost.&nbsp;Izgraðena je od visoko kvalitetnih materijala po&scaron;tujuæi tradiciju dalmatinskih kuæa grada Primo&scaron;tena.</p>\r\n<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;">CIJENA SNI®ENA SA 1.400.000 EURA!!</span></p>', '<p>We are pleased to offer this majestic villa in a stunning ''grade A'' location on the shore near Primosten. The plot is 570 m sq and is situated among pine trees on the very edge of the sea, but in a location where no further building is allowed, so this secluded oasis will always remain private. There is direct access to the beach from the garden and the beach here is clean and completely natural.</p>\r\n<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;">PRICE REDUCED FROM 1.400.000 EURO!!</span></p>', '', '<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;"><strong>CIJENA SNI®ENA SA 1.400.000 EURA!!</strong></span></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Prekrasna vila u 1. redu do mora u neposrednoj blizini Primo&scaron;tena, u centru zelene oaze borova, na svega par metara od prirodne kamenite pla¾e.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa ima direktan izlaz na pla¾u te u potpunosti ograðenu okuænicu. Borovi oko kuæe osiguravaju privatnost i hladovinu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nalazi se u zelenom pojasu gdje nije moguæa daljnja gradnja &scaron;to ovoj vili daje ekskluzivnost i jedinstvenost.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Izgraðena je od visoko kvalitetnih materijala po&scaron;tujuæi tradiciju dalmatinskih kuæa grada Primo&scaron;tena.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U prizemlju se nalaze dva jednosobna apartmana, a u gornjem dijelu prostrani trosobni stan. Kuhinja, blagovaonica i dnevni boravak èine jednu cjelinu s velikim otvorom na terasu s koje se pru¾a prekrasan pogled na otvoreno more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je prikljuèena na struju i vodu, ima vlastitu septièku jamu velikog kapaciteta. Ugraðeno centralno grijanje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Prednost je i moguænost kori&scaron;tenja solarne energije s obzirom da ima ugraðene solarne æelije.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Iza kuæe u sklopu parcele su dva parkirna mjesta s prirodnom sjenicom.</p>', '<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;"><strong>PRICE REDUCED FROM 1.400.000 EURO!!</strong></span></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>We are pleased to offer this majestic villa in a stunning ''grade A'' location  on the shore near Primosten.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The plot is 470 m sq and is situated among  pine trees on the very edge of the sea, but in a location where no further  building is allowed, so this secluded oasis will always remain  private.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There is direct access to the beach from the garden and the beach  here is clean and completely natural.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property itself consists of  a ground floor apartment and the upper floor is a large 3 bedroom  apartment. All the rooms have views or balconies overlooking the sea, and  this view dominates the house.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The terrace has large BBQ grill, and  plenty of space.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>At the back of the house are two parking spaces off the  road.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It has been beautifully built with the most modern materials, and  design features, but still reflecting the historic traditions of Dalmatian stone built houses. It has a good feel.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It has water and electric  supplied and it has many mod cons, such as central heating, sat TV  etc.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The local area is dominated by quiet and unspoilt natural pine  woods, and the nearest village and shops is less than ten minutes driving,  or a good walk!</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact our office for more  information.</p>', '', '855_House-Villa_0.jpg', '855_House-Villa_1.jpg', '855_House-Villa_2.jpg', '855_House-Villa_3.jpg', '855_House-Villa_4.jpg', '855_House-Villa_5.jpg', '855_House-Villa_6.jpg', '855_House-Villa_7.jpg', '855_House-Villa_8.jpg'),
(856, 'Slobodanka', 'Ðuderija', '', '095/8455401', 'bobamorska@gmail.com', 'Trogir', 'O.Gornji, Boèiæ 39, 766/22', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '130', '300', '300', 1, '330000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 7, 4, 'September 20, 2014', '<p>Samostojeæa kuæa sa ukupno 3 odvojena apartmana, sa odliènim turistièkim potencijalom, udaljena od prekrasne pla¾e i uvale 130 m. Smje&scaron;tena je na ju¾noj strani otoka Èiova udaljena od centra mjesta 3 minute vo¾nje. Ukupno zemlji&scaron;te iznosi 300 m2, dok je brutto stambena povr&scaron;ina 300 m2. Sve 3 eta¾e su odvojene vanjskim ulazima.</p>', '<p>We are offering this detached house, divided into 3 separate apartments, which is ready for immediate habitation. The distance from the beach is 130m and there are beautiful quiet coves near to the main swimming area. The house sits on a land plot of 300m sq, and the living area inside the house is also, 300m sq. Each floor has a separate entrance from the outside.</p>', '', '<p>Samostojeæa kuæa sa ukupno 3 odvojena apartmana, sa odliènim turistièkim potencijalom, udaljena od prekrasne pla¾e i uvale 130 m.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Smje&scaron;tena je na ju¾noj strani otoka Èiova udaljena od centra mjesta 3 minute vo¾nje, gdje se ujedno nalaze trgovine, restorani, ljekarna i svi ostali sadr¾aji.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ukupno zemlji&scaron;te iznosi 300 m2, dok je brutto stambena povr&scaron;ina 300 m2. Sve 3 eta¾e su odvojene vanjskim ulazima.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U suterenu se nalazi 1 apartman koji se sastoji od blagovaonice + kuhinje + dnevnog boravka, hodnika, 3 spavaæe sobe i 1 kupaonice. Ispred u dvori&scaron;tu se nalazi ljetna kuhinja sa kaminom i wc-om.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U prizemlju i 1.katu (potkrovlje) se nalazi po 1 apartman koji se sastoje od dnevnog boravka + kuhinje + blagovaonice, 2 spavaæe sobe, 1 kupaonice i terase sa pogledom na more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ispred kuæe moguæe je parkirati 3 automobila.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæi je potrebno jo&scaron; dodatnog ulaganja ali se zbog odliènog polo¾aja mo¾e pretvoriti u pravu obiteljsku kuæu za odmor ili turistièko iznajmljivanje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Meðunarodni aerodrom udaljen je 20 min. vo¾nje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za sve dodatne informacije stojimo vam na raspolaganju.</p>', '<p>We are offering this detached house, divided into 3 separate apartments, which  is ready for immediate habitation or the continuation of a successful holiday  lettings business.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The distance from the beach is 130m and there are  beautiful quiet coves near to the main swimming area. It is a very popular  location due to the clean water and safe shore with no currents.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is on the south side of the island and just a few minute&rsquo;s drive  from the village centre where there are many options for bars, restaurants and  shops etc.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The nearest larger town Trogir, is just 10 minutes by  car.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house sits on a land plot of 300m sq, and the living area inside  the house is also, 300m sq. Each floor has a separate entrance from the  outside.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The top apartment and middle apartment have two bedrooms, and an  open plan living area, while the ground floor has 3 bedrooms and kitchen, lounge  etc.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property is in good condition and it has been well looked after.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Outside, on a patio area is a large bbq grill, with great sea views. At  the back of the property is a parking area for three vehicles to park privately,  off the road.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The airport is about 20 minutes away from the  apartments.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact the Croatia Property sales office for more  information.</p>', '', '856_House-Villa_0.jpg', '856_House-Villa_1.jpg', '856_House-Villa_2.jpg', '856_House-Villa_3.jpg', '856_House-Villa_4.jpg', '856_House-Villa_5.jpg', '856_House-Villa_6.jpg', '856_House-Villa_7.jpg', '856_House-Villa_8.jpg'),
(857, 'Andrija', 'Vido¹eviæ', '', '', '', 'Hvar', 'Vrbanj', 'For sale', 'Old stone house', '4000', '0', '60', 1, '45000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 2, 1, 'September 20, 2014', '<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;">STARA KAMENA KUÆA U NIZU!</span></p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je smje&scaron;tena u selu na sjevernoj strani otoka Hvara, cca 4km udaljena od mora. Kuæa se sastoji od prizemlja i kata ukupne stambene povr&scaron;ine ca.60m2. Ima pogled na more. Pristup do kuæe vozilom. Potrebna je potpuna adaptacija.</p>', '<p>This is an excellent value property, a renovation project, 4 km away from the coast, on the north side of Hvar island. It''s a terrace house and consists of two floors, with a total living area of 60m sq. It was formerly a building used as storage (farming) with a living space on the first floor. This is 20m sq, while the ground floor is 40m sq.</p>', '', '<p>STARA KAMENA KUÆA U NIZU!</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je smje&scaron;tena u selu na sjevernoj strani otoka Hvara, cca 4km udaljena od mora.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa se sastoji od prizemlja i kata ukupne stambene povr&scaron;ine ca.60m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U prizemlju se nalazi konoba 40 m2, dok je na prvom katu blagovaona (20m2).&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa ima pogled na more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Pristup do kuæe vozilom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Potrebna je potpuna adaptacija.</p>', '<p>This is an excellent value property, a renovation project, 4 km away from  the coast, on the north side of Hvar island.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It''s a terrace house and  consists of two floors, with a total living area of 60m sq.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It was  formerly a building used as storage (farming) with a living space&nbsp; on the  first floor. This is 20m sq, while the ground floor is 40m sq.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The  building appears in sound condition but it has not been habited for some  time, so complete refurbishment is required.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The village is very quiet,  as all the ''inland'' villages are on the islands, and there are lovely views  across the countryside and even to the sea.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The village has shops and  coffee bars and caters for the local population and you would need private  transport to get there.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact our Hvar office for more  information on this property and with any questions about the restoration  work.</p>', '', '857_Old-stone-house_0.jpg', '857_Old-stone-house_1.jpg', '857_Old-stone-house_2.jpg', '857_Old-stone-house_3.jpg', '857_Old-stone-house_4.jpg', '', '', '', ''),
(858, 'Sanja', 'Vrliæ-Mo¹ura', '021 572799', '098 9186455 ', '', 'Hvar', 'Stari Grad, Ploèa', 'For sale', 'Old stone house', '30', '0', '100', 2, '104000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 0, 0, 'September 20, 2014', '<p>Kamena kuæa za adaptaciju u strogom centru mjesta. Sastoji se od prizemlja, dva kata i potkrovlja, ukupne stambene povr&scaron;ine&nbsp;100 m2. Kuæa se nalazi na samome trgu s pogledom na more. Od mora je udaljena 30 metara. Idealno za poslovnu namjenu!</p>\r\n<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;">CIJENA SNI®ENA SA 110.000 EURA!</span></p>', '<p>We are very pleased to offer this superb opportunity to renovate the interior of this old village house. It is just 30m from the harbour, in the centre of the village and overlooking the main square, and would be the ideal location for a small commercial purpose. The building consists of a ground floor, first and second floor and a large attic. The total space inside is 100m sq.</p>\r\n<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;">PRICE REDUCED FROM 110.000 EURO!</span></p>', '', '<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;"><strong>CIJENA SNI®ENA SA 110.000 EURA!</strong></span></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kamena kuæa za adaptaciju u strogom centru mjesta.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sastoji se od  prizemlja, dva kata i potkrovlja, ukupne stambene povr&scaron;ine&nbsp;100  m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa se nalazi na samome trgu s pogledom na more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Od mora je  udaljena 30 metara.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Idealno za poslovnu namjenu!</p>', '<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;"><strong>PRICE REDUCED FROM 110.000 EURO!</strong></span></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>We are very pleased to offer this superb opportunity to renovate the interior of this old village house.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is just 30m from the harbour,  in the centre of the village and overlooking the main square, and would be  the ideal location for a small commercial purpose.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The building  consists of a ground floor, first and second floor and a large attic, not  tall enough to stand in, but a space unobstructed by cross beams, which  could become valuable storage space.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The total space inside is 100m  sq.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The building itself, including the roof, appears to be in good  condition but the inside needs to be completely renovated.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Water and  electric are already present, so all that is needed is some good ideas and a  winter of hard work to turn this into your dream house!</p>', '', '858_Old-stone-house_0.jpg', '858_Old-stone-house_1.jpg', '858_Old-stone-house_2.jpg', '858_Old-stone-house_3.jpg', '858_Old-stone-house_4.jpg', '858_Old-stone-house_5.jpg', '858_Old-stone-house_6.jpg', '858_Old-stone-house_7.jpg', ''),
(859, '', 'Dalmat i Hormus', '', '', '', 'Sibenik', 'Brodarica', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '500', '0', '84', 2, '100000', '', 2, 1, 2, 2, 1, 2, 2, 2, 'September 21, 2014', '<p>Novoizgraðeni apartmani nedaleko od hotelskog kompleksa Solaris. Smje&scaron;teni su u mirnijem predjelu i s gornjih eta¾a se pru¾a lijepi pogled na more. Kvalitetna gradnja, dobar raspored prostorija i 2 velike terase pru¾aju udobnost ne samo za ljetovanje nego i za stalni boravak. U zgradi se nalaze jos 2 slobodna apartmana: apartman u prizemlju, stambene povr&scaron;ine 83,86m2, 100.000,00 EUR i apartman na 1.katu, 83,86m2, 104.825,00 EUR.</p>', '<p>New apartments located in a quiet area near the Solaris hotel complex. Quality construction, good layout, and two large terraces provide comfort not only for holidays but also for permanent residence. Two apartments are still available: apartment on the ground floor, living area 83,86 m2, 100.000,00 EUR and apartment on the 1st floor, 83,86 m2,&nbsp;104.825,00 EUR.</p>', '', '<p>Novoizgraðeni apartmani nedaleko od hotelskog kompleksa Solaris.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Smje&scaron;teni su u mirnijem predjelu i s gornjih eta¾a se pru¾a lijepi pogled na more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kvalitetna gradnja, dobar raspored prostorija i 2 velike terase pru¾aju udobnost ne samo za ljetovanje nego i za stalni boravak.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U zgradi se nalaze jos 2 slobodna apartmana:</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>-apartman u prizemlju, jugoistoène orijentacije, stambene povr&scaron;ine 83,86m2, a sastoji se od hodnika, kupaonice, wc-a, kuhinje, dnevne sobe, 2 spavaæe sobe i 2 terase. Apartmanu pripada spremi&scaron;te ispod ulaznih stepenica, kuæni vrt i parking mjesto, ukupne povr&scaron;ine 89,95m2.&nbsp;<strong>Cijena: 100.000,00 EUR</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>-apartman na 1.katu, 83,86m2, ima identièan raspored prostorija kao i apartman u prizemlju, te mu pripada 1 parking mjesto (11,25m2). U cijenu apartmana je ukljuèen namje&scaron;taj.&nbsp;<strong>Cijena: 104.825,00 EUR.</strong></p>', '<p>New apartments located in a quiet area near the Solaris hotel complex.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Quality construction, good layout, and two large terraces provide comfort not only for holidays but also for permanent residence.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Two apartments are still available:</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>-apartment on the ground floor, south-east orientation, living area 83,86 m2 which consists of a hallway, bathroom, toilet, kitchen, living room, 2 bedrooms and 2 terraces. It also includes storage, small garden and single parking space, all in all 89,95 m2. <strong>Price: 100.000,00 EUR</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>-apartment on the 1st floor, 83,86 m2, identical layout as the apartment on the ground floor, 1 parking space. Apartment is fully furnished. <strong>Price: 104.825,00 EUR</strong></p>', '', '859_Apartment_0.jpg', '859_Apartment_1.jpg', '859_Apartment_2.jpg', '859_Apartment_3.jpg', '859_Apartment_4.jpg', '859_Apartment_5.jpg', '859_Apartment_6.jpg', '859_Apartment_7.jpg', '859_Apartment_8.jpg'),
(860, '', 'Dalmat i Hormus', '', '', '', 'Sibenik', 'Vodice', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '50', '0', '64', 1, '135000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 1, 1, 'September 21, 2014', '<p>Moderan stan povr&scaron;ine 64 m2 u turistièkom sredi&scaron;tu grada Vodica. Stan se sastoji od hodnika, kupaonice, 1 spavaæe sobe, kuhinje, blagovaonice, dnevnog boravka i natkrivenog balkona s pogledom na more. Smje&scaron;ten je u blizini marine, duæana i restorana. Opremljen je klimom i luksuznim namje&scaron;tajem.</p>', '<p>An exclusively fitted apartment in center of city Vodice. The apartment is situated on the third floor, the dwelling space is 64 sqm, and it encompasses a kitchen, a living room, a dining room, a bathroom, 1 bedroom and a balcony. The apartment has air-conditioning. A true opportunity for those who appreciate exclusiveness in the heart of the city Vodice!</p>', '', '<p>Moderan stan povr&scaron;ine 64 m2 u turistièkom sredi&scaron;tu grada Vodica.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Stan se sastoji od hodnika, kupaonice, 1 spavaæe sobe, kuhinje, blagovaonice, dnevnog boravka i natkrivenog balkona s pogledom na more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Smje&scaron;ten je u blizini marine, duæana i restorana.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Opremljen je klimom i luksuznim namje&scaron;tajem.</p>', '<p>An exclusively fitted apartment in center of city Vodice.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The apartment is situated on the third floor, the dwelling space is 64 sqm, and it encompasses a kitchen, a living room, a dining room, a bathroom, 1 bedroom and a balcony.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The apartment has air-conditioning.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>A true opportunity for those who appreciate exclusiveness in the heart of the city Vodice!</p>', '', '860_Apartment_0.jpg', '860_Apartment_1.jpg', '860_Apartment_2.jpg', '860_Apartment_3.jpg', '860_Apartment_4.jpg', '860_Apartment_5.jpg', '860_Apartment_6.jpg', '860_Apartment_7.jpg', '860_Apartment_8.jpg'),
(861, '', 'Dalmat i Hormus', '', '', '', 'Rogoznica', 'Rogoznica', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '200', '0', '85', 2, '100000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 3, 1, 'September 21, 2014', '<p>Apartman u Rogoznici, smje&scaron;ten na 2. katu s pogledom na more. Ukupna korisna povr&scaron;ina apartmana iznosi 85m2, a sastoji se od kuhinje sa blagovaonicom, 2 spavaæe sobe, kupaonice i balkona s pogledom na more. Postoji dodatna prostorija u potkrovlju koja je u funkciji dnevnog boravka, a mo¾e se koristiti i kao spavaæa soba za 2 osobe.&nbsp;Do pla¾e ima svega 200m, dok je centar Rogoznice udaljen 1000m.</p>', '<p>Apartment in Rogoznica, located on the 2nd floor overlooking the sea. The total living area of the apartment is 85m2 and consists of a kitchen, dining room, 2 bedrooms, bathroom and a balcony overlooking the sea. There is an additional room in the attic, which is used as a living room, and also can be used as a bedroom for 2 people.&nbsp;The beach is only 200m away, while the center of Rogoznica is 1000m.</p>', '', '<p>Apartman u Rogoznici, smje&scaron;ten na 2. katu s pogledom na more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ukupna korisna povr&scaron;ina apartmana iznosi 85m2, a sastoji se od kuhinje sa blagovaonicom, 2 spavaæe sobe, kupaonice i balkona s pogledom na more. Postoji dodatna prostorija u potkrovlju koja je u funkciji dnevnog boravka, a mo¾e se koristiti i kao spavaæa soba za 2 osobe.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartman je kompletno opremljen i namje&scaron;ten, a cijena namje&scaron;taja je dodatnih 2000 EUR.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Dva klima ureðaja (konvertera) su ukljuèeni u cijenu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartmanu pripada jedno parkirno mjesto, a 2 ro&scaron;tilja koji se nalaze unutar okuænice su na raspolaganju svim stanarima zgrade.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Do pla¾e ima svega 200m, dok je centar Rogoznice udaljen 1000m.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Rogoznica je mirno i toplo mediteransko mjesto na samom kraju Srednje Dalmacije. Prote¾e se uzdu¾ 50 km obale i rado je posjeæuju nautièari, jer je poznata kao jedna od najljep&scaron;ih i najsigurnijih luka na Jadranu. Pla¾e su u Rogoznici &scaron;ljunèane, ima i pone&scaron;to stijena, a svako naselje nudi skrovita kupali&scaron;ta u brojnim malim uvalama. Klima je jedan od najva¾nijih atraktivnih turistièkih elemenata, te na rogoznièkom podruèju prosjeèno ima 2600 sunèanih sati na godinu. Tijekom èetiri ljetna mjeseca u prosjeku ima svega od 4 do 7 ki&scaron;nih dana.&nbsp;Rogoznica ima odliènu prometnu povezanost, a najbli¾i aerodrom u Splitu udaljen je 25km.</p>', '<p>Apartment in Rogoznica, located on the 2nd floor overlooking the sea.T</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>he total living area of the apartment is 85m2 and consists of a kitchen, dining room, 2 bedrooms, bathroom and a balcony overlooking the sea. There is an additional room in the attic, which is used as a living room, and also can be used as a bedroom for 2 people.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The apartment is fully furnished and equipped, and the price of furniture is additional 2000 EUR.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Two air conditioners (converters) are included in the price.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>One parking spot belongs to the apartment and 2 barbecues that are within the garden are available to all tenants of the building.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The beach is only 200m away, while the center of Rogoznica is 1000m.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Rogoznica is calm and warm Mediterranean town on the outskirts of Central Dalmatia. It stretches 50 km along the coast and is gladly visited by sailors, because it is known as one of the most beautiful and safest ports. Beaches in Rogoznica are mostly gravel, but there are some rocks, and every resort offers secluded beaches in the numerous small bays. The climate is one of the most attractive tourist elements, and the Rogoznica field has averaged 2,600 sunny hours per year. During the four summer months, on average, there are only 4-7 rainy days.Rogoznica has excellent transport connection, and the nearest international airport in Split is 25 km away.</p>', '', '861_Apartment_0.jpg', '861_Apartment_1.jpg', '861_Apartment_2.jpg', '861_Apartment_3.jpg', '861_Apartment_4.jpg', '861_Apartment_5.jpg', '861_Apartment_6.jpg', '861_Apartment_7.jpg', '861_Apartment_8.jpg'),
(862, 'Pat', 'O''Donohue', '00353 86 811 2868', '', 'pwod@eircom.net', 'Brac', 'Sutivan', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '80', '0', '45', 1, '120000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 2, 1, 'September 21, 2014', '<p>Dvosobni apartman sa prekrasnim pogledom na more i Braèki kanal.&nbsp;Apartman  ima stambenu povr&scaron;inu od 45,34 m2.&nbsp;Krase ga  visoki plafoni i lijepi balkon sa pogledom.&nbsp;Unutra&scaron;njost apartmana je  maksimalno iskori&scaron;tena, a ureðenje prostora prepu&scaron;teno struènjaku za  unutra&scaron;nji dizajn.&nbsp;Apartman je kompletno namje&scaron;ten.</p>', '<p>A top floor, two bed apartment around 80 meters from the sea front with a  spectacular view over to Split!&nbsp;The apartment has a living area of 45,34m  sq.&nbsp;It has very high ceilings and a  nice size balcony which is not covered&nbsp;overhead.&nbsp;It is one of the top rented  apartments with the management company who look after the  apartment.</p>', '', '<p>Dvosobni apartman sa prekrasnim pogledom na more i Braèki kanal.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartman  ima stambenu povr&scaron;inu od 45,34 m2. Tlocrt apartmana je na slici.</p>\r\n<p>Postoji i velik prostor/sremi&scaron;te u potkrovlju iznad jedne od soba.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Krase ga  visoki plafoni i lijepi balkon sa pogledom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Unutra&scaron;njost apartmana je  maksimalno iskori&scaron;tena, a ureðenje prostora prepu&scaron;teno struènjaku za  unutra&scaron;nji dizajn.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartman je kompletno namje&scaron;ten.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Od centra mjesta  je udaljen 10 minuta &scaron;etnjom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>More i pla¾e su udaljeni samo nekoliko minuta  &scaron;etnjom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za dodatne informacije i dogovor oko razgledavanja stojimo na  usluzi.</p>', '<p>A top floor, two bed apartment around 80 meters from the sea front with a  spectacular view over to Split!</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The apartment has a living area of 45,34m  sq. Its layout is shown on the picture.</p>\r\n<p>There is a huge attic space for storage over the second twin bedroom accessible by a pull down attic stairs.</p>\r\n<p>It has very high ceilings and a  nice size balcony which is not covered overhead.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is rented by the  Vendors and they have a rental license for it.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is one of the top rented  apartments with the management company who look after the  apartment.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is a ten minute stroll from Sutivan and a two minute walk  to the sea front.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The inside has been furnished and planned by an  interior designer and the most is made of all the available space.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>To  visit please call our office and meet our representative on Brac island.</p>', '', '862_Apartment_0.jpg', '862_Apartment_1.jpg', '862_Apartment_2.jpg', '862_Apartment_3.jpg', '862_Apartment_4.jpg', '862_Apartment_5.jpg', '862_Apartment_6.jpg', '862_Apartment_7.jpg', '862_Apartment_8.jpg'),
(863, 'Dana', 'Stinson', '+15086938533', '+66898928196', '3roofedhouse@gmail.com', 'Hvar', 'Vrbanj', 'For sale', 'Old stone house', '4000', '0', '140', 1, '185000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 3, 2, 'September 21, 2014', '<p>Renovirana kamena kuæa u unutra&scaron;njosti otoka, 4 km od mora! Zadovoljstvo nam je ponuditi ovu obnovljenu tradicionalnu staru kamenu kuæu s 3&nbsp;spavaæe sobe i 2 kupaonice, te s prekrasnim pogledom na selo i more. Unutra&scaron;njost kuæe, koja se sastoji od 4 kata, èine 3 spavaæe sobe, (2 unutar glavne kuæe i 1 kod ljetne kuhinje), a ukupni stambeni prostor iznosi 140 m2.</p>', '<p>Restored house in HVAR inland village 4 k from the sea. We are pleased to offer this restored traditional old stone house with 3 bedrooms and 2 bathroom, and with interesting views across the village to the sea from the upper floors. Inside the house, which is over 4 floors there are 3 bedrooms, (2 inside the main house and 1 attached to the ''summer kitchen''). And the total space inside is 140 m sq.</p>', '', '<p>Renovirana kamena kuæa u unutra&scaron;njosti otoka, 4 km od mora!</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Zadovoljstvo nam je ponuditi ovu obnovljenu tradicionalnu staru kamenu kuæu s 3&nbsp;spavaæe sobe i 2 kupaonice, te s prekrasnim pogledom na selo i more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa posjeduje i veliki vrt.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Unutra&scaron;njost kuæe, koja se sastoji od 4 kata, èine 3 spavaæe sobe, (2 unutar glavne kuæe i 1 kod ljetne kuhinje), a ukupni stambeni prostor iznosi 140 m2.&nbsp;Jedna od spavaæih soba ima i vlastitu kupaonicu i balkon s pogledom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U stra¾njem dijelu kuæe je terasa u hladu vinove loze za objedovanje na otvorenom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je kupljena 2007. godine i potpuno renovirana na naèin da su oèuvani svi tradicionalni detalji. Svi kuhinjski aparati i klima ureðaji u sobama su u potpunosti novi.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je savr&scaron;ena za osobnu upotrebu ili kao investiciju.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa se prodaje u potpunosti namje&scaron;tena, osim nekoliko osobnih stvari koje æe vlasnik zadr¾ati.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za obilazak ove nekretnine nazovite na&scaron; ured na otoku Hvaru.</p>', '<p>Restored house in HVAR inland village 4 k from the sea.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>We are pleased to  offer this restored traditional old stone house with 3 bedrooms and 2  bathroom, and with interesting views across the village to the sea from the  upper floors.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property has a large garden at the rear.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Inside the  house, which is over 4 floors there are 3 bedrooms, (2 inside the main house  and 1 attached to the ''summer kitchen''). And the total space inside is 140 m  sq.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Inside this private villa is a master suite with ensuite bath and private balcony. It has a second large bathroom with two additional  bedrooms. At the rear of the property is a terrace shaded by vines for  outdoor dining. Inside is designed to be comfortable open plan living area  with a modern kitchen, dining table, and sitting area.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>House was  purchased in 2007 and completely renovated to exquisite detail in the  traditional stone house style with modern amenities including all kitchen  appliances and air conditioning units in the bedrooms.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Unfinished stone  walls, sea views, and the peaceful surrounding of the village are the  foundation for a restful and special home.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>House is perfect for personal  use or as an investment.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The rental history since renovation is strong and  the quiet nature of the surroundings makes it the perfect getaway for the  owner.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>House will be sold furnished minus a few personal items to be  retained by the current owner.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Clear ownership and parcel  documents. Letting license received in 2012.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>To visit please call our  office and meet our representative on Hvar island.</p>', '', '863_Old-stone-house_0.jpg', '863_Old-stone-house_1.jpg', '863_Old-stone-house_2.jpg', '863_Old-stone-house_3.jpg', '863_Old-stone-house_4.jpg', '863_Old-stone-house_5.jpg', '863_Old-stone-house_6.jpg', '863_Old-stone-house_7.jpg', '863_Old-stone-house_8.jpg'),
(864, 'Jadranka', 'Bo¾ikoviæ', '', '', '', 'Hvar', 'Rudina, Stari Grad', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '500', '1340', '120', 2, '139000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 3, 1, 'September 21, 2014', '<p>Kuæa u selu na sjevernoj strani otoka Hvara u blizini mora i lijepih pla¾a. Stambena povr&scaron;ina objekta je 120 m2. Povr&scaron;ina parcele je 1340 m2. Ima privatnost i mir. Vlasnik u stvari prodaje kuæu kao graðevinsko zemlji&scaron;te i to za atraktivnu cijenu od samo 100/Eura po m2.</p>', '<p>We are offering this fabulous opportunity to purchase a house in need of complete renovation, for the price of the land plot alone. It is situated in a village on the north side of the island near the sea where there are some beautiful beaches. The living area of the building is 120 m2. The plot is 1340 m sq, very large for one villa.</p>', '', '<p>Kuæa u selu na sjevernoj strani otoka Hvara u blizini mora i lijepih pla¾a.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Stambena povr&scaron;ina objekta je 120 m2. U postupku je legalizacije.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Povr&scaron;ina parcele je 1340 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæi je potreban zavr&scaron;etak odnosno renovacija/rekonstrukcija, ali se nalazi na odliènom mjestu i na velikoj parceli u blizini svih sadr¾aja.&nbsp;Ima privatnost i mir.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ima pristup vozilom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Selo u kojem se kuæa nalazi je jedino selo na otoku Hvaru gdje se do mora i pla¾a mo¾e stiæi laganom &scaron;etnjom kroz prirodu za svega 10-ak minuta.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Vlasnik u stvari prodaje kuæu kao graðevinsko zemlji&scaron;te i to za atraktivnu cijenu od samo 100/Eura po m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za detaljnije informacije CPS - Hvar ured stoji Vam na usluzi.</p>', '<p>We are offering this fabulous opportunity to purchase a house in need of complete renovation, for the price of the land plot alone.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is  situated in a village on the north side of the island near the sea where  there are some beautiful beaches.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The living area of the building is 120  m2. The plot is 1340 m sq, very large for one villa.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>We are in the  process of completing the paper work, ready for a sale within a few  months.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house needs complete renovation and / reconstruction but is in a very quiet and secluded location.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There is road access and parking on  the plot.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The beach can be reached by an easy walk through nature in just 10  minutes.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The owner is actually selling this property as a building site  and for an attractive price of only 100 / Euros per m2!!</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please  contact our Hvar office for more information.</p>', '', '864_House-Villa_0.jpg', '864_House-Villa_1.jpg', '864_House-Villa_2.jpg', '864_House-Villa_3.jpg', '864_House-Villa_4.jpg', '864_House-Villa_5.jpg', '864_House-Villa_6.jpg', '864_House-Villa_7.jpg', '864_House-Villa_8.jpg'),
(865, 'Sanjin', 'Iliæ', '', '', 'sanjin07@yahoo.com', 'Hvar', 'Grad Hvar', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '300', '0', '54', 1, '140000', '', 2, 1, 2, 2, 1, 2, 2, 1, 'September 21, 2014', '<p>Moderni dvosobni apartman u gradu Hvaru sa prekrasnim  pogledom!&nbsp;Orijentacija je jug-zapad sa pogledom na more, Paklene otoke,  otok Vis i&nbsp;zalazak sunca.&nbsp;Apartman je novogradnja, ukupne stambene  povr&scaron;ine 46 m2 plus natkriveni<br />balkon od 8m2.&nbsp;Kompletno je namje&scaron;ten i  opremljen.</p>', '<p>We are pleased to be offering this newly constructed two bedroom apartment in a superior block with commanding views across the old town and harbour. The apartment is light and airy with a south west orientation overlooking the sea, Pakleni islands, Vis island and sunset. The apartment is newly built, with a total living area of &#8203;&#8203;46 m2 plus covered balcony of 8m2. It is fully furnished and equipped. 300 meters from the sea and beaches.</p>', '', '<p>Moderni dvosobni apartman u gradu Hvaru sa prekrasnim  pogledom!</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Orijentacija je jug-zapad sa pogledom na more, Paklene otoke,  otok Vis i&nbsp;zalazak sunca.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartman je novogradnja, ukupne stambene  povr&scaron;ine 46 m2 plus natkriveni&nbsp;balkon od 8m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kompletno je namje&scaron;ten i  opremljen.</p>', '<p>We are pleased to be offering this newly constructed two bedroom apartment  in a superior block with commanding views across the old town and  harbour.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The apartment is light and airy with a south west orientation overlooking the sea, Pakleni islands, Vis island and sunset.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The  apartment is newly built, with a total living area of &#8203;&#8203;46 m2 plus covered  balcony of 8m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The block itself was designed and built to a very high  specification, with wide stone stairs, attractive facade and landscaped  environment.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is fully furnished and equipped.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>300 meters from the  sea and beaches.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact the office in Hvar to arrange to visit  this property.</p>', '', '865_Apartment_0.jpg', '865_Apartment_1.jpg', '865_Apartment_2.jpg', '865_Apartment_3.jpg', '865_Apartment_4.jpg', '865_Apartment_5.jpg', '865_Apartment_6.jpg', '865_Apartment_7.jpg', '865_Apartment_8.jpg'),
(866, 'Vedrana', 'Solaja', '+914801009', '', 'Vedrana.solaja@gmail.com', 'Hvar', 'Stari Grad -Hvar', 'For sale', 'Old stone house', '40', '100', '250', 1, '600000', '', 2, 2, 2, 1, 1, 2, 0, 0, 'September 21, 2014', '<p>Investicijski projekt /stambeno-poslovni objekt/ u centru mjesta sa&nbsp;ishoðenom graðevinskom dozvolom! Nalazi se u samom centru mjesta, udaljenost od mora cca 40m. Nakon izgradnje prema projektu, kuæa bi imala ukupnu stambenu povr&scaron;inu&nbsp;250 m2 (projekcija u prilogu).</p>', '<p>We are offering this substantial development project for the rebuilding&nbsp;of a residential-business premises in a prime location in the centre of&nbsp;the town. The harbour front and sea is just 40 m away. It has all the necessary permits for reconstruction according to the&nbsp;project and copies are available on request. The completed building will have a total surface of 250 m2.</p>', '', '<p>Investicijski projekt /stambeno-poslovni objekt/ u centru mjesta sa&nbsp;ishoðenom graðevinskom dozvolom!</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nalazi se u samom centru mjesta, udaljenost od mora cca 40m.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Posjeduje sve potrebne dozvole za rekonstrukciju prema projektu /kojeg&nbsp;&scaron;aljemo na upit/.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Podmirena sva davanja (osim jednog dijela struje koja se plaæa tijekom&nbsp;graðevinskih radova).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>S obzirom na lo&scaron;e stanje i veliku moguænost uru&scaron;avanja, ru&scaron;enje&nbsp;objekta je veæ napravljeno, te objekt sada ima samo kameni dio kao na&nbsp;slikama.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nakon izgradnje prema projektu, kuæa bi imala ukupnu stambenu povr&scaron;inu&nbsp;250 m2 (projekcija u prilogu).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>PRIZEMLJE:</p>\r\n<p>- 2 prodajna prostora</p>\r\n<p>- recepcija</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>PRVI KAT:&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>- 2 apartmana s pogledom na grad i more i izlazom na terasu</p>\r\n<p>- 1 apartman s dvori&scaron;ne strane</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>DRUGI KAT:</p>\r\n<p>- 2 apartmana s pogledom na grad i more</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>POTKROVLJE:</p>\r\n<p>- 1 apartman</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Vlasnik je zainteresiran i za poslovnu suradnju, tj. partnerstvo na&nbsp;ovom projektu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za detaljnije informacije i obilazak nekretnine CPS Hvar ured Vam&nbsp;stoji na usluzi.</p>', '<p>We are offering this substantial development project for the rebuilding&nbsp;of a residential-business premises in a prime location in the centre of&nbsp;the town.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The harbour front and sea is just 40 m away.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It has all the necessary permits for reconstruction according to the&nbsp;project and copies are available on request.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Given the poor state of the original structure, work has taken place to&nbsp;make it safe and the site has largely been cleared.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The completed building will have a total surface of 250 m2 (projection&nbsp;attached).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>GROUND FLOOR:</p>\r\n<p>- 2 shops/any sales area</p>\r\n<p>- reception</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>FIRST FLOOR:</p>\r\n<p>- 2 apartments with views of the town and the sea, with the access to&nbsp;the terrace</p>\r\n<p>- 1 apartment on the back side</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>SECOND FLOOR:</p>\r\n<p>- 2 apartments with views of the city and the sea</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>LOFT:</p>\r\n<p>- 1 apartment</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The owner is interested in business cooperation, ie. partnership on&nbsp;this project.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For more information and a tour of Hvar real estate CPS office is at&nbsp;your service.</p>', '', '866_Old-stone-house_0.jpg', '866_Old-stone-house_1.jpg', '', '', '', '', '', '', '');
INSERT INTO `nekretnina` (`id`, `ime`, `prezime`, `telefon`, `mobitel`, `e_mail`, `lokacija_id`, `adresa`, `status_id`, `vrsta_id`, `udaljenost`, `povrsina`, `stambenapovrsina`, `display`, `cijena`, `cijenatocka`, `ponuda_tjedna`, `new_built`, `must_sell`, `prvi_red_do_mora`, `pogled_na_more`, `bazen`, `broj_soba`, `broj_kupatila`, `datum`, `title_hr`, `title_en`, `title_ge`, `opis_hr`, `opis_en`, `opis_ge`, `PropertyImageURL0`, `PropertyImageURL1`, `PropertyImageURL2`, `PropertyImageURL3`, `PropertyImageURL4`, `PropertyImageURL5`, `PropertyImageURL6`, `PropertyImageURL7`, `PropertyImageURL8`) VALUES
(867, 'Boris', 'Tomiæ', '', '', '', 'Brac', 'Supetar', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '100', '150', '120', 1, '260000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 4, 2, 'September 21, 2014', '<p>Dvojna kuæa na dvije eta¾e smje&scaron;tena u&nbsp;mirnom dijelu, u neposrednoj blizini pla¾e i samo 5 minuta hoda do centra mjesta. Kuæa ima 120m2 stambene povr&scaron;ine sa 4 spavaæe sobe. Kompletno namje&scaron;teno i u funkciji. Klimatizirano.</p>', '<p>We are pleased to offer this affordable 4 bedroom villa near the village&nbsp;centre in Supetar. It is a semi detached house on 2 floors. The garden is in the front of the house where there is parking, and at&nbsp;the rear is an enclosed patio with BBQ grill. It is situated 100 m from the centre of the village and 80 m from the&nbsp;harbour.</p>', '', '<p>Dvojna kuæa na dvije eta¾e smje&scaron;tena u&nbsp;mirnom dijelu, u neposrednoj blizini pla¾e i samo 5 minuta hoda do centra mjesta.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Prizemlje se sastoji od hodnika i stepeni&scaron;ta za na kat, 1 spavaæa soba, kupaonica, sprema, dnevni boravak s kuhinjom, blagovaonicom i izlazom na terasu s kaminom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na katu su 3 spavaæe sobe, kupaonica i terasa.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Podovi su keramièke ploèice i parket u sobama.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kompletno namje&scaron;teno i u funkciji. Klimatizirano.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Okuænicu èini prednje donje dvori&scaron;te s parkingom, te stra¾nje sjenovito zatvoreno dvori&scaron;te s kaminom.</p>', '<p>We are pleased to offer this affordable 4 bedroom villa near the village&nbsp;centre in Supetar.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is a semi detached house on 2 floors.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The ground floor consists of a hallway and stairs to the first floor, 1&nbsp;bedroom, bathroom, storage room, living room with kitchen, dining room&nbsp;and terrace with fireplace.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Upstairs are three bedrooms, bathroom and terrace.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The floors are ceramic tile and the property comes fully furnished and&nbsp;functional.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It has many mod cons, such as air on etc.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The garden is in the front of the house where there is parking, and at&nbsp;the rear is an enclosed patio with BBQ grill.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is situated 100 m from the centre of the village and 80 m from the&nbsp;harbour.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There are regular ferries to Split, and this beautiful village has many&nbsp;options for bars and shops etc and is popular with tourists for obvious&nbsp;reasons.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact our office for more information.</p>', '', '867_House-Villa_0.jpg', '867_House-Villa_1.jpg', '867_House-Villa_2.jpg', '867_House-Villa_3.jpg', '867_House-Villa_4.jpg', '867_House-Villa_5.jpg', '867_House-Villa_6.jpg', '867_House-Villa_7.jpg', '867_House-Villa_8.jpg'),
(868, 'Boris', 'Tomiæ', '', '', '', 'Brac', 'Supetar', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '200', '0', '47', 1, '85000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 2, 1, 'September 21, 2014', '<p>Dvosoban stan na prvom katu u vi&scaron;estambenoj zgradi. Apartman je povr&scaron;ine 47 m2 i sastoji se od dnevnog boravka s balkonom, blagovaonice, kuhinje, &nbsp;kupaonice, 2 spavaæe sobe + 3 m2 sprema u prizemlju. Od pla¾a je udaljen 200 metara te pet minuta hoda od centra mjesta, gdje se nalaze svi potrebni sadr¾aji. Kvalitetno graðeno, solidno opremljen, namje&scaron;ten i u funkciji.</p>', '<p>We are offering this attractive and affordable apartment in Supetar, measuring 47 m2. It is located on the first floor of a well positioned block just 5 minutes from the town centre and harbour in this very attractive Dalmatian village. It has an excellent sea view from the apartment, and balcony. This apartment is well built, well equipped, well furnished and functional.</p>', '', '<p>Dvosoban stan na prvom katu u vi&scaron;estambenoj zgradi.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartman je povr&scaron;ine 47 m2 i sastoji se od dnevnog boravka s balkonom, blagovaonice, kuhinje, &nbsp;kupaonice, 2 spavaæe sobe + 3 m2 sprema u prizemlju.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Od pla¾a je udaljen 200 metara te pet minuta hoda od centra mjesta, gdje se nalaze svi potrebni sadr¾aji: restorani, barovi, tr¾nice, banka, po&scaron;tanski ured, trajektna luka.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sjeveroistoèna orijentacija. Odlièan pristup, svijetao, s odliènim pogledom na more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Podovi keramièke ploèice, braèki kamen na balkonskoj ogradi. Klima ureðaj za hlaðenje i grijanje. PVC fasadna stolarija.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kvalitetno graðeno, solidno opremljen, namje&scaron;ten i u funkciji.</p>', '<p>We are offering this attractive and affordable apartment in Supetar.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It  is located on the first floor of a well positioned block just 5 minutes from the  town centre and harbour in this very attractive Dalmatian village.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It  consists of: 47 m2 (living room with balcony, dining room, kitchen, bathroom, 2  bedrooms) + 3 m2 storage at the ground.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The balcony faces north east.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It  has an excellent sea view from the apartment, and balcony.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The flat is well  designed and bright, with large windows.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It has PVC doors and windows, air  con, and other attractive features such as high quality flooring and Brac stone balcony.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>This apartment is well built, well equipped, well furnished and  functional.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact our office to arrange to visit this  property.</p>', '', '868_Apartment_0.jpg', '868_Apartment_1.jpg', '868_Apartment_2.jpg', '868_Apartment_3.jpg', '868_Apartment_4.jpg', '868_Apartment_5.jpg', '868_Apartment_6.jpg', '868_Apartment_7.jpg', ''),
(869, 'Stipe', 'Mu¾iniæ', '', '095 907 46 33', 'Stipe.muzinic@gmail.com', 'Rogoznica', 'O¹trièka luka, 13710/1 Sevid', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '15', '350', '180', 1, '490000', '', 2, 2, 2, 1, 1, 2, 5, 3, 'September 24, 2014', '<p>Samostojeæa kuæa, 1.red do mora smje&scaron;tena u mirnoj uvali nedaleko od Rogoznice. Obnovljena je u potpunosti 2014. godine. Povr&scaron;ina kuæe je 180 m2 (sa terasama), a sastoji se od 3 apartmana: 2 jednosobna i 1 dvosobni. S kuæe se pru¾a pogled na more. Lijepo ureðen vrt mediteranskim biljem pru¾a moguænost idiliènog odmora. Povr&scaron;ina parcele iznosi 348 m2.</p>', '<p>We are offering this renovated shore side house in a typically quiet bay. It is situated only yards from the waters edge, on the edge of a bay near the village of Rogoznica, which is 20 minutes north of Trogir. It is a detached property, and the entire house was completely rebuilt in 2014, redecorated and refitted with modern fittings and features. The house is 180 m sq, including the terraces, and the entire plot is 348 m sq.</p>', '', '<p>Samostojeæa kuæa, 1.red do mora smje&scaron;tena u mirnoj uvali nedaleko od Rogoznice.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je smje&scaron;tena uz samo more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Obnovljena je u potpunosti 2014. godine.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Povr&scaron;ina kuæe je 180 m2 (sa terasama). Kuæa je u potpunosti opremljena. U njoj se nalaze 3 apartmana: 2 jednosobna i 1 dvosobni.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>S kuæe se pru¾a pogled na more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ispred kuæe nalazi se mala sjenica povr&scaron;ine 20m2. Uz kuæu se nalazi kamin.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Lijepo ureðen vrt mediteranskim biljem pru¾a moguænost idiliènog odmora.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Povr&scaron;ina parcele iznosi 348 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa raspola¾e vlastitim parkingom.</p>', '<p>We are offering this renovated shore side house in a typically quiet  bay.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is situated only yards from the waters edge, on the edge of a bay near the village of Rogoznica, which is 20 minutes north of  Trogir.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is a detached property, and the entire house was completely  rebuilt in 2014, redecorated and refitted with modern fittings and  features.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house is 180 m sq, including the terraces, and the entire plot  is 348 m sq.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house is divided into 3 separate apartments, 2 with one  bedroom and the other with two bedrooms.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There are superb sea views  of the sea from the balconies and windows throughout the house.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There is  a 20 m sq patio area, with a shaded cover, and an excellent BBQ grill.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The remainder of the garden has been well planted with  Mediterranean plants, requiring little attention throughout the  summer.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house has it''s own off street parking area.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nearby, in the  village, are many useful and attractive small bars, coffee shops,  restaurants and shops with useful services.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The airport is about 20 minutes  drive and the bigger town of Split is 40 minutes.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact our  Split office to arrange a visit.</p>', '', '869_House-Villa_0.jpg', '869_House-Villa_1.jpg', '869_House-Villa_2.jpg', '869_House-Villa_3.jpg', '869_House-Villa_4.jpg', '869_House-Villa_5.jpg', '869_House-Villa_6.jpg', '', ''),
(870, 'Josip', 'Dragun', '', '099 815 71 73', 'josip.dragun@gmail.com', 'Rogoznica', 'Ljoljinica, 7873/55 K.O. Sevid', 'For sale', 'Land plot', '70', '0', '505', 2, '100000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 0, 0, 'September 24, 2014', '<p>Graðevinsko zemlji&scaron;te u vrlo mirnoj i atraktivnoj uvali nedaleko od Rogoznice. Zemlji&scaron;te je udaljeno svega 70 metara od mora te ima prekrasan pogled na uvalu i otvoreno more. Povr&scaron;ina zemlji&scaron;ta je 505 m2. Parcela je smje&scaron;tena u graðevinskoj zoni gdje je dozvoljena gradnja. Na parceli se mo¾e graditi objekt maksimalne tlocrtne povr&scaron;ine 151 m2 i maksimalne katnosti: prizemlje + 2 kata.</p>', '<p>Building land plot in great location in a quiet and attractive bay near Rogoznica village. The land is located only 70 meters from the sea and has a beautiful view of the bay and the open sea. The land area is 505 m2. The plot is located in a construction zone where construction is allowed. The plot can be built with facility maximum layout area 151 sq m and maximum number of floors: ground floor + 2 floors.</p>', '', '<p>Graðevinsko zemlji&scaron;te u vrlo mirnoj i atraktivnoj uvali nedaleko od Rogoznice.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Zemlji&scaron;te je udaljeno svega 70 metara od mora te ima prekrasan pogled na uvalu i otvoreno more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Povr&scaron;ina zemlji&scaron;ta je 505 m2, a dimenzije su:</p>\r\n<p>- strana prema moru (zapadna) 27,71 m</p>\r\n<p>- nasuprotna strana 36,13 m (istoèna)</p>\r\n<p>- boèna ju¾na strana 18,42 m</p>\r\n<p>- boèna sjeverna strana 15,59 m.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Parcela je smje&scaron;tena u graðevinskoj zoni gdje je dozvoljena gradnja. Na parceli se mo¾e graditi objekt maksimalne tlocrtne povr&scaron;ine 151 m2 i maksimalne katnosti: prizemlje + 2 kata.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>S obzirom na gore navedeno maksimalna kvadratura kuæe bi mogla biti 450 m2 (naravno kvadratura mo¾e biti i manja ovisno o ¾eljama).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Do samog zemlji&scaron;ta postoji kolni pristup.</p>\r\n<p>Voda i struja su na samoj parceli.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Imajuæi u vidu cijenu ove nekretnine i polo¾aj parcele, ovo je trenutno jedna od atraktivnijih graðevinskih parcela u blizini Rogoznice.</p>', '<p>Building land plot in great location in a quiet and attractive bay near Rogoznica village.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The land is located only 70 meters from the sea  and has a beautiful view of the bay and the open sea.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The land area  is 505 m2, and the dimensions are:</p>\r\n<p>- side to the sea (west) 27.71 m</p>\r\n<p>- opposite side 36,13 m (east)</p>\r\n<p>- south side 18.42 m</p>\r\n<p>- north side of 15,59  m.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The plot is located in a construction zone where construction is allowed. The plot can be built with facility maximum layout area 151 sq m and maximum number of floors: ground floor + 2 floors.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Given the  above, the maximum square footage of the house could be 450 m2&nbsp;(of course  surface area can be less, depending on preference).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There is vehicular  access to the property.</p>\r\n<p>There is water and electricity on the  plot.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact the office about the purchase of this land, or about details regarding building.</p>', '', '870_Land-plot_0.jpg', '870_Land-plot_1.jpg', '870_Land-plot_2.jpg', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(871, 'Melita i Ivica', 'Lovriæ', '099 8064649', '091 730 40 30', 'gajeta340@hotmail.com', 'Rogoznica', 'Rogoznica, Obala Kneza Domagoja 132, K.è. 177/1 i k.è. 177/2', 'For sale', 'Old stone house', '20', '0', '123', 1, '258000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 5, 2, 'September 24, 2014', '<p>Prekrasna stara kuæa iz 1763. godine u potpunosti renovirana u samom centru mjesta. Renovirana je u skladu s preporukama konzervatora te je u njoj saèuvan izvorni raspored starih dalmatinskih kuæa. Sastoji se od prizemlja, dva kata i potkrovlja, ukupne stambene povr&scaron;ine 123 m2. Svega je 20 metara udaljena od mora i ima pogled na more.</p>\r\n<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;">CIJENA SNI®ENA S 321.000 EURO!</span></p>', '<p>Croatia Property Sales are pleased to offer this preserved and restored Dalmatian house from 1763, in the centre of the village. The building was so unspoilt that the restoration project was undertaken with recommendations from the conservators and was done using the highest quality materials to completely preserve the spirit of the house. Total living area is 123 m2. It consists of a ground floor, two floors and an attic.</p>\r\n<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;">PRICE REDUCED FROM 321.000 EURO!</span></p>', '', '<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;"><strong>CIJENA SNI®ENA S 321.000 EURO!</strong></span></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Prekrasna stara kuæa iz 1763. godine u potpunosti renovirana u samom centru mjesta.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa s oèuvanim dalmatinskim duhom i vlastitom dalmatinskom kaletom ispred kuæe, pru¾a moguænost odmora i do¾ivljaja nekada&scaron;nje Dalmacije.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Renovirana je u skladu s preporukama konzervatora te je u njoj saèuvan izvorni raspored starih dalmatinskih kuæa. Obnovljena je koristeæi kvalitetne materijale.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa sa kosim dvostre&scaron;nim krovom, vanjske visine 8,74 m, a tlocrtne du¾ine i &scaron;irine 6,46 m X 6,42 m. Sastoji se od prizemlja, dva kata i potkrovlja.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Iz kalete se ulazi u prostoriju koja slu¾i kao dnevni boravak, kojem posebnu toplinu u zimskim danima pru¾a peæ na drva, dok tijekom ljeta zahvaljujuæi debelim zidovima od 0,50 m pru¾a izniman hlad. Pored su kupaonica i WC.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na prvi kat se ide drvenim stepenicama i tu se nalaze dvije spavaæe sobe.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Drugi kat je u potpunosti otvorena prostorija u kojoj je u spomen na dalmatinske stare kuæe smje&scaron;tena velika kuhinja i blagovaona. Posebnost ove prostorije je i veliki prozor s kamenom klupicom za sjedenje ispod njega odakle se pru¾a pogled na more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Drvenim stepenicama penje se na galeriju koja je jo&scaron; jedna soba s krovnim prozorom za one vi&scaron;e i prekrasnim pogledom na more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je prikljuèena na struju, gradski vodovod i gradsku kanalizaciju.</p>', '<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;"><strong>PRICE REDUCED FROM 321.000 EURO!</strong></span></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Croatia Property Sales are pleased to offer this preserved and restored  Dalmatian house from 1763, in the centre of the village.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The building was  so unspoilt that the restoration project was undertaken with recommendations  from the conservators and was done using the highest quality materials to  completely preserve the spirit of the house.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>In front of the property is a  stone alley leading directly to the harbour.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The traditional layout of  the property was retained, and the end result is a house with a wonderfully  relaxing feel.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The House has a sloping gable roof, with an exterior height of  over 7m and the layout footprint measures 6.46 m X 6.42 m.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Total living  area is 123 m2. It consists of a ground floor, two floors and an  attic.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;">Ground floor:</span><span style="text-decoration: underline;">&nbsp;</span>from the street you enter the room that serves as  living room, where a special warmth is provided by a wood stove, while during  the property is kept cool through the summer by walls of 0.50 m. There is also a  bathroom and toilet.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;">Wooden stairs lead to the first floor</span><span style="text-decoration: underline;">&nbsp;</span>where there  are two bedrooms.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;">The second floor</span> is one completely open plan kitchen  and dining room, like the original Dalmatian residents had, and a special  feature of this room is a large window with a stone bench seating underneath,  offering a view of the village and the sea.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;">A wooden staircase ascends to  the gallery,</span> which is another room with skylight window/roof window  overlooking the sea.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house has electricity, city water and  telecoms.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There is parking in nearby streets.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The village is  popular with visitors who enjoy the quietness and retained charm, but it has  shops, and coffee bars and restaurants around the old harbour.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>A short walk  will take you to clean and unspoilt beaches which is safe for  swimming.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The larger town of Trogir is 20 minutes driving, and the  airport just 25 minutes from the property.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please call our Split office  to arrange a visit.</p>', '', '871_Old-stone-house_0.jpg', '871_Old-stone-house_1.jpg', '871_Old-stone-house_2.jpg', '871_Old-stone-house_3.jpg', '871_Old-stone-house_4.jpg', '871_Old-stone-house_5.jpg', '871_Old-stone-house_6.jpg', '871_Old-stone-house_7.jpg', '871_Old-stone-house_8.jpg'),
(872, 'Adela', 'Perliæ', '', '099/ 3013780', '', 'Rogoznica', 'Rogoznica', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '70', '100', '108', 1, '150000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 3, 2, 'September 24, 2014', '<p>Kuæa u starom dijelu Rogoznice, centar. Tlocrtne dimenzije kuæe su 6,5 m x 6,5 m, a ukupna povr&scaron;ina kuæe iznosi 108 m2.&nbsp;S terase i istoèno orijentiranih prozora pru¾a se pogled na more i uvalu Marina Frapa. Prvi kat èini jedna otvorena prostorija bez pregradnih zidova i Wc a na drugom katu se nalaze dvije sobe i kupaonica. Kuæa nije ureðena iznutra.</p>', '<p>We offer for sale this detached house in the old part of Rogoznica village centre. It is situated less than 100m from the edge of the water in the bay facing the marina. The terrace at the side of the building and the windows have attractive views across the village and to the marina. The house itself is a detached modern property with a footprint of 6.5 m x 6.5 m, a total living area of 108 square meters.</p>', '', '<p>Kuæa u starom dijelu Rogoznice, centar.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>S terase i istoèno orijentiranih prozora pru¾a se pogled na more i uvalu Marina Frapa.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Iako se u blizini nalaze kafiæi, restorani i trgovine ona svojim polo¾ajem pru¾a moguænost odmora u miru i ti&scaron;ini.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Tlocrtne dimenzije kuæe su 6,5 m x 6,5 m, a ukupna povr&scaron;ina kuæe iznosi 108 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Prvi kat èini jedna otvorena prostorija bez pregradnih zidova i Wc a na drugom katu se nalaze dvije sobe i kupaonica. Kuæa nije ureðena iznutra.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>S gornjeg balkona (&scaron;irine 1,5 m) pru¾a se pogled na uvalu kao i sa donje terase koja se pru¾a du¾ cijele istoène strane (&scaron;irine 3 m) te kao takva pru¾a idealno mjesto za boravak tijekom cijelog dana.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa trenutno nije prikljuèena na vodu i struju, ali je naravno moguæe ishoditi prikljuèke struje i vode.</p>', '<p>We offer for sale this detached house in the old part of Rogoznica village  centre.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is situated less than 100m from the edge of the water in the  bay facing the marina.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The terrace at the side of the building and the  windows have attractive views across the village and to the  marina.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house itself is a detached modern property with a footprint  of 6.5 m x 6.5 m, a total living area of 108 square meters. Plot area is 100  m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The first floor is designed as an open plan area of one open room with no interior walls apart from a toilet. The second floor has two bedrooms  and a bathroom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The interior of the house is not finished being  decorated.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Upper balcony (width 1.5 m) offers a view of the bay as well as  the lower terrace that stretches along the east side (of 3 m width) and as such provides an ideal place to stay during the day.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property is  currently not connected to water and electricity, but these services are in  the street and it doesn''t take long to organise.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The price reflects the need  to connect the services and complete the decorating.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property is  situated in the old part of the village, and there are shops, bars and  restaurants nearby.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>A short walk or drive outside the village brings you to  many near deserted beaches and private bays, so this beautiful part of the  coast can be fully enjoyed.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The main town of Trogir is 20 minutes  driving, and the airport less than 30 minutes.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For viewing please  contact our Split office.</p>', '', '872_House-Villa_0.jpg', '872_House-Villa_1.jpg', '872_House-Villa_2.jpg', '872_House-Villa_3.jpg', '872_House-Villa_4.jpg', '', '', '', ''),
(873, 'Slavica', 'Radiæ', '', '098 193 15 37 ', 'radicslavica@net.hr', 'Rogoznica', 'Stupin Èeline, 2853 Rogoznica', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '10', '570', '300', 2, '650000', '', 2, 2, 2, 1, 1, 2, 6, 4, 'September 24, 2014', '<p>Prekrasna kuæa s pogledom na uvalu, 1.red do mora. Nalazi se u mirnoj, za&scaron;tiæenoj uvali u blizini Rogoznice. Terase su ju¾no orijentirane i kao otvoreni dnevni boravci imaju pogled na uvalu. Okuænica je lijepo ureðeni vrt, velièine 500 m2 i ima direktni izlaz na &scaron;ljunkovitu pla¾u ispred kuæe. Stambena povr&scaron;ina kuæe je 300m2.</p>', '<p>A beautiful house overlooking the bay, in the first line to the sea! Located in a quiet, sheltered bay on the mainland, near Rogoznica. The terraces are south facing and they function as an extra outdoor&nbsp;room. The courtyard is a nice garden, measuring 500sq m and has direct&nbsp;access to a pebble beach just in front of the house. Total living area is 300sq m. The house has 5 parking spaces and 2 boat berths.</p>', '', '<p>Prekrasna kuæa s pogledom na uvalu, 1.red do mora.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nalazi se u mirnoj, za&scaron;tiæenoj uvali u blizini Rogoznice.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Terase su ju¾no orijentirane i kao otvoreni dnevni boravci imaju pogled na uvalu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Okuænica je lijepo ureðeni vrt, velièine 500 m2 i ima direktni izlaz na &scaron;ljunkovitu pla¾u ispred kuæe.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Stambena povr&scaron;ina kuæe je 300m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa se sastoji od podruma, prizemlja (jedan stan - 4 spavaæe sobe, 2 kupaonice) i kata (dva zasebna velika apartmana - svaki se sastoji od 1 spavaæe sobe, dnevnog boravka, kuhinje i kupaonice).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>I prizemlje i kat imaju lijepe velike terase.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa posjeduje i 5 mjesta za parkiranje te 2 veza za brod.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Dokumentacija je uredna. Vlasni&scaron;tvo 1/1.</p>', '<p>A beautiful house overlooking the bay, in the first line to the sea!</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Located in a quiet, sheltered bay on the mainland, near Rogoznica.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The terraces are south facing and they function as an extra outdoor&nbsp;room, with a BBQ grill, overlooking the bay.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The courtyard is a nice garden, measuring 500sq m and has direct&nbsp;access to a pebble beach just in front of the house.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Total living area is 300sq m.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house consists of a basement, ground floor (one apartment - 4&nbsp;bedrooms, 2 bathrooms) and 1st floor (two separate large apartments - bedroom, living room, kitchen and bathroom).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Both, ground floor and first floor have a nice outdoor terrace with a&nbsp;sea view.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house has 5 parking spaces and 2 boat berths.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>This is a great example of a modern waterside property and they rarely&nbsp;come for sale.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The documentation is clear.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The airport is only 20 minutes, and the larger town of Trogir, the same&nbsp;distance.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please speak to the office for more information and to arrange to view&nbsp;this property.</p>', '', '873_House-Villa_0.jpg', '873_House-Villa_1.jpg', '873_House-Villa_2.jpg', '873_House-Villa_3.jpg', '873_House-Villa_4.jpg', '873_House-Villa_5.jpg', '873_House-Villa_6.jpg', '873_House-Villa_7.jpg', '873_House-Villa_8.jpg'),
(874, 'Zdenko', 'Kisièek', '', '098/248308', 'tamara.kisicek@gmail.com', 'Rogoznica', 'Centar Rogoznica', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '50', '0', '72', 1, '99000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 'September 27, 2014', '<p>Kuæa u centru Rogoznice, udaljena svega 50 metara od mora. Kuæa je smje&scaron;tena u mirnoj i tihoj ulici i stoga je idealna za odmor od gradske buke. Sastoji se od dva apartmana svaki sa svojim ulazom.&nbsp;Apartmani su velièine 36 m2. Kuæa je prikljuèena na struju, gradski vodovod i kanalizaciju.</p>', '<p>We are pleased to offer this excellent value property in the center of Rogoznica, completely renovated and very close to the sea. The house is situated in a quiet street, away from the noise of cars, but walking distance from the village, and 50m to the sea shore. It has total living area of 72sq m and consists of two apartments. Each apartment is 36sq m and has its own entrance.</p>', '', '<p>Kuæa u centru Rogoznice, udaljena svega 50 metara od mora.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je smje&scaron;tena u mirnoj i tihoj ulici i stoga je idealna za odmor od gradske buke.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Graðena je prije 1968. godine, ali je u potpunosti obnovljena.&nbsp;Sastoji se od dva apartmana svaki sa svojim ulazom.&nbsp;Apartmani su velièine 36 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U prizemlju s terase se ulazi u kuhinju i blagovaonu, a odatle s jedne strane u kupaonicu a s druge u spavaæu sobu.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Vanjskim stepenicama s terase se dolazi na kat na kojem je velika natkrivena terasa na kojoj se nalazi kamin. S terase se ulazi u sobu s kupaonicom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je prikljuèena na struju, gradski vodovod i kanalizaciju.</p>\r\n<p>Ima svu potrebnu dokumentaciju.</p>', '<p>We are pleased to offer this excellent value property in the center of Rogoznica, completely renovated and very close to the sea.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house is  situated in a quiet street, away from the noise of cars, but walking  distance from the village, and 50m to the sea shore.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house was built  before 1968., but has recently been fully restored to a very high  standard.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It has total living area of 72sq m and consists of two  apartments.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Each apartment is 36sq m and has its own entrance.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The  ground floor terrace leads into the kitchen and dining area, bathroom and  one bedroom.&nbsp;An outside staircase leads from the terrace to the first floor  where there is a large covered terrace with a fireplace for a BBQ  grill. From the terrace there is a entrance to another bedroom with a  bathroom.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The decorating and fittings are new and the property ready for  habitation.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house has electricity, city water and is attached to the main  drains.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact our Split office for more information.</p>', '', '874_House-Villa_0.jpg', '874_House-Villa_1.jpg', '874_House-Villa_2.jpg', '874_House-Villa_3.jpg', '874_House-Villa_4.jpg', '874_House-Villa_5.jpg', '874_House-Villa_6.jpg', '874_House-Villa_7.jpg', ''),
(875, '', 'Emko graðenje d.o.o.', 'Emin Had¾iomeroviæ', '099 677 82 14', 'Eminemko1@gmail.com', 'Rogoznica', 'Rogoznica, Lozica I br. 15, K.è. 1816 ', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '50', '0', '0', 1, '140000', '', 2, 1, 2, 2, 1, 2, 2, 2, 'September 27, 2014', '<p>Novoizgraðena apartmanska kuæa, 50 m od mora, u jednoj od najljep&scaron;ih uvala rogoznièke rivijere, s djelomiènim pogledom na more. Kuæa se sastoji od 3 apartmana - svaki ima vlastiti vanjski ulaz, a sadr¾i dvije spavaæe sobe, kupaonicu, wc i dnevni boravak s kuhinjom i blagovaonom.</p>\r\n<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;">Povr&scaron;ine apartmana od 93,66 - 117,55 m2, a cijena od 140.000 Eura do 160.000 Eura!</span></p>', '<p>We are pleased to present this newly built apartment block of three flats, each for sale separately, in one of the most beautiful bays in Rogoznica. It is situated just 50 m from the water, and close enough to walk to the nearest shops and coffee bar. Apartments are measuring from 93,66 m2 up to 117,55 m2!</p>\r\n<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;">Price 140k- 165k euro!</span></p>', '', '<p>Novoizgraðena apartmanska kuæa, 50 m od mora, u jednoj od najljep&scaron;ih uvala rogoznièke rivijere, s djelomiènim pogledom na more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Moguænost kupovine zasebno apartmana ili cijele kuæe.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Svaki apartman ima vlastiti vanjski ulaz, a sadr¾i dvije spavaæe sobe, kupaonicu, wc i dnevni boravak s kuhinjom i blagovaonom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartman u prizemlju koristi pripadajuæu okuænicu kao vanjski prostor, dok apartmani na katu imaju terase jugoistoène orijentacije s kojih se pru¾a pogled na more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong><span style="text-decoration: underline;">PRIZEMLJE</span></strong>: brutto povr&scaron;ina apartmana 117,55 m2 = <strong><span style="text-decoration: underline;">150.000 EURA</span></strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong><span style="text-decoration: underline;">1. KAT</span></strong>: brutto povr&scaron;ina apartmana 104,48 m2 = <strong><span style="text-decoration: underline;">140.000 EURA</span></strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong><span style="text-decoration: underline;">2. KAT</span></strong>: brutto povr&scaron;ina apartmana 93,66 m2 = <strong><span style="text-decoration: underline;">160.000 EURA</span></strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Moguænost kupovine gara¾e za dodatnih 10.000 Eura.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je izgraðena na parceli povr&scaron;ine 358 m2, te ima 315 m2 stambene povr&scaron;ine. Cijena cijele kuæe iznosi 410.000 Eura!</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Svaki apartman ima zasebno mjerilo struje i vode.</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa ima vlastitu septièku jamu.</p>', '<p>We are pleased to present this newly built apartment block of three flats, each  for sale separately, in one of the most beautiful bays in Rogoznica.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The  total land plot is 358m sq with residential area of 315m sq.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is  situated just 50 m from the water, and close enough to walk to the nearest shops  and coffee bar.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The largest major town is Trogir and this is 20 minutes  drive, while the airport is less than 30 minutes away.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The sea here is  wonderfully clear and clean, and this area is increasingly popular with tourists  who value, peace and quiet and having quick access from the airport.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Each  apartment is similar, with two bedrooms, and a modern open plan kitchen and  lounge, exactly what modern families and tourists are looking for. Each  apartment has a terrace or balcony facing south east and with sea  views.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The <strong><span style="text-decoration: underline;">GROUND FLOOR</span></strong> is 117m sq and is valued at <strong><span style="text-decoration: underline;">150.000 EURO!</span></strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The <strong><span style="text-decoration: underline;">FIRST FLOOR</span></strong> is 104m sq and is <strong><span style="text-decoration: underline;">140.000 EURO!</span></strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The <strong><span style="text-decoration: underline;">TOP FLOOR</span></strong> is 93m sq and is  <strong><span style="text-decoration: underline;">160.000 EURO!</span></strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There is an opportunity to purchase a garage at 10k.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>All the  services are separate to each property and they share a septic tank.</p>\r\n<p>There  are 3 parking spaces attached to the plot.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;">Interested purchasers can  buy all three properties for a discounted price of 410k euro.</span></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please  contact CPS -office for more information or to arrange a viewing.</p>', '', '875_Apartment_0.jpg', '875_Apartment_1.jpg', '875_Apartment_2.jpg', '875_Apartment_3.jpg', '875_Apartment_4.jpg', '875_Apartment_5.jpg', '875_Apartment_6.jpg', '875_Apartment_7.jpg', '875_Apartment_8.jpg'),
(876, 'Damir', 'Poljak', '0994210411', '', '', 'Hvar', 'Gromin Dolac', 'For sale', 'Old stone house', '60', '670', '65', 1, '189000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 1, 3, 2, 'September 27, 2014', '<p>Imanje na ju¾noj strani otoka Hvara s dvije odvojene kuæice ukupne povr&scaron;ine od 65m2 i lijepom okuænicom. Posjed je ograðen kamenim zidom unutar kojeg su smje&scaron;tene dvije kuæice s odliènim, panoranskim pogledom na more. Na imanju je bazen, svega 60 metara od mora. Idealno za najam u pravcu Robinzonskog turizma ili kao kuæa za odmor. Mir i osama!</p>\r\n<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;">CIJENA SNI®ENA SA 199.000 EUR!!</span></p>', '<p>We are offering this property on the south side of the island that is two separate stone houses with internal area of 65 m sq, and a lovely garden, just off the sea shore. The property is surrounded by a stone wall, and within are two houses with excellent, panoramic sea views. The sea is only 60 meters from here. The area is unimaginably peaceful, just the noises from nature to enjoy.</p>\r\n<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;">PRICE REDUCED FROM 199.000 EUR!!</span></p>', '', '<p><strong><span style="text-decoration: underline;">CIJENA SNI®ENA SA 199.000 EUR!!</span></strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Imanje na ju¾noj strani otoka Hvara s dvije odvojene kuæice ukupne povr&scaron;ine od 65m2 i lijepom okuænicom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Posjed je ograðen kamenim zidom unutar kojeg su smje&scaron;tene dvije kuæice s odliènim, panoranskim pogledom na more.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na imanju je bazen, svega 60 metara od mora.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Do imanja postoji cesta ali nije asfaltirana.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Idealno za najam u pravcu Robinzonskog turizma ili kao kuæa za odmor.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Mir i osama!</p>', '<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;"><strong>PRICE REDUCED FROM 199.000 EUR!!</strong></span></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>We are offering this property on the south side of the island that is two  separate stone houses with internal area of 65 m sq, and a lovely garden,  just off the sea shore.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property is surrounded by a stone wall, and  within are two houses with excellent, panoramic sea views.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The sea is  only 60 meters from here.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The garden incorporates a small swimming pool,  a superb investment for attracting tourists, even when the property is so  close to the sea.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The access road is not paved but the property is easily  accessible with a normal vehicle, and in fact this seems to add to the  character.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The inside of the property is well decorated, and would be  ready for tourists or a private family holiday destination.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The area  is unimaginably peaceful, just the noises from nature to enjoy.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>To visit  please call our CPS -&nbsp; Hvar office.</p>', '', '876_Old-stone-house_0.jpg', '876_Old-stone-house_1.jpg', '876_Old-stone-house_2.jpg', '876_Old-stone-house_3.jpg', '876_Old-stone-house_4.jpg', '876_Old-stone-house_5.jpg', '876_Old-stone-house_6.jpg', '876_Old-stone-house_7.jpg', '876_Old-stone-house_8.jpg'),
(877, 'Ivan', 'Crnèiæ', '048/714518', '', '', 'Hvar', 'Basina, Hvar', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '800', '3400', '74', 1, '135000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 3, 1, 'September 27, 2014', '<p>Imanje/ranè na prodaju nedaleko od mora! Prizemna kuæa od 59 m2, novije gradnje, useljiva na velikom zemlji&scaron;tu od 3.400 m2. Na zemlji&scaron;tu je ucrtana i postojeæa kamena kuæica povr&scaron;ine 25 m2. Zemlji&scaron;te se nalazi na sjevernom dijelu otoka hvara u blizini mjesta Vrboska i od je mora svega 800 metara. Idealno za manju vilu s bazenom kojeg je sada po novom zakonu moguæe sagraditi do 100 m2 bez dozvole.</p>', '<p>This is a relatively small property, completely detached, on a land plot of 3,400m sq. The sea is only 800m from the property. The building is newly built, with 59 m sq of internal space, on the footprint of the original house. The land is located in the northern part of the island near Vrboska. It is legal to add to the building up to 50m sq, add a swimming pool, or other improvements/investments.</p>', '', '<p>Imanje/ranè na prodaju nedaleko od mora!</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Prizemna kuæa od 59 m2, novije gradnje, useljiva na velikom zemlji&scaron;tu od 3.400 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na zemlji&scaron;tu je ucrtana i postojeæa kamena kuæica povr&scaron;ine 25 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Zemlji&scaron;te se nalazi na sjevernom dijelu otoka hvara u blizini mjesta Vrboska i od je mora svega 800 metara.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ranè ima pristup automobilom, a zadnjih 150 metara je makadamska cesta.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ima prikljuèak vode, a struju i telefon je moguæe prikljuèiti.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Idealno za manju vilu s bazenom kojeg je sada po novom zakonu moguæe sagraditi do 100 m2 bez dozvole.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Takoðer je moguæe sagraditi pomoæni objekt do 50 m2.</p>', '<p>This is a relatively small property, completely detached, on a land plot of  3,400m sq.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The sea is only 800m from the property.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The building is  newly built, with 59 m sq of internal space, on the footprint of the  original house.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The land is located in the northern part of the island near  Vrboska, and the road that leads to the property becomes a gravel track for  the last 150m. It is manageable by ordinary cars.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is legal to add  to the building up to 50m sq, add a swimming pool, or other  improvements/investments.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It has water, while electricity and phone lines can  be connected.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact the office in Hvar for more details and to  arrange to visit this property.</p>', '', '877_House-Villa_0.jpg', '877_House-Villa_1.jpg', '877_House-Villa_2.jpg', '877_House-Villa_3.jpg', '877_House-Villa_4.jpg', '877_House-Villa_5.jpg', '877_House-Villa_6.jpg', '877_House-Villa_7.jpg', '877_House-Villa_8.jpg'),
(878, 'Darko', 'Medak', '', '', '', 'Hvar', 'grad Hvar, 845 zgr. K.O. Hvar', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '300', '100', '150', 1, '350000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 7, 7, 'September 27, 2014', '<p>Dio kuæe u Gradu Hvaru! Kuæa je podjeljena na dvije cijeline. Predmet prodaje je gornji dio kuæe, dva kata koja se sastoje od:&nbsp;<strong>prvog kata</strong>&nbsp;gdje su 4 sobe s kupaonicama i wc-om, te&nbsp;<strong>drugog kata</strong>&nbsp;koji takoðer ima 4 sobe s kupaonicama i wc-ima te balkone ispred dvije sobe koje gledaju na ju¾nu stranu. Idealno za bavljenje turizmom ili nakon manjeg preureðenja kao veliki dvoeta¾ni stan za ¾ivljenje!!</p>', '<p>We are pleased to offer this house in Hvar town, with stunning views. The house is divided into two separate units. Subject of the sale is the upper part of the house/150 sq m, ie two floors consisting of: <strong>first floor&nbsp;</strong>where there are 4 bedrooms with bathrooms and toilets, and the&nbsp;<strong>second floor</strong>, which also has 4 rooms with bathrooms and toilets It is an ideal property for tourism or after minor renovations, as a duplex apartment to live.</p>', '', '<p>Dio kuæe u Gradu Hvaru!</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je podjeljena na dvije cijeline. Predmet prodaje je gornji dio kuæe, dva kata koja se sastoje od:</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>- <strong>prvog kata</strong> gdje su 4 sobe s kupaonicama i wc-om od kojih je jedna soba prenamjenjena u kuhinju i blagavaonicu. Ispred soba koje su ju¾no orijentirane se nalazi velika terasa.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>- unutarnjim stubi&scaron;tem se ide na <strong>drugi kat</strong> koji takoðer ima 4 sobe s kupaonicama i wc-ima te balkone ispred dvije sobe koje gledaju na ju¾nu stranu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na samom ulazu je dio lijepog i od¾avanog vrta i jo&scaron; dva prostora kao terase koji slu¾e za sobe koje nemaju balkon.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa ima i posebnu spremu izvan kuæe od nekih 15m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Idealno za bavljenje turizmom ili nakon manjeg preureðenja kao veliki dvoeta¾ni stan za ¾ivljenje!!</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U <strong>prizemlju </strong>je dvosoban stan od ca.50 m2 sa velikom terasom koji se takoðer prodaje, a vlasnik tog stana tra¾i dodatnih 200.000 eura.</p>', '<p>We are pleased to offer this house in Hvar town, with stunning  views.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house is divided into two separate units. Subject of the  sale is the upper part of the house/150 sq m, ie two floors consisting  of:</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>- First floor </strong>where there are 4 bedrooms with bathrooms and toilets  of which one room has been converted into an open plan kitchen and dining room,  with a large south facing balcony in front of the building facing the sea.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>- internal stairs lead to to the <strong>second floor</strong>, which also has 4 rooms  with bathrooms and toilets and balconies in front of two rooms that overlook the  south side.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>At the entrance is a part of a beautiful and well maintained  garden and two terraces used by those rooms that do not have a  balcony.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property comes with a separate storage room outside the the  house of some 15m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is an ideal property for tourism or after minor  renovations, as a duplex apartment to live.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>By coincidence, the ground floor  has a flat of ca.50 m2 with large terrace which is also sale by different owner.  Asking price of this ground floor apartment is 200.000 euros.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>This is a  rare opportunity to combine both properties into a substantial  villa.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact our Hvar office to arrange viewing.</p>', '', '878_House-Villa_0.jpg', '878_House-Villa_1.jpg', '878_House-Villa_2.jpg', '878_House-Villa_3.jpg', '878_House-Villa_4.jpg', '878_House-Villa_5.jpg', '878_House-Villa_6.jpg', '878_House-Villa_7.jpg', ''),
(879, 'Zvonko', 'Grebenar', '', '', '', 'Hvar', 'Hvar-Stari Grad', 'For sale', 'Old stone house', '350', '150', '90', 1, '175000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 4, 2, 'September 27, 2014', '<p>Kamena kuæa s vrtom u centru najstarijeg mjesta na na&scaron;im podruèjima. Kuæa se nalazi u romantiènoj i lijepoj ulici, ima poseban ulaz i sastoji se od prizemlja i kata. Kuæu je potrebno modernizirati, ali uz malo ulaganje mo¾e biti perfektan ljetni dom! Ukupna stambena povr&scaron;ina iznosi 90 m2, dok je povr&scaron;ina parcele 150 m2.</p>', '<p>We are pleased to offer this 4 bedroom old stone house, near the harbour, in the centre of this old village. The floor area is 90m sq and the land plot it sits on is 150m sq. The street is very old and historic and with its cobbled pavement and narrow walls it is very charismatic and full of charm. We suggest that this house needs modernising and then it could become a much sought after space for tourists or a superb family holiday home.</p>', '', '<p>Kamena kuæa s vrtom u centru najstarijeg mjesta na na&scaron;im podruèjima.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa se nalazi u romantiènoj i lijepoj ulici, ima poseban ulaz i sastoji se od prizemlja gdje je kuhinja, dnevni boravak, jedna spavaæa soba, kupaonica i veliki zatvoreni vrt koji slu¾i kao dvori&scaron;te i pru¾a kuæi poseban ugoðaj uz komin i stol za veliku obitelj.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Unutarnjim stubi&scaron;tem se ide na kat gdje su tri sobe i wc te balkon za dvije sobe.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæu je potrebno modernizirati, ali uz malo ulaganje mo¾e biti perfektan ljetni dom!</p>', '<p>We are pleased to offer this 4 bedroom old stone house, near the harbour, in the  centre of this old village.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The floor area is 90m sq and the land plot it  sits on is 150m sq.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The street is very old and historic and with its  cobbled pavement and narrow walls it is very charismatic and full of  charm.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>From the street there is the entrance to the ground floor<strong> </strong>where  there is a kitchen, living room, 1 bedroom and bathroom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The courtyard has a  BBQ grill and table and chairs and is maintained as a garden area with shrubs  that give the space a unique atmosphere.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>An internal staircase leads to three  more bedrooms and a bathroom, with two of the rooms having balconies.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>We  suggest that this house needs modernising and then it could become a much sought  after space for tourists or a superb family holiday home.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There are  shops, bars and restaurants all in walking distance, and open countryside  nearby.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact the Croatia Property Sales - Hvar office to  arrange to visit this property.</p>', '', '879_Old-stone-house_0.jpg', '879_Old-stone-house_1.jpg', '879_Old-stone-house_2.jpg', '879_Old-stone-house_3.jpg', '879_Old-stone-house_4.jpg', '879_Old-stone-house_5.jpg', '879_Old-stone-house_6.jpg', '879_Old-stone-house_7.jpg', '879_Old-stone-house_8.jpg');
INSERT INTO `nekretnina` (`id`, `ime`, `prezime`, `telefon`, `mobitel`, `e_mail`, `lokacija_id`, `adresa`, `status_id`, `vrsta_id`, `udaljenost`, `povrsina`, `stambenapovrsina`, `display`, `cijena`, `cijenatocka`, `ponuda_tjedna`, `new_built`, `must_sell`, `prvi_red_do_mora`, `pogled_na_more`, `bazen`, `broj_soba`, `broj_kupatila`, `datum`, `title_hr`, `title_en`, `title_ge`, `opis_hr`, `opis_en`, `opis_ge`, `PropertyImageURL0`, `PropertyImageURL1`, `PropertyImageURL2`, `PropertyImageURL3`, `PropertyImageURL4`, `PropertyImageURL5`, `PropertyImageURL6`, `PropertyImageURL7`, `PropertyImageURL8`) VALUES
(880, 'Ljiljana', 'Ru¾eviæ', '', '', '', 'Hvar', 'Vrboska', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '70', '100', '135', 1, '210000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 5, 3, 'September 27, 2014', '<p>Kuæa u nizu na atraktivnoj lokaciji i pogledom na more. Stambena povr&scaron;ina kuæe iznosi 135 m2; ima 5 spavaæih soba i 3 kupaonice. Kuæa je opremljena i namje&scaron;tena te ima, satelitsku antenu, tri klima ureðaja, kalijevu peæ i podno grijanje u sobi, hodniku i kupaonici.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>We are offering this attractive terraced house with a great sea view. The property is on two floors, with a total living space of 135m sq and it consists of: Ground floor with a one bedroom apartment of 30 m2 with a terrace of 30 m2 with sea view! On the first floor two bedroom apartment of 76 m2 with a balcony and a terrace. Only 70 meters from the sea!</p>', '', '<p>Kuæa u nizu na atraktivnoj lokaciji i pogledom na more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa se sastoji od jednosobnog komfornog apartmana 30 m2 s velikom terasom od 30 m2 i pogledom na more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na katu je dvosoban komforan stan 76 m2 s balkonom, te terasom i vrtom 60 m2 (vanjski komin).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je opremljena i namje&scaron;tena te ima, satelitsku antenu, tri klima ureðaja, kalijevu peæ i podno grijanje u sobi, hodniku i kupaonici.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Iza kuæe je pomoæni ili dodatni objekt povr&scaron;ine 32 m2, a sastoji se od spavaæe sobe, hodnika, kupaonice i ostave s posebnim ulazom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ispred pomoænog objekta nalazi se takoðer terasa i mali vrt.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Moguænost kupnje jo&scaron; susjednog zemlji&scaron;ta za pro&scaron;irenje vrta.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa ima svoje parking mjesto na zajednièkom parkingu.</p>', '<p>We are offering this attractive terraced house with a great sea view.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The  property is on two floors, with a total living space of 135m sq and it consists  of:</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>- Ground floor with a one bedroom apartment of 30 m2 with a terrace of 30  m2 with sea view!</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>- On the first floor two bedroom apartment of 76 m2 with a  balcony and a terrace.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The garden has an area of &#8203;&#8203;60 m2 with outdoor BBQ  grill, and family seating area.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house is equipped and furnished and  features a satellite dish, air conditioners, tiled stove and underfloor heating  in the bathroom, hallway and bathroom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Behind the house, there is an  extra or additional building, of &#8203;&#8203;32 m2 and it consists of a bedroom, hallway,  bathroom and utility room with separate entrance.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>In front of a building  there is also a terrace and small garden, attractively planted.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There is  an option to purchase an additional adjacent land to expand the  garden.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house has its own parking on the same parking  lot.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please call our CPS -Hvar to arrange a viewing.</p>', '', '880_House-Villa_0.jpg', '880_House-Villa_1.jpg', '880_House-Villa_2.jpg', '880_House-Villa_3.jpg', '880_House-Villa_4.jpg', '880_House-Villa_5.jpg', '880_House-Villa_6.jpg', '880_House-Villa_7.jpg', '880_House-Villa_8.jpg'),
(881, 'Ðorðe Vranjican', 'Grey d.o.o.', '', '0912519526 - kljuèevi', '', 'Hvar', 'Stari Grad', 'For sale', 'Old stone house', '400', '126', '95', 1, '220000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 3, 2, 'September 27, 2014', '<p>Restaurirana kamena kuæa sa zatvorenim dvori&scaron;tem u centru mjesta. Kuæa ima ulaz kroz dvori&scaron;te koje je okru¾eno visokim kamenim zidom i posaðeno raznom mediteranskom vegitacijom. Ukupna stambena povr&scaron;ina kuæe je 126 m2. Kuæa je stilski autohtono restaurirana i spremna za najam ili ¾ivljenje. Ne&scaron;to prelijepo za ljubitelje kamenih kuæa.&nbsp;Rijetko na tr¾i&scaron;tu!!!</p>', '<p>We are pleased to offer this superbly restored old stone cottage in the centre of the village. The property for sale is an excellent excellent example of how to make the best use of space, because what appeared to be a small cottage is now a luxurious 3 bedroom house, with a courtyard featuring an outdoor BBQ grill and enough space for sun loungers and a table for 6 people. The house is stylish with great character. Properties like this are rarely on the market, so an early viewing is recommended.</p>', '', '<p>Restaurirana kamena kuæa sa zatvorenim dvori&scaron;tem u centru mjesta.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa  ima ulaz kroz dvori&scaron;te koje je okru¾eno visokim kamenim zidom i posaðeno  raznom mediteranskom vegitacijom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ukupna stambena povr&scaron;ina kuæe je 126  m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U prizemlju je dnevni boravak, kuhinja i blagavaonica koja je  smje&scaron;tena&nbsp;ispod kamenog volta, kupaonica te mala ljetna kuhinjica i stol za 6  osoba u vanjskom prostoru.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kroz dvori&scaron;te zatvorenog tipa gdje su  le¾aljke i vanjski dnevni boravak se penje stepeni&scaron;tem na gornji kat gdje su  tri spavaæe sobe i velika kupaonica.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je stilski autohtono  restaurirana i spremna za najam ili ¾ivljenje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ne&scaron;to prelijepo za ljubitelje  kamenih kuæa.&nbsp;Rijetko na tr¾i&scaron;tu!!!</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za dogovor oko razgledavanja  kontaktirajte na&scaron; CPS - Hvar ured.</p>', '<p>We are pleased to offer this superbly restored old stone cottage in the centre of the village.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is in walking distance of the old harbour  and the vibrant area around, with most of the shops and  restaurants.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property for sale is an excellent excellent example of  how to make the best use of space, because what appeared to be a small  cottage is now a luxurious 3 bedroom house, with a courtyard featuring an  outdoor BBQ grill and enough space for sun loungers and a table for 6  people.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house has an entrance through the courtyard which is surrounded  by a high stone wall partly hidden by a variety of Mediterranean  vegetation.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The ground floor has a living room, kitchen and dining room,  connected through vaulted doorways and ceilings to a bathroom and a small  summer kitchen and table for 6 in outer space.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Access to the upstairs is  through the closed courtyard where there is a staircase to the upper floor  with three bedrooms and a large bathroom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house is stylish with great  character. It is ready to rent or live.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Properties like this are rarely on  the market, so an early viewing is recommended.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>To visit this  property, please contact the Hvar office.</p>', '', '881_Old-stone-house_0.jpg', '881_Old-stone-house_1.jpg', '881_Old-stone-house_2.jpg', '881_Old-stone-house_3.jpg', '881_Old-stone-house_4.jpg', '881_Old-stone-house_5.jpg', '881_Old-stone-house_6.jpg', '881_Old-stone-house_7.jpg', '881_Old-stone-house_8.jpg'),
(882, 'Toni', 'Gotovac', '', '', '', 'Hvar', 'Sv.Nedelja - Hvar', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '20', '1170', '885', 1, '4000000', '', 2, 2, 2, 1, 1, 1, 5, 5, 'September 28, 2014', '<p>Luksuzna villa na Hvaru - prvi red do mora! Ekskluzivna Vila prvi red do mora na Hvaru, izgraðena na zemlji&scaron;tu povr&scaron;ine 1170m2. Povr&scaron;ina objekta je 885 m2. Opremljena je sa grijanim bazenom od 45 m2 i Jaccuziem. U sklopu vile je vinski podrum cca 50m2. Vila posjeduje nesmetani pristup moru kao i moguænost priveza jahte u marini u neposrednoj blizini ili èamca ispred vile.</p>', '<p>Croatia Property Sales are keen to offer this substantial luxury holiday villa, on the south shore of Hvar island. It is located in a very beautiful and private part of the shore, with superb views across the sea. It sits on a plot of 1170m sq, and the internal floor space covers 885m sq. The villa has unobstructed access to the sea as well as the possibility of mooring a yacht in a marina near the boat or in front of the villa.</p>', '', '<p>Luksuzna villa na Hvaru - prvi red do mora!</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ekskluzivna Vila prvi red do mora na Hvaru, izgraðena na zemlji&scaron;tu povr&scaron;ine 1170m2. Povr&scaron;ina objekta je 885 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Prvi red uz more sa otvorenim pogledom na more i otok Korèulu!</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Opremljena je sa grijanim bazenom od 45 m2 i Jaccuziem.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Vila se sastoji od 5 spavaæih soba, 5 kupaonica, 3 WC-a, dnevnog boravka, blagovaonice, kuhinje sa pretprostorom, podrumske gara¾e sa 6 parkirnih mjesta, profesionalne praone, wellnes centra koji ima tursku parnu kupku, finsku saunu, tu&scaron;eve sa specijalnim efektima kao i prostor za masa¾ne stolove i dnevni odmor.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Bazenska zgrada cca 215m2 ima svrhu viseæeg bazena 45m2 sa prelijevom i slapom te prostorom ispod bazena koji se upotebljava za strojarnicu. Preostalih 120m2 mo¾e imati raznu namjenu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U sklopu vile je vinski podrum cca 50m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Standard je po kategorizaciji 5* &scaron;to znaèi eksterijer sav u kamenu, klimatizacija-grijanje, ventilacija, vodoinstalacije, elektroinstalacije, sve po najvi&scaron;em standardu kvalitete. Kuhinja kompletno opremljena sa tehnikom Miele.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Vila posjeduje nesmetani pristup moru kao i moguænost priveza jahte u marini u neposrednoj blizini ili èamca ispred vile.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sustav video nadzora, alarma kao i sistema polupametne kuæe koji mo¾e biti nadograðen do "full" pametne kuæe.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Vila ima ureðenu okuænicu, a zemlji&scaron;te je zasaðeno hortikulturom sa automatskim navodnjavanjem.</p>', '<p>Croatia Property Sales are keen to offer this substantial luxury holiday villa, on the south shore of Hvar island.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is located in a very  beautiful and private part of the shore, with superb views across the  sea.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It sits on a plot of 1170m sq, and the internal floor space covers  885m sq.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>In addition there are landscaped surroundings which include a heated swimming pool of 45m sq and a jacuzzi.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The villa consists of 5 bedrooms, 5  bathrooms, 3 toilets, living room, dining room, kitchen with antechamber, a  basement garage with 6 parking spaces.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>In addition there is a  professional laundry, dry storage, and wellness center, which has a Turkish  steam bath, Finnish sauna, showers with special effects as well as space for  massage tables and a relaxation room.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The swimming pool building is  approx 215m2, and encloses the 45m2 pool with cascade, waterfall, about 8m,  and the area under the pool for use in the engine room. The ''infinity'' pool  has been designed so that the natural environment and stunning sea view can  be fully enjoyed. The remaining 120m2 can have different purposes.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The  villa has a substantial wine cellar, approx 50m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>All the fittings and  decorations have been chosen to give the property a complete ''wow'' factor,  and this has certainly been achieved. There is a wonderful stone exterior,  air conditioning and heating, ventilation, plumbing, electrical, all to the  highest standard of quality.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Fully equipped kitchen appliances top class  / Miele.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The villa has unobstructed access to the sea as well as the  possibility of mooring a yacht in a marina near the boat or in front of the  villa.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It has an elaborate Video surveillance system, alarm system, as  well as ''semi smart'' technical gadgets that can be upgraded to ''full smart  home''.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The villa has a beautiful yard, and the land is planted and  maintained by professionals who have installed an automatic irrigation  system.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>To agree on the tour we are at your service in our CPS Hvar  office!</p>', '', '882_House-Villa_0.jpg', '882_House-Villa_1.jpg', '882_House-Villa_2.jpg', '882_House-Villa_3.jpg', '882_House-Villa_4.jpg', '882_House-Villa_5.jpg', '882_House-Villa_6.jpg', '882_House-Villa_7.jpg', '882_House-Villa_8.jpg'),
(884, 'Sanda', 'Bo¹koviæ agencija', '', '095 913 04 25', 'sanda.boskovic@gmail.com', 'Omis', 'Mimice', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '30', '209', '140', 2, '245000', '', 2, 2, 2, 1, 1, 2, 2, 1, 'September 29, 2014', '<p>Kuæa na omi&scaron;koj rivijeri, prvi red uz more, na izuzetnoj i mirnoj&nbsp;lokaciji, svega nekoliko stepenica je dijeli od &scaron;ljunèane pla¾e s&nbsp;kristalno èistim morem. Ukupna stambena povr&scaron;ina je 140 m2 + terase (30 m2). Povr&scaron;ina&nbsp;zemlji&scaron;ta je 209 m2. Sastoji se od dva kata, u naravi dva stana.</p>\r\n<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;">NOVA SNI®ENA CIJENA!!</span></p>', '<p>We are pleased to offer this excellent house on the Omis Riviera,&nbsp;seafront, in an exceptional and quiet location, only a few steps away&nbsp;from the pebble beach with crystal clear waters. It has a total living area of 140 m2 with terraces (30 m2). The land&nbsp;area is 209 m2. It consists of two floors with one apartment on each floor. It has a beautiful courtyard, lined with stone with plenty of potential.</p>\r\n<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;">NEW REDUCED PRICE!!</span></p>', '', '<p>Kuæa na omi&scaron;koj rivijeri, prvi red uz more, na izuzetnoj i mirnoj&nbsp;lokaciji, svega nekoliko stepenica je dijeli od &scaron;ljunèane pla¾e s&nbsp;kristalno èistim morem.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ukupna stambena povr&scaron;ina je 140 m2 + terase (30 m2). Povr&scaron;ina&nbsp;zemlji&scaron;ta je 209 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Novije je gradnje i oblo¾ena kamenom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sastoji se od dva kata, u naravi dva stana.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na prvom katu je dvosoban namje&scaron;ten stan povr&scaron;ine 70 m2, koji se&nbsp;sastoji od: dvije spavaæe sobe, kupaonice, kuhinje, blagovaonice i&nbsp;dnevnog boravka.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Drugi kat je u roh bau, samo su postavljene potrebne instalacije.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ima ureðenu okuænicu, oblo¾enu kamenom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæi pripada jedno parking mjesto.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za detaljnije informacije i dogovor oko posjeta nekretnine stojimo vam&nbsp;na usluzi.</p>', '<p>We are pleased to offer this excellent house on the Omis Riviera,&nbsp;seafront, in an exceptional and quiet location, only a few steps away&nbsp;from the pebble beach with crystal clear waters.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It has a total living area of 140 m2 with terraces (30 m2). The land&nbsp;area is 209 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It has recently been built and lined with stone.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It consists of two floors with one apartment on each floor.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the first floor is a furnished apartment of 70 m2, consisting of&nbsp;two bedrooms, bathroom, kitchen, dining and living room.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The second floor is unfinished, but the required installation present,&nbsp;so only the fittings and decorations need completing.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It has a beautiful courtyard, lined with stone with plenty of potential.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house has one parking space.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>To arrange a visit to this property please contact our CPS - Split office.</p>', '', '884_House-Villa_0.jpg', '884_House-Villa_1.jpg', '884_House-Villa_2.jpg', '884_House-Villa_3.jpg', '884_House-Villa_4.jpg', '884_House-Villa_5.jpg', '884_House-Villa_6.jpg', '884_House-Villa_7.jpg', '884_House-Villa_8.jpg'),
(885, 'Marija', 'Radas', '+61 416 487 893', '098/9858-374', 'maria.radas@bigpond.com', 'Lastovo', 'Pasadur, 13068/85 KO Lastovo, ZU 578', 'For sale', 'Land plot', '40', '500', '0', 1, '200000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 0, 0, 'October 3, 2014', '<p>Graðevinsko zemlji&scaron;te na iznimno atraktivnoj lokaciji i s prekrasnim panoramskim pogledom na more. Zemlji&scaron;te je povr&scaron;ine 500 m2, i ima pristupni put sa stra¾nje strane. Zemlji&scaron;te je zapravo smje&scaron;teno u drugom redu od mora, ali buduæi se ispred zemlji&scaron;ta nalazi zeleni pojas, zapravo se mo¾e reæi da se radi o prvom graðevinskom zemlji&scaron;tu do mora, &scaron;to osigurava nesmetan panoramski pogled na more sa svake eta¾e.</p>', '<p>We are pleased to offer this rare and exceptional opportunity to build a substantial villa or apartments on Lastovo island. The plot is 40m from the water''s edge, but the strip in front is preserved ''green belt'' so no further building is allowed. It is an exceptional location with breathtaking panoramic sea views from every floor. The land area is 500 m2 and has an access road from the ''high'' side of the plot.</p>', '', '<p>Graðevinsko zemlji&scaron;te na iznimno atraktivnoj lokaciji i s prekrasnim panoramskim pogledom na more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Zemlji&scaron;te je povr&scaron;ine 500 m2, i ima pristupni put sa stra¾nje strane.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Zemlji&scaron;te je zapravo smje&scaron;teno u drugom redu od mora, ali buduæi se ispred zemlji&scaron;ta nalazi zeleni pojas, zapravo se mo¾e reæi da se radi o prvom graðevinskom zemlji&scaron;tu do mora, &scaron;to osigurava nesmetan panoramski pogled na more sa svake eta¾e.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ju¾ne je orijentacije i svega je 40 metara udaljeno od mora i pla¾e.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Dozvoljena je izgradnja stambene ili apartmanske kuæe (maksimalno 3 apartmana) maksimalne katnosti prizemlje + 2 kata (odnosno maksimalne visine 8,5 metara) i tlocrtne povr&scaron;ine kuæe cca 150 m2, odnosno maksimalno 30% povr&scaron;ine parcele.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Koeficijent izgraðenosti za ovu parcelu iznosi 0,9 &scaron;to znaèi da je moguæe graditi kuæu s maksimalnom brutto razvijenom povr&scaron;inom od 450 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Lastovo zbog ne&scaron;to veæe udaljenosti od Splita nudi izniman mir i privatnost te ukoliko ste u potrazi za prekrasnom prirodom i mirnom lokacijom, onda je Lastovo mjesto za Vas!</p>', '<p>We are pleased to offer this rare and exceptional opportunity to build a substantial villa or apartments on Lastovo island.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The plot is 40m  from the water''s edge, but the strip in front is preserved ''green belt'' so  no further building is allowed.&nbsp;It is an exceptional location with  breathtaking panoramic sea views from every floor.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The land area is  500 m2 and has an access road from the ''high'' side of the plot.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The plot  has a southern orientation.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>- according to building regulations it is  possible to build a single house or apartment building (maximum 3 apartments)</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>- maximum ground floor + 2 floors (with a maximum height of 8.5  meters)</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>- the footprint of the house about 150 m2, or maximum of 30% of the plot area.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Building coefficient for this plot is 0.9, which means  that it is possible to build a house with a maximum gross developed area of  450 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Lastovo is a very distinctive island, and due to it being further distance from Split offers exceptional peace and privacy, and if you are looking for beautiful scenery and quiet location, then Lastovo is the place for you!</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For viewing arrangement please contact our Split  office.</p>', '', '885_Land-plot_0.jpg', '885_Land-plot_1.jpg', '885_Land-plot_2.jpg', '885_Land-plot_3.jpg', '885_Land-plot_4.jpg', '885_Land-plot_5.jpg', '885_Land-plot_6.jpg', '885_Land-plot_7.jpg', ''),
(886, 'Chris', 'Parry', '', '', '', 'Hvar', 'Pitve', 'For sale', 'Old stone house', '2000', '270', '250', 1, '315000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 7, 0, 'October 3, 2014', '<p>Kamena aristokratska kuæa u selu, nedaleko od mora i lijepih pla¾a ju¾ne&nbsp;strane Hvara. Selo je jedno od oèuvanijih i autentiènijih na èitavom otoku Hvaru, a&nbsp;osudili bi se reæi i u Dalmaciji. Kuæa je nekad bila u vlasni&scaron;tvu bogatijih obitelji poljoprivrednika i&nbsp;vinara. Kuæa je prostrana, ukupne stambene povr&scaron;ine 250 m2. Povr&scaron;ina zemlji&scaron;ta je 200m2 + 70 m2 parking. Ima lijepi pogled na more i okolna brda.</p>', '<p>Renovation project on Hvar island! We are offering this old stone house, the former home of a wealthy&nbsp;aristocratic family of farmers and winemakers, in one of the most&nbsp;authentic and well-preserved villages in Dalmatia. It is situated on the southern side of the island, about 2k from the sea&nbsp;where the best beaches are situated. The house is spacious, with a total living area of &#8203;&#8203;250 m2. It has a beautiful view of the sea and surrounding hills.</p>', '', '<p>Kamena aristokratska kuæa u selu, nedaleko od mora i lijepih pla¾a ju¾ne&nbsp;strane Hvara.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Selo je jedno od oèuvanijih i autentiènijih na èitavom otoku Hvaru, a&nbsp;osudili bi se reæi i u Dalmaciji.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je nekad bila u vlasni&scaron;tvu bogatijih obitelji poljoprivrednika i&nbsp;vinara.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Potrebna je potpuna renovacija.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je prostrana, ukupne stambene povr&scaron;ine 250 m2. Povr&scaron;ina zemlji&scaron;ta je 200m2 + 70 m2 parking.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nekretnina se sastoji od:&nbsp;dvori&scaron;ta, velike konobe, terasa, te dva dodatna kata gdje se mo¾e&nbsp;napraviti raspored po ¾elji.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Mo¾e biti u funkciji kuæe za odmor ili kao motel na glavnom putu za&nbsp;ju¾nu stranu Hvara gdje se nalaze najljep&scaron;e pla¾e otoka Hvara.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ima lijepi pogled na more i okolna brda.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Uz kuæu je i veliki parking sa ca.8 parkirnih mjesta. Infrastruktura je u neposrednoj blizini. 2 km od obale.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za detalje i dogovor oko razgledavanja CPS - Hvar ured vam stoji na usluzi.</p>', '<p>Renovation project on Hvar island!</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>We are offering this old stone house, the former home of a wealthy&nbsp;aristocratic family of farmers and winemakers, in one of the most&nbsp;authentic and well-preserved villages in Dalmatia.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is situated on the southern side of the island, about 2k from the sea&nbsp;where the best beaches are situated.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house is spacious, with a total living area of &#8203;&#8203;250 m2, and it sits&nbsp;on a land plot of land area of 200m2 with an additional 70 m2 used as&nbsp;parking.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property consists of: courtyard, spacious cellar, terrace, and two&nbsp;additional floors which allow for the complete redesign of the rooms at&nbsp;will.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It can be used as an exceptional private house, holiday homes or as a&nbsp;hotel near the main road to the south side of Hvar, which is always&nbsp;popular with tourists.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It has a beautiful view of the sea and surrounding hills.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Beside the house is a large parking lot for about 8 vehicles.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For serious enquiries about visiting the property and talking to a&nbsp;renovation company about the options and potential costs of undertaking&nbsp;this project, then please contact our office on Hvar island.</p>', '', '886_Old-stone-house_0.jpg', '886_Old-stone-house_1.jpg', '886_Old-stone-house_2.jpg', '886_Old-stone-house_3.jpg', '886_Old-stone-house_4.jpg', '886_Old-stone-house_5.jpg', '886_Old-stone-house_6.jpg', '886_Old-stone-house_7.jpg', '886_Old-stone-house_8.jpg'),
(887, 'Vlado', 'Pavloviæ', '', '0981687557', '', 'Hvar', 'Stari Grad', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '70', '70', '54', 1, '89000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 'October 3, 2014', '<p>Dio vikendice, u funkciji dvosobnog stana, na sjevernoj strani otoka&nbsp;Hvara, 70 metara od mora. Prodaje se stan na katu ukupne stambene povr&scaron;ine 54 m2, koji se sastoji od: kuhinje sa trepezarijom, kupaone s wc-om i dvije spavaæe sobe. Ispred stana/bungalova je terasa sa ro&scaron;tiljem i parking za jedan automobil.</p>\r\n<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;">SNI®ENA CIJENA S 95.000 NA 89.000 EURA!!!</span></p>', '<p>We are offering this modestly priced two bedroom apartment on the north&nbsp;side of the island. The property is situated in one of the larger villages, and is 70m from&nbsp;the sea and the historic harbour. The apartment is part of a larger single floor bungalow with a floor&nbsp;area of 54m sq, and it consists of a kitchen, dining room, bathroom with&nbsp;toilet, two bedrooms (one with a balcony).</p>\r\n<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;">PRICE REDUCED FROM 95.000 TO 89.000 EURO!!!</span></p>', '', '<p>Dio vikendice, u funkciji dvosobnog stana, na sjevernoj strani otoka&nbsp;Hvara, 70 metara od mora.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;">SNI®ENA CIJENA S 95.000 NA 89.000 EURA!!!</span></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Prodaje se stan na katu ukupne stambene povr&scaron;ine 54 m2, koji se sastoji od: kuhinje sa trepezarijom, kupaone s wc-om i dvije spavaæe sobe. Jedna&nbsp;spavaæa soba ima balkon.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ispred stana/bungalova je terasa sa ro&scaron;tiljem i parking za jedan automobil.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Moguæa dogradnja jo&scaron; jednog kata.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Napomena: Upisano kao idealno vlasni&scaron;tvo nekretnine!</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za dogovor oko razgledavanja javite se CPS Hvar ured.</p>', '<p>We are offering this modestly priced two bedroom apartment on the north&nbsp;side of the island.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;">PRICE REDUCED FROM 95.000 TO 89.000 EURO!!!</span></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property is situated in one of the larger villages, and is 70m from&nbsp;the sea and the historic harbour.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The apartment is part of a larger single floor bungalow with a floor&nbsp;area of 54m sq, and it consists of a kitchen, dining room, bathroom with&nbsp;toilet, two bedrooms (one with a balcony).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>In front of the property is a good sized terrace with a bbq grill and&nbsp;parking.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It should be noted that the papers relating to this property need to be&nbsp;adjusted at the land registry office /subdivision has not been done&nbsp;yet/, but the ownership is clear.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact our office in Hvar for more information and to arrange to&nbsp;visit this property.</p>', '', '887_House-Villa_0.jpg', '887_House-Villa_1.jpg', '887_House-Villa_2.jpg', '887_House-Villa_3.jpg', '887_House-Villa_4.jpg', '887_House-Villa_5.jpg', '887_House-Villa_6.jpg', '887_House-Villa_7.jpg', ''),
(888, 'Vera', 'Boepple', '', 'boepple.ub@t-online.de', '', 'Hvar', 'Stari Grad', 'For sale', 'Old stone house', '150', '0', '56', 1, '120000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 3, 2, 'October 3, 2014', '<p>Stara kamena renovirana kuæa u centru mjesta na sjevernoj strani otoka Hvara.&nbsp;Kuæa je ukupne stambene povr&scaron;ine 56 m2 + terase od 15  m2. Sastoji od prizemlja u kojem se nalazi studio apartman i prvog kata na kojem se nalazi dvoeta¾ni stan.&nbsp;Na prvoj eta¾i nalazi se jedna spavaæa  soba, kupatilo i hodnik. Do druge eta¾e vodi drveno stubi&scaron;te do dnevnog  boravka i kuhinje.&nbsp;Autentièan i lijep okoli&scaron; na maloj pjaceti, lijep  ambijent.</p>', '<p>We are pleased to have this renovated old stone house in the middle of a small village on the north side of Hvar island. The house has a total living area of &#8203;&#8203;56 m2 + terraces of 15 m2. Both the inside and outside of this building has been renovated to a high standard.</p>', '', '<p>Stara kamena renovirana kuæa u centru mjesta na sjevernoj strani otoka Hvara.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je ukupne stambene povr&scaron;ine 56 m2 + terase od 15  m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sastoji od prizemlja u kojem se nalazi studio apartman i prvog kata na kojem se nalazi dvoeta¾ni stan.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na prvoj eta¾i nalazi se jedna spavaæa  soba, kupatilo i hodnik.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Do druge eta¾e vodi drveno stubi&scaron;te do dnevnog  boravka i kuhinje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Autentièan i lijep okoli&scaron; na maloj pjaceti, lijep  ambijent.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za dogovor oko razgledavanja CPS Hvar ured vam stoji na  usluzi.</p>', '<p>We are pleased to have this renovated old stone house in the middle of a small village on the north side of Hvar island.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house has a total  living area of &#8203;&#8203;56 m2 + terraces of 15 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It consists of a ground floor  with studio apartment and first floor where there is a duplex  apartment.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The duplex apartment on the first floor has one bedroom, bathroom  and hallway.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Wooden staircase leads to the living room and  kitchen.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Both the inside and outside of this building has been renovated  to a high standard.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The location in the village is on the side of a  small piazza, completely charming and an authentic Dalmatian environment.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>To set up an appointment to visit the property, please  contact Hvar CPS office.</p>', '', '888_Old-stone-house_0.jpg', '888_Old-stone-house_1.jpg', '888_Old-stone-house_2.jpg', '888_Old-stone-house_3.jpg', '888_Old-stone-house_4.jpg', '888_Old-stone-house_5.jpg', '', '', ''),
(889, 'Josip', 'Lovriæ', '', '0912140555', '', 'Rogoznica', 'Zagrebaèka ul., Rogoznica, è.z. 723, 728', 'For sale', 'Land plot', '100', '150', '0', 1, '37500', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 0, 0, 'October 3, 2014', '<p>Graðevinsko zemlji&scaron;te u samom centru Rogoznice. Sa zemlji&scaron;ta se pru¾a pogled na more i uvalu. Parcela je od mora udaljena 100 m. Na zemlji&scaron;tu se mo¾e graditi kuæa na dva kata tlocrtne povr&scaron;ine 60 m2. Pristup cestom je na 70 m, a udaljenost do najbli¾eg parkinga je 100 m.</p>', '<p>We are offering this building plot of 150 m2 in the center of Rogoznica. The plot is elevated to give views from the house that are over the village, the sea and across the bay. The building will be 100 m from the seashore. The land will allow the building of two-story house with a layout area of 60 m2. Access road at 70 m distance from the plot. Nearest parking is 100 m away.</p>', '', '<p>Graðevinsko zemlji&scaron;te u samom centru Rogoznice!</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sa zemlji&scaron;ta se pru¾a pogled na more i uvalu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U skladu s prostornim planom i konzervatorskim uvjetima, na zemlji&scaron;tu se mo¾e graditi kuæa na dva kata tlocrtne povr&scaron;ine 60 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Udaljenost od mora iznosi 100 m.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ublizini parcele su pla¾e, restorani, kafiæi i trgovine.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Pristup cestom je na 70 m, a udaljenost do najbli¾eg parkinga je 100 m.</p>', '<p>We are offering this building plot of 150 m2 in the center of  Rogoznica.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The plot is elevated to give views from the house that are  over the village, the sea and across the bay.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The building will be 100 m from the seashore.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>This is a popular village with tourists because of its  quietness, it is close to the airport, and the surrounding coast is  exceptionally clean, the shore has many private areas and coves for swimming  etc, and this house will be close to essential services in the village such  as the shops, bars and restaurants.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The land will allow the building of  two-story house with a layout area of 60 m2. From conservators there  is already permission for the construction of this property on the  land.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Access road at 70 m distance from the plot.</p>\r\n<p>Nearest parking is  100 m away.</p>\r\n<p>Trogir and the airport are 30 mins drive.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please  contact the CPS office to arrange to visit this land plot.</p>', '', '889_Land-plot_0.jpg', '889_Land-plot_1.jpg', '889_Land-plot_2.jpg', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(890, 'Luka', 'Roso', '01/ 2336 118', '091/ 5666 563', '', 'Split', 'Kneza Vi¹eslava 18', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '300', '0', '64', 2, '145000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 'October 3, 2014', '<p>U potpunosti renoviran stan, smje&scaron;ten u samoj blizini centra grada u suterenu zgrade koja ima 4 kata. Nalazi se na odliènoj lokaciji, svega nekoliko stotina metara udaljen od Rive. Stambena povr&scaron;ina ovog stana iznosi 64 m2, a sastoji se od 2 spavaæe sobe, kupaonice, kuhinje te dnevnog boravka sa blagovaonicom. Pristup autom je moguæ do samog ulaza u zgradu.</p>', '<p>We are pleased to offer this fully renovated apartment, located near the city center, in the high basement of an attractive old town building with 4 floors. It is situated in a prime location, just a few hundred meters away from the waterfront. The living area of this apartment is 64 m2 and consists of 2 bedrooms, bathroom, open plan kitchen and living room with dining area. Access by car is possible to the entrance of the building.</p>', '', '<p>U potpunosti renoviran stan, smje&scaron;ten u samoj blizini centra grada u suterenu zgrade koja ima 4 kata.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nalazi se na odliènoj lokaciji, svega nekoliko stotina metara udaljen od Rive.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Stambena povr&scaron;ina ovog stana iznosi 64 m2, a sastoji se od 2 spavaæe sobe, kupaonice, kuhinje te dnevnog boravka sa blagovaonicom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Pristup autom je moguæ do samog ulaza u zgradu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Stan je idealan za vlastito u¾ivanje i boravak preko cijele godine, ali s obzirom na sve veæu popularnost Splita moguæe je i bavljenje turistièkim iznajmljivanjem.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Svi potrebni sadr¾aji nalaze se u blizini.</p>\r\n<p>Meðunarodni aerodrom udaljen je 40 min. vo¾nje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za sve dodatne informacije i razgledavanje nekretnine slobodno nas kontaktirajte.</p>', '<p>We are pleased to offer this fully renovated apartment, located near the city center, in the high basement of an attractive old town building with 4 floors.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is situated in a prime location, just a few hundred  meters away from the waterfront.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The living area of this apartment is  64 m2 and consists of 2 bedrooms, bathroom, open plan kitchen and living  room with dining area.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Access by car is possible to the entrance of the  building.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The apartment would be ideal for private use throughout the  year, but due to the increasing popularity of Split as a tourist  destination, it would have an excellent alternative use for tourist lets and  rentals.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>In this central location is the area with the greatest concentration  of shops, bars and restaurants, as well as having access to the park and ferry terminal.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The international airport is 40 minutes  driving.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For further information and to agree a tour of the apartment,  please make arrangements through our&nbsp; CPS Split office.</p>', '', '890_Apartment_0.jpg', '890_Apartment_1.jpg', '890_Apartment_2.jpg', '890_Apartment_3.jpg', '890_Apartment_4.jpg', '', '', '', ''),
(993, 'Leonidas', 'Lonèar', '', '091/ 937 5051', '', 'Split', 'Hrvojeva 12, 2905/1 ulo¾ak: 5064', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '250', '0', '119', 1, '430000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 3, 1, 'December 17, 2014', '<p>U samom centru Splita, 200 m od popularne Rive, 30 m od Dioklecijanove palaèe, u starogradskoj zgradi nalazi se apartman ukupne povr&scaron;ine 119 m2. Sastoji se od hodnika, kuhinje + blagovaonice, 3 spavaæe sobe, dnevnog boravka, kupatila, wc-a, ostave i 2 balkona.&nbsp;Stanu pripada ostava u podrumu povr&scaron;ine 10 m2.</p>', '<p>We are pleased to offer this very spacious apartment, just 30m from the Palace. It is situated in the centre of town, on the third floor of an old apartment block, 200 meters from Riva, and 30 m from the Diocletian''s Palace. The property is 119 m sq and it consists of hallway, kitchen + dining room, 3 bedrooms, living room, bathroom, toilet, utility room and two balconies, with an additional room in the basement of 10 m2.</p>', '', '<p>U samom centru Splita, 200 m od popularne Rive, 30 m od Dioklecijanove palaèe, u starogradskoj zgradi nalazi se apartman ukupne povr&scaron;ine 119 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sastoji se od hodnika, kuhinje + blagovaonice, 3 spavaæe sobe, dnevnog boravka, kupatila, wc-a, ostave i 2 balkona.&nbsp;Stanu pripada ostava u podrumu povr&scaron;ine 10 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ovo je jedinstvena prilika ¾elite li nekretninu na unikatnoj lokaciji koji mo¾ete koristiti u svrhu turistièkog iznajmljivanja ili za vlastito u¾ivanje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U blizini se nalaze mnogobrojni restorani, kafiæi, trgovine i svi ostali potrebni sadr¾aji.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Meðunarodni aerodrom udaljen je 30 min. vo¾nje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za sve dodatne informacije i razgledavanje nekretnine stojimo vam na raspolaganju.</p>', '<p>We are pleased to offer this very spacious apartment, just 30m from the  Palace.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is situated in the centre of town, on the third floor of an  old apartment block, 200 meters from Riva, and 30 m from the Diocletian''s  Palace.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property is 119 m sq and it consists of hallway, kitchen + dining  room, 3 bedrooms, living room, bathroom, toilet, utility room and two balconies,  with an additional room in the basement of 10 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property is in need  of some renovation, but on completion, it''s location would make it attractive  for tourism, or private dwelling.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nearby, and within walking distance,  are many restaurants, cafes, shops and other services and transport connections,  as well as all the major tourist attractions in the town.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The  international airport is 30 minutes driving.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For additional information and a  tour of the property we are at your disposal.</p>', '', '993_Apartment_0.jpg', '993_Apartment_1.jpg', '993_Apartment_2.jpg', '993_Apartment_3.jpg', '993_Apartment_4.jpg', '993_Apartment_5.jpg', '993_Apartment_6.jpg', '993_Apartment_7.jpg', '993_Apartment_8.jpg'),
(891, 'Marija', 'Jeriniæ', '', '098 1348227', 'Marija.jerinic@gmail.com', 'Rogoznica', 'Ljoljinica 25, Ra¾anj, 7926/1 K.o. Sevid', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '70', '460', '200', 1, '245000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 9, 4, 'October 8, 2014', '<p>Kuæa na rogoznièkoj rivijeri s prekrasnim pogledom na more. Svega je 70 m udaljena od pla¾e na kojoj se nalazi trgovina i restoran. Kuæa se sastoji od 4 apartmana, svaki sa zasebnim ulazom.&nbsp;Svaki apartman ima vlastitu terasu s koje se pru¾a pogled na more. Ispred kuæe je parking u sklopu parcele s 4 parkirna mjesta.</p>', '<p>Croatia Property Sales are pleased to offer this large apartment villa with landscaped gardens. It is situated 70m from the shore near the village of Razanj, on the main land north of Trogir. There are three floors. The total floor area is 169m sq. The house was completed in 2006, and all together has 4 parking spaces.</p>', '', '<p>Kuæa na rogoznièkoj rivijeri s prekrasnim pogledom na more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Svega je 70 m udaljena od pla¾e na kojoj se nalazi trgovina i restoran.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa ima ureðenu okuænicu. Vrt je terasasto izveden s mediteranskim biljem (lavanda, smokva, maslina, &scaron;ipak, lovor, kaktus) koji ovoj kuæi pru¾a privatnost i hladovinu tijekom ljetnih vruæina. Prostranost vrta i terasasta izvedenost pru¾a moguænost izgradnje bazena.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa se sastoji od 4 apartmana, svaki sa zasebnim ulazom.&nbsp;Svaki apartman ima vlastitu terasu s koje se pru¾a pogled na more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na najvi&scaron;em katu nalazi se apartman povr&scaron;ine 62 m2 (skupa s terasom) u kojem su dnevni boravak s kuhinjom, kupaonicom, 2 dvokrevetne i 1 jednokrevetna soba. Posebnost ovog dijela kuæe je velika terasa povr&scaron;ine 26 m2 s koje se pru¾a prekrasan pogled na more i uvalu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kat ispod je manji apartman (povr&scaron;ine 57m2) s dnevnom sobom, kuhinjom, kupaonicom i dvije spavaæe sobe. &Scaron;arm ovog dijela je izlaz na dio vrta koji je idealan za odmor u hladovini. Na istom katu je jo&scaron; jedan apartman (povr&scaron;ine 50 m2 s terasom) s dnevnim boravkom, kuhinjom, kupaonicom i 2 spavaæe sobe, a oko njega cijelom du¾inom je terasa povr&scaron;ine 19 m2 s koje se pru¾a pogled na more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U prizemlju je kamenom poploèana terasa u sklopu vrta, a na nju se izlazi iz dnevnog boravka uz koji je kuhinja, kupaonica i odvojeni prostor za spavanje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je zavr&scaron;ena 2006 godine.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ispred kuæe je parking u sklopu parcele s 4 parkirna mjesta.</p>', '<p>Croatia Property Sales are pleased to offer this large apartment villa with landscaped gardens.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is situated 70m from the shore near the village of Razanj, on the main land north of Trogir.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There are three floors. The total floor area is 169m sq.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>The ground floor</strong> is a one bedroom apartment. It has a bedroom, kitchen, bathroom and living room with access to the extensive terrace.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>The first floor </strong>has two apartments.Both have two bedrooms, kitchen, bathroom and lounge and a substantial balcony. The second apartment on this floor has a balcony going around the front which measures 19m sq, and overlooks the sea and the old part of the village.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>The top floor</strong> is an apartment of 60m sq and it has two double bedrooms, and single bedroom, and kitchen, lounge etc with access to a large terrace with superb views.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house was completed in 2006, and all together has 4 parking spaces.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The gardens and grounds have all been well maintained and are planted with beautiful plants, suitable for the dry Mediterranean climate such as figs, olives, vines, and cactus.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The local village has shops, bars and facilities for tourist and the resident population, all in walking distance of the building, and the larger town of Trogir is 30 minutes by car, the same distance as the airport.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact the office in Split &nbsp;to arrange a visit to this property.</p>', '', '891_House-Villa_0.jpg', '891_House-Villa_1.jpg', '891_House-Villa_2.jpg', '891_House-Villa_3.jpg', '891_House-Villa_4.jpg', '891_House-Villa_5.jpg', '891_House-Villa_6.jpg', '891_House-Villa_7.jpg', '891_House-Villa_8.jpg'),
(892, 'Hajdi', 'Ocicek', '', '091 5831644', 'hajdi.ocicek@gmail.com', 'Rogoznica', 'Zeèevo', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '5', '300', '160', 1, '450000', '', 2, 2, 2, 1, 1, 2, 5, 3, 'October 9, 2014', '<p>Kuæa 1. red do mora, s vlastitim izlazom iz vrta na prirodnu kamenitu pla¾u, a na svega par metara udaljenosti od lijepo ureðene &scaron;ljunèane pla¾e. Kuæa je ju¾no orijentirana te se s njenih terasa pru¾a prekrasan pogled na more. Stambena povr&scaron;ina kuæe iznosi 160 m2, a sastoji se od prizemlja i dva kata. Podijeljena je na 3 apartmana svaki s zasebnim ulazom.</p>', '<p>We are pleased to offer this first line villa, just yards from the pebble beach. The property has three floors, and is divided into apartments, with a total living area of 160m sq. Each of the apartments has a separate entrance from the ground. The plot size is 300m sq, and is well planted with native plants. The house has 3 private parking spaces.</p>', '', '<p>Kuæa 1. red do mora, s vlastitim izlazom iz vrta na prirodnu kamenitu pla¾u, a na svega par metara udaljenosti od lijepo ureðene &scaron;ljunèane pla¾e.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je ju¾no orijentirana te se s njenih terasa pru¾a prekrasan pogled na more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Stambena povr&scaron;ina kuæe iznosi 160 m2, a sastoji se od prizemlja i dva kata. Podijeljena je na 3 apartmana svaki s zasebnim ulazom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na najvi&scaron;em katu su 2 apartmana s kuhinjom, dnevnim boravkom, kupaonicom, spavaæom sobom i izlazom na terase s kojih se pru¾a pogled na more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Prvi kat i prizemlje je u sklopu velikog dvoeta¾nog apartmana. Na gornjem katu su tri spavaæe sobe i kupaonica, a u prizemlju dnevni boravak s kuhinjom i terasa s pogledom na more i uvalu ispred kuæe.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Okuænica je kultivirana mediteranskim biljem.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa ima vlastiti parking s tri parking mjesta.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Udaljenost od aerodroma je 30 minuta.</p>\r\n<p>Restorani i kafiæi su u neposrednoj blizini.</p>', '<p>We are pleased to offer this first line villa, just yards from the pebble  beach.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property has three floors, and is divided into apartments,  with a total living area of 160m sq. Each of the apartments has a  separate entrance from the ground.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>The top floor</strong> has two separate  apartments, with one bedroom, open plan lounge and kitchen, and each with  balconies facing the sea.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>The lower two floors</strong> make one larger  apartment. It has 3 bedrooms and a bathroom upstairs, and on the ground  floor an open plan style kitchen and lounge with access to the extensive terrace  and garden, with a private path straight down to the water&rsquo;s edge.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The  plot size is 300m sq, and is well planted with native plants.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house  has 3 private parking spaces.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is situated on the mainland, on a very  quiet part of the coast near Rogoznica village, where there are shops, bars and  a few restaurants.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The nearest larger town is Trogir, the local centre for  historic and cultural events and here are some of the best restaurants along the  entire coast.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is 30 minutes away from the property.</p>\r\n<p>The airport is on  the edge of Trogir, also.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact the office in Split to arrange  to view this property and several similar ones on this part of the coast.</p>', '', '892_House-Villa_0.jpg', '892_House-Villa_1.jpg', '892_House-Villa_2.jpg', '892_House-Villa_3.jpg', '892_House-Villa_4.jpg', '892_House-Villa_5.jpg', '', '', '');
INSERT INTO `nekretnina` (`id`, `ime`, `prezime`, `telefon`, `mobitel`, `e_mail`, `lokacija_id`, `adresa`, `status_id`, `vrsta_id`, `udaljenost`, `povrsina`, `stambenapovrsina`, `display`, `cijena`, `cijenatocka`, `ponuda_tjedna`, `new_built`, `must_sell`, `prvi_red_do_mora`, `pogled_na_more`, `bazen`, `broj_soba`, `broj_kupatila`, `datum`, `title_hr`, `title_en`, `title_ge`, `opis_hr`, `opis_en`, `opis_ge`, `PropertyImageURL0`, `PropertyImageURL1`, `PropertyImageURL2`, `PropertyImageURL3`, `PropertyImageURL4`, `PropertyImageURL5`, `PropertyImageURL6`, `PropertyImageURL7`, `PropertyImageURL8`) VALUES
(893, 'Boris', 'Tomiæ', '', '', '', 'Brac', 'Supetar', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '500', '0', '50', 1, '88000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 2, 1, 'October 9, 2014', '<p>Stan u Supetru, pet stotina metara udaljen od pla¾a. U blizini su i nedirnuti dijelovi obale za korisnike koji preferiraju mir i osamu. Dvosoban stan na 2 katu povr&scaron;ine 50 m2, svijetao, prozraèan, s odliènim pogledom s balkona na more. Sastoji se od: predsoblje, dnevni boravak s blagovaonicom i kuhinjom, 2 spavaæe sobe, kupaonica i balkon.</p>', '<p>We are pleased to offer this modestly priced apartment near the centre of Supetar. It is 10 minutes from the centre of the village and from the harbour, and from here a few minutes to many of the very un-crowded beaches, suitable for&nbsp;swimming and boating, which makes this coast so popular with tourists. The property is a modern style apartment on the second floor measuring 50m sq.</p>', '', '<p>Stan u Supetru, pet stotina metara udaljen od pla¾a.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U blizini su i nedirnuti dijelovi obale za korisnike koji preferiraju mir i osamu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartman udaljen svega pet minuta hoda od centra mjesta, gdje se nalaze svi potrebni sadr¾aji: restorani, barovi, tr¾nice, banka, po&scaron;tanski ured, trajektna luka.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Dvosoban stan na 2 katu, svijetao, prozraèan, s odliènim pogledom s balkona na more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sastoji se od: predsoblje, dnevni boravak s blagovaonicom i kuhinjom, 2 spavaæe sobe, kupaonica i balkon.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Stolarija unutarnja drvena solidna. Vanjska alu-plast izo stakla s pode&scaron;avanjem svjetla sa &scaron;kurama.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Braèki kamen na balkonskoj ogradi.</p>', '<p>We are pleased to offer this modestly priced apartment near the centre of  Supetar.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is 10 minutes from the centre of the village and from the  harbour, and from here a few minutes to many of the very un-crowded beaches,  suitable for&nbsp;swimming and boating, which makes this coast so popular with  tourists.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property is a modern style apartment on the second floor.  It has many of the modern design features which are becoming more fashionable  such as&nbsp;larger windows, open plan dining and kitchen areas, and access to  balconies with long views across the sea.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The floors inside are solid wood and  the&nbsp;bathroom is fitted with good quality fixtures.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The balcony has  the famous local stone, and the windows are aluminium and insulated, with  adjustable light shutters.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact our office to arrange to visit  this property.</p>', '', '893_Apartment_0.jpg', '893_Apartment_1.jpg', '893_Apartment_2.jpg', '893_Apartment_3.jpg', '893_Apartment_4.jpg', '893_Apartment_5.jpg', '893_Apartment_6.jpg', '893_Apartment_7.jpg', ''),
(894, 'Boris', 'Tomiæ', '', '', '', 'Brac', 'Supetar', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '400', '200', '110', 1, '160000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 4, 2, 'October 9, 2014', '<p>Samostojeæa kuæa na dvije eta¾e ukupne povr&scaron;ine 110 m2 smje&scaron;tena na parceli povr&scaron;ine 200m2. Donja eta¾a je manji dvosoban stan cca 40 m2, mala visina od samo 210 cm. Gornja eta¾a, standardna visina, prostrana terasa 20 m2 + 70 m2: ulazni hodnik, kupaonica, 2 spavaæe sobe, dnevni boravak i posebna prostorija kuhinja s blagovaonom.</p>', '<p>We are offering this modern detached house on two floors near the centre of one of the larger island villages. It is 10 minutes'' walk to the harbour, where the majority of restaurants and bars tend to be found, but is in a quiet part of the town with parking&nbsp;attached. The property is partly dug into the steep side of the hill, so in high summer it remains cool.</p>', '', '<p>Samostojeæa kuæa na dvije eta¾e ukupne povr&scaron;ine 110 m2 smje&scaron;tena na parceli povr&scaron;ine 200m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Donja eta¾a je manji dvosoban stan cca 40 m2, mala visina od samo 210 cm.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Gornja eta¾a, standardna visina, prostrana terasa 20 m2 + 70 m2: ulazni hodnik, kupaonica, 2 spavaæe sobe, dnevni boravak i posebna prostorija kuhinja s blagovaonom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Klimatizirana gornja eta¾a, donja ukopana s ju¾ne strane tako da je ugodno hladno tijekom ljeta.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Okuænica je prednje donje dvori&scaron;te &ndash; parking natkriven vinovom lozom i prolaz oko kuæe.</p>', '<p>We are offering this modern detached house on two floors near the centre of one  of the larger island villages.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is 10 minutes'' walk to the harbour,  where the majority of restaurants and bars tend to be found, but is in a quiet  part of the town with parking&nbsp;attached.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The lower floor of this building  has relatively low ceilings (2.1m) but is a one bedroom apartment of 40m  sq.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The first floor, with all the rooms having standard height ceilings, is a  two bedroom apartment, with a separate kitchen and dining room and a  lounge&nbsp;with access to the covered terrace with a substantial bbq  grill.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property is partly dug into the steep side of the hill, so in  high summer it remains cool.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please feel free to contact the Croatian  Property Sales office to arrange a visit to this property.</p>', '', '894_House-Villa_0.jpg', '894_House-Villa_1.jpg', '894_House-Villa_2.jpg', '894_House-Villa_3.jpg', '894_House-Villa_4.jpg', '894_House-Villa_5.jpg', '894_House-Villa_6.jpg', '894_House-Villa_7.jpg', '894_House-Villa_8.jpg'),
(895, 'Boris', 'Tomiæ', '', '', '', 'Brac', 'Dol', 'For sale', 'Old stone house', '2000', '200', '165', 2, '268000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 4, 3, 'October 9, 2014', '<p>Kompletno renovirana kamena kuæa u mjestu 2 km od mora. Cijelo mjesto je za&scaron;tiæeni spomenik kulture. U mjestu se nalazi nekoliko tipiènih dalmatinskih konoba-restorana i ku&scaron;aonica vina. Kuæa je tlocrtne povr&scaron;ine 55 m2 i sastoji se od 4 spavaæe sobe i 3 kupaonice. Kuæa je u najmu i posjeduje 3 zvjezdice!</p>', '<p>We are very pleased to offer this beautifully renovated stone house in a stunning location. To fully appreciate the location and character of this property we urge you to come and visit it. The village is inland from the sea, and is set at the top of a steep valley. The house has been completely renovated to a high standard, both outside and inside, and measures 55m sq on each of the three floors.</p>', '', '<p>Kompletno renovirana kamena kuæa u mjestu 2 km od mora.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Cijelo mjesto je za&scaron;tiæeni spomenik kulture.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U mjestu se nalazi nekoliko tipiènih dalmatinskih konoba-restorana i ku&scaron;aonica vina.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Do veæeg mjesta gdje su duæani, restorani, caffei, hoteli, autobusna stanica ima 2 km, a 7 km je udaljeno od trajektne luke.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je tlocrtne povr&scaron;ine 55 m2 i sastoji se od:</p>\r\n<p>- konoba, gustirna i gara¾a na najdonjoj eta¾i</p>\r\n<p>- visoko prizemlje: terasa 30 m2, stan 55 m2, dvor 40 m2</p>\r\n<p>- kat: stan 55 m2 + 12 m2 (2 kupaonice) + &nbsp;terasa 16 m2</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je u najmu i posjeduje 3 zvjezdice!</p>', '<p>We are very pleased to offer this beautifully renovated stone house in a  stunning location.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>To fully appreciate the location and character of this  property we urge you to come and visit it.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The village is inland from the  sea, and is set at the top of a steep valley.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The entire village is a  protected monument, but like all inland villages on the island, it is off most  tourist radar screens, so is wonderfully peaceful&nbsp;at all times, being visited  by only those coming to the typical Dalmatian ''Konoba'' restaurants for the wine  tasting and famous home cooking.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is 2k to the nearest larger town with  shops, hotels and more facilities, and from there it is 7k to the main  port.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house has been completely renovated to a high standard, both  outside and inside, and measures 55m sq on each of the three floors.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The  ground floor is a cellar, water storage tank and a garage.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Above this is a  one bedroom apartment, and at the top is a further apartment with two bathrooms.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The open plan lounge leads to the large terrace covered with vines giving  shade in high summer.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>These rooms were being rented to tourists and had a  3 star rating.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact our island office to make an appointment to  visit the property.</p>', '', '895_Old-stone-house_0.jpg', '895_Old-stone-house_1.jpg', '895_Old-stone-house_2.jpg', '895_Old-stone-house_3.jpg', '895_Old-stone-house_4.jpg', '895_Old-stone-house_5.jpg', '895_Old-stone-house_6.jpg', '895_Old-stone-house_7.jpg', '895_Old-stone-house_8.jpg'),
(896, 'Boris', 'Tomiæ', '', '', '', 'Brac', 'Mirca', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '100', '350', '350', 1, '280000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 10, 5, 'October 9, 2014', '<p>Kuæa u nizu u malom, mirnom mjestu uz more na sjevernoj strani otoka, udaljenom svega 2 km od Supetra. Od mora je udaljena svega 100 metara.&nbsp;Kao takva je i svojevrsna oaza mira u blizini koje je planski ostavljen pojas zelenila-borov &scaron;umarak. Kuæa se sastoji od prizemlja i 2 kata, s ukupnom stambenom povr&scaron;inom od 350 m2.</p>', '<p>We are pleased to offer this attractive house in a small village 100m from the shore. The village is close to Supetar, on the north coast of the island, facing the mainland, and is very much unspoilt and typical Dalmatian in character. The house itself has 3 floors, with a total living area of 350 m sq.</p>', '', '<p>Kuæa u nizu u malom, mirnom mjestu uz more na sjevernoj strani otoka, udaljenom svega 2 km od Supetra.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Od mora je udaljena svega 100 metara.&nbsp;Kao takva je i svojevrsna oaza mira u blizini koje je planski ostavljen pojas zelenila-borov &scaron;umarak.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa se sastoji od prizemlja i 2 kata.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Prizemlje èine 2 dvosobna apartmana</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>1.kat se takoðer sastoji od 2 dvosobna apartmana (svaki apartman se sastoji od dnevnog boravka s blagovaonicom i kuhinjom, balkonom, kupaonicom i 2 spavaæe sobe, od ukupno cca 60-70 m2)</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Treæa eta¾a visokog potkrovlja nije dovr&scaron;ena, ali je u uporabi od strane vlasnika za vrijeme dok su ostali apartmani iznajmljeni.</p>', '<p>We are pleased to offer this attractive house in a small village 100m from the  shore.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The village is close to Supetar, on the north coast of the island,  facing the mainland, and is very much unspoilt and typical Dalmatian in  character.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There are small shops, bars, and a small harbour, and 10 minutes  walk in any direction brings you to either a beautiful part of the coast or  natural&nbsp;woodland.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house itself has 3 floors.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The ground and  first floor were designed as two bedroom flats, with open plan family-style  kitchens, and with separate entrances. They have been well maintained and  are very presentable, and both have attractive balconies. The total area of  each floor is just under 70m sq.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The top floor has not been decorated as yet  and the current owner intended to live here while the two lower floors were  rented to tourists.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There is parking near the property.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please  contact our island office to arrange to visit this and similar properties.</p>', '', '896_House-Villa_0.jpg', '896_House-Villa_1.jpg', '896_House-Villa_2.jpg', '896_House-Villa_3.jpg', '896_House-Villa_4.jpg', '896_House-Villa_5.jpg', '896_House-Villa_6.jpg', '', ''),
(897, 'Richard', 'Roberts', '+44 771 942 8357, +996 770 971 821', '091 534 7730 kljuè Ranko Alimiæ', 'richrob@emirates.net.ae', 'Peljesac', 'Radalj 144, 20356 Klek, k.è. 10553/97 KO Slivno', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '5', '271', '155', 2, '250000', '', 2, 2, 2, 1, 1, 2, 3, 2, 'October 11, 2014', '<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;">CIJENA SNI®ENA NA 250.000 &euro;!</span></p>\r\n<p>U potpunosti namje&scaron;tena dvojna kuæa u prvom redu do mora, s pogledom na Pelje&scaron;ac. Kuæa je povr&scaron;ine 155 m2 (ukljuèujuæi i terase), a sastoji se od prizemlja i kata. Nalazi se u malom mjestu nedaleko od Kleka. Kuæa posjeduje i mul s vezom za brod. Odlièna lokacija!</p>', '<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;">Croatia - Radalj Peninsula, Klek - overlooking Peljesac.</span></p>\r\n<p>A&nbsp;fully furnished&nbsp;semi-detached house located on the Radalj peninsula, in the first line to the sea overlooking Peljesac. The villa approximate area is 155 square meters on two floors, including terraces. The house has recently been fully renovated / refurbished internally and externally. The house has its own mooring and an ideal location for sailing, fishing, wind surfing and other water sports.&nbsp;Prime location!</p>', '', '<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;"><strong>CIJENA SNI®ENA NA 250.000 &euro;</strong></span></p>\r\n<p><strong><br /></strong></p>\r\n<p>U potpunosti namje&scaron;tena dvojna kuæa u prvom redu do mora, s pogledom na Pelje&scaron;ac.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je povr&scaron;ine 155 m2 (ukljuèujuæi i terase), a sastoji se od prizemlja i kata. Nalazi se u malom mjestu nedaleko od Kleka.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Prizemlje</strong>: dnevni boravak / blagovaona, 1 kupaonica i kuhinja.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Prvi kat</strong>: 1 braèna soba okrenuta prema moru s velikom terasom, 1 dvokrevetna soba na strani ceste s pogledom na more i malom terasom, 1 jednokrevetna soba na strani ceste takoðer s pogledom na more i malom terasom, 1 kupaonica.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Okuænica</strong>: 2 ostave ispod terase, 1 WC / tu&scaron; za kori&scaron;tenje nakon kupanja u moru koji se nalazi ispod vanjskih stepenica (potrebno renoviranje).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Vrt</strong>: mali vrt / poploèen prostor s velikom palmom. Iz vrta se izlazi na pla¾u gdje se nalazi "privatni" mol s vezom za brod.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa se nalazi u neposrednoj blizini gradskih sadr¾aja - po&scaron;ta / trgovine / ugostiteljstvo itd.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Mnoga mjesta od interesa su u neposrednoj blizini: stari grad Ston je 15 minuta vo¾nje, Dubrovnik 70 km, Opuzen i Metkoviæ 10-20 minuta gdje se nalaze brojni shopping centri. Stari grad Mostar 45 minuta vo¾nje i Sarajevo cca 2 sata.</p>', '<p><strong><span style="text-decoration: underline;">Croatia - Radalj Peninsula, Klek - overlooking Peljesac</span></strong></p>\r\n<p><strong><span style="text-decoration: underline;"><br /></span></strong></p>\r\n<p><strong><span style="text-decoration: underline;">PRICE REDUCED TO 250.000 &euro;!</span></strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>A <strong>fully furnished</strong> semi-detached house located on the Radalj peninsula, in the first line to the sea overlooking Peljesac. The Radalj peninsula is just south of the Repic peninsula and 2 km north of the tourist village Klek, <strong>70 km north of Dubrovnik</strong> and <strong>150 km south of Split</strong> accessed easily from the main Split &ndash; Dubrovnik highway / coast road. The situation of the Radalj peninsula is unique as seen in the panoramic view and is the home to a limited number [25+] of sort after villas with direct private sea frontage.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The villa approximate area is 155 square meters on two floors, including terraces. The house has recently been fully renovated / refurbished internally and externally, high quality widows and shutters installed giving full security, external fa&ccedil;ade renewed, complete new bathrooms and kitchen [sanitary ware and finishes], internal finishes / doors, plumbing and electrical installations.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house has its own mooring and an ideal location for sailing, fishing, wind surfing and other water sports.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Ground Floor;</strong></p>\r\n<p>The main entrance at ground floor is via the covered car port integral to the building, the entrance opens onto the main living room and dining areas, there is a fitted kitchen that faces the access road, a bathroom [with shower, WC, wash hand basin and washing machine] and an oak staircase to the first floor. The living room fa&ccedil;ade is fully glazed and shuttered that opens onto the large covered terrace facing the sea.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>First Floor;</strong></p>\r\n<p>The first floor is accessed by an oak staircase onto the upper landing that leads to three bedrooms and the second bathroom. The main double bedroom faces the sea with direct access to a large open terrace. The second double bedroom and single bedroom are road side also with sea views and have a small covered terrace. The second bathroom has bath with shower, WC, wash hand basin and electric boiler providing hot water to both bathrooms and kitchen.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>External;</strong></p>\r\n<p>There is a small paved garden with a large palm tree and gated access to sea front with boat mooring and sitting area. A store room under the terrace, a toilet and shower for beach use below the external stairs [needs renovation].</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>General;</strong></p>\r\n<p>Local amenities are found in Klek [post office, shops, restaurants etc] a short walking distance along the sea front.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Many places of interest on your doorstep, the old city of Ston a 15 minute drive, Dubrovnik 70 km, Opuzen and Metkovic 10 &ndash; 20 minutes with full shopping facilities. The historic cities of Mostar a 45 minute drive and Sarajevo 2 hours plus.</p>', '', '897_House-Villa_0.jpg', '897_House-Villa_1.JPG', '897_House-Villa_2.JPG', '897_House-Villa_3.JPG', '897_House-Villa_4.JPG', '897_House-Villa_5.JPG', '897_House-Villa_6.JPG', '897_House-Villa_7.JPG', '897_House-Villa_8.JPG'),
(898, 'Tade', 'Brataniæ', '', '', '', 'Hvar', 'Uvala Oskoru¹ica', 'For sale', 'Old stone house', '200', '1000', '50', 1, '120000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 2, 1, 'October 12, 2014', '<p>Novo sagraðena prizemna mala kamena kuæa na zemlji&scaron;tu od 1000m2 sa popratnim objektom, u blizini mora i lijepih uvala na sjevernoj strani otoka Hvara.&nbsp;Kuæa je stambene povr&scaron;ine 40 m2 plus komin kuæica od 10 m2.&nbsp;Pristup vozilom do kuæe.&nbsp;Voda i struja nisu prikljuèeni ali se nalaze u neposrednoj blizini, cca 500 metara od kuæe.&nbsp;Sa zemlji&scaron;ta se pru¾a pogled na otok Braè.</p>', '<p>We are very pleased to offer this small property on a very large plot, just outside Hvar town. It is a newly built single-storey stone house on a large plot of 1000m2, close to the sea and beautiful bays on the north side of the island. The shore is 200m from the house. It is a small house with living area of &#8203;&#8203;40 m2 plus a small covered out house with barbeque/ grill of 10 m2.</p>', '', '<p>Novo sagraðena prizemna mala kamena kuæa na zemlji&scaron;tu od 1000m2 sa popratnim objektom, u blizini mora i lijepih uvala na sjevernoj strani otoka Hvara.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je stambene povr&scaron;ine 40 m2 plus komin kuæica od 10 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je predana za legalizaciju jer je sagraðena prije roka kada se mo¾e legalizirati objekt.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Pristup vozilom do kuæe.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Voda i struja nisu prikljuèeni ali se nalaze u neposrednoj blizini, cca 500 metara od kuæe.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sa zemlji&scaron;ta se pru¾a pogled na otok Braè.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Udaljenost od mora 200 m.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Najbli¾e mjesto je grad Hvar.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Lijepa lokacija!</p>', '<p>We are very pleased to offer this small property on a very large plot, just  outside Hvar town.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is a newly built single-storey stone house on a  large plot of 1000m2, close to the sea and beautiful bays on the north side  of the island.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The shore is 200m from the house.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The nearest town is the  town of Hvar.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is a small house with living area of &#8203;&#8203;40 m2 plus a  small covered out house with barbeque/ grill of 10 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The legalisation  of the recent work is still outstanding, but it has been submitted, so we  expect it to be done in the near future.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property has vehicle access,  but water and electricity has not yet been connected. The nearest connection  is 500 meters, and should be quite straight forward.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>These ''defects''  have been built into the price, and once sorted the owner will have a house  with stunning views in a spectacular location, just outside the town of  Hvar.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact the office on Hvar to arrange to visit this  property.</p>', '', '898_Old-stone-house_0.jpg', '898_Old-stone-house_1.jpg', '898_Old-stone-house_2.jpg', '898_Old-stone-house_3.jpg', '898_Old-stone-house_4.jpg', '898_Old-stone-house_5.jpg', '', '', ''),
(899, 'Miljenko', 'Radi¹iæ', '', '', '', 'Hvar', 'Jelsa Hvar', 'For sale', 'Old stone house', '400', '50', '90', 2, '120000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 3, 2, 'October 12, 2014', '<p>Kamena kuæa u veæem mjestu na moru na sjevernoj strani otoka Hvara. Kuæa ima ukupnu stambenu povr&scaron;inu 90 m2. Sastoji se od prizemlja i kata koje je povezano unutarnjim i vanjskim stepenicama. Kuæa ima pravo dogradnje potkrovlja za sto je veæ uèinjen nacrt. Potrebna renovacija.</p>', '<p>We are pleased to offer this attractive stone house on the north side of the island. The property is a traditional Dalmatian style property, 90m sq, on two floors. There are internal and external stairs connecting the floors. There is possibility to build an extra floor/attic, and Vendor has plans which are available for inspection. The house is in need of some renovation.</p>', '', '<p>Kamena kuæa u veæem mjestu na moru na sjevernoj strani otoka Hvara.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa ima ukupnu stambenu povr&scaron;inu 90 m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sastoji se od prizemlja i kata koje je povezano unutarnjim i vanjskim stepenicama.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U prizemlju je kuhinja i dnevni boravak u kojem se nalazi kamin, te jedna kupaonica i mala sprema.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na katu su tri sobe i jo&scaron; jedna kupaonica s wc-om.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa ima pravo dogradnje potkrovlja za sto je veæ uèinjen nacrt.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Potrebna renovacija.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za dogovor oko razgledavanja kontaktirajte CPS - Hvar ured!</p>', '<p>We are pleased to offer this attractive stone house on the north side of the  island.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property is a traditional Dalmatian style property, 90m sq,  on two floors.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There are internal and external stairs connecting the  floors.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The ground floor has a kitchen and a living room with a fireplace,  and a bathroom and a small storage space.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Upstairs are three bedrooms and  another bathroom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There is possibility to build an extra floor/attic, and  Vendor has plans which are available for inspection.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house is in need  of some renovation.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is situated in a village with many facilities,  shops, bars and restaurants, but very charming and typical of the many  unspoilt villages on the island.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact our office on Hvar  island to arrange to visit this property.</p>', '', '899_Old-stone-house_0.jpg', '899_Old-stone-house_1.jpg', '899_Old-stone-house_2.jpg', '899_Old-stone-house_3.jpg', '899_Old-stone-house_4.jpg', '899_Old-stone-house_5.jpg', '', '', ''),
(900, 'Zlata', 'Popoviæ', '', '095/ 908 1671', '', 'Split', 'Istarska 16', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '650', '0', '114', 1, '220000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 3, 2, 'October 13, 2014', '<p>Prostrani apartman u potkrovlju (3.kat) starogradske zgrade, sa prekrasnim pogledom na Marjan, sa izvrsnim turistièkim potencijalom. Smje&scaron;ten je u centru Splita, 10 minuta hodanja istoèno od palaèe i rive. Apartman je u potpunosti renoviran. Ukupna brutto stambena povr&scaron;ina sa terasom iznosi 114 m2.</p>\r\n<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;">CIJENA SNI®ENA S &euro;240.000 - IZVRSNA PRILIKA</span></p>', '<p>We are pleased to offer this spacious apartment near Split town centre. It is situated about 10 minute&rsquo;s walk from the centre of the Palace, the water front, and 5 minutes from the Marjan Park. This apartment is on the top floor (third) looking towards the Marjan park. The flat has been restored and modernised by the current owners, and it has been decorated to a good standard. It measures 114m sq.</p>\r\n<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;">PRICE REDUCED FROM &euro;240.000 - EXCELLENT OPPORTUNITY</span></p>', '', '<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;"><strong>CIJENA SNI®ENA S &euro;240.000</strong></span></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Prostrani apartman u potkrovlju (3.kat) starogradske zgrade, sa prekrasnim pogledom na Marjan, sa izvrsnim turistièkim potencijalom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Smje&scaron;ten je u centru Splita, 10 minuta hodanja istoèno od palaèe i rive.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartman je u potpunosti renoviran, te je potrebno samo dodatno ulaganje po ¾elji buduæeg vlasnika. Takoðer su krov i cijeli vanjski dio zgrade obnovljeni.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ukupna brutto stambena povr&scaron;ina sa terasom iznosi 114 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sastoji se od hodnika, kuhinje + blagovaonice, 3 spavaæe sobe, 1 manje radne sobe, kupaonice, wc-a i dnevnog boravka iz kojeg se izlazi na prostrani balkon sa kojeg se pru¾a pogled na grad i park &scaron;umu Marjan.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Najbli¾e pla¾e se nalaze na popularnim Baèvicama, do kojih je potrebno 15 minuta hodanja.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Veliki javni parking udaljen je 50 m od zgrade, ali postoji moguænost i parkiranja uz samu zgradu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Svi potrebni sadr¾aji nalaze se u blizini, dok je meðunarodni aerodrom udaljen 40 min. vo¾nje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za sve dodatne informacije slobodno nas kontaktirajte.</p>', '<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;"><strong>PRICE REDUCED FROM &euro;240.000</strong></span></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>We are pleased to offer this spacious apartment near Split town centre.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is situated about 10 minute&rsquo;s walk from the centre of the Palace, the water front, and 5 minutes from the Marjan Park.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The building is early 20th century, built while the country was part of the Austria-Hungary empire, and the exterior and roof have recently been restored.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>This apartment is on the top floor (third) looking towards the Marjan park.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The flat has been restored and modernised by the current owners, and it has been decorated to a good standard.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It measures 114m sq.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is designed with a kitchen and dining room, a small study, bathroom and separate WC, 3 bedrooms, and a lounge with access on to a spacious balcony, with views over the city and park.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There is parking next to the building, and a larger carpark 50m away. There are shops, bars, bakery, restaurants and many of Splits tourist attractions within walking distance of the property.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The airport is less than 40 minutes drive away.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact our office in Split to arrange to visit this property.</p>', '', '900_Apartment_0.jpg', '900_Apartment_1.jpg', '900_Apartment_2.jpg', '900_Apartment_3.jpg', '900_Apartment_4.jpg', '900_Apartment_5.jpg', '900_Apartment_6.jpg', '900_Apartment_7.jpg', '900_Apartment_8.jpg'),
(901, 'Petar', 'Bazo', '', '097/922 2597', '', 'Split', 'Istarska 21', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '600', '0', '60', 1, '200000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 3, 2, 'October 13, 2014', '<p>Apartman u starogradskoj zgradi, djelomièno renoviran, smje&scaron;ten na 1.katu u mirnom dijelu grada. Nalazi se u centru Splita udaljen 10 minuta &scaron;etnje istoèno od Dioklecijanove palaèe i popularne Rive. Ukupna stambena povr&scaron;ina iznosi 60 m2, a sastoji se od hodnika, kuhinje, 1 velike spavaæe sobe na jugu koja ima izlaz na balkon, kupaonice, 1 spavaæe sobe i odvojenog dijela gdje se nalazi spavaæa soba i kupaonica.</p>', '<p>We are offering this apartment near the centre of Split. It is situated within walking distance of all the cultural and historic monuments in Split, 10 minutes from the Palace, the waterfront and five minute&rsquo;s walk from the Marjan park. It is on the first floor, in a quiet street, and it measures 60m sq.</p>', '', '<p>Apartman u starogradskoj zgradi, djelomièno renoviran, smje&scaron;ten na 1.katu u mirnom dijelu grada.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nalazi se u centru Splita udaljen 10 minuta &scaron;etnje istoèno od Dioklecijanove palaèe i popularne Rive.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ukupna stambena povr&scaron;ina iznosi 60 m2, a sastoji se od hodnika, kuhinje, 1 velike spavaæe sobe na jugu koja ima izlaz na balkon, kupaonice, 1 spavaæe sobe i odvojenog dijela gdje se nalazi spavaæa soba i kupaonica.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartmanu je potrebno jo&scaron; ulaganja ali je i u sada&scaron;njem stanju moguæ normalan boravak.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>S obzirom na odlièan polo¾aj ima turistièki potencijala ali je idealan i za vlastito u¾ivanje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Javni parking se nalazi odmah uz zgradu dok je veliki parking udaljen cca. 200 m.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Svi potrebni sadr¾aji nalaze se u blizini dok je meðunarodni aerodrom udaljen 40 min. vo¾nje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za sve dodatne informacije stojimo vam na raspolaganju.</p>', '<p>We are offering this apartment near the centre of Split.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is situated within walking distance of all the cultural and historic monuments in Split, 10 minutes from the Palace, the waterfront and five minute&rsquo;s walk from the Marjan park.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is on the first floor, in a quiet street, and it measures 60m sq.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There is a hall, kitchen, bedroom with balcony, a smaller bedroom and a separate area with a further bedroom and bathroom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property needs some investment to complete the redecorating which has been left half completed by the current owners, although it is habitable as it is.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Near this property are shops, a bakery, bars and other facilities needed by residents and tourists, alike.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The nearest parking is just outside the building, and the airport is 40 minute&rsquo;s drive from here.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact the office to arrange to visit this property.</p>', '', '901_Apartment_0.jpg', '901_Apartment_1.jpg', '901_Apartment_2.jpg', '901_Apartment_3.jpg', '901_Apartment_4.jpg', '901_Apartment_5.jpg', '901_Apartment_6.jpg', '901_Apartment_7.jpg', '901_Apartment_8.jpg'),
(902, 'Krsto', 'Livaèiæ', '', '091 302 53 78, 021 319239', '', 'Rogoznica', 'Uvala do Kanice, 13370 K.O. Sevid', 'For sale', 'Land plot', '5', '859', '65', 1, '240000', '', 2, 2, 2, 1, 1, 2, 0, 0, 'October 15, 2014', '<p>Parcela 1. red do mora s pravomoænom graðevinskom dozvolom, udaljena svega par metara od mora i prirodne &scaron;ljunkovite pla¾e. Zemlji&scaron;te povr&scaron;ine 859 m2 se nalazi u uvali koja je u potpunosti nenaseljena i neizgraðena. Smje&scaron;tena je u samom dnu uvale, odnosno odmah povi&scaron;e &scaron;ljunèane pla¾e. Ekskluzivna parcela kakvih je malo u ponudi!</p>', '<p>We are offering a large plot of 859m sq on a very secluded part of the coast, adjacent to the sea. The plot is on the mainland, first line to the sea and with no near neighbours. This really is an unusual and exciting project. The plot was historically occupied by a house that fell into ruin and this allowed the rare permission to be agreed. The views are superb and the sea is absolutely clear at this point.</p>', '', '<p>Parcela 1. red do mora s pravomoænom graðevinskom dozvolom, udaljena svega par metara od mora i prirodne &scaron;ljunkovite pla¾e.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Zemlji&scaron;te povr&scaron;ine 859 m2 se nalazi u uvali koja je u potpunosti nenaseljena i neizgraðena.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Smje&scaron;tena je u samom dnu uvale, odnosno odmah povi&scaron;e &scaron;ljunèane pla¾e.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na parceli se nalazi kuæa koja je u ru&scaron;evnom stanju, ali je izgraðena po projektu za koji je dobivena graðevinska dozvola te je kao takva u potpunosti legalna.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ukupna brutto povr&scaron;ina kuæe koju je moguæe izgraditi iznosi 81 m2, a netto povr&scaron;ina 65 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je prizemnica s dvije spavaæe sobe, dnevnim prostorom, kuhinjom, blagovaonicom, kupaonicom i spremom za vodu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na parceli nema prikljuèak za&nbsp; struju i vodu, a ima vlastitu septièku jamu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Oko kuæe je&nbsp; vrt s terasom. U vrtu je zasaðeno mediteransko bilje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U potpunosti netaknuta priroda oko parcele i prekrasan pogled na more i uvalu èini ovu parcelu jedinstvenom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Pristup parceli je makadamska cesta koja je probijena kroz prirodu kao obavezni vatrogasni put.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ekskluzivna parcela kakvih je malo u ponudi !</p>', '<p>We are offering a large plot of 859m sq on a very secluded part of  the coast, adjacent to the sea.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The plot is on the mainland, first line  to the sea and with no near neighbours.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>This really is an unusual and  exciting project.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The entire bay is uninhabited and this plot has a  building permit. The plot was historically occupied by a house that fell  into ruin and this allowed the rare permission to be agreed.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There is no  electricity or water, but there is an existing septic tank.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Access to the  plot is down a gravel track maintained for emergency vehicles.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The total  area of the house that can be built is 81 m2 gross, i.e. 65 m2 net  area.&nbsp;It''s a ground floor house with two bedrooms, living room, kitchen, dining room, bathroom and storage of water.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The plot is mostly  gardens and terraces with native plants being dominant.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The views are superb and the sea is absolutely clear at this point.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>This is a very rare  opportunity, to be able to design and build your own house in such a dream  location, and we urge anyone looking for this type of property to act fast  and arrange a visit.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The nearest larger towns are Rogoznica and Trogir.</p>\r\n<p>The airport is about 30 minutes driving.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact the office in  Split.</p>', '', '902_Land-plot_0.jpg', '902_Land-plot_1.jpg', '902_Land-plot_2.jpg', '902_Land-plot_3.jpg', '902_Land-plot_4.jpg', '902_Land-plot_5.jpg', '902_Land-plot_6.jpg', '', ''),
(1023, '®arko', 'Rogan', '', '', '', 'Hvar', 'Basina, Hvar', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '70', '320', '120', 2, '400000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 4, 2, 'January 27, 2015', '<p>Lijepa kuæa u prekrasnoj uvali sa otvorenim pogledom, 70 metara od mora. Povr&scaron;ina zemlji&scaron;ta je 320 m2. Kuæa ima ukupnu stambenu povr&scaron;inu od 120 m2 i sastoji se od dva kata. Kuæa je izmeðu katova povezana unutarnjim i vanjskim stepenicama. Oko kuæe je lijep vrt, a iznad kuæe se nalazi natkriveno parkirno mjesto za dva automobila.</p>', '<p>We are pleased to offer this attractive villa, elevated on the sloping side of a beautiful bay, with great views, just a minutes'' walk from the water''s edge.&nbsp;It is situated just 70m from the quiet and protected shore on Hvar island, surrounded by some low density housing, set among natural vegetation and protected woodland.&nbsp;The house has a living area of 120 m2 and consists of two floors.&nbsp;The land around the house has been landscaped and well maintained, so the gardens an attractive feature to enjoy.</p>', '', '<p>Lijepa kuæa u prekrasnoj uvali sa otvorenim pogledom, 70 metara od mora.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Povr&scaron;ina zemlji&scaron;ta je 320 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa ima ukupnu stambenu povr&scaron;inu od 120 m2 i sastoji se od dva kata.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U prizemlju je jednosobni apartman.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na katu je trosoban stan.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sve sa terasama i balkonima sa kojih se iz svakog kuta vidi more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je izmeðu katova povezana unutarnjim i vanjskim stepenicama.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Oko kuæe je lijep vrt, a iznad kuæe se nalazi natkriveno parkirno mjesto za dva automobila.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Solidne je gradnje i ima odlièan pogled na more i cijelu uvalu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za detaljnije informacije i obilazak nekretnine stojimo na usluzi.</p>', '<p>We are pleased to offer this attractive villa, elevated on the sloping side of a beautiful bay, with great views, just a minutes'' walk from the water''s edge.<br /><br /><br />It is situated just 70m from the quiet and protected shore on Hvar island, surrounded by some low density housing, set among natural vegetation and protected woodland.<br /><br /><br />The nearest coffee bar is within walking distance, and the nearest shops and other services are in easy reach with a car.<br /><br /><br />The total land area is 320 m2.<br /><br /><br />The &nbsp;house has a living area of 120 m2 and consists of two floors.<br /><br /><br />The ground floor is one bedroom apartment.<br /><br /><br />On the first floor is a three bedroom apartment.<br /><br /><br />Each level has access outside onto the covered terrace, or balcony upstairs, and all angles have a great view out to sea and beyond the immediate bay.<br /><br /><br />There are internal stairs between each floor, and in addition, both floors have an independent entrance from outside.<br /><br /><br />The land around the house has been landscaped and well maintained, so the gardens an attractive feature to enjoy.<br /><br /><br />The property was built well, with good materials, and it has been well looked after, needing little maintenance immediately.<br /><br /><br />For more specific information or tour around the property we are at your service.</p>', '', '1023_House-Villa_0.jpg', '1023_House-Villa_1.jpg', '1023_House-Villa_2.jpg', '1023_House-Villa_3.jpg', '1023_House-Villa_4.jpg', '1023_House-Villa_5.jpg', '1023_House-Villa_6.jpg', '1023_House-Villa_7.jpg', '1023_House-Villa_8.jpg'),
(903, 'Nata¹a', 'Radecki', '', '091 2535 854', 'natasa.radecki@gmail.com', 'Rogoznica', 'Sevid, 20210/7 upis è. zgr. 15778', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '100', '480', '150', 1, '300000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 5, 4, 'October 15, 2014', '<p>Kuæa s pogledom na more u lijepoj uvali. Povr&scaron;ina kuæe je 150 m2, a sagraðena je na parceli povr&scaron;ine 480 m2. Kuæa se sastoji od prizemlja i prvog kata. Kuæa ima sve dozvole za obavljanje turistièke djelatnosti iznajmljivanja apartmana. Od mora je udaljena 100 metara, a do najbli¾ih restorana, duæana i centra mjesta udaljenost je 100 m.</p>', '<p>We are pleased to offer this house, divided into 2 holiday apartments. It is situated in a beautiful bay, overlooking the sea, on the edge of a small village. It is just 100m from the shops, bars and bakery in the village and 20 minutes away from the larger town. The house is of a modern style, and well maintained. It has a ground and first floor, each of 75m sq.</p>', '', '<p>Kuæa s pogledom na more u lijepoj uvali.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Povr&scaron;ina kuæe je 150 m2, a sagraðena je na parceli povr&scaron;ine 480 m2. Kuæa se sastoji od prizemlja i prvog kata.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U prizemlju povr&scaron;ine 75 m2 nalaze se: dnevni boravak, kuhinja, 2 kupaonice i 2 spavaæe sobe. Oko kuæe je balkon du¾ine 7 m i dvije terase jedna povr&scaron;ine 10 m2, a druga 10,5 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na prvom katu povr&scaron;ine 75 m2 nalaze se: kuhinja s dnevnim boravkom, 3 spavaæe sobe, 2 kupaonice i oko kuæe dva balkona od 7 m.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Oba kata su klimatizirana.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa ima sve dozvole za obavljanje turistièke djelatnosti iznajmljivanja apartmana.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Pored kuæe u vrtu nalazi se sjenica i kamin, a okolo je zasaðeno mediteransko bilje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Uveden je solarni sustav koji se koristi za pripremu tople vode.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>S parcele se mo¾e izaæi na dvije prometnice. Kuæa ima parking mjesto.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Do najbli¾ih restorana, duæana i centra mjesta udaljenost je 100 m.</p>', '<p>We are pleased to offer this house, divided into 2 holiday apartments.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is situated in a beautiful bay, overlooking the sea, on the edge of a small  village.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is just 100m from the shops, bars and bakery in the village and  20 minutes away from the larger town, and cultural centre which is  Trogir.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house is of a modern style, and well maintained. It has a  ground and first floor, each of 75m sq.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The ground floor has an open plan  lounge, kitchen with 2 bedrooms, 3 bathrooms plus two terraces: one of 10 m2 and  another of 10.5 m2, both with nice sea view.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>First floor of 75 m2 includes:  kitchen, living room, 3 bedrooms, 2 bathrooms.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Around the house there are  spacious balconies (7 meters length) so the superb view can be fully  enjoyed.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There is air-con on both floors, and solar panels supplying hot  water.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Outside are parking spaces and a large and practical BBQ/grill for  parties, built on a spacious patio under shade.&nbsp;The remainder of the garden  is planted with native plants.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>House has rental license in  tourism.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact our office in Split to arrange to visit this  property.</p>', '', '903_House-Villa_0.jpg', '903_House-Villa_1.jpg', '903_House-Villa_2.jpg', '903_House-Villa_3.jpg', '903_House-Villa_4.jpg', '903_House-Villa_5.jpg', '903_House-Villa_6.jpg', '903_House-Villa_7.jpg', '903_House-Villa_8.jpg'),
(904, 'Ljiljana', 'Radiæ', '021/361-400', '091/ 460 1755', '095/903 7313 Stanka', 'Split', 'Istarska 18', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '600', '0', '80', 1, '170000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 'October 17, 2014', '<p>Apartman u prizemlju starogradske zgrade, od Rive i Dioklecijanove palaèe udaljen cca 300 m. Od mora je udaljen nekih 600 m. Apartman ukupne povr&scaron;ine 80m2 se sastoji od hodnika, kuhinje + blagovaonice, dnevog boravka, 2 spavaæe sobe, kupatila, wc-a, i ostave. Iz dnevnog boravka je izlaz u vrt kojim se vlasnici apartmana koriste.</p>', '<p>Ground floor apartment with direct access to the garden! We are pleased to offer this attractive and convenient property situated just 300m from the Riva and Diocletian Roman Palace. It is down a very quiet side street with little through traffic, but still walking distance from all the tourist attractions in the old city. It measures 80m2 and consists of hallway, kitchen and dining room, dining room, 2 bedrooms, bathroom, toilet, and storage.</p>', '', '<p>Apartman u prizemlju starogradske zgrade, od Rive i Dioklecijanove palaèe udaljen cca 300 m. Od mora je udaljen nekih 600 m.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ako ¾elite vlastitu oazu u jednom od najpopularnijih gradova u Dalmaciji, ovo je idealna nekretnina za vas. Takoðer se zbog odliènog potencijala mo¾e koristiti i u svrhu turistièkog iznajmljivanja.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartman ukupne povr&scaron;ine 80m2 se sastoji od hodnika, kuhinje + blagovaonice, dnevog boravka, 2 spavaæe sobe, kupatila, wc-a, i ostave.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Iz dnevnog boravka je izlaz u vrt kojim se vlasnici apartmana koriste, a u postupku je i rje&scaron;avanje vlasni&scaron;tva tog vrta koji im treba pripasti.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Javni parking je udaljen 100m od apartmana.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Svi potrebni sadr¾aji nalaze se u blizini.</p>\r\n<p>Meðunarodni aerodrom udaljen je 45 min. vo¾nje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za sve dodatne informacije stojimo vam na raspolaganju.</p>', '<p>Ground floor apartment with direct access to the garden!</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>We are pleased  to offer this attractive and convenient property situated just 300m from the  Riva and Diocletian Roman Palace.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is down a very quiet side street  with little through traffic, but still walking distance from all the tourist  attractions in the old city, most restaurants and bars and the ferry terminal,  with access to the islands etc.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It measures 80m2 and consists of hallway,  kitchen and dining room, dining room, 2 bedrooms, bathroom, toilet, and  storage.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The living room has entrance to a garden area which the owners have  right to use it, but it is not in the ownership.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Public parking is  located 100m from the apartment.</p>\r\n<p>The airport is 45 minutes from the  address.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact the office in Split to arrange to view this  property.</p>', '', '904_Apartment_0.jpg', '904_Apartment_1.jpg', '904_Apartment_2.jpg', '904_Apartment_3.jpg', '904_Apartment_4.jpg', '904_Apartment_5.jpg', '904_Apartment_6.jpg', '904_Apartment_7.jpg', '904_Apartment_8.jpg');
INSERT INTO `nekretnina` (`id`, `ime`, `prezime`, `telefon`, `mobitel`, `e_mail`, `lokacija_id`, `adresa`, `status_id`, `vrsta_id`, `udaljenost`, `povrsina`, `stambenapovrsina`, `display`, `cijena`, `cijenatocka`, `ponuda_tjedna`, `new_built`, `must_sell`, `prvi_red_do_mora`, `pogled_na_more`, `bazen`, `broj_soba`, `broj_kupatila`, `datum`, `title_hr`, `title_en`, `title_ge`, `opis_hr`, `opis_en`, `opis_ge`, `PropertyImageURL0`, `PropertyImageURL1`, `PropertyImageURL2`, `PropertyImageURL3`, `PropertyImageURL4`, `PropertyImageURL5`, `PropertyImageURL6`, `PropertyImageURL7`, `PropertyImageURL8`) VALUES
(905, 'Nenad', 'Mihoviloviæ', '', '098/ 707 123', '', 'Split', 'Istarska 13, Zgrada br. è. 4047, zemlji¹noknji¾ni ulo¾ak 7916', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '600', '0', '79', 1, '99999999', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 3, 1, 'October 17, 2014', '<p>Apartman na mezaninu starogradske zgrade, od Rive i Dioklecijanove palaèe udaljen cca 300 m. Od mora je udaljen nekih 600 m. Apartman ukupne povr&scaron;ine 79m2 se sastoji od hodnika, kuhinje + blagovaonice, 3 sobe, kupatila. Iz dnevnog boravka je izlaz u vrt povr&scaron;ine 98 m2 graðevnog zemlji&scaron;ta na koji ovaj vlasnik jedini ima pravo kori&scaron;tenja. Vlasnik posjeduje i Rje&scaron;enje po kojem ima i pravo prvokupa navedenog zemlji&scaron;ta.</p>', '<p>Convenient city centre apartment, 300m from the Palace. We are pleased to offer this spacious apartment on the mezzanine floor of an old building. The access to the property is on the first floor, by climbing a superb marble stair case. The floor area is 79m sq and is currently designed with three bedrooms, bathroom, kitchen and dining room.</p>', '', '<p>Apartman na mezaninu starogradske zgrade, od Rive i Dioklecijanove palaèe udaljen cca 300 m. Od mora je udaljen nekih 600 m.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ako ¾elite vlastitu oazu u jednom od najpopularnijih gradova u Dalmaciji, ovo je idealna nekretnina za vas. Takoðer se zbog odliènog potencijala mo¾e koristiti i u svrhu turistièkog iznajmljivanja.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartman ukupne povr&scaron;ine 79m2 se sastoji od hodnika, kuhinje + blagovaonice, 3 sobe, kupatila.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Iz dnevnog boravka je izlaz u vrt povr&scaron;ine 98 m2 graðevnog zemlji&scaron;ta na koji jedino ovaj vlasnik ima pravo kori&scaron;tenja. Vlasnik posjeduje i Rje&scaron;enje po kojem ima i pravo prvokupa navedenog zemlji&scaron;ta.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Javni parking je udaljen 100m od apartmana.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Svi potrebni sadr¾aji nalaze se u blizini.</p>\r\n<p>Meðunarodni aerodrom udaljen je 45 min vo¾nje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za sve dodatne informacije stojimo vam na raspolaganju.</p>', '<p>Convenient city centre apartment, 300m from the Palace.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>We are pleased to  offer this spacious apartment on the mezzanine floor of an old building.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The access to the property is on the first floor, by climbing a superb  marble stair case.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The floor area is 79m sq and is currently designed  with three bedrooms, bathroom, kitchen and dining room.<br />The rear of the  property is level with the garden and access is available through the living  room.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The garden is not private to the apartment, but this owner has a sole right to use it. The Vendor also has a written proof as a "first buyer right" for this garden area.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property is in good condition and  well maintained, and ready to be inhabited immediately.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is  conveniently situated with access to all the main tourist attractions in Split,  as well as the ferry terminal, the central restaurants etc.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Parking is 100m  from the building, and the airport is 45min drive.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact the  Split office of Croatia Property Sales to arrange a viewing of this  property.</p>', '', '905_Apartment_0.jpg', '905_Apartment_1.jpg', '905_Apartment_2.jpg', '905_Apartment_3.jpg', '905_Apartment_4.jpg', '905_Apartment_5.jpg', '905_Apartment_6.jpg', '905_Apartment_7.jpg', ''),
(906, 'Danko', '©ago', '021/ 345-883 ', '091/ 553 6313', '', 'Split', 'Vukasoviæeva 10, Zemlji¹noknji¾ni ulo¾ak 8931', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '400', '0', '70', 2, '146000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 'October 17, 2014', '<p>Apartman na zadnjem 3. katu starogradske zgrade, od Rive i Dioklecijanove palaèe udaljen cca 150 m.&nbsp;Od mora je udaljen nekih 400 m. Apartman ukupne povr&scaron;ine 70m2 se sastoji od hodnika, dnevnog boravka, kuhinje + blagovaonice, 2 sobe, kupatila.</p>', '<p>Spacious and modernised apartment on the top/third floor, next to the Palace. This property measures 70m sq and is set out with hall, 2 bedrooms, bathroom, lounge, kitchen and dining area. It has been modernised and redecorated with a new modern kitchen and bathroom fittings, and is available for immediate living. The locality is excellent, with convenient access to markets, shops, restaurants and all the main tourist attractions in Split town.</p>', '', '<p>Apartman na zadnjem 3. katu starogradske zgrade, od Rive i Dioklecijanove palaèe udaljen cca 150 m.&nbsp;Od mora je udaljen nekih 400 m.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ako ¾elite vlastitu oazu u jednom od najpopularnijih gradova u Dalmaciji, ovo je idealna nekretnina za vas. Takoðer se zbog odliènog potencijala mo¾e koristiti i u svrhu turistièkog iznajmljivanja.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartman ukupne povr&scaron;ine 70m2 se sastoji od hodnika, dnevnog boravka, kuhinje + blagovaonice, 2 sobe, kupatila.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Javni parking je udaljen 50 m od apartmana, a pristup vozilom je moguæ do samog ulaza.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Svi potrebni sadr¾aji nalaze se u blizini.</p>\r\n<p>Meðunarodni aerodrom udaljen je 45 min vo¾nje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za sve dodatne informacije stojimo vam na raspolaganju.</p>', '<p>Spacious and modernised apartment on the top/third floor, next to the  Palace.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>This property measures 70m sq and is set out with hall, 2  bedrooms, bathroom, lounge, kitchen and dining area.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It has been  modernised and redecorated with a new modern kitchen and bathroom fittings, and  is available for immediate living.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The locality is excellent, with  convenient access to markets, shops, restaurants and all the main tourist  attractions in Split town, just by walking, and the ferry terminal is just 5  minutes away.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The nearest parking is 50m, but access is possible for  loading etc.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The airport is 45 minutes by car.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact the  office in Split to arrange to visit this property.</p>', '', '906_Apartment_0.jpg', '906_Apartment_1.jpg', '906_Apartment_2.jpg', '906_Apartment_3.jpg', '906_Apartment_4.jpg', '906_Apartment_5.jpg', '', '', ''),
(907, 'Ana', 'Reiæ', 'Ana &#8211; 091/ 200 7632', 'Duje &#8211; 091/ 190 9716', '', 'Split', 'Dr¾iæeva 21', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '500', '0', '107', 1, '300000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 3, 2, 'October 17, 2014', '<p>Renovirani apartman u starogradskoj zgradi smje&scaron;ten u mirnom kvartu starog dijela grada Splita.&nbsp;Centar i popularna riva udaljeni su 15 minuta hodanja. Nalazi se na 2.katu od okupno 3 kata. Ukupna povr&scaron;ina iznosi 107 m2 + 2 manja balkona. Nije potrebno nikakvo dodatno ulaganje jedino u sluèaju mjenjanja po vlastitim ¾eljama.</p>', '<p>We are pleased to offer this recently renovated apartment in a quiet area of the old town of Split. It is conveniently situated within walking distance of all the main tourist attractions in the old part of town, and is less than 15 minutes walk to the Riva, the Palace, the Marjan park and the ferry terminal. The apartment is located on the 2nd floor in the building of 3 floors. The total floor area is 107m sq and in addition there are two balconies.</p>', '', '<p>Renovirani apartman u starogradskoj zgradi smje&scaron;ten u mirnom kvartu starog dijela grada Splita.&nbsp;Centar i popularna riva udaljeni su 15 minuta hodanja.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nalazi se na 2.katu od okupno 3 kata.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ukupna povr&scaron;ina iznosi 107 m2 + 2 manja balkona.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartman se sastoji od hodnika, velikog dnevnog boravka (40 m2) sa izlazom na balkon, kuhinje, 1 spavaæe sobe, 1 radne sobe koja se mo¾e koristiti i kao spavaæa, 1 manje sobe koja je trenutno garderoba, kupaonice, wc-a i jo&scaron; jednog manjeg balkona.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartman ima ugraðeno centralno grijanje i 3 Daikin klimatizacijska ureðaja.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nije potrebno nikakvo dodatno ulaganje jedino u sluèaju mjenjanja po vlastitim ¾eljama.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ispred kuæe se nalazi vrt koji ovom apartmanu pripada na kori&scaron;tenje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Moguæe je parkirati na ulici ispred zgrade, dok je najbli¾i veliki parking udaljen cca. 200 m.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>***U apartmanu se nalazi jako ekskluzivan i unikatan namje&scaron;taj koji nije ukljuèen u cijenu ali postoji moguænost dogovora.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za sve dodatne informacije stojimo vam na raspolaganju.</p>', '<p>We are pleased to offer this recently renovated apartment in a quiet area of the  old town of Split.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is conveniently situated within walking distance of all  the main tourist attractions in the old part of town, and is less than 15  minutes walk to the Riva, the Palace, the Marjan park and the ferry  terminal.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The apartment is located on the 2nd floor in the building of 3  floors. The total floor area is 107m sq and in addition there are two  balconies.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property consists of a hallway, large living room (40 m2)  with balcony, kitchen, 1 bedroom, 1 study room which can be used as bedroom, 1  smaller room that is currently a &lsquo;changing room&rsquo;, bathroom, toilet and another  smaller balcony.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The renovation was completed to a very high standard,  with built&ndash;in heating and aircons and good quality bathroom fittings.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It  has been tastefully furnished with many unusual and attractive items which can  be negotiated separately with the apartment.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There is a communal garden  that is for the residents of the block only, parking in the nearby street, or a  carpark (50m).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact the office to arrange to visit the property  with one of our agents.</p>', '', '907_Apartment_0.jpg', '907_Apartment_1.jpg', '907_Apartment_2.jpg', '907_Apartment_3.jpg', '907_Apartment_4.jpg', '907_Apartment_5.jpg', '907_Apartment_6.jpg', '907_Apartment_7.jpg', '907_Apartment_8.jpg'),
(908, 'Edo', 'Masteliæ', '091/ 728 2795', '091/548 89117', '', 'Split', 'Èuliæa dvori 4, 5907 katastar zgr 3023', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '380', '0', '106', 1, '250000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 3, 2, 'October 17, 2014', '<p>Prostrani apartman u starogradskoj zgradi sa odliènim turistièkim i poslovnim potencijalom zbog odliènog polo¾aja i rasporeda prostorija. Smje&scaron;ten je u centru Splita udaljen 5 minuta hodanja od Dioklecijanove palaèe i predivne rive. Nalazi se na 2.katu (zadnjem) ukupne povr&scaron;ine 106 m2. Potrebno mu je renoviranje ali je moguæe preureðenje u 2 apartmana.</p>', '<p>We offer this very spacious top floor apartment needing restoration. It is situated on the second (top) floor of a block only 5 minutes from the centre of the city, walking distance from the main tourist area, the ferry terminal, the Riva, markets and the Palace. The property is 105m sq and has a large hall, three bedrooms, kitchen and two family rooms and south facing balconies.</p>', '', '<p>Prostrani apartman u starogradskoj zgradi sa odliènim turistièkim i poslovnim potencijalom zbog odliènog polo¾aja i rasporeda prostorija.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Smje&scaron;ten je u centru Splita udaljen 5 minuta hodanja od Dioklecijanove palaèe i predivne rive.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U blizini se nalaze mnogobrojne trgovine, kafiæi, tr¾nica, ljekarna i svi ostali potrebni sadr¾aji.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nalazi se na 2.katu (zadnjem) ukupne povr&scaron;ine 106 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Potrebno mu je renoviranje ali je moguæe preureðenje u 2 apartmana koja se mogu iznajmljivati ili ga jednostavno urediti u jedan prostrani za vlastito u¾ivanje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Zbog odliènog polo¾aja idealan je i za ured.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sastoji se od velikog hodnika, 3 spavaæe sobe, wc &ndash;a, kupaonice, kuhinje, 2 prostrane prostorije i balkona koji se nalaze na jugu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Iznad apartmana se nalazi potkrovlje koje je moguæe preurediti u galeriju uz dodatni dogovor sa ostalim vlasnicima.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Visina stropova u apartmanu je 3, 17 m.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Pla¾a je udaljena 15 minuta hodanja dok je najbli¾i parking udaljen&nbsp; 50 m od zgrade &scaron;to je isto jako bitno za centar grada.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Meðunarodni aerodrom udaljen je 40 minuta vo¾nje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za sve dodatne informacije stojimo na raspolaganju.</p>', '<p>We offer this very spacious top floor apartment needing restoration.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It  is situated on the second (top) floor of a block only 5 minutes from the centre  of the city, walking distance from the main tourist area, the ferry terminal,  the Riva, markets and the Palace.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property is 105m sq and has a large  hall, three bedrooms, kitchen and two family rooms and south facing  balconies.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It would be possible to create two separate flats, should the  owner wish, while doing the restoration work.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It would also be an ideal  location for an office.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>This apartment was designed in a grand fashion,  with high ceilings (3.17m) wide corridor, balconies to the south, and this  historic luxury could be recreated with a little imagination.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There is  street parking, or a carpark (50m), and the airport, if you didn&rsquo;t know by now,  is 40 minutes drive from Split.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact the office in Split to  arrange a tour of the property.</p>', '', '908_Apartment_0.jpg', '908_Apartment_1.jpg', '908_Apartment_2.jpg', '908_Apartment_3.jpg', '908_Apartment_4.jpg', '908_Apartment_5.jpg', '908_Apartment_6.jpg', '908_Apartment_7.jpg', '908_Apartment_8.jpg'),
(909, 'Lori', 'Vitaljiæ', '021/ 771 185  ', '098/ 208 485', 'vitaljic.lori@gmail.com', 'Split', 'Petrova 36, 13379 k.o. Split', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '200', '0', '189', 1, '550000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 4, 2, 'October 17, 2014', '<p>Luksuzno namje&scaron;ten i potpuno renoviran troeta¾ni apartman, s pogledom na more. Od Rive i Dioklecijanove palaèe je udaljen cca 400 m.&nbsp;Od mora je udaljen nekih 250 m. Povr&scaron;ina apartmana je 189 m2. Apartman se sastoji od tri eta¾e. Postoji moguænost nadogradnje jo&scaron; jednog kata.</p>', '<p>We are pleased to present this fully renovated apartment, with views of the Riva, the Palace and out to sea. It is a large property 189m sq, and is spaciously designed on three floors. It has been well decorated and is quite luxurious, with many modern features, appropriate to have in a modern style property. It is a short walk to the ferry terminal and the town beach is just 5 minutes walk from the front door.</p>', '', '<p>Luksuzno namje&scaron;ten i potpuno renoviran troeta¾ni apartman, sa lijepim pogledom. Od Rive i Dioklecijanove palaèe je udaljen cca 400 m.&nbsp;Od mora je udaljen nekih 250 m.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ako ¾elite vlastitu oazu u jednom od najpopularnijih gradova u Dalmaciji, ovo je idealna nekretnina za vas. Takoðer se zbog odliènog potencijala mo¾e koristiti i u svrhu turistièkog iznajmljivanja.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Povr&scaron;ina apartmana je 189 m2. Apartman se sastoji od tri eta¾e.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na prvoj eta¾i se nalaze 2 sobe, kupatilo i tehnièka soba.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na drugoj eta¾i je kuhinja, veliki dnevni boravak, wc i velika terasa od 33m2 sa lijepim pogledom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na treæoj eta¾i je velika spavaæa soba, radna soba, kupatilo i terasa povr&scaron;ine 12m2 sa lijepim pogledom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Postoji moguænost nadogradnje jo&scaron; jednog kata.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Svi potrebni sadr¾aji nalaze se u blizini.</p>\r\n<p>Meðunarodni aerodrom udaljen je 45 min. vo¾nje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za sve dodatne informacije stojimo vam na raspolaganju.</p>', '<p>We are pleased to present this fully renovated apartment, with views of the  Riva, the Palace and out to sea.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is a large property 189m sq, and is  spaciously designed on three floors.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The lower floor has two bedrooms a  bathroom and a spare room, there are internal stairs leading to the main  living area which is a kitchen, bathroom, living room which has patio doors  leading onto a spacious balcony of 33m sq.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Internal stairs then lead up to  the third floor where there is a master bedroom, bathroom, with a smaller  terrace of 12m.&nbsp;From here there are exciting views across the harbour  towards the Palace and Riva.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It has been well decorated and is quite  luxurious, with many modern features, appropriate to have in a modern style  property.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is conveniently situated close to all the tourist  attractions in the town, the best restaurants, bars and lively night life.  The immediate area is quiet, with no through traffic.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is a short  walk to the ferry terminal and the town beach is just 5 minutes walk from  the front door.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property has potential to be enlarged with an extra  floor.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The airport is 45 minutes from the property, and parking a few  minute''s walk.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact the office in Split to arrange to visit  this property.</p>', '', '909_Apartment_0.jpg', '909_Apartment_1.jpg', '909_Apartment_2.jpg', '909_Apartment_3.jpg', '909_Apartment_4.jpg', '909_Apartment_5.jpg', '909_Apartment_6.jpg', '909_Apartment_7.jpg', '909_Apartment_8.jpg'),
(910, 'Bo¾o', 'Milardoviæ', '', '098/589 9509', '', 'Split', 'Vukasoviæeva 9, Zgr 2821   6236/15  z.u. 16384', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '450', '0', '78', 1, '190000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 'October 17, 2014', '<p>Dvoeta¾ni apartman u staroj kamenoj kuæi, na mirnoj lokaciji u jednom od najpopularnijih dijelova starog grada Splita. Nekretnina se sastoji od prostorije u prizemlju koja ima poseban ulaz te mo¾e slu¾iti kao vinski podrum ili za neku drugu svrhu. Na 1. i 2. katu smje&scaron;ten je dvoeta¾ni apartman. Ukupna netto povr&scaron;ina podruma, 1. i 2. kata iznosi 78 m2, dok je brutto povr&scaron;ina sa stepenicama i predulazom 101 m2.</p>', '<p>We are pleased to offer this rare opportunity to buy a duplex apartment in an old stone house, on a large plot in the old part of Split City. The property consists of one room on the ground floor which has a separate entrance and which would make an ideal wine cellar, or substantial storage area. On the 1st and 2nd floor is a duplex apartment. The total net area of &#8203;&#8203;basement, first and second floors is 78 m2, while the gross area with stairs is 101 m2.</p>', '', '<p>Dvoeta¾ni apartman u staroj kamenoj kuæi, na mirnoj lokaciji u jednom od najpopularnijih dijelova starog grada Splita.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Do Dioklecijanove palaèe i prekrasne rive potrebno je svega 10 minuta hodanja, dok je najbli¾a pla¾a udaljena cca. 450 m.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nekretnina se sastoji od prostorije u prizemlju koja ima poseban ulaz te mo¾e slu¾iti kao vinski podrum ili za neku drugu svrhu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na 1. i 2. katu smje&scaron;ten je dvoeta¾ni apartman.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ukupna netto povr&scaron;ina podruma, 1. i 2. kata iznosi 78 m2, dok je brutto povr&scaron;ina sa stepenicama i predulazom 101 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na 1.katu apartmana nalaze se stepenice, kuhinja + blagovaonica i dnevni boravak iz kojeg se pru¾a pogled na vrt.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na 2.katu koji je spojen unutarnjim stepenicama se nalazi hodnik, kupaonica, 1 manja i 1 veæa spavaæa soba.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartmanu je potrebno dodatno ulaganje ali je i u sada&scaron;njem stanju moguæ normalan boravak i turistièko iznajmljivanje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartmanu pripada dio dvora gdje se nalazi parking mjesto &scaron;to je rijetkost u starom dijelu grada.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Cijeloj kuæi pripada zajedièki vrt na kori&scaron;tenje &scaron;to je jo&scaron; jedna prednost.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Meðunarodni aerodrom udaljen je 40 minuta vo¾nje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za sve dodatna informacije stojimo vam na raspolaganju.</p>', '<p>We are pleased to offer this rare opportunity to buy a duplex apartment in an  old stone house, on a large plot in the old part of Split City.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is  situated in a quiet street, just 10 minutes walk from the Palace and the Riva,  and less than 10 to the town&rsquo;s sandy beach at Bacvice.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property  consists of one room on the ground floor which has a separate entrance and which  would make an ideal wine cellar, or substantial storage area.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the 1st  and 2nd floor is a duplex apartment.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The total net area of &#8203;&#8203;basement, first  and second floors is 78 m2, while the gross area with stairs is 101 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On  the 1st floor are stairs, kitchen, dining room and living room which overlooks  the garden.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the 2nd floor which is connected by the internal stairs is a  hallway, bathroom, one small and one large bedroom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartment needs  additional redecorating&nbsp; but in the present state is comfortably  habitable.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The apartment has a part of the courtyard where there is a  private parking, place which is rare in the old town.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>This building has a  spacious garden around the house which is another advantage, and if landscaped  nicely could become a superb garden.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The international airport is 40  minutes drive.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For taking a tour, please contact the CPS office in  Split.</p>', '', '910_Apartment_0.jpg', '910_Apartment_1.jpg', '910_Apartment_2.jpg', '910_Apartment_3.jpg', '910_Apartment_4.jpg', '910_Apartment_5.jpg', '910_Apartment_6.jpg', '910_Apartment_7.jpg', '910_Apartment_8.jpg'),
(911, 'Ante', 'Jeloviæ', '', '095/ 904 3767', 'jelava66@gmail.com', 'Trogir', 'O. Gornji, Put Sv. Karla 34 &#8211; kuæa  Ivana Filipoviæa Grèiæa 3,572/1  1364 zgr', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '750', '0', '190', 2, '300000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 3, 2, 'October 17, 2014', '<p>Prostrani apartman u privatnoj kuæi, na mirnoj lokaciji sa prekrasnim pogledom na more, u blizini centra gdje se nalazi svi potrebni sadr¾aji. Nalazi se na ju¾noj strani otoka Èiova, udaljen od mora 750 m ili 1 min. pje&scaron;ke. Apartman je potpuno renoviran i namje&scaron;ten, te se koristi u svrhu turistièkog iznajmljivanja, ali je takoðer idealan i za vlastito ¾ivljenje. Ukupna brutto stambena povr&scaron;ina iznosi 190 m2.</p>', '<p>We are offering this very spacious apartment, with great views over the village and out to the sea. It is on the top floor (2nd) and conveniently situated near the centre of the small village, but still only 5 minutes walk from the popular beaches on the south side of the island. The apartment has been recently decorated and furnished. The total gross living area is 190 m2.</p>', '', '<p>Prostrani apartman u privatnoj kuæi, na mirnoj lokaciji sa prekrasnim pogledom na more, u blizini centra gdje se nalazi svi potrebni sadr¾aji.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nalazi se na ju¾noj strani otoka Èiova, udaljen od mora 750 m ili 1 min. pje&scaron;ke.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Smje&scaron;ten je na 2.katu (zadnjem) obiteljske kuæe.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartman je potpuno renoviran i namje&scaron;ten, te se koristi u svrhu turistièkog iznajmljivanja, ali je takoðer idealan i za vlastito ¾ivljenje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ukupna brutto stambena povr&scaron;ina iznosi 190 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sastoji se od kuhinje + blagovaonice, dnevnog boravka, 3 spavaæe sobe, 2 kupaonice i 4 balkona, dok se sa 2 pru¾a pogled na more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na vrhu kuæe nalazi se salon za zabavu (biljar, stolni nogomet, stolni tenis i pikado) koji dijelom takoðer pripada vlasniku ovog apartmana.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U vlasni&scaron;tvu mu pripada i dio vrta i parkirnih mjesta.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Grad Trogir udaljen je 10 minuta vo¾nje, dok je meðunarodni aerodrom udaljen 15 minuta.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za sve dodatne informacije stojimo vam na raspolaganju.</p>', '<p>We are offering this very spacious apartment, with great views over the village  and out to the sea.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is on the top floor (2nd) and conveniently  situated near the centre of the small village where there are many facilities  for tourists and the resident population, but still only 5 minutes walk from the  popular beaches on the south side of the island.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The apartment has been  recently decorated and furnished, and is currently used for renting to tourists,  but could also be good for all year living.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The total gross living area is  190 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It consists of a kitchen with dining area, living room, 3 bedrooms, 2  bathrooms and 4 balconies (2 have sea views).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the top floor of&nbsp; there  is an additional common lounge for entertainment (billiards, table football,  table tennis and darts) and part ownership of this comes with this  apartment.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Outside there are two parking spaces with the flat, and part  ownership of landscaped gardens.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The town of Trogir is only 10 minutes  away, the centre of the historic and cultural tourism in the area, while the  international airport is 15 minutes.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For further information please  contact the office in Split.</p>', '', '911_Apartment_0.jpg', '911_Apartment_1.jpg', '911_Apartment_2.jpg', '911_Apartment_3.jpg', '911_Apartment_4.jpg', '911_Apartment_5.jpg', '911_Apartment_6.jpg', '911_Apartment_7.jpg', '911_Apartment_8.jpg'),
(912, 'Alen ©kara', 'Dalmatis', '', '', '', 'Zadar', 'Zadar', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '300', '920', '220', 1, '785000', '', 2, 1, 2, 2, 1, 1, 3, 3, 'October 23, 2014', '<p><strong>OTOK PAG - mostom spojen sa kopnom</strong></p>\r\n<p>Luksuzna moderna Vila, ukupne BRP povr&scaron;ine 220 m2, udaljena od mora svega 300 m, nalazi se na atraktivnoj i mirnoj lokaciji na terenu povr&scaron;ine 920 m2 sa kojeg se prostire istovremeno prekrasan pogled na more sa ju¾ne strane, te planinu Velebit sa sjeverne strane.&nbsp;Vila pru¾a apsolutnu privatnost buduæi da se nalazi na uzdignutom dijelu parcele, te je okru¾ena mediteranskim biljem i autohtonim raslinjem.</p>', '<p><strong>ISLAND OF PAG - a bridge connection to the mainland</strong></p>\r\n<p>The luxury and modern Villa of total surface of 220 m2, is located in an attractive and quiet area, only 300 m far away from the sea. This lovely detached villa has the benefit of a 920 m2 plot with a beatiful seaview from the southern side a mountain view from the northern side.&nbsp;The Villa offers an absolutely privacy thanks to its construction on a raised part of the plot, which is surrounded by mediterranean plants and vegetation.</p>', '', '<p><strong>OTOK PAG - mostom spojen sa kopnom</strong></p>\r\n<p>Luksuzna moderna Vila, ukupne BRP povr&scaron;ine 220 m2, udaljena od mora svega 300 m, nalazi se na atraktivnoj i mirnoj lokaciji na terenu povr&scaron;ine 920 m2 sa kojeg se prostire istovremeno prekrasan pogled na more sa ju¾ne strane, te planinu Velebit sa sjeverne strane.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Vila pru¾a apsolutnu privatnost buduæi da se nalazi na uzdignutom dijelu parcele, te je okru¾ena mediteranskim biljem i autohtonim raslinjem, tako da se tokom cijelog dana osjeti "miris mediterana", &scaron;to sve zajedno ovu vilu èini idelanom za bijeg od gradske gu¾ve i miran obiteljski odmor.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Villa se sastoji od:</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Vanjski parking</strong> povr&scaron;ine 50 m2, sa nadstre&scaron;nicom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Prizemlje </strong>&ndash; ulazni prostor "loby", utility "prostor za pranje, su&scaron;enje, peglanje", tehnièka prostorija sa kamerama, stubi&scaron;te, spremi&scaron;te, veliki dnevni boravak, kuhinja sa blagovaonicom povezana sa natkrivenom vanskom ljetnom terasom, gostinski WC, prostorija koja slu¾i kao "wine bar". &nbsp;U sklopu prizemne eta¾e nalazi se i prostrani vanjski dnevni boravak za relaksaciju, te vanjski &scaron;ank sa barom i grillom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Kat</strong> - smje&scaron;tene su tri spavaæe sobe, svaka sa vlastitom kupaonicom i garderobom (od toga jedna master bedroom s individualnom terasom). Iz svih soba se vidi prekrasan pogled na more i otoke, te vanjski bazen u vrtu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Vila je projektirana sa osnovnom namjerom i potrebom kao ladanjska kuæa za odmor sa pogledom na mediteranski krajobraz i more sa maksimalnim iskori&scaron;tenjem osunèanja u svim aspektima, pa je kao rezultat takovog pristupa potpuno otvorena prema moru sa ju¾ne strane dok je sa sjevera za&scaron;tiæena od bure zatvorenim arh.strukturama i sadr¾ajima.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Pogled na more i sam bazen ispred vile, su ostvareni preko staklene stijene prizemlja koja se prote¾e kroz sam dnevni &nbsp;boravak, te kuhinju i blagovaonicu, dok je na katu na isti naèin pogled omoguæen iz svih spavaæih soba preko otvorenih &nbsp;terasa.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Interijer vile izveden je na moderan naèin, minimalistièki èistim formama i dizajnom u toplim tonovima i visokokvalitetnim materijalima.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Okoli&scaron; je ureðen u mediteranskom stilu, prekriven zelenom travom iz uzgoja i autohtonim raslinjem, sa sustavom automatskog navodnjavanja.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kupoprodajna cijena: 785.000 EUR u cijenu je ukljuèen cjelokupan opisan namje&scaron;taj i tehnika !!</p>', '<p><strong>ISLAND OF PAG - a bridge connection to the mainland</strong></p>\r\n<p>The luxury and modern Villa of total surface of 220 m2, is located in an attractive and quiet area, only 300 m far away from the sea. This lovely detached villa has the benefit of a 920 m2 plot with a beatiful seaview from the southern side a mountain view from the northern side.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The Villa offers an absolutely privacy thanks to its construction on a raised part of the plot, which is surrounded by mediterranean plants and vegetation.&nbsp;That''s why you will be surrounded by the Mediterranean scents during the whole day. All these characteristics together make this villa the ideal choice and a great place to escape from city rush and for unforgettable family vacations.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The Villa consists of:</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>-<span> </span><strong>Outdoor covered parking</strong>, surface: 50 m2</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>-<span> </span><strong>Ground floor</strong> &ndash; with entrance area, the lobby with the staircase to the upper floor and the ground floor, the utility space for washing, drying and ironing of the clothes, a technical room with cameras, a storage, a spacious living room, kitchen with dining area which is connected to the covered outdoor terrace, guests toilett and an area which can be used as a wine bar. As a part of the ground floor there is also a spacious garden with an outdoor living room for relaxation &ndash; the lounge and the bar with barbecue.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>-<span> </span><strong>First floor </strong>&ndash; with three bedrooms, each with a separate bathroom and wardrobe (one of these is the master bedroom with a private terrace). All bedrooms offer a beautiful view of the sea and the islands as well as to the swimming pool in the garden.</p>', '', '912_House-Villa_0.jpg', '912_House-Villa_1.jpg', '912_House-Villa_2.jpg', '912_House-Villa_3.jpg', '912_House-Villa_4.jpg', '912_House-Villa_5.jpg', '912_House-Villa_6.jpg', '912_House-Villa_7.jpg', '912_House-Villa_8.jpg'),
(913, 'Natalija', 'Beniæ', '021/489-271 susjed kljuè', '099/ 652 8518 Marina ', 'marinabenic@yahoo.com', 'Split', 'Gupèeva 11A', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '400', '0', '155', 1, '360000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 4, 1, 'October 23, 2014', '<p>Dvoeta¾ni apartman na drugom katu u prekrasnom dijelu Splita, blizu centra grada.&nbsp;Od Rive i Dioklecijanove palaèe udaljen 15 minuta laganog hoda.&nbsp;Apartman se sastoji od dvije eta¾e, ukupne stambene povr&scaron;ine 155 m2.&nbsp;Apartmanu je potrebno renoviranje.&nbsp;Moguæ je pristup vozilom do samog ulaza i parking se nalazi iza kuæe.</p>', '<p>We are pleased to offer this duplex apartment on the second floor in a beautiful part of town, near the city center. Within a 15 minute walk are all the tourist attractions, most of the town&rsquo;s best restaurants, the Palace, the Riva, the ferry terminal, markets and the superb Marjan Park. The apartment consists of two floors, with a total living area of 155 m2.</p>', '', '<p>Dvoeta¾ni apartman na drugom katu u prekrasnom dijelu Splita, blizu centra grada.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Od Rive i Dioklecijanove palaèe udaljen 15 minuta laganog hoda.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartman se sastoji od dvije eta¾e. Na prvoj eta¾i se nalazi hodnik, kuhinja sa blagovaonicom, dnevni boravak, 3 sobe, kupatilo, wc i balkon. Na drugoj eta¾i se nalazi atelje sa terasom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>S obzirom na lokaciju i povr&scaron;inu stana, stan je moguæe prilagoditi za turistièko  iznajmljivanje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartmanu je potrebno renoviranje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Moguæ je pristup vozilom do samog ulaza i parking se nalazi iza kuæe.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za obilazak nekretnine CPS Split ured vam stoji na raspolaganju.</p>', '<p>We are pleased to offer this duplex apartment on the second floor in a beautiful part of town, near the city center.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Within a 15 minute walk are all the tourist attractions, most of the town&rsquo;s best restaurants, the Palace, the Riva, the ferry terminal, markets and the superb Marjan Park.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The apartment consists of two floors, with a total living area of 155 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the first floor there is a hall, kitchen, dining room, living room, 3 bedrooms, bathroom, toilet and balcony.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the second floor there is an atelier (studio) with terrace.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The apartment feels wonderfully spacious and light, but we feel is in need of some redecorating for it to meet its full potential.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>This property could be used for letting to tourists, and/or private family living.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>You can drive to the front of the property for deliveries etc. but longer term parking is at the rear of the property.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact our office in Split to arrange to visit this property.</p>', '', '913_Apartment_0.jpg', '913_Apartment_1.jpg', '913_Apartment_2.jpg', '913_Apartment_3.jpg', '913_Apartment_4.jpg', '913_Apartment_5.jpg', '913_Apartment_6.jpg', '913_Apartment_7.jpg', '913_Apartment_8.jpg'),
(914, '®arka', 'Tokiæ', '021 347-079', '098/ 911 8710  Bo¾o Tokiæ', '', 'Split', 'Kneza Vi¹eslava 21', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '600', '0', '47', 2, '90000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 'October 23, 2014', '<p>Dvosoban stan na odliènoj lokaciji u blizini centra grada. Stan je povr&scaron;ine 47 m2 i smje&scaron;ten je na zadnjem/drugom katu male stambene zgrade bez lifta. Sastoji se od dvije spavaæe sobe, kupatila i kuhinje sa blagovaonicom. Centar grada je udaljen svega 10 min ugodne &scaron;etnje.</p>', '<p>We are pleased to offer this two bedroom apartment in an attractive city centre location. The property is 47m sq and is situated on the second/top floor of a block in a prime location close to the Roman palace, restaurants, the ferries, and numerous services and attractions around town. It has two bedrooms, a bathroom and kitchen with dining area and is in good condition, but needs some internal decorating. We feel that the price reflects this.</p>', '', '<p>Dvosoban stan na odliènoj lokaciji u blizini centra grada.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Stan je povr&scaron;ine 47 m2 i smje&scaron;ten je na zadnjem/drugom katu male stambene zgrade bez lifta.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sastoji se od dvije spavaæe sobe, kupatila i kuhinje sa blagovaonicom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Centar grada je udaljen svega 10 min ugodne &scaron;etnje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Pristup vozilom moguæ je do samog ulaza.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Trajektna luka, autobusna i ¾eljeznièka stanica su svega nekoliko minuta vo¾nje ili desetak minuta ugodnom &scaron;etnjom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Meðunarodni aerodrom 30 min vo¾nje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Stan je na lokaciji koja je vrlo atraktivna kako za miran i ugodan ¾ivot, tako i za turistièko iznajmljivanje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za razgledavanje stojimo vam na usluzi.</p>', '<p>We are pleased to offer this two bedroom apartment in an attractive city centre  location.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property is 47m sq and is situated on the second/top floor  of a block in a prime location close to the Roman palace, restaurants, the  ferries, and numerous services and attractions around town.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It has two  bedrooms, a bathroom and kitchen with dining area and is in good condition, but  needs some internal decorating. We feel that the price reflects this.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The  area around the property is quiet and generally well maintained.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The  airport is 30 minutes away, and the nearest parking is a few minute&rsquo;s  walk.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact the office in Split to arrange to visit this and  similar properties.</p>', '', '914_Apartment_0.jpg', '914_Apartment_1.jpg', '914_Apartment_2.jpg', '914_Apartment_3.jpg', '914_Apartment_4.jpg', '914_Apartment_5.jpg', '914_Apartment_6.jpg', '', ''),
(915, 'Marija', 'Bezina', '021/ 489 150  ', '091/ 253 5575', '', 'Split', 'Klarina 16', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '150', '0', '75', 1, '245000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 'October 23, 2014', '<p>Apartman na 1. katu manje starogradske zgrade, smje&scaron;ten na lijepoj i mirnoj lokaciji, svega 150 metara udaljen od mora. Do Rive i Dioklecijanove palaèe je desteak minuta ugodne &scaron;etnje, dok su svi potrebni sadr¾aji u neposrednoj blizini. Apartman je ukupne povr&scaron;ine 75 m2. Cijeli apartman je renoviran prije 6 godina.</p>', '<p>We are pleased to offer this light and spacious town apartment two minutes walk from the sea. It is situated to the south of the palace near the town beach and swimming area where there are many attractions for tourists nearby. The living space is 75m sq, and is designed in a modern style of an open plan living room and kitchen and with two bedrooms, and a bathroom. There is also a larder storage area of 6m sq.</p>', '', '<p>Apartman na 1. katu manje starogradske zgrade, smje&scaron;ten na lijepoj i mirnoj  lokaciji, svega 150 metara udaljen od mora.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Do Rive i Dioklecijanove  palaèe je desteak minuta ugodne &scaron;etnje, dok su svi potrebni sadr¾aji u  neposrednoj blizini.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartman je ukupne povr&scaron;ine 75 m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sastoji se od  hodnika, dnevnog boravka + kuhinje + blagovaonice, 2 spavaæe sobe i&nbsp; kupaonice.  Pripada mu i ostava povr&scaron;ine cca. 6 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Cijeli apartman je renoviran  prije 6 godina.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za sve dodatne informacije stojimo vam na  raspolaganju.</p>', '<p>We are pleased to offer this light and spacious town apartment two minutes walk  from the sea.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is situated to the south of the palace near the town  beach and swimming area where there are many attractions for tourists nearby,  with good restaurants, bars, shops etc and only walking distance from the Ferry  terminal, Riva and Roman palace.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The living space is 75m sq, and is  designed in a modern style of an open plan living room and kitchen and with two  bedrooms, and a bathroom. There is also a larder storage area of 6m  sq.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property was renovated to a high standard six years ago with new  double glazed windows, doors, kitchen, bathroom fittings, heating system and  decorated throughout.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>This property can be viewed by contacting our  office in Split.</p>', '', '915_Apartment_0.jpg', '915_Apartment_1.jpg', '915_Apartment_2.jpg', '915_Apartment_3.jpg', '915_Apartment_4.jpg', '915_Apartment_5.jpg', '915_Apartment_6.jpg', '915_Apartment_7.jpg', '915_Apartment_8.jpg'),
(916, 'Ana', 'Reiæ', 'Ana &#8211; 091/ 200 7632', 'Duje &#8211; 091/ 190 9716', '', 'Brac', 'Mirca', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '400', '1280', '180', 1, '880000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 1, 5, 2, 'October 23, 2014', '<p>Kuæa s pogledom na more smje&scaron;tena u malom pitoresknom mjestu. Tipièna dalmatinska villa s kamenom fasadom koja se sastoji od prizemlja i kata, izgraðena je na zemlji&scaron;tu povr&scaron;ine 1.280 m2. Svaka eta¾a predstavlja zasebni apartman, oba sa velikim terasama s prekrasnim pogledom na more. U okuænicu skladno uklopljen bazen 4m x 8m sa sunèali&scaron;tem, kaminom i romantiènom sjenicom meðu stablima mandarina.</p>', '<p>Croatia Property sales are pleased to offer this luxury villa set in beautiful landscaped gardens. It is located on the island of Brac, on the north side, about 400m from the shore, but elevated to give stunning views across the sea. The gardens are on two terraces, on a large plot of 1280m sq, with long views through the trees. The total living area is 180m sq.</p>', '', '<p>Kuæa s pogledom na more smje&scaron;tena u malom pitoresknom mjestu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&Scaron;armantna villa okru¾ena ureðenim vrtom nalik malom botanièkom vrtu sa lavandom, ru¾marinom, mandarinama, limunom, ru¾ama i drugim cvijeæem.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Tipièna dalmatinska villa s kamenom fasadom koja se sastoji od prizemlja i kata, izgraðena je na zemlji&scaron;tu povr&scaron;ine 1.280 m2. Svaka eta¾a predstavlja zasebni apartman, oba sa velikim terasama s prekrasnim pogledom na more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U okuænicu skladno uklopljen bazen 4m x 8m sa sunèali&scaron;tem, kaminom i romantiènom sjenicom meðu stablima mandarina.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Prizemlje 100 m2</strong>: 3 spavaæe sobe, kupaonica, velika kuhinja i dnevni boravak s izlazom na veliku terasu 35 m2</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Kat 80 m2</strong>: 2 spavaæe sobe, kuhinja i dnevni boravak, kupaonica, terasa 35 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sva infrastruktura prisutna - struja, voda, telefon, Wi-Fi, satelitska tv, klima.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Gara¾a s elektriènim podizaèem vrata i parking za 2 vozila se nalaze ispred kuæe.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kompletno opremljeno modernim namje&scaron;tajem, ukra&scaron;eno pomno izabranim umjetninama.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Predstavljena u mnogim turistièkim magazinima kao iznimno lijepo i ukusno ureðena villa kompletno opremljena za boravak 10 osoba.</p>', '<p>Croatia Property sales are pleased to offer this luxury villa set in beautiful landscaped gardens.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is located on the island of Brac, on the north side, about 400m from the shore, but elevated to give stunning views across the sea.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The gardens are on two terraces, on a large plot of 1280m sq, with long views through the trees.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The total living area is 180m sq.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The ground floor has a large kitchen, living room with terrace (35 m2), bathroom and 3 bedrooms. On the 1st floor there is a kitchen, living room, balcony (35 m2) and 2 bedrooms.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>When the property was designed, many features were included to ensure that this villa was luxurious in every way.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There are built in air conditioners, wooden and stone tile floors, sound systems, WiFi, and it is fitted with modern furniture and many works of art.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Immediately in front is a 32 m2 swimming pool with sun deck, a bbq/fireplace decorated with stone artifacts and romantic gazebo surrounded by tangerine trees which makes it sheltered and private.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It has been featured in many tourist magazines, as a great example of a modern luxury villa, fully equipped to accommodate 10 people.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Brac Island is connected by direct ferry from the city of Split, and the trip is 40 minutes.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The ferry port is a few minute&rsquo;s drive, and the area around the property is very peaceful, with some low density housing, but the nearest coffee bar is walking distance.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The international airport is 40 minutes drive from Split.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact us for further information.</p>', '', '916_House-Villa_0.jpg', '916_House-Villa_1.jpg', '916_House-Villa_2.jpg', '916_House-Villa_3.jpg', '916_House-Villa_4.jpg', '916_House-Villa_5.jpg', '916_House-Villa_6.jpg', '916_House-Villa_7.jpg', '916_House-Villa_8.jpg');
INSERT INTO `nekretnina` (`id`, `ime`, `prezime`, `telefon`, `mobitel`, `e_mail`, `lokacija_id`, `adresa`, `status_id`, `vrsta_id`, `udaljenost`, `povrsina`, `stambenapovrsina`, `display`, `cijena`, `cijenatocka`, `ponuda_tjedna`, `new_built`, `must_sell`, `prvi_red_do_mora`, `pogled_na_more`, `bazen`, `broj_soba`, `broj_kupatila`, `datum`, `title_hr`, `title_en`, `title_ge`, `opis_hr`, `opis_en`, `opis_ge`, `PropertyImageURL0`, `PropertyImageURL1`, `PropertyImageURL2`, `PropertyImageURL3`, `PropertyImageURL4`, `PropertyImageURL5`, `PropertyImageURL6`, `PropertyImageURL7`, `PropertyImageURL8`) VALUES
(917, 'Biserka', 'Bogdan', '', '098/ 969 0112', '', 'Split', 'Bubalova 3, Z.U. 3799', 'For sale', 'Old stone house', '300', '0', '61', 1, '150000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 'October 26, 2014', '<p>Mala kamena kuæa u starom dijelu grada Splita, smje&scaron;tena istoèno od Dioklecijanove palaèe i prekrasne rive. Potrebno joj je kompletno renoviranje, ali je zbog izvrsnog polo¾aja prilika za ulaganje u investiciju koja bi se vi&scaron;estruko isplatila kod turistièkog iznajmljivanja. Sastoji se od prizemlja, 1. i 2. kata ukupne brutto povr&scaron;ine 61 m2.</p>', '<p>We are offering for sale this small stone house in the old, historic part of Split, located east of the Diocletian''s Palace and Riva. It needs a complete renovation, but because of the excellent location has great potential for tourism, or a private dwelling. It consists of ground, 1st and 2nd floor, total area of 61 m2.</p>', '', '<p>Mala kamena kuæa u starom dijelu grada Splita, smje&scaron;tena istoèno od Dioklecijanove palaèe i prekrasne rive.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Potrebno joj je kompletno renoviranje, ali je zbog izvrsnog polo¾aja prilika za ulaganje u investiciju koja bi se vi&scaron;estruko isplatila kod turistièkog iznajmljivanja.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sastoji se od prizemlja, 1. i 2. kata ukupne brutto povr&scaron;ine 61 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U prizemlju se nalazi manji hodnik, sprema i stepenice koje vode na 1.kat na kojem se nalazi dnevni boravak + kuhinja + blagovaonica i loggia koja je trenutno zatvorena.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na 2.katu se nalazi hodnik i 2 sobe.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Postoji moguænost izgradnje jo&scaron; jedne eta¾e ali je potrebno tra¾enje dozvole.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa se nalazi u mirnom dijelu bez buke i prometa, &scaron;to je jo&scaron; jedna prednost ¾elite li nekretninu i za vlastito u¾ivanje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Najbli¾i parking udaljen je cca. 50 m.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U blizini se nalaze mnogobrojne trgovine, restorani, kafiæi, i svi ostali sadr¾aji.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Najbli¾a pla¾a udaljena je 15 minuta hodanja.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Meðunarodni aerodrom udaljen je 40 min. vo¾nje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za sva dodatna pitanja stojimo vam na raspolaganju.</p>', '<p>We are offering for sale this small stone house in the old, historic part of  Split, located east of the Diocletian''s Palace and Riva.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It needs a  complete renovation, but because of the excellent location has great potential  for tourism, or a private dwelling.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It consists of ground, 1st and 2nd  floor, total area of 61 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the ground floor there is a small hallway,  storage and stairs leading to the 1st floor.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the 1st floor there is a  living room, kitchen + dining room and balcony.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the 2nd floor is a hallway  and two bedrooms.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There is a possibility of enlarging the building when  doing the renovation, subject to obtaining building permission.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house  is located in a pedestrian&nbsp; area with no traffic and noise, which&nbsp; was one of  the earliest areas to be built up, in the middle ages, and the streets and  houses retain the charm that makes Dalmatia so attractive.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The nearest  parking is 50m, and within walking distance there are many shops, bars and  restaurants.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The beach is 15 minute&rsquo;s walk, and so is the centre of the  Palace and the Riva.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The international airport is 40 minutes  driving.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For viewing please contact our office.</p>', '', '917_Old-stone-house_0.jpg', '917_Old-stone-house_1.jpg', '917_Old-stone-house_2.jpg', '917_Old-stone-house_3.jpg', '917_Old-stone-house_4.jpg', '917_Old-stone-house_5.jpg', '917_Old-stone-house_6.jpg', '917_Old-stone-house_7.jpg', '917_Old-stone-house_8.jpg'),
(918, 'John', 'Britton', '+353 87 994 1034', 'kljuè kod Branke', 'jbritton@eircon.net', 'Trogir', 'Villa Bu¹inci, K. Branimira 2/A', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '450', '0', '60', 2, '78000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 1, 2, 1, 'October 26, 2014', '<p>Apartman na 2.katu ju¾ne orjentacije, potpuno namje&scaron;ten i klimatiziran u mirnoj zgradi na ju¾noj strani otoka Èiova. Ukupna stambena povr&scaron;ina apartmana iznosi 60 m2 (43 m2 + terasa 17 m2). Sastoji se od kuhinje + blagovaonice + dnevnog boravka, hodnika, 2 spavaæe sobe, kupaonice i prostrane terase sa pogledom na more. Nije potrebno nikakvo ulaganje stoga je odmah moguæe useliti ali i iznajmljivati tijekom turistièke sezone.</p>', '<p>Great value apartment on the top/2nd floor facing the south, with sea view, in a quiet building on the south side of Ciovo. Total living area is 60 m2 (43 m2 + terrace 17 m2). It consists of a spacious and light open plan kitchen + dining room + living room, hallway, two bedrooms, bathroom and a spacious covered terrace overlooking the sea. There is no need for further investment as the property is fully furnished and air conditioned.</p>', '', '<p>Apartman na 2.katu ju¾ne orjentacije, potpuno namje&scaron;ten i klimatiziran u mirnoj zgradi na ju¾noj strani otoka Èiova.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ju¾na strana otoka je najpopularnija, kako za turiste tako i za boravak preko cijele godine.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Do prirodno kamenite pla¾e potrebno je 10 minuta hodanja, dok je do centra mjesta gdje se nalaze trgovine, restorani, kafiæi i ostali sadr¾aji potrebno 3 minute vo¾nje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ukupna stambena povr&scaron;ina apartmana iznosi 60 m2 (43 m2 + terasa 17 m2).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sastoji se od kuhinje + blagovaonice + dnevnog boravka, hodnika, 2 spavaæe sobe, kupaonice i prostrane terase sa pogledom na more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nije potrebno nikakvo ulaganje stoga je odmah moguæe useliti ali i iznajmljivati tijekom turistièke sezone.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sa ju¾ne strane zgrade se nalazi zajednièki bazen sa velikim prostorom za odmor i sunèanje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ispred zgrade je zajednièki parking koji je uglavnom slobodan jer veèina vlasnika u apartmanima ne boravi tijekom cijele godine.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Do povijesnog grada Trogira potrebno je 10 minuta vo¾nje, dok je do meðunarodnog aerodroma potrebno 15 minuta.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Stojimo na raspolaganju za sve dodatne informacije.</p>', '<p>Great value apartment on the top/2nd floor facing the south, with sea view, in a  quiet building on the south side of Ciovo.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The southern side of the  island is the most popular area, both for tourists and for residents living  throughout the year because of the convenience of access to the mainland and so  many superb beaches. The natural stone beach is only a 10 minute walk, while the  village center where there are shops, restaurants, cafes and other facilities  required 3 minute drive.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Total living area is 60 m2 (43 m2 + terrace 17  m2).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It consists of a spacious and light open plan kitchen + dining room +  living room, hallway, two bedrooms, bathroom and a spacious covered terrace  overlooking the sea.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There is no need for further investment as the property  is fully furnished and air conditioned and is ready for living in or for renting  during the tourism season.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the south side of the building is a large  swimming pool area for relaxing and sunbathing, shared only with other  residents.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>In front of the building is private parking, which is usually free  because many of the apartments are underused.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The historic town of Trogir  need is 10 minutes away, while the international airport takes 15  minutes.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Prompt viewing is advised!</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact the office in Split  to make an appointment.</p>', '', '918_Apartment_0.jpg', '918_Apartment_1.jpg', '918_Apartment_2.jpg', '918_Apartment_3.jpg', '918_Apartment_4.jpg', '918_Apartment_5.jpg', '918_Apartment_6.jpg', '918_Apartment_7.jpg', '918_Apartment_8.jpg'),
(919, 'John', 'Britton', '+353 87 994 1034', 'kljuè kod Branke', 'jbritton@eircon.net', 'Trogir', 'Villa Bu¹inci, K. Branimira 2/A, z.u. 4488', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '450', '0', '45', 2, '53000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 1, 1, 1, 'October 26, 2014', '<p>Na 2.katu sa djelomiènim pogledom na more nalazi se apartman u mirnoj zgradi na ju¾noj strani otoka Èiova. Ukupna stambena povr&scaron;ina iznosi 45 m2 (34 m2 + loggia 11 m2). Potpuno je namje&scaron;ten i spreman na useljenje, ali i turistièko iznajmljivanje. Sastoji se od hodnika, dnevnog boravka+ kuhinje + blagovaonice, 1 spavaæe sobe, 1 kupaonice i loggie sa djelomiènim pogledom na more.</p>', '<p>Excellent opportunity and price!&nbsp;Modern apartment on the south side of Ciovo, on the 2nd floor with a partial sea view. Total area is 45 m2 (34 m2 + covered balcony 11 m2). It is fully furnished and ready to move in, or ready for tourist guests. It consists of a hall, open plan living room, kitchen and dining room, 1 bedroom, 1 bathroom and balcony with partial sea views.</p>', '', '<p>Na 2.katu sa djelomiènim pogledom na more nalazi se apartman u mirnoj zgradi na ju¾noj strani otoka Èiova.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Prirodno kamenita pla¾a udaljena je cca. 450 m ili 10 minuta &scaron;etnje. Centar mjesta gdje se nalaze trgovine, restorani, ljekarna i ostali sadr¾aji udaljen je 3 min. vo¾nje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ukupna stambena povr&scaron;ina iznosi 45 m2 (34 m2 + loggia 11 m2).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Potpuno je namje&scaron;ten i spreman na useljenje, ali i turistièko iznajmljivanje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sastoji se od hodnika, dnevnog boravka+ kuhinje + blagovaonice, 1 spavaæe sobe, 1 kupaonice i loggie sa djelomiènim pogledom na more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sa ju¾ne strane se nalazi bazen i velika zajednièka terasa za sunèanje &scaron;to je jo&scaron; jedna prednost ovog apartmana.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U apartmanu se takoðer nalazi i klimatizacijski ureðaj.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na sjevernoj strani nalazi se nekoliko zajednièkih parkirnih mjesta koja su uglavnom slobodna jer veèina vlasnika u apartmanima boravi samo za vrijeme odmora.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Popularni grad Trogir udaljen je 10 minuta, dok je meðunarodni aerodrom udaljen 15 minuta vo¾nje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za sva ostala pitanja molimo da nas kontaktirate.</p>', '<p>Modern apartment on the south side of Ciovo, on the 2nd floor with a partial sea  view.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Excellent opportunity and price!</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The natural rocky shore, and  swimming beaches are approx. 450 m or 10 minutes walk.&nbsp;The centre of the  local village, where there are shops, restaurants, pharmacy and other facilities  is 3 min. driving.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Total area is 45 m2 (34 m2 + covered balcony 11  m2).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is fully furnished and ready to move in, or ready for tourist  guests.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It consists of a hall, open plan living room, kitchen and dining  room, 1 bedroom, 1 bathroom and balcony with partial sea views.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the  south side of the building there is a common swimming pool and a large terrace  for sunbathing, private for residents of the block only.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The apartment has an  air conditioner and heating, and good quality fixtures, such as solid wooden  doors, ceramic floors fitted kitchen etc.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the north side there are  several common parking lots for the residents which are mostly  free.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Historic UNESCO maintained town of Trogir is 10 minutes driving,  while the international airport is 15 minutes.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For viewing of this  excellent priced property please hurry!</p>', '', '919_Apartment_0.jpg', '919_Apartment_1.jpg', '919_Apartment_2.jpg', '919_Apartment_3.jpg', '919_Apartment_4.jpg', '919_Apartment_5.jpg', '919_Apartment_6.jpg', '919_Apartment_7.jpg', '919_Apartment_8.jpg'),
(920, 'Nikola', 'Jeliæ', '', '', '', 'Hvar', 'Stari Grad', 'For sale', 'Old stone house', '300', '100', '85', 2, '150000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 3, 2, 'October 26, 2014', '<p>Kamena kuæa sa velikom terasom u centru grada na sjevernoj strani otoka Hvara. Kuæa je ukupne stambene povr&scaron;ine 85m2, i sastoji se od prizemlja i dva kata. U prizemlju je kuhinja i dnevni boravak, a na katu su spavaæe sobe. Kuæa ima veliku terasu sa kominom (ro&scaron;tiljem). Sa terase se pru¾a prekrasan pogled na okolna brda i prirodu.</p>', '<p>We are offering this stone house with a large terrace in the village centre on the northern side of the island of Hvar. The traditional style house has a total floor area of 85m2, and consists of three floors. On the ground floor is the kitchen and living room, and upstairs are the bedrooms. The house has a large terrace with bbq/grill. The terrace offers a breathtaking view of the surrounding hills and countryside.</p>', '', '<p>Kamena kuæa sa velikom terasom u centru grada na sjevernoj strani otoka Hvara.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je ukupne stambene povr&scaron;ine 85m2, i sastoji se od prizemlja i dva kata.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U prizemlju je kuhinja i dnevni boravak, a na katu su spavaæe sobe.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa ima veliku terasu sa kominom (ro&scaron;tiljem).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sa terase se pru¾a prekrasan pogled na okolna brda i prirodu.</p>', '<p>We are offering this stone house with a large terrace in the village centre on  the northern side of the island of Hvar.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The traditional style house has  a total floor area of 85m2, and consists of three floors.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the ground  floor is the kitchen and living room, and upstairs are the bedrooms.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The  house has a large terrace with bbq/grill.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The terrace offers a  breathtaking view of the surrounding hills and countryside.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property  has been modernised and well maintained, both on the outside and  inside.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Within a short walk are many beaches with clear water, shops,  bakery, coffee bars, market and behind the village is traditional countryside  with olive groves.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please call our CPS - Hvar office to arrange  viewing.</p>', '', '920_Old-stone-house_0.jpg', '920_Old-stone-house_1.jpg', '920_Old-stone-house_2.jpg', '920_Old-stone-house_3.jpg', '920_Old-stone-house_4.jpg', '920_Old-stone-house_5.jpg', '920_Old-stone-house_6.jpg', '920_Old-stone-house_7.jpg', '920_Old-stone-house_8.jpg'),
(921, 'Jelka', 'Aniæ', '', '099/ 561 8807', '', 'Trogir', 'O.Gornji, Put Diruna, 836/6', 'For sale', 'Land plot', '160', '560', '0', 1, '210000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 0, 0, 'October 27, 2014', '<p>Graðevinsko zemlji&scaron;te sa izvrsnim potencijalom u jednoj od najljep&scaron;ih i najpopularnijih uvala na ju¾noj strani otoka Èiova. S obzirom da je na ovom podruèju ostalo jo&scaron; malo graðevinskih zemlji&scaron;ta koja su na prodaji, ovo je izuzetna prilika ¾elite li izgraditi nekretninu prema vlastitim ¾eljama. Zemlji&scaron;te ima ukupnu povr&scaron;inu 560 m2, je moguæa izgradnja kuæe koja se sastoji od suterena, prizemlja, 1.i 2. kata.</p>', '<p>We have this substantial building land plot with excellent potential in one of the most popular bays on the south side of Ciovo. This area has very few undeveloped building plots, so this offers a genuine and rare opportunity to build the house to your own specifications. The land has a total area of 560 m2, and it is possible to build a house that has a basement, ground floor, 1st and 2nd floor. On the upper floors would afford a breathtaking view of the sea and the bay.</p>', '', '<p>Graðevinsko zemlji&scaron;te sa izvrsnim potencijalom u jednoj od najljep&scaron;ih i najpopularnijih uvala na ju¾noj strani otoka Èiova.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>S obzirom da je na ovom podruèju ostalo jo&scaron; malo graðevinskih zemlji&scaron;ta koja su na prodaji, ovo je izuzetna prilika ¾elite li izgraditi nekretninu prema vlastitim ¾eljama.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Zemlji&scaron;te ima ukupnu povr&scaron;inu 560 m2, je moguæa izgradnja kuæe koja se sastoji od suterena, prizemlja, 1.i 2. kata.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sa gornjim eta¾a bi se pru¾ao prekrasan pogled na more i cijelu uvalu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Udaljenost od mora i prirodno kamenite pla¾e je 160 m gdje takoðer postoji moguænost privezivanja manjeg broda.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Do zemlji&scaron;ta je direktan pristupni put, dok je sva potrebna infrastruktura odmah do zemlji&scaron;ta.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Centar mjesta gdje se nalaze svi sadr¾aji udaljen je 3 min. vo¾nje, dok je meðunarodni aerodrom udaljen 20 min. vo¾nje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za sve dodatne informacije stojimo vam na raspolaganju.</p>', '<p>We have this substantial building land plot with excellent potential in one of  the most popular bays on the south side of Ciovo.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>This area has very few  undeveloped building plots, so this offers a genuine and rare opportunity to  build the house to your own specifications.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The land has a total area of  560 m2, and it is possible to build a house that has a basement, ground floor,  1st and 2nd floor.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the upper floors would afford a breathtaking view of  the sea and the bay.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Distance from the natural rocky shore is 160 m,  where there is also the possibility of having a private mooring  buoy.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The plot has direct access from the road and all the infrastructure  needed is already adjacent to the plot.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The village centre has many  shops, bars and other facilities, both for tourists and residents and this is  just 3 minute&rsquo;s drive from the property, while the international airport is 20  minutes. driving.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please call our office for further information, and we  will do our best to answer questions.</p>', '', '921_Land-plot_0.jpg', '921_Land-plot_1.jpg', '921_Land-plot_2.jpg', '921_Land-plot_3.jpg', '921_Land-plot_4.jpg', '921_Land-plot_5.jpg', '', '', ''),
(922, 'Aljo¹a', 'Dimiæ', '', '091/3655809', '', 'Split', 'Dr¾iæeva 16', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '530', '0', '72', 1, '215000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 2, 1, 'October 27, 2014', '<p>Jako zanimljiv i prekrasno ureðen apartman u potkrovlju (4.kat) starogradske zgrade, u mirnom dijelu grada starog dijela grada Splita. udaljen je 10 minuta hodanja od Dioklecijanove palaèe i ostalih ljepota samog starog dijela grada. Cijeli kat na kojem se nalazi apartman je zapravo novogradnja na veæ postojeæoj starograskoj zgradi. Ukupna povr&scaron;ina iznosi 72 m2 + 10 m2 galerije koja se trenutno koristi kao spremi&scaron;te.</p>', '<p>We are pleased to offer this very interesting and contemporary apartment in the penthouse/ (4.floor) of an old building in a quiet part of the old town of Split. The entire floor on which the apartment is placed is actually an additional floor added to the existing old town building.&nbsp;With such a free hand the architect has created a wonderful light, airy and spacious apartment. The total area is 72 m2 with a 10 m2 gallery.</p>', '', '<p>Jako zanimljiv i prekrasno ureðen apartman u potkrovlju (4.kat) starogradske zgrade, u mirnom dijelu grada starog dijela grada Splita.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Udaljen je 10 minuta hodanja od Dioklecijanove palaèe i ostalih ljepota samog starog dijela grada.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Cijeli kat na kojem se nalazi apartman je zapravo novogradnja na veæ postojeæoj starograskoj zgradi.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Iz apartmana se pru¾a djelomièan pogled na more, katedralu Sv. Duje i dio starog dijela grada.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ukupna povr&scaron;ina iznosi 72 m2 + 10 m2 galerije koja se trenutno koristi kao spremi&scaron;te.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sastoji se od kuhinje + blagovaonice + dnevnog boravka, hodnika, 2 spavaæe sobe, kupaonice i galerije.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Cijeli apartman je jako osunèan i prozraèan.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>prodaje se potpuno namje&scaron;ten i klimatiziran.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U blizini se nalazi parking mjesto koje je moguæe dobiti na kori&scaron;tenje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Popularna pla¾a Baèvice je udaljena 15 minuta hodanja, dok su svi ostali sadr¾aji u blizini.</p>\r\n<p>Meðunarodni aerodrom udaljen je 40 minuta vo¾nje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Molimo da nas kontaktirate za sve dodatne informacije.</p>', '<p>We are pleased to offer this very interesting and contemporary apartment in the  penthouse/ (4.floor) of an old building in a quiet part of the old town of  Split.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The entire floor on which the apartment is placed is actually an  additional floor added to the existing old town building.&nbsp;With such a free  hand the architect has created a wonderful light, airy and spacious  apartment.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The total area is 72 m2 with a&nbsp; 10 m2 gallery.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It consists of  an open plan kitchen + dining room + living room, hallway, two bedrooms,  bathroom and gallery.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The dominant material is wood, and all the fittings  have been chosen to give a warm and comfortable feel, but be practical  also.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The photographs do not do the property justice.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The apartment  offers views across the city, which include the sea, the main Cathedral, Marjan  park and part of the old town.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The whole apartment is very sunny and airy and  is being sold fully furnished, ready for immediate habitation.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nearby  there is a parking place.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>A popular beach Bacvice is 15 minutes of  walking, while all other facilities nearby, including the Riva, the Palace etc,  but maybe more importantly, a 24 hour bakery, and some great bars.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The  international airport is 40 minutes drive.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact us for further  information.</p>', '', '922_Apartment_0.jpg', '922_Apartment_1.jpg', '922_Apartment_2.jpg', '922_Apartment_3.jpg', '922_Apartment_4.jpg', '922_Apartment_5.jpg', '922_Apartment_6.jpg', '922_Apartment_7.jpg', '922_Apartment_8.jpg'),
(923, 'Joka', 'Machado', 'kljuè -Nicol i Gordan 0958927874 021887181', '091/ 592 3055', '', 'Trogir', 'Petra Kre¹imira 41 (Mavar¹tica), 800/11   1182 zgr', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '135', '485', '105', 2, '297000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 4, 4, 'October 27, 2014', '<p>Samostojeæa kuæa na ju¾noj strani otoka Èiova, sa prostranim kultiviranim dvori&scaron;tem i prekrasnim pogledom na more. Ukupno zemlji&scaron;te iznosi 485 m2, dok je stambena povr&scaron;ina kuæe 105 m2 + 2 prostrane terase (30 m2). Zbog odliènog polo¾aja mo¾e se koristiti i u svrhu turistièkog iznajmljivanja.</p>', '<p>We are pleased to offer this detached house on the south side of Ciovo island, with a large cultivated garden and a beautiful views of the village and the sea. It is situated 135 m distance from the natural rocky shore where it is a possible to moor small boat. The total land plot is 485 m2, while the living area is 105 m2 with 2 spacious terraces (30 m2).</p>', '', '<p>Samostojeæa kuæa na ju¾noj strani otoka Èiova, sa prostranim kultiviranim dvori&scaron;tem i prekrasnim pogledom na more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Udaljenost od prirodno kamenite pla¾e gdje postoji moguænost privezivanja manjeg broda je 135 m.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ukupno zemlji&scaron;te iznosi 485 m2, dok je stambena povr&scaron;ina kuæe 105 m2 + 2 prostrane terase (30 m2).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U prizemlju se nalazi gara¾a sa jednim parkirnim mjestom i studio apartmanom sa posebnim ulazom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na 1.katu se nalazi hodnik, wc, kupaonica, dnevni boravak + kuhinja + kupaonica i terasa sa pogledom na more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na 2.katu su 3 spavaæe sobe, 1 kupaonica, 1 manja i 1 prostrana terasa sa prekrasnim pogledom na more i uvalu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>1. i 2. kat su spojeni unutarnjih stepenicama, dok je iz 2.kata takoðer ulaz u neureðeno potkrovlje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ispred se nalazi parking za 2 automobila i dovoljno mjesta za izgradnju bazena. Sa sjeverne strane kuæe je smje&scaron;ten kamin sa ureðenim vrtom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je u useljivom stanju, ali je potrebno dodatno ulaganje da bi se dobio luksuzniji nivo.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Zbog odliènog polo¾aja mo¾e se koristiti i u svrhu turistièkog iznajmljivanja.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U blizini se nalazi centar mjesta sa svim potrebnim sadr¾ajima.</p>\r\n<p>Meðunarodni aerodrom udaljen je 20 min. vo¾nje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za sve dodatne informacije slobodno nas kontaktirajte.</p>', '<p>We are pleased to offer this detached house on the south side of Ciovo island,  with a large cultivated garden and a beautiful views of the village and the  sea.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is situated 135 m distance from the natural rocky shore where it  is a possible to moor small boat.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The total land plot is 485 m2, while  the living area is 105 m2 with 2 spacious terraces (30 m2).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the  ground floor there is a garage with one parking space and a studio apartment  with a separate entrance.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the 1st floor there is a hall, toilet, bathroom,  living room and kitchen, and terrace overlooking the sea.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the 2nd floor  are 3 bedrooms, 1 bathroom, 1 small and 1 large terrace with a beautiful view of  the sea and the bay.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>1st and 2nd floor are connected to the internal stairs,  while the 2nd floor has entrance to the attic, which needs the decorating to be  completed.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>In front there is parking for two cars and plenty of room for  redesigning the garden to include a large patio area, or even a swimming  pool.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the north side of the house is a bbq/fireplace and a beautiful  garden.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house is in a habitable condition but requires additional  investment to obtain a luxurious level.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Due to the excellent location  this property can be used for the purpose of tourist rental.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house is  within walking distance of bars, shops, bakery, coffee shops and  restaurants.</p>\r\n<p>The main town, Trogir, is 10 minute&rsquo;s driving from here,  while the airport&nbsp; is 20 minutes.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For further information please contact  our CPS - Split office.</p>', '', '923_House-Villa_0.jpg', '923_House-Villa_1.JPG', '923_House-Villa_2.JPG', '923_House-Villa_3.JPG', '923_House-Villa_4.JPG', '923_House-Villa_5.JPG', '923_House-Villa_6.jpg', '923_House-Villa_7.jpg', '923_House-Villa_8.jpg'),
(924, 'Josip', 'Lovrinoviæ', '', '091/ 169 0353', '', 'Trogir', 'Mavar¹tica, 851/9', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '230', '400', '240', 1, '240000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 2, 1, 'October 27, 2014', '<p>Samostojeæa kuæa u jednoj od najljep&scaron;ih uvala na ju¾noj strani otoka Èiova. Nalazi se u mirnom dijelu uvale sa prekrasnim pogledom na sve 3 eta¾e. Prizemlje je zavr&scaron;eno dok su podrum, 1. i 2. kat u Roh-bau fazi. Ukupna povr&scaron;ina zemlji&scaron;ta iznosi 400 m2, dok je brutto stambena povr&scaron;ina 240 m2 (80 m2 x 3) + podrum 45 m2. Sastoji se od podruma, prizemlja, 1. i 2. kata.</p>', '<p>Building project! We are offering this detached house in one of the most beautiful bays on the south side of Ciovo island. The ground floor has been completed while the basement, first and second floor are in unfinished stage.The total land area is 400 m2, while the gross living area is &#8203;&#8203;240 m2 (80 m2 x 3) + basement of 45 m2.&nbsp;It consists of a basement, ground, first and second floors.</p>', '', '<p>Samostojeæa kuæa u jednoj od najljep&scaron;ih uvala na ju¾noj strani otoka Èiova. Nalazi se u mirnom dijelu uvale sa prekrasnim pogledom na sve 3 eta¾e.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Prizemlje je zavr&scaron;eno dok su podrum, 1. i 2. kat u Roh-bau fazi.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Potrebno je jo&scaron; ulaganja ali je zbog izvrsnog polo¾aja izuzetna prilika za investiciju i preureðenje u predivnu villu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ukupna povr&scaron;ina zemlji&scaron;ta iznosi 400 m2, dok je brutto stambena povr&scaron;ina 240 m2 (80 m2 x 3) + podrum 45 m2. Sastoji se od podruma, prizemlja, 1. i 2. kata.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Uprizemlju, koje je veæ ureðeno se nalazi kuhinja + blagovaonica + dnevni boravak, hodnik, kupaonica, ostava i 1 spavaæa soba.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ispred kuæe se nalazi parking za 3 automobila i prostrano dvori&scaron;te gdje je moguæa izgradnja bazena.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Prirodno kamenita i manja pje&scaron;èana pla¾a su udaljene cca. 235 m. Uz du¾ cijele obale nalazi se &scaron;etnica i mnoge ureðene kamenite pla¾e.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Centar mjesta sa svim sadr¾ajima udaljeno je svega par minuta vo¾nje.</p>\r\n<p>Meðunarodni aerodrom udaljen je 20 minuta vo¾nje, &scaron;to je jo&scaron; jedna prednost Èiova.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za sva dodatna pitanja molim da nas kontaktirate.</p>', '<p>Building project!</p>\r\n<p>We are offering this detached house in one of the most  beautiful bays on the south side of Ciovo island.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The ground floor has  been completed while the basement, first and second floor are in unfinished  stage.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It will need some more investment but because of the excellent  position is a great opportunity for investment and renovation in a beautiful  villa.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Most of the heavy work has been done and the price is little more  than value of the original plot. This is a great opportunity.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The total  land area is 400 m2, while the gross living area is &#8203;&#8203;240 m2 (80 m2 x 3) +  basement of 45 m2.&nbsp;It consists of a basement, ground, first and second  floors.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the ground floor, which is already finished is: kitchen + dining  room, living room, bathroom, storage room and one bedroom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house has  parking for 3 cars and a spacious garden where there is enough space to build a  swimming pool.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is located in a quiet cove with a beautiful view from  all three floors.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The shore in front of the house is natural stone with small  pebble beach and this is a five minute walk. Along the entire coastline  is a promenade/riva and many nice beaches.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The village centre with plenty  of shops, bars, bakery and many other useful amenities is just a few  minutes.</p>\r\n<p>The international airport is 20 minutes away, which is another  advantage of Ciovo.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;">The new bridge to the island is coming up in 2016  and work has already started.</span></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For any additional questions please  contact us, where we are always ready to help.</p>', '', '924_House-Villa_0.jpg', '924_House-Villa_1.jpg', '924_House-Villa_2.jpg', '924_House-Villa_3.jpg', '924_House-Villa_4.jpg', '924_House-Villa_5.jpg', '924_House-Villa_6.jpg', '924_House-Villa_7.jpg', '924_House-Villa_8.jpg'),
(925, 'Alison', 'McDonnell', '+353 86 8018264, 099/ 674 6616 Alison', 'Ed Mc Donnell  +353 87 258 8249', 'almcdonnell@hotmail.com', 'Trogir', 'Ante Starèeviæa 45 b  Stan S8, Z.u. 4561', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '200', '0', '47', 2, '115000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 2, 1, 'October 27, 2014', '<p>Apartman na 4. katu (potkrovlje), sa prekrasnim pogledom na more, prostranom terasom i namje&scaron;tajem ukljuèenim u cijenu. Nalazi se na otoku Èiovu, na mirnom dijelu udaljenom od prekrasne pla¾e cca. 200 m. Ukupna povr&scaron;ina apartmana je 47 m2 + 23 m2 terase sa pogledom na more koji ne mo¾e biti zaklonjen. Radi se o simpatiènom apartmanu idealnom za vlastito u¾ivanje ali i iznajmljivanje.</p>', '<p>We are offering this holiday apartment on the 4th floor (top floor), with beautiful sea views, a spacious terrace with furniture included. It is located on the island of Ciovo, in a quiet part, 200 m away from the beautiful pebble and stone beaches. The whole apartment is 47 m2 + 23 m2 roof top terrace which has stunning views in all directions.</p>', '', '<p>Apartman na 4. katu (potkrovlje), sa prekrasnim pogledom na more, prostranom terasom i namje&scaron;tajem ukljuèenim u cijenu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nalazi se na otoku Èiovu, na mirnom dijelu udaljenom od prekrasne pla¾e cca. 200 m.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Centar mjesta sa trgovinama, kafiæima, restoranima i svim ostalim sadr¾ajima udaljen je par minuta vo¾nje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ukupna povr&scaron;ina apartmana je 47 m2 + 23 m2 terase sa pogledom na more koji ne mo¾e biti zaklonjen.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartman se sastoji od hodnika, dnevnog boravka + kuhinje + blagovaonice, 2 spavaæe sobe, kupaonice i terase. U dnevnom boravku se nalazi klimatizacijski ureðaj.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Radi se o simpatiènom apartmanu idealnom za vlastito u¾ivanje ali i iznajmljivanje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Zgrada je iznimno mirna, u kojoj stanari ne borave tijekom cijele godine nego samo za vrijeme godi&scaron;njih odmora.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ispred zgrade se nalazi 1 parking mjesto koje je ukljuèeno u cijenu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Povijesni grad Trogir udaljen je 15 min., dok je meðunarodni aerodrom udaljen 20 min. vo¾nje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Stojimo na raspolaganju za sva dodatna pitanja.</p>', '<p>We are offering this holiday apartment on the 4th floor (top floor), with  beautiful sea views, a spacious terrace with furniture included.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is  located on the island of Ciovo, in a quiet part, 200 m away from the beautiful  pebble and stone beaches.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The whole apartment is 47 m2 + 23 m2 roof top  terrace which has stunning views in all directions.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The apartment consists of  a hall, living room, kitchen and dining room, 2 bedrooms, bathroom and  terrace.&nbsp;In the living room there is air conditioning.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is a lovely  holiday apartment ideal for your own enjoyment but easy to rent when not being  used privately.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The building is very quiet, where many residents live  throughout the year rather than just during the holiday season.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>In front  of the building there is one parking place and is included in the  price.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Town centre with shops, bakery, cafes, restaurants and all other  amenities is only a few minutes drive away.</p>\r\n<p>The old town of Trogir is only 15  min.</p>\r\n<p>International airport is 20 minutes driving.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For viewing the  apartment contact our CPS- Split office.</p>', '', '925_Apartment_0.jpg', '925_Apartment_1.jpg', '925_Apartment_2.jpg', '925_Apartment_3.jpg', '925_Apartment_4.jpg', '925_Apartment_5.jpg', '925_Apartment_6.jpg', '925_Apartment_7.jpg', '925_Apartment_8.jpg'),
(926, 'Pave', 'Brajèiæ', '021/ 571 700', '098/ 134 7798', '', 'Split', 'Istarska 13', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '580', '0', '73', 2, '150000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 3, 1, 'October 27, 2014', '<p>Apartman u starogradskoj zgradi, smje&scaron;ten u centru Splita, udaljen od rive 10 minuta hodanja, na mirnoj lokaciji bez puno buke i prometa. Nalazi se na 1.katu, Z- I orjentacije. Ukupna stambena povr&scaron;ina iznosi 73 m2, a sastoji se od prostranog hodnika, kuhinje, kupaonica, 2 veæe i 1 manje spavaæe sobe. Iz apartmana se pru¾a pogled na ulicu i zajednièki dvor.</p>', '<p>This property is just 10 minute&rsquo;s walk from the waterfront, in a quiet location without too much noise and traffic. It is situated on the 1st floor, with a W/E orientation. Total area is 73 m2 and consists of a spacious hall, kitchen, bathroom, 2 large bedroom and 1 small bedroom.&nbsp;It has a spacious feel and the large windows give plenty of natural light. The apartment offers a view of the street and private courtyard.</p>', '', '<p>Apartman u starogradskoj zgradi, smje&scaron;ten u centru Splita, udaljen od rive 10 minuta hodanja, na mirnoj lokaciji bez puno buke i prometa.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nalazi se na 1.katu, Z- I orjentacije.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ukupna stambena povr&scaron;ina iznosi 73 m2, a sastoji se od prostranog hodnika, kuhinje, kupaonica, 2 veæe i 1 manje spavaæe sobe.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Iz apartmana se pru¾a pogled na ulicu i zajednièki dvor.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U podrumu se nalazi sprema velièine 9 m2.</p>\r\n<p>Na vrhu zgrade nalazi se zajednièka terasa sa prekrasnim pogledom na grad, &scaron;to je jo&scaron; jedna prednost ovog apartmana.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Iako je apartmanu potrebno renoviranje, radi se jako kvalitetnoj gradnji zgrade, stoga je ovo prava prilika za investiranje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Zbog rasporeda prostorija i moguænosti ru&scaron;enja nekoliko zidova, moguæe je preureðenje u dva manja apartmana.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Moguæe je parkirati ispred zgrade na ulici, dok je veliki parking udaljen 100 m.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Do najbli¾e pla¾e potrebno je 15 minuta &scaron;etnje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za sve dodatne informacije slobodno nas kontaktirajte.</p>', '<p>This property is just 10 minute&rsquo;s walk from the waterfront, in a quiet location  without too much noise and traffic.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is situated on the&nbsp; 1st floor,  with a W/E orientation.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Total area is 73 m2 and consists of a spacious hall,  kitchen, bathroom, 2 large bedroom and 1 small bedroom.&nbsp;It has a spacious  feel and the large windows give plenty of natural light.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The apartment  offers a view of the street and private courtyard.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>In the basement is a  storage room, size 9 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>At the top of the building there is a communal  terrace, rarely used, with a beautiful view of the city, which is another  advantage of this apartment.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Although the apartment needs renovation, the  building is attractive and was built to a high specification, so this is a real  opportunity for investment.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Because of the arrangement of rooms it could  be possible to rearrange the layout of the property, or even to convert it into  two smaller apartments.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There is parking&nbsp; in front of the building on the  street, while a large parking lot is about 100 yards.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The nearest beach  is only 15 minutes walk.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For additional information, please contact us.</p>', '', '926_Apartment_0.jpg', '926_Apartment_1.jpg', '926_Apartment_2.jpg', '926_Apartment_3.jpg', '926_Apartment_4.jpg', '926_Apartment_5.jpg', '926_Apartment_6.jpg', '926_Apartment_7.jpg', '926_Apartment_8.jpg'),
(927, 'Maja', 'Olujiæ', '', '098/ 906 1017', 'maja.olujic1@inet.hr', 'Trogir', 'O.Gornji, Gospino, Z.U. 1276', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '80', '548', '90', 2, '200000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 3, 1, 'November 2, 2014', '<p>Samostojeæa prizemnica, sa moguèno&scaron;æu nadogradnje, djelomiènim pogledom na more i prostranom okuænicom. Nalazi se na ju¾noj strani otoka Èiova, udaljena 80 m od prekrasne pla¾e i jedne od najpopularnijih uvala za odmor. Ukupno zemlji&scaron;te iznosi 548 m2 sa moguèno&scaron;æu izgradnje prostranog bazena. Povr&scaron;ina prizemnog dijela kuæe trenutno iznosi 90 m2, a sastoji se od dnevnog boravka + kuhinje + blagovaonice, 3 spavaæe sobe i kupaonice.</p>', '<p>We are pleased to have this house sitting on a large plot on Ciovo.&nbsp;The  property is a detached bungalow consisting of a kitchen, dining room, lounge  with three bedrooms.&nbsp;The footprint of the house is 90m sq but the plot  is 548m sq.&nbsp;It is situated 80m from the shore, on the south side of the island  in a quiet and popular bay.&nbsp;The airport is 20  minutes drive.</p>', '', '<p>Samostojeæa prizemnica, sa moguèno&scaron;æu nadogradnje, djelomiènim pogledom na more i prostranom okuænicom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nalazi se na ju¾noj strani otoka Èiova, udaljena 80 m od prekrasne pla¾e i jedne od najpopularnijih uvala za odmor.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ukupno zemlji&scaron;te iznosi 548 m2 sa moguèno&scaron;æu izgradnje prostranog bazena. U dvori&scaron;tu se nalazi parking za 2 automobila.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Povr&scaron;ina prizemnog dijela kuæe trenutno iznosi 90 m2, a sastoji se od dnevnog boravka + kuhinje + blagovaonice, 3 spavaæe sobe i kupaonice. Ispred se nalazi terasa sa kaminom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Trenutno se iz kuæe pru¾a djelomièan pogled dok bi se sa izgradnjom jo&scaron; eta¾a pru¾ao prekrasan pogled.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je trenutno u funkciji vikend kuæe, ali ima odlièan potencijal za izgradnju i preureðenje u vi&scaron;e apartmana, sa moguèno&scaron;æu turistièkog iznajmljivanja.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Centar mjesta gdje se nalaze trgovine, restorani, ljekarna, po&scaron;ta i svi ostali sadr¾aji je udaljen 3 minute vo¾nje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Do meðunarodnog aerodroma ima svega 20 minuta vo¾nje, &scaron;to je jo&scaron; jedna prednost ovog podruèja.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za sva dodatna pitanja stojimo vam na raspolaganju.</p>', '<p>We are pleased to have this house sitting on a large plot on Ciovo.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The  property is a detached bungalow consisting of a kitchen, dining room, lounge  with three bedrooms.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The footprint of the house is 90m sq but the plot  is 548m sq.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>This is enough space for parking for several cars, a large  garden area, and a swimming pool, with a patio surrounds.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>If building work is  considered then the plot would allow several apartments on such a large  plot.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There are partial sea views from the ground floor, but building  several apartments would give fabulous views across the town and to the  sea.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is situated 80m from the shore, on the south side of the island  in a quiet and popular bay.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The nearest village is only a few minutes by  car or a short walk, and here are many choices for bars, restaurants, shops, and  other services.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The nearest large town is Trogir, which is the cultural and  historic centre of the coast, which together with Split and Dubrovnik is a  designated UNESCO heritage site. This is 10 minutes drive.</p>\r\n<p>The airport is 20  minutes drive.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact the office for more information and to  arrange to visit the site.</p>', '', '927_House-Villa_0.jpg', '927_House-Villa_1.jpg', '927_House-Villa_2.jpg', '927_House-Villa_3.jpg', '927_House-Villa_4.jpg', '927_House-Villa_5.jpg', '927_House-Villa_6.jpg', '927_House-Villa_7.jpg', '927_House-Villa_8.jpg'),
(928, 'Josip', 'Bodro¾iæ D¾akiæ', '', '098/ 968 5128', '', 'Trogir', 'Mastrinka, Mi¹evac 98b', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '130', '0', '62', 1, '130000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 2, 1, 'November 2, 2014', '<p>Apartman u novogradnji na 2. katu, potpuno namje&scaron;ten i klimatiziran sa pogledom na more. Smje&scaron;ten je na sjevernoj strani otoka Èiova, udaljen od mora i pje&scaron;èane pla¾e svega 130 m. Ukupna stambena povr&scaron;ina iznosi 62 m2, a sastoji se od hodnika, dnevnog boravka + kuhinje + blagovaonice, 2 spavaæe sobe, kupaonice i terase sa pogledom na more.</p>', '<p>Croatia Property Sales have this new, two bedroom apartment on the second floor. It is situated 130m away from the shore on the north side of Ciovo island. The total area of the apartment is 62 m2 and it consists of a hall, living room, kitchen and dining room, two bedrooms, bathroom and balcony overlooking the sea. The price includes the furniture, so there is no need for any additional investment when purchasing the apartment.</p>', '', '<p>Apartman u novogradnji na 2. katu, potpuno namje&scaron;ten i klimatiziran sa pogledom na more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Smje&scaron;ten je na sjevernoj strani otoka Èiova, udaljen od mora i pje&scaron;èane pla¾e svega 130 m.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Povijesni grad Trogir gdje se nalaze zanimljive znamenitosti i razni drugi sadr¾aji udaljen je 10 min. vo¾nje, dok je meðunarodni aerodrom udaljen 15 min. vo¾nje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ukupna stambena povr&scaron;ina iznosi 62 m2, a sastoji se od hodnika, dnevnog boravka + kuhinje + blagovaonice, 2 spavaæe sobe, kupaonice i terase sa pogledom na more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U cijenu je ukljuèen namje&scaron;taj, stoga nije potrebno nikakvo dodatno ulaganje prilikom kupnje apartmana.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U podrumu se nalazi vlastita i jedna zajednièka ostava.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>1 vanjsko parking mjesto ispred zgrade je ukljuèeno u cijenu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Podruèje je idealno za ¾ivljenje preko cijele godine, ali i za turistièko iznajmljivanje. Cijeli otok jako je popularan zbog prekrasnih pla¾a i uvala, ali i zbog blizine aerodroma.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za sva dodatna pitanja vam stojimo na raspolaganju.</p>', '<p>Croatia Property Sales have this new, two bedroom apartment on the second  floor.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is situated 130m away from the shore on the north side of Ciovo  island. This part of the shore is popular for children to play and for swimmers  because of the clean water, low tides and sandy floor.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There are several  shops, coffee bars and beach bars within walking distance of the apartment, and  the nearest larger town, Trogir, is just 10 minutes by car where there are many  options for excellent restaurants and, historic and cultural  entertainments.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The total area of the apartment is 62 m2 and it consists  of a hall, living room, kitchen and dining room, two bedrooms, bathroom and  balcony overlooking the sea.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The price includes the furniture, so there is no  need for any additional investment when purchasing the apartment.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The  property has been well maintained and has been fitted with good quality  materials and fixtures.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There is some additional storage in the  basement.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There is a parking space in front of the building which is included  in the price.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The area is ideal for living all year round as well as for  tourist rentals.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The whole island is very popular because of the beautiful  beaches and bays, and also because of the proximity of the airport.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The  construction of the new access bridge to the island has been started, which  should ease the queues at peak times.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact our office in Split  for additional information and to arrange to view this property.</p>', '', '928_Apartment_0.jpg', '928_Apartment_1.jpg', '928_Apartment_2.jpg', '928_Apartment_3.jpg', '928_Apartment_4.jpg', '928_Apartment_5.jpg', '928_Apartment_6.jpg', '928_Apartment_7.jpg', '928_Apartment_8.jpg');
INSERT INTO `nekretnina` (`id`, `ime`, `prezime`, `telefon`, `mobitel`, `e_mail`, `lokacija_id`, `adresa`, `status_id`, `vrsta_id`, `udaljenost`, `povrsina`, `stambenapovrsina`, `display`, `cijena`, `cijenatocka`, `ponuda_tjedna`, `new_built`, `must_sell`, `prvi_red_do_mora`, `pogled_na_more`, `bazen`, `broj_soba`, `broj_kupatila`, `datum`, `title_hr`, `title_en`, `title_ge`, `opis_hr`, `opis_en`, `opis_ge`, `PropertyImageURL0`, `PropertyImageURL1`, `PropertyImageURL2`, `PropertyImageURL3`, `PropertyImageURL4`, `PropertyImageURL5`, `PropertyImageURL6`, `PropertyImageURL7`, `PropertyImageURL8`) VALUES
(930, 'Pavo i Else', 'Matana', '', '098/ 901 6151', '', 'Split', 'Washingtonova 6', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '1000', '0', '84', 1, '168000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 3, 2, 'November 2, 2014', '<p>Apartman u starogradskoj zgradi na 3.katu u mirnoj ulici bez puno buke i prometa u jednom od najpopularnijih kvartova grada Splita. Najbli¾a pla¾a u uvali Baèvice udaljena je cca. 1km. Apartman je smje&scaron;ten u visokom potkrovlju visine stropova 2,80 m. Ukupna stambena povr&scaron;ina iznosi 84 m2.</p>', '<p>We are pleased to offer this town apartment with 2 bedrooms, in a popular neighborhood near the city centre. It is on the third floor of a block in a quiet street with no through traffic, and conveniently situated for access to the centre of the city and the palace, or the nearest beach which is Bacvice. Both places are just a 15 minute walk. The apartment itself is on the top floor with 84m sq. The ceilings are unusually tall, being 2.8m high.</p>', '', '<p>Apartman u starogradskoj zgradi na 3.katu u mirnoj ulici bez puno buke i prometa u jednom od najpopularnijih kvartova grada Splita.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Najbli¾a pla¾a u uvali Baèvice udaljena je cca. 1km. Povijesne znamenitosti Dioklecijanove palaèe i svi ostali sadraji u centru su udaljeni 15 min. &scaron;etnje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartman je smje&scaron;ten u visokom potkrovlju visine stropova 2,80 m.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ukupna stambena povr&scaron;ina iznosi 84 m2, a sastoji se od hodnika, kuhinje + spreme, dnevnog boravka + 1 sobe, 1 male i 1 velike spavaæe sobe, kupaonice i wc-a.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U podrumu se nalazi zajednièka prostorija koja slu&scaron;i kao prostorija za pranje rublja.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Vlasnici apartmana takoðer imaju na kori&scaron;tenje dio vrta i potkrovlja èiji se ulaz nalazi odmah nasuprot glavnog ulaza u apartman.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Prije 30 godina su promjenjene sve vodne i elektriène instalacije koje su i dalje u normalnoj funkciji.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartman je u useljivom stanju, ali je potrebno dodatno renoviranje i ulaganja pogotovo ako ¾elite veæi nivo luksuznosti.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Svi potrebni sadr¾aji se nalaze u blizini, dok je do meðunarodnog aerodroma potrebno 40 min. vo¾nje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za sve dodatne informacije slobodno nas kontaktirajte.</p>', '<p>We are pleased to offer this town apartment with 2 bedrooms, in a popular  neighborhood near the city centre.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is on the third floor of a block in  a quiet street with no through traffic, and conveniently situated for access to  the centre of the city and the palace, or the nearest beach which is  Bacvice. Both places are just a 15 minute walk.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The apartment  itself is on the top floor with 84m sq. The ceilings are unusually tall, being  2.8m high.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property design has a hallway, kitchen with attached  storage, living room, 3 bedrooms (one small and two large bedrooms) and a  bathroom and toilet. In the basement there is a common room which serves as a  laundry room.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property is habitable but is probably due for some  modernisation and redecoration.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The owners also have s rights to use part  of the garden and also the attic.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The entrance to the attic and roof is  directly opposite the main entrance to the apartment and is rarely visited by  the other residents.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There are plenty of shops, bars and restaurants  within walking distance of the property, and the airport is about 30 minutes  drive.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact the office in Split to arrange to visit this  property.</p>', '', '930_Apartment_0.jpg', '930_Apartment_1.jpg', '930_Apartment_2.jpg', '930_Apartment_3.jpg', '930_Apartment_4.jpg', '930_Apartment_5.jpg', '930_Apartment_6.jpg', '930_Apartment_7.jpg', '930_Apartment_8.jpg'),
(931, 'Franèe¹ko', 'Paliæ', '', '091/ 202 3533', '', 'Split', 'Duplanèiæa dvori 14, 13017 arkod/kat.', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '400', '0', '38', 2, '75000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 1, 1, 'November 2, 2014', '<p>Simpatièan apartman u potkrovlju manje kamene kuæe, u mirnoj ulici starog dijela grada Splita, sa djelomiènim pogledom na more i katedralu sv. Duje. Ukupna stambena povr&scaron;ina iznosi 38 m2, dok je brutto podna povr&scaron;ina 50 m2. Sastoji se od posebnog ulaza, stepenica, hodnika, kuhinje, dnevnog boravka, 2 spavaæe sobe i kupaonice.</p>', '<p>An affordable apartment in the attic of old houses, in a quiet street in the old town of Split, with partial views of the sea and the main cathedral church. The apartment needs to be fully renovated. The total gross area is 50 m2 and it consists of a stairway, independent to the rest of the property, hall, kitchen, living room, two bedrooms and a bathroom.</p>', '', '<p>Simpatièan apartman u potkrovlju manje kamene kuæe, u mirnoj ulici starog dijela grada Splita, sa djelomiènim pogledom na more i katedralu sv. Duje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartman je za kompletno renoviranje, te se mo¾e preurediti za vlastiti boravak i u¾ivanje ali i za turistièko iznajmljivanje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ovaj dio grada koji je udaljen svega 5 minuta hodanja od rive i Dioklecijanove palaèe je jako popularan upravo zbog blizine centra i mirnih ulica.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ukupna stambena povr&scaron;ina iznosi 38 m2, dok je brutto podna povr&scaron;ina 50 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sastoji se od posebnog ulaza, stepenica, hodnika, kuhinje, dnevnog boravka, 2 spavaæe sobe i kupaonice.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Najbli¾i parking udaljen je cca. 50 m od kuæe.</p>\r\n<p>Mnogobrojni restorani, barovi, tr¾nica, ljekarne i svi ostali potrebni sadr¾aji nalaze se u blizini.</p>\r\n<p>Meðunarodni aerodrom udaljen je 40 min. vo¾nje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Grad Split odu&scaron;evit æe vas mnogim zamenitostima, bogatom gastronomskom ponudom ali i modernim sadr¾ajima.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Molim da nas kontaktirate za sve dodatne informacije.</p>', '<p>An affordable apartment in the attic of old houses, in a quiet street in the old  town of Split, with partial views of the sea and the main cathedral  church.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The apartment needs to be fully renovated.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The total gross  area is 50 m2 and it consists of a stairway, independent to the rest of the  property, hall, kitchen, living room, two bedrooms and a bathroom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The  nearest parking is cca. 50 m from the house.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>This part of town&nbsp; is only 5  minutes walk from the promenade and Diocletian''s Palace is very popular with  tourists because of the proximity to downtown Split.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Around the  apartment, within a short walk are many restaurants, bars, the ferry terminal,  bus and taxi station, the beach, markets and many other useful  facilities.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The international airport is 30 minutes.  driving.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact us in our humble but convenient office in Split  for more information.</p>', '', '931_Apartment_0.jpg', '931_Apartment_1.jpg', '931_Apartment_2.jpg', '931_Apartment_3.jpg', '931_Apartment_4.jpg', '931_Apartment_5.jpg', '931_Apartment_6.jpg', '931_Apartment_7.jpg', '931_Apartment_8.jpg'),
(932, 'Renata', 'Hegedu¹ ©imetoviæ', '', '091/ 543 7322', '', 'Split', 'Istarska 5, z.u. 9146', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '600', '0', '142', 1, '310000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 4, 2, 'November 2, 2014', '<p>Prostrani apartman na zadnjem katu starogradske zgrade u mirnom dijelu grada Splita u blizini tr¾nice i mnogih drugih sadr¾aja. Iz apartmana se pru¾a djelomièan pogled na more, katedralu sv. Duje i stari dio grada. Ukupna povr&scaron;ina iznosi 142 m2 + 2 terase (11,69 m2 i 6,25 m2). Apartmanu je potrebno kompletno renoviranje, te je dovoljno prostran da se preuredi u 2 ili 3 manja.</p>', '<p>We are pleased to offer this spacious 4/5 bedroom apartment on the top floor of the old town building. It is situated in a quiet part of Split, near the centre and within 5 minutes walking distance of markets, the Riva, the Palace, and many of the best restaurants and bars. The apartment offers a partial view of the sea, the main cathedral church and much of the old part of the city. The total floor area is 142 m2 + 2 terraces (11.69 m2 and 6.25 m2).</p>', '', '<p>Prostrani apartman na zadnjem katu starogradske zgrade u mirnom dijelu grada Splita u blizini tr¾nice i mnogih drugih sadr¾aja.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Riva, palaèa i sve ostale znamenitosti samog centra grada udaljeni su hodanjem cca. 5 minuta.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Iz apartmana se pru¾a djelomièan pogled na more, katedralu sv. Duje i stari dio grada.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ukupna povr&scaron;ina iznosi 142 m2 + 2 terase (11,69 m2 i 6,25 m2).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sastoji se od 3 hodnika, dnevnog boravka i 2 spavaæe sobe na jugu sa izlazom na terase, 3 hodnika, kupaonice, wc-a, 2 manje spavaæe sobe, kuhinje i terase na sjeveru.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartmanu je potrebno kompletno renoviranje, te je dovoljno prostran da se preuredi u 2 ili 3 manja.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Zbog odliène lokacije i blizine centra mo¾e se i turistièki iznajmljivati. Takoðer je idealan i za obiteljski ¾ivot preko cijele godine.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Povi&scaron;e apartmana nalazi se zajednièko potkrovlje za koje postoji moguænosti otkupa po povoljnoj cijeni.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Najbli¾i parking udaljen je 20 m od zgrade gdje se mo¾e dobiti povoljna godi&scaron;nja pretplata te bi imali osigurano mjesto &scaron;to je rijetkost u starom dijelu grada.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Meðunarodni aerodrom udaljen je 40 min. vo¾nje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za sva ostala pitanja vam stojimo na raspolaganju.</p>', '<p>We are pleased to offer this spacious 4/5 bedroom apartment on the top floor of  the old town building.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is situated in a quiet part of Split, near the  centre and within 5 minutes walking distance of markets, the Riva, the Palace,  and many of the best restaurants and bars.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The apartment offers a partial  view of the sea, the main cathedral church and much of the old part of the  city.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The total floor area is 142 m2 + 2 terraces (11.69 m2 and 6.25  m2).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It consists of a hall, living room and three large bedrooms, with access  to the balcony, bathroom, toilet, two smaller bedrooms, a kitchen with access to  a second balcony.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The apartment needs a complete renovation and is  spacious enough to be rearranged into two or three smaller, independent  flats.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Above the apartment there is also a common attic for which there is  the possibility of buying for a modest sum.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Its location and proximity to  the centre would ensure there was a high demand from tourists, even though it  would also be an ideal property for family life throughout the year.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The  nearest parking is located 20 meters from the building where you can get  inexpensive annual subscription and would have secured a place which is rare in  the old town.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The international airport is 40 minutes driving.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For any  other questions, please contact our office in Split.</p>', '', '932_Apartment_0.jpg', '932_Apartment_1.jpg', '932_Apartment_2.jpg', '932_Apartment_3.jpg', '932_Apartment_4.jpg', '932_Apartment_5.jpg', '', '', ''),
(933, 'Jelena', 'Petriæ', '', '091/ 151 1707', '', 'Split', 'Bijankinijeva 6 (2.kat), 9600/4 arkod/kat', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '250', '0', '60', 1, '166000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 1, 'November 3, 2014', '<p>Prostrani apartman na 2.katu starogradske zgrade, u mirnom dijelu grada Splita, koji je ujedno popularan zbog pla¾e Baèvice koja je od ove zgrade udaljena svega 250 m. Sami centar i Dioklecijanova palaèa su udaljeni cca. 500 m ili 10 minuta hodanja. Ukupna povr&scaron;ina apartmana iznosi 60 m2 i u useljivom je stanju.</p>', '<p>We are offering this large and elegant one bedroom apartment. The property is on the 2nd floor of an old town block, built in a quiet area without through traffic, but only a short walk away from the main tourist areas which include the Riva and the Palace. The apartment is 60m sq, and was designed with just one bedroom, which makes it exceptionally spacious and somewhat grand.</p>', '', '<p>Prostrani apartman na 2.katu starogradske zgrade, u mirnom dijelu grada Splita, koji je ujedno popularan zbog pla¾e Baèvice koja je od ove zgrade udaljena svega 250 m.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U uvali Baèvice i drugim jednako prekrasnim koje su meðusobno povezane, nalaze se mnogobrojni kafiæi, restorani i ostali sadr¾aji.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sami centar i Dioklecijanova palaèa su udaljeni cca. 500 m ili 10 minuta hodanja.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U samoj blizini zgrade se nalaze svi potrebni sadr¾aji dok je za u¾ivanje u mnogim znamenitostima i bogatoj gastronomskoj ponudi potrebno iæi do samog centra.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ukupna povr&scaron;ina apartmana iznosi 60 m2 i u useljivom je stanju.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Potrebno je ulaganje ukoliko ¾elite veæi nivo luksuznosti.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sastoji se od hodnika, kuhinje i prostranog dnevnog boravka, 1 spavaæe sobe, 1 kupaonice i zatvorene loggie.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>***Namje&scaron;taj nije ukljuèen u cijenu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartman je idealan za turistièko iznajmljivanje, sa najveæom predno&scaron;æu blizine pla¾e, ali je idealan iz za boravak preko cijele godine.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Najbli¾i parking udaljen je cca. 20 m.</p>\r\n<p>Meðunarodni aerodrom udaljen je 40 minuta vo¾nje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za sva dodatna pitanja molim da nas kontaktirate.</p>', '<p>We are offering this large and elegant one bedroom apartment.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The  property is on the 2nd floor of an old town block, built in a quiet area without  through traffic, but only a short walk away from the main tourist areas which  include the Riva and the Palace.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Also within a few minute&rsquo;s walk are the main  markets, many fine restaurants and the town beach (Bacvice), the ferry terminal,  buses and taxis.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The apartment is 60m sq, and was designed with just one  bedroom, which makes it exceptionally spacious and somewhat grand.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is in  good condition, but probably needs redecorating for it to fulfill its  potential.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It has a good sized balcony which has been &lsquo;enclosed&rsquo;, with access  from the lounge.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There is parking nearby, and the airport is 30 minutes  drive from here.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact the office in Split to arrange to visit  this property.</p>', '', '933_Apartment_0.jpg', '933_Apartment_1.jpg', '933_Apartment_2.jpg', '933_Apartment_3.jpg', '933_Apartment_4.jpg', '933_Apartment_5.jpg', '933_Apartment_6.jpg', '933_Apartment_7.jpg', '933_Apartment_8.jpg'),
(934, 'Zdenka Valcic', 'Srecko Vargek', 'srecko-098228807', 'zdenka -0914680632, igrajna (kcer) -0914680633', 'igrajna@gmail.com', 'Brac', 'Put zlatnog rata 12, Bol, 649/4 KO Bol', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '20', '950', '130', 2, '900000', '', 2, 2, 2, 1, 1, 2, 3, 3, 'November 3, 2014', '<p>Ova jedinstvena nekretnina nalazi se u tipiènom dalmatinskom mjestu na ju¾noj strani otoka Braèa, na jednom od najljep&scaron;ih &scaron;etalista na Jadranskoj obali! Cijelo zemlji&scaron;te prote¾e se na cca 950 m2, a sastoji se od 4 graðevine: 3 su rezidencijalne (1 ima povr&scaron;inu 60 m2, i dvije manje svaka povr&scaron;ine 35m 2). Èetvrta gradevina je ljetna kuhinja i tipièna dalmatinska konoba povr&scaron;ine cca 40 m2.</p>', '<p>The Pearl of the Adriatic! This unique SEAFRONT property is situated on the most beautiful stretch of the Adriatic Coast, on the South side of island of Brac. The whole property is around 950 square meters. It consists of 4 buildings; 3 are residential (1 measures 60 square meters and the other two are smaller stone cottages of 35 square meters each). The fourth building is a summer kitchen and a typical Dalmatian storage room called konoba.</p>', '', '<p>Ova jedinstvena nekretnina nalazi se u tipiènom dalmatinskom mjestu na ju¾noj strani otoka Braèa, na jednom od najljep&scaron;ih &scaron;etalista na Jadranskoj obali!</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Cijelo zemlji&scaron;te prote¾e se na cca 950 m2, a sastoji se od 4 graðevine: 3 su rezidencijalne (1 ima povr&scaron;inu 60 m2, i dvije manje svaka povr&scaron;ine 35m 2).&nbsp;Svaka od njih ima svoju kupaonicu i wc.&nbsp;Èetvrta gradevina je ljetna kuhinja i tipièna dalmatinska konoba povr&scaron;ine cca 40 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Blagovaonica je smje&scaron;tena na otvorenom ali s èvrstim krovom, sa stolom u sredi&scaron;tu koje je izraðen od poznatog braèkog kamena.&nbsp;Cijeli dnevni boravak je takoðer smje&scaron;ten na otvorenom ali natkriven, &scaron;to osigurava ugodan boravak bez obzira na vrijeme.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sve je graðeno i koncipirano na principu cijelodnevnog boravka na otvorenom, kako bi se bovareæi u ovom prostoru u potpunosti osjetio mir upijajuæi dalmatinske mirise bilja koji okru¾uju cijelu kuæu &nbsp;i slu&scaron;ajuæi opu&scaron;tajuæi zvuk mora. Velika terasa se prote¾e na 140 m2, dok je druga prednja terasa povr&scaron;ine 50 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Zadnji graðevinski radovi su uèinjeni 2009.godine.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U stra¾njem dijelu zemlji&scaron;ta ima dovoljno mjesta za izgradnju bazena. Sada&scaron;nji vlasnici nisu imali potrebu za istim s obzirom da je udaljenost od mora samo 10 m od ulaznih vrata posjeda!</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Fotografije koje prila¾emo namjerno nisu snimljene profesionalno, kako bismo vam sto vi&scaron;e pribli¾ili stvarnu atmosferu svakodnevnice boravka na ovom prekrasnom posjedu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nadamo se da smo vam barem malo pribli¾ili ovaj mali raj na zemlji.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za dogovor oko razgledavanja stojimo na usluzi.</p>', '<p>The Pearl of the Adriatic!</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>This unique SEAFRONT property is situated on the most  beautiful stretch of the Adriatic Coast, on the South side of island of  Brac.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The whole property is around 950 square meters.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It consists of 4  buildings; 3 are residential (1 measures 60 square meters and the other two are  smaller stone cottages of 35 square meters each). Each has its own bathroom  and a toilet.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The fourth building is a summer kitchen and a typical  Dalmatian storage room called&nbsp; konoba, its size is approximately 40 square  meters.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The dining room is outdoors but with a solid roof above it. The  dining room table is made of famous stone from the island of Brac.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The  living room is outdoors as well. It is fully covered and can be used for  socializing regardless of the weather.&nbsp;The covered terrace areas measure  about 140 square meters. There is also another wonderful front terrace of 50  square meters.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The last part of the construction took place in  2009.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>This unite was built intentionally this way so that life can take  place outside, in the open where you can enjoy in the fresh air surrounded by  Mediterranean plants of all kinds.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>In the backyard there is sufficient space  to build a swimming pool, although the sea is right in front of the house, not  even 10 meters away from the front gate.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The photos we are enclosing were  not done by professionals on purpose, because we wanted to present the daily  atmosphere at the property.... the way people live in this part of the island  paradise... we hope you can feel it too.</p>', '', '934_House-Villa_0.jpg', '934_House-Villa_1.jpg', '934_House-Villa_2.jpg', '934_House-Villa_3.jpg', '934_House-Villa_4.jpg', '934_House-Villa_5.jpg', '934_House-Villa_6.jpg', '934_House-Villa_7.jpg', '934_House-Villa_8.jpg'),
(935, 'Reinke i Wulf', '', '', '', '', 'Hvar', 'Zavala', 'For sale', 'Old stone house', '600', '520', '110', 1, '549000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 3, 3, 'November 5, 2014', '<p>Luksuzno renovirana i ureðena kamena kuæa na ju¾noj strani otoka Hvara sa odliènim panoramskim pogledom na more!! Ukupna stambena povr&scaron;ina je 110 m2, a sastoji se 3 eta¾e. Povr&scaron;ina parcele je 520 m2. Luksuzno je opremljena i kompletno renovirana do najsitnijeg detalja. Iz svakog kuta kuæe se pru¾a odlièan pogled na more i obli¾nje otoke.</p>', '<p>We are very pleased to offer this fabulous luxury stone house on Hvar island, with excellent panoramic views of the sea. It is situated just a few minutes from the shore on the south side of the island. The property has been completely renovated and great care has been taken to ensure that no detail has been overlooked and the result is that the house is luxuriously equipped and decorated to an excellent standard. The total living area is 110 m2. The plot area is 520 m2.</p>', '', '<p>Luksuzno renovirana i ureðena kamena kuæa na ju¾noj strani otoka Hvara sa odliènim panoramskim pogledom na more!!</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ukupna stambena povr&scaron;ina je 110 m2, a sastoji se od:</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>-<span> </span>prizemlje gdje je gara¾a za dva automobila i vinski podrum</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>-<span> </span> prvi kat je veliki dnevni boravak sa blagavaonicom i terasama sa svih strana kuæe</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>-<span> </span>drugi kat su tri spavaæe sobe, svaka sa svojim kupatilom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Povr&scaron;ina parcele je 520 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je idalna za ¾ivljenje i najam tokom ljetnog prioda, kada u njoj istovremeno mo¾e boraviti 7 ljudi.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Luksuzno je opremljena i kompletno renovirana do najsitnijeg detalja.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Iz svakog kuta kuæe se pru¾a odlièan pogled na more i obli¾nje otoke.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U cijenu je ukljuèena gara¾a.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za sva pitanja, te dogovor oko razgledavanja ove jedinstvene nekretnine javite se u CPS- Hvar ured.</p>', '<p>We are very pleased to offer this fabulous luxury stone house on Hvar island, with excellent panoramic views of the sea.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is situated  just a few minutes from the shore on the south side of the island, where  there are many exclusive coves and beaches, and the nearest village is a  short journey by car.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property has been completely renovated and  great care has been taken to ensure that no detail has been overlooked and  the result is that the house is luxuriously equipped and decorated to an  excellent standard.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The total living area is 110 m2 and it consists of:</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>- Ground where the are two garages and a wine cellar</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>- First floor is a  large living room, dining room and terraces on all sides of the house</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>-  Second floor are three bedrooms, each with its own bathroom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The plot area  is 520 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house is ideal for the family to live or to rent during  the summer season, when it can accommodate 7 people.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The really  breathtaking feature about this house are the views from every window and  balcony. Wherever you stand the backdrop is sea views with the islands.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The surrounding area consists mostly of established native trees and shrubs with olive groves.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact the Croatia Property Sales office  in Hvar to arrange to visit this house.</p>', '', '935_Old-stone-house_0.jpg', '935_Old-stone-house_1.jpg', '935_Old-stone-house_2.jpg', '935_Old-stone-house_3.jpg', '935_Old-stone-house_4.jpg', '935_Old-stone-house_5.jpg', '935_Old-stone-house_6.jpg', '935_Old-stone-house_7.jpg', '935_Old-stone-house_8.jpg'),
(936, 'Martina', 'Moriæ', '', '095 895 99 20', 'info@oggibijoux.com', 'Sibenik', 'SRIMA XV 18d, Èest.zgr.1652,na èest zem. 7344/14 Z.U.7096', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '100', '0', '42', 2, '72000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 1, 1, 'November 5, 2014', '<p>Potpuno namje&scaron;ten i ureðen apartman ju¾ne orijentacije u Srimi s pogledom na more i otok Prviæ. Apartman se nalazi na drugom katu zgrade i spada pod visoko potkrovlje. Povr&scaron;ina apartmana je 42,37 m2. Apartman je udaljen 100 m od novoureðene pla¾e.</p>', '<p>We are offering this fully furnished and decorated apartment facing south, overlooking the sea and Prvic island. The apartment is located on the second floor (top), affording the best and most dramatic views. Apartment size is 42.37 m2 and it consists of a living room, bedroom, dining room, kitchen, bathroom and a balcony. The apartment is located 100 meters from the newly renovated beach.</p>', '', '<p>Potpuno namje&scaron;ten i ureðen apartman ju¾ne orijentacije u Srimi s pogledom na more i otok Prviæ.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartman se nalazi na drugom katu zgrade i spada pod visoko potkrovlje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Povr&scaron;ina apartmana je 42,37 m2, a sastoji se od dnevne sobe, spavaæe sobe, blagovaonice, kuhinje, kupaonice i terase s koje se pru¾a pogled na otok Prviæ.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U podrumu se nalazi pripadajuæa ostava povr&scaron;ine 5,42 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartman je udaljen 100 m od novoureðene pla¾e.</p>\r\n<p>Nalazi se nedaleko od kafiæa, restorana, igrali&scaron;ta i trgovina, a svega je 5 minuta vo¾nje automobilom do Vodica.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartman ima vlastito parking mjesto povr&scaron;ine 11 m2.</p>', '<p>We are offering this fully furnished and decorated apartment facing south, overlooking the sea and Prvic island.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The apartment is located on the second floor (top), affording the best and most dramatic views.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartment size is 42.37 m2 and it consists of a living room, bedroom, dining room, kitchen, bathroom and a balcony.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>In the basement there is a storage area of 5.42 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The apartment is located 100 meters from the newly renovated beach.</p>\r\n<p>It is close to cafes, restaurants, playgrounds and shops, and is only 5 minutes drive to the nearest village.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The apartment has its own parking space.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please call our fabulous office to arrange a viewing.</p>', '', '936_Apartment_0.jpg', '936_Apartment_1.jpg', '936_Apartment_2.jpg', '936_Apartment_3.jpg', '936_Apartment_4.jpg', '936_Apartment_5.jpg', '936_Apartment_6.jpg', '936_Apartment_7.jpg', ''),
(937, 'Zoran Beziæ', 'Tehnoart d.o.o. ', '', '098 318 623', 'zoran.bezic@say.hr', 'Murter', 'Jezera, Murter, k.è 573/2  K.O. Jezera', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '100', '0', '176', 2, '290000', '', 2, 1, 2, 2, 1, 1, 5, 3, 'November 5, 2014', '<p>Ekskluzivan penthouse apartman neto korisne povr&scaron;ine 176,45 m2 s prekrasnim pogledom na marinu. Apartman se nalazi u potkrovlju ekskluzivne apartmanske vile s bazenom. Udaljenost apartmana od glavne pla¾e je 100 m, od marine 50 m a od centra mjesta 200 m.</p>', '<p>Exclusive penthouse apartment with swimming pool. We are pleased to offer this very smart and modern penthouse apartment on the top/3rd floor of this port side property. The net residential space, including terrace and balcony, measures &#8203;176.45 m2. It is situated 100m from the centre of the village and the marina on the island of Murter, connected to the mainland by the charismatic bridge.</p>', '', '<p>Ekskluzivan penthouse apartman neto korisne povr&scaron;ine 176,45 m2 s prekrasnim pogledom na marinu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartman se nalazi u potkrovlju ekskluzivne apartmanske vile s bazenom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Tlocrtna povr&scaron;ina apartmana iznosi 103,5 m2, a sastoji se od dnevnog boravka, pet spavaæih soba, tri kupaonice, predprostora i hodnika.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Iz apartmana se izlazi na natkrivenu terasu povr&scaron;ine 132,5 m2 i nenatkrivenu terasu 26,8 m2. S terase se pru¾a prelijepi pogled na marinu i more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ukupna povr&scaron;ina apartman s terasama iznosi 262,8 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Udaljenost apartmana od glavne pla¾e je 100 m, od marine 50 m a od centra mjesta 200 m.</p>', '<p>Exclusive penthouse apartment with swimming pool.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>We are pleased to offer this very smart and modern penthouse apartment on the top/3rd floor of this port side property.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The net residential space, including terrace and balcony, measures &#8203;176.45 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is situated 100m from the centre of the village and the marina on the island of Murter, connected to the mainland by the charismatic bridge.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The layout of the property is 103.5 m2 and the design includes an open plan lounge kitchen and dining area, 5 bedrooms, 3 bathrooms plus hall and corridor.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Covered terrace is 132.5 m2 and the open-air terrace is 26.8 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property is beautifully decorated and the design ensures plenty of natural light through the large windows that give spectacular views in all directions.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The swimming pool and large pool side patio area is shared with the other residents.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The village with shops, bars etc., the marina and the nearest swimming beach are all just a short walk from the apartment.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>This is a great value property.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact our office for more information and to view this apartment.</p>', '', '937_Apartment_0.jpg', '937_Apartment_1.jpg', '937_Apartment_2.jpg', '937_Apartment_3.jpg', '937_Apartment_4.jpg', '', '', '', ''),
(938, 'EMKO graðenje', 'Emin Had¾iomeroviæ', '', '099 677 82 14', 'eminemko1@gmail.com', 'Rogoznica', 'Rogoznica, K.è. 1/42, K.è. 1/70', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '80', '446', '417', 1, '1050000', '', 2, 1, 2, 2, 1, 1, 5, 4, 'November 5, 2014', '<p>Luksuzne vile na Rogoznièkoj rivijeri. Prodaju se dvije novoizgraðene vile, s prekrasnim pogledom na uvalu s jedne strane i borovu &scaron;umu s druge strane. Udaljenost vila do mora je 80 m, a 100 m do centra mjesta.</p>\r\n<p>VILA A je povr&scaron;ine 417 m2 na parceli od 446 m2. Cijena&nbsp;= 1.050.000 Eura</p>\r\n<p>VILA B je povr&scaron;ine 472 m2 na parceli od 453 m2. Cijena = 1.100.000 Eura</p>', '<p>Croatia Property sales are pleased to offer these 2 newly built and well presented villas near Rogoznica. Both villas are&nbsp;well constructed with top quality materials and featuring many modern features such as integral air-con, solar heating, and surveillance cameras.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>VILLA "A" - 417m sq and is on a plot of 446m sq. Price = 1.200.000 Euro</p>\r\n<p>VILLA "B" - 472m sq and is on a plot of 453m sq. Price = 1.250.000 Euro</p>', '', '<p>Luksuzne vile na Rogoznièkoj rivijeri.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Prodaju se dvije novoizgraðene vile, s prekrasnim pogledom na uvalu s jedne strane i borovu &scaron;umu s druge strane.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Pri gradnji su kori&scaron;teni samo vrhunski materijali.&nbsp;Vile su opremljene solarnim sustavom grijanja, vrhunskim klima ureðajima i nadzornim kamerama u svakoj prostoriji.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;"><strong>VILA A je povr&scaron;ine 417 m2 na parceli od 446 m2. Cijena&nbsp;= 1.050.000 Eura</strong></span></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong><span style="text-decoration: underline;">VILA B je povr&scaron;ine 472 m2 na parceli od 453 m2. Cijena = 1.100.000 Eura</span></strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>VILE se sastoje od:</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>-<span> </span>na prvom katu: prostrani dnevni boravak s kliznom staklenom stjenkom du¾ zapadne strane koja povezuje unutarnji dio s terasom i bazenom koji je povr&scaron;ine 24 m2. Iz bilo kojeg kuta terase pru¾a se prekrasni pogled na uvalu i more. Tu se jo&scaron; nalaze kupatilo, sauna i prostor koji je predviðen kao vinski podrum</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>-<span> </span>na drugom katu su tri spavaæe sobe, kupatilo, Wc, kuhinja i blagovaona sa staklenom kliznom stjenkom kao izlazom na terasu</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>-<span> </span>na treæem katu su dvije velike spavaæe sobe, dva kupatila i terasa</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Prikljuèene su na gradski vodovod, struju i gradsku kanalizaciju.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Oko vila je lijepo ureðena zelena povr&scaron;ina s parking mjestima.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Udaljenost &nbsp;vila do mora je 80 m, a 100 m do centra mjesta.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Svaka vila ima dva parking mjesta u sklopu parcele.</p>', '<p>Croatia Property sales are pleased to offer these 2 newly built and well presented  villas near Rogoznica.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Both villas are&nbsp;well constructed with top quality materials and featuring many modern features  such as integral air-con, solar heating, and surveillance cameras.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong><span style="text-decoration: underline;">VILLA "A" has a surface area of 417m sq and is on a plot of 446m sq.</span></strong></p>\r\n<p><strong><span style="text-decoration: underline;">Price = 1.050.000 Euro</span></strong></p>\r\n<p>- First  floor: spacious living room with sliding glass wall along the western side that  connects the inner part with a terrace and swimming pool, which has an area of  24 m2.&nbsp;From any angle on the terrace there are magnificent views of the  bay and the sea. There is also a bathroom, a sauna, and a wine cellar.</p>\r\n<p>- On  the second floor there are three bedrooms, bathroom, toilet, kitchen and dining  room with glass sliding wall as access to the terrace</p>\r\n<p>- On the third floor  are two large bedrooms, two bathrooms and a terrace. Each room has been designed  to enjoy the best views with large windows giving plenty of natural  light.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong><span style="text-decoration: underline;">VILLA "B" has a surface area of 472m sq and is on a plot of 453m sq.</span></strong></p>\r\n<p><strong><span style="text-decoration: underline;">Price = 1.100.000 Euro</span></strong></p>\r\n<p>- First floor: spacious living room  with sliding glass wall along the western side that connects the inner part with  a terrace and swimming pool, which has an area of 24 m2.&nbsp;From any angle on  the terrace there are magnificent views of the bay and the sea. There is also a  bathroom, a sauna, and a wine cellar.</p>\r\n<p>- On the second floor there are three  bedrooms, bathroom, toilet, kitchen and dining room with glass sliding wall as  access to the terrace</p>\r\n<p>- On the third floor are two large bedrooms, two  bathrooms and a terrace. Each room has been designed to enjoy the best views  with large windows giving plenty of natural light.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Around the villas is beautiful natural woodland.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Each villa has  two parking spaces within the plot.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Distance&nbsp; to the sea is 80 m, and 100  m to the village centre where there are coffee bars, bars and a few shops and  other services.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact our office to arrange to visit this  property.</p>', '', '938_House-Villa_0.jpg', '938_House-Villa_1.jpg', '938_House-Villa_2.jpg', '938_House-Villa_3.jpg', '938_House-Villa_4.jpg', '938_House-Villa_5.jpg', '938_House-Villa_6.jpg', '938_House-Villa_7.jpg', '938_House-Villa_8.jpg'),
(939, 'Vic O''Brien', 'O''Brien-Tilling doo', '', '+447825732553', 'vic.obrien@btinternet.com', 'Brac', 'Povlja, z.u. 971', 'For sale', 'Old stone house', '180', '95', '66', 2, '100000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 3, 2, 'November 7, 2014', '<p>Tradicionalna stara kamena kuæa u nizu, potpuno renovirana i luksuzno namje&scaron;tena. Smje&scaron;tena je prekrasnom mjestu na otoku Braèu koje se nalazi na sjevernoj strani. Od pla¾e i centra mjesta je udaljena cca. 180 m, dok se s terase i veæine prozora pru¾a oèaravajuæi pogled na more i uvalu. Kuæa se sastoji od prizemlja, 1.kata i potkrovlja ukupne povr&scaron;ine 66 m2.</p>\r\n<p><strong><span style="text-decoration: underline;">PRILIKA: CIJENA SNI®ENA S 170.000 Eura!!!</span></strong></p>', '<p>A rare opportunity to buy a restored cottage in one of the most beautiful villages on the island. It faces the mainland, towards the south of the island, and is 5 minutes walk from the harbour and centre of the village. It was built so that there are excellent views across the bay, the harbour and out to sea and across to the mainland from most of the windows and the terrace. It''s a terraced stone house on 3 floors, with a total living area of 66m sq.</p>\r\n<p><strong><span style="text-decoration: underline;">BARGAIN: PRICE REDUCED FROM 170.000 Euro!!!</span></strong></p>', '', '<p>Tradicionalna stara kamena kuæa u nizu, potpuno renovirana i luksuzno namje&scaron;tena.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong><span style="text-decoration: underline;">PRILIKA: CIJENA SNI®ENA S 170.000 Eura!!!</span></strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Smje&scaron;tena je prekrasnom mjestu na otoku Braèu koje se nalazi na sjevernoj strani.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Od pla¾e i centra mjesta je udaljena cca. 180 m, dok se s terase i veæine prozora pru¾a oèaravajuæi pogled na more i uvalu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa se sastoji od prizemlja, 1.kata i potkrovlja ukupne povr&scaron;ine 66 m2. Zemlji&scaron;te na kojem se nalazi je povr&scaron;ine 95 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa ima ukupno 3 sobe, 2 kupaonice i 2 terase te je trenutno u funkciji turistièkog iznajmljivanja za ukupno 9 osoba.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U prizemlju se nalazi kuhinja, kupaonica i veliki dnevni boravak sa odvojenom blagovaonicom sa izlazom na terasu gdje se nalazi ro&scaron;tilj.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Unutarnje stepenice vode na 1.kat gdje se nalaze 2 spavaæe sobe i kupaonica, dok se u potkrovlju nalazi 1 velika spavaæa soba.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na gornjoj eta¾i se nalazi zasebna terasa koja takoðer ima oèaravajuæi pogled na uvalu i more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U kuæi je ukupno 3 klimatizacijska ureðaja.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Centar mjesta gdje se nalazi trgovina, restorani, kafiæi i svi ostali sadr¾aji je udaljen par minuta &scaron;etnje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Otok Braè je povezan svakodnevnom trajektnom linijom sa gradom Splitom, dok je meðunarodni aerodrom udaljen 40 minuta vo¾nje od Splita koji æe vas jednako kao i Braè oèarati ljepotom i mnogim povijesnim znamenitostima.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za sve dodatne informacije stojimo vam na raspolaganju.</p>', '<p>A rare opportunity to buy a restored cottage in one of the most beautiful  villages on the island.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong><span style="text-decoration: underline;">BARGAIN: PRICE REDUCED FROM 170.000 Euro!!!</span></strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It faces the mainland, towards the south of the  island, and is 5 minutes walk from the harbour and centre of the  village.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It was built so that there are excellent views across the bay, the harbour and out to sea and across to the mainland from most of the windows and the terrace.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It''s a terraced stone house on 3 floors,  with a total living area of 66m sq.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property has 3 bedrooms and is  currently being used for letting to tourists, and is described as suitable  for 9 people.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The ground floor has a modern kitchen and a dining area  inside and a patio suited for ''alfresco dining'' with bbq grill. There is  also a separate lounge.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There are internal stairs leading to two large  bedrooms on the first floor and the roof space has been turned into another  good size bedroom.&nbsp;It is comfortable but practical, and is clearly well  decorated and maintained. There are 3 air-con units.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There is  parking nearby the property, which is surrounded by the natural woodland of  the island.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The village has bars, a bakers and other services and shops  which cater both for the local population and tourists.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ferry port is 45  mins drive.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please  contact our office to arrange a tour of this property.</p>', '', '939_Old-stone-house_0.jpg', '939_Old-stone-house_1.jpg', '939_Old-stone-house_2.jpg', '939_Old-stone-house_3.jpg', '939_Old-stone-house_4.jpg', '939_Old-stone-house_5.jpg', '939_Old-stone-house_6.jpg', '939_Old-stone-house_7.jpg', '939_Old-stone-house_8.jpg'),
(940, 'Snje¾ana', 'Fu¾ul', '', '099 862 1632', 'snjezanafuzul@yahoo.com', 'Zadar', 'Malenica 9, Sukosan, 9792  K.O. Sukosan', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '10', '800', '400', 1, '900000', '', 2, 2, 2, 1, 1, 2, 8, 3, 'November 7, 2014', '<p>Obiteljska kuæa u prvom redu do mora, na samoj obali, u malom dalmatinskom mjestu pokraj grada Zadra. Kuæa se nalazi unutar ograðenog velikog dvori&scaron;ta, po&scaron;umljenog borovima, u okviru kojeg postoji moguænost izgradnje bazena. Ukupna povr&scaron;ina parcele je 800 m2! Kuæa je ukupne stambene povr&scaron;ine 400 m2, a sastoji se od prizemlja i kata.</p>', '<p>We are pleased to offer this large family house in the first row of property to the sea, near a small Dalmatian village. The house is located within a fenced large plot, just a few yards from the Adriatic Sea, surrounded by mature pines, and this spacious plot would have enough space for a swimming pool, in the patio area. The total area of &#8203;&#8203;the plot is 800 m2. The house has a total living area of &#8203;&#8203;400 m2 and consists of two floors.</p>', '', '<p>Obiteljska kuæa u prvom redu do mora, na samoj obali, u malom dalmatinskom mjestu pokraj grada Zadra.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa se nalazi unutar ograðenog velikog dvori&scaron;ta, po&scaron;umljenog borovima, u okviru kojeg postoji moguænost izgradnje bazena. Ukupna povr&scaron;ina parcele je 800 m2!</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Susjedne kuæe su na pristojnoj udaljenosti tako da ova nekretnina ima potrebnu privatnost. Sama kuæa je graðena 1968 g, ali je potpuno obnovljena 2000 g.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je ukupne stambene povr&scaron;ine 400 m2, a sastoji se od prizemlja i kata.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Prizemlje: veliki otvoreni dnevni boravak cca 60 m2, blagavaonice sa kuhinjom. 3 spavaæe sobe i kupaonica.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kat: zasebna stambena jedinica - stan koji je do sada bio u funciji turizma, a sastoji se od: velike blagavaonice sa kuhinjom, prostranog dnevnog boravka, 5 spavaæih soba, 2 kupaonice, te balkona sa staklnom stijenkom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa ima velike moguænosti nadogradnje i preureðenja.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ispred kuæe su pla¾e i razni zabavni sadr¾aji, te zaklonjena uvala sa vezovima za manje brodove.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Cijelo podruèje je izuzetno mirno i idilièno, ali sa uhodanim i nenametljivim turizmom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Lokacija je 11 km jugoistoèno od grada Zadra, odnosno 10 min vo¾nje.</p>\r\n<p>Blizina svih potrebnih sadr¾aja, ukljuèujuèi dr''s, te zraènu luku Zadar koja je udaljena 30 min vo¾nje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Razgledavanje na upit.</p>', '<p>We are pleased to offer this large family house in the first row of property to  the sea, near a small Dalmatian village.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The nearest major town is Zadar,  which is 10 minutes drive away, but the centre of the local village is 10  minutes walk. It is typical of the coastal villages, very attractive and  charming with several options for caf&eacute;s, bars and shops, as well as other useful  services such as pharmacy etc.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house is located within a fenced large  plot, just a few yards from the Adriatic Sea, surrounded by mature pines, and  this spacious plot would have enough space for a swimming pool, in the patio  area. The total area of &#8203;&#8203;the plot is 800 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house was first built in  1968 but was completely renovated in 2000.&nbsp;It has a total living area of  &#8203;&#8203;400 m2 and consists of two floors.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ground floor: large open living area  approx 60 m2, dining room and kitchen, 3 bedrooms and a bathroom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Floor:  private residential unit-a separate apartment- that has until now been used in  service of tourism, and consists of a large dining room with a kitchen, living  room, five bedrooms, two bathrooms and a balcony with glass front.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The  house is due for redecorating again and perhaps other work might be considered  to allow this building to reach its full potential.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>In front of the house is  the beach suitable for swimming and boating, as it is in a sheltered and safe  bay. There are some berths for smaller boats.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Neighbouring houses are at  a respectful distance so that this property enjoys the maximum privacy.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The whole area is very peaceful and idyllic, but with some unobtrusive  tourism.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The nearest airport is Zadar, which is just 30 minutes  drive.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact our office for more information, and if you would  like to visit this property.</p>', '', '940_House-Villa_0.jpg', '940_House-Villa_1.jpg', '940_House-Villa_2.jpg', '940_House-Villa_3.jpg', '940_House-Villa_4.jpg', '940_House-Villa_5.jpg', '940_House-Villa_6.jpg', '940_House-Villa_7.jpg', '940_House-Villa_8.jpg'),
(941, 'Boris', 'Tomiæ', '', '', '', 'Brac', 'Supetar', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '150', '0', '47', 2, '105000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 2, 1, 'November 7, 2014', '<p>Dvosoban apartman u Supetru, na dobroj lokaciji i sa lijepim pogledom na more. Smje&scaron;ten je na najgornjoj eta¾i manje apartmanske zgrade, jugozapadne orijentacije. Apartman je nov, potpuno opremljen novim izuzetno kvalitetnim dizajnerskim namje&scaron;tajem. Apartman je ukupne stambene povr&scaron;ine 47 m2. Od mora i pla¾a i centra mjesta je udaljen 150 metara.</p>', '<p>We are offering this smart, modern two bedroom apartment in Supetar. It is situated on the top floor of a small apartment building, facing south-west, near the centre of the village. The suite is fully furnished with new, high-quality furniture all unused and ready for occupancy. The apartment has a total living area of 47 m2. From the sea, beach and the town centre is 150 meters away.</p>', '', '<p>Dvosoban apartman u Supetru, na dobroj lokaciji i sa lijepim pogledom na more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Smje&scaron;ten je na najgornjoj eta¾i manje apartmanske zgrade,  jugozapadne orijentacije.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartman je nov, potpuno opremljen novim  izuzetno kvalitetnim dizajnerskim namje&scaron;tajem.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nekori&scaron;ten je i spreman za  useljenje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartman je ukupne stambene povr&scaron;ine 47 m2, a sastoji se  od: ulaznog hodnika, kupatila, dvije spavaæe sobe, dnevnog boravka s kuhinjom i blagovaonom, te prostranog balkona.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Stanu pripada i mala  sprema u prizemlju zgrade i vlastito parking mjesto.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Od mora i pla¾a i  centra mjesta je udaljen 150 metara.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za dogovor oko razgledavanja javite  se u CPS ured - Split.</p>', '<p>We are offering this smart, modern two bedroom apartment in Supetar.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It  is situated on the top floor of a small apartment building, facing south-west, near the centre of the village.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The suite is fully  furnished with new, high-quality furniture all unused and ready for  occupancy.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The apartment has a total living area of 47 m2 and consists  of:&nbsp;entrance hall, bathroom, two bedrooms, a living room with kitchen and dining area, leading outside onto a spacious balcony with great views over the village and to the sea.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The apartment also has a small  storage space on the ground floor and ample parking.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>From the sea, beach  and the town centre is 150 meters away.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For  visiting contact our CPS office - Split.</p>', '', '941_Apartment_0.jpg', '941_Apartment_1.jpg', '941_Apartment_2.jpg', '941_Apartment_3.jpg', '941_Apartment_4.jpg', '941_Apartment_5.jpg', '', '', '');
INSERT INTO `nekretnina` (`id`, `ime`, `prezime`, `telefon`, `mobitel`, `e_mail`, `lokacija_id`, `adresa`, `status_id`, `vrsta_id`, `udaljenost`, `povrsina`, `stambenapovrsina`, `display`, `cijena`, `cijenatocka`, `ponuda_tjedna`, `new_built`, `must_sell`, `prvi_red_do_mora`, `pogled_na_more`, `bazen`, `broj_soba`, `broj_kupatila`, `datum`, `title_hr`, `title_en`, `title_ge`, `opis_hr`, `opis_en`, `opis_ge`, `PropertyImageURL0`, `PropertyImageURL1`, `PropertyImageURL2`, `PropertyImageURL3`, `PropertyImageURL4`, `PropertyImageURL5`, `PropertyImageURL6`, `PropertyImageURL7`, `PropertyImageURL8`) VALUES
(942, 'Ana', 'Miliæ', '', '091/600-9477', 'marija.uzun1976@gmail.com', 'Brac', 'Antonija Jutroniæa 1, Sutivan, 2071 E-15', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '50', '0', '46', 2, '82000', '', 2, 1, 2, 2, 1, 2, 1, 1, 'November 7, 2014', '<p>Apartman u malom dalmatinskom mjestu na sjevernoj strani otoka Braèa, u drugom redu sa pogledom na more! Apartman je jednosoban, ukupne stambene povr&scaron;ine 40 m2 + balkon 6 m2. Smje&scaron;ten je na zadnjem katu/u potkrovlju manje zgrade/novogradnja. Kompletno je opremljen i namje&scaron;ten. Jugozapadne orijentacije. Nalazi se na mirnoj lokaciji, svega 50 metara udaljen od mora.</p>', '<p>We are pleased to have this modestly priced but tidy and well presented apartment on the north side of the island of Brac. Its exact location is on the top floor of a newly built modern apartment block, 50m from the shore in the second row of houses and with a great view of the sea and across to the mainland. The apartment is living area of 40 m2 + balcony of 6 m2. It''s south east orientation.</p>', '', '<p>Apartman u malom dalmatinskom mjestu na sjevernoj strani otoka Braèa, u drugom  redu sa pogledom na more!</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartman je jednosoban, ukupne stambene  povr&scaron;ine 40 m2 + balkon 6 m2. Smje&scaron;ten je na zadnjem katu/u potkrovlju manje  zgrade/novogradnja.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kompletno je opremljen i namje&scaron;ten.</p>\r\n<p>Jugozapadne  orijentacije.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nalazi se na mirnoj lokaciji, svega 50 metara udaljen od  mora.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartmanu pripada jedno parking mjesto ispred zgrade koje je ukljuèeno  u cijenu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Od centra mjesta udaljen je 200 metara.</p>\r\n<p>Trajektna luka  je udaljena 10 min vo¾nje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za dogovor oko razledavanja stojimo vam na  usluzi.</p>', '<p>We are pleased to have this modestly priced but tidy and well presented  apartment on the north side of the island of Brac.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Its exact location is  on the top floor of a newly built modern apartment block, 50m from the shore in  the second row of houses and with a great view of the sea and across to the  mainland.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The apartment is living area of 40 m2 + balcony of 6 m2. It''s  south east orientation.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It has one bedroom, a modern style open plan kitchen  and lounge area leading to windows that access the sea facing  balcony.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property is being sold fully equipped and furnished, ready  for habitation or to be let for tourists.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The apartment has one parking space  in front of the building which is included in the price.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is situated  in a quiet location, 200 meters away from the village centre where there are  shops, caf&eacute;s and coffee bars.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The  Ferry port, with regular access to Split, is a 10 minute drive.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>We are  happy to arrange a tour of the property and answer any other questions.</p>', '', '942_Apartment_0.jpg', '942_Apartment_1.jpg', '942_Apartment_2.jpg', '942_Apartment_3.jpg', '942_Apartment_4.jpg', '942_Apartment_5.jpg', '942_Apartment_6.jpg', '', ''),
(943, 'Ani', 'Dodig', '', '099/ 312 2101', 'vice.dodig@gmail.com', 'Korcula', 'V.Luka, Ulica 63 br. 33/1', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '450', '1200', '240', 1, '500000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 6, 4, 'November 7, 2014', '<p>Luksuzna moderna Vila na otoku Korèuli, ukupne BRP povr&scaron;ine 240 m2, udaljena od mora svega 400 m, nalazi se na atraktivnoj i mirnoj lokaciji na terenu povr&scaron;ine 1200 m2. Ispred kuæe se nalazi bazen dimenzija 10x4 m i terasa sa prekrasnim pogledom na bazen i imanje. Interijer vile izveden je na moderan naèin, minimalistièki èistim formama i dizajnom u toplim tonovima i visokokvalitetnim materijalima.</p>', '<p>We are pleased to offer this luxury, modern villa on Korcula island, in an attractive and quiet location. The villa is 400 m from the sea, on the north shore of the island, in a location surrounded by natural woodland and native plants. The plot is large, measuring 1200m sq, and this surrounds the villa with landscaped gardens, which includes a swimming pool and large patio area and two covered parking places. The inside of the villa covers 240 m2.</p>', '', '<p>Luksuzna moderna Vila na otoku Korèuli, ukupne BRP povr&scaron;ine 240 m2, udaljena od mora svega 400 m, nalazi se na atraktivnoj i mirnoj lokaciji na terenu povr&scaron;ine 1200 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ispred kuæe se nalazi bazen dimenzija 10x4 m i terasa sa prekrasnim pogledom na bazen i imanje. Uz bazen se nalaze dvije prateæe kuæice povr&scaron;ine 50 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Interijer vile izveden je na moderan naèin, minimalistièki èistim formama i dizajnom u toplim tonovima i visokokvalitetnim materijalima.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Okoli&scaron; je ureðen u mediteranskom stilu, prekriven zelenom travom iz uzgoja i autohtonim raslinjem.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Donja eta¾a kuæe se sastoji od zatvorene loðe,kuhinje sa trpezarijom i dnevnim boravkom, 3 spavaæe sobe i 2 kupatila.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Gornja eta¾a ima isti raspored, visoki roh-bau, potrebno je samo postaviti sanitarije, vrata i podloge na podove.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na parceli se nalaze 2 natkrivena parking mjesta.</p>', '<p>We are pleased to offer this luxury, modern villa on Korcula island, in an  attractive and quiet location.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The villa is 400 m from the sea, on the  north shore of the island, in a location surrounded by natural woodland and  native plants.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The plot is large, measuring 1200m sq, and this surrounds the  villa with landscaped gardens, which includes a swimming pool and large patio  area and two covered parking places.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The inside of the villa covers 240  m2.&nbsp;It is designed in a modern way, in a minimalist style with warm colours  and high quality materials.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The lower floor of the house consists of the  enclosed terrace, kitchen and living room, three bedrooms and two  bathrooms.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The upper floor has a similar layout, but is not yet habitable.  Some of the fittings in the bathroom and decorating has yet to be  completed.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The villa enjoys a swimming pool measuring 10x4 m which sits  on a spacious and private lounge area in the villa''s own grounds.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Next to the  pool are two accompanying cottages, in total of 50 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>In the grounds  there are two covered parking spaces.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For  viewing please call Croatia Property Sales - Split office.</p>', '', '943_House-Villa_0.jpg', '943_House-Villa_1.jpg', '943_House-Villa_2.jpg', '943_House-Villa_3.jpg', '943_House-Villa_4.jpg', '943_House-Villa_5.jpg', '943_House-Villa_6.jpg', '943_House-Villa_7.jpg', '943_House-Villa_8.jpg'),
(944, 'Lesley Anne', 'Evans', '+441440703152', '', 'lesleyanne.evans@aol.com', 'Brac', 'Milna', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '220', '750', '115', 1, '220000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 3, 2, 'November 7, 2014', '<p>Prekrasna samostojeæa kuæa na zapadnom dijelu otoka Braèa, sa pogledom na more i prostranom ureðenom okuænicom. Kuæa je potpuno ureðena i namje&scaron;tena, stoga nisu potrebna nikakva dodatna ulaganja. More i pla¾a su udaljeni cca. 220 m. Kuæa se sastoji od prizemlja i 1.kata ukupne povr&scaron;ine 115 m2.&nbsp;Ukupna povr&scaron;ina zemlji&scaron;ta ne kojem se smjestila kuæa iznosi 750 m2.</p>', '<p>Croatia Property Sales is proud to offer this beautiful house, overlooking the sea, in the most sought after part of the island. The sea and beaches are approx 220 m distant. The total land area is 750 m2 and it has been planted with nicely cultivated Mediterranean garden plants and shrubs. The house has total living area of 115 m2, and consists of ground floor and 1st floor.</p>', '', '<p>Prekrasna samostojeæa kuæa na zapadnom dijelu otoka Braèa, sa pogledom na more i prostranom ureðenom okuænicom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Otok Braè je jedan od najpopularnijih otoka srednje Dalmacije, zbog prirodnih ljepota ali i blizine Splita tj. svakodnevnom trajektnom povezano&scaron;æu sa gradom Splitom. 40 minuta vo¾nje od Splita se nalazi meðunarodni aerodrom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je potpuno ureðena i namje&scaron;tena, stoga nisu potrebna nikakva dodatna ulaganja. Moguæe je odmah useliti i u¾ivati, ali i iznajmljivati tijekom turistièke sezone.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>More i pla¾a su udaljeni cca. 220 m, gdje se takoðer nalazi i centar mjesta sa svim sadr¾ajima.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ukupna povr&scaron;ina zemlji&scaron;ta ne kojem se smjestila kuæa iznosi 750 m2, te ima dovoljno mjesta za izgradnju bazena.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa se sastoji od prizemlja i 1.kata ukupne povr&scaron;ine 115 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U prizemlju se nalazi dnevni boravak, kuhinja, blagovaonica, kupaonica i 1 spavaæa soba.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na 1.katu se nalazi kuhinja + blagovaonica, 1 spavaæa soba, kupaonica i prostrana terasa od 20 m2 sa koje se pru¾a prekrasan pogled na more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ispred kuæe se nalazi parking za nekoliko automobila.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za sva dodatna pitanja molimo da nas kontaktirate.</p>', '<p>Croatia Property Sales is proud to offer this beautiful house, overlooking the  sea, in the most sought after part of the island.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The sea and beaches  are approx 220 m distant, and the centre of the village, with bars, cafes and  shops is a similar distance.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The total land area is 750 m2 and it has  been planted with nicely cultivated Mediterranean garden plants and shrubs, but  there is still&nbsp; plenty of space for building a swimming pool and patio.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The  house has total living area of 115 m2, and consists of ground floor and 1st  floor.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the ground floor there is a living room, kitchen, dining room,  bathroom and one bedroom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the 1st floor there is a kitchen + dining room,  one bedroom, bathroom and windows lead out onto a large terrace of 20 m2 with a  beautiful views of the sea.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house is fully furnished and ready for  immediate habitation, so it does not require any additional investment.&nbsp;The  property can be used for tourism, or as a private home, or of course both  options.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>In front of the house there is parking for several  cars.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The island of Brac is one of the most popular islands of Central  Dalmatia, due to its natural beauty but also the proximity of Split.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There  are regular daily ferry connections with the city of Split throughout the  year.</p>\r\n<p>40 minutes drive from Split international airport.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>We advise an  urgent viewing, as this property is excellent value. Please call the office on  Brac to arrange a visit.</p>', '', '944_House-Villa_0.jpg', '944_House-Villa_1.jpg', '944_House-Villa_2.jpg', '944_House-Villa_3.jpg', '944_House-Villa_4.jpg', '944_House-Villa_5.jpg', '944_House-Villa_6.jpg', '', ''),
(945, 'Zoran', 'Filipoviæ', '', '098/ 232 644', 'zifsesvete@yahoo.com', 'Brac', 'Splitska, Punta Donja, 199/212 k.o. Splitska', 'For sale', 'Land plot', '25', '470', '0', 1, '125000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 0, 0, 'November 7, 2014', '<p>Graðevinsko zemlji&scaron;te na izuzetnoj lokaciji u popularnom mjestu Splitska koje je smje&scaron;teno na sjevernoj strani otoka Braèa. Zemlji&scaron;te je smje&scaron;teno u 2. redu od mora udaljeno svega 25 m od prekrasne pla¾e. Izgradivost zemlji&scaron;ta je 30%, te se na zemlji&scaron;tu mo¾e smjetiti kuæa od ukupno 3 eta¾e (prizemlje, 1.kat i potkrovlje).</p>', '<p>We are pleased to have this large building plot by the sea shore in a small village on the north side of the island of Brac. The area of land is 475 m2 and is in an excellent location, 25m from the water and with great views. The plot is located in the second row from the sea, and therefore represents an exceptional opportunity for anyone wanting to construct their own house throughout. This is easily the best way to acquire your perfect villa!</p>', '', '<p>Graðevinsko zemlji&scaron;te na izuzetnoj lokaciji u popularnom mjestu Splitska koje je smje&scaron;teno na sjevernoj strani otoka Braèa.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Otok Braè je osim iznimne ljepote popularan zbog blizine grada Splita tj. svakodnevnim trajektnim linijama.</p>\r\n<p>Meðunarodni aerodrom je udaljen 40 minuta vo¾nje od Splita.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Zemlji&scaron;te je smje&scaron;teno u 2. redu od mora udaljeno svega 25 m od prekrasne pla¾e.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Stoga je ova nekretnina izuzetna prilika ¾elite li lokaciju za izgradnju kuæe uz samo more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Zemlji&scaron;te je dovoljno veliko i za izgradnju bazena.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Pristupni put je odmah do zemlji&scaron;ta dok je sva infrastruktura takoðer odmah do.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Izgradivost zemlji&scaron;ta je 30%, te se na zemlji&scaron;tu mo¾e smjetiti kuæa od ukupno 3 eta¾e (prizemlje, 1.kat i potkrovlje).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Prekrasni centar mjesta sa starim kamenim kuæama i mnogim znamenitostima udaljen je svega par minuta vo¾nje. U centru se takoðer nalaze svi potrebni sadr¾aji.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za sva dodatna pitanja vam stojimo na raspolaganju.</p>', '<p>We are pleased to have this large building plot by the sea shore in a small  village on the north side of the island of Brac.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The area of land is 475  m2 and is in an excellent location, 25m from the water and with great views.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The plot is located in the second row from the sea, and therefore  represents an exceptional opportunity for anyone wanting to construct their own  house throughout.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>This is easily the best way to acquire your perfect  villa!</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Buildable area is 30% of the total size of the plot. The zoning  plan for this area allows to build house on 3 floors (ground floor, 1st floor  and attic).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There is enough land&nbsp; for a good size swimming pool.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The  access road is right next to the land, while all the infrastructure (water  electric etc) is also next to the land.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The local village has shops,  cafes, bars and other services and can be reached by a short walk.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Brac island is popular due to the proximity of the city of Split, ie, daily ferry  lines, the clear and safe beaches for swimming, and the beauty and original  Dalmatian character of the villages.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The international airport is 40  minutes drive from Split.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For  viewing the property please call our Split office.</p>', '', '945_Land-plot_0.jpg', '945_Land-plot_1.jpg', '945_Land-plot_2.jpg', '945_Land-plot_3.jpg', '945_Land-plot_4.jpg', '945_Land-plot_5.jpg', '', '', ''),
(946, 'Ratko', 'Klisoviæ', '', '091/ 377 1470', '', 'Split', 'Duplanèiæa dvori 16, Kat./arkod 13018, 13019 z.u. 1468', 'For sale', 'Old stone house', '500', '341', '350', 1, '1260000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 5, 4, 'November 7, 2014', '<p>Ekskluzivna nekretnine u samom centru starog dijela grada Splita, udaljena od popularne pla¾e Baèvice 10 minuta hodanja. Samostojeæa stara kamena kuæa potpuno novoizgraðena i lukuzno opremljena. Zemlji&scaron;te je potpuno ograðeno &scaron;to garantira privatnost i mir. Kuæa se sastoji od podruma, prizemlja, 1. i 2. kata (potkrovlje) ukupne brutto povr&scaron;ine 350 m2.</p>', '<p>We are pleased to offer this large detached house with parking in the heart of Split old town. It is just 10 minutes walk from the town&rsquo;s beach at Bacvice, and also 10 minutes from almost any of the historic, cultural and transport centres of the town, such as the Riva, Palace, ferry terminal, bus station etc. The house consists of a basement, ground floor, first and second floor (attic), with a total area of 350 m2.</p>', '', '<p>Ekskluzivna nekretnine u samom centru starog dijela grada Splita, udaljena od popularne pla¾e Baèvice 10 minuta hodanja.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Samostojeæa stara kamena kuæa potpuno novoizgraðena i lukuzno opremljena, smje&scaron;tena na zemlji&scaron;tu ukupne povr&scaron;ine 31 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ispred se nalazi ureðeni vrt i parking za 3 automobila, &scaron;to je rijetkost u starom dijelu grada.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Zemlji&scaron;te je potpuno ograðeno &scaron;to garantira privatnost i mir.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa se sastoji od podruma, prizemlja, 1. i 2. kata (potkrovlje) ukupne brutto povr&scaron;ine 350 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U podrumu je smje&scaron;tena kotlovnica, sauna, kupaonica i 1 velika soba.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U prizemlju se nalazi dnevni boravak + kuhinja + blagovaonica, kupaonica i predulaz.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na 1.katu je 1 velika prostorija koja mo¾e biti spavaæa, 2 spavaæe, kupaonice i garderoba.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na najzadnjem katu se nalazi 1 velika spavaæa sa garderobom i kupaonicom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ovo je izuzetna prilika ¾elite li luksuznu oazu u samom centru jednog od najpopularnijih gradova u Dalmaciji u koju nije potrebno nikakvo dodatno ulaganje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Mnogobrojni restorani, trgovine, ljekarne i ostali moderni i tradicionalni sadr¾aji se nalaze u blizini.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Meðunarodni aerodrom udaljen je 40 minuta vo¾nje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za sva dodatna pitanja vam stojimo na raspolaganju.</p>', '<p>We are pleased to offer this large detached house with parking in the heart of  Split old town.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is just 10 minutes walk from the town&rsquo;s beach at  Bacvice, and also 10 minutes from almost any of the historic, cultural and  transport centres of the town, such as the Riva, Palace, ferry terminal, bus  station etc.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property is a detached stone house, newly built and  luxuriously equipped, placed on a land plot of 341 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>In front of the  house is a landscaped garden and parking for three cars, which is a rarity in  the old town.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property is completely fenced it and offers complete  peace and privacy.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house consists of a basement, ground floor, first  and second floor (attic), with a total area of 350 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Basement:  heating/boiler room, sauna, bathroom and one large room.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The ground floor:  living room, kitchen, dining room, bathroom and pre-entrance (porch).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>1st  floor: one large room that can be used as a bedroom, two bedrooms, bathroom and  cloakroom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Last floor: one large bedroom with dressing room and  bathroom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>This is a great opportunity if you are seeking a luxurious  oasis in the heart of one of the most historical cities in Dalmatia, and which  does not require any additional investment.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Many of the best restaurants,  bars, shops, markets and other modern and traditional facilities are located  nearby.</p>\r\n<p>The international airport is 40 minutes drive.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For visiting  this exceptional and rare property call our Split office.</p>', '', '946_Old-stone-house_0.jpg', '946_Old-stone-house_1.jpg', '946_Old-stone-house_2.jpg', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(947, 'Helena', 'FirstPropertyCroatia', '', ' 091/ 883 5903', '', 'Split', 'Svaèiæeva 5, Kat./arkod- 5693   zgr 3011', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '500', '0', '90', 2, '170000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 3, 1, 'November 7, 2014', '<p>Apartman u starogradskoj zgradi na jedinstvenoj lokaciji u samom centru povijesnom grada Splita. Smje&scaron;ten je na 3.katu S-Z-J orjentacije, na mirnoj strani zgrade, koja nije direktno okrenuta prema ulici. Ukupna povr&scaron;ina iznosi 90 m2, a sastoji se od velikog hodnika, kuhinje, kupaonice i dnevnog boravka sa balkonom na sjevernoj strani, 2 velike prostorije na juznoj strani i 1 male sobe na zapadnoj.</p>', '<p>We are pleased to offer this exciting renovation project in a unique location in the center of the historic city of Split. It is located on the 3rd floor (S/W-E orientation), on the quiet side of the building, which is facing away from the main street. The total area is 90 m2 and it consists of a large hall, kitchen, bathroom and living room with balcony on the north side, two large rooms on the south side and one small room on the west.</p>', '', '<p>Apartman u starogradskoj zgradi na jedinstvenoj lokaciji u samom centru povijesnom grada Splita.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Prekrasna riva i Dioklecijanova palaèa su udaljeni svega par minuta &scaron;etnje, dok se u blizini nalaze mnogobrojne trgovine, restorani, barovi i svi ostali potrebni sadr¾aji.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Smje&scaron;ten je na 3.katu S-Z-J orjentacije, na mirnoj strani zgrade, koja nije direktno okrenuta prema ulici.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ukupna povr&scaron;ina iznosi 90 m2, a sastoji se od velikog hodnika, kuhinje, kupaonice i dnevnog boravka sa balkonom na sjevernoj strani, 2 velike prostorije na juznoj strani i 1 male sobe na zapadnoj.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Potrebno je kompletno renoviranje ali se zbog odliènog rasporeda i visokih stropova 3.20 m mo¾e pretvoriti u pravi luksuzni apartman za u¾ivanje ili iznajmljivanje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Jedan vanjski dio zgrade je obnovljen dok je i ostatak u jako dobrom stanju zbog kvalitetne gradnje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartman u potkrovlju koji je smje&scaron;ten povi&scaron;e ovog je kompletno renoviran stoga ne morate brinuti o lo&scaron;im instalacijama i vlazi.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>20 m od zgrade se nalazi veliki gradski parking gdje je moguæe dobiti povoljnu godi&scaron;nju pretplatu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Meðunarodni aerodrom udaljen je 40 minuta vo¾nje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za sva dodatna pitanja molimo da nas kontaktirate.</p>', '<p>We are pleased to offer this exciting renovation project in a unique location in  the center of the historic city of Split.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The Riva and Diocletian''s  Palace are only a few minute&rsquo;s walk, while conveniently close are many of the  best restaurants, bars, markets and other facilities.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is located on  the 3rd floor (S/W-E orientation), on the quiet side of the building, which is  facing away from the main street.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The total area is 90 m2 and it consists  of a large hall, kitchen, bathroom and living room with balcony on the north  side, two large rooms on the south side and one small room on the west.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Needs  complete renovation but due to the great layout and high ceilings 3.20 m it can  be transformed into a true luxury apartment to live in or rent on tourist  market.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>One side of the exterior of the building has been renovated while  the rest is in very good condition due to the high quality of the old fashioned  construction.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Many of the other apartments in the block have already been  renovated, including the flat above (which is the top), and the block and the  location are recovering their former glories!</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>20 m from the building is a  large parking area where it is possible to get a favorable annual  subscription.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The international airport is 40 minutes  drive.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact the office for more information, and to arrange to  visit this property.</p>', '', '947_Apartment_0.jpg', '947_Apartment_1.jpg', '947_Apartment_2.jpg', '947_Apartment_3.jpg', '947_Apartment_4.jpg', '947_Apartment_5.jpg', '947_Apartment_6.jpg', '947_Apartment_7.jpg', ''),
(948, 'Josip', 'Poljak', '®ena 098 9360 664', 'sin 098 537 440', 'v_poljak@yahoo.com', 'Rogoznica', 'Sevid, k.è. 20164/12  Vini¹æe', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '60', '450', '390', 1, '350000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 6, 6, 'November 7, 2014', '<p>Nedovr&scaron;ena kuæa s pogledom na more na iznimnoj lokaciji koja osigurava privatnost, a od mora je udaljena 60 m. Povr&scaron;ina kuæe je 390 m2. Kuæa je podijeljena na tri eta¾e: prizemlje, prvi kat i drugi kat. Na svakom katu se nalaze po dva apartmana koja se sastoje od: spavaæe sobe, dnevnog boravka, kuhinje i kupatila. Iz dnevnog boravka je izlaz na terasu s koje se pru¾a pogled na more.</p>', '<p>We are offering this large, unfinished project, consisting of an apartment block with 6 flats overlooking the sea. The bulk of &lsquo;heavy&rsquo; work is completed, but there is much to do. This fact is, of course, reflected in the price. It is situated 60m from the shore and the nearest village is Rogoznica. The house is divided into three floors: ground floor, first floor and second floor. The total floor space is 390m sq.</p>', '', '<p>Nedovr&scaron;ena kuæa s pogledom na more na iznimnoj lokaciji koja osigurava privatnost, a od mora je udaljena 60 m.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Povr&scaron;ina kuæe je 390 m2.</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je podijeljena na tri eta¾e: prizemlje, prvi kat i drugi kat.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na svakom katu se nalaze po dva apartmana koja se sastoje od: spavaæe sobe, dnevnog boravka, kuhinje i kupatila. Iz dnevnog boravka je izlaz na terasu s koje se pru¾a pogled na more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa se nalazi na parceli povr&scaron;ine 450 m2 tako da je moguæe na njoj urediti lijepi vrt kao i napraviti parking mjesta za aute.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Udaljenost od trgovina i restorana je 150 m, a od aerodroma 25 km.</p>', '<p>We are offering this large, unfinished project, consisting of an apartment block  with 6 flats overlooking the sea.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The bulk of &lsquo;heavy&rsquo; work is completed,  but there is much to do. This fact is, of course, reflected in the  price.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is situated 60m from the shore and the nearest village is  Rogoznica.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house is divided into three floors: ground floor, first  floor and second floor.</p>\r\n<p>The total floor space is 390m sq.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On each floor there  are two apartments, each consists of a bedroom, living room, kitchen and  bathroom and from the living room there is access to a balcony that overlooks  the sea.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house is situated on a plot of 450 m2, making it possible to  make a beautiful garden as well as having plenty of space for parking  cars.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Distance from the village with shops, bars&nbsp; and restaurants is 150  meters and the airport is 25 km.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is a quiet and appealing location,  with easy and convenient access to the village, the airport and being on the  mainland adds to the appeal for many people.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact our office to  get more details, especially about the estimated cost of outstanding works.</p>', '', '948_House-Villa_0.jpg', '948_House-Villa_1.jpg', '948_House-Villa_2.jpg', '948_House-Villa_3.jpg', '948_House-Villa_4.jpg', '', '', '', ''),
(949, 'Ivo', 'Aniæ', '', '091 1234 102', 'ivo.odvodnja@gmail.com', 'Rogoznica', 'Stiva¹nica, k.è. 10185/2', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '80', '303', '200', 2, '500000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 7, 6, 'November 7, 2014', '<p>Prekrasna u potpunosti renovirana vila s pogledom na more, udaljena je od pla¾e 80 m. Vila je kvalitetno izgraðena i lijepo ureðena. Povr&scaron;ina vile je 200m2. Podijeljena je na tri kata. U prizemlju se nalaze dva apartmana, na prvom katu je dvosoban apartman, a na drugom katu je trosoban apartman. Svaki apartman ima izlaz na terasu s koje se pru¾a pogled na more.</p>', '<p>We are pleased to have this detached villa, divided into 4 apartments, and renovated in a modern style and to a high standard, just 2 minutes walk from the beach. It is situated 80m from the shore, on the mainland 20k from Trogir town. The property has been completely upgraded and decorated beautifully. The living area is 200m sq and it is designed on three floors.</p>', '', '<p>Prekrasna u potpunosti renovirana vila s pogledom na more, udaljena je od pla¾e 80 m.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Vila je kvalitetno izgraðena i lijepo ureðena.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Povr&scaron;ina vile je 200m2. Podijeljena je na tri kata.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U prizemlju se nalaze dva apartmana, na prvom katu je dvosoban apartman, a na drugom katu je trosoban apartman. Svaki apartman ima izlaz na terasu s koje se pru¾a pogled na more. U potkrovlju kuæe je teretana s jacuzzijem.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa ima ukupno 7 spavaæih soba i 6 kupaonica.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Povr&scaron;ina parcele je 303 m2, oko kuæe je vrt, a sa stra¾nje strane kuæe je parking za tri auta.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Vila se nalazi u lijepoj uvali nedaleko od mjesta s restoranima i trgovinama, a udaljenost od aerodroma je 25 km.</p>', '<p>We are pleased to have this detached villa, divided into 4 apartments, and  renovated in a modern style and to a high standard, just 2 minutes walk from the  beach.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is situated 80m from the  shore, on the mainland 20k from Trogir town.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><br />The property has been  completely upgraded and decorated beautifully. The living area is 200m sq and it  is designed on three floors.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The ground floor has two apartments.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the  first floor is one two bedroom apartment.</p>\r\n<p>On the second floor is a three  bedroom apartment.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house has a total of seven bedrooms and six  bathrooms.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Each apartment has a terrace or balcony that overlooks the sea  and across the village.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>In the attic of the house is communal gym and a  jacuzzi.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The plot area is 303 m2 around the house is a garden, and at the  rear of the house is parking for three cars.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The villa is located in a  beautiful bay near the village with restaurants and shops, and the distance to  the airport is 25 km.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact our office for more  information.</p>', '', '949_House-Villa_0.jpg', '949_House-Villa_1.jpg', '949_House-Villa_2.jpg', '949_House-Villa_3.jpg', '949_House-Villa_4.jpg', '949_House-Villa_5.jpg', '', '', ''),
(950, 'dr. Csapo', 'Balazs', '', '+36 30 440 5004', 'csapobalazs@yahoo.com', 'Peljesac', 'Orebic, Brace Radic 4. Cest.zem 638 zgrada  i 1048/2  KO Orebic', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '150', '520', '310', 1, '460000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 12, 9, 'November 14, 2014', '<p>Samostojeæa kuæa 2. red do mora sa prekrasnim pogledom. Kuæa je smje&scaron;tena na prekrasnom poluotoku Pelje&scaron;cu. Kuæa se nalazi na zemlji&scaron;tu ukupne povr&scaron;ine 520 m2, dok je stambena povr&scaron;ina 310 m2. Sagraðena je prije 25 godina u svojstvu motela. Sastoji se od 4 eta¾e sa ukupno 10 soba sa zasebnim kupatilima i balkonima.</p>\r\n<p><span style="text-decoration: underline; color: #ff0000;">CIJENA SNI®ENA SA 560.000 EUR!!!</span></p>', '<p>The house is situated in Southern Dalmatia, in the south-western corner of the Peljesac peninsula, about 100 km far from Dubrovnik, neighbouring the famous Korcula island. The house is located in the 2nd line, 150 m far from the sandy seashore surrounded by rocky cliffs. The 25-year-old motel is convenient and aesthetic building, with total living area of 310 m2.</p>\r\n<p><span style="text-decoration: underline; color: #ff0000;">PRICE REDUCED FROM 560.000 EUR!!!</span></p>', '', '<p><span style="text-decoration: underline; color: #ff0000;"><strong>CIJENA SNI®ENA SA 560.000 EUR!!!</strong></span></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Samostojeæa kuæa 2. red do mora sa prekrasnim pogledom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je smje&scaron;tena na prekrasnom poluotoku Pelje&scaron;cu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ovo je izuzetna prilika ¾elite li nekretninu udaljenu od mora i pje&scaron;èane pla¾e svega 150 m ili svega nekoliko minuta lagane &scaron;etnje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa se nalazi na zemlji&scaron;tu ukupne povr&scaron;ine 520 m2, dok je stambena povr&scaron;ina 310 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sagraðena je prije 25 godina u svojstvu motela. Sastoji se od 4 eta¾e sa ukupno 10 soba sa zasebnim kupatilima i balkonima.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U kuæi se nalazi i zaseban apartman koji se sastoji od dnevnog boravka, 2 spavaæe sobe i kupatila.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U podrumu se nalazi cca 100 m2 prostora koji je opremljen i slu¾i kao velika kuhinja i blagovaona. Takoðer mo¾e poslu¾iti kao veliki lounge prostor za odmor.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je opremljena solarnim sistemom kojim se osigurava topla voda za cijeli objekt.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ispred kuæe se nalazi parking za 5 automobila.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za sve dodatne informacije stojimo vam na raspolaganju.</p>', '<p><span style="text-decoration: underline; color: #ff0000;"><strong>PRICE REDUCED FROM 560.000 EUR!!!</strong></span></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house is situated in Southern Dalmatia, in the south-western corner of  the Peljesac peninsula, about 100 km far from Dubrovnik, neighbouring the  famous Korcula island.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>This area is rightfully famous for its sights and  historical monuments. Moreover, it&rsquo;s also a renowned wine-growing  region.&nbsp;Its flagship wine, the Dignac is considered to be one if the 10 best wines in the world.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house is located in the 2nd line, 150 m far  from the sandy seashore surrounded by rocky cliffs.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There is a public  beach right in front of the house popular with families with  children.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The 25-year-old motel is convenient and aesthetic building,  with total living area of 310 m2.&nbsp;The guests are welcomed by a huge palm  tree, leanders and some more exotic plants in the 520 m2 land which is  surrounded by a fence.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There is also a parking lot behind the house offering  spots for 5 cars. The parking lot is surrounded by a small a kiwi and  vineyard trellis.&nbsp;There is also a yard behind the house which is full of  fruit (orange, lemon, clementine, fig) trees. A playground was also built in  the yard which is a great place for children to play and have some  fun.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house has 4 floors accommodating 10 rooms altogether.&nbsp;Each  room has an &ldquo;own&rdquo; bathroom (Room 2 and 3 and room 7 and 8 has a shared  bathroom) equipped with a bathtub, sink and toilet.&nbsp;All the rooms are  furnished with bedside tables, beds and wardrobes.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>All the rooms have a  balcony and overlook the see (room 2 and 3 and room 7 and 8 shares one  balcony).&nbsp;All the rooms have a fan, an air conditioner and  fridge.&nbsp;Furthermore, there is a suite in the house where a living room, a&nbsp;wardrobe and 2 bedrooms offer comfort for the guests. The suite is furnished with a settee, beds and Swiss wooden pieces of furniture and has an own bathroom. On the 2 sides you can find a 60 m2 terrace covered  with limestone.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>In the basement there is a nearly 100 m2 equipped and  furnished dining room (2 dishwashers, 3 ovens, 2 microwave ovens, iron,  billiard table etc. The basement may also serve as a lounge and a meeting  spot.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The stairwell and the terrace are covered with limestone; wooden  mosaics are laid on the floors in the rooms.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Hot water is supplied by  solar power supplies.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house has a garage with shelves.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Although is  the 2nd line, there is no building in front of the house providing an  undisturbed view to the sea. According to the mayor of the city, the owner  of the neighbouring land may only build a one-floor house.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house is  well designed, manufactured: foundation, walls, concreting, electrical  installation, etc. The entire design and construction documents are  available after visiting.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Note:</p>\r\n<p>The city managed to obtain 3 million  EUR worth EU catch-up funds for drainage systems. The implementation of the  project has already been started.&nbsp;The Croatian government started to  build a bridge near the 18-km-long Bosnian seashore (Neum), between Duboka  and Komarna, so that the highway wouldn&rsquo;t have to run through Bosnia. It  can already be seen that the construction has already started both on the  land mass and peninsula. The expected completion and inauguration date of the  bridge is the end of 2015. Next year the latest, the Ploce-Dubrovnik part  of the highway will be opened.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please call to arrange a  viewing.</p>', '', '950_House-Villa_0.jpg', '950_House-Villa_1.jpg', '950_House-Villa_2.jpg', '950_House-Villa_3.jpg', '950_House-Villa_4.jpg', '950_House-Villa_5.jpg', '950_House-Villa_6.jpg', '950_House-Villa_7.jpg', '950_House-Villa_8.jpg'),
(951, 'Dejan', 'Jokiæ', '', '091/ 797 8919', 'Dejan.jokic5@gmail.com', 'Trogir', 'Rastiæi, Z.U. 2832', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '95', '508', '96', 1, '195000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 2, 1, 'November 14, 2014', '<p>Na ju¾noj strani otoka Èiova, ujedno i najljep&scaron;eg dijela otoka, smjetila se manja samostojeæa kuæa na prostranom zemlji&scaron;tu sa mnogim potencijalima. Udaljenost od mora i prirodno kamenite pla¾e je 95 m, &scaron;to je svega nekoliko minuta hodanja. Kuæa se nalazi na zemlji&scaron;tu ukupne povr&scaron;ine 508 m2, &scaron;to je dovoljno za izgradnju bazena i ureðenje prostranog vrta sa kaminom. Ukupna stambena povr&scaron;ina iznosi 96 m2, a sastoji se od prizemlja i 1.kata.</p>', '<p>We have this small house on a large plot on the south side of Ciovo, in the most beautiful part of the island. The distance from the sea and natural stone beach is 95 m, and there is a direct path so it is only a few minutes walking distance. The house is on a land area of 508 m2, much of it landscaped with a range of Mediterranean shrubs and trees, but which is enough land to make a swimming pool, patio and bbq/fireplace. The total living area is 96 m2 and it consists of a ground floor and 1st floor.</p>', '', '<p>Na ju¾noj strani otoka Èiova, ujedno i najljep&scaron;eg dijela otoka, smjetila se manja samostojeæa kuæa na prostranom zemlji&scaron;tu sa mnogim potencijalima.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Udaljenost od mora i prirodno kamenite pla¾e je 95 m, &scaron;to je svega nekoliko minuta hodanja.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa se nalazi na zemlji&scaron;tu ukupne povr&scaron;ine 508 m2, &scaron;to je dovoljno za izgradnju bazena i ureðenje prostranog vrta sa kaminom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ukupna stambena povr&scaron;ina iznosi 96 m2, a sastoji se od prizemlja i 1.kata.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U prizemlju se nalaze 2 roh-bau prostorije do kojih su dovedene elektriène i vodne instalacije.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na 1.katu se nalazi dnevni boravak + blagovaonica + kuhinja, 2 spavaæe sobe, kupaonica i velika terasa sa pogledom na more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ispred kuæe se nalaze 2 gara¾e za ukupno 2 automobila. U dvori&scaron;tu je takoðer moguæe parkirati 4 automobila.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Osim &scaron;to bi se sa dodatnim renoviranjem dobilo ukupno 2 apartmana postoji moguænost izgradnje jo&scaron; jedne eta¾e koja bi imala jo&scaron; ljep&scaron;i pogled na more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Centar mjesta gdje se nalaze svi sadr¾aji udaljen je 3 minute vo¾nje, dok je povijesni grad Trogir udaljen 15 minuta.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Do meðunarodnog aerodroma je potrebno 20 minuta vo¾nje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za sva dodatna pitanja vam stojimo na raspolaganju.</p>', '<p>We have this small house on a large plot on the south side of Ciovo, in the most  beautiful part of the island.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The distance from the sea and natural stone  beach is 95 m, and there is a direct path so it is only a few minutes walking  distance.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house is on a land area of 508 m2, much of it landscaped  with a range of Mediterranean shrubs and trees, but which is enough land to make  a swimming pool, patio and bbq/fireplace.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The total living area is 96 m2  and it consists of a ground floor and 1st floor.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The ground floor has two  unfinished rooms, with the services (electricity and water) connection, so they  need completing and decorating.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the 1st floor there is a living room,  dining room, kitchen, two bedrooms, bathroom and a large terrace overlooking the  sea!</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house has two garages, and plenty of space in front of them for  car parking.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There are great views from both apartments, especially the  upper floor, from the balcony.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The nearest village is conveniently  situated, just 3 minutes away by car, and here are many useful facilities such  as shops, bars and cafes while some very smart restaurants are found in Trogir,  the UNESCO protected town which is the cultural and historic&nbsp; centre of the area  and is 15 minutes drive.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The International airport is 20 minutes to  drive.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For any questions or viewing we are at your disposal in our Split  office.</p>', '', '951_House-Villa_0.jpg', '951_House-Villa_1.jpg', '951_House-Villa_2.jpg', '951_House-Villa_3.jpg', '951_House-Villa_4.jpg', '951_House-Villa_5.jpg', '951_House-Villa_6.jpg', '951_House-Villa_7.jpg', '951_House-Villa_8.jpg'),
(952, '', 'Avema nekretnine doo', '099/ 3122101 Vice Dodig', 'kljuè ©karo Josip 091/ 281 2272', 'vice.dodig@gmail.com', 'Brac', 'Postira, Pavi¹iæa vrtli 9-11', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '300', '0', '0', 2, '61600', '', 2, 1, 2, 2, 1, 2, 0, 0, 'November 15, 2014', '<p>Novoizgraðeni apartmani u Postirama na otoku Braèu, sa prekrasnim pogledom na more. U ponudi je 10 potpuno opremljenih apartmana, jednosobnih, dvosobnih i trosobnih, povr&scaron;ine od 42 m2 do 92 m2. Svi apartmani imaju prekrasan pogled na more i centar mjesta.</p>\r\n<p><strong><span style="text-decoration: underline;">Cijene apartmana od 61.600 Eura - 143.400 Eura!</span></strong></p>', '<p>We are pleased to offer a selection of newly completed apartments in a pretty village on the north side of the island, all facing the sea. The building has been constructed with 12 fully furnished apartments, one, two or three bedrooms, with a floor area from 42 m2 to 92 m2.&nbsp;All apartments have a wonderful view of the sea and across the village and harbour.</p>\r\n<p><strong><span style="text-decoration: underline;">Price 61.600 Euro &ndash; 143.400 Euro!</span></strong></p>', '', '<p>Novoizgraðeni apartmani u Postirama na otoku Braèu, sa prekrasnim pogledom na more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U ponudi je 10 potpuno opremljenih apartmana, jednosobnih, dvosobnih i trosobnih, povr&scaron;ine od 42 m2 do 92 m2.</p>\r\n<p><strong><span style="text-decoration: underline;">Cijene apartmana od 61.600 Eura - 143.400 Eura!</span></strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartmani se nalaze u stambenoj zgradi od ukupno 12 apartmana, po 4 na svakoj eta¾i.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na drugom katu su dvoeta¾ni apartmani sa po 3 sobe i 2 kupaonice. Ostali apartmani imaju 2 sobe i kupaonicu, osim jednog u prizemlju koji je jednosoban.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Svi apartmani imaju prekrasan pogled na more i centar mjesta.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U cijenu je ukljuèeno i parking mjesto za svaki apartman.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Udaljenost od Supetra i trajektne luke koja je povezana trajektnom linijom sa Splitom je 10 kilometara.</p>', '<p>We are pleased to offer a selection of newly completed apartments in a pretty  village on the north side of the island, all facing the sea.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The building  has been constructed with 12 fully furnished apartments, one, two or three  bedrooms, with a floor area from 42 m2 to 92 m2.</p>\r\n<p><strong><span style="text-decoration: underline;">Price 61.600 EUR &ndash; 143.400 EUR</span></strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>They have been designed  with modern living in mind. They have an open plan living area and the  large sliding windows give access to the balcony in the warm summer or plenty of  light when closed through the winter.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The apartments are located in a  building of 3 floors with 4 apartments on each floor.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the second floor are  two-levels apartments, all with 3 bedrooms and 2 bathrooms.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Other apartments  have two bedrooms and a bathroom, except the one on the ground floor that is a  one bedroom apartment.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>All apartments have a wonderful view of the sea  and across the village and harbour.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The price includes a parking space for  each apartment.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The developer will continue to manage the communal areas  after the properties have been sold. These are great apartments either to let to  tourists or for private summer living.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The village centre is a few  minute&rsquo;s walk, the same distance as the beach alongside, which has a famous  beach of small, round pebbles.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The village has many small shops, bars and a  lively night life in the summer evenings, as well as a market and some of the  best restaurants on the island.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Distance from Supetar ferry port that is  connected by ferry to Split is 10 kilometers.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>This is an excellent  opportunity to become member of the community of this great small village which  won an award as a best small Dalmatian place to live in in 2013!</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>To  arrange a tour call our CPS Split office.</p>', '', '952_Apartment_0.jpg', '952_Apartment_1.jpg', '952_Apartment_2.jpg', '952_Apartment_3.jpg', '952_Apartment_4.jpg', '952_Apartment_5.jpg', '952_Apartment_6.jpg', '952_Apartment_7.jpg', '952_Apartment_8.jpg');
INSERT INTO `nekretnina` (`id`, `ime`, `prezime`, `telefon`, `mobitel`, `e_mail`, `lokacija_id`, `adresa`, `status_id`, `vrsta_id`, `udaljenost`, `povrsina`, `stambenapovrsina`, `display`, `cijena`, `cijenatocka`, `ponuda_tjedna`, `new_built`, `must_sell`, `prvi_red_do_mora`, `pogled_na_more`, `bazen`, `broj_soba`, `broj_kupatila`, `datum`, `title_hr`, `title_en`, `title_ge`, `opis_hr`, `opis_en`, `opis_ge`, `PropertyImageURL0`, `PropertyImageURL1`, `PropertyImageURL2`, `PropertyImageURL3`, `PropertyImageURL4`, `PropertyImageURL5`, `PropertyImageURL6`, `PropertyImageURL7`, `PropertyImageURL8`) VALUES
(953, 'Antoni', 'Jurica', '', '098/9386-035', 'anthonyjurica@gmail.com', 'Lastovo', 'Pasadur', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '100', '0', '0', 1, '110000', '', 2, 1, 2, 2, 1, 2, 2, 2, 'November 15, 2014', '<p>Luksuzni kompletno namje&scaron;teni apartmani u jednoj od najljep&scaron;ih uvala s pogledom na more. Apartmanska zgrada je ju¾ne orijentacije i sastoji se od tri eta¾e s ukupno pet apartmana, svaki s pogledom na more. Od mora je udaljena 100 m.&nbsp;<span style="text-decoration: underline;">Povr&scaron;ine apartmana 62,61 m2 - 81,26 m2. Cijena 110.000 Eura - 180.000 Eura!</span></p>', '<p>A rare opportunity to buy one of 5, stylish, modern apartments. They are situated 100m from the sea and 300m from the marina and the centre of the small village on Lastovo island. The apartment building is south facing and consists of three floors with a total of five apartments, each with stunning views of the wooded coast and the sea. <span style="text-decoration: underline;">Apartments are measuring <span style="text-decoration: underline;">62,61 m2 - 81,26 m2. Price from 110.000 Euro - 180.000 Euro!</span></span></p>', '', '<p>Luksuzni kompletno namje&scaron;teni apartmani u jednoj od najljep&scaron;ih uvala s pogledom na more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartmanska zgrada je ju¾ne orijentacije i sastoji se od tri eta¾e s ukupno pet apartmana, svaki s pogledom na more. Od mora je udaljena 100 m.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;"><strong>APARTMANI - PRVI KAT:</strong></span></p>\r\n<p><strong>Apartman A1 povr&scaron;ine 62.78 m2 &nbsp;- cijena 140.000 Eura</strong></p>\r\n<p>Sastoji se od: 2 spavaæe sobe, kupaonice, wc, kuhinje i dnevnog boravka s izlazom na natkrivenu terasu s koje se pru¾a pogled na more.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Apartman A2 povr&scaron;ine 62.97 m2 - cijena 150.000 Eura</strong></p>\r\n<p>Sastoji se od: 2 spavaæe sobe, kupaonice, wc, kuhinje i dnevnog boravka s izlazom na natkrivenu terasu s pogledom na more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong><span style="text-decoration: underline;">APARTMANI - DRUGI KAT:</span></strong></p>\r\n<p><strong>Apartman B1 povr&scaron;ine 72.51 m2 - cijena 140.000 Eura</strong></p>\r\n<p>Sastoji se od:2 spavaæe sobe, kupaonice, wc, kuhinje i dnevnog boravka s izlazom na nenatkrivenu terasu s koje se pru¾a pogled na more.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Apartman B2 povr&scaron;ine 62.61 m2 - cijena 110.000 Eura</strong></p>\r\n<p>Sastoji se od:2 spavaæe sobe, 2 kupaonice, wc, kuhinje i dnevnog boravka s izlazom na nenatkrivenu terasu s koje se pru¾a pogled na more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong><span style="text-decoration: underline;">APARTMAN - TREÆI KAT:</span></strong></p>\r\n<p><strong>Apartman C povr&scaron;ine 81.26 m2 - cijena 180.000 Eura</strong></p>\r\n<p>Sastoji se od 2 spavaæe sobe, 2 kupaonice, kuhinje i dnevnog boravka s izlazom na nenatkrivenu terasu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U cijenu apartmana ukljuèen je kompletni namje&scaron;taj.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Svaki apartman ima parkirno mjesto od 12,50 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartmani su veæ u funkciji iznajmljivanja ukoliko se netko ¾eli nastaviti baviti tom djelatno&scaron;æu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartmani su od marine, lijepo ureðene pla¾e, restorana i kafiæa udaljeni 300 m.</p>', '<p>A rare opportunity to buy one of 5, stylish, modern apartments.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>They are  situated 100m from the sea and 300m from the marina and the centre of the small  village on Lastovo island.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The apartment building is south facing and  consists of three floors with a total of five apartments, each with stunning  views of the wooded coast and the sea.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong><span style="text-decoration: underline;">APARTMENTS - FIRST FLOOR:</span></strong></p>\r\n<p><strong>Apartment A1 area 62.78 m2 - price 140.000 euro</strong></p>\r\n<p>It consists of two  bedrooms, bathroom, toilet, kitchen and living room opening onto a covered  terrace that overlooks the sea.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Apartment A2 area 62.97 m2 - price 150.000  euro</strong></p>\r\n<p>It consists of two bedrooms, bathroom, toilet, kitchen and living room  with access to a covered terrace overlooking the sea.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong><span style="text-decoration: underline;">APARTMENTS - SECOND FLOOR:</span></strong></p>\r\n<p><strong>Apartment B1 area 72.51 m2 - price 140.000 euro</strong></p>\r\n<p>It consists of two  bedrooms, bathroom, toilet, kitchen and living room with access to the open-air  terrace that overlooks the sea.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Apartment B2 area 62.61 m2 - price 110.000  euro</strong></p>\r\n<p>It consists of two bedrooms, two bathrooms, kitchen and living room with  access to the open-air terrace that overlooks the sea.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong><span style="text-decoration: underline;">APARTMENT - THIRD FLOOR:</span></strong></p>\r\n<p><strong>Apartment C area 81.26 m2 - price 180.000 euro</strong></p>\r\n<p>It consists of two  bedrooms, two bathrooms, kitchen and living room with access to the open-air  terrace.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>All the properties have been stylishly decorated and furnished  and the price includes all furnishings.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Each apartment has a parking place of 12.50 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The apartments are already in  operation to rent so this activity may be seamlessly continued.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The  surrounding area is very peaceful and quiet, on a barely used road, but the  nearest village with shops, cafes, and bars is only a few minute&rsquo;s walk.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The  sea around the coast is the clearest off Croatia, and is one of the richest  fishing grounds. There are many dolphins as well as other wildlife in the water and on the island.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please  contact the office in Split to arrange to be escorted to these apartments.</p>', '', '953_Apartment_0.jpg', '953_Apartment_1.jpg', '953_Apartment_2.jpg', '953_Apartment_3.jpg', '953_Apartment_4.jpg', '953_Apartment_5.jpg', '953_Apartment_6.jpg', '953_Apartment_7.jpg', '953_Apartment_8.jpg'),
(954, 'Marijano', 'Mi¹e', '021/389-423  ', '098/ 816 365', '', 'Split', 'Gospinica 8', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '300', '0', '110', 1, '311500', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 3, 1, 'November 15, 2014', '<p>Prostrani apartman na zadnjem katu starogradske zgrade u mirnom dijelu grada Splita. Iz apartmana se pru¾a djelomièan pogled na more, Rivu i marinu. Apartman je prekrasno ureðen i renoviran, ukupne povr&scaron;ine 110 m2. Sastoji se od kuhinje sa blagovaonicom i prostranim dnevnim boravkom, 3 sobe, kupatila, wc-a i dvije terase.</p>', '<p>We are pleased to offer this spacious apartment on the top floor of a fine old town building in a quiet part of the city of Split. The apartment offers a partial view from several windows and the balcony, of the sea, the waterfront, the marina, and the town. It has a total floor area of 112m sq and is designed with a large modern style family lounge, kitchen and dining room, three bedrooms, bathroom, separate WC and two balconies.</p>', '', '<p>Prostrani apartman na zadnjem katu starogradske zgrade u mirnom dijelu grada Splita.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Iz apartmana se pru¾a djelomièan pogled na more, Rivu i marinu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartman je prekrasno ureðen i renoviran, ukupne povr&scaron;ine 110 m2. Sastoji se od kuhinje sa blagovaonicom i prostranim dnevnim boravkom, 3 sobe, kupatila, wc-a i dvije terase.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Opremljen je centralnim grijanjem i klimatiziran. Na terasi se nalazi i kamin koji æe odlièno poslu¾iti u svakodnevnom ¾ivotu, a posebno kad vam dolaze prijatelji na dru¾enje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Zbog odliène lokacije i blizine centra mo¾e se i turistièki iznajmljivati. Takoðer je idealan i za obiteljski ¾ivot preko cijele godine.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Meðunarodni aerodrom udaljen je 40 min. vo¾nje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za sva ostala pitanja vam stojimo na raspolaganju.</p>', '<p>We are pleased to offer this spacious apartment on the top floor of a fine old  town building in a quiet part of the city of Split.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The apartment offers  a partial view from several windows and the balcony, of the sea, the waterfront,  the marina, and the town.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It has a total floor area of 112m sq and is  designed with a large modern style family lounge, kitchen and dining room, three  bedrooms, bathroom, separate WC and two balconies.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It has been  beautifully decorated, and furnished and has been modernised with central  heating and air conditioning.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the terrace is a very practical and  substantial bbq, perfect for entertaining.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property is conveniently  situated for almost all the tourism attractions in the city, as well as the  markets, shops and the best restaurants.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It would be a superb holiday  apartment, or for dwelling if you wanted to be close to the city  centre.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The airport is 40 minutes driving, although most taxi drivers  regard that as a very slow journey!</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please call our office to arrange to  visit this apartment.</p>', '', '954_Apartment_0.jpg', '954_Apartment_1.jpg', '954_Apartment_2.jpg', '954_Apartment_3.jpg', '954_Apartment_4.jpg', '954_Apartment_5.jpg', '954_Apartment_6.jpg', '954_Apartment_7.jpg', '954_Apartment_8.jpg'),
(955, 'Ante', 'Lau¹', '021/486-396', '', '', 'Split', 'Æirila i Metoda 5', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '400', '0', '137', 2, '800000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 3, 2, 'November 15, 2014', '<p>U prekrasnom dijelu grada Splita, u samom centru, od Dioklecijanove palaèe udaljena svega 1 minutu. Kuæa se sastoji od dvije eta¾e i sa moguæno&scaron;æu izgradnje jo&scaron; jedne eta¾e. Ukupna stambena povr&scaron;ina kuæe iznosi 137 m2. Kuæi je potrebno kompletno renoviranje. Idealna je za funkciju turistièkog iznajmljivanja ali i za vlastito u¾ivanje. Riva je udaljena 3-4 minute lagane &scaron;etnje.</p>', '<p>We have this detached house, unusual in the centre of Split, only a few yards from the entrance to the Palace. The house has a total living area of 137 m2 and consists of two floors. If serious renovations were carried out, then a third floor could be considered. The house needs complete renovation. The house is ideally situated&nbsp; for tourist rentals but is also a perfect property for family living.</p>', '', '<p>U prekrasnom dijelu grada Splita, u samom centru, od Dioklecijanove palaèe udaljena svega 1 minutu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa se sastoji od dvije eta¾e i sa moguæno&scaron;æu izgradnje jo&scaron; jedne eta¾e.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Prizemlje povr&scaron;ine 60 m2 se sastoji od hodnika, 3 sobe, kupatila i kuhinje sa blagovaonicom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Gornja eta¾a povr&scaron;ine 70 m2 se sastoji od hodnika, kuhinje sa blagovaonicom, dnevnog boravka, sobe, kupatila i ostave.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kraj kuæe se nalazi odvojena ostava povr&scaron;ine 7 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæi je potrebno kompletno renoviranje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je idealna za funkciju turistièkog iznajmljivanja ali i za vlastito u¾ivanje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Riva je udaljena 3-4 minute lagane &scaron;etnje.</p>\r\n<p>Meðunarodni aerodrom udaljen je 30 min. vo¾nje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za sve dodatne informacije i razgledavanje slobodno nas kontaktirajte.</p>', '<p>We have this detached house, unusual in the centre of Split, only a few yards  from the entrance to the Palace.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house has a total living area of 137  m2 and consists of two floors. If serious renovations were carried out, then a  third floor could be considered.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The ground floor area of 60 m2 consists of a  hallway, three bedrooms, bathroom and kitchen with dining area.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The upper  floor of 70 m2 consists of a hallway, kitchen, dining room, living room,  bedroom, bathroom and storage.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There is a separate storage area of 7 m2 near  the house.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house needs complete renovation.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house is ideally  situated&nbsp; for tourist rentals but is also a perfect property for family  living.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>All the tourist attractions of the city are within a few minute&rsquo;s  walk, and the markets, shops and best restaurants are very close,  too.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact our office in Split to arrange to visit this  property.</p>', '', '955_House-Villa_0.jpg', '955_House-Villa_1.jpg', '955_House-Villa_2.jpg', '955_House-Villa_3.jpg', '955_House-Villa_4.jpg', '955_House-Villa_5.jpg', '', '', ''),
(956, 'Maja', 'Mijaè-Majiæ', '', '095/ 199 1566 Pavo Majiæ', 'pavo.studionaranca@gmail.com', 'Split', 'Istarska 19, ZEM 9291/1 ; ZGR 4648', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '600', '0', '96', 1, '278400', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 'November 15, 2014', '<p>Renovirani prostrani apartman na 3. katu starogradske zgrade, u mirnom dijelu grada, udaljen od Dioklecijanove palaèe svega 5 minuta lagane &scaron;etnje. Apartman je ukupne povr&scaron;ine 96 m2, a sastoji se od hodnika, kuhinje, dnevnog boravka, 2 spavaæe sobe, kupatila, wc-a i balkona. Apartman je ureðen i nije potrebno nikakvo dodatno ulaganje jedino u sluèaju mijenjanja po vlastitim ¾eljama.</p>', '<p>We are offering this spacious apartment, fully renovated, on the third floor of an old town building, only 5 minutes walk from the Diocletian palace and Riva. The apartment has a total floor area of 96 m2 and consists of: hallway, kitchen with dinning area, living room with access to the balcony, two bedrooms, bathroom and separate toilet. The apartment is nicely renovated/decorated and requires no further investment unless the owner has different personal taste and ideas.</p>', '', '<p>Renovirani prostrani apartman na 3. katu starogradske zgrade, u mirnom dijelu grada, udaljen od Dioklecijanove palaèe svega 5 minuta lagane &scaron;etnje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartman je ukupne povr&scaron;ine 96 m2, a sastoji se od hodnika, kuhinje, dnevnog boravka, 2 spavaæe sobe, kupatila, wc-a i balkona.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U podrumu zgrade je mala ostava cca 4 m2 koje pripada apartmanu, uz pravo kori&scaron;tenja zajednièke praonice, potkrovlja i vrtova sa dvije strane kojima je kuæa ograðena.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartman je ureðen i nije potrebno nikakvo dodatno ulaganje jedino u sluèaju mijenjanja po vlastitim ¾eljama.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Moguæe je parkirati na ulici ispred zgrade, dok je najbli¾i veliki parking udaljen cca. 200 m.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Meðunarodni aerodrom udaljen je 40 min. vo¾nje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za sve dodatne informacije stojimo vam na raspolaganju.</p>', '<p>We are offering this spacious apartment, fully renovated, on the third floor of  an old town building, only 5 minutes walk from the Diocletian palace and Riva.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The apartment has a total floor area of 96 m2 and consists of: hallway,  kitchen with dinning area, living room with access to the balcony, two bedrooms,  bathroom and separate toilet.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>In the basement there is an additional small  storage area about 4 m2, which belongs to the apartment. Also there is a right  to use the common laundry room, attic and gardens which surround the  building.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The apartment is nicely renovated/decorated and requires no  further investment unless the owner has different personal taste and  ideas.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Within a short walk are almost all of the main attractions of the city  of Split, and it is conveniently situated close to markets, shops, bars and  restaurants, as well as the ferry terminal, marina and other  facilities.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The surrounding area is quiet and there is street parking in  front of the property.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The international Split airport is 40 minutes  comfortable drive, or a 20 minutes taxi drive. Don''t forget to wear a seat  belt!</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For visiting the apartment please call our office.</p>', '', '956_Apartment_0.jpg', '956_Apartment_1.jpg', '956_Apartment_2.jpg', '956_Apartment_3.jpg', '956_Apartment_4.jpg', '956_Apartment_5.jpg', '956_Apartment_6.jpg', '956_Apartment_7.jpg', ''),
(957, 'Sanda', 'Vrljièak', '', '091/ 150 1261  Luka (otac vlasnice)', '', 'Split', 'Mato¹eva 3', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '600', '0', '71', 1, '145250', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 'November 16, 2014', '<p>Apartman u starogradskoj zgradi, na 5. katu orijentacije sjever-jug, sa pogledom na stari dio grada. Smje&scaron;ten je u starom dijelu grada Splita udaljen od Rive i Dioklecijanove palaèe cca. 500 m. Apartman ukupne povr&scaron;ine 71 m2 sastoji se od hodnika, kuhinje+ dnevnog boravka + blagovaonice, 2 spavaæe sobe, kupaonice i spreme.</p>', '<p>We are offering this 2 bedroom apartment, 5 minutes walk from the Palace. It is situated on the 5th floor of an old town building, on a north/south orientation with an attractive view of the city from the windows. It is 15 minutes walk to the beaches at Marjan park. Inside the apartment the living area is 71m sq and the architectural layout is with a hallway, 2 bedrooms, bathroom, kitchen and large lounge with a dining area.</p>', '', '<p>Apartman u starogradskoj zgradi, na 5. katu orijentacije sjever-jug, sa pogledom na stari dio grada.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Smje&scaron;ten je u starom dijelu grada Splita udaljen od Rive i Dioklecijanove palaèe cca. 500 m.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Najbli¾e pla¾e nalaze se u park &scaron;umi Marjan koja je udaljena 15 min. hodanja.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartman ukupne povr&scaron;ine 71 m2 sastoji se od hodnika, kuhinje+ dnevnog boravka + blagovaonice, 2 spavaæe sobe, kupaonice i spreme. U podrumu zgrade takoðer se nalazi spremi&scaron;te (3 m2) koje pripada apartmanu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>S ju¾ne strane pru¾a se pogled na stari dio grada i park &scaron;umu Marjan.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Javni parking nalazi se odmah ispred zgrade.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U blizini se nalaze mnogobrojne trgovine, kafiæi, restorani i svi ostali sadr¾aji.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Meðunarodni aerodrom udaljen je 40 min. vo¾nje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za sve dodatne informacije slobodno nas kontaktirajte.</p>', '<p>We are offering this 2 bedroom apartment, 5 minutes walk from the  Palace.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is situated on the 5th floor of an old town building, on a  north/south orientation with an attractive view of the city from the windows.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is 15 minutes walk to the beaches at Marjan park, and almost all the  best restaurants, the markets and shops etc.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Inside the apartment the  living area is 71m sq and the architectural layout is with a hallway, 2  bedrooms, bathroom, kitchen and large lounge with a dining area.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There is  plenty of built in storage, and an additional storage space in the basement of  the building (3m sq).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is well presented, well decorated and  maintained.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There is parking around the building, and the airport is  between 30 and 40 minutes driving, depending on the driver&rsquo;s  skills.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please call our office in Split to arrange to visit this  property.</p>', '', '957_Apartment_0.jpg', '957_Apartment_1.jpg', '957_Apartment_2.jpg', '957_Apartment_3.jpg', '957_Apartment_4.jpg', '957_Apartment_5.jpg', '957_Apartment_6.jpg', '957_Apartment_7.jpg', '957_Apartment_8.jpg'),
(958, 'Jurica', 'Juri¹iæ', '', '099 233 05 36', 'jujurisic@gmail.com', 'Rogoznica', 'Zeèevo, Rtiæ 34, k.è 20296/16,20296/17,20296/18,20292/8 ko Rogoznica', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '50', '360', '200', 1, '300000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 6, 4, 'November 16, 2014', '<p>Apartmanska kuæa u mirnoj i lijepoj uvali, udaljena 50 m od mora. Sa svih eta¾a se pru¾a pogled na more. Povr&scaron;ina kuæe iznosi 200 m2, a nalazi se na parceli povr&scaron;ine 360 m2. Kuæa je podijeljena na suteren, prvi i drugi kat. Apartmani su kategorizirani s tri zvjezdice tako da se kuæa mo¾e koristiti i u turistièke svrhe.</p>', '<p>We are offering this purpose built apartment block of four apartments in a quiet and beautiful bay just 50 m from the sea. The property is situated near Rogoznica, in a quiet part of the village with no through traffic, but still close and convenient to many of the bars, shops and other facilities. Each floor has balconies and windows overlooking the bay and the shore which is less than 50m from the property. The living area is 200 m2 and the plot is 360 m2.</p>', '', '<p>Apartmanska kuæa u mirnoj i lijepoj uvali, udaljena 50 m od mora.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sa svih eta¾a se pru¾a pogled na more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Povr&scaron;ina kuæe iznosi 200 m2, a nalazi se na parceli povr&scaron;ine 360 m2. Kuæa je podijeljena na suteren, prvi i drugi kat.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U suterenu je studio apartman.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Prvi kat se sastoji od dvije spavaæe sobe, kupaonice, kuhinje s blagovaonom i dnevnim boravkom. S terase se pru¾a prekrasan pogled na more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na drugom katu su jedan jednosoban i jedan dvosoban apartman. Svaki apartman ima svoju terasu s pogledom na more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na parceli se nalazi 5 parkirnih mjesta.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartmani su kategorizirani s tri zvjezdice tako da se kuæa mo¾e koristiti i u turistièke svrhe.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U blizini kuæe nalazi se restoran i kafiæ.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na parceli oko kuæe je zasaðeno mediteransko bilje.</p>', '<p>We are offering this purpose built apartment block of four apartments in a quiet  and beautiful bay just 50 m from the sea.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property is situated near  Rogoznica, in a quiet part of the village with no through traffic, but still  close and convenient to many of the bars, shops and other facilities in this  gorgeous Dalmatian fishing village.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Each floor has balconies and windows  overlooking the bay and the shore which is less than 50m from the  property.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The living area is 200 m2 and the plot is 360 m2.&nbsp;The house is  divided into the ground, first and second floor.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>In the ground: one studio  apartment.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The first floor consists of: two bedrooms, bathroom, kitchen,  dining and living area. The balcony has superb views of the sea, and the  bay.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the second floor are: one bedroom and one two bedroom apartment. Each  apartment has its own terrace overlooking the sea.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There are five parking  spaces on the parcel, and the remainder of the plot has been planted with low  maintenance Mediterranean shrubs and trees.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The apartments are  categorized with three stars so that the house can have continued use for  tourism purposes, without reapplying.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>International airport is 30  minute&rsquo;s drive.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>To visit this house and similar in the area, please  contact our office.</p>', '', '958_House-Villa_0.jpg', '958_House-Villa_1.jpg', '958_House-Villa_2.jpg', '958_House-Villa_3.jpg', '958_House-Villa_4.jpg', '958_House-Villa_5.jpg', '958_House-Villa_6.jpg', '958_House-Villa_7.jpg', '958_House-Villa_8.jpg'),
(959, 'Ante', 'Jurkov', '', '099 815 6775', 'jurko.ante@gmail.com', 'Rogoznica', 'Stiva¹nica, k.è.10042/7 K.O. Sevid', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '200', '360', '125', 2, '125000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 1, 1, 'November 17, 2014', '<p>Nedovr&scaron;ena prizemna kuæa s koje se pru¾a pogled na more i uvalu. Kuæa se nalazi na lijepom, mirnom mjesto udaljenom 200 m od pla¾e u lijepoj uvali. Graðevinska brutto povr&scaron;ina kuæe iznosi 125 m2, a nalazi se na parceli povr&scaron;ine 360 m2. Trenutno je izgraðen samo prizemni dio kuæe u kojem je planirana jedna spavaæa soba, kupaonica, dnevni boravak, kuhinja i blagovaonica. Daljnja gradnja je takoðer moguæa.</p>', '<p>Excellent opportunity for builder to create an amazing home. We are offering this unfinished project at a discounted price for anyone prepared to complete this ground floor house that offers great view of the sea and the bay. It is situated in a quiet and beautiful rural location, amongst old olive groves and sage and rosemary shrubs, 200 meters from the beach. The building gross area is 125 m2, while the total plot area is 360 m2.</p>', '', '<p>Nedovr&scaron;ena prizemna kuæa s koje se pru¾a pogled na more i uvalu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa se nalazi na lijepom, mirnom mjesto udaljenom 200 m od pla¾e u lijepoj uvali.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Graðevinska brutto povr&scaron;ina kuæe iznosi 125 m2, a nalazi se na parceli povr&scaron;ine 360 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Trenutno je izgraðen samo prizemni dio kuæe u kojem je planirana jedna spavaæa soba, kupaonica, dnevni boravak, kuhinja i blagovaonica.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Daljnja gradnja je takoðer moguæa.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa ima prikljuèak na vodu i struju.</p>', '<p>Excellent opportunity for builder to create an amazing home.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>We are offering  this unfinished project at a discounted price for anyone prepared to complete  this ground floor house that offers great view of the sea and the bay.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is  situated in a quiet and beautiful rural location, amongst old olive groves and  sage and rosemary shrubs, 200 meters from the beach.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The building gross  area is 125 m2, while the total plot area is 360 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Currently, only the  ground floor has been built, according to the plans and the heavy work has been  largely completed, and the property has one bedroom, bathroom, living room,  kitchen and dining room.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Further (extended) construction would be possible,  with permission and the grounds allow space for good size swimming pool and  patio area.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house has connection to public water and  electricity.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Price is set to ensure a quick sale, so hurry!</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact the Croatia  Property Sales office to arrange a visit to the property.</p>', '', '959_House-Villa_0.jpg', '959_House-Villa_1.jpg', '959_House-Villa_2.jpg', '959_House-Villa_3.jpg', '959_House-Villa_4.jpg', '959_House-Villa_5.jpg', '', '', ''),
(960, 'Dubravko', 'Hum', '01/ 6152314', 'kæerka 091 531 98 06', 'dubravka@compgraph.hr', 'Lastovo', 'Lastovo Pasadur', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '10', '400', '75', 1, '220000', '', 2, 2, 2, 1, 1, 2, 2, 1, 'November 17, 2014', '<p>Prekrasna kuæa u prvom redu do mora, s prekrasnim pogledom na more. Nalazi se u lijepoj uvali s ureðenom pla¾om od koje je udaljena svega 10 m, a ima i vlastiti prilaz izgraðenom mulu. Kuæa je povr&scaron;ine 75 m2, a nalazi se na parceli povr&scaron;ine 400 m2. Sastoji se od 2 spavaæe sobe, kupaonice, dnevnog boravka, kuhinje i ljetne kuhinje.</p>\r\n<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;">CIJENA SNI®ENA SA 240.000 EURA!!</span></p>', '<p>We are offering this beautiful house on the seafront on Lastovo island. It is situated in a beautiful bay with a beach only 10 meters distant. It is a very private location but it has access to the pier, for mooring boats. The house is 75 m2 and is located on a plot of 400 m2. It consists of two bedrooms, bathroom, living room, kitchen and summer kitchen. Two balconies overlook the sea and are ideal for relaxing in the shade and quiet.</p>\r\n<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;">PRICE REDUCED FROM 240.000 EURO!!</span></p>', '', '<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;"><strong>CIJENA SNI®ENA SA 240.000 EURA!!</strong></span></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Prekrasna kuæa u prvom redu do mora, s prekrasnim pogledom na more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nalazi se u lijepoj uvali s ureðenom pla¾om od koje je udaljena svega 10 m, a ima i vlastiti prilaz izgraðenom mulu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U neposrednoj je blizini restorana, kafiæa i marine ali je saèuvana privatnost&nbsp; jer se nalazi na prirodnoj uzvisini okru¾ena zelenilom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je povr&scaron;ine 75 m2, a nalazi se na parceli povr&scaron;ine 400 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sastoji se od 2 spavaæe sobe, kupaonice, dnevnog boravka, kuhinje i ljetne kuhinje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Dvije terase s kojih se pru¾a pogled na more su idealne za odmor u hladu i ti&scaron;ini.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je prikljuèena na struju i vodu, a ima i septièku jamu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Do kuæe se mo¾e doæi vozilom te ima osiguran parking.</p>', '<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;"><strong>PRICE REDUCED FROM 240.000 EURO!!</strong></span></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>We are offering this beautiful house on the seafront on Lastovo  island.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is situated in a beautiful bay with a beach only 10 meters  distant and great pleasure can be had from feeding the fish with bread from the  balcony. It is a great art to ensure the fish eat it before the greedy  seagulls.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is a very private location but it has access to the pier,  for mooring boats.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The surrounding area is mature pine woods and natural  vegetation, which gives enhanced privacy, and despite this it is close to the  marina with the cafes, bars, restaurants and shops.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house is 75 m2  and is located on a plot of 400 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It consists of two bedrooms, bathroom,  living room, kitchen and summer kitchen.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Two balconies overlook the sea and  are ideal for relaxing in the shade and quiet.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house has electricity and  water, and has a private septic tank.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house can be reached by car and has  parking lot.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>This island is popular and special to many people who visit  it every year.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact our office so we can arrange a visit to  this property with you.</p>', '', '960_House-Villa_0.jpg', '960_House-Villa_1.jpg', '960_House-Villa_2.jpg', '960_House-Villa_3.jpg', '960_House-Villa_4.jpg', '', '', '', ''),
(961, 'Damir', 'Toma¹eviæ', '', '098 262 918', 'damir@gradatin.hr', 'Rogoznica', 'Sevid', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '10', '640', '120', 1, '480000', '', 2, 2, 2, 1, 1, 2, 4, 2, 'November 17, 2014', '<p>Nedovr&scaron;ena kuæa, prvi red do mora s prekrasnom prirodnom pla¾om ispred kuæe i pogledom na more. Prizemna kvalitetno graðena kuæa u kamenu s moguæno&scaron;æu daljnje gradnje nalazi se u prekrasnoj uvali nedaleko od trgovina, restorana i kafiæa. Kuæa je povr&scaron;ine 120 m2, a nalazi se na parceli povr&scaron;ine 640 m2. Uz kuæu se nalazi i prostor povr&scaron;ine 20 m2 koji se trenutno koristi kao ljetna kuhinja.</p>', '<p>We are pleased to offer this unfinished seafront house with beautiful natural beach just in front. It consists of two apartments of 50 m2 each, each with two bedrooms, bathroom, kitchen and living room. Outside, there is a large patio and covered bbq/grill for summer cooking. The house presently has 120 m2 living area and the land plot area is 640 m2.</p>', '', '<p>Nedovr&scaron;ena kuæa, prvi red do mora s prekrasnom prirodnom pla¾om ispred kuæe i pogledom na more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Prizemna kvalitetno graðena kuæa u kamenu s moguæno&scaron;æu daljnje gradnje nalazi se u prekrasnoj uvali nedaleko od trgovina, restorana i kafiæa.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je povr&scaron;ine 120 m2, a nalazi se na parceli povr&scaron;ine 640 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U prizemnom dijelu kuæe se nalaze dva apartmana povr&scaron;ine 50 m2 koja se sastoje od: dvije spavaæe sobe, kupaonice i kuhinje s dnevnim boravkom. Velika natkrivena terasa je s prednje strane i s nje se pru¾a pogled na more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Uz kuæu se nalazi i prostor povr&scaron;ine 20 m2 koji se trenutno koristi kao ljetna kuhinja.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa ima vlastitu gustirnu i crnu jamu.</p>', '<p>We are pleased to offer this unfinished seafront house with beautiful natural  beach just in front.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The &lsquo;heavy&rsquo; building on the ground floor has been  completed and it has been designed to maximise the potential for letting to  tourists.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It consists of two apartments of 50 m2 each, each with two  bedrooms, bathroom, kitchen and living room.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Outside, there is a large  patio and covered bbq/grill for summer cooking.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>This property would be  perfect for the person who can complete the project, and he will find it has  gone up in value much more than the costs involved.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house presently  has 120 m2 living area and the land plot area is 640 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house has  its own water tank and septic tank.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>International Split airport is 30 mins  drive.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For any questions or viewing call out Split office.</p>', '', '961_House-Villa_0.jpg', '961_House-Villa_1.jpg', '961_House-Villa_2.jpg', '961_House-Villa_3.jpg', '961_House-Villa_4.jpg', '961_House-Villa_5.jpg', '961_House-Villa_6.jpg', '961_House-Villa_7.jpg', ''),
(962, 'Maja', 'Vlajèeviæ', '', '091/ 530 2372', '', 'Split', 'Zrinsko- Frankopanska 6', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '450', '0', '76', 1, '290550', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 'November 17, 2014', '<p>Apartman u starogradskoj zgradi u samoj blizini Dioklecijanove palaèe, udaljen svega 4-5 minuta lagane &scaron;etnje. Povr&scaron;ina apartmana je 76 m2, a sastoji se od hodnika, kuhinje sa blagovaonicom, dnevnog boravka, 2 spavaæe sobe, kupatila i 2 balkona. Uz apartman ide i mala ostava povr&scaron;ine cca 5 m2 u podrumu kuæe.</p>', '<p>We are pleased to offer this apartment in an old building near the old town centre and Diocletian''s palace. The apartment size is 76 m2 and it consists of hallway, kitchen with dining room, living room, two bedrooms, bathroom and two balconies. With the apartment goes the small pantry area of approximately 5 m2 in the basement of the house.</p>', '', '<p>Apartman u starogradskoj zgradi u samoj blizini Dioklecijanove palaèe, udaljen svega 4-5 minuta lagane &scaron;etnje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Povr&scaron;ina apartmana je 76 m2, a sastoji se od hodnika, kuhinje sa blagovaonicom, dnevnog boravka, 2 spavaæe sobe, kupatila i 2 balkona.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Uz apartman ide i mala ostava povr&scaron;ine cca 5 m2 u podrumu kuæe.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Zbog odliène lokacije i blizine strogog centra grada, apartman je moguæe koristiti u svrhu turistièkog iznajmljivanja ili za vlastito u¾ivanje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Svi potrebni sadr¾aji nalaze se u blizini, dok je meðunarodni aerodrom udaljen 40 min. vo¾nje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za sve dodatne informacije slobodno nas kontaktirajte.</p>', '<p>We are pleased to offer this apartment in an old building near the old town  centre and Diocletian''s palace.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The apartment size is 76 m2 and it  consists of hallway, kitchen with dining room, living room, two bedrooms,  bathroom and two balconies.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>With the apartment goes the small pantry area of  approximately 5 m2 in the basement of the house.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The apartment is in good condition.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Its location and  proximity to the city centre make it ideal for a private residence or for  tourist visitors to the city.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>All facilities are located nearby, such as  the tourist attractions, markets, bars and restaurants, while the international  airport is 40 minutes driving.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For additional information, please contact  our office in Split.</p>', '', '962_Apartment_0.jpg', '962_Apartment_1.jpg', '962_Apartment_2.jpg', '962_Apartment_3.jpg', '962_Apartment_4.jpg', '962_Apartment_5.jpg', '962_Apartment_6.jpg', '', ''),
(963, 'Lucijan', 'Pupiæ Bakraè', '', '091/ 444 6044', 'l.bakrac@tulipan.hr', 'Trogir', 'Planikovica, Z.U. 5410 ', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '100', '0', '90', 1, '230000', '', 2, 1, 2, 2, 1, 1, 2, 2, 'November 17, 2014', '<p>Luksuzni apartman smje&scaron;ten u novijoj zgradi na sjevernom dijelu otoka Èiova u mirnoj uvali bez buke i prometa. Iz apartmana se pru¾a prekrasan pogled na more i cijelu uvalu. Do mora i prekrasne pla¾e ima svega 100 m, dok se u ureðenom dvori&scaron;tu nalazi zajednièki bazen. Ukupna povr&scaron;ina iznosi 90 m2 (79 m2 + terasa 11 m2).</p>', '<p>We are offering this luxury apartment located in a new building in the northern part of the island Ciovo, in a quiet cove with little noise or traffic. The sea and the beach are only 100 m distant, while the landscaped grounds include an attractive patio area and a private pool for residents only! The total living area is 90 m2 (79 m2 + terrace 11 m2).</p>', '', '<p>Luksuzni apartman smje&scaron;ten u novijoj zgradi na sjevernom dijelu otoka Èiova u mirnoj uvali bez buke i prometa.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Iz apartmana se pru¾a prekrasan pogled na more i cijelu uvalu. Do mora i prekrasne pla¾e ima svega 100 m, dok se u ureðenom dvori&scaron;tu nalazi zajednièki bazen.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ukupna povr&scaron;ina iznosi 90 m2 (79 m2 + terasa 11 m2). Apartmanu jo&scaron; pripada sprema u prizemlju (2,08 m2) i natkriveno parking mjesto sa ju¾ne strane zgrade.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sastoji se od 2 hodnika, dnevnog boravka + kuhinje + blagovaonice, 2 spavaæe sobe, 2 kupaonice i prostrane terase sa prekrasnim pogledom na more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartman je potpuno luksuzno namje&scaron;ten i klimatiziran, stoga je moguæe odmah useliti i u¾ivati u prekrasnom pogledu i okolini.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Mnogobrojne trgovine, restorani, barovi i ostali sadr¾aji se nalaze u blizini stoga je ovo idealno mjesto i za boravak tijekom cijele godine.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Meðunarodni aerodrom udaljen je 20 minuta vo¾nje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Do povijesnog grada Trogira koji æe vas odu&scaron;eviti mnogim zanemitostima i ostalim sadr¾ajima udaljen je 15 minuta vo¾nje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za sva dodatna pitanja molimo da nas kontaktirate.</p>', '<p>We are offering this luxury apartment located in a new building in the northern  part of the island Ciovo, in a quiet cove with little noise or  traffic.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The natural geography of the sloping hill side ensure that  there is a beautiful view of the sea and the bay from the windows and  balcony.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The sea and the beach are only 100 m distant, while the landscaped  grounds include an attractive patio area and a private pool for residents  only!</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The total living area is 90 m2 (79 m2 + terrace 11 m2).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It  consists of two hallways, open plan&nbsp; living room with kitchen and dining area,  two bedrooms, two bathrooms and a spacious terrace overlooking the sea.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The  apartment is luxuriously furnished and with air cons, and it is ready for  immediate habitation.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The apartment also has an extra storage room on the  ground floor (2.08 m2) and a covered parking space from the south side of the  building.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There are numerous shops, restaurants, bars and newly opened  beauty rejuvenation salon nearby, so this is also a good place to stay and relax  any time of the year.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The international airport is 20 minutes  away.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The historic city of Trogir is within a 10 minutes drive.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For any additional questions  please contact us.</p>', '', '963_Apartment_0.jpg', '963_Apartment_1.jpg', '963_Apartment_2.jpg', '963_Apartment_3.jpg', '963_Apartment_4.jpg', '963_Apartment_5.jpg', '963_Apartment_6.jpg', '', ''),
(964, 'Meri', 'Herceg', '', '091/576 3626', '', 'Trogir', 'Rovci, Slatine, Zem 990/ 18 kat-1433/3', 'For sale', 'Land plot', '90', '530', '0', 2, '79500', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 0, 0, 'November 22, 2014', '<p>Graðevinsko zemlji&scaron;te na sjeveroistoènoj strani otoka Èiova, u mirnom dijelu idealnom za izgradnju kuæe sa prostranim dvori&scaron;tem u kojem je moguæe smjetiti i bazen. Udaljenost od mora i pje&scaron;èane pla¾e je cca. 90 m. Ukupna povr&scaron;ina zemlji&scaron;ta iznosi 530 m2 + moguænost kupnje dijela puta. Zemlji&scaron;te se nalazi u mje&scaron;ovitoj, prete¾ito stambenoj zoni, gdje je izgradivost 30 %.</p>', '<p>We are offering this building plot on the north side of the island of Ciovo, in a quiet area ideal for a house with a swimming pool and large garden. It is about 90m from the beach, an area popular with swimmers and families due to the shallow and clear, warm water with little tide. The total land area is 530 m2 with the possibility of buying additional land adjacent, which includes the access road. The land is located in a mixed, mainly residential area, and the planning rules allow that 30% of the plot area can be the footprint of the building.</p>', '', '<p>Graðevinsko zemlji&scaron;te na sjeveroistoènoj strani otoka Èiova, u mirnom dijelu idealnom za izgradnju kuæe sa prostranim dvori&scaron;tem u kojem je moguæe smjetiti i bazen.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Udaljenost od mora i pje&scaron;èane pla¾e je cca. 90 m. Uz du¾ cijele obale prostiru se mnogobrojne prirodno kamenite i pje&scaron;èane pla¾e, dok je moguæe doæi i na ju¾nu stranu gdje se smje&scaron;tena &scaron;uma i skrivene uvale.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ukupna povr&scaron;ina zemlji&scaron;ta iznosi 530 m2 + moguænost kupnje dijela puta.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Zemlji&scaron;te se nalazi u mje&scaron;ovitoj, prete¾ito stambenoj zoni, gdje je izgradivost 30 %.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Moguæe je izgraditi kuæu koja bi se sastojala od podruma, prizemlja, 1. i 2. kata.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Do grada Trogira potrebno je 10 minuta vo¾nje, dok je do meðunarodnog aerodroma potrebno 15 min.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Grad Trogir odu&scaron;evit æe vas prekrasnim ulicama, starim kamenim kuæama i mnogim znamenitosima. Jednako tako i bogatom gastronomskom ponudom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za sva dodatna pitanja molimo da nas kontaktirate.</p>', '<p>We are offering this building plot on the north side of the island of Ciovo, in  a quiet area ideal for a house with a swimming pool and large garden.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It  is about 90m from the beach, an area popular with swimmers and families due to  the shallow and clear, warm water with little tide.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The total land area  is 530 m2 with the possibility of buying additional land adjacent, which  includes the access road.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The land is located in a mixed, mainly residential  area, and the planning rules allow that 30% of the plot area can be the  footprint of the building.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is possible to build a substantial house  consisting of basement, ground, first and second floor.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The surrounding  area is natural pine woods with native shrubs, such as rosemary and sage, with a  low density holiday villas. A short walk away are the nearest shops, and coffee  bars.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The town of Trogir is 10 minutes away, while to the international  airport takes 15 minutes.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Town of Trogir &ndash;a UNESCO heritage site- will  delight you with beautiful old alleys, old stone houses and many other hidden  treasures. Likewise, the rich gastronomic offer from some of the best  restaurants on the coast are an added draw for the area.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For any  additional questions please contact us and chat to our very helpful staff in our  office in Split.</p>', '', '964_Land-plot_0.jpg', '964_Land-plot_1.jpg', '964_Land-plot_2.jpg', '964_Land-plot_3.jpg', '964_Land-plot_4.jpg', '', '', '', '');
INSERT INTO `nekretnina` (`id`, `ime`, `prezime`, `telefon`, `mobitel`, `e_mail`, `lokacija_id`, `adresa`, `status_id`, `vrsta_id`, `udaljenost`, `povrsina`, `stambenapovrsina`, `display`, `cijena`, `cijenatocka`, `ponuda_tjedna`, `new_built`, `must_sell`, `prvi_red_do_mora`, `pogled_na_more`, `bazen`, `broj_soba`, `broj_kupatila`, `datum`, `title_hr`, `title_en`, `title_ge`, `opis_hr`, `opis_en`, `opis_ge`, `PropertyImageURL0`, `PropertyImageURL1`, `PropertyImageURL2`, `PropertyImageURL3`, `PropertyImageURL4`, `PropertyImageURL5`, `PropertyImageURL6`, `PropertyImageURL7`, `PropertyImageURL8`) VALUES
(965, 'Marjo', 'Muslim', '', '091/ 385 0510', '', 'Split', 'Duilovo- povi¹e hotela Zg', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '500', '0', '89', 1, '260000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 1, 'November 22, 2014', '<p>Apartman u jednoj od najluksuzijih zgrada u gradu Splitu koja je smje&scaron;tena u istoènom dijelu u mirnom dijelu u blizini prekrasne pje&scaron;èane pla¾e. Zgrada je luksuzno opremljena sa saunom i fitness centrom u prizemlju i zajednièkim bazenom u ureðenom dvori&scaron;tu. Ukupna povr&scaron;ina iznosi 89 m2, a sastoji se od hodnika, dnevnog dijela + blagovaonice, kuhinje, 2 spavaæe sobe, kupaonice i loggie. Apartman je smje&scaron;ten na 1.katu, dok mu je orjentacija sjeverozapadna.</p>', '<p>We are pleased to offer this luxurious apartment in one of the most prestigious buildings in Split. (Apart from the 2000 year old Roman Palace). The apartment is located on the 1st floor, northwest orientation. The building is luxuriously equipped with a sauna and fitness center on the ground floor and a private swimming pool in landscaped courtyard for residents only. The total area is 89 m2.</p>', '', '<p>Apartman u jednoj od najluksuzijih zgrada u gradu Splitu koja je smje&scaron;tena u istoènom dijelu u mirnom dijelu u blizini prekrasne pje&scaron;èane pla¾e.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Do samog centra Splita i Dioklecijanove palaèe potrebno je 20 minuta vo¾nje. Centar æe vas odu&scaron;eviti sa mnogim zanimljivostima, bogatom kulturnom ba&scaron;tinom i gastronomskom ponudom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Zgrada je luksuzno opremljena sa saunom i fitness centrom u prizemlju i zajednièkim bazenom u ureðenom dvori&scaron;tu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ukupna povr&scaron;ina iznosi 89 m2, a sastoji se od hodnika, dnevnog dijela + blagovaonice, kuhinje, 2 spavaæe sobe, kupaonice i loggie.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartman je smje&scaron;ten na 1.katu, dok mu je orjentacija sjeverozapadna.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U cijenu stana je ukljuèena sprema i parkirno mjesto u podzemnoj gara¾i.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Osim luksuznog ureðenja i svi ostalih popratnih sadr¾aja, odmah do zgrade se nalazi teniski teren &scaron;to je jo&scaron; jedna prednost ove nekretnine.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Posebno izabran tim struènjaka zaslu¾an je za ovu jednistvenu nekretninu koja æe zadovoljiti i najzahtjevnije ukuse.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ovo je jedinstvena prilika ¾elite li u¾ivati u luksuznom apartmanu u najpopularnijem gradu u Dalmaciji.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Meðunarodni aerodrom udaljen je 40 minuta vo¾nje, dok je grad Split trajektnom linijom povezan sa svim otocima.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za sva dodatna pitanja molimo da nas kontaktirate.</p>', '<p>We are pleased to offer this luxurious apartment in one of the most prestigious  buildings in Split. (Apart from the 2000 year old Roman Palace).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is located  in a quiet area on the eastern side of the city behind the long pebble  beach.&nbsp;The apartment is located on the 1st floor, northwest  orientation.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The building is luxuriously equipped with a sauna and fitness  center on the ground floor and a private swimming pool in landscaped courtyard  for residents only.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The total area is 89 m2 and consists of a hall, a modern  style open plan family living + dining room, kitchen, two bedrooms, bathroom and  large covered balcony.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It has been furnished and decorated with the highest  quality materials available, and the result is a very pleasing stylish living  space.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The price also includes storage and parking area in the  underground garage.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Besides the luxurious interior and all other  supporting facilities, there is an all weather tennis court next to the  building.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Every effort has been made by the designers and architects to  provide the ultimate apartment in term of comfort and practicality and we are  keen to promote this as a unique opportunity to purchase a luxury apartment in  the most popular city in Dalmatia.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The old town, Riva and the palace are  20 minute&rsquo;s drive from the property, and here are most of the cities numerous  tourist attractions.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The international airport is 40 minutes drive away,  while the city of Split by ferry is connected with all the islands.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For  any additional questions please contact us in our happy little office.</p>', '', '965_Apartment_0.jpg', '965_Apartment_1.jpg', '965_Apartment_2.jpg', '965_Apartment_3.jpg', '965_Apartment_4.jpg', '965_Apartment_5.jpg', '', '', ''),
(966, 'Mate', 'Vukoja', 'kljuc - 098 212 974', '098/ 275 333  Pa¹ko', '', 'Split', 'Zagrebaèka 13', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '300', '0', '131', 1, '348000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 3, 1, 'November 22, 2014', '<p>Atraktivan veliki apartman na 2. katu starogradske zgrade u samom centru, udaljen 1 minutu hoda od Dioklecijanove palaèe. Apartman je povr&scaron;ine 131 m2 + loða 4m2 + balkon 8m2, a sastoji se od hodnika, kuhinje sa blagovaonicom, trpezarije, dnevnog boravka, kupatila, wc-a i ostave.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>We are very pleased to offer this attractive and large apartment on the second floor of an old town building in the city centre. The apartment has a living area of 131 m2 with an additional two balconies (4m2 and 8m2), and consists of:&nbsp;hall, kitchen with dining room, spacious living room, bathroom, toilet and a plenty of storage. The property is well maintained and decorated, and in no need of redecorating, apart from through personal tastes.</p>', '', '<p>Atraktivan veliki apartman na 2. katu starogradske zgrade u samom centru, udaljen 1 minutu hoda od Dioklecijanove palaèe. Riva je udaljena svega &nbsp;5 minuta lagane &scaron;etnje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartman je povr&scaron;ine 131 m2 + loða 4m2 + balkon 8m2, a sastoji se od hodnika, kuhinje sa blagovaonicom, trpezarije, dnevnog boravka, kupatila, wc-a i ostave.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U podrumu zgrade je ostava velièine cca 5 m2 koja pripada apartmanu te dio potkrovlja.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>S obzirom na odlièan polo¾aj ima turistièki potencijal ali je idealan i za vlastito u¾ivanje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Meðunarodni aerodrom udaljen je 40 min. vo¾nje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za sve dodatne informacije i razgledavanje nekretnine stojimo vam na raspolaganju.</p>', '<p>We are very pleased to offer this attractive and large apartment on the second  floor of an old town building in the city centre.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The apartment has a  living area of 131 m2 with an additional two balconies (4m2 and 8m2), and  consists of:&nbsp;hall, kitchen with dining room, spacious living room, bathroom,  toilet and a plenty of storage.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>In the basement there is an extra storage  room of approximately 5 m2, which belongs to the apartment, and part of the  attic may also be used for private storage.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property is well maintained  and decorated, and in no need of redecorating, apart from through personal  tastes.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Given the excellent location, this property has tourist potential  but it would also be very desirable for permanent living.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The international  airport is 40 minutes driving. Maybe a little quicker on quiet days.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For  additional information or a visiting tour of this apartment, please call our  Split office.</p>', '', '966_Apartment_0.jpg', '966_Apartment_1.jpg', '966_Apartment_2.jpg', '966_Apartment_3.jpg', '966_Apartment_4.jpg', '966_Apartment_5.jpg', '966_Apartment_6.jpg', '966_Apartment_7.jpg', '966_Apartment_8.jpg'),
(967, 'Zorica', 'Salihod¾iæ', '', '', '', 'Hvar', 'Rudina -Hvar', 'For sale', 'Old stone house', '1000', '70', '95', 2, '115000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 3, 2, 'November 22, 2014', '<p>Kamena renovirana kuæa sa dvori&scaron;tem od ca.40m2, terasama i vanjskim ro&scaron;tiljem u dvori&scaron;tu, smje&scaron;tena u malom selu 1 km udaljena od mora. Ukupna stambena povr&scaron;ina kuæe je 95 m2, a sastoji se od tri eta¾e povezane unutarnjim stubi&scaron;tem. Kuæa je kompletno renovirana, ima svu infrastrukturu, te je spremna za ¾ivljenje ili iznajmljivanje. Orjientacija je jugo-zapad. Iz potkrovlja ima pogled na more i zalazak sunca.</p>\r\n<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;">CIJENA SNI®ENA SA 165.000 EURO!!</span></p>', '<p>We are pleased to offer this renovated stone house in a small village 1 km away from the sea. The total living area is 95 m2 on three floors connected by an internal staircase. The house has been completely renovated, with new electrics, new plumbing and redecorated. It is in a condition to rent or live in immediately. It has a south-west orientation and from the loft there is a view of the sea, towards the sunset, and the natural woods and fields.</p>\r\n<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;">PRICE REDUCED FROM 165.000 EURO!!</span></p>', '', '<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;"><strong>CIJENA SNI®ENA SA 165.000 EURO!!</strong></span></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kamena renovirana kuæa sa dvori&scaron;tem od ca.40m2, terasama i vanjskim ro&scaron;tiljem u dvori&scaron;tu, smje&scaron;tena u malom selu 1 km udaljena od mora.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ukupna stambena povr&scaron;ina kuæe je 95 m2, a sastoji se od tri eta¾e povezane unutarnjim stubi&scaron;tem.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U prizemlju je dnevni boravak sa kuhinjom i izlazom na dvori&scaron;te, a na katovima su sobe s balkonima.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je kompletno renovirana, ima svu infrastrukturu, te je spremna za ¾ivljenje ili iznajmljivanje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Orjientacija je jugo-zapad.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Iz potkrovlja ima pogled na more i zalazak sunca.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za sva pitaja ili dogovor oko razgledavanja stojimo na usluzi u CPS uredu u gradu Hvaru.</p>', '<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;"><strong>PRICE REDUCED FROM 165.000 EURO!!</strong></span></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>We are pleased to offer this renovated stone house in a small village 1 km  away from the sea.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The total living area is 95 m2 on three floors  connected by an internal staircase.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The ground floor is a living room and  kitchen with access to the yard, and on the upper floors are bedrooms with  balconies.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house has been completely renovated, with new electrics,  new plumbing and redecorated. It is in a condition to rent or live in immediately.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The outside of the building is also in good condition and  checked to ensure no repairs are necessary.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It has a south-west  orientation and from the loft there is a view of the sea, towards the  sunset, and the natural woods and fields.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The village has shops, bars,  and other facilities and the nearest larger town with restaurants is 10  minutes drive.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact our office on Hvar island to arrange a tour  of the property.</p>', '', '967_Old-stone-house_0.jpg', '967_Old-stone-house_1.jpg', '967_Old-stone-house_2.jpg', '967_Old-stone-house_3.jpg', '967_Old-stone-house_4.jpg', '967_Old-stone-house_5.jpg', '967_Old-stone-house_6.jpg', '967_Old-stone-house_7.jpg', '967_Old-stone-house_8.jpg'),
(968, 'Asja', 'Lujak', '098/ 328 259 Ana', '095/ 835 58 56 ', '', 'Split', 'Nazorov prilaz 20', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '600', '0', '100', 1, '190000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 3, 1, 'November 30, 2014', '<p>Apartman povr&scaron;ine 100 m2 na 2. katu starogradske zgrade, od Rive i Dioklecijanove Palaèe udaljen 10 minuta laganog hoda, a park &scaron;uma Marjan 5 minuta. Sastoji se od hodnika, kuhinja + blagovaonica + dnevni boravak, 3 spavaæe sobe, 2 balkona, kupatila, ostave i 2 balkona.</p>\r\n<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;">CIJENA SNI®ENA S 205.000 EUR!!</span></p>', '<p>We are pleased to offer this spacious and attractive 3 bedroom apartment near the centre of town. It is situated between the Palace and the Marjan park, walking distance to either, on the second floor of an attractive block built in Austria-Hungary days. The apartment is a massive 100m sq, modernised with heating systems, double glazed windows, and many other features.</p>\r\n<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;">PRICE REDUCED FROM 205.000 EUR!!</span></p>', '', '<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;"><strong>CIJENA SNI®ENA S 205.000 EUR!!</strong></span></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartman povr&scaron;ine 100 m2 na 2. katu starogradske zgrade, od Rive i Dioklecijanove Palaèe udaljen 10 minuta laganog hoda, a park &scaron;uma Marjan 5 minuta.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sastoji se od hodnika, kuhinja + blagovaonica + dnevni boravak, 3 spavaæe sobe, 2 balkona, kupatila, ostave i 2 balkona.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Javni parking je udaljen 50 m od apartmana, a pristup vozilom je moguæ do samog ulaza.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Svi potrebni sadr¾aji nalaze se u blizini.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Meðunarodni aerodrom udaljen je 45 min vo¾nje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za sve dodatne informacije stojimo vam na raspolaganju.</p>', '<p><strong><span style="text-decoration: underline;">PRICE REDUCED FROM 205.000 EUR!!</span><br /></strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>We are pleased to offer this spacious and attractive 3 bedroom apartment near  the centre of town.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is situated between the Palace and the Marjan  park, walking distance to either, on the second floor of an attractive block  built in Austria-Hungary days.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The large wide stair case and marble floors  give a clue to the former status of this block when it was built.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The  apartment is a massive 100m sq, modernised with heating systems, double glazed  windows, and many other features, but the old wooden floor has been retained.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It has been well decorated and well maintained and needs little additional  work.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The design inside the proper has a large open plan kitchen and  dining area, 3 double bedrooms, bathroom, separate utility room, and two  balconies with commanding views above the street and to the park.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The  surrounding area has street parking, markets, shops, bars and restaurants, as  well as being in walking distance to all the tourist attractions in the city,  and the ferry terminal, bus station etc..</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact our office in Split  to arrange to visit this property. It is an excellent opportunity to buy a large  central apartment at a very modest price.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The international airport is 45  minutes away.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For additional information, please feel free to contact  our Split office.</p>', '', '968_Apartment_0.jpg', '968_Apartment_1.jpg', '968_Apartment_2.jpg', '968_Apartment_3.jpg', '968_Apartment_4.jpg', '968_Apartment_5.jpg', '968_Apartment_6.jpg', '', ''),
(969, 'Mario', '©estan-Loliæ', '091/117 6086', '095/ 396 3382', '', 'Split', 'Gunduliæeva 2', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '600', '0', '118', 2, '290000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 4, 2, 'November 30, 2014', '<p>Apartman na 2. katu starogradske zgrade, od Rive i Dioklecijanove palaèe udaljen cca 400 m. Apartman ukupne povr&scaron;ine 118m2 se sastoji od hodnika, dnevnog boravka, kuhinje + blagovaonice, 4 sobe, kupatila, wc-a i 3 balkona. Apartmanu je potrebno preureðenje.</p>', '<p>We are offering this large apartment in one of the many grand blocks built around the outside of the Palace about 100 years ago. It is 400m from the palace and the waterfront, and situated on the second floor. The staircase is built from marble and is a very attractive entrance to the building. The apartment is a massive 118m sq and it consists of 4 bedrooms, a hall, living room and spacious kitchen/dining room, bathroom, separate wc and 3 balconies.</p>', '', '<p>Apartman na 2. katu starogradske zgrade, od Rive i Dioklecijanove palaèe udaljen cca 400 m.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ako ¾elite vlastitu oazu u jednom od najpopularnijih gradova u Dalmaciji, ovo je idealna nekretnina za vas. Takoðer se zbog odliènog potencijala mo¾e koristiti i u svrhu turistièkog iznajmljivanja.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartman ukupne povr&scaron;ine 118m2 se sastoji od hodnika, dnevnog boravka, kuhinje + blagovaonice, 4 sobe, kupatila, wc-a i 3 balkona.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartmanu je potrebno preureðenje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Prekrasan park je udaljen svega 30 metara od apartmana. Javni parking je udaljen 50 m od apartmana, a pristup vozilom je moguæ do samog ulaza.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Svi potrebni sadr¾aji nalaze se u blizini.</p>\r\n<p>Meðunarodni aerodrom udaljen je 45 min vo¾nje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za sve dodatne informacije stojimo vam na raspolaganju.</p>', '<p>We are offering this large apartment in one of the many grand blocks built  around the outside of the Palace about 100 years ago.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is 400m from the  palace and the waterfront, and situated on the second floor. The staircase is  built from marble and is a very attractive entrance to the building.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The  apartment is a massive 118m sq and it consists of 4 bedrooms, a hall, living  room and spacious kitchen/dining room, bathroom, separate wc and 3  balconies.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>the internal condition of the property is fine but most new owners  would probably like to redecorate and maybe add some extra modern  furnishings.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The surrounding area allows parking 50m from the property,  but there is access for unloading etc, and there is a park 30m from the  block.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>All the main tourism attractions in the city are within walking  distance and so are the ferries, most of the best restaurants and bars, markets  and shops.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The airport is about 30 minutes away.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact  the office in Split to arrange to visit this property.</p>', '', '969_Apartment_0.jpg', '969_Apartment_1.jpg', '969_Apartment_2.jpg', '969_Apartment_3.jpg', '969_Apartment_4.jpg', '969_Apartment_5.jpg', '969_Apartment_6.jpg', '969_Apartment_7.jpg', ''),
(970, 'Radmila', 'D¾udoviæ', '022 559 355', '', '', 'Rogoznica', 'Rogoznica, Miline 128. k.è 921/1', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '10', '340', '350', 1, '395000', '', 2, 2, 2, 1, 1, 2, 8, 4, 'November 30, 2014', '<p>Kuæa u prvom redu do mora s pogledom na more i marinu. S terasa kuæe pru¾a se krasan pogled na more i cijelu okolicu. Kuæa je povr&scaron;ine 350 m2, a nalazi se na parceli èija povr&scaron;ina iznosi 340 m2. Kuæa je podijeljena na 4 apartmanske cjeline. Dva apartmana su trosobna, a dva su jednosobna. Svaki apartman ima zasebni ulaz. Ispred kuæe je parking s tri parking mjesta.</p>', '<p>We are pleased to offer this complete detached house in the first line of property to the sea. The house is near the centre of the village, just walking distance from the restaurants, bars and shops, as well as the marina. The house is on two floors, a total of 350m sq, and is divided into 4 apartments for tourists. Two apartments are one bedroom, and the other two have three bedrooms, each with a separate entrance.</p>', '', '<p>Kuæa u prvom redu do mora s pogledom na more i marinu. S terasa kuæe pru¾a se krasan pogled na more i cijelu okolicu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U blizini kuæe nalazi se centar mjesta sa svim turistièkim sadr¾ajima i ponudama.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je povr&scaron;ine 350 m2, a nalazi se na parceli èija povr&scaron;ina iznosi 340 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je podijeljena na 4 apartmanske cjeline. Dva apartmana su trosobna, a dva su jednosobna. Svaki apartman ima zasebni ulaz.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Trosobni apartman se sastoji od tri spavaæe sobe, kuhinje, dnevne sobe i kupaonice.</p>\r\n<p>Jednosobni apartman se sastoji od jedne spavaæe sobe, dnevne sobe s kuhinjom, blagovaonicom i kupaonicom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Oko kuæe je mali vrt sa zasaðenim cvijeæem.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ispred kuæe je parking s tri parking mjesta.</p>', '<p>We are pleased to offer this complete detached house in the first line of  property to the sea.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house is near the centre of the village, just  walking distance from the restaurants, bars and shops, as well as the  marina.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house is on two floors, a total of 350m sq, and is divided into 4  apartments for tourists.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Two apartments are one bedroom, and the other two  have three bedrooms, each with a separate entrance.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The apartments with  three bedrooms have a kitchen and separate lounge, and bathroom, and the one  bedroom properties have a kitchen with dining area, and lounge.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>All the  apartments are well decorated and looked after, and outside there are balconies  upstairs with superb views while downstairs on the terrace are views across the  marina.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There is parking for three vehicles, and the remainder of the  garden is planted with shrubs and flowers.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact our office for  more information.</p>', '', '970_House-Villa_0.jpg', '970_House-Villa_1.jpg', '970_House-Villa_2.jpg', '970_House-Villa_3.jpg', '970_House-Villa_4.jpg', '970_House-Villa_5.jpg', '970_House-Villa_6.jpg', '', ''),
(971, 'Mandica', '®upanoviæ', '022 559 286', '091 944 27 30', '', 'Rogoznica', 'Rogoznica, Miline 72, K.è. 1220 KO Rogoznica', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '10', '480', '260', 1, '650000', '', 2, 2, 2, 1, 1, 2, 7, 3, 'November 30, 2014', '<p>Samostojeæa kuæa koja se nalazi u prvom redu do mora, s pogledom na more i marinu, a u neposrednoj blizini trgovina, restorana i kafiæa. Povr&scaron;ina kuæe iznosi 260 m2, a nalazi se na parceli povr&scaron;ine 480 m2. Kuæa se sastoji od prizemlja i prvog kata. Kuæa ima ishoðenu graðevinsku dozvolu za izgradnju jo&scaron; jedne eta¾e. Prodaje se s vezom za brod koji je na 20 m udaljenosti od kuæe. Oko kuæe je vrt s mediteranskim biljem. Ispred kuæe je parking s tri parking mjesta.</p>', '<p>We are offering this detached house, located in the seafront, overlooking the sea and marina, and conveniently situated close to the village centre. The living area is 260 m2 and the house is located on a plot of 480 m2. The house consists of ground and first floor. The house is unusual for Croatia in that it has a private boat mooring just 20m from the property. The garden around the property has been planted with a variety of native plants, flowers and shrubs designed for low maintenance.</p>', '', '<p>Samostojeæa kuæa koja se nalazi u prvom redu do mora, s pogledom na more i marinu, a u neposrednoj blizini trgovina, restorana i kafiæa.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Povr&scaron;ina kuæe iznosi 260 m2, a nalazi se na parceli povr&scaron;ine 480 m2. Kuæa se sastoji od prizemlja i prvog kata.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U prizemlju je trosoban stan s tri spavaæe sobe, dnevnim boravkom, kuhinjom i kupaonicom. Loða koja se nalazi na prizemlju pru¾a idealno mjesto za odmor s pogledom na more. U prizemlju se nalazi i studio apartman s posebnim ulazom. Kuæa ima u prizemlju konobu i ljetnu kuhinju.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na prvom katu se nalaze tri spavaæe sobe, kuhinja, dnevni boravak, kupaonica i velika loða s koje se pru¾a pogled na more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa ima ishoðenu graðevinsku dozvolu za izgradnju jo&scaron; jedne eta¾e.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Prodaje se s vezom za brod koji je na 20 m udaljenosti od kuæe.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Oko kuæe je vrt s mediteranskim biljem. Ispred kuæe je parking s tri parking mjesta.</p>', '<p>We are offering this detached house, located in the seafront, overlooking the  sea and marina, and conveniently situated close to the village  centre.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The living area is 260 m2 and the house is located on a plot of  480 m2. The house consists of ground and first floor.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The ground floor is  an apartment with three bedrooms, living room, kitchen and bathroom. There is a  covered patio located on the ground floor which provides the ideal place for  relaxation with a sea view.&nbsp;On the ground floor there is also a studio  apartment with separate entrance.&nbsp;Also on the ground floor is a cellar area  with a substantial BBQ and summer kitchen.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the first floor there are three  bedrooms, kitchen, living room, bathroom and a large balcony with a view of the  sea, and the marina.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house is unusual for Croatia in that it has a  private boat mooring just 20m from the property.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The garden around the  property has been planted with a variety of native plants, flowers and shrubs  designed for low maintenance, and there are three parking spaces off the  road.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The airport is 30 minutes driving, Trogir is 20 minutes with many  fabulous restaurants, and Split 1 hour.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact the office to  arrange to visit this property.</p>', '', '971_House-Villa_0.jpg', '971_House-Villa_1.jpg', '971_House-Villa_2.jpg', '971_House-Villa_3.jpg', '971_House-Villa_4.jpg', '971_House-Villa_5.jpg', '971_House-Villa_6.jpg', '', ''),
(972, 'Marin', 'Meiæ', '', '095 513 0169', 'stikadent89@gmail.com', 'Sibenik', 'Pirovac, Petra Draganiæa Vranèiæa 41, k.è. 3458', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '10', '500', '462', 1, '560000', '', 2, 2, 2, 1, 1, 2, 9, 3, 'November 30, 2014', '<p>Prekrasna kuæa, prvi red do mora na svega 10 m od pla¾e u tradicionalnom dalmatinskom mjestu udaljenom 20-ak kilometara od &Scaron;ibenika. Povr&scaron;ina kuæe iznosi 462 m2, a nalazi se na parceli povr&scaron;ine 500 m2. Kuæa je podijeljena na prizemlje, prvi i drugi kat. U kuæi se nalazi: 9 spavaæih soba, 3 kupaonice, 3 kuhinje, 2 ostave i 3 dnevna boravka i u potpunosti namje&scaron;tena. Izgraðena je 2003 godine od visoko kvalitetnih materijala (mramor, kamen, drvo, 100% rostfrei-zbog soli).</p>', '<p>We are offering this large waterside villa with nine bedrooms on the edge of a charming Dalmatian village. It is just 12 m from the beach and clear water, with a quiet road in front of the garden. The property is a very attractive house on 3 floors, each a separate apartment. The total floor space is 460m sq and the land plot is 500m sq.&nbsp;It was constructed in 2003, and when it was first built the very best materials were used.</p>', '', '<p>Prekrasna kuæa, prvi red do mora na svega 10 m od pla¾e u tradicionalnom dalmatinskom mjestu udaljenom 20-ak kilometara od &Scaron;ibenika.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Povr&scaron;ina kuæe iznosi 462 m2, a nalazi se na parceli povr&scaron;ine 500 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je podijeljena na prizemlje, prvi i drugi kat. U kuæi se nalazi: 9 spavaæih soba, 3 kupaonice, 3 kuhinje, 2 ostave i 3 dnevna boravka i u potpunosti namje&scaron;tena.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Izgraðena je 2003 godine od visoko kvalitetnih materijala (mramor, kamen, drvo, 100% rostfrei-zbog soli).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Pored kuæe se nalazi posebna kuæica za centralno grijanje. U vrtu oko kuæe nalazi se mediteransko bilje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ispred se nalazi parking sa 7 sedam parkirnih mjesta.</p>', '<p>We are offering this large waterside villa with nine bedrooms on the edge of a  charming Dalmatian village.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is just 12 m from the beach and clear water,  with a quiet road in front of the garden.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property is a very  attractive house on 3 floors, each a separate apartment. Each floor has a  kitchen, three bedrooms, bathroom and lounge. It is fully furnished and ready  for its continued use by tourists.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It was constructed in 2003, and when  it was first built the very best materials were used, with little regard to  costs. The steel fencing around the property was ''stainless steel'' and used to  prevent sea corrosion, and marble and hard woods were used where necessary to  keep up the luxurious feel.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The total floor space is 460m sq and the land  plot is 500m sq.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The gardens around the property were planted with  appropriate Mediterranean plants and the drive at the front comfortably has 7  parking spaces.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The walk to the centre of the village, along the shore  path, takes a few minutes and here are bars, shops, and caf&eacute;s.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please  contact our office in Split for more information and to arrange to visit this  property.</p>', '', '972_House-Villa_0.jpg', '972_House-Villa_1.jpg', '972_House-Villa_2.jpg', '972_House-Villa_3.jpg', '972_House-Villa_4.jpg', '972_House-Villa_5.jpg', '972_House-Villa_6.jpg', '972_House-Villa_7.jpg', '972_House-Villa_8.jpg'),
(973, 'Kre¹o', 'Kri¹to', '', '091/6072-961', 'kreso.kristo@gmail.com', 'Hvar', 'Hvar, Sv.Nedelja, 1187/7 k.o. Svirèe', 'For sale', 'Land plot', '150', '501', '0', 2, '80000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 0, 0, 'November 30, 2014', '<p>Graðevinsko zemlji&scaron;te na ju¾noj strani otoka Hvara! Sada&scaron;nje stanje zemlji&scaron;ta je maslinik sa 12 maslina u stanju pune rodnosti. Prema Urbanistièkom planu grada Hvara spada u neizgraðenu graðevinsku zonu. Stupanj izgraðenosti 25% graðevinske èestice. Visina gradnje: Pd+Pr+K+Po (podrum, prizemlje, kat i izgradivo potkrovlje). Udaljenost od mora 150.</p>', '<p>We are offering this substantial plot of building land on the south side of the island. The current state of the land is an olive grove with 12 olive trees but it has in fact been designated ''building land'' and is within the construction zone. It is an unusually large plot 501m sq, with water present, and the other services nearby ready for connection. This is a rare opportunity - hurry while stocks last!</p>', '', '<p>Graðevinsko zemlji&scaron;te na ju¾noj strani otoka Hvara!</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sada&scaron;nje stanje zemlji&scaron;ta je maslinik sa 12 maslina u stanju pune rodnosti.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Namjena: graðevinska, a prema Urbanistièkom planu grada Hvara spada u neizgraðenu graðevinsku zonu. Stupanj izgraðenosti 25% graðevinske èestice. Visina gradnje: Pd+Pr+K+Po (podrum, prizemlje, kat i izgradivo potkrovlje).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Udaljenost od mora 150.</p>\r\n<p>Udaljenost od pla¾e na slici 5 minuta pje&scaron;ice.</p>\r\n<p>Udaljenost od marine 3 minute pje&scaron;ice</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Komunalije: sve dostupno, a voda je veæ prikljuèena na gradili&scaron;tu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Udaljenost od Hvara je 17 km, cestom koja je do uvale prokopana kao makadam, a prema planu na proljeæe bi zapoèelo asfaltiranje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za sva pitanje ili dogovor oko razgledavanja stojimo vam na usluzi u CPS uredu u gradu Hvaru.</p>', '<p>We are offering this substantial plot of building land on the south side of  the island.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The current state of the land is an olive grove with 12 olive  trees but it has in fact been designated ''building land'' and is within the construction zone.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is an unusually large plot 501m sq, with water  present, and the other services nearby ready for connection.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The road is  currently a gravel track but that is to be improved in 2015.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The development  allowed is 25% of the plot and the height allowed is 4 levels, if one is a  ''basement''.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The sea and beach is 5 minutes walk (150m), and the marina is  also a similar walk.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The town of Hvar is about 10 minutes  driving.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>This is a rare opportunity - hurry while stocks  last!</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please call our office on the island to arrange to visit this  location.</p>', '', '973_Land-plot_0.jpg', '973_Land-plot_1.jpg', '973_Land-plot_2.jpg', '973_Land-plot_3.jpg', '', '', '', '', ''),
(974, 'Vice', 'Dodig', '', '099/3122101', 'vice.dodig@gmail.com', 'Split', 'Rosveltova 26', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '200', '0', '210', 1, '695000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 4, 3, 'November 30, 2014', '<p>Prekrasna luksuzno ureðena kuæa u predivnom mirnom dijelu grada, udaljena od mora i prekrasnih pla¾a svega 200 metara. Kuæa je u bloku, povr&scaron;ine 210 m2, a sastoji se od 3 eta¾e po 55m2 i potkrovlja od 35m2. Gara¾a sa jednim gara¾nim mjestom ulazi u cijenu kuæe. Kuæa je graðena u modernom stilu i sa kvalitetnim materijalima i ima centralno i solarno grijanje.</p>', '<p>We are offering this beautiful luxury house 200m from the beach within walking distance of the Riva and the Palace. The house is 210 m2 and consists of 3 floors of 55m2 each and 35m2 loft. The condition of the house is excellent and ready for immediate living. There is a garage included in the price of the house. The house was built in a modern style and with good quality materials and has several features such as central heating and solar panels.</p>', '', '<p>Prekrasna luksuzno ureðena kuæa u predivnom mirnom dijelu grada, udaljena od mora i prekrasnih pla¾a svega 200 metara.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je u bloku, povr&scaron;ine 210 m2, a sastoji se od 3 eta¾e po 55m2 i potkrovlja od 35m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Podrum se sastoji od kuhinje, ostave, dnevnog boravka za dru¾enje i zabave,wc-a i kotlovnice.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U prizemlju je predulaz, kuhinja sa velikim dnevnim boravkom i wc. Iz prizemlja je izlaz u vrt povr&scaron;ine 70 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na prvom katu su dvije spavaæe sobe sa kupatilom te braèna soba sa svojim kupatilom. Svaka soba ima svoju terasu sa prekrasnim pogledom na more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartman u potkrovlju se sastoji od sobe sa kupatilom i radnog prostora, takoðer sa terasom i prekrasnim pogledom na more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Gara¾a sa jednim gara¾nim mjestom ulazi u cijenu kuæe.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je graðena u modernom stilu i sa kvalitetnim materijalima i ima centralno i solarno grijanje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>More i pla¾e su udaljene svega 5 minuta, a Riva i Dioklecijanova palaèa 15 minuta laganog hoda.</p>\r\n<p>Meðunarodni aerodrom udaljen je 40 min. vo¾nje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za sve dodatne informacije i razgledavanje nekretnine stojimo vam na raspolaganju.</p>', '<p>We are offering this beautiful luxury house 200m from the beach within walking distance of the Riva and the Palace.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house is 210 m2 and consists of 3 floors of 55m2 each and 35m2 loft.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The basement consists of a kitchen, a living room, toilets and boiler room.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the ground floor is hallway, kitchen with large living room and toilet.&nbsp;The ground floor has a garden of 70 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the first floor are two bedrooms with a bathroom and double bedroom with its own bathroom. Each room has its own terrace with a beautiful view of the sea.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The attic apartment has one bedroom with a bathroom and working area. It also has a balcony with a fabulous view over the town and an unobstructed view of the sea.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The condition of the house is excellent and ready for immediate living.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There is a garage included in the price of the house.The house was built in a modern style and with good quality materials and has several features such as central heating and solar panels.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The sea and beaches are only 5 minutes walk, and almost of the tourist attractions in the town, markets and ferry terminal are all within a short walk.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The international airport is 40 min. driving.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For additional information and a tour of the property please contact the office in Split.</p>', '', '974_House-Villa_0.jpg', '974_House-Villa_1.jpg', '974_House-Villa_2.jpg', '974_House-Villa_3.jpg', '974_House-Villa_4.jpg', '974_House-Villa_5.jpg', '974_House-Villa_6.jpg', '974_House-Villa_7.jpg', '974_House-Villa_8.jpg'),
(975, 'Claus', 'Schmidt', '', 'Boris Dusper 095 825 0130', 'c.schmidt@3si.at', 'Rogoznica', 'Zeèevo, Rtiæ, K.è. 1895 Rogoznica', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '15', '380', '150', 1, '750000', '', 2, 2, 2, 1, 1, 2, 3, 2, 'December 2, 2014', '<p>Samostojeæa kuæa u prvom redu do mora na svega par metara od prirodne pla¾e, s vlastitim pristupom istoj. Kuæa se nalazi u prekrasnoj mirnoj uvali ali istovremeno nedaleko od trgovina i kafiæa. Povr&scaron;ina kuæe iznosi 150 m2, a nalazi se na parceli povr&scaron;ine 380 m2. Kuæa se sastoji od dva kata. Oko kuæe je lijepo ureðen vrt sa dvije palme i mediteranskim biljem. U sklopu okuænice su i dva parking mjesta.</p>', '<p>We are offering this stylish, modern house, just in front of the shore near Rogoznica. It is situated on the shore with a private entrance to the beach at the bottom of the garden. It is a very quiet haven in a wonderful tranquil bay but around the corner there are shops, bars and other convenient facilities for tourists. The residential area of the house is 150m sq and the plot is 380m. The garden is planted out with attractive flowers and shrubs and a couple of palms.</p>', '', '<p>Samostojeæa kuæa u prvom redu do mora na svega par metara od prirodne pla¾e, s vlastitim pristupom istoj.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa se nalazi u prekrasnoj mirnoj uvali ali istovremeno nedaleko od trgovina i kafiæa.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Povr&scaron;ina kuæe iznosi 150 m2, a nalazi se na parceli povr&scaron;ine 380 m2. Kuæa se sastoji od dva kata.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Cijeli prvi kat je jedna prostorija u kojoj su povezani dnevni boravak, kuhinja i blagovaonica. S obzirom da je cijela ju¾na strana jedna velika staklena klizna stjenka iz svakog dijela ovih prostorija se pru¾a prekrasan pogled na more i pla¾u. Izlaz je na natkrivenu loðu povr&scaron;ine 22 m2, s koje se pru¾a pogled na more i pla¾u. Na prvom katu se nalazi i kupaonica i wc.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na drugom katu su kupaonica (s jacuzzijem i tu&scaron; kadom), wc i tri spavaæe sobe od kojih dvije imaju izlaz na terase i pogled na more i pla¾u.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U prizemlju kuæe nalaze se dvije manje prostorije koje slu¾e kao ostave za ljetni namje&scaron;taj.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Oko kuæe je lijepo ureðen vrt sa dvije palme i mediteranskim biljem. U sklopu okuænice su i dva parking mjesta.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa ima prikljuèak za struju, cisternu za vodu, a prikljuèak za vodu se oèekuje kroz koji mjesec s obzirom da je zahtjev podnesen.</p>', '<p>We are offering this stylish, modern house, just in front of the shore near  Rogoznica.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is situated on the shore with a private entrance to the  beach at the bottom of the garden.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is a very quiet haven in a wonderful  tranquil bay but around the corner there are shops, bars and other convenient  facilities for tourists.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The residential area of the house is 150m sq and the  plot is 380m.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The ground floor is an open plan family living area, including  a kitchen, one giant room with sliding glass doors along the entire south side  of the house, which faces the sea, and spectacular views from every corner of  the house. There is a bathroom for convenience.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Up the internal stairs are  three bedrooms, two ensuite and a large&nbsp; ''wetroom'' which has a bath, shower and  jacuzzi. This is designed with access to a balcony, so from here also you can  enjoy the sea view.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There is plenty of storage space built into the  ground floor which is useful for storing the summer outdoor furniture over the  winter.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house has electricity, but this property is reliant on a water  tank for the water, although the mains connection is due this year. This should  immediately increase the value of the property.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The garden is planted out  with attractive flowers and shrubs and a couple of palms. There are two parking  spaces.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact the office in Split to  arrange to visit this house.</p>', '', '975_House-Villa_0.jpg', '975_House-Villa_1.jpg', '975_House-Villa_2.jpg', '975_House-Villa_3.jpg', '975_House-Villa_4.jpg', '975_House-Villa_5.jpg', '975_House-Villa_6.jpg', '975_House-Villa_7.jpg', '975_House-Villa_8.jpg'),
(976, 'Alison', 'Mc Donnell', 'Alison +353 86 8018264, 099/ 674 6616', 'Ed Mc Donnell +353 87 258 8249', 'almcdonnell@hotmail.com', 'Trogir', 'O.Gornji, Ante Starèeviæa 47  Stan S18, Z.u. 4098', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '200', '0', '80', 2, '135000', '', 2, 1, 2, 2, 1, 2, 2, 2, 'December 3, 2014', '<p>Simpatièan apartman sa galerijom i prekrasnim pogledom na more smje&scaron;ten na otoku Èiovu, koji je jako popularan zbog prekrasnih pla¾a i blizine aerodroma, koji je od ove zgrade udaljen 20 min. vo¾nje. Ukupna povr&scaron;ina iznosi 60 m2 + 20 m2 galerije. Prodaje se potpuno namje&scaron;ten i klimatiziran. Grad Trogir udaljen je 15 min. vo¾nje.</p>', '<p>We are offering this attractive apartment with balcony and sea views. It is situated on the popular island of Ciovo, 200m from the beach but on the 4th (top floor) of a block elevated by the geography to give commanding views over the village and sea. The property is 60m sq but the area is enhanced by a gallery 20m sq and the balcony, also 20m sq. The property is well decorated and nicely presented. It is being sold fully furnished.</p>', '', '<p>Simpatièan apartman sa galerijom i prekrasnim pogledom na more smje&scaron;ten na otoku Èiovu, koji je jako popularan zbog prekrasnih pla¾a i blizine aerodroma, koji je od ove zgrade udaljen 20 min. vo¾nje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nalazi se na 4. katu (potkrovlje), dok mu ispred zgrade pripada jedno parking mjesto koje je ukljuèeno u cijenu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ukupna povr&scaron;ina iznosi 60 m2 + 20 m2 galerije.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sastoji se od hodnika, kuhinje + dnevnog boravka + blagovaonice, 1 spavaæe sobe, kupaonice i balkona sa pogledom na more. Stepenice vode do galerije gdje se nalazi mali dnevni dio, spavaæa soba i wc.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Prodaje se potpuno namje&scaron;ten i klimatiziran.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Najbli¾a pla¾a udaljena je 200 m dok se trgovine, restorani, ljekarna i svi ostali sadr¾aji nalaze u centru mjesta koji je udaljen svega par minuta vo¾nje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Radi se o kvalitetoj zgradi na mirnoj lokaciji koja je idealna za ¾ivljenje, ali i turistièko iznajmljivanje zbog velike popularnosti otoka.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Grad Trogir udaljen je 15 min. vo¾nje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za sve dodatne informacije stojimo vam na raspolaganju.</p>', '<p>We are offering this attractive apartment with balcony and sea views.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is  situated on the popular island of Ciovo, 200m from the beach but on the 4th (top  floor) of a block elevated by the geography to give commanding views over the  village and sea.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property is 60m sq but the area is enhanced by a  gallery 20m sq and the balcony, also 20m sq. It is currently laid out with a  large open plan family area, which includes the kitchen, one bedroom, bathroom,  and then stairs inside up to the elevated gallery which is a living area, a  second bedroom, and bathroom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property is well decorated and nicely  presented. It is being sold fully furnished.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>In front of the building is a  parking space.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The village, with many facilities, bars and shops etc, is  a few minutes by car and the larger town with many more attractions, Trogir, is  10 minutes by car, while the airport is 20 minutes away.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The local and  surrounding area is very quiet and the road in front of the flat, is barely  used.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact the office in Split with questions and to arrange to  visit the property.</p>', '', '976_Apartment_0.jpg', '976_Apartment_1.jpg', '976_Apartment_2.jpg', '976_Apartment_3.jpg', '976_Apartment_4.jpg', '976_Apartment_5.jpg', '976_Apartment_6.jpg', '976_Apartment_7.jpg', '976_Apartment_8.jpg');
INSERT INTO `nekretnina` (`id`, `ime`, `prezime`, `telefon`, `mobitel`, `e_mail`, `lokacija_id`, `adresa`, `status_id`, `vrsta_id`, `udaljenost`, `povrsina`, `stambenapovrsina`, `display`, `cijena`, `cijenatocka`, `ponuda_tjedna`, `new_built`, `must_sell`, `prvi_red_do_mora`, `pogled_na_more`, `bazen`, `broj_soba`, `broj_kupatila`, `datum`, `title_hr`, `title_en`, `title_ge`, `opis_hr`, `opis_en`, `opis_ge`, `PropertyImageURL0`, `PropertyImageURL1`, `PropertyImageURL2`, `PropertyImageURL3`, `PropertyImageURL4`, `PropertyImageURL5`, `PropertyImageURL6`, `PropertyImageURL7`, `PropertyImageURL8`) VALUES
(977, '', 'Real Treuhand Croati', 'Patricija Orliæ 021/ 885 347 ', 'Mob: 099/ 535 9933', 'orlic@rtm.at', 'Trogir', 'Planikovica, Z.U. 3581', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '10', '0', '0', 2, '525000', '', 2, 1, 2, 1, 1, 2, 0, 0, 'December 3, 2014', '<p>Ekskluzivna nekretnina u 1.redu do mora, udaljena od prekrasne pla¾e svega nekoliko metara. Sastoji se od ukupno 2 apartmana koji su trenutno u fazi izgradnje. Smje&scaron;teni su na zapadnom dijelu otoka Èiova, dok je orjentacija sjeverna. Svakom apartmanu pripadaju 2 vanjska parking mjesta, dok je na pla¾i moguæe privezivanje manjeg broda.</p>', '<p>We are pleased to offer these new and luxury apartments in the first line of building on the shore. They are situated just a few m from the sea, in the western part of the island of Ciovo. The apartments each have parking spaces and another attraction is that the sea in front of the property is suitable for temporary mooring of small boats.</p>', '', '<p>Ekskluzivna nekretnina u 1.redu do mora, udaljena od prekrasne pla¾e svega nekoliko metara.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sastoji se od ukupno 2 apartmana koji su trenutno u fazi izgradnje. Smje&scaron;teni su na zapadnom dijelu otoka Èiova, dok je orijentacija sjeverna.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Svakom apartmanu pripadaju 2 vanjska parking mjesta, dok je na pla¾i moguæe privezivanje manjeg broda.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Centar mjesta udaljen je par minuta vo¾nje, gdje se ujedno nalaze svi potrebni sadr¾aji.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;"><strong>APARTMAN 1: 87 M2 + loggia i vrt &ndash; 525.000 Eura</strong></span></p>\r\n<p><strong>&nbsp;</strong>Nalazi se u prizemlju, a sastoji se od dnevnog boravka, blagovaonice, kuhinje, 2 spavaæe sobe od kojih svaka ima svoju kupaonicu, dodatne kupaonice, garderobe, velike loggie i vrta.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;"><strong>APARTMAN 2: 168 M2 + loggia i terasa &ndash; 750.000 Eura</strong></span></p>\r\n<p><strong>&nbsp;</strong>Dvoeta¾ni apartman smje&scaron;ten na 1. i 2.katu. Na 1.katu se nalazi dnevni boravak, blagovaonice, kuhinja, soba sa kupaonicom, garderoba, wc i loggia. Na 2.katu je hodnik, 3 spavaæe sobe, 3 kupaonice i prostrana terasa.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>***Navedene cijene se odnose na potpuni zavr&scaron;etak vanjskog dijela, dok bi unutarnji bio u roh-bau fazi.</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Meðunarodni aerodrom udaljen je 20 min. vo¾nje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za sve dodatne informacije molimo da nas kontaktirate.</p>', '<p>We are pleased to offer these new and luxury apartments in the first line of  building on the shore.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>They are situated just a few m from the sea, in  the western part of the island of Ciovo.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The apartments each have parking spaces and another attraction is  that the sea in front of the property is suitable for temporary mooring of small  boats.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The nearest shops, bars and other useful services are conveniently  situated within a short walk from the property.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong><span style="text-decoration: underline;">APARTMENT 1: 87 m2 + balcony  and garden - Euro 525.000</span></strong></p>\r\n<p>It is located on the ground floor and consists of a  living room, dining room, kitchen, 2 bedrooms, each with its own bathroom,  additional bathroom, cloakroom, large balcony and garden.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong><span style="text-decoration: underline;">APARTMENT 2:  168 M2 + balcony and terrace - Euro 750.000</span></strong></p>\r\n<p>Duplex apartment located on the 1st  and 2nd floor.&nbsp;On the 1st floor has a living room, dining room, kitchen,  bedroom with bathroom, dressing room, bathroom and balcony.&nbsp;On the 2nd floor  of the hall, 3 bedrooms, 3 bathrooms and a spacious terrace.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>***Above prices include finishing from the outside, while the inside would be unfinished.&nbsp;</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The  international airport is 20 minutes. driving.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For additional information and  to view the office, please contact us.</p>', '', '', '977_Apartment_1.jpg', '977_Apartment_2.jpg', '977_Apartment_3.jpg', '977_Apartment_4.jpg', '977_Apartment_5.jpg', '977_Apartment_6.jpg', '977_Apartment_7.jpg', ''),
(978, '', 'Real Treuhand Croati', 'Patricija Orliæ 021/ 885 347 ', 'Mob: 099/ 535 9933', 'orlic@rtm.at', 'Trogir', 'Planikovica, Z.U. 5680', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '30', '0', '101', 2, '250000', '', 2, 1, 2, 2, 1, 2, 2, 2, 'December 3, 2014', '<p>Luksuzni apartmani u novogradnji u 2.redu od mora, udaljeni od pla¾e i prekrasnog mora svega 20 m. Na pla¾i je moguæe privezati manji brod. U zgradi su ukupno 2 apartmana dok je na prodaju preostao 1. Ukupna stambena povr&scaron;ina iznosi 101 m2 + dvije terase (31 m2 + 8 m2). Apartmanu pripadaju 2 parking mjesta koja su ukljuèena u cijenu. Jedan apartman je potpuno namje&scaron;ten, dok je u drugome ugraðena kuhinja. Oba su klimatizirana i sa ugraðenim podnim grijanjem. &nbsp;Ovo je izuzetna prilika ¾elite li apartman bez ikakvog ulaganja, u blizini prekrasne pla¾e i mora.</p>', '<p>We are pleased to offer this brand new luxury apartment in a new building in the 2nd row from the sea. The sea and lovely bathing beach is just 20 m from the building, and there is direct access onto this popular pebble beach. Not only is the beach perfect for swimming but it is convenient and suitable to moor up a small boat temporarily. In the building are a total of 2 apartments and one apartment is remaining for sale.&nbsp;Total area is 101 m2 + two terraces (31 m2 + 8 m2). The apartment is fully furnished, air conditioned with underfloor heating.</p>', '', '<p>Luksuzni apartmani u novogradnji u 2.redu od mora, udaljeni od pla¾e i prekrasnog mora svega 20 m. Na pla¾i je moguæe privezati manji brod.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Zgrada je smje&scaron;tena za zapadnom dijelu otoka Èiova, dok je orijentacija sjeverna.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Centar mjesta gdje su svi sadr¾aji je udaljen par minuta vo¾nje, dok je povijesni grad Trogir udaljen 15 min. Do meðunarodnog aerodroma je potrebno 20 min.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U zgradi su ukupno 2 apartmana dok je na prodaju preostao 1.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>APARTMAN 1: 101 m2 + 2 dijela dvora povr&scaron;ine 39 m2 - 250.000 &euro;</strong></p>\r\n<p><strong>APARTMAN 2: 101 m2 + 2 dijela dvora povr&scaron;ine 108 m2 - 250.000 &euro;</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Svakom apartmanu pripadaju 2 parking mjesta koja su ukljuèena u cijenu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartmani su dvoeta¾ani, te se u prizemlju nalazi ulazni prostor, wc, blagovaonica, kuhinja, dnevni boravak i 2 vanjske terase. Na 1.katu se nalaze 2 spavaæe sobe i kupaonica.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Jedan apartman je potpuno namje&scaron;ten, dok je u drugome ugraðena kuhinja. Oba su klimatizirana i sa ugraðenim podnim grijanjem.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ovo je izuzetna prilika ¾elite li apartman bez ikakvog ulaganja, u blizini prekrasne pla¾e i mora.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za sve dodatne informacije slobodno nas kontaktirajte.</p>', '<p>We are pleased to offer this brand new luxury apartment in a new building in the  2nd row from the sea.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The sea and lovely bathing beach is just 20 m from  the building, and there is direct access onto this popular pebble beach. Not  only is the beach perfect for swimming but it is convenient and suitable to moor  up a small boat temporarily.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The building is located in the western part of  the island of Ciovo, and constructed on a northern orientation.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The village  centre, where all facilities are located, is a few minutes walk away, while the  historic city of Trogir is 15 min. by car. THe international airport is 20  min.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>In the building are a total of 2 apartments and one apartment is  remaining for sale.&nbsp;Total area is 101 m2 + two terraces (31 m2 + 8  m2).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartment has two parking spaces that are included in the price.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The  apartment has two floors and the ground floor is an entrance hall, bathroom,  dining room, kitchen, living room and two outdoor terraces. On the 1st floor  there are 2 bedrooms and bathroom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The apartment is fully furnished, air  conditioned with underfloor heating.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>This is a great opportunity if you  want to apartment without any investment, close to the beautiful  beach.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact the office in Split for more information and to  arrange to view this property.</p>', '', '978_Apartment_0.jpg', '978_Apartment_1.jpg', '978_Apartment_2.jpg', '978_Apartment_3.jpg', '978_Apartment_4.jpg', '978_Apartment_5.jpg', '978_Apartment_6.jpg', '978_Apartment_7.jpg', '978_Apartment_8.jpg'),
(979, 'Goranka', 'Podnar', 'kæer- 095/4677735', '098/ 884 971', 'goranka.podnar@gmail.com', 'Brac', 'Osibova,1239/47 k.o. Milna (u postupku etaziranja)', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '10', '250', '140', 1, '270000', '', 2, 1, 2, 1, 1, 2, 3, 3, 'December 4, 2014', '<p>Novoizgraðena kuæa u dalmatinskom stilu na prekrasnoj lokaciji u 1.redu do mora. Smje&scaron;tena je na otoku Braèu u mirnoj uvali bez puno kuæa &scaron;to je prednost ako ¾elite mir i ti&scaron;inu. Radi se o dvojnoj kuæi u roh-bau fazi, stoga novi vlasnik mora dov&scaron;iti preostale radove. Vanjski dio je potpuno zavr&scaron;en, kao i instalacije vode i struje. Ukupno zemlji&scaron;te iznosi 250 m2, dok je stambena povr&scaron;ina 140 m2. Na pla¾i je moguæe privezati manji brod.</p>', '<p>We are pleased to offer this newly built semi detached house in a wonderful location in the 1st row of property to the sea.It is located on the island of Brac in a quiet bay with very few houses which is an advantage if you want peace and quiet. It is semi detached house in the unfinished stage, therefore, the new owner must finish the works. Total land is 250 m2, while the living area is 140 m2. On the beach it is possible to moor a small boat.</p>', '', '<p>Novoizgraðena kuæa u dalmatinskom stilu na prekrasnoj lokaciji u 1.redu do mora.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Do prekrasne prirodno kamenite pla¾e ima svega 10 m, dok se iz kuæe takoðer pru¾a pogled na more i uvalu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Smje&scaron;tena je na otoku Braèu u mirnoj uvali bez puno kuæa &scaron;to je prednost ako ¾elite mir i ti&scaron;inu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Radi se o dvojnoj kuæi u roh-bau fazi, stoga novi vlasnik mora dov&scaron;iti preostale radove. Vanjski dio je potpuno zavr&scaron;en, kao i instalacije vode i struje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ukupno zemlji&scaron;te iznosi 250 m2, dok je stambena povr&scaron;ina 140 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sastoji se od prizemlja/podruma u kojem se nalazi dnevni boravak + kuhinja + blagovaonica, wc i terasa.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na gornjem dijelu prizemlja se nalaze 2 spavaæe sobe, kupaonica i terasa sa pogledom na more. U potkrovlju se nalazi 1 spavaæa soba i kupaonica.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ispred kuæe se nalazi parking za 1 vozilo, kao i ureðeni vrt koji je idealan za u¾ivanje u zalasku sunca.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na pla¾i je moguæe privezati manji brod.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Otok Braè povezan je svakodnevnom trajektnom linijom sa gradom Splitom. Od grada Splita do meðunarodnog aerodroma je potrebno 40 min. vo¾nje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za sva dodatnja pitanja stojimo vam na raspolaganju.</p>', '<p>We are pleased to offer this newly built semi detached house in a wonderful  location in the 1st row of property to the sea.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The beautiful natural rocky  beach is just 10 m, while the house, elevated by the dramatic shore completely  overlooks the sea and the bay.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is located on the island of Brac in a quiet  bay with very few houses which is an advantage if you want peace and  quiet.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is semi detached house in the unfinished stage, therefore, the  new owner must finish the works. Although this seems like a burden, it is the  best way to purchase a property well under the market value, and have your own  choice of decorating.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The main heavy building is fully completed, as well as  the installation of water and electricity, so although there is plenty of work  left to do, it could be done reasonably quickly.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Total land is 250 m2, while  the living area is 140 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the ground floor / basement where there is a  living room + kitchen + dining room, bathroom and terrace.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the upper part  of the ground floor there are 2 bedrooms, bathroom and terrace with sea views.  On the top floor is one bedroom and bathroom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house has parking for  one vehicle, and the landscaped garden is ideal for enjoying the sunset.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On  the beach it is possible to moor a small boat.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The island of Brac is  connected by daily ferry lines to Split. From the city of Split to the  international airport it takes 40 min driving.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For all questions we are  available, and to view the property please contact our office for  directions.</p>', '', '979_House-Villa_0.jpg', '979_House-Villa_1.jpg', '979_House-Villa_2.jpg', '979_House-Villa_3.jpg', '979_House-Villa_4.jpg', '979_House-Villa_5.jpg', '979_House-Villa_6.jpg', '979_House-Villa_7.jpg', ''),
(980, 'Neno', 'Schlenz', '', '091/ 571 0005', '', 'Split', 'Sinjska 7, Kat.10791/1   Z.U. 10457', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '370', '0', '152', 2, '298000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 5, 1, 'December 4, 2014', '<p>Prostrani apartman na 3.katu (zadnjem) u starogradskoj zgradi u samom centru povijesnog grada Splita. Apartanu je potrebno renoviranje, ali zbog svoje velièine i pozicije ima odlièan potencijal za ¾ivljenje i iznajmljivanje. Ukupna povr&scaron;ina iznosi 152 m2 + 25 m2 potkrovlja u koji se ulazi direktno iz apartmana. Postoji moguænost preureðenja u vi&scaron;e manjih apartmana.</p>', '<p>We are offering this spacious apartment as a renovation project with huge potential. It is situated on the 3rd floor (top) in one of the old buildings near the centre of the town. The apartment needs total renovation, but because of its size and position has great potential. The total area is 152 m2 + 25 m2 attic, which is accessed through private stairs within the apartment. The view from the balconies stretch to the Marjan park woods and across the old town.</p>', '', '<p>Prostrani apartman na 3.katu (zadnjem) u starogradskoj zgradi u samom centru povijesnog grada Splita. Do rive i Dioklecijanove palaèe potrebno je svega nekoliko minuta hodanja.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartanu je potrebno renoviranje, ali zbog svoje velièine i pozicije ima odlièan potencijal za ¾ivljenje i iznajmljivanje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ukupna povr&scaron;ina iznosi 152 m2 + 25 m2 potkrovlja u koji se ulazi direktno iz apartmana.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sastoji se od hodnika, blagovaonice, kuhinje, kupaonice, 5 spavaæih soba, 2 prostrana balkona &nbsp;i potkrovlja.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Pogled se pru¾a prema park &scaron;umi Marjan i starom dijelu grada.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Postoji moguænost preureðenja u vi&scaron;e manjih apartmana.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U blizini se nalaze mnoge trgovine, restorani, kafiæi i svi ostali potrebni sadr¾aji. More i prekrasne pla¾e se nalaze na zapadnom dijelu gdje je ujedno i park &scaron;uma Marjan i na ju¾noj dijelu gdje se nalazi popularna pla¾a Baèvice.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Do meðunarodnog aerodroma potrebno je 40 min. vo¾nje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za sva dodatna pitanja molimo da nas kontaktirate.</p>', '<p>We are offering this spacious apartment as a renovation project with huge  potential.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is situated on the 3rd floor (top) in one of the old  buildings near the centre of the town.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The waterfront and Diocletian''s  palace, and Marjan Park all take a few minutes walking and nearby are many  shops, restaurants, bars and other services, as well as the Town&rsquo;s main tourist  attractions.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The sea and beautiful beaches are located to the west near  the &lsquo;Marjan&rsquo; Forest Park and to the south where there is the popular beach  &lsquo;Bacvice&rsquo;.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The apartment needs total renovation, but because of its size  and position has great potential.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The total area is 152 m2 + 25 m2 attic,  which is accessed through private stairs within the apartment.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It consists of  hallway, dining room, kitchen, bathrooms, 5 bedrooms, 2 spacious balconies and  the attic.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The view from the balconies stretch to the Marjan park woods and  across the old town.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There is the possibility of redesigning the apartment  into smaller units, and internal work does not require planning  permission.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>To the international airport takes 40 minutes driving.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For any additional questions please contact us.</p>', '', '980_Apartment_0.jpg', '980_Apartment_1.jpg', '980_Apartment_2.jpg', '980_Apartment_3.jpg', '980_Apartment_4.jpg', '980_Apartment_5.jpg', '980_Apartment_6.jpg', '980_Apartment_7.jpg', '980_Apartment_8.jpg'),
(981, 'Claus', 'Schmidt', 'Boris 095 8250130', '+43 699 111 07 466', 'c.schmidt@3si.at', 'Rogoznica', 'Iza Zeèeva, k.è.1463 Rogoznica', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '10', '638', '105', 1, '180000', '', 2, 2, 2, 1, 1, 2, 2, 1, 'December 5, 2014', '<p>Za ljubitelje netaknute prirode samostojeæa kuæa, prvi red do mora, s vlastitom pla¾om ispred kuæe. Kuæa se nalazi u maloj uvali koja svojim polo¾ajem i slabom izgraðeno&scaron;æu pru¾a moguænost odmora u miru i ti&scaron;ini. Kuæa je prizemnica, povr&scaron;ine 105 m2 s dvije spavaæe sobe, dnevnim boravkom, kuhinjom, blagovaonicom i kupaonicom. S obzirom da je parcela prvi red do mora ima vlastitu pla¾u ispred kuæe s direktnim pristupom iz vrta. Parcela je povr&scaron;ine 638 m2 s prekrasno terasasto izvedenim vrtom.</p>', '<p>We are offering this exceptional and rare opportunity to purchase a detached seafront property with great potential. This detached house, next to the sea, has a private beach right in front of the house, in Rogoznica area, on the mainland. The house is a ground floor, of 105 m2 with two bedrooms, living room, kitchen, dining room and bathroom. The plot has an area of 638 m2 with terraced gardens.</p>', '', '<p>Za ljubitelje netaknute prirode samostojeæa kuæa, prvi red do mora, s vlastitom pla¾om ispred kuæe.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa se nalazi u maloj uvali koja svojim polo¾ajem i slabom izgraðeno&scaron;æu pru¾a moguænost odmora u miru i ti&scaron;ini.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je prizemnica, povr&scaron;ine 105 m2 s dvije spavaæe sobe, dnevnim boravkom, kuhinjom, blagovaonicom i kupaonicom. S terase povr&scaron;ine 25 m2 se pru¾a prekrasan pogled na more i okolicu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ispred i ispod kuæe se nalazi podrumska prostorija.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>S obzirom da je parcela prvi red do mora ima vlastitu pla¾u ispred kuæe s direktnim pristupom iz vrta.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Parcela je povr&scaron;ine 638 m2 s prekrasno terasasto izvedenim vrtom u kojem se nalazi mediteransko bilje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa ima solarne ploèe, cisternu i septièku jamu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Do uvale se dolazi autom. Osigurana su dva parking mjesta. Udaljenost od parkinga do kuæe iznosi 70 m.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je od centra lijepog turistièkog mjesta udaljena 10 minuta vo¾nje, a od aerodroma 30 minuta vo¾nje.</p>', '<p>We are offering this exceptional and rare opportunity to purchase a detached  seafront property with great potential.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>This detached  house, next to the sea, has a private beach right in front of the house, in  Rogoznica area, on the mainland.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is situated in a small bay and its  position and low level of surrounding development creates the ideal location for  owners looking for nature, quiet and undisturbed surroundings.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house is a  ground floor, of 105 m2 with two bedrooms, living room, kitchen, dining room and  bathroom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house is elevated by the sloping geography of the shore and  from the large terrace of 25m sq there are beautiful views of the sea and  surrounding area.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There is direct access to the beach from the  garden.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The plot has an area of 638 m2 with terraced gardens are planted with  many Mediterranean plants.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house has solar panels, water cistern and  septic tank.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It has 2 parking places 70 meters dislocated from the house!</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Center of the nearest village is 10 mins  driving.</p>\r\n<p>Trogir and Split International airport are 30 mins driving.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>We look forward to your earliest contact!</p>', '', '981_House-Villa_0.jpg', '981_House-Villa_1.jpg', '981_House-Villa_2.jpg', '981_House-Villa_3.jpg', '981_House-Villa_4.jpg', '981_House-Villa_5.jpg', '981_House-Villa_6.jpg', '981_House-Villa_7.jpg', '981_House-Villa_8.jpg'),
(986, 'Jurica', 'Surjan', '', '091 123 2223', 'arhitekt.surjan@gmail.com  ', 'Korcula', 'Prapatna, K. è. 2478/724 Vela luka', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '10', '332', '71.96', 1, '250000', '', 2, 2, 2, 1, 1, 1, 3, 2, 'December 13, 2014', '<p>Kuæa graðena i namje&scaron;tena u dalmatinskom duhu, nalazi se u prvom redu do mora. Iz kuæe se pru¾a prekrasan pogled na more. Kuæa se nalazi na atraktivnoj lokaciji okru¾ena stablima maslina i borova, a na samo 10 m udaljenosti od prirodne, ali ureðene pla¾e. Cijela kuæa se sastoji od tri zasebne jedinice. Dvije se nalaze u visokom prizemlju, a jedna u prizemlju.</p>', '<p>We are offering this  house, built and furnished in the traditional Dalmatian style and  located in the first row of houses by the sea. The  house is situated in an attractive location, on the sloping shore,  surrounded by ancient olive trees and pines, and only 10 meters from the  natural beach. The property is sitting on a land plot of 332m sq. The house has a living area of 71,96m&nbsp;sq. The whole house is divided into three separate units/apartments.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>', '', '<p>U prekrasnoj uvali, netaknute prirode, u prvom redu do mora nalazi se kuæa koja ima direktni pristup lijepo ureðenoj pla¾i i moru. Kuæa je graðena i namje&scaron;tena u dalmatinskom duhu. Iz kuæe se pru¾a prekrasan pogled na more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa se nalazi na atraktivnoj lokaciji okru¾ena stablima maslina i borova. Èisto more, svje¾ mediteranski zrak, mirna uvala i prirodna lijepo ureðena pla¾a èine ovu nekretninu izuzetno atraktivnom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa se sastoji od tri zasebne jedinice. Dvije se nalaze u visokom prizemlju, a jedna u prizemlju.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Apartman 1 ukupne neto povr&scaron;ine 40,02 m2</strong>.</p>\r\n<p>Sastoji se od: dvije spavaæe sobe, dnevnog boravka, kuhinje, blagovaone u kojoj se nalazi kamin, Wc-a, kupaonice i terase. Vanjski ro&scaron;tilj i okuænica povr&scaron;ine 42,30 m2 takoðer su dio ovog apartmana. Apartman ima zaseban ulaz.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Apartman 2 ukupne neto korisne povr&scaron;ine 16,35 m2.</strong></p>\r\n<p>Sastoji se od: spavaæe sobe, kuhinje, kupaonice, Wc-a i terase &nbsp;s pripadajuæom okuænicom povr&scaron;ine 43,50m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Apartman 3 ukupne neto korisne povr&scaron;ine 15,59 m2</strong></p>\r\n<p>Sastoji se od sobe i kuhinje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ukupna povr&scaron;ina parcele je 332 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Do kuæe vodi djelom asfaltna, dijelom makadamska cesta.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Osigurano je parkirali&scaron;te koje je od kuæe&nbsp;udaljeno 80 m.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Vodoopskrba je iz vlastitih cisterni. Elektrièna energija je solarna 220V.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa nema re¾ijskih tro&scaron;kova vode i struje osim zamjene akumulatora nakon 7 godina kori&scaron;tenja. Prodaje se u potpunosti namje&scaron;tena.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je legalizirina, eta¾irana i ima energetski certifikat.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Udaljenost do centra Vele luke je 3000 m.</p>', '<p>We are offering this  house, built and furnished in the traditional Dalmatian style and  located in the first row of houses by the sea.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The  house is situated in an attractive location, on the sloping shore,  surrounded by ancient olive trees and pines, and only 10 meters from the  natural beach.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property is sitting on a land plot of 332m sq.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house has a living area of 71,96m&nbsp;sq.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The whole house is divided into three separate units/apartments.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>One apartment &nbsp;on the ground floor and two apartments &nbsp;on the high ground floor.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;">Apartment 1 total net area of 40.02 m2</span></p>\r\n<p>It  consists of two bedrooms, living room, kitchen, dining room where there  is a fireplace, toilet, bathroom and terrace.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Outdoor barbecue and  garden area of 42.30 m2 is also sold with this apartment.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The apartment  has a separate entrance.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;">Apartment 2 with total area of 16.35 m2 </span></p>\r\n<p>It consists of a bedroom, kitchen, bathroom, toilet and a terrace with a garden area of 43,50m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;">Apartment 3 with total area of 15.59 m2 </span></p>\r\n<p>It consists of one bedroom and a kitchen.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The road to the house is partly paved and partly gravel.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Parking is available and is 80 m away from the house.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The apartments are sold fully furnished.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Water supply is from our own tanks.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Electricity is solar 220V.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>House  does not have overhead costs of water and electricity. Only additional  cost is replacement of the accumulator after 7 years of use.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The  distance to the nearest town is a few minutes by car, where there are  shops, bars and other facilities, so this property has a great feeling  of being completely rural, with the sea a few yards away, but  conveniently close to neighbours and the village.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;For more information please contact our office.&nbsp;</p>', '', '986_House-Villa_0.jpg', '986_House-Villa_1.jpg', '986_House-Villa_2.jpg', '986_House-Villa_3.jpg', '986_House-Villa_4.jpg', '986_House-Villa_5.jpg', '986_House-Villa_6.jpg', '986_House-Villa_7.jpg', '986_House-Villa_8.jpg'),
(982, 'Andrej', 'Su¹ac', 'Zora 091 206 7122', '091/ 312 1222', 'tina.jelavic@gmail.com', 'Split', 'Miliæeva 51, 11693 ark/kat   z.u. 32', 'For sale', 'Old stone house', '300', '256', '360', 1, '1200000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 6, 3, 'December 7, 2014', '<p>Luksuzna samostojeæa kuæa u centru Splita, na jednoj od najljep&scaron;ih lokacija u blizini park &scaron;ume Marjan gdje se ujedno nalaze i prekrasne pla¾e. Smje&scaron;tena je na zemlji&scaron;tu ukupne povr&scaron;ine 256 m2, sa vlastitim parkingom za 2 automobila i ureðenim dvori&scaron;tem. Kuæa se sastoji od prizemlja, 1., 2. i 3. kata (potkrovlje) ukupne povr&scaron;ine 360 m2. Potpuno je opremljena, namje&scaron;tena i spremna za useljenje i u¾ivanje.</p>', '<p>We are pleased to offer this beautiful detached house in one of the most attractive locations between the Riva and the Marjan Park. The property has been completely restored to a high standard, both inside and outside, and it consists of 6 bedrooms, 3 bathrooms, living room, dining room, kitchen and terrace and balcony with views of the harbour, the waterfront, the old town and the islands further out to sea. The house consists of ground floor, 1st, 2nd 3rd floor (top floor) and the total residential area is 360 m2.</p>', '', '<p>Luksuzna samostojeæa kuæa u centru Splita, na jednoj od najljep&scaron;ih lokacija u blizini park &scaron;ume Marjan gdje se ujedno nalaze i prekrasne pla¾e.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Smje&scaron;tena je na zemlji&scaron;tu ukupne povr&scaron;ine 256 m2, sa vlastitim parkingom za 2 automobila i ureðenim dvori&scaron;tem.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa se sastoji od prizemlja, 1., 2. i 3. kata (potkrovlje) ukupne povr&scaron;ine 360 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Potpuno je opremljena, namje&scaron;tena i spremna za useljenje i u¾ivanje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ima ukupno 6 spavaæih soba, 3 kupaonice, dnevni boravak, blagovaonicu, kuhinju i terasu sa prekrasnim pogledom na more, rivu i stari dio grada.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Dvori&scaron;te je potpuno ograðeno i zaklonjeno od ulice &scaron;to garantira mir i privatnost.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Do samog centra i Dioklecijanove palaèe je potrebno svega 5 minuta hodanja. U blizini se takoðer nalaze mnoge trgovine, restorani, barovi i svi ostali sadr¾aji.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Meðunarodni aerodrom udaljen je 40 min. vo¾nje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za sva dodatna pitanja stojimo vam na raspolaganju.</p>', '<p>We are pleased to offer this beautiful detached house in one of the most  attractive locations between the Riva and the Marjan Park.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property  has been completely restored to a high standard, both inside and outside, and it  consists of 6 bedrooms, 3 bathrooms, living room, dining room, kitchen and  terrace and balcony with views of the harbour, the waterfront, the old town and  the islands further out to sea.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house consists of ground floor, 1st,  2nd 3rd floor (top floor) and the total residential area is 360 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It  sits on total land area of 256 m2, with private parking for two cars and a  landscaped courtyard.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is fully equipped, decorated and furnished- ready to  move in.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The yard is fully fenced and sheltered from the street, which  guarantees peace and privacy.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The centre of town and the Diocletian  Palace, takes only 5 minutes walking, and in the vicinity are many shops,  restaurants, bars and other services and attractions.&nbsp;The international  airport is 40 min. driving.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For any questions or for viewing we are  available. Take some energy pills before walking up the hill!!</p>', '', '982_Old-stone-house_0.jpg', '982_Old-stone-house_1.jpg', '982_Old-stone-house_2.jpg', '982_Old-stone-house_3.jpg', '982_Old-stone-house_4.jpg', '982_Old-stone-house_5.jpg', '982_Old-stone-house_6.jpg', '982_Old-stone-house_7.jpg', '982_Old-stone-house_8.jpg'),
(983, 'Alen ©kara', 'Dalmatis', '', '', '', 'Zadar', 'Bibinje', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '100', '621', '528', 1, '930000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 10, 10, 'December 7, 2014', '<p>Luksuzna Vila sa 6 apartmana ukupne brutto povr&scaron;ine 528 m2, udaljena od mora 100 m, prekrasan pogled na more i Zadarski kanal!! Villa je projektirana sa osnovnom namjerom i potrebom kao kuæa za odmor, te se sastoji od 6 (&scaron;est) stambenih jedinica-luksuzno opremljenih apartmana, te ujedno ima 6 (&scaron;est) pripadujuæih parking mjesta koji se nalaze na ulazu ispred objekta.</p>', '<p>We are offering these 6 modern, luxury apartments, beautifully designed with convenience and comfort in mind. They are 100m from the sea with interesting views across the Zadar channel. The internal area is 528 m sq and the plot 621m sq. They were designed with the primary purpose as a holiday home, and consist of six (6) dwelling units-luxurious suites, and each with a parking space that are located at the entrance in front of the building.</p>', '', '<p>Luksuzna Vila sa 6 apartmana, udaljena od mora 100 m, prekrasan pogled na more i Zadarski kanal!!</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Luksuzna moderna Vila, ukupne brutto povr&scaron;ine 528 m2, udaljena od mora svega 100 m, nalazi se na atraktivnoj i mirnoj lokaciji na terenu povr&scaron;ine 621 m2 sa kojeg se prostire istovremeno prekrasan pogled na more i Zadarski kanal sa ju¾ne strane, te Marinu Dalmacija sa sjeverne strane.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Villa je projektirana sa osnovnom namjerom i potrebom kao kuæa za odmor, te se sastoji od 6 (&scaron;est) stambenih jedinica-luksuzno opremljenih apartmana, te ujedno ima 6 (&scaron;est) pripadujuæih parking mjesta koji se nalaze na ulazu ispred objekta.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Vanjski grill/komin u vrtu je idealan za obiteljsko dru¾enje na ovtvorenom za vrijeme odmora, kao i zelena povr&scaron;ina koja okru¾uje sam objekt.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Villa se sastoji od:</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong><span style="text-decoration: underline;">Podruma</span> </strong>&ndash; ukupne brutto povr&scaron;ine 121,42 m2. U podrumu se nalazi 1 (jedan) jednosoban stan sa kupatilom netto povr&scaron;ine 42,11 m2, stubi&scaron;te i gospodarske prostorije. U njemu se nalazi wellnes prostorija sa "saunom i jacuzzijem".</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong><span style="text-decoration: underline;">Prizemlja</span> </strong>&ndash; ukupne brutto povr&scaron;ine 177,83 m2. Sastoji se od 2 (dva) dvosobna stana, svaki stan posjeduje dva kupatila sa wc, svaki stan netto povr&scaron;ine 73,01 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong><span style="text-decoration: underline;">1.Kat</span> </strong>&ndash; ukupne brutto povr&scaron;ine 127,03 m2. Sastoji od 2 (dva) dvosobna stana svaki stan posjeduje dva kupatila sa wc, svaki stan netto povr&scaron;ine 73,01 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong><span style="text-decoration: underline;">Potkrovlja</span></strong> &ndash; ukupne brutto povr&scaron;ine 74,76 m2, u kojem se nalazi 1 (jedan) jednosoban stan sa kupatilom netto povr&scaron;ine 62,24 m2, te stubi&scaron;te.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kupoprodajna cijena: 930.000 EUR, a u cijenu je ukljuèen cjelokupan opisan namje&scaron;taj i tehnika!!</p>', '<p>We are offering these 6 modern, luxury apartments, beautifully designed with convenience and comfort in mind.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>They are 100m from the sea with interesting views across the Zadar channel. The surrounding area is quiet and spacious with plenty of space around the buildings.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The internal area is 528 m sq and the plot 621m sq.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>They were designed with the primary purpose as a holiday home, and consist of six (6) dwelling units-luxurious suites, and each with a parking space that are located at the entrance in front of the building.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>A large Barbecue / fireplace in the landscaped garden is ideal for larger gatherings of families and friends.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Villa consists of:</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong><span style="text-decoration: underline;">Cellars</span></strong> - a total area 121.42 m2. In the basement there is one (1) bedroom apartment with bathroom net area of 42.11 m2, stairs and utility rooms. It houses a wellness area with a "sauna and Jacuzzi."</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong><span style="text-decoration: underline;">Ground floor</span></strong> - total area 177.83 m2. It consists of two (2) bedroom apartments, each apartment has two bathrooms with toilets, each apartment net area of 73.01 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong><span style="text-decoration: underline;">1st floor</span></strong> - total area 127.03 m2. It consists of two (2) bedroom apartments, each apartment has two bathrooms with toilets, each apartment net area of 73.01 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong><span style="text-decoration: underline;">Attic</span></strong> - total area 74.76 m2, where there is one (1) bedroom apartment with bathroom (net area of 62.24 m2).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Purchase price: 930,000 EUR, the price includes the entire furniture and equipment described !!</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact our office for more information and to arrange an escorted visit.</p>', '', '983_House-Villa_0.jpg', '983_House-Villa_1.jpg', '983_House-Villa_2.jpg', '983_House-Villa_3.jpg', '983_House-Villa_4.jpg', '983_House-Villa_5.jpg', '983_House-Villa_6.jpg', '983_House-Villa_7.jpg', '983_House-Villa_8.jpg'),
(984, 'Alen ©kara', 'Dalmatis', '', '', '', 'Zadar', '', 'For sale', 'Old stone house', '6000', '560', '410', 1, '665000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 5, 7, 'December 7, 2014', '<p>Luksuzna kamena kuæa udaljena svega 4 km od grada Zadra sagraðena na terenu povr&scaron;ine 560 m2. Tlocrtna povr&scaron;ina kuæe iznosi 140 m2, odnosno ukupna netto povr&scaron;ina cijelog objekta iznosi 410 m2. Kuæa se sastoji od podruma (suterena), velikog luksuznog apartmana u prizemlju i na katu od dva luksuzna apartmana, kompletno namje&scaron;teni sa inverter klimatizacijom, te podnim grijanjem cijelog stambenog prostora. Kuæa je graðena izuzetno kvalitetno.</p>', '<p>We have this luxury stone house situated only 4 km from the city of Zadar. The internal layout area is 140 m2, and the total net area of the entire facility is 410 m2. The house consists of a basement, large luxury apartment on the ground floor and first floor of the two luxury apartments, fully furnished with inverter air conditioning, underfloor heating very the entire living space. The house is built extremely well. The whole furniture and appliances included in the price !!</p>', '', '<p>Luksuzna kamena kuæa udaljena svega 4 km od grada Zadra sagraðena na terenu povr&scaron;ine 560 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Tlocrtna povr&scaron;ina kuæe iznosi 140 m2, odnosno ukupna netto povr&scaron;ina cijelog objekta iznosi 410 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa se sastoji od podruma (suterena), velikog luksuznog apartmana u prizemlju i na katu od dva luksuzna apartmana, kompletno namje&scaron;teni sa inverter klimatizacijom, te podnim grijanjem cijelog stambenog prostora.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa ima ugraðen video nadzor objekta sa 8 kamera sa gledanjem i kontrolom preko mobitela i interneta.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U podrumu (suterenu) kuæe nalazi se fittnes dvorana za vje¾banje sa 4 sanitarna èvora, koju se namjerava opremiti modernim spravama za vje¾banje, whirpool bazenom i saunom, te bi tim bila mali "wellness" centar unutar objekta.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U prizemlju je (1) jedan veliki apartman ukupne povr&scaron;ine 130 m2, koji se sastoji od tri spavaæe sobe, WC-a, kupaone, ostave, kuhinje sa blagovaonom i dnevnim boravkom iz kojeg se izlazi na veliku natkrivenu terasu. Kroz cijeli stan postavljen je sustav podnog grijanja, ventilacija (rekuperator) i svaka prostorija ima klimu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na katu se nalaze (2) dva apartmana, svaki sa jednom spavaæom sobom, WC, kupaonom, ostavom, kuhinje sa blagovaonom i dnevnim boravkom, te imaju kategorizaciju 3 i 4 zvjezdice. Vanjski izgled kuæe prene&scaron;en je i u ureðenje apartmana koji su opremljeni masivnim hrastovim namje&scaron;tajem, drvenim podovima i puno detalja.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Oko cijele kuæe postavljen je kameni ogradni zid sa ogradom od kovanog ¾eljeza, te vrata na daljinsko upravljanje za ulaz i izlaz u dvori&scaron;te. Okoli&scaron; kuæe je lijepo ureðen mediteranski vrt sa puno trave, velikim maslinama i ostalog ukrasnog bilja sa sistemom za automatsko navodnjavanje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je graðena izuzetno kvalitetno. Puno se mislilo na toplinsku izolaciju, tako da su zidovi prizemlja i kata zidani ciglenim termo blokom 30 cm, zatim je postavljena izolacija, stirpopr i armaturna mre¾a, pa tek na kraju kamen.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kupoprodajna cijena: 665.000, Eur. Cjelokupan namje&scaron;taj i tehnika ukljuèeni u cijenu !!</p>', '<p>We have this luxury stone house situated only 4 km from the city of  Zadar.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The internal layout area is 140 m2, and the total net area of the  entire facility is 410 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house consists of a basement, large luxury  apartment on the ground floor and first floor of the two luxury apartments,  fully furnished with inverter air conditioning, underfloor heating very the  entire living space. The house has CCTV with 8 cameras watching and satellite  control over&nbsp; it from mobile phones or the Internet.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>In the basement the  floor is a fitness gym with 4 toilets, which are intended to be equipped with  modern exercise equipment, whirlpool swimming pool and sauna, and used as a  private "wellness" center inside the building.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the ground floor is (1)  a large apartment with total area of 130 m2, which consists of three bedrooms,  toilets, bathrooms, pantry, kitchen and living room with exit to a large covered  terrace. Throughout the house is a floor heating system, ventilation (heat  recovery unit) and each room has air conditioning.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Upstairs there are (2)  two apartments, each with one bedroom, toilet, bathroom, pantry, kitchen and  living room, and a categorization 3 and 4 stars. The external appearance of the  house is traditional and the apartments were decorated and equipped with massive  oak furniture, wooden floors and lots of details.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Around the house there  is a stone boundary wall with impressive wrought iron gates and doors and gates  for entry and exit to the garden.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Surrounding the house is a beautifully  landscaped Mediterranean garden with lots of grass, large olive trees and other  ornamental plants with automatic irrigation.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house is built extremely  well. A lot of thought went to ensure the thermal insulation worked with a high  insulation factor inside the traditional stone walls giving a high level of  comfort.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Purchase price: 665.000 Eur. The whole furniture and appliances  included in the price !!</p>', '', '984_Old-stone-house_0.jpg', '984_Old-stone-house_1.jpg', '984_Old-stone-house_2.jpg', '984_Old-stone-house_3.jpg', '984_Old-stone-house_4.jpg', '984_Old-stone-house_5.jpg', '984_Old-stone-house_6.jpg', '984_Old-stone-house_7.jpg', '984_Old-stone-house_8.jpg');
