(985, '', 'Gleba d.o.o.', '', '099 677 82 14 ', 'mahirhujic@gmail.com', 'Trogir', 'Poljica, 3750/1, 3751', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '450', '0', '0', 1, '69108', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 0, 0, 'December 7, 2014', '<p>Dvije apartmanske zgrade u izgradnji, od mora su udaljene 450 m, na svega par kilometara udaljene od turistièkog mjesta, a 15 min od aerodroma. Apartmanske zgrade su graðene od kvalitetnih materijala i po va¾eæim graðevinskim normama. Zgrade su podijeljene na tri kata: prizemlje, I kat i II kat. Na svakom katu se nalaze po dva apartmana.</p>\r\n<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;">Povr&scaron;ine apartmana 37 - 54 m2; cijene od 70.645 - 115.225 Eura!</span></p>', '<p>We are offering two apartments under construction with modern design and a high standard of materials. They are 450m from the sea shore and a few kilometers from the centre of the nearest village centre. The apartment building is 3 floors high, with 2 apartments on each floor, and each apartment on the top two floors having a wide balcony with sea views.</p>\r\n<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;">Apartments are measuring 37 - 54 m2; prices are from 70.645 - 115.225 Eurao</span></p>', '', '<p>Dvije apartmanske zgrade u izgradnji, od mora su udaljene 450 m, na svega par kilometara udaljene od turistièkog mjesta, a 15 min od aerodroma.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartmanske zgrade su graðene od kvalitetnih materijala i po va¾eæim graðevinskim normama. Zgrade su podijeljene na tri kata: prizemlje, I kat i II kat. Na svakom katu se nalaze po dva apartmana. Svaki apartman ima balkon.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartmani s prvog i drugog kata imaju pogled na more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong><span style="text-decoration: underline;">SJEVERNA ZGRADA:</span></strong></p>\r\n<p><strong>Prizemlje</strong>:</p>\r\n<p><strong>NS1</strong> &ndash; povr&scaron;ina <strong>40.18 m2, cijena&nbsp;74.249&nbsp;Eura</strong> &ndash; spavaæa soba, kuhinja, blagovaonica, dnevni boravak i kupaonica i balkon povr&scaron;ine 1.78 m2</p>\r\n<p><strong>NS2 </strong>&ndash; povr&scaron;ina<strong> 54.7 m2, cijena 108.777</strong>&nbsp;<strong>Eura</strong>&nbsp;&ndash; dvije spavaæe sobe, kuhinja, dnevna soba, blagovaonica, kupaonica i balkon povr&scaron;ine 4.1 m2</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>I kat:</strong></p>\r\n<p><strong>NS3 </strong>&ndash; povr&scaron;ina <strong>40.18 m2</strong><strong>, cijena 63.791</strong>&nbsp;<strong>Eura</strong>&nbsp;&ndash; spavaæa soba, kuhinja, blagovaonica, dnevni boravak i kupaonica i balkon povr&scaron;ine 1.78m2</p>\r\n<p><strong>NS4 </strong>&ndash; povr&scaron;ina<strong> 54.7 m2</strong><strong>, cijena </strong><strong>93.456</strong>&nbsp;<strong>Eura</strong>&nbsp;&ndash; dvije spavaæe sobe, kuhinja, dnevna soba, blagovaonica, kupaonica i balkon povr&scaron;ine 4.1 m2</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>II kat:</strong></p>\r\n<p><strong>NS5 </strong>&ndash; povr&scaron;ina <strong>40.18 m2</strong><strong>, cijena 74.249</strong>&nbsp;<strong>Eura</strong>&nbsp;&ndash; spavaæa soba, kuhinja, blagovaonica, dnevni boravak i kupaonica i balkon povr&scaron;ine 1.78m2</p>\r\n<p><strong>NS6</strong> &ndash; povr&scaron;ina<strong> 54.7 m2</strong><strong>, cijena </strong><strong>108.777</strong>&nbsp;<strong>Eura</strong>&nbsp;&ndash; dvije spavaæe sobe, kuhinja, dnevna soba, blagovaonica, kupaonica i balkon povr&scaron;ine 4.1 m2</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong><span style="text-decoration: underline;">JU®NA ZGRADA:</span></strong></p>\r\n<p><strong>Prizemlje</strong>:</p>\r\n<p><strong>SS1 </strong>&ndash; povr&scaron;ina <strong>48.47 m2</strong><strong>, cijena&nbsp;</strong><strong>110.209</strong>&nbsp;<strong>Eura</strong>&nbsp;&ndash; dvije spavaæa sobe, kuhinja, blagovaonica, dnevni boravak i kupaonica i balkon povr&scaron;ine 3.51 m2</p>\r\n<p><strong>SS2 </strong>&ndash; povr&scaron;ina<strong> 37.89 m2</strong><strong>, cijena </strong><strong>80.874</strong>&nbsp;<strong>Eura</strong>&nbsp;&ndash; spavaæa soba, kuhinja, dnevna soba, blagovaonica, kupaonica i balkon povr&scaron;ine 3.08 m2</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>I kat:</strong></p>\r\n<p><strong>SS3 </strong>&ndash; povr&scaron;ina <strong>48.47 m2</strong><strong>, cijena 95.112</strong>&nbsp;<strong>Eura</strong>&nbsp;&ndash; dvije spavaæa sobe, kuhinja, blagovaonica, dnevni boravak i kupaonica i balkon povr&scaron;ine 3.51 m2</p>\r\n<p><strong>SS4 </strong>&ndash; povr&scaron;ina<strong> 37.89 m2</strong><strong>, cijena 69.795</strong>&nbsp;<strong>Eura</strong>&nbsp;&ndash; spavaæa soba, kuhinja, dnevna soba, blagovaonica, kupaonica i balkon povr&scaron;ine 3.08 m2</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>II kat:</strong></p>\r\n<p><strong>SS5 </strong>&ndash; povr&scaron;ina <strong>48.47 m2</strong><strong>, cijena </strong><strong>110.209</strong>&nbsp;<strong>Eura</strong>&nbsp;&ndash; dvije spavaæa sobe, kuhinja, blagovaonica, dnevni boravak i kupaonica i balkon povr&scaron;ine 3.51 m2</p>\r\n<p><strong>SS6 </strong>&ndash; povr&scaron;ina<strong> 37.89 m2</strong><strong>, cijena</strong> <strong>80.874</strong>&nbsp;<strong>Eura</strong>&nbsp;&ndash; spavaæa soba, kuhinja, dnevna soba, blagovaonica, kupaonica i balkon povr&scaron;ine 3.08 m2</p>', '<p>We are offering two apartments under construction with modern design and a high  standard of materials.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>They are 450m from the sea shore and a few kilometers  from the centre of the nearest village centre.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The apartment building is 3  floors high, with 2 apartments on each floor, and each apartment on the top two  floors having a wide balcony with sea views.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>NORTH BUILDING:</strong></p>\r\n<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;">Ground floor:</span></p>\r\n<p><strong>NS1</strong> - area <strong>40.18 m2, the price of 74.249 euros</strong> - bedroom, kitchen, dining room, living room and bathroom and a  balcony of 1.78m2</p>\r\n<p><strong>NS2 </strong>- area <strong>54.7 m2, the price of 108.777 euros </strong>- two  bedrooms, kitchen, living room, dining room, bathroom and balcony of 4.1  m2</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;">First floor</span>:</p>\r\n<p><strong>NS3</strong> - area <strong>40.18 m2, the price of 63.791 euros</strong> -  bedroom, kitchen, dining room, living room and bathroom and a balcony of  1.78m2</p>\r\n<p><strong>NS4 </strong>- area <strong>54.7 m2, the price of 93.456 euros</strong> - two bedrooms, kitchen,  living room, dining room, bathroom and balcony of 4.1 m2</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;">Second  floor</span>:</p>\r\n<p><strong>NS5 </strong>- area <strong>40.18 m2, the price of 74.249 euros</strong> - bedroom, kitchen, dining  room, living room and bathroom and a balcony of 1.78m2</p>\r\n<p><strong>NS6</strong> - area <strong>54.7 m2,  the price of 108.777 euros</strong> - two bedrooms, kitchen, living room, dining room,  bathroom and balcony of 4.1 m2</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>SOUTH BUILDING:</strong></p>\r\n<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;">Ground  floor:</span></p>\r\n<p><strong>SS1</strong> - area <strong>48.47 m2, the price of 110.209 euros</strong> - two sleeping rooms,  kitchen, dining room, living room and bathroom and balcony of 3.51 m2</p>\r\n<p><strong>SS2 </strong>-  area <strong>37.89 m2, the price of 80.874 euros</strong> - bedroom, kitchen, living room, dining  room, bathroom and balcony of 8.3 m2</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;">First floor</span>:</p>\r\n<p><strong>SS3 </strong>- area <strong>48.47  m2, the price of 95.112 euros</strong> - two sleeping rooms, kitchen, dining room, living  room and bathroom and balcony of 3.51 m2</p>\r\n<p><strong>SS4 </strong>- area <strong>37.89 m2, the price of 69.795 euros</strong> - bedroom, kitchen, living room, dining room, bathroom and balcony  of 8.3 m2</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;">Second floor</span>:</p>\r\n<p><strong>SS5</strong> - area <strong>48.47 m2, the price of 110.209 euros</strong> -  two sleeping rooms, kitchen, dining room, living room and bathroom and balcony  of 3.51 m2</p>\r\n<p><strong>SS6</strong> - area <strong>37.89 m2, the price of 80.874 euros</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;- bedroom, kitchen,  living room, dining room, bathroom and balcony of 8.3 m2</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For a viewing  appointment please call our Split office.</p>', '', '985_Apartment_0.jpg', '985_Apartment_1.jpg', '985_Apartment_2.jpg', '985_Apartment_3.jpg', '985_Apartment_4.jpg', '985_Apartment_5.jpg', '985_Apartment_6.jpg', '985_Apartment_7.jpg', '985_Apartment_8.jpg'),
(1303, '', 'Rakiæ', '', '', '', 'Sibenik', '®aboriæ', 'For sale', 'Land plot', '10', '770', '0', 1, '346500', '', 2, 2, 2, 1, 1, 2, 0, 0, 'August 13, 2015', '<p>Graðevinsko zemlji&scaron;te prvi red do mora, nedaleko &Scaron;ibenika.&nbsp;Neposredna blizina &scaron;ljunèane pla¾e, ju¾na orijentacija, idealan nagib terena, moguæa gradnja dvojnog ili samostojeæeg objekta s maksimalno 4 stana po objektu (dvojno ukupno 8 SJ).&nbsp;Zemlji&scaron;te ima povr&scaron;inu 742 m2. Cijena &euro;450/m2.</p>', '<p>We are pleased to offer this rare opportunity to buy a large first line building plot on the mainland shore. It is situated adjacent to the traditional small harbour in a small village near Sibenik, just a few yards from the water''s edge. There is a nearby pebble beach, and the land faces South on a gentle slope. Permission would allow the construction of a pair of buildings, or one larger property with 4 separate apartments per building. The land has an area of 742 m2. Price: 450 EUR/m2.&nbsp;</p>', '', '<p>Graðevinsko zemlji&scaron;te prvi red do mora, nedaleko &Scaron;ibenika.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Neposredna blizina &scaron;ljunèane pla¾e, ju¾na orijentacija, idealan nagib terena, moguæa gradnja dvojnog ili samostojeæeg objekta s maksimalno 4 stana po objektu (dvojno ukupno 8 SJ).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Zemlji&scaron;te ima povr&scaron;inu 742 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Cijena: 450 EUR /m<sup>2</sup></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za sve dodatne informacije molimo kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured u Splitu.</p>', '<p>We are pleased to offer this rare opportunity to buy a large first line building plot on the mainland shore.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is situated adjacent to the traditional small harbour in a small village near Sibenik, just a few yards from the water''s edge.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There is a nearby pebble beach, and the land faces South on a gentle slope.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Permission would allow the construction of a pair of buildings, or one larger property with 4 separate apartments per building.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The land has an area of 742 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Price: 450 EUR / m2&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The area has many services for tourists, such as shops, bars, coffee shops etc, and is close enough to the airport at Split (40 minutes) to be convenient.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>This is an increasingly popular area for people looking for a more ''traditional Croatia'' - away from Split and other larger destinations, but who still want the convenience of being on the mainland.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact our office to arrange to visit the location and speak to our agents.</p>', '', '1303_Land-plot_0.JPG', '1303_Land-plot_1.jpg', '1303_Land-plot_2.JPG', '1303_Land-plot_3.JPG', '1303_Land-plot_4.JPG', '1303_Land-plot_5.JPG', '1303_Land-plot_6.JPG', '1303_Land-plot_7.JPG', '1303_Land-plot_8.jpg'),
(1283, 'Milica', 'Pajièiæ', '', '0914444872', '', 'Trogir', 'Zrinsko Frankopanska 6 - Punta Okrug Donji, 2260/15', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '150', '590', '370', 1, '1050000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 10, 11, 'July 24, 2015', '<p>Samostojeæa apartmanska kuæa idealna za turistièko iznajmljivanje smje&scaron;tena na zapadnom dijelu otoka Èiova u mirnoj uvali u blizini &scaron;ljunèanih pla¾a, ali i mnogih prirodno kamenitih.&nbsp;Kuæa se nalazi u 2. redu od mora, dok je pla¾a udaljena 150 m.&nbsp;Povr&scaron;ina zemlji&scaron;ta iznosi 590 m2 gdje se nalazi kuæa, ureðena okuænica i parking za 6 automobila.&nbsp;Postoji moguænost izgradnje bazena i ostalih sadr¾aja. Ukupna brutto stambena povr&scaron;ina iznosi 370 m2. Sastoji se od prizemlja, 1., 2. i 3. kata.</p>', '<p>We are pleased to offer this great opportunity to purchase, a detached house of 8 individual apartments used for letting to tourists.&nbsp;The house is located in the 2nd row of houses from the sea, while the beach is 150 m. The land area is 590 m2 which includes the house, a nice garden, and private parking for 6 cars.&nbsp;There is the possibility of making improvements by building a swimming pool or other facilities. The total gross living area is 370 m2. The property has the ground floor, 1st, 2nd and 3rd floors.</p>', '', '<p>Samostojeæa apartmanska kuæa idealna za turistièko iznajmljivanje smje&scaron;tena na zapadnom dijelu otoka Èiova u mirnoj uvali u blizini &scaron;ljunèanih pla¾a, ali i mnogih prirodno kamenitih.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa se nalazi u 2. redu od mora, dok je pla¾a udaljena 150 m.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Centar mjesta gdje se nalazi trgovina i kafiæ je udaljen 5 min. vo¾nje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Do svih ostalih sadr¾aja je potrebno 10 min. vo¾nje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Povr&scaron;ina zemlji&scaron;ta iznosi 590 m2 gdje se nalazi kuæa, ureðena okuænica i parking za 6 automobila.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Postoji moguænost izgradnje bazena i ostalih sadr¾aja.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ukupna brutto stambena povr&scaron;ina iznosi 370 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sastoji se od prizemlja, 1., 2. i 3. kata.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Iz kuæe se pru¾a prekrasan pogled na malu luæicu, more i otoke. &nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa se sastoji od ukupno 8 apartmana.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>2 manja se nalaze u prizemlje, dok se na ostalim eta¾ama nalaze po dva na svakoj.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U prizemlju se jo&scaron; nalazi ostava i soba koja slu¾a kao praonica rublja.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Svi apartmani su klimatizirani, namje&scaron;teni i u funkciji turistièkog iznajmljivanja.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Vlasnici takoðer imaju pravo kori&scaron;tenja veza za brod u luèici kojeg buduæi vlasnici mogu koristiti.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ukoliko imate bilo kakvih dodatnih upita stojimo Vam na raspolaganju.</p>', '<p>We are pleased to offer this great opportunity to purchase, a detached house of 8 individual apartments used for letting to tourists.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is ideally situated in the western part of the island Ciovo in a quiet cove near several beaches, and the village centre where there is a charming harbour.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house is located in the 2nd row of houses from the sea, while the beach is 150 m.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The town centre, where there are shops and several cafes, is 5 min. on a bicycle.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>A greater range of shops, restaurants and services is 10 min. driving.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The land area is 590 m2 which includes the house, a nice garden, and private parking for 6 cars.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There is the possibility of making improvements by building a swimming pool or other facilities.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The total gross living area is 370 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property has the ground floor, 1st, 2nd and 3rd floors.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house offers a beautiful view all around, including the small port, the sea and islands.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house consists of 8 apartments.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There are two smaller apartments on the ground floor, and the ground floor also has a storage room and a room that serves as a laundry room.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The apartments on the first, second, and third all all larger.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>All the suites are air-conditioned, furnished and are being used to rent to summer tourists.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>They are in good condition and ready for immediate use for tourists.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property includes a right to moore a boat in the harbour, and have access from the shore.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact the office for more information and to arrange to visit this property. &nbsp; &nbsp;</p>', '', '1283_House-Villa_0.JPG', '1283_House-Villa_1.JPG', '1283_House-Villa_2.JPG', '1283_House-Villa_3.JPG', '1283_House-Villa_4.JPG', '1283_House-Villa_5.JPG', '1283_House-Villa_6.JPG', '1283_House-Villa_7.JPG', '1283_House-Villa_8.JPG'),
(1543, '', 'Jerkunica', '463 844', '098 1912 471', '', 'Brac', 'Sumartin (Puntinak), k.c. 1028/77 k.o. selca', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '15', '545', '93', 2, '420000', '', 2, 2, 2, 1, 1, 2, 3, 2, 'January 21, 2016', '<p>Kuæa u prvom redu do mora na otoku Braèu. Smje&scaron;tena na velikoj parceli, okru¾ena brojnim terasama i kaskadnim odr¾avanim vrtom, ova lijepa nekretnina nalazi se u maloj uvali te je svojim polo¾ajem izvrsno za&scaron;tiæena od vjetra.&nbsp;Ispred svakog apartmana nalazi se velika terasa sa pogledom na more.&nbsp;Do male pla¾e ima svega nekoliko koraka, a susjedstvo je iznimno mirno. Nekretnina ima i gara¾u te vanjski ro&scaron;tilj, a u dvori&scaron;te je moguæe napraviti manji bazen.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;">CIJENA SNI®ENA SA 480.000 EURA!!</span></p>', '<p>Fairly priced seafront house on Brac island, located on a large plot, surrounded by terraces and cascade well-kept garden. This trully beautiful property overlooks the small bay and is perfectly protected from the wind.&nbsp;Both apartments feature large terraces facing and overlooking the sea.&nbsp;The property is located steps away from the beach. The neighbourhood is very quiet and peaceful. There is a garage in the corner of the plot, as well as BBQ area. The garden could host a small swimming pool.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;">PRICE REDUCED FROM 480.000 EURO!!</span></p>', '', '<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;"><strong>CIJENA SNI®ENA SA 480.000 EURA!!</strong></span></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Odlièna kuæa u prvom redu do mora</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa u prvom redu do mora na otoku Braèu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Smje&scaron;tena na velikoj parceli, okru¾ena brojnim terasama i kaskadnim odr¾avanim vrtom, ova lijepa nekretnina nalazi se u maloj uvali te je svojim polo¾ajem izvrsno za&scaron;tiæena od vjetra.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U prizemlju objekta nalazi se studio apartman povr&scaron;ine 30 m2, koji se sastoji od zajednièkog prostora dnevnog boravka i kuhinje te odvojene kupaonice.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na prvom katu smje&scaron;ten je apartman sa posebnim ulazom, a u njemu se nalaze dvije spavaæe sobe, kupaonica te kuhinja sa blagovaonicom.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ispred svakog apartmana nalazi se velika terasa sa pogledom na more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je oblo¾ena braèkim kamenom, konstrukcijski u vrlo dobrom stanju te je renovacija potrebna samo iznutra.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Do male pla¾e ima svega nekoliko koraka, a susjedstvo je iznimno mirno.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nekretnina ima i gara¾u te vanjski ro&scaron;tilj, a u dvori&scaron;te je moguæe napraviti manji bazen.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za dodatne informacije molimo kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured u Splitu.&nbsp;</p>', '<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;"><strong>PRICE REDUCED FROM 480.000 EURO!!</strong></span></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Excellent seafront property &ndash; rare to find</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Fairly priced seafront house on Brac island, located on a large plot, surrounded by terraces and cascade well-kept garden.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>This trully beautiful property overlooks the small bay and is perfectly protected from the wind.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the ground floor there is a studio apartment sized 30 sqm, containing living/sleeping area, kitchen and bathroom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the first floor there is another apartment with separate entrance.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It has 2 bedrooms, bathroom, kitchen and dining room.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Both apartments feature large terraces facing and overlooking the sea.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house is covered in local stone and structurally very sound.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It only needs renovation from within.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property is located steps away from the beach.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The neighbourhood is very quiet and peaceful.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There is a garage in the corner of the plot, as well as BBQ area.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The garden could host a small swimming pool.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For further information please contact our office in Split.&nbsp;</p>', '', '1543_House-Villa_0.jpg', '1543_House-Villa_1.jpg', '1543_House-Villa_2.jpg', '1543_House-Villa_3.jpg', '1543_House-Villa_4.jpg', '1543_House-Villa_5.jpg', '1543_House-Villa_6.jpg', '1543_House-Villa_7.jpg', '1543_House-Villa_8.jpg'),
(1541, 'Mladen', 'Deliæ', '', '091/537-1068', '', 'Split', 'Smojina 9 Varo¹ Split, zk 4916', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '200', '0', '40', 1, '80000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 'January 20, 2016', '<p>Stan za renovaciju, s prostranom terasom s koje se pru¾a pogled na grad, u samom centru.&nbsp;Kuæa u kojoj se nalazi stan je dvojna, te je smje&scaron;tena u mirnom dijelu starog grada, ali u blizini svih sadr¾aja.&nbsp;Udaljena je od mora samo 200 m, u blizini Dioklecijanove palaèe i Marjana.&nbsp;Prikljuèena je na vodu i struju.&nbsp;Stan stambene povr&scaron;ine 40 m2 se nalazi na prvom katu, a vlasniku pripada i terasa od 40 m2 povrh stana.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>We are pleased to offer this rare opportunity to acquire one of the traditional old stone buildings in the conservation area close to the city centre. It is located 200 m from the sea, in the area between the Diocletian Palace and the Marjan hill, within walking distance of the Riva and all the historic and tourist attractions of the town. The Apartment living area is 40 m2, is located on the first floor, and it has a roof terrace of 40 m2 with elevated views over the old town of Split.</p>', '', '<p>Stan za renovaciju, s prostranom terasom s koje se pru¾a pogled na grad, u samom centru.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa u kojoj se nalazi stan je dvojna, te je smje&scaron;tena u mirnom dijelu starog grada, ali u blizini svih sadr¾aja.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Udaljena je od mora samo 200 m, u blizini Dioklecijanove palaèe i Marjana.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Prikljuèena je na vodu i struju.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Stan stambene povr&scaron;ine 40 m2 se nalazi na prvom katu, te mu pripada i terasa od 40 m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Stan se sastoji od dvije spavaæe sobe, kuhinje s blagovaonicom i kupaonice.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Vlasni&scaron;tvo uredno.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>S obzirom na poziciju ovo je izvrsna prilika ukoliko ¾elite nekretninu renovirati u svrhu turistièkog iznajmljivanja ili je jednostavno ¾elite koristiti za vlastiti boravak.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Parking je javni, nedaleko kuæe, a najbli¾i veæi parking udaljen je 300 m od kuæe.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Park &scaron;uma Marjan gdje se nalazi rekreacijska zona i prekrasne pla¾e udaljena je nekoliko minuta hodanja.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Meðunarodni aerodrom udaljen je 40 min. vo¾nje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za sve dodatne informacije slobodno nas kontaktirajte.</p>', '<p>We are pleased to offer this rare opportunity to acquire one of the traditional old stone buildings in the conservation area close to the city centre.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is located 200 m from the sea, in the area between the Diocletian Palace and the Marjan hill, within walking distance of the Riva and all the historic and tourist attractions of the town. &nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The area is very popular with tourists because of its character and central location, with many of the neighbouring properties already used by the fast growing numbers of tourists to Split.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house is presently arranged as one duplex apartment and needs complete interior renovation.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The services (water, electric etc.) are present.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The Apartment living area is 40 m2, is located on the first floor, and it has a roof terrace of 40 m2 with elevated views over the old town of Split.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It consists of two bedrooms, kitchen, dining room and bathroom.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Due to this position is an excellent opportunity if you want to renovate the property for the purpose of renting for tourism purposes, or simply want to use for your own rooms in the town centre.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Parking is public, not far from the house, but the nearest large parking is 300 meters from the house.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Marjan Forest Park is a large recreation area and beautiful beaches within a few minutes of walking.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The international airport is 40 minutes driving.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For further information please contact our Split old town office.</p>', '', '1541_Apartment_0.jpg', '1541_Apartment_1.jpg', '1541_Apartment_2.jpg', '1541_Apartment_3.jpg', '1541_Apartment_4.jpg', '1541_Apartment_5.jpg', '1541_Apartment_6.jpg', '1541_Apartment_7.jpg', '1541_Apartment_8.jpg'),
(987, 'Du¹ica', '®ivèiæ', '', '091/ 507 7136', '', 'Split', 'Ljudevita Posavskog 17, 4693 ark.kat.   z.u. 10447', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '800', '0', '116', 1, '190000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 4, 1, 'December 13, 2014', '<p>Apartman na 4.katu (potkrovlje) prekrasne starogradske zgrade. Smje&scaron;ten je u centru Splita udaljen 10 minuta hodanja od popularne rive. Ukupna povr&scaron;ina iznosi 116 m2, a sastoji se od hodnika, kuhinje, dnevnog boravka, 4 spavaæe sobe, spreme, wc-a i kupaonice. Apartmanu je potrebno renoviranje, ali je zbog cijene, velicine i polozaja izvrsna investicija.</p>', '<p>We are pleased to offer this very large apartment on the 4th floor (top floor) of this beautiful old building. It is superbly located in the centre of Split, a 10-minute walk from Riva and the Palace. The total area is 116 m2 and after ascending the lovely wide marble stairs. The apartment is in need of renovation, but due to the reduced price, the potential, and position would make an excellent investment!!</p>', '', '<p>Apartman na 4.katu (potkrovlje) prekrasne starogradske zgrade.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Smje&scaron;ten je u centru Splita udaljen 10 minuta hodanja od popularne rive, mnogih znamenitosti i ostalih sadr¾aja koje pru¾a povijesni dio samog centra i palaèe.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ukupna povr&scaron;ina iznosi 116 m2, a sastoji se od hodnika, kuhinje, dnevnog boravka, 4 spavaæe sobe, spreme, wc-a i kupaonice.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Iz dnevnog boravka se izlazi na veliku krovnu terasu susjedne zgrade koja se mo¾e koristiti za su&scaron;enje rublja i u¾ivanje za vrijeme sunèanih dana.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sa terase se pru¾a pogled na grad i park &scaron;umu Marjan gdje se ujedno nalaze i mnogobrojne prirodno kamenite pla¾e.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartmanu je potrebno renoviranje, ali je zbog cijene, velicine i polozaja izvrsna investicija.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Najbli¾i parking udaljen je cca. 30 m, dok je do meðunarodnog aerodroma potrebno 40 min. vo¾nje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Molimo da nas kontaktirate za sva dodatna pitanja.</p>', '<p>We are pleased to offer this very large apartment on the 4th floor (top floor)  of this beautiful old building.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is superbly located in the centre of  Split, a 10-minute walk from Riva and the Palace, with many tourist attractions  and other facilities provided in the historical part of the city.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The  total area is 116 m2 and after ascending the lovely wide marble stairs. The  apartment consists of hallway, kitchen, living room, 4 bedrooms, storage,  toilets and bathrooms.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The living room has access to the large area on  the roof of the adjacent building, which could be exploited whether just for  drying clothes, or with some adjustments for private sun bathing.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The terrace  offers views of the city, the sea, and Marjan Forest Park.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The apartment  is in need of renovation, but due to the reduced price, the potential, and  position would make an excellent investment!!</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The nearest parking is located  approx 30 m distant, while to the international airport takes 30 minutes  driving.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact us for any further questions.</p>', '', '987_Apartment_0.jpg', '987_Apartment_1.jpg', '987_Apartment_2.jpg', '987_Apartment_3.jpg', '987_Apartment_4.jpg', '987_Apartment_5.jpg', '987_Apartment_6.jpg', '987_Apartment_7.jpg', '987_Apartment_8.jpg'),
(988, 'Tajana', 'Ilic', '+447810 750555 - Chris Charles', '+447828 404196 - Tajana Ilic', 'inbox@chrischarles.com kljuè 021796686', 'Kastela', 'Murtinica 18, Kastel Luksic, 292/1, ZU1146 kljuè0919500821', 'For sale', 'Old stone house', '30', '0', '75', 1, '240000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 'December 14, 2014', '<p>Kompletno renovirana i opremljena stara kamena kuæa u jednom od 7 prekrasnih Ka&scaron;tela. Od mora i atraktivnog dvorca udaljena je 30 m, dok se pje&scaron;èana pla¾a takoðer nalazi u blizini. Ukupna stambena povr&scaron;ina iznosi 75 m2 + 25 m2 krovne terase sa kaminom. S terase se pru¾a pogled na mjesto.</p>', '<p>It''s a fantastic renovated stone house located in the centre of the beautiful historic village, ideally located between Split and Trogir. The house has 3 floors and a large roof terrace with panoramic mountain view from balcony!&nbsp;Total living area is 75 square meters + 25 square metre roof terrace with brick built BBQ. The house is part of the original settlement of houses behind the Castle that was built in the 15th century.</p>', '', '<p>Kompletno renovirana i opremljena stara kamena kuæa u jednom od 7 prekrasnih Ka&scaron;tela, koja su se smjetila izmeðu povijesnih gradova Trogira i Splita.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Od mora i atraktivnog dvorca udaljena je 30 m, dok se pje&scaron;èana pla¾a takoðer nalazi u blizini.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ukupna stambena povr&scaron;ina iznosi 75 m2 + 25 m2 krovne terase sa kaminom. S terase se pru¾a pogled na mjesto.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U prizemlju se nalazi kuhinja i kupaonica koje su kompletno opremljenje modernim i kvalitetnim materijalima i ureðajima.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na 1.katu se nalazi kupaonica i spavaæa soba, dok je na 2.katu prostrana spavaæa soba koja se takoðer koristi&nbsp; kao dnevni boravak.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je potpuno opremljena sa LCD televizorima, DVD playerima, satelitskom antenom, modernom talijanskom kuhinjom sa svim ureðajima, posebnim fri¾iderom za piæe, klimatizacijskim ureðajima i svim ostalim potrebnim za ugodan boravak.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je u funkciji turistièkog iznajmljivanja stoga je mo¾ete koristiti u istu svrhu ili za vlastiti odmor.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Najbli¾i parking udaljen je cca. 50m, dok je meðunarodni aerodrom udaljen 15 min. vo¾nje.</p>\r\n<p>U blizini se nalaze trgovine, kafiæi, restorani i svi ostali sadr¾aji.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za sva dodatna pitanja molimo da nas kontaktirate.</p>', '<p>It''s a fantastic renovated stone house located in the centre of the beautiful  historic village, ideally located between Split and Trogir.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house has  3 floors and a large roof terrace with panoramic mountain view from  balcony!&nbsp;Total living area is 75 square meters + 25 square metre roof terrace  with brick built BBQ.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house is part of the original settlement of  houses behind the Castle that was built in the 15th century.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property is  a traditional stone house that has existed since the village was formed in the  15th Century and it&rsquo;s very well situated for visiting Split, Trogir, Sibenik,  Omis, Zadar and Krka Park.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house is only 30 metres from the sea with  the closest beach only being a 1 minute walk from the house. There are quiet  family beaches with natural shade close by.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The beaches of the Kastela region  combine into a 6km long string of bays and bathing areas which are shaded by  pine trees.&nbsp;The shops and restaurants in the local area are open all year  round.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The location is peaceful with all the shops you require for your  essentials accessible by foot. As well as being close to the beach the  house is also close to historic buildings including a Castle and Church.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house is original stone house so no parking space. There is lots of  free parking on street nearby.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Key Features</strong></p>\r\n<p><strong>&nbsp;</strong>- Luxury Stone  House That Was Part Of The Original Village Settlement. Completely Refurbished  To High Standard.<br />- Large 25 m2 Roof Terrace. Rare for stone houses. With  Built in Large Charcoal Brick Barbecue and Panoramic View. Grill fish and some  meat and enjoy meals in the warm Croatian sun enjoying the panoramic mountain  view.<br />- Air Conditioning is installed on all 3 floors for ultimate  comfort<br />- 2 Bathrooms &ndash; Ground floor with large bath for 2, sink,toilet  and 1st floor with Luxury Jet Shower with radio, sink, toilet. Tiled.<br />- Satellite Television installed for large selection of channels in English,  German, Italian, French and other languages<br />- Bedroom 1 with Large Super  King Size Bed with large cupboard for storage space, 32 Inch Flat Screen TV with  DVD &amp; Satellite.<br />- Bedroom 2/Living Room &ndash; This room is open plan and  can either be used as a bedroom or a living room. Italian designer double sofa  bed and 2nd single sofa bed. 42 Inch Flat Screen Television, Drinks Fridge,  Hi-Fi, DVD Player, DVDs, Playstation 2.<br />- Designer Fully Fitted Italian  Kitchen, Bosch Oven,Microwave, Tall Fridge Freezer, Washing Machine, Large Dish  Washer. Tile Flooring.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Price includes Kitchen, All Appliances in the  house, Televisions, Satellite, Furniture and ready to move in or for rental.  House already has letting permit.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house is 10 minutes to Split  airport, 15 minutes to Split town, 15 minutes to Trogir by car.&nbsp;Approximately  1 hour to Krka National Park. Great Location for discovering Croatia. There  is also a good bus service that runs to Split and Trogir  nearby.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please call our Split office to arrange a viewing.</p>', '', '988_Old-stone-house_0.jpg', '988_Old-stone-house_1.jpg', '988_Old-stone-house_2.jpg', '988_Old-stone-house_3.jpg', '988_Old-stone-house_4.jpg', '988_Old-stone-house_5.jpg', '988_Old-stone-house_6.jpg', '988_Old-stone-house_7.jpg', '988_Old-stone-house_8.jpg'),
(989, 'Ivana', 'Ujèiæ', '', '091 5522 793', 'ivana.ujcic@ri.t-com.hr', 'Brac', 'Mirca', 'For sale', 'Old stone house', '800', '600', '200', 1, '190000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 4, 1, 'December 14, 2014', '<p>&Scaron;armantna stara kamena kuæa u solidnom stanju, sa dodatnim objektima na velikoj okuænici. Kuæa je dvojna, a sastoji se od prizemlja, kata i potkrovlja. Ukupna stabmena povr&scaron;ina iznosi 200 m2, a parcela je povr&scaron;ina 600 m2. S obzirom na stanje objekta, polo¾aj, pristup, velièinu parcele s moguæno&scaron;æu izgradnje bazena i ureðenje dodatnih objekata kao posebnog bungalova i ljetne kuhinje s kaminom, ova nekretnina ima izuzetan potencija!</p>', '<p>Charming semi detached old stone house in good condition with sea views and with additional facilities on a large plot! It is situated on a land plot of 600 m2, while the gross living area 200 m2 (house 150 m2 + cellar 32 m2 + storage 18 m2). It is 800 maters distant from the sea shore but has nice sea views, as well as views across the natural woods on the island. The property has great potential!</p>', '', '<p>&Scaron;armantna stara kamena kuæa u solidnom stanju, sa dodatnim objektima na velikoj okuænici.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nalazi se u malom i mirnom mjestu udaljenom svega 2 km od mjesta Supetar.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Prilaz do kuæe komodan.&nbsp;Okuænicu èini dvori&scaron;te s palmom, naranèama, limunom, smokvom i dodatni objekti: konoba, sprema i gustirna</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je dvojna, a sastoji se od prizemlja, kata i potkrovlja.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>- Prizemlje: kuhinja, blagovaona, soba, hodnik</p>\r\n<p>- Kat: 3 sobe, unutra&scaron;nje stepeni&scaron;te za prizemlje i potkrovlje</p>\r\n<p>- Visoko potkrovlje: neureðeno, solidne visine</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Potrebna je adaptacija. Zidovi su debljine preko 60 cm, podovi katova su solidne drvene grede na koje su polo¾ene daske, a na njih parket koji kao takav mo¾e i ostati.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>S obzirom na stanje objekta, polo¾aj, pristup, velièinu parcele s moguæno&scaron;æu izgradnje bazena i ureðenje dodatnih objekata kao posebnog bungalova i ljetne kuhinje s kaminom, ova nekretnina ima izuzetan potencija!</p>', '<p>Charming semi detached old stone house in good condition with sea views and with  additional facilities on a large plot!</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is situated in a small Dalmatian  fishing village only 2 km from Supetar.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is situated on a land plot of 600  m2, while the gross living area 200 m2 (house 150 m2 + cellar 32 m2 + storage 18  m2).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is 800 maters distant from the sea shore but has nice sea views, as  well as views across the natural woods on the island.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>An attractive garden  around the house with palm trees, oranges, lemon and fig tree, add to the  timeless character of this property. The property boasts additional facilities  on the plot and these include konoba/tavern, storage and traditional  draw-well.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house is designed with:</p>\r\n<p>- Ground floor: kitchen, dining room,  bedroom, hall</p>\r\n<p>- 1st floor: 3 bedrooms, internal staircase to the ground floor  and attic</p>\r\n<p>- Attic: currently used as storage only</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house is in good  condition, with thick old stone walls and solid wooden beams under substantial  planks on the floor, and although the building needs redecorating, these  features can remain.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property has great potential due to the good  condition, good location, access,&nbsp; land size, the possibility of building a  swimming pool and renovation of additional facilities as a separate bungalow and  summer kitchen with fireplace, and of course, the price reflects the fact that  this property is semi-detached.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The island of Brac is connected daily by  ferry to Split, while the international airport is 40 min from Split.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For  any questions, you are at your disposal.</p>', '', '989_Old-stone-house_0.jpg', '989_Old-stone-house_1.jpg', '989_Old-stone-house_2.jpg', '989_Old-stone-house_3.jpg', '989_Old-stone-house_4.jpg', '989_Old-stone-house_5.jpg', '989_Old-stone-house_6.jpg', '989_Old-stone-house_7.jpg', '989_Old-stone-house_8.jpg'),
(990, 'Josip', 'Mornar Deman', '', '098 350 297', 'Beposound@gmail.com', 'Kastela', 'K.©tafiliæ, Lucijin put 17, k.è 2933', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '200', '333', '142', 1, '210000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 4, 2, 'December 14, 2014', '<p>Samostojeæa kuæa u malom mjestu Ka&scaron;tela koje se smjestilo izmeðu povijesnih gradova Trogira i Splita. Trenutno se sastoji samo od prizemlja i manjeg potkrovlja, ali postoji moguænost nadogradnje. Ukupna povr&scaron;ina zemlji&scaron;ta iznosi 333 m2, sa prostranim dvori&scaron;tem u kojem je moguæa izgradnja bazena. U dvori&scaron;tu se takoðer nalazi parking za 2 automobila i gara¾a. Potpuno je renovirana, stoga je odmah moguæe useliti.</p>', '<p>We are offering this detached house in the coastal village of Ka&scaron;tela, situated between the historic towns of Trogir and Split. The property at the moment only consists of a ground floor and a small loft, but there is the option to upgrade the house. The total land plot is 333 m2, with a spacious courtyard where it is possible to build a swimming pool. It has been completely renovated, so it is possible to move in immediately.</p>', '', '<p>Samostojeæa kuæa u malom mjestu Ka&scaron;tela koje se smjestilo izmeðu povijesnih gradova Trogira i Splita.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Trenutno se sastoji samo od prizemlja i manjeg potkrovlja, ali postoji moguænost nadogradnje. Iskoristivost potkrovlja je 60 %</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ukupna povr&scaron;ina zemlji&scaron;ta iznosi 333 m2, sa prostranim dvori&scaron;tem u kojem je moguæa izgradnja bazena.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U dvori&scaron;tu se takoðer nalazi parking za 2 automobila i gara¾a.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa se sastoji od 4 sobe, 2 kupaonice sa wc-om, velikim dnevnim boravkom, kuhinjom i gara¾om.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Zemlji&scaron;te ima prilaz sa dvije strane.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Potpuno je renovirana, stoga je odmah moguæe useliti i u¾ivati u jednom od 7 prekrasnih Ka&scaron;tela.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>More i &scaron;etnica su udaljeni 200 m, dok se svi sadr¾aji nalazi u blizini.</p>\r\n<p>Meðunarodni aerodrom udaljen je 10 min. vo¾nje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za sva dodatna pitanja vam stojimo na usluzi.</p>', '<p>We are offering this detached house in the coastal village of Ka&scaron;tela, situated  between the historic towns of Trogir and Split.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property at the moment  only consists of a ground floor and a small loft, but there is the option to  upgrade the house.&nbsp;Utilization of the attic is 60%</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The total land plot is  333 m2, with a spacious courtyard where it is possible to build a swimming  pool.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the property there is space for the parking of 2 cars and a garage,  as well as storage etc.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house consists of 4 bedrooms, 2 bathrooms with  toilet, large living room, kitchen and garage.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The land has access from two  sides.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It has been completely renovated, so it is possible to move in  immediately.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The sea and Riva are 200 meters distant, and it is conveniently  situated for the local shops, bars and restaurants, and other facilities. The  international airport is 10 minutes driving.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For any questions, please  contact the office in Split, and we will be at your service.</p>', '', '990_House-Villa_0.jpg', '990_House-Villa_1.jpg', '990_House-Villa_2.jpg', '990_House-Villa_3.jpg', '990_House-Villa_4.jpg', '990_House-Villa_5.jpg', '990_House-Villa_6.jpg', '990_House-Villa_7.jpg', '990_House-Villa_8.jpg'),
(991, '', 'Dalmatis', '', '', '', 'Zadar', 'Maslenica', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '500', '874', '75', 2, '143000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 2, 1, 'December 14, 2014', '<p>Obiteljska kuæa (prizemnica sa potkrovjem) nettto povr&scaron;ine prizemlja 75 m2, udaljena od mora svega 500 m. Kuæa se nalazi mirnoj lokaciji na terenu povr&scaron;ine 874 m2 sa kojeg se prostire istovremeno prekrasan pogled na more sa ju¾ne strane kuæe, te je idealna za obiteljski odmor ili turistièku djelatnost buduæi da je teren idealan za izgradnju vanjskog bazena. Kuæa je iznutra u cijelosti namje&scaron;tena, a izvana je potrebno zavr&scaron;iti fasadu.</p>', '<p>We are pleased to offer this detached house, at the top of the village. The property is a family house (bungalow with attic) with a surface area on the ground floor of 75m sq, 500m from the sea. The house is in a quiet location on a plot of 874 m2 which has a beautiful view of the sea from the south side of the house, and behind is the wild countryside. It is an ideal property for family vacations or tourist activity since the terrain would suit a patio and swimming pool.</p>', '', '<p>Obiteljska kuæa (prizemnica sa potkrovjem) nettto povr&scaron;ine prizemlja 75 m2, udaljena od mora svega 500 m.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa se nalazi mirnoj lokaciji na terenu povr&scaron;ine 874 m2 sa kojeg se prostire istovremeno prekrasan pogled na more sa ju¾ne strane kuæe, te je idealna za obiteljski odmor ili turistièku djelatnost buduæi da je teren idealan za izgradnju vanjskog bazena.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je iznutra u cijelosti namje&scaron;tena, a izvana je potrebno zavr&scaron;iti fasadu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa se sastoji od:&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>- Vanjskog parkinga sa dvori&scaron;tem.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>- Prizemlja kuæe: ulazni prostor "hodnik", veliki dnevni boravak, kuhinja sa blagovaonicom, kupatila sa wc, dvije spavaæe sobe.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>- Gara¾e povr&scaron;ine 37 m2.</p>', '<p>We are pleased to offer this detached house, at the top of the  village.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property is a family house (bungalow with attic) with a  surface area on the ground floor of 75m sq, 500m from the sea.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house is  in a quiet location on a plot of 874 m2 which has a beautiful view of the sea  from the south side of the house, and behind is the wild countryside.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is  an ideal property for family vacations or tourist activity since the terrain  would suit a patio and swimming pool.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house is fully furnished, and the  outside needs a small amount of effort to completely transform this property from a grey concrete box, to an attractive family holiday home.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house  consists of:</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>- Outer parking with a yard.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>- Ground floor: entrance hall  "corridor", a large living room, kitchen, dining room, bathroom with toilet, two  bedrooms.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>- Garages of 37 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The price reflects its appeal as it  stands, but two days painting outside would make you realise what good value  this property really is.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact our agents who will gladly show  you round.</p>', '', '991_House-Villa_0.jpg', '991_House-Villa_1.jpg', '991_House-Villa_2.jpg', '991_House-Villa_3.jpg', '991_House-Villa_4.jpg', '991_House-Villa_5.jpg', '991_House-Villa_6.jpg', '991_House-Villa_7.jpg', '991_House-Villa_8.jpg');
INSERT INTO `nekretnina` (`id`, `ime`, `prezime`, `telefon`, `mobitel`, `e_mail`, `lokacija_id`, `adresa`, `status_id`, `vrsta_id`, `udaljenost`, `povrsina`, `stambenapovrsina`, `display`, `cijena`, `cijenatocka`, `ponuda_tjedna`, `new_built`, `must_sell`, `prvi_red_do_mora`, `pogled_na_more`, `bazen`, `broj_soba`, `broj_kupatila`, `datum`, `title_hr`, `title_en`, `title_ge`, `opis_hr`, `opis_en`, `opis_ge`, `PropertyImageURL0`, `PropertyImageURL1`, `PropertyImageURL2`, `PropertyImageURL3`, `PropertyImageURL4`, `PropertyImageURL5`, `PropertyImageURL6`, `PropertyImageURL7`, `PropertyImageURL8`) VALUES
(992, 'Zdravko', 'Po¹a', '', '091/ 891 7617', '', 'Split', 'Teutina 1, 10958/1 arkod katastar   z.u. 2737 ', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '300', '0', '95', 2, '185000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 3, 1, 'December 14, 2014', '<p>Prostrani apartman u starogradskoj zgradi u samom centru Splita na jednoj od najljep&scaron;ih lokacija u blizini mnogobrojnih restorana, barova, trgovina i ostalih sadr¾aja. Apartman je smje&scaron;ten na 3.katu, dok je orjentacija S-Z-J. Ukupna stambena povr&scaron;ina iznosi 95 m2 + 2 m2 spremi&scaron;ta u prizemlju. Kompletno je renoviran prije 5 godina, te nije potrebno nikakvo dodatno ulaganje.</p>', '<p>We are pleased to offer this spacious apartment in an old building in the centre of Split, close to many restaurants, bars, shops and other facilities. The Riva and Diocletian''s Palace are on the doorstep! The apartment is located on the 3rd floor, and the orientation is North-West-South.&nbsp;Total area is 95 m2 + 2 m2 with an extra storage room on the ground floor.</p>', '', '<p>Prostrani apartman u starogradskoj zgradi u samom centru Splita na jednoj od najljep&scaron;ih lokacija u blizini mnogobrojnih restorana, barova, trgovina i ostalih sadr¾aja.Do rive i Dioklecijanove palaèe je potrebno svega par minuta hodanja.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartman je smje&scaron;ten na 3.katu, dok je orjentacija S-Z-J. Ukupna stambena povr&scaron;ina iznosi 95 m2 + 2 m2 spremi&scaron;ta u prizemlju.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sastoji se od prostranog hodnika, kuhinje, dnevnog boravka, manje radne sobe, 3 spavaæe sobe, kupaonice i balkona na ju¾noj strani.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kompletno je renoviran prije 5 godina, te nije potrebno nikakvo dodatno ulaganje, jedino ako ga ¾elite preurediti prema vlastitim ¾eljama.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>***Namje&scaron;taj nije ukljuèen u cijenu, ali takoðer postoji moguænost dogovora.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Do najbli¾eg parking je potrebno cca. 50 m, &scaron;to je jo&scaron; jedna prednost ove nekretnine.</p>\r\n<p>Meðunarodni aerodrom udaljen je 40 min. vo¾nje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za sva dodatna pitanja i razgledavanje molimo da nas kontaktirate.</p>', '<p>We are pleased to offer this spacious apartment in an old building in the centre  of Split, close to many restaurants, bars, shops and other  facilities.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The Riva and Diocletian''s Palace are on the  doorstep!</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;The apartment is located on the 3rd floor, and the orientation  is North-West-South.&nbsp;Total area is 95 m2 + 2 m2 with an extra storage room on  the ground floor.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It consists of a spacious hall, and leading from this  are a kitchen, living room, small study room, 3 bedrooms, bathroom and with a  balcony on the south side.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Both the inside of the apartment and the  building have been completely renovated, only 5 years ago, and the property does  not need any additional investment.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>***Furniture is not included in the  price.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The nearest  parking is a couple of minutes walk, which is another advantage of this  property, bearing in mind how close it is to the centre of ''old town  Split''.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The international airport is 40 mins driving, although some taxi  drivers can do the journey in 30 minutes.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For any additional questions  and tour please contact us, and we will be happy to show you round.</p>', '', '992_Apartment_0.jpg', '992_Apartment_1.jpg', '992_Apartment_2.jpg', '992_Apartment_3.jpg', '992_Apartment_4.jpg', '992_Apartment_5.jpg', '992_Apartment_6.jpg', '992_Apartment_7.jpg', '992_Apartment_8.jpg'),
(994, 'Gordana/Vedran', 'Cindro', '091/5129866 Vedran', '091/ 512 9897 Gordana', '', 'Split', 'Gospinica 31', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '250', '0', '122', 1, '465000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 4, 2, 'December 17, 2014', '<p>Prekrasan apartman na drugom katu u predivnom mirnom dijelu grada, udaljen od mora i prekrasnih pla¾a svega 250 metara. Apartman je lijepo ureðen, povr&scaron;ine 122 m2 + 22 m2 lijepo ureðene konobe koja se nalazi u podrumu kuæe. Sastoji se od kuhinje sa blagovaonicom i prostranim dnevnim boravkom, 4 sobe, 2 kupatila i dvije terase. Apartmanu pripada i parkirno mjesto ispred kuæe.</p>', '<p>We have this exceptionally large and beautiful apartment on the second floor of a stylish building in a quiet area near Split town centre. The apartment is nicely decorated and furnished, 122 m2 + 22 m2 with superb wine cellars located in the basement of the house. It consists of a kitchen, dining room and spacious living room, four bedrooms, two bathrooms and two balconies, with long views over the town and the sea. Apartment has a parking space in front of the house.</p>', '', '<p>Prekrasan apartman na drugom katu u predivnom mirnom dijelu grada, udaljen od mora i prekrasnih pla¾a svega 250 metara.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartman je lijepo ureðen, povr&scaron;ine 122 m2 + 22 m2 lijepo ureðene konobe koja se nalazi u podrumu kuæe.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sastoji se od kuhinje sa blagovaonicom i prostranim dnevnim boravkom, 4 sobe, 2 kupatila i dvije terase.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Opremljen je centralnim grijanjem i klimatiziran.Konoba se sastoji od male kuhinje, kupatila i prostorije sa kaminom koji æe odlièno poslu¾iti u svakodnevnom ¾ivotu, a posebno kad vam dolaze prijatelji na dru¾enje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartmanu pripada i parkirno mjesto ispred kuæe.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Zbog odliène lokacije i blizine centra mo¾e se i turistièki iznajmljivati. Takoðer je idealan i za obiteljski ¾ivot preko cijele godine.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Meðunarodni aerodrom udaljen je 40 min. vo¾nje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za sva ostala pitanja vam stojimo na raspolaganju.</p>', '<p>We have this exceptionally large and beautiful apartment on the second floor of  a stylish building in a quiet area near Split town centre.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The apartment  is nicely decorated and furnished, 122 m2 + 22 m2 with superb wine cellars  located in the basement of the house.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It consists of a kitchen, dining room  and spacious living room, four bedrooms, two bathrooms and two balconies, with  long views over the town and the sea.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is equipped with central heating and  air conditioned, and is used all year at the moment.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>In the cellar, the  ''Tavern'' consists of a small kitchen, bathroom and room with BBQ/fireplace that  works fine in everyday life or on special occasions.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartment has a  parking space in front of the house.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Its location and proximity to the&nbsp;  centre&nbsp; would make it popular for renting to tourists, but it would be a  fabulous property to live all year.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The international airport is 30 min  driving.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For all other questions you are at your disposal.</p>', '', '994_Apartment_0.jpg', '994_Apartment_1.jpg', '994_Apartment_2.jpg', '994_Apartment_3.jpg', '994_Apartment_4.jpg', '994_Apartment_5.jpg', '994_Apartment_6.jpg', '994_Apartment_7.jpg', '994_Apartment_8.jpg'),
(995, 'Nenad', 'Mihoviloviæ', '', '098/ 707 123', 'nenad.mihovilovic@gmail.com', 'Split', 'Cosmijeva 7', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '150', '0', '22', 1, '170000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 0, 1, 'December 17, 2014', '<p>Ugostiteljski objekt u Dioklecijanovoj palaèi, trenutno u funkciji mini restorana. Prostor je povr&scaron;ine 22 m2, sa dozvolom grada za vanjskih 12 mjesta, kompletno renoviran prije 3 godine u skladu sa zahtjevima konzervatora jer je objekt pod za&scaron;titom UNESCO-a. Udaljen je svega 40 metara od glavnog gradskog trga i 150 metara od Rive. U cijenu je ukljuèen i kompletan inventar.</p>\r\n<p><span style="text-decoration: underline; color: #ff0000;">CIJENA SNI®ENA SA 210.000 EUR!!!</span></p>', '<p>We are offering this rare opportunity to buy a catering business with freehold  premises within the Diocletian Palace walls. The property is currently  being operated as a restaurant, 12 months of the year, and it covers 22,47m sq  with an additional 12 seats on the adjoining pavement.&nbsp;The location is 40 m  from the main sq and 2 minutes walk from the water front. Like all the streets  in the Palace it has a significant hourly ''footfall''.</p>\r\n<p><span style="text-decoration: underline; color: #ff0000;">PRICE REDUCED FROM 210.000 EUR!!!</span></p>', '', '<p><span style="text-decoration: underline; color: #ff0000;"><strong>CIJENA SNI®ENA SA 210.000 EUR!!!</strong></span></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ugostiteljski objekt u Dioklecijanovoj palaèi, trenutno u funkciji mini restorana.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Prostor je povr&scaron;ine 22 m2, sa dozvolom grada za vanjskih 12 mjesta, kompletno renoviran prije 3 godine u skladu sa zahtjevima konzervatora jer je objekt pod za&scaron;titom UNESCO-a.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Udaljen je svega 40 metara od glavnog gradskog trga i 150 metara od Rive.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U cijenu je ukljuèen i kompletan inventar.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Meðunarodni aerodrom 30 min vo¾nje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za razgledavanje i dodatne informacije vam stojimo na usluzi.</p>', '<p><span style="text-decoration: underline; color: #ff0000;"><strong>PRICE REDUCED FROM 210.000 EUR!!!</strong></span></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>We are offering this rare opportunity to buy a catering business with freehold  premises within the Diocletian Palace walls.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property is currently  being operated as a restaurant, 12 months of the year, and it covers 22,47m sq  with an additional 12 seats on the adjoining pavement.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The location is 40 m  from the main sq and 2 minutes walk from the water front. Like all the streets  in the Palace it has a significant hourly ''footfall''.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property was  completely renovated 3 years ago in accordance with the requirements of  conservators because the building is within the protection of UNESCO.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The  property includes a complete inventory of stock etc. and is being sold fully  furnished, as it is assumed that the new owners will continue the business. It  is fully licensed, and ready for immediate ''take over''.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact  our office in Split to be shown around.</p>', '', '995_Apartment_0.jpg', '995_Apartment_1.jpg', '995_Apartment_2.jpg', '995_Apartment_3.jpg', '995_Apartment_4.jpg', '995_Apartment_5.jpg', '', '', ''),
(996, 'Kristian', 'Suiæ', '01/4834 363', '0915593059', 'nini.nini.suic@gmail.com', 'Omis', 'Staniæi, Tice 24A, k.è. 2452, Z.U. 1091', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '10', '198', '70', 1, '390000', '', 2, 2, 2, 1, 1, 1, 3, 2, 'December 17, 2014', '<p>Kuæa na jedinstvenoj lokaciji u 1.redu do mora sa direktnim pristupnim putem do pje&scaron;æane pla¾e koja garantira mir i privatnost. Ukupna povr&scaron;ina zemlji&scaron;ta iznosi 198 m2, dok je stambena povr&scaron;ina 70 m2 + 2 prostrane terase (35 x 2 m2). Kuæa je izgraðena 1965.godine, dok je potpuno renovirana 2012.god. Potpuno je namje&scaron;tena i u funkciji turistièkog iznajmljivanja.</p>', '<p>We are offering this shore side property in the first row, with a swimming pool. It is situated next to the sea, with access to the water through the garden, and down a private access road shared by only a few houses. The property is semi detached, close to the attractive mainland town of Omis, 30 minutes drive from Split, on the Dubrovnik road. The total land area is 198 m2, and the living area is 70 m2 + 2 spacious terraces/balconies (35 x 2 m2).</p>', '', '<p><strong style="color: #f30b23;">CIJENA SNI®ENA SA 480.000 &euro; !!</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa na jedinstvenoj lokaciji u 1.redu do mora sa direktnim pristupnim putem do pje&scaron;æane pla¾e koja garantira mir i privatnost.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Smje&scaron;tena je u malom turistièkom mjestu udaljenom 30 minuta vo¾nje od povijesnog grada Splita i 10 min. od Omi&scaron;a.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ukupna povr&scaron;ina zemlji&scaron;ta iznosi 198 m2, dok je stambena povr&scaron;ina 70 m2 + 2 prostrane terase (35 x 2 m2).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U prizemlju je smje&scaron;ten veliki dnevni boravak, kuhinja, kupaonica, ostava i spavaæa soba. Na 1.katu su 2 spavaæe sobe, terasa sa pogledom na more i mali wc.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U dvori&scaron;tu se nalazi bazen 5 x 3 m pokraj kojeg prolaze stepenice koje vode na privatnu pla¾u. Iz dvori&scaron;ta i bazena se takoðer pru¾a pogled na more i pla¾u.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ispred kuæe se nalazi parking za 1 automobil.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je izgraðena 1965.godine, dok je potpuno renovirana 2012.god.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Potpuno je namje&scaron;tena i u funkciji turistièkog iznajmljivanja.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Iako se radi o dvojnoj kuæi to ne umanjuje njezinu kvalitetu zbog izvrsnog polo¾aja uz samo more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Svi potrebni sadr¾aji se nalaze u blizini.</p>\r\n<p>Do meðunarodnog aerodroma je potrebno 1h vo¾nje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za sve dodatne informacije i razgledavanje molimo da nas kontaktirate.</p>', '<p><strong style="color: #f70724;">PRICE REDUCED FROM 480.000 EURO!</strong></p>\r\n<p><br style="color: #f50925;" /></p>\r\n<p>We are offering this shore side property in the first row, with a swimming  pool.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is situated next to the sea, with access to the water through  the garden, and down a private access road shared by only a few houses.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The  property is semi detached, close to the attractive mainland town of Omis, 30  minutes drive from Split, on the Dubrovnik road.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The total land area is  198 m2, and the living area is 70 m2 + 2 spacious terraces/balconies (35 x 2  m2).&nbsp;The ground floor has a large living room, kitchen, bathroom, pantry and  bedroom.&nbsp;On the 1st floor are two bedrooms, a balcony overlooking the sea and  another toilet.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>In the garden there is a small swimming pool surrounded by  the patio, set among mature trees.&nbsp;From here is a staircase leading to a  private beach in front!</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house has parking for one car.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house  was built in 1965 and was completely renovated in 2012.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It has been well  decorated and is completely furnished and ready to be used either privately or  for letting to tourists.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Although that this property is a semi detached,  that does not diminish its quality because of excellent position by the sea  which is very rare to find on this part of coastline.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The local area  serves the property well. The shore is clean and pebbled, with barely any tide,  making it safe for swimming and water sports, while the nearest coffee bar is  within walking distance. The town of Omis is very much ''geared up'' to tourists  and it provide a range of shops, and good restaurants to explore.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The  international airport is 1 hour drive.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For additional information and a  tour please contact us.</p>', '', '996_House-Villa_0.jpg', '996_House-Villa_1.jpg', '996_House-Villa_2.jpg', '996_House-Villa_3.jpg', '996_House-Villa_4.jpg', '996_House-Villa_5.jpg', '996_House-Villa_6.jpg', '996_House-Villa_7.jpg', '996_House-Villa_8.jpg'),
(997, '', 'Dalmat i Hormus doo', '', '', '', 'Sibenik', 'Kaprije', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '30', '263', '140', 1, '270000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 0, 0, 'December 28, 2014', '<p>Jedinstvena prilika za savr&scaron;en odmor na osami, u idiliènom okru¾enju skrovite uvale na otoku Kapriju! Posjed se sastoji od jedne stambene kuæe podijeljene u dvije zasebne jedinice (stana), potpuno obnovljene na temeljima starih kamenih objekata, nepunih 30m od kristalno èistog mora i pla¾e. Oba objekta imaju sve potrebne dozvole ali ih je nu¾no dovr&scaron;iti prije samog useljenja (svi grubi radovi su veæ dovr&scaron;eni kao i veæina instalacija).</p>', '<p>A unique opportunity for a perfect holiday in a secluded, idyllic bay located on the island of Kaprije! The property consists of one residential house divided into two separate units (flats), completely renovated on the foundations of old stone buildings, less than 30m from the crystal clear sea and the pebbly beach. Both buildings have all necessary permits, but interior and facade must be finished before moving in. This property truly represents a perfect getaway from civilization!</p>', '', '<p><span> </span>Jedinstvena prilika za savr&scaron;en odmor na osami, u idiliènom okru¾enju skrovite uvale na otoku Kapriju!<br /><br /><br />Posjed se sastoji od jedne stambene kuæe podijeljene u dvije zasebne jedinice (stana), potpuno obnovljene na temeljima starih kamenih objekata, nepunih 30m od kristalno èistog mora i pla¾e.<br /><br /><br />Oba objekta imaju sve potrebne dozvole ali ih je nu¾no dovr&scaron;iti prije samog useljenja (svi grubi radovi su veæ dovr&scaron;eni kao i veæina instalacija).<br /><br /><br />Najbli¾e naselje (Kaprije) je udaljeno cca 3km, a u susjednoj uvali je smje&scaron;ten restoran koji radi tijekom ljetne sezone.<br /><br /><br />Moguæe je rekonstruirati postojeæi gat (mol) udaljen cca 50m od kuæe i time omoguæiti direktno pristajanje jahti u neposrednoj blizini.<br /><br /><br />Na terenu se nalazi betonsko spremi&scaron;te vode (Velièina: 55,16m3. Mo¾e se za ki&scaron;nicu ili pitku voda dopremljena brodom), a za napajanje strujom predviðena je instalacija solarnih panela ili mini-vjetroelektrane.<br /><br /><br />Do posjeda se dolazi iskljuèivo brodom i sidri se u samoj uvali koja je prirodno za&scaron;tiæena od ju¾nih vjetrova.<br /><br /><br />Ukupna stambena povr&scaron;ina je 100,79m2 (bruto 136,18m2), a izradom dodatnih galerija ista se poveæava na preko 140m2, dok je velièina pripadajuæe parcele (terena) 263m2.<br /><br /><br />Ispred svakog objekta se nalazi terasa povr&scaron;ine cca 25-30m2. Vlasni&scaron;tvo je uredno, 1/1.<br /><br /><br />Ova nekretnina doista predstavlja savr&scaron;en bijeg od civilizacije uz zavidan dio komfora na raspolaganju!</p>', '<p>A unique opportunity for a perfect holiday in a secluded, idyllic bay located on the island of Kaprije!<br /><br /><br />The property consists of one residential house divided into two separate units (flats), completely renovated on the foundations of old stone buildings, less than 30m from the crystal clear sea and the pebbly beach. Both buildings have all necessary permits, but interior and facade must be finished before moving in (all rough works are already completed as are most of the inside installations).<br /><br /><br />The nearest village (Kaprije) is situated approximately 3 km away, while in the neighboring bay one will find a restaurant opened during the summer season (May-September).<br /><br /><br />It is possible to reconstruct the existing jetty (pier) located approximately 50m from the house, allowing the direct docking of yachts in the immediate vicinity. On the field there is a concrete water tank (Size: 55,16m3). Can store rainwater or potable water delivered by boat), and the power supply is provided via installation of solar panels or mini-wind farms.<br /><br /><br />The property can be reached only by boat, anchored in the bay which is protected from strong southerly winds.<br /><br /><br />Total living area is 100,79m2 (gross 136,18m2), and with creating of additional galleries it increases to over 140m2, while the size of the corresponding plot is 263m2.<br /><br /><br />In front of each building is a terrace of approx 25-30m2. Title is clear, 1/1.<br /><br /><br />This property truly represents a perfect getaway from civilization!</p>', '', '997_House-Villa_0.jpg', '997_House-Villa_1.jpg', '997_House-Villa_2.jpg', '997_House-Villa_3.jpg', '997_House-Villa_4.jpg', '997_House-Villa_5.jpg', '997_House-Villa_6.jpg', '997_House-Villa_7.jpg', '997_House-Villa_8.jpg'),
(998, 'Nenad i Zoran', 'Bortolazzi', 'kontakt Boris', '', '', 'Brac', 'Milna', 'For sale', 'Old stone house', '150', '820', '180', 2, '180000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 0, 0, 'January 4, 2015', '<p>U jednom od nekoliko prekrasnih mjesta na otoku Braèu smjestila se stara kamena kuæa sa mnogim potencijalima i prekrasnim pogledom na more i luèicu. Radi se o dvojnoj staroj kamenoj kuæi staroj vi&scaron;e od 200 god., koja je smje&scaron;tena na prostranom zemlji&scaron;tu povr&scaron;ine 820 m2. U niskom prizemlju se nalazi konoba povr&scaron;ine 50 m2, dok se u visokom prizemlju i 1.katu nalazi po 60 m2. Uz kuæu se nalazi i manji objekt cca 10 m2, koji bi mogao biti sprema ili ljetna kuhinja.</p>', '<p>We are offering this beautiful 200 year old house, with garden, in the old centre of this exclusive village on Brac. It is situated on the sloping hill with views across the harbour and the old village. The new owner will have many options and opportunities for this property, with 180m sq of living space inside, and a large garden of 820m sq. which will allow a lounging area and swimming pool. It is a semi detached, typical stone house of the time with solid exterior walls that should not be changed.</p>', '', '<p>U jednom od nekoliko prekrasnih mjesta na otoku Braèu smjestila se stara kamena kuæa sa mnogim potencijalima i prekrasnim pogledom na more i luèicu.<br /><br /><br />Radi se o dvojnoj staroj kamenoj kuæi staroj vi&scaron;e od 200 god., koja je smje&scaron;tena na prostranom zemlji&scaron;tu povr&scaron;ine 820 m2.<br /><br /><br />U niskom prizemlju se nalazi konoba povr&scaron;ine 50 m2, dok se u visokom prizemlju i 1.katu nalazi po 60 m2.<br /><br /><br />Orjentacija kuæe je jugozapadna.<br /><br /><br />Uz kuæu se nalazi i manji objekt cca 10 m2, koji bi mogao biti sprema ili ljetna kuhinja. Solidni vanjski zidovi koje ne treba mijenjati dok jekrovi&scaron;te renovirano prije 25 god. Potrebno unutra&scaron;nje ureðenje, te eventualno rekonstrukcija postojeæih drvenih podova.<br /><br /><br />Odlièna pozicija i pristup sa posebannim ulazom i moguæno&scaron;æu ureðenja lijepe okuænice s bazenom. Kuæa je u blizini mora, marine &nbsp;i centra mjesta gdje se nalaze svi potrebni sadr¾aji.<br /><br /><br />Otok Braè povezan je svakodnevnom trajektnom linijom sa gradom Splitom, dok je meðunarodni aerodrom udaljen 40 min. vo¾nje od Splita.<br /><br /><br />Kontaktirajte nas za sve dodatne informacije i razgledavanje nekretnine.</p>', '<p>We are offering this beautiful 200 year old house, with garden, in the old centre of this exclusive village on Brac.<br /><br /><br />It is situated on the sloping hill with views across the harbour and the old village.<br /><br /><br />The new owner will have many options and opportunities for this property, with 180m sq of living space inside, and a large garden of 820m sq. which will allow a lounging area and swimming pool.<br /><br /><br />It is a semi detached, typical stone house of the time with solid exterior walls that should not be changed, but inside it is designed with a cellar area of 50 m2, while the ground floor and 1st floor are of 60 m2 each.<br /><br /><br />Orientation of the house is south-west.<br /><br /><br />The house also has a smaller outbuilding of 10 m2, which could be used as a storage or summer kitchen with BBQ fire place.<br /><br /><br />It needs some internal and external renovation, but the roof was replaced in 1990.<br /><br /><br />It is in an excellent location with good access, and with the possibility of improving the beautiful garden with swimming pool, which makes this property highly attractive. The house is near the sea, marina and the town center, where there are services such as shops, restaurants and other attractions for tourists and the local population alike.<br /><br /><br />The island of Brac is connected by daily ferry lines to Split, while the international airport is 30 mins drive from Split.<br /><br /><br />The price has been fixed to ensure this property is sold quickly.<br /><br /><br />Contact us for further information and a tour of the property.</p>', '', '998_Old-stone-house_0.jpg', '998_Old-stone-house_1.jpg', '998_Old-stone-house_2.jpg', '998_Old-stone-house_3.jpg', '998_Old-stone-house_4.jpg', '998_Old-stone-house_5.jpg', '998_Old-stone-house_6.jpg', '998_Old-stone-house_7.jpg', '998_Old-stone-house_8.jpg'),
(1000, 'Ivica i Jak¹a', 'Marasoviæ', '', '098/ 255 171', '', 'Split', 'Bihaæka 14', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '600', '0', '203', 1, '700000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 3, 1, 'January 4, 2015', '<p>Prostrani apartman u staroj vili u samoj blizini Dioklecijanove palaèe. Apartman je udaljen 5 minuta hoda od samog centra grada i popularne Rive. Apartman se nalazi na 1. katu vile koja je izgraðena 1939. godine, povr&scaron;ine 153 m2, a sastoji se od hodnika, predprostora, kuhinje, blagovaonice, dnevnog boravka, 3 spavaæe sobe, kupatila, wc-a, zatvorene verande i otvorene terase. Apartmanu pripada i potkrovlje povr&scaron;ine 50 m2 sa terasom povr&scaron;ine 59 m2. Ispred kuæe se nalazi vrt i parkirna mjesta za 3 automobila.</p>', '<p>Croatia Property Sales are offering this spacious apartment on the first floor of this former luxury villa near the Diocletian Palace.&nbsp;It is situated just 5 minutes from the city centre and Riva, set back off the road, within its own garden with mature trees.&nbsp;The apartment is located on the first floor of the villa, which was built in 1939, and measures 153 m2. It is designed with a hall, kitchen, dining room, living room, 3 bedrooms, bathroom, wc, enclosed porch and an open terrace.&nbsp;The apartment has an additional attic floor area of 50 m2 with a terrace of 59 m2.</p>', '', '<p>Prostrani apartman u staroj vili u samoj blizini Dioklecijanove palaèe. Apartman je udaljen 5 minuta hoda od samog centra grada i popularne Rive.<br /><br /><br />Apartman se nalazi na 1. katu vile koja je izgraðena 1939. godine, povr&scaron;ine 153 m2, a sastoji se od hodnika, predprostora, kuhinje, blagovaonice, dnevnog boravka, 3 spavaæe sobe, kupatila, wc-a, zatvorene verande i otvorene terase.<br /><br /><br />Apartmanu pripada i potkrovlje povr&scaron;ine 50 m2 sa terasom povr&scaron;ine 59 m2. Ispred kuæe se nalazi vrt i parkirna mjesta za 3 automobila.<br /><br /><br />Apartman je u funkciji stanovanja ali je potrebno renoviranje. Sa dodatnim ulaganjem se mo¾e dobiti luksuzni apartman u prekrasnom dijelu grada.<br /><br /><br />Svi potrebni sadr¾aji nalazi se u blizini, dok je meðunarodni aerodrom udaljen 40 min. vo¾nje.<br /><br /><br />Za sva dodatna pitanja stojimo vam na raspolaganju.</p>', '<p>Croatia Property Sales are offering this spacious apartment on the first floor of this former luxury villa near the Diocletian Palace.<br /><br /><br />It is situated just 5 minutes from the city centre and Riva, set back off the road, within its own garden with mature trees.<br /><br /><br />The apartment is located on the first floor of the villa, which was built in 1939, and measures 153 m2. It is designed with a hall, kitchen, dining room, living room, 3 bedrooms, bathroom, wc, enclosed porch and an open terrace.<br /><br /><br />The apartment has an additional attic floor area of 50 m2 with a terrace of 59 m2.&nbsp;<br /><br /><br />The property is inhabited at the moment, but needs refurbishing.&nbsp;<br /><br /><br />This villa was built in a grand style, with a wide stone stair case, elaborate mosaic flooring in the entrance foyer and an attractive wrought iron bannister created by craftsmen on site.<br /><br /><br />If this building is properly restored to its former prestigious glory, it will be one of the most distinctive and attractive in the town.<br /><br /><br />The property has parking for 3 vehicles, off the road, as well as some private garden space.<br /><br /><br />The area around the building has restaurants, bars, and all the city''s main attractions within a short walk.<br /><br /><br />The airport is about 30 minutes drive.<br /><br /><br />Please contact our office in Split for more information.</p>', '', '1000_Apartment_0.jpg', '1000_Apartment_1.jpg', '1000_Apartment_2.jpg', '1000_Apartment_3.jpg', '1000_Apartment_4.jpg', '1000_Apartment_5.jpg', '1000_Apartment_6.jpg', '1000_Apartment_7.jpg', '1000_Apartment_8.jpg'),
(999, 'Marijan', '©timac', '', '095 871 5481', 'mmsti60@gmail.com', 'Zadar', 'Dugi Otok, Veli rat, 5810 Veli Rat', 'For sale', 'Land plot', '10', '1121', '0', 2, '135000', '', 2, 2, 2, 1, 1, 2, 0, 0, 'January 4, 2015', '<p>Izuzetna prilika za investiciju u zemlji&scaron;te i projekt u 1.redu do mora na otoku Dugi Otok u prekrasnoj uvali i netaknutoj prirodi. Povr&scaron;ina zemlji&scaron;ta iznosi 1121 m, dok je prekrasna pla¾a i oèaravajuæe èisto more udaljeno svega 10 m. Odmah uz zemlji&scaron;te je vez za brod, dok je i u samoj uvali moguæe usidriti veæi brod ili jedrilicu. U ovu cijenu je ukljuèena i veæ ishoðena graðevinska dozvola za objekt brutto povr&scaron;ina 400 m2.&nbsp;Prema graðevinskoj dozvoli objekt bi se sastojao od prizemlja/suterena, 1. i 2.kata.</p>', '<p>We are pleased to offer this rare and exciting opportunity to invest in land and a project in the 1st row to the sea on the island of Dugi Otok in a beautiful bay. The land is 20 minutes drive from the ferry port, which has regular daily ferries from the town of Zadar. Land area is 1.121m sq, while the beautiful sandy beaches and stunning clear sea are only 10 m away. Next to the land is a berth for small boats. The price includes the construction permit, which has already been obtained.</p>', '', '<p>Izuzetna prilika za investiciju u zemlji&scaron;te i projekt u 1.redu do mora na otoku Dugi Otok u prekrasnoj uvali i netaknutoj prirodi.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Zemlji&scaron;te je udaljeno 20 minuta vo¾nje automobilom od trajektnom pristani&scaron;ta koji je povezan svakodnevnom trajektom linijom sa gradom Zadrom. Meðunarodni aerodrom nalazi se u gradu Zadru i Splitu koji je udaljen 2h vo¾nje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Povr&scaron;ina zemlji&scaron;ta iznosi 1121 m, dok je prekrasna pla¾a i oèaravajuæe èisto more udaljeno svega 10 m.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Odmah uz zemlji&scaron;te je vez za brod, dok je i u samoj uvali moguæe usidriti veæi brod ili jedrilicu. Do samog zemlji&scaron;ta je moguæe i doæi automobilom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U ovu cijenu je ukljuèena i veæ ishoðena graðevinska dozvola za objekt brutto povr&scaron;ina 400 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Prema graðevinskoj dozvoli objekt bi se sastojao od prizemlja/suterena, 1. i 2.kata.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Takoðer je zbog prostranog zemlji&scaron;ta moguæa izgradnja bazena i ostalih sadr¾aja.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za sva dodatna pitanja, slike i tlocrt nekretnine molimo da nas kontaktirate.</p>', '<p>We are pleased to offer this rare and exciting opportunity to invest in land and a project in the 1st row to the sea on the island of Dugi Otok in a beautiful bay with a natural and undeveloped shore.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>This is a ''one off'' plot, and not part of a larger development covering the entire area.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The land is 20 minutes drive from the ferry port, which has regular daily ferries from the town of Zadar. The international airports are in Zadar and Split ( which is only 1:30 h drive).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Land area is 1.121m sq, while the beautiful sandy beaches and stunning clear sea are only 10 m away.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Next to the land is a berth for small boats, while in the bay it is possible to anchor a larger boat or sailboat. The land has also car access.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The price includes the construction permit, which has already been obtained, for a building with a gross living area of 400 m2.&nbsp;According to the building permit, the building would consist of a ground floor+ basement+ 1st + 2nd floor.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Because of the large plot area it is also possible to construct the swimming pools and other facilities.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For any additional questions about the plans, or assistance with the technical side of building such a project, more images and layout of the property, then please contact us.</p>', '', '999_Land-plot_0.jpg', '999_Land-plot_1.jpg', '999_Land-plot_2.jpg', '999_Land-plot_3.jpg', '999_Land-plot_4.jpg', '999_Land-plot_5.jpg', '999_Land-plot_6.jpg', '999_Land-plot_7.jpg', '999_Land-plot_8.jpg'),
(1001, 'Zlatko', 'Èipèiæ', '', '091 531 08 88', '', 'Rogoznica', 'Ra¾anj, Ljoljinica, 7854/2 KO Sevid', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '40', '500', '100', 2, '350000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 2, 1, 'January 4, 2015', '<p>Manja kuæa u prvom redu do mora s prekrasnim pogledom na more i uvalu. Kuæa se nalazi na mirnoj lokaciji, na kraju uvale s direktnim pristupom prirodnoj pla¾i. Od mora je udaljena svega 40 m. Kuæa je povr&scaron;ine 100 m2, a nalazi se na parceli povr&scaron;ine 500 m2. Podijeljena je na suteren i prvi kat. Oko kuæe je lijepo ureðen vrt s mediteranskim biljem, a kako je kuæa zadnja u toj uvali mediteransko bilje okru¾uje cijelu parcelu.</p>', '<p>We have this small detached house on the shore with access to the sea from the bottom of the garden, at a very modest price. The house is situated in a very quiet location, on the edge of the bay with direct views across the water and with access to the natural beach only 40 m distant from the front door. The house is 100 m2 living area and is located on a plot of 500 m2. The house is divided into basement and first floor. Around the house is a beautiful garden with established Mediterranean plants.</p>', '', '<p>Manja kuæa u prvom redu do mora s prekrasnim pogledom na more i uvalu.<br /><br /><br />Kuæa se nalazi na mirnoj lokaciji, na kraju uvale s direktnim pristupom prirodnoj pla¾i. Od mora je udaljena svega 40 m.<br /><br /><br />Kuæa je povr&scaron;ine 100 m2, a nalazi se na parceli povr&scaron;ine 500 m2. Podijeljena je na suteren i prvi kat.<br /><br /><br />U suterenu koji je povr&scaron;ine 30 m2 nalaze se ljetna kuhinja i kupaonica.<br /><br /><br />Povr&scaron;ina prvog kata je 72 m2. Na prvom katu se nalaze: spavaæa soba, kupaona, dnevni boravak s kuhinjom i blagovaonicom. Iz dnevnog boravka je izlaz na terasu povr&scaron;ine 52 m2 i s nje se pru¾a predivan pogled na more i uvalu.<br /><br /><br />Oko kuæe je lijepo ureðen vrt s mediteranskim biljem, a kako je kuæa zadnja u toj uvali mediteransko bilje okru¾uje cijelu parcelu.<br /><br /><br />Do kuæe je moguæ pristup autom, a ispred kuæe je osiguran parking.<br /><br /><br />Kuæa je prikljuèena na struju i vodu i ima septièku jamu.<br /><br /><br />Na svega 1,5 km od kuæe je centar malog dalmatinskog sela gdje se nalaze restorani, kafiæ i duæan.<br />Udaljenost do veæeg turistièkoj mjesta je 5 km, a do aerodroma 25 km.</p>', '<p>We have this small detached house on the shore with access to the sea from the bottom of the garden, at a very modest price.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house is situated in a very quiet location, on the edge of the bay with direct views across the water and with access to the natural beach only 40 m distant from the front door.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house is 100 m2 living area and is located on a plot of 500 m2. The house is divided into basement and first floor.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>In the basement, which has an area of 30 m2 includes a summer kitchen/BBQ area, and bathroom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Area of the first floor is 72 m2. On the first floor are: bedroom, bathroom, living room with kitchen and dining room. The living room has a terrace of 52 m2 which also offers the best view of the sea and the bay.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Around the house is a beautiful garden with established Mediterranean plants, and because this is the last property in the building zone in the bay, natural vegetation surrounds the plot, and explains why this is such a quiet area.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house is accessible by car, and in front of the house is private parking.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house has electricity and water and a septic tank.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The nearest small village with essential shops, bars, caf&eacute;s, etc., is a charming old fishing port 1.5 k. away or &nbsp;5 wonderful minutes on a bicycle!</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Proximity to a larger tourist center is 5 km, to the airport 25 km.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please call our Split office to arrange a viewing.</p>', '', '1001_House-Villa_0.jpg', '1001_House-Villa_1.jpg', '1001_House-Villa_2.jpg', '1001_House-Villa_3.jpg', '1001_House-Villa_4.jpg', '1001_House-Villa_5.jpg', '1001_House-Villa_6.jpg', '1001_House-Villa_7.jpg', '1001_House-Villa_8.jpg'),
(1002, 'Dr. Antun', 'Sasso', '091 4228222', 'Jadranka Sasso  091 522 6950', 'antun.sasso@medri.uniri.hr', 'Primosten', 'Primo¹ten, ©ibenska 17, 1064 k.o. Primo¹ten, zemlji¹no knji¾ni ulo¾ak 2758', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '20', '150', '40', 1, '130000', '', 2, 2, 2, 1, 1, 2, 1, 1, 'January 5, 2015', '<p>Dio kamene kuæe u prekrasnom turistièkom mjestu u prvom redu do mora s pogledom na more. Mala, &scaron;armantna kuæa izgraðena je u dalmatinskom duhu. Od kuæe do pla¾e je direktan pristup s parcele tako da je udaljenost od kuæe do mora svega 15 m. Stambena povr&scaron;ina je 39,5 m2, a nalazi se na parceli povr&scaron;ine 150 m2. Kuæa je podijeljena na suteren i prizemlje. Predivan pogled na more pru¾a se sa svih terasa i balkona.</p>', '<p>We are pleased to offer a part of a stone house, in the first row to the sea, in a stunning location. The living area inside the property is 40m sq, but the garden is 150m sq. The house is divided into a basement and ground floor. The gardens, have many established fruit trees and have been beautifully landscaped, so terraces cascade down to the shore, just 15m from the front wall of the garden. This property, in such a grade ''A'' location on the mainland has massive potential.</p>', '', '<p>Dio kamene kuæe u prekrasnom turistièkom mjestu u prvom redu do mora s pogledom na more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Mala, &scaron;armantna kuæa izgraðena je u dalmatinskom duhu. Od kuæe do pla¾e je direktan pristup s parcele tako da je udaljenost od kuæe do mora svega 15 m.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Stambena povr&scaron;ina je 39,5 m2, a nalazi se na parceli povr&scaron;ine 150 m2. Kuæa je podijeljena na suteren i prizemlje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U suterenu kuæe nalaze se kuhinja, konoba i velika terasa.</p>\r\n<p>U prizemlju kuæe nalaze se spavaæa soba, kuhinja, kupaonica, zatvorena terasa i balkon.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Predivan pogled na more pru¾a se sa svih terasa i balkona.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Oko kuæe je prekrasno ureðen vrt s mediteranskim biljem (mandarine, masline, palma, oleandar).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Do kuæe se mo¾e doæi autom te je na parceli osigurano jedno parking mjesto.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je od centra jednog od najljep&scaron;ih turistièkih mjesta Dalmacije udaljena svega 500m, a tamo se nalaze restorani i kafiæi za svaèiji ukus kao i trgovine.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Od aerodroma je udaljena 30 km.</p>', '<p>We are pleased to offer a part of a stone house, in the first row to the sea, in a stunning location.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The living area inside the property is 40m sq, but the garden is 150m sq. The house is divided into a basement and ground floor.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>In the basement of the house is a kitchen, cellar storage area, and access to the large terrace.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The ground floor has a bedroom, bathroom kitchen, covered balcony at the front and terrace at the rear.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The gardens, have many established fruit trees and have been beautifully landscaped, so terraces cascade down to the shore, just 15m from the front wall of the garden.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There is access to the property by car, parking, and is 500m from the nearest village centre with caf&eacute;s, bars and other services for tourists and the local population alike.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The airport at Split is 30k away.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>This property, in such a grade ''A'' location on the mainland has massive potential.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact the office in Split to arrange a visit and for more information.</p>', '', '1002_Apartment_0.jpg', '1002_Apartment_1.jpg', '1002_Apartment_2.jpg', '1002_Apartment_3.jpg', '1002_Apartment_4.jpg', '1002_Apartment_5.jpg', '1002_Apartment_6.jpg', '1002_Apartment_7.jpg', '1002_Apartment_8.jpg'),
(1003, 'Ante', 'Filipoviæ', '', '098 1774882', '', 'Rogoznica', 'Ljoljinica, 7873/1 K.o. Sevid', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '130', '180', '110', 2, '100000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 4, 2, 'January 5, 2015', '<p>U potpunosti ureðena kuæa zapadne orijentacije u lijepoj mirnoj uvali s pogledom na more. Kuæa je smje&scaron;tena na 130 m od mora. Kuæa je povr&scaron;ine 110 m2, a nalazi se na parceli povr&scaron;ine 180 m2. Sastoji se od prizemlja i kata. Ispred kuæe je prostor za dva parking mjesta. Kuæa je prikljuèena na struju, vodu i septièku jamu.</p>', '<p>We are offering this well built, modern chalet style detached house, fully furnished, in a quiet bay overlooking the sea. The house is located 130 m from the sea, in a west orientation, 1km from the nearest village with caf&eacute;s, shops etc and 5 km from a larger town. The habitable area in the property is 110 m2 and it is located on a plot of 180 m2. It has two floors. Around the house is a courtyard paved with stone slabs, which incorporates two private parking spaces at the front.</p>', '', '<p>U potpunosti ureðena kuæa zapadne orijentacije u lijepoj mirnoj uvali s pogledom na more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je smje&scaron;tena na 130 m od mora.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je povr&scaron;ine 110 m2, a nalazi se na parceli povr&scaron;ine 180 m2. Sastoji se od prizemlja i kata.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U prizemlju kuæe nalaze se dvije spavaæe sobe, kupaonica, kuhinja i dnevni boravak s izlazom na terasu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na katu se nalaze dvije spavaæe sobe, kupaonica, kuhinja i dnevni boravak s izlazom na terasu s koje se pru¾a pogled na more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Oko kuæe je okuænica poploèana s kamenim ploèama.</p>\r\n<p>Ispred kuæe je prostor za dva parking mjesta.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je prikljuèena na struju, vodu i septièku jamu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Od centra mjesta je udaljena svega 1 km, a od lijepog turistièkog mjesta 5 km.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Udaljenost do aerodroma je 25 km.</p>', '<p>We are offering this well built, modern chalet style detached house, fully furnished, in a quiet bay overlooking the sea.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house is located 130 m from the sea, in a west orientation, 1km from the nearest village with caf&eacute;s, shops etc and 5 km from a larger town.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The habitable area in the property is 110 m2 and it is located on a plot of 180 m2.&nbsp;It has two floors.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the ground floor there are two bedrooms, bathroom, kitchen and living room with terrace.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Upstairs are two bedrooms, bathroom, kitchen and living room opening onto a terrace with a view of the sea.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Around the house is a courtyard paved with stone slabs, which incorporates two private parking spaces at the front.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house is connected to electricity and water public system,&nbsp; and it has a septic tank for drainage.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Distance to airport 25 km.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please call our CPS Split office to arrange a tour of this and other similar properties in the area.</p>', '', '1003_House-Villa_0.jpg', '1003_House-Villa_1.jpg', '1003_House-Villa_2.jpg', '1003_House-Villa_3.jpg', '1003_House-Villa_4.jpg', '', '', '', ''),
(1004, 'Mario', 'Moriæ', '022 338 669  ', '091 892 6178', 'info@oggibijoux.com', 'Sibenik', '®aboriæ, Zlarinska 3, 3051/213 K.o Krapanj', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '80', '215', '150', 1, '210000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 3, 2, 'January 5, 2015', '<p>Kvalitetno izgraðena dvojna kuæa u lijepom turistièkom mjestu na udaljenosti 80 m od mora i lijepe pla¾e, s djelomiènim pogledom na more i uvalu. Kuæa je sjeverne orijentacije povr&scaron;ine 150 m2, a nalazi se na parceli povr&scaron;ine 215 m2. Kuæa je u potpunosti zavr&scaron;ena prije par godina s kompletnom infrastrukturom. Vrt je kultiviran s nekoliko tradicionalnih mediteranskih stabala. Kuæa se nalazi na mirnom podruèju i osim za ljetovanje mo¾e se koristiti i za boravak tijekom cijele godine.</p>', '<p>We are offering for sale this well built, semi detached house, in a beautiful resort, 80m from the shore. It is situated in an attractive bay, on the mainland, with clean sea and shallow beaches, and with partial views of the water from the house. The house has a north/south orientation with 150 m2 of living area, and is located on a plot of 215 m2. The house was fully completed a few years ago with all the modern infrastructure, phone lines etc. The house is located in a quiet area, and not only is it perfect for holidays.</p>', '', '<p>Kvalitetno izgraðena dvojna kuæa u lijepom turistièkom mjestu na udaljenosti 80 m od mora i lijepe pla¾e, s djelomiènim pogledom na more i uvalu.<br /><br /><br />Kuæa je sjeverne orijentacije povr&scaron;ine 150 m2, a nalazi se na parceli povr&scaron;ine 215 m2.<br /><br /><br />U prizemlju ima gara¾u od 30m2 &nbsp;koja se mo¾e koristiti kao ljetna kuhinja.&nbsp;<br /><br /><br />Prvi kat se sastoji od kuhinje s trpezarijom, dnevnog boravka, wc-a, predsoblja i balkona (stambeni dio 50m2).<br /><br /><br />Na drugom katu se nalaze tri sobe (jedna sa pogledom na uvalu), kupatilo, hodnik i balkon (stambeni dio 50m2).<br /><br /><br />Kuæa je u potpunosti zavr&scaron;ena prije par godina s kompletnom infrastrukturom. Vrt je kultiviran s nekoliko tradicionalnih mediteranskih stabala. U vrtu se nalazi sjenica od divlje vinove loze i kamin.<br /><br /><br />Kuæa se nalazi na mirnom podruèju i osim za ljetovanje mo¾e se koristiti i za boravak tijekom cijele godine.<br /><br /><br />Ispred kuæe nalaze se dva parking mjesta.<br /><br /><br />Kuæa je od &Scaron;ibenika udaljena 10 km, a udaljenost do aerodroma je 45 km.</p>', '<p>We are offering for sale this well built, semi detached house, in a beautiful resort, 80m from the shore.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is situated in an attractive bay, on the mainland, with clean sea and shallow beaches, and with partial views of the water from the house.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house has a north/south orientation with 150 m2 of living area, and is located on a plot of 215 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The ground floor has a garage of 30m2 that can be used as summer kitchen.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The first floor has 50m2 of living area and consists of a kitchen, dining room, living room, toilet, hall and terrace.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The second floor is also 50 m2 living area with&nbsp; a family bathroom and three bedrooms, one of which has windows leading out onto a balcony with lovely sea views.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house was fully completed a few years ago with all the modern infrastructure, phone lines etc.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The garden is cultivated with several established traditional Mediterranean trees and there is a gazebo from wild vines and outdoor BBQ/fireplace.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house is located in a quiet area, and not only is it perfect for holidays, it can also be used to stay all year round.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>In front of the house there are two private parking spaces.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house is 10km from Sibenik 10 km and the distance to the airport is 45 km.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>We will be pleased to show you around this property or any other similar property in the area.</p>', '', '1004_House-Villa_0.jpg', '1004_House-Villa_1.jpg', '1004_House-Villa_2.jpg', '1004_House-Villa_3.jpg', '1004_House-Villa_4.jpg', '1004_House-Villa_5.jpg', '1004_House-Villa_6.jpg', '1004_House-Villa_7.jpg', '1004_House-Villa_8.jpg');
INSERT INTO `nekretnina` (`id`, `ime`, `prezime`, `telefon`, `mobitel`, `e_mail`, `lokacija_id`, `adresa`, `status_id`, `vrsta_id`, `udaljenost`, `povrsina`, `stambenapovrsina`, `display`, `cijena`, `cijenatocka`, `ponuda_tjedna`, `new_built`, `must_sell`, `prvi_red_do_mora`, `pogled_na_more`, `bazen`, `broj_soba`, `broj_kupatila`, `datum`, `title_hr`, `title_en`, `title_ge`, `opis_hr`, `opis_en`, `opis_ge`, `PropertyImageURL0`, `PropertyImageURL1`, `PropertyImageURL2`, `PropertyImageURL3`, `PropertyImageURL4`, `PropertyImageURL5`, `PropertyImageURL6`, `PropertyImageURL7`, `PropertyImageURL8`) VALUES
(1005, '', 'Teslenko d.o.o.', '', 'Ante Topiæ 099/ 862 4339', '', 'Split', 'Split, Trumbuèac 11, Z.U. 5803 ', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '200', '0', '55.39', 2, '130000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 'January 12, 2015', '<p>Apartman u manjoj starogradskoj zgradi, smje&scaron;ten u starom dijelu grada Splita udaljen od Rive i Dioklecijanove palaèe cca. 500 m. Nalazi se na 2.katu (potkrovlje). Apartman je ukupne povr&scaron;ine 55,39 m2 sastoji se od hodnika, kuhinje sa dnevnim boravkom, 2 spavaæe sobe, kupaonice i 2 verande povr&scaron;ine 3,20 m2. Takoðer je u vlasnistvu dodatnih 12 m2 &ndash; dio stubi&scaron;ta i dvori&scaron;ta.Apartman je kompletno renoviran, stoga nije potrebno dodatno ulaganje.</p>', '<p>We are offering this excellent value apartment in a small building, located in the old town of Split. It is situated on the 2nd floor (top floor) of this small house, approx. 200 m from the sea, and the nearest and very popular Bacvice Beach 15 min walking. The Palace and Riva is 200m away. The apartment has a total area of 55.39 m2 consists of a hall, kitchen, living room, 2 bedrooms, bathroom and two verandas with a surface of 3.20 m2. There is an additional 12 m2 as a part of the stairs and courtyards.</p>', '', '<p>Apartman u manjoj starogradskoj zgradi, smje&scaron;ten u starom dijelu grada Splita udaljen od Rive i Dioklecijanove palaèe cca. 500 m. Nalazi se na 2.katu (potkrovlje).<br /><br /><br />More je udaljeno cca. 200 m dok je najbli¾a i vrlo popularna pla¾a Baèvice &nbsp;udaljena 15 min. hodanja.<br /><br /><br />Apartman je ukupne povr&scaron;ine 55,39 m2 sastoji se od hodnika, kuhinje sa dnevnim boravkom, 2 spavaæe sobe, &nbsp;kupaonice i 2 verande povr&scaron;ine 3,20 m2. Takoðer je u vlasnistvu dodatnih 12 m2 &ndash; dio stubi&scaron;ta i dvori&scaron;ta.<br /><br /><br />Apartman je kompletno renoviran, stoga nije potrebno dodatno ulaganje.<br /><br /><br />®elite li ulo¾iti u nekretninu koja je spremna za useljenje, ovo je idealna prilika za vas.<br /><br /><br />U blizini se nalaze mnogobrojne trgovine, kafiæi, restorani i povijesni dio grada sa mnogim ostalim sadr¾ajima.<br /><br /><br />Meðunarodni aerodrom udaljen je 40 min. vo¾nje.<br /><br /><br />Za sve dodatne informacije slobodno nas kontaktirajte.</p>', '<p>We are offering this excellent value apartment in a small building, located in the old town of Split.<br /><br /><br />It is situated on the 2nd floor (top floor) of this small house, approx. 200 m from the sea, and the nearest and very popular Bacvice Beach 15 min walking. The Palace and Riva is 200m away.<br /><br /><br />The apartment has a total area of 55.39 m2 consists of a hall, kitchen, living room, 2 bedrooms, bathroom and two verandas with a surface of 3.20 m2. There is an additional 12 m2 as a part of the stairs and courtyards.<br /><br /><br />The apartment is fully renovated, so no additional investment is required.<br /><br /><br />If you are looking for property entirely to ready to move into, this is the ideal opportunity for you.<br /><br /><br />Nearby are numerous shops, bars, restaurants and historic part of the city with many other amenities and all the historic attractions.<br /><br /><br />The international airport is 30 min driving.<br /><br /><br />For further information please contact us, at our office in Split.</p>', '', '1005_Apartment_0.jpg', '1005_Apartment_1.jpg', '1005_Apartment_2.jpg', '1005_Apartment_3.jpg', '1005_Apartment_4.jpg', '1005_Apartment_5.jpg', '1005_Apartment_6.jpg', '1005_Apartment_7.jpg', '1005_Apartment_8.jpg'),
(1006, 'Mila', 'Rado¹', '', '095/ 558 1034 Ana Rados', '', 'Trogir', 'O.Gornji, Rastiæi IX, 335/9  335/8  ', 'For sale', 'Land plot', '180', '446', '0', 2, '103500', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 0, 0, 'January 12, 2015', '<p>Graðevinsko zemlji&scaron;te na ju¾noj strani otoka Èiova sa pogledom na more, direktnim pristupnim putem i mnogim moguænostima. Sa zemlji&scaron;ta se trenutno pru¾a djelomièan pogled na more, ali bi se izgradnjom objekta a veæih katova pru¾ao prekrasni otvoreni pogled. Ukupna povr&scaron;ina zemlji&scaron;ta iznosi 446 m2.</p>\r\n<p>Udaljenost od mora i prekrasne uvale gdje se nalazi prirodno kamenita pla¾a je 180 m.</p>', '<p>We are pleased to offer this building land on the south side of Ciovo with great sea views, and with direct access to the shore from the land plot. The total land area is 446 m2.</p>\r\n<p>The distance from the sea and the beautiful bay where there is a natural rocky beach is 180 m, while the town centre and nearest amenities are only 5 minutes drive.</p>', '', '<p>Graðevinsko zemlji&scaron;te na ju¾noj strani otoka Èiova sa pogledom na more, direktnim pristupnim putem i mnogim moguænostima.<br /><br /><br />Sa zemlji&scaron;ta se trenutno pru¾a djelomièan pogled na more, ali bi se izgradnjom objekta a veæih katova pru¾ao prekrasni otvoreni pogled.<br /><br /><br />Ukupna povr&scaron;ina zemlji&scaron;ta iznosi 446 m2.&nbsp;<br /><br /><br />Udaljenost od mora i prekrasne uvale gdje se nalazi prirodno kamenita pla¾a je 180 m, dok je centar mjesta sa svim sadr¾ajima udaljen 5 minuta vo¾nje.<br /><br /><br />Meðunarodni aerodrom udaljen je 20 min.<br /><br /><br />Na zemlji&scaron;tu je moguæa izgradnja kuæe koja bi se sastojala od prizemlja, 1. i 2. kata ili podruma, prizemlja, 1.kata i potkrovlja.<br /><br /><br />Sva potrebna infrastruktura se nalazi odmah do zemlji&scaron;ta.<br /><br /><br />Za sva dodatna pitanja vam stojimo na raspolaganju.</p>', '<p>We are pleased to offer this building land on the south side of Ciovo with great sea views, and with direct access to the shore from the land plot.<br /><br /><br />The total land area is 446 m2.&nbsp;<br /><br />The distance from the sea and the beautiful bay where there is a natural rocky beach is 180 m, while the town centre and nearest amenities are only 5 minutes drive.<br /><br /><br />The international airport is 20 minutes.<br /><br /><br />On the land plot it is possible to build a house that would consist of ground, first and second floors and basement, ground floor, 1st floor and attic.<br /><br /><br />There is a partial sea view from the plot, but floors above the ground floor would have better and uninterrupted sea views.<br /><br /><br />All necessary infrastructure, water, electric etc. is located next to the land.<br /><br /><br />For any questions, and to arrange to visit the site, please contact our office.</p>', '', '1006_Land-plot_0.jpg', '1006_Land-plot_1.jpg', '1006_Land-plot_2.jpg', '1006_Land-plot_3.jpg', '1006_Land-plot_4.jpg', '1006_Land-plot_5.jpg', '1006_Land-plot_6.jpg', '1006_Land-plot_7.jpg', '1006_Land-plot_8.jpg'),
(1007, 'Ante', 'Bajiæ-Tomasoviæ', '021/ 57 22 28', 'cijena 30 Eura/m2!', 'ante.b.tomasovic@gmail.com', 'Trogir', 'Krtine, 6717, 6721, 6722, 6723 k.o. Trogir', 'For sale', 'Land plot', '3500', '65311', '0', 1, '99000001', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 0, 0, 'January 12, 2015', '<p>Poljoprivredno zemlji&scaron;te na jedinstvenoj lokaciji sa prekrasnim pogledom na more i moguæno&scaron;æu izgradnje objekta. Smje&scaron;teno je u gradu Trogiru, sjeverno od starog povijesnog dijela grada do kojeg je potrebno 10 minuta vo¾nje isto kao i do meðunarodnog aerodroma. Ukupna povr&scaron;ina zemlji&scaron;ta iznosi 65 311 m2, te postoji moguænost kupnje samo jednog dijela. Sa zemlji&scaron;ta se pru¾a prekrasan pogled na more i cijeli grad Trogir, Ciovo i Split.</p>', '<p><span>We offer this plot as an investment, to build a 3 level house, with up to a 100m sq layout.&nbsp;</span><span>It is currently agricultural land but it is in a superb location with beautiful sea views, Split, Trogir, and the islands.&nbsp;</span><span>It is located in the town of Trogir, north of the old historic part of the city and it takes only 10 minutes drive.&nbsp;</span><span>The total land area is 65.311 m2, and there is the possibility to buy one portion, as two smaller houses could be built.</span></p>', '', '<p>Poljoprivredno zemlji&scaron;te na jedinstvenoj lokaciji sa prekrasnim pogledom na more i moguæno&scaron;æu izgradnje objekta.<br /><br /><br />Smje&scaron;teno je u gradu Trogiru, sjeverno od starog povijesnog dijela grada do kojeg je potrebno 10 minuta vo¾nje isto kao i do meðunarodnog aerodroma.<br /><br /><br />Ukupna povr&scaron;ina zemlji&scaron;ta iznosi 65 311 m2, te postoji moguænost kupnje samo jednog dijela.<br /><br /><br /><strong>***Cijena po 1 metru kvaratnom &nbsp;iznosi 30 &euro;</strong><br /><br /><br />Na zemlji&scaron;tu je moguæe izgraditi stambenu graðevinu za potrebe stanovanja i prijavljenog obiteljskog gospodarstva i pru¾anje ugostiteljskih i turistièkig usluga u seljaèkom domaæinstvu i to najveæe brutto tlocrtne povr&scaron;ine 100 m2. Mo¾e se izgraditi suteren, prizemlje i 1.kat.<br /><br /><br />Na zemlji&scaron;tu se nalazi bu&scaron;otina vode, ali je prikljuèak na gradski vodovod u blizini. Prikljuèak struje se takoðer nalazi u blizini.<br /><br /><br />Sa zemlji&scaron;ta se pru¾a prekrasan pogled na more i cijeli grad Trogir, Ciovo i Split.<br /><br /><br />Najbli¾a veæa trgovina udaljena je 3 km.<br /><br /><br />Za sve dodatne informacije vam stojimo na raspolaganju.</p>', '<p>We offer this plot as an investment, to build a 3 level house, with up to a 100m sq layout.<br /><br /><br />It is currently agricultural land but it is in a superb location with beautiful sea views, Split, Trogir, and the islands.<br /><br /><br />It is located in the town of Trogir, north of the old historic part of the city and it takes only 10 minutes drive.<br /><br /><br />The total land area is 65.311 m2, and there is the possibility to buy one portion, as two smaller houses could be built.<br /><br /><br /><strong>*** Price per m2 is 30 &euro;</strong><br /><br /><br />On the plot &nbsp;it is possible to build a house for residential purposes, or have a family business relating to the the provision of catering and letting services related to farming.<br /><br /><br />There is a well for water on the plot, but the connection to city water is nearby and the electricity connection is also located nearby. Nearest larger shops are 3 km away.<br /><br /><br />For additional information, you are at your disposal, so please contact the office.</p>', '', '1007_Land-plot_0.jpg', '1007_Land-plot_1.jpg', '1007_Land-plot_2.jpg', '1007_Land-plot_3.jpg', '1007_Land-plot_4.jpg', '1007_Land-plot_5.jpg', '', '', ''),
(1008, 'Marija', 'Èolak', '', '098 9141389', '', 'Rogoznica', 'Ra¾anj, 8322/3 i 8335/1', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '70', '673', '193', 1, '420000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 8, 3, 'January 14, 2015', '<p>U prekrasnoj uvali udaljena svega 70 m od mora nalazi se samostojeæa kuæa s vlastitim prolazom do prekrasne prirodne i lijepo ureðene pla¾e. Kuæa je zapadne orijentacije, a posebnost ove kuæe je da se pogled na more pru¾a s tri strane kuæe. Povr&scaron;ina kuæe je 193 m2, a s obzirom da je graðena na neravnom terenu podijeljena je na suteren, visoko prizemlje i potkrovlje. Prednost ove nekretnine je parcela povr&scaron;ine 673 m2.</p>', '<p>We are offering this detached house just a few minutes from the beach on the main land near Rogoznica. The house is west orientation, and the almost unique feature of this house is that it provides a view of the sea on three sides of the house (north, east and west). The house living size is 193 m2, and given that it was built on uneven terrain is divided into a basement, ground floor and attic. The advantage of this property is that it is on a large plot of 673 m2.</p>', '', '<p>U prekrasnoj uvali udaljena svega 70 m od mora nalazi se samostojeæa kuæa s vlastitim prolazom do prekrasne prirodne i lijepo ureðene pla¾e.<br /><br /><br />Kuæa je zapadne orijentacije, a posebnost ove kuæe je da se pogled na more pru¾a s tri strane kuæe (sjeverne, istoène i zapadne), tako da se pogled pru¾a sa svih loða, terasa kao i iz svih soba.<br /><br /><br />Povr&scaron;ina kuæe je 193 m2, a s obzirom da je graðena na neravnom terenu podijeljena je na suteren, visoko prizemlje i potkrovlje.<br /><br /><br />Suteren se sastoji od dvije spavaæe sobe, dnevnog boravka s kuhinjom, kupaonice, dvije spreme i dvije terase (jedna povr&scaron;ine 8,50 m2, a druga 6, 44 m2).<br /><br /><br />Prizemlje se sastoji od tri spavaæe sobe, kuhinje s blagovaonicom, kupaonice, spreme i loðe povr&scaron;ine 8,40 m2.<br /><br /><br />Potkrovlje se sastoji od tri spavaæe sobe, kuhinje s blagovaonicom, kupaonice, spreme i loðe povr&scaron;ine 7,92 m2.<br /><br /><br />Kuæa je eta¾irana tako da se trenutno koristi kao apartmanska kuæa, iznajmljuju se dva apartmana.<br /><br /><br />Prednost ove nekretnine je parcela povr&scaron;ine 673 m2 na kojoj se trenutno nalazi prostor za parking i &nbsp;mediteransko drveæe, ali se na istom mjestu mo¾e izgraditi i bazen s obzirom da su ispred kuæe osigurana tri parking mjesta.<br /><br /><br />Kuæa je svega 2 km udaljena od centra turistièkog mjesta, trgovina, kafiæa i restorana.<br /><br /><br />Udaljenost do aerodroma je 25 km.</p>', '<p>We are offering this detached house just a few minutes from the beach on the main land near Rogoznica.<br /><br /><br />The house is west orientation, and the almost unique feature of this house is that it provides a view of the sea on three sides of the house (north, east and west), so that the view extends from every balcony, terrace as well as from every room.<br /><br /><br />The house living size is 193 m2, and given that it was built on uneven terrain is divided into a basement, ground floor and attic.<br /><br /><br />The basement/ground floor consists of two bedrooms, living room with kitchen, bathroom, two storage rooms and two terraces (one of 8.50 m2, and the other 6, 44 m2).<br /><br /><br />The ground floor consists of three bedrooms, kitchen, dining room, bathroom, storage and balcony area of 8.40 m2.<br /><br /><br />Top floor has three bedrooms, kitchen, dining room, bathroom, storage and balcony area of 7.92 m2.<br /><br /><br />The house is apportioned so that it is currently divided into three apartments from which two apartments are let out through the tourism season.<br /><br /><br />The advantage of this property is that it is on a large plot of 673 m2 which is currently laid out as garden with Mediterranean plants and trees, with one parking space.<br /><br /><br />There is ample opportunity to redesign the land into more parking, or a sun patio, even with a swimming pool.<br /><br /><br />The house is only 2 km away from the centre of the village which caters well for tourists, with many shops, cafes, small bars and restaurants.<br /><br /><br />Distance to Split airport 25 km.<br /><br /><br />CPS Split office will answer your question or arrange a viewing.</p>', '', '1008_House-Villa_0.jpg', '1008_House-Villa_1.jpg', '1008_House-Villa_2.jpg', '1008_House-Villa_3.jpg', '1008_House-Villa_4.jpg', '1008_House-Villa_5.jpg', '1008_House-Villa_6.jpg', '1008_House-Villa_7.jpg', '1008_House-Villa_8.jpg'),
(1009, 'Marija', 'Boriæ', '021 466756, 022577616', '0997348011', 'marioboric53@gmail.com', 'Primosten', '©paradiæi 19, Greba¹tica, k.è. 25/2 krapanj', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '10', '1100', '160', 1, '790000', '', 2, 2, 2, 1, 1, 2, 4, 3, 'January 15, 2015', '<p>Prekrasna samostojeæa kuæa u prvom redu do mora za sve koji ¾ele biti na svega par metara od mora, a istovremeno imati moguænost odmora u privatnosti okru¾eni mediteranskim biljem s pogledom na more i uvalu. Povr&scaron;ina kuæe iznosi 160 m2, a nalazi se na terasasto izvedenoj parceli povr&scaron;ine 1100 m2. Kuæa je podijeljena na prizemlje, prvi i drugi kat svaki s vlastitim vanjskim ulazom. U sklopu parcele je gara¾a s dva parking mjesta, a osigurana su i dva parking mjesta iza kuæe.</p>', '<p>We are offering this beautiful detached villa just a few yards from the waters&rsquo; edge on the main land near Primosten. It is situated on a sloping garden, giving superb views across the water, between Primosten and Sibenik, on a quiet part of the coast with natural stone shore with a sand and pebble floor. The living area inside the house is 160 m2 and is located on an unusually large plot of 1100m sq. The property was built in 1978. The house is divided on the ground floor, first floor and second floor each with its own outside entrance.</p>', '', '<p>Prekrasna samostojeæa kuæa u prvom redu do mora za sve koji ¾ele biti na svega par metara od mora, a istovremeno imati moguænost odmora u privatnosti okru¾eni mediteranskim biljem s pogledom na more i uvalu.<br /><br /><br />Povr&scaron;ina kuæe iznosi 160 m2, a nalazi se na terasasto izvedenoj parceli povr&scaron;ine 1100 m2.<br /><br /><br />Kuæa je podijeljena na prizemlje, prvi i drugi kat svaki s vlastitim vanjskim ulazom.<br /><br /><br />U prizemlju se nalazi studio apartman.<br /><br /><br />Na prvom i drugom katu se nalaze apartmani povr&scaron;ine 60 m2, s dvije spavaæe sobe, dnevnim boravkom, kuhinjom i kupaonicom.<br /><br /><br />Svaki kat ima terasu sjeverne orijentacije s koje se pru¾a pogled na more.<br /><br /><br />Kuæa je izgraðena 1978 god.<br /><br /><br />Na parceli je moguæe izgraditi bazen.<br /><br /><br />U sklopu parcele je gara¾a s dva parking mjesta, a osigurana su i dva parking mjesta iza kuæe.<br /><br /><br />Primo&scaron;ten i &Scaron;ibenik su udaljeni od kuæe oko 10 km, a zraèna luka 30 km.</p>', '<p>We are offering this beautiful detached villa just a few yards from the waters&rsquo; edge on the main land near Primosten.<br /><br /><br />It is situated on a sloping garden, giving superb views across the water, between Primosten and Sibenik, on a quiet part of the coast with natural stone shore with a sand and pebble floor.<br /><br /><br />The living area inside the house is 160 m2 and is located on an unusually large plot of 1100m sq. The property was built in 1978.<br /><br /><br />The house is divided on the ground floor, first floor and second floor each with its own outside entrance.<br /><br /><br />The ground floor is an independent studio apartment.<br /><br /><br />On the first and second floor there are apartments of 60 m2, each with two bedrooms, living room, kitchen and bathroom.<br /><br /><br />Each floor has a terrace facing north with a view of the sea.<br /><br /><br />The plot can easily be redesigned to meet modern tourist requirements, with plenty of pace to add a swimming pool and patio.<br /><br /><br />There is a garage and two additional parking spaces, with even more parking, if required, behind the house.<br /><br /><br />The property is about 30km from the airport, at Split.<br /><br /><br />For all questions, as well as opportunity to visit the property we are at your service in the CPS office in Split.</p>', '', '1009_House-Villa_0.jpg', '1009_House-Villa_1.jpg', '1009_House-Villa_2.jpg', '1009_House-Villa_3.jpg', '1009_House-Villa_4.jpg', '1009_House-Villa_5.jpg', '1009_House-Villa_6.jpg', '1009_House-Villa_7.jpg', '1009_House-Villa_8.jpg'),
(1010, 'Maja', 'Hem', '', '098/ 1 888 336', '', 'Split', 'Sinjska 2, Z.U. 4525  kat./arkod 10807', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '270', '0', '160', 1, '350000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 7, 3, 'January 15, 2015', '<p>Jedinstvena nekretnina u samom centru Splita, na izuzetnoj lokaciji sa mnogim potencijalima. Apartman je smje&scaron;ten na predzadnjem, 4. katu u jednoj od poznatijih starogradskih zgrada sa pogledom na stari dio grada. Brutto povr&scaron;ina stana iznosi 160 m2, te postoji moguænost preureðenja u vi&scaron;e apartmana. Sastoji se od hodnika koji je dug 13 m, 7 soba, 3 kupaonice, kuhinje sa blagovaonicom, jo&scaron; jedne kuhinje i 2 terase.</p>', '<p>We are pleased to offer this rare and exceptional property in a central location in Split. The apartment is located on the 4th floor (out of 5 floors) in one of the most recognizable of old buildings overlooking the old town. The gross floor area is 160 m2 which offers many possibilities for renovation, or even dividing this large apartment into two smaller ones. The flat consists of a hall which is 13 m long, leading through glass doors onto a balcony, 7 rooms, 3 bathrooms, kitchen, dining room, another kitchen and another balcony.</p>', '', '<p>Jedinstvena nekretnina u samom centru Splita, na izuzetnoj lokaciji sa mnogim potencijalima.<br /><br /><br />Apartman je smje&scaron;ten na predzadnjem, 4. katu u jednoj od poznatijih starogradskih zgrada sa pogledom na stari dio grada.<br /><br /><br />Od Rive i Dioklecijanove palaèe udaljen je svega nekoliko minuta hodanja, dok se mnogi sadr¾aji nalaze u blizini.<br /><br /><br />Brutto povr&scaron;ina stana iznosi 160 m2, te postoji moguænost preureðenja u vi&scaron;e apartmana.<br /><br /><br />Sastoji se od hodnika koji je dug 13 m, 7 soba, 3 kupaonice, kuhinje sa blagovaonicom, jo&scaron; jedne kuhinje i 2 terasa. Po jedna terasa se nalazi na sjevernoj i ju¾noj strani &scaron;to je ujedno i orjentacija apartmana.<br /><br /><br />Potrebno mu je kompletno renoviranje i ureðenje, ali je zbog odliènog polo¾aja i velièine idealna prilika ¾elite li investirati u za potrebe turistièkog iznajmljivanja ili jednostavno ¾elite vlastitu oazu u jednom od najljep&scaron;ih i trenutno najpopularnijih gradova u Dalmaciji.<br /><br /><br />Najbli¾i parking udaljen je cca. 50 m od zgrade, dok je do meðunarodnog aerodroma potrebno 40 min. vo¾nje.<br /><br /><br />Za sva dodatna pitanja molimo da nas kontaktirate.</p>', '<p>We are pleased to offer this rare and exceptional property in a central location in Split.<br /><br /><br />The apartment is located on the 4th floor (out of 5 floors) in one of the most recognizable of old buildings overlooking the old town. Orientation is South/ North.<br /><br /><br />The gross floor area is 160 m2 which offers many possibilities for renovation, or even dividing this large apartment into two smaller ones.<br /><br /><br />The flat consists of a hall which is 13 m long, leading through glass doors onto a balcony, 7 rooms, 3 bathrooms, kitchen, dining room, another kitchen and another balcony. One balcony is on the north and one on the south side of the apartment.<br /><br /><br />The flat needs complete renovation and decoration, but due to the excellent location and the historic grandness of the block when it was first built, this could become a fabulous home in the heart of one of the Mediterranean''s most historic cities.<br /><br /><br />The nearest parking is approx. 50 m from the building, while to the international airport takes 30 minutes driving.<br /><br /><br />For questions or viewing of this and other similar properties in the central town area please contact our Split old town office.</p>', '', '', '1010_Apartment_1.jpg', '1010_Apartment_2.jpg', '1010_Apartment_3.jpg', '1010_Apartment_4.jpg', '1010_Apartment_5.jpg', '1010_Apartment_6.jpg', '1010_Apartment_7.jpg', '1010_Apartment_8.jpg'),
(1011, 'Vinko', 'Radiæ', '', '098/982-7694', 'zlata.tustanovski@gmail.com', 'Sibenik', 'Te¾aèka 2, Tribunj, 22212, 12/1, 12/2, 13/1, 13/2, K.O. Tribunj, Staro selo', 'For sale', 'Old stone house', '20', '0', '170', 1, '295000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 4, 3, 'January 15, 2015', '<p>Stara kamena kuæa u strogom centru manjeg mjesta, nedaleko od &Scaron;ibenika, udaljena svega 20 m od mora s terasom na ravnom krovu s koje se pru¾a pogled na more i Kornatsko otoèje. Cijela kuæa je poslo¾ena spiralno oko centralnog atrija koji predstavlja svojevrsno malo dvori&scaron;te poploèano kamenom. Kuæa je povr&scaron;ine 170 m2. Podijeljena je na polueta¾e, svaka sa zasebnim ulazom sa stepeni&scaron;ta koje okru¾uje atrij.</p>', '<p>We are pleased to offer this old stone house, only 20 m away from the sea with a superb roof terrace with long sea views. The whole house is arranged in a circular style around a central atrium which is a small courtyard paved with stone. The house has 170 m2 living area. The house is divided into different floors, each with a separate entrance from the stairs surrounding the atrium. The house was built in 1960 and requires renovation, depending on the needs and desires of the customer.</p>', '', '<p>Stara kamena kuæa u strogom centru manjeg mjesta, nedalako od &Scaron;ibenika, udaljena svega 20 m od mora s terasom na ravnom krovu s koje se pru¾a pogled na more i Kornatsko otoèje.<br /><br /><br />Cijela kuæa je poslo¾ena spiralno oko centralnog atrija koji predstavlja svojevrsno malo dvori&scaron;te poploèano kamenom.<br /><br /><br />Kuæa je povr&scaron;ine 170 m2. Podijeljena je na polueta¾e, svaka sa zasebnim ulazom sa stepeni&scaron;ta koje okru¾uje atrij.<br /><br /><br />U suterenu je soba s kupaonicom.<br /><br /><br />Prizemlje se sastoji od kuhinje s blagovaonicom.<br /><br /><br />I kat apartman sa spavaæom sobom, dnevnom sobom i kupaonicom.<br /><br /><br />II kat spavaæa soba.<br /><br /><br />III kat apartman sa spavaæom sobom i kupaonicom.<br /><br /><br />Kuæa je izgraðena 1960. godine, te zahtjeva renoviranje, ovisno o potrebama i ¾eljama kupca.<br /><br /><br />S obzirom da je cijeli otok za&scaron;tiæena zona pristup autom je dopu&scaron;ten samo tijekom jutarnjih sati. Odmah preko mostiæa koji povezuje otok s kopnom se nalazi parking za koji se mogu dobiti mjeseène karte po povla&scaron;tenoj cijeni za vlasnike nekretnina na otoku.<br /><br /><br />Na samo par minuta hoda od kuæe nalazi se marina, ureðene gradske pla¾e, restorani, trgovine, kafiæi, knji¾nica i kulturni centar.<br /><br /><br />Udaljenost do aerodroma je 70 km.</p>', '<p>We are pleased to offer this old stone house, only 20 m away from the sea with a superb roof terrace with long sea views.<br /><br /><br />The whole house is arranged in a circular style around a central atrium which is a small courtyard paved with stone. The house has 170 m2 living area.<br /><br /><br />The house is divided into different floors, each with a separate entrance from the stairs surrounding the atrium.<br /><br /><br />The basement has a bedroom with bathroom.<br /><br /><br />The ground floor consists of a kitchen with dining room.<br /><br /><br />First floor is an apartment with a bedroom, living room and bathroomSecond floor is one bedroom.<br /><br /><br />Third floor is an apartment with one &nbsp;bedroom and bathroom.<br /><br /><br />The house was built in 1960 and requires renovation, depending on the needs and desires of the customer.<br /><br /><br />Given that the entire island is protected zone, access by car is only allowed during the morning hours. Immediately across the bridge that connects the island to the mainland there is parking for which you can get a monthly ticket at a subsidized price for the property owners on the island.<br /><br /><br />In only a few minutes walk from the house there is a marina, beautiful beaches, restaurants, shops, bars, library and cultural center.<br /><br /><br />Proximity to Split airport is 70 km.<br /><br /><br />CPS Split office stay at your service for any questions or viewing.</p>', '', '1011_Old-stone-house_0.jpg', '1011_Old-stone-house_1.jpg', '1011_Old-stone-house_2.jpg', '1011_Old-stone-house_3.jpg', '1011_Old-stone-house_4.jpg', '1011_Old-stone-house_5.jpg', '1011_Old-stone-house_6.jpg', '1011_Old-stone-house_7.jpg', '1011_Old-stone-house_8.jpg'),
(1013, 'Petra', '©kariæ', '', ' 091 7922 004', 'petraskaric@hotmail.com', 'Brac', 'Postira, Put svetog Duha, k.o. Positra, Z.U. 1805, èest. zem. 909', 'For sale', 'Land plot', '80', '903', '0', 2, '163000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 0, 0, 'January 23, 2015', '<p>Graðevinsko zemlji&scaron;te na otoku Braèu u malom turistièkom mjestu na sjevernom dijelu, sa prekrasnim pogledom na more, Braèki kanal i centar mjesta. Ukupna povr&scaron;ina iznosi 903 m2, dok je udaljenost od mora i pla¾e cca. 80 m. Sva infrastruktura je dovedena do samog zemlji&scaron;ta, dok je pristup automobilom direktan. Zemlji&scaron;te je u laganom padu, idealno za izgradnju vile sa bazenom i mnogim drugim sadr¾ajima.</p>\r\n<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;">CIJENA SNI®ENA S &euro;200.000!</span></p>', '<p>We are pleased to offer this building land on the island of Brac in a small village in the northern part, with beautiful sea views towards the mainland and over the village centre. The total land area is 903 m2, while the distance from the beach approx. 80 m. The land is on a steady slope, ideal for building a villa with swimming pool with space for many other amenities.</p>\r\n<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;">PRICE REDUCED FROM &euro;200.000!</span></p>', '', '<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;"><strong>CIJENA SNI®ENA S &euro;200.000!</strong></span></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Graðevinsko zemlji&scaron;te na otoku Braèu u malom turistièkom mjestu na sjevernom dijelu, sa prekrasnim pogledom na more, Braèki kanal i centar mjesta.<br /><br /><br />Ukupna povr&scaron;ina iznosi 903 m2, dok je udaljenost od mora i pla¾e cca. 80 m.<br /><br /><br />Sva infrastruktura je dovedena do samog zemlji&scaron;ta, dok je pristup automobilom direktan.<br /><br /><br />Zemlji&scaron;te je u laganom padu, idealno za izgradnju vile sa bazenom i mnogim drugim sadr¾ajima.<br /><br /><br />Svi potrebni sadr¾aji se nalaze u blizini.<br /><br /><br />Otok Braè je povezan svakodnevnom trajektnom linijom sa gradom Splitom, dok je meðunarodni aerodrom udaljen 40 min. vo¾nje od Splita.<br /><br /><br />Za sve dodatne informacije stojimo na raspolaganju.</p>', '<p><strong><span style="text-decoration: underline;">PRICE REDUCED FROM &euro;200.000!</span></strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>We are pleased to offer this building land on the island of Brac in a small village in the northern part, with beautiful sea views towards the mainland and over the village centre.<br /><br /><br />The total land area is 903 m2, while the distance from the beach approx. 80 m.<br /><br /><br />All the infrastructure is already on the land, and their is direct access by car.<br /><br /><br />The land is on a steady slope, ideal for building a villa with swimming pool with space for many other amenities.<br /><br /><br />All necessary facilities are nearby.<br /><br /><br />The island of Brac is connected by daily ferry lines to Split, while the international airport is 40 min ride from Split.<br /><br /><br />For additional information Croatia Property Sales stay at your service.</p>', '', '1013_Land-plot_0.jpg', '1013_Land-plot_1.jpg', '1013_Land-plot_2.jpg', '1013_Land-plot_3.jpg', '1013_Land-plot_4.jpg', '', '', '', ''),
(1014, 'Marijan', 'Lovriæ-Jakov', '091 3596908', '091 7963164', '', 'Rogoznica', 'Stiva¹nica, 10382/1 K.o. Sevid', 'For sale', 'Land plot', '50', '523', '0', 1, '109000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 0, 0, 'January 23, 2015', '<p>Graðevinsko zemlji&scaron;te povr&scaron;ine 523 m2 nalazi se u lijepoj mirnoj uvali na svega 50 m od mora. Sa zemlji&scaron;ta se pru¾a pogled na more i uvalu. Kompletna infrastruktura je prisutna. Od centra mjesta zemlji&scaron;te je udaljeno svega 1 km. U mjestu se nalazi prekrasna pla¾a i svi ostali potrebni sadr¾aju (trgovine, restorani i kafiæi).</p>', '<p>Croatia Property Sales are pleased to offer this building plot located in a nice quiet bay only 50 m from the sea. This is an attractive plot of 523m sq on land overlooking the sea and the bay. The entire infrastructure (water, electric etc) is present. The distance to the nearest village from the centre of land is 1 km. Distance from the airport is 25 km.</p>', '', '<p>Graðevinsko zemlji&scaron;te povr&scaron;ine 523 m2 nalazi se u lijepoj mirnoj uvali na svega 50 m od mora.<br /><br /><br />Sa zemlji&scaron;ta se pru¾a pogled na more i uvalu.<br /><br /><br />Kompletna infrastruktura je prisutna.<br /><br /><br />Od centra mjesta zemlji&scaron;te je udaljeno svega 1 km. U mjestu se nalazi prekrasna pla¾a i svi ostali potrebni sadr¾aju (trgovine, restorani i kafiæi).<br /><br /><br />Udaljenost od aerodroma je 25 km.</p>', '<p>Croatia Property Sales are pleased to offer this building plot located in a nice quiet bay only 50 m from the sea.<br /><br /><br />This is an attractive plot of 523m sq on land overlooking the sea and the bay.<br /><br /><br />The entire infrastructure (water, electric etc) is present.<br /><br /><br />The distance to the nearest village from the centre of land is 1 km. The town has a beautiful beach and all other necessary facilities, such as shops, bars, restaurants and cafes).<br /><br /><br />Distance from the airport is 25 km.<br /><br /><br />Pls call our office in Split to arrange to visit this or other similar properties in the area.</p>', '', '1014_Land-plot_0.jpg', '1014_Land-plot_1.jpg', '1014_Land-plot_2.jpg', '1014_Land-plot_3.jpg', '', '', '', '', ''),
(1015, 'Ivana', 'Lovriæ', '', '095 399 05 83', 'ilovri@gmail.com', 'Rogoznica', 'Stiva¹nica, K.è 10389, 10390/1, 10388 K.o. Sevid', 'For sale', 'Land plot', '70', '480', '0', 1, '105600', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 0, 0, 'January 23, 2015', '<p>U prekrasnom malom dalmatinskom mjestu na svega 70 m udaljenosti od mora nalazi se zemlji&scaron;te povr&scaron;ine 480 m2. Zemlji&scaron;te se nalazi u graðevinskoj zoni sa svom potrebnom infrastrukturom. Parcela je sjeverozapadne orijentacije. Sa zemlji&scaron;ta se pru¾a pogled na more i uvalu. Parcela je od centra mjesta udaljena svega 1 km, a samim time i od svih turistièkih sadr¾aja, ponuda, trgovina, restorana i kafiæa.</p>', '<p>We are pleased to offer this land plot In a small seaside village just 70 meters from the sea. The land is 482m sq and is located in a construction zone with access from the road and all necessary infrastructure (water, electric, etc). The plot is north-west orientation, overlooking the sea and the bay. The distance from the town centre is only 1 km, with attractions and facilities for tourists such as shops, restaurants and cafes.</p>', '', '<p>U prekrasnom malom dalmatinskom mjestu na svega 70 m udaljenosti od mora nalazi se zemlji&scaron;te povr&scaron;ine 480 m2.<br /><br /><br />Zemlji&scaron;te se nalazi u graðevinskoj zoni sa svom potrebnom infrastrukturom.<br /><br /><br />Parcela je sjeverozapadne orijentacije.<br /><br /><br />Sa zemlji&scaron;ta se pru¾a pogled na more i uvalu.<br /><br /><br />Parcela je od centra mjesta udaljena svega 1 km, a samim time i od svih turistièkih sadr¾aja, ponuda, trgovina, restorana i kafiæa.<br /><br /><br />Do parcele vodi asfaltirana cesta.<br /><br /><br />Udaljenost do aerodroma je 25 km.</p>', '<p>We are pleased to offer this land plot In a small seaside village just 70 meters from the sea.<br /><br /><br />The land is 482m sq and is located in a construction zone with access from the road and all necessary infrastructure (water, electric, etc).<br /><br /><br />The plot is north-west orientation, overlooking the sea and the bay.<br /><br /><br />The distance from the town centre is only 1 km, with attractions and facilities for tourists such as shops, restaurants and cafes.<br /><br /><br />Pitch leads to an asphalt road.<br /><br /><br />Distance to airport 25 km.<br /><br /><br />Please call our office full of attractive ladies in the town centre in Split.</p>', '', '1015_Land-plot_0.jpg', '1015_Land-plot_1.jpg', '1015_Land-plot_2.jpg', '1015_Land-plot_3.jpg', '1015_Land-plot_4.jpg', '', '', '', ''),
(1016, 'Marko', 'Marin', 'klljuè Matija Tomiæ, mob: 099 3013123', '091 33 22 171', '', 'Split', 'Klaiæeva poljana 1, 2167/2', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '300', '0', '60', 1, '354000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 3, 2, 'January 23, 2015', '<p>Apartman u starograskoj zgradi smje&scaron;ten u centru grada Splita na izuzetnoj poziciji udaljen od Rive i Dioklecijanove palaèe svega par minuta hodanja. Nalazi se na 1.katu, dok cijela zgrada ima ukupno 4 kata. Orijentacija apartmana je jug, dok se pogled pru¾a na jednu od naprometnijih ulica. Ukupna povr&scaron;ina je 60 m2, a sastoji se od 3 spavaæe sobe, kuhinje, kupaonice, wc-a, predsoblja, hodnika i balkona.</p>', '<p>We are pleased to offer this apartment in an old building located in the center of Split in an exceptional location. It is situated just a few minutes walk from the Riva and the centre of the Diocletian Palace. It is located on the 1st floor, of a building with 4 floors. The orientation of the apartment is south, while the view extends down one of the busiest streets. The total area inside the property is 60 m2.</p>', '', '<p>Apartman u starograskoj zgradi smje&scaron;ten u centru grada Splita na izuzetnoj poziciji udaljen od Rive i Dioklecijanove palaèe svega par minuta hodanja.<br /><br /><br />Nalazi se na 1.katu, dok cijela zgrada ima ukupno 4 kata.<br /><br /><br />Orijentacija apartmana je jug, dok se pogled pru¾a na jednu od naprometnijih ulica.<br /><br /><br />Ukupna povr&scaron;ina je 60 m2, a sastoji se od 3 spavaæe sobe, kuhinje, kupaonice, wc-a, predsoblja, hodnika i balkona.<br /><br /><br />Apartman je u funkciji turistièkog iznajmljivanja, stoga je moguæe nastaviti veæ uhodani posao.<br /><br /><br />U useljivom je stanju, ali je potrebno dodatno renoviranje i ureðenje ¾elite li luksuzniji nivo.<br /><br /><br />Mnoge trgovine, restorani i ostali sadr¾aji se nalaze u blizini.<br /><br /><br />Do meðunarodnog aerodroma je potrebno 40 min. vo¾nje.<br /><br /><br />Za sve dodatne informacije slobodno nas kontaktirajte.</p>', '<p>We are pleased to offer this apartment in an old building located in the center of Split in an exceptional location.<br /><br /><br />It is situated just a few minutes walk from the Riva and the centre of the Diocletian Palace, with many restaurants, bars and almost all the famous historic and cultural attractions of the town.<br /><br /><br />It is located on the 1st floor, of a building with 4 floors.<br /><br /><br />The orientation of the apartment is south, while the view extends down one of the busiest streets.<br /><br /><br />The total area inside the property is 60 m2 and it consists of 3 bedrooms, kitchen, bathroom, toilet, hall, and balcony.<br /><br /><br />The apartment is being used for for tourist renting, so it is possible to continue with this well-established business, or for it to be used privately.<br /><br /><br />It is In a habitable condition, but probably needs further renovation and decoration if you want to enjoy a more luxurious level.<br /><br /><br />The journey to the international airport takes 40 min driving.<br /><br /><br />For further information please contact us in our little office opposite Olymp bar.</p>', '', '1016_Apartment_0.jpg', '1016_Apartment_1.jpg', '1016_Apartment_2.jpg', '1016_Apartment_3.jpg', '1016_Apartment_4.jpg', '1016_Apartment_5.jpg', '1016_Apartment_6.jpg', '1016_Apartment_7.jpg', '1016_Apartment_8.jpg'),
(1017, 'Bo¾o', 'Æapeta', 'Bo¾o Æapeta - vlasnik - 097 7255 138', 'Tonæi Gudelj, mob: 095 1999425', 'gudelj.tonci@gmail.com', 'Split', 'Obala Hrvatskog narodnog preporoda 8, ', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '40', '0', '165', 1, '450000', '', 2, 2, 2, 1, 1, 2, 5, 2, 'January 23, 2015', '<p>Ekskluzivna nekretnina koja se nalazi na 4. katu (potkrovlju) na atraktivnoj lokaciji na samoj Rivi u centru grada. Iz apartmana se pru¾a prekrasan pogled na more i obli¾nje otoke. Tlocrtna povr&scaron;ina stana je 165m2, dok je u dokumentaciji zbog kosina i koeficienta upisano 138 m2. Postoji moguænost kori&scaron;tenja tavana koji je velièine 30-40 m2. Trenutno je podijeljen u zasebne jedinice koje se kao takve mogu preurediti ili spojiti u 1 veliki apartman.</p>', '<p>We are pleased to offer this rare opportunity to buy of the few apartments located above the Riva. It is located on the 4th floor (top floor) in a stunning location on the waterfront in the old city centre! The view from the apartment is breathtaking and includes views of the sea and nearby islands, as well as the harbour and marina. The layout area of the apartment is 165m2, although the documentation, because of the attic slope size, is shown as 138 m2. You can use the attic which has a size of 30-40 m2.</p>', '', '<p>Ekskluzivna nekretnina koja se nalazi na 4. katu (potkrovlju) na atraktivnoj lokaciji na samoj Rivi u centru grada.<br /><br /><br />Iz apartmana se pru¾a prekrasan pogled na more i obli¾nje otoke.<br /><br /><br />Tri velika luminara-prozora gledaju direktno na Rivu, Gradsku luku i Marjan.<br /><br /><br />S obzirom na lokaciju apartman pru¾a mnogo moguæosti, kako privatnih tako i poslovnih ukoliko se ¾elite baviti turistièkim iznajmljivanjem.<br /><br /><br />Tlocrtna povr&scaron;ina stana je 165m2, dok je u dokumentaciji zbog kosina i koeficienta upisano 138 m2.<br /><br /><br />Postoji moguænost kori&scaron;tenja tavana koji je velièine 30-40 m2.<br /><br /><br />Trenutno je podijeljen u zasebne jedinice koje se kao takve mogu preurediti ili spojiti u 1 veliki apartman.<br /><br /><br />Sastoji se od tri sobe na jugu, hodnka u sredini, dvije kuhinje i dvije blagovaonice na sjeveru. Na sjevernoj strani se takoðer nalazi jo&scaron; jedna spavaæa soba, 2 kupaonice i mali hodnik.<br /><br /><br />Potrebno mu je renoviranje, ali postoji moguænost boravka i u sada&scaron;njem stanju.<br /><br /><br />Najbli¾i parking udaljen je 50 m od zgrade, dok je meðunarodni aerodrom udaljen 40 min. vo¾nje.<br /><br /><br />Za sve dodatne informacije stojimo vam na raspolaganju.</p>', '<p>We are pleased to offer this rare opportunity to buy of the few apartments located above the Riva. It is located on the 4th floor (top floor) in a stunning location on the waterfront in the old city centre!<br /><br /><br />The view from the apartment is breathtaking and includes views of the sea and nearby islands, as well as the harbour and marina.<br /><br /><br />Three great windows look directly at Riva/waterfront, the city harbor and Marjan, from the apartment.<br /><br /><br />This location offers a lot of possibilities, both private and business, if they want to become with tourist renting.<br /><br /><br />The layout area of the apartment is 165m2, although the documentation, because of the attic slope size, is shown as 138 m2.<br /><br /><br />You can use the attic which has a size of 30-40 m2.<br /><br /><br />Currently the flat is divided into two separate units, which can be rearranged or merged into one large apartment.<br /><br /><br />It consists of three rooms in the south, hall in the middle, two kitchens and two dining rooms on the north. On the north side there is also another bedroom, 2 bathrooms and a small hallway.<br /><br /><br />It needs renovation, but there is the possibility of using it in the present state.<br /><br /><br />The nearest parking is 50 meters from the building, while the international airport is 40 min driving.<br /><br /><br />For additional information, please feel free to call us in our lovely little office, opposite Bar Olymp:)</p>', '', '1017_Apartment_0.jpg', '1017_Apartment_1.jpg', '1017_Apartment_2.jpg', '1017_Apartment_3.jpg', '1017_Apartment_4.jpg', '1017_Apartment_5.jpg', '1017_Apartment_6.jpg', '1017_Apartment_7.jpg', '1017_Apartment_8.jpg'),
(1018, 'Matko', '©ikliæ', '', '091 582 88 88', 'rahela.maslinica@gmail.com', 'Solta', 'Maslinica, ', 'For sale', 'Old stone house', '5', '0', '60', 1, '180000', '', 2, 2, 2, 1, 1, 2, 2, 1, 'January 23, 2015', '<p>Kuæa je smje&scaron;tena uz samu obalu malog ribarskog mjesta na otoku &Scaron;olti, sa pogledom na uvalu i svega 5 metara od udaljena mora. Kuæa ima prizemlje i kat, ukupne stambene povr&scaron;ine 60 m2, te je jugozapadne orjentacije. Kompletno je rekonstruirana uz po&scaron;tivanje svih konzervatorskih savjeta i naputaka. Kod rekonstrukcije kori&scaron;teni su visokokvalitetni i autohtoni materijali. Kuæa je u samom centru mjesta.</p>', '<p>We are offering this semi-detached house which is located on the shore of a small fishing village on the island of Solta. It is situated 5 meters away from the harbour wall, where the local fishing boats are moored up in the clear water. The house has two floors, with a total floor area of 60 m2, and the south-west orientation. It was completely reconstructed in compliance with all conservation requirements and instructions. When the construction work was undertaken only high quality and authentic natural materials were used.</p>', '', '<p>Kuæa je smje&scaron;tena uz samu obalu malog ribarskog mjesta na otoku &Scaron;olti, sa pogledom na uvalu i svega 5 metara od udaljena mora.<br /><br /><br />Kuæa ima prizemlje i kat, ukupne stambene povr&scaron;ine 60 m2, te je jugozapadne orjentacije.<br /><br /><br />Kompletno je rekonstruirana uz po&scaron;tivanje svih konzervatorskih savjeta i naputaka. Kod rekonstrukcije kori&scaron;teni su visokokvalitetni i autohtoni materijali.<br /><br /><br />Unutra&scaron;njost kuæe je u grubim radovima te se time ostavlja moguænost zavr&scaron;etka unutra&scaron;njosti prema ¾eljama buduæih vlasnika.<br /><br /><br />Kuæa je u samom centru mjesta.<br /><br /><br />Od trajektne luke udaljena je petnaestak minuta vo¾nje.<br /><br /><br />&Scaron;olta ima redovne trajektne i brodske linije sa Splitom kroz cijelu godinu.<br /><br /><br />Za sva pitanja ili dogovor oko razgledavanja ove ili slicnih nekretnina na otoku stojimo na usluzi.</p>', '<p>We are offering this semi-detached house which is located on the shore of a small fishing village on the island of Solta.<br /><br /><br />It is situated 5 meters away from the harbour wall, where the local fishing boats are moored up in the clear water.<br /><br /><br />The house has two floors, with a total floor area of 60 m2, and the south-west orientation.<br /><br /><br />It was completely reconstructed in compliance with all conservation requirements and instructions. When the construction work was undertaken only high quality and authentic natural materials were used.<br /><br /><br />The interior of the house is completed to a rough standard, ready for the fine interior decorating to begin.<br /><br /><br />The house is very much in the village centre with shops, bars and coffee shops all nearby.<br /><br /><br />The ferry port is about fifteen minutes drive.<br /><br /><br />Solta has regular ferry and ship lines with Split throughout the year.<br /><br /><br />For any questions or to see this or similar real estate on the island, we are at your service.</p>', '', '1018_Old-stone-house_0.jpg', '1018_Old-stone-house_1.jpg', '1018_Old-stone-house_2.jpg', '1018_Old-stone-house_3.jpg', '1018_Old-stone-house_4.jpg', '1018_Old-stone-house_5.jpg', '1018_Old-stone-house_6.jpg', '1018_Old-stone-house_7.jpg', '1018_Old-stone-house_8.jpg');
INSERT INTO `nekretnina` (`id`, `ime`, `prezime`, `telefon`, `mobitel`, `e_mail`, `lokacija_id`, `adresa`, `status_id`, `vrsta_id`, `udaljenost`, `povrsina`, `stambenapovrsina`, `display`, `cijena`, `cijenatocka`, `ponuda_tjedna`, `new_built`, `must_sell`, `prvi_red_do_mora`, `pogled_na_more`, `bazen`, `broj_soba`, `broj_kupatila`, `datum`, `title_hr`, `title_en`, `title_ge`, `opis_hr`, `opis_en`, `opis_ge`, `PropertyImageURL0`, `PropertyImageURL1`, `PropertyImageURL2`, `PropertyImageURL3`, `PropertyImageURL4`, `PropertyImageURL5`, `PropertyImageURL6`, `PropertyImageURL7`, `PropertyImageURL8`) VALUES
(1019, '', 'MarcoPolo', '', '', '', 'Korcula', 'kod Vela Luke', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '10', '900', '65', 1, '280000', '', 2, 2, 2, 1, 1, 2, 3, 2, 'January 25, 2015', '<p>Prodajemo ureðeno imanje s manjom kuæom na otoku Korèula, prvi red do mora. Sama povr&scaron;ina parcele (900 m2), osigurava mir i privatnost. Potpuno privatnim putem, koji vodi kroz maslinik, dolazi se do kuæe koja je smje&scaron;tena tik do obale. Ova &scaron;armantna prizemnica se sastoji od ukupno tri spavaæe sobe, kuhinje i dva kupatila. Na doslovno par koraka nalazi se more s ureðenim platoima za sunèanje.</p>', '<p>Croatia Property Sales are offering this charming seafront house on the island of Korcula. This real estate is located directly next to the sea. The house is surrounded by 900 m2 of olive trees and beauty. The house has three bedrooms, a kitchen and two bathrooms. Outside there are several spacious terraces, partially covered and several sitting areas which offer sun-bathing platforms and stunning views of summer sunsets. This is a unique property and we welcome your inquiries.</p>', '', '<p>Prodajemo ureðeno imanje s manjom kuæom na otoku Korèula, prvi red do mora.<br /><br /><br />Sama povr&scaron;ina parcele (900 m2), osigurava mir i privatnost.<br /><br /><br />Potpuno privatnim putem, koji vodi kroz maslinik, dolazi se do kuæe koja je smje&scaron;tena tik do obale.<br /><br /><br />Ova &scaron;armantna prizemnica se sastoji od ukupno tri spavaæe sobe, kuhinje i dva kupatila.<br /><br /><br />Okru¾ena je s vi&scaron;e prostranih terasa (koje su jednim dijelom natkrite) te dodatnim platoima / sjenicama s kojih se pru¾a pogled na fantastiène zalaske sunca.<br /><br /><br />Na doslovno par koraka nalazi se more s ureðenim platoima za sunèanje.<br /><br /><br />Predio u kojem se ova nekretnina nalazi nema struju ni tekuæu vodu, ali je kuæa u potpunosti opremljena solarnim sustavima i cisternom za vodu, tako da ima sve preduvjete za nesmetano u¾ivanje prirodi, miru i ti&scaron;ini, a opet bez odricanja od civilizacijskih navika i potreba.<br /><br /><br />Do veæeg naselja s svim potrebnim resursima (trgovinama, restoranima, bankama...) je 5 min. vo¾nje.</p>', '<p>Croatia Property Sales are offering this charming seafront house on the island of Korcula.<br /><br /><br />This real estate is located directly next to the sea.<br /><br /><br />The house is surrounded by 900 m2 of olive trees and beauty.<br /><br /><br />The house has three bedrooms, a kitchen and two bathrooms. Outside there are several spacious terraces, partially covered and several sitting areas which offer sun-bathing platforms and stunning views of summer sunsets.<br /><br /><br />There is no connection to the electrical grid or the town water system. However, a solar system provides for basic electrical needs and can easily be expanded. As for water, the house is equipped with a large water tank.<br /><br /><br />There is direct road access and plenty of parking.<br /><br /><br />The closest bigger town is a five minute drive away. The large land area and rural setting makes for a very quiet and peaceful environment.<br /><br /><br />This is a unique property and we welcome your inquiries. The ownership title is proper.</p>', '', '1019_House-Villa_0.jpg', '1019_House-Villa_1.jpg', '1019_House-Villa_2.jpg', '1019_House-Villa_3.jpg', '1019_House-Villa_4.jpg', '1019_House-Villa_5.jpg', '', '', ''),
(1020, '', 'MarcoPolo', '', '', '', 'Korcula', 'Pri¾ba', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '30', '600', '350', 1, '420000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 7, 6, 'January 25, 2015', '<p>Ova prostrana apartmanska kuæa se nalazi na parceli povr&scaron;ine 600 m2 i od mora je udaljena svega 30 &ndash; tak metara. Ukupne je unutarnje stambene povr&scaron;ine 350 m2 + vi&scaron;e od 90 m2 natkritih terasa. Okuænica ureðena i kultivirana veæim dijelom, dok je dio ostavljen u prirodnom obliku. Do mora vodi ureðen prilaz, a na obali postoje platoi za sunèanje i vez za èamac.</p>', '<p>Prime south coast location: this spacious holiday home is located on 600 m2 of land and is only 30 meters from the sea. The house has a total living space of 350 m2 which includes a 90 m2 covered balcony. The surrounding grounds are landscaped in a natural form. There is direct access to the sea with plateaus for sunbathing. It is also possible to moor a boat.</p>', '', '<p>Ova prostrana apartmanska kuæa se nalazi na parceli povr&scaron;ine 600 m2 i od mora je udaljena svega 30 &ndash; tak metara.<br /><br /><br />Ukupne je unutarnje stambene povr&scaron;ine 350 m2 + vi&scaron;e od 90 m2 natkritih terasa.<br /><br /><br />Uz cestu se nalazi parking za 4 automobila i objekt povr&scaron;ine 50 m2 u kojem se nalazi jednosoban stan (spavaæa soba, kupatilo i kombinirani dnevni prostor).<br /><br /><br />Visoko prizemlje saèinjavaju 2 potpuno ureðena i opremljana apartmana (75m2 svaki), te natkrita terasa s otvorenim pogledom na more. Apartmani su meðusobno povezani vratima i uz manje intervencije ih je lako pretvoriti u jedan prostrani stan. Svaki ima zasebni ulaz i sastoje se; apartman 1: dvije spavaæe sobe, kuhinja, kupatilo i dnevna soba. Apartman 2: jedna spavaæa soba, kuhinja, kupatilo i veliki dnevni prostor.<br /><br /><br />Drugu eta¾u saèinjavaju tri odvojena apartmana (55m2, 50m2, 40m2), od kojih je najveæi ureðen i u funkciji (dnevni prostor s kuhinjom, spavaæa soba, kupatilo), dok su ostala dva nedovr&scaron;ena i u Roh Bau fazi. Ovaj kat ima natkritu terasu èitavim proèeljem kuæe s velièanstvenim pogledom.<br /><br /><br />Okuænica ureðena i kultivirana veæim dijelom, dok je dio ostavljen u prirodnom obliku.<br /><br /><br />Do mora vodi ureðen prilaz, a na obali postoje platoi za sunèanje i vez za èamac.</p>', '<p>Prime south coast location: this spacious holiday home is located on 600 m2 of land and is only 30 meters from the sea.<br /><br /><br />The house has a total living space of 350 m2 which includes a 90 m2 covered balcony.<br /><br /><br />The ground floor consists of two fully-furnished and equipped apartments, 75 m2 each, and a covered terrace with a very nice sea-view. Apartment 1: two bedrooms, kitchen, bathroom and living room. Apartment 2: one bedroom, kitchen, bathroom and a large living space. The two apartments are inter-connected and have separate entrances and they can easily be converted into one large apartment.<br /><br /><br />The second level consists of three separate apartments of 55, 50 and 40m2. One apartment is finished, the other two need to be finished. The basic configuration is a living room, kitchen, bedroom and bathroom. This level has a covered terrace for all three apartments and a wonderful sea view.<br /><br /><br />There is also a separate building of approx. 50 m2 that is used as an apartment.<br /><br /><br />There is ample road-side parking.<br /><br /><br />The surrounding grounds are landscaped in a natural form.<br /><br /><br />There is direct access to the sea with plateaus for sunbathing.<br /><br /><br />It is also possible to moor a boat.<br /><br /><br />Please call us for a private viewing.</p>', '', '1020_House-Villa_0.jpg', '1020_House-Villa_1.jpg', '1020_House-Villa_2.jpg', '1020_House-Villa_3.jpg', '1020_House-Villa_4.jpg', '1020_House-Villa_5.jpg', '1020_House-Villa_6.jpg', '', ''),
(1021, '', 'MarcoPolo', '', '', '', 'Korcula', 'Pri¾ba, cijena 460.000 Eura', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '10', '700', '160', 2, '99000001', '', 2, 2, 2, 1, 1, 2, 5, 3, 'January 26, 2015', '<p>Na veoma atraktivnoj lokaciji ju¾ne obale otoka, prodaje se &scaron;armantna obiteljska kuæa tik do mora. Ova ''''kuæa iz snova'''' se nalazi na parceli povr&scaron;ine 700 m2 koja se prote¾e od ceste do obale. Sastoji od dva kata, tj. dvije stambene jedinice + gostinjski studio apartman u prizemlju. Ulazi u svaki stan su odvojeni. Èitava kuæa je okru¾ena borovima i ureðenim vrtovima koji osiguravaju hlad u ljetnim mjesecima te za&scaron;titu od buke i pogleda. Do mora se sti¾e u doslovno par koraka i tamo se nalaze ureðeni platoi i privezi&scaron;te za èamac.</p>', '<p>We are offering this charming family house located at one of the best south-coast locations. This &ldquo;dream house&rdquo; is on a plot of 700 m2 which extends from the access road to the sea front. The house had two floors (two separate residential units) plus a guest, studio apartment in the basement. All living quarters have separate enterances. The sea is only steps away and there are plateaus for sunbathing. It is also possible to moor a boat.</p>', '', '<p>Na veoma atraktivnoj lokaciji ju¾ne obale otoka, prodaje se &scaron;armantna obiteljska kuæa tik do mora.<br /><br /><br />Ova ''''kuæa iz snova'''' se nalazi na parceli povr&scaron;ine 700 m2 koja se prote¾e od ceste do obale. Sastoji od dva kata, tj. dvije stambene jedinice + gostinjski studio apartman u prizemlju. Ulazi u svaki stan su odvojeni.<br /><br /><br />Prizemlje saèinjava od 65 m2 koji se sattoji od kuhinje, kupatila, hodnika, spavaæe sobe te prostranog dnevnog prostora koji je dijelom pregraðen te se u tu nalazi jos jo&scaron; jedna spavaæa soba. Ispred ovog stana je velika terasa koja je dijelom natkrita dok se ispod iste nalazi manje spremi&scaron;te.<br /><br /><br />Vanjsko stepeni&scaron;te vodi na kat gdje se nalazi dvosoban stan povr&scaron;ine 65 m2 + prostrana terasa prema moru i dvori&scaron;te pozadi kuæe.<br /><br /><br />Gostinjski apartman / garsonjera (30m2) se nalazi u suterenu i pripada mu malo dvori&scaron;te.<br /><br /><br />Èitava kuæa je okru¾ena borovima i ureðenim vrtovima koji osiguravaju hlad u ljetnim mjesecima te za&scaron;titu od buke i pogleda.<br /><br /><br />Do mora se sti¾e u doslovno par koraka i tamo se nalaze ureðeni platoi i privezi&scaron;te za èamac.<br /><br /><br />Parking za 3 automobila je odmah uz cestu.<br /><br /><br />Kuæa je ne&scaron;to starije gradnje ali vrlo kvalitetno napravljena i odr¾avana.<br /><br /><br />Idealna za odmor ili iznajmljivanje.</p>', '<p>We are offering this charming family house located at one of the best south-coast locations.<br /><br /><br />This &ldquo;dream house&rdquo; is on a plot of 700 m2 which extends from the access road to the sea front. The house had two floors (two separate residential units) plus a guest, studio apartment in the basement. All living quarters have separate enterances.<br /><br /><br />The gound floor has a living space of 65 m2, consisting of a kitchen, bathroom, hallway, a bedroom and a spacious living room, plus an unfinished room that can be finished into an additional bedroom. There is a large, partly-covered terrace.<br /><br /><br />An external staircase leads to the second level where there is a two-bedroom apartment of 65 m2 with a spacious terrace overlooking the sea.<br /><br /><br />The basement studio apartment has a small courtyard.<br /><br /><br />The house is surrounded by trees (shade in the summer) and landscaped gardens.<br /><br /><br />The sea is only steps away and there are plateaus for sunbathing.<br /><br /><br />It is also possible to moor a boat.<br /><br /><br />There is parking space for three cars.<br /><br /><br />The house has been very well maintained and is ideal for year-round living, a holiday home or for holiday rental.<br /><br /><br />We are sure you will be happy with the location. Please call us for more information.</p>', '', '1021_House-Villa_0.jpg', '1021_House-Villa_1.jpg', '1021_House-Villa_2.jpg', '1021_House-Villa_3.jpg', '1021_House-Villa_4.jpg', '1021_House-Villa_5.jpg', '1021_House-Villa_6.jpg', '', ''),
(1022, 'Tomislav', 'Maroviæ', '', '095/8715-808', '', 'Solta', 'Uvala Travna 1, Solta (Gornje Selo), 3353/1 ko Gornje selo', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '20', '3000', '110', 2, '650000', '', 2, 2, 2, 1, 1, 2, 3, 2, 'January 27, 2015', '<p>Jedinstvena nekretnina koja se smjestila u mirnoj uvali na otoku &Scaron;olti u kojoj nema susjeda. Kuæa ima 110 m2 i sastoji se od prizemlja u kojem je velika konoba, kata koji se sastoji od kuhinje, blagovaonice, dnevnog boravka, dvije sobe, kupaonice i wc-a te dodatne sobe u potkrovlju. Kuæa sa terasama je na zemlji&scaron;tu od 3.000 m2 te zahtijeva renovaciju kako bi se modernizirala.</p>\r\n<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;">CIJENA SNI®ENA sa 750.000 Eura na 650.000 Eura!</span></p>', '<p>Croatia Property Sales is pleased to offer this UNIQUE property in a quiet bay on the island of Solta, with no neighbours around. The house is 110 sqm and consists of ground floor with the tavern, first floor (kitchen, dining room, living area, two bedrooms, bathroom and a toilet and additional room in the attic. The house is on the land plot of 3.000 sqm and requires renovation to make it more modern.</p>\r\n<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;">PRICE REDUCED from 750.000 Euro to 650.000 Euro!</span></p>', '', '<p>Jedinstvena nekretnina koja se smjestila u mirnoj uvali na otoku &Scaron;olti u kojoj nema susjeda.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;"><strong>CIJENA SNI®ENA sa 750.000 Eura na 650.000 Eura!</strong></span><br /><br /><br />Kuæa ima 110 m2 i sastoji se od prizemlja u kojem je velika konoba, kata koji se sastoji od kuhinje, blagovaonice, dnevnog boravka, dvije sobe, kupaonice i wc-a te dodatne sobe u potkrovlju.<br /><br /><br />Oko kuæe su i dvije velike terase (70 m2) sa kojih se pru¾a jedinstven pogled na okolno zelenilo i more.<br /><br /><br />Kuæa sa terasama je na zemlji&scaron;tu od 3.000 m2 te zahtijeva renovaciju kako bi se modernizirala.<br /><br /><br />Moguæ je dogovor oko kupnje dodatnog zemlji&scaron;ta.<br /><br /><br />U uvali nema struje niti vode veæ se koristi cisterna za vodu kao i septièka jama.<br /><br /><br />Ispred kuæe se nalaze predivne &scaron;ljunèane pla¾e i vez za brod.<br /><br /><br />Najbli¾e veæe mjesto nalazi se na udaljenosti od otprilike 5 kilometara.<br /><br /><br />Do trajektne luke (Rogaèa) potrebno je petnaestak minuta vo¾nje.</p>', '<p>Croatia Property Sales is pleased to offer this UNIQUE property in a quiet bay on the island of Solta, with no neighbours around.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong><span style="text-decoration: underline;">PRICE REDUCED from 750.000 Euro to 650.000 Euro!</span></strong><br /><br /><br />The house is 110 sqm and consists of ground floor with the tavern, first floor (kitchen, dining room, living area, two bedrooms, bathroom and a toilet and additional room in the attic.<br /><br /><br />There are two big terraces around the house (70 sqm) with exceptional view to the sea and greenery.<br /><br /><br />The house is on the land plot of 3.000 sqm and requires renovation to make it more modern.<br /><br /><br />There is the possibility of buying the additional land.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<div><span>The  plot is out of the building zone&nbsp;</span><span>(foreign  nationals may acquire agricultural land only by setting up the  company).</span></div>\r\n<p><br /><br /><br />There is no electricity or water in the bay, but the house uses the water tank and there is also the septic tank.<br /><br /><br />There are beautiful pebbled beaches in the bay plus the boat mooring.<br /><br /><br />The closest bigger village is approximately 5 km away.<br /><br /><br />The ferry port Rogac is 15 minutes&rsquo; drive from the bay.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>', '', '1022_House-Villa_0.jpg', '1022_House-Villa_1.jpg', '1022_House-Villa_2.jpg', '1022_House-Villa_3.jpg', '1022_House-Villa_4.jpg', '1022_House-Villa_5.jpg', '', '1022_House-Villa_7.jpg', ''),
(1024, '', 'odvjetnik Bojaniæ', '', '', '', 'Hvar', 'Suæuraj, 541/22,546/1,547/2', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '15', '1600', '350', 1, '1400000', '', 2, 2, 2, 1, 1, 1, 5, 3, 'January 27, 2015', '<p>Jedinstveno na trzi&scaron;tu!! Vila na prodaju na ju¾noj strani otoka Hvara direktno uz more sa velikom okuænicom, zatvorenog tipa i bazenom koja nudi privatnost i mir! Prekrasan pogled. Vila ima stambenu povr&scaron;inu 350 m2, dok je povr&scaron;ina zemlji&scaron;ta 1600 m2. Vili je potrebna modernizacija.</p>', '<p>Unique on the market! Croatia Property Sales are offering this grand villa on the south side of the island of Hvar, directly by the sea with a walled garden, private mooring and swimming pool. It offers privacy and peace and beautiful views. The building itself has a living area of 350 m2, while the area around property is 1.600 m2.</p>', '', '<p>Jedinstveno na trzi&scaron;tu!!</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Vila na prodaju na ju¾noj strani otoka Hvara direktno uz more sa velikom okuænicom,zatvorenog tipa i bazenom koja nudi privatnost i mir! Prekrasan pogled.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Vila ima stambenu povr&scaron;inu 350 m2, dok je povr&scaron;ina zemlji&scaron;ta 1600 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Do vile se prodaje jo&scaron; jedno graðevinsko zemlji&scaron;te od 750m2 koje mo¾e slu¾iti kao dodatni sadr¾aj, za izgradnju kuæe ili teniskog igrali&scaron;ta. Uz kupnju vile povoljniji uvjeti kupnje ovog zemlji&scaron;ta.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Vili je potrebna modernizacija.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za pitanja i razgledavanje stojimo na usluzi u na&scaron;em uredu u gardu Hvaru.</p>', '<p>Unique on the market!</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Croatia Property Sales are offering this grand villa on the south side of the island of Hvar, directly by the sea with a walled garden, private mooring and swimming pool.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It offers privacy and peace and beautiful views.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The building itself has a living area of 350 m2, while the area around property is 1.600 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Being sold with the villa is another plot, adjacent, of 750m2, which can become an annex, another house or another structure such as a tennis court.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property needs modernization, but it appears structurally sound.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For questions and to visit this property, we are at your service in our office in the town of Hvar.</p>', '', '1024_House-Villa_0.jpg', '1024_House-Villa_1.jpg', '1024_House-Villa_2.jpg', '1024_House-Villa_3.jpg', '1024_House-Villa_4.jpg', '1024_House-Villa_5.jpg', '1024_House-Villa_6.jpg', '1024_House-Villa_7.jpg', '1024_House-Villa_8.jpg'),
(1025, 'Marija', 'Cvitaniæ', '', '0919083909 Marija', '', 'Trogir', 'Fran Krste Frankopana 17 (Bu¹inci), Z.U. 1760 749/11 774', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '10', '482', '108', 2, '350000', '', 2, 2, 2, 1, 1, 2, 3, 2, 'January 28, 2015', '<p>Samostojeæa kuæa na izuzetoj lokaciji u 1.redu na ju¾noj strani otoka Èiova sa direktnim pristupom do mora i prirodno kamenite pla¾e. Zbog malog broja povoljnih nekretnina na prodaji u 1.redu na ju¾noj strani Èiova, ovo je izuzetna prilika za investiranje. Kuæa koja je inaèe izgraðena 1975.g, smje&scaron;tena je na zemlji&scaron;tu povr&scaron;ine 482 m2. Kuæa se sastoji od prizemlja i 1.kata. Ukupna netto stambena povr&scaron;ina iznosi 108 m2.</p>\r\n<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;">CIJENA SNI®ENA SA 450.000 EURO!</span></p>', '<p>We are offering this detached house on an exceptional location in the 1st row next to the sea, on the south side of the island of Ciovo. Due to the limited amount of real estate for sale on the shore, this is a great investment opportunity.&nbsp;The house consists of ground floor and 1st floor, with a total net living area is 108 m2.&nbsp;The dimensions of the property in relation to the plot would allow the possibility of building another floor.</p>\r\n<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;">PRICE REDUCED FROM 450.000 EURO!</span></p>', '', '<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;"><strong>CIJENA SNI®ENA SA 450.000 EURO!</strong></span></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Samostojeæa kuæa na izuzetoj lokaciji u 1.redu na ju¾noj strani otoka Èiova sa direktnim pristupom do mora i prirodno kamenite pla¾e.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Zbog malog broja povoljnih nekretnina na prodaji u 1.redu na ju¾noj strani Èiova, ovo je izuzetna prilika za investiranje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa koja je inaèe izgraðena 1975.g, smje&scaron;tena je na zemlji&scaron;tu povr&scaron;ine 482 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Dvori&scaron;te je dovoljno prostrano za izgradnju bazena i nekoliko parking mjesta. U dvori&scaron;tu se jo&scaron; nalaze dvi otorene prostorije koje mogu slu¾iti kao spremi&scaron;te ili ih jednostavno pretvoriti u vanjske kuhinje sa kaminom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa se sastoji od prizemlja i 1.kata. Obe eta¾e imaju odvojen ulaz, dok im je povr&scaron;ina (prizemlje 28 m2, 1.kat 80m2 + terasa 10 m2).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ukupna netto stambena povr&scaron;ina iznosi 108 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Postoji moguænost izgradnje jo&scaron; jedne eta¾e.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U prizemlju se nalazi manji 1-soban apartman, dok se na 1.katu nalazi pred ulaz, 2 spreme, dnevni boravak podijeljen iz dva dijela, terasa sa pogledom na more, hodnik, 2 spavaæe sobe i kuhinja iz koje se izlazi na sjevernu terasu u vrtu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Potrebno joj je renoviranje, ali ima izvrstan potencijal za preureðenje u pravu villu sa bazenom i svi ostalim sadr¾ajima potrebnim za u¾ivanje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Centar mjesta gdje se nalaze svi potrebni sadr¾aji je udaljen 5 min. vo¾nje, dok je meðunarodni aerodrom udaljen 20 min. vo¾nje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za sve dodatne informacije vam stojimo na raspolaganju.</p>', '<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;"><strong>PRICE REDUCED FROM 450.000 EURO!</strong></span></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>We are offering this detached house on an exceptional location in the 1st row next to the sea, on the south side of the island of Ciovo.<br /><br /><br />There is direct &nbsp;access to the clear sea and natural rocky beaches from the garden, and due to the limited amount of real estate for sale on the shore, this is a great investment opportunity.<br /><br /><br />The house was built 1975.g. and most new owners would agree it needs renovating.<br /><br /><br />The house consists of ground floor and 1st floor, with a total net living area is 108 m2. Both floors have a separate entrance, and the dimensions are:<br />- 28 m2 ground floor<br />- 1st floor 80m2 + terrace 10 m2<br /><br /><br />On the ground floor there is a small one-bedroom apartment, while on the 1st floor the living room is divided in two parts, including a terrace facing the open sea, hallway, two bedrooms and a kitchen with an exit to the north terrace in the garden.<br /><br /><br />The land area is 482 m2 and it is big enough to incorporate a patio area and swimming &nbsp;pool and several parking spaces.<br /><br /><br />In the courtyard are &nbsp;two open-air rooms that can be turned into an outdoor kitchen with bbq/ fireplace or used as a storage.<br /><br /><br />The dimensions of the property in relation to the plot would allow the possibility of building another floor.<br /><br /><br />It needs complete renovation but has great potential for conversion into a proper villa with swimming pool and all other amenities needed for full enjoyment.<br /><br /><br />The village centre where there are bars, cafes and coffee shops as well many other necessary facilities, is few minutes driving, or 15 minutes walk.<br /><br /><br />Split international airport is 20 minutes driving.<br /><br /><br />For question or viewing call our Split agents.</p>', '', '1025_House-Villa_0.JPG', '1025_House-Villa_1.JPG', '1025_House-Villa_2.JPG', '1025_House-Villa_3.JPG', '1025_House-Villa_4.JPG', '1025_House-Villa_5.JPG', '1025_House-Villa_6.JPG', '1025_House-Villa_7.JPG', '1025_House-Villa_8.JPG'),
(1026, 'Boris', 'Sinkoviæ', '', '', '', 'Hvar', 'Vrbanj', 'For sale', 'Old stone house', '3000', '0', '110', 1, '69000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 3, 1, 'January 28, 2015', '<p>Stara kamena kuæa u selu 3 km od mora, potrebno renoviranje. Kuæi je 2010. godine promjenjen krov i nalivene betonske ploèe iznad katova, te terasa u potkrovlju kuæe. Nalazi se u mirom dijelu sela ima zatvoreno dvoriste. Kuæa ima dva kata i podrum, te u potkrovlju jo&scaron; jedna terasa od 20 m2. Ukupna stambena povr&scaron;ina je 110 m2.</p>\r\n<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;">Cijena sni¾ena sa 79.000 euro!</span></p>', '<p>We are pleased to offer this fabulous restoration project. This traditional old stone property is in a small village 3 km from the sea, and in need of complete renovation. It is situated in a peaceful part of the village, with its own closed courtyard, and in addition to the buildings, some extra land is available to buy adjacent to the property, which would be an ideal garden or patio and swimming pool. This is 2k euro, and the land is 70 m2. Total living area is 110 m2.</p>\r\n<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;">Priced reduced from 79.000 euro to 69.000 euro!</span></p>', '', '<p><strong><span style="text-decoration: underline;">Cijena sni¾ena sa 79.000 euro na 69.000 euro!</span></strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Stara kamena kuæa u selu 3 km od mora, potrebno renoviranje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæi je 2010. godine promjenjen krov i nalivene betonske ploèe iznad katova, te terasa u potkrovlju kuæe.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nalazi se u mirom dijelu sela ima zatvoreno dvoriste.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa ima dva kata i podrum, te u potkrovlju jo&scaron; jedna terasa od 20 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Prvi kat ima balkon, a drugi izlaz na terasu.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Orijentacija jugo-istok.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Infrastruktura odmah do kuæe.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ukupna stambena povr&scaron;ina je 110 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Uz kuæu se nalazi zemlji&scaron;te od cca 70 m2 koje se mo¾e kupiti za 2.000 eura, a na istom bi se mogao napraviti bazen ili moze sluziti kao vrt.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za sva pitanja stojimo na usluzi.</p>', '<p><strong><span style="text-decoration: underline;">Price reduced from 79.000 euro to 69.000 euro!</span></strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>We are pleased to offer this fabulous restoration project.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>This traditional old stone property is in a small village 3 km from the sea, and in need of complete renovation.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is situated in a peaceful part of the village, with its own closed courtyard, and in addition to the buildings, some extra land is available to buy adjacent to the property, which would be an ideal garden or patio and swimming pool. This is 2k euro, and the land is 70 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>In 2010 the roof was repaired, and the floors strengthened with concrete, but almost all the original features and exterior stone work is still present, giving the property character and charm.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There is balcony on the 1st floor, and terrace on the 2nd floor.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>South-east oriented.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>All infrastructure present.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house has two floors and a basement, and there is an extra balcony attached to the attic, which is 20 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Total living area is 110 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For any questions we are at your service in our Croatia Property Sales office (Hvar office).</p>', '', '1026_Old-stone-house_0.jpg', '1026_Old-stone-house_1.jpg', '1026_Old-stone-house_2.jpg', '1026_Old-stone-house_3.jpg', '1026_Old-stone-house_4.jpg', '1026_Old-stone-house_5.jpg', '1026_Old-stone-house_6.jpg', '1026_Old-stone-house_7.jpg', '1026_Old-stone-house_8.jpg'),
(1027, 'Josip', 'Bogdaniæ', '', '', '', 'Hvar', 'Stari Grad', 'For sale', 'Old stone house', '50', '0', '105', 2, '110000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 'January 28, 2015', '<p>Kamena kuæa u centru mjesta na tri eta¾e, sjeverna strana otoka Hvara. U prizemlju je kuhinja i blagavaonica, a na katu su dvije sobe i dva kupatila. Ukupna stambena povr&scaron;ina je 105 m2. Kuæa je kompletno renovirana i namje&scaron;tena i uz samu kuæu se nalazi veliki vrt od ca.60 m2 koji se takoðer prodaje za dodatnih 40.000 eura. Od mora je udaljena 50 metara.</p>', '<p>We are pleased to offer this traditional stone house on three floors, in the centre of a village on the north side of Hvar island. On the ground floor is the kitchen and dining room, and upstairs are two bedrooms and two bathrooms. Total living area is 105 m2. The house has been completely renovated and furnished, and beside the house is a large garden of cca 60 m2, which is also for sale for an additional 40k euro. The sea is 50 meters.</p>', '', '<p>Kamena kuæa u centru mjesta na tri eta¾e, sjeverna strana otoka Hvara.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U prizemlju je kuhinja i blagavaonica, a na katu su dvije sobe i dva kupatila.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ukupna stambena povr&scaron;ina je 105 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je kompletno renovirana i namje&scaron;tena i uz samu kuæu se nalazi veliki vrt od ca.60 m2 koji se takoðer prodaje za dodatnih 40.000 eura.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Od mora je udaljena 50 metara.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ima pristup vozilom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za sve informacije i razgledavanje stojimo vam na usluzi u na&scaron;em uredu u gradu Hvaru.</p>', '<p>We are pleased to offer this traditional stone house on three floors, in the centre of a village on the north side of Hvar island.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the ground floor is the kitchen and dining room, and upstairs are two bedrooms and two bathrooms.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Total living area is 105 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house has been completely renovated and furnished, and beside the house is a large garden of cca 60 m2, which is also for sale for an additional 40k euro.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The sea is 50 meters.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The village has a busy harbour, and within walking distance from the property are many options of coffee bars, cafes and bars to enjoy the views, as well as various shops, art galleries and other facilities. What the village really needs is a lively piano bar.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>House has a vehicle access.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For more information and to arrange viewings of the property please contract the Croatia Property sales office on Hvar.</p>', '', '1027_Old-stone-house_0.jpg', '1027_Old-stone-house_1.jpg', '1027_Old-stone-house_2.jpg', '1027_Old-stone-house_3.jpg', '1027_Old-stone-house_4.jpg', '1027_Old-stone-house_5.jpg', '1027_Old-stone-house_6.jpg', '1027_Old-stone-house_7.jpg', ''),
(1028, 'Kászonyi', 'György', '', 'Aniko Pincolic 0982177979', 'kokoboth66@gmail.com', 'Trogir', 'Kneza Branimira 2a, Villa Bu¹inci, Z.U. 4488', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '450', '0', '44.29', 2, '73000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 1, 1, 1, 'January 29, 2015', '<p>Na 1.katu sa djelomiènim pogledom na more nalazi se apartman u mirnoj zgradi na ju¾noj strani otoka Èiova. Ukupna stambena povr&scaron;ina iznosi 44,29 m2 (33,54 m2 + loggia 10,75m2). Potpuno je namje&scaron;ten i spreman na useljenje. Sa ju¾ne strane se nalazi bazen i velika zajednièka terasa za sunèanje &scaron;to je jo&scaron; jedna prednost ovog apartmana. Popularni grad Trogir udaljen je 10 minuta, dok je meðunarodni aerodrom udaljen 15 minuta vo¾nje.</p>', '<p>We are offering this 1st floor apartment with a partial sea view located in a quiet building on the south side of Ciovo. It is situated 450 m or 10 minutes walk from the natural rocky beach with beautifully clear water. The total living area is 44.29 m2 (33.54 m2 + balcony 10,75m2). It is fully furnished and ready to move in, but it can also be used on purchase immediately for tourist rentals.</p>', '', '<p>Na 1.katu sa djelomiènim pogledom na more nalazi se apartman u mirnoj zgradi na ju¾noj strani otoka Èiova.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Prirodno kamenita pla¾a udaljena je cca. 450 m ili 10 minuta &scaron;etnje. Centar mjesta gdje se nalaze trgovine, restorani, ljekarna i ostali sadr¾aji udaljen je 3 min. vo¾nje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ukupna stambena povr&scaron;ina iznosi 44,29 m2 (33,54 m2 + loggia 10,75m2). Potpuno je namje&scaron;ten i spreman na useljenje, ali i turistièko iznajmljivanje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sastoji se od hodnika, dnevnog boravka+ kuhinje + blagovaonice, 1 spavaæe sobe, 1 kupaonice i loggie sa djelomiènim pogledom na more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sa ju¾ne strane se nalazi bazen i velika zajednièka terasa za sunèanje &scaron;to je jo&scaron; jedna prednost ovog apartmana.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U apartmanu se takoðer nalazi i klimatizacijski ureðaj.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na sjevernoj strani nalazi se nekoliko zajednièkih parkirnih mjesta koja su uglavnom slobodna jer veèina vlasnika u apartmanima boravi samo za vrijeme odmora.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Popularni grad Trogir udaljen je 10 minuta, dok je meðunarodni aerodrom udaljen 15 minuta vo¾nje.</p>', '<p>We are offering this 1st floor apartment with a partial sea view located in a quiet building on the south side of Ciovo.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is situated 450 m or 10 minutes walk from the natural rocky beach with beautifully clear water. It is also just 3 minutes driving from the nearest village centre where there are shops, restaurants, bars, pharmacy and other facilities.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The total living area is 44.29 m2 (33.54 m2 + balcony 10,75m2)</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is fully furnished and ready to move in, but it can also be used on purchase immediately for tourist rentals.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It consists of hallway, living room + kitchen + dining room, 1 bedroom, 1 bathroom and balcony with partial sea view.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the south side there is a swimming pool and a large terrace for sunbathing which is another attractive feature of this apartment.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The apartment also has an air-con.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the north side there are several private parking spaces.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The popular town of Trogir is 10 minutes, with many history and cultural attractions, and is a UNESCO heritage site, while the international airport is 15 minutes away.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please arrange to visit this property through our office in Split.</p>', '', '1028_Apartment_0.jpg', '1028_Apartment_1.jpg', '1028_Apartment_2.jpg', '1028_Apartment_3.jpg', '1028_Apartment_4.jpg', '1028_Apartment_5.jpg', '1028_Apartment_6.jpg', '1028_Apartment_7.jpg', '1028_Apartment_8.jpg'),
(1029, 'Colin', 'Baldwin', '', 'Anita Kekiæ 0989535158', '', 'Trogir', 'Planikovica, Z.U.4009  1562/61 kat./zemlj.', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '200', '0', '154.45', 2, '99000001', '', 2, 1, 2, 2, 1, 2, 3, 2, 'January 29, 2015', '<p>Prostrani apartman na zapadnom dijelu Èiova sjeverne orjentacije na mirnom mjestu bez puno buke i prometa. Iz apartmana se pru¾a pogled na more dok je more i prekrasna pje&scaron;èana i kamenita pla¾a udaljena 200 m &scaron;to je nekoliko minuta hodanja. Apartman se nalazi u prizemlju/visokom prizemlju ukupne brutto povrsine 154,45 m2. Apartman se prodaje potpuno namje&scaron;ten i opremljen stoga je moguæe odmah useliti i u¾ivati u ti&scaron;ini i prekrasnom pogledu.</p>', '<p>We are offering this modern and spacious apartment on the west side of Ciovo island.&nbsp;It is situated in a north/south orientation in a quiet place with little noise and traffic.&nbsp;The apartment has a view of the sea from the lounge and balcony, and the sea and beautiful pebble and rocky beach are a few minute&rsquo;s walk &ndash; about 200m.&nbsp;The apartment is located on the ground floor and it has a &nbsp;total living area of 154.45 m2.</p>', '', '<p>Prostrani apartman na zapadnom dijelu Èiova sjeverne orjentacije na mirnom mjestu bez puno buke i prometa.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Iz apartmana se pru¾a pogled na more dok je more i prekrasna pje&scaron;èana i kamenita pla¾a udaljena 200 m &scaron;to je nekoliko minuta hodanja.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartman se nalazi u prizemlju/visokom prizemlju ukupne brutto povrsine 154,45 m2 <strong>(105,56 m2 + 2 balkona 12 m2 + velika terasa 36,89 m2)</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sastoji se od dva hodnika, dnevnog boravka, kuhinje sa blagovaonicom, 2 kupaonice, 3 spavaæe sobe, 2 manja balkona i prostrane terase sa kaminom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartman se prodaje potpuno namje&scaron;ten i opremljen stoga je moguæe odmah useliti i u¾ivati u ti&scaron;ini i prekrasnom pogledu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U cijenu apartmana je ukljuèeno 1 parking mjesto ispred zgrade.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Centar mjesta gdje se nalaze svi sadr¾aji je udaljeno 3 minute vo¾nje, dok je meðunarodni aerodrom udaljen 15 minuta.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ukoliko ¾elite dodatne informacije stojimo vam na raspolaganju.</p>', '<p>We are offering this modern and spacious apartment on the west side of Ciovo island.<br /><br /><br />It is situated in a north/south orientation &nbsp;in a quiet place with little noise and traffic.<br /><br /><br />The apartment has a view of the sea from the lounge and balcony, and the sea and beautiful pebble and rocky beach are a few minute&rsquo;s walk &ndash; about 200m.<br /><br /><br />The apartment is located on the ground floor and it has a &nbsp;total living area of 154.45 m2 (105.56 m2 + 2 balconies 12 m2 + terrace 36.89 m2)<br /><br /><br />It consists of two halls, living room, kitchen, dining room, two bathrooms, three bedrooms, two small balconies and a spacious terrace with fireplace.<br /><br /><br />The apartment is sold fully furnished and equipped thus enabling the purchasers to move in immediately. It has been well maintained and does not need any redecorating etc.<br /><br /><br />The price includes one parking space in front of the building.<br /><br /><br />The centre with, shops, bars, cafes and other services &nbsp;is 3 minutes away, while the international airport is 15 minutes.<br /><br /><br />If you want more information and to arrange a viewing of this property, we are available.</p>', '', '1029_Apartment_0.jpg', '1029_Apartment_1.jpg', '1029_Apartment_2.jpg', '1029_Apartment_3.jpg', '1029_Apartment_4.jpg', '1029_Apartment_5.jpg', '1029_Apartment_6.jpg', '1029_Apartment_7.jpg', '1029_Apartment_8.jpg'),
(1030, '®ivka', 'Gnjeè', '', '099 490 9177', 'zivka.gnjec@gmail.com', 'Peljesac', ' Brijesta, opæina Ston, poluotok Pelje¹ac, 69/1', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '20', '480', '62', 1, '250000', '', 2, 2, 2, 1, 1, 2, 3, 2, 'January 29, 2015', '<p>Zapoèeta izgradnja na izuzetnoj lokaciji u 1.redu do mora, udaljeno prekrasne pla¾e svega 10 m. Kuæa je smje&scaron;tena u prekrasnom mjestu na poluotoku Pelje&scaron;cu udaljena pola sata vo¾nje do Stona i trajekta za otok Mljet, pola sata do Orebiæa i trajekta za Korèulu, 1 sat do Dubrovnika ili 2 sata do religijskog sveti&scaron;ta Meðugorja. Izgraðen je suteren koji je ureðen i u funkciji stanovanja, ali postoji moguænost izgradnje jos dva kata.</p>', '<p>We have this first line building project just 20m from the water&rsquo;s edge.&nbsp;The house is situated in a beautiful spot on the Peljesac peninsula located half an hour drive to Ston and the ferry to the island of Mljet, half an hour to Orebic and the ferry to Korcula, 1 hour to Dubrovnik, or 2 h to a religious shrine of Medjugorje.&nbsp;The basement has been built which is habitable, but there is the possibility of building two more floors on top.</p>', '', '<p>Zapoèeta izgradnja na izuzetnoj lokaciji u 1.redu do mora, udaljeno prekrasne pla¾e svega 10 m.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je smje&scaron;tena u prekrasnom mjestu na poluotoku Pelje&scaron;cu udaljena &nbsp;pola sata vo¾nje do Stona i trajekta za otok Mljet, pola sata do Orebiæa i trajekta za Korèulu, 1 sat do Dubrovnika ili 2 sata do religijskog sveti&scaron;ta Meðugorja.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Izgraðen je suteren koji je ureðen i u funkciji stanovanja, ali postoji moguænost izgradnje jos dva kata ili 4 apartmana na gotovoj terasi od 140 m2- za &scaron;to postoji izraðen idejni projekt.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Suteren ima ukupnu povr&scaron;inu 62 m2 u kojem se nalazi 3-sobni apartman.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Zemlji&scaron;te je ukupne povr&scaron;ine 480 m2, pravokutnog oblika 10 x 48m.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Okuænica je bogata zelenilom i aromatskim biljem, idealno za opu&scaron;tanje i odmor.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Pristupni put je odmah do kuæe dok se ispred nalazi veliki parking za ukupno 7 automobila.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U mjestu trenutno nema prikljuèenog vodovoda stoga je u dvorit&scaron;tu postaljen rezervar sa vodom, te sa slobodnim padom bez problema cijelu kuæu opskrbljuje vodom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ukoliko imate dodatnih pitanja molimo da nas kontaktirate.</p>', '<p>We have this first line building project just 20m from the water&rsquo;s edge.<br /><br /><br />It&rsquo;s not really for the faint hearted, as construction has started, and only the basement has been &lsquo;completed&rsquo;, but two more floors, (4 apartments) can be built on top of the existing structure.<br /><br /><br />The house is situated in a beautiful spot on the Peljesac peninsula located half an hour drive to Ston and the ferry to the island of Mljet, half an hour to Orebic and the ferry to Korcula, 1 hour to Dubrovnik, or 2 h to a religious shrine of Medjugorje.<br /><br /><br />The immediate area is natural woodland and vegetation, much of it aromatic herbs, protected, with low density housing along the coast, including several coffee bars and cafes in walking distance.<br /><br /><br />The basement has been built which is habitable, but there is the possibility of building two more floors (4 apartments) on top, for which there is a concept design. The basement has a total area of 62 m2 and it is designed as a 3-bedroom apartment.<br /><br /><br />The land has a total area of 480 m2, rectangular 10 x 48m.<br /><br /><br />There is an access road to the house and there is a large parking lot for seven cars.<br /><br /><br />The town currently has no water supply is therefore connected to the reservoir with water, and the pressure supplies the whole house with water.<br /><br /><br />If you have any questions please contact us, in our office in Split.</p>', '', '1030_House-Villa_0.jpg', '1030_House-Villa_1.jpg', '1030_House-Villa_2.jpg', '1030_House-Villa_3.jpg', '1030_House-Villa_4.jpg', '1030_House-Villa_5.jpg', '1030_House-Villa_6.jpg', '1030_House-Villa_7.jpg', '1030_House-Villa_8.jpg'),
(1031, 'Branko', 'Berlan', 'Mob: 095 8750188 - Ines Biuk', '+447825524519 - BRanko', 'berlan_branko@itf.org.uk', 'Split', 'Kralja Zvonimira 65 a, ', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '500', '0', '136', 1, '320000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 5, 2, 'January 30, 2015', '<p>Luksuzno namje&scaron;ten apartman u blizini centra grada Splita, smje&scaron;ten na 3. katu. Smje&scaron;ten je istoèno od prekrasne Rive i povijesne stare gradske jezgre. Orjentacija apartmana je sjever-jug. Udaljenost do najbli¾e popularne gradske pla¾e je 500 m, a centar grada udaljen je 10 min. hodanja. Ukupna stambena povr&scaron;ina sa svim galerijama iznosi 136 m2. Apartman 97 m2 + galerije 39 m2.</p>', '<p>We have this spacious and well presented apartment near the centre of Split, located on the 3rd (top) floor.&nbsp;It is situated east of Riva the beautiful promenade and Diocletian Palace in the old town, a short walk from the ferry terminal.&nbsp;The orientation of the apartment is north-south.&nbsp;Total living area with all the galleries is 136 m2 (apartment 97 m2 + 39 m2 gallery).&nbsp;The height of the rooms is upto 5.2 m.</p>', '', '<p>Luksuzno namje&scaron;ten apartman u blizini centra grada Splita, smje&scaron;ten na 3. katu (zadnjem).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Smje&scaron;ten je istoèno od prekrasne Rive i povijesne stare gradske jezgre.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Orjentacija apartmana je sjever-jug. Udaljenost do najbli¾e popularne gradske pla¾e je 500 m, a centar grada udaljen je 10 min. hodanja.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ukupna stambena povr&scaron;ina sa svim galerijama iznosi 136 m2. Apartman 97 m2 + galerije 39 m2,</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sastoji se od 4 sobe, 2 kupatila sa wc- om, dnevnog boravka, kuhinje, balkona i potkrovlja (galerija). Dvije sobe kao i dnevni boravak imaju dodatne radne prostore-galerije. Svaka soba je klimatizirana, a u cijelom stanu je provedeno eta¾no centralno grijanje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ukupna visina cijelog apartmana iznosi 5.2 m.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartman je renoviran 2007. god.(podovi afrièko drvo, ostalo mahagonij i drvo otporno na vlagu).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Prodaje se potpuno namje&scaron;ten, dok je takoðer moguæe pregovaranje oko namje&scaron;taja.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U blizini se nalaze mnogi sadr¾aji, dok je u blizini takoðer autobusni kolodvor i trajektna luka.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Do meðunarodnog aerodroma je potrebno 40 min. vo¾nje.</p>', '<p>We have this spacious and well presented &nbsp;apartment near the centre of Split, located on the 3rd (top) floor.<br /><br /><br />It is situated east of Riva the beautiful promenade and Diocletian Palace in the old town, a short walk from the ferry terminal. The distance to the nearest beach /sandy and pebble/ is 500 m, and the city centre with the historic and cultural attractions, as well as most of the best restaurants in the town are all within 10 minutes&rsquo; walk of the property.<br /><br /><br />The orientation of the apartment is north-south.<br /><br /><br />Total living area with all the galleries is 136 m2 (apartment 97 m2 + 39 m2 gallery).<br /><br /><br />The interior of the apartment consists of 4 bedrooms, 2 bathrooms and WC, living room, kitchen, balcony and attic (gallery). Two bedrooms and living room have additional workspace galleries. Each room is air-conditioned, and the entire apartment has central heating.<br /><br /><br />The height of the rooms is upto 5.2 m.<br /><br /><br />The apartment was renovated in 2007 and many features were incorporated, such as African wood floors - resistant to moisture.<br /><br /><br />The flat is presented fully furnished, and it is possible to agree the purchase of all the contents from the owners.<br /><br /><br />To the international airport it takes 30 min driving.<br /><br /><br />Please contact the office in Split to arrange to visit this property, or maybe similar ones as well.</p>', '', '1031_Apartment_0.jpg', '1031_Apartment_1.jpg', '1031_Apartment_2.jpg', '1031_Apartment_3.jpg', '1031_Apartment_4.jpg', '1031_Apartment_5.jpg', '1031_Apartment_6.jpg', '1031_Apartment_7.jpg', '1031_Apartment_8.jpg');
INSERT INTO `nekretnina` (`id`, `ime`, `prezime`, `telefon`, `mobitel`, `e_mail`, `lokacija_id`, `adresa`, `status_id`, `vrsta_id`, `udaljenost`, `povrsina`, `stambenapovrsina`, `display`, `cijena`, `cijenatocka`, `ponuda_tjedna`, `new_built`, `must_sell`, `prvi_red_do_mora`, `pogled_na_more`, `bazen`, `broj_soba`, `broj_kupatila`, `datum`, `title_hr`, `title_en`, `title_ge`, `opis_hr`, `opis_en`, `opis_ge`, `PropertyImageURL0`, `PropertyImageURL1`, `PropertyImageURL2`, `PropertyImageURL3`, `PropertyImageURL4`, `PropertyImageURL5`, `PropertyImageURL6`, `PropertyImageURL7`, `PropertyImageURL8`) VALUES
(1032, 'Olga', 'Sinèiæ', '098 932 7178 / 021 488 517', '001 816 832 7564 (do 24.2.2014.)', 'sincic.olga@gmail.com', 'Brac', 'Supetar, Put Pasika 3, C. zem. 62/2', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '300', '1089', '76', 1, '335000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 3, 2, 'January 30, 2015', '<p>Trosobna samostojeæa kuæa smje&scaron;tena u mirnom dijelu turistièkog mjesta na sjevernom dijelu Braèa. Unutra&scaron;njost kuæe je vrlo uredna i odr¾avana, s parketom u spavaæim sobama i kamenim podom u ostalim prostorijama i PVC zatvorima novijeg datuma. Ukupna povr&scaron;ina zemlji&scaron;ta iznosi 1089 m2, dok je kuæa povr&scaron;ine 76 m2. Trenutno se sastoji samo od prizemlja u kojem se nalazi dnevni boravak, kuhinja, blagovaonica, 3 spavaæe sobe, wc i kupaonica.</p>', '<p>We are offering this lovely three bedroom detached house situated in a quiet area of a small town on the northern part of the island of Brac.&nbsp;It is 3 minutes walk to the nearest beach, and less than 5 min walk to the town centre.&nbsp;The total land area is unusually large for this location, of 1089 m2 size, while the living surface of the house is quite small 76 m2.&nbsp;The interior of the house is well presented and well maintained, with parquet flooring in the bedrooms and stone flooring in the other rooms.</p>', '', '<p>Trosobna samostojeæa kuæa smje&scaron;tena u mirnom dijelu lijepog mjesta na sjevernom dijelu otoka Braèa.<br /><br /><br />Ima 3 min &scaron;etnje do najbli¾e pla¾e ("Vlacica"), i manje od 5 min hoda do centra mjesta.<br /><br /><br />Unutra&scaron;njost kuæe je vrlo uredna i odr¾avana, s parketom u spavaæim sobama i kamenim podom u ostalim prostorijama, te PVC zatvorima novijeg datuma.<br /><br /><br />Sve instalacije su uredne, mijenjane 2000.-te i 2004.-te u stambenom dijelu objekta, stoga nije potrebno dodatno ulaganje.<br /><br /><br />Terasa je povr&scaron;ine 15m2. U vrtu koji je ureðen ima 20 stabala maslina, te jo&scaron; jedna terasa sa starim kamenim stolom.<br /><br /><br />Za potencijalne kupce, objekt moze biti zanimljiv u postojeæem stanju, ali ga je naravno moguæe preurediti i nadograditi, dodati bazen..itd.<br /><br /><br />Ukupna povr&scaron;ina zemlji&scaron;ta je neuobièajeno velika za mjesto i iznosi 1089 m2, dok je stambna povr&scaron;ine kuæe 76 m2.<br /><br /><br />Trenutno se sastoji samo od prizemlja: dnevni boravak, kuhinja, blagovaonica, 3 spavaæe sobe, wc i kupaonica.<br /><br /><br />Vani se takoðer nalazi i tu&scaron;.<br /><br /><br />Ima pristup vozilom i parking za 2 vozila u okviru parcele.<br />Sva infrastruktura postoji.<br /><br /><br />Moguæa je izgradnja veæeg, sasvim novog objekta (npr. apartmanska zgrada); prema postojeæim urbanistièkim uvjetima minimalno 12 apartmana.<br /><br /><br />U centru mjesta je gtrajektna luka, trgovine, restorani, kafiæi i ostali sadr¾aji.<br /><br /><br />Kontaktirajte nam za sve ostale informacije.</p>', '<p>We are offering this lovely three bedroom detached house situated in a quiet area of a small town on the northern part of the island of Brac.<br /><br /><br />It is 3 minutes walk to the nearest beach, and less than 5 min walk to the town centre.<br /><br /><br />The total land area is unusually large for this location, of 1089 m2 size, while the living surface of the house is quite small 76 m2.The layout inside has 3 bedrooms, lounge, kitchen and dining room, toilet and bathroom. There is access from the lounge onto a large terrace of 15m sq.<br /><br /><br />The interior of the house is well presented and well maintained, with parquet flooring in the bedrooms and stone flooring in the other rooms.<br /><br /><br />The inside of the property has been largely upgraded with new PVC windows etc, new fittings throughout, and frankly, no new investment is required.<br /><br /><br />The gardens have been landscaped and 20 olive trees give a useful area of shade in high summer, and an outside shower is great after returning from a swim in the sea.<br /><br /><br />The gardens could at some time in the future be redesigned and could include a swimming pool, patio and other features using the large space.<br /><br /><br />It has car access and parking for 2 vehicles on the site.<br /><br /><br />All the infrastructure there.<br /><br /><br />It would also be possible to build a larger building on the site (eg. Residential development); under the existing zoning conditions with 12 apartments.<br /><br /><br />In the centre, which is close enough to walk to, &nbsp;there are shops, restaurants, cafes and other facilities.<br /><br /><br />Ferry port is walking distance.<br /><br /><br />Contact us for any further information and to arrange to visit this property.</p>', '', '1032_House-Villa_0.jpg', '1032_House-Villa_1.jpg', '1032_House-Villa_2.jpg', '1032_House-Villa_3.jpg', '1032_House-Villa_4.jpg', '1032_House-Villa_5.jpg', '1032_House-Villa_6.jpg', '1032_House-Villa_7.jpg', '1032_House-Villa_8.jpg'),
(1033, 'Pavica', 'Staniæ', '', 'Boris', '', 'Brac', '808/32 ko Supetar', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '400', '250', '90', 2, '178000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 2, 2, 'January 30, 2015', '<p>&Scaron;armantna dvojna kuæa na dvije eta¾e smje&scaron;tena na sjevenoj strani otoka Braèa u lijepom turistièkom mjestu koje je svakodnevnim trajektnim linijama povezano sa Splitom i ostalim dalmatinskim otocima. Od mora je udeljana &scaron;etnjom 400 metara.&nbsp;Povr&scaron;ina parcele je 250 m2, dok je ukupna stambena povr&scaron;ina kuæe 90 m2.&nbsp;Cijela kuæa je kompletno solidno namje&scaron;tena.&nbsp;Okuænicu èini prostrano prednje donje dvori&scaron;te u svojstvu parkinga, te stra¾nje sjenovito zatvoreno dvori&scaron;te s kaminom.</p>', '<p>We have this semi-detached house on two floors located on the north coast of the island of Brac.&nbsp;It is located in an attractive Dalmatian port, in a quiet street, with regular ferry connections to the mainland. It is 400m from the pebble beach.&nbsp;The plot area is 250 m2, while the total living area is 90 m2. The house is designed inside as two apartments.&nbsp;The whole house is sold fully furnished.</p>', '', '<p>&Scaron;armantna dvojna kuæa na dvije eta¾e smje&scaron;tena na sjevenoj strani otoka Braèa u lijepom turistièkom mjestu koje je svakodnevnim trajektnim linijama povezano sa Splitom i ostalim dalmatinskim otocima. Od mora je udeljana &scaron;etnjom 400 metara.<br /><br /><br />Povr&scaron;ina parcele je 250 m2, dok je ukupna stambena povr&scaron;ina kuæe 90 m2.<br /><br /><br />Prizemlje: garsonjera od cca 45 m2.<br /><br /><br />1 kat: garsonjera od cca 45 m2.<br /><br /><br />Kuæa je graðena 1985.g. ali je kompletno renovirana 2010.g. Tada su postavljene nove ploèice i parketi, preureðena je kupaonica, &nbsp;postavljena su nova vrata i prozori s ugraðenim mre¾ama protiv komaraca).<br /><br /><br />Cijela kuæa je kompletno solidno namje&scaron;tena.<br /><br /><br />U kuæi je smje&scaron;ten unutarnji i vanjski kamin.<br /><br /><br />Gornja eta¾a je klimatizirana, dok je donja ukopana s ju¾ne strane stoga je tijekom ljeta ugodno i hladno.<br /><br /><br />Okuænicu èini prostrano prednje donje dvori&scaron;te u svojstvu parkinga, te stra¾nje sjenovito zatvoreno dvori&scaron;te s kaminom.<br /><br /><br />U vrtu se nalazi palma, agrumi i ostalo nezahtjevno mediteransko raslinje.<br /><br /><br />Smje&scaron;tena je u mirnom dijelu mjesta bez puno buke i prometa.<br /><br /><br />Sva infrastrktura prisutna. Dokumentacija uredna.<br /><br /><br />Za sva dodatna pitanja vam stojimo na raspolaganju.</p>', '<p>We have this semi-detached house on two floors located on the north coast of the island of Brac.<br /><br /><br />It is located in an attractive Dalmatian port, in a quiet street, with regular ferry connections to the mainland. It is 400m from the pebble beach, and also, only a short walk to many bars, caf&eacute;s, coffee shops and other services and facilities useful for tourists and the local population on the island.<br /><br /><br />The plot area is 250 m2, while the total living area is 90 m2. The house is designed inside as two apartments.<br /><br /><br />Ground floor: apartment of 45 m2.<br /><br /><br />1st floor: apartment of 45 m2.<br /><br /><br />The house was built in 1985 but was completely renovated in 2010 when new tile and parquet floors, new bathroom fittings, new doors and windows were installed.<br /><br /><br />The whole house is sold fully furnished.<br /><br /><br />The house has indoor fireplaces, and an outdoor fireplace/BBQ.<br /><br /><br />The upper floor is air conditioned, while the lower floor is cooler since it has less sun and is protected by being partially dug into the sloping earth.<br /><br /><br />There is parking in front of the property, and the garden has a palm, citrus fruits and other Mediterranean vegetation, requiring little maintenance.<br /><br /><br />Please contact our office for further information and to arrange to visit this property.</p>', '', '1033_House-Villa_0.jpg', '1033_House-Villa_1.jpg', '1033_House-Villa_2.jpg', '1033_House-Villa_3.jpg', '1033_House-Villa_4.jpg', '1033_House-Villa_5.jpg', '1033_House-Villa_6.jpg', '1033_House-Villa_7.jpg', '1033_House-Villa_8.jpg'),
(1034, 'Marx', 'Rudiger', 'Ivana Brcic 091 45 999 01', '', 'i.brcic@latium-croatia.com ', 'Omis', 'Dugi Rat, 2500/1 i 2500/2 ko Duce', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '100', '0', '85', 1, '192896', '', 2, 1, 2, 2, 1, 2, 2, 2, 'January 31, 2015', '<p>Ovaj jedinstven i vrlo uspje&scaron;an projekt u izgradnji je jedan od rijetkih takvih na tr¾i&scaron;tu u ovome trenutku.&nbsp;Ova zgrada sa apartmanima &nbsp;radi se na otprilike 1.000 m2 zemlji&scaron;ta i sastoji se od èetiri kata plus penthouse-a i privatne podzemne gara¾e. Na prve tri eta¾e nalaze se po tri stana velièina od 85 do 105 m2 dok se na èetvrtoj eta¾i nalaze dva stana - jedan od 85 m2 i drugi od 200 m2.</p>\r\n<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;">Cijene stanova su od 192.896 do 496.670 &euro;.</span></p>', '<p>This architecturally very successful off plan project is one of its kind in Dalmatia, one of a rare projects that has been offered in the real estate market at the moment. This apartment building will be constructed on an approx. 1.000 m building plot. It will be a four story object, with a penthouse and private parking garage in the basement. First three floors will have three apartments ranging from 85 m to 105 sqm and the fourth floor will have two apartments - one of 85 sqm and the second one of 200 m2.</p>\r\n<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;">The prices range from 192.896 to 496.670 &euro;.</span></p>', '', '<p>Ovaj jedinstven i vrlo uspje&scaron;an projekt u izgradnji je jedan od rijetkih takvih na tr¾i&scaron;tu u ovome trenutku.<br /><br /><br />Dizajn su osmislili njemaèki arhitekti u suradnji sa lokalnim arhitektima kako bi se projekt uklopio u hrvatsku arhitekturu &nbsp;i tradicionalno okru¾enje.</p>\r\n<p><br /><span>Ova zgrada sa apartmanima gradi se na otprilike 1.000 m2 zemlji&scaron;ta i sastojat æe se od èetiri kata plus penthouse-a i private podzemne gara¾e.&nbsp;Na prve tri eta¾e nalaze se po tri stana velièina od 85 do 105 m2 dok se na èetvrtoj eta¾i nalaze dva stana - jedan od 85 m2 i drugi od 200 m2.</span><br /><br /><br /><span style="text-decoration: underline;"><strong>Cijene stanova su od 192.896 to 496.670 &euro;.</strong></span></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartmani u prizemlju imat æe i vlastiti vrt dok æe apartmani na katovima imati loðe. Za svaki stan osigurano je pripadajuæe parkirno mjesto u gara¾i.</p>\r\n<p><br /><br />Svi stanovi imaju optimalan raspored koji pretpostavlja udobnost njihovim buduæim vlasnicima.<br /><br /><br />Zgrada ima lift te su svi stanovi prilagoðeni osobama sa specijalnim potrebama.<br /><br /><br />Okoli&scaron; zgrade bit æe ureðen u mediteranskome stilu.<br /><br /><br />Radovi su zapoèeli u sijeènju 2015 i investiror æe dovr&scaron;iti zgradu do kraja 2016. godine,<br /><br /><br />U sluèaju rane kupnje investitor je spreman razgovarati o eventualnim (razumnim) promjenama u stanu te razgovarati o materijalima kojima æe se stan dovr&scaron;avati.<br /><br /><br />Najbli¾a pla¾a je udaljena 100 m dok je najljep&scaron;a pla¾a u regiji na kojoj se nalazi vrlo poznati restoran udaljena 500 m.<br /><br /><br />Mjesto Dugi Rat smje&scaron;teno je na &scaron;irem podruèju grada Omi&scaron;a u prekrasnom mirnom okru¾enju koje omoguæuje zaboraviti da je grad Split I njegova vreva na dohvat ruke. To prirodno okru¾enje jednostavno zove na odlazak na predivne pla¾e i kupanje u kristalno èistom moru.<br /><br /><br />U Dugome Ratu planiran je projekt hotelskog kompleksa sa 5 zvjezdica sa marinom &scaron;to æe svakako pridonjeti na vrijednosti nekretnina u regiji.</p>', '<p>This architecturally very successful off plan project is one of its kind in Dalmatia, one of a rare projects that has been offered in the real estate market at the moment.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The design is done by German architects who are cooperating with local architects to meet Croatian architecture and traditional landscaping.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>This apartment building will be constructed on an approx. 1.000 m building plot. It will be a four story object, with a penthouse and private parking garage in the basement.&nbsp;First three floors will have three apartments ranging from 85 m to 105 sqm and the fourth floor will have two apartments - one of 85 sqm and the second one of 200 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong><span style="text-decoration: underline;">The prices range from 192.896 to 496.670 &euro;.</span></strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The apartments on the ground floor will have private gardens, while the apartments in the upper floors will have loggias. Each apartment will have an own parking space in the garage.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>All of the apartments have optimum layouts, tailored to the needs of the users and tenants.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The object has an own elevator. The elevator and all apartments will be adjusted to persons with disabilities.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The outdoor area and the garden will be landscaped in Mediterranean style.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The building works started in January 2015 and the investor will complete the object by the end of 2016.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>In case you decide to buy an apartment in the early phase, there are still options of making reasonable changes and to choose finishing materials.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The nearest beach is just 100 m away Some 500 meters distant from our object is one of the nicest beaches of the region, with a very trendy restaurant.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The place Dugi Rat is placed near the town of Omis, in the lovely natural surroundings, making us forget that the bustling, modern city of Split is only a stone throw away. Pine forests grow well in the warm sun rays, shingle beaches call for fun and bathing in the crystal clear sea waters.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>At the main coastal road a 5* hotel resort will be built with a luxurious Marina, which will contribute to the real estate value here.</p>', '', '1034_Apartment_0.jpg', '1034_Apartment_1.jpg', '1034_Apartment_2.jpg', '1034_Apartment_3.jpg', '1034_Apartment_4.jpg', '1034_Apartment_5.jpg', '1034_Apartment_6.JPG', '', ''),
(1035, '', 'Domanèiæ', '', 'Boris Tomic', '', 'Brac', 'Supetar, 217/7', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '500', '380', '176', 1, '285000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 3, 3, 'January 31, 2015', '<p>Samostojeæa kuæa iznad samog centra prekrasnog mjesta smje&scaron;tenom na sjevernom dijelu otoka Braèa. Udaljenost od mora je 500 m isto kao i od centra gdje su smje&scaron;teni svi potrebni sadr¾aji. Kuæa im oblik slova L i u osnovi se sastoji od 2 meðusobno povezane cjeline. Ukupno zemlji&scaron;te je 380 m2, dok je stambena povr&scaron;ina 176 m2. Sve je namje&scaron;teno i u funkciji stalnog stanovanja.</p>', '<p>We have this modern detached house above the town centre, on the north side of the island of Brac. It is situated 500 m from the sea shore, but a few minutes walk from the centre of this attractive Dalmatian town, where there are many options for restaurants, caf&eacute;s, coffee shops and bars. The total land area is 380 m2, while the living area is 176 m2. Everything is fully furnished and currently inhabited as a permanent residence.</p>', '', '<p>Samostojeæa kuæa iznad samog centra prekrasnog mjesta smje&scaron;tenom na sjevernom dijelu otoka Braèa.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ima dobar prilaz automobilom iz centra i sa obilaznice.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Udaljenost od mora je 500 m isto kao i od centra gdje su smje&scaron;teni svi potrebni sadr¾aji. U centru se takoðer nalazi trajektno pristani&scaron;te.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa im oblik slova L i u osnovi se sastoji od 2 meðusobno povezane cjeline.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ukupno zemlji&scaron;te je 380 m2, dok je stambena povr&scaron;ina 176 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Zapadnu stranu èini konoba 48 m2 u prizemlju, a na &nbsp;katu 64 m2 se nalazi: kuhinja s blagovaonicom &nbsp;dnevnim boravkom s izlazom na veliku terasu sa otvorenim pogledom na more i kupaonica.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Istoènu stranu na katu èini kupatilo i 2 spavaæe sobe&nbsp; ukupne povr&scaron;ine 34 m2 (povezano polustepeni&scaron;tem sa dnevnim boravkom zapadne strane.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U prizemlju se nalazi jednosobni apartman 32 m2 sa posebnim ulazom i dijelom dvori&scaron;ta kao izdvojenom cjelinom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sve je namje&scaron;teno i u funkciji stalnog stanovanja.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ispred kuæe se nalazi parking za 3 automobila.</p>', '<p>We have this modern detached house above the town centre, on the north side of the island of Brac.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is situated 500 m from the sea shore, but a few minutes walk from the centre of this attractive Dalmatian town, where there are many options for restaurants, caf&eacute;s, coffee shops and bars.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The total land area is 380 m2, while the living area is 176 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house was built in 2000, ''L-shaped'' and basically it consists of two interconnecting units, west and east.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;">The west side of the house:</span></p>\r\n<p>- ground floor is a room of 48 m2</p>\r\n<p>- first floor is an apartment of 64 m2: kitchen with dining room, bedroom, living room with large terrace with sea view and bathroom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;">The east side of the house:</span></p>\r\n<p>- ground floor is one bedroom apartment of 32 m2 size with separate entrance and part of the private yard</p>\r\n<p>- first floor with two bedrooms with shared bathroom with total area of 34 m2 / connected by a few steps to the lounge area on the west side</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Everything is fully furnished and currently inhabited as a permanent residence.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It has good car access, with parking for 3 cars.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ferry port is walking distance.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact the office in Split to arrange to visit this property.</p>', '', '1035_House-Villa_0.jpg', '1035_House-Villa_1.jpg', '1035_House-Villa_2.jpg', '1035_House-Villa_3.jpg', '1035_House-Villa_4.jpg', '1035_House-Villa_5.jpg', '1035_House-Villa_6.jpg', '1035_House-Villa_7.jpg', ''),
(1036, '', '©alindrija', 'Boris Tomiæ', '', '', 'Brac', 'Sutivan, 557 zgr', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '70', '600', '150', 1, '310000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 4, 2, 'January 31, 2015', '<p>Lijepa samostojeæa kuæa smje&scaron;tena u prekrasnom mjestu na otoku Braèu. Sastoji se od dvije eta¾e + podrum, sveukupno cca 150 m2. Cijelo zemlji&scaron;te ima povr&scaron;inu 600 m2. Nalazi se u 3 redu od mora, udaljena 70 m od pje&scaron;èane pla¾e. U dobrom je stanju, namje&scaron;tena i kompletno u funkciji. Sve prostorije su svijetle i prostrane i sve ostavlja dojam solidne gradnje.</p>', '<p>We have this detached house situated in a lovely village set in beautiful natural woodland on the island of Brac. It is located in the 3rd from the sea, 70 meters away from the sandy beach, but due to the sloping nature of the landscape, there are great views. The whole plot has an area of 600 m2. The house consists of the basement and two floors, with total living area of approximately 150 m2. The house is in good condition, is well presented and furnished. Ready to move in immediately.</p>', '', '<p>Lijepa samostojeæa kuæa smje&scaron;tena u prekrasnom mjestu na otoku Braèu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sastoji se od dvije eta¾e + podrum, sveukupno cca 150 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Cijelo zemlji&scaron;te ima povr&scaron;inu 600 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nalazi se u 3 redu od mora, udaljena 70 m od pje&scaron;èane pla¾e.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U dobrom je stanju, namje&scaron;tena i kompletno u funkciji.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U prizemlju je dnevni boravak koji izlazi na veliku terasu, s blagoaonica, kuhinja i kupaonica &nbsp;kao jedna cjelina, te soba s kuhinjom i blagovaonicom koja izlazi dvori&scaron;te s nasadom mandarina.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Unutra&scaron;njim stepeniniama se izlazi na kat gdje su 3 spavaæe sobe, svaka s jednom kupaonicom i izlazo m na balkon s krasnim pogledom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Iako neuobièajen raspored izgleda funkcionalno i simpatièno.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Parket je u sobama, dok su ploèice u ostalim djelovima. Stolarija je drvo, a dvije fasade su u braèkom kamenu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sve prostorije su svijetle i prostrane i sve ostavlja dojam solidne gradnje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Podrum je u suterenu cca 20 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Otok Braè povezn je svakodnevnom trajektnom linijom sa gradom Splitom, dok je meðunarodni aerodrom udaljen 40 min. vo¾nje od grada.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za sva dodatna pitanja nas slobodno kontaktirajte.</p>', '<p>We have this detached house situated in a lovely village set in beautiful natural woodland on the island of Brac.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is located in the 3rd from the sea, 70 meters away from the sandy beach, but due to the sloping nature of the landscape, there are great views.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The whole plot has an area of 600 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house consists of the basement and two floors, with total living area of approximately 150 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house is in good condition, is well presented and furnished. Ready to move in immediately.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the ground floor there is a living room that opens onto a terrace, dining room, kitchen and bathroom plus one room with kitchen and dining room.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Outside there is a yard with tangerine orchards, and a BBQ fireplace.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>An internal staircase leads to the first floor with three bedrooms, each with a bathroom and doors to the balcony which has beautiful views.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Though unusual, the layout looks functional and cute.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There is parquet flooring in the bedrooms, with tiles in other parts of the house. There are wooden internal doors, and two sides of the exterior facade are covered in Brac stone.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>All the rooms are bright and spacious and everything looks and feels well built.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The cellar in the basement is 20 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Island of Brac is linked to every day by ferry to Split, while the international airport is 30 min drive from Split ferry port.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For any additional questions please contact us, and we can arrange for you to visit the property.</p>', '', '1036_House-Villa_0.jpg', '1036_House-Villa_1.jpg', '1036_House-Villa_2.jpg', '1036_House-Villa_3.jpg', '1036_House-Villa_4.jpg', '1036_House-Villa_5.jpg', '1036_House-Villa_6.jpg', '1036_House-Villa_7.jpg', ''),
(1037, 'Ranko', 'Bogdaniæ', '', '098 952 1678 ', '', 'Split', 'Osjeèka 44, 6121/ 1  6121/2   Z.U. 4955', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '880', '575', '135', 1, '600000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 4, 1, 'January 31, 2015', '<p>Izuzetna prilika za kupnju samostojeæe kuæe u Splitu u jednom od popularnih kvartova, koji je udaljen svega par minuta vo¾nje od Rive i centra grada. Nalazi se u kvartu Gripe u blizini svi potrebnih sadr¾aja. Ukupna povr&scaron;ina zemlji&scaron;ta iznosi 575 m2, dok je stambena povr&scaron;ina kuæe 135 m2. Kuæa se trenutno sastoji samo od prizemlja dok postoji moguænost pro&scaron;irenja i nadogradnje jo&scaron; 2 eta¾e. Pristup automobilom je direktan, dok se u dvori&scaron;tu nalazi 1 natkriveno parking mjesto.</p>', '<p>We are offering this rare opportunity to buy a detached house in an attractive area of Split, only 10 minutes walk to the promenade and town old centre. The house was built in 1926, on a plot of 575 m2, and with a living area of 135 m2. The house is currently consists only of a ground floor but there is a potential to expand and upgrade the property with the addition of 2 more floors. The layout of the property has 4 bedrooms, kitchen, living room, bathroom, hall.</p>', '', '<p>Izuzetna prilika za kupnju samostojeæe kuæe u Splitu u jednom od popularnih kvartova, koji je udaljen svega par minuta vo¾nje od Rive i centra grada.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nalazi se u kvartu Gripe u blizini svi potrebnih sadr¾aja.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ukupna povr&scaron;ina zemlji&scaron;ta iznosi 575 m2, dok je stambena povr&scaron;ina kuæe 135 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa se trenutno sastoji samo od prizemlja dok postoji moguænost pro&scaron;irenja i nadogradnje jo&scaron; 2 eta¾e.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Pristup automobilom je direktan, dok se u dvori&scaron;tu nalazi 1 natkriveno parking mjesto.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Zbog velièine okuænice moguæe je izgraditi prostrani bazen &scaron;to je prava rijetkost u centru grada.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Prizemlje se trenutno sastoji od predsoblja, hodnika, kuhinje, dnevnog boravka i 4 sobe.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Najbli¾a pla¾a na Baèvicama je udaljena cca. 1 km.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Do meðunarodnog aerodroma ima 40 min. vo¾nje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za sve dodatna informacije i slike vam stojimo na raspolaganju.</p>', '<p>We are offering this rare opportunity to buy a detached house in an attractive area of Split, only 10 minutes walk to the promenade and town old centre.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house was built in 1926, on a plot of 575 m2, and with a living area of 135 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house is currently consists only of a ground floor but there is a potential to expand and upgrade the property with the addition of 2 more floors.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The layout of the property has 4 bedrooms, kitchen, living room, bathroom, hall.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house has a covered parking space, and plenty of additional space in the garden, currently a grass lawn.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The centre of the old town and Roman Palace with so many famous historic attractions, are 10 minutes walk away, and the nearest beach is situated approx 1 km.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The international airport is 30 minutes drive.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For all additional information and images, and to arrange to visit this property, please call our office in Split.</p>', '', '1037_House-Villa_0.jpg', '1037_House-Villa_1.jpg', '1037_House-Villa_2.jpg', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(1038, 'Helena', 'Varendorff', '', '', 'helena.varendorff@chello.at', 'Hvar', 'Sveta Nedelja - Hvar, 1267/5', 'For sale', 'Land plot', '30', '750', '0', 1, '230000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 0, 0, 'January 31, 2015', '<p>PROJEKT &ndash; graðevinsko zemlji&scaron;te povr&scaron;ine 750 m2, na ju¾noj strani otoka Hvara sa svom potrebnom dokumentacijom - za gradnju vile s bazenom. Gradnja moze zapoèeti odmah! Zemlji&scaron;te se nalazi na litici i ima otvoreni pogled na more, orjentirano jug-jugozapad. Zalazak sunca u more iz svih djelova kuæe i bazena. Jedinstvena prilika! Jedna od najljep&scaron;ih lokacija na otoku Hvaru.</p>', '<p>This really is a unique opportunity! We are pleased to offer this exciting land plot on a cliff top with open sea views all round. The building land plot is 750 m2, with planning permission, on the south side of the island with all necessary documents - for building a villa with swimming pool. The construction can start immediately! The land is located on a cliff, with paths down to the clear sea, oriented south-southwest, and with no immediate neighbours. This is clearly one of the most beautiful locations on the island.</p>', '', '<p>PROJEKT &ndash; graðevinsko zemlji&scaron;te povr&scaron;ine 750 m2, na ju¾noj strani otoka Hvara sa svom potrebnom dokumentacijom - za gradnju vile s bazenom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Gradnja moze zapoèeti odmah!</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Zemlji&scaron;te se nalazi na litici i ima otvoreni pogled na more, orjentirano jug-jugozapad.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Zalazak sunca u more iz svih djelova kuæe i bazena.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Jedinstvena prilika!</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Jedna od najljep&scaron;ih lokacija na otoku Hvaru.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za kompletnu prezenatciju projektne dokumentacije, kao i za razgledavanje terena stojimo na usluzi u CPS-Hvar uredu!</p>', '<p>This really is a unique opportunity!</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>We are pleased to offer this exciting land plot on a cliff top with open sea views all round.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The building land plot is 750 m2, with planning permission, on the south side of the island with all necessary documents - for building a villa with swimming pool.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The construction can start immediately!</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The land is located on a cliff, with paths down to the clear sea, oriented south-southwest, and with no immediate neighbours.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>This is clearly one of the most beautiful locations on the island.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For a complete slide show, project documentation, and visiting the location, please contact our office in Hvar!</p>', '', '1038_Land-plot_0.jpg', '1038_Land-plot_1.jpg', '1038_Land-plot_2.jpg', '1038_Land-plot_3.jpg', '1038_Land-plot_4.jpg', '1038_Land-plot_5.jpg', '1038_Land-plot_6.jpg', '', ''),
(1039, 'Hanefija', 'Zorniæ', '', '', '', 'Hvar', 'Dol', 'For sale', 'Land plot', '3000', '1600', '0', 1, '115000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 0, 0, 'January 31, 2015', '<p>Lijepo graðevinsko zemlji&scaron;te koje se sastoji od dvije meðusobno povezane parcele, svaka povr&scaron;ine 800 m2. Svaka parcela ima pristup putu i svu infrastrukturu tako da je moguæe sagraditi ili dva zasebna objekta, dvojna objekta ili jednu lijepu vilu sa bazenom koja bi imala veliku okuænicu i privatnost. Moguæa gradnja odmah. Udaljenost od mora je 3 km.</p>', '<p>We have this building plot in a great location which actually consists of two interconnected plots, each of 800 m2. Each plot has its own access road and all the infrastructure so that it is possible to build either a large separate building or two, semi detached. Any property would have a large garden and privacy, and there is plenty of options to enjoy a patio and swimming pool. Distance from the sea is 3 km.</p>', '', '<p>Lijepo graðevinsko zemlji&scaron;te koje se sastoji od dvije meðusobno povezane parcele, svaka povr&scaron;ine 800 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Svaka parcela ima pristup putu i svu infrastrukturu tako da je moguæe sagraditi ili dva zasebna objekta, dvojna objekta ili jednu lijepu vilu sa bazenom koja bi imala veliku okuænicu i privatnost.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Moguæa gradnja odmah.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na parceli se nalazi mali objekt koi je u fazi legalizacije i ogromna palma stara ca.40 godina.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Udaljenost od mora je 3 km.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za detaljnije informacije stojimo vam na usluzi.</p>', '<p>We have this building plot in a great location which actually consists of two interconnected plots, each of 800 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Each plot has its own access road and all the infrastructure so that it is possible to build either a large separate building or two, semi detached. Any property would have a large garden and privacy, and there is plenty of options to enjoy a patio and swimming pool.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>All the permits are almost ready so that it would be possible for construction to commence immediately.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Distance from the sea is 3 km.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For further information we are at your service. Please contact the Hvar office of Croatia Property Sales.</p>', '', '1039_Land-plot_0.jpg', '1039_Land-plot_1.jpg', '1039_Land-plot_2.jpg', '1039_Land-plot_3.jpg', '1039_Land-plot_4.jpg', '1039_Land-plot_5.jpg', '', '', ''),
(1040, 'Anka', 'Mustapiæ', '', '091 111 0039 - Boris', '', 'Split', 'Palmina 1, Zgr 631', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '260', '0', '27', 1, '70000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 'January 31, 2015', '<p>Apartman u staroj kamenoj kuæi u samom centru povijesnog grada Splita, udaljeni par minuta hodanja zapadno od Rive i Dioklecijanove palaèe. Kuæa ima ukupno 3 eta¾e i na svakoj se nalazi po 1 apartman. Na prodaji je apartman u prizemlju povr&scaron;ine 27m2, orjentacije sjever-jug, a sastoji se od dnevnog boravka, kuhinje sa blagovaonicom, spavaæe sobe i kupaonice. Potrebno mu je renoviranje, ali je moguæ boravak i u sada&scaron;njem stanju.</p>', '<p>We are pleased to offer this small, ground floor apartment in the old town of Split.&nbsp;It has a north/south orientation, and is designed with a living room, kitchen, dining room, bedroom and bathroom. It measures 27m sq in total.&nbsp;The property is in need of renovation, but is habitable.&nbsp;The building is an old stone built property which appears in good condition.&nbsp;The area is popular with tourists in the summer, as the Palace and the Marjan park are a short walk away.</p>', '', '<p>Apartman u staroj kamenoj kuæi u samom centru povijesnog grada Splita, udaljeni par minuta hodanja zapadno od Rive i Dioklecijanove palaèe.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Najbli¾e pla¾e nalaze se u park &scaron;umi Marjan, koja je ujedno i rekreacijska zona.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa ima ukupno 3 eta¾e i na svakoj se nalazi po 1 apartman. Ima poseban ulaz iz zajednièkog unutarnjeg hodnika.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ispred se nalazi zajednièko dvori&scaron;te kojeg dijele sa jo&scaron; dva apartmana.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;"><strong>APARTMAN 27 M2 &ndash; 70.000 &euro;</strong></span></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Smje&scaron;ten je u prizemlju orjentacije sjever-jug, a sastoji se od dnevnog boravka, kuhinje sa blagovaonicom, spavaæe sobe i kupaonice.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Potrebno mu je renoviranje, ali je moguæ boravak i u sada&scaron;njem stanju.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>*** U kuæi je na prodaji apartman i na 1.katu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Najbli¾i parking je udaljen 200m, dok se svi sadr¾aji nalaze u blizini.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Meðunarodni aerodrom udaljen je 40 min. vo¾nje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za sve ostale informacije molimo da nas kontaktirate.</p>', '<p>We are pleased to offer this small, ground floor apartment in the old town of Split.<br /><br /><br />It has a north/south orientation, and is designed with a living room, kitchen, dining room, bedroom and bathroom. It measures 27m sq in total.<br /><br /><br />The property is in need of renovation, but is habitable.<br /><br /><br />The building is an old stone built property which appears in good condition.<br /><br /><br />The area is popular with tourists in the summer, as the Palace and the Marjan park are a short walk away.<br /><br /><br />Most of the major historic and cultural attractions are within a few minutes walk, as are many of the finest restaurants and most popular bars.<br /><br /><br />Please contact our office for more information, and for us to arrange visits to the property.</p>', '', '1040_Apartment_0.jpg', '1040_Apartment_1.jpg', '1040_Apartment_2.jpg', '1040_Apartment_3.jpg', '1040_Apartment_4.jpg', '1040_Apartment_5.jpg', '1040_Apartment_6.jpg', '1040_Apartment_7.jpg', '1040_Apartment_8.jpg'),
(1041, 'Anka', 'Mustapiæ', '', '091 111 0039 - Boris', '', 'Split', 'Palmina 1, Zgr 631', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '260', '0', '28', 1, '80000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 'January 31, 2015', '<p>Apartman u staroj kamenoj kuæi u samom centru povijesnog grada Splita, udaljeni par minuta hodanja zapadno od Rive i Dioklecijanove palaèe. Smje&scaron;ten je u kuæi od ukupno 3 eta¾e. Ispred se nalazi zajednièko dvori&scaron;te kojeg dijele sa jo&scaron; jednim vlasnikom koji posjeduje apartman u potkrovlju. Nalazi se na 1.katu sjeverne orjentacije, a sastoji se od a sastoji se od dnevnog boravka, kuhinje sa blagovaonicom, spavaæe sobe i kupaonice, ukupne povr&scaron;ine 28 m2.</p>', '<p>We are pleased to offer this 1st floor apartment in an old stone building in the old town area of Split. It measures 28m sq in total.&nbsp;It has a north/south orientation and the internal layout of the property is as follows: Living room, kitchen, dining room, bedroom and bathroom. The property is fine to move into straight away, but most new owners might want to renovate the property soon.</p>', '', '<p>Apartman &nbsp;u staroj kamenoj kuæi u samom centru povijesnog grada Splita, udaljeni par minuta hodanja zapadno od Rive i Dioklecijanove palaèe.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Najbli¾e pla¾e nalaze se u park &scaron;umi Marjan, koja je ujedno i rekreacijska zona.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Smje&scaron;ten je u kuæi od ukupno 3 eta¾e. Ukupna povr&scaron;ina apartmana iznosi 28 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ima poseban ulaz iz zajednièkog unutarnjeg hodnika.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ispred se nalazi zajednièko dvori&scaron;te kojeg dijele sa jo&scaron; jednim vlasnikom koji posjeduje apartman u potkrovlju.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nalazi se na 1.katu sjeverne orjentacije, a sastoji se od a sastoji se od dnevnog boravka, kuhinje sa blagovaonicom, spavaæe sobe i kupaonice. Nije mu potrebno renoviranje kao apartmanu u prizemlju, ali za veæi nivo luksuza je potrebno jo&scaron; ureðenja.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>***U kuæi je takoðer na prodaji apartman u prizemlju.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Najbli¾i parking je udaljen 200m, dok se svi sadr¾aji nalaze u blizini.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Meðunarodni aerodrom udaljen je 40 min. vo¾nje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za sve ostale informacije molimo da nas kontaktirate.</p>', '<p>We are pleased to offer this 1st floor apartment in an old stone building in the old town area of Split. It measures 28m sq in total.<br /><br /><br />It has a north/south orientation and the internal layout of the property is as follows: Living room, kitchen, dining room, bedroom and bathroom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property is fine to move into straight away, but most new owners might want to renovate the property soon.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>This part of Split is blessed with many fine restaurants, bars and many of the historic and cultural attractions that makes Split so famous, as well being close to the ferry and coach station. It has become very popular with well-informed tourists.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property is in a pedestrianised area, which makes for quiet streets, but the nearest parking is 200m away.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There is access to the building for unloading etc but not parking.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The international airport is 30 min driving.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact our office for more information and to arrange to visit this property.</p>', '', '1041_Apartment_0.jpg', '1041_Apartment_1.jpg', '1041_Apartment_2.jpg', '1041_Apartment_3.jpg', '1041_Apartment_4.jpg', '1041_Apartment_5.jpg', '1041_Apartment_6.jpg', '1041_Apartment_7.jpg', '1041_Apartment_8.jpg'),
(1042, 'Andrej', 'Baraè', '099 1978349 - mama', 'kljuè - Zrinka Budimir 098 748581', '', 'Split', 'Ulica Grada Antofagaste 8, Zem 6656/1', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '1000', '0', '51', 2, '89000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 1, 'January 31, 2015', '<p>Apartman koji se nalazi na 2. katu stambene zgrade novije gradnje u blizini starog dijela grada Splita, popularne Rive i mnogih drugih sadr¾aja. Apartman se sastoji od spavaæe sobe, kuhinje sa dnevnim boravkom, kupaonice sa wc-om, ostave i loðe. Orjentacija apartmana je istoèna, dok je pogled na susjednu zgradu i ulicu. Prodaje se potpuno namje&scaron;ten stoga nije potrebno dodatno ulaganje.</p>', '<p>We have this modestly priced, large one bedroom apartment located on the second floor of a modern block near the old town of Split. The apartment consists of one bedroom, kitchen, living room, bathroom with toilet, utility room and wide balcony.&nbsp;It also has a space in the underground garage. The orientation of the apartment is east, while the view is of the neighboring building and the street. Sold fully furnished, therefore, no additional investment is required.</p>', '', '<p>Apartman koji se nalazi na 2. katu stambene zgrade novije gradnje u blizini starog dijela grada Splita, popularne Rive i mnogih drugih sadr¾aja.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Najbli¾e pla¾e se nalaze u park &scaron;umi Marjan koja je udaljena cca. 1 km, dok je Riva i Dioklecijanova palaèa takoðer udaljena 1 km.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartman se sastoji od spavaæe sobe, kuhinje sa dnevnim boravkom, kupaonice sa wc-om, ostave i loðe.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Posjeduje i gara¾no mjesto u veliko zajednièkoj gara¾i.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Orjentacija apartmana je istoèna, dok je pogled na susjednu zgradu i ulicu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Prodaje se potpuno namje&scaron;ten stoga nije potrebno dodatno ulaganje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U blizini se nalaze poznati sportski objekti (bazeni, dvorane, stadion)...</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Do meðunarodnog aerodroma je potrebno 40 min. vo¾nje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za sva dodatna pitanja nas slobodno kontaktirajte.</p>', '<p>We have this modestly priced, large one bedroom apartment located on the second floor of a modern block near the old town of Split.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The block is late 20th century in construction, and it has many good qualities despite the architecture being quite grim.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The rooms are large and the solid construction means there is no disturbance from neighbouring properties.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is well situated just 10 minutes walk from the old town, the Marjan Park, and most of the historic landmarks in the city.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is also close to the town sports hall, swimming pool and stadium.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The nearest beaches are located in the forest park At Marjan.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The apartment consists of one bedroom, kitchen, living room, bathroom with toilet, utility room and wide balcony.&nbsp;It also has a space in the underground garage.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The orientation of the apartment is east, while the view is of the neighboring building and the street.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sold fully furnished, therefore, no additional investment is required.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>To the international airport it takes 40 min. driving.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For any additional questions please contact us at our Split office.</p>', '', '1042_Apartment_0.jpg', '1042_Apartment_1.jpg', '1042_Apartment_2.jpg', '1042_Apartment_3.jpg', '1042_Apartment_4.jpg', '1042_Apartment_5.jpg', '1042_Apartment_6..jpg', '1042_Apartment_7.jpg', '1042_Apartment_8.jpg'),
(1043, 'Ante', 'Cinotti', '', '098/ 646 145', '', 'Kastela', ' Ka¹tel Novi, ', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '50', '0', '47', 1, '63000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 'February 1, 2015', '<p>Simpatièan apartman u staroj kamenoj kuæi smje&scaron;ten na 1.katu u jednom od 7 malim mjesta Ka&scaron;tela smje&scaron;tena izmeðu Trogira i Splita. Ukupna povr&scaron;ina apartmana je 47 m2, a sastoji se od kuhinje + blagovaonice + dnevnog boravka, 2 spavaæe sobe i kupaonice. Apartman je u solidnom stanju, te je moguæe ¾ivljenje i ljetovanje u njemu, ali je potrebno dodatno renoviranje ukoliko ¾elite luksuzniji nivo.</p>', '<p>We have this two bedroom apartment in an old stone house located on the 1st floor in Kastela.&nbsp;The whole apartment is 47 m2 and consists of a kitchen + dining room + living room, two bedrooms and a bathroom.&nbsp;The apartment is in good condition, but it would suit a new owner who owned sunglasses and a wide paint brush!&nbsp;The international airport is only 10 min, while Split town and Trogir are only 15 min driving.</p>', '', '<p>Simpatièan apartman u staroj kamenoj kuæi smje&scaron;ten na 1.katu u jednom od 7 malim mjesta Ka&scaron;tela smje&scaron;tena izmeðu Trogira i Splita.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U prizemlju se nalazi ulazni dio tj. manje dvori&scaron;te i vrata gdje se direktno izlazi na ulicu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ukupna povr&scaron;ina apartmana je 47 m2, a sastoji se od kuhinje + blagovaonice + dnevnog boravka, 2 spavaæe sobe i kupaonice.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartman je u solidnom stanju, te je moguæe ¾ivljenje i ljetovanje u njemu, ali je potrebno dodatno renoviranje ukoliko ¾elite luksuzniji nivo.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U blizini se nalazi ulièni parking, mnoge trgovine, konobe i ostali potrebni sadr¾aji.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Meðunarodni aerodrom udaljen je 15 min., dok je grad Split udaljen 20 min. vo¾nje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za sva dodatna pitanja stojimo na raspolaganju.</p>', '<p>We have this two bedroom apartment in an old stone house located on the 1st floor in Kastela.<br /><br /><br />The ground floor is an entrance area i.e.. a small courtyard with doors directly out onto to the street which is the access.<br /><br /><br />The whole apartment is 47 m2 and consists of a kitchen + dining room + living room, two bedrooms and a bathroom.<br /><br /><br />The apartment is in good condition, but it would suit a new owner who owned sunglasses and a wide paint brush!<br /><br /><br />Nearby there is street parking, many shops, taverns, restaurants and other necessary facilities and attractions for tourists and the local population equally.<br /><br /><br />The international airport is only 10 min, while Split town and Trogir are only 15 min driving.<br /><br /><br />For any additional questions you may have, please contact our office in Split.</p>', '', '1043_Apartment_0.jpg', '1043_Apartment_1.jpg', '1043_Apartment_2.jpg', '1043_Apartment_3.jpg', '1043_Apartment_4.jpg', '1043_Apartment_5.jpg', '1043_Apartment_6.jpg', '', '');
INSERT INTO `nekretnina` (`id`, `ime`, `prezime`, `telefon`, `mobitel`, `e_mail`, `lokacija_id`, `adresa`, `status_id`, `vrsta_id`, `udaljenost`, `povrsina`, `stambenapovrsina`, `display`, `cijena`, `cijenatocka`, `ponuda_tjedna`, `new_built`, `must_sell`, `prvi_red_do_mora`, `pogled_na_more`, `bazen`, `broj_soba`, `broj_kupatila`, `datum`, `title_hr`, `title_en`, `title_ge`, `opis_hr`, `opis_en`, `opis_ge`, `PropertyImageURL0`, `PropertyImageURL1`, `PropertyImageURL2`, `PropertyImageURL3`, `PropertyImageURL4`, `PropertyImageURL5`, `PropertyImageURL6`, `PropertyImageURL7`, `PropertyImageURL8`) VALUES
(1044, 'Anðelko', 'Rogulj', '', '098 647 707', '', 'Kastela', 'K.Novi, Vinogradska 2 (Povi¹e Intrade), 137/1   137/2', 'For sale', 'Old stone house', '40', '29', '54', 2, '70000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 4, 1, 'February 1, 2015', '<p>Stara kamena kuæa u samom centru starog dijela Ka&scaron;tela, udaljena od mora i &scaron;etnice svega 40 metara. Kuæi je potrebno potpuno renoviranje, ali zbog polo¾aja ima odlièan potencijal za ljetni boravak, ali i preko cijele godine. Sastoji se od prizemlja, 1. i 2. kata ukupne povr&scaron;ine 54 m2. Sve eta¾e imaju poseban vanjski ulaz.</p>', '<p>We are offering this old stone house as a renovation project.&nbsp;It is situated in the centre of the old part of Kastela, just 40m from the sea and the promenade which stretches unbroken for several miles in each direction.&nbsp;It consists of ground, first and second floor with a total area inside of 54 m2.&nbsp;Each floor has its own private entrance.&nbsp;The house also has a garden area of 11 m2.</p>', '', '<p>Stara kamena kuæa u samom centru starog dijela Ka&scaron;tela, udaljena od mora i &scaron;etnice svega 40 metara.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U blizini se nalaze mnogi sadr¾aji, dok do meðunarodnog aerodroma ima 15 min. vo¾nje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Do povijesnog grada Splita je potrebno 20 minuta vo¾nje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæi je potrebno potpuno renoviranje, ali zbog polo¾aja ima odlièan potencijal za ljetni boravak, ali i preko cijele godine.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sastoji se od prizemlja, 1. i 2. kata ukupne povr&scaron;ine 54 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sve eta¾e imaju poseban vanjski ulaz.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa takoðer ima dvori&scaron;te povr&scaron;ine 11 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U prizemlju se nalaze 2 prostorije, od kojih svaka ima odvojen ulaz.</p>\r\n<p>Na 1. katu je manja terasa, predulaz i 1 soba.</p>\r\n<p>Na 2.katu se nalaze 3 sobe.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sve elektriène i vodne instalacije su spojene u kuæi stoga je moguæe izgraditi i kupaonicu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Orjentacija kuæe je zapad &ndash; istok. Veæi dio kuæe kao i dvori&scaron;te se nalazi na zapadnoj strani.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Najbli¾i ulièni parking udaljen je cca. 50 m.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Stojimo na raspolaganju za sva dodatna pitanja.</p>', '<p>We are offering this old stone house as a renovation project.<br /><br /><br />It is situated in the centre of the old part of Kastela, just 40m from the sea and the promenade which stretches unbroken for several miles in each direction.<br /><br /><br />It consists of ground, first and second floor with a total area inside of 54 m2.<br /><br /><br />Each floor has its own private entrance.<br /><br /><br />The house also has a garden area of 11 m2.<br /><br /><br />The ground floor has two rooms, again, each with a separate entrance.&nbsp;<br />On the first floor there is a small terrace and one bedroom.<br />The 2nd floor is divided into 3 rooms.<br /><br /><br />All electrical and water installations are connected to the house.<br /><br /><br />The orientation of the house is east - west. Most of the house and yard is located on the west side.<br /><br /><br />It is a pedestrian area, but with access to the property by car is allowed. The nearest street parking is about 50 m.<br /><br /><br />Close to the property are many activities and bars, restaurants and caf&eacute;s while the international airport is just 10 min driving.<br /><br /><br />The historic city of Split is 15 minutes driving.<br /><br /><br />The house is in need of total renovation, but due to its location has great potential for a summer holiday residence, or also throughout the year.<br /><br /><br />We are available for additional questions and to arrange a visit for you.</p>', '', '1044_Old-stone-house_0.jpg', '1044_Old-stone-house_1.jpg', '1044_Old-stone-house_2.jpg', '1044_Old-stone-house_3.jpg', '1044_Old-stone-house_4.jpg', '1044_Old-stone-house_5.jpg', '1044_Old-stone-house_6.jpg', '1044_Old-stone-house_7.jpg', '1044_Old-stone-house_8.jpg'),
(1045, 'Tim Jarc', 'MarcoPolo', '', '', '', 'Korcula', 'Pri¾ba', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '100', '532', '42', 1, '150000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 1, 1, 'February 2, 2015', '<p>Ova kuæa se nalazi u treæem redu od obale; na uzvisini s nesmetanim i fantastiènim pogledom na puèinu. Na parceli 532 m2, nalazi se prizemnica unutarnje povr&scaron;ine 42m2. Vlasnièki papiri uredni, postoji graðevinska dozvola za dogradnjiu jo&scaron; jednog kata. Izuzetno mirno okru¾enje, pogled koji oduzima dah, spektakularni zalasci i izlasci sunca i jo&scaron; mnogo toga, èine ovu nekretninu jedinstvenim i po¾eljnim utoèi&scaron;æem od gradske vreve i svakodnevnog stresa.</p>', '<p>The house sits on the 3rd row and has a magnificent, unobstructed sea view; the best on the south coast. Single family house, 45 m2. The total land area is 532 m2. A unique house in a special location with a wonderfully romantic view. Designed for year-round living and also makes a really nice holiday home.</p>', '', '<p>Ova kuæa se nalazi u treæem redu od obale; na uzvisini s nesmetanim i fantastiènim pogledom na puèinu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na parceli 532 m2, nalazi se prizemnica unutarnje povr&scaron;ine 42m2. Vlasnièki papiri uredni, postoji graðevinska dozvola za dogradnjiu jo&scaron; jednog kata.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Unutra&scaron;njost se sastoji od kombiniranog dnevnog prostora (potpuno opremljena kuhinja, trpezarija i dnevna soba), djelomièno namje&scaron;tene spavaæe sobe i kupatila.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Podovi su izvedeni u kombinaciji hrastova parketa i keramièkih ploèica. Zidovi su dodatno izolirani kamenom vunom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je prikljuèena na elektriènu energiju i gradski vodovod, dok se telekomunikacijski prikljuèci nalaze u blizini.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Vanjska fasada je oblo¾ena benkovaèkim kamenom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Uz kuæu se nalazi manji vrt, dva dvori&scaron;ta i prednja terasa, te dosta prostora, sada ostavljenom u &ldquo;prirodnom obliku&rdquo; a koji se mo¾e oplemeniti i pretvoriti u dodatnu okuænicu ili eventualno bazen.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ova nekretnina trenutno nema direktan prilaz na cestu, veæ se do nje dolazi stepeni&scaron;tem uz koje se nalazi manji vagon kojeg pogoni el. vinè, te je dobrodo&scaron;la pomoæ za prijenos stvari i eventualno materijala, do same kuæe.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Cesta koja je predviðena i projektirana prolazi uz gornji rub parcele (ne dira samu parcelu) te æe u skora&scaron;njoj buduænosti i taj &ldquo;problem&rdquo; æe biti rije&scaron;en.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Izuzetno mirno okru¾enje, pogled koji oduzima dah, spektakularni zalasci i izlasci sunca i jo&scaron; mnogo toga, èine ovu nekretninu jedinstvenim i po¾eljnim utoèi&scaron;æem od gradske vreve i svakodnevnog stresa.</p>', '<p>The house sits on the 3rd row and has a magnificent, unobstructed sea view; the best on the south coast.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Single family house, 45 m2. The house is legally constructed and the building permit allows for the construction of an additional floor. The ownership title is up-to-date and clean. There are no liens or encumbrances. Living / kitchen area, one bedroom, WC / shower.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The exterior fa&ccedil;ade is&nbsp;finished with&nbsp;"Benkovac" stone. The interior has wood parquet and tile floors. The WC is fully tiled. The two rooms are finished in sheetrock and the walls and ceiling are insulated with rock wool. The parquet floors are constructed with a vapor barrier and insulated with Styrofoam and cork, and finished with glossy polyurethane (very nice!).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Electricity and town water are connected. Energy efficient "instant on" water heating (continuous hot water!)</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Partially furnished: two free-standing bedroom closets, mattress (no frame), excellent quality kitchen including refrigerator and ceramic / gas cook top, living room furniture and book shelves, small, folding dining table. "Nordica" free-standing, cast iron wood stove. Washing machine is included.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The total land area is 532 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There is currently no direct road access; the house sits at the top of a stairway of 105 steps (healthy living!). There is an electric cable winch and wagon to assist with bringing items and material up to the house (the winch system is not suitable for transporting people).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There is a small garden area, two terraces and a balcony.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The urban zoning plan has approved the construction of a new road&nbsp;which will be above the property. When that road is finished there will be direct road access. The road will not cut across the property land borders.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Quiet, peaceful area. Watch the sun rise and set directly into the sea between October and February.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There is a house being constructed directly&nbsp;below this house. However, because of the slope of the land, the open sea view will not be obstructed. You must see the view!!!</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>A unique house in a special location with a wonderfully romantic view. Designed for year-round living and also makes a really nice holiday home.</p>', '', '1045_House-Villa_0.jpg', '1045_House-Villa_1.jpg', '1045_House-Villa_2.jpg', '1045_House-Villa_3.jpg', '1045_House-Villa_4.jpg', '1045_House-Villa_5.jpg', '1045_House-Villa_6.jpg', '1045_House-Villa_7.jpg', '1045_House-Villa_8.jpg'),
(1046, '', 'MarcoPolo', '', '', '', 'Korcula', 'Raèi¹æe', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '10', '0', '50', 1, '59000', '', 2, 2, 2, 1, 1, 2, 2, 1, 'February 2, 2015', '<p>Prodaje se apartman na prvom katu stare kamene kuæe; tik do mora. Nalazi se na rivi u centru tradicionalnog mjesta&scaron;ca na sjevernoj obali. Apartman se sastoji od 2 spavaæe sobe, hodnika i kupatila, dok se kuhinja / blagovaona nalazi u zasebnom dijelu do kojeg se dolazi preko natkrite terase. Ukupna stambena povr&scaron;ina je 50 m2 + 22 m2 dvori&scaron;te &ndash; terasa. Apartman je potpuno u useljivom stanju, potrebne (ali ne i neophodne) manje adaptacije. Idealan za ljetni odmor ili iznajmljivanje.</p>', '<p>The first floor of an old-stone house, located just 10 meters from the sea! Traditional architecture only steps away from the sea is awaiting a lucky buyer. The apartment consists of 2 bedrooms, a hallway and a bathroom. Total living area is 50 m2 plus a 22 m2 garden and terrace.&nbsp;Ideal for a holiday home or summer rental.</p>', '', '<p>Prodaje se apartman na prvom katu stare kamene kuæe; tik do mora.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nalazi se na rivi u centru tradicionalnog mjesta&scaron;ca na sjevernoj obali.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartman se sastoji od 2 spavaæe sobe, hodnika i kupatila, dok se kuhinja / blagovaona nalazi u zasebnom dijelu do kojeg se dolazi preko natkrite terase.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Iza kuhinje / blagovaone se nalazi omanje dvori&scaron;te sa kaminom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ukupna stambena povr&scaron;ina je 50 m2 + 22 m2 dvori&scaron;te &ndash; terasa.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartman je potpuno u useljivom stanju, potrebne (ali ne i neophodne) manje adaptacije.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Idealan za ljetni odmor ili iznajmljivanje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sva infrastruktura prisutna, te se duæani, restorani, po&scaron;ta i pla¾a nalaze na par koraka udaljenosti.</p>', '<p>The first floor of an old-stone house!</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Traditional architecture only steps away from the sea is awaiting a lucky buyer.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The apartment consists of 2 bedrooms, a hallway and a bathroom. There is a combined kitchen-dining area that is accessed via a covered terrace. Behind the kitchen is a small courtyard with a fireplace.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Total living area is 50 m2 plus a 22 m2 garden and terrace.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The apartment is in &ldquo;move-in&rdquo; condition but of course it could use some minor renovations.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ideal for a holiday home or summer rental.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Electricity and town water is connected.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Only steps away are shops, restaurants and the sea.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For this location you will not find a more reasonable price.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact us as soon as you can for a private tour of this wonderful apartment.</p>', '', '1046_Apartment_0.jpg', '1046_Apartment_1.jpg', '1046_Apartment_2.jpg', '1046_Apartment_3.jpg', '1046_Apartment_4.jpg', '1046_Apartment_5.jpg', '', '', ''),
(1047, 'Jo¹ko', '®ivkoviæ', '', '091/ 553 6541', '', 'Kastela', 'Gospodska ¹trada 2, Ka¹tel Suæurac', 'For sale', 'Old stone house', '70', '0', '33', 2, '22000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 'February 2, 2015', '<p>Prilika za kupnju iznimno povoljne nekretnine na zanimljivoj lokaciji!!! Stara kamena kuæa kojoj je potrebno potpuno renoviranje, sa potencijalom turistièkog iznajmljivanja ili ljetovanja u jednom od 7 prekrasnih mjesta Ka&scaron;tela. Kuæa se nalazi unutar zajednièkog dvori&scaron;ta, izolirana od glavne ulice ujedno rive i &scaron;etnice koja je udaljena cca. 70 m od kuæe. Sastoji se od prizemlja i 1.kata ukupne povr&scaron;ine 30 m2. Odmah do kuæe se nalazi sprema od 3 m2.</p>', '<p>We are offering this old stone house in Kastela as a renovation project. It is situated in an interesting location, 2 minutes walk from the Riva. The building has a shared courtyard, isolated from the main street, and It has ground floor and 1st floor, total area of 30 m2. Next to the house is storage of 3 m2. This is a great opportunity to own a traditional&nbsp;old stone house in the heart of Dalmatia for little money!</p>', '', '<p>Prilika za kupnju iznimno povoljne nekretnine na zanimljivoj lokaciji!!!</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Stara kamena kuæa kojoj je potrebno potpuno renoviranje, sa potencijalom turistièkog iznajmljivanja ili ljetovanja u jednom od 7 prekrasnih mjesta Ka&scaron;tela.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ka&scaron;tela su smje&scaron;tena izmeðu povijesnih gradova Trogira i Splita, dok je meðunarodni aerodrom udaljen 20 min. vo¾nje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa se nalazi unutar zajednièkog dvori&scaron;ta, izolirana od glavne ulice ujedno rive i &scaron;etnice koja je udaljena cca. 70 m od kuæe.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sastoji se od prizemlja i 1.kata ukupne povr&scaron;ine 30 m2. Odmah do kuæe se nalazi sprema od 3 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Orjentacija kuæe je zapad &ndash; istok.</p>\r\n<p>Na zapadnoj strani se nalazi glavni ulaz, dok je na istoènoj iz druge ulice jo&scaron; jedan ulaz.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Do kuæe su instalacije struje i vode koje je potrebno instalirati prilikom ureðenja.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U blizini se nalaze svi potrebni sadr¾aji.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za sve dodatne informacije vam stojimo na raspolaganju.</p>', '<p>We are offering this old stone house in Kastela as a renovation project.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is situated in an interesting location, 2 minutes walk from the Riva, which is the walkway running along the entire length of the shore in the village, but still close to the high street, with bars, caf&eacute;s, shops and other services etc.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The building has a shared courtyard, isolated from the main street, and It has ground floor and 1st floor, total area of 30 m2. Next to the house is storage of 3 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The connection of electricity and water, which are next to the house and can easaly be installed during the planning process.&nbsp;Nearby are all necessary services which would make this &nbsp;quite easy.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>We are available for any questions.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>This is a great opportunity to own a traditional&nbsp;old stone house in the heart of Dalmatia for little money!</p>', '', '1047_Old-stone-house_0.jpg', '1047_Old-stone-house_1.jpg', '1047_Old-stone-house_2.jpg', '1047_Old-stone-house_3.jpg', '1047_Old-stone-house_4.jpg', '1047_Old-stone-house_5.jpg', '1047_Old-stone-house_6.jpg', '1047_Old-stone-house_7.jpg', '1047_Old-stone-house_8.jpg'),
(1048, 'Ante', 'Gogiæ', '', '091/ 254 0051', '', 'Kastela', 'K.Stari, Kraljice mira 1', 'For sale', 'Old stone house', '70', '65', '130', 2, '130000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 1, 'February 2, 2015', '<p>Stara kamena kuæa u nizu u odliènom stanju, udaljena svega 70 m od &scaron;etnice i pje&scaron;èane pla¾e. Ukupna stambena povr&scaron;ina iznosi 130 m2, a sastoji se od prizemlja i 1.kata. U prizemlju se nalaze 2 poslovna prostora (20 m2 i 25 m2) sa odvojenim vanjskim ulazima. Dva prostora je moguæe iznajmljivati kao poslovne ili ih preurediti u manje apartmane.</p>', '<p>We are pleased to offer this old stone built house in excellent condition, only 70 m away from the promenade and pebble beach. It is located in one of the seven Kastela villages, an area located between two historic towns of Trogir and Split. The total area inside is 130 m2 and consists of ground floor and 1st floor. The ground floor has 2 commercial spaces (20 m2 and 25 m2) with separate outside entrances. Two spaces can be rented as a business or rearranged to become small apartments for tourists or dwelling.</p>', '', '<p>Stara kamena kuæa u nizu u odliènom stanju, udaljena svega 70 m od &scaron;etnice i pje&scaron;èane pla¾e.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Smje&scaron;tena je u jednom od 7 mjesta Ka&scaron;tela koja se nalaze u blizini povijesnih gradova Trogira i Splita.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ukupna stambena povr&scaron;ina iznosi 130 m2, a sastoji se od prizemlja i 1.kata.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U prizemlju se nalaze 2 poslovna prostora (20 m2 i 25 m2) sa odvojenim vanjskim ulazima. Mjerilo vode i struje je odvojeno od prvog kata.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za ostatak kuæe je takoðer odvojeni ulaz u prizemlju gdje se nalazi predprostor i kupaonica.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Unutarnje stepenice vode na 1.kat gdje se nalazi veliko predsoblje, wc, ostava, spavaæa soba, kuhinja + blagovaonica + dnevni boravak.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Dva prostora je moguæe iznajmljivati kao poslovne ili ih preurediti u manje apartmane.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa ima vi&scaron;e moguænosti i potencijala.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U blizini se nalaze trgovine, kafiæi, restorani i svi ostali sadr¾aji.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Meðunarodni aerodrom udaljen je 15 min. vo¾nje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na raspolaganju smo za sva dodatna pitanja.</p>', '<p>We are pleased to offer this old stone built house in excellent condition, only 70 m away from the promenade and pebble beach.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is located in one of the seven Kastela villages, an area located between two historic towns of Trogir and Split.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The total area inside is 130 m2 and consists of ground floor and 1st floor.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The ground floor has 2 commercial spaces (20 m2 and 25 m2) with separate outside entrances. These two units have separate meters for water and electricity.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The upstairs has a separate entrance on the ground floor where there is a hall and bathroom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Internal stairs lead to the 1st floor where there is a large entrance hall, toilet, storage room, bedroom, kitchen, dining room and living room.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Two spaces can be rented as a business or rearranged to become small apartments for tourists or dwelling.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house has many possibilities and much potential.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nearby are shops, bars, restaurants and other facilities and services.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The international airport is 15 minutes driving.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>We are available for any questions and to arrange a tour.</p>', '', '1048_Old-stone-house_0.jpg', '1048_Old-stone-house_1.jpg', '1048_Old-stone-house_2.jpg', '1048_Old-stone-house_3.jpg', '1048_Old-stone-house_4.jpg', '1048_Old-stone-house_5.jpg', '1048_Old-stone-house_6.jpg', '1048_Old-stone-house_7.jpg', '1048_Old-stone-house_8.jpg'),
(1049, 'Nenad', 'Ninèeviæ', '091 214 7380  ', 'Ante Djelalija 095 922 1592', '', 'Trogir', 'Mastrinka, Put sv. Kri¾a, Z.U. 245', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '40', '482', '255', 1, '320000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 7, 3, 'February 7, 2015', '<p>Samostojeæa kuæa u 2.redu od mora udaljena svega 40 m od prekrasne pje&scaron;èane pla¾e. Smje&scaron;tena je na sjevernoj strani otoka Èiova nedaleko od povijesnog grada Trogira i meðunarodnog aerodroma koji je udaljen 15 min. vo¾nje. Kuæa se nalazi na zemlji&scaron;tu ukupne povr&scaron;ine 482 m2, dok je stambena povr&scaron;ina 255 + terase 65 m2 m2. Sastoji se od suterena, visokog prizemlja, 1. i 2.kata (potkrovlje).</p>', '<p>We have this detached house in the 2nd row, only 40 m from the clear sea and the shore. It is located on the north side on the island Ciovo near the historic town of Trogir and the international airport, which is only 15 min driving. The house is located on a plot with a total area of 482 m2, while the living area is 255 m2 + large terrace of 65 m2. It consists of basement, ground floor, 1st and 2nd floor (top floor).</p>', '', '<p>Samostojeæa kuæa u 2.redu od mora udaljena svega 40 m od prekrasne pje&scaron;èane pla¾e.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Smje&scaron;tena je na sjevernoj strani otoka Èiova nedaleko od povijesnog grada Trogira i meðunarodnog aerodroma koji je udaljen 15 min. vo¾nje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa se nalazi na zemlji&scaron;tu ukupne povr&scaron;ine 482 m2, dok je stambena povr&scaron;ina 255 + terase 65 m2 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sastoji se od suterena, visokog prizemlja, 1. i 2.kata (potkrovlje).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U suterenu se nalazi gara¾a i 2 prostorije koje slu¾e kao spremi&scaron;te.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U visokom prizemlju je 3-sobni apartman sa prostranom terasom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na 1.katu se nalazi 3-sobni apartman sa pogledom na more koji se pru¾a sa terase, dok se na 2.katu nalazi 1-sobni apartman takoðer sa velikom terasom i prekrasnim pogledom na more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je u prosjeènom stanju, stoga je potrebno dodatno ulaganje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U dvori&scaron;tu je moguæa izgradnja bazena i vi&scaron;e parking mjesta.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Trenutno se ispred kuæe nalazi parking za 1 vozilo, dok je u gara¾i isto moguæe parkirati.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Do same kuæe su dva pristupna puta.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Bez obzira &scaron;to je kuæi potrebno dodatno renoviranje, ima odlièan potencijal za preureðenje u pravu obiteljsku vilu za odmor.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U blizini se nalaze svi potrebni sadr¾aji.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Stojimo na raspolaganju za sva dodatna pitanja.</p>', '<p>We have this detached house in the 2nd row, only 40 m from the clear sea and the shore.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is located on the north side on the island Ciovo near the historic town of Trogir and the international airport, which is only 15 min driving.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house is located on a plot with a total area of 482 m2, while the living area is 255 m2 + large terrace of 65 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It consists of basement, ground floor, 1st and 2nd floor (top floor).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>In the basement there is a garage and two rooms that serve as storage.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the ground floor is a three-room apartment with a spacious terrace.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the 1st floor there is 3 bedroom apartment with sea views from the terrace, while on the 2nd floor there is a one bedroom apartment also with a large terrace and great views overlooking the sea.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house is in average condition, therefore, needs significant redecorating.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>In the yard is possible to build a swimming pool and more parking spaces.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Currently the front of the house has parking for one vehicle, as well as the garage.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>No matter that the house needs further renovation, it still has great potential for conversion into a real family holiday villa.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Within walking distance are bars, caf&eacute;s and other facilities on the coast.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>We are at your disposal for any additional questions.</p>', '', '1049_House-Villa_0.jpg', '1049_House-Villa_1.jpg', '1049_House-Villa_2.jpg', '1049_House-Villa_3.jpg', '1049_House-Villa_4.jpg', '1049_House-Villa_5.jpg', '1049_House-Villa_6.jpg', '1049_House-Villa_7.jpg', '1049_House-Villa_8.jpg'),
(1050, 'Marica', 'Juriæ', '', '099 811 8323', 'mjuric1952@gmail.com', 'Kastela', 'K.Suæurac, Branitelja od Turaka 17, 7046, 7048', 'For sale', 'Old stone house', '160', '234', '111', 2, '68000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 0, 0, 'February 7, 2015', '<p>Izuzetna prilika za investiranje u staru kamenu kuæu u centru Ka&scaron;tela udaljenu od mora i rive 160 m. Iako joj je potrebno kompletno renoviranje ima odlièan potencijal za poslovne ali i privatne svrhe. Sastoji se od prizemlja i 1.kata + 1 spreme. Ukupna povr&scaron;ina iznosi 111 m2. Svaka eta¾a ima 47 m2 + sprema 17 m2. 10 m od kuæe se nalazi vrt povr&scaron;ine 170 m2 koji je ukljuèen u cijenu.</p>', '<p>We are offering this great opportunity to invest in an old stone house, needing complete restoration, in Kastela old village centre, just 160 m. away from the sea.&nbsp;Although it needs a complete renovation has great potential for business or private purposes, and is superb value at this price.&nbsp;Inside it has a ground floor, 1st floor + 1 storage. The total area is 111 m2.&nbsp;10 m from the house is a garden of 170 m2, which is included in the price.</p>', '', '<p>Izuzetna prilika za investiranje u staru kamenu kuæu u centru Ka&scaron;tela udaljenu od mora i rive 160 m.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Iako joj je potrebno kompletno renoviranje ima odlièan potencijal za poslovne ali i privatne svrhe.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sastoji se od prizemlja i 1.kata + 1 spreme.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ukupna povr&scaron;ina iznosi 111 m2. Svaka eta¾a ima 47 m2 + sprema 17 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>10 m od kuæe se nalazi vrt povr&scaron;ine 170 m2 koji je ukljuèen u cijenu. Ovo je jo&scaron; jedna prednost nekretnine jer je rijetkost imati prostrani vrt u samom centru starog dijela.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Do kuæe je diretan pristupni put, dok je u vrt moguæe preurediti u parking mjesta.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Do autobusne stanice koja povezuje povijesne gradove Trogir i Split ima svega nekoliko minuta hodanja.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Svi sadr¾aji su u blizini dok je meðunarodni aerodrom udaljen 2 min. vo¾nje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za sva dodatna pitanja vam stojimo na raspolaganju</p>', '<p>We are offering this great opportunity to invest in an old stone house, needing complete restoration, in Kastela old village centre, just 160 m. away from the sea.<br /><br /><br />Although it needs a complete renovation has great potential for business or private purposes, and is superb value at this price.<br /><br /><br />Inside it has a ground floor, 1st floor + 1 storage. The total area is 111 m2.<br /><br /><br />Each floor has 47 m2 + storage 17 m2.<br /><br /><br />10 m from the house is a garden of 170 m2, which is included in the price. This is another advantage of the property as it is rare to have a large garden in the center of the old part, and this can be used as private parking spaces.<br /><br /><br />The house has direct access to the road.<br /><br /><br />Split and Trogir are 15 mins driving, and the nearest bus stop with regular stops is just a few minutes walk from the house.<br /><br /><br />All facilities such as shops and caf&eacute;s are nearby while the international airport is 20 minutes driving.<br /><br /><br />For any questions, you are at your disposal.</p>', '', '1050_Old-stone-house_0.jpg', '1050_Old-stone-house_1.jpg', '1050_Old-stone-house_2.jpg', '1050_Old-stone-house_3.jpg', '1050_Old-stone-house_4.jpg', '1050_Old-stone-house_5.jpg', '1050_Old-stone-house_6.jpg', '1050_Old-stone-house_7.jpg', '1050_Old-stone-house_8.jpg'),
(1051, 'Ivica', '', 'kljuè - Vinko Èurlin 095 904 8968', '098 947 0191 treutno neaktivan', '', 'Kastela', 'K.Gomilica, Dijega Rokova 2, *83', 'For sale', 'Old stone house', '30', '0', '120', 2, '120000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 3, 3, 'February 7, 2015', '<p>Djelomièno renovirana stara kamena kuæa u prekrasnom mjestu Ka&scaron;tela udaljena 30 m od mora i povijesne kule. Pje&scaron;èana pla¾a udaljena je par minuta hodanja. Kuæi je renovirana vanjska fasada, dok je unutra&scaron;njost djelomièno renovirana. Ukupna stambena povr&scaron;ina iznosi 120 m2 + terasa 40 m2. Na krovu se nalazi terasa (40 m2) sa pogledom na more.</p>', '<p>We are offering this partially renovated old stone house just 30 m away from the sea and historic sea front buildings. The house has had the exterior completely renovated, including the windows and doors, while the interior has been partially renovated, with the heavy work done. The total inside area is 120 m2 + terrace 40 m2. On the roof is a terrace (40 m2) with sea view.</p>', '', '<p>Djelomièno renovirana stara kamena kuæa u prekrasnom mjestu Ka&scaron;tela udaljena 30 m od mora i povijesne kule.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Pje&scaron;èana pla¾a udaljena je par minuta hodanja.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæi je renovirana vanjska fasada, dok je unutra&scaron;njost djelomièno renovirana.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ukupna stambena povr&scaron;ina iznosi 120 m2 + terasa 40 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ima dva vanjska ulaza koja se nalaze u prizemlje. Prvi ulaz je za jednosobni stan u prizemlju, dok je drugi ulaz za 2 apartmana koji se nalaze na 1. i 2.katu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na krovu se nalazi terasa (40 m2) sa pogledom na more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Svaki apartman se sastoji od dnevnog boravka + blagovaonice + kuhinje, 1 spavaæe sobe i kupaonice.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Najbli¾i parking udaljen je 20 m od kuæe iako je moguæe parkirati i do samog ulaza.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Svi sadr¾aji se nalaze u blizini.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Meðunarodni aerodrom udaljen je 20 min. vo¾nje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za sve dodatne informacije slobodno nas kontaktirajte.</p>', '<p>We are offering this partially renovated old stone house just 30 m away from the sea and historic sea front buildings.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house has had the exterior completely renovated, including the windows and doors, while the interior has been partially renovated, with the heavy work done.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The total inside area is 120 m2 + terrace 40 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There are two separate entrances which are located in the ground floor.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The first entry is for a one-bedroom apartment on the ground floor, while the second entrance for two apartments located on the 1st and 2nd floor.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the roof is a terrace (40 m2) with sea view.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Each apartment consists of living room + dining room and kitchen, one bedroom and bathroom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The nearest parking is located 20 m from the house although it is possible to park by the entrance for unloading etc.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>All amenities such as shops and bars and caf&eacute;s are nearby.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The international airport is 20 minutes. driving.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For further information please contact us.</p>', '', '1051_Old-stone-house_0.jpg', '1051_Old-stone-house_1.jpg', '1051_Old-stone-house_2.jpg', '1051_Old-stone-house_3.jpg', '1051_Old-stone-house_4.jpg', '1051_Old-stone-house_5.jpg', '1051_Old-stone-house_6.jpg', '', ''),
(1052, 'Milan', 'Remetin', '', '098 817 191', '', 'Kastela', 'K.Suæurac, Ulica Kneza Trpimira 15, ', 'For sale', 'Old stone house', '95', '0', '180', 1, '130000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 4, 3, 'February 7, 2015', '<p>Stara kamena kuæa u centru jednog od sedam prekrasnih Ka&scaron;tela smje&scaron;tenih izmeðu Trogira i Splita. Od mora i rive je udaljena 95 m, dok su trgovine, kafiæi i svi ostali sadr¾aji u blizini. Sastoji se od prizemlja, 1. i 2. kata ukupne povr&scaron;ine 180 m2 + krovna terasa 60 m2 sa koje se pru¾a prekrasan pogled na more, grad Split i otok Èiovo.</p>', '<p>We are offering this renovation project as a great investment in Kastela.&nbsp;It is situated 95m from the shore and the extensive Riva running along this part of the coast but close to many options of bars, caf&eacute;s and restaurants.&nbsp;It consists of ground, first and second floor with total area of 180 m2 + roof terrace 60 m2 with a beautiful view of the sea, the city of Split and the island of Ciovo.</p>', '', '<p>Stara kamena kuæa u centru jednog od sedam prekrasnih Ka&scaron;tela smje&scaron;tenih izmeðu Trogira i Splita.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Od mora i rive je udaljena 95 m, dok su trgovine, kafiæi i svi ostali sadr¾aji u blizini.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæi je potrebno kompletno renoviranje, ali je zbog velièine i polo¾aja izvrsna prilika za ulaganje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sastoji se od prizemlja, 1. i 2. kata ukupne povr&scaron;ine 180 m2 + krovna terasa 60 m2 sa koje se pru¾a prekrasan pogled na more, grad Split i otok Èiovo.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U prizemlju koje ima poseban ulaz se nalazi 1 velika prostorija, manja sprema i wc. Dvoeta¾ni apartman na 1. i 2. katu takoðer ima odvojen ulaz.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na 1.katu se nalazi kuhinja + dnevni boravak, 1 soba i kupaonica.</p>\r\n<p>Na 2.katu je mala kupaonica i 3 spavaæe sobe.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Osim krovne terase na vrhu, na 1.katu se nalazi manji balkon.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U blizini se nalazi stanica za autobusnu liniju koja povezuje gradove Split i Trogir.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za sva dodatna pitanja vam stojimo na raspolaganju.</p>', '<p>We are offering this renovation project as a great investment in Kastela.<br /><br /><br />It is situated 95m from the shore and the extensive Riva running along this part of the coast but close to many options of bars, caf&eacute;s and restaurants.<br /><br /><br />The house needs complete renovation, but due to the size, position and original stylish design it is a great opportunity.<br /><br /><br />It consists of ground, first and second floor with total area of 180 m2 + roof terrace 60 m2 with a beautiful view of the sea, the city of Split and the island of Ciovo.<br /><br /><br />The ground floor has a separate entrance and there is one large room, a smaller stores room and toilets. Duplex apartment on the first and second floor also have a separate entrance.<br /><br /><br />On the 1st floor there is a kitchen, living room, one bedroom and bathroom, and a small but attractive balcony above the front door.<br /><br /><br />On the 2nd floor is a small bathroom and three bedrooms.<br /><br /><br />Nearby is a bus stop for the bus line that connects the cities of Split and Trogir.<br /><br /><br />For any questions, you are at your disposal. Please contact our office to arrange a tour.</p>', '', '1052_Old-stone-house_0.jpg', '1052_Old-stone-house_1.jpg', '1052_Old-stone-house_2.jpg', '1052_Old-stone-house_3.jpg', '1052_Old-stone-house_4.jpg', '1052_Old-stone-house_5.jpg', '1052_Old-stone-house_6.jpg', '1052_Old-stone-house_7.jpg', '1052_Old-stone-house_8.jpg'),
(1053, 'Zvonimir', 'Uvodiæ', '0958185514 ', '0915218494, 0959201752', '', 'Rogoznica', 'O¹trièka luka, Put dragovoda 33, k.è. 13999, 14001', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '70', '744', '385', 1, '450000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 1, 6, 4, 'February 7, 2015', '<p>U mirnoj uvali na svega 70 m od ureðene pla¾e nalazi se kuæa s bazenom, s koje se pru¾a pogled na more i uvalu. Na parceli povr&scaron;ine 744 m2, nalaze se dvije stambene zgrade. Stambena zgrada A&nbsp;je povr&scaron;ine 220 m2, a podijeljena je na prizemlje i kat. Na razini kata nalazi se&nbsp;stambena zgrada B&nbsp;povr&scaron;ine 164 m2, koja se sastoji od dva apartmana. Terasa s bazenom je sa svih strana okru¾ena zelenilom kako bi se osigurala privatnost i intimnost prostora.</p>', '<p>We have this well presented holiday villa with a swimming pool, in a quiet cove only 70 m from the beach. It is situated on the mainland near Rogoznica, a village between Trogir and Sibenik.&nbsp;It is on a plot of 744 m2, and there are two residential buildings.&nbsp;Residential building A is the area of 220 m2 and is divided into two floors.&nbsp;On the first floor level there is a residential building B area of 164 m2, consisting of two apartments.</p>', '', '<p>U mirnoj uvali na svega 70 m od ureðene pla¾e nalazi se kuæa s bazenom, s koje se pru¾a pogled na more i uvalu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na parceli povr&scaron;ine 744 m2, nalaze se dvije stambene zgrade.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Stambena zgrada A</strong> je povr&scaron;ine 220 m2, a podijeljena je na prizemlje i kat.</p>\r\n<p>U prizemlju se nalazi konoba u jednom dijelu, a u drugom dijelu prostrani dnevni boravak, kuhinja, kupaonica i dvije spavaæe sobe. Prizemlje ima izlaz na terasu s kaminom. Na katu se nalazi dnevni&nbsp; boravak, kuhinja, kupaonica i dvije spavaæe sobe. Izlaz je na terasu u sklopu koje se nalazi bazen, a sa terase se pru¾a i lijepi pogled na more i uvalu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na razini kata nalazi se <strong>stambena zgrada B</strong> povr&scaron;ine 164 m2, koja se sastoji od dva apartmana. Svaki apartman ima dnevni boravak s kuhinjom, spavaæu sobu i kupaonicu. Apartmani imaju terasu kao i pristup terasi s bazenom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Okuænica je lijepo ureðena mediteranskim biljem, poploèana je kamenom, a pored bazena nalazi se sjenica. Terasa s bazenom je sa svih strana okru¾ena zelenilom kako bi se osigurala privatnost i intimnost prostora.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>S obzirom da se sastoji od dvije stambene zgrade osim kao obiteljska kuæa ova nekretnina pru¾a i moguænost iznajmljivanja apartmana u turistièke svrhe&nbsp; ili za prijatelje i rodbinu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je u dobrom stanju.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>S obzirom da je parcela prostrana, u sklopu parcele nalazi se 6 parking mjesta.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je od restorana, kafiæa i duæana udaljena svega par kilometara, a od aerodroma 20 km.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa ima dvije cisterne za vodu (prikljuèak za gradsku vodu se oèekuje do 2016 godine), septièku jamu i uvedenu struju.</p>', '<p>We have this well presented holiday villa with a swimming pool, in a quiet cove only 70 m from the beach. It is situated on the mainland near Rogoznica, a village between Trogir and Sibenik.<br /><br /><br />It is on a plot of 744 m2, and there are two residential buildings.<br /><br /><br />Residential building A is the area of 220 m2 and is divided into two floors.<br />On the ground floor there is a tavern/cellar &nbsp;in one part, while in the second part of a spacious living room, kitchen, bathroom and two bedrooms. The ground floor has a terrace with fireplace. The first floor has a living room, kitchen, bathroom and two bedrooms. The terrace has a swimming pool and the surrounding patio has a beautiful view of the sea and the bay.<br /><br /><br />On the first floor level there is a residential building B area of 164 m2, consisting of two apartments. Each apartment has a living room with kitchen, bedroom and bathroom. The apartments have balconies and access to the patio and pool.<br /><br /><br />The courtyard is beautifully decorated with Mediterranean plants, paved with stone, and around the pool there is an arbor. The swimming &nbsp;pool and patio is surrounded with greenery to ensure privacy and intimacy of the space.<br /><br /><br />Given that this property consists of two residential buildings, apart from being a substantial private house, this property offers the possibility to rent apartments for tourism purposes or for friends and relatives.<br /><br /><br />The house is in good condition.<br /><br /><br />There are 6 parking spaces within the gardens of the property.<br /><br /><br />The local village centre has several restaurants, caf&eacute;s and shops and this is only a few kilometers away, while the airport is 20 km.<br /><br /><br />The house has two water tanks (connection to city water is expected by 2016), a septic tank and the current supply.<br /><br /><br />Please contact our offices in Split to arrange a tour of the property.</p>', '', '1053_House-Villa_0.jpg', '1053_House-Villa_1.jpg', '1053_House-Villa_2.jpg', '1053_House-Villa_3.jpg', '1053_House-Villa_4.jpg', '1053_House-Villa_5.jpg', '1053_House-Villa_6.jpg', '1053_House-Villa_7.jpg', '1053_House-Villa_8.jpg'),
(1054, 'Kre¹imir', 'Falak', '', '', '', 'Hvar', 'Hvar, Vicka Butorovica 14', 'For sale', 'Old stone house', '100', '60', '100', 1, '730000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 3, 2, 'February 8, 2015', '<p>Prodajemo renoviranu kamenu kuæu u centru grada Hvara, na 3 eta¾e s terasom i bazenom. Nalazi se na povi&scaron;enom terenu, tako da ima prekrasan pogled na stari grad, a od luke je udaljena 100 m. Stambena povr&scaron;ina kuæe iznosi 100m2 i ima 50m2 vrta / dvori&scaron;te s bazenom. Kuæa ima privatnu gara¾u (200 m od kuæe).</p>', '<p>We are offering this spacious and bright, renovated stone house in the centre of Hvar town, on 3 floors with a terrace and swimming pool. It is situated on elevated ground, so it has great views of the old town, and is about 100m from the harbour. The internal living is 100m2 and there is 50m2 of garden/patio with the swimming pool. The property is well presented and completely modernised in every way.</p>', '', '<p>Prodajemo renoviranu kamenu kuæu u centru grada Hvara, na 3 eta¾e s terasom i bazenom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nalazi se na povi&scaron;enom terenu, tako da ima prekrasan pogled na stari grad, a od luke je udaljena 100 m.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Stambena povr&scaron;ina kuæe iznosi 100m2 i ima 50m2 vrta / dvori&scaron;te s bazenom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Unutra&scaron;njost kuæe je vrlo moderna, s kuhinjom i dnevnim boravakom u prizemlju, s pripadajuæom kupaonicom i ostavom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na prvom katu je spavaæa soba s kupaonicom koja ima izlaz na veliku terasu koja gleda na centar grada Hvara, a na drugom katu je takoðer jedna spavaæa soba sa vlastitom kupaonicom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa ima privatnu gara¾u (200 m od kuæe).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Molimo nazovite na&scaron; CPS ured u Hvaru za dogovor oko razgledavanja.</p>', '<p>We are offering this spacious and bright, renovated stone house in the centre of Hvar town, on 3 floors with a terrace and swimming pool.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is situated on elevated ground, so it has great views of the old town, and is about 100m from the harbour.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The internal living is 100m2 and there is 50m2 of garden/patio with the swimming pool.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The internal layout of the property has a modern style open plan living room, kitchen, and lounge on the ground floor, with bathroom and storage.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The first floor has a bedroom with bathroom with access to the large balcony which&nbsp; looks across the old town, and a second floor is also one bedroom with a private bathroom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property is well presented and completely modernised in every way.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The decorations and furniture are practical and give the property a stylish and relaxing feel.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house has a private garage (200 m from the house).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please call our Hvar CPS office for viewing and to arrange a visit.</p>', '', '1054_Old-stone-house_0.jpg', '1054_Old-stone-house_1.jpg', '1054_Old-stone-house_2.jpg', '1054_Old-stone-house_3.jpg', '1054_Old-stone-house_4.jpg', '1054_Old-stone-house_5.jpg', '1054_Old-stone-house_6.jpg', '1054_Old-stone-house_7.jpg', '1054_Old-stone-house_8.jpg'),
(1055, 'Ivan', 'Anðeliæ', '', '091 5120370', '', 'Trogir', 'Vini¹æe', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '50', '330', '167', 1, '500000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 1, 4, 4, 'February 9, 2015', '<p>Luksuzno ureðena vila s bazenom, na atraktivnom mirnom mjestu s pogledom na more. Udaljenost do lijepo ureðene pla¾e je 50 m. Stambena povr&scaron;ina je netto 167 m2. Vila je podijeljena na dvije eta¾e: prizemlje i prvi kat. Kuæa se prodaje s kvalitetnim i luksuzno ureðenim interijerom. Vila ima vlastitu gara¾u povr&scaron;ine 60 m2, a uz kuæu se nalaze i dva parking mjesta. Vila ima vlastiti vez za brod.</p>', '<p>We are offering this modern, luxury villa with a swimming pool in a great location above the shore.&nbsp;The distance to the clear sea and access to the water is just 50 m.&nbsp;The living area inside the property is 167 m2 net and the plot area is 330 m2. The villa is divided into two floors: ground floor and first floor.&nbsp;The house is sold with all the furniture and luxury fittings ready for immediate living.&nbsp;The villa has a private garage of 60 m2, and the house has an additional two parking spaces.</p>', '', '<p>Luksuzno ureðena vila s bazenom, na atraktivnom mirnom mjestu s pogledom na more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Udaljenost do lijepo ureðene pla¾e je 50 m.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Stambena povr&scaron;ina je netto 167 m2. Vila je podijeljena na dvije eta¾e: prizemlje i prvi kat.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Prizemlje se sastoji od prostranog dnevnog boravka, blagovaonice i kuhinje, te spavaæe sobe i kupaonice. Iz dnevnog boravka, a i iz spavaæe sobe se izlazi na veliku natkrivenu terasu u sklopu koje se nalazi bazen, a s koje se pru¾a pogled na more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na prvom katu se nalaze tri spavaæe sobe, svaka sa svojom pripadajuæom kupaonicom, garderoba i praonica. Iz svake sobe je izlaz na terasu s kojih se pru¾a otvoreni pogled na more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa se prodaje s kvalitetnim i luksuzno ureðenim interijerom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Vila ima vlastitu gara¾u povr&scaron;ine 60 m2, a uz kuæu se nalaze i dva parking mjesta.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Povr&scaron;ina parcele je 330 m2. Okuænica je kultivirana mediteranskim biljem.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Vila ima vlastiti vez za brod.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Od centra mjesta, restorana, kafiæa i trgovina kuæa je udaljena svega kilometar.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Udaljenost do Trogira je 12 km, a do aerodroma 15 km.</p>', '<p>We are offering this modern, luxury villa with a swimming pool in a great location above the shore.<br /><br /><br />The distance to the clear sea and access to the water is just 50 m.<br /><br /><br />The living area inside the property is 167 m2 net and the plot area is 330 m2. The villa is divided into two floors: ground floor and first floor.<br /><br /><br />The ground floor consists of a spacious open plan living room, dining room, kitchen and a bedroom and bathroom. From the living room, as well as from the bedrooms, sliding doors open onto a large covered terrace, with the swimming pool, and sun patio which offers views of the sea.<br /><br /><br />On the first floor there are three bedrooms, each with en suite bathroom, and dressing room. Each room has a balcony with sea views.<br /><br /><br />The house is sold with all the furniture and luxury fittings ready for immediate living.<br /><br /><br />The villa has a private garage of 60 m2, and the house has an additional two parking spaces.<br /><br /><br />The villa has its own private mooring.<br /><br /><br />The garden has been planted with appropriate Mediterranean plants and herbs, needing little maintenance.<br /><br /><br />The distance to the town centre with restaurants, cafes, shops and other services it is about 1 mile. Distance from Trogir is 12 km and the airport 15 km.<br /><br /><br />For any question or viewing please call our Split office.</p>', '', '1055_House-Villa_0.jpg', '1055_House-Villa_1.jpg', '1055_House-Villa_2.jpg', '1055_House-Villa_3.jpg', '1055_House-Villa_4.jpg', '1055_House-Villa_5.jpg', '1055_House-Villa_6.jpg', '1055_House-Villa_7.jpg', '1055_House-Villa_8.jpg');
INSERT INTO `nekretnina` (`id`, `ime`, `prezime`, `telefon`, `mobitel`, `e_mail`, `lokacija_id`, `adresa`, `status_id`, `vrsta_id`, `udaljenost`, `povrsina`, `stambenapovrsina`, `display`, `cijena`, `cijenatocka`, `ponuda_tjedna`, `new_built`, `must_sell`, `prvi_red_do_mora`, `pogled_na_more`, `bazen`, `broj_soba`, `broj_kupatila`, `datum`, `title_hr`, `title_en`, `title_ge`, `opis_hr`, `opis_en`, `opis_ge`, `PropertyImageURL0`, `PropertyImageURL1`, `PropertyImageURL2`, `PropertyImageURL3`, `PropertyImageURL4`, `PropertyImageURL5`, `PropertyImageURL6`, `PropertyImageURL7`, `PropertyImageURL8`) VALUES
(1056, 'Smiljka', 'Alar', '', '098 836 113, 098 931 2637', 'smiljka.alar@gmail.com', 'Trogir', 'Vini¹æe, Baèine 23, ', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '40', '210', '150', 2, '180000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 4, 3, 'February 9, 2015', '<p>Na mirnoj atraktivnoj lokaciji na svega 40 m udaljenosti od mora nalazi se ova samostojeæa kuæa s koje se pru¾a pogled na more i mjesto. Povr&scaron;ina kuæe je 150 m2, a nalazi se na parceli povr&scaron;ine 210 m2. Kuæa je podijeljena na suteren, prizemlje i potkrovlje. Kuæa je na svega 40 m udaljenosti od mora i rive, a u neposrednoj blizini su &nbsp;duæani, restorani i kafiæi. Udaljenost do Trogira je 12 km, a do aerodroma 15 km.</p>', '<p>We are pleased to offer this holiday villa, in an attractive location near the shore, with views of the sea and the village.&nbsp;It is just 40m from the water''s edge, with a direct track to the sea from the garden.&nbsp;The house size is 150 m2 and it is located on a plot of 210 m2. It is divided into a basement, ground floor and first floor.&nbsp;The courtyard is beautifully decorated with Mediterranean plants, many of them are herbs.&nbsp;Distance from Trogir is 12 km and the airport 15 km.</p>', '', '<p>Na mirnoj atraktivnoj lokaciji na svega 40 m udaljenosti od mora nalazi se ova samostojeæa kuæa s koje se pru¾a pogled na more i mjesto.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Povr&scaron;ina kuæe je 150 m2, a nalazi se na parceli povr&scaron;ine 210 m2. Kuæa je podijeljena na suteren, prizemlje i potkrovlje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U suterenu se nalazi jednosoban apartman sa spavaæom sobom, dnevnim boravkom, kuhinjom , blagovaonicom i kupaonicom. Isti takav apartman nalazi se i u potkrovlju.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U prizemlju je dvosoban apartman sa dvije spavaæe sobe, dnevnim boravkom, kuhinjom i kupaonicom. Izlaz je na terasu povr&scaron;ine 20 m2, s koje se pru¾a lijep pogled na more i mjesto.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartmani su namje&scaron;teni i klimatizirani.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Okuænica je lijepo ureðena s mediteranskim biljem. Kuæa ima vlastiti parking.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je na svega 40 m udaljenosti od mora i rive, a u neposrednoj blizini su &nbsp;duæani, restorani i kafiæi.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Udaljenost do Trogira je 12 km, a do aerodroma 15 km.</p>', '<p>We are pleased to offer this holiday villa, in an attractive location near the shore, with views of the sea and the village.<br /><br /><br />It is just 40m from the water''s edge, with a direct track to the sea from the garden.<br /><br /><br />The house size is 150 m2 and it is located on a plot of 210 m2. It is divided into a basement, ground floor and first floor.<br /><br /><br />In the basement there is a one bedroom apartment with a bedroom, living room, kitchen, dining room and bathroom.<br /><br /><br />The ground floor is a two bedroom apartment with two bedrooms, living room, kitchen and bathroom. From the living room there is access to the terrace of 20 m2, which offers a nice view of the sea and the old village.<br /><br /><br />The top floor is another one bedroom apartment, with the same layout as the one in the basement.<br /><br /><br />All apartments are furnished and air conditioned.<br /><br /><br />The house has its own parking.&nbsp;<br /><br /><br />The courtyard is beautifully decorated with Mediterranean plants, many of them are herbs.<br /><br /><br />A short walk along the shore path brings you to a selection of family run bars, caf&eacute;s and shops. Nearby are other services for the locals and tourists alike.<br /><br /><br />Distance from Trogir is 12 km and the airport 15 km.<br /><br /><br />For any question or viewing please call our Split office.</p>', '', '1056_House-Villa_0.jpg', '1056_House-Villa_1.jpg', '1056_House-Villa_2.jpg', '1056_House-Villa_3.jpg', '1056_House-Villa_4.jpg', '1056_House-Villa_5.jpg', '1056_House-Villa_6.jpg', '1056_House-Villa_7.jpg', '1056_House-Villa_8.jpg'),
(1057, 'Ivan', 'Mlaèiæ', '', '00381602072231', 'mlacicdarko@gmail.com', 'Trogir', 'Vini¹æe, Vini¹ka 39, ', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '500', '423', '300', 1, '260000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 5, 2, 'February 9, 2015', '<p>Samostojeæa obiteljska kuæa koja se mo¾e koristiti i kao apartmanska kuæa, nalazi se na mirnoj lokaciji koja je 500 m udaljena od ureðene pla¾e, restorana, duæana i kafiæa. Kuæa je povr&scaron;ine 300 m2. Podijeljena je na prizemlje, kat i visoko potkrovlje. Prednost ove kuæe osim pogleda na more i blizine pla¾e je i moguænost nadogradnje kao i izgradnje bazena na parceli. Udaljenost do Trogira je 12 km, a do aerodroma 15 km.</p>', '<p>We have this detached family house that can be used for family holidays or as an apartment house, situated in the centre of this popular resort. It is situated in a quiet location, 500m from the sea and small harbour, but close to many different shops, bars and coffee shops, bakery etc. The plot of 423 m2 is planted with native plants, many herbs and fruit trees. The house has an area of 300 m2 and is divided into ground floor, first floor and attic. Distance from Trogir is 12 km and the airport 15 km.</p>', '', '<p>Samostojeæa obiteljska kuæa koja se mo¾e koristiti i kao apartmanska kuæa, nalazi se na mirnoj lokaciji koja je 500 m udaljena od ureðene pla¾e, restorana, duæana i kafiæa.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je povr&scaron;ine 300 m2. Podijeljena je na prizemlje, kat i visoko potkrovlje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U prizemlju se nalazi spavaæa soba, kupaonica i dnevni boravak s kuhinjom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na katu se nalaze 4 spavaæe sobe i kupaonica kao i terasa s koje se pru¾a pogled na more i mjesto.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Visoko potkrovlje nije ureðeno.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Cijela kuæa zahtjeva renoviranje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Parcela povr&scaron;ine 423 m2 je kultivirana.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Prednost ove kuæe osim pogleda na more i blizine pla¾e je i moguænost nadogradnje kao i izgradnje bazena na parceli.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa ima svu potrebnu infrastrukturu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Udaljenost do Trogira je 12 km, a do aerodroma 15 km.</p>', '<p>We have this detached family house that can be used for family holidays or as an apartment house, situated in the centre of this popular resort.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is situated in a quiet location, 500m from the sea and small harbour, but close to many different shops, bars and coffee shops, bakery etc.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The plot of 423 m2 is planted with native plants, many herbs and fruit trees.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house has an area of 300 m2 and is divided into ground floor, first floor and attic.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The ground floor has one bedroom, bathroom and living room with kitchen.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Upstairs are four bedrooms and a bathroom and access to the balcony with a view of the sea and the resort.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The attic has not been decorated, but presents an opportunity for a new owner.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The whole house needs redecorating.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>One advantage of this house, as well as the sea views and proximity to the beach is the ability to improve it and build a swimming pool in the grounds.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Distance from Trogir is 12 km and the airport 15 km.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For more info please contact our Split office.</p>', '', '1057_House-Villa_0.jpg', '1057_House-Villa_1.jpg', '1057_House-Villa_2.jpg', '1057_House-Villa_3.jpg', '1057_House-Villa_4.jpg', '1057_House-Villa_5.jpg', '1057_House-Villa_6.jpg', '1057_House-Villa_7.jpg', '1057_House-Villa_8.jpg'),
(1058, 'Marko', 'Propadalo', '', '+385914312405, +385916600032', 'dukaivan@yahoo.com', 'Murter', 'Betina, ®al 13 ispod crkve,  k.è.br. 698 ZGR, zk.ul.br. 2984 k.o. Murter Betina', 'For sale', 'Old stone house', '100', '270', '135', 2, '230000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 3, 3, 'February 9, 2015', '<p>U potpunosti renovirana samostojeæa kamena kuæa na svega 100 m od mora. S kuæe se pru¾a pogled na more, marinu i otoèje. Povr&scaron;ina kuæe iznosi 135 m2, a sastoji se od tri spavaæe sobe, dnevnog boravka, kuhinje, blagovaonice i kupaone. Kuæa je u potpunosti ureðena, opremljena i klimatizirana. Adaptacija kuæe je izvr&scaron;ena 2014/2015. Kuæa ima 3 parkirna mjesta.</p>', '<p>We are offering this completely renovated stone house only 100 m from the sea and harbour, with great views of the sea, marina and islands.&nbsp;The property is situated in the village and is close to bars, caf&eacute;s restaurants and other facilities and services.&nbsp;The living area of the property is 135 m2 and it consists of three bedrooms, living room, kitchen, dining room and bathroom.&nbsp;The house is fully furnished, equipped and air conditioned.&nbsp;The recondition of the house, both inside and outside, took place in 2014/2015.</p>', '', '<p>U potpunosti renovirana samostojeæa kamena kuæa na svega 100 m od mora. S kuæe se pru¾a pogled na more, marinu i otoèje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Povr&scaron;ina kuæe iznosi 135 m2, a sastoji se od tri spavaæe sobe, dnevnog boravka, kuhinje, blagovaonice i kupaone.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je u potpunosti ureðena, opremljena i klimatizirana.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Adaptacija kuæe je izvr&scaron;ena 2014/2015.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Parcela je povr&scaron;ine 270 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa ima 3 parkirna mjesta.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>S obzirom da se kuæa nalazi u malom turistièkom dalmatinskom mjestu svi sadr¾aji: trgovine, restorani i kafiæi su u neposrednoj blizini.</p>', '<p>We are offering this completely renovated stone house only 100 m from the sea and harbour, with great views of the sea, marina and islands.<br /><br /><br />Murter is an island near town Sibenik and connected with bridge to the mainland. The property is situated in the village and is close to bars, caf&eacute;s restaurants and other facilities and services.<br /><br /><br />The living area of the property is 135 m2 and it consists of three bedrooms, living room, kitchen, dining room and bathroom.<br /><br /><br />The house is fully furnished, equipped and air conditioned.<br /><br /><br />The recondition of the house, both inside and outside, took place in 2014/2015.<br /><br /><br />The plot is 270 m2. The house has 3 parking spaces.<br /><br /><br />Sibenik is 20 mins drive. Split or Zadar airport is an hour drive.<br /><br /><br />Please contact our office to arrange to visit this property.</p>', '', '1058_Old-stone-house_0.jpg', '1058_Old-stone-house_1.jpg', '1058_Old-stone-house_2.jpg', '1058_Old-stone-house_3.jpg', '1058_Old-stone-house_4.jpg', '1058_Old-stone-house_5.jpg', '1058_Old-stone-house_6.jpg', '1058_Old-stone-house_7.jpg', '1058_Old-stone-house_8.jpg'),
(1059, 'Davor i Jure', 'Neve¹èanin', 'jurenevescanin@gmail.com', '0916885160   0976207769', 'davor.nevescanin@brodotrogir.hr', 'Trogir', 'Marina', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '100', '135', '150', 2, '160000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 3, 2, 'February 9, 2015', '<p>U samom centru prekrasnog dalmatinskog turistièkog mjesta, na svega 150 m udaljenosti od mora nalazi se obiteljska kuæa. S kuæe se pru¾a predivan pogled na more, marinu i mjesto. Povr&scaron;ina stambenog dijela kuæe iznosi 100 m2, a parcele 364 m2. Kuæa je podijeljena na prizemlje i kat. Kuæa je u potpunosti renovirana i ureðena.</p>', '<p>We are pleased to offer this detached family villa in a stunning village location.&nbsp;It is situated on the mainland, in the centre of a beautiful Dalmatian tourist resort, only 150 meters from the sea but with great views across the bay and harbour because of the gently sloping geography of the bay.&nbsp;The size of the living area in the house is 100 m2 and the plot size is 364 m2. The house is divided into two floors.&nbsp;The house has been completely renovated, modernised and decorated.</p>', '', '<p>U samom centru prekrasnog dalmatinskog turistièkog mjesta, na svega 150 m udaljenosti od mora nalazi se obiteljska kuæa.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>S kuæe se pru¾a predivan pogled na more, marinu i mjesto.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Povr&scaron;ina stambenog dijela kuæe iznosi 100 m2, a parcele 364 m2. Kuæa je podijeljena na prizemlje i kat.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U prizemlju se nalazi dnevni boravak, kuhinja s blagovaonicom i kupatilo.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na katu se nalaze tri spavaæe sobe i kupaonica.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je u potpunosti renovirana i ureðena.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U sklopu parcele nalazi se jedno parking mjesto.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Do ureðene pla¾e mo¾e se doæi za samo par minuta hoda (150 m).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>S obzirom da se kuæa nalazi u samom centru mjesta u blizini se nalaze&nbsp; trgovine, kafiæi i restorani.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa ima svu potrebnu infrastrukturu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Parcela je poploèana (bez zelenila), tako da se pru¾a moguænost ureðenja po vlastitim ¾eljama.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Zahvaljujuæi dobroj prometnoj povezanosti udaljenost do Trogira je 12 km, a do aerodroma 15 km. Split je na 36 km udaljenosti.</p>', '<p>We are pleased to offer this detached family villa in a stunning village location.<br /><br /><br />It is situated on the mainland, in the centre of a beautiful Dalmatian tourist resort, only 150 meters from the sea but with great views across the bay and harbour because of the gently sloping geography of the bay.<br /><br /><br />The size of the living area in the house is 100 m2 and the plot size is 364 m2. The house is divided into two floors.<br /><br /><br />The ground floor has an open plan living room, kitchen and bathroom.<br /><br /><br />Upstairs are three bedrooms and a bathroom.<br /><br /><br />The house has been completely renovated, modernised and decorated, and now has a well presented and practical interior.<br /><br /><br />The beaches can be reached in just a few minutes walk, with a direct path to the shore and a path along the shore leading to the harbour. Here are many family shops, bars, restaurants and other services useful for tourists and the locals alike.<br /><br /><br />The plot is paved (no green), so that there is a possibility to arrange at their own wishes, but it includes private parking.<br /><br /><br />It is a fast journey to Trogir and the airport because of the good transport connections. Split is 36 km away.<br /><br /><br />Please contact our office for more information and for us to arrange a viewing.</p>', '', '1059_House-Villa_0.jpg', '1059_House-Villa_1.jpg', '1059_House-Villa_2.jpg', '1059_House-Villa_3.jpg', '1059_House-Villa_4.jpg', '1059_House-Villa_5.jpg', '1059_House-Villa_6.jpg', '1059_House-Villa_7.jpg', '1059_House-Villa_8.jpg'),
(1060, 'Oskar', 'Rukavina', '', '098 723 592', 'oskar.rukavina@optinet.hr', 'Primosten', 'Primo¹ten, Podakraje 30A  kè 51 ko primo¹ten ', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '30', '0', '181', 1, '390000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 6, 3, 'February 17, 2015', '<p>Dvojna kuæa u samom centru otoka na svega 30 m udaljenosti od mora. Kuæa je uvuèena, na vrhu kale, tako da iako se nalazi u centru mjesta osigurani su mir i privatnost. S prekrasnim pogledom na more ova kuæa je iznimna prilika. Kuæa je povr&scaron;ine 181 m2, a sastoji se od prizemlja i dva kata. Kuæa je adaptirana 2013 godine.</p>', '<p>We are offering this semi-detached house in the centre of the old village, 30m from the sea.&nbsp;It is situated at the top of a short &lsquo;pedestrian only&rsquo; alley, a few minutes from the sea, and in a place guaranteeing peace and privacy.&nbsp;The house has an area of 181 m2 and consists of a ground, first and second floors.&nbsp;The house was renovated and redecorated to a high standard in 2013.</p>', '', '<p>Dvojna kuæa u samom centru otoka na svega 30 m udaljenosti od mora.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je uvuèena, na vrhu kale, tako da iako se nalazi u centru mjesta osigurani su mir i privatnost.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>S prekrasnim pogledom na more ova kuæa je iznimna prilika.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je povr&scaron;ine 181 m2, a sastoji se od prizemlja i dva kata.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U prizemlju se nalazi dnevni boravak s kuhinjom i blagovaonicom, spavaæa soba i kupaonica.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na 1. katu se nalaze tri spavaæe sobe, dnevni boravak s kuhinjom i blagovaonicom te kupaonica. S balkona se pru¾a pogled na more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na 2. katu se nalaze dvije spavaæe sobe, kupaonica, dnevni boravak s kuhinjom i blagovaonicom iz kojeg se izlazi na terasu. Iz dnevnog boravka i s terase se pru¾a prekrasan pogled na more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U potpunosti ureðena kuæa trenutno se koristi u turistièke svrhe, iznajmljivanje apartmana, ali kuæa se mo¾e koristiti i kao obiteljska kuæa za odmor u prekrasnom Dalmatinskom mjestu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Okuænica je povr&scaron;ine 20 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je adaptirana 2013 godine.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na svega par stotina metara od kuæe nalazi se centar mjesta s restoranima, kafiæima, trgovinama i ureðenom pla¾om.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Parking je javni, a s autom se mo¾e doæi na 30 m udaljenosti od kuæe.</p>', '<p>We are offering this semi-detached house in the centre of the old village, 30m from the sea.<br /><br /><br />It is situated at the top of a short &lsquo;pedestrian only&rsquo; alley, a few minutes from the sea, and in a place guaranteeing peace and privacy.<br /><br /><br />The house has an area of 181 m2 and consists of a ground, first and second floors.<br /><br /><br />On the ground floor there is a living room with kitchen and dining room, bedroom and bathroom.<br /><br /><br />On the first floor there are three bedrooms, and bathroom, living room with kitchen and dining room with doors leading directly onto a wide balcony with sea views.<br /><br /><br />On the second floor there are two bedrooms, bathroom, living room with kitchen and dining room from which exit to the terrace. From the living room and the terrace offers a breathtaking view of the sea.<br /><br /><br />The fully furnished house is currently being used for tourist purposes, apartments for rent, but the house can be used as a family holiday home in beautiful Dalmatia.<br /><br /><br />The land area outside is 20 m2.<br /><br /><br />The house was renovated and redecorated to a high standard in 2013.<br /><br /><br />A short walk from the property is the very centre of the village, with restaurants, cafes, shops and the most popular beach.<br /><br /><br />Parking is 30 m from the house.<br /><br /><br />Call for more information or to arrange a viewing of the property!</p>', '', '1060_House-Villa_0.jpg', '1060_House-Villa_1.jpg', '1060_House-Villa_2.jpg', '1060_House-Villa_3.jpg', '1060_House-Villa_4.jpg', '1060_House-Villa_5.jpg', '1060_House-Villa_6.jpg', '', ''),
(1061, 'dr.Tomasoviæ -', '- vlasnik 0912310004', 'Tomiæ  (kljuc) 0989060502', '', '', 'Omis', 'Lokva Rogoznica, Ruskamen, ', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '200', '800', '1000', 1, '800000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 8, 8, 'February 20, 2015', '<p>Kamena vila s 8 apartmana, pogledom na more i otoèje smje&scaron;tena je na prekrasnoj terasasto izvedenoj, kultiviranoj parceli od 1000 m2. Udaljenost do ureðene pla¾e, kafiæa i restorana je 200 m. Vila je ukupne stambene povr&scaron;ine 800 m2, a podijeljena na prizemlje, dva kata i potkrovlje. Svaki apartman ima terasu s pogledom na more. S obzirom na velièinu parcele na njoj je moguæe izgraditi i bazen.</p>', '<p>We are offering this magnificent stone villa designed with 8 stylishly designed apartments.&nbsp;It is situated 200m from the shore and beaches where there are cafes, shops and restaurants and the distance to Omis is 7 km and to Split is 30km.&nbsp;The villa has a total floor area of 800 m2 and is divided on the ground floor, two floors and penthouse on the top floor.&nbsp;One of the superb features about this elegant looking block are the wide balconies running the entire length of each floor.&nbsp;Each has stunning views.</p>', '', '<p>Kamena vila s &nbsp;8 apartmana, pogledom na more i otoèje smje&scaron;tena je na prekrasnoj terasasto izvedenoj, kultiviranoj parceli od 1000 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Udaljenost do ureðene pla¾e, kafiæa i restorana je 200 m.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Vila je ukupne stambene povr&scaron;ine 800 m2, a podijeljena na prizemlje, dva kata i potkrovlje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U prizemlju se nalazi jednosoban apartman i tri gara¾e.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na prvom i drugom katu su dva jednosobna apartmana, kao i u potkrovlju.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Zasebni studio apartman nalazi se na nivou prvog kata.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Svaki apartman ima terasu s pogledom na more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ispred kuæe osigurano je vi&scaron;e parkirnih mjesta.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>S obzirom na velièinu parcele na njoj je moguæe izgraditi i bazen.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa se veæ nekoliko godina koristi u turistièke svrhe.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Udaljenost do Omi&scaron;a je 7 km, a do aerodroma 50 km.</p>', '<p>We are offering this magnificent stone villa designed with 8 stylishly designed apartments.<br /><br /><br />It is situated 200m from the shore and beaches where there are cafes, shops and restaurants and the distance to Omis is 7 km and to Split is 30km.<br /><br /><br />The villa has a total floor area of 800 m2 and is divided on the ground floor, two floors and penthouse on the top floor.<br /><br /><br />The ground floor is designed as a one bedroom apartment and three garages.<br /><br /><br />The first and second floor there are two one-bedroom apartments, which is the same as the top floor.<br /><br /><br />Private studio apartment is located on the first floor level.<br /><br /><br />One of the superb features about this elegant looking block are the wide balconies running the entire length of each floor.<br /><br /><br />Each has stunning views, and there is enough space and privacy for alfresco dining and relaxing in comfort.<br /><br /><br />Each apartment has access to the balcony through the opening lounge windows.<br /><br /><br />In front of the house there are more parking spaces, for guests and visitors.<br /><br /><br />Given the size of the parcel of land, it is possible to build a swimming pool.<br /><br /><br />The house has been used for tourism purposes for several years and has built up an established base of clients returning as well as being popular with new visitors looking for a seaside holiday on this superb part of the coast.<br /><br /><br />Please call our office in Split for a tour of the property.</p>', '', '1061_House-Villa_0.jpg', '1061_House-Villa_1.jpg', '1061_House-Villa_2.jpg', '1061_House-Villa_3.jpg', '1061_House-Villa_4.jpg', '1061_House-Villa_5.jpg', '1061_House-Villa_6.jpg', '1061_House-Villa_7.jpg', '1061_House-Villa_8.jpg'),
(1062, 'Jo¹ko', 'Agliæ', '', '092 2695488', '', 'Rogoznica', 'Ljolijnica ', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '10', '320', '176', 2, '650000', '', 2, 2, 2, 1, 1, 2, 4, 2, 'February 20, 2015', '<p>Na svega par metara od mora s vlastitim pristupom prirodnoj pla¾i nalazi se kuæa na kultiviranoj parceli, okru¾ena mediteranskim biljem. Kuæa je povr&scaron;ine 176 m2, a podijeljena je na kat i prizemlje. U sklopu parcele pored kuæe nalazi se i mali studio apartman povr&scaron;ine 45 m2. Iza kuæe osigurana su dva parking mjesta. Splitski aerodrom je udaljen 20-ak minuta vo¾nje.</p>', '<p>We are pleased to offer this detached house, in need of renovation, in a prime location with a large garden leading straight into the sea.&nbsp;It is located on the mainland, north of Trogir, on a large plot and with great views, but walking distance along the shore to restaurants, bars and shops in the village centre.&nbsp;The house living area is 176 m2 and it is built with a ground and first floor.&nbsp;Behind the house, off the road are provided two parking spaces.&nbsp;Split Airport is a 20-minute drive.</p>', '', '<p>Na svega par metara od mora s vlastitim pristupom prirodnoj pla¾i nalazi se kuæa na kultiviranoj parceli, okru¾ena mediteranskim biljem.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je povr&scaron;ine 176 m2, a podijeljena je na kat i prizemlje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U prizemlju se nalazi dnevni boravak s kuhinjom, blagovaonicom, kupaonicom i spavaæom sobom. Iz dnevnog boravka izlazi se na terasu s koje se pru¾a pogled na more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na katu se nalaze dvije spavaæe sobe, kuhinja s dnevnim boravkom i kupaonica. S terase se pru¾a pogled na more i marinu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U sklopu parcele pored kuæe nalazi se i mali studio apartman povr&scaron;ine 45 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæi je potrebna renovacija.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Iza kuæe osigurana su dva parking mjesta.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na parceli povr&scaron;ine 320 m2 moguæe je izgraditi bazen.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa ima svu potrebnu infrastrukturu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Splitski aerodrom je udaljen 20-ak minuta vo¾nje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Restorani i kafiæi se nalaze u neposrednoj blizini.</p>', '<p>We are pleased to offer this detached house, in need of renovation, in a prime location with a large garden leading straight into the sea.<br /><br /><br />It is located on the mainland, north of Trogir, on a large plot and with great views, but walking distance along the shore to restaurants, bars and shops in the village centre.<br /><br /><br />The house living area is 176 m2 and it is built with a ground and first floor.<br /><br /><br />On the ground floor there is a living room with kitchen, dining room, bathroom and bedroom and from the living room there are opening windows leading onto a terrace, just above the sea.<br /><br /><br />Upstairs are two bedrooms, kitchen, living room and bathroom.<br /><br /><br />As part of the property there is an additional small studio apartment of 45 m2.<br /><br /><br />The house needs renovation to restore it to its former splendour.<br /><br /><br />Behind the house, off the road are provided two parking spaces.<br /><br /><br />The plot size is 320m sq and there is enough space to build a swimming pool, if the owners so wished.<br /><br /><br />Split Airport is a 20-minute drive.<br /><br /><br />Please contact our agents for more information or to arrange a viewing of this property.</p>', '', '1062_House-Villa_0.jpg', '1062_House-Villa_1.jpg', '1062_House-Villa_2.jpg', '1062_House-Villa_3.jpg', '1062_House-Villa_4.jpg', '1062_House-Villa_5.jpg', '', '', ''),
(1063, 'Ivica', 'Markotiæ', '095 90 33 289 ', 'Darijan 095 90 333 06', '', 'Trogir', 'Marina, Preko Dobreèeva 23, ', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '250', '940', '700', 1, '890000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 13, 8, 'February 20, 2015', '<p>Apartmanska kuæa ju¾ne orijentacije s prekrasnim pogledom na more i Marinu, u potpunosti ureðena s uhodanim poslom iznajmljivanja apartmana. Kuæa se sastoji od apartmanskog dijela i privatnog dijela. U sklopu apartmanskog dijela nalaze se: 4 jednosobna apartmana (povr&scaron;ine 40 m2) i tri dvosobna apartmana (povr&scaron;ine 66 m2). Privatni dio sastoji se od dvoeta¾nog stana povr&scaron;ine 250 m2. S obzirom na polo¾aj u kuæi je osigurana privatnost i mir.</p>', '<p>We are pleased to offer this modern and well presented apartment house, facing south, overlooking the sea in the beautiful village of Marina. It is situated on a gentle slope, elevated above the village, which gives excellent views of the sea. The house consists of two parts, the apartments part and the private part for owner. In the apartment part are: 4 one-bedroom apartments (40 m2) and 3 two-bedroom apartments (66 m2). The family part&nbsp;consists of a two-storey apartment of 250 m2.</p>', '', '<p>Apartmanska kuæa ju¾ne orijentacije s prekrasnim pogledom na more i Marinu, u potpunosti ureðena s uhodanim poslom iznajmljivanja apartmana.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa se sastoji od apartmanskog dijela i privatnog dijela.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U sklopu apartmanskog dijela nalaze se: 4 jednosobna apartmana (povr&scaron;ine 40 m2) i tri dvosobna apartmana (povr&scaron;ine 66 m2). Svi apartmani imaju izlaz na terasu s koje se pru¾a pogled na more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Privatni dio sastoji se od dvoeta¾nog stana povr&scaron;ine 250 m2 koji se sastoji od velikog dnevnog boravka s blagovaonicom, kuhinjom i kupaonicom na donjem katu i tri spavaæe sobe s kupaonicom na gornjem katu. S terase se pru¾a pogled na more i okolicu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ispod stambenog dijela nalaze se gara¾a povr&scaron;ine 24 m2 i podrum ispod povr&scaron;ine 70 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U sklopu parcele nalazi se mala kuæica koja ima dozvolu za kori&scaron;tenje kao poslovni prostor 20 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Parcela je ureðena s moguæno&scaron;æu izgradnje bazena na njoj.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa ima svu potrebnu infrastrukturu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>S obzirom na polo¾aj u kuæi je osigurana privatnost i mir. U sklopu parcele nalazi se 11 parking mjesta.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Udaljenost od centra Marine je svega par kilometara, od Trogira 12 km, a od aerodroma 15 km.</p>', '<p>We are pleased to offer this modern and well presented apartment house, facing south, overlooking the sea in the beautiful village of Marina.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is situated on a gentle slope, elevated above the village, which gives excellent views of the sea, the islands, the village and natural surrounding countryside.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property is an established &lsquo;holiday letting&rsquo; business, and the apartments are being sold fully furnished so this business of tourism and renting apartments may continue.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house consists of two parts, the apartments part and the private part for owner.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;">In the apartment part are</span>: 4 one-bedroom apartments (40 m2) and 3 two-bedroom apartments (66 m2).&nbsp;All apartments have terraces with a view of the sea.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;">The family part </span>consists of a two-storey apartment of 250 m2, which consists of a large living room, dining room, kitchen and bathroom downstairs and three bedrooms with a bathroom on the upper floor. The terrace offers views of the sea and the countryside.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Below the residential section there is a garage of 24 m2 and a basement beneath with an area of 70 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Within the plot there is another small building, which has a license for use as office space 20 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The plot is planted with trees and shrubs, needing little maintenance and there is enough space to improve the site by building a swimming pool and patio area.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property has been used for tourism for many years, with many customers returning year on year, but it is also highly rated by &lsquo;trip advisor&rsquo; which brings in many guests.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Within the plot there are 11 parking spaces.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Distance from the centre of Marina and the harbour is only a few kilometers away, Trogir 12 km from Split airport is15 km.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For more information or viewing call our Split agents.</p>', '', '1063_House-Villa_0.jpg', '1063_House-Villa_1.jpg', '1063_House-Villa_2.jpg', '1063_House-Villa_3.jpg', '1063_House-Villa_4.jpg', '1063_House-Villa_5.jpg', '1063_House-Villa_6.jpg', '1063_House-Villa_7.jpg', '1063_House-Villa_8.jpg'),
(1064, 'Domagoj', 'Periæ', '', '0913655850', '', 'Omis', 'Lokva Rogoznica, Iva¹njak, kè. 4145/10', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '200', '800', '400', 1, '740000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 1, 14, 8, 'February 20, 2015', '<p>Prekrasna vila s 8 apartmana i uhodanim poslom iznajmljivanja na predjelu Omi&scaron;ke rivijere. Vila je smje&scaron;tena na prekrasno ureðenoj parceli na rubu borove &scaron;ume tako da osim pogleda na more potpuni mediteranski ugoðaj pru¾a mir i ti&scaron;ina u sjeni borovih drveæa. S obzirom da je vila ju¾ne orijentacije iz svih apartmana i njihovih pripadajuæih terasa pru¾a se pogled na more. Povr&scaron;ina vile je 400 m2, a sastoji se od prizemlja, dva kata i potkrovlja.</p>', '<p>We are offering this entire apartment block with eight apartments and an established business renting in the area of Riviera Omis. The villa is situated on a beautiful cultivated plot on the edge of a pine forest so that the fabulous views of the open sea are complemented by the natural fragrance given by the pine trees, and other herbs in the garden. The villa faces south and all apartments and their terraces overlook the sea. The living area in the villa is 400 m2 and it consists of a ground, first, second floor, and penthouse.</p>', '', '<p>Prekrasna vila s 8 apartmana i uhodanim poslom iznajmljivanja na predjelu Omi&scaron;ke rivijere.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Vila je smje&scaron;tena na prekrasno ureðenoj parceli na rubu borove &scaron;ume tako da osim pogleda na more potpuni mediteranski ugoðaj pru¾a mir i ti&scaron;ina u sjeni borovih drveæa.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>S obzirom da je vila ju¾ne orijentacije iz svih apartmana i njihovih pripadajuæih terasa pru¾a se pogled na more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Udaljenost do pla¾e je 200 m.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Povr&scaron;ina vile je 400 m2, a sastoji se od prizemlja, dva kata i potkrovlja.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U prizemlju su tri jednosobna apartmana, na prvom i drugom katu su po dva jednosobna apartmana, a u potkrovlju je studio apartman.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na parceli povr&scaron;ine 800 m2 nalazi se bazen, djeèje igrali&scaron;te, vanjski ro&scaron;tilj i prostorija za fitnes.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Udaljenost do Omi&scaron;a je 7 km, a do aerodroma 50 km.</p>', '<p>We are offering this entire apartment block with eight apartments and an established business renting in the area of Riviera Omis.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The villa is situated on a beautiful cultivated plot on the edge of a pine forest so that the fabulous views of the open sea are complemented by the natural fragrance given by the pine trees, and other herbs in the garden.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The villa faces south and all apartments and their terraces overlook the sea.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The living area in the villa is 400 m2 and it consists of a ground, first, second floor, and penthouse.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the ground floor are three 1bedroom apartments.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>First floor are two 1bedroom apartments.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Second floor are two 1bedroom apartments.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The penthouse is one studio apartment.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The plot measures 800 m2. The grounds have been landscaped to include a patio and private swimming pool.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property also has a gym room and a bbq / fire place.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The distance to the beach is 200 m.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>This is always a superb attraction for tourists wanting a luxury holiday on Croatia&rsquo;s coast.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Distance to Omis is 7 km, to Split airport is 50 km.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact our office to arrange to view this property.</p>', '', '1064_House-Villa_0.jpg', '1064_House-Villa_1.jpg', '1064_House-Villa_2.jpg', '1064_House-Villa_3.jpg', '1064_House-Villa_4.jpg', '1064_House-Villa_5.jpg', '1064_House-Villa_6.jpg', '1064_House-Villa_7.jpg', '1064_House-Villa_8.jpg'),
(1065, 'Nada', 'Osekovac', '', '091 1556791', 'nipos@os.t-com.hr', 'Trogir', 'Marina, k.è. 2967/12', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '100', '650', '495', 1, '490000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 10, 6, 'February 20, 2015', '<p>Kuæa sa &scaron;est apartmana, ju¾ne orijentacije s pogledom na more i Marinu nalazi se na 200 m udaljenosti od mora. Kuæa je povr&scaron;ine 494 m2, a nalazi se na parceli povr&scaron;ine 650 m2. Dva apartmana su ureðena i useljiva, a preostala èetiri apartmana trebaju zavr&scaron;ne unutarnje radove. Kuæa se nalazi nedaleko od centra mjesta, udaljenost do Trogira je 9 km, a do aerodroma 14 km.</p>', '<p>We have this entire modern apartment block, with six apartments, facing south and overlooking the sea and village.&nbsp;It is located 200 m from the sea in a small and attractive fishing port on the mainland north of Trogir.&nbsp;The house has a total residential area of 494 m2 inside, and is located on a plot of 650 m2.&nbsp;Two of the apartments are furnished and ready to move in, and the remaining four apartments need the interiors completing.&nbsp;Behind the house it would be possible to add a swimming pool.</p>', '', '<p>Kuæa sa &scaron;est apartmana, ju¾ne orijentacije s pogledom na more i Marinu nalazi se na 200 m udaljenosti od mora.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je povr&scaron;ine 494 m2, a nalazi se na parceli povr&scaron;ine 650 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Dva apartmana su ureðena i useljiva, a preostala èetiri apartmana trebaju zavr&scaron;ne unutarnje radove.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Iza kuæe moguæe je izgraditi bazen.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na parceli se nalazi 6 parking mjesta.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa se nalazi nedaleko od centra mjesta, udaljenost do Trogira je 9 km, a do aerodroma 14 km.</p>', '<p>We have this entire modern apartment block, with six apartments, facing south and overlooking the sea and village.<br /><br /><br />It is located 200 m from the sea in a small and attractive fishing port on the mainland north of Trogir.<br /><br /><br />The house has a total residential area of 494 m2 inside, and is located on a plot of 650 m2.<br /><br /><br />Two of the apartments are furnished and ready to move in, and the remaining four apartments need the interiors completing.<br /><br /><br />Behind the house it would be possible to add a swimming pool.<br /><br /><br />The plot has six parking spaces.<br /><br /><br />The house is located not far from the town centre, distance from Trogir is 9 km, to the airport 14 km.<br /><br /><br />Within walking distance are shops, bars and restaurants in the village, but a much wider range of options are found in the larger town of Trogir, which is very much the historic and cultural capital of the region.<br /><br /><br />For questions or viewing call our CPS Split office.</p>', '', '1065_House-Villa_0.jpg', '1065_House-Villa_1.jpg', '1065_House-Villa_2.jpg', '1065_House-Villa_3.jpg', '1065_House-Villa_4.jpg', '', '', '', ''),
(1066, '®eljko', '®i¾ak', '021 378211', '091 9406013 Tonèi', 'zeljko.zizak@yahoo.com', 'Rogoznica', 'Sevid, Velika O¹trica 19, 20226/4, 20226/19 Sevid', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '50', '1000', '332', 1, '600000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 6, 5, 'February 21, 2015', '<p>Luksuzno ureðena vila u amerièkom stilu s panoramskim pogledom na more i uvalu. Udaljenost do mora svega 50 m. Vila je drugi red do mora, a oko nje su sve parcele koje ne spadaju u graðevnu zonu, tako da je na parceli osigurana privatnost. Sastoji se od 3 jednosobna apartmana (1 x 28 m2 i 2 x 32 m2) i prostranog dvoeta¾nog stana povr&scaron;ine 240 m2. Pogled sa svih terasa i apartmana na more.</p>', '<p>We are offering this villa divided into 4 apartments in a popular location. They are situated just 50m from the sea in the second row of houses, with uninterrupted views of the bay and countryside, in a scenic village north of Trogir. Inside the building are 3 x 1 bedroom apartments (1 x 28 m2 and 2 x 32 m2) and a spacious duplex apartment of 240 m2. All the apartments have sea views.</p>', '', '<p>Luksuzno ureðena vila u amerièkom stilu s panoramskim pogledom na more i uvalu. Udaljenost do mora svega 50 m.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Vila je drugi red do mora, a oko nje su sve parcele koje ne spadaju u graðevnu zonu, tako da je na parceli osigurana privatnost.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sastoji se od 3 jednosobna apartmana (1 x 28 m2 i 2 x 32 m2) i prostranog dvoeta¾nog stana povr&scaron;ine 240 m2. Stan se sastoji od dva kata.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na donjem katu se nalazi prostrani dnevni boravak s blagovaonicom, kuhinjom i spavaæom sobom povezanom sa kupaonicom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na katu su dvije spavaæe sobe, kuhinja, wc i prostrani dnevni boravak s blagovaonicom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Prodaje se s kompletnim luksuznim namje&scaron;tajem (kako unutarnjim tako i vanjskim).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Pogled sa svih terasa i apartmana na more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Parcela je povr&scaron;ine 1000 m2. Prekrasno ureðena parcela s odr¾avanim vrtom u kojem se nalazi mediteransko bilje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Iza kuæe moguæe je izgraditi bazen od 40 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa ima gara¾u povr&scaron;ine 81 m2 i posebno izgraðen kamin sa ostavom povr&scaron;ine 36 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Dvije su cisterne za vodu jedna zapremine 7 vagona, a druga 3 vagona.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Osim sve potrebne infrastrukture vila je klimatizirana s ventilatorima i klimama u svakoj prostoriji.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ugraðen je alarmni sustav za&scaron;tite s kamerama u kuæi i oko parcele.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za zimu je unutar dnevnog boravka stambenog dijela izgraðen najmoderniji kamin s posebnim sustavom ventiliranja, ispuhivanja toplog zraka.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Osigurana su 4 parking mjesta u sklopu parcele.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U cijenu je uraèunat i brodiæ s vanbrodskim motorom penta 5 ks kao i vez za vezom.</p>', '<p>We are offering this villa divided into 4 apartments in a popular location.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>They are situated just 50m from the sea in the second row of houses, with uninterrupted views of the bay and countryside, in a scenic village north of Trogir.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Inside the building are 3 x 1 bedroom apartments (1 x 28 m2 and 2 x 32 m2) and a spacious duplex apartment of 240 m2. It consists of two floors.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the lower floor there is a spacious living room with dining room, kitchen and bedroom connected with bathroom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the first floor are two bedrooms, kitchen, bathroom and a spacious living room with dining area.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>All the apartments have sea views.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is being offered complete with luxurious furniture (both internal and external).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The total external plot area is 1000 m2. And the gardens have been well planted and maintained with Mediterranean plants.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Behind the house there is the opportunity to improve this property by building a swimming pool of 40 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house has a garage of 81 m2 and specially built bbq/fireplace and there is a storage room of 36 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There are two water tanks one volume 7 wagons, and the other three wagons.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>In addition to all other infrastructure the villa is air-conditioned with fans and air conditioners in every room.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Fitted alarm protection system with cameras in and around the plot.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is also designed with a modern fireplace so the property can be used throughout the year in complete comfort.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There are four parking spaces within the plot.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The price includes a boat with outboard engine and mooring.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Close to the property are several family run bars, cafes and shops useful for the local population and tourists in the summer season. Further is Trogir, a main town with many options for fine dining and night life.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please call our office for more information and we can arrange to view this property with you.</p>', '', '1066_House-Villa_0.jpg', '1066_House-Villa_1.jpg', '1066_House-Villa_2.jpg', '1066_House-Villa_3.jpg', '1066_House-Villa_4.jpg', '1066_House-Villa_5.jpg', '1066_House-Villa_6.jpg', '1066_House-Villa_7.jpg', '1066_House-Villa_8.jpg'),
(1080, 'Neno', 'Bego', '', '0955522964', '', 'Split', 'Gajeva 18, ZEM 7362/21, 5540 KATASTAR', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '500', '0', '58', 2, '90000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 'March 11, 2015', '<p>Apartman u prizemlju kuæe u mirnom podruèju Splita, svega nekoliko minuta od samog centra grada, zapadno od Dioklecijanove palaèe. Nalazi se u blizini Marjana, 500 m od mora.&nbsp;Ukupna stambena povr&scaron;ina iznosi 50 m2. Apartman iziskuje renovaciju.&nbsp;Svi potrebni sadr¾aji kao &scaron;to su mnoge trgovine, kafiæi, restorani, itd.. udaljeni su 5 min. hodanja. Najbli¾i parking udaljen je 20 m, dok je meðunarodni aerodrom udaljen 40 min. vo¾nje.</p>', '<p>We have this ground floor apartment, requiring modest renovation in a good location near the Marjan park.&nbsp;It is situated on the west of the town, 500m from the sea, within walking distance of almost all the historic and cultural attractions of the city, many of the best bars and restaurants and the ferry port.&nbsp;The living area of the apartment is 50 m2., and although the property is inhabited at the moment, we suggest it needs renovation.All necessary amenities are close to the apartment, with the closest shops and bars less than 5 minutes walk.Parking is 20 m away.</p>', '', '<p>Apartman u prizemlju kuæe u mirnom podruèju Splita, svega nekoliko minuta od samog centra grada, zapadno od Dioklecijanove palaèe. Nalazi se u blizini Marjana, 500 m od mora.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartman se sastoji od dnevnog boravka, hodnika, kupaone, kuhinje i dvije spavaæe sobe. Glavni ulaz je sa sjeverne strane.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuhinja i jedna od spavaæih soba imaju pristup dvjema loggama s ju¾ne strane ukupne povr&scaron;ine 8m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ukupna stambena povr&scaron;ina iznosi 50 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartman iziskuje renovaciju.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Svi potrebni sadr¾aji kao &scaron;to su mnoge trgovine, kafiæi, restorani, itd.. udaljeni su 5 min. hodanja.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Najbli¾i parking udaljen je 20 m, dok je meðunarodni aerodrom udaljen 40 min. vo¾nje.</p>', '<p>We have this ground floor apartment, requiring modest renovation in a good location near the Marjan park.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is situated on the west of the town, 500m from the sea, within walking distance of almost all the historic and cultural attractions of the city, many of the best bars and restaurants and the ferry port.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The apartment consists of a living room, hallway, bathroom, kitchen and 2 bedrooms.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The main entrance comes from the north side.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The kitchen and one bedroom have access to a closed balconies.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Orientation is N/S.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The living area of the apartment is 50 m2., and although the property is inhabited at the moment, we suggest it needs renovation.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>All necessary amenities are close to the apartment, with the closest shops and bars less than 5 minutes walk.Parking is 20 m away.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Split international airport is 40 minutes driving.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact our office to view this and similar properties.</p>', '', '1080_Apartment_0.jpg', '1080_Apartment_1.jpg', '1080_Apartment_2.jpg', '1080_Apartment_3.jpg', '1080_Apartment_4.jpg', '1080_Apartment_5.jpg', '1080_Apartment_6.jpg', '1080_Apartment_7.jpg', '1080_Apartment_8.jpg');
INSERT INTO `nekretnina` (`id`, `ime`, `prezime`, `telefon`, `mobitel`, `e_mail`, `lokacija_id`, `adresa`, `status_id`, `vrsta_id`, `udaljenost`, `povrsina`, `stambenapovrsina`, `display`, `cijena`, `cijenatocka`, `ponuda_tjedna`, `new_built`, `must_sell`, `prvi_red_do_mora`, `pogled_na_more`, `bazen`, `broj_soba`, `broj_kupatila`, `datum`, `title_hr`, `title_en`, `title_ge`, `opis_hr`, `opis_en`, `opis_ge`, `PropertyImageURL0`, `PropertyImageURL1`, `PropertyImageURL2`, `PropertyImageURL3`, `PropertyImageURL4`, `PropertyImageURL5`, `PropertyImageURL6`, `PropertyImageURL7`, `PropertyImageURL8`) VALUES
(1067, 'Andrija', 'Radan', '021 891 195   ', 'Kæer Ivanka 0049-89-92587181', 'ivanka@ivankaradan.com', 'Trogir', 'Slatine, Zvonimirova obala 91,  3225/4  kat/arkod', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '10', '821', '837', 2, '99999999', '', 2, 2, 2, 1, 1, 2, 15, 17, 'February 26, 2015', '<p>Apartmanska kuæa&nbsp; na ekskluzivnoj lokaciji u 1.redu do mora i prekrasne &scaron;ljunèane pla¾e. Sastoji se od ukupno 13 apartmana i ostalih popratnih prostorija. Iz cijele kuæe se pru¾a prekrasan pogled na more, pla¾u i grad Split. Sastoji se od suterena, visokog prizemlja, 1.kata, 2.kata i potkrovlja sveukupne povr&scaron;ine 837 m2. Kuæa je zbog svoje velièine i polo¾aja idealna za turistièko iznajmljivanje.</p>', '<p>We are offering this superb business opportunity of a beach side apartment house in an exclusive location.&nbsp;It is just a few yards from a clean pebble beach on the island of Ciovo, with views of the sea and the mountains on the mainland, and of Split itself.&nbsp;It consists of a total of 13 apartments with other supporting facilities.&nbsp;From anywhere in the whole house there are beautiful views of the sea.&nbsp;The international airport 20 min. driving.</p>', '', '<p>Apartmanska kuæa&nbsp; na ekskluzivnoj lokaciji u 1.redu do mora i prekrasne &scaron;ljunèane pla¾e.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sastoji se od ukupno 13 apartmana i ostalih popratnih prostorija.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Iz cijele kuæe se pru¾a prekrasan pogled na more, pla¾u i grad Split.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ukupno zemlji&scaron;te je povr&scaron;ine 821 m2 na kojem se nalazi parking za 10 automobila, ali je i takoðer moguæa i izgradnja bazena. Sastoji se od suterena, visokog prizemlja, 1.kata, 2.kata i potkrovlja sveukupne povr&scaron;ine 837 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ima ukupno 4 vanjska ulaza &scaron;to pru¾a mnoge opcije i moguænosti.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Suteren je predviðen kao prostor za poslu¾ivanje gostiju (mini restoran), praonica i zajednièki dio.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U suterenu se nalazi pumpa za bunar i kotao za centralno grijanje koje je instalirano.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U visokom prizemlju se nalazi 6 studio apartmana. 3 na sjeveru imaju balkone sa pogledom na more, dok 3 na jugu nemaju balkone.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na 1.katu je 6 studio apartmana od kojih svaki ima balkon. 3 su na sjeveru i 3 na jugu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na 2.katu je smje&scaron;ten prostrani apartman (160 m2) koji je u roh bau stanju. Sastoji se od 2 hodnika, kuhinje + dn. boravka + blagovaonice, 3 spavaæe sobe, 2 kupaonice i 4 balkona. Iz apartmana se pru¾a prekrasan pogled na more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na 3.katu (potkrovlje), koji je takoðer u roh bau stanju, se nalazi dugi hodnik i 6 mali sprema.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>6 apartmana u kuæi je u funkciji turistièkog iznajmljivanja.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je zbog svoje velièine i polo¾aja idealna za turistièko iznajmljivanje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U blizini se nalaze svi potrebni sadr¾aji dok je do meðunarodnog aerodroma udaljenost 20 min. vo¾nje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za sve dodatne informacije vam stojimo na raspolaganju.</p>', '<p>We are offering this superb business opportunity of a beach side apartment house in an exclusive location.<br /><br /><br />It is just a few yards from a clean pebble beach on the island of Ciovo, with views of the sea and the mountains on the mainland, and of Split itself.<br /><br /><br />It consists of a total of 13 apartments with other supporting facilities.<br /><br /><br />From anywhere in the whole house there are beautiful views of the sea.<br /><br /><br />The land plot is 821 m2, where there is parking for 10 cars, but this land can be redesigned to accommodate a swimming pool if the owner wished to make such improvements.<br /><br /><br />It consists of a basement, ground floor, 1st floor, 2nd and penthouse with an overall area of 837 m2. There are a total of four external entrances which provides many options.<br /><br /><br />The basement is designed as a ''konoba'' and is used as a mini restaurant but there is also a a laundry and common part. In the basement there is a well and pump for the central heating boiler.<br /><br /><br />The high ground floor consists of 6 studio apartments. 3 in the north have balconies overlooking the sea, and three in the south do not have balconies.<br /><br /><br />On the 1st floor has 6 studio apartments, each of which has a balcony. 3 are in the north and three in the south.<br /><br /><br />On the 2nd floor is located spacious apartment (160 m2), which is in the unfinished state. It consists of two hall, kitchen + living. room + dining room, 3 bedrooms, 2 bathrooms and 4 balconies. The apartment offers breathtaking views of the sea.<br /><br /><br />On the 3rd floor (top floor), which is also needs decorating and there is a long corridor and six small storages.<br /><br /><br />6 apartments are already used by tourists.<br /><br /><br />Nearby are all necessary facilities including shops, bars coffee shops and restaurants. There is a foot ferry to Split or Trogir regularly cruising passed and stopping near the property.<br /><br /><br />The international airport 20 min. driving.<br />Trogir is 10 mins driving.<br /><br /><br />For additional information, we are at your disposal.</p>', '', '1067_House-Villa_0.jpg', '1067_House-Villa_1.jpg', '1067_House-Villa_2.jpg', '1067_House-Villa_3.jpg', '1067_House-Villa_4.jpg', '1067_House-Villa_5.jpg', '1067_House-Villa_6.jpg', '1067_House-Villa_7.jpg', '1067_House-Villa_8.jpg'),
(1068, '®eljka i Jo¹ko', 'Erceg', '', '098 744 225', '', 'Split', 'Vinogradska 41 (Pazdigrad), 7424/16', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '550', '0', '100', 2, '149000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 'February 26, 2015', '<p>Potpuno namje&scaron;ten apartman u popularnom kvartu smje&scaron;ten u istoènom dijelu Splita. Nalazi se u slijepoj ulici bez puno buke i prometa. Iz apartmana se ne pru¾a pogled na more, ali je prednost &scaron;to je pla¾a udaljena 550 m &scaron;to je svega 5 minuta hodanja. Nalazi se na 1.katu od ukupno 2.kata, dok je orjentacija S-J.&nbsp;Ukupna povr&scaron;ina iznosi 61,61 m2 + loggia 8,50 m2 + terasa 30 m2. Zgrada je izgraðea 2000. god., dok je apartman potpuno renoviran prije 7 godina.</p>', '<p>We are pleased to offer this modernised and fully furnished 2 bedroom apartment in a popular neighborhood located in the eastern part of Split. It is located in a ''cul-de-sac'' street with very little noise and traffic. The suites and balconies are NOT overlooking the sea, but the beach is about 500m, which is only 5 minutes walking.&nbsp;The total area inside the apartment is 61.61 m2 + balcony 8.50 m2 + 30 m2 terrace.</p>', '', '<p>Potpuno namje&scaron;ten apartman u popularnom kvartu smje&scaron;ten u istoènom dijelu Splita.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nalazi se u slijepoj ulici bez puno buke i prometa.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Iz apartmana se ne pru¾a pogled na more, ali je prednost &scaron;to je pla¾a udaljena 550 m &scaron;to je svega 5 minuta hodanja.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nalazi se na 1.katu od ukupno 2.kata, dok je orjentacija S-J.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>****Ukupna povr&scaron;ina iznosi 61,61 m2 + loggia 8,50 m2 + terasa 30 m2.</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sastoji se od malog ulaznog hodnika, wc-a, kuhinje + dnevnog boravka + blagovaonice, jo&scaron; jednog malog hodnika, kupaonice, 2 spavaæe sobe, loggie na jugu (izlaz iz dnevnog boravka) i prostrane terase na sjeveru (izlaz iz spavaæih soba). Na terasi je prikljuèena voda, dok se na njoj nalazi i manja prostorija koja slu¾i kao sprema.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U suterenu zgrade se nalazi zajednièka gara¾a u kojoj se nalazi 1 parking mjesto koje je ukljuèeno u cijenu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Zgrada je izgraðea 2000. god., dok je apartman potpuno renoviran prije 7 godina.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Trgovina se nalazi u blizini, isto kao i ostali sadr¾aji.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Do meðunarodnog aerodroma ima 40 minuta vo¾nje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na raspolaganju smo za sva dodatna pitanja.</p>', '<p>We are pleased to offer this modernised and fully furnished 2 bedroom apartment in a popular neighborhood located in the eastern part of Split.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is located in a ''cul-de-sac'' street with very little noise and traffic.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The suites and balconies are NOT overlooking the sea, but the beach is about 500m, which is only 5 minutes walking.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is located on the 1st floor of the 2 floors, and the orientation is S-N.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>**** The total area inside the apartment is 61.61 m2 + balcony 8.50 m2 + 30 m2 terrace.</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It consists of a small entrance hall, toilets, kitchen with living room + dining room, another small hallway, bathroom, 2 bedrooms, balcony on the south (exit from the living room) and a spacious terrace on the north (exit from the bedrooms). The terrace has a connection&nbsp; to the water supply and there is also a small room that Is used for storage.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>In the basement there is a shared garage in which there is one parking place which is included in the price.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The building was built in 2000., but the apartment was completely renovated and modernised to the current high standard, 7 years ago.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Shops are located in the vicinity, as well as other amenities, and in Split are most of the cultural and historic attractions that make this area so famous for tourists.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Split old town is 10 mins driving.</p>\r\n<p>The international airport is 40 minutes driving.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>We are available for any questions, please call and we can arrange to view this property with you.</p>', '', '1068_Apartment_0.jpg', '1068_Apartment_1.jpg', '1068_Apartment_2.jpg', '1068_Apartment_3.jpg', '1068_Apartment_4.jpg', '1068_Apartment_5.jpg', '1068_Apartment_6.jpg', '1068_Apartment_7.jpg', '1068_Apartment_8.jpg'),
(1069, '', 'Dalmat i Hormus doo', '', 'Jak¹a', '', 'Sibenik', 'Brodarica, uvala Gaj', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '30', '400', '421', 1, '650000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 1, 6, 3, 'March 2, 2015', '<p>Moderna samostojeæa kuæa s prekrasnim pogledom na more. Nalazi se u mirnom dijelu naselja Brodarica, a od prve pla¾e udaljena je svega 30m. Sastoji se od tri eta¾e, ukupne stambene povr&scaron;ine 421 m2. Na svakoj eta¾i se nalazi po jedan apartman.&nbsp;Svi stanovi su klimatizirani i cjelokupni namje&scaron;taj ulazi u prodajnu cijenu kuæe.</p>', '<p>Modern house with three separate living units and a beautiful sea view. The property is located in a quiet part of Brodarica and the nearest beach is only 30m away. House is consisted of basement, ground floor, first floor and the attic, with the total living area of 421 m2. All (three) apartments have air-conditioners and complete furniture is included in the price.</p>', '', '<p>Moderna samostojeæa kuæa s prekrasnim pogledom na more. Nalazi se u mirnom dijelu naselja Brodarica, a od prve pla¾e udaljena je svega 30m.<br /><br /><br />U suterenu se nalazi gara¾a povr&scaron;ine 37,84m2.<br /><br /><br />Prizemlje se sastoji od velikog trosobnog stana (3 spavaæe sobe, balkon, kupaonica, trijem, hodnik, te prostrani dnevni boravak s kuhinjom i blagovaonicom). Ukupna stambena povr&scaron;ina stana u prizemlju iznosi 149,55m2.<br /><br /><br />Vanjskim stepeni&scaron;tem dolazi se na prvi kat gdje se nalazi dvosoban stan ukupne stambene povr&scaron;ine 149,55m2 &scaron;to ukljuèuje: 2 spavaæe sobe, 2 trijema, balkon, hodnik, kupaonicu, dnevni boravak, blagovaonicu i kuhinju.<br /><br /><br />U potkrovlju je smje&scaron;ten manji jednosoban stan kojem pripada i velika terasa povr&scaron;ine 42m2 s prekrasnim pogledom na more. Stan se sastoji od spavaæe sobe, kuhinje, dnevnog boravka , kupaonice. Ukupna povr&scaron;ina stana u potkrovlju iznosi 90,85m2.<br /><br /><br />U sklopu nekretnine nalazi se zatvorena peèenjara sa wc-om, odr¾avani i kultivirani vrt, te tri parkirna mjesta.<br /><br /><br />Svi stanovi su klimatizirani i cjelokupni namje&scaron;taj ulazi u prodajnu cijenu kuæe.</p>', '<p>Modern house with three separate living units and a beautiful sea view. The property is located in a quiet part of Brodarica and the nearest beach is only 30m away.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>House is consisted of basement, ground floor, first floor and the attic.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>In the basement there is a garage of 37,84 m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The ground floor consists of a large three-bedroom apartment (3 bedrooms, balcony, bathroom, porch, hallway, and a spacious living room with kitchen and dining area ). Total living area of the apartment on the ground floor is 149,55 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>An outside staircase leads to the first floor where there is a two bedroom apartment with total living area of 149,55m2 which includes: 2 bedrooms, 2 porches, balcony, hallway, bathroom, living room, dining room and kitchen.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>In the attic there is a one-bedroom apartment which has a large terrace (42m2) overlooking the sea. It consists of a bedroom, kitchen, living room, bathroom. The total area of the apartment on the top floor is 90,85 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Within the property there is a closed barbecue with toilet, maintained and cultivated garden and three parking spaces.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>All apartments have air-conditioners and complete furniture is included in the price.</p>', '', '1069_House-Villa_0.jpg', '1069_House-Villa_1.jpg', '1069_House-Villa_2.jpg', '1069_House-Villa_3.jpg', '1069_House-Villa_4.jpg', '1069_House-Villa_5.jpg', '1069_House-Villa_6.jpg', '1069_House-Villa_7.jpg', '1069_House-Villa_8.jpg'),
(1070, '', 'Dalmat i Hormus doo', '', 'Jak¹a', '', 'Rogoznica', 'Zatoglav', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '20', '500', '200', 2, '599000', '', 2, 2, 2, 1, 1, 1, 4, 2, 'March 2, 2015', '<p>Atraktivna samostojeæa kuæa smje&scaron;tena u prvom redu do mora!!! Nekretnina se nalazi u Rogoznici, polo¾ena je na 500 m2 okuænice, a ukupna stambena povr&scaron;ina iznosi 200 m2 na dvije eta¾e. U sklopu nekretnine nalazi se lijepo kultivirana okuænica, gara¾a za dva automobila, ljetna kuhinja, te novoureðeni bazen. S obzirom na lokaciju (prvi red do mora) postoji moguænost za privez manjeg broda.</p>', '<p>An attractive detached house situated in the first row to the sea !!! The property is located in Rogoznica, placed on a 500 m2 plot of land and the total living area is 200 m2 on two floors. Within the property there is a nice cultivated garden, garage for two cars, a summer kitchen and newly renovated pool. Due to the location (by the sea) there is a possibility for mooring small boat.</p>', '', '<p>Atraktivna samostojeæa kuæa smje&scaron;tena u prvom redu do mora!!!</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nekretnina se nalazi u Rogoznici, polo¾ena je na 500 m2 okuænice, a ukupna stambena povr&scaron;ina iznosi 200 m2 na dvije eta¾e.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U prizemlju se nalazi dvosoban stan koji se sastoji od: kuhinje, blagovaonice, dnevnog boravka, kupaonice i dvije spavaæe sobe te terase.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na katu je isti raspored kao u prizemlju (kuhinja, blagovoaonica, dnevni boravak, kupaonica, dvije spavaæe sobe i terasa s pogledom na more). Svaka eta¾a ima cca 100m2 stambene povr&scaron;ine.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U sklopu nekretnine nalazi se lijepo kultivirana okuænica, gara¾a za dva automobila, ljetna kuhinja, te novoureðeni bazen.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>S obzirom na lokaciju (prvi red do mora) postoji moguænost za privez manjeg broda.</p>', '<p>An attractive detached house situated in the first row to the sea !!!</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property is located in Rogoznica, placed on a 500 m2 plot of land and the total living area is 200 m2 on two floors.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The ground floor has two bedroom apartment consisting of a kitchen, dining room, living room, bathroom and two bedrooms and a terrace.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The first floor has the same layout as the ground floor (kitchen, dinning room, living room, bathroom, two bedrooms and a terrace overlooking the sea). Each floor has approximately 100m2 of living space.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Within the property there is a nice cultivated garden, garage for two cars, a summer kitchen and newly renovated pool.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Due to the location (by the sea) there is a possibility for mooring small boat.</p>', '', '1070_House-Villa_0.jpg', '1070_House-Villa_1.jpg', '1070_House-Villa_2.jpg', '1070_House-Villa_3.jpg', '1070_House-Villa_4.jpg', '1070_House-Villa_5.jpg', '1070_House-Villa_6.jpg', '1070_House-Villa_7.jpg', '1070_House-Villa_8.jpg'),
(1071, 'Davor', '®aja', '', '095/ 9039 006', '', 'Rogoznica', 'Zeèevo, kè20183/3,20185,20188/4,2125,20186,20187 k.o. Rogoznica', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '380', '500', '210', 1, '350000', '', 2, 1, 2, 2, 1, 1, 3, 3, 'March 5, 2015', '<p>Samostojeæa obiteljska vila trenutno u izgradnji, s pogledom na more u jako mirnom okru¾enju. Udaljena je 4 km sjeverno od popularnog naselja Rogoznica gdje se ujedno nalazi i Marina za jahte. More i prekrasna uvala udaljeni su 380 m. Vila se sastoji od prizemlja i 1.kata. Ispred se nalazi gara¾a sa 1 parkirnim mjestom, ureðeni vrt, bazen, dok se sa terasa pru¾a prekrasnog pogleda na more i uvalu.</p>', '<p>We are pleased to offer this attractively priced, of plan, villa on the mainland. It is situated 380m from the sea, 4 km from Rogoznica, on a very attractive part of the mainland coast. It is 30km from the airport at Split. The villa is well designed and has a good balanced feel to it, reflecting modern trends and family requirements. It has 210m sq of living space, and sits on a plot of 500m sq. This gives it plenty of outside space, and the facility to store a small boat over winter, or have additional private parking.</p>', '', '<p>Povr&scaron;ina zemlji&scaron;ta: 500 m2</p>\r\n<p>Brutto stambena povr&scaron;ina: 210 m2</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Samostojeæa obiteljska vila trenutno u izgradnji, s pogledom na more u jako mirnom okru¾enju.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Udaljena je 4 km sjeverno od popularnog naselja Rogoznica gdje se ujedno nalazi i Marina za jahte.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>More i prekrasna uvala udaljeni su 380 m.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Vila se sastoji od prizemlja i 1.kata, te je ureðena prema modernim standardima, idealna za obiteljski odmor i u¾ivanje. Ispred se nalazi gara¾a sa 1 parkirnim mjestom, ureðeni vrt, bazen, dok se sa terasa pru¾a prekrasnog pogleda na more i uvalu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Vila se sastoji od 3 spavaæe sobe, 3 kupaonice, blagovaonice, kuhinje, dnevnog boravka, 2 terase, spremi&scaron;ta.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U centru mjesta nalazi se nekoliko lokalnih trgovina.</p>\r\n<p>Meðunarodni aerodrom u Splitu udaljen je 30 km.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za sve dodatne informacije i organiziraje razgledavanja nekretnine, stojimo vam na raspolaganju.</p>', '<p>Land area: 500 m2</p>\r\n<p>Gross Living Area: 210 m2</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>We are pleased to offer this attractively priced, of plan, villa on the mainland.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is situated 380m from the sea, 4 km from Rogoznica, on a very attractive part of the mainland coast. It is 30km from the airport at Split.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The villa is well designed and has a good balanced feel to it, reflecting modern trends and family requirements. It has 210m sq of living space, and sits on a plot of 500m sq. This gives it plenty of outside space, and the facility to store a small boat over winter, or have additional private parking.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property has a garage, a swimming pool and landscaped garden, outside bbq cooking facilities, and superb views of the coast and sea.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The inside of the villas are designed so there are of 3 bedrooms, 3 bathrooms, dining room, kitchen, living room all open plan, 2 terraces, and laundry room. High quality materials have been used throughout.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The immediate local area has some basic shops and an atmospheric bar but is not a crowded or busy and there is a yacht marina 4km away.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact Croatia Property Sales for more information.</p>', '', '1071_House-Villa_0.jpg', '1071_House-Villa_1.jpg', '1071_House-Villa_2.jpg', '1071_House-Villa_3.jpg', '1071_House-Villa_4.jpg', '1071_House-Villa_5.jpg', '', '', ''),
(1072, 'Vladimir', 'Jeliæ', '', '0916661661', 'jelic2014@gmail.com', 'Rogoznica', 'Ljoljinica, do Tomiæa', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '10', '245', '145', 2, '250000', '', 2, 2, 2, 1, 1, 2, 3, 2, 'March 5, 2015', '<p>Kuæa zapadne orijentacije smje&scaron;tena na Rogoznièkoj rivijeri na vrlo atraktivnoj lokaciji u prvom redu do mora i s pogledom na more. Ispred kuæe se nalazi gotovo privatna pla¾a i vez za brod. Radi se o dvojnoj kuæi ukupne stambene povr&scaron;ine 145 m2, a povr&scaron;ina zemlji&scaron;ta na kojoj je izgraðena iznosi 245 m2. Sastoji se od prizemlja i dva kata.</p>', '<p>We are pleased to offer this seafront house on the mainland with its own secluded beach and mooring. It is facing west and overlooking the water, on the edge of a small village near Rogoznica. It is a semi-detached house with a total floor area of 145 m2, and the surface of the land on which it is built is 245 m2.&nbsp;It consists of a ground floor and two floors. All floors have beautiful view of the sea and sunset.</p>', '', '<p>Kuæa zapadne orijentacije smje&scaron;tena na Rogoznièkoj rivijeri na vrlo atraktivnoj lokaciji u prvom redu do mora i s pogledom na more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ispred kuæe se nalazi gotovo privatna pla¾a i vez za brod.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Radi se o dvojnoj kuæi ukupne stambene povr&scaron;ine 145 m2, a povr&scaron;ina zemlji&scaron;ta na kojoj je izgraðena iznosi 245 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sastoji se od prizemlja i dva kata. Prizemlje je povr&scaron;ine 60 m2, a sastoji se od dnevnog boravka, kuhinje, ostave, kupaonice, stepeni&scaron;ta za prvi kat, WC, spremi&scaron;ta i terase. Prvi kat (takoðer 60 m2) se sastoji od 3 spavaæe sobe, predsoblja sa stepeni&scaron;tem, WC, ljetne kuhinje i balkona. Drugi kat povr&scaron;ine 45m2 se sastoji od sobe, dnevnog boravka s kuhinjom, kupaonice i 3 terase.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sa svih eta¾a se pru¾a prekrasan pogled na more i zalazak sunca.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Okuænica je kultivirana. 3 parking mjesta nalaze se sa stra¾nje strane kuæe.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa ima svu potrebnu infrastrukturu: struju, gradsku vodu i septièku jamu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Radi se o vrlo mirnom mjestu gdje mo¾ete u¾ivati u miru i privatnosti.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Udaljenost do restorana, kafiæa, duæana je svega par kilometara.</p>\r\n<p>Aerodrom je udaljen 25 km.</p>', '<p>We are pleased to offer this seafront house on the mainland with its own  secluded beach and mooring.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is facing west and  overlooking the water, on the edge of a small village near Rogoznica.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It  is a semi-detached house with a total floor area of 145 m2, and the surface of  the land on which it is built is 245 m2.&nbsp;It consists of a ground floor and  two floors.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The ground floor has an area of 60 m2 and consists of a living  room, kitchen, utility room, bathroom, stairs to first floor, toilet, storage  room and terrace.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>First floor (also 60 m2) consists of 3 bedrooms, hall with  staircase, toilet, summer kitchen and balcony.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Second floor area of 45m2  consists of a bedroom, living room with kitchen, bathroom and three  terraces.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The internal decorations and condition of the building are very  smart and the property is very well presented.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>All floors have beautiful view  of the sea and sunset.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Land plot is cultivated with Mediterranean herbs  and fruit trees.&nbsp;3 parking spaces are located on the back of the  house.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house has all the necessary infrastructure: electricity, city  water and septic tank.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is a very quiet place, very close to natural  woodland, where you can enjoy peace and privacy.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Proximity to  restaurants, cafes, shops is only a few kilometers.</p>\r\n<p>Split airport is 25 km  distant. Trogir is 20 mins drive, Split is 40 mins drive.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please call  our Split office for more information or to arrange a visit.</p>', '', '1072_House-Villa_0.jpg', '1072_House-Villa_1.jpg', '1072_House-Villa_2.jpg', '1072_House-Villa_3.jpg', '1072_House-Villa_4.jpg', '1072_House-Villa_5.jpg', '1072_House-Villa_6.jpg', '1072_House-Villa_7.jpg', '1072_House-Villa_8.jpg'),
(1443, 'SURADNJA', 'Sandra Radan', '', '095 1977 708', 'stan4you.st@gmail.com ', 'Brac', 'Supetar', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '90', '0', '49', 2, '165050', '', 2, 2, 2, 1, 1, 2, 1, 1, 'November 10, 2015', '<p>U prodaji imamo tri stana u centru Supetra, sa pogledom na more, nedaleko od svih sadr¾aja i trajektne luke. Terasa iznad stanova je u njihovom vlasni&scaron;tvu.&nbsp;Jednosobni stan na drugom katu, povr&scaron;ine 49,09 sa terasom povr&scaron;ine 29,50 m2.&nbsp;Dvosobni stan na 2. katu, povr&scaron;ine 72,47 m2 sa terasom povr&scaron;ine 22,10 m2.&nbsp;Trosobni stan na 2. katu, povr&scaron;ine 107,28 m2 sa terasom povr&scaron;ine 32,45 m2.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>For sale we have these 3 apartments in the center of Supetar, in vicinity of all amenities and the ferry port. The terrace above the apartments in in their ownership. Apartments have sea views.&nbsp;One bedroom apartment on the 2nd floor, 49,09 sqm with the terrace of 29,50 sqm, priced 165.050 EUR.&nbsp;Two bedroom apartment on the 2nd floor, 72,47 sqm with the terrace of 22,10 sqm, priced 198.600 EUR.&nbsp;Three bedroom apartment on the 2nd floor, 107,28 sqm with the terrace of 32,45 sqm, priced 293.450 EUR.&nbsp;<br /><br /></p>', '', '<p><strong>Tri stana u prvom redu do mora na otoku Braèu</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U prodaji imamo tri stana u centru Supetra, sa pogledom na more, nedaleko od svih sadr¾aja i trajektne luke.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Terasa iznad stanova je u njihovom vlasni&scaron;tvu. &nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Jednosobni stan na drugom katu, povr&scaron;ine 49,09 sa terasom povr&scaron;ine 29,50 m2. Cijena 165.050 EUR.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Dvosobni stan na 2. katu, povr&scaron;ine 72,47 m2 sa terasom povr&scaron;ine 22,10 m2. Cijena 198.600 EUR.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Trosobni stan na 2. katu, povr&scaron;ine 107,28 m2 sa terasom povr&scaron;ine 32,45 m2. Cijena 293.450 EUR.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Svakom stanu pripada i gara¾no mjesto koje se prodaje posebno za cijenu od 15.000 EUR.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za dodatne informacije molimo kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured u Splitu.&nbsp;</p>', '<p><strong>Three seafront apartments for sale on Brac island</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For sale we have these 3 apartments in the center of Supetar, in vicinity of all amenities and the ferry port.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The terrace above the apartments in in their ownership.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartments have sea views.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>One bedroom apartment on the 2nd floor, 49,09 sqm with the terrace of 29,50 sqm, priced 165.050 EUR.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Two bedroom apartment on the 2nd floor, 72,47 sqm with the terrace of 22,10 sqm, priced 198.600 EUR</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Three bedroom apartment on the 2nd floor, 107,28 sqm with the terrace of 32,45 sqm, priced 293.450 EUR.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Each apartment has garage space, sold separately for the price of 15.000 EUR.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For further information please contact our office in Split.&nbsp;</p>', '', '1443_Apartment_0.jpg', '1443_Apartment_1.jpg', '1443_Apartment_2.jpg', '1443_Apartment_3.jpg', '', '', '', '', ''),
(1073, 'Nikola', 'Vuku¹iæ', '', '00385 98 266 808', 'sanjabaljak@hotmail.com', 'Primosten', 'Bilo, k.è. 1773 Burije', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '10', '600', '450', 1, '1000000', '', 2, 2, 2, 1, 1, 1, 6, 6, 'March 7, 2015', '<p>Vila u izgradnji, u prvom redu na prekrasnom dijelu dalmatinske obale, s direktnim pristupom pla¾i. Kuæa je jo&scaron; uvijek u izgradnji, te se u skladu sa ¾eljama kupca mo¾e mijenjati i dograðivati. Povr&scaron;ina kuæe iznosi 450 m2. Sastoji se od prizemlja,prvog, drugog kata i potkrovlja. Parcela je povr&scaron;ine 600 m2. Na parceli æe biti izgraðen bazen.</p>', '<p>We are offering this substantial villa, currently partially constructed but to be completed, in the first line on a beautiful part of the Dalmatian coast, with direct access to the beach.&nbsp;The living area is 450 m2. It consists of a ground floor, first, second floor and penthouse.&nbsp;The plot has an area of 600 m2. and it is planned to incorporate a swimming pool and patio are for enjoying the sun.</p>', '', '<p>Vila u izgradnji, u prvom redu na prekrasnom dijelu dalmatinske obale, s direktnim pristupom pla¾i.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je jo&scaron; uvijek u izgradnji, te se u skladu sa ¾eljama kupca mo¾e mijenjati i dograðivati.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Povr&scaron;ina kuæe iznosi 450 m2. Sastoji se od prizemlja,prvog, drugog kata i potkrovlja.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Prizemlje se sastoji od kuhinje, spavaæe sobe i wc-a.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Prvi kat je veæ izgraðen apartman, sadr¾i kuhinju, dvije sobe i 2 kupaonice.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Drugi kat je u izgradnji i sastojati æe se od tri sobe, svaka sa kupaonicom za sebe.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Potkrovlje je predvidjeno za teretanu i saunu, te &nbsp;mali Bar-kutak. Potkrovlje se mo¾e mjenjati po ¾eljama kupca, te se umjesto teretane mo¾e napraviti igraonica za djecu ili ne&scaron;to drugo ovisno o potrebama.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Parcela je povr&scaron;ine 600 m2. Na parceli æe biti izgraðen bazen.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Pristup do kuæe kao i parking mjesta su osigurani.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa ima svu potrebnu infrastrukturu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Udaljenost do Primo&scaron;tena je svega par kilometara, a do aerodroma u Splitu 60 km; do aerodroma u Zadru 100 km.</p>', '<p>We are offering this substantial villa, currently partially constructed but to be completed, in the first line on a beautiful part of the Dalmatian coast, with direct access to the beach.<br /><br /><br />The house is still under construction, with the heavy work completed, but in accordance with the wishes of the customer, internal fittings can be changed and upgraded.<br /><br /><br />The living area is 450 m2. It consists of a ground floor, first, second floor and penthouse.<br /><br /><br />The ground floor consists of a kitchen, bedroom and bathroom.<br /><br /><br />The first floor is already completed as an apartment. It has a kitchen, two bedrooms and two bathrooms.<br /><br /><br />The second floor is under construction and shall consist of three rooms, each with an ensuite bathroom.<br /><br /><br />The top floor is designed to have a gym and sauna, and a small bar. This can be changed according to customer requirements with many alternative options possible.<br /><br /><br />The plot has an area of 600 m2. and it is planned to incorporate a swimming pool and patio are for enjoying the sun.<br /><br /><br />Road access to the house and parking spaces are provided.<br /><br /><br />The house has all the necessary infrastructure.<br /><br /><br />The distance to Primosten is only a few kilometers, where there are many bars, coffee shops and bakery etc.. The airport in Split 40 minutes driving and the airport in Zadar 1 hour.<br /><br /><br />Please contact our office to arrange to visit this property.</p>', '', '1073_House-Villa_0.jpg', '1073_House-Villa_1.jpg', '1073_House-Villa_2.jpg', '1073_House-Villa_3.jpg', '1073_House-Villa_4.jpg', '1073_House-Villa_5.jpg', '1073_House-Villa_6.jpg', '1073_House-Villa_7.jpg', '1073_House-Villa_8.jpg'),
(1074, 'Gianandrea', 'Babini (Babini doo)', 'Kljuè Adriana 098 655 521, info@portamarina.hr', '+39 347 6485 508;info@portamarina.hr', 'Gianandrea.babini@babini.com', 'Zadar', 'Verunic Dugi Otok Croatia', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '40', '100', '106', 1, '150000', '', 2, 1, 2, 2, 1, 2, 2, 2, 'March 7, 2015', '<p>U 2.redu do mora i prekrasne pla¾e nalazi se novoizgraðena kuæa od tri dijela. Smje&scaron;tena je na Dugom Otoku koji je povezan svakodnevnom trajektnom linijom sa gradom Zadrom gdje se ujedno nalazi i meðunarodni aerodrom. Kuæa se nalazi se na zapadnoj strani. Orijentacija kuæe je sjever &ndash; jug. Predmet prodaje je dvoeta¾ni stan u srednjem objektu.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>We are offering this newly built house in the second row to the sea. It is located on Dugi Otok (Island), which has a daily ferry to the city of Zadar. The property is on the west side of the island on a north-south orientation. Apartment consists of a ground floor and 1st floor with total living area of 106 m2. On the beach, which is 40 m away from the house, it is possible to keep a small boat. The environment is calm and ideal for enjoyment and relaxation.</p>', '', '<p>U 2.redu do mora i prekrasne pla¾e nalazi se kuæa (trojni objekt).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Smje&scaron;tena je na Dugom Otoku koji je povezan svakodnevnom trajektnom linijom sa gradom Zadrom gdje se ujedno nalazi i meðunarodni aerodrom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa se nalazi na zapadnoj strani. Orjentacija kuæe je sjever &ndash; jug.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Predmet prodaje je dvoeta¾ni apartman u srednjem objektu kojem pripada dio dvori&scaron;ta, a sastoji se od prizemlja i 1.kata ukupne stambene povr&scaron;ine 106 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U prizemlju se nalazi dnevni boravak + kuhinja + blagovaonica, kupaonica i loggia.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na 1.katu su 2 spavaæe sobe, kupaonica i terasa sa djelomiènim pogledom na more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ispred kuæe se nalazi parking i mali ureðeni vrt.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na pla¾i koja je udaljena 40 m od kuæe je moguæe privezati manji brod.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je potpuno zavr&scaron;ena, te nisu potrebna nikakva dodatna ulaganja.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Okru¾enje je mirno i idealno za u¾ivanje i odmor.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ukoliko imate dodatnih pitanja molimo da nas kontaktirate.</p>', '<p>We are offering this newly built house in the second row of property to the sea.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is located on Dugi Otok (Island), which has a daily ferry to the city of Zadar. The property is on the west side of the island on a north-south orientation.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For sale is duplex apartment (with a small yard) in the middle part of the object which consists of a ground floor and 1st floor with total living area of 106 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The ground floor has an open plan living room + kitchen + dining room, bathroom and terrace.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the 1st floor are two bedrooms, bathroom and a wide balcony with partial sea view.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>In front of the house there is parking and a small garden.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the beach, which is 40 m away from the house, it is possible to keep a small boat.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house is fully completed, and requires minimal additional investment for some final fittings and furniture.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The surrounding area is beautifully tranquil, with calm and clear water in front of the property, and natural preserved woodland behind.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The environment is calm and ideal for enjoyment and relaxation.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>If you have any questions please contact us.</p>', '', '1074_House-Villa_0.jpg', '1074_House-Villa_1.jpg', '1074_House-Villa_2.jpg', '1074_House-Villa_3.jpg', '1074_House-Villa_4.jpg', '1074_House-Villa_5.jpg', '1074_House-Villa_6.jpg', '1074_House-Villa_7.jpg', '1074_House-Villa_8.jpg'),
(1075, 'Margita', 'Nuhagiæ', 'Marica 091 786 5199', 'Margita 095 568 3445   ', 'kljuè - Ma¹a Jerèiæ 021 225 015', 'Kastela', 'Ka¹tel Suæurac, ®rtava rata 10, 7101 kat.', 'For sale', 'Old stone house', '30', '143', '166', 1, '200000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 4, 2, 'March 7, 2015', '<p>Stara kamena kuæa u centru jednog od 7 prekrasnih mjesta Ka&scaron;tela koja u se smjestila izmeðu Trogira i Splita. Od mora i &scaron;etnice je udaljena 50 m, gdje se ujedno nalaze trgovine i ostali sadr¾aji. Ukupna povr&scaron;ina zemlji&scaron;ta iznosi 143 m2, dok je samo dvori&scaron;te 60 m2. Stambena povr&scaron;ina iznosi 166 m2. Sastoji se od prizemlja i 1.kata sa posebnim vanjskim ulazima za svaku eta¾u.</p>', '<p>We have this well built old stone house in the centre of one of the seven beautiful small villages of Kastela which is situated between Trogir and Split. It is situated just 50m from the sea and the promenade with many shops, bakeries, bars, and coffee shops all nearby, and with easy access to Split from the regular bus service. The total land area is 143 m2, which includes a courtyard of 60 m2. The living area of the house&nbsp; is 166 m2. The house inside, consists of ground floor and 1st floor with separate outside entrances for each floor.</p>', '', '<p>Stara kamena kuæa u centru jednog od 7 prekrasnih mjesta Ka&scaron;tela koja u se smjestila izmeðu Trogira i Splita.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Od mora i &scaron;etnice je udaljena 50 m, gdje se ujedno nalaze trgovine i ostali sadr¾aji.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ukupna povr&scaron;ina zemlji&scaron;ta iznosi 143 m2, dok je samo dvori&scaron;te 60 m2.</p>\r\n<p>Stambena povr&scaron;ina iznosi 166 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sastoji se od prizemlja i 1.kata sa posebnim vanjskim ulazima za svaku eta¾u.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U prizemlju se nalazi zatvorena loggia, dnevni boravak, kuhinja, kupaonica i konoba.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na 1.katu je zatvorena loggia sa djelomiènim pogledom na more, kupaonica i 4 spavaæe sobe.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæi je potrebno renoviranje, ali je za poèetak moguæ boravak i u sada&scaron;njem stanju.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Zbog odliènog polo¾aja i sve veæe popularnosti Ka&scaron;tela, ovo je idealna prilika za investiciju.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Velika prednost je i blizna meðunarodnog aerodroma.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za sva dodatna pitanja stojimo na raspolaganju.</p>', '<p>We have this well built old stone house in the centre of one of the seven beautiful small villages of Kastela which is situated between Trogir and Split.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is situated just 50m from the sea and the promenade with many shops, bakeries, bars, and coffee shops all nearby, and with easy access to Split from the regular bus service.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The total land area is 143 m2, which includes a courtyard of 60 m2.</p>\r\n<p>The living area of the house&nbsp; is 166 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house inside, consists of ground floor and 1st floor with separate outside entrances for each floor.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The ground floor: loggia, living room, kitchen, bathroom and cellar.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The 1st floor has a closed balcony with a partial sea view, bathroom and four bedrooms.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house needs renovation, but it is currently habitable.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Because of the excellent location and the increasing popularity of Kastela, this is an ideal investment.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The big advantage is the close proximity and easy access to Split and the international airport.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For any additional questions please contact our CPS Split office.</p>', '', '1075_Old-stone-house_0.JPG', '1075_Old-stone-house_1.JPG', '1075_Old-stone-house_2.JPG', '1075_Old-stone-house_3.jpg', '1075_Old-stone-house_4.jpg', '1075_Old-stone-house_5.jpg', '1075_Old-stone-house_6.jpg', '1075_Old-stone-house_7.jpg', '1075_Old-stone-house_8.jpg'),
(1076, 'Marko i Vlade', 'Te¹ija', '021 230 196', 'Tomislav Te¹ija 098 922 3324', 'Vlade Te¹ija 099 415 2564', 'Kastela', 'K.Novi, Ante Beretina 44A, 203/ zgr  203/4 zgr', 'For sale', 'Old stone house', '100', '72', '151', 1, '175000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 4, 5, 'March 7, 2015', '<p>Stara kamena kuæa sa 2 poslovna prostora i mnogim moguænostima smje&scaron;tena u centru jednog od 7 Ka&scaron;tela koja bilje¾e svu veæu turistèiku popularnost. Od mora i &scaron;etnice ima cca. 50 m, dok je malo dalje smje&scaron;tena &scaron;ljunèana pla¾a sa prekrasnim pogledom na Split i Èiovo. Kuæa se nalazi na zemlji&scaron;tu ukupne povr&scaron;ine 72 m2, dok je stambena povr&scaron;ina 151 m2. Sastoji se od prizemlja i 1.kata.</p>', '<p>We are pleased to offer this old stone house with two commercial premisses, modernised inside, in an area of fast increasing tourism. It is situated in the centre of one of the 7 Kastela which is increasingly popular with tourists as it is just outside Split, but still retains the peaceful charm of old Croatia. It is 50m from the Riva and the sea, while a little further is a pebble beach opposite Split and Ciovo. The house is located on a total plot area of 72 m2, and the living area inside the house is 151 m2.</p>', '', '<p>Stara kamena kuæa sa 2 poslovna prostora i mnogim moguænostima smje&scaron;tena u centru jednog od 7 Ka&scaron;tela koja bilje¾e svu veæu turistèiku popularnost.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Od mora i &scaron;etnice ima cca. 50 m, dok je malo dalje smje&scaron;tena &scaron;ljunèana pla¾a sa prekrasnim pogledom na Split i Èiovo.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa se nalazi na zemlji&scaron;tu ukupne povr&scaron;ine 72 m2, dok je stambena povr&scaron;ina 151 m2. Sastoji se od prizemlja i 1.kata.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U prizemlju se nalaze 2 poslovna prostora sa posebnim vanjskim ulazima. U svakom se nalazi 1 velika prostorija i wc.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sa druge strane kuæe se nalazi konoba koja takoðer ima vlastiti ulaz.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na 1.katu se nalazi hodnik i 3 manja apartmana. U prvom se nalazi kuhinja, 2 spavaæe sobe i kupaonica. U drugom i treæem je po 1 prostrana prostorija i kupaonica.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa ima i neiskori&scaron;teno potkrovlje koje trenutno nije moguæe preurediti u stambeni prostor.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je u solidnom stanju ali joj je potrebno renoviranje ukoliko se ¾elite luksuzniji nivo.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U blizini se nalaze mnogobrojni restorani, konobe, trgovine i ostali sadr¾aji.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Do meðunarodnog aerodroma je potrebno svega 15 min. vo¾nje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na usluzi smo za sva dodatna pitanja i informacije.</p>', '<p>We are pleased to offer this old stone house with two commercial premisses, modernised inside, in an area of fast increasing tourism.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is situated in the centre of one of the 7 Kastela which is increasingly popular with tourists as it is just outside Split, but still retains the peaceful charm of old Croatia.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is 50m from the Riva and the sea, while a little further is a pebble beach opposite Split and Ciovo.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house is located on a total plot area of 72 m2, and the living area inside the house is 151 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It consists of the ground floor and 1st floor.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The ground floor has 2 commercial spaces with separate outside entrances. In each there is one large room and toilet.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the other side of the house there is a bar, which also has its own entrance.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the 1st floor there is a hallway and three smaller apartments. One apartment consists of a kitchen, 2 bedrooms and bathroom. In the second and third there is one large and spacious room with a bathroom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house has an unused attic, which is currently not possible to convert into a residential area, but useful for storage.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house is in good condition both inside and out.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nearby are numerous restaurants, bars, coffee shops, shops and other facilities, and a bus stop for quick and regular access to Split.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>By car to the International Airport, it takes only 15 min driving.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact our office in Split to arrange to visit this property, similar properties or with questions.</p>', '', '1076_Old-stone-house_0.jpg', '1076_Old-stone-house_1.jpg', '1076_Old-stone-house_2.jpg', '1076_Old-stone-house_3.jpg', '1076_Old-stone-house_4.jpg', '1076_Old-stone-house_5.jpg', '1076_Old-stone-house_6.jpg', '1076_Old-stone-house_7.jpg', '1076_Old-stone-house_8.jpg');
INSERT INTO `nekretnina` (`id`, `ime`, `prezime`, `telefon`, `mobitel`, `e_mail`, `lokacija_id`, `adresa`, `status_id`, `vrsta_id`, `udaljenost`, `povrsina`, `stambenapovrsina`, `display`, `cijena`, `cijenatocka`, `ponuda_tjedna`, `new_built`, `must_sell`, `prvi_red_do_mora`, `pogled_na_more`, `bazen`, `broj_soba`, `broj_kupatila`, `datum`, `title_hr`, `title_en`, `title_ge`, `opis_hr`, `opis_en`, `opis_ge`, `PropertyImageURL0`, `PropertyImageURL1`, `PropertyImageURL2`, `PropertyImageURL3`, `PropertyImageURL4`, `PropertyImageURL5`, `PropertyImageURL6`, `PropertyImageURL7`, `PropertyImageURL8`) VALUES
(1077, 'Ivan', 'Zokiæ', '021 231 934 ', '091 554 0486   ', 'Sin Sreæko 091 721 0183', 'Kastela', 'K.Novi, Bratimska 2, ', 'For sale', 'Old stone house', '20', '108', '324', 1, '180000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 5, 1, 'March 7, 2015', '<p>U 2.redu od mora i prekrasne &scaron;etnice nalazi se stara kamena kuæa kojoj je potrebno renoviranje. Zbog svoje velièine ima vi&scaron;e opcija i prednosti. Iz kuæe se pru¾a djelomièan pogled na more dok se u blizini nalaze mnogi restorani, konobe, trgovine i svi ostali sadr¾aji. Kuæa se sastoji od prizemlja, 1.kata i potkrovlja ukupne stambene povr&scaron;ine 324 m2 &scaron;to je dovoljno za preureðenje u nekoliko apartmana.</p>', '<p>We are offering this old stone house in need of renovation, in one of the old Kastela villages, close to the sea. It is in the second row of property, just a few yards from the sea and the Riva. The house offers a partial view of the sea while in the vicinity are many options of restaurants, taverns, shops and other facilities, but with easy access to Split with a regular bus service. This substantial house consists of a ground floor, 1st floor and attic, with a total living area of 324 m2.</p>', '', '<p>U 2.redu od mora i prekrasne &scaron;etnice nalazi se stara kamena kuæa kojoj je potrebno renoviranje. Zbog svoje velièine ima vi&scaron;e opcija i prednosti.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Iz kuæe se pru¾a djelomièan pogled na more dok se u blizini nalaze mnogi restorani, konobe, trgovine i svi ostali sadr¾aji.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Do meðunarodnog aerodroma je potrebno svega 10 min. vo¾nje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa se sastoji od prizemlja, 1.kata i potkrovlja ukupne stambene povr&scaron;ine 324 m2 &scaron;to je dovoljno za preureðenje u nekoliko apartmana.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U prizemlju se nalaze ukupno 2 vanjska ulaza. Jedan ulaz trenutno vodi u prostranu konobu koju je moguæe preurediti u apartman ili vinski podrum. U prizemlju se jo&scaron; nalazi hodnik, kuhinja + blagovaonica iz koje je izlaz na terasu, kupaonica i 1 soba.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na 1.katu se nalazi hodnik, 4 spavaæe sobe i predulaz gdje su stepenice za potkrovlje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U potkrovlju se nalaze 2 velike prostorije i vanjska terasa sa malim prostorom koji mo¾e slu¾iti kao sprema.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je prikljuèena na gradsku kanalizaciju, dok su takoðer prikljuèena i sva ostala infrastruktura.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ukoliko ¾elite vi&scaron;e informacija molimo da nas kontaktirate.</p>', '<p>We are offering this old stone house in need of renovation, in one of the old Kastela villages, close to the sea.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is in the second row of property, just a few yards from the sea and the Riva.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house offers a partial view of the sea while in the vicinity are many options of restaurants, taverns, shops and other facilities, but with easy access to Split with a regular bus service.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The International Airport is only 10 min driving.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>This substantial house consists of a ground floor, 1st floor and attic, with a total living area of 324 m2 which would allow conversion into several substantial apartments.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The ground floor has two entrances. One entrance currently leads in the spacious cellar currently used as storage, but which can be incorporate into residential space, or a wine cellar. The ground floor also has hall, kitchen + dining room from which there is an exit to the terrace, a bathroom and one bedroom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the 1st floor is a hallway, four bedrooms and hall with stairs to the attic.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The top floor has two large rooms and an outdoor terrace with a small space that can serve as storage.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>This is a large property in an excellent location, but it needs renovation.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>If you want more information please contact us.</p>', '', '1077_Old-stone-house_0.jpg', '1077_Old-stone-house_1.jpg', '1077_Old-stone-house_2.jpg', '1077_Old-stone-house_3.jpg', '1077_Old-stone-house_4.jpg', '1077_Old-stone-house_5.jpg', '1077_Old-stone-house_6.jpg', '1077_Old-stone-house_7.jpg', '1077_Old-stone-house_8.jpg'),
(1078, 'Tereza', '©egviæ', '', '095/911-7458', 'villamucho@gmail.com', 'Split', '®rnovnica, Privor, Put Jerkoviæa 79, ', 'For sale', 'Old stone house', '3000', '274', '172', 2, '155000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 1, 3, 2, 'March 9, 2015', '<p>Samostojeæa stara kamena kuæa sa najekskluzivnijim pogledom na more, otoke i cijelo podruèje oko Splita i Stobreèa. Kuæa je potpuno obnovljena, luksuzno namje&scaron;tena i spremna za useljenje i u¾ivanje. Smje&scaron;tena je na zemlji&scaron;tu povr&scaron;ine 274 m2 gdje se nalazi bazen i prekrasno ureðena okuænica. Do mora i pla¾e je udaljenost 3 km &scaron;to je nekih 15 minuta vo¾nje. Kuæa se sastoji od prizemlja, 1., 2., i 3. kata ukupne stambene povr&scaron;ina 160 m2.</p>', '<p>We are offering this stunning but traditional stone house in a village with dramatic views of the sea, islands and the entire area around Split and the mountains. The house has been completely restored, luxuriously furnished and is ready for immediate living. The village is 3k from the coast, on the mainland above Split. It is situated on a land area of 274 m2 where there is a swimming pool and beautifully maintained garden. The house consists of ground, first, second, and third floors with a total floor area of 160 m2.</p>', '', '<p>Samostojeæa stara kamena kuæa sa najekskluzivnijim pogledom na more, otoke i cijelo podruèje oko Splita i Stobreèa.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je potpuno obnovljena, luksuzno namje&scaron;tena i spremna za useljenje i u¾ivanje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Smje&scaron;tena je na zemlji&scaron;tu povr&scaron;ine 274 m2 gdje se nalazi bazen i prekrasno ureðena okuænica.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Do mora i pla¾e je udaljenost 3 km &scaron;to je nekih 15 minuta vo¾nje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa se sastoji od prizemlja, 1., 2., i 3. kata ukupne stambene povr&scaron;ina 160 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U dvori&scaron;tu se nalazi jedna dodatna kuæica (12 m2) koja je trenutno u funkciji spreme.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U prizemlju je smje&scaron;tena kuhinja + blagovaonica i konoba.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na 1.katu je smje&scaron;tena kupaonica, wc, dnevni boravak i balkon.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na 2.katu su 2 spavaæe sobe, do je na 3.katu spavaæa soba, dnevni boravak + balkon sa prekrasnim pogledom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je veæ 5 godina u funkciji turistièkog iznajmljivanja stoga je moguæe nastaviti veæ uhodani posao.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Do centra povijesnog grada Splita ima cca 15 km.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za sve dodatne upite stojimo vam na raspolaganju.</p>', '<p>We are offering this stunning but traditional stone house in a village with dramatic views of the sea, islands and the entire area around Split and the mountains.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house has been completely restored, luxuriously furnished and is ready for immediate living.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The village is 3k from the coast, on the mainland above Split, but the growing numbers of people looking to buy away from the coast, will ensure that this is is as an excellent long term investment.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is situated on a land area of 274 m2 where there is a swimming pool and beautifully maintained garden.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house consists of ground, first, second, and third floors with a total floor area of 160 m2.&nbsp;In the backyard there is one additional house (12 m2), which is currently used as a storage area.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The ground floor has kitchen, dining room and wine cellar.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the 1st floor is &nbsp;bathroom, toilet, living room and balcony.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the 2nd floor there are 2 bedrooms.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the 3rd floor is another bedroom, living room and balcony with a beautiful views!</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house has been used for the last 5 years to rent to tourists and this well established and successful business can be continued.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The center of the historic city of Split is approximately 15 km.&nbsp;International airport is 40 mins drive.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For further inquiries we are available, and happy to escort buyers to the property.</p>', '', '1078_Old-stone-house_0.jpg', '1078_Old-stone-house_1.jpg', '1078_Old-stone-house_2.jpg', '1078_Old-stone-house_3.jpg', '1078_Old-stone-house_4.jpg', '1078_Old-stone-house_5.jpg', '1078_Old-stone-house_6.jpg', '1078_Old-stone-house_7.jpg', '1078_Old-stone-house_8.jpg'),
(1079, 'Gianandrea', 'Babini', '+39 347 6485 508', '', 'Gianandrea.babini@babini.com', 'Zadar', 'Verunic Dugi Otok Croatia', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '40', '100', '106', 2, '150000', '', 2, 1, 2, 2, 1, 2, 2, 2, 'March 9, 2015', '<p>U 2.redu do mora i prekrasne pla¾e nalazi se dvojna novoizgraðena kuæa. Smje&scaron;tena je na Dugom Otoku koji je povezan svakodnevnom trajektnom linijom sa gradom Zadrom gdje se ujedno nalazi i meðunarodni aerodrom. Kuæa je dvojna i nalazi se na zapadnoj strani. Orijentacija kuæe je istok &ndash; jug. Sastoji se od prizemlja i 1.kata ukupne stambene povr&scaron;ine 106 m2. Na prodaji je i istoèni dio kuæe sa èijim bi se spajanjem dobila prava villa.</p>', '<p>We are offering this newly completed, semi-detached house in the second rowto the sea.&nbsp;It is located on Dugi Otok island, which has daily ferries from Zadar.&nbsp;The property is located on the west side of the island, and the orientation of the house is south-east. The ground floor and 1st floor has a total living area of 106 m2. &nbsp;<br /><br /><br /></p>', '', '<p>U 2.redu do mora i prekrasne pla¾e nalazi se dvojna novoizgraðena kuæa.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Smje&scaron;tena je na Dugom Otoku koji je povezan svakodnevnom trajektnom linijom sa gradom Zadrom gdje se ujedno nalazi i meðunarodni aerodrom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je dvojna i nalazi se na zapadnoj strani. Orijentacija kuæe je istok &ndash; jug.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sastoji se od prizemlja i 1.kata ukupne stambene povr&scaron;ine 106 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U prizemlju se nalazi dnevni boravak + kuhinja + blagovaonica, kupaonica i loggia.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na 1.katu su 2 spavaæe sobe, kupaonica i terasa sa djelomiènim pogledom na more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ispred kuæe se nalazi parking i mali ureðeni vrt.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na pla¾i koja je udaljena 40 m od kuæe je moguæe privezati manji brod.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je potpuno zavr&scaron;ena, te nisu potrebna nikakva dodatna ulaganja.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na prodaji je i istoèni dio kuæe sa èijim bi se spajanjem dobila prava villa.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Okru¾enje je mirno i idealno za u¾ivanje i odmor.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ukoliko imate dodatnih pitanja molimo da nas kontaktirate.</p>', '<p>We are offering this newly completed, semi-detached house in the second row to the sea.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is located on Dugi Otok island, which has daily ferries from Zadar.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property is located on the west side of the island, and the orientation of the house is south-east.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The ground floor and 1st floor has a total living area of 106 m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The ground floor is an open plan living room + kitchen + dining room,bathroom and terrace.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the 1st floor are two bedrooms, bathroom and terrace with partial seaview.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>In front of the house there is parking and a small garden.&nbsp; There is the possibility of keeping a small boat on the nearby beach.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house has been fully completed, and requires with only some finalfittings and furniture to be purchased.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The local area is beautifully tranquil, perfect for enjoyment andrelaxation, with clear seas and natural preserved habitat behind theproperty.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>If you have any questions please contact us.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact the CPS office to arrange a viewing.</p>', '', '1079_House-Villa_0.jpg', '1079_House-Villa_1.jpg', '1079_House-Villa_2.jpg', '1079_House-Villa_3.jpg', '1079_House-Villa_4.jpg', '1079_House-Villa_5.jpg', '1079_House-Villa_6.jpg', '1079_House-Villa_7.jpg', '1079_House-Villa_8.jpg'),
(1081, 'Andrea', 'Wassmer', 'Nada Dajak 0914041188', 'Branko Ba¹iæ 0955502583', 'info@divota.hr ', 'Split', 'Radmiloviæeva 2', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '180', '0', '50', 1, '137500', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 1, 'March 13, 2015', '<p>&Scaron;armantan apartman u centru povijesnog grada Splita. Apartman je smje&scaron;ten u mirnom podruèju, ali u blizini svih sadr¾aja.&nbsp;Udaljen je od mora samo 180 m, u blizini Dioklecijanove palaèe i Marjana.&nbsp;Apartman se nalazi u prizemlju stare kamene kuæe, udaljene od gradske vreve. &nbsp;Nedavno je u potpunosti renoviran te prikljuèen na struju i vodu.&nbsp;S obzirom na podruèje moguæe je iznajmljivanje tijekom cijele godine.</p>', '<p>We are pleased to offer this stylishly renovated apartment in the heart of the old town of Split.The apartment is situated in a quiet area, &nbsp;just 180 m from the sea, in an area popular with tourists as the Palace, the Riva and the Marjan park are a short walk away. The apartment is fully furnished.&nbsp;The current owners are in the process of obtaining a ''renting licence'' for tourism.</p>', '', '<p>&Scaron;armantan apartman u centru povijesnog grada Splita.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartman je smje&scaron;ten u mirnom podruèju, ali u blizini svih sadr¾aja.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Udaljen je od mora samo 180 m, u blizini Dioklecijanove palaèe i Marjana.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartman se nalazi u prizemlju stare kamene kuæe, udaljene od gradske vreve. &nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nedavno je u potpunosti renoviran te prikljuèen na struju i vodu.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Orijentiran je sjeverno.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sastoji se od dnevnog boravka, blagavaone, kuhinje, malog hodnika, kupaone i jedne sobe koja slu¾i kao garderoba ili sprema.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Moguæe je odvajanje spavaæe sobe.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Stan je moderno opremljen, s cjelokupnim namje&scaron;tajem:</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>- Kuhinja: u potpunosti opremljena, ugradbeni hladnjak, perilica posuða, peænica, ploèa 4 x plin</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>- Kupaonica: ugraðeno podno grijanje, kada 180 x 80, ugradbeni vodokotliæ, konzolna wc &scaron;koljka, umivaonik 85 cm, bojler 80 l, perilica rublja</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>- Garderoba: komforna ventilirana prostorija s velikim ogledalom</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>- Dnevni dio/spavanje: le¾ajevi na razvlaèenje za dvije osobe, stol za blagovanje, noæni stoliæi, radni stoliæ, LCD TV.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Stambena povr&scaron;ina iznosi 50 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong><span style="text-decoration: underline;">Postoji moguænost iznajmljivanja apartmana na du¾e vrijeme po cijeni od 400 eura mjeseèno.</span></strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Buduæi da se radi o samom centru grada gdje je pristup automobilom ogranièen, najbli¾i parking udaljen je cca. 50 m.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Meðunarodni aerodrom udaljen je 40 min vo¾nje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za sve &nbsp;dodatne informacije stojimo vam na raspolaganju.</p>', '<p>We are pleased to offer this stylishly renovated apartment in the heart of the old town of Split.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The apartment is situated in a quiet area, &nbsp;just 180 m from the sea, in an area popular with tourists as the Palace, the Riva and the Marjan park are a short walk away.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The living area of the apartment is 50 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Inside this spacious ground floor studio apartment is an open plan living room, dining room, kitchen, a short hallway, bathroom and wardrobe.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is possible to separate one bedroom.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The apartment is fully furnished:</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>- Fully fitted kitchen with built-in fridge, dishwasher, oven and stove (4 gas burners)</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>- Bathroom with underfloor heating, bathtub 180 x 80 cm, built-in toilet tank, framed toilet bowl, sink 85 cm, heater 80 l, washing machine</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>- Wardrobe: spatious air-conditioned room with large mirror</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>- Living/sleeping area: pull-out sofa for 2 people, dining table, nightstands, desk, LCD TV.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The current owners are in the process of obtaining a ''renting licence'' for tourism.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is convenient for many shops, bars, and the cultural and historic attractions of the city.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The local streets are almost all ''pedestrian only''.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Parking is 50m away, but there is access for deliveries etc.</p>\r\n<p><strong><span style="text-decoration: underline;"><br /></span></strong></p>\r\n<p><strong><span style="text-decoration: underline;">There is a possibility to rent the apartment for a longer period at the price of &euro;400 per month.</span></strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Split international airport is 40 minutes driving.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please call our fabulous office to arrange to view this property.</p>', '', '1081_Apartment_0.jpg', '1081_Apartment_1.jpg', '1081_Apartment_2.jpg', '1081_Apartment_3.jpg', '1081_Apartment_4.jpg', '1081_Apartment_5.jpg', '1081_Apartment_6.jpg', '1081_Apartment_7.jpg', '1081_Apartment_8.jpg'),
(1082, 'Ana ', 'Reiæ', '091/ 200 7632', '', '', 'Brac', '3913 k.o. Sutivan Z.U. 1615', 'For sale', 'Old stone house', '1000', '9506', '25', 2, '155000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 1, 1, 'March 16, 2015', '<p>Posebna i unikatna nekretnina na Braèu, jednom od najljep&scaron;ih otoka srednje Dalmacije.&nbsp;Renoviranje je trajalo pune tri godine, gdje se pazilo na svaki detalj obla¾uæi ju posebno klesanim braèkim kamenom.&nbsp;Kuæa je graðena 2006. od ruèno obraðenog bijelog braèkog kamena po uzoru na autohtonu graðevinu otoka Braèa - bunju.&nbsp;Centar mjesta u prekrasnoj uvali udaljen je cca. 2km.&nbsp;Radi se o dvije tradicionalne kuæice lokalnog imena Bunje.</p>', '<p>We are pleased to offer this spectacular and unique old stone house, fully restored, on Brac island, one of the most beautiful Dalmatian islands. The process of renovation has lasted for 3 years, carefully using local stone and the finest materials to create a luxury space within a traditional historic building. The house was built in 2006. as a model of popular original house on Brac. There are two objects for sale.</p>', '', '<p>Posebna i unikatna nekretnina na Braèu, jednom od najljep&scaron;ih otoka srednje Dalmacije.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Renoviranje je trajalo pune tri godine, gdje se pazilo na svaki detalj obla¾uæi ju posebno klesanim braèkim kamenom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je graðena 2006. od ruèno obraðenog bijelog braèkog kamena po uzoru na autohtonu graðevinu otoka Braèa - bunju.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Centar mjesta u prekrasnoj uvali udaljen je cca. 2km.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Radi se o dvije tradicionalne kuæice lokalnog imena Bunje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Veæa je povr&scaron;ine 20 m2 + terasa, dok manja iznosi 5 m2 i slu¾i kao ostava i spremnik sa 11 000 litara vode.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U veæoj se nalazi 1 velika prostorija koja slu¾i kao spavaæa soba, luksuzno ureðena i idealna za odmor i opu&scaron;tanje. Unutra se takoðer nalazi i funkcionalno uklopljena kupaonica, jednako ureðena i unikatna.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Unutar bunje je fri¾ider, klima ureðaj, wc sa tu&scaron;em i rasvjeta koja koristi solarnu energiju.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ispred se nalazi velika terasa povr&scaron;ine 40 m2 sa koje se pru¾a prekrasan pogled na more, maslenik i cijeli krajolik.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>S obzirom na oblik obadvije bunje i terase, prema koeficijentima ukupna netto povr&scaron;ina iznosi 55 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Zidovi su debeli 80 cm, krov je pokriven kamenim ploèama, dok su metalna vrata iznutra oblo¾ena drvom kako bi se kod eventualnog po¾ara sprijeèilo da plamen uni&scaron;ti njezinu unutra&scaron;njost.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ukupna povr&scaron;ina zemlji&scaron;ta iznosi 9506 m2 gdje se smjestio i maslinik.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Od gornje strane ceste do maslinika vodi 200 m ureðen put do ulazne kapije i parking mjesta.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Otok Braè povezan je svakodnevnom trajektnom linijom sa gradom Splitom, stoga povezanost sa kopnom ne predstavlja problem.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Meðunarodni aerodrom udaljen je 40 minuta vo¾nje od grada Splita.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za sve ostale informacije molimo da nas kontaktirate.</p>', '<p>We are pleased to offer this spectacular and unique old stone house, fully restored, on Brac island, one of the most beautiful Dalmatian islands.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The process of renovation has lasted for 3 years, carefully using local stone and the finest materials to create a luxury space within a traditional historic building.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house was built in 2006. as a model of popular original house on Brac.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There are two objects for sale.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>One of the houses has living space of 20 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It consists of a big sleeping room, luxuriously fitted and decorated, with a unique bathroom and also a terrace of another 40 m2 with beautiful sea views and views across the landscape and the olive groves.</p>\r\n<p>Bigger house has electricity from the solar panels.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The second one has an area of 5 m2 and it is used as a storage and water tank.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Despite the interesting shape of the house, total net area is 55 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The plot is measuring 9506 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The land is out of the building zone (foreign nationals may acquire agricultural land only by setting up the company). &nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There is a 200 m long path from the upper side of the road to olive grove which leads to the main entrance and the parking place.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The closest village centre is about 2 km.The island of Brac is connected by daily ferry lines to Split, while the international airport is 30 mins drive from Split.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact us for further information and a tour of the property.</p>', '', '1082_Old-stone-house_0.jpg', '1082_Old-stone-house_1.jpg', '1082_Old-stone-house_2.jpg', '1082_Old-stone-house_3.jpg', '1082_Old-stone-house_4.jpg', '1082_Old-stone-house_5.jpg', '1082_Old-stone-house_6.jpg', '1082_Old-stone-house_7.jpg', '1082_Old-stone-house_8.jpg'),
(1083, 'Braco ', 'Omeroviæ', '022577937 baka Nada', '099 7733123', 'braco.omerovic@gmail.com', 'Sibenik', '®aboriæ', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '30', '600', '250', 1, '350000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 4, 2, 'March 16, 2015', '<p>Prekrasna samostojeæa kuæa u mirnom predjelu ®aboriæa, smje&scaron;tena svega 30 m od mora i pla¾e. Ima djelomièan pogled na more koji se pru¾a s terase, a poseban ugoðaj daje mediteransko bilje u vrtu koje je i ujedno za&scaron;tita od buke i znati¾eljnih pogleda.&nbsp;Kuæa se sastoji od prizemlja i kata, sveukupne povr&scaron;ine 250 m2. Mjesto je poznato po svojim ureðenim prirodno pjeskovitim i &scaron;ljunèanim pla¾ama, te po kristalno èistom moru.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>We have this beautiful detached house in a quiet area of &#8203;&#8203;Zaboric, situated only a few meters from the beach.&nbsp;It has partial sea view through the trees, but the established garden, with many Mediterranean plants gives a special calm atmosphere and privacy.&nbsp;The house consists of two floors, with a total area of &#8203;&#8203;250 m2.The place is known for its well-kept natural sandy and pebbly beaches and the crystal clear sea.</p>', '', '<p>Prekrasna samostojeæa kuæa u mirnom predjelu ®aboriæa, smje&scaron;tena svega 30 m od mora i pla¾e. Ima djelomièan pogled na more koji se pru¾a s terase, a poseban ugoðaj daje mediteransko bilje u vrtu koje je i ujedno za&scaron;tita od buke i znati¾eljnih pogleda.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa se sastoji od prizemlja i kata, sveukupne povr&scaron;ine 250 m2.U prizemlju se nalaze dnevni boravak, kuhinja, 2 spavaæe sobe i kupaona.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na katu se takoðer nalaze dnevni boravak, kuhinja, 2 spavaæe sobe i kupaona + terasa s koje se pru¾a predivan pogled na mjesto i more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na prostranom zemlji&scaron;tu povr&scaron;ine 600 m2 postoji moguænost izgradnje bazena.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na zemlji&scaron;tu je osiguran i parking.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa zahtijeva manju renovaciju, ali trenutno ima svu potrebnu infrastrukturu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je svega par &nbsp;minuta udaljena od turistièkog mjesta u kojem se nalaze svi sadr¾aji potrebni za idealan odmor ali i ¾ivot tijekom cijele godine, a od grada &Scaron;ibenika 15 minuta vo¾nje.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Mjesto je poznato po svojim ureðenim prirodno pjeskovitim i &scaron;ljunèanim pla¾ama, te po kristalno èistom moru.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Udaljenost do aerodroma je 30 km.</p>', '<p>We have this beautiful detached house in a quiet area of &#8203;&#8203;Zaboric, situated only a few meters from the beach.&nbsp;It has partial sea view through the trees, but the established garden, with many Mediterranean plants gives a special calm atmosphere and privacy.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house consists of two floors, with a total area of &#8203;&#8203;250 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The ground floor has a modern style living room and kitchen, with 2 bedrooms and bathroom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the first floor are also a living room, kitchen, 2 bedrooms and bathroom + terrace with a beautiful view of the town and the sea.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the large land plot of &#8203;&#8203;600 m2 there is plenty of opportunity for improvements, such as a swimming pool, and boat storage.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the property is secured parking.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>House requires minor redecorating, but was well built with good fittings.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house is only a few minutes away from the tourist town where you can find all the facilities required for an ideal holiday and life throughout the year, and the town of Sibenik 15 minutes.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The place is known for its well-kept natural sandy and pebbly beaches and the crystal clear sea.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Distance to airport 30 km.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact our office and we will arrange for you to visit the property.</p>', '', '1083_House-Villa_0.JPG', '1083_House-Villa_1.JPG', '1083_House-Villa_2.JPG', '1083_House-Villa_3.JPG', '1083_House-Villa_4.JPG', '1083_House-Villa_5.JPG', '1083_House-Villa_6.JPG', '1083_House-Villa_7.JPG', '1083_House-Villa_8.JPG'),
(1100, 'Igor', 'Paviæ', '091 5171009', '098209762 igor paviæ', '', 'Rogoznica', 'Stiva¹nica - Ra¾anj, kè10384/1 ko Sevid', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '10', '700', '400', 1, '850000', '', 2, 1, 2, 1, 1, 2, 6, 5, 'March 27, 2015', '<p>Kuæa u prvom redu do mora smje&scaron;tena u lijepoj uvali malog ribarskog mjesta. S obzirom na svoj polo¾aj od kuæe do lijepe prirodne pla¾e je svega par metara.&nbsp;Kuæa nije u potpunosti dovr&scaron;ena tako da je potrebno odreðeno ulaganje.&nbsp;Povr&scaron;ina kuæe je 400 m2, a nalazi se na parceli od 700 m2. Kuæa se sastoji od 5 apartmana. Udaljenost do restorana, kafiæa i duæana je svega par kilometara.</p>', '<p>We are pleased to offer this newly built house, house next to the sea, in a beautiful bay by a small fishing village. It is situated just a few meters from the shore, and within walking distance to the nearest coffee bar. The house consists of 400 m2 of internal living area, and is located on a plot of 700 m2. The house was built with 5 apartments.</p>', '', '<p>Kuæa u prvom redu do mora smje&scaron;tena u lijepoj uvali malog ribarskog mjesta. &nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>S obzirom na svoj polo¾aj od kuæe do lijepe prirodne pla¾e je svega par metara.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa nije u potpunosti dovr&scaron;ena tako da je potrebno odreðeno ulaganje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Povr&scaron;ina kuæe je 400 m2, a nalazi se na parceli od 700 m2. Kuæa se sastoji od 5 apartmana.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Gara¾a je povr&scaron;ine 60 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa ima asfaltiran pristup i parking mjesta.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Okuænica je terasasto izvedena, a s obzirom na velièinu parcele na njoj je moguæe izgraditi bazen.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Udaljenost do restorana, kafiæa i duæana je svega par kilometara.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Aerodrom je na 25 km udaljenosti.</p>', '<p>We are pleased to offer this newly built house, house next to the sea, in a beautiful bay by a small fishing village.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is situated just a few meters from the shore, and within walking distance to the nearest coffee bar.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house is not completely finished so it will take more investment, but this has been built into the price.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house consists of 400 m2 of internal living area, and is located on a plot of 700 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house was built with 5 apartments. The garage is 60 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house has a paved access and private parking spaces.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The remaining land has been landscaped into terraces, but there is sufficient to late incorporate a boat store or a swimming pool.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>A very useful attraction if you are letting to tourists!</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The nearest village centre where there are restaurants, cafes and shops and a bakery is only a few kilometers.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The airport is 25 km away.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please call our office to make arrangements to visit this property.</p>', '', '1100_House-Villa_0.jpg', '1100_House-Villa_1.jpg', '1100_House-Villa_2.jpg', '1100_House-Villa_3.jpg', '1100_House-Villa_4.jpg', '1100_House-Villa_5.jpg', '1100_House-Villa_6.jpg', '1100_House-Villa_7.jpg', '1100_House-Villa_8.jpg'),
(1084, 'Dario ', 'Gulin', '091 3375484', '098 530068  Jakov Bujas 00385919055055 Sandra jerk', 'dario.gulin@gmail.com', 'Sibenik', '®aboriæ Komorica 7', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '15', '300', '136', 1, '360000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 4, 2, 'March 16, 2015', '<p>Kuæa drugi red do mora, u potpunosti renovirana, kvalitetno i moderno ureðena. Smje&scaron;tena u mirnom i lijepom okru¾enju, od mora i pla¾e udaljena samo 15 m!&nbsp;Kuæa je podijeljena na dvije eta¾e, prizemlje i kat, ukupne stambene povr&scaron;ine 136 m2.&nbsp;Svaka eta¾a se sastoji od dvije spavaæe sobe, dnevnog boravka, kuhinje i kupaone.&nbsp;Kuæa ima prelijepu okuænicu, a na zemlji&scaron;tu povr&scaron;ine 300 m2 postoji moguænost izgradnje manjeg bazena.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>', '<p>We are offering this completely renovated and modernised, spacious house, located with the sea and the beach only 15 m!&nbsp;The house is divided into two floors, ground floor and first floor, total residential surface area of &#8203;&#8203;136 m2.Each floor consists of two bedrooms, with an open plan living room, kitchen and bathroom.&nbsp;The house has a beautiful garden, with a land area of &#8203;&#8203;300 m2 which is enough to improve the property by building a swimming pool and patio area.<br /><br /></p>', '', '<p>Kuæa drugi red do mora, u potpunosti renovirana, kvalitetno i moderno ureðena. Smje&scaron;tena u mirnom i lijepom okru¾enju, od mora i pla¾e udaljena samo 15 m!&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je podijeljena na dvije eta¾e, prizemlje i kat, ukupne stambene povr&scaron;ine 136 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Svaka eta¾a se sastoji od dvije spavaæe sobe, dnevnog boravka, kuhinje i kupaone.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Dnevni boravak i spavaæa soba na katu imaju izlaz &nbsp;na terasu s koje se pru¾a prekrasan &nbsp;pogled na more, dok se u prizemlju iz dnevnog boravka i spavaæe sobe izlazi na lijepo ureðeni travnati vrt , koji ima ugraðen sustav za navodnjavanje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa ima prelijepu okuænicu, a na zemlji&scaron;tu povr&scaron;ine 300 m2 postoji moguænost izgradnje manjeg bazena.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U sklopu zemlji&scaron;ta nalazi se parking mjesto kao i dio za ro&scaron;tilj.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa ima svu potrebnu infrastrukturu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Mjesto je poznato po svojim ureðenim prirodno pjeskovitim i &scaron;ljunèanim pla¾ama, te po kristalno èistom moru.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Restorani i kafiæi se nalaze u neposrednoj blizini.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&Scaron;ibenik je udaljen 10-ak minuta, a splitski aerodrom 20 minuta vo¾nje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za sve daljnje informacije molimo Vas kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured.</p>', '<p>We are offering this completely renovated and modernised, spacious house, located with the sea and the beach only 15 m!</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house is divided into two floors, ground floor and first floor, total residential surface area of &#8203;&#8203;136 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Each floor consists of two bedrooms, with an open plan living room, kitchen and bathroom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Living room and bedroom on the first floor have a terrace that offers a breathtaking view of the sea, while on the ground floor, from the living room and bedrooms is a nice grass lawn, which incorporates a system for irrigation to keep it lush.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house has a beautiful garden, with a land area of &#8203;&#8203;300 m2 which is enough to improve the property by building a swimming pool and patio area.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Within the grounds there is a private parking area, &nbsp;and a bbq/grill.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house is on the main drains and water supply. The place is known for its well-kept natural sandy and pebbly beaches and the crystal clear sea.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Restaurants and bars are located along the beach in walking distance.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sibenik is 10 minutes, and the Split airport 20 minutes away.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For further information please contact our office.</p>', '', '1084_House-Villa_0.JPG', '1084_House-Villa_1.JPG', '1084_House-Villa_2.JPG', '1084_House-Villa_3.JPG', '1084_House-Villa_4.JPG', '1084_House-Villa_5.JPG', '1084_House-Villa_6.JPG', '1084_House-Villa_7.JPG', '1084_House-Villa_8.JPG'),
(1085, 'Jurin', 'Miroè', '', '091/561 5611', '', 'Primosten', 'Strane 44, Bilo', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '30', '600', '250', 1, '250000', '', 2, 1, 2, 2, 1, 2, 6, 4, 'March 16, 2015', '<p>Kuæa u izgradnji na svega 30 m od mora, s koje se pru¾a pogled na more. Povr&scaron;ina izgraðenog dijela (samo grubi radovi) kuæe je 250m2. Trenutno je kuæa podijeljena na dva kata na svakom katu su po dva apartmana, ukupno 4 apartmana. Na kuæu se mo¾e nadograditi jo&scaron; jedan kat i potkrovlje. U potkrovlju je po planu pola zatvoreni dio a pola otvorena velika terasa.&nbsp;S kuæe se pru¾a predivan pogleda na more i okolicu.</p>', '<p>We have this project of a house, partly constructed, at a huge discount on the completed cost of the finished building.&nbsp;It is situated only 30 meters from the sea, with a view of the sea and islands nearby, on the mainland north of Trogir, near Primosten.&nbsp;Much of the heavy work has been completed and the area of the house completed is 250m2.&nbsp;The house is divided into two floors and on each floor there are two apartments, in total 4 apartments, with a top floor to be added.&nbsp;<br /><br /></p>', '', '<p>Kuæa u izgradnji na svega 30 m od mora, s koje se pru¾a pogled na more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Povr&scaron;ina izgraðenog dijela (samo grubi radovi) kuæe je 250m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Trenutno je kuæa podijeljena na dva kata na svakom katu su po dva apartmana, ukupno 4 apartmana.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Dva apartmana imaju dvije spavaæe sobe, dnevni boravak s kuhinjom i kupaonicu ali mo¾e biti dovr&scaron;ena ovisno o ¾eljama i potrebama.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Druga dva apartmana imaju jednu spavaæu sobu, dnevni boravak s kuhinjom i kupaonicu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na kuæu se mo¾e nadograditi jo&scaron; jedan kat i potkrovlje. U potkrovlju je po planu pola zatvoreni dio a pola otvorena velika terasa.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Povr&scaron;ina parcele je 600 m2.S kuæe se pru¾a predivan pogleda na more i okolicu.Kuæa ima osiguran parking.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Udaljenost do Primo&scaron;tena je svega par kilometara, a do aerodroma u Splitu 60 km , a do aerodroma u Zadru 100 km.</p>', '<p>We have this project of a house, partly constructed, at a huge discount on the completed cost of the finished building.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is situated only 30 meters from the sea, with a view of the sea and islands nearby, on the mainland north of Trogir, near Primosten.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Much of the heavy work has been completed and the area of the house completed is 250m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house is divided into two floors and on each floor there are two apartments, in total 4 apartments, with a top floor to be added.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Two apartments have two bedrooms, living room with kitchen and bathroom but the design can be completed according to the wishes and needs of a new owner.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The other two apartments have one bedroom, living room with kitchen and bathroom.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>House can be upgraded with adding &nbsp;floor and the attic.&nbsp;The top floor is planed as half closed and half as a big open terrace.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Plot area is 600 m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house has a beautiful view of the sea and the countryside.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house has a parking lot.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Distance to Primosten is only a few kilometers, and the airport in Split 60 km, and the airport in Zadar 100 km.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>We can help with questions about local builders who could finish this project without much difficulty, and for the purchaser with vision, this is the best way to acquire a substantial property at a considerable discount.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For questions or to arrange to visit this and similar properties call our Split office.</p>', '', '1085_House-Villa_0.JPG', '1085_House-Villa_1.JPG', '1085_House-Villa_2.JPG', '1085_House-Villa_3.JPG', '1085_House-Villa_4.JPG', '1085_House-Villa_5.JPG', '1085_House-Villa_6.JPG', '1085_House-Villa_7.JPG', '1085_House-Villa_8.JPG'),
(1086, 'Darko', 'Kopjar', '', '095 391 3559', 'Mihael.kopjar@gmail.com', 'Trogir', 'Put Kave 2B, k.è. 2113/84', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '150', '0', '81', 1, '178000', '', 2, 2, 2, 1, 1, 2, 3, 2, 'March 17, 2015', '<p>Kompletno namje&scaron;ten i opremljen apartman na Èiovu, samo 150 m udaljen od &scaron;ljunèane pla¾e. Smje&scaron;ten u izuzetno mirnom predjelu, okru¾en &scaron;umom gdje nije dozvoljena gradnja, pa ovaj dio pru¾a sigurnu privatnost te idiliènu atmosferu.&nbsp;Apartman se nalazi u prizemlju.&nbsp;Cijeli otok prepun je lijepim pla¾ama, skrivenim uvalama i mnogim drugim prirodnim ljepotama.</p>', '<p>We have this stylishly furnished and equipped apartment on Ciovo.&nbsp;It is only 150 m away from the beach, and a direct path through preserved woodland to the shore with great bathing and swimming areas adds to the feeling of privacy and an idyllic atmosphere.&nbsp;The apartment is located on the ground floor.&nbsp;The whole island is popular and has many beautiful beaches, hidden coves and other natural attractions.</p>', '', '<p>Kompletno namje&scaron;ten i opremljen apartman na Èiovu, samo 150 m udaljen od &scaron;ljunèane pla¾e.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Smje&scaron;ten u izuzetno mirnom predjelu, okru¾en &scaron;umom gdje nije dozvoljena gradnja, pa ovaj dio pru¾a sigurnu privatnost te idiliènu atmosferu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartman se nalazi u prizemlju gdje se nalazi dnevni boravak, kuhinja, 3 spavaæe sobe, 2 kupaone i garderoba.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U prizemlju su dvije otvorene terase ukupne povr&scaron;ine 14 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na sporednom dijelu zgrade nalazi se jo&scaron; jedna terasa &nbsp;(83,75 m2) na kojoj je smje&scaron;tena konoba (12 m2).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ukupna stambena povr&scaron;ina iznosi 81,30 m2.</p>\r\n<p>Apartmanu pripadaju dva parkirna mjesta ispred zgrade sa postavljenom ogradom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Zgrada ima direktan pristup sa ceste.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartman je orijentiran sjeveroistoèno.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Cijeli otok prepun je lijepim pla¾ama, skrivenim uvalama i mnogim drugim prirodnim ljepotama.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Centar mjesta sa svim potrebnim sadr¾ajima je udaljen 2 minute vo¾nje, dok je grad Trogir udaljen 10 min., a meðunarodni aerodrom 15 min. vo¾nje.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Molimo Vas da kontaktirate na&scaron; ured za daljnje informacije.</p>', '<p>We have this stylishly furnished and equipped apartment on Ciovo.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is only 150 m away from the beach, and a direct path through preserved woodland to the shore with great bathing and swimming areas adds to the feeling of privacy and an idyllic atmosphere.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The apartment is located on the ground floor where there is a living room, kitchen, 3 bedrooms, 2 bathrooms and a cloakroom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the ground floor are two open terraces total area of 14 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the side of the building there is a terrace (83.75 m2) in which there is a cellar (12 m2).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Total area is 81.30 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The apartment has two parking spaces in front of the building, and there is direct access from the road.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property is oriented northeast.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The whole island is popular and has many beautiful beaches, hidden coves and other natural attractions.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The nearest village with bars, bakery and shops is just a 2-minute drive away, while the larger town of Trogir is 10 min.,and here are many more options of restaurants, night life as well it being the cultural and historic centre of tourism in the area.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The international airport is 15 minutes. driving.Please contact our office for further information.</p>', '', '1086_Apartment_0.jpg', '1086_Apartment_1.jpg', '1086_Apartment_2.jpg', '1086_Apartment_3.jpg', '1086_Apartment_4.jpg', '1086_Apartment_5.jpg', '1086_Apartment_6.jpg', '1086_Apartment_7.JPG', '1086_Apartment_8.JPG'),
(1089, 'Goran', 'Ivanda', '', '0997991670', 'ivagor@net.hr', 'Sibenik', '®aboriæ, k.è.*766 KO Krapanj, 890.000 &#8364;', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '5', '520', '400', 1, '99999999', '', 2, 2, 2, 1, 1, 2, 7, 4, 'March 18, 2015', '<p>Na svega par metara od mora nalazi se u potpunosti ureðena kuæa s koje se pru¾a pogled na more. Borovi oko kuæe i lijepo ureðena parcela osiguravaju nesmetano u¾ivanje u ti&scaron;ini i svje¾em morskom zgradu.&nbsp;Povr&scaron;ina kuæe je 400 m2, a povr&scaron;ina parcele 520 m2.&nbsp;Kuæa se sastoji od prizemlja, I, II i III kata.&nbsp;Lijepo ureðena pla¾a nalazi se neposredno ispred kuæe.&nbsp;U cijenu je ukljuèen i vlastiti vez za brod.&nbsp;Kuæa ima svu potrebnu infrastrukturu.</p>', '<p>We are offering this substantial attractive apartment house in a beautiful location just a few meters from the sea.&nbsp;The property is surrounded by established woodland, with the sea at the bottom of the garden. The house itself is 400 m2 of residential living area, and 520 m2 plot size. The house consists of a ground floor, I, II and III floor.&nbsp;The beach in front of the house is a popular area for swimmers in the tourist season.&nbsp;The price includes your own private mooring.</p>', '', '<p>Na svega par metara od mora nalazi se u potpunosti ureðena kuæa s koje se pru¾a pogled na more. Borovi oko kuæe i lijepo ureðena parcela osiguravaju nesmetano u¾ivanje u ti&scaron;ini i svje¾em morskom zgradu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Povr&scaron;ina kuæe je 400 m2, a povr&scaron;ina parcele 520 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa se sastoji od prizemlja, I, II i III kata.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U prizemlju su smje&scaron;teni: gara¾a i stambeni dio.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Stambeni dio saèinjavaju kuhinja, dnevni boravak, spavaæa soba i kupaona.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Prvi &nbsp;kat se sastoji od spavaæe sobe, kupaone, spreme, kuhinje i dnevnog boravka s izlazom na veliku terasu povr&scaron;ine 60 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Drugi i treæi kat zauzima dvoeta¾ni stan povr&scaron;ine 175 m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Donji &nbsp;kat stana èine dnevni boravak, kuhinja, kupaona i tri spavaæe sobe.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Gornji kat èine dvije spavaæe sobe, kupaonica, mala kuhinja s dnevnim boravkom i velika terasa.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Svaki kat ima izlaz na balkon s kojeg se pru¾a prekrasan pogled na more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>S obzirom na velièinu parcele moguæe je izgraditi bazen.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Lijepo ureðena pla¾a nalazi se neposredno ispred kuæe.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U cijenu je ukljuèen i vlastiti vez za brod.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa ima svu potrebnu infrastrukturu.</p>', '<p>We are offering this substantial attractive apartment house in a beautiful location just a few meters from the sea.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property is surrounded by established woodland, with the sea at the bottom of the garden.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house itself is 400 m2 of residential living area, and 520 m2 plot size.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house consists of a ground floor, I, II and III floor.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The ground floor has a garage and living area, and this part consists of a kitchen, living room, bedroom and bathroom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The first floor consists of a bedroom, bathroom, storage, kitchen and living room with access to a large terrace of 60 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The second and third floor duplex apartment occupies an area of 175 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The lower floor of the apartment consists of living room, kitchen, bathroom and three bedrooms.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The upper floor consists of two bedrooms, bathroom, small kitchen, living room and large terrace.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Of course each floor has a balcony with a beautiful view of the sea.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The condition and fittings inside the property are excellent and it has been well maintained.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Given the size of the plot it is possible to build a swimming pool.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The beach in front of the house is a popular area for swimmers in the tourist season.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The price includes your own private mooring.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>A few minutes drive from here is the small village with several choices of bars, restaurants and other useful services, such as shops, bakery etc.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please call our office to arrange to visit this property.</p>', '', '1089_House-Villa_0.JPG', '1089_House-Villa_1.JPG', '1089_House-Villa_2.JPG', '1089_House-Villa_3.JPG', '1089_House-Villa_4.JPG', '1089_House-Villa_5.JPG', '1089_House-Villa_6.JPG', '1089_House-Villa_7.JPG', '1089_House-Villa_8.JPG');
INSERT INTO `nekretnina` (`id`, `ime`, `prezime`, `telefon`, `mobitel`, `e_mail`, `lokacija_id`, `adresa`, `status_id`, `vrsta_id`, `udaljenost`, `povrsina`, `stambenapovrsina`, `display`, `cijena`, `cijenatocka`, `ponuda_tjedna`, `new_built`, `must_sell`, `prvi_red_do_mora`, `pogled_na_more`, `bazen`, `broj_soba`, `broj_kupatila`, `datum`, `title_hr`, `title_en`, `title_ge`, `opis_hr`, `opis_en`, `opis_ge`, `PropertyImageURL0`, `PropertyImageURL1`, `PropertyImageURL2`, `PropertyImageURL3`, `PropertyImageURL4`, `PropertyImageURL5`, `PropertyImageURL6`, `PropertyImageURL7`, `PropertyImageURL8`) VALUES
(1087, 'Maja', 'Gvozdenoviæ', '', '095/5443117', 'maki7686@gmail.com', 'Split', '©etali¹te I. Me¹troviæa 102, k.è. 7806/1, 7806/2, 7789', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '400', '3258', '173', 2, '990000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 5, 1, 'March 17, 2015', '<p>Kuæa na prostranom zemlji&scaron;tu, s prekrasnim pogledom na more, pru¾a izniman mir i privatnost, a udaljena je od centra grada svega 5 min.&nbsp;Smje&scaron;tena je &nbsp;u gradu Splitu, na zapadnom dijelu, ujedno i jednom od najpopularnijih djelova grada.&nbsp;Udaljena je od mora i pla¾e samo 400 m.&nbsp;Sastoji se od podruma, prizemlja i potkrovlja. Zahtijeva manju renovaciju. Zemlji&scaron;te je oznaèeno kao poljoprivredno.</p>', '<p lang="en-GB">We are pleased to offer this house on a giant plot, in Split.&nbsp;It is situated on the west side of town, in the most affluent residential area, 400 m from the sea and the beach.&nbsp;There are sea views from the building and most areas of the plot, and the property is close to the Marjan park, the preserved woodland park to the west of the town.&nbsp;The house consists of a basement, ground floor and the attic, and the property needs renovation.&nbsp;The plot is not designated ''building'' land, but ''agricultural'' only.<br /><br /></p>', '', '<p>Kuæa na prostranom zemlji&scaron;tu, s prekrasnim pogledom na more, pru¾a izniman mir i privatnost, a udaljena je od centra grada svega 5 min. Smje&scaron;tena je &nbsp;u gradu Splitu, na zapadnom dijelu, ujedno i jednom od najpopularnijih djelova grada.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Udaljena je od mora i pla¾e samo 400 m.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sastoji se od podruma, prizemlja i potkrovlja.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Podrum se sastoji od 3 sobe i spreme. Ukupna povr&scaron;ina stambenog prostora je 173 m2 (podrum + prizemlje).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U prizemlju se nalazi dnevni boravak, kuhinja, kupaonica i 2 spavaæe sobe.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa takoðer ima i potkrovlje u kojem se mo¾e urediti jedna soba.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>S obzirom na prostranost zemlji&scaron;ta postoji i moguænost izgradnje bazena.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Povr&scaron;ina zemlji&scaron;ta iznosi 3258 m2 &nbsp;te se na njemu nalazi 40 stabala maslina.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Buduæi da zemlji&scaron;te nije oznaèeno kao graðevno, nego kao poljoprivredno, ne postoji moguænost izgradnje novog objekta ili nadogradnje na postojeæi.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Svi sadr¾aji ukljuèujuæi kulturne i povijesne znamenitosti te restorane i &nbsp;barove su udaljeni svega nekoliko minuta vo¾nje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Molimo Vas da kontaktirate na&scaron; ured za sve &nbsp;dodatne informacije.</p>', '<p>We are pleased to offer this house on a giant plot, in Split.&nbsp;It is situated on the west side of town, in the most affluent residential area, 400 m from the sea and the beach.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There are sea views from the building and most areas of the plot, and the property is close to the Marjan park, the preserved woodland park to the west of the town.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house consists of a basement, ground floor and the attic, and the property needs renovation.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The ground floor consists of a kitchen, living room, bathroom and 2 bedrooms.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>In the basement are 3 rooms and a small storage.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Total living area is of the house is 173 m2 (basment + ground floor).&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Attic could be transformed into additional living area.There is plenty of space to add swimming pool.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property sits on a large plot of 3258 m2 which is planted with 40 olive trees.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The plot is not designated ''building'' land, but ''agricultural'' only.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please note that most probably no new buildings or extensions to the current property would be allowed.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Property can be&nbsp;accessed by car and there&nbsp;is plenty parking space on plot.</p>\r\n<p>Within a few minutes'' drive, are many of the cultural and&nbsp;historic monuments in the city, as well as many of the best bars, restaurants and the active nightlife.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is a short walk to the main marina in Split.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact our office for more information and to arrange to visit this property.</p>', '', '1087_House-Villa_0.jpg', '1087_House-Villa_1.png', '1087_House-Villa_2.jpg', '1087_House-Villa_3.jpg', '1087_House-Villa_4.jpg', '1087_House-Villa_5.jpg', '1087_House-Villa_6.jpg', '1087_House-Villa_7.jpg', '1087_House-Villa_8.jpg'),
(1092, 'Gordana', 'Petrat', '', '', '', 'Brac', 'Supetar 806/33     853 zgr', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '200', '150', '45', 2, '115000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 'March 19, 2015', '<p>Stan u prizemlju &scaron;armantne dvojne kuæe smje&scaron;tene na sjevenoj strani otoka Braèa u lijepom turistièkom mjestu koje je svakodnevnim trajektnim linijama povezano sa Splitom i ostalim dalmatinskim otocima. Od mora je udaljana &scaron;etnjom 200 metara. Nedaleko se nalaze brojni restorani, kafiæi, barovi i ostali sadr¾aji korisni turistima.&nbsp;Kuæa se nalazi u mirnom predjelu, blizu ureðene gradske pla¾e i centra mjesta. Nedaleko su i sportski i rekreativni sadr¾aji u sklopu hotelskog naselja.&nbsp;<br /><br /></p>', '<p lang="en-GB">We have this charming semi-detached house located on the north coast of the island of Brac.&nbsp;It is located in an attractive and historic Dalmatian port, in a quiet street, just 200 m from the pebble beach, and also, only a short walk to many bars, caf&eacute;s, coffee shops and other services and facilities useful for tourists and the local population on the island. It is situated in a quiet area, nearby beautiful beaches, the town centre with sports and recreational facilities in the hotel complex, nearby.</p>', '', '<p>Stan u prizemlju &scaron;armantne dvojne kuæe smje&scaron;tene na sjevenoj strani otoka Braèa u lijepom turistièkom mjestu koje je svakodnevnim trajektnim linijama povezano sa Splitom i ostalim dalmatinskim otocima.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Od mora je udaljana &scaron;etnjom 200 metara. Nedaleko se nalaze brojni restorani, kafiæi, barovi i ostali sadr¾aji korisni turistima.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Povr&scaron;ina dvori&scaron;ta iznosi 150 m2, dok je brutto povr&scaron;ina stana 45 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Dvori&scaron;te èine natkrivena sjenica, parking i velika terasa. Tu je i vi&scaron;e stabala smokve, limuna, gusta zelena ograda i pergola.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na parceli postoji moguænost izgradnje bazena.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Stambeni dio se sastoji od dnevnog boravka koji ima izlaz na veliku natkrivenu terasu povr&scaron;ine 30 m2, kuhinje, kupatila i 2 spavaæe sobe. Stan je novonamje&scaron;ten.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je sjeverozapadno orijentirana.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa se nalazi u mirnom predjelu, blizu ureðene gradske pla¾e i centra mjesta. Nedaleko su i sportski i rekreativni sadr¾aji u sklopu hotelskog naselja.&nbsp;<br /><br /></p>\r\n<p>Odlièna prilika za iznajmljivanje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je renovirana 2013. &nbsp;godine (nova fasada, postavljeni novi prozori i vrata, elektriène instalacije te instalacije za vodu).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ima uporabnu dozvolu.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Molimo kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured za dodatne informacije.</p>', '<p lang="en-GB">We have this charming semi-detached house located on the north coast of the island of Brac.</p>\r\n<p lang="en-GB">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p lang="en-GB">It is located in an attractive and historic Dalmatian port, in a quiet street, just 200 m from the pebble beach, and also, only a short walk to many bars, caf&eacute;s, coffee shops and other services and facilities useful for tourists and the local population on the island.</p>\r\n<p lang="en-GB">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p lang="en-GB">The property is relatively modest, with the ground floor 45 m2 and with a garden of 150 m2 .</p>\r\n<p lang="en-GB">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p lang="en-GB">The garden consists of a covered gazebo, parking space and a large terrace. There are also several fruit trees, including figs, and lemon, and good fences which help preserve privacy.</p>\r\n<p lang="en-GB">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p lang="en-GB">The property is a furnished apartment with an open living room opening onto a large covered terrace, with kitchen, bathroom and two bedrooms. The apartment is being sold fully furnished.</p>\r\n<p lang="en-GB">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p lang="en-GB">The house is north/east orientation.</p>\r\n<p lang="en-GB">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p lang="en-GB">It is situated in a quiet area, nearby beautiful beaches, the town centre with sports and recreational facilities in the hotel complex, nearby.</p>\r\n<p lang="en-GB">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p lang="en-GB">It is an excellent rental opportunity.</p>\r\n<p lang="en-GB">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p lang="en-GB">The house was recently completely renovated and upgraded in 2013 with a new facade, new doors and windows, new electric installations, new water installations, and redecorating throughout.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>All infrastrusture is present.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house has a usage permit.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p lang="en-GB">Please contact our office to arrange a visit.</p>', '', '1092_House-Villa_0.jpg', '1092_House-Villa_1.jpg', '1092_House-Villa_2.jpg', '1092_House-Villa_3.jpg', '1092_House-Villa_4.jpg', '1092_House-Villa_5.jpg', '1092_House-Villa_6..jpg', '1092_House-Villa_7.jpg', '1092_House-Villa_8.jpg'),
(1090, 'Ivan ', 'Jurkoviæ', '', '098 321 552', '', 'Trogir', 'Put Punte 57A Okrug Donji, k.è. 2257/92', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '250', '0', '70', 1, '120000', '', 2, 1, 2, 2, 1, 2, 2, 2, 'March 18, 2015', '<p>Apartmani s predivnim pogledom na more u zgradi smje&scaron;tenoj u mirnom djelu mjesta nedaleko Trogira. Samo 250 m udaljeni od mora i &scaron;ljunèanih pla¾a, a svega nekoliko minuta od restorana, barova, trgovina i ostalih potrebnih sadr¾aja.&nbsp;APARTMAN 1: &euro;120.000, 70 M2,&nbsp;APARTMAN 2: &euro;125.000, 70 M2.&nbsp;Zgrada je udaljena 3 minute od trgovine, a 10 minuta od veæeg mjesta, dok je grad Trogir udaljen 15 min.&nbsp;Meðunarodni aerodrom udaljen 15 minuta vo¾nje.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>We have these two newly completed apartments with stunning sea views in a building situated in a quiet place on Ciovo Island, near Trogir.&nbsp;They are situated just 250 meters from the sea and beaches, and only minutes from restaurants, bars, shops and other necessary facilities in the nearest small village.&nbsp;APARTMENT 1: &euro; 120,000, 70 M2,&nbsp;APARTMENT 2: &euro; 125 000, 70 M2. The international airport is 15 minutes away.</p>', '', '<p>Apartmani s predivnim pogledom na more u zgradi smje&scaron;tenoj u mirnom djelu mjesta nedaleko Trogira.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Samo 250 m udaljeni od mora i &scaron;ljunèanih pla¾a, a svega nekoliko minuta od restorana, barova, trgovina i ostalih potrebnih sadr¾aja.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;"><strong>APARTMAN 1: &euro;120.000, 70 M2</strong></span></p>\r\n<p>Apartman na prvom katu zgrade, sastoji se od dvije spavaæe sobe, jedne kupaone, jednog wc-a, predsoblja, dnevnog boravka s kuhinjom i dvije loggie.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartman ima 2 balkona s pogledom na more, vrt i &scaron;umu te jedno parkirno mjesto.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;"><strong>APARTMAN 2: &euro;125.000, 70 M2</strong></span></p>\r\n<p>Apartman na drugom katu zgrade, sastoji se od dvije spavaæe sobe, jedne kupaone, jednog wc-a, predsoblja, dnevnog boravka s kuhinjom i dvije loggie.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartman ima 2 balkona s pogledom na more, vrt i &scaron;umu te jedno parkirno mjesto.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartmani su orijentirani S-Z-I.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Zgrada je udaljena 3 minute od trgovine, a 10 minuta od veæeg mjesta, dok je grad Trogir udaljen 15 min.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Meðunarodni aerodrom udaljen 15 minuta vo¾nje.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>We have these two newly completed apartments with stunning sea views in a building situated in a quiet place on Ciovo Island, near Trogir.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>They are situated just 250 meters from the sea and beaches, and only minutes from restaurants, bars, shops and other necessary facilities in the nearest small village.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;"><strong>APARTMENT 1: &euro; 120,000, 70 M2</strong></span></p>\r\n<p>This apartment is on the first floor consists of two bedrooms, one bathroom, one toilet, hallway, modern open plan living room with kitchen with access to two large balconies.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Both balconies overlook the sea, the garden in front of the property and forest. There is one parking space.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;"><strong>APARTMENT 2: &euro; 125 000, 70 M2</strong></span></p>\r\n<p>Apartment on the second floor consists of two bedrooms, one bathroom, one toilet, hallway, open plan living room with kitchen and with access to two balconies.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The two balconies overlook the sea, garden and forest and one parking space comes with the property.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The apartments are oriented North/west-east.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The building is located 3 minutes from shops, coffee shops, bakery and other useful services, while the town of Trogir is a 15 min.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The international airport is 15 minutes away.Please contact our office to arrange to visit this property, or similar ones in the area.</p>', '', '1090_Apartment_0.jpg', '1090_Apartment_1.jpg', '1090_Apartment_2.jpg', '1090_Apartment_3.jpg', '1090_Apartment_4.jpg', '1090_Apartment_5.jpg', '1090_Apartment_6.jpg', '1090_Apartment_7.jpg', '1090_Apartment_8.jpg'),
(1093, 'Ivan ', 'Jurkoviæ', '', '098 321 552', '', 'Trogir', 'Put Punte 57A Okrug Donji, k.è. 2257/92', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '250', '75', '40', 2, '81000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 1, 1, 'March 19, 2015', '<p>Kuæa s predivnim pogledom na more smje&scaron;tena u mirnom djelu mjesta nedaleko Trogira. Samo 250 m udaljena od mora i &scaron;ljunèanih pla¾a, a svega nekoliko minuta od restorana, barova, trgovina i ostalih potrebnih sadr¾aja.&nbsp;Kuæa je udaljena 3 minute od trgovine, a 10 minuta od veæeg mjesta, dok je grad Trogir udaljen 15 min.&nbsp;Meðunarodni aerodrom udaljen 15 minuta vo¾nje.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>We are offering this house with stunning sea views situated on Ciovo Island, near Trogir.&nbsp;The property is situated only 250 m away from the sea and beaches, and only minutes fromrestaurants, bars, shops and other necessary facilities in the village centre.&nbsp;The house is located 3 minutes from the nearest village shops, while the town of Trogir is a 15 min. and here are many more options for restaurants and night life.&nbsp;The international airport is 15 minutes away.</p>', '', '<p>Kuæa s predivnim pogledom na more smje&scaron;tena u mirnom djelu mjesta nedaleko Trogira.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Samo 250 m udaljena od mora i &scaron;ljunèanih pla¾a, a svega nekoliko minuta od restorana, barova, trgovina i ostalih potrebnih sadr¾aja.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa se sastoji od prizemlja i prvog kata s posebnim ulazima, ukupne stambene povr&scaron;ine cca 40 m2, a smje&scaron;tena je na zemlji&scaron;tu povr&scaron;ine 75 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Prizemlje se sastoji od kuhinje, jedne spavaæe sobe i kupaone.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Prvi kat ima jednu veliku sobu s kaminom koja se mo¾e koristiti kao dnevna soba i kupaonu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Orijentacija je Z-I-J.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa ima jedno parking mjesto.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je udaljena 3 minute od trgovine, a 10 minuta od veæeg mjesta, dok je grad Trogir udaljen 15 min.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Meðunarodni aerodrom udaljen 15 minuta vo¾nje.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>We are offering this house with stunning sea views situated on Ciovo Island, near Trogir.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property is situated only 250 m away from the sea and beaches, and only minutes fromrestaurants, bars, shops and other necessary facilities in the village centre.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house consists of ground and first floors each with a separate entrance.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The total surface area of residential space is about 40 m2 and is located on a land area of 75 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The ground floor consists of a kitchen, one bedroom and bathroom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The first floor is a large room with a fireplace and this can be used as a living room and there is a bathroom.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property is on a west/South-east orientation.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house has one private parking space.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house is located 3 minutes from the nearest village shops, while the town of Trogir is a 15 min. and here are many more options for restaurants and night life.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The international airport is 15 minutes away.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact our office for more information and for us to arrange a visit to the property.</p>', '', '1093_House-Villa_0.jpg', '1093_House-Villa_1.jpg', '1093_House-Villa_2.jpg', '1093_House-Villa_3.jpg', '1093_House-Villa_4.jpg', '1093_House-Villa_5.jpg', '1093_House-Villa_6.jpg', '1093_House-Villa_7.jpg', '1093_House-Villa_8.jpg'),
(1094, 'Ivan ', 'Nikoliæ', '', '091 5171009', '', 'Rogoznica', 'Ra¾anj', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '10', '450', '250', 1, '800000', '', 2, 2, 2, 1, 1, 2, 4, 3, 'March 19, 2015', '<p>Prekrasna kuæa u prvom redu do mora smje&scaron;tena u lijepoj uvali malog ribarskog mjesta, gdje ljeto provodi velik broj turista, u¾ivajuæi u prekrasnom ambijentu borovih &scaron;uma, pla¾a i kristalno èistog mora.&nbsp;Na svega par metara od prirodne pla¾e je lijepo ureðen vrt u mediteranskom duhu.&nbsp;Kuæa je podijeljena na prizemlje, prvi i drugi kat, gdje su smje&scaron;tena tri apartmana, jedan dvosoban i dva jednosobna.</p>', '<p>We have this beautiful house in the first row to the sea in a beautiful bay on the edge of an idyllic small fishing village.It is situated a few meters from the shore, a natural shingle beach, surrounded by natural pine woods.&nbsp;The house is built on three floors, the ground floor, first and second floor, where there are three apartments, one 1-bedroom apartment and two 2-bedrooms apartments.</p>', '', '<p>Prekrasna kuæa u prvom redu do mora smje&scaron;tena u lijepoj uvali malog ribarskog mjesta, gdje ljeto provodi velik broj turista, u¾ivajuæi u prekrasnom ambijentu borovih &scaron;uma, pla¾a i kristalno èistog mora.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na svega par metara od prirodne pla¾e je lijepo ureðen vrt u mediteranskom duhu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Povr&scaron;ina kuæe je 250 m2, a nalazi se na parceli od 450 m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na parceli je moguæe izgraditi manji bazen.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je podijeljena na prizemlje, prvi i drugi kat, gdje su smje&scaron;tena tri apartmana, jedan dvosoban i dva jednosobna.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U prizemlju kuæe su ostava i gara¾a.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na prvom katu nalazi se veliki dvosoban apartman s izlazom na prostranu terasu na kojoj su sjenica i ro&scaron;tilj.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na drugom katu su dva jednosobna apartmana.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Iz svih soba i sa svih terasa pru¾a se èaroban pogled na more i uvalu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa ima pripadajuæi vez za brod.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Udaljenost do restorana, kafiæa i duæana je svega par kilometara, a mjesto je &nbsp;idealno za miran obiteljski odmor u netaknutoj prirodi.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Mjesto je udaljeno od Rogoznice samo nekoliko kilometara, a od grada &Scaron;ibenika pola sata.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Aerodrom je na 25 km udaljenosti.</p>', '<p>We have this beautiful house in the first row to the sea in a beautiful bay on the edge of an idyllic small fishing village.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is situated a few meters from the shore, a natural shingle beach, surrounded by natural pine woods.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house size is 250 m2 and is located on a plot of 450 m2 which is ample to allow improvements to the property such as boat storage or a swimming pool and patio area.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house is built on three floors, the ground floor, first and second floor, where there are three apartments, one 1-bedroom apartment and two 2-bedrooms apartments.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the ground floor is &nbsp;storage and a garage.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the first floor there is a large two bedroom apartment with access from the living room to the substantial terrace, covered with a gazebo, and equipped with a barbecue.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the second floor are two apartments.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Wherever you are inside this property, every window has marvellous views of the sea and the bay.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The decorating inside the property is all in good condition and needs little further investment.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house has a berth for a boat.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The beach below the property is beautifully clean with clear water and is ideal for, swimming and boating etc.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The distance to several restaurants, cafes and shops is a few minutes on a bicycle, and the location is ideal for a quiet family holiday in unspoilt nature.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The location is close to Rogoznica and half an hour by car from the city of Sibenik.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The airport is 25 km away.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please call our office to arrange to visit this property.</p>', '', '1094_House-Villa_0.jpg', '1094_House-Villa_1.jpg', '1094_House-Villa_2.jpg', '1094_House-Villa_3.jpg', '1094_House-Villa_4.jpg', '1094_House-Villa_5.jpg', '1094_House-Villa_6.jpg', '1094_House-Villa_7.jpg', '1094_House-Villa_8.jpg'),
(1095, 'Ivan ', 'Cigiæ', '©ime Malovan 021/887 024 ', 'Ana Malovan- 098/174 3584', 'Vlasnik Ivan Cigiæ  092 170 5501', 'Trogir', '©ime Malovan, Put Rastiæa 14, ®edno, Èiovo, k.è. 721/1 KO ®edno', 'For sale', 'Land plot', '1000', '602', '0', 2, '55000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 0, 0, 'March 19, 2015', '<p>Graðevinsko zemlji&scaron;te s pogledom na more, smje&scaron;teno na sjevernoj strani otoka, 1 km udaljeno od pla¾a, a svega nekoliko minuta od centra mjesta.&nbsp;Zemlji&scaron;te ima povr&scaron;inu 602 m2.&nbsp;Ima direktan pristup vozilom, dok su prikljuèci vode i struje u blizini.&nbsp;Ovo je idealna prilika tra¾ite li mjesto na kojem bi izgradili kuæu sa bazenom za vlastito u¾ivanje ili u svrhu turistièkog iznajmljivanja.</p>', '<p>We have this building plot with sea views, located on the northern side of the island of Ciovo, 1 km away from the beach and just minutes from the village centre.&nbsp;The land has an area of 602 m2. and it has direct access to the road, and connections to water and electricity are nearby ready for connection.&nbsp;This is an ideal opportunity you are looking for a place to build a holiday villa of your dreams with a swimming pool or large landscaped garden for your own enjoyment or for tourist rental.</p>', '', '<p>Graðevinsko zemlji&scaron;te s pogledom na more, smje&scaron;teno na sjevernoj strani otoka, 1 km udaljeno od pla¾a, a svega nekoliko minuta od centra mjesta.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Zemlji&scaron;te ima povr&scaron;inu 602 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ima direktan pristup vozilom, dok su prikljuèci vode i struje u blizini.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ovo je idealna prilika tra¾ite li mjesto na kojem bi izgradili kuæu sa bazenom za vlastito u¾ivanje ili u svrhu turistièkog iznajmljivanja.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Cijeli otok je okru¾en prekrasnim pla¾ama i netaknutom prirodom. U mjestu se nalaze trgovina i restoran.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Grad Trogir je udaljen 10 minuta vo¾nje, dok je meðunarodni aerodrom udaljen 15 min.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za sve dodatne informacije stojimo Vam na raspolaganju.</p>', '<p>We have this building plot with sea views, located on the northern side of the island of Ciovo, 1 km away from the beach and just minutes from the village centre.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The land has an area of 602 m2 and it has direct access to the road, and connections to water and electricity are nearby ready for connection.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>This is an ideal opportunity you are looking for a place to build a holiday villa of your dreams with a swimming pool or large landscaped garden for your own enjoyment or for tourist rental.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The entire island is surrounded by beautiful beaches and much of it is preserved.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The village has a shop, coffee shop, restaurant, as well as some other services.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The city of Trogir is a 10-minute drive, while the international airport is 15 minutes.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For further information or to arrange to visit this plot, we are available.</p>', '', '1095_Land-plot_0.JPG', '1095_Land-plot_1.JPG', '1095_Land-plot_2.JPG', '1095_Land-plot_3.JPG', '1095_Land-plot_4.JPG', '1095_Land-plot_5.JPG', '1095_Land-plot_6.JPG', '1095_Land-plot_7.JPG', ''),
(1098, 'Zdenka ', 'Sessa', '021/386385', '098448998', 'zdenkasessa@hotmail.com', 'Brac', 'Lo¾i¹æa, otok Braè, Cest.zgr.122/1, Z.U. 1634, cest.zgr.122/3,Z.U.351 i cest.zem.1491/2 Z.U. 104K.O ', 'For sale', 'Old stone house', '1000', '18', '50', 2, '33000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 0, 0, 'March 24, 2015', '<p>U malom &nbsp;prekrasnom mjestu &nbsp;na otoku Braèu, od mora udaljenom 1 km, smjestila se ova stara kamena kuæa sa pogledom na more, te mnogim potencijalima.&nbsp;Smje&scaron;tena je u blizini crkve u starom dijelu mjesta.&nbsp;Vlasnici posjeduju &nbsp;idejni projekt sanacije i rekonstrukcije te odobrenje za sanaciju od konzervatorskog odjela Ministarstva kulture Hrvatske.&nbsp;Kuæa ima stambenu povr&scaron;inu 50 m2, dok je zemlji&scaron;te velièine 18 m2.</p>', '<p>We are pleased to offer this superb looking refurbishment project in a small village on the west side of the island.It is situated 1 km away from the sea shore, in the centre of the village, near the historic church.&nbsp;The property was once one of the grandest buildings in the village, and the challenge would be to restore it to its former status.&nbsp;The owners have a preliminary design for the rehabilitation and reconstruction as well as approval by the Conservation Department of the Ministry of Culture Croatian.&nbsp;The house has a living area of 50 m2 and has a garden of 18 m2.</p>', '', '<p>U malom &nbsp;prekrasnom mjestu &nbsp;na otoku Braèu, od mora udaljenom 1 km, smjestila se ova stara kamena kuæa sa pogledom na more, te mnogim potencijalima.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Smje&scaron;tena je u blizini crkve u starom dijelu mjesta.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Vlasnici posjeduju &nbsp;idejni projekt sanacije i rekonstrukcije te odobrenje za sanaciju od konzervatorskog odjela Ministarstva kulture Hrvatske.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa ima stambenu povr&scaron;inu 50 m2, a nasuprot kuæe nalazi se dvor velièine 18 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Odlièna pozicija i pristup sa posebnim ulazom i moguæno&scaron;æu ureðenja lijepe okuænice.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je u blizini mora i centra mjesta gdje se nalaze svi potrebni sadr¾aji.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Mjesto se nalazi &nbsp;na zapadnom dijelu otoka Braèa, a ova nekretnina predstavlja jedinstvenu priliku za nekoga tko ¾eli stvoriti miran ¾ivot ili provoditi odmor u jednom od najljep&scaron;ih podruèja na otoku.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Otok Braè povezan je svakodnevnom trajektnom linijom sa gradom Splitom, dok je meðunarodni aerodrom udaljen 40 minuta vo¾nje od Splita.<br /><br /></p>\r\n<p>Molimo kontaktirajte nas za sve dodatne informacije.</p>', '<p>We are pleased to offer this superb looking refurbishment project in a small village on the west side of the island.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is situated 1 km away from the sea shore, in the centre of the village, near the historic church.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property was once one of the grandest buildings in the village, and the challenge would be to restore it to its former status.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The owners have a preliminary design for the rehabilitation and reconstruction as well as approval by the Conservation Department of the Ministry of Culture Croatian.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house has a living area of 50 m2 and has a garden of 18 m2 opposite the house.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The excellent location and access includes a separate entrance and enough land to landscape a beautiful garden.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Near this property are coffee bars, bakery and other services, for tourists and residents.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>This property presents a unique opportunity for someone who wants to create a peaceful life or spend their holiday in one of the most beautiful areas of the island.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The island of Brac is connected by daily ferry lines to Split, while the international airport is 40 minutes drive from Split.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact us for more information and to arrange to visit the property.</p>', '', '1098_Old-stone-house_0.jpg', '1098_Old-stone-house_1.jpg', '1098_Old-stone-house_2.jpg', '1098_Old-stone-house_3.jpg', '1098_Old-stone-house_4.jpg', '', '', '', ''),
(1141, 'Boris ', 'Horvat', '', '091 515 8304', 'geminidizajn@gmail.com', 'Solta', 'Grohote ©olta, Gradjevnu cesticu cini kat.cest.zrm. 1613 (sud.cest.zem.  418/44) k.o. Grohote, povrs', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '100', '656', '188', 1, '150000', '', 2, 1, 2, 2, 1, 2, 3, 1, 'April 21, 2015', '<p>Kuæa u izgradnji, s prekrasnim pogledom na more, na otoku &Scaron;olti, u blizini svih sadr¾aja.&nbsp;Smje&scaron;tena je na udaljenosti 100 m od mora.&nbsp;Ima tlocrtnu povrsinu 187,36 m2.&nbsp;Graðevina je prizemnica sa natkrivenom terasom u prizemlju.</p>', '<p>We are offering this building project for investors.&nbsp;The house is under construction, and the ground work has been completed. It is situated in a great location, has beautiful sea views, is surrounded by natural woods and vegetation, yet is still close to the village and the amenities.&nbsp;It is situated at a distance of 100 m from the sea. There layout area has 187,36 m2. The building is a ground-floor house with a covered terrace.&nbsp;</p>', '', '<p>Kuæa u izgradnji, s prekrasnim pogledom na more, na otoku &Scaron;olti, u blizini svih sadr¾aja.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Smje&scaron;tena je na udaljenosti 100 m od mora.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ima tlocrtnu povrsinu 187,36 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Graðevina je prizemnica sa natkrivenom terasom u prizemlju.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sastoji se od tri spavace sobe, dnevnog boravka s blagovaonom, kuhinje, kupaone s wc-om, zasebnog wc-a i ostave.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Krov je predviðen kao dvostre&scaron;ni kosi sa djelom ravnog prohodnog krova (terasa).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Objekt ima izgraðenu septicku jamu i pripremljen teren za bazen povr&scaron;ine 32 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na ulazu u parcelu predviðen je objekt cca 35 m2 iznad kojega je parkirno mjesto.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sva dokumentacija je uredna.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Gradnja je zapoèeta 2012. god.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Placeni su svi komunalni i vodni doprinosi.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Vlasnik posjeduje rjesenje elektroenergetske suglasnosti.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Objekt je orijentiran istoèno, a iza parcele prema sjeveru nalazi se &nbsp;zelena zona, pa na tom podruèju nije dozvoljena gradnja.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sa zapadne strane je teren povi&scaron;en &scaron;to ljeti pru¾a dobru za&scaron;titu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>S gornje terase pru¾a se predivan lijep pogled na Èiovo i Split.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>S donje terase pru¾a se pogled na uvalu Rogaè.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je od trajektnog pristanista udaljena 150 m.</p>', '<p>We are offering this building project for investors.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house is under construction, and the ground work has been completed.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is situated in a great location, has beautiful sea views, is surrounded by natural woods and vegetation, yet is still close to the village and the amenities.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is situated at a distance of 100 m from the sea.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There layout area has 187,36 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The building is a ground-floor house with a covered terrace.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Its design consists of three bedrooms, an open plan modern style living room with dining area, kitchen, bathroom with toilet, separate toilet and utility room.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The roof is a sloping design with a flat area so it can be used as a terrace.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property has a septic tank, already completed, and has prepared ground for the swimming pool area of 32 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The entrance of the plot has a parking places.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>All documentation is clear, and the project easy to be continued and completed.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Construction began in 2012.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The utility and water bills are paid ''up to date''.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The building is oriented east and behind the plot to the north is an area that appears to be another plot, but this has not been not permitted.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The upper terrace offers a wonderful scenic views of the Ciovo and Split, across the sea.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The lower terrace offers a view of the bay Carob.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house is 150m from the ferry port.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact the office for more information and to arrange a visit to the property.&nbsp;</p>', '', '1141_House-Villa_0.JPG', '1141_House-Villa_1.JPG', '1141_House-Villa_2.JPG', '1141_House-Villa_3.JPG', '1141_House-Villa_4.JPG', '1141_House-Villa_5.JPG', '1141_House-Villa_6.jpg', '1141_House-Villa_7.jpg', '1141_House-Villa_8.jpg'),
(1097, 'Ratko', 'Roso', '095-811-9575', '', 'ratko.roso@gmail.com', 'Kastela', 'Braæe Popiæ 4, 2501 k.è. &#8211; arkod    zemlji¹nik i katastar 247', 'For sale', 'Old stone house', '50', '36', '144', 1, '260000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 4, 2, 'March 24, 2015', '<p>Kuæa s pogledom na more, u malom mjestu Ka&scaron;tela koje se smjestilo izmeðu povijesnih gradova Trogira i Splita.&nbsp;More i &scaron;etnica su udaljeni samo 50 m, dok se svi sadr¾aji nalaze u blizini.&nbsp;Kuæa se sastoji od prizemlja, prvog, drugog i treæeg kata (144 m2). Prizemlje i prvi kat imaju jedan ulaz, dok drugi i treæi kat imaju zaseban ulaz.&nbsp;Kuæa je adaptirana zadnji put 2005. godine, a prizemlje je trenutno u postupku renovacije.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>We are offering this restored house in Kastela, with partial sea views.It is situated 50m from the sea and the Riva promenade while all facilities such as shops, bars, restaurants are all nearby.&nbsp;The house consists of ground floor, first, second and third floor (144 m2). The ground floor and first floor have one entrance, while the second and third floor has a separate entrance.&nbsp;The house was renovated completely in 2005, and the ground floor is being redecorated by the current owners.</p>', '', '<p>Kuæa s pogledom na more, u malom mjestu Ka&scaron;tela koje se smjestilo izmeðu povijesnih gradova Trogira i Splita.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>More i &scaron;etnica su udaljeni samo 50 m, dok se svi sadr¾aji nalaze u blizini.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa se sastoji od prizemlja, prvog, drugog i treæeg kata.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Prizemlje i prvi kat imaju jedan ulaz, dok drugi i treæi kat imaju zaseban ulaz.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je adaptirana zadnji put 2005. godine, a prizemlje je trenutno u postupku renovacije.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U prizemlju se nalaze dnevni boravak, kuhinja i kupaona.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Prvi kat ima dvije spavaæe sobe.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na drugom katu se nalaze kuhinja, blagavaona, dnevni boravak i mala ostava. S drugog kata se pru¾a pogled na more.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Treæi kat se sastoji od dvije spavaæe sobe, kupaone i malog balkona. Tu se nalaze stepenice koje vode na terasu koja je trenutno pokrivena krovom.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ukupna stambena povr&scaron;ina iznosi 144 m2, dok je povr&scaron;ina zemlji&scaron;ta 36 m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je orijentirana S-Z-I.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za prizemlje kuæe vlasnici posjeduju licencu za iznjamljivanje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Parking je javan i nalazi se ispred kuæe.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Meðunarodni aerodrom udaljen je 10 minuta vo¾nje, dok je Split udaljen 20 minuta.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za sva dodatna pitanja vam stojimo na usluzi.</p>', '<p>We are offering this restored house in Kastela, with partial sea views.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is situated 50m from the sea and the Riva promenade while all facilities such as shops, bars, restaurants are all nearby.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house consists of ground floor, first, second and third floor.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The ground floor and first floor have one entrance, while the second and third floor has a separate entrance.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house was renovated completely in 2005, and the ground floor is being redecorated by the current owners.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The ground floor has a living room, kitchen and bathroom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The first floor has two bedrooms.On the second floor there is a kitchen, dining room, living room and small storage room.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Second floor is overlooking the sea.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The third floor consists of two bedrooms, bathroom and small balcony. There are stairs leading to the covered terrace on the top floor.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Total living area is 144 m2, and the plot &nbsp;area is 36 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house is oriented South- West- East.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The ground floor apartment has a letting licence and the new owner may continue to use the two lower floors for tourism.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There is parking on the public road in front of the house.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The international airport is 10 minutes drive away, and Split is 20 minutes, with frequent buses.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For any questions, CPS Split team is at your service.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact the office to arrange to visit this and similar properties in the area.</p>', '', '1097_House-Villa_0.jpg', '1097_House-Villa_1.jpg', '1097_House-Villa_2.jpg', '1097_House-Villa_3.jpg', '1097_House-Villa_4.jpg', '1097_House-Villa_5.jpg', '1097_House-Villa_6.JPG', '1097_House-Villa_7.JPG', '1097_House-Villa_8.jpg'),
(1099, 'Andrea', 'Szegedi', '+36 30 2178821', '+385 23 394 253, skype: szegediandi', 'szegedi_andi@yahoo.com www.plazs41.hu', 'Zadar', 'Djecji Raj 45 1/2, Suko¹an', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '15', '0', '0', 2, '120000', '', 2, 2, 2, 1, 1, 2, 0, 0, 'March 26, 2015', '<p>Izvanredna prilika na tr¾i&scaron;tu, kuæa s apartmanima u prvom redu do mora, s prekrasnim pogledom i okuænicom. Smje&scaron;tena na odliènoj lokaciji, u mjestu udaljenom od Zadra 10 km.&nbsp;Kuæa se sastoji od pet apartmana te je povoljna za iznajmljivanje, kojim se vlasnici bave veæ par godina.&nbsp;U prizemlju i na prvom katu se nalaze po 2 apartmana, dok se na drugom katu nalazi jedan deluxe apartman.</p>\r\n<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;">Cijene od &euro;120.000 - &euro;370.000&nbsp;</span></p>', '<p>We are offering this selection of stunning apartments in the first row to the sea, with great views.They are situated in a great location, on the shore beside clear water and a clean beach, surrounded by a large established garden.&nbsp;It is just 10 km. from Zadar, but only a walk from the nearest coffee bars and shops.The house consists of five apartments all suitable for rental, which the owners have done for the last few years.</p>\r\n<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;">Prices from &euro;120.000 - &euro;370.000</span></p>', '', '<p>Izvanredna prilika na tr¾i&scaron;tu, kuæa s apartmanima u prvom redu do mora, s prekrasnim pogledom i okuænicom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Smje&scaron;tena na odliènoj lokaciji, u mjestu udaljenom od Zadra 10 km.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa se sastoji od pet apartmana te je povoljna za iznajmljivanje, kojim se vlasnici bave veæ par godina.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U prizemlju i na prvom katu se nalaze po 2 apartmana, dok se na drugom katu nalazi jedan deluxe apartman.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Apartman 1: &euro;120.000, 39 m2&nbsp;+ terasa&nbsp;6.10 m2</strong></p>\r\n<p>Apartman u prizemlju kuæe, ulaz sa sjeverozapadne strane.</p>\r\n<p>Sastoji se od predsoblja, jedne spavaæe sobe, kupaone, dnevnog boravka, blagavaone, kuhinje i terase.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Apartman 2: &euro;190.000,&nbsp;</strong><strong>56.1 m2&nbsp;+ terasa 13.70 m2</strong></p>\r\n<p>Apartman u prizemlju kuæe, ulaz sa jugoistoène strane preko otvorenog trijema.</p>\r\n<p>Sastoji se od dvije spavaæe sobe s predsobljima, kupaone, dnevnog boravka, blagavaone, kuhinje i terase.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Apartman 3: &euro;160.000,&nbsp;45.5 m2&nbsp;+ terasa 21.5 m2&nbsp;</strong></p>\r\n<p>Apartman na prvom katu, ulaz sa sjeverozapadne strane preko otvorenog vanjskog stubi&scaron;ta.</p>\r\n<p>Sastoji se od dvije spavaæe sobe s predsobljima, jedne kupaone, dnevnog boravka, blagavaone i kuhinje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Apartman 4: &euro;120.000,&nbsp;<strong>50.57 m2&nbsp;+ terasa 4.88 m2&nbsp;</strong></strong></p>\r\n<p>Apartman na prvom katu, ulaz sa sjeverozapadne strane preko otvorenog vanjskog stubi&scaron;ta.</p>\r\n<p>Sastoji se od dvije spavaæe sobe, kupaone, dnevnog boravka, blagavaone, kuhinje i terase.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Apartman 5: &euro;370.000, 90 m2<strong><strong>&nbsp;+ terasa 22.20 m2</strong></strong></strong></p>\r\n<p>Apartman na drugom katu, ulaz sa sjeverozapadne strane preko otvorenog vanjskog stubi&scaron;ta.</p>\r\n<p>Sastoji se od tri spavaæe sobe s predsobljima, tri kupaone, dnevnog boravka, blagavaone, kuhinje i terase.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U vrtu se nalazi se jo&scaron; jedan dodatni objekat koji slu¾i kao ostava povr&scaron;ine cca 10 m2, s otvorenim kaminom.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ukupna stambena povr&scaron;ina apartmana iznosi cca 280 m2, dok je zemlji&scaron;te povr&scaron;ine 430 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ukupna godi&scaron;nja zarada od iznajmljivanja svih apartmana je 65.000 &euro; - 70.000 &euro;.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Moguæa je i prodaja cijele kuæe.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je izvana rekonstruirana 2014. godine (novi krov, Rockwool izolacijski sistem i solarni sistem), a svi apartmani su opremljeni s Mitsubishi klima ureðajima.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartmani imaju 7 parking mjesta koja se iznajmljuju na zemlji&scaron;tu do, &scaron;to je izvrsna prilika za kupnju dodatnog zemlji&scaron;ta.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Vlasni&scaron;tvo je uredno.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Molimo Vas da se javite u na&scaron; ured za sve dodatne informacije.</p>', '<p>We are offering this selection of stunning apartments in the first row to the sea, with great views.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>They are situated in a great location, on the shore beside clear water and a clean beach, surrounded by a large established garden.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is just 10 km. from Zadar, but only a walk from the nearest coffee bars and shops.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house consists of five apartments all suitable for rental, which the owners have done for the last few years.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Apartment 1: &euro; 120,000, 39 m2 +&nbsp;terrace 6.10 m2&nbsp;</strong></p>\r\n<p>The apartment on the ground floor, entrance on the northwest side.</p>\r\n<p>It consists of hallway, two bedrooms, bathroom, living room, dining room, kitchen and terrace.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Apartment 2: &euro; 190,000,&nbsp;</strong><strong>56.1 m2&nbsp;+ terrace 13.70 m2</strong></p>\r\n<p>The apartment on the ground floor, entrance on the southeast side through the open porch.</p>\r\n<p>It consists of two bedrooms with a hall, bathroom, living room, dining room, kitchen and terrace.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Apartment 3: &euro; 160,000,&nbsp;<strong>&nbsp;45.5 m2&nbsp;+ terrace 21.5 m2&nbsp;</strong></strong></p>\r\n<p>Apartment on the first floor, entrance from the northwest across the open outside staircase.</p>\r\n<p>It consists of two bedrooms with a hall, one bathroom, living room, dining room and kitchen.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Apartment 4: &euro; 120,000,&nbsp;<strong><strong>50.57 m2&nbsp;+ terrace 4.88 m2&nbsp;</strong></strong></strong></p>\r\n<p>Apartment on the first floor, entrance from the northwest across the open outside staircase.</p>\r\n<p>It consists of two bedrooms, bathroom, living room, dining room, kitchen and terrace.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Apartment 5: &euro; 370,000,&nbsp;<strong>90 m2<strong><strong>&nbsp;+ terrace 22.20 m2</strong></strong></strong></strong></p>\r\n<p>Apartment on the second floor, entrance on the northwest side over an open external staircase.</p>\r\n<p>It consists of three bedrooms with a hall, three bathrooms, living room, dining room, kitchen and terrace.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>In the garden there is an additional facility that serves as a storage area of about 10 m2, with open fireplace.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Total living area of the apartments is approximately 280 m2, while the land area of 430 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The total annual income from the rental of the apartment is &euro; 65,000 - &euro; 70,000.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The owners would consider offers for the entire property.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house was reconditioned in 2014, with a new roof, Rockwool insulation system and the solar panels, and all apartments are equipped with Mitsubishi air conditioning.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartments have seven parking spaces that are for rent and the adjacent land could become for sale.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The garden has been carefully landscaped with Mediterranean plants, and features a children''s sand play area, a patio and an outside fireplace/bbq.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There is an additional storage area of 10m sq.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact our office for further information and to arrange to visit this property.</p>', '', '1099_Apartment_0.jpg', '1099_Apartment_1.jpg', '1099_Apartment_2.jpg', '1099_Apartment_3.jpg', '1099_Apartment_4.jpg', '1099_Apartment_5.jpg', '1099_Apartment_6.jpg', '1099_Apartment_7.jpg', '1099_Apartment_8.jpg');
INSERT INTO `nekretnina` (`id`, `ime`, `prezime`, `telefon`, `mobitel`, `e_mail`, `lokacija_id`, `adresa`, `status_id`, `vrsta_id`, `udaljenost`, `povrsina`, `stambenapovrsina`, `display`, `cijena`, `cijenatocka`, `ponuda_tjedna`, `new_built`, `must_sell`, `prvi_red_do_mora`, `pogled_na_more`, `bazen`, `broj_soba`, `broj_kupatila`, `datum`, `title_hr`, `title_en`, `title_ge`, `opis_hr`, `opis_en`, `opis_ge`, `PropertyImageURL0`, `PropertyImageURL1`, `PropertyImageURL2`, `PropertyImageURL3`, `PropertyImageURL4`, `PropertyImageURL5`, `PropertyImageURL6`, `PropertyImageURL7`, `PropertyImageURL8`) VALUES
(1101, 'Andrea', 'Szegedi', 'Mob/Viber: +36 30 2178821 ', 'Landline: +385 23 394 25', 'szegedi_andi@yahoo.com www.plazs41.hu', 'Zadar', 'Djecji Raj 45 1/2, Suko¹an', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '15', '430', '340', 2, '960000', '', 2, 2, 2, 1, 1, 2, 11, 7, 'March 27, 2015', '<p>Izvanredna prilika na tr¾i&scaron;tu, apartmanska kuæa u prvom redu do mora, s prekrasnim pogledom i okuænicom. Smje&scaron;tena na odliènoj lokaciji, udaljenosti samo 15 od mora.&nbsp;Kuæa se sastoji od pet apartmana te je povoljna za iznajmljivanje, kojim se vlasnici bave veæ par godina.&nbsp;U prizemlju se nalaze 2 apartmana ( 1 jednosoban, 1 dvosoban), na prvom katu 2 dvosobna apartmana, dok se na drugom katu nalazi jedan deluxe trosobni apartman.</p>', '<p>We have this outstanding opportunity; an apartment house in the first row to the sea, with great views and a spacious garden. It is situated in a prime location, just 15m from the shore.&nbsp;The house consists of five apartments all suitable for rental, which the owners have organised with themselves over the last few years.&nbsp;The ground floor has two apartments both one bedroom, and on the first floor there are two-bedroom apartments, while on the second floor just one deluxe three-room apartment.</p>', '', '<p>Izvanredna prilika na tr¾i&scaron;tu, apartmanska kuæa u prvom redu do mora, s prekrasnim pogledom i okuænicom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Smje&scaron;tena na odliènoj lokaciji, udaljenosti samo 15 od mora.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa se sastoji od pet apartmana te je povoljna za iznajmljivanje, kojim se vlasnici bave veæ par godina.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U prizemlju se nalaze 2 apartmana ( 1 jednosoban, 1 dvosoban), na prvom katu 2 dvosobna apartmana, dok se na drugom katu nalazi jedan deluxe trosobni apartman.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U vrtu se nalazi se jo&scaron; jedan dodatni objekat koji slu¾i kao ostava povr&scaron;ine cca 10 m2, s otvorenim kaminom.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Orijentirana je J-Z.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ukupna stambena povr&scaron;ina apartmana iznosi cca 340 m2, dok je zemlji&scaron;te povr&scaron;ine 430 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ukupna godi&scaron;nja zarada od iznajmljivanja svih apartmana je 65.000 &euro; - 70.000 &euro;.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je izvana rekonstruirana 2014. godine (novi krov, Rockwool izolacijski sistem i solarni sistem), a svi apartmani su opremljeni s Mitsubishi klima ureðajima.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa ima 7 parking mjesta koja se iznajmljuju na zemlji&scaron;tu do, &scaron;to je izvrsna prilika za kupnju dodatnog zemlji&scaron;ta.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Vlasni&scaron;tvo je uredno.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Mjesto je popularno meðu turistima, prepoznato ako idealno za odmor i opu&scaron;tanje, poznato po predivnim pla¾ama, a od Zadra udaljeno samo 7 km.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Meðunarodni aerodrom u Zemuniku je udaljen 12 km.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Molimo Vas da se javite u na&scaron; ured za sve dodatne informacije.</p>', '<p>We have this outstanding opportunity; an apartment house in the first row to the sea, with great views and a spacious garden.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is situated in a prime location, just 15m from the shore.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house consists of five apartments all suitable for rental, which the owners have organised with themselves over the last few years.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The ground floor has two apartments both one bedroom, and on the first floor there are two-bedroom apartments, while on the second floor just one deluxe three-room apartment.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>In the garden there is a storage area of about 10 m2, and a patio with an open bbq/fireplace.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Total living area of the house is approximately 340 m2, while the land area of 430 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property is in good condition, both inside and outside, as it was well built, and has been well maintained.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house was refurbished in 2014 to include a new roof, new insulation, new solar panels and redecoration - in the middle of the garden there is a well-designed sandpit for children.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house has seven parking spaces that are for rent on the land adjacent but this could also be an excellent opportunity to purchase this additional land.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property is receiving an income of between 65k euro and 70 k euro each year.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The place is popular among tourists, because of the clean shore and beach, and it is identified as an ideal area for rest and relaxation, and it is only 7 km away from Zadar.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The international airport in Zemunik (Zadar) is 12 km away.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact our office for further information or to arrange to visit the property.</p>', '', '1101_House-Villa_0.JPG', '1101_House-Villa_1.JPG', '1101_House-Villa_2.JPG', '1101_House-Villa_3.JPG', '1101_House-Villa_4.JPG', '1101_House-Villa_5.JPG', '1101_House-Villa_6.JPG', '1101_House-Villa_7.JPG', '1101_House-Villa_8.JPG'),
(1592, 'Goran', 'Mamut', '', '091 533 6231', 'goran.mamut1@st.t-com.hr', 'Trogir', '4. o¾ujka 1a Okrug Gornji, 99/10 k.o. Okrug', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '270', '466', '177', 1, '1000000', '', 2, 1, 2, 2, 1, 1, 3, 4, 'February 29, 2016', '<p>Luksuzna vila zanimljivog oblika i ureðenja smje&scaron;tena na otoku Èiovu u blizini prekrasne pla¾e i mnogobrojnih sadr¾aja.&nbsp;Smje&scaron;tena je na zemlji&scaron;tu povr&scaron;ine 466 m2, dok je brutto povr&scaron;ina kuæe 200 m2.&nbsp;Ispred se nalazi parking za 2 automobila, dok se u simpatièno ureðenom dvori&scaron;tu nalaze bazen i kamin. Vila je potpuno ureðena i nisu potrebna nikakva dodatna ulaganja. Trenutno se koristi u svrhu turistièkog ulaganja.</p>', '<p>We are offering this luxurious villa, attractively designed in a stylish and interesting shape. It is situated on the island of Ciovo close to beautiful beaches and many facilities and attractions for tourists. It is built on a land plot of 466 m2, while the gross area of the house 200 m2. In front there is parking for 2 cars, and a landscaped garden with a swimming pool and outdoor bbq/fireplace.&nbsp;The villa is fully furnished and a very generous budget has been given to the fittings and interior design of the property. It does not require any additional investment.&nbsp;</p>', '', '<p>Luksuzna vila zanimljivog oblika i ureðenja smje&scaron;tena na otoku Èiovu u blizini prekrasne pla¾e i mnogobrojnih sadr¾aja.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Iako se nalazi u jednom od popularnijih mjesta na otoku, kuæa je smje&scaron;tena na mirnom dijelu idealnom za odmor.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Smje&scaron;tena je na zemlji&scaron;tu povr&scaron;ine 466 m2, dok je brutto povr&scaron;ina kuæe 200 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sastoji se od suterena, prizemlja, 1. i 2. kata.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U vili se nalazi teretana, kuhinja sa blagovaonicom, dnevni boravak, 3 spavaæe sobe, 4 kupaonice i prostrana terasa s pogledom na more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ispred se nalazi parking za 2 automobila, dok se u simpatièno ureðenom dvori&scaron;tu nalaze bazen i kamin.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Vila je potpuno ureðena i nisu potrebna nikakva dodatna ulaganja.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Trenutno se koristi u svrhu turistièkog ulaganja.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Do najbli¾e uvale i &scaron;ljunèane pla¾e je potrebno svega nekoliko minuta pje&scaron;ke.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Do samog centra mjesta gdje se nalaze svi potrebni sadr¾aji je takoðer potrebno nekoliko minuta pje&scaron;ke.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Meðunarodni aerodrom udaljen je 15 min. vo¾nje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ostajemo na usluzi za sva dodatna pitanja.</p>', '<p>We are offering this luxurious villa, attractively designed in a stylish and interesting shape.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is situated on the island of Ciovo close to beautiful beaches and many facilities and attractions for tourists.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property is located in one of the most popular villages on the island, but on a quiet area ideal for relaxation.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is built on a land plot of 466 m2, while the gross area of the house 200 m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It consists of a basement, ground, first and second floor.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The villa has a gym, kitchen, dining room, living room, 3 bedrooms, 4 bathrooms and a spacious terrace overlooking the sea.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>In front there is parking for 2 cars, and a landscaped garden with a swimming pool and outdoor bbq/fireplace.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The villa is fully furnished and a very generous budget has been given to the fittings and interior design of the property.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It does not require any additional investment.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is currently used for the purposes of tourism investments.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The nearest bays and pebble beaches are very close and it takes only a few minutes on foot.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The international airport is 15 minutes driving.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Trogir old town is 15 mins driving.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Split town is 25 mins driving.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>We remain at your disposal for any further questions, so feel free to contact our office and speak to one of our agents.</p>', '', '1592_House-Villa_0.jpg', '1592_House-Villa_1.jpg', '1592_House-Villa_2.jpg', '1592_House-Villa_3.jpg', '1592_House-Villa_4.jpg', '1592_House-Villa_5.jpg', '1592_House-Villa_6.jpg', '1592_House-Villa_7.jpg', '1592_House-Villa_8.jpg'),
(1102, 'Jo¹ko', 'Juriæ', '098523343', '', 'Josko.juric2@si.t-com.hr', 'Primosten', 'Primo¹ten, 2437/2', 'For sale', 'Land plot', '1000', '500', '0', 1, '125000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 0, 0, 'March 27, 2015', '<p>Graðevinsko zemlji&scaron;te u neposrednoj blizini Primo&scaron;tena, s otvorenim pogledom na more.&nbsp;Zemlji&scaron;te ima povr&scaron;inu 500 m2 i s va¾eæom graðevinskom dozvolom.&nbsp;Zemlji&scaron;te se nalazi na 1 km udaljenosti od mora i lijepih prirodnih pla¾a, a zbog strmog terena sa zemlji&scaron;ta se pru¾a prekrasan panoramski pogled, &scaron;to ovu nekretninu èini iznimno atraktivnom.</p>', '<p>We are pleased to offer this building plot in the vicinity of Primosten, with sweeping views of the sea.&nbsp;The land has an area of 500 m2 with a valid building permit.&nbsp;The land is located 1 km away from the sea and because of the steep terrain of the land it has a beautiful panoramic view of the sea and nearby islands. The sea here is very clear and the property''s situation, set among undisturbed protected nature, makes this building plot good value.</p>', '', '<p>Graðevinsko zemlji&scaron;te u neposrednoj blizini Primo&scaron;tena, s otvorenim pogledom na more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Zemlji&scaron;te ima povr&scaron;inu 500 m2 i s va¾eæom graðevinskom dozvolom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Zemlji&scaron;te se nalazi na 1 km udaljenosti od mora i lijepih prirodnih pla¾a, a zbog strmog terena sa zemlji&scaron;ta se pru¾a prekrasan panoramski pogled, &scaron;to ovu nekretninu èini iznimno atraktivnom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za sve koji ¾ele istovremeno imati moguænost odmora u èistom zraku, ti&scaron;ini i mediteranskom ozraèju ova parcela je izuzetna prilika.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Zemlji&scaron;te ima svu potrebnu infrastrukturu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Primo&scaron;ten je smje&scaron;ten 20-ak kilometara od grada &Scaron;ibenika, a svojom zanimljivom arhitekturom i kristalno bistrim morem privlaèi brojene turiste.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Meðunarodni aerodrom u Trogiru udaljen je 45 km.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za sve dodatne informacije slobodno nas kontaktirajte.</p>', '<p>We are pleased to offer this building plot in the vicinity of Primosten, with sweeping views of the sea.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The land has an area of 500 m2 with a valid building permit.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The land is located 1 km away from the sea and because of the steep terrain of the land it has a beautiful panoramic view of the sea and nearby islands.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The sea here is very clear and the property''s situation, set among undisturbed protected nature, makes this building plot good value, as a modern and well equipped villa here would be a great investment.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The land has all the necessary infrastructure.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The village is located 20 kilometers from the town of Sibenik, and its interesting architecture and crystal-clear sea attracts many tourists.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The international airport in Trogir is only 45 km.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For further information please contact us.</p>', '', '1102_Land-plot_0.jpg', '1102_Land-plot_1.jpg', '1102_Land-plot_2.jpg', '1102_Land-plot_3.jpg', '1102_Land-plot_4.jpg', '1102_Land-plot_5.jpg', '1102_Land-plot_6.jpg', '', ''),
(1103, 'Marija', 'Cvitanoviæ', 'Suprug vlasnice Ivan &#8211; 091 906 3688', 'Pero Bureèiæ 095 906 5781 ', '1562/61', 'Trogir', 'Planikovica, Okrug Gornji', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '190', '0', '112', 1, '186000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 4, 2, 'March 27, 2015', '<p>Prostrani apartman povr&scaron;ine 112 m2, na drugom katu zgrade, na odliènoj lokaciji.&nbsp;Smje&scaron;ten je na zapadnom dijelu otoka Èiova, udaljen od pla¾e samo 190 m. Okru¾en je zelenilom, dok se s balkona se pru¾a predivan pogled na more.&nbsp;Cijeli otok idealan je za odmor i u¾ivanje.</p>', '<p lang="en-GB">We have this newly completed, spacious apartment of 112 m2, on the second floor, located in the western part of the island of Ciovo. It is only 190 m away from the popular pebble beach, and the property is surrounded by greenery. The balcony offers a beautiful view of the village and the sea beyond. The whole island is popular with tourists and is an ideal place to relax and enjoy the Dalmatian coast.</p>', '', '<p>Prostrani apartman na drugom katu zgrade, na odliènoj lokaciji.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Smje&scaron;ten je na zapadnom dijelu otoka Èiova, udaljen od pla¾e samo 190 m.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Okru¾en je zelenilom, dok se s balkona se pru¾a predivan pogled na more.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Cijeli otok idealan je za odmor i u¾ivanje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartman se sastoji od dva hodnika, dvije kupaone, dva dnevna boravka i dvije kuhinje, jedne blagavaone, èetiri spavaæe sobe, te dvije loðe, svaka povr&scaron;ine 6 m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ukupna stambene povr&scaron;ina iznosi 111,81 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Zgrada je izgraðena 2006. godine. Apartman ima 2 klima ureðaja, ali nije namje&scaron;ten.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Orijentiran je S-Z-I.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Pripada mu gara¾a povr&scaron;ine 15,08 m2 s parking mjestom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Centar mjesta gdje se nalaze svi sadr¾aji udaljen je par minuta hoda, dok je grad Trogir udaljen 15 minuta.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Meðunarodni aerodrom udaljen je 20 minuta vo¾nje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za sve dodatne informacije stojimo Vam na raspolaganju.</p>', '<p lang="en-GB">We have this newly completed, spacious apartment on the second floor, located in the western part of the island of Ciovo.</p>\r\n<p lang="en-GB">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p lang="en-GB">It is only 190 m away from the popular pebble beach, and the property is surrounded by greenery.</p>\r\n<p lang="en-GB">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p lang="en-GB">The balcony offers a beautiful view of the village and the sea beyond.</p>\r\n<p lang="en-GB">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p lang="en-GB">The whole island is popular with tourists and is an ideal place to relax and enjoy the Dalmatian coast.</p>\r\n<p lang="en-GB">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p lang="en-GB">The total residential area is 111.81 m2.</p>\r\n<p lang="en-GB">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p lang="en-GB">The apartment consists of two halls, two bathrooms, two living rooms and two kitchens, one dining room, four bedrooms and two balconies, each of 6 m2.</p>\r\n<p lang="en-GB">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p lang="en-GB">The apartment has 2 air conditioners, but not furnished.</p>\r\n<p lang="en-GB">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p lang="en-GB">It is oriented to the North/west- east.</p>\r\n<p lang="en-GB">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p lang="en-GB">The property has its own garage of 15.08 m2 with a parking lot.</p>\r\n<p lang="en-GB">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p lang="en-GB">The village centre, where there are all facilities such as shops, bars, bakery, chemist etc is  a few minutes&rsquo; walk away, while the town of Trogir 15 minutes, where there are many options of excellent restaurants.</p>\r\n<p lang="en-GB">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p lang="en-GB">The international airport is 20 minutes away.</p>\r\n<p lang="en-GB">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p lang="en-GB">For further information and to arrange to visit the property, we are available.</p>', '', '1103_Apartment_0.jpg', '1103_Apartment_1.jpg', '1103_Apartment_2.jpg', '1103_Apartment_3.jpg', '1103_Apartment_4.jpg', '1103_Apartment_5.jpg', '1103_Apartment_6.jpg', '1103_Apartment_7.jpg', '1103_Apartment_8.jpg'),
(1104, 'Jo¹ko', 'Juriæ', '098523343', '', 'Josko.juric2@si.t-com.hr', 'Primosten', 'Primo¹ten, kè 2437/2 Primo¹ten', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '1000', '700', '220', 1, '1000000', '', 2, 1, 2, 2, 1, 1, 3, 4, 'March 27, 2015', '<p>Luksuzna vila s bazenom u izgradnji nedaleko Primo&scaron;tena, s prekrasnim pogledom na more i mjesto. Moderno arhitektonsko rje&scaron;enje kao i kvalitetna gradnja èine ovu vilu iznimno atraktivnom.&nbsp;Udaljenost do Primo&scaron;tena i pla¾a je 1 km.&nbsp;Kuæa je smje&scaron;tena na zemlji&scaron;tu povr&scaron;ine 700 m2, te je podijeljena na prizemlje i kat (220 m2).</p>', '<p>We are pleased to offer this newly built, luxury modern villa with swimming pool on the mainland. It is situated about 1 km from the shore, but elevated on the sloping countryside to allow fabulous long views out to sea.&nbsp;The nearest village is Primostan.&nbsp;The house is situated on a land area of 700 m2 and is divided into two floors (220 m2).</p>', '', '<p>Luksuzna vila s bazenom u izgradnji nedaleko Primo&scaron;tena, s prekrasnim pogledom na more i mjesto.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Moderno arhitektonsko rje&scaron;enje kao i kvalitetna gradnja èine ovu vilu iznimno atraktivnom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Udaljenost do Primo&scaron;tena i pla¾a je 1 km.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je smje&scaron;tena na zemlji&scaron;tu povr&scaron;ine 700 m2, te je podijeljena na prizemlje i kat.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U prizemlju se nalaze prostrani dnevni boravak s kuhinjom i blagovaonom, kupaona i prostorija predviðena za saunu.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Staklene stjenke odvajaju unutra&scaron;njost kuæe od terase s bazenom.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na katu su tri spavaæe sobe s pripadajuæim kupaonama.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Iz svake prostorije pru¾a se prekrasan pogled na more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ukupna stambena povr&scaron;ina iznosi 220 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa ima gara¾u kao i osigurana parking mjesta.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na svega par stotina metara od kuæe nalazi se centar mjesta s restoranima, kafiæima, trgovinama i ureðenom pla¾om.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Primo&scaron;ten je smje&scaron;ten 20-ak kilometara od grada &Scaron;ibenika, a svojom zanimljivom arhitekturom i kristalno bistrim morem privlaèi brojene turiste.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Meðunarodni aerodrom u Trogiru udaljen je 45 km.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za sve dodatne informacije slobodno nas kontaktirajte.</p>', '<p>We are pleased to offer this newly built, luxury modern villa with swimming pool on the mainland.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is situated about 1 km from the shore, but elevated on the sloping countryside to allow fabulous long views out to sea, and across the natural woodland and vegetation surrounding the property.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The nearest village is Primostan, and here, in this typical Dalmatian coastal village are, options for bars, restaurants, shops and bakery etc.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house is situated on a land area of 700 m2 and is divided into two floors.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The total living area is 220 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The ground floor has a spacious modern style open plan living room with kitchen and dining area, a bathroom and room for sauna.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There is a glass wall separating the interior of the house from the pool terrace.Upstairs are three bedrooms with ensuite bathrooms.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Every room offers a breathtaking view of the sea.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property has been carefully designed to meet the highest modern standards, for the benefit of tourists from any where in the world, and it will be one of the most luxurious properties in the region.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house has a garage and several secured parking spaces.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The town is located 20 kilometers from the town of Sibenik, and its interesting architecture and crystal-clear sea attracts many tourists.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The international airport in Trogir is only 45 km.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For further information and to arrange to visit this property, please contact us.</p>', '', '1104_House-Villa_0.jpg', '1104_House-Villa_1.jpg', '1104_House-Villa_2.jpg', '1104_House-Villa_3.jpg', '1104_House-Villa_4.jpg', '1104_House-Villa_5.jpg', '1104_House-Villa_6.jpg', '1104_House-Villa_7.jpg', '1104_House-Villa_8.jpg'),
(1107, 'Mark i Carmel', 'O Brien', '0877695156', '', 'obrienreilly@eircom.net', 'Brac', 'Brac, Milna, Apt B9', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '70', '72', '60', 1, '110000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 1, 2, 1, 'March 30, 2015', '<p>Moderan i opremljen apartman na prvom katu zgrade, sa zajednièkim bazenom, smje&scaron;ten u mirnom podruèju, okru¾en &scaron;umom.&nbsp;Nalazi se na otoku Braèu , samo 70 m od pla¾e, s predivnim pogledom na more. Ukupna stambena povr&scaron;ina iznosi 59,20 m2.&nbsp;Udaljen je nekoliko minuta &scaron;etnje od centra mjesta u kojem se nalaze svi korisni sadr¾aji poput prodavaonica, restorana, barova...</p>', '<p>We are pleased to offer this modern, well-designed and well-equipped apartment with a shared swimming pool, in a charming village on the west side of Brac island.&nbsp;It is on the first floor, located in a quiet area, surrounded by woods, and only 70 m from the beach, with stunning sea views from the windows and balcony.&nbsp;Total living area of the flat is 59.20 m2.&nbsp;It is a short walk from the town centre where you can find many useful facilities.</p>', '', '<p><strong>SNI®ENA CIJENA</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Moderan i opremljen apartman na prvom katu zgrade, sa zajednièkim bazenom, smje&scaron;ten u mirnom podruèju, okru¾en &scaron;umom.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nalazi se na otoku Braèu , samo 70 m od pla¾e, s predivnim pogledom na more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Udaljen je nekoliko minuta &scaron;etnje od centra mjesta u kojem se nalaze svi korisni sadr¾aji poput prodavaonica, restorana, barova...</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Zgrada je sagraðena 2004. godine.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartman se sastoji od dnevnog boravka s kuhinjom i blagavaonom, 2 spavaæe sobe i kupaone.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Iz dnevnog boravka postoji izlaz na balkon s kojeg se pru¾a prekrasan pogled na more i mjesto.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ukupna stambena povr&scaron;ina iznosi 59,20 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Stan ima izlaz na terasu povr&scaron;ine 12,70 m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Orijentiran je sjeverozapadno.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Parking se nalazi u sklopu objekta.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartman posjeduje licencu za iznajmljivanje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Cijeli otok prepun je lijepim pla¾ama, skrivenim uvalama i mnogim drugim prirodnim ljepotama.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Centar grada je udaljen 1 km, dok je trajektna luka udaljena 15 km.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Molimo Vas da kontaktirate na&scaron; ured za daljnje informacije.</p>', '<p><strong>PRICE REDUCED</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>We are pleased to offer this modern, well-designed and well-equipped apartment with a shared swimming pool, in a charming village on the west side of Brac island.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is on the first floor, located in a quiet area, surrounded by woods, and only 70 m from the beach, with stunning sea views from the windows and balcony.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is a short walk from the town centre where you can find many useful facilities such as shops, restaurants, bars, bakery..</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The building was built in 2004, with a modern open plan design for the living areas.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Total living area of the flat is 59.20 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The apartment consists of a living room with kitchen and dining area, 2 bedrooms and bathroom.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>From the living room there are doors leading onto a spacious balcony with a beautiful view of the sea and the resort.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The apartment has a balcony of 12.70 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is oriented to the northwest.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property has private allocated parking.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The apartment has a license to rent.</p>\r\n<p><br /><br />The island has many beautiful beaches, hidden coves and many other natural areas where people can enjoy bathing and swimming in the sea in privacy.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The nearest village centre is 1 km, while the ferry port is 15 km.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact our office for further information and to arrange to visit this property.</p>', '', '1107_Apartment_0.jpg', '1107_Apartment_1.jpg', '1107_Apartment_2.jpg', '1107_Apartment_3.jpg', '1107_Apartment_4.jpg', '1107_Apartment_5.jpg', '1107_Apartment_6.jpg', '1107_Apartment_7.jpg', ''),
(1105, 'Marija', 'Dra¾iæ', '', '091 5859858', '', 'Sibenik', '®aboriæ, k.è. 3227/14 k.o krapanj  po z.u 773 m2', 'For sale', 'Land plot', '5', '798', '0', 1, '482500', '', 2, 2, 2, 1, 1, 2, 0, 0, 'March 27, 2015', '<p>Rijetka prilika na tr¾i&scaron;tu, zemlji&scaron;te u prvom redu do mora, na prekrasnom dijelu &scaron;ibenske rivijere, s predivnim pogledom na more, smje&scaron;teno je svega 5 m od lijepo ureðene pla¾e. Na parceli su izvr&scaron;ena sva geodetska mjerenja. Prema uvjetima iz prostornog plana na parceli je moguæe graditi kuæu tlocrtne povr&scaron;ine od 240 m2, a maximalne visine 9m, dok povr&scaron;ina parcele iznosi 798 m2.</p>', '<p>We have this rare opportunity of &nbsp;land in the first row to the sea, on a beautiful part of the Sibenik Riviera.&nbsp;With stunning sea views, situated only 5 m from the beautiful beach.&nbsp;Land area is 798 m2.The plot has already been surveyed and according to the ''zoning plan'' it is possible to build a house layout area of 240 m2, with the maximal height of 9m.&nbsp;This is an ideal opportunity for the construction of one or several houses, either privately, or exactly what many tourists are looking for.</p>', '', '<p>Rijetka prilika na tr¾i&scaron;tu, zemlji&scaron;te u prvom redu do mora, na prekrasnom dijelu &scaron;ibenske rivijere, s predivnim pogledom na more, smje&scaron;teno je svega 5 m od lijepo ureðene pla¾e.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na parceli su izvr&scaron;ena sva geodetska mjerenja.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Prema uvjetima iz prostornog plana na parceli je moguæe graditi kuæu tlocrtne povr&scaron;ine od 240 m2, a maximalne visine 9m, dok povr&scaron;ina parcele iznosi 798 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ovo je idealna prilika za gradnju kuæe za odmor, kao i za iznajmljivanje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Pristup zemlji&scaron;tu je asfaltiranom cestom s gornje strane</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sva potrebna infrastruktura je prisutna.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Udaljenost do restorana, kafiæa i duæana je svega nekoliko minuta, a mjesto je &nbsp;idealno za miran obiteljski odmor u netaknutoj prirodi. &nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Udaljenost od Rogoznice pola sata vo¾nje, a od grada &Scaron;ibenika 15-ak minuta.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Meðunarodni aerodrom u Splitu je udaljen sat vremena vo¾nje.</p>', '<p>We have this rare opportunity of &nbsp;land in the first row to the sea, on a beautiful part of the Sibenik Riviera, with stunning sea views, situated only 5 m from the beautiful beach.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Land area is 798 m2.The plot has already been surveyed and according to the ''zoning plan'' it is possible to build a house layout area of 240 m2, with the maximal height of 9m.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>This is an ideal opportunity for the construction of one or several houses, either privately, or exactly what many tourists are looking for.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Access to the land is down a paved road from the upper side of the plot.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>All necessary infrastructure is already present.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The distance to restaurants, cafes and shops and other services is conveniently situated just a few minutes away, and the location is ideal for a quiet family holiday surrounded by unspoilt nature.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Distance from Rogoznica town &nbsp;is half an hour away, and the town of Sibenik 15 minutes.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The international airport in Split is an hour''s drive.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please call our office for more information and to arrange to visit this plot.</p>', '', '1105_Land-plot_0.jpg', '1105_Land-plot_1.jpg', '1105_Land-plot_2.jpg', '1105_Land-plot_3.jpg', '1105_Land-plot_4.jpg', '1105_Land-plot_5.jpg', '1105_Land-plot_6.jpg', '', ''),
(1106, 'Ivan ', 'Nikoliæ', '091 517 1009', '', '', 'Rogoznica', 'Stiva¹nica, Ra¾anj', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '40', '270', '200', 1, '300000', '', 2, 1, 2, 2, 1, 2, 4, 4, 'March 27, 2015', '<p>Dvojna kuæa novoizgraðena na svega 40 m od mora. S kuæe se pru¾a pogled na more i uvalu. Kuæa je u drugom redu do mora u prekrasnoj mirnoj uvali. Povr&scaron;ina kuæe je 200 m2, a nalazi se na parceli povr&scaron;ine 270 m2. Okuænica je ureðena mediteranskim biljem i poploèana. U sklopu parcele osigurana su tri parking mjesta, a takoðer je izgraðen i ro&scaron;tilj. Kuæa je podijeljena na tri apartmana.</p>', '<p>We are offering this newly built semi-detached house only 40 m from the sea. It is situated just 40m from the shore, being on the second row of property in a quiet bay on the mainland near Rogoznica.&nbsp;The house has living space of 200 m2 and is located on a plot of 270 m2.&nbsp;The courtyard is planted with Mediterranean herbs in pots and and pavement.&nbsp;Within the plot are three parking spaces, where there is also an outdoor barbecue.&nbsp;The house is divided into three apartments.</p>', '', '<p>Dvojna kuæa novoizgraðena na svega 40 m od mora.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>S kuæe se pru¾a pogled na more i uvalu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je u drugom redu do mora u prekrasnoj mirnoj uvali.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Povr&scaron;ina kuæe je 200 m2, a nalazi se na parceli povr&scaron;ine 270 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Okuænica je ureðena mediteranskim biljem i poploèana.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U sklopu parcele osigurana su tri parking mjesta, a takoðer je izgraðen i ro&scaron;tilj.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je podijeljena na tri apartmana.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U prizemlju je stan koji se sastoji od dnevnog boravka, kuhinje, kupaonice i dvije spavaæe sobe s izlazom na terasu s koje se pru¾a pogled na more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na katu su dva jednosobna apartmana ( dnevni boravak, kuhinja, kupaonica i spavaæa soba).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Udaljenost do trgovina, restorana i kafiæa je svega par kilometara , a tijekom ljeta svi potrebni turistièki sadr¾aji mogu se naæi u ovoj uvali.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Udaljenost do aerodroma je 25 km.</p>', '<p>We are offering this newly built semi-detached house only 40 m from the sea.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is situated just 40m from the shore, being on the second row of property in a quiet bay on the mainland near Rogoznica.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house has living space of 200 m2 and is located on a plot of 270 m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The courtyard is planted with Mediterranean herbs in pots and and pavement.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Within the plot are three parking spaces, where there is also an outdoor barbecue.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house is divided into three apartments.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The ground floor apartment consists of a living room, kitchen, bathroom and two bedrooms opening onto a terrace with a view of the sea.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Upstairs are two one-bedroom apartments (living room, kitchen, bathroom and bedroom).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The distance to shops, restaurants and caf&eacute;s is only a few kilometres, and during the summer all the necessary tourist facilities can be found in this bay.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The apartments are designed for family villa holidays, with open plan kitchen living areas and spacious balconies wide enough for family meals while enjoying the views across the bay.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Distance to Split airport 25 km.Split town is 40 mins drive.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact our office to arrange to visit these properties or with other questions.</p>', '', '1106_House-Villa_0.jpg', '1106_House-Villa_1.jpg', '1106_House-Villa_2.jpg', '1106_House-Villa_3.jpg', '1106_House-Villa_4.jpg', '1106_House-Villa_5.jpg', '1106_House-Villa_6.jpg', '1106_House-Villa_7.jpg', '1106_House-Villa_8.jpg'),
(1108, 'Dragan i Branka', 'Gole¹', '', '099 213 5041', '', 'Rogoznica', 'Podglavièka 9, Rogoznica', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '150', '0', '150', 1, '360000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 3, 2, 'March 30, 2015', '<p>Dvoeta¾ni apartman u novoizgraðenoj zgradi s kojeg se pru¾a prekrasan pogled na more i Rogoznicu.&nbsp;Udaljenost do mora je svega 150 m. Apartman zauzima zadnja dva kata apartmanske zgrade i podijeljen je na dva kata. U sklopu kata je i terasa s koje se pru¾a prekrasan panoramski pogled. Apartman je u potpunosti ureðen. Povr&scaron;ina apartmana iznosi 150 m2.&nbsp;Aerodrom je od Rogoznice udaljen 25 km.</p>', '<p lang="en-GB">We have this two-storey apartment in a newly built building with beautiful views of the sea and the village port in Rogoznica. Distance to the sea is 150 m. The apartment occupies the top two floors of an apartment building and is divided into two floors. As part of this floor is a terrace that offers equally breathtaking panoramic views.&nbsp;Apartment size is 150 m2.</p>', '', '<p>Dvoeta¾ni apartman u novoizgraðenoj zgradi s kojeg se pru¾a prekrasan pogled na more i Rogoznicu.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Udaljenost do mora je svega 150 m.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartman zauzima zadnja dva kata apartmanske zgrade i podijeljen je na dva kata.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Povr&scaron;ina apartmana iznosi 150 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na I. katu je veliki dnevni boravak &nbsp;s kuhinjom i &nbsp;blagovaonicom, kupaonica i sprema.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Iz dnevnog boravka izlazi se na veliku terasu s koje se pru¾a prekrasan pogled na more i Rogoznicu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na II. katu se nalaze dvije spavaæe sobe, manji dnevni boravak s kuhinjom i kupaonica.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U sklopu ovog kata je i terasa s koje se pru¾a prekrasan panoramski pogled.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartman je u potpunosti ureðen.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Udaljenost do centra Rogoznice je 150 m.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Aerodrom je od Rogoznice udaljen 25 km.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za sve dodatne informacije molimo kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured u Splitu.</p>', '<p>We have this two-storey apartment in a newly built building with beautiful views of the sea and the village port in Rogoznica.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Distance to the sea is 150 m.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The apartment occupies the top two floors of an apartment building and is divided into two floors.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartment size is 150 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the first floor is a large open plan living room with kitchen and dining room, bathroom and stores.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The living room opens onto a large terrace with long views.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the second floor there are two bedrooms, a small living room with kitchen and bathroom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>As part of this floor is a terrace that offers equally breathtaking panoramic views.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The apartment is fully furnished, well appointed and well decorated.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Distance from the town centre with many options for shops, bars and cafes is 150 m.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The airport is from Rogoznica 25 km.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact the office for similar properties or to arrange to visit and tour the property.</p>', '', '1108_Apartment_0.jpg', '1108_Apartment_1.jpg', '1108_Apartment_2.jpg', '1108_Apartment_3.jpg', '1108_Apartment_4.jpg', '1108_Apartment_5.jpg', '1108_Apartment_6.jpg', '1108_Apartment_7.jpg', '1108_Apartment_8.jpg'),
(1109, 'Dragan i Branka', 'Gole¹', '', '099 2135041', '', 'Rogoznica', 'Podglavièka 9, Rogoznica', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '150', '0', '82', 1, '182600', '', 2, 1, 2, 2, 1, 2, 2, 1, 'March 30, 2015', '<p>Prodaju se dva dvosobna apartmana, svaki povr&scaron;ine 83 m2, u novoizgraðenoj apartmanskoj zgradi na svega 150 m udaljenosti od mora. Prekrasan pogled na more i Rogoznicu s terasa ovih apartmana èini ove apartmane izuzetno zanimljivima. Apartmani se &nbsp;nalaze na I. katu zgrade.&nbsp;Apartmani imaju svu potrebnu infrastrukturu. Udaljenost do centra Rogoznice je 150 m, a do aerodroma 25 km.</p>', '<p>We have for sale two-bedroom apartments, each of 83 m2, in a newly built apartment building, only 150 meters from the sea. They have terrific views overlooking the sea and Rogoznica harbour from the terrace.&nbsp;The apartments are located on the first floor of the building.&nbsp;Distance from the town center is 150 m where there are many shops, bars cafes and other services for tourists and the resident population, and the airport 25 km.&nbsp;</p>', '', '<p>Prodaju se dva dvosobna apartmana u novoizgraðenoj apartmanskoj zgradi na svega 150 m udaljenosti od mora.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Prekrasan pogled na more i Rogoznicu s terasa ovih apartmana èini ove apartmane izuzetno zanimljivima.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartmani se &nbsp;nalaze na I. katu zgrade.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;"><strong>Apartman A</strong> &ndash; Povr&scaron;ina 83 m2, &euro;2200/m2</span></p>\r\n<p>Sastoji se od dvije spavaæe sobe , kupaonice, velikog dnevnog boravka , kuhinje i kupaonice.</p>\r\n<p>Apartman ima veliku terasu s koje se pru¾a pogled na more.</p>\r\n<p>Osigurano je jedno parking mjesto.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;"><strong>Apartman B</strong> &ndash; Povr&scaron;ina 83 m2, &euro;2200/m2</span></p>\r\n<p>Sastoji se od dvije spavaæe sobe , kupaonice, velikog dnevnog boravka , kuhinje i kupaonice.</p>\r\n<p>Apartman ima veliku terasu s koje se pru¾a pogled na more.</p>\r\n<p>Osigurano je jedno parking mjesto.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartmani imaju svu potrebnu infrastrukturu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Udaljenost do centra Rogoznice je 150 m, a do aerodroma 25 km.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za ostale informacije molimo kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured u Splitu.</p>', '<p>We have for sale two-bedroom apartments in a newly built apartment building, only 150 meters from the sea.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>They have terrific views overlooking the sea and Rogoznica harbour from the terrace.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The apartments are located on the first floor of the building.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;"><strong>Apartment A</strong> - Area 83 m2, &euro;2200/m2</span></p>\r\n<p>It consists of two bedrooms, a bathroom, a large living room, kitchen and bathroom.</p>\r\n<p>The apartment has a large terrace with a view of the sea.</p>\r\n<p>There is one parking space.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;"><strong>Apartment B</strong> - Area 83 m2, &euro;2200/m2</span></p>\r\n<p>It consists of two bedrooms, a bathroom, a large living room, kitchen and bathroom.</p>\r\n<p>The apartment has a large terrace with a view of the sea.</p>\r\n<p>There is one parking space.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The apartments have all modern conveniences and are designed with a large open plan living area.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Distance from the town center is 150 m where there are many shops, bars cafes and other services for tourists and the resident population, and the airport 25 km.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Split town is 45 mns drive.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact our office to arrange to visit this property or similar ones in the area.</p>', '', '1109_Apartment_0.jpg', '1109_Apartment_1.jpg', '1109_Apartment_2.jpg', '1109_Apartment_3.jpg', '1109_Apartment_4.jpg', '1109_Apartment_5.jpg', '1109_Apartment_6.jpg', '1109_Apartment_7.jpg', '1109_Apartment_8.jpg'),
(1110, 'Ivan ', 'Nikoliæ', '', '0915171009', '', 'Rogoznica', 'Stiva¹nica Ra¾anj', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '40', '435', '180', 1, '450000', '', 2, 1, 2, 2, 1, 1, 3, 2, 'March 30, 2015', '<p>Luksuzna novoizgraðena kuæa s bazenom na svega 40 m od mora s prekrasnim pogledom na more i uvalu. Kuæa je povr&scaron;ine 180 m2, na parceli povr&scaron;ine 435 m2. Okuænica je ureðena i poploèana kvalitetnim kamenom. Bazen, prostor oko bazena za odmor i ro&scaron;tilj takoðer su izgraðeni u kamenu. Cijela kuæa iako moderna odi&scaron;e mediteranskim duhom. Kuæa je podijeljena na prizemlje i kat.</p>', '<p lang="en-GB">We have this luxury, newly built house with swimming pool only 40 m from the sea and with breathtaking views of the sea and the bay.&nbsp;The house has 180 m2 of residential floor area and is on a plot of 435 m2. The house is divided into two floors.&nbsp;The swimming pool, and pool area is designed for resting and enjoying the peaceful surroundings, and has a barbecue, also built in stone.</p>', '', '<p>Luksuzna novoizgraðena kuæa s bazenom na svega 40 m od mora s prekrasnim pogledom na more i uvalu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je povr&scaron;ine 180 m2, na parceli povr&scaron;ine 435 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Okuænica je ureðena i poploèana kvalitetnim kamenom. Bazen, prostor oko bazena za odmor i ro&scaron;tilj takoðer su izgraðeni u kamenu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Cijela kuæa iako moderna odi&scaron;e mediteranskim duhom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je podijeljena na prizemlje i kat.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U prizemlju se nalazi prostrani dnevni boravak s kuhinjom, sauna i kupaonica.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na katu se nalaze dvije spavaæe sobe i kupaonica.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Iz svih soba pru¾a se pogled na more i imaju izlaz na terase.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Iz dnevnog boravka je izlaz na bazen i prostor oko bazena.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa ima i podrum.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U kuæi je ugraðeno podno grijanje, takoðer ima i svu potrebnu infrastrukturu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Do kuæe vodi asfaltirana cesta i osiguran je vlastiti parking ispred kuæe.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Udaljenost do centra mjesta, trgovina, restorana i kafiæa je svega par kilometara, a do aerodroma 25 km.</p>', '<p>We have this luxury, newly built house with swimming pool only 40 m from the sea and with breathtaking views of the sea and the bay.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house has 180 m2 of residential floor area and is on a plot of 435 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house is divided into two floors.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the ground floor there is a spacious living room with kitchen, sauna and bathroom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Upstairs are two bedrooms and a bathroom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Each room and the terraces and balconies offer views of the sea.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The living room has access through glass doors into the pool and pool area.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house has a basement.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house has underfloor heating, also has all the necessary infrastructure.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The courtyard is finished with attractive and practical stone.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The swimming pool, and pool area is designed for resting and enjoying the peaceful surroundings, and has a barbecue, also built in stone.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The whole house although modern exudes a Mediterranean flair, and style.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>To the house leads an asphalt road and has its own private parking.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Distance to the city centre, shops, restaurants, bars, bakery and caf&eacute;s etc. is only a few kilometers, and the airport 25 km.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact the office to arrange to visit this property or similar ones.</p>', '', '1110_House-Villa_0.jpg', '1110_House-Villa_1.jpg', '1110_House-Villa_2.jpg', '1110_House-Villa_3.jpg', '1110_House-Villa_4.jpg', '1110_House-Villa_5.jpg', '1110_House-Villa_6.jpg', '1110_House-Villa_7.jpg', '1110_House-Villa_8.jpg');
INSERT INTO `nekretnina` (`id`, `ime`, `prezime`, `telefon`, `mobitel`, `e_mail`, `lokacija_id`, `adresa`, `status_id`, `vrsta_id`, `udaljenost`, `povrsina`, `stambenapovrsina`, `display`, `cijena`, `cijenatocka`, `ponuda_tjedna`, `new_built`, `must_sell`, `prvi_red_do_mora`, `pogled_na_more`, `bazen`, `broj_soba`, `broj_kupatila`, `datum`, `title_hr`, `title_en`, `title_ge`, `opis_hr`, `opis_en`, `opis_ge`, `PropertyImageURL0`, `PropertyImageURL1`, `PropertyImageURL2`, `PropertyImageURL3`, `PropertyImageURL4`, `PropertyImageURL5`, `PropertyImageURL6`, `PropertyImageURL7`, `PropertyImageURL8`) VALUES
(1111, 'Branimir', 'Vagros', '', '099 7214652', '', 'Hvar', 'Hvar Brusje', 'For sale', 'Old stone house', '2000', '45', '62', 2, '77000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 1, 1, 'March 30, 2015', '<p>&Scaron;armantna kamena kuæa povr&scaron;ine 62 m2, u centru idiliènog sela, s predivnim pogledom na more i mjesto. Nalazi se na zapadnom dijelu otoka, u blizini grada Hvara, nadomak svim potrebnim sadr¾ajima. Kuæa je kompletno renovirana, a sastoji se od prizemlja i galerije. Danas je ovo sele predgraðe grada Hvara i omiljeno izleti&scaron;te za sve koji ¾ele vidjeti i osjetiti izvorni seoski ugoðaj otoka Hvara.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>We have this charming stone house of 62 m2, in a typical charming village, with a beautiful view of the surrounding natural woodland and preserved meadows as well as the sea and the resort. It is located in the western part of the island, near the town of Hvar, close to all necessary amenities, such as shops, coffee bars, restaurants, bakery etc. The house is completely renovated and consists of ground floor and gallery. The property is 2 km from the sea, so almost entirely off the beaten tourist track, and with a price that reflects this.</p>', '', '<p>&Scaron;armantna kamena kuæa u centru idiliènog sela, s predivnim pogledom na more i mjesto.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nalazi se na zapadnom dijelu otoka, u blizini grada Hvara, nadomak svim potrebnim sadr¾ajima.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je kompletno renovirana, a sastoji se od prizemlja i galerije.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U prizemlju se nalazi kuhinja s dnevnim boravkom i kupaonom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U galeriji je prostrana spavaæa soba iz koje se pru¾a pogled na selo i more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ukupna stambena povr&scaron;ina iznosi 62 m2, dok terasa ima povr&scaron;inu cca 25 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je smje&scaron;tena na parceli povr&scaron;ine 45 m2, a orijentirana je sjeverozapadno.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Selo je udaljeno od mora i pla¾e 2 km.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Mjesti je udaljeno 6 km istoèno od Hvara, poznato po proizvodnji vina, maslinova ulja, ru¾marinova ulja i meda.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Danas je ovo sele predgraðe grada Hvara i omiljeno izleti&scaron;te za sve koji ¾ele vidjeti i osjetiti izvorni seoski ugoðaj otoka Hvara.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Grad Hvar je povezan katamaranskom linijom iz Splita.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za sve dodatne informacije molimo Vas kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>We have this charming stone house in a typical charming village, with a beautiful view of the surrounding natural woodland and preserved meadows as well as the sea and the resort.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is located in the western part of the island, near the town of Hvar, close to all necessary amenities, such as shops, coffee bars, restaurants, bakery etc.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house is completely renovated and consists of ground floor and gallery.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the ground floor there is a spacious open kitchen and living room and a bathroom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The gallery is a spacious bedroom which offers views of the village and the sea.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Total area is 62 m2, while the terrace has an area of 25 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house is situated on a plot of 45 m2, and is oriented north/west.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property is 2 km from the sea, so almost entirely off the beaten tourist track, and with a price that reflects this.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The village is 6 km east of Hvar and the ferry port, and it is known for its wine, olive oil, rosemary oil and honey.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The village is almost on the outskirts of Hvar town which is a favourite resort for all who want to see and feel the original rural atmosphere of Hvar, and Dalmatia.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For further information or a tour of the property please contact our office.</p>', '', '1111_Old-stone-house_0.JPG', '1111_Old-stone-house_1.JPG', '1111_Old-stone-house_2.JPG', '1111_Old-stone-house_3.JPG', '1111_Old-stone-house_4.JPG', '1111_Old-stone-house_5.JPG', '1111_Old-stone-house_6.JPG', '1111_Old-stone-house_7.JPG', '1111_Old-stone-house_8.JPG'),
(1112, '', 'Skoric', '098/187-0547 (majka) ', ' 095/879-5438 (Elvis)', '', 'Zadar', 'Siroka Ulica 10/3, Zadar, Poluotok', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '300', '0', '61', 1, '160000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 1, 'March 31, 2015', '<p>Stan u samom centru Poluotoka, u povijesnoj jezgri grada Zadra, s pogledom na Kalelargu i katerdalu Sv. Stosije.&nbsp;Udaljen samo nekoliko minuta od mnogobrojnih zanimljivosti kao sto su primjerice: Morske orgulje i Pozdrav Suncu, Katedrala Sv. Donata, Bedemi, Narodni trg itd.&nbsp;Nalazi se na samoj Kalelargi, najzanimljivijoj i najvecoj pjesackoj zoni grada.&nbsp;Ukupna stambena povrsina iznosi 61 m2.&nbsp;Nekoliko gradskih plaza udaljeno je 15-ak minuta lagane setnje.</p>', '<p>We are pleased to offer this apartment in the heart of the historical center of Zadar with an extraordinary view of the famous street Kalelarga, promenade of Zadar, the towns largest pedestrian area.&nbsp;It is located just a few minutes from many interesting town&rsquo;s landmarks such as: The Sea Organ, Greetings to the Sun, Cathedral of Sant Donat- Patron of Zadar, National Square, The City Walls and many others.&nbsp;The living area of the apartment is 61 m2.&nbsp;Town&rsquo;s nice pebble beaches are 15 mins walking along the promenade.</p>', '', '<p>Stan u samom centru Poluotoka, u povijesnoj jezgri grada Zadra, s pogledom na Kalelargu i Katerdalu Sv. Stosije.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Udaljen samo nekoliko minuta od mnogobrojnih zanimljivosti kao sto su primjerice: Morske orgulje i Pozdrav Suncu, Katedrala Sv. Donata, Bedemi, Narodni trg itd.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nalazi se na samoj Kalelargi, najzanimljivijoj i najvecoj pjesackoj zoni grada.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Stan se nalazi na trecem katu cetverokatnice iz kasnog 19. stoljeca.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Zgrada je u &nbsp;dobrom stanju. Lift nema.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Stan je orijentiran prema jugu, sa suncane je strane.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ukupna stambena povrsina iznosi 61m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sastoji se od kuhinje/dnevnog boravka/blagavaone, jedne spavace sobe, malog hodnika, kupaone i WC-a.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ima cetiri francuska prozora sa juzne strane..</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Stan je u dobrom stanju, odmah useljiv, iako bi zahtjevao manju renovaciju.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Buduci da se radi o samom centru grada pristup vozilom je ogranicen, dok je najblizi parking od stana udaljen cca 200 m.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nekoliko gradskih plaza udaljeno je 15-ak minuta lagane setnje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Medunarodni aerodrom Zadar &nbsp;udaljen je 13km odnosno 15 minuta voznje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za sve &nbsp;dodatne informacije stojimo vam na raspolaganju.</p>', '<p>We are pleased to offer this apartment in the heart of the historical center of Zadar with an extraordinary view of the famous street Kalelarga, promenade of Zadar, the towns largest pedestrian area.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is located just a few minutes from many interesting town&rsquo;s landmarks such as: The Sea Organ, Greetings to the Sun, Cathedral of Sant Donat - Patron of Zadar, National Square, The City Walls and many others.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The apartment is a part of a building dating from the late 19. century.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The apartment is located on the third floor of a four story well constructed, solid building.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is south oriented, with 4 French windows with plenty of sun.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The living area of the apartment is 61 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It consists of an open plan kitchen/living room/dining room, a short hallway, one bedroom, bathroom and a toilet.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It&rsquo;s a few steps away from many famous restaurants and taverns-&ldquo;konobas&rdquo;, cafes&rsquo;, bars&hellip;..</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The whole peninsula is ''pedestrian only''.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Parking is 200m away, but there is access for deliveries etc.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Town&rsquo;s nice pebble beaches are 15 mins walking along the promenade.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Zadar international airport is 13 km away, 15 minute drive.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please call our office for more information or to arrange to view this and other properties in the area.</p>', '', '1112_Apartment_0.jpg', '1112_Apartment_1.jpg', '1112_Apartment_2.jpg', '1112_Apartment_3.jpg', '1112_Apartment_4.jpg', '1112_Apartment_5.jpg', '1112_Apartment_6.jpg', '1112_Apartment_7.jpg', '1112_Apartment_8.jpg'),
(1113, 'Tin', 'Vujeviæ', '', '0911972505', '', 'Rogoznica', 'Ljoljinica, Ra¾anj', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '12', '781', '259', 2, '720000', '', 2, 1, 2, 1, 1, 2, 3, 3, 'March 31, 2015', '<p>Luksuzne vile u prekrasnoj mirnoj uvali, prvi red do mora, vlastiti prilaz pla¾i i pogled na more èine ove vile jedinstvenim. Od tri vile u komplesku, dvije su jo&scaron; na prodaju. Vile se sastoje od prizemlja i kata, svaka stambene povr&scaron;ine 259 m2. Svaka vila ima vlastiti pristup s parcele na pla¾u. Sa stra¾nje strane parcele nalaze se parking mjesta.</p>', '<p>We are offering these luxury villas in beautiful, quiet bay as part of a complex with private access to the beach and sea, first row to the sea. There are just three villas in the complex, one has been sold and two are still on sale.&nbsp;The villas consist of two floors, each of them has living space of 259 m2. There is sufficient space in the gardens to add other improvements such as a boat store or swimming pool and patio.&nbsp;On the back of the plot there are private parking places.<br /><br /></p>', '', '<p>Luksuzne vile u prekrasnoj mirnoj uvali, prvi red do mora, vlastiti prilaz pla¾i i pogled na more èine ove vile jedinstvenim.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Tri vile su izgraðene u &nbsp;ovom kompleksu, jedna je prodana a dvije su jo&scaron; na prodaju.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Vile se sastoje od prizemlja i kata, svaka stambene povr&scaron;ine 259 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U prizemlju se nalazi dnevni boravak, kuhinja, blagovaonica, kupaonica i natkrivena terasa sa koje se pru¾a pogled na more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na katu se nalaze tri spavaæe sobe, dvije kupaonice i natkrivena idealna za odmor i u¾ivanje u prekrasnom pogledu na more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Prizemlje i kat su povezani natkrivenim stepenicama.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Vile su izgraðene od kvalitetnog graðevinskog materijala.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Vrt je lijepo ureðen u dalmatinskom duhu s mediteranskim biljem.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U vrtu koji je terasasto izveden je sjenica za dnevni odmor u hladu, s obzirom da se na svega par metara nalazi pla¾a.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Moguæe izgraditi bazen na parceli.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Svaka vila ima vlastiti pristup s parcele na pla¾u.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sa stra¾nje strane parcele nalaze se parking mjesta.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Vila A</strong></p>\r\n<p>Povr&scaron;ina zemlji&scaron;ta 659 m2</p>\r\n<p>Stambena povr&scaron;ina 259 m2</p>\r\n<p>Ljetna kuhinja 20 m2</p>\r\n<p>Sjenica na pla¾i 12 m2</p>\r\n<p>Cijena &euro;760.000</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Vila B</strong></p>\r\n<p>Povr&scaron;ina zemlji&scaron;ta 781 m2</p>\r\n<p>Stambena povr&scaron;ina 259 m2</p>\r\n<p>Ljetna kuhinja 20 m2</p>\r\n<p>Sjenica na pla¾i 12 m2</p>\r\n<p>Cijena &euro;720.000 &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Udaljenost do restorana, kafiæa, duæana je &nbsp;svega par kilometara.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Aerodrom je na 25 km udaljenosti od mjesta.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za sve informacije kao i obilazak molimo kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured u Splitu.</p>', '<p>We are offering these luxury villas in beautiful, quiet bay as part of a complex with private access to the beach and sea.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There are just three villas in the complex, one has been sold and two are still on sale.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The villas consist of two floors, each of them has living space of 259 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The ground floor has a modern style open plan living room, kitchen, dining room, bathroom and direct access to the terrace which has extensive views of the sea and bay.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Upstairs are three bedrooms, two bathrooms and a covered balcony, ideal to relax and enjoy the beautiful view of the sea.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The ground floor and first floor are connected by internal stairs.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The villas are constructed with high-quality building materials and fittings.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The garden is beautifully landscaped into terraces, in the spirit of Dalmatia with Mediterranean plants, and larger trees have been incorporated to ensure there is shade.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The garden has a gate and access directly to the beach and clean water of the sea.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There is sufficient space in the gardens to add other improvements such as a boat store or swimming pool and patio.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the back of the plot there are private parking places.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Villa A</strong></p>\r\n<p>Land area 659 m2</p>\r\n<p>Living area 259 m2</p>\r\n<p>Summer kitchen 20 m2</p>\r\n<p>Arbour on the beach 12 m2</p>\r\n<p>Price &euro;760,000</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Villa B</strong></p>\r\n<p>Land area 781 m2</p>\r\n<p>Living area 259 m2</p>\r\n<p>Summer kitchen 20 m2</p>\r\n<p>Arbour on the beach 12 m2</p>\r\n<p>Price &euro;720,000</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Proximity to restaurants, cafes, shops is only a few kilometers.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The airport is 25 km away from the resort.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>To visit these or similar properties, please contact the office.</p>', '', '1113_House-Villa_0.jpg', '1113_House-Villa_1.jpg', '1113_House-Villa_2.JPG', '1113_House-Villa_3.JPG', '1113_House-Villa_4.JPG', '1113_House-Villa_5.JPG', '1113_House-Villa_6.JPG', '1113_House-Villa_7.JPG', '1113_House-Villa_8.JPG'),
(1114, 'Mirjana i Boris', 'Hrepiæ', '', '', '', 'Brac', 'Supetar', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '200', '0', '35', 2, '69000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 1, 1, 'March 31, 2015', '<p>Apartman na drugom katu zgrade, s predivnim pogledom na more na otoku Braèu.&nbsp;Smje&scaron;ten iznad glavne gradske pla¾e, na samo 200 m udaljenosti od mora. Od centra mjesta gdje su svi potrebni sadr¾aji (restorani, barovi, tr¾nica, banka, po&scaron;tanski ured, ambulanta, trajektna luka) ima svega pet minuta hoda.&nbsp;Ukupna stambena povr&scaron;ina iznosi 35 m2.</p>', '<p>We have this modestly priced apartment on the second floor, with stunning sea views on the island.&nbsp;It is located above the main beach, just 200 meters from the sea. To walk from the centre where there are all necessary facilities (restaurants, bars, market, bakery, bank, post office, medical clinic, ferry) is only five minutes.&nbsp;The total loiving area is 35 m2.</p>', '', '<p>Apartman na drugom katu zgrade, s predivnim pogledom na more na otoku Braèu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Smje&scaron;ten iznad glavne gradske pla¾e, na samo 200 m udaljenosti od mora.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Od centra mjesta gdje su svi potrebni sadr¾aji (restorani, barovi, tr¾nica, banka, po&scaron;tanski ured, ambulanta, trajektna luka) ima svega pet minuta hoda.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartman se sastoji od dnevnog boravka s pridru¾enom loggiom, blagovaone, kuhinje, kupaone, jedne spavaæe sobe te spreme u prizemlju povr&scaron;ine 4 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ukupna stambena povr&scaron;ina iznosi 35 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Jugoistoèno je orijentiran.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ima pristup s glavne ceste, te svu potrebnu infrastrukturu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U potpunosti je opremljen - klimatiziran be&scaron;umnim klima ureðajem, ima PVC fasadnu stolariju, podove od keramike i laminata.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Zgrada je kvalitetno graðena.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartmanu pripada jedno parkirno mjesto.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Trajektna luka je udaljena 300 m od apartmana. &nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za sve ostale informacije stojimo Vam na usluzi.</p>', '<p>We have this modestly priced apartment on the second floor, with stunning sea views on the island.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is located above the main beach, just 200 meters from the sea.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>To walk from the centre where there are all necessary facilities (restaurants, bars, market, bakery, bank, post office, medical clinic, ferry) is only five minutes.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Southeast oriented.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The total area is 35 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Living room with access onto the adjacent balcony, dining room, kitchen, bathroom, 1 bedroom) + 4 m2 stores on the ground floor + one parking place.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It has &nbsp;excellent access from the main road.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>All infrastructure (water/drains etc.), antenna system for TV reception.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Air conditioned with a noiseless air-conditioning that acts as a heater in winter, pvc flooring ceramics and laminate.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is well built, well equipped, tastefully furnished with new furniture and functional.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ferry port is 300 m away from the apartment.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For all other information please contact us at your service.</p>', '', '1114_Apartment_0.jpg', '1114_Apartment_1.jpg', '1114_Apartment_2.jpg', '1114_Apartment_3.jpg', '1114_Apartment_4.jpg', '1114_Apartment_5.jpg', '1114_Apartment_6.jpg', '1114_Apartment_7.jpg', '1114_Apartment_8.jpg'),
(1115, 'Sasenka', 'Visic', '023/250-584', '', '', 'Zadar', 'Zore Dalmatinske 4, z.k. 22, Zadar', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '100', '0', '76', 1, '250000', '', 2, 2, 2, 1, 1, 2, 2, 1, 'April 1, 2015', '<p>Stan u samom centru Poluotoka, u povijesnoj jezgri grada Zadra, prvi red do mora.&nbsp;Nalazi se na samoj rivi, na trecem katu peterokatnice (1959). Zgrada je u &nbsp;dobrom stanju i ima lift.&nbsp;Ukupna stambena povrsina iznosi 76m2.&nbsp;Udaljen je samo &nbsp;nekoliko minuta &scaron;etnje od mnogobrojnih zanimljivosti: Morske orgulje i Pozdrav Suncu, katedrala Sv. Donata, Bedemi, Narodni trg itd.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>We are pleased to offer this apartment in the heart of the historical center of Zadar, first row to the sea.&nbsp;The apartment is located on the third floor of a solid five story building with lift, dated 1959. The living area of the apartment is 76 m2.&nbsp;It is located just a few minutes from many interesting town&rsquo;s landmarks such as: The Sea Organ, Greetings to the Sun, Cathedral of Sant Donat- Patron of Zadar National Square, The City Walls and many others.</p>', '', '<p>Stan u samom centru Poluotoka, u povijesnoj jezgri grada Zadra, u prvom redu, s pogledom na more.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nalazi se na samoj rivi, na trecem katu peterokatnice (1959).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Zgrada je u &nbsp;dobrom stanju i ima lift.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ukupna stambena povrsina iznosi 76m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sastoji se od kuhinje, dnevnog boravka, blagavaone, dvije spavace sobe, malog hodnika, kupaone i WC-a.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ima pet prozora i staklenu balkonsku stijenku du¾ine 9 metara s jugo-istocne strane.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Stan je u vrlo dobrom stanju i odmah je useljiv.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Udaljen je samo &nbsp;nekoliko minuta &scaron;etnje od mnogobrojnih zanimljivosti: Morske orgulje i Pozdrav Suncu, Katedrala Sv. Donata, Bedemi, Narodni trg itd.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Pristup vozilom je moguc i zgrada ima vlastiti parking.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nekoliko gradskih plaza udaljeno je 15-ak minuta lagane setnje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Medunarodni aerodrom Zadar udaljen je 15 minuta voznje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za sve &nbsp;dodatne informacije stojimo vam na raspolaganju.</p>', '<p>We are pleased to offer this apartment in the heart of the historical center of Zadar, first row to the sea.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The apartment is located on the third floor of a solid five story building with lift, dated 1959.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The living area of the apartment is 76 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It consists of a kitchen, a living room, a dining room, a short hallway, two bedrooms, bathroom and a toilet.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is south-east oriented, with 5 windows and a 9 meter glass balcony wall.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The building has its own parking.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It&rsquo;s a few steps away from many famous restaurants and taverns-&ldquo;konobas&rdquo;, cafes&rsquo;, bars&hellip;..</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is located just a few minutes from many interesting town&rsquo;s landmarks such as: The Sea Organ, Greetings to the Sun, Cathedral of Sant Donat- Patron of Zadar National Square, The City Walls and many others.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It&rsquo;s a 15 minutes&rsquo; walk to the towns nice pebble beaches.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Zadar international airport is 15 minute drive.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please call our office for more information or to arrange to visit this and other properties in the area.</p>', '', '1115_Apartment_0.jpg', '1115_Apartment_1.jpg', '1115_Apartment_2.jpg', '1115_Apartment_3.jpg', '1115_Apartment_4.jpg', '1115_Apartment_5.jpg', '1115_Apartment_6.jpg', '1115_Apartment_7.jpg', '1115_Apartment_8.jpg'),
(1116, 'Mark i Carmel', 'O Brien', '    Miro Basic 098 321 482', '0877695156', 'obrienreilly@eircom.net', 'Trogir', 'Èiovo Okrug Gornji, k.è.766/77 KO Okrug', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '450', '', '60', 1, '78000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 1, 2, 1, 'April 1, 2015', '<p><strong style="color: #ed1127;">CIJENA SNI®ENA SA 90.000 &euro; NA 78.000 &euro;!</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Moderan i potpuno opremljen apartman na drugom katu zgrade, sa zajednièkim bazenom.&nbsp;Nalazi se u Okrugu, samo 450 m od pla¾e, s predivnim pogledom na more i otoke. Udaljen je nekoliko minuta &scaron;etnje od centra mjesta u kojem se nalaze svi korisni sadr¾aji poput prodavaonica, restorana, barova...&nbsp;Ukupna stambena povr&scaron;ina iznosi cca 43 m2.<br /><br /></p>', '<p><strong><span style="color: #f5092f;">PRICE REDUCED FROM 90.000 &euro; to 78.000 &euro;!</span></strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>We have this modern, fully furnished apartment, on the second floor, with a shared swimming pool.&nbsp;It is situated about 450m from the sea, on the sloping hills round Okrug and with beautiful views from the balcony of the village, the sea and islands beyond. The centre of the village is just a few minutes walk, and there are bars, coffee shops, supermarket, bakers and other useful services.&nbsp;The total living area is 43 m2, not including the wide balcony of 17 m2 and a basement storage room of 4 m2.</p>', '', '<p><strong style="color: #e9153f;">CIJENA SNI®ENA SA 90.000 &euro; NA 78.000 &euro;!</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Moderan i potpuno opremljen apartman na drugom katu zgrade, sa zajednièkim bazenom.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nalazi se u Okrugu, samo 450 m od pla¾e, s predivnim pogledom na more i otoke.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Udaljen je nekoliko minuta &scaron;etnje od centra mjesta u kojem se nalaze svi korisni sadr¾aji poput prodavaonica, restorana, barova...</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Zgrada je sagraðena 2004. i sastoji se od dnevnog boravka, kuhinje, blagavaone, predsoblja, 2 spavaæe sobe i kupaone.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Iz dnevnog boravka postoji izlaz na balkon s kojeg se pru¾a prekrasan pogled na more, otoke i mjesto.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ukupna stambena povr&scaron;ina iznosi cca 43 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Stan ima izlaz na terasu povr&scaron;ine 17 m2, a u prizemlju ostavu povr&scaron;ine 4 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Orijentiran je jugozapadno.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Parking se nalazi u sklopu objekta.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartman posjeduje licencu za iznajmljivanje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Cijeli otok prepun je lijepim pla¾ama, skrivenim uvalama i mnogim drugim prirodnim ljepotama.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Grad Trogir udaljen je 10 min., dok je meðunarodni aerodrom udaljen 15 min. vo¾nje.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Molimo Vas da kontaktirate na&scaron; ured za daljnje informacije.</p>', '<p><strong style="color: #f20c1a;">PRICE REDUCED FROM 90.000 &euro; to 78.000 &euro;!</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>We have this modern, fully furnished apartment, on the second floor, with a shared swimming pool.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is situated about 450m from the sea, on the sloping hills round Okrug and with beautiful views from the balcony of the village, the sea and islands beyond.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The centre of the village is just a few minutes walk, and there are bars, coffee shops, supermarket, bakers and other useful services.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property was built in 2004, and consists of an open plan lounge, kitchen and dining room, hallway, 2 bedrooms and bathroom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>From the lounge are opening windows leading onto the balcony with great views of the village, the sea and islands beyond.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The total living area is 43 m2, not including the wide balcony of 17 m2 and a basement storage room of 4 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartment is South West orientation.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Property has a septic tank.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Parking is secured within the property.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartment has a current letting licence.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The island of Ciovo is popular with tourists with the famous beach at Okrug and the quiet preserved natural pine forests and old olive groves.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The coast has many hidden coves and small beaches, suitable for private family picnics and swimming.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Split international airport is 15 min driving.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Trogir is 10 minutes driving, while Split town is 30 min driving.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact our office to arrange to visit this property or similar ones.</p>', '', '1116_Apartment_0.jpg', '1116_Apartment_1.jpg', '1116_Apartment_2.jpg', '1116_Apartment_3.jpg', '1116_Apartment_4.jpg', '1116_Apartment_5.jpg', '1116_Apartment_6.jpg', '1116_Apartment_7.jpg', ''),
(1117, 'Zdenka ', 'Sessa', '098448998', '', '', 'Zadar', 'Pag, 15057/5, 2236/3, 2238/2, 15057/4, KO Pag', 'For sale', 'Land plot', '150', '2140', '0', 1, '192600', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 0, 0, 'April 1, 2015', '<p>Izuzetna prilika za investiciju u mirnom podruèju, samo 150 m udaljenom od mora.&nbsp;Smje&scaron;teno na otoku Pagu s prekrasnim pogledom na more, zemlji&scaron;te je idealno za izgradnju kuæe s bazenom.&nbsp;Dozvoljena je gradnja prizemlja i 2 kata.&nbsp;Povr&scaron;ina zemlji&scaron;ta iznosi 2140 m2. Moguæe je kupiti samo dio zemlji&scaron;ta &nbsp;od 600 m2.&nbsp;Zemlji&scaron;te je ju¾no orijentirano.</p>', '<p>We have this extraordinary investment opportunity to build a substantial villa with a swimming pool in a superb location. The plot is beautifully positioned on the edge of a charming village on Pag Island. It is just 150m from the sea.&nbsp;The planners have allowed the building of a three story property on the plot, which measures a healthy 2140m sq, and already near the plot are the services.&nbsp;There is a possibility to buy also a part of building plot (600 m2).&nbsp;South oriented.</p>', '', '<p>Izuzetna prilika za investiciju u mirnom podruèju, samo 150 m udaljenom od mora.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Smje&scaron;teno na otoku Pagu s prekrasnim pogledom na more, zemlji&scaron;te je idealno za izgradnju kuæe s bazenom.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Dozvoljena je gradnja prizemlja i 2 kata.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Povr&scaron;ina zemlji&scaron;ta iznosi 2140 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Moguæe je kupiti samo dio zemlji&scaron;ta &nbsp;od 600 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Zemlji&scaron;te je ju¾no orijentirano.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Pristupni put i sva potrebna infrastruktura nalaze se odmah do zemlji&scaron;ta.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Odmah uz zemlji&scaron;te je vez za brod, dok je i u samoj uvali moguæe usidriti brod ili jedrilicu.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Zemlji&scaron;te je udaljeno 6 minuta vo¾nje automobilom od centra mjesta koje je povezano svakodnevnom &nbsp;autobusnom linijom sa gradom Zadrom.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Udaljenost od zraène luke u Zadru je 15 min., dok je Splitska zraèna luka udaljena 1,5 h vo¾nje.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za sva dodatna pitanja molimo da nas kontaktirate.</p>', '<p>We have this extraordinary investment opportunity to build a substantial villa with a swimming pool in a superb location.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The plot is beautifully positioned on the edge of a charming village on Pag Island.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is just 150m from the shore and less than 10 minutes drive to the centre of the island.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The planners have allowed the building of a three story property on the plot, which measures a healthy 2140m sq, and already near the plot are the services (water supply, drains, electric etc).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There is a possibility to buy also a part of building plot (600 m2).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>South oriented.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Another fabulous benefit of this land, is that a birth for a boat is available in the bay.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Zadar is 15 minutes drive and Split is 1.5 hours drive.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For any additional questions, and to arrange to visit this property, please contact us.</p>', '', '1117_Land-plot_0.jpg', '1117_Land-plot_1.jpg', '1117_Land-plot_2.JPG', '1117_Land-plot_3.jpg', '1117_Land-plot_4.jpg', '', '', '', ''),
(1118, 'Irina', 'Padovan', '', 'Brigita Pelivan 098/602 319', 'marinka.nala@yahoo.com', 'Split', 'Starèeviæeva 7, Z.U. 5558', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '550', '0', '127', 2, '260000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 5, 2, 'April 1, 2015', '<p>Apartman na jedinstvenoj lokaciji u prekrasnoj starogradskoj zgradi u centru Splita, udaljen svega par minuta hodanja od Dioklecijanove palaèe i ostalih povijesnih zanimljivosti samog centra.&nbsp;Udaljen je od mora 550 m.&nbsp;Smje&scaron;ten je na 1.katu od ukupno 4 kata.&nbsp;Stambena povr&scaron;ina iznosi 127 m2, stoga postoji moguænosti preureðenja u 2 ili 3 manja apartmana ukoliko se ¾elite baviti turistièkim iznajmljivanjem.</p>', '<p>We are offering this distinctive ''art deco'' style apartment in the centre of Split.It is located just a few minutes walk from the palace and other historical monuments in the city,as well as being in walking distance from many restaurants, bars and tourist attractions.&nbsp;It is located on the 1st floor of 4 floors in the building. The living area is 127 m2, thus there is an option to redesign the internal lay out to make 2 or even 3 small apartments within, for tourism renting.</p>', '', '<p>Apartman na jedinstvenoj lokaciji u prekrasnoj starogradskoj zgradi u centru Splita, udaljen svega par minuta hodanja od Dioklecijanove palaèe i ostalih povijesnih zanimljivosti samog centra.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Udaljen je od mora 550 m.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Smje&scaron;ten je na 1.katu od ukupno 4 kata.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Stambena povr&scaron;ina iznosi 127 m2, stoga postoji moguænosti preureðenja u 2 ili 3 manja apartmana ukoliko se ¾elite baviti turistièkim iznajmljivanjem.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sastoji se od ulaznog dijela, hodnika, 5 spavaæih soba, wc-a, kupaonice, velike kuhinje i blagovaonice te 2 balkona.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Orijentacija apartmana je I &ndash;Z.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Potrebno mu je kompletno renoviranje i preureðenje, ali je zbog velièine i izvrsnog polo¾aja izuzetna prilika za investiranje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Park &scaron;uma Marjan gdje se ujedno nalaze i najbli¾e pla¾e udaljena je par minuta vo¾nje, dok se svi ostali sadr¾aji kao &scaron;to su trgovine, restorani, kafiæi, nalaze u blizini.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Najbli¾i parking udaljen je svega 20 m.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Do meðunarodnog aerodroma je potrebno 40 min. vo¾nje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Stojimo na raspolaganju za sva dodatna pitanja.</p>', '<p>We are offering this distinctive ''art deco'' style apartment in the centre of Split.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is located just a few minutes walk from the palace and other historical monuments in the city,as well as being in walking distance from many restaurants, bars and tourist attractions.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is located on the 1st floor of 4 floors in the building.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The living area is 127 m2, thus there is an option to redesign the internal lay out to make 2 or even 3 small apartments within, for tourism renting.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It consists of an entrance area, hall, 5 bedrooms, toilet, bathroom, large kitchen and dining room and two balconies.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The orientation of the apartment is E-W.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It needs complete renovation and refurbishment, but because of the size and excellent position this is a great opportunity for investment.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The Marjan Forest Park, where you also find the nearest beach, is a few minutes drive, while all other facilities such as shops, restaurants, cafes, all located nearby.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The nearest parking is only 20 m.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>To the international airport it takes 40 min. driving.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>We will be pleased to arrange a tour of the property, so contact our office in Split for further details.</p>', '', '1118_Apartment_0.jpg', '1118_Apartment_1.jpg', '1118_Apartment_2.jpg', '1118_Apartment_3.jpg', '1118_Apartment_4.jpg', '1118_Apartment_5.jpg', '1118_Apartment_6.jpg', '1118_Apartment_7.jpg', '1118_Apartment_8.jpg'),
(1121, 'Susn M Warren ', 'David Geddes', '61473373892 ', '+64278813912', 'susanmwarren@gmail.com', 'Hvar', 'Ivana Mestrovica BB, 21460 Starigrad, Hvar', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '50', '604', '152', 1, '650000', '', 2, 2, 2, 1, 1, 2, 4, 4, 'April 1, 2015', '<p>Luksuzna vila na dvije eta¾e, s pogledom na more u mirnom poruèju na otoku Hvaru, u potpunosti renovirana i moderno opremljena, okru¾ena prostranim vrtom, idealnim za odmor i opu&scaron;tanje.&nbsp;Kuæa je smje&scaron;tena na jednoj od dvije parcele.&nbsp;Kuæa se sastoji od prizemlja i prvog kata koji su povezani unutarnjim stepeni&scaron;tem.&nbsp;<strong>Vila sa pripadajuæom parcelom od 486 m2 - &euro;650.000; druga parcela od 593 m2 - &euro;300.000; obadvije parcele + vila - &euro;900.000</strong>.<br /><br /></p>', '<p>We have this renovated luxury villa on two floors, overlooking the sea in a quiet area and surrounded by a spacious garden, ideal for rest and relaxation.&nbsp;The house is situated on one of the two land plots /486 m2/.&nbsp;The house consists of ground and first floors connected by an internal staircase.&nbsp;<strong>Villa with adjoining plot of 486 m2 - &euro; 650,000; second plot of 593 m2 - &euro; 300,000; both plots + villa - &euro; 900,000.</strong></p>', '', '<p>Luksuzna vila na dvije eta¾e, s pogledom na more u mirnom poruèju na otoku Hvaru, u potpunosti renovirana i moderno opremljena, okru¾ena prostranim vrtom, idealnim za odmor i opu&scaron;tanje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Vilu mogu koristiti dvije do tri obitelji, s tim da je svakoj osigurana privatnost.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je smje&scaron;tena na jednoj od dvije parcele.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Druga parcela je dio okuænice na kojoj se mo¾e izgraditi druga stambena jedinica.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa se sastoji od prizemlja i prvog kata koji su povezani unutarnjim stepeni&scaron;tem.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na gornjoj eta¾i nalaze se dvije velike spavaæe sobe s braènim krevetima i kupaonama, velika kuhinja te terasa i balkon koji imaju ukupnu povr&scaron;inu 20.8 sqm, dok su na donjoj eta¾i dvije spavaæe sobe, od kojih je jedna s braènim krevetom, dvije kupaone, mala kuhinja, &nbsp;veliki dnevni boravak i prostrana terasa povr&scaron;ine 45,41 sqm.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ukupna stambena povr&scaron;ina gornje eta¾e iznosi 70.93 sqm, dok je povr&scaron;ina donjeg dijela 81.47 sqm. &nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Postoji i moguænost ulaska izvana u spavaæu sobu na gornjoj eta¾i.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Vila ima direktan pristup s ceste te dva parking mjesta.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Moguæe je iznjamljivanje, buduæi da se vlasnici vise od 10 godina bave turizmom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong><span style="text-decoration: underline;">Cijena:</span></strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Vila sa pripadajuæom parcelom od 486 m2 - &euro;650.000; druga parcela od 593 m2 - &euro;300.000; obadvije parcele + vila - &euro;900.000</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Mjesto je u blizini trajektne luke, te svega nekoliko minuta hoda od samoga centra.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za sve ostale informacije molimo Vas kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured.</p>', '<p>We have this renovated luxury villa on two floors, overlooking the sea in a quiet area and surrounded by a spacious garden, ideal for rest and relaxation.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house is situated on one of the two land plots /486 m2/.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The second plot of is part of 593 m2 is also part of the property and it is possible to build another house on this plot.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house consists of ground and first floors connected by an internal staircase.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Total living area of the upper floor is 70.93 sqm, while the lower surface of 81.47 sqm.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the upper floor there are two large bedrooms with double beds and bathrooms, large kitchen and terrace and balcony (20.8 sqm), while on the lower floor two bedrooms, one of which is with double bed, two bathrooms, a small kitchen, large living room and a spacious terrace of 45.41 sqm.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There is also an alternative entrance from the outside into the bedroom on the upper floor.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Villa can be used two to three families, with the privacy of each ensured.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong><span style="text-decoration: underline;">Price:</span></strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Villa with adjoining plot of 486 m2 - &euro; 650,000; second plot of 593 m2 - &euro; 300,000; both plots + villa - &euro; 900,000</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The villa has direct access from the road and two parking spaces.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The location is near the ferry port and only a few minutes&rsquo; walk from the very centre of the village.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong><span style="text-decoration: underline;">Villa</span></strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The villa has spacious communal areas, with four large bedrooms and four bathrooms, all equipped with modern fittings and designed for comfort.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It has been totally renovated, and the holiday home is very spacious, with a large upstairs kitchen and smaller downstairs kitchen, two lounges and terraces upstairs and at ground level that offer great views and lots of sun &ndash; and shade! &nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The villa is quiet and private.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There is a garden to the side of the house, and it has its own private courtyard, and as well a full plot in the front to enjoy and relax in. The perfect luxury home for a holiday.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong><span style="text-decoration: underline;">Land plot</span></strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>This is a unique opportunity to purchase a house and an adjoining plot sitting one section away from the marina and with water views.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Should an owner wish to build on the plot it is sub-dividable and can have right of access through the Villa plot, plus shared parking.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong><span style="text-decoration: underline;">Income</span></strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Villa has been run as a boutique tourism business for more than ten years.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is rented out to families through the summer and has a local manager and Tourism Agency managing the bookings as well as listings in many sites.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Occupancy is basically 100% from June- September.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For any further information please contact our office.</p>', '', '1121_House-Villa_0.jpg', '1121_House-Villa_1.jpg', '1121_House-Villa_2.jpg', '1121_House-Villa_3.jpg', '1121_House-Villa_4.jpg', '1121_House-Villa_5.jpg', '', '1121_House-Villa_7.jpg', '1121_House-Villa_8.jpg'),
(1119, 'Gordana', 'Reiæ', '+38521412457', '+385981733801', 'sfoglia1990@gmail.com', 'Split', 'Jurkov prolaz 5, Kuèine, 1310/1, 1310/2, 1310/4 , 90/6, ', 'For sale', 'Old stone house', '3000', '551', '216', 2, '250000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 3, 2, 'April 1, 2015', '<p>Dvojna kuæa s predivnim pogledom na splitski akvatorij u starom dijelu mjesta nedaleko Splita. Od ureda za turizam grada Splita ocijenjena je sa 3 zvjezdice.&nbsp;Kuæa se sastoji od prizemlja i kata ukupne stambene povr&scaron;ine 218 m2, a sa terasama cca 280 m2. Smje&scaron;tena je na zemlj&scaron;tu povr&scaron;ine 551 m2. Postoji moguænost kupnje dodatnih 1000 m2 maslinika koji se nalazi tik uz vrt.</p>', '<p>We are offering this semi-detached house with stunning views of the islands and the sea in the old part of a village near Split.&nbsp;The house consists of two floors with a total floor area of 218 m2, with terraces of approximately 280 m2.&nbsp;It is situated on a land plot area of 551 m2.&nbsp;There is the option to purchase an additional 1000 m2 of agricultural land located next to the garden, which have recently been planted with olive trees.</p>', '', '<p>Dvojna kuæa s predivnim pogledom na splitski akvatorij u starom dijelu mjesta nedaleko Splita.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Od ureda za turizam grada Splita ocijenjena je sa 3 zvjezdice.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa se sastoji od prizemlja i kata ukupne stambene povr&scaron;ine 218 m2, a sa terasama cca 280 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Smje&scaron;tena je na zemlj&scaron;tu povr&scaron;ine 551 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Postoji moguænost kupnje dodatnih 1000 m2 maslinika koji se nalazi tik uz vrt.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Prizemlje se sastoji od prostrane verande koja ima ulaz u dnevnu sobu, kuhinje sa blagovaonom, malog toaleta i spavaæe sobe.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na kat se dolazi drvenim stepenicama iz prizemlja u hodnik koji s jedne strane vodi u spavaæu sobu i kupatilo sa WC-om te, te ima izlaz na prostrani balkon s pogledom na more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Drugom stranom hodnika ulazi se u veliku spavaæu sobu i radnu sobu sa ostavom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na toj strani takoðer postoje i druga vrata koja se otvaraju prema velikoj ograðenoj terasi, a slu¾e za uzlaz i izlaz iz kuæe.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Svaki kat ima zasebno brojilo za struju.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je spojena na gradski vodovod i kanalizaciju te posjeduje telefon.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Orijentacija kuæe je jug.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Parking se nalazi 10 m od kuæe.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Postoji i moguænost nastavka bavljenja turizmom, buduæi da je kuæa veæ rezervirana za ljeto 2015. godine.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa se nalazi 400 m od centra mjesta gdje su svi potrebni sadr¾aji, a 9 km od centra Splita.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Udaljenost od zraène luke je 25 km.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za sve dodatne informacije molimo da kontaktirate na&scaron; ured u Splitu.</p>', '<p>We are offering this semi-detached house with stunning views of the islands and the sea in the old part of a village near Split.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house consists of two floors with a total floor area of 218 m2, with terraces of approximately 280 m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is situated on a land plot area of 551 m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There is the option to purchase an additional 1000 m2 of agricultural land located next to the garden, which have recently been planted with olive trees.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The ground floor consists of a spacious veranda which has an entrance into the living room, kitchen, toilets and a small bedroom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the first floor, which is reached with internal wooden stairs from the ground floor there is a hallway that leads from one side to the bedroom with ensuite bathroom and toilet, and has access to a spacious balcony with sea view.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The other side of the hallway leads into the large bedroom currently used as a study room with storage.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On this side of the property there are other doors that open to an enclosed terrace which are used for entry into the house.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Each floor has a separate meter for electricity.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house is connected to city water and sewage, and have a phone.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It has a three star tourism rating from Split office.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The orientation of the house is south.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Parking is located 10 m from the house.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There is also possibility to continue in tourism, since the house has several bookings for summer 2015.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house is located 400 m from the center where all necessary facilities, shops, restaurants etc are located and 9 km from the center of Split.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Distance from the airport is 25 km.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For further information please contact our office in Split.</p>', '', '1119_Old-stone-house_0.jpg', '1119_Old-stone-house_1.jpg', '1119_Old-stone-house_2.jpg', '1119_Old-stone-house_3.jpg', '1119_Old-stone-house_4.jpg', '1119_Old-stone-house_5.jpg', '1119_Old-stone-house_6.jpg', '1119_Old-stone-house_7.jpg', '1119_Old-stone-house_8.jpg');
INSERT INTO `nekretnina` (`id`, `ime`, `prezime`, `telefon`, `mobitel`, `e_mail`, `lokacija_id`, `adresa`, `status_id`, `vrsta_id`, `udaljenost`, `povrsina`, `stambenapovrsina`, `display`, `cijena`, `cijenatocka`, `ponuda_tjedna`, `new_built`, `must_sell`, `prvi_red_do_mora`, `pogled_na_more`, `bazen`, `broj_soba`, `broj_kupatila`, `datum`, `title_hr`, `title_en`, `title_ge`, `opis_hr`, `opis_en`, `opis_ge`, `PropertyImageURL0`, `PropertyImageURL1`, `PropertyImageURL2`, `PropertyImageURL3`, `PropertyImageURL4`, `PropertyImageURL5`, `PropertyImageURL6`, `PropertyImageURL7`, `PropertyImageURL8`) VALUES
(1699, 'Steffi', 'Knapp', '', '', 'steffi.knapp@web.de', 'Rogoznica', 'Razanj, Ljoljinica 8 Razanj, Kc 7915/4 KO Sevid', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '3', '162', '95', 1, '350000', '', 2, 2, 2, 1, 1, 2, 2, 3, 'May 23, 2016', '<p>&Scaron;armantna kuæa s prekrasnim panoramskim pogledom, okru¾ena mediteranskim biljem koje skriva od znati¾eljnih pogleda, idealna je za sve koji tra¾e kuæu u prvom redu do mora. Stambeni dio kuæe je povr&scaron;ine 95 m2, a nalazi se na parceli povr&scaron;ine 162 m2.&nbsp;Kuæa se sastoji od suterena, prizemlja i kata.&nbsp;U naravi kuæa je obiteljskog tipa, ali je podijeljena na dva jednosobna apartmana na svakom katu te studio apartman u prizemlju.</p>', '<p>We have this charming shore side property with a beautiful panoramic view, surrounded by Mediterranean plants and is ideal for anyone looking for a first line house with privacy.&nbsp;The residential part of the house is 95 m2 and is located on a plot of 162 m2.&nbsp;The house consists of basement, ground floor and first floor.&nbsp;In the basement there is a storage room, living room and bathroom.&nbsp;It is a family house, but it is divided into two one bedroom apartments on each floor and a studio apartment on the ground floor.</p>', '', '<p>&Scaron;armantna kuæa s prekrasnim panoramskim pogledom, okru¾ena mediteranskim biljem koje skriva od znati¾eljnih pogleda, idealna je za sve koji tra¾e kuæu u prvom redu do mora.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Stambeni dio kuæe je povr&scaron;ine 95 m2, a nalazi se na parceli povr&scaron;ine 162 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa se sastoji od suterena, prizemlja i kata.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U suterenu se nalazi spremi&scaron;te, dnevni boravak i kupaonica.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Vanjskim stubi&scaron;tem ide se u prizemlje gdje se nalaze spavaæa soba, kupaonica, dnevni boravak s kuhinjom i blagovaonicom, kao i natkriveni dio terase (povr&scaron;ine 8 m2), koji se nastavlja u prostranu otvorenu terasu (povr&scaron;ine 19 m2) s panoramskim pogledom na more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na katu se nalaze spavaæa soba, kupaonica, dnevni boravak s kuhinjom i blagovaonicom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U naravi kuæa je obiteljskog tipa, ali je podijeljena na dva jednosobna apartmana na svakom katu i studio apartman u prizemlju.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa ima svu potrebnu infrastrukturu i Energetski certifikat razred B.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je u potpunosti renovirana 2013 godine, a trenutno je u odliènom stanju.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa ima dva pripadajuæa parking mjesta.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Udaljenost do trgovina, restorana i kafiæa je svega par kilometara.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Aerodrom je udaljen 28 km.</p>', '<p>We have this charming shore side property with a beautiful panoramic view, surrounded by Mediterranean plants and is ideal for anyone looking for a first line house with privacy.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The residential part of the house is 95 m2 and is located on a plot of 162 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house consists of basement, ground floor and first floor.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>In the basement there is a storage room, living room and bathroom.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>An external staircase going up to the first floor leads to a bedroom, bathroom, open plan living room with kitchen and dining room, and covered part of the terrace (8 m2).&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>This continues onto a large open &nbsp;terrace (19 m2) with panoramic sea views.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Upstairs is a bedroom, bathroom, living room with kitchen and dining room.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is a family house, but it is &nbsp;divided into two one bedroom apartments on each floor and a studio apartment on the ground floor.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house has all the necessary infrastructure (water/electric etc) and energy certificate class B.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house was completely renovated in 2013, and currently is in good condition for tourism.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house has two private parking spaces.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The distance to shops, restaurants and caf&eacute;s is only a few kilometers away.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The airport is 28 km.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact our office to arrange a visit to this property.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>This property is priced to ensure a quick sale. Hurry!</p>', '', '1699_House-Villa_0.jpg', '1699_House-Villa_1.jpg', '1699_House-Villa_2.jpg', '1699_House-Villa_3.jpg', '1699_House-Villa_4.jpg', '1699_House-Villa_5.jpg', '1699_House-Villa_6.jpg', '1699_House-Villa_7.jpg', '1699_House-Villa_8.jpg'),
(1122, 'Matko ', 'Kataviæ', '091 380 1122', '', '', 'Brac', 'Mala Lozna, Postire', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '200', '0', '0', 2, '81000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 2, 1, 'April 7, 2015', '<p>Tri &nbsp;dvosobna apartmana na atraktivnoj lokaciji u Postirama na otoku Braèu.&nbsp;Stanovi su smje&scaron;teni 200 m od &scaron;ljunèane pla¾e te 800 m od samoga centra. Uz pla¾u se nalazi &scaron;etnica kroz borovu &scaron;umu koja je idealna za opu&scaron;tanje. Apartmani imaju lijep pogled na more i potpuno su namje&scaron;teni i opremljeni.&nbsp;U cijenu su ukljuèeni &nbsp;namje&scaron;taj, ureðaji i oprema kao i parkirna mjesta. Apartmani imaju stambenu povr&scaron;inu od 37,5 m2 - 42 m2.</p>', '<p>We are offering three, great value, 2 x bedroom apartments in a superb location in an attractive village on the north side of the island of Brac.&nbsp;The apartments are located 200 m from the beach and 800 m from the very centre of the village. Along the beach there is a promenade through the pine forest that is ideal for relaxation. The apartments have stunning sea views and are fully furnished and equipped. Apartments have living space from 37,5 m2 - 42 m2.</p>', '', '<p>Tri &nbsp;dvosobna apartmana na atraktivnoj lokaciji u Postirama na otoku Braèu.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Stanovi su smje&scaron;teni 200 m od &scaron;ljunèane pla¾e te 800 m od samoga centra.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Uz pla¾u se nalazi &scaron;etnica kroz borovu &scaron;umu koja je idealna za opu&scaron;tanje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartmani imaju lijep pogled na more i potpuno su namje&scaron;teni i opremljeni.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Apartman 2 (prizemlje)</strong>:<strong> 42m2 + 55m2 terasa, &euro;110.000</strong></p>\r\n<p>Sastoji se dvije spavaæe sobe, kupaone, dnevne sobe, kuhinje s blagavonom, te prostrane terase.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Apartman 5 (drugi kat):</strong> <strong>37,5m2 + 13m2 galerija, &euro;81,000&nbsp;</strong></p>\r\n<p>Sastoji se od dvije spavaæe sobe, kupaone, dnevne sobe, kuhinje s blagavaonom, te balkona.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Apartman 6 (drugi kat): 42m2 + 9m2 galerija, &euro;90.000</strong></p>\r\n<p>Sastoji se od dvije spavaæe sobe, kupaone, dnevne sobe, kuhinje s blagavaonom, te balkona s kojeg se pru¾a predivan pogled na more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Apartmani 5+6 (drugi kat) = &euro;165,000</strong></p>\r\n<p>Dva stana na drugom katu mogu se uz manje preinake spojiti u jedan &ndash; u sluèaju da se kupuju oba stana, cijena bi bila 168,500 eura.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ukupna stambena povr&scaron;ina iznosi &nbsp;79,60 m2 + i 22 m2 galerije (+ 2m2 predsoblja), sveukupno 103 m2.<br /><br /></p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je sagraðena po visokim standardima granje 2008., a apartmani koji su u ponudi opremljeni su 2010. godine.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartmani su pogodni za iznajmljivanje, te posjeduju kompletnu dokumentaciju.<br /><br /></p>\r\n<p>U cijenu su ukljuèeni &nbsp;namje&scaron;taj, ureðaji i oprema kao i parkirna mjesta.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Postire su ribarsko i turistièko naselje smje&scaron;teno na sjevernoj obali otoka Braèa, bogato s atraktivnim pje&scaron;èanim i &scaron;ljunèanim uvalama, na udaljenosti 9 km od glavne trajektne luke u Supetru.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Molimo &nbsp;za sve informacije kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured u Splitu.</p>', '<p>We are offering three, great value, 2 x bedroom apartments in a superb location in an attractive village on the north side of the island of Brac.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The apartments are located 200 m from the beach and 800 m from the very centre of the village.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Along the beach there is a promenade through the pine forest that is ideal for relaxation.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The apartments have stunning sea views and are fully furnished and equipped.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>They are in a very good condition and have been well managed and well maintained.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Apartment 2 (ground floor): 42m2 + 55m2 terrace, &euro; 110,000</strong></p>\r\n<p>It consists of two bedrooms, bathroom, living room, kitchen with dining room, and spacious terrace.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Apartment 5 (second floor): 37,5m2 + 13m2 gallery, &euro; 81.000</strong></p>\r\n<p>It consists of two bedrooms, bathroom, open plan living room, kitchen, dining room and balcony with a beautiful view of the sea.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Apartment 6 (second floor): 42m2 + 9m2 gallery, &euro; 90,000</strong></p>\r\n<p>It consists of two bedrooms, bathroom, living room, kitchen, dining room and balcony with a beautiful view of the sea.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Apartments 5 + 6 (second floor) = &euro; 165.000</strong></p>\r\n<p>Two apartments on the second floor can be used with minor modifications merged into one - in case you are buying both apartments, the price would be 168.500 euros.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Total area is 79.60 m2 and 22 m2 gallery (+ 2m2 hall) - in total 103 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house is built to high standards in 2008.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The apartments are very suitable for rental, and have all the necessary documentation.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The price includes furniture, appliances and equipment as well as parking spaces.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The village is a small port and a popular tourist destination on the northern coast of the island, rich with attractive coves and beaches, at a distance of 9 km from the main ferry port in Supetar.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please for more information contact our office in Split.</p>', '', '1122_Apartment_0.jpg', '1122_Apartment_1.jpg', '1122_Apartment_2.jpg', '1122_Apartment_3.jpg', '1122_Apartment_4.jpg', '1122_Apartment_5.jpg', '1122_Apartment_6.jpg', '1122_Apartment_7.jpg', '1122_Apartment_8.jpg'),
(1123, 'Nikola', 'Orhanoviæ', '098/795-978 (Luka &#8211; kljuèevi)', '', 'luka.orhanovic@gmail.com', 'Peljesac', 'Podobuèe 9, 20250 Orebiæ', 'For sale', 'Old stone house', '60', '205', '200', 1, '200000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 0, 0, 'April 8, 2015', '<p>Stara kamena kuæa na Pelje&scaron;cu, s prekrasnim pogledom na more, okru¾ena zelenilom.&nbsp;Udaljena je 60 m od mora.&nbsp;Smje&scaron;tena je u mirnoj uvali na ju¾noj strani poluotoka.&nbsp;Kuæa zajedno sa jo&scaron; dvije zgrade èini cjelinu povr&scaron;ine 200 m2, koja se prodaje za &euro;200.000, ali je moguæe i kupiti samo jednu kuæu, èija bi cijena tada iznosila &euro;150.000.&nbsp;Sastoji se od prizemlja i tri kata.</p>', '<p>We are offering this old stone house as a refurbishment project, requiring a complete interior redecoration. It is situated just 60m from the sea, in a quiet bay on the south side of the Peljesac peninsula. The house, together with two other small buildings, forms one property of 200 m2, which is sold for &euro; 200,000, but it is possible to buy just the main house, and the price would be reduced to &euro; 150,000. It consists of a ground floor and three floors above.</p>', '', '<p>Stara kamena kuæa na Pelje&scaron;cu, s prekrasnim pogledom na more, okru¾ena zelenilom.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Udaljena je 60 m od mora.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Smje&scaron;tena je u mirnoj uvali na ju¾noj strani poluotoka.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa zajedno sa jo&scaron; dvije zgrade èini cjelinu koja se prodaje za &euro;200.000, ali je moguæe i kupiti samo jednu kuæu, èija bi cijena tada iznosila &euro;150.000.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sastoji se od prizemlja i tri kata.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Zahtijeva kompletno ureðenje interijera.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ima ukupnu stambenu povr&scaron;inu 200 m2, a nalazi se na zemlji&scaron;tu povr&scaron;ine 205 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Orijentirana je ju¾no.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ima pristup vozilom i prukljuèke na vodu, struju i telefon.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ovo &scaron;armantno mjesto nalazi se 11 km od Orebiæa.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Mjesto je turistièki popularno, te poznato po vinogradarstvu i maslinarstvu.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nedaleko su Dubrovnik i Korèula te NP Mljet.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Meðunarodni aerodrom u Dubrovniku udaljen je 1.5 h vo¾nje.</p>', '<p>We are offering this old stone house as a refurbishment project, requiring a complete interior redecoration.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is situated just 60m from the sea, in a quiet bay on the south side of the Peljesac peninsula.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house, together with two other small buildings, forms one property, which is sold for &euro; 200,000, but it is possible to buy just the main house, and the price would be reduced to &euro; 150,000.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It consists of a ground floor and three floors above.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It has a total living area of 200 m2 and is located on a land area of 205 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is oriented south.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It has car access and all connections for water, electricity and telephone.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>This charming and historic village is located 11 km from Orebic, which is a popular tourist destination and is known for its vineyards and olive trees.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is a short drive to The ferry for trips to Korcula and the Mljet National Park.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The closest international airport is Dubrovnik - only 1.5 hours drive away.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact our offices for moreover information and to arrange a visit to the property.</p>', '', '1123_Old-stone-house_0.JPG', '1123_Old-stone-house_1.JPG', '1123_Old-stone-house_2.JPG', '1123_Old-stone-house_3.JPG', '1123_Old-stone-house_4.JPG', '1123_Old-stone-house_5.JPG', '1123_Old-stone-house_6.JPG', '1123_Old-stone-house_7.JPG', '1123_Old-stone-house_8.JPG'),
(1124, '®eljan', 'Raiæ', '098/166-2044', '', 'Zelja.manus@gmail.com', 'Split', 'Æuliæa Dvori 19, 5881/4 - 3028', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '300', '0', '76', 1, '200000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 3, 1, 'April 8, 2015', '<p>Atraktivan apartman povr&scaron;ine 76 m2, u visokom potkrovlju zgrade, u centru Splita, tek 300 m udaljene od mora i Rive.&nbsp;Smje&scaron;ten u blizini svih potrebnih sadr¾aja (restorana, barova, prodavaonica), ali s osiguranom privatno&scaron;æu.&nbsp;Ispred zgrade nalazi se vrt u kojem je ro&scaron;tilj, idealan za opu&scaron;tanje u ljetnim danima. Do glavnog ulaza u zgardu nalazi se ostava koja pripada samo vlasniku ovoga apartmana.&nbsp;Iz apartmana se pru¾a predivan pogled na centar i katedralu.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>We have this apartment of 76 m2, on the second floor of this attractive building in the center of Split, only 300 m away from the sea and the Riva promenade. It is located close to all necessary facilities (restaurants, bars, shops), but with secured privacy, and set back from the road, with a garden at the front of the property. The apartment offers wonderful views of the city and the cathedral.</p>', '', '<p>Atraktivan apartman u visokom potkrovlju zgrade u centru Splita, tek 300 m udaljene od mora i Rive.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Smje&scaron;ten u blizini svih potrebnih sadr¾aja (restorana, barova, prodavaonica), ali s osiguranom privatno&scaron;æu.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ispred zgrade nalazi se vrt u kojem je ro&scaron;tilj, idealan za opu&scaron;tanje u ljetnim danima.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Do glavnog ulaza u zgardu nalazi se ostava koja pripada samo vlasniku ovoga apartmana.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartman na 3. katu (visoko potkrovlje) sastoji se od tri spavaæe sobe, jedne kupaone, dnevnog boravka, kuhinje s blagavaonom te ostave.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ukupna stambena povr&scaron;ina iznosi 76 m2, a povr&scaron;ina &nbsp;zajednièkog vrta iznosi 350 m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Iz apartmana se pru¾a predivan pogled na centar i katedralu.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartman je u potpunosti opremljen i novonamje&scaron;ten (renoviran 2011. godine).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Orijentiran je prema jugozapadu.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ima pristup vozilom i jedno parking mjesto.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za apartman je izdan energetski certifikat razred B, a moguæe je i tra¾iti licencu za iznajmljivanje, buduæi da se apartman nalazi na turistièki popularnom djelu grada Splita.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Centar grada udaljen je nekoliko minuta &scaron;etnje.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Meðunarodni aerodrom udaljen je 40 minuta.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za sve dodatne informacije molimo kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured u Splitu.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>We have this apartment on the second floor of this attractive building in the center of Split, only 300 m away from the sea and the Riva promenade.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is located close to all necessary facilities (restaurants, bars, shops), but with secured privacy, and set back from the road, with a garden at the front of the property.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The apartment is on the top floor and it consists of three bedrooms, one bathroom, living room, kitchen, dining room and utility room.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Total area is 76 m2, and common garden is 350 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The apartment offers wonderful views of the city and the cathedral.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The apartment is fully equipped and in good condition.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It was newly furnished (renovated in 2011).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>At the front of the building, on the ground floor, is a bbq and small storage room.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is oriented to the southwest.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It has car access and a parking place.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The apartment has ''energy certificate class B'' and the property can have a licence for rental, because the apartment is located on the popular tourist part of the town.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The city centre is just a few minutes walk.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The international airport is 40 minutes.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For further information please contact our office in Split.</p>', '', '1124_Apartment_0.JPG', '1124_Apartment_1.JPG', '1124_Apartment_2.JPG', '1124_Apartment_3.JPG', '1124_Apartment_4.JPG', '1124_Apartment_5.JPG', '1124_Apartment_6.JPG', '1124_Apartment_7.JPG', '1124_Apartment_8.JPG'),
(1128, 'Veselko Jukiæ  ', 'Toni Brkiæ', 'Veselko Jukiæ 098303376', 'Toni Brkiæ 0985677716', 'toni.brkic01@yahoo.com', 'Trogir', 'Seget Vranjica, Vinogradska 7, 3191 Z.U.  Kat. Èest. 431/9', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '100', '0', '0', 1, '78000', '', 2, 1, 2, 2, 1, 2, 0, 0, 'April 9, 2015', '<p>Samostojeæi objekt u novogradnji s prekrasnim pogledom na more u Seget Vranjicu, ukupne stambene povr&scaron;ine cca. 300 m2.&nbsp;Zgrada je udaljena samo 100 m od mora.&nbsp;U naravi se sastoji od prizemlja + 2 eta¾e.&nbsp;Apartmani imaju povr&scaron;inu od 39 &ndash; 80 m2.</p>\r\n<p><strong>CIJENA: &euro;78.000 - &euro;198.000</strong></p>', '<p>We have this newly built apartment house overlooking the sea in the Trogir area. It is situated just 100m from the sea, and a few minutes drive from the nearest selection of shops, coffee bars and local restaurants. It has been built in a quiet area, in a sought after location. The building consists of ground + 2 floors. The apartments have a floor area of 39-80 m2.</p>\r\n<p><strong>PRICE:&nbsp;<strong>&euro;78.000 - &euro;198.000</strong></strong></p>', '', '<p>Samostojeæi objekt u novogradnji s prekrasnim pogledom na more u Seget Vranjicu, ukupne stambene povr&scaron;ine cca. 300 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Zgrada je udaljena samo 100 m od mora.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U naravi se sastoji od prizemlja + 2 eta¾e.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kvaliteta gradnje je na iznimno visokom nivou (termo fasada, objekt je dijelom oblo¾en u kamen, kamene ograde, blindo vrata...).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartmani imaju povr&scaron;inu od 39 &ndash; 80 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U prizemlju je veliki trosoban stan sa velikom terasom i vlastitom gara¾om, na prvoj eta¾i su dva jednosobna stana, svaki po 40 m2 od kojih jedan ima veliku terasu od cca. 30 m2, na drugoj eta¾i nalaze se dva jednosobna stana od kojih jedan ima zatvorenu loðu a drugi otvoreni balkon.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Uz gara¾u tu je jo&scaron; i 5 vanjskih parkirnih mjesta, te dio zemlji&scaron;ta na kojem postoji moguænost izgradnje bazena.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Stan S1 - &euro;198.000 -</strong>&nbsp;visoko prizemlje, komforan trosoban stan 80m2 + 25m2 terasa + 20m2 gara¾a koja je izravno povezana sa stanom + cca. 60m2 vrta ispred terase.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Stan S2 - &euro;78.000 -&nbsp;</strong>39m2 + balkon iz sobe 3m2 + balkon iz dnevnog boravka 5m2 , 1.kat, parking.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Stan S3 - 93.000 -&nbsp;</strong>36m2 + terasa 26m2 + balkon 5m2 , 1.kat, parking.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Stan S4 - &euro;88.000 -</strong>&nbsp;40m2 + balkon iz sobe 3m2 + balkon iz dnevnog boravka 5m2 , 2. kat, parking.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Stan S5 &ndash; &euro;93.000 -&nbsp;</strong>38m2 + natkrivena loggia 5m2 , 2.kat, parking.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>NAPOMENA:</strong> Cijena se odnosi za sistem ''''kljuè u ruke'''' s tim da kupac ukoliko ¾eli ima moguænost odabira keramike po ¾elji!</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Tlocrte &scaron;aljemo na zahtjev.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Centar mjesta gdje se nalaze svi potrebni sadr¾aji (restorani, trgovine, kafiæi) udaljen je tek nekoliko minuta vo¾nje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Trogir je udaljen 10 minuta vo¾nje, a meðunarodni aerodrom 15 min.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Molimo za sve dodatne informacije kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured u Splitu.</p>', '<p>We have this newly built apartment house overlooking the sea in the Trogir area.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is situated just 100m from the sea, and a few minutes drive from the nearest selection of shops, coffee bars and local restaurants.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It has been built in a quiet area, in a sought after location.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The building consists of ground + 2 floors.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The quality of construction is at a very high level, with thermal facade, partially lined in stone, stone edging on the balconies, safety doors, grand marble stairs, and many other features.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The apartments have a floor area of 39-80 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the ground floor is a large three bedroom apartment with access to a large terrace and a private garage.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the first floor are two x one bedroom apartments, each 40m2, one of which has a large terrace of approx. 30 m2, on the second floor there are two x one bedroom apartments, one of which has a closed lodge and the other an outdoor balcony.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>In addition to the garage there is also 5 outdoor parking places, and spare land, intended as a garden but is enough space for boat storage or a patio with a swimming pool.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Apartment S1 - &euro; 198,000 -</strong>&nbsp;raised ground floor, comfortable three bedroom apartment of 80m2 + 25m2 terrace + 20m2 garage which is directly connected with the apartment + approx. 60m2 garden in front of the terrace.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Apartment S2 - &euro; 78,000 -</strong>&nbsp;39m2 + balcony of the room 3m2 + balcony from the living room 5m2, 1st floor, parking.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Apartment S3 - 93 000 -</strong>&nbsp;36m2 + terrace 26m2 + balcony 5m2, 1st floor, parking.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Apartment S4 - &euro; 88,000 -</strong>&nbsp;40m2 + balcony of the room 3m2 + balcony from the living room 5m2, second floor, parking.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Apartment S5 - &euro; 93,000 -</strong>&nbsp;38m2 + 5m2 covered balcony, 2nd floor, parking.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>NOTE:</strong> Price is for the system '''' turnkey '''' with the proviso that if the buyer wants a choice of ceramic options, it can be arranged.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>We have floor plans for each apartment can be sent on request.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Trogir is a 10 minute drive and the international airport 15 min.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please for further information contact our office in Split.<br /><br /><br /><br /></p>', '', '1128_Apartment_0.JPG', '1128_Apartment_1.jpg', '1128_Apartment_2.JPG', '1128_Apartment_3.JPG', '1128_Apartment_4.JPG', '1128_Apartment_5.jpg', '1128_Apartment_6.jpg', '1128_Apartment_7.jpg', '1128_Apartment_8.JPG'),
(1126, 'Vesna', '©ariæ', '098/9977955', '', '', 'Rogoznica', 'Ulica Nova Vig. 71 22203 Rogoznica, 1401 zgr KO Rogoznica', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '100', '290', '200', 2, '400000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 3, 2, 'April 8, 2015', '<p>Luksuzno ureðena kuæa u Rogoznici, s oèaravajuæim pogledom na more.&nbsp;Nalazi se u mirnoj lokaciji, blizu pla¾e, okru¾ena lijepo ureðenim vrtom, samo 100 m udaljena od mora.&nbsp;Kuæa se sastoji od prizemlja i jednog kata (200 m2) koji su povezani unutarnjim stepeni&scaron;tem, Udaljenost od restorana, trgovina i kafiæa je svega nekoliko minuta, a tijekom ljeta svi potrebni turistièki sadr¾aji mogu se pronaæi u mjestu.</p>', '<p>We have this luxury house in Rogoznica, with a stunning views of the sea. It is situated in a quiet location, 100m from the beach, surrounded by beautifully landscaped garden. The house consists of ground and first floor (200 m2) which are connected by an internal staircase. The distance to restaurants, shops and caf&eacute;s is only a few minutes walk, and during the summer all the necessary tourist facilities can be found in the traditional historic village.</p>', '', '<p>Luksuzno ureðena kuæa u Rogoznici, s oèaravajuæim pogledom na more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nalazi se u mirnoj lokaciji, blizu pla¾e, okru¾ena lijepo ureðenim vrtom, samo 100 m udaljena od mora.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa se sastoji od prizemlja i jednog kata koji su povezani unutarnjim stepeni&scaron;tem.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Smje&scaron;tena je na zemlji&scaron;tu povr&scaron;ine 290 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ima parking.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U prizemlju se nalaze jedna spavaæa soba, kupaona, dnevni boravak, kuhinja, blagavaona, hodnik, loða i pomoæni prostor ukupne stambene povr&scaron;ine cca 110 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na katu su dvije spavaæe sobe, kupaona, radna soba, hodnik i nenatkrivena terasa povr&scaron;ine 12 m2 s koje se pru¾a pogled prema Stupin Èelinama i Zatoglavu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ukupna stambena povr&scaron;ina kata iznosi cca 90 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je potpuno opremljena i namje&scaron;tena, renovirana prije 4 godine.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sjeveroistoèno je orijentirana.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Udaljenost od restorana, trgovina i kafiæa je svega nekoliko minuta, a tijekom ljeta svi potrebni turistièki sadr¾aji mogu se pronaæi u mjestu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&Scaron;ibenik je udaljen 25 km, a Split 55 km.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Meðunarodni aerodrom je udaljen 31 km.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za sve dodatne informacije molimo kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured u Splitu.</p>', '<p>We have this luxury house in Rogoznica, with a stunning views of the sea.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is situated in a quiet location, 100m from the beach, surrounded by beautifully landscaped garden.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house consists of ground and first floor which are connected by an internal staircase.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is situated on a land area of 290 m2, which includes private parking.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The ground floor has one bedroom, bathroom, living room, kitchen, dining room, hallway, and terrace with extra storage space with a total floor area of approximately 110 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the first floor are two bedrooms, bathroom, study room, hallway and uncovered terrace of 12 m2 with a beautiful view.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property has been well maintained and feels very spacious inside.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The decorating is of a good standard, needs no additional investment.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It was renovated 4 years ago.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Total residential floor area is approximately 90 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Northeast oriented.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The distance to restaurants, shops and caf&eacute;s is only a few minutes walk, and during the summer all the necessary tourist facilities can be found in the traditional historic village.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sibenik is 25 km, and Split 55 km.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>International airport is 31 km.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For further information please contact our office in Split.</p>', '', '1126_House-Villa_0.jpg', '1126_House-Villa_1.jpg', '1126_House-Villa_2.jpg', '1126_House-Villa_3.jpg', '1126_House-Villa_4.jpg', '1126_House-Villa_5.jpg', '1126_House-Villa_6.jpg', '1126_House-Villa_7.jpg', '1126_House-Villa_8.jpg'),
(1127, 'Zlatko', 'Ro¾iæ', '091 2537492', '', '', 'Rogoznica', 'Rogoznica, Sevid', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '5', '330', '40', 2, '130000', '', 2, 2, 2, 1, 1, 2, 1, 1, 'April 8, 2015', '<p>U prekrasnom mjestu na svega par metara od pla¾e nalazi se nedovr&scaron;ena kuæa s pogledom na more. Kuæa koja je trenutno u grubim radovima, smje&scaron;tena je na zemlji&scaron;tu povr&scaron;ine 330 m2. Moguæe je ishoditi dozvolu za daljnju nadogradnju. Na postojeæe prizemlje tlocrtne povr&scaron;ine od 40 m2 mogu se nadograditi jo&scaron; kat i potkrovlje. Zemlji&scaron;te je omeðeno kamenim zidom, a kuæu okru¾uje zelenilo.</p>', '<p>We have this unfinished building project in a great location at a hugely reduced price.&nbsp;It is situated just a few yards from the sea and shore on the mainland, North of Trogir.&nbsp;The builders have completed most of the heavy work are needing to sell the property in its current state and have allowed a heavy discount to accommodate this. The building of 40 m2 sits on a good sized plot of 330 m2, which allows for private parking, boat store or other useful improvements.&nbsp;</p>', '', '<p>U prekrasnom mjestu na svega par metara od pla¾e nalazi se nedovr&scaron;ena kuæa s pogledom na more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa koja je trenutno u grubim radovima, smje&scaron;tena je na zemlji&scaron;tu povr&scaron;ine 330 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Moguæe je ishoditi dozvolu za daljnju nadogradnju.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na postojeæe prizemlje tlocrtne povr&scaron;ine od 40 m2 mogu se nadograditi jo&scaron; kat i potkrovlje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Zemlji&scaron;te je omeðeno kamenim zidom, a kuæu okru¾uje zelenilo.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Od infrastrukture prisutni su struja, voda (cisterna) i septièka jama.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Do kuæe je osiguran pristup autom, a u sklopu parcele moguæe je napraviti parking mjesto.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa ima pristup pla¾i.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Orijentirana istoèno.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Udaljenost od kafiæa i trgovina je svega 150 metara.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Mjesto Marina je udaljeno 8 km, a meðunarodni aerodrom 19 km.</p>', '<p>We have this unfinished building project in a great location at a hugely reduced price.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is situated just a few yards from the sea and shore on the mainland, North of Trogir.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The builders have completed most of the heavy work are needing to sell the property in its current state and have allowed a heavy discount to accommodate this.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For more information on what still needs to be done and an estimate of the costs to a basic standard can be obtained from our office.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Also alterations to the architect''s design can be made, again, you need to speak to the staff in our office.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The building sits on a good sized plot of 330 m2, which allows for private parking, boat store or other useful improvements.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The existing ground floor layout has an area of 40 m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The land is bordered by a stone wall and is situated in an area of natural countryside.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The basic infrastructure is present - electricity, water (tank) and a septic tank.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house has direct access to the beach, and the sea here is exceptionally clear and clean.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The plot is oriented east.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Distance from the cafes, coffee bars, bakery and shops is only 150 meters.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Town Marina is 8 km away, and the international airport 19 km.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For further information please contact our office in Split.&nbsp;</p>', '', '1127_House-Villa_0.JPG', '1127_House-Villa_1.JPG', '1127_House-Villa_2.JPG', '1127_House-Villa_3.JPG', '1127_House-Villa_4.JPG', '1127_House-Villa_5.JPG', '1127_House-Villa_6.JPG', '1127_House-Villa_7.JPG', ''),
(1719, 'Helmut', 'Kohler', '(+49 711) 320 999 59', '(+49 711) 636 90 47', 'koehler@architekten-koehler.de', 'Trogir', 'Domovinske zahvalnosti 102 Arbanija, 969/1, 456 zgr', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '5', '495', '110', 1, '350000', '', 2, 2, 1, 1, 1, 2, 3, 3, 'June 17, 2016', '<p>Jako zanimljiva samostojeæa kuæa u 1.redu do mora na otoku Èiovu koji je povezan mostom sa gradom Trogirom, a ubrzo æe biti povezan jo&scaron; jednim mostom koji æe znatno utjecati na jo&scaron; veæu popularnost otoka.&nbsp;Smje&scaron;tena je na zemlji&scaron;tu povr&scaron;ine 495 m2, dok je stambena povr&scaron;ina 110 m2. Sastoji se od podruma, 1.kata i potkrovlja.&nbsp;Ispred kuæe se nalazi parking za 3 automobila, dok se odmah uz pla¾u nalazi gara¾a za brod.&nbsp;Vrt je jako lijepo ureðen i postoji moguænost izgradnje prostranog bazena.</p>', '<p>We are pleased to offer this rare opportunity to buy a substantial holiday property right on the shore of Ciovo island. It is on a land area of 495 m2, and the living area of 110 m2. It consists of basement, 1st floor and 2nd floor. In the basement there is a laundry room, 2 storage rooms, a toilet and two doors leading into the garden. This part can be improved and become extra residential space. This is an excellent property, in a great location, in good condition and at a price designed to ensure a fast sale for the current owners.&nbsp;</p>', '', '<p>Jako zanimljiva samostojeæa kuæa u 1.redu do mora na otoku Èiovu koji je povezan mostom sa gradom Trogirom, a ubrzo æe biti povezan jo&scaron; jednim mostom koji æe znatno utjecati na jo&scaron; veæu popularnost otoka.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Meðunarodni aerodrom je udaljen cca. 15 min. automobilom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Udaljena je svega 5 metara od mora i prekrasne &scaron;ljunèane pla¾e gdje se mo¾e privezati manji brod.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Smje&scaron;tena je na zemlji&scaron;tu povr&scaron;ine 495 m2, dok je stambena povr&scaron;ina 110 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sastoji se od podruma, 1.kata i potkrovlja.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U podrumu se nalazi praonica rublja, 2 spreme, wc i dva izlaza u vrt.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ovaj dio takoðer mo¾e biti stambeni.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U prizemlju je kuhinja, kupaonica koja ima odvojeni tu&scaron; od wc-a, spavaæa soba, dnevni dio sa blagovaonicom i izlazom u vrt.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Iz prizemlja se ide na galeriju.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na 1.katu su 2 spavaæe sobe i kupaonica.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je potpuno namje&scaron;tena i u dobrom stanju.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Zanimljivog je rasporeda i izgleda stoga vjerujemo da æe ubrzo pronaæi novog vlasnika.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ispred kuæe se nalazi parking za 3 automobila, dok se odmah uz pla¾u nalazi gara¾a za brod.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Vrt je jako lijepo ureðen i postoji moguænost izgradnje prostranog bazena.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U vrtu se takoðer nalazi kamin i tu&scaron;.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Povi&scaron;e gara¾e se nalazi velika terasa sa koje imate direktan pogled na more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ukoliko imate dodatnih pitanja za ovu jedinstvenu nekretninu slobodno nas kontaktirajte.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>We are pleased to offer this rare opportunity to buy a substantial holiday property right on the shore of Ciovo island.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is situated just a few yards from the clear and safe sea which is popular with tourists, and sits on the shore side of the road, unlike most 1st line properties in Croatia.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is 5 minutes by car to Trogir, but is set in a quiet location where you can walk into the natural woods and old olive groves around the island within a few minutes.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is on a land area of 495 m2, and the living area of 110 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It consists of basement, 1st floor and 2nd floor.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>In the basement there is a laundry room, 2 storage rooms, a toilet and two doors leading into the garden.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>This part can be improved and become extra residential space.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the ground floor is a kitchen, a bathroom with a separate shower and toilet, bedroom, living room, dining room and access to the garden.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>From the ground floor there are stairs up to the gallery.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the 1st floor are two bedrooms and a bathroom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house is fully furnished and in good condition, ready for immediate living or renting to tourists who, of course love the concept of a holiday on the shore.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house has parking for 3 cars, while next to the beach is a garage/storage for the boat, which can be moored in front of the property.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The garden is attractive and there is the possibility of improving it with a patio and by building a large swimming pool.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>In the garden there is also a fireplace/bbq and outdoor shower for use after swimming in the sea.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Above the garage is a large terrace with spectacular views across the sea and the mainland mountains.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>This is an excellent property, in a great location, in good condition and at a price designed to ensure a fast sale for the current owners.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>If you are looking for such a property, then contact us quickly to arrange a visit and make sure you do not miss this opportunity.</p>', '', '1719_House-Villa_0.jpg', '1719_House-Villa_1.jpg', '1719_House-Villa_2.jpg', '1719_House-Villa_3.jpg', '1719_House-Villa_4.jpg', '1719_House-Villa_5.jpg', '1719_House-Villa_6.jpg', '1719_House-Villa_7.jpg', '1719_House-Villa_8.jpg'),
(1129, 'Alen ', 'Dalmatis', '', '098/536-896', 'info@dalmatis.hr', 'Zadar', 'Pa¹man', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '20', '300', '120', 1, '350000', '', 2, 1, 2, 1, 1, 2, 3, 2, 'April 9, 2015', '<p>Prekrasna kuæa za odmor zajedno sa pomoænim objektom, smje&scaron;tena je u prvom redu do mora na jako lijepom i mirnom mjestu, na otoku Pa&scaron;manu.&nbsp;Kuæa je okru¾ena &scaron;umom te u¾iva neometan pogled na more sa prostrane terase i balkona.&nbsp;Sastoji se od prizemlja i potkrovlja, ukupne stambene povr&scaron;ine 120 m2. Otok Pa&scaron;man obiluje prelijepim pje&scaron;èanim pla¾ama te je turistièki populuran. Povezan je &nbsp;trajektnom linijom sa Zadrom i Biogradom na Moru.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>We have this beautifully located house, in the first row to the sea on the beautiful and quiet shore on the island of Pasman, and with no immediate neighbours. The house is surrounded by preserved woods and enjoys unobstructed sea views from the spacious terrace and balcony.&nbsp;It consists of ground floor and first floor, total living space of 120 m2. Pasman Island is well known for the beautiful sandy beaches and is popular with tourists because of this. It is connected by ferry with Zadar and Biograd na Moru.</p>', '', '<p>Prekrasna kuæa za odmor zajedno sa pomoænim objektom, smje&scaron;tena je u prvom redu do mora na jako lijepom i mirnom mjestu, na otoku Pa&scaron;manu.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je okru¾ena &scaron;umom te u¾iva neometan pogled na more sa prostrane terase i balkona.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sastoji se od prizemlja i potkrovlja.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U prizemlju su smje&scaron;tene kuhinja, blagovaonica, kupaonica i jedna spavaæa soba.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Iz dnevnog boravka izlazi se na prednju terasu, sa samo nekoliko stepenica spu&scaron;ta se u prednji dio vrta iz kojeg se odmah izlazi na pla¾u.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Iz blagovaonice se ide u stra¾nji vrt u kojem je smje&scaron;tena jedna mala vrtna kuæica, a ispred nje je prostor za stol, stolice i le¾aljke.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U potkrovlju su smje&scaron;tene jo&scaron; dvije spavaæe sobe, od kojih jedna ima balkon koji gleda na more, i kupaonica.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Moguæa je izgradnja bazena ili jacuzzija.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ukupna stambena povr&scaron;ina kuæe iznosi 120 m2, a povr&scaron;ina zemlji&scaron;ta 300 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Orijentirana je istoèno.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Otok Pa&scaron;man obiluje prelijepim pje&scaron;èanim pla¾ama te je turistièki populuran.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Povezan je &nbsp;trajektnom linijom sa Zadrom i Biogradom na Moru.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Meðunarodni aerodrom u Zadru udaljen je 25 km.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za sve dodatne informacije molimo kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured u Split.</p>', '<p>We have this beautifully located house, in the first row to the sea on the beautiful and quiet shore on the island of Pasman, and with no immediate neighbours.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house is surrounded by preserved woods and enjoys unobstructed sea views from the spacious terrace and balcony.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It consists of ground floor and first floor.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The ground floor has a kitchen, dining room, bathroom and one bedroom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There is access from the living room through patio windows out to the front terrace, with just a few steps down to the front part of the garden from which they immediately go to the beach.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>From the dining room you go into the back garden in which is located a small garden house and in front of it is a space for table, chairs and sun loungers.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The loft consists of two bedrooms, one with a balcony that overlooks the sea, and bathroom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There is enough space to improve the property with a boat store or even a swimming pool or Jacuzzi.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Total living area is 120 m2, and land area of &#8203;&#8203;300 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is oriented east.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Pasman Island is well known for the beautiful sandy beaches and is popular with tourists because of this.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is connected by ferry with Zadar and Biograd na Moru.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The international airport of Zadar is 25 km.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For further information please contact our office in Split.&nbsp;</p>', '', '1129_House-Villa_0.jpg', '1129_House-Villa_1.jpg', '1129_House-Villa_2.jpg', '1129_House-Villa_3.jpg', '1129_House-Villa_4.jpg', '1129_House-Villa_5.jpg', '1129_House-Villa_6.jpg', '1129_House-Villa_7.jpg', '1129_House-Villa_8.jpg'),
(1130, 'Hrvoje ', 'Smoljanoviæ', '021/510-918', '099/735-37-27', 'Hrvoje.smoljanovic@gradst.hr', 'Split', 'Sv. Æirila i Metoda 38', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '250', '0', '41', 2, '140000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 1, 'April 13, 2015', '<p>Prekrasan apartman u Splitu, novonamje&scaron;ten, u blizini svih potrebnih sadr¾aja, samo 250 m udaljen od mora.&nbsp;Smje&scaron;ten tek 2 minute &scaron;etnje do centra grada.&nbsp;Zgrada se sastoji od 5 katova, a apartman se nalazi na drugom katu.&nbsp;Stambena povr&scaron;ina iznosi 41 m2.&nbsp;Vlasniku pripada i prostorija u podrumu povezana s parkingom (14,2 m2).</p>', '<p>We are offering this modernised apartment in Split, newly furnished, in a great location close to the centre, and only 250 m away from the sea. It is located just 2 minutes walk from the city centre where almost all the historic, cultural and tourist attractions are found, as well as the main transport links. The building consists of five floors and the apartment is on the second floor. The living area is 41 m2.&nbsp;The owner is entitled to the garage in the basement associated with parking (14.2 m2).</p>', '', '<p>Prekrasan apartman u Splitu, novonamje&scaron;ten, u blizini svih potrebnih sadr¾aja, samo 250 m udaljen od mora.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Smje&scaron;ten tek 2 minute &scaron;etnje do centra grada.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Zgrada se sastoji od 5 katova, a apartman se nalazi na drugom katu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Vlasniku pripada i prostorija u podrumu povezana s parkingom (14,2 m2).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Zgrada je izgraðena 2007. godine.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartman se sastoji od jedne spavaæe sobe, jedne kupaone, kuhinje s blagavonom, dnevnog boravka i balkona.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Stambena povr&scaron;ina iznosi 41 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartman ima vlastito parking mjesto koje se prodaje po cijeni od &euro;25.000.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Istoèno je orijentiran.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>®elite li ulo¾iti u nekretninu koja je spremna za useljenje, ovo je idealna prilika za vas.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U blizini se nalaze mnogobrojne trgovine, kafiæi, restorani i povijesni dio grada sa mnogim ostalim sadr¾ajima.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Meðunarodni aerodrom udaljen je 40 minuta vo¾nje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za sve dodatne informacije slobodno nas kontaktirajte.</p>', '<p>We are offering this modernised apartment in Split, newly furnished, in a great location close to the centre, and only 250 m away from the sea.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is located just 2 minutes walk from the city centre where almost all the historic, cultural and tourist attractions are found, as well as the main transport links.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The building consists of five floors and the apartment is on the second floor.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The owner is entitled to the garage in the basement associated with parking (14.2 m2).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The building was built in 2007.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The apartment has one bedroom, one bathroom, kitchen with dinning room, living room and balcony.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is nicely furnished with wooden floors, and with a practical layout, and is ready for immediate habitation.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The living area is 41 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The apartment has its own parking place at price &euro;25.000.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The apartment on an East orientation.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The international airport is 40 minutes driving.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For further information please contact our office in Split.</p>', '', '1130_Apartment_0.jpg', '1130_Apartment_1.jpg', '1130_Apartment_2.jpg', '1130_Apartment_3.jpg', '1130_Apartment_4.jpg', '1130_Apartment_5.jpg', '1130_Apartment_6.jpg', '1130_Apartment_7.jpg', '1130_Apartment_8.jpg');
INSERT INTO `nekretnina` (`id`, `ime`, `prezime`, `telefon`, `mobitel`, `e_mail`, `lokacija_id`, `adresa`, `status_id`, `vrsta_id`, `udaljenost`, `povrsina`, `stambenapovrsina`, `display`, `cijena`, `cijenatocka`, `ponuda_tjedna`, `new_built`, `must_sell`, `prvi_red_do_mora`, `pogled_na_more`, `bazen`, `broj_soba`, `broj_kupatila`, `datum`, `title_hr`, `title_en`, `title_ge`, `opis_hr`, `opis_en`, `opis_ge`, `PropertyImageURL0`, `PropertyImageURL1`, `PropertyImageURL2`, `PropertyImageURL3`, `PropertyImageURL4`, `PropertyImageURL5`, `PropertyImageURL6`, `PropertyImageURL7`, `PropertyImageURL8`) VALUES
(1132, 'Ivo', 'Mio¹iæ', '098 1953854', '', '', 'Peljesac', 'Kapetanska Palaèa - Mimbeli u Orebiæu, Pelje¹ac - Orebiæ', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '30', '1900', '550', 2, '1800000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 15, 5, 'April 16, 2015', '<p>Povijesna zgrada stambene povr&scaron;ine 550m2, samo 30 m od mora, na lijepom mjestu na Pelje&scaron;cu.&nbsp;Sastoji se od prizemlja i tri kata.&nbsp;Uz glavnu zgradu imanju pripadaju i pomoæne zgrade povr&scaron;ine 300 m2.&nbsp;Ima 15 soba, svaka povr&scaron;ine 20 m2, 4 salona, svaki po 42 m2, jednu veliku komfortnu kupaonicu i wc, te tri manje kupaone i wc.&nbsp;Palaèa je okru¾ena sa vrtovima i ðardinom ukupne povr&scaron;ine 1900 m2.</p>', '<p>We are the agents for this major historical building on the peninsula of Peljesac. It is just 30m from the shore, in a beautiful location, and sits on a plot of 1900 m sq. The building was built in the 18th century, and seclusion is ensured by a ''walled'' garden around the property. The building covers 550m2, and it consists of a ground floor and three floors. In addition to the main building, there is an auxiliary building of 300 m2.</p>', '', '<p>Povijesna zgrada stambene povr&scaron;ine 550m2, samo 30 m od mora, na lijepom mjestu na Pelje&scaron;cu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sastoji se od prizemlja i tri kata.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Uz glavnu zgradu imanju pripadaju i pomoæne zgrade povr&scaron;ine 300 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ima 15 soba, svaka povr&scaron;ine 20 m2, 4 salona, svaki po 42 m2, jednu veliku komfortnu kupaonicu i wc, te tri manje kupaone i wc.<br /><br /></p>\r\n<p>Palaèa je okru¾ena sa vrtovima i ðardinom ukupne povr&scaron;ine 1900 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Palaèa je izgraðena u 18. stoljeæu, a u 19. stoljeæu unutra&scaron;nje zidove oslikali su talijanski majstori.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Interijer je bogato opremljen antiknim namje&scaron;tajem, kojeg su kapetani brodovlasnièke obitelji Mimbeli generacijama donosili sa svjetskih putovanja.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa se prodaje sa namje&scaron;tajem.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kontinuirano je odr¾avana.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Prilaz kuæi s juga moguæ je s glavne &scaron;etnice uz more, a sjeverno sa glavne ceste prilazi se gara¾i i pripadajuæem parkingu sa 10 parkirnih mjesta.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Èitavo imanje ograðeno je starim zidovima, koji su vlasnicima osiguravali privatnost i mir.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je orijentirana ju¾no.</p>', '<p>We are the agents for this major historical building on the peninsula of Peljesac.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is just 30m from the shore, in a beautiful location, and sits on a plot of 1900 m sq.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The building was built in the 18th century, and seclusion is ensured by a ''walled'' garden around the property.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It has been continually maintained since it was built and is in excellent condition.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The building covers 550m2, and it consists of a ground floor and three floors.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>In addition to the main building, there is an auxiliary building of 300 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There are 15 rooms, each with an area of 20 m2, 4 lounges, each with 42 m2, a large comfortable bathroom and toilet, and three smaller bathroom and toilets.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The palace was built in the 18th century, and in the 19th century the interior walls were painted with spectacular frescos by Italian masters.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The interior is richly furnished with antique furniture, which the captains of the ship-owning family ''Mimbeli'' brought back with them from their world travel.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house is sold with furniture.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Access to the house is from the south is possible, which is from the main promenade by the sea, and north from the main road approaching the garage with allocated parking for 10 parking spaces.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The entire property is surrounded by old walls, which are the owners ensured privacy and peace.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house is oriented south, with stunning views out to sea.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact our office to arrange a viewing of this and similar properties.</p>', '', '1132_House-Villa_0.jpg', '1132_House-Villa_1.jpg', '1132_House-Villa_2.jpg', '1132_House-Villa_3.jpg', '1132_House-Villa_4.jpg', '1132_House-Villa_5.jpg', '1132_House-Villa_6.jpg', '1132_House-Villa_7.jpg', '1132_House-Villa_8.jpg'),
(1133, '', 'Dalmatian Home', '', '', '', 'Sibenik', 'Brodarica', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '100', '0', '0', 2, '95000', '', 2, 1, 2, 2, 1, 2, 2, 1, 'April 17, 2015', '<p>Moderni apartmani u izgradnji s predivnim pogledom na more.&nbsp;Smje&scaron;teni na 100 metara udaljenosti od mora pridonose osjeæaju potpunog mira i opu&scaron;tenosti, a svi potrebni sadr¾aji su u neposrednoj blizini. U zgradi se nalazi ukupno 9 apartmana, a svaki od njih ima terasu ju¾ne orijentacije. Apartmani imaju povr&scaron;inu od 64,46 m2 - 70,18 m2.</p>\r\n<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;">Cijena: &euro;95.000 - &euro;108.000</span></p>', '<p>New, modern apartments (in construction) with a sea view.&nbsp;Apartments are located just 100 meters from the sea.&nbsp;There are total nine apartments situated into the building.&nbsp;All apartments have their south oriented terraces with a nice sea view. Apartments have living space from 64,46 m2 - 70,18 m2.</p>\r\n<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;">Price: &euro;95.000 - &euro;108.000</span></p>', '', '<p>Moderni apartmani u izgradnji s predivnim pogledom na more.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Smje&scaron;teni na 100 metara udaljenosti od mora pridonose osjeæaju potpunog mira i opu&scaron;tenosti, a svi potrebni sadr¾aji su u neposrednoj blizini.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U zgradi se nalazi ukupno 9 apartmana, a svaki od njih ima terasu ju¾ne orijentacije.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Postoji moguænost kupnje ostave koja se nalazi u podrumu, a nadoplaæuje se po cijeni od 1200 EUR/m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Parkirno mjesto je naravno ukljuèeno u prodajnu cijenu apartmana.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Prema projektu objekt je klasificiran u klasu A - prema energetskom certifikatu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Slobodni apartmani su:</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>A2, DVOSOBAN APARTMAN, PRIZEMLJE, 95.000 EUR, 64,46 m2</strong></p>\r\n<p>Sastoji se od hodnika (6,29 m2), dvije spavaæe sobe (svaka cca 11 m2), kupaone (4,54 m2), kuhinje i dnevnog boravka s blagavaonom (24,80 m2) i terase (15,02 m2x koef 0,5 =7,51 m2).</p>\r\n<p>Apartman ima pripadajuæu okuænicu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>A4, DVOSOBAN APARTMAN, 1.KAT, 100.000,00 EUR, 64,28m2 - <span style="color: #ff0000;">PRODANO!</span></strong></p>\r\n<p>Sastoji se od hodnika (6,29 m2), dvije spavaæe sobe (svaka cca 11 m2), kupaone (4,54 m2), kuhinje i dnevnog boravka s blagavaonom (24,80 m2) i terase (15,02 m2x koef 0,5 =7,51 m2).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>B2, KOMFORAN DVOSOBNI APARTMAN, 1.KAT, 108.000,00 EUR, 70,18m2 - <span style="color: #ff0000;">PRODANO!</span></strong></p>\r\n<p>Sastoji se od hodnika (5.47 m2), dvije spavaæe sobe (svaka 11,20 m2), kupaone (5.96 m2), WC-a (2,07 m2), kuhinje i dnevnog boravka s blagavaonom (24,03 m2) i terase (16,6 m2 x koef 0,5 = 8,30 m2).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Predviðen rok zavr&scaron;etka gradnje, te termin za useljenje je listopad 2015.godine.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nalaze se u turistièki atraktivnom malom mjestu Brodarica koja se prote¾e du¾ Jadranske magistrale, samo 3 km ju¾no od grada &Scaron;ibenika.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>New, modern apartments (in construction) with a sea view.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartments are located just 100 meters from the sea.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>All necessary facilities are nearby.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There are total nine apartments situated into the building.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Each apartment has its own parking lot and price includes completely finished apartment, on turnkey basis.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>All apartments have their south oriented terraces with a nice sea view.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There is possibility to buy a storage place in the basement (1200 EUR/m2).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Projected date for completion is October/2015.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>According to the new EU regulatives, apartments will be classified as A-class (regarding energetic classification).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Available apartments:</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>A2, TWO-BEDROOM APARTMENT, GROUND FLOOR, 95.000 EUR, 64,46 m2</strong></p>\r\n<p>Apartment consists of hall (6,29 m2), two bedrooms (cca 11,00 m2), bathroom (4,54 m2), kitchen, living room and dinning room (24,80 m2), terrace (15,02 m2 x 0.5 = 7,51m2).</p>\r\n<p>Apartment has its own courtyard.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>A4, TWO-BEDROOM APARTMENT, 1ST FLOOR, 100.000,00 EUR, 42,31 m2 - <span style="color: #ff0000;">SOLD!</span></strong></p>\r\n<p>Apartment consists of hall (6,29 m2), two bedrooms (cca 11,00 m2), bathroom (4,54 m2), kitchen, living room and dinning room (24,80 m2), terrace (15,02 m2 x 0.5 = 7,51m2).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>B2, TWO-BEDROOM APARTMENT, 1ST FLOOR, 108.000,00 EUR, 70,18 m2 - <span style="color: #ff0000;">SOLD!</span></strong></p>\r\n<p>Apartment consists of hall (5,47 m2), two bedrooms (cca 11,00 m2), bathroom (5,96 m2), WC (2,07 m2), kitchen, living room and dinning room (26,03 m2), terrace (16,6 m2 x 0.5 = 8,30m2).<br /><br /></p>\r\n<p>Projected date for completion is October/2015.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartments are located in an attractive small town Brodarica that spreads along the main road (Adriatic highway), 3 km south of Sibenik.</p>', '', '1133_Apartment_0.jpg', '1133_Apartment_1.jpg', '1133_Apartment_2.jpg', '1133_Apartment_3.jpg', '1133_Apartment_4.jpg', '1133_Apartment_5.jpg', '1133_Apartment_6.jpg', '1133_Apartment_7.jpg', '1133_Apartment_8.jpg'),
(1134, '', 'Dalmatian home', '', '', '', 'Sibenik', 'Brodarica', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '80', '0', '0', 1, '70000', '', 2, 1, 2, 2, 1, 2, 0, 0, 'April 17, 2015', '<p>Apartmani u novogradnji, smje&scaron;teni u Brodarici na atraktivnoj lokaciji, svega 80 m udaljeni od mora.&nbsp;U neposrednoj blizini se nalaze svi potrebni sadr¾aji za ugodan ¾ivot, dok se &Scaron;ibenik nalazi samo 3 km sjeverozapadno.&nbsp;Svaki apartman ima terasu ju¾ne orijentacije, te takoðer svakom apartmanu pripada ostava u podrumu kao i parkirno mjesto. Apartmani imaju povr&scaron;inu od&nbsp;44,30 m2 - 93,93 m2.</p>\r\n<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;">Cijena: &euro;70.000 - &euro;147.000</span><br /><br /></p>', '<p>Apartments in a new building, located in Brodarica on attractive location, only 80m away from the sea.&nbsp;All necessary facilities for a comfortable life are in the immediate vicinity, while Sibenik as a regional center is located just 3 km to the north-west.&nbsp;Each apartment has a comfortable terrace facing south, storage space in the basement and a belonging parking lot. Apartments have living space from 44,30 m2 - 93,93 m2.</p>\r\n<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;">Price: &euro;70.000 - &euro;147.000</span></p>', '', '<p>Apartmani u novogradnji, smje&scaron;teni u Brodarici na atraktivnoj lokaciji, svega 80 m udaljeni od mora.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U neposrednoj blizini se nalaze svi potrebni sadr¾aji za ugodan ¾ivot, dok se &Scaron;ibenik nalazi samo 3 km sjeverozapadno.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Svaki apartman ima terasu ju¾ne orijentacije, te takoðer svakom apartmanu pripada ostava u podrumu kao i parkirno mjesto.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Prednosti ove nekretnine su kvalitetna izvedba gradnje, pouzdan investitor, moguænost izbora detalja oko ureðenja interijera, dobra lokacija (ispod jadranske magistrale), te neposredna blizina mora i pla¾e.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Cijena parkirnog mjesta je 1800 EUR.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Raspolo¾ivi apartmani na istoku su :</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>PP 1 &ndash; prizemlje &ndash; povr&scaron;ina 44,30 m2</strong></p>\r\n<p>Sastoji se od kuhinje, dnevnog boravka i blagovaonice u cjelini, spavaæe sobe, kupaonice i terase od 9,33 m2.</p>\r\n<p>Cijena : 70.000 EUR</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>PP 2 &ndash; prizemlje &ndash; povr&scaron;ina 50,49 m2</strong></p>\r\n<p><strong> </strong>Sastoji se od kuhinje, dnevnog boravka i blagovaonice u cjelini, spavaæe sobe, kupaonice i terase od 13,85 m2.</p>\r\n<p>Cijena : 80.000 EUR</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>PP 3 &ndash; prizemlje &ndash; povr&scaron;ina 52,51 m2</strong></p>\r\n<p><strong>&nbsp;</strong>Sastoji se od kuhinje, dnevnog boravka i blagovaonice u cjelini, spavaæe sobe, kupaonice i terase od 16,03 m2.</p>\r\n<p>Cijena : 84.000 EUR</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>SJ 1&ndash; prvi kat &ndash; povr&scaron;ina 56,25 m2</strong></p>\r\n<p><strong>&nbsp;</strong>Sastoji se od kuhinje, dnevnog boravka i blagovaonice u cjelini, 2 spavaæe sobe, kupaonice i terase od 8,00 m2.</p>\r\n<p>Cijena : 95.000 EUR</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>SJ 2 &ndash; prvi kat &ndash; povr&scaron;ina 69,36 m2</strong></p>\r\n<p><strong>&nbsp;</strong>Sastoji se od kuhinje, dnevnog boravka i blagovaonice u cjelini, 2 spavaæe sobe, kupaonice i loðe od 10,11 m2.</p>\r\n<p>Cijena : 118.000 EUR</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>SJ 3&ndash; drugi kat &ndash; povr&scaron;ina 67,39 m2</strong></p>\r\n<p><strong>&nbsp;</strong>Sastoji se od kuhinje, dnevnog boravka i blagovaonice u cjelini, 2 spavaæe sobe, kupaonice i terase od 6,86 m2.</p>\r\n<p>Cijena : 109.000 EUR</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>SJ 4&ndash; drugi kat &ndash; povr&scaron;ina 104,59 m2</strong></p>\r\n<p>Sastoji se od kuhinje, dnevnog boravka i blagovaonice u cjelini, 2 spavaæe sobe, galerije, kupaonice i terase od 10,08 m2.</p>\r\n<p>Cijena : 154.000 EUR</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Raspolo¾ivi apartmani na zapadu su :</p>\r\n<p><br /><br /><strong>PP 1 &ndash; prizemlje &ndash; povr&scaron;ina 56,90 m2</strong></p>\r\n<p>Sastoji se od kuhinje, dnevnog boravka i blagovaonice u cjelini, spavaæe sobe, kupaonice i terase od 13,54 m2</p>\r\n<p>Cijena : 90.000 EUR</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>PP 2 &ndash; prizemlje &ndash; povr&scaron;ina 45,53 m2</strong></p>\r\n<p><strong>&nbsp;</strong>Sastoji se od kuhinje, dnevnog boravka i blagovaonice u cjelini, spavaæe sobe, kupaonice i terase od 13,72 m2.</p>\r\n<p>Cijena : 72.000 EUR</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>PP 3 &ndash; prizemlje &ndash; povr&scaron;ina &ndash; 39,70 m2 </strong></p>\r\n<p><strong>&nbsp;</strong>Sastoji se od kuhinje, dnevnog boravka i blagovaonice u cjelini, spavaæe sobe i kupaonice.</p>\r\n<p>Cijena : 62.000 EUR</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>SJ 1 &ndash; prvi kat &ndash; povr&scaron;ina 58,03 m2</strong></p>\r\n<p><strong>&nbsp;</strong>Sastoji se od kuhinje, dnevnog boravka i blagovaonice u cjelini, 2 spavaæe sobe, kupaonice i terase od 8,28 m2.</p>\r\n<p>Cijena : 97.000 EUR</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>SJ 2 &ndash; prvi kat &ndash; povr&scaron;ina 71,15 m2</strong></p>\r\n<p>Sastoji se od kuhinje, dnevnog boravka i blagovaonice u cjelini, 2 spavaæe sobe, kupaonice i loðe od 11,57 m2.</p>\r\n<p>Cijena : 120.000 EUR</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>SJ 3 &ndash; drugi kat &ndash; povr&scaron;ina 58,15 m2</strong></p>\r\n<p><strong>&nbsp;</strong>Sastoji se od kuhinje, dnevnog boravka i blagovaonice u cjelini, 2 spavaæe sobe, kupaonice i terase od 8,48 m2.</p>\r\n<p>Cijena : 103.000 EUR</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>SJ 4 &ndash; drugi kat &ndash; povr&scaron;ina 93,93 m2</strong></p>\r\n<p><strong>&nbsp;</strong>Sastoji se od kuhinje, dnevnog boravka i blagovaonice u cjelini, 2 spavaæe sobe, galerije, kupaonice, loðe od 11,77 m2 i terase od 5,17 m2.</p>\r\n<p>Cijena : 147.000 EUR</p>', '<p>Apartments in a new building, located in Brodarica on attractive location, only 80m away from the sea.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>All necessary facilities for a comfortable life are in the immediate vicinity, while Sibenik as a regional center is located just 3 km to the north-west.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Each apartment has a comfortable terrace facing south, storage space in the basement and a belonging parking lot.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The advantages of this property are high quality of construction, reliable investor, possibility to choose interior details and design, good location (below the Adriatic highway), and proximity to the beach.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The price for parking place is 1800 EUR.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Available apartments in the east are:</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>PP 1 &ndash; ground floor &ndash; area 44.30 m2</strong></p>\r\n<p>It consists of a kitchen, living and dinning room as a whole, bedroom, bathroom and terrace of 9.33 m2.</p>\r\n<p>Price : 70.000 EUR</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>PP 2 &ndash; ground floor &ndash; area 50.49 m2</strong></p>\r\n<p>It consists of a kitchen, living and dinning room as a whole, bedroom, bathroom and terrace of 13.85 m2.</p>\r\n<p>Price : 80.000 EUR</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>PP 3 &ndash; ground floor &ndash; area 52.51 m2</strong></p>\r\n<p>It consists of a kitchen, living and dinning room as a whole, bedroom, bathroom and terrace of 16.03 m2.</p>\r\n<p>Price : 84.000 EUR</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>SJ 1 &ndash; first floor &ndash; area of 56.25 m2</strong></p>\r\n<p>It consists of a kitchen, living and dinning room as a whole, 2 bedrooms, bathroom and terrace of 8.00 m2.</p>\r\n<p>Price : 95.000 EUR</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>SJ 2 &ndash; first floor &ndash; area of 69.36 m2</strong></p>\r\n<p>It consists of a kitchen, living and dinning room as a whole, 2 bedrooms, bathroom and balcony of 10.11 m2.</p>\r\n<p>Price : 118.000 EUR</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>SJ 3 &ndash; second floor &ndash; 67.39 m2 surface. </strong></p>\r\n<p>It consists of a kitchen, living and dinning room as a whole, 2 bedrooms, bathroom and terrace of 6.86 m2.</p>\r\n<p>Price : 109.000 EUR</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>SJ 4 &ndash; second floor &ndash; area of 104.59 m2</strong></p>\r\n<p>It consists of a kitchen, living and dinning room as a whole, 2 bedrooms, gallery, bathroom and terrace of 10.08 m2.</p>\r\n<p>Price : 154.000 EUR</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Available apartments in the west are:</p>\r\n<p><br /><strong><br />PP 1 &ndash; ground floor &ndash; area 56.90 m2</strong></p>\r\n<p>It consists of a kitchen, living and dinning room as a whole, bedroom, bathroom and terrace of 13.54 m2.</p>\r\n<p>Price : 90.000 EUR</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>PP 2 &ndash; ground floor &ndash; area 45.53 m2</strong></p>\r\n<p>It consists of a kitchen, living and dinning room as a whole, bedroom, bathroom and terrace of 13.72 m2.</p>\r\n<p>Price : 72.000 EUR</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>PP 3 &ndash; ground floor &ndash; surface &ndash; 39,70 m2</strong></p>\r\n<p>It consists of a kitchen, living and dinning room as a whole, bedroom and bathroom.</p>\r\n<p>Price : 62.000 EUR</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>SJ 1 &ndash; first floor &ndash; area of 58.03 m2</strong></p>\r\n<p>It consists of a kitchen, living and dinning room as a whole, 2 bedrooms, bathroom and terrace of 8.28 m2.</p>\r\n<p>Price : 97.000 EUR</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>SJ 2 &ndash; first floor &ndash; area of 71.15 m2</strong></p>\r\n<p>It consists of a kitchen, living and dinning room as a whole, 2 bedrooms, bathroom and balcony of 11.57 m2.</p>\r\n<p>Price : 120.000 EUR</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>SJ 3 &ndash; second floor &ndash; 58.15 m2 surface</strong></p>\r\n<p>It consists of a kitchen, living and dinning room as a whole, 2 bedrooms, bathroom and terrace of 8.48 m2.</p>\r\n<p>Price : 103.000 EUR</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>SJ 4 &ndash; second floor &ndash; 93.93 m2 surface</strong></p>\r\n<p>It consists of a kitchen, living and dinning room as a whole, 2 bedrooms, gallery, bathroom, balcony of 11.77 m2 and a terrace of 5.17 m2.</p>\r\n<p>Price : 147.000 EUR</p>', '', '1134_Apartment_0.jpg', '1134_Apartment_1.jpg', '1134_Apartment_2.jpg', '1134_Apartment_3.jpg', '1134_Apartment_4.jpg', '1134_Apartment_5.jpg', '1134_Apartment_6.jpg', '1134_Apartment_7.jpg', '1134_Apartment_8.jpg'),
(1135, '', 'Dalmatian Home', '', '', '', 'Sibenik', 'Brodarica', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '200', '0', '0', 1, '115000', '', 2, 1, 2, 2, 1, 2, 0, 0, 'April 17, 2015', '<p>Apartmani modernog dizajna, s naglaskom na kvalitetne i trajne materijale, s predivnim pogledom na more.&nbsp;Do najbli¾e pla¾e ima cca 200 m.&nbsp;Gradnja apartmana zapoèeta je poèetkom 2015., a predviðeni rok zavr&scaron;etka radova je krajem 2015. godine. Povr&scaron;ina apartmana iznosi od 31 m2 - 71 m2.</p>', '<p>Each apartment has a spacious terrace or loggia and the apartments on the ground floor has the attached garden. There will be beautiful sea view from the apartments on the 1st and 2nd floor. Distance to the nearest beach is 200m.&nbsp;Construction started in February 2015. and building is scheduled for completion till the end of 2015. Apartments have living space from 31 m2 - 71 m2.</p>', '', '<p>Apartmani modernog dizajna, s naglaskom na kvalitetne i trajne materijale, s predivnim pogledom na more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Do najbli¾e pla¾e ima cca 200 m.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Gradnja apartmana zapoèeta je poèetkom 2015., a predviðeni rok zavr&scaron;etka radova je krajem 2015. godine.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartmani æe biti opremljeni sigurnosnim vratima, klimatizacijom s moguæno&scaron;æu grijanja, prikljuècima za TV/SAT, talijanskom keramikom 1. klase, sobnim parketima od hrastovine, PVC i aluminijskom stolarijom, dok æe kupaonice biti opremljene tu&scaron; kadama.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Moguæa je izrada kuhinje po mjeri kao i ugradbenih ormara u sobama.Naravno, svakom apartmanu pripada po jedno ili 2 parkirna mjesta, koja su ukljuèena u cijenu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Raspolo¾ivi apartmani su:</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>A1, prizemlje, 55.000,00 EUR, 31 m2, dodatnih 40 m2 terase, 1 parkirno mjesto - <span style="color: #ff0000;">PRODANO</span></strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>A2, prizemlje, 64.900,00 EUR, 41m2 stambene povr&scaron;ine, 25 m2 dvori&scaron;te, 2m2 ostava, 1 parkirno mjesto - <span style="color: #ff0000;">PRODANO</span></strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>A3, <span style="color: #ff0000;">PRODANO</span></strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>A4, <span style="color: #ff0000;">PRODANO</span></strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>A5, 1.kat, 115.000,00 EUR, 69,5 m2 stambene povr&scaron;ine + 12,8 m2 tarasa, 2 parkirna mjesta</strong></p>\r\n<p><strong><br /></strong></p>\r\n<p><strong>A6, 1.kat, 117.500,00 EUR, 71,2 m2 stambene povr&scaron;ine +10,34 m2 terasa, 2 parkirna mjesta</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>A7, <span style="color: #ff0000;">PRODANO</span></strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>A8, 2.kat, 122.000,00 EUR, 71,2 m2 stambena povr&scaron;ina + 10,34 m2 terasa, 2 parkirna mjesta - <span style="color: #ff0000;">PRODANO</span></strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Svi potrebni sadr¾aji kao &scaron;to su trgovaèki centri, pumpne stanice, marina, restorani, cafe barovi, beach barovi, &scaron;kola, bolnica, itd., nalaze se u krugu od 5 km, a najbli¾a zraèna luka koja je povezana sa svim va¾nijim Europskim destinacijama locirana je u Ka&scaron;telima (cca 55 km udaljen od &Scaron;ibenika, 35 min vo¾nje automobilom).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U blizini se nalazi hotelski kompleks Solaris sa svim dodatnim aktivnostima za razonodu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Unutar 20km nalaze se 2 nacionalna parka, NP Krka i NP Kornati, brojne turistièke destinacije, kao i prekrasan &Scaron;ibenski arhipelag.</p>', '<p>Each apartment has a spacious terrace or loggia and the apartments on the ground floor has the attached garden.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There will be beautiful sea view from the apartments on the 1st and 2nd floor.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Distance to the nearest beach is 200m.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Construction started in February 2015. and building is scheduled for completion till the end of 2015.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartment units will have security doors, air conditioning with heating, TV/SAT connections, high quality Italian tiles and ceramics, real wood floors (oak), bathroom with a shower cabins, PVC high grade windows, lots of light, sea-view from all the apartments, except for the ground floor.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Of course, each apartment has one or 2 parking lots next to the building of minimum 12 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Parking lot is included in the price.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Available apartments:</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>A1, ground floor, 31 m2 living area, 55.000,00 EUR, additional 40m2 terrace, 1 parking space - <span style="color: #ff0000;">SOLD</span><br /></strong></p>\r\n<p><strong><br /></strong></p>\r\n<p><strong>A 2, ground floor, 41m2 living area, 64.900,00 EUR, 25m2 courtyard, 2m2 pantry, 1 parking space - <span style="color: #ff0000;">SOLD</span></strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>A3, <span style="color: #ff0000;">SOLD</span><br /></strong></p>\r\n<p><strong><br /></strong></p>\r\n<p><strong>A4, <span style="color: #ff0000;">SOLD</span></strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>A5, 1st, 69,5m2 of living space +12,8 m2 terrace, 115.000,00 EUR, 2 parking spaces, 1<br /></strong></p>\r\n<p><strong><br /></strong></p>\r\n<p><strong>A6, 1st, 71,2m2 of living space + 10,34m2 terrace, 117.500,00 EUR, 2 parking spaces</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>A7, <span style="color: #ff0000;">SOLD</span><br /></strong></p>\r\n<p><strong><br /></strong></p>\r\n<p><strong>A8, 2nd floor, 71,2m2 residential area + 10,34m2 terrace, 122.000,00 EUR, 2 parking spaces - <span style="color: #ff0000;">SOLD</span></strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>All the shopping centers, gas stations, restaurants, beach bars, caffe bars, hotels, spa&rsquo;s, marina, hospital...everything within 5 km radius!</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The main Dalmatian Split airport is situated in Kastela, some 55 km away (35 min drive).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There are 2 national parks within 20km, NP Krka river and NP Kornati Islands, as well as numerous touristic destinations and beautiful Sibenik arhipelago.</p>', '', '1135_Apartment_0.jpg', '1135_Apartment_1.jpg', '1135_Apartment_2.jpg', '1135_Apartment_3.jpg', '1135_Apartment_4.jpg', '1135_Apartment_5.jpg', '1135_Apartment_6.jpg', '1135_Apartment_7.jpg', '1135_Apartment_8.jpg'),
(1136, 'Jo¹ko', '©kabar', '', '092 297 47 72', '', 'Hvar', 'Grad Hvar', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '300', '500', '230', 1, '460000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 5, 3, 'April 17, 2015', '<p>Kuæa s prekrasnim pogledom na more i otoke, svega nekoliko minuta od centra grada i svih potrebnih sadr¾aja.&nbsp;Smje&scaron;tena je na zapadnoj strani otoka Hvara, samo 300 m udaljena od mora i lijepih pla¾a. Kuæa se sastoji od prizemlja, prvog i drugog kata. Do kuæe se nalazi i jedan dodatan objekt koji slu¾i kao konoba.&nbsp;Kuæa s objektom je smje&scaron;tena na zemlji&scaron;tu povr&scaron;ine 500 m2.&nbsp;Ukupna stambena povr&scaron;ina kuæe iznosi 140 m2.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>We have this apartment house in Hvar town, spacious, with great views and walking distance to the main harbour, but also 300m to some superb beaches.It is overlooking the sea and islands, only minutes from the town centre where there are some fine restaurants, plenty of coffee shops, shops, bakery, and other required facilities for a great time. The house consists of ground, first and second floors. The residential space in the house, together with the extra cellar, is 140m sq. It is built on a plot of 500 m2.</p>', '', '<p>Kuæa s prekrasnim pogledom na more i otoke, svega nekoliko minuta od centra grada i svih potrebnih sadr¾aja.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Smje&scaron;tena je na zapadnoj strani otoka Hvara, samo 300 m udaljena od mora i lijepih pla¾a.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa se sastoji od prizemlja, prvog i drugog kata.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Do kuæe se nalazi i jedan dodatan objekt koji slu¾i kao konoba.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa s objektom je smje&scaron;tena na zemlji&scaron;tu povr&scaron;ine 500 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U prizemlju kuæe nalaze se dnevni boravak, kuhinja i kupaona.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na prvom katu su 3 sobe i kupaona.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ukupna stambena povr&scaron;ina kuæe iznosi 140 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartman se sastoji od velike prostorije sa kaminom, sobe /spreme, kuhinje i kupaone, ukupne povr&scaron;ine 60 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartmani imaju potpuno odvojen ulaz, te veliku terasu sa pripadajuæim vrtom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U odvojenom objektu nalaze se konoba povr&scaron;ine 25 m2 i radiona povr&scaron;ine 8 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Trenutno se u dvori&scaron;tu nalaze 3 parking mjesta, ali dvori&scaron;te je moguæe preurediti za jo&scaron; dodatna 4 mjesta.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Prema Prostornom planu Grada Hvara, koji je jo&scaron; na snazi, kuæu je moguæe pro&scaron;iriti i nadograditi.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Grad Hvar je povezan sa Splitom svakodnevnom trajektnom linijom, dok je trajektna luka udaljena samo nekoliko minuta od same kuæe.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>We have this apartment house in Hvar town, spacious, with great views and walking distance to the main harbour, but also 300m to some superb beaches.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is overlooking the sea and islands, only minutes from the town centre where there are some fine restaurants, plenty of coffee shops, shops, bakery, and other required facilities for a great time.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house consists of ground, first and second floors.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house is an auxiliary building which serves as a cellar.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The residential space in the house, together with the extra cellar, is 140m sq.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is built on a plot of 500 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the ground floor there is a living room, kitchen and bathroom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the first floor are three bedrooms and bathroom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The apartment consists of a large main living room with an attractive fireplace, kitchen and bathroom, total area of &#8203;&#8203;60 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The apartments have a completely separate entrance and a large terrace with a garden.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>In a separate building there is the cellar of 25 m2 and a workshop area of &#8203;&#8203;8 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There is space in the yard for up to four cars to park.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property can be improved or extended, but there are no plans available.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The condition of the property is good, and it has been well maintained both in and outside.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There are very few properties coming for sale in the town, so this represents a rare opportunity.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact our office to arrange a viewing to see this property.</p>', '', '1136_House-Villa_0.jpg', '1136_House-Villa_1.JPG', '1136_House-Villa_2.JPG', '1136_House-Villa_3.jpg', '1136_House-Villa_4.jpg', '1136_House-Villa_5.jpg', '1136_House-Villa_6.jpg', '1136_House-Villa_7.jpg', '1136_House-Villa_8.jpg'),
(1137, 'Ado ', 'Alesi', '', '', '', 'Hvar', 'Ivan Dolac, Hvar', 'For sale', 'Land plot', '50', '640', '0', 2, '160000', '', 2, 2, 2, 1, 1, 2, 0, 0, 'April 17, 2015', '<p>Graðevinsko zemlji&scaron;te na ju¾noj strani Hvara, u mjestu s najljep&scaron;im &scaron;ljunèanim pla¾ama otoka.&nbsp;Zemlji&scaron;te je udaljeno od mora svega 50 m, pru¾a predivan pogled i u¾iva mir.&nbsp;Ima povr&scaron;inu 640 m2 te je pravilnog oblika.&nbsp;Buduæi da na parceli koja dijeli do mora nije moguæa ili dozvoljena gradnja, zemlji&scaron;te se smjestilo je u prvom redu do mora.&nbsp;Idalno je za gradnju obiteljske kuæe sa apartmanima ili privatne vile s bazenom.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>We have this first line building land on the south side of the island, in one of the most beautiful sandy beaches of the island. The building laws require the property is built 50m from the shore, and it is not possible to build closer. It has an area of 640 m2 and has a regular shape. The plot already has all the necessary infrastructure. It would be ideal for a substantial family house or for an apartment house or several private villas with a swimming pool.</p>', '', '<p>Graðevinsko zemlji&scaron;te na ju¾noj strani Hvara, u mjestu s najljep&scaron;im &scaron;ljunèanim pla¾ama otoka.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Zemlji&scaron;te je udaljeno od mora svega 50 m, pru¾a predivan pogled i u¾iva mir.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ima povr&scaron;inu 640 m2 te je pravilnog oblika.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Buduæi da na parceli koja dijeli do mora nije moguæa ili dozvoljena gradnja, zemlji&scaron;te se smjestilo je u prvom redu do mora.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ima svu potrebnu infrastukturu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Idalno je za gradnju obiteljske kuæe sa apartmanima ili privatne vile s bazenom.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Mjesto se nalazi na ju¾noj strani Hvara, 20 km od Starog Grada koji je povezan sa Splitom svakodnevnom trajektnom linijom.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U mjestu postoji trgovina i nekoliko restorana, a sve ostalo potrebno za nezaboravan odmor u istinskoj mediteranskoj atmosferi nalazi se u obli¾njoj Jelsi.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za sve dodatne informacije kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured.</p>', '<p>We have this first line building land on the south side of the island, in one of the most beautiful sandy beaches of the island.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The building laws require the property is built 50m from the shore, and it is not possible to build closer.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>In front of the house are some mature pine trees but there are still great views from the house, which complements peaceful environment around the area.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It has an area of 640 m2 and has a regular shape.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The plot already has all the necessary infrastructure.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It would be ideal for a substantial family house or for an apartment house or several private villas with a swimming pool.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The place is 20km from Stari Grad or within 30 minutes from the ferry port, but only a few minutes to the sea plane stop in Jelsa harbour with flights to the mainland taking just a few minutes.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The nearest town, Jelsa, has shops, several restaurants, bakery, market and everything needed to immerse into the welcoming and relaxing Dalmatian lifestyle.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For further information please contact our office.</p>', '', '1137_Land-plot_0.JPG', '1137_Land-plot_1.JPG', '1137_Land-plot_2.JPG', '1137_Land-plot_3.JPG', '1137_Land-plot_4.JPG', '1137_Land-plot_5.JPG', '1137_Land-plot_6.JPG', '1137_Land-plot_7.JPG', '1137_Land-plot_8.JPG'),
(1138, 'Jure', 'Gurduliæ', '098/894828', '', '', 'Hvar', 'Selo Prapratna blizu Jelse, Hvar', 'For sale', 'Old stone house', '2000', '100', '100', 2, '40000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 0, 0, 'April 17, 2015', '<p>Stara kamena kuæa na otoku Hvaru, s predivnim pogledom na more i mjesto.&nbsp;U sklopu kuæe nalazi se jo&scaron; jedna manja kuæica od cca 20 m2, te ru&scaron;evina od 20 m2.&nbsp;Ukupna stambena povr&scaron;ina iznosi 100 m2.&nbsp;Okuænica ima povr&scaron;inu 100 m2.&nbsp;Zemlji&scaron;te koje je takoðer na prodaju udaljeno je cca 500 m od kuæe, a sastoji se od dvije parcele s pogledom na more, svaka po cca 10 000 m2.</p>\r\n<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;">CIJENA SNI®ENA S &euro;80.000 NA &euro;40.000</span></p>', '<p>We have this old stone house, inland on Hvar Island with the option of extra land. The area of both the cellar and the first floor is 35 m2, but the height in the first floor allows a ''gallery'' bedroom above the living area.&nbsp;As part of the property for sale is another smaller house of 20 m2, and other ruins, also of 20 m2.&nbsp;Total area of internal space could be 100 m2. The additional land which is also for sale, is approx 500 yards from the house, and consists of two parcels of agricultural land, with sea views, each about 10 000 m2.</p>\r\n<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;">PRICE REDUCED FROM &euro;80.000 TO &euro;40.000</span></p>', '', '<p><strong><span style="text-decoration: underline;">CIJENA SNI®ENA S &euro;80.000 NA &euro;40.000</span></strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Stara kamena kuæa na otoku Hvaru, s predivnim pogledom na more i mjesto.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je dvojna te je djelomièno renovirana.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sastoji se od prizemlja koje slu¾i kao konoba i prvog kata.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Povr&scaron;ina konobe iznosi 35 m2, kao i povr&scaron;ina prvog kata (35 m2), dok je kuæa podignuta pola metra tako da potkrovlje mo¾e poslu¾iti kao galerija.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U sklopu kuæe nalazi se jo&scaron; jedna manja kuæica od cca 20 m2, te ru&scaron;evina od 20 m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ukupna stambena povr&scaron;ina iznosi 100 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Okuænica ima povr&scaron;inu 100 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Zapadno je orijentirana.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa ima novoizgraðenu betonsku cisternu kao i novosagraðenu crnu jamu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Zemlji&scaron;te koje je takoðer na prodaju udaljeno je cca 500 m od kuæe, a sastoji se od dvije parcele s pogledom na more, svaka po cca 10 000 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na zemlji&scaron;tu je bila prije vinova loza tako da postoji moguænost sadnje razlièitih kultura.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Cijena kuæe i zemlji&scaron;ta je 39.900 E + 30.000E = 69.000 eura</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Postoji i moguænost kupnje kuæe bez zemlji&scaron;ta.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za sve dodatne informacije kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured.</p>', '<p><strong><span style="text-decoration: underline;">PRICE REDUCED FROM &euro;80.000 TO &euro;40.000</span></strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>We have this old stone house, &nbsp;inland on Hvar Island with the option of extra land.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is situated in a fabulous location, with superb views over the sea, and surrounded by natural and historic olive groves and open meadows.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The build on is detached and builders have begun the work in restoration, so the property comes in a partially renovated condition.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There is a ground floor, which is designed to be the wine cellar, and the first floor, which is the living area.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The area of both the cellar and the first floor is 35 m2, but the height in the first floor allows a ''gallery'' bedroom above the living area.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>As part of the property for sale is another smaller house of 20 m2, and other ruins, also of 20 m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Total area of internal space could be 100 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The land has a total area of 100 m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The main house is West oriented.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house has a newly built concrete water tank, as well as newly built septic drainage system.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The additional land which is also for sale, is approx 500 yards from the house, and consists of two parcels of agricultural land, with sea views, each about 10 000 m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The land was previously a vineyard, so there is the exciting potential of re-establishing the vines &nbsp;or of planting different crops.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The price of the house and land is 39.900 E + 30.000 E = 69.900 euros.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The owner has offered the option of buying the house without land.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For further information please contact our office.&nbsp;</p>', '', '1138_Old-stone-house_0.jpg', '1138_Old-stone-house_1.jpg', '1138_Old-stone-house_2.jpg', '1138_Old-stone-house_3.jpg', '1138_Old-stone-house_4.jpg', '1138_Old-stone-house_5.jpg', '1138_Old-stone-house_6.jpg', '1138_Old-stone-house_7.jpg', '1138_Old-stone-house_8.jpg'),
(1139, 'Nenad', 'Babiæ', '00385641258998', '003865413483 ', 'Nec2070@gmail.com, Kljuè &#8211; Ivana K', 'Kastela', 'Trg fra Bernardina Sokola,  Ka¹tel Suæurac', 'For sale', 'Old stone house', '100', '0', '69', 1, '60100', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 3, 1, 'April 20, 2015', '<p>Stara kamena kuæa sa mnogim moguænostima smje&scaron;tena u starom dijelu jednog od 7 prekrasnih mjesta Ka&scaron;tela.&nbsp;Kuæa je djelomièno adaptirana, dok je za njeno potpuno ureðenje potrebno jo&scaron; ulaganja.&nbsp;Ukupna povr&scaron;ina iznosi 69 m2 + 2 terase (16 m2 + 17 m2).&nbsp;Vanjski ulaz i hodnik u prizemlju koriste i drugi stanari koji u prizemlju imaju 3 prostorije u svom vlasni&scaron;tvu.</p>', '<p>We have this old stone house as an investment and refurbishment project with many possibilities situated in a popular and preserved area in one of the seven beautiful Kastela villages. The house has been partly renovated, and to complete the renovation needs more investment, and this has been incorporated in the price. The total living area is 69 m2 + 2 terraces (16 m2 + 17 m2). There is a shared (with one neighbour) outdoor entrance and hallway on the ground floor.</p>', '', '<p>Stara kamena kuæa sa mnogim moguænostima smje&scaron;tena u starom dijelu jednog od 7 prekrasnih mjesta Ka&scaron;tela.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je djelomièno adaptirana, dok je za njeno potpuno ureðenje potrebno jo&scaron; ulaganja.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ukupna povr&scaron;ina iznosi 69 m2 + 2 terase (16 m2 + 17 m2).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U prizemlju se nalazi &nbsp;manja kuhinja i wc, te 1 soba koja je idealna za svrhu spremi&scaron;ta.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>**Vanjski ulaz i hodnik u prizemlju koriste i drugi stanari koji u prizemlju imaju 3 prostorije u svom vlasni&scaron;tvu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Iz hodnika je posebni ulaz koji vodi na 1.kat gdje se nalazi terasa i ulaz u ostale katove koji su spojeni unutarnjim stepenicama.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na 1., 2. i 3. katu se nalazi po 1 spavaæa soba, dok je na krovu smje&scaron;tena terasa sa prekrasnim pogledom na more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Potrebna je izgradnja stepenica koje bi povezale 3. kat i krovnu terasu jer je sada&scaron;nji pristup ogranièen.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Moguænost parkiranja automobila odmah do kuæe.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Svi sadr¾aji se nalaze u blizini dok je more udaljeno 100 m.Do meðunarodnog aerodroma je potrebno 30 min. vo¾nje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za sva ostala pitanja stojimo na raspolaganju.</p>', '<p>We have this old stone house as an investment and refurbishment project with many possibilities situated in a popular and preserved area in one of the seven beautiful Kastela villages.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house has been partly renovated, and to complete the renovation needs more investment, and this has been incorporated in the price.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The total living area is 69 m2 + 2 terraces (16 m2 + 17 m2).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The ground floor has a small kitchen and toilet, and one room which is ideal for storage purposes.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There is a shared (with one neighbour) outdoor entrance and hallway on the ground floor.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>From the hallway there is a private entrance that leads up to the 1st floor where there is a terrace and steps that lead to the other floors.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the first, second and third floor there is one bedroom, while on the roof, there is another terrace with a beautiful views of the sea.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It would be good and possible, to build external steps to the roof terrace to make access easier.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There is parking next to the house.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Amenities such as shops, bars, coffee bars and restaurants are all nearby and the sea and Riva is 100 m.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>To the international airport it takes 30 min. driving.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For all other questions and arrange to visit the property, please contact the office.&nbsp;</p>', '', '1139_Old-stone-house_0.jpg', '1139_Old-stone-house_1.JPG', '1139_Old-stone-house_2.jpg', '1139_Old-stone-house_3.JPG', '1139_Old-stone-house_4.JPG', '1139_Old-stone-house_5.JPG', '1139_Old-stone-house_6.JPG', '1139_Old-stone-house_7.JPG', '1139_Old-stone-house_8.JPG'),
(1140, 'Anna i Josip ', 'Jurèev', '0917897055', '00420721207373', 'kljuèevi u agenciji', 'Kastela', 'Ivana Danila 2, 180/1 i 179 k.è.', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '45', '0', '86', 2, '98000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 1, 'April 20, 2015', '<p>Apartman u staroj kamenoj kuæi sa prostranom terasom na jugu, smje&scaron;ten u starom dijelu jednog od sedam prekrasnih mjesta Ka&scaron;tela.&nbsp;Jedan dio kuæe je star preko 500 god., dok je ostatak star cca. 100 god. Nalazi se u samom centru u blizini svih sadr¾aja.&nbsp;Smje&scaron;ten je na 2. i 3. katu (potkrovlje) ukupne povr&scaron;ine 62 m2 + terasa 24 m2.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>We have this apartment in old stone house with a spacious terrace on the south, situated in the old and preserved area of Kastela.&nbsp;This is a great old building, in excellent condition, with one part of the house over 500 years old, and the rest is around 100 years old. It is situated on the second and third floor with total area of 86 m2 (62 m2 + terrace 24 m2)</p>', '', '<p>Apartman u staroj kamenoj kuæi sa prostranom terasom na jugu, smje&scaron;ten u starom dijelu jednog od sedam prekrasnih mjesta Ka&scaron;tela.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Jedan dio kuæe je star preko 500 god., dok je ostatak star cca. 100 god.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nalazi se u samom centru u blizini svih sadr¾aja.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Smje&scaron;ten je na 2. i 3. katu (potkrovlje) ukupne povr&scaron;ine 62 m2 + terasa 24 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>2. kat se sastoji od hodnika, 1 spavaæe sobe i dnevnog boravka.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na 3. katu je hodnik, kuhinja, wc i prostrana terasa osunèana preko cijelog dana.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartman je u dobrom stanju, ali je za luksuzniji nivo ureðenja potrebno jo&scaron; ulaganja.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Zbog polo¾aja je idealna za odmor, ali i turistièko iznajmljivanje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Parking se nalazi cca. 20 m od kuæe, dok je pristup automobilom direktan.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Meðunarodni aerodrom udaljen je 10 min. vo¾nje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ukoliko imate jo&scaron; dodatnih pitanja i zainteresirani ste za razgledavanja, slobodno nas kontaktirajte.</p>', '<p>We have this apartment in old stone house with a spacious terrace on the south, situated in the old and preserved area of Kastela.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>This is a great old building, in excellent condition, with one part of the house over 500 years old, and the rest is around 100 years old.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is located in the centre of the village close to all amenities, such as bakery, coffee bars, restaurants and one of several excellent sea front '' Konaba'' found here.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is situated on the second and third floor with total area of 86 m2 (62 m2 + terrace 24 m2)</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>2nd floor consists of a hall, one bedroom and a living room.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the 3rd floor is a hallway, kitchen, bathroom and with access to the spacious terrace which catches the sun all day long.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The apartment is in good condition, and habitable but for a more luxurious standard it needs more investment.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Due to the location it is ideal for holiday and tourist rentals.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Parking is located approx. 20 m from the house, while there is access for deliveries etc.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The international airport is 10 minutes. driving.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>If you have additional questions and are interested in visiting the property feel free to contact us.&nbsp;</p>', '', '1140_Old-stone-house_0.JPG', '1140_Old-stone-house_1.JPG', '1140_Old-stone-house_2.JPG', '1140_Old-stone-house_3.JPG', '1140_Old-stone-house_4.JPG', '1140_Old-stone-house_5.JPG', '1140_Old-stone-house_6.JPG', '1140_Old-stone-house_7.JPG', '1140_Old-stone-house_8.JPG');
INSERT INTO `nekretnina` (`id`, `ime`, `prezime`, `telefon`, `mobitel`, `e_mail`, `lokacija_id`, `adresa`, `status_id`, `vrsta_id`, `udaljenost`, `povrsina`, `stambenapovrsina`, `display`, `cijena`, `cijenatocka`, `ponuda_tjedna`, `new_built`, `must_sell`, `prvi_red_do_mora`, `pogled_na_more`, `bazen`, `broj_soba`, `broj_kupatila`, `datum`, `title_hr`, `title_en`, `title_ge`, `opis_hr`, `opis_en`, `opis_ge`, `PropertyImageURL0`, `PropertyImageURL1`, `PropertyImageURL2`, `PropertyImageURL3`, `PropertyImageURL4`, `PropertyImageURL5`, `PropertyImageURL6`, `PropertyImageURL7`, `PropertyImageURL8`) VALUES
(1160, '', 'Dalmatian Home', '', '', 'info@dalmatianhome.com', 'Rogoznica', 'Ra¾anj', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '30', '450', '164', 1, '350000', '', 2, 1, 2, 2, 1, 1, 3, 3, 'May 5, 2015', '<p>Prekrasna moderna villa sa bazenom u Rogoznici. Nalazi se svega 30m zraène linije od mora i prirodnih pla¾a, a iz same nekretnine se mo¾e u¾ivati u lijepom pogledu na more i obli¾nje otoke.&nbsp;Ukupna kvadratura objekta iznosi 163,93m2 (115,08m2 stambeno + 48,85m2 terasa na 1.katu), dok je povr&scaron;ina parcele 450m2.&nbsp;Vila se sastoji od prizemlja i kata.&nbsp;Gradnja je zapoèeta 2015.godine, a planirani zavr&scaron;etak radov æe biti krajem 2016.godine.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>A beautiful modern villa with swimming pool in Rogoznica.It is located just 30m away from the sea and natural beaches, and the owners of the property can enjoy in a nice view of the sea and nearby islands.&nbsp;The total living area of the building is 163,93m2 (115,08m2 housing + 48,85m2 terrace on the 1st floor) and the size of the plot is 450m2.&nbsp;Villa is consisted of a ground floor and first floor.&nbsp;Construction began in 2015., and the planned completion of the work will be till the end of 2016.</p>', '', '<p>Prekrasna moderna villa sa bazenom u Rogoznici.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nalazi se svega 30m zraène linije od mora i prirodnih pla¾a, a iz same nekretnine se mo¾e u¾ivati u lijepom pogledu na more i obli¾nje otoke.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ukupna kvadratura objekta iznosi 163,93m2 (115,08m2 stambeno + 48,85m2 terasa na 1.katu), dok je povr&scaron;ina parcele 450m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Vila se sastoji od prizemlja i kata.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U prizemlju se nalaze jedna spavaæa soba, jedna kupaona, dnevni boravak, kuhinja i blagavaona, te 3 spremi&scaron;ta.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na prvom katu su 2 spavaæe sobe, 2 kupaone, 2 spremi&scaron;ta i 2 terase.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Unutar okuænice se nalazi bazen, vrt, terasa, natkriveni parking za 2 automobila, te vanjski parking za jo&scaron; 2 vozila.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Villa se prodaje po sistemu kljuè u ruke, a u cijeni je ukljuèeno kompletno ureðenje i opremanje interijera (bez namje&scaron;taja) i dekoriranje okuænice.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U fazi gradnje moguæ je izbor keramike, sanitarija, te parketa po ¾elji kupca.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Cijena takoðer ukljuèuje klimatizaciju u cijelom objektu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Gradnja je zapoèeta 2015.godine, a planirani zavr&scaron;etak radov æe biti krajem 2016.godine.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>A beautiful modern villa with swimming pool in Rogoznica.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is located just 30m away from the sea and natural beaches, and the owners of the property can enjoy in a nice view of the sea and nearby islands.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The total living area of the building is 163,93m2 (115,08m2 housing + 48,85m2 terrace on the 1st floor) and the size of the plot is 450m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Villa is consisted of a ground floor and first floor.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ground floor consists of 1 bedroom, 1 bathroom, living room, kitchen, dinning room and 3 storage rooms.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>First floor consists of 2 bedrooms, 2 bathrooms, 2 storage rooms and 2 terraces.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Within the garden there is a pool, garden, terrace, covered parking for 2 cars and outdoor parking for 2 vehicles.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The price includes the complete finishing and equipping the interior (without the furniture) and decorating the garden.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There is possibility to select ceramics, sanitary ware, and parquet on customer request, in construction phase of building.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Price also includes air conditioning throughout the house.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Construction began in 2015., and the planned completion of the work will be till the end of 2016.</p>', '', '1160_House-Villa_0.jpg', '1160_House-Villa_1.jpg', '1160_House-Villa_2.jpg', '1160_House-Villa_3.jpg', '1160_House-Villa_4.jpg', '1160_House-Villa_5.jpg', '1160_House-Villa_6.jpg', '1160_House-Villa_7.jpg', '1160_House-Villa_8.jpg'),
(1142, 'Ivica', 'Pavièiæ', '', '098/308 394', '', 'Hvar', 'Dol, Hvar', 'For sale', 'Land plot', '3000', '1860', '0', 1, '110000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 0, 0, 'April 21, 2015', '<p>Graðevinsko zemlji&scaron;te stambene namjene, smje&scaron;teno ispod ceste, na udaljenosti 3 km od mora.&nbsp;Sa zemlji&scaron;ta se pru¾a predivan pogled na mjesto i prirodu.&nbsp;Ukupna povr&scaron;ina zemlji&scaron;ta iznosi 1860 m2.&nbsp;Oblikovno kuæa mora biti kamena zidana ili ¾bukana s kamenim okvirima prozora i kosim krovom, te je po¾eljno da ima &bdquo;dvor&ldquo;- tradicinalno zatvoreno dvori&scaron;te karakteristièno za to podneblje.&nbsp;<br /><br /></p>', '<p>We are offering this very rare opportunity to buy building land in this historic village. It is situated below the road, at a distance of 3 km from the sea, adjacent to agricultural land, ensuring the ''edge of village'' location for the future.&nbsp;The plot offers magnificent views of the village and countryside. The total land plot area is 1860 m2.&nbsp;</p>', '', '<p>Graðevinsko zemlji&scaron;te stambene namjene, smje&scaron;teno ispod ceste, na udaljenosti 3 km od mora.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sa zemlji&scaron;ta se pru¾a predivan pogled na mjesto i prirodu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ukupna povr&scaron;ina zemlji&scaron;ta iznosi 1860 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Oblikovno kuæa mora biti kamena zidana ili ¾bukana s kamenim okvirima prozora i kosim krovom, te je po¾eljno da ima &bdquo;dvor&ldquo;- tradicinalno zatvoreno dvori&scaron;te karakteristièno za to podneblje.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Maksimalna moguæa visina graðevine iznosi 10 m+krov.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Koeficijent izgraðenosti je 0.3, a koeficijent iskoristivosti 1.0, &scaron;to znaèi da se na parceli povr&scaron;ine od 1000 m2 mo¾e izgraditi kuæa tlocrtne povr&scaron;ine 300m2 x 3 kata= 900m2, te potkrovlja 100m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Zemlji&scaron;te se nalazi u centru naselja, nasuprot poljoprivredng zemlji&scaron;ta, &scaron;to garantira mir i privatnost, buduæi da je zemlji&scaron;te nasuprot po namjeni poljoprivredno, &scaron;to znaèi da na tom dijelu nije dozvoljena gradnja.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kvalitetno rje&scaron;enje graðevine na parceli bi trebalo prihvatiti postojeæa stabla maslina u &scaron;to veæoj mjeri, jer bi ona graðevini davala poseban ambijent.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Mjesto ima sve potrebne sadr¾aje, a smje&scaron;teno &nbsp;je ju¾no od Starog Grada koji je svakodnevno povezan trajektnom linijom sa Splitom.</p>', '<p lang="en-GB">We are offering this very rare opportunity to buy building land in this historic village.</p>\r\n<p lang="en-GB">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p lang="en-GB">It is situated below the road, at a distance of 3 km from the sea, adjacent to agricultural land, ensuring the ''edge of village'' location for the future.</p>\r\n<p lang="en-GB">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p lang="en-GB">The plot offers magnificent views of the village and countryside.</p>\r\n<p lang="en-GB">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p lang="en-GB">The total land plot area is 1860 m2.</p>\r\n<p lang="en-GB">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p lang="en-GB">The structural design of the house has to be in keeping with the area so must be built of stone or mortared with stone window frames and a sloping roof, and it would be advisable to have a "palace style" project- traditionally a closed courtyard which was typical for prominent houses in this area.</p>\r\n<p lang="en-GB">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p lang="en-GB">The maximum possible height of the building is 10 m + roof.</p>\r\n<p lang="en-GB">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p lang="en-GB">Coefficient is 0.3, a coefficient of 1.0, which means that on a plot of 1000 m2 can build a house of 300m2 x 3 floors = 900m2 and 100m2 attic.</p>\r\n<p lang="en-GB">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p lang="en-GB">The land is located close to the centre of the village, but still next to fields.</p>\r\n<p lang="en-GB">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p lang="en-GB">The nearest larger village has all the necessary facilities such as shops, bars and market, and is located south of the main port, which has many daily ferries to Split all year.</p>\r\n<p lang="en-GB">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p lang="en-GB">It is 20 minutes by car to reach the ferry terminal.</p>\r\n<p lang="en-GB">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p lang="en-GB">Please contact our office to arrange to visit this location.</p>', '', '1142_Land-plot_0.jpg', '1142_Land-plot_1.jpg', '1142_Land-plot_2.jpg', '1142_Land-plot_3.jpg', '1142_Land-plot_4.jpg', '', '', '', ''),
(1145, 'Jasmine', 'Herdell', 'http://www.dalmatianpropertymanagement.com/pages/c', '0046707319769', 'herdelljasmine@gmail.com', 'Trogir', 'Okrug Gornji', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '80', '880', '502', 1, '900000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 1, 9, 6, 'April 23, 2015', '<p>Prostrana villa potpuno renovirana i ureðena sa prekrasnim pogledom, udaljena od mora i &scaron;ljunèane pla¾e svega 80 m.&nbsp;Ukupno zemlji&scaron;te na kojem se nalazi je povr&scaron;ine 880 m2, dok je povr&scaron;ina ville 502 m2. Brutto povr&scaron;ina iznosi 681 m2.&nbsp;Sastoji se od prizemlja, 1. i 2. kata, te se na svakoj eta¾i nalazi po 1 apartman sa posebnim ulazom.&nbsp;U dvori&scaron;tu se nalazi bazen i ureðeni vrt koji garantira mir i privatnost.<br /><br /></p>', '<p>We have this spacious modern villa completely renovated and decorated with a private swimming pool.&nbsp;The property is 80m from the sea and elevated by the sloping geography to give commanding views across the village and the sea. Total land on which the area is 880 m2, while the living area of the villa 502 m2, including the balconies the gross area is 681 m2. It consists of ground, first and second floor, and on each floor is one apartment with a separate entrance. In the backyard is a shared swimming pool and landscaped garden that guarantees peace and privacy.</p>', '', '<p>Prostrana villa potpuno renovirana i ureðena sa prekrasnim pogledom, udaljena od mora i &scaron;ljunèane pla¾e svega 80 m.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Izgraðena je 1986. godine, dok je 2008. potpuno renovirana gdje su kori&scaron;teni najkvalitetniji materijali i oprema.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Svi podovi i terase poploèani su granitom u raznim bojama i nijansama.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Smje&scaron;tena je na zapadom dijelu otoka Èiova sjeverozapadne orjentacije, udaljena od grada Trogira cca. 10 min. vo¾nje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ukupno zemlji&scaron;te na kojem se nalazi je povr&scaron;ine 880 m2, dok je povr&scaron;ina ville 502 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Brutto povr&scaron;ina iznosi 681 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sastoji se od prizemlja, 1. i 2. kata, te se na svakoj eta¾i nalazi po 1 apartman sa posebnim ulazom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U dvori&scaron;tu se nalazi bazen i ureðeni vrt koji garantira mir i privatnost.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Svi apartmani su opremljeni klimatizacijskim ureðajima i podnim grijanjem.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na krovu se koriste solarni paneli koji slu¾e za zagrijanjanje vode.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U villi je ukupno 9 spavaæih soba, 6 kupaonica i 6 terasa sa pogledom na more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U prizemlju se nalaze 2 gara¾e sa ukupno 2 parking mjesta, dok se ispred gara¾a mo¾e parkirati jo&scaron; 2 automobila.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Villa se uspje&scaron;no turistièki iznajmljuje, stoga je moguæe nastaviti se baviti uhodanim poslom ili je jednostavno koristiti za vlastiti boravak.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Centar mjesta udaljen je svega par minuta vo¾nje, a do meðunarodnog aerodroma je potrebno 15 min.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za sva dodatna pitanja, slike i tlocrte vam stojimo na usluzi.</p>', '<p>We have this spacious modern villa completely renovated and decorated with a private swimming pool.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property is 80m from the sea and elevated by the sloping geography to give commanding views across the village and the sea.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There is a pebble beach in front of the house.It was built in 1986, and in 2008 completely renovated, when they used the best materials and fittings.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>All the floors and terraces are attractively tiled with granite, and the bathrooms and kitchen with practical and attractive fittings.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is located on the west side of island Ciovo northwest orientation, away from the town of Trogir approx. which is 10 min. driving.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Total land on which the area is 880 m2, while the living area of the villa 502 m2, including the balconies the gross area is 681 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It consists of ground, first and second floor, and on each floor is one apartment with a separate entrance.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>In the backyard is a shared swimming pool and landscaped garden that guarantees peace and privacy.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>All the apartments are equipped with air conditioning and underfloor heating.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the roof are solar panels that heat the water.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The villa has a total of 9 bedrooms, 6 bathrooms and 6 terraces/balconies overlooking the sea.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The ground floor has two garages with 2 parking places, while in front of the garage there is place for another 2 cars.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The villa has been used as a successful tourist rental business, and it is possible to continue this established business or is simply use the property privately.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The town centre of Trogir is only a few minutes, and the international airport takes 15 min.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For any additional questions, pictures and floor plans we are at your service.</p>', '', '1145_House-Villa_0.JPG', '1145_House-Villa_1.JPG', '1145_House-Villa_2.JPG', '1145_House-Villa_3.JPG', '1145_House-Villa_4.JPG', '1145_House-Villa_5.JPG', '1145_House-Villa_6.JPG', '1145_House-Villa_7.JPG', '1145_House-Villa_8.jpg'),
(1144, 'Vinka ', 'Jurjeviæ', '0989606833', '', 'vinka.jurjevic@xnet.hr', 'Brac', 'Uvala Luèice, 1018/6, KO Milna', 'For sale', 'Old stone house', '5', '3468', '50', 2, '700000', '', 2, 2, 2, 1, 1, 2, 2, 1, 'April 23, 2015', '<p>Jedinstvena nekretnina ja ju¾noj strani otoka Braèa na lokaciji koja pru¾a mir i odmor. Prizemnica povr&scaron;ine 50 m2. Kuæa je smje&scaron;tena na zemlji&scaron;tu od 3.500 m2 i to u zelenoj zoni gdje nije moguæa nadogradnja. Obzirom da je u okolini tek nekoliko kuæa ovo je idealna nekretnina za miran odmor. Najbli¾e trgovine i restorani su na udaljenosti od 2 km.</p>', '<p>Unique property on the south side of island Brac at a location that offers peace and quietness. Property of 50 sqm. The house is on a land plot of 3.500 sqm and it is in a green zone which means that it cannot be extended. Since there are only couple of houses in this area you can be sure this i san ideal property to have quiet vacation. The nearest stores and restaurants are 2 km away.</p>', '', '<p>Jedinstvena nekretnina ja ju¾noj strani otoka Braèa na lokaciji koja pru¾a mir i odmor.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Prizemnica povr&scaron;ine 50 m2, a sastoji se od kuhinje, dnevnog boravka, blagovaonice, kupaonice te dvije spavaæe sobe.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Uz kuæu nalazi se gustirna te komin.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ispred kuæe je predivna natkrivena terasa od 30 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa se nalazi na zemlji&scaron;tu od 3.500 m2 i to u zelenoj zoni pa nije moguæa nadogradnja.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nekretnina nema pristup automobilom veæ se parkira na udaljenosti od 100 m.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na zemlji&scaron;tu nema vode niti struje te se koristi gustirna te plin.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Obzirom da je u okolini tek nekoliko &nbsp;kuæa ovo je idealna nekretnina za miran odmor.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Najbli¾e trgovine i restorani su na udaljenosti od 2 km.</p>', '<p>Unique property on the south side of island Brac at a location that offers peace and quietness.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Property of 50 sqm that consists only of ground floor with kitchen, living area, dining area, bathroom and two bedrooms.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Next to the house there is a water tank and summer kitchen.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There is a beautiful and spacious terrace in front of the house of 30 sqm.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house is on a land plot of 3.500 sqm and it i sin a green zone which means that it cannot be extended.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There is no car access but car can be parked 100 m away.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There is no water or electricity, but the water tank and gas (bottles) are used.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Since there are only couple of houses in this area you can be sure this i san ideal property to have quiet vacation.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The nearest stores and restaurants are 2 km away.</p>', '', '1144_House-Villa_0.jpg', '1144_House-Villa_1.jpg', '1144_House-Villa_2.jpg', '1144_House-Villa_3.JPG', '1144_House-Villa_4.jpg', '1144_House-Villa_5.jpg', '', '', ''),
(1146, 'Danijela ', 'Rozga', '0913952133 ', '', 'danijela@apid.co.uk', 'Solta', 'Maslinica, ©olta', 'For sale', 'Old stone house', '500', '700', '200', 2, '385000', '', 2, 1, 2, 2, 1, 1, 3, 3, 'April 23, 2015', '<p>Novoizgraðena prekrasna kamena villa sa bazenom i pogledom na more i &scaron;umu. Smje&scaron;tena je na otoku &Scaron;olti koji je povezan svakodnevnom trajektnom linijom sa gradom Splitom.&nbsp;Ukupna povr&scaron;ina zemlji&scaron;ta iznosi 700 m2 gdje se nalaze bazen i ureðena okuænica. Vrt je kultiviran mnogobrojnim cvijeæem, palmama i maslinama, gdje se takoðer nalaze vanjski tu&scaron; i kamin.&nbsp;Sastoji se od prizemlja i 1.kata ukupne povr&scaron;ine 200 m2.</p>', '<p>We are pleased to offer this newly built beautiful stone villa with swimming pool and views of the sea and the forest.&nbsp;It is located on the island of Solta, 500m from the sea, and a similar distance to the centre of the nearest beautiful and unchanged village.&nbsp;The total land area is 700 m2 where there is a landscaped and well-maintained garden around the swimming pool. In addition to the flowers and trees in the garden there is also an outdoor shower and bbq/fireplace.&nbsp;It has ground floor and 1st floor with total living area of 200 m2.&nbsp;</p>', '', '<p>Novoizgraðena prekrasna kamena villa sa bazenom i pogledom na more i &scaron;umu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Smje&scaron;tena je na otoku &Scaron;olti koji je povezan svakodnevnom trajektnom linijom sa gradom Splitom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ukupna povr&scaron;ina zemlji&scaron;ta iznosi 700 m2 gdje se nalaze bazen i ureðena okuænica.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Vrt je kultiviran mnogobrojnim cvijeæem, palmama i maslinama, gdje se takoðer nalaze vanjski tu&scaron; i kamin.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sastoji se od prizemlja i 1.kata ukupne povr&scaron;ine 200 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U prizemlju se nalaze veliki dnevni boravak, blagovaonica, kuhinja, kupaonica i mala sprema ispod stepenica.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Unutarnjim stepenicama se dolazi na 1.kat gdje se nalaze prostrana kupaonica, 2 spavaæe sobe s pogledom na more i terase.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na istoj eta¾i se nalazi jedan mali studio apartman sa kuhinjom, kupaonicom, dnevnim boravkom i terasom s pogledom na more.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Villa ima ugraðen WI-FI internet i solarno grijanje, te posjeduje energetski certifikat B razreda.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Centar mjesta i pla¾a su udaljeni cca. 500 m, dok cijeli otok obiluje mnogim uvalama i prirodnim ljepotama.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Meðunarodni aerodrom udaljen je 40 min. vo¾nje od grada Splita.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Slobodno nas kontaktirajte za sva dodatna pitanja.</p>', '<p>We are pleased to offer this newly built beautiful stone villa with swimming pool and views of the sea and the forest.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is located on the island of Solta, 500m from the sea, and a similar distance to the centre of the nearest beautiful and unchanged village.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The total land area is 700 m2 where there is a landscaped and well-maintained garden around the swimming pool.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>In addition to the flowers and trees in the garden there is also an outdoor shower and bbq/fireplace.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It has ground floor and 1st floor with total living &nbsp;area of 200 m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The ground floor has a large practical open plan living room, dining room, kitchen, and a bathroom and the stairs.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Internal stairs leads to the 1st floor where there is a spacious bathroom, and two two bedrooms with sea views and terraces.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the same floor is a small studio apartment with kitchen, bathroom, living room and terrace overlooking the sea.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The villa has a built-in WI-FI internet and solar heating, and has an energy certificate B grade.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The village has shops for essential items, bakery, family run restaurants and the area in is full of natural and preserved woods and meadows while the shore has beautiful clean water and many private beaches and coves.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There are several ferries a day to the mainland, and it is the shortest crossing to Split of the main islands, but it is one of the islands least visited by tourists, and still unaffected and beautiful.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The international airport is 40 min. drive from the city of Split.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please feel free to contact us for any further questions and to arrange a visit.&nbsp;</p>', '', '1146_Old-stone-house_0.JPG', '1146_Old-stone-house_1.JPG', '1146_Old-stone-house_2.JPG', '1146_Old-stone-house_3.JPG', '1146_Old-stone-house_4.JPG', '1146_Old-stone-house_5.JPG', '1146_Old-stone-house_6.jpg', '1146_Old-stone-house_7.jpg', '1146_Old-stone-house_8.jpg'),
(1147, 'Alen ', 'Dalmatis', '', '', '', 'Zadar', 'Ra¾anac', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '5', '133', '122', 1, '120000', '', 2, 2, 2, 1, 1, 2, 4, 0, 'April 23, 2015', '<p>Prekrasna kuæa u nizu, na odliènoj lokaciji, smje&scaron;tena prvi red do mora.&nbsp;Ima prekrasan pogled na more, a nalazi se u samom centru, na rivi, nadomak svim potrebnim sadr¾ajima. Velièina zemlji&scaron;ta iznosi 133 m2, dok je stambena povr&scaron;ina kuæe 122 m2. Kuæa ima 4 spavaæe sobe.</p>', '<p>We have this rare opportunity to buy a large terraced house on the water''s edge, near the centre of the village, at a very modest price.&nbsp;The land plot is 133 m2, while the living area is 122 m2.&nbsp;The lay out inside the house is practical and it has 4 bedrooms. It has been well decorated and well maintained, despite being an older building.&nbsp;</p>', '', '<p>Prekrasna kuæa u nizu, na odliènoj lokaciji, smje&scaron;tena prvi red do mora.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ima prekrasan pogled na more, a nalazi se u samom centru, na rivi, nadomak svim potrebnim sadr¾ajima.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Velièina zemlji&scaron;ta iznosi 133 m2, dok je stambena povr&scaron;ina kuæe 122 m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa ima 4 spavaæe sobe.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Objekt je starije gradnje, ali je uredan i odr¾avan.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Mjesto je idealno za odmor i turizam, ujedno je i administrativno sjedi&scaron;te podruèja.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nalazi se u blizini parka Paklenice, samo pola sata vo¾nje do Zadra.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>We have this rare opportunity to buy a large terraced house on the water''s edge, near the centre of the village, at a very modest price.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The land plot is 133 m2, while the living area is 122 m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The lay out inside the house is practical and it has 4 bedrooms.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It has been well decorated and well maintained, despite being an older building.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It would be impossible to build a property this close to the sea with modern planning constraints!</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>This is an excellent property that would make a substantial private house or to use for tourism and holiday rentals.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The village is the administrative seat of the area, and has many essential services such as shops, bars, coffee shops, bakery and family run restaurants.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is located near the National Park Paklenica, and only a half hour drive to Zadar.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>This is a great value property.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact the office to arrange to visit this property.&nbsp;</p>', '', '1147_House-Villa_0.jpg', '1147_House-Villa_1.jpg', '1147_House-Villa_2.jpg', '1147_House-Villa_3.jpg', '1147_House-Villa_4.jpg', '1147_House-Villa_5.jpg', '1147_House-Villa_6.jpg', '1147_House-Villa_7.jpg', '1147_House-Villa_8.jpg'),
(1148, 'Elvira', 'Santo', '0917810106 &#8211; suprug ', '0919741657 &#8211; Elvira  0915095524 - mama', 'santoelvira@gmail.com', 'Trogir', 'Kamenita 8a Trogir', 'For sale', 'Old stone house', '90', '58', '90', 1, '155000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 'April 23, 2015', '<p>Stara kamena kuæa u starom dijelu Trogira udaljena od samog centra i rive svega nekoliko minuta hodanja.&nbsp;Smje&scaron;tena je u mirnoj maloj ulici bez puno buke i prometa. Najbli¾i pristup automobilom je cca. 40 m od kuæe, dok je parking udaljen cca. 50 m.&nbsp;Kuæa se sastoji od prizemlja i 1.kata ukupne povr&scaron;ine 90 m2.</p>', '<p>We have this old stone house in the heart of Trogir. This UNESCO site, alongside Split and Dubrovnic, is a magnet for visitors around the world who come to enjoy this walled Venetian town and the sale of this wonderful house is a rare opportunity to purchase a property in this unique location.&nbsp;It is a traditional old stone building, in good condition, in a pedestrian only street, just minutes from any where in the town or any area of the shore nearby. The house consists of a ground floor and 1st floor with an area of 90m sq.&nbsp;</p>', '', '<p>Stara kamena kuæa u starom dijelu Trogira udaljena od samog centra i rive svega nekoliko minuta hodanja.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Smje&scaron;tena je u mirnoj maloj ulici bez puno buke i prometa.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Najbli¾i pristup automobilom je cca. 40 m od kuæe, dok je parking udaljen cca. 50 m.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa se sastoji od prizemlja i 1.kata ukupne povr&scaron;ine 90 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U prizemlju je smje&scaron;tena kuhinja + blagovaonica + dnevni boravak, hodnik, kupaonica, wc i sprema.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Unutarnje spiralne stepenice vode na 1.kat gdje se nalazi hodnik, 2 spavaæe sobe i terasa (16 m2).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Potpuno je namje&scaron;tena sa svom potrebnom infrastrukturom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ispred kuæe nalazi se mali zajednièki dvor gdje postoji moguænost boravka.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je u dobrom stanju i spremna za boravak ili turistièko iznajmljivanje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ukoliko ¾elite vi&scaron;i nivo ureðenja potrebno je jo&scaron; ulaganja.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ovo je izuzetna prilika ¾elite li nekretninu u mirnoj okru¾enju u blizini centra prekrasnog povijesnog grada Trogira.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Meðunarodni aerodrom udaljen je 5 min. vo¾nje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za sva dodatna pitanja vam stojimo na raspolaganju.</p>', '<p>We have this old stone house in the heart of Trogir.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>This UNESCO site, alongside Split and Dubrovnic, is a magnet for visitors around the world who come to enjoy this walled Venetian town and the sale of this wonderful house is a rare opportunity to purchase a property in this unique location.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is a traditional old stone building, in good condition, in a pedestrian only street, just minutes from any where in the town or any area of the shore nearby.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house consists of a ground floor and 1st floor with an area of 90m sq.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The ground floor has a kitchen, dining room, living room, hallway, bathroom, toilet and stores.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The internal spiral staircase leads to the 1st floor where there is a hallway, two bedrooms and a terrace (16 m2).&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is fully furnished, is in good condition and well decorated so is ready for residence or holiday rental.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There are many shops, bakery, various bars and restaurants in the immediate area.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The airport is about 5-10 minutes away, parking is about 40m from the house.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact our office for more information and to arrange to visit this property.&nbsp;</p>', '', '1148_Old-stone-house_0.jpg', '1148_Old-stone-house_1.jpg', '1148_Old-stone-house_2.jpg', '1148_Old-stone-house_3.jpg', '1148_Old-stone-house_4.jpg', '1148_Old-stone-house_5.jpg', '1148_Old-stone-house_6.jpg', '1148_Old-stone-house_7.jpg', '1148_Old-stone-house_8.jpg'),
(1149, 'Josip', 'Karabatiæ', '', '091 4422319', '', 'Rogoznica', 'Ra¾anj, Uvala luka 50 Dvornice,  Kalebova luka, 5920/2 K.O. Sevid', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '3', '488', '110', 1, '350000', '', 2, 2, 2, 1, 1, 2, 2, 1, 'April 23, 2015', '<p>Na svega par metara od mora u prekrasnoj mirnoj uvali nalazi se kuæa s direktnim pristupom pla¾i. Kuæa je ju¾ne orijentacije s panoramskim pogledom na more. Parcela se pru¾a od ceste do mora. Ispred parcele je lijepo ureðena prirodna pla¾a. Povr&scaron;ina parcele je 488 m2, a na njoj je kuæa ukupne povr&scaron;ine 110 m2. Kuæa &nbsp;se sastoji od prizemlja i kata.</p>', '<p>We have this attractive holiday villa just a few meters from the sea in beautiful quiet bay with access to the shore, which is a well maintained natural pebble beach.&nbsp;The house and garden are south facing with wide panoramic sea views. The plot stretches from the road to the sea and the plot area is 488 m2.&nbsp;The house consists of two floors, with a total floor area of 110m sq.&nbsp;</p>', '', '<p>Na svega par metara od mora u prekrasnoj mirnoj uvali nalazi se kuæa s direktnim pristupom pla¾i.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je ju¾ne orijentacije s panoramskim pogledom na more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Parcela se pru¾a od ceste do mora.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ispred parcele je lijepo ureðena prirodna pla¾a.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Povr&scaron;ina parcele je 488 m2, a na njoj je kuæa ukupne povr&scaron;ine 110 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa &nbsp;se sastoji od prizemlja i kata.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Prizemlje je podijeljeno na dnevni dio s ljetnom kuhinjom i prostor u kojem se nalazi cisterna za vodu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na katu su dvije spavaæe sobe, dnevni boravak, kuhinja i kupaonica.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U sklopu kuæe s ju¾ne strane je velika terasa od 20 m2 ju¾ne orijentacije s koje se pru¾a pogled na more i pla¾u ispred kuæe.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæu zahtijeva odreðeno renoviranje, a postoji i moguænost nadogradnje jo&scaron; jednog kata.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Vrt je kultiviran mediteranskim biljem.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Uz cestu, a u sklopu parcele su tri parking mjesta.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa ima struju, vodu i septièku jamu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Udaljenost do obli¾njeg ribarskog mjesta, duæana, restorana i kafiæa je svega 3 km.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Aerodrom je udaljen 25 km.</p>', '<p>We have this attractive holiday villa just a few meters from the sea in beautiful quiet bay with access to the shore, which is a well maintained natural pebble beach.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house and garden are south facing with wide panoramic sea views.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The plot stretches from the road to the sea and the plot area is 488 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house consists of two floors, with a total floor area of 110m sq.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The ground floor is divided into an open plan style living area with an outdoor bbq/kitchen and a space where there is a water tank.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the first floor are two bedrooms, living room, kitchen and bathroom.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house on the south side is a large terrace of 20 m2 with a view of the sea and the beach in front of the house.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>House needs redecorating, and there is the opportunity to improve the property by adding an extra floor.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The garden has been landscaped and planted with Mediterranean plants, needing little maintenance.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property comes with three private parking places.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house has electricity, water and septic tank.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The distance to the nearby fishing village, with a small harbour, shops, restaurants and cafes is only 3 km, and is a wonderful cycle ride along the shore, or a couple of minutes by car.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The airport is 25 km.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact the office to arrange to visit this property.&nbsp;</p>', '', '1149_House-Villa_0.JPG', '1149_House-Villa_1.JPG', '1149_House-Villa_2.JPG', '1149_House-Villa_3.JPG', '1149_House-Villa_4.JPG', '1149_House-Villa_5.JPG', '1149_House-Villa_6.JPG', '1149_House-Villa_7.JPG', '1149_House-Villa_8.JPG'),
(1150, 'Danijela ', 'Skopin', 'Juran Tihomir  098 451 783', '098 209 425', 'ivan@interugos.hr', 'Murter', 'Vlake 2, Murter', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '80', '1500', '450', 1, '1500000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 8, 7, 'April 24, 2015', '<p>Apartmanska vila prvi red do mora, na atraktivnoj lokaciji, okru¾ena zelenilom.&nbsp;Vila je smje&scaron;tena u blizini prekrasne uvale, na udaljenosti 80 m od mora.&nbsp;Izgraðena je 2000. godine, te je kompletno namje&scaron;tena i opremljena.&nbsp;Teren na kojem je izgraðena ima povr&scaron;inu 1500 m2.&nbsp;Vila se sastoji od prizemlja i dva kata, ukupne neto povr&scaron;ine 450 m2.</p>', '<p>We are pleased to offer this apartment villa, close by the sea, in a stunning setting surrounded by greenery.&nbsp;The villa is situated 80 m from the sea, elevated from the shore line by the dramatic geography of the island, and with superb views out to the sea.&nbsp;It was built in 2000 and is fully furnished and equipped.&nbsp;The plot on which it was built has an area of 1500 m2.&nbsp;The villa consists of a ground floor and two floors, total 450 m2 net.&nbsp;</p>', '', '<p>Apartmanska vila prvi red do mora, na atraktivnoj lokaciji, okru¾ena zelenilom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Vila je smje&scaron;tena u blizini prekrasne uvale, na udaljenosti 80 m od mora.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Izgraðena je 2000. godine, te je kompletno namje&scaron;tena i opremljena.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Teren na kojem je izgraðena ima povr&scaron;inu 1500 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Vila se sastoji od prizemlja i dva kata.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U prizemlju se nalaze 2 apartmana i konoba s prostranom terasom i ro&scaron;tiljem.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Svaki od apartmana sadr¾i jednu spavaæu sobu, kupaonu, kuhinju, dnevni boravak, blagavaonu i terasu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na prvom katu se nalazi prostrani apartman koji sadr¾i jednu spavaæu sobu, kupaonu, kuhinju s blagavaonom, dnevni boravak i balkon.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na drugom katu su dva apartmana od kojih takoðer svaki sadr¾i po jednu spavaæu sobu, kupaonu, kuhinju s blagavaonom, dnevni boravak i balkon.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Svaki apartman pru¾a prekrasan panoramski pogled na more i Kornate.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Svi apartmani su povezani stepeni&scaron;tem, ali imaju i zaseban ulaz.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Orijentirana je zapadno.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Vili pripada 7 parking mjesta.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Posjeduje licencu za iznajmljivanje (3-4*).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Objekt je legaliziran, a vlasnik posjeduje graðevinsku i uporabnu dozvolu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Murter je cestovno povezan sa Zadrom i &Scaron;ibenikom.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Udaljenost od centra mjesta gdje se nalaze svi potrebni sadr¾aji je 800 m.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Udaljenost od zraène luke u Zadru je 60 km, dok je Split udaljen 80 km.</p>', '<p>We are pleased to offer this apartment villa, close by the sea, in a stunning setting surrounded by greenery.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The villa is situated 80 m from the sea, elevated from the shore line by the dramatic geography of the island, and with superb views out to the sea.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It was built in 2000 and is fully furnished and equipped.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The plot on which it was built has an area of 1500 m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The villa consists of a ground floor and two floors.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The ground floor has two apartments and a cellar, and with access to the spacious terrace with barbecue.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Each apartment has one bedroom, bathroom, kitchen, living room, dining room and terrace.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the first floor there is a spacious apartment that has one bedroom, bathroom, kitchen, dining room, living room and balcony.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the second floor there are two apartments each of which also contains one bedroom, bathroom, kitchen, dining room, living room and balcony.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Each apartment offers a wonderful and interesting panoramic view of the sea and the Kornati islands.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>All apartments are connected by a staircase, but also have a separate entrance.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The condition of the properties are excellent and the building was built and is well maintained.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Many tourists return continually, and demand is high for holidays in such a wonderful location.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is oriented west.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Villa has seven parking spaces.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It has a license to rent (3-4 *).&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property is legalized, and the owner has a building and use permit.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Murter has road connections with Zadar and Sibenik.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is 800 m from the town centre where there are family run restaurants, bars, a bakery, shops and other attractions and essential businesses for tourists and the local population alike.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The distance from the airport in Zadar is 60 km, and Split is 80 km.&nbsp;</p>', '', '1150_House-Villa_0.jpg', '1150_House-Villa_1.jpg', '1150_House-Villa_2.jpg', '1150_House-Villa_3.jpg', '1150_House-Villa_4.jpg', '1150_House-Villa_5.jpg', '1150_House-Villa_6.jpg', '1150_House-Villa_7.jpg', '1150_House-Villa_8.jpg'),
(1151, 'Vesna ', '©ariæ', '', '098 9977 955', '', 'Murter', 'Betina, Murter', 'For sale', 'Old stone house', '25', '0', '90', 2, '85000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 0, 0, 'April 24, 2015', '<p>Stara kamena kuæa na otoku Murteru, u blizini pla¾e, u centru mjesta.&nbsp;Nalazi se na poèetku ulice koja vodi na glavni trg.&nbsp;Kuæa se sastoji od prizemlja i dva kata.&nbsp;Iz drugog kata se mo¾e uæi u malo potkrovlje od kojeg se mo¾e napraviti terasa s koje bi se pru¾ao pogled na more.&nbsp;Kuæa zahtijeva kompletnu renovaciju. Tlocrtna povr&scaron;ina iznoci 65 m2, a sama kuæa ima oko 90 m2.</p>', '<p>We have this serious renovation project of a historic old stone house on the island of Murter, near the beach, and in the centre of town.&nbsp;It is situated in the same street that leads to the main square. The house consists of a ground floor and two floors.&nbsp;From the second floor there is access to the attic which, in renovation, can have the roof terrace incorporated giving fabulous views across the village and out to sea.&nbsp;The house requires complete renovation, inside and outside.&nbsp;Layout area is 65 m2 and the total living area has about 90 m2.&nbsp;</p>', '', '<p>Stara kamena kuæa na otoku Murteru, u blizini pla¾e, u centru mjesta.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nalazi se na poèetku ulice koja vodi na glavni trg.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa se sastoji od prizemlja i dva kata.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Iz drugog kata se mo¾e uæi u malo potkrovlje od kojeg se mo¾e napraviti terasa s koje bi se pru¾ao pogled na more.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa zahtijeva kompletnu renovaciju.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Tlocrtna povr&scaron;ina iznoci 65 m2, a sama kuæa ima oko 90 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Prikljuèeni su voda i struja, raèuni se mjeseèno plaæaju da se ne ukine dovod.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Mjesto se nalazi na otoku Murteru, na udaljenosti 7 km od Tisnog, a 65 km od Zadra.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Meðunarodni aerodrom u Splitu je udaljen 120 km.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>We have this serious renovation project of a historic old stone house on the island of Murter, near the beach, and in the centre of town.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is situated in the same street that leads to the main square.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house consists of a ground floor and two floors.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>From the second floor there is access to the attic which, in renovation, can have the roof terrace incorporated giving fabulous views across the village and out to sea.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house requires complete renovation, inside and outside.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Layout area is 65 m2 and the total living area has about 90 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The building is connected to water and electricity, and the bills are paid on a monthly basis so as not to have the supply cut.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The village is known for its beautiful, old stone work and traditional wood shipbuilding.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There is a long coastline promenade encourages recreation and gives a wonderful feel of friendliness.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The beaches are located in the village, and these are pebbly and easily accessible.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>They are ideal for families and children.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Murter is between Sibenik and Zadar, a small island closer to Sibenik.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is connected by bridge and Murter has the lucky option of being accessible by car at any time.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The place is located on the island of Murter, at a distance of 7 km from Tisno, and 65 km from Zadar international airport.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The international airport in Split is situated 120 km.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact our office for more details, and for help with possible costs for renovation, and to arrange a visit. &nbsp;</p>', '', '1151_Old-stone-house_0.jpg', '1151_Old-stone-house_1.jpg', '1151_Old-stone-house_2.jpg', '1151_Old-stone-house_3.jpg', '1151_Old-stone-house_4.jpg', '1151_Old-stone-house_5.jpg', '1151_Old-stone-house_6.jpg', '1151_Old-stone-house_7.jpg', '1151_Old-stone-house_8.jpg'),
(1152, 'Tracey', 'Watson', '', '+34 965 832 408', 'traceywatson@mail.com', 'Hvar', 'Predraga Bogdanica 7.  Stari Grad, 21460, Hvar', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '25', '0', '67', 1, '210000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 2, 2, 'April 24, 2015', '<p>Atraktivan apartman u prizemlju kuæe s pogledom na marinu, smje&scaron;ten u samom centru prelijepog mjesta na otoku Hvaru.&nbsp;Udaljen je 25 m od mora, te samo nekoliko minuta hoda do poznatih pla¾a.&nbsp;Ukupna stambena povr&scaron;ina iznosi 66.80 m2.&nbsp;Opremljen je i namje&scaron;ten po visokim standardima.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>We have this attractive apartment, on the ground floor overlooking the marina, located in the centre of this typical Dalmatian port on the north side of Hvar island. Total living area is 66.80 m2. It also has private, off street parking and private basement storage. It is fitted out for all year living, or for tourist breaks, with a log stove, washing machine and other features for easy living. This apartment is is finished to a very high standard with luxurious fittings and fixtures.</p>', '', '<p>Atraktivan apartman u prizemlju kuæe s pogledom na marinu, smje&scaron;ten u samom centru prelijepog mjesta na otoku Hvaru.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Udaljen je 25 m od mora , te samo nekoliko minuta hoda do poznatih pla¾a.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartman se sastoji od dvije spavaæe sobe, dvije kupaone, kuhinje, blagavaone, dnevnog boravka, ostave i prostrane terase (15 m2) s koje se pru¾a pogled na more i mjesto.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ukupna stambena povr&scaron;ina iznosi 66.80 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Opremljen je i namje&scaron;ten po visokim standardima.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ima prikljuèene vodu i struju (djelomièno se koristi solarna energija).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Orijentiran je sjeverno.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sama zgrada sastoji se od 6 apartmana , a sagraðena je 2004. godine.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartman je izvanredno oèuvan, buduæi da ga vlasnici nisu iznajmljivali od 2008. godine.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartman ima privatan parking.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Grad Hvar je udaljen 14 km, dok je trajektna luka na udaljenosti cca 1 km.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Svi potrebni sadr¾aji poput prodavaonica, kafiæa i restorana &nbsp;nalaze se u neposrednoj blizini, tek 5 minuta hoda.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Molimo Vas za &nbsp;vi&scaron;e informacije kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>We have this attractive apartment, on the ground floor overlooking the marina, located in the centre of this typical Dalmatian port on the north side of Hvar island.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Total living area is 66.80 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The apartment has two bedrooms, two bathrooms, kitchen, dining room, living room, utility room and a spacious terrace (15 m2) with a view to the sea and the resort.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It also has private, off street parking and private basement storage.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is fitted out for all year living, or for tourist breaks, with a log stove, washing machine and other features for easy living.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>This apartment is is finished to a very high standard with luxurious fittings and fixtures.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is oriented north.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It has been lovingly maintained by the owners since 2008 this property has never been rented out to holiday makers and is therefore in immaculate and very new condition.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The apartment building is made up of 6 separate apartments, all owned privately owned. &nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>This building was erected in 2004 by a renowned local builder and the building is often referred to as the best apartment block for miles around.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The apartment is perfectly located being 20 meters from the sea and sits on the edge of the old town, a 5 minute walk away to the many shops, bars, bakery, and restaurants.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Bathing beaches and boating facilities are right on the door step and the ferry port is less than a 1 km away.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The town of Hvar is 14 km, while the ferry port at a distance of about 1 km.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please for more information contact our office.</p>', '', '1152_Apartment_0.jpg', '1152_Apartment_1.JPG', '1152_Apartment_2.JPG', '1152_Apartment_3.JPG', '1152_Apartment_4.jpg', '1152_Apartment_5.JPG', '1152_Apartment_6.JPG', '1152_Apartment_7.JPG', '1152_Apartment_8.jpg');
INSERT INTO `nekretnina` (`id`, `ime`, `prezime`, `telefon`, `mobitel`, `e_mail`, `lokacija_id`, `adresa`, `status_id`, `vrsta_id`, `udaljenost`, `povrsina`, `stambenapovrsina`, `display`, `cijena`, `cijenatocka`, `ponuda_tjedna`, `new_built`, `must_sell`, `prvi_red_do_mora`, `pogled_na_more`, `bazen`, `broj_soba`, `broj_kupatila`, `datum`, `title_hr`, `title_en`, `title_ge`, `opis_hr`, `opis_en`, `opis_ge`, `PropertyImageURL0`, `PropertyImageURL1`, `PropertyImageURL2`, `PropertyImageURL3`, `PropertyImageURL4`, `PropertyImageURL5`, `PropertyImageURL6`, `PropertyImageURL7`, `PropertyImageURL8`) VALUES
(1153, 'Veronika', 'Ra¹kopoljac', '', '021/461-831', '', 'Split', 'Miliæeva 66', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '200', '0', '34', 2, '60000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 1, 'April 24, 2015', '<p>Jednosoban stan u dvojnoj kuæi, u centru grada, na odliènoj lokaciji.&nbsp;Stan se nalazi u mirnom predjelu, a u blizini svih potrebnih sadr¾aja.&nbsp;Ima povr&scaron;inu 34 m2, te zahtijeva potpunu renovaciju.&nbsp;Stan je na lokaciji koja je vrlo atraktivna kako za miran i ugodan ¾ivot, tako i za turistièko iznajmljivanje.</p>', '<p>We are pleased to offer this one bedroom apartment in the ''Varos'' area of the old part of Split.&nbsp;It requires refurbishment as it is currently uninhabitable with no furniture or fittings.&nbsp;It is situated on the Marjan hill, between the park and the Riva and Diocletian Palace. It has an area of 34 m2, and is laid out to have one bathroom and two rooms that are an open plan living room with kitchen and one bedroom. The apartment is in a location that is very attractive for both peaceful and comfortable living, and also suitable for tourist rental.&nbsp;</p>', '', '<p>Jednosoban stan u dvojnoj kuæi, u centru grada, na odliènoj lokaciji.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Stan se nalazi u mirnom predjelu, a u blizini svih potrebnih sadr¾aja. &nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ima povr&scaron;inu 34 m2, te zahtijeva potpunu renovaciju.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sastoji se od jedne kupaone i dvije prostorije koje su predviðene za spavaæu sobu te kuhinju s blagavaonom.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Stan ima prikljuèke na vodu i struju.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U blizini je parking.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Centar grada udaljen je svega nekoliko minuta &scaron;etnje.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U blizini se nalaze i trajektna luka, autobusna i ¾eljeznièka stanica.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Meðunarodni aerodrom 30 min vo¾nje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Stan je na lokaciji koja je vrlo atraktivna kako za miran i ugodan ¾ivot, tako i za turistièko iznajmljivanje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za razgledavanje stojimo vam na usluzi.</p>', '<p>We are pleased to offer this one bedroom apartment in the ''Varos'' area of the old part of Split.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It requires refurbishment as it is currently uninhabitable with no furniture or fittings.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is situated on the Marjan hill, between the park and the Riva and Diocletian Palace.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>This area has many narrow streets, and although there is access for deliveries etc.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is mostly ''pedestrian only'' ensuring it is always peaceful and quiet, but still in walking distance to the ferry terminal, the Palace, the Riva, Marina and most of the historic and cultural attractions in the town.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It has an area of 34 m2, and is laid out to have one bathroom and two rooms that are an open plan living room with kitchen and one bedroom.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The apartment has connections to water and electricity.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nearby is parking.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The International Airport is 30 minutes drive.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The apartment is in a location that is very attractive for both peaceful and comfortable living, and also suitable for tourist rental.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact the office to arrange to see this property.&nbsp;</p>', '', '1153_Apartment_0.jpg', '1153_Apartment_1.jpg', '1153_Apartment_2.jpg', '1153_Apartment_3.jpg', '1153_Apartment_4.jpg', '1153_Apartment_5.jpg', '', '', ''),
(1154, 'Velimir ', 'Nanjara', '091 799 0664, 022/350-139', '', 'ruzmarino@gmail.com', 'Sibenik', 'Jadrtovac pokraj ©ibenika, Morinjski zaljev', 'For sale', 'Land plot', '60', '1660', '0', 1, '160000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 0, 0, 'April 27, 2015', '<p>Graðevinsko zemlji&scaron;te smje&scaron;teno na odliènoj lokaciji, samo 60 m od mora, u blizini &Scaron;ibenika.&nbsp;Nalazi se na blago zako&scaron;enom terenu, okru¾enom zelenilom, s prekrasnim pogledom na zaljev.&nbsp;Ima povr&scaron;inu 1660 m2.&nbsp;Prikljuèci na vodu, struju i telefon se nalaze u blizini.&nbsp;Na zemlji&scaron;tu se mogu izgraditi stambeno &ndash; poslovni objekti.</p>', '<p>For builders and investors.&nbsp;We have this building plot situated in a prime location, just 60 m from the sea, near Sibenik.&nbsp;It is situated on a slightly inclined terrain, surrounded by greenery, thus ensuring commanding views overlooking the bay and surrounding natural terrain.&nbsp;The plot is large, it has an area 1660 m2.&nbsp;Water and telephone are already in place, and there is an access road coming from the northeast.&nbsp;</p>', '', '<p>Graðevinsko zemlji&scaron;te smje&scaron;teno na odliènoj lokaciji, samo 60 m od mora, u blizini &Scaron;ibenika.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nalazi se na blago zako&scaron;enom terenu, okru¾enom zelenilom, s prekrasnim pogledom na zaljev.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ima povr&scaron;inu 1660 m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Prikljuèci na vodu, struju i telefon se nalaze u blizini.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na zemlji&scaron;tu se mogu izgraditi stambeno &ndash; poslovni objekti.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Do zemlji&scaron;te se dolazi pristupnim putem sa sjeveroistoène strane.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Vlasni&scaron;tvo 1/1.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Mjesto je poznato po ribarstvu, idealno za obiteljski odmor u netaknutoj prirodi.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sam zaljev je turistièki popularan te te udovoljava onima koji tra¾e mirna podruèja.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Mnogim nautièarima ovaj zaljev je postao redovita stanica ljetnih krstarenja.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Centar mjesta je udaljen samo 100 m od zemlji&scaron;ta, svega nekoliko minuta od restorana, kafiæa i duæana.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&Scaron;ibenik je udaljen 4 km.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Meðunarodni aerodrom u Splitu je na udaljenosti 45 km.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za sve dodatne informacije molimo kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured u Splitu.</p>', '<p>For builders and investors.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>We have this building plot situated in a prime location, just 60 m from the sea, near Sibenik.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is situated on a slightly inclined terrain, surrounded by greenery, thus ensuring commanding views overlooking the bay and surrounding natural terrain.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The plot is large, it has an area 1660 m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Water and telephone are already in place, and there is an access road coming from the northeast.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The area is known for its fishing, is ideal for family holidays in unspoiled nature.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The bay itself is great for tourists looking for quiet, relaxing and unaffected bays and beaches and many boaters enjoy cruising past this bay which has become a regular stop on their summer cruises.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The centre of the village is just 100 m from the land, just minutes from restaurants, caf&eacute;s and shops.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sibenik is about 4 km away.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The international airport of Split is at a distance of 45 km.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For further information and to arrange to view this property, please contact our office in Split.&nbsp;</p>', '', '1154_Land-plot_0.jpg', '1154_Land-plot_1.jpg', '1154_Land-plot_2.jpg', '1154_Land-plot_3.jpg', '1154_Land-plot_4.jpg', '', '', '', ''),
(1155, 'Josip ', 'Bilic', '0044 7984 663596', '', 'deawindross@yahoo.co.uk', 'Makarska', 'Kotisina, Makarska, UDIO: 636/5199  3750/1', 'For sale', 'Land plot', '800', '600', '0', 1, '120000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 0, 0, 'April 27, 2015', '<p>Zemlji&scaron;te u Makarskoj s prekrasnim panoramskim pogledom na planine, more, otok Braè, te grad Makarsku.&nbsp;Udaljeno je od mora 800 m.&nbsp;Zemlji&scaron;te ima povr&scaron;inu 600 m2, a trenutno se tu nalaze stabla maslina.&nbsp;Zemlji&scaron;te ima pristupni put i parking, te prikljuèke na vodu i struju.&nbsp;Zemlji&scaron;te ima graðevinsku dozvolu, te se na njemu mogu sagraditi dvije manje kuæe ili prostrana vila.</p>', '<p>We have this land plot in Makarska with a beautiful panoramic view of the mountains, the sea, island of Brac, and the town of Makarska.&nbsp;It is situated 800m from the sea, and 100m from the road that runs between the centre of Makarska (and onto Split) and Dubrovnik.&nbsp;Land (600 m2) has a building permit, and on it you can build two small houses or spacious villa.&nbsp;</p>', '', '<p>Zemlji&scaron;te u Makarskoj s prekrasnim panoramskim pogledom na planine, more, otok Braè, te grad Makarsku.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Udaljeno je od mora 800 m.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Zemlji&scaron;te ima povr&scaron;inu 600 m2, a trenutno se tu nalaze stabla maslina.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Zemlji&scaron;te ima pristupni put i parking, te prikljuèke na vodu i struju.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Cesta koja vodi do zemlji&scaron;ta smje&scaron;tena je na uzvisini, 100 m od glavne Dubrovaèke ceste koja prolazi kroz Makarsku.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Zemlji&scaron;te ima graðevinsku dozvolu, te se na njemu mogu sagraditi dvije manje kuæe ili prostrana vila. Na prodaju se nudi suvlasnièki udio u èestici zemlje.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Najbli¾e mjesto se nalazi na 300 m udaljenosti, a Makarska je 600 m udaljena.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Makarska Rivijera obiluje pje&scaron;èanim i &scaron;ljunèanim pla¾ama, te razlièitim turistièkim sadr¾ajima. &nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Aerodrom u Splitu udaljen je 98 km.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za sve dodatne informacije molimo kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured u Splitu.</p>', '<p>We have this land plot in Makarska with a beautiful panoramic view of the mountains, the sea, island of Brac, and the town of Makarska.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is situated 800m from the sea, and 100m from the road that runs between the centre of Makarska (and onto Split) and Dubrovnik.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Land has a building permit, and on it you can build two small houses or spacious villa. Please note that the offer refers to co-ownership part in a large plot.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nearest village with cafes, bars and shops is located 300 m away, and Makarska is 600 m away.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The Makarska Riviera is rich in sand and pebble beaches, and has a variety of tourist attractions.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The Split airport is 98 km away.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For further information and to visit this property please contact our office in Split.&nbsp;</p>', '', '1155_Land-plot_0.jpg', '1155_Land-plot_1.jpg', '1155_Land-plot_2.jpg', '1155_Land-plot_3.jpg', '', '', '', '', ''),
(1157, 'Tereza', '©egviæ', '095/911-7458', '', 'villamucho@gmail.com', 'Split', 'Put Jerkoviæa 79 Privor ®rnovnica', 'For sale', 'Old stone house', '4000', '274', '172', 2, '130000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 3, 2, 'April 30, 2015', '<p>Samostojeæa stara kamena kuæa sa pogledom na more u mirnom dijelu daleko od gu¾ve i buke, idealna za odmor i u¾ivanje.&nbsp;Smje&scaron;tena je na zemlji&scaron;tu povr&scaron;ine 274 m2 sa lijepo ureðenom okuænicom.&nbsp;Do mora i pla¾e je udaljenost 4 km &scaron;to je nekih 15 minuta vo¾nje. Kuæa se sastoji od prizemlja, 1., 2., i 3. kata ukupne stambene povr&scaron;ina 160 m2. U dvori&scaron;tu se nalazi jedna dodatna kuæica (12 m2) koja je trenutno u funkciji spreme.</p>', '<p>We have this excellent value traditional stone house with sea views, high above Split in the mountains. It is situated on a land area of 274 m2 with a beautifully maintained garden. The sea and the beach is 4 km distance which is about 15 minutes drive, and the drive to Split is about 25 minutes. The house consists of ground, first, second, and third floors with a total floor area of 160 m2. In the backyard there is one additional small house of 12 m2.</p>', '', '<p>Samostojeæa stara kamena kuæa sa pogledom na more u mirnom dijelu daleko od gu¾ve i buke, idealna za odmor i u¾ivanje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Smje&scaron;tena je na zemlji&scaron;tu povr&scaron;ine 274 m2 sa lijepo ureðenom okuænicom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Do mora i pla¾e je udaljenost 4 km &scaron;to je nekih 15 minuta vo¾nje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa se sastoji od prizemlja, 1., 2., i 3. kata ukupne stambene povr&scaron;ina 160 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U dvori&scaron;tu se nalazi jedna dodatna kuæica (12 m2) koja je trenutno u funkciji spreme.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U prizemlju su smje&scaron;tene kuhinja + blagovaonica i konoba.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na 1. katu je smje&scaron;tena kupaonica, wc, dnevni boravak i balkon.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na 2. katu su 2 spavaæe sobe, dok je na 3. katu jedna spavaæa soba, dnevni boravak + balkon sa prekrasnim pogledom.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je veæ 5 godina u funkciji turistièkog iznajmljivanja stoga je moguæe nastaviti veæ uhodani posao.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Do centra povijesnog grada Splita ima cca 15 km.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za sve dodatne informacije stojimo vam na raspolaganju.</p>', '<p>We have this excellent value traditional stone house with sea views, high above Split in the mountains.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is situated on a land area of 274 m2 with a beautifully maintained garden.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The sea and the beach is 4 km distance which is about 15 minutes drive, and the drive to Split is about 25 minutes.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house consists of ground, first, second, and third floors with a total floor area of 160 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>In the backyard there is one additional small house (12 m2), and an application has been submitted for this property to be incorporated in the deeds of the house.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The ground floor has a kitchen, dining room and wine cellar.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the 1st floor there is one bathroom, toilet, living room and balcony.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the 2nd floor there are 2 bedrooms, and a staircase up to the 3rd floor where there is a bedroom, living room with a balcony with a beautiful view.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house has been used for 5 years for Tourism and is therefore possible to continue with this well-established business.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The center of the historic city of Split is approximately 15 km.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact our office for details about this and similar properties in the area, and to arrange a viewing.</p>', '', '1157_Old-stone-house_0.jpg', '1157_Old-stone-house_1.jpg', '1157_Old-stone-house_2.jpg', '1157_Old-stone-house_3.jpg', '1157_Old-stone-house_4.jpg', '1157_Old-stone-house_5.jpg', '1157_Old-stone-house_6.jpg', '1157_Old-stone-house_7.jpg', '1157_Old-stone-house_8.jpg'),
(1158, 'Marko', 'Jug-Dujakoviæ', '+385 (0)  98 292 455', '', 'marko.jug-dujakovic@croatianland.com', 'Trogir', 'Punta Feral Marina, 290/9 k.o. Marina', 'For sale', 'Land plot', '50', '1450', '0', 1, '185000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 0, 0, 'April 30, 2015', '<p>Graðevinsko zemlji&scaron;te na izvrsnoj lokaciji smje&scaron;teno u 3. redu od mora, udaljeno svega 50 m od prekrasne pla¾e koja garantira mir i privatnost.&nbsp;Trokutastog je oblika sa direktnim pristupnim putom sve do samog zemlji&scaron;ta.&nbsp;Ukupna povr&scaron;ina je 1450 m2.&nbsp;Posjeduje graðevinsku dozvolu za objekt ukupne povr&scaron;ine 116 m2 sa veæ izgraðenim temeljima.</p>', '<p>For builders, and investors. We have this building plot, in a great location with spectacular sea views, and with the foundations and basement already completed. It is situated about 30 m from the shore, in the third row of villas, but on a sloping bank that will ensure the views will stay unobstructed. The plot of 1450 m2 is triangular in shape with direct access from the road to the land itself. The building permit allows for a 116 m2 usable area house.</p>', '', '<p>Graðevinsko zemlji&scaron;te na izvrsnoj lokaciji smje&scaron;teno u 3. redu od mora, udaljeno svega 50 m od prekrasne pla¾e koja garantira mir i privatnost.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Zemlji&scaron;te se nalazi u malom turistièkom mjestu udaljeno 15 min. od povijesnog grada Trogira i 20 min. od meðunarodnog aerodroma.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Centar mjesta gdje se nalaze svi potrebni sadr¾aji udaljen je 2 min. vo¾nje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U blizini se takoðer nalazi i marina za jahte.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Trokutastog je oblika sa direktnim pristupnim putem sve do samog zemlji&scaron;ta.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ukupna povr&scaron;ina je 1450 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Posjeduje graðevinsku dozvolu za objekt ukupne povr&scaron;ine 116 m2 sa veæ izgraðenim temeljima.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Svi doprinosi su plaæeni stoga je moguæe odmah poèeti sa izgradnjom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Prikljuèci vode, struje i telefona su udaljeni cca. 800 m od zemlji&scaron;ta.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ukoliko imate dodatna pitanja molimo da nas kontaktirate.</p>', '<p>For builders, and investors.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>We have this building plot, in a great location with spectacular sea views, and with the foundations and basement already completed.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>This project is ready to start immediately.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is situated about 30m from the shore, in the third row of villas, but on a sloping bank that will ensure the views will stay unobstructed.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is near the village of Marina, on the mainland, close To the larger town of Trogir, a UNESCO heritage site and a magnet for tourists enjoying the historic and cultural treasures on the region.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property is easily accessible down a short gravel road, and is just outside the village.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The plot is triangular in shape with direct access from the road to the land itself.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is perfectly sloped and affords spectacular views of the bay.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The beach is only 30m away.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The total land area is 1450 m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property has an existing building permit with foundations and the basement already completed.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The building permit allows for a 116m2 usable area house.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Building can commence immediately as all fees have been paid up.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>If desired, an application for extension of the house can be submitted.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Connections for water, electricity and telephone are approx. 800 m from the land.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The centre where there are some shops, bars, cafes and other facilities is 2 minutes driving.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nearby is also a large (ACI) marina for yachts.&nbsp;20 min. from the international airport.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact the office if &nbsp;you have any questions, and to arrange to visit this site.&nbsp;</p>', '', '1158_Land-plot_0.jpg', '1158_Land-plot_1.jpg', '1158_Land-plot_2.jpg', '1158_Land-plot_3.jpg', '1158_Land-plot_4.jpg', '1158_Land-plot_5.jpg', '1158_Land-plot_6.jpg', '1158_Land-plot_7.jpg', '1158_Land-plot_8.jpg'),
(1462, 'Kristina', 'Medvidoviæ', '', '095 815 6917', 'josip.medvidovic3@st.t-com.hr', 'Brac', 'Milna 1012  Milna, 2411/5 k.o. milna', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '170', '0', '35', 1, '85000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 1, 'November 20, 2015', '<p>Prodajemo lijepi prizemni stan svega 170 metara zracne linije od mora u mirnom dijelu malog mjesta na otoku Bracu.&nbsp;Apartman ima dva ulaza, a sastoji se od hodnika, dnevnog boravka i kuhinje, dvije spavaæe sobe i kupaonice, stambene povr&scaron;ine 34,53 m2, sa dodatkom loðe 5,72 m2 te vrta (natkrivena terasa) 28,90 m2.&nbsp;Stan je klimatiziran te u cijelosti namje&scaron;ten i opremljen. Zgrada ima zajednièki bazen za stanare.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>We have this lovely ground floor apartment for sale, located only 170 meters from the sea in a peaceful residential area of a small town on Brac island.&nbsp;Apartment has 2 entrances and consists of a hallway, living room, kitchen, two bedrooms and bathroom, sized 34,53 sqm, with the addition of loggia 5,72 sqm and garden (covered terrace) 28,90 sqm.&nbsp;The property is air-conditioned and fully furnished. The building has communal pool. &nbsp;</p>', '', '<p><strong>Prizemni stan u blizini mora</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Prodajemo lijepi prizemni stan svega 170 metara zracne linije od mora u mirnom dijelu malog mjesta na otoku Bracu.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartman ima dva ulaza, a sastoji se od hodnika, dnevnog boravka i kuhinje, dvije spavaæe sobe i kupaonice, stambene povr&scaron;ine 34,53 m2, sa dodatkom loðe 5,72 m2 te vrta (natkrivena terasa) 28,90 m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Stan je klimatiziran te u cijelosti namje&scaron;ten i opremljen.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Zgrada ima zajednièki bazen za stanare.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za sve dodatne informacije molimo kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured u Splitu.&nbsp;</p>', '<p><strong>Ground floor apartment near the sea</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>We have this lovely ground floor apartment for sale, located only 170 meters from the sea in a peaceful residential area of a small town on Brac island.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartment has 2 entrances and consists of a hallway, living room, kitchen, two bedrooms and bathroom, sized 34,53 sqm, with the addition of loggia 5,72 sqm and garden (covered terrace) 28,90 sqm.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property is air-conditioned and fully furnished.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The building has communal pool. &nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For further information please contact our office in Split.</p>', '', '1462_Apartment_0.jpg', '1462_Apartment_1.jpg', '1462_Apartment_2.jpg', '1462_Apartment_3.jpg', '1462_Apartment_4.jpg', '1462_Apartment_5.jpg', '1462_Apartment_6.jpg', '1462_Apartment_7.jpg', ''),
(1159, 'Petar', 'Jeliæ', '091/5088-290', 'Mladen Jeliæ - kljuè', 'mjelicespanol@yahoo.es', 'Sibenik', 'Prviæ ©epurine, 323 zgr KO Prvic', 'For sale', 'Old stone house', '100', '0', '70', 2, '45000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 3, 1, 'May 4, 2015', '<p>&Scaron;armantna stara kamena kuæa na otoku Prviæu, u &scaron;ibenskom arhipelagu, s prekrasnim pogledom na more i mjesto.&nbsp;Udaljena od mora samo 100 m, smje&scaron;tena u mirnom podruèju, 50 m od samoga centra mjesta.&nbsp;Sastoji se od prizemlja, dva kata i tavana ukupne stambene povr&scaron;ine 70 m2.</p>', '<p>We have this charming old stone house as a renovation project on the island Prvic, in the Sibenik archipelago.&nbsp;It is only 100 m from the sea, situated in a quiet area, and just 50 m from the centre of this historic village. The building inside has a ground floor, first and second floor and an attic. The total living area is 70 m2.</p>', '', '<p>&Scaron;armantna stara kamena kuæa na otoku Prviæu, u &scaron;ibenskom arhipelagu, s prekrasnim pogledom na more i mjesto.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Udaljena od mora samo 100 m, smje&scaron;tena u mirnom podruèju, 50 m od samoga centra mjesta.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sastoji se od prizemlja, dva kata i tavana ukupne stambene povr&scaron;ine 70 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Prizemlje se sastoji od jedne prostorije i kupaone.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na prvom katu se nalazi jedna soba, a na drugom katu su dvije sobe i kuhinja.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Zahtijeva kompletnu renovaciju.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Orijentirana je sjeverno.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ima prikljuèke na vodu i struju.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Mjesto je udaljeno od Vodica 5 minuta brodom, a od grada &Scaron;ibenika sat vremena (pet brodskih linija dnevno u oba smjera).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Otok obiluje &scaron;ljunèanim i pje&scaron;èanim pla¾ama &nbsp;i uvalama, te je prirodni nastavak otoka Zlarina.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Poznat je po kristalno èistom moru, te je turistièki popularan.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Zraène luke Zadar i Split su udaljene manje od 50 km.</p>', '<p>We have this charming old stone house as a renovation project on the island Prvic, in the Sibenik archipelago.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is only 100 m from the sea, situated in a quiet area, and just 50 m from thecentre of this historic village.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The building inside has a ground floor, first and second floor and an attic.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The total living area is 70 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The ground floor consists of one room and bathroom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the first floor there is one bedroom and on the second floor are twobedrooms and a kitchen.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Requires complete renovation.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is oriented north, and it has beautiful views of the village and out to seaIt has connections to water and electricity.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The location is not far from Vodice, 5 minutes by boat, from the city ofSibenik is one hour (there are five shipping lines daily in each direction).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The island is full of sandy beaches and bays, and is a naturalextension of the neighbouring island of Zlarin, which is known for its crystal clear waters, andis a popular tourist.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Zadar Airport and Split are less than 50 km.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For further information please contact our office in Split.</p>', '', '1159_Old-stone-house_0.jpg', '1159_Old-stone-house_1.jpg', '1159_Old-stone-house_2.jpg', '1159_Old-stone-house_3.JPG', '1159_Old-stone-house_4.JPG', '1159_Old-stone-house_5.JPG', '1159_Old-stone-house_6.jpg', '1159_Old-stone-house_7.jpg', '1159_Old-stone-house_8.jpg'),
(1161, '', 'Dalmatian Home', '', '', 'info@dalmatianhome.com', 'Rogoznica', '', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '20', '450', '295', 1, '530000', '', 2, 1, 2, 2, 1, 1, 4, 5, 'May 5, 2015', '<p>Moderna villa sa bazenom u 2.redu do mora smje&scaron;tena u Rogoznici.&nbsp;Nalazi se svega 20m zraène linije od mora i prirodnih pla¾a, a iz same nekretnine se mo¾e u¾ivati u lijepom pogledu na more i obli¾nje otoke. Ukupna kvadratura objekta iznosi 294,75, dok je povr&scaron;ina parcele 450m2.&nbsp;Gradnja je zapoèeta 2015.godine, a planirani zavr&scaron;etak radova æe biti krajem 2016.</p>', '<p>Modern villa with swimming pool in the 2nd row to the sea in Rogoznica.&nbsp;It is located only 20 meters away from the sea and natural beach, and owners of the property, can enjoy the beautiful view of the sea and nearby islands. The total living area of the building is 294.75m2 and the size of the plot is 450m2.&nbsp;Construction began in 2015., and the planned completion of the work will be till the end of 2016.&nbsp;</p>', '', '<p>Moderna villa sa bazenom u 2.redu do mora smje&scaron;tena u Rogoznici.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nalazi se svega 20m zraène linije od mora i prirodnih pla¾a, a iz same nekretnine se mo¾e u¾ivati u lijepom pogledu na more i obli¾nje otoke.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ukupna kvadratura objekta iznosi 294,75, dok je povr&scaron;ina parcele 450m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Suteren (95,8m2) se sastoji od dnevnog boravka sa izlazom na terasu, kuhinje, ulaznog dijela, kupaonice, 2 spremi&scaron;ta i praonice.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U prizemlju (91,33m2) se nalaze 3 spavaæe sobe, svaka sa svojom pripadajuæom kupaonicom, garderoba, terasa i gara¾a sa stra¾nje strane kuæe.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na prvom katu (107,62m2) je smje&scaron;tena spavaæa soba sa kupaonicom, mini kuhinjom, te prostranom natkrivenom terasom od 72,73m2.<br /><br /></p>\r\n<p>Unutar okuænice se nalazi bazen od 18m2, vrt, terasa, te parking za 2 automobila.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Villa se prodaje po sistemu kljuè u ruke, a u cijeni je ukljuèeno kompletno ureðenje i opremanje interijera (bez namje&scaron;taja) i dekoriranje okuænice.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U fazi gradnje moguæ je izbor keramike, sanitarija, te parketa po ¾elji kupca.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Cijena takoðer ukljuèuje klimatizaciju u cijelom objektu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Gradnja je zapoèeta 2015.godine, a planirani zavr&scaron;etak radova æe biti krajem 2016.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>NAPOMENA: u prodaji su dvije vile, vila sa istocne strane (lijeva ako se gleda put mora) cijene je 580.000 &euro;, dok je cijena vile sa zapadne strane (desna ako se gleda put mora) 530.000 &euro;.</p>', '<p>Modern villa with swimming pool in the 2nd row to the sea in Rogoznica.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is located only 20 meters away from the sea and natural beach, and owners of the property, can enjoy the beautiful view of the sea and nearby islands.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The total living area of the building is 294.75m2 and the size of the plot is 450m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Basement (95,8m2) consists of a living room with terrace, kitchen, entrance area, bathroom, 2 storage rooms and laundry.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The ground floor (91,33m2) comprises 3 bedrooms, each with its own bathroom, dressing room, terrace and the garage at the back side of the house.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the first floor (107,62m2) there is master bedroom with bathroom, small kitchen, and a spacious terrace of 72,73m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The price includes the complete finishing and equipping the interior (without the furniture) and decorating the garden.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There is possibility to select ceramics, sanitary ware, and parquet on customer request, in construction phase of building.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Price also includes air conditioning throughout the house.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Construction began in 2015., and the planned completion of the work will be till the end of 2016.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>NOTE: there are two villas for sale, the villa from the east side (left when you look at the sea) is at the price of 580.000 &euro; and the price of the villa from the west side (right when you look at the sea) is 530.000 &euro;.</p>', '', '1161_House-Villa_0.jpg', '1161_House-Villa_1.jpg', '1161_House-Villa_2.jpg', '1161_House-Villa_3.jpg', '1161_House-Villa_4.jpg', '1161_House-Villa_5.jpg', '1161_House-Villa_6.jpg', '1161_House-Villa_7.jpg', '1161_House-Villa_8.jpg'),
(1162, '', 'Dalmatian Home', '', '', 'info@dalmatianhome.com', 'Rogoznica', 'Ra¾anj', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '5', '450', '218', 1, '770000', '', 2, 1, 2, 1, 1, 1, 4, 4, 'May 5, 2015', '<p>Atraktivna moderna villa sa bazenom 1.redu u Rogoznici.&nbsp;Nalazi se svega 5-6m od mora i prirodnih pla¾a, a iz nekretnine se pru¾a neometani pogled na more i obli¾nje otoke.&nbsp;Kvadratura ville iznosi 217,78m2, dok je povr&scaron;ina parcele na kojoj se villa nalazi 450m2.&nbsp;Gradnja je zapoèeta 2015.godine, a planirani zavr&scaron;etak radova æe biti krajem 2016.godine.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>Attractive modern villa with the swimming pool situated in 1st row to the sea in Rogoznica.&nbsp;It is only 5-6m from the sea and natural beach, and the property provides unobstructed views of the sea and nearby islands.&nbsp;Total size of the villa is 217,78m2, while the size of the land is 450m2.&nbsp;Construction began in 2015., and the planned completion of the work will be till the end of 2016.&nbsp;</p>', '', '<p>Atraktivna moderna villa sa bazenom 1.redu u Rogoznici.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nalazi se svega 5-6m od mora i prirodnih pla¾a, a iz nekretnine se pru¾a neometani pogled na more i obli¾nje otoke.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kvadratura ville iznosi 217,78m2, dok je povr&scaron;ina parcele na kojoj se villa nalazi 450m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Unutar okuænice se nalazi bazen, vrt, terasa, te parking za 2 automobila.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Koncept ville je osmi&scaron;ljen za odmor i relaksaciju jedne velike obitelji.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U prizemlju se nalazi prostrani dnevni boravak sa izlazom na terasu, jedna spavaæa soba sa vlastitom kupaonicom, zatim odvojeni manji WC, garderoba, praonica, te kotlovnica sa vanjskim (odvojenim) ulazom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na 1.eta¾i se nalaze 3 spavaæe sobe, svaka sa vlastitom kupaonicom, 2 garderobe i terasa.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sa stra¾nje strane kuæe se nalazi i gara¾a od 22,2m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Villa se prodaje po sistemu kljuè u ruke, a u cijeni je ukljuèeno kompletno ureðenje i opremanje interijera (bez namje&scaron;taja) i dekoriranje okuænice.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U fazi gradnje moguæ je izbor keramike, sanitarija, te parketa po ¾elji kupca.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Cijena takoðer ukljuèuje klimatizaciju u cijelom objektu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Gradnja je zapoèeta 2015.godine, a planirani zavr&scaron;etak radova æe biti krajem 2016.godine.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>Attractive modern villa with the swimming pool situated in 1st row to the sea in Rogoznica.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is only 5-6m from the sea and natural beach, and the property provides unobstructed views of the sea and nearby islands.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Total size of the villa is 217,78m2, while the size of the land is 450m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Within the garden there is a pool, garden, terrace and parking for 2 cars.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The concept of the villa is designed for relaxation and accomodaton of one big family.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The ground floor has a spacious living room with terrace, one bedroom with its own bathroom, smaller separate toilet, dressing room, laundry room and a boiler room with external (separate) entrance.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the 1st floor there are 3 bedrooms, each with private bathroom, 2 dressing rooms and a terrace.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the back side of the house there is a garage of 22,2m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The price includes the complete finishing and equipping the interior (without the furniture) and decorating the garden.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There is possibility to select ceramics, sanitary ware, and parquet on customer request, in construction phase of building.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Price also includes air conditioning throughout the house.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Construction began in 2015., and the planned completion of the work will be till the end of 2016.&nbsp;</p>', '', '1162_House-Villa_0.jpg', '1162_House-Villa_1.jpg', '1162_House-Villa_2.jpg', '1162_House-Villa_3.jpg', '1162_House-Villa_4.jpg', '1162_House-Villa_5.jpg', '1162_House-Villa_6.jpg', '1162_House-Villa_7.jpg', '1162_House-Villa_8.jpg'),
(1163, '', 'Bertozzini d.o.o.', '', 'Andrea Ricci, +39 335 7377349', 'anricci@bertozzini.it', 'Omis', 'Mediæi', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '20', '1554', '0', 2, '650000', '', 2, 2, 2, 1, 1, 2, 0, 0, 'May 5, 2015', '<p>ZEMLJI&Scaron;TE SA ZAPOÈETOM IZGRADNJOM NA IZNIMNOJ LOKACIJI, PRVI RED UZ MORE.&nbsp;Na svega 10 minuta udaljenosti autom od Omi&scaron;a prodaje se graðevna parcela povr&scaron;ine 1.550 m2, prvi red uz more i prekrasnu pla¾u.&nbsp;Zemlji&scaron;te je kaskadnog oblika, sa oformljenim potpornim kamenim zidovima, a na njemu je zapoèeta gradnja objekta na tri eta¾e, ukupne povr&scaron;ine cca. 660 m2. &nbsp;</p>', '<p>SEAFRONT BUILDING LAND WITH COMMENCED CONSTRUCTION ON SUPERB LOCATION.&nbsp;At only 10 min car ride from Omis we have this wonderful seafront building plot for sale. Sized 1.550 sq.m and overlooking gorgeous beach towards the open sea.&nbsp;A construction of a large building on 3 floors commenced, but has been terminated to sell ''as-is''. Once completed, the building will have cca 600 sq.m. in size.&nbsp;</p>', '', '<p>ZEMLJI&Scaron;TE SA ZAPOÈETOM IZGRADNJOM NA IZNIMNOJ LOKACIJI, PRVI RED UZ MORE</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na svega 10 minuta udaljenosti autom od Omi&scaron;a prodaje se graðevna parcela povr&scaron;ine 1.550 m2, prvi red uz more i prekrasnu pla¾u.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>S obzirom na velièinu i polo¾aj, predstavlja pravu rijetkost na tr¾i&scaron;tu. Pristup zemlji&scaron;tu ostvaren je izravno sa magistralne ceste.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Zemlji&scaron;te je kaskadnog oblika, sa oformljenim potpornim kamenim zidovima, a na njemu je zapoèeta gradnja objekta na tri eta¾e, ukupne povr&scaron;ine ca. 660 m2. &nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Objekt se nalazi u niskoj roh-bau fazi.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Prodavatelj neæe dovr&scaron;avati projekt, veæ ga prodaje u zateèenom stanju, a kupcu ustupa idejna rje&scaron;enja za dovr&scaron;etak (apartmanska zgrada ili luksuzna obiteljska vila).&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Mjesto je turistièki popularno, te ima sve potrebne sadr¾aje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Grad Omi&scaron; se nalazi na 10 km udaljenosti.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Meðunarodni aerodrom u Splitu udaljen je 55 km.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za sve dodatne informacije molimo kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured u Splitu.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong><span style="text-decoration: underline;">CIJENA NE UKLJUÈUJE PDV</span></strong></p>', '<p>SEAFRONT BUILDING LAND WITH COMMENCED CONSTRUCTION ON SUPERB LOCATION</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>At only 10 min car ride from Omis we have this wonderful seafront building plot for sale.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sized 1.550 sq.m and overlooking gorgeous beach towards the open sea.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Having in mind its size and location, this property represents a rare opportunity on the market.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The land can be accessed straight from the main coastal road.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Cascade-like plot has supporting stone walls built around.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>A construction of a large building on 3 floors commenced, but has been terminated to sell ''as-is''.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Once completed, the building will have circa &nbsp;600 sq.m. in size.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The seller can provide conceptual design for apartment house and luxurious family villa. &nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Distance from Omis town is 10 minutes.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>International airport Split is 55 km away.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact our office in Split for the further information and to arrange a visit.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong><span style="text-decoration: underline;">THE PRICE DOES NOT INCLUDE VAT</span></strong></p>', '', '1163_Land-plot_0.jpg', '1163_Land-plot_1.jpg', '1163_Land-plot_2.jpg', '1163_Land-plot_3.jpg', '1163_Land-plot_4.jpg', '1163_Land-plot_5.jpg', '1163_Land-plot_6.jpg', '1163_Land-plot_7.jpg', '1163_Land-plot_8.jpg'),
(1164, 'Ivan', 'Maras', '', '099/409-31-69', 'sunshinesplit@gmail.com', 'Split', 'Kninska 1', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '400', '0', '78', 1, '250000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 3, 2, 'May 8, 2015', '<p>Apartman se nalazi u samom centru grada, na èetvrtom katu zgrade, na odliènoj lokaciji, nadomak svim turistièkim sadr¾ajima. Ima povr&scaron;inu 78 m2. Nalazi se na vrlo atraktivnoj lokaciji, samo 2 minute &scaron;etnje od Dioklecijanove palaèe, HNK, Marmontove i Splitske rive. Meðunarodni aerodrom je udaljen 30 minuta vo¾nje.</p>', '<p>We have this modernised city centre apartment close all the attractions of Split. It is situated on the 4th floor of a refurbished block, which is just 2minutes'' walk from the Riva, the National Theatre, the Diocletian Palace, Marmont street... Also within walking distance are most of the favoured restaurants, bars andother attractions, and the ferry terminal.&nbsp;The apartment has an area of 78 m2.&nbsp;</p>', '', '<p><strong>***Ishodovana je dozvola za izgradnju balkona na ju¾noj strani sa kojeg bi se pru¾ao pogled na more.</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartman se nalazi u samom centru grada, na èetvrtom katu zgrade, na odliènoj lokaciji, nadomak svim turistièkim sadr¾ajima.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ima povr&scaron;inu 78 m2, a sastoji se od tri spavaæe sobe, dnevnog boravka s kuhinjom, kupaone i malog wc-a.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Cijeli stan je renoviran prije 3 mjeseca.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Potpuno je opremljen.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U apartmanu se nalaze 4 klime (3 u sobama i 1 u dnevnom boravku) te kompletan namje&scaron;taj.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Trenutno se iznajmljuje te zauzima prvo mjesto prema ocjenama zadovoljstva gostiju.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Svi aparati i namje&scaron;taj koji se nalazi na slikama su ukljuèeni u cijenu stana.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Uredno vlasni&scaron;tvo.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartman se nalazi na vrlo atraktivnoj lokaciji, samo 2 minute &scaron;etnje od Dioklecijanove palaèe, HNK, Marmontove i Splitske rive.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Meðunarodni aerodrom je udaljen 30 minuta vo¾nje.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za sva dodatnapitanja stojimo Vam na usluzi.&nbsp;</p>', '<p><strong>***Obtained a license to build a balcony on the south side with a sea view.</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>We have this modernised city centre apartment close all the attractions of Split.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is situated on the 4th floor of a refurbished block, which is just 2minutes'' walk from the Riva, the National Theatre, the Diocletian Palace, Marmont street...</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Also within walking distance are most of the favoured restaurants, bars andother attractions, and the ferry terminal.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The apartment has an area of 78 m2 and consists of three bedrooms, livingroom, kitchen, bathroom and a small toilet.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The whole apartment was renovated 3 months ago.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It was well decorated and is fully equipped and ready to move in or to beused for letting purposes.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There is a possibility to build a balcony with the sea view.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The apartment has 4 climate (3 in the bedrooms and 1 in the living room)and is sold with all the furniture included.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The apartment is currently rented, and is consistently rated highly by guests.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>All appliances and furniture located in the pictures are included in the price.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The international airport is 30 minutes away.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact our office to arrange to visit this property.</p>', '', '1164_Apartment_0.jpg', '1164_Apartment_1.jpg', '1164_Apartment_2.jpg', '1164_Apartment_3.jpg', '1164_Apartment_4.jpg', '1164_Apartment_5.jpg', '1164_Apartment_6.jpg', '1164_Apartment_7.jpg', '1164_Apartment_8.jpg'),
(1167, 'Marija', 'Gelo', '099/ 517 6344  ', '091/ 568 0120', '', 'Kastela', 'Koludrovac 6 Ka¹tel ©tafiliæ', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '350', '1788', '416', 1, '650000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 6, 3, 'May 11, 2015', '<p>Samostojeæa kuæa smje&scaron;tena na prostranom zemlji&scaron;tu koje pru¾a mnoge moguænosti. Nalazi se u jednom od sedam prekrasnih mjesta Ka&scaron;tela koja su se smjestila izmeðu povijesnih gradova Trogira i Splita.&nbsp;Ukupna povr&scaron;ina zemlji&scaron;ta iznosi 1788 m2 gdje je moguæa izgradnja jo&scaron; 2 kuæe ili prostranog bazena sa mnogim drugim sadr¾ajima.&nbsp;Postojeæa kuæa se sastoji od prizemlja, 1.kata i 2. kata ukupne brutto stambene povr&scaron;ine 416 m2.</p>', '<p>We have this unusually large detached house situated on a spacious land that offers many opportunities. It is located in one of the seven beautiful Kastela which is situated between the historic cities of Trogir and Split.&nbsp;The total land area is 1788 m2, and it is possible to build 2 further houses or improve the tourism potential with spacious swimming pools or &nbsp;many other amenities.&nbsp;The existing house has a ground floor, 1st and 2nd floors, with a total living area of 416 m2.&nbsp;</p>', '', '<p>Samostojeæa kuæa smje&scaron;tena na prostranom zemlji&scaron;tu koje pru¾a mnoge moguænosti.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nalazi se u jednom od sedam prekrasnih mjesta Ka&scaron;tela koja su se smjestila izmeðu povijesnih gradova Trogira i Splita.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>More je udaljeno 350 m, dok je centar ujedno i stari dio mjesta udaljen nekoliko minuta vo¾nje automobilom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ukupna povr&scaron;ina zemlji&scaron;ta iznosi 1788 m2 gdje je moguæa izgradnja jo&scaron; 2 kuæe ili prostranog bazena sa mnogim drugim sadr¾ajima.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Postojeæa kuæa se sastoji od prizemlja, 1.kata i 2. kata ukupne brutto stambene povr&scaron;ine 416 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U prizemlju se nalazi hodnik, kuhinja + blagovaonica + dnevni boravak, &nbsp;1 kupaonice, 2 spavaæe sobe i terasa.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U prizemlju je takoðer i gara¾a.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na 1.katu su 2 hodnika, kuhinja + blagovaonica + dnevni boravak, &nbsp;1 kupaonice, 2 spavaæe sobe i 2 terase.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>2.kat (potkrovlje) ima iste prostorije kao i 1.kat.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Svi katovi su spojeni unutarnjim stepenicama i imaju odvojene ulaze.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je graðena 80-ih godina, ali je jako kvalitetno izgraðena i namje&scaron;tena.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Trogir je udaljen 10 min. vo¾nje, dok je do meðunarodnog aerodroma potrebno samo 5 min.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ukoliko imate dodatnih pitanja slobodno nas kontaktirajte.</p>', '<p>We have this unusually large detached house situated on a spacious land that offers many opportunities.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is located in one of the seven beautiful Kastela which is situated between the historic cities of Trogir and Split.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The sea is 350 m, while the centre of the old part of town, is only a few minutes away by car, but easily in walking distance.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The total land area is 1788 m2, and it is possible to build 2 further houses or improve the tourism potential with spacious swimming pools or &nbsp;many other amenities.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The existing house has a ground floor, 1st and 2nd floors, with a total living area of 416 m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is divided into separate apartments.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The ground floor has a hallway, kitchen, dining room, living room, all separate in a traditional way, 1 bathroom, 2 bedrooms and a terrace.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the ground floor is also a garage. &nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the 1st floor are 2 halls, kitchen, dining room, living room, 1 bathroom, 2 bedrooms and 2 terraces.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>2nd floor (top) has the same layout as 1st floor.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>All floors are connected with internal stairs and have separate entrances.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house was built 80 years ago, but is very well built and furnished.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Trogir is 10 min. driving while to the international airport takes only 5 minutes.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>If you have any questions please contact us.</p>', '', '1167_House-Villa_0.jpg', '1167_House-Villa_1.jpg', '1167_House-Villa_2.jpg', '1167_House-Villa_3.jpg', '1167_House-Villa_4.jpg', '1167_House-Villa_5.jpg', '1167_House-Villa_6.jpg', '1167_House-Villa_7.jpg', '1167_House-Villa_8.jpg');
INSERT INTO `nekretnina` (`id`, `ime`, `prezime`, `telefon`, `mobitel`, `e_mail`, `lokacija_id`, `adresa`, `status_id`, `vrsta_id`, `udaljenost`, `povrsina`, `stambenapovrsina`, `display`, `cijena`, `cijenatocka`, `ponuda_tjedna`, `new_built`, `must_sell`, `prvi_red_do_mora`, `pogled_na_more`, `bazen`, `broj_soba`, `broj_kupatila`, `datum`, `title_hr`, `title_en`, `title_ge`, `opis_hr`, `opis_en`, `opis_ge`, `PropertyImageURL0`, `PropertyImageURL1`, `PropertyImageURL2`, `PropertyImageURL3`, `PropertyImageURL4`, `PropertyImageURL5`, `PropertyImageURL6`, `PropertyImageURL7`, `PropertyImageURL8`) VALUES
(1166, '', 'Dalmatian Home', '', '', '', 'Primosten', 'Primo¹ten', 'For sale', 'Land plot', '1500', '6544', '0', 1, '654400', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 0, 0, 'May 8, 2015', '<p>Graðevinska parcela ukupne povr&scaron;ine 6.544m2 na brdu iznad Primo&scaron;tena.&nbsp;S terena se pru¾a izvanredan pogled na stari dio Primo&scaron;tena kao i otvoreno more s druge strane.&nbsp;Teren se nalazi na blagoj padini i samim tim omoguæava se nesmetan raspored vi&scaron;e objekata (vila) koje bi imale pogled na more. Uz samu parcelu su telefonski, strujni i vodovodni prikljuèak.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>Building plot of 6.544sqm on the hill above Primosten.&nbsp;There is an excellent view of the old part of Primosten and the open sea view on the other side.&nbsp;The land is located on a gentle slope and thus enables a smooth arrangement of multiple objects (villa) that would have a sea view.&nbsp;</p>', '', '<p>Graðevinska parcela ukupne povr&scaron;ine 6.544 m2 na brdu iznad Primo&scaron;tena.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>S terena se pru¾a izvanredan pogled na stari dio Primo&scaron;tena kao i otvoreno more s druge strane.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Do &scaron;ljunèanih pla¾a u Marini Luèici je manje od 1,5km, a zraène udaljenosti oko 1km.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Teren se nalazi na blagoj padini i samim tim omoguæava se nesmetan raspored vi&scaron;e objekata (vila) koje bi imale pogled na more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Uz samu parcelu su telefonski, strujni i vodovodni prikljuèak.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Terenu se pristupa asfaltnom cestom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Moguæa je kupnja dijela parcele prema postojeæoj parcelacijskoj skici.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Primo&scaron;ten je smje&scaron;ten 20-ak kilometara od grada &Scaron;ibenika, a svojom zanimljivom arhitekturom i kristalno bistrim morem privlaèi brojene turiste.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Meðunarodni aerodrom u Trogiru udaljen je 45 km.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za sve dodatne informacije slobodno nas kontaktirajte.</p>', '<p>Building plot of 6.544sqm on the hill above Primosten.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There is an excellent view of the old part of Primosten and the open sea view on the other side.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Pebble beach in Marina Port is less than 1.5 km away, and the airport distance is about 1 km.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The land is located on a gentle slope and thus enables a smooth arrangement of multiple objects (villa) that would have a sea view.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>All utility connections are nearby ( telephone, electric and water connection).&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Access to the property is by asphalt road.<br /><br /></p>\r\n<p>It is possible to purchase part of the plot according to the existing sketch (parcelling of land).&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The village is located 20 kilometers from the town of Sibenik, and its interesting architecture and crystal-clear sea attracts many tourists.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The international airport in Trogir is only 45 km.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For further information please contact us.</p>', '', '1166_Land-plot_0.jpg', '1166_Land-plot_1.jpg', '1166_Land-plot_2.jpg', '1166_Land-plot_3.jpg', '1166_Land-plot_4.jpg', '1166_Land-plot_5.jpg', '1166_Land-plot_6.jpg', '1166_Land-plot_7.jpg', '1166_Land-plot_8.jpg'),
(1168, 'Georg', 'Flohr', '098445700', '', '', 'Rogoznica', 'Rogoznica', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '100', '443', '366', 1, '495000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 9, 5, 'May 11, 2015', '<p>Apartmanska kuæa u Rogoznici s koje se pru¾a predivan pogled na more i uvalu.&nbsp;Nalazi se samo 100 m od mora.&nbsp;Na parceli povr&scaron;ine 443 m2 nalazi se kuæa povr&scaron;ine 366 m2.&nbsp;Kuæa se sastoji od prizemlja, prvog i drugog kata.</p>', '<p>We are offering this modern apartment house in Rogoznica with a beautiful view of the sea and the bay. The property is located 100 m from the sea, in the centre of the village, which is 30 minutes up the Dalmatian coast from the airport. It sits on a plot of 443 m2 and the measurements of the 3 apartments add up to 366 m2. The house consists of ground, first and second floors.</p>', '', '<p>Apartmanska kuæa u Rogoznici s koje se pru¾a predivan pogled na more i uvalu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nalazi se samo 100 m od mora.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na parceli povr&scaron;ine 443 m2 nalazi se kuæa povr&scaron;ine 366 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa se sastoji od prizemlja, prvog i drugog kata.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U prizemlju se nalazi dnevni boravak s kuhinjom te dvije spavaæe sobe, svaka sa svojom kupaonicom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na prvom katu se nalazi kuhinja s izlazom na terasu s koje se pru¾a djelomièan pogled na more, pet &nbsp;soba i dvije kupaonice.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na drugom katu je penthouse povr&scaron;ine 130 m2, a sastoji se od dnevnog boravka i kuhinje, dvije spavaæe sobe i kupaonice.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Iz dnevnog boravka se pru¾a prekrasan otvoren pogled na more i otoke, a u istom pogledu se mo¾e u¾ivati i sa terase ovog kata.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Do kuæe &nbsp;je pristup asfaltiranom cestom, a u sklopu parcele nalazi se pet parking mjesta..</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Oko kuæe se nalazi ureðen, kultiviran vrt s moguæno&scaron;æu izgradnje bazena.Kuæa ima svu potrebnu infrastrukturu, kao i moguænost centralnog grijanja.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Udaljenost do centra mjesta, kafiæa, restorana i duæana je svega 2 km.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Udaljenost do meðunarodnog aerodroma je 25 km.</p>', '<p>We are offering this modern apartment house in Rogoznica with a beautiful view of the sea and the bay.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property is located 100 m from the sea, in the centre of the village, which is 30 minutes up the Dalmatian coast from the airport.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It sits on a plot of 443 m2 and the measurements of the 3 apartments add up to 366 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house consists of ground, first and second floors.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The ground floor has a living room with kitchen and two bedrooms, each with its own bathroom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the first floor there is a kitchen with access to a large terrace that offers a partial sea view, five bedrooms and two bathrooms.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the second floor is the penthouse of 130 m2 and consists of a living room and kitchen, two bedrooms and a bathroom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The &nbsp;floor living room has a beautiful view of the sea and islands, and in the same view can be enjoyed from the terrace of the first floor.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house has access to a paved road, and, as part of the plot, there are five parking spaces...</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Around the house is a cultivated garden with enough space for improvements such as storage for a small boat or even a swimming pool and patio.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house is well decorated and furnished with high quality fittings.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The distance to the city centre, cafes, restaurants and shops is only 2 km, but there are some closer bars and cafes.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Distance to the international airport is 25 km.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact the office for more information and to arrange to come and see this property.</p>', '', '1168_House-Villa_0.jpg', '1168_House-Villa_1.jpg', '1168_House-Villa_2.jpg', '1168_House-Villa_3.jpg', '1168_House-Villa_4.jpg', '1168_House-Villa_5.jpg', '1168_House-Villa_6.jpg', '1168_House-Villa_7.jpg', '1168_House-Villa_8.jpg'),
(1169, 'Georg', 'Flohr', '098 445 700', '', '', 'Rogoznica', 'Rogoznica', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '100', '324', '284', 2, '210000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 6, 2, 'May 11, 2015', '<p>Nedovr&scaron;ena kuæa ju¾ne orijentacije, s moguæno&scaron;æu nadogradnje jo&scaron; jednog kata u mirnom dijelu Rogoznice.&nbsp;Kuæa je smje&scaron;tena svega 100 m od mora.&nbsp;Ima povr&scaron;inu 284 m2, a nalazi se na parceli povr&scaron;ine 324 m2.&nbsp;Kuæa je podijeljena na prizemlje i kat.</p>', '<p>Property of interest to investors and builders! We are offering this unfinished house facing south, habitable, but with the possibility of building another floor. The property is located only 100 m from the sea. It has a surface of 284 m2 and is located on a plot of 324 m2. The house is divided into two floors.</p>', '', '<p>Nedovr&scaron;ena kuæa ju¾ne orijentacije, s moguæno&scaron;æu nadogradnje jo&scaron; jednog kata u mirnom dijelu Rogoznice.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je smje&scaron;tena svega 100 m od mora.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ima povr&scaron;inu 284 m2, a nalazi se na parceli povr&scaron;ine 324 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je podijeljena na prizemlje i kat.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U prizemlju &nbsp;je predviðen ugostiteljski dio, restoran koji se sastoji od velike kuhinje i trpezarije za 25 osoba s izlazom na terasu povr&scaron;ine 70 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U prizemlju je i sanitarni èvor.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na katu se nalazi 5 soba s kupaonicom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>S terase koja je du¾ cijele ju¾ne strane kuæe &nbsp;pru¾a se djelomièan pogled na more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Podrum ispod kuæe je povr&scaron;ine 60 m2, a tu se nalazi i prostor koji je predviðen za saunu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Do kuæe je osiguran pristup autom kao i &nbsp;dva parking mjesta.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Okuænica je kultivirana, a u sklopu parcele je moguæe izgraditi bazen.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa ima svu potrebnu infrastrukturu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Udaljenost do centra mjesta, restorana i kafiæa je svega 2 km, a do meðubarodnog aerodroma 25 km.</p>', '<p>Property of interest to investors and builders!</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>We are offering this unfinished house facing south, habitable, but with the possibility of building another floor.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property is located only 100 m from the sea.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It has a surface of 284 m2 and is located on a plot of 324 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house is divided into two floors.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The ground floor is designed as a restaurant and consists of a large kitchen and dining room for 25 people with terrace of 70 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the ground floor is also a toilet.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The first floor has 5 bedrooms with bathroom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>From the terrace, which is along the south side of the house there are partial sea views.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The cellar under the house is 60 m2, and there is also a space that is designed for a sauna.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house can be accessed by car as well as having two parking spaces.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The garden has been landscaped and as part of the plot and it has been designed to include a swimming pool with a patio sunbathing area.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house has all the necessary infrastructure.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Distance to the city center, restaurants and cafes is just 2 km away and international airport 25 km.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact our office to arrange to visit this property.</p>', '', '1169_House-Villa_0.jpg', '1169_House-Villa_1.jpg', '1169_House-Villa_2.jpg', '1169_House-Villa_3.jpg', '1169_House-Villa_4.jpg', '1169_House-Villa_5.jpg', '1169_House-Villa_6.jpg', '1169_House-Villa_7.jpg', '1169_House-Villa_8.jpg'),
(1170, 'Sanja', 'Zeleni brijeg d.o.o', '0918838085', '', 'z.brijeg@gmail.com', 'Rogoznica', 'Stiva¹nica Ra¾anj', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '5', '400', '360', 1, '1150000', '', 2, 1, 2, 1, 1, 1, 7, 4, 'May 11, 2015', '<p>U mirnoj uvali na svega par metara od mora nalazi se novoizgraðena, moderno ureðena vila s bazenom.&nbsp;Na parceli povr&scaron;ine 400 m2, nalazi se vila povr&scaron;ine 360 m2 ju¾ne orijentacije.&nbsp;S terasa, suterena gdje se nalazi bazen i &nbsp;ju¾no orijentiranih prostorija pru¾a se prekrasan pogled na otvoreno more i uvalu.&nbsp;Vila je podijeljena na suteren, prizemlje i kat.</p>', '<p>We are pleased to offer this magnificent shore side villa with swimming pool on the mainland. It is situated a quiet cove only a few meters from the sea, facing South, on the shore near Rogoznica, 2k to the nearest village centre and 25k to the airport.&nbsp;It is on a plot of 400 m2, and the internal space of this villa is 360 m2. From almost anywhere either inside or outside, are breathtaking views of the open sea and the bay.&nbsp;The villa is divided into a basement, ground floor and first floor.</p>', '', '<p>U mirnoj uvali na svega par metara od mora nalazi se novoizgraðena, moderno ureðena vila s bazenom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na parceli povr&scaron;ine 400 m2, nalazi se vila povr&scaron;ine 360 m2 ju¾ne orijentacije.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>S terasa, suterena gdje se nalazi bazen i &nbsp;ju¾no orijentiranih prostorija pru¾a se prekrasan pogled na otvoreno more i uvalu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Vila je podijeljena na suteren, prizemlje i kat.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U suterenu su dvije spavaæe sobe, kupaonica, praonica, spremi&scaron;te i &nbsp;dnevni boravak s izlazom na terasu povr&scaron;ine 20 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U prizemlju su dvije spavaæe sobe, kupaonica, kuhinja s blagovaonicom i izlaz na terasu povr&scaron;ine 33 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na katu su tri spavaæe sobe, dvije kupaonice i terasa povr&scaron;ine 22 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na nivou suterena, a u sklopu terase je bazen oko kojeg je lijepo ureðen, kultiviran vrt.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Do vile se mo¾e doæi asfaltiranom cestom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U sklopu parcele osigurana su dva parking mjesta, a vila ima i gara¾u.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sva potrebna infrastruktura je prisutna.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Energetski razred A.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Udaljenost do restorana i duæana je svega 2 km, a do meðunarodnog aerodroma 25 km.</p>', '<p>We are pleased to offer this magnificent shore side villa with swimming pool on the mainland.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is situated a quiet cove only a few meters from the sea, facing South, on the shore near Rogoznica, 2k to the nearest village centre and 25k to the airport.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is on a plot of 400 m2, and the internal space of this villa is 360 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>From almost anywhere either inside or outside, are breathtaking views of the open sea and the bay.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The villa is divided into a basement, ground floor and first floor.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>In the basement there are two bedrooms, bathroom, laundry room, storage room and living room with windows opening onto a terrace of 20 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the ground floor are two bedrooms, bathroom, kitchen, dining room and terrace area of 33 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Upstairs are three bedrooms, two bathrooms and a balcony of 22 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the basement level, as part of the terrace is a swimming pool set on a patio and surrounded by a landscaped and cultivated garden.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The inside of the property is immaculate and in no need of further decorating or investment.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The villa can be reached by paved road.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Within the plot a two parking spaces, and the villa has a garage.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>All necessary infrastructure is present.Energy class A.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Proximity to restaurants and shops is only 2 km to the international airport 25 km. &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact the office to arrange to visit this property. &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</p>', '', '1170_House-Villa_0.jpg', '1170_House-Villa_1.jpg', '1170_House-Villa_2.jpg', '1170_House-Villa_3.jpg', '1170_House-Villa_4.jpg', '1170_House-Villa_5.jpg', '1170_House-Villa_6.jpg', '1170_House-Villa_7.jpg', '1170_House-Villa_8.jpg'),
(1171, 'Marija Gelo', 'Vorobyev d.o.o.', '099/ 517 6344  ', '091/ 568 0120 ', '', 'Trogir', 'O. Donji, K.È.2203/30', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '130', '0', '51', 2, '77000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 1, 1, 'May 11, 2015', '<p>Apartman smje&scaron;ten u prizemlju izuzetno kvalitetne zgrade udaljene cca. 130 m od mora i prekrasne &scaron;ljunèane pla¾e.&nbsp;Ispred zgrade se nalazi &scaron;uma gdje trenutno nije moguæa izgradnja.&nbsp;Ukupna stambena povr&scaron;ina iznosi 50,55 m2, a sastoji se od hodnika, kuhinje + blagovaonice + dnevnog boravka, kupaonice, spavaæe sobe i balkona.</p>', '<p>We offer this brand new ground floor apartment close to the sea. It is located on the west side of the island Ciovo, and the nearest larger town Trogir is 15 min driving. In front of the building there is natural and preserved forest and any building is strictly forbidden.&nbsp;The total area inside is 50.55 m2 and it consists of hallway, with modern and spacious open plan living area of kitchen + dining room + living room, bathroom, bedroom and balcony.</p>', '', '<p>Apartman smje&scaron;ten u prizemlju izuzetno kvalitetne zgrade udaljene cca. 130 m od mora i prekrasne &scaron;ljunèane pla¾e.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ispred zgrade se nalazi &scaron;uma gdje trenutno nije moguæa izgradnja.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nalazi se na zapadnoj strani otoka Èiova, dok je grad Trogir udaljen 15 min. vo¾nje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Do meðunarodnog aerodroma je potrebno 20 min. automobilom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ukupna stambena povr&scaron;ina iznosi 50,55 m2, a sastoji se od hodnika, kuhinje + blagovaonice + dnevnog boravka, kupaonice, spavaæe sobe i balkona.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Iz balkona se ne pru¾a pogled nam more, ali to ne umanjuje njegovu vrijednost.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartman je namje&scaron;ten i spreman za useljenje.S obzirom da poziciju i blizinu pla¾e idealan je i za turistièko iznajmljivanje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ispred zgrade se nalazi 1 vanjsko parking mjesto koje je ukljuèeno u cijenu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za sve ostale informacije nas slobodno kontaktiratje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><span style="color: #ff0000;">*** NA ZAHTJEV &Scaron;ALJEMO VIDEO ZAPISE</span></p>\r\n<p><span style="color: #ff0000;">---------</span></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><span style="color: #0a0000;">&#1054;&#1087;&#1080;&#1089;&#1072;&#1085;&#1080;&#1077;: &nbsp;&#1059;&#1053;&#1048;&#1050;&#1040;&#1051;&#1068;&#1053;&#1054;&#1045; &#1055;&#1056;&#1045;&#1044;&#1051;&#1054;&#1046;&#1045;&#1053;&#1048;&#1045;! &#1044;&#1074;&#1091;&#1093;&#1082;&#1086;&#1084;&#1085;&#1072;&#1090;&#1085;&#1099;&#1077; &#1072;&#1087;&#1072;&#1088;&#1090;&#1072;&#1084;&#1077;&#1085;&#1090;&#1099; &#1089; &#1095;&#1072;&#1089;&#1090;&#1085;&#1086;&#1081; &#1087;&#1072;&#1088;&#1082;&#1086;&#1074;&#1082;&#1086;&#1081; &#1087;&#1086;&#1076; &#1073;&#1072;&#1083;&#1082;&#1086;&#1085;&#1086;&#1084; &nbsp;&#1085;&#1072; &#1087;&#1086;&#1083;&#1091;&#1086;&#1089;&#1090;&#1088;&#1086;&#1074;&#1077; &#1063;&#1080;&#1086;&#1074;&#1086;. &#1055;&#1083;&#1086;&#1097;&#1072;&#1076;&#1100; &nbsp;49 &#1082;&#1074;.&#1084;. &#1040;&#1087;&#1072;&#1088;&#1090;&#1072;&#1084;&#1077;&#1085;&#1090;&#1099; &#1088;&#1072;&#1089;&#1087;&#1086;&#1083;&#1072;&#1075;&#1072;&#1102;&#1090;&#1089;&#1103; &#1085;&#1072; 1 &#1101;&#1090;&#1072;&#1078;&#1077; &#1085;&#1086;&#1074;&#1086;&#1075;&#1086; 4-&#1101;&#1090;&#1072;&#1078;&#1085;&#1086;&#1075;&#1086; &#1076;&#1086;&#1084;&#1072; &#1087;&#1086;&#1074;&#1099;&#1096;&#1077;&#1085;&#1085;&#1086;&#1081; &#1082;&#1086;&#1084;&#1092;&#1086;&#1088;&#1090;&#1085;&#1086;&#1089;&#1090;&#1080;, &#1087;&#1086;&#1089;&#1090;&#1088;&#1086;&#1077;&#1085;&#1085;&#1086;&#1075;&#1086; &#1074; &#1083;&#1091;&#1095;&#1096;&#1080;&#1093; &#1096;&#1074;&#1077;&#1081;&#1094;&#1072;&#1088;&#1089;&#1082;&#1080;&#1093; &#1090;&#1088;&#1072;&#1076;&#1080;&#1094;&#1080;&#1103;&#1093; (&#1089;&#1077;&#1084;&#1100;&#1103; &#1079;&#1072;&#1089;&#1090;&