&#1076;&#1083;&#1103; &#1075;&#1072;&#1088;&#1076;&#1077;&#1088;&#1086;&#1073;&#1072; &#1080; &#1074;&#1077;&#1097;&#1077;&#1081;. &#1042;&#1089;&#1077; &#1085;&#1086;&#1074;&#1086;&#1077; &#1080; &#1082;&#1072;&#1095;&#1077;&#1089;&#1090;&#1074;&#1077;&#1085;&#1085;&#1086;&#1077;.&nbsp;&#1056;&#1103;&#1076;&#1086;&#1084; &#1089; &#1076;&#1086;&#1084;&#1086;&#1084; &#1088;&#1072;&#1089;&#1087;&#1086;&#1083;&#1072;&#1075;&#1072;&#1077;&#1090;&#1089;&#1103; &#1079;&#1072;&#1097;&#1080;&#1097;&#1077;&#1085;&#1085;&#1072;&#1103; &#1079;&#1072;&#1082;&#1086;&#1085;&#1086;&#1084; &#1079;&#1077;&#1083;&#1077;&#1085;&#1072;&#1103; &#1079;&#1086;&#1085;&#1072;, &#1082;&#1086;&#1090;&#1086;&#1088;&#1072;&#1103; &#1085;&#1080;&#1082;&#1086;&#1075;&#1076;&#1072; &#1085;&#1077; &#1073;&#1091;&#1076;&#1077;&#1090; &#1079;&#1072;&#1089;&#1090;&#1088;&#1086;&#1077;&#1085;&#1072;, &#1072; &#1090;&#1072;&#1082;&#1078;&#1077; &#1087;&#1086;&#1095;&#1090;&#1072;, &#1072;&#1074;&#1090;&#1086;&#1073;&#1091;&#1089;&#1085;&#1072;&#1103; &#1086;&#1089;&#1090;&#1072;&#1085;&#1086;&#1074;&#1082;&#1072;, &#1088;&#1077;&#1089;&#1090;&#1086;&#1088;&#1072;&#1085;, &#1089;&#1091;&#1087;&#1077;&#1088;&#1084;&#1072;&#1088;&#1082;&#1077;&#1090;. &#1044;&#1086; &#1084;&#1086;&#1088;&#1103; 100 &#1084;&#1077;&#1090;&#1088;&#1086;&#1074; &#1074;&#1085;&#1080;&#1079; &#1087;&#1086; &#1082;&#1072;&#1084;&#1077;&#1085;&#1085;&#1099;&#1084; &#1089;&#1090;&#1091;&#1087;&#1077;&#1085;&#1100;&#1082;&#1072;&#1084; &#1095;&#1077;&#1088;&#1077;&#1079; &#1089;&#1086;&#1089;&#1085;&#1086;&#1074;&#1099;&#1081; &#1083;&#1077;&#1089;&#1086;&#1082; &#1089; &#1083;&#1077;&#1095;&#1077;&#1073;&#1085;&#1099;&#1084; &#1074;&#1086;&#1079;&#1076;&#1091;&#1093;&#1086;&#1084;. &nbsp;&#1054;&#1073;&#1086;&#1088;&#1091;&#1076;&#1086;&#1074;&#1072;&#1085;&#1085;&#1099;&#1081; &#1084;&#1077;&#1083;&#1082;&#1086;&#1075;&#1072;&#1083;&#1077;&#1095;&#1085;&#1099;&#1081; &#1087;&#1083;&#1103;&#1078; &#1089; &#1095;&#1080;&#1089;&#1090;&#1077;&#1081;&#1096;&#1077;&#1081; &#1074;&#1086;&#1076;&#1086;&#1081;. &#1054;&#1090; &#1085;&#1077;&#1075;&#1086; &#1078;&#1077; &#1088;&#1077;&#1075;&#1091;&#1083;&#1103;&#1088;&#1085;&#1086; &#1093;&#1086;&#1076;&#1103;&#1090; &#1087;&#1072;&#1088;&#1086;&#1093;&#1086;&#1076;&#1080;&#1082;&#1080; &#1076;&#1086; &#1089;&#1086;&#1089;&#1077;&#1076;&#1085;&#1077;&#1075;&#1086; &#1058;&#1088;&#1086;&#1075;&#1080;&#1088;&#1072;. &#1044;&#1086; &#1072;&#1101;&#1088;&#1086;&#1087;&#1086;&#1088;&#1090;&#1072; &#1057;&#1087;&#1083;&#1080;&#1090; 12 &#1082;&#1084;, &#1076;&#1086; &#1058;&#1088;&#1086;&#1075;&#1080;&#1088;&#1072; &ndash; 5 &#1082;&#1084;. &#1058;&#1088;&#1086;&#1075;&#1080;&#1088;-&#1076;&#1088;&#1077;&#1074;&#1085;&#1080;&#1081; &#1075;&#1086;&#1088;&#1086;&#1076;, &#1086;&#1093;&#1088;&#1072;&#1085;&#1103;&#1077;&#1084;&#1099;&#1081; &#1070;&#1085;&#1077;&#1089;&#1082;&#1086;!&#1042;&#1089;&#1077; &#1085;&#1077;&#1086;&#1073;&#1093;&#1086;&#1076;&#1080;&#1084;&#1099;&#1077; &#1076;&#1086;&#1082;&#1091;&#1084;&#1077;&#1085;&#1090;&#1099; &#1080;&#1084;&#1077;&#1102;&#1090;&#1089;&#1103;, &#1074;&#1086;&#1079;&#1084;&#1086;&#1078;&#1085;&#1072; &#1087;&#1088;&#1086;&#1076;&#1072;&#1078;&#1072; &#1092;&#1080;&#1079;.&#1083;&#1080;&#1094;&#1091; &#1080;&#1083;&#1080; &#1087;&#1088;&#1086;&#1076;&#1072;&#1078;&#1072; &#1072;&#1087;&#1072;&#1088;&#1090;&#1072;&#1084;&#1077;&#1085;&#1090;&#1086;&#1074; &#1074;&#1084;&#1077;&#1089;&#1090;&#1077; &#1089; &#1092;&#1080;&#1088;&#1084;&#1086;&#1081;, &#1077;&#1089;&#1083;&#1080; &#1077;&#1089;&#1090;&#1100; &#1087;&#1083;&#1072;&#1085;&#1099; &#1087;&#1086; &#1074;&#1077;&#1076;&#1077;&#1085;&#1080;&#1102; &#1073;&#1080;&#1079;&#1085;&#1077;&#1089;&#1072;.&#1062;&#1045;&#1053;&#1040; 77000 &#1077;&#1074;&#1088;&#1086;!!!&#1058;&#1086;&#1088;&#1086;&#1087;&#1080;&#1090;&#1077;&#1089;&#1100; &#1082;&#1091;&#1087;&#1080;&#1090;&#1100; &#1082;&#1091;&#1089;&#1086;&#1095;&#1077;&#1082; &#1061;&#1086;&#1088;&#1074;&#1072;&#1090;&#1080;&#1080;! &#1054;&#1090;&#1076;&#1072;&#1076;&#1080;&#1084; &#1090;&#1086;&#1083;&#1100;&#1082;&#1086; &#1074; &#1093;&#1086;&#1088;&#1086;&#1096;&#1080;&#1077; &#1088;&#1091;&#1082;&#1080;!</p>', '', '1171_Apartment_0.jpg', '1171_Apartment_1.jpg', '1171_Apartment_2.jpg', '1171_Apartment_3.jpg', '1171_Apartment_4.jpg', '1171_Apartment_5.jpg', '1171_Apartment_6.jpg', '1171_Apartment_7.jpg', '1171_Apartment_8.jpg'),
(1172, 'Jan i Ann Margr', 'Stutterheim', '021886005  0994123836 kljuc- 021886153', '0046705413791  0046722019650', 'jan@stutterheim.se am.stutterheim@live.s', 'Trogir', 'Ribarski put 7, Okrug Gornji, 960/2', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '300', '0', '47', 1, '120000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 1, 1, 'May 11, 2015', '<p>Apartman na ju¾noj strani otoka Èiova, ujedno i najpopularnijeg dijela otoka, smje&scaron;ten na 1.katu u manjoj zgradi izgraðenoj 2008. godine.&nbsp;&Scaron;ljunèana pla¾a je udaljena cca. 300 m, dok su u blizini mnogobrojne uvale i prirodno kamenite pla¾e.&nbsp;Ukupna stambena povr&scaron;ina iznosi 47,18 m2. Klimatiziran je i potpuno opremljen kvalitetnim namje&scaron;tajem.</p>', '<p>We have this apartment on the south side of Ciovo, the most popular &nbsp;part of the island, located on the 1st floor in a small block built in 2008. Pebble beach is approx. 300 m, while in the vicinity of numerous coves&nbsp;and natural rocky beaches. Total area is 47.18 m2. It is air conditioned and fully equipped with quality furnishings.</p>', '', '<p>Apartman na ju¾noj strani otoka Èiova, ujedno i najpopularnijeg dijela otoka, smje&scaron;ten na 1.katu u manjoj zgradi izgraðenoj 2008. godine.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&Scaron;ljunèana pla¾a je udaljena cca. 300 m, dok su u blizini mnogobrojne uvale i prirodno kamenite pla¾e.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Centar sa svim sadr¾ajima je udaljen nekoliko minuta vo¾nje, dok je povijesni grad Trogir udaljen 10 min. vo¾nje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartman se sastoji od hodnika, kuhinje + blagovaonice + dnevnog boravka, 1 spavaæe sobe, kupaonice i balkona sa pogledom na more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ukupna stambena povr&scaron;ina iznosi 47,18 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Klimatiziran je i potpuno opremljen kvalitetnim namje&scaron;tajem.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartmanu pripada 1 vanjsko parking mjesto koje je ukljuèeno u cijenu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Dvori&scaron;te je zajednièko, ali svaki vlasnik koristi jedan odreðeni dio.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Meðunarodni aerodrom je udaljen 15 min. vo¾nje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za sva dodatna pitanja i fotografije nas slobodno kontaktirajte.</p>', '<p>We have this apartment on the south side of Ciovo, the most popular &nbsp;part of the island, located on the 1st floor in a small block built in 2008.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Pebble beach is approx. 300 m, while in the vicinity of numerous coves&nbsp;and natural rocky beaches.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is very safe and popular with swimmers and children playing.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The nearest village with amenities such as Dr''s, shops and coffee bars etc, is very close while a short drive away is the historic city of Trogir, the cultural and historic centre of the area has many more attractions for tourists.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The apartment consists of hallway, with a spacious open plan living area of kitchen + dining room + living room, 1 bedroom, bathroom and a good sized balcony with commanding views overlooking the sea.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Total area is 47.18 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is air conditioned and fully equipped with quality furnishings.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartment has 1 personal parking place allotted which is included in the price.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The courtyard is shared, but each owner uses one particular part.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>International airport is 15 minutes. driving.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For any additional questions and to arrange to visit this property, please contact us. &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</p>', '', '1172_Apartment_0.jpg', '1172_Apartment_1.jpg', '1172_Apartment_2.jpg', '1172_Apartment_3.jpg', '1172_Apartment_4.jpg', '1172_Apartment_5.jpg', '1172_Apartment_6.jpg', '1172_Apartment_7.jpg', '1172_Apartment_8.jpg'),
(1173, 'Jan i Ann Margr', 'Stutterheim', '021886005  0994123836 kljuc- 021886153', '0046705413791  0046722019650', 'jan@stutterheim.se am.stutterheim@live.s', 'Trogir', 'Ribarski put 7, Okrug Gornji, 960/2', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '300', '0', '57', 1, '160000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 2, 1, 'May 11, 2015', '<p>Apartman smje&scaron;ten na 1.katu zgrade izgraðene 2008. godine, ali i dalje u odliènom stanju.&nbsp;Nalazi se na ju¾noj strani otoka Èiova, dok je orjentacija apartmana istoèna.&nbsp;More i mala &scaron;ljunèana pla¾a su udaljeni cca. 300 m, dok se uz du¾ cijele obale prote¾e prirodno kamenita pla¾a.&nbsp;Ukupna povr&scaron;ina iznosi 56,77 m2 + gara¾a 51,30 m2.</p>', '<p>We have this spacious apartment located on the 1st floor in excellent condition. It is situated in a block built in 2008 on the south side of Ciovo, while the orientation of the apartment is towards the east. The sea and small pebble beach are approx. 300 m, while along the entire coastline stretching either way is natural rocky beach between pebble beaches. The property has &nbsp;a total area of 56.77 m2 + garage 51.30 m2.ny additional questions.</p>', '', '<p>Apartman smje&scaron;ten na 1.katu zgrade izgraðene 2008. godine, ali i dalje u odliènom stanju.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nalazi se na ju¾noj strani otoka Èiova, dok je orjentacija apartmana istoèna.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>More i mala &scaron;ljunèana pla¾a su udaljeni cca. 300 m, dok se uz du¾ cijele obale prote¾e prirodno kamenita pla¾a.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ukupna povr&scaron;ina iznosi 56,77 m2 + gara¾a 51,30 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Posebnost gara¾e je &scaron;to je potpuno preureðena u stambeni prostor, te sa kupnjom ove nekretnine dobijate 2 apartmana.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartman se sastoji od hodnika, kuhinje + blagovaonice + dnevnog boravka, 2 spavaæe sobe, 1 kupaonice i balkona sa pogledom na more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartman u gara¾i se sastoji od 1 velike prostorije, kupaonice i spremi&scaron;ta.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>***Namje&scaron;taj nije ukljuèen u cijenu, ali postoji moguænost dogovora.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ispred zgrade se nalazi 1 parking mjesto, dok je dvori&scaron;te zajednièko.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Centar mjesta sa svim sadr¾ajima je udaljen svega par min. vo¾nje, dok je do meðunarodnog aerodroma potrebno 15 min.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ostajemo na usluzi za sva dodatna pitanja.</p>', '<p>We have this spacious apartment located on the 1st floor in excellent condition.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is situated in a block built in 2008 on the south side of Ciovo, while the orientation of the apartment is towards the east.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The sea and small pebble beach are approx. 300 m, while along the entire coastline stretching either way is natural rocky beach between pebble beaches.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property has &nbsp;a total area of 56.77 m2 + garage 51.30 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>A special feature is this spacious garage which is completely transformed into a residential space, so with the purchase of this property you get &nbsp;2 apartments.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The apartment consists of hallway, and a large open plan designed living area of kitchen + dining room + living room, leading onto a balcony overlooking the sea and the village, 2 bedrooms, and 1 bathroom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartment in the garage consists of 1 large room, bathroom and storage.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>***Furniture is not included in price but it is possible to make an agreement.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>In front of the building there is one private parking space, while the yard is shared.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The centre of the nearest village, with all amenities such as Dr''s surgery, shops, cafes and various coffee bars etc. is only a few minutes driving or a 10 minute walk, while to the international airport takes 15 minutes.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>We remain at your disposal for any additional questions.</p>', '', '1173_Apartment_0.jpg', '1173_Apartment_1.jpg', '1173_Apartment_2.jpg', '1173_Apartment_3.jpg', '1173_Apartment_4.jpg', '1173_Apartment_5.jpg', '1173_Apartment_6.jpg', '1173_Apartment_7.jpg', '1173_Apartment_8.jpg');
