(1174, 'Marija', 'Gelo', ' 021/235-377', '099/ 517 6344       091/ 568 0120 ', '', 'Trogir', 'O. Donji, 2203/29', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '130', '0', '79', 1, '150000', '', 2, 1, 2, 2, 1, 2, 2, 1, 'May 11, 2015', '<p>Apartman u novogradnji iz kojeg se pru¾a prekrasan pogled na more, dok je do &scaron;ljunèane pla¾e potrebno svega par minuta hodanja.&nbsp;Izmeðu zgrade i pla¾e je &scaron;uma gdje se takoðer nalaze i prirodno kamenite pla¾e.&nbsp;Smje&scaron;ten je na 3.katu (zadnjem) S &ndash; J orjentacije.&nbsp;Ukupna povr&scaron;ina je 78,55 m2 + galerija 18 m2.</p>', '<p>We are offering this new and contemporary designed apartment with breathtaking views across the sea and just a few minutes&rsquo; walk from the water''s edge.&nbsp;Between the building and the beach are trees, part of the original forest on the island, and through here is a path leading down to the natural rocky shore.&nbsp;It is located on the top (3rd) floor with a North/South orientation. The total area is 78.55 m2 + 18 m2 gallery.&nbsp;</p>', '', '<p>Apartman u novogradnji iz kojeg se pru¾a prekrasan pogled na more, dok je do &scaron;ljunèane pla¾e potrebno svega par minuta hodanja.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Izmeðu zgrade i pla¾e je &scaron;uma gdje se takoðer nalaze i prirodno kamenite pla¾e.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Smje&scaron;ten je na 3.katu (zadnjem) S &ndash; J orjentacije.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Zgrada se nalazi na zapadnoj strani otoka Èiova u mirnom okru¾enju idealnom za odmor i u¾ivanje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ukupna povr&scaron;ina je 78,55 m2 + galerija 18 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sastoji se od hodnika, kuhinje + blagovaonice + dnevnog boravka, 1 kupaonice, 2 spavaæe sobe i &nbsp;2 terase.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nisu potrebna nikakava dodatna ulaganja zbog toga &scaron;to je apartman potpuno namje&scaron;ten i opremljen.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Jedno parking mjesto ukljuèeno u cijenu se nalazi ispred zgrade.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U mjestu se nalazi trgovina, restoran i kafiæ, dok je do ostalih sadr¾aja potrebno 10 min. vo¾nje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Meðunarodni aerodrom udaljen je 20 min.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Slobodno nas kontaktirajte za sva dodatna pitanja.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><span style="color: #ff0000;">***NA UPIT &Scaron;ALJEMO VIDEO ZAPISE</span></p>', '<p>We are offering this new and contemporary designed apartment with breathtaking views across the sea and just a few minutes&rsquo; walk from the water''s edge.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Between the building and the beach are trees, part of the original forest on the island, and through here is a path leading down to the natural rocky shore.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is located on the top (3rd) floor with a North/South orientation.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The building is located on the west side of the island Ciovo in a peaceful environment away from the main tourist crowds, and in an excellent location for relaxation and enjoyment.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The total area is 78.55 m2 + 18 m2 gallery.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It consists of hallway, modern open plan kitchen + dining room + living room, 1 bathroom, 2 bedrooms and 2 terraces.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property &nbsp;does not require any additional investment because the apartment is already fully furnished and equipped.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There is one private parking space in front of the building and this is already included in the price.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There is a shop, restaurant and cafe within walking distance, while it takes 10 minutes by car to reach many more options of restaurants, bars, shops and other services, as well as the historic and cultural sights of the main town, Trogir.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The international airport is 20 minutes.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><span style="color: #ff0000;">*** ON DEMAND we send short mobile videos.</span></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>This apartment is excellent value!</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact the office to arrange to view this property.</p>', '', '1174_Apartment_0.jpg', '1174_Apartment_1.jpg', '1174_Apartment_2.jpg', '1174_Apartment_3.jpg', '1174_Apartment_4.jpg', '1174_Apartment_5.jpg', '1174_Apartment_6.jpg', '1174_Apartment_7.jpg', '1174_Apartment_8.jpg'),
(1175, 'Andres', 'Marinoviæ', '099 565 0895', '', 'antoniomarinovic@me.com', 'Trogir', 'Kralja Tomislava 60 (Balan), 6067/1, 6067/2, 6067/3', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '3', '3000', '407', 1, '3975000', '', 2, 2, 2, 1, 1, 2, 8, 8, 'May 11, 2015', '<p>Spektakularna nekretnina smje&scaron;tena u 1.redu do mora na jedinstvenoj lokaciji sa zagarantiranom privatno&scaron;æu. Nalazi se na otoku Èiovu u blizini povijesnog grada Trogira i meðunarodnog aerodroma.&nbsp;Villa je smje&scaron;tena na zemlji&scaron;tu povr&scaron;ine 3000 m2.&nbsp;Na samoj pla¾i se nalazi manja kuæa koja slu¾i kao spremi&scaron;te za brodsku i morsku opremu.&nbsp;Villa se sastoji od suterena, prizemlja i 1.kata sa galerijom. Ukupna povr&scaron;ia iznosi 407 m2 &nbsp;+ terase 120 m2.</p>', '<p>This spectacular property is located in the 1st row to the sea in a unique location with guaranteed privacy. It is situated on the island of Ciovo, on the doorstep of the historic town of Trogir (A UNESCO heritage site) and 15 mins from Split international airport.&nbsp;This stunning villa is situated on a land plot of 3000 m2. On the beach is a small boat house that has extra room for equipment. The Villa itself consists of basement, ground floor and 1st floor with a gallery. Total area inside is 407 m2 + 120 m2 terrace.&nbsp;</p>', '', '<p>Spektakularna nekretnina smje&scaron;tena u 1.redu do mora na jedinstvenoj lokaciji sa zagarantiranom privatno&scaron;æu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nalazi se na otoku Èiovu u blizini povijesnog grada Trogira i meðunarodnog aerodroma.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Villa je smje&scaron;tena na zemlji&scaron;tu povr&scaron;ine 3000 m2 koje je ureðeno kao Mediteranski vrt, dok je pristup pla¾i, osim sa ovog posjeda, moguæ samo morem.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na samoj pla¾i se nalazi manja kuæa koja slu¾i kao spremi&scaron;te za brodsku i morsku opremu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U njoj se takoðer nalazi i manja kuhinja.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sama pla¾a je ureðena i prilagoðena za djecu, dok je ispred moguæe usidriti brod, ali i veæu jahtu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Najveæa usidrena jahta je bila du¾ine 50 metara.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Villa se sastoji od suterena, prizemlja i 1.kata sa galerijom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ukupna povr&scaron;ia iznosi 407 m2 &nbsp;+ terase 120 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U suterenu se nalaze 2 odvojena apartmana od kojih se svaki sastoji od kuhinje, dnevnog boravka, kupaonice i spavaæe sobe.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ispred se nalazi terasa sa pogledom na more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U prizemlju je smje&scaron;ten hodnik, kuhinja, dnevni boravak + kupaonica, 2 spavaæe sobe, 3 kupaonice i 2 terasa sa pogledom na more i vrt.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na 1.katu je hodnik, kuhinja + blagovaonica + dnevni boravak, 4 spavaæe sobe, 3 kupaonice i galerija na kojoj se nalazi radna soba.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sa terase na 1.katu se pru¾a oèaravajuæi pogled na more i vrt.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Villa je potpuno renovirana, namje&scaron;tena i spremna za kori&scaron;tenje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>S obzirom na velièinu zemlji&scaron;ta moguæe je pro&scaron;iriti veæ postojeæu villu, ali i izgraditi jo&scaron; jednu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Osim privatnosti na pla¾i, sa sjeverne strane je garantira veliki zid koji se nalazi na samoj cesti.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Odmah na ulazu se nalazi parking za 8 automobila.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Stojimo na usluzi za sva dodatna pitanja, slike i tlocrte.</p>', '<p>This spectacular property is located in the 1st row to the sea in a unique location with guaranteed privacy.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is situated on the island of Ciovo, on the doorstep of the historic town of Trogir (A UNESCO heritage site) and 15 mins from Split international airport.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>This stunning villa is situated on a land plot of 3000 m2, which has been extensively landscaped and planted &nbsp;in a traditional Mediterranean style, while access to the beach in front of the property is only possible from the villa or with a boat.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the beach is a small boat house that has extra room for equipment, and even incorporates a kitchen.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The beach is clean and safe, and suitable for children, while the sea in front of the property is suitable for anchoring a larger yacht, and has comfortably been used for boats up to 50m long.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The Villa itself consists of basement, ground floor and 1st floor with a gallery.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Total area inside is 407 m2 + 120 m2 terrace.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>In the basement are 2 separate apartments, each of which consists of a kitchen, living room, bathroom and bedroom leading onto a terrace in front, overlooking the sea.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The ground floor has a hall, kitchen, living room, bathroom, 2 bedrooms, and 3 bathrooms.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Outside, in the garden, are two terraces with views of the open sea.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the 1st floor is a hallway, kitchen, dining room, living room, 4 bedrooms, 3 bathrooms and a gallery which is currently used as a study.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>From the terrace on the 1st floor there are amazing views of the sea and garden.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The villa has been completely renovated, to an unusually high standard and I''d completely ready for use.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Given the size of the land plot it is would be possible to make extensive alterations, even adding considerably more space inside or an extra building.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>In addition to the privacy on the beach, on the northern side of the property is a wall which offers protection and privacy from the road.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>At the entrance is a carp ark and private parking for 8 cars.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>We are at your disposal for any further questions, photos and floor plans, so please call us to arrange to view this property.</p>', '', '1175_House-Villa_0.jpg', '1175_House-Villa_1.jpg', '1175_House-Villa_2.jpg', '1175_House-Villa_3.jpg', '1175_House-Villa_4.jpg', '1175_House-Villa_5.jpg', '1175_House-Villa_6.jpg', '1175_House-Villa_7.jpg', '1175_House-Villa_8.jpg'),
(1305, '', 'Rakiæ', '', '', '', 'Zadar', 'Biograd, Soline', 'For sale', 'Land plot', '10', '4800', '0', 1, '1700000', '', 2, 2, 2, 1, 1, 2, 0, 0, 'August 13, 2015', '<p>Graðevinsko zemlji&scaron;te s pogledom na more u T1 zoni (zona za gradnju hotela), smje&scaron;teno je u nizu od vi&scaron;e hotela i okru¾eno gustom borovom &scaron;umom.&nbsp;Zemlji&scaron;te se nalazi u prvom redu, samo 10 m od mora, a od centra mjesta je udaljeno 400 m.&nbsp;Ispred zemlji&scaron;ta nalazi se ureðena &scaron;ljunèana pla¾a.&nbsp;Mo¾e se izgraditi novi hotel graðevinske bruto povr&scaron;ine 3800m&sup2;.</p>', '<p>Croatia Property sales are pleased to offer this rare opportunity to buy a substantial first line plot (4800 m2) with sea views in the T1 zone (zone for the construction of hotels).&nbsp;The land is situated in the first row, only 10 m from the sea and 400m from the centre of the village and it is in the area of other high quality hotels. The beach in front of the building is made from pebbles, and faces South.</p>', '', '<p>Graðevinsko zemlji&scaron;te s pogledom na more u T1 zoni (zona za gradnju hotela), smje&scaron;teno je u nizu od vi&scaron;e hotela i okru¾eno gustom borovom &scaron;umom.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Zemlji&scaron;te se nalazi u prvom redu, samo 10 m od mora, a od centra mjesta je udaljeno 400 m.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ispred zemlji&scaron;ta nalazi se ureðena &scaron;ljunèana pla¾a.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Pravilnog je oblika i ju¾ne orijentacije.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na samom terenu se nalazi ru&scaron;evan objekt koji ima graðevinsku dozvolu te sve komunalne prikljuèke.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Mo¾e se izgraditi novi hotel, graðevinske bruto povr&scaron;ine 3800m&sup2;.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ju¾no orijentirano.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za sve dodatne informacije molimo kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured u Splitu.</p>', '<p>Price 1.7 Million euro &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Croatia Property sales are pleased to offer this rare opportunity to buy a substantial first line plot with sea views in the T1 zone (zone for the construction of hotels).&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The land is situated in the first row, only 10 m from the sea and 400m from the centre of the village and it is in the area of other high quality hotels.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The beach in front of the building is made from pebbles, and faces South.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There is already a building present so utility connections are already present.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The plot allows the construction of new hotel, on an area of 3800m&sup2;.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact our office for more information, and to arrange to visit the location.</p>', '', '1305_Land-plot_0.JPG', '1305_Land-plot_1.JPG', '1305_Land-plot_2.JPG', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(1176, 'Tomislav', 'Sladojeviæ', '098 907 5387', '', 'tomislav@trigoncapital.com', 'Omis', 'Lokva Rogoznica, staro selo, ispod crkve, k.è. 2681/1,2 k.o. rogoznica, ZK 3280', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '750', '1082', '200', 1, '900000', '', 2, 1, 2, 2, 1, 1, 4, 5, 'May 15, 2015', '<p>Luksuzna vila sa velièanstvenim pogledom na more u blizini Omi&scaron;a.&nbsp;Udaljena je od mora 750 m, a sastoji se od prizemlja i kata.&nbsp;Ima ukupnu stambenu povr&scaron;inu 200 m2 + 100 m2 terase, a smje&scaron;tena je na zemlji&scaron;tu povr&scaron;ine 1082 m2.&nbsp;Ova iznimna vila rijedak je primjer kvalitetne i promi&scaron;ljene gradnje te svakako preporuèavamo obilazak kupcima koji tra¾e vrhunsku nekretninu u Hrvatskoj.</p>\r\n<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;">CIJENA SNI®ENA SA 1.200.000 EURA!!</span></p>', '<p>Luxurious state-of-the-art villa with magnificent sea views near Omis.&nbsp;It is situated 750 m from the sea, consists of ground floor and first floor.&nbsp;Total area inside is 200 m2 plus 100 m2 terraces, while the land plot measures 1082 m2.&nbsp;This outstanding property is rare to find in the region and should be seen by anyone looking for a top-end real estate in Croatia.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;">PRICE REDUCED FROM 1.200.000 EURO!!</span></p>', '', '<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;"><strong>CIJENA SNI®ENA SA 1.200.000 EURA!!</strong></span></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Luksuzna vila sa velièanstvenim pogledom na more u blizini Omi&scaron;a.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Udaljena je od mora 750 m, a sastoji se od prizemlja i kata.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ova spektakularna nekretnina ima 3 spavaæe sobe (svaka sa svojom kupaonicom), otvoreni koncept dnevnog boravka i kuhinje, gostinjski apartman, SPA sa jacuzzi-jem, saunu, teretanu, praonicu / spremi&scaron;te, vanjski ro&scaron;tilj, vinski podrum te vanjski grijani bazen.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ima ukupnu stambenu povr&scaron;inu 200 m2 + 100 m2 terase, a smje&scaron;tena je na zemlji&scaron;tu povr&scaron;ine 1082 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ima svu potrebnu infrastrukturu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ju¾no je orijentirana.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sve sobe su klimatizirane, a okuænica dobro odr¾avana &scaron;to ostavlja iznimno dobar utisak.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ima pristup vozilom i parking.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Vlasnik posjeduje licencu za iznajmljivanje.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nekretnina se nalazi pokraj centra malog sela, 5 min vo¾nje od magistralne ceste, &scaron;to joj osigurana mir i potpunu privatnost. &nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ova iznimna vila rijedak je primjer kvalitetne i promi&scaron;ljene gradnje te svakako preporuèavamo obilazak kupcima koji tra¾e vrhunsku nekretninu u Hrvatskoj.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Svi potrebni sadr¾aji se nalaze u blizini.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Mjesto je udaljeno 10-ak km od Omi&scaron;a.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Meðunarodni aerodrom je udaljen 55 km.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Molimo za dodatne informacije kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured u Splitu.</p>', '<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;"><strong>PRICE REDUCED FROM 1.200.000 EURO!!</strong></span></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Luxurious state-of-the-art villa with magnificent sea views near Omis.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is situated 750 m from the sea, consisted of ground floor and first floor.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The villa has 3 en-suite bedrooms, large open-plan living area with kitchen, a guest apartment, SPA with jacuzzi, sauna, gym, laundry room / storage, BBQ area, wince cellar and heated outdoor infinity pool.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Total area inside is 200 m2 plus 100 m2 terraces, while the land plot measures 1082 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It has water and electricity supply.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>South oriented.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>All rooms are air-conditioned, garden well kept and the overal impressions are simply perfect.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It has car access and parking places.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The villa has rental licence.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is located near the center of a very small village, 5 min car ride up the hill from the coastal road, therefore it enjoys full privacy. &nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>This outstanding property is rare to find in the region and should be seen by anyone looking for a top-end real estate in Croatia.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>All necessary facilities are nearby.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Omis town is 12 km awy, while the internationa airport is 55 km away.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact our office for the further information.&nbsp;</p>', '', '1176_House-Villa_0.jpg', '1176_House-Villa_1.jpg', '1176_House-Villa_2.jpg', '1176_House-Villa_3.jpg', '1176_House-Villa_4.jpg', '1176_House-Villa_5.jpg', '1176_House-Villa_6.jpg', '1176_House-Villa_7.jpg', '1176_House-Villa_8.jpg'),
(1177, 'Maja', 'Andriæ', '', '0959024209', 'maja.andric@gradst.hr', 'Kastela', 'Don Petra ®anete 20, Ka¹tel Novi', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '1000', '0', '52', 1, '82000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 'May 19, 2015', '<p>Prekrasan apartman u Ka&scaron;telima, smje&scaron;ten 1 km od mora, u novoizgraðenoj stambenoj zgradi.&nbsp;Nalazi se na 1. katu zgrade koja se sastoji od prizemlja, 2 kata i potkrovlja.&nbsp;Ima ukupnu stambenu povr&scaron;inu 52 m2.&nbsp;Apartman je u odliènom stanju, kompletno oèuvan i namje&scaron;ten.&nbsp;Ima svu potrebnu infrastrukturu.&nbsp;Ju¾no je orijentiran.</p>', '<p>We are pleased to offer this beautiful apartment in Kastela, located 1 km from the sea, in a new residential building, facing south.&nbsp;It is located on the 1st floor of a building consisting of ground floor, 2 floors and attic. It has a total surface of 52 m2. The apartment is in excellent condition, well maintained, and furnished. It has all the necessary infrastructure- electric, broadband, connection to the main drains etc.&nbsp;</p>', '', '<p>Prekrasan apartman u Ka&scaron;telima, smje&scaron;ten 1 km od mora, u novoizgraðenoj stambenoj zgradi.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nalazi se na 1. katu zgrade koja se sastoji od prizemlja, 2 kata i potkrovlja.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Zgrada je izgraðena 2008. godine, te posjeduje energetski certifikat razred A.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartman se sastoji od 2 spavaæe sobe, kuhinje, blagovaonice, dnevnog boravka, kupaonice i loðe.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ima ukupnu stambenu povr&scaron;inu 52 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kupaonica ima ugraðeno podno grijanje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartman je u odliènom stanju, kompletno oèuvan i namje&scaron;ten.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ima svu potrebnu infrastrukturu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ju¾no je orijentiran.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Vlasnik posjeduje jedno parking mjesto.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Od centra mjesta je udaljen 500 m, a u blizini se nalazi novoizgraðena &scaron;kola, te svi potrebni sadr¾aji.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Trogir je udaljen 8 km, a Split 17 km.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Medjunarodni aerodrom udaljen je 4 km.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za sve dodatne informacije slobodno nas kontaktirajte.</p>', '<p>We are pleased to offer this beautiful apartment in Kastela, located 1 km from the sea, in a new residential building, facing south.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is located on the 1st floor of a building consisting of ground floor, 2 floors and attic.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The building was built in 2008, and has energy certification- class A.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The apartment consists of 2 bedrooms, kitchen, dining room, living room, bathroom and balcony.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It has a total surface of 52 m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The bathroom has underfloor heating.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The apartment is in excellent condition, well maintained, and furnished.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It has all the necessary infrastructure- electric, broadband, connection to the main drains etc.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The owner has one private parking space.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>From the town center is 500 m, where there many options for shops, some great Konobas, bakery, coffee shops, and is located near the newly constructed school.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Trogir is 8 km, and Split 17 km.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The international airport is 4 km.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>To visit this property please contact our office in Split.</p>', '', '1177_Apartment_0.jpg', '1177_Apartment_1.jpg', '1177_Apartment_2.jpg', '1177_Apartment_3.jpg', '1177_Apartment_4.jpg', '1177_Apartment_5.jpg', '1177_Apartment_6.jpg', '1177_Apartment_7.jpg', '1177_Apartment_8.jpg'),
(1178, 'Tonæi', 'Racic', '', '098225607', 'as.pletis@gmail.com', 'Hvar', 'Basina, Hvar', 'For sale', 'Old stone house', '90', '490', '55', 1, '350000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 2, 1, 'May 20, 2015', '<p>Prekrasna kamena kuæa za odmor, smje&scaron;tena na atraktivnoj lokaciji, samo 90 m od mora.&nbsp;Nalazi se na osami te ima predivan pogled na more i otok Braè.&nbsp;Kuæa je prizemnica ukupne stambene povr&scaron;ine 55 m2.&nbsp;Smje&scaron;tena je na zemlji&scaron;tu od 490 m2.&nbsp;Tu se nalazi i sprema metalne konstrukcije koju je moguæe odvojiti od prizemnice.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;">CIJENA SNI®ENA SA 370.000 EUR!!</span></p>', '<p>We have this traditional old stone house on Hvar island, located in anattractive location, only 90 m from the sea.&nbsp;It is situated in a secluded location facing the narrow strait between Brac Island and Hvar with superb views. The house has a total floor area of 55 m2.&nbsp;It is situated on a plot of 490 m2.&nbsp;There is also a metal storage structure that can be part of the house orseparated from it.</p>\r\n<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;">PRICE REDUCED FROM 370.000 EUR!!&nbsp;</span></p>', '', '<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;"><strong>CIJENA SNI®ENA SA 370.000 EUR!!</strong></span></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Prekrasna kamena kuæa za odmor, smje&scaron;tena na atraktivnoj lokaciji, samo 90 m od mora.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nalazi se na osami te ima predivan pogled na more i otok Braè.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je prizemnica te se sastoji od dvije sobe, kupaonice te kuhinje s blagovaonicom ukupne stambene povr&scaron;ine 55 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Smje&scaron;tena je na zemlji&scaron;tu od 490 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Tu se nalazi i sprema metalne konstrukcije koju je moguæe odvojiti od prizemnice.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa posjeduje licencu za iznajmljivanje te je kategorizirana sa 3 zvjezdice.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ima parking mjesto, te pristup makadamskom cestom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je prikljuèena na gradski vodovod.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Postoji moguænost gradnje jacuzzija i bazena ispred kuæe.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Mjesto je okru¾eno gustom borovom &scaron;umom, poljima maslina, vinovom lozom i lavandom, te èistim morem bogatim brojnim vrstama &scaron;koljaka i riba, &scaron;to èini ovo podruèje vrlo primamljivim ljubiteljima ronjenja.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Stari Grad (trajektna luka) gdje se nalaze restorani, kafiæi i trgovine udaljen je 7 minuta vo¾nje.</p>', '<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;"><strong>PRICE REDUCED FROM 370.000 EUR!!&nbsp;</strong></span></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>We have this traditional old stone house on Hvar island, located in anattractive location, only 90 m from the sea.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is situated in a secluded location facing the narrow strait between Brac Island and Hvar with superb views.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house has just a ground floor which has two bedrooms, bathroom, kitchen, dining room with a total floor area of 55 m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is situated on a plot of 490 m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There is also a metal storage structure that can be part of the house orseparated from it.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house has a license for rental and is categorized with 3 stars.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It has a private parking space and access to the macadam road.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house is connected to city water.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There is a possibility of making improvements, such as building a jacuzzi and swimming pool in front of the house.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The area is surrounded by thick pine forests, fields of olive trees, grapevines and lavender, and clear waters rich in fish and shellfish species,which makes this area very attractive for diving.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Stari Grad which is the main port on the island and ferry terminal, is wherethere are several restaurants, bars and shops and other services, is 7-minute drive.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>To visit this property, please contact the office and we will make anappointment.</p>', '', '1178_Old-stone-house_0.jpg', '1178_Old-stone-house_1.jpg', '1178_Old-stone-house_2.jpg', '1178_Old-stone-house_3.jpg', '1178_Old-stone-house_4.jpg', '1178_Old-stone-house_5.jpg', '1178_Old-stone-house_6.jpg', '1178_Old-stone-house_7.jpg', '1178_Old-stone-house_8.jpg'),
(1179, 'Vesna ', '', '', '004366473761864', '', 'Hvar', 'Zavala', 'For sale', 'Old stone house', '300', '0', '100', 1, '120000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 3, 2, 'May 20, 2015', '<p>Predivna kamena kuæa s otvorenim pogledom na more u mjestu na ju¾noj strani otoka Hvara.&nbsp;Ova obiteljska kuæa je kompletno renovirana i opremljena.&nbsp;Udaljena je od mora samo 300 m.&nbsp;Ima ukupnu stambenu povr&scaron;inu 100 m2, a sastoji se od prizemlja i kata.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;">CIJENA SNI®ENA SA 130.000 EURA!</span></p>', '<p>We are offering this charming old stone house, completely renovated, with great sea views. It is situated on the south coast on the island of Hvar, 300m from the sea, in a typical Dalmatian village. This fishing village is a few kilometres from Jelsa, rich in the scents from lavender and olive trees and with a shore of crystal clear water and sandy beaches which make it a very attractive destination for many tourists. This house is completely renovated and equipped. It has a total surface of 100 m2 and consists of two floors.</p>\r\n<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;">PRICE REDUCED FROM 130.000 EURO!</span></p>', '', '<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;"><strong>CIJENA SNI®ENA SA 130.000 EURA!</strong></span></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Predivna kamena kuæa s otvorenim pogledom na more u mjestu na ju¾noj strani otoka Hvara.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ova obiteljska kuæa je kompletno renovirana i opremljena.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Udaljena je od mora samo 300 m.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ima ukupnu stambenu povr&scaron;inu 100 m2, a sastoji se od prizemlja i kata.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U prizemlju se nalaze kuhinja, blagovaonica, kupaonica, jedna spavaæa soba te terasa.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Drveno stepeni&scaron;te spaja prizemlje s prvim katom gdje se nalaze jo&scaron; dvije spavaæe sobe, wc, soba koja mo¾e poslu¾iti kao dnevni boravak, te balkon s oèaravajuæim pogledom na more.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Vlasniku pripada i drvena ostava koja se nalazi pored kuæe.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa ima svu potrebnu infrastrukturu te pristup vozilom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Parking je natkriven lozom, &scaron;to ljeti omoguæuje hlad.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Centar mjesta gdje se nalaze trgovina, pekarna i restorani udaljen je nekoliko minuta &scaron;etnje.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ovo ribarsko mjesto smje&scaron;teno je nekoliko kilometara od Jelse, obiluje mirisima lavande, maslinicima, a kristalno èisto more i &scaron;ljunèane pla¾e ga èine nezaobilaznom destinacijom mnogobrojnih turista.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Trajektna luka Stari Grad je udaljena 20 km.&nbsp;</p>', '<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;"><strong>PRICE REDUCED FROM 130.000 EURO!</strong></span></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>We are offering this charming old stone house, completely renovated, with great sea views.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is situated on the south coast on the island of Hvar, 300m from the sea, in a typical Dalmatian village.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>This fishing village is a few kilometres from Jelsa, rich in the scents from lavender and olive trees and with a shore of crystal clear water and sandy beaches which make it a very attractive destination for many tourists.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>This house is completely renovated and equipped.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It has a total surface of 100 m2 and consists of two floors.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The ground floor has a kitchen, dining room, bathroom, bedroom and covered terrace.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>A wooden staircase connects the ground floor to the first floor where there are two bedrooms, a bathroom, and a room that can serve as a living room with a balcony with stunning sea views.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The owner also has a wooden storage room which is located next to the house.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house has all the necessary infrastructure and access to a vehicle.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The private parking place is covered with vines, which provides shade in summer.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Town centre where there are shops, a bakery and restaurants is a few minutes&rsquo; walk.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ferry port Stari Grad is 20 km away.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>To view this property, please contact the office and make an appointment.</p>', '', '1179_Old-stone-house_0.jpg', '1179_Old-stone-house_1.jpg', '1179_Old-stone-house_2.jpg', '1179_Old-stone-house_3.jpg', '1179_Old-stone-house_4.jpg', '1179_Old-stone-house_5.jpg', '1179_Old-stone-house_6.jpg', '1179_Old-stone-house_7.jpg', '1179_Old-stone-house_8.jpg'),
(1180, 'Jure', 'Caratan', '', '0958917069', '', 'Hvar', 'Zavala', 'For sale', 'Old stone house', '300', '1200', '300', 1, '250000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 4, 1, 'May 20, 2015', '<p>Stara kamena kuæa s predivnim pogledom na more, smje&scaron;tena na ju¾noj strani otoka Hvara.&nbsp;Nalazi se u mirnom podruèju, na udaljenosti od samo 300 m od mora.&nbsp;Kuæi pripadaju jo&scaron; dvije ru&scaron;evne kuæe te veliki vrt smje&scaron;ten na zemlji&scaron;tu povr&scaron;ine 1200 m2, na kojem se mo¾e izgraditi i bazen.&nbsp;Kuæa se sastoji od prizemlja, prvog i drugog kata ukupne stambene povr&scaron;ine 300 m2.</p>', '<p>We have this old stone house with a beautiful view of the sea, located on the south side of the island of Hvar. It is located in a quiet area, at a distance of only 300 m from the sea, on the edge of a charming village. The house consists of ground, first and second floors with a total area of 300 m2. The property also has two ruins and a large garden situated on a large land area of 1200 m2.&nbsp;</p>', '', '<p>Stara kamena kuæa s predivnim pogledom na more, smje&scaron;tena na ju¾noj strani otoka Hvara.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nalazi se u mirnom podruèju, na udaljenosti samo 300 m od mora.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæi pripadaju jo&scaron; dvije ru&scaron;evne kuæe te veliki vrt smje&scaron;ten na zemlji&scaron;tu povr&scaron;ine 1200 m2, na kojem se mo¾e izgraditi i bazen.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ispred glavne kuæe se nalaze ljetna kuhinja, konoba i dvori&scaron;te, dok se u kuæi nalaze kamin i blagovaonica.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa se sastoji od prizemlja, prvog i drugog kata.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Vanjske stepenice vode na prvi kat gdje se nalaze dvije sobe i kupaonica.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Drvenim stepeni&scaron;tem je prvi kat spojen s drugim gdje se nalaze jo&scaron; dvije nekori&scaron;tene sobe.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa ima svu potrebnu infrastrukturu, ali iziskuje renovaciju.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ima pristup vozilom, a parking se nalazi ispred kuæe.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Centar mjesta gdje se nalaze trgovina, pekarna i restorani udaljen je nekoliko minuta &scaron;etnje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ovo ribarsko mjesto smje&scaron;teno je nekoliko kilometara od Jelse, obiluje mirisima lavande, maslinicima, a kristalno èisto more i &scaron;ljunèane pla¾e ga èine nezaobilaznom destinacijom mnogobrojnih turista.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Trajektna luka Stari Grad je udaljena 20 km.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>We have this old stone house with a beautiful view of the sea, located on the south side of the island of Hvar.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is located in a quiet area, at a distance of only 300 m from the sea, on the edge of a charming village.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>This fishing village is a few kilometres from Jelsa, which is rich in the scents of lavender, olive trees and has crystal clear water and sandy beaches which make it an unmissable destination for many tourists.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house consists of ground, first and second floors.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>External stairs lead to the first floor where there are two bedrooms and a bathroom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>A wooden staircase connects the floors to each other and the first floor has two unused rooms.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property also has two ruins and a large garden situated on a large land area of 1200 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>This is enough space to make improvements such as building a swimming pool.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>In front of the main house is a summer bbq/kitchen, wine cellar and garden, and other features in the house include an old fireplace and dining room.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property needs some renovation, but structurally, it appears in good condition.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house has all the necessary infrastructure, but requires renovation.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It has car access and parking in front of the house.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The town centre where there are shops, a bakery and restaurants is a few minutes&rsquo; walk.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The Ferry port Stari Grad is 20 km away.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>To visit this property please contact our office to make an appointment.</p>', '', '1180_Old-stone-house_0.jpg', '1180_Old-stone-house_1.jpg', '1180_Old-stone-house_2.jpg', '1180_Old-stone-house_3.jpg', '1180_Old-stone-house_4.jpg', '1180_Old-stone-house_5.jpg', '1180_Old-stone-house_6.jpg', '1180_Old-stone-house_7.jpg', '1180_Old-stone-house_8.jpg'),
(1181, 'Marija', 'Sardeliæ', '', '095-874-9762', 'anabacetic@yahoo.com', 'Korcula', 'Pri¾ba, 20271 Blato/Koèula', 'For sale', 'Land plot', '25', '600', '0', 1, '95000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 0, 0, 'May 20, 2015', '<p>Graðevinsko zemlji&scaron;te u predivnoj uvali na ju¾noj strani otoka Korèule, samo 25 m udaljeno od mora.&nbsp;Zemlji&scaron;te ima pogled na more, te je okru¾eno zelenilom.&nbsp;Nalazi se u ugodnoj okolini, mirnom podruèju, u drugom redu do mora.&nbsp;Ima povr&scaron;inu 600 m2, te dozvoljenu gradnju za obiteljsku kuæu/vikendicu s gara¾om, prizemljem, katom i visokim potkrovljem.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>We are offering this building land in a beautiful bay on the south side of Korcula island, in a most sought after location, just 25 m from the sea. A rare opportunity to buy so close to the shore. The land has a beautiful view of the sea, elevated by the natural slope of the shore, and is surrounded by greenery. It has an area of 600 m2, on which there is permission to build a house with ground floor, first floor and second floor plus garage.</p>', '', '<p>Graðevinsko zemlji&scaron;te u predivnoj uvali na ju¾noj strani otoka Korèule, samo 25 m udaljeno od mora.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Zemlji&scaron;te ima predivan pogled na more, te je okru¾eno zelenilom.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nalazi se u ugodnoj okolini, mirnom podruèju, u drugom redu do mora.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ima povr&scaron;inu 600 m2, te dozvoljenu gradnju za obiteljsku kuæu/vikendicu s gara¾om, prizemljem, katom i visokim potkrovljem.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Buduæi da se zemlji&scaron;te nalazi blizu asfaltirane ceste, ima pristup vozilom.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Prikljuèci za struju, vodu i telefon se nalaze uz cestu nadomak zemlji&scaron;tu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Svi potrebni sadr¾aji (trgovine, restorani, barovi...) nalaze se u blizini.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Pri¾ba se nalazi na ju¾noj strani otoka Korèule, smje&scaron;tena je na obali uz samo more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Turistièki je popularna, a u blizini se nalaze i otoèiæi koji obiluju &scaron;ljunèanim pla¾ama i kristalno èistim morem.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Udaljena je od Vele Luke 17 km, a od grada Korèule 40 km.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>We are offering this building land in a beautiful bay on the south side of Korcula island, in a most sought after location, just 25 m from the sea.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>A rare opportunity to buy so close to the shore.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The land has a beautiful view of the sea, elevated by the natural slope of the shore, and is surrounded by greenery.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is situated in a pleasant environment, a quiet area, in the second row to the sea, with shops, bakery and other services and attractions in the village, close by.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The land is located near a paved road, which gives access with a vehicle and there are already connections for electricity, water and telephone along the road near the property.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It has an area of 600 m2, on which there is permission to build a house with ground floor, first floor and second floor plus garage.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is 17 km from Vela Luka and 40 km from the city of Korcula.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact our office to arrange a visit to this location.</p>', '', '1181_Land-plot_0.jpg', '1181_Land-plot_1.jpg', '1181_Land-plot_2.jpg', '1181_Land-plot_3.jpg', '1181_Land-plot_4.jpg', '1181_Land-plot_5.jpg', '1181_Land-plot_6.jpg', '1181_Land-plot_7.jpg', '1181_Land-plot_8.jpg'),
(1182, 'Mislav', 'Lovic', '', '098 733777', 'mislav.lovic@st.t-com.hr', 'Omis', 'Iva¹njak VII / 1b Lokva Rogoznica, k.è. 4189 k.o. rogoznica', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '70', '986', '252', 1, '990000', '', 2, 1, 2, 2, 1, 1, 3, 5, 'May 21, 2015', '<p>Predstavljamo modernu luksuznu vilu sa otvorenim pogledom na more.&nbsp;Nekretnina se nalazi u malom mjestu svega 8 km ju¾no od Omi&scaron;a.&nbsp;U podrumu se nalaze gara¾a, gostinjski studio apartman, praonica rublja te SPA centar sa saunom, teretanom, jacuzzijem i kupaonicom. Sve su prostorije u cijelosti opremljene i namje&scaron;tene, a nekretnina kategorizirana za turistièki najam sa 5 zvjezdica.&nbsp;Vila ima ukupno 409 m2 stvarne povr&scaron;ine, a primjenom redukcijskih koeficijenata neto korisna povr&scaron;ina iznosi 252 m2.</p>', '<p>We are proud to present this luxurious modern villa with open sea views. The property is located in a small village, only 8 km south of Omis. The basement contains garage, guest studio apartment, laundry and SPA center with sauna, gym, jacuzzi and bathroom. All rooms are fully furnished and equipped with modern appliances. The property has 5 star rental license.&nbsp;Overal real size is 409 sq.m, while reduced net size equals to 252 sq.m.</p>', '', '<p>Predstavljamo modernu luksuznu vilu sa otvorenim pogledom na more.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nekretnina se nalazi u malom mjestu svega 8 km ju¾no od Omi&scaron;a.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U podrumu se nalaze gara¾a, gostinjski studio apartman, praonica rublja te SPA centar sa saunom, teretanom, jacuzzijem i kupaonicom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U prizemlju je smje&scaron;ten dnevni prostor sa kuhinjom, blagovaonicom i wc-om, a na katu se nalaze tri spavaæe sove, svaka sa kupaonicom u kojoj je podno grijanje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sve su prostorije u cijelosti opremljene i namje&scaron;tene, a nekretnina kategorizirana za turistièki najam sa 5 zvjezdica.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Vila ima ukupno 409 m2 stvarne povr&scaron;ine, a primjenom redukcijskih koeficijenata neto korisna povr&scaron;ina iznosi 252 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nekretnina je arhitektonski osmi&scaron;ljena na naèin da iz svih glavnih prostorija ima pogled na more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U prizemlju objekta nalazi se vanjski bazen pokraj kojeg je terasa za sunèanje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Pojedine sobe imaju izlaze na boène terase (vrtove).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Zemlji&scaron;te je hortikulturno ureðeno te opremljeno automatskim sustavom za navodnjavanje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Od ostalih katekteristika vrijedi spomenuti centralni sustav za upravljanje klimatizacijom, alarm i video nadzor, vatronepropusna vrata u tehnièkim prostorijama u podrumu, luksomat za regulaciju rasvjete.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Cijena ovisi o naèinu kupnje &ndash; putem preuzimanja tvrtke (990.000 EUR) ili kupnje same nekretnine (1,35 mil. EUR).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U cijenu je ukljuèen i projekt sa plaæenim komunalnim davanjima za jo&scaron; jednu vilu pokraj postojeæe.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za detalje molimo kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured.</p>', '<p>We are proud to present this luxurious modern villa with open sea views.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property is located in a small village, only 8 km south of Omis.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The basement contains garage, guest studio apartment, laundry and SPA center with sauna, gym, jacuzzi and bathroom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ground floor features large living area, kitchen, dining room and toilet.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There are three en-suite bedrooms on the first floor and each bathroom has underfloor heating.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>All rooms are fully furnished and equipped with modern appliances.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property has 5 star rental license.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Overal real size is 409 sq.m, while reduced net size equals to 252 sq.m.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>This property is architecturally designed in a way that provides sea views from all major rooms.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the ground floor there is an outdoor swimming pool with sun deck.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Some bedrooms have access to side terraces (gardens).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The plot is nicely landscaped with automatic irrigation system.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Other features include central air-con system, alarm and video surveillance, fireproof doors in the engineering room, automated illumination control system. &nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The price depends on the purchase mode &ndash; by overtaking the company (990.000 EUR) or buying the sole property (1,35 mil EUR).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The price includes a project with paid communal feses for another villa to be built next to this.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For more details please contact our office.</p>', '', '1182_House-Villa_0.jpg', '1182_House-Villa_1.jpg', '1182_House-Villa_2.jpg', '1182_House-Villa_3.jpg', '1182_House-Villa_4.jpg', '1182_House-Villa_5.jpg', '1182_House-Villa_6.jpg', '1182_House-Villa_7.jpg', '1182_House-Villa_8.jpg'),
(1183, 'Margita', 'Bakotiæ', '091 447 8144', '', 'margita.bakotic@gmail.com', 'Omis', 'Krug 3, Krug &#8211; Krilo Jesenice Krilo Jesenice, k.è. 6300/2 k.o. jesenice', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '800', '678', '220', 1, '680000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 1, 3, 2, 'May 21, 2015', '<p>Predivna &scaron;armanta vila smje&scaron;tena na 20tak minuta vo¾nje od Splita. Nekretnina se nalazi na uzvi&scaron;enom polo¾aju s kojeg se pru¾a spektakularan pogled na braèki kanal. Unutra&scaron;njost je ukusno dizajnirana u tradicionalnom mediteranskom stilu. Glavna kuæa prostire se na tri eta¾e ukupne stambene povr&scaron;ine 220 m2, a&nbsp;nalazi se na zemlji&scaron;tu povr&scaron;ine 678 m2.</p>', '<p>Gorgeous villa at 20 min car ride south of Split. The property is in an elevated position, offering spectacular sea views accross towards Brac island.&nbsp;The interior is tastefully designed following tradiotional Mediterranean style. The main house is spread over 3 floor, total living area of 220 m2, one of which serves as a guest apartment, while the other two floors contain living and dining area, kitchen, 3 bedrooms and 2 bathrooms.&nbsp;The villa sits on the land plot of 678 m2.</p>', '', '<p>Predivna &scaron;armanta vila smje&scaron;tena na 20tak minuta vo¾nje od Splita.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nekretnina se nalazi na uzvi&scaron;enom polo¾aju s kojeg se pru¾a spektakularan pogled na braèki kanal.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Unutra&scaron;njost je ukusno dizajnirana u tradicionalnom mediteranskom stilu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Glavna kuæa prostire se na tri eta¾e ukupne stambene povr&scaron;ine 220 m2, od kojih prizemna mo¾e poslu¾iti kao gistinjski apartman, dok se na ostale dvije eta¾e nalaze dveni prostor sa blagovaonicom, kuhinja, 3 spavaæe sobe i 2 kupaonice.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Vila se nalazi na zemlji&scaron;tu povr&scaron;ine 678 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Pokraj kuæe nalaze se gara¾a, parkirali&scaron;e, grijani bazen, velika terasa za sunèanje, vanjski kamin, spremi&scaron;te te lijepo odr¾avani vrt.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nekretnina je kategorizirana te se mo¾e koristiti kao ugodan obiteljski dom, ali i investicija. &nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Svi potrebni sadr¾aji se nalaze u blizini.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Omis je udaljen 7 km.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Do meðunarodnog aerodroma je potrebno 1h vo¾nje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za sve dodatne informacije i razgledavanje molimo da nas kontaktirate.</p>', '<p>Gorgeous villa at 20 min car ride south of Split.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property is in an elevated position, offering spectacular sea views accross towards Brac island.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The interior is tastefully designed following tradiotional Mediterranean style.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The main house is spread over 3 floor, total living area of 220 m2, one of which serves as a guest apartment, while the other two floors contain living and dining area, kitchen, 3 bedrooms and 2 bathrooms.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The villa sits on the land plot of 678 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>This property also comes with the garage, parking place, heated swimming pool, large sun deck, BBQ, storage and well kept garden.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The villa has rental license and can be used both as a cozy family home and investment. &nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The local area serves the property well.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The shore is clean and pebbled, with barely any tide, making it safe for swimming and water sports, while the nearest coffee bar is within walking distance.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Omis town is 7 km away.The international airport is 1 hour drive.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For additional information and a tour please contact us.</p>', '', '1183_House-Villa_0.jpg', '1183_House-Villa_1.jpg', '1183_House-Villa_2.jpg', '1183_House-Villa_3.jpg', '1183_House-Villa_4.jpg', '1183_House-Villa_5.jpg', '1183_House-Villa_6.jpg', '1183_House-Villa_7.jpg', '1183_House-Villa_8.jpg');
