(1184, 'Damir i Filip', 'Markovic', 'k.è. 4292     z.u.5487', '091 244 3009', '', 'Split', 'Zoraniæeva 8', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '400', '0', '28', 2, '36000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 1, 'May 21, 2015', '<p>Jednosoban apartman u Splitu na odliènoj lokaciji, u samom centru grada, u blizini svih potrebnih sadr¾aja.&nbsp;Apartman se nalazi u prizemlju zgrade koja je udaljena 400 m od mora. Sastoji se od jedne sobe, kuhinje s blagovaonicom i kupaonice ukupne stambene povr&scaron;ine 28 m2.&nbsp;Apartmanu pripada i ostava. Zajednièko dvori&scaron;te koje je smje&scaron;teno sa stra¾nje strane zgrade &nbsp;ima pristup iz hodnika, ali ga koriste samo vlasnici ovog apartmana.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>We are offering this one bedroom apartment in a great location near the citycentre in Split, close to all necessary facilities.&nbsp;The apartment is located on the ground floor of the building, which islocated 400 m from the sea.&nbsp;It has one bedroom, a kitchen with a pantry, and a bathroom with a totalfloor area of 28 m2.&nbsp;It has a shared yard, which is located on the back of the building withaccess from the hallway, but, in practice, the only users are the owners ofthis apartment.&nbsp;</p>', '', '<p>Jednosoban apartman u Splitu na odliènoj lokaciji, u samom centru grada, u blizini svih potrebnih sadr¾aja.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartman se nalazi u prizemlju zgrade koja je udaljena 400 m od mora.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sastoji se od jedne sobe, kuhinje s blagovaonicom i kupaonice ukupne stambene povr&scaron;ine 28 m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartmanu pripada i ostava.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Zajednièko dvori&scaron;te koje je smje&scaron;teno sa stra¾nje strane zgrade ima pristup iz hodnika, ali ga koriste samo vlasnici ovog apartmana.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Voda i struja su prikljuèeni.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Pogodno za iznajmljivanje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Parking se nalazi u blizini.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U blizini se nalaze mnogobrojni restorani, kafiæi, suvenirnice i ostali sadr¾aji.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Centar Splita je iz godine u godinu sve popularnije turistièko odredi&scaron;te, te je ovaj apartman idealan za iznajmljivanje, ali i za vlastito u¾ivanje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Meðunarodni aerodrom udaljen je 40 min. vo¾nje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za sve dodatne informacije slobodno nas kontaktirajte.</p>', '<p>We are offering this one bedroom apartment in a great location near the citycentre in Split, close to all necessary facilities.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The apartment is located on the ground floor of the building, which islocated 400 m from the sea.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It has one bedroom, a kitchen with a pantry, and a bathroom with a totalfloor area of 28 m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It has a shared yard, which is located on the back of the building withaccess from the hallway, but, in practice, the only users are the owners ofthis apartment.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Water and electricity are connected.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>This property would be suitable for renting to tourists.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Parking is located nearby.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nearby are many restaurants, cafes, souvenir shops and other facilities, aswell as the cultural and historic attractions of the city.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The centre of Split is becoming a more and more popular touristdestination, with the season now extending to almost all year long.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The international airport is 40 minutes.</p>', '', '1184_Apartment_0.jpg', '1184_Apartment_1.jpg', '1184_Apartment_2.jpg', '1184_Apartment_3.jpg', '1184_Apartment_4.jpg', '1184_Apartment_5.jpg', '1184_Apartment_6.jpg', '1184_Apartment_7.jpg', '1184_Apartment_8.jpg'),
(1185, '', 'Dr. Trogrliæ', '', '098 348 129', '', 'Omis', 'Lokva Rogoznica &#8211; Ruskamen, 300m iza Sagite', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '200', '367', '165', 2, '160000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 3, 2, 'May 21, 2015', '<p>SNI®ENA CIJENA!&nbsp;Samostojeæa obiteljska kuæa, nedaleko od lijepe &scaron;ljunèane pla¾e i sa lijepim pogledom na more.&nbsp;Sastoji se od prizemlja, prvog kata &nbsp;i potkrovlja ukupne stambene povr&scaron;ine 165 m2.&nbsp;Povr&scaron;ina zemlji&scaron;ta na kojem se nalazi kuæa iznosi 367 m2.</p>', '<p>PRICED TO SELL!&nbsp;Detached family house, not far from the nice gravel beach and with great sea views.&nbsp;It consists of a ground floor, first floor and the attick, total living space od 165 m2.&nbsp;The land plot measures 367 m2.</p>', '', '<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;"><strong>SNI®ENA CIJENA!</strong></span></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Samostojeæa obiteljska kuæa, nedaleko od lijepe &scaron;ljunèane pla¾e i sa lijepim pogledom na more.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sastoji se od prizemlja, prvog kata &nbsp;i potkrovlja ukupne stambene povr&scaron;ine 165 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U prizemlju se nalazi ostava/wc.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Prvi kat se sastoji od kuhinje, dnevnog boravka, kupaonice i spavaæe sobe.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U potkrovlju se nalate 2 spavaæe sobe i kupaonica.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Povr&scaron;ina zemlji&scaron;ta na kojem se nalazi kuæa iznosi 367 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæi je potrebna obnova, kako izvana tako i iznutra, ukljuèujuæi nove podne i zidne obloge kao i novo pokuæstvo.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Meðutim, struktura kuæe je solidna.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ima dovoljno okuænice na kojoj se mo¾e formirati lijepi vrt sa parkingom.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Cijena je sni¾ena &ndash; kuæa ne ko&scaron;ta vi&scaron;e od prosjeènog stana u okolici!</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Svi potrebni sadr¾aji se nalaze u blizini.Do meðunarodnog aerodroma je potrebno 1h vo¾nje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za sve dodatne informacije i razgledavanje molimo da nas kontaktirate.</p>', '<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;"><strong>PRICED TO SELL!</strong></span></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Detached family house, not far from the nice gravel beach and with great sea views.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It consists of a ground floor, first floor and the attick, total living space od 165 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the ground floor there is storage/wc.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>First floor consists of kitchen, living room, bathroom and one bedroom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>In the attic there are 2 bedrooms and bathroom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The land plot measures 367 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house needs refurbishment, both external and internal, possibly new flooring, tiling as well as new furniture.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There is enough space to form a nice garden with parking.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Now priced to sell &ndash; it does not cost more than an average apartment in the area!&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The local area serves the property well.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The shore is clean and pebbled, with barely any tide, making it safe for swimming and water sports, while the nearest coffee bar is within walking distance.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The town of Omis is very much ''geared up'' to tourists and it provide a range of shops, and good restaurants to explore.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The international airport is 1 hour drive.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For additional information and a tour please contact us.</p>', '', '1185_House-Villa_0.jpg', '1185_House-Villa_1.jpg', '1185_House-Villa_2.jpg', '1185_House-Villa_3.jpg', '1185_House-Villa_4.jpg', '1185_House-Villa_5.jpg', '1185_House-Villa_6.jpg', '1185_House-Villa_7.jpg', '1185_House-Villa_8.jpg'),
(1186, '®arko', 'Ba¹iæ', '', 'Snje¾ana ¾ena 0997358811', 'zarkobasic@net.hr', 'Primosten', 'Put Plate 11a Primo¹ten, 403/2 k.o. Primo¹ten', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '150', '130', '150', 1, '370000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 3, 2, 'May 21, 2015', '<p>U centru prekrasnog malog mjesta Primo&scaron;ten nalazi se dvojna kuæa udaljena 150 &nbsp;m od mora.&nbsp;Sastoji se od prizemlja i 1. kata ukupne stambene povr&scaron;ine 150 m2. Zemlji&scaron;te ima povr&scaron;inu 130 m2.</p>', '<p>We are offering this semi-detached house in the centre of the small village of Primosten.The property is situated just 150 from the shore and harbour in this traditional and beautiful Dalmatian village.&nbsp;It consists of ground and first floors with a total floor area of 150 m2. The land plot measures 130 m2.</p>', '', '<p>U centru prekrasnog malog mjesta Primo&scaron;ten nalazi se dvojna kuæa udaljena 150 &nbsp;m od mora.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sastoji se od prizemlja i 1. kata ukupne stambene povr&scaron;ine 150 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U prizemlju se nalazi apartman sa kuhinjom, blagovaonicom, dnevnim boravkom, 1 spavaæom sobom, kupaonicom, ljetnom kuhinjom i terasom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na prvom katu se takoðer nalazi apartman koji se sastoji od kuhinje, blagovaonice, dnevnog boravka, 2 spavaæe sobe, hodnika, kupaonice i 2 balkona.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sa jednog balkona pru¾a se pogled na more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Orijentacija kuæe je zapadna, dok je glavni ulaz sa istoène strane.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Okuænica iznosi 50 m2 i cijela je poploèana kamenom.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Oba apartman su dizajnerski ureðena te nije potrebno nikakvo ulaganje u namje&scaron;taj.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Zbog atraktivnog polo¾aja kuæu je lako iznajmiti tijekom turistièke sezone.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>1. kat posjeduje licencu za iznajmljivanje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>S obzirom da se kuæa nalazi u starom dijelu grada parking mjesto nalazi se cca. 30 m udaljeno od kuæe.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Svi potrebni sadr¾aji nalaze se u blizini.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za sve dodatne informacije slobodno nas kontaktirajte.</p>', '<p>We are offering this semi-detached house in the centre of the small village of Primosten.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property is situated just 150 from the shore and harbour in this traditional and beautiful Dalmatian village.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It consists of ground and first floors with a total floor area of 150 m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The ground floor apartment has a kitchen, dining room, living room, 1 bedroom, bathroom, outdoor summer kitchen and terrace.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the first floor there is a second apartment with a kitchen, dining room, living room, 2 bedrooms, hallway, bathroom and 2 balconies.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The balcony offers a view of the sea and the old town.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The orientation of the house is west, while the main entrance is on the east side.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There is a courtyard of 50 m2 and the whole garden area is attractively paved with stone.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Both apartments are well designed and decorated and require no investment in furniture.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>This property is located in an attractive area and has proved easy to rent during the tourist season.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>1st floor has a rental license, which comes with the property sale.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house is located in a pedestrian area, and the nearest parking lot is approx. 30 m from the house.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>All necessary facilities such as shops, bakery, bars and family run restaurants are nearby.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For further information and to arrange to visit this property, please contact us.</p>', '', '1186_House-Villa_0.jpg', '1186_House-Villa_1.JPG', '1186_House-Villa_2.JPG', '1186_House-Villa_3.JPG', '1186_House-Villa_4.jpg', '1186_House-Villa_5.jpg', '1186_House-Villa_6.JPG', '1186_House-Villa_7.JPG', '1186_House-Villa_8.JPG'),
(1187, 'David ', 'Grguroviæ', '', '+61406 484173', 'info@zad-apartments.com', 'Zadar', 'Suko¹an', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '50', '380', '150', 2, '280000', '', 2, 1, 2, 2, 1, 2, 4, 2, 'May 22, 2015', '<p>Lijepa dvoeta¾na kuæa s ureðenim vrtom, smje&scaron;tena samo 50 m od mora u blizini Zadra. Kuæa se sastoji od 2 identièna apartmana ukupne stambene povr&scaron;ine 150 m2, a nalazi se na zemlji&scaron;tu velièine 380 m2. Podijeljena je na prizemlje i kat. Apartmani su kompletno namje&scaron;teni, a svaki se sastoji od dvije spavaæe sobe, jedne kupaonice, kuhinje s blagavaonicom, velikog dnevnog boravka te prostrane terase.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>A realistic price and set to achieve a quick sale. Croatia Property Sales is proud to offer this spacious house, divided into two apartments, 50 meters from the beach, 3 kilometres from Zadar. They are designed with 2 double bedrooms, bathroom and a generous open plan living area with a practical kitchen, dining area and lounge, each of 75m sq. and from this room there is access to the substantial balcony with superb sea views. The land plot measures 380m sq.</p>', '', '<p>Lijepa dvoeta¾na kuæa s ureðenim vrtom, smje&scaron;tena samo 50 m od mora u blizini Zadra.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa se sastoji od 2 identièna apartmana ukupne stambene povr&scaron;ine 150 m2, a nalazi se na zemlji&scaron;tu velièine 380 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Podijeljena je na prizemlje i kat.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Vrt je osiguran elegantnom ogradom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartmani su kompletno namje&scaron;teni, a svaki se sastoji od dvije spavaæe sobe, jedne kupaonice, kuhinje s blagavaonicom, velikog dnevnog boravka te prostrane terase.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæi pripadaju 4 parkirna mjesta.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Svaki apartman je potpuno opremljen, te ima klima ureðaje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa ima svu potrebnu infrastrukturu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Vlasnik posjeduje graðevinsku i uporabnu dozvolu, te licencu za iznajmljivaje.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nekretnina je idealna za iznajmljivanje, buduæi da se sastoji od dvije odvojene jedinice.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ovo &scaron;armantno mjesto, turistièki popularno, nalazi se samo nekoliko kilometara ju¾no od Zadra gdje je i meðunarodni aerodrom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Svi potrebni sadr¾aji se nalaze u neposrednoj blizini.</p>', '<p>A realistic price and set to achieve a quick sale.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Croatia Property Sales is proud to offer this spacious house, divided into two apartments, 50 meters from the beach, 3 kilometres from Zadar.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>They are designed with 2 double bedrooms, bathroom and a generous open plan living area with a practical kitchen, dining area and lounge, each of 75m sq. and from this room there is access to the substantial balcony with superb sea views.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>They are in good condition, well decorated, and are fully furnished.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The building is on a plot of 380m sq, surrounded by elegant fencing and entrance gate, and it has been landscaped with a lovingly maintained garden, which includes a luscious lawn (a very rare feature in Croatia).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Wake up in the morning to views of the Croatian Adriatic sea.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The water here is crystal clear, safe for children and enjoyed by swimmers, and a short walk along the shore brings you to the nearest coffee shop.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nearby are also some basic shops, bars and bakery, while 10 minutes drive will bring you to Zadar, a popular tourism town with many more attractions and facilities, and an international airport.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property has four private parking spaces.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>City water is connected, fast internet available and the property has a clear title and all required building permits.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>This apartments are booked solid during the high summer and easily return &euro;200 per night during the peak season.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Included in the sale price is our rental internet site, along with training on its use.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The Sellers would like to relocate back to Australia sooner, rather than later, so will consider offers.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact our office in Split to arrange to visit this property.</p>', '', '1187_House-Villa_0.jpg', '1187_House-Villa_1.jpg', '1187_House-Villa_2.jpg', '1187_House-Villa_3.jpg', '1187_House-Villa_4.jpg', '1187_House-Villa_5.jpg', '1187_House-Villa_6.jpg', '1187_House-Villa_7.jpg', '1187_House-Villa_8.jpg'),
(1188, 'Ivan ', 'Cvitanovic, Cod prom', '0919063688', '', '', 'Trogir', 'Ulica Ante Starèeviæa   Okrug Gornji', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '230', '0', '75', 1, '90000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 'May 22, 2015', '<p>Na prodaji su 2 apartmana u zgradi smje&scaron;tenoj na zapadnoj strani otoka Èiova. Najbli¾a &scaron;ljunèana pla¾a je udaljena cca. 230 m2, dok se trgovina nalazi u blizini. Svi ostali potrebni sadr¾aji se nalaze u centru koji je udaljen par minuta vo¾nje.&nbsp;Okru¾enje je mirno bez puno ljudi i prometa.&nbsp;Apartmani su klimatizirani i namje&scaron;teni, te svakom pripada po jedno parking mjesto sa ju¾ne strane zgrade.&nbsp;<span style="text-decoration: underline;">Povr&scaron;ina svakog apartmana iznosi 74,71 m2, a cijene &euro;90.000 i &euro;100.000.</span></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>', '<p>We are offering two apartments in a modern building situated on the west side of the island Ciovo. The location is 230m from the beach and conveniently close to the nearest shop, cafe and coffee bar.&nbsp;All other necessary services are in the centre of the village which is located a few minutes&rsquo; drive away. There are two apartments, fully furnished and air conditioned, and with their own private parking space adjacent to the building. <span style="text-decoration: underline;">The apartments measures 74,71m sq, the price are &euro;90.000 and &euro;100.000.</span></p>', '', '<p>Na prodaju su 2 apartmana u zgradi smje&scaron;tenoj na zapadnoj strani otoka Èiova.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Najbli¾a &scaron;ljunèana pla¾a je udaljena cca. 230 m2, dok se trgovina nalazi u blizini.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Svi ostali potrebni sadr¾aji se nalaze u centru koji je udaljen par minuta vo¾nje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Okru¾enje je mirno bez puno ljudi i prometa.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartmani su klimatizirani i namje&scaron;teni, te svakom pripada po jedno parking mjesto sa ju¾ne strane zgrade.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Orijentacija apartmana je sjeveroju¾na.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong><span style="text-decoration: underline;">APARTMAN 1: PRIZEMLJE, 74,71 M2 &ndash; 90.000&euro;,&nbsp;</span></strong><span style="text-decoration: underline;"><strong>65,51 + 2 balkona (6,52 m2 + 4,10 m2)</strong></span></p>\r\n<p>Sastoji se od hodnika, kuhinje + blagovaonice + dnevnog boravka, 2 spavaæe sobe, 2 kupaonice i 2 balkona.</p>\r\n<p>Jedan balkon je na sjeveru, a jedan na jugu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong><span style="text-decoration: underline;">APARTMAN 2: 1.KAT, 74,71 M2 &ndash; 100.000&euro;, 65,51 + 2 balkona (6,52 m2 + 4,10 m2)</span></strong></p>\r\n<p>Sastoji se od hodnika, kuhinje + blagovaonice + dnevnog boravka, 2 spavaæe sobe, 2 kupaonice i 2 balkona.</p>\r\n<p>Balkoni se nalaze na sjevernoj i ju¾noj strani.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>***Iz apartmana se ne pru¾a pogled na more, ali to ne umanjuje njihovu kvalitetu zbog toga &scaron;to se nalaze na odliènom polo¾aju.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Meðunarodni aerodroma je udaljen 15 min. vo¾nje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Slobodno nas kontaktirajte za sva dodatna pitanja.</p>', '<p>We are offering two apartments in a modern building situated on the west side of the island Ciovo.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The location is 230m from the beach and conveniently close to the nearest shop, cafe and coffee bar.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>All other necessary services are in the centre of the village which is located a few minutes&rsquo; drive away.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The area is quiet with little traffic and a away from the busiest parts of the beach.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There are two apartments, fully furnished and air conditioned, and with their own private parking space adjacent to the building.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The orientation of the apartments is North/South.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong><span style="text-decoration: underline;">APARTMENT 1: GROUND FLOOR, 74,71 M2 - 90.000&euro;, 65,51 + 2 balconies (6,52 m2 + 4.10 m2)</span></strong></p>\r\n<p>It consists of hallway, kitchen + dining room + living room, 2 bedrooms, 2 bathrooms and 2 balconies.</p>\r\n<p>One balcony is in the north and one in the south.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong><span style="text-decoration: underline;">APARTMENT 2: 1st floor, 74.71 m2 - 100.000&euro;, 65,51 + 2 balconies (6,52 m2 + 4.10 m2)</span></strong></p>\r\n<p>It consists of hallway, kitchen + dining room + living room, 2 bedrooms, 2 bathrooms and 2 balconies.</p>\r\n<p>The balconies on the north and south side.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>They are in excellent condition and ready for moving in immediately, or can be used for holiday lets in this popular area.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>They do not have a sea view from the balcony but they are in an excellent location.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>International airport is 15 minutes driving.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact us for any further questions and to arrange to visit.</p>', '', '1188_Apartment_0.jpg', '1188_Apartment_1.jpg', '1188_Apartment_2.jpg', '1188_Apartment_3.jpg', '1188_Apartment_4.jpg', '1188_Apartment_5.jpg', '1188_Apartment_6.jpg', '1188_Apartment_7.jpg', '1188_Apartment_8.jpg'),
(1189, '', 'Dalmatian Home', '', '', '', 'Primosten', 'Primo¹ten', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '300', '0', '54', 1, '135000', '', 2, 1, 2, 2, 1, 2, 2, 1, 'May 22, 2015', '<p>Apartmani u Primo&scaron;tenu s pogledom na more!&nbsp;Stanovi se trenutaèno nalaze u roh-bau stanju, a radi se o ukupno 7 stanova. Povr&scaron;ine svih stanova su cca. 54m2, a svaki stan sastoji se od kuhinje, blagovaonice, dnevnog boravka, kupaonice, dvije spavaæe sobe i balkona. Udaljenost do mora i prve pla¾e iznosi 300 m zraène linije.&nbsp;<span style="text-decoration: underline;"><span>Apartman u prizemlju sa dodatnom okuænicom od 70 m2 iznosi 150.000 EUR.</span><br /></span></p>', '<p>Apartments in Primosten with a sea view! Flats are currently in the roh-bau stage, and there are 7 apartments for sale. The surfaces of all apartments are approximately 54m2, and each apartment consists of a kitchen, dining room, living room, bathroom, two bedrooms and a balcony.&nbsp;Distance to the sea and the nearest beach is only 300 m. <span style="text-decoration: underline;">Apartment on the ground floor with a garden (70m sq) is at price 150.000 EUR.</span></p>\r\n<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;"><br /></span></p>', '', '<p>Apartmani u Primo&scaron;tenu s pogledom na more!</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Stanovi se trenutaèno nalaze u roh-bau stanju, a radi se o ukupno 7 stanova.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Povr&scaron;ine svih stanova su cca. 54m2, a svaki stan sastoji se od kuhinje, blagovaonice, dnevnog boravka, kupaonice, dvije spavaæe sobe i balkona.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Udaljenost do mora i prve pla¾e iznosi 300 m zraène linije.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Postoji moguænost odabira keramike (po tro&scaron;kovniku do 150kn/m2) i kompletnih ugradbenih sanitarija.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za svaki apartman osigurano je jedno parkirno mjesto, dok se u suterenu zgrade nalaze i dvije gara¾e sa sanitarnim èvorom (moguæa prenamjena u stambeni prostor).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartman u prizemlju sa dodatnom okuænicom od 70 m2 iznosi 150.000 EUR.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartmani u potrovlju su prodani.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Meðunarodni aerodrom u Splitu udaljen je 45 km.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za sve dodatne informacije slobodno nas kontaktirajte.</p>', '<p>Apartments in Primosten with a sea view!</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Flats are currently in the roh-bau stage, and there are 7 apartments for sale.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The surfaces of all apartments are approximately 54m2, and each apartment consists of a kitchen, dining room, living room, bathroom, two bedrooms and a balcony.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Distance to the sea and the nearest beach is only 300 m.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There is a possibility for choosing tiles (150 Kn/sqm) and a complete bathroom installation.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Each apartment hasone parking space, while in the basement there are two garages with toilet (possible conversion into a residential area).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartment on the ground floor with a garden (70m sq) is at price 150.000 EUR.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartments in the attic are sold.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>International airport is 45 km away.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For any further information please contact our office in Split.</p>', '', '1189_Apartment_0.jpg', '1189_Apartment_1.jpg', '1189_Apartment_2.jpg', '1189_Apartment_3.jpg', '1189_Apartment_4.jpg', '1189_Apartment_5.jpg', '1189_Apartment_6.jpg', '1189_Apartment_7.jpg', '1189_Apartment_8.png'),
(1190, 'Ivanka', 'Pavloviæ', '®eljko Cengija', '091 517 59 23 ', 'mandolina2@ymail.com ', 'Lastovo', 'Lastovo, Luèice, Kuæa èest. br.769 , dvori¹te br.6909/2 ', 'For sale', 'Old stone house', '20', '37', '44', 2, '45000', '', 2, 2, 2, 1, 1, 2, 0, 0, 'May 25, 2015', '<p>&Scaron;armantna stara kamena kuæa na Lastovu, u prvom redu do mora, smje&scaron;tena na podruèju netaknute prirode. Kuæa se sastoji od prizemlja i kata. Potrebna je kompletna renovacija, predviðena je izgradnja dviju eta¾a i visokog potkrovlja. Ukupna stambena povr&scaron;ina dviju eta¾a iznosi 44 m2. Kuæi pripada i dvori&scaron;te povr&scaron;ine 37 m2.&nbsp;Ima prikljuèke na vodu i struju. Iz dvori&scaron;ta se pru¾a prekrasan pogled na more koje je svega 20 m udaljeno.</p>', '<p>We are pleased to offer this renovation project of a traditional old stone house on Lastovo island, a property on the first row to the sea, and situated in an area of unspoiled nature.&nbsp;The house consists of two floors.&nbsp;A complete renovation in needed, &nbsp;including floors a new roof but it can have &nbsp;two floors and attic with accommodation.&nbsp;The total living area of two floors is 44 m2.&nbsp;The house has a garden area of 37 m2. From the courtyard there is a beautiful view of the sea which is only 20 meters away.&nbsp;</p>', '', '<p>&Scaron;armantna stara kamena kuæa na Lastovu, u prvom redu do mora, smje&scaron;tena na podruèju netaknute prirode.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa se sastoji od prizemlja i kata.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Potrebna je kompletna renovacija, predviðena je izgradnja dviju eta¾a i visokog potkrovlja.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ukupna stambena povr&scaron;ina dviju eta¾a iznosi 44 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæi pripada i dvori&scaron;te povr&scaron;ine 37 m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ima prikljuèke na vodu i struju.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Buduæi da je dvori&scaron;te ograðeno visokim kamenim zidom, osigurani su mir i privatnost.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Iz dvori&scaron;ta se pru¾a prekrasan pogled na more koje je svega 20 m udaljeno.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Parking je javni, ali sama kuæa ima pristup vozilom.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Uvala je veoma mirna i vrlo atraktivna.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Mjesto u kojem se nalazi je bilo izvorno ribarsko naselje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za posjetitelje ona je skrovito, sjenovito, mirno i nadasve ugodno, betonom neranjenog okru¾enja, bogate vi&scaron;estoljetne vegetacije.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Lastovo zbog ne&scaron;to veæe udaljenosti od Splita nudi izniman mir i privatnost te ukoliko ste u potrazi za prekrasnom prirodom i mirnom lokacijom, onda je Lastovo mjesto za Vas!</p>', '<p>We are pleased to offer this renovation project of a traditional old stone house on Lastovo island, a property on the first row to the sea, and situated in an area of unspoiled nature.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house consists of two floors.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>A complete renovation in needed, including floors a new roof but it can have two floors and attic with accommodation.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The total living area of two floors is 44 m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house has a garden area of 37 m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There are connections to electricity and city water.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Since the yard is surrounded by a high stone wall, peace and privacy are guaranteed.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>From the courtyard there is a beautiful view of the sea which is only 20 meters away.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Parking is public, but the house itself has car access.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The bay is sheltered and the view across the water is very attractive.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>This village was originally a fishing village and visitors now will find a hidden, shady, calm and very comfortable village, not changed by modern construction and surrounded by rich vegetation established over many centuries.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The village has bars and bakery for the local population and tourists alike, a great place to mix and enjoy the hospitality of the residents.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact our office to arrange a visit to the property, or more details about the refurbishment which is required.&nbsp;</p>', '', '1190_Old-stone-house_0.jpg', '1190_Old-stone-house_1.jpg', '1190_Old-stone-house_2.jpg', '1190_Old-stone-house_3.jpg', '1190_Old-stone-house_4.jpg', '1190_Old-stone-house_5.jpg', '1190_Old-stone-house_6.jpg', '1190_Old-stone-house_7.jpg', '1190_Old-stone-house_8.jpg'),
(1191, 'Thomas', 'Ryan ', '099 700 2638', '', 'tomryan10@gmail.com', 'Omis', 'Magistrala, Maru¹iæi, 6321, 6322/2 k.o. rogoznica, ZU 2160, 4009', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '200', '0', '0', 1, '96350', '', 2, 1, 2, 2, 1, 2, 0, 0, 'May 25, 2015', '<p>Predstavljamo vam manju stambenu zgradu sa 5 kvalitetnih apartmana u malom mjestu 15 km ju¾no od Omi&scaron;a. Zgrada je nedavno dovr&scaron;ena te su sve jedinice slobodne, &scaron;to pru¾a dobar izbor jednosobnih ili dvosobnih stanova. Povr&scaron;ine apartmana su od 45.25 m2 - 57.55 m2, a cijene od &euro;96.350 - &euro;105.600.</p>', '<p>We have this 5 lovely affordable newly built apartments in a small village 15 km south of Omis. The building has just been finished and all units are available, giving you a great selection of one and two bedroom holiday apartments to choose from. Living area of the apartments from 45.25 - 57.55m sq, and the price at &euro;96.350 - &euro;105.600.</p>', '', '<p>Predstavljamo vam manju stambenu zgradu sa 5 kvalitetnih apartmana u malom mjestu 15 km ju¾no od Omi&scaron;a.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Zgrada je nedavno dovr&scaron;ena te su sve jedinice slobodne, &scaron;to pru¾a dobar izbor jednosobnih ili dvosobnih stanova.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Stanovi mogu biti kupljeni: bez ikakvog ureðenja, u postojeæem stanju (po ni¾oj cijeni ) ili ukljuèuju osnovnu opremu (kupaonica, kuhinja, klima).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Svaki apartment ima balkon/terasu, spremi&scaron;te u prizemlju te jedno parkirali&scaron;no mjesto.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Prizemlje: 1 x dvosobni apartman, 57.55 m2 + 14.55 m2 terasa, cijena 105.600 EUR neopremljen ili 118.200 EUR sa osnovnokm opremom.</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Prvi kat: Jednosobni apartman, 45.25 m2 + 9.7 sq.m terasa, cijena 99.350 EUR neopremljen ili 109.500 EUR sa osnovnom opremom. &nbsp;</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Drugi kat: 2 x jednosobni apartman, 45.25 m2 + 9.7 sq.m terasa, cijena 96.350 EUR neopremljen ili 105.500 EUR sa osnovnokm opremom.</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Svi potrebni sadr¾aji se nalaze u blizini.Do meðunarodnog aerodroma je potrebno 1h vo¾nje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za sve dodatne informacije i razgledavanje molimo da nas kontaktirate.</p>', '<p>We have this 5 lovely affordable newly built apartments in a small village 15 km south of Omis.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The building has just been finished and all units are available, giving you a great selection of one and two bedroom holiday apartments to choose from.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartments can be bought:&nbsp;without any fittings (at lower price) orincl. fittings (bathroom, kitchen, air-con).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Each apartment has balcony/terrace, storage on the ground floor and one parking place.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Ground floor: 1 x 2-bedroom apartment, 57.55 sq.m internal + 14.55 sq.m terrace, priced 105.600 EUR without fittings or 118.200 EUR fitted.<br /></strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>First floor: 1-bedroom apartment, 45.25 sq.m internal + 9.7 sq.m terrace, priced 99.350 EUR without fittings or 109.500 EUR fitted. &nbsp;<br /></strong></p>\r\n<p><strong><br /></strong></p>\r\n<p><strong>Second floor: 2 x 1-bedroom apartment, 45.25 sq.m internal + 9.7 sq.m terrace, priced 96.350 EUR without fittings or 105.500 EUR fitted. &nbsp;&nbsp;</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The town of Omis is very much ''geared up'' to tourists and it provide a range of shops, and good restaurants to explore.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The international airport is 1 hour drive.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For additional information and a tour please contact us.</p>', '', '1191_Apartment_0.JPG', '1191_Apartment_1.JPG', '1191_Apartment_2.JPG', '1191_Apartment_3.JPG', '1191_Apartment_4.JPG', '1191_Apartment_5.JPG', '1191_Apartment_6.JPG', '1191_Apartment_7.JPG', '1191_Apartment_8.JPG'),
(1192, 'Nata¹a', 'Mlaèiæ', '091 545 9999', 'Darko Mlaèiæ, 091 486 9144', 'darko.mlacic@fibis.hr ', 'Omis', 'Mije Mimice 1a, Mimice, k.è. 5335/1, 5335/2 k.o. rogoznica', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '400', '820', '250', 2, '800000', '', 2, 1, 2, 2, 1, 1, 4, 5, 'May 26, 2015', '<p>IZNIMNA OBITELJSKA VILA ZA LJUBITELJE MIRA I PRIVATNOSTI&nbsp;<br />Ova jedinstvena vila nalazi se 15tak minuta vo¾nje ju¾no od Omi&scaron;a, a zbog svog polo¾aja na rubu graðevne zone nudi mir i potpunu privatnost. Pogled na more pru¾a se iz svih prostorija, a na vanjskoj terasi pogled se¾e preko cijelog braèkog kanala.&nbsp;Elegantne ravne linije savr&scaron;eno se uklapaju u krajolik. Ima stambenu povr&scaron;inu 250 m2, a nalazi se nazemlji&scaron;tu povr&scaron;ine 820 m2.</p>', '<p>EXCEPTIONAL ''MUST-SEE'' PROPERTY&nbsp;<br />Truly outstanding property that will win one''s heart and soul. This exceptional villa is located on the edge of the building zone, ensuring total privacy and offering spectacular sea views.&nbsp;Sleek contemporary architecture blends perfectly into the environment. It has living area of 250m sq, and sits on the land plot of 820m sq.</p>', '', '<p>IZNIMNA OBITELJSKA VILA ZA LJUBITELJE MIRA I PRIVATNOSTI&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ova jedinstvena vila nalazi se 15tak minuta vo¾nje ju¾no od Omi&scaron;a, a zbog svog polo¾aja na rubu graðevne zone nudi mir i potpunu privatnost.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Pogled na more pru¾a se iz svih prostorija, a na vanjskoj terasi pogled se¾e preko cijelog braèkog kanala.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Elegantne ravne linije savr&scaron;eno se uklapaju u krajolik.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Vilu èine dva kvadra, svaki orijentiran na svoju stranu, spojena u sredini ispred koje se nalazi vanjska terasa sa bazenom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Vila ima stambenu povr&scaron;inu 250 m2, a nalazi se na zemlji&scaron;tu povr&scaron;ine 820 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Interijer je promi&scaron;ljeno dizajniran, a sve prostorije u cijelosti namje&scaron;tene i opremljene vrhunskim namje&scaron;tajem.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Vila ima 4 spavaæe sobe sa kupaonicama, veliki dnevni prostor, blagovaonicu, kuhinju, parkirali&scaron;te, gara¾u, pomoæne prostorije, vanjsku terasu sa bazenom i vanjskim kaminom te boène vrtove kraj spavaæih soba. &nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Svi potrebni sadr¾aji se nalaze u blizini.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Do meðunarodnog aerodroma je potrebno 1h vo¾nje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za sve dodatne informacije i razgledavanje molimo da nas kontaktirate.</p>', '<p>EXCEPTIONAL ''MUST-SEE'' PROPERTY&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Truly outstanding property that will win one''s heart and soul.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>This exceptional villa is located on the edge of the building zone, ensuring total privacy and offering spectacular sea views.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sleek contemporary architecture blends perfectly into the environment.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Two parallelpipeds that form the main structure are oriented each to its own side, joined in the middle with striking infinity pool in between.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Villa has living area of 250m sq, and sits on the land plot of 820m sq.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Interior is well designed and fully furnished.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Villa has 4 en-suite bedrooms, large living area with fire place, kitchen and dinig room, terrace, parking, BBQ area and well kept garden.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The shore is clean and pebbled, with barely any tide, making it safe for swimming and water sports, while the nearest coffee bar is within walking distance.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The town of Omis is very much ''geared up'' to tourists and it provide a range of shops, and good restaurants to explore.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The international airport is 1 hour drive.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For additional information and a tour please contact us.</p>', '', '1192_House-Villa_0.jpg', '1192_House-Villa_1.jpg', '1192_House-Villa_2.jpg', '1192_House-Villa_3.jpg', '1192_House-Villa_4.jpg', '1192_House-Villa_5.jpg', '1192_House-Villa_6.jpg', '1192_House-Villa_7.jpg', '1192_House-Villa_8.jpg'),
(1193, 'Marija', 'Kr¾ek', '+385 98 975 6116', '', 'krzek.marija@gmail.com', 'Zadar', 'Metajna 139  Pag, 4424/60', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '5', '350', '103', 2, '150000', '', 2, 2, 2, 1, 1, 2, 2, 2, 'May 26, 2015', '<p>Atraktivna kuæa na otoku Pagu, u mirnoj uvali, prvi red do mora.&nbsp;Mjesto se nalazi na sredi&scaron;njem dijelu otoka, najpoznatije je po svojim brojnim pje&scaron;èanim pla¾ama i uvalama te po kristalno èistom moru.&nbsp;Kuæa je podijeljena na dvije eta¾e.&nbsp;Ima i konobu s malom kuhinjom, dvori&scaron;te ispred i iza objekta te dvije terase.&nbsp;Stambena povr&scaron;ina iznosi 103 m2, dok je zemlji&scaron;te povr&scaron;ine 350 m2.</p>', '<p>We have this great value house, right on the shore, in a quiet bay, next to the sea. It is situated in the central part of Pag island, made famous by winning the ''best cheese in the world award'' last year and because of its numerous sandy beaches and coves surrounded crystal clear waters. The living area inside is 103 m2, while the land area is 350 m2.</p>', '', '<p>Atraktivna kuæa na otoku Pagu, u mirnoj uvali, prvi red do mora.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Mjesto se nalazi na sredi&scaron;njem dijelu otoka, najpoznatije je po svojim brojnim pje&scaron;èanim pla¾ama i uvalama te po kristalno èistom moru.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je podijeljena na dvije eta¾e.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sastoji se od podruma (sobe), prizemlja i prvog kata.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U prizemlju se nalaze dnevni boravak, kuhinja s blagovaonicom i kupaonica.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na katu se nalaze dnevni boravak, kuhinja s blagovaonicom, spavaæa soba, i kupaonica.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Stan je opremljen klima ureðajima.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ima i konobu s malom kuhinjom, dvori&scaron;te ispred i iza objekta te dvije terase.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Stambena povr&scaron;ina iznosi 103 m2, dok je zemlji&scaron;te povr&scaron;ine 350 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sastavni dio objekta su gara¾a (24 m2) i parkirali&scaron;te s tri parkirna mjesta.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Vlasni&scaron;tvo uredno.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Pogodno za iznajmljivanje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Otok Pag pru¾a potpun odmor u tihom, umirujuæem ambijentu slikovitih pejsa¾a tisuæljetnih maslina, kamenog hrasta i crnog bora. &nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Udaljenost od zraène luke u Zadru je 15 min., dok je splitska zraèna luka udaljena 1,5 h vo¾nje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za sva dodatna pitanja molimo kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured u Splitu.</p>', '<p>We have this great value house, right on the shore, in a quiet bay, next to the sea.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is situated in the central part of Pag island, made famous by winning the ''best cheese in the world award'' last year and because of its numerous sandy beaches and coves surrounded crystal clear waters.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house is divided on two floors.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It consists of basement (room), ground floor and 1st floor.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the ground floor there is living room, kitchen with dinning room, and bathroom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There is living room, kitchen with dinning room, bedroom and bathroom on the first floor.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The apartment is equipped with air conditioning.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There is also a cellar with a small kitchen, a courtyard in front and behind the building and two terraces, all of which have spectacular sea views.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The living area inside is 103 m2, while the land area is 350 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property boasts an integral building a garage (24 m2) and a private parking lot with three parking spaces.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Suitable for rental.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The island of Pag offers the opportunity to enjoy a complete rest in a quiet and calm setting of picturesque and preserved nature with century old olive trees, stone oaks and black pine creating a wonderfully peaceful environment.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There are shops, restaurants, and coffee shops along the shore on Pag, some in walking distance and a bridge to the mainland, giving the best of both worlds.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>An island feel, but the convenience of the mainland.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The distance from the airport in Zadar is 15 min., while Split Airport &nbsp;is 1.5 hours'' drive away.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For any questions, please contact our office in Split. &nbsp;&nbsp;</p>', '', '1193_House-Villa_0.jpg', '1193_House-Villa_1.jpg', '1193_House-Villa_2.jpg', '1193_House-Villa_3.jpg', '1193_House-Villa_4.jpg', '1193_House-Villa_5.jpg', '1193_House-Villa_6.jpg', '1193_House-Villa_7.jpg', '1193_House-Villa_8.jpg'),
(1194, 'Igor ', 'Klimovskih', '003725015002', '', 'ikl@klipmarine.eu', 'Trogir', 'Iza crkve  Slatine, Èiovo', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '70', '0', '59', 1, '125000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 1, 1, 1, 'May 26, 2015', '<p>Apartman u iznimno mirnom okru¾enju u blizini prirodno kamenite pla¾e i mnogih drugih sadr¾aja. Smje&scaron;ten je na 3.katu u potkrovlju sa prekrasnim pogledom na more i &scaron;umu.&nbsp;Nalazi se na istoènoj strani &nbsp;Èiova, dok je orjentacija apartmana S &ndash; J. Ukupna povr&scaron;ina apartmana iznosi 59,39 m2 (45,50 m2 + terasa 13,89 m2).&nbsp;Grad Trogir udaljen je 15 minuta, dok je meðunarodni aerodrom udaljen 20 min. vo¾nje.</p>', '<p>We are pleased to offer this spacious apartment with swimming pool in the first line of property to the sea.&nbsp;It is on the 3rd floor of a modern block in a quiet environment on the edge of a small village on Ciovo Island, 70m from sea where there is a natural rocky and pebble beach. It is located on the east side of Ciovo, while the orientation of the apartment North/South. The living area of this spacious apartment is 59,39 m2 (45.50 m2 + 13.89 m2 terrace).</p>', '', '<p>Apartman u iznimno mirnom okru¾enju u blizini prirodno kamenite pla¾e i mnogih drugih sadr¾aja.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Smje&scaron;ten je na 3.katu u potkrovlju sa prekrasnim pogledom na more i &scaron;umu.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nalazi se na istoènoj strani &nbsp;Èiova, dok je orijentacija apartmana S &ndash; J.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ukupna povr&scaron;ina apartmana iznosi 59,39 m2 (45,50 m2 + terasa 13,89 m2).&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sastoji se od hodnika, kuhinje + blagovaonice + dnevnog boravka, 1 spavaæe sobe, kupaonice i terase sa pogledom na more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Pripada mu i odvojeno spremi&scaron;te na 1.katu povr&scaron;ine 5,87 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartman je potpuno namje&scaron;ten i spreman za kori&scaron;tenje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Prekrasna pla¾a udaljena je 70 m od zgrade dok se sa sjeverne strane zgrade nalazi prostrana zajednièka terasa sa bazenom, &scaron;to je jo&scaron; jedna prednost ove zgrade.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sa ju¾ne strane se nalazi parking mjesto.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><span style="color: #ff0000;">***NA ZAHTJEV &Scaron;ALJEMO KRATKE VIDEO ZAPISE</span></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Grad Trogir udaljen je 15 minuta, dok je meðunarodni aerodrom udaljen 20 min. vo¾nje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za sva dodatna pitanja molimo da na kontaktirate.</p>', '<p>We are pleased to offer this spacious apartment with swimming pool in the first line of property to the sea.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is on the 3rd floor of a modern block in a quiet environment on the edge of a small village on Ciovo Island, 70m from sea where there is a natural rocky and pebble beach.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is located on the east side of Ciovo, while the orientation of the apartment North/South.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The living area of this spacious apartment is 59,39 m2 (45.50 m2 + 13.89 m2 terrace).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The balcony has stunning views across the natural woodland down to the sea, and across the channel to the mountains on the mainland and Split.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property inside consists of modern open plan kitchen /dining room / living room, 1 bedroom, bathroom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It also has a separate storage room on the 1st floor, with an area of 5.87 m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The apartment is well decorated, well fully furnished and ready for immediate use.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the north side of the building is a spacious shared terrace with swimming pool, which is another advantage, especially if the owner is considering renting out this property to tourists.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the south side there is a private parking place.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><span style="color: #ff0000;">*** ON DEMAND we send short videos!!&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The town of Trogir is 15 minutes, with many fine restaurants, bars and is the historic and cultural centre with many attractions, while the international airport is 20 minutes. driving.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For any questions and to arrange to visit this property, then please contact our office.</p>', '', '1194_Apartment_0.jpg', '1194_Apartment_1.jpg', '1194_Apartment_2.JPG', '1194_Apartment_3.JPG', '1194_Apartment_4.JPG', '1194_Apartment_5.JPG', '1194_Apartment_6.JPG', '1194_Apartment_7.JPG', '1194_Apartment_8.jpg');
INSERT INTO `nekretnina` (`id`, `ime`, `prezime`, `telefon`, `mobitel`, `e_mail`, `lokacija_id`, `adresa`, `status_id`, `vrsta_id`, `udaljenost`, `povrsina`, `stambenapovrsina`, `display`, `cijena`, `cijenatocka`, `ponuda_tjedna`, `new_built`, `must_sell`, `prvi_red_do_mora`, `pogled_na_more`, `bazen`, `broj_soba`, `broj_kupatila`, `datum`, `title_hr`, `title_en`, `title_ge`, `opis_hr`, `opis_en`, `opis_ge`, `PropertyImageURL0`, `PropertyImageURL1`, `PropertyImageURL2`, `PropertyImageURL3`, `PropertyImageURL4`, `PropertyImageURL5`, `PropertyImageURL6`, `PropertyImageURL7`, `PropertyImageURL8`) VALUES
(1196, 'Dobrila', 'Baliæ', '021/891-025 &#8211; Dobrila      021/891-170 ', 'Antonia 0998881377, 099/841-1431 Dunja Èeliæ', '', 'Trogir', 'Slatine - Èiovo, k.è. 18 k.o. Slatine  ', 'For sale', 'Land plot', '180', '1206', '0', 1, '180000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 0, 0, 'May 26, 2015', '<p>Prostrano graðevinsko zemlji&scaron;te u 3. redu od mora sa prekrasnim pogledom, u blizini &scaron;ljunèane pla¾e i ostalih sadr¾aja.&nbsp;Smje&scaron;teno je na istoènom dijelu otoka Èiova, dok je orijentacija zemlji&scaron;ta sjeverna.&nbsp;Udaljenost od mora je cca. 180 m gdje se nalazi mirna &scaron;ljunèana pla¾a.&nbsp;Zemlji&scaron;te je pravilnog oblika i idealna za izgradnju ville sa bazenom ili apartmanske kuæe.&nbsp;Izgradivost zemlji&scaron;ta je 30% za samostojeæe, 35% za dvojne i 40% za objekte u nizu.</p>', '<p>We have this large plot in the 3rd row of houses from the sea that can be either a large villa with a swimming pool, or an apartment house. It is situated about 180m from the sea, near Slatine, a small village on the island of Ciovo, with a regular direct ferry to Split. The airport is 20 minutes away. The buildable land area is 30% for a free-standing house, 35% for a semi-detached, and 40% for terraced &nbsp;objects in a row.</p>', '', '<p>Prostrano graðevinsko zemlji&scaron;te u 3. redu od mora sa prekrasnim pogledom, u blizini &scaron;ljunèane pla¾e i ostalih sadr¾aja.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Smje&scaron;teno je na istoènom dijelu otoka Èiova, dok je orijentacija zemlji&scaron;ta sjeverna.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Udaljenost od mora je cca. 180 m gdje se nalazi mirna &scaron;ljunèana pla¾a.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Centar mjesta udaljen je svega nekoliko minuta pje&scaron;ke.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Do povijesnog grada Trogira potrebno je 15 minuta vo¾nje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Meðunarodni aerodrom je takoðer vrlo blizu &scaron;to je jo&scaron; jedna prednost ove lokacije.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Zemlji&scaron;te je pravilnog oblika i idealna za izgradnju ville sa bazenom ili apartmanske kuæe.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Izgradivost zemlji&scaron;ta je 30% za samostojeæe, 35% za dvojne i 40% za objekte u nizu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Podrum, prizemlje i 2 kata je moguæe izgraditi kod samostojeæih i dvojnih objekata, dok je za objekte u nizu dopu&scaron;tena izgradnja podruma, prizemlja i 1 kata.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za sve ostale informacije molimo da nas kotaktirate.</p>', '<p>We have this large plot in the 3rd row of houses from the sea that can be either a large villa with a swimming pool, or an apartment house.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is situated about 180m from the sea, near Slatine, a small village on the island of Ciovo, with a regular direct ferry to Split.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is on sloping land which elevates the plot to allow great views to the mainland and of Split.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The sea in front is sheltered and safe for swimmers, with a shore of pebble beaches and rocky coves.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The centre of the village is only a few minutes'' walk, with bakery, coffee shops, restaurants and a variety of bars, while a little further the historic town of Trogir takes 15 minutes to drive.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The airport is 20 minutes away.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The buildable land area is 30% for a free-standing house, 35% for a semi-detached, and 40% for terraced &nbsp;objects/ in a row.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Detached and semi-detached house are allowed to have basement, ground floor and 2 floors.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Terraced houses are allowed to have &nbsp;basement, ground floor and 1 floor.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact the office to arrange to visit this building land location.</p>', '', '1196_Land-plot_0.JPG', '1196_Land-plot_1.JPG', '1196_Land-plot_2.JPG', '1196_Land-plot_3.JPG', '1196_Land-plot_4.jpg', '1196_Land-plot_5.jpg', '1196_Land-plot_6.JPG', '1196_Land-plot_7.JPG', ''),
(1195, 'Igor ', 'Klimovskih', '', '003725015002', '', 'Trogir', 'Iza crkve Slatine, Èiovo ', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '70', '0', '105', 1, '260000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 1, 2, 2, 'May 26, 2015', '<p>Prostrani apartman u prizemlju zgrade smje&scaron;tene na zanimljivoj lokaciji u blizini prirodno kamenite pla¾e sa zagarantiranim mirom i privatno&scaron;æu. Zgrada se nalazi na istoènoj strani otoka Èiova koji je povezan mostom sa gradom Trogirom, dok je meðunarodni aerodrom udaljen svega 5 min. od Trogira.&nbsp;Povr&scaron;ina apartmana iznosi 105,13 m2 (apartman 96,85 m2 + balkon 8,28 m2).&nbsp;Potpun je klimatiziran, namje&scaron;ten i spreman za u¾ivanje. S obzirom na velièinu i polo¾aj apartmana idealan je za obitelj.</p>', '<p>We are offering this spacious apartment with swimming pool on the ground floor of a modern building close to the sea. The building is located on the eastern side of the island Ciovo, 70m from the shore which consists of a pebble beach between natural rocky bays. The property itself is a spacious apartment with surface of 105.13 m2 (96.85 m2 apartment + balcony 8.28 m2). The apartment is fully air-conditioned, well decorated and furnished and ready to enjoy immediately.</p>', '', '<p>Prostrani apartman u prizemlju zgrade smje&scaron;tene na zanimljivoj lokaciji u blizini prirodno kamenite pla¾e sa zagarantiranim mirom i privatno&scaron;æu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Zgrada se nalazi na istoènoj strani otoka Èiova koji je povezan mostom sa gradom Trogirom, dok je meðunarodni aerodrom udaljen svega 5 min. od Trogira.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Povr&scaron;ina apartmana iznosi 105,13 m2 (apartman 96,85 m2 + balkon 8,28 m2).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U apartmanu se nalaze dva hodnika, kuhinja + blagovaonica + dnevni boravak, 2 spavaæe sobe, 2 kupaonice, sprema i balkon.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Pripada mu i spremi&scaron;te sa odvojenim ulazom iz hodnika zgrade.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Orijentacija apartmana je S-J.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Veæi dio apartmana se nalazi na sjevernoj strani zgrade gdje je direktni izlaz na prostranu zajednièku terasu sa bazenom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Pla¾a je udaljena svega 70 m od zgrade, ali je velika prednost posjedovati apartman sa bazenom.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Potpun je klimatiziran, namje&scaron;ten i spreman za u¾ivanje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>S obzirom na velièinu i polo¾aj apartmana idealan je za obitelj.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><span style="color: #ff0000;">***NA ZAHTJEV &Scaron;ALJEMO KRATKE VIDEO ZAPISE</span></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Stojimo na raspolaganju za sva dodatna pitanja i informacije.</p>', '<p>We are offering this spacious apartment with swimming pool on the ground floor of a modern building close to the sea.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The building is located on the eastern side of the island Ciovo, 70m from the shore which consists of a pebble beach between natural rocky bays.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The local village has a variety of bars, coffee shops, and some shops and restaurants.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The larger town, 15 minutes driving, is Trogir, with many options for some of the best restaurants in the region and is the historic and cultural centre of the region.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property itself is a spacious apartment with surface of 105.13 m2 (96.85 m2 apartment + balcony 8.28 m2).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The apartment has two halls, a modern open plan kitchen/ dining room/ living room, 2 bedrooms, 2 bathrooms, storage room and balcony leading from the main living area.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It also has a storage room with a separate entrance from the hallway of the building.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The orientation of the apartment is the North/South.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The bigger area of the &nbsp;apartment is located on the north side of the building where there is a direct access to the shared terrace with swimming pool.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The beach is only 70 meters from the building, but it is a great advantage to own an apartment with a swimming pool, especially if the owner is looking to rent the property through the tourist season.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The apartment is fully air-conditioned, well decorated and furnished and ready to enjoy immediately.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Given the unusual large size of the apartment it is ideal for families.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><span style="color: #ff0000;">&nbsp;*** ON DEMAND we send short videos</span></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact our office for a conducted tour of the property.</p>', '', '1195_Apartment_0.jpg', '1195_Apartment_1.JPG', '1195_Apartment_2.JPG', '1195_Apartment_3.JPG', '1195_Apartment_4.JPG', '1195_Apartment_5.JPG', '1195_Apartment_6.jpg', '1195_Apartment_7.jpg', '1195_Apartment_8.jpg'),
(1197, 'Emil ', 'Buljuba¹iæ', '095 5520146', '', 'bluesplit@net.hr', 'Split', 'Pazdigradska 28  Split, ZEM 1833/2 ETA®A 50/2265', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '550', '0', '50', 2, '90000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 1, 1, 'May 29, 2015', '<p>Simpatièan apartman u jako dobrom stanju, smje&scaron;ten u manjoj stambenoj zgradi &nbsp;sa pogledom na more.&nbsp;Nalazi se u gradu Splitu na istoènoj dijelu udaljenom od popularne Rive i Dioklecijanove palaèe cca. 20 min. vo¾nje.&nbsp;Apartman je na 4. katu (zadnjem), dok je orjentacija sjeveroju¾na. Ukupna povr&scaron;ina iznosi 50 m2.&nbsp;Od namje&scaron;taja je u cijenu ukljuèena kuhinja sa svim kuæanskim aparatima.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>We are pleased to offer this modern one bedroom open plan apartment locatedin a small building with a view of the sea. It is located in the eastern side of Split, 20 minutes drive from thepopular and crowded promenade and Diocletian palace. The apartment is on the 4th floor (top), and has a North/South orientation. The total area is 50 m2. The furniture is included in the price plus all the kitchen appliances.</p>', '', '<p>Simpatièan apartman u jako dobrom stanju, smje&scaron;ten u manjoj stambenoj zgradi &nbsp;s pogledom na more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nalazi se u gradu Splitu na istoènoj dijelu udaljenom od popularne Rive i Dioklecijanove palaèe cca. 20 min. vo¾nje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartman je na 4. katu (zadnjem), dok je orijentacija sjeveroju¾na.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ukupna povr&scaron;ina iznosi 50 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ju¾ni dio apartmana se sastoji od hodnika, kuhinje + blagovaonice + dnevnog boravka i loggie sa pogledom na more.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na sjevernom dijelu je kupaonica, spavaæa soba i kupaonica.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Od namje&scaron;taja je u cijenu ukljuèena kuhinja sa svim kuæanskim aparatima.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U apartmanu se jo&scaron; nalaze i 2 &nbsp;klimatizacijska ureðaja.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Zgrada nema lift, a do apartmana je ukupno 65 stepenica.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ispred zgrade se nalazi zajednièki parking za sve stanare.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&Scaron;ljunèana pla¾a je udaljena cca. 550 m gdje se takoðer nalazi i manja pla¾a za pse.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U blizini se nalaze nekoliko veæih i manjih trgovina.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartman posjeduje energetski certifikat B razreda.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ostajemo na usluzi za sva dodatna pitanja i informacije.</p>', '<p>We are pleased to offer this modern one bedroom open plan apartment locatedin a small building with a view of the sea.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is located in the eastern side of Split, 20 minutes drive from thepopular and crowded promenade and Diocletian palace.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The apartment is on the 4th floor (top), and has a North/South orientation.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The total area is 50 m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The southern part of the apartment consists of hallway, open plan kitchen/dining room/living room leading to a balcony with long sea views and awayfrom the sun is one bedroom and bathroom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The furniture is included in the price plus all the kitchen appliances.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The building does not have a lift.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>In front of the building is shared private parking for all tenants.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The nearest beach is approx. 550 m.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nearby are a number of larger and smaller shops and other facilities, aswell as traditional cafes and coffee bars and restaurants.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The apartment has an energy certificate B level.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact the Croatia Property Sales office for more more informationand to arrange to visit this property.</p>', '', '1197_Apartment_0.jpg', '1197_Apartment_1.jpg', '1197_Apartment_2.jpg', '1197_Apartment_3.jpg', '1197_Apartment_4.jpg', '1197_Apartment_5.jpg', '1197_Apartment_6.jpg', '1197_Apartment_7.jpg', '1197_Apartment_8.jpg'),
(1198, 'Jozo', '', 'Andrea Kljuè 0958249039', '0997383664', '', 'Split', 'Senjska 64, Split', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '300', '0', '40', 2, '68000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 1, 1, 'May 29, 2015', '<p>Apartman na prvom katu stare kamene kuæe s prekrasnim pogledom na more, samo nekoliko minuta &scaron;etnje udaljen od centra grada i Marjana. Kuæa se sastoji od prizemlja, prvog kata i potkrovlja u kojem je smje&scaron;ten ovaj jednosobni apartman stambene povr&scaron;ine 40 m2. S obzirom da poziciju ovo je izvrsna prilika ¾elite li nekretninu za svrhu turistièkog iznajmljivanja ili je jednostavno ¾elite koristiti za vlastiti boravak.</p>\r\n<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;">CIJENA SNI®ENA SA 75.000 NA 68.000 EURA!!</span></p>', '<p>We are pleased to offer this renovated apartment with a sea view close to the centre of Split. The apartment has one bedroom, kitchen, dining room and bathroom, with atotal living area of 40 m2. The property has been renovated and is in good condition, and is in the mostpopular area for tourism, with the charming historic cobbled streets andelevated views of the old city.</p>\r\n<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;">PRICE REDUCED FROM 75.000 TO 68.000 EUROS!!</span></p>', '', '<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;"><strong>CIJENA SNI®ENA SA 75.000 NA 68.000 EURA!!</strong></span></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartman na prvom katu stare kamene kuæe s prekrasnim pogledom na more, samo nekoliko minuta &scaron;etnje udaljen od centra grada i Marjana.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa se sastoji od prizemlja, prvog kata i potkrovlja u kojem je smje&scaron;ten ovaj jednosobni apartman.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartman se sastoji od jedne spavaæe sobe, kuhinje s blagovaonicom te kupaonice.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Iz blagovaonice i spavaæe sobe pru¾a se pogled na grad i more, dok spavaæa soba ima jo&scaron; jedan prozor koji gleda na vrt sa suprotne strane.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>S obzirom da poziciju ovo je izvrsna prilika ¾elite li nekretninu za svrhu turistièkog iznajmljivanja ili je jednostavno ¾elite koristiti za vlastiti boravak.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Najbli¾i parking udaljen je 20 m od kuæe, dok se svi ostali sadr¾aji nalaze u blizini.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Park &scaron;uma Marjan gdje se nalazi rekreacijska zona i prekrasne pla¾e udaljena je 5 min. hodanja.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Meðunarodni aerodrom udaljen je 40 min. vo¾nje.Za sve dodatne informacije slobodno nas kontaktirajte.</p>', '<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;"><strong>PRICE REDUCED FROM 75.000 TO 68.000 EUROS!!</strong></span></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>We are pleased to offer this renovated apartment with sea view close to the centre of Split.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is situated on the top floor of a three level old stone house between theold Roman centre of the city and the Marjan Park.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>A short walk to eitherattraction.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The apartment has one bedroom, kitchen, dining room and bathroom, with atotal living area of 40 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>From the dining room and bedroom there is a view of the old city and theport and the sea, while the bedroom has one window facing the garden on theopposite side of the house.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property has been renovated and is in good condition, and is in the mostpopular area for tourism, with the charming historic cobbled streets andelevated views of the old city.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The nearest parking is located 20 meters from the house, while all otherfacilities such as bars, shops, cafes, bakery etc are nearby.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Marjan Forest Park is a nature reserve with winding paths and recreationarea with beautiful beaches and &nbsp;is only few minutes walking.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The international airport is 40 minutes.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact the Croatia Property Sales office to arrange to visit this property, and similar ones available in the area.</p>', '', '1198_Apartment_0.jpg', '1198_Apartment_1.jpg', '1198_Apartment_2.jpg', '1198_Apartment_3.jpg', '1198_Apartment_4.jpg', '1198_Apartment_5.jpg', '1198_Apartment_6.jpg', '1198_Apartment_7.jpg', '1198_Apartment_8.jpg'),
(1199, 'Ivan', 'Cvitanoviæ', '0919063688', '', 'Cod promet d.o.o.', 'Trogir', 'Ulica Ante Starèeviæa  Okrug Gornji', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '230', '0', '75', 2, '115000', '', 2, 1, 2, 2, 1, 2, 2, 2, 'May 29, 2015', '<p>Apartman sjeveroju¾ne orijentacije smje&scaron;ten na 3.katu (potkrovlje) sa pogledom na more i u blizini mnogobrojnih sadr¾aja.&nbsp;Nalazi se na otoku Èiovu na zapadnoj strani dok je do povijesnog grada Trogira potrebno svega 10 minuta vo¾nje. Prednost je i blizina meðunarodnog aerodroma.&nbsp;Ukupna povr&scaron;ina apartmana je 65,51 m2. Dva balkona su ukljuèena u kvadraturu (5,10 m2 i 4,10 m2).<br /><br /></p>', '<p>We have this large modern apartment with a north/south orientation locatedon the 3rd floor (top floor) with a sea view and close to many facilities inthe village. It is located on Ciovo, five minutes from the sea and also five minutes fromthe centre of the popular tourist village on the western side of the island. The apartment is only 15 minutes tothe Split airport. The whole apartment is a spacious 65.51 m2 with two balconies which areincluded in square footage (5.10 m2 and 4.10 m2).</p>', '', '<p>Apartman sjeveroju¾ne orijentacije smje&scaron;ten na 3.katu (potkrovlje) sa pogledom na more i u blizini mnogobrojnih sadr¾aja.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nalazi se na otoku Èiovu na zapadnoj strani dok je do povijesnog grada Trogira potrebno svega 10 minuta vo¾nje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Prednost je i blizina meðunarodnog aerodroma.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ukupna povr&scaron;ina apartmana je 65,51 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Dva balkona su ukljuèena u kvadraturu (5,10 m2 i 4,10 m2).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sastoji se od hodnika, dnevnog boravka + blagovaonice + kuhinje, 2 spavaæe sobe, 2 kupaonice i 2 balkona.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Jedan balkon je na sjevernoj, dok je jedan na ju¾noj strani.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Potpuno je klimatiziran i namje&scaron;ten.Najbli¾a &scaron;ljunèana pla¾a udaljena je cca. 5 minuta hodanja, dok je centar mjesta udaljen nekoliko minuta vo¾nje gdje se nalazi velika &scaron;ljunèana pla¾a sa mnogim barovima i sadr¾ajima.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ispred zgrade se nalazi 1 parking mjesto koje je ukljuèeno u cijenu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Stojimo na raspolaganju ukoliko imate dodatnih pitanja.</p>', '<p>We have this large modern apartment with a north/south orientation locatedon the 3rd floor (top floor) with a sea view and close to many facilities inthe village.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is located on Ciovo, five minutes from the sea and also five minutes fromthe centre of the popular tourist village on the western side of the island.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The larger historic town of Trogir is only about 10 minutes drive and hereare many options for restaurants, night life, coffee bars as well as athriving market and other facilities.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The apartment is only 15 minutes tothe Split airport.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The whole apartment is a spacious 65.51 m2 with two balconies which areincluded in square footage (5.10 m2 and 4.10 m2).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It consists of a hallway, modern style open plan living room /dining roomand kitchen, 2 bedrooms, 2 bathrooms and 2 balconies.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>One balcony is on thenorth, while the other one is on the south side.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Fully air-conditioned and furnished.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property is well decorated and has been well maintained and apart frompersonal taste, needs no additional investment.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The area is popular because it is adjacent to a superb sandy beach (approx.5 minutes walk) or a similar distance from the large pebble beach with manybars and amenities.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>In front of the building there is one parking place is included in theprice.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact the office at Croatia Property Sales to arrange to visit thisproperty.</p>', '', '1199_Apartment_0.jpg', '1199_Apartment_1.JPG', '1199_Apartment_2.JPG', '1199_Apartment_3.JPG', '1199_Apartment_4.JPG', '1199_Apartment_5.JPG', '1199_Apartment_6.JPG', '1199_Apartment_7.JPG', '1199_Apartment_8.JPG'),
(1200, 'Eugen ', 'Moriæ', '00385 98 1621868', '', 'villa.most@gmail.com', 'Murter', 'Villa Most   Tisno MURTER', 'For sale', 'Old stone house', '50', '151', '240', 1, '550000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 5, 4, 'May 29, 2015', '<p>Predivna kamena vila na otoku Murteru. Vila se nalazi samo 50 m od mora. Sastoji se od 4 apartmana ukupne povr&scaron;ine 240 m2, dok zemlji&scaron;te na kojem je smje&scaron;tena ima povr&scaron;inu 151 m2. Vila ima dva dvori&scaron;ta, otvoreni bazen i terasu. Vila je kompletno opremljena modernom tehnièkom opremom i namje&scaron;tajem.&nbsp;2007. godine je obnovljena po konzervatorskim standardima dalmatinske arhitekture.</p>', '<p>Croatia Property Sales are pleased to have this beautiful and spacious old stone villa. It is situated only 50 m from the sea, in a small typical Dalmatian fishing village, on the island of Murter. The building consists of 4 apartments with a total area of 240 m2, while the land on which it is located has an area of 151 m2. The villa has two courtyards, an outdoor swimming pool and terrace. In 2007 the property was completely restored and modernised, under the supervision of conservation officials, and is now an attractive property, with great use of the space both inside and outside.</p>', '', '<p>Predivna kamena vila na otoku Murteru.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Vila se nalazi samo 50 m od mora.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sastoji se od 4 apartmana ukupne povr&scaron;ine 240 m2, dok zemlji&scaron;te na kojem je smje&scaron;tena ima povr&scaron;inu 151 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Vila ima dva dvori&scaron;ta, otvoreni bazen i terasu.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Prizemlje se sastoji od dvije spavaæe sobe, kupaonice, WC-a, dnevnog boravka i kuhinje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na prvom katu je jednosoban stan s kupaonicom, dnevnim boravkom i kuhinjom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na drugom katu se nalaze jedna spavaæa soba i kupaonica s jacuzzijem.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na drugoj strani kuæe nalazi se studio apartman.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Vila je kompletno opremljena modernom tehnièkom opremom i namje&scaron;tajem.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>2007. godine je obnovljena po konzervatorskim standardima dalmatinske arhitekture.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>S obzirom da se kuæa nalazi u malom turistièkom dalmatinskom mjestu svi sadr¾aji: trgovine, restorani i kafiæi su u neposrednoj blizini.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Molimo za sve dodatne informacije kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured u Splitu.</p>', '<p>Croatia Property Sales are pleased to have this beautiful and spacious old stone villa.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is situated only 50 m from the sea, in a small typical Dalmatian fishing village, on the island of Murter.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Within walking distance, apart from the village harbour and the shore, are plenty of useful facilities including bakery, restaurants, shops, coffee shops and bars.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The building consists of 4 apartments with a total area of 240 m2, while the land on which it is located has an area of 151 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The ground floor consists of two bedrooms, bathroom, toilet, and a spacious open plan living room and kitchen.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the first floor is one bedroom apartment with bathroom, living room and kitchen.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the second floor there are one bedroom and a bathroom with a jacuzzi.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the other side of the house is a studio apartment.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The villa is fully equipped with modern fittings and furniture.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The villa has two courtyards, an outdoor swimming pool and terrace.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>In 2007 the property was completely restored and modernised, under the supervision of conservation officials, and is now an attractive property, with great use of the space both inside and outside.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property has been well maintained and is ready for immediate dwelling and renting.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact our offices to visit this property or with questions.</p>', '', '1200_House-Villa_0.jpg', '1200_House-Villa_1.jpg', '1200_House-Villa_2.jpg', '1200_House-Villa_3.jpg', '1200_House-Villa_4.jpg', '1200_House-Villa_5.jpg', '1200_House-Villa_6.jpg', '1200_House-Villa_7.jpg', '1200_House-Villa_8.jpg'),
(1201, 'Ivo', 'Zavoreo', '099 285 6454,', 'sin Vedran: 098 218 972', 'vzavoreo@gmail.com ', 'Brac', 'Put Bistrice 19, Sutivan Sutivan, 2094/18 k.o .sutivan', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '50', '546', '270', 1, '775000', '', 2, 1, 2, 2, 1, 1, 3, 3, 'June 1, 2015', '<p>Nova luksuzno namje&scaron;tena vila smje&scaron;tena 50 m od &scaron;ljunèane pla¾e.&nbsp;Lijepa prostrana vila s pogledom na more na otoku Braèu.&nbsp;Vila se sastoji od prizemlja, prvog i drugog kata.&nbsp;Ukupna stambena povr&scaron;ina vile iznosi 270 m2.&nbsp;Okuænica (546 m2) je lijepo hortikulturno ureðena (palme, masline itd.) sa sustavom navodnjavanja. U dvori&scaron;tu se nalazi bazen sa terasom za sunèanje, a sa stra¾nje strane otvoreni kamin na drva. &nbsp;</p>', '<p>Newly built luxurious villa only 50 meters from the sea.&nbsp;Beautiful spatious villa with a sea view on island Brac.&nbsp;Villa consists of ground floor, first and second floor.&nbsp;Total living area of the villa is 270 m2.&nbsp;Garden (546 m2) is landscaped (palm trees, olives etc.) and equipped with irrigation system. There is an outdoor swimming pool with sun deck as well as BBQ / fire place from the back side of the property. &nbsp;</p>', '', '<p>Nova luksuzno namje&scaron;tena vila smje&scaron;tena 50 m od &scaron;ljunèane pla¾e.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Lijepa prostrana vila s pogledom na more na otoku Braèu.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Vila se sastoji od prizemlja, prvog i drugog kata.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U prizemlju se nalaze gara¾a, praonica rublja i ostava.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Unutarnjim stepeni&scaron;tem dolazi se do prvog kata gdje je otvoreni prostor kuhinje, blagovaonice i dnevnog boravka te wc.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Velike dvostrane klizne staklene stijenke omoguæavaju izlaz na prostranu terasu sa koje se pru¾a lijepi pogled na more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na drugom katu nalaze se tri spavaæe sobe, svaka sa kupaonicom.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ukupna stambena povr&scaron;ina vile iznosi 270 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Prostorije su klimatizirane.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U kupaonicama je postavljeno podno grijanje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je potpuno opremljena i namje&scaron;tena.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Komunikacijske povr&scaron;ine, ukljuèujuæi vanjske terase i ograde, izraðene su od kamena.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Okuænica (546 m2) je lijepo hortikulturno ureðena (palme, masline itd.) sa sustavom navodnjavanja.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U dvori&scaron;tu se nalazi bazen sa terasom za sunèanje, a sa stra¾nje strane otvoreni kamin na drva. &nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Mjesto je udaljeno od Supetra 6 km.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Otok Braè povezan je svakodnevnom trajektnom linijom sa gradom Splitom, dok je meðunarodni aerodrom udaljen 40 minuta vo¾nje od Splita.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Molimo kontaktirajte nas za sve dodatne informacije.</p>', '<p>Newly built luxurious villa only 50 meters from the sea.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Beautiful spatious villa with a sea view on island Brac.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Villa consists of ground floor, first and second floor.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the ground floor there is garage, laundry and storage.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Internal staricase leads onto the first floor, featuring large living area with kitchen, dining room and toilet.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Lounge room opens to a great terrace with sea views.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There are 3 en-suite bedrooms on the second floor.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Total living area of the villa is 270 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>All rooms are air-conditioned and bathrooms have underfloor heating.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house is fully furnished and equipped with modern appliances.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Terraces are made of local stone.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Garden (546 m2) is landscaped (palm trees, olives etc.) and equipped with irrigation system.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There is an outdoor swimming pool with sun deck as well as BBQ / fire place from the back side of the property. &nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Supetar is 6 km away.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The island of Brac is connected by daily ferry lines to Split, while the international airport is 40 minutes drive from Split.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact us for more information and to arrange to visit the property.</p>', '', '1201_House-Villa_0.jpg', '1201_House-Villa_1.jpg', '1201_House-Villa_2.jpg', '1201_House-Villa_3.jpg', '1201_House-Villa_4.jpg', '1201_House-Villa_5.jpg', '1201_House-Villa_6.jpg', '1201_House-Villa_7.jpg', '1201_House-Villa_8.jpg'),
(1202, '®arko', 'Rogan', '099 2146522 ', 'zrinka vrca 098 452010', 'zrinka.vrca@t.ht.hr', 'Hvar', 'Otok Hvar uvala Basina, Zemlji¹no knji¾ni ul 148; èest.zem:582/25', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '20', '350', '108', 1, '550000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 4, 2, 'June 1, 2015', '<p>Prekrasna kuæa u mirnoj uvali na otoku Hvaru s oèaravajuæim pogledom na more.&nbsp;Udaljena je od mora samo 20 m.&nbsp;Sastoji se od prizemlja i kata ukupne stambene povr&scaron;ine 108 m2.&nbsp;Zemlji&scaron;te na kojem se nalazi kuæa ima povr&scaron;inu 350 m2.&nbsp;Mjesto je okru¾eno gustom borovom &scaron;umom, poljima maslina, vinove loze i lavande, te èistim morem bogatim brojnim vrstama &scaron;koljaka i riba, vrlo primamljivim ljubiteljima ronjenja.</p>', '<p>We have this beautiful house in a quiet bay on the island of Hvar with a magnificent view of the sea. It is situated just 20m away from the sea, among pine woods, old vines and olive groves. It consists of two floors with a total floor area of 108 m2. The land on which the house has an area of 350 m2. The house is 3 km from the nearest town centre, less than 10 minutes cycling on a quiet track, and here are all necessary facilities such as restaurants, shops, bars and coffee shops, bakery etc.</p>', '', '<p>Prekrasna kuæa u mirnoj uvali na otoku Hvaru s oèaravajuæim pogledom na more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Udaljena je od mora samo 20 m.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sastoji se od prizemlja i kata ukupne stambene povr&scaron;ine 108 m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U prizemlju se nalaze velika kuhinja i blagovaonica te izlaz na natkrivenu terasu.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na katu su 4 spavaæe sobe, terasa du¾ dvije sobe koje imaju pogled na more, kupaonica i WC odvojeno.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Takoðer postoji i tavanski prostor koji se mo¾e preurediti u spavaæe sobe.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Zemlji&scaron;te na kojem se nalazi kuæa ima povr&scaron;inu 350 m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U kuæu se mo¾e uæi s vanjske i s unutarnje strane.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Orijentacija S-J.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa ima svu potrebnu infrastrukturu i useljiva je.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kompletno je namje&scaron;tena te ima ugraðenu klimatizaciju.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Iznad kuæe je parkirno mjesto s moguæno&scaron;æu parkiranja 3 automobila.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Mjesto je okru¾eno gustom borovom &scaron;umom, poljima maslina, vinove loze i lavande, te èistim morem bogatim brojnim vrstama &scaron;koljaka i riba, vrlo primamljivim ljubiteljima ronjenja.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je udaljena do centra gdje se nalaze svi potrebni sadr¾aji 3 km.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Trajektna luka Stari Grad je na udaljenosti 5 km od mjesta.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>We have this beautiful house in a quiet bay on the island of Hvar with a magnificent view of the sea.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is situated just 20m away from the sea, among pine woods, old vines and olive groves.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The sea here has clear waters rich in fish and with many shellfish species, making it very attractive for diving and swimming.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property is on a North/south orientation with private parking for three vehicles.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It consists of two floors with a total floor area of 108 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The ground floor has a large kitchen and dining room leading out to a splendid covered terrace.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the first floor are a bathroom and toilet with four bedrooms, two having access to the terrace along the front of the property with fabulous views over the harbour and the sea.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There is also a loft used for storage that can be converted into a bedroom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The land on which the house has an area of 350 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house has two entrances, is fully furnished with built-in air conditioning, and is ready for immediate living or renting to tourists.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house is 3 km from the nearest town centre, less than 10 minutes cycling on a quiet track, and here are all necessary facilities such as restaurants, shops, bars and coffee shops, bakery etc.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The main island ferry port is Stari Grad which is about 5 km from the property.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>We remain at your disposal for any additional questions and information and an agent will happily assist with viewing the property.</p>', '', '1202_House-Villa_0.jpg', '1202_House-Villa_1.jpg', '1202_House-Villa_2.jpg', '1202_House-Villa_3.jpg', '1202_House-Villa_4.jpg', '1202_House-Villa_5.jpg', '1202_House-Villa_6.jpg', '1202_House-Villa_7.jpg', '1202_House-Villa_8.jpg'),
(1203, 'Jure', 'Grgièeviæ', '0915273349', '', '', 'Hvar', 'Mala Rudina, Hvar', 'For sale', 'Old stone house', '350', '30', '150', 1, '199000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 0, 0, 'June 1, 2015', '<p>&Scaron;armantna stara kamena kuæa u mjestu na zapadnoj strani otoka, u prekrasnoj uvali blizu grada Hvara. Udaljena je od mora 350 m. Ima ukupnu stambenu povr&scaron;inu 150 m2, a sastoji se od prizemlja, prvog kata i potkrovlja. Dvori&scaron;te ima povr&scaron;inu 30 m2.&nbsp;Kuæa ima svu potrebnu infrastrukturu te pristup vozilom i parking. Zahtijeva&nbsp;kompletnu renovaciju.</p>', '<p>We have this renovation project of a grand old stone house in a small village on the west side of the island, in a beautiful bay near the town of Hvar. The property is situated in a lovely spot, only 350 m from the sea, and was formerly one of the dominant properties in the village and the challenge is to restore it to its former status. It has a total surface of 150 m2 and consists of ground floor, first floor and attic. The yard has an area of 30 m2.</p>', '', '<p>&Scaron;armantna stara kamena kuæa u mjestu na zapadnoj strani otoka, u prekrasnoj uvali blizu grada Hvara.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Udaljena je od mora 350 m.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ima ukupnu stambenu povr&scaron;inu 150 m2, a sastoji se od prizemlja, prvog kata i potkrovlja.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Dvori&scaron;te ima povr&scaron;inu 30 m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa ima svu potrebnu infrastrukturu te pristup vozilom i parking.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Zahtijeva kompletnu renovaciju.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Centar mjesta gdje se nalaze trgovina, pekarna i restorani udaljen je nekoliko minuta &scaron;etnje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Trajektna luka Stari Grad je udaljena 6 km.</p>', '<p>We have this renovation project of a grand old stone house in a small village on the west side of the island, in a beautiful bay near the town of Hvar.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property is situated in a lovely spot, only 350 m from the sea, and was formerly one of the dominant properties in the village and the challenge is to restore it to its former status.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It has a total surface of 150 m2 and consists of ground floor, first floor and attic.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The yard has an area of 30 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house has all the necessary infrastructure - water, electric etc - and car access and parking.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It needs a complete renovation, but the main walls look in good condition, and it is dry inside.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>In the local village there are shops, a bakery, bars and coffee shops, and restaurants.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>This house is only a few minutes&rsquo; walk from the centre, albeit the village is small.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The ferry port Stari Grad is 6 km away.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>This property has been pitched at a price to ensure a quick sale, and as the numbers of ''renovation projects'' are slowly dwindling we would urge potential purchasers to move quickly.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact our offices for more information and to visit the site with one of our agents.</p>', '', '1203_Old-stone-house_0.jpg', '1203_Old-stone-house_1.jpg', '1203_Old-stone-house_2.jpg', '1203_Old-stone-house_3.jpg', '1203_Old-stone-house_4.jpg', '1203_Old-stone-house_5.jpg', '1203_Old-stone-house_6.jpg', '1203_Old-stone-house_7.jpg', '1203_Old-stone-house_8.jpg'),
(1204, 'Radoslav ', 'Staniæ', '098 450 181', 'brat Mirko (Split) 098 287 427, 098 901 0566 ', 'radoslav.stanic@trgofortuna.hr', 'Omis', 'Ruskamen II, br. 13 Ruskamen &#8211; Lokva Rogoznica, k.è. 1054/3 k.o. rogoznica', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '120', '350', '450', 2, '360000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 14, 10, 'June 1, 2015', '<p>Prostrana apartmanska kuæa sa pogledom na more,&nbsp;nekoliko kilometara ju¾no od Omi&scaron;a. Sastoji se od prizemlja, prvog i drugog kata.&nbsp;Ukupna stambena povr&scaron;ina kuæe iznosi 450 m2, dok je povr&scaron;ine zemlji&scaron;ta 350 m2.&nbsp;Apartmani su namje&scaron;teni i klimatizirani. Parkirali&scaron;na mjesta nalaze se pokraj objekta.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>Spatious apartment house at only few kilometers south of Omis town. Consists of ground floor, first and second floors.&nbsp;Total living area of the house is 450m sq, while the land plot measures 350 m sq.&nbsp;All units are furnished and air-conditioned. Parking place is next to the house.&nbsp;The shore is clean and pebbled, with barely any tide, making it safe for swimming and water sports, while the nearest coffee bar is within walking distance.</p>', '', '<p>Prostrana apartmanska kuæa sa pogledom na more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Prostrana apartmanska kuæa nekoliko kilometara ju¾no od Omi&scaron;a.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U prizemlju objekta nalazi se apartman za vlasnika, kotlovnica (solarno grijanje) te veliki prostor sa kaminom na zajednièko kori&scaron;tenje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na prvom katu nalaze se tri studio apartmana (spavaæa soba sa èajnom kuhinjom, balkon, kupaonica) te dva jednosobna apartmana (spavaæa soba sa èajnom kuhinjom, spavaæa soba sa krevetom na kat, balkon, kupaonica).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Drugi kat ima strukturu identiènu prvome.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ukupna stambena povr&scaron;ina kuæe iznosi 450 m2, dok je povr&scaron;ine zemlji&scaron;ta 350 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartmani su namje&scaron;teni i klimatizirani.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Parkirali&scaron;na mjesta nalaze se pokraj objekta.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Svi potrebni sadr¾aji se nalaze u blizini.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Do meðunarodnog aerodroma je potrebno 1h vo¾nje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za sve dodatne informacije i razgledavanje molimo da nas kontaktirate.</p>', '<p>Spatious apartment house with sea views.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Spatious apartment house at only few kilometers south of Omis town.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the ground floor there is an owner''s suite, heating room (solar heating) and large room with BBQ to be used by the guests.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the first floor there are 3 studio apartments (bedroom with kitchenette, balcony, bathroom) and two 1-bedroom apartments bedroom with kitchenette, bedroom with bunk beds, balcony, bathroom).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ther second floor has identical structure.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Total living area of the house is 450m sq, while the land plot measures 350m sq.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>All units are furnished and air-conditioned.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Parking place is next to the house.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The shore is clean and pebbled, with barely any tide, making it safe for swimming and water sports, while the nearest coffee bar is within walking distance.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The town of Omis is very much ''geared up'' to tourists and it provide a range of shops, and good restaurants to explore.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The international airport is 1 hour drive.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For additional information and a tour please contact us.</p>', '', '1204_House-Villa_0.jpg', '1204_House-Villa_1.jpg', '1204_House-Villa_2.jpg', '1204_House-Villa_3.jpg', '1204_House-Villa_4.jpg', '1204_House-Villa_5.jpg', '1204_House-Villa_6.jpg', '1204_House-Villa_7.jpg', '1204_House-Villa_8.jpg'),
(1205, 'Jak¹a', 'Dalmatian Home', '', '', 'info@dalmatianhome.com', 'Sibenik', 'Brodarica', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '100', '0', '55', 2, '100000', '', 2, 1, 2, 2, 1, 2, 2, 1, 'June 1, 2015', '<p>Novi apartmani u Brodarici, 3 km ju¾no od &Scaron;ibenika.&nbsp;Zgrada je moderne arhitekture, s naglaskom na kvalitetne i trajne materijale. Unutra&scaron;njost objekta èini ukupno 6 dvosobnih apartmana (po dva apartmana na svakom katu) èije neto stambene povr&scaron;ine variraju od 54,55m2 do 56,81m2 sa dodatnim terasama cca 12-16 m2. Apartmani u prizemlju imaju pripadajuæu okuænicu. Sa apartmana smje&scaron;tenih na 1. i 2. katu moæi æe se u¾ivati u lijepom pogledu na more. Do najbli¾e pla¾e ima cca 200 m.</p>', '<p>New apartments in Brodarica, 3 km south from Sibenik.&nbsp;Building has 6 two-bedroom apartments (two apartments on each floor). Each apartment has a spacious terrace or loggia and the apartments on the ground floor has the attached garden. There will be beautiful sea view from the apartments on the 1st and 2nd floor. Distance to the nearest beach is 200m.</p>', '', '<p>Novi apartmani u Brodarici, 3 km ju¾no od &Scaron;ibenika.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Zgrada je moderne arhitekture, s naglaskom na kvalitetne i trajne materijale.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Unutra&scaron;njost objekta èini ukupno 6 dvosobnih apartmana (po dva apartmana na svakom katu) èije neto stambene povr&scaron;ine variraju od 54,55m2 do 56,81m2 sa dodatnim terasama cca 12-16 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartmani u prizemlju imaju pripadajuæu okuænicu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sa apartmana smje&scaron;tenih na 1. i 2. katu moæi æe se u¾ivati u lijepom pogledu na more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Do najbli¾e pla¾e ima cca 200 m.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Gradnja apartmana zapoèela je u rujnu 2014., a predviðeni rok zavr&scaron;etka radova je 01.07.2015. godine.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartmani æe biti prozraèni i puni svjetla, opremljeni sigurnosnim vratima, klimatizacijom s moguæno&scaron;æu grijanja, prikljuècima za TV/SAT, talijanskom keramikom 1. klase, sobnim parketima od hrastovine, PVC i aluminijskom stolarijom, dok æe kupaonice biti opremljene tu&scaron; kadama.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Moguæa je izrada kuhinje po mjeri kao i ugradbenih ormara u sobama.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Naravno, svakom apartmanu pripada po jedno parkirno mjesto, koje je ukljuèeno u cijenu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><span style="color: #ff0000;"><strong><span style="text-decoration: underline;">Raspolo¾ivi apartmani su:</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong><span style="text-decoration: underline;">2.kat, A6, 54,55m2 stambena povr&scaron;ina + 16,38m2 natkrivena terasa + jugoistoèna orijentacija, 100.000,00 EUR&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Svi potrebni sadr¾aji kao &scaron;to su trgovaèki centri, pumpne stanice, marina, restorani, cafe barovi, beach barovi, &scaron;kola, bolnica, itd., nalaze se u krugu od 5 km, a najbli¾a zraèna luka koja je povezana sa svim va¾nijim Europskim destinacijama locirana je u Ka&scaron;telima (cca 55 km udaljen od &Scaron;ibenika, 35 min vo¾nje automobilom).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U blizini se nalazi hotelski kompleks Solaris sa svim dodatnim aktivnostima za razonodu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Unutar 20 km nalaze se 2 nacionalna parka, NP Krka i NP Kornati, brojne turistièke destinacije, kao i prekrasan &Scaron;ibenski arhipelag.</p>', '<p>New apartments in Brodarica, 3 km south from Sibenik.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Building has 6 two-bedroom apartments (two apartments on each floor).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Each apartment has a spacious terrace or loggia and the apartments on the ground floor has the attached garden.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There will be beautiful sea view from the apartments on the 1st and 2nd floor.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Distance to the nearest beach is 200m.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Construction started in September 2014., and building is scheduled for completion in 01.07.2015.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartment units will have security doors, air conditioning with heating, TV/SAT connections, high quality Italian tiles and ceramics, real wood floors (oak), bathroom with a shower cabins, PVC high grade windows, lots of light, sea-view from all the apartments, except for the ground floor.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Of course, each apartment has a parking lot next to the building of minimum 12 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Parking lot is included in the price.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><span style="color: #ff0000;"><strong><span style="text-decoration: underline;">Available apartments:</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong><span style="text-decoration: underline;">2nd floor, A6, 54,55m2 living area + 16,38m2 covered terrace, south-east orientation, 100.000,00 EUR&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>All the shopping centers, gas stations, restaurants, beach bars, caffe bars, hotels, spa&rsquo;s, marina, hospital...everything within 5 km radius!</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The main Dalmatian Split airport is situated in Kastela, some 55 km away (35 min drive).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There are 2 national parks within 20km, NP Krka river and NP Kornati Islands, as well as numerous touristic destinations and beautiful Sibenik arhipelago.</p>', '', '1205_Apartment_0.jpg', '1205_Apartment_1.jpg', '1205_Apartment_2.jpg', '1205_Apartment_3.jpg', '1205_Apartment_4.jpg', '1205_Apartment_5.jpg', '1205_Apartment_6.jpg', '1205_Apartment_7.jpg', '1205_Apartment_8.jpg');
INSERT INTO `nekretnina` (`id`, `ime`, `prezime`, `telefon`, `mobitel`, `e_mail`, `lokacija_id`, `adresa`, `status_id`, `vrsta_id`, `udaljenost`, `povrsina`, `stambenapovrsina`, `display`, `cijena`, `cijenatocka`, `ponuda_tjedna`, `new_built`, `must_sell`, `prvi_red_do_mora`, `pogled_na_more`, `bazen`, `broj_soba`, `broj_kupatila`, `datum`, `title_hr`, `title_en`, `title_ge`, `opis_hr`, `opis_en`, `opis_ge`, `PropertyImageURL0`, `PropertyImageURL1`, `PropertyImageURL2`, `PropertyImageURL3`, `PropertyImageURL4`, `PropertyImageURL5`, `PropertyImageURL6`, `PropertyImageURL7`, `PropertyImageURL8`) VALUES
(1206, 'Alen ', 'Dalmatis', '', '', 'info@dalmatis.hr', 'Dubrovnik', 'Mljet', 'For sale', 'Old stone house', '3000', '600', '360', 1, '270000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 0, 0, 'June 1, 2015', '<p>Èetiri tradicionalne dalmatinske kamene kuæe na odliènoj lokaciji.&nbsp;Dalmatinske kamene kuæe nalaze se svega nekoliko kilometara od mora na otoku Mljetu, te iz svih kuæa se pru¾a prekrasan pogled prema otvorenom moru u pravcu Italije.&nbsp;Stari obiteljski posjed sa kraja 19. st., 3 spojene stare kamene kuæe i 1 odvojeni objekt sveukpnog stambenog prostora povr&scaron;ine cca 360 m2 zajedno sa cca 600 m2 okuænice.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>Great restoration project for builder or investor. We have four traditional Dalmatian old stone house on one plot for renovation/restoration.&nbsp;A rare opportunity.&nbsp;They are situated only a few kilometers from the sea on the island of Mljet, and each of these houses have a beautiful elevated views of the open sea towards Italy.&nbsp;It is part of an old family estate from the late 19th century; 3 terraced stone houses and one separate building with a total living space of approx 360 m2 with 600 m2 of land.&nbsp;</p>', '', '<p>Èetiri tradicionalne dalmatinske kamene kuæe na odliènoj lokaciji.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Dalmatinske kamene kuæe nalaze se svega nekoliko kilometara od mora na otoku Mljetu, te iz svih kuæa se pru¾a prekrasan pogled prema otvorenom moru u pravcu Italije.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Stari obiteljski posjed sa kraja 19. st., 3 spojene stare kamene kuæe i 1 odvojeni objekt sveukpnog stambenog prostora povr&scaron;ine cca 360 m2 zajedno sa cca 600 m2 okuænice.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ovaj spojeni blok vi&scaron;ekatnica ima 6 spavaæih soba.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U prizemlju kuæe nalazi se konoba u koju se ulazi kroz atraktivni kameni volat.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Vanjske kamene stepenice vode na prvi kat koji je unutarnjim drvenim stepenicama povezan s drugim katom.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Neto tlocrtna povr&scaron;ina svake eta¾e iznosi cca. 30 m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Podovi su drveni, na kuæi se nalazi stari kameni oluk, a uz kuæu ograðeno dvori&scaron;te povr&scaron;ine cca.45 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæi je potrebna adaptacija.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Svojim polo¾ajem i jedinstveno&scaron;æu ova kuæa odi&scaron;e posebnom atmosferom te omoguæava potpuni do¾ivljaj mediteranskog duha i mediteranskog podneblja u svoj njegovoj ljepoti i posebnosti.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa ima veliku gustirnu, te prikljuèak za struju.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Njezina vrijednost je u kamenim zidovima, velièini same nekretnine, lokaciji.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na oznaèenoj slici pod brojevima 1, 2, 3 nalazi se potpod, mlinica za preradu maslina, 5 spavaæih soba, dnevni boravak, tavan.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Pod brojem 4 je takoðer dnevni boravak i kuhinja. Kupaone nema, poljski wc na slici nije oznaèen brojem, ali je vidljiv.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Prikljuèci struje i vode su moguæi.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Dokumentacija uredna (1/1).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Mljet, otok izvorne i nedirnute prirode odi&scaron;e ljepotom, bogat &scaron;umama, idealan je za odmor i u¾ivanje.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Spojen je svakodnevno s Dubrovnikom trajektnim i katamaranskim linijama.</p>', '<p>Great restoration project for builder or investor.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>We have four traditional Dalmatian old stone house on one plot for renovation/restoration.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>A rare opportunity.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>They are situated only a few kilometers from the sea on the island of Mljet, and each of these houses have a beautiful elevated views of the open sea towards Italy.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is part of an old family estate from the late 19th century; 3 terraced stone houses and one separate building with a total living space of approx 360 m2 with 600 m2 of land.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Collectively they have six bedrooms.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the ground floor there is a restaurant, which is entered through an attractive stone arch.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>An external stone staircase leads to the first floor which has an internal wooden staircase connected to the other floors.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Net surface area of each floor is approx. 30 m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The floors are wooden, the house is an old stone gutter, and the house garden area cca.45 m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house is in need of renovation.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>This collection of houses is located in a beautiful village, off the coast, which means there are very few casual visitors through the summer, and it will always retain the special sought after Mediterranean spirit and unique atmosphere that we all find so charming.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house has a large water tank and electricity supplies.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The buildings indicated: 1, 2, 3 have a basement, where there are still the mills for processing olives, and upstairs they have 5 bedrooms, living room, attic.&nbsp;Building 4 &nbsp;also has &nbsp;a living room and kitchen.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There is no bathroom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property has an outside toilet &nbsp;which is shown in the picture but is not numbered.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Mljet island is a national park, original and untouched nature of beauty, rich in forests, ideal for relaxation and enjoyment.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is connected with Dubrovnik daily ferry and catamaran lines.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please call our office for more information, or to arrange to visit this property.&nbsp;</p>', '', '1206_Old-stone-house_0.jpg', '1206_Old-stone-house_1.jpg', '1206_Old-stone-house_2.jpg', '1206_Old-stone-house_3.jpg', '1206_Old-stone-house_4.jpg', '1206_Old-stone-house_5.jpg', '1206_Old-stone-house_6.jpg', '1206_Old-stone-house_7.jpg', '1206_Old-stone-house_8.jpg'),
(1207, 'Axel ', 'Endresen, Katharina ', ' 00385 91 5081 244 Darko Bumbar  ', '', 'axelendresen@hotmail.com, katharina.hern', 'Rogoznica', 'Rogoznica', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '250', '0', '85', 2, '145000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 3, 2, 'June 2, 2015', '<p>Prekrasan, prostrani dvoeta¾ni apartman u lijepom dijelu Rogoznice, na svega 250 m udaljenosti od mora i centra mjesta.&nbsp;S balkona koji je ju¾ne orijentacije pru¾a se predivan pogled na more i cijelu uvalu i marinu.&nbsp;Apartman je u potpunosti ureðen , kvalitetnim i modernim namje&scaron;tajem.&nbsp;Povr&scaron;ina apartmana je 85 m2.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>We have this spacious duplex apartment on a beautiful part of the mainland shore near Rogoznica, only 250 meters from the sea and the village centre. From the south facing balcony there are beautiful views of the sea, the bay and the marina. The apartment size is 85 m2. Distance to restaurants, shops and caf&eacute;s is only a few minutes walking, and during the summer all the necessary shops, restaurants and other tourist facilities can be found in the village.</p>', '', '<p>Prekrasan, prostrani dvoeta¾ni apartman u lijepom dijelu Rogoznice, na svega 250 m udaljenosti od mora i centra mjesta.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>S balkona koji je ju¾ne orijentacije pru¾a se predivan pogled na more i cijelu uvalu i marinu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartman je u potpunosti ureðen , kvalitetnim i modernim namje&scaron;tajem.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Povr&scaron;ina apartmana je 85 m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U donjem dijelu apartmana nalaze se dvije spavaæe sobe, kupaonica, dnevni boravak s kuhinjom i blagovaonicom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na kat (galeriju) se ide kru¾nim stepenicama, a tu se nalazi jo&scaron; jedna spavaæa soba i kupaonica.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartman ima osigurano parking mjesto.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Zgrada ima svu potrebnu infrastrukturu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Udaljenost od restorana, trgovina i kafiæa je svega nekoliko minuta, a tijekom ljeta svi potrebni turistièki sadr¾aji mogu se pronaæi u mjestu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Meðunarodni aerodrom je udaljen 25 km.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za sve dodatne informacije molimo kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured u Splitu.</p>', '<p>We have this spacious duplex apartment on a beautiful part of the mainland shore near Rogoznica, only 250 meters from the sea and the village centre.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>From the south facing balcony there are beautiful views of the sea, the bay and the marina.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The apartment size is 85 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>In the lower part of the apartment there are two bedrooms, bathroom, an open plan family area consisting of a living room with kitchen and dining room.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The apartment is fully furnished, with high-quality fittings, and modern furniture.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the first floor (gallery) there is a circular staircase, with another bedroom and bathroom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The apartment comes with its own private parking place.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Distance to restaurants, shops and caf&eacute;s is only a few minutes walking, and during the summer all the necessary shops, restaurants and other tourist facilities can be found in the village.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The international airport is 25 km away.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For further information please contact our agents in Split and we will be pleased to show you this good value property.</p>', '', '1207_Apartment_0.jpg', '1207_Apartment_1.JPG', '1207_Apartment_2.JPG', '1207_Apartment_3.JPG', '1207_Apartment_4.JPG', '1207_Apartment_5.JPG', '1207_Apartment_6.JPG', '1207_Apartment_7.JPG', '1207_Apartment_8.JPG'),
(1208, 'Biserka', 'Babiæ', '091 4545 131', '', 'Biserka.babic@gmail.com', 'Rogoznica', 'Rogoznica', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '10', '162', '100', 1, '350000', '', 2, 2, 2, 1, 1, 2, 4, 3, 'June 2, 2015', '<p>Na svega par metara od mora i lijepo ureðene pla¾e &nbsp;na atraktivnom dijelu Rogoznice nalazi se ureðena kuæa zapadne orijentacije s koje se pru¾a otvoreni pogled na more i uvalu.&nbsp;Kuæa je povr&scaron;ine 100 m2, a nalazi se na parceli povr&scaron;ine 162 m2.&nbsp;Kuæa je podijeljena na prizemlje i dva kata.&nbsp;U sklopu lijepo ureðene okuænice nalazi se ro&scaron;tilj i jedno parking mjesto.&nbsp;Do kuæe je osiguran prilaz cestom.</p>', '<p>We are offering this excellent value sea front apartment house on one of the most popular parts of the mainland. It is situated just a few meters from the beautiful beach in a bay near Rogoznica facing west, and only 2 minutes&rsquo; walk along the shore to the old harbour and centre of this historic village. The house itself is modern and has a living area of 100 m2 and is located on a plot of 162 m2.&nbsp;The house is divided into three floors.&nbsp;</p>', '', '<p>Na svega par metara od mora i lijepo ureðene pla¾e &nbsp;na atraktivnom dijelu Rogoznice nalazi se ureðena kuæa zapadne orijentacije s koje se pru¾a otvoreni pogled na more i uvalu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je povr&scaron;ine 100 m2, a nalazi se na parceli povr&scaron;ine 162 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je podijeljena na prizemlje i dva kata.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U prizemlju se nalazi jedna prostorija koja slu¾i &nbsp;kao dnevni boravak a mo¾e slu¾iti i kao ljetna kuhinja, mala kupaonica i velika gara¾a.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na prvom katu se nalazi dvosobni apartman koji se sastoji od dvije spavaæe sobe, dnevnog boravka, kuhinje, kupaonice.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Izlaz je na lijepu veliku terasu zapadne orijentacije s koje se pru¾a pogled na more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na drugom katu je jo&scaron; jedan dvosobni apartman, a posebno je zanimljivo rje&scaron;enje kuhinje koja se nalazi na meðukatu i koja takoðer ima svoj balkon s pogledom na more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je u dobrom stanju, u potpunosti ureðena.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U sklopu lijepo ureðene okuænice nalazi se ro&scaron;tilj i jedno parking mjesto.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Do kuæe je osiguran prilaz cestom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Udaljenost do centra mjesta je svega par stotina metara, a do aerodroma 28 km.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa ima svu potrebnu infrastrukturu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za sve dodatne informacije molimo kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured u Splitu.</p>', '<p>We are offering this excellent value sea front apartment house on one of the most popular parts of the mainland.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is situated just a few meters from the beautiful beach in a bay near Rogoznica &nbsp;facing west, and only 2 minutes&rsquo; walk along the shore to the old harbour and centre of this historic village.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The village is small and charming with family run bars and coffee shops, some shops, restaurants, bakery and other useful services.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house itself is modern and has a living area of 100 m2 and is located on a plot of 162 m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house is divided into three floors.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The ground floor is a room that serves as living room (but can serve as a summer kitchen) with a small bathroom and a large garage.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the first floor is a two bedroom apartment with an open plan living room, kitchen, and a bathroom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the second floor is a one bedroom apartment, and it has a particularly interesting and practical solution to the kitchen, which is located on the mezzanine, which again has a balcony overlooking the sea.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There are spectacular views across the bay and out to sea, and of course in the evening faces the right way to enjoy the sunset.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house is in good condition, fully furnished, and has many modern features and fittings.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property has been well maintained and is in good decorative condition.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Within the landscaped grounds there is a barbecue and patio, and an additional private parking place.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house has access from the public road.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The &nbsp;distance to the airport is less than 30 km.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For further information please contact our office in Split and we can arrange to view this property with you.</p>', '', '1208_House-Villa_0.jpg', '1208_House-Villa_1.jpg', '1208_House-Villa_2.jpg', '1208_House-Villa_3.jpg', '1208_House-Villa_4.jpg', '1208_House-Villa_5.jpg', '1208_House-Villa_6.jpg', '1208_House-Villa_7.jpg', '1208_House-Villa_8.jpg'),
(1209, 'Marina', 'Stenek', '091 5382585', '0911231262 (Ivanka Stenek)', 'marinastenek@gmail.com', 'Korcula', 'Raèi¹æe, Otok Korèula', 'For sale', 'Land plot', '100', '345', '0', 1, '60000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 0, 0, 'June 2, 2015', '<p>Graðevinsko zemlji&scaron;te drugi red od mora na otoku Korèuli.&nbsp;Zemlji&scaron;te se nalazi na ravnom terenu s asfaltiranom pristupnom cestom i dostupnom infrastrukturom.&nbsp;Sa zemlji&scaron;ta se pru¾a prekrasan pogled na more koje je udaljeno samo 100 m.&nbsp;Zemlji&scaron;te ima povr&scaron;inu 345 m2.&nbsp;Koeficijent igradivosti iznosi 0,45, dok je koeficijent iskoristivosti 1,5.&nbsp;Na zemlji&scaron;tu je dozvoljena gradnja: suteren + prizemlje + kat + potkrovlje (Po/Pu + P + 1 + Pks).</p>', '<p>We have this building plot in a good location in the second/third row from the sea.&nbsp;The land is located 100m from the shore, on flat terrain, with a paved access road among trees and low density holiday villas. The land has a beautiful view of the sea, which is clear and safe at this point. The land has an area of 345 m2.The plans allow for the building of a building with 4 levels, - &nbsp;basement + ground floor+ 1st floor + top floor.&nbsp;</p>', '', '<p>Graðevinsko zemlji&scaron;te drugi red od mora na otoku Korèuli.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Zemlji&scaron;te se nalazi na ravnom terenu s asfaltiranom pristupnom cestom i dostupnom infrastrukturom.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sa zemlji&scaron;ta se pru¾a prekrasan pogled na more koje je udaljeno samo 100 m.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Zemlji&scaron;te ima povr&scaron;inu 345 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Koeficijent igradivosti iznosi 0,45, dok je koeficijent iskoristivosti 1,5.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na zemlji&scaron;tu je dozvoljena gradnja: suteren + prizemlje + kat + potkrovlje (Po/Pu + P + 1 + Pks).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Postoji moguænost kupnje i dodatnih 1500 m2 zemlji&scaron;ta. &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Vlasni&scaron;tvo èisto, prisutni svi dokumenti.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Mjesto u kojem je smje&scaron;teno zemlji&scaron;te nalazi se 1,5 km od Raèi&scaron;æa, te 10 km od grada Korèule.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Meðunarodni aerodrom u Dubrovniku je udaljen 150 km.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Raèi&scaron;æe je popularno i meðu nautièarima jer je zahvaljujuæi svom velikom lukobranu sigurna luka po svakom vremenu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U mjestu se nalazi i mala &scaron;ljunèana pla¾a, a zapadno od Raèi&scaron;æa su i dvije uvale Vaja i Samograd sa &scaron;ljunèanim pla¾ama.</p>', '<p>We have this building plot in a good location in the second/third row from the sea.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The land is located 100m from the shore, on flat terrain, with a paved access road among trees and low density holiday villas.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The land has a beautiful view of the sea, which is clear and safe at this point.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The land has an area of 345 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The plans allow for the building of a building with 4 levels, basement + ground floor + 1st floor + top floor.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There is also an option to purchase an additional 1500 m2 of adjacent land.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ownership clear, all documents are present, and all the service connections are nearby.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is situated 1.5 km from Racisce and 10 km from the town of Korcula.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The island is sparsely populated and a short cycle ride will get you to shops, bars and coffee shops and the other useful facilities in a town.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Racisce is popular among boaters because thanks to its large pier it has a safe harbour in all weathers.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>In the village there is a small pebble beach, and, west of Racisce are two bays Vaja and Samograd with pebble beaches.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The international airport in Dubrovnik is 150 km.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For further information please contact us.</p>', '', '1209_Land-plot_0.jpg', '1209_Land-plot_1.jpg', '1209_Land-plot_2.jpg', '1209_Land-plot_3.jpg', '1209_Land-plot_4.jpg', '1209_Land-plot_5.jpg', '1209_Land-plot_6.jpg', '1209_Land-plot_7.jpg', '1209_Land-plot_8.jpg'),
(1210, 'Bo¾o', 'Vuèak', '021/358-304', '', '', 'Split', 'Me¹troviæevo ¹etali¹te 31, Zemlj.8170, kuæa 3369', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '10', '2228', '420', 1, '2500000', '', 2, 2, 2, 1, 1, 2, 7, 3, 'June 2, 2015', '<p>Prekrasna kuæa u Splitu u prvom redu do mora, smje&scaron;tena na atraktivnoj lokaciji. Kuæa ima oèaravajuæ pogled na more, a od samog centra je udaljena samo 800 m. Smje&scaron;tena je na zemlji&scaron;tu povr&scaron;ine 2228 m2, s lijepo kultiviranim vrtom s kaminom te vlastitim pristupom pla¾i.&nbsp;Ukupna bruto povr&scaron;ina same kuæe iznosi 420 m2. Kuæa se sastoji od prizemlja (suterena), kata i potkrovlja, od kojeg svaki ima tlocrtnu povr&scaron;inu 140 m2.</p>', '<p>We are offering this very rare opportunity to buy one of only a handful of villas in the FIRST row to the sea in Split. The property is situated just 800m from the centre of the town but it has a private footpath down the garden to the sea or is 5 minutes walk to the superb beaches in Marjan park. It is situated on a huge land area of 2228 m2, with a beautifully landscaped and cultivated garden that includes a bbq fireplace and places to sit where you can enjoy watching the sea under the shade of some mature trees. The total gross area inside the house is 420 m2.</p>', '', '<p>Prekrasna kuæa u Splitu u prvom redu do mora, smje&scaron;tena na atraktivnoj lokaciji.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa ima oèaravajuæ pogled na more, a od samog centra je udaljena samo 800 m.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Smje&scaron;tena je na zemlji&scaron;tu povr&scaron;ine 2228 m2, s lijepo kultiviranim vrtom s kaminom te vlastitim pristupom pla¾i.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ukupna bruto povr&scaron;ina same kuæe iznosi 420 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa se sastoji od prizemlja (suterena), kata i potkrovlja, od kojeg svaki ima tlocrtnu povr&scaron;inu 140 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Prizemlje (suteren) se sastoji od dvije spavaæe sobe, kuhinje, dnevnog boravka, blagovaonice, kupaonice i ostave.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na prvom katu se nalaze takoðer dvije spavaæe sobe, dnevni boravak, blagovaonica, kuhinja i balkon s predivnim pogledom na more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Drugi kat (potkrovlje) se sastoji od tri spavaæe sobe, dnevnog boravka, kuhinje s blagovaonicom, kupaonice te terase s koje se pru¾a pogled na vrt i more. &nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U kuæi je prisutna sva inrastruktura, te ima prikljuèke za kamere.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Orijentacija J.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je izgraðena 1932. godine, te kompletno renovirana 1995.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U prostranom vrtu postoji moguænost izgradnje bazena.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Vlasnici posjeduju i podrum s terasom povr&scaron;ine cca 20 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Vlasni&scaron;tvo èisto, prisutna sva dokumentacija.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Park &scaron;uma Marjan gdje se nalazi rekreacijska zona i prekrasne pla¾e udaljena je 5 min. hodanja.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Meðunarodni aerodrom udaljen je 40 min. vo¾nje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za sve dodatne informacije slobodno nas kontaktirajte.</p>', '<p>We are offering this very rare opportunity to buy one of only a handful of villas in the FIRST row to the sea in Split.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property is situated just 800m from the centre of the town but it has a private footpath down the garden to the sea or is 5 minutes walk to the superb beaches in Marjan park.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is situated on a huge land area of 2228 m2, with a beautifully landscaped and cultivated garden that includes a bbq fireplace and places to sit where you can enjoy watching the sea under the shade of some mature trees.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The total gross area inside the house is 420 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house consists of a ground floor (basement) and two floors, each of which has a footprint of 140 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The ground floor (basement) has two bedrooms, kitchen, living room, dining room, bathroom and storage.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the first floor there are also two bedrooms, living room, dining room, kitchen and balcony with ocean view.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Second floor (top) consists of three bedrooms, living room, kitchen, dining room, bathroom and terrace with a view of the garden and the sea.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property is facing South.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house was originally built in 1932 and was completely renovated in 1995.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>In the spacious garden there is plenty of room to make improvements such as a boat store or the possibility of building a swimming pool and patio.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There is a basement with a terrace of 20 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There are shops, bars and restaurants, and the marina all within a short walk of the property.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>We would encourage an early viewing on the property as this is a rare chance to buy a property in such a stunning location.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The international airport is 40 minutes. driving.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact the Croatia Property Sales office to arrange to visit this property.</p>', '', '1210_House-Villa_0.jpg', '1210_House-Villa_1.jpg', '1210_House-Villa_2.jpg', '1210_House-Villa_3.jpg', '1210_House-Villa_4.jpg', '1210_House-Villa_5.jpg', '1210_House-Villa_6.jpg', '1210_House-Villa_7.jpg', '1210_House-Villa_8.jpg'),
(1211, '®eljko', 'Peran', '098 20 49 49', '', 'peran@peran.com.hr', 'Split', 'Kneza VI©ESLAVA 6  Split', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '300', '0', '81', 1, '194016', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 0, 1, 'June 2, 2015', '<p>Poslovni prostor u centar grada, na odliènoj lokaciji.&nbsp;Prostor je potpuno zavr&scaron;en i kompletno ureðen i namje&scaron;ten. Visina prostora iznosi 5m.&nbsp;Klima u svakoj prostoriji, telefonska centrala.&nbsp;Prostor se sastoji od prizemlja i galerije (koja nije po cijeloj povr&scaron;ini prizemlja) povezane stepeni&scaron;tem.&nbsp;Prizemlje ima povr&scaron;inu 65,84 m&sup2;, a galerija 15 m&sup2;.&nbsp;Cijena za 1 m&sup2; = 2.400,00 EUR.&nbsp;Ukupno obraèunski: 80,84 m&sup2; x 2.400,00 EUR = 194.016,00 EUR</p>', '<p>We have this rare opportunity to purchase an office in a prime location in the city centre of Split. The space consists of a ground floor and a gallery, connected by an internal staircase. The ground floor has an area of 65.84 m&sup2; plus 15 m&sup2; gallery. In total 80,84 m&sup2;. It is completely finished and fully furnished, with the furniture being included in the sale. Price for 1 m&sup2; = &euro; 2,400 euroTotal Valuation: 80.84 m&sup2; x &euro; 2,400.00 = &euro; 194,016.00.</p>', '', '<p>Poslovni prostor u centar grada, na odliènoj lokaciji.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Prostor je potpuno zavr&scaron;en i kompletno ureðen i namje&scaron;ten.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Visina prostora iznosi 5m.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Klima u svakoj prostoriji, telefonska centrala.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Prostor se sastoji od prizemlja i galerije (koja nije po cijeloj povr&scaron;ini prizemlja) povezane stepeni&scaron;tem.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Prizemlje ima povr&scaron;inu 65,84 m&sup2;, a galerija 15 m&sup2;.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Cijena za 1 m&sup2; = 2.400,00 EUR.<br /></strong></p>\r\n<p><strong><br /></strong></p>\r\n<p><strong>Ukupno obraèunski: 80,84 m&sup2; x 2.400,00 EUR = 194.016,00 EUR</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Prostor se mo¾e preurediti u 2 lijepa apartmana s posebnim ulazom za svaki.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U cijenu je ukljuèen kompletan namje&scaron;taj, wc i kuhinja.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Parking ispred zgrade.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nacrte &scaron;aljemo na zahtjev.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U blizini se nalaze mnogobrojni restorani, kafiæi, suvenirnice i ostali sadr¾aji.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Centar Splita je iz godine u godinu sve popularnije turistièko odredi&scaron;te, te je ovaj prostor idealan za iznajmljivanje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Meðunarodni aerodrom udaljen je 40 min. vo¾nje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za sve dodatne informacije molimo kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured u Splitu.</p>', '<p>We have this rare opportunity to purchase an office in a prime location in the city centre of Split.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The space consists of a ground floor and a gallery, connected by an internal staircase.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The ground floor has an area of 65.84 m&sup2; plus 15 m&sup2; gallery.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>In total 80,84 m&sup2;.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is completely finished and fully furnished, with the furniture being included in the sale.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There is also air conditioning in every room, and a telephone switchboard.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property is currently a show room, with an office and a connecting bathroom and kitchen area.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It has parking in front of the property.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Split is becoming more and more popular every year, with the tourism season extending to almost 12 months now.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is situated in a busy area with restaurants, bars and other services close by and is walking distance from the ferry terminal, the palace and most other historic and cultural attractions.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Price for 1 m&sup2; = &euro; 2,400 euro</strong></p>\r\n<p><strong><br /></strong></p>\r\n<p><strong>Total Valuation: 80.84 m&sup2; x &euro; 2,400.00 = &euro; 194,016.00</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>We can send plans of the property on request, and are happy to advise on other option for the property, even converting the space into two residential apartments.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The international airport is 40 minutes driving.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For further information please contact us, and to arrange to view this property.</p>', '', '1211_Apartment_0.jpg', '1211_Apartment_1.jpg', '1211_Apartment_2.jpg', '1211_Apartment_3.jpg', '1211_Apartment_4.jpg', '1211_Apartment_5.jpg', '1211_Apartment_6.jpg', '1211_Apartment_7.jpg', '1211_Apartment_8.jpg'),
(1212, 'Dane', 'Gudelj', '0994325818', '0958675004 spiro', '', 'Rogoznica', 'Zatoglav, Rogoznica, 5289/3 k.o. Sevid', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '15', '0', '43', 1, '100320', '', 2, 1, 2, 2, 1, 2, 0, 0, 'June 3, 2015', '<p>&Scaron;est apartmana u novoizgraðenoj zgradi, drugi red do mora, svega 15 m do lijepe ureðene pla¾e. Svi apartmani su zapadne orijentacije s prekrasnim pogledom na more i Rogoznicu. Zgrada se sastoji od tri kata.&nbsp;Prisutna sva potrebna infrastruktura. Svaki apartman ima osigurano parking mjesto. Udaljenost do centra Rogoznice svega par kilometara, a do aerodroma 25 km.&nbsp;Cijena apartmana od 100.320 do 151.000 Eura!</p>', '<p>We are pleased to offer these six newly constructed apartments in only the second row to the sea, just 15 m to the shore.&nbsp;They are situated facing west, towards the evening sunset, and with great views across the bay and sea, in the small and historic village of Rogoznica. Within a few minutes walk are a variety of useful shops, coffee bars and cafes near the old harbour. The building consists of three floors. Apartments from 100.320 to 151.000 Euros.</p>', '', '<p>&Scaron;est apartmana u novoizgraðenoj zgradi, drugi red do mora, svega 15 m do lijepe ureðene pla¾e.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Svi apartmani su zapadne orijentacije s prekrasnim pogledom na more i Rogoznicu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Zgrada se sastoji od tri kata.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Prizemlje (stan S1 i stan S2), prvi kat (stan S3 i S4), drugi kat (stan S5 i S6).</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong><span style="text-decoration: underline;">PRIZEMLJE</span></strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong><span style="text-decoration: underline;">S1 - jednosoban stan = 100.320 Eura</span></strong></p>\r\n<p><strong>&nbsp;</strong>spavaæa soba, dnevni boravak, kuhinja i kupaonica, povr&scaron;ine 43,73m2 + terasa, parking i plato stana. Sveukupno prodajni prostor je 52,80 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong><span style="text-decoration: underline;">S2 - jednosoban stan = 113.610 Eura PRODANO</span></strong></p>\r\n<p><strong>&nbsp;</strong>spavaæa soba, dnevni boravak, kuhinja i kupaonica, povr&scaron;ine 42,92m2 + plato stana, zeleni dio i parking. Sveukupno prodajni prostor je 54,10 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong><span style="text-decoration: underline;">1. KAT</span></strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong><span style="text-decoration: underline;">S3 - dvosobni stan = 132.880 Eura</span></strong></p>\r\n<p><strong>&nbsp;</strong>2 spavaæe sobe, dnevni boravak, kuhinja i kupaonica, povr&scaron;ine 54,43m2 + terasa i parking. Sveukupno prodajni prostor je 60,40 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong><span style="text-decoration: underline;">S4 - dvosobni stan = 125.810 Eura</span></strong></p>\r\n<p><strong>&nbsp;</strong>2 spavaæe sobe, dnevni boravak, kuhinja i kupaonica, povr&scaron;ine 48,06m2 + terasa i parking. Sveukupno prodajni prostor je 54,70 m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong><span style="text-decoration: underline;">2. KAT</span></strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong><span style="text-decoration: underline;">S5 - dvosobni stan = 151.000 Eura</span></strong></p>\r\n<p><strong>&nbsp;</strong>2 spavaæe sobe, dnevni boravak, kuhinja i kupaonica, povr&scaron;ine 54,22m2 + terasa i parking. Sveukupno prodajni prostor je 60,40 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong><span style="text-decoration: underline;">S6 - dvosobni stan = 140.250 Eura</span></strong></p>\r\n<p><strong>&nbsp;</strong>2 spavaæe sobe, dnevni boravak, kuhinja i kupaonica, povr&scaron;ine 48,45m2 + terasa i parking. Sveukupno prodajni prostor je 56,10 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Stanovi su izgraðeni vrlo kvalitetno, unutra&scaron;nja vrata pvc, ploèice, parket, drvena vrata, klima ureðaji, sva balkonska vrata i prozori s automatskim podizanjem i spu&scaron;tanjem roleta.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Prisutna sva potrebna infrastruktura.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Svaki apartman ima osigurano parking mjesto.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Udaljenost do centra Rogoznice svega par kilometara, a do aerodroma 25 km.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Cijena cijelog objekta &euro;723.870.</p>', '<p>We are pleased to offer these six newly constructed apartments in only the second row to the sea, just 15 m to the shore.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>They are situated facing west, towards the evening sunset, and with great views across the bay and sea, in the small and historic village of Rogoznica.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Within a few minutes walk are a variety of useful shops, coffee bars and cafes near the old harbour.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The building consists of three floors.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ground floor apartment S1 and S2 flat, 1st floor apartment S3 and S4 flat, 2nd floor apartment S5 and S6 flat.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong><span style="text-decoration: underline;">GROUND FLOOR</span></strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong><span style="text-decoration: underline;">S1 - 1 bedroom apartment = 100.320 Euros</span></strong></p>\r\n<p><strong>&nbsp;</strong>a bedroom, living room, kitchen and bathroom, living area of 43,73m2 + terrace, parking and a flat patio. Overall sales space is 52,80 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong><span style="text-decoration: underline;">S2 - 1 bedroom apartment = 113.610 Euros SOLD</span></strong></p>\r\n<p><strong>&nbsp;</strong>bedroom, living room, kitchen and bathroom, living area of 42,92m2 + patio plus garden part and parking. Overall sales space is 54,10 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong><span style="text-decoration: underline;">1ST FLOOR</span></strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong><span style="text-decoration: underline;">S3 - 2 bedroom apartment = 132.880 Euros</span></strong></p>\r\n<p><strong>&nbsp;</strong>2 bedrooms, living room, kitchen and bathroom, living area of 54,43m2 + terrace and parking. Overall sales space is 60,40 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong><span style="text-decoration: underline;">S4 - 2 bedroom apartment = 125.810 Euros</span></strong></p>\r\n<p><strong>&nbsp;</strong>2 bedrooms, living room, kitchen and bathroom, living area of 48,06m2 + terrace and parking. Overall sales space is 54,70 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong><span style="text-decoration: underline;">2ND FLOOR</span></strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong><span style="text-decoration: underline;">S5 - 2 bedroom apartment = 151.000 Euros</span></strong></p>\r\n<p>2 bedrooms, living room, kitchen and bathroom, living area of 54,22m2 + terrace and parking. Overall sales area is 60,40m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong><span style="text-decoration: underline;">S6 - 2 bedroom apartment = 140.250 Euros</span></strong></p>\r\n<p><strong>&nbsp;</strong>2 bedrooms, living room, kitchen and bathroom, living area of 48,45m2 + terrace and parking. Overall sales space is 56,10 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please for further information contact our agents in Split.</p>', '', '1212_Apartment_0.jpg', '1212_Apartment_1.jpg', '1212_Apartment_2.jpg', '1212_Apartment_3.jpg', '1212_Apartment_4.jpg', '1212_Apartment_5.jpg', '1212_Apartment_6.jpg', '1212_Apartment_7.jpg', ''),
(1213, 'Paul', 'Bowen', '+353867721444', '', 'pbslainte@gmail.com', 'Rogoznica', 'Rogoznica', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '400', '0', '61', 2, '110000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 2, 2, 'June 3, 2015', '<p>Prostrani dvosobni apartman ju¾ne orijentacije u mirnom dijelu Rogoznice s prekrasnim otvorenim pogledom na more i marinu.&nbsp;Zgrada je udaljena od mora 400 m.&nbsp;Izgraðena je 2003. godine.&nbsp;Apartman ima povr&scaron;inu 60,39 m2.&nbsp;Apartman ima svu potrebnu infrastrukturu.&nbsp;Udaljenost do pla¾e, centra mjesta, duæana, restorana i kafiæa je 400 m.</p>', '<p>We have this modestly priced and spacious two-bedroom apartment facing southin a quiet part of Rogoznica with beautiful views of the sea and marina.&nbsp;It is situated 400 m from the shore, and the historic harbour in thevillage with shops, bars, restaurants and other useful facilities.&nbsp;It is a modern style apartment, built in 2003, with an open plan familyliving area and access onto the wide South facing balcony with long sea views. The apartment has a surface of 60.39 m2.&nbsp;</p>', '', '<p>Prostrani dvosobni apartman ju¾ne orijentacije u mirnom dijelu Rogoznice s prekrasnim otvorenim pogledom na more i marinu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Zgrada je udaljena od mora 400 m.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Izgraðena je 2003. godine.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartman ima povr&scaron;inu 60,39 m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sastoji se od dvije spavaæe sobe, kupaonice, kuhinje i blagovaonice koja je povezana s dnevnim boravkom.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartman ima dva balkona koji su dovoljno prostrana za vanjski namje&scaron;taj (stol i stolice), a s balkona se pru¾a prekrasan pogled na more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U cijenu je ukljuèen namje&scaron;taj kao i dva parking mjesta uz zgradu (povr&scaron;ine 11,50 m2).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartman ima svu potrebnu infrastrukturu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Udaljenost do pla¾e, centra mjesta, duæana, restorana i kafiæa je 400 m.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Meðunarodni aerodrom je udaljen 25 km.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za sve dodatne informacije molimo kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured u Splitu.</p>', '<p>We have this modestly priced and spacious two-bedroom apartment facing southin a quiet part of Rogoznica with beautiful views of the sea and marina.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is situated 400 m from the shore, and the historic harbour in thevillage with shops, bars, restaurants and other useful facilities.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is a modern style apartment, built in 2003, with an open plan family living area and access onto the wide South facing balcony with long sea views.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There is a second balcony from one of the bedrooms, and this too hasenough space for furniture so that the views over the village and the seacan be enjoyed.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The apartment has a surface of 60.39 m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It consists of two bedrooms, bathroom, kitchen and dining room which isconnected with the living room.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The price includes furniture, as well as two parking spaces next to the building (surface 11.50 m2).&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The international airport is 25 km away.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For further information please contact our agents in our Split office.</p>', '', '1213_Apartment_0.jpg', '1213_Apartment_1.jpg', '1213_Apartment_2.jpg', '1213_Apartment_3.jpg', '1213_Apartment_4.jpg', '1213_Apartment_5.jpg', '1213_Apartment_6.jpg', '', ''),
(1214, 'Ante', 'Æapin', '098 1654098', 'brat Damir  098 266 523', 'megamin2007@gmail.com', 'Primosten', 'Bilo Primo¹ten', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '5', '470', '490', 2, '400000', '', 2, 1, 2, 1, 1, 2, 0, 0, 'June 3, 2015', '<p>Kuæa u izgradnji (rohbau) prvi red do mora, u mirnoj uvali nedaleko od jednog od najljep&scaron;ih dalmatinskih mjesta.&nbsp;Prekrasan pogled na more i direktan pristup pla¾i èine ovu nekretninu izuzetnom prilikom.&nbsp;Kuæa je u izgradnji (rohbau) i kao takva se prodaje.&nbsp;Povr&scaron;ina parcele iznosi 470 m2, a povr&scaron;ina kuæe je 490 m2.&nbsp;Kuæa je podijeljena na prizemlje i kat.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>We are offering this rare buying opportunity, at a reduced cost, this partly constructed house, in a quiet bay near Primosten, one of the most beautiful places in Dalmatia. The house will be sold in its current condition, not as a finished and habitable property, and the price has been reduced to reflect this, making it a rare opportunity to buy a property in such a great location so cheaply. Plot area is 470 m2, and the living area is 490 m2. The house is divided into two floors, facing west - giving a daily opportunity to enjoy the sunset.</p>', '', '<p>Kuæa u izgradnji (rohbau) prvi red do mora, u mirnoj uvali nedaleko od jednog od najljep&scaron;ih dalmatinskih mjesta.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Prekrasan pogled na more i direktan pristup pla¾i èine ovu nekretninu izuzetnom prilikom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je u izgradnji (rohbau) i kao takva se prodaje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Povr&scaron;ina parcele iznosi 470 m2, a povr&scaron;ina kuæe je 490 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je podijeljena na prizemlje i kat.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Zapadno je orijentirana.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Unutar kuæe moguæe je napraviti raspored po ¾elji (bilo obiteljsku kuæu bilo kuæu apartmanskog tipa).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U sklopu kuæe je predviðena i gara¾a.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Uz kuæu se nalazi parking.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ma parceli postoji moguænost izgradnje bazena.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa ima svu potrebnu infrastrukturu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je od lijepog dalmatinskog mjesta u kojem se nalazi svi potrebni turistièki sadr¾aji udaljena svega par kilometara.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Raznovrsne moguænosti za rekreaciju, &scaron;kola jedrenja i ronjenja, brojne restauracije i konobe, suvenirnice te bogato kulturno ljeto razlièitog sadr¾aja, Primo&scaron;ten svrstava u sam vrh turistièke ponude ovoga podneblja.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Meðunarodni aerodrom je udaljen sat vremena vo¾nje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za sve dodatne informacije molimo kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured u Splitu.</p>', '<p>We are offering this rare buying opportunity, at a reduced cost, this partly constructed house, in a quiet bay near Primosten, one of the most beautiful places in Dalmatia.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house will be sold in its current condition, not as a finished and habitable property, and the price has been reduced to reflect this, making it a rare opportunity to buy a property in such a great location so cheaply.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is situated just a few yards from the sea with access to the Adriatic shore through a gate at the bottom of the garden.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The sea here is clear and clean with many shell fish and fish making it great place for swimming and enjoying nature.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Plot area is 470 m2, and the living area is 490 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house is divided into two floors, facing west - giving a daily opportunity to enjoy the sunset.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The inside of the house has a choice of layouts.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It can either become a family villa, or an apartment house.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house has a garage built into the design, and in addition, beside the house is street parking.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The plot is large enough for a swimming pool, or boat store.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house has all the necessary infrastructure (electric, drains etc).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property is near a beautiful Dalmatian town that has all the necessary tourist facilities such as shops, cafes, bars etc. and 10 minutes cycling along the shore path should get you there.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is a great area for swimming, other water sports, boating and Primosten is a centre of cultural activities throughout the tourist season.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The International airport in Split is an hour away.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For further information please contact our agents from the office in Split.</p>', '', '1214_House-Villa_0.JPG', '1214_House-Villa_1.JPG', '1214_House-Villa_2.JPG', '1214_House-Villa_3.JPG', '1214_House-Villa_4.JPG', '1214_House-Villa_5.JPG', '1214_House-Villa_6.JPG', '1214_House-Villa_7.JPG', '1214_House-Villa_8.JPG'),
(1215, 'Tomislav', 'Mariæ', '098 213 813', '', 'tomislav.maric@posta.hr', 'Rogoznica', 'k.è 1201 Rogoznica, Zu 1812 ©ibenik', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '20', '290', '140', 1, '320000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 4, 2, 'June 3, 2015', '<p>U centru lijepog dalmatinskog mjesta na 20 m od mora i ureðene pla¾e, u drugom redu do mora nalazi se kuæa sjeverne orijentacije.&nbsp;Stambena povr&scaron;ina kuæe iznosi 140 m2, a nalazi se na parceli povr&scaron;ine 290 m2.&nbsp;Kuæa je podijeljena na prizemlje i kat.&nbsp;S velikih terasa na sjevernoj strani kuæe pru¾a se prekrasan pogled na more i mjesto.&nbsp;S kuæe se pru¾a pogled na more i uvalu.</p>', '<p>We are offering this attractive house, just yards from the sea shore, and in the centre of a beautiful Dalmatian village in the second row to the sea. The living area is 140 m2 and it is located on a plot of 290 m2. The house is divided into two floors, with independent entrances from external stairs. The large terrace on the north side of the house, facing the sea, offers a breathtaking view across the water and the resort.</p>', '', '<p>U centru lijepog dalmatinskog mjesta na 20 m od mora i ureðene pla¾e, u drugom redu do mora nalazi se kuæa sjeverne orijentacije.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Stambena povr&scaron;ina kuæe iznosi 140 m2, a nalazi se na parceli povr&scaron;ine 290 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je podijeljena na prizemlje i kat.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U prizemlju se nalazi dnevni boravak s kuhinjom, dvije spavaæe sobe i kupaonica.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na kat se ide vanjskim stepenicama, a tu se nalaze dnevni boravak, kuhinja, dvije spavaæe sobe i kupaonica.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>S velikih terasa na sjevernoj strani kuæe pru¾a se prekrasan pogled na more i mjesto.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>S kuæe se pru¾a pogled na more i uvalu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je u dobrom stanju, sa svom potrebnom infrastrukturom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Do kuæe vodi cesta tako da je osiguran pristup autom.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Trenutno nema parking mjesta, ali se mogu napraviti dva mjesta u sklopu parcele.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Udaljenost do centra mjesta kao i svih potrebnih sadr¾aja (restorana, duæana, kafiæa) je 10 min laganog hoda.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Udaljenost od meðunarodnog aerodroma je 28 km.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Molimo za dodatne informacije kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured u Splitu.</p>', '<p>We are offering this attractive house, just yards from the sea shore, and in the centre of a beautiful Dalmatian village in the second row to the sea.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The living area is 140 m2 and it is located on a plot of 290 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house is divided into two floors, with independent entrances from external stairs.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The ground floor has a living room with kitchen, two bedrooms and a bathroom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the first floor there is a living room, kitchen, two bedrooms and a bathroom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The large terrace on the north side of the house, facing the sea, offers a breathtaking view across the water and the resort.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house is in good condition, with modern fittings, is well decorated.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house has road so it can be accessed by car.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There are currently no parking spaces on the plot, but there is enough for two spaces.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There is parking on the road adjacent to the property.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Distance to the village centre and all necessary facilities (restaurants, shops, bars) is 10 min walk along the shore.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Distance from international airport is 28 km.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For further information please contact &nbsp;our agents in Split.</p>', '', '1215_House-Villa_0.jpg', '1215_House-Villa_1.jpg', '1215_House-Villa_2.jpg', '1215_House-Villa_3.jpg', '1215_House-Villa_4.jpg', '1215_House-Villa_5.jpg', '1215_House-Villa_6.jpg', '1215_House-Villa_7.jpg', '1215_House-Villa_8.jpg');
INSERT INTO `nekretnina` (`id`, `ime`, `prezime`, `telefon`, `mobitel`, `e_mail`, `lokacija_id`, `adresa`, `status_id`, `vrsta_id`, `udaljenost`, `povrsina`, `stambenapovrsina`, `display`, `cijena`, `cijenatocka`, `ponuda_tjedna`, `new_built`, `must_sell`, `prvi_red_do_mora`, `pogled_na_more`, `bazen`, `broj_soba`, `broj_kupatila`, `datum`, `title_hr`, `title_en`, `title_ge`, `opis_hr`, `opis_en`, `opis_ge`, `PropertyImageURL0`, `PropertyImageURL1`, `PropertyImageURL2`, `PropertyImageURL3`, `PropertyImageURL4`, `PropertyImageURL5`, `PropertyImageURL6`, `PropertyImageURL7`, `PropertyImageURL8`) VALUES
(1216, '®eljko', 'Galekoviæ', '0919361616', '', 'zeljkogalekovic00@gmail.com', 'Rogoznica', 'Rogoznica, K.è. 968 K.o Rogoznica', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '10', '159', '200', 1, '260000', '', 2, 2, 2, 1, 1, 2, 4, 3, 'June 3, 2015', '<p>Na svega par metara od mora i pla¾e nalazi se nedovr&scaron;ena kuæa zapadne orijentacije u jednom od najljep&scaron;ih djelova Rogoznice.&nbsp;Kuæa je povr&scaron;ine 200 m2 (tlocrtna povr&scaron;ina 100 m2), nalazi se na parceli povr&scaron;ine 159 m2.&nbsp;Kuæa se sastoji od prizemlja i kata.&nbsp;U prizemlju se nalazi &nbsp;jednosoban apartman i studio apartman.&nbsp;U sklopu prizemlja je i velika poploèana terasa.</p>', '<p>We are offering this great opportunity to buy an unfinished house, at a reduced cost, facing west in a great location on the sea shore in one of the most beautiful parts of Rogoznica. The house is 200 m2 (floor area 100 m2), located on a plot of 159 m2. The house consists of two floors. The ground floor consists of a one bedroom apartment and a studio apartment. Outside the ground floor is a large paved terrace, with the sea just in front.&nbsp;</p>', '', '<p>Na svega par metara od mora i pla¾e nalazi se nedovr&scaron;ena kuæa zapadne orijentacije u jednom od najljep&scaron;ih djelova Rogoznice.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je povr&scaron;ine 200 m2 (tlocrtna povr&scaron;ina 100 m2), nalazi se na parceli povr&scaron;ine 159 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa se sastoji od prizemlja i kata.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U prizemlju se nalazi jednosoban apartman i studio apartman.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U sklopu prizemlja je i velika poploèana terasa.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na kat se ide vanjskim stepenicama.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kat &nbsp;je u rohbau tako da je trenutno podijeljen na dva dvosobna apartmana.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Du¾inom cijelog kata prote¾e se terasa.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kako se kuæa nalazi u prvom redu do mora iz bilo kojeg dijela kuæe pru¾e se otvoren pogled na more i uvalu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Do kuæe je osiguran pristup autom s obzirom da do kuæe ide cesta.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U sklopu parcele je ostavljeno jedno parking mjesto.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa ima svu potrebnu infrastrukturu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Do centra mjesta, koje je udaljeno svega par stotina metara mo¾e se doæi 10 minutnim &nbsp;hodom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Udaljenost do aerodroma je 28 km.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Molimo za dodatne informacije kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured u Splitu.</p>', '<p>We are offering this great opportunity to buy an unfinished house, at a reduced cost, facing west in a great location on the sea shore in one of the most beautiful parts of Rogoznica.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house is 200 m2 (floor area 100 m2), located on a plot of 159 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house consists of two floors.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The ground floor consists of a one bedroom apartment and a studio apartment.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Outside the ground floor is a large paved terrace, with the sea just in front.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The first floor is reached by outside stairs.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>That lead to two unfinished apartments.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Whole length of the floor there is a terrace.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>As the house is located in next to the sea from any part of the house has a view of the sea and the bay.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house can be accessed by car as the road goes to the house.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>As part of the plot is left to one parking space.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house has all the necessary infrastructure.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Town centre, which is only a few hundred meters can be reached 10-minute walk.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Proximity to the airport is 28 km.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please for further information contact our office in Split.</p>', '', '1216_House-Villa_0.jpg', '1216_House-Villa_1.jpg', '1216_House-Villa_2.jpg', '1216_House-Villa_3.jpg', '1216_House-Villa_4.jpg', '1216_House-Villa_5.jpg', '1216_House-Villa_6.jpg', '1216_House-Villa_7.JPG', '1216_House-Villa_8.JPG'),
(1217, 'Ivo', 'Aniæ', '091 1234102', '', 'ivo.odvodnja@gmail.com', 'Rogoznica', 'Stiva¹nica Ra¾anj', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '5', '300', '380', 1, '900000', '', 2, 1, 2, 1, 1, 2, 12, 7, 'June 3, 2015', '<p>Na samoj obali, u sjeni borova, na svega par metara od mora nalazi se velika kuæa apartmanskog tipa, sjeverne orijentacije. Ono &scaron;to ovu kuæu èini rijetkom je direktan pristup moru. Iz vrta &nbsp;se izlazi na kamenom poploèanu, lijepo ureðenu pla¾u. Parcela je povr&scaron;ine 300 m2, kultivirana je mediteranskim biljem. Povr&scaron;ina kuæe je 380 m2. Kuæa se sastoji od tri kata, svaki kat je tlocrtno cca 120 m2. Na svakom katu smje&scaron;tena su po dva apartmana, ukupno &scaron;est apartmana.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>We are offering this great opportunity to buy an apartment house in a first class location. It is situated in the first line of buildings from the sea, just a few minutes'' walk from the centre of the old village near Rogoznica with coffee shops and bars, but with the clear sea at the bottom of the stairs, in front of the house.&nbsp;The plot is 300 m2, and is cultivated with Mediterranean plants. The house floor area size is 380 m2. The house consists of three floors, each floor is approximately 120 m2 footprint. On each floor there are two apartments, making six apartments in total.</p>', '', '<p>Na samoj obali, u sjeni borova, na svega par metara od mora nalazi se velika kuæa apartmanskog tipa, sjeverne orijentacije.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ono &scaron;to ovu kuæu èini rijetkom je direktan pristup moru.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Iz vrta se izlazi na kamenom poploèanu, lijepo ureðenu pla¾u.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Parcela je povr&scaron;ine 300 m2, kultivirana je mediteranskim biljem.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Povr&scaron;ina kuæe je 380 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa se sastoji od tri kata, svaki kat je tlocrtno cca 120 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na svakom katu smje&scaron;tena su po dva apartmana, ukupno &scaron;est apartmana.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Svih &scaron;est apartmana se sastoje od dvije spavaæe sobe, kupaonice, kuhinje, blagovaonice i dnevnog boravka s izlazom na prostranu terasu s koje se pru¾a prekrasan pogled na otvoreno more i uvalu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na ravnom krovu kuæe je parking sa sjenicom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa ima svu potrebnu infrastrukturu (struju, gradsku vodu i septièku jamu).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartmani su &nbsp;ureðeni i opremljeni sa svim potrebnim aparatima te su spremni za iznajmljivanje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Udaljenost do centra mjesta, restorana i duæana je svega 2 km.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Meðunarodni aerodrom udaljen je 28 km.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Molimo za dodatne informacije kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured u Splitu.</p>', '<p>We are offering this great opportunity to buy an apartment house in a first class location.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is situated in the first line of buildings from the sea, just a few minutes'' walk from the centre of the old village near Rogoznica with coffee shops and bars, but with the clear sea at the bottom of the stairs, in front of the house.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The plot is 300 m2, and is cultivated with Mediterranean plants.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house floor area size is 380 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house consists of three floors, each floor is approximately 120 m2 footprint.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On each floor there are two apartments, making six apartments in total.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>All six apartments have two bedrooms, bathroom, with a modern open plan kitchen, dining room and living room opening onto a spacious terrace with a beautiful views of the open sea and the bay.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the flat area is a private reserved parking lot with a gazebo.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house has all the necessary infrastructure (electricity, city water and septic tank).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The apartments are furnished and equipped with stylish modern appliances and ready to rent.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Distance to the larger village centre with many restaurants and shops is only 2 km.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The international airport is 28 km.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please for further information contact our agents in Split who can help further.</p>', '', '1217_House-Villa_0.jpg', '1217_House-Villa_1.jpg', '1217_House-Villa_2.jpg', '1217_House-Villa_3.jpg', '1217_House-Villa_4.jpg', '1217_House-Villa_5.jpg', '1217_House-Villa_6.jpg', '1217_House-Villa_7.jpg', '1217_House-Villa_8.jpg'),
(1218, 'Peri¹a', 'Modriniæ', '091/551-6592', '', 'perisa.modrinic@du.t-com.hr', 'Korcula', 'Korèula stari grad', 'For sale', 'Old stone house', '50', '0', '150', 1, '435000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 5, 5, 'June 3, 2015', '<p>Apartmanska kuæa s prekrasnim pogledom na more, smje&scaron;tena u samom centru grada, koji je pod za&scaron;titom kulturne ba&scaron;tine. Kuæa je udaljena od mora samo 50 metara.&nbsp;Kuæa se sastoji od prizemlja koje je moguæe preurediti u poslovni prostor, dva kata i visokog potkrovlja. Sveukupno se u kuæi nalaze 4 studio apartmana, jedna dvokrevetna soba i pet kupaonica ukupne stambene povr&scaron;ine 150 m2. Apartmani su moderno ureðeni i potpuno opremljeni.&nbsp;U prizemlju se nalazi kameni &scaron;ank, a u potkrovlju kamin.</p>\r\n<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;">CIJENA SNI®ENA SA 490.000 EURA!</span></p>', '<p>We are offering this apartment house with a beautiful views of the sea, located in Korcula town centre, the area under the protection of UNESCO cultural heritage. The house is 50 metres from the sea. The house inside consists of a ground floor that has the option of being converted into office space, two floors and the top floor. Overall, in the house are 4 studio apartments, and a one bedroom apartment. There are five bathrooms with a total floor area of 150 m2. The apartments are modern, well decorated, and fully equipped.</p>\r\n<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;">PRICE REDUCED FROM 490.000 EURO!</span></p>', '', '<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;"><strong>CIJENA SNI®ENA SA 490.000 EURA!</strong></span></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartmanska kuæa s prekrasnim pogledom na more, smje&scaron;tena u samom centru grada, koji je pod za&scaron;titom kulturne ba&scaron;tine.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je udaljena od mora samo 50 metara.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa se sastoji od prizemlja koje je moguæe preurediti u poslovni prostor, dva kata i visokog potkrovlja.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sveukupno se u kuæi nalaze 4 studio apartmana, jedna dvokrevetna soba i pet kupaonica ukupne stambene povr&scaron;ine 150 m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartmani su moderno ureðeni i potpuno opremljeni.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U prizemlju se nalazi kameni &scaron;ank, a u potkrovlju kamin.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Krov je betonski, a na njemu su polo¾eni prozori s kojih se pru¾a pogled na more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa ima pristup vozilom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sva infrastruktura prisutna (struja plus solarno grijanje).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Vlasni&scaron;tvo uredno.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je kompletno renovirana u studio apartmane modernog interijera.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Vlasnici se bave biznom iznajmljivanja, kojeg je moguæe nastaviti buduæi da je kuæa kategorizirana s 3 zvjezdice.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;"><strong>Moguænost kupnje apartmana odvojeno:</strong></span></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;"><strong>- prizemlje s odvojenim ulazom, ispred pogled na more, 30 m2, &euro;115.000</strong></span></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;"><strong>- apartmani na 1., 2. i 3. katu (potkrovlje) ukupne stambene povr&scaron;ine 120 m2, &euro;320.000.</strong></span></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Meðunarodni aerodrom u Dubrovniku je udaljen 150 km.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Grad Korèula smje&scaron;ten je na istoènom dijelu otoka Korèule.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Obiluje prekrasnim pla¾ama te znamenitostima.</p>', '<p><strong><span style="text-decoration: underline;">PRICE REDUCED FROM 490.000 EURO!</span><br /></strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>We are offering this apartment house with a beautiful views of the sea, located in Korcula town centre, the area under the protection of UNESCO cultural heritage.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house is 50 metres from the sea.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house inside consists of a ground floor that has the option of being converted into office space, two floors and the top floor.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Overall, in the house are 4 studio apartments, and a one bedroom apartment.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There are five bathrooms with a total floor area of 150 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The apartments are modern, well decorated, and fully equipped.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The roof has windows built into and from here are it are great views of the sea.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house has access for a vehicle.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>All the infrastructure is present (electricity plus solar heating, drains etc).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house was completely renovated into studio apartments with modern interiors.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The current owners are engaged in rentals, which may be continued and the house has been categorized with 3 stars.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong><span style="text-decoration: underline;">Possibility of buying apartments separately:</span></strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong><span style="text-decoration: underline;">- studio apartment &nbsp;with a sea view, ground floor, 30 sqm, &euro;115.000</span></strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong><span style="text-decoration: underline;">- apartments on 1st, 2nd and 3rd floors (attic) total living area of 120 sqm, &euro;320.000.</span></strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The international airport in Dubrovnik is 150 km.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The town of Korcula is situated on the eastern part of the island.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It abounds in beautiful beaches and sights, and is the cultural centre of the area, with restaurants, bars, and many shops.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact one of our agents to arrange to visit this property.</p>', '', '1218_Old-stone-house_0.JPG', '1218_Old-stone-house_1.JPG', '1218_Old-stone-house_2.JPG', '1218_Old-stone-house_3.JPG', '1218_Old-stone-house_4.JPG', '1218_Old-stone-house_5.JPG', '1218_Old-stone-house_6. i skale 037.JPG', '1218_Old-stone-house_7. i skale 039.JPG', '1218_Old-stone-house_8.JPG'),
(1219, 'Lenka', 'Modriniæ', '091/883-7516', '', 'lenni.modrinic@hi.t-com.hr', 'Korcula', '®rnovo Korèula', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '1000', '4170', '53', 1, '197000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 2, 1, 'June 3, 2015', '<p>Prekrasna kuæa za odmor na imanju udaljenom od grada Korèule 4 km.&nbsp;Nalazi se na usamljenom mjestu, ograðena kamenim ogradama u masliniku.&nbsp;Imanje je udaljeno 1 km od mora.&nbsp;Sa zemlji&scaron;ta se pru¾a oèaravajuæ pogled na pelje&scaron;ki kanal i otok Hvar.&nbsp;Kuæa je monta¾na, te ima stambenu povr&scaron;inu 53 m2, dok zemlji&scaron;e ima 10 996 m2.&nbsp;Vlasnicima pripadaju i kamene kuæice za obnovu, povr&scaron;ina 21 m2 i 17 m2 (uraèunate u cijenu).</p>\r\n<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;">CIJENA SNI®ENA SA 215.000 EURA!</span></p>', '<p>We have this amazing retreat for sale! A small, prefabricated house of only 53m sq, on a land plot of 11,000 m2, on the island of Korcula, 4km from the main town, and 1km from the sea. Also, on the land are several old stone houses for renovation, surface of 21 m2 and 17 m2 (included in the price).&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;">PRICE REDUCED FROM 215.000 EURO!</span></p>', '', '<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;"><strong>CIJENA SNI®ENA SA 215.000 EURA!</strong></span></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Prekrasna kuæa za odmor na imanju udaljenom od grada Korèule 4 km.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nalazi se na usamljenom mjestu, ograðena kamenim ogradama u masliniku.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Imanje je udaljeno 1 km od mora.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sa zemlji&scaron;ta se pru¾a oèaravajuæ pogled na pelje&scaron;ki kanal i otok Hvar.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je monta¾na, te ima stambenu povr&scaron;inu 53 m2, dok zemlji&scaron;e ima 10 996 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je prizemnica te ima kuhinju s dnevnim boravkom, dvije spavaæe sobe, kupaonicu i balkon.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Vlasnicima pripadaju i kamene kuæice za obnovu, povr&scaron;ina 21 m2 i 17 m2 (uraèunate u cijenu).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je potpuno namje&scaron;tena te ima prikljuèene vodu i struju, solarne panele, pristup vozilom i parking.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U prostranom vrtu su stabla naranèe, limuna, smokve i dunje.&nbsp;Vlasnici posjeduju obradivo zemlji&scaron;te i &scaron;umu. &nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je udaljena 300 m od centra mjesta gdje su svi sadr¾aji.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong><span style="text-decoration: underline;">Moguænost kupnje dodatnog zemlji&scaron;ta (obradive povr&scaron;ine sa &scaron;umom + kuæe) sveukupno 10.996 m2 po cijeni &euro;237.000.</span></strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Grad Korèula je udaljen nekoliko minuta vo¾nje.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Meðunarodni aerodrom u Dubrovniku je udaljen 150 km.</p>', '<p><strong><span style="text-decoration: underline;">PRICE REDUCED FROM 215.000 EURO!</span><br /></strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>We have this amazing retreat for sale!</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>A small, prefabricated house of only 53m sq, on a land plot of 11,000 m2, on the island of Korcula, 4km from the main town, and 1km from the sea.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house is on one level and has a living room, kitchen, two bedrooms, bathroom and a terrace.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property has only ground floor and has a kitchen, living room, two bedrooms, bathroom and balcony.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It has water and electricity, easy access and parking, and solar panels, and comes fully furnished.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is surprisingly comfortable inside, with modern fittings and is well decorated.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It has great views of the sea and the island of Hvar.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The large garden has many orange trees, lemons, figs, quince, and groves of olives.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The owners also have arable land and forest.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Also, on the land are several old stone houses for renovation, surface of 21 m2 and 17 m2 (included in the price).&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;"><strong>There is a possibility of buying 10.996m sq (including all objects) at price &euro;237.000.</strong></span></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house is 300 m away from the nearest village, where there are facilities, mostly for the few local residents who live hereabouts, such as coffee bars, cafes and bars.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The town of Korcula is a short drive away.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The international airport in Dubrovnik is 150 km.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact our office in Split to speak to one of our agents about this property.</p>', '', '1219_House-Villa_0.JPG', '1219_House-Villa_1.JPG', '1219_House-Villa_2.JPG', '1219_House-Villa_3.JPG', '1219_House-Villa_4.JPG', '1219_House-Villa_5.JPG', '1219_House-Villa_6.JPG', '1219_House-Villa_7.JPG', '1219_House-Villa_8.JPG'),
(1220, 'Axel ', 'Endresen', 'Darko Bumbar  00385 91 5081 244', '', 'axelendresen@hotmail.com, katharina.hern', 'Rogoznica', 'Rogoznica', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '400', '0', '90', 1, '135000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 2, 2, 'June 3, 2015', '<p>Prekrasan prostrani apartman u potpunosti ureðen kvalitetnim i modernim &nbsp;namje&scaron;tajem nalazi se u mirnom dijelu Rogoznice.&nbsp;Prekrasan pogled na more, marinu i cijelo mjesto pru¾a se sa svih strana stana.&nbsp;Apartman je povr&scaron;ine 90 m2.&nbsp;Zgrada ima svu potrebnu infrastrukturu.&nbsp;Svaki apartman u zgradi ima osigurano parking mjesto.</p>', '<p>We are offering this modern, well designed and spacious apartment, fully furnished with good quality furniture and fittings, in a quiet part of Rogoznica. It is situated overlooking the sea, marina and the town from all angles from the apartment. The sea, the harbour and shops and the centre of the village is about 400m from the property. The living area in the apartment is 90 m2, and faces South. Each apartment in the building has its own private parking place.</p>', '', '<p>Prekrasan prostrani apartman u potpunosti ureðen kvalitetnim i modernim &nbsp;namje&scaron;tajem nalazi se u mirnom dijelu Rogoznice.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Prekrasan pogled na more, marinu i cijelo mjesto pru¾a se sa svih strana stana.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartman je povr&scaron;ine 90 m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sastoji se od dvije spavaæe sobe, kupaonice, prostranog dnevnog boravka koji je povezan s kuhinjom i blagovaonicom.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartman ima tri balkona, na svakom se mo¾e postaviti vanjski namje&scaron;taj i u¾ivati u prekrasnom pogledu na more i marinu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ju¾ne je orijentacije.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Zgrada ima svu potrebnu infrastrukturu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Svaki apartman u zgradi ima osigurano parking mjesto.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Udaljenost do centra mjesta, restorana i duæana kao i do pla¾e je 400 m.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Aerodrom je udaljen 25 km. &nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za sve dodatne informacije molimo kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured u Splitu.</p>', '<p>We are offering this modern, well designed and spacious apartment, fully furnished with good quality furniture and fittings, in a quiet part of Rogoznica.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is situated overlooking the sea, marina and the town from all angles from the apartment.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The sea, the harbour and shops and the centre of the village is about 400m from the property.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The living area in the apartment is 90 m2, and faces South.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It consists of two bedrooms, bathroom, living room connected with kitchen and dining room.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The apartment has three wide balconies, each can be set up with outdoor furniture to enjoy the beautiful views of the sea and Marina.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Each apartment in the building has its own private parking place.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The airport is 25 km away.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For further information please contact our agents in our office in Split.</p>', '', '1220_Apartment_0.JPG', '1220_Apartment_1.JPG', '1220_Apartment_2.jpg', '1220_Apartment_3.jpg', '1220_Apartment_4.JPG', '1220_Apartment_5.JPG', '1220_Apartment_6.JPG', '1220_Apartment_7.JPG', '1220_Apartment_8.JPG'),
(1221, 'Phoebe ', 'Moxsonm ', '+44 7950 920003', '', 'pmoxsomturnbull@gmail.com lmoxsom@gmail.', 'Trogir', 'Kralja Tomislava 47C, Trogir  Ro¾ac/ Saldun, 6021/8 katastar  317/1, 2547 zgr 2. etaza', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '200', '0', '106', 2, '120000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 2, 2, 'June 8, 2015', '<p>Prekrasni apartman u prizemlju na izuzetnoj lokaciji u blizini pla¾e, grada Trogira i mnogih drugih sadr¾aja.&nbsp;Smje&scaron;ten je na otoku Èiovu, dok je stari dio Trogira udaljen svega nekoliko minuta vo¾nje. Iz apartmana se pru¾a djelomièan pogled na more koje je udaljeno cca. 200 m.&nbsp;Povr&scaron;ina apartmana iznosi 60 m2 + 46 m2 vrta.</p>', '<p>We are offering this beautiful ground floor apartment in an excellentlocation near the beach, the town of Trogir and many other facilities. It is situated on the island Ciovo, connected to the mainland by a historicbridge, while the old UNESCO site of Trogir is only a few minutes'' drive. The beach is only two minutes'' walk from the property, and there are partialsea views from the terrace. The nearest shops and bars are also just a fewminutes walking.&nbsp;The apartment size is 60 m2 + 46 m2 garden.&nbsp;</p>', '', '<p>Prekrasni apartman u prizemlju na izuzetnoj lokaciji u blizini pla¾e, grada Trogira i mnogih drugih sadr¾aja.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Smje&scaron;ten je na otoku Èiovu, dok je stari dio Trogira udaljen svega nekoliko minuta vo¾nje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Iz apartmana se pru¾a djelomièan pogled na more koje je udaljeno cca. 200 m.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>***Povr&scaron;ina apartmana iznosi 60 m2 + 46 m2 vrta.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Vrt je iznimno prostran &scaron;to je velika prednost ovog apartmana.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sastoji se od hodnika, predsoblja, 2 spavaæe sobe, kuhinje, dnevnog boravka + blagovaonice, kupaonice i wc &ndash;a.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Cijeli apartman je zapadno orjentiran kao i vrt.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartman je potpuno namje&scaron;ten i trenutno se koristi u svrhu turistièkog iznajmljivanja.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U cijenu je takoðer ukljuèeno i 1 parking mjesto.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Okolina je izuzetno mirna stoga je ovaj apartman idealan i za odmor.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Do meðunarodnog aerodroma je potrebno 10 minuta vo¾nje &scaron;to je jo&scaron; jedna prednost.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ukoliko imate dodatnih pitanja molimo da nas kotaktirate.</p>', '<p>We are offering this beautiful ground floor apartment in an excellent location near the beach, the town of Trogir and many other facilities.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is situated on the island Ciovo, connected to the mainland by a historic bridge, while the old UNESCO site of Trogir is only a few minutes'' drive.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The beach is only two minutes'' walk from the property, and there are partial sea views from the terrace.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The nearest shops and bars are also just a few minutes walking.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The apartment size is 60 m2 + 46 m2 garden.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The garden is very spacious and this is a big advantage of this apartment.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It consists, inside, of a hallway, 2 bedrooms, kitchen, living room +dining room, bathroom and toilet.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The whole apartment is west orientated as well as garden.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The apartment is fully furnished and is currently used for tourist rental.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property is well maintained, well decorated and in overall good condition.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The price also includes 1 private parking space.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The surrounding environment is very quiet, even though it is close to many of the local attractions, so this apartment is ideal for holidays.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The international airport is 10 minutes drive which is another advantage.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact one of our agents for more information and to arrange to visit this property.</p>', '', '1221_Apartment_0.1.jpg', '1221_Apartment_1.1.jpg', '1221_Apartment_2.1.jpg', '1221_Apartment_3.1.jpg', '1221_Apartment_4.1.jpg', '1221_Apartment_5.1.jpg', '1221_Apartment_6.JPG', '1221_Apartment_7.JPG', '1221_Apartment_8.1.jpg'),
(1222, 'Pero', 'Bureèiæ', '0959065781', '', '', 'Trogir', 'Bufaliæi 5 Okrug Gornji, 585/14', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '350', '0', '95', 2, '150000', '', 2, 1, 2, 2, 1, 1, 2, 1, 'June 8, 2015', '<p>Apartman u novogradnji smje&scaron;ten u prizemlju sa prostranom terasom gdje se nalazi bazen.&nbsp;Nalazi se na ju¾noj strani otoka Èiova, ali na mirnijem dijelu gdje nema puno kuæa i prometa.&nbsp;Najbli¾a pla¾a je udaljena cca. 350 m, a na podruèju cijelog otoka se nalaze mnogobrojne pla¾e i uvale.&nbsp;Ukupna povr&scaron;ina iznosi 95 m2 (apartman 79 m2 + terasa 16 m2). Apartmanu takoðer pripada i podrum od 12 m2 gdje se nalaze sprema i pogon za bazen.</p>', '<p>We have this new apartment with private swimming pool in a small building, located on the ground floor with a spacious terrace.&nbsp;It is situated on the south side of Ciovo Island, but in the quieter part where there are few houses and little traffic. The nearest beach is approx. 350 m, and the shore here is clear and safe for bathing and swimming. The total area is 95 m2 (apartment of 79 m2 + terrace 16 m2). The apartment also has a basement of 12 m2.&nbsp;</p>', '', '<p>Apartman u novogradnji smje&scaron;ten u prizemlju sa prostranom terasom gdje se nalazi bazen.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nalazi se na ju¾noj strani otoka Èiova, ali na mirnijem dijelu gdje nema puno kuæa i prometa.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Najbli¾a pla¾a je udaljena cca. 350 m, a na podruèju cijelog otoka se nalaze mnogobrojne pla¾e i uvale.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Iz apartmana se pru¾a djelomièan pogled na more, ali to ne umanjuje njegovu kvalitetu s obzirom na polo¾aj.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Orijentacija apartmana je jugozapadna, dok je na sjevernoj strani parking mjesto.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ukupna povr&scaron;ina iznosi 95 m2 (apartman 79 m2 + terasa 16 m2).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartmanu takoðer pripada i podrum od 12 m2 gdje se nalaze sprema i pogon za bazen.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartman se sastoji od hodnika, dnevnog dijela sa kuhinom i blagovaonicom, 2 spavaæe sobe i 1 kupaonice.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ispred se nalazi terasa sa bazenom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartman je potpuno namje&scaron;ten i klimatiziran.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>***Na prodaju je i dvoeta¾ni apartman u istoj kuæi.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Povijesni grad Trogir je udaljen 15 min. vo¾nje, dok je do meðunarodnog aerodroma &nbsp;potrebno 20 min. vo¾nje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za dodatne slike i tlocrte slobodno nas kontaktirajte.</p>', '<p>We have this new apartment with private swimming pool in a small building, located on the ground floor with a spacious terrace.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is situated on the south side of Ciovo Island, but in the quieter part where there are few houses and little traffic.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The nearest beach is approx. 350 m, and the shore here is clear and safe for bathing and swimming.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Around the island there are many beaches and coves, mostly with round pebbles on the sea bed.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The apartment offers partial sea views.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The orientation of the apartment is south-west, while on the north side is a parking lot.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The total area is 95 m2 (apartment of 79 m2 + terrace 16 m2).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The apartment also has a basement of 12 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The apartment consists of a hallway, modern style open plan living area/kitchen/dining room, 2 bedrooms and 1 bathroom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>In front of the property, with access through the glazed doors, is the terrace and private swimming pool.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The apartment is fully air-conditioned, decorated and furnished.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The historic city of Trogir is 15 minutes driving while to the international airport takes 20 minutes driving.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The nearest village with shops, bars and cafes is just a few minutes&rsquo; walk and is a lovely place to &nbsp;mix and meet and relax with the local residents.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For additional photos and floor plans, please contact one our agents in the office.</p>', '', '1222_Apartment_0.JPG', '1222_Apartment_1.JPG', '1222_Apartment_2.JPG', '1222_Apartment_3.JPG', '1222_Apartment_4.JPG', '1222_Apartment_5.JPG', '1222_Apartment_6.JPG', '1222_Apartment_7.JPG', '1222_Apartment_8.JPG'),
(1223, 'Pero', 'Bureèiæ', '', '0959065781', '', 'Trogir', 'Bufaliæi 5 Okrug Gornji, 585/14', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '350', '0', '107', 1, '160000', '', 2, 1, 2, 2, 1, 2, 3, 3, 'June 8, 2015', '<p>Dvoeta¾ni apartman u novogradnji na izuzetnoj mirnom dijelu bez prometa i gradske gu¾ve.&nbsp;Najbli¾a pla¾a je udaljena cca. 350 m od kuæe, a uz du¾ cijele obale se pru¾a prekrasna prirodno kamenita pla¾a.&nbsp;Nalazi se u manjoj kuæi na ju¾noj strani otoka Èiova, dok je orijentacija jugozapadna.&nbsp;Smje&scaron;ten je na 1. katu i potkrovlju ukupne povr&scaron;ine 107 m2.</p>', '<p>We are offering this new and spacious apartment, built on two floors in a quiet part of the island, away from the traffic and crowds. The nearest beach is approx. 350 m from the house, which is a mixture of fine pebbles and natural limestone rock between the bay''s. The property is located in a small building on the south side of Ciovo, and the apartment has a south-west orientation. The apartment is on two floors, 1st floor and the attic, total area of 107 m2.</p>', '', '<p>Dvoeta¾ni apartman u novogradnji na izuzetno mirnom dijelu bez prometa i gradske gu¾ve.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Najbli¾a pla¾a je udaljena cca. 350 m od kuæe, a uz du¾ cijele obale se pru¾a prekrasna prirodno kamenita pla¾a.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nalazi se u manjoj kuæi na ju¾noj strani otoka Èiova, dok je orijentacija jugozapadna.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Smje&scaron;ten je na 1. katu i potkrovlju ukupne povr&scaron;ine 107 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na 1.katu se nalazi hodnik, wc, spavaæa soba, prostrani dnevni dio sa blagovaonicom i kuhinjom iz koje se izlazi na loggiu koja ima djelomièan pogled na more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U potkrovlju se nalazi hodnik, 2 manje spavaæe sobe, wc i loggia sa pogledom na more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartman je potpuno namje&scaron;ten i klimatiziran, te nisu potrebna nikakva dodatna ulaganja.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ispred se nalazi 1 parking mjesto koje je ukljuèeno u cijenu</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Do meðunarodnog aerodroma je potrebno 20 min. vo¾nje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za dodatne slike i tlocrte slobodno nas kontaktirajte.</p>', '<p>We are offering this new and spacious apartment, built on two floors in a quiet part of the island, away from the traffic and crowds.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The nearest beach is approx. 350 m from the house, which is a mixture of fine pebbles and natural limestone rock between the bay''s.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property is located in a small building on the south side of Ciovo, and the apartment has a south-west orientation.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The apartment is on two floors, 1st floor and the attic, total area of 107 m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the 1st floor is a hallway, spacious living room, open plan dining room/kitchen with exit to the balcony which has a partial sea view, bedroom and bathroom.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The top floor is the hall, two smaller bedrooms, bathroom and balcony overlooking the sea.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The apartment is fully air conditioned and furnished, and does not require any additional investment.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is clean, tidy and well decorated, with ceramic stone floors and high quality fittings throughout.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>In front of the property is one private parking place, which is included in the price.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>To the international airport it takes 20 min. driving.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For additional photos and floor plans, please contact one of our agents in Split.</p>', '', '1223_Apartment_0.JPG', '1223_Apartment_1.JPG', '1223_Apartment_2.JPG', '1223_Apartment_3.JPG', '1223_Apartment_4.JPG', '1223_Apartment_5.JPG', '1223_Apartment_6.JPG', '1223_Apartment_7.JPG', '1223_Apartment_8.JPG'),
(1224, 'Mlaðan', 'Vrcan', '091/250-0807', '', 'vrcanmlaan@yahoo.com', 'Split', 'Bartola Ka¹iæa 30 (iza hotela Marjan)  Split, k.è. 8865/1, ZU 5278', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '100', '756', '460', 1, '1050000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 0, 0, 'June 8, 2015', '<p>Prekrasna kuæa na odliènoj lokaciji, s pogledom na more, samo 300 m od centra grada.&nbsp;Kuæa je udaljena od mora 100 m.&nbsp;Zemlji&scaron;te na kojem je smje&scaron;tena ima povr&scaron;inu 756 m2, ukupna postojeæa &nbsp;stambena povr&scaron;ina kuæe iznosi 192 m2, dok bi ukupna moguæa stambena povr&scaron;ina bila 460 m2, buduæi da vlasnik posjeduje va¾eæi projekt za nadogradnju kuæe.&nbsp;Kuæa se sastoji od prizemlja i kata, te ima moguænost nadogradnje potkrovlja s terasama.&nbsp;U prizemlju se nalaze dva odvojena useljiva stana, dok je prvi kat roh bau.</p>\r\n<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;">CIJENA SNI®ENA SA 1.180.000 EURA!!</span></p>', '<p>We are offering this exciting ''investment project''. An opportunity to have a large house in a great location, overlooking the sea, just 300 meters from the old town centre. The land on which it is located has an area of 756 m2, and currently the total existing residential area is 192 m2, while the total possible living area can be 460 m2. The house currently consists of two floors, and has the option to upgrade the attic with terraces, or become another floor. The ground floor has two separate habitable flats, while the first floor is still unfinished.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;">PRICE REDUCED FROM 1.180.000 EURO!!</span></p>', '', '<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;"><strong>CIJENA SNI®ENA SA 1.180.000 EURA!!</strong></span></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Prekrasna kuæa na odliènoj lokaciji, s pogledom na more, samo 300 m od centra grada.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je udaljena od mora 100 m.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Zemlji&scaron;te na kojem je smje&scaron;tena ima povr&scaron;inu 756 m2, ukupna postojeæa stambena povr&scaron;ina kuæe iznosi 192 m2, dok bi ukupna moguæa stambena povr&scaron;ina bila 460 m2, buduæi da vlasnik posjeduje va¾eæi projekt za nadogradnju kuæe.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa se sastoji od prizemlja i kata, te ima moguænost nadogradnje potkrovlja s terasama.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U prizemlju se nalaze dva odvojena useljiva stana, dok je prvi kat roh bau.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa ima svu potrebnu infrastrukturu.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Orijentirana je S-J.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ima pristup vozilom te moguænost 3 parking mjesta + gara¾a (u projektu).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U cijenu ulaze i dva prostorna prostora koji se nalaze ispod kuæe, svaki po 30 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Idealna prilika za investitore.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Do meðunarodnog aerodroma 40 min. vo¾nje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U blizini se nalaze i trajektna luka, autobusna i ¾eljeznièka stanica.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je na lokaciji koja je vrlo atraktivna kako za miran i ugodan ¾ivot, tako i za turistièko iznajmljivanje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za razgledavanje stojimo vam na usluzi.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Molimo za sve informacije kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured u Splitu.</p>', '<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;"><strong>PRICE REDUCED FROM 1.180.000 EURO!!</strong></span></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>We are offering this exciting ''investment project''.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>An opportunity to have a large house in a great location, overlooking the sea, just 300 meters from the old town centre.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>A project to improve this historic building has already been agreed.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The land on which it is located has an area of 756 m2, and currently the total existing residential area is 192 m2, while the total possible living area can be 460 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>This gives the property massive potential, as it is situated close to the town centre, the Riva, and most of the tourism attractions in the city as well as being nearby to the ferry port, bus and train station.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house currently consists of two floors, and has the option to upgrade the attic with terraces, or become another floor.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The ground floor has two separate habitable flats, while the first floor is still unfinished.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house is already connected to all the necessary infrastructure (electric, drains, water etc).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property is oriented North/South.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It has car access, with the possibility of 3 parking spaces, and a garage, which is part of the project agreed by the planners.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The price also includes two spacious business premises in front of the house, each 30 m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is 40 minutes to the international airport.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house is in a location that is very attractive for both peaceful and comfortable life, and for tourist rentals.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact our agents in the office in Split for more information.</p>', '', '1224_House-Villa_0.jpg', '1224_House-Villa_1.jpg', '1224_House-Villa_2.jpg', '1224_House-Villa_3.jpg', '1224_House-Villa_4.jpg', '1224_House-Villa_5.jpg', '1224_House-Villa_6.jpg', '1224_House-Villa_7.jpg', '1224_House-Villa_8.jpg'),
(1225, 'Radoslav ', 'Staniæ', '098 450 181', '', 'radoslav.stanic@trgofortuna.hr', 'Omis', 'Ruskamen II, br. 15 Ruskamen &#8211; Lokva Rogoznica, k.è. 1054/6, k.o. rogoznica', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '150', '340', '234', 2, '120000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 0, 0, 'June 8, 2015', '<p>Kuæa u izgradnji ju¾no od Omi&scaron;a.&nbsp;Prodaje se kuæa u izgradnji nekoliko kilometara ju¾no od Omi&scaron;a. Objekt se sastoji od prizemlja i kata, a na ravnom krovu predviðeno je parkirali&scaron;te za 10 automobila. Kuæa ima boèni pogled na more.&nbsp;Ima stambenu povr&scaron;inu 450 m2, dok povr&scaron;ina zemlji&scaron;ta iznosi 234 m2.</p>', '<p>House in construction south of Omis.&nbsp;House in construction at just few kilometers south of Omis. The property consists of a ground floor, first floor and there is a parking place for 10 vehicles on the flat roof. There are sea views from the side of the house.&nbsp;Living area of the house is 450m sq, while the land plot measures 234m sq.<br /><br /></p>', '', '<p>Kuæa u izgradnji ju¾no od Omi&scaron;a.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Prodaje se kuæa u izgradnji nekoliko kilometara ju¾no od Omi&scaron;a.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Objekt se sastoji od prizemlja i kata, a na ravnom krovu predviðeno je parkirali&scaron;te za 10 automobila.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa ima boèni pogled na more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ima stambenu povr&scaron;inu 450 m2, dok povr&scaron;ina zemlji&scaron;ta iznosi 234 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Cijena se odnosi na sada&scaron;nje stanje (niski roh bau).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Svi potrebni sadr¾aji se nalaze u blizini.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Do meðunarodnog aerodroma je potrebno 1h vo¾nje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za sve dodatne informacije i razgledavanje molimo da nas kontaktirate.</p>', '<p>House in construction south of Omis.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>House in construction at just few kilometers south of Omis.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property consists of a ground floor, first floor and there is a parking place for 10 vehicles on the flat roof.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There are sea views from the side of the house.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Living area of the house is 450m sq, while the land plot measures 234m sq.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The price assumes current condition.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>All necessary facilities are nearby.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact our office in Split for additional information.</p>', '', '1225_House-Villa_0.jpg', '1225_House-Villa_1.jpg', '1225_House-Villa_2.jpg', '1225_House-Villa_3.jpg', '1225_House-Villa_4.jpg', '1225_House-Villa_5.jpg', '1225_House-Villa_6.jpg', '1225_House-Villa_7.jpg', '1225_House-Villa_8.jpg'),
(1226, 'Nigel', 'Dunkley Horzenzija d', '+44 7588 512875', '', 'nigel@unionpacific.co.uk ', 'Brac', 'Povlja, Braè, ZU 174, 197, 297 k.o. povlja', 'For sale', 'Old stone house', '60', '25', '65', 1, '85000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 0, 0, 'June 9, 2015', '<p>Predstavljamo vam set kamenih kuæica s pogledom na more, smje&scaron;tenih u centru mjesta Povlja na otoku Braèu. Glavni dio nekretnine saèinjavaju dvije dvojne kuæe (18 i 29 m2), sa djelomiènim pogledom ma more te uliènim pristupom automobilu. Sporedni dio nekretnine saèinjava ru&scaron;evni objekt (biv&scaron;a staja) povr&scaron;ine 18 m2 sa dvori&scaron;tem 25 m2. Glavni i sporedni objekt nisu fizièki povezani, ali se nalaze u neposrednoj blizini.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>We are pleased to offer this set of stone houses with sea view, located in the charming village of Povlja on Brac island. The main property consists of two semi-detached houses (sized 18 and 29 sq.m), with car access and partial sea views to the bay. In addition, there is another ruin (formerly a barn) sized 18 sq.m with the garden of 25 sq.m, both being phisically detached from the main property, but in immediate vicinity.&nbsp;</p>', '', '<p>SET KAMENIH KUÆA U BLIZINI MORA</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Predstavljamo vam set kamenih kuæica na prodaju, smje&scaron;tenih u centru mjesta Povlja na otoku Braèu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Glavni dio nekretnine saèinjavaju dvije dvojne kuæe (18 i 29 m2), sa djelomiènim pogledom ma more te uliènim pristupom automobilu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sporedni dio nekretnine saèinjava ru&scaron;evni objekt (biv&scaron;a staja) povr&scaron;ine 18 m2 sa dvori&scaron;tem 25 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Glavni i sporedni objekt nisu fizièki povezani, ali se nalaze u neposrednoj blizini.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæe nemaju prikljuèke, ali ih je lako izvesti buduæi da su okru¾ene gotovim useljenim objektima.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Potrebna je potpuna renovacija svih kuæa.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ovo je zanimljiva prilika za kupce koji tra¾e tradicionalne dalmatinske kamene kuæe.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Otok Braè povezan je svakodnevnom trajektnom linijom sa gradom Splitom, dok je meðunarodni aerodrom udaljen 40 minuta vo¾nje od Splita.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Molimo kontaktirajte nas za sve dodatne informacije.</p>', '<p>SET OF STONE HOUSES NEAR THE SEA</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>We are pleased to offer this set of stone houses for sale, located in the charming village of Povlja on Brac island.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The main property consists of two semi-detached houses (sized 18 and 29 sq.m), with car access and partial sea views to the bay.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>In addition, there is another ruin (formerly a barn) sized 18 sq.m with the garden of 25 sq.m, both being phisically detached from the main property, but in immediate vicinity.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Houses have no utilities (though, the neighbouring properties are a step away) and need to be completely renovated.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>This is a good opportunity for the buyers looking for traditional Dalmatian homes.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>This property presents a unique opportunity for someone who wants to create a peaceful life or spend their holiday in one of the most beautiful areas of the island.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The island of Brac is connected by daily ferry lines to Split, while the international airport is 40 minutes drive from Split.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact us for more information and to arrange to visit the property.</p>', '', '1226_Old-stone-house_0.jpg', '1226_Old-stone-house_1.jpg', '1226_Old-stone-house_2.jpg', '1226_Old-stone-house_3.jpg', '1226_Old-stone-house_4.jpg', '1226_Old-stone-house_5.jpg', '1226_Old-stone-house_6.jpg', '1226_Old-stone-house_7.jpg', '1226_Old-stone-house_8.jpg');
INSERT INTO `nekretnina` (`id`, `ime`, `prezime`, `telefon`, `mobitel`, `e_mail`, `lokacija_id`, `adresa`, `status_id`, `vrsta_id`, `udaljenost`, `povrsina`, `stambenapovrsina`, `display`, `cijena`, `cijenatocka`, `ponuda_tjedna`, `new_built`, `must_sell`, `prvi_red_do_mora`, `pogled_na_more`, `bazen`, `broj_soba`, `broj_kupatila`, `datum`, `title_hr`, `title_en`, `title_ge`, `opis_hr`, `opis_en`, `opis_ge`, `PropertyImageURL0`, `PropertyImageURL1`, `PropertyImageURL2`, `PropertyImageURL3`, `PropertyImageURL4`, `PropertyImageURL5`, `PropertyImageURL6`, `PropertyImageURL7`, `PropertyImageURL8`) VALUES
(1227, 'Nigel', 'Dunkley Horzenzija d', '', '+44 7588 512875', 'nigel@unionpacific.co.uk ', 'Hvar', 'Riva Suæuraj, Hvar, ZU 168 k.o. sucuraj', 'For sale', 'Old stone house', '20', '83', '97', 1, '170000', '', 2, 2, 2, 1, 1, 2, 0, 0, 'June 9, 2015', '<p>Kamena kuæa prvi red uz more, nekoæ davno kori&scaron;tena kao trgivina namirnicama. Nekretnina se sastoji od glavne zgrade (54 + 43 m2) te pomoænog objekta povrine 47 m2 skupa sa komadom dvori&scaron;ta povr&scaron;ine 36 m2. Ima pristup automobilom, a nalazi se svega 20 metara od obale, pokraj glavne &scaron;etnice u mjestu Suæuraj na otoku Hvaru. Nekretninu je potrebno renovirati.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>Seafront stone house formerly used as a grocery shop. It consists of a main house (54 + 43 sq.m) and additional facility of 47 sq.m with the piece of garden sized 36 sq.m. It has car access and is located at only 20 meters from the waterfront, next to the central valkway in the village of Sucuraj on Hvar island. The property is in a need of renovation.&nbsp;</p>', '', '<p>Kamena kuæa prvi red uz more, nekoæ davno kori&scaron;tena kao trgivina namirnicama.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nekretnina se sastoji od glavne zgrade (54 + 43 m2) te pomoænog objekta povrine 47 m2 skupa sa komadom dvori&scaron;ta povr&scaron;ine 36 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ima pristup automobilom, a nalazi se svega 20 metara od obale, pokraj glavne &scaron;etnice u mjestu Suæuraj na otoku Hvaru.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nekretninu je potrebno renovirati.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Meðunarodna zraèna luka Split udaljena je 120 km, a dolazak do nekretnine ukljuèuje i 20-minutnu vo¾nju trajektom. &nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Hvar je povezan katamaranskom linijom iz Splita.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za sve dodatne informacije molimo Vas kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured.</p>', '<p>Seafront stone house formerly used as a grocery shop.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It consists of a main house (54 + 43 sq.m) and additional facility of 47 sq.m with the piece of garden sized 36 sq.m.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It has car access and is located at only 20 meters from the waterfront, next to the central valkway in the village of Sucuraj on Hvar island.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property is in a need of renovation.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Split international aisport is 120 km away, and the travel incluides a 20-minute ferry journey. &nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Hvar is a favourite resort for all who want to see and feel the original rural atmosphere of the island and Dalmatia.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For further information or a tour of the property please contact our office.</p>', '', '1227_Old-stone-house_0.jpg', '1227_Old-stone-house_1.jpg', '1227_Old-stone-house_2.jpg', '1227_Old-stone-house_3.jpg', '1227_Old-stone-house_4.jpg', '1227_Old-stone-house_5.jpg', '1227_Old-stone-house_6.jpg', '1227_Old-stone-house_7.jpg', ''),
(1228, 'Nigel', 'Dunkley Hortenzija', '+44 7588 512875', '', 'nigel@unionpacific.co.uk ', 'Primosten', 'Rogoznica, ZU 3576, 3504 k.o. rogoznica', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '1500', '3655', '68', 1, '130000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 0, 0, 'June 9, 2015', '<p>Nekretnina se sastoji od nedovr&scaron;ene prizemne kuæe smje&scaron;tene na velikom poljoprivrednom zemlji&scaron;tu na pola puta izmeðu Primo&scaron;tena i Rogoznice.&nbsp;Udaljena je od mora 1,5 km.&nbsp;Parcela je izvan graðevne zone, a kuæa nema prikljuèaka struje ni vode.&nbsp;Stambena povr&scaron;ina kuæe iznosi 68 m2, dok zemlji&scaron;te ima povr&scaron;inu 3655 m2.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>The property consists of a an unfinished bungalow sitting on a vast agricultural land, located half way between Rogoznica and Primosten.&nbsp;Distance from the sea 1,5 km.&nbsp;The plot is out of the building zone <span>(foreign nationals may acquire  agricultural land only by setting up the company)</span> and the house has no utility connections.&nbsp;Living area of the house is 68m sq, while the land plot measures 3655m sq.&nbsp;</p>', '', '<p>Nekretnina se sastoji od nedovr&scaron;ene prizemne kuæe smje&scaron;tene na velikom poljoprivrednom zemlji&scaron;tu na pola puta izmeðu Primo&scaron;tena i Rogoznice.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Udaljena je od mora 1,5 km.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Parcela je izvan graðevne zone, a kuæa nema prikljuèaka struje ni vode.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Stambena povr&scaron;ina kuæe iznosi 68 m2, dok zemlji&scaron;te ima povr&scaron;inu 3655 m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sa terena se pru¾a spektakularan pogled na more, a grad Primo&scaron;ten udaljen je svega 5 km.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ova ponuda zanimljiva je kupcima koji tra¾e izolirane i skrivene lokacije.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Meðunarodna zraèna luka Split udaljena je 44 km.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Udaljenost od restorana, trgovina i kafiæa je svega nekoliko minuta, a tijekom ljeta svi potrebni turistièki sadr¾aji mogu se pronaæi u mjestu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za sve dodatne informacije molimo kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured u Splitu.</p>', '<p>The property consists of a an unfinished bungalow sitting on a vast agricultural land, located half way between Rogoznica and Primosten.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Distance from the sea 1,5 km.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The plot is out of the building zone <span>(foreign nationals may acquire  agricultural land only by setting up the company)</span>&nbsp;and the house has no utility connections. &nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Living area of the house is 68m sq, while the land plot measures 3655m sq.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sea views are spectacular and the town of Primosten is only 5 km away.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>This is a good opportunity to a buyer looking for secluded location.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Split international airport is only 44 km away. &nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Distance to restaurants, shops and caf&eacute;s is only a few minutes walking, and during the summer all the necessary shops, restaurants and other tourist facilities can be found in the village.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For further information please contact our agents in Split and we will be pleased to show you this good value property.</p>', '', '1228_House-Villa_0.jpg', '1228_House-Villa_1.jpg', '1228_House-Villa_2.jpg', '1228_House-Villa_3.jpg', '1228_House-Villa_4.jpg', '1228_House-Villa_5.jpg', '1228_House-Villa_6.jpg', '1228_House-Villa_7.jpg', '1228_House-Villa_8.jpg'),
(1229, 'Ana ', 'Baèetiæ', '095 874 9762', '', 'anabacetic@yahoo.com', 'Korcula', 'Prigradica, Korèula', 'For sale', 'Old stone house', '50', '0', '90', 1, '85000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 0, 0, 'June 9, 2015', '<p>Stara kamena kuæa s pogledom na more, na otoku Korèuli, smje&scaron;tena u predivnoj uvali Prigradica.&nbsp;Udaljena je od mora samo 50 m.&nbsp;Kuæa je u nizu, a sastoji se od prizemlja, kata i visokog potkrovlja.&nbsp;Ima ukupnu stambenu povr&scaron;inu 90 m2.&nbsp;Pripada joj maleno dvori&scaron;te te vrt sa &scaron;upom/ poljski WC.</p>', '<p>We have this old village house, in need of renovation, in one of the most beautiful bays on the island.It is situated only 50 m from the sea, in a small traditional village with shops, bakery, coffee bars, and family run restaurants. As quiet and undisturbed a place as you could hope to find. The house is terraced and consists of a ground floor, first floor and attic with a surface area of 90 m2.</p>', '', '<p>Stara kamena kuæa s pogledom na more, na otoku Korèuli, smje&scaron;tena u predivnoj uvali Prigradica.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Udaljena je od mora samo 50 m.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je u nizu, a sastoji se od prizemlja, kata i visokog potkrovlja.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ima ukupnu stambenu povr&scaron;inu 90 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Pripada joj maleno dvori&scaron;te te vrt sa &scaron;upom/ poljski WC.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Potrebna adaptacija.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ima betonske ploèe te prikljuèke za struju i vodu.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Izuzetno mirno okru¾enje, pogled koji oduzima dah, spektakularni zalasci i izlasci sunca i jo&scaron; mnogo toga, èine ovu nekretninu jedinstvenim i po¾eljnim utoèi&scaron;æem od gradske vreve i svakodnevnog stresa.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Bezbrojne prekrasne pla¾e i uvale, kuæe za odmor, stoljetni maslinici i vinogradi, prastari ljetnikovci i drevna otoèna mjesta koja kao da su ostala izgubljena u nekom davno minulom vremenu mame na ovaj otok turiste iz cijeloga svijeta.</p>', '<p>We have this old village house, in need of renovation, in one of the most beautiful bays on the island.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is situated only 50 m from the sea, in a small traditional village with shops, bakery, coffee bars, and family run restaurants.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The village has barely changed since it evolved around a small fishing and farmingcommunity - entirely charming, and a natural port, with olive groves and traditional crops grown in the poor quality farm land in the region.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>As quiet and undisturbed a place as you could hope to find.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house is terraced and consists of a ground floor, first floor and attic with a surface area of 90 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house also has a small courtyard and a small garden with shed/outhouse.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property is in need of complete renovation, but some of the heavy work has been completed, as well as the connections for water and electric supplies.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact our offices to make an appointment to visit the property or to fine out more about the extent of renovation still required.</p>', '', '1229_Old-stone-house_0.jpg', '1229_Old-stone-house_1.jpg', '1229_Old-stone-house_2.jpg', '1229_Old-stone-house_3.jpg', '1229_Old-stone-house_4.jpg', '1229_Old-stone-house_5.jpg', '1229_Old-stone-house_6.jpg', '1229_Old-stone-house_7.jpg', '1229_Old-stone-house_8.jpg'),
(1230, 'Marin', 'Tubiæ', '0989374054', '0049731265679', '', 'Trogir', 'Bulièiæev bok 16 Okrug Gornji, 746/17,  746/15,  737 ZGR', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '50', '660', '200', 1, '485000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 5, 4, 'June 10, 2015', '<p>Samostojeæa kuæa na izuzetnoj lokaciji smje&scaron;tena u 2. redu od mora sa prostranom okuænicom i moguæno&scaron;æu izgradnje prostranog bazena. Nalazi se na ju¾noj strani Èiova u jednoj od najljep&scaron;ih uvala na otoku. Okru¾enje je mirno i idealno za odmor. Zemlji&scaron;te je povr&scaron;ine 660 m2 gdje se nalazi kultivirana okuænica sa kaminom, zatvorenom terasom, ljetnom kuhinjom i mjestom koje je predviðeno za izgradnju bazena.&nbsp;Ukupna povr&scaron;ina iznosi &nbsp;200 m2 (150 m2 + terasa na 1.katu &ndash; 50 m2).</p>', '<p>We have this detached house in an excellent location situated in the 2nd row from the sea with large garden. It is located on the south side of Ciovo in one of the most beautiful bays on the island, 10m from the shore. The land area is 660 m2 and the gardens have been cultivated and landscaped to include an outdoor/bbq fireplace, an enclosed terrace, outdoor and a terrace that would be ideal for a swimming pool. The total living area of 200 m2 (150 m2 + terrace of 50 m2 on the 1st floor).</p>', '', '<p>Samostojeæa kuæa na izuzetnoj lokaciji smje&scaron;tena u 2. redu od mora sa prostranom okuænicom i moguæno&scaron;æu izgradnje prostranog bazena.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nalazi se na ju¾noj strani Èiova u jednoj od najljep&scaron;ih uvala na otoku.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Okru¾enje je mirno i idealno za odmor.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Do mora i prekrasne pla¾e je potrebno svega 2 minute hoda &scaron;to je velika prednost ove kuæe.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Zemlji&scaron;te je povr&scaron;ine 660 m2 gdje se nalazi kultivirana okuænica sa kaminom, zatvorenom terasom, ljetnom kuhinjom i mjestom koje je predviðeno za izgradnju bazena.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>***Ukupna povr&scaron;ina iznosi &nbsp;200 m2 (150 m2 + terasa na 1.katu &ndash; 50 m2).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U prizemlju se nalazi hodnik, kuhinja + dnevni boravak, 2 spavaæe sobe i kupaonica.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Prostrano spremi&scaron;te gdje se nalazi mali wc se takoðer nalazi u prizemlju, ali sa odvojenim ulazom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U kuhinji se nalazi stropni ventilator.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na 1. katu se nalazi prostrana terasa sa pogledom na more, hodnik, kuhinja, 3 spavaæe sobe, kupaonica i wc.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na ovom katu se nalaze i 3 stropna ventilatora.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je graðena 70-ih godina, ali je renovirana prije 8 godina.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Potpuno je namje&scaron;tena i u jako dobrom stanju.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Svi sadr¾aji su u blizini dok je meðunarodni aerodrom udaljen 20 min. vo¾nje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Stojimo na usluzi za sva dodatna pitanja i fotografije.</p>', '<p>We have this detached house in an excellent location situated in the 2nd row from the sea with large garden.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is located on the south side of Ciovo in one of the most beautiful bays on the island, 10m from the shore, in an area of safe beaches and many quiet places to sunbathe and enjoy the water.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The environment is calm and ideal for holidays.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The land area is 660 m2 and the gardens have been cultivated and landscaped to include an outdoor/bbq fireplace, an enclosed terrace, outdoor and a terrace that would be ideal for a swimming pool.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>*** The total living area of 200 m2 (150 m2 + terrace of 50 m2 on the 1st floor).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The ground floor: hallway, kitchen, living room, 2 bedrooms and bathroom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Spacious storage room where there is a small toilet is also located on the ground floor, but with a separate entrance.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the 1st floor there is a spacious terrace overlooking the sea, hall, kitchen, 3 bedrooms, bathroom and toilet.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house was built in the 70s, but was renovated 8 years ago.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is fully furnished with modern fittings and is in very good condition.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>All facilities such as shops, cafes, bars etc are nearby and the international airport is 20 minutes driving.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>We are at your disposal for any additional questions and photos.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact one of our agents to arrange a visit to this property.</p>', '', '1230_House-Villa_0.JPG', '1230_House-Villa_1.JPG', '1230_House-Villa_2.JPG', '1230_House-Villa_3.JPG', '1230_House-Villa_4.JPG', '1230_House-Villa_5.JPG', '1230_House-Villa_6.JPG', '1230_House-Villa_7.JPG', '1230_House-Villa_8.JPG'),
(1231, 'Norman', 'Payne', '', '+44 7970 843532', 'eastwayroofing7@gmail.com  ', 'Brac', 'Puntinak Puntinak &#8211; Sumartin', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '90', '0', '50', 1, '119000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 1, 1, 'June 15, 2015', '<p>Simpatièan apartman za odmor, smje&scaron;ten na prvom katu manje stambene zgrade. Nalazi se u malom slikovitom mjestu na otoku Braèu, 2 km od trajektne luke u Sumartinu. Apartman je udaljen od mora 90 m. Nekretnina se sastoji od dvnevnog boravka sa kuhinjom, kupaonice, dvokrevetne spavaæe sobe, velike nenatkrivene terase te parkirali&scaron;nog mjesta. Stambena povr&scaron;ina iznosi 50 m2, dok je povr&scaron;ina terase 33 m2.</p>', '<p>Lovely holiday apartment on the first floor of a low-rise building. Located in a small picturesque village on Brac island, a great hideaway at 2 km from the ferry port of Sumartin.&nbsp;The apartment is located 90 m from the sea.&nbsp;The property consists of an open-plan living area and kitchen, bathroom, double bedroom, large uncovered terrace and parking place (total living area 50m sq + terrace 33m sq).&nbsp;</p>', '', '<p>Simpatièan apartman za odmor, smje&scaron;ten na prvom katu manje stambene zgrade.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nalazi se u malom slikovitom mjestu na otoku Braèu, 2 km od trajektne luke u Sumartinu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartman je udaljen od mora 90 m.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nekretnina se sastoji od dvnevnog boravka sa kuhinjom, kupaonice, dvokrevetne spavaæe sobe, velike nenatkrivene terase te parkirali&scaron;nog mjesta.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Stambena povr&scaron;ina iznosi 50 m2, dok je povr&scaron;ina terase 33 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Namje&scaron;taj je ukljuèen u cijenu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Zgrada se nalazi svega 90 m od mora, a iz stana se pru¾a jedlomièan pogled na more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U mjestu se nalazi trajektna luka, a lijepe pla¾e i kristalno èisto more nedoljiv su mamac svim posjetiteljima.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Otok Braè povezan je svakodnevnom trajektnom linijom sa gradom Splitom, dok je meðunarodni aerodrom udaljen 40 minuta vo¾nje od Splita.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Molimo kontaktirajte nas za sve dodatne informacije.</p>', '<p>Lovely holiday apartment on the first floor of a low-rise building.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Located in a small picturesque village on Brac island, a great hideaway at 2 km from the ferry port of Sumartin.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The apartment is located 90 m from the sea.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property consists of an open-plan living area and kitchen, bathroom, double bedroom, large uncovered terrace and parking place (total living area 50m sq + terrace 33m sq).&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Furniture is included.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The building is only 90 meters away from the sea and apartment features some sea views too.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The ferry-port in this place connects a part of the island with the land.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Chief occupations are farming, viniculture, olive growing, fishing and tourism.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Situated on the regional road running along the island.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The island of Brac is connected by daily ferry lines to Split, while the international airport is 40 minutes drive from Split.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact us for more information and to arrange to visit the property.</p>', '', '1231_Apartment_0.jpg', '1231_Apartment_1.jpg', '1231_Apartment_2.jpg', '1231_Apartment_3.jpg', '1231_Apartment_4.jpg', '1231_Apartment_5.jpg', '1231_Apartment_6.jpg', '1231_Apartment_7.jpg', '1231_Apartment_8.jpg'),
(1232, 'Matkoviæ', 'Primo¹ten nekretnine', '', '098 386 376', 'info@primosten-immobilien.com', 'Primosten', 'Primo¹ten Dolac', 'For sale', 'Land plot', '100', '1306', '0', 1, '175000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 0, 0, 'June 15, 2015', '<p>Prodaje se graðevinsko zemlji&scaron;te s prekrasnim otvorenim pogledom na more.&nbsp;Udaljeno je od mora i pla¾e samo 100 m.&nbsp;Ukupna povr&scaron;ina zemlji&scaron;ta iznosi 1306 m2, zemlji&scaron;te je pravilnog oblika i stambene namjene, idealno za izgradnju dviju obiteljskih vila.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>We are offering this well situated building plot on the main land with beautiful sea views. It is located just 100m from the beach, with easy access and great views from the gently sloping shore, near Primosten. The total land area is 1306 m2, in an ideal shape for the construction of two family villas.</p>', '', '<p>Prodaje se graðevinsko zemlji&scaron;te s prekrasnim otvorenim pogledom na more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Udaljeno je od mora i pla¾e samo 100 m.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ukupna povr&scaron;ina zemlji&scaron;ta iznosi 1306 m2, zemlji&scaron;te je pravilnog oblika i stambene namjene, idealno za izgradnju dviju obiteljskih vila.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong><span style="text-decoration: underline;">Cijena: 175.000,00 EUR</span></strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Zemlji&scaron;te se nalazi na mirnoj lokaciji 3 km od Primo&scaron;tena, u blizini centra jednog od najljep&scaron;ih turistièkih mjesta Dalmacije, gdje se nalaze svi potrebni sadr¾aji.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Od aerodroma je udaljeno 30 km.</p>', '<p>We are offering this well situated building plot on the main land with beautiful sea views.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is located just 100m from the beach, with easy access and great views from the gently sloping shore, near Primosten.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The total land area is 1306 m2, in an ideal shape for the construction of two family villas.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The land is located in a quiet location 3 km from Primosten, near the centre of one of the most beautiful places in Dalmatia, where there are all the necessary facilities (water, drains electric etc).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The distance from the airport is 30 km.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact our agents to arrange to visit this property and ask questions.</p>', '', '1232_Land-plot_0.JPG', '1232_Land-plot_1.JPG', '1232_Land-plot_2.JPG', '1232_Land-plot_3.jpg', '1232_Land-plot_4.jpg', '1232_Land-plot_5.jpg', '', '', ''),
(1233, 'Vlado', 'Nikoliæ', '', '098225932', '', 'Rogoznica', 'Stiva¹nica Ra¾anj, kè 10132/3 Sevid', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '50', '858', '390', 1, '690000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 9, 5, 'June 15, 2015', '<p>Kuæa u rohbau, ju¾ne orijentacije, u mirnoj uvali, drugi red od mora, na svega 50 m udaljenosti od prirodne pla¾e.&nbsp;S kuæe se pru¾a pogled na cijelu uvalu ali i na otvoreno more.&nbsp;Povr&scaron;ina parcele iznosi 858 m2 i s obzirom na velièinu na parceli je moguæe izgraditi bazen kao i ostaviti mjesta za parking.&nbsp;Stambena povr&scaron;ina kuæe iznosi 389 m2.&nbsp;Kuæa se sastoji od suterena, prvog, drugog i treæeg kata.&nbsp;Suteren je povr&scaron;ine 60 m2, a èine ga kuhinja, dnevni boravak, spavaæa soba i kupaonica.</p>', '<p>We have this heavily discounted property: an-unfinished building, facing south, in a quiet bay, with great views of the sea and only 50 meters from the beach. It is situated close to the sea, where it is safe for swimming and for children to play in the water. The property consists of a plot of 858 m2, which is enough for this substantial building of 4 floors plus a swimming pool and adequate private parking spaces. The living area inside the building is 389 m2. The house consists of ground floor, first, second and third floor.&nbsp;Ground floor is 60 m2.</p>', '', '<p>Kuæa u rohbau, ju¾ne orijentacije, u mirnoj uvali, drugi red od mora, na svega 50 m udaljenosti od prirodne pla¾e.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>S kuæe se pru¾a pogled na cijelu uvalu ali i na otvoreno more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Povr&scaron;ina parcele iznosi 858 m2 i s obzirom na velièinu na parceli je moguæe izgraditi bazen kao i ostaviti mjesta za parking.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Stambena povr&scaron;ina kuæe iznosi 389 m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa se sastoji od suterena, prvog, drugog i treæeg kata.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Suteren je povr&scaron;ine 60 m2, a èine ga kuhinja, dnevni boravak, spavaæa soba i kupaonica.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ovaj dio kuæe je kompletno ureðen.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na prvom katu su dva dvosobna apartmana svaki po 60 m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sastoje se od dvije spavaæe sobe, dnevnog boravka, kuhinje, kupaonice i wc-a.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Svaki ima izlaz na loðu povr&scaron;ine 15 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na drugom katu je prostrani èetverosobni apartman s velikom loðom povr&scaron;ine 30 m2, a s koje se pru¾a predivan pogled na more i uvalu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Treæi i zadnji kat je ravna povr&scaron;ina &nbsp;na kojoj je predviðen jedan studio apartman povr&scaron;ine 40 m2 s velikom terasom na kojoj je predviðena ugradnja jakuzija.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ovaj kat pru¾a moguænost vrhunskog ugoðaja s obzirom da se s njega pru¾a pogled na otvoreno more i uvalu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa ima svu potrebnu infrastrukturu (struja, gradska voda, septièka jama).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Udaljenost do centra mjesta, duæana, restorana i kafiæa je svega 2 km, a do aerodroma 28 km.</p>', '<p>We have this heavily discounted property: an-unfinished building, facing south, in a quiet bay, with great views of the sea and only 50 meters from the beach.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is situated close to the sea, where it is safe for swimming and for children to play in the water.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The nearest village is only a few minutes cycling along the sea path where there are coffee shops, bars and other essential services.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The airport is under 30 km, and the main centre for historic and cultural activities is Trogir, which is about 15 minutes by car.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property consists of a plot of 858 m2, which is enough for this substantial building of 4 floors plus a swimming pool and adequate private parking spaces.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The living area inside the building is 389 m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house consists of ground floor, first, second and third floor.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ground floor is 60 m2, consisting of kitchen, living room, bedroom and bathroom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>This part of the house is complete and fully furnished.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the first floor are two apartments each 60 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Each apartment consists of two bedrooms, living room, kitchen, bathroom and toilet.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Each has access to a large balcony of 15 m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the second floor is a spacious and light 4 bedroom apartment with a large balcony area of 30 m2, and offers a beautiful view of the sea and the bay.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The third (top) is a flat surface at the moment, but is is planned as big studio apartment of 40 m2 with a large terrace on which it was planned to build in Jacuzzi.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>This floor provides the best atmosphere since it provides a view of the open sea and the bay.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house has all the necessary infrastructure (electricity, city water, septic tank), already installed.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>This property is really for builders and investors but help can be given to someone wanting an exciting project with great financial upside and who doesn''t have experience working in Croatia.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact one of our agents for more information and to arrange to visit this property.</p>', '', '1233_House-Villa_0.jpg', '1233_House-Villa_1.jpg', '1233_House-Villa_2.jpg', '1233_House-Villa_3.jpg', '1233_House-Villa_4.jpg', '1233_House-Villa_5.jpg', '1233_House-Villa_6.jpg', '1233_House-Villa_7.jpg', '1233_House-Villa_8.jpg'),
(1234, 'Antun', 'Gondi', '098 343322', 'Ivana Ripli 099 5130905', 'gondi@vt.t-com.hr', 'Brac', 'Bol', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '500', '0', '59', 1, '117900', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 3, 1, 'June 16, 2015', '<p>Posljednji stan u zgradi!&nbsp;Lijepi dvosobni stan u prizemlju manje stambene zgrade. Zgrada se nalazi u mjestu sa ju¾ne strane otoka, oko 500 metara od centra i prekrasnih pla¾a.&nbsp;Sastoji se od tri spavaæe sobe, kupaonice, otvorenog prostora dnevnog boravka s kuhinjom te terase, ukupne stambene povr&scaron;ine 58,93 m2.</p>', '<p>Last unit in the building!&nbsp;Lovely 2-bedroom apartment on the ground floor.&nbsp;The building is located in a town from the south side of Brac island, about 500 meters from the center and lovely beaches.&nbsp;It consists of 3 bedrooms, bathroom, open-plan living room with kitchen and terrace, total living area 58,93 sqm.</p>', '', '<p><strong>Posljednji stan u zgradi!</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Lijepi trosobni stan u prizemlju manje stambene zgrade.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Zgrada se nalazi u mjestu sa ju¾ne strane otoka, oko 500 metara od centra i prekrasnih pla¾a.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sastoji se od tri spavaæe sobe, kupaonice, otvorenog prostora dnevnog boravka s kuhinjom te terase, ukupne stambene povr&scaron;ine 58,93 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Zgrada je u fazi izgradnje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ima pristup vozilom i parking, te svu potrebnu infrastrukturu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Otok Braè povezan je svakodnevnom trajektnom linijom sa gradom Splitom, dok je meðunarodni aerodrom udaljen 40 minuta vo¾nje od Splita.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Molimo kontaktirajte nas za sve dodatne informacije.</p>', '<p><strong>Last unit in the building!</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Lovely 3-bedroom apartment on the ground floor.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The building is located in a town from the south side of Brac island, about 500 meters from the center and lovely beaches.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It consists of 3 bedrooms, bathroom, open-plan living room with kitchen and terrace, total living area 58,93 sqm.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The building is completed.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property has car access and parking place.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>All necessary infrastructure is present.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Near this property are coffee bars, bakery and other services, for tourists and residents.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The island of Brac is connected by daily ferry lines to Split, while the international airport is 40 minutes drive from Split.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact us for more information and to arrange to visit the property.</p>', '', '1234_Apartment_0.jpg', '1234_Apartment_1.jpg', '1234_Apartment_2.jpg', '1234_Apartment_3.jpg', '', '', '', '', ''),
(1439, 'Jo¹ko', 'Kulji¹', '', '091 760 3912', '', 'Trogir', 'Petra Kre¹imira IV &#8211; na kraju ulice (Mavar¹tica) Okrug Gornji, 806/8, 804/1- parking na vrhu', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '10', '409', '70', 1, '225000', '', 2, 2, 2, 1, 1, 2, 0, 0, 'November 4, 2015', '<p><strong>***POSJEDUJE GRAÐEVINSKU DOZVOLU ZA 2. ETA®E</strong></p>\r\n<p><strong><br /></strong></p>\r\n<p>Nekretnina na ekskluzivnoj lokaciji u 1.redu do mora bez ceste izmeðu zemlji&scaron;ta i prekrasne kamenite pla¾e. Izmeðu kuæe i pla¾e se nalazi &scaron;etnica, dok je ispred moguæe privezati manji brod.&nbsp;Smje&scaron;tena je u jednoj od najpopularnijih uvala na otoku Èiovu gdje gotovo da i nema povoljnih nekretnina odmah uz more.&nbsp;S obzirom da se gradi jo&scaron; jedan most koji æe spajati kopno i otok Èiovo, ovo podruèje æe definitivno biti jo&scaron; popularnije.&nbsp;Ukupna povr&scaron;ina zemlji&scaron;ta iznosi 409 m2, dok je kuæa 70 m2.</p>', '<p><strong>***IT HAS A BUILDING PERMIT FOR TWO FLOORS.</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>We are offering this rare opportunity to buy a shell of a building-basically a land plot-in the 1st row to the sea with no road between property and beautiful rocky beaches.&nbsp;It is located in one of the most popular bays on the island of Ciovo so this will be one of only a select few houses with direct access to the sea at the bottom of the garden. The total land area is 409 m2, while the house is 70 m2.&nbsp;</p>', '', '<p><strong>***POSJEDUJE GRAÐEVINSKU DOZVOLU ZA 2. ETA®E</strong></p>\r\n<p><strong><br /></strong></p>\r\n<p>Nekretnina na ekskluzivnoj lokaciji u 1.redu do mora bez ceste izmeðu zemlji&scaron;ta i prekrasne kamenite pla¾e.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Izmeðu kuæe i pla¾e se nalazi &scaron;etnica, dok je ispred moguæe privezati manji brod.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Smje&scaron;tena je u jednoj od najpopularnijih uvala na otoku Èiovu gdje gotovo da i nema povoljnih nekretnina odmah uz more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Najbli¾e trgovine i ostali sadr¾aji su udaljeni 3 minute vo¾nje, dok je do grada Trogira potrebno 10 minuta vo¾nje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>S obzirom da se gradi jo&scaron; jedan most koji æe spajati kopno i otok Èiovo, ovo podruèje æe definitivno biti jo&scaron; popularnije.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ukupna povr&scaron;ina zemlji&scaron;ta iznosi 409 m2, dok je kuæa 70 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Trenutno je na zemlji&scaron;tu zapoèeta izgradnja prizemnice, ali postoji moguænost nadogradnje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nedovr&scaron;ena kuæa pru¾a jo&scaron; veæe moguænosti zbog izgradnje i preureðenja prema vlastitim ¾eljama.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ukoliko ste zainteresirani za ovu jedinstvenu priliku, slobodno nas kontaktirajte.</p>', '<p><strong>***IT HAS A BUILDING PERMIT FOR TWO FLOORS.</strong></p>\r\n<p><strong><br /></strong></p>\r\n<p>We are offering this rare opportunity to buy a shell of a building - basically a land plot - in the 1st row to the sea with no road between property and beautiful rocky beaches.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is located in one of the most popular bays on the island of Ciovo so this will be one of only a select few houses with direct access to the sea at the bottom of the garden.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The nearest shops and other facilities are located 3 minutes away, while the town of Trogir, with many options for top restaurants and historical and cultural attractions, needs a 10 minute drive.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Many improvements are being made to the area, and a new bridge is being built (completed in 2016/7) which will improve the access to the island, and cure some of the traffic problems in high season, and make the area yet more desirable.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The total land area is 409 m2, while the house is 70 m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Currently, a bungalow has been built, but there is the option to upgrade orto start with an entirely new project and house.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>This unfinished house provides even more varied opportunities for construction and remodelling to suit your preferences.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>If you are interested in this unique opportunity, please contact our office for more information and to tour the location.</p>', '', '1439_House-Villa_0.jpg', '1439_House-Villa_1.jpg', '1439_House-Villa_2.jpg', '1439_House-Villa_3.jpg', '1439_House-Villa_4.jpg', '1439_House-Villa_5.jpg', '1439_House-Villa_6.jpg', '1439_House-Villa_7.jpg', '1439_House-Villa_8.jpg'),
(1235, 'Anton', 'Gondi', '098 343322', 'Ivana Ripli 099 5130905', 'gondi@vt.t-com.hr', 'Brac', 'Bol', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '500', '0', '0', 1, '99320', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 'June 16, 2015', '<p>Apartmani se nalaze u mjestu sa ju¾ne strane otoka Braèa, oko 500 metara od centra i lijepih pla¾a.&nbsp;Zgrada je u procesu izgradnje. Nekretnina ima pristup automobilom. Sva potrebna infrastruktura nalazi se na parceli.&nbsp;Svi apartmani imaju 2 spavaæe sobe, kupaonicu, otvoreni prostor nevnog boravka sa kuhinjom i terasu.&nbsp;Na prodaju su i dva prostrana gara¾na mjesta u zgradi, svako po cijeni od 24.840 EUR.</p>', '<p>The building is located in a town from the south side of Brac island, about 500 meters from the center and lovely beaches. The building is in construction. The property has car access. All necessary infrastructure is present. All apartments have 2 bedrooms, bathroom, open-plan living room with kitchen and terrace. There are 2 spatious garages left for sale in the building, each at 24.840 EUR.</p>', '', '<p>Apartmani u izgradnji na otoku Braèu</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartmani se nalaze u mjestu sa ju¾ne strane otoka Braèa, oko 500 metara od centra i lijepih pla¾a.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Zgrada je u procesu izgradnje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nekretnina ima pristup automobilom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sva potrebna infrastruktura nalazi se na parceli.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Svi apartmani imaju 2 spavaæe sobe, kupaonicu, otvoreni prostor nevnog boravka sa kuhinjom i terasu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Apartman 1: prizemlje, 49,66 m2, 99.320 EUR</strong></p>\r\n<p><strong><br /></strong></p>\r\n<p><strong>Apartman 2: prizemlje, 55,95 m2, 111.900 EUR - PRODANO</strong></p>\r\n<p><strong><br /></strong></p>\r\n<p><strong>Apartman 5: drugi kat, 49,66 m2, pogled na more, 99.320 EUR - PRODANO</strong></p>\r\n<p><strong><br /></strong></p>\r\n<p><strong>Apartman 6: drugi kat, 55,95 m2, pogled na more, 111.900 EUR - PRODANO</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na prodaju su i dva prostrana gara¾na mjesta u zgradi, svako po cijeni od 24.840 EUR.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Otok Braè povezan je svakodnevnom trajektnom linijom sa gradom Splitom, dok je meðunarodni aerodrom udaljen 40 minuta vo¾nje od Splita.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Molimo kontaktirajte nas za sve dodatne informacije.</p>', '<p>Apartments in construction on Brac island</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The building is located in a town from the south side of Brac island, about 500 meters from the center and lovely beaches.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The building is in construction.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property has car access.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>All necessary infrastructure is present.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>All apartments have 2 bedrooms, bathroom, open-plan living room with kitchen and terrace.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Apartment 1: ground floor, 49,66 sq.m, 99.320 EUR</strong></p>\r\n<p><strong><br /></strong></p>\r\n<p><strong>Apartment 2: ground floor, 55,95 sq.m, 111.900 EUR - SOLD</strong></p>\r\n<p><strong><br /></strong></p>\r\n<p><strong>Apartment 5: second floor, 49,66 sq.m, sea views, 99.320 EUR - SOLD</strong></p>\r\n<p><strong><br /></strong></p>\r\n<p><strong>Apartment 6: second floor, 55,95 sq.m, sea views, 111.900 EUR - SOLD</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There are 2 spatious garages left for sale in the building, each at 24.840 EUR.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Near this property are coffee bars, bakery and other services, for tourists and residents.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The island of Brac is connected by daily ferry lines to Split, while the international airport is 40 minutes drive from Split.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact us for more information and to arrange to visit the property.</p>', '', '1235_Apartment_0.jpg', '1235_Apartment_1.jpg', '1235_Apartment_2.jpg', '1235_Apartment_3.jpg', '1235_Apartment_4.jpg', '1235_Apartment_5.jpg', '1235_Apartment_6.jpg', '', ''),
(1236, 'Pjer', 'Samohod', '', '098/824-657', '', 'Split', 'Bana Berislaviæa 13   Split, 7306/3', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '600', '0', '45', 1, '115000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 1, 'June 17, 2015', '<p>Atraktivan apartman u Splitu na odliènoj lokaciji, u mirnom podruèju, blizu centra grada te svih potrebnih sadr¾aja.&nbsp;Apartman se nalazi u prizemlju zgrade koja je udaljena 600 m od mora.&nbsp;Sastoji se od jedne spavaæe sobe, kuhinje s blagovaonicom, dnevnog boravka, kupaonice te ostave ukupne stambene povr&scaron;ine 45 m2.&nbsp;Balkon ispred kojeg je lijepo ureðen vrt ima povr&scaron;inu 5 m2.</p>', '<p>We are pleased to offer this attractive apartment in a great location close to the city center and all facilities.&nbsp;It is situated on the ground floor of this building, 600 m from the sea.&nbsp;The apartment consists of bedroom, living room, kitchen with dinning room, bathroom and pantry with total living area of 45 sqm.&nbsp;There is also small cultivated garden in front of the balcony of 5 sqm used only by the owners of this apartment.</p>', '', '<p>Atraktivan apartman u Splitu na odliènoj lokaciji, u mirnom podruèju, blizu centra grada te svih potrebnih sadr¾aja.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartman se nalazi u prizemlju zgrade koja je udaljena 600 m od mora.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sastoji se od jedne spavaæe sobe, kuhinje s blagovaonicom, dnevnog boravka, kupaonice te ostave ukupne stambene povr&scaron;ine 45 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Balkon ispred kojeg je lijepo ureðen vrt ima povr&scaron;inu 5 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartmanu pripada i drvarnica, a vlasnici imaju pristup i vrtu te terasi s koje se pru¾a djelomièan pogled na more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Zajednièki vrt koji je smje&scaron;ten nadomak balkonu koriste samo vlasnici ovog apartmana.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Voda i struja su prikljuèeni.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Pogodno za iznajmljivanje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Parking ispred zgrade.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U blizini se nalaze mnogobrojni restorani, kafiæi, suvenirnice i ostali sadr¾aji.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Centar Splita je iz godine u godinu sve popularnije turistièko odredi&scaron;te, te je ovaj apartman idealan za iznajmljivanje, ali i za vlastito u¾ivanje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Meðunarodni aerodrom udaljen je 30 min. vo¾nje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za sve dodatne informacije slobodno nas kontaktirajte.</p>', '<p>We are pleased to offer this attractive apartment in a great location close to the city center and all facilities.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is situated on the ground floor of this building, 600 m from the sea.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The apartment consists of bedroom, living room, kitchen with dinning room, bathroom and pantry with total living area of 45 sqm.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There is also small cultivated garden in front of the balcony of 5 sqm used only by the owners of this apartment.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the top of the building is terrace with partial sea view.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>All furniture is included in the price.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The apartment has connections to water and electricity.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Parking is in front of the building.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The International Airport is 30 minutes drive.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The apartment is in a location that is very attractive for both peaceful and comfortable living, and also suitable for tourist rental.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact the office to arrange to see this property.</p>', '', '1236_Apartment_0.jpg', '1236_Apartment_1.jpg', '1236_Apartment_2.jpg', '1236_Apartment_3.jpg', '1236_Apartment_4.jpg', '1236_Apartment_5.jpg', '1236_Apartment_6.jpg', '1236_Apartment_7.jpg', '1236_Apartment_8.jpg'),
(1237, 'Antun ', 'Gondi', '098 343322', ' Ivana Ripli 099 5130905', 'gondi@vt.t-com.hr ', 'Brac', 'Ulica Stara cesta Bol', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '500', '0', '52', 1, '125000', '', 2, 1, 2, 2, 1, 2, 1, 1, 'June 19, 2015', '<p>Posljednji stan u zgradi!&nbsp;Lijepi jednosobni stan u potkrovlju manje stambene zgrade, sa velikom terasom i otvorenim pogledom na more.&nbsp;Zgrada se nalazi u mjestu sa ju¾ne strane otoka, oko 500 metara od centra i prekrasnih pla¾a.&nbsp;Sastoji se od spavaæe sobe, kupaonice, dnevnog boravka s blagovaonicom i kuhinjom, ukupne stambene povr&scaron;ine 52 m2.&nbsp;Stan je kompletno namje&scaron;ten.</p>', '<p>Last unit in the building!&nbsp;Lovely 1-bedroom apartment in the attick with large terrace and great sea views.&nbsp;The building is located in a town from the south side of Brac island, about 500 meters from the center and lovely beaches.&nbsp;It consists of bedroom, bathroom, living room with dinning room and the kitchen, total living area 52 sqm.&nbsp;Apartment is fully furnished.&nbsp;</p>', '', '<p>Posljednji stan u zgradi!</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Lijepi jednosobni stan u potkrovlju manje stambene zgrade, sa velikom terasom i otvorenim pogledom na more.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Zgrada se nalazi u mjestu sa ju¾ne strane otoka, oko 500 metara od centra i prekrasnih pla¾a.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sastoji se od spavaæe sobe, kupaonice, dnevnog boravka s blagovaonicom i kuhinjom, ukupne stambene povr&scaron;ine 52 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Stan je kompletno namje&scaron;ten.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ima pristup vozilom i parking, te svu potrebnu infrastrukturu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Stan u namje&scaron;ten te predstavlja dobru priliku za kupnju, kako za osobnu uporabu tako i za turistièki najam.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Otok Braè povezan je svakodnevnom trajektnom linijom sa gradom Splitom, dok je meðunarodni aerodrom udaljen 40 minuta vo¾nje od Splita.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Molimo kontaktirajte nas za sve dodatne informacije.</p>', '<p>Last unit in the building!</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Lovely 1-bedroom apartment in the attick with large terrace and great sea views.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The building is located in a town from the south side of Brac island, about 500 meters from the center and lovely beaches.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It consists of bedroom, bathroom, living room with dinning room and the kitchen, total living area 52 sqm.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartment is fully furnished.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It has car access and parking place.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>All necessary infrastructure is present.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It represents a smart purchase for either private use or as buy-to-let property.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Near this property are coffee bars, bakery and other services, for tourists and residents.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>This property presents a unique opportunity for someone who wants to create a peaceful life or spend their holiday in one of the most beautiful areas of the island.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The island of Brac is connected by daily ferry lines to Split, while the international airport is 40 minutes drive from Split.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact us for more information and to arrange to visit the property.</p>', '', '1237_Apartment_0.jpg', '1237_Apartment_1.jpg', '1237_Apartment_2.jpg', '1237_Apartment_3.jpg', '1237_Apartment_4.jpg', '1237_Apartment_5.jpg', '1237_Apartment_6.jpg', '1237_Apartment_7.jpg', '1237_Apartment_8.jpg');
