(1238, 'Antun ', 'Gondi', '098 343322', 'Ivana Ripli 099 5130905', 'gondi@vt.t-com.hr', 'Brac', 'Ul.hrvatskih domobrana 17 Bol', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '500', '0', '0', 1, '117500', '', 2, 1, 2, 2, 1, 2, 2, 1, 'June 19, 2015', '<p>Lijepi apartmani u novogradnji sa ju¾ne strane otoka Braèa, svega 500 metara od centra mjesta i pla¾a.&nbsp;Svaki se apartman sastoji od dnavnog boravka, kuhinje, dvije spavaæe sobe i terase. Parkirali&scaron;no mjesto postoji za svaki stan. Povr&scaron;ine apartmana iznose od 55,35 m2 - 59,71 m2, dok cijene se¾u od 117.500 - 125.000 EUR.&nbsp;Stanovi predstavljaju dobru priliku za kupnju, kako za osobnu uporabu tako i za turistièki najam.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>Lovely 2 bedroom apartments&nbsp;on the south side of Brac island, at only 500 meters from the center and beaches.&nbsp;Each unit consists of a living room, kitchen, two bedrooms and terrace. A parking place comes with every apartment. Living area of the apartments from 55,35 sq.m - 59,71 sq.m, and prices from 117.500 - 125.000 EUR.&nbsp;It represents a smart purchase for either private use or as buy-to-let property.&nbsp;</p>', '', '<p>Lijepi dovosobni stanovi.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Lijepi apartmani u novogradnji sa ju¾ne strane otoka Braèa, svega 500 metara od centra mjesta i pla¾a.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Svaki se apartman sastoji od dnavnog boravka, kuhinje, dvije spavaæe sobe i terase.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Parkirali&scaron;no mjesto postoji za svaki stan.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Apartman 1: prizemlje, 55,35 m2, vrt 112,05 m2, bez pogleda, 125.000 EUR</strong></p>\r\n<p><strong><br /></strong></p>\r\n<p><strong>Apartman 2: prizemlje, 59,71 m2, pogled na more, 120.000 EUR</strong></p>\r\n<p><strong><br /></strong></p>\r\n<p><strong>Apartman 5: drugi kat, 58,68 m2, pogled na more, 117.500 EUR</strong></p>\r\n<p><strong><br /></strong></p>\r\n<p>Stanovi predstavljaju dobru priliku za kupnju, kako za osobnu uporabu tako i za turistièki najam.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Otok Braè povezan je svakodnevnom trajektnom linijom sa gradom Splitom, dok je meðunarodni aerodrom udaljen 40 minuta vo¾nje od Splita.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Molimo kontaktirajte nas za sve dodatne informacije.</p>', '<p>Lovely 2 bedroom apartments.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Lovely apartments on the south side of Brac island, at only 500 meters from the center and beaches.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Each unit consists of a living room, kitchen, two bedrooms and terrace.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>A parking place comes with every apartment.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Apartment 1: ground floor, 55,35 sq.m, garden 112,05 sq.m, no views, 125.000 EUR</strong></p>\r\n<p><strong><br /></strong></p>\r\n<p><strong>Apartment 2: ground floor, 59,71 sq.m, sea views, 120.000 EUR</strong></p>\r\n<p><strong><br /></strong></p>\r\n<p><strong>Apartment 5: second floor, 58,68 sq.m, sea views, 117.500 EUR</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>All necessary infrastructure is present.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It represents a smart purchase for either private use or as buy-to-let property.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Near this property are coffee bars, bakery and other services, for tourists and residents.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>This property presents a unique opportunity for someone who wants to create a peaceful life or spend their holiday in one of the most beautiful areas of the island.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The island of Brac is connected by daily ferry lines to Split, while the international airport is 40 minutes drive from Split.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact us for more information and to arrange to visit the property.</p>', '', '1238_Apartment_0.jpg', '1238_Apartment_1.jpg', '1238_Apartment_2.jpg', '1238_Apartment_3.jpg', '1238_Apartment_4.jpg', '1238_Apartment_5.jpg', '1238_Apartment_6.jpg', '1238_Apartment_7.jpg', '1238_Apartment_8.jpg'),
(1239, 'Tolan', 'Radica', '', '098 829 721', 'tolan.radica@zg.htnet.hr ', 'Brac', 'Milna, Brac', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '300', '582', '172', 1, '250000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 4, 2, 'June 19, 2015', '<p>Lijepa kuæa smje&scaron;tena nedaleko od najzapadnijeg mjesta na otoku Braèu.&nbsp;Kuæa je udaljena od mora 300 m.&nbsp;Sastoji se od prizemlja i kata ukupne stambene povr&scaron;ine 172 m2, dok zemlji&scaron;te na kojem je smje&scaron;tena ima povr&scaron;inu 582 m2.&nbsp;Vlasnik prodaje i dva graðevinska zemlji&scaron;ta u neposrednoj blizini.&nbsp;Ova nekretnina predstavlja jedinstvenu priliku za nekoga tko ¾eli stvoriti miran ¾ivot ili provoditi odmor u jednom od najljep&scaron;ih podruèja na otoku.</p>', '<p>A lovely house nearby the westmost village on Brac island.&nbsp;The house is located 300 m from the sea.&nbsp;It consists of ground floor and 1st floor, total living area 172 sqm, while the land plot measures 582 sqm.&nbsp;The owner has 2 nearby building plots to sell too.&nbsp;The house has inner and outer fire place. Nice views onto the sea and the village spread from the first floor.&nbsp;It takes less than 10 min on foot to reach the center of the village.&nbsp;</p>', '', '<p>Lijepa kuæa smje&scaron;tena nedaleko od najzapadnijeg mjesta na otoku Braèu.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je udaljena od mora 300 m.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sastoji se od prizemlja i kata ukupne stambene povr&scaron;ine 172 m2, dok zemljið&scaron;te na kojem je smje&scaron;tena ima povr&scaron;inu 582 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U prizemlju objekta nalazi se stan (renoviran 2005.) sa 2 spavaæe sobe, kupaonicom, kuhinjom i dnevnim boravkom te jo&scaron; jedan jednosobni stan (interijer nedovr&scaron;en).&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na prvom katu nalazi se treæi stan sa 2 spavaæe sobe, kupaonicom, kuhinjom, dnevnim boravkom i terasom (70 m2) sa koje se pru¾a lijepi pogled na more i mjesto.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Vrt je hortikulturno ureðen.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Do centra mjesta ima manje od 10 min ugodnog hoda.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Vlasnik prodaje i dva graðevinska zemlji&scaron;ta u neposrednoj blizini.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ova nekretnina predstavlja jedinstvenu priliku za nekoga tko ¾eli stvoriti miran ¾ivot ili provoditi odmor u jednom od najljep&scaron;ih podruèja na otoku.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Otok Braè povezan je svakodnevnom trajektnom linijom sa gradom Splitom, dok je meðunarodni aerodrom udaljen 40 minuta vo¾nje od Splita.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Molimo kontaktirajte nas za sve dodatne informacije.</p>', '<p>A lovely house nearby the westmost village on Brac island.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house is located 300 m from the sea.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It consists of ground floor and 1st floor, total living area 172 sqm, while the land plot measures 582 sqm.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ground floor features 2-bedroom 1-bathroom apartment (renovated in 2005) as well as another 1-bedroom apartment (yet unfinished).&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the first floor there is another unit with 2 bedrooms, living room, kitchen, bathroom and terrace (70 sqm).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house has inner and outer fire place.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Garden is landscaped.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nice views onto the sea and the village spread from the first floor.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It takes less than 10 min on foot to reach the center of the village.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The owner has 2 nearby building plots to sell too.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The island of Brac is connected by daily ferry lines to Split, while the international airport is 40 minutes drive from Split.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact us for more information and to arrange to visit the property.</p>', '', '1239_House-Villa_0.JPG', '1239_House-Villa_1.JPG', '1239_House-Villa_2.JPG', '1239_House-Villa_3.JPG', '1239_House-Villa_4.JPG', '1239_House-Villa_5.JPG', '1239_House-Villa_6.JPG', '1239_House-Villa_7.JPG', '1239_House-Villa_8.jpg'),
(1240, 'Ana ', '©tambuk', 'Ana ©tambuk, 021 632 633, 095 880 7088', 'Miljenko (suprug) 098 192 1245', 'ana.stambuk@st.t-com.hr', 'Brac', 'Punta II / 26 Splitska, Braè, k.c. 199/188 k.o. splitska', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '180', '425', '240', 1, '300000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 8, 4, 'June 19, 2015', '<p>Apartmanska kuæa smje&scaron;tena u malom mjestu nedaleko od trajekte luke u Supetru.&nbsp;Kuæa je udaljena od mora 180 m.&nbsp;Kuæa se prostire na 3 eta¾e te ima 4 stambene jedinice, ukupne stambene povr&scaron;ine 240 m2, dok zemlji&scaron;te na kojem je smje&scaron;tena ima povr&scaron;inu 425 m2.&nbsp;Svi stanovi imaju dvije spavaæe sobe, kupaonicu, kuhinju i dnevni boravak te terasu.&nbsp;Kuæu okru¾uje odr¾avani vrt sa mediteranskim raslinjem, a na posjedu se nalazi i gara¾a te parking za 3 automobila.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>An apartment house located in a small village not far from the island''s main ferry port.&nbsp;It is located 180 m from the sea.&nbsp;The house has 3 floors and 4 units altogether, total living area of 240 sqm, while the land plot measures 425 sqm.&nbsp;All apartments have 2 bedrooms, bathroom, kitchen/living room and terrace.&nbsp;The property is surrounded by well kept garden, featuring garage and parking for 3 cars.&nbsp;</p>', '', '<p>Apartmanska kuæa smje&scaron;tena u malom mjestu nedaleko od trajekte luke u Supetru.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je udaljena od mora 180 m.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa se prostire na 3 eta¾e te ima 4 stambene jedinice, ukupne stambene povr&scaron;ine 240 m2, dok zemlji&scaron;te na kojem je smje&scaron;tena ima povr&scaron;inu 425 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Svi stanovi imaju dvije spavaæe sobe, kupaonicu, kuhinju i dnevni boravak te terasu.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæu okru¾uje odr¾avani vrt sa mediteranskim raslinjem, a na posjedu se nalazi i gara¾a te parking za 3 automobila.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nekretnina im pogled na more i mjesto.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa ima visok potencijal za turistièki najam. &nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ova nekretnina predstavlja jedinstvenu priliku za nekoga tko ¾eli stvoriti miran ¾ivot ili provoditi odmor u jednom od najljep&scaron;ih podruèja na otoku.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Supetar koji je povezan svakodnevnom trajektnom linijom sa gradom Splitom udaljen je 6 km, dok je meðunarodni aerodrom udaljen 40 minuta vo¾nje od Splita.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Molimo kontaktirajte nas za sve dodatne informacije.</p>', '<p>An apartment house located in a small village not far from the island''s main ferry port.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is located 180 m from the sea.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house has 3 floors and 4 units altogether, total living area of 240 sqm, while the land plot measures 425 sqm.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>All apartments have 2 bedrooms, bathroom, kitchen/living room and terrace.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property is surrounded by well kept garden, featuring garage and parking for 3 cars.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property overlooks the village and offers nice sea views.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house has high rental potential.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Supetar is 6 km away and it is connected by daily ferry lines to Split, while the international airport is 40 minutes drive from Split.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact us for more information and to arrange to visit the property.</p>', '', '1240_House-Villa_0.jpg', '1240_House-Villa_1.jpg', '1240_House-Villa_2.jpg', '1240_House-Villa_3.jpg', '1240_House-Villa_4.jpg', '1240_House-Villa_5.jpg', '1240_House-Villa_6.jpg', '1240_House-Villa_7.jpg', '1240_House-Villa_8.jpg'),
(1241, '', 'Visibaba d.o.o.', 'Herbert Houben, osnivaè, +32 89 300710', 'Marko Vrljièak, direktor &#8211; 098 175 2902 ', 'vrljicak.marko@gmail.com', 'Omis', 'Mije Mimice 2a, Mimice Mimice, k.è. 5638/1 k.o. Rogoznica ZU 3823', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '500', '569', '0', 1, '245000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 1, 0, 0, 'June 19, 2015', '<p>Lijepa manja stambena zgrada sa izvrsnim pogledom na more, na mirnoj lokaciji blizu ruba graðevne zone.&nbsp;Zgrada se nalazi 500 m od mora.&nbsp;Zajednièki prostori ukljuèuju parkirali&scaron;no mjesto te bazen sa terasom za sunèanje. Okoli&scaron; je ureðen i odr¾avan. Svi stanovi su u cijelosti opremljeni (kategorizirani 3*), a namje&scaron;taj je ukljuèen u cijenu. Svaki stan zauzima cijeli kat zgrade.&nbsp;Ukupna bruto povr&scaron;ina apartmana je 192 m2, dok zemlji&scaron;te na kojem je zgrada smje&scaron;tena ima povr&scaron;inu 569 m2.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>Lovely low-rise building with exceptional sea view. Peaceful location near the edge of the building zone.&nbsp;The building is located 500 m from the sea.&nbsp;Communal areas include parking place and outdoor pool with sundeck. The garden is landscaped and well maintained. All units are fully furnished (included in the price). Each apartment occupies the whole floor of the building.&nbsp;Total gross is 192m sq, while the land plot measures 569m sq.</p>', '', '<p>Lijepa manja stambena zgrada sa izvrsnim pogledom na more, na mirnoj lokaciji blizu ruba graðevne zone.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Zgrada se nalazi 500 m od mora.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Zajednièki prostori ukljuèuju parkirali&scaron;no mjesto te bazen sa terasom za sunèanje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Okoli&scaron; je ureðen i odr¾avan.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Svi stanovi su u cijelosti opremljeni (kategorizirani 3*), a namje&scaron;taj je ukljuèen u cijenu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Svaki stan zauzima cijeli kat zgrade.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ukupna bruto povr&scaron;ina apartmana je 192 m2, dok zemlji&scaron;te na kojem je zgrada smje&scaron;tena ima povr&scaron;inu 569 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Prizemlje</strong>: stan sa tri spavaæe sobe, tri kupaonice, otvorenim prostorom dnevnog boravka i kuhinje te velikom terasom sa ju¾ne strane, 99 m2, &euro;245.000</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Prvi kat</strong>: stan sa dvije spavaæe sobe, dvije kupaonice, &nbsp;otvorenim prostorom dnevnog boravka i kuhinje te terasom sa ju¾ne strane, 86,56 m2, &euro;265.000</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Drugi kat</strong>: stan sa dvije spavaæe sobe, dvije kupaonice, &nbsp;otvorenim prostorom dnevnog boravka i kuhinje te terasom sa ju¾ne strane, 75,21 m2, &euro;270.000</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Treæi kat (potkrovlje)</strong>: stan sa dvije spavaæe sobe, dvije kupaonice, &nbsp;otvorenim prostorom dnevnog boravka i kuhinje te terasom sa ju¾ne strane, 73,66 m2, &euro;275.000</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Svi potrebni sadr¾aji se nalaze u blizini.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Do meðunarodnog aerodroma je potrebno 1h vo¾nje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za sve dodatne informacije i razgledavanje molimo da nas kontaktirate.</p>', '<p>Lovely low-rise building with exceptional sea view.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Peaceful location near the edge of the building zone.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The building is located 500 m from the sea.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Communal areas include parking place and outdoor pool with sundeck. &nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The garden is landscaped and well maintained.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>All units are fully furnished (included in the price).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Each apartment occupies the whole floor of the building. &nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Total gross is 192m sq, while the land plot measures 569m sq.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Ground floor</strong>: 3 bedrooms, 3 bathrooms, open plan living room and kitchen, large south-oriented terrace, 99 sq.m internal + 116 sq.m supplements, 245.000 EUR</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>First floor</strong>: 2 bedrooms, 2 bathrooms, open plan living room and kitchen, south-oriented terrace, 86,56 sq.m internal + 23,95 sq.m supplements, 265.000 EUR</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Second floor</strong>: 2 bedrooms, 2 bathrooms, open plan living room and kitchen, south-oriented terrace, 75,21 sq.m internal + 33,83 sq.m supplements, 270.000 EUR</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Third floor (attick)</strong>: 2 bedrooms, 2 bathrooms, open plan living room and kitchen, south-oriented terrace, 73,66 sq.m internal + 32,34 sq.m supplements, 275.000 EUR</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The town of Omis is very much ''geared up'' to tourists and it provide a range of shops, and good restaurants to explore.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The international airport is 1 hour drive.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For additional information and a tour please contact us.</p>', '', '1241_Apartment_0.JPG', '1241_Apartment_1.JPG', '1241_Apartment_2.JPG', '1241_Apartment_3.JPG', '1241_Apartment_4.JPG', '1241_Apartment_5.JPG', '1241_Apartment_6.JPG', '1241_Apartment_7.JPG', '1241_Apartment_8.JPG'),
(1242, '', 'Visibaba d.o.o.', 'Herbert Houben, osnivaè, +32 89 300710', 'Marko Vrljièak, direktor &#8211; 098 175 2902 ', 'vrljicak.marko@gmail.com', 'Omis', 'Mije Mimice 2c, Mimice Mimice, k.è. 5637 k.o. Rogoznica ZU 3440', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '500', '550', '0', 1, '300000', '', 2, 1, 2, 2, 1, 1, 3, 2, 'June 19, 2015', '<p>Lijepa manja stambena zgrada sa izvrsnim pogledom na more, na mirnoj lokaciji blizu ruba graðevne zone. Zajednièki prostori ukljuèuju parkirali&scaron;no mjesto te bazen sa terasom za sunèanje. Okoli&scaron; je ureðen i odr¾avan. Svi stanovi su u cijelosti opremljeni (kategorizirani 3*), a namje&scaron;taj je ukljuèen u cijenu. Svaki stan povr&scaron;ine 71,60 m2 zauzima cijeli kat zgrade. Cijene od &euro;300.000 do &euro;350.000.</p>', '<p>Lovely low-rise building with exceptional sea view. Peaceful location near the edge of the building zone. Communal areas include parking place and outdoor pool with sundeck. The garden is landscaped and well maintained. All units are fully furnished (included in the price). Each apartment of 71,60m sq occupies the whole floor of the building. The prices range from &euro;300.000 - &euro;350.000.<br /><br /></p>', '', '<p>Lijepa manja stambena zgrada sa izvrsnim pogledom na more, na mirnoj lokaciji blizu ruba graðevne zone.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Zajednièki prostori ukljuèuju parkirali&scaron;no mjesto te bazen sa terasom za sunèanje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Okoli&scaron; je ureðen i odr¾avan.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Svi stanovi su u cijelosti opremljeni (kategorizirani 3*), a namje&scaron;taj je ukljuèen u cijenu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Svaki stan zauzima cijeli kat zgrade.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Svi su stanovi isti u strukturi, a stastoje se od: dvije dvokrevetne sobe, jedne jednokrevetne sobe, dvije kupaonice, otvorenog prostora dnevnog boravka i kuhinje te terase.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Prizemni stan umjesto terase ima ograðeno poploèano dvori&scaron;te.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Prizemlje: 71,60 m2 stambene povr&scaron;ine + 12,40 terasa, 350.000 EUR</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Prvi kat</strong><strong>: 71,60 m2 stambene povr&scaron;ine + 12,40 terasa, 300.000 EUR</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Drugi kat</strong><strong>: 71,60 m2 stambene povr&scaron;ine + 12,40 terasa, 300.000 EUR</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Treæi kat (potkrovlje)</strong><strong>: 71,60 m2 stambene povr&scaron;ine + 12,40 terasa, 300.000 EUR</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Svi potrebni sadr¾aji se nalaze u blizini.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Do meðunarodnog aerodroma je potrebno 1h vo¾nje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za sve dodatne informacije i razgledavanje molimo da nas kontaktirate.</p>', '<p>Lovely low-rise building with exceptional sea view.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Peaceful location near the edge of the building zone.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Communal areas include parking place and outdoor pool with sundeck. &nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The garden is landscaped and well maintained.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>All units are fully furnished (included in the price).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Each apartment occupies the whole floor of the building. &nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>All units have the same in structure &ndash; 2 double bedrooms, 1 single bedroom, 2 bathrooms, open-plan living area and kitchen, large terrace.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Exceptionally, the ground floor unit has its own garden, instead of the terrace.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Ground floor</strong><strong>: 71,60 sq.m internal + 12,40 sq.m terrace, 350.000 EUR</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>First floor: 71,60 sq.m internal + 12,40 sq.m terrace, 300.000 EUR</strong></p>\r\n<p><strong><br /></strong></p>\r\n<p><strong>Second floor: 71,60 sq.m internal + 12,40 sq.m terrace, 300.000 EUR</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Third floor (attick)</strong><strong>: 71,60 sq.m internal + 12,40 sq.m terrace, 300.000 EUR</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The town of Omis is very much ''geared up'' to tourists and it provide a range of shops, and good restaurants to explore.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The international airport is 1 hour drive.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For additional information and a tour please contact us.</p>', '', '1242_Apartment_0.JPG', '1242_Apartment_1.JPG', '1242_Apartment_2.JPG', '1242_Apartment_3.JPG', '1242_Apartment_4.JPG', '1242_Apartment_5.JPG', '1242_Apartment_6.JPG', '1242_Apartment_7.JPG', '1242_Apartment_8.jpg'),
(1243, 'Robert i Franci', 'Lukiæ', '099-6824816 ( TAMARA LUKIÆ)', '', 'jabuka3@net.hr', 'Solta', 'PETRA HEKTOROVIÆA 23, NEÈUJAM  NEÈUJAM, Br.zk.ul.1395 k.o. Grohote', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '200', '600', '119', 1, '220000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 2, 1, 'June 19, 2015', '<p>Samostojeæa kuæa na dvije eta¾e, tlocrtne povr&scaron;ine 120 m2, sagraðena na parceli povr&scaron;ine 600 m2.&nbsp;Okuænicu èini prekrasan mediteranski vrt (masline, limuni, mandarine&hellip;..) dok je dvori&scaron;te poploèeno autohtonim kamenom.&nbsp;Oko cijele parcele su kameni zidiæi.&nbsp;U prizemlju korisne povr&scaron;ine 47.92 m2 nalaze se spremi&scaron;te i konoba s wc-om i gara¾om.&nbsp;Posjed je od mora udaljen oko 200 m i ima prekrasan pogled na more.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>The property is situated 200m from the shore, a mixture of rocks and pebble beaches, with crystal clear water and a place safe for swimming and for children to play. The layout inside the house has 119.90 m2, and the property was built on a plot of 600 m2. Around the house there are many trees including a beautiful Mediterranean garden (olives, lemons, tangerines ... ..) and a patio yard which is paved with indigenous stone. Around the whole plot are stone walls.&nbsp;</p>', '', '<p>Samostojeæa kuæa na dvije eta¾e, tlocrtne povr&scaron;ine 120 m2, sagraðena na parceli povr&scaron;ine 600 m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Okuænicu èini prekrasan mediteranski vrt (masline, limuni, mandarine&hellip;..) dok je dvori&scaron;te poploèeno autohtonim kamenom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Oko cijele parcele su kameni zidiæi.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U prizemlju korisne povr&scaron;ine 47.92 m2 nalaze se spremi&scaron;te i konoba s wc-om i gara¾om.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U prizemlju se nalazi i cisterna za pitku vodu, zapremnine cca 16 m3, iz koje se crpi voda sa terase na prvom katu.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na prvom katu se nalazi stambeni prostor, u potpunosti ureðen i namje&scaron;ten, (namje&scaron;taj je ukljuèen u cijenu kuæe) korisne stambene povr&scaron;ine 75.25 m2, s pripadajuæom terasom povr&scaron;ine 38.40 m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Stambeni prostor èine dnevni dio s blagovaonicom i kuhinjom, sprema, ulazni hodnik, WC s tu&scaron; kadom te dvije spavaæe sobe.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Posjed je od mora udaljen oko 200 m i ima prekrasan pogled na more.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Vlasni&scaron;tvo uredno, cjelokupna infrastruktura.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa ima pristup vozilom i parking.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Orijentacija I-Z.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&Scaron;olta ima redovne trajektne i brodske linije sa Splitom kroz cijelu godinu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Mjesto je udaljeno od trajektne luke 10 km.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Molimo za sve dodatne informacije kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured.</p>', '<p>The property is situated 200m from the shore, a mixture of rocks and pebble beaches, with crystal clear water and a place safe for swimming and for children to play.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The layout inside the house &nbsp;has 119.90 m2, and the property was built on a plot of 600 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Around the house there are many trees including a beautiful Mediterranean garden (olives, lemons, tangerines ... ..) and a patio yard which is paved with indigenous stone.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Around the whole plot are stone walls.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The orientation is West/East.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the ground floor, there is a usable area of 47.92 m2, used as a store and a cellar with a toilet and a garage.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the ground floor there is a tank which holds the drinking water, a volume about 16 m3, from which it draws water from the terrace on the first floor.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the first floor there is a living area, fully furnished, (the furniture is included in the price of the house) with a floor area of 75.25 m2, and with a large terrace of 38.40 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The living area consists of living room, dining room and kitchen, storage room, entrance hall, bathroom with shower and two bedrooms.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There is electricity and the property is connected to the drains.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact our office to arrange to visit this property.&nbsp;</p>', '', '1243_House-Villa_0.JPG', '1243_House-Villa_1.jpg', '1243_House-Villa_2.JPG', '1243_House-Villa_3.JPG', '1243_House-Villa_4.JPG', '1243_House-Villa_5.JPG', '1243_House-Villa_6.JPG', '1243_House-Villa_7.jpg', '1243_House-Villa_8.jpg'),
(1244, 'Tom', 'Wheltle', '+12406028003  ', ' +13019242691', 'twheltle@wheltle.com', 'Trogir', 'Ulica Kralja Zvonimira 16  Okrug Gornji, 1363zgr  673/15 9.eta¾a', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '400', '0', '34', 2, '45000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 1, 1, 'June 19, 2015', '<p>Simpatièan apartman na 2.katu u potkrovlju zgrade smje&scaron;tene na ju¾noj dijelu Èiova koji je ujedno i najpopularniji dio.&nbsp;Orijentacija je jugozapadna, ali se iz apartmana ne pru¾a pogled na more. Pogled na umanjuje njegov potencijal za ulaganje ukoliko usporedimo polo¾aj i cijenu.&nbsp;Ukupna povr&scaron;ina iznosi 34 m2, dok je u cijenu ukljuèeno i 1 parking mjesto ispred zgrade.&nbsp;Potpuno je klimatiziran i namje&scaron;ten, te se trenutno koristi u svrhu turistièkog iznajmljivanja.</p>', '<p>We are offering this apartment on the 2nd floor (top) of a building located on the popular south part of Ciovo. The orientation is south-west, but the apartment does not overlook the sea, which is the reason the price is so low. The total area is 34 m2.&nbsp;The price includes one private parking place in front of the building. Inside the apartment there is a kitchen and living room, with access to the balcony, bathroom, bedroom. The property is fully air-conditioned and furnished, and is currently used for tourist rental.</p>', '', '<p>Simpatièan apartman na 2.katu u potkrovlju zgrade smje&scaron;tene na ju¾noj dijelu Èiova koji je ujedno i najpopularniji dio.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Orijentacija je jugozapadna, ali se iz apartmana ne pru¾a pogled na more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Pogled na umanjuje njegov potencijal za ulaganje ukoliko usporedimo polo¾aj i cijenu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ukupna povr&scaron;ina iznosi 34 m2, dok je u cijenu ukljuèeno i 1 parking mjesto ispred zgrade.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartman se sastoji od kuhinje sa dnevnim boravkom, kupaonice, spavaæe sobe i malog balkona.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Potpuno je klimatiziran i namje&scaron;ten, te se trenutno koristi u svrhu turistièkog iznajmljivanja.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Najbli¾a pla¾a udaljena je 400 m &scaron;to je cca. 10 minuta hodanja.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Centar mjesta sa svim sadr¾ajima se takoðer nalazi u blizini, dok je meðunarodni aerodrom udaljen 20 min. vo¾nje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Stojimo na usluzi za sva dodatna pitanja.</p>', '<p>We are offering this apartment on the 2nd floor (top) of a building located on the popular south part of Ciovo.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The orientation is south-west, but the apartment does not overlook the sea, which is the reason the price is so low.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The total area is 34 m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The price includes one private parking place in front of the building.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Inside the apartment there is a kitchen and living room, with access to the balcony, bathroom, bedroom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property is fully air-conditioned and furnished, and is currently used for tourist rental.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It has modern fittings in the bathroom and kitchen, attractive stone floor and is well decorated.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The nearest beach is 400 m, which is approx. 10 minutes of walking, and here is a safe place for swimming and for young children to enjoy the water.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The centre with shops, bars, cafes and all facilities is also located nearby, while the international airport is 20 minutes driving.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>We are at your disposal for any additional questions and to arrange for clients to view this property.</p>', '', '1244_Apartment_0.JPG', '1244_Apartment_1.JPG', '1244_Apartment_2.JPG', '1244_Apartment_3.JPG', '1244_Apartment_4.JPG', '1244_Apartment_5.JPG', '1244_Apartment_6.JPG', '1244_Apartment_7.JPG', '1244_Apartment_8.JPG'),
(1245, 'Zlatica ', 'Cerovac', '021 797 283', '099 7889 856', '', 'Trogir', 'Obala Mira Bare¹iæa 93 Seget Vranjica, ZU 2729, k.è. 433 k.o. seget donji', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '30', '620', '550', 1, '800000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 1, 9, 7, 'June 19, 2015', '<p>Lijepa apartmanska kuæa drugi red od mora u malom mjestu 6 km udaljenom od Trogira.&nbsp;Kuæa je udaljena od mora samo 20 m.&nbsp;Stambena povr&scaron;ina kuæe iznosi 550 m2, dok je povr&scaron;ina zemlji&scaron;ta 620 m2.&nbsp;Sa uliène razine nalaze se gara¾na mjesta te prostorija sa kotlovnicom.&nbsp;Sa stra¾nje strane objekta smje&scaron;ten je veliki bazen. Kuæa se nalazi u mirnom dijelu mjesta, a sa brojih terasa oko objekta pru¾a se pogled na more.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>This spatious apartment house is located in the second line to the sea, in a small charming village only 6 km from Trogir.&nbsp;The house is distant only 20 m from the sea.&nbsp;Living space of the house is 550m sq, while the land plot measures 620m sq.&nbsp;Garages and heating room are accessed from the street level. Big swimming pool is at the back side of the house.&nbsp;Numerous terraces around the house offer great sea views. &nbsp;</p>', '', '<p>Lijepa apartmanska kuæa drugi red od mora u malom mjestu 6 km udaljenom od Trogira.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je udaljena od mora samo 20 m.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Stambena povr&scaron;ina kuæe iznosi 550 m2, dok je povr&scaron;ina zemlji&scaron;ta 620 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sa uliène razine nalaze se gara¾na mjesta te prostorija sa kotlovnicom.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U prizemlju objekta nalazi se veliki stan sa tri spavaæe sobe i dvije kupaonice.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Pokraj njega smje&scaron;tena su dva jednosobna apartmana.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na katu kuæe nalaze se dva jednosobna i jedan dvosobni apartman.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sa stra¾nje strane objekta smje&scaron;ten je veliki bazen.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa se nalazi u mirnom dijelu mjesta, a sa brojih terasa oko objekta pru¾a se pogled na more.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Grad Trogir udaljen je 6 km, dok se u mjestu nalaze svi potrebni sadr¾aji.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Meðunarodni aerodrom Split udaljen je 10 km.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Molimo kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured za sve dodatne informacije.</p>', '<p>This spatious apartment house is located in the second line to the sea, in a small charming village only 6 km from Trogir. &nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house is distant only 20 m from the sea.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Living space of the house is 550m sq, while the land plot measures 620m sq.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Garages and heating room are accessed from the street level.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the elevated ground floor there is a large 3-bedroom 2-bathroom apartment.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Next to it, there are two 1-bedroom apartments.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>First floor contains two 1-bedroom and one 2-bedroom apartments.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Big swimming pool is at the back side of the house.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The area is quiet.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Numerous terraces around the house offer great sea views.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Trogir town is 6 km away and all necessary facilities are nearby.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The international airport Split is 10 km away.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact our office for the further information.</p>', '', '1245_House-Villa_0.jpg', '1245_House-Villa_1.jpg', '1245_House-Villa_2.jpg', '1245_House-Villa_3.jpg', '1245_House-Villa_4.jpg', '1245_House-Villa_5.jpg', '1245_House-Villa_6.jpg', '1245_House-Villa_7.jpg', '1245_House-Villa_8.jpg'),
(1246, '®ivko', 'Grgureviæ', '', '091 627 4482', '', 'Trogir', 'Mornarska 26 Seget Vranjica, k.è.681 ko.o seget donji, ZU 3842', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '60', '600', '495', 2, '350000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 3, 2, 'June 19, 2015', '<p>Obiteljska kuæa smje&scaron;tena 6 km od Trogira, u mirnom dijelu mjesta, orijentirana prema jugu sa predivnim pogledom na more.&nbsp;Udaljena je od mora samo 60 m.&nbsp;Sastoji se od prizemlja, prvog i drugog kata.&nbsp;Okuænica (600 m2) je velika te ima dovoljno mjesta za bazen.&nbsp;Pokraj kuæe nalaze se dvije gara¾e, parkirali&scaron;no mjesto te nekoliko pomoænih prostorija.&nbsp;Nova uplana je u tijeku, prema kojoj æe&nbsp;ukupno izgraðena bruto povr&scaron;ina biti 495 m2.&nbsp;<br /><br /></p>', '<p>This family house is located only 6 km from Trogir town. It is south-oriented, in a tranquil part of the village and features splendid sea views.&nbsp;House is situated 60 m from the sea.&nbsp;It consists of ground, first and second floor.&nbsp;The plot (600 sqm) is large enough to fit well-sized swimming pool.&nbsp;Next to the house there are two garages, parking place and several additional/utility rooms.&nbsp;New planning is in the process, according to which the total gross size of built areas will be 495 sq.m.</p>', '', '<p>Obiteljska kuæa smje&scaron;tena 6 km od Trogira, u mirnom dijelu mjesta, orijentirana prema jugu sa predivnim pogledom na more.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Udaljena je od mora samo 60 m.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sastoji se od prizemlja, prvog i drugog kata.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Prizemlje kuce nije provedeno funkciji.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na prvom katu nalaze se dnevni boravak, kuhinja sa blagovaonicom, spavaæa soba, kupaonica i velika teresa.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na drugom katu nalaze se dvije spavaæe sobe, kupaonica te velika nenatkrivena terasa.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Okuænica (600 m2) je velika te ima dovoljno mjesta za bazen.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Pokraj kuæe nalaze se dvije gara¾e, parkirali&scaron;no mjesto te nekoliko pomoænih prostorija.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nova uplana je u tijeku, prema kojoj æe ukupno izgraðena bruto povr&scaron;ina biti 495 m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je dobro graðena, a fasada izraðena od debelih kamenih blokova.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Unutra&scaron;njost kuæe potrebno je u cijelosti renovirati.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa ima svu potrebnu infrastrukturu, parking i gara¾u.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>S obzirom na poziciju i moguænosti koje kuæa renovacijom nudi, predstavlja dobru priliku za kupnju.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Grad Trogir udaljen je 6 km, dok se u mjestu nalaze svi potrebni sadr¾aji.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Meðunarodni aerodrom Split udaljen je 10 km.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Molimo kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured za sve dodatne informacije.</p>', '<p>This family house is located only 6 km from Trogir town.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is south-oriented, in a tranquil part of the village and features splendid sea views.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>House is situated 60 m from the sea.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It consists of ground, first and second floor.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The ground floor has not yet been brought to function.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the first floor there is a living room, kithchen with dining room, bathroom, bedrooms and large terrace.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Second floor contains two bedrooms, bathroom and large uncovered terrace.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The plot (600 sqm) is large enough to fit well-sized swimming pool.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Next to the house there are two garages, parking place and several additional/utility rooms.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>New planning is in the process, according to which the total gross size of built areas will be 495 sq.m.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Construction is sound and facade made of thick stone.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The interior needs full renovation.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Water and electricity are connected.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There is parking and garage.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Concerning its position and the possibilities the property would offer after the renovation, this house represent a smart purchase.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Trogir town is 6 km away and all necessary facilities are nearby.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The international airport Split is 10 km away.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact our office for the further information.</p>', '', '1246_House-Villa_0.jpg', '1246_House-Villa_1.jpg', '1246_House-Villa_2.jpg', '1246_House-Villa_3.jpg', '1246_House-Villa_4.jpg', '1246_House-Villa_5.jpg', '1246_House-Villa_6.jpg', '1246_House-Villa_7.jpg', '1246_House-Villa_8.jpg'),
(1247, 'Denis i Nediljk', '©krapiæ', '', '099 5783 548', 'denis.skrapic@gmail.com', 'Trogir', 'Put Punte 7 Seget vranjica, ZU 2545 k.o. seget donji', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '80', '320', '200', 1, '390000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 4, 3, 'June 19, 2015', '<p>Obiteljska kuæa na mirnoj lokaciji smje&scaron;tena u treæem redu od mora, orijentirana na jugozapad, na mirnoj lokaciji u malom mjestu nedaleko Trogira.&nbsp;Kuæa je udaljena od mora 80 m.&nbsp;Sastoji se od prizemlja i kata ukupne stambene povr&scaron;ine 200 m2, dok zemlji&scaron;te ima povr&scaron;inu 320 m2.&nbsp;Pokraj kuæe nalazi se mali jednosobni apartman (ca. 32 m2) sa zasebnim ulazom.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;">CIJENA SNI®ENA S 420.000 EURA!</span></p>', '<p>Family house in a quiet location, located in a third rown from the sea, southwest oriented, in a small peaceful village not far from Trogir town.&nbsp;House is situated 80 m from the sea.&nbsp;House consists of ground and first floor total living area of 200 sqm, while the land plot measures 320 sqm.&nbsp;Next to the house there is a small one bedroom apartment (ca. 32 sq.m) with separate entrance.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;">PRICE REDUCED FROM 420.000 EUROS!</span></p>', '', '<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;"><strong>CIJENA SNI®ENA S 420.000 EURA!</strong></span></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Obiteljska kuæa na mirnoj lokaciji smje&scaron;tena u treæem redu od mora, orijentirana na jugozapad, na mirnoj lokaciji u malom mjestu nedaleko Trogira.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je udaljena od mora 80 m.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sastoji se od prizemlja i kata ukupne stambene povr&scaron;ine 200 m2, dok zemlji&scaron;te ima povr&scaron;inu 320 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U prizemlju se nalaze kuhinja, dnevni boravak sa blagovaonicom, kupaonica, ostava i terasa.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na katu objekta nalaze se tri spavaæe sobe sa wc-om.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Pokraj kuæe nalazi se mali jednosobni apartman (ca. 32 m2) sa zasebnim ulazom.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Postoji parkirali&scaron;no mjesto, kao i gara¾a povr&scaron;ine 23 m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Okuænica je uredna i odr¾avana, a u dvori&scaron;tu postoje i dva vanjska tu&scaron;a.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Energetski razred: E.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je izgraðena 1980. godine.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Orijentacija J-Z.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa ima svu potrebnu infrastrukturu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Grad Trogir udaljen je 6 km, mjesto Vranjica 200 m.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Meðunarodni aerodrom Split udaljen je 10 km.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Molimo kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured za sve dodatne informacije.</p>', '<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;"><strong>PRICE REDUCED FROM 420.000 EUROS!</strong></span></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Family house in a quiet location, located in a third rown from the sea, southwest oriented, in a small peaceful village not far from Trogir town.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>House is situated 80 m from the sea.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>House consists of ground and first floor total living area of 200 sqm, while the land plot measures 320 sqm.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the ground floor there is a kitchen, living area with dining room, bathroom, storage and terrace.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the first floor there are 3 bedrooms and a toilet.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Next to the house there is a small one bedroom apartment (ca. 32 sq.m) with separate entrance.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There is aparking place as well as a 23 sq.m garage.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Garden is well kept and there are two outdoor summer showers.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Energy certificate: E.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house needs minor renovation and refurbishment.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house is built 1980.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Orientation S-W.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Water and electricity are connected.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Trogir town is 6 km away and all necessary facilities are nearby.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The international airport Split is 10 km away.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact our office for the further information.</p>', '', '1247_House-Villa_0.jpg', '1247_House-Villa_1.jpg', '1247_House-Villa_2.jpg', '1247_House-Villa_3.jpg', '1247_House-Villa_4.jpg', '1247_House-Villa_5.jpg', '1247_House-Villa_6.jpg', '1247_House-Villa_7.jpg', '1247_House-Villa_8.jpg'),
(1248, 'Dan', 'Wainwright', '', '00 44 207 381 4477', 'Dan@stdavidgroup.com', 'Trogir', 'Put Matice Hrvatske 36B  Mastrinka, Èiovo, 779/108 k.o. ®edno', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '350', '0', '37', 1, '60000', '', 2, 1, 2, 2, 1, 1, 1, 1, 'June 23, 2015', '<p style="color: #f5092a;"><strong>PREOSTALA SU SAMO DVA APARTMANA !!!</strong></p>\r\n<p style="color: #f5092a;">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style="color: #f5092a;"><strong>&nbsp;</strong><span style="color: #000000;">Apartmani na ekskluzivnoj lokaciji sa prekrasnim pogledom na cijeli zaljev od Trogira do Splita. Do mora i prekrasne pla¾e ima 350 m, ali apartmani takoðer imaju zajednièki bazen u dvori&scaron;tu zgrade.&nbsp;Smje&scaron;teni su na sjevernoj strani otoka Èiova u blizini mnogih sadr¾aja, povijesnog grada Trogira i meðunarodnog aerodroma. Svaki apartman je velièine 30,94 m2 + loggia 5,74 m2.</span></p>', '<p style="color: #f40a2b;"><strong>&nbsp;ONLY TWO LEFT !!!</strong></p>\r\n<p style="color: #f40a2b;"><span style="color: #000000;">We have this great opportunity to buy an apartment with swimming pool and private parking at a superb price. This is a selection of apartments in an exclusive location with a beautiful views of the bay and the coast from Trogir to Split. The sea and beautiful beach is 350 m, but the apartments also have a shared swimming pool in the courtyard. Each apartment has a size of 30.94 m2 + balcony 5.74 m2.&nbsp;</span></p>', '', '<p><strong style="color: #f9050a;">PREOSTALA SU SAMO DVA APARTMANA !!!</strong></p>\r\n<p><span style="color: #f9050a;"><strong><br /></strong></span></p>\r\n<p>Apartmani na ekskluzivnoj lokaciji sa prekrasnim pogledom na cijeli zaljev od Trogira do Splita.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Do mora i prekrasne pla¾e ima 350 m, ali apartmani takoðer imaju zajednièki bazen u dvori&scaron;tu zgrade.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;"><strong>APARTMAN S1: A &ndash; PRIZEMLJE &ndash; 60.000 &euro;</strong></span></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;"><strong>APARTMAN S5: A &ndash; DRUGI KAT &ndash; 65.000 &euro;</strong></span></p>\r\n<p><strong><br /></strong></p>\r\n<p>Smje&scaron;teni su na sjevernoj strani otoka Èiova u blizini mnogih sadr¾aja, povijesnog grada Trogira i meðunarodnog aerodroma.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Svaki apartman je velièine 30,94 m2 + loggia 5,74 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sastoje se od hodnika, kuhinje + blagovaonice + dnevnog boravka, kupaonice, spavaæe sobe i loggie.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Potpuno su namje&scaron;teni i klimatizirani.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U podrumu se nalazi po 1 ostava za svaki velièine cca. 5 m2, dok je ispred zgrade parking.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Lokacija je mirna bez mnogo prometa i drugih nekretnina u susjedstvu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartmani su trenutno u funkciji turistièkog iznajmljivanja stoga kupnja ovih apartmana mo¾e biti i dobra investicija.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong style="color: #f60841;">***NA ZAHTJEV &Scaron;ALJEMO DRONE FOTOGRAFIJE I KRATKE VIDEO ZAPISE</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Stojimo na usluzi za sva dodatna pitanja i informacije.</p>', '<p><strong style="color: #f9050f;">&nbsp;ONLY TWO LEFT !!!</strong></p>\r\n<p><strong style="color: #f40a21;"><br /></strong></p>\r\n<p>We have this great opportunity to buy an apartment with swimming pool and private parking at a superb price.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;"><strong>APARTMENT S1: A - GROUND FLOOR - 60.000 &euro;&nbsp;&nbsp;</strong></span></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;"><strong>APARTMENT S5: A - SECOND FLOOR - 65.000 &euro;&nbsp;&nbsp;</strong></span></p>\r\n<p><strong><br /></strong></p>\r\n<p>This is a selection of apartments in an exclusive location with a beautiful views of the bay and the coast from Trogir to Split.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The sea and beautiful beach is 350 m, but the apartments also have a shared swimming pool in the courtyard.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>They are located on the north side of the island of Ciovo close to many facilities, the historical city of Trogir and the international airport.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Each apartment has a size of 30.94 m2 + balcony 5.74 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>They consist of a hall, combined kitchen + dining room + living room, bathroom, bedroom and a wide balcony.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>They come fully furnished and air conditioned.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>In the basement there is 1 storage room for each apartment, approx. size 5 m2, while in the front of the building are common parking spaces.</p>\r\n<p>The location is quiet with little traffic and few other properties in the neighbourhood.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartments are currently operating tourist renting so buying these apartments can be a good investment.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong style="color: #f30b27;">***ON DEMAND SENDING DRONE PHOTOS AND SHORT MOBILE VIDEOS&nbsp;</strong></p>\r\n<p>These properties are priced to sell quickly, so please contact us immediately to avoid disappointment.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Contact one of our agents for a tour and with questions.</p>', '', '1248_Apartment_0.JPG', '1248_Apartment_1.JPG', '', '', '1248_Apartment_4.JPG', '1248_Apartment_5.JPG', '1248_Apartment_6.JPG', '', '1248_Apartment_8.jpg');
INSERT INTO `nekretnina` (`id`, `ime`, `prezime`, `telefon`, `mobitel`, `e_mail`, `lokacija_id`, `adresa`, `status_id`, `vrsta_id`, `udaljenost`, `povrsina`, `stambenapovrsina`, `display`, `cijena`, `cijenatocka`, `ponuda_tjedna`, `new_built`, `must_sell`, `prvi_red_do_mora`, `pogled_na_more`, `bazen`, `broj_soba`, `broj_kupatila`, `datum`, `title_hr`, `title_en`, `title_ge`, `opis_hr`, `opis_en`, `opis_ge`, `PropertyImageURL0`, `PropertyImageURL1`, `PropertyImageURL2`, `PropertyImageURL3`, `PropertyImageURL4`, `PropertyImageURL5`, `PropertyImageURL6`, `PropertyImageURL7`, `PropertyImageURL8`) VALUES
(1720, 'Zoja', 'Puljiz', 'Sin Mijo &#8211; 0917646368', 'Zoja- 0913470001', '', 'Trogir', 'Osoje VII/2 Okrug Donji', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '120', '140', '90', 1, '170000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 0, 0, 'June 20, 2016', '<p>Simpatièna dvojna kuæa u blizini prekrasne prirodno kamenite pla¾e. Nalazi se na otoku Èiovu, a do grada Trogira je potrebo 10 minuta vo¾nje.&nbsp;Kuæa je potpuno adaptirana i namje&scaron;tena prije 7 godina. Smje&scaron;tena je na zemlji&scaron;tu povr&scaron;ine 140 m2, dok je stambena povr&scaron;ina 90 m2 + podrum 20 m2.&nbsp;Svi katovi su spojeni unutarnjim spiralnim skalama, ali takoðer postoje i 2 odvojena vanjska ulaza.</p>', '<p>We have this utterly charming detached house on shore of Ciovo island, with beautiful natural rocky beaches and swimming area in front of the garden.&nbsp;It is located on the island of Ciovo, and the town of Trogir is 10 minute''s drive. Trogir is a significant attraction for tourists being a UNESCO heritage site and containing many cultural and historic places of interest and importance.&nbsp;The house has been completely renovated and modernised.&nbsp;It is situated on a plot of 140 m2, and the living area is 90 m2 + basement of 20 m2.&nbsp;</p>', '', '<p>Simpatièna dvojna kuæa u blizini prekrasne prirodno kamenite pla¾e.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nalazi se na otoku Èiovu, a do grada Trogira je potrebo 10 minuta vo¾nje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je potpuno adaptirana i namje&scaron;tena prije 7 godina.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Smje&scaron;tena je na zemlji&scaron;tu povr&scaron;ine 140 m2, dok je stambena povr&scaron;ina 90 m2 + podrum 20 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U prizemlju se nalazi kuhinja sa blagovaonicom i kupaonicom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na 1.katu se nalaze 2 spavaæe sobe, a u potkrovlju je galerija sa manjim balkonom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Svi katovi su spojeni unutarnjim spiralnim skalama, ali takoðer postoje i 2 odvojena vanjska ulaza.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U prizemlju se nalazi prostrana terasa, dok se kraj manjeg vrta nalazi kamin.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Do kuæe je moguæe doæi automobilom, ali se 2 slu¾bena parking mjesta nalaze jako blizu na glavnoj cesti.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ostajemo na usluzi za sva dodatna pitanja.</p>', '<p>We have this utterly charming detached house on shore of Ciovo island, with beautiful natural rocky beaches and swimming area in front of the garden.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is located on the island of Ciovo, and the town of Trogir is 10 minute''s drive.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Trogir is a significant attraction for tourists being a UNESCO heritage site and containing many cultural and historic places of interest and importance.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house has been completely renovated and modernised.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is situated on a plot of 140 m2, and the living area is 90 m2 + basement of 20 m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the ground floor there is a kitchen, dining room and bathroom.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the 1st floor there are 2 bedrooms, and the top floor is a gallery with a small balcony in front of large windows which make the most of the spectacular long sea views.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>All floors are connected by a spiral staircase, but there are also separate entrances for each floor.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The ground floor leads onto a spacious terrace where there is a traditional Dalmatian style bbq/fireplace.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house can be reached by car with private parking on adjacent land.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>We are happy to arrange a visit to this attractive property.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>This property will sell quickly, in a prime position, and with the modest price.</p>', '', '1720_House-Villa_0.jpg', '1720_House-Villa_1.jpg', '1720_House-Villa_2.jpg', '1720_House-Villa_3.jpg', '1720_House-Villa_4.jpg', '1720_House-Villa_5.jpg', '1720_House-Villa_6.jpg', '1720_House-Villa_7.jpg', '1720_House-Villa_8.jpg'),
(1715, 'Stipe', 'Pinju¹iæ', '00385 95 8123875', '0049 1575 1976 499 ', 'stipe.pinjusic@gmx.de', 'Trogir', 'Put Rtine Vini¹æe, k.è. 12504', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '200', '470', '120', 1, '210000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 1, 4, 3, 'June 13, 2016', '<p>Prodaje se atraktivna kuæa u izgradnji moderne arhitekture s vanjskim bazenom i pogledom na more.&nbsp;Kuæa stambene povr&scaron;ine 120 m2 je smje&scaron;tena na parceli od 470 m2, koja je udaljena od mora samo 200 m.&nbsp;U kuæi su predviðene 4 spavaæe sobe i 3 kupaonice.&nbsp;Orijentirana je prema jugu.&nbsp;Ispred se nalaze 3 parking mjesta, a sam prilaz je asfaltiran.</p>', '<p>We are offering this modern detached house with private outdoor pool and fabulous sea views. It is situated 200 from the sea, in a charming area near the UNESCO heritage town of Trogir. The house living area is 120 m2 and it is situated on a plot of 470 m2.&nbsp;The outside area allows a spacious patio and swimming pool and there are three private parking spaces off the road.&nbsp;</p>', '', '<p>Prodaje se atraktivna kuæa u izgradnji moderne arhitekture s vanjskim bazenom i pogledom na more.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa stambene povr&scaron;ine 120 m2 je smje&scaron;tena na parceli od 470 m2, koja je udaljena od mora samo 200 m.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U kuæi su predviðene 4 spavaæe sobe i 3 kupaonice.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Orijentirana je prema jugu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nekretnina ima struju i vodu, ali nije prikljuèena na mjesnu kanalizaciju, nego na septièku jamu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ispred se nalaze 3 parking mjesta, a sam prilaz je asfaltiran.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Meðunarodni aerodrom je udaljen 25 km, a grad Split 35 km.</p>', '<p>We are offering this modern detached house with private outdoor pool and fabulous sea views.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is situated 200 from the sea, in a charming area near the UNESCO heritage town of Trogir.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Within walking distance is a family run coffee shop and bar, while in the larger town, just a few minutes drive, are some of the best restaurants along the coast.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is a very popular area with tourists being close to the airport (25km) and the quality of the local beaches.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house living area is 120 m2 and it is situated on a plot of 470 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There are 4 bedrooms and 3 bathrooms upstairs, with another open plan family kitchen and lounge below.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property is oriented to the south.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property has electric and water but the drainage is vis septic tank.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The outside area allows a spacious patio and swimming pool and there are three private parking spaces off the road.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The international airport is 25 km away, and the city of Split 35 km.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact our office to arrange to visit this property.</p>', '', '1715_House-Villa_0.jpg', '1715_House-Villa_1.jpg', '1715_House-Villa_2.jpg', '1715_House-Villa_3.jpg', '1715_House-Villa_4.jpg', '1715_House-Villa_5.jpg', '1715_House-Villa_6.PNG', '1715_House-Villa_7.jpeg', '1715_House-Villa_8.jpg'),
(1249, 'Maja', 'Deliæ Ratkoviæ', '', '095/3946019', 'odvjetnica.maja.delicratkovic@gmail.com', 'Split', 'Split Baèvice, Vi¹ka ulica 7', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '0', '0', '102', 2, '350000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 3, 2, 'June 23, 2015', '<p>Prekrasan stan u Splitu, na atraktivnoj lokaciji, novije gradnje. Stan se nalazi na treæem katu zgrade, te je orijentiran S-I. Ima ukupnu stambenu povr&scaron;inu 102 m2, a sastoji se od tri spavaæe sobe, odvojenog dnevnog boravka, kuhinje, blagovaonice, kupaonice, wc-a sa tu&scaron; kadom, predsoblja, dega¾mana, spreme i dva velika balkona. Povr&scaron;ina balkona iznosi preko 20 m2, a prote¾e se uzdu¾ cijelog dnevnog prostora gdje se nalazi staklena stijenka, &scaron;to omoguæuje mnogo svjetlosti.&nbsp;Svaka prostorija ima izlaz na balkon.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>We have this beautiful, newly designed and built apartment in Split, in an attractive location. The apartment is located on the third floor, and is oriented N/E. It has a total living area 102 m2 and consists of three bedrooms, a separate living room, kitchen, dining room, bathroom, toilet and shower, a hallway, a storage, storage and two balconies. The balcony area is over 20 m2, and extends along the entire front living space where there is a glass wall, allowing lots of light. Each room has access to the balcony.</p>', '', '<p>Prekrasan stan u Splitu, na atraktivnoj lokaciji, novije gradnje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Stan se nalazi na treæem katu zgrade, te je orijentiran S-I.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ima ukupnu stambenu povr&scaron;inu 102 m2, a sastoji se od tri spavaæe sobe, odvojenog dnevnog boravka, kuhinje, blagovaonice, kupaonice, wc-a sa tu&scaron; kadom, predsoblja, dega¾mana, spreme i dva velika balkona.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Povr&scaron;ina balkona iznosi preko 20 m2, a prote¾e se uzdu¾ cijelog dnevnog prostora gdje se nalazi staklena stijenka, &scaron;to omoguæuje mnogo svjetlosti.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Svaka prostorija ima izlaz na balkon.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Stanu pripada i drvarnica u prizemlju zgrade.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Vlasni&scaron;tvo uredno.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Prisutna sva potrebna infrastruktura.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U blizini se nalazi pla¾a, mnogobrojni restorani, kafiæi, suvenirnice i ostali sadr¾aji.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Centar Splita je iz godine u godinu sve popularnije turistièko odredi&scaron;te, te je ovaj apartman idealan za iznajmljivanje, ali i za vlastito u¾ivanje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Meðunarodni aerodrom udaljen je 40 min. vo¾nje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za sve dodatne informacije slobodno nas kontaktirajte.</p>', '<p>We have this beautiful, newly designed and built apartment in Split, in an attractive location.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The apartment is located on the third floor, and is oriented N/E.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is within walking distance from the centre of the town, close to all the main attractions and amenities.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It has a total living area 102 m2 and consists of three bedrooms, a separate living room, kitchen, dining room, bathroom, toilet and shower, a hallway, a storage, storage and two balconies.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The balcony area is over 20 m2, and extends along the entire front living space where there is a glass wall, allowing lots of light.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Each room has access to the balcony.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>With the apartment there is also a storage room on the ground floor in the building.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nearby is the beach, numerous restaurants, cafes, many shops and other facilities.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The centre of Split is every year becoming more and more popular as a tourist destination, and this apartment is ideal for rental or for your own enjoyment.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The international airport is 40 minutes driving.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For further information please contact us, and we can arrange for you to visit the property.&nbsp;</p>', '', '1249_Apartment_0.jpg', '1249_Apartment_1.jpg', '1249_Apartment_2.jpg', '1249_Apartment_3.jpg', '1249_Apartment_4.jpg', '1249_Apartment_5.jpg', '1249_Apartment_6.jpg', '1249_Apartment_7.jpg', '1249_Apartment_8.jpg'),
(1250, 'Branka', 'Drnas Tomas', '', '0988344052', 'Branka.drnastomas@gmail.com', 'Trogir', 'Bana Josipa Jelaèiæa 175 Slatine, Èiovo, 1400/9 katastar, ZEM 990/13', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '40', '356', '90', 1, '350000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 1, 3, 2, 'June 23, 2015', '<p><strong>CIJENA SNI®ENA SA 430.000 euro na 350.000 euro!</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Potpuno renovirana samostojeæa kuæa na istoènoj strani otoka Èiova. Nalazi se u 2.redu od mora i prekrasne prirodno kamenite pla¾e.&nbsp;Ukupna povr&scaron;ina zemlji&scaron;ta na kojoj se nalazi kuæa je 356 m2, dok je stambena povr&scaron;ina kuæe 90 m2 + konoba + tavan koji se koristi kao spremi&scaron;te.&nbsp;Sastoji se od prizemlja i 1.kata koji su meðusobno povezani unutarnjim stepenicama. U kultiviranom dvori&scaron;tu se nalazi bazen, kamin i solarni tu&scaron;. Vrt se zalijeva automatskim navodnjavanjem. Kuæa je prije nekoliko godina potpuno renovirana i luksuzno namje&scaron;tena.</p>', '<p><strong>PRICE REDUCED FROM 430.000 euro to 350.000 euro!</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>We have this beautifully renovated old house on the eastern side of the island Ciovo. It is located in the 2nd row from the sea where there are superb natural rocky and pebble beaches. The total land area of the house is 356 m2, while the living area is 90 m2 + cellar + attic used as storage. The house has ground floor and 1st floor which are connected by internal stairs. In cultivated backyard there is a pool, bbq/fireplace and a solar shower. The house is a few years ago completely renovated and luxuriously furnished.&nbsp;</p>', '', '<p><strong><span style="color: #ff0000;">CIJENA SNI®ENA SA 430.000 euro na 350.000 euro!</span></strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Potpuno renovirana samostojeæa kuæa na istoènoj strani otoka Èiova.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nalazi se u 2.redu od mora i prekrasne prirodno kamenite pla¾e.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Centar mjesta udaljen je nekoliko minuta vo¾nje, dok je do grada Trogira potrebno 15 minuta.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ukupna povr&scaron;ina zemlji&scaron;ta na kojoj se nalazi kuæa je 356 m2, dok je stambena povr&scaron;ina kuæe 90 m2 + konoba + tavan koji se koristi kao spremi&scaron;te.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sastoji se od prizemlja i 1.kata koji su meðusobno povezani unutarnjim stepenicama.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U prizemlju se nalazi kuhinja, blagovaonica, dnevni boravak sprema i kupaonica.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na 1.katu su 3 spavaæe sobe, kupaonica i terasa sa pogledom na more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U kultiviranom dvori&scaron;tu se nalazi bazen, kamin i solarni tu&scaron;.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Vrt se zalijeva automatskim navodnjavanjem.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je prije nekoliko godina potpuno renovirana i luksuzno namje&scaron;tena.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ovo je obiteljska kuæa idealna za odmor zbog blizine mora i mirnog okru¾enja.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Zbog polo¾aja je moguæe i koristiti je u svrhu turistièkog iznajmljivanja.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ukoliko imate dodatnih pitanja slobodno nas kontaktirajte.</p>', '<p><strong><span style="color: #ff0000;">PRICE REDUCED FROM 430.000 euro to 350.000 euro!</span></strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>We have this beautifully renovated old house on the eastern side of&nbsp;&nbsp;the island Ciovo.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is located in the 2nd row from the sea where there are superb natural rocky and pebble beaches.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is situated a few minutes'' drive from the village centre, or a short cycle ride, while to the town of Trogir is 15 minutes driving.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The total land area of the house is 356 m2, while the living area is 90 m2 + cellar + attic used as storage.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house has ground floor and 1st floor which are connected by internal stairs.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the ground floor there is a modern, open plan style kitchen, dining room, living room, storage room and a bathroom.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the 1st floor are 3 bedrooms, bathroom and wide terrace overlooking the sea, facing Split.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>In cultivated backyard there is a pool, bbq/fireplace and a solar shower.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The garden has been landscaped professionally and is watered by automatic irrigation.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house is a few years ago completely renovated and luxuriously furnished.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>This is a house ideal for holidays or tourism Lettings because of the proximity to the sea and peaceful surroundings.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>If you have any questions please contact us and we can arrange you to visit the property with one of our agents.</p>', '', '1250_House-Villa_0.jpg', '1250_House-Villa_1.jpg', '1250_House-Villa_2.jpg', '1250_House-Villa_3.jpg', '1250_House-Villa_4.jpg', '1250_House-Villa_5.jpg', '1250_House-Villa_6.jpg', '1250_House-Villa_7.jpg', '1250_House-Villa_8.JPG'),
(1251, 'Anton', 'Golubiæ', '098 1970175', '098 667 640', 'anton.golubic@st.t-com.hr <anton.golubic', 'Trogir', 'Put Selina 34 Vini¹æe Trogir', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '5', '1100', '450', 1, '1700000', '', 2, 2, 2, 1, 1, 1, 7, 4, 'June 23, 2015', '<p>Na svega par metra od mora nalazi se prekrasna vila s bazenom i oèaravajuæim pogledom na more i uvalu, ju¾ne orijentacije.&nbsp;U potpunosti ureðena i u odliènom stanju ova vila zadovoljit æe zahtjeve svih zainteresiranih koji ¾ele u¾ivati u mediteranskom okru¾enju.&nbsp;Povr&scaron;ina parcele je 1100 m2, a povr&scaron;ina vile je 450 m2.&nbsp;Stambeni dio kuæe je podijeljena na I, II i III kat.&nbsp;Na prvom katu nalazi se dvosobni apartman. Drugi kat je podijeljen na studio apartman i dvosoban apartman. Na treæem katu je dvosoban apartman.</p>', '<p>We have this beautiful villa with a swimming pool and breath-taking views of the sea and the bay, facing south on the shore near Trogir. This is an unusually large and wonderfully designed family apartment villa, making great use of the space with modern and stylish ideas. The plot area is 1100 m2, and the surface of the villa is 450 m2. On the first floor there is a two bedroom apartment. The second floor is divided into a studio apartment and two bedroom apartment. On the third floor is a two bedroom apartment.&nbsp;</p>', '', '<p>Na svega par metra od mora nalazi se prekrasna vila s bazenom i oèaravajuæim pogledom na more i uvalu, ju¾ne orijentacije.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U potpunosti ureðena i u odliènom stanju ova vila zadovoljit æe zahtjeve svih zainteresiranih koji ¾ele u¾ivati u &nbsp;mediteranskom okru¾enju.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Povr&scaron;ina parcele je 1100 m2, a povr&scaron;ina vile je 450 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Stambeni dio kuæe je podijeljena na I, II i III kat.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na prvom katu nalazi se dvosobni apartman.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Drugi kat je podijeljen na studio apartman i dvosoban apartman.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Postoji moguænost spajanja u jedan apartman.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na treæem katu je dvosoban apartman.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Svi apartmani su tako koncipirani da je otvoreni prostrani dnevni boravak spojen s kuhinjom i blagovaonicom ju¾ne orijentacije te ima izlaz na veliku terasu s koje se pru¾a pogled na more, pla¾u i bazen u sklopu parcele.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Okuænica je kultivirana mediteranskim biljem i ureðena s puno dalmatinskih detalja.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Uz bazen na prvom katu nalazi se prostor za sunèanje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Cijeli prostor oko bazena je poploèan dalmatinskim kamenom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Pristup cestom do vile.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Osiguran je parking za 10 auta s obzirom da se uz cestu u prizemlju kuæe nalazi gara¾a povr&scaron;ine 200 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Vila ima svu potrebnu infrastrukturu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Udaljenost do centra malog dalmatinskog mjesta u kojem se mogu naæi svi potrebni sadr¾aji (duæani, restorani, kafiæi) je svega 1 km.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Meðunarodni aerodrom je udaljen 15 km.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Molimo za sve dodatne informacije kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured u Splitu.</p>', '<p>We have this beautiful villa with a swimming pool and breath-taking views of the sea and the bay, facing south on the shore near Trogir.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>This is an unusually large and wonderfully designed family apartment villa, making great use of the space with modern and stylish ideas.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is fully furnished and in excellent condition.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>This villa will satisfy the requirements of the most discerning of clients who want to enjoy the Mediterranean atmosphere.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The plot area is 1100 m2, and the surface of the villa is 450 m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The residential part of the house is divided into I, II and III floor.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the first floor there is a two bedroom apartment.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The second floor is divided into a studio apartment and two bedroom apartment, but these have the easy possibility of being merged into one apartment.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the third floor is a two bedroom apartment.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>All the apartments are designed with an open spacious living room connected to the kitchen and dining room facing south and with large terraces to enjoy the great sea view, and overlook the beach and pool.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The land is cultivated with Mediterranean plants and decorated with many Dalmatian details.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The swimming pool has a spacious sunbathing patio around, built with distinctive Dalmatian stone, and will no doubt become every visitors favourite space!&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There is a quiet access road to the villa.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There is parking for 10 cars and a garage of 200 m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The villa has all the necessary infrastructure.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Distance to the centre of the small Dalmatian town where you can find all the necessary facilities (shops, restaurants, bars) is only 1 km, a few minutes by bicycle.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The international airport is 15 km away.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The nearest larger town is Trogir, which is only five minutes by car, and the centre of cultural and historic attractions in the area.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It has a large ACI Marina, and deep water mooring, a thriving market, shops, restaurants, bars and evening and night life events.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please for further information contact our office in Split, and we can arrange the tour.</p>', '', '1251_House-Villa_0.jpg', '1251_House-Villa_1.jpg', '1251_House-Villa_2.jpg', '1251_House-Villa_3.jpg', '1251_House-Villa_4.jpg', '1251_House-Villa_5.jpg', '1251_House-Villa_6.jpg', '1251_House-Villa_7.jpg', '1251_House-Villa_8.jpg'),
(1253, '', 'Dalmatian Home', '', '', '', 'Murter', 'murter', 'For sale', 'Old stone house', '500', '27', '90', 1, '105000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 3, 2, 'June 24, 2015', '<p>Povoljno! U mirnom dijelu Betine na otoku Murteru smjestila se obnovljena kamena kuæa od 90m2. U prizemlju se nalazi kuhinja i spremi&scaron;te, dok spiralno stubi&scaron;te vodi na 1. kat gdje se nalazi velika spavaæa soba i kupaonica. Drugi kat se sastoji od 2 manje spavaæe sobe, WC-a i natkrivene terase (16m2) sa pogledom na more.&nbsp;Do mora i centra mjesta ima 400m zraène udaljenosti.<br /><br /></p>', '<p>Great offer !In a quiet part of Betina (island of Murter) lies a renovated stone house of 90m2. On the ground floor there is a kitchen and pantry, while a spiral staircase leads to the first floor where there is a large bedroom and bathroom. The second floor consists of 2 smaller bedrooms, bathroom and a covered terrace (16 m2) which offers a sea view. The great advantage of this house is quiet and pleasant surroundings that are provide by narrow stone streets which offer natural. The sea and the town center is 400 m air distance.</p>', '', '<p>Povoljno!</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U mirnom dijelu Betine na otoku Murteru smjestila se obnovljena kamena kuæa od 90m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U prizemlju se nalazi kuhinja i spremi&scaron;te, dok spiralno stubi&scaron;te vodi na 1. kat gdje se nalazi velika spavaæa soba i kupaonica.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Drugi kat se sastoji od 2 manje spavaæe sobe, WC-a i natkrivene terase (16m2) sa pogledom na more.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Do mora i centra mjesta ima 400m zraène udaljenosti.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Prilikom renovacije 2010. godine mijenjana je drvenarija i keramika, te ugraðena kvalitetna kuhinja i namje&scaron;taj.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Va¾no je napomenuti da se sada&scaron;nji vlasnici ne bave iznajmljivanjem, tako da je ova nekretnina vrlo dobro oèuvana.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Velika prednost ove kuæe je miran i ugodan ambijent koji pru¾aju uske kamene ulièice, dajuæi prirodan hlad i potièuæi znati¾elju za otkrivanjem zanimljivih kamenih detalja, malih trgova, volata (nadsvoðenih ulièica) i ostalih kadrova vrijednih za pamæenje.</p>', '<p>Great offer!</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>In a quiet part of Betina (island of Murter) lies a renovated stone house of 90m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the ground floor there is a kitchen and pantry, while a spiral staircase leads to the first floor where there is a large bedroom and bathroom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The second floor consists of 2 smaller bedrooms, bathroom and a covered terrace (16 m2) which offers a sea view.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The great advantage of this house is quiet and pleasant surroundings that are provide by narrow stone streets which offer natural.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The sea and the town center is 400 m air distance.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Partial renovation is done in 2010, woodwork and ceramics are changed, and house is now equipped with quality kitchen parts and other furniture.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is important to note that the current owners do not deal with renting, so this property is very well preserved.</p>', '', '1253_Old-stone-house_0.jpg', '1253_Old-stone-house_1.jpg', '1253_Old-stone-house_2.jpg', '1253_Old-stone-house_3.jpg', '1253_Old-stone-house_4.jpg', '1253_Old-stone-house_5.jpg', '1253_Old-stone-house_6.jpg', '1253_Old-stone-house_7.jpg', '1253_Old-stone-house_8.jpg'),
(1254, 'Niko', '©oljak', '091 5665 254', '', 'znanost@hssd.hr', 'Brac', 'Ulica Ive Jak¹iæa Supetar, k.c. 477, 677/2, 679 k.o. Supetar ', 'For sale', 'Old stone house', '200', '937', '570', 1, '370000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 0, 0, 'June 26, 2015', '<p>Kamena kuæa s pogledom na more za zapoèetom renovacijom u Supetru, nedaleko od centra mjesta.&nbsp;Kuæa ima 3 eta¾e, ukupne povr&scaron;ine ca. 570 m2, dok zemlji&scaron;te ima povr&scaron;inu 937 m2.&nbsp;Zapoèeta je renovacija 5 manjih apartmana unutar objekta, a mo¾e ih se napraviti jo&scaron; toliko.&nbsp;Parcela je velika, okru¾uje objekt sa istoène, ju¾ne i zapadne strane te se sa ulice mo¾e izvesti pristup, a u dijelu dvori&scaron;ta napraviti parking i bazen.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>Stone house with the sea view in renovation process, located in Supetar on Brac island, near the town''s center.&nbsp;The house has 3 floors, sized ca. 570 m2 altogether, while the land plot measures 937 m2.&nbsp;The owner has already started with renovation works and 5 small apartments have been formed within.&nbsp;Another 5 units can be fitted in the house.&nbsp;The plot is large and surrounds the house from the east, south and west.&nbsp;</p>', '', '<p>Kamena kuæa s pogledom na more za zapoèetom renovacijom u Supetru, nedaleko od centra mjesta.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa ima 3 eta¾e, ukupne povr&scaron;ine ca. 570 m2, dok zemlji&scaron;te ima povr&scaron;inu 937 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Zapoèeta je renovacija 5 manjih apartmana unutar objekta, a mo¾e ih se napraviti jo&scaron; toliko.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Parcela je velika, okru¾uje objekt sa istoène, ju¾ne i zapadne strane te se sa ulice mo¾e izvesti pristup, a u dijelu dvori&scaron;ta napraviti parking i bazen.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sa kata se pru¾a pogled na more i mjesto.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Otok Braè povezan je svakodnevnom trajektnom linijom sa gradom Splitom, dok je meðunarodni aerodrom udaljen 40 minuta vo¾nje od Splita.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je udaljena od centra mjesta 200 m.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Molimo kontaktirajte nas za sve dodatne informacije.</p>', '<p>Stone house with the sea view in renovation process, located in Supetar on Brac island, near the town''s center.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house has 3 floors, sized ca. 570 m2 altogether, while the land plot measures 937 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The owner has already started with renovation works and 5 small apartments have been formed within.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Another 5 units can be fitted in the house.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The plot is large and surrounds the house from the east, south and west.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is possible to grant access to the garden from the street side and use it for the parking or to put the pool from the back side.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The island of Brac is connected by daily ferry lines to Split, while the international airport is 40 minutes drive from Split.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Supetar town is 200 m away, while the Brac airport is 35 km away.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact us for more information and to arrange to visit the property.</p>', '', '1254_Old-stone-house_0.jpg', '1254_Old-stone-house_1.jpg', '1254_Old-stone-house_2.jpg', '1254_Old-stone-house_3.jpg', '1254_Old-stone-house_4.jpg', '1254_Old-stone-house_5.jpg', '1254_Old-stone-house_6.jpg', '', ''),
(1255, 'Ivana', 'Zilic', '021886921', '0989696443', 'apartmanizilic@gmail.com', 'Trogir', 'Bu¹inci 10 Okrug Gornji, 1921 zgr, 756/13', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '170', '330', '150', 2, '380000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 1, 4, 3, 'June 26, 2015', '<p>Luksuzna samostojeæa kuæa na ju¾noj strani otoka Èiova u blizini prekrasne prirodno kamenite pla¾e.&nbsp;Centar mjesta nalazi se u blizini, dok su grad Trogir i meðunarodni aerodrom udaljeni 15 i 20 minuta vo¾nje.&nbsp;Kuæa je istoène orjentacije iz koje se pru¾a pogled na more. Ukupna povr&scaron;ina zemlji&scaron;ta iznosi 366 m2 dok je stambena povr&scaron;ina 150 m2.&nbsp;U ureðenom vrtu se nalazi bazen i kamin, dok se ispred kuæe nalazi parking za 4 automobila.&nbsp;Kuæa je podijeljena u 2 apartmana sa posebnim vanjskim ulazima.</p>', '<p>We have this stylish modern luxury apartment house with a swimming pool on the south side of Ciovo Island. The village centre is located conveniently close, while the larger town of Trogir and the international airport is 15 and 20 minutes'' drive. This newly refurbished house is east orientation with a view of the sea. The total land area is 366 m2 and the living area of 150 m2. The house is divided into 2 apartments with separate external entrances.&nbsp;</p>', '', '<p>Luksuzna samostojeæa kuæa na ju¾noj strani otoka Èiova u blizini prekrasne prirodno kamenite pla¾e.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Centar mjesta nalazi se u blizini, dok su grad Trogir i meðunarodni aerodrom udaljeni 15 i 20 minuta vo¾nje.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je istoène orjentacije iz koje se pru¾a pogled na more.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ukupna povr&scaron;ina zemlji&scaron;ta iznosi 366 m2 dok je stambena povr&scaron;ina 150 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U ureðenom vrtu se nalazi bazen i kamin, dok se ispred kuæe nalazi parking za 4 automobila.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je podijeljena u 2 apartmana sa posebnim vanjskim ulazima.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Prizemni apartman se sastoji od kuhinje + dnevnog boravaka + blagovaonice, 2 spavaæe sobe i 2 kupaonice.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na 1.katu su dnevni boravak sa blagovaonicom i kuhinjom, 2 spavaæe sobe, kupaonica i terasa sa pogledom na more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Oba apartmana imaju odvojeno mjerilo vode i struje, stoga ih je moguæe koristiti kao potpuno odvojene jedinice.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je potpuno renovirana prije 4 godine i trenutno se koristi u svrhu turistièkog iznajmljivanja.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U cijenu je takoðer ukljuèen i namje&scaron;taj.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nisu potrebna nikakva dodatna ulaganja stoga je ovo izuzetna prilika ¾elite li veæ useljivi objekt.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ukoliko imate dodatnih pitanja molimo da nas kontaktirate.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>We have this stylish modern luxury apartment house with a swimming pool on the south side of Ciovo Island.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The village centre is located conveniently close, while the larger town of Trogir and the international airport is 15 and 20 minutes'' drive.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>This newly refurbished house is east orientation with a view of the sea.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The total land area is 366 m2 and the living area of 150 m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The landscaped garden with a swimming pool has a bbq/fireplace, while at the front it has private parking for 4 cars.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house is divided into 2 apartments with separate external entrances.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The ground floor apartment consists of a modern and spacious open plan kitchen + living room + dining room, 2 bedrooms and 2 bathrooms.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the 1st floor are a living room, dining room and kitchen, 2 bedrooms, bathroom and terrace overlooking the sea.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Both apartments have a separate meter for water and electricity, so they can be used as a completely separate units.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house was completely renovated 4 years ago, using high quality fittings and decorations such as the wooden floors and marble stairs.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is currently used for tourist rental.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The price also includes the furniture.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>They do not require any additional investment because they have &nbsp;even so well maintained.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>If you have any questions please contact us and to arrange to visit the property.</p>', '', '1255_House-Villa_0.jpg', '1255_House-Villa_1.jpg', '1255_House-Villa_2.JPG', '1255_House-Villa_3.jpg', '1255_House-Villa_4.JPG', '1255_House-Villa_5.jpg', '1255_House-Villa_6.jpg', '1255_House-Villa_7.JPG', '1255_House-Villa_8.JPG'),
(1256, '®ivko', 'Vuletiæ', '091 591 0061  ; 021 202 987 ¾ena', '091 762 9001', '', 'Rogoznica', '®drilo 17 Stupin Èeline, Rogoznica', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '6', '500', '245', 1, '600000', '', 2, 2, 2, 1, 1, 2, 9, 5, 'June 26, 2015', '<p>Na svega par metara od mora s prekrasnim pogledom na more i cijelu uvalu nalazi se apartmanska kuæa koja se mo¾e koristiti u turistièke svrhe (iznajmljivanje apartmana) ili se objediniti u prostranu obiteljsku kuæu.&nbsp;Ispred kuæe nalazi se lijepo ureðena pla¾a.&nbsp;Povr&scaron;ina stambenog dijela kuæe je 245 m2, a nalazi se na parceli povr&scaron;ine 500 m2.&nbsp;Kuæa se sastoji od prizemlja i dva kata.</p>', '<p>We have this sea front apartment house just a few yards from the Adriatic. It has great potential to be used either for tourism purposes (renting) or be transformed into a large family home. It is situated with a safe and clean beach directly in front of the property, with direct access through the garden. The surface area of the inside is 245 m2 and is it located on a plot &nbsp;of 500 m2. The house consists of a ground floor and two floors above.&nbsp;</p>', '', '<p>Na svega par metara od mora s prekrasnim pogledom na more i cijelu uvalu nalazi se apartmanska kuæa koja se mo¾e koristiti u turistièke svrhe (iznajmljivanje apartmana) ili se objediniti u prostranu obiteljsku kuæu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ispred kuæe nalazi se lijepo ureðena pla¾a.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Povr&scaron;ina stambenog dijela kuæe je 245 m2, a nalazi se na parceli povr&scaron;ine 500 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa se sastoji od prizemlja i dva kata.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U prizemlju je studio apartman i gara¾a.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na I katu je prostrani trosobni stan s velikom terasom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Drugi kat se sastoji od jednog jednosobnog i jednog dvosobnog apartmana.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Uz kuæu u odvojenom dijelu je dvosobni apartman povr&scaron;ine 40 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je ju¾ne orijentacije tako da su sve &nbsp;terase okrenute k jugu s pogledom na more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Okuænica je lijepo ureðena mediteranskim biljem a hladovinu pru¾a sjenica povr&scaron;ine 35 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Do kuæe je pristup asfaltiranom cestom, a u sklopu parcele osigurana su 4 parking mjesta.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa ima svu potrebnu infrastrukturu (struja, gradska voda i septièka jama).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Restorani, kafiæi, duæani su udaljenije svega par kilometara, a meðunarodni aerodrom je udaljen 28 km.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Molimo za sve dodatne informacije kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured u Splitu.</p>', '<p>We have this sea front apartment house just a few yards from the Adriatic.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It has great potential to be used either for tourism purposes (renting) or be transformed into a large family home.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is situated with a safe and clean beach directly in front of the property, with direct access through the garden.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Within a few minutes walking is a small family run cafe, but there are many more options for shops, bars and restaurants five minutes driving down the coast.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The surface area of the inside is 245 m2 and is it located on a plot &nbsp;of 500 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house consists of a ground floor and two floors above.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the ground floor is a studio apartment and garage.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the first floor is a spacious three-room apartment with a large terrace, and on the top - it has one one-bedroom apartment and one two-bedrooms apartment.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Next to the house, there is a separate building - this is used as a two bedroom guest apartment of 40 m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house is south facing with all the terraces facing the south with views of the sea.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The courtyard is beautifully decorated with established Mediterranean plants which offer shade, including an arbore/gazebo of 35 m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house has direct access to a paved road and within the plot are 4 private parking spaces.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house has all the necessary infrastructure (electricity, city water and septic tank).&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact our office in Split to arrange to visit this property.</p>', '', '1256_House-Villa_0.JPG', '1256_House-Villa_1.JPG', '1256_House-Villa_2.JPG', '1256_House-Villa_3.JPG', '1256_House-Villa_4.JPG', '1256_House-Villa_5.JPG', '1256_House-Villa_6.JPG', '1256_House-Villa_7.JPG', '1256_House-Villa_8.JPG'),
(1257, 'Marko', 'Èulina', '098 9393330', '', '', 'Rogoznica', 'Sevid Rogoznica', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '5', '370', '375', 1, '750000', '', 2, 2, 2, 1, 1, 2, 5, 4, 'June 26, 2015', '<p>Od kristalno plavog i èistog mora udaljena svega par metara, okru¾ena mediteranskim biljem i s prekrasnim pogledom &nbsp;ova kuæa ju¾ne orijentacije nikoga neæe ostaviti ravnodu&scaron;nim.&nbsp;Kuæa se nalazi u mirnoj uvali s prirodnom i lijepo ureðenom pla¾om do koje s parcele vodi svega par stepenica.&nbsp;Povr&scaron;ina kuæe iznosi 375 m2, a nalazi se na parceli povr&scaron;ine 370 m2.&nbsp;Kuæa se sastoji od prizemlja i dva kata.</p>', '<p>We are pleased to offer this apartment house, a modern and attractive first line property on the shore of one of the most popular parts of the coast. It is just a few metres from the wonderfully clear water, in a quiet bay, with easy access through a private gate in the garden, and surrounded by native Mediterranean herbs, shrubs and trees.&nbsp;The house has 375 m2 of internal space and it is located on a plot of 370 m2. The house consists of a ground floor with two upper floors.</p>', '', '<p>Od kristalno plavog i èistog &nbsp;mora udaljena svega par metara, okru¾ena mediteranskim biljem i s prekrasnim pogledom &nbsp;ova kuæa ju¾ne orijentacije nikoga neæe ostaviti ravnodu&scaron;nim.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa se nalazi u mirnoj uvali s prirodnom i lijepo ureðenom pla¾om do koje s parcele vodi svega par stepenica.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Povr&scaron;ina kuæe iznosi 375 m2, a nalazi se na parceli povr&scaron;ine 370 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa se sastoji od prizemlja i dva kata.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U jednom dijelu prizemlja je dnevni boravak s kuhinjom, spavaæa soba i kupaonica, a u drugom dijelu je konoba.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Velika terasa s pogledom na more i pla¾u takoðer se nalazi na nivou prizemlja.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na prvom katu su dva jednosobna apartmana s terasama ju¾ne orijentacije - &nbsp;prema moru.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Drugi kat zauzima veliki prostrani dvosobni apartman s terasom s koje se pru¾a panoramski pogled.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Uz kuæu se nalazi jo&scaron; jedna manja kuæica s vlastitim ulazom koja se koristi kao studio apartman koji ima izlaz na vlastitu terasu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Uz kuæu se nalazi gara¾a povr&scaron;ine 45 m2, kao i dva parking mjesta u sklopu parcele.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa ima svu potrebnu infrastrukturu (struja, septièka jama, cisterna - dolazak vode oèekuje se u roku od godinu dana).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Do kuæe vodi asfaltirana cesta.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Udaljenost do restorana, kafiæa i duæana je svega par stotina metara.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Aerodrom je udaljen 25 min. vo¾nje.</p>', '<p>We are pleased to offer this apartment house, a modern and attractive first line property on the shore of one of the most popular parts of the coast.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is just a few metres from the wonderfully clear water, in a quiet bay, with easy access through a private gate in the garden, and surrounded by native Mediterranean herbs, shrubs and trees.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house has 375 m2 of internal space and it is located on a plot of 370 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house consists of a ground floor with two upper floors.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>In one part of the ground floor is the living room with kitchen, bedroom and bathroom, and in the second part is the cellar.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There is a large terrace overlooking the entire bay and the surrounding geography.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the first floor are two apartments with terraces facing south - towards the sea.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The second floor is occupied by a large spacious two-bedroom apartment with a terrace that offers a panoramic view.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Beside the house is another small cottage with its own entrance, which is used as a studio apartment and this has access to a private terrace.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property has been designed for occupants to enjoy the views with large windows allowing in plenty of natural light, and with open plan living areas.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The decorations are in good condition and the property is generally well maintained.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Beside the house is a garage of 45 m2 and there are two parking spaces&nbsp;within the plot.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house has electricity, septic tank, tank - and the mains water is being connected to the village later this year - an event which should immediately add to the value of the property.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Access to the house is by an asphalt road connected to the main road on the edge of the village.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is just a few hundred meters away to the centre of the village where there is a range of shops, bars and other useful services.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The airport is 25 minutes driving.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please call for more information or to set up a viewing appointment.</p>', '', '1257_House-Villa_0.JPG', '1257_House-Villa_1.JPG', '1257_House-Villa_2.JPG', '1257_House-Villa_3.JPG', '1257_House-Villa_4.JPG', '1257_House-Villa_5.JPG', '1257_House-Villa_6.JPG', '1257_House-Villa_7.JPG', '1257_House-Villa_8.JPG');
INSERT INTO `nekretnina` (`id`, `ime`, `prezime`, `telefon`, `mobitel`, `e_mail`, `lokacija_id`, `adresa`, `status_id`, `vrsta_id`, `udaljenost`, `povrsina`, `stambenapovrsina`, `display`, `cijena`, `cijenatocka`, `ponuda_tjedna`, `new_built`, `must_sell`, `prvi_red_do_mora`, `pogled_na_more`, `bazen`, `broj_soba`, `broj_kupatila`, `datum`, `title_hr`, `title_en`, `title_ge`, `opis_hr`, `opis_en`, `opis_ge`, `PropertyImageURL0`, `PropertyImageURL1`, `PropertyImageURL2`, `PropertyImageURL3`, `PropertyImageURL4`, `PropertyImageURL5`, `PropertyImageURL6`, `PropertyImageURL7`, `PropertyImageURL8`) VALUES
(1258, '', 'Baliæ', 'javit se Ivi prije zvanja', '', '', 'Trogir', 'Slatine, 1118, 1119 zemljisnik &#8211; zem 1370, zem 1369', 'For sale', 'Land plot', '400', '490', '0', 2, '75000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 0, 0, 'June 29, 2015', '<p>Graðevinsko zemlji&scaron;te na istoènoj strani otoka Èiova sa djelomiènim pogledom na more i Split. Udaljenost od prekrasne &scaron;ljunèane pla¾e je 400 m, gdje se nalaze i ostali sadr¾aji.&nbsp;Ukupna povr&scaron;ina iznosi 490 m2, dok je pristupni put sa zapadne i istoène strane zemlji&scaron;ta.&nbsp;Prikljuèak vode se nalazi na zemlji&scaron;tu, dok se sva ostala infrastruktura nalazi u blizini.&nbsp;Zemlji&scaron;te se nalazi u mirnom dijelu na samom rubu graðevinske zone.Idealno je za izgradnju obiteljske ville sa bazenom.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>We have this building land on the eastern side of the island Ciovo with partial views of the sea and Split town. The distance from the beautiful well maintained pebble beach is 400 m, where there are also other facilities, such as shops, beach coffee bar, and cafes.&nbsp;The total land area is 490 m2, with two access roads/west and east side of the land.&nbsp;There is already water connection located on land, while all other infrastructure is nearby - electricity, drains etc. It is an ideal size and situation for building a large family villa with swimming pool.&nbsp;</p>', '', '<p><span style="color: #ff0000;">***Na zahtjev &scaron;aljemo dodatne fotografije</span></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Graðevinsko zemlji&scaron;te na istoènoj strani otoka Èiova sa djelomiènim pogledom na more i Split.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Udaljenost od prekrasne &scaron;ljunèane pla¾e je 400 m, gdje se nalaze i ostali sadr¾aji.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ukupna povr&scaron;ina iznosi 490 m2, dok je pristupni put sa zapadne i istoène strane zemlji&scaron;ta.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Prikljuèak voze se nalazi na zemlji&scaron;tu, dok se sva ostala infrastruktura nalazi u blizini.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Zemlji&scaron;te se nalazi u mirnom dijelu na samom rubu graðevinske zone.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Idealno je za izgradnju obiteljske ville sa bazenom.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nalazi se u M1 mje&scaron;ovitoj, prete¾no stambenoj zoni gdje u dozvoljeni samostojeæni ili dvojni objekti.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Koeficijent izgraðenosti za samostojeæe objekte je 30%, dok je za dvojne 35%.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Maksimalna tlocrtna povr&scaron;ina samostojeæeg objekta iznosi 200 m2, a za dvojni objekt 250 m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Maksimalna katnost iznosi podrum + prizemlje + 2 kata.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Grad Trogir je udaljen 15 min., dok je do meðunarodnog aerodroma potrebno 20 min. vo¾nje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Stojimo na raspolaganju za sva dodatna pitanja.&nbsp;</p>', '<p><span style="color: #ff0000;">*** Sending more photos on demand</span></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>We have this building land on the eastern side of the island Ciovo with partial views of the sea and Split town.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The distance from the beautiful well maintained pebble beach is 400 m, where there are also other facilities, such as shops, beach coffee bar, and cafes.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The total land area is 490 m2, with two access roads / west and east side of the land.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There is already water connection located on land, while all other infrastructure is nearby - electricity, drains etc.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The land is located in a quiet area on the edge of the construction zone, so is safe from being surrounded by other new building.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is an ideal size and situation for building a large family villa with swimming pool.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is located in the M1 mixed zone, predominantly residential area where it is allowed to build self-standing or semi-detached houses.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Coefficient for free-standing buildings is 30%, while for semi-detached is 35%.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The maximum allowed area of the freestanding building is 200 m2, and for semi-detached house 250 m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The maximum number of floors is basement + ground + 2 floors.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The area is fast becoming more popular with tourists, as the new bridge attaching the island to the mainland has been started, and more people are taking advantage of the fast foot ferry to Split so they can enjoy the attractions of the main town, while sleeping in the peaceful village on the island.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The town of Trogir is 15 min., while to the international airport takes 20 minutes driving.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>We are available to answer further questions and to arrange to visit the location with one of our agents.</p>', '', '1258_Land-plot_0.jpg', '1258_Land-plot_1.jpg', '1258_Land-plot_2.jpg', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(1259, 'Dajana', 'Krolo', '095 5818-205', '', 'dajana.krolo@gmail.com,', 'Hvar', 'ju¾na strana Hvara, Sv.Nedjelja, 1169-5  I   1179-3 KO SVIRÈE', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '200', '1227', '140', 1, '172000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 4, 3, 'June 30, 2015', '<p>Graðevno zemlji&scaron;te s kuæom u prekrasnoj borovoj &scaron;umi s pogledom na more na ju¾noj strani Hvara.&nbsp;Imanje je udaljeno od mora 200 m.&nbsp;Kuæa je smje&scaron;tena na zemlji&scaron;tu od 1227 m2.&nbsp;Ju¾ne je orijentacije.&nbsp;Teren je pogodan za gradnju buduæi da je blago nako&scaron;en, te ima svu potrebnu infrastrukturu.&nbsp;Cesta se nalazi nadomak terenu, te nije prometna.&nbsp;Kuæa se sastoji od prizemlja i kata.</p>', '<p>We are offering this rare opportunity to buy building land in such a beautiful location. It is a small house in a pine forest overlooking the sea on the south side of the island of Hvar. The property is from the sea 200 m, and a direct path leads from the house to the water''s edge. The house is situated on a large plot of 1,227 m2 with a south orientation. The land is very suitable for building because it is slightly sloping, and already has all the necessary infrastructure. The house consists of two floors.<br /><br /><br /></p>', '', '<p>Graðevno zemlji&scaron;te s kuæom u prekrasnoj borovoj &scaron;umi s pogledom na more na ju¾noj strani Hvara.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Imanje je udaljeno od mora 200 m.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je smje&scaron;tena na zemlji&scaron;tu od 1227 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ju¾ne je orijentacije.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Teren je pogodan za gradnju buduæi da je blago nako&scaron;en, te ima svu potrebnu infrastrukturu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Cesta se nalazi nadomak terenu, te nije prometna.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa se sastoji od prizemlja i kata.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Prizemlje se sastoji od jedne spavaæe sobe, kuhinje s dnevnim boravkom, kupaonice, te spreme (18 m2) povrh koje se nalazi terasa.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ukupna stambena povr&scaron;ina prizemlja iznosi 30 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Prizemlje je useljivo, te potpuno namje&scaron;teno, s dva odvojena klimatizacijska ureðaja.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kat je u izgradnji, a ima ukupnu povr&scaron;inu 110 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sastoji se od 3 spavaæe sobe, od kojih je jedna potpuno ureðena, dnevnog boravka, kuhinje, dvije kupaonice te prostrane terase.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Drugi dio zemlji&scaron;ta ima povr&scaron;inu 845 m2, te se na njemu mo¾eizgraditi bazen.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Parking za 10 vozila.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong><span style="text-decoration: underline;">Zemlji&scaron;te (1227 m2) s kuæom moguæe je kupiti zasebno po cijeni od &euro;172.000, a drugi dio zemlji&scaron;ta (845 m2) po cijeni od &euro;125.000.</span></strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na terenu se nalazi put koji vodi do mora.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Restorani i marina su udaljeni minutu vo¾nje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Grad Hvar i Jelsa su udaljeni 20 minuta vo¾nje.</p>', '<p>We are offering this rare opportunity to buy building land in such a beautiful location.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is a small house in a pine forest overlooking the sea on the south side of the island of Hvar.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property is from the sea 200 m, and a direct path leads from the house to the water''s edge.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house is situated on a large plot of 1,227 m2 with a south orientation.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The land is very suitable for building because it is slightly sloping, and already has all the necessary infrastructure.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The road is located close to the ground, and has barely any traffic.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house consists of two floors.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The ground floor consists of a bedroom, kitchen, living room,&nbsp;bathroom, and education in addition to which there is a terrace.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Total living area ground floor of 30 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ground floor is fully furnished, with two separate air cons unit.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The first floor is under construction and has a total surface of 110 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It consists of 3 bedrooms, one of which is completely furnished,&nbsp;living room, kitchen, two bathrooms and a spacious terrace.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The second part of the land has an area 845 m2, and on it can be build a swimming pool and sun patio.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>This land can be purchased separately.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There is private parking for 10 vehicles.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong><span style="text-decoration: underline;">There is a possibility to buy separately the house together with the land plot (1227 m2) at the price of &euro;172.000, while the other part of the land plot (845 m2)is at the price of &euro;125.000.</span></strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There are restaurants, shops and other useful services only a minute away, and one of the island marinas is very close.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The town of Hvar and Jelsa are only 20 minutes away.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact our office for more details and to arrange to view this property.<br /><br /><br /></p>', '', '1259_House-Villa_0.jpg', '1259_House-Villa_1.jpg', '1259_House-Villa_2.jpg', '1259_House-Villa_3.jpg', '1259_House-Villa_4.jpg', '1259_House-Villa_5.jpg', '1259_House-Villa_6.jpg', '1259_House-Villa_7.jpg', '1259_House-Villa_8.jpg'),
(1260, 'Miljenko', 'Giljanoviæ', '(021) 71 17 24', '09153 71 832 ', '', 'Vis', 'Vis, Rogaèiæ 5, 7197/136 ko Vis', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '5', '110', '52', 1, '235000', '', 2, 2, 2, 1, 1, 2, 2, 1, 'July 1, 2015', '<p>Atraktivna samostojeæa kuæa, prvi red do mora, u prekrasnoj uvali nadomak grada Visa.&nbsp;Kuæa je udaljena od mora i pla¾e samo 5 m.&nbsp;Kuæa se sastoji od dvije eta¾e ukupne stambene povr&scaron;ine 70 m2.&nbsp;Dvor ima 41 m2.&nbsp;Ova nekretnina je idealna za one koje vole mir i privatnost.&nbsp;Cijeli otok prepun je skrivenih uvala i prekrasnih pla¾a, stoga je ovo izuzetna prilika ¾elite li izgraditi vlastitu nekretninu gdje je privatnost zagarantirana.</p>', '<p>Croatia Property Sales are offering this attractive detached house on the shore, in a beautiful bay near Vis town. The house is so close to the water that you can hear the waves hit the beach and feed the fish from the balcony. The house consists of two floors with a total floor area of 70 m2. The lower floor has an area of 18 m2, which includes the water tank, while the upper floor area of 52 m2 and consists of two bedrooms, kitchen, dining room, bathroom and terrace with stunning views overlooking the sea. The courtyard has 41 m2.</p>', '', '<p>Atraktivna samostojeæa kuæa, prvi red do mora, u prekrasnoj uvali nadomak grada Visa.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je udaljena od mora i pla¾e samo 5 m.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa se sastoji od dvije eta¾e ukupne stambene povr&scaron;ine 70 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na donjoj eta¾i je prostor od 18 m2, u kojoj je i gustirna, dok je gornja eta¾a povr&scaron;ine od 52 m2, a sastoji se od dvije spavaæe sobe, kuhinje s blagovaonicom, kupaonice i terase s pogledom na more.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Dvor ima 41 m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Vlasni&scaron;tvo uredno.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa posjeduje energetski certifikat "D".</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ova nekretnina je idealna za one koje vole mir i privatnost.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Otok Vis povezan je sa svakodnevnom trajektnom linijom sa gradom Splitom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Cijeli otok prepun je skrivenih uvala i prekrasnih pla¾a, stoga je ovo izuzetna prilika ¾elite li izgraditi vlastitu nekretninu gdje je privatnost zagarantirana.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Meðunarodni aerodrom od Splita je udaljen cca. 40 min.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za sve dodatne informacije slobodno nas kontaktirajte.</p>', '<p>Croatia Property Sales are offering this attractive detached house on the shore, in a beautiful bay near Vis town.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house is so close to the water that you can hear the waves hit the beach and feed the fish from the balcony.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house consists of two floors with a total floor area of 70 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The lower floor has an area of 18 m2, which includes the water tank, while the upper floor area of 52 m2 and consists of two bedrooms, kitchen, dining room, bathroom and terrace with stunning views overlooking the sea.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The courtyard has 41 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house has an energy certificate "A".</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Inside the property is well decorated and it has.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Even well looked after.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>This property is ideal for those who love peace and privacy, as the island is the least visited of the inhabited islands around Split, and is one of the furthest from the mainland.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The area surrounding the bay is natural old olives and forests many years old.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The nearest shop and coffee bar etc is a short cycle away, and there is barely a vehicle on the roads at any time of the year.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The whole island is full of hidden coves and beautiful beaches, so this is a great opportunity if you want to enjoy your own property where privacy is guaranteed.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The island of Vis is linked to the daily ferry from the city of Split.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The international airport of Split is located approximately 40 min.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please for further information contact our office in Split, and we can arrange to visit the property.</p>', '', '1260_House-Villa_0.jpg', '1260_House-Villa_1.jpg', '1260_House-Villa_2.jpg', '1260_House-Villa_3.jpg', '1260_House-Villa_4.jpg', '1260_House-Villa_5.jpg', '1260_House-Villa_6.jpg', '1260_House-Villa_7.jpg', '1260_House-Villa_8.jpg'),
(1261, 'Jozo', 'Hrgoviæ', '', '098/386-770', '', 'Vis', '', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '10', '287', '60', 1, '129000', '', 2, 2, 2, 1, 1, 2, 0, 0, 'July 1, 2015', '<p>Prekrasna kuæa u prvom redu do mora na otoku Visu.&nbsp;Kuæa (roh-bau) je smje&scaron;tena u predivnoj uvali, na udaljenosti samo 10 m od mora.&nbsp;Tlocrtna povr&scaron;ina kuæe iznosi 60 m2.&nbsp;Moguæa je izgradnja 2 kata.&nbsp;Povr&scaron;ina graðevnog zemlji&scaron;ta iznosi 287 m2.&nbsp;Uvala se nalazi na ju¾noj strani otoka s malom &scaron;ljunèanom pla¾om.&nbsp;Ova kuæa osigurava mir i privatnost te nudi prekrasan pogled na more i prirodu.&nbsp;Vis je trajektnom linijom povezan sa gradom Splitom i ostalim otocima.</p>\r\n<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;">CIJENA SNI®ENA SA 149.000 EURO!!</span></p>', '<p>House in the first row to the sea, on the island of Vis island.&nbsp;The house is situated in a beautiful bay, only 10 m from the sea.&nbsp;It is unfinished.&nbsp;The layout of the house is 60 m2.&nbsp;There is possibility to build 2 floors.&nbsp;The building plot measures 287 m2.&nbsp;The bay is on the south side of the island with a small pebble beach.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;">PRICE REDUCED FROM 149.000 EURO!!</span></p>', '', '<p><strong><span style="text-decoration: underline;">CIJENA SNI®ENA SA 149.000 EURO!!</span><br /></strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Prekrasna kuæa u prvom redu do mora na otoku Visu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa (roh-bau) je smje&scaron;tena u predivnoj uvali, na udaljenosti samo 10 m od mora. &nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Tlocrtna povr&scaron;ina kuæe iznosi 60 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Moguæa je izgradnja 2 kata.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Povr&scaron;ina graðevnog zemlji&scaron;ta iznosi 287 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Uvala se nalazi samo 10 minuta vo¾nje makadamskim putem od sela Marinje Zemlje.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Uvala se nalazi na ju¾noj strani otoka s malom &scaron;ljunèanom pla¾om.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ova kuæa osigurava mir i privatnost te nudi prekrasan pogled na more i prirodu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Vis je trajektnom linijom povezan sa gradom Splitom i ostalim otocima.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Meðunarodni aerodrom od Splita je udaljen cca. 40 min.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za sve dodatne informacije slobodno nas kontaktirajte.</p>', '<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;"><strong>PRICE REDUCED FROM 149.000 EURO!!</strong></span></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>House in the first row to the sea, on the island of Vis island.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house is situated in a beautiful bay, only 10 m from the sea.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is unfinished.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The layout of the house is 60 m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There is possibility to build 2 floors.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The building plot measures 287 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The bay is located just 10 minutes by following the path from the village Marinje Earth.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The bay is on the south side of the island with a small pebble beach.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Very few people live on the island throughout the whole year, and the majority of tourists to the Dalmatia don''t visit it either, but the few people who have chosen Vis as a destination for their second love it for its charm and natural state.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There are shops with essential items, restaurants, bars and other facilities, and any number of near deserted coves and beaches to enjoy.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Vis is connected by ferry from Split and the other islands.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The international airport of Split is located approx. 40 min.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact our office in Split and talk to one of our agents for more.</p>', '', '1261_House-Villa_0.jpg', '1261_House-Villa_1.jpg', '1261_House-Villa_2.jpg', '1261_House-Villa_3.jpg', '1261_House-Villa_4.jpg', '1261_House-Villa_5.jpg', '', '', ''),
(1262, '', 'Stipèeviæ', '023 341 888', '099 836 88 10', 'tina.jelenkovic@gmail.com', 'Zadar', 'Petrèane, k.è. 2688 Petrèane', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '5', '510', '410', 1, '1150000', '', 2, 1, 2, 1, 1, 2, 3, 5, 'July 3, 2015', '<p>Prekrasna vila u blizini Zadra, u prvom redu do mora.&nbsp;Vila je moderno ureðena, te ima predivan pogled na more koje je udaljeno svega nekoliko metara.&nbsp;Sastoji se od èetiri eta¾e (podruma, prizemlja, prvog i drugog kata) ukupne stambene povr&scaron;ine 410 m2, dok zemlji&scaron;te ima povr&scaron;inu 510 m2.&nbsp;Vila je skoro dovr&scaron;ena, potrebno je jo&scaron; postaviti keramiku, sanitariju, podne obloge i vrata.</p>', '<p>Beautiful villa near Zadar, first row to the sea.&nbsp;Villa is modern designed, and it has spectacular sea view.&nbsp;It is situated only few m from the sea.&nbsp;It consists of four floors with a total living area of 410 sqm, while the land plot measures 510 sqm.&nbsp;Villa is finished except ceramic, sanitary, flooring and interior doors.&nbsp;</p>', '', '<p>Prekrasna vila u blizini Zadra, u prvom redu do mora.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Vila je moderno ureðena, te ima predivan pogled na more koje je udaljeno svega nekoliko metara.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sastoji se od èetiri eta¾e (podruma, prizemlja, prvog i drugog kata) ukupne stambene povr&scaron;ine 410 m2, dok zemlji&scaron;te ima povr&scaron;inu 510 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Vila je skoro dovr&scaron;ena, potrebno je jo&scaron; postaviti keramiku, sanitariju, podne obloge i vrata.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Podrum se sastoji od prostora u kojem se nalazi konoba u dalmatinskom stilu s kominom, vinoteka, kupaonica, wc, te prostor za rekreaciju.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Prizemlje se sastoji od gara¾e, prostorije za tehniku (centralni bojler, grijanje i sl.),wc-a, dnevnog boravka, blagovaonice, kuhinje i prostora za bijelu tehniku.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Treæa eta¾a se sastoji od spavaæe sobe, dva studio apartmana s odvojenom garderobom, dvije kupaonice, te jo&scaron; jedne spavaæe sobe iz koje se pru¾a pogled na more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Èetvrta eta¾a se sastoji od krovna terasa na kojoj se nalazi polunatkriven prostor za sunèanje s hidromasa¾nom kadom 2x2m, coctail barom i saunom (po izboru mo¾e i drugaèije).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Vlasni&scaron;tvo je uredno.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Mjesto je popularno meðu turistima, prepoznato ako idealno za odmor i opu&scaron;tanje, poznato po predivnim pla¾ama, a od Zadra udaljeno samo 7 km.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Meðunarodni aerodrom u Zadru je udaljen 12 km.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Molimo Vas da se javite u na&scaron; ured za sve dodatne informacije.<br /><br /></p>', '<p>Beautiful villa near Zadar, first row to the sea.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Villa is modern designed, and it has spectacular sea view.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is situated only few metres from the sea.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It consists of four floors with a total living area of 410 sqm, while the land plot measures 510 sqm.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Villa is finished except ceramic, sanitary, flooring and interior doors.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The basement consists of a space where is a tavern in Dalmatian style with a fireplace, wine cellar, bathroom, toilet and space for recreation.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The ground floor consists of a garage, room for technique (central boiler, heating, etc.), bathroom, living room dining room, kitchen and space for appliances.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the third floor is a sleeping room, two studio apartments with a separate dressing room, comfortable bathrooms, and a separate bathroom in the hallway and another room with a sea view (three bedrooms).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the fourth floor there is a roof terrace of the half-sun deck with hot tub 2x2m, cocktail bar and sauna (optionally or otherwise), briefly another cozy place to socialize.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The place is popular among tourists, because of the clean shore and beach, and it is identified as an ideal area for rest and relaxation, and it is only 7 km away from Zadar.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The international airport in Zadar is 12 km away.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact our office for further information or to arrange to visit the property.</p>', '', '1262_House-Villa_0.jpg', '1262_House-Villa_1.jpg', '1262_House-Villa_2.jpg', '1262_House-Villa_3.jpg', '1262_House-Villa_4.jpg', '1262_House-Villa_5.jpg', '1262_House-Villa_6.jpg', '1262_House-Villa_7.jpg', '1262_House-Villa_8.jpg'),
(1263, 'Mirko', 'Vidoviæ', '', 'Jasna Vidoviæ 098 188 5321', 'ja.vidovic@yahoo.com', 'Split', 'Gospe od mira 9 Stobreè, k.è.2192/1 k.o. stobreè, ZU 1558', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '400', '483', '400', 1, '750000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 1, 7, 5, 'July 8, 2015', '<p>Lijepa apartmanska kuæa s bazenom u Stobreèu, 400 metara od mora i svih sadr¾aja, u mirnom okru¾enju manjih stambenih objekata.&nbsp;Objekt je iznimno dobro odr¾avan i koristi se u svrhu turistièkog najma (4*).&nbsp;Sastoji se od prizemlja i dva kata ukupne stambene povr&scaron;ine 400 m2.&nbsp;Zemlji&scaron;te ima povr&scaron;inu 483 m2.</p>', '<p>Lovely apartment house with swimming pool in Stobrec, at only 400 meters from the sea and all amenities.&nbsp;It is located in a peaceful part of the village, surrounded by low-rise family homes.&nbsp;The property is being used for tourist rental (4*).&nbsp;It consisits of ground floor + 1st + 2nd floor total living area of 400m sq, while the land plot measures 483m sq.</p>', '', '<p><strong>Dobra prilika za investiranjem u turistièko iznajmljivanje</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Lijepa apartmanska kuæa s bazenom u Stobreèu, 400 metara od mora i svih sadr¾aja, u mirnom okru¾enju manjih stambenih objekata.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Objekt je iznimno dobro odr¾avan i koristi se u svrhu turistièkog najma (4*). S obzirom na dokazano postignute rezultate u najmu predstavlja dobru priliku za investicijom.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sastoji se od prizemlja i dva kata ukupne stambene povr&scaron;ine 400 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Zemlji&scaron;te ima povr&scaron;inu 483 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U prizemlju se nalazi veliki jednosobni stan sa vanjskom terasom te sala za biljar/dru¾enje gostiju.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na prvom katu se nalazi veliki trosobni stan, dok drugi kat zgrade zauzimaju dva stana &ndash; manji dvosoban i komforan jednosoban.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U dvori&scaron;tu se nalazi bazen sa sjenicom i vanjskim ro&scaron;tiljem, a na parceli postoje gara¾na i parkirali&scaron;na mjesta za ukupno 6 automobila.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Centar Splita je udaljen 4 km, dok je meðunarodni aerodrom udaljen 25 km.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za sve dodatne informacije molimo kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured u Splitu.</p>', '<p><strong>Great opportunity in tourist rental business</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Lovely apartment house with swimming pool in Stobrec, at only 400 meters from the sea and all amenities.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is located in a peaceful part of the village, surrounded by low-rise family homes.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property is being used for tourist rental (4*). Due to proven record of income, it represents great investment opportunity. &nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It consisits of ground floor + 1st + 2nd floor total living area of 400m sq, while the land plot measures 483m sq.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ground floor contains large 1-bedroom apartment and snooker room.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Big 3-bedroom apartment occupies the second floor.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The third floor hosts two apartments &ndash; smaller 2-bedroom unit and comfortable 1-bedroom unit.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Swimming pool is in the garden, along with the shed and outdoor BBQ.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There are 6 parking and garage places altogether.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Center of Split is 4 km, while the international airport is 25 km away.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact our office in Split for the further information.</p>', '', '1263_House-Villa_0.jpg', '1263_House-Villa_1.jpg', '1263_House-Villa_2.jpg', '1263_House-Villa_3.jpg', '1263_House-Villa_4.jpg', '1263_House-Villa_5.jpg', '1263_House-Villa_6.jpg', '1263_House-Villa_7.jpg', '1263_House-Villa_8.jpg'),
(1264, 'Maria', 'Wilson', '+61 899 271 418,', ' Senka Ban 091 512 2420', 'killara66@bigpond.com.au ', 'Solta', 'Turanj 5 Gornje Selo, o. ©olta, k.è. 4214, 4220 k.o. Gornje Selo, ZU1020', 'For sale', 'Old stone house', '1500', '227', '135', 1, '180000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 4, 2, 'July 8, 2015', '<p>Lijepa renovirana kamena kuæa na &Scaron;olti, u malom mjestu u unutra&scaron;njosti otoka, oko 1,5 km od mora. U samom centru mjesta, nedaleko od javnog prijevoza i trgovine.&nbsp;Kuæa je temeljito renovirana &ndash; novi krov, ploèice, instalacije, PVC prozori sa aluminijskim griljama.&nbsp;135 m2 stambenog prostora + 90 m2 konobe i gustirne + 45 m2 terase na drugom katu + dva objekta za renovaciju (14 i 47 m2).&nbsp;Povr&scaron;ina zemlji&scaron;ta iznosi 227 m2.</p>', '<p>Lovely renovated stone house on Solta island, in a small inland village, approx. 1,5 km from the sea.&nbsp;The house has recently been renovated (new roof, pvc windows, alluminum shutters, new wiring etc). Next to the house there are 2 stone houses for renovation (one ruin and the other in decent external condition).&nbsp;135 sq.m living space + 90 sq.m optional living space on the ground floor + 45 sq.m terrace + nearby stone houses for renovation (14 and 47 sq.m). The land plot measures 227 sq.m.</p>', '', '<p>Lijepa renovirana kamena kuæa na &Scaron;olti, u malom mjestu u unutra&scaron;njosti otoka, oko 1,5 km od mora.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U samom centru mjesta, nedaleko od javnog prijevoza i trgovine.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Prizemlje: konoba te cisterna za vodu (jo&scaron; u fuknciji, iako je kuæa spojena na gradski vodovod).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Lijepo ureðeni unutarnji dvor, od ulice ograðen zidom, a u dvori&scaron;tu se nalazi ro&scaron;tilj te mali wc.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Prvi kat: blagovaonica i kuhinja, dnevna soba, ulazni predprostor i kupaonica, spavaæa soba.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Drugi kat: dvije spavaæe sobe (velika i manja djeèja), kupaonica.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Spu&scaron;teni strop sa ugraðenom rasvjetom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Velika otvorena krovna terasa sa lijepim pogledom na okolne kuæe.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je temeljito renovirana &ndash; novi krov, ploèice, instalacije, PVC prozori sa aluminijskim griljama.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Pokraj kuæe nalaze se dva gospodarska objekta (jedna ru&scaron;evina te druga kuæica za renovaciju) sa manjim dvori&scaron;tem.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Moguæe ih je obnoviti ili koristiti prostor kao parking.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>135 m2 stambenog prostora + 90 m2 konobe i gustirne + 45 m2 terase na drugom katu + dva objekta za renovaciju (14 i 47 m2).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Povr&scaron;ina zemlji&scaron;ta iznosi 227 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Grohote su udaljene 8 km.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&Scaron;olta ima redovne trajektne i brodske linije sa Splitom kroz cijelu godinu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za sva pitanja ili dogovor oko razgledavanja ove ili slicnih nekretnina na otoku stojimo na usluzi.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>Lovely renovated stone house on Solta island, in a small inland village, approx. 1,5 km from the sea.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It''s in the center, nearby the local shop and public transport.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ground floor: utility room and water tank (the house has mains water).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nicely decorated inner courtyard with BBQ and toilet.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>First floor: dining room, kitchen, living room, bathroom and bedroom.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Second floor: two bedrooms, bathroom and large uncovered terrace with lovely views on the village.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house has recently been renovated (new roof, pvc windows, alluminum shutters, new wiring etc).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Next to the house there are 2 stone houses for renovation (one ruin and the other in decent external condition).&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>135 sq.m living space + 90 sq.m optional living space on the ground floor + 45 sq.m terrace + nearby stone houses for renovation (14 and 47 sq.m).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The land plot measures 227 sq.m.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The island of Solta is the nearest habited island to Split but strangely one of the least visited and perhaps the quietest.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Local people believe it to be the most charming and beautiful.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact Croatia property sales for more information.</p>', '', '1264_Old-stone-house_0.jpg', '1264_Old-stone-house_1.jpg', '1264_Old-stone-house_2.jpg', '1264_Old-stone-house_3.jpg', '1264_Old-stone-house_4.jpg', '1264_Old-stone-house_5.jpg', '1264_Old-stone-house_6.jpg', '1264_Old-stone-house_7.jpg', '1264_Old-stone-house_8.jpg'),
(1265, 'Klaus', 'Meyer', 'Klaus +49 151 18449186,', 'Paula +385 99 5939894', 'pk-meyer@t-online.de', 'Brac', 'Sutivan, k.è. 20/5 k.o. sutivan', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '220', '720', '185', 1, '350000', '', 2, 1, 2, 2, 1, 2, 2, 2, 'July 8, 2015', '<p>Novoizgraðena prizemna kuæa u Sutivanu, svega 5 minuta hoda do mora.&nbsp;Objekt ima 2 spavaæe sobe, 2 kupaonice te veliki dnevni boravak sa kuhinjom i blagovaonicom ukupne stambene povr&scaron;ine 185 m2.&nbsp;Povr&scaron;ina zemlji&scaron;ta iznosi 720 m2.&nbsp;Kuæa je udaljena od mora 220 m.&nbsp;U suterenu se nalazi gostinjski apartman povr&scaron;ine 46 m2.</p>\r\n<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;">CIJENA SNI®ENA SA 370.000 EUR!</span></p>', '<p>Newly built bungalow in Sutivan, only 5 min walking distance to the beach.&nbsp;The house features 2 bedrooms, 2 bathrooms, large open-plan living room with kitchen and dining room, total living area of 185 m2.&nbsp;The land plot measures 720 m2.&nbsp;House is situated 220 m from the sea.&nbsp;Lower ground floor has a guest suite/apartment sized 46 sq.m.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;">PRICE REDUCED FROM 370.000 EUR!</span></p>', '', '<p><strong><span style="text-decoration: underline;">CIJENA SNI®ENA SA 370.000 EUR!</span><br /></strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Novoizgraðena prizemna kuæa u Sutivanu, svega 5 minuta hoda do mora.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Objekt ima 2 spavaæe sobe, 2 kupaonice te veliki dnevni boravak sa kuhinjom i blagovaonicom ukupne stambene povr&scaron;ine 185 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Povr&scaron;ina zemlji&scaron;ta iznosi 720 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je udaljena od mora 220 m.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Po cijeloj kuæi provedene su instalacije za vodu, struju, grijanje/hlaðenje te postavljene elektriène roletne.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sve su prostorije klimatizirane, a kupaonica, kihinja i dnevni boravak u cijelosti namje&scaron;teni.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U suterenu se nalazi gostinjski apartman povr&scaron;ine 46 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je &nbsp;sjeverno orijentirana.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Po ¾elji kupca, uz nadolatu je moguæe izvesti dovr&scaron;etak radova te postavljanje bazena.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Otok Braè povezan je svakodnevnom trajektnom linijom sa gradom Splitom, dok je meðunarodni aerodrom udaljen 40 minuta vo¾nje od Splita.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Supetar je udaljen 6 km od mjesta.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Molimo kontaktirajte nas za sve dodatne informacije.</p>', '<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;"><strong>PRICE REDUCED FROM 370.000 EUR!</strong></span></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Newly built bungalow in Sutivan, only 5 min walking distance to the beach.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house features 2 bedrooms, 2 bathrooms, large open-plan living room with kitchen and dining room, total living area of 185 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The land plot measures 720 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>House is situated 220 m from the sea.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Water, electricity, heating/cooling has been put through the entire house, as well as electrical shutters.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>All rooms are air-conditioned. Fully fitted bathroom, kitchen and living room.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Lower ground floor has a guest suite/apartment sized 46 sq.m.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>North oriented.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>At extra charge, it is possible to complete the house according to the buyer''s wishes and to build a pool.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The island of Brac is connected by daily ferry lines to Split, while the international airport is 40 minutes drive from Split.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Supetar is 6 km away from this place.</p>', '', '1265_House-Villa_0.jpg', '1265_House-Villa_1.jpg', '1265_House-Villa_2.jpg', '1265_House-Villa_3.jpg', '1265_House-Villa_4.jpg', '1265_House-Villa_5.jpg', '1265_House-Villa_6.jpg', '1265_House-Villa_7.jpg', '1265_House-Villa_8.jpg'),
(1266, '', 'Dalmatian Home', '', '', '', 'Rogoznica', '', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '10', '0', '100', 1, '138000', '', 2, 2, 2, 1, 1, 2, 0, 0, 'July 14, 2015', '<p>Apartmani na top lokaciji!&nbsp;Nalaze se u samom srcu Rogoznice u 1.redu do mora, u zgradi sa ukupno 8 apartmanskih jedinica. Graðena je od kvalitetnih materijala i po svim va¾eæim graðevinskim normama. Svaka jedinica je klimatizirana, a sama zgrada je u razredu nisko energetskih graðevina. Va¾no je napomenuti da svaki apartman pogled na more, bez obzira na poziciju u objektu! Takoðer, svakom apartmanu pripada i jedno eta¾irano parkirno mjesto.</p>', '<p>Apartments on top location!&nbsp;Apartments are located in the heart of Rogoznica, in the 1st row to the sea. The building is built with high quality materials and with rigorous building standards. Each unit is air-conditioned, and the building itself is classified as low EC. It&rsquo;s also important to note that apartment has a sea view than cannot be obstructed in the future! Each apartment has one parking place included in the price.<br /><br /></p>', '', '<p>Apartmani na top lokaciji!</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nalaze se u samom srcu Rogoznice u 1.redu do mora, u zgradi sa ukupno 8 apartmanskih jedinica.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Graðena je od kvalitetnih materijala i po svim va¾eæim graðevinskim normama.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Svaka jedinica je klimatizirana, a sama zgrada je u razredu nisko energetskih graðevina.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Va¾no je napomenuti da svaki apartman pogled na more, bez obzira na poziciju u objektu!</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Takoðer, svakom apartmanu pripada i jedno eta¾irano parkirno mjesto.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Slobodni apartmani:</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>S3, 1.kat, 41,50m2 stambene povr&scaron;ine + 13,24m2 terasa + 44,91m2 vrt, cijena 138.000,00 EUR</strong></p>\r\n<p><strong><br /></strong></p>\r\n<p><strong>S4, 2.kat, 63,77m2, cijena 145.000,00 EURS5, 2.kat, 59,69m2, cijena 134.000,00 EUR</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Rogoznica je mirno i toplo mediteransko mjesto na samom kraju Srednje Dalmacije.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Prote¾e se uzdu¾ 50 km obale i rado je posjeæuju nautièari, jer je poznata kao jedna od najljep&scaron;ih i najsigurnijih luka na Jadranu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Pla¾e su u Rogoznici &scaron;ljunèane, ima i pone&scaron;to stijena, a svako naselje nudi skrovita kupali&scaron;ta u brojnim malim uvalama.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Klima je jedan od najva¾nijih atraktivnih turistièkih elemenata, te na rogoznièkom podruèju prosjeèno ima 2600 sunèanih sati na godinu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Tijekom èetiri ljetna mjeseca u prosjeku ima svega od 4 do 7 ki&scaron;nih dana.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Rogoznica ima odliènu prometnu povezanost, a najbli¾i aerodrom u Splitu udaljen je 25km.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>Apartments on top location!</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartments are located in the heart of Rogoznica, in the 1st row to the sea.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The building is built with high quality materials and with rigorous building standards.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Each unit is air-conditioned, and the building itself is classified as low EC.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It&rsquo;s also important to note that apartment has a sea view than cannot be obstructed in the future!</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Each apartment has one parking place included in the price.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Available apartments are:</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>S3, 1st floor, living area 41,50m2 + 13,24m2 + 44,91m2 terrace garden, price 138,000.00 EUR</strong></p>\r\n<p><strong><br /></strong></p>\r\n<p><strong>S4, 2nd floor, 63,77m2, price 145,000.00 EURS5, 2nd floor, 59,69m2, price 134,000.00 EUR</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Rogoznica is calm and warm Mediterranean town on the outskirts of Central Dalmatia.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It stretches 50 km along the coast and is gladly visited by sailors, because it is known as one of the most beautiful and safest ports.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Beaches in Rogoznica are mostly gravel, but there are some rocks, and every resort offers secluded beaches in the numerous small bays.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The climate is one of the most attractive tourist elements, and the Rogoznica field has averaged 2,600 sunny hours per year.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>During the four summer months, on average, there are only 4-7 rainy days.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Rogoznica has excellent transport connection, and the nearest international airport in Split is 25 km away.</p>', '', '1266_Apartment_0.jpg', '1266_Apartment_1.jpg', '1266_Apartment_2.jpg', '1266_Apartment_3.jpg', '1266_Apartment_4.jpg', '1266_Apartment_5.jpg', '1266_Apartment_6.jpg', '1266_Apartment_7.jpg', ''),
(1267, 'Jozo ', 'Lovriæ', '', 'Jelena Duvnjak 0958599806', '', 'Trogir', 'Planikovica  Okrug Gornji, 1630/4', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '200', '530', '250', 1, '750000', '', 2, 1, 2, 2, 1, 1, 3, 4, 'July 17, 2015', '<p>Izuzetna prilika za kupnju luksuzne samostojeæe vile na otoku Èiovu koja se nalazi u blizini povijesnih gradova Trogira, Splita i mnogobrojnih drugih sadr¾aja.&nbsp;Smje&scaron;tena je na zapadnoj strani otoka, dok je orijentacija kuæe sjeverna. Pje&scaron;èana pla¾a udaljena je 230 m, ali na otoku takoðer postoje mnoge prirodno kamenite pla¾e i skrivene uvale.&nbsp;Zemlji&scaron;te ne kojem se nalazi vila velièine je 530 m2. Stambena povr&scaron;ina iznosi 250 m2, a sastoji se od prizemlja i 1.kata.</p>', '<p>Unique opportunity to buy a luxury detached villas on Ciovo which is located near the historic towns of Trogir, Split and many other attractions.&nbsp;It is located on the west side of the island, while the orientation of the house north. The pebble beach is 230 meters, but on the island there are also many natural rocky beaches and hidden coves.&nbsp;The land is not located villa size is 530 m2. Living area approx. 250 m2 and consists of ground floor and 1st floor.</p>', '', '<p>Izuzetna prilika za kupnju luksuzne samostojeæe vile na otoku Èiovu koja se nalazi u blizini povijesnih gradova Trogira, Splita i mnogobrojnim drugih sadr¾aja.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Smje&scaron;tena je na zapadnoj strani otoka, dok je orijentacija kuæe sjeverna.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Pje&scaron;èana pla¾a udaljena je 230 m, ali na otoku takoðer postoje mnoge prirodno kamenite pla¾e i skrivene uvale.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Zemlji&scaron;te ne koje se nalazi vila velièine je 530 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Stambena povr&scaron;ina iznosi cca. 250 m2, a sastoji se od prizemlja i 1.kata.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U prizemlju se nalazi dnevni boravak koji je oblo¾en velikim staklenim stjenkama, kuhinja, blagovaonica, kupaonica i 2 spreme.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U prizemlju se jo&scaron; nalazi sauna i prostorija sa fitness spravama.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na 1.katu se 3 spavaæe sobe, 3 kupaonice i 2 balkona sa direktnim izlazom iz 2 sobe.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na 1.katu se takoðer nalazi i odvojena vanjska terasa sa kaminom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Vila je potpuno luksuzno ureðena i namje&scaron;tena sa bazenom i jaccuzijem u dvori&scaron;tu, solarnim kolektorima, automatskim zalijevanjem, elektiènim roletama, itd...&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Parking mjesto je dovoljno za 2 automobila, dok je kuæa za&scaron;tiæena sa kvalitetnim video nadzorom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Svi su sadr¾aji u blizini, a do meðunarodnog aerodroma je potrebno 15 min. vo¾nje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ostajemo na usluzi za sve dodatne informacije.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>Unique opportunity to buy a luxury detached villas on Ciovo which is located near the historic towns of Trogir, Split and many other attractions.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is located on the west side of the island, while the orientation of the house north.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The pebble beach is 230 meters, but on the island there are also many natural rocky beaches and hidden coves.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The land is not located villa size is 530 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Living area approx. 250 m2 and consists of ground floor and 1st floor.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The ground floor living room, which is lined with large glass walls, kitchen, dining room, bathroom and 2 qualifications.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The ground is still there with a sauna and a gym workout.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the 1st floor are 3 bedrooms, 3 bathrooms and 2 balconies with direct access from 2 bedrooms.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the 1st floor is also a separate outdoor terrace with fireplace.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The villa is fully luxuriously furnished and equipped with pool and Jacuzzi in the garden, solar panels, automatic watering, an electric shutters, etc ...</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Parking space is enough for 2 cars, while the house is protected with high-quality video surveillance.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>All the facilities in the vicinity, and to the international airport it takes 15 min. driving.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>We remain at your disposal for any further information.</p>', '', '1267_House-Villa_0.jpg', '1267_House-Villa_1.jpg', '1267_House-Villa_2.jpg', '1267_House-Villa_3.jpg', '1267_House-Villa_4.jpg', '1267_House-Villa_5.jpg', '1267_House-Villa_6.jpg', '1267_House-Villa_7.jpg', '1267_House-Villa_8.jpg');
INSERT INTO `nekretnina` (`id`, `ime`, `prezime`, `telefon`, `mobitel`, `e_mail`, `lokacija_id`, `adresa`, `status_id`, `vrsta_id`, `udaljenost`, `povrsina`, `stambenapovrsina`, `display`, `cijena`, `cijenatocka`, `ponuda_tjedna`, `new_built`, `must_sell`, `prvi_red_do_mora`, `pogled_na_more`, `bazen`, `broj_soba`, `broj_kupatila`, `datum`, `title_hr`, `title_en`, `title_ge`, `opis_hr`, `opis_en`, `opis_ge`, `PropertyImageURL0`, `PropertyImageURL1`, `PropertyImageURL2`, `PropertyImageURL3`, `PropertyImageURL4`, `PropertyImageURL5`, `PropertyImageURL6`, `PropertyImageURL7`, `PropertyImageURL8`) VALUES
(1268, 'Ivan ', 'Èamber', '098 887 7494', '', '', 'Trogir', 'Krèiæ 3 Okrug Gornji, 631/2', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '400', '0', '41', 1, '85000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 1, 1, 'July 17, 2015', '<p>Potpuno namje&scaron;ten i opremljen apartman koji se trenutno koristi u svrhu turistièkog iznajmljivanja.&nbsp;Nalazi se na 1.katu u zgradi smje&scaron;tenoj na ju¾nom dijelu otoka Èiova koji je ujedno turistièki najpopularniji dio.&nbsp;Do prekrasne uvale i mnogobrojnih prirodno kamenitih pla¾a ima 400 m. U samoj uvali nalazi se i manja &scaron;ljunèana pla¾a.&nbsp;Apartman ima povr&scaron;inu 32,59 m2 + balkon 8,62 m2. S balkona se pru¾a djelomièan pogled na more.</p>', '<p>We are offering this fully furnished apartment in a great location for agreat price.&nbsp;It is located on the 1st floor in a building located in the southern partof the island Ciovo, a popular area for tourists, and the apartment has beenused to rent for tourists.&nbsp;The road to the beautiful bay and shore is 400m only, and there are manynatural rocky inlets between beaches and a pebble beach in the bay to enjoy.&nbsp;The apartment has an area of 32.59 m2 + balcony 8.62 m2.&nbsp;The balcony offers a partial sea view.&nbsp;</p>', '', '<p>Potpuno namje&scaron;ten i opremljen apartman koji se trenutno koristi u svrhu turistièkog iznajmljivanja.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nalazi se na 1.katu u zgradi smje&scaron;tenoj na ju¾nom dijelu otoka Èiova koji je ujedno turistièki najpopularniji dio.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Udaljenost od prekrasne uvale i mnogobrojnih prirodno kamenitih pla¾a je 400 m.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U samoj uvali nalazi se i manja &scaron;ljunèana pla¾a.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartman ima povr&scaron;inu 32,59 m2 + balkon 8,62 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>S balkona se pru¾a djelomièan pogled na more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartman se sastoji od dnevnog boravka sa kuhinjom i blagovaonicom, kupaonice, spavaæe sobe i balkona.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Potpuno je namje&scaron;ten i spreman za useljenje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ispred zgrade nalazi se parking mjesto koje je ukljuèeno u cijenu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U prizemlju zgrade se nalazi restoran, a u blizini su svi ostali sadr¾aji.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Centar mjesta udaljen je 10 minuta pje&scaron;ke, dok je prekrasni povijesni grad Trogir udaljen 10 min. vo¾nje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za sve dodatne informacije nas slobodno kontaktirajte.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>We are offering this fully furnished apartment in a great location for agreat price.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is located on the 1st floor in a building located in the southern partof the island Ciovo, a popular area for tourists, and the apartment has beenused to rent for tourists.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The road to the beautiful bay and shore is 400m only, and there are manynatural rocky inlets between beaches and a pebble beach in the bay to enjoy.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The apartment has an area of 32.59 m2 + balcony 8.62 m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The balcony offers a partial sea view.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The apartment has a modern design with an open plan living room and kitchen leading out onto the wide balcony, a bathroom, bedroom and balcony.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is fully furnished and ready for immediate occupancy.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>In front of the building there is a private parking place which is includedin the price.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The ground floor is a restaurant, and it is close to many other facilitiesin the local village.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The centre is 10 minutes away on foot, while the beautiful historical cityof Trogir is 10 min. driving.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact the office for more information and to arrange to visit the property.</p>', '', '1268_Apartment_0.JPG', '1268_Apartment_1.JPG', '1268_Apartment_2.JPG', '1268_Apartment_3.JPG', '1268_Apartment_4.JPG', '', '', '', ''),
(1269, 'Nadia', 'Glumac', '', '+447950146143', 'nadiaglumac@aol.com', 'Trogir', 'Mavarstica &#8211; 3 red od centra uvale Okrug Gornji, 914/1', 'For sale', 'Land plot', '70', '500', '0', 1, '89000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 0, 0, 'July 17, 2015', '<p>U 3. redu od mora u jednoj od najpopularnijih dijelova otoka Èiova nalazi se graðevinsko zemlji&scaron;te.&nbsp;Smje&scaron;teno je na ju¾nom dijelu udaljeno svega 70 m od &scaron;ljunèane i mnogih prirodno kamenitih pla¾a.&nbsp;Pristupni put je direktan dok se sva infrastruktura nalazi odmah do zemlji&scaron;ta. Ukupna povr&scaron;ina iznosi 500 m2 i postoji moguæost izgradnje objekta na 3 eta¾e.&nbsp;Dovoljno je prostrano za luksuznu vilu sa bazenom ili manju obiteljsku kuæu.</p>', '<p>We are offering this building plot in the third row of property from the sea, in one of the most popular and beautiful villages on the island Ciovo.&nbsp;It is located in the southern part situated only 70 meters from the shore where there is a sandy and pebble sea bed. Access road is direct while all the infrastructure is located next to &nbsp;the land (electric, gas, water, drains etc). The total area is 500 m2 and there is the possibility to construct a building with 3 floors - a spacious luxury villa with swimming pool or a small family house.&nbsp;</p>', '', '<p>U 3. redu od mora u jednoj od najpopularnijih dijelova otoka Èiova nalazi se graðevinsko zemlji&scaron;te.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Smje&scaron;teno je na ju¾nom dijelu udaljeno svega 70 m od &scaron;ljunèane i mnogih prirodno kamenitih pla¾a.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Pristupni put je direktan dok se sva infrastruktura nalazi odmah do zemlji&scaron;ta.Ukupna povr&scaron;ina iznosi 500 m2 i postoji moguæost izgradnje objekta na 3 eta¾e.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Dovoljno je prostrano za luksuznu vilu sa bazenom ili manju obiteljsku kuæu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ovo je prilika s obzirom da je na tom dijelu ogranièena ponuda zemlji&scaron;ta koja su na prodaju.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Cijeli otok je popularno turistièko odredi&scaron;te, stoga mo¾ete izgraditi objekt koji bi vam slu¾io u svrhu iznajmljivanja.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Centar mjesta je udaljen nekoliko minuta vo¾nje, a do grada Trogira i aerodroma je potrebno cca. 15 min. vo¾nje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na usluzi smo za sve dodatne informacije.</p>', '<p>We are offering this building plot in the third row of property from the sea, in one of the most popular and beautiful villages on the island Ciovo.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is located in the southern part situated only 70 meters from the shore where there is a sandy and pebble sea bed.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Access road is direct while all the infrastructure is located next to the land (electric, gas, water, drains etc).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The total area is 500 m2 and there is the possibility to construct a building with 3 floors - a spacious luxury villa with swimming pool or a small family house.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>This is rare opportunity as there is a limited supply of land available for building which is for sale.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The entire island is a popular tourist destination, and the infrastructure is constantly being improved, so building a property suitable for renting is entirely viable.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The centre of the village is a short drive away, and the town of Trogir the UNESCO area, and the airport is around. 15 min. driving.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact the office to arrange to visit this building plot.</p>', '', '1269_Land-plot_0.JPG', '1269_Land-plot_1.JPG', '1269_Land-plot_2.JPG', '1269_Land-plot_3.JPG', '1269_Land-plot_4.JPG', '1269_Land-plot_5.JPG', '', '', ''),
(1270, 'Stanko', 'Mrdulja¹', '021386722', '0913867 722', '', 'Trogir', 'Osoje VI &#8211; prvi red lijevo Okrug Donji, 1924/4 , 1267 zgr', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '10', '955', '200', 1, '450000', '', 2, 2, 2, 1, 1, 2, 6, 2, 'July 17, 2015', '<p>U 1.redu do mora smjestila se samostojeæa kuæa kojoj je potrebna kompletna adaptacija, ali je zbog &nbsp;polo¾aja i velièine zemlji&scaron;ta izuzetna prilika za ulaganje.&nbsp;Nalazi se na zapadnoj strani otoka Èiova uz samu prirodno kamenitu pla¾u. Ukupna povr&scaron;ina zemlji&scaron;ta iznosi 955 m2, dok je tlocrtna povr&scaron;ina kuæe 130 m2.&nbsp;Kuæa se sastoji od suterena, prizemlja i potkrovlja ukupne povr&scaron;ine cca. 200 m2.</p>', '<p>We are excited to offer this renovation project and great opportunity to buy a first line detached property on a large plot. It is situated just a few yards from the water, where there is a natural stone and pebble beach, on the west side of Ciovo island. Total land is 955 m2, while the surface area of the house 130 m2. The house consists of basement, ground floor and top floor, with a total area of approximately 200 m2.</p>', '', '<p>U 1.redu do mora smjestila se samostojeæa kuæa kojoj je potrebna kompletna adaptacija, ali je zbog &nbsp;polo¾aja i velièine zemlji&scaron;ta izuzetna prilika za ulaganje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nalazi se na zapadnoj strani otoka Èiova uz samu prirodno kamenitu pla¾u.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ukupna povr&scaron;ina zemlji&scaron;ta iznosi 955 m2, dok je tlocrtna povr&scaron;ina kuæe 130 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa se sastoji od suterena, prizemlja i potkrovlja ukupne povr&scaron;ine cca. 200 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sastoji se od 6 soba, 2 kupaonice, 3 terase i 2 loggie.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Postoji moguænost pro&scaron;irenja kuæe.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Teren je trenutno zapu&scaron;ten i na strani od kuæe prema mogu je dosta strm, ali je uz dodatno ulaganje moguæe urediti prostrano dvori&scaron;te sa bazenom i parkingom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je graðena 80-ih godina, a sva potrebna infrastruktura se nalazi odmah do zemlji&scaron;ta.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Centar mjesta gdje se nalazi trgovina je udaljen nekoliko minuta, dok su svi ostali sadr¾aji udaljeni cca. 10 minuta vo¾nje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Do meðunarodnog aerodroma je potrebno 20 min. vo¾nje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Stojimo na usluzi za sva dodatna pitanja.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>We are excited to offer this renovation project and great opportunity to buy a first line detached property on a large plot.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is situated just a few yards from the water, where there is a natural stone and pebble beach, on the west side of Ciovo island.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Total land is 955 m2, while the surface area of the house 130 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house consists of basement, ground floor and top floor, with a total area of approximately 200 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It consists of 6 bedrooms, 2 bathrooms, 3 terraces and 2 balconies.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The entire property needs modernising and renovating, but there is also the chance to improve the property by extending the house.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The garden has not been maintained and, on the land plot to one side of the house, the land is quite steep, but there is plenty of space for other viable improvements to the property such as a swimming pool, boat storage or other buildings and parking.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house was built 80 years ago, and all the necessary infrastructure in place.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The village centre, where the nearest shop is located, is only a few minutes away, while many other facilities are located approx. 10 minute drive.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The international airport is 20 min. driving.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>We are available to answer any questions and to arrange for you to visit the property where you can appreciate the great potential this property has.</p>', '', '1270_House-Villa_0.JPG', '1270_House-Villa_1.JPG', '1270_House-Villa_2.JPG', '1270_House-Villa_3.JPG', '1270_House-Villa_4.JPG', '1270_House-Villa_5.JPG', '1270_House-Villa_6.JPG', '1270_House-Villa_7.JPG', '1270_House-Villa_8.JPG'),
(1271, 'Lucijan', 'Pupiæ Bakraè', '', '091/ 444 6044', 'l.bakrac@tulipan.hr', 'Trogir', 'Planikovica Okrug Gornji, Z.U. 5314', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '100', '0', '88', 1, '170000', '', 2, 1, 2, 2, 1, 2, 2, 2, 'July 17, 2015', '<p>Apartman u novogradnji na jedinstvenoj lokaciji sjevernog dijela otoka Èiova, sa prekrasnim pogledom na more i cijelu uvalu. Od&nbsp;mora i prekrasne pla¾e gdje postoji moguænost privezivanja manjeg broda udaljenost je cca. 100 m &scaron;to je svega par minuta &scaron;etnje.&nbsp;Apartman se nalazi na 2.katu ukupne brutto povr&scaron;ine 88,28 m2 (apartman 67,94 m2 + 2 terase 16,76 m2 i 3,58 m2).</p>', '<p>We are pleased to offer this modern apartment in a new building in a great location on the northern part of island Ciovo, with beautiful and interesting views of the sea and the bay.&nbsp;The property is situated 100m from the shore where there is possibility of mooring a small boat. The shore here is pebble, sand and rock with many small coves.&nbsp;The apartment is located on the 2nd floor, and has a total area 88.28 m2 (67.94 m2 apartment 2 + terrace 16.76 m2 and 3.58 m2).&nbsp;</p>', '', '<p>Apartman u novogradnji na jedinstvenoj lokaciji sjevernog dijela otoka Èiova, sa prekrasnim pogledom na more i cijelu uvalu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Od mora i prekrasne pla¾e gdje postoji moguænost privezivanja manjeg broda udaljenost je cca. 100 m &scaron;to je svega par minuta &scaron;etnje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartman se nalazi na 2.katu ukupne brutto povr&scaron;ine 88,28 m2 (apartman 67,94 m2 + 2 terase 16,76 m2 i 3,58 m2).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sastoji se od hodnika, dnevnog boravka + blagovaonice + kuhinje, 2 spavaæe sobe, 2 kupaonice i 2 balkona od kojih je jedan veæi i ima prekrasan pogled na more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Cijeli apartman je klimatiziran i namje&scaron;ten, stoga nije potrebno nikakvo dodatno ulaganje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartmanu pripada sprema 2,5 m2 i vanjsko parking mjesto.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Idealan je za odmor i u¾ivanje zbog mirnog polo¾aja van buke i prometa.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Cijeli otok takoðer je turistièko odredi&scaron;te, te se mo¾e i turistièki iznajmljivati.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U blizini se nalaze trgovine, restorani, kafiæi i svi ostali sadr¾aji.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Prekrasni grad Trogir udaljen je 10 minuta vo¾nje, dok je meðunarodni aerodrom udaljen 15 minuta.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za sva dodatna pitanja stojimo vam na raspolaganju.</p>', '<p>We are pleased to offer this modern apartment in a new building in a great location on the northern part of island Ciovo, with beautiful and interesting views of the sea and the bay.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property is situated 100m from the shore where there is possibility of mooring a small boat.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The shore here is pebble, sand and rock with many small coves.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The apartment is located on the 2nd floor, and has a total area 88.28 m2 (67.94 m2 apartment 2 + terrace 16.76 m2 and 3.58 m2).&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It consists of a hallway, living room + dining room and kitchen, 2 bedrooms, 2 bathrooms and 2 balconies one of which is superbly wide with plenty of space for '' alfresco dining and has a beautiful view of the sea.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The whole apartment is air conditioned and furnished, with a modern designto make good use of the light and space and will not require any additional investment.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The apartment has storage of 2.5 m2 and outside parking place.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is an ideal spot for relaxation and to enjoy the peace, away from noise.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The whole island is a popular tourist destination, making this property ideal for tourism and renting.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nearby are a bakery, shops, restaurants, cafes and other services and facilities.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The beautiful town of Trogir is 10 minutes drive away, with many fine restaurants, the marina and deep water mooring while the international airport is 15 minutes.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact the office to arrange to visit this property and for more information.</p>', '', '1271_Apartment_0.jpg', '1271_Apartment_1.jpg', '1271_Apartment_2.jpg', '1271_Apartment_3.jpg', '1271_Apartment_4.jpg', '1271_Apartment_5.jpg', '1271_Apartment_6.jpg', '1271_Apartment_7.jpg', '1271_Apartment_8.jpg'),
(1272, 'Ljuban', 'Grube¹a', '021 888 750  ', '0917396218', '', 'Trogir', 'Bana Petra Berislaviæa 8 Mastrinka, Èiovo, 3/18', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '280', '269', '200', 1, '295000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 4, 4, 'July 17, 2015', '<p>U mirnom dijelu otoka Èiova na sjevernoj strani prodaje se samostojeæa kuæa u jako dobrom stanju. Od&nbsp;mora i &scaron;ljunèane pla¾e je udaljena 280 m, &scaron;to je svega 5 minuta hodanja. Kuæa se nalazi na zemlji&scaron;tu povr&scaron;ine 269 m2, dok stambena povr&scaron;ina sa svim terasama iznosi 200 m2.&nbsp;Sastoji se od prizemlja, 1. i 2. kata. Kuæa je obnovljena prije 6 god, dok je 2. kat u roh-bau fazi.&nbsp;Svi katovi imaju posebne vanjske ulaze, stoga u kuæi mo¾e boraviti vi&scaron;e obitelji.</p>', '<p>We are offering this beautifully designed detached house in a very good location on Ciovo Island.&nbsp;The sea and pebble beach is only 280m which is only 5 minutes walking.&nbsp;The house is situated on a land area of 269 m2, while the living area with all the terraces is 200 m2.&nbsp;There is a ground floor, 1st and 2nd floors.&nbsp;The house was renovated 6 yrs ago, but the second floor is still in the unfinished stage.&nbsp;All floors have a separate entrance, so the house can be used for tourism apartments and accommodate more families.&nbsp;</p>', '', '<p>U mirnom dijelu otoka Èiova na sjevernoj strani prodaje se samostojeæa kuæa u jako dobrom stanju.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Od mora i &scaron;ljunèane pla¾e je udaljena 280 m, &scaron;to je svega 5 minuta hodanja.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa se nalazi na zemlji&scaron;tu povr&scaron;ine 269 m2, dok stambena povr&scaron;ina sa svim terasama iznosi 200 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sastoji se od prizemlja, 1. i 2. kata.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je obnovljena prije 6 god, dok je 2. kat u roh-bau fazi.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Svi katovi imaju posebne vanjske ulaze, stoga u kuæi mo¾e boraviti vi&scaron;e obitelji.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U prizemlju se nalazi dnevni boravak sa blagovaonicom, kuhinja, kupaonica i sprema.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na 1.katu je prostrana terasa sa pogledom na more, dnevni boravak, blagovaonica, kuhinja, kupaonica i spavaæa soba.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>2.kat je u roh-bau fazi, a sastoji se od dnevnog boravka sa kuhinjom i blagovaonicom, 2 spavaæe sobe, wc-a, kupaonice i 2 prostrane terase.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Jedna je na ju¾noj, a druga na sjevernoj s koje se pru¾a pogled na more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na 2.katu su instalacije vode i struje, te su postavljeni svi vanjski prozori i vrata.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ispred kuæe se nalazi gara¾a za automobil.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Jo&scaron; jedno parking mjesto u dvori&scaron;tu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Trgovina se je udaljena par minuta hodanja, a svi ostali sadr¾aji se nalaze u blizini.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ukoliko imate dodatnih pitanja stojimo vam na raspolaganju.</p>', '<p>We are offering this beautifully designed detached house in a very good location on Ciovo Island.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The sea and pebble beach is only 280m which is only 5 minutes walking.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house is situated on a land area of 269 m2, while the living area with all the terraces is 200 m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There is a ground floor, 1st and 2nd floors.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house was renovated &nbsp;6 yrs ago, but the second floor is still in the unfinished stage.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>All floors have a separate entrance, so the house can be used for tourism apartments and accommodate more families.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The ground floor has a living room, dining room and kitchen, bathroom and storage room.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the 1st floor is a spectacular terrace with great sea views, living room, dining room, kitchen, bathroom and bedroom.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The 2nd floor is in the unfinished stage, and consists of a living room with kitchen, 2 bedrooms, toilets, bathrooms and 2 spacious terraces.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>One is on the south, and the other on the north with a view of the sea.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the 2nd floor, all the services are already in place, all the heavy work has been done, and needs the interior to be completed.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>A lovely project for someone with good taste and interior design skills.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house has a built in garage, with plenty of space for more private parking, should the garden be redesigned.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There are shops, a bakery, coffee shops and traditional bars nearby and many lovely restaurants in the larger town of Trogir.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact the office to arrange to visit this property.</p>', '', '1272_House-Villa_0.JPG', '1272_House-Villa_1.JPG', '1272_House-Villa_2.JPG', '1272_House-Villa_3.JPG', '1272_House-Villa_4.JPG', '1272_House-Villa_5.JPG', '1272_House-Villa_6.JPG', '1272_House-Villa_7.JPG', '1272_House-Villa_8.JPG'),
(1274, 'Bojan i Neven', 'Potkonjak', '00385(0)14812923', '00385(0)91 545 1301', 'bojan.potkonjak1@zg.t-com.hr', 'Rogoznica', 'Rtiæ Stupin Èeline, 2931, 2933, 1618 zgr  k.o. Rogoznica', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '20', '600', '130', 1, '175000', '', 2, 2, 2, 1, 1, 2, 3, 2, 'July 20, 2015', '<p>Izvrsna prilika za ulaganje u nekretninu u 1.redu do mora na ekskluzivnoj lokaciji!&nbsp;Samostojeæa kuæa u 1.redu do mora u prekrasnoj uvali udaljena 20 m od &scaron;ljunèane pla¾e. Centar sa svim sadr¾ajima udaljen je 5 min., dok je meðunarodni aerodrom udaljen 30 min. vo¾nje. Nalazi se na prostranom zemlji&scaron;tu povr&scaron;ine 600 m2, sa ureðenom okuænicom i moguæno&scaron;æu izgradnje bazena.&nbsp;Ukupna povr&scaron;ina kuæe je 140 m2, a sastoji se od prizemlja i 1.kata sa kojeg se pru¾a pogled na more.</p>', '<p>This is an excellent opportunity to invest in real estate in the 1st row tothe sea in a very exclusive location on the mainland.&nbsp;The house in situated in the 1st row to the sea in a beautiful bay and isjust 20 meters from the beach. The property is situated on a spacious plot of 600 m2, with a landscaped garden and plenty of space for improvements such as a new swimming pool.&nbsp;The total living area is 140 m2 and consists of ground floor and 1st floor with a view of the sea.</p>', '', '<p>Izvrsna prilika za ulaganje u nekretninu u 1.redu do mora na ekskluzivnoj lokaciji!!!</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Samostojeæa kuæa u 1.redu do mora u prekrasnoj uvali udaljena 20 m od &scaron;ljunèane pla¾e.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Centar sa svim sadr¾ajima udaljen je 5 min., dok je meðunarodni aerodrom udaljen 30 min. vo¾nje.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nalazi se na prostranom zemlji&scaron;tu povr&scaron;ine 600 m2, sa ureðenom okuænicom i moguæno&scaron;æu izgradnje bazena.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ukupna povr&scaron;ina kuæe je 140 m2 , a sastoji se od prizemlja i 1.kata sa kojeg se pru¾a pogled na more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U prizemlju se nalazi dnevni boravak sa kuhinjom i blagovaonicom, kupaonica, spavaæa soba i ostava.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na 1.katu koji ima posebni vanjski ulaz se nalaze 2 spavaæe sobe, kupaonica i terasa povr&scaron;ine 30 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je potpuno namje&scaron;tena i trenutno se koristi u svrhu turistièkog iznajmljivanja.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U odliènom je stanju, ali je potrebno jo&scaron; dodatnog ulaganja.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Okru¾enje je mirno bez prometa i gradske buke stoga je ovo idealna nekretnina ukoliko ¾elite odmor i opu&scaron;tanje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ispred kuæe se nalazi parking za 2 automobila, ali postoji moguænost pro&scaron;irenja.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za sve dodatne informacije i fotografije nas slobodno kontaktirajte.</p>', '<p>This is an excellent opportunity to invest in real estate in the 1st row to the sea in a very exclusive location on the mainland.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house in situated in the 1st row to the sea in a beautiful bay and is just 20 meters from the beach.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The nearest village centre with all facilities such as shops, cafes, traditional bars, bakery and other services is within a 5 minute walk, while the international airport at 30 minutes driving, and the major town of Trogir a little less.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property is situated on a spacious plot of 600 m2, with a landscaped garden and plenty of space for improvements such as a new swimming pool.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The total living area is 140 m2 and consists of ground floor and 1st floor with a view of the sea.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the ground floor is a living room with kitchen, bathroom, bedroom and storage room.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the 1st floor, which has a separate outside entrance, there are 2 bedrooms, bathroom and a wide terrace of 30 m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house is fully furnished and is currently used for tourist rental.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property is in excellent condition, but needs redecorating, and even some modernisation to maximise it''s great potential.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The environment is calm with little traffic and city noise so this is an ideal property if a quiet location is important.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house has private parking for 2 cars, but there is the possibility of increasing this number.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For additional information and photos please contact us and we can also arrange a tour of the property.</p>', '', '1274_House-Villa_0.JPG', '1274_House-Villa_1.JPG', '1274_House-Villa_2.JPG', '1274_House-Villa_3.JPG', '1274_House-Villa_4.JPG', '1274_House-Villa_5.JPG', '1274_House-Villa_6.JPG', '1274_House-Villa_7.JPG', '1274_House-Villa_8.JPG'),
(1275, 'Ivan', 'Camber', '098 887 7494', '', '', 'Trogir', 'Krèiæ 5  Okrug Gornji, 1912 zgr   631/1', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '400', '1185', '500', 1, '800000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 1, 10, 6, 'July 20, 2015', '<p>Luksuzna samostojeæa vila sa bazenom smje&scaron;tena na prostranom zemlji&scaron;tu u mirnom dijelu mjesta.&nbsp;Nalazi se na ju¾noj strani otoka Èiova u prekrasnoj uvali sa mnogobrojnim prirodno kamenitim pla¾ama.&nbsp;Centar mjesta gdje se nalaze svi sadr¾aji udaljen je 10 minuta hodanja. Jako popularna velika &scaron;ljunèana pla¾a sa mnogim kafiæima udaljena je 20 min. hodanja.&nbsp;Ukupno zemlji&scaron;te iznosi 1185 m2, dok je ukupna stambena povr&scaron;ina cca. 500 m2.</p>', '<p>We are pleased to offer this detached apartment villa with a private swimming pool located on a spacious plot in a quiet area.&nbsp;It is situated on the south side of Ciovo along a beautiful bay with a natural rock and pebble shore.&nbsp;The local village centre where there are many shops, bars and other facilities is within a 10-minute walk.&nbsp;One of the popular attractions in the village is the long pebble beach with many cafes and bars, catering to tourists and is 20 min. walking.&nbsp;The total land is 1185 m2, while the total living area of approx. 500 m2.&nbsp;</p>', '', '<p>Luksuzna samostojeæa vila sa bazenom smje&scaron;tena na prostranom zemlji&scaron;tu u mirnom dijelu mjesta.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nalazi se na ju¾noj strani otoka Èiova u prekrasnoj uvali sa mnogobrojnim prirodno kamenitim pla¾ama.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Centar mjesta gdje se nalaze svi sadr¾aji udaljen je 10 minuta hodanja.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Jako popularna velika &scaron;ljunèana pla¾a sa mnogim kafiæima udaljena je 20 min. hodanja.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ukupno zemlji&scaron;te iznosi 1185 m2, dok je ukupna stambena povr&scaron;ina cca. 500 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U ureðenom dvori&scaron;tu se nalazi bazen, kamen i parking za nekoliko automobila.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Vila se sastoji od prizemlja, 1.kata i potkrovlja sa djelomiènim pogledom na more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ima ukupno 5 odvojenih apartmana koji su trenutno u funkciji turistièkog iznajmljivanja.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Potpuno su namje&scaron;teni, klimatizirani i sa ugraðenim centralnim grijanjem.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U jednom apartmanu se takoðer nalazi i kamin.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ukoliko imate dodatnih pitanja molimo da nas kontaktirate.</p>', '<p>We are pleased to offer this detached apartment villa with a private swimming pool located on a spacious plot in a quiet area.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is situated on the south side of Ciovo along a beautiful bay with a natural rock and pebble shore.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The local village centre where there are many shops, bars and other facilities is within a 10-minute walk.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>One of the popular attractions in the village is the long pebble beach with many cafes and bars, catering to tourists and is 20 min. walking.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The total land is 1185 m2, while the total living area of approx. 500 m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The landscaped courtyard has a swimming pool, and parking for several cars.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The villa consists of a ground floor, 1st floor and top floor and this has a great view of the sea.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There is a total of 5 separate apartments which are currently being used torent to tourists.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>They are all fully furnished, air conditioned and with built-in central heating.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>One apartment has a fireplace.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The condition of the properties is good, needing little immediate maintenance.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact the office with questions and to arrange to visit this property.</p>', '', '1275_House-Villa_0.JPG', '1275_House-Villa_1.JPG', '1275_House-Villa_2.JPG', '1275_House-Villa_3.JPG', '1275_House-Villa_4.JPG', '1275_House-Villa_5.JPG', '1275_House-Villa_6.JPG', '1275_House-Villa_7.JPG', '1275_House-Villa_8.JPG'),
(1276, 'Jozo', 'Tabak', '091 572 5051', '021 888 220', '', 'Trogir', 'Rovci 1  Slatine, Èiovo, 1389/1 katastar, zemljisnik &#8211; 1024/2, 1024/3', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '20', '550', '250', 1, '550000', '', 2, 2, 2, 1, 1, 2, 3, 2, 'July 20, 2015', '<p>Samostojeæa kuæa jako zanimljivog dizajna u 1.redu do mora udaljena svega 20 m od prekrasne &scaron;ljunèane i prirodno kamenite pla¾e.&nbsp;Smje&scaron;tena je na istoènom dijelu Èiova sa pogledom na more i ureðeni vrt. Ukupna povr&scaron;ina zemlji&scaron;ta iznosi 550 m2, dok je kuæa velièine 250 m2.&nbsp;Sastoji se od podruma, 1. i 2. kata, dok se ispred nalazi ureðeni vrt na kojem se nalazi kamin. Moguæa je izgradnja bazena koji bi se odlièno uklopio u cijeli ambijent.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>Croatia Property Sales are offering this interesting house in the 1st row to the sea only 20 m away from the beautiful pebble beach on the increasingly popular east side of the island.&nbsp;It is situated on the eastern part of the Ciovo with a sea view and well maintained garden.&nbsp;The total land area is 550 m2, while the house of 250 m2.&nbsp;It consists of a basement, first and second floors, while in the front, ona landscaped garden, is a bbq/fireplace.</p>', '', '<p>Samostojeæa kuæa jako zanimljivog dizajna u 1.redu do mora udaljena svega 20 m od prekrasne &scaron;ljunèane i prirodno kamenite pla¾e.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Smje&scaron;tena je na istoènom dijelu Èiova sa pogledom na more i ureðeni vrt.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ukupna povr&scaron;ina zemlji&scaron;ta iznosi 550 m2, dok je kuæa velièine 250 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sastoji se od podruma, 1. i 2. kata, dok se ispred nalazi ureðeni vrt na kojem se nalazi kamin.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Moguæa je izgradnja bazena koji bi se odlièno uklopio u cijeli ambijent.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U podrumu se nalaze gara¾a, spremi&scaron;te i stepenice koje povezuju prodrum i prizemlje gdje se nalazi glavni ulaz u kuæu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U prizemlju se nalazi prostrani dnevni boravak, blagovaonica, kuhinja, wc, hodnik i balkon sa pogledom na more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Prizemlje i 1.kat povezuju jako kvalitetne i zanimljivo dizajnirane drvene stepenice.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na 1.katu se nalazi hodnik, 3 spavaæe sobe, kupaonica i 3 balkona sa prekrasnim pogledom na more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>1 spavaæa soba ima galeriju.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je izgraðena 1977. god., ali je jako kvalitetna i jo&scaron; uvijek moderna.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U blizini se nalaze mnogobrojni sadr¾aji, dok je povijesni grad Trogir udaljen 15 min. vo¾nje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za sva ostala pitanja i dodatne slike stojimo na raspolaganju.</p>', '<p>Croatia Property Sales are offering this interesting house in the 1st row to the sea only 20 m away from the beautiful pebble beach on the increasingly popular east side of the island.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is situated on the eastern part of the Ciovo with a sea view and well maintained garden.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The total land area is 550 m2, while the house of 250 m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It consists of a basement, first and second floors, while in the front, ona landscaped garden, is a bbq/fireplace.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There is plenty of space to redesign the exterior to incorporate a swimming pool and patio sunbathing area.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>In the basement there is a garage and storage room with stairs that connect the basement to the ground floor where there is an alternative main entrance to the house.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The ground floor has a spacious living room, dining room, kitchen,bathroom, hall and balcony with sea view.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The ground floor and 1st floor are connected with a very quality and interesting designed wooden stairs.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the 1st floor is a hallway, 3 bedrooms, bathroom, 3 balconies all with beautiful views of the sea and one of the bedrooms has a gallery.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house was built in 1977, and has been lovingly maintained by a local family as a home, and needs no immediate further investment.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nearby are many activities, attractions and services such as useful shops and bars etc., while the historic city of Trogir is 15 min. driving.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact the office for more information and to arrange to visit the property.</p>', '', '1276_House-Villa_0.JPG', '1276_House-Villa_1.JPG', '1276_House-Villa_2.JPG', '1276_House-Villa_3.JPG', '1276_House-Villa_4.JPG', '1276_House-Villa_5.JPG', '1276_House-Villa_6.JPG', '1276_House-Villa_7.JPG', '1276_House-Villa_8.JPG'),
(1277, 'Ivan', 'Camber', '098 887 7494', '', '', 'Trogir', 'Krèiæ 1 Okrug Gornji, 631/2', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '400', '0', '206', 1, '500000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 0, 3, 'July 20, 2015', '<p>Izuzetna prilika za ulaganju u poslovni prostor koji je smje&scaron;ten na ju¾noj strani otoka Èiova. Trenutno je u funkciji restorana koji dobro posluje jer se nalazi na turistièki najpopularnijem dijelu otoka.&nbsp;U navedenu cijenu je ukljuèen cijeli inventar restorana. Prostor se sastoji od podruma i prizemlja ukupne povr&scaron;ine 206 m2.&nbsp;Ispred se nalazi prostrano dvori&scaron;te povr&scaron;ine 225 m2 gdje se trenutno nalaze stolovi za goste i kamin.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>We are offering this rare opportunity to invest in a substantial restauranton the south side of Ciovo.&nbsp;It is situated in a popular area on the south side of the island and is doing well. As a commercial building, the use can be changed if the ownerwishes. The specified price includes the entire inventory of the restaurant.&nbsp;The area consists of a basement and ground floor with a total area of 206 m2.&nbsp;In front is a spacious garden of 225 m2 where there are tables ''Al fresco'' for the guests and there is a grill/fireplace.&nbsp;</p>', '', '<p>Izuzetna prilika za ulaganju u poslovni prostor koji je smje&scaron;ten na ju¾noj strani otoka Èiova.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Trenutno je u funkciji restorana koji dobro posluje jer se nalazi na turistièki najpopularnijem dijelu otoka.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U navedenu cijenu je ukljuèen cijeli inventar restorana.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Prostor se sastoji od podruma i prizemlja ukupne povr&scaron;ine 206 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ispred se nalazi prostrano dvori&scaron;te povr&scaron;ine 225 m2 gdje se trenutno nalaze stolovi za goste i kamin.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U podrumu se nalazi wc i velika prostorija koja slu¾i kao skladi&scaron;te.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U prizemlju se nalaze 2 wc-a, &scaron;ank i veliki prostor za goste.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sve je potpuno ureðeno i u odliènog stanju, stoga ukoliko ¾elite nastaviti uhodani posao nije potrebno nikakvo ulaganje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ispred zgrade se nalazi parking za 6 automobila.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Do centra mjesta je potrebno svega nekoliko minuta vo¾nje, dok je meðunarodni aerodrom udaljen 15 min. vo¾nje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ukoliko imate dodatnih pitanja slobodno nas kontaktirajte.</p>', '<p>We are offering this rare opportunity to invest in a substantial restauranton the south side of Ciovo.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is situated in a popular area on the south side of the island and is doing well.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>As a commercial building, the use can be changed if the owner wishes.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The specified price includes the entire inventory of the restaurant.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The area consists of a basement and ground floor with a total area of 206 m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>In front is a spacious garden of 225 m2 where there are tables ''Al fresco'' for the guests and there is a grill/fireplace.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>In the basement there are toilets and a large room that serves as a store.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The ground floor has 2 toilets, bar and ample room for guests.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Everything is fully equipped and in excellent condition, so if you want to continue with this established trade then there is no need for any investment.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>In front of the building there is private parking for 6 cars.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The town centre, is only a few minutes'' drive away, while the international airport is just 15 minutes driving.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please call for further details and to arrange to visit this property.</p>', '', '1277_Apartment_0.JPG', '1277_Apartment_1.JPG', '1277_Apartment_2.JPG', '1277_Apartment_3.JPG', '1277_Apartment_4.JPG', '1277_Apartment_5.JPG', '1277_Apartment_6.JPG', '1277_Apartment_7.JPG', '1277_Apartment_8.JPG'),
(1278, 'Julianna', 'Papp', '0915006858 ', '021888356', '', 'Trogir', ' Prema Kavi Slatine, Zem 178/2  arkod/katastar 3099', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '10', '550', '30', 1, '190000', '', 2, 2, 2, 1, 1, 2, 2, 1, 'July 20, 2015', '<p>Ekskluzivna nekretnina u 1.redu do mora na istoènoj strani otoka Èiova uz samu prekrasnu &scaron;ljunèanu pla¾u.&nbsp;Zemlji&scaron;te je ukupne povr&scaron;ine 550 m2 na kojem se nalazi kvalitetna monta¾na kuæa velièine 30 m2.&nbsp;Sastoji se od kuhinje + blagovaonice, 2 spavaæe sobe i kupaonice. Sve je u potpunosti namje&scaron;teno i priljuèeno na svu infrastrukturu.</p>', '<p>We are offering this property in the 1st row to the sea on the eastern side of the island Ciovo near the beautiful pebble beach.&nbsp;The value is in the land plot rather than the chicken shed style prefabricated house of 30 m2 which is currently sitting on the plot. The land plot has a total area of 550 m2 and, with permission from building authorities (which should not be difficult), it could be replaced with a more substantial and habitable building.</p>', '', '<p>Ekskluzivna nekretnina u 1.redu do mora na istoènoj strani otoka Èiova uz samu prekrasnu &scaron;ljunèanu pla¾u.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Zemlji&scaron;te je ukupne povr&scaron;ine 550 m2 na kojem se nalazi kvalitetna monta¾na kuæa velièine 30 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sastoji se od kuhinje + blagovaonice, 2 spavaæe sobe i kupaonice.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sve je u potpunosti namje&scaron;teno i priljuèeno na svu infrastrukturu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Zemlji&scaron;te je pravokutnog oblika na kojem je moguæa izgradnja veæe kuæe sa bazenom za koju treba imati graðevinsku dozvolu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na zemlji&scaron;tu se takoðer nalazi i manje spremi&scaron;te.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Pristupni put je direktan, dok je zemlji&scaron;te sa sjeverne strane ograðeno zidom &scaron;to dodatno garantira sigurnost i privatnost.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Parking je na samom ulazu, a ostatatak dvori&scaron;ta je ureðen i kultiviran.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Iz kuæe se pru¾a djelomièan pogled na more, ali bi se izgradnjom veæe kuæe pru¾ao mnogo bolji.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Svi potrebni sadr¾aji se nalaze u blizini.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Popularni veæi gradovi Trogir i Split su jako blizu, jednako kao i meðunarodni aerodrom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Tijekom ljetne sezone prometuje brodska linija koja povezuje Èiovo i Split.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Brodsko pristani&scaron;te se nalazi u blizini ove nekretnine.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kontaktirajte nas za sva dodatna pitanja i fotografije.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>We are offering this property in the 1st row to the sea on the eastern side of the island Ciovo near the beautiful pebble beach.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The value is in the land plot rather than the chicken shed style prefabricated house of 30 m2 which is currently sitting on the plot.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The land plot has a total area of 550 m2 and, with permission from building authorities (which should not be difficult), it could be replaced with a more substantial and habitable building.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It consists of a kitchen, dining room, 2 bedrooms and bathroom.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Every room is fully furnished and connected to all the infrastructure /water, drains, electric etc/.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The land plot has a rectangular shape on which it should be possible to get permission to build a decent house, even with a pool.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the property there is also a small storage room.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The access road is direct, while the land on the north side is surrounded by a wall which gives further privacy.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Private parking is at the entrance, and rest of the courtyard is decorated and cultivated.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house offers a view of the sea, and from a bigger house it would be even better.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The popular major cities of Trogir and Split are very close, and connected by a foot ferry throughout the summer which stops close to the property, and the international airport is only 15 minutes driving.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>During the summer season boat line that connects Ciovo and Split.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Contact us for any additional questions and photos and to arrange to visit this plot. &nbsp;&nbsp;</p>', '', '1278_House-Villa_0.JPG', '1278_House-Villa_1.JPG', '1278_House-Villa_2.JPG', '1278_House-Villa_3.JPG', '1278_House-Villa_4.JPG', '1278_House-Villa_5.JPG', '1278_House-Villa_6.JPG', '1278_House-Villa_7.jpg', '1278_House-Villa_8.JPG'),
(1279, 'Ivan ', 'Èamber', '', '098 887 7494', '', 'Trogir', 'Nasuprot Krèiæ 6 Okrug Gornji, 630/2', 'For sale', 'Land plot', '400', '945', '0', 1, '250000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 0, 0, 'July 21, 2015', '<p>Graðevinsko zemlji&scaron;te na ju¾noj strani na otoku Èiovu u blizini centra mjesta i prekrasne uvale.&nbsp;More i mala &scaron;ljunèana pla¾a su udaljeni 400 m, dok se uz du¾ cijele obale pru¾a prekrasna prirodno kamenita pla¾a.&nbsp;Zemlji&scaron;te je ograðeno zidovima, sa direktnim pristupnim putem. Ukupna povr&scaron;ina iznosi 945 m2, te ima dovoljno mjesta za izgradnju prostrane vile sa bazenom.&nbsp;Prema prostornom planu moguæe je izgraditi objekt na 3 eta¾e.</p>', '<p>We have this building land plot on the south side of the island Ciovo in a great position near the village centre and on a beautiful part of the coast. The shore is 400 meters, and here are many places for swimming, where it is safe for children to enjoy the sandy floor of the bay. The total area is 945 m2, and has enough space to build a spacious villa with swimming pool, or apartment villa with three floors.</p>', '', '<p>Graðevinsko zemlji&scaron;te na ju¾noj strani na otoku Èiovu u blizini centra mjesta i prekrasne uvale.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>More i mala &scaron;ljunèana pla¾a su udaljeni 400 m, dok se uz du¾ cijele obale pru¾a prekrasna prirodno kamenita pla¾a.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Do grada Trogira potrebno je svega 10 min. vo¾nje, dok se i meðunarodni aerodrom nalazi u blizini.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Zemlji&scaron;te je ograðeno zidovima, sa direktnim pristupnim putem.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ukupna povr&scaron;ina iznosi 945 m2, te ima dovoljno mjesta za izgradnju prostrane vile sa bazenom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Prema prostornom planu moguæe je izgraditi objekt na 3 eta¾e.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Prikljuèak elektriène energije se nalazi odmah na zemlji&scaron;tu, dok su ostale komunalije odmah do zemlji&scaron;ta.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sa vi&scaron;ih eta¾a bi se pru¾ao djelomièan pogled na more, ali to ne umanjuje vrijednost zemlj&scaron;ta s obzirom da se nalazi na vrlo atraktivnom mjestu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Stojimo na raspolaganju u koliko imate jo&scaron; dodatnih pitanja.</p>', '<p>We have this building land plot on the south side of the island Ciovo in a great position near the village centre and on a beautiful part of the coast.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The shore is 400 meters, and here are many places for swimming, where it is safe for children to enjoy the sandy floor of the bay.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The larger town of Trogir, a UNESCO site of historical importance, is only 10 min. driving, while the international airport is 15 minutes away.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The land is surrounded by stone walls, and there is direct access to the road.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The total area is 945 m2, and has enough space to build a spacious villa with swimming pool, or apartment villa with three floors.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Electric power connection is located next to the land, while there are all the other utilities adjacent to the land.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the higher floors there will be long sea views.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact the office for more information and to arrange to visit this location.</p>', '', '1279_Land-plot_0.JPG', '1279_Land-plot_1.JPG', '1279_Land-plot_2.JPG', '1279_Land-plot_3.JPG', '1279_Land-plot_4.JPG', '1279_Land-plot_5.JPG', '1279_Land-plot_6.JPG', '1279_Land-plot_7.JPG', '');
INSERT INTO `nekretnina` (`id`, `ime`, `prezime`, `telefon`, `mobitel`, `e_mail`, `lokacija_id`, `adresa`, `status_id`, `vrsta_id`, `udaljenost`, `povrsina`, `stambenapovrsina`, `display`, `cijena`, `cijenatocka`, `ponuda_tjedna`, `new_built`, `must_sell`, `prvi_red_do_mora`, `pogled_na_more`, `bazen`, `broj_soba`, `broj_kupatila`, `datum`, `title_hr`, `title_en`, `title_ge`, `opis_hr`, `opis_en`, `opis_ge`, `PropertyImageURL0`, `PropertyImageURL1`, `PropertyImageURL2`, `PropertyImageURL3`, `PropertyImageURL4`, `PropertyImageURL5`, `PropertyImageURL6`, `PropertyImageURL7`, `PropertyImageURL8`) VALUES
(1280, 'Ivan', 'Èamber', '', '098 887 7494', '', 'Trogir', 'Krèiæ 1 Okrug Gornji, 631/2', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '400', '0', '108', 1, '110000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 0, 0, 'July 21, 2015', '<p>Na ju¾noj strani otoka Èiova nalazi se skladi&scaron;te povr&scaron;ine 108 m2. Smje&scaron;teno je u suterenu jako kvalitetne zgrade u kojoj se takoðer prodaje restoran.&nbsp;Centar mjesta udaljen je svega nekoliko minuta vo¾nje, stoga ako vam je potreban dodatni prostor ovo je idealna prilika za ulaganje.&nbsp;Pristupni put je direktan stoga nema problema oko preno&scaron;enja stvari.</p>', '<p>We have this commercial space (large warehouse/store room) 108 m2 on the south side of the island in Okrug.&nbsp;It is located in the basement of a modern building with a restaurant above which is also currently for sale. The space is currently being used by the restaurant.&nbsp;The village centre is only a few minutes'' drive, so if you need clean, dry space this is an ideal opportunity to acquire some.</p>', '', '<p>Na ju¾noj strani otoka Èiova nalazi se skladi&scaron;te povr&scaron;ine 108 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Smje&scaron;teno je u suterenu jako kvalitetne zgrade u kojoj se takoðer prodaje restoran.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Centar mjesta udaljen je svega nekoliko minuta vo¾nje, stoga ako vam je potreban dodatni prostor ovo je idealna prilika za ulaganje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Pristupni put je direktan stoga nema problema oko preno&scaron;enja stvari.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ukoliko imate dodatnih pitanja slobodno nas kontaktirajte.</p>', '<p>We have this commercial space (large warehouse/store room) 108 m2 on the south side of the island in Okrug.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is located in the basement of a modern building with a restaurant above which is also currently for sale.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The space is currently being used by the restaurant.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The village centre is only a few minutes'' drive, so if you need clean, dry space this is an ideal opportunity to acquire some.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The access road is direct so there is no problem about transferring/loading etc.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>If you have any questions please contact us and also we can arrange to visit the premises.</p>', '', '1280_House-Villa_0.JPG', '1280_House-Villa_1.JPG', '1280_House-Villa_2.JPG', '1280_House-Villa_3.JPG', '', '', '', '', ''),
(1281, 'Ljuban', 'Grube¹a', '021 888 750', '', '', 'Trogir', 'Put Sv. Ivana 29  ®edno, 797/143 k.o. ®edno', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '700', '875', '60', 1, '160000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 1, 1, 'July 21, 2015', '<p>Samostojeæa prizemnica smje&scaron;tena u mirnom dijelu u &scaron;umi sa svega nekoliko susjednih kuæa.&nbsp;Sa istoène strane se nalazi zeleni pojas gdje nije dozvoljena izgradnja.&nbsp;Nalazi se na sjevernoj dijelu otoka Èiova u blizini trgovine, ljekarne i restorana. Najbli¾a &scaron;ljunèana pla¾a udaljena je 700 m, dok se iz kuæe pru¾a djelomièan pogled na more.&nbsp;Pravokutno zemlji&scaron;te je velièine 875 m2, dok je stambena povr&scaron;ina kuæe 60 m2 + suteren 25 m2.&nbsp;Kuæa se sastoji od suterena i prizemlja.</p>', '<p>We are pleased to offer this detached house situated in a quiet area in one of the few inland villages on Ciovo. It is situated among woods with few neighbouring houses on the east side of the green belt where construction of its not allowed. The shore is 700m, and the house, elevated by the steep sides of the island, has a partial and interesting sea view. The property is on a rectangular shaped plot, 875 m2, while the living area is 60 m2 + basement of 25 m2. The house consists of basement and ground floor.</p>', '', '<p>Samostojeæa prizemnica smje&scaron;tena u mirnom dijelu u &scaron;umi sa svega nekoliko susjednih kuæa.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sa istoène strane se nalazi zeleni pojas gdje nije dozvoljena izgradnja.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nalazi se na sjevernoj dijelu otoka Èiova u blizini trgovine, ljekarne i restorana.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Najbli¾a &scaron;ljunèana pla¾a udaljena je 700 m, dok se iz kuæe pru¾a djelomièan pogled na more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Pravokutno zemlji&scaron;te je velièine 875 m2, dok je stambena povr&scaron;ina kuæe 60 m2 + suteren 25 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa se sastoji od suterena i prizemlja.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U suterenu je ljetna kuhinja i terasa, dok se na 1.katu nalazi dnevni boravak sa kuhinjom i blagovaonicom, spavaæa soba, kupaonica i terasa sa djelomiènim pogledom na more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Visina stropa u suterenu je manja od uobièajene, ali je svejedno moguæ normalan boravak.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Zemlji&scaron;te je dovoljno prostrano za izgradnju bazena &scaron;to bi ovu nekretninu dodatno obogatilo.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Takoðer postoji moguænost nadogradnje kuæe.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Pristup do kuæe je direktan, te se ispred nalazi parking.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Do grada Trogira je potrebno 10 min. vo¾nje, dok je meðunarodni aerodrom udaljen 15 min.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Slobodno nas kontaktirajte za sve ostale informacije.</p>', '<p>We are pleased to offer this detached house situated in a quiet area in one of the few inland villages on Ciovo.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is situated among woods with few neighbouring houses on the east side of the green belt where construction of its not allowed, but conveniently close to several shops, restaurants, bars and useful services such as a pharmacy.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The shore is 700m, and the house, elevated by the steep sides of the island, has a partial and interesting sea view.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property is on a rectangular shaped plot, 875 m2, while the living area is 60 m2 + basement of 25 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house consists of basement and ground floor.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>In the basement is a summer kitchen leading out onto a terrace, while on the 1st floor is a living room with kitchen, bedroom, bathroom and terrace and from here are views of the sea.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The ceiling in the basement is lower than usual, but it was still possible to stand normally.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The land is large enough for improvements such as a pool and a landscaped garden and patio which would further enrich this property.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There is also the possibility of enlarging the house with an extension.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Access to the house is direct from a quiet road, and there is private parking at the front.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The town of Trogir, takes 10 minutes driving, while the international airport is 15 minutes.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact us for more information and for us to arrange a tour of the property.</p>', '', '1281_House-Villa_0.JPG', '1281_House-Villa_1.JPG', '1281_House-Villa_2.JPG', '1281_House-Villa_3.JPG', '1281_House-Villa_4.JPG', '1281_House-Villa_5.JPG', '1281_House-Villa_6.JPG', '1281_House-Villa_7.JPG', '1281_House-Villa_8.JPG'),
(1282, 'Silvana', 'Mi¹e', '021888026', '0989060425 ', '', 'Trogir', 'Cesta Dom. Zahvalnosti 23 Arbanija, 364 zgr, 801/2, 800/3', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '30', '880', '200', 1, '420000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 6, 2, 'July 24, 2015', '<p>Na otoku Èiovu na sjevernoj strani nalazi se kuæa u 1.redu udaljena od mora i &scaron;ljunèane pla¾e cca. 30 m.&nbsp;Iz kuæe se pru¾a prekrasan pogled na more sa sjeverne i na &scaron;umu sa ju¾ne strane.&nbsp;Kuæa je samostojeæa, smje&scaron;tena na prostranom zemlji&scaron;tu povr&scaron;ine 880 m2 &scaron;to je dovoljno za izgradnju veæeg bazena.&nbsp;Stambena povr&scaron;ina iznosi 200 m2, a sastoji se od visokog prizemlja i 1.kata. Ispred kuæe se nalazi parking za 2 automobila i gara¾a gdje se mo¾e parkirati 1 automobil.</p>', '<p>We have this detached house in the first row to the sea, just 30m from the beach. It is situated on the island of Ciovo, on the north side, where the shore is mixed rock, pebble and sand. The house offers a beautiful view of the sea from the north and the woods to the south.&nbsp;The property is detached and situated on a vast land plot of 880 m2 which would allow a large swimming pool and patio area to be built, and landscaped gardens.&nbsp;The living area is 200 m2 and consists of a ground and 1st floor.&nbsp;</p>', '', '<p>Na otoku Èiovu na sjevernoj strani nalazi se kuæa u 1.redu udaljena od mora i &scaron;ljunèane pla¾e cca. 30 m.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Iz kuæe se pru¾a prekrasan pogled na more sa sjeverne i na &scaron;umu sa ju¾ne strane.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je samostojeæa, smje&scaron;tena na prostranom zemlji&scaron;tu povr&scaron;ine 880 m2 &scaron;to je dovoljno za izgradnju veæeg bazena.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Stambena povr&scaron;ina iznosi 200 m2, a sastoji se od visokog prizemlja i 1.kata.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ispred kuæe se nalazi parking za 2 automobila i gara¾a gdje se mo¾e parkirati 1 automobil.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Obje eta¾e imaju odvojene vanjske ulaze &scaron;to je prednost ukoliko se ¾elite baviti turistièkim iznajmljivanjem.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Slicnog &nbsp;su tlocrta, te se svaka sastoji od hodnika, dnevnog boravka sa kuhinjom i blagovaonicom, 3 spavaæe sobe i kupaonice.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Prizemlje ima terasu na sjevernoj, dok 1.kat ima terasu na sjevernoj i loggiu na ju¾noj strani.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U suterenu se nalazi mala sprema i cisterna za vodu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæi je potrebno renoviranje, ali ima odlièan potencijal s obzirom na lokaciju i blizinu svih sadr¾aja.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Grad Trogir je udaljen 10 min.,a meðunarodni aerodrom 15 min. vo¾nje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ostajemo na usluzi za sva dodatna pitanja.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>We have this detached house in the first row to the sea, just 30m from the beach.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is situated on the island of Ciovo, on the north side, where the shore is mixed rock, pebble and sand.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house offers a beautiful view of the sea from the north and the woods to the south.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property is detached and situated on a vast land plot of 880 m2 which would allow a large swimming pool and patio area to be built, and landscaped gardens.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The living area is 200 m2 and consists of a ground and 1st floor.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property has private parking for 2 cars in addition to a single garage.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Both floors have separate outside entrances which is an advantage if you want to make alterations and use the property for tourism renting.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Both floors have a similar layout, and each consists of a hall, living room with kitchen and dining room, 3 bedrooms and bathrooms.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The ground floor has a terrace on the north, while the 1st floor has a terrace on the north and balcony on the south side.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>In the basement there is a small storage space and a water tank.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house needs renovation and some modernisation, but has great potential due to the location, the size of the plot, and proximity to all amenities.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The nearest larger town of Trogir is 10 min., where there are many choices for fine restaurants and cultural events, while the international airport 15 min.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact the office for more information and to arrange to tour the property.</p>', '', '1282_House-Villa_0.JPG', '1282_House-Villa_1.JPG', '1282_House-Villa_2.JPG', '1282_House-Villa_3.JPG', '1282_House-Villa_4.JPG', '1282_House-Villa_5.JPG', '1282_House-Villa_6.JPG', '1282_House-Villa_7.JPG', '1282_House-Villa_8.JPG'),
(1284, '', 'Dalmatian Home', '', '', '', 'Sibenik', 'otok Krapanj', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '50', '20', '75', 1, '110000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 2, 1, 'July 30, 2015', '<p>Potpuno renovirana kamena kuæa na tri eta¾e smje&scaron;tena na istoènom dijelu malog dalmatinskog otoka Krapanj. Nekretnina se nalazi svega 50 m od mora i pla¾e.&nbsp;Povr&scaron;ina dvora iznosi 20 m2, dok je stambena povr&scaron;ina kuæe 75 m2. Ima djelomièan pogled na more.<br /><br /></p>', '<p>Completely renovated old stone house on three floors, located on the east side of a small Dalmatian island of Krapanj. The property is located only 50 meters from the beach and 100m from the town center. The house has total living area 75 sqm, and the yard of 20 sqm.</p>', '', '<p>Potpuno renovirana kamena kuæa na tri eta¾e smje&scaron;tena na istoènom dijelu malog dalmatinskog otoka Krapanj.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nekretnina se nalazi svega 50 m od mora i pla¾e, a od centra mjesta 100m, gdje su svi otoèki sadr¾aji: restoran, trgovina, pristani&scaron;te za brod.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U prizemlju se nalazi kupaonica, terasa, kuhinja i blagovaonica.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Vanjsko stepeni&scaron;te vodi na kat gdje je smje&scaron;tena spavaæa soba prostrani dnevni boravak i terasa.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Unutra&scaron;njim stepeni&scaron;tem dolazi se na zadnju eta¾u (potkrovlje) gdje je smje&scaron;tena jo&scaron; jedna spavaæa soba iz koje se pru¾a djelomièan pogled na more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nekretnina je u potpunosti renovirana (nove instalacije struje i vode, stolarija s komarnicima, fasada, krovi&scaron;te, dva klima ureðaja...) te ne zahtijeva nikakva dodatna ulaganja.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Prodaje se potpuno namje&scaron;tena (izuzev osobnih stvari sada&scaron;njih vlasnika).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za sve dodatne informacije molimo kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured u Splitu.</p>', '<p>Completely renovated old stone house on three floors, located on the east side of a small Dalmatian island of Krapanj.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property is located only 50 meters from the beach and 100m from the town center, where all the island''s facilities: restaurants, shops, pier for the boat.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the ground floor there is a bathroom, terrace, kitchen and dining room.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>External staircase leads to the first floor where there is bedroom, spacious living room and terrace.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Internal staircase leads up to the last floor (attic) where the is another bedroom with a partial sea view.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property was completely renovated (new installation of electricity and water, windows, facades, roofing, two air conditioners...) and does not require any additional investment.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is on market fully furnished (except personal items of the current owners).&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For the further information please contact our office in Split.</p>', '', '1284_House-Villa_0.jpg', '1284_House-Villa_1.jpg', '1284_House-Villa_2.jpg', '1284_House-Villa_3.jpg', '1284_House-Villa_4.jpg', '1284_House-Villa_5.jpg', '1284_House-Villa_6.jpg', '1284_House-Villa_7.jpg', '1284_House-Villa_8.jpg'),
(1285, '', 'Dalmatian Home', '', '', '', 'Sibenik', 'Bogdanoviæi, Jadrija', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '700', '1678', '200', 1, '199999', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 4, 2, 'July 30, 2015', '<p>Obiteljska kuæa smje&scaron;tena u idiliènom mjestu, udaljena svega 3 km od Jadrije, a 5 km od centra &Scaron;ibenika. Nekretnina je polo¾ena na zemlji&scaron;tu povr&scaron;ine 1678 m2, a ukupna stambena povr&scaron;ina iznosi 200 m2 (sa prateæim objektom).&nbsp;Pored kuæe nalazi se manji pomoæni objekt povr&scaron;ine 39 m2, koji se sastoji od male kuhinje, blagovaonice, kupaonice spavaæe sobe i terase s prekrasnim kamenim zatvorenim ro&scaron;tiljem.<br /><br /></p>', '<p>The family house is situated in the idyllic village, only 3 km from Jadrija, and 5 km from the center of Sibenik. The property is placed on a land area of 1678 m2, a total living area is 200 m2 (with accompanying apartment building).&nbsp;Beside the house is a small auxiliary building of 39 m2, consisting of a small kitchen, dining room, bathroom and bedroom terrace with a beautiful stone enclosed barbecue.</p>', '', '<p>Obiteljska kuæa smje&scaron;tena u idiliènom mjestu, udaljena svega 3 km od Jadrije, a 5 km od centra &Scaron;ibenika.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nekretnina je polo¾ena na zemlji&scaron;tu povr&scaron;ine 1678 m2, a ukupna stambena povr&scaron;ina iznosi 200 m2 (sa prateæim objektom).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Glavni objekt sastoji se od podruma povr&scaron;ine 70 m2, te trosobnog stana (tri spavaæe sobe, kuhinja, blagovaonica, kupaonica, wc, veliki dnevni boravak, veranda, terasa).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ukupna povr&scaron;ina stana iznosi 100 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je klimatizirana, a postavljena je peæ na drva i centralno grijanje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Pored kuæe nalazi se manji pomoæni objekt povr&scaron;ine 39 m2, koji se sastoji od male kuhinje, blagovaonice, kupaonice spavaæe sobe i terase s prekrasnim kamenim zatvorenim ro&scaron;tiljem.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Potrebno je kultivirati dvori&scaron;te, a zbog velièine terena postoji moguænost za izgradnju bazena.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nekretnina je idealna za obiteljski ¾ivot tokom cijele godine, ili za seoski turizam.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>The family house is situated in the idyllic village, only 3 km from Jadrija, and 5 km from the center of Sibenik.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property is placed on a land area of 1678 m2, a total living area is 200 m2 (with accompanying apartment building).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The main building consists of basment (70 m2) and three-bedroom flat (three bedrooms, kitchen, dining room, bathroom, toilet, large living room, porch, terrace).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Total floor area is 100 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house is air conditioned, has wood stove and central heating.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Beside the house is a small auxiliary building of 39 m2, consisting of a small kitchen, dining room, bathroom and bedroom terrace with a beautiful stone enclosed barbecue.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Because of the size of the plot there is a possibility to build a pool.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property is ideal for family living all year round, or for rural tourism.</p>', '', '1285_House-Villa_0.jpg', '1285_House-Villa_1.jpg', '1285_House-Villa_2.jpg', '1285_House-Villa_3.jpg', '1285_House-Villa_4.jpg', '1285_House-Villa_5.jpg', '1285_House-Villa_6.jpg', '1285_House-Villa_7.jpg', '1285_House-Villa_8.jpg'),
(1286, '', 'Dalmatian Home', '', '', '', 'Sibenik', 'Brodarica', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '50', '850', '282', 1, '470000', '', 2, 1, 2, 2, 1, 2, 4, 3, 'July 30, 2015', '<p>Samostojeæa kuæa novije gradnje sa vi&scaron;e stambenih jedinica (ukupno tri) i prekrasno ureðenom i odr¾avanom okuænicom, u blizini pla¾e.&nbsp;Stanu pripada i velika terasa od 20 m2 kao i spremi&scaron;te povr&scaron;ine 3,58 m2.&nbsp;Ukupna stambena povr&scaron;ina nekretnine (neto) iznosi 282,18 m2, a povr&scaron;ina okuænice iznosi cca 850 m2.<br /><br /></p>', '<p>The house with three separate flats and beautifully arranged and maintained garden, close to the beach.&nbsp;The apartment also has a large terrace of 20 m2 and a storage area of 3,58 m2.&nbsp;Total living area of the property (netto) is 282,18 m2, and the plot area is approximately 850 m2.<br /><br /></p>', '', '<p>Samostojeæa kuæa novije gradnje sa vi&scaron;e stambenih jedinica (ukupno tri) i prekrasno ureðenom i odr¾avanom okuænicom, u blizini pla¾e.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U prizemlju se nalaze gara¾a (27 m2) , ostava i stubi&scaron;te te jednosoban stan povr&scaron;ine 56,54 m2 (hodnik, boravak, kuhinja + blagovaonica, soba, ostava, kupaonica).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Stanu pripada i velika terasa od 20 m2 kao i spremi&scaron;te povr&scaron;ine 3,58 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ukupna povr&scaron;ina prizemlja iznosi 106,48 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Prvi kat sastoji se od jednosobnog stana kojem pripada i velika terasa povr&scaron;ine 40 m2, veranda i stubi&scaron;te, a ukupni stambeni dio sastoji se od boravka, kuhinje s blagovaonicom, jedne spavaæe sobe, kupaonice, ostave, verande i balkona.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ukupna povr&scaron;ina prvog kata iznosi 115,20 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Unutarnjim stubi&scaron;tem dolazi se na kat gdje je smje&scaron;ten dvosoban stan (hodnik, dvije spavaæe sobe, dnevni boravak, kuhinja i blagovaonica, kupaonica, ostava, terasa).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ukupna povr&scaron;ina drugog kata iznosi 60,50 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ukupna stambena povr&scaron;ina nekretnine (neto) iznosi 282,18 m2, a povr&scaron;ina okuænice iznosi cca 850 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nekretnina je odr¾avana, u dobrom stanju i vrlo blizu popularne pla¾e Rezali&scaron;te za koju je planirano kompletno ureðenje pla¾e, kao i obogaæivanje iste dodatnim sadr¾ajima.</p>', '<p>The house with three separate flats and beautifully arranged and maintained garden, close to the beach.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the ground floor there is a garage (27 m2), storage room staircase and one bedroom apartment of 56,54 m2 (hallway, living room, kitchen, dining room, pantry, bathroom).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The apartment also has a large terrace of 20 m2 and a storage area of 3,58 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The total floor area of ground floor is 106,48 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The first floor consists of a one-bedroom apartment with a large terrace of 40 m2, porch and staircase, and the living area consists of a lounge, kitchen, dining room, bedroom, bathroom, utility room, porch and balcony.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The total floor area of the first floor is 115,20 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Indoor staircase leads to the first floor where there is two bedroom apartment (hallway, two bedrooms, living room, kitchen and dining room in one, bathroom, storage room, terrace).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The total floor area of the second floor is 60,50 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Total living area of the property (netto) is 282,18 m2, and the plot area is approximately 850 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property is maintained in good condition and very close to the popular beach "Rezaliste" which is planned to be completely reconstructied, as well as the enrichment of the same additional facilities. &nbsp;</p>', '', '1286_House-Villa_0.jpg', '1286_House-Villa_1.jpg', '1286_House-Villa_2.jpg', '1286_House-Villa_3.jpg', '1286_House-Villa_4.jpg', '1286_House-Villa_5.jpg', '1286_House-Villa_6.jpg', '1286_House-Villa_7.jpg', '1286_House-Villa_8.jpg'),
(1287, 'Ante', 'Tièinoviæ', '', '095 911 4072', 'Ante.Ticinovic@splitskabanka.hr ', 'Makarska', 'Brela, Jakiru¹a', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '0', '0', '85', 1, '250000', '', 2, 2, 2, 1, 1, 2, 0, 0, 'July 31, 2015', '<p>Fantastièna lokacija, prvi red uz more, manja zgrada u izgradnji (trenutno P+2 u fazi niskog rohbau-a).&nbsp;Prodaje se treæi kat koji æe strukturom iznutra biti prilagoðen ¾eljama kupca, a nakon dovr&scaron;etka eta¾iran.&nbsp;Moguæe je izvesti zaseban ulaz.&nbsp;Ukupna stambena povr&scaron;ina stana iznosi cca 85 m2 i cijena se odnosi na sada&scaron;nje stanje (roh-bau).&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;">CIJENA SNI®ENA SA 350.000 EURA!</span></p>', '<p>We are pleased to offer this apartment in a unique seafront location, on the top of a low rise building which is is in the construction process. The heavy work on the ground, first and second floors has been completed. The third floor is being added and a future buyer can arrange this penthouse to his own design, internally. It is possible to create an entrance separately from the rest of the building. Total living area of the apartment is 85 m2 and the price refers to the current condition. &nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;">PRICE REDUCED FROM 350.000 EURO!</span></p>', '', '<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;"><strong>CIJENA SNI®ENA SA 350.000 EURA!</strong></span></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Fantastièna lokacija, prvi red uz more, manja zgrada u izgradnji (trenutno P+2 u fazi niskog rohbau-a).&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Prodaje se treæi kat koji æe strukturom iznutra biti prilagoðen ¾eljama kupca, a nakon dovr&scaron;etka eta¾iran.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Moguæe je izvesti zaseban ulaz.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ukupna stambena povr&scaron;ina stana iznosi cca 85 m2 i cijena se odnosi na sada&scaron;nje stanje (roh-bau).&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ju¾no orijentiran.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Parkirali&scaron;no mjesto ukljuèeno u cijenu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Slijepa ulica &ndash; mirna i jedinstvena lokacija prvi red do mora. &nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Brela su udaljena 1 km, a Makarska 15 km.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Meðunarodni aerodrom udaljen je 65 km.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za sve dodatne informacije molimo kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured u Splitu.</p>', '<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;"><strong>PRICE REDUCED FROM 350.000 EURO!</strong></span></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>We are pleased to offer this apartment in a unique seafront location, on the top of a low rise building which is is in the construction process.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The heavy work on the ground, first and second floors has been completed. The third floor is being added&nbsp;and a future buyer can arrange this penthouse to his own design, internally.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is possible to create an entrance separately from the rest of the building.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Total living area of the apartment is 85 m2 and the price refers to the current condition.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The apartment is South oriented.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>A private parking place included in the price.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is situated on a ''nothrough road'' thus ensuring almost complete silence from vehicles.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The village of Brela is the nearest conurbation and is well equipped for tourist with bars, restaurants, bakery, pharmacy and other useful services, while the larger town with more attractions and night life is 15 km away.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>International airport in Split is 65 km away.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact our office in Split for the further information, and to arrange to visit this location.</p>', '', '1287_Apartment_0.jpg', '1287_Apartment_1.jpg', '1287_Apartment_2.jpg', '1287_Apartment_3.jpg', '1287_Apartment_4.jpg', '1287_Apartment_5.jpg', '1287_Apartment_6.jpg', '1287_Apartment_7.jpg', '1287_Apartment_8.jpg'),
(1288, 'Anton', 'Fabijanoviæ', '', '099/819-8150', '', 'Split', 'Radmiloviæeva 39 a Split,153/2 i 154/2', 'For sale', 'Old stone house', '200', '', '57', 2, '90000', '', 1, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 4, 1, 'July 31, 2015', '<p>Stara kamena kuæa za renovaciju, u centru povijesnog grada Splita.&nbsp;Kuæa je dvojna, te je smje&scaron;tena u mirnom dijelu starog grada, ali u blizini svih sadr¾aja.&nbsp;Ukupna stambena povr&scaron;ina cijele kuæe iznosi 57 m2.&nbsp;S obzirom na poziciju ovo je izvrsna prilika ukoliko ¾elite nekretninu renovirati u svrhu turistièkog iznajmljivanja ili je jednostavno ¾elite koristiti za vlastiti boravak.</p>', '<p><span style="color: #ff0000;"><strong>Price reduced from 120.000 Euro!</strong></span></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>We are pleased to be the agent for this old stone house with a part of the yard for renovation, in the historical city of Split. The house is semi-detached and needs completely refurbishing. The total living area of the house is 57 m2, not including the loft area. Due to the position it is an excellent opportunity if you want to renovate the property for the purpose of renting to tourists or simply want to use it for your own living.&nbsp;</p>', '', '<p>Stara kamena kuæa s dvori&scaron;tem za renovaciju, u centru povijesnog grada Splita.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je dvojna, te je smje&scaron;tena u mirnom dijelu starog grada, ali u blizini svih sadr¾aja.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Udaljena je od mora samo 200 m, u blizini Dioklecijanove palaèe i Marjana.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Prikljuèena je na vodu i struju.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Glavni ulaz vodi u dvori&scaron;te iz kojeg se ulazi u kuæu koja se sastoji od dva dijela.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Jedan dio kuæe se sastoji od sobe (u donjem dijelu), te sobe i kupaonice u gornjem dijelu.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Drugi dio kuæe se sastoji od prizemlja, kata (koji ima izlaz na stra¾nje dvori&scaron;te) i potkrovlja koje nije u funkciji stambenog prostora.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Tu se nalaze ukupno 3 sobe i kupaonice.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ukupna stambena povr&scaron;ina cijele kuæe iznosi 57 m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Vlasni&scaron;tvo uredno.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>S obzirom na poziciju ovo je izvrsna prilika ukoliko ¾elite nekretninu renovirati u svrhu turistièkog iznajmljivanja ili je jednostavno ¾elite koristiti za vlastiti boravak.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Parking je javni, ispred kuæe, a najbli¾i veæi parking udaljen je 100 m od kuæe.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Park &scaron;uma Marjan gdje se nalazi rekreacijska zona i prekrasne pla¾e udaljena je 10 min. hodanja.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Meðunarodni aerodrom udaljen je 40 min. vo¾nje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za sve dodatne informacije slobodno nas kontaktirajte.</p>', '<p><span style="color: #ff0000;"><strong>Price reduced from 120.000 euro!</strong></span></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>We are pleased to be the agent for this old stone house with a part of the yard for renovation, in the historical city of Split.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is situated just 200m from the sea, between Marjan park and the Palace in the historic and popular area of ''Varos''.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house is semi-detached and needs completely refurbishing.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There are water and electric supplies present.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property has 3 bedrooms, and a bathroom, with additional ground floor space and a private yard.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The total &nbsp;living area of the house is 57 m2, not including the loft area.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There are many shops, bars and good restaurants within a short walk from here, as well as it being close to either the Diocletian Palace or the Marjan Park with many great beaches.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Due to the position it is an excellent opportunity if you want to renovate the property for the purpose of renting to tourists or simply want to use it for your own living.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There are very few ''un-refurbished'' properties in such a good situation these days.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There is parking in front of the house and the nearest large parking lot is located 100 m from the house.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The international airport is 40 minutes. driving.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For further information please contact us and an agent will be pleased to show you round.</p>', '', '1288_House-Villa_0.jpg', '1288_House-Villa_1.JPG', '1288_House-Villa_2.JPG', '1288_House-Villa_3.JPG', '1288_House-Villa_4.JPG', '1288_House-Villa_5.jpg', '1288_House-Villa_6.jpg', '', ''),
(1289, 'Frane', 'Pono¹', '095 518 0305', '091 533 0447', 'frane.ponos@gmail.com; nelagospodnetic@y', 'Brac', 'Put gospe od Krtina 16 Sutivan, ZU 2548 k.o. Sutivan', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '250', '240', '180', 1, '540000', '', 2, 1, 2, 2, 1, 1, 3, 3, 'July 31, 2015', '<p>Arhitektonski jedinstvena vila izgraðena na temeljima stare mirine. Predstavlja zanimljiv spoj tradicionalne vanj&scaron;tine i modernog interijera.&nbsp;Ima ukupnu stambenu povr&scaron;inu 180 m2, dok je povr&scaron;ina zemlji&scaron;ta 240 m2.&nbsp;Kuæa ima podno grijanje, centralni sustav hlaðenja, smart system kontrole temperature, svjetla, ozvuèenja. Bazen je izdignut na razinu prizemlja, a oko njega se nalazi terasa za sunèanje poploèana kamenom, okru¾ena palmama i ostalim mediteranskim biljem.</p>', '<p>Architecturally unique villa built on the foundations of an old stone house. It represents an interesting blend of traditional exterior and contemporary interior.&nbsp;It has living area of 180 m2, while the land plot measures 240 m2.&nbsp;The property has underfloor heating, central air-conditioning system, smart temperature, light and sound controls. Lovely sundeck surrounded with mediterranean herbs and palm trees.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>', '', '<p>Arhitektonski jedinstvena vila izgraðena na temeljima stare mirine.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Predstavlja zanimljiv spoj tradicionalne vanj&scaron;tine i modernog interijera.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Villa ima unutarnji grijani bazen, dnevni boravak, kuhinju sa jedeæim dijelom, 3 spavaæe sobe sa kupaonicama, tu&scaron;/wc, terasu te balkone.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sa prizemlja i kata se pru¾a lijepi pogled na dio mjesta i more.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa ima podno grijanje, centralni sustav hlaðenja, smart system kontrole temperature, svjetla, ozvuèenja.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Parking za 2 automobila.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Bazen je izdignut na razinu prizemlja, a oko njega se nalazi terasa za sunèanje poploèana kamenom, okru¾ena palmama i ostalim mediteranskim biljem.</p>', '<p>Architecturally unique villa built on the foundations of an old stone house.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It represents an interesting blend of traditional exterior and contemporary interior. &nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The villa has inner heated pool, loung/living room, kitchen with dining table, 3 en-suite bedrooms, toilet, terrace and balconies.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ground and first floor offer scenic views on the village and the sea.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property has underfloor heating, central air-conditioning system, smart temperature, light and sound controls.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Parking for 2 cars.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Lovely sundeck surrounded with mediterranean herbs and palm trees.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>', '', '1289_House-Villa_0.JPG', '1289_House-Villa_1.JPG', '1289_House-Villa_2.JPG', '1289_House-Villa_3.JPG', '1289_House-Villa_4.JPG', '1289_House-Villa_5.JPG', '1289_House-Villa_6.JPG', '1289_House-Villa_7.JPG', '1289_House-Villa_8.jpg'),
(1290, '®eljko', 'Obrovac', '', '099 674 0581', 'jenniferobrovac@hotmail.com', 'Zadar', 'Put Smokvice 10 23231 Ko¾ino (ZADAR) RH, 412/438', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '20 ', '0', '64', 2, '144900', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 2, 1, 'July 31, 2015', '<p>Luksuzan dvosoban apartman u elitnom dijelu, nedaleko Zadra, na odliènoj lokaciji. Nalazi se na drugom od ukupno tri kata zgrade, koja je sagraðena 2005. godine. Ukupna povr&scaron;ina stambenog dijela iznosi 64,2 m2.&nbsp;Ispred zgrade se nalazi ureðena pla¾a s parkingom udaljena od zgrade samo 40 m.&nbsp;Postoje instalacije za parno grijanje, dok je namje&scaron;taj raðen po narud¾bi. Vlasnicima pripada i vez za brod. Postoji i moguænost kupnje stana bez namje&scaron;taja po cijeni od &euro;139,900.</p>', '<p>We have this very presentable and luxurious two-bedroom apartment in a desirable area, near Zadar. Total size of the living area is 64.2 m2. The building is close to the nearest beach and parking is only 40m away from the building. The furniture is included but without the furniture the price is reduced to 139k euro. All necessary facilities are located 450 m, and close to the public transport (buses for the city). Marina Borik is located 5 km, while Zadar, 3 km away.</p>', '', '<p>Luksuzan dvosoban &nbsp;apartman u elitnom dijelu, nedaleko Zadra, na odliènoj lokaciji.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nalazi se na drugom od ukupno tri kata zgrade, koja je sagraðena 2005. godine.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sastoji se od dvije spavaæe sobe 4X4,5m i 3,8mX4,0m, kupaonice, dnevnog boravka (6,5mX5,5m) s kuhinjom i izlazom na veliki balkon sa tendom i plinskim ro&scaron;tiljem (8m2).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>S balkona se pru¾a predivan pogled na more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuhinja ima izlaz na manji balkon (3m2) takoðer s pogledom na more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ukupna povr&scaron;ina stambenog dijela iznosi 64,2 m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ispred zgrade se nalazi ureðena pla¾a s parkingom udaljena od zgrade samo 40 m.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Postoje instalacije za parno grijanje, dok je namje&scaron;taj raðen po narud¾bi.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Vlasnicima pripada i vez za brod.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Postoji i moguænost kupnje stana bez namje&scaron;taja po cijeni od &euro;139,900.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Svi potrebni sadr¾aji su udaljeni 450 m, a u blizini je i javni prijevoz (autobusne linije za grad).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Marina Borik je udaljena 5 km, dok je Zadar udaljen 3 km.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Molimo za sve dodatne informacije kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured u Splitu.</p>', '<p>We have this very presentable and luxurious two-bedroom apartment in a desirable area, near Zadar.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is situated on the second floor of a three storey building, which was built in 2005.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It consists of two double bedrooms and bathroom, a spacious open plan kitchen/ living room (6,5mX5,5m) leading onto a large balcony with awning shade and gas bbq/grill (8m2).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The balcony offers a beautiful wide view including the sea.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The kitchen area also has access to a small balcony (3m2) also with sea views.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Total size of the living area is 64.2 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The building is close to the nearest beach and parking is only 40m away from the building.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The furniture is included but without the furniture the price is reduced to 139k euro.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>All necessary facilities are located 450 m, and close to the public transport (buses for the city).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Marina Borik is located 5 km, while Zadar, 3 km away.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact our office in Split for further information.</p>', '', '1290_Apartment_0.jpg', '1290_Apartment_1.jpg', '1290_Apartment_2.jpg', '1290_Apartment_3.jpg', '1290_Apartment_4.jpg', '1290_Apartment_5.jpg', '1290_Apartment_6.jpg', '1290_Apartment_7.jpg', '1290_Apartment_8.jpg'),
(1291, 'Ivica', 'Bosniæ', '095 399 2824   ', '095 905 9961', 'Ivica.bosnic@pomorstvo.hr', 'Zadar', 'Pravdono¹e 10.  Zadar, 9612/2', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '55', '0', '73', 1, '400000', '', 2, 2, 2, 1, 1, 2, 3, 1, 'July 31, 2015', '<p>Stan u centru Zadra, na odliènoj lokaciji.&nbsp;Nalazi se na poluotoku, prvi red uz more s pogledom na marinu, ravne kotare i Velebit sa sjeverne, te na park i djelomièno na zvonik s ju¾ne strane.&nbsp;Orijentiran je sjever-jug.&nbsp;Stambena povr&scaron;ina stana iznosi 72,65 m2.&nbsp;Od samog centra poluotoka udaljen je 5 min laganog hoda, a isto toliko od Morskih orgulja. &nbsp;</p>', '<p>We are offering this well presented apartment in the centre of Zadar, in a great location.&nbsp;It is located on a peninsula, close to the seafront overlooking the marina, the residential districts and Velebit mountains to the north, and with the park to the south side. Inside the property it has a floor space of 72.65 m2. From the center of the peninsula it is just a 5 min walk to the centre of town, with a similar distance from the shore and the famous ''Sea Organ''.</p>', '', '<p>Stan u centru Zadra, na odliènoj lokaciji.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nalazi se na poluotoku, prvi red uz more s pogledom na marinu, ravne kotare i Velebit sa sjeverne, te na park i djelomièno na zvonik s ju¾ne strane.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Orijentiran je sjever-jug.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Stambena povr&scaron;ina stana iznosi 72,65 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuhinja i dnevni boravak su na ju¾noj, a spavaæe sobe na sjevernoj strani.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Zgrada je kvalitetno graðena te su gotovo svi zidovi nosivi osim pregradnih izmeðu kupaonice i wc-a.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Zgrada ima ukupno 6 stanova.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Stan se nalazi na treæem katu koji je inaèe i zadnji te je moguæa nadogradnja potkrovlja za koje veæ postoji projekt.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Tu se mo¾e dobiti jo&scaron; jedan po svemu atraktivan apartman od cca. 50-ak m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U istoj zgradi je i pripadajuæa gara¾a (&asymp;20 m2), smje&scaron;tena odmah uz ulazna vrata zgrade.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ispred gara¾e ima uvijek slobodan parking za eventualne goste &scaron;to nudi dodatan komfor.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Gara¾a se mo¾e preinaèiti u poslovni prostor jer joj je to bila i prvobitna namjena.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Stan ima klima ureðaj Daikin od 4 kW te Mramoterm ploèe u svim sobama i kuhinji.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ima i 2 dimnjaka te je moguæa ugradnja kalijevih peæi ili kamina.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Stan i gara¾a imaju svoja mjerila za struju i vodu, te nema problema sa preraspodjelom tro&scaron;kova potro&scaron;nje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Od samog centra poluotoka udaljen je 5 min laganog hoda, a isto toliko od Morskih orgulja.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nekoliko gradskih pla¾a udaljeno je 15-ak minuta lagane &scaron;etnje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Meðunarodni aerodrom Zadar udaljen je 13 km odnosno 15 minuta vo¾nje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za sve dodatne informacije stojimo Vam na raspolaganju.</p>', '<p>We are offering this well presented apartment in the centre of Zadar, in a great location.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is located on a peninsula, close to the seafront overlooking the marina, the residential districts and Velebit mountains to the north, and with the park to the south side.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is oriented north-south.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Inside the property it has a floor space of 72.65 m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The kitchen and living room are on the south, and the bedrooms on the north side.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The building is well built and with good sound insulation, almost all the walls are solid.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is well decorated, if dated, and well maintained.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The building has a total of only 6 apartments.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The apartment is located on the third (top) floor, and there is the possibility of enlarging this into the attic, and a project has been drawnup to incorporate this.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Here you can create an attractive apartment of approx. around 50 m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property comes with a private garage in the same building, and additional free parking for any guests is always available in front of the property.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The garage can be transformed into an internal space if preferred.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The apartment has powerful air conditioning in all rooms and the kitchen.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There are two chimneys and the possible installation of stoves or fireplaces.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>From the center of the peninsula it is just a 5 min walk to the centre of town, with a similar distance from the shore and the famous ''Sea Organ''.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Zadar International Airport is 13 km or 15 minutes.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For additional information, please contact us.</p>', '', '1291_Apartment_0.JPG', '1291_Apartment_1.JPG', '1291_Apartment_2.JPG', '1291_Apartment_3.JPG', '1291_Apartment_4.JPG', '1291_Apartment_5.JPG', '1291_Apartment_6.JPG', '1291_Apartment_7.JPG', '1291_Apartment_8.JPG'),
(1292, 'Olah', 'Nandor', '098 912 6428', '', 'sutivan@sutivan.hu', 'Brac', 'Ulica 1.svibnja Supetar, K.è. 812/3 k.o. supetar, ZU 1427', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '230', '0', '64', 1, '180000', '', 2, 1, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 'August 10, 2015', '<p>Novogradnja iznimne kvalitete u Supetru na otoku Braèu, nadomak centra mjesta i pla¾a. Zgrada se sastoji od 3 stana, a svakoj jedinici pristupa se preko vanjskog stepeni&scaron;ta. Povr&scaron;ina unutarnjeg dijela iznosi 64 m2, a stanu pripada i vanjska terasa bruto povr&scaron;ine 19 m2.&nbsp;Prizemlje: 180.000 EUR. Prvi kat: 190.000 EUR. Visoko potkrovlje: 185.000 EUR.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>New development of exceptional quality located in Supetar on Brac island, at walking distance to the center and beaches. The building has 3 units, each accessed through external staircase. Living area is sized 64 sqm, and in addition there is spatious terrace sized 19 sqm gross.&nbsp;Ground floor: 180.000 EUR. First floor: 190.000 EUR. High attick: 185.000 EUR.</p>', '', '<p>Novogradnja iznimne kvalitete u Supetru na otoku Braèu, nadomak centra mjesta i pla¾a.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Zgrada se sastoji od 3 stana, a svakoj jedinici pristupa se preko vanjskog stepeni&scaron;ta. &nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Svaki stan ima predsoblje, otvoreni dio kuhinje sa jedeæim dijelom i dnevnim boravkom, dvije spavaæe sobe, kupaonicu i wc.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Povr&scaron;ina unutarnjeg dijela iznosi 64 m2, a stanu pripada i vanjska terasa bruto povr&scaron;ine 19 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Svaki stan ima 3 klima ureðaja, spu&scaron;teni strop sa vrhunskom rasvjetom, najkvalitetnije podne i zidne obloge te mu pripadaju 2 parkirna mjesta.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Okoli&scaron; zgrade je ureðen, opremljen sustavom navodnjavanja te led rasvjetom na fasadi, terasama i stepeni&scaron;tu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Stanovi su svijetli, prozraèni, nemaju pogled na more, ali se nalaze u ureðenom susjedstvu.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong><br /></strong></p>\r\n<p><strong>Prizemlje: 180.000 EUR</strong></p>\r\n<p><strong><br /></strong></p>\r\n<p><strong>Prvi kat: 190.000 EUR</strong></p>\r\n<p><strong><br /></strong></p>\r\n<p><strong>Visoko potkrovlje: 185.000 EUR</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Molimo za dodatne informacije kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured u Splitu.</p>', '<p>New development of exceptional quality located in Supetar on Brac island, at walking distance to the center and beaches.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The building has 3 units, each accessed through external staircase.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Every apartment has lobby, open-plan kitchen, dining and living area, two bedrooms, bathroom and toilet.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Living area is sized 64 sqm, and in addition there is spatious terrace sized 19 sqm gross.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Each apartment features 3 a/c units, ceilings with top quality lightning fixtures, superb flooring and tiling as well as 2 parking places.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Garden is paved and landscaped, equipped with automatic irigation system and led lights on facade, terraces and stairs.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartments are airy and bright.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Even though they don''t have sea views, they are located in well-kept and appealing neighbourhood.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Ground floor: 180.000 EUR</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>First floor: 190.000 EUR</strong></p>\r\n<p><strong><br /></strong></p>\r\n<p><strong>High attick: 185.000 EUR</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For the further information please contact our office in Split.</p>', '', '1292_Apartment_0.jpg', '1292_Apartment_1.jpg', '1292_Apartment_2.jpg', '1292_Apartment_3.jpg', '1292_Apartment_4.jpg', '1292_Apartment_5.jpg', '1292_Apartment_6.jpg', '1292_Apartment_7.jpg', '1292_Apartment_8.jpg');
