(1293, 'Andrija', 'Beljan', '', '098 174 4167', 'branimir@snn.hr ', 'Makarska', 'Put Topiæa Ba¹ka Voda, k.è. 3734/2 ZU 10207 k.o. Bast-Ba¹ka Voda', 'For sale', 'Land plot', '380', '790', '0', 1, '220000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 0, 0, 'August 10, 2015', '<p>Graðevno zemlji&scaron;te u neizgraðenom graðevnom dijelu naselja, oko 380 m od mora, pravilnog oblika, uz javni put.&nbsp;Povr&scaron;ina zemlji&scaron;ta iznosi 790 m2.&nbsp;Dozvoljena izgradnja samostojeæe graðevine: kig 0.3, Kis 1.2, broj eta¾a Po + P + 1, udaljenost od prometnice 5 m, a od granica parcele 4.&nbsp;Ju¾no orijentirano.</p>', '<p>Building land in designated undeveloped building zone, ca. 380 meters from the sea, of rectangular shape, next to the public road.&nbsp;The land plot measures 790 m2.&nbsp;Detached houses: footprint ratio 0.3, utilization ratio 1.2, number of floors basement + ground + first, distance from the road 5 m, and from other boundaries of the plot 4 m.&nbsp;South oriented.</p>', '', '<p>Graðevno zemlji&scaron;te u neizgraðenom graðevnom dijelu naselja, oko 380 m od mora, pravilnog oblika, uz javni put.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Povr&scaron;ina zemlji&scaron;ta iznosi 790 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Dozvoljena izgradnja samostojeæe graðevine: kig 0.3, Kis 1.2, broj eta¾a Po + P + 1, udaljenost od prometnice 5 m, a od granica parcele 4.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ju¾no orijentirano.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Makarska je udaljena 10 km, a Ba&scaron;ka Voda 400 m.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Split je udaljen 80 km.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Molimo za dodatne informacije kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured.</p>', '<p>Building land in designated undeveloped building zone, ca. 380 meters from the sea, of rectangular shape, next to the public road.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The land plot measures 790 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Detached houses: footprint ratio 0.3, utilization ratio 1.2, number of floors basement + ground + first, distance from the road 5 m, and from other boundaries of the plot 4 m.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>South oriented.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Makarska is 10 km away.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>International airport Split is 80 km away.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please for the further information contact our office.</p>', '', '1293_Land-plot_0.jpg', '1293_Land-plot_1.jpg', '1293_Land-plot_2.jpg', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(1294, 'Mirjana', 'Mrmiæ', '091 884 3897', '', '', 'Trogir', 'Mornarska 2 / ugao Ribarska 6a Seget vranjica, ZU 4155 pu 2, k.o. Seget', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '80', '0', '70', 1, '240000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 2, 1, 'August 10, 2015', '<p>Poslovni prostor (70 m2) u prizemlju vi&scaron;estambene zgrade, a sastoji se od otvorenog kancelarijskog prostira sa dvije sobe te sanitarnog èvora. Prostoru pripada i terasa povr&scaron;ine ca. 100 m2.&nbsp;Postoji moguænost kupnje gara¾no - skladi&scaron;nog prostora u podrumu, povr&scaron;ine ca. 75 m2 za 1.000 EUR/m2.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>Business premise (70 m2) on the ground floor of a low - rise building. It contains open-plan space with 2 rooms and bathroom. A terrace sized ca. 100 m2 belongs to the premise.&nbsp;There is an option of buying garage-storage space in the basement, sized ca. 75 m2 for 1.000 EUR/m2.</p>', '', '<p>Poslovni prostor u prizemlju vi&scaron;estambene zgrade, a sastoji se od otvorenog kancelarijskog prostira sa dvije sobe te sanitarnog èvora.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Prostoru pripada i terasa povr&scaron;ine ca. 100 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nekretnina je legalizirana &ndash; utvrðivanje toènih povr&scaron;ina novim eta¾nim elaboratom je u tijeku.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Prostor je prethodno bio stambeni te se mo¾e opet prenamijeniti kao takav.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Visina stropa oko 3 metra.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Podno grijanje u cijelom prostoru.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Zapadno orijentiran.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Postoji moguænost kupnje gara¾no-skladi&scaron;nog prostora u podrumu, povr&scaron;ine ca. 75 m2 za 1.000 EUR/m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Trogir je udaljen 6 km, a meðunarodni aerodrom Split 8 km.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za sve dodatne informacije molimo kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured u Splitu.</p>', '<p>Business premise on the ground floor of a low - rise building.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It contains open-plan space with 2 rooms and bathroom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>A terrace sized ca. 100 m2 belongs to the premise.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property is legalized &ndash; exact sizes will be determined by the geometer.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Originally, the premise was an apartment and can be converted back to residential purpose.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ceiling height ca 3 meters.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Underfloor heating throughout the property.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>West oriented.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There is an option of buying garage-storage space in the basement, sized ca. 75 m2 for 1.000 EUR/m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Trogir town is 6 km, while the internationa airport Split is 8 km away.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For the further information please contact our office in Split.</p>', '', '1294_Apartment_0.jpg', '1294_Apartment_1.jpg', '1294_Apartment_2.jpg', '1294_Apartment_3.jpg', '1294_Apartment_4.jpg', '1294_Apartment_5.jpg', '1294_Apartment_6.jpg', '1294_Apartment_7.jpg', '1294_Apartment_8.jpg'),
