sidential purpose.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ceiling height ca 3 meters.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Underfloor heating throughout the property.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There is an option of buying garage - storage space in the basement, sized ca. 75 m2 for 1.000 EUR/m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Trogir town is 6 km, while the internationa airport Split is 8 km away.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For the further information please contact our office in Split.</p>', '', '1295_Apartment_0.jpg', '1295_Apartment_1.jpg', '1295_Apartment_2.jpg', '1295_Apartment_3.jpg', '1295_Apartment_4.jpg', '1295_Apartment_5.jpg', '1295_Apartment_6.jpg', '1295_Apartment_7.jpg', '1295_Apartment_8.jpg'),
(1561, '', 'Gumulin', '021 761-617', '091 555  5100', '', 'Hvar', 'Jelsa', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '20', '1960', '328', 1, '600000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 0, 0, 'February 9, 2016', '<p>Kuæa na izvrsnoj lokaciji, 2 red do mora.&nbsp;Nalazi se na jedinstvenoj lokaciji, s prekrasnim vrtom obogaæenim mediteranskim biljkama, oleandrom, palmama, a u blizini mora i pla¾a.&nbsp;Kuæa ima pontencijal da se pretvori u prekrasnu privatnu vilu.&nbsp;Nekretnina ima ukupnu stambenu povr&scaron;inu 328 m2 (250 m2 prizemlje te 78 m2 podrum), a smje&scaron;tena je na zemlji&scaron;tu od 1960 m2.&nbsp;Okru¾ena je visokim zidom koji pru¾a privatnost.</p>', '<p>We are pleased to offer this house in the second line to the sea.&nbsp;The property has a total living area of 328 m2 (250 m2 of ground floor and basement of 78 m2), and is located on a plot of 1960 m2.&nbsp;It is surrounded by a high wall which ensure peace and privacy.&nbsp;It is situated in a unique location, surrounded with a beautiful garden enriched with Mediterranean plants. The house has the potential to be turned into a beautiful private villa.&nbsp;</p>', '', '<p><strong>Kuæa na izvrsnoj lokaciji, 2 red do mora</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nalazi se na jedinstvenoj lokaciji, s prekrasnim vrtom obogaæenim mediteranskim biljkama, oleandrom, palmama, a u blizini mora i pla¾a.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Svi potrebni sadr¾aji nalaze se u blizini (ljekarne, restorani, kafiæi, slastièarne, po&scaron;ta, banke, trgovine).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa ima pontencijal da se pretvori u prekrasnu privatnu vilu.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nekretnina ima ukupnu stambenu povr&scaron;inu 328 m2 (250 m2 prizemlje te 78 m2 podrum), a smje&scaron;tena je na zemlji&scaron;tu od 1960 m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Okru¾ena je visokim zidom koji pru¾a privatnost.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za dodatne informacije molimo kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured u Splitu.&nbsp;</p>', '<p><strong>We are pleased to offer this house in the second line to the sea</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property has a total living area of 328 m2 (250 m2 of ground floor and basement of 78 m2), and is located on a plot of 1960 m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is surrounded by a high wall which ensure peace and privacy.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is situated in a unique location, surrounded with a beautiful garden enriched with Mediterranean plants, oleander, palm trees and the sea and beach are just in front.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>All necessary facilities are nearby (pharmacy, restaurants, cafes, bakery, post office, banks, shops).&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house has the potential to be turned into a beautiful private villa.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For further information, please contact our office in Split.</p>', '', '1561_House-Villa_0.jpg', '1561_House-Villa_1.jpg', '1561_House-Villa_2.jpg', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(1296, '', 'Rakiæ', '', '', '', 'Rogoznica', 'Lozica', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '40', '383', '160', 1, '349000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 4, 3, 'August 10, 2015', '<p>Prodaje se samostojeæa obiteljska kuæa s pogledom na more u Rogoznici. Udaljena je 40 m od mora i pla¾e.&nbsp;Kuæa ima stambenu povr&scaron;inu 160 m2.&nbsp;Sastoji se od podruma, prizemlja i kata. Kuæa je okru¾ena ureðenom okuænicom od 280 m&sup2;.&nbsp;Orijentirana prema jugu.</p>', '<p>A detached family house with beautiful sea view in Rogoznica, located 40 m from the sea and the beach. The house has living area of 160 m2. The house features a basement, ground and first floor. There is also a spacious terrace with a wonderful view of the open sea. The house is surrounded by 280 m&sup2; plot.&nbsp;South oriented.</p>', '', '<p>Prodaje se samostojeæa obiteljska kuæa s pogledom na more u Rogoznici.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Udaljena je 40 m od mora i pla¾e.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa ima stambenu povr&scaron;inu 160 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sastoji se od podruma, prizemlja i kata.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Prostor podruma se trenutno koristi kao sprema.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U prostor prizemlja se ulazi preko natkrivene otvorene verande.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sastoji se od predsoblja, dvije spavaæe sobe, dvije kupaonice, dnevnog boravka i blagovaonice u jednoj cjelini te kuhinje iz koje se izlazi na loggiu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Odvojenim stubi&scaron;tem dolazi se na kat koji se sastoji od dvije spavaæe sobe, kupaonice te kuhinje, blagovaonice i dnevnog boravka u jednoj cjelini.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na katu se nalazi i velika terasa s lijepim pogledom na otvoreno more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je okru¾ena ureðenom okuænicom od 280 m&sup2;.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Orijentirana prema jugu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Od samog centra mjesta je udaljena 2 km.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za sve dodatne informacije molimo kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured u Splitu.</p>', '<p>A detached family house with beautiful sea view in Rogoznica, located 40 m from the sea and the beach.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house has living area of 160 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house features a basement, ground and first floor.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The basement is currently being used as storage space.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>An open roofed veranda leads to the ground floor spaces consisting of a hall, two bedrooms, two bathrooms, lounge and dining area and a kitchen opening up onto a loggia.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>A separate staircase leads to the first floor consisting of two bedrooms, bathroom and an open plan kitchen, lounge and dining area.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There is also a spacious terrace with a wonderful view of the open sea.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house is surrounded by 280 m&sup2; plot.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>South oriented.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The center of Rogoznica is 2 km away.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For the further information please contact our office in Split.</p>', '', '1296_House-Villa_0.JPG', '1296_House-Villa_1.JPG', '1296_House-Villa_2.JPG', '1296_House-Villa_3.JPG', '1296_House-Villa_4.JPG', '1296_House-Villa_5.JPG', '1296_House-Villa_6.JPG', '1296_House-Villa_7.JPG', '1296_House-Villa_8.JPG'),
(1297, '', 'Rakiæ', '', '', '', 'Rogoznica', 'Rogoznica, Kopara', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '50', '0', '0', 1, '132000', '', 2, 1, 2, 2, 1, 2, 2, 1, 'August 11, 2015', '<p>Rogoznica - poluotok - centar, apartmani s pogledom na more, drugi red do mora. Sastoje se od dvije spavaæe sobe, kuhinje, blagovaone i dnevnog boravka u jednoj cjelini, hodnika i balkona. Apartmanima pripada i po jedno parkirno mjesto koje se dodatno naplaæuje 500,00 &euro;/m2. Orijentirani su sjeverno. Nalaze se u Rogoznici na odliènoj lokaciji, u blizini &scaron;ljunèane pla¾e i samog centra mjesta Rogoznica.</p>', '<p>We are pleased to offer these two recently completed apartments near Rogoznica. They are situated in the second row of property from the shore, with elevated views directly onto the small village harbour, and within a few yards from shops, bakery, coffee and licensed bars and cafes along the shore. Each apartment has one parking place that is charged extra &euro; 500 / m2. Oriented north.</p>', '', '<p>Rogoznica - poluotok - centar, apartmani s pogledom na more, drugi red do mora.</p>\r\n<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;"><br /></span></p>\r\n<p><strong><span style="text-decoration: underline;">APARTMAN 1: visoko potkrovlje, 60 m2, &euro;147.000</span></strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartman se nalazi u visokom potkrovlju zgrade.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sastoji se od dvije spavaæe sobe, kuhinje, blagovaone i dnevnog boravka u jednoj cjelini, hodnika i balkona.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong><span style="text-decoration: underline;">APARTMAN 2: visoko prizemlje, 62 m2, &euro;132.000 PRODANO</span></strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartman se nalazi u visokom prizemlju zgrade.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sastoji se od dvije spavaæe sobe, kupaonice, hodnika, kuhinje, blagovaone i dnevnog boravka u jednoj cjelini.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartmanima pripada i po jedno parkirno mjesto koje se dodatno naplaæuje 500,00 &euro;/m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Orijentirani su sjeverno.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nalaze se u Rogoznici na odliènoj lokaciji, u blizini &scaron;ljunèane pla¾e i samog centra mjesta Rogoznica.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U cijenu stana nije ukljuèeno parkirno mjesto koje se naplaæuje 500,00 &euro;/m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Do same pla¾e je cca 50 m, a do centra Rogoznice cca 200 m.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartmani visokog standarda na odliènoj lokaciji.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Idealni za boravak tijekom cijele godine.</p>', '<p>We are pleased to offer these two recently completed apartments near Rogoznica.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>They are situated in the second row of property from the shore, with elevated views directly onto the small village harbour, and within a few yards from shops, bakery, coffee and licensed bars and cafes along the shore.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The coast here is mixed fine gravel and sand and is very safe for children and playing in the water.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong><span style="text-decoration: underline;">APARTMENT 1: attic, 60 m2 &euro; 147.000</span></strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The apartment is located on the second floor.It consists of two bedrooms, kitchen, dining room and living room in one area, hall and balcony.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong><span style="text-decoration: underline;">APARTMENT 2: ground floor, 62 m2 &euro; 132,000 SOLD</span></strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The apartment is located on the ground floor of the building.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It consists of two bedrooms, bathroom, hallway, kitchen, dining room and living room in one area.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Each apartment has one parking place that is charged extra &euro; 500 / m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Oriented north.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The beach is about 50 m, and the town centre about 200 m.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The properties have been finished well, with wooden floors, large windows - so the views can be enjoyed throughout the flat and practical and stylish fittings in the bathrooms.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>They are ideal apartments to stay in at a time of the year.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact our agents to arrange to visit the property.</p>', '', '1297_Apartment_0.JPG', '1297_Apartment_1.JPG', '1297_Apartment_2.JPG', '1297_Apartment_3.JPG', '1297_Apartment_4.JPG', '1297_Apartment_5.JPG', '1297_Apartment_6.JPG', '1297_Apartment_7.jpg', '1297_Apartment_8.JPG'),
(1298, '', 'Rakiæ', '', '', '', 'Rogoznica', 'Lozica, Rogoznica', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '100', '0', '0', 1, '91800', '', 2, 1, 2, 2, 1, 2, 2, 1, 'August 11, 2015', '<p>Apartmani &nbsp;s pogledom na more, nalaze se u mirnoj lokaciji, u blizini prekrasnih pla¾a, samo 100 m od mora.&nbsp;Apartman na 1. katu ima povr&scaron;inu 63 m2, a apartman na 2. katu 54.40 m2.&nbsp;Postoji moguænost kupovine i dodatne prostorije u podrumu zgrade.&nbsp;Apartmani se nalaze u kvalitetnoj zgradi koja je smje&scaron;tena u blizini prekrasnih pla¾a.&nbsp;Mirna lokacija, predivan pogled na more, ju¾na orijentacije.<br /><br /></p>', '<p>We are pleased to offer these two, newly completed apartments in a great location near Rogoznica. They are situated in a quiet location, near the beautiful beaches, just 100 meters from the sea, facing south.&nbsp;Apartment on the 1st floor has living area of 63 m2, and apartment on the ground floor 54.40 m2.&nbsp;The apartments are located in a well constructed building and fitted and finished with good quality items. The apartments have private parking.</p>', '', '<p>Apartmani &nbsp;s pogledom na more, nalaze se u mirnoj lokaciji, u blizini prekrasnih pla¾a, samo 100 m od mora.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong><span style="text-decoration: underline;">APARTMAN 1: 63 m2, &euro;105.000</span></strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartman na 1. katu zgrade u Rogoznici.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sastoji se od dvije spavaæe sobe, kuhinje sa blagovaonom i dnevnim boravkom, balkona te kupaonice.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Mirna lokacija, predivan pogled na more, ju¾na orijentacije.</p>\r\n<p><strong><span style="text-decoration: underline;"><br /></span></strong></p>\r\n<p><strong><span style="text-decoration: underline;">APARTMAN 2: 54.40 m2, &euro;91.800</span> - <span style="color: #ff0000;">PRODAN!</span></strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartman u prizemlju zgrade u Rogoznici.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartman se sastoji od dvije spavaæe sobe, kupaone, hodnika, kuhinje, blagovaone i dnevnog boravka u jednoj cjelini te balkona.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Postoji moguænost kupovine i dodatne prostorije u podrumu zgrade.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartmani se nalaze u kvalitetnoj zgradi koja je smje&scaron;tena u blizini prekrasnih pla¾a.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ju¾na orijentacija.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Udaljenost od centra mjesta je 1 km.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je izgraðena 2014. godine.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartmani imaju parking.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za sve dodatne informacije molimo kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured.</p>', '<p>We are pleased to offer these two, newly completed apartments in a great location near Rogoznica.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>They are situated in a quiet location, near the beautiful beaches, just 100 meters from the sea, facing south.</p>\r\n<p><strong><span style="text-decoration: underline;"><br /></span></strong></p>\r\n<p><strong><span style="text-decoration: underline;">APARTMENT 1: 63 m2 &euro; 105.000</span></strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>First floor, it consists of two bedrooms, kitchen and living room, balcony and bathroom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The balcony is South facing and covered, so provides privacy but great views across the sea.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong><span style="text-decoration: underline;">APARTMENT 2: 54.40 m2, &euro; 91,800</span> - <span style="color: #ff0000;">SOLD!</span></strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ground floor, the apartment has two bedrooms, bathroom, hallway, kitchen, dining room and living room in one area and a balcony.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There is the possibility of buying additional rooms in the basement of the building.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The apartments are located in a well constructed building and fitted and finished with good quality items.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The apartments have private parking.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The distance from the town center is 1 km, and here is a good range of services and useful shops, bakery, and bars etc.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact our agents for more information and to arrange to visit the property.</p>', '', '1298_Apartment_0.JPG', '1298_Apartment_1.JPG', '1298_Apartment_2.JPG', '1298_Apartment_3.JPG', '1298_Apartment_4.JPG', '1298_Apartment_5.jpg', '1298_Apartment_6.JPG', '1298_Apartment_7.JPG', '1298_Apartment_8.JPG'),
(1299, '', 'Rakiæ', '', '', '', 'Rogoznica', 'Ra¾anj', 'For sale', 'Land plot', '80', '11000', '0', 1, '2090000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 0, 0, 'August 11, 2015', '<p>Graðevinsko zemlji&scaron;te u Rogoznici, povr&scaron;ine 11000 m2, pogodno za gradnju luksuznih vila.&nbsp;Idealan nagib terena, pravilan oblik, dimenzija 120x90m.&nbsp;Zemlji&scaron;te ima &scaron;iroki pogled na more i Rogoznicu, svu infrastrukturu, asfaltni pristup, te prikljuèak vode na terenu.&nbsp;Nalazi se u treæem redu od mora udaljenosti oko 80 metara.</p>', '<p>We are pleased to offer this rare opportunity to buy a substantial building/development plot on the mainland near Rogoznica, surface &nbsp;of 11.000m2, suitable for building luxury villas. The plot is situated on a gentle slope - ideal for ensuring each unit ofbuilding has long uninterrupted sea views, and with dimensions 120x90m. The land has views of the sea and Rogoznica, all the infrastructure already present, and an asphalt access road. It is located in the third row from the sea a distance of about 80 meters.</p>', '', '<p>Graðevinsko zemlji&scaron;te u Rogoznici, povr&scaron;ine 11000 m2, pogodno za gradnju luksuznih vila.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Idealan nagib terena, pravilan oblik, dimenzija 120x90m.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Zemlji&scaron;te ima &scaron;iroki pogled na more i Rogoznicu, svu infrastrukturu, asfaltni pristup, te prikljuèak vode na terenu.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nalazi se u treæem redu od mora udaljenosti oko 80 metara.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Planski uvjeti za zonu u kojem se zemlji&scaron;te nalazi:</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>(1) Neizgraðeno, a ureðeno graðevinsko podruèje naselja izgraðuje se i ureðuje na naèin da se &scaron;to vi&scaron;e oèuvaju vrijednosti prostora.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>(2) Za gradnju novih stambenih, stambeno poslovnih i poslovnih graðevina, rekonstrukciju i zamjenu postojeæih graðevina odreðuju se sljedeæi uvjeti:&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>a) minimalna povr&scaron;ina graðevne èestice je 400 m2;&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>b) maksimalni koeficijent izgraðenosti kig=0,3 za povr&scaron;ine graðevne èestice do 600 m2, a kig=0,25 za povr&scaron;inu graðevne èestice preko 600 m2;&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>c) maksimalni ukupni koeficijent iskori&scaron;tenosti kis=1,5, a nadzemni kis=0,9;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>d) maksimalni broj eta¾a 3 (P+2) sa maksimalnom visinom V=9 m;&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>e) minimalna udaljenost od susjedne meðe iznosi 3 m;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>f) minimalna udaljenost od nerazvrstanih i drugih javno prometnih povr&scaron;ina iznosi 3 m;&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>g) minimalna udaljenost od linije izvla&scaron;tenja dr¾avne ceste iznosi 10 m;&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>h) sve graðevine se mogu graditi s podrumom, suterenom i potkrovljem, a unutar zadane visine;&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>i) za novu izgradnju potrebno je osigurati najmanje 30% povr&scaron;ine graðevne èestice za ureðene zelene (vodopropusne) povr&scaron;ine obrasle vegetacijom.</p>', '<p>We are pleased to offer this rare opportunity to buy a substantial building/development plot on the mainland near Rogoznica, surface of 11.000m2, suitable for building luxury villas.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The plot is situated on a gentle slope - ideal for ensuring each unit of building has long uninterrupted sea views, and with dimensions 120x90m.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The land has views of the sea and Rogoznica, all the infrastructure already present, and an asphalt access road.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is located in the third row from the sea a distance of about 80 meters.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The village is becoming more popular, is within easy reach of the airport, and is blessed with many services such as shops, bakery, bars, coffee shops, restaurants and cafes.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact our agents in Split for more information and to arrange to visit the location.</p>', '', '1299_Land-plot_0.jpg', '1299_Land-plot_1.jpg', '1299_Land-plot_2.jpg', '1299_Land-plot_3.jpg', '1299_Land-plot_4.jpg', '1299_Land-plot_5.jpg', '1299_Land-plot_6.jpg', '1299_Land-plot_7.jpg', '1299_Land-plot_8.jpg'),
(1300, '', 'Rakiæ', '', '', '', 'Sibenik', 'Brodarica', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '10', '1076', '320', 1, '570000', '', 2, 2, 2, 1, 1, 2, 0, 0, 'August 11, 2015', '<p>Kuæa prvi red do mora, na zemlji&scaron;tu s velikim potencijalom, u okolici &Scaron;ibenika.&nbsp;Kuæa se nalazi na vrhunskoj mikrolokaciji, polo¾aj i velièina zemlji&scaron;ta idealni su za izgradnju jedne veæe ili dvije manje vile s bazenom.&nbsp;Udaljena je 10 m od mora.&nbsp;Stambena povr&scaron;ina objekta iznosi 320 m2, dok je povr&scaron;ina zemlji&scaron;ta 1076 m2.<br /><br /></p>', '<p>We are offering this house, by the sea, on a spacious land plot with great potential, near &nbsp;Sibenik. House size is 320 m2, while the land 1076 m2. The house is situated on a superb micro-location, just 10 yards from the sea, in a quiet area of the village with no through traffic.</p>', '', '<p>Kuæa prvi red do mora, na zemlji&scaron;tu s velikim potencijalom, u okolici &Scaron;ibenika.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa se nalazi na vrhunskoj mikrolokaciji, polo¾aj i velièina zemlji&scaron;ta idealni su za izgradnju jedne veæe ili dvije manje vile s bazenom.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Udaljena je 10 m od mora.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Izrazita vrijednost ove nekretnine je zemlji&scaron;te s velikim potencijalom na kojem se nalazi objekt kojem je potrebna adaptacija/ru&scaron;enje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Stambena povr&scaron;ina objekta iznosi 320 m2, dok je povr&scaron;ina zemlji&scaron;ta 1076 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Orijentacija jugozapad.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za sve dodatne informacije molimo kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured.</p>', '<p>We are offering this house, by the sea, on a spacious land plot with great potential, near Sibenik.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Really this is a building project opportunity as the land plot is unusually large, and to use the potential of this site a larger villa or two smaller properties could comfortably fit onto it.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>However, the potential is always ''locked'' into the plot so the property can be kept and lived in.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>House size is 320 m2, while the land 1076 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house is situated on a superb micro-location, just 10 yards from the sea, in a quiet area of the village with no through traffic.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The orientation of the property is towards South-west.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please call our office for more information from our agents, and to arrangeto visit the area.</p>', '', '1300_House-Villa_0.JPG', '1300_House-Villa_1.JPG', '1300_House-Villa_2.JPG', '1300_House-Villa_3.JPG', '', '', '', '', ''),
(1301, '', 'Rakiæ', '', '', '', 'Sibenik', 'Vodice', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '10', '200', '0', 1, '520000', '', 2, 1, 2, 1, 1, 2, 2, 2, 'August 12, 2015', '<p>Prekrasna kuæa u prvom redu u blizini &Scaron;ibenika. Kuæa je vertikalno eta¾irana na dva dijela. Predmet prodaje je zapadna eta¾a, a sastoji se od èetiri kata.&nbsp;Nekretnina ima lijepo ureðenu okuænicu od cca 200 m&sup2;.&nbsp;Sama okuænica sastoji se od vrta, ro&scaron;tilja, vanjskog tu&scaron;a i parkinga. Kuæa je sagraðena 2012. godine od biranih materijala i obloga. Na sve tri eta¾e terase su orijentirane prema jugu i moru te su dovoljno prostrane za postavljanje le¾aljki kao i veæih sjedeæih garnitura.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>We are offering this recently completed building (semi-detached house) in the first row to the sea. The property is situated next to a pebble beach in a beautiful small village in northern Dalmatia. The house is semi-detached and for sale is the west side of the building. It consists of four floors. The property has a nice courtyard of approximately 200 m&sup2;. The plot consists of a low maintenance garden, barbecue, outdoor showers and private parking.</p>', '', '<p>Prekrasna kuæa u prvom redu u blizini &Scaron;ibenika.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je vertikalno eta¾irana na dva dijela.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Predmet prodaje je zapadna eta¾a, a sastoji se od èetiri kata.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Prvi je podrum u kojem se nalazi vinoteka, kotlovnica te ostava.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U prizemlju se nalazi wc, kuhinja sa prostranim dnevnim boravkom i ljetnom terasom.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na katu je jedna velika spavaæa soba sa kupaonicom i terasom dok se u visokom potkrovlju nalazi studio apartman takoðer sa velikom terasom.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Donji dio kuæe i kompletno dvori&scaron;te oblo¾eno je klesanim kamenom.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nekretnina ima lijepo ureðenu okuænicu od cca 200 m&sup2;.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sama okuænica sastoji se od vrta, ro&scaron;tilja, vanjskog tu&scaron;a i parkinga.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je sagraðena 2012. godine od biranih materijala i obloga.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na sve tri eta¾e terase su orijentirane prema jugu i moru te su dovoljno prostrane za postavljanje le¾aljki kao i veæih sjedeæih garnitura.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je multifunkcionalna sa velikim prostorijama i moderno opremljena.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ugraðeno je centralno-podno grijanje i klimatizacija.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Tijekom cijele godine ovo mjesto nudi ugodan boravak obogaæen svim potrebnim sadr¾ajima (duæani, marina, ambulanta, ljekarne, &scaron;kola, vrtiæi...).</p>', '<p>We are offering this recently completed building (semi-detached house) in the first row to the sea.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property is situated next to a pebble beach in a beautiful small village in northern Dalmatia.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house is semi-detached and for sale is the west side of the building.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It consists of four floors.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Basement is a wine cellar, a boiler room and a storage room.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The ground floor has a bathroom, kitchen, spacious living room and a large summer terrace for enjoying the long summer.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Upstairs is a large bedroom with a bathroom and windows leading out onto the large balcony.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The top floor is a studio apartment that also has a large balcony.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The design of the property was done to ensure there was plenty of light, and to make maximum use of the fabulous views, with large rooms, and large windows and terraces looking out to sea.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The lower part of the house and garden is completely covered with a carved stone.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property has a nice courtyard of approximately 200 m&sup2;.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The plot consists of a low maintenance garden, barbecue, outdoor showers and private parking.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house was built in 2012 years and materials were carefully chosen to ensure this was a superior project.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On all three floors, the terraces and balconies are oriented to the south and the sea, and are large enough to set up deck chairs and large sofas.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property has underfloor central heating and air conditioning.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The local village has plenty of services and facilities such as Marina, restaurants, shops, bars and pharmacy, schools etc., as well as being only a few minutes driving from quiet undisturbed countryside.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact our agents in Split for more information and to arrange to visit this property.</p>', '', '1301_House-Villa_0.JPG', '1301_House-Villa_1.JPG', '1301_House-Villa_2.JPG', '1301_House-Villa_3.JPG', '1301_House-Villa_4.jpg', '1301_House-Villa_5.jpg', '1301_House-Villa_6.JPG', '1301_House-Villa_7.JPG', '1301_House-Villa_8.JPG'),
(1326, '', 'Rakiæ', '', '', '', 'Zadar', 'Ko¾ino, Zadar', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '100', '0', '0', 1, '217000', '', 2, 1, 2, 2, 1, 1, 3, 2, 'August 21, 2015', '<p>Dvoeta¾ni stanovi na prodaju, samo 100 m od mora.&nbsp;Samostojeæa graðevina sa tri dvoeta¾na stana/kuæe u nizu.&nbsp;U prizemlju se nalaze dnevni boravak, blagovaonica, kuhinja, kupaonica, spremi&scaron;te i prostrana terasa sa stepenicama koje se spu&scaron;taju u vrt.&nbsp;Na katu su smje&scaron;tene tri spavaæe sobe, kupaonica i logga.&nbsp;Slobodni stanovi:&nbsp;Stan S2, &euro;217.000,&nbsp;98.68m2 i&nbsp;Stan S3, &euro;244.000, 108.51m2.</p>', '<p>We are pleased to offer these modern, high quality Duplex apartments only 100 m from the sea. They are part of a detached building with three separate apartments in a row, and facing out to sea. The ground floor has a large open plan living room, dining room, kitchen, bathroom, storage room and a spacious terrace with stairs that lead down to the garden.&nbsp;Available apartments:&nbsp;Apartment S2, &euro;217,000, 98.68m2 and&nbsp;Apartment S3, &euro;244,000, 108.5m2.</p>', '', '<p>Dvoeta¾ni stanovi na prodaju, samo 100 m od mora.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Samostojeæa graðevina sa tri dvoeta¾na stana/kuæe u nizu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U prizemlju se nalaze dnevni boravak, blagovaonica, kuhinja, kupaonica, spremi&scaron;te i prostrana terasa sa stepenicama koje se spu&scaron;taju u vrt.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na katu su smje&scaron;tene tri spavaæe sobe, kupaonica i logga.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Slobodni stanovi:</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Stan S2, &euro;217.000,&nbsp;</strong><strong>98.68 m2, prizemlje + 1. kat</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sastoji se od dnevno boravka + 3 spavaæe sobe, orijentacija istok-zapad, prizemlje (eta¾a 1) 42.02 m2 + kat (eta¾a 2) 41.73 m2, ukupno 83.75 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Parking 6.58 m2, vrt 8.35 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Stan S3, &euro;244.000, 108.51 m2, prizemlje + 1. kat</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sastoji se od dnevno boravka + 3 spavaæe sobe, orijentacija istok-zapad, prizemlje (eta¾a 1) 42.02 m2, kat (eta¾a 2) 41.75 m2, ukupno 83.75 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Parking 6.26 m2, vrt 18.50 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Molimo za sve dodatne informacije kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured u Splitu.</p>', '<p>Price 217k - 244k euro</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>We are pleased to offer these modern, high quality Duplex apartments only 100 m from the sea.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>They are part of a detached building with three separate apartments in a row, and facing out to sea.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>They are conveniently close to the nearest coffee bar and shops.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The ground floor has a large open plan living room, dining room, kitchen, bathroom, storage room and a spacious terrace with stairs that lead down to the garden.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>All the fixtures and materials used in the project were of high quality, creating a modern, practical and well presented property.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Upstairs are three bedrooms, bathroom and Loggia.Each has private secure parking.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Available apartments:</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Apartment S2, &euro;217,000, 98.68 m2, ground floor + 1st floor</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Details: ground floor + 1st floor, 3 bedrooms, orientation east-west, ground&nbsp;floor (level 1) 42.02 m2, 1st floor (level 2) 41.73 m2 = a total of 83.75 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Parking 6.58 m2, garden 8.35 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Apartment S3, &euro;244,000, 108.5 m2, ground floor + 1st floor</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Details: ground floor + 1st floor, 3 bedrooms, orientation east-west, ground&nbsp;floor (level 1) 42.02 m2, 1st floor (level 2) 41.75 m2 = a total of 83.75 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Parking 6.26 m2, 18.50 m2 garden.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please for further information contact our office in Split and our agents will arrange for you to visit the property.</p>', '', '1326_Apartment_0.jpg', '1326_Apartment_1.jpg', '1326_Apartment_2.jpg', '1326_Apartment_3.jpg', '1326_Apartment_4.jpg', '1326_Apartment_5.jpg', '1326_Apartment_6.jpg', '1326_Apartment_7.jpg', '1326_Apartment_8.jpg'),
(1302, '', 'Rakiæ', '', '', '', 'Sibenik', '®aboriæ, Jasenovo', 'For sale', 'Land plot', '10', '1260', '0', 1, '420000', '', 2, 2, 2, 1, 1, 2, 0, 0, 'August 12, 2015', '<p>Prodaje se atraktivno zemlji&scaron;te za gradnju vile prvi red do mora. Ispred zemlji&scaron;ta je &scaron;ljunèana pla¾a. Mirno okru¾enje. Sa zemlji&scaron;ta se pru¾a predivan pogled na zalazak sunca. Mo¾e se sagraditi obiteljska kuæa tlocrtne povr&scaron;ine cca 150 m2, podrum, prizemlje i 2 kata, max visine V=9,5 m, maksimalno 4 stambene jedinice. Povr&scaron;ina zemlji&scaron;ta iznosi 1260 m2.</p>', '<p>We are pleased to have this attractive building land plot by the sea of 1260 m2 area.&nbsp;The front half of the land is located in the tourist zone, and no building scan be erected on this part, but it can be part of a landscaped plot with a swimming pool or other such facilities. On the other half it is possible to build a residential building, family house/villa with a layout area of approximately 150 m2, or apartments.</p>', '', '<p>Prodaje se atraktivno zemlji&scaron;te za gradnju vile prvi red do mora.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ispred zemlji&scaron;ta je &scaron;ljunèana pla¾a.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Mirno okru¾enje.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sa zemlji&scaron;ta se pru¾a predivan pogled na zalazak sunca.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Prednja polovina zemlji&scaron;ta nalazi se u turistièkoj zoni i na tom dijelu gradnja nije moguæa osim bazena i sl.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na stra¾njem dijelu terena gledano od mora moguæa je gradnja stambene graðevine i to prema parametrima vezanim za povr&scaron;inu dijela zemlji&scaron;ta koje se nalazi u stambenoj zoni.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Mo¾e se sagraditi obiteljska kuæa tlocrtne povr&scaron;ine cca 150 m2, podrum, prizemlje i 2 kata, max visine V=9,5 m, maksimalno 4 stambene jedinice.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Povr&scaron;ina zemlji&scaron;ta iznosi 1260 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Orijentacija sjeverozapad.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Vlasni&scaron;tvo uredno.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Prisutna infrastruktura.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Zemlji&scaron;te ima pristup vozilom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Molimo za sve dodatne informacije kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured u Splitu.</p>', '<p>We are pleased to have this attractive building land plot by the sea of 1260 m2 area.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The land is wonderfully situated on the mainland between the clean pebble beach and among low density private houses along the shore.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The area is very peaceful, with no through traffic, a traditional fishing harbour with just a handful of boats and plenty of safe areas close along the shore for swimming and enjoying the water.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The plot faces out to sea on a northwest orientation where there are memorable views.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The front half of the land is located in the tourist zone, and no building scan be erected on this part, but it can be part of a landscaped plot with a swimming pool or other such facilities.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the other half it is possible to build a residential building, family house/villa with a layout area of approximately 150 m2, or apartments.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It can have basement, ground floor and two floors, maximum&nbsp;height H = 9.5 m, a maximum of 4 units.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The infrastructure - electric, water etc is present, as well as an access road.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please for further information and to visit the plot, please contact our office in Split.</p>', '', '1302_Land-plot_0.jpg', '1302_Land-plot_1.jpg', '1302_Land-plot_2.jpg', '1302_Land-plot_3.jpg', '1302_Land-plot_4.jpg', '1302_Land-plot_5.jpg', '1302_Land-plot_6.jpg', '1302_Land-plot_7.jpg', ''),
(1304, '', 'Rakiæ', '', '', '', 'Zadar', 'Biograd centar', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '0', '100', '200', 1, '220000', '', 2, 1, 2, 2, 2, 2, 3, 3, 'August 13, 2015', '<p>Vi&scaron;eeta¾ni stan na odliènoj lokaciji, u blizini Zadra (predmet ponude je tamni dio objekta).&nbsp;Gornje dvije eta¾e su jedinstveni stambeni prostor ukupne povr&scaron;ine 200 m2.&nbsp;Zgrada je izgraðena 2014. godine.&nbsp;Objekt se sastoji od podruma, prvog i drugog kata.&nbsp;Vrt ima 100 m2. Va¾no je &scaron;to svaka eta¾a ima i poseban ulaz iz stubi&scaron;ta te mogu funkcionirati kao zasebne dvije stambene jedinice.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>We are pleased to offer this incomplete apartment at a reduced price, in a modern building in a small village near Zadar. The main building was completed in 2014. In the attached photographs, it is the darker property. The property for sale consists of a basement, first and second floors. The upper two floors are unique, with a total living area of 200 m2. The garden is 100 m2.&nbsp;</p>', '', '<p>Vi&scaron;eeta¾ni stan na odliènoj lokaciji, u blizini Zadra (predmet ponude je tamni dio objekta).&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Gornje dvije eta¾e su jedinstveni stambeni prostor ukupne povr&scaron;ine 200 m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Zgrada je izgraðena 2014. godine.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Objekt se sastoji od podruma, prvog i drugog kata.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Gore su tri spavaæe sobe, kupaonica i WC te terasa.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Dolje je smje&scaron;tena kuhinja, blagovaonica, kupaonica s WC-om i ostava s velikom terasom te izlazom na vrt.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Vrt ima 100 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Va¾no je &scaron;to svaka eta¾a ima i poseban ulaz iz stubi&scaron;ta te mogu funkcionirati kao zasebne dvije stambene jedinice.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U suterenskom dijelu je prostorija po èitavoj tlocrtnoj povr&scaron;ini te mo¾e takoðer biti u stambenoj funkciji ili kao konoba, fitnes, itd.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Objekt ima dva parkirna mjesta.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Jugoistoèno orijentiran.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Struja i voda prisutni.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za sve dodatne informacije molimo kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured u Splitu.</p>', '<p>We are pleased to offer this incomplete apartment at a reduced price, in a modern building in a small village near Zadar.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The main building was completed in 2014.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>In the attached photographs, it is the darker property.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property for sale consists of a basement, first and second floors.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The upper two floors are unique, with a total living area of 200 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The top floor has three bedrooms, bathroom and toilet and sliding windows leading out onto a large balcony.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The first floor has a kitchen, dining room, all open plan, and a&nbsp;toilet and storage room with a large terrace and access to the garden.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There is a large basement in the premises, the area of the footprint, which could become another apartment, function room, fitness centre or whatever.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Each floor has a separate entrance from the staircase, making it possible to create two or three independent apartments.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The garden is 100 m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The facility has two private parking spaces.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The building is Southeast oriented.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Electricity and water are present and connected.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For further information and to arrange to visit the property, please contact our office in Split.</p>', '', '1304_Apartment_0.jpg', '1304_Apartment_1.jpg', '1304_Apartment_2.jpg', '1304_Apartment_3.jpg', '1304_Apartment_4.jpg', '1304_Apartment_5.jpg', '1304_Apartment_6.jpg', '1304_Apartment_7.jpg', '1304_Apartment_8.jpg');
INSERT INTO `nekretnina` (`id`, `ime`, `prezime`, `telefon`, `mobitel`, `e_mail`, `lokacija_id`, `adresa`, `status_id`, `vrsta_id`, `udaljenost`, `povrsina`, `stambenapovrsina`, `display`, `cijena`, `cijenatocka`, `ponuda_tjedna`, `new_built`, `must_sell`, `prvi_red_do_mora`, `pogled_na_more`, `bazen`, `broj_soba`, `broj_kupatila`, `datum`, `title_hr`, `title_en`, `title_ge`, `opis_hr`, `opis_en`, `opis_ge`, `PropertyImageURL0`, `PropertyImageURL1`, `PropertyImageURL2`, `PropertyImageURL3`, `PropertyImageURL4`, `PropertyImageURL5`, `PropertyImageURL6`, `PropertyImageURL7`, `PropertyImageURL8`) VALUES
(1306, 'Mirko', 'Vidoviæ', '', '098 188 5321', 'ja.vidovic@yahoo.com', 'Zadar', 'Tkon, otok Pa¹man', 'For sale', 'Old stone house', '500', '12500', '73', 1, '150000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 1, 1, 'August 13, 2015', '<p>Na otoku Pa&scaron;manu prodjemo ovu jedinstvenu nekretninu koja se sastoji od ca. 12.500 m2 poljoprivrednog zemlji&scaron;ta na kojem se nalaze dva uplanjena i legalna objekta &ndash; kuæa povr&scaron;ine 56 m2 sa pomoænim objektom povr&scaron;ine 17 m2.&nbsp;Renovacija kuæe je zapoèeta i dobrim dijelom dovr&scaron;ena, osim unutra&scaron;njosti.&nbsp;U idejnom rje&scaron;enju nad dnevnim boravkom je zami&scaron;ljena galerija, a du¾inom objekta sa vanjske strane terasa, ispod koje je gustirna.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>We are proud to present this unique property for sale on Pasman island, consisting of approx. 12.500 sqm of agricultural land with two buildings on it &ndash; a house sized 56 sqm with additional facility sized 17 sqm. Renovation has already started and is greatly finished, except for the interior. Conceptual design predicts a gallery above the living room, as well as outdoor terrace along the entire length of the house, under which the water tank is located.</p>', '', '<p>Na otoku Pa&scaron;manu prodjemo ovu jedinstvenu nekretninu koja se sastoji od ca. 12.500 m2 poljoprivrednog zemlji&scaron;ta na kojem se nalaze dva uplanjena i legalna objekta &ndash; kuæa povr&scaron;ine 56 m2 sa pomoænim objektom povr&scaron;ine 17 m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Renovacija kuæe je zapoèeta i dobrim dijelom dovr&scaron;ena, osim unutra&scaron;njosti.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ima jednu spavaæu sobu, kupaonicu, hodnik te dnevni boravak.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U idejnom rje&scaron;enju nad dnevnim boravkom je zami&scaron;ljena galerija, a du¾inom objekta sa vanjske strane terasa, ispod koje je gustirna.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Iz kuæe i sa parcele pru¾a se lijepi otvoreni pogled na more.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za sve dodatne informacije molimo kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured u Splitu.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>We are proud to present this unique property for sale on Pasman island, consisting of approx. 12.500 sqm of agricultural land with two buildings on it &ndash; a house sized 56 sqm with additional facility sized 17 sqm. &nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Renovation has already started and is greatly finished, except for the interior.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house has 1 bedroom, 1 bathroom, hallway and living room.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Conceptual design predicts a gallery above the living room, as well as outdoor terrace along the entire length of the house, under which the water tank is located.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property features superb open sea views.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please note that foreign citizens may acquire agricultural land in Croatia only by incorporating private limited company. &nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For the further information please contact our office in Split.</p>', '', '1306_Old-stone-house_0.jpg', '1306_Old-stone-house_1.jpg', '1306_Old-stone-house_2.jpg', '1306_Old-stone-house_3.JPG', '1306_Old-stone-house_4.JPG', '1306_Old-stone-house_5.JPG', '1306_Old-stone-house_6.jpg', '1306_Old-stone-house_7.jpg', '1306_Old-stone-house_8.jpg'),
(1307, '', 'Boris', '', '', '', 'Brac', 'Postire', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '150', '550', '57', 2, '160000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 1, 1, 'August 14, 2015', '<p>Samostojeæa kuæa, s pogledom na more na otoku Braèu.&nbsp;Nalazi se na odliènoj lokaciji, samo 150 m od mora.&nbsp;Ukupan stambena povr&scaron;ina kuæe iznosi 57 m2 (nisko prizemlje 20 m2, te visoko prizemlje 37 m2).&nbsp;Povr&scaron;ina zemlji&scaron;ta iznosi 550 m2.&nbsp;Postoji moguænost ureðenja lijepe okuænice s bazenom.&nbsp;Kuæa je u blizini mora i centra mjesta, smje&scaron;tena u mirnom okru¾enju, 20 m od pristupne ulice.</p>', '<p>We are pleased to offer this small detached house, overlooking the sea in one of the most beautiful villages on the island.&nbsp;It is situated 150m from the sea, elevated on the sloping shore to give partial sea views, in a prime location in the village. The total living area is 57 m2: lower ground floor of 20 sqm and higher ground floor of 37 sqm.&nbsp;It is designed with an open plan living room with large windows leading onto the terrace and garden.&nbsp;The plot size is 550 m2.&nbsp;</p>', '', '<p>Samostojeæa kuæa, s pogledom na more na otoku Braèu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nalazi se na odliènoj lokaciji, samo 150 m od mora.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ukupan stambena povr&scaron;ina kuæe iznosi 57 m2 (nisko prizemlje 20 m2, te visoko prizemlje &nbsp;37 m2).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Povr&scaron;ina zemlji&scaron;ta iznosi 550 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Postoji moguænost ureðenja lijepe okuænice s bazenom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je u blizini mora i centra mjesta, smje&scaron;tena u mirnom okru¾enju, 20 m od pristupne ulice.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Od centra mjesta je udaljena 400 m.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za sve dodatne informacije molimo kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured.</p>', '<p>We are pleased to offer this small detached house, overlooking the sea in one of the most beautiful villages on the island.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is situated 150m from the sea, elevated on the sloping shore to give partial sea views, in a prime location in the village.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The total living area is 57 m2: lower ground floor of 20 sqm and higher ground floor of 37 sqm.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is designed with an open plan living room with large windows leading onto the terrace and garden.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The plot size is 550 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The inside of the property has been well maintained and well decorated.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is only a few minutes'' walk from the center of the village, where there is a market, shops, bakery, cafes and bars, peace and quiet, and the immaculate village football pitch - used by the national squad before major matches.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There is no private parking, as the immediate streets are pedestrian only.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Parking is 50m from the property.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact our office to arrange to visit this property.</p>', '', '1307_House-Villa_0.jpg', '1307_House-Villa_1.jpg', '1307_House-Villa_2.jpg', '1307_House-Villa_3.jpg', '1307_House-Villa_4.jpg', '1307_House-Villa_5.jpg', '1307_House-Villa_6.jpg', '1307_House-Villa_7.jpg', '1307_House-Villa_8.jpg'),
(1308, '', 'Boris', '', '', '', 'Brac', 'Postire', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '300', '65', '75', 1, '105000', '', 2, 1, 2, 2, 1, 2, 3, 2, 'August 14, 2015', '<p>Apartman na Braèu, udaljen od mora samo 300 m.&nbsp;Nalazi se u prizemlju. Ima dvije (moguæe 3 spavaæe sobe), te 2 kupaonice.&nbsp;Stambena povr&scaron;ina 75 m2.&nbsp;Ima veliku okuænicu (65 m2) sa dvije strane i na dvije razine.&nbsp;Orijentiran sjeverno. Ugraðeni standardno kvalitetni materijali.</p>', '<p>We are offering this newly completed two bedroom apartment in one of the most beautiful villages on the island of Brac. It is on the north coast, facing the mainland, 150m from the shore, where there is clean and clear water, safe for children to swim and popular with residents and tourists in the summer. The apartment is located on the ground floor and designed with two large bedrooms and two bathrooms. Living area of 75 m2. It has a large garden (65 m2) with two sides and on two levels.</p>', '', '<p>Apartman na Braèu, udaljen od mora samo 300 m.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nalazi se u prizemlju.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ima dvije (moguæe 3 spavaæe sobe), te 2 kupaonice.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Stambena povr&scaron;ina 75 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ima veliku okuænicu (65 m2) sa dvije strane i na dvije razine.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Orijentiran sjeverno.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ugraðeni standardno kvalitetni materijali.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Zgrada je izgraðena 2014. godine.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nov, neuseljen i nenamje&scaron;ten.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Smje&scaron;ten je u mirnom okru¾enju, ima odlièan pristup, te se nalazi u blizini centra i mora.</p>', '<p>We are offering this newly completed two bedroom apartment in one of the most beautiful villages on the island of Brac.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is on the north coast, facing the mainland, 150m from the shore, where there is clean and clear water, safe for children to swim and popular with residents and tourists in the summer.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The apartment is located on the ground floor and designed with two large bedrooms, (which could be altered easily to become three bedrooms) and two bathrooms.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Living area of 75 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It has a large garden (65 m2) with two sides and on two levels.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The building is on a North/south orientation.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It has been completed with high quality materials but still needs many of the fittings to be chose before the property is habitable.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The location of the property is convenient for the centre of the village with a range of shops, cafes, bakery and many other services.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The ferry link to Split is 15 minutes by car, with regular trips daily.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact our office for agents to arrange to a visit to the apartment.</p>', '', '1308_Apartment_0.jpg', '1308_Apartment_1.jpg', '1308_Apartment_2.jpg', '1308_Apartment_3.jpg', '1308_Apartment_4.jpg', '1308_Apartment_5.jpg', '1308_Apartment_6.jpg', '1308_Apartment_7.jpg', '1308_Apartment_8.jpg'),
(1309, '', 'Boris', '', '', '', 'Brac', 'Sutivan', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '200', '0', '48', 1, '125000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 2, 1, 'August 14, 2015', '<p>Apartman u prizemlju s dvije spavaæe sobe ukupne stambene povr&scaron;ine 48 m2.&nbsp;Udaljen je od mora samo 200 m.&nbsp;Ima veliku terasu-dvori&scaron;te.&nbsp;Sjeverno orijentiran.&nbsp;Mirno okru¾enje, odlièan pristup, blizu mora. Ugraðeni kvalitetni materijali.&nbsp;Namje&scaron;ten i klimatiziran.&nbsp;Ima parking. Od centra mjesta udaljen 500 m.</p>', '<p>We are offering this modern two bedroom apartment in one of the beautiful villages on Brac Island. It is on the ground floor, and only 200m from the shore. The building is high on the sloping side of the village, with great views across the sea to the mainland. The property is on a North/South orientation. The inside of the apartment is modern and practical, with spacious rooms and stylish and high quality fittings and furniture. The total floor area is 48m sq.&nbsp;</p>', '', '<p>Apartman u prizemlju s dvije spavaæe sobe ukupne stambene povr&scaron;ine 48 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Udaljen je od mora samo 200 m.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ima veliku terasu-dvori&scaron;te.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sjeverno orijentiran.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Mirno okru¾enje, odlièan pristup, blizu mora.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ugraðeni kvalitetni materijali.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Namje&scaron;ten i klimatiziran.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ima parking.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Od centra mjesta udaljen 500 m.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Molimo za dodatne informacije kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured.</p>', '<p>We are offering this modern two bedroom apartment in one of the beautiful villages on Brac Island.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is on the ground floor, and only 200m from the shore.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The building is high on the sloping side of the village, with great views across the sea to the mainland.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property is on a North/South orientation.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The Inside of the apartment is modern and practical, with spacious rooms and stylish and high quality fittings and furniture.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The total floor area is 48m sq.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property is being sold fully furnished, and air conditioned.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There is private parking adjacent to the building.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The village centre is 5 minutes'' walk where there are shops, bars, cafes and many other useful services.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ferry port 15 mins drive.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact our agents who can arrange to show the property to you.</p>', '', '1309_Apartment_0.jpg', '1309_Apartment_1.jpg', '1309_Apartment_2.jpg', '1309_Apartment_3.jpg', '1309_Apartment_4.jpg', '1309_Apartment_5.jpg', '1309_Apartment_6.jpg', '1309_Apartment_7.jpg', '1309_Apartment_8.jpg'),
(1310, '', 'Rakiæ', '', '', '', 'Murter', 'Tisno', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '5', '36', '53', 2, '79000', '', 2, 2, 2, 1, 1, 2, 1, 1, 'August 14, 2015', '<p>Tisno, prekrasno ureðen apartman u prvom redu do mora. Kuæa se nalazi na izvrsnoj lokaciji. Apartman je smje&scaron;ten u potkrovlju, a pripada mu i dvori&scaron;te povr&scaron;ine 36 m2. Stambena povr&scaron;ina samog apartmana iznosi 52,33 m2. Orijentacija sjeverozapad. S obzirom da se kuæa nalazi u malom turistièkom mjestu svi sadr¾aji su u blizini.</p>', '<p>We are very pleased to offer this charming one bedroom apartment next to the sea on Murter Island. It is located in the attic. Apartment has a garden area of 36 m2. Living area is 52.33 m2. It is conveniently situated in the small village and close to the sea, cafes, shops, bars and the centre of village life. The garden consists of native plants and shrubs and needs little maintenance to keep it looking so attractive. Orientation north-west.</p>', '', '<p>Tisno, prekrasno ureðen apartman u prvom redu do mora.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa se nalazi na izvrsnoj lokaciji.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartman se nalazi u potkrovlju zgrade, a sastoji se od &nbsp;od jedne spavaæe sobe, dnevnog boravka, kuhinje i &nbsp;blagavaonice u jednoj cjelini, kupaonice i terase.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartmanu pripada i dvori&scaron;te povr&scaron;ine 36 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Stambena povr&scaron;ina iznosi 52,33 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Orijentacija sjeverozapad.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Dokumentacija uredna.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Cijena: &euro;79.000</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Meðunarodni aerodrom u Splitu je udaljen 120 km.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>S obzirom da se kuæa nalazi u malom turistièkom dalmatinskom mjestu svi sadr¾aji poput trgovina, restorana i kafiæa su u neposrednoj blizini.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Molimo za sve dodatne informacije kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured u Splitu.</p>', '<p>We are very pleased to offer this charming one bedroom apartment next to the sea on Murter Island.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is located in the attic and consists of one bedroom, an open-plan living room, kitchen and dining area, a bathroom and a terrace.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartment has a garden area of 36 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Living area is 52.33 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property is full of character and has been well looked after and loved by the current owners, who are disappointed to have to let it go.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is conveniently situated in the small village and close to the sea, cafes, shops, bars and the centre of village life.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The garden consists of native plants and shrubs and needs little maintenance to keep it looking so attractive.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Orientation north-west.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The papers have been made ready for a quick sale.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact our office to arrange to visit this property.</p>', '', '1310_Apartment_0.JPG', '1310_Apartment_1.JPG', '1310_Apartment_2.JPG', '1310_Apartment_3.JPG', '1310_Apartment_4.JPG', '1310_Apartment_5.JPG', '1310_Apartment_6.JPG', '1310_Apartment_7.JPG', '1310_Apartment_8.JPG'),
(1311, '', 'Rakiæ', '', '', '', 'Murter', 'Slanica Murter', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '350', '0', '72', 1, '150000', '', 2, 1, 2, 2, 1, 2, 2, 1, 'August 14, 2015', '<p>Murter, novoizgraðeni apartmani s pogledom na more. Apartmani imaju stambenu povr&scaron;inu 72.21 m2. Nalaze se na prvom i drugom katu zgrade, na mirnoj lokaciji, blizu pla¾e.&nbsp;Izmeðu zgrade i mora nalazi se zemlji&scaron;te koje spada u rekreacijsku zonu. Kuæa je udaljena od mora 350 m, a od samog centra mjesta 800 m. Zgrada je izgraðena 2013. godine. Ima parking. Voda i struja prikljuèeni.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><br /><br /></p>', '<p>We are pleased to have these new apartments, still requiring internal fittings, for sale at a reduced price. They were built in 2013 and represent a great investment. There are two separate apartments, well built and designed with sea views from the wide windows and spacious balconies. Each apartment has living area of 72.21 m2. Apartments are situated on the 1st and 2nd floors. The land between the building and the sea is land that belongs to the recreation area, and as it is not in a designated building zone, so no further buildings can be built on this line.</p>', '', '<p>Murter, novoizgraðeni apartmani s pogledom na more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong><span style="text-decoration: underline;">APARTMAN 1: &euro;150.000, 1.kat, 72.21 m2&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Dvosoban apartman nalazi se na prvom katu stambene zgrade, u mirnom okru¾enju.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sam apartman se sastoji od dvije spavaæe sobe, kupaonice, kuhinje, dnevnog boravka sa kuhinjom i blagovaonicom u jednoj cjelini te natkrivene terase.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong><span style="text-decoration: underline;"><br /></span></strong></p>\r\n<p><strong><span style="text-decoration: underline;">APARTMAN 2: &euro;155.000, 2. kat, 72.21 m2</span></strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Dvosoban apartman nalazi se na drugom katu stambene zgrade.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartman se sastoji od dvije spavaæe sobe, kupaonice, kuhinje, dnevnog boravka sa kuhinjom i blagovaonicom u jednoj cjelini, te natkrivene terase.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartmani se nalaze na mirnoj lokaciji, blizu pla¾e.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Izmeðu zgrade i mora nalazi zemlji&scaron;te koje spada u rekreacijsku zonu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je udaljena od mora 350 m, a od samog centra mjesta 800 m.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Zgrada je izgraðena 2013. godine.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ima parking.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Voda i struja prikljuèeni.&nbsp;</p>', '<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;">Price 150 - 155k euro</span></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>We are pleased to have these new apartments, still requiring internal fittings, for sale at a reduced price.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>They were built in 2013 and represent a great investment.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There are two separate apartments, well built and designed with sea views from the wide windows and spacious balconies.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong><span style="text-decoration: underline;">APARTMENT 1: &euro; 150.000, 1st floor, 72.21 m2&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Two bedroom apartment is on the first floor.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The apartment consists of two bedrooms, bathroom, kitchen, living room, kitchen and dining room in one area and a covered terrace.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong><span style="text-decoration: underline;">APARTMENT 2: &euro; 155.000, 2nd floor, 72.21 m2&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Two bedroom apartment is on the second floor.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The apartment has two bedrooms, bathroom, kitchen, living room, kitchen and dining room in one area, and a covered terrace.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The apartments are located in a quiet location, with no through traffic nearby, but close to the pebble beach at the nearest point of the shore.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The land between the building and the sea is land that belongs to the recreation area, and as it is not in a designated building zone, so no further buildings can be built on this line.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house is 350 m from the shore, and 800m from the village centre of this very popular village on Murter Island.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There is private parking attached with each apartment.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Water and electricity connected.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please call our office to arrange to visit this property.</p>', '', '1311_Apartment_0.JPG', '1311_Apartment_1.JPG', '1311_Apartment_2.JPG', '1311_Apartment_3.JPG', '1311_Apartment_4.JPG', '1311_Apartment_5.JPG', '1311_Apartment_6.JPG', '1311_Apartment_7.JPG', '1311_Apartment_8.JPG'),
(1312, 'Pero ', 'Planiniæ', '', '+387 63 320251', 'ivan.planinic92@hotmail.com ', 'Dubrovnik', 'Koloèep, k.è. 517/3 k.o. koloèep', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '30', '428', '83', 2, '210000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 2, 1, 'August 17, 2015', '<p>Ponosno Vam predstavljamo ovu izvrsnu nekretninu za odmor na otoku pokraj Dubrovnika, najju¾nije naseljenom hrvatskom otoku na kojem nema prometa automobilima &ndash; &scaron;armantnoj oazi mira udaljenoj svega 30 minuta vo¾nje brodom od gradske vreve Dubrovnika.&nbsp;Ova udobna samostojeæa kuæa ima stambenu povr&scaron;inu 83 m2, dok je zemlji&scaron;te velièine 428 m2.&nbsp;Smje&scaron;tena je svega 30 m od mora te oko 300 metara od centa sela i pristani&scaron;ta za brod.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>We are proudly presenting this lovely holiday home on an island near Dubrovnik. It''s the south-most populated Croatian island, a car -free zone and a charming and tranquille oasis located a mere 30 min boat ride from the hustle and bustle of Dubrovnik city.&nbsp;This comfortable air-conditioned detached house has living area of &nbsp;83 m2, while the land plot measures 428 m2.&nbsp;Stone''s throw to the sea and only 300 meters to the center of the village and the port.&nbsp;</p>', '', '<p>Samostojeæa kuæa za odmor nedaleko od Dubrovnika</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ponosno Vam predstavljamo ovu izvrsnu nekretninu za odmor na otoku pokraj Dubrovnika, najju¾nije naseljenom hrvatskom otoku na kojem nema prometa automobilima &ndash; &scaron;armantnoj oazi mira udaljenoj svega 30 minuta vo¾nje brodom od gradske vreve Dubrovnika.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ova udobna samostojeæa kuæa ima stambenu povr&scaron;inu 83 m2, dok je zemlji&scaron;te velièine 428 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sastoji se od dvevnog boravka, potpuno opremljene kuhinje i kupaonice, dvije spavaæe sobe, vanjskog ro&scaron;tilja u sklopu bojnog i dobro odr¾avanog vrta, podruma te biv&scaron;e gustirne.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Fasada je napravljena od braèkog kamena.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæi je potrebno manje osvje¾enje iznutra, no konstrukciji je odlièna i vrlo dobro odr¾avana.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Smje&scaron;tena je svega 30 metara od mora te oko 300 metara od centra sela i pristani&scaron;ta za brod.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ovo je izvrsna prilika za kupnju za sve ljubitelje dubrovaèkih otoka. &nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za sve dodatne informacije molimo kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured u Splitu.</p>', '<p>Detached holiday home near Dubrovnik - Priced to sell</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>We are proudly presenting this lovely holiday home on an island near Dubrovnik.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It''s the south-most populated Croatian island, a car-free zone and a charming and tranquille oasis located a mere 30 min boat ride from the hustle and bustle of Dubrovnik city.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>This comfortable air-conditioned detached house has living area of &nbsp;83 m2, while the land plot measures 428 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It contains living room, fully fitted kitchen and bathroom, two bedrooms, outdoor BBQ area in well-kept lush garden, a basement and former water tank.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Facade is made of famous Brac stone.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house may need minor refurbishment within, but the construction is sound and the property is overall well maintained.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Stone''s throw to the sea and only 300 meters to the center of the village and the port.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For the buyers keen on Dubrovnik islands this is an oportunitiy not to be missed!</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For the further information please contact our office in Split.&nbsp;</p>', '', '1312_House-Villa_0.jpg', '1312_House-Villa_1.jpg', '1312_House-Villa_2.jpg', '1312_House-Villa_3.jpg', '1312_House-Villa_4.jpg', '1312_House-Villa_5.jpg', '1312_House-Villa_6.jpg', '1312_House-Villa_7.jpg', '1312_House-Villa_8.jpg'),
(1313, 'Teubl projects', 'Werinos i Werinos do', '+43 664 609 154 420 (Reinhard Werinos)', '43 3332 60915 4430 (Sanja Baljak)', 'baljak.s@teubl.at', 'Trogir', 'Ljubljeva, Vini¹æe, 17981/19, 20, 21, 22; 17981/14, 17921/13 K.O. Vini¹æe', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '10', '1090', '162', 2, '1650000', '', 2, 1, 2, 1, 1, 1, 3, 3, 'August 17, 2015', '<p>Croatia Property Sales vam predstavlja ovu vrhunsku luksuznu nekretninu uz samo more koja nudi mir, privatnost i oèaravajuæi pogled na more. Villa ima stambenu povr&scaron;inu 162 m2, dok je zemlji&scaron;te povr&scaron;ine 1090 m2. Na zemlji&scaron;tu su predviðena 4 parkirali&scaron;na mjesta, bazen od 75 m2, natkrivena terasa i vanjska kuhinja. Cijena ukljuèuje sustav klimatizacije te vrhunske podne i zidne obloge. Investitori su veæ ishodovali sve potrebne dozvole te je formirano gradili&scaron;te.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>Croatia Property Sales are pleased to offer this luxurious seafront property offering peace, privacy and outstanding views. The villa has living area of 162 m2, while the land plot measures 1090 m2. There will be parking place for 4 cars, a 75 sqm swimming pool, shaded terrace and al-fresco dining area. The price includes a air-conditioning system throughout and top quality flooring and tiling. Investors have already obtained all the necessary documents and permission for construction.</p>', '', '<p>Croatia Property Sales vam predstavlja ovu vrhunsku luksuznu nekretninu uz samo more koja nudi mir, privatnost i oèaravajuæi pogled na more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Villa (162 m2) se sastoji od 3 spavaæe sobe, 3 kupaonice, velikog otvorenog prostora dnevnog boravka sa kuhinjom i blagovaonicom te masivnih staklenih kliznih vrata koja se otvaraju prema prostoru terase i vrta.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Zemlji&scaron;te ima povr&scaron;inu 1090 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na zemlji&scaron;tu su predviðena 4 parkirali&scaron;na mjesta, bazen od 75 m2, natkrivena terasa i vanjska kuhinja.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Cijena ukljuèuje sustav klimatizacije te vrhunske podne i zidne obloge.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Investitori su veæ ishodovali sve potrebne dozvole te je formirano gradili&scaron;te.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Molimo kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured za detalje. &nbsp;</p>', '<p>Croatia Property Sales are pleased to offer this luxurious seafront property offering peace, privacy and outstanding views.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The villa (162 m2) has 3 bedrooms, 3 bathrooms and a large living room with kitchen and dining room, with giant glazed doors leading onto the terrace.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The land plot measures 1090 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There will be parking place for 4 cars, a 75 sqm swimming pool, shaded terrace and al-fresco dining area.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The price includes a air-conditioning system throughout and top quality flooring and tiling.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Investors have already obtained all the necessary documents and permission for construction.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact our office for more details.</p>', '', '1313_House-Villa_0.jpg', '1313_House-Villa_1.jpg', '1313_House-Villa_2.jpg', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(1314, '', 'Rakiæ', '', '', '', 'Primosten', 'Primo¹ten', 'For sale', 'Land plot', '50', '1200', '0', 1, '300000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 0, 0, 'August 17, 2015', '<p>Graðevinsko zemlji&scaron;te s predivnim pogledom na more. Graðevinska parcela se nalazi u izgraðenom dijelu naselja na vrlo ugodnoj i blago strmoj lokaciji s predivnim pogledom na more i primo&scaron;tensko otoèje. Zemlji&scaron;te ima povr&scaron;inu cca 1200 m2, a ispred parcele do mora nije moguæa gradnja, tako da ovaj jedinstveni pogled prema moru ostaje otvoren. U samo 80m udaljenosti nalazi se predivna prirodna pla¾a, koja se povezuje s centrom Primo&scaron;tena.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>We have this excellent building land plot with beautiful sea views in an attractive location in Primosten. It is located in the village on a very pleasant and gentle slope with a magnificent view of the sea and the islands off the shore which make up the Primosten archipelago. The land is cca 1,200 m2, and in front of the plot it is not possible to build, so this unique view of the sea will always remain.</p>', '', '<p>Graðevinsko zemlji&scaron;te s predivnim pogledom na more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Graðevinska parcela se nalazi u izgraðenom dijelu naselja na vrlo ugodnoj i blago strmoj lokaciji s predivnim pogledom na more i primo&scaron;tensko otoèje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Zemlji&scaron;te ima povr&scaron;inu cca 1200 m2, a ispred parcele do mora nije moguæa gradnja, tako da ovaj jedinstveni pogled prema moru ostaje otvoren.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U samo 80m udaljenosti nalazi se predivna prirodna pla¾a, koja se povezuje s centrom Primo&scaron;tena.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Investicijska nekretnina ili za gradnju 2 objekta na vrlo atraktivnoj lokaciji.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Zemlji&scaron;te je ju¾no orijentirano.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Cijena &euro;250/m2</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Centar mjesta je udaljen 350 m.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za sve dodatne informacije molimo kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured.</p>', '<p>We have this excellent building land plot with beautiful sea views in an attractive location in Primosten.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is located in the village on a very pleasant and gentle slope with a magnificent view of the sea and the islands off the shore which make up the Primosten archipelago.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The land is cca 1,200 m2, and in front of the plot it is not possible to build, so this unique view of the sea will always remain.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>At only 80 meters there is a beautiful natural beach, safe and clean,&nbsp;which is associated with the town.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The land is south oriented.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Price at &euro;250/m2</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The centre of the village with the cafes, bars and a variety of shops is located 350 m.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It could be a great investment property or 2 objects in a great location.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For further information please contact our office and speak to one of our agents.</p>', '', '1314_Land-plot_0.jpg', '1314_Land-plot_1.jpg', '1314_Land-plot_2.jpg', '1314_Land-plot_3.jpg', '1314_Land-plot_4.jpg', '1314_Land-plot_5.jpg', '1314_Land-plot_6.jpg', '1314_Land-plot_7.jpg', ''),
(1315, '', 'Rakiæ', '', '', '', 'Primosten', '©iri centar Primo¹ten', 'For sale', 'Land plot', '0', '600', '0', 1, '126000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 0, 0, 'August 17, 2015', '<p>Primo&scaron;ten, blizina centra, graðevinski teren povr&scaron;ine cca 600 m2 (potrebna izmjera), za gradnju obiteljske kuæe ili vi&scaron;estambenog apartmanskog objekta. Najisplativija kombinacija za gradnju dvojne obiteljske kuæe. Jedno od rijetkih graðevnih zemlji&scaron;ta na tom podruèju na kojem se mo¾e odmah iæi na ishodovanje graðevne dokumentacije. Sva &nbsp;komunalna infrastruktura uz teren. Odlièan pogled na more veæ sa prve eta¾e. Cijena 210 EUR/m2.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>We are offering this building plot of 600 m2, suitable for a comfortable family home, semi-detached building or a residential apartment building, in the centre of Primosten village. The plans are ready for an almost immediate start, with all the documentation ready.&nbsp;The utilities are present. Any building will have sea views from the first floor, and it''s location in the heart of the village will be wonderfully convenient for all the services and shops etc nearby. Property such as this is always popular with tourists. The price is set at 210 EUR / m2.</p>', '', '<p>Primo&scaron;ten, blizina centra, graðevinski teren povr&scaron;ine cca 600 m2 (potrebna izmjera), za gradnju obiteljske kuæe ili vi&scaron;estambenog apartmanskog objekta.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Najisplativija kombinacija za gradnju dvojne obiteljske kuæe.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Jedno od rijetkih graðevnih zemlji&scaron;ta na tom podruèju na kojem se mo¾e odmah iæi na ishodovanje graðevne dokumentacije.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sva komunalna infrastruktura uz teren.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Odlièan pogled na more veæ sa prve eta¾e.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Cijena 210 EUR/m2&nbsp;</strong></p>', '<p>We are offering this building plot of 600 m2, suitable for a comfortable family home, semi-detached building or a residential apartment building, in the centre of Primosten village.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The plans are ready for an almost immediate start, with all the documentation ready.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The utilities are present.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Any building will have sea views from the first floor, and it''s location in the heart of the village will be wonderfully convenient for all the services and shops etc nearby.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Property such as this is always popular with tourists.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>The price is set at 210 EUR/m2</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For further information please contact our office and one of our agents will have more information.</p>', '', '1315_Land-plot_0.jpg', '1315_Land-plot_1.jpg', '1315_Land-plot_2.jpg', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(1316, '', 'Rakiæ', '', '', '', 'Primosten', 'Dolac, Primo¹ten', 'For sale', 'Land plot', '400', '5000', '0', 1, '675000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 0, 0, 'August 17, 2015', '<p>Veliko graðavinsko zemlji&scaron;te s pogledom na more, pravilnog oblika (cca 5000 m2).&nbsp;Zemlji&scaron;te je udaljeno samo 400 m od mora.&nbsp;Pristupni put se nalazi uz cijelu &scaron;irinu zemlji&scaron;ta. Teren ima blagi nagib i s njega se pru¾a prekrasan pogled na otvoreno more.&nbsp;Zemlji&scaron;te je pogodno za gradnju vila s bazenima iz kojih bi se pru¾ao pogled na morsku puèinu.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>We are pleased to offer this large building plot with sea views on the mainland near Primosten. It is 400m from the shore, but elevated above all other buildings along the front by the gently sloping geography of the landscape. Building land is approx. 5000 m2, and has an access road located along the entire width of the land. The land is suitable for building villas with swimming pools, each of which will overlooked the sea.</p>', '', '<p>Veliko graðavinsko zemlji&scaron;te s pogledom na more, pravilnog oblika (cca 5000 m2).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Zemlji&scaron;te je udaljeno samo 400 m od mora.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Pristupni put se nalazi uz cijelu &scaron;irinu zemlji&scaron;ta.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Teren ima blagi nagib i s njega se pru¾a prekrasan pogled na otvoreno more.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Zemlji&scaron;te je pogodno za gradnju vila s bazenima iz kojih bi se pru¾ao pogled na morsku puèinu.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Investicijska nekretnina.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ima svu potrebnu infrastrukturu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>2 km udaljeno od Primo&scaron;tena.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Molimo za sve dodatne informacije kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured u Splitu.</p>', '<p>We are pleased to offer this large building plot with sea views on the mainland near Primosten.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is 400m from the shore, but elevated above all other buildings along the front by the gently sloping geography of the landscape.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The nearest village is Primosten, less than 10 minutes by bicycle, where there are shops, cafes, bakery and useful services and facilities for the resident population and tourists alike.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Building land is approx. 5000 m2, and has an access road located along the entire width of the land.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The land is suitable for building villas with swimming pools, each of which will overlooked the sea.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It has all the necessary infrastructure (electric, drains etc.).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The price is set at 130.00 euro /m&sup2;.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For further information please contact our office in Split and speak with one of our agents.</p>', '', '1316_Land-plot_0.JPG', '1316_Land-plot_1.JPG', '1316_Land-plot_2.JPG', '1316_Land-plot_3.JPG', '1316_Land-plot_4.JPG', '', '', '', ''),
(1317, '', 'Rakiæ', '', '', '', 'Rogoznica', 'Ra¾anj, rt Planka', 'For sale', 'Land plot', '60', '1400', '0', 1, '420000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 0, 0, 'August 17, 2015', '<p>Atraktivno zemlji&scaron;te u blizini Rogoznice, na maloj uzvisini, pravilnog oblika.&nbsp;Zemlji&scaron;te je udaljeno od mora samo 60 m.&nbsp;Nalazi se na rubu graðevne zone, na mirnoj lokaciji. Ima povr&scaron;inu 1400 m2.&nbsp;Blagi nagib terena, te otvoren pogled na more, idealno za izgradnju dviju vila s bazenima.&nbsp;Cijena: 300eur/m2.</p>', '<p>We are pleased to offer this attractive land plot of 1400 m2, on a small hill on the mainland, just up the coast from Trogir.&nbsp;The land plot is a good practical shape, and enough for two villas with swimming pools. The land is gently sloping, enough to ensure there are great and long views out to sea, but not an inconvenience.&nbsp;The plot is only 60m from the sea.&nbsp;It is on the edge of the building zone, in a quiet location, adjacent to natural woods and shrubs found in all the protected coastal land.&nbsp;The price is set at 300EUR/m2.</p>', '', '<p>Atraktivno zemlji&scaron;te (1400 m2) u blizini Rogoznice, na maloj uzvisini, pravilnog oblika.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Zemlji&scaron;te je udaljeno od mora samo 60 m.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nalazi se na rubu graðevne zone, na mirnoj lokaciji.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Blagi nagib terena, te otvoren pogled na more, idealno za izgradnju dviju vila s bazenima.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za sve dodatne informacije molimo kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured u Splitu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Cijena: 300eur/m2</strong></p>', '<p>We are pleased to offer this attractive land plot of 1400 m2, on a small hill on the mainland, just up the coast from Trogir.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The land plot is a good practical shape, and enough for two villas with swimming pools.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The land is gently sloping, enough to ensure there are great and long views out to sea, but not an inconvenience.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The plot is only 60m from the sea.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is on the edge of the building zone, in a quiet location, adjacent to natural woods and shrubs found in all the protected coastal land.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>The price is set at 300EUR/m2&nbsp;</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For further information please contact our office in Split.</p>', '', '1317_House-Villa_0.JPG', '1317_House-Villa_1.JPG', '1317_House-Villa_2.JPG', '1317_House-Villa_3.JPG', '1317_House-Villa_4.JPG', '1317_House-Villa_5.JPG', '1317_House-Villa_6.JPG', '1317_House-Villa_7.JPG', '1317_House-Villa_8.jpg'),
(1318, '', 'Rakiæ', '', '', '', 'Rogoznica', 'Kanica, Rogoznica', 'For sale', 'Land plot', '10', '2300', '0', 1, '360000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 0, 0, 'August 18, 2015', '<p>Graðevno zamlji&scaron;te u Rogoznici, povr&scaron;ine 2310 m2. Nalazi se u prvom redu graðevne zone, u izdvojenom podruèju, omeðenom zelenim pojasom sa tri strane.&nbsp;Egzotièna lokacija, idealan nagib terena za gradnju luksuznih vila, struja do terena.&nbsp;Privremeni nedostatak je to &scaron;to jo&scaron; nije sagraðena vodovodna mre¾a.</p>', '<p>We are pleased to present this excellent opportunity to buy a substantial building plot on the mainland North of Trogir. It is situated 80m from the shore, along the first line of permitted building, with three sides guaranteed to remain adjacent to natural woodland by being preserved ''green belt''. This large plot measures 2310 m2, and is just outside the popular village of Rogoznica. The land is gently sloping towards the sea, ensuring each property has great sea views. There is electricity to the location.</p>', '', '<p>Graðevno zamlji&scaron;te u Rogoznici, povr&scaron;ine 2310 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nalazi se u prvom redu graðevne zone, u izdvojenom podruèju, omeðenom zelenim pojasom sa tri strane.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Egzotièna lokacija, idealan nagib terena za gradnju luksuznih vila, struja do terena.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Privremeni nedostatak je to &scaron;to jo&scaron; nije sagraðena vodovodna mre¾a.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Vlasni&scaron;tvo uredno 1/1.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Neometan pristup do parcele.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Cijena: 360 000 EUR &nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Prilika!!!</p>', '<p>We are pleased to present this excellent opportunity to buy a substantial building plot on the mainland North of Trogir.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is situated 80m from the shore, along the first line of permitted building, with three sides guaranteed to remain adjacent to natural woodland by being preserved ''green belt''.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>This large plot measures 2310 m2, and is just outside the popular village of Rogoznica.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The land is gently sloping towards the sea, ensuring each property has great sea views.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There is electricity to the location, and easy access to the plot, but this part of the coast is not yet connected to the water supplies, so a tank will have to be built to accommodate this.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The connection is treated as a priority by the government and EU funds are being made available for this purpose.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For more information and technical questions about the planning consent, please contact our agents in Split.</p>', '', '1318_Land-plot_0.JPG', '1318_Land-plot_1.JPG', '1318_Land-plot_2.jpg', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(1319, '', 'Rakiæ', '', '', '', 'Rogoznica', 'Stiva¹nica Ra¾anj', 'For sale', 'Land plot', '20', '1090', '0', 1, '218000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 0, 0, 'August 18, 2015', '<p>Odlièan teren (1090 m2) u drugom redu do mora, u Rogoznici.&nbsp;Pogodno za gradnju dviju obiteljskih vila (samostojeæih ili dvojnih), kao i za gradnju apartmana.&nbsp;Nalazi se u okru¾enju novih modernih vila.&nbsp;Pristup odlièan.&nbsp;S terena se pru¾a prekrasan pogled na more.&nbsp;Sva infrastruktura se nalazi uz teren.<br /><br /></p>', '<p>We are pleased to offer this well located building land in the second row with wonderful views of the sea. It is situated 20 yards from the water, at the end of the bay in a small village near Rogoznica. The plot measures 1090m2 and is suitable for the construction of two family villas or for the construction of apartments. The access is excellent, on good roads, the services are already close, and the neighbouring property is mostly high quality modern buildings, creating a sought after part of the village.</p>', '', '<p>Odlièan teren u drugom redu do mora, u Rogoznici.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Pogodno za gradnju dviju obiteljskih vila (samostojeæih ili dvojnih) kao i za gradnju apartmana.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nalazi se u okru¾enju novih modernih vila.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Pristup odlièan.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>S terena se pru¾a prekrasan pogled na more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sva infrastruktura se nalazi uz teren.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Povr&scaron;ina zemlji&scaron;ta iznosi 1090 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Molimo za dodatne informacije kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured u Splitu.</p>', '<p>We are pleased to offer this well located building land in the second row with wonderful views of the sea.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is situated 20 yards from the water, at the end of the bay in a small village near Rogoznica.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The plot measures 1090m2 and is suitable for the construction of two family villas (stand alone or dual) or for the construction of apartments.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The access is excellent, on good roads, the services are already close, and the neighbouring property is mostly high quality modern buildings, creating a sought after part of the village.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Price: 200 EUR/m2</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact our agents who can answer questions and arrange to visit the location.</p>', '', '1319_Land-plot_0.JPG', '1319_Land-plot_1.JPG', '1319_Land-plot_2.JPG', '1319_Land-plot_3.JPG', '1319_Land-plot_4.JPG', '1319_Land-plot_5.JPG', '1319_Land-plot_6.JPG', '1319_Land-plot_7.JPG', '1319_Land-plot_8.jpg');
INSERT INTO `nekretnina` (`id`, `ime`, `prezime`, `telefon`, `mobitel`, `e_mail`, `lokacija_id`, `adresa`, `status_id`, `vrsta_id`, `udaljenost`, `povrsina`, `stambenapovrsina`, `display`, `cijena`, `cijenatocka`, `ponuda_tjedna`, `new_built`, `must_sell`, `prvi_red_do_mora`, `pogled_na_more`, `bazen`, `broj_soba`, `broj_kupatila`, `datum`, `title_hr`, `title_en`, `title_ge`, `opis_hr`, `opis_en`, `opis_ge`, `PropertyImageURL0`, `PropertyImageURL1`, `PropertyImageURL2`, `PropertyImageURL3`, `PropertyImageURL4`, `PropertyImageURL5`, `PropertyImageURL6`, `PropertyImageURL7`, `PropertyImageURL8`) VALUES
(1320, '', 'Rakiæ', '', '', '', 'Rogoznica', 'Zatoglav', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '100', '591', '200', 1, '290000', '', 2, 1, 2, 2, 1, 2, 4, 2, 'August 18, 2015', '<p>Prodaje se dvojna kuæa novije gradnje sa velikom terasom i lijepo ureðeno okuænicom. Nalazi se u blizini Rogoznice, udaljena 100 m od mora i pla¾e.&nbsp;Kuæa se sastoji od prizemlja i kata ukupne stambene povr&scaron;ine 200 m2, dok zemlji&scaron;te ima povr&scaron;inu 591 m2.&nbsp;U kuæi su dvije stambene jedinice, koje imaju zasebne ulaze preko stubi&scaron;ta na kraju desne i lijeve strane kuæe, &scaron;to stvara uvjet da kuæa mo¾e funkcionirati i kao dvojna, te postoji moguænost prodaje polovice kuæe.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>We are pleased to offer this well presented new semi-detached house. It has been well designed and built and the garden area landscaped with appropriate Mediterranean plants. It is situated near Rogoznica, 100 yards from the beach. The house consists of two floors with a total floor area of 200 m2, while the land has an area of 591 m2.&nbsp;The house has two apartments, each of which has a separate entrance. This allows different options for the use of the building, and also could even allow each apartment to sold separately.&nbsp;</p>', '', '<p>Prodaje se dvojna kuæa novije gradnje sa velikom terasom i lijepo ureðeno okuænicom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nalazi se u blizini Rogoznice, udaljena 100 m od mora i pla¾e.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa se sastoji od prizemlja i kata ukupne stambene povr&scaron;ine 200 m2, dok zemlji&scaron;te ima povr&scaron;inu 591 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U kuæi su dvije stambene jedinice, koje imaju zasebne ulaze preko stubi&scaron;ta na kraju desne i lijeve strane kuæe, &scaron;to stvara uvjet da kuæa mo¾e funkcionirati i kao dvojna, te postoji moguænost prodaje polovice kuæe.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U prizemlju kuæe nalazi se spremi&scaron;te, koje se mo¾e pretvoriti i u vinoteku ili ljetnu kuhinju.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na kat se dolazi vanjskim otvorenim stubi&scaron;tem i sastoji se od dva trosobna stana sa velikom zajednièkom terasom.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Natkrivena terasa ima preko 40m&sup2; i s nje se pru¾a lijepi pogled na more.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Mirna lokacija, uredna dokumentacija, dobar pristup, blizina mora, zapadna orijentacija èine ovu kuæu pravim izborom za buduæeg kupca.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Molimo za dodatne informacije kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured u Splitu.</p>', '<p>We are pleased to offer this well presented new semi-detached house.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It has been well designed and built and the garden area landscaped with appropriate Mediterranean plants.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is situated near Rogoznica, 100yards from the beach, but on elevated and gently sloping land which allows it have commanding views out to sea.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house consists of two floors with a total floor area of 200 m2, while the land has an area of 591 m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house has two apartments, each of which has a separate entrance via the stairwell at either end of the property.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>This allows different options for the use of the building, and also could even allow each apartment to sold separately.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The ground floor is a storage room, which can be converted in the wine cellar or summer kitchen.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The upper floor is accessed by external open staircase and consists of&nbsp;two bedroom apartments with a large terrace that access through sliding doors that lead from the kitchen/family lounge.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The balcony is covered and measures over 40m&sup2; and from here are superb views.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The quiet location, good access, proximity to the sea, and convenience for village services and shops, make this house a good choice.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact our agents who can provide more information and arrange to visit the property.</p>', '', '1320_House-Villa_0.JPG', '1320_House-Villa_1.JPG', '1320_House-Villa_2.JPG', '1320_House-Villa_3.JPG', '1320_House-Villa_4.JPG', '1320_House-Villa_5.JPG', '1320_House-Villa_6.JPG', '1320_House-Villa_7.JPG', '1320_House-Villa_8.JPG'),
(1321, 'Peter', 'Farkas', '+36 7077 55885', '', 'pfarkas1987@gmail.com', 'Brac', 'Braæe Jutroniæ 14 Sutivan,k.è. 2130/5 k.o. sutivan', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '40', '0', '50', 2, '92000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 2, 1, 'August 18, 2015', '<p>Predstavljamo Vam simpatièan dvosobni apartman na mirnoj lokaciji u malom mjestu sa sjeverne strane otoka Braèa.&nbsp;Apartman ima stambenu povr&scaron;inu 50 m2.&nbsp;Zgrada se nalazi u neposrednoj blizini pla¾e, a do centra mjesta ima oko 5 minuta ugodnog hoda.&nbsp;Zgrada se nalazi u drugom redu do mora. Apartman se nalazi na drugom katu.</p>', '<p>We are proud to present this lovely two bedroom apartment in a peaceful location at the end of small town from the northern side of Brac island.&nbsp;Apartment has living area of 50m sq.&nbsp;The building is located stones throw to the beach and it takes only 5 minutes to reach the center on foot.&nbsp;This property is in a second line to the sea, on the second floor.&nbsp;</p>', '', '<p>Predstavljamo Vam simpatièan dvosobni apartman na mirnoj lokaciji u malom mjestu sa sjeverne strane otoka Braèa.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartman ima stambenu povr&scaron;inu 50 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Zgrada se nalazi u neposrednoj blizini pla¾e, a do centra mjesta ima oko 5 minuta ugodnog hoda.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Zgrada se nalazi u drugom redu do mora.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Stan je na drugom katu, a sastoji se od dvije spavaæe sobe, otvorenog prostora kuhinje i dnevnog boravka, kupaonice te balkona.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Klimatiziran je.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U stanu postoji mali sef u kojem se mogu drzati dragocijenosti.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nekretnina se prodaje potpuno namje&scaron;tena i opremljena, spremna za kategorizaciju i turistièki najam, &scaron;to je èini dobrom investicijom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ulièni parking dostupan odmah pored zgrade.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Centar mjesta je udaljen 300 m.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Supetar je udaljen 12 km.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za sve dodatne informacije molimo kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured u Splitu.</p>', '<p>We are proud to present this lovely two bedroom apartment in a peaceful location at the end of small town from the northern side of Brac island.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartment has living area of 50m sq.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The building is located stones throw to the beach and it takes only 5 minutes to reach the center on foot.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>This property is in a second line to the sea, on the second floor and consits of two bedrooms, open-plan living room and kitchen, bathroom and balcony.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is airconditioned.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There is a small vault in the apartment where you can leave your valuables.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property is sold fully furnished, equipped and ready to be let to tourists, making it a great investment too.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Street parking next to the building.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The closest center is 300 m away.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Supetar is 12 km away.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please for the further information contact our office in Split.</p>', '', '1321_Apartment_0.jpg', '1321_Apartment_1.jpg', '1321_Apartment_2.jpg', '1321_Apartment_3.jpg', '1321_Apartment_4.jpg', '1321_Apartment_5.jpg', '1321_Apartment_6.jpg', '1321_Apartment_7.jpg', '1321_Apartment_8.jpg'),
(1322, 'Vladimir', 'Melamed', '+1 773 878 7590, +1 847 338 1954', 'Jozica Eteroviæ 097 783 3110', 'jozica@bonusnekretnine.hr', 'Zadar', 'Ulica XI 29 Ko¾ino, k.è. 660/42 k.o. diklo', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '870', '560', '420', 1, '480000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 5, 3, 'August 18, 2015', '<p>Svega 8 km od Zadra te 18 km od meðunarodne zraène luke Zadar nudimo ovu kuæu, potencijalno zanimljivu kao investiciju ili kao nekretninu za odmor. Kuæa se nalazi u malom mjestu, ca. 870 metara od mora. Nema pogled na more, ali je smje&scaron;tena u mirnom dijelu mjesta.&nbsp;Kuæa je samostojeæa, a sastoji se od 3 stana (po jedan na svakoj eta¾i) ukupne stambene povr&scaron;ine 420 m2.&nbsp;Zemlji&scaron;te ima povr&scaron;inu 560 m2.&nbsp;Dva stana su dvosobna, a jedan jednosoban.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;">CIJENA SNI®ENA SA 600.000 EURA!!</span></p>', '<p>Only 8 km from Zadar city and 18 km from its international airport we have this house to offer, interesting both as an investment property or holiday home. It is located in a small village, some 870 meters from the sea. It does not have sea views, but lays in a tranquil part of the settlement.&nbsp;This detached house comprises of 3 apartments (one on each floor) total living area of 420m sq. The land plot measures 560m sq. Two units have 2 bedrooms and one apartment has 1 bedroom.</p>\r\n<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;">PRICE REDUCED FROM 600.000 EUR!!</span></p>', '', '<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;"><strong>CIJENA SNI®ENA SA 600.000 EURA!!</strong></span></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Svega 8 km od Zadra te 18 km od meðunarodne zraène luke Zadar nudimo ovu kuæu, potencijalno zanimljivu kao investiciju ili kao nekretninu za odmor.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa se nalazi u malom mjestu, ca. 870 metara od mora.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nema pogled na more, ali je smje&scaron;tena u mirnom dijelu mjesta.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je samostojeæa, a sastoji se od 3 stana (po jedan na svakoj eta¾i) ukupne stambene povr&scaron;ine 420 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Zemlji&scaron;te ima povr&scaron;inu 560 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Dva stana su dvosobna, a jedan jednosoban.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Svaka jedinica ima dnevni boravak, kuhinju, kupaonicu, a neke i dodatni wc.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U prizemlju objekta nalaze se dva poslovna prostora &ndash; konoba i caffe bar.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nekretnina je kategorizirana i uspje&scaron;no se iznajmljuje u sezoni.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Cijena ukljuèuje preuzimanje tvrtke koja je vlasnik nekretnine, pri èemu nema poreza na promet nekretnina za kupca.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Meðunarodni aerodrom u Zadru je udaljen 8 km.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Molimo za sve dodatne informacije kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured u Splitu.</p>', '<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;"><strong>PRICE REDUCED FROM 600.000 EUR!!</strong></span></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Only 8 km from Zadar city and 18 km from its international airport we have this house to offer, interesting both as an investment property or holiday home.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is located in a small village, some 870 meters from the sea.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It does not have sea views, but lays in a tranquil part of the settlement.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>This detached house comprises of 3 apartments (one on each floor) total living area of 420m sq.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The land plot measures 560m sq.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Two units have 2 bedrooms and one apartment has 1 bedroom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>All of them are fully furnished and contain kitchen, bathroom, living room and some additional toilete.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the ground floor there are 2 commercial premises &ndash; a bar and restaurant.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property is categorized and successfully rented in the season.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The price includes the take-over of the limited liability company that owns the property &ndash; in this case the buyer does not pay real estate transfer tax.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Zadar international airport is 8 km away.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For the further information please contact our office in Split.</p>', '', '1322_House-Villa_0.jpg', '1322_House-Villa_1.jpg', '1322_House-Villa_2.jpg', '1322_House-Villa_3.jpg', '1322_House-Villa_4.jpg', '1322_House-Villa_5.jpg', '1322_House-Villa_6.jpg', '1322_House-Villa_7.jpg', '1322_House-Villa_8.jpg'),
(1323, 'Marija', 'Li¹niæ', '', '091 809 1969', 'marija.lisnic@gmail.com', 'Trogir', '©etali¹te Stjepana Radiæa 21 Okrug Gornji, c.zem 1342/3, 1342/4, c.zgr. 623, k.o. Okrug, ZU 1224', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '20', '720', '1030', 1, '1200000', '', 2, 2, 2, 1, 1, 2, 5, 4, 'August 19, 2015', '<p>Samostojeæa kuca na izvrsnoj lokaciji, u centru turistièkog mjesta u prvom redu do mora.&nbsp;Kuæa se sastoji od prizemlja i kata ukupne stambene povr&scaron;ine 1030 m2.&nbsp;Zemlji&scaron;te ima povr&scaron;inu 720 m2.&nbsp;Prizemlje objekta zauzima poslovni prostor, trenutno u najmu do kraja 2015. godine. Na katu se nalaze smje&scaron;tajne jedinice, kategorizirane i u funkciji turizma.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>Detached house on excellent location, in the center of touristic village, in the firs row to the sea.&nbsp;The house consists of ground floor and 1st floors total living area of 1030m sq.&nbsp;The land plot measures 720m sq.&nbsp;Business premise occupies the ground floor and is rented until the end of 2015. On the first floor there are accomodation units, categorized and rented to tourists.&nbsp;</p>', '', '<p>Samostojeæa kuæa na izvrsnoj lokaciji, u centru turistièkog mjesta u prvom redu do mora.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa se sastoji od prizemlja i kata ukupne stambene povr&scaron;ine 1030 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Zemlji&scaron;te ima povr&scaron;inu 720 m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Prizemlje objekta zauzima poslovni prostor, trenutno u najmu do kraja 2015. godine.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na katu se nalaze smje&scaron;tajne jedinice, kategorizirane i u funkciji turizma.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Trenutnu strukturu iznutra èini studio apartman, èetverokrevetna soba sa kupaonicom, jedan dvosobni apartman te jedan jednosobni apartman.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sa zapadne strane nalazi se velika zajednièka terasa (100 m2) sa predivnim pogledom na uvalu i pla¾u.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nekretnina je u zakupu, stoga za razgledavanje molimo unaprijed dogovorite termin u agenciji.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Trogir je udaljen 2km, a Split 6 km.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Molimo za sve dodatne informacije kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured u Splitu.</p>', '<p>Detached house on excellent location, in the center of touristic village, in the firs row to the sea.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house consists of ground floor and 1st floors total living area of 1030m sq.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The land plot measures 720m sq.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Business premise occupies the ground floor and is rented until the end of 2015.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the first floor there are accomodation units, categorized and rented to tourists.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>This floor currently hosts studio apartment, quadruple bedroom with bathroom, one 2-bedroom apartment and one 1-bedroom apartment.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>A large 100 sqm terrace is located on the western side of the house, featuring spectacular views over the beach and the bay. &nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property is leased, therefore any viewings should be announced to the agency on time.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Trogir is 2 km, and Split international airport 6 km away.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please for the futher information contact our office in Split.&nbsp;</p>', '', '1323_House-Villa_0.jpg', '1323_House-Villa_1.jpg', '1323_House-Villa_2.jpg', '1323_House-Villa_3.jpg', '1323_House-Villa_4.jpg', '1323_House-Villa_5.jpg', '1323_House-Villa_6.jpg', '1323_House-Villa_7.jpg', '1323_House-Villa_8.jpg'),
