nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Dvije spavaæe sobe, kupaonica te wc takoðer se nalaze na ovoj eta¾i, kao i zasebna radna soba sa tu&scaron;em.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Mramorno stepeni&scaron;te vodi na prvi kat gdje se nalaze tri manja apartmana, svaki sa terasom i pogledom na more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U podrumu objekta nalaze te pomoæne i tehnièke prostorije. &nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Centar mjesta je udaljen 300 m.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Split je udaljen 55 km.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Molimo za sve dodatne informacije kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured u Splitu.</p>', '<p>Lovely house on Solta island, featuring open views onto the bay and the sea.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property is surrounded by well-maintained lush Mediterranean garden.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Outdoor area includes plunge pool, shower, terraces with al-fresco dining, BBQ and parking for 6 cars.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>House is 240 m distant from the sea.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It consists of ground and 1st floors total living area of 320m sq.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The land plot measures 600m sq.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property was renovated in 2001.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the ground floor there is an open-plan living and dining area with 3 exists to the sundeck with pool.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>This floor also contains 2 bedrooms, bathroom and wc, as well as separate study with shower.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Marble stairs lead on the first floor, containing 3 smaller apartments, each with its own seaview terrace.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Auxiliary rooms are located in the basement.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Center of this place is 300 m, while Split international airport is 55 km away.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please for the further information contact our office in Split.&nbsp;</p>', '', '1324_House-Villa_0.jpg', '1324_House-Villa_1.jpg', '1324_House-Villa_2.jpg', '1324_House-Villa_3.jpg', '1324_House-Villa_4.jpg', '1324_House-Villa_5.jpg', '1324_House-Villa_6.jpg', '1324_House-Villa_7.jpg', '1324_House-Villa_8.jpg'),
(1325, '', 'Charles', '', 'Linda (+385 20 712 150) as she manages the Lina of', 'cvdm_6@hotmail.com', 'Korcula', 'Korcula, Lumbarda Lumbarda', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '40', '0', '36', 1, '68000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 1, 1, 1, 'August 20, 2015', '<p><strong>CIJENA SNI®ENA SA 85.000 &euro; NA 68.000 &euro;</strong></p>\r\n<p>&Scaron;armantan stan na Korèuli, smje&scaron;ten samo 40 m od mora, s predivnim pogledom na more.&nbsp;U sklopu je veæeg kompleksa koji ukljuèuje i zajednièki bazen te prostranu terasu uz more.&nbsp;Apartman se sastoji od jedne sobe, kuhinje sa dnevnim boravkom, kupaonice i terase, ukupne stambene povr&scaron;ine 36 m2.&nbsp;Ima lijep pogled na more i osiguran parking u sklopu kompleksa.</p>', '<p><strong>PRICE REDUCED FROM 85.000 &euro; TO 68.000 &euro;</strong></p>\r\n<p>Charming apartment on the island of Korcula, only 40 m to the sea, with a beautiful sea view.&nbsp;It is within a bigger complex including the pool and nice seaside terrace.&nbsp;The apartment itself consists of one bedroom, living/dining room, kitchen, bathroom and a nice terrace, total living area of 36m sq.&nbsp;It has nice sea views and free parking within the complex.</p>', '', '<p><strong>CIJENA SNI®ENA SA 85.000 &euro; NA 68.000 &euro;</strong></p>\r\n<p><strong><br /></strong></p>\r\n<p>&Scaron;armantan stan na Korèuli, smje&scaron;ten samo 40 m od mora, s predivnim pogledom na more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U sklopu je veæeg kompleksa koji ukljuèuje i zajednièki bazen te prostranu terasu uz more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartman se sastoji od jedne sobe, kuhinje sa dnevnim boravkom, kupaonice i terase.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Stan ima ukupnu stambenu povr&scaron;inu 36 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ima lijep pogled na more i osiguran parking u sklopu kompleksa.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nalazi se 200 m od centra mjesta i samo 10 minutu vo¾nje od povijesnog grada Korèule.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Molimo za sve dodatne informacije kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured u Splitu.</p>', '<p><strong>PRICE REDUCED FROM 85.000 &euro; TO 68.000 &euro;</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Charming apartment on the island of Korcula, only 40 m to the sea, with a beautiful sea view.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is within a bigger complex including the pool and nice seaside terrace.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The apartment itself consists of one bedroom, living/dining room, kitchen, bathroom and a nice terrace.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartment has living area of 36m sq.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It has nice sea views and free parking within the complex.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is only 200 m to the centre of the village and just 10 minutes drive to the historical town of Korcula.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please for the further information contact our office in Split.</p>', '', '1325_Apartment_0.jpg', '1325_Apartment_1.jpg', '1325_Apartment_2.jpg', '1325_Apartment_3.jpg', '1325_Apartment_4.jpg', '1325_Apartment_5.jpg', '1325_Apartment_6.jpg', '1325_Apartment_7.jpg', '1325_Apartment_8.jpg'),
(1327, 'Ivo', 'Bojaniæ (Nik¹a)', '', '', '', 'Hvar', 'Zavala', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '30', '0', '100', 2, '200000', '', 2, 1, 2, 2, 1, 2, 0, 0, 'August 26, 2015', '<p>Apartmani u novogradnji s predivnim pogledom na more, na ju¾noj strani otoka Hvara.&nbsp;Kuæa se nalazi u drugom redu do mora, a sastoji se od 3 apartmana.&nbsp;Svaki apartman ima povr&scaron;inu 100 m2.&nbsp;Ima prikljuèene vodu i struju.&nbsp;Iznutra je nedovr&scaron;ena.&nbsp;Do trajektne luke 9 km.&nbsp;Brojne &scaron;ljunèane pla¾e i skrovite uvale nude posjetiteljima mir i potpuni odmor daleko od buke i vreve modernog ¾ivota.</p>', '<p>We are the agent for these two new apartments with beautiful views of the sea, on the south side of Hvar island.&nbsp;The house is located in the second row to the sea, and consists of 3 apartments. Each apartment has a floor area of 100 m2. The inside requires decorating and fittings (which is reflected in the&nbsp;&nbsp;price) but they are designed with an open plan living area with plenty of light from the large windows, and with access to the balconies.</p>', '', '<p>Apartmani u novogradnji s predivnim pogledom na more, na ju¾noj strani otoka Hvara.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa se nalazi u drugom redu do mora, a sastoji se od 3 apartmana.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Svaki apartman ima povr&scaron;inu 100 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ima prikljuèene vodu i struju.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Iznutra je nedovr&scaron;ena.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa se nalazi u blizini svih sadr¾aja (trgovine, pekara, restorani...).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Udaljenost od veæeg grada 5 km, kao i do pristani&scaron;ta katamarana i hidroaviona.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Do trajektne luke 9 km.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Brojne &scaron;ljunèane pla¾e i skrovite uvale nude posjetiteljima mir i potpuni odmor daleko od buke i vreve modernog ¾ivota.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Molimo za sve informacije kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured.</p>', '<p>Price 200k euro (each apartment)</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>We are the agent for these two new apartments with beautiful views of the sea, on the south side of Hvar island.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house is located in the second row to the sea, and consists of 3 apartments.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Each apartment has a floor area of 100 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The inside requires decorating and fittings (which is reflected in the&nbsp;&nbsp;price) but they are designed with an open plan living area with plenty of light from the large windows, and with access to the balconies.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house is located conveniently close to many amenities (shops, bakeries, bars and restaurants etc) and walking distance to the excellent clean and clear water beach.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The distance from the larger town is 5 km, where there are the docks for regular catamarans and hydroplanes connecting to the mainland.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>To the ferry port is 9 km.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact agents at our office for more information and to arrange to visit the property.</p>', '', '1327_Apartment_0.jpg', '1327_Apartment_1.jpg', '1327_Apartment_2.jpg', '1327_Apartment_3.jpg', '1327_Apartment_4.jpg', '1327_Apartment_5.jpg', '1327_Apartment_6.jpg', '1327_Apartment_7.jpg', '1327_Apartment_8.jpg'),
(1328, 'Dajana', 'Krolo', '', '', 'dajana.krolo@gmail.com', 'Split', 'Odeska 15 Split', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '400', '0', '65', 2, '125000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 2, 1, 'August 26, 2015', '<p>Apartman na 4. katu stambene zgrade s prekrasnim pogledom na more.&nbsp;Apartman se sastoji od dvije spavaæe sobe, blagovaonice s dnevnim boravkom, kuhinje, kupaonice te spreme, ukupne stambene povr&scaron;ine 65 m2.&nbsp;Spavaæe sobe imaju izlaz u loðu, dok dnevni boravak ima izlaz na balkon s kojeg se pru¾a predivan pogled na more.&nbsp;Apartman je ju¾no orijentiran.&nbsp;Zgrada ima lift.</p>\r\n<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;">CIJENA SNI®ENA SA 135.000 EURA!</span></p>', '<p>We are pleased to offer this apartment on the 4th floor, overlooking the sea, near Split. The bedrooms have access to a balcony, while the living room has large windows with access to a wide balcony with beautiful views of the sea. This apartment is south orientation.</p>\r\n<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;">PRICE REDUCED FROM 135.000 EURO!</span></p>', '', '<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;"><strong>CIJENA SNI®ENA SA 135.000 EURA!</strong></span></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartman na 4. katu stambene zgrade s prekrasnim pogledom na more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartman se sastoji od dvije spavaæe sobe, blagovaonice s dnevnim boravkom, kuhinje, kupaonice te spreme, ukupne stambene povr&scaron;ine 65 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Spavaæe sobe imaju izlaz u loðu, dok dnevni boravak ima izlaz na balkon s kojeg se pru¾a predivan pogled na more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartman je ju¾no orijentiran.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Zgrada ima lift.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Parking ispred zgrade.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>S obzirom da poziciju ovo je izvrsna prilika ¾elite li nekretninu za svrhu turistièkog iznajmljivanja ili je jednostavno ¾elite koristiti za vlastiti boravak.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Svi potrebni sadr¾aji (market, ljekarna, banka...) nalaze se u neposrednoj blizini.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Meðunarodni aerodrom udaljen je 40 min. vo¾nje.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za sve dodatne informacije slobodno nas kontaktirajte.</p>', '<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;"><strong>PRICE REDUCED FROM 135.000 EURO!</strong></span></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>We are pleased to offer this apartment on the 4th floor, overlooking the sea, near Split.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>This well presented apartment has two bedrooms, dining room, living room, kitchen, bathroom and study area with a total floor area of 65 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The bedrooms have access to a balcony, while the living room has large windows with access to a wide balcony with beautiful views of the sea.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>This apartment is south orientation.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property has been well maintained and was built with good quality fittings to a modern style and design.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The building has a lift/elevator.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There is parking in front of the building.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property is situated in the residential area, on the edge of Split, but is conveniently placed near shops and other services, near cafes and bars, walking distance to the beach, and with easy access to the historic tourist part of the town, to the north.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The international airport is 40 minutes driving.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For further information please contact our office in Split.</p>', '', '1328_Apartment_0.jpg', '1328_Apartment_1.jpg', '1328_Apartment_2.jpg', '1328_Apartment_3.jpg', '1328_Apartment_4.jpg', '1328_Apartment_5.jpg', '1328_Apartment_6.jpg', '1328_Apartment_7.jpg', '1328_Apartment_8.jpg'),
(1329, '', 'Dalmatian Home', '', '', '', 'Sibenik', 'Brodarica', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '50', '351', '380', 1, '375000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 0, 0, 'August 26, 2015', '<p>Kuæa s predivnim pogledom na more.&nbsp;Sadr¾i &nbsp;9 apartmana, a smje&scaron;tena je ispod magistrale u mjestu nedaleko &Scaron;ibenika.&nbsp;Nalazi se u 3.redu do mora.&nbsp;Svaki apartman se sastoji od jedne spavaæe sobe i dnevnog boravka koji je odjeljen te ima 2 dodatna le¾aja.&nbsp;Svaki apartman ima i svoju terasu.&nbsp;Ukupna stambena povr&scaron;ina kuæe iznosi 380 m2 neto ili 500 m2 sa terasama.&nbsp;Parcela ima 351 m2.</p>', '<p>We are offering this apartment block, with 9 separate apartments, as an ongoing business in a good location near the sea. It is in the third row of property - only 50m from the shore - and has beautiful views across the sea, and the old village. The village is a small historic fishing village on the mainland near Sibenik. Each apartment has one bedroom and a living room divided to allow two extra beds.&nbsp;Each apartment has its own balcony. Total living area is 380 m2 net or 500 m2 with balconies. The plot has 351 m2.&nbsp;</p>', '', '<p>Kuæa s predivnim pogledom na more.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sadr¾i &nbsp;9 apartmana, a smje&scaron;tena je ispod magistrale u mjestu nedaleko &Scaron;ibenika.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nalazi se u 3. redu do mora.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Svaki apartman se sastoji od jedne spavaæe sobe i dnevnog boravka koji je odjeljen te ima 2 dodatna le¾aja.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Svaki apartman ima i svoju terasu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ukupna stambena povr&scaron;ina kuæe iznosi 380 m2 neto ili 500 m2 sa terasama.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Parcela ima 351 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæi pripadaju 4 parkirna mjesta.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Udaljena je samo 50 m od mora.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Mjesto je bogato pla¾ama i èistim morem, a smje&scaron;teno je samo nekoliko kilometara od &Scaron;ibenika.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Svi potrebni sadr¾aji se nalaze u blizini.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Molimo za sve dodatne informacije kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured u Splitu.</p>', '<p>We are offering this apartment block, with 9 separate apartments, as an ongoing business in a good location near the sea.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is in the third row of property - only 50m from the shore - and has beautiful views across the sea, and the old village.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The village is a small historic fishing village on the mainland near Sibenik.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Each apartment has one bedroom and a living room divided to allow two extra beds.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Each apartment has its own balcony.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Total living area is 380 m2 net or 500 m2 with balconies.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The plot has 351 m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house has 4 parking spaces within the plot.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is only 50 m from the sea.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The village is rich with beaches with clear waters, and has many shops, bars and cafes to give a vibrant and popular area around the harbour.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is a sought after destination for tourists, being so peaceful and safe for children, making the purchase of the apartment block such a good investment.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Split airport is 1 hour.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please for further information contact our office in Split to arrange to visit this property.</p>', '', '1329_House-Villa_0.jpg', '1329_House-Villa_1.jpg', '1329_House-Villa_2.jpg', '1329_House-Villa_3.jpg', '1329_House-Villa_4.jpg', '1329_House-Villa_5.jpg', '1329_House-Villa_6.jpg', '1329_House-Villa_7.jpg', '1329_House-Villa_8.jpg'),
(1330, 'Vlatko i Gordan', 'Kolareviæ', 'Gordana 098480577', 'Vlatko 0911755553', 'Mrkonjiæ Lucija 0919144816 kljuè', 'Rogoznica', 'Lozica IV 15 Rogoznica', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '50', '0', '58', 1, '98000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 1, 1, 'August 26, 2015', '<p>Jednosoban apartman u &scaron;armantnom dalmatinskom mjestu.&nbsp;Jedna od najljep&scaron;e ureðenih i atraktivnih pla¾a ovog mjesta nalazi se svega 50 m od apartmana.&nbsp;Ukupna stambena povr&scaron;ina apartmana iznosi 58 m2.&nbsp;Sastoji se od spavaæe sobe, prostranog dnevnog boravka s kuhinjom i kupaonice.&nbsp;Dnevni boravak ima izlaz na prostranu terasu gdje se mo¾e u¾ivati u ti&scaron;ini, pogledu i mediteranskom zraku.&nbsp;Zgrada je kvalitetno izgraðena 2006. godine, a apartman se nalazi u visokom prizemlju.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>We are pleased to offer this small and attractively priced one bedroom apartment in a charming Dalmatian village. It is situated only 50 meters from the shore, a beach, where there is clear water safe for children to enjoy. The total living area of the apartment is 58 m2.&nbsp;It consists of a bedroom, living room with kitchen and bathroom. The living room has windows leading on to a spacious terrace where you can enjoy the peace, with a lovely sea view and mediterranean air.&nbsp;</p>', '', '<p>Jednosoban apartman u &scaron;armantnom dalmatinskom mjestu.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Jedna od najljep&scaron;e ureðenih i atraktivnih pla¾a ovog mjesta nalazi se svega 50 m od apartmana.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ukupna stambena povr&scaron;ina apartmana iznosi 58 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sastoji se od spavaæe sobe, prostranog dnevnog boravka s kuhinjom i kupaonice.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Dnevni boravak ima izlaz na prostranu terasu gdje se mo¾e u¾ivati u ti&scaron;ini, pogledu i mediteranskom zraku.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Zgrada je kvalitetno izgraðena 2006. godine, a apartman se nalazi u visokom prizemlju.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartman je lijepo ureðen i kao takav se prodaje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Do centra mjesta (u kojem se nalaze vrhunski restorani, duæani, kafiæi i tr¾nica) lijepo ureðenom &scaron;etnicom uz more se mo¾e doæi za 15 minuta hoda.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Uz apartman je osigurano jedno odvojeno parking mjesto te mali vrt uz terasu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Aerodrom je udaljen 28 km.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Molimo za sve dodatne informacije kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured u Splitu.</p>', '<p>Price 98k euro&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>We are pleased to offer this small and attractively priced one bedroom apartment in a charming Dalmatian village.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is situated only 50 meters from the shore, a beach, where there is clear water safe for children to enjoy.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The total living area of the apartment is 58 m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It consists of a bedroom, living room with kitchen and bathroom.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The living room has windows leading on to a spacious terrace where you can enjoy the peace, with a lovely sea view and mediterranean air.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The building was built in 2006, and the apartment is located on the ground floor of this modern and attractive block.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The apartment is well decorated and furnished, and the fittings and furniture are part of the sale.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is 15 minutes walk to the centre of the local village and there is a selection of excellent restaurants, shops, cafes and markets, creating a very pleasant and vibrant village with a beautifully landscaped promenade along the shore.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>This apartment has a separate private parking space and a small garden with a terrace.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The airport is less than 30 minutes by car.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For further information please contact our office in Split and speak with one of our agents.</p>', '', '1330_Apartment_0.JPG', '1330_Apartment_1.JPG', '1330_Apartment_2.JPG', '1330_Apartment_3.JPG', '1330_Apartment_4.JPG', '1330_Apartment_5.JPG', '1330_Apartment_6.JPG', '1330_Apartment_7.JPG', '1330_Apartment_8.JPG'),
(1331, 'Marko', 'Domjanoviæ', '035 266350', '0915193012', '', 'Rogoznica', 'Miline 126  Rogoznica', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '20', '272', '196', 1, '270000', '', 2, 2, 2, 1, 1, 2, 5, 3, 'August 26, 2015', '<p>Kuæa u centru lijepog dalmatinskog mjesta, ju¾ne orijentacije, na svega par metara od mora i marine.&nbsp;Povr&scaron;ina kuæe je 196 m2, a nalazi se na parceli povr&scaron;ine 272 m2.&nbsp;Kuæa se sastoji od prizemlja i kata.&nbsp;Du¾ kuæe se nalazi velika terasa s koje se pru¾a pogled na more i marinu.&nbsp;Okuænica je poploèana.&nbsp;U sklopu parcele osigurana su tri parking mjesta.</p>', '<p>We are offering this modern style house in the centre of beautiful dalmatian village, facing south, and just a few meters from the sea and marina.&nbsp;House size is 196 m2 and is located on a plot of 272 m2 and is on two floors. Along the house is a large balcony, with good elevated views of the sea and marina.&nbsp;The courtyard in front of the property is paved and the plot has three private and secure parking spaces.&nbsp;</p>', '', '<p>Kuæa u centru lijepog dalmatinskog mjesta, ju¾ne orijentacije, na svega par metara od mora i marine.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Povr&scaron;ina kuæe je 196 m2, a nalazi se na parceli povr&scaron;ine 272 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa se sastoji od prizemlja i kata.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U prizemlju je dvosoban apartmana (koji se sastoji od spavaæe sobe, kupaonice, dnevnog boravak i kuhinje) i prostor koji trenutno slu¾i kao ostava, a mo¾e se prenamijeniti u gara¾u ili jo&scaron; jedan apartman.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na katu se nalazi dvosoban apartman i jo&scaron; jedna veæa soba s kupaonicom.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Du¾ kuæe se nalazi velika terasa s koje se pru¾a pogled na more i marinu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Okuænica je poploèana.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U sklopu parcele osigurana su tri parking mjesta.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Centar mjesta sa svim potrebnim sadr¾ajima nalaze se na svega par stotina metara od kuæe (restorani koji æe zadovoljiti i najzahtjevnije gurmane, duæani, turistièki sadr¾aji...).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa ima svu potrebnu infrastrukturu (gradski vodovod, struju i gradsku kanalizaciju).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ova kuæa, uz odreðene preinake, zadovoljit æe one koji ¾ele obiteljsku kuæu i odmor u miru, ali &nbsp;isto tako i one koji je ¾ele koristiti u turistièke svrhe (iznajmljivanje apartmana).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Udaljenost aerodroma je 28 km.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Molimo za sve dodatne informacije kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured u Splitu.</p>', '<p>We are offering this modern style house in the centre of beautiful dalmatian village, facing south, and just a few meters from the sea and marina.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>House size is 196 m2 and is located on a plot of 272 m2 and is on two floors.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the ground floor is a separate two bedroom apartment (consisting of bedroom, bathroom, living room and kitchen) and a room currently used as storage, and can be converted into a garage or included into the residence.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The first floor is a two bedroom apartment that has a large room with bathroom.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Along the house is a large balcony, with good elevated views of the sea and marina.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The courtyard in front of the property is paved and the plot has three private and secure parking spaces.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The centre of the village is only a few hundred meters from home and here is a vibrant area around the old harbour with restaurants, shops, coffee bars, cafes and tourist attractions and activities.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property could easily be adapted to become one larger family house, or to continue with tourism.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Distance to the airport is 28 km.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact our office in Split and arrange to visit this property.</p>', '', '1331_House-Villa_0.JPG', '1331_House-Villa_1.JPG', '1331_House-Villa_2.JPG', '1331_House-Villa_3.JPG', '1331_House-Villa_4.JPG', '1331_House-Villa_5.JPG', '1331_House-Villa_6.JPG', '1331_House-Villa_7.JPG', '1331_House-Villa_8.JPG'),
(1332, 'Snje¾ana', 'Rucner', '', '098 162 6058', '', 'Brac', 'Punta 53  Povlja, 224/97 k.o. povlja', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '50', '416', '180', 1, '450000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 1, 5, 3, 'August 26, 2015', '<p>Atraktivna obiteljska kuæa smje&scaron;tena na rubu malog mjesta na sjeveroistiènoj strani otoka Braèa. Kuæa se sastoji od prizemlja i prvog kata, svaki sa zasebnim ulazom, ukupne stambene povr&scaron;ine 180 m2.&nbsp;Zemlji&scaron;te ima povr&scaron;inu 416 m2.&nbsp;Nekretnina nudi lijep i otvoren pogled na more te planinu Biokovo. Visokokvalitetni materijali kori&scaron;teni su pri gradnji ove kuæe, ukljuèujuæi braèki kamen te vodonepropusnu fasadu. Iza kuæe nalazi se terasa povr&scaron;ine 50 m2 s vanjskim ro&scaron;tiljem preko koje se pristupa vrtu s bazenom.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>An attractive family home located on the outskirts of a small village on the northerst side of Brac island. The house comprises of a ground floor and first floor, each with their own entrances, total living area of 180 sqm.&nbsp;The land plot measures 416 sqm.&nbsp;The property offers splendid open views onto the sea and Biokovo mountain on the coast. High quality materials were used in construction, including local stone and water-resistant facade.</p>', '', '<p>Atraktivna obiteljska kuæa smje&scaron;tena na rubu malog mjesta na sjeveroistiènoj strani otoka Braèa.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa se sastoji od prizemlja i prvog kata, svaki sa zasebnim ulazom, ukupne stambene povr&scaron;ine 180 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Zemlji&scaron;te ima povr&scaron;inu 416 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Stan u prizemlju ima 3 spavaæe sobe, 2 kupaonice, dnevni boravak sa kuhinjom, terasu povr&scaron;ine 20 m2 te ostavu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Stan na prvom katu sadr¾i 2 spavaæe sobe, kupaonicu, dnevni boravak sa kuhinjom te terasu povr&scaron;ine 20 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nekretnina nudi lijep i otvoren pogled na more te planinu Biokovo.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Visokokvalitetni materijali kori&scaron;teni su pri gradnji ove kuæe, ukljuèujuæi braèki kamen te vodonepropusnu fasadu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Interijer je moderan, jednostavnih ravnih linija, jedva kori&scaron;ten.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Iza kuæe nalazi se terasa povr&scaron;ine 50 m2 s vanjskim ro&scaron;tiljem preko koje se pristupa vrtu s bazenom.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za dodatne informacije molimo kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured u Splitu.</p>', '<p>An attractive family home located on the outskirts of a small village on the northerst side of Brac island.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house comprises of a ground floor and first floor, each with their own entrances, total living area of 180 sqm.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The land plot measures 416 sqm.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartment on the ground floor contains 3 bedrooms, 2 bathrooms, open-plan living room and kitchen, 20 sq.m terrace and storage.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartment on the first floor features 2 bedrooms, bathroom, open-plan living room and kitchen and 20 sq.m terrace.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property offers splendid open views onto the sea and Biokovo mountain on the coast.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>High quality materials were used in construction, including local stone and water-resistant facade.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Interior is modern, sleek and hardly used.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Behind the house there is a 50 sq.m terrace with BBQ and access to a garden with swimming pool.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For the further information please contact our office in Split.</p>', '', '1332_House-Villa_0.jpg', '1332_House-Villa_1.jpg', '1332_House-Villa_2.jpg', '1332_House-Villa_3.jpg', '1332_House-Villa_4.jpg', '1332_House-Villa_5.jpg', '1332_House-Villa_6.jpg', '1332_House-Villa_7.jpg', '1332_House-Villa_8.jpg');
INSERT INTO `nekretnina` (`id`, `ime`, `prezime`, `telefon`, `mobitel`, `e_mail`, `lokacija_id`, `adresa`, `status_id`, `vrsta_id`, `udaljenost`, `povrsina`, `stambenapovrsina`, `display`, `cijena`, `cijenatocka`, `ponuda_tjedna`, `new_built`, `must_sell`, `prvi_red_do_mora`, `pogled_na_more`, `bazen`, `broj_soba`, `broj_kupatila`, `datum`, `title_hr`, `title_en`, `title_ge`, `opis_hr`, `opis_en`, `opis_ge`, `PropertyImageURL0`, `PropertyImageURL1`, `PropertyImageURL2`, `PropertyImageURL3`, `PropertyImageURL4`, `PropertyImageURL5`, `PropertyImageURL6`, `PropertyImageURL7`, `PropertyImageURL8`) VALUES
(1333, 'Branislava', 'Koraksiæ', '021 630623, +381 11 616 2813', 'suprug Predrag 091 5324472', 'corax33@yahoo.com', 'Brac', 'Sv. Roka 41 Supetar, k.è. 596/2 k.o. supetar', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '550', '435', '120', 1, '260000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 4, 2, 'August 26, 2015', '<p>Lijepa obiteljska kuæa u mirnom dijelu Supetra.&nbsp;Kuæa se sastoji od prizemlja i kata ukupne stambene povr&scaron;ine 120 m2.&nbsp;Zemlji&scaron;te ima povr&scaron;inu 435 m2. Na svakoj eta¾i nalazi se po jedan stan sa dvije spavaæe sobe, kuhinjom i kupaonicom. U sastavu objekta nalazi se i gara¾a povr&scaron;ine 30 m2, povi&scaron;e koje je natkrivena terasa. Krov je promijenjen prije 5 godina te su postavljeni novi PVC prozori.&nbsp;Kuæa gleda na park, a sa gornje eta¾e djelomièno se vidi i more.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>This is a nice family house in the peaceful part of Supetar town. It consists of a ground floor and first floor, total living area of 120 sqm.&nbsp;The land plot mesures 435 sqm.&nbsp;Each level has an apartment made of two bedrooms, kitchen and bathroom. A 30 sqm garage belongs to the property, above which there is a lovely covered terrace offering partial sea views.&nbsp;</p>', '', '<p>Lijepa obiteljska kuæa u mirnom dijelu Supetra.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa se sastoji od prizemlja i kata ukupne stambene povr&scaron;ine 120 m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Zemlji&scaron;te ima povr&scaron;inu 435 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na svakoj eta¾i nalazi se po jedan stan sa dvije spavaæe sobe, kuhinjom i kupaonicom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U sastavu objekta nalazi se i gara¾a povr&scaron;ine 30 m2, povi&scaron;e koje je natkrivena terasa.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Krov je promijenjen prije 5 godina te su postavljeni novi PVC prozori.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa gleda na park, a sa gornje eta¾e djelomièno se vidi i more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Do centra mjesta i svih sadr¾aja ima oko 5 minuta hoda.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæu okru¾uje odr¾avani vrt.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Centar mjesta je udaljen 500 m.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za dodatne informacije molimo kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured u Splitu.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>This is a nice family house in the peaceful part of Supetar town.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It consists of a ground floor and first floor, total living area of 120 sqm.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The land plot mesures 435 sqm.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Each level has an apartment made of two bedrooms, kitchen and bathroom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>A 30 sqm garage belongs to the property, above which there is a lovely covered terrace offering partial sea views.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property overlooks the part and is located only 5 min walking distance to the center.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The roof was changed 5 years ago, along with new windows.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Well kept garden surrounds the property. &nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The center is 500 m away.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For the further information please contact our office in Split.&nbsp;</p>', '', '1333_House-Villa_0.jpg', '1333_House-Villa_1.jpg', '1333_House-Villa_2.jpg', '1333_House-Villa_3.jpg', '1333_House-Villa_4.jpg', '1333_House-Villa_5.jpg', '1333_House-Villa_6.jpg', '1333_House-Villa_7.jpg', '1333_House-Villa_8.jpg'),
(1334, 'Andrej ', 'Grgièeviæ', '', '0981761014', '', 'Hvar', 'Vrboska', 'For sale', 'Old stone house', '50', '100', '110', 1, '250000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 3, 1, 'August 26, 2015', '<p>Stara kamena kuæa s vrtom na mirnoj lokaciji, blizu mora i pla¾a, u centru mjesta.&nbsp;Udaljena je od mora samo 50 m.&nbsp;Sastoji se od prizemlja i kata, ukupne stambene povr&scaron;ine 100 m2.&nbsp;Zemlji&scaron;te ima povr&scaron;inu 400 m2.&nbsp;Kuæa je useljiva.&nbsp;Potrebna adaptacija (novi namje&scaron;taj, ploèice).</p>\r\n<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;">CIJENA SNI®ENA SA 300.000 EURO!!</span></p>', '<p>We are pleased to offer this old stone house with a garden in a quiet location, close to the sea in the centre of this typical Dalmatian village on the North Side of the island.&nbsp;The distance from the shore is only 50 m.&nbsp;It consists of two floors, with a total floor area of 100 m2, and sits on asubstantial land plot of 400 m2. The house is habitable, but a new owner would probably take the view it needs complete renovation (new furniture, tiles).&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;">PRICE REDUCED FROM 300.000 EURO!!</span></p>', '', '<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;"><strong>CIJENA SNI®ENA SA 300.000 EURO!!</strong></span></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Stara kamena kuæa s vrtom na mirnoj lokaciji, blizu mora i pla¾a, u centru mjesta.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Udaljena je od mora samo 50 m.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sastoji se od prizemlja i kata, ukupne stambene povr&scaron;ine 100 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Zemlji&scaron;te ima povr&scaron;inu 400 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je useljiva.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Potrebna adaptacija (novi namje&scaron;taj, ploèice).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Udaljenost od trajektne luke iznosi 4km, a do katamarana i hydroaviona 2 km.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Svi potrebni sadr¾aji se nalaze u blizini.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Molimo za dodatne informacije kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured.</p>', '<p><strong><span style="text-decoration: underline;">PRICE REDUCED FROM 300.000 EURO!!</span><br /></strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>We are pleased to offer this old stone house with a garden in a quiet location, close to the sea in the centre of this typical Dalmatian village on the North Side of the island.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The distance from the shore is only 50 m.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It consists of two floors, with a total floor area of 100 m2, and sits on a substantial land plot of 400 m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house is habitable, but a new owner would probably take the view it needs complete renovation (new furniture, tiles).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is conveniently situated close to the village shops, bars and cafe,while the distance to the ferry port is 4 km, and less to the sea plane terminal at Jelsa.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For further information contact our office, and to arrange a visit to the property.</p>', '', '1334_Old-stone-house_0.jpg', '1334_Old-stone-house_1.jpg', '1334_Old-stone-house_2.jpg', '1334_Old-stone-house_3.jpg', '1334_Old-stone-house_4.jpg', '1334_Old-stone-house_5.jpg', '1334_Old-stone-house_6.jpg', '1334_Old-stone-house_7.jpg', '1334_Old-stone-house_8.jpg'),
(1335, 'Miho', 'Nik¹a', '', '', '', 'Hvar', 'Sveta Nedjelja', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '200', '1000', '100', 1, '280000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 0, 0, 'August 26, 2015', '<p>Kuæa na jedinstvenoj lokaciji, na ju¾noj strani otoka Hvara.&nbsp;Kuæa ima predivan pogled na more i zalazak sunca, a nalazi se na samoj litici.&nbsp;Objekt je legaliziran, zahtijeva renovaciju.&nbsp;Kuæa ima ukupnu stambenu povr&scaron;inu od 100 m2, dok je povr&scaron;ina zemlji&scaron;ta 1000 m2.&nbsp;Udaljenost od mora iznosi 200 m.&nbsp;Voda i struja se nalaze na parceli.&nbsp;Kuæa ima pristup vozilom te parking.</p>', '<p>This property is a real gem.&nbsp;It is situated in a unique and dramatic location, on the South side of the island of Hvar, on top of a cliff with stunning views of the sea and the evening sunset. The property requires renovation inside, but it has the potential to be one of the premium buildings on the island, despite it not being a huge building. It has great investment potential. The house has a total surface of 100 m2, while the land area of 1000 m2.&nbsp;Distance from the sea is 200 m.</p>', '', '<p>Kuæa na jedinstvenoj lokaciji, na ju¾noj strani otoka Hvara.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa ima predivan pogled na more i zalazak sunca, a nalazi se na samoj litici.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Objekt je legaliziran, zahtijeva renovaciju.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa ima ukupnu stambenu povr&scaron;inu od 100 m2, dok je povr&scaron;ina zemlji&scaron;ta 1000 m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Udaljenost od mora iznosi 200 m.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Voda i struja se nalaze na parceli.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa ima pristup vozilom te parking.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Udaljenost od veæeg grada iznosi cca 10 km, a do trajektne luke 15 km.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Pod selom je dojmljiva pla¾a, a u okolici se nalaze brojne &scaron;ljunèane pla¾e i skrovite uvale.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Molimo za sve dodatne informacije kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured.</p>', '<p>This property is a real gem.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is situated in a unique and dramatic location, on the South side of the island of Hvar, on top of a cliff with stunning views of the sea and the evening sunset.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property requires renovation inside, but it has the potential to be one of the premium buildings on the island, despite it not being a huge building.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It has great investment potential.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house has a total surface of 100 m2, while the land area of 1000 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Distance from the sea is 200 m, and there is a footpath down to the water''s edge, where there are many pebble beaches, and hidden coves with the clear sea water the island is famous for.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Water and electricity are on the plot.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house has private and secure car parking.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Distance from the nearest town is about 10 km, to the ferry port 15 km, and there is also a Sea plane connection to/from Split.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For further information contact our office and speak to one of our agents about visiting this property.</p>', '', '1335_House-Villa_0.JPG', '1335_House-Villa_1.jpg', '1335_House-Villa_2.jpg', '1335_House-Villa_3.jpg', '1335_House-Villa_4.jpg', '1335_House-Villa_5.jpg', '1335_House-Villa_6.jpg', '1335_House-Villa_7.JPG', '1335_House-Villa_8.JPG'),
(1336, 'Kathleen', 'Vitasovich', '', '00649 8386536', 'vv444@slingshot.co.nz', 'Makarska', 'Drvenik', 'For sale', 'Land plot', '20', '2104', '0', 1, '841600', '', 2, 2, 2, 1, 1, 2, 0, 0, 'August 26, 2015', '<p>Zemlji&scaron;te u T2 zoni u prvom redu do mora.&nbsp;U malom mjestu 30 km od Makarske prodajemo zemlji&scaron;te u T2 zoni (ugostiteljsko-turistièka namjena) s prekrasnim pogledom na more.&nbsp;Povr&scaron;ina zemlji&scaron;ta iznosi 2104 m2.&nbsp;Pristupni put i infrastruktura odmah uz parcelu.&nbsp;UPU za zonu jo&scaron; nije done&scaron;en.<br /><br /></p>', '<p>Land in T2 zone, first line to the sea.&nbsp;The land plot measures 2104m sq.&nbsp;30 km from Makarska we have this seafont land for sale. It is located in the T2 zone, designed for the development of accomodation facilities to tourists (no residential construction allowed).&nbsp;Access road and infrastructure immediately next to the plot.&nbsp;Detailed urbanistic plan for the zone is not completed.&nbsp;South oriented.</p>', '', '<p>Zemlji&scaron;te u T2 zoni u prvom redu do mora.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U malom mjestu 30 km od Makarske prodajemo zemlji&scaron;te u T2 zoni (ugostiteljsko-turistièka namjena) s prekrasnim pogledom na more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Povr&scaron;ina zemlji&scaron;ta iznosi 2104 m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Pristupni put i infrastruktura odmah uz parcelu.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>UPU za zonu jo&scaron; nije done&scaron;en.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Meðunarodni aerodrom u Splitu je udaljen 110 km.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Molimo za dodatne informacije kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured u Splitu.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>Land in T2 zone, first line to the sea.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The land plot measures 2104m sq.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>30 km from Makarska we have this seafont land for sale.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is located in the T2 zone, designed for the development of accomodation facilities to tourists (no residential construction allowed).&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Access road and infrastructure immediately next to the plot.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Detailed urbanistic plan for the zone is not completed. &nbsp; &nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>South oriented.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Split international airport is 110 km away. &nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For the further information please contact our office in Split.</p>', '', '1336_Land-plot_0.jpg', '1336_Land-plot_1.jpg', '1336_Land-plot_2.jpg', '1336_Land-plot_3.jpg', '', '', '', '', ''),
(1337, 'Miro', 'Juri¹iæ (Nik¹a)', '', '', '', 'Hvar', 'Ivan Dolac, Hvar', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '10', '0', '45', 1, '157000', '', 2, 1, 2, 1, 1, 2, 1, 1, 'August 27, 2015', '<p>Stanovi u novogradnji, na jedinstvenoj lokaciji, u prvom redu do mora.&nbsp;Nalaze se na ju¾noj strani otoka Hvara, nadomak &scaron;ljunèanoj pla¾i. Imaju pogled na otvoreno more.&nbsp;Stan na prvom katu ima povr&scaron;inu 45 m2, a sastoji se od sobe, kuhinje, blagavonice, dnevnog boravak i balkona.&nbsp;Pripada mu jedno parking mjesto.</p>', '<p>We have this apartment in a unique location above the beach on the south side of Hvar Island.&nbsp;The floor area is 45m sq and is laid out with an open plan living/kitchen area, bathroom and toilet and with one bedroom. Opening windows in the lounge lead to the balcony which overlooks the pebble beach immediately in front of the building.&nbsp;It is well decorated and has a modern kitchen and bathroom. There is a private parking place with this apartment.</p>', '', '<p>Stanovi u novogradnji, na jedinstvenoj lokaciji, u prvom redu do mora.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nalaze se na ju¾noj strani otoka Hvara, nadomak &scaron;ljunèanoj pla¾i.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Imaju pogled na otvoreno more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Stan na prvom katu ima povr&scaron;inu 45 m2, a sastoji se od sobe, kuhinje, blagavonice, dnevnog boravak i balkona.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Pripada mu jedno parking mjesto.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Mjesto je udaljeno 20 km od trajektne luke.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U mjestu postoji mala samoposluga i nekoliko restorana.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Osim dobrim vinima, mjesto se ponosi i èistim okoli&scaron;em, punim aromatiènog bilja, te ostalom mediteranskom florom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Molimo za sve dodatne informacije kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured.</p>', '<p>Price 157k euro</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>We have this apartment in a unique location above the beach on the south side of Hvar Island.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The floor area is 45m sq and is laid out with an open plan living/kitchen area, bathroom and toilet and with one bedroom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Opening windows in the lounge lead to the balcony which overlooks the pebble beach immediately in front of the building.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is well decorated and has a modern kitchen and bathroom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There is a private parking place with this apartment.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The local area has a good selection of useful shops, bars, restaurants and other services and there is good access to the mainland and Split from the island.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact our office for more information and to arrange to visit this property.</p>', '', '1337_Apartment_0.jpg', '1337_Apartment_1.jpg', '1337_Apartment_2.jpg', '1337_Apartment_3.jpg', '1337_Apartment_4.jpg', '1337_Apartment_5.jpg', '1337_Apartment_6.jpg', '1337_Apartment_7.jpg', '1337_Apartment_8.jpg'),
(1338, 'Miro', 'Juri¹iæ (Nik¹a)', '', '', '', 'Hvar', 'Ivan Dolac, Hvar', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '10', '0', '120', 1, '299000', '', 2, 1, 2, 1, 1, 2, 2, 1, 'August 27, 2015', '<p>Stanovi u novogradnji, na jedinstvenoj lokaciji, u prvom redu do mora.&nbsp;Nalaze se na ju¾noj strani otoka Hvara, nadomak &scaron;ljunèanoj pla¾i. Imaju pogled na otvoreno more.&nbsp;Stan na drugom katu prodaje se sa tavanom/ krov (120 m2).&nbsp;Pripadaju mu 2 parking mjesta.</p>', '<p>We are pleased to offer this apartment situated in a unique location high above the beach on the south side of Hvar Island. The main floor area is 45m sq but there is access to a large habitable roof area which adds 120m sq which makes this a substantial property. It has an open plan family living area, with a kitchen and a lounge with large sliding windows leading onto a balcony overlooking the sea and beach. It has one bedroom and stairs leading up to the larger sleeping area above.</p>', '', '<p>Stanovi u novogradnji, na jedinstvenoj lokaciji, u prvom redu do mora.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nalaze se na ju¾noj strani otoka Hvara, nadomak &scaron;ljunèanoj pla¾i.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Imaju pogled na otvoreno more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Stan na drugom katu prodaje se sa tavanom/ krov (120 m2).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Pripadaju mu 2 parking mjesta.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Mjesto je udaljeno 20 km od trajektne luke.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U mjestu postoji mala samoposluga i nekoliko restorana.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Osim dobrim vinima, mjesto se ponosi i èistim okoli&scaron;em, punim aromatiènog bilja, te ostalom mediteranskom florom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Molimo za sve dodatne informacije kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured.</p>', '<p>Price 299k euro</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>We are pleased to offer this apartment situated in a unique location high above the beach on the south side of Hvar Island.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The main floor area is 45m sq but there is access to a large habitable roof area which adds 120m sq which makes this a substantial property.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It has an open plan family living area, with a kitchen and a lounge with large sliding windows leading onto a balcony overlooking the sea and beach.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It has one bedroom and stairs leading up to the larger sleeping area above.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property is used for letting to tourists and has been well maintained and ready for this use to be continued.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There are two private parking spaces with this property.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The village caters well for visitors and the long term residents, with options for food shops, bars and restaurants and other services.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There isgood access to the mainland and Split from the island.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact our office to arrange to visit this property.</p>', '', '1338_Apartment_0.jpg', '1338_Apartment_1.jpg', '1338_Apartment_2.jpg', '1338_Apartment_3.jpg', '1338_Apartment_4.jpg', '1338_Apartment_5.jpg', '1338_Apartment_6.jpg', '1338_Apartment_7.jpg', '1338_Apartment_8.jpg'),
(1339, 'Vladimir', 'Ivanoviæ', '', '098 227085', 'vladimir.ivanovic@ivanal.hr', 'Sibenik', 'Lozovac, Skradin', 'For sale', 'Land plot', '0', '170000', '0', 1, '99999999', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 0, 0, 'August 27, 2015', '<p>Svega 13 km od &Scaron;ibenika na prodaju nudimo ovo veliko zemlji&scaron;te povr&scaron;ine 170.000 m2. Parcela se nalazi u zoni T1/T2 ugostiteljsko-turistièke namjene za izgradnju hotela/apartmanskog naselja, iskljuèivo u turistièke svrhe.&nbsp;Sva infrastruktura prisutna je na terenu-cesta, voda, kanalizacija, struja (4.400 kW/h) i telefon.&nbsp;Postojeæa tvornièka zgrada treba biti sru&scaron;ena, za &scaron;to postoji projekt uklanjanja. Investitor mo¾e profitirati od priznavanja komunalnih doprinosa sadr¾anih u volumenu postojeæeg objekta.&nbsp;<br /><br /></p>', '<p>Only 13 km from Sibenik town we have this vast plot of land for sale, sized 170.000 sqm. The plot is located within the designated T1/T2 zone for hotel/apartment development, solely for touristic purposes.&nbsp;All infrastructure is already there &ndash; access road, water, sewage, electricity (4.400 kW/h) and telephone.&nbsp;A former factory on the site needs to be demolished (a project of removal exists).&nbsp;<br /><br /></p>', '', '<p>Svega 13 km od &Scaron;ibenika na prodaju nudimo ovo veliko zemlji&scaron;te povr&scaron;ine 170.000 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Parcela se nalazi u zoni T1/T2 ugostiteljsko-turistièke namjene za izgradnju hotela/apartmanskog naselja, iskljuèivo u turistièke svrhe.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sva infrastruktura prisutna je na terenu &ndash; cesta, voda, kanalizacija, struja (4.400 kW/h) i telefon.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Postojeæa tvornièka zgrada treba biti sru&scaron;ena, za &scaron;to postoji projekt uklanjanja.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Investitor mo¾e profitirati od priznavanja komunalnih doprinosa sadr¾anih u volumenu postojeæeg objekta.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Detaljni urbanistièki plan za cijelu zonu treba biti done&scaron;en prije ikakve gradnje, iako su osnovni koeficijenti izgradnje veæ zadani.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nekretnina je izvrsno poziciionirana blizu autoceste, &Scaron;ibenika, manje od sata vo¾nje do zraène luke Split te pred vratima nacionalnog parka Krka.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Cijena na upit.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sve daljnje informacije iskljuèivo osobno u na&scaron;em uredu.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>Only 13 km from Sibenik town we have this vast plot of land for sale, sized 170.000 sqm.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The plot is located within the designated T1/T2 zone for hotel/apartment development, solely for touristic purposes.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>All infrastructure is already there &ndash; access road, water, sewage, electricity (4.400 kW/h) and telephone.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>A former factory on the site needs to be demolished (a project of removal exists).&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Developer can benefit from paying less communal contibuations as the volume of the old buildings would be acknowledged into the calculation.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>A detailed urbanistic place for the entire zone has to be brought before any development, but we already have basic building coefficients available.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The site is perfectly positioned near the highway, close to Sibenik town, less than an hour away from Split international airport and at the gates of Krka national park!&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Price on request.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>More information in person only. &nbsp;</p>', '', '1339_Land-plot_0.jpg', '1339_Land-plot_1.jpg', '1339_Land-plot_2.jpg', '1339_Land-plot_3.jpg', '1339_Land-plot_4.jpg', '1339_Land-plot_5.jpg', '', '', ''),
(1340, 'Ivan ', 'Bertoviæ', '385 99 4083 379,  +971 5045 39 800', '+385 98 245 828', 'kbertovic@gmail.com', 'Zadar', 'Stara Ulica br.8 Kali, Ugljan, 157/1', 'For sale', 'Old stone house', '150', '0', '75', 1, '105000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 3, 2, 'August 27, 2015', '<p>Novo-adaptirana tradicionalna dalmatinska kamena kuæa s prekrasnim pogledom na more na otoku Ugljanu.&nbsp;Kuæa ima ukupnu povrsinu 95 m2. Unutra&scaron;njost ove tradicionalne kuce, povrsine 75m2, pru¾a vlasniku komforni smje&scaron;taj u moderno ureðenom prostoru. Meðutim, prava arhitektonska "poslastica" nalazi se na krovu kuæe kao terasa povr&scaron;ine 20 m2 koja pruza pogled na Zadar i okolicu od kojeg zastaje dah.&nbsp;Kuæa se sastoji od 3 nivoa.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>This is a newly renovated old stone house (typical for Dalmatia) with a beautiful sea view on Ugljan Island.&nbsp;The internal living space is 75sqm with a 20sqm terrace on the roof top with an open view to Zadar and the coast.&nbsp;The house is made of 3 levels.&nbsp;On the roof level there is a terrace with the storage space. Since the property is on the top of the hill you will have a full privacy while having an open view to the blue Adriatic. House is fully furnished with appliances and furniture that have been only used few days in a year.</p>', '', '<p>Novo-adaptirana tradicionalna dalmatinska kamena kuæa s prekrasnim pogledom na more na otoku Ugljanu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa ima ukupnu povr&scaron;inu 95 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Unutra&scaron;njost ove tradicionalne kuce, povr&scaron;ine 75m2, pru¾a vlasniku komforni smje&scaron;taj u moderno ureðenom prostoru.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Meðutim, prava arhitektonska "poslastica" nalazi se na krovu kuæe kao terasa povr&scaron;ine 20 m2 koja pru¾a pogled na Zadar i okolicu od kojeg zastaje dah.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa se sastoji od 3 nivoa.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Prizemlje kuæe koje èine kuhinja, dnevni boravak i blagavaonica (otvoreni plan) te moderno ureðena kupaonica sa WC-om.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kutna sjedeæa garnitura u dnevnom boravku jednostavno se pretvara u le¾aj za dvoje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na prvom katu kuæe, do kojega vode unutra&scaron;nje drvene stepenice, nalazi se prostor koji se mo¾e koristiti kao djeèja soba (krevet na kat) ili kao jo&scaron; jedan manji dnevni boravak ili lounge prostor.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Iz navedenog prostora ulazi se u spavaæu sobu (klimatizirana) opremljenu king-size krevetom i ormarom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Spavaæa soba ima vlastitu kupaonicu i WC.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Drvene stepenice vode dalje na krovnu terasa te manje spremi&scaron;te za ro&scaron;tilj, suncobran, stol, stolice i le¾aljke.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Buduæi je kuæa smje&scaron;tena na uzvisini, pogled sa terase je nesmetan, a privatnost zajamèena.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je potpuno namje&scaron;tena, a namje&scaron;taj i postojeæi kuæanski aparati ulaze u cijenu objekta.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Namje&scaron;taj i ureðaji su kori&scaron;teni iznimno malo.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Molimo za dodatne informacije kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured u Splitu.</p>', '<p>This is a newly renovated old stone house (typical for Dalmatia) with a beautiful sea view on Ugljan Island.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The internal living space is 75sqm with a 20sqm terrace on the roof top with an open view to Zadar and the coast.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house is made of 3 levels.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The ground floor is consisted of a living and a dining room together with a kitchen (in an open plan) and a nice modern bathroom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The sofa in the living room can be converted into a double bed.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the first floor there is a foyer that can be used as a family room or a kids room (bunk beds) and a master bedroom (A/C) with an en-suite bathroom.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the roof level there is a terrace with the storage space.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Since the property is on the top of the hill you will have a full privacy while having an open view to the blue Adriatic.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The terrace is equipped with a small BBQ, sunshade and a table with chairs for 4.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>House is fully furnished with appliances and furniture that have been only used few days in a year.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For the further information please contact our office in Split.</p>', '', '1340_Old-stone-house_0.jpg', '1340_Old-stone-house_1.jpg', '1340_Old-stone-house_2.jpg', '1340_Old-stone-house_3.jpg', '1340_Old-stone-house_4.jpg', '1340_Old-stone-house_5.jpg', '1340_Old-stone-house_6.jpg', '1340_Old-stone-house_7.jpg', '1340_Old-stone-house_8.jpg'),
(1341, '', 'Boris', '', '', '', 'Brac', '©krip', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '2000', '580', '190', 1, '350000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 1, 4, 2, 'August 28, 2015', '<p>Predstavljamo Vam ovu lijepu obiteljsku kuæu sa bazenom, smje&scaron;tenu na sjevernoj strani otoka Braèa.&nbsp;Buduæi da je kuæa smje&scaron;tena na uzvisini, nudi izvrstan otvoreni pogled na more. Na prostranoj parceli povr&scaron;ine 800 m2 smjestila se kuæa stambene povr&scaron;ine 190 m2. Trenutno je podijeljena na dva stana &ndash; svaki zauzima po jednu eta¾u kuæe.&nbsp;Lijep i odr¾avan vrt, zasaðen oleandrima i voækama okru¾uje posjed, a u dvori&scaron;tu se nalazi bazen od 35 m2, sauna te ljetna kuhinja sa vanjskim ro&scaron;tiljem.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>We are very pleased to have this spacious family house with swimming pool at a very realistic price.&nbsp;This property sits on a large land plot, of 800m2 and the living area inside is 190m2. The property is currently split into two separate apartments.&nbsp;The gardens are extensive, and well-kept with fruit trees, and oleanders surrounding the patio that has a large swimming pool (35m&sup2;/almost 400ft&sup2;).&nbsp;Both residences are fully furnished with furniture, a fully equipped.&nbsp;The inside of the house is well decorated and the property modernised to a high standard.</p>', '', '<p>Predstavljamo Vam ovu lijepu obiteljsku kuæu sa bazenom, smje&scaron;tenu na sjevernoj strani otoka Braèa.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Buduæi da je kuæa smje&scaron;tena na uzvisini, nudi izvrstan otvoren pogled na more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na prostranoj parceli povr&scaron;ine 800 m2 smjestila se kuæa stambene povr&scaron;ine 190 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Trenutno je podijeljena na dva stana &ndash; svaki zauzima po jednu eta¾u kuæe.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Svaki stan ima zaseban ulaz, a sastoji se od dnevnog boravka, spremi&scaron;ta, kihunje, kupaonice, dvije spavaæe sobe i terase.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Objekt sadr¾i i gara¾u sa vinskim podrumom, a u dvori&scaron;tu ima pet parkirali&scaron;nih mjesta.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Lijep i odr¾avan vrt, zasaðen oleandrima i voækama okru¾uje posjed, a u dvori&scaron;tu se nalazi bazen od 35 m2, sauna te ljetna kuhinja sa vanjskim ro&scaron;tiljem.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Oba stana su u potpunosti opremljena i klimatizirana.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Mjesto je izvan popularnih turistièkih odredi&scaron;ta i nudi mir, &scaron;arm i tradiciju Mediterana.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Umjestu postoje osnovni sadr¾aji, a grad Supetar udaljen je 10 minuta vo¾nje automobilom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za dodatne informacije molimo kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured u Splitu.</p>', '<p>We are very pleased to have this spacious family house with swimming pool at a very realistic price.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property is situated away from the shore on Brac Island, facing the mainland.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The plot is on elevated land, affording commanding and dynamic views across the sea, and is 10 minutes by car to the nearest town.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>This property sits on a large land plot, of 800m2 and the living area inside is 190m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property is currently split into two separate apartments, - ground and first floor.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Both have their own entrance, so there is a total of 2 living rooms, 2 kitchens, 2 utility rooms, 2 bathrooms with each a shower, toilet and washing machine each, and 4 bedrooms (2 double and 2 with two single beds).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Each apartment boasts its own spacious terrace.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The area of each apartment consists of 95m&sup2; (total area from the whole villa is 190m&sup2;).&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There is also a sizeable underground garage or wine cellar; and private and secure parking for 5 cars.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The gardens are extensive, and well-kept with fruit trees, and oleanders surrounding the patio that has a large swimming pool (35m&sup2;/almost 400ft&sup2;).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There is also a great summer/outdoor kitchen with BBQ and sauna in the garden.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Both residences are fully furnished with furniture, a fully equipped kitchen, bathroom, beds, cupboards, garden furniture, sun loungers, large marble table with marble benches in the garden.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Each apartment is equipped with satellite TV, Wi-Fi and air conditioning.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The inside of the house is well decorated and the property modernised to a high standard.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The area is off the most popular tourist routes, so peace and traditional charm is guaranteed in this ancient village.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There are basic shops, with many more options down the valley in seaside villages and the ferry terminal port of Supetar, as well as a family run coffee shop and bar.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact our office to arrange to visit this property.</p>', '', '1341_House-Villa_0.jpg', '1341_House-Villa_1.jpg', '1341_House-Villa_2.jpg', '1341_House-Villa_3.jpg', '1341_House-Villa_4.jpg', '1341_House-Villa_5.jpg', '1341_House-Villa_6.jpg', '1341_House-Villa_7.jpg', '1341_House-Villa_8.jpg'),
(1342, '', 'Rakiæ', '', '', '', 'Primosten', 'Dolac, Primo¹ten', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '80', '2400', '370', 1, '700000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 0, 0, 'August 28, 2015', '<p>Prodaje se kuæa u Primo&scaron;tenu s prekrasnim pogledom na more.&nbsp;Kuæa se nalazi na odliènoj lokaciji, jugozapadne orijentacije sa &scaron;irokim pogledom na more i puèinu.&nbsp;Kvalitetna graðevina na tri eta¾e ukupne stambene povr&scaron;ine 370 m2.&nbsp;Kuæa se nalazi na velikom zemlji&scaron;tu povr&scaron;ine 2400 m2 (1300 m2 kuæa i dvor + 900 m2 graðevinskog zemlji&scaron;ta) &scaron;to predstavlja dodatni investicijski potencijal za gradnju jo&scaron; jedne vi&scaron;estambene ili obiteljske zgrade.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>We are pleased to have this substantial villa in a prime location on the mainland near Primosten, with beautiful sea views.&nbsp;The house is situated 80m from the shore, which here is a mixture of fine gravel beaches and rocks, on a south-west orientation with a wide view of the bay and the open sea.&nbsp;It is a high quality building on three floors with a total floor area of 370 m2. The house is situated on a large plot of 2400 m2, which could represent an additional investment should the owner wish to expand this property.</p>', '', '<p>Prodaje se kuæa u Primo&scaron;tenu s prekrasnim pogledom na more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa se nalazi na odliènoj lokaciji, jugozapadne orijentacije sa &scaron;irokim pogledom na more i puèinu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kvalitetna graðevina na tri eta¾e ukupne stambene povr&scaron;ine 370 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sastoji se od èetiri jednosobna, dva dvosobna, jednog trosobnog i jednog manjeg dograðenog apartmana obraðenog klesanim kamenom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa se nalazi na velikom zemlji&scaron;tu povr&scaron;ine 2400 m2 (1300 m2 kuæa i dvor + 900 m2 graðevinskog zemlji&scaron;ta) &scaron;to predstavlja dodatni investicijski potencijal za gradnju jo&scaron; jedne vi&scaron;estambene ili obiteljske zgrade.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Udaljenost od mora i pla¾e 80 metara.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Molimo za sve dodatne informacije kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured u Splitu.</p>', '<p>We are pleased to have this substantial villa in a prime location on the mainland near Primosten, with beautiful sea views.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house is situated 80m from the shore, which here is a mixture of fine gravel beaches and rocks, on a south-west orientation with a wide view of the bay and the open sea.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is a high quality building on three floors with a total floor area of 370 m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It consists of four separate apartments: one-bedroom, two-bedroom, one three-bedroom and a smaller apartment.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house is situated on a large plot of 2400 m2 (1300 m2 is the land plot with this house on plus 900 m2 additional building land), which could represent an additional investment should the owner wish to expand this property.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property is well maintained and has an attractive garden which has been landscaped and gives the owners great pleasure.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Split town is 40 mins drive, and getting to the airport is 20 mins drive, if the roads are clear.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact the office to arrange to visit this property.</p>', '', '1342_House-Villa_0.JPG', '1342_House-Villa_1.JPG', '1342_House-Villa_2.JPG', '1342_House-Villa_3.JPG', '1342_House-Villa_4.JPG', '1342_House-Villa_5.JPG', '1342_House-Villa_6.JPG', '1342_House-Villa_7.JPG', '1342_House-Villa_8.JPG'),
(1343, '', 'Rakiæ', '', '', '', 'Rogoznica', 'Kopara 2.red', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '30', '0', '68', 1, '185000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 2, 1, 'August 28, 2015', '<p>Luksuzni apartman u drugom redu od mora.&nbsp;Nalazi se u starom dijelu Rogoznice u iznimno mirnoj lokaciji.&nbsp;Udaljen je od mora samo 30 m, nedaleko rive i za&scaron;tiæene &scaron;ume, koja ima dugu &scaron;etnicu uz more.&nbsp;Sastoji se od kuhinje, trpezarije i dnevne sobe, kupaonice, dvije spavaæe sobe, loðe i balkona.&nbsp;Ukupna stambena povr&scaron;ina apartmana iznosi 68 m2.&nbsp;Buduæi da apartman u potkrovlju ima visoke stropove, postoji moguænost izrade i treæe sobe.&nbsp;Apartman je opremljen prvoklasnim aparatima i namje&scaron;tajem.</p>', '<p>We are pleased to offer this well presented modern and spacious apartment close to the shore on the mainland near Rogoznica. This luxury apartment is in the second row of property from the sea, facing east, and situated in the old part of the village where it is very quiet. The total living area of the apartment is 68 m2. Since the apartment is on the top floor and has high ceilings, there is the possibility of utilising this space with an extra ''mezzanine'' floor.&nbsp;</p>', '', '<p>Luksuzni apartman u drugom redu od mora.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nalazi se u starom dijelu Rogoznice u iznimno mirnoj lokaciji.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Udaljen je od mora samo 30 m, nedaleko rive i za&scaron;tiæene &scaron;ume, koja ima dugu &scaron;etnicu uz more.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sastoji se od kuhinje, trpezarije i dnevne sobe, kupaonice, dvije spavaæe sobe, loðe i balkona.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ukupna stambena povr&scaron;ina apartmana iznosi 68 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Buduæi da apartman u potkrovlju ima visoke stropove, postoji moguænost izrade i treæe sobe.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartman je opremljen prvoklasnim aparatima i namje&scaron;tajem.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ima i podno grijanje na struju, te kamene ploèice na podu, elektriène rolete i tendu, mitshubishi klima ureðaj, vrhunsko kuhinjsko postrojenje, ugraðene instalacije za video nadzor i alarm itd.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Udaljenost od centra mjesta je 200 m.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Molimo za sve dodatne informacije kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured u Splitu.</p>', '<p>We are pleased to offer this well presented modern and spacious apartment close to the shore on the mainland near Rogoznica.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>This luxury apartment is in the second row of property from the sea, facing east, and situated in the old part of the village where it is very quiet.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The distance from the sea is only 30 m, where it is safe and clean to swim, and the plot is among native woodland and trees which surround the building and create a very private feel.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The apartment inside consists of a kitchen, dining room and living room, all in an open plan design, bathroom, two bedrooms, and a long wide balcony.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The total living area of the apartment is 68 m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Since the apartment is on the top floor and has high ceilings, there is the possibility of utilising this space with an extra ''mezzanine'' floor.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is equipped with first-class appliances and furniture, and many other features which make this an excellent property.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It has under floor heating, natural stone tiles, electric shutters, Mitsubishi air conditioning, premium kitchen facility, built-in installation of video surveillance and alarm, etc.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Distance from the town center is 200 m, where there is a selection of useful shops, bars, cafes and other useful services and attractions.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact our office to visit this property.</p>', '', '1343_Apartment_0.JPG', '1343_Apartment_1.JPG', '1343_Apartment_2.JPG', '1343_Apartment_3.JPG', '1343_Apartment_4.JPG', '1343_Apartment_5.JPG', '1343_Apartment_6.JPG', '1343_Apartment_7.JPG', '1343_Apartment_8.jpg'),
(1727, 'Ladislav i Silv', 'Feher', '0996868637', '031-736-447', 'Kljuc: Vlado 099 518 6290', 'Hvar', 'Vrboska', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '70', '750', '200', 1, '250000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 7, 7, 'June 27, 2016', '<p>Samostojeæa apartmanska kuæa, udaljena od mora samo 70 m.&nbsp;Sastoji se od prizemlja, prvog i drugog kata ukupne stambene povr&scaron;ine 200 m2, a smje&scaron;tena je na parceli od 750 m2.&nbsp;Kuæa ima pristup autom te parking mjesto.&nbsp;Terase/balkoni su ju¾no orijentirani.&nbsp;Kuæa je useljiva.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>We are pleased to offer this detached house, just 70 m from the shore in a very quiet area of Hvar Island. The nearest village is Vrboska, a charming and typical unspoilt small Dalmatian fishing village on the north side of the island, facing towards the mainland.&nbsp;This a modern house, well designed for family holidays or its current use which is apartment holiday lettings. It has plenty of outside space and with light and spacious rooms.&nbsp;</p>', '', '<p>Samostojeæa apartmanska kuæa, udaljena od mora samo 70 m.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sastoji se od prizemlja, prvog i drugog kata ukupne stambene povr&scaron;ine 200 m2, a smje&scaron;tena je na parceli od 750 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Prizemlje se sastoji od studio apartmana, kuhinje, spreme i ostave.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ispod velike vanjske terase sa stolovima se nalazi dvokrevetni apartman sa kupaonicom i kuhinjom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na prvom katu su 2 dvokrevetna apartmana, a na drugom 3 dvokrevetna apartmana.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa ima pristup autom te parking mjesto.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Terase/balkoni su ju¾no orijentirani.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je useljiva.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za dodatne informacije molimo kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>We are pleased to offer this detached house, just 70 m from the shore in a very quiet area of Hvar Island.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The nearest village is Vrboska, a charming and typical unspoilt small Dalmatian fishing village on the north side of the island, facing towards the mainland.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>This a modern house, well designed for family holidays or its current use which is apartment holiday lettings.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It has plenty of outside space and with light and spacious rooms.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the ground floor, first and second floors there is a total floor area of 200 m2 and it is located on a large plot of 750 m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The ground floor consists of an independent studio apartment with kitchen, storage and utility room.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Below the large outdoor terrace is another two-bedroom apartment with a bathroom and kitchen.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the first floor are two 2-bedroom apartments.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the 3rd floor there are two 3-bedrooms apartments.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>House has car access and private parking off the public road.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The terraces and balconies are South oriented.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house is well decorated and has been well maintained, needing little immediate work or improvements for someone wanting to continue with the letting business.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For further information and to arrange a visit to the property, please contact our office.</p>', '', '1727_House-Villa_0.jpg', '1727_House-Villa_1.jpg', '1727_House-Villa_2.jpg', '1727_House-Villa_3.jpg', '1727_House-Villa_4.jpg', '1727_House-Villa_5.jpg', '1727_House-Villa_6.jpg', '1727_House-Villa_7.jpg', '1727_House-Villa_8.jpg'),
(1344, '', 'Rakiæ', '', '', '', 'Sibenik', 'Pirovac', 'For sale', 'Land plot', '800', '400', '0', 2, '20460', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 0, 0, 'August 28, 2015', '<p>Malo graðevinsko zemlji&scaron;te nedaleko &Scaron;ibenika, na mirnoj lokaciji.&nbsp;Zemlji&scaron;te je pravilnog oblika, ju¾ne orijentacije, blagog pada terena prema moru.&nbsp;Nalazi se uz asfaltni put sa svom komunalnom infrastrukturom.&nbsp;Idealno je za izgradnju obiteljske kuæe.&nbsp;Udaljeno je od mora 800 m.</p>', '<p>A small building plot in a village near Sibenik, in a quiet location. Land is the proper form, facing south, a slight decline in the waterfront. It is located along the asphalt road with all utilities infrastructure. It is ideal for a family house. It is 5 minutes walk to the sea - 800 m. Price &euro; 20,460</p>', '', '<p>Malo graðevinsko zemlji&scaron;te nedaleko &Scaron;ibenika, na mirnoj lokaciji.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Zemlji&scaron;te je pravilnog oblika, ju¾ne orijentacije, blagog pada terena prema moru.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nalazi se uz asfaltni put sa svom komunalnom infrastrukturom.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Idealno je za izgradnju obiteljske kuæe.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Udaljeno je od mora 800 m.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za dodatne informacije molimo kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured u Splitu.</p>', '<p>A small building plot in a village near Sibenik, in a quiet location.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Land is the proper form, facing south, a slight decline in the waterfront.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is located along the asphalt road with all utilities infrastructure.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is ideal for a family house.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is 5 minutes walk to the sea - 800 m.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Price &euro; 20,460</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact our office to visit this location.</p>', '', '1344_Land-plot_0.jpg', '1344_Land-plot_1.jpg', '1344_Land-plot_2.jpg', '1344_Land-plot_3.jpg', '', '', '', '', '');
INSERT INTO `nekretnina` (`id`, `ime`, `prezime`, `telefon`, `mobitel`, `e_mail`, `lokacija_id`, `adresa`, `status_id`, `vrsta_id`, `udaljenost`, `povrsina`, `stambenapovrsina`, `display`, `cijena`, `cijenatocka`, `ponuda_tjedna`, `new_built`, `must_sell`, `prvi_red_do_mora`, `pogled_na_more`, `bazen`, `broj_soba`, `broj_kupatila`, `datum`, `title_hr`, `title_en`, `title_ge`, `opis_hr`, `opis_en`, `opis_ge`, `PropertyImageURL0`, `PropertyImageURL1`, `PropertyImageURL2`, `PropertyImageURL3`, `PropertyImageURL4`, `PropertyImageURL5`, `PropertyImageURL6`, `PropertyImageURL7`, `PropertyImageURL8`) VALUES
(1345, '', 'Rakiæ', '', '', '', 'Zadar', 'Suko¹an', 'For sale', 'Land plot', '10', '679', '0', 1, '203700', '', 2, 2, 2, 1, 1, 2, 0, 0, 'August 28, 2015', '<p>Graðevinsko zemlji&scaron;te, prvi red do mora, u blizini Zadra. Zemlji&scaron;te ima povr&scaron;inu 679 m2.&nbsp;Ima pristup s javnog puta, a infrastruktura se nalazi u blizini. Ispred parcele se ureðuje &scaron;etnica uz more.&nbsp;Ovaj dio naselja je neizgraðen, ali komunalno opremljen, te se odmah mo¾e iæi na ishodavanje graðevinske dokumentacije.&nbsp;Na parceli propisno izgraðena gustirna i septièka jama (armatura, hidroizolacija). Cijena: 300eur/m2&nbsp;</p>', '<p>We are offering this building land, suitable for ''single unit development'' in the first row, near Zadar town. The land has an area of 679 m2 and has the advantage of being adjacent to a public road and with all the infrastructure services already close by. This part of town is still under developed but the construction documentation is easily available so building can start quickly. Price &euro;300/m2</p>', '', '<p>Graðevinsko zemlji&scaron;te, prvi red do mora, u blizini Zadra.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Zemlji&scaron;te ima povr&scaron;inu 679 m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ima pristup s javnog puta, a infrastruktura se nalazi u blizini.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ovaj dio naselja je neizgraðen, ali komunalno opremljen, te se odmah mo¾e iæi na ishodavanje graðevinske dokumentacije.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na parceli propisno izgraðena gustirna i septièka jama (armatura, hidroizolacija itd).&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ispred parcele se ureðuje &scaron;etnica uz more.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Vlasni&scaron;tvo uredno.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Cijena: 300eur/m2&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za sve dodatne informacije molimo kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured u Splitu.</p>', '<p>We are offering this building land, suitable for ''single unit development'' in the first row, near Zadar town.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The land has an area of 679 m2 and has the advantage of being adjacent to a public road and with all the infrastructure services already close by.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>This part of town is still under developed but the construction documentation is easily available so building can start quickly.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The plot already has a constructed water tank and septic tank (valves, insulation, etc.).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>In front of the plot is the shore and pebble beach but the area is being improved by creating a Riva walkway, which will become a path going to the village centre where there are several shops, bars and attractive family run cafes, just a few minutes walk from here.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Price &euro;300/m2</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact our office for more information, and to arrange to visit this location.</p>', '', '1345_Land-plot_0.jpg', '1345_Land-plot_1.jpg', '1345_Land-plot_2.jpg', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(1346, 'Janez', 'ZInrajh', '098 571 629, http://www.apartma-janez.hr/', '', 'janez.zinrajh@gmail.com', 'Brac', 'Molo Lozna III, br. 17 Postira, Kc 1221/174 ko postira', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '200', '380', '300', 1, '655000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 9, 6, 'August 28, 2015', '<p>Ova lijepa kuæa nalazi se sa sjeverne strane otoka Braèa i nudi spektakularan pogled na more zbog uzvi&scaron;ene pozicije. Centar mjesta je udaljen samo nekoliko minuta hoda, dok se mala &scaron;ljunèana pla¾a nalazi svega 200 metara od nekretnine. Susjedstvo je mirno i uredno. Kuæa je kategorizirana i donosi znaèajan prihod od turistièkog najma.&nbsp;Ukupna stambena povr&scaron;ina kuæe iznosi 300 m2, dok je zemlji&scaron;te povr&scaron;ine 380 m2.&nbsp;Cijela nekretnina se mo¾e kupiti za ogla&scaron;enu cijenu ili mo¾ete odabrati kupnju samo jedne od dolje navedenih eta¾a.</p>', '<p>This lovely house is located on the nothern side of Brac island and offers excellent open views onto the sea due to elevated position. The center of the village is minutes away on foot, while the charming pebble beach is only 200 meters from the property. It''s a quiet residential neighbourhood, neat and well presented. The property is categorized and brings substantial rental income.&nbsp;Total living area of the house is 300 m2, while the land plot measures 380 m2.</p>', '', '<p>Ova lijepa kuæa nalazi se sa sjeverne strane otoka Braèa i nudi spektakularan pogled na more zbog uzvi&scaron;ene pozicije.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Centar mjesta je udaljen samo nekoliko minuta hoda, dok se mala &scaron;ljunèana pla¾a nalazi svega 200 metara od nekretnine.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Susjedstvo je mirno i uredno. Kuæa je kategorizirana i donosi znaèajan prihod od turistièkog najma. &nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ukupna stambena povr&scaron;ina kuæe iznosi 300 m2, dok je zemlji&scaron;te povr&scaron;ine 380 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Prizemlje i prvi kat imaju sliènu strukturu, a svaka eta¾a se sastoji od dva stana &ndash; jednog dvosobnog i jednog jednosobnog, sa kupaonicom, kuhinjom/blagovaonicom, dnevnim prostorom i terasom ili balkonom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na zadnjem katu nalazi se veliki trosobni stan kojeg koristi vlasnik.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Cijela nekretnina se mo¾e kupiti za ogla&scaron;enu cijenu ili mo¾ete odabrati kupnju samo jedne od dolje navedenih eta¾a sa pripadajuæim cijenama:</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Prizemlje (2 stana): 220.000 EUR</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Prvi kat (2 stana): 220.000 EUR</strong></p>\r\n<p><strong><br /></strong></p>\r\n<p><strong>Stan na drugom katu sa gara¾om: 240.000 EUR<br /></strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za detaljnije informacije kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>This lovely house is located on the nothern side of Brac island and offers excellent open views onto the sea due to elevated position.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The center of the village is minutes away on foot, while the charming pebble beach is only 200 meters from the property.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It''s a quiet residential neighbourhood, neat and well presented.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property is categorized and brings substantial rental income.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Total living area of the house is 300 m2, while the land plot measures 380 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ground floor and first floor have similar structure, each containig two apartments &ndash; one 1-bedroom and one 2-bedroom apartment with bathroom, kitchen/dining area, living room and terrace or balcony.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the top floor there is a spatious penthouse used by the owner.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There is an option to buy the whole house for the listed price, or to buy the each floor separately, in case of which the following prices apply:&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Ground floor (2 apartments): 220.000 EUR</strong></p>\r\n<p><strong><br /></strong></p>\r\n<p><strong>First floor (2 apartments): 220.000 EUR</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Top floor apartment with the garage: 240.000 EUR</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact our office for more information.</p>', '', '1346_House-Villa_0.jpg', '1346_House-Villa_1.jpg', '1346_House-Villa_2.jpg', '1346_House-Villa_3.jpg', '1346_House-Villa_4.jpg', '1346_House-Villa_5.jpg', '1346_House-Villa_6.jpg', '1346_House-Villa_7.jpg', '1346_House-Villa_8.jpg'),
(1347, 'Janez', 'Zinarjh', '098 571 629, http://www.apartma-janez.hr/ ', '', 'janez.zinrajh@gmail.com', 'Brac', 'Molo Lozna III, br. 17 Postira, Kc 1221/174 ko postira', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '200', '0', '115', 1, '240000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 2, 2, 'August 28, 2015', '<p>Ovaj izvrstan stan nalazi se na zadnjem katu male zgrade sa sjeverne strane otoka Braèa i nudi spektakularan pogled na more. Centar mjesta je udaljen samo nekoliko minuta hoda, dok se mala &scaron;ljunèana pla¾a nalazi svega 200 metara od nekretnine. Susjedstvo je mirno i uredno. Stan se sastoji od hodnika, tri spavaæe sobe, kuponice, wc-a, kuhinje, blagovaonice sa dnevnim boravkom, terase i gara¾e, ukupne stambene povr&scaron;ine 115 m2.</p>', '<p>This lovely penthouse is located in a small building on the nothern side of Brac island and offers spectacular open views onto the sea. The center of the village is minutes away on foot, while the charming pebble beach is only 200 meters from the property. It''s a quiet residential neighbourhood, neat and well presented. Apartment consists of a hallway, three bedrooms, bathroom, toilet, kitchen, living and dining area, terrace and the garage, total living area of 115 m2.</p>', '', '<p>Ovaj izvrstan stan nalazi se na zadnjem katu male zgrade sa sjeverne strane otoka Braèa i nudi spektakularan pogled na more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Centar mjesta je udaljen samo nekoliko minuta hoda, dok se mala &scaron;ljunèana pla¾a nalazi svega 200 metara od nekretnine.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Susjedstvo je mirno i uredno.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Stan se sastoji od hodnika, tri spavaæe sobe, kuponice, wc-a, kuhinje, blagovaonice sa dnevnim boravkom,terase i gara¾e, ukupne stambene povr&scaron;ine 115 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za detaljnije informacije kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>This lovely penthouse is located in a small building on the nothern side of Brac island and offers spectacular open views onto the sea.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The center of the village is minutes away on foot, while the charming pebble beach is only 200 meters from the property.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It''s a quiet residential neighbourhood, neat and well presented.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartment consists of a hallway, three bedrooms, bathroom, toilet, kitchen, living and dining area, terrace and the garage, total living area of 115 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact our office for more information.</p>', '', '1347_Apartment_0.jpg', '1347_Apartment_1.jpg', '1347_Apartment_2.jpg', '1347_Apartment_3.jpg', '1347_Apartment_4.jpg', '1347_Apartment_5.jpg', '1347_Apartment_6.jpg', '1347_Apartment_7.jpg', '1347_Apartment_8.jpg'),
(1348, 'Vesna ', 'Prlenda', '', '091 338 0300', 'vesna.prlenda@gmail.com', 'Omis', 'Zavode II br. 2 Èeline &#8211; Lokva Rogoznica (Omi¹), k.è. 804/2 k.o. rogoznica', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '80', '350', '45', 1, '125000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 2, 1, 'August 28, 2015', '<p>Nudimo Vam ovu malu prizemnu kuæu na prodaju, smje&scaron;tenu svega 6 minuta vo¾nje od grada Omi&scaron;a, ispod glavne magistralne ceste. Nekretnina je udaljena 80 metara od mora i nudi lijepi pogled. Kuæa se sastoji od dvije spavaæe sobe, kupaonice te kuhinje sa blagovaonicom, ukupne stambene povr&scaron;ine 45 m2.&nbsp;Zemlji&scaron;te ima povr&scaron;inu 350 m2.&nbsp;Ispred objekta nalazi se prostrana poploèana terasa. &nbsp;</p>', '<p>We have this charming bungalow for sale, located a 6 min car ride from Omis town, below the main coastal road. The property is only 80 meters from the sea and features nice views. This little house contains two bedrooms, bathroom and kitchen with dining area, total living area of 45 m2.&nbsp;The land plot measures 350 m2.&nbsp;There is a large paved terrace in front, convenient for al-fresco dining, sunbathing or spending lazy afternoons watching the sunset.&nbsp;</p>', '', '<p>Nudimo Vam ovu malu prizemnu kuæu na prodaju, smje&scaron;tenu svega 6 minuta vo¾nje od grada Omi&scaron;a, ispod glavne magistralne ceste.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nekretnina je udaljena 80 metara od mora i nudi lijepi pogled.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa se sastoji od dvije spavaæe sobe, kupaonice te kuhinje sa blagovaonicom, ukupne stambene povr&scaron;ine 45 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Zemlji&scaron;te ima povr&scaron;inu 350 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ispred objekta nalazi se prostrana poploèana terasa. &nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za dodatne informacije molimo kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured u Splitu.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>We have this charming bungalow for sale, located a 6 min car ride from Omis town, below the main coastal road.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property is only 80 meters from the sea and features nice views.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>This little house contains two bedrooms, bathroom and kitchen with dining area, total living area of 45 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The land plot measures 350 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There is a large paved terrace in front, convenient for al-fresco dining, sunbathing or spending lazy afternoons watching the sunset.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Serious buyers are encouraged to place bid.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For the further information please contact our office in Split.</p>', '', '1348_House-Villa_0.jpg', '1348_House-Villa_1.jpg', '1348_House-Villa_2.jpg', '1348_House-Villa_3.jpg', '1348_House-Villa_4.jpg', '1348_House-Villa_5.jpg', '1348_House-Villa_6.jpg', '1348_House-Villa_7.jpg', ''),
(1349, '', 'Rakiæ', '', '', '', 'Zadar', 'Drage, Zadar', 'For sale', 'Land plot', '0', '8124', '0', 1, '1624800', '', 2, 2, 2, 1, 1, 2, 0, 0, 'September 4, 2015', '<p>Zemlji&scaron;te s prekrasnim pogledom na more, u blizini Zadra.&nbsp;Zemlji&scaron;te ima povr&scaron;inu 8124 m2.&nbsp;Nalazi se u zoni T3 -<span> </span>ugostiteljsko turistièka namjena &ndash; kamp.&nbsp;Planirana je postava smje&scaron;tajnih jedinica kampa (mobilne kuæice, kamp parcele i kamp mjesta) te prateæih sadr¾aja i sanitarnih èvorova.&nbsp;Izuzetna prilika za investiciju u mirnom podruèju.&nbsp;<span style="text-decoration: underline;">Nekretnina se nalazi u turistièkoj zoni, tj. nije dozvoljena gradnja stambenih objekata.&nbsp;</span></p>', '<p>We are pleased to be the agent for this extraordinary and unique land plot investment. This is a substantial plot of 8124m sq, located in the zone T3 - hospitality and tourism purposes. The plan is to have a &nbsp;Camp (mobile homes, camping pitches and camping sites) and supporting facilities and sanitary facilities built on this first line and quiet dramatic outcrop on the mainland shore near Zadar.&nbsp;<span style="text-decoration: underline;">The zone is designed for the development of accomodation facilities to tourists (no residential construction allowed).</span></p>', '', '<p>Zemlji&scaron;te s prekrasnim pogledom na more, u blizini Zadra.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Zemlji&scaron;te ima povr&scaron;inu 8124 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nalazi se u zoni T3 -<span> </span>ugostiteljsko turistièka namjena &ndash; kamp.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Planirana je postava smje&scaron;tajnih jedinica kampa (mobilne kuæice, kamp parcele i kamp mjesta) te prateæih sadr¾aja i sanitarnih èvorova.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;">Nekretnina se nalazi u turistièkoj zoni, tj. nije dozvoljena gradnja stambenih objekata.&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Izuzetna prilika za investiciju u mirnom podruèju.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Cijena: 200 &euro;/m2&nbsp;</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Meðunarodni aerodrom u Zadru udaljen je 38 km.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za sva dodatna pitanja molimo kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured u Splitu.</p>', '<p>We are pleased to be the agent for this extraordinary and unique land plot investment.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>This is a substantial plot of 8124m sq, located in the zone T3 - hospitality and tourism purposes - for a commercial camp.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;">The zone is designed for the development of accomodation facilities to tourists (no residential construction allowed).</span></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The plan is to have a Camp (mobile homes, camping pitches and camping&nbsp;&nbsp;sites) and supporting facilities and sanitary facilities built on this first line and quiet dramatic outcrop on the mainland shore near Zadar.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>This is a rare opportunity for investment with huge potential.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Price: 200 &euro; / m2&nbsp;</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The international airport of Zadar is 38 km.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For any questions, please contact our head office in Split, and speak to one of our agents.</p>', '', '1349_Land-plot_0.jpg', '1349_Land-plot_1.jpg', '1349_Land-plot_2.jpg', '1349_Land-plot_3.jpg', '1349_Land-plot_4.jpg', '1349_Land-plot_5.jpg', '1349_Land-plot_6.jpg', '1349_Land-plot_7.jpg', '1349_Land-plot_8.jpg'),
(1350, 'Nediljko', 'Gudelj', '', '099 738 9590', 'nglj.1957@gmail.com', 'Split', '©enoina 2a Split, ZU 3937 k.o. Split', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '300', '86', '210', 1, '415000', '', 1, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 6, 5, 'September 4, 2015', '<p>Ova &scaron;armantna vila nalazi se u jednoj od najstarijih stambenih èetvrti Splita &scaron;to je èini atraktivnom kako za ¾ivljenje tako i za turistièki najam.&nbsp;Nekretnina se veæ dvije godine uspje&scaron;no radi unajmljuje turistima i buduæem vlasniku osigurava znaèajan prihod. Ovaj uhodani posao sastoji se od 13 kreveta, a prodaje sa cjelokupnom opremon, namje&scaron;tajem i logistikom.&nbsp;Ova gradska dvojna kuæa ima pribli¾no 210 m2 stambenog prostora, rasporeðenog na tri eta¾e.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><span style="color: #fa0417; text-decoration: underline;">CIJENA SNI®ENA SA 525.000 EURO!</span></p>', '<p><strong><span>GREAT ESTIMATED RETURNS!&nbsp;</span></strong>This charming villa is located in an ancient residential quarter of Split city and has easy access to all year-round amenities. The property has been operating as a small hotel and offers substantial returns to the future owner. This established business with 13 beds is sold with all the funiture, contents and rental logistics.&nbsp;This semi-detached townhouse has approximately 210 sqm of the living space, spread accross three floors.</p>\r\n<p><span style="color: #fa041c; text-decoration: underline;">PRICE REDUCED FROM 525.000 EURO!</span></p>', '', '<p><span style="text-decoration: underline; color: #ff0000;"><strong>CIJENA SNI®ENA SA 525.000 EURO!</strong></span></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;"><strong>ODLIÈNE MOGUÆNOSTI POVRATA INVESTICIJA!!</strong></span></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ova &scaron;armantna vila nalazi se u jednoj od najstarijih stambenih èetvrti Splita i u¾iva lagan pristup cjelogodi&scaron;njim sadr¾ajima (restoranima, kafiæima, muzejima, javnom prijevozu, pla¾ama itd) &scaron;to je èini atraktivnom kako za ¾ivljenje tako i za turistièki najam.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nekretnina se veæ dvije godine uspje&scaron;no radi unajmljuje turistima i buduæem vlasniku osigurava znaèajan prihod.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ovaj uhodani posao sastoji se od 13 kreveta, a prodaje sa cjelokupnom opremon, namje&scaron;tajem i logistikom.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ova gradska dvojna kuæa ima pribli¾no 210 m2 stambenog prostora, rasporeðenog na tri eta¾e.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U prizemlju se nalaze dva stana, svaki sa jednom spavaæom sobom, kupaonicom i kuhinjom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na jednog od njih naslanja se konoba sa vinskim podrumom u kojem se mo¾e vidjeti izvorni kameni zid temelja.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na prvom katu kuæe nalaze se takoðer dva stana, od kojih svaki sadr¾i dnevni prostor, spavaæu sobu, kuhinju i kupaonicu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Cijeli zadnji kat kuæe zauzima prostrani dvosobni stan.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Pokraj objekta nalazi se mala terasa, kao zejdnièki vanjski prostor za odmor i dru¾enje stanara/gostiju.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nekretnina je jedna od rijetkih u starom dijelu grada sa pristupom automobilima. &nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za dodatne informacije molimo kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured u Splitu.</p>', '<p><span style="text-decoration: underline; color: #ff0000;"><strong>PRICE REDUCED FROM 525.000 EURO!</strong></span></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;"><strong><span style="text-decoration: underline;">GREAT ESTIMATED RETURNS!</span><br /></strong></span></p>\r\n<p><br style="color: #fb0321;" /></p>\r\n<p>This charming villa is located in an ancient residential quarter of Split city and has easy access to all year-round amenities: numerous restaurants, bars, museums, public transport, beaches etc.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property has been operating as a small hotel and offers substantial returns to the future owner.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>This established business with 13 beds is sold with all the funiture, contents and rental logistics.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>This semi-detached townhouse has approximately 210 sqm of the living space, spread accross three floors.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the ground floor there are 2 units, each containing one bedroom, bathrom and kitchenette.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Adjacent to one of them, there is a wine cellar in its original stone walls.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>First floor hosts two units as well, each with the living room, bedroom, bathroom and kitchen.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Entire top floor is occupied by a large 2-bedroom apartment.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There is a small terrace/outdoor space to be used as a lounge area for the tenants/guests.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property is among the rare ones next to the Old Town to have a car access.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For the further information please contact our office in Split.</p>', '', '1350_House-Villa_0.jpg', '1350_House-Villa_1.jpg', '1350_House-Villa_2.jpg', '1350_House-Villa_3.jpg', '1350_House-Villa_4.jpg', '1350_House-Villa_5.jpg', '1350_House-Villa_6.jpg', '1350_House-Villa_7.jpg', '1350_House-Villa_8.jpg'),
(1351, 'Slaven', 'Ivankoviæ', '', '095/8111-111', '095/8111-111', 'Split', 'Podstrana, k.è. 4155 Donja Podstrana, z.u. 2673', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '150', '0', '40', 1, '80000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 1, 1, 'September 4, 2015', '<p>Jednosoban potpuno opremljen apartman u Podstrani, nekoliko kilometara od Splita.&nbsp;Apartman adaptiran 2015. godine po visokim standardima, sa&nbsp;zasebnim prikljuècima za vodu i struju. Ima stambenu povr&scaron;inu 40 m2.&nbsp;Ima parking.&nbsp;Apartman je pripremljen za turistièku sezonu i kao takav kategoriziran sa 4 zvjezdice.&nbsp;Prodaje se s kompletnim namje&scaron;tajem i svim potrebnim dodacima za iznajmljivanje.</p>', '<p>We are pleased to offer this bright and spacious one bedroom apartment just outside Split - in Podstrana. The &nbsp;property has been refurbished with a modern theme and with high standard fixtures by the owner who initially wanted to use it for tourist rentals before deciding to sell it, and it has been granted a 4 star rating.&nbsp;It has private parking, and is being sold at a good price which includes all the furniture. It is ready to be used immediately to live in, or for rentingto tourists.</p>', '', '<p><strong>Podstrana</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Jednosoban potpuno opremljen apartman u Podstrani, nekoliko kilometara od Splita.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartman adaptiran 2015. godine po visokim standardima, sa zasebnim prikljuècima za vodu i struju.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ima parking.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartman je pripremljen za turistièku sezonu i kao takav kategoriziran sa 4 zvjezdice.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Prodaje se s kompletnim namje&scaron;tajem i svim potrebnim dodacima za iznajmljivanje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sastoji se od spavaæe sobe, kupaonice, dnevnog boravka, kuhinje i blagovaonice ukupne stambene povr&scaron;ine 40 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Posjeduje energetski certifikat razred D (prije adaptacije).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Objekt legaliziran.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Vlasni&scaron;tvo uredno.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Svi sadr¾aji se nalaze u blizini.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Podstana je udaljena od Splita 10 km.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Meðunarodni aerodrom je udaljen 20 km.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za dodatne informacije molimo kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured u Splitu.</p>', '<p><strong>Podstrana</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>We are pleased to offer this bright and spacious one bedroom apartment just outside Split.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is situated a few minutes from the sea, and several kilometres from the old centre of Split and the ferry port.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The &nbsp;property has been refurbished with a modern theme and with high standard fixtures by the owner who initially wanted to use it for tourist rentals before deciding to sell it, and it has been granted a 4 star rating.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It has private parking, and is being sold at a good price which includes all the furniture.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is ready to be used immediately to live in, or for rentingto tourists.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There are shops, bars and other useful services a short walk from the property, as well as it being located with easy access to the sea, and inland to some traditional and attractive villages surrounded by natural woodland, all of which are very unaffected by tourism.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The airport is 20 kilometres from the property.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact our office to arrange a visit with one of our agents.</p>', '', '1351_Apartment_0.jpg', '1351_Apartment_1.jpg', '1351_Apartment_2.jpg', '1351_Apartment_3.jpg', '1351_Apartment_4.jpg', '1351_Apartment_5.jpg', '1351_Apartment_6.jpg', '1351_Apartment_7.jpg', '1351_Apartment_8.jpg'),
(1352, 'Vedran', 'Gott (Nik¹a)', '', '0989317466', '', 'Hvar', 'Pitve', 'For sale', 'Old stone house', '2000', '150', '400', 1, '650000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 0, 0, 'September 4, 2015', '<p>Kompletno renovirana &scaron;armantna stara kamena kuæa na otoku Hvaru.&nbsp;Nalazi se u unutra&scaron;njosti, na udaljenosti 2 km od mora.&nbsp;Sastoji se od prizemlja, prvog i drugog kata, ukupne stambene povr&scaron;ine 400 m2.&nbsp;Ispred kuæe se nalazi dvori&scaron;te koje s terasom i balkonom èini ukupnu povr&scaron;inu od 150 m2.&nbsp;Kuæa ima predivan pogled na more.</p>\r\n<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;">CIJENA SNI®ENA SA 700.000 EURA!</span></p>', '<p>We are very pleased to offer this beautifully renovated old stone house on the island of Hvar. It is situated in the centre of a typical and charming old village - 2km from the shore, but elevated by geography so it still has sea views and interesting long views across the natural landscape. Inside the building is a ground floor, first and second floor, with a total floor area of 400 m2. In front of the house is a courtyard, and with a terrace and balcony it makes a total area of 150 m2.</p>\r\n<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;">PRICE REDUCED FROM 700.000 EURO!</span></p>', '', '<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;"><strong>CIJENA SNI®ENA SA 700.000 EURA!</strong></span></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kompletno renovirana &scaron;armantna stara kamena kuæa na otoku Hvaru.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nalazi se u unutra&scaron;njosti, na udaljenosti 2 km od mora.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sastoji se od prizemlja, prvog i drugog kata, ukupne stambene povr&scaron;ine 400 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ispred kuæe se nalazi dvori&scaron;te koje s terasom i balkonom èini ukupnu povr&scaron;inu od 150 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa ima predivan pogled na more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Prostran parking u blizini kuæe.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U mjestu se nalazi restoran.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Grad Hvar je udaljen 2 km.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Molimo za dodatne informacije kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured.</p>', '<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;"><strong>PRICE REDUCED FROM 700.000 EURO!</strong></span></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>We are very pleased to offer this beautifully renovated old stone house on the island of Hvar.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is situated in the centre of a typical and charming old village - 2km from the shore, but elevated by geography so it still has sea views and interesting long views across the natural landscape.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Inside the building is a ground floor, first and second floor, with a total floor area of 400 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>In front of the house is a courtyard, and with a terrace and balcony it makes a total area of 150 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The interior or exterior of the house needs no further work, apart from occasional decorating, as the renovation was done with great care and precision, and every detail given complete attention.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>To visit the property will underline the care given by the owner to this charismatic property.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There is sample parking near the house.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property is conveniently close to a bar and restaurant and a village shop.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The village is 2km from the town of Hvar - a short bike ride, really, and here there are many options for night life, restaurants, bars and many different types of shops, as well as fast access to the mainland and the marina, and boat taxis for the nearby islands.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact the office for more information and to arrange to tour this property.</p>', '', '1352_Old-stone-house_0.jpg', '1352_Old-stone-house_1.jpg', '1352_Old-stone-house_2.JPG', '1352_Old-stone-house_3.JPG', '1352_Old-stone-house_4.JPG', '1352_Old-stone-house_5.JPG', '1352_Old-stone-house_6.JPG', '1352_Old-stone-house_7.JPG', '1352_Old-stone-house_8.JPG'),
(1353, 'Slobodan', 'Jeliæ', '', '098 264 853', 'projektbiro@st.t-com.hr', 'Split', 'Kralja Tomislava 8a, Split Split, centar, Zgr 2273, ZU15299 pu 8, k..o. Split', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '200', '0', '105', 1, '348000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 3, 1, 'September 7, 2015', '<p>Ovaj prostrani stan nalazi se na prvom katu zgrade, izvorno graðene kao palaèa u gotièkom stilu, dograðene sredinom 18.stoljeæa. Veæ dugi niz godina koristi se kao prodajno-uredski prostor, no lako mu je prenamijeniti namjenu u stambenu. Smje&scaron;ten u sredi&scaron;tu Splita, u pje&scaron;aèkoj zoni, nalazi se u neposrednoj blizini svih sadr¾aja i atrakcija. Ima dva zasebna ulaza&ndash;jedan sa uliène strane, a drugi preko zajednièkog stepeni&scaron;ta.&nbsp;Prostor je podijeljen na tri velike prostorije i sanitarni èvor, ukupne stambene povr&scaron;ine 105 m2.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>This large property is located on the first floor of the building originally built as a gothic palace, but remodelled in the 18th century. It was an apartment, converted into the retail/office space as has been used as such for a number of years, but can be easily changed back into apartment.&nbsp;It has two entrances&ndash;entirely separate entrance from the street side and another entrance through communal stairs. There are 3 large rooms at the moment and 1 toilet, total living area of 105 sqm.</p>', '', '<p>Ovaj prostrani stan nalazi se na prvom katu zgrade, izvorno graðene kao palaèa u gotièkom stilu, dograðene sredinom 18.stoljeæa.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Veæ dugi niz godina koristi se kao prodajno-uredski prostor, no lako mu je prenamijeniti namjenu u stambenu.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Smje&scaron;ten u sredi&scaron;tu Splita, u pje&scaron;aèkoj zoni, nalazi se u neposrednoj blizini svih sadr¾aja i atrakcija.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ima dva zasebna ulaza &ndash; jedan sa uliène strane, a drugi preko zajednièkog stepeni&scaron;ta.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Prostor je podijeljen na tri velike prostorije i sanitarni èvor, ukupne stambene povr&scaron;ine 105 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Iako mu treba detaljna renovacija, nude odliène moguænosti zbog izvrsnog polo¾aja. &nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za dodatne informacije molimo kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured u Splitu.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>This large property is located on the first floor of the building originally built as a gothic palace, but remodelled in the 18th century.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It was an apartment, converted into the retail/office space as has been used as such for a number of years, but can be easily changed back into apartment.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Located in the heart of Split, within the pedestrian zone, stones throw from all downtown attractions.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It has two entrances &ndash; entirely separate entrance from the street side and another entrance through communal stairs.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There are 3 large rooms at the moment and 1 toilet, total living area of 105 sqm.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>In needs substantial renovation, but it offers great possibilities due to exquisite location.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact our office for more information.</p>', '', '1353_Apartment_0.jpg', '1353_Apartment_1.jpg', '1353_Apartment_2.jpg', '1353_Apartment_3.jpg', '1353_Apartment_4.jpg', '1353_Apartment_5.jpg', '', '', ''),
(1354, 'Nela', 'Dominis', ' Nela 091 219 1112', 'Ana Dominis 091 556 4300', '', 'Brac', 'Zastivanje 11 Postira, ZU 1252 k.o. Postira', 'For sale', 'Old stone house', '10', '137', '138', 1, '250000', '', 2, 2, 2, 1, 1, 2, 0, 0, 'September 7, 2015', '<p>Stara kamena kuæa sa dvori&scaron;tem, smje&scaron;tena u centru ¾ivopisnog mjesta na otoku Braèu, uz more i pla¾u, sa lijepim otvorenim pogledom na braèki kanal.&nbsp;Kuæa je dio dvojnog objekta, a potrebna joj je potpuna renovacija, kako izvana tako i iznutra.&nbsp;Ima ukupnu stambenu povr&scaron;inu 138 m2.&nbsp;Povr&scaron;ina zemlji&scaron;ta je 137 m2.&nbsp;Nekretnina ima veliki potencijal, a njena vrijednost je u jedinstvenoj lokaciji.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>Seafront stone house with the garden, located in the center of a charming village on Brac island, next to the beach. The property features lovely sea views and Brac channel. This is semi-detached house on two floors and it needs complete external and internal renovation.&nbsp;House has living area of 138 sqm, while the land plot measures 137 sqm.&nbsp;The property has huge potential and its greatest value is its unique location.&nbsp;</p>', '', '<p>Stara kamena kuæa sa dvori&scaron;tem, smje&scaron;tena u centru ¾ivopisnog mjesta na otoku Braèu, uz more i pla¾u, sa lijepim otvorenim pogledom na braèki kanal.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je dio dvojnog objekta, a potrebna joj je potpuna renovacija, kako izvana tako i iznutra.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ima ukupnu stambenu povr&scaron;inu 138 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Povr&scaron;ina zemlji&scaron;ta je 137 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Svi prikljuèci na infrastrukturnu mre¾u su odmah pokraj nekretnine.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nekretnina ima veliki potencijal, a njena vrijednost je u jedinstvenoj lokaciji.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Centar mjesta je udaljen 100 m.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za dodatne informacije molimo kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured u Splitu.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>Seafront stone house with the garden, located in the center of a charming village on Brac island, next to the beach.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property features lovely sea views and Brac channel.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>This is semi-detached house on two floors and it needs complete external and internal renovation.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>House has living area of 138 sqm, while the land plot measures 137 sqm.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>All utilities are right next to the house.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property has huge potential and its greatest value is its unique location.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>House is 100 m awy from the center of the village, while the ferry port is 12 km away.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For the further information please contact our office in Split.</p>', '', '1354_Old-stone-house_0.jpg', '1354_Old-stone-house_1.jpg', '1354_Old-stone-house_2.jpg', '1354_Old-stone-house_3.jpg', '1354_Old-stone-house_4.jpg', '1354_Old-stone-house_5.jpg', '1354_Old-stone-house_6.jpg', '', ''),
(1355, 'Senka', 'Petroviæ', '091 590 7528', 'Petar Petroviæ (sin) +44 7531 797 385', 'petar011@hotmail.com', 'Omis', 'Poljièka cesta 6, Dugi Rat Dugi Rat, ZU 2021, 2022 k.o. Jesenice', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '10', '730', '520', 1, '990000', '', 2, 2, 2, 1, 1, 2, 12, 7, 'September 7, 2015', '<p>Ova prostrana kuca smjestena je uz samu plazu, a nalazi se u malom mjestu juzno od Splita sa lakim pristupom svim bitnim sadrzajima.&nbsp;Sjeverna strana kuce nalazi se uz cestu, dok je glavni dio objekta otvoren prema moru i lijepoj sljuncanoj plazi. Nekretnina nudi predivan pogled na more sa bilo koje od brojnih terasa.&nbsp;Glavna zgrada proteze se na tri etaze &ndash; prizemlje, mezanin i prvi kat &ndash; te sadrzi ukupno 12 spavacih soba.&nbsp;Ukupna stambena povr&scaron;ina kuæe iznosi 529 m2, dok zemlji&scaron;te ima povr&scaron;inu 730 m2.<br /><br /></p>', '<p>This beachfront property is located in a small village south of Split. It has easy access to all year-round amenities.&nbsp;North side of the house lies next to the road, while the major part of it opens towards beautiful pebble beach, nine steps away from the sea. The property offers amazing sea views from its 260 sqm terraces and balconies.&nbsp;House has total living area of 520 sqm, while the land plot measures 730 sqm.&nbsp;</p>', '', '<p>Ova prostrana kuca smjestena je uz samu plazu, a nalazi se u malom mjestu juzno od Splita sa lakim pristupom svim bitnim sadrzajima.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sjeverna strana kuce nalazi se uz cestu, dok je glavni dio objekta otvoren prema moru i lijepoj sljuncanoj plazi.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nekretnina nudi predivan pogled na more sa bilo koje od brojnih terasa.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Glavna zgrada proteze se na tri etaze &ndash; prizemlje, mezanin i prvi kat &ndash; te sadrzi ukupno 12 spavacih soba.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Prizemlje je jos potrebno privest svrsi.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Zgrada je projektirana na nacin da se svaka etaza moze lako pretvoriti u dva stana, sto ukupno daje 6 stanova.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ukupna stambena povr&scaron;ina kuæe iznosi 529 m2, dok zemlji&scaron;te ima povr&scaron;inu 730 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Solarno grijanje je instalirano, skupa sa 2 rezervara kapaciteta 600 litara.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nekretnina je prikljucena na struju, vodu, kanalizaciju i telefon.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Prostrani parking za 6 automobila nalazi se u unutarnjem poplocanom dvoristu, a garazi za brod pristupa se s morske strane.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za dodatne informacije molimo kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured u Splitu.</p>', '<p>This beachfront property is located in a small village south of Split.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It has easy access to all year-round amenities.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>North side of the house lies next to the road, while the major part of it opens towards beautiful pebble beach, nine steps away from the sea.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property offers amazing sea views from its 260 sqm terraces and balconies.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The main building stretches over three floors and contains 12 bedrooms.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The ground floor is still left to be brought to final purpose.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The building was designed in a way to allow each level to be divided into 2 apartments, giving 6 in total, spread over 3 floors.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>House has total living area of 520 sqm, while the land plot measures 730 sqm.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>A solar system has been installed with 2 water tanks (600 litres).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property is connected to utilities.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There is ample parking place for 6 cars in the paved courtyard, while the boat garage has direct access to the beach.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For the further information please contact our office in Split.</p>', '', '1355_House-Villa_0.jpg', '1355_House-Villa_1.jpg', '1355_House-Villa_2.jpg', '1355_House-Villa_3.jpg', '1355_House-Villa_4.jpg', '1355_House-Villa_5.jpg', '1355_House-Villa_6.jpg', '1355_House-Villa_7.jpg', '1355_House-Villa_8.jpg'),
(1356, '', 'Nik¹a + Tim Coulson', '', '', '', 'Hvar', 'Sv. Nedilja', 'For sale', 'Land plot', '50', '1000', '0', 1, '225000', '', 2, 2, 2, 1, 1, 2, 0, 0, 'September 8, 2015', '<p>Graðevinsko zemlji&scaron;te u prvom redu do mora.&nbsp;Smje&scaron;teno na rubu litice, ovo graðevinsko zemlji&scaron;te nudi spektakularan neometani pogled na more uz umjerenu cijenu u usporedbi sa prosjekom cijena sliènih nekretnina u prvom redu do mora na otoku Hvaru.&nbsp;Zemlji&scaron;te ''A'' povr&scaron;ine ca. 1.200 m2 veæ sadr¾i objekt u vrlo ranoj fazi gradnje, tako da su izmjene moguæe, ali uz odobrenje ureda za prostorno planiranje.&nbsp;Zemlji&scaron;te ''B'' povr&scaron;ine ca. 1.000 m2 nalazi se pokraj zemlji&scaron;ta ''A''.</p>', '<p>Building plot in the first line to the sea.&nbsp;Located on the edge of a cliff top, this building plots offers spectacular unobstructed views and is fairly priced compared to other seafront plots on Hvar island.&nbsp;Plot ''A'' sized ca. 1.200 sqm already contains a shell of a house at very early stage of construction, therefore changes are possible, but have to be approved by the planning office.&nbsp;Plot ''B'' sized ca. 1.000 sqm is located next to the plot ''A''.</p>', '', '<p>Graðevinsko zemlji&scaron;te u prvom redu do mora.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Smje&scaron;teno na rubu litice, ovo graðevinsko zemlji&scaron;te nudi spektakularan neometani pogled na more uz umjerenu cijenu u usporedbi sa prosjekom cijena sliènih nekretnina u prvom redu do mora na otoku Hvaru.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Zemlji&scaron;te ''A'' povr&scaron;ine ca. 1.200 m2 veæ sadr¾i objekt u vrlo ranoj fazi gradnje, tako da su izmjene moguæe, ali uz odobrenje ureda za prostorno planiranje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Cijena: 275.000 EUR (230 EUR/m2).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Zemlji&scaron;te ''B'' povr&scaron;ine ca. 1.000 m2 nalazi se pokraj zemlji&scaron;ta ''A'', a njegova cijena je 225.000 EUR (225 EUR/m2).&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Toènu povr&scaron;inu svakog dijela zemlji&scaron;ta odrediti æe geodet.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Oba dijela (A i B) trenutno èine jedinstvenu katastarsku èesticu koja se prodaje za cijenu od 450.000 EUR, &scaron;to je popust od 25 tisuæa EUR u odnosu na pojedinaènu prodaju.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za sve dodatne informacije molimo kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured.</p>', '<p>Building plot in the first line to the sea.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Located on the edge of a cliff top, this building plots offers spectacular unobstructed views and is fairly priced compared to other seafront plots on Hvar island.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Plot ''A'' sized ca. 1.200 sqm already contains a shell of a house at very early stage of construction, therefore changes are possible, but have to be approved by the planning office.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Price: 275.000 EUR (230 EUR/sqm)</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Plot ''B'' sized ca. 1.000 sqm is located next to the plot ''A'' and priced 225.000 EUR (225 EUR/sqm).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Precise size of each plot will be determined by the geometer.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Both sites A and B (currently forming a single cadastral plot) can be purchased for 450.000 EUR, which is 25 thousand EUR less than if sold separately.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For all the further information please contact our office.&nbsp;</p>', '', '1356_Land-plot_0.jpg', '1356_Land-plot_1.jpg', '1356_Land-plot_2.jpg', '1356_Land-plot_3.jpg', '1356_Land-plot_4.jpg', '1356_Land-plot_5.jpg', '', '', ''),
(1357, '', 'Primo¹ten nekretnine', '', '098 386 376', '', 'Primosten', 'Primo¹ten', 'For sale', 'Land plot', '0', '1000', '0', 2, '100000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 0, 0, 'September 8, 2015', '<p>Graðevinsko zemlji&scaron;te u Primo&scaron;tenu s predivnim, neometanim pogledom na more. Zemlji&scaron;te ima povr&scaron;inu 1000 m2.&nbsp;Vlasni&scaron;tvo èisto. Zemlji&scaron;te se nalazi uz put, sva potrebna infrastruktura 30 metara od terena. Cijena 100.000,00 EUR.&nbsp;Udaljeno svega jedan kilometar od Primo&scaron;tena, smje&scaron;teno na mirnoj lokaciji u blizini centra jednog od najljep&scaron;ih turistièkih mjesta Dalmacije, gdje se nalaze svi potrebni sadr¾aji. Od aerodroma je udaljeno 30 km.</p>', '<p>We have this building land in Primosten with beautiful, unobstructed views of the sea, and natural woods along the coast. The land has an area of 1000 m2 and is located down a 30m track off a small road, with all the necessary services easily accessible. Price at &euro;100,000.00. It is only one kilometre from Primosten, along the part of the coast considered one of the most beautiful in Dalmatia. Within a 10 minute walk are cafes, shops and coffee shops near the sea. From the airport is 30 km away.</p>', '', '<p>Graðevinsko zemlji&scaron;te u Primo&scaron;tenu s predivnim, neometanim pogledom na more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Zemlji&scaron;te ima povr&scaron;inu 1000 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Vlasni&scaron;tvo èisto, 1/1.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Zemlji&scaron;te se nalazi uz put, sva potrebna infrastruktura 30 metara od terena.</p>\r\n<p><strong><br /></strong></p>\r\n<p><strong>Cijena 100.000,00 EUR</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Udaljeno svega jedan kilometar od Primo&scaron;tena, smje&scaron;teno na mirnoj lokaciji u blizini centra jednog od najljep&scaron;ih turistièkih mjesta Dalmacije, gdje se nalaze svi potrebni sadr¾aji.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Od aerodroma je udaljeno 30 km.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za dodatne informacije molimo kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured u Splitu.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>We have this building land in Primosten with beautiful, unobstructed views of the sea, and natural woods along the coast.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The land has an area of 1000 m2 and is located down a 30m track off a small road, with all the necessary services easily accessible.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Price 100,000.00 EUR</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is only one kilometre from Primosten, along the part of the coast considered one of the most beautiful in Dalmatia.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Within a 10 minute walk are cafes, shops and coffee shops near the sea.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>From the airport is 30 km away.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact the office to arrange to visit this property.</p>', '', '1357_Land-plot_0.jpg', '1357_Land-plot_1.jpg', '1357_Land-plot_2.jpg', '', '', '', '', '', '');
INSERT INTO `nekretnina` (`id`, `ime`, `prezime`, `telefon`, `mobitel`, `e_mail`, `lokacija_id`, `adresa`, `status_id`, `vrsta_id`, `udaljenost`, `povrsina`, `stambenapovrsina`, `display`, `cijena`, `cijenatocka`, `ponuda_tjedna`, `new_built`, `must_sell`, `prvi_red_do_mora`, `pogled_na_more`, `bazen`, `broj_soba`, `broj_kupatila`, `datum`, `title_hr`, `title_en`, `title_ge`, `opis_hr`, `opis_en`, `opis_ge`, `PropertyImageURL0`, `PropertyImageURL1`, `PropertyImageURL2`, `PropertyImageURL3`, `PropertyImageURL4`, `PropertyImageURL5`, `PropertyImageURL6`, `PropertyImageURL7`, `PropertyImageURL8`) VALUES
(1358, '', 'Rakiæ', '', '', '', 'Sibenik', '®aboriæ', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '150', '0', '84', 2, '130000', '', 2, 1, 2, 2, 1, 2, 2, 2, 'September 8, 2015', '<p>Prodaje se dvoeta¾ni apartman u blizini &Scaron;ibenika u novogradnji.&nbsp;Ukupna povr&scaron;ina apartmana iznosi 84 m2 (donja eta¾e 53m&sup2;).&nbsp;Iznad cijelog tlocrta stana nalazi se galerijski prostor do koga se dolazi unutarnjim kru¾nim stepeni&scaron;tem iz dnevne sobe.&nbsp;Zgrada u kojoj se nalazi apartman udaljena je 150 m od mora.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>We are offering this 2/3 bedroom duplex apartment in a new building, close to the sea in a small village near Sibenik. The apartment is 84 m2 (lower floors 53m&sup2;). The building needs some finishing and the owner is invited to select the furnishings and fittings for the bathrooms and kitchen. The building is located 150 m from the sea, where there are several beautiful beaches with clear water and safe for children.&nbsp;</p>', '', '<p>Prodaje se dvoeta¾ni apartman u blizini &Scaron;ibenika u novogradnji.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Donja eta¾a sastoji se od dnevnog boravka, kuhinje, hodnika, spavaæe sobe, kupaonice i balkona.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ukupna povr&scaron;ina apartmana iznosi 84 m2 (donja eta¾e 53m&sup2;).&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Iznad cijelog tlocrta stana nalazi se galerijski prostor do koga se dolazi unutarnjim kru¾nim stepeni&scaron;tem iz dnevne sobe.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U galerijskom prostoru je dodatna kupaonica, soba, balkon s pogledom na more, te prostorija koja se mo¾e iskoristiti za dodatnu jednu ili dvije spavaæe sobe.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Zgrada u kojoj se nalazi apartman udaljena je 150 m od mora.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U cijenu apartmana ukljuèena je i gara¾a koja se nalazi u prizemlju zgrade.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U apartmanu treba jo&scaron; samo obaviti zavr&scaron;ne radove koji su ukljuèeni u cijenu (ploèice, sanitarije&hellip;), dok se izbor materijala za te radove prepu&scaron;ta buduæem kupcu.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartman se nalazi u mirnom mjestu sa lijepim pla¾ama, svega 10 km od &Scaron;ibenika, 12 km od Primo&scaron;tena.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za dodatne informacije molimo kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured u Splitu.</p>', '<p>We are offering this 2/3 bedroom duplex apartment in a new building, close to the sea in a small village near Sibenik.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Orientation is South /East.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The apartment is 84 m2 (lower floors 53m&sup2;).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The lower floor has a living room, kitchen, hallway, bedroom, bathroom and a large balcony with access through the lounge.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There is a second floor of the apartment, which is a gallery space that you get in by an internal circular staircase from the living room.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The gallery space has an additional bathroom, one large bedroom with a balcony with sea views, and another room that can be used as additional &nbsp;bedroom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The building needs some finishing, and the owner is invited to select the furnishings and fittings for the bathrooms and kitchen.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The building is located 150 m from the sea, where there are several beautiful beaches with clear water and safe for children.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The surrounding area is peaceful and built among the natural woods found in the area.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is only a short walk to the village shops, bars, and cafes near the old harbour.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The price includes a garage which is located on the ground floor.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The apartment is located in a quiet place with beautiful beaches, just 10 km from Sibenik, 12 km from Primosten.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For further information, please contact our office in Split, and we can arrange for you to visit the property.</p>', '', '1358_Apartment_0.jpg', '1358_Apartment_1.jpg', '1358_Apartment_2.jpg', '1358_Apartment_3.jpg', '1358_Apartment_4.jpg', '1358_Apartment_5.jpg', '1358_Apartment_6.jpg', '1358_Apartment_7.jpg', '1358_Apartment_8.jpg'),
(1359, '', 'Rakiæ', '', '', '', 'Murter', 'Slanica Murter', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '200', '330', '150', 1, '210000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 4, 4, 'September 9, 2015', '<p>Samostojeæa kuæa novije gradnje s prekrasnim pogledom na more.&nbsp;Kuæa se sastoji od 4 jednosobna apartmana.&nbsp;Kuæa je kompletno ureðena i useljiva, ima ljetnu kuhinju, podrum, te terase s pogledom na more.&nbsp;Sastoji se od prizemlja i prvog kata ukupne stambene povr&scaron;ine 150 m2. Lijepo ureðena okuænica s ro&scaron;tiljem i vi&scaron;e parkirnih mjesta ima povr&scaron;inu 350 m2.</p>', '<p>We are offering this attractive, modern and well-presented house with lovely sea views on the island of Murter. It is situated 200 m from the shore, and consists of 4 apartments, total living area of 150 m sq. The house is in a good sized plot of 350 m sq with a beautifully landscaped and maintained garden that includes a substantial barbecue and a parking area.</p>', '', '<p>Samostojeæa kuæa novije gradnje s prekrasnim pogledom na more.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa se sastoji od 4 jednosobna apartmana.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je kompletno ureðena i useljiva, ima ljetnu kuhinju, podrum, te terase s pogledom na more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sastoji se od prizemlja i prvog kata ukupne stambene povr&scaron;ine 150 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Lijepo ureðena okuænica s ro&scaron;tiljem i vi&scaron;e parkirnih mjesta ima povr&scaron;inu 350 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je pogodna za bavljenje turizmom.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Udaljena je od pla¾e samo 200 m, a od centra mjesta 500 m.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Molimo za dodatne informacije kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured u Splitu.</p>', '<p>We are offering this attractive, modern and well-presented house with lovely sea views on the island of Murter.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is situated 200 m from the shore, where there are many beautiful beaches for swimming safely, and 500 m from the centre of the village where there many options for cafes, small shops and bars.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house is in a good sized plot of 350 m sq with a beautifully landscaped and maintained garden that includes a substantial barbecue and a parking area.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house consists of ground and first floor with a total floor area of 150m2 and it has been divided into four one-bedroom apartments which are used to let to tourists.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house is being sold fully furnished and is in good decorative condition.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It has a cellar and a terrace overlooking the sea.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The Orientation is south / west.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For further information please contact our office in Split, and we can arrange for you to view the property.</p>', '', '1359_House-Villa_0.jpg', '1359_House-Villa_1.JPG', '1359_House-Villa_2.JPG', '1359_House-Villa_3.JPG', '1359_House-Villa_4.JPG', '1359_House-Villa_5.JPG', '1359_House-Villa_6.JPG', '1359_House-Villa_7.JPG', '1359_House-Villa_8.JPG'),
(1360, '', 'Rakiæ', '', '', '', 'Murter', 'Betina, Murter', 'For sale', 'Old stone house', '5', '206', '170', 1, '300000', '', 2, 2, 2, 1, 1, 2, 6, 3, 'September 9, 2015', '<p>Kamena kuæa prvi red uz more s vlastitom pla¾om ograðenom kamenim zidom na otoku Murteru.&nbsp;Sastoji se od tri useljiva stana ukupne povr&scaron;ine 170 m2. Prizemlje ima povr&scaron;inu 90 m2.&nbsp;Vanjske stepenice vode u potkrovlje povr&scaron;ine 80 m2 sa dva 2-sobna apartmana i predivnom terasom od 40 m2 s koje se pru¾a otvoren pogled na more.&nbsp;Kuæa se nalazi na parceli velièine 206 m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;">CIJENA SNI®ENA SA 380.000 EURA!!</span></p>', '<p>We are pleased to offer this stone built house by the sea with access to the water at the bottom of the private walled garden. The property inside consists of three habitable apartments with total area of 170 m2. The ground floor has living area of 90 m2. There are external stairs leading to the attic (80 m2) that has two 2-bedroom apartments and a beautiful terrace of 40 m2 which provides a view of the sea. The house is situated on a plot of 206 m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;">PRICE REDUCED FROM 380.000 EURO!!</span></p>', '', '<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;"><strong>CIJENA SNI®ENA SA 380.000 EURA!!</strong></span></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kamena kuæa prvi red uz more s vlastitom pla¾om ograðenom kamenim zidom na otoku Murteru.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sastoji se od tri useljiva stana ukupne povr&scaron;ine 170 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Prizemlje od 90 m2 sastoji se od kuhinje, blagovaonice, dnevne sobe, 2 spavaæe sobe, hodnika, kupaonice i terase uz more.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Vanjske stepenice vode u potkrovlje povr&scaron;ine 80 m2 sa dva 2-sobna apartmana i predivnom terasom od 40 m2 s koje se pru¾a otvoren pogled na more.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa se nalazi na parceli velièine 206 m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>S obzirom na vrhunsku lokaciju, kuæi je potrebna manja adaptacija u svrhu poveæanja standarda ¾ivljenja.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za dodatne informacije molimo kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured u Splitu.&nbsp;</p>', '<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;"><strong>PRICE REDUCED FROM 380.000 EURO!!</strong></span></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>We are pleased to offer this stone built house by the sea with access to the water at the bottom of the private walled garden.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property inside consists of three habitable apartments with total area of 170 m2.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The ground floor of 90 m2 consists of a kitchen, dining room, living room, 2 bedrooms, hallway, bathroom and terrace facing the sea.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There are external stairs leading to the attic (80 m2) that has two 2-bedroom apartments and a beautiful terrace of 40 m2 which provides a view of the sea.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house is situated on a plot of 206 m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house has been well maintained over the years but could do with being modernised and redecorated to meet modern living standards.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For further information, please contact our office in Split, and we can arrange viewings to the property.</p>', '', '1360_Old-stone-house_0.jpg', '1360_Old-stone-house_1.jpg', '1360_Old-stone-house_2.jpg', '1360_Old-stone-house_3.jpg', '1360_Old-stone-house_4.jpg', '1360_Old-stone-house_5.jpg', '', '', ''),
(1361, '', 'Rakiæ', '', '', '', 'Rogoznica', '', 'For sale', 'Land plot', '700', '5850', '0', 1, '497250', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 0, 0, 'September 11, 2015', '<p>Na uzvisini u blizini Rogoznice jako interesantno graðevinsko zemlji&scaron;te sa panoramskim pogledom na Rogoznicu, more i otoke.&nbsp;Zemlji&scaron;te ima povr&scaron;inu 5850 m2.&nbsp;Udaljeno je od mora 700 m.&nbsp;Zemlji&scaron;te nudi moguænosti za gradnju razlièitih stambenih objekata na parcelama minimalne povr&scaron;ine 400m&sup2;.&nbsp;Ima pristup s vi&scaron;e strana, te je tipièna investicijska i dobro iskoristiva nekretnina.&nbsp;Lokacija je iznimno mirna i nije zagaðena neukusnom gradnjom, a blizu svih sadr¾aja.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>We have this very interesting plot on a hill that allows a panoramic view of Rogoznica and the sea. The land has an area of 5850 m2, and it is situated 700m from the shore. The land offers the opportunity for the construction of various residential buildings on plots of a minimum 400m&sup2; land area. It would be ideal for building houses/villas with swimming pools, and where every house was guaranteed a nice view.</p>', '', '<p>Na uzvisini u blizini Rogoznice jako interesantno graðevinsko zemlji&scaron;te sa panoramskim pogledom na Rogoznicu, more i otoke.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Zemlji&scaron;te ima povr&scaron;inu 5850 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Udaljeno je od mora 700 m.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Zemlji&scaron;te nudi moguænosti za gradnju razlièitih stambenih objekata na parcelama minimalne povr&scaron;ine 400m&sup2;.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ima pristup s vi&scaron;e strana, te je tipièna investicijska i dobro iskoristiva nekretnina.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Lokacija je iznimno mirna i nije zagaðena neukusnom gradnjom, a blizu svih sadr¾aja.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Interesantno i za gradnju kuæa s bazenima, gdje bi svaka kuæa imala lijep pogled.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Do centra Rogoznice je svega 2-3 min vo¾nje automobilom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za dodatne informacije molimo kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured u Splitu.</p>', '<p>We have this very interesting plot on a hill that allows a panoramic view of Rogoznica and the sea.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The land has an area of 5850 m2, and it is situated 700m from the shore.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The land offers the opportunity for the construction of various residential buildings on plots of a minimum 400m&sup2; land area.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It would be ideal for building houses/villas with swimming pools, and where every house was guaranteed a nice view.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There is access from all sides, but the location is very quiet, and not surrounded by cheaper style property that will detract from building a high quality development.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There are shops, bars, restaurants and other services nearby and the centre of the village can be reached only 2-3 minutes by car, or a 10 minute stroll.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For further information, please contact our office in Split.</p>', '', '1361_Land-plot_0.jpg', '1361_Land-plot_1.jpg', '1361_Land-plot_2.jpg', '1361_Land-plot_3.jpg', '', '', '', '', ''),
(1362, 'Ivo', 'Koviæ', '', '098 942 4012', 'ivo.kovic@st.t-com.hr', 'Omis', 'Krug 7a Krug, Jesenice, k.è. 2966 k.o. jesenice', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '1000', '510', '230', 1, '700000', '', 2, 1, 2, 2, 1, 1, 4, 4, 'September 11, 2015', '<p>Luksuzna vila sa otvorenim pogledom na more. Izvrsna nekretnina smjestena 4 km povise glavne magistralne ceste Split &ndash; Omis. Ovo malo autenticno selo nudi nevjerojatan mir, buduci da se nalazi izvan uobicajenih turistickih ruta.&nbsp;Vila od 230 m2 je novoizgraðena te se prote¾e na 3 eta¾e.&nbsp;Zemljiste ima povrsinu 510 m2.&nbsp;Kuca je u cijelosti namjestena i opremljena do najsitnijih detalja. Neometani pogled na more pruza se iz vecine prostorija te sa terase i prostora oko bazena.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;">CIJENA SNI®ENA SA 800.000 EURA!!</span></p>', '<p>Luxurious villa with sea views. Fantastic property located 4 km up from the main coastal road Split &ndash; Omis. The village is small, authentic and offers amazing tranqullity being away from common tourist routes.&nbsp;This newly built villa of 230 sqm spreads over 3 floors.&nbsp;The land plot measures 510 sqm.&nbsp;The property is fully furnished to the finest details. Top quality materials were used in construction as well as in internal decoration.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;">PRICE REDUCED FROM 800.000 EURO!!</span></p>', '', '<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;"><strong>CIJENA SNI®ENA SA 800.000 EURA!!</strong></span></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Luksuzna vila sa otvorenim pogledom na more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Izvrsna nekretnina smjestena 4 km povise glavne magistralne ceste Split &ndash; Omis.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ovo malo autenticno selo nudi nevjerojatan mir, buduci da se nalazi izvan uobicajenih turistickih ruta.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Vila od 230 m2 je novoigraðena te se prote¾e na 3 eta¾e.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U kuæi se nalaze 4 spavaæe sobe, svaka sa svojom kupaonicom, dnevni boravak sa kaminom, kuhinja sa blagovaonicom, teretana, sauna, prostrana terasa sa bazenom i jacuzzijem, ljetna kuhinja sa otvorenim kaminom i sjenicom te parking.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Zemljiste ima povrsinu 510 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuca je u cijelosti namjestena i opremljena do najsitnijih detalja.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Vrhunski materijali koristeni su u gradnji i opremanju.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Neometani pogled na more pruza se iz vecine prostorija te sa terase i prostora oko bazena.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Molimo kontaktirajte nas ured u Splitu za vise informacija.&nbsp;</p>', '<p><strong><span style="text-decoration: underline;">PRICE REDUCED FROM 800.000 EURO!!</span><br /></strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Luxurious villa with sea views.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Fantastic property located 4 km up from the main coastal road Split &ndash; Omis. &nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The village is small, authentic and offers amazing tranqullity being away from common tourist routes.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>This newly built villa of 230 sqm spreads over 3 floors and features 4 en-suite bedrooms, living room with fire place, kitchen with dining room, gym, sauna, sundeck with pool and jacuzzi, covered al-fresco dining area with open fire place and parking.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The land plot measures 510 sqm.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property is fully furnished to the finest details.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Top quality materials were used in construction as well as in internal decoration.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Splendid unobstructed sea views can be enjoyed throughout the property and sundeck/pool area.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact our office in Split for more details. &nbsp;</p>', '', '1362_House-Villa_0.jpg', '1362_House-Villa_1.jpg', '1362_House-Villa_2.jpg', '1362_House-Villa_3.jpg', '1362_House-Villa_4.jpg', '1362_House-Villa_5.jpg', '1362_House-Villa_6.jpg', '1362_House-Villa_7.jpg', '1362_House-Villa_8.jpg'),
(1363, 'Vlatko', 'Mustapiæ', '', '098 925 5800', '', 'Brac', 'Hrv. Preporoda 16 Bol, Braè, ZU 1666 k.o. Bol', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '10', '1080', '200', 1, '1300000', '', 2, 2, 2, 1, 1, 2, 5, 4, 'September 11, 2015', '<p>U ponudi nudimo ovu lijepu kuæu u prvom redu uz more na iznimnoj lokaciji sa ju¾ne strane otoka Braèa.&nbsp;Kuæa se sastoji od 4 apartmana koji sveukupno sa 4 terase daju stambenu povr&scaron;inu od ca. 200 m2.&nbsp;Nekretnina se nalazi neposredno uz &scaron;etnicu, pla¾u i more, udaljena svega koju minutu hoda od svih potrebnih sadr¾aja. Velika parcela (1080 m2) nudi buduæem vlasniku moguænost pro&scaron;irenja objekta, formiranja parkirali&scaron;nih mjesta ili postavljanje bazena.&nbsp;<br /><br /></p>', '<p>For sale we have this seafront property in amazing location on the south side of Brac island.&nbsp;The house consists of 4 apartments: studio and 1-bedroom unit on the ground floor; 1-bedroom and 2-bedroom unit on the first floor, along with the 4 terraces giving the size of 200 sqm of the living area altogether.&nbsp;The plot is large (1080 sqm), next to the walkway, beach and the sea, at walking distance to all amenities.&nbsp;</p>', '', '<p>U ponudi nudimo ovu lijepu kuæu u prvom redu uz more na iznimnoj lokaciji sa ju¾ne strane otoka Braèa.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa se sastoji od 4 apartmana: studio apartmana i jednogobnog apartmana u prizemlju objekta te jednosobnog i dvosobnog apartmana na katu kuæe, koji sveukupno sa 4 terase daju stambenu povr&scaron;inu od ca. 200 m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nekretnina se nalazi neposredno uz &scaron;etnicu, pla¾u i more, udaljena svega koju minutu hoda od svih potrebnih sadr¾aja.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Velika parcela (1080 m2) nudi buduæem vlasniku moguænost pro&scaron;irenja objekta, formiranja parkirali&scaron;nih mjesta ili postavljanje bazena.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Centar mjesta udaljen je 400 m.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za vi&scaron;e informacija molimo kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured. &nbsp;</p>', '<p>For sale we have this seafront property in amazing location on the south side of Brac island.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house consists of 4 apartments: studio and 1-bedroom unit on the ground floor; 1-bedroom and 2-bedroom unit on the first floor, along with the 4 terraces giving the size of 200 sqm of the living area altogether.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The plot is large (1080 sqm), next to the walkway, beach and the sea, at walking distance to all amenities.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sufficient size of the plot enables future owner either an extension of the property or formation of the parking, swimming pool etc.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>House is 400 m away from the center of the village.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For more information please contact our office.&nbsp;</p>', '', '1363_House-Villa_0.jpg', '1363_House-Villa_1.jpg', '1363_House-Villa_2.jpg', '1363_House-Villa_3.jpg', '1363_House-Villa_4.jpg', '1363_House-Villa_5.jpg', '1363_House-Villa_6.jpg', '1363_House-Villa_7.jpg', '1363_House-Villa_8.jpg'),
(1364, '', 'Sapere Aude d.o.o.', 'Ingrid Blain and Jim Hanglow, 091 727 9740', '', 'jimhanglow@hotmail.com', 'Brac', 'Postira, ZU 160 p.u.3 k.o. Postira', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '20', '0', '75', 1, '165000', '', 2, 2, 2, 1, 1, 2, 2, 2, 'September 11, 2015', '<p>Fantastièan stan u prvom redu do mora.&nbsp;Ovaj izvrstan stan nalazi se na prvom katu stare kamene zgrade pored mora i svega nekoliko koraka od pla¾e i centra &scaron;armantnog mjesta na otoku Braèu.&nbsp;Stan se sastoji od 2 spavaæe sobe, 2 kupaonice te velikog prostora dnevnog boravka i kuhinje, ukupne stambene povr&scaron;ine 75 m2. Renoviran je po najvi&scaron;im standardima. Strop je visok 3 metra, a interijer promi&scaron;ljeno renoviran na naèin da je zadr¾ao sve izvorne karakteristike.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;">SMANJENA CIJENA SA &euro;185.000 ZA BRZU PRODAJU - PONUDA VRIJEDI SAMO 2 TJEDNA</span></p>', '<p>Amazing apartment next to the sea.&nbsp;This stylish apartment is located in an old stone building next to the sea and stones throw to the beach and the center of a charming village on Brac island.&nbsp;This 2-bedroom 2-bathroom apartment is fully renovated up to the highest standard and features amazing sea views.&nbsp;It has total living area of 75 sqm.&nbsp;Ceilings are 3 meters high and the interior has kept is original characteristics due to thoughtful renovation.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;">PRICE REDUCED FROM 185.000 EURO FOR QUICK SALE - VALID FOR 2 WEEKS ONLY</span></p>', '', '<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;"><strong>SMANJENA CIJENA SA &euro;185.000 ZA BRZU PRODAJU - PONUDA VRIJEDI SAMO 2 TJEDNA</strong></span></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Fantastièan stan u prvom redu do mora.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ovaj izvrstan stan nalazi se na prvom katu stare kamene zgrade pored mora i svega nekoliko koraka od pla¾e i centra &scaron;armantnog mjesta na otoku Braèu.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Stan se satoji od 2 spavaæe sobe, 2 kupaonice te velikog prostora dnevnog boravka i kuhinje, ukupne stambene povr&scaron;ine 75 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Renoviran je po najvi&scaron;im standardima.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Strop je visok 3 metra, a interijer promi&scaron;ljeno renoviran na naèin da je zadr¾ao sve izvorne karakteristike.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Centar mjesta je udaljen 50 m.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za sve dodatne informacije molimo kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured u Splitu. &nbsp;</p>', '<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;"><strong>PRICE REDUCED FROM 185.000 EURO FOR QUICK SALE - VALID FOR 2 WEEKS ONLY</strong></span></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Amazing apartment next to the sea.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>This stylish apartment is located in an old stone building next to the sea and stones throw to the beach and the center of a charming village on Brac island.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>This 2-bedroom 2-bathroom apartment is fully renovated up to the highest standard and features amazing sea views.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It has total living area of 75 sqm.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ceilings are 3 meters high and the interior has kept is original characteristics due to thoughtful renovation.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The closest center is 50 m away from the apartment.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For the further information please contact our office in Split.&nbsp;</p>', '', '1364_Apartment_0.jpg', '1364_Apartment_1.jpg', '1364_Apartment_2.jpg', '1364_Apartment_3.jpg', '1364_Apartment_4.jpg', '1364_Apartment_5.jpg', '1364_Apartment_6.jpg', '1364_Apartment_7.jpg', '1364_Apartment_8.jpg'),
(1365, 'Kre¹imir', 'Derjanoviæ', '', '098 231 034 ', '', 'Hvar', 'Negdje kraj Starog grada', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '10', '0', '0', 1, '600000', '', 2, 2, 2, 1, 1, 2, 2, 2, 'September 11, 2015', '<p>Neodoljiva vila uz samo more.&nbsp;Ova &scaron;armantna kamena kuæa nalazi se oko 15 minuta vo¾nje od glavne trajektne luke na otoku. Nekretnina je okru¾ena maslinikom i voænjakom. Tradicionalna izvana, moderna iznutra &ndash; najbolji je naèin opisa ove sjajne nekretnine.&nbsp;Spektakularni pogled na more i uvalu pru¾a se sa vanjske terase, prostora ljetne kuhinje i sjenice.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>Charming seafront stone house.&nbsp;This irrestistibly charming stone house in located a 15min car ride from the island''s main ferry port. The property is surrounded by olive groves and orchards. Traditional from the outside, luxurious from the inside is the best way to describe this little piece of heaven. The beach and pier for the boat are only few steps away. Spectacular sea views can be enoyed from the sundeck, al-fresco dining area or gazebo.&nbsp;</p>', '', '<p>Neodoljiva vila uz samo more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ova &scaron;armantna kamena kuæa nalazi se oko 15 minuta vo¾nje od glavne trajektne luke na otoku.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nekretnina je okru¾ena maslinikom i voænjakom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Tradicionalna izvana, moderna iznutra &ndash; najbolji je naèin opisa ove sjajne nekretnine.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa se sastoji od 2 spavaæe sobe, 2 kupaonice, dnevnog boravka, kuhinje i blagovaonice.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Plaza i vez za brod nalaze se nekoliko koraka od posjeda.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Spektakularni pogled na more i uvalu pru¾a se sa vanjske terase, prostora ljetne kuhinje i sjenice.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nekretnina nije prikljuèena na mre¾nu struju i vodu, ali je energetski neovisna (rezervar za vodu, solarne ploèe).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nalazi se izvan graðevne zone.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za sve dodatne informacije molimo kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured.</p>', '<p>Charming seafront stone house.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>This irrestistibly charming stone house in located a 15min car ride from the island''s main ferry port.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property is surrounded by olive groves and orchards.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Traditional from the outside, luxurious from the inside is the best way to describe this little piece of heaven.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house contains 2 bedrooms, 2 bathrooms, living room, kitchen and dinig room.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The beach and pier for the boat are only few steps away.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Spectacular sea views can be enoyed from the sundeck, al-fresco dining area or gazebo.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property is not connected to mains utilities, but is fully independent with energy sources (solar panels, water tanks).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is located out of the building zone, hence the need for all non Croatians to set up Croatian limited liability company to acquire this property.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For all the further information please contact our office.</p>', '', '1365_House-Villa_0.jpg', '1365_House-Villa_1.jpg', '1365_House-Villa_2.jpg', '1365_House-Villa_3.jpg', '1365_House-Villa_4.jpg', '1365_House-Villa_5.jpg', '1365_House-Villa_6.jpg', '1365_House-Villa_7.jpg', '1365_House-Villa_8.jpg'),
(1366, '', 'Rakiæ', '', '', '', 'Sibenik', '©ibenik - ©kopinac', 'For sale', 'Old stone house', '0', '230', '120', 1, '150000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 3, 2, 'September 11, 2015', '<p>Stara kamena kuæa s okuænicom na atraktivnoj lokaciji u blizini &Scaron;ibenika.&nbsp;Kuæa se sastoji od prizemlja, prvog i drugog kata.&nbsp;U prizemlju se nalazi velika konoba, tj. dnevni boravak.&nbsp;Prvi kat se sastoji od kuhinje, sobe, kupaonice i loðe.&nbsp;Na drugom katu se nalaze 2 sobe i kupaonica.&nbsp;Svaka eta¾a ima povr&scaron;inu oko 40 m2 (3x40m2).&nbsp;Na terenu postoji jo&scaron; jedna manja kamena ru&scaron;evina.&nbsp;Vrt ima povr&scaron;inu cca 230 m2.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>We have this great renovation project in an attractive location on the mainland near Sibernik. This Old stone house with a nice garden (nearly 500m sq) is in need of complete renovation, although the exterior walls look in good condition.&nbsp;The house consists of ground, first and second floor.&nbsp;Each floor has an area of about 40 m2 (3x40m2). On the plot &nbsp;there is another small stone ruin which can be upgraded intoresidential space.&nbsp;</p>', '', '<p>Stara kamena kuæa s okuænicom na atraktivnoj lokaciji u blizini &Scaron;ibenika.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa se sastoji od prizemlja, prvog i drugog kata.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Svaka eta¾a ima povr&scaron;inu oko 40 m2 (3x40m2).&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U prizemlju se nalazi velika konoba, tj. dnevni boravak.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Prvi kat se sastoji od kuhinje, sobe, kupaonice i loðe.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na drugom katu se nalaze 2 sobe i kupaonica.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na terenu postoji jo&scaron; jedna manja kamena ru&scaron;evina.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Vrt ima povr&scaron;inu cca 230 m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Postoje najmanje dva parkirna mjesta te dobar pristup automobilom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za dodatne informacije molimo kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured u Splitu.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>We have this great renovation project in an attractive location on the mainland near Sibernik.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>This Old stone house with a nice garden (nearly 500m sq) is in need of complete renovation, although the exterior walls look in good condition.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house consists of ground, first and second floor.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Each floor has an area of about 40 m2 (3x40m2).&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The ground floor has one large room that would make an extremely grand living room.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The first floor consists of a kitchen, bedroom, bathroom and balcony.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the second floor there are 2 bedrooms and bathroom.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the plot there is another small stone ruin which can be upgraded intoresidential space.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There are at least two parking spaces and good access by car.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property is conveniently within walking distance of local services suchas bars, cafes and some shops.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For further information and to arrange to visit the property, please contact our office in Split.</p>', '', '1366_Old-stone-house_0.JPG', '1366_Old-stone-house_1.JPG', '1366_Old-stone-house_2.jpg', '1366_Old-stone-house_3.jpg', '1366_Old-stone-house_4.jpg', '1366_Old-stone-house_5.JPG', '1366_Old-stone-house_6.JPG', '1366_Old-stone-house_7.JPG', '1366_Old-stone-house_8.JPG'),
(1367, 'Jakica', 'Franèeski i ostali', '095 824 0997', '', '', 'Split', 'Bosanska 11 Split, ZU 7195 p.u.3 k.o. Split', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '250', '0', '85', 2, '270000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 4, 1, 'September 14, 2015', '<p>Veliki stan u centru Splita, dvostrane orijentacije, u neposrednoj blizini svih sadr¾aja. Konstrukcija zgrade je dobra, no stanu je potrebna unutarnja renovacija.&nbsp;Sastoji se od velikog hodnika preko kojeg se pristupa ostalim prostorijama &ndash; 4 sobe, kuhinja, blagovaonica i manja kupaonica, sveukupne povr&scaron;ine ca. 85 m2.&nbsp;Zbog atraktivnog polo¾aja idealan je za turistièki najam.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>Spatious apartment in the center of Split, bilaterally oriented, steps away from all town''s amenities. The structure of the building is sound, but the apartments needs internal renovation.&nbsp;A long hallway connects to four bedrooms, kitchen, dining room and bathroom, altogether sized ca. 85 sqm.&nbsp;For its perfect position, it is ideal for touristic rental.&nbsp;</p>', '', '<p>Veliki stan u centru Splita, dvostrane orijentacije, u neposrednoj blizini svih sadr¾aja.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Konstrukcija zgrade je dobra, no stanu je potrebna unutarnja renovacija.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sastoji se od velikog hodnika preko kojeg se pristupa ostalim prostorijama &ndash; 4 sobe, kuhinja, blagovaonica i manja kupaonica, sveukupne povr&scaron;ine ca. 85 m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Zbog atraktivnog polo¾aja idealan je za turistièki najam.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za dodatne informacije molimo kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured u Splitu.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>Spatious apartment in the center of Split, bilaterally oriented, steps away from all town''s amenities.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The structure of the building is sound, but the apartments needs internal renovation. &nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>A long hallway connects to four bedrooms, kitchen, dining room and bathroom, altogether sized ca. 85 sqm.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For its perfect position, it is ideal for touristic rental.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For the further information please contact our office in Split.</p>', '', '1367_Apartment_0.jpg', '1367_Apartment_1.jpg', '1367_Apartment_2.jpg', '1367_Apartment_3.jpg', '1367_Apartment_4.jpg', '1367_Apartment_5.jpg', '1367_Apartment_6.jpg', '1367_Apartment_7.jpg', '1367_Apartment_8.jpg'),
(1368, 'Srðana', 'Èuliæ', '', '098448133', 'sculic@kbsplit.hr srdjana.culic@st.htnet', 'Split', 'Vickotina 5 Split, k.è. 13265,  ZEM 9624', 'For sale', 'Old stone house', '350', '15', '27', 2, '50000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 0, 'September 14, 2015', '<p>Izuzetna prilika za ulaganje u nekretninu u samom centru Splita sa moguæno&scaron;æu nadogradnje.&nbsp;Nekretnina je zanimljiva jer je u centru grada gotovo rijetkost pronaæi nekretninu gdje postoji moguænost nadogradnje.&nbsp;Smje&scaron;tena je istoèno od Dioklecijanove palaèe i Rive, dok je popularna pla¾a Baèvice udaljena 10 minuta pje&scaron;ke.&nbsp;Trenutno je izgraðeno samo prizemlje povr&scaron;ine 15 m2, a moguæe je nadograditi jo&scaron; 2 eta¾e i nadgraðe, te bi se dobila ukupna povr&scaron;ina od 60 m2.</p>', '<p>We are offering this unusual building plot as an opportunity to invest in real estate in the center of Split. The plot consists of a patch of land 15m sq and on this can be built a property of four floors that has a total of 60m sq. All the services are close by.&nbsp;It is located east of the Diocletian''s Palace and Riva promenade, 10minutes from the public beaches.&nbsp;The street is quiet, with little traffic,yet conveniently close to all necessary facilities, the main shopping area in the Palace, and almost all the historic attractions which make the city so special.</p>', '', '<p>Izuzetna prilika za ulaganje u nekretninu u samom centru Splita sa moguæno&scaron;æu nadogradnje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nekretnina je zanimljiva jer je u centru grada gotovo rijetkost pronaæi nekretninu gdje postoji moguænost nadogradnje.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Smje&scaron;tena je istoèno od Dioklecijanove palaèe i Rive, dok je popularna pla¾a Baèvice udaljena 10 minuta pje&scaron;ke.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nalazi se u mirnoj ulici bez puno prometa, a u blizini svih potrebnih sadr¾aja.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Meðunarodni aerodrom udaljen je 40 min. vo¾nje, &scaron;to je jako bitno ukoliko se ¾elite baviti turistièkim iznajmljivanjem.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Trenutno je izgraðeno samo prizemlje povr&scaron;ine 15 m2, a moguæe je nadograditi jo&scaron; 2 eta¾e i nadgraðe, te bi se dobila ukupna povr&scaron;ina od 60 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sva potrebna infrastruktura nalazi se odmah do nekretnine.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Pristup automobilom je direktan te je moguæe parkirati odmah ispred ulaza.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Takoðer ima prednost blizine trajektne luke i autobusnog kolodvora.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Slobodno nas kontaktirajte ukoliko trebate jo&scaron; dodatnih informacija.</p>', '<p>We are offering this unusual building plot as an opportunity to invest in real estate in the center of Split.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The plot consists of a patch of land 15m sq and on this can be built a property of four floors that has a total of 60m sq.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>All the services are close by.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is located east of the Diocletian''s Palace and Riva promenade, 10minutes from the public beaches.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The street is quiet, with little traffic,yet conveniently close to all necessary facilities, the main shopping area in the Palace, and almost all the historic attractions which make the city so special.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The bus station and the ferry terminal are also within comfortable walking distance, which is another advantage if the property is used for tourism.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The airport is 40 minutes drive, and parking is allowed in front of the property.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact the office for more information, the exact location of the property and to arrange a tour.</p>', '', '1368_Old-stone-house_0.jpg', '1368_Old-stone-house_1.jpg', '1368_Old-stone-house_2.jpg', '1368_Old-stone-house_3.JPG', '1368_Old-stone-house_4.JPG', '1368_Old-stone-house_5.JPG', '1368_Old-stone-house_6.jpg', '1368_Old-stone-house_7.jpg', '1368_Old-stone-house_8.jpg'),
(1369, '', 'Rakiæ', '', '', '', 'Sibenik', 'Brodarica', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '15', '500', '250', 1, '380000', '', 2, 2, 2, 1, 1, 2, 7, 4, 'September 14, 2015', '<p>Kuæa pokraj &Scaron;ibenika, prvi red uz more sa prekrasnim pogledom na otok Krapanj.&nbsp;Kuæa je samostojeæa, te ima stambenu povr&scaron;inu 250 m2, a smje&scaron;tena je &nbsp;na zemlji&scaron;tu povr&scaron;ine 500 m2.&nbsp;Sastoji se od prizemlja i kata povezanih unutarnjim stepenicama.&nbsp;Koncepcija kuæe je takva da se s obzirom na unutarnje stubi&scaron;te i veliku terasu bez veæih graðevinskih radova brzo pretvara u ugodnu obiteljsku kuæu na izvrsnoj lokaciji pogodnoj za cjelogodi&scaron;nji boravak.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>We are offering this first line house in a beautiful small village near Sibenik, with uninterrupted views looking over the sea towards the island of Krapanj. It is situated by the tiny private harbour for only 4 small boats, but it is only a short walk to the centre of this village, and here are several options for coffee bars, bars and cafes. The house is a detached property and is designed a a single family holiday home with a living area of 250 m2 and is located on a large plot of 500 m2. It consists of two floors connected with internal stairs.&nbsp;</p>', '', '<p>Kuæa pokraj &Scaron;ibenika, prvi red uz more sa prekrasnim pogledom na otok Krapanj.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je samostojeæa, te ima stambenu povr&scaron;inu 250 m2, a smje&scaron;tena je &nbsp;na zemlji&scaron;tu povr&scaron;ine 500 m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sastoji se od prizemlja i kata povezanih unutarnjim stepenicama.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Prostorije u prizemlju su dnevni boravak, kuhinja, dvije sobe, kupaonica, i natkrivena terasa.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na katu se nalazi pet spavaæih soba, dvije kupaonice, WC, hodnik i velika terasa okrenuta prema moru.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ju¾na orijentacija.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je kvalitetno sagraðena prije èetrdesetak godina te je potrebna manja adaptacija za podizanje standarda.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Koncepcija kuæe je takva da se s obzirom na unutarnje stubi&scaron;te i veliku terasu bez veæih graðevinskih radova brzo pretvara u ugodnu obiteljsku kuæu na izvrsnoj lokaciji pogodnoj za cjelogodi&scaron;nji boravak.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Teren je pravilnog oblika, te ispred i iza kuæe ima dovoljno prostora za bazen.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Odlièna cestovna komunikacija te direktan pristup s magistrale privatnim putem.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Graðevna dokumentacija i vlasni&scaron;tvo uredno.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za sve dodatne informacije molimo kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured u Splitu.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>We are offering this first line house in a beautiful small village near Sibenik, with uninterrupted views looking over the sea towards the island of Krapanj.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is situated by the tiny private harbour for only 4 small boats, but it is only a short walk to the centre of this village, and here are several options for coffee bars, bars and cafes.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house is a detached property and is designed a a single family holiday home with a living area of 250 m2 and is located on a large plot of 500 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It consists of two floors connected with internal stairs.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Rooms on the ground floor are a living room, kitchen, two bedrooms, bathroom, and fabulous terrace.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Upstairs there are five bedrooms, two bathrooms, toilet, hall and a large balcony facing the sea.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It has a South orientation.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house was designed and built forty years ago and most people would think it needs renovation to raise standards, and this is reflected in the price.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There is plenty of space in front and behind the house for many ideas for improving the property, and these could include a boat store or the addition of a patio area and swimming pool.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There is excellent road access to the village and to the plot for parking.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For further information please contact our office in Split and we can arrange for you to view the property.</p>', '', '1369_House-Villa_0.jpg', '1369_House-Villa_1.jpg', '1369_House-Villa_2.jpg', '1369_House-Villa_3.jpg', '1369_House-Villa_4.jpg', '1369_House-Villa_5.jpg', '1369_House-Villa_6.jpg', '1369_House-Villa_7.jpg', ''),
(1370, 'Anðelka ', 'Mravak', '021 654 625  ', '098 168 0625', '', 'Kastela', 'Don Ivana Èuline 16 Ka¹tel Suæurac, k.è. 703', 'For sale', 'Old stone house', '50', '39', '140', 1, '75000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 'September 14, 2015', '<p>Stara kamena kuæa smje&scaron;tena u sve popularnijim Ka&scaron;telima, u blizini &scaron;ljunèane pla¾e i drugih potrebnih sadr¾aja. Kuæa je udaljena 50 m od mora, dok je automobilom moguæe doæi 35 m od kuæe. Tu je ujedno moguæe i parkirati vozilo.&nbsp;Sastoji se od prizemlja, 1. i 2.kata ukupne netto povr&scaron;ine cca. 140 m2. Prizemlje ima odvojen ulaz, a sastoji se od konobe i kupaonice. U ostatku kuæe se nalazi 1., 2. i 3. kat. Spojeni su unutarnjim stepenicama, a postoji moguænost spajanja sve 4 eta¾e.</p>', '<p>We are offering this very affordable house requiring renovation. It is situated in the closest Kastella to Split - 15 minutes from the airport, 50m from the pebble beach shore, which looks across the bay to the island of Ciovo and Split. This old stone building has a ground, first, second and third floor with a floor area of 140m sq. In the rest of the house are the 1st, 2nd and 3rd floors. They are connected with internal stairs, and the layout internally would allow the possibility of connecting all four floors.</p>', '', '<p>Stara kamena kuæa smje&scaron;tena u sve popularnijim Ka&scaron;telima, u blizini &scaron;ljunèane pla¾e i drugih potrebnih sadr¾aja.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Gradovi Trogir i Split se nalaze u blizini isto kao i meðunarodni aerodrom do kojeg je potrebno cca. 20 minuta vo¾nje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je udaljena 50 m od mora, dok je automobilom moguæe doæi 35 m od kuæe.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Tu je ujedno moguæe i parkirati vozilo.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sastoji se od prizemlja, 1. i 2.kata ukupne netto povr&scaron;ine cca. 140 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Orijentacija kuæe je sjeverozapadna, dok je pogled iz kuæe na ulicu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Prizemlje ima odvojen ulaz, a sastoji se od konobe i kupaonice.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U ostatku kuæe se nalazi 1., 2. i 3. kat.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Spojeni su unutarnjim stepenicama, a postoji moguænost spajanja sve 4 eta¾e.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na 1.katu se nalazi kuhinja + dnevni boravak i kupaonica.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na 2. katu i potkrovlju se nalazi po 1 soba.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæi je potrebno kompletno renoviranje, ali je i u sada&scaron;njem stanju moguæ boravak.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Stojimo na raspolaganju za sva dodatna pitanja.</p>', '<p>We are offering this very affordable house requiring renovation.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is situated in the closest Kastella to Split - 15 minutes from the airport, 50m from the pebble beach shore, which looks across the bay to the island of Ciovo and Split.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is within walking distance of shops, other useful services, bars and cafes along the shoreline.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>This old stone building has a ground, first, second and third floor with afloor area of 140m sq.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The orientation of the house is north-west.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The ground floor has a separate entrance, and consists of one room and a bathroom.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>In the rest of the house are the 1st, 2nd and 3rd floors. &nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>They are connected with internal stairs, and the layout internally would allow the possibility of connecting all four floors.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the 1st floor there is a kitchen, living room and bathroom.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the 2nd floor and top floor there is 1 bedroom on each floor.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house needs complete renovation, but is currently habitable.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact our office in Split for more information and to arrange to visit this property.</p>', '', '1370_Old-stone-house_0.jpg', '1370_Old-stone-house_1.jpg', '1370_Old-stone-house_2.jpg', '1370_Old-stone-house_3.jpg', '1370_Old-stone-house_4.jpg', '1370_Old-stone-house_5.jpg', '1370_Old-stone-house_6.jpg', '1370_Old-stone-house_7.jpg', '1370_Old-stone-house_8.jpg');
INSERT INTO `nekretnina` (`id`, `ime`, `prezime`, `telefon`, `mobitel`, `e_mail`, `lokacija_id`, `adresa`, `status_id`, `vrsta_id`, `udaljenost`, `povrsina`, `stambenapovrsina`, `display`, `cijena`, `cijenatocka`, `ponuda_tjedna`, `new_built`, `must_sell`, `prvi_red_do_mora`, `pogled_na_more`, `bazen`, `broj_soba`, `broj_kupatila`, `datum`, `title_hr`, `title_en`, `title_ge`, `opis_hr`, `opis_en`, `opis_ge`, `PropertyImageURL0`, `PropertyImageURL1`, `PropertyImageURL2`, `PropertyImageURL3`, `PropertyImageURL4`, `PropertyImageURL5`, `PropertyImageURL6`, `PropertyImageURL7`, `PropertyImageURL8`) VALUES
(1371, 'Vedrana', 'Lukaè', '', '091 338 5177', 'v.lukac@global-marketing.hr', 'Zadar', 'Ko¾ino, Zadar, k.è. 370/2 k.o. Diklo', 'For sale', 'Land plot', '350', '1115', '0', 1, '180000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 0, 0, 'September 14, 2015', '<p>Na prodaju nudimo ovo lijepo graðevinsko zemlji&scaron;te s pogledom na more u malom naselju svega 5 minuta vo¾nje od grada Zadra. Stambene je namjene, a mo¾e se izgraditi najvi&scaron;e 600 m2 bruto razvijene povr&scaron;ine i do 4 stambene jedinice.&nbsp;Zemlji&scaron;te od 1115 m2 ima direktan i lagan pristup javnom putu, a sva infrastruktura nalazi se u neposrednoj blizini. Blagi pad terena zahvalan je za gradnju, a osigurava neometani pogled na more. Sa svoje istoène strane parcela granièi za zelenom zonom.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;">CIJENA SNI®ENA SA 200.000 EURA!!</span></p>', '<p>For sale we have this lovely plot with sea view located in a small village, a 5 min car ride from Zadar town. Residential construction is allowed, with maximum of 600 sqm gross and up to four apartments.&nbsp;The plot of 1115 sqm has easy road access and mains infrastructure is nearby. Gentle slope ensures good sea views. A green zone is bordering with the plot from its eastern side.</p>\r\n<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;">PRICE REDUCED FROM 200.000 EURO!!&nbsp;</span></p>', '', '<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;"><strong>CIJENA SNI®ENA SA 200.000 EURA!!</strong></span></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na prodaju nudimo ovo lijepo graðevinsko zemlji&scaron;te s pogledom na more u malom naselju svega 5 minuta vo¾nje od grada Zadra.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Stambene je namjene, a mo¾e se izgraditi najvi&scaron;e 600 m2 bruto razvijene povr&scaron;ine i do 4 stambene jedinice.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Zemlji&scaron;te od 1115 m2 ima direktan i lagan pristup javnom putu, a sva infrastruktura nalazi se u neposrednoj blizini.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Blagi pad terena zahvalan je za gradnju, a osigurava neometani pogled na more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sa svoje istoène strane parcela granièi za zelenom zonom.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Mjesto karakteriziraju lijepe obiteljske kuæe, a svi sadr¾aji potrebni kako za odmor tako i za cjelogodi&scaron;nje ¾ivljenje nalaze se u blizini nekrenine.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Parcela je od mora udaljena svega 350 metara zraène linije.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za sve dodatne informacije molimo kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured u Splitu.&nbsp;</p>', '<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;"><strong>PRICE REDUCED FROM 200.000 EURO!!&nbsp;</strong></span></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For sale we have this lovely plot with sea view located in a small village, a 5 min car ride from Zadar town.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Residential construction is allowed, with maximum of 600 sqm gross and up to four apartments.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The plot of 1115 sqm has easy road access and mains infrastructure is nearby.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Gentle slope ensures good sea views.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>A green zone is bordering with the plot from its eastern side.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>This charming village is characterised by low-rise family homes and offers all basic amenities needed for both vacation and permanent living. &nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The sea is only 350 meters away.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For the further information please contact our office in Split.</p>', '', '1371_Land-plot_0.jpg', '1371_Land-plot_1.jpg', '1371_Land-plot_2.jpg', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(1372, 'Frankica', 'Mileta (Nik¹a)', '', '', '', 'Hvar', 'Pitve', 'For sale', 'Old stone house', '2000', '0', '40', 1, '49000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 0, 0, 'September 14, 2015', '<p>Stara kamena kuæa za renovaciju na otoku Hvaru, s predivnim pogledom na more i mjesto.Sastoji se od prizemlja i prvog kata, ukupne stambene povr&scaron;ine 40 m2.&nbsp;U prizemlju se nalazi konoba.&nbsp;Vanjske kamene stepenice vode na prvi kat s malim balkonom s kojeg se pru¾a prekrasan pogled na more. Kuæa je u ru&scaron;evnom stanju. Orijentirana sjeveroistoèno. Postoji moguænost parkinga u selu. Struja i voda se nalaze do kuæe.</p>', '<p>Renovation project.We have this traditional Dalmatian old stone house for renovation in a smallinland village, with a beautiful view of the sea and the village. It consists of ground and first floors with a total floor area of 40 m2. On the ground floor there is a cellar.&nbsp;There is an external stone staircase leading to the first floor with asmall balcony that offers beautiful views of the sea and natural woodland onthe island. The house is complete ruin, and unsuitable for clients without a good imagination! Two useful points are that the water and electric supplies are close.</p>', '', '<p>Stara kamena kuæa za renovaciju na otoku Hvaru, s predivnim pogledom na more i mjesto.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sastoji se od prizemlja i prvog kata, ukupne stambene povr&scaron;ine 40 m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U prizemlju se nalazi konoba.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Vanjske kamene stepenice vode na prvi kat s malim balkonom s kojeg se pru¾a prekrasan pogled na more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je u ru&scaron;evnom stanju.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Orijentirana sjeveroistoèno.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Postoji moguænost parkinga u selu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Struja i voda se nalaze do kuæe.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Grad Hvar je udaljen 2 km.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za sve dodatne informacije kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured.</p>', '<p><strong>Renovation project</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>We have this traditional Dalmatian old stone house for renovation in a small inland village, with a beautiful view of the sea and the village.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It consists of ground and first floors with a total floor area of 40 m2 (2x20m2).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the ground floor there is a cellar.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There is an external stone staircase leading to the first floor with a small balcony that offers beautiful views of the sea and natural woodland on the island.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house is complete ruin, and unsuitable for clients without a good imagination!</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Two useful points are that the water and electric supplies are close.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Oriented northeast.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There is parking close to the house in the village.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The town of Hvar and beaches are 2 km distant.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For further information contact our office and we can arrange to view the property and help with questions about renovation.</p>', '', '1372_Old-stone-house_0.jpg', '1372_Old-stone-house_1.jpg', '1372_Old-stone-house_2.jpg', '1372_Old-stone-house_3.jpg', '1372_Old-stone-house_4.jpg', '1372_Old-stone-house_5.jpg', '1372_Old-stone-house_6.jpg', '1372_Old-stone-house_7.jpg', ''),
(1373, 'Jana', 'Vyhnalova', '+420226201342', '+420602235702', 'vyhnalova@bellesfleurs.cz', 'Rogoznica', 'Ra¾anj', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '50', '359', '40', 1, '170000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 1, 'September 14, 2015', '<p>Samostojeæa prizemna kuæa u prelijepoj, mirnoj uvali s prirodnim stjenovitim pla¾ama na svega 50 m udaljenosti od kuæe.&nbsp;Stambena povr&scaron;ina kuæe iznosi 40 m2, a nalazi se na parceli povr&scaron;ine 359 m2.&nbsp;Kuæa je u potpunosti opremljena lijepim namje&scaron;tajem, a cijela kuæa je renovirana 2004 godine.&nbsp;Terasa povr&scaron;ine 19 m2 nalazi se ispred kuæe i &nbsp;okru¾ena je autohtonim mediteranskim biljem &scaron;to ovoj prizemnoj kuæi daje poseban &scaron;arm.&nbsp;U sklopu parcele je parking povr&scaron;ine 23 m2.</p>', '<p>We have this single storey, detached house, in a beautiful, quiet bay with natural rocky beaches, on the mainland near Rogoznica.&nbsp;It is situated 50 m from the beach and shore, in a quiet area of the village, and 2 kilometres from the centre of the nearest town which has restaurants, bars and shops etc. it is 10 minutes on a bike!&nbsp;Inside the property the living area is 40 m2 and it is located on a plot of 359 m2. There is a terrace of 19 m2 in front of the house.&nbsp;As part of the plot is a parking area of 23m sq.&nbsp;</p>', '', '<p>Samostojeæa prizemna kuæa u prelijepoj, mirnoj uvali s prirodnim stjenovitim pla¾ama na svega 50 m udaljenosti od kuæe.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Stambena povr&scaron;ina kuæe iznosi 40 m2, a nalazi se na parceli povr&scaron;ine 359 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa se sastoji od prostranog dnevnog boravka, kuhinje, kupaonice i spavaæe sobe.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je u potpunosti opremljena lijepim namje&scaron;tajem, a cijela kuæa je renovirana 2004 godine.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Terasa povr&scaron;ine 19 m2 nalazi se ispred kuæe i &nbsp;okru¾ena je autohtonim mediteranskim biljem &scaron;to ovoj prizemnoj kuæi daje poseban &scaron;arm.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U sklopu parcele je parking povr&scaron;ine 23 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Udaljenost do restorana, kafiæa, trgovina je 2 km , a do aerodrom je 25 km.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa ima struju, septièku jamu i gradsku vodu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za dodatne informacije molimo kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured u Splitu.</p>', '<p>We have this single storey, detached house, in a beautiful, quiet bay with natural rocky beaches, on the mainland near Rogoznica.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is situated 50 m from the beach and shore, in a quiet area of the village, and 2 kilometres from the centre of the nearest town which has restaurants, bars and shops etc. it is 10 minutes on a bike!&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Inside the property the living area is 40 m2 and it is located on a plot of 359 m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house consists of a spacious living room, kitchen, bathroom and bedroom.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house is fully furnished with nice furniture, and the whole house was renovated in 2004.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There is a terrace of 19 m2 in front of the house and the property issurrounded by lush Mediterranean vegetation which gives this one-storey house a special charm.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>As part of the plot is a parking area of 23m sq.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house has electricity, a septic tank and mains water.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The airport is 25 kilometres away.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For further information, please contact our office in Split.</p>', '', '1373_House-Villa_0.JPG', '1373_House-Villa_1.JPG', '1373_House-Villa_2.JPG', '1373_House-Villa_3.JPG', '1373_House-Villa_4.JPG', '1373_House-Villa_5.JPG', '1373_House-Villa_6.JPG', '1373_House-Villa_7.JPG', '1373_House-Villa_8.jpg'),
(1374, '', 'Rakiæ', '', '', '', 'Murter', 'Tisno', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '90', '100', '130', 1, '219000', '', 2, 1, 2, 2, 1, 2, 3, 2, 'September 15, 2015', '<p>Murter, novogradnja s otvorenim pogledom na more.&nbsp;Kuæa je dvojna, dovr&scaron;ena u lipnju 2015 g.&nbsp;Udaljena je samo 90 m od mora.&nbsp;Sastoji se od prizemlja, kata i visokog potkrovlja ukupne stambene povr&scaron;ine 130 m2.&nbsp;Vrt ima povr&scaron;inu 100 m2.&nbsp;U prizemlju je prostorija gdje su dovedene sve instalacije i mo¾e se napraviti zasebni stan ili se mogu dobiti dodatne dvije ili tri spavaæe sobe.&nbsp;Na katu i visokom potkrovlju je dvoeta¾ni stan.<br /><br /></p>', '<p>We are pleased to offer this new, semi-detached building with open sea views. The house was completed in June 2015 and it is situated 90m from the shore, on the mainland opposite the island of Murter.&nbsp;The house has a ground floor, first floor and top floor and the total residential area is 130 m2. The garden has an area of 100 m2. The ground floor is a spacious room which is currently empty, but has the connections ready so that it could be made into a separate apartment.&nbsp;On the first and second floor it is a duplex apartment.</p>', '', '<p>Murter, novogradnja s otvorenim pogledom na more.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je dvojna, dovr&scaron;ena u lipnju 2015 g.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Udaljena je samo 90 m od mora.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sastoji se od prizemlja, kata i visokog potkrovlja ukupne stambene povr&scaron;ine 130 m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Vrt ima povr&scaron;inu 100 m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U prizemlju je prostorija gdje su dovedene sve instalacije i mo¾e se napraviti zasebni stan ili se mogu dobiti dodatne dvije ili tri spavaæe sobe.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na katu i visokom potkrovlju je dvoeta¾ni stan.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sastoji se od dvije spavaæe sobe, kupaonice i balkona u donjem dijelu, dok je zbog pogleda dnevni boravak, sa kuhinjom i blagovaonicom u gornjem dijelu.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U gornjem dijelu je i dodatni wc, te terasa na koju se izlazi iz dnevnog boravka.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa ima visoku razinu opremljenosti, dio fasade je u kamenu.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Jugozapadno orijentirana, u zavjetrini od bure, s lijepim pogledom.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Novogradnja sa dobrim rasporedom, pogodna za cjelogodi&scaron;nji boravak u mjestu koje ima sve potrebne sadr¾aje.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je udaljena od centra mjesta 300 m.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Lijeva strana gledano prema moru je na prodaju, dok je desna prodana.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za sve dodatne informacije molimo kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>We are pleased to offer this new, semi-detached building with open sea views.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house was completed in June 2015 and it is situated 90m from the shore, on the mainland opposite the island of Murter.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house has a ground floor, first floor and top floor and the total residential area is 130 m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The garden has an area of 100 m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The ground floor is a spacious room which is currently empty, but has the connections ready so that it could be made into a separate apartment.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the first and second floor it is a duplex apartment.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It consists of two bedrooms, a bathroom and a balcony on the lower part, while the living room, kitchen and dining room are in the upper part and have excellent sea views from most of the windows.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The upper part has a wide balcony which you enter through sliding doors from the living room.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house has a high quality fittings and was well built with part of the facade built in stone.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is south-west oriented, in the wind sheltered area, with a nice view.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The distance from the centre of the village with shops, bars, cafes and restaurants is about 300m.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Left side (facing the sea view) is for sale, while the right side is sold.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Split airport is 1.15 hour distant.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For further information please contact our office.</p>', '', '1374_House-Villa_0.jpg', '1374_House-Villa_1.jpg', '1374_House-Villa_2.jpg', '1374_House-Villa_3.jpg', '1374_House-Villa_4.jpg', '1374_House-Villa_5.jpg', '1374_House-Villa_6.jpg', '1374_House-Villa_7.jpg', '1374_House-Villa_8.jpg'),
(1375, 'Hrvoje ', 'Brajkoviæ - Sitolor ', '099 660 0088', '099 251 6848', 'hrvoje.brajkovic@sitolor.hr ', 'Brac', 'Pavli¹iæa Vrtli Postira, k.è. 1149 k.o. postira, ZU 1920', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '200', '0', '0', 1, '94000', '', 2, 1, 2, 2, 1, 2, 1, 1, 'September 15, 2015', '<p>U ponudi imamo ove novoizgraðene stanove nedaleko od centra manjeg mjesta na sjevernoj strani otoka Braèa i svega 10tak minuta vo¾nje od trajektnog pristani&scaron;ta u Supetru. Okoli&scaron; je u fazi ureðenja, a stanovi su prikljuèeni na infrastrukturu i useljivi. Stanovi nisu namje&scaron;teni, ali bez obzira na to predstavljaju dobru priliku za kupce nekretnina za odmor s obzirom na njihovu cijenu.</p>', '<p>For sale we have this great newly built apartment building, not far from the center of a lovely village on the northern side of Brac island and a short car ride from the main town/ferry port of Supetar.&nbsp;The property is being lanscaped at the moment, it is already connected to all utilities and ready to move in. Apartments are not furnished; still they represent an excellent opportunity for a holiday property near the sea for the buyers on the budget.</p>', '', '<p>U ponudi imamo ove novoizgraðene stanove nedaleko od centra manjeg mjesta na sjevernoj strani otoka Braèa i svega 10tak minuta vo¾nje od trajektnog pristani&scaron;ta u Supetru.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Okoli&scaron; je u fazi ureðenja, a stanovi su prikljuèeni na infrastrukturu i useljivi.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Stanovi nisu namje&scaron;teni, ali bez obzira na to predstavljaju dobru priliku za kupce nekretnina za odmor s obzirom na njihovu cijenu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Stan P1 (nisko prizemlje, bez pogleda): 37,99 m2 + 4 m2 ostava + 37,76 m2 vrt + 12,15 m2 parking, 98.400 EUR</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Stan P2 (nisko prizemlje, bez pogleda): 40,53 m2 + 33,58 m2 vrt + 12,15 m2 parking, 94.000 EUR</strong></p>\r\n<p><strong><br /></strong></p>\r\n<p><strong>Stan VP3 (visoko prizemlje, djelomièan pogled): 47,90 m2 + 11,57 m2 parking, 99.000 EUR</strong></p>\r\n<p><strong><br /></strong></p>\r\n<p><strong>Stan VP4 (visoko prizemlje, bez pogleda): 45,42 m2 + 11,57 m2 parking, 94.200 EUR</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Stan 1K5 (prvi kat, pogled na more): 55,92 m2 + 11,57 m2 parking, 114.600 EUR</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za dodatne informacije molimo kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured u Splitu.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>For sale we have this great newly built apartment building, not far from the center of a lovely village on the northern side of Brac island and a short car ride from the main town/ferry port of Supetar.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property is being lanscaped at the moment, it is already connected to all utilities and ready to move in.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartments are not furnished; still they represent an excellent opportunity for a holiday property near the sea for the buyers on the budget.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Apartment P1 (lower ground floor, no views): 37,99 m2 + 4 m2 storage + 37,76 m2 garden + 12,15 m2 parking, 98.400 EUR</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Apartment P2 (lower ground floor, no views): 40,53 m2 + 33,58 m2 garden + 12,15 m2 parking, 94.000 EUR</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Apartment VP3 (higher ground floor, partial views): 47,90 m2 + 11,57 m2 parking, 99.000 EUR</strong></p>\r\n<p><strong><br /></strong></p>\r\n<p><strong>Apartment VP4 (higher ground floor, no views): 45,42 m2 + 11,57 m2 parking, 94.200 EUR</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Apartment 1K5 (first floor, sea views): 55,92 m2 + 11,57 m2 parking, 114.600 EUR</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For further information please contact our office in Split.&nbsp;</p>', '', '1375_Apartment_0.jpg', '1375_Apartment_1.jpg', '1375_Apartment_2.jpg', '1375_Apartment_3.jpg', '1375_Apartment_4.jpg', '1375_Apartment_5.jpg', '1375_Apartment_6.jpg', '1375_Apartment_7.jpg', '1375_Apartment_8.jpg'),
