ogled na more): 41,02 m2 + 10,80 m2 parking, 85.200 EUR</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za dodatne informacije molimo kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured u Splitu.</p>', '<p>For sale we have this great newly built building, not far from the center of a lovely village on the northern side of Brac island and a short car ride from the main town/ferry port of Supetar.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property is being lanscaped at the moment, it is already connected to all utilities and ready to move in.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartments are not furnished; still they represent an excellent opportunity for a holiday property near the sea for the buyers on the budget.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Apartment NP1 (lower ground floor, sea views): 39,12 m2 + 46,15 m2 garden + 14,01 m2 parking, 97.300 EUR</strong></p>\r\n<p><strong><br /></strong></p>\r\n<p><strong>Apartment NP2 (lower ground floor, sea views): 29,67 m2 + 3,90 m2 storage + 52,56 m2 garden + 11,54 m2 parking, 88.400 EUR</strong></p>\r\n<p><strong><br /></strong></p>\r\n<p><strong>Apartment 1K5 (first floor, sea views): 41,02 m2 + 10,80 m2 parking, 85.200 EUR</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For further information please contact our office in Split.</p>', '', '1377_Apartment_0.JPG', '1377_Apartment_1.JPG', '1377_Apartment_2.JPG', '1377_Apartment_3.JPG', '1377_Apartment_4.JPG', '1377_Apartment_5.JPG', '1377_Apartment_6.JPG', '1377_Apartment_7.JPG', '1377_Apartment_8.jpg'),
(1378, 'Nik¹a', 'Zaninoviæ', '', '', '', 'Hvar', 'Jagodna', 'For sale', 'Old stone house', '500', '1800', '56', 1, '70000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 0, 0, 'September 15, 2015', '<p>Stara kamena kuæa za renovaciju na otoku Hvaru, s otvorenim pogledom na more i selo. Ukupna stambena povr&scaron;ina iznosi 54 m2, dok zemlji&scaron;te ima povr&scaron;inu 2000 m2. Kuæa ima mali vrt ispred te pristupni put. Orijentirana je ju¾no. Prisutna infrastruktura. Udaljena je 500 m od mora.</p>', '<p>We are offering this old stone house with huge potential as a renovation project. It is a small traditional cottage on a large plot, elevated by natural geography to give with sweeping views of the sea and the village. It has a total floor area of 54 m2, while the land has an area of 2000 m2. The house has a small garden in front and access is from a short, private, access road.&nbsp;It is oriented south.</p>', '', '<p>Stara kamena kuæa za renovaciju na otoku Hvaru, s otvorenim pogledom na more i selo.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ukupna stambena povr&scaron;ina je 54 m2, dok zemlji&scaron;te ima povr&scaron;inu 2000 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa ima mali vrt ispred te pristupni put.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Orijentirana je ju¾no.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je prikljuèena na struju te ima cisternu za vodu.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Udaljena je 500 m od mora.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Grad Hvar je udaljen 10 km, dok je trajektna luka udaljena 15 km.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za sve dodatne informacije kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured.</p>', '<p><strong>Renovation project</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>We are offering this old stone house with huge potential as a renovation project.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is a small traditional cottage on a large plot, elevated by natural geography to give with sweeping views of the sea and the village.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It has a total floor area of 54 m2, while the land has an area of 2000 m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house has a small garden in front and access is from a short, private, access road.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is oriented south.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>House is connected to the electricity and it has water tank.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is located 500 m from the sea.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The village is 10 kilometres from the Historic town of Hvar, while the ferry port is 15 km away.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For further information contact our office and we can help organise a tour and with information on renovating property in Croatia.</p>', '', '1378_Old-stone-house_0.jpg', '1378_Old-stone-house_1.jpg', '1378_Old-stone-house_2.jpg', '1378_Old-stone-house_3.jpg', '', '', '', '', ''),
(1379, 'Nikica', 'Dragun', '', '0915555237', '', 'Trogir', 'Sv. Petra 43 Trogir (Èiovska strana)', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '50', '0', '17', 1, '43000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 1, 'September 15, 2015', '<p>Simpatièan studio apartman na jedinstvenoj lokaciji na otoku Èiovu u blizini stare jezgre grada Trogira.&nbsp;Udaljenost od mora je 50 m, dok je Trogirska riva udaljena svega 5 minuta hodanja. Najbli¾i pristup automobilom je 30 metara od apartmana.&nbsp;Nalazi se u prizemlju u mirnoj i slijepoj ulici. Smje&scaron;ten je u prizemlju stare kamene kuæe sa potpuno odvojenim ulazom sa zapadne strane.&nbsp;***Na prodaju je i ostatak kuæe koji se sastoji od 1., 2. i 3. kata koji su spojeni unutarnjim stepenicama po cijeni od 120.000 &euro;.</p>', '<p>We have this well presented and modernised studio apartment in a unique location in Trogir old town. It is situated on the ground floor of a quiet street with no through access, only 50m from the sea, while Trogir Riva/waterfront is only 5 minutes walking. Nearest access by car is 30 meters away. It is the ground floor of an old stone house, in good condition, and with a separate entrance from the west side. The rest of the house (which consists of first, second and third floor), and which are connected with internal steps is for sale with a price of 120k euro.</p>', '', '<p>Simpatièan studio apartman na jedinstvenoj lokaciji na otoku Èiovu u blizini stare jezgre grada Trogira.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Udaljenost od mora je 50 m, dok je Trogirska riva udaljena svega 5 minuta hodanja.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Meðunarodni aerodrom udaljen je 10 minuta vo¾nje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Najbli¾i pristup automobilom je 30 metara od apartmana.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nalazi se u prizemlju u mirnoj i slijepoj ulici.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Smje&scaron;ten je u prizemlju stare kamene kuæe sa potpuno odvojenim ulazom sa zapadne strane.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sastoji se od kupaonice i 1 prostrane sobe gdje se trenutno nalaze dva manja kreveta.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U apartmanu je takoðer moguæe ugraditi kuhinju zbog veæ postojeæih instalacija.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nedavno je potpuno renoviran, namje&scaron;ten i klimatiziran.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Jako je zanimljiv i ureðen u dalmatinskom stilu &scaron;to je velika pogodnost kod turistièkog iznajmljivanja.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>***Na prodaju je i ostatak kuæe koji se sastoji od 1., 2. i 3. kata koji su spojeni unutarnjim stepenicama.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Cijena je 120.000 &euro;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>®elite li vlastitu nekretninu u jednom od najljep&scaron;ih gradova u Dalmaciji, kontaktirajte nas ukoliko imate dodatnih pitanja ili ¾elite direktno dogovoriti razgledavanje.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>We have this well presented and modernised studio apartment in a unique location in Trogir old town.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is situated on the ground floor of a quiet street with no through access, only 50m from the sea, while Trogir Riva/waterfront is only 5 minutes walking.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The international airport is 10 minutes away.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nearest access by car is 30 meters away.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is the ground floor of an old stone house, in good condition, and with a separate entrance from the west side.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Inside the apartment it it has a bathroom and one large room containing two single beds.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is currently being used as an extra bedroom for tourism, but the connections are in place to install a kitchen wherein it can become an independent dwelling.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please note that the rest of the building is also for sale and this can be bought independently, or with this apartment.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The rest of the house (which consists of first, second and third floor), and which are connected with internal steps is for sale with a price of 120k euro.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The ground floor apartment has recently been completely renovated, furnished and had air conditioning installed.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It has been decorated in Dalmatian style and many tourists have commented positively.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The town of Trogir is a UNESCO heritage site, and the centre of tourism and cultural events for the area, so is in constant demand from tourists enjoying this charming town.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact our office to arrange to visit this property.</p>', '', '1379_Apartment_0.jpg', '1379_Apartment_1.jpg', '1379_Apartment_2.jpg', '1379_Apartment_3.jpg', '1379_Apartment_4.jpg', '1379_Apartment_5.jpg', '1379_Apartment_6.jpg', '1379_Apartment_7.jpg', '1379_Apartment_8.jpg'),
(1380, 'Maja', 'Spaija', '+385 21 888 026', '+385 98 906 04 25', 'm.spaija@yahoo.com', 'Trogir', 'Cesta Domovinske Zahvalnosti 101 Arbanija', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '5', '581', '250', 1, '560000', '', 2, 2, 2, 1, 1, 2, 8, 5, 'September 16, 2015', '<p>Kuæa u 1.redu do mora odmah do &scaron;ljunèane pla¾e, smje&scaron;tena na otoku Èiova udaljena cca. 10 minuta od grada Trogira. Na samoj pla¾i se uz sklopu kuæe nalazi i gara¾a za brod (38 m2) sa direktnim pristupom iz mora. Povr&scaron;ina zemlji&scaron;ta je 581 m2, sa prostranim kultiviranim vrtom gdje se nalazi kamin. Kuæa se sastoji od ukupno 5 apartmana koji su u funkciji turistièkog iznajmljivanja &ndash; tri studio ap., jedan trosobni i jedan dvosobni. Ukupna povr&scaron;ina iznosi 250 m2, a kuæa se prote¾e na suteren, 1.kat i 2.kat (potkrovlje).</p>', '<p>We are pleased to offer this rare opportunity to buy one of the superior first line villas on the shore of Ciovo Island. The land area is 581 m2, with a large cultivated garden where there is a bbq/fireplace. The house consists of 5 apartments which are currently being used for tourist rental - three studio apartments, one three bedroom apartment, and one one bedroom apartment. The total living area is 250 m2, which includes the basement, 1st and 2nd floor (attic).&nbsp;</p>', '', '<p>Kuæa u 1.redu do mora odmah do &scaron;ljunèane pla¾e, smje&scaron;tena na otoku Èiova udaljena cca. 10 minuta od grada Trogira.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na samoj pla¾i se uz sklopu kuæe nalazi i gara¾a za brod (38 m2) sa direktnim pristupom iz mora.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Povi&scaron;e gara¾e se nalazi terasa èija je velièina jednaka kao i gara¾a.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Lokacija je jedinstvena jer se izmeðu kuæe i pla¾e ne nalazi cesta i pla¾a je skoro kao privatna.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Povr&scaron;ina zemlji&scaron;ta je 581 m2, sa prostranim kultiviranim vrtom gdje se nalazi kamin.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Dovoljno je mjesta za izgradnju bazena &scaron;to bi dodatno obogatilo ionako veæ vrijednu nekretninu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa se sastoji od ukupno 5 apartmana koji su u funkciji turistièkog iznajmljivanja &ndash; tri studio apartmana, jedan trosobni i jedan dvosobni.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ukupna povr&scaron;ina iznosi 250 m2, a kuæa se prote¾e na suteren, 1.kat i 2.kat (potkrovlje).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sa svih terasa se pru¾a prekrasan pogled na more i vrt.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je u jako dobrom stanju, ali je potrebno jo&scaron; ulaganja.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ispred se nalaze 2 parking mjesta dovoljna za 4 automobila.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kontaktirajte nas ukoliko je ba&scaron; ovo nekretnina koja odgovara Va&scaron;im ¾eljama.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Stojimo na usluzi za sva dodatna pitanja.</p>', '<p>We are pleased to offer this rare opportunity to buy one of the superior first line villas on the shore of Ciovo Island.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is situated just a few yards back from the sea, with no roadway between the sea and the house, and with the unusual asset of a private boat house (38m sq) the roof of which makes a superb terrace.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The beach at this point is small pebbles, which makes the water completely clear and safe for children wanting to swim.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The land area is 581 m2, with a large cultivated garden where there is a bbq/fireplace.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There is enough space to build a swimming pool which would further enrich an already valuable property.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house consists of 5 apartments which are currently being used for tourist rental - three studio apartments, one three bedroom apartment, and one one bedroom apartment.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The total living area is 250 m2, which includes the basement, 1st and 2nd floor (attic). &nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house is in very good condition, but needs some redecorating and perhaps modernising.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>At the rear of the house there are parking spaces sufficient for 4 cars.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact us if this property matches your wishes!&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>We are at your disposal for any additional questions and to arrange to visit this property.</p>', '', '1380_House-Villa_0.jpg', '1380_House-Villa_1.jpg', '1380_House-Villa_2.jpg', '1380_House-Villa_3.jpg', '1380_House-Villa_4.jpg', '1380_House-Villa_5.jpg', '1380_House-Villa_6.jpg', '1380_House-Villa_7.jpg', '1380_House-Villa_8.jpg'),
(1381, 'Vivianne ', 'Pickford', '00441276 671550 ', '0919805786 - 432/6  7.etaza', 'Viv.pickford55@gmail.com graham@ecifa.co', 'Trogir', '©pira Puoviæa I/ 52c  Trogir (Balan)', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '500', '0', '135', 1, '325000', '', 2, 1, 2, 2, 1, 2, 3, 2, 'September 17, 2015', '<p>Luksuzni penthouse sa prekrasnim pogledom na more na otoku Èiovu u blizini pla¾e i grada Trogira.&nbsp;Polo¾aj zgrade je odlièan zbog blizine starog centra Trogira do kojeg je potrebno 5 minuta pje&scaron;ke.&nbsp;Najbli¾a pla¾a je udaljena cca. 500m. Popularna &scaron;ljunèana pla¾a sa mnogim barovima i ostalim sadr¾ajima je udaljena 10 minuta pje&scaron;ke.&nbsp;Apartman je orijentacije sjever &ndash; jug, a smje&scaron;ten je na 3.katu. Pripadaju mu 2 vanjska parking mjesta i ostava u podrumu.&nbsp;Ukupna povr&scaron;ina iznosi 135 m2.</p>', '<p>Presenting this luxury penthouse with stunning sea views, on the island Ciovo near the beach and the town of Trogir.&nbsp;The apartment is situated in an excellent location, close to the old town of Trogir which takes 5 minutes on foot, and less than that to reach the beaches facing out from Okrug.&nbsp;The nearest beach is approx. 500m. and here is the popular pebble beach with many bars, music and other attractions. The apartment''s orientation is north - south, and it is located on the 3rd floor (top floor). The total area inside the property is 135 m2.</p>', '', '<p>Luksuzni penthouse sa prekrasnim pogledom na more na otoku Èiovu u blizini pla¾e i grada Trogira.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Polo¾aj zgrade je odlièan zbog blizine starog centra Trogira do kojeg je potrebno 5 minuta pje&scaron;ke.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Najbli¾a pla¾a je udaljena cca. 500m.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Popularna &scaron;ljunèana pla¾a sa mnogim barovima i ostalim sadr¾ajima je udaljena 10 minuta pje&scaron;ke.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartman je orijentacije sjever &ndash; jug, a smje&scaron;ten je na 3.katu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Pripadaju mu 2 vanjska parking mjesta i ostava u podrumu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ukupna povr&scaron;ina iznosi 135 m2, a sastoji se od 2 hodnika, 2 kupaonice, prostranog dnevnog boravka sa blagovaonicom i kuhinjom, 3 spavaèe sobe i 2 loggie sa prekrasnim pogledom na more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Svaka soba je opremljena klimatizacijskim ureðajem kao i dnevni dio.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U apartmanu je instaliran internet, dok je elektrièni napon jaèi od uobièajenog.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U cijenu je ukljuèen namje&scaron;taj u spavaæim sobama i dnevnom boravku te kuhinja sa jako kvalitetnim ureðajima.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Takoðer je u cijenu ukljuèena i sva oprema u kupaonicama.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>O svim ostalim skupim dizajnerskim detaljima se mo¾e naknadno pregovarati.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na usluzi smo za sva dodatna pitanja.</p>', '<p>Presenting this luxury penthouse with stunning sea views, on the island Ciovo near the beach and the town of Trogir.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The apartment is situated in an excellent location, close to the old town of Trogir which takes 5 minutes on foot, and less than that to reach the beaches facing out from Okrug.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The nearest beach is approx. 500m. and here is the popular pebble beach with many bars, music and other attractions.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The apartment''s orientation is north - south, and it is located on the 3rd floor (top floor).&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It has 2 parking spaces and basement.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The total area inside the property is 135 m2 and it consists of 2 halls, 2 bathrooms, a spacious open plan style family living room with dining area and kitchen, 3 bedrooms and 2 balconies with beautiful views of the sea, and the old town of Trogir.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Each room is equipped with independent air conditioning.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The apartment has installed Internet connection.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The price includes furniture and fittings in the bedrooms, the kitchen with the high quality appliances and furniture in the living room.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property was built with high quality fittings and was well decorated.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It has been looked after and is a good opportunity to buy a top quality apartment in a good location.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact our office to arrange to visit this property.</p>', '', '1381_Apartment_0.jpg', '1381_Apartment_1.jpg', '1381_Apartment_2.jpg', '1381_Apartment_3.jpg', '1381_Apartment_4.jpg', '1381_Apartment_5.jpg', '1381_Apartment_6.jpg', '1381_Apartment_7.jpg', '1381_Apartment_8.jpg'),
(1382, '', 'Pasqua d.o.o.', '', 'Lada Mimica 091 399 9904 ', 'adriano.simeoni@gmail.com', 'Lastovo', 'Jurjeva Luka Lastovo, k.è. 13068/105, 13068/106 k.o. lastovo', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '10', '820', '1211', 1, '812500', '', 2, 1, 2, 1, 1, 2, 19, 12, 'September 17, 2015', '<p>Nudimo dvije apartmanske zgrade smje&scaron;tene u mirnoj predivnoj uvali na otoku Lastovu.&nbsp;Oba objekta su u niskoj roh-bau fazi i buduæi vlasnik treba dovr&scaron;iti objekte izvana i iznutra (instalaterski, obrtnièki i zavr&scaron;ni radovi). Projekt se prodaje u zateèenom stanju. Prikljuèak struje se nalazi na nekretnini, a voda je u neposrednoj blizini.&nbsp;Svaka zgrada ima 6 apartmana, jednosobne i dvosobne te dovoljan broj parkirali&scaron;nih mjesta. Svi stanovi imaju izvrstan pogled na more.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>We are offering two seafront apartment buildings for sale, located in a tranquil charming bay on Lastovo island.&nbsp;Both buildings are in the phase of shell completion and the future owner has to do the plumbing, wiring, flooring, tiling, facade etc. The project is on sale in ''as-is'' condition. Electricity is on the site, while the mains water is nearby the property.&nbsp;Each building hosts 6 apartments, a combination of 1-bedroom and 2-bedroom units. All apartments has parking place and feature gorgeous sea views.&nbsp;</p>', '', '<p><strong>Dvije apartmanske zgrade pokraj mora</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nudimo dvije apartmanske zgrade smje&scaron;tene u mirnoj predivnoj uvali na otoku Lastovu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Oba objekta su u niskoj roh-bau fazi i buduæi vlasnik treba dovr&scaron;iti objekte izvana i iznutra (instalaterski, obrtnièki i zavr&scaron;ni radovi).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Projekt se prodaje u zateèenom stanju.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Prikljuèak struje se nalazi na nekretnini, a voda je u neposrednoj blizini.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Svaka zgrada ima 6 apartmana, jednosobne i dvosobne te dovoljan broj parkirali&scaron;nih mjesta.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Svi stanovi imaju izvrstan pogled na more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U cijeni je ukljuèen PDV, &scaron;to svakako ide u prilog kao odbitak kupcima koji se nalaze u PDV sustavu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Postoji moguænost kupnje tvrtke osnovane za gradnju projekta, pri èemu nema poreza na promet nekretnina.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za dodatne informacije molimo kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured u Splitu.&nbsp;</p>', '<p><strong>Two apartment buildings by the sea</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>We are offering two seafront apartment buildings for sale, located in a tranquil charming bay on Lastovo island.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Both buildings are in the phase of shell completion and the future owner has to do the plumbing, wiring, flooring, tiling, facade etc.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The project is on sale in ''as-is'' condition.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Electricity is on the site, while the mains water is nearby the property.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Each building hosts 6 apartments, a combination of 1-bedroom and 2-bedroom units.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>All apartments has parking place and feature gorgeous sea views.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The price includes the VAT, therefore VAT-regostered buyer can make significant savings.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Aternatively, a company owning the project can be bought (no property transfer tax).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For further information please contact our office in Split.&nbsp;</p>', '', '1382_House-Villa_0.jpg', '1382_House-Villa_1.jpg', '1382_House-Villa_2.jpg', '1382_House-Villa_3.jpg', '1382_House-Villa_4.jpg', '1382_House-Villa_5.jpg', '1382_House-Villa_6.jpg', '1382_House-Villa_7.jpg', '1382_House-Villa_8.jpg');
INSERT INTO `nekretnina` (`id`, `ime`, `prezime`, `telefon`, `mobitel`, `e_mail`, `lokacija_id`, `adresa`, `status_id`, `vrsta_id`, `udaljenost`, `povrsina`, `stambenapovrsina`, `display`, `cijena`, `cijenatocka`, `ponuda_tjedna`, `new_built`, `must_sell`, `prvi_red_do_mora`, `pogled_na_more`, `bazen`, `broj_soba`, `broj_kupatila`, `datum`, `title_hr`, `title_en`, `title_ge`, `opis_hr`, `opis_en`, `opis_ge`, `PropertyImageURL0`, `PropertyImageURL1`, `PropertyImageURL2`, `PropertyImageURL3`, `PropertyImageURL4`, `PropertyImageURL5`, `PropertyImageURL6`, `PropertyImageURL7`, `PropertyImageURL8`) VALUES
(1383, 'Alexis', 'Nicou', 'Nina 091 1829615, 092 2861170', '+46 70 7956161', 'alexis@nicou.se , alexisnicou@gmail.com ', 'Brac', 'Milna, k.è. 336/1, 336/2 k.o. Milna', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '7', '86', '145', 1, '350000', '', 2, 2, 2, 1, 1, 2, 3, 3, 'September 18, 2015', '<p>Predstavljamo Vam lijepu kamenu kuæu uz rivu i more, smje&scaron;tenu u centru malog mjesta na otoku Braèu. Nekretnina se nalazi u neposrednoj blizini mora i svih sadr¾aja potrebnih za ugodan odmor, ali i dugotrajniji boravak. Sastoji se od prizemlja, prvog i drugog kata.&nbsp;Apartman nije i cijelosti dovr&scaron;en i opremljen. Mo¾e lako poslu¾iti kao gostinjski smje&scaron;taj ili za turistièki najam.&nbsp;Ukupna stambena povr&scaron;ina kuæe iznosi 145 m2.</p>\r\n<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;">CIJENA SNI®ENA SA 390.000 EURA!!</span></p>', '<p>We are proudly presenting this lovely stone house for sale, located in a charming village on Brac island. The property is right in the town center, a stone''s throw to the sea and at walking distance to all amenities.&nbsp;Total living area of the house is 145 sqm. The property has been recently renovated, incl. new air-condition and land line with internet.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;">PRICED TO SELL &ndash; REDUCED FROM 390 TO 350 THOUSAND!!</span></p>', '', '<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;"><strong>CIJENA SNI®ENA SA 390.000 EURA!!</strong></span></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Lijepa kamena kuæa uz more</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Predstavljamo Vam lijepu kamenu kuæu uz rivu i more, smje&scaron;tenu u centru malog mjesta na otoku Braèu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nekretnina se nalazi u neposrednoj blizini mora i svih sadr¾aja potrebnih za ugodan odmor, ali i dugotrajniji boravak.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Prizemlje se sastoji od studio apartmana kojem se pristupa putem zasebnog ulaza iz unutarnjeg dvori&scaron;ta.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartman nije i cijelosti dovr&scaron;en i opremljen.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Mo¾e lako poslu¾iti kao gostinjski smje&scaron;taj ili za turistièki najam.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Vanjsko stepeni&scaron;te vodi na prvu eta¾u na kojoj se nalazi prostrani dveni boravak, dvije spavaæe sobe i kupaonica.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Unutarnjim stepeniptem dolazi se na drugi kat na kojem su smje&scaron;teni kuhinja, blagovaonica i terasa.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ukupna stambena povr&scaron;ina kuæe iznosi 145 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ako ste u potrazi za autentiènom dalmatinskom kamenom kuæom uz more, ovo je prilika koju ne smijete propustiti. &nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za dodatne informacije molimo kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured u Splitu.</p>', '<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;"><strong>PRICED TO SELL &ndash; REDUCED FROM 390 TO 350 THOUSAND!!</strong></span></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Lovely seafront stone house for sale</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>We are proudly presenting this lovely stone house for sale, located in a charming village on Brac island.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property is right in the town center, a stone''s throw to the sea and at walking distance to all amenities.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ground floor comprises of a studio apartment with toilet and shower, yet to be furnished.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Featuring separate entrance from the courtyard, this unit has good rental potential or it can easily host your guests.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Outdoor stairs lead onto the first floor, containing well presented living room, two bedrooms and bathroom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Internal stairs head on the second floor composed of a beautiful kitchen, dining area and terrace.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Total living area of the house is 145 sqm.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property has been recently renovated, incl. new air-condition and land line with internet.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>If authentic seafront holiday home is what you are looking for, this one is not to be missed.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>A small boat (MN55) and mooring right next to the house are included in the price!</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact our Split office for more details.&nbsp;</p>', '', '1383_House-Villa_0.jpg', '1383_Old-stone-house_1.jpg', '1383_Old-stone-house_2.jpg', '1383_Old-stone-house_3.jpg', '1383_Old-stone-house_4.jpg', '1383_Old-stone-house_5.jpg', '1383_Old-stone-house_6.jpg', '1383_Old-stone-house_7.jpg', '1383_Old-stone-house_8.jpg'),
(1384, '', 'Voloder - Mariæ', '', '', '', 'Rogoznica', 'Zatoglav', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '30', '411', '160', 1, '450000', '', 2, 1, 2, 2, 1, 1, 4, 4, 'September 18, 2015', '<p>Luksuzna moderna vila u izgradnji!&nbsp;Pogled od kojeg zastaje dah! Projekt ove vile smatra se jednim od najboljih na ovom dijelu dalmatinske rivijere. Vila se nalazi u mirnoj uvali, na svega 30 m od mora i pla¾e. Stambeni dio vile iznosi 160 m2, dok parcela ima povr&scaron;inu 411 m2. Zapadno orijentirana terasa u prizemlju povr&scaron;ine 52 m2 s bazenom u nastavku je produ¾etak dnevnog boravka na kojem æete u¾ivati u zalasku sunca povrh prekrasnog kristalnog mora.</p>', '<p>We are pleased to offer this luxurious modern villa under construction. Every effort is being made to ensure that this project of the villa will become one of the best along this part of the Dalmatian coast. The villa is superbly located in a quiet bay, near Rogoznica, only 30 m from the beach, but elevated by the sloping shore to give commanding views out to sea. The residential part of the villa is 160 m2, while the plot has an area of 411 m2. The west oriented terrace on the ground floor has an area of 52 m2 with an ''infinity'' swimming pool.</p>', '', '<p><strong>Luksuzna moderna vila u izgradnji!</strong>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Pogled od kojeg zastaje dah! Projekt ove vile smatra se jednim od najboljih na ovom dijelu dalmatinske rivijere.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Vila se nalazi u mirnoj uvali, na svega 30 m od mora i pla¾e.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Stambeni dio vile iznosi 160 m2, dok parcela ima povr&scaron;inu 411 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Zapadno orijentirana terasa u prizemlju povr&scaron;ine 52 m2 s bazenom u nastavku je produ¾etak dnevnog boravka na kojem æete u¾ivati u zalasku sunca povrh prekrasnog kristalnog mora.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U prizemlju se nalazi otvoreni dnevni boravak zapadne orijentacije koji je povezan s kuhinjom i blagovaonicom.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Staklena stijenka cijelom prednjom stranom ovog prostora i veliki boèni prozori omoguæuju pogled na more od kojeg zastaje dah iz svakog dijela prostorije.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U prizemlju je predviðena jedna spavaæa soba i kupaonica.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na katu se nalaze dvije spavaæe sobe s kupaonicama.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>One su takoðer orijentirane zapadno, s velikim staklenim stijenkama tako da se èaroban pogled na more pru¾a iz kreveta spavaæe sobe.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Drugi kat je krovna terasa povr&scaron;ine 75 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Dio terase je natkriven te su na tom dijelu predviðene staklene boène stijenke.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na terasi je predviðen jacuzzi.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Dodatna prostorija iza kuæe, koja se mo¾e koristiti kao radna soba/ured ima povr&scaron;inu 20 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Udaljenost od vrhunskih restorana, kafiæa, trgovina kao i poznate marine je svega par kilometara .&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Aerodrom je udaljen 25 km.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Do kuæe je osiguran pristup autom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Uz kuæu se nalaze dva parking mjesta.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa ima svu potrebnu infrastrukturu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Zavr&scaron;etak projekta se oèekuje do o¾ujka 2016. godine.</p>', '<p>We are pleased to offer this luxurious modern villa under construction.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Every effort is being made to ensure that this project of the villa will become one of the best along this part of the Dalmatian coast.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The villa is superbly located in a quiet bay, near Rogoznica, only 30 m from the beach, but elevated by the sloping shore to give commanding views out to sea.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The residential part of the villa is 160 m2, while the plot has an area of 411 m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The west oriented terrace on the ground floor has an area of 52 m2 with an ''infinity'' swimming pool incorporated into the terrace with access directly from the main living room.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Here there is plenty of space to eat ''alfresco'' and enjoy the spectacular vening sunsets.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The ground floor has an open plan living room, facing west, which is includes the kitchen and dining room.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The glass wall around the front side of the area and the large side windows have sliding doors, and enjoy views of the sea which are breathtaking from every corner of the room.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The ground floor also has a bedroom and a bathroom.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Upstairs are two double bedrooms with bathrooms.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>They are also oriented west, with large glass windows so that a magical sea view is offered from each room.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The second floor is a roof terrace of 75 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Part of the terrace is covered and have been in this part of the envisaged glass side wall.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The terrace has a jacuzzi, discreetly placed to ensure complete privacy.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There is an extra room behind the house, which can be used as a study/office which has a floor area of 20 m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The distance from a selection of family run restaurants, cafes, shops and the famous marina is only a few kilometres, which takes 10 minutes on a bicycle.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The airport is 25 km away.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house can be accessed by car, and beside the house there are two private parking spaces.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Project completion is expected by March 2016, and discounts have been incorporated into the price.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact the office to arrange to visit the location and discuss staged payments available for buying this project.</p>', '', '1384_House-Villa_0.jpg', '1384_House-Villa_1.jpg', '1384_House-Villa_2.jpg', '1384_House-Villa_3.jpg', '1384_House-Villa_4.jpg', '', '', '', ''),
(1385, '', 'Dalmatian Home', '', '', '', 'Sibenik', 'Srima', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '100', '0', '40', 1, '66000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 1, 1, 'September 18, 2015', '<p>Na podruèju Vodica nedaleko od prekrasne pje&scaron;èane pla¾e (u drugom redu do mora), nalazi se stambena zgrada, gdje su na prodaju dva apartmana na prvom katu. Stanovi su identiènog rasporeda, a ukupna stambena povr&scaron;ina svakog apartmana iznosi 40m2. Apartmane je moguæe kupiti zajedno, te tako dobiti veæi stambeni dio (jer se nalaze na istoj eta¾i), a postoji i moguænost odvojene kupnje apartmana.&nbsp;Svakom apartmanu pripada i jedno parkirno mjesto povr&scaron;ine 10m2 koje se nalazi ispred zgrade.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>In Vodice area near the beautiful sandy beach (the second row), there is a residential building, with two apartments on the first floor for sale. The apartments have an identical layout (hall,kitchen, bathroom, living room, dining room, bedroom and terrace), and the total living area of each apartment is 40m2. Apartments can be purchased together to get a larger living area (because they are located on the same floor), and there is a possibility of separate purchase of apartments.</p>', '', '<p>Na podruèju Vodica nedaleko od prekrasne pje&scaron;èane pla¾e (u drugom redu do mora), nalazi se stambena zgrada, gdje su na prodaju dva apartmana na prvom katu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Stanovi su identiènog rasporeda (hodnik,kuhinja, kupaonica, dnevni boravak, blagovaonica, spavaæa soba i terasa), a ukupna stambena povr&scaron;ina svakog apartmana iznosi 40m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartmane je moguæe kupiti zajedno, te tako dobiti veæi stambeni dio (jer se nalaze na istoj eta¾i), a postoji i moguænost odvojene kupnje apartmana.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Svakom apartmanu pripada i jedno parkirno mjesto povr&scaron;ine 10m2 koje se nalazi ispred zgrade.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Mjerila struje i vode su odvojena, stanovi su opremljeni klima ureðajima, protuprovalnim ulaznim vratima, aluminijskom stolarijom, te kompletno ureðenom kupaonicom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Udaljenost do centra mjesta iznosi 500 m, a do najbli¾e pla¾e 100m.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Oba apartmana imaju kategorizaciju od 3 * za iznajmljivanje.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za dodatne informacije molimo kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured u Splitu.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>In Vodice area near the beautiful sandy beach (the second row), there is a residential building, with two apartments on the first floor for sale.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The apartments have an identical layout (hall, kitchen, bathroom, living room, dining room, bedroom and terrace), and the total living area of each apartment is 40m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartments can be purchased together to get a larger living area (because they are located on the same floor), and there is a possibility of separate purchase of apartments.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Each apartment has a parking space of 10m2 located in front of the building.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Water and electricity are separated, the apartments are equipped with air conditioning, security doors, aluminum windows and fully equipped bathroom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Distance from the town center is 500 m, and the distance to the nearest beach 100m.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Both apartments have a 3* to rent.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For further information please contact our office in Split.&nbsp;</p>', '', '1385_Apartment_0.jpg', '1385_Apartment_1.jpg', '1385_Apartment_2.jpg', '1385_Apartment_3.jpg', '1385_Apartment_4.jpg', '1385_Apartment_5.jpg', '1385_Apartment_6.jpg', '1385_Apartment_7.jpg', '1385_Apartment_8.jpg'),
(1386, 'Zdravko', 'Adoriæ', '0915215211 ', '098518631', '', 'Trogir', 'Osoje VII/19 Okrug Donji, 1924/3 k.o. Okrug', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '10', '581', '128', 1, '260000', '', 2, 2, 2, 1, 1, 2, 4, 2, 'September 21, 2015', '<p>Samostojeæa kuæa u 1.redu do mora udaljena svega 10 m od prirodno kamenite pla¾e sa vlastitim privezi&scaron;tem za brod.&nbsp;Kuæa je smje&scaron;tena u mirnom dijelu otoka gdje su mir i privatnost zagarantirani.&nbsp;Zemlji&scaron;te je ukupne povr&scaron;ine 581 m2 gdje postoji moguænost izgradnje prostranog bazena.&nbsp;Kuæa se sastoji od podruma, prizemlja i 1.kata. Ukupna stambena povr&scaron;ina iznosi 128 m2 (78 m2 + 2 terase 50 m2).&nbsp;U prizemlju i na 1.katu se nalazi po 1 apartman sa odvojenim vanjskim ulazima.</p>', '<p>We are offering this rare opportunity to buy a first line house, just 10m from the shore, with a private boat mooring. The house is situated in a quiet part of the island, near Okrug Gornji, where peace and privacy guaranteed. The land plot has a total area of 581 m2, which gives plenty of space for improvements such as landscaping and incorporating a swimming pool. The house consists of basement, ground floor and 1st floor. Total area is 128 m2 (78 m2 + 2 terraces 50 m2).</p>', '', '<p><strong>JEDINSTVENA PRILIKA!!!</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Samostojeæa kuæa u 1.redu do mora udaljena svega 10 m od prirodno kamenite pla¾e sa vlastitim privezi&scaron;tem za brod.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je smje&scaron;tena u mirnom dijelu otoka gdje su mir i privatnost zagarantirani.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Grad Trogir udaljen je 15 min. vo¾nje, a meðunarodni aerodrom 20 min.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Zemlji&scaron;te je ukupne povr&scaron;ine 581 m2 gdje postoji moguænost izgradnje prostranog bazena.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Slu¾beno parking mjesto se nalazi na vrhu ulice.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Bez obzira &scaron;to nije moguæe parkirati direktno na zemlji&scaron;tu, ne umanjuje kvalitetu nekretnine.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa se sastoji od podruma, prizemlja i 1.kata.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Ukupna stambena povr&scaron;ina iznosi 128 m2 (78 m2 + 2 terase 50 m2)</strong>.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U prizemlju i na 1.katu se nalazi po 1 apartman sa odvojenim vanjskim ulazima.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Svaki se sastoji od kuhinje + blagovaonice + dnevnog boravka, 2 spavaæe sobe, kupaonice i prostrane terase sa pogledom na more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U podrumu je manja sprema i postoji moguænost izgradnje jo&scaron; jednog apartmana jer se u produ¾etku nalazi spremnik za vodu koji se vi&scaron;e ne koristi.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je graðena 80-ih godina i u jako je dobrom stanju.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Naravno, ukoliko ¾elite moderniji nivo ureðenja potrebno je jo&scaron; ulaganja.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Potencijal nekretnine se vidi na slikama, ali se pravi utisak tek do¾ivi prilikom razgledavanja.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kontaktirajte nas za sve dodatne informacije i slike.</p>', '<p>We are offering this rare opportunity to buy a first line house, just 10m from the shore, with a private boat mooring.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house is situated in a quiet part of the island, near Okrug Gornji, where peace and privacy guaranteed.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The larger town of Trogir is 15 min. drive and the international airport 20 min.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The land plot has a total area of 581 m2, which gives plenty of space for improvements such as landscaping and incorporating a swimming pool.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Official parking is located on the top of the street.</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house consists of basement, ground floor and 1st floor.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Total area is 128 m2 (78 m2 + 2 terraces 50 m2).</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the ground and on the 1st floor are located two independent apartments, each with two bedrooms, bathroom, and a kitchen, dining room and living room, leading out onto a spacious terrace overlooking the sea.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Much of the basement is taken up with a large water tank from the days before the property was connected to the mains water supply, but is now redundant and could be incorporated into the residential space.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house was built 40 years ago and is in very good condition, and although is perfectly habitable many new owners might consider it needs modernising.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>This is reflected in the price, which makes this an excellent investment.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The potential of the property is shown in the pictures, but the real impression only experience when visiting.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact us for more information and to arrange to visit the property.</p>', '', '1386_House-Villa_0.jpg', '1386_House-Villa_1.jpg', '1386_House-Villa_2.jpg', '1386_House-Villa_3.jpg', '1386_House-Villa_4.jpg', '1386_House-Villa_5.jpg', '1386_House-Villa_6.jpg', '1386_House-Villa_7.jpg', '1386_House-Villa_8.jpg'),
(1387, 'Josip', 'Dujiæ', '   Susjed Jo¹ko Rogulj 091 580 4037 ', '098760809', 'vinkovcisped@outlook.com', 'Trogir', 'Antuna Gustava Mato¹a 52  Mastrinka, 795/198 k.o. ®edno', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '85', '0', '52', 1, '117000', '', 2, 1, 2, 2, 1, 2, 2, 1, 'September 22, 2015', '<p>Novoizgraðena zgrada visoke kvalitete sa prekrasnim pogledom na more u blizini &scaron;ljunèane pla¾e.&nbsp;Nalazi se na istoènoj strani Èiova, dok je orijentacija sjeverna.&nbsp;U zgradi je ukupno 6 apartmana, a na prodaju su preostala 4 apartmana.&nbsp;Svi apartmani su visoko kvalitetni &scaron;to potvrðuje visoki B razred energetskog certifikata. Svakom pripada po 1 parking mjesto i 1 sprema. Zgrada se nalazi u slijepoj ulici &scaron;to je dodatna prednost zbog smanjene buke i prometa.</p>', '<p>We are offering this selection of newly constructed apartments, close to the shore, of high quality with a beautiful view of the sea. The building has a total of 6 apartments. All the apartments were built with high quality materials and modern and stylish fittings as evidenced by a high class B energy certificate. Each apartment has a private parking place and a small storage space. The building is located in a ''no through road'' which gives an additional advantage of reduced noise and traffic.</p>', '', '<p>Novoizgraðena zgrada visoke kvalitete sa prekrasnim pogledom na more u blizini &scaron;ljunèane pla¾e.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nalazi se na istoènoj strani Èiova, dok je orijentacija sjeverna.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Pla¾a je udaljena 85 m od zgrade, a do ostalih sadr¾aja je potrebno nekoliko minuta vo¾nje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Prekrasni grad Trogir udaljen je 10 minuta vo¾nje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U zgradi je ukupno 6 apartmana, a na prodaju su preostala 4 apartmana.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Svi apartmani su visoko kvalitetni &scaron;to potvrðuje visoki B razred energetskog certifikata.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Svakom pripada po 1 parking mjesto i 1 sprema.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Zgrada se nalazi u slijepoj ulici &scaron;to je dodatna prednost zbog smanjene buke i prometa.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Svi se sastoje od dnevnog boravka + blagovaonice + kuhinje, 2 spavaæe sobe, kupaonice i loggie s pogledom na more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>APARTMAN 1</strong> &ndash; Prizemlje (istok), 52 m2 &ndash; 120.000 &euro; - pripada mu i vrt povr&scaron;ine 113 m2 - <strong>P R O D A N O ! ! !</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>APARTMAN 2</strong> &ndash; 1.kat (istok), 52 m2 &ndash; 120.000 &euro;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>APARTMAN 3</strong> &ndash; 1.kat (zapad), 52 m2 &ndash; 117.000 &euro;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>APARTMAN 4</strong> &ndash; 2. kat (zapadna), 52 m2 &ndash; 140.000 &euro; - pripada mu krovna terasa povr&scaron;ine 47 m2 s koje se pru¾a prekrasna panorama na more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na terasu su takoðer spojeni voda i struja.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Omjer cijene i ostalih faktora je svakako prilika za ulaganje u ovu nekretninu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Zbog izgradnje novog mosta koji spaja kopno i otok Èiovo, lokacija æe postati jo&scaron; popularnija &scaron;to æe utjecati i na cijene nekretnina.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Slobodno nas kontaktirajte za vi&scaron;e informacija i eventualni dogovor za razgledavanje.</p>', '<p>We are offering this selection of newly constructed apartments, close to the shore, of high quality with a beautiful view of the sea.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>They are located on the east side of Ciovo, northern orientation, 85 m from the sea and 10 minutes drive from the major town on the island.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The building has a total of 6 apartments, and we have been instructed to sell the last remaining 4.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>All the &nbsp;apartments were built with high quality materials and modern and stylish fittings as evidenced by a high class B energy certificate.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Each apartment has a private parking place and a small storage space.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The building is located in a ''no through road'' which gives an additional advantage of reduced noise and traffic.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>All consist of an open plan style living room/dining room and kitchen, 2 bedrooms, bathroom and a wide balcony leading from the lounge, overlooking the sea.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>APARTMENT 1</strong> - Ground Floor (East), 52 m2 - 120.000 &euro; - it also has a garden area of 113 m2 -<strong> S O L D ! ! !&nbsp;</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>APARTMENT 2</strong> - 1st floor (east), 52 m2 - 120.000 &euro;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>APARTMENT 3</strong> - 1st floor (west), 52 m2 - &euro; 117,000</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>APARTMENT 4</strong> - 2nd Floor (West), 52 m2 - 140.000 &euro; - has a roof terrace of 47 m2, which offers a beautiful panorama of the sea.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the terrace are connections to water and electricity.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The ratio of price and other factors makes this a good opportunity to invest in this property.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Due to the construction of a new bridge connecting the mainland and the island Ciovo, the location will become even more popular and have a positive impact on property prices.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact us for more information and to arrange to visit the property.</p>', '', '1387_Apartment_0.jpg', '1387_Apartment_1.jpg', '1387_Apartment_2.jpg', '1387_Apartment_3.jpg', '1387_Apartment_4.jpg', '1387_Apartment_5.jpg', '1387_Apartment_6.jpg', '1387_Apartment_7.jpg', '1387_Apartment_8.jpg'),
(1388, 'Tullio', 'Liblik', 'Djordje Skarica 0981777007 kljuè', '®ena Jana 0919752065', 'tullio@energiamaja.ee , janamoraru2002@m', 'Rogoznica', 'Crljine 39  Rogoznica', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '350', '0', '62', 1, '125000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 2, 2, 'September 22, 2015', '<p>Prostrani apartman u odliènom stanju, u zgradi izgraðenoj 2007. godine.&nbsp;Nalazi se na svega nekoliko stotina metara udaljenosti od lijepo ureðene pla¾e i centra mjesta.&nbsp;Prekrasan pogled na more, Rogoznicu i Marinu Frapu èini ovaj apartman izuzetnom prilikom.&nbsp;Apartman se nalazi na drugom (posljednjem) katu zgrade.&nbsp;Povr&scaron;ina apartmana iznosi 61m2, a povr&scaron;ina terase je 5,19m2.&nbsp;Iz dnevnog boravka izlazi se na terasu.&nbsp;Pogled na more i okolinu pru¾a se iz dnevnog boravka i s terase.</p>', '<p>We have this well presented and spacious apartment in excellent condition, in a building built in 2007.&nbsp;It is located just a few hundred meters from the sea and the town centre, where it is conveniently close to many useful shops and services, bars and cafes. The sea in the village is clear and safe for swimming and children to play.&nbsp;The apartment is on the top floor and boasts superb views from the openplan style lounge and wide balcony across the sea and the village and Marina. The apartment size is 61 m2 and terrace 5,19 m2.&nbsp;</p>', '', '<p>Prostran apartman u odliènom stanju, u zgradi izgraðenoj 2007. godine.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nalazi se na svega nekoliko stotina metara udaljenosti od lijepo ureðene pla¾e i centra mjesta.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Prekrasan pogled na more, Rogoznicu i Marinu Frapu èini ovaj apartman izuzetnom prilikom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartman se nalazi na drugom (posljednjem) katu zgrade.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Povr&scaron;ina apartmana iznosi 61 m2, a povr&scaron;ina terase je 5,19 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartman se sastoji od dvije spavaæe sobe, kupaonice, Wc-a i &nbsp;prostranog dnevnog boravka koji je povezan s blagovaonicom i kuhinjom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Iz dnevnog boravka izlazi se na terasu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Pogled na more i okolinu pru¾a se iz dnevnog boravka i s terase koja je dovoljno velika za stol i stolice.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartman ima svu potrebnu infrastrukturu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Uz apartman ide i pripadajuæe parking mjesto kao i gara¾a povr&scaron;ine 10 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kafiæi, restorani, duæani, pijaca kao i lijepo ureðena pla¾a nalaze se na svega 350 m udaljenosti.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Aerodrom je udaljen 28 km.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za sve dodatne informacije molimo kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured u Splitu.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>We have this well presented and spacious apartment in excellent condition, in a building built in 2007.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is located just a few hundred meters from the sea and the town centre, where it is conveniently close to many useful shops and services, bars and cafes.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The sea in the village is clear and safe for swimming and children to play.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The apartment is on the top floor and boasts superb views from the openplan style lounge and wide balcony across the sea and the village and Marina.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The apartment size is 61 m2 and terrace 5,19 m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The apartment has two bedrooms, bathroom, toilet and a living room that incorporates the dining area and kitchen.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Large sliding windows lead out onto the balcony, which is comfortably large enough for alfresco dining.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>With the apartment goes private parking and an integral garage of 10m sq.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The airport is 28 km.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>To arrange a tour, please contact our office in Split.</p>', '', '1388_Apartment_0.jpg', '1388_Apartment_1.jpg', '1388_Apartment_2.jpg', '1388_Apartment_3.jpg', '1388_Apartment_4.jpg', '1388_Apartment_5.jpg', '1388_Apartment_6.jpg', '1388_Apartment_7.jpg', '1388_Apartment_8.jpg'),
(1389, 'Tamara Malinovs', 'Tamaris d.o.o.', 'Ivana ®aja 099/518-97-08', '099/518-97-08', 'tamaris.hr@yandex.ru', 'Trogir', 'Vukovarska 60, Seget Vranjica, 327/126, k.o.Seget, zk.ulozak 4696, stan br.7', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '250', '140', '52', 1, '115000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 'September 23, 2015', '<p>Apartman se nalazi na dijelu poluotoka, u blizini Trogira, samo nekoliko minuta &scaron;etnje do pla¾e. Ima ukupnu stambenu povr&scaron;inu 52 m2.&nbsp;Apartman ima i prostranu zatvorenu terasu (20 m2) s velikim prozorima na fasadi te krovnim prozorima.&nbsp;Postoji i moguænost dogradnje jo&scaron; jedne ljetne kuhinje s obzirom na prisutnost svih potrebnih prikljuèaka.&nbsp;U dvori&scaron;tu, povr&scaron;ine 140 m2 postoji solarni tu&scaron; te veliki ro&scaron;tilj s plohom za pripremanje hrane.</p>', '<p>We are pleased to market this beautiful apartment in a small village on the coast, near Trogir.&nbsp;The apartment is located on the peninsula, only a few minutes walk away from the beach. It consists of 2 bedrooms, an open plan style living room and kitchen&nbsp;&nbsp;with a bathroom and separate shower with a total floor area of 52 m2. The apartment has a spacious enclosed terrace (20 m2) with large windows on the front facade and roof windows. In the courtyard, 140 m2, there is an outdoor shower, powered by solar energy and a useful summer kitchen.</p>', '', '<p>Prekrasan apartman u blizini Trogira.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartman se nalazi na dijelu poluotoka, samo nekoliko minuta &scaron;etnje do pla¾e.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sastoji se od 2 spavaæe sobe, dnevnog boravka s kuhinjom te kupaonice s tu&scaron; kadom ukupne stambene povr&scaron;ine 52 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kupaonica je u potpumosti opremljena.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartman ima i prostranu zatvorenu terasu (20 m2) s velikim prozorima na fasadi te krovnim prozorima.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Postoji i moguænost dogradnje jo&scaron; jedne ljetne kuhinje s obzirom na prisutnost svih potrebnih prikljuèaka.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Stan je zu potpunosti namje&scaron;ten i opremljen talijanskim namje&scaron;tajem.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Podovi su oblo¾eni parketom + podno grijanje na mjestima gdje su ploèice.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ima svu potrebnu infrastrukturu: prikljuèak na internet, telefon, struja, voda, klimatizacija (dvije klime), drvni kamin.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartmanu pripadaju vrt, ostava i drvenarnica.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ima dva ulaza - jedan ulaz je odvojen, preko parkinga.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Tu je i odvojeni parking povr&scaron;ine 42 m2 za èuvanje ili za parking broda ili jahte.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Dvori&scaron;te je oblo¾eno ploèicama.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U dvori&scaron;tu, povr&scaron;ine 140 m2 postoji solarni tu&scaron; te veliki ro&scaron;tilj s plohom za pripremanje hrane.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U dvori&scaron;tu se nalaze voda i kanalizacija.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartman se nalazi u tihom okru¾enju, na granici sa borovom &scaron;umom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Udaljenost od mora 250m. &nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Smje&scaron;ten je na podruèju s èistim morem omeðenim pla¾ama sa sve tri strane.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U blizini se nalaze sportsko - rekreacijski centar te svi sportski sadr¾aji.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Udaljenost aerodroma je 15 km.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Dokumentacija za stan i dvori&scaron;te je uredna.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za dodatne informacije molimo kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured u Splitu.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>We are pleased to market this beautiful apartment in a small village on the coast, near Trogir.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The apartment is located on the peninsula, only a few minutes walk away from the beach.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It consists of 2 bedrooms, an open plan style living room and kitchen with a bathroom and separate shower with a total floor area of 52 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The apartment has a spacious enclosed terrace (20 m2) with large windows on the front facade and roof windows.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The apartment is well decorated and comes fully furnished with high quality Italian furniture.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The floors are covered with a mixture of wooden parquet flooring + stone tiles and has been fitted with underfloor heating in places where there are tiles.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It has all the necessary infrastructure: internet access, telephone, electricity, water, air (two air conditioners), and an attractive wood fireplace for the winter months.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The apartment has a garden, and storage room in the basement.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There is a separate parking area of 42 m2 for storage or parking of boat or yacht on a tiled floor.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>In the courtyard, 140 m2, there is an outdoor shower, powered by solar energy and a useful summer kitchen including a bbq area, food preparation area, water and drains.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The apartments are situated in a quiet area, surrounded on the sides by pine woods.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The distance from the sea 250m and the shore here is safe and clean for swimming, with clear water and beaches on three sides.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nearby is a popular sports and recreation centre with many other sports facilities.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Distance airport is 15 km.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For further information, please contact our office in Split and we can arrange for you to visit the property.</p>', '', '1389_Apartment_0.jpg', '1389_Apartment_1.jpg', '1389_Apartment_2.jpg', '1389_Apartment_3.jpg', '1389_Apartment_4.jpg', '1389_Apartment_5.jpg', '1389_Apartment_6.jpg', '1389_Apartment_7.jpg', '1389_Apartment_8.jpg'),
(1390, 'Jana', 'Vyhnalova', '+420226201342', '+420602235702,  Ivan kaurin  0994080443 022555300', 'vyhnalova@bellesfleurs.cz', 'Rogoznica', 'Ra¾anj', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '30', '370', '183', 1, '355000', '', 2, 2, 2, 1, 1, 2, 3, 3, 'September 28, 2015', '<p>U potpunosti renovirana 2005. godine prekrasna vila, nalazi se u jednoj od ljep&scaron;ih Rogoznièkih uvala na svega 30 m udaljenosti od mora.&nbsp;Samostojeæa kuæa ju¾ne orijentacije, luksuzno ureðena s prekrasnim pogledom na more i uvalu ukupne je stambene povr&scaron;ine 183 m2, a nalazi se na parceli povr&scaron;ine 370 m2.&nbsp;U vrtu se nalazi sjenica s kaminom.&nbsp;Vrt je kultiviran mediteranskim biljem.&nbsp;Kuæa ima i gara¾u kao i osigurano parking mjesto. Udaljenost do kafiæa, restorana i duæana je 2 km.</p>', '<p>We are offering this beautifully renovated family villa, located in one of the most attractive bays around Rogoznica only 30 meters from the sea. The house is facing south, well furnished with tasteful and good quality fittings. The property overlooks the sea which can be seen from all the upstairs balcony and windows. Inside the property it has a total living area of 183 m2 and it is located on large a plot of 370 m2. The garden has been landscaped and planted with Mediterranean plants requiring little maintenance, but there is also an attractive gazebo and abbq/fireplace. &nbsp;</p>', '', '<p>U potpunosti renovirana 2005. godine prekrasna vila, nalazi se u jednoj od ljep&scaron;ih Rogoznièkih uvala na svega 30 m udaljenosti od mora.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Samostojeæa kuæa ju¾ne orijentacije, luksuzno ureðena s prekrasnim pogledom na more i uvalu ukupne je stambene povr&scaron;ine 183 m2, a nalazi se na parceli povr&scaron;ine 370 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa se sastoji od spavaæe sobe, kupaonice, kuhinje i prostranog dnevnog boravka s ostakljenim dijelom terase u kojoj se nalazi blagovaonica.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U dnevnom boravku se nalazi kamin.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na katu se nalaze dvije spavaæe sobe, dvije kupaonice, prostrani dnevni boravak i velika terasa.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Prekrasan pogled na more pru¾a se i sa terase na katu i sa donjeg dijela.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U vrtu se nalazi sjenica s kaminom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Vrt je kultiviran mediteranskim biljem.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa ima septièku jamu, gradsku vodu i struju.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa ima i gara¾u kao i osigurano parking mjesto.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Udaljenost do kafiæa, restorana i duæana je 2 km.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Aerodrom je udaljen 25 km.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za dodatne informacije molimo kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured u Splitu.</p>', '<p>We are offering this beautifully renovated family villa, located in one of the most attractive bays around Rogoznica only 30 meters from the sea.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house is facing south, well furnished with tasteful and good quality fittings.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property overlooks the sea which can be seen from all the upstairs balcony and windows.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Inside the property it has a total living area of 183 m2 and it is located on large a plot of 370 m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house consists of a bedroom, bathroom, open plan designed kitchen and spacious living room leading onto a glazed terrace which houses the dining room.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The living room has a fireplace.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Upstairs are two bedrooms, two bathrooms, spacious living room and a large balcony, which has spectacular sea views.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The garden has been landscaped and planted with Mediterranean plants requiring little maintenance, but there is also an attractive gazebo and abbq/fireplace.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house has its own septic tank, but is connected to the city water and electricity.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house has a garage and additional private parking space.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The distance to cafes, restaurants and shops and other services is 2 km away, but there is a nearer coffee bar that can be reached after a short walk.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The airport is 25 km away.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For further information, please contact our office in Split, and we can arrange for you to tour the property.</p>', '', '1390_House-Villa_0.JPG', '1390_House-Villa_1.JPG', '1390_House-Villa_2.JPG', '1390_House-Villa_3.JPG', '1390_House-Villa_4.JPG', '1390_House-Villa_5.JPG', '1390_House-Villa_6.JPG', '1390_House-Villa_7.JPG', '1390_House-Villa_8.JPG'),
(1391, 'Denis', 'Puljiz', '', '095 904 6624', 'dpuljiz@net.hr', 'Split', 'Ban Mladenova 4  Split', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '50', '0', '97', 2, '190000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 'September 29, 2015', '<p>Atraktivan apartman u maloj kamenoj kuæi, samo 50 m od Rive.&nbsp;Apartman se nalazi u potkrovlju, ukupne stambene povr&scaron;ine 97 m2.&nbsp;Ima vlastiti ulaz sa stubi&scaron;ta, te prilaz automobilom.&nbsp;Parking u blizini.&nbsp;Apartman je pogodan, osim za stanovanje, i za turistièko iznajmljivanje, te je kategoriziran.&nbsp;Potpuno je renoviran 2004. godine.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>We are offering this attractive apartment in a small stone house, in the city centre, just 50 meters from the shore.&nbsp;The apartment is located on the second floor - the top floor with a total living area of 97 m2.&nbsp;It has its own entrance with private staircase and there is access by car and parking close by.&nbsp;It has been well looked after and is in excellent condition, ready for immediate living but would also be perfect for tourist rental and is already registered for that purpose.&nbsp;</p>', '', '<p>Atraktivan apartman u maloj kamenoj kuæi, samo 50 m od Rive.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartman se nalazi u potkrovlju, a sastoji se od dvije spavaæe sobe, velikog dnevnog boravka s kuhinjom, kupaonice te manje loggie, ukupne stambene povr&scaron;ine 97 m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ima vlastiti ulaz sa stubi&scaron;ta, te prilaz automobilom.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Parking u blizini.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartman je pogodan, osim za stanovanje, i za turistièko iznajmljivanje, te je kategoriziran.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Potpuno je renoviran 2004. godine.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Moguæa kupnja cijelog objekta, u kojem se na donjem dijelu nalazi i poslovni prostor.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za dodatne informacije molimo kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured u Splitu.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>We are offering this attractive apartment in a small stone house, in the city centre, just 50 meters from the shore.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The apartment is located on the second floor - the top floor - and it consists of two bedrooms, a large living room with kitchen, bathroom and small balcony, with a total living area of 97 m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It has its own entrance with private staircase and there is access by car and parking close by.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It has been well looked after and is in excellent condition, ready for immediate living but would also be perfect for tourist rental and is already registered for that purpose.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It was completely renovated in 2004.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Possible purchase of the entire building, which is on the lower part of the office space.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For further information and to arrange to visit the property, please contact our office in Split.</p>', '', '1391_Apartment_0.jpg', '1391_Apartment_1.jpg', '1391_Apartment_2.jpg', '1391_Apartment_3.jpg', '', '', '', '', ''),
(1392, 'Zoran', 'Karmeliæ', '', '091/5189 905', 'verah1@net.amis.hr', 'Split', 'Poji¹anska 34, Baèvice  Split', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '0', '0', '81', 2, '190000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 'September 29, 2015', '<p>Atraktivan apartman u blizini Baèvica, na treæem katu manje stambene zgrade. Sastoji se od dvije spavaæe sobe, dnevnog boravka, kuhinje s blagovaonicom, kuponice, wc-a i balkona. Ukupna stambena povr&scaron;ina apartmana iznosi 81 m2. Energetski razred B. Za dodatne informacije molimo kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured u Splitu.</p>', '<p>We are selling this spacious apartment within walking distance of all the main cultural and historic touristic attractions in Split. It is situated on the third floor of a modern residential building, 150 m from the popular sandy beach in Split, and a similar distance from the ferry port. It is ready for immediate living, but could benefit from refurbishment. The total residential floor area is 81 m2. Energy class B.</p>', '', '<p>Atraktivan apartman u blizini Baèvica, na treæem katu manje stambene zgrade.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sastoji se od dvije spavaæe sobe, dnevnog boravka, kuhinje s blagovaonicom, kuponice, wc-a i balkona.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ukupna stambena povr&scaron;ina apartmana iznosi 81 m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Energetski razred B.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za dodatne informacije molimo kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured u Splitu.</p>', '<p>We are selling this spacious apartment within walking distance of all the main cultural and historic touristic attractions in Split.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is situated on the third floor of a modern residential building, 150 m from the popular sandy beach in Split, and a similar distance from the ferry port.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The apartment consists of two double bedrooms, an open plan designed living room/kitchen with dining room, leading out onto a balcony, bathrooms, and a separate toilet.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is ready for immediate living, but could benefit from refurbishment.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The total residential floor area is 81 m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Energy class B.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For further information, please contact our office in Split and we can arrange a tour.</p>', '', '1392_Apartment_0.jpg', '1392_Apartment_1.jpg', '1392_Apartment_2.jpg', '1392_Apartment_3.jpg', '1392_Apartment_4.jpg', '1392_Apartment_5.jpg', '1392_Apartment_6.jpg', '1392_Apartment_7.jpg', '1392_Apartment_8.jpg');
INSERT INTO `nekretnina` (`id`, `ime`, `prezime`, `telefon`, `mobitel`, `e_mail`, `lokacija_id`, `adresa`, `status_id`, `vrsta_id`, `udaljenost`, `povrsina`, `stambenapovrsina`, `display`, `cijena`, `cijenatocka`, `ponuda_tjedna`, `new_built`, `must_sell`, `prvi_red_do_mora`, `pogled_na_more`, `bazen`, `broj_soba`, `broj_kupatila`, `datum`, `title_hr`, `title_en`, `title_ge`, `opis_hr`, `opis_en`, `opis_ge`, `PropertyImageURL0`, `PropertyImageURL1`, `PropertyImageURL2`, `PropertyImageURL3`, `PropertyImageURL4`, `PropertyImageURL5`, `PropertyImageURL6`, `PropertyImageURL7`, `PropertyImageURL8`) VALUES
(1393, 'Nikica', 'Dragun', '', '0915555237', '', 'Trogir', 'Sv. Petra 43 Trogir (Èiovska strana)', 'For sale', 'Old stone house', '50', '0', '60', 1, '120000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 1, 'September 29, 2015', '<p>Dio stare kamene kuæe u blizini stare jezgre grada Trogira, pod UNESCO-vom za&scaron;titom. Pristup automobilom je moguæ 30 m od kuæe, dok je more udaljeno 50 m.&nbsp;Meðunarodni aerodrom udaljen je svega 10 minuta vo¾nje.&nbsp;Sastoji se od 1.kata, 2.kata i potkrovlja ukupne povr&scaron;ine 60 m2. U prizemlju je studio apartman koji je takoðer na prodaju. Velièina je 17 m2, a cijena je 43.000 &euro;. Sve 3 eta¾e su spojene unutarnjim stepenicama.</p>', '<p>We have this property which is part of an old stone house in the vicinity of the old town in Trogir, under UNESCO protection.&nbsp;It is situated 50m from the sea in a pedestrian only zone, with the access by car to 30 meters from the property.&nbsp;The international airport is only 10 minutes drive.&nbsp;The building consists of a 1st floor, 2nd and top floor, total area of 60 m2. On the ground floor is a studio apartment which is also on sale! Size is 17 m2 and the price is &euro; 43,000.&nbsp;All three floors are connected with internal stairs.</p>', '', '<p>Dio stare kamene kuæe u blizini stare jezgre grada Trogira, pod UNESCO-vom za&scaron;titom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Pristup automobilom je moguæ 30 m od kuæe, dok je more udaljeno 50 m.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Meðunarodni aerodrom udaljen je svega 10 minuta vo¾nje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sastoji se od 1.kata, 2.kata i potkrovlja ukupne povr&scaron;ine 60 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>***U prizemlju je studio apartman koji je takoðer na prodaju.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Velièina je 17 m2, a cijena je 43.000 &euro;.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sve 3 eta¾e su spojene unutarnjim stepenicama.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na 1.katu se nalazi dnevni boravak sa kuhinjom i blagovaonicom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na 2.katu je soba i kupaonica, dok je na 3.kat jedna soba.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je djelomièno renovirana 2008. godine, ali je potrebno jo&scaron; ulaganja.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Prodaje se potpuno namje&scaron;tena i klimatizirana.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Slobodno nas kontaktirajte za sva dodatna pitanja.</p>', '<p>We have this property which is part of an old stone house in the vicinity of the old town in Trogir, under UNESCO protection.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is situated 50m from the sea in a pedestrian only zone, with the access by car to 30 meters from the property.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The international airport is only 10 minutes drive.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The building consists of a 1st floor, 2nd and top floor, total area of 60 m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>*** On the ground floor is a studio apartment which is also on sale!</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Size is 17 m2 and the price is &euro; 43,000.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>All three floors are connected with internal stairs.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the 1st floor there is a living room with kitchen and dining room.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the 2nd floor is a bedroom and a bathroom, while on the top floor is one bedroom.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house was partially renovated in 2008, and aircon installed, but needs redecorating.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property is being sold fully furnished.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is conveniently close to many shops, bars, cafes and other services in the town of Trogir, as well as some of the best restaurants on the coast.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The area is the historic and cultural centre for tourism so there is always a big demand from tourists to visit the town in short stay accommodation.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact the office to arrange to visit this property.</p>', '', '1393_Old-stone-house_0.jpg', '1393_Old-stone-house_1.jpg', '1393_Old-stone-house_2.jpg', '1393_Old-stone-house_3.jpg', '1393_Old-stone-house_4.jpg', '1393_Old-stone-house_5.jpg', '1393_Old-stone-house_6.jpg', '1393_Old-stone-house_7.jpg', '1393_Old-stone-house_8.jpg'),
(1394, 'Boris', 'Drpiæ', '', '099 530 0393', '', 'Brac', ' Splitska ', 'For sale', 'Land plot', '85', '2770', '0', 1, '1050000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 0, 0, 'October 2, 2015', '<p>Graðevinsko zemlji&scaron;te ukupne povr&scaron;ine 2.770 m2 u izgraðenom dijelu naselja, u centru malog mjesta sa sjeverne strane otoka Braèa.&nbsp;Zemlji&scaron;te je udaljeno od mora 85 m.&nbsp;Parcele imaju pristup infrastrukturi.&nbsp;Cijena je fiksna.&nbsp;Za dodatne informacije molimo kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured u Splitu.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>Building land near the sea, sized 2.770 sqm, in the center of the small village on the northern side of Brac island.&nbsp;Plot is situated only 85 m from the sea.&nbsp;Plots have easy access to all infrastructure.&nbsp;The price is fixed.&nbsp;For further information please contact our office in Split.&nbsp;</p>', '', '<p>Graðevinsko zemlji&scaron;te ukupne povr&scaron;ine 2.770 m2 u izgraðenom dijelu naselja, u centru malog mjesta sa sjeverne strane otoka Braèa.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Zemlji&scaron;te je udaljeno od mora 85 m.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Parcele imaju pristup infrastrukturi.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Cijena je fiksna.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za dodatne informacije molimo kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured u Splitu.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>Building land near the sea, sized 2.770 sqm, in the center of the small village on the northern side of Brac island.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Plot is situated only 85 m from the sea.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Plots have easy access to all infrastructure.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The price is fixed.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For further information please contact our office in Split.&nbsp;</p>', '', '1394_Land-plot_0.jpg', '1394_Land-plot_1.jpg', '1394_Land-plot_2.jpg', '1394_Land-plot_3.jpg', '1394_Land-plot_4.jpg', '1394_Land-plot_5.jpg', '1394_Land-plot_6.jpg', '1394_Land-plot_7.jpg', ''),
(1395, 'Danka', 'Kovaèev', '021 767 085', '', '', 'Hvar', 'Pitve', 'For sale', 'Old stone house', '2000', '0', '100', 1, '200000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 2, 1, 'October 2, 2015', '<p>&Scaron;armantna stara kamena kuæa u mirnom mjestu na otoku Hvaru.&nbsp;Kuæa je renovirana.&nbsp;Nalazi se na udaljenosti 2 km od mora.&nbsp;Ima prekrasan pogled na mjesto i otok Braè, a sastoji se od prizemlja, prvog i drugog kata, ukupne stambene povr&scaron;ine 100 m2.&nbsp;Moguænost parkinga u selu.&nbsp;Nalazi se u prekrasnom autentiènom selu na mirnoj lokaciji.</p>\r\n<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;">CIJENA SNI®ENA SA 250.000 EURA!!</span></p>', '<p>We have this charming restored old stone house in a quiet inland village on the island of Hvar. It is 2 km from the sea, situated in the centre of a beautiful authentic village that is very peaceful, even in the height of the tourist season. It is situated on the hill side with beautiful views of the village and the island of Brac. The house has been completely renovated, both in and outside. The house consists of a ground, first and second floor, with a total floor area of 100 m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;">PRICE REDUCED FROM 250.000 EURO!!</span></p>', '', '<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;"><strong>CIJENA SNI®ENA SA 250.000 EURA!!</strong></span></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&Scaron;armantna stara kamena kuæa u mirnom mjestu na otoku Hvaru.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je renovirana.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nalazi se na udaljenosti 2 km od mora.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ima prekrasan pogled na mjesto i otok Braè, a sastoji se od prizemlja, prvog i drugog kata, ukupne stambene povr&scaron;ine 100 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U prizemlju se nalaze kuhinja, blagovaonica i dnevni boravak.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Unutarnje stepeni&scaron;te vodi do prvog kata gdje su dvije spavaæe sobe i kupaonica, te do drugog kata gdje se nalaze soba i kupaonica.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Postoji i vanjsko stepeni&scaron;te od prizemlja do prvog kata.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Moguænost parkinga u selu.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nalazi se u prekrasnom autentiènom selu na mirnoj lokaciji.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U mjestu se nalazi restoran, a veæi grad je udaljen 2km.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za sve dodatne informacije molimo kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured.&nbsp;</p>', '<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;"><strong>PRICE REDUCED FROM 250.000 EURO!!</strong></span></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>We have this charming restored old stone house in a quiet inland village on the island of Hvar.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is 2 km from the sea, situated in the centre of a beautiful authentic village that is very peaceful, even in the height of the tourist season.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is situated on the hill side with beautiful views of the village and the island of Brac.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house has been completely renovated, both in and outside.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house consists of a ground, first and second floor, with a total&nbsp;&nbsp;floor area of 100 m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The ground floor has a kitchen, dining room and living room.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There is an internal staircase that leads to the first floor where there are two bedrooms and a bathroom, and to the second floor where there is one bedroom and bathroom.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There is also an external staircase from the ground floor to the first floor.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property is well decorated and ready for immediate living.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There is plenty of parking in the village, close to the property.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The village has a restaurant, and the nearest larger town is 2km where there is a range of shops, bars and cafes, as well as some great swimming areas and safe beaches.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It takes 5 minutes to get there on a bike, but 15minutes to get back.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For further information please contact our office and we can arrange a tour of the property.</p>', '', '1395_Old-stone-house_0.jpg', '1395_Old-stone-house_1.jpg', '1395_Old-stone-house_2.jpg', '1395_Old-stone-house_3.jpg', '1395_Old-stone-house_4.jpg', '1395_Old-stone-house_5.jpg', '1395_Old-stone-house_6.jpg', '1395_Old-stone-house_7.jpg', ''),
(1396, '', 'Caratan (Nik¹a)', '', '', '', 'Hvar', 'Pitve', 'For sale', 'Old stone house', '2000', '0', '60', 1, '100000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 0, 0, 'October 2, 2015', '<p>Stara kamena kuæa za renovaciju na otoku Hvaru, s predivnim pogledom na mjesto i otok Braè. Kuæa je udaljena od mora 2 km.&nbsp;Sastoji se od prizemlja i prvog kata, ukupne stambene povr&scaron;ine 60 m2.&nbsp;U prizemlju se nalazi konoba.&nbsp;Postoji moguænost parkinga u selu.&nbsp;Struja i voda se nalaze do kuæe.</p>', '<p>We are pleased to offer this old stone house with great potential, for renovation on the island of Hvar. It is situated just 2km from the coast, and the main ferry port, but elevated on the hilly island to give commanding views of the village, the natural land and the neighbouring island of Brac. The building consists of ground and first floor, with a total floor area of 60 m2.&nbsp;On the ground floor there is a cellar.&nbsp;</p>', '', '<p>Stara kamena kuæa za renovaciju na otoku Hvaru, s predivnim pogledom na mjesto i otok Braè.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je udaljena od mora 2 km.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sastoji se od prizemlja i prvog kata, ukupne stambene povr&scaron;ine 60 m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U prizemlju se nalazi konoba.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Postoji moguænost parkinga u selu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Struja i voda se nalaze do kuæe.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Trajektna luka je udaljena 2 km.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za sve dodatne informacije kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured.</p>', '<p><strong>Renovation project&nbsp;</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>We are pleased to offer this old stone house with great potential, for renovation on the island of Hvar.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is situated just 2km from the coast, and the main ferry port, but elevated on the hilly island to give commanding views of the village, the natural land and the neighbouring island of Brac.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The building consists of ground and first floor, with a total floor area of 60 m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the ground floor there is a cellar.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There is parking close to the property in the village.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Electricity and water are next to the house, so connections will not be a big problem.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For further information contact our office and we can arrange a tour of the property and give advice on refurbishment (and costs).</p>', '', '1396_Old-stone-house_0.jpg', '1396_Old-stone-house_1.jpg', '1396_Old-stone-house_2.jpg', '1396_Old-stone-house_3.jpg', '1396_Old-stone-house_4.jpg', '1396_Old-stone-house_5.jpg', '', '', ''),
(1397, '', 'Tim i Tatjana', '', '', '', 'Hvar', 'Vrbanj', 'For sale', 'Old stone house', '2000', '0', '100', 2, '220000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 3, 2, 'October 2, 2015', '<p>Renovirana stara kamena kuæa s terasom i dvori&scaron;tem na otoku Hvaru.&nbsp;Kuæa ima prekrasan pogled na more i otok Braè, a sastoji se od prizemlja, prvog i drugog kata, ukupne stambene povr&scaron;ine 100 m2, dok je povr&scaron;ina terasa i dvori&scaron;ta cca 80 m2.&nbsp;Kuæa je kompletno namje&scaron;tena i spremna za najam ili za kori&scaron;tenje u privatne svrhe.<br /><br /></p>', '<p>We have this renovated old stone house with roof terrace and garden on the island of Hvar. It is located in a beautiful authentic village in a quiet location, 2 km away from the sea. The house has a beautiful view across the village, of the sea and the island of Brac.&nbsp;The house consists of a ground, first and second floor, with a total floor area of 100 m2, and the area of the garden and terrace is approximately 80m sq (drains, water, electric etc.). The house is being sold fully furnished and is ready to rent or for private use.&nbsp;</p>', '', '<p>Renovirana stara kamena kuæa s terasom i dvori&scaron;tem na otoku Hvaru.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa ima prekrasan pogled na more i otok Braè, a sastoji se od prizemlja, prvog i drugog kata, ukupne stambene povr&scaron;ine 100 m2, dok je povr&scaron;ina terasa i dvori&scaron;ta cca 80 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U prizemlju se nalaze ulaz, dvori&scaron;te, kuhinja, blagovaonica, dnevni boravak i sprema.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Vanjske stepenice vode do prvog kata gdje su dvije spavaæe sobe od kojih jedna ima izlaz na sjeverno orijentiranu terasu.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Prvi i drugi kat su spojeni unutarnjim stepeni&scaron;tem.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na drugom katu se nalaze dvije spavaæe sobe s kupaonicom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Prisutna sva infrastruktura.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je kompletno namje&scaron;tena i spremna za najam ili za kori&scaron;tenje u privatne svrhe.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nalazi se u prekrasnom autentiènom selu na mirnoj lokaciji, 2 km udaljenoj od mora.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Mjesto ima sve potrebne sadr¾aje, a veæi grad je udaljen 2 km.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za sve dodatne informacije molimo kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>We have this renovated old stone house with roof terrace and garden on the island of Hvar.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is located in a beautiful authentic village in a quiet location, 2 km away from the sea, and the similar distance from a larger village with more options for shops, cafes, bars and restaurants.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house has a beautiful view across the village, of the sea and the island of Brac.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house consists of a ground, first and second floor, with a total floor area of 100 m2, and the area of the garden and terrace is approximately 80m sq.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The ground floor has an entrance to the courtyard, kitchen, dining room, living room and stores.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There are external stairs leading to the first floor where there are two bedrooms, one with access to the fabulous wide roof terrace.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The first and second floors are connected by an internal staircase.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the second floor there are two bedrooms with a bathroom.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Present all the infrastructure (drains, water, electric etc.).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house is being sold fully furnished and is ready to rent or for private use.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For further information please contact our office, to arrange to tour this property.</p>', '', '1397_Old-stone-house_0.jpg', '1397_Old-stone-house_1.jpg', '1397_Old-stone-house_2.jpg', '1397_Old-stone-house_3.jpg', '1397_Old-stone-house_4.jpg', '1397_Old-stone-house_5.jpg', '1397_Old-stone-house_6.jpg', '1397_Old-stone-house_7.jpg', '1397_Old-stone-house_8.jpg'),
(1398, 'Jure', 'Grgièeviæ (Nik¹a)', '', '', '', 'Hvar', 'Selo Vrisnik', 'For sale', 'Old stone house', '2000', '0', '80', 1, '49000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 0, 0, 'October 2, 2015', '<p>Stara kamena kuæa za renovaciju na otoku Hvaru, s predivnim pogledom na mjesto. Sastoji se od prizemlja i prvog kata, ukupne stambene povr&scaron;ine 80 m2.&nbsp;U prizemlju se nalazi konoba.&nbsp;Orijentirana sjeveroistoèno.&nbsp;Postoji moguænost parkinga u selu. Struja i voda se nalaze do kuæe. Grad Hvar je udaljen 2 km. Za sve dodatne informacije kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured.</p>', '<p>We have this traditional old stone cottage in need of complete renovation in an inland village. It is situated in one of the villages 10 minutes drive from the coast, and 2 kilometres from the main island town of Hvar, and it also benefits from elevated views across the other few houses and open countryside. The walls appear sound, and there is water and electric nearby, so, apart from the great location, there is some ''upside''!&nbsp;It consists of ground and first floor, with a total floor area of 80 m2.</p>', '', '<p>Stara kamena kuæa za renovaciju na otoku Hvaru, s predivnim pogledom na mjesto.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sastoji se od prizemlja i prvog kata, ukupne stambene povr&scaron;ine 80 m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U prizemlju se nalazi konoba.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Orijentirana sjeveroistoèno.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Postoji moguænost parkinga u selu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Struja i voda se nalaze do kuæe.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Grad Hvar je udaljen 2 km.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za sve dodatne informacije kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured.</p>', '<p><strong>Great renovation project</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>We have this traditional old stone cottage in need of complete renovation in an inland village.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is situated in one of the villages 10 minutes drive from the coast, and 2 kilometres from the main island town of Hvar, and it also benefits from elevated views across the other few houses and open countryside.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The walls appear sound, and there is water and electric nearby, so, apart from the great location, there is some ''upside''!&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It consists of ground and first floor, with a total floor area of 80 m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the ground floor there is a cellar.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The building is oriented northeast.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There is parking in the village, close to the house.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Electricity and&nbsp;&nbsp;water are close to the house.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For further information, contact our office, and we can arrange to view the property and give our advice on renovation costs etc.</p>', '', '1398_Old-stone-house_0.JPG', '1398_Old-stone-house_1.JPG', '1398_Old-stone-house_2.JPG', '1398_Old-stone-house_3.JPG', '1398_Old-stone-house_4.JPG', '1398_Old-stone-house_5.JPG', '1398_Old-stone-house_6.JPG', '1398_Old-stone-house_7.JPG', ''),
(1399, 'Jure', 'Grgièeviæ (Nik¹a)', '', '', '', 'Hvar', 'Selo Vrisnik', 'For sale', 'Old stone house', '2000', '400', '130', 1, '159000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 0, 0, 'October 2, 2015', '<p>Stara kamena kuæa s balkonom na otoku Hvaru, s predivnim pogledom na mjesto i otok Braè.&nbsp;Sastoji se od prizemlja i prvog kata, ukupne stambene povr&scaron;ine 130 m2, dok zemlji&scaron;te ima povr&scaron;inu 400 m2.&nbsp;U vrtu se nalazi jo&scaron; jedna kamena kuæica od 30 m2.&nbsp;U prizemlju se nalazi konoba.&nbsp;Kuæa je orijentirana sjeveroistoèno.&nbsp;Ima parking.&nbsp;Kuæa ima prikljuèke na vodu i struju.&nbsp;Od mora je udaljena 2 km.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>We have this beautiful old stone cottage with much potential. It is situated inland, but with a balcony that has beautiful views of the village and Brac. It is 2 kilometres to the sea, and also 2 kilometres to the main town on the island, which is Hvar. It takes 5 minutes on a bicycle!&nbsp;The property consists of a ground and first floor, with a total floor area of 130 m2, while the large garden has an area of 400 m2.&nbsp;In the garden there is another stone out house of 30 m2, which can be converted into residential space.&nbsp;</p>', '', '<p>Stara kamena kuæa s balkonom na otoku Hvaru, s predivnim pogledom na mjesto i otok Braè.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sastoji se od prizemlja i prvog kata, ukupne stambene povr&scaron;ine 130 m2, dok zemlji&scaron;te ima povr&scaron;inu 400 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U vrtu se nalazi jo&scaron; jedna kamena kuæica od 30 m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U prizemlju se nalazi konoba.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je orijentirana sjeveroistoèno.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ima parking.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa ima prikljuèke na vodu i struju.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Od mora je udaljena 2 km.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Grad Hvar &nbsp;je udaljen 2 km.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za sve dodatne informacije kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured.</p>', '<p>We have this beautiful old stone cottage with much potential.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is situated inland, but with a balcony that has beautiful views of the village and Brac.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is 2 kilometres to the sea, and also 2 kilometres to the main town on the island, which is Hvar.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It takes 5 minutes on a bicycle!&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property consists of a ground and first floor, with a total floor area of 130 m2, while the large garden has an area of 400 m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>In the garden there is another stone out house of 30 m2, which can be converted into residential space.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the ground floor there is a cellar.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house is oriented northeast.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There is plenty of private and secure parking either on the plot or nearby.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house has connections to the mains water and electricity.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact our office for the exact location and to arrange to visit the property.</p>', '', '1399_Old-stone-house_0.JPG', '1399_Old-stone-house_1.JPG', '1399_Old-stone-house_2.JPG', '1399_Old-stone-house_3.JPG', '1399_Old-stone-house_4.JPG', '1399_Old-stone-house_5.JPG', '1399_Old-stone-house_6.JPG', '1399_Old-stone-house_7.JPG', '1399_Old-stone-house_8.JPG'),
(1400, 'Pavao Kri¹to ', 'Ru¾a Konta', '098406039 Pavao', '', '', 'Kastela', 'Janka Rodina 14 Ka¹tel Luk¹iæ, 62/6, 62/19  K.O. Ka¹tel Luk¹iæ', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '280', '0', '75', 1, '90000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 'October 2, 2015', '<p>Apartman za renoviranje s prostranom terasom i vrtom s gara¾om u prizemlju.&nbsp;Smje&scaron;ten je na 2.katu (zadnjem) u zgradi sagraðenoj 1972. godine. Potrebno je potpuno renoviranje, ali ima odlièan potencijal zbog blizine starog dijela mjesta gdje se nalazi popularan dvorac i mnogi drugi sadr¾aji.&nbsp;Apartman ima povr&scaron;inu 75,59 m2 (51,75 m2 + terasa 21,84 m2 &nbsp;i balkon 2 m2).</p>\r\n<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;">CIJENA SNI®ENA SA 110.000 EURA!</span></p>', '<p>We are offering this apartment as a renovation project with a spacious terrace and garden, and a garage on the ground floor. It is located on the 2nd floor (top) of a building constructed in 1972. The apartment has an area of 75.59 m2 (51.75 m2 + 21.84 m2 terrace and balcony 2 m2). The advantage of this property is that it is owned and also a garage with a small garden.</p>\r\n<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;">PRICE REDUCED FROM 110.000 EUR!</span></p>', '', '<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;"><strong>CIJENA SNI®ENA SA 110.000 EURA!</strong></span></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartman za renoviranje s prostranom terasom i vrtom s gara¾om u prizemlju.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Smje&scaron;ten je na 2.katu (zadnjem) u zgradi sagraðenoj 1972. godine.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Potrebno je potpuno renoviranje, ali ima odlièan potencijal zbog blizine starog dijela mjesta gdje se nalazi popularan dvorac i mnogi drugi sadr¾aji.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ka&scaron;tela su sve popularnije odredi&scaron;te, kako za &nbsp;turiste, tako i za boravak tijekom cijele godine.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>More je udaljeno cca. 280 m, a u blizini se nalazi i &scaron;ljunèana pla¾a.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ka&scaron;tela su smje&scaron;tena izmeðu Trogira i Splita, dok je meðunarodni aerodrom takoðer blizu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartman je povr&scaron;ine 75,59 m2 (51,75 m2 + terasa 21,84 m2 &nbsp;i balkon 2 m2).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sastoji se od malog hodnika, dnevnog boravka s kuhinjom i blagovaonicom, 2 spavaæe sobe, kupaonice, manjeg balkona i terase na kojoj se nalazi kamin.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na terasi je takoðer i vodovodna instalacija.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Prednost ove nekretnine je &scaron;to je u vlasni&scaron;tvu takoðer i gara¾a s manjim vrtom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ostajemo na usluzi za sva dodatna pitanja i fotografije.</p>', '<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;"><strong>PRICE REDUCED FROM 110.000 EUR!</strong></span></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>We are offering this apartment as a renovation project with a spacious terrace and garden, and a garage on the ground floor.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is located on the 2nd floor (top) of a building constructed in 1972.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The apartment has an area of 75.59 m2 (51.75 m2 + 21.84 m2 terrace and balcony 2 m2).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It consists of a hall, living room with kitchen, 2 bedrooms, bathroom, small balcony and a terrace where there is a bbq/fireplace.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The terrace also has plumbing instalation.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The advantage of this property is that it is owned and also a garage with a small garden.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It requires a complete renovation, but has great potential because of the proximity to the old location of the popular castle and many other facilities.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kastela is an increasingly popular destination for both tourists and people who want to live near Split throughout the year which is making it a consistently good place to invest in property, particularly, renovation projects, such as this.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The sea is approx. 280 m, and nearby there is a pebble beach, as well as the Riva walkway all along the shore, passing many of the best restaurants and other bars and cafes in the region.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The airport is 10 minutes away, driving.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>We are happy to answer questions, and arrange a tour of the property.</p>', '', '1400_Apartment_0.JPG', '1400_Apartment_1.JPG', '1400_Apartment_2.JPG', '1400_Apartment_3.JPG', '1400_Apartment_4.JPG', '1400_Apartment_5.JPG', '1400_Apartment_6.JPG', '1400_Apartment_7.JPG', '1400_Apartment_8.JPG'),
(1401, 'Boran', 'Doriæ', '', '091 251 7109', '', 'Omis', 'Krug, 6300/3, 6300/5 k.o. jesenice', 'For sale', 'Land plot', '1000', '900', '0', 1, '155000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 0, 0, 'October 2, 2015', '<p>Gradjevinsko zemlji&scaron;te smjesteno 1 km zraène udaljenosti od mora, a 4 km cestovne udaljenosti od magistralne ceste Split &ndash; Omis.&nbsp;Ima povr&scaron;inu 900 m2.&nbsp;S parcele se pru¾a lijepi pogled na more. Zemljiste ima pristup javnom putu, ali je sirina nedovoljna za prolaz vozilom. Struja se nalazi u neposrednoj blizini, a vodovod ne postoji (okolne kuæe za opskrbu vodom koriste gustirne).&nbsp;</p>', '<p>Building plot for sale, located 1 km areal distance from the sea and 4 km by car to the main coastal road Split &ndash; Omis.&nbsp;It measures 900 m2.&nbsp;The plot offers nice open sea views. It has access to public path, but the width is insufficient for the vehicles. Electricity connection is nearby the plot, while there is no mains water &ndash; all inhabited houses in the village have water tanks.&nbsp;For further information please contact our office in Split.</p>', '', '<p>Gradjevinsko zemlji&scaron;te smjesteno 1 km zraène udaljenosti od mora, a 4 km cestovne udaljenosti od magistralne ceste Split &ndash; Omis.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ima povr&scaron;inu 900 m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>S parcele se pru¾a lijepi pogled na more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Zemljiste ima pristup javnom putu, ali je sirina nedovoljna za prolaz vozilom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Struja se nalazi u neposrednoj blizini, a vodovod ne postoji (okolne kuæe za opskrbu vodom koriste gustirne).&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za dodatne informacije molimo kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured u Splitu.</p>', '<p>Building plot for sale, located 1 km areal distance from the sea and 4 km by car to the main coastal road Split &ndash; Omis.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It measures 900 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The plot offers nice open sea views.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It has access to public path, but the width is insufficient for the vehicles.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Electricity connection is nearby the plot, while there is no mains water &ndash; all inhabited houses in the village have water tanks.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For further information please contact our office in Split.</p>', '', '1401_Land-plot_0.jpg', '1401_Land-plot_1.jpg', '1401_Land-plot_2.jpg', '1401_Land-plot_3.jpg', '1401_Land-plot_4.jpg', '1401_Land-plot_5.jpg', '1401_Land-plot_6.jpg', '1401_Land-plot_7.jpg', '1401_Land-plot_8.jpg'),
(1402, 'Toma', 'Sokiæ', '', '098 603 210 Bonko Sokiæ', '', 'Omis', 'Ulica Stiva 12 Krilo Jesenice, k.è. 7631 k.o. jesenice, ZU 2412', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '110', '600', '290', 1, '375000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 4, 2, 'October 2, 2015', '<p>U malom mjestu svega 15 minuta vo¾nje ju¾no od Splita prodajemo ovu lijepu kvalitetno graðenu obiteljsku kuæu ukupne bruto razvijene povr&scaron;ine 380 m2.&nbsp;Kuæa ima tri eta¾e, parkirali&scaron;no-gara¾ni prostor te stra¾nje dvori&scaron;te u kojem je moguæe napraviti bazen.&nbsp;Drugi kat ima sliènu strukturu prostora kao i prvi. Obje gornje eta¾e imaju izvrstan pogled na more.&nbsp;Kuæa je udaljena od mora svega 110 m zraène linije, a cestom se do mora sti¾e za 5 minuta hoda.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>In a small village only 15 min drive south of Split we have this nice family home for sale, sized 380 sq.m GFA.&nbsp;The house has 3 floors, parking, garage and back yard suitable to fit a swimming pool.&nbsp;Both first and second floor feature excellent open sea views.&nbsp;The property is located only 100 meters areal distance from the sea, while the beach can be reached by road in less than 5 minutes on foot.&nbsp;</p>', '', '<p><strong>Lijepa obiteljska kuæa s pogledom na more</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U malom mjestu svega 15 minuta vo¾nje ju¾no od Splita prodajemo ovu lijepu kvalitetno graðenu obiteljsku kuæu ukupne bruto razvijene povr&scaron;ine 380 m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa ima tri eta¾e, parkirali&scaron;no-gara¾ni prostor te stra¾nje dvori&scaron;te u kojem je moguæe napraviti bazen.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Prizemlje nije u cijelosti privedeno funkciji, a sastoji se od dnevnog prostora sa kaminom, sobe, wc-a, praonice te prostorije za centralno grijanje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Unutarnjim stepeni&scaron;tem prizemlje je povezano sa prvim i drugim katom.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Stan na prvom katu sastoji se od hodnika, kuhinje sa blagovaonicom, dnevnog boravka, terase, dvije spavaæe sobe, kupaonice i ostave.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Drugi kat ima sliènu strukturu prostora kao i prvi.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Obje gornje eta¾e imaju izvrstan pogled na more.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je udaljena od mora svega 110 m zraène linije, a cestom se do mora sti¾e za 5 minuta hoda.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za dodatne informacije molimo kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured u Splitu.&nbsp;</p>', '<p><strong>Nice family home with great sea views</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>In a small village only 15 min drive south of Split we have this nice family home for sale, sized 380 sq.m GFA.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house has 3 floors, parking, garage and back yard suitable to fit a swimming pool.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ground floor has not yet been brought to use and comprises of a living room with fire place, bedroom, toilet, laindry and utility room (electrically powered central heating exists throughout the house).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Internal staircase connects all the floors.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartment on the first floor contains hallway, kitchen with dining room, living room, terrace, two bedrooms, bathroom and storage.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Second floor has the same-like structure.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Both first and second floor feature excellent open sea views.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property is located only 100 meters areal distance from the sea, while the beach can be reached by road in less than 5 minutes on foot.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For further information please contact our office in Split. &nbsp;</p>', '', '1402_House-Villa_0.jpg', '1402_House-Villa_1.jpg', '1402_House-Villa_2.jpg', '1402_House-Villa_3.jpg', '1402_House-Villa_4.jpg', '1402_House-Villa_5.jpg', '1402_House-Villa_6.jpg', '1402_House-Villa_7.jpg', '1402_House-Villa_8.jpg'),
(1403, 'Petar Svibor d.', 'Ljubas Anita', '', '0912293388', '', 'Rogoznica', 'Vi¹ka 37 Rogoznica', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '150', '440', '110', 1, '259000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 3, 2, 'October 2, 2015', '<p>Apartman ju¾ne - istoène orijentacije u odliènom stanju, nalazi se u zgradi izgraðenoj 2005 godine, na svega 500 m udaljenosti od centra lijepog i vrlo atraktivnog turistièkog mjesta.&nbsp;Udaljenost do pla¾e je svega 150 m.&nbsp;Povr&scaron;ina apartmana je 110 m2, a s obzirom da se nalazi u prizemlju zgrade pripada mu i vrt povr&scaron;ine 440 m2.&nbsp;S terase i vrta mo¾e se u¾ivati u nesmetanom pogledu na more i okolicu.</p>', '<p>We are offering this well presented ground floor apartment that comes witha large garden of 440m sq.&nbsp;The apartment has a south - east orientation, is in excellent condition situated in a modern building built in 2005, only 500 m distance from the beautiful and very attractive tourist places in the centre of the village.&nbsp;The shore and nearest beach is only 150 m.&nbsp;The apartment size is 110 m2. From the terrace and the garden you can enjoy unobstructed views of the sea and the countryside.</p>', '', '<p>Apartman ju¾ne - istoène orijentacije u odliènom stanju, nalazi se u zgradi izgraðenoj 2005 godine, na svega 500 m udaljenosti od centra lijepog i vrlo atraktivnog turistièkog mjesta.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Udaljenost do pla¾e je svega 150 m.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Povr&scaron;ina apartmana je 110 m2, a s obzirom da se nalazi u prizemlju zgrade pripada mu i vrt povr&scaron;ine 440 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartman se sastoji od tri spavaæe sobe, kupaonice, dnevnog boravka i kuhinje s pripadajuæom terasom u sklopu vrta.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>S terase i vrta mo¾e se u¾ivati u nesmetanom pogledu na more i okolicu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Luksuzno ureðen stan u vrlo odliènom stanju udaljen je do centra mjesta, duæana, tr¾nice, restorana i kafiæa svega 500 m, a do aerodroma 28 km.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartman ima svu potrebnu infrastrukturu.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Dva parking mjesta su takoðer ukljuèena u cijenu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za dodatne informacije molimo kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured u Splitu.</p>', '<p>We are offering this well presented ground floor apartment that comes witha large garden of 440m sq.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The apartment has a south - east orientation, is in excellent condition situated in a modern building built in 2005, only 500 m distance from the beautiful and very attractive tourist places in the centre of the village.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The shore and nearest beach is only 150 m.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The apartment size is 110 m2, and is designed with three bedrooms, bathroom, living room and kitchen, leading out onto a terrace in the garden.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>From the terrace and the garden you can enjoy unobstructed views of the sea and the countryside.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property comes with two private parking spaces.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The airport is less than 20 minutes driving.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For further information, and to arrange to visit this apartment, please contact our office in Split.</p>', '', '1403_Apartment_0.jpg', '1403_Apartment_1.jpg', '1403_Apartment_2.jpg', '1403_Apartment_3.JPG', '1403_Apartment_4.JPG', '1403_Apartment_5.JPG', '1403_Apartment_6.JPG', '1403_Apartment_7.JPG', '1403_Apartment_8.JPG'),
(1404, '', 'Mirica i Zeljko Bruæ', '', '091 517 9332 Ante0955585029', 'martina.b.23@gmail.com', 'Rogoznica', 'Nova 40, uðe se u X i kruzno silazi u IX  Rogoznica, k.è. 1930 k.o. Rogoznica', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '190', '150', '270', 1, '175000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 4, 2, 'October 2, 2015', '<p>Dvojna kuca u Rogoznici s djelomicnim pogledom na more, udaljena svega par minuta od lijepo uredjene plaze i centra mjesta.&nbsp;Povrsina stambenog dijela kuce je 270 m2, a bruto povrsina kuce (s terasama) iznosi 330 m2.&nbsp;Kuca se nalazi na parceli povrsine 150 m2. Kuca se sastoji od prizemlja i dva kata. U prizemlju je studio apartman povrsine 20 m2, pogodan za iznajmljivanje tijekom turisticke sezone.</p>', '<p>We are pleased to offer this semi-detached house in Rogoznica with sea views, only a few minutes walk from the beaches and the village centre.&nbsp;Inside the property it comprises of a living area of 270 m2, and the gross area of the house, including the terrace is 330 m2.&nbsp;The house is on a &nbsp;plot of 150 m2.&nbsp;The house was designed over three floors, and on the ground floor is a studio apartment of 20 m2, suitable for rental during the tourist season.</p>', '', '<p>Dvojna kuca u Rogoznici s djelomicnim pogledom na more, udaljena svega par minuta od lijepo uredjene plaze i centra mjesta.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Povrsina stambenog dijela kuce je 270 m2, a bruto povrsina kuce (s terasama) iznosi 330 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuca se nalazi na parceli povrsine 150 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuca se sastoji od prizemlja i dva kata.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U prizemlju je studio apartman povrsine 20 m2, pogodan za iznajmljivanje tijekom turisticke sezone.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na prvom katu su dvije spavace sobe, kupaonica, kuhinja i dnevni boravak iz kojeg se izlazi na veliku terasu na kojoj se moze uzivati u prirodnoj hladovini, tisini i pogledu na more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Drugi kat takodjer ima dvije spavace sobe, kupaonicu, kuhinju, dnevni boravak i terasu s pogledom na more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuca ima svu potrebnu infrastrukturu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Uz kucu se nalaze i tri parking mjesta.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Udaljenost do plaze je svega 190 m, a nedaleko je i centar mjesta sa svim potrebnim sadrzajima (restorani, kafici, ducani, pijaca).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Aerodrom je udaljen 28 km.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za dodatne informacije molimo kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured u Splitu.</p>', '<p>We are pleased to offer this semi-detached house in Rogoznica with sea views, only a few minutes walk from the beaches and the village centre.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Inside the property it comprises of a living area of 270 m2, and the gross area of the house, including the terrace is 330 m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house is on a plot of 150 m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house was designed over three floors, and on the ground floor is a studio apartment of 20 m2, suitable for rental during the tourist season.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the first floor are two bedrooms, bathroom, kitchen and living room in an open plan style, which exits onto a large terrace where you can enjoy the natural shade, silence and view of the sea.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The second floor there are also two bedrooms, bathroom, kitchen, living room and terrace with elevated sea views.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house was well built using good quality materials and finished to a high standard, and since then has been well maintained.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It requires little if any further expenditure.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>With the house there are three private parking spaces.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The distance from the beach is only 190 m, and nearby is the village centre with many necessary amenities such as restaurants, shops, caf&eacute;s, market, and coffee and licensed bars.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The airport is 28 km.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For further information, please contact our office in Split and our agents can arrange a tour.</p>', '', '1404_House-Villa_0.JPG', '1404_House-Villa_1.JPG', '1404_House-Villa_2.JPG', '1404_House-Villa_3.JPG', '1404_House-Villa_4.JPG', '1404_House-Villa_5.JPG', '1404_House-Villa_6.JPG', '1404_House-Villa_7.JPG', '1404_House-Villa_8.jpg'),
(1405, 'Nevenka', 'Blagaiæ', '', '+385 99 6186064', 'nblagaic@gmail.com', 'Sibenik', 'Fra Pija Fr¾opa 5 Vodice, 323/3', 'For sale', 'Old stone house', '70', '0', '50', 1, '69000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 1, 'October 2, 2015', '<p style="color: #f70732;">CIJENA SNI®ENA SA 75.000 &euro;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Simpatièna renovirana stara kamena kuæa u nizu.&nbsp;Nalazi se u turistièkom mjestu nedaleko &Scaron;ibenika.&nbsp;Najbli¾i aerodrom je udaljen 1h vo¾nje.&nbsp;Kuæa se nalazi samo 70 m od mora.&nbsp;S obzirom da se nalazi u centru mjesta, trgovine i ostali sadr¾aji su u blizini.&nbsp;Pristup automobilom je moguæ do same kuæe gdje se ujedno nalazi i parking.&nbsp;Sastoji se od prizemlja i 1.kata ukupne povr&scaron;ina 50 m2 + krovne terase od cca 20 m2.<br /><br /></p>', '<p style="color: #f90536;">PRICE REDUCED FROM 75.000 &euro;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Charming old stone house near &Scaron;ibenik. In a beautiful position - quiet street, only 70 meters from the sea and 100 meters from the beach, 100 meters from the town center.&nbsp;Internal stairs lead to the first floor, where is the bedroom.&nbsp;The house has a roof terrace (second floor), suitable for outdoor living (electricity, water supply), which can be reached by internal stairs from the first floor.&nbsp;Total living area of the house is 50 sqm + roof terrace of cca 20 sqm.</p>', '', '<p style="color: #f30b35;">CIJENA SNI®ENA SA 75.000 &euro;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Simpatièna renovirana stara kamena kuæa u nizu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nalazi se u turistièkom mjestu nedaleko &Scaron;ibenika.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Najbli¾i aerodrom je udaljen 1h vo¾nje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa se nalazi samo 70 m od mora.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>S obzirom da se nalazi u centru mjesta, trgovine i ostali sadr¾aji su u blizini.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Pristup automobilom je moguæ do same kuæe gdje se ujedno nalazi i parking.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sastoji se od prizemlja i 1.kata &nbsp;ukupne povr&scaron;ina 50 m2 + krovne terase od cca 20 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Cijela kuæa je povezana unutarnjim stepenicama.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U prizemlju se nalazi kuhinja sa blagovaonicom i dnevnim boravkom.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na istoj eta¾i se nalaze kupaonica i mala sprema.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na 1.katu je prostrana spavaæa soba.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Krovna terasa je takoðer prostrana (s prikljuècima struje i vode).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je klimatizirana i ureðena u dalmatinskom stilu, &scaron;to je dodatna prednost.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Renovirana je i ureðena jako kvalitetno pazeæi na svaki detalj.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nije potrebno dodatno ulaganje, stoga je ovo izuzetno povoljna prilika s obzirom na stanje i lokaciju.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za sva dodatna pitanja molimo kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured u Splitu.&nbsp;</p>', '<p style="color: #f5091c;">PRICE REDUCED FROM 75.000 &euro;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Charming old stone house near &Scaron;ibenik.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>In a beautiful position - quiet street, only 70 meters from the sea and 100 meters from the beach, 100 meters from the town center.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The ground floor comprises kitchen, dining room and living room - all as one space.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There is also a bathroom, with a small storage space.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Internal stairs lead to the first floor, where is the bedroom.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house has a roof terrace (second floor), suitable for outdoor living (electricity, water supply), which can be reached by internal stairs from the first floor.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Total living area of the house is 50 sqm + roof terrace of cca 20 sqm.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house was renovated and in very good condition, and decorated in fine Dalmatian combination of blue (floors and tiles) and white (furniture, walls).&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Renovated (new) interior woodwork (windows) is made of PVC (white) and external (doors and shutters) is made of aluminum (green).&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Window benches are from well konown stone from island Brac.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Air conditioning device on the first floor (bedroom).&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The entrance to the house can be accessed by car.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Having a clean ownership - 1/1, without any obstacles for the transfer to the buyer.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For further information please contact our office in Split.&nbsp;</p>', '', '1405_Old-stone-house_0.jpg', '1405_Old-stone-house_1.jpg', '1405_Old-stone-house_2.jpg', '1405_Old-stone-house_3.jpg', '1405_Old-stone-house_4.jpg', '1405_Old-stone-house_5.jpg', '1405_Old-stone-house_6.jpg', '1405_Old-stone-house_7.jpg', '1405_Old-stone-house_8.jpg');
INSERT INTO `nekretnina` (`id`, `ime`, `prezime`, `telefon`, `mobitel`, `e_mail`, `lokacija_id`, `adresa`, `status_id`, `vrsta_id`, `udaljenost`, `povrsina`, `stambenapovrsina`, `display`, `cijena`, `cijenatocka`, `ponuda_tjedna`, `new_built`, `must_sell`, `prvi_red_do_mora`, `pogled_na_more`, `bazen`, `broj_soba`, `broj_kupatila`, `datum`, `title_hr`, `title_en`, `title_ge`, `opis_hr`, `opis_en`, `opis_ge`, `PropertyImageURL0`, `PropertyImageURL1`, `PropertyImageURL2`, `PropertyImageURL3`, `PropertyImageURL4`, `PropertyImageURL5`, `PropertyImageURL6`, `PropertyImageURL7`, `PropertyImageURL8`) VALUES
(1406, 'Blankica', 'Kurner', '095 587 5625', '091 509 4832', 'blanka.kurner@gmail.com', 'Brac', 'Pjaca 1 Postira, 159 zgr k.o. postira', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '130', '0', '47', 1, '74000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 'October 5, 2015', '<p>Dvosobni prizemni prostor u centru Postira na otoku Braèu. U pje&scaron;aèkoj zoni, bez pogleda na more. Nekretnina je bila u procesu renovacije te su zavr&scaron;eni grubi radovi.&nbsp;Ukupna stambena povr&scaron;ina iznosi 47 m2.&nbsp;Cijena je fiksna.&nbsp;Udaljenost od mora 130 m.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>Two bedroom premise in the center of Postira on Brac island. In pedestrian zone, without sea views. The property has recently been in renovation process and structural works are done.&nbsp;Total living area of47 sqm.&nbsp;The price is fixed.&nbsp;Distance to the sea 130 m.&nbsp;</p>', '', '<p>Dvosobni prizemni prostor u centru Postira na otoku Braèu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U pje&scaron;aèkoj zoni, bez pogleda na more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nekretnina je bila u procesu renovacije te su zavr&scaron;eni grubi radovi. Nije eta¾irana i prodaje se kao suvlasnièki udio.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ukupna stambena povr&scaron;ina iznosi 47 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Cijena je fiksna.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Udaljenost od mora 130 m.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Centar mjesta je udaljen 100 m, dok je trajektna luka udaljena 12 km.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za vise informacija kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured u Splitu.</p>', '<p>Two bedroom premise in the center of Postira on Brac island.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>In pedestrian zone, without sea views.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property has recently been in renovation process and structural works are done. It is sold as co-ownership part in the building (joint title deed).&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Total living area of47 sqm.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The price is fixed.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Distance to the sea 130 m.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Center is 100 m, while the ferry port is 12 km away.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For more information please contact our office in Split.&nbsp;</p>', '', '1406_Apartment_0.jpg', '1406_Apartment_1.jpg', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(1407, 'Nik¹a', 'Zaninoviæ', '', '', '', 'Hvar', 'Jagodna', 'For sale', 'Old stone house', '500', '0', '150', 1, '125000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 0, 0, 'October 5, 2015', '<p>Stara kamena kuæa za renovaciju na otoku Hvaru, s otvorenim pogledom na more. Sastoji se od prizemlja i prvog kata, ukupne stambene povr&scaron;ine 150 m2.&nbsp;U prizemlju se nalazi konoba. Kuæa ima mali vrt ispred.&nbsp;Orijentirana je ju¾no. Postoji moguænost parkinga u selu. Kuæa je prikljuèena na struju. Udaljena je 500 m od mora.&nbsp;Veæe mjesto je udaljeno 2 km.</p>', '<p>We are pleased to offer this old stone house with balcony and garden, as a project for builders/investors. It is a traditional cottage needing complete renovation, but has sweeping views of the sea from the balcony and some of the windows. It consists of ground and first floor, with a total floor area of 150 m2. On the ground floor there is a cellar. The first floor is the living area. The house has a small garden in front.&nbsp;It is oriented south. There is a parking close to the property in the village.</p>', '', '<p>Stara kamena kuæa za renovaciju na otoku Hvaru, s otvorenim pogledom na more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sastoji se od prizemlja i prvog kata, ukupne stambene povr&scaron;ine 150 m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U prizemlju se nalazi konoba.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa ima mali vrt ispred.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Orijentirana je ju¾no.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Vlasniku pripada i objekt smje&scaron;ten odmah pored, povr&scaron;ine 40 m2, a ukupna cijena oba objekta bi bila &euro;160.000.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Postoji moguænost parkinga u selu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Mjesto je prikljuèeno na struju, a za opskrbu vodom koristi se cisterna.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Udaljena je 500 m od mora.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Veæe mjesto je udaljeno 2 km.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za sve dodatne informacije kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured.</p>', '<p><strong>Renovation project</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>We are pleased to offer this old stone house with balcony and garden, as a project for builders/investors.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is a traditional cottage needing complete renovation, but has sweeping views of the sea from the balcony and some of the windows.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The location is peaceful and off the main tourist track.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It consists of ground and first floor, with a total floor area of 150 m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the ground floor there is a cellar.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The first floor is the living area.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house has a small garden in front.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is oriented south.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For sale is one small object of 40 m2 next to the house as well, and the price would be &euro;160.000 for both houses.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There is a parking close to the property in the village.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>House is connected to the electricity and the owners use water tank.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is located 500 m from the sea and within cycling/walking distance if a bigger village - 2 km.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For further information about renovating this type of building, and to arrange to visit this property, please contact our office.</p>', '', '1407_Old-stone-house_0.jpg', '1407_Old-stone-house_1.jpg', '1407_Old-stone-house_2.jpg', '1407_Old-stone-house_3.jpg', '1407_Old-stone-house_4.jpg', '1407_Old-stone-house_5.jpg', '1407_Old-stone-house_6.jpg', '1407_Old-stone-house_7.jpg', '1407_Old-stone-house_8.jpg'),
(1408, '', 'Rakiæ', '', '', '', 'Rogoznica', 'Zeèevo', 'For sale', 'Land plot', '250', '1320', '0', 2, '171600', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 0, 0, 'October 6, 2015', '<p>Graðevno zemlji&scaron;te u blizini Rogoznice, povr&scaron;ine 1320 m2 s prekrasnim pogledom na more.&nbsp;Ima dobar pristup te svu potrebnu infrastrukturu.&nbsp;Zemlji&scaron;te je udaljeno od pla¾e samo 250 m. Pogodno je za gradnju vila s bazenima, dvojnih objekata ili za vi&scaron;estambenu izgradnju.&nbsp;&Scaron;irina zemlji&scaron;ta u naj&scaron;irem sjevernom dijelu je cca 34 m, a u naju¾em dijelu cca 24 m.&nbsp;S obzirom da ima put po zapadnoj i sjevernoj meði zemlji&scaron;te je i iskoristivo i za cijepanje na manje parcele.</p>', '<p>Croatia property sales are pleased to offer this substantial building land in a good location, near the village of Rogoznica. The plot size is 1320 m2 and the sloping shore ensures that any buildings will have a beautiful sea view!&nbsp;It has good access and all the necessary infrastructure is close or present. The land is only 250 m from the beach. The land is suitable for building villas with swimming pools, semi-detached houses or for a residential apartment building.&nbsp;</p>', '', '<p>Graðevno zemlji&scaron;te u blizini Rogoznice, povr&scaron;ine 1320 m2 s prekrasnim pogledom na more.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ima dobar pristup te svu potrebnu infrastrukturu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Zemlji&scaron;te je udaljeno od pla¾e samo 250 m.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Pogodno je za gradnju vila s bazenima, dvojnih objekata ili za vi&scaron;estambenu izgradnju.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&Scaron;irina zemlji&scaron;ta u naj&scaron;irem sjevernom dijelu je cca 34 m, a u naju¾em dijelu cca 24 m.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>S obzirom da ima put po zapadnoj i sjevernoj meði zemlji&scaron;te je i iskoristivo i za cijepanje na manje parcele.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za dodatne informacije molimo kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured u Splitu.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>Croatia property sales are pleased to offer this substantial building land in a good location, near the village of Rogoznica.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The plot size is 1320 m2 and the sloping shore ensures that any buildings will have a beautiful sea view!&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It has good access and all the necessary infrastructure is close or present.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The land is only 250 m from the beach.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The land is suitable for building villas with swimming pools, semi-detached houses or for a residential apartment building.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The width of land in the northern part of the widest is approximately 34 m, and in the narrowest part of approximately 24 m.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There are several different options how the plot can be best utilised, so please contact our office in Split for further details and to arrange to visit the location.</p>', '', '1408_Land-plot_0.jpg', '1408_Land-plot_1.jpg', '1408_Land-plot_2.jpg', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(1409, 'Srðana', 'Èuliæ', '', '098448133', 'sculic@kbsplit.hr srdjana.culic@st.htnet', 'Split', 'Blizu City C. &#8211; Vukovarska ulica Split', 'For sale', 'Land plot', '3500', '4400', '0', 1, '1760000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 0, 0, 'October 6, 2015', '<p>Graðevinsko zemlji&scaron;te u istoènom dijelu Splita na izuzetnoj lokaciji u blizini popularnog shoping centra.&nbsp;Najbli¾a pla¾a udaljena je 10 minuta vo¾nje, dok je sami centar grada cca. 20 minuta vo¾nje.&nbsp;Ukupna povr&scaron;ina zemlji&scaron;ta iznosi 4 400 m2, a glavna orijentacija je ju¾na.&nbsp;Nalazi se odmah do ceste, dok je sva potrebna infrastruktura u blizini. Ovo je zemlji&scaron;te idealno za izgradnju stambene zgrade za daljnu prodaju.</p>', '<p>We are offering this substantial parcel of building land in the eastern part of Split town in an excellent location close to the popular shopping centre.&nbsp;The nearest beach is 10 minutes away, while the center of town approx. 15minutes away.&nbsp;The total land area is 4400 m2, and the gently sloping plot is mainly South orientation. It is located next to the road, with all the necessary infrastructure nearby.&nbsp;This land is ideal for the construction of residential buildings for further sale.</p>', '', '<p>Graðevinsko zemlji&scaron;te u istoènom dijelu Splita na izuzetnoj lokaciji u blizini popularnog shoping centra.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Najbli¾a pla¾a udaljena je 10 minuta vo¾nje, dok je sami centar grada cca. 20 minuta vo¾nje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ukupna povr&scaron;ina zemlji&scaron;ta iznosi 4 400 m2, a glavna orijentacija je ju¾na.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nalazi se odmah do ceste, dok je sva potrebna infrastruktura u blizini.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ovo je zemlji&scaron;te idealno za izgradnju stambene zgrade za daljnu prodaju.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ukoliko imate dodatnih pitanja slobodno nas kontaktirajte.</p>', '<p>We are offering this substantial parcel of building land in the eastern part of Split town in an excellent location close to the popular shopping centre.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The nearest beach is 10 minutes away, while the center of town approx. 15 minutes away.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The total land area is 4400 m2, and the gently sloping plot is mainly South orientation.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is located next to the road, with all the necessary infrastructure nearby.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>This land is ideal for the construction of residential buildings for further sale, and serious applicants should negotiate the exact number and dimensions with the building control in the town offices.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>We are willing tobe retained to assist with this task.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>If you have any questions please enquire through our office in Split.</p>', '', '1409_Land-plot_0.jpg', '1409_Land-plot_1.jpg', '1409_Land-plot_2.jpg', '1409_Land-plot_3.jpg', '1409_Land-plot_4.jpg', '', '', '', ''),
(1411, '', 'Medak', '', '091/219 1001', '', 'Split', 'Petrova 36 Split', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '200', '0', '50', 2, '120000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 1, 1, 'October 12, 2015', '<p>Lijepo ureðen apartman, smje&scaron;ten na 3. katu kuæe u samom centru grada, na iznimnoj lokaciji.&nbsp;Nedavno je obnovljen.&nbsp;Sastoji se od dnevnog boravka s blagovaonicom, potpuno opremljene kuhinje, kupaonice i spavaæe sobe, ukupne stambene povr&scaron;ine 50 m2.&nbsp;Spavaæa soba ima braèni krevet ili po potrebi dva odvojena.&nbsp;Sa svih prozora se pru¾a prekrasan pogled na centar grada.</p>', '<p>Apartment is a really pleasant and pretty, situated in the center of town, in a great location.&nbsp;It has been recently renovated and this has been done with lots of taste.&nbsp;Set on a third floor, this 50 m2 apartment offers a cosy living room with dining area, a totally equipped kitchen and a marble bathroom with a bath.&nbsp;The main bedroom has a double bed or twin if needed.&nbsp;All windows offer an amazing view on the city center.</p>', '', '<p>Lijepo ureðen apartman, smje&scaron;ten na 3. katu kuæe u samom centru grada, na iznimnoj lokaciji.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nedavno je obnovljen.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sastoji se od dnevnog boravka s blagovaonicom, potpuno opremljene kuhinje, kupaonice i spavaæe sobe, ukupne stambene povr&scaron;ine 50 m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Spavaæa soba ima braèni krevet ili po potrebi dva odvojena.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sa svih prozora se pru¾a prekrasan pogled na centar grada.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartman se nalazi u blizini stare Dioklecijanove palaèe i popularne pla¾e Baèvice, koja je udaljena od apartmana samo 3 minute hoda.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za dodatne informacije molimo kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured u Splitu.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>Apartment is a really pleasant and pretty, situated in the center of town, in a great location.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It has been recently renovated and this has been done with lots of taste.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Set on a third floor, this 50 m2 apartment offers a cosy living room with dining area, a totally equipped kitchen and a marble bathroom with a bath.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The main bedroom has a double bed or twin if needed.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>All windows offer an amazing view on the city center.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The location itself is reachable on foot for less than 5 minutes from all the means of transportation which can get you to Split (airport bus terminal, bus main station, train main station, city ferry port).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The apartment is with it''s location close to the old Diocletian''s Palace and Split''s most popular beach Bacvice, which with dozens of night clubs in the night hours becomes the biggest clubbing point in town all this is located less than 3 minutes on foot from the apartment.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For further information please contact our office in Split.&nbsp;</p>', '', '1411_Apartment_0.jpg', '1411_Apartment_1.JPG', '1411_Apartment_2.JPG', '1411_Apartment_3.JPG', '1411_Apartment_4.jpg', '1411_Apartment_5.jpg', '1411_Apartment_6.jpg', '1411_Apartment_7.jpg', '1411_Apartment_8.jpg'),
(1412, 'Mario ', 'Radiæ', '', '', 'ma-li@hotmail.no', 'Sibenik', 'Krapanjska  ©ibeni - ®aboriæ', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '0', '400', '290', 1, '589000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 6, 3, 'October 15, 2015', '<p>Obiteljska kuæa s lijepim pogledom na more u centru turistièkog mjesta.&nbsp;Povr&scaron;ina kuæe je 290 m2, a nalazi se na parceli povr&scaron;ine 400 m2.&nbsp;Iako je kuæa trenutno koncipirana kao obiteljska kuæa lako se mo¾e prenamijeniti u tri zasebna apartmana.&nbsp;Prilaz kuæi je asfaltiranom cestom, a u sklopu parcele nalaze se tri natkrivena parking mjesta.</p>', '<p>We are offering this spacious family house with a beautiful view of the sea in a small but popular tourist village near Sibenik.&nbsp;The house floor area is 290 m2 and is it located on a plot of 400 m2. Although the house is currently designed and used as a large family house, it can easily be converted into three separate apartments. Access to the back of the house is on a paved road, and as part of the plot there are three covered parking spaces.</p>', '', '<p>Obiteljska kuæa s lijepim pogledom na more u centru turistièkog mjesta.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Povr&scaron;ina kuæe je 290 m2, a nalazi se na parceli povr&scaron;ine 400 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa ima dnevni boravak, kuhinju, blagovaonicu, 6 spavaæih soba i tri kupaonice.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Iako je kuæa trenutno koncipirana kao obiteljska kuæa lako se mo¾e prenamijeniti u tri zasebna apartmana.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Okuænica je lijepo ureðena mediteranskim biljem (drvo limuna, naranèe, mandarine...).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je u potpunosti opremljena uz prisutnu klimatizaciju, centralno grijanje te solarno grijanje vode u kupaonicama.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa ima svu potrebnu infrastrukturu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Prilaz kuæi je asfaltiranom cestom, a u sklopu parcele nalaze se tri natkrivena parking mjesta.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Uz nekretninu idu i 2 veza za brod u moru, te jedan na kopnu.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Udaljenost od trgovina, restorana, kafiæa je svega par stotina metara.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Aerodrom je udaljen 50 km.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za dodatne informacije molimo kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured u Splitu.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>We are offering this spacious family house with a beautiful view of the sea in a small but popular tourist village near Sibenik.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house floor area is 290 m2 and is it located on a plot of 400 m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house has a living room, kitchen, dining room, 6 bedrooms and three bathrooms.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Although the house is currently designed and used as a large family house, it can easily be converted into three separate apartments.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There is a wide first floor balcony that allows alfresco meals while watching the boats crossing the bay in front of the property, and a gate from the front leads straight down to the seashore.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property is well decorated and has been well looked after.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The garden and courtyard is beautifully landscaped and planted with Mediterranean herbs and fruit trees, including lemon tree, oranges, tangerines.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house is fully equipped with modern air conditioning, central heating and solar water heating in the bathrooms, and is attached to the maindrains.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Access to the back of the house is on a paved road, and as part of the plot there are three covered parking spaces.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property comes with 2 boat moorings, and 1 dry dock.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is conveniently close to shops, restaurants, and cafes which are located around the old harbour, which is just a few hundred meters away.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The airport is 50 km away.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>This property is good value.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For further information, please contact our office in Split and we can arrange a tour of the property.</p>', '', '1412_House-Villa_0.jpg', '1412_House-Villa_1.jpg', '1412_House-Villa_2.jpg', '1412_House-Villa_3.jpg', '1412_House-Villa_4.jpg', '1412_House-Villa_5.jpg', '1412_House-Villa_6.jpg', '1412_House-Villa_7.jpg', '1412_House-Villa_8.jpg'),
(1413, 'Mario', 'Radiæ', '', '0996706177', '', 'Sibenik', 'Zlarinska 12  ®aboriæ', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '5', '466', '160', 1, '990000', '', 2, 2, 2, 1, 1, 2, 3, 2, 'October 15, 2015', '<p>Kvalitetno izgraðena i u potpunosti ureðena vila na svega par metara udaljenosti od lijepe &scaron;ljunèane pla¾e. Prekrasan pogled na more pru¾e se s terase kao i iz dnevnog boravka kuæe. Stambeni dio kuæe iznosi 160 m2, s gara¾om i dvije ostave ukupna povr&scaron;ina kuæe je 212 m2. Povr&scaron;ina parcele iznosi 466 m2.&nbsp;Okuænica je lijepo ureðena mediteranskim biljem. U sklopu parcele osigurano je parking mjesto, a kuæa ima i gara¾u.</p>', '<p>We are offering this well built and fully furnished villa, in the first line of property, just a few meters from the shore.&nbsp;It has striking views across the sea from every room on the front of the house and especially from the spacious terrace.&nbsp;The residential part of the house is 160 m2, but with the garage and two storage rooms the total area is 212 m2.&nbsp;Plot area is 466 m2.&nbsp;</p>', '', '<p>Kvalitetno izgraðena i u potpunosti ureðena vila na svega par metara udaljenosti od lijepe &scaron;ljunèane pla¾e.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Prekrasan pogled na more pru¾e se s terase kao i iz dnevnog boravka kuæe.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Stambeni dio kuæe iznosi 160 m2, s gara¾om i dvije ostave ukupna povr&scaron;ina kuæe je 212 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Povr&scaron;ina parcele iznosi 466 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa se sastoji od tri spavaæe sobe, dvije kupaonice, radnog prostora, kuhinje i prostranog dnevnog prostora.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Centralno grijanje, podno grijanje u kupaonicama, automatska gara¾na vrata i vrata kapije, klimatizacija kuæe, automatsko navodnjavanje u vrtu su samo neke od pogodnosti koje èine ovu nekretninu izuzetno zanimljivom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Okuænica je lijepo ureðena mediteranskim biljem.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U sklopu parcele osigurano je parking mjesto, a kuæa ima i gara¾u.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sva potrebna infrastruktura je prisutna (struja, kanalizacija, gradska voda).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nekretnini pripada i vez za brod.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je smje&scaron;tena u lijepom dalmatinskom mjestu sa svim potrebnim sadr¾ajima (duæan, kafiæ, restoran) u blizini.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Aerodrom je udaljen cca 50 km.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za sve dodatne informacije molimo kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured u Splitu.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>We are offering this well built and fully furnished villa, in the first line of property, just a few meters from the shore.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It has striking views across the sea from every room on the front of the house and especially from the spacious terrace.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The residential part of the house is 160 m2, but with the garage and two storage rooms the total area is 212 m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Plot area is 466 m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house consists of three bedrooms, two bathrooms, offices, kitchen and spacious open plan family living space.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is well decorated and has been maintained to a high standard.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property has many modern conveniences such as central heating, underfloor heating in bathrooms, automatic garage doors and gates, home air conditioning, automatic irrigation in the garden.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The courtyard has been landscaped and planted with Mediterranean plants.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There is secure parking on the plot in addition to the integral garage.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>All necessary infrastructure is present (electricity, sewage, city water).&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property comes with boat mooring.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house is situated in a beautiful Dalmatian village with useful facilities such as shops, cafes, restaurants, bars etc within a convenient walking distance nearby.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The airport is located approximately 50 km.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For further information please contact our office in Split and we will arrange a tour of the property.</p>', '', '1413_House-Villa_0.jpg', '1413_House-Villa_1.jpg', '1413_House-Villa_2.jpg', '1413_House-Villa_3.jpg', '1413_House-Villa_4.jpg', '1413_House-Villa_5.jpg', '1413_House-Villa_6.jpg', '1413_House-Villa_7.jpg', ''),
(1414, 'Marijan', 'Bralo', 'Katarina Kalebiæ 021 261 600', 'David Zeko 091 510 7353', 'ordinacija@salonadental.com', 'Brac', 'Osibova, 1239/60 k.o. milna', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '75', '470', '280', 1, '250000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 1, 0, 0, 'October 15, 2015', '<p>Prodajemo ovu kuæu u izgradnji na odliènoj lokaciji sa ju¾ne strane otoka Braèa. Sastoji se od tri eta¾e, a koncipirana je kao obiteljska kuæa / kuæa za odmor.&nbsp;Ukupna stambena povr&scaron;ina iznosi 280 m2, dok je povr&scaron;ina zemlji&scaron;ta 470 m2.&nbsp;Cijena se odnosi na kupnju u postojeæem stanju (roh bau). Iz objekta se pru¾a lijepi pogled na more, a na parceli je formiran i bazen povr&scaron;ine 24 m2.&nbsp;<br /><br /></p>', '<p>We are preseting this family / leisure home for sale, in splendid location on a south side of Brac island. The property comprises of 3 floors and the price refers to current condition (raw works completed).&nbsp;Total living area of the house is 280 sqm, while the land plot measures 470 sqm.&nbsp;The property features lovely sea views and swimming pool. It is located only few steps away from the sea. &nbsp;</p>', '', '<p>Kuæa u izgradnji na odliènoj lokaciji.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Prodajemo ovu kuæu u izgradnji na odliènoj lokaciji sa ju¾ne strane otoka Braèa.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sastoji se od tri eta¾e, a koncipirana je kao obiteljska kuæa / kuæa za odmor.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ukupna stambena povr&scaron;ina iznosi 280 m2, dok je povr&scaron;ina zemlji&scaron;ta 470 m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Cijena se odnosi na kupnju u postojeæem stanju (roh bau).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Iz objekta se pru¾a lijepi pogled na more, a na parceli je formiran i bazen povr&scaron;ine 24 m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je udaljena od mora samo 75 m.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Molimo za dodatne informacije kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured u Splitu.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>House in construction in splendid location.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>We are preseting this family / leisure home for sale, in splendid location on a south side of Brac island.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property comprises of 3 floors and the price refers to current condition (raw works completed).&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Total living area of the house is 280 sqm, while the land plot measures 470 sqm.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property features lovely sea views and swimming pool.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is located only few steps away from the sea. &nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For further information please contact our office in Split.&nbsp;</p>', '', '1414_House-Villa_0.jpg', '1414_House-Villa_1.jpg', '1414_House-Villa_2.jpg', '1414_House-Villa_3.jpg', '1414_House-Villa_4.jpg', '1414_House-Villa_5.jpg', '', '', ''),
(1415, 'Cathy Buelens-F', 'Sunèana strana d.o.o', '+32 2 2697509', '', 'Cathy.Buelens@telenet.be, andy.buelens@t', 'Rogoznica', 'Rogoznica unutra¹njost, 17519/2,3,4, 17529 k.o. rogoznica', 'For sale', 'Land plot', '1200', '4025', '0', 1, '295000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 0, 0, 'October 19, 2015', '<p>Croatia Property Sales predstavlja projekt za gradnju velike obiteljske kuæe na zemlji&scaron;tu povr&scaron;ine 4.025 m2, od èega se 1.296 m2 nalazi u graðevnoj zoni. Ishodovana je graðevinska dozvola, plaæeni doprinosi te prijavljen poèetak radova.&nbsp;Kuæa je konceptualno osmi&scaron;ljena na tri eta¾e &ndash; podrumsku (gara¾a, pomoæne prostorije) te prizemlje i prvi kat (za stanovanje), sa okuænicom, parkirali&scaron;tem i bazenom.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>Croatia Property Sales is presenting this large plot of land, sized 4.025 sqm, out of which 1.296 sq.m is in the building zone, with building permit already obtained, communal contributions paid and land works commenced.&nbsp;The villa to be is conceptually designed on 3 floors &ndash; basement (garage and utility rooms), ground floor and first floor (living areas) with parking place, garden and swimming pool.&nbsp;</p>', '', '<p><strong>Projekt za prostranu obiteljsku kuæu</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Croatia Property Sales predstavlja projekt za gradnju velike obiteljske kuæe na zemlji&scaron;tu povr&scaron;ine 4.025 m2, od èega se 1.296 m2 nalazi u graðevnoj zoni.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ishodovana je graðevinska dozvola, plaæeni doprinosi te prijavljen poèetak radova.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nekretnina se nalazi ca. 1,2 km zraène udaljenosti od mora, a cestovna udaljenost je 3 km.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Otvoreni pogled na more zagarantiran je i u buduænosti, jer se zemlji&scaron;te nalazi na rubu graðevne zone.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je konceptualno osmi&scaron;ljena na tri eta¾e &ndash; podrumsku (gara¾a, pomoæne prostorije) te prizemlje i prvi kat (za stanovanje), sa okuænicom, parkirali&scaron;tem i bazenom.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Prodaju se udjeli u tvrtki koja ima vlasni&scaron;tvo nad nekretninom, skupa sa projektnom dokumentacijom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Cijena je fiksna.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za vi&scaron;e informacija molimo nazovite na&scaron; ured.&nbsp;</p>', '<p><strong>A project for spacious family villa</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Croatia Property Sales is presenting this large plot of land, sized 4.025 sqm, out of which 1.296 sq.m is in the building zone, with building permit already obtained, communal contributions paid and land works commenced.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property is located approx. 1,2 km areal distance to the sea and only 3 km away by road to Rogoznica.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>If features great open sea views.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Located on the edge of the building zone, the site ensures splendid views in the future.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The villa to be is conceptually designed on 3 floors &ndash; basement (garage and utility rooms), ground floor and first floor (living areas) with parking place, garden and swimming pool.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>A company is owning the land and project and the owner is selling shares of the company, meaning that the buyer would not pay property transfer tax.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The price is fixed.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact our office for more information.</p>', '', '1415_Land-plot_0.jpg', '1415_Land-plot_1.jpg', '1415_Land-plot_2.jpg', '1415_Land-plot_3.jpg', '1415_Land-plot_4.jpg', '1415_Land-plot_5.jpg', '1415_Land-plot_6.jpg', '1415_Land-plot_7.jpg', '1415_Land-plot_8.jpg'),
(1416, '', 'Drpic', '', '095 557 0816', '', 'Brac', 'Splitska, k.c. 4/4 k.o. splitska', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '10', '600', '260', 1, '800000', '', 2, 2, 2, 1, 1, 2, 6, 5, 'October 19, 2015', '<p>Ova samostojeæa kuæa nalazi se u centru malog mjesta sa sjeverne strane otoka Braèa, u prvom redu do mora i &scaron;etnice. Okuænica je lijepo ureðena i odr¾avana, sa parkirali&scaron;nim mjestom, vanjskom terasom i ro&scaron;tiljem.&nbsp;Ukupna stambena povr&scaron;ina iznosi 260 m2, dok zemlji&scaron;te ima povr&scaron;inu 600 m2.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>A detached house for sale, well positioned in the first line to the sea and walkway, in a small village on the northern side of the island. Garden is well kept and features parking place, BBQ and terrace.&nbsp;Total living area of the house is 260 sqm, while the land plot measures 600 sqm.&nbsp;</p>', '', '<p><strong>Lijepa kuæa u prvom redu do mora</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ova samostojeæa kuæa nalazi se u centru malog mjesta sa sjeverne strane otoka Braèa, u prvom redu do mora i &scaron;etnice.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Okuænica je lijepo ureðena i odr¾avana, sa parkirali&scaron;nim mjestom, vanjskom terasom i ro&scaron;tiljem.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U prizemlju kuæe nalazi se prostrani dnevni boravak spojen s blagovaonicom i kuhinjom, hodnik, spavaæa soba i kupaonica, dok je na katu kuæe smje&scaron;teno pet spavaæih soba, od kojih je jedna jednokrevetna, a èetiri su dvokrevetne i imaju vlastitu kupaonicu.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ukupna stambena povr&scaron;ina iznosi 260 m2, dok zemlji&scaron;te ima povr&scaron;inu 600 m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za vi&scaron;e informacija molimo kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured u Splitu.</p>', '<p><strong>Lovey detached seafront house</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>A detached house for sale, well positioned in the first line to the sea and walkway, in a small village on the northern side of the island.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Garden is well kept and features parking place, BBQ and terrace.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ground floor contains spatious open-plan living room, kitchen and dining room, hallway, bedroom and bathroom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the first floor there are five bedrooms, one of which is a single room, while four others are double rooms with their own bathrooms.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Total living area of the house is 260 sqm, while the land plot measures 600 sqm.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact our office in Split for more details. &nbsp;</p>', '', '1416_House-Villa_0.jpg', '1416_House-Villa_1.jpg', '1416_House-Villa_2.jpg', '1416_House-Villa_3.jpg', '1416_House-Villa_4.jpg', '1416_House-Villa_5.jpg', '1416_House-Villa_6.jpg', '1416_House-Villa_7.jpg', '1416_House-Villa_8.jpg'),
(1417, 'Mirko', 'Paviæ', '021 220 628     ', '092 322 5938', '', 'Kastela', 'Kumbatova 28 Ka¹tel Kambelovac, 100/1 zgr', 'For sale', 'Old stone house', '100', '43', '130', 1, '208000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 3, 1, 'October 19, 2015', '<p>Stara kamena kuæa u jednom od sedam prekrasnih Ka&scaron;tela u blizini prekrasne &scaron;ljunèane pla¾e.&nbsp;Nalazi se u centru mjesta u blizini svih potrebnih sadr¾aja i autobusne linije koja povezuje gradove Split i Trogir. Do meðunarodnog aerodroma je potrebno 20 min. vo¾nje.&nbsp;Kuæa se sastoji od prizemlja, 1.i 2. kata (potkrovlja). Sve 3 eta¾e su povezane unutarnjim stepenicama. Ukupna stambena povr&scaron;ina iznosi 130 m2.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>We are offering this traditional Dalmatian old stone house in one of the seven beautiful villages by the beautiful pebble beach along the shore of Kastella.&nbsp;It is located in the old town centre, conveniently close to all necessary facilities - shops, cafes, bars and restaurants etc. and a bus line connecting the cities of Split and Trogir. To the international airport it takes 20 min. driving. The house consists of ground floor, 1st and 2nd floor (top).&nbsp;All three floors are connected by internal stairs.&nbsp;Total area is 130 m2.</p>', '', '<p>Stara kamena kuæa u jednom od sedam prekrasnih Ka&scaron;tela u blizini prekrasne &scaron;ljunèane pla¾e.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nalazi se u centru mjesta u blizini svih potrebnih sadr¾aja i autobusne linije koja povezuje gradove Split i Trogir.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Do meðunarodnog aerodroma je potrebno 20 min. vo¾nje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa se sastoji od prizemlja, 1.i 2. kata (potkrovlja).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sve 3 eta¾e su povezane unutarnjim stepenicama.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ukupna stambena povr&scaron;ina iznosi 130 m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Orijentacija kuæe sjeverozapadna, dok je terasa na istoènoj strani kuæe.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Potpuno je renovirana prije 10 godina, a dio (dnevni dio, kuhinja i kupaonica) prije 5 godina.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U prizemlju se nalaze hodnik, kupaonica, kuhinja i blagovaonica.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na 1. i 2. katu se nalazi po jedna prostrana soba.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je potpuno namje&scaron;tena, klimatizirana i spremna za useljenje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Najbli¾i parking je udaljen cca. 50 m od kuæe.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kontaktirajte nas ukoliko ste zainteresirani za kupnju stare kamene kuæe predivnog Dalmatinskog ugoðaja.</p>', '<p>We are offering this traditional Dalmatian old stone house in one of the seven beautiful villages by the beautiful pebble beach along the shore of Kastella.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is located in the old town centre, conveniently close to all necessaryfacilities - shops, cafes, bars and restaurants etc. and a bus line connecting the cities of Split and Trogir.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>To the international airport it takes 20 min. driving.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house consists of ground floor, 1st and 2nd floor (top).&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>All three floors are connected by internal stairs.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Total area is 130 m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The orientation is north-west, and there is a terrace on the east side of the house.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It was completely renovated and modernised 10 years ago, and has been well maintained and looked after since then by only one owner.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The ground floor has a hallway, bathroom, kitchen and dining room, designed ''open plan''.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the 1st and 2nd floor there is one spacious room each floor.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house is fully furnished, air-conditioned and ready to move into immediatly.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The nearest parking is located approx. 50 m from the house.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact the office in Split to arrange to visit this great old house with a special atmosphere.</p>', '', '1417_Old-stone-house_0.jpg', '1417_Old-stone-house_1.jpg', '1417_Old-stone-house_2.jpg', '1417_Old-stone-house_3.jpg', '1417_Old-stone-house_4.jpg', '1417_Old-stone-house_5.jpg', '1417_Old-stone-house_6.jpg', '1417_Old-stone-house_7.jpg', '1417_Old-stone-house_8.jpg'),
(1418, 'Zora', 'Su¹ac', '021389407', '0912067122', 'Poliklinika.susac@email.t-com.hr', 'Trogir', 'Obala Mira Bare¹iæa 34 Seget Vranjica, Zemlji¹nik &#8211; 201/16, z.u. 2403  katastar &#8211; 465/2', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '5', '351', '250', 1, '1100000', '', 2, 2, 2, 1, 1, 2, 7, 3, 'October 19, 2015', '<p>Luksuzna nekretnina u 1.redu do mora i ureðene prirodno kamenite pla¾e. Izgraðena je 2006. godine i u potpunosti je luksuzno namje&scaron;tena, stoga nije potrebno nikakvo dodatno ulaganje. Posebnost kuæe, osim &scaron;to je udaljena svega nekoliko metara od mora, je ta &scaron;to ima i privatni vez za brod ispred same kuæe.&nbsp;Sastoji se od prizemlja, 1.kata i 2.kata sa ukupnom povr&scaron;inom 250 m2. Ukupno zemlji&scaron;te iznosi 351 m2.<br /><br /></p>', '<p>We are pleased to offer this rare opportunity to buy one of the best located private villas on the sought after location near Trogir. This is a luxury property, in the first row, just a few feet from the water and one of the few to have a private boat mooring in front. The airport is just 10 minutes&rsquo; drive from the property. The house was built in 2006 to a high specification, and it consists of a ground, first and second floor with a total area of 250m sq. The total size of the land plot is 351m sq.</p>', '', '<p>Luksuzna nekretnina u 1.redu do mora i ureðene prirodno kamenite pla¾e.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Izgraðena je 2006. godine i u potpunosti je luksuzno namje&scaron;tena, stoga nije potrebno nikakvo dodatno ulaganje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Posebnost kuæe, osim &scaron;to je udaljena svega nekoliko metara od mora, je ta &scaron;to ima i privatni vez za brod ispred same kuæe.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nalazi se u mirnom turistièkom mjestu udaljenom cca. 5 km od Trogira gdje se takoðer nalazi i meðunarodni aerodrom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sastoji se od prizemlja, 1.kata i 2.kata sa ukupnom povr&scaron;inom 250 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ukupno zemlji&scaron;te iznosi 351 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sa 7 spavaæih soba, 3 kupaonice, 3 terase te ostalim prostorijama dovoljno je prostrana za odmor iz snova, ali je zbog polo¾aja i velièine idealna i za turistièki najam.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Orijentacija je sjeverozapadna sa dovoljno sunca tijekom cijelog dana.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ispred kuæe se nalazi parking za 3-4 automobila.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Vrt je ureðen i kultiviran sa kaminom i tu&scaron;om, dok ima mjesta i za izgradnju manjeg bazena.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Centar mjesta sa potrebnim sadr¾ajima udaljen je nekoliko minuta pje&scaron;ke.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ukoliko ¾elite vi&scaron;e fotografija i informacija za ovu iznimnu i rijetku nekretninu slobodno nas kontaktirajte.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><span style="color: #ff0000;">***NA ZAHTJEV &Scaron;ALJEMO DODATNE FOTOGRAFIJE</span></p>', '<p>We are pleased to offer this rare opportunity to buy one of the best located private villas on the sought after location near Trogir.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>This is a luxury property, in the first row, just a few feet from the water and one of the few to have a private boat mooring in front.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is located in a quiet and sought after part of a popular tourist village, 5k from the major cultural and historic centre, Trogir, the major town along this part of the coast.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The airport is just 10 minutes&rsquo; drive from the property.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house was built in 2006 to a high specification, and it consists of a ground, first and second floor with a total area of 250m sq.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The total size of the land plot is 351m sq.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>With 7 bedrooms, 3 bathrooms, 3 terraces and other rooms it is spacious enough for large family holidays and unlike many larger front houses it is not sub divided into smaller apartments.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The interior is maintained to a high standard and it is well decorated.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The orientation is north-west with plenty of sunshine throughout the day.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house has private parking for 3-4 cars.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The mature garden has been well landscaped and is an attractive feature, and it includes a bbq/fireplace and shower, and there is enough space to build a small pool.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The village centre with shops, cafes and coffee bars can be reached with a short stroll along the shore, on foot.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Split is 30 mins driving.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>International airport and seaplane connection is 15 mins driving.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>If you want more photos and drone film for this property, please contact one of our agents in Split.</p>', '', '1418_House-Villa_0.JPG', '1418_House-Villa_1.JPG', '1418_House-Villa_2.JPG', '1418_House-Villa_3.jpg', '1418_House-Villa_4.jpg', '1418_House-Villa_5.jpg', '1418_House-Villa_6.jpg', '1418_House-Villa_7.jpg', ''),
(1419, 'Lenka', 'Modriniæ', '091 883 7516', '', '', 'Korcula', 'Korèula stari grad', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '50', '0', '0', 1, '115000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 1, 1, 'October 26, 2015', '<p>Apartmani s prekrasnim pogledom na more, smje&scaron;tena u samom centru grada, koji je pod za&scaron;titom kulturne ba&scaron;tine. Kuæa je udaljena od mora samo 50 metara. Kuæa se sastoji od prizemlja koje je moguæe preurediti u poslovni prostor, dva kata i visokog potkrovlja. Sveukupno se u kuæi nalaze 4 studio apartmana, jedna dvokrevetna soba i pet kupaonica ukupne stambene povr&scaron;ine 150 m2. Apartmani su moderno ureðeni i potpuno opremljeni. U prizemlju se nalazi kameni &scaron;ank, a u potkrovlju kamin.</p>', '<p>We are offering this apartments with a beautiful views of the sea, located in Korcula town centre, the area under the protection of UNESCO cultural heritage. The house is 50 metres from the sea. The house inside consists of a ground floor that has the option of being converted into office space, two floors and the top floor. Overall, in the house are 4 studio apartments, and a one bedroom apartment. There are five bathrooms with a total floor area of 150 m2. The apartments are modern, well decorated, and fully equipped.</p>', '', '<p>Apartmani s prekrasnim pogledom na more, smje&scaron;tena u samom centru grada, koji je pod za&scaron;titom kulturne ba&scaron;tine.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je udaljena od mora samo 50 metara.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Prodaje se:</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>- apartman u prizemlju stambene povr&scaron;ine 30 m2, s kamenim &scaron;ankom, s pogledom na more, &euro;115.000, apartman ima zaseban ulaz</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>- apartmani na prvom (studio plavi apartman i dvokrevetna soba s kupaonicom), drugom (¾uti apartman) i treæem katu (potkrovlju) ukupne stambene povr&scaron;ine 120 m2, &euro;320.000.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartmani su moderno ureðeni i potpuno opremljeni.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U prizemlju se nalazi kameni &scaron;ank, a u potkrovlju kamin.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Krov je betonski, a na njemu su polo¾eni prozori s kojih se pru¾a pogled na more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa ima pristup vozilom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sva infrastruktura prisutna (struja plus solarno grijanje).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Vlasni&scaron;tvo uredno.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je kompletno renovirana u studio apartmane modernog interijera.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Vlasnici se bave biznom iznajmljivanja, kojeg je moguæe nastaviti buduæi da je kuæa kategorizirana s 3 zvjezdice.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Meðunarodni aerodrom u Dubrovniku je udaljen 150 km.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Grad Korèula smje&scaron;ten je na istoènom dijelu otoka Korèule.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Obiluje prekrasnim pla¾ama te znamenitostima.</p>', '<p>We are offering this apartment house with a beautiful views of the sea, located in Korcula town centre, the area under the protection of UNESCO cultural heritage.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house is 50 metres from the sea.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house inside consists of a ground floor that has the option of being converted into office space, two floors and the top floor.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For sale:</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>- apartment on the ground floor, 30 sqm, &euro;115.000, separated entrance, sea view</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>- apartment on 1st floor (studio and double room apartment), 2nd floor (1 apartment) and 3rd floor (attic), total living area of 120 sqm, &euro;320.000.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The apartments are modern, well decorated, and fully equipped.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The roof has windows built into and from here are it are great views of the sea.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house has access for a vehicle.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>All the infrastructure is present (electricity plus solar heating, drains etc).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house was completely renovated into studio apartments with modern interiors.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The current owners are engaged in rentals, which may be continued and the house has been categorized with 3 stars.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The international airport in Dubrovnik is 150 km.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The town of Korcula is situated on the eastern part of the island.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It abounds in beautiful beaches and sights, and is the cultural centre of the area, with restaurants, bars, and many shops.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact one of our agents to arrange to visit this property.</p>', '', '1419_Apartment_0.JPG', '1419_Apartment_1.JPG', '1419_Apartment_2.JPG', '1419_Apartment_3.JPG', '1419_Apartment_4.JPG', '1419_Apartment_5.JPG', '1419_Apartment_6.JPG', '1419_Apartment_7.JPG', '1419_Apartment_8.JPG');
INSERT INTO `nekretnina` (`id`, `ime`, `prezime`, `telefon`, `mobitel`, `e_mail`, `lokacija_id`, `adresa`, `status_id`, `vrsta_id`, `udaljenost`, `povrsina`, `stambenapovrsina`, `display`, `cijena`, `cijenatocka`, `ponuda_tjedna`, `new_built`, `must_sell`, `prvi_red_do_mora`, `pogled_na_more`, `bazen`, `broj_soba`, `broj_kupatila`, `datum`, `title_hr`, `title_en`, `title_ge`, `opis_hr`, `opis_en`, `opis_ge`, `PropertyImageURL0`, `PropertyImageURL1`, `PropertyImageURL2`, `PropertyImageURL3`, `PropertyImageURL4`, `PropertyImageURL5`, `PropertyImageURL6`, `PropertyImageURL7`, `PropertyImageURL8`) VALUES
(1420, 'Werner ', 'Ruegemer', '0049 163 86 89 945', '', '', 'Hvar', ' Jurija skarpe 14  Stari grad', 'For sale', 'Old stone house', '100', '0', '120', 1, '110000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 3, 1, 'October 28, 2015', '<p>Stara kamena kuæa u samom centru grada.&nbsp;Udaljena je od mora 100 m.&nbsp;Sastoji se od tri eta¾e.&nbsp;U potkrovlju se nalaze unutarnja i vanjska terasa s koje se pru¾a predivan pogled na staru jezgru grada te brda bli¾ih sela.&nbsp;Ukupna stambena povr&scaron;ina iznosi 120 m2.&nbsp;Kuæa je useljiva.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;">CIJENA SNI®ENA SA 150.000 EUR!!</span></p>', '<p>We are pleased to offer this old stone house in the old town centre of Starigrad.&nbsp;It is situated 100m from the shore and the harbour where most of the shops,cafes, bars and restaurants are conveniently located. The building consists of three floors. The top floor has indoor and outdoor terrace with a beautiful view of&nbsp;&nbsp;the old town and the hills nearby villages. Total floor area is 120 m2.&nbsp;The house is habitable and has been well maintained, but some areas insidecould be redecorated.</p>\r\n<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;">PRICE REDUCED FROM 150.000 EUR!!</span></p>', '', '<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;"><strong>CIJENA SNI®ENA SA 150.000 EUR!!</strong></span></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Stara kamena kuæa u samom centru grada.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Udaljena je od mora 100 m.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sastoji se od tri eta¾e.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U prizemlju se nalaze kuhinja s blagovaonicom, WC/ tu&scaron; i ostava.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na prvom katu su dvije spavaæe sobe, a u hodniku ostava.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Drvene stepenice vode do drugog kata na kojem se nalazi jedna velika spavaæa soba.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U potkrovlju se nalaze unutarnja i vanjska terasa s koje se pru¾a predivan pogled na staru jezgru grada te brda bli¾ih sela.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ukupna stambena povr&scaron;ina iznosi 120 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je useljiva.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sva dokumentacija je uredna.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za dodatne informacije molimo kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured u Splitu.&nbsp;</p>', '<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;"><strong>PRICE REDUCED FROM 150.000 EUR!!</strong></span></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>We are pleased to offer this old stone house in the old town centre of Starigrad.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is situated 100m from the shore and the harbour where most of the shops,cafes, bars and restaurants are conveniently located.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The building consists of three floors.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The ground floor has a kitchen, dining room, WC / shower and storage room.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the first floor are two bedrooms, hallway and storage room.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>A wooden staircase leads to the second floor where there is a large bedroom.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The top floor has indoor and outdoor terrace with a beautiful view of&nbsp;&nbsp;the old town and the hills nearby villages.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Total floor area is 120 m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house is habitable and has been well maintained, but some areas insidecould be redecorated.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For further information, please contact our office in Split, and we can arrange visits to this property.</p>', '', '1420_Old-stone-house_0.jpg', '1420_Old-stone-house_1.jpg', '1420_Old-stone-house_2.jpg', '1420_Old-stone-house_3.jpg', '1420_Old-stone-house_4.jpg', '1420_Old-stone-house_5.jpg', '1420_Old-stone-house_6.jpg', '1420_Old-stone-house_7.jpg', '1420_Old-stone-house_8.jpg'),
(1421, 'Denis Alexander', '', '', '091 552 70 98', '', 'Hvar', 'Stari Grad', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '150', '380', '90', 1, '230000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 3, 1, 'October 28, 2015', '<p>Jednokatni bungalow u blizini mora s vrtom, terasama i gara¾om.&nbsp;Nalazi se u mirnom podruèju, samo 150 m od mora.&nbsp;Bungalow ima ukupnu stambenu povr&scaron;inu 90 m2.&nbsp;Povr&scaron;ina zemlji&scaron;ta iznosi 380 m2.&nbsp;Iza kuæe se nalazi vajnski WC, otvoreni tu&scaron;, terasa te zatvorena gara¾a.</p>', '<p>We have this single-story bungalow near the sea with garden, terraces and a garage. It is habitable but needs redecorating, with some modernisation required. It is located in a quiet area, only 150 m from the sea, and equally close to most of the shops, bars and cafes around the centre of this traditional old Dalmatian village. It has a total floor area of 90 m2.&nbsp;Land area is 380 m2.&nbsp;Behind the house is an outdoor toilet, outdoor shower, terrace and closed garage.&nbsp;</p>', '', '<p>Jednokatni bungalow u blizini mora s vrtom, terasama i gara¾om.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nalazi se u mirnom podruèju, samo 150 m od mora.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Bungalow se sastoji od predsoblja, tri sobe, kuhinje, blagaovaonice, dnevnog boravka te WC/tu&scaron;a ukupne stambene povr&scaron;ine 90 m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Povr&scaron;ina zemlji&scaron;ta iznosi 380 m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Iza kuæe se nalazi vajnski WC, otvoreni tu&scaron;, terasa te zatvorena gara¾a.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Udaljenost od centra grada nekoliko minuta &scaron;etnje, svi sadr¾aji u blizini (restorani, trgovine).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je useljiva, potrebna manja adaptacija.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za dodatne informacije molimo kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured u Splitu.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>We have this single-story bungalow near the sea with garden, terraces and a garage.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is habitable but needs redecorating, with some modernisation required.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The big attraction of this property is that it is near the centre of the village but sits on an unusually large land plot.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is located in a quiet area, only 150 m from the sea, and equally close to most of the shops, bars and cafes around the centre of this traditional old Dalmatian village.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The bungalow consists of hallway, three bedrooms, kitchen, dining&nbsp;&nbsp;room, living room and bathroom / shower and internally it has a total floor area of 90 m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Land area is 380 m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Behind the house is an outdoor toilet, outdoor shower, terrace and closed garage.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For further information, please contact our office in Split.</p>', '', '1421_House-Villa_0.jpg', '1421_House-Villa_1.jpg', '1421_House-Villa_2.jpg', '1421_House-Villa_3.jpg', '1421_House-Villa_4.jpg', '1421_House-Villa_5.jpg', '1421_House-Villa_6.jpg', '1421_House-Villa_7.jpg', '1421_House-Villa_8.jpg'),
(1422, 'Robert', 'Stokes', 'Vlado Gotovac 0993336663', '0044797121955', 'Stokes693@sky.com', 'Kastela', 'Senjskih uskoka 5  Ka¹tel ©tafiliæ, 2507, 2509, 2503, 2504', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '50', '0', '76', 1, '130000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 2, 2, 'October 28, 2015', '<p>Apartman u staroj kamenoj kuæi koja je udaljena svega 50 m od &scaron;ljunèane pla¾e. Nalazi se u prekrasnim Ka&scaron;telima koja su sve popularnija zbog blizine Trogira i Splita, ali i zbog meðunarodnog aerodroma koji je udaljen 10 min. vo¾nje.&nbsp;S terase se pru¾a djelomièan pogled na more.&nbsp;Apartmanu pripada i tavan visine cca. 1,5 m. Tavan ima izlaz na terasu velièine 10 m s koje se pru¾a prekrasan pogled na more.</p>', '<p>We are offering this apartment built into an old stone house, only 50 meters from the shore in Kastela. On the ground floor is a garage, which is approx. 20m sq but currently it is not accessible for parking. On the 1st floor there is a spacious terrace of 20 m. It is located facing the south so it is sunny all day.&nbsp;On the 2nd floor is an apartment which occupies 76 m2, and consists of a small terrace at the entrance. Apartment has an attic which is the height of approx. 1.5 m. which is currently just a storage area.</p>', '', '<p>Apartman u staroj kamenoj kuæi koja je udaljena svega 50 m od &scaron;ljunèane pla¾e.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nalazi se u prekrasnim Ka&scaron;telima koja su sve popularnija zbog blizine Trogira i Splita, ali i zbog blizine meðunarodnog aerodroma koji je udaljen 10 min. vo¾nje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U prizemlju je smje&scaron;tena gara¾a velièine cca. 20 m.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Potrebno ju je preurediti i pro&scaron;iriti ulaz, pa bi bilo moguæe parkirati vozilo.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na 1.katu se nalazi prostrana terasa povr&scaron;ine 20 m.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Smje&scaron;tena je na jugu, stoga je osunèana tijekom cijelog dana.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na 2.katu se nalazi apartman koji se prostire na 76 m2, a sastoji se od manje terase na ulazu, hodnika, 2 spavaæe sobe, 2 kupaonice, blagovaonice i odvojenog dnevnog boravka i kuhinje (dvije odvojene prostorije).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Dnevni boravak takoðer mo¾e biti treæa spavaæa soba.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>S terase se pru¾a djelomièan pogled na more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartmanu pripada i tavan visine cca. 1,5 m.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Tavan ima izlaz na terasu velièine 10 m2 s koje se pru¾a prekrasan pogled na more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U ureðenje tavana i terase je potrebno dodatno ulagati, dok je apartman renoviran prije 8 godina.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Potpuno je namje&scaron;ten i klimatiziran sa dva klimatizacijska ureðaja.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ostajemo na usluzi za sva dodatna pitanja.</p>', '<p>We are offering this apartment built into an old stone house, only 50 meters from the shore in Kastela.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the ground floor is a garage, which is approx. 20m sq but currently it is not accessible for parking.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is necessary to reorganize and expand the entrance area to clear the way so the and it would be possible to use for vehicles.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the 1st floor there is a spacious terrace of 20 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is located facing the south so it is sunny all day.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the 2nd floor is an apartment which occupies 76 m2, and consists of a small terrace at the entrance, a hall, 2 bedrooms, 2 bathrooms, dining room and a separate living room and kitchen (two separate rooms).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The living room can also be used as a third bedroom.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The terrace from here offers a partial sea view.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartment has an attic which is the height of approx. 1.5 m. which is currently just a storage area.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>From the attic there is access onto a terrace of 10 m2, which offers a beautiful view of the sea.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Some internal building and modernisation needs to take place for the property to fully meet its potential, but the living area was renovated 8 years ago.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is fully furnished and air conditioned with two air conditioning system.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The local area is one of the fast improving areas around Split, popular because it is so close to the main town, and also the airport, and it still retains the charm of a Dalmatian village.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There are shops, bars, local Konobas and cafes all within walking distance along the shore.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>We remain at your disposal for any additional questions and to arrange to visit the property.</p>', '', '1422_Apartment_0.JPG', '1422_Apartment_1.JPG', '1422_Apartment_2.JPG', '1422_Apartment_3.JPG', '1422_Apartment_4.JPG', '1422_Apartment_5.JPG', '1422_Apartment_6.JPG', '1422_Apartment_7.JPG', '1422_Apartment_8.JPG'),
(1423, '', 'Albedo, Emil ©o¹tari', '', '098 507 989', 'emil@albedonekretnine.hr ', 'Makarska', 'Makarska', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '50', '0', '163', 1, '99999999', '', 2, 1, 2, 1, 1, 2, 3, 3, 'October 28, 2015', '<p>Prodajemo apartman u centru Makarske, nedaleko od glavne gradske pla¾e. Nekretnina se sastoji od hodnika, 3 spavaæe sobe, 3 kupaonice, kuhinje sa blagovaonicom, dnevnog boravka te 2 terase sa pogledom na more. Ukupna stambena povr&scaron;ina apartmana iznosi 163 m2. Kvalitetni materijali ugraðeni u stan (hrastov parket, keramika A klase, aluminijske &scaron;kure, sigurnosna vrata, masa¾na kada itd). Pakirali&scaron;te ispred zgrade. Gara¾no mjesto je moguæe dodatno kupiti.</p>', '<p>Newly built seafront apartment on the first floor next to the central beach in Makarska.&nbsp;Total living area of the apartment is 163 sqm. Top building materials (oak hardwood floors, aluminum shutters, safety doors, a/c in every room, top ceramics, massage shower/tub, lift in the building, stone facade). Parking in front of the building. Garage space in the basement can be bough at extra cost.</p>', '', '<p><strong>Novogradnja u centru Makarske</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Prodajemo apartman u centru Makarske, nedaleko od glavne gradske pla¾e.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nekretnina se sastoji od hodnika, 3 spavaæe sobe, 3 kupaonice, kuhinje sa blagovaonicom, dnevnog boravka te 2 terase sa pogledom na more.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ukupna stambena povr&scaron;ina apartmana iznosi 163 m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kvalitetni materijali ugraðeni u stan (hrastov parket, keramika A klase, aluminijske &scaron;kure, sigurnosna vrata, masa¾na kada itd).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Pakirali&scaron;te ispred zgrade.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Gara¾no mjesto je moguæe dodatno kupiti.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za dodatne informacije molimo kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured u Splitu.&nbsp;</p>', '<p><strong>Newly built apartment in Makarska</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Newly built seafront apartment on the first floor next to the central beach in Makarska.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property consists of a hallway, 3 bedrooms, 3 bathrooms, kitchen and dining room, living room, storage and 2 terraces with sea views.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Total living area of the apartment is 163 sqm.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Top building materials (oak hardwood floors, aluminum shutters, safety doors, a/c in every room, top ceramics, massage shower/tub, lift in the building, stone facade).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Parking in front of the building.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Garage space in the basement can be bough at extra cost.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For further information please contact our office in Split.&nbsp;</p>', '', '1423_Apartment_0.jpg', '1423_Apartment_1.jpg', '1423_Apartment_2.jpg', '1423_Apartment_3.jpg', '1423_Apartment_4.jpg', '1423_Apartment_5.jpg', '1423_Apartment_6.jpg', '1423_Apartment_7.jpg', '1423_Apartment_8.jpg'),
(1424, '', 'Albedo, Emil ©o¹tari', '098 507 989', '', 'emil@albedonekretnine.hr ', 'Makarska', 'Brist', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '5', '300', '237', 1, '490000', '', 2, 2, 2, 1, 1, 2, 6, 3, 'October 28, 2015', '<p>Samostojeæa kuæa u prvom redu do mora na tri eta¾e. Svaki kat sastoji se od stana povr&scaron;ine 79 m2 sa vlastitim ulazom, a pokraj objekta nalazi se gara¾a povr&scaron;ine 40 m2. Kuæa je u cijelosti renovirana 2010. godine izvana (nova fasada, krov, zatvori i instalacije) te iznutra (osim stana na prvom katu). U dvori&scaron;tu se nalaze palme, a nekretnina je smje&scaron;tena pokraj &scaron;ljunèane pla¾e i ima izvrstan pogled na more.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>Detached seafront house on 3 floors.&nbsp;Each floor hosts a 79 sqm apartment with its own entrance, while the garage sized 40 sqm stands next to the house.&nbsp;The house was fully renovated in 2010 from the outside (new facade, roof, shutters, wiring/plumbing) and the inside (with the exception of apartment on the first floor). There are lovely palm trees in the garden. As the property is located next to a pebble beach, it features excellent open sea views.&nbsp;</p>', '', '<p>Samostojeæa kuæa u prvom redu do mora na tri eta¾e.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Svaki kat sastoji se od stana povr&scaron;ine 79 m2 sa vlastitim ulazom, a pokraj objekta nalazi se gara¾a povr&scaron;ine 40 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je u cijelosti renovirana 2010. godine izvana (nova fasada, krov, zatvori i instalacije) te iznutra (osim stana na prvom katu).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U dvori&scaron;tu se nalaze palme, a nekretnina je smje&scaron;tena pokraj &scaron;ljunèane pla¾e i ima izvrstan pogled na more.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za dodatne informacije molimo kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured u Splitu.&nbsp;</p>', '<p><strong>Detached seafront house on 3 floors</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Each floor hosts a 79 sqm apartment with its own entrance, while the garage sized 40 sqm stands next to the house.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house was fully renovated in 2010 from the outside (new facade, roof, shutters, wiring/plumbing) and the inside (with the exception of apartment on the first floor).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There are lovely palm trees in the garden.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>As the property is located next to a pebble beach, it features excellent open sea views.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For further information please contact our office in Split.&nbsp;</p>', '', '1424_House-Villa_0.jpg', '1424_House-Villa_1.jpg', '1424_House-Villa_2.jpg', '1424_House-Villa_3.jpg', '1424_House-Villa_4.jpg', '1424_House-Villa_5.jpg', '1424_House-Villa_6.jpg', '', ''),
(1425, '', 'Albedo, Emil ©o¹tari', '098 507 989', '', 'emil@albedonekretnine.hr ', 'Makarska', 'Dra¹nice', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '5', '200', '350', 1, '650000', '', 2, 2, 2, 1, 1, 2, 8, 7, 'October 28, 2015', '<p>Apartmanska kuæa na pet eta¾a u prvom redu do mora, izgraðena 2003. godine. U prizemlju objekta smje&scaron;tena je gara¾a. Na prvom katu nalazi se jednosobni stan sa terasom, vrtom i vanjskim ro&scaron;tiljem. Drugi i treæi kat imaju identiènu strukturu, a svaki se sastoji od dva jednosobna apartmana. Na zadnjem katu kuæe smje&scaron;ten je veliki trosobni stan sa dvije kupaonice i dva balkona.&nbsp;Ukupna stambena povr&scaron;ina kuæe je 350 m2, dok povr&scaron;ina zemlji&scaron;ta iznosi 200 m2.</p>', '<p>An apartment house on 5 floors, built in 2003. Ground floor contains the garage, while the first floor hosts 1-bedroom apartment with terrace, garden and BBQ area. Second and third floor have the same structure, each containing two 1-bedroom apartments. Top floor hosts large 3-bedroom 2-bathroom apartment with 2 balconies.&nbsp;Total living area of the house is 350 sqm, while the land plot measures 200 sqm.&nbsp;The property is south-oriented and features great sea views from all the floors.&nbsp;</p>', '', '<p>Apartmanska kuæa na pet eta¾a u prvom redu do mora, izgraðena 2003. godine.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U prizemlju objekta smje&scaron;tena je gara¾a.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na prvom katu nalazi se jednosobni stan sa terasom, vrtom i vanjskim ro&scaron;tiljem.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Drugi i treæi kat imaju identiènu strukturu, a svaki se sastoji od dva jednosobna apartmana.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na zadnjem katu kuæe smje&scaron;ten je veliki trosobni stan sa dvije kupaonice i dva balkona.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ukupna stambena povr&scaron;ina kuæe je 350 m2, dok povr&scaron;ina zemlji&scaron;ta iznosi 200 m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nekretnina je ju¾no orijentirana i ima izvrstan pogled na more sa svih katova.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za dodatne informacije molimo kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured u Splitu.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>An apartment house on 5 floors, built in 2003.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ground floor contains the garage, while the first floor hosts 1-bedroom apartment with terrace, garden and BBQ area.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Second and third floor have the same structure, each containing two 1-bedroom apartments.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Top floor hosts large 3-bedroom 2-bathroom apartment with 2 balconies.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Total living area of the house is 350 sqm, while the land plot measures 200 sqm.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property is south-oriented and features great sea views from all the floors.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For further information please contact our office in Split.&nbsp;</p>', '', '1425_House-Villa_0.jpg', '1425_House-Villa_1.jpg', '1425_House-Villa_2.jpg', '1425_House-Villa_3.jpg', '1425_House-Villa_4.jpg', '1425_House-Villa_5.jpg', '1425_House-Villa_6.jpg', '1425_House-Villa_7.jpg', '1425_House-Villa_8.jpg'),
(1426, '', 'Albedo, Emil ©o¹tari', '098 507 989', '', 'emil@albedonekretnine.hr ', 'Makarska', 'Podaca', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '10', '314', '183', 1, '360000', '', 2, 2, 2, 1, 1, 2, 6, 3, 'October 28, 2015', '<p>Dvojna kuæa u prvom redu do mora na vrlo mirnoj lokaciji, izvana renovirana 2011. godine (nova fasada, krov i PVC zatvori). Kuæa je djelomièno renovirana i iznutra, a u cijelosti je klimatizirana. Stepenice kroz vrt vode fo male &scaron;ljunèane pla¾e kojoj se mo¾e pristupiti samo preko nekretnine. Kuæa se sastoji od tri zasbna apartmana, a svaki od njih ima kuhinju, dnevni prostor, kupaonicu te dvije spavaæe sobe i terasu.&nbsp;Ukupna stambena povr&scaron;ina kuæe iznosi 183 m2.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>Semi-detached house on a very peaceful location, renovated from the outside in 2011 (new facade, roof and PCV windows). The house is partially renovated from the inside, fully furnished and air-conditioned. The garden is well kept, planted with lemon, kiwi, fig trees and olives. Steps through the garden lead onto a small pebble beach, accessible only from the property. The house consists of 3 separate apartments, one on each floor.&nbsp;Total living area of the house is 183 sqm.&nbsp;</p>', '', '<p>Dvojna kuæa u prvom redu do mora na vrlo mirnoj lokaciji, izvana renovirana 2011. godine (nova fasada, krov i PVC zatvori).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je djelomièno renovirana i iznutra, a u cijelosti je klimatizirana.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Vrt je lijepo odr¾avan i zasaðen mediteranskim voækama.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Stepenice kroz vrt vode fo male &scaron;ljunèane pla¾e kojoj se mo¾e pristupiti samo preko nekretnine.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa se sastoji od tri zasbna apartmana, a svaki od njih ima kuhinju, dnevni prostor, kupaonicu te dvije spavaæe sobe i terasu.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ukupna stambena povr&scaron;ina kuæe iznosi 183 m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Natkriveni parking za 3 automobila nalazi se sa stra¾nje strane kuæe.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za sve dodatne informacije molimo kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured u Splitu.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>Semi-detached house on a very peaceful location, renovated from the outside in 2011 (new facade, roof and PCV windows).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house is partially renovated from the inside, fully furnished and air-conditioned.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Tha garden is well kept, planted with lemon, kiwi, fig trees and olives.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Steps through the garden lead onto a small pebble beach, accessible only from the property.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house consists of 3 separate apartments, one on each floor.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Total living area of the house is 183 sqm.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Every apartment contains kitchen, living room, bathroom, 2 bedrooms and large terrace.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Covered parking place for 3 cars is located from behind the house.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For further information please contact our office in Split.&nbsp;</p>', '', '1426_House-Villa_0.jpg', '1426_House-Villa_1.jpg', '1426_House-Villa_2.jpg', '1426_House-Villa_3.jpg', '1426_House-Villa_4.jpg', '1426_House-Villa_5.jpg', '1426_House-Villa_6.jpg', '1426_House-Villa_7.jpg', '1426_House-Villa_8.jpg'),
(1427, 'Marko', 'Èulina', '', '098 9393330', '', 'Rogoznica', 'Sevid Rogoznica', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '70', '170', '45', 1, '140000', '', 2, 1, 2, 2, 1, 2, 1, 1, 'October 29, 2015', '<p>&Scaron;armantna, mala, novoizgraðena prizemna dvojna kuæa u malom dalmatinskom mjestu, istoène orijentacije.&nbsp;S obzirom da je kuæa smje&scaron;tena na blagoj uzvisini, nesmetan pogled na prekrasno kristalno more pru¾it æe Vam se s parcele, bilo da pogledate na istok ili na jug. Udaljenost lijepo ureðene prirodne pla¾e je 70 m.&nbsp;Kuæa je povr&scaron;ine 45 m2, a nalazi se na parceli povr&scaron;ine 170 m2.</p>', '<p>We offer this small, newly built detached house in a charming village near Rogoznica town, with east orientation. Since the house is located on a gentle hill, it has an unobstructed view of the sea bay from all directions. It is conveniently close to the shops, cafes and other services in the village and 70m from the safe and clear beach. The house is 45 m2 and is located on a plot of 170 m2.</p>', '', '<p>&Scaron;armantna, mala, novoizgraðena prizemna dvojna kuæa u malom dalmatinskom mjestu, istoène orijentacije.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>S obzirom da je kuæa smje&scaron;tena na blagoj uzvisini, nesmetan pogled na prekrasno kristalno more pru¾it æe Vam se s parcele, bilo da &nbsp;pogledate na istok ili na jug.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Udaljenost lijepo ureðene prirodne pla¾e je 70 m.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je povr&scaron;ine 45 m2, a nalazi se na parceli povr&scaron;ine 170 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa se sastoji od jedne spavaæe sobe, kupaonice i otvorenog dnevnog boravka povezanog s kuhinjom i blagovaonicom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ispred kuæe nalazi se poploèana terasa okru¾ena maslinama i drugim mediteranskim biljem.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>S obzirom da je kuæa ravnog krova ta povr&scaron;ina se mo¾e iskoristiti za postavljanje sjenice ili kao parking mjesto.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je novoureðena i prodaje se s namje&scaron;tajem.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Do kuæe vodi asfaltirana cesta.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na parceli je osigurano parking mjesto.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Udaljenost do trgovina, kafiæa i restorana je svega 250 m.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa ima svu potrebnu infrastrukturu: struja, septièka jama i voda (cisterna).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Aerodrom je udaljen 25 km.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za dodatne informacije molimo kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured u Splitu.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>We offer this small, newly built detached house in a charming village near Rogoznica town, with east orientation.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Since the house is located on a gentle hill, it has an unobstructed view of the sea bay from all directions.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is conveniently close to the shops, cafes and other services in the village and 70m from the safe and clear beach.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house is 45 m2 and is located on a plot of 170 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house consists of two bedrooms, a bathroom and an open plan design family area that includes a sitting room and kitchen with dining area.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property has a paved terrace surrounded by olive trees and other Mediterranean plants.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house has a flat roof which could be put to use, in other ways, and of course being elevated gives longer, more dramatic views.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property has space for private parking on the plot.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house is well decorated and is being sold with furniture.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It has has all the necessary infrastructure, and is approached via an asphalt road.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It has electricity, septic tank and water (water tank).&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The airport is 25 km away.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For further information, please contact our office in Split and our agents can arrange for you to visit the property.</p>', '', '1427_House-Villa_0.JPG', '1427_House-Villa_1.JPG', '1427_House-Villa_2.JPG', '1427_House-Villa_3.JPG', '1427_House-Villa_4.JPG', '1427_House-Villa_5.JPG', '1427_House-Villa_6.JPG', '1427_House-Villa_7.JPG', '1427_House-Villa_8.JPG'),
(1428, '®eljko i Sovjet', 'Vidakoviæ', 'Marko Vidakoviæ, 099 211 4131', '', 'marko.vidakovic11@gmail.com', 'Split', 'Kneza Mislava 93a Podstrana, k.c. 3579 k.o. Donja Podstrana, ZU 413', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '660', '600', '370', 1, '465000', '', 2, 1, 2, 2, 1, 2, 6, 4, 'October 29, 2015', '<p>Na mirnoj lokaciji podalje od magistralne ceste prodajemo kvalitetno graðenu obiteljsku kuæu sa tri odvojene stambene jedinice.&nbsp;Komforni stanovi s pogledom na more u prizemlju i na prvom katu u cijelosti su opremljeni, a namje&scaron;taj je ukljuèen u cijenu. Stanovi imaju sliènu strukturu, a sastoje se od hodnika, otvorenog prostora kuhinje, blagovaonice i dnevnog boravka, dvije kupaonice te tri spavaæe sobe.&nbsp;Ukupna stambena povr&scaron;ina kuæe iznosi 370 m2, dok zemlji&scaron;te ima povr&scaron;inu 600 m2.</p>', '<p>In a peaceful location, away from the main coastal road, we have this quality family house for sale, consisting of 3 separate units.&nbsp;Spatious apartments with sea view on the ground floor and the first floor are fully furnished and the furniture is included in the price. Both units have similar layout &ndash; a hall, open-plan living room, kitchen and dining room, two bathrooms and three bedrooms.&nbsp;Total living area of the house is 370 sqm, while the land plot measures 600 sqm.</p>', '', '<p>Na mirnoj lokaciji podalje od magistralne ceste prodajemo kvalitetno graðenu obiteljsku kuæu sa tri odvojene stambene jedinice.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Komforni stanovi s pogledom na more u prizemlju i na prvom katu u cijelosti su opremljeni, a namje&scaron;taj je ukljuèen u cijenu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Stanovi imaju sliènu strukturu, a sastoje se od hodnika, otvorenog prostora kuhinje, blagovaonice i dnevnog boravka, dvije kupaonice te tri spavaæe sobe.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ukupna stambena povr&scaron;ina kuæe iznosi 370 m2, dok zemlji&scaron;te ima povr&scaron;inu 600 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Svi stanovi imaju zasebne ulaze, a povezuje ih unutarnje stepeni&scaron;te zgrade.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Veliki dvoeta¾ni stan u potkrovlju nalazi se u rohbau stupnju.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Split je udaljen 11 km.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za dodatne informacije molimo kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured u Splitu.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>In a peaceful location, away from the main coastal road, we have this quality family house for sale, consisting of 3 separate units.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Spatious apartments with sea view on the ground floor and the first floor are fully furnished and the furniture is included in the price.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Both units have similar layout &ndash; a hall, open-plan living room, kitchen and dining room, two bathrooms and three bedrooms.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Total living area of the house is 370 sqm, while the land plot measures 600 sqm.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Every apartment has its own entrance and they are accessed via internal staircase.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Large duplex unit on the top floor still needs to be finished.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Split is 11 km away.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For further information please contact our office in Split.&nbsp;</p>', '', '1428_House-Villa_0.jpg', '1428_House-Villa_1.jpg', '1428_House-Villa_2.jpg', '1428_House-Villa_3.jpg', '1428_House-Villa_4.jpg', '1428_House-Villa_5.jpg', '1428_House-Villa_6.jpg', '1428_House-Villa_7.jpg', '1428_House-Villa_8.jpg'),
(1429, 'Josip i Donka ', 'Cukor', '', '091 787 0967', '', 'Trogir', 'Rastiæa III/ 2a Okrug Gornji, 264/160, 2.eta¾a', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '80', '0', '71', 1, '150000', '', 2, 1, 2, 2, 1, 2, 2, 2, 'October 30, 2015', '<p>Apartman u kvalitetnoj zgradi u novogradnji smje&scaron;tenoj na ju¾noj strani otoka Èiova.&nbsp;Do jedne od ljep&scaron;ih uvala na otoku je potrebno svega minuta pje&scaron;ke.&nbsp;Apartman je smje&scaron;ten u prizemlju iz kojeg se pru¾a djelomièan pogled na more.&nbsp;Stambena povr&scaron;ina apartmana iznosi 71 m2.&nbsp;Velika prednost ovog apartmana je &scaron;to je u cijenu ukljuèen vrt povr&scaron;ine 20 m2, suterenski prostor od 46 m2 i 2 parking mjesta.</p>', '<p>We are offering this new apartment in an attractive new development located on the south side of Ciovo. It is in one of the most beautiful bays on the island, and it only takes a few minutes on foot to get to the clear water and natural rocky beach. The apartment is located on the ground floor and offers a partial sea view from the terrace. The living area of the apartment is 71 m2. The great advantage of this apartment is that the price includes the garden of 20 m2, and a basement area of 46 m2 and two personal parking spaces.&nbsp;</p>', '', '<p>Apartman u jako kvalitetnoj zgradi u novogradnji smje&scaron;tenoj na ju¾noj strani otoka Èiova.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Do jedne od ljep&scaron;ih uvala na otoku je potrebno svega minuta pje&scaron;ke.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Pla¾a je prirodno kamenita i dodatno prilagoðena.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartman je smje&scaron;ten u prizemlju iz kojeg se pru¾a djelomièan pogled na more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Orijentacija je zapad &ndash; istok.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Stambena povr&scaron;ina apartmana iznosi 71 m2, a sastoji se od hodnika, dnevnog dijela sa blagovaonicom i kuhinjom, 2 spavaæe sobe, 2 kupaonice i 2 loggie.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Velika prednost ovog apartmana je &scaron;to je u cijenu ukljuèen vrt povr&scaron;ine 20 m2, suterenski prostor od 46 m2 i 2 parking mjesta.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U podrumu je spojena voda i elektrièna energija stoga ga je moguæe pretvoriti u stambeni prostor ili povezati s apartmanom unutarnjim stepenicama.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Do centra mjesta je potrebno nekoliko minuta vo¾nje, dok je grad Trogir udaljen 10 minuta vo¾nje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>15 minuta je potrebno do meðunarodnog aerodroma &scaron;to je velika prednost ove nekretnine, ali i cijelog podruèja.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ostajemo na usluzi za sve dodatne informacije i fotografije.</p>', '<p>We are offering this new apartment in an attractive new development located on the south side of Ciovo.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is in one of the most beautiful bays on the island, and it only takes a few minutes on foot to get to the clear water and natural rocky beach.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The apartment is located on the ground floor and offers a partial sea view from the terrace.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Orientation is east - west.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The living area of the apartment is 71 m2 and consists of hallway, open plan designed living area including dining room and kitchen, 2 bedrooms, 2 bathrooms and 2 balconies.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The great advantage of this apartment is that the price includes the garden of 20 m2, and a basement area of 46 m2 and two personal parking spaces.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The basement is connected to water and electricity so it can be converted into living space or connected to the apartment.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The village centre is a few minutes drive away, with useful shops, cafes and coffee bars while the town of Trogir with many choices of restaurants and cultural attractions is 10 minutes away.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is 15 minutes to reach the international airport which is a great advantage with this property, but also the whole region.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>We remain at your disposal for any further information and to arrange to visit this property.</p>', '', '1429_Apartment_0.JPG', '1429_Apartment_1.JPG', '1429_Apartment_2.JPG', '1429_Apartment_3.JPG', '1429_Apartment_4.JPG', '1429_Apartment_5.JPG', '1429_Apartment_6.JPG', '1429_Apartment_7.JPG', '1429_Apartment_8.JPG'),
(1430, 'Predrag ', 'Cosic', '00498033303738, ', '00491797085526', 'Predrag.cosic@t-online.de', 'Trogir', 'Rastiæa IV/ 20a  Okrug Gornji, 1351 ZGR, 357/3', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '280', '0', '60', 1, '110000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 3, 2, 'October 30, 2015', '<p>Dvoeta¾ni apartman s pogledom na more u mirnom dijelu otoka Èiova. Prekrasna kamenita pla¾a udaljena je cca. 280 m, a centar mjesta sa svim sadr¾ajima je udaljen 5 min. vo¾nje.&nbsp;Nalazi se na 2. i 3. katu koji je ujedno i zadnji kat zgrade. Zgrada je stara 17 godina, ali je kvalitetno graðena.&nbsp;Potrebno je dodatno ulaganje i uljep&scaron;avanje, ali je nekretnina jako povoljna s obzirom na polo¾aj i velièinu.&nbsp;Velika prednost je &scaron;to apartmanu pripada i gara¾a u prizemlju zgrade.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>We have this modern duplex apartment with sea views in a quiet part of the island Ciovo.&nbsp;It is situated on the 2/3 floor (top) of this low level purpose builtblock, 280m from the shore, and 5 minutes drive from the centre of the village. The building is 17 years old and was well built with high grade materials.&nbsp;It needs redecorating, and this is reflected in the price, but considering the location and size it is exceptional value. The orientation is north-south, while the internal surface area is 60 m2.&nbsp;</p>', '', '<p>Dvoeta¾ni apartman s pogledom na more u mirnom dijelu otoka Èiova.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Prekrasna kamenita pla¾a udaljena je cca. 280 m, a centar mjesta sa svim sadr¾ajima je udaljen 5 min. vo¾nje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nalazi se na 2. i 3. katu koji je ujedno i zadnji kat zgrade.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Zgrada je stara 17 godina, ali je kvalitetno graðena.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Potrebno je dodatno ulaganje i uljep&scaron;avanje, ali je nekretnina jako povoljna s obzirom na polo¾aj i velièinu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Orijentacija je sjever &ndash; jug, dok je povr&scaron;ina 60 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Glavna orijentacija apartmana tj. balkona je ju¾na.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na 2.katu se nalazi hodnik, spavaæa soba, kuhinja i blagovaonica, kupaonica i balkon s pogledom na more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na zadnjoj eta¾i se nalazi hodnik s galerijom i le¾ajem, 2 spavaæe sobe i balkon s pogledom na more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Potpuno je namje&scaron;ten i opremljen sa 3 klimatizacijska ureðaja.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Takoðer se u 2 sobe nalaze stropni ventilatori.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Velika prednost je &scaron;to apartmanu pripada i gara¾a u prizemlju zgrade.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ostajemo na usluzi za sva dodatna pitanja i fotografije.</p>', '<p>We have this modern duplex apartment with sea views in a quiet part of the island Ciovo.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is situated on the 2/3 floor (top) of this low level purpose builtblock, 280m from the shore, and 5 minutes drive from the centre of the village.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The building is 17 years old and was well built with high grade materials.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It needs redecorating, and this is reflected in the price, but considering the location and size it is exceptional value.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The orientation is north - south, while the internal surface area is 60 m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The main orientation of the apartment is South - Balcony is South.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the 1st level is a hallway, one bedroom, an open plan designed family living area including a kitchen and dining room, bathroom with a spacious balcony overlooking the sea.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the 2nd level is a hall with a gallery and a bed, 2 bedrooms and asecond balcony overlooking the sea.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is fully furnished and equipped with 3 air conditioners.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The big advantage is that the apartment has a garage on the ground floor.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>We remain at your disposal for any additional questions and further photographs and to arrange a private visit to the property.</p>', '', '1430_Apartment_0.JPG', '1430_Apartment_1.JPG', '1430_Apartment_2.JPG', '1430_Apartment_3.JPG', '1430_Apartment_4.JPG', '1430_Apartment_5.JPG', '1430_Apartment_6.JPG', '1430_Apartment_7.JPG', '1430_Apartment_8.JPG'),
(1431, 'Tonka ', 'Grubor', '021 885 450', '', '', 'Trogir', 'Obrov Trogir, Katastar 4159, podulozak 631, ulozak 2453', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '75', '0', '32', 2, '69000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 1, 'October 30, 2015', '<p>U samom centru starog dijela grada Trogira prodaje se apartman s odliènim potencijalom turistièkog iznajmljivanja.&nbsp;Udaljen je svega 30 m od popularne rive i mnogobrojnih restorana te ostalih sadr¾aja.&nbsp;Povr&scaron;ina apartmana je 32 m2.&nbsp;Na samom ulazu iz glavnog hodnika zgrade nalazi se predsoblje koje se trenutno dijeli sa susjednim apartmanom.&nbsp;Bez puno ulaganja hodnik se mo¾e pregraditi i potpuno odvojiti.&nbsp;Susjedni apartman se takoðer prodaje, te bi se s kupnjom oba dobio prostrani 2-sobni apartman.</p>', '<p>We have this apartment in the centre of the old town of Trogir for sale that needs modernising but has excellent potential for tourism or as aprivate dwelling.&nbsp;It is only 30 meters from the popular promenade with many restaurants and most of the historic attractions of this UNESCO protected town all conveniently within walking distance.&nbsp;The apartment size is 32 m2. The adjacent apartment is also for sale by the same owner, and to have both properties would create a spacious 2-bedroom apartment.&nbsp;</p>', '', '<p>U samom centru starog dijela grada Trogira prodaje se apartman s odliènim potencijalom turistièkog iznajmljivanja.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Udaljen je svega 30 m od popularne rive i mnogobrojnih restorana te ostalih sadr¾aja.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Grad Trogir uvr&scaron;ten je pod UNESCO-vu za&scaron;titu, dok je velika prednost blizina meðunarodnog aerodroma i otoka Èiova gdje se nalaze prekrasne pla¾e i uvale.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Povr&scaron;ina apartmana je 32 m2, a sastoji se od hodnika, kuhinje sa blagovaonicom i dnevnim boravkom, 1 spavaæe sobe i kupaonice.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Potrebno mu je renoviranje, ali je jo&scaron; uvijek u funkciji stanovanja.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Smje&scaron;ten je na 2.katu koji je ujedno i zadnji.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Povrh apartmana se nalazi potkrovlje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na samom ulazu iz glavnog hodnika zgrade nalazi se predsoblje koje se trenutno dijeli sa susjednim apartmanom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Bez puno ulaganja hodnik se mo¾e pregraditi i potpuno odvojiti.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Susjedni apartman se takoðer prodaje, te bi se s kupnjom oba dobio prostrani 2-sobni apartman.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>S obzirom da se nalazi u strogom centru grada, parking je udaljen cca. 80 m od zgrade.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za dodatne informacije molimo kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured u Splitu.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>We have this apartment in the centre of the old town of Trogir for sale that needs modernising but has excellent potential for tourism or as aprivate dwelling.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is only 30 meters from the popular promenade with many restaurants and most of the historic attractions of this UNESCO protected town all conveniently within walking distance.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The apartment size is 32 m2 and consists of hallway, kitchen, combine ddining room and living room, 1 bedroom and bathroom.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is located on the 2nd floor/top floor, and above is an attic that provides an area for storage.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On entering the building by the front door there is a shared main hall, which can be easily be altered to provide independent entrances.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The adjacent apartment is also for sale by the same owner, and to have both properties would create a spacious 2-bedroom apartment.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Parking is located approx. 80 m from the building and the airport is just 10 minutes away.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact us to arrange to visit this property.</p>', '', '1431_Apartment_0.JPG', '1431_Apartment_1.JPG', '1431_Apartment_2.JPG', '1431_Apartment_3.JPG', '1431_Apartment_4.JPG', '1431_Apartment_5.JPG', '1431_Apartment_6.JPG', '1431_Apartment_7.JPG', '1431_Apartment_8.JPG'),
(1432, 'Nenada', 'Vukman', '', '098353981', '', 'Trogir', 'Obrov 2 Trogir, 765/1 zgr, podulo¾ak 649, ulo¾ak 2453', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '75', '0', '33', 2, '69000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 1, 1, 'October 30, 2015', '<p>Apartman u srcu prekrasnog povijesnog grada Trogira sa djelomiènim pogledom na more. Popularna Riva je odmah u blizini &scaron;to ovoj nekretnini daje jo&scaron; veæu vrijednost.&nbsp;Iz apartmana se pru¾a djelomièni pogled na more i stari dio grada.&nbsp;Povr&scaron;ina je 33 m2.&nbsp;U dobrom je stanju, te je potrebno ulaganje uglavnom u namje&scaron;taj. Ulazno predsoblje se trenutno dijeli sa susjednim apartmanom koji je takoðer na prodaju. Uz manje ulaganje hodnik se mo¾e pregraditi i potpuno odvojiti.</p>', '<p>We are pleased to offer this compact apartment in the heart of the beautiful historic town of Trogir. It is located on the 2nd floor (top), and the orientation is to the west.&nbsp;The apartment offers a partial view of the sea down the old street and a partial view of the old part of the city.&nbsp;The living area is 33 m2. The entrance hall is currently shared with the neighbouring apartment, which is also for sale, but this can be reconfigured to become independent to occupants of this apartment.&nbsp;</p>', '', '<p>Apartman u srcu prekrasnog povijesnog grada Trogira sa djelomiènim pogledom na more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Popularna Riva je odmah u blizini &scaron;to ovoj nekretnini daje jo&scaron; veæu vrijednost.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nalazi se na 2.katu (zadnjem), a orijentacija je zapadna.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Iz apartmana se pru¾a djelomièni pogled na more i stari dio grada.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Povr&scaron;ina je 33 m2, a sastoji se od hodnika, kuhinje sa blagovaonicom i dnevnim boravkom, 1 spavaæe sobe i kupaonice.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U dobrom je stanju, te je potrebno ulaganje uglavnom u namje&scaron;taj.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kupaonici je potrebno najveæe ulaganje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ulazno predsoblje se trenutno dijeli sa susjednim apartmanom koji je takoðer na prodaju.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Uz manje ulaganje hodnik se mo¾e pregraditi i potpuno odvojiti.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Bez obzira na zajednièko predsoblje oba apartmana imaju poseban ulaz u ostatak stambenog prostora.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Najbli¾i parking je udaljen 80 m od zgrade buduæi da je u starom dijelu grada ogranièen pristup automobilom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Do aerodrom je potrebno 10 minuta vo¾nje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ostajemo na usluzi za sve informacije ukoliko ste zainteresirani za ovu izuzetnu ponudu.</p>', '<p>We are pleased to offer this compact apartment in the heart of the beautiful historic town of Trogir.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The iconic Riva walkway that allows people to walk the length of the town on the waterfront, is nearby and the close proximity of this adds interest to residents of this flat, and especially to visiting tourists.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is located on the 2nd floor (top), and the orientation is to the west.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The apartment offers a partial view of the sea down the old street and a partial view of the old part of the city.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The living area is 33 m2 and it consists of hallway, kitchen, dining room and living room, 1 bedroom and bathroom.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property is in good condition, but some interior redecorating and even modernisation could increase its appeal.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The entrance hall is currently shared with the neighbouring apartment, which is also for sale, but this can be reconfigured to become independent to occupants of this apartment.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The nearest parking is located 80 meters from the building because the old part of the town is ''pedestrian only'', but despite this there is provision for heavy materials to be brought to any property.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The journey to/from the airport takes 10 minutes drive.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>We remain at your disposal to supply more information if you are interested in this property.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>This property is at a price to ensure a quick sale.</p>', '', '1432_Apartment_0.jpg', '1432_Apartment_1.jpg', '1432_Apartment_2.jpg', '1432_Apartment_3.jpg', '1432_Apartment_4.jpg', '1432_Apartment_5.jpg', '1432_Apartment_6.JPG', '1432_Apartment_7.JPG', '1432_Apartment_8.jpg');
INSERT INTO `nekretnina` (`id`, `ime`, `prezime`, `telefon`, `mobitel`, `e_mail`, `lokacija_id`, `adresa`, `status_id`, `vrsta_id`, `udaljenost`, `povrsina`, `stambenapovrsina`, `display`, `cijena`, `cijenatocka`, `ponuda_tjedna`, `new_built`, `must_sell`, `prvi_red_do_mora`, `pogled_na_more`, `bazen`, `broj_soba`, `broj_kupatila`, `datum`, `title_hr`, `title_en`, `title_ge`, `opis_hr`, `opis_en`, `opis_ge`, `PropertyImageURL0`, `PropertyImageURL1`, `PropertyImageURL2`, `PropertyImageURL3`, `PropertyImageURL4`, `PropertyImageURL5`, `PropertyImageURL6`, `PropertyImageURL7`, `PropertyImageURL8`) VALUES
(1433, 'Srdjana ', 'Culic', '098448133', '', 'srdjana.culic@st.htnet.hr   sculic@kbspl', 'Hvar', 'Maslinica Hvar, Star Grad, 2439/1,  2439/3,  2439/2 2439/4', 'For sale', 'Land plot', '100', '3246', '0', 1, '1623000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 0, 0, 'October 30, 2015', '<p>Zemlji&scaron;te sa pogledom na more na ekskluzivnoj lokaciji na otoku Hvaru. Otok Hvar je veæ godinama popularna destinacija, kako za ljetovanje tako i za investiranje.&nbsp;Osim &scaron;to je povezan trajektnom linijom sa gradom Splitom, takoðer je povezan i avionskom. Trajektno pristani&scaron;te je udaljeno 350 m od zemlji&scaron;ta.&nbsp;Povr&scaron;ina zemlji&scaron;ta je 3246 m2, a nalazi se u graðevinskoj zoni. S obzirom na velièinu postoji vi&scaron;e moguænosti izgradnje i ulaganja.</p>', '<p>We are offering one of the largest blocks of land with planning options, on the hugely popular island of Hvar. This piece of land is blessed with a great sea view, in an exclusive location. The ever increasing number of tourists visiting the island are ever more demanding and there is a definite shortage of good quality property in prime locations which makes this land plot an exceptional opportunity. The Land area is 3246 m2 and is located within a construction zone.&nbsp;</p>', '', '<p>Zemlji&scaron;te sa pogledom na more na ekskluzivnoj lokaciji na otoku Hvaru.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Otok Hvar je veæ godinama popularna destinacija, kako za ljetovanje tako i za investiranje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Osim &scaron;to je povezan trajektnom linijom sa gradom Splitom, takoðer je povezan i avionskom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Trajektno pristani&scaron;te je udaljeno 350 m od zemlji&scaron;ta.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Povr&scaron;ina zemlji&scaron;ta je 3246 m2, a nalazi se u graðevinskoj zoni.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>S obzirom na velièinu postoji vi&scaron;e moguænosti izgradnje i ulaganja.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>More i pla¾a su udaljeni 100 m.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Pristupni put je direktan, dok se sva infrastruktura nalazi u blizini.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Velika prednost ovog zemlji&scaron;ta je &scaron;to se odmah do zemlji&scaron;ta gradi veliki kompleks luksuznih vila &scaron;to æe jo&scaron; vi&scaron;e poveæati vrijednost cijelog podruèja, ali i ovog zemlji&scaron;ta.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Stojimo na raspolaganju za sve dodatne informacije.</p>', '<p>We are offering one of the largest blocks of land with planning options, on the hugely popular island of Hvar.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>This piece of land is blessed with a great sea view, in an exclusive location.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The ever increasing number of tourists visiting the island are ever more demanding and there is a definite shortage of good quality property in prime locations which makes this land plot an exceptional opportunity.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The land area is 3246 m2 and is located within a construction zone.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Given the size of the plot, there are many possibilities for building and investment.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apart from the ferry to the city of Split, there is also a connection by a regular seaplane service.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The Ferry port with coffee bars, cafes and shops etc is situated 350 m from the land.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The sea and beach are within 100 m.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The plot has a direct access road while all the infrastructure (water/drains/electric etc) is nearby.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The big advantage of this area is that it is next to a large complex of luxury villas, which will further increase the value of the entire area, and specifically this land plot.</p>', '', '1433_Land-plot_0.jpg', '1433_Land-plot_1.jpg', '1433_Land-plot_2.jpg', '1433_Land-plot_3.jpg', '', '', '', '', ''),
(1434, 'Danka', 'Kovaèev', '', '', '', 'Hvar', 'Pitve', 'For sale', 'Old stone house', '2000', '0', '100', 1, '250000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 3, 1, 'November 3, 2015', '<p>Renovirana stara kamena kuca s dvoristem.&nbsp;Kuca ima 100 m2.&nbsp;Prisutna sva infrastruktura. Kuca se nalazi u prekrasnom autenticnom selu na mirnoj lokaciji.&nbsp;U prizemlju se nalaze ulaz, dvoriste, kuhinja, blagovaonica, dnevni boravak, te unutarnje stepeniste za prvi kat.&nbsp;Na prvom katu se nalaze spavaca soba i kupaonica.&nbsp;Na drugom katu su jos dvije spavace sobe.</p>', '<p>We are pleased to offer this old stone house with a traditional courtyardin a charming inland village on Hvar island, 2 km from the seashore. It has attractive views looking the village and down to the sea, and across to the neighbouring island of Brac.&nbsp;The house has a living area of 100m sq.&nbsp;The property has all the infrastructure present, but needs some slight redecorating. The house is located in a beautiful authentic village rarely visited bymost tourists making for a wonderful quiet but convenient house.</p>', '', '<p>Renovirana kamena kuca s dvoristem.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuca ima 100 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U prizemlju se nalaze ulaz, dvoriste, kuhinja, blagovaonica, dnevni boravak, te unutarnje stepeniste za prvi kat.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Postoji takoðer vanjsko stepeni&scaron;te.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na prvom katu se nalaze spavaca soba i kupaonica.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na drugom katu su jos dvije spavace sobe, te unutarnje stepenice.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Prisutna sva infrastruktura.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuca se nalazi u prekrasnom autenticnom selu na mirnoj lokaciji.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Parking nedaleko sela.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Udaljenost od veceg grada je 2km.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Do hydroaviona 2km.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za dodatne informacije molimo kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured u Splitu.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>We are pleased to offer this old stone house with a traditional courtyardin a charming inland village on Hvar island, 2 km from the seashore.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It has attractive views looking the village and down to the sea, and across to the neighbouring island of Brac.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house has a living area of 100m sq.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The ground floor has an entrance through the courtyard leading into a kitchen, dining room, living room and then internal stairs to the first floor.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the first floor are bedroom and bathroom.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the second floor are two more bedrooms and inside stairs.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There are also external stairs directly to the bedrooms on the first floor.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property has all the infrastructure present, but needs some slight redecorating.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house is located in a beautiful authentic village rarely visited by most tourists making for a wonderful quiet but convenient house.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There is street parking adjacent to the house.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The distance from the bigger town is 2km, where there are many options for bars, restaurants and shops etc.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The ''hydroplane'' (sea-plane) is 2km.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For further information, please contact agents in either our office in Split or Hvar town.</p>', '', '1434_Old-stone-house_0.JPG', '1434_Old-stone-house_1.JPG', '1434_Old-stone-house_2.JPG', '1434_Old-stone-house_3.JPG', '1434_Old-stone-house_4.JPG', '1434_Old-stone-house_5.JPG', '1434_Old-stone-house_6.JPG', '1434_Old-stone-house_7.JPG', '1434_Old-stone-house_8.jpg'),
(1435, 'Ivan ', 'Roje', 'Nino Roje 091/5862046 kljuè', '091/9065702', '', 'Split', 'Slaviæeva 37, 10492 k.è.', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '500', '0', '120', 2, '240000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 4, 1, 'November 3, 2015', '<p>Kuæa za renovaciju, u centru grada Splita.&nbsp;Kuæa je dvojna, te je smje&scaron;tena u mirnom dijelu starog grada, ali u blizini svih sadr¾aja.&nbsp;Udaljena je od mora 500 m, u blizini Dioklecijanove palaèe.&nbsp;Prikljuèena je na vodu i struju.&nbsp;Kuæa zahtijeva kompletnu renovaciju.&nbsp;Sastoji se od prizemlja, prvog i drugog kata.&nbsp;Prizemlje slu¾i kao poslovni prostor.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>We are offering this renovation project, a house, well located in the centre of Split. The building is detached and is located in a quiet street, very much in the historical and popular tourist area in the old town, and within walking distance to all the historic and cultural attractions of the city, the travel centres-ferries, buses etc, shops, and the many restaurants and bars. It is connected to the water and electricity.&nbsp;The house requires complete renovation, and has three levels.&nbsp;</p>', '', '<p>Kuæa za renovaciju, u centru grada Splita.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je dvojna, te je smje&scaron;tena u mirnom dijelu starog grada, ali u blizini svih sadr¾aja.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Udaljena je od mora samo 500 m, u blizini Dioklecijanove palaèe.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Prikljuèena je na vodu i struju.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa zahtijeva kompletnu renovaciju.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sastoji se od prizemlja, prvog i drugog kata.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Prizemlje slu¾i kao poslovni prostor.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Prvi kat se sastoji od dvije sobe i kupaonice.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na drugom katu su jo&scaron; dvije sobe i balkon s kojeg se pru¾a pogled na grad.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ju¾no orijentirana.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ukupna stambena povr&scaron;ina cijele kuæe iznosi 120 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Vlasni&scaron;tvo uredno.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>S obzirom na poziciju ovo je izvrsna prilika ukoliko ¾elite nekretninu renovirati u svrhu turistièkog iznajmljivanja ili je jednostavno ¾elite koristiti za vlastiti boravak.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Parking je javni, ispred kuæe, a najbli¾i veæi parking udaljen je 100 m od kuæe.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Dioklecijanova Palaèa je udaljena nekoliko minuta &scaron;etnje.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Meðunarodni aerodrom udaljen je 40 min. vo¾nje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za sve dodatne informacije slobodno nas kontaktirajte.</p>', '<p>We are offering this renovation project, a house, well located in the centre of Split.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The building is detached and is located in a quiet street, very much in the historical and popular tourist area in the old town, and within walking distance to all the historic and cultural attractions of the city, the travel centres - ferries, buses etc, shops, and the many restaurants and bars.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is only 500 m from the sea, and Riva promenade stretching along the shore in front of the Roman Palace.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is connected to the water and electricity.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house requires complete renovation, and has three levels.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The ground floor is used as office space.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The first floor consists of two bedrooms and a bathroom.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the second floor are two bedrooms and a balcony with a view of the city.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The total floor area is 2000m sq.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property is South oriented.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Due to the position, it is an excellent opportunity to create a house or rooms for tourists, or a great place to own in the centre of this great town.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Parking is on the public road, in front of the house, and the nearest large parking lot is located 100 m from the property.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The international airport is 40 minutes. driving.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For further information please contact our office, close to the property.</p>', '', '1435_House-Villa_0.jpg', '1435_House-Villa_1.jpg', '1435_House-Villa_2.jpg', '1435_House-Villa_3.jpeg', '', '', '', '', ''),
(1436, 'Marin', 'Terziæ', '', '099/3383-003', '', 'Split', 'Ljudevita Posavskog 12 a, 7. kat, ZEM 9172/18', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '700', '0', '54', 1, '310000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 2, 1, 'November 3, 2015', '<p>Ovaj &scaron;armantan stan, penthouse, nalazi se u popularnoj èetvrti Splita i u¾iva lagan pristup cjelogodi&scaron;njim sadr¾ajima koji ga èine atraktivnim kako za ¾ivljenje tako i za turistièki najam.&nbsp;Sastoji se od 2 spavaæe sobe, kuponice, dnevnog boravka, kuhinje, blagovaonice i prostrane terase od 67 m2, s koje se pru¾a oèaravajuæ pogled na cijeli Split, park &scaron;umu Marjan i more.&nbsp;Ukupna stambena povr&scaron;ina stana iznosi 54 m2.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>We are offering this charming penthouse apartment, located in Split and enjoying conveniently easy access to year-round amenities (restaurants,cafes, museums, public transport, beaches, etc.) which makes this property attractive both for living and for tourist rental.&nbsp;The total living area of the apartment is 54 m2 plus terrace of 67 m2 plus garage 20 m2.</p>', '', '<p>Ovaj &scaron;armantan stan, penthouse, nalazi se u popularnoj èetvrti Splita i u¾iva lagan pristup cjelogodi&scaron;njim sadr¾ajima (restoranima, kafiæima, muzejima, javnom prijevozu, pla¾ama itd.) koji ga èine atraktivnim kako za ¾ivljenje tako i za turistièki najam.</p>\r\n<p><strong><br /></strong></p>\r\n<p><strong>Stambena povr&scaron;ina stana je 54 m2 + 67 m2 terasa + 20 m2 gara¾a.&nbsp;</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sastoji se od 2 spavaæe sobe, kuponice, dnevnog boravka, kuhinje, blagovaonice i prostrane terase od 67 m2, s koje se pru¾a oèaravajuæ pogled na cijeli Split, park &scaron;umu Marjan i more.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ukupna stambena povr&scaron;ina stana iznosi 54 m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na terasi se nalazi i vanjska kuhinja.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Vlasniku pripada i zatvorena gara¾a (20 m2) koja ima prikljuèene struju i vodu.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Stan je udaljen od centra grada 5 minuta hoda.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Postoji moguænost izuzimanja gara¾e iz prodaje, u sluèaju èega je cijena proporcionalno umanjena te otvorena za ozbiljne ponude.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za dodatne informacije molimo kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured u Splitu.</p>', '<p>We are offering this charming penthouse apartment, located in Split and enjoying conveniently easy access to year-round amenities (restaurants,cafes, museums, public transport, beaches, etc.) which makes this property attractive both for living and for tourist rental.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>The total living area of the apartment is 54 m2 plus terrace of 67 m2 plus garage 20 m2.</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It consists of 2 bedrooms, bathroom, living room, kitchen, dining room and large terrace of 67 m2, which offers striking views in and around the city of Split, the park forest Marjan and the sea.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The garage can be excluded from the sale, in case of which the price would be proportionally lowered and open to reasonable offers.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property is ready for immediate moving.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the terrace is a substantial bbq cooking facility.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The owner also has a closed garage (20 m2), which has connected electricity and water.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The apartment is away from the old town center 5 minutes walk.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For further information, please contact our office in Split and we can arrange a visit to the apartment.</p>', '', '1436_Apartment_0.jpg', '1436_Apartment_1.jpg', '1436_Apartment_2.jpg', '1436_Apartment_3.jpg', '1436_Apartment_4.jpg', '1436_Apartment_5.jpg', '1436_Apartment_6.jpg', '1436_Apartment_7.jpg', '1436_Apartment_8.jpg'),
(1437, 'Ante', 'Burmeta', '099/6759-242', '', 'burmeta@gmail.com', 'Zadar', 'Borik ZADAR, 162/3,  163/3', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '300', '497', '380', 1, '410400', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 8, 6, 'November 3, 2015', '<p><span style="color: #ff0000;"><strong><span style="text-decoration: underline;">POSEBNA PONUDA - 10% SNI®ENA CIJENA DO 31.3.2016!!</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p>Kuæa se nalazi u elitnom turistièkom djelu grada Zadra, samo 300 metara od mora.&nbsp;Sastoji se od pet apartmana, poslovnog prostora i podruma ukupne stambene povr&scaron;ine 380 m2.&nbsp;Zemlji&scaron;te na kojem se nalazi parking za 4 automobila ima povr&scaron;inu 497 m2.&nbsp;Okuænica je kultivirana (naranèa, limun, maslinik).&nbsp;Kuæa je u potpunosti opremljena i namje&scaron;tena, zadnja adaptacija 2005. godine.<br /><br /></p>', '<p><span style="color: #ff0000;"><strong><span style="text-decoration: underline;">SPECIAL OFFER - ADDITIONAL PRICE REDUCTION OF 10% UNTIL MARCH 31!!</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p>We are offering this excellent house in a desirable tourist part of Zadar town, just 300 meters from the sea.&nbsp;It consists of five apartments, office space and a basement with a total floor area of 380 m2.&nbsp;There is parking for 4 cars in the large land plot of 497 m2.&nbsp;The garden has been landscaped and cultivated with a fabulous selection ofthriving citrus and other Mediterranean trees (orange, lemon, grapes and olive).&nbsp;</p>', '', '<p><span style="color: #ff0000;"><strong>POSEBNA PONUDA - 10% SNI®ENA CIJENA DO 31.3.2016!!<br /></strong></span></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa se nalazi u elitnom turistièkom djelu grada Zadra, samo 300 metara od mora.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sastoji se od pet apartmana, poslovnog prostora i podruma ukupne stambene povr&scaron;ine 380 m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Zemlji&scaron;te na kojem se nalazi parking za 4 automobila ima povr&scaron;inu 497 m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Okuænica je kultivirana (naranèa, limun, maslinik).&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je u potpunosti opremljena i namje&scaron;tena, zadnja adaptacija 2005. godine.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U vrtu se nalazi prekrasan kamin.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je ju¾no orijentirana.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Vlasnik posjeduje licencu za iznajmljivanje (3*).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Grad Zadar udaljen je 3 km, dok je meðunarodni aerodrom udaljen 10 km.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za dodatne informacije molimo kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured u Splitu.&nbsp;</p>', '<p><span style="color: #ff0000;"><strong>SPECIAL OFFER - ADDITIONAL PRICE REDUCTION OF 10% UNTIL MARCH 31!!</strong></span></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>We are offering this excellent house in a desirable tourist part of Zadar town, just 300 meters from the sea.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It consists of five apartments, office space and a basement with a total floor area of 380 m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There is parking for 4 cars in the large land plot of 497 m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The garden has been landscaped and cultivated with a fabulous selection ofthriving citrus and other Mediterranean trees (orange, lemon, grapes and olive).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Among the fruit trees is a outdoor fireplace/bbq suitable for large family gatherings, and still enough space for a swimming pool, should the new owner wish to make such investments.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house internally is fully equipped, beautifully maintained and furnished, and the last renovation was in 2005.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Air cons and central heating have been installed on each floor.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Enough space for swimming pool.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house is south oriented.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The owner has a license for rental (3 *).&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The city of Zadar is 3 km away, while the international airport 10 km away with a sea plane connection to other costal/islands destinations.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For further information, please contact our office in Split.</p>', '', '1437_House-Villa_0.jpg', '1437_House-Villa_1.jpg', '1437_House-Villa_2.jpg', '1437_House-Villa_3.jpg', '1437_House-Villa_4.jpg', '1437_House-Villa_5.jpg', '1437_House-Villa_6.jpg', '1437_House-Villa_7.jpg', '1437_House-Villa_8.jpg'),
(1438, 'Branka', 'Zokiæ', '091 194 9282', '091 220 1975 ', '', 'Trogir', 'Kneza Trpimira 6 Trogir, 3227/1, 3227/2', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '10', '503', '112', 1, '650000', '', 2, 2, 2, 1, 1, 2, 3, 1, 'November 3, 2015', '<p>Samostojeæa kuæa na ekskluzivnoj lokaciji u blizini centra prekrasnog Trogira uvr&scaron;tenog pod UNESCO-vu za&scaron;titu.&nbsp;Na podruèju gdje se nalazi kuæa gotovo da i nema nekretnina na prodaju, stoga je ovo izuzetna prilika za ulaganje.&nbsp;Nalazi se u 1.redu do mora, dok je u blizini prekrasna &scaron;ljunèana pla¾a sa nekoliko popularnih barova.&nbsp;Trenutna velièina kuæe je 112 m2.&nbsp;Ukupna velièina zemlji&scaron;ta je 503 m2, dok u prostranom vrtu postoji moguænost izgradnje bazena.</p>', '<p>We are pleased to offer this detached bungalow house in a prime location close to the centre of the beautiful town of Trogir listed under the UNESCO protection.&nbsp;It is located in the 1st row to the sea, and nearby is a beautiful pebble beach with a number of popular bars.&nbsp;The area is expected to become yet more popular as a result of the completion of another bridge, making access to and from the island even easier.&nbsp;The house currently consists only of a ground floor, but the real potential lies with the possibility of building another 2 floors. The maximum overall height can be 12 m.&nbsp;Current size of the house is 112 m2.</p>', '', '<p>Samostojeæa kuæa na ekskluzivnoj lokaciji u blizini centra prekrasnog Trogira uvr&scaron;tenog pod UNESCO-vu za&scaron;titu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Do samog srca grada potrebno je svega 5 minuta pje&scaron;ke, a u blizini se nalazi autobusna stanica koja povezuje sa gradom Splitom i ostalim mjestima.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na podruèju gdje se nalazi kuæa gotovo da i nema nekretnina na prodaji, stoga je ovo izuzetna prilika za ulaganje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nalazi se u 1.redu do mora, dok je u blizini prekrasna &scaron;ljunèana pla¾a sa nekoliko popularnih barova.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Mnogobrojne pla¾e se takoðer nalaze i na otoku Èiovu koji je povezan sa mostom sa gradom Trogirom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Trenutno je u izgradnji jo&scaron; jedan most koji se nalazi u blizini ove nekretnine &scaron;to je jo&scaron; jedna velika prednost.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa se trenutno sastoji samo od prizemlja, ali postoji moguænost izgradnje jo&scaron; 2 eta¾e tj. ukupna visina mo¾e iznositi 12 m.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Trenutna velièina kuæe je 112 m2, a sastoji se od predsoblja, hodnika, kuhinje, 3 prostrane sobe i kupaonice.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ukupna velièina zemlji&scaron;ta je 503 m2, dok u prostranom vrtu postoji moguænost izgradnje bazena.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Zbog pozicije idealna je za ulaganje u svrhu turistèkog iznajmljivanja.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Slobodno nas kontaktirajte za sve dodatne informacije.</p>', '<p>We are pleased to offer this detached bungalow house in a prime location close to the centre of the beautiful town of Trogir listed under the UNESCO protection.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>To the heart of the town it is only 5 minutes on foot, and is located conveniently near a bus stop that connects directly to the city of Split and a foot ferry that goes to Split and other destinations on the island.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is situated in the area where there are rarely any houses to sell, so this is an unusual opportunity for investment.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is located in the 1st row to the sea, and nearby is a beautiful pebble beach with a number of popular bars.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The area is expected to become yet more popular as a result of the completion of another bridge, making access to and from the island even easier.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house currently consists only of a ground floor, but the real potential lies with the possibility of building another 2 floors, ie.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The maximum overall height can be 12 m.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Current size of the house is 112 m2 and consists of hallway, kitchen, 3 spacious bedrooms and bathrooms.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Total land size is 503 m2, while the spacious garden would allow a swimming pool and patio area to be built.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>This is a great opportunity for investing in tourism.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact us for more information and to arrange to visit the property.</p>', '', '1438_House-Villa_0.jpg', '1438_House-Villa_1.jpg', '1438_House-Villa_2.jpg', '1438_House-Villa_3.jpg', '1438_House-Villa_4.jpg', '1438_House-Villa_5.jpg', '1438_House-Villa_6.jpg', '', ''),
(1440, 'Silvia', 'Markotiæ', '091 2006 020', '0918907049 mama Neda', 'silvia_markotic@yahoo.com', 'Kastela', 'Povi¹e ulice Ivana Jurasa Ka¹tel Stari, 1737/2, 1737/7, 1737/8', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '160', '979', '0', 1, '240000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 0, 0, 'November 4, 2015', '<p>Graðevinsko zemlji&scaron;te na odliènoj lokaciji u jednom o sedam Ka&scaron;tela smje&scaron;tenih izmeðu Trogira i Splita.&nbsp;S obzirom na lokaciju u blizini se nalaze svi potrebni sadr¾aji kao i cesta koja povezuje Tg i St.&nbsp;U cijenu je ukljuèena i graðevinska dozvola sa svim plaæenim komunalnim doprinosima.&nbsp;Prema postojeæoj dozvoli moguæe je izgraditi 3 zgrade sa ukupno 12 apartmana. Sa gornjih katova se pru¾a prekrasan pogled na more i stari dio mjesta.</p>', '<p>Opportunity to purchase well located building plot. We are offering this substantial building land of 979 m2, with planning permission already obtained, in a prime location in one of the Kastela situated between Trogir and Split. A beautiful pebble beach is 10 minutes walk away. The major towns of Split and Trogir are close either on public transport-no more than 15 minutes-or with a private car, and the airport is 10 minutes away.<br /><br /></p>', '', '<p>Graðevinsko zemlji&scaron;te na odliènoj lokaciji u jednom o sedam Ka&scaron;tela smje&scaron;tenih izmeðu Trogira i Splita.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nalazi se u starom dijelu mjesta, udaljeno od centra nekoliko minuta pje&scaron;ke.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Prekrasna &scaron;ljunèana pla¾a udaljena je 10 minuta pje&scaron;ke.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>S obzirom na lokaciju u blizini se nalaze svi potrebni sadr¾aji kao i cesta koja povezuje Tg i St.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U cijenu je ukljuèena i graðevinska dozvola sa svim plaæenim komunalnim doprinosima.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Prema postojeæoj dozvoli moguæe je izgraditi 3 zgrade sa ukupno 12 apartmana.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sa gornjih katova se pru¾a prekrasan pogled na more i stari dio mjesta.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Zgrada A: 2 apartmana od 126 m2 i 2 apartmana od 60 m2</strong></p>\r\n<p><strong><br /></strong></p>\r\n<p><strong>Zgrada B: 2 apartmana od 90 m2 i 2 apartmana od 47 m2</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Zgrada C: 2 apartmana od 126 m2 i 2 apartmana od 60 m2</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Takoðer postoji moguænost izgradnje 2 luksuzne ville sa bazenima.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ukupna povr&scaron;ina zemlji&scaron;ta iznosi 979 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sva infrastruktura se nalazi odmah na zemlji&scaron;tu, dok je pristupni put direktan.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Do meðunarodnog aerodroma je potrebno 15 min. vo¾nje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Slobodno nas kontaktirajte za sve dodatne detalje.</p>', '<p><strong>Opportunity to purchase well located building plot</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>We are offering this substantial building land of 979 m2, with planning permission already obtained, in a prime location in one of the Kastela situated between Trogir and Split.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is located in the old part of town, away from the centre, but conveniently close within a few minutes on foot.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>A beautiful pebble beach is 10 minutes walk away.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The major towns of Split and Trogir are close either on public transport - no more than 15 minutes - or with a private car, and the airport is 10 minutes away.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>According to the existing license is possible to build 3 buildings with 12 apartments.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the upper floors there is a beautiful view of the sea and the old part of town.</p>\r\n<p><strong><br /></strong></p>\r\n<p><strong>Building A: 2 apartments of 126 m2, 2 apartments of 60 m2</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Building B: 2 apartments of &nbsp;90 m2, 2 apartments of 47 m2</strong></p>\r\n<p><strong><br /></strong></p>\r\n<p><strong>Building C: 2 apartments of 126 m2, 2 apartments of 60 m2</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Or there is also the possibility of building two luxury villas with swimming pools.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The total land area is 979 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>All the infrastructure is located next to the land, and there is a direct access road.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The international airport it takes 15 min. driving.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The price includes a building permit with all utilities paid contributions.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact our office for further details.<br /><br /></p>', '', '1440_Land-plot_0.jpg', '1440_Land-plot_1.jpg', '1440_Land-plot_2.jpg', '1440_Land-plot_3.jpg', '1440_Land-plot_4.jpg', '1440_Land-plot_5.jpg', '1440_Land-plot_6.jpg', '1440_Land-plot_7.jpg', '1440_Land-plot_8.jpg'),
(1441, 'SELINGER- KOCIJ', 'Dunja', '091/552-0100 Rujana Baketiæ', '01 3776990', 'rujana.baketic@gmail.com ', 'Brac', 'Bol, Setnica', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '10', '646', '70', 1, '750000', '', 2, 2, 2, 1, 1, 2, 2, 1, 'November 5, 2015', '<p>Kuæa u prvom redu do mora, smje&scaron;tena na ju¾noj strani otoka Braèa, u mirnom stambenom dijelu naselja sa ekskluzivnim vilama u susjedstvu, svega nekoliko koraka od lijepe &scaron;ljunèane pla¾e te par minuta hoda do centra mjesta.&nbsp;Kuæa se nalazi na velikoj parceli i moguæe je njeno pro&scaron;irenje.&nbsp;Ukupna stambena povr&scaron;ina kuæe iznosi 70 m2, dok zemlji&scaron;te ima 646 m2.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>A seafront house located on the south side of Brac island, in a quiet and exclusive residential area, at short walking distance to a beautiful pebble beach and not far from the town''s center.&nbsp;The property stands on a large plot and can be extended.&nbsp;Total living area of the house is 70 sqm, while the land plot measures 646 sqm.&nbsp;</p>', '', '<p>Kuæa u prvom redu do mora, smje&scaron;tena na ju¾noj strani otoka Braèa, u mirnom stambenom dijelu naselja sa ekskluzivnim vilama u susjedstvu, svega nekoliko koraka od lijepe &scaron;ljunèane pla¾e te par minuta hoda do centra mjesta.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa se nalazi na velikoj parceli i moguæe je njeno pro&scaron;irenje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Postojeæi prizemni objekt sastoji se od dnevnog boravka, kuhinje, dvije spavaæe sobe i kupaonice.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Pokraj kuæe nalazi se mala ostava.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ukupna stambena povr&scaron;ina kuæe iznosi 70 m2, dok zemlji&scaron;te ima 646 m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Odr¾avani vrt okru¾uje kuæu, a more se nalazi na svega nekoliko koraka od nekretnine. &nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za dodatne informacije molimo kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured u Splitu.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>A seafront house located on the south side of Brac island, in a quiet and exclusive residential area, at short walking distance to a beautiful pebble beach and not far from the town''s center.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property stands on a large plot and can be extended.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>An existing house contains the ground floor only and consists of a living room, kitchen, two bedrooms and bathroom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Next to the house there is a small storage.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Total living area of the house is 70 sqm, while the land plot measures 646 sqm.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Well kept lush garden surrounds the house and the sea is less than a minute walk from the property.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For further information please contact our office in Split.&nbsp;</p>', '', '1441_House-Villa_0.jpg', '1441_House-Villa_1.jpg', '1441_House-Villa_2.jpg', '1441_House-Villa_3.jpg', '1441_House-Villa_4.jpg', '1441_House-Villa_5.jpg', '1441_House-Villa_6.jpg', '', ''),
(1442, 'Ivo', 'Budroviæ', '', '', '', 'Hvar', 'Basina, Hvar', 'For sale', 'Land plot', '100', '1000', '0', 1, '110000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 0, 0, 'November 6, 2015', '<p>Gradjevinsko zemljiste stambene namjene na sjevernoj strani otoka Hvara, s predivnim pogledom na more.&nbsp;Zemljiste ima povrsinu 1000 m2, te je udaljeno samo 100 m od mora.&nbsp;Nalazi se u zoni za gradnju obiteljskih kuca.&nbsp;Nalazi se u uvali koja ima trgovinu i mali restoran.&nbsp;Struju, vodu i telefon je moguce prikljuciti, a do parcele je uredjen put.</p>\r\n<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;">CIJENA SNI®ENA SA 120.000 EURA!!</span></p>', '<p>We are able to offer this stunning building land on the North side of the island, with a beautiful views of the sea.&nbsp;The plot has a surface of 1000 m2 and is located only 100 m from the sea, but elevated to give spectacular views of the wild and secluded sea and shore on this side of the island.&nbsp;It is located on the edge of a small village and permission is for the construction of a family house.&nbsp;The bay has a shop and a small restaurant.</p>\r\n<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;">PRICE REDUCED FROM 120.000 EURO!!</span></p>', '', '<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;"><strong>CIJENA SNI®ENA SA 120.000 EURA!!</strong></span></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Gradjevinsko zemljiste stambene namjene na sjevernoj strani otoka Hvara, s predivnim pogledom na more.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Zemljiste ima povrsinu 1000 m2, te je udaljeno samo 100 m od mora.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nalazi se u zoni za gradnju obiteljskih kuca.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nalazi se u uvali koja ima trgovinu i mali restoran.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Struju, vodu i telefon je moguce prikljuciti, a do parcele je uredjen put.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Svega 3 km od veceg mjesta.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Grad Hvar je 25 km udaljen.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za dodatne informacije molimo kontaktirajte nas ured.&nbsp;</p>', '<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;"><strong>PRICE REDUCED FROM 120.000 EURO!!</strong></span></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>We are able to offer this stunning building land on the North side of the island, with a beautiful views of the sea.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The plot has a surface of 1000 m2 and is located only 100 m from the sea, but elevated to give spectacular views of the wild and secluded sea and shore on this side of the island.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is located on the edge of a small village and permission is for the construction of a family house.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The bay has a shop and a small restaurant.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Electricity, water and telephone is not far and can be connected to the plot with little extra cost.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There is a road access to the land.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The area is only 3 km from larger towns with many more options of shops, bars and restaurants.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There is an excellent road, suitable for cycling, each way.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The town of Hvar is 25 km away.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For further information, please contact our office, and we will be pleased to arrange a tour of the property for you.</p>', '', '1442_Land-plot_0.JPG', '1442_Land-plot_1.JPG', '1442_Land-plot_2.jpg', '1442_Land-plot_3.jpg', '1442_Land-plot_4.jpg', '', '', '', ''),
(1444, 'Tomislav', '©ijan', '', '098311904', 'tomislav.sijan@gmail.com', 'Trogir', 'Matije Gubca 10  Trogir, k.è. 640', 'For sale', 'Old stone house', '100', '0', '72', 1, '185000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 4, 3, 'November 10, 2015', '<p>Kompletno renovirana i luksuzno namje&scaron;tena stara kamena kuæa u srcu starog dijela Trogira uvr&scaron;tenog pod UNESCO-vu za&scaron;titu.&nbsp;Iako se nalazi u samom centru u blizini Rive, smje&scaron;tena je u mirnoj ulici. Tijekom cijelog dana je osunèana zbog jugozapadne orijentacije.&nbsp;Kuæa se sastoji od 3 odvojene jedinice koje su trenutno u funkciji turistièkog iznajmljivanja.&nbsp;Ukupna stambena povr&scaron;ina iznosi 72 m2.</p>', '<p>We are offering a completely renovated and luxuriously furnished old stone house in the heart of the old city of Trogir. It is situated in the ''UNESCO protected'' part of the town, and although this is hugely popular with tourists, and the street is close to the shore and waterfront, it is still very quiet, being in a ''pedestrian only'' zone. During the day it is nice and sunny-due to its south-west orientation. The building consists of 3 separate apartments that are currently operating for tourist renting. Total floor area is 72 m2.</p>', '', '<p>Kompletno renovirana i luksuzno namje&scaron;tena stara kamena kuæa u srcu starog dijela Trogira uvr&scaron;tenog pod UNESCO-vu za&scaron;titu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Iako se nalazi u samom centru, u blizini Rive, smje&scaron;tena je u mirnoj ulici.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Tijekom cijelog dana je osunèana zbog jugozapadne orijentacije.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U centru Trogira se nalaze mnogobrojni restorani, kafiæi i ostali sadr¾aji koji su dovoljni i za najzahtjevnije ukuse.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa se sastoji od 3 odvojene jedinice koje su trenutno u funkciji turistièkog iznajmljivanja. &nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U prizemlju koje ima odvojen vanjski ulaz se nalazi studio apartman (16m2).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na 1.katu se nalazi odvojena jedinica sa sobom i kupaonicom (11m2) i 2-sobni apartman takoðer sa odvojenim ulazom (45m2).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ukupna stambena povr&scaron;ina iznosi 72 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sve jedinice su klimatizirane i ureðene uz mnogo truda i ukusa.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>S obzirom da se radi o centru Trogira, parking je udaljen cca. 70 m od kuæe.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>S obzirom na sve veæu popularnost Trogira i sve du¾u turistièku sezonu, ova nekretnina je izuzetna prilika za ulaganje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ostajemo na usluzi za sva dodatna pitanja.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>We are offering a completely renovated and luxuriously furnished old stone house in the heart of the old city of Trogir.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is situated in the ''UNESCO protected'' part of the town, and although this is hugely popular with tourists, and the street is close to the shore and waterfront, it is still very quiet, being in a ''pedestrian only'' zone.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>During the day it is nice and sunny - due to its south - west orientation.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>In the centre of Trogir, there are numerous restaurants, bars and other attractions, including some of the best restaurants along the entire coast.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>This town is visited and enjoyed by many of the high profile and famous international visitors who come to Croatia and they are well catered for here.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The building consists of 3 separate apartments that are currently operating for tourist renting.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The ground floor, which has a separate outside entrance, there is a studio apartment (16m2).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the 1st floor is a separate flat with 1 bedroom and bathroom (11m2), and on the same floor there is a 2-room apartment also with separate entrance (45m2).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Total floor area is 72 m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>All apartments are air-conditioned and decorated distinctively.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Given that it is a centre of Trogir, parking is located approx. 70 m from the house, but there is vehicle access for heavy deliveries etc.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Due to the increasing popularity of Trogir and because of a prolonged tourist season, this property is a great investment.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>We remain at your disposal for any additional questions, and to arrange to visit this property.</p>', '', '1444_Old-stone-house_0.jpg', '1444_Old-stone-house_1.jpg', '1444_Old-stone-house_2.jpg', '1444_Old-stone-house_3.jpg', '1444_Old-stone-house_4.jpg', '1444_Old-stone-house_5.jpg', '1444_Old-stone-house_6.jpg', '1444_Old-stone-house_7.jpg', '1444_Old-stone-house_8.jpg'),
(1445, 'Penelope and Si', 'Rowling', '', 'peterrowling@hotmail.com ', 'pennyrowling@hotmail.com', 'Makarska', 'Komarna 99 Komarna, 8113/11 k.o. slivno', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '5', '0', '83', 2, '225000', '', 2, 2, 2, 1, 1, 1, 3, 2, 'November 10, 2015', '<p>Croatia Property Sales Vam predstavlja izvrstan apartman u manjem stambenom objektu pokraj mora, smje&scaron;tenom u malom obalnom mjestu sa pogledom na pelje&scaron;ki poluotok.&nbsp;Apartman se nalazi na prvom katu (83,20 m2).&nbsp;Apartman se prodaje u cijelosti namje&scaron;ten (pokuæstvo, posteljina, bijela tehnika, tv) te se uspje&scaron;no iznajmljuje turistima du¾i niz godina sa prosjeènom popunjeno&scaron;æu od 15 tjedana.&nbsp;<br />&nbsp;<br /></p>', '<p>Croatia Property Sales is pleased to offer this wonderful spacious apartment in a low-rise building next to the sea. The property is located in lovely village 80 km south of Makarska, off the coast road and overlooking Peljesac peninsula.&nbsp;This first floor apartment has living area of 83,20 sqm. Large corridor gives the property a spacious feeling.&nbsp;The property is fully furnished (furniture, bed linen, white goods, flat screen tv etc.) and has been successfully rented to tourists over the years with an average occupancy of 15 weeks.&nbsp;</p>', '', '<p><strong>Izvrstan apartman u prvom redu do mora sa pogledom na Pelje&scaron;ac</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Croatia Property Sales Vam predstavlja izvrstan apartman u manjem stambenom objektu pokraj mora, smje&scaron;tenom u malom obalnom mjestu sa pogledom na pelje&scaron;ki poluotok.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartman se nalazi na prvom katu (83,20 m2) i sastoji se od 3 spavaæe sobe, 2 kupaonice, dvevnog boravka sa blagovaonicom i kuhinjom te balkona sa kojeg se pru¾a pogled na more i pla¾u.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Veliki hodnik daje nekretnini osjeæaj prostranosti.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartman se prodaje u cijelosti namje&scaron;ten (pokuæstvo, posteljina, bijela tehnika, tv) te se uspje&scaron;no iznajmljuje turistima du¾i niz godina sa prosjeènom popunjeno&scaron;æu od 15 tjedana.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Vlasnici i njihova obitelj u sezoni mogu besplatno koristiti zatvoreni bazen, saunu i teretanu.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ovo malo tiho mjesto ljeti postaje vrlo ¾ivo turistièko naselje, nudi trgovinu namirnicama, restoran, kafiæ, moguænost najma broda te druge sadr¾aje. &nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za sve dodatne informacije molimo konatktirajte na&scaron; ured u Splitu.&nbsp;</p>', '<p><strong>Lovely seafront apartment near Peljesac</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Croatia Property Sales is pleased to offer this wonderful spacious apartment in a low-rise building next to the sea. The property is located in lovely village 80 km south of Makarska, off the coast road and overlooking Peljesac peninsula.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>This first floor apartment has living area of 83,20 sqm, and contains 3 bedrooms, 2 bathrooms, open-plan living area with dining room and kitchen and balcony with sea/beach views.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Large corridor gives the property a spacious feeling.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property is fully furnished (furniture, bed linen, white goods, flat screen tv etc.) and has been successfully rented to tourists over the years with an average occupancy of 15 weeks.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Owners and their family members can use the indoor pool in the high season free of charge (pool, sauna, gym, bar).&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>This small village is sleepy in the winter, but in the season it becomes lively holiday resort.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There is a grocery shop, restaurant, caffe bar, rent-a-boat and other services.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For further information please contact our office in Split.&nbsp;</p>', '', '1445_Apartment_0.jpg', '1445_Apartment_1.jpg', '1445_Apartment_2.jpg', '1445_Apartment_3.jpg', '1445_Apartment_4.jpg', '1445_Apartment_5.jpg', '1445_Apartment_6.jpg', '1445_Apartment_7.jpg', '');
INSERT INTO `nekretnina` (`id`, `ime`, `prezime`, `telefon`, `mobitel`, `e_mail`, `lokacija_id`, `adresa`, `status_id`, `vrsta_id`, `udaljenost`, `povrsina`, `stambenapovrsina`, `display`, `cijena`, `cijenatocka`, `ponuda_tjedna`, `new_built`, `must_sell`, `prvi_red_do_mora`, `pogled_na_more`, `bazen`, `broj_soba`, `broj_kupatila`, `datum`, `title_hr`, `title_en`, `title_ge`, `opis_hr`, `opis_en`, `opis_ge`, `PropertyImageURL0`, `PropertyImageURL1`, `PropertyImageURL2`, `PropertyImageURL3`, `PropertyImageURL4`, `PropertyImageURL5`, `PropertyImageURL6`, `PropertyImageURL7`, `PropertyImageURL8`) VALUES
(1446, '', 'Samo Legnar', '0038641663074', '0038641268095', 'posedarje2014@gmail.com', 'Zadar', 'Posedarje, Dio 923/1, 923/6, 924/2, dio 924/3 Ko Posedarje', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '60', '500', '90', 1, '175000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 2, 2, 'November 10, 2015', '<p>Interesantna kuæa od 90 m2, udaljena samo 60 m od mora, u manjem gradiæu, idealna za ljetni odmor, u blizii svih sadr¾aja (trgovine, restorani, kafiæi...).&nbsp;Kuæa se sastoji od prizemlja i kata sa odvojenim ulazima.&nbsp;Kuæa se nalazi na parceli od cca 500 m2, vrt je kutiviran i ureðen, ima puno zelenila i zraèi mediteranskim ugoðajem. U vrtu je vrtni ro&scaron;tilj tj. komin/ljetna kuhinja.&nbsp;Uz kuæu dolazi i vez za brod te pristup kamenoj pla¾i koju uglavnom koriste samo vlasnici.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>Very interesting house of 90 sqm, only 60 m to the sea in a smaller town, ideal for a nice and quiet summer vacation, close to all amenities (shops, restaurants, cafe bars...).&nbsp;It consists of two floors and each floor has its own entrance.&nbsp;The house is on the plot of ca 500 sqm, the garden is cultivated and nicely done with a feeling of the real green Mediterranean garden. There is a barbecue in the garden as well (summer kitchen).&nbsp;There is a boat mooring that belongs to the house and also the access to the stone beach that mostly use current owners.</p>', '', '<p>Interesantna kuæa od 90 m2, udaljena samo 60 m od mora, u manjem gradiæu, idealna za ljetni odmor, u blizii svih sadr¾aja (trgovine, restorani, kafiæi...).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa se sastoji od prizemlja i kata sa odvojenim ulazima.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Prizemlje od 45 m2 sastoji se od kuhinnje, dnevnog boravka, spavaæe sobe i kupaonice sa natkrivenom vanjskom terason od 25 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na katu se nalaze kuhinja sa dnevnim boravkom, spavaæa soba i kupaonice sa terasom od 20 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa se nalazi na parceli od cca 500 m2, vrt je kutiviran i ureðen, ima puno zelenila i zraèi mediteranskim ugoðajem.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U vrtu je vrtni ro&scaron;tilj tj. komin/ljetna kuhinja.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Uz kuæu dolazi i vez za brod te pristup kamenoj pla¾i koju uglavnom koriste samo vlasnici.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Osiguran parking za dva do tri auta.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa se nalazi 18 km od grada Zadra te najbli¾eg aerodroma, a u blizini je nacionalnog parka Paklenica koji pru¾a mno&scaron;tvo zabavnih i dodatnih aktivnosti.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za dodatne informacije molimo kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured u Splitu.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>Very interesting house of 90 sqm, only 60 m to the sea in a smaller town, ideal for a nice and quiet summer vacation, close to all amenities (shops, restaurants, cafe bars...).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It consists of two floors and each floor has its own entrance.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The ground floor is 45 sqm and it consists of kitchen, living room, bedroom and bathroom with a terrace of 25 sqm.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The first floor consists of a kitchen with dining/living room, bedroom, bathroom and a terrace of 20 sqm.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house is on the land plot of ca 500 sqm, the garden is cultivated and nicely done with a feeling of the real green Mediterranean garden.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There is a barbecue in the garden as well (summer kitchen).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There is a boat mooring that belongs to the house and also the access to the stone beach that mostly use current owners.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Parking places for two or three cars.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house is only 18 km from Zadar which is the nearest airport and it is also close to Paklenica National Park which offers different and interesting additional activities.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For further information please contact our office in Split.&nbsp;</p>', '', '1446_House-Villa_0.jpg', '1446_House-Villa_1.jpg', '1446_House-Villa_2.jpg', '1446_House-Villa_3.jpg', '1446_House-Villa_4.jpg', '1446_House-Villa_5.jpg', '1446_House-Villa_6.jpg', '1446_House-Villa_7.jpg', '1446_House-Villa_8.jpg'),
(1447, 'Terezija', 'Janez Mercun', '', ' 0038641718424', '', 'Hvar', ' Domobranska 50A  Stari Grad, 7440/3', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '200', '0', '55', 1, '89000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 1, 'November 11, 2015', '<p>Prodaju se stanovi od 55 m2 u dvojnoj apartmanskoj kuæi blizu mora.&nbsp;Kuæa se sastoji od prizemlja, prvog i drugog kata te potkrovlja.&nbsp;Ju¾no je orijentirana.&nbsp;Nekretnina se nalazi u mirnoj lokaciji na sunèanoj strani.&nbsp;Svaki kat ima jednosoban stan s balkonom na jugu i jedan studio apartman s balkonom orijentiranim prema jugozapadu.</p>\r\n<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;">CIJENA SNI®ENA SA 100.000 &euro;!!</span></p>', '<p>For sale we have 55 sqm apartments in a semi-detached house near the sea.&nbsp;The building comprises of a ground floor, first and second floor and attick.&nbsp;It is south-oriented.&nbsp;Each floor has 1-bedroom apartment with balcony facing south as well as studio apartments with balcony facing south-west.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;">PRICE REDUCED FROM 100.000 &euro;!!</span></p>', '', '<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;"><strong>CIJENA SNI®ENA SA 100.000 &euro;!!</strong></span></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Prodaju se stanovi od 55 m2 u dvojnoj apartmanskoj kuæi blizu mora.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa se sastoji od prizemlja, prvog i drugog kata te potkrovlja.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ju¾no je orijentirana.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nekretnina se nalazi u mirnoj lokaciji na sunèanoj strani.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Stan u prizemlju se sastoji od jedne spavaæe sobe, kupaonice, dnevnog boravka s kuhinjom i blagovaonicom, spremi&scaron;ta te balkona.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Stanovi na prvom i drugom katu imaju isti raspored.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Svaki kat ima jednosoban stan s balkonom na jugu i jedan studio apartman s balkonom orijentiranim prema jugozapadu. &nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa ima pristup vozilom te parking za 4 automobila.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na krovu je postavljena toplinska pumpa.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Udaljenost od mora i pla¾a je 200 m.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Centar grada je udaljen 15 minuta pje&scaron;ice.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Do trajekta 6 minuta vo¾nje.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za dodatne informacije molimo kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured.&nbsp;</p>', '<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;"><strong>PRICE REDUCED FROM 100.000 &euro;!!</strong></span></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For sale we have 55 sqm apartments in a semi-detached house near the sea.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The building comprises of a ground floor, first and second floor and attick.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is south-oriented.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property is located in a peaceful area and enjoys the sunny position.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ground floor apartment contains 1 bedrooms, bathroom, living room with kitchen and dining room, storage and balcony.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Frist and second floor units have the same layout.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Each floor has 1-bedroom apartment with balcony facing south as well as studio apartments with balcony facing southwest.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The buildng has car access and 4 parking places.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>A heating pump is mounted on the roof.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The sea and the beach are 200 meters away.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The center of the town is only 15 min walk from the property.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There are 6 minutes car ride to the ferry port.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For more information, please contact our office. &nbsp;</p>', '', '1447_Apartment_0.jpg', '1447_Apartment_1.jpg', '1447_Apartment_2.jpg', '1447_Apartment_3.jpg', '1447_Apartment_4.jpg', '1447_Apartment_5.jpg', '1447_Apartment_6.jpg', '1447_Apartment_7.jpg', '1447_Apartment_8.jpg'),
(1448, '', 'Sunce R d.o.o.Vara¾d', '', '', '', 'Hvar', 'Stari Grad  Centar &#8211;ulica unutar mjesta', 'For sale', 'Old stone house', '50', '0', '100', 1, '249000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 8, 4, 'November 11, 2015', '<p>Stara kamena kuca u nizu za renovaciju, udaljena od mora samo 50 m.&nbsp;Kuæa se sastoji od prizemlja, prvog, drugog i treæeg kata ukupne stambene povr&scaron;ine 100 m2.&nbsp;U prizemlju se nalazi stara konoba koja je bila preuredjena u restoran.&nbsp;Na prvom,drugom i treæem katu su sobe te po jedna kupaonica na svakom.&nbsp;Orijentirana sjeverozapadno.&nbsp;Kuæa je idealna za izgradnju hostela.</p>', '<p>We are offering this old stone house, in need of re-decorating, in the town centre, 50m from the sea. The house consists of a ground floor, first, second and third floor with atotal floor area of 100 m2.&nbsp;The ground floor is an old bar/tavern that has been converted into a restaurant.&nbsp;On the first, second and third floor are bedrooms with one bathroom on each floor.&nbsp;</p>', '', '<p>Stara kamena kuca u nizu za renovaciju, udaljena od mora samo 50 m.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa se sastoji od prizemlja, prvog, drugog i treæeg kata ukupne stambene povr&scaron;ine &nbsp;100 m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U prizemlju se nalazi stara konoba koja je bila preuredjena u restoran.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na prvom, drugom i trecem katu su sobe i te po jedna kupaonica na svakom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Orijentirana sjeverozapadno.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je idealna za izgradnju hostela.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nalazi se na odlicnoj lokaciji.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Trajektna luka u blizini.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za dodatne informacije molimo kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>We are offering this old stone house, in need of re-decorating, in the town centre, 50m from the sea.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house consists of a ground floor, first, second and third floor with a total floor area of 100 m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The ground floor is an old bar/tavern that has been converted into a restaurant.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the first, second and third floor are bedrooms with one bathroom on each floor.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The orientation of the property is north-west.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property is in a great location, in the centre of the largest village on the island and conveniently close to shops, bars, restaurants and other services and facilities.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The Ferry port is nearby, and in addition the fast catamaran and island sea plane both connect the island to Split.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For further information, please contact our office, and we can arrange a tour of the property.</p>', '', '1448_Old-stone-house_0.JPG', '1448_Old-stone-house_1.JPG', '1448_Old-stone-house_2.JPG', '1448_Old-stone-house_3.JPG', '1448_Old-stone-house_4.JPG', '1448_Old-stone-house_5.JPG', '1448_Old-stone-house_6.JPG', '1448_Old-stone-house_7.JPG', '1448_Old-stone-house_8.JPG'),
(1449, 'Slavenka', 'Svab', '765747  Glasinovic', '0912541820', '', 'Hvar', 'Stari Grad', 'For sale', 'Old stone house', '2000', '50', '300', 1, '250000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 6, 6, 'November 11, 2015', '<p>Stara kamena kuæa na tri eta¾e u centru grada.&nbsp;Svaka soba ima prekrasan pogled na zidine te na prostrani vrt obogaæen mediterasnkim biljem.&nbsp;Kuæa je ju¾no orijentirana.&nbsp;U dobrom je stanju i useljiva.&nbsp;Prizemlje se sastoji od stana s prekrasnom terasom/dvori&scaron;tem s kojeg se pru¾a pogled na vrt.&nbsp;Na prvom katu su 3 dvokrevetne sobe s kupaonicama, a na drugom katu su 2 studio apartmana.&nbsp;Ukupna stambena povr&scaron;ina kuæe iznosi 300 m2.</p>', '<p>We are pleased to present this stone house on 3 floors in the Old Town.&nbsp;Each room has lovely views on the ancient walls and spacious garden full of Mediterranean plants.&nbsp;The house is south-oriented, in a good condition and habitable.&nbsp;Ground floor hosts an apartment, featuring beautiful terrace the views on the garden.&nbsp;On the first floor there are 3 double bedrooms with bathrooms, while the second floor hosts two studio apartments.&nbsp;Total living size is 300 sqm and the property is connected to all utilities.&nbsp;</p>', '', '<p><strong>Unikatna nekretnina u povijesnom dijelu grada</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Stara kamena kuæa na tri eta¾e u centru grada.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Svaka soba ima prekrasan pogled na zidine te na prostrani vrt obogaæen mediterasnkim biljem.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je ju¾no orijentirana.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U dobrom je stanju i useljiva.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ukoliko bi se novi vlasnik odluèio za iznajmljivanje, bila bi joj potrebna modernizacija. &nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Prizemlje se sastoji od stana s prekrasnom terasom/dvori&scaron;tem s kojeg se pru¾a pogled na vrt.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na prvom katu su 3 dvokrevetne sobe s kupaonicama, a na drugom katu su 2 studio apartmana.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ukupna stambena povr&scaron;ina kuæe iznosi 300 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Prisutna sva infrastruktura.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa se nalazi na mirnoj lokaciji, a u blizini svih potrebnih sadr¾aja (pla¾a, trgovina, restorana...).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Trajektna luka udaljena je 20 min. hoda.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za sve dodatne informacije molimo kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured.&nbsp;</p>', '<p><strong>Unique property in the Old Town</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>We are pleased to present this stone house on 3 floors in the Old Town.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Each room has lovely views on the ancient walls and spacious garden full of Mediterranean plants.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house is south-oriented, in a good condition and habitable.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>If the new owner would consider doing tourist rental, the property would most likely need to be upgraded.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ground floor hosts an apartment, featuring beautiful terrace the views on the garden.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the first floor there are 3 double bedrooms with bathrooms, while the second floor hosts two studio apartments.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Total living size is 300 sqm and the property is connected to all utilities.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house is in a peaceful location, yet in a walking distance to all amenities (shops, restaurants, beaches...).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The ferry port is only 20 min away on foot.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For more information please contact our office.&nbsp;</p>', '', '1449_Old-stone-house_0.jpg', '1449_Old-stone-house_1.jpg', '1449_Old-stone-house_2.jpg', '1449_Old-stone-house_3.jpg', '1449_Old-stone-house_4.jpg', '1449_Old-stone-house_5.jpg', '1449_Old-stone-house_6.jpg', '1449_Old-stone-house_7.jpg', '1449_Old-stone-house_8.jpg'),
(1450, 'Mario ', 'Skarpa', '', '', '', 'Hvar', 'Stari Grad', 'For sale', 'Old stone house', '200', '350', '364', 1, '270000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 6, 3, 'November 11, 2015', '<p>Velika stara kamena kuæa u centru grada s prostranim vrtom, ju¾no orijentirana.&nbsp;Kuæa je idealna za ureðenje hostela ili hotela.&nbsp;Sastoji se od prizemlja, prvog kata, drugog kata i potkrovlja, ukupne stambene povr&scaron;ine 364 m2.&nbsp;Potkrovlje (70 m2) zahtijeva kompletnu renovaciju.&nbsp;Povr&scaron;ina zemlji&scaron;ta je 350 m2.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>Large stone house in the town''s center, south-oriented with spacious garden.&nbsp;The house comprises of a ground floor, first and second floor and attick, sized 364 sqm all together.&nbsp;The attick is sized 70 sqm and it needs complete renovation.&nbsp;Land plot is slized 350 sqm and hosts 2 small auxiliary houses.&nbsp;</p>', '', '<p>Velika stara kamena kuæa u centru grada s prostranim vrtom, ju¾no orijentirana.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je idealna za ureðenje hostela ili hotela.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sastoji se od prizemlja, prvog kata, drugog kata i potkrovlja, ukupne stambene povr&scaron;ine 364 m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Prizemlje se sastoji od kuhinje, blagovaonice, spavaæe sobe, kupaonice i podruma ukupne povr&scaron;ine 112 m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na prvom katu se nalaze 3 spavaæe sobe, kupaonica i terasa ukupne povr&scaron;ine 105 m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Drugi kat se sastoji od 2 spavaæe sobe, kupaonice i kuhinje (77 m2).&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Potkrovlje (70 m2) zahtijeva kompletnu renovaciju.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Povr&scaron;ina zemlji&scaron;ta je 350 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U vrtu postoje jos dvije manje kuæice.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za dodatne informacije molimo kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>Large stone house in the town''s center, south-oriented with spacious garden.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property has great potential to become hostel or a small boutique hotel.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house comprises of a ground floor, first and second floor and attick, sized 364 sqm all together.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the ground floor there is a kitchen, dining room, bedroom, bathroom and basement, sized 112 sqm in total.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>First floor hosts 3 bedrooms, bathroom and terrace, sized 105 sqm in total.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the second floor there are 2 bedrooms, bathroom and kitchen, sized 77 sqm.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The attick is sized 70 sqm and it needs complete renovation.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Land plot is slized 350 sqm and hosts 2 small auxiliary houses.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact our office for more information.&nbsp;</p>', '', '1450_Old-stone-house_0.jpg', '1450_Old-stone-house_1.jpg', '1450_Old-stone-house_2.jpg', '1450_Old-stone-house_3.jpg', '1450_Old-stone-house_4.jpg', '1450_Old-stone-house_5.jpg', '1450_Old-stone-house_6.jpg', '1450_Old-stone-house_7.jpg', '1450_Old-stone-house_8.jpg'),
(1451, 'Jure', 'Caratan (Nik¹a)', '', '0958917069', '', 'Hvar', '', 'For sale', 'Land plot', '70', '1260', '0', 1, '252000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 0, 0, 'November 11, 2015', '<p>Graðevno zemlji&scaron;te na ju¾noj strani otoka, samo 70 m od mora i pla¾e.&nbsp;Sa zemlji&scaron;ta se pru¾a prekrasan pogled na more i otoke.&nbsp;Ima povr&scaron;inu 1260 m2, te je ju¾ne orijentacije.&nbsp;U blizini zemlji&scaron;ta se nalaze svi potrebni sadr¾aji (restoran, trgovina...).&nbsp;Infrastruktura odmah do zemlji&scaron;ta.&nbsp;Moguæe je kupiti i dio zemlji&scaron;ta.&nbsp;Cijena 200 eura/m2.</p>', '<p>Building plot on the south side of Hvar island, only 70 m from the sea and the beach.&nbsp;A beautiful view on the sea and the islands spreads from the plot.&nbsp;The land is south-oriented and has a surface of 1.260 sqm.&nbsp;All amenities (shop, restaurant...) are at walking distance to the property.&nbsp;Infrastructure (water, electricity) nearby.&nbsp;It is possible to buy only a part of the plot.&nbsp;It is priced 200 EUR/sqm.&nbsp;</p>', '', '<p>Graðevno zemlji&scaron;te na ju¾noj strani otoka, samo 70 m od mora i pla¾e.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sa zemlji&scaron;ta se pru¾a prekrasan pogled na more i otoke.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ima povr&scaron;inu 1260 m2, te je ju¾ne orijentacije.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U blizini zemlji&scaron;ta se nalaze svi potrebni sadr¾aji (restoran, trgovina...).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Infrastruktura odmah do zemlji&scaron;ta.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Moguæe je kupiti i dio zemlji&scaron;ta.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Cijena 200 eura/m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za dodatne informacije molimo kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>Building plot on the south side of Hvar island, only 70 m from the sea and the beach.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>A beautiful view on the sea and the islands spreads from the plot.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The land is south oriented and has a surface of 1.260 sqm.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>All amenities (shop, restaurant...) are at walking distance to the property.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Infrastructure (water, electricity) nearby.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is possible to buy only a part of the plot.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is priced 200 EUR/sqm.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For more information please contact our office. &nbsp;</p>', '', '1451_Land-plot_0.jpg', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(1452, 'Milena', '©ipek', '', '091/569-1249', '', 'Split', 'Branimrova Obala 10  Split', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '10', '0', '123', 2, '553000', '', 2, 2, 2, 1, 1, 2, 4, 2, 'November 11, 2015', '<p>Dva atraktivna apartmana u prvom redu do mora.&nbsp;Nalaze se u jednoj od najpopularnijih èetvrti Splita i u¾ivaju lagan pristup cjelogodi&scaron;njim sadr¾ajima (restoranima, kafiæima, muzejima, javnom prijevozu i pla¾ama) &scaron;to ih èini atraktivnim kako za ¾ivljenje tako i za turistièki najam.&nbsp;Imaju odvojene ulaze, a dijeli ih pregradni zid.&nbsp;Apartmani ukupno imaju 123 m2 stambene povr&scaron;ine, a apartmanu s ju¾ne strane pripada i dio od 7 m2 koji se mo¾e ograditi.</p>', '<p>We are offering this very rare opportunity to buy two modern apartments in the first row to the sea in the town centre of Split. These two apartments - for sale within the same block - are located on the new Riva, with views of the marina, and the main port, as well as further out to sea towards Brac Island from all the front windows. Both apartments are on the same floor and have separate entrances.&nbsp;The apartments have a total of 123 m2 of living space.</p>', '', '<p><strong>Dva atraktivna apartmana u prvom redu do mora</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nalaze se u jednoj od najpopularnijih èetvrti Splita i u¾ivaju lagan pristup cjelogodi&scaron;njim sadr¾ajima (restoranima, kafiæima, muzejima, javnom prijevozu i pla¾ama) &scaron;to ih èini atraktivnim kako za ¾ivljenje tako i za turistièki najam.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartmani se uspje&scaron;no unajmljuju turistima i buduæem vlasniku osiguravaju znaèajan prihod.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ova 2 apartmana se nalaze na istoj razini (visokom prizemlju).&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Imaju odvojene ulaze, a dijeli ih pregradni zid.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartmani ukupno imaju 123 m2 stambene povr&scaron;ine, a apartmanu s ju¾ne strane pripada i dio od 7 m2 koji se mo¾e ograditi.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Svaki se sastoji od 2 spavaæe sobe iz kojih se pru¾a prekrasan pogled na more, kuhinje, blagovaonice s dnevnim boravkom i kupaonice.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Imaju visoke stropove, te su renovirani 2000. godine.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Postoji moguænost izgradnje jo&scaron; jedne kupaonice.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Vlasniku pripada i vanjska ostava.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nekretnina je jedna od rijetkih u samom centru grada sa pristupom automobilom.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za dodatne informacije molimo kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured u Splitu.</p>', '<p>We are offering this very rare opportunity to buy two modern apartments in the first row to the sea in the town centre of Split.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>These two apartments - for sale within the same block - are located on the new Riva, with views of the marina, and the main port, as well as further out to sea towards Brac Island from all the front windows.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>From the property all the main historic and cultural attractions are within a short walking distance, as well as most of the best restaurants, the ferry port, other public transport, shops and bars, beaches and the town park, which makes it ideal for tourism.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The apartments are successfully let to tourists and the new owner could continue to receive a significant revenue.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Both apartments are on the same floor and have separate entrances.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The apartments have a total of 123 m2 of living space.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Each consists of 2 bedrooms which offer breathtaking views, kitchen, dining room, living room and bathroom.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>They have high ceilings and were renovated in 2000.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Elsewhere in the block is a storage room for the owner of this property.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>They have been maintained to a good standard, needing few improvements should the new owner wish to continue renting the apartments to tourists.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property is one of the few in the city centre with access by car.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For further information, please contact our office in Split, and speak with our agents.</p>', '', '1452_Apartment_0.jpg', '1452_Apartment_1.jpg', '1452_Apartment_2.jpg', '1452_Apartment_3.jpg', '1452_Apartment_4.jpg', '1452_Apartment_5.jpg', '1452_Apartment_6.jpg', '1452_Apartment_7.jpg', '1452_Apartment_8.jpg'),
(1453, 'Dominko', 'Kunkiæ', '', '091 180 6961', '', 'Trogir', 'Planikovica VII Okrug Gornji, 1562/5', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '10', '560', '250', 1, '2100000', '', 2, 1, 2, 1, 1, 1, 6, 8, 'November 12, 2015', '<p>Luksuzna vila u novogradnji, potpuno namje&scaron;tena i opremljena, u 1.redu do mora i &scaron;ljunèane pla¾e.&nbsp;Nalazi se na Èiovu, prekrasnom otoku povezanim sa gradom Trogirom, èija je popularnost sve veæa zbog izgradnje novog mosta.&nbsp;Vila je smje&scaron;tena na zemlji&scaron;tu povr&scaron;ine 560 m2, dok je stambena povr&scaron;ina 250 m2.&nbsp;Sastoji se od 4 eta¾e.&nbsp;U dvori&scaron;tu se nalazi bazen, ali i u unutarnjem dijelu vile &scaron;to ovu nekretninu èini jo&scaron; posebnijom.</p>', '<p>Modern ''state of the art'' seafront villa.&nbsp;Luxurious newly built villa next to the sea and the pebble beach, fully furnished and equipped.&nbsp;It is located on Ciovo, a lovely island near Trogir town, connected with the bridge to the mainland. A new bigger bridge is being built, giving Ciovo more popularity among overseas property buyers.&nbsp;The plot is sized 560 sqm and the house has 250 sqm internally.&nbsp;Villa has 4 levels.&nbsp;Oposite to usual building practise, this property comes with 2 pools &ndash; outdoor pool in the garden and indoor pool.&nbsp;</p>', '', '<p><strong>Luksuzna vila u novogradnji, potpuno namje&scaron;tena i opremljena, u 1.redu do mora i &scaron;ljunèane pla¾e</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nalazi se na Èiovu, prekrasnom otoku povezanim sa gradom Trogirom, èija je popularnost sve veæa zbog izgradnje novog mosta.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Do grada Splita je potrebno 40 minuta, dok je udaljenost od meðunarodnog aerodroma 15 minuta.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Vila je smje&scaron;tena na zemlji&scaron;tu povr&scaron;ine 560 m2, dok je stambena povr&scaron;ina 250 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sastoji se od 4 eta¾e &ndash; podrum, suteren, prizemlje i 1.kat.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Eta¾e su zbog terena izgraðene kaskadno, ali se zbog modernog dizajna sve savr&scaron;eno uklopilo.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Potpuno je luksuzno namje&scaron;tena i u funkciji turistièkog iznajmljivanja.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Trenutno je za najam licencirana sa 4 zvjezdice, ali je u ishoðenju licenca sa 5 zvjezdica.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U dvori&scaron;tu se nalazi bazen, ali i u unutarnjem dijelu vile &scaron;to ovu nekretninu èini jo&scaron; posebnijom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ima ukupno 6 spavaæih soba, 8 kupaonica, saunu, 2 prostorije za rekreaciju gdje se nalaze sprave za vje¾banje i stol za biljar, prostranu kuhinju sa blagovaonicom i dnevnim dijelom i 2 terase sa pogledom na more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U dvori&scaron;tu se nalazi parking za 4 automobila.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>*** Na prodaju je takoðer i vila u 2.redu koja je potpuno ista kao i ova.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Stojimo na raspolaganju za dodatne slike i tlocrte ukoliko ste zainteresirani za ovu jedinstvenu i modernu nekretninu.</p>', '<p><strong>Modern ''state of the art'' seafront villa</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Luxurious newly built villa next to the sea and the pebble beach, fully furnished and equipped.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is located on Ciovo, a lovely island near Trogir town, connected with the bridge to the mainland.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>A new bigger bridge is being built, giving Ciovo more popularity among overseas property buyers.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It takes only 15 minutes by car to reach Split international airpiort and 40 minutes to get to Split city.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The plot is sized 560 sqm and the house has 250 sqm internally.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Villa has 4 levels &ndash; basement, semi-interred floor, ground floor and first floor.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Construction is of cascade type due to steep land, but the modern composition ensured a perfect architectural success.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property is fully furnished and rented to tourists, currently ranking 4 stars.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Oposite to usual building practise, this property comes with 2 pools &ndash; outdoor pool in the garden and indoor pool.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There are 6 bedrooms, 8 bathrooms, 2 recreational rooms (gym and pool), spacious kitchen with dining room, living room and 2 terraces with sea views.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There is a parking for 4 cars on the site.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>***Identical villa in the second line to the sea is also for sale.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>We are at your disposal for more images, floorplans and any questions you may have on this fabulous property.&nbsp;</p>', '', '1453_House-Villa_0.jpg', '1453_House-Villa_1.jpg', '1453_House-Villa_2.jpg', '1453_House-Villa_3.jpg', '1453_House-Villa_4.jpg', '1453_House-Villa_5.jpg', '1453_House-Villa_6.jpg', '1453_House-Villa_7.jpg', '1453_House-Villa_8.jpg'),
