p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Potpuno je luksuzno namje&scaron;tena i u funkciji turistièkog iznajmljivanja.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Trenutno je za najam licencirana sa 4 zvjezdice, ali je u ishoðenju licenca sa 5 zvjezdica.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U dvori&scaron;tu se nalazi bazen, ali i u unutarnjem dijelu vile &scaron;to ovu nekretninu èini jo&scaron; posebnijom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ima ukupno 6 spavaæih soba, 8 kupaonica, saunu, 2 prostorije za rekreaciju gdje se nalaze sprave za vje¾banje i stol za biljar, prostranu kuhinju sa blagovaonicom i dnevnim dijelom i 2 terase sa pogledom na more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U dvori&scaron;tu se nalazi parking za 4 automobila.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>*** Na prodaju je takoðer i vila u 1.redu koja je potpuno ista kao i ova.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Stojimo na raspolaganju za dodatne slike i tlocrte ukoliko ste zainteresirani za ovu jedinstvenu i modernu nekretninu.</p>', '<p><strong>Modern ''state of the art'' villa in the second line to the sea</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Luxurious newly built villa 35 meters from the sea and the pebble beach, fully furnished and equipped.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is located on Ciovo, a lovely island near Trogir town, connected with the bridge to the mainland.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>A new bigger bridge is being built, giving Ciovo more popularity among overseas property buyers.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It takes only 15 minutes by car to reach Split international airpiort and 40 minutes to get to Split city.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The plot is sized 541 sqm and the house has 250 sqm internally.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Villa has 4 levels &ndash; basement, semi-interred floor, ground floor and first floor.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Construction is of cascade type due to steep land, but the modern composition ensured a perfect architectural success.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property is fully furnished and rented to tourists, currently ranking 4 stars.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Oposite to usual building practise, this property comes with 2 pools &ndash; outdoor pool in the garden and indoor pool.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There are 6 bedrooms, 8 bathrooms, 2 recreational rooms (gym and pool), spacious kitchen with dining room, living room and 2 terraces with sea views.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There is a parking for 4 cars on the site.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Identical villa in the first line to the sea is also for sale.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>We are at your disposal for more images, floorplans and any questions you may have on this fabulous property.</p>', '', '1454_House-Villa_0.jpg', '1454_House-Villa_1.jpg', '1454_House-Villa_2.jpg', '1454_House-Villa_3.jpg', '1454_House-Villa_4.jpg', '1454_House-Villa_5.jpg', '1454_House-Villa_6.jpg', '1454_House-Villa_7.jpg', '1454_House-Villa_8.jpg'),
(1457, 'Dragica', 'Bulj', '', '099 2380 547', 'Drazen.bulj@evoco.hr', 'Trogir', 'Mira Bare¹iæa 87  Seget Vranjica, 436 k.o. Seget Vranjica', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '35', '997', '130', 1, '600000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 4, 2, 'November 12, 2015', '<p>Kuæa na prostranom zemlji&scaron;tu u 2. redu do mora sa privatnim vezom za brod.&nbsp;Ukupna povr&scaron;ina zemlji&scaron;ta je 997 m2, dok je stambena povr&scaron;ina kuæe 130 m2 + pomoæna 70 m2 + 2 terase 170 m2.&nbsp;Vrt je prepun pomno biranih stabala i biljaka i dovoljno je prostran za izgradnju bazena.&nbsp;Kuæa ima 2 eta¾e, ali su zbog nagnutog terena obe eta¾e prizemne. Svaka eta¾a ima po 1 apartman sa odvojenim vanjskim ulazom.</p>', '<p>Second line to the sea &ndash; a house on large plot with private mooring.&nbsp;The sea and the rocky beach are only 35 meters away from this lovely holiday home. The village center, offering nice pebble beaches, is 2 minutes away on foot.&nbsp;The total size of the plot equals to 997 sqm, while the house has 130 sqm internally, plus auxiliary object of 70 sqm as well as 170 sqm of the terraces around the house.&nbsp;The house has 2 floors, but due to lop-sided land both of them appear to be on the ground floor. Each floor contains one apartment with its own separate entrance.&nbsp;</p>', '', '<p><strong>Kuæa na prostranom zemlji&scaron;tu u 2. redu do mora sa privatnim vezom za brod</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>More i kamenita pla¾a su udaljeni 35 m od kuæe, dok je sami centar mjesta 2 minute pje&scaron;ke.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U mjestu se takoðer nalaze i prekrasne &scaron;ljunèane pla¾e.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nalazi se u malom mjestu udaljenom 10 minuta zapadno od grada Trogira.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Do popularnog Splita je potrebno 30 minuta, gdje se ujedno nalazi i trajektna luka.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ukupna povr&scaron;ina zemlji&scaron;ta je 997 m2, dok je stambena povr&scaron;ina kuæe 130 m2 + pomoæna 70 m2 + 2 terase 170 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa ima i novoizgraðenu gara¾u povr&scaron;ine 50 m2 u kojoj je moguæe parkirati 4 automobila.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Vrt je prepun pomno biranih stabala i biljaka i dovoljno je prostran za izgradnju bazena.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa ima 2 eta¾e, ali su zbog nagnutog terena obe eta¾e prizemne.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Svaka eta¾a ima po 1 apartman sa odvojenim vanjskim ulazom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na 1.eta¾i se nalazi jednosobni, simpatièno dizajniran apartman sa izlazom na terasu povr&scaron;ine 70 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na 2.eta¾i se nalazi dvosoban apartman s terasom od cca. 100 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Iza glavne kuæe je pomoæna zgrada s dvije prostorije, vanjskom kuhinjom s velikim kaminom, te jedna manja gostinjska soba.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je potpuno renovirana 2012. godine gdje se pazilo na svaki detalj.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Podovi su mramorni, dok je u spavaæim sobama egzotièni parket.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ukoliko imate dodatnih pitanja, slobodno nas kontaktirajte.</p>', '<p><strong>Second line to the sea &ndash; a house on large plot with private mooring</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The sea and the rocky beach are only 35 meters away from this lovely holiday home.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The village center, offering nice pebble beaches, is 2 minutes away on foot.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The village is located less than 10 minutes drive west of Trogir town.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It tales about 30 minutes ba car to reach Split city and its ferry port.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The total size of the plot equals to 997 sqm, while the house has 130 sqm internally, plus auxiliary object of 70 sqm as well as 170 sqm of the terraces around the house.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Property features newly built garage sized 50 sqm, spacious enough to host 4 cars.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The garden is planted and well kept, big enough to fit the swimming pool.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house has 2 floors, but due to lop-sided land both of them appear to be on the ground floor.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Each floor contains one apartment with its own separate entrance.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the first level there is a nice 1-bedroom apartment with private terrace of 70 sqm.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the second level there is larger 2-bedroom apartment with private terrace sized 100 sqm.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Behind the house there is auxiliary building with 2 rooms, summer kitchen, BBQ and small guest room.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property was carefully renovated in 2011/2012, paying much attention to all the details.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house has marble flooring in living areas and exotic parquet flooring in the bedrooms.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Feel free to contact us to arrange the viewing.&nbsp;</p>', '', '1457_House-Villa_0.jpg', '1457_House-Villa_1.jpg', '1457_House-Villa_2.jpg', '1457_House-Villa_3.jpg', '1457_House-Villa_4.jpg', '1457_House-Villa_5.jpg', '1457_House-Villa_6.jpg', '1457_House-Villa_7.jpg', '1457_House-Villa_8.jpg'),
(1456, 'Erna', 'Rapiæ', '', '098262751', 'ernarapic@hotmail.com', 'Trogir', 'Obala Mira Bare¹iæa Seget Vranjica, 201/30, 201/150 - zemljisnik', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '10', '582', '335', 1, '3600000', '', 2, 2, 2, 1, 1, 1, 3, 3, 'November 12, 2015', '<p>Luksuzna vila izgraðena 2011. godine, smje&scaron;tena uz samo more i kamenitu pla¾u gdje postoji moguænost privezivanja broda.&nbsp;Ukupna povr&scaron;ina zemlji&scaron;ta iznosi 582 m2, dok je stambena 335 m2. Sastoji se od podruma, prizemlja, 1. i 2.kata.&nbsp;Vila ima ukupno 3 spavaæe sobe, 3 kupaonice, 2 kuhinje sa blagovaonicom i dnevnim boravkom. U podrumu se nalazi sauna i prostorija za rekreaciju. Iz vile se pru¾a pogled na more, ali i prekrasno ureðenu okuænicu i vrt u kojem se nalazi bazen (24 m2) i kamin.</p>', '<p>Spendid villa built in 2001, stone''s throw to the sea and the rocky beach, with mooring for a small boat.&nbsp;The property is located on the south side of peaceful village, less than 10 minutes drive from Trogir (Split airport) and 30 minutes from the city of Split.&nbsp;Villa is successfully rented in high season, but it has great occupancy in low season too, due to high level of furnishing and the kind of luxury that the local market misses.&nbsp;The plot is sized 582 sqm, while the living area equals to 335 sqm on all the floors. The house has 4 level.<br /><br /></p>', '', '<p>Luksuzna vila izgraðena 2011. godine, smje&scaron;tena uz samo more i kamenitu pla¾u gdje postoji moguænost privezivanja broda.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Smje&scaron;tena je na ju¾noj strani simpatiènog mjesta udaljenog 30 min. vo¾nje od grada Splita i 10 min. od Trogira.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U funkciji je turistièkog iznajmljivanja tijekom ljeta, ali i ostatka godine upravo zbog luksuznog nivoa ureðenosti i manjka ovakvih nekretnina na tr¾i&scaron;tu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ukupna povr&scaron;ina zemlji&scaron;ta iznosi 582 m2, dok je stambena 335 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sastoji se od podruma, prizemlja, 1. i 2.kata.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ispred vile se nalazi parking za 4 automobila.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Vila ima ukupno 3 spavaæe sobe, 3 kupaonice, 2 kuhinje sa blagovaonicom i dnevnim boravkom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U podrumu se nalazi sauna i prostorija za rekreaciju.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Iz vile se pru¾a pogled na more, ali i prekrasno ureðenu okuænicu i vrt u kojem se nalazi bazen (24 m2) i kamin.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Opremljena je najsuvremenijim sustavom grijanja i hlaðenja, podnim grijanjem u svim kupaonicama, video nadzorom, alarmom, centralnim usisavaèem i solarnim panelima za grijanje vode.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U ureðenje vile je ulo¾eno jako puno truda da bi se zadovoljio i najfiniji ukus.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ukoliko ¾elite znati vi&scaron;e o ovoj ekskluzivnoj vili, stojimo na raspolaganju za sva dodatna pitanja.</p>', '<p><strong>Luxurious seafront villa at only 15 min drive from Split airport</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Spendid villa built in 2001, stone''s throw to the sea and the rocky beach, with mooring for a small boat.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property is located on the south side of peaceful village, less than 10 minutes drive from Trogir (Split airport) and 30 minutes from the city of Split.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Villa is successfully rented in high season, but it has great occupancy in low season too, due to high level of furnishing and the kind of luxury that the local market misses.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The plot is sized 582 sqm, while the living area equals to 335 sqm on all the floors.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house has 4 levels &ndash; basement, ground floor, first and second floor.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Next to the property there is a parking, comfortable for 4 cars.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There are 3 bedrooms, 3 bathrooms, 2 kitchens with dining room and living room.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sauna and gym are fitted in the basement.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Amazing sea views are spread from all the floors.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The garden is well kept, featuring 24 sqm swimming pool and BBQ.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property has top cooling/heating system throughout, underfloor heating in all the bathrooms, video surveillance and alarm, central vacuum cleaning system and solar pannels.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>A lot of effort has been put in internal decoration to comply with the most demanding and refined taste.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>We are at your disposal for any questions you may have on this property.&nbsp;</p>', '', '1456_House-Villa_0.jpg', '1456_House-Villa_1.jpg', '1456_House-Villa_2.jpg', '1456_House-Villa_3.jpg', '1456_House-Villa_4.jpg', '1456_House-Villa_5.jpg', '1456_House-Villa_6.jpg', '1456_House-Villa_7.jpg', '1456_House-Villa_8.JPG'),
(1458, 'Lenka', 'Modriniæ', '', '091 883 7516', 'lenni.modrinic@hi.t-com.hr', 'Korcula', 'Oskoru¹ica, 9458 i 9457/1', 'For sale', 'Land plot', '10', '1037', '0', 1, '186660', '', 2, 2, 2, 1, 1, 2, 0, 0, 'November 13, 2015', '<p>Graðevinsko zemlji&scaron;te smje&scaron;teno u prvom redu do mora, na sjevernoj strani otoka, zapadno od grada Korèule.&nbsp;Sa zemlji&scaron;ta se pru¾a prekrasan pogled na more i pelje&scaron;ki kanal. Nalazi se samo 10 m od mora, nadomak male pla¾e i kamenih mostova. Na zemlji&scaron;tu povr&scaron;ine 1037 m2 postoji moguænost izgradnje stepenastog oblika kako bi se zgrada uzdignula na bre¾uljku. Cesta se nalazi uz teren koji se pru¾a sunèanom stranom.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>We are offering this rare opportunity to buy a seafront building plot of 1037 m2, on the northern side of the island of Korcula, west of the town. It is blessed with beautiful views of the sea and the channel, and set among the natural woods and nature of the island. It is located just 10 m from the seashore, near the beach and small stone jetties in an area with amazingly clear and safe water. On the land area of 1037 m2 there is the opportunity to build a stepped shape building, using the natural sloping geography of the hill.&nbsp;</p>', '', '<p>Graðevinsko zemlji&scaron;te smje&scaron;teno u prvom redu do mora, na sjevernoj strani otoka, zapadno od grada Korèule.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sa zemlji&scaron;ta se pru¾a prekrasan pogled na more i pelje&scaron;ki kanal.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nalazi se samo 10 m od mora, nadomak male pla¾e i kamenih mostova.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na zemlji&scaron;tu povr&scaron;ine 1037 m2 postoji moguænost izgradnje stepenastog oblika kako bi se zgrada uzdignula na bre¾uljku.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Cesta se nalazi uz teren koji se pru¾a sunèanom stranom.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Struja se nalazi 20 m od terena, a voda 10 m.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>®rnovska Banja je udaljena 3 km, a grad Korèula 10 km. &nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Meðunarodni aerodrom u Dubrovniku udaljen je 135 km.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za dodatne informacije molimo kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured u Splitu.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>We are offering this rare opportunity to buy a seafront building plot of 1037 m2, on the northern side of the island of Korcula, west of the town.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is blessed with beautiful views of the sea and the channel, and set among the natural woods and nature of the island.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is located just 10 m from the seashore, near the beach and small stone jetties in an area with amazingly clear and safe water.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the land area of 1037 m2 there is the opportunity to build a stepped shape building, using the natural sloping geography of the hill.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There is an access road directly to the plot, and electricity is located 20 m, and water is 10 m.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Lumbarda is 3 km away, and the town of Korcula 10 km.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The international airport in Dubrovnik is 135 km.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For further information, please contact our office in Split, and we can arrange a visit to the location and discuss building plans/costs etc.</p>', '', '1458_Land-plot_0.jpg', '1458_Land-plot_1.jpg', '1458_Land-plot_2.jpg', '1458_Land-plot_3.jpg', '1458_Land-plot_4.jpg', '1458_Land-plot_5.jpg', '1458_Land-plot_6.jpg', '1458_Land-plot_7.jpg', '1458_Land-plot_8.jpg');
INSERT INTO `nekretnina` (`id`, `ime`, `prezime`, `telefon`, `mobitel`, `e_mail`, `lokacija_id`, `adresa`, `status_id`, `vrsta_id`, `udaljenost`, `povrsina`, `stambenapovrsina`, `display`, `cijena`, `cijenatocka`, `ponuda_tjedna`, `new_built`, `must_sell`, `prvi_red_do_mora`, `pogled_na_more`, `bazen`, `broj_soba`, `broj_kupatila`, `datum`, `title_hr`, `title_en`, `title_ge`, `opis_hr`, `opis_en`, `opis_ge`, `PropertyImageURL0`, `PropertyImageURL1`, `PropertyImageURL2`, `PropertyImageURL3`, `PropertyImageURL4`, `PropertyImageURL5`, `PropertyImageURL6`, `PropertyImageURL7`, `PropertyImageURL8`) VALUES
(1459, 'Janja', 'Baliæ', '021 735 027', '091 579 8979', '', 'Omis', 'Glavica II br. 7 Duæe, Za dio kuæe 3*', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '240', '400', '580', 1, '890000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 8, 6, 'November 13, 2015', '<p>Na prodaju nudimo ovu veliku kuæu nedaleko od Omi&scaron;a, pogodnu za ¾ivljenje i bavljenje turizmom. Kuæa se nalazi povi&scaron;e magistralne ceste, svega 240 metara zraène linije od mora, nedaleko od pla¾e i sadr¾aja.&nbsp;Objekt se sastoji od 5 eta¾a. Suteren ima izlaz u lijepo ureðeno dvori&scaron;te u kojem se nalazi parkirali&scaron;ni prostor za 12 automobila.&nbsp;Prvi i drugi kat imaju istu strukturu. Ove dvije eta¾e kategorizirane su i opremljene za prihvat turista.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>For sale we have this large house near Omis town, suitable both for living and tourist rental. The property is located above the main coastal road, only 240 m areal distance to the sea, not far from the beach and amenities.&nbsp;The building has 5 floors. This floor opens to a lovely garden, hosting parking place for 12 cars.&nbsp;First and second floor have the same structure. These two floors are rented out to tourists.&nbsp;</p>', '', '<p>Na prodaju nudimo ovu veliku kuæu nedaleko od Omi&scaron;a, pogodnu za ¾ivljenje i bavljenje turizmom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa se nalazi povi&scaron;e magistralne ceste, svega 240 metara zraène linije od mora, nedaleko od pla¾e i sadr¾aja.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Objekt se sastoji od 5 eta¾a.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U suterenu su smje&scaron;teni kotlovnica, praonica, spremi&scaron;te i terasa, a na njega se nadovezuje i pomoæni objekt &ndash; gara¾a povr&scaron;ine 45 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Suteren ima izlaz u lijepo ureðeno dvori&scaron;te u kojem se nalazi parkirali&scaron;ni prostor za 12 automobila.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U prizemlju se nalazi stan sa dvije spavaæe sobe, dvije kupaonice, tri terase, blagovaonicom sa &scaron;ankom ureðenom za prihvat gostiju u vrijeme doruèka te malom profesionalnom kuhinjom.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Prvi i drugi kat imaju istu strukturu &ndash; na svakom od njih nalaze se po dvije sobe sa kupaonicom i loðom te jedan apartman sa dvije spavaæe sobe, kupaonicom i èajnom kuhinjom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ove dvije eta¾e kategorizirane su i opremljene za prihvat turista.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na zadnjoj eta¾i potkrovlja nalazi se stan sa dvije spavaæe sobe, dnevnim boravkom, kupaonicom, kuhinjom i blagovaonicom te balkonom i terasom sa lijepim otvorenim pogledom na more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ukupna bruto povr&scaron;ina svih eta¾a skupa sa terasama iznosi 587 m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa ima centralno grijanje, a sve sobe su klimatizirane.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za dodatne informacije molimo kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured u Splitu.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>For sale we have this large house near Omis town, suitable both for living and tourist rental.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property is located above the main coastal road, only 240 m areal distance to the sea, not far from the beach and amenities.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The building has 5 floors.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Semi-interred floor contains heating room, laundy, storage and terrace.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Next to it, there is auxiliary building sized 45 sqm used as a garage.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>This floor opens to a lovely garden, hosting parking place for 12 cars.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the ground floor there is an apartment with 2 bedrooms, 2 bathrooms, 3 terraces, dining room with bar suitable to serve breakfast, as well as small professional kitchen.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>First and second floor have the same structure &ndash; each contains 2 bedrooms with bathrooms and balconies, as well as one 2-bedroom apartment with bathroom and kitchenette.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>These two floors are rented out to tourists.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Attick contains an apartment with 2 bedrooms, bathroom, kitchen and dining room, living room, balcony and terrace, featuring great open sea views.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Total gross size of the building equals to 587 sqm, incl. all the terraces. &nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house has central heating and each room is air-conditioned.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For further information please contact our office in Split.&nbsp;</p>', '', '1459_House-Villa_0.jpg', '1459_House-Villa_1.jpg', '1459_House-Villa_2.jpg', '1459_House-Villa_3.jpg', '1459_House-Villa_4.jpg', '1459_House-Villa_5.jpg', '1459_House-Villa_6.jpg', '1459_House-Villa_7.jpg', '1459_House-Villa_8.jpg'),
(1460, 'Kristina', 'Pomo Jelusic ', '', '', '', 'Hvar', 'Stari Grad', 'For sale', 'Old stone house', '400', '0', '105', 1, '160000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 3, 3, 'November 19, 2015', '<p>Stara kamena kuæa na tri kata.&nbsp;Sastoji se od konobe u prizemlju, zapravo prostorije koja je prije bila konoba/restoran (&scaron;ank, mu&scaron;ki i ¾enski WC te terasa iza kuæe povr&scaron;ine 25 m2).&nbsp;Samo nekoliko metara dalje, u blizini samog centra grada, nalazi se veliki gradski park.&nbsp;Svi potrebni sadr¾aji su u blizini (trgovine, kafiæi, restorani, ljekarna, tr¾nica, pekare).&nbsp;Udaljenost od mora je 400 m, dok je trajektna luka udaljena 25 minuta hoda.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>Old stone house on 3 floor.&nbsp;Charming character property nearby the town''s park and at walking distance to the center.&nbsp;Ground floor contains a room previously used as restaurant ''konoba'' (bar counter, 2 toilets and backside terrace sized 25 sqm).&nbsp;Accross the entrance there is auxiliary object with toilet, storage and kitchen with big BBQ/grill.&nbsp;All amenities are near the property (shops, bars, restaurants, pharmacy, bakery, green market etc).&nbsp;The property is only 400 meters away from the sea.</p>', '', '<p><strong>Stara kamena kuæa na tri kata</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sastoji se od konobe u prizemlju, zapravo prostorije koja je prije bila konoba/restoran (&scaron;ank, mu&scaron;ki i ¾enski WC te terasa iza kuæe povr&scaron;ine 25 m2).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Preko puta ulaza u konobu je mali objekt gdje su WC, sprema i kuhinja s velikim ro&scaron;tiljem.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na prvom katu se nalaze dvije spavaæe sobe, kupaonica i veliko spremi&scaron;te.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Unutarnje stepenice vode na drugi kat gdje su velika spavaæa soba, kuhinja, dnevni boravak, kupaonica, te natkrivena terasa s pogledom na brda i sela.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Samo nekoliko metara dalje, u blizini samog centra grada, nalazi se veliki gradski park.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Svi potrebni sadr¾aji su u blizini (trgovine, kafiæi, restorani, ljekarna, tr¾nica, pekare).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Udaljenost od mora 400 m, dok je trajektna luka udaljena 25 minuta pje&scaron;ke.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za sve dodatne informacije molimo kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured.&nbsp;</p>', '<p><strong>Old stone house on 3 floor</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Charming character property nearby the town''s park and at walking distance to the center.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ground floor contains a room previously used as restaurant ''konoba'' (bar counter, 2 toilets and backside terrace sized 25 sqm).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Accross the entrance there is auxiliary object with toilet, storage and kitchen with big BBQ/grill.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the first floor there are 2 bedrooms, bathroom and large storage.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Internal stairs lead into the second floor, hosting master bedroom, kitchen, living room, bathroom and covered terrace featuing lovely views on the hills and the village.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>All amenities are near the property (shops, bars, restaurants, pharmacy, bakery, green market etc).&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property is only 400 meters away from the sea and 25 min walking distance to the ferry port.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For more information please contact our office. &nbsp;</p>', '', '1460_Old-stone-house_0.jpg', '1460_Old-stone-house_1.jpg', '1460_Old-stone-house_2.jpg', '1460_Old-stone-house_3.jpg', '1460_Old-stone-house_4.jpg', '1460_Old-stone-house_5.jpg', '1460_Old-stone-house_6.jpg', '1460_Old-stone-house_7.jpg', '1460_Old-stone-house_8.jpg'),
(1461, 'Ivana', 'Brèiæ (suradnja)', '', '091 459 9901', 'i.brcic@latium-croatia.com', 'Rogoznica', 'Rogoznica', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '100', '0', '134', 1, '600000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 1, 3, 3, 'November 19, 2015', '<p>Penthouse sa pogledom na more.&nbsp;Na prodaju nudimo lijepi penthouse u Rogoznici, sa 3 spavaæe sobe i 3 kupaonice ukupne stambene povr&scaron;ine 134 m2, s izvrsnim pogledom na more i marinu.&nbsp;Apartmanu pripadaju 2 parkirali&scaron;na mjesta, velika terasa te zajednièki bazen.&nbsp;Stan je u potpunosti namje&scaron;ten. Nalazi se u mirnom dijelu mjesta, nedaleko od mora.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>Penthouse with sea views.&nbsp;For sale we have this lovely penthouse in Rogoznica town, featuring 3 bedrooms, 3 bathrooms (living area 134 sqm), 2 parking places, spacious terrace, communal pool and splendid views over the sea and marina.&nbsp;The property comes fully furnished. It is located in a quiet residenatial area, not far from the sea.&nbsp;</p>', '', '<p><strong>Penthouse sa pogledom na more</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na prodaju nudimo lijepi penthouse u Rogoznici, sa 3 spavaæe sobe i 3 kupaonice ukupne stambene povr&scaron;ine 134 m2, s izvrsnim pogledom na more i marinu.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartmanu pripadaju 2 parkirali&scaron;na mjesta, velika terasa te zajednièki bazen.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Stan je u potpunosti namje&scaron;ten.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nalazi se u mirnom dijelu mjesta, nedaleko od mora.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za svi&scaron;e informacija molimo kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured.</p>', '<p><strong>Penthouse with sea views</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For sale we have this lovely penthouse in Rogoznica town, featuring 3 bedrooms, 3 bathrooms (living area 134 sqm), 2 parking places, spacious terrace, communal pool and splendid views over the sea and marina.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property comes fully furnished.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is located in a quiet residenatial area, not far from the sea.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For more information please contact our office.&nbsp;</p>', '', '1461_Apartment_0.jpg', '1461_Apartment_1.jpg', '1461_Apartment_2.jpg', '1461_Apartment_3.jpg', '1461_Apartment_4.jpg', '1461_Apartment_5.jpg', '1461_Apartment_6.jpg', '1461_Apartment_7.jpg', '1461_Apartment_8.jpg'),
(1463, 'Milan ', 'Novak ', '', '', '', 'Zadar', 'Privlaka, Zadar', 'For sale', 'Land plot', '10', '1082', '0', 1, '195000', '', 2, 2, 2, 1, 1, 2, 0, 0, 'November 24, 2015', '<p>Graðevinsko zemlji&scaron;te u prvom redu do mora, nedaleko Zadra.&nbsp;Zemlji&scaron;te je pravokutnog oblika 25 m X 44 m.&nbsp;Udaljeno je samo 10 m od mora.&nbsp;Struja i voda u blizini. Na ovoj lokaciji æe se graditi samo presti¾ne vile i apartmani.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>We are offering an increasingly rare commodity - building land in the first line to the sea. It is situated directly onto the shore, near Zadar, in a regular shape - 25 m X 44 m. It is only 10 m from the sea a point with clear and clean water and is safe for swimming and playing.&nbsp;The plot has electricity and water nearby.&nbsp;On this site will be built only prestigious villas and apartments.&nbsp;</p>', '', '<p>Graðevinsko zemlji&scaron;te u prvom redu do mora, nedaleko Zadra.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Zemlji&scaron;te je pravokutnog oblika 25 m X 44 m.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Udaljeno je samo 10 m od mora.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Struja i voda u blizini.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na ovoj lokaciji æe se graditi samo presti¾ne vile i apartmani.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Cijena je sni¾ena sa &euro;220.000 na &euro;195.000.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za dodatne informacije molimo kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured u Splitu.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>We are offering an increasingly rare commodity - building land in the first line to the sea.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is situated directly onto the shore, near Zadar, in a regular shape - 25 m X 44 m.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is only 10 m from the sea a point with clear and clean water and is safe for swimming and playing.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The plot has electricity and water nearby.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On this site will be built only prestigious villas and apartments.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The price has been reduced from &euro; 220,000 to &euro; 195,000, to ensure a quick sale.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For further information, please contact one of our agents in our office in Split.</p>', '', '1463_Land-plot_0.jpg', '1463_Land-plot_1.jpg', '1463_Land-plot_2.jpg', '1463_Land-plot_3.jpg', '1463_Land-plot_4.jpg', '1463_Land-plot_5.jpg', '1463_Land-plot_6.jpg', '1463_Land-plot_7.jpg', '1463_Land-plot_8.jpg'),
(1464, '', 'Alen Dalmatis', '', '', '', 'Zadar', 'Suko¹an', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '200', '1955', '390', 1, '670000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 9, 7, 'November 24, 2015', '<p>Obiteljska kuæa u blizini mora, smje&scaron;tena na mirnoj lokaciji, okru¾ena mediteranskim vrtom, idealna za ¾ivot ili za turizam.&nbsp;Kuæa se nalazi na parceli povr&scaron;ine 1955 m2, te je udaljena od mora svega 200 m i 10 minuta vo¾nje do grada Zadra.&nbsp;Ima ukupnu povr&scaron;inu 390 m2, a sastoji se od podruma, prizemlja i kata.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;">CIJENA SNI®ENA SA 800.000 EUR!!</span></p>', '<p>We are offering this substantial family house furnished to a high level of comfort set in superb grounds. It is situated 200m from the shore and 10 minutes drive from the old town centre of Zadar.&nbsp;The house is situated on a plot of 1955 m2, and the internal space has&nbsp;&nbsp;an area of 390 m2 which consists of a basement, ground and first floors.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;">PRICE REDUCED FROM 800.000 EUR!!</span></p>', '', '<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;"><strong>CIJENA SNI®ENA SA 800.000 EUR!!</strong></span></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Obiteljska kuæa u blizini mora, smje&scaron;tena na mirnoj lokaciji, okru¾ena mediteranskim vrtom, idealna za ¾ivot ili za turizam.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa se nalazi na parceli povr&scaron;ine 1955 m2, te je udaljena od mora svega 200 m i 10 minuta vo¾nje do grada Zadra.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ima ukupnu povr&scaron;inu 390 m2, a sastoji se od podruma, prizemlja i kata.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Podrum (apartman sa saunom) - jednosoban stan povr&scaron;ine 40 m2 sastoji se od dnevnog boravka, blagavaonice sa kuhinjom, kupaonice sa wc-om, spavaæe sobe, te saune.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Prizemlje (2 apartmana) - dva komforna ureðena dvosobna stana, svaki 70 m2, a sastoje se od dnevnog boravka, blagavaonice sa kuhinojm, kupaonice sa wc-om, dvije spavaæe sobe, te vanjske natkrivene terase.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kat (4 apartmana) - koji se sastoji od 4 &bdquo;stana-apartmana&ldquo; svaki povr&scaron;ine 30 m2, &nbsp;a sastoje se od spavaæe sobe, kupaonice sa wc, kuhinje sa blagavaonicom, dnevnog boravka i balkonske terase.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Vanjska konoba (sa vanjskom terasom i nadstre&scaron;nicom) - povr&scaron;ine 70 m2, koja je idealna za ljetnja dru¾enja i grill.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Zbog velièine parcele, postoji moguænost izgradnje jo&scaron; jednog objekta i jednog/dva bazena.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Parking ispred kuæe mo¾e primiti do 10 automobila.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa posjeduje urednu lokacijsku i graðevinsku dozvolu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za sve dodatne informacije molimo kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured u Splitu.&nbsp;</p>', '<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;"><strong>PRICE REDUCED FROM 800.000 EUR!!</strong></span></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>We are offering this substantial family house furnished to a high level of comfort set in superb grounds.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is situated 200m from the shore and 10 minutes drive from the old town centre of Zadar.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house is situated on a plot of 1955 m2, and the internal space has an area of 390 m2 which consists of a basement, ground and first floors.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The basement has a bedroom apartment of 40 m2 and consists of a living room, dining room, kitchen, bathroom with toilet, bedroom and sauna.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ground floor (2 apartments) - two comfortable furnished apartments, each 70 m2 and consist of a living room, dining room with kitchen, a bathroom with a toilet, two bedrooms and exterior terrace.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Floor (4 suites) - which consists of 4 "Apartment", each measuring 30 m2, and consist of a bedroom, bathroom with toilet, kitchen, dining room, living room and balcony terrace.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>All the rooms have been fitted and decorated with luxurious fittings which suit this unusually grand property.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>In the grounds is a large patio area - 70 m2, which is ideal for summer gatherings and bbq/grill.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There is enough space in the grounds to build additional houses, or add value to the property with a swimming pool.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There is parking in front of the house which can accommodate up to 10 cars.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For further information please contact our agents in the office in Split.</p>', '', '1464_House-Villa_0.jpg', '1464_House-Villa_1.jpg', '1464_House-Villa_2.jpg', '1464_House-Villa_3.jpg', '1464_House-Villa_4.jpg', '1464_House-Villa_5.jpg', '1464_House-Villa_6.jpg', '1464_House-Villa_7.jpg', '1464_House-Villa_8.jpg'),
(1465, 'Marko', 'Duplanèiæ', '091 9092660 Zorana', 'Marin 0916002361', '', 'Rogoznica', 'Stiva¹nica, 10127/2 K.o. sevid', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '100', '310', '96', 1, '310000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 3, 2, 'November 24, 2015', '<p>Na svega 100 m od mora nalazi se ova lijepo ureðena obiteljska kuæa s moguæno&scaron;æu iznajmljivanja kata u turistièke svrhe.&nbsp;Pogled na more, prostrana terasa, privatnost, ti&scaron;ina i blizina pla¾e s jedne strane, dok blizina trgovina, restorana i kafiæa s druge strane èine ovu kuæu izuzetnom prilikom.&nbsp;Kuæa ima bruto povr&scaron;inu 118 m2, dok je stambeni dio 96 m2, a nalazi se na parceli povr&scaron;ine 310 m2.&nbsp;Kuæa se sastoji od prizemlja i kata.&nbsp;Okuænica je lijepo ureðena mediteranskim biljem te ima odvojen prostor za ro&scaron;tilj.</p>', '<p>We are pleased to offer this detached house in an ideal location for renting to tourists. It is the village of Rogoznica, a very sought after destination for tourists wanting holidays in a traditional charming village, with quiet and safe waters for swimming and bathing, and several choices of restaurants for an evening meal. The property itself has 96 m2 of living space, on a spacious plot of 310 m2. It has a sea view, large terrace, privacy, quiet and close to the beach. The house consists of two floors.</p>', '', '<p>Na svega 100 m od mora nalazi se ova lijepo ureðena obiteljska kuæa s moguæno&scaron;æu iznajmljivanja kata u turistièke svrhe.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Pogled na more, prostrana terasa, privatnost, ti&scaron;ina i blizina pla¾e s jedne strane, dok blizina trgovina, restorana i kafiæa s druge strane èine ovu kuæu izuzetnom prilikom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa ima bruto povr&scaron;inu 118 m2, dok je stambeni dio 96 m2, a nalazi se na parceli povr&scaron;ine 310 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa se sastoji od prizemlja i kata.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U prizemlju se nalaze dnevni boravak s kuhinjom i blagovaonicom, spavaæa soba i kupaonica.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na katu su dvije spavaæe sobe, dnevni boravak s kuhinjom i kupaonica.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Okuænica je lijepo ureðena mediteranskim biljem te ima odvojen prostor za ro&scaron;tilj.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na parceli se nalazi i parking mjesto za dva auta.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa ima struju, gradsku vodu i septièku jamu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Najbli¾i restorani, kafiæi i trovine nalaze se na svega 2 km udaljenosti, a aerodrom je udaljen 28 km.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za sve dodatne informacije molimo kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured u Splitu.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>We are pleased to offer this detached house in an ideal location for renting to tourists.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is situated on the mainland, just 100m from the sea, with fabulous elevated sea views, and conveniently close to shops, bars and cafes in the village.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is the village of Rogoznica, a very sought after destination for tourists wanting holidays in a traditional charming village, with quiet and safe waters for swimming and bathing, and several choices of restaurants for an evening meal.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The airport is about 25km from the property.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property itself has 96 m2 of living space, on a spacious plot of 310 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It has a sea view, large terrace, privacy, quiet and close to the beach on one side, and close to shops, restaurants and cafes on the other hand.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house consists of two floors.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The ground floor has a living room with kitchen and dining room, bedroom and bathroom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Upstairs there are two bedrooms, and a living room with kitchen and bathroom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property is well decorated and has been maintained to a high standard by conscientious owners.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The courtyard is beautifully decorated with Mediterranean herbs and the house has a separate barbecue area.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the plot there are parking places for two cars.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house has electricity, mains water and a septic tank.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For further information please contact our office in Split and one of our agents can arrange to escort you around the property.</p>', '', '1465_House-Villa_0.jpg', '1465_House-Villa_1.JPG', '1465_House-Villa_2.JPG', '1465_House-Villa_3.JPG', '1465_House-Villa_4.JPG', '1465_House-Villa_5.JPG', '1465_House-Villa_6.JPG', '1465_House-Villa_7.JPG', '1465_House-Villa_8.JPG'),
(1466, 'Milan ', 'Novak ', '0038523272703', '00385955080691, 0038641723888 ', 'novak.m1@siol.net', 'Zadar', 'Bilotinjak IV br.2 2  Privlaka', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '10', '160', '213', 1, '350000', '', 2, 2, 2, 1, 1, 2, 4, 2, 'November 25, 2015', '<p>Atraktivan apartman u prvom redu do mora, s prostranim vrtom, nedaleko Zadra.&nbsp;Apartman ima stambenu povr&scaron;inu 210 m2, a sastoji se od èetiri spavaæe sobe, dvije kupaonice te velikog dnevnog boravka s blagovaonicom i kuhinjom.&nbsp;Apartmanu pripada i dvostruka gara¾a te veliki vrt.&nbsp;Nalazi se u prizemlju, a ispred je natkrivena terasa.&nbsp;Parking 65 m2.&nbsp;Samo 10-ak metara od apartmana je prekrasna pje&scaron;èana pla¾a.</p>', '<p>We are offering this attractive and spacious well-designed apartment next to the sea. It is situated just a few yards from the water''s edge on the ground floor of a modern, well built building with only three other apartments. The nearest larger town is Zadar, which is very close, and the village has a family run coffee bar and cafe in walking distance.&nbsp;The apartment has a living area of 210 m2. The apartment has a double garage and parking area of 65m2, and the building is within a large, and well maintained garden.</p>', '', '<p>Atraktivan apartman u prvom redu do mora, s prostranim vrtom, nedaleko Zadra. &nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartman ima stambenu povr&scaron;inu 210 m2, a sastoji se od èetiri spavaæe sobe, dvije kupaonice te velikog dnevnog boravka s blagovaonicom i kuhinjom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartmanu pripada i dvostruka gara¾a te veliki vrt.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nalazi se u prizemlju, a ispred je natkrivena terasa.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Parking 65 m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Samo 10-ak metara od apartmana je prekrasna pje&scaron;èana pla¾a.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Meðunarodni aerodrom je udaljen manje od 30 km. &nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za dodatne informacije molimo kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured u Splitu.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>We are offering this attractive and spacious well-designed apartment next to the sea.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is situated just a few yards from the water''s edge on the ground floor ofa modern, well built building with only three other apartments.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The nearest larger town is Zadar, which is very close, and the village has a family run coffee bar and cafe in walking distance.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The apartment has a living area of 210 m2 and consists of four bedrooms, two bathrooms and a large open plan living room, dining room and kitchen.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>All the rooms are well decorated and the property has been well looked after.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The apartment has a double garage and parking area of 65m2, and the building is within a large, and well maintained garden.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>International airport Zadar is less than 30 km.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For further information, please contact one of our agents from our office in Split.</p>', '', '1466_Apartment_0.jpg', '1466_Apartment_1.jpg', '1466_Apartment_2.jpg', '1466_Apartment_3.jpg', '1466_Apartment_4.jpg', '1466_Apartment_5.jpg', '1466_Apartment_6.jpg', '1466_Apartment_7.jpg', '1466_Apartment_8.jpg'),
(1467, '', 'Fernetiæ', '', '0915905439', '', 'Korcula', 'Vela Luka', 'For sale', 'Old stone house', '50', '50', '35', 1, '57000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 1, 'November 25, 2015', '<p>Stara kamena kuæa na otoku Korèuli, smje&scaron;tena u predivnom mjestu, u mirnom okru¾enju.&nbsp;Udaljena je od mora samo 50 m.&nbsp;Kuæa se sastoji se od prizemlja i kata stambene povr&scaron;ine 35 m2.&nbsp;Vrt ima povr&scaron;inu 50 m2.&nbsp;Kuæa je kompletno adaptirana 2011. godine.&nbsp;Namje&scaron;tena je i useljiva.&nbsp;Vlasni&scaron;tvo uredno.&nbsp;Izuzetno mirno okru¾enje, a ujedno blizina svih potrebnih sadr¾aja èine ovu nekretninu jedinstvenim i po¾eljnim utoèi&scaron;tem od gradske vreve i svakodnevnog stresa.</p>', '<p>Excellent opportunity to buy a ''ready to move in'' stone house at an incredible price to ensure an immediate sale. It is situated on one of the most desirable islands down the Dalmatian coast-Korcula-in a small and historic village full of charm. The sea is just 50m walk. The property is a restored old stone house, situated in a quiet environment and it consists of a ground floor living area of 35 m2. The garden has an area of 50 m2.&nbsp;The building was fully renovated in 2011.&nbsp;It is furnished and ready for occupancy!&nbsp;</p>', '', '<p>Stara kamena kuæa na otoku Korèuli, smje&scaron;tena u predivnom mjestu, u mirnom okru¾enju.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Udaljena je od mora samo 50 m.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa se sastoji se od prizemlja i kata stambene povr&scaron;ine 35 m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Vrt ima povr&scaron;inu 50 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je kompletno adaptirana 2011. godine.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Namje&scaron;tena je i useljiva.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Vlasni&scaron;tvo uredno.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Izuzetno mirno okru¾enje, a ujedno blizina svih potrebnih sadr¾aja èine ovu nekretninu jedinstvenim i po¾eljnim utoèi&scaron;tem od gradske vreve i svakodnevnog stresa.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Bezbrojne prekrasne pla¾e i uvale, kuæe za odmor, stoljetni maslinici i vinogradi, prastari ljetnikovci i drevna otoèna mjesta koja kao da su ostala izgubljena u nekom davno minulom vremenu, mame na ovaj otok turiste iz cijeloga svijeta.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za sve dodatne informacije molimo kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured u Splitu.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>Excellent opportunity to buy a ''ready to move in'' stone house at an incredible price to ensure an immediate sale.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is situated on one of the most desirable islands down the Dalmatian coast - Korcula - in a small and historic village full of charm.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The sea is just 50m walk.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property is a restored old stone house, situated in a quiet environment and it consists of a ground floor living area of 35 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The garden has an area of 50 m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The building was fully renovated in 2011.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is furnished and ready for occupancy!&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The extremely quiet surroundings, and being close to all necessary facilities make this property unique and desirable to anyone wanting an escape from the city noise and stress of everyday life.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The island has numerous beautiful beaches and bays, houses, centuries-old olive groves and vineyards, ancient villas and this historic island village seems to have remained lost in some timeless pocket, overlooked by the thousands of tourists that visit the area each year.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For further information please contact our office in Split.</p>', '', '1467_Old-stone-house_0.JPG', '1467_Old-stone-house_1.jpg', '1467_Old-stone-house_2.jpg', '1467_Old-stone-house_3.jpg', '1467_Old-stone-house_4.jpg', '1467_Old-stone-house_5.jpg', '', '', ''),
(1468, 'Rajkoviæ', 'Karl Heinz i Dubravk', '022 558118', '', 'karlheinz.rajkovic@gmail.com', 'Rogoznica', 'VI Nova Rogoznica Rogoznica', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '120', '118', '95', 1, '285000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 2, 2, 'November 25, 2015', '<p>Luksuzno i kvalitetno ureðena kuæa ju¾ne orijentacije nalazi se na svega 100 m od lijepo ureðene pla¾e i &scaron;etnice.&nbsp;S kuæe se pru¾a prekrasan pogled na more i uvalu.&nbsp;Povr&scaron;ina kuæe je 95 m2, a nalazi se na parceli povr&scaron;ine 118 m2.&nbsp;Kuæa je podijeljena na prizemlje i kat.&nbsp;S terase se pru¾a pogled na more i uvalu.&nbsp;<br /><br /></p>', '<p>We are offering this attractive and well-furnished house, facing south, which is located only 100 meters from the beach. It is situated within a short walk from the centre of this small village, where there is a small selection of shops, cafes, bakery and coffee bars. The house is divided into two floors, with a total floor area of 95m2 and the building sits on a plot of 118m2.</p>', '', '<p>Luksuzno i kvalitetno ureðena kuæa ju¾ne orijentacije nalazi se na svega 100 m od lijepo ureðene pla¾e i &scaron;etnice.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>S kuæe se pru¾a prekrasan pogled na more i uvalu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Povr&scaron;ina kuæe je 95 m2, a nalazi se na parceli povr&scaron;ine 118 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je podijeljena na prizemlje i kat.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U prizemlju se nalazi kompletno luksuzno ureðena kuhinja, spavaæa soba, kupaonica i WC.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na katu se nalazi spavaæa soba, WC i prostrani dnevni boravak s izlazom na veliku terasu povr&scaron;ine 20 m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>S terase se pru¾a pogled na more i uvalu.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Oko kuæe je ureðeni vrt.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U sklopu parcele se nalazi jedno parking mjesto.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Do centra mjesta, duæana, restorana i kafiæa je svega par stotina metara.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Svi ovi sadr¾aji rade tijekom cijele godine tako da je kuæa pogodno za cjelogodi&scaron;nji boravak.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa ima svu potrebnu infrastrukturu (struja, gradska voda, septièka jama).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Aerodrom je udaljen 28 km.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za dodatne informacije molimo kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured u Splitu.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>We are offering this attractive and well-furnished house, facing south, which is located only 100 meters from the beach.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is situated within a short walk from the centre of this small village, where there is a small selection of shops, cafes, bakery and coffee bars.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house is divided into two floors, with a total floor area of 95m2 and the building sits on a plot of 118m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The ground floor has a fully furnished kitchen, one bedroom, bathroom and toilet.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The first floor has a bedroom, bathroom and a spacious living room with doors leading onto a large terrace of 20 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The terrace has superb views overlooking the sea and the bay.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property is nicely decorated and has been well maintained, and around the house there is a landscaped garden.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Within the plot there is a private parking place.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The airport is 28 km.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For further information, please contact our agents in our Split office.</p>', '', '1468_House-Villa_0.JPG', '1468_House-Villa_1.JPG', '1468_House-Villa_2.JPG', '1468_House-Villa_3.JPG', '1468_House-Villa_4.JPG', '1468_House-Villa_5.JPG', '1468_House-Villa_6.JPG', '1468_House-Villa_7.JPG', '1468_House-Villa_8.JPG'),
(1469, 'Neven i Ðurða', 'Domljanoviæ', '022555048', '0997921326  ', '', 'Rogoznica', 'Kanica 199 Rogoznica', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '100', '380', '96', 1, '130000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 3, 2, 'November 25, 2015', '<p>Dvojna kuæa u lijepoj i mirnoj uvali na svega 100 m od mora pru¾a izniman do¾ivljaj Mediterana.&nbsp;Kuæa je povr&scaron;ine 96 m2, a nalazi se na parceli povr&scaron;ine 380 m2.&nbsp;Sastoji se od prizemlja i kata.&nbsp;U prizemlju je veliki trijem koji se nastavlja u vrt, a na katu se nalazi terasa s koje se pru¾a prekrasan pogled na more.&nbsp;Vrt je kultiviran i odr¾avan. Mandarine, naranèe, limun i drugo mediteransko bilje nalazi se oko kuæe.&nbsp;U sklopu parcele je parking mjesto kao i gara¾a za jedno auto.</p>', '<p>We have this semi-detached house in a beautiful and peaceful bay only 100 meters from the sea. It is located just a short walk from village shops, bars and cafes around the harbour in this charming and quiet village, but still only 40 minutes drive from the airport.&nbsp;The house has a living area of 96 m2 and is located on a plot of 380 m2.&nbsp;It consists of two floors. On the ground floor is a large porch that goes out onto the garden, and upstairs there is a terrace that offers a breath-taking view of the sea.&nbsp;</p>', '', '<p>Dvojna kuæa u lijepoj i mirnoj uvali na svega 100 m od mora pru¾a izniman do¾ivljaj Mediterana.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je povr&scaron;ine 96 m2, a nalazi se na parceli povr&scaron;ine 380 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sastoji se od prizemlja i kata.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U prizemlju je prostrani dnevni boravak s kuhinjom i blagovaonicom, kupaonica i spavaæa soba.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Vanjsko stubi&scaron;te vodi na kat gdje se nalaze dvije spavaæe sobe i dnevni boravak s kuhinjom i kupaonicom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U prizemlju je veliki trijem koji se nastavlja u vrt, a na katu se nalazi terasa s koje se pru¾a prekrasan pogled na more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Vrt je kultiviran i odr¾avan.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Mandarine, naranèe, limun i drugo mediteransko bilje nalazi se oko kuæe.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U sklopu parcele je parking mjesto kao i gara¾a za jedno auto.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa ima svu potrebnu infrastrukturu (gustirna, struja i septièka jama).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kafiæi, restoran, lijepo ureðena pla¾a nalaze se na svega 100 m udaljenosti od kuæe.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Aerodrom je udaljen 28 km.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za sve dodatne informacije molimo kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured u Splitu.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>We have this semi-detached house in a beautiful and peaceful bay only 100meters from the sea.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is located just a short walk from village shops, bars and cafes around the harbour in this charming and quiet village, but still only 40 minutes drive from the airport.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house has a living area of 96 m2 and is located on a plot of 380 m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It consists of two floors.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the ground floor is a spacious family living room incorporating the kitchen, bathroom and one bedroom.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>An outside staircase leads to the first floor where there are two bedrooms and a living room with kitchen and bathroom.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the ground floor is a large porch that goes out onto the garden, and upstairs there is a terrace that offers a breath-taking view of the sea.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The garden is cultivated and maintained and has a wonderful selection of fruit trees, including tangerines, oranges, lemons and other Mediterranean herbs and plants located around the house.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>As part of the plot there is parking and a garage for one car.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house has all the necessary infrastructure (water tank, electricity and septic tank).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The nearest larger town with a range of good quality restaurants, historic and cultural events and a lively night life is Trogir, which is 20 minutes by car.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For further information please contact our office in Split.</p>', '', '1469_House-Villa_0.JPG', '1469_House-Villa_1.JPG', '1469_House-Villa_2.JPG', '1469_House-Villa_3.JPG', '1469_House-Villa_4.JPG', '1469_House-Villa_5.JPG', '1469_House-Villa_6.JPG', '1469_House-Villa_7.JPG', '1469_House-Villa_8.JPG'),
(1470, 'Ivan', 'Kosi', '', '', '', 'Rogoznica', 'Sevid Rogoznica', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '70', '200', '160', 2, '450000', '', 2, 1, 2, 2, 1, 1, 4, 2, 'November 26, 2015', '<p>Na svega 70 m od mora, u centru idiliènog dalmatinskog mjesta nalaze se dvije novoizgraðene (2015. god.), moderne i luksuzne vile s kojih se pru¾a pogled na more i uvalu. Prostrana terasa s bazenom &nbsp;s kojeg se pru¾e prekrasan neometan pogled na more, kao i mir i ti&scaron;ina samog okru¾enja èini ove vile pravim draguljem meðu nekretninama. Obje vile su izgraðene po istom principu. Imaju povr&scaron;inu 160 m2, a svaka se nalazi na parceli povr&scaron;ine 200 m2.</p>', '<p>We are offering these excellent value modern style villas with swimming pool and spectacular views of the sea and the bay. They are only 70 m from the sea, in the centre of the idyllic Dalmatian village. The nearest coffee bars and cafe is 10 minutes stroll along the shore, and the nearest larger town is Trogir, a UNESCO heritage site, 10 minutes by car. These two villas were constructed in 2015 in a very peaceful location and include a spacious terrace with swimming pool with a beautiful unobstructed view of the sea. They have a surface of 160 m2, and each is on a plot of 200 m2.</p>', '', '<p>Na svega 70 m od mora, u centru idiliènog dalmatinskog mjesta nalaze se dvije novoizgraðene (2015. god.), moderne i luksuzne vile s kojih se pru¾a pogled na more i uvalu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Prostrana terasa s bazenom s kojeg se pru¾e prekrasan neometan pogled na more, kao i mir i ti&scaron;ina samog okru¾enja èini ove vile pravim draguljem meðu nekretninama.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Obje vile su izgraðene po istom principu.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Imaju povr&scaron;inu 160 m2, a svaka se nalazi na parceli povr&scaron;ine 200 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Vile se sastoje od èetiri spavaæe sobe, dvije kupaonice, dnevnog boravka, kuhinje i terase s bazenom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Okuænica vile je lijepo ureðena i odr¾avana.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Svaka vila ima osigurana dva parking mjesta.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Vile su moderno dizajnirane, kvalitetno izgraðene sa svom potrebnom&nbsp;infrastrukturom (voda - cisterna, struja, energetski certifikat A, septièka jama).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Udaljenost do najbli¾ih trgovina, kafiæa i restorana je svega par stotina metara.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Aerodrom je udaljen 15 km.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za dodatne informacije molimo kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured u Splitu.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>We are offering these excellent value modern style villas with swimming pool and spectacular views of the sea and the bay.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>They are only 70 m from the sea, in the centre of the idyllic Dalmatian village.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The nearest coffee bars and cafe is 10 minutes stroll along the shore, and the nearest larger town is Trogir, a UNESCO heritage site, 10 minutes by car.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>These two villas were constructed in 2015 in a very peaceful location and include a spacious terrace with swimming pool with a beautiful unobstructed view of the sea.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Both villas are built on the same principle, with similar design.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>They have a surface of 160 m2, and each is on a plot of 200 m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Each villa consists of four bedrooms, two bathrooms, living room, kitchen and terrace with swimming pool.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The garden is beautifully landscaped and maintained.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Each villa has two private parking spaces provided.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Inside each house they have a modern open plan style living area, making the most of the great views through the large glass windows along the front of the property, with easy access to the terrace and balcony.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Infrastructure (water - water tank, electricity, energy certificate A septic tank).&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The airport is 15 km away.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For further information, please contact our office in Split.</p>', '', '1470_House-Villa_0.JPG', '1470_House-Villa_1.JPG', '1470_House-Villa_2.JPG', '1470_House-Villa_3.JPG', '1470_House-Villa_4.JPG', '1470_House-Villa_5.JPG', '1470_House-Villa_6.JPG', '1470_House-Villa_7.JPG', '1470_House-Villa_8.JPG'),
(1471, 'Bosiljka', 'Gruhl', '022 558645', '', '', 'Rogoznica', 'Podglavica Stupin 24 RG Stupin Èeline', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '5', '237', '155', 1, '350000', '', 2, 2, 2, 1, 1, 2, 5, 2, 'November 26, 2015', '<p>U prvom redu do mora na svega par metara od pla¾e nalazi se kuæa s koje se pru¾a pogled na more i uvalu.&nbsp;Kuæa je stambene povr&scaron;ine 155 m2 (bruto povr&scaron;ina 193 m2), a nalazi se na parceli povr&scaron;ine 237 m2.&nbsp;Dnevni boravak ima izlaz na prostranu terasu koja se pru¾e cijelom zapadnom stranom kuæe, a s koje se pru¾a lijep pogled na more.&nbsp;Na drugom katu su tri spavaæe sobe i kupaonica. Terasa se nalazi na zapadnoj strani kuæe.&nbsp;Oko kuæe je lijepo ureðen vrt.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>We are offering this five bedroom house-divided into two apartments, in the first line of property, only a few meters from the beach.&nbsp;The house has a floor area of 155 m2 (gross area of 193 m2), and it is located on a plot of 237 m2.&nbsp;On the ground floor are two bedrooms, kitchen and bathroom.&nbsp;The first floor has a living room, dining room and kitchen, and a spacious bathroom.&nbsp;The living room has access to a spacious terrace that stretches around the western side of the house, and offers a beautiful view.&nbsp;</p>', '', '<p>U prvom redu do mora na svega par metara od pla¾e nalazi se kuæa s koje se pru¾a pogled na more i uvalu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je stambene povr&scaron;ine 155 m2 (bruto povr&scaron;ina 193 m2), a nalazi se na parceli povr&scaron;ine 237 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U prizemlju kuæe su dvije spavaæe sobe, kuhinja i kupaonica.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na prvom katu se nalazi dnevni boravak s blagovaonicom i kuhinjom, te prostrani WC.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Dnevni boravak ima izlaz na prostranu terasu koja se pru¾e cijelom zapadnom stranom kuæe, a s koje se pru¾a lijepi pogled na more.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na drugom katu su tri spavaæe sobe i kupaonica.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Terasa je sa zapadne strane kuæe.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Oko kuæe je lijepo ureðen vrt.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Do kuæe se dolazi asfaltiranom cestom i osiguarno je parking mjesto.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa ima svu potrebnu infrastrukturu (gradska voda, struja, septièka jama).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Udaljenost do centra mjesta s restoranima, kafiæima i duæanima je par kilometara.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Aerodrom je udaljen 25 km.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za dodatne informacije molimo kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured u Splitu.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>We are offering this five bedroom house-divided into two apartments, in the first line of property, only a few meters from the beach.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house has a floor area of 155 m2 (gross area of 193 m2), and it is located on a plot of 237 m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the ground floor are two bedrooms, kitchen and bathroom.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The first floor has a living room, dining room and kitchen, and a spacious bathroom.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The living room has access to a spacious terrace that stretches around the western side of the house, and offers a beautiful view.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the second floor there are three bedrooms and a bathroom.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The terrace is on the west side of the house, and catches the late afternoon sun.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Around the house is a lovely landscaped garden.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house is reached by a paved road and the property has a parking space.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house has all the necessary infrastructure (urban water, electricity, septic tank).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The &nbsp;distance to the city centre with restaurants, cafes and shops is a couple of kilometers, or a 30 minute walk along the shore.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The airport is 25 km away.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For further information, please contact our office in Split.</p>', '', '1471_House-Villa_0.JPG', '1471_House-Villa_1.JPG', '1471_House-Villa_2.JPG', '1471_House-Villa_3.JPG', '1471_House-Villa_4.JPG', '1471_House-Villa_5.JPG', '1471_House-Villa_6.JPG', '1471_House-Villa_7.JPG', '1471_House-Villa_8.JPG');
INSERT INTO `nekretnina` (`id`, `ime`, `prezime`, `telefon`, `mobitel`, `e_mail`, `lokacija_id`, `adresa`, `status_id`, `vrsta_id`, `udaljenost`, `povrsina`, `stambenapovrsina`, `display`, `cijena`, `cijenatocka`, `ponuda_tjedna`, `new_built`, `must_sell`, `prvi_red_do_mora`, `pogled_na_more`, `bazen`, `broj_soba`, `broj_kupatila`, `datum`, `title_hr`, `title_en`, `title_ge`, `opis_hr`, `opis_en`, `opis_ge`, `PropertyImageURL0`, `PropertyImageURL1`, `PropertyImageURL2`, `PropertyImageURL3`, `PropertyImageURL4`, `PropertyImageURL5`, `PropertyImageURL6`, `PropertyImageURL7`, `PropertyImageURL8`) VALUES
(1472, 'Mladen', '©kreblin', '', '099 5900 948', 'mladen.skreblin@gmail.com', 'Brac', 'Murvica, Bol, Kc 5771 zgr 607, 695 k.o. nerezisca', 'For sale', 'Old stone house', '300', '350', '150', 1, '175000', '', 1, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 0, 0, 'November 26, 2015', '<p><span style="color: #ff0000;"><strong><span style="text-decoration: underline;">CIJENA SNI®ENA SA 250.000 euro!</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p>Iznimno &scaron;armantna kamena kuæa na otoku Braèu &ndash; nekretnina kakvu je danas rijetkost naæi na tr¾i&scaron;tu. Sastoji se od glavne dvojne kuæe na 3 eta¾e te pomoænog objekta, ukupne povr&scaron;ine oko 150 m2.&nbsp;Vrt ima povr&scaron;inu oko 350 m2, a iz nekretnine se pru¾a lijepi pogled na more koje je udaljeno svega 300 m zraène linije. Nekretnina nema direktan pristup automobilom &ndash; do nje vodi malen javni put.&nbsp;</p>', '<p><span style="color: #ff0000;"><strong><span style="text-decoration: underline;">PRICE REDUCED FROM 250.000 euro!</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p>Irresistibly charming stone house on Brac, a real gem that is hard to find on the market. It consists of a main semi-detached house on 3 levels, and auxiliary object, both sized ca. 150 sqm altogether.&nbsp;There is a garden of ca. 350 sqm and the property features lovely sea views. It is located only 300 meters areal distance from the sea. It does not have direct car access, but it''s a short walk from the paved road along the public path.&nbsp;</p>', '', '<p><strong><span style="color: #ff0000;">PRICED TO SELL!!</span></strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><span style="color: #000000;"><strong><span style="text-decoration: underline;">CIJENA SNI®ENA SA 250.000 euro!</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Iznimno &scaron;armantna kamena kuæa na otoku Braèu</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Iznimno &scaron;armantna kamena kuæa na otoku Braèu &ndash; nekretnina kakvu je danas rijetkost naæi na tr¾i&scaron;tu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sastoji se od glavne dvojne kuæe na 3 eta¾e te pomoænog objekta, ukupne povr&scaron;ine oko 150 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Vrt ima povr&scaron;inu oko 350 m2, a iz nekretnine se pru¾a lijepi pogled na more koje je udaljeno svega 300 m zraène linije.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nekretnina nema direktan pristup automobilom &ndash; do nje vodi malen javni put.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Dobar dio strukturnih renovacijskih radova je veæ obavljen, a do zavr&scaron;etka treba jo&scaron; ulo¾iti 50-70 tisuæa EUR.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Mjesto ima status eko-etno sela kako bi se oèuvala njegova jedinstvena arhitektura.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za dodatne informacije molimo kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured u Splitu.&nbsp;</p>', '<p><span style="color: #ff0000;"><strong>PRICED TO SELL!!</strong></span></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><span style="color: #000000;"><strong><span style="text-decoration: underline;">PRICE REDUCED FROM 250.000 euro!</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Irresistibly charming stone house on Brac</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Irresistibly charming stone house on Brac, a real gem that is hard to find on the market.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It consists of a main semi-detached house on 3 levels, and auxiliary object, both sized ca. 150 sqm altogether.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>euro</p>\r\n<p>There is a garden of ca. 350 sqm and the property features lovely sea views.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is located only 300 meters areal distance from the sea.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It does not have direct car access, but it''s a short walk from the paved road along the public path.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property has already undertaken great renovation works, including electricity and water being installed and septic tank formed.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Estimated renovation costs until completion and turn-key system are 50-70 thousand euros.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The village has eco-ethno status to ensure presevation of its unique artchitecture. &nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For further information please contact our office in Split.&nbsp;</p>', '', '1472_Old-stone-house_0.jpg', '1472_Old-stone-house_1.jpg', '1472_Old-stone-house_2.jpg', '1472_Old-stone-house_3.jpg', '1472_Old-stone-house_4.jpg', '1472_Old-stone-house_5.jpg', '1472_Old-stone-house_6.jpg', '1472_Old-stone-house_7.jpg', ''),
(1473, 'Igor ', 'Keser', '', '091 3012 971', 'igor.keser@elasto.hr', 'Brac', '7/2, 7/3, 182/1, 184/1, 189/3 k.o. splitska', 'For sale', 'Old stone house', '5', '430', '367', 1, '700000', '', 2, 2, 2, 1, 1, 2, 0, 0, 'November 26, 2015', '<p>Ova nekretnina izgraðena je u 16.stoljeæu. Izvorno je zami&scaron;ljena kao utvrda, no vremenom je do¾ivljela brojne izmjene koje su rezultirale dana&scaron;njim izgledom.&nbsp;Velika vrata sa ulice vode u unutarnje dvori&scaron;te iz kojeg se pristupa u oba dijela nekretnine. Na lijevoj se strani nalazi prva kuæa na 3 eta¾e i kula, dok se na desnoj strani nalazi veliki poploèani prostor te ulaz u stan na prvom katu druge kuæe.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>The property was built in the 16th century. Originally designed as a fortification, it went through a number of changes giving its current shape and looks.&nbsp;Large doors open into the courtyard, from where both parts of the property can be accessed. On the left side there is a house on 3 floors and a castle, while the right part of the yard leads onto spacious paved deck and the apartment on the first floor of the other house.</p>', '', '<p>Ova nekretnina izgraðena je u 16.stoljeæu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Izvorno je zami&scaron;ljena kao utvrda, no vremenom je do¾ivljela brojne izmjene koje su rezultirale dana&scaron;njim izgledom.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Velika vrata sa ulice vode u unutarnje dvori&scaron;te iz kojeg se pristupa u oba dijela nekretnine.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na lijevoj se strani nalazi prva kuæa na 3 eta¾e i kula, dok se na desnoj strani nalazi veliki poploèani prostor te ulaz u stan na prvom katu druge kuæe. &nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa na lijevoj strani sastoji se od konobe u prizemlju, a na prvom i drugom katu od 3 prostorije sa hodnikom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Iz zadnje eta¾e ulazi se u prostor kule, gdje je najvi&scaron;a visina zadnjeg kata 7 metara.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ovaj dio nekretnine strukturno je stabilan, za novim podnim konstruktivnim elementima i promijenjenim krovi&scaron;tem.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Bez obzira &scaron;to je prostor useljiv, potrebno mu je jo&scaron; dodatnih radova u unapreðenja kako bi na vidjelo iza&scaron;ao njegov potpuni potencijal.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Stan na prvom katu kuæe nasuprot ima 3 sobe, èajnu kuhinju i kupaonicu.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Zemlji&scaron;te ima povr&scaron;inu od oko 430 m2, a ukupna stabmena pov&scaron;ina svih dijelova nekretnine iznosi oko 367 m2. &nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za dodatne informacije molimo kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured u Splitu.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>The property was built in the 16th century.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Originally designed as a fortification, it went through a number of changes giving its current shape and looks.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Large doors open into the courtyard, from where both parts of the property can be accessed.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the left side there is a house on 3 floors and a castle, while the right part of the yard leads onto spacious paved deck and the apartment on the first floor of the other house.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>House of the left side comprises of a ground floor (summer kitchen, storage), first floor (3 rooms and hallway) and second floor (3 rooms and hallway) opening into the attick and the castle (top floor is 7 meters high).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>This part of the property is structurally sound, with new tiled roof and new supporting structures in between the floors.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is habitable, but still needs quite substantial amount of works to gain its former glory.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The apartment on the first floor of the house to the right contains 3 rooms, kitchenette and bathroom.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There is about 430 sqm of the land and 367 sqm of the living space in total.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For further information please contact our office in Split.&nbsp;</p>', '', '1473_Old-stone-house_0.jpg', '1473_Old-stone-house_1.jpg', '1473_Old-stone-house_2.jpg', '1473_Old-stone-house_3.jpg', '1473_Old-stone-house_4.jpg', '1473_Old-stone-house_5.jpg', '1473_Old-stone-house_6.jpg', '', ''),
(1474, 'Stefica', ' Vasko', '035 440-290', '', 'vesna.zanko64@gmail.com', 'Hvar', '264/3 Pitve', 'For sale', 'Old stone house', '400', '0', '50', 1, '55000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 0, 0, 'November 26, 2015', '<p>Stara kamena kuæa za renovaciju, s prekrasnim pogledom na more, na ju¾noj strani otoka.&nbsp;Kuæa je dvojna, a sastoji se od prizemlja i kata ukupne stambene povr&scaron;ine 50 m2.&nbsp;Kuæa zahtijeva kompletnu renovaciju.&nbsp;U prizemlju se nalazi konoba (5.5x8).&nbsp;Iza kuæe je terasa, a na prvom katu balkon (5.5x7) s kojeg se pru¾a oèaravajuæ pogled na more.&nbsp;<br /><br /></p>', '<p>Fabulous renovation project on Hvar Island. We are pleased to offer this old stone house for renovation, situated within a small and historic village with basic shops, cafes and bars on the south side of the island of Hvar.&nbsp;The house is detached and consists of two floors with a total floor area of 50 m2, but requires complete renovation.&nbsp;On the ground floor, built into the sloping side of the hill, there is a tavern (5.5x8). &nbsp;</p>', '', '<p>Stara kamena kuæa za renovaciju, s prekrasnim pogledom na more, na ju¾noj strani otoka.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je dvojna, a sastoji se od prizemlja i kata ukupne stambene povr&scaron;ine 50 m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa zahtijeva kompletnu renovaciju.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U prizemlju se nalazi konoba (5.5x8).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Iza kuæe je terasa, a na prvom katu balkon (5.5x7) s kojeg se pru¾a oèaravajuæ pogled na more.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je ju¾no orijentirana.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ima pristup automobilom.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Vlasni&scaron;tvo je èisto, va¾eæa graðevinska dozvola.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U centru mjesta su svi potrebni sadr¾aji, a trgovina se nalazi u blizini same nekretnine.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Mjesto obiluje prekrasnim &scaron;ljunèanim pla¾ama, koje su udaljene od kuæe samo 400 m.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za sve dodatne informacije molimo kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured.&nbsp;</p>', '<p><strong>Fabulous renovation project on Hvar Island</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>We are pleased to offer this old stone house for renovation, situated within a small and historic village with basic shops, cafes and bars on the south side of the island of Hvar.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house is detached and consists of two floors with a total floor area of 50 m2, but requires complete renovation.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the ground floor, built into the sloping side of the hill, there is a tavern (5.5x8). &nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The first floor, the same size has a kitchen, lounge area, bathroom and bedroom.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>At the rear of the house is a terrace, and on the first floor (5.5x7), is a balcony which offers a striking view across the sea.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house is south oriented.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It has access by a car with parking close by.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The local shore is full of beautiful sandy beaches, which are only 400m away from the house.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>This could be a fabulous property and a great project to restore the building.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For further information please contact our office.</p>', '', '1474_Old-stone-house_0.jpg', '1474_Old-stone-house_1.jpg', '1474_Old-stone-house_2.jpg', '1474_Old-stone-house_3.jpg', '1474_Old-stone-house_4.jpg', '1474_Old-stone-house_5.jpg', '1474_Old-stone-house_6.jpg', '1474_Old-stone-house_7.jpg', '1474_Old-stone-house_8.jpg'),
(1475, '', 'Policajac ???', '', '', '', 'Hvar', 'Vrboska', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '150', '180', '105', 1, '79000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 3, 3, 'November 26, 2015', '<p>Dvojna kuæa starije gradnje, na tri eta¾e.&nbsp;Kuæa je udaljena samo 150 m od mora.&nbsp;Sastoji se od prizemlja, prvog i drugog kata (potkrovlja) ukupne stambene povr&scaron;ine 105 m2, a nalazi se na zemlji&scaron;tu povr&scaron;ine 180 m2.&nbsp;Vanjske stepenice vode na prvi kat gdje se nalazi studio apartman od 26 m2, te velika terasa (14 m2) sjeverno orijentirana, stra¾nja terasa od 7 m2 i prilazna terasa (5 m2).&nbsp;Potkrovlje se sastoji od studio apartmana od 24 m2 s balkonom (5 m2).</p>', '<p>We have this three story house, needing renovation, in a traditional village on Hvar Island.&nbsp;It is a semi-detached house on three floors, situated 150m from the shore but still with great views across the bay and the sea. There is a ground floor, first floor and second floor (top) with a total floor area of 105 m2 and it is located on a plot of 180 m2.&nbsp;On the ground floor is one apartment of 46 m2. There are external stairs leading to the first floor. The top floor has a studio apartment of 24 m2 with its own balcony (5 m2).&nbsp;</p>', '', '<p>Dvojna kuæa starije gradnje, na tri eta¾e.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je udaljena samo 150 m od mora.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sastoji se od prizemlja, prvog i drugog kata (potkrovlja) ukupne stambene povr&scaron;ine 105 m2, a nalazi se na zemlji&scaron;tu povr&scaron;ine 180 m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U prizemlju je jednosoban apartman od 46 m2 i prostorija koja slu¾i kao ostava.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ispred kuæe su dvori&scaron;te i vrt.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Vanjske stepenice vode na prvi kat gdje se nalazi studio apartman od 26 m2, te velika terasa (14 m2) sjeverno orijentirana, stra¾nja terasa od 7 m2 i prilazna terasa (5 m2).&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Potkrovlje se sastoji od studio apartmana od 24 m2 s balkonom (5 m2).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Parking mjesto u dvori&scaron;tu i ispred kuæe.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæi je potrebna kompletna renovacija.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nalazi se na mirnoj lokaciji, u blizini trgovina, kafiæa i restorana, samo nekoliko minuta od centra grada.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za dodatne informacije molimo kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured u Splitu.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>We have this three story house, needing renovation, in a traditional village on Hvar Island.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is a semi-detached house on three floors, situated 150m from the shore but still with great views across the bay and the sea.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There is a ground floor, first floor and second floor (top) with a total floor area of 105 m2 and it is located on a plot of 180 m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the ground floor is one apartment of 46 m2 and a store room that servesas a pantry.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>In front of the house is a parking area and garden.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There are external stairs leading to the first floor where there is a studio apartment of 26 m2, with a large terrace of 14 m2 (north-oriented) and a rear terrace of 12m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The top floor has a studio apartment of 24 m2 with its own balcony (5 m2).&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There is a parking space in the yard in front of the house.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house is in need of complete renovation.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is situated in a quiet location, close to shops, cafes and restaurants, only a few minutes from the old harbour and centre of the village.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It has good transport links, and is popular with yachts because of its decent Marina.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For further information, please contact our office in Split.</p>', '', '1475_House-Villa_0.jpg', '1475_House-Villa_1.jpg', '1475_House-Villa_2.jpg', '1475_House-Villa_3.jpg', '1475_House-Villa_4.jpg', '', '', '', ''),
(1476, '', 'Konzum', '021/319-313', '', '', 'Hvar', 'Jelsa', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '150', '0', '60', 1, '59000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 1, 'November 26, 2015', '<p>Prodaju se dva apartmana u staroj kamenoj kuæi na prvom katu.&nbsp;Svaki apartman ima povr&scaron;inu 30 m2, a sastoji se od spavaæe sobe, kuhinje, blagovaonice, dnevnog boravka i kupaonice.&nbsp;Stanu koji je ju¾no orijentiran pripada vrt povr&scaron;ine 25 m2.&nbsp;Drugi stan, sjeverno orijentiran, ima balkon.&nbsp;Kuæa je udaljena od mora samo 150 m.</p>', '<p>We are offering these two apartments - both on the first floor of an old stone house on the north side of Hvar island. They are situated in a small and attractive village, only a few minute''s walk from the beach and conveniently close to essential village facilities - such as the bakery, bars, cafe and other useful shops, 150 m from the sea. Each apartment has an area of 30 m2.&nbsp;</p>', '', '<p>Prodaju se dva apartmana u staroj kamenoj kuæi na prvom katu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Svaki apartman ima povr&scaron;inu 30 m2, a sastoji se od spavaæe sobe, kuhinje, blagovaonice, dnevnog boravka i kupaonice.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Stanu koji je ju¾no orijentiran pripada vrt povr&scaron;ine 25 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Drugi stan, sjeverno orijentiran, ima balkon.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je udaljena od mora samo 150 m, te je smje&scaron;tena u samom centru mjesta gdje se nalaze svi potrebni sadr¾aji (trgovine, po&scaron;ta, restorani, barovi...).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Vlasni&scaron;tvo uredno.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Pla¾a je udaljena samo nekoliko minuta &scaron;etnje.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za sve dodatne informacije molimo kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured.</p>', '<p><strong>Fabulous value</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>We are offering these two apartments - both on the first floor of an old stone house on the north side of Hvar island.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>They are situated in a small and attractive village, only a few minute''s walk from the beach and conveniently close to essential village facilities - such as the bakery, bars, cafe and other useful shops.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Each apartment has an area of 30 m2 and consists of a bedroom, kitchen, dining room, living room and bathroom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The apartment, which is oriented to the south, has a garden of 25 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The second apartment, north-oriented, has a balcony.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There is street parking close to the property.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house is only 150 m from the sea, and the harbour - which is effectively the town centre.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The nearest larger town with direct ferry access to Split, is 6 km distant.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There is also a regular sea plane connection to the island.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For further information please contact our office.</p>', '', '1476_Apartment_0.jpg', '1476_Apartment_1.jpg', '1476_Apartment_2.jpg', '1476_Apartment_3.jpg', '1476_Apartment_4.jpg', '', '', '', ''),
(1477, '', 'ZG???', '', '', '', 'Hvar', 'Pitve', 'For sale', 'Old stone house', '2000', '150', '67', 1, '90000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 1, 1, 'November 26, 2015', '<p>Stara kamena kuæa za adaptaciju u predivnom selu na otoku Hvaru.&nbsp;Kuæa je useljiva (zahtijeva modernizaciju), a sastoji se od prizemlja, prvog i drugog kata ukupne stambene povr&scaron;ine 67 m2.&nbsp;S oba balkona se pru¾a predivan pogled na more.&nbsp;Orijentacija jugoistok.&nbsp;U vrtu od 150 m2 smje&scaron;ten je i manji objekt za renovaciju, povr&scaron;ine 15 m2 s kojeg se pru¾a pogled na more i Makarsku rivijeru.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;">CIJENA SNI®ENA SA 100.000 EUR!!</span></p>', '<p>We are offering this old stone house for renovation in a beautiful village on the island. The house is habitable but requires modernisation, and it consists of a ground, first and second floors with a total floor area of 67 m2. From both balcony there are magnificent views of the sea.&nbsp;The house orientation is south-east.&nbsp;In the garden of 150 m2 is located and additional small building for renovation, of 15 m2 again with views of the sea and the Makarska Riviera.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;">PRICE REDUCED FROM 100.000 EUR!!</span></p>', '', '<p><strong><span style="text-decoration: underline;">CIJENA SNI®ENA SA 100.000 EUR!!</span><br /></strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Stara kamena kuæa za adaptaciju u predivnom selu na otoku Hvaru.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je useljiva (zahtijeva modernizaciju), a sastoji se od prizemlja, prvog i drugog kata ukupne stambene povr&scaron;ine 67 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U prizemlju se nalaze kuhinja i blagovaonica.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Unutarnje stepeni&scaron;te vodi do prvog kata gdje je dnevni boravak.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na drugom katu se nalazi spavaæa soba.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>S oba balkona se pru¾a predivan pogled na more.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Orijentacija jugoistok.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U vrtu od 150 m2 smje&scaron;ten je i manji objekt za renovaciju, povr&scaron;ine 15 m2 s kojeg se pru¾a pogled na more i Makarsku rivijeru.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Udaljenost od veæeg grada i svih potrebnih sadr¾aja je 2 km.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za sve dodatne informacije molimo kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured.&nbsp;</p>', '<p><strong><span style="text-decoration: underline;">PRICE REDUCED FROM 100.000 EUR!!</span><br /></strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>We are offering this old stone house for renovation in a beautiful village on the island.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house is habitable but requires modernisation, and it consists of a ground, first and second floors with a total floor area of 67 m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The ground floor has a kitchen and dining room.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There are internal staircase that lead to the first floor where there is a substantial living room.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the second floor is a bedroom.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>From both balcony there are magnificent views of the sea.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house orientation is south-east.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>In the garden of 150 m2 is located and additional small building for renovation, of 15 m2 again with views of the sea and the Makarska Riviera.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Distance from the nearest large town and its facilities is 2 km.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For further information please contact our office.</p>', '', '1477_Old-stone-house_0.jpg', '1477_Old-stone-house_1.jpg', '1477_Old-stone-house_2.jpg', '1477_Old-stone-house_3.jpg', '1477_Old-stone-house_4.jpg', '1477_Old-stone-house_5.jpg', '1477_Old-stone-house_6.jpg', '1477_Old-stone-house_7.jpg', '1477_Old-stone-house_8.jpg'),
(1478, 'Ivi¹iæ ', 'Mladen', '', '', '', 'Hvar', 'Priko, Stari Grad', 'For sale', 'Land plot', '110', '473', '0', 2, '100000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 0, 0, 'November 26, 2015', '<p>Prodaje se graðevinsko zemlji&scaron;te ju¾ne orijentacije, udaljeno od mora i pla¾e samo 110 m.&nbsp;Zemlji&scaron;te ima povr&scaron;inu 473 m2.&nbsp;Infrastruktura odmah do zemlji&scaron;ta.&nbsp;Ima pristup vozilom i parking.&nbsp;Zemlji&scaron;te se nalazi na mirnoj lokaciji, a u blizini svih sadr¾aja i trajektne luke.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>We are selling this building land plot, facing south, only 110 m from the shore, in one of the larger villages on Hvar Island.&nbsp;The land has an area of 473 m2.&nbsp;All the necessary infrastructure is already next to the land, making the connections for water, electric etc. straight forward.&nbsp;It has car access and private parking.&nbsp;The land is located in a quiet location, conveniently close to all amenities and the ferry port in the centre of the village.&nbsp;</p>', '', '<p>Prodaje se graðevinsko zemlji&scaron;te ju¾ne orijentacije, udaljeno od mora i pla¾e samo 110 m.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Zemlji&scaron;te ima povr&scaron;inu 473 m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Infrastruktura odmah do zemlji&scaron;ta.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ima pristup vozilom i parking.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Zemlji&scaron;te se nalazi na mirnoj lokaciji, a u blizini svih sadr¾aja i trajektne luke.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Otok Hvar je veæ godinama popularna destinacija, kako za ljetovanje tako i za investiranje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Osim &scaron;to je povezan trajektnom linijom sa gradom Splitom, takoðer je povezan i avionskom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za sve dodatne informacije molimo kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>We are selling this building land plot, facing south, only 110 m from the shore, in one of the larger villages on Hvar Island.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The land has an area of 473 m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>All the necessary infrastructure is already next to the land, making the connections for water, electric etc. straight forward.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It has car access and private parking.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The land is located in a quiet location, conveniently close to all amenities and the ferry port in the centre of the village.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There is also the seaplane service to the mainland from the island.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The island of Hvar has been a popular destination for both holiday tourists and for investment.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For further information please contact our office.</p>', '', '1478_Land-plot_0.jpg', '1478_Land-plot_1.jpg', '1478_Land-plot_2.jpg', '1478_Land-plot_3.jpg', '1478_Land-plot_4.jpg', '1478_Land-plot_5.jpg', '1478_Land-plot_6.jpg', '1478_Land-plot_7.jpg', '1478_Land-plot_8.jpg'),
(1479, 'Boris', 'Vojkoviæ', 'Kresimir  091 2761 234', '098 484 302', 'borisvojkovic3@gmail.com', 'Hvar', 'Jelsa, Cest.zgr. 574    376/2', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '200', '0', '100', 1, '110000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 4, 2, 'November 27, 2015', '<p>Stanovi u staroj kamenoj kuæi na otoku Hvaru, u blizini mora. Prodaju se dva stana, u prizemlju i na prvom katu, svaki ima po 50 m2, sa zajednièkim malim dvori&scaron;tem ispred.&nbsp;Ulaz/hodnik je zajednièki.&nbsp;Stan u prizemlju ima kupaonicu, dvije sobe, kuhinju, blagovaonicu, ostavu, te mu pripada dvoriste od 15 &nbsp;m2.&nbsp;Stepeni&scaron;te vodi do kata gdje se nalaze dvije sobe, dnevni boravak i kupaonica. Svaki stan ima stambenu povr&scaron;inu 50 m2. Navedena je ukupna cijena za oba stana.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>', '<p>We have these two apartments for sale in a converted old stone house in a small town on the north side of Hvar island. They are situated 200m from the sea, a two minute walk through the old narrow village streets, passing bars, coffee shops, cafes and shops.&nbsp;The two apartments are on the ground floor and first floor, each with 50 m2, with a common, small garden in front. The staircase leads to the first floor. Each apartment has a living area of 50 m2. First floor apartment has a sea view.</p>', '', '<p>Stanovi u staroj kamenoj kuæi na otoku Hvaru, u blizini mora.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Prodaju se dva stana, u prizemlju i na prvom katu, svaki ima po 50 &nbsp;m2, sa zajednièkim malim dvori&scaron;tem ispred.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ulaz/hodnik je zajednièki.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Stan u prizemlju ima kupaonicu, dvije sobe, kuhinju, blagovaonicu, ostavu, te mu pripada dvoriste od 15 &nbsp;m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Stepeni&scaron;te vodi do kata gdje se nalaze dvije sobe, dnevni boravak i kupaonica.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Svaki stan ima stambenu povr&scaron;inu 50 m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Stan na prvom katu ima pogled na more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ne postoji moguænost kupnje stanova odvojeno.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa se nalazi na mirnoj lokaciji, a nadomak svi sadr¾ajima (restoranima, barovima, trgovinama...).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Od mora je udaljena samo 200 m.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za sve dodatne informacije molimo kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>We have these two apartments for sale in a converted old stone house in a small town on the north side of Hvar island.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>They are situated 200m from the sea, a two minute walk through the old narrow village streets, passing bars, coffee shops, cafes and shops.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The two apartments are on the ground floor and first floor, each with 50 m2, with a common, small garden in front.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The entrance / hallway is shared.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The ground floor apartment has a bathroom, two bedrooms, kitchen, dining room, pantry, and it has garden of 15 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The staircase leads to the first floor where there are two bedrooms, living room and bathroom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Each apartment has a living area of 50 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>First floor apartment has a sea view.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Both apartments need redecorating, internally, but the building seems in good condition.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There is NO option to purchase apartments separately.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The ferry port is 5 km away, there is also a sea plane connection to Split available on the island.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For further information please contact our office.</p>', '', '1479_Apartment_0.jpg', '1479_Apartment_1.jpg', '1479_Apartment_2.jpg', '1479_Apartment_3.jpg', '1479_Apartment_4.jpg', '1479_Apartment_5.jpg', '1479_Apartment_6.jpg', '1479_Apartment_7.jpg', '1479_Apartment_8.jpg'),
(1480, 'Pavino', 'Petriæ', '', '0911765029', '', 'Hvar', 'Stari Grad', 'For sale', 'Old stone house', '30', '0', '70', 1, '200000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 'November 27, 2015', '<p>Stara kamena kuæa u centru grada, samo 30 m od mora.&nbsp;Kuæa se sastoji od prizemlja, prvog kata i potkrovlja, ukupne stambene povr&scaron;ine 70 m2.&nbsp;U prizemlju se nalazi &nbsp;konoba, koja trenutno slu¾i kao poslovni prostor, s posebnim ulazom sa ulice.&nbsp;Na prvom katu su kuhinja, dnevni boravak, blagovaonica, kupaonica i wc.&nbsp;U potkrovlju se nalazi jedna spavaæa soba.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>We are pleased to be offering this old stone house in the centre of this historic and charming village, just 30 m from the sea. The house consists of ground floor, first and top floor, with a total surface area of 70 m2.&nbsp;On the ground floor there is a cellar, which is currently used as office space, and has a separate entrance from the street.&nbsp;On the first floor is the kitchen, living room, dining room, bathroom and toilet, while on the top floor is one bedroom.&nbsp;</p>', '', '<p>Stara kamena kuæa u centru grada, samo 30 m od mora.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa se sastoji od prizemlja, prvog kata i potkrovlja, ukupne stambene povr&scaron;ine 70 m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U prizemlju se nalazi &nbsp;konoba, koja trenutno slu¾i kao poslovni prostor, s posebnim ulazom sa ulice.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na prvom katu su kuhinja, dnevni boravak, blagovaonica, kupaonica i wc.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U potkrovlju se nalazi jedna spavaæa soba.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je orijentirana jugoistoèno.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za dodatne informacije molimo kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>We are pleased to be offering this old stone house in the centre of this historic and charming village, just 30 m from the sea.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house consists of ground floor, first and top floor, with a total surface area of 70 m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the ground floor there is a cellar, which is currently used as office space, and has a separate entrance from the street.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the first floor is the kitchen, living room, dining room, bathroom and toilet, while on the top floor is one bedroom.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house is in reasonably good condition, but would benefit from some redecorating.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house is oriented southeast.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For further information, please contact our office in Split.</p>', '', '1480_Old-stone-house_0.jpg', '1480_Old-stone-house_1.jpg', '1480_Old-stone-house_2.jpg', '1480_Old-stone-house_3.jpg', '1480_Old-stone-house_4.jpg', '', '', '', ''),
(1481, '', 'Sraka', '', '', '', 'Hvar', 'Vrboska', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '100', '400', '230', 1, '220000', '', 2, 1, 2, 2, 1, 2, 2, 2, 'November 27, 2015', '<p>Novogradnja - Samostojeæa kuæa u blizini mora i prekrasnih pla¾a.&nbsp;Kuæa se sastoji od podzemne gara¾e i 2 kata ukupne stambene povr&scaron;ine 230 m2.&nbsp;Zemlji&scaron;te na kojem je kuæa smje&scaron;tena ima povr&scaron;inu 400 m2.&nbsp;Raspored prostorija se mo¾e mijenjati po ¾elji kupca.&nbsp;Kuæi pripada parking od 30 m2.&nbsp;Kuæa je udaljena samo 100 m od mora.&nbsp;Vlasni&scaron;tvo uredno.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>We are offering this newly constructed house near the sea on the island of Hvar. It is situated 100m from the shore in a village well catered for with a bakery, small shops and cafes and bars. The house has an underground garage and 2 floors with a total floor area of 230 m2. The land plot on which the house is located is 400 m2.&nbsp;The fittings and decorating design can be selected and chosen with the developer to the choice of the customer.&nbsp;</p>', '', '<p>Novogradnja - Samostojeæa kuæa u blizini mora i prekrasnih pla¾a.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa se sastoji od podzemne gara¾e i 2 kata ukupne stambene povr&scaron;ine 230 m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Zemlji&scaron;te na kojem je kuæa smje&scaron;tena ima povr&scaron;inu 400 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ju¾ne je orijentacije.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na prvom katu se nalaze dnevni boravak, spavaæa soba, kuhinja, kupaonica i terasa.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Drugi kat se sastoji od dnevnog boravka, spavaæe sobe, kuhinje, kupaonice i terase s djelomiènim pogledom na more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Raspored prostorija se mo¾e mijenjati po ¾elji kupca. &nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæi pripada parking od 30 m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je udaljena samo 100 m od mora.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Vlasni&scaron;tvo uredno.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za sve dodatne informacije molimo kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>We are offering this newly constructed house near the sea on the island of Hvar.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is situated 100m from the shore in a village well catered for with a bakery, small shops and cafes and bars.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house has an underground garage and 2 floors with a total floor area of 230 m2.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The land plot on which the house is located is 400 m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property has a southern orientation.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the first floor is a modern open plan style are a living room, bedroom, kitchen, bathroom and terrace and on the second floor there is a living room, bedroom, kitchen, bathroom and terrace with partial sea view.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The fittings and decorating design can be selected and chosen with the developer to the choice of the customer.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house has extra parking of 30 m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For further information please contact our office in Split or Hvar.</p>', '', '1481_House-Villa_0.JPG', '1481_House-Villa_1.jpg', '1481_House-Villa_2.jpg', '1481_House-Villa_3.jpg', '1481_House-Villa_4.jpg', '', '', '', ''),
(1482, '', 'Sraka', '0049 721 374365', '0049 15229311320', '', 'Hvar', 'Vrboska', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '100', '150', '170', 1, '340000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 3, 3, 'November 27, 2015', '<p>Samostojeæa kuæa novije gradnje, samo 100 m od mora.&nbsp;Kuæa se sastoji od 3 apartmana ukupne stambene povr&scaron;ine 170 m2.&nbsp;U prizemlju se nalaze jedan stan i gara¾a, a vanjsko stepeni&scaron;te vodi do drugog kata gdje su smje&scaron;tena 2 apartmana.&nbsp;Ispred kuæe je lijepo ureðen vrt (150 m2) s mediteranskim biljem.&nbsp;Kuæa je ju¾no orijentirana.&nbsp;Oba apartmana na prvom katu imaju izlaz na balkon s kojeg se pru¾a djelomièan pogled na more.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>We have this well located detached apartment house in a small town on the island of Hvar. The property is situated 100m from the shore, conveniently close to shops, bars and coffee shops in the small and charismatic village. The house consists of 3 apartments with a total floor area of 170 m2.&nbsp;On the ground floor there is one apartment and a garage with an external staircase leading to the second floor where there are two more apartments.&nbsp;The house is surrounded by a beautiful landscaped garden (150 m2).</p>', '', '<p>Samostojeæa kuæa novije gradnje, samo 100 m od mora.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa se sastoji od 3 apartmana ukupne stambene povr&scaron;ine 170 m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U prizemlju se nalaze jedan stan i gara¾a, a vanjsko stepeni&scaron;te vodi do drugog kata gdje su smje&scaron;tena 2 apartmana.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ispred kuæe je lijepo ureðen vrt (150 m2) s mediteranskim biljem.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je ju¾no orijentirana.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Oba apartmana na prvom katu imaju izlaz na balkon s kojeg se pru¾a djelomièan pogled na more.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Vlasni&scaron;tvo uredno.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Svi potrebni sadr¾aji (trgovina, restorani, kafiæi) i pla¾a nalaze se u blizini.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za sve dodatne informacije molimo kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>We have this well located detached apartment house in a small town on the island of Hvar.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property is situated 100m from the shore, conveniently close to shops, bars and coffee shops in the small and charismatic village.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house consists of 3 apartments with a total floor area of 170 m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the ground floor there is one apartment and a garage with an external staircase leading to the second floor where there are two more apartments.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house is surrounded by a beautiful landscaped garden (150 m2) planted with many Mediterranean plants.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house is south oriented.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Both apartments on the first floor have a balcony that offers a partial sea view.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For further information please contact our office either in Split or Hvar.</p>', '', '1482_House-Villa_0.jpg', '1482_House-Villa_1.jpg', '1482_House-Villa_2.JPG', '1482_House-Villa_3.jpg', '1482_House-Villa_4.jpg', '1482_House-Villa_5.jpg', '1482_House-Villa_6.jpg', '', ''),
(1483, '', 'Renato', '', '', '', 'Hvar', 'Pitve', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '1500', '550', '260', 1, '650000', '', 2, 1, 2, 2, 1, 1, 4, 5, 'November 27, 2015', '<p>Dvije vile u novogradnji s bazenom, na ju¾noj strani otoka Hvara.&nbsp;Vile imaju pogled na more, selo i brda, a nalaze se na mirno lokaciji kraj borove &scaron;ume. Sastoje se od podruma, prizemlja i potkrovlja ukupne stambene povr&scaron;ine 260 m2. Svaka vila ima 4 sobe sa svojom kupaonicom u potkrovlju te izlaz na terasu. Podrum od 55 m2 ima podno grijanje, saunu, fitness i konobu. Terase imaju 50 m2.</p>', '<p>We are pleased to offer this newly constructed pair of villas, with individual private swimming pools on the island of Hvar. They are blessed with views of the sea and across the natural woods and old olive groves which surround the area - a place where there can be absolute silence. They consist of a basement, ground floor and top floor with a total living area of 260 m2. Each villa has 4 bedrooms with a bathroom on the top floor and balcony.</p>', '', '<p>Dvije vile u novogradnji s bazenom, na ju¾noj strani otoka Hvara.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Vile imaju pogled na more, selo i brda, a nalaze se na mirnoj lokaciji kraj borove &scaron;ume.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Vile su ju¾no orijentirane.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sastoje se od podruma, prizemlja i potkrovlja ukupne stambene povr&scaron;ine 260 m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Svaka vila ima 4 sobe sa svojom kupaonicom u potkrovlju te izlaz na terasu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Prizemlje se sastoji od kupaonice, kuhinje, blagovaonice te dnevnog boravka s izlazom na terasu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Podrum od 55 m2 ima podno grijanje, saunu, fitness i konobu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Terase imaju 50 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Bazen prve zgrade 33 m2, dok drugi ima povr&scaron;inu 42 m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za dodatne informacije molimo kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>We are pleased to offer this newly constructed pair of villas, with individual private swimming pools on the island of Hvar.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>They are situated in a small and utterly charming inland village on the south side of the island, 2km from the coast.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>They are blessed with views of the sea and across the natural woods and old olive groves which surround the area - a place where there can be absolute silence.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>A 30 minute walk, or short cycle ride brings you to a larger town with modern facilities such as shops, bars and cafes, and of course, the coast - where there many safe areas for swimming and playing in the water.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The villas are south oriented.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>They consist of a basement, ground floor and top floor with a total living area of 260 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Each villa has 4 bedrooms with a bathroom on the top floor and balcony.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The ground floor consists of a bathroom, open plan designed kitchen, dining room and living room with access to the terrace.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Basement of 55 m2 has under floor heating, sauna, fitness room and a tavern.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Terrace is 50 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The swimming pool for the first building 33 m2, while the other has a surface of 42 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For further information, please contact our office.</p>', '', '1483_House-Villa_0.jpg', '1483_House-Villa_1.jpg', '1483_House-Villa_2.jpg', '1483_House-Villa_3.jpg', '1483_House-Villa_4.jpg', '1483_House-Villa_5.jpg', '1483_House-Villa_6.jpg', '1483_House-Villa_7.jpg', '1483_House-Villa_8.jpg'),
(1484, 'Alfastan 2surad', 'Andrea Bogdanoviæ ', '', '095 455 2077', 'andrea.bogdanovic@alfastan2.hr', 'Split', 'Podstrana', 'For sale', 'Land plot', '1500', '3000', '0', 1, '240000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 0, 0, 'November 27, 2015', '<p>Na prodaju nudimo veliko graðevinsko zemlji&scaron;te u neposrednoj blizini infrastrukture, sa predivnim pogledom na more i splitski akvatorij te projektom za gradnju stambeno-gospodarskog kompleksa, tj. vile sa pomoænim objektom i bazenom.&nbsp;Vila bi prema trenutnom idejnom rje&scaron;enju trebala imati 175 m2 bruto razvijene povr&scaron;ine, bazen 46 m2, a gospodarska graðevina 199 m2.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>For sale we have this large building plot nearby the infrastructure, featuring amazing views on the sea and Split channel as well as the project documentation to build a villa and commercial premise with the pool.&nbsp;According to conceptual design, the villa should have the size of 175 sqm, pool is 46 sqm and commercial premise 199 sqm.</p>', '', '<p><strong>Graðevinsko zemlji&scaron;te sa projektom</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na prodaju nudimo veliko graðevinsko zemlji&scaron;te u neposrednoj blizini infrastrukture, sa predivnim pogledom na more i splitski akvatorij te projektom za gradnju stambeno-gospodarskog kompleksa, tj. vile sa pomoænim objektom i bazenom.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Vila bi prema trenutnom idejnom rje&scaron;enju trebala imati 175 m2 bruto razvijene povr&scaron;ine, bazen 46 m2, a gospodarska graðevina 199 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Cijena ukljuèuje zemlji&scaron;te i postojeæi idejni projekt, ali ne i komunalne doprinose ili bilo kakve tro&scaron;kove povezane sa izmjenama i dopunama projekta.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nekretnina se nalazi na iznimno mirnom mjestu, udaljena je od mora oko 1,5 km zraène linije, na obrocnima brda Perun svega 15tak minuta vo¾nje od Splita.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za dodatne informacije molimo kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured u Splitu.&nbsp;</p>', '<p><strong>Building land with the project</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For sale we have this large building plot nearby the infrastructure, featuring amazing views on the sea and Split channel as well as the project documentation to build a villa and commercial premise with the pool.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>According to conceptual design, the villa should have the size of 175 sqm, pool is 46 sqm and commercial premise 199 sqm.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The price includes the land and the project, but not communal charges related to the building permit or any other costs related to the changes and amendments of existing project.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property is located in a peaceful area, 1.5 km away from the sea, on the slopes of Perun hill only 15 minutes drive from Split city.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For further information please contact our office in Split.</p>', '', '1484_Land-plot_0.jpg', '1484_Land-plot_1.jpg', '1484_Land-plot_2.jpg', '1484_Land-plot_3.jpg', '1484_Land-plot_4.jpg', '1484_Land-plot_5.jpg', '1484_Land-plot_6.jpg', '1484_Land-plot_7.jpg', '1484_Land-plot_8.jpg');
INSERT INTO `nekretnina` (`id`, `ime`, `prezime`, `telefon`, `mobitel`, `e_mail`, `lokacija_id`, `adresa`, `status_id`, `vrsta_id`, `udaljenost`, `povrsina`, `stambenapovrsina`, `display`, `cijena`, `cijenatocka`, `ponuda_tjedna`, `new_built`, `must_sell`, `prvi_red_do_mora`, `pogled_na_more`, `bazen`, `broj_soba`, `broj_kupatila`, `datum`, `title_hr`, `title_en`, `title_ge`, `opis_hr`, `opis_en`, `opis_ge`, `PropertyImageURL0`, `PropertyImageURL1`, `PropertyImageURL2`, `PropertyImageURL3`, `PropertyImageURL4`, `PropertyImageURL5`, `PropertyImageURL6`, `PropertyImageURL7`, `PropertyImageURL8`) VALUES
(1485, 'Ivo', 'Plemenèiæ', '', '0994005111', '', 'Trogir', 'Rastiæa III/4 Okrug Gornji', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '25', '0', '99', 1, '380000', '', 2, 1, 2, 2, 1, 1, 3, 3, 'November 27, 2015', '<p>Luksuzni penthouse smje&scaron;ten na 2.katu u novoizgraðenoj zgradi udaljenoj svega 25 m od mora i prekrasne pla¾e. Smje&scaron;tena je na otoku Èiovu u blizini povijesnih gradova Trogira i Splita, ali i meðunarodnog aerodroma. Zgrada je graðena od kvalitetnih materijala, dok je cijeli stan kompletno luksuzno opremljen i spreman na useljenje. Trenutno je u u funkciji turistièkog iznajmljivanja, stoga je ovo prilika i za investiranje. Apartmanu takoðer pripada zajednièki bazen u dvori&scaron;tu gdje se nalazi vanjski tu&scaron;, kamin i terasa ureðena za sunèanje i u¾ivanje.</p>', '<p>We are pleased to offer this modern, luxury penthouse apartment only 25 meters from the sea and beautiful beaches. The property faces south and is located on the island Ciovo near the historic towns of Trogir and Split, and close to the international airport. The apartment is currently being used to rent to tourists and the high return would make this a good quality investment. Apartment also has a shared swimming pool built into a slick and easy to clean patio and sunning area, where there is also an outdoor shower, and bbq/fireplace.</p>', '', '<p>Luksuzni penthouse smje&scaron;ten na 2.katu u novoizgraðenoj zgradi udaljenoj svega 25 m od mora i prekrasne pla¾e.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Orijentacija zgrade je ju¾na, a smje&scaron;tena je na otoku Èiovu u blizini povijesnih gradova Trogira i Splita, ali i meðunarodnog aerodroma.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Zgrada je graðena od kvalitetnih materijala, dok je cijeli stan kompletno luksuzno opremljen i spreman na useljenje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Trenutno je u funkciji turistièkog iznajmljivanja, stoga je ovo prilika i za investiranje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ukupna povr&scaron;ina apartmana je 99 m2, a sastoji se od hodnika, dnevnog dijela sa blagovaonicom i kuhinjom, 3 spavaæe sobe, 2 kupaonice, 1 wc-a, 2 manje i 1 prostrane terase na ju¾noj strani sa koje se pru¾a prekrasan pogled koji nije moguæe zatvoriti.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartmanu takoðer pripada zajednièki bazen u dvori&scaron;tu gdje se nalazi vanjski tu&scaron;, kamin i terasa ureðena za sunèanje i u¾ivanje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartmanu pripada 1 parking mjesto ispred zgrade.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Posjeduje energetski certifikat B razreda.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ukoliko ¾elite vi&scaron;e informacija o ovoj iznimnoj nekretnini, stojimo vam na raspolaganju.</p>', '<p>We are pleased to offer this modern, luxury penthouse apartment only 25 meters from the sea and beautiful beaches.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property faces south and is located on the island Ciovo near the historic towns of Trogir and Split, and close to the international airport.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Within a few minute''s drive are shops, bars and cafes, while the larger town of Trogir, with many more options for tourism attractions, is 10 minutes by car.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The building is constructed using high quality materials, and once you have climbed the wide marble stairs you will find the whole apartment fully and luxuriously furnished - all ready to move in.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The apartment is currently being used to rent to tourists and the high return would make this a good quality investment.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The apartment is 99 m2 and consists of hallway, open plan living area, with a dining area and kitchen, 3 bedrooms, 2 bathrooms, 1 toilet, 2 small and 1 large terrace on the south side, which offers beautiful views of the near islands and the open sea.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartment also has a shared swimming pool built into a slick and easy to clean patio and sunning area, where there is also an outdoor shower, and bbq/fireplace.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartment has one private parking space in front of the building.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It has an energy certificate class B.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>If you want more information on this exceptional property-being sold at a realistic price-then please contact us. &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</p>', '', '1485_Apartment_0.jpg', '1485_Apartment_1.jpg', '1485_Apartment_2.jpg', '1485_Apartment_3.jpg', '1485_Apartment_4.jpg', '1485_Apartment_5.jpg', '1485_Apartment_6.jpg', '1485_Apartment_7.jpg', '1485_Apartment_8.jpg'),
(1486, 'Albedo', 'Emil ©o¹tariæ ', '', '098 507 989', 'emil@albedonekretnine.hr ', 'Makarska', 'Ba¹ka Voda', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '400', '0', '66', 1, '138000', '', 2, 1, 2, 2, 1, 2, 2, 1, 'November 27, 2015', '<p>Na prodaju nudimo ovaj izvrstan dvosobni apartman od 66 m2, koji se nalazi na drugom katu manje stambene zgrade u popularnom turistièkom mjestu 10 kilometara od Makarske.&nbsp;Apartman je svijetao i prozraèan, sa lijepim pogledom na more, a pripada mu i parkirali&scaron;no mjesto. Popularna pla¾a udaljena je svega 400 m od nekretnine. Prostor oko zgrade je ureðen i odr¾avan, a nekretnina ima energetski razred A.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>For sale we have this lovely 2-bedroom apartment of 66 sqm, located on the second floor of a low-rise building in a very popular tourist village 10 km away from Makarska.&nbsp;Apartment is airy and bright, featuring parking place and sea views. A fantastic beach is only 400 meters away. Space around the building is landscaped and the property has A-level energy efficiency certificate.</p>', '', '<p>Na prodaju nudimo ovaj izvrstan dvosobni apartman od 66 m2, koji se nalazi na drugom katu manje stambene zgrade u popularnom turistièkom mjestu 10 kilometara od Makarske.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartman je svijetao i prozraèan, sa lijepim pogledom na more, a pripada mu i parkirali&scaron;no mjesto.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Popularna pla¾a udaljena je svega 400 m od nekretnine.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Prostor oko zgrade je ureðen i odr¾avan, a nekretnina ima energetski razred A.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za dodatne informacije molimo kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured u Splitu.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>For sale we have this lovely 2-bedroom apartment of 66 sqm, located on the second floor of a low-rise building in a very popular tourist village 10 km away from Makarska.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartment is airy and bright, featuring parking place and sea views.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>A fantastic beach is only 400 meters away.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Space around the building is landscaped and the property has A-level energy efficiency certificate.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For further information please contact our office in Split.&nbsp;</p>', '', '1486_Apartment_0.jpg', '1486_Apartment_1.jpg', '1486_Apartment_2.jpg', '1486_Apartment_3.jpg', '1486_Apartment_4.jpg', '1486_Apartment_5.jpg', '1486_Apartment_6.jpg', '1486_Apartment_7.jpg', '1486_Apartment_8.jpg'),
(1487, 'Albedo', 'Emil ©o¹tariæ', '', '098 507 989', 'emil@albedonekretnine.hr ', 'Makarska', 'Baska Voda', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '100', '0', '79', 1, '218000', '', 2, 1, 2, 2, 1, 2, 2, 2, 'November 27, 2015', '<p>Atraktivan dvoeta¾ni stan sa pogledom na more.&nbsp;U popularnom turistièkom mjesto 10 km od Makarske nudimo atraktivan dvoeta¾ni stan od 79 m2 sa pogledom na more. Stan se sastoji od hodnika, kupaonice, kuhinje sa blagovaonicom, dnevnog boravka i terase na donjoj eta¾i te hodnika, kupaonice i dvije spavaæe sobe i loðe na gornjoj eta¾i.&nbsp;Postoji moguænost kupnje gara¾nog mjesta u suterenu zgrade po cijeni od 20.000 EUR.</p>', '<p>We are offering this attractive duplex apartment of 79 sqm for sale, located in a popular tourist place 10 km away from Makarska. The apartments consists of a hallway, bathroom, kitchen with dining room, living room and terrace on the lower level and hallway, 2 bedrooms and balcony on the upper level.&nbsp;A garage place can be bough at extra cost of 20.000 EUR.</p>', '', '<p><strong>Atraktivan dvoeta¾ni stan sa pogledom na more</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U popularnom turistièkom mjesto 10 km od Makarske nudimo atraktivan dvoeta¾ni stan od 79 m2 sa pogledom na more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Stan se sastoji od hodnika, kupaonice, kuhinje sa blagovaonicom, dnevnog boravka i terase na donjoj eta¾i te hodnika, kupaonice i dvije spavaæe sobe i loðe na gornjoj eta¾i.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Postoji moguænost kupnje gara¾nog mjesta u suterenu zgrade po cijeni od 20.000 EUR.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Zagrada se nalazi na mirnoj lokaciji, svega par stotina metara od lijepe &scaron;ljunèane pla¾e.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za dodatne informacije molimo kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured u Splitu.&nbsp;</p>', '<p><strong>An attractive duplex apartment with sea views</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>We are offering this attractive duplex apartment of 79 sqm for sale, located in a popular tourist place 10 km away from Makarska.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The apartments consists of a hallway, bathroom, kitchen with dining room, living room and terrace on the lower level and hallway, 2 bedrooms and balcony on the upper level.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>A garage place can be bough at extra cost of 20.000 EUR.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The building is located in a peaceful area, yet only few hundred meters away from amazing pebble beach.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For further information please contact our office in Split.&nbsp;</p>', '', '1487_Apartment_0.jpg', '1487_Apartment_1.jpg', '1487_Apartment_2.jpg', '1487_Apartment_3.jpg', '1487_Apartment_4.jpg', '1487_Apartment_5.jpg', '1487_Apartment_6.jpg', '1487_Apartment_7.jpg', '1487_Apartment_8.jpg'),
(1488, 'Albedo', 'Emil ©o¹tariæ ', '', '098 507 989', 'emil@albedonekretnine.hr ', 'Makarska', 'Makarska', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '500', '0', '53', 1, '93500', '', 2, 1, 2, 2, 1, 2, 1, 1, 'November 30, 2015', '<p>Izvrstan jednosoban stan (53 m2) u zapadnom dijelu Makarske, sa panoramskim pogledom na more. Parkirali&scaron;no mjesto je ukljuèeno u cijenu.&nbsp;Apartman se nalazi na treæem (zadnjem) katu manje stambene zgrade, a sastoji se od hodnika, spavaæe sobe, kupaonice, dnevnog boravka sa kuhinjom te terase.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>Lovely 1-bedrooms apartment (53 sqm) in the western part of Makarska, featuring panoramic sea views. The property comes with the parking place.&nbsp;Apartment is located on the third (last) floor of a small building and consists of a hallway, bedrooms, bathroom, living room with kitchen and terrace.&nbsp;</p>', '', '<p><strong>Izvrsna cijena &ndash; sni¾eno sa 123.000 na 93.500 EUR</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Izvrstan jednosoban stan (53 m2) u zapadnom dijelu Makarske, sa panoramskim pogledom na more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Parkirali&scaron;no mjesto je ukljuèeno u cijenu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartman se nalazi na treæem (zadnjem) katu manje stambene zgrade, a sastoji se od hodnika, spavaæe sobe, kupaonice, dnevnog boravka sa kuhinjom te terase.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za dodatne informacije molimo kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured u Splitu.&nbsp;</p>', '<p><strong>Excellent price &ndash; reduced from 123.000 to 93.500 EUR</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Lovely 1-bedrooms apartment (53 sqm) in the western part of Makarska, featuring panoramic sea views.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property comes with the parking place.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartment is located on the third (last) floor of a small building and consists of a hallway, bedrooms, bathroom, living room with kitchen and terrace.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For further information please contact our office in Split.&nbsp;</p>', '', '1488_Apartment_0.jpg', '1488_Apartment_1.jpg', '1488_Apartment_2.jpg', '1488_Apartment_3.jpg', '1488_Apartment_4.jpg', '1488_Apartment_5.jpg', '1488_Apartment_6.jpg', '1488_Apartment_7.jpg', ''),
(1489, 'Albedo', 'Emil ©o¹tariæ ', '098 507 989', '', 'emil@albedonekretnine.hr ', 'Makarska', 'Makarska', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '400', '0', '67', 1, '135000', '', 2, 1, 2, 2, 1, 2, 2, 2, 'November 30, 2015', '<p>Na prodaju nudimo ovaj lijepi stan od 67 m2, smje&scaron;ten na zadnjem katu novogradnje iz 2014. godine, a koji ima 2 spavaæe sobe, 2 kupaonice sa podnim grijanjem, parkirali&scaron;no mjesto te veliku terasu sa panoramskim pogledom na more i grad Makarsku.&nbsp;Nekretnina se nalazi nedaleko od centra grada i pla¾a, no u mirnoj rezidencijalnoj èetvrti. Izvrsna prilika za kupce koji tra¾e apartman u Makarskoj. &nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;">Cijena sni¾ena sa 154.000 na 135.000 EUR</span></p>', '<p>For sale we have this lovely top floor apartment of 67 sqm, built in 2014, featuring 2 bedrooms, 2 bathrooms with underfloor heating, parking place and large terrace with panoramic views on the sea and Makarska town.&nbsp;It is located a short walk from the center and the beaches, yet in a quiet residential neighbourhood. An excellent opportunity for the buyers interested in Makarska.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;">Price reduced from 154.000 to 135.000 EUR</span></p>', '', '<p><strong><span style="text-decoration: underline;">Cijena sni¾ena sa 154.000 na 135.000 EUR</span></strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na prodaju nudimo ovaj lijepi stan od 67 m2, smje&scaron;ten na zadnjem katu novogradnje iz 2014. godine, a koji ima 2 spavaæe sobe, 2 kupaonice sa podnim grijanjem, parkirali&scaron;no mjesto te veliku terasu sa panoramskim pogledom na more i grad Makarsku.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nekretnina se nalazi nedaleko od centra grada i pla¾a, no u mirnoj rezidencijalnoj èetvrti.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Izvrsna prilika za kupce koji tra¾e apartman u Makarskoj. &nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za dodatne informacije molimo kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured u Splitu.&nbsp;</p>', '<p><strong><span style="text-decoration: underline;">Price reduced from 154.000 to 135.000 EUR</span></strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For sale we have this lovely top floor apartment of 67 sqm, built in 2014, featuring 2 bedrooms, 2 bathrooms with underfloor heating, parking place and large terrace with panoramic views on the sea and Makarska town.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is located a short walk from the center and the beaches, yet in a quiet residential neighbourhood.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>An excellent opportunity for the buyers interested in Makarska.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For further information please contact our office in Split.&nbsp;</p>', '', '1489_Apartment_0.jpg', '1489_Apartment_1.jpg', '1489_Apartment_2.jpg', '1489_Apartment_3.jpg', '1489_Apartment_4.jpg', '1489_Apartment_5.jpg', '1489_Apartment_6.jpg', '1489_Apartment_7.jpg', '1489_Apartment_8.jpg'),
(1490, 'Albedo', 'Emil ©o¹tariæ ', '098 507 989', '', 'emil@albedonekretnine.hr ', 'Makarska', 'Makarska', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '400', '0', '93', 1, '160000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 3, 2, 'November 30, 2015', '<p>Moderan dvoeta¾ni stan (93 m2) smje&scaron;ten na drugom katu manje urbane vile u centru Makarske.&nbsp;Nekretnina je prete¾no namje&scaron;tena, a ima 3 spavaæe sobe, 2 kupaonice, dobro opremljenu kuhinju te prostrani dnevni boravak iz kojeg se pru¾a pogled na more, otoke i gradsku pla¾u.&nbsp;Apartman im vlastito spremi&scaron;te u podrumu zgrade, gara¾u povr&scaron;ine 26 m2 te parkirali&scaron;no mjesto.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;">CIJENA SNI®ENA SA 240.000 EURA!</span></p>', '<p>A modern duplex apartment (93 sqm) located on a second floor of a 2008 low-rise building in the center of Makarska.&nbsp;The property comes mostly furnished, featuring 3 bedrooms, 2 bathrooms, well equipped kitchen and large living room with great views on the sea and the islands.&nbsp;Apartment has its own storage in the basement, a 26 sqm garage and the parking place.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;">PRICE REDUCED FROM 240.000 EURO!</span></p>', '', '<p><strong>Izvrsna cijena &ndash; sni¾eno sa 240 na 160 tisuæa EUR</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Moderan dvoeta¾ni stan (93 m2) smje&scaron;ten na drugom katu manje urbane vile u centru Makarske.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nekretnina je prete¾no namje&scaron;tena, a ima 3 spavaæe sobe, 2 kupaonice, dobro opremljenu kuhinju te prostrani dnevni boravak iz kojeg se pru¾a pogled na more, otoke i gradsku pla¾u.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartman im vlastito spremi&scaron;te u podrumu zgrade, gara¾u povr&scaron;ine 26 m2 te parkirali&scaron;no mjesto.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za dodatne informacije molimo kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured u Splitu.&nbsp;</p>', '<p><strong>Excellent price &ndash; reduced from 240 to 160 thousand EUR</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>A modern duplex apartment (93 sqm) located on a second floor of a 2008 low-rise building in the center of Makarska.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property comes mostly furnished, featuring 3 bedrooms, 2 bathrooms, well equipped kitchen and large living room with great views on the sea and the islands.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartment has its own storage in the basement, a 26 sqm garage and the parking place.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For further information please contact our office in Split.&nbsp;</p>', '', '1490_Apartment_0.jpg', '1490_Apartment_1.jpg', '1490_Apartment_2.jpg', '1490_Apartment_3.jpg', '1490_Apartment_4.jpg', '1490_Apartment_5.jpg', '1490_Apartment_6.jpg', '1490_Apartment_7.jpg', '1490_Apartment_8.jpg'),
(1491, 'Albedo', 'Emil ©o¹tariæ ', '098 507 989', '', 'emil@albedonekretnine.hr ', 'Makarska', 'Makarska', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '50', '0', '64', 1, '193000', '', 2, 1, 2, 2, 1, 2, 2, 1, 'November 30, 2015', '<p>Izvrstan dvosobni stan u samom centru Makarske, sa pogledom na more. Stan je ju¾no orijentiran, povr&scaron;ine 64,34 m2, a sastoji se od 2 spavaæe sobe, kupaonice, wc-a, hodnika, kuhinje i blagovaonice, dnevnog boravka i balkona.&nbsp;Parkirali&scaron;no mjesto prodaje se za cijenu od 5.000 EUR, a moguæe je kupiti i gara¾no mjesto za cijenu od 15.000 EUR.&nbsp;Glavna gradska pla¾a i centar grada su minutu hoda od nekretnine.</p>', '<p>Excellent two bedroom apartment featuring open sea views, in the center of Makarska. South-oriented, sized 64,34 sqm, consisting of 2 bedrooms, bathroom, toilet, hallway, kitchen with dining room, living room and balcony.&nbsp;Parking place can be bough at extra price of 5.000 EUR, while garage place costs 15.000 EUR.&nbsp;Central beach and town''s center are stone''s throw away.</p>', '', '<p><strong>Dvosobni stan u centru Makarske sa pogledom na more</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Izvrstan dvosobni stan u samom centru Makarske, sa pogledom na more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Stan je ju¾no orijentiran, povr&scaron;ine 64,34 m2, a sastoji se od 2 spavaæe sobe, kupaonice, wc-a, hodnika, kuhinje i blagovaonice, dnevnog boravka i balkona.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Parkirali&scaron;no mjesto prodaje se za cijenu od 5.000 EUR, a moguæe je kupiti i gara¾no mjesto za cijenu od 15.000 EUR.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Glavna gradska pla¾a i centar grada su minutu hoda od nekretnine.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za dodatne informacije molimo kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured u Splitu.&nbsp;</p>', '<p><strong>Two bedroom apartment with sea views in the center of Makarska</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Excellent two bedroom apartment featuring open sea views, in the center of Makarska.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>South-oriented, sized 64,34 sqm, consisting of 2 bedrooms, bathroom, toilet, hallway, kitchen with dining room, living room and balcony.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Parking place can be bough at extra price of 5.000 EUR, while garage place costs 15.000 EUR.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Central beach and town''s center are stone''s throw away.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For additional information please contact our office in Split.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>', '', '1491_Apartment_0.jpg', '1491_Apartment_1.jpg', '1491_Apartment_2.jpg', '1491_Apartment_3.jpg', '1491_Apartment_4.jpg', '1491_Apartment_5.jpg', '1491_Apartment_6.jpg', '1491_Apartment_7.jpg', '1491_Apartment_8.jpg'),
(1492, 'Albedo', 'Emil ©o¹tariæ ', '098 507 989', '', 'emil@albedonekretnine.hr ', 'Makarska', 'Promajna', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '100', '0', '83', 1, '250000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 2, 2, 'November 30, 2015', '<p>U malom obalnom mjestu blizu Makarske nudimo ovaj dvoeta¾ni apartman (83 m2) na prodaju, a koji ima 2 spavaæe sobe, 2 kupaonice sa podnim grijanjem, parkirali&scaron;no mjesto te prostranu krovnu terasu sa izvrsnim pogledom na more i otoke.&nbsp;Pla¾a i centar mjesta udaljeni su svega 2 minute hoda. Nekretnina je u potpunosti namje&scaron;tena i spremna za useljenje. &nbsp;&nbsp;</p>', '<p>In a small coastal village near Makarska we have this great duplex apartment (83 sqm) for sale, featuring 2 bedrooms, 2 bathrooms with underfloor heating, parking place and spacious rooftop terrace with gorgeous views on the sea and the islands.&nbsp;The beach and the center of the village is only 2 minutes away on foot. The property is fully furnished and ready for occupany. &nbsp;</p>', '', '<p><strong>Luksuzan dvoeta¾ni stan u blizini Makarske</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U malom obalnom mjestu blizu Makarske nudimo ovaj dvoeta¾ni apartman (83 m2) na prodaju, a koji ima 2 spavaæe sobe, 2 kupaonice sa podnim grijanjem, parkirali&scaron;no mjesto te prostranu krovnu terasu sa izvrsnim pogledom na more i otoke.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Pla¾a i centar mjesta udaljeni su svega 2 minute hoda.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nekretnina je u potpunosti namje&scaron;tena i spremna za useljenje. &nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za dodatne informacije molimo kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured u Splitu.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>', '<p><strong>Luxurious duplex apartment near Makarska</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>In a small coastal village near Makarska we have this great duplex apartment (83 sqm) for sale, featuring 2 bedrooms, 2 bathrooms with underfloor heating, parking place and spacious rooftop terrace with gorgeous views on the sea and the islands.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The beach and the center of the village is only 2 minutes away on foot.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property is fully furnished and ready for occupany. &nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For further information please contact our office in Split.&nbsp;</p>', '', '1492_Apartment_0.jpg', '1492_Apartment_1.jpg', '1492_Apartment_2.jpg', '1492_Apartment_3.jpg', '1492_Apartment_4.jpg', '1492_Apartment_5.jpg', '1492_Apartment_6.jpg', '1492_Apartment_7.jpg', '1492_Apartment_8.jpg'),
(1493, 'George', 'Bozikovic Toncika', '', '091 524 83 00', '', 'Hvar', 'Jelsa', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '200', '0', '67', 1, '160000', '', 2, 1, 2, 2, 1, 2, 2, 1, 'November 30, 2015', '<p>Prodaje se apartman s pogledom na more u prizemlju novoizgraðene zgrade.&nbsp;Apartman se nalazi 200 m od mora, u mirnom naselju, blizu pla¾e i centra grada.&nbsp;Ukupna povr&scaron;ina apartmana (zajedno s terasom) iznosi cca 67 m2.&nbsp;Apartmanu pripada i parking povr&scaron;ine 30 m2.&nbsp;Apartman je jugoistoèno orijentiran.&nbsp;U dvori&scaron;tu se nalazi zajednièki ro&scaron;tilj.&nbsp;Zgrada je kvalitetno graðena, te je apartman opremljen visokokvalitetnim materijalima, ukljuèujuæi i podno grijanje.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>We are offering this newly built two bedroom apartment with a great seaview. The apartment is located 200 m from the sea, in one of the charming and historic villages on this hugely popular island. The total area of the apartment (with terrace) is about 67 m2.&nbsp;Apartment has private parking area of 30 m2. In the garden there is a barbecue cooking facility.&nbsp;The property is well built using good building materials and the apartmentis equipped with high-quality fittings and modern features such a sunderfloor heating.&nbsp;</p>', '', '<p>Prodaje se apartman s pogledom na more u prizemlju novoizgraðene zgrade.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartman se nalazi 200 m od mora, u mirnom naselju, blizu pla¾e i centra grada.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sastoji se od dvije spavaæe sobe od kojih jedna ima izlaz na terasu, kupaonice, dnevnog boravka, kuhinje te blagovaonice koja takoðer ima &nbsp;izlaz na terasu.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ukupna povr&scaron;ina apartmana (zajedno s terasom) iznosi cca 67 m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartmanu pripada i parking povr&scaron;ine 30 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartman je jugoistoèno orijentiran.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U dvori&scaron;tu se nalazi zajednièki ro&scaron;tilj.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Zgrada je kvalitetno graðena, te je apartman opremljen visokokvalitetnim materijalima, ukljuèujuæi i podno grijanje.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Svi potrebni sadr¾aji (restorani, trgovine, kafiæi...) se nalaze 500 m od zgrade.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za sve dodatne informacije molimo kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>We are offering this newly built two bedroom apartment with a great seaview.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The apartment is located 200 m from the sea, in one of the charming and historic villages on this hugely popular island.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is conveniently close to all the town facilities - shops, cafes, family run bars and bakery, which are all within 10 minutes walk.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It consists of two bedrooms, one with a balcony, bathroom, an open plan living room, kitchen and dining room which access out onto a terrace.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The total area of the apartment (with terrace) is about 67 m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartment has private parking area of 30 m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The apartment is south-east oriented.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>In the garden there is a barbecue cooking facility.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property is well built using good building materials and the apartmentis equipped with high-quality fittings and modern features such a sunderfloor heating.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The Ferry port 15 mins drive, and the new seaplane service is also asimilar distance.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For further information please contact our office.</p>', '', '', '1493_Apartment_1.jpg', '1493_Apartment_2.jpg', '1493_Apartment_3.jpg', '1493_Apartment_4.jpg', '1493_Apartment_5.jpg', '1493_Apartment_6.jpg', '1493_Apartment_7.jpg', '1493_Apartment_8.jpg'),
(1494, '', 'Benetton', '', '', '', 'Hvar', 'Stari Grad', 'For sale', 'Land plot', '5', '2800', '0', 1, '980000', '', 2, 2, 2, 1, 1, 2, 0, 0, 'November 30, 2015', '<p>Prodaje se graðevinsko zemlji&scaron;te jugozapadne orijentacije, prvi red do mora.&nbsp;Zemlji&scaron;te ima povr&scaron;inu 2.800 m2.&nbsp;Infrastruktura odmah do zemlji&scaron;ta.&nbsp;Ima pristup vozilom i parking.&nbsp;Zemlji&scaron;te se nalazi na mirnoj lokaciji, samo 5 m od mora, a u blizini svih sadr¾aja i trajektne luke.&nbsp;Otok Hvar je veæ godinama popularna destinacija, kako za ljetovanje tako i za investiranje.&nbsp;Osim &scaron;to je povezan trajektnom linijom sa gradom Splitom, takoðer je povezan i avionskom.</p>', '<p>We have this substantial area of building land, by the sea, with asouth-west orientation. It is situated on the island of Hvar, in a quiet area of one of the larger towns, conveniently close to all the facilities, shops, harbour etc. and just 5 m from the shore. The land area is 2,800 m2. Price per m2 is 350 euro.&nbsp;All the necessary infrastructure is adjacent to the plot.&nbsp;It has car access and parking. The land is located in a quiet location.</p>', '', '<p>Prodaje se graðevinsko zemlji&scaron;te jugozapadne orijentacije, prvi red do mora.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Zemlji&scaron;te ima povr&scaron;inu 2.800 m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Infrastruktura odmah do zemlji&scaron;ta.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ima pristup vozilom i parking.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Vlasni&scaron;tvo 1/1.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Zemlji&scaron;te se nalazi na mirnoj lokaciji, samo 5 m od mora, a u blizini svih sadr¾aja i trajektne luke.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Otok Hvar je veæ godinama popularna destinacija, kako za ljetovanje tako i za investiranje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Osim &scaron;to je povezan trajektnom linijom sa gradom Splitom, takoðer je povezan i avionskom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za sve dodatne informacije molimo kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>We have this substantial area of building land, by the sea, with a south-west orientation.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is situated on the island of Hvar, in a quiet area of one of the larger towns, conveniently close to all the facilities, shops, harbour etc. and just 5 m from the shore.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The land area is 2,800 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Price per m2 is 350 euro.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>All the necessary infrastructure is adjacent to the plot.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It has car access and parking.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The land is located in a quiet location.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The island of Hvar has been a popular destination for both holidays and investment with great opportunities in the short, medium and long term.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apart from the ferry to the city of Split, the island recently has enjoyed a regular daily connection to the mainland by seaplane.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For further information please contact our office.</p>', '', '1494_Land-plot_0.jpg', '1494_Land-plot_1.jpg', '1494_Land-plot_2.jpg', '1494_Land-plot_3.jpg', '1494_Land-plot_4.jpg', '1494_Land-plot_5.jpg', '1494_Land-plot_6.jpg', '', ''),
(1495, 'Albedo', 'Emil ©o¹tariæ ', '', '098 507 989', 'emil@albedonekretnine.hr ', 'Makarska', 'Ba¹ka Voda', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '500', '0', '81', 1, '155000', '', 2, 1, 2, 2, 1, 2, 2, 1, 'December 1, 2015', '<p>Atraktivan stan sa pogledom na more.&nbsp;U zapadnom dijelu Makarske prodajemo ovaj atraktivan stan sa pogledom na more. Stan (81 m2) se sastoji od dvije spavaæe sobe, dnevnog boravka, kuhinje sa blagovaonicom, kupaonice, hodnika, terase, balkona, gara¾nog mjesta i ostave.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>An attractive apartment with sea views.&nbsp;In the western part of Makarska we have this lovely apartment of 81m sq for sale. It is located on the third (last) floor of a low-rise building and features great sea views. It consists of 2 bedrooms, living room, kitchen with dining room, bathroom, hall, terrace, balcony, garage place and storage. &nbsp;&nbsp;</p>', '', '<p><strong>Atraktivan stan sa pogledom na more</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U zapadnom dijelu Makarske prodajemo ovaj atraktivan stan sa pogledom na more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Stan (81 m2) se sastoji od dvije spavaæe sobe, dnevnog boravka, kuhinje sa blagovaonicom, kupaonice, hodnika, terase, balkona, gara¾nog mjesta i ostave.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za dodatne informacije molimo kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured u Splitu.&nbsp;</p>', '<p><strong>An attractive apartment with sea views</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>In the western part of Makarska we have this lovely apartment of 81m sq for sale.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is located on the third (last) floor of a low-rise building and features great sea views.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It consists of 2 bedrooms, living room, kitchen with dining room, bathroom, hall, terrace, balcony, garage place and storage. &nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For further information please contact our office in Split.&nbsp;</p>', '', '1495_Apartment_0.jpg', '1495_Apartment_1.jpg', '1495_Apartment_2.jpg', '1495_Apartment_3.jpg', '1495_Apartment_4.jpg', '1495_Apartment_5.jpg', '1495_Apartment_6.jpg', '1495_Apartment_7.jpg', ''),
(1496, 'Albedo', 'Emil ©o¹tariæ ', '098 507 989', '', 'emil@albedonekretnine.hr ', 'Makarska', 'Brela', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '1000', '250', '195', 1, '295000', '', 2, 1, 2, 2, 1, 2, 5, 3, 'December 1, 2015', '<p>Nova samostojeæa kuæa udaljena 1 km od mora, u blizini popularnog turistièkog mjesta 15 km zapadno od Makarske.&nbsp;U suterenu se nalaze dvije odvojene velike gara¾e te parkirali&scaron;no mjesto. U prizemlju je smje&scaron;ten jednosobni stan sa velikom vanjskom terasom. Na prvom i drugom katu nalaze se dva dvosobna stana, svaki sa balkonom.&nbsp;Ukupna stambena povr&scaron;ina iznosi 195 m2, a povr&scaron;ina parcele je 250 m2.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>New detached house, 1 km away from the sea, close to a popular tourist village 15 km west from Makarska.&nbsp;Semi-interred floor contains 2 garages and a parking place. On the gorund floor there is a 1-bedroom apartment with large terrace. First and second floor have the same layout&ndash;each containing 2-bedroom apartment with balcony.&nbsp;Total living area is 195 sqm, while the plot measures 250 sqm.&nbsp;</p>', '', '<p><strong>Nova samostojeæa kuæa</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nova samostojeæa kuæa udaljena 1 km od mora, u blizini popularnog turistièkog mjesta 15 km zapadno od Makarske.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U suterenu se nalaze dvije odvojene velike gara¾e te parkirali&scaron;no mjesto.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U prizemlju je smje&scaron;ten jednosobni stan sa velikom vanjskom terasom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na prvom i drugom katu nalaze se dva dvosobna stana, svaki sa balkonom.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ukupna stambena povr&scaron;ina iznosi 195 m2, a povr&scaron;ina parcele je 250 m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Svi su apartmani namje&scaron;teni i klimatizirani, a svaka jedinica ima svoj ulaz.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Postoji mogucnost izgradnje bazena.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sa svih se eta¾a pru¾a lijepi panoramski pogled na more.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za dodatne informacije molimo kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured u Splitu.&nbsp;</p>', '<p><strong>New detached house</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>New detached house, 1 km away from the sea, close to a popular tourist village 15 km west from Makarska.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Semi-interred floor contains 2 garages and a parking place.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the gorund floor there is a 1-bedroom apartment with large terrace.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>First and second floor have the same layout &ndash; each containing 2-bedroom apartment with balcony.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Total living area is 195 sqm, while the plot measures 250 sqm.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>All units are air-conditioned, fully furnished and with separate entrances.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>A pool could be built next to the building.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>All floors feature splendid panoramic sea views.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For further information please contact our office in Split.&nbsp;</p>', '', '1496_House-Villa_0.jpg', '1496_House-Villa_1.jpg', '1496_House-Villa_2.jpg', '1496_House-Villa_3.jpg', '1496_House-Villa_4.jpg', '1496_House-Villa_5.jpg', '', '', ''),
(1497, 'Albedo', 'Emil ©o¹tariæ ', '098 507 989', '', 'emil@albedonekretnine.hr ', 'Makarska', 'Makarska', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '500', '650', '350', 1, '620000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 1, 5, 5, 'December 1, 2015', '<p>Ova lijepa vila nalazi se povi&scaron;e magistralne ceste, oko 500 metara od mora i centra grada te zbog svog polo¾aja nudi odlièan pogled na more. U prizemlju se nalazi dvosoban stan sa direktim izlazom na terasu za sunlanje sa bazenom.&nbsp;Ukupna stambena povr&scaron;ina kuæe je 350 m2 na parceli od 650 m2.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>This charming villa is located above the main coastal road, some 500 meters away from the sea and with great sea views, perfectly positioned for leisure and relaxation.&nbsp;On the ground floor there is a 2-bedroom apartment with direct access to the sundeck with pool.&nbsp;Total living area of the house is 350 sqm, while the plot easures 650 sqm.&nbsp;</p>', '', '<p><strong>Luksuzna vila sa bazenom u Makarskoj</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ova lijepa vila nalazi se povi&scaron;e magistralne ceste, oko 500 metara od mora i centra grada te zbog svog polo¾aja nudi odlièan pogled na more. &nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U prizemlju se nalazi dvosoban stan sa direktim izlazom na terasu za sunlanje sa bazenom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na prvom katu sa sjeverne strane nalaze se konoba, bar, blagovaonica i wc, dok se sa ju¾ne strane nalazi kuhinja, blagovaonica, dnevni boravak, radna soba, kupaonica, ostava i terasa.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na drugom katu su 3 spavaæe sobe i 2 kupaonice, a svaka soba ima svoj balkon. Nekretnina je klimatizirana i ima sustav centralog grijanja.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ukupna stambena povr&scaron;ina kuæe je 350 m2 na parceli od 650 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za dodatne informacije molimo kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured u Splitu.</p>', '<p><strong>Luxurious villa with pool in Makarska</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>This charming villa is located above the main coastal road, some 500 meters away from the sea and with great sea views, perfectly positioned for leisure and relaxation.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the ground floor there is a 2-bedroom apartment with direct access to the sundeck with pool.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the first floor there is a summer kitchen with bar, dining room and toilet from the northern side, as well as kitchen, dining room, living room, study, bathroom, storage and terrace from the southern side.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Second floor hosts 3 bedrooms and 2 bathrooms.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Each bedrooms has balcony.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property is air-conditioned and centrally heated.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Total living area of the house is 350 sqm, while the plot easures 650 sqm.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For further information please contact our office in Split.&nbsp;</p>', '', '1497_House-Villa_0.jpg', '1497_House-Villa_1.jpg', '1497_House-Villa_2.jpg', '1497_House-Villa_3.jpg', '1497_House-Villa_4.jpg', '1497_House-Villa_5.jpg', '1497_House-Villa_6.jpg', '1497_House-Villa_7.jpg', '1497_House-Villa_8.jpg'),
(1498, 'Objektiv nekret', '', 'Lidija Grlji¹iæ 099 698 5474', 'Danijela Glumac 091 576 4749', 'info@objektiv-nekretnine.com', 'Makarska', 'Ba¹ka Voda', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '300', '0', '0', 1, '290000', '', 2, 1, 2, 2, 1, 2, 3, 2, 'December 1, 2015', '<p>U blizini centra manjeg popularnog turistièkog odredi&scaron;ta pokraj Makarske prodajemo stanove u urbanoj vili, smje&scaron;tenoj na mirnoj lokaciji.&nbsp;Stanovi se sastoje od kuhinje sa blagovaonicom i dnevnim boravkom, hodnika, 3 spavaæe sobe, 2 kupaonice te loðe sa koje se pru¾a lijepi pogled na more.&nbsp;Stanovima pripada gara¾no mjesto i ostava.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>In the center of a popular tourist village near Makarska we are selling newly built apartments in a low-rise building. The area is peaceful, yet close to the sea.&nbsp;Apartments consist of kitchen with dining room and living room, hall, 3 bedrooms, 2 bathrooms and loggia, featuring lovely sea views.&nbsp;Apartments come with the garage space and storage.&nbsp;</p>', '', '<p>U blizini centra manjeg popularnog turistièkog odredi&scaron;ta pokraj Makarske prodajemo stanove u urbanoj vili, smje&scaron;tenoj na mirnoj lokaciji.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Stanovi se sastoje od kuhinje sa blagovaonicom i dnevnim boravkom, hodnika, 3 spavaæe sobe, 2 kupaonice te loðe sa koje se pru¾a lijepi pogled na more.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Stan 1, prvi kat, 109 m2, 290.000 EUR</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Stan 2, prvi kat, 110 m2, 290.000 EUR</strong></p>\r\n<p><strong><br /></strong></p>\r\n<p><strong>Stan 3, potkrovlje, 156 m2, 390.000 EUR</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Stanovima pripada gara¾no mjesto i ostava.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za dodatne informacije molimo kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured u Splitu.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>In the center of a popular tourist village near Makarska we are selling newly built apartments in a low-rise building.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The area is peaceful, yet close to the sea.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartments consist of kitchen with dining room and living room, hall, 3 bedrooms, 2 bathrooms and loggia, featuring lovely sea views.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Apt 1, 1st floor, 109 sqm, 290.000 EUR</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Apt 2, 1st floor, 110 sqm 290.000 EUR</strong></p>\r\n<p><strong><br /></strong></p>\r\n<p><strong>Apt 3, attick, 156 sqm, 390.000 EUR</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartments come with the garage space and storage.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For additional information please contact our office in Split.&nbsp;</p>', '', '1498_Apartment_0.jpg', '1498_Apartment_1.jpg', '1498_Apartment_2.jpg', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(1499, '', 'Voloder (Nedo)', '', '', '', 'Rogoznica', 'Zatoglav', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '35', '508', '175', 1, '570000', '', 2, 1, 2, 2, 1, 1, 5, 3, 'December 7, 2015', '<p>Moderna zapadno orijentirana vila u izgradnji s prekrasnim pogledom i luksuzom koji se mo¾e samo po¾eljeti.&nbsp;Povrsina stambenog dijela vile iznosi 175 m2, a povrsina parcele 508 m2.&nbsp;Vila se sastoji od 4 etaze.&nbsp;Izlaz na terasu povrsine 50 m2, s bazenom povrsine 48 m2 cine ovu nekretninu izuzetnom jer se iz svakog kutka pruza zadivljujuci pogled na more i uvalu.&nbsp;Drugi kat odnosno cetvrtu etazu cini krovna terasa s ljetnjom kuhinjom povrsine 102 m2.</p>', '<p>We are offering this newly built villa of modern, still under construction, near the sea on the mainland. The living space of the villa is 175 m2 and 508 m2 surface plot. The villa has been constructed over 4 floors, and from each floor there are wonderful uninterrupted sea views. Exit to the terrace of 50 m2, with pool 48 m2 make this property exceptional because from every corner offers stunning views of the sea and the bay. The second floor and the fourth floor is a rooftop terrace with summer kitchen/bbq area of 102 m2.&nbsp;</p>', '', '<p>Moderna zapadno orijentirana vila u izgradnji s prekrasnim pogledom i luksuzom koji se mo¾e samo po¾eljeti.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na svega 35 m od mora u mirnoj uvali, 2 km udaljenosti od svih potrebnih turistièkih sadr¾aja (restorani, kafici, ducani, trgovine, setnica, marina&hellip;) pruzit ce Vam izniman ugodjaj Mediterana.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Vila bi u potpunosti trebala biti zavrsena do ozujka 2017. godine.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Povrsina stambenog dijela vile iznosi 175 m2, a povrsina parcele 508 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Vila se sastoji od 4 etaze.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U suterenu se nalazi spavaæa soba, kupaonica, dnevni boravak s kuhinjom i blagovaonicom koja ima izlaz na terasu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Prizemlje se sastoji od radne sobe i tri spavace sobe, svaka sa svojom kupanicom, a jedna soba ima i garderobu.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sobe imaju izlaz na terasu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Prvi kat cine prostrani dnevni boravak s kuhinjomi blagovaonicom kao i konoba povrsine 19 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Izlaz na terasu povrsine 50 m2, s bazenom povrsine 48 m2 cine ovu nekretninu izuzetnom jer se iz svakog kutka pruza zadivljujuci pogled na more i uvalu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Drugi kat odnosno cetvrtu etazu cini krovna terasa s ljetnjom kuhinjom povrsine 102 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Jedinstvena arhitektura ove vile daje mogucnost uzivanja u pogledu na more iz sobe i sa terase bilo koje etaze.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Do kuce je osiguran prilaz cestom kao i parking prostor povrsine 59 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Vila ima osiguranu svu potrebnu infrastrukturu (voda, struja, septicka jama).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Aerodrom je udaljen 28 km.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za sve dodatne informacije molimo kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured u Splitu.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>We are offering this newly built villa of modern, still under construction, near the sea on the mainland.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is situated just 35m from the shore, west orientated, in a quiet bay, but 2km from a busy tourist town where there are restaurants, shops, bars, cafes, marina, providing a bustling Mediterranean experience - such a short journey from the property.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Villa will be fully completed by March 2017.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The living space of the villa is 175 m2 and 508 m2 surface plot.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The villa has been constructed over 4 floors, and from each floor there are wonderful uninterrupted sea views.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The basement has a bedroom, bathroom, living room with kitchen and dining room leading out onto a terrace.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The ground floor consists of study and three bedrooms, each with a bathroom and one bedroom has a dressing room.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Each room has a terrace.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The first floor consists of a spacious living room with a kitchen, dining room and tavern area of 19 m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Exit to the terrace of 50 m2, with pool 48 m2 make this property exceptional because from every corner offers stunning views of the sea and the bay.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The second floor and the fourth floor is a rooftop terrace with summer kitchen/bbq area of 102 m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The unique architecture of this villa gives the opportunity to enjoy the sea view from any room, either from the balcony of any floors.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house has a secured access road and parking space of 59 m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The Villa has already secured all the necessary infrastructure (water, electricity, septic tank).&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The airport is 28 km.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For further information please contact our office in Split.</p>', '', '1499_House-Villa_0.jpg', '1499_House-Villa_1.jpg', '1499_House-Villa_2.jpg', '1499_House-Villa_3.jpg', '1499_House-Villa_4.jpg', '', '', '', '');
INSERT INTO `nekretnina` (`id`, `ime`, `prezime`, `telefon`, `mobitel`, `e_mail`, `lokacija_id`, `adresa`, `status_id`, `vrsta_id`, `udaljenost`, `povrsina`, `stambenapovrsina`, `display`, `cijena`, `cijenatocka`, `ponuda_tjedna`, `new_built`, `must_sell`, `prvi_red_do_mora`, `pogled_na_more`, `bazen`, `broj_soba`, `broj_kupatila`, `datum`, `title_hr`, `title_en`, `title_ge`, `opis_hr`, `opis_en`, `opis_ge`, `PropertyImageURL0`, `PropertyImageURL1`, `PropertyImageURL2`, `PropertyImageURL3`, `PropertyImageURL4`, `PropertyImageURL5`, `PropertyImageURL6`, `PropertyImageURL7`, `PropertyImageURL8`) VALUES
(1500, 'Barbiæ', ' Odvjetnik Rino ', '', '', '', 'Hvar', 'Vrboska, zona Soline', 'For sale', 'Land plot', '200', '19000', '0', 1, '2280000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 0, 0, 'December 7, 2015', '<p>Prodaje se graðevinsko zemlji&scaron;te ju¾ne orijentacije, udaljeno od mora i pla¾e 200 m.&nbsp;Zemlji&scaron;te ima povr&scaron;inu 19.000 m2.&nbsp;Infrastruktura odmah do zemlji&scaron;ta. Ima pristup vozilom i parking. Zemlji&scaron;te se nalazi na mirnoj lokaciji, a u blizini svih sadr¾aja &ndash; 300 m od centra mjesta.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>', '<p>We are pleased to offer this building plot on Hvar. It is well situated within the town area, and near the sea and beaches. The land plot is facing south - a distance of about 200m from the beach. The total area of land is about 19,000 m2. There is already the necessary infrastructure (road/electric/water/drainsetc) immediately adjacent to the land, and a car parking area has already been established.&nbsp;The land is located in a quiet location, and close to all amenities - 300 m from the centre.</p>', '', '<p>Prodaje se graðevinsko zemlji&scaron;te ju¾ne orijentacije, udaljeno od mora i pla¾e 200 m.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Zemlji&scaron;te ima povr&scaron;inu 19.000 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Infrastruktura odmah do zemlji&scaron;ta.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ima pristup vozilom i parking.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Zemlji&scaron;te se nalazi na mirnoj lokaciji, a u blizini svih sadr¾aja &ndash; 300 m od centra mjesta.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Otok Hvar je veæ godinama popularna destinacija, kako za ljetovanje tako i za investiranje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Osim &scaron;to je povezan trajektnom linijom sa gradom Splitom, takoðer je povezan i avionskom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Cijena &euro;120/m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za sve dodatne informacije molimo kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured.</p>', '<p>We are pleased to offer this building plot on Hvar.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is well situated within the town area, and near the sea and beaches.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The land plot is facing south - a distance of about 200m from the beach.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The total area of land is about 19,000 m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There is already the necessary infrastructure (road/electric/water/drainsetc) immediately adjacent to the land, and a car parking area has already been established.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The land is located in a quiet location, and close to all amenities - 300 m from the centre - where there are shops, cafes, bars, market, bakery and other services.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Price at &euro;120/m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The island of Hvar is becoming more and more popular for both holidays and individuals wanting solid investment in property.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apart from the ferry to the city of Split, the island has a scheduled seaplane service to the mainland - which takes only a few minutes.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For further information please contact our office.</p>', '', '1500_Land-plot_0.jpg', '1500_Land-plot_1.jpg', '1500_Land-plot_2.jpg', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(1501, 'Juraj', 'Pavi¹iæ', '', '+ 385 91 20 25264', 'juki.bol@gmail.com', 'Brac', 'Murvica 8 Bol, Murvica, Zgr 587/1, Ko.Nere¾i¹æa', 'For sale', 'Old stone house', '250', '113', '280', 1, '370000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 5, 4, 'December 8, 2015', '<p>Stara kamena kuæa renovirana 2012. godine.&nbsp;Blizina mora i duh davnih vremena prednosti su ove kuæe. Predivna terasa sa otvorenim pogledom na more i nekoliko odvojenih stambenih jedinica omoguæuju novim vlasnicima nastaviti uhodani posao iznajmljivanja.&nbsp;Kuæa se prote¾e na tri kata uz dodatnu prostor komina (25 m2) koji je uz kuæu.&nbsp;U prizemljiu se nalazi &nbsp;konoba visokih stropova koju vlasnik koristi kao spremu i moguæe ju je preurediti u jedan ili dva apartmana.&nbsp;Prilika za investiciju ili u¾ivanje u dru&scaron;tvu obitelji i prijatelja.</p>', '<p>Old stone house, renovated in 2012.&nbsp;Closeness to the sea and spirit of old times are advantages of this house. It has a beautiful and unobstructed sea view and couple of separate apartments give the possibility to the new owner to continue the rental business.&nbsp;The house is spread over three floors and it has an additional room that is used as both, fire place and storage.&nbsp;This is an opportunity, to buy a property as an investment or to enjoy it with family and friends.</p>', '', '<p><strong>Stara kamena kuæa renovirana 2012. godine</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Blizina mora i duh davnih vremena prednosti su ove kuæe.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Predivna terasa sa otvorenim pogledom na more i nekoliko odvojenih stambenih jedinica omoguæuju novim vlasnicima nastaviti uhodani posao iznajmljivanja.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa se prote¾e na tri kata uz dodatni prostor kamina (25 m2) koji je uz kuæu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U prizemljiu se nalazi &nbsp;konoba visokih stropova koju vlasnik koristi kao spremu i moguæe ju je preurediti u jedan ili dva apartmana.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na prvom katu su hodnik, tri spavaæe sobe, kupaonica, zaseban wc te zaseban tu&scaron;.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuhinja i blagovaonica su odvojeni sa moguæim ulazom ili sa prednje ili sa stra¾nje strane kuæe.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na drugom katu nalaze se dva jednosobna apartmana, svaki ima kuhinju i kupaonicu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Prilika za investiciju ili u¾ivanje u dru&scaron;tvu obitelji i prijatelja.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za sve dodatne informacije molimo kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured u Splitu.&nbsp;</p>', '<p><strong>Old stone house, renovated in 2012</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Closeness to the sea and spirit of old times are advantages of this house.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It has a beautiful and unobstructed sea view and couple of separate apartments give the possibility to the new owner to continue the rental business.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house is spread over three floors and it has an additional room that is used as both, fire place and storage.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>First floor consists of hall, three bedrooms, bathroom, separate toilet and separate shower.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kitchen and dining room are separated and accessible from both, front of back side of the house.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There are two separated one-bedroom apartments on the second floor and each has its own kitchen and bathroom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>This is an opportunity, to buy a property as an investment or to enjoy it with family and friends.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For further information please contac our office in Split.&nbsp;</p>', '', '1501_Old-stone-house_0.jpg', '1501_Old-stone-house_1.jpg', '1501_Old-stone-house_2.jpg', '1501_Old-stone-house_3.jpg', '1501_Old-stone-house_4.jpg', '1501_Old-stone-house_5.jpg', '1501_Old-stone-house_6.jpg', '1501_Old-stone-house_7.jpg', '1501_Old-stone-house_8.jpg'),
(1502, 'Ivan ', 'Duka, Propadalo', '+385914312405', '+385916600032', 'dukaivan@yahoo.com', 'Murter', 'Betina, Murter', 'For sale', 'Old stone house', '0', '0', '100', 1, '180000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 3, 2, 'December 8, 2015', '<p>U centru lijepog dalmatinskog mjesta nalazi se ova iznimna kamena u potpunosti renovirana kuca.&nbsp;Kuca je u nizu.&nbsp;Povrsina kuce iznosi 100 m2.&nbsp;Kuca se sastoji od tri spavace sobe, dvije kupaonice, dvije kuhinje, ostave, dnevnog boravka, galerije i konobe.&nbsp;Izuzetan unutarnji dizajn kuce, kao i namjestaj cine ovu kucu jedinstvenom u tom podrucju.&nbsp;Kuca ima svu potrebnu infrastrukturu.</p>', '<p>We are offering this renovated and beautiful town house on one of the islands of Dalmatia.&nbsp;It is situated in the centre of one of the charismatic old fishing villages, as part of a row of traditionally built terraced houses. It is a short walk to the old harbour, where there are many options for coffee bars and cafes, a bakery and other useful services for tourists and the resident population. The house area is 100 m2. The exceptional and interesting interior design of the house, and furniture make this house unique.&nbsp;</p>', '', '<p>U centru lijepog dalmatinskog mjesta nalazi se ova iznimna kamena u potpunosti renovirana kuca.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuca je u nizu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Povrsina kuce iznosi 100 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuca se sastoji od tri spavace sobe, dvije kupaonice, dvije kuhinje, ostave, dnevnog boravka, galerije i konobe.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Izuzetan unutarnji dizajn kuce, kao i namjestaj cine ovu kucu jedinstvenom u tom podrucju.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuca ima svu potrebnu infrastrukturu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kako se kuca nalazi u centru mjesta svi potrebni sadrzaji (restorani, ducani, kafici) su u neposrednoj blizini.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sibenik je udaljen 20 min voznje, a splitski i zadarski aerodromi su udaljeni na oko ssat vremena voznje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za sve dodatne informacije molimo kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured u Splitu.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>We are offering this renovated and beautiful town house on one of the islands of Dalmatia.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is situated in the centre of one of the charismatic old fishing villages, as part of a row of traditionally built terraced houses.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is ashort walk to the old harbour, where there are many options for coffee bars and cafes, a bakery and other useful services for tourists and the resident population.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house area is 100 m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house consists of three bedrooms, two bathrooms, two kitchens, utilityroom, living room, galleries and taverns.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The exceptional and interesting interior design of the house, and furniture make this house unique.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house has all the necessary services - water/electric etc.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sibenik is located 20 minutes drive from Split and Zadar airports and are located at about one hour drive.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For further information please contact our office in Split.</p>', '', '1502_Old-stone-house_0.jpg', '1502_Old-stone-house_1.jpg', '1502_Old-stone-house_2.jpg', '1502_Old-stone-house_3.jpg', '1502_Old-stone-house_4.jpg', '1502_Old-stone-house_5.jpg', '1502_Old-stone-house_6.jpg', '1502_Old-stone-house_7.jpg', '1502_Old-stone-house_8.jpg'),
(1503, 'Kristofor', 'Pavlak', '', 'Petra Pavlak 091 444 4848', 'pkristofor@gmail.com', 'Sibenik', '©ibenik', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '100', '0', '77', 1, '360000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 2, 1, 'December 8, 2015', '<p>Predivno renoviran stan s pogledom na more u naju¾em centru &Scaron;ibenika, a sastoji se od 2 spavaæe sobe, 1 kupaonice, dnevnog prostora sa kuhinjom, ostave te terase povr&scaron;ine 30 m2 sa pogledom na more i &scaron;ibenski kanal. Upravo je terasa ono &scaron;to èini ovu nekretninu posebnom, buduæi da su stanovi sa vanjskim prostorom u u¾oj gradskoj jezgri jako rijetki.&nbsp;Zgrada je za&scaron;tiæeno kulturno dobro, odr¾avana, unutar pje&scaron;aèke zone sa mnogo barova, restorana i trgovina.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>The best you can buy in Sibenik Old Town.&nbsp;This amazingly restored seaview apartment located in the heart of the town features 2 bedrooms, 1 bathroom, living room with kitchen, storage and 30 sqm terrace with breathtaking views over the channel and the sea.&nbsp;All the stone walls are renovated and top quality flooring (oak parquet, Italian ceramic tiles) is put throughout, as well as heat and soundproof windows, safety doors, new wiring/plumbing, separate water and electrictiy meters and built-in wardrobes.</p>', '', '<p><strong>Izvrsno renoviran stan u centru &Scaron;ibenika s pogledom na more</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Predivno renoviran stan s pogledom na more u naju¾em centru &Scaron;ibenika, a sastoji se od 2 spavaæe sobe, 1 kupaonice, dnevnog prostora sa kuhinjom, ostave te terase povr&scaron;ine 30 m2 sa pogledom na more i &scaron;ibenski kanal.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Upravo je terasa ono &scaron;to èini ovu nekretninu posebnom, buduæi da su stanovi sa vanjskim prostorom u u¾oj gradskoj jezgri jako rijetki.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kameni zidovi u stanu su u potpunosti obnovljeni, a na podovima su postavljene talijanske keramièke ploèice te hrastov parket.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U sklopu renovacije ugraðeni su i novi prozori sa toplinskom i zvuènom izolacijom, sigurnosna vrata, izmijenjene instalacije sa odvojenim mjerilima struje i vode te napravljeni ogradbeni ormari u sobama.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ulaz u stan nalazi se na prvom katu sa uliène strane, dok zapravo ima visinu èetvrtoga kata zbog kaskadnog naèina gradnje zgrade.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Zgrada je za&scaron;tiæeno kulturno dobro, odr¾avana, unutar pje&scaron;aèke zone sa mnogo barova, restorana i trgovina.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Automobil se mo¾e parkirati na glavnoj &scaron;etnici koja je od nekretnine udaljena manje od 3 minute hoda.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nekretnina je u funkciji turistièkog najma te donosi znaèajan prihod, &scaron;to je èini atraktivnom kao investciju.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za dodatne informacije molimo kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured u Splitu.&nbsp;</p>', '<p><strong>The best you can buy in Sibenik Old Town</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>This amazingly restored seaview apartment located in the heart of the town features 2 bedrooms, 1 bathroom, living room with kitchen, storage and 30 sqm terrace with breathtaking views over the channel and the sea.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>All the stone walls are renovated and top quality flooring (oak parquet, Italian ceramic tiles) is put throughout, as well as heat and soundproof windows, safety doors, new wiring/plumbing, separate water and electrictiy meters and built-in wardrobes.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The entrance to the property is on the 1st floor, but in fact it has the height of a 4th floor from the south side, as the building is of cascade type.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The building is classified as a cultural heritage, well-maintained, in the pedestrian zone full of bars, shops and restaurants.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>A car can be parked on the main promenade, which is less than 3 min walking distance from the property.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property is successfully rented to tourists and the owners are getting substantial income, making this property very attractive as an investment.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For further information please contact our office in Split.&nbsp;</p>', '', '1503_Apartment_0.jpg', '1503_Apartment_1.jpg', '1503_Apartment_2.jpg', '1503_Apartment_3.jpg', '1503_Apartment_4.jpg', '1503_Apartment_5.jpg', '1503_Apartment_6.jpg', '1503_Apartment_7.jpg', '1503_Apartment_8.jpg'),
(1504, 'Branka', 'Gal', 'Kreminac 53 Podravska slatina', '0989619019', 'kljuè Kao i za Gudeljeviæa', 'Rogoznica', 'Kalebova luka  Rogoznica', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '5', '304', '156', 1, '350000', '', 2, 2, 2, 1, 1, 2, 3, 3, 'December 8, 2015', '<p>&Scaron;armantna kuæa prvi red do mora, na svega 5 m od kristalno èistog mora mora nalazi se u mirnoj i tihoj uvali, a istovremeno na svega par kilometara udaljenosti od trgovina, restorana i kafiæa.&nbsp;Kuæa se nalazi na parceli povr&scaron;ine 304 m2.&nbsp;Stambeni dio kuæe (bez terasa) iznosi 156 m2.&nbsp;Kuæa se je podijeljena na prizemlje i kat.&nbsp;U prizemlju se nalazi jednosoban apartman. Na katu se nalaze dva jednosobna apartmana.</p>', '<p>We are pleased to offer this first row house in a beautiful bay on the mainland. It is 5m from the shore with unobstructed views out to sea from all the front windows, and a short cycle ride of 2 km along the shore path to the shops and restaurants in the centre of the village.&nbsp;The house is situated on a plot of 304 m2, and the residential part of the house (without terraces) is 156 m2. The house is divided into two floors.&nbsp;The ground floor has one bedroom apartment. Upstairs are 2 one-bedroom apartments.</p>', '', '<p>&Scaron;armantna kuæa prvi red do mora, na svega 5 m od kristalno èistog mora mora nalazi se u mirnoj i tihoj uvali, a istovremeno na svega par kilometara udaljenosti od trgovina, restorana i kafiæa.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa se nalazi na parceli povr&scaron;ine 304 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Stambeni dio kuæe (bez terasa) iznosi 156 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa se je podijeljena na prizemlje i kat.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U prizemlju se nalazi jednosoban apartman (spavaæa soba, dnevni boravak s kuhinjom i kupaonica).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na katu se nalaze dva jednosobna apartmana (spavaæa soba, dnevni boravak s kuhinjom i kupaonica).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Okuænica je ureðena mediteranskim biljem.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Do kuæe je osiguran pristup autom, a na parceli se nalaze dva parking mjesta.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa ima svu potrebnu infrastrukturu (struja, septièka jama, voda).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za sve one koji ¾ele u¾ivati u privatnosti, èistom zraku i mediteranskom okru¾enju ova kuæa je idealna prilika.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Aerodrom je udaljen svega 28 km.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za dodatne informacije molimo kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured u Splitu.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>We are pleased to offer this first row house in a beautiful bay on the mainland.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is 5m from the shore with unobstructed views out to sea from all the front windows, and a short cycle ride of 2 km along the shore path to the shops and restaurants in the centre of the village.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house is situated on a plot of 304 m2, and the residential part of the house (without terraces) is 156 m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house is divided into two floors.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The ground floor has one bedroom apartment (bedroom, living room with kitchen and bathroom).&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Upstairs are 2 one-bedroom apartments (bedroom, living room with&nbsp;&nbsp;kitchen and bathroom).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house is well decorated and has been well maintained, needing little - if any, redecorating.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The courtyard is attractively landscaped with Mediterranean herbs.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house can be accessed by car and in the grounds there are two private parking spaces.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house has all the necessary infrastructure (electricity, septic tank, water).&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The airport is about 30 km.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For further information, please contact our office in Split. &nbsp;</p>', '', '1504_House-Villa_0.jpg', '1504_House-Villa_1.jpg', '1504_House-Villa_2.jpg', '1504_House-Villa_3.jpg', '1504_House-Villa_4.jpg', '1504_House-Villa_5.jpg', '1504_House-Villa_6.jpg', '1504_House-Villa_7.jpg', '1504_House-Villa_8.jpg'),
(1505, 'Anðela ', 'Miljus', '', '917643802', '', 'Rogoznica', 'Kanica Rogoznica, kè 14117/4 ko Sevid', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '60', '350', '150', 1, '299000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 3, 2, 'December 10, 2015', '<p>U izuzetno tihoj i lijepoj uvali na svega 60 m od mora nalazi se odrzavana i uredjena kuca.&nbsp;Pogled na more, tisina, kristalno cisto more i prirodna hladovina mediteranskog bilja cine ovu kucu izuzetnom prilikom.&nbsp;Kuca se nalazi na parceli povrsine 350 m2.&nbsp;Povrsina kuce je 150 m2.&nbsp;Kuca se sastoji od prizemlja i kata.&nbsp;Uz kucu se nalazi lijepo uredjena kamena konoba.&nbsp;Okucnica je uredjena mediteranskim biljem (mandarine, limun, bogenvilija, masline).&nbsp;Kuca ima pripadajuci vez za brod.</p>', '<p>We are pleased to offer this two story detached house on the mainland. It is situated 60m from the sea in a beautiful bay, where there is lowdensity housing, giving a lovely ambience to the community. The property has a sea view and has a small landscaped and planted gardenwhich creates an attractive and welcoming feel. The house is located on a plot of 350 m2 and the house has a living area of 150 m2.&nbsp;The house consists of two floors. With the house is a beautifully furnished stone cellar.</p>', '', '<p>U izuzetno tihoj i lijepoj uvali na svega 60 m od mora nalazi se odrzavana i uredjena kuca.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Pogled na more, tisina, kristalno cisto more i prirodna hladovina mediteranskog bilja cine ovu kucu izuzetnom prilikom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuca se nalazi na parceli povrsine 350 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Povrsina kuce je 150 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuca se sastoji od prizemlja i kata.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U prizemlju se nalazi jednosobni apartman (dnevni boravak s kuhinjom i blagovaonicom, spavaca soba i kupaonica).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na katu je prostrani dvosobni apartman (dnevni boravak s kupaonicom, dvije spavace sobe i kupaonica).&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>DnevnI boravak i spavace soba imaju izlaz na terasu s koje se pruza pogled na more i uvalu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Uz kucu se nalazi lijepo uredjena kamena konoba.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Mjesto za rostilj nalazi se u posebno izgradjenoj maloj kamenoj kucici.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Okucnica je uredjena mediteranskim biljem (mandarine, limun, bogenvilija, masline).&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuca ima pripadajuci vez za brod.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U mjestu se nalazi lijepo uredjena plaza s kaficem.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Najbliza trgovina je udaljena 2 km.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuca ima svu potrebnu infrastrukturu (voda, struja, septicka jama).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Do kuce se dolazi asfaltiranom cestom.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U sklopu parcele su osigurana tri parking mjesta.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Aerodrom je udaljen 28 km.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za sve dodatne informacije molimo kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured u Splitu.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>We are pleased to offer this two story detached house on the mainland.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is situated 60m from the sea in a beautiful bay, where there is lowdensity housing, giving a lovely ambience to the community.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property has a sea view and has a small landscaped and planted garden which creates an attractive and welcoming feel.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house is located on a plot of 350 m2 and the house has a living area of 150 m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house consists of two floors.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The ground floor has one bedroom apartment (living room with kitchen and dining room, bedroom and bathroom).&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Upstairs is a spacious two-room apartment (living room with bathroom, two bedrooms and bathroom).&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Living room and bedroom have access to the terrace with a view of the&nbsp;&nbsp;sea and the bay.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property has been well maintained and decorated.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>With the house is a beautifully furnished stone cellar.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>An external bbq/fireplace is located in a specially-built small stone house.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The courtyard is decorated with Mediterranean herbs and fruit trees, including tangerine, lemon, borgenvillia, and olives.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There are three parking spaces incorporated on the plot.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house has a private mooring, just a short walk from the front door.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The beach in front of the house is safe and clear with a coffee bar close by, making it very inviting to enjoy the Mediterranean atmosphere.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house has all the necessary infrastructure (water, electricity, septictank).&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Access is by an asphalt road, and there a several useful shops and cafesclose by.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The airport is about 30km.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For further information please contact our office in Split.</p>', '', '1505_House-Villa_0.JPG', '1505_House-Villa_1.jpg', '1505_House-Villa_2.jpg', '1505_House-Villa_3.jpg', '1505_House-Villa_4.jpg', '1505_House-Villa_5.jpg', '1505_House-Villa_6.jpg', '1505_House-Villa_7.jpg', '1505_House-Villa_8.jpg'),
(1506, 'Marko', 'Goreta', '', '098420210', 'markogoreta2704@st.t-com.hr', 'Rogoznica', 'Zatoglav, Rogoznica, 5714/1, 5714/3  ko Sevid', 'For sale', 'Land plot', '50', '1843', '0', 1, '450000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 0, 0, 'December 11, 2015', '<p>Gradjevinsko zemljiste u Rogoznici, drugi red od mora.&nbsp;Udaljenost plaze je svega 50 m.&nbsp;Odlicna investicija s obzirom na velicinu parcele sto je rijetkost za naci kao i za sve koji zele privatnost i mir uz more.&nbsp;S obzirom na velicinu parcele idealna je za izgradnju jedne ili dvije vile.&nbsp;Konfiguracija terena osigurava prekrasan pogled na more.&nbsp;Osigurana je sva potrebna infrastruktura (voda, struja).</p>', '<p>We have this attractive investment of a building land plot, 50m from the shore on the mainland. It is in the second row of property, but on a part of the shore with sloping geography that will ensure there are uninterrupted sea views from any part of a new property.&nbsp;This has great potential and would be a very good investment considering the size of the parcel. It is rare to find a parcel in such a quiet and tranquil part of the mainland coast.&nbsp;Given the size of the plot it is ideal for the construction of one or two villas.&nbsp;</p>', '', '<p>Gradjevinsko zemljiste u Rogoznici, drugi red od mora.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Udaljenost plaze je svega 50 m.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Odlicna investicija s obzirom na velicinu parcele sto je rijetkost za naci kao i za sve koji zele privatnost i mir uz more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>S obzirom na velicinu parcele idealna je za izgradnju jedne ili dvije vile.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Konfiguracija terena osigurava prekrasan pogled na more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Osigurana je sva potrebna infrastruktura (voda, struja).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Uz parcelu je osiguran pristupni put i sa gornje i sa donje strane.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za dodatne informacije molimo kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured u Splitu.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>We have this attractive investment of a building land plot, 50m from the shore on the mainland.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is in the second row of property, but on a part of the shore with sloping geography that will ensure there are uninterrupted sea views from any part of a new property.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>This has great potential and would be a very good investment considering the size of the parcel.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is rare to find a parcel in such a quiet and tranquil part of the mainland coast.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Given the size of the plot it is ideal for the construction of one or two villas.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There is already all necessary infrastructure (water, electricity) by the property.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>In addition to the lot, the access road is secured.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For further information, please contact our office in Split.</p>', '', '1506_Land-plot_0.JPG', '1506_Land-plot_1.JPG', '1506_Land-plot_2.JPG', '1506_Land-plot_3.JPG', '1506_Land-plot_4.JPG', '1506_Land-plot_5.JPG', '1506_Land-plot_6.JPG', '1506_Land-plot_7.JPG', '1506_Land-plot_8.JPG'),
(1507, 'Josip', 'Paladino', '091 4818 457', '098 161 15 48 ili 092 304 85 69 ,gða Blagaic kljuc', 'josip.paladino@zg.t-com.hr', 'Solta', 'Maslinica, ©olta, 1752/572, zgr. 715, KO Donje Selo', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '5', '646', '170', 1, '650000', '', 2, 2, 2, 1, 1, 2, 4, 3, 'December 11, 2015', '<p>Vila prvi red uz more, interesantnog oblika i jedna od rijetkih prilika za kupnju ovakve vrste nekretnine na otoku.&nbsp;Graðena kao obiteljska kuæa stambene povr&scaron;ine 170 m2.&nbsp;Spiralne stepenice iz prizemlja vode na prvi kat gdje je izlaz na terasu.&nbsp;Velika okuænica (646 m2) omoguæuje gradnju bazena, a more je udaljeno svega par metara.</p>', '<p>First line villa with total living area of 170m sq, that has a very interesting shape and which is one of the rare opportunities to buy such a property on the island.&nbsp;It is built as a family house.&nbsp;Spiral staircase lead to the first floor where there is the exit to the terrace.&nbsp;The land plot (646m sq) is big enough to build a pool.</p>', '', '<p><strong>Iznimna neretnina na iznimnoj lokaciji</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Vila prvi red uz more, interesantnog oblika i jedna od rijetkih prilika za kupnju ovakve vrste nekretnine na otoku.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Graðena kao obiteljska kuæa stambene povr&scaron;ine 170 m2, u prizemlju se nalaze kuhinja, blagovaonica te dnevni boravak, jedna spavaæa soba, kupaonica i WC.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Spiralne stepenice vode na prvi kat gdje se nalaze jo&scaron; tri spavaæe sobe, kupaonica te velik i prostran dodatan prostor sa izlazom na terasu koji se mo¾e pretvoriti u jo&scaron; jedan dnevni boravak sa kutkom za radni prostor.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Velika okuænica (646 m2) omoguæuje gradnju bazena, a more je udaljeno svega par metara.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Trgovine, kafiæi i restorani su udaljeni nekoliko minuta hoda.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa zahtijeva adaptaciju.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za sve dodatne informacije molimo kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured u Splitu.&nbsp;</p>', '<p><strong>Exceptional property at exceptional location</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>First line villa with total living area of 170m sq, that has a very interesting shape and which is one of the rare opportunities to buy such a property on the island.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is built as a family house and has a kitchen, dining, living room, one bedroom, bathroom and toilet on the ground floor.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Spiral staircase lead to the first floor where there are three bedrooms, bathroom and big open space that can be made in additional living area with part that can be made into a small office and with the exit to the terrace.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The land plot (646m sq) is big enough to build a pool.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The stores, caf&eacute; bars and restaurants are just couple of minutes&rsquo; walk away.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>This villa requires renovation.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For additional information please contact our office in Split.&nbsp;</p>', '', '1507_House-Villa_0.JPG', '1507_House-Villa_1.JPG', '1507_House-Villa_2.JPG', '1507_House-Villa_3.JPG', '1507_House-Villa_4.JPG', '1507_House-Villa_5.JPG', '1507_House-Villa_6.JPG', '1507_House-Villa_7.JPG', ''),
(1508, 'Luka', 'Babiæ', '01 2984132', '099 5030789', '', 'Brac', 'Splitska, k.c. 199/201 k.o. splitska', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '200', '510', '180', 1, '200000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 5, 6, 'December 11, 2015', '<p>Obiteljska kuæa na tri eta¾e u malom mjestu nedaleko od Supetra. S glavnog ulaza pristupa se mezaninu iz kojeg stepenice vode u prizemlje (tri spavaæe sobe) i na prvi kat (dnevni boravak, spavaæa soba i terasa). Sve spavaæe sobe imaju vlastite kupaonice&ndash;u sluèaju iznajmljivanja svaka se soba mo¾e zasebno izdavati.&nbsp;Ukupna stambena povr&scaron;ina kuæe iznosi 180 m2, smje&scaron;tena na zemlji&scaron;tu od 510 m2.</p>\r\n<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;">Cijena sni¾ena sa 300.000 EUR na 200.000 EUR!!</span></p>', '<p>Family home on 3 levels, located in a small village not far from Supetar town. Main entrance leads into the mazannine (kitchen, living area and bedroom), from which the stairs split into the ground floor (3 bedrooms) and first floor (living rooms, bedroom, terrace). All bedrooms are en-suite and can be rented separately.&nbsp;Total living area of the house is 180m sq, while the land plot measures 510m sq.</p>\r\n<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;">Price reduced from 300.000 EUR to 200.000 EUR!!</span></p>', '', '<p><strong><span style="text-decoration: underline;">Cijena sni¾ena sa 300.000 EUR na 200.000 EUR!!</span></strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Obiteljska kuæa na tri eta¾e u malom mjestu nedaleko od Supetra.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>S glavnog ulaza pristupa se mezaninu (na kojem su smje&scaron;teni kuhinja, spavaæa soba i dnevni prostor), iz kojeg stepenice vode u prizemlje (tri spavaæe sobe) i na prvi kat (dnevni boravak, spavaæa soba i terasa).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sve spavaæe sobe imaju vlastite kupaonice &ndash; u sluèaju iznajmljivanja svaka se soba mo¾e zasebno izdavati.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ukupna stambena povr&scaron;ina kuæe iznosi 180 m2, smje&scaron;tena na zemlji&scaron;tu od 510 m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Mirna lokacija sa pogledom na more.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæi je potrebna renovacija.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za dodatne informacije molimo kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured u Splitu.&nbsp;</p>', '<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;"><strong>Price reduced from 300.000 EUR to 200.000 EUR!!</strong></span></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Family home on 3 levels, located in a small village not far from Supetar town.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Main entrance leads into the mazannine (kitchen, living area and bedroom), from which the stairs split into the ground floor (3 bedrooms) and first floor (living rooms, bedroom, terrace).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>All bedrooms are en-suite and can be rented separately.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Total living area of the house is 180m sq, while the land plot measures 510m sq.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Quite location with sea views.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house needs renovation.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For further information please contact our office in Split.&nbsp;</p>', '', '1508_House-Villa_0.jpg', '1508_House-Villa_1.jpg', '1508_House-Villa_2.jpg', '1508_House-Villa_3.jpg', '1508_House-Villa_4.jpg', '1508_House-Villa_5.jpg', '1508_House-Villa_6.jpg', '1508_House-Villa_7.jpg', '1508_House-Villa_8.jpg'),
(1509, 'Boris', 'Tomiæ', '', '095 525 0026', 'tomic_boris@hotmail.com', 'Brac', 'Supetar', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '300', '0', '40', 1, '69000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 1, 1, 'December 11, 2015', '<p>U ponudi imamo jednosoban apartman na prvom katu manje stambene zgrade u Supetru. Stan ima loðu sa djelomiènim pogledom na more. U cijelosti je namje&scaron;ten, klimatiziran, a ima i parkirali&scaron;no mjesto te ostavu u prizemlju.&nbsp;Apartman ima stambenu povr&scaron;inu 40 m2.&nbsp;Za sve dodatne informacije molimo kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured u Splitu.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>We have this 1-bedroom apartment in offer, located on the 1st floor of a low-rise residential building in Supetar. Apartment has loggia with partial sea views. The property is fully furnished, air-conditioned and comes with the parking place and storage.&nbsp;Apartment has living area of 40 sqm.&nbsp;For furher information, please contact our office in Split.&nbsp;</p>', '', '<p>U ponudi imamo jednosoban apartman na prvom katu manje stambene zgrade u Supetru.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Stan ima loðu sa djelomiènim pogledom na more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U cijelosti je namje&scaron;ten, klimatiziran, a ima i parkirali&scaron;no mjesto te ostavu u prizemlju.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartman ima stambenu povr&scaron;inu 40 m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za sve dodatne informacije molimo kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured u Splitu.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>We have this 1-bedroom apartment in offer, located on the 1st floor of a low-rise residential building in Supetar.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartment has loggia with partial sea views.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property is fully furnished, air-conditioned and comes with the parking place and storage.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartment has living area of 40 sqm.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For furher information, please contact our office in Split.&nbsp;</p>', '', '1509_Apartment_0.jpg', '1509_Apartment_1.jpg', '1509_Apartment_2.jpg', '1509_Apartment_3.jpg', '1509_Apartment_4.jpg', '1509_Apartment_5.jpg', '1509_Apartment_6.jpg', '1509_Apartment_7.jpg', ''),
(1510, 'Boris', 'Tomiæ', '', '095 525 0026', '', 'Brac', 'Supetar', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '400', '0', '50', 2, '75000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 2, 1, 'December 11, 2015', '<p>U ponudi imamo dvosoban apartman na zadnjoj eta¾i manje stambene zgrade u Supetru. Stan ima balkon sa lijepim pogledom na more. U cijelosti je namje&scaron;ten, klimatiziran, kategoriziran, a ima i parkirali&scaron;no mjesto. Kompletno je opremljen sa svim ureðajima, posuðem i posteljinom, spreman za useljenje ili turistièki najam.&nbsp;Apartman ima stambenu povr&scaron;inu 50 m2.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>We have this great 2-bedroom apartment in offer, located in the last floor of a low-rise residential building in Supetar. Apartment has balcony with excellent sea views. The property is fully furnished, air-conditioned and comes with the parking place. It is also fully equipped with furniture, white goods and bed linen, ready for occupany or tourist rental. Apartment has living area of 50 sqm.</p>', '', '<p>U ponudi imamo dvosoban apartman na zadnjoj eta¾i manje stambene zgrade u Supetru.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Stan ima balkon sa lijepim pogledom na more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U cijelosti je namje&scaron;ten, klimatiziran, kategoriziran, a ima i parkirali&scaron;no mjesto.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kompletno je opremljen sa svim ureðajima, posuðem i posteljinom, spreman za useljenje ili turistièki najam.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartman ima stambenu povr&scaron;inu 50 m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za sve dodatne informacije molimo kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured u Splitu.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>We have this great 2-bedroom apartment in offer, located in the last floor of a low-rise residential building in Supetar.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartment has balcony with excellent sea views.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property is fully furnished, air-conditioned and comes with the parking place.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is also fully equipped with furniture, white goods and bed linen, ready for occupany or tourist rental. &nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartment has living area of 50 sqm.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For furher information, please contact our office in Split.&nbsp;</p>', '', '1510_Apartment_0.jpg', '1510_Apartment_1.jpg', '1510_Apartment_2.jpg', '1510_Apartment_3.jpg', '1510_Apartment_4.jpg', '1510_Apartment_5.jpg', '1510_Apartment_6.jpg', '1510_Apartment_7.jpg', ''),
(1511, 'Illes Tamas', 'Illes House d.o.o.', '', '098 912 6428 Olah Nandor', 'sutivan@sutivan.hu', 'Brac', 'Sutivan, 1261/3', 'For sale', 'Land plot', '5', '1916', '0', 1, '958000', '', 2, 2, 2, 1, 1, 2, 0, 0, 'December 11, 2015', '<p>Atraktivno zemlji&scaron;te u mirnom okru¾enju, prvi red uz more.&nbsp;Zemlji&scaron;te 1.916 m2 idealno za gradnju obiteljske ville ili pak objekta sa apartmanima, ovisno o ¾elji buduæih vlasnika. Postoji moguænost i podijele zemlji&scaron;ta u dva dijela te gradnje dviju vila.&nbsp;Ishodovanje graðevinske dozvole moguæe je odmah, struja i voda su uz parcelu.&nbsp;Velièina zemlji&scaron;ta osigurava privatnost, a zemlji&scaron;te je smje&scaron;teno tek 10-tak minuta hoda od centra mjesta.<br /><br /></p>', '<p>Attractive land plot in peaceful surroundings, first line to the sea.&nbsp;The land plot is 1.916 sqm and it is ideal to build a nice family villa or object with more apartments, depending on the future owners wishes. There is a possibility to split the land plot into two and build two villas.&nbsp;One can apply for the building permit immediately and the water and electricity are next to the land plot.<br /><br /></p>', '', '<p>Atraktivno zemlji&scaron;te u mirnom okru¾enju, prvi red uz more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Zemlji&scaron;te 1.916 m2 idealno za gradnju obiteljske ville ili pak objekta sa apartmanima, ovisno o ¾elji buduæih vlasnika.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Postoji moguænost i podijele zemlji&scaron;ta u dva dijela te gradnje dviju vila.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ishodovanje graðevinske dozvole moguæe je odmah, struja i voda su uz parcelu.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Velièina zemlji&scaron;ta osigurava privatnost, a zemlji&scaron;te je smje&scaron;teno tek 10-tak minuta hoda od centra mjesta.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Jedno od rijetkih zemlji&scaron;ta u graðevnoj zoni te velièine, na takvoj poziciji.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Cijena 500&euro;/m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za dodatna informacije molimo kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured u Splitu.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>Attractive land plot in peaceful surroundings, first line to the sea.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The land plot is 1.916 sqm and it is ideal to build a nice family villa or object with more apartments, depending on the future owners wishes.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There is a possibility to split the land plot into two and build two villas.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>One can apply for the building permit immediately and the water and electricity are next to the land plot.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The size of the land plot offers privacy and the land plot is situated only 10 minutes walk from the center of the town.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>One of the rare land plots in the building zone of this size and on this kind of a location.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Price 500&euro;/m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For further information please contact our office in Split.&nbsp;</p>', '', '1511_Land-plot_0.JPG', '1511_Land-plot_1.JPG', '1511_Land-plot_2.JPG', '1511_Land-plot_3.JPG', '1511_Land-plot_4.JPG', '1511_Land-plot_5.JPG', '1511_Land-plot_6.JPG', '1511_Land-plot_7.JPG', '1511_Land-plot_8.JPG'),
(1512, 'Igor ', 'Freiman ', '0049 1632029999', '099 244 6688 Milorad Lucic remax', 'firstmont@gmail.com', 'Trogir', 'Osoje III  Okrug Donji, 2113/126', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '60', '0', '69', 1, '143800', '', 1, 1, 2, 2, 1, 2, 2, 2, 'December 11, 2015', '<p>Kvalitetni apartmani u novogradnji na otoku Èiovu udaljeni od grada Splita cca. 45 min. vo¾nje.&nbsp;Smje&scaron;teni su u manjem mjestu u kojem gotovo da i nema apartmana na prodaji, stoga je ovo prilika za ulaganje s obzirom na veliki interes upravo zbog manjka apartmana na tr¾i&scaron;tu.&nbsp;Ureðena prirodno kamenita pla¾a udaljena je svega 60 m. Na pla¾i postoji moguænost privezivanja manjeg broda.&nbsp;U istoènom bloku se nalazi ukupno 6 apartmana, po 2 apartmana na svakoj eta¾i.&nbsp;Svi apartmani su velièine 69 m2.</p>', '<p>Modern quality apartments located on Ciovo island, at only 45 minutes car ride from Split.&nbsp;The building is located in a small village, where there are practically no apartments left for sale, making it a good investment opportunity due to shortage of newly built apartments on the market.&nbsp;Clean and well kept stone beach is only 60 meters away. A small boat can be temporarily moored near the beach.&nbsp;The are 6 apartments in total in the eastern wing of the building, 2 on each floor.&nbsp;All of them are sized 69 sqm.</p>', '', '<p>Kvalitetni apartmani u novogradnji na otoku Èiovu udaljeni od grada Splita cca. 45 min. vo¾nje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Smje&scaron;teni su u manjem mjestu u kojem gotovo da i nema apartmana na prodaji, stoga je ovo prilika za ulaganje s obzirom na veliki interes upravo zbog manjka apartmana na tr¾i&scaron;tu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ureðena prirodno kamenita pla¾a udaljena je svega 60 m.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na pla¾i postoji moguænost privezivanja manjeg broda.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U istoènom bloku se nalazi ukupno 6 apartmana, po 2 apartmana na svakoj eta¾i.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Svi apartmani su velièine 69 m2, a sastoje se od ulaznog dijela, kuhinje sa blagovaonicom i dnevnim boravkom, ostave, manjeg hodnika, 2 spavaæe sobe, kupaonice, wc-a i loggie sa prekrasnim pogledom na more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Svakom apartmanu pripada jedno parking mjesto ispred zgrade.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Klimatizirani su i opremljeni sa najkvalitetnijim materijalima &ndash; porculanskim ploèicama, prirodnim bojama na zidovima, kupaonskim sanitarijama talijanske marke Hatria i slavinama njemaèke marke Hansgrohe.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Takoðer postoji moguænost dodatne kupnje visoko kvalitetnog namje&scaron;taja.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>**Na ogla&scaron;enim fotografijama se nalazi apartman koji slu¾i kao prezentacija veæ potpuno namje&scaron;tenog apartmana.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Apartman 1: Prizemlje istok &ndash; 169.800 &euro; - Namje&scaron;ten</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Apartman 2: Prizemlje zapad &ndash; 143.800 &euro;</strong></p>\r\n<p><strong><br /></strong></p>\r\n<p><strong>Apartman 3: 1. kat istok &ndash; 149.800 &euro;</strong></p>\r\n<p><strong><br /></strong></p>\r\n<p><strong>Apartman 4: 1. kat zapad &ndash; 148.900 &euro;</strong></p>\r\n<p><strong><br /></strong></p>\r\n<p><strong>Apartman 5: 2. kat istok &ndash; 159.900 &euro;</strong></p>\r\n<p><strong><br /></strong></p>\r\n<p><strong>Apartman 6: 2. kat zapad &ndash;159.800 &euro;</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za dodatne informacije molimo kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured u Splitu.</p>', '<p>Modern quality apartments located on Ciovo island, at only 45 minutes car ride from Split.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The building is located in a small village, where there are practically no apartments left for sale, making it a good investment opportunity due to shortage of newly built apartments on the market.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Clean and well kept stone beach is only 60 meters away.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>A small boat can be temporarily moored near the beach.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The are 6 apartments in total in the eastern wing of the building, 2 on each floor.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>All of them are sized 69 sqm, and comprise of a corridor, kitchen with dining room, living room, storage, 2 bedrooms, bathroom, toilet and balcony, featuring splendid sea views.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>One parking place in front of the building is assigned to every apartment.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>All units are air-conditioned and equipped with top materials &ndash; ceramic tiles, natural colour on the walls, Italian Hatria bathroom ware and Hansgrohe faucets.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>High quality furniture can be bought at extra price.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>**Images are exposing a show-unit, presenting a look of a fully furnished apartment.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Apartment 1: ground floor (east) &ndash;&nbsp;<strong>169.800 &euro; - Furnished</strong></strong></p>\r\n<p><strong><br /></strong></p>\r\n<p><strong>Apartment 2: ground floor (west) &ndash;&nbsp;<strong>143.800 &euro;</strong></strong></p>\r\n<p><strong><br /></strong></p>\r\n<p><strong>Apartment 3: 1st floor (east) &ndash;&nbsp;<strong>149.800 &euro;</strong></strong></p>\r\n<p><strong><br /></strong></p>\r\n<p><strong>Apartment 4: 1st floor (west) &ndash;&nbsp;<strong>148.900 &euro;</strong></strong></p>\r\n<p><strong><br /></strong></p>\r\n<p><strong>Apartment 5: 2nd floor (east) &nbsp;&ndash;&nbsp;<strong>159.900 &euro;</strong></strong></p>\r\n<p><strong><br /></strong></p>\r\n<p><strong>Apartment 6: 2nd floor (west) &ndash;&nbsp;</strong><strong>159.800 &euro;</strong></p>\r\n<div><strong><br /></strong></div>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For further information please contact our office in Split.&nbsp;</p>', '', '1512_Apartment_0.JPG', '1512_Apartment_1.jpg', '1512_Apartment_2.JPG', '1512_Apartment_3.JPG', '1512_Apartment_4.JPG', '1512_Apartment_5.jpg', '1512_Apartment_6.JPG', '1512_Apartment_7.JPG', '1512_Apartment_8.JPG');
INSERT INTO `nekretnina` (`id`, `ime`, `prezime`, `telefon`, `mobitel`, `e_mail`, `lokacija_id`, `adresa`, `status_id`, `vrsta_id`, `udaljenost`, `povrsina`, `stambenapovrsina`, `display`, `cijena`, `cijenatocka`, `ponuda_tjedna`, `new_built`, `must_sell`, `prvi_red_do_mora`, `pogled_na_more`, `bazen`, `broj_soba`, `broj_kupatila`, `datum`, `title_hr`, `title_en`, `title_ge`, `opis_hr`, `opis_en`, `opis_ge`, `PropertyImageURL0`, `PropertyImageURL1`, `PropertyImageURL2`, `PropertyImageURL3`, `PropertyImageURL4`, `PropertyImageURL5`, `PropertyImageURL6`, `PropertyImageURL7`, `PropertyImageURL8`) VALUES
(1513, 'Tim', 'Coulson', '', '', '', 'Hvar', 'Vrboska', 'For sale', 'Old stone house', '5', '13', '60', 1, '130000', '', 2, 2, 2, 1, 1, 2, 2, 2, 'December 11, 2015', '<p>Tradicionalna stara kamena kuæa prvi red uz more na otoku Hvaru.&nbsp;Kuæa se nalazi na atraktivnoj lokaciji, samo nekoliko metara od mora.&nbsp;Sastoji se od prizemlja i kata ukupne stambene povr&scaron;ine 60 m2.&nbsp;U prizemlju je moguæe napraviti jednu do dvije sobe sa kupaonicom i wc-om.&nbsp;Na prvom katu je predviðena kuhinja s izlazom na terasu te dnevni boravak koji takoðer ima izlaz na balkon s kojeg se pru¾a predivan pogled na more.&nbsp;Kuæi pripada i dio dvori&scaron;ta. &nbsp;</p>', '<p>Croatia Property sales are pleased to offer this rare opportunity to buy a beautiful and historic harbour side house. It is situated just a few feet from the village harbour, on Hvar island. It is a stunning location.&nbsp;It consists of two floors with a total floor area of 60 m2. The first floor provides a kitchen, living room and terrace at the rear, while there is also a balcony at the front with a beautiful view of the harbour and out to sea. The house has a courtyard, where it is possible to store a boat.</p>', '', '<p>Tradicionalna stara kamena kuæa prvi red uz more na otoku Hvaru.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa se nalazi na atraktivnoj lokaciji, samo nekoliko metara od mora.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Renovirana &nbsp;je izvana, ima novi krov, podove i pragove.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Unutra&scaron;njost je ostala nedovr&scaron;ena kako bi je novi vlasnik mogao urediti po vlastitoj ¾elji i ukusu.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sastoji se od prizemlja i kata ukupne stambene povr&scaron;ine 60 m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U prizemlju je moguæe napraviti jednu do dvije sobe sa kupaonicom i wc-om.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na prvom katu je predviðena kuhinja s izlazom na terasu te dnevni boravak koji takoðer ima izlaz na balkon s kojeg se pru¾a predivan pogled na more.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæi pripada i dio dvori&scaron;ta u kojem je moguæe ostaviti brod.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Postoji moguænost pretvaranja prizemlja u poslovni prostor, buduæi da je prizemni dio nekada slu¾io kao pekara.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ova &scaron;armantna dalmatinska kuæa je smje&scaron;tena blizu prekrasnih &nbsp;pla¾a, marine, restorana, prodavaonica i svih ostalih potrebnih sadr¾aja.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za sve dodatne informacije molimo kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured.&nbsp;</p>', '<p><strong>Renovation Project</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Croatia Property sales are pleased to offer this rare opportunity to buy a beautiful and historic harbour side house.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is situated just a few feet from the village harbour, on Hvar island.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is a stunning location.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>This old stone property has been renovated externally, including a new roof, floors and ceilings and the outstanding internal work includes: Windows, Design and fitting of the interior walls, Kitchen, Flooring, Plastering, Electric, Plumbing, Selecting decorating options.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>We have estimated costs to complete this project at 25k euro.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The price has been more than adjusted to reflect these works, making this a very good value property.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It consists of two floors with a total floor area of 60 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the ground floor it is possible to make one or two rooms with bathroom and toilet.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The first floor provides a kitchen, living room and terrace at the rear, while there is also a balcony at the front with a beautiful view of the harbour and out to sea.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house has a courtyard, where it is possible to store a boat.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There is the possibility of converting the ground floor into office space, since the ground floor served as a bakery.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The services are adjacent to the property and are ready to be connected.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There is a temporary power source.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The village has a selection of family run cafes, coffee bars and basic shops including a bakery and grocers and the marina means that it is visited by many sailing yachts enjoying the clear waters.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The nearest safe and clear swimming area is just a few minute&rsquo;s walk, and any visitor to the village cannot help be impressed by its charm and quiet.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact Croatia Property Sales to arrange to visit the property.&nbsp;</p>', '', '1513_Old-stone-house_0.jpg', '1513_Old-stone-house_1.jpg', '1513_Old-stone-house_2.jpg', '1513_Old-stone-house_3.jpg', '1513_Old-stone-house_4.jpg', '1513_Old-stone-house_5.jpg', '1513_Old-stone-house_6.jpg', '1513_Old-stone-house_7.jpg', '1513_Old-stone-house_8.jpg'),
(1514, 'George', 'Bozikovic Toncika ', '', '091 5248300', '', 'Hvar', 'Jelsa', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '200', '0', '108', 1, '270000', '', 2, 1, 2, 2, 1, 2, 3, 2, 'December 11, 2015', '<p>Apartmani u novoizgraðenoj zgradi, s prostranom terasom i dvori&scaron;tem, samo 250 m od mora.&nbsp;Jedan apartman je smje&scaron;ten na prvom katu, dok je drugi u potkrovlju.&nbsp;Imaju ukupnu stambenu povr&scaron;inu 108 m2.&nbsp;Apartman na prvom katu sastoji se od dvije spavaæe sobe, kupaonice, kuhinje, blagovaonice i dnevnog boravka koji imaju izlaz na prostranu terasu (s ro&scaron;tiljem) s koje se pru¾a prekrasan pogled na Braè i makarsku rivijeru. Unutarnje stepenice vode do potkrovlja gdje se nalazi jedna spavaæa soba s kupaonicom.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>We are offering these two apartments in one sale. They are apartments in a newly built building, with a spacious terrace and garden, just 250 m from the sea, in a small town on the north side of Hvar island. One apartment is located on the first floor, while the other is in the attic. They have a total surface of 108 m2 (no separate sale). There is also spacious terrace (with barbecue cooking) and which offers a beautiful view out to sea and of the Brac and the Makarska Riviera.</p>', '', '<p>Apartmani u novoizgraðenoj zgradi, s prostranom terasom i dvori&scaron;tem, samo 250 m od mora.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Jedan apartman je smje&scaron;ten na prvom katu, dok je drugi u potkrovlju.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Imaju ukupnu stambenu povr&scaron;inu 108 m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartman na prvom katu sastoji se od dvije spavaæe sobe, kupaonice, kuhinje, blagovaonice i dnevnog boravka koji imaju izlaz na prostranu terasu (s ro&scaron;tiljem) s koje se pru¾a prekrasan pogled na Braè i makarsku rivijeru. &nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Unutarnje stepenice vode do potkrovlja gdje se nalazi jedna spavaæa soba s kupaonicom.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sa svih prozora se pru¾a pogled na more.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartmanima pripada i parking.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U potpunosti su opremljeni (podno grijanje, klima) a zgrada je kvalitetno graðena.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Objekt se nalazi na mirnom podruèju, 400 m od centra mjesta gdje mo¾ete pronaæi sve potrebne sadr¾aje (restorane, kafiæe, trgovine).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za sve dodatne informacije molimo kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>We are offering these two apartments in one sale.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>They are apartments in a newly built building, with a spacious terrace and garden, just 250 m from the sea, in a small town on the north side of Hvar island.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>One apartment is located on the first floor, while the other is in the attic.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>They have a total surface of 108 m2 (no separate sale).&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The apartment on the first floor consists of two bedrooms, bathroom, kitchen, dining and living room, which has access to the spacious terrace (with barbecue cooking) and which offers a beautiful view out to sea and of the Brac and the Makarska Riviera.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Internal stairs lead to the attic where there is one bedroom with bathroom.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>All the windows overlook the sea.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartments have parking.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>They are fully equipped (underfloor heating, air conditioning) and the building has been built with good quality materials to an attractive design.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property is located in a quiet area, 400 m from the centre where you can find all the necessary amenities (restaurants, bars, shops).&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For further information please contact our office.</p>', '', '1514_Apartment_0.jpg', '1514_Apartment_1.jpg', '1514_Apartment_2.jpg', '1514_Apartment_3.jpg', '1514_Apartment_4.jpg', '1514_Apartment_5.jpg', '1514_Apartment_6.jpg', '1514_Apartment_7.jpg', '1514_Apartment_8.jpg'),
(1515, 'Nik¹a, Tatjana', 'Georgi bozikovic', '', '091 524 83 00', '', 'Hvar', 'Jelsa', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '250', '120', '45', 1, '165000', '', 2, 1, 2, 2, 1, 2, 2, 1, 'December 11, 2015', '<p>Apartman u novoizgraðenoj zgradi, s prostranom terasom i dvori&scaron;tem, samo 250 m od mora.&nbsp;Apartman se nalazi u prizemlju zgrade, te ima stambenu povr&scaron;inu 45 m2.&nbsp;Sastoji se od dvije spavaæe sobe, kupaonice, spremi&scaron;ta, kuhinje, blagovaonice i dnevnog boravka koji imaju izlaz na terasu povr&scaron;ine 51 m2.&nbsp;Lijepo ureðen vrt na kojem je zasaðeno mediterasnko bilje ima povr&scaron;inu 120 m2, a s jednog se dijela pru¾a i pogled na more.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>We have this two bedroom apartment in a newly built building with seaviews. It enjoys an unusually spacious terrace and garden that includes a fabulousbbq cooking facility and plenty of space for even large family dinners. It has a beautifully landscaped garden which is planted with Mediterranean herbs and plants with an area of 120 m2, and provides a view of the sea. It is located just 250 m from the sea.</p>', '', '<p>Apartman u novoizgraðenoj zgradi, s prostranom terasom i dvori&scaron;tem, samo 250 m od mora.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartman se nalazi u prizemlju zgrade, te ima stambenu povr&scaron;inu 45 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sastoji se od dvije spavaæe sobe, kupaonice, spremi&scaron;ta, kuhinje, blagovaonice i dnevnog boravka koji imaju izlaz na terasu povr&scaron;ine 51 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Jugoistoèno orijentiran.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Lijepo ureðen vrt na kojem je zasaðeno mediterasnko bilje ima povr&scaron;inu 120 m2, a s jednog se dijela pru¾a i pogled na more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Dio dvora je natkriven, na njemu nalazi kamin, a iza zgrade je i mala kamena kuæica koja slu¾i kao spremi&scaron;te.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartmanu pripada i parking mjesto.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U potpunosti je opremljen, a zgrada je kvalitetno graðena.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nalazi se na mirnom podruèju, 400 m od centra mjesta gdje mo¾ete pronaæi sve potrebne sadr¾aje (restorane, kafiæe, trgovine).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za sve dodatne informacije molimo kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>We have this two bedroom apartment in a newly built building with sea views.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It enjoys an unusually spacious terrace and garden that includes a fabulous bbq cooking facility and plenty of space for even large family dinners.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It has a beautifully landscaped garden which is planted with Mediterranean herbs and plants with an area of 120 m2, and provides a view of the sea.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is located just 250 m from the sea, and 400m from the centre of this small and charming village on the north side of Hvar island, where there are many shops, bars, cafes and restaurants.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The apartment is located on the ground floor and has a living area of 45m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It consists of two bedrooms, bathroom, storage room, kitchen, living room and dining room with large doors leading onto a terrace of 51 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property is well designed and has been nicely decorated.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is inimmaculate condition.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is Southeast oriented.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The apartment has a private parking place.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For further information please contact our office and arrange to visit it with one of our agents.</p>', '', '1515_Apartment_0.jpg', '1515_Apartment_1.jpg', '1515_Apartment_2.jpg', '1515_Apartment_3.jpg', '1515_Apartment_4.jpg', '1515_Apartment_5.jpg', '1515_Apartment_6.jpg', '1515_Apartment_7.jpg', '1515_Apartment_8.jpg'),
(1516, 'Tatjana ', 'Novi Sad Boriæ', '', '', '', 'Hvar', 'Stari Grad', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '100', '499', '100', 1, '270000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 3, 1, 'December 11, 2015', '<p>&Scaron;armantna kuæa s vrtom u blizini mora i centra grada.&nbsp;Kuæa se sastoji od prizemlja i kata ukupne stambene povr&scaron;ine 100 m2.&nbsp;Parcela na kojoj je kuæa smje&scaron;tena ima povr&scaron;inu 499 m2.&nbsp;Kuæi je potrebna manja adaptacija.&nbsp;Oko kuæe je prekrasan vrt s mediterasnkim biljem, gdje se nalazi i prostran parking.&nbsp;S balkona se pru¾a pogled na more.&nbsp;Odvojeni dio kuæe se koristi u svrhu iznajmljivanja.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>We are offering this two story detached house needing renovation. It is situated in one of the larger villages on Hvar Island, 100m from the sea shore and 250m from the historic centre of the village, where there is a good range of shops, cafes, bars and restaurants, all charmingly surrounding the harbour. The house sits on a plot of 500m sq, planted with a range of Mediterranean herbs and fruit trees, and with space and access for private off road parking. The house consists of two floors with a total floor area of 100 m2.</p>', '', '<p>&Scaron;armantna kuæa s vrtom u blizini mora i centra grada. &nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa se sastoji od prizemlja i kata ukupne stambene povr&scaron;ine 100 m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Parcela na kojoj je kuæa smje&scaron;tena ima povr&scaron;inu 499 m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæi je potrebna manja adaptacija.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Oko kuæe je prekrasan vrt s mediterasnkim biljem, gdje se nalazi i prostran parking.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>S balkona se pru¾a pogled na more.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Jugozapadne je orijentacije.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Iza kuæe se nalazi spremi&scaron;te i ro&scaron;tilj.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Odvojeni dio kuæe se koristi u svrhu iznajmljivanja.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>More i pla¾a su udaljeni 100 m, dok je centar grada gdje se nalaze trgovine, restorani i kafiæi na samo 250 m udaljenosti.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za sve dodatne informacije molimo kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>We are offering this two story detached house needing renovation.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is situated in one of the larger villages on Hvar Island, 100m from the sea shore and 250m from the historic centre of the village, where there is a good range of shops, cafes, bars and restaurants, all charmingly surrounding the harbour.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house sits on a plot of 500m sq, planted with a range of Mediterranean herbs and fruit trees, and with space and access for private off road parking.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house consists of two floors with a total floor area of 100 m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There is a balcony with access from the first floor that offers a view of the sea.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property has a Southwest orientation.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Behind the house, in one area of the garden there is a storage room and outside barbecue.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>A separate part of the house has been used for the purpose of renting to tourists.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property is habitable, but needs redecorating, and possibly some renovation work - internally.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For further information please contact our office.</p>', '', '1516_House-Villa_0.jpg', '1516_House-Villa_1.jpg', '1516_House-Villa_2.jpg', '1516_House-Villa_3.jpg', '1516_House-Villa_4.jpg', '1516_House-Villa_5.jpg', '1516_House-Villa_6.jpg', '1516_House-Villa_7.jpg', '1516_House-Villa_8.jpg'),
(1517, 'Ivo', 'Plemenèiæ', '', '0994005111', 'kristina.plemencic@gmail.com', 'Trogir', 'Rastiæa III Okrug Gornji', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '90', '0', '75', 1, '210000', '', 2, 1, 2, 2, 1, 1, 2, 2, 'December 11, 2015', '<p>Luksuzna zgrada u novogradnji sa bazenom i prekrasnim pogledom na more. Novoizgraðena zgrada u 4.redu od mora udaljena 90 m od prirodno kamenite pla¾e i jedne od popularnijih uvala na otoku Èiovu.&nbsp;U zgradi su ukupno 4 apartmana, dok su na prodaju dva apartmana. Zgrada se sastoji od prizemlja, 1. i 2. kata. Apartmani imaju povr&scaron;inu 75 m2. Luksuzno su namje&scaron;teni i spremni za useljenje.</p>', '<p>We have this rare and exciting opportunity to buy one of two new apartments with a swimming pool. The property itself has been built to a high luxury standard, with wide marble stairs, large rooms and exciting sea views from all the windows and balconies, and with easy access to a patio area with a swimming pool. Apartments that are for sale are 75 m2.</p>', '', '<p>Luksuzna zgrada u novogradnji sa bazenom i prekrasnim pogledom na more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Novoizgraðena zgrada u 4.redu od mora udaljena 90 m od prirodno kamenite pla¾e i jedne od popularnijih uvala na otoku Èiovu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Otok je povezan mostom sa gradom Trogirom, a sa izgradnjom jo&scaron; jednog mosta popularnost æe biti jo&scaron; veæa &scaron;to æe utjecati i na poveæanje cijena nekretnina.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U zgradi su ukupno 4 apartmana, dok su na prodaju dva.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Zgrada se sastoji od prizemlja, 1. i 2. kata.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartmani imaju povr&scaron;inu 75 m2, a sastoje se od kuhinje sa blagovaonicom i dnevnim dijelom, 2 spavaæe sobe, 2 kupaonice i terase s prekresnim pogledom na more.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartmani su luksuzno namje&scaron;teni i spremni za useljenje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U ureðenom dvori&scaron;tu se nalazi zajednièki bazen, a ispred ulaza u zgradu po jedno parking mjesto za svaki apartman.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>APARTMAN 1: 1.KAT &ndash; 210.000 &euro;</strong></p>\r\n<p><strong><br /></strong></p>\r\n<p><strong>APARTMAN 2: 2.KAT &ndash; 210.000 &euro;</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ukoliko imate dodatnih pitanja, slobodno nas kontaktirajte.</p>', '<p>We have this rare and exciting opportunity to buy one of two new apartments with a swimming pool.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>They are situated in the first line of housing, along the clean and rocky shore, but a few minutes walk to one of the best beaches on the island.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property is close to the centre of the small village with essential shops, bakery, cafes and bars, and just 10 minutes drive from the larger town of Trogir, with many choices of fine restaurants, and historic and cultural activities enjoyed by tourists.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The island is connected by a bridge to the city of Trogir, and the construction of a new - additional - bridge will increase its popularity and ensure that investment on the island remains sound.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property itself has been built to a high luxury standard, with wide marble stairs, large rooms and exciting sea views from all the windows and balconies, and with easy access to a patio area with a swimming pool.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The building has 4 apartments, with 2 remaining apartments for sale.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The building consists of ground, first and second floor.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartments that are for sale are 75 m2 and consist of a kitchen, dining room and living room, 2 bedrooms, 2 bathrooms and a wide terrace with lovely view.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The apartments are being sold fully and luxuriously furnished and ready for occupancy.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The landscaped garden and surrounds contain the communal swimming pool and in front of the building is 1 private parking space for each apartment.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>APARTMENT 1: 1st floor - &euro; 210,000&nbsp;&nbsp;</strong></p>\r\n<p><strong><br /></strong></p>\r\n<p><strong>APARTMENT 2: 2nd FLOOR - &euro; 210,000&nbsp;&nbsp;</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>If you have any questions, please contact our agents in the Split office.</p>', '', '1517_Apartment_0.jpg', '1517_Apartment_1.jpg', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(1518, '', 'Norve¹ki san d.o.o.', 'Erlend Pollestad, +47 95873811', 'Telefon Promajna 021 621 161', 'post@eiendom2.no ', 'Makarska', 'Omi¹ka 4  Promajna', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '370', '634', '0', 1, '670000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 0, 0, 'December 11, 2015', '<p>Na prodaju nudimo tvrtku (registriranu kao dru&scaron;tvo s ogranièenom odgovorno&scaron;æu) koja u vlasni&scaron;tvu ima ovu zanimljivu nekretninu u malom mjestu nedaleko od Makarske. Osim nekretnine, koja je renovirana 2010.godine (nove instalacije vode, struje, novi podovi, krovi&scaron;te, zatvori itd), kupac takoðer dobiva logistiku za turistièki najam, biciklu, gumeni èamac i platstièni vanjski bazen.&nbsp;Nekretnina ima 7 parkirnih mjesta te je pokrivena sigurnosnim nadzornim kamerama.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>For sale we have Croatian limited liability company, owning this lovely property minutes drive from Makarska town. Apart from the property that was fully rebuilt in 2010 (new wiring, plumbic, flooring, tiling, roof, pvc doors and windows etc), the buyer would also get rental logistics, bicycle, rubber boat and plastic outdoor pool.&nbsp;There is a parking for 7 cars.&nbsp;</p>', '', '<p><strong>CIJENA SNI®ENA za 100.000 EUR!</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na prodaju nudimo tvrtku (registriranu kao dru&scaron;tvo s ogranièenom odgovorno&scaron;æu) koja u vlasni&scaron;tvu ima ovu zanimljivu nekretninu u malom mjestu nedaleko od Makarske.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Osim nekretnine, koja je renovirana 2010.godine (nove instalacije vode, struje, novi podovi, krovi&scaron;te, zatvori itd), kupac takoðer dobiva logistiku za turistièki najam, biciklu, gumeni èamac i platstièni vanjski bazen.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nekretnina ima 7 parkirnih mjesta te je pokrivena sigurnosnim nadzornim kamerama.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Prva eta¾a: jednosobni apartman sa balkonom, recepcija sa kuhinjom, ostava, vanjski wc, ro&scaron;tilj, natkriveni parking.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Druga eta¾a: radna soba, 2 x studio apartman sa balkonom, 2 x jednosobni apartman sa balkonom, ljetna kuhinja.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Treæa eta¾a: praonica, 2 x studio apartman sa balkonom, jednosobni apartman sa balknom, servisna prostorija.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sobe i apartmani su klimatizirani i u cijelosti opremljeni i namje&scaron;teni.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za vi&scaron;e informacija molimo kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured u Splitu.&nbsp;</p>', '<p><strong>PRICE REDUCED BY 100.000 EUR!</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For sale we have Croatian limited liability company, owning this lovely property minutes drive from Makarska town.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apart from the property that was fully rebuilt in 2010 (new wiring, plumbic, flooring, tiling, roof, pvc doors and windows etc), the buyer would also get rental logistics, bicycle, rubber boat and plastic outdoor pool.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There is a parking for 7 cars.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property has CCTV.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Level 1: 1-bedroom apartment with balcony, reception with kitchen, storage, outdoor toilet, BBQ area, covered carport.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Level 2: study/library, 2 x double room with bathroom, 2 x 1-bedroom apartment with balcony, summer kitchen.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Level 3: laundry, 2 x studio apartment with balcony, 1-bedroom apartment with balcony, service room.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Rooms and apartments are air-conditioned and fully furnished. There are 27 beds and 10 bathrooms in total.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property gives substantial returns from tourist rental and represents a great investment opportunity.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please enquire with our Split office for more information.&nbsp;</p>', '', '1518_House-Villa_0.jpg', '1518_House-Villa_1.jpg', '1518_House-Villa_2.jpg', '1518_House-Villa_3.jpg', '1518_House-Villa_4.jpg', '1518_House-Villa_5.jpg', '1518_House-Villa_6.jpg', '1518_House-Villa_7.jpg', '1518_House-Villa_8.jpg'),
(1519, 'Boris', 'Tomiæ', '', '095 525 0026', 'tomic_boris@hotmail.com', 'Brac', 'Milna', 'For sale', 'Land plot', '2000', '51000', '0', 1, '255000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 0, 0, 'December 14, 2015', '<p>Poljoprivredno zemlji&scaron;te povr&scaron;ine ca. 51.000 m2 sa jugozapadne strane otoka Braèa. Nema pogled na more.&nbsp;Zemlji&scaron;te se ne obraðuje niti ima infrastrukturne prikljuèke.&nbsp;Buduæi da se zemlji&scaron;te nalazi van graðevne zone, strani dr¾avljani ga mogu kupiti jedino putem hrvatske tvrtke.&nbsp;Na poljoprivrednom zemlji&scaron;tu povr&scaron;ine iznad 30 tisuæa m2 dozvoljena je gradnja po uvjetom osnivanja registriranog OPG-a, i to ne vi&scaron;e od 400 m2 BRP prizemne eta¾e, visine do 5 metara i ne bli¾e od 100 metara od mora.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>Agricultural land sized ca. 51.000 sqm on the southwestern side of Brac island. It has no sea views.&nbsp;The land is not cropped nor it has utility connections.&nbsp;The plot is out of the building zone (foreign nationals may acquire agricultural land only by setting up the company).&nbsp;On agricultural land sized over 30 thousand sqm within the protected maritime zone (1 km from the shore), a registered agricultural household can be built &ndash; a ground floor house sized up to 400 sqm gross, not higher than 5 meters and not closer than 100 meters from the sea. &nbsp;</p>', '', '<p>Poljoprivredno zemlji&scaron;te povr&scaron;ine ca. 51.000 m2 sa jugozapadne strane otoka Braèa.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nema pogled na more.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Zemlji&scaron;te se ne obraðuje niti ima infrastrukturne prikljuèke.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Buduæi da se zemlji&scaron;te nalazi van graðevne zone, strani dr¾avljani ga mogu kupiti jedino putem hrvatske tvrtke.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na poljoprivrednom zemlji&scaron;tu povr&scaron;ine iznad 30 tisuæa m2 dozvoljena je gradnja po uvjetom osnivanja registriranog OPG-a, i to ne vi&scaron;e od 400 m2 BRP prizemne eta¾e, visine do 5 metara i ne bli¾e od 100 metara od mora.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za dodatne informacije molimo kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured u Splitu.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>Agricultural land sized ca. 51.000 sqm on the southwestern side of Brac island.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It has no sea views.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The land is not cropped nor it has utility connections.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The plot is out of the building zone (foreign nationals may acquire agricultural land only by setting up the company).&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On agricultural land sized over 30 thousand sqm within the protected maritime zone (1 km from the shore), a registered agricultural household can be built &ndash; a ground floor house sized up to 400 sqm gross, not higher than 5 meters and not closer than 100 meters from the sea. &nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For further information please contact our office in Split.&nbsp;</p>', '', '1519_Land-plot_0.jpg', '1519_Land-plot_1.jpg', '1519_Land-plot_2.jpg', '1519_Land-plot_3.jpg', '', '', '', '', ''),
(1520, 'Boris', 'Tomiæ', '', '095 525 0026', 'tomic_boris@hotmail.com', 'Brac', 'Postire', 'For sale', 'Land plot', '200', '39000', '0', 1, '312000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 0, 0, 'December 14, 2015', '<p>Poljoprivredno zemlji&scaron;te povr&scaron;ine ca. 39.000 m2 sa sjeverne strane otoka Braèa. Zemlji&scaron;te gleda na braèki kanal i more.&nbsp;Na zemlji&scaron;tu se nalazi oko 400 stabala maslina, od kojih oko 100 stabala trenutno daje urod. Postoji izvor vode, a struja se nalazi na udaljenosti od oko 200 metara.&nbsp;Buduæi da se zemlji&scaron;te nalazi van graðevne zone, strani dr¾avljani ga mogu kupiti jedino putem hrvatske tvrtke.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>Agricultural land sized ca. 39.000 sqm on the northern side of Brac island, ovverlooking the channel and the sea.&nbsp;There are around 400 olive trees on the land, out of which 100 are currently exploitable. There is a water on the land, while the electrictiy is ca. 200 meters away.&nbsp;The plot is out of the building zone (foreign nationals may acquire agricultural land only by setting up the company).&nbsp;</p>', '', '<p>Poljoprivredno zemlji&scaron;te povr&scaron;ine ca. 39.000 m2 sa sjeverne strane otoka Braèa.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Zemlji&scaron;te gleda na braèki kanal i more.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na zemlji&scaron;tu se nalazi oko 400 stabala maslina, od kojih oko 100 stabala trenutno daje urod.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Postoji izvor vode, a struja se nalazi na udaljenosti od oko 200 metara.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Buduæi da se zemlji&scaron;te nalazi van graðevne zone, strani dr¾avljani ga mogu kupiti jedino putem hrvatske tvrtke.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na poljoprivrednom zemlji&scaron;tu povr&scaron;ine iznad 30 tisuæa m2 dozvoljena je gradnja po uvjetom osnivanja registriranog OPG-a, i to ne vi&scaron;e od 400 m2 BRP prizemne eta¾e, visine do 5 metara i ne bli¾e od 100 metara od mora.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za dodatne informacije molimo kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured u Splitu.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>Agricultural land sized ca. 39.000 sqm on the northern side of Brac island, ovverlooking the channel and the sea.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There are around 400 olive trees on the land, out of which 100 are currently exploitable.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There is a water on the land, while the electrictiy is ca. 200 meters away.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The plot is out of the building zone (foreign nationals may acquire agricultural land only by setting up the company).&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On agricultural land sized over 30 thousand sqm within the protected maritime zone (1 km from the shore), a registered agricultural household can be built &ndash; a ground floor house sized up to 400 sqm gross, not higher than 5 meters and not closer than 100 meters from the sea. &nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For further information please contact our office in Split.&nbsp;</p>', '', '1520_Land-plot_0.jpg', '1520_Land-plot_1.jpg', '1520_Land-plot_2.jpg', '1520_Land-plot_3.jpg', '', '', '', '', ''),
