bli¾e od 100 metara od mora.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za dodatne informacije molimo kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured u Splitu.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>Agricultural land sized ca. 89.000 sqm on of Brac island.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It has excellent sea views.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The land is not cropped nor it has utility connections.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The plot is out of the building zone (foreign nationals may acquire agricultural land only by setting up the company).&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On agricultural land sized over 30 thousand sqm within the protected maritime zone (1 km from the shore), a registered agricultural household can be built &ndash; a ground floor house sized up to 400 sqm gross, not higher than 5 meters and not closer than 100 meters from the sea. &nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For further information plese contact our office in Split.&nbsp;</p>', '', '1521_Land-plot_0.jpg', '1521_Land-plot_1.jpg', '1521_Land-plot_2.jpg', '1521_Land-plot_3.jpg', '', '', '', '', ''),
(1523, 'Bo¹ko ', 'Miliæ', '', '099 2160 060', '', 'Split', 'Tararina 7 Split', 'For sale', 'Old stone house', '200', '25', '130', 2, '415000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 3, 2, 'December 22, 2015', '<p>&Scaron;armantna kamena kuæa s terasom u centru grada!&nbsp;Nalazi se u jednoj od najpopularnijih èetvrti Splita i u¾iva lagan pristup cjelogodi&scaron;njim sadr¾ajima (restoranima, kafiæima, muzejima, javnom prijevozu i pla¾ama) &scaron;to èini ovu kuæu atraktivnom kako za ¾ivljenje tako i za turistièki najam ili pak preureðenje u hostel.&nbsp;Izolirana je od buke i gradske vreve, a samo 200 m udaljena od mora.&nbsp;Kuæa se sastoji od prizemlja, prvog kata i visokog potkrovlja s izlazom na terasu, ukupne stambene povr&scaron;ine 130 m2.<br /><br /></p>', '<p>We have this utterly charming resorted stone house with a terrace in the City centre! It is located in one of the most popular districts of Split and enjoys close and easy access to all the tourist and cultural attractions of the city. The property is in an isolated situation - away from the noise and bustle, but only 200 m away from the sea. This makes this house attractive both for living and for tourist rental or conversion into a hostel. The house consists of ground floor, first floor and attic, with a total floor area of 130 m2.</p>', '', '<p>&Scaron;armantna kamena kuæa s terasom u centru grada!</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nalazi se u jednoj od najpopularnijih èetvrti Splita i u¾iva lagan pristup cjelogodi&scaron;njim sadr¾ajima (restoranima, kafiæima, muzejima, javnom prijevozu i pla¾ama) &scaron;to èini ovu kuæu atraktivnom kako za ¾ivljenje tako i za turistièki najam ili pak preureðenje u hostel.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Izolirana je od buke i gradske vreve, a samo 200 m udaljena od mora.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Takoðer buduæem vlasniku osigurava i znaèajan prihod.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je iznutra i izvana renovirana, dok je fasada raðena ruèno.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Vlasnik je prilikom renoviranja pazio na svaki detalj.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa se sastoji od prizemlja, prvog kata i visokog potkrovlja, ukupne stambene povr&scaron;ine 130 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U prizemlju se nalaze dvije spavaæe sobe i kupaonica.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Od prizemlja sve do potkrovlja vode unutarnje stepenice.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na prvom katu su kuhinja s blagovaonicom i dnevni boravak, dok se u visokom potkrovlju nalaze jedna spavaæa soba, kupaonica te izlaz na terasu povr&scaron;ine 25 m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nekretnina je jedna od rijetkih u samom centru grada s prostranom terasom.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za dodatne informacije molimo kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured u Splitu.</p>', '<p>We have this utterly charming resorted stone house with a terrace in the City centre!</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is located in one of the most popular districts of Split and enjoys close and easy access to all the tourist and cultural attractions of the city.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property is in an isolated situation -away from the noise and bustle, but only 200 m away from the sea.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>This makes this house attractive both for living and for tourist rental or conversion into a hostel.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house consists of ground floor, first floor and attic, with a total floor area of 130 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It has been restored to a very high standard, both inside and outside, with every detail being considered carefully.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The ground floor has two bedrooms and a bathroom.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>From the ground floor to the top floor there are internal stairs.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the first floor are the kitchen, dining room and living room, while on the top floor are a bedroom, bathroom and terrace of 25 m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property has one major and almost unique feature - it is one of the few in the city centre with a spacious roof terrace.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For further information, please contact our office in Split.</p>', '', '1523_Old-stone-house_0.jpg', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(1524, 'Valentina i Pre', 'Ðerda', '091/8928107 (Laura)', '091/9106370 (Valentina)', 'Laura.resetar@gmail.com', 'Zadar', 'Dr. Franje Tuðmana 33 Suko¹an', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '20', '250', '240', 1, '320000', '', 2, 2, 2, 1, 1, 2, 6, 3, 'December 22, 2015', '<p>Izvanredna prilika na tr¾i&scaron;tu, kuæa u prvom redu do mora, s prekrasnim pogledom na more i otoke.&nbsp;Smje&scaron;tena na odliènoj lokaciji, udaljena samo 20 m od mora.&nbsp;Kuæa se sastoji od dva stana te je povoljna za iznajmljivanje.&nbsp;U prizemlju je stan od 81 m2, s posebnim ulazom.&nbsp;Ukupna stambena povr&scaron;ina apartmana iznosi cca 240 m2, dok je okuænica 250 m2.</p>', '<p>We are pleased to offer this well presented front line house of two apartments. The house consists of two nicely decorated apartments and would beextremely attractive to tourists, if not being used privately by the owner. The ground floor apartment is 81 m2, with a separate entrance. There isa fabulous roof terrace, facing south across the water, with views to the off-shore islands and along the coast. Total living area of the apartment is approximately 240 m2, and 250 m2 garden.&nbsp;</p>', '', '<p>Izvanredna prilika na tr¾i&scaron;tu, kuæa u prvom redu do mora, s prekrasnim pogledom na more i otoke.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Smje&scaron;tena na odliènoj lokaciji, udaljena samo 20 m od mora.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa se sastoji od dva stana te je povoljna za iznajmljivanje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U prizemlju je stan od 81 m2, s posebnim ulazom.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Stan ima 2 spavaæe sobe, kupaonicu, dnevni boravak i kuhinju.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na prvom katu je dvoeta¾ni stan koji se sastoji od velikog dnevnog boravka, kuhinje, kupaonice i sobe, a u potkrovlju se nalaze jo&scaron; 3 spavaæe sobe, mali wc i velika terasa.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Orijentirana je ju¾no.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ukupna stambena povr&scaron;ina apartmana iznosi cca 240 m2, dok je okuænica 250 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je graðena 2008. godine.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ima 4 parking mjesta.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Vlasni&scaron;tvo je uredno.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Mjesto je popularno meðu turistima, prepoznato ako idealno za odmor i opu&scaron;tanje, poznato po predivnim pla¾ama.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Meðunarodni aerodrom u Zemuniku je udaljen 12 km, a centar Zadra 10 min. vozilom.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za sve dodatne informacije molimo kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured u Splitu.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>We are pleased to offer this well presented front line house of two apartments.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is situated just 20 m from the shore in a small village on the mainland, near Zadar.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house consists of two nicely decorated apartments and would be extremely attractive to tourists, if not being used privately by the owner.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The ground floor apartment is 81 m2, with a separate entrance.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>This apartment has 2 bedrooms, bathroom, and modern style open plan living room and kitchen.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The upper apartment on the first and second floors is a duplex design, which consists of a large family living room, kitchen, bathroom and bedroom, and upstairs, in the attic there are 3 bedrooms, a small bathroom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There isa fabulous roof terrace, facing south across the water, with views to the off-shore islands and along the coast.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is oriented south.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Total living area of the apartment is approximately 240 m2, and 250 m2 garden.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house was built in 2008.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There are 4 parking spaces.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The local area is popular with tourists, especially those looking for restand relaxation, as the area is known for its beautiful beaches and peaceful and tranquil environment.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is only a short walk along the shore to the nearest cafes and bars in the village centre.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The international airport in Zemunik is 12 km away, and the center of&nbsp;&nbsp;Zadar, 10 min drive.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For further information please contact our office in Split.</p>', '', '1524_House-Villa_0.jpg', '1524_House-Villa_1.jpg', '1524_House-Villa_2.jpg', '1524_House-Villa_3.jpg', '1524_House-Villa_4.jpg', '1524_House-Villa_5.jpg', '1524_House-Villa_6.jpg', '1524_House-Villa_7.jpg', '1524_House-Villa_8.jpg'),
(1525, 'Wolfgang', 'Hohler', '021 584 513', '091 527 0293', '', 'Trogir', 'Tepli Bok 26a Okrug Gornji, 380/15, 1570 zgr', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '150', '409', '182', 1, '340000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 3, 2, 'December 22, 2015', '<p>Simpatièno ureðena i renovirana kuæa na otoku Èiovu u blizini mora i prekrasne uvale.&nbsp;Povr&scaron;ina zemlji&scaron;ta je 409 m2, a ukupna brutto stambena povr&scaron;ina iznosi 182 m2.&nbsp;U prizemlju se jo&scaron; nalazi mini bar sa odvojenim ulazom i dvije spreme takoðer sa odvojenim ulazom.&nbsp;Obe eta¾e imaju vanjske i unutarnje stepenice stoga postoji moguænost odvajanja 2 apartmana.</p>', '<p>We have this attractively decorated and renovated house in a good village location close to the sea. The house was renovated 8 years ago and has been very well looked after sois still in excellent condition.&nbsp;It is to be sold fully furnished and ready for immediate use.&nbsp;Land area is 409 m2 and the total area of living space inside is 182 m2.&nbsp;</p>', '', '<p>Simpatièno ureðena i renovirana kuæa na otoku Èiovu u blizini mora i prekrasne uvale.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Smje&scaron;tena je na jednom od popularnijih otoka zbog povezanosti sa kopnom i blizine aerodroma.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Renovirana je prije 8 godina i jo&scaron; uvijek je u izvrsnom stanju.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Prodaje se sa svim namje&scaron;tajem, klima ureðajem i centralnim grijanjem.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Povr&scaron;ina zemlji&scaron;ta je 409 m2, a ukupna brutto stambena povr&scaron;ina iznosi 182 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U prizemlju se nalazi dnevni boravak sa kuhinoj i blagovaonicom, hodnik, wc, sprema i terasa sa pogledom na ureðeni vrt gdje ima dovoljna mjesta za izgradnju bazena.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U prizemlju se jo&scaron; nalazi mini bar sa odvojenim ulazom i dvije spreme takoðer sa odvojenim ulazom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na 1.katu se nalazi hodnik, kupaonica, 3 spavaæe sobe i prostrana terasa sa djelomiènim pogledom na more.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Obe eta¾e imaju vanjske i unutarnje stepenice stoga postoji moguænost odvajanja 2 apartmana.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ispred kuæe se nalazi parking za 2 automobila.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Centar mjesta sa svim sadr¾ajima udaljen je 10 minuta pje&scaron;ke.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Stojimo na usluzi za sve dodatne informacije.</p>', '<p>We have this attractively decorated and renovated house in a good village location close to the sea.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is located on Ciovo, one of the most popular islands, and connected to the mainland by a bridge which makes it very convenient for visitors.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The airport is only 15 minutes driving away which is another big plus point.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house was renovated 8 years ago and has been very well looked after sois still in excellent condition.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is to be sold fully furnished and ready for immediate use.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Land area is 409 m2 and the total area of living space inside is 182 m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The ground floor has an open plan family living, kitchen and dining room, hallway, bathroom, storage room and terrace overlooking the landscaped garden where there is enough space for a patio and even a swimming pool.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The ground floor is designed with a mini-bar and has a separate entrance and it includes two storage rooms that also have external and separate entrance.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the 1st floor is a hallway, leading to a bathroom, three bedrooms and aspacious terrace with a partial sea view.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Both floors have outdoor and indoor stairs, therefore, there is the possibility of separating the property into 2 apartments.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house has private parking for 2 cars.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The centre of the village has shops, bakery, bars and cafes plus other facilities, and is just 10-minute walk.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>We are happy to assist with further information if you contact one of the agents.</p>', '', '1525_House-Villa_0.jpg', '1525_House-Villa_1.jpg', '1525_House-Villa_2.jpg', '1525_House-Villa_3.jpg', '1525_House-Villa_4.jpg', '1525_House-Villa_5.jpg', '1525_House-Villa_6.jpg', '1525_House-Villa_7.jpg', '1525_House-Villa_8.jpg');
INSERT INTO `nekretnina` (`id`, `ime`, `prezime`, `telefon`, `mobitel`, `e_mail`, `lokacija_id`, `adresa`, `status_id`, `vrsta_id`, `udaljenost`, `povrsina`, `stambenapovrsina`, `display`, `cijena`, `cijenatocka`, `ponuda_tjedna`, `new_built`, `must_sell`, `prvi_red_do_mora`, `pogled_na_more`, `bazen`, `broj_soba`, `broj_kupatila`, `datum`, `title_hr`, `title_en`, `title_ge`, `opis_hr`, `opis_en`, `opis_ge`, `PropertyImageURL0`, `PropertyImageURL1`, `PropertyImageURL2`, `PropertyImageURL3`, `PropertyImageURL4`, `PropertyImageURL5`, `PropertyImageURL6`, `PropertyImageURL7`, `PropertyImageURL8`) VALUES
(1527, 'Dürgõ', 'Balazs', '+3620 921 1442', '', 'durgob95@gmail.com', 'Brac', 'Kalafata 7 Sutivan, 2080/12, zu 3444, KO Sutivan', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '300', '0', '61', 1, '149000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 2, 1, 'January 7, 2016', '<p>Atraktivan stan u prizemlju s pogledom na more. Mirna lokacija i velika terasa.&nbsp;Stan u prizemlju, 60 m2, ureðen te spreman za useljenje na mirnoj lokaciji i sa predivnim pogledom na more.&nbsp;Sastoji se od dvije spavaæe sobe, kupaonice te otvorenog dnevnog boravka, kuhinje te blagovaonice. Stan ima terasu od 62 m2 koja se proteze sa tri strane stana.</p>', '<p>Attractive ground floor apartment with sea view. Quiet location and big terrace.&nbsp;Ground floor apartment, 60 m2, finished and ready to move in, in a quiet location and with beautiful sea view.&nbsp;It consists of two bedrooms, bathroom and open plan kitchen, dining and living room. The apartment has a terrace of 62 m2 that is spread on three sides of the apartment.&nbsp;</p>', '', '<p>Atraktivan stan u prizemlju s pogledom na more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Mirna lokacija i velika terasa.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Stan u prizemlju, 60 m2, ureðen te spreman za useljenje na mirnoj lokaciji i sa predivnim pogledom na more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sastoji se od dvije spavaæe sobe, kupaonice te otvorenog dnevnog boravka, kuhinje te blagovaonice.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Stan ima terasu od 62 m2 koja se proteze sa tri strane stana.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Namje&scaron;taj je ukljuèen u cijenu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nalazi se u blizini pla¾e i u mirnom je okru¾enju, 15-tak miuta hoda od centra mjesta.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Jedinstvena prilika za kupnju stana u prizemlju sa velikom terasom te otvorenim pogledom na more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za dodatne informacije molimo kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured u Splitu.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>Attractive ground floor apartment with sea view.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Quiet location and big terrace.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ground floor apartment, 60 m2, finished and ready to move in, in a quiet location and with beautiful sea view.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It consists of two bedrooms, bathroom and open plan kitchen, dining and living room.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The apartment has a terrace of 62 m2 that is spread on three sides of the apartment.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Furniture included in the price.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is close to the beach and in quiet surroundings; 15 minutes walk to the town center.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Unique opportunity to buy a ground floor apartment that has a big terrace and open sea view.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For further information please contact our office in Split.&nbsp;</p>', '', '1527_Apartment_0.jpg', '1527_Apartment_1.jpg', '1527_Apartment_2.jpg', '1527_Apartment_3.jpg', '1527_Apartment_4.jpg', '1527_Apartment_5.jpg', '1527_Apartment_6.jpg', '1527_Apartment_7.jpg', '1527_Apartment_8.jpg'),
(1528, 'Maja Grudiæ', 'I OSTALI', '051 644 966  043 244 646', '095 9044182', 'Nino.grudic@gmail.com', 'Trogir', 'Ul. Kralja Zvonimira  Okrug Donji, 2260/103', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '10', '319', '125', 1, '250000', '', 2, 2, 2, 1, 1, 2, 2, 2, 'January 7, 2016', '<p>Izuzetna prilika za ulaganje u nekretninu u 1.redu do mora i ureðene prirodno kamenite pla¾e.&nbsp;Kuæa je smje&scaron;tena na otoku Èiovu, jugozapadne orijentacije. Radi se o dvojnoj kuæi, ali sa dovoljno zemlji&scaron;ta i stambene povr&scaron;ine.&nbsp;Potrebno je renoviranje, ali ako uzmemo u obzir potencijal i cijenu, svakako je jedna od povoljnijih ponuda na tr¾i&scaron;tu.&nbsp;Ukupna povr&scaron;ina zemlji&scaron;ta iznosi 319 m2, dok je stambena 125 m2 + manji podrum u suterenu.</p>', '<p>We are offering this property &ndash; needing renovation - as a great opportunity to purchase a sea shore property at a very modest price. The house is located on the island of Ciovo, with a south-west orientation. Within walking distance are popular beach bars, shops, cafes and other services such as bakery and pharma. It is a semi-detached house, but built with enough land around and plenty of living space. The house needs renovation, but if we take into account the potential and the price, it is certainly one of the best value we have in this area of the market.&nbsp;</p>', '', '<p>Izuzetna prilika za ulaganje u nekretninu u 1.redu do mora i ureðene prirodno kamenite pla¾e.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je smje&scaron;tena na otoku Èiovu, jugozapadne orijentacije.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Radi se o dvojnoj kuæi, ali sa dovoljno zemlji&scaron;ta i stambene povr&scaron;ine.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Potrebno je renoviranje, ali ako uzmemo u obzir potencijal i cijenu, svakako je jedna od povoljnijih ponuda na tr¾i&scaron;tu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ukupna povr&scaron;ina zemlji&scaron;ta iznosi 319 m2, dok je stambena 125 m2 + manji podrum u suterenu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sa sjeverne strane kuæe se nalazi parking za 2 automobila. Velika je prednost moguænost direktnog pristupa automobilom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa se sastoji od suterena (podruma), prizemlja, 1. i 2. kata.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U prizemlju je jedna velika prostorija sa kuhinjom, kupaonica i terasa.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na 1.katu se nalazi hodnik, 2 spavaæe sobe, kuhinja sa blagovaonicom i balkon s pogledom na more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>2.kat je u roh bau fazi.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Va¾no je napomenuti da su sve 3 eta¾e odvojene sa vanjskim ulazima, te se mogu koristiti kao 3 odvojena apartmana.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Naravno, prilikom renoviranja moguæe je izgraditi i unutarnje stepenice.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Dvori&scaron;te koji se prote¾e do samog mora, ima dovoljno mjesta za kultivirani vrt i bazen.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Grad Trogir udaljen je 10 min. vo¾nje, a meðunarodni aerodrom 15 min.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Prednost je i blizina Splita, glavnog grada Dalmacije, ali i popularnog turistièkog sredi&scaron;ta.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ostajemo na usluzi za sva dodatna pitanja.</p>', '<p>We are offering this property &ndash; needing renovation - as a great opportunity to purchase a sea shore property at a very modest &nbsp;price.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house is located on the island of Ciovo, with a south-west orientation.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Within walking distance are popular beach bars, shops, cafes and other services such as bakery and pharma.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is a semi-detached house, but built with enough land around and plenty of living space.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house needs renovation, but if we take into account the potential and the price, it is certainly one of the best value we have in this area of the market.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>We expect prices in the area generally to improve once the access improvements which have started &ndash; including new roads and the bridge to the mainland are finished this summer.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The total land area is 319 m2, while the housing 125 m2 + a small cellar in the basement.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the north side of the house is private parking for 2 cars with direct access from the road.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house consists of a basement, ground floor, 1st and 2nd floor.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the ground floor is one large room with kitchen, bathroom and terrace with stunning sea views.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the 1st floor is a hallway, two bedrooms, kitchen, dining room and balcony overlooking the sea.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>2nd floor is still &nbsp;in the unfinished stage.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>All three floors are with separate exterior entrances, and can be used as 3 separate apartments.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Of course it is possible to build &nbsp;interior stairs.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The garden, which stretches down to the sea, has enough room for landscaping into a major feature, or for a sun patio and swimming pool.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The town of Trogir is 10 min. drive and the international airport 15 min.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The larger City of Split is 40 minutes from here, and from here is access to all other islands from the ferry terminal.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact our agents in Split for more information.</p>', '', '1528_House-Villa_0.jpg', '1528_House-Villa_1.jpg', '1528_House-Villa_2.jpg', '1528_House-Villa_3.jpg', '1528_House-Villa_4.jpg', '1528_House-Villa_5.jpg', '1528_House-Villa_6.jpg', '1528_House-Villa_7.jpg', '1528_House-Villa_8.jpg'),
(1529, 'Mijo', 'Èuljak', '', '095 907 3010', '', 'Trogir', 'Planikovica Okrug Gornji, 1555/11', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '170', '0', '125', 1, '280000', '', 2, 1, 2, 2, 1, 1, 3, 3, 'January 7, 2016', '<p>Luksuzni apartmani u novogradnji sa prekrasnim pogledom na more u blizini &scaron;ljunèane pla¾e.&nbsp;Zgrada je zanimljiva zbog modernog dizajna, ali i mnogobrojnih prozora koji osiguravaju prozraènost i osunèanost.&nbsp;Zgrada se sastoji od prizemlja, 1. kata, 2.kata i krovne terase. Preostala dva apartmana se prostiru preko 1. i 2. kata, dok svakom pripada po jedna krovna terasa.</p>', '<p>We are offering a selection of newly built luxury apartments with a beautiful view of the sea, the bay and nearby beaches. The building is interesting because of its modern design, with a large open plan living area which makes full use of the many windows to provide excellent views in all directions and also ventilation and natural light. The location ensures the views cannot be obstructed by new development, as it is high up on sloping land.</p>', '', '<p>Luksuzni apartmani u novogradnji sa prekrasnim pogledom na more u blizini &scaron;ljunèane pla¾e.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Zgrada je zanimljiva zbog modernog dizajna, ali i mnogobrojnih prozora koji osiguravaju prozraènost i osunèanost.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Pogled nije moguæe zakloniti zbog uzvi&scaron;enog polo¾aja zgrade, &scaron;to je jo&scaron; jedna prednost apartmana.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Smje&scaron;tena je na otoku Èiovu u blizini mnogih trgovina, restorana, barova i ostalih sadr¾aja.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&Scaron;ljunèana pla¾a je udaljena cca. 170 m, dok je u blizini netaknuta &scaron;uma i prirodno kamenita pla¾a.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Do meðunarodnog aerodroma je potrebno 15 min. vo¾nje. Grad Split je udaljen 40 min.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Zgrada se sastoji od prizemlja, 1. kata, 2.kata i krovne terase.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Preostala dva apartmana se prostiru preko 1. i 2. kata, dok svakom pripada po jedna krovna terasa</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U cijenu je ukljuèeno i jedno parking mjesto, a bazen je zajednièki.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>APARTMAN 2: 120 m2 + krovna terasa 38 m2 &ndash; 280.000 &euro;</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>APARTMAN 3: 125 m2 + krovna terasa 42 m2 &ndash; 280.000 &euro;&nbsp;</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ukoliko ¾elite tlocrte i dodatne fotografije, stojimo Vam na raspolaganju.</p>', '<p>We are offering a selection of newly built luxury apartments with a beautiful view of the sea, the bay and nearby beaches.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The building is interesting because of its modern design, with a large open plan living area which makes full use of the many windows to provide excellent views in all directions and also ventilation and natural light.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The location ensures the views cannot be obstructed by new development, as it is high up on sloping land.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is situated close to the pebble beach - approx. 170 m, while also in the vicinity, behind the property, is natural forest.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The area is hugely popular with tourists and they are well catered for with beach bars, cafes, restaurants and useful shops and services such as pharma and bakery.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The international airport is just 15 min. driving, the nearest larger town is Trogir, a massive attraction for tourists and the larger city of Split is 40 min, and here is the ferry terminal for access to all the major islands along the Dalmation coast.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The building consists of ground floor, 1st floor, 2nd floor and roof terrace.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The other two suites are spread over the first and second floor, and both have access and shared use of the roof terrace.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Included in the price is 1 private parking place, a communal swimming pool in the patio area which is shared with the other residents.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>APARTMENT 2: 120 m2 + roof terrace 38 m2 - 280.000 &euro;</strong></p>\r\n<p><strong><br /></strong></p>\r\n<p><strong>APARTMENT 3: 125 m2 + roof terrace 42 m2 - 280.000 &euro;</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>We have floor plans and additional information and photographs, so please contact our agents in the Split office.&nbsp;</p>', '', '1529_Apartment_0.jpg', '1529_Apartment_1.jpg', '1529_Apartment_2.jpg', '1529_Apartment_3.jpg', '1529_Apartment_4.JPG', '1529_Apartment_5.JPG', '1529_Apartment_6.JPG', '1529_Apartment_7.jpg', '1529_Apartment_8.jpg'),
(1530, 'Dragan', 'Martinoviæ', '095 8010 663 ', 'Sandra Marinkovic &#8211; 092 246 9551', 'sandramarinkovic2411@gmail.com', 'Trogir', 'Trogirska  Slatine, k.c. 1491/3, 1491/1 ZEM 970, ZEM 971/1', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '30', '792', '106', 2, '199000', '', 2, 2, 2, 1, 1, 2, 0, 0, 'January 7, 2016', '<p>Kuæa prvi red uz more, smje&scaron;tena na prostranom zemlji&scaron;tu sa mnogim moguænostima i turistièkim potencijalom. Kuæa je smje&scaron;tena na zemlji&scaron;tu povr&scaron;ine 792 m2 gdje je moguæa izgradnja bazena i ureðenje prekrasnog vrta sa mnogim sadr¾ajima. More i &scaron;ljunèana pla¾a su udaljeni 30 m od kuæe. Ukupna stambena povr&scaron;ina iznosi 106 m2 (kuæa 66 m2 + 2 terase 24 m2 + 16 m2).</p>', '<p>We are pleased to offer this sea shore house needing renovation - on a large plot. The plot measures nearly 800m sq, which is enough space to make substantial extensions to the original house, or incorporate boat storage or a patio and swimming pool - or all of these!&nbsp;The house has a total area of 106 m2 (house 66 m2 + 2 terraces of 24 m2 + 16 m2). The biggest advantage is the large terrace at the front of the house, on the 1st floor, with a stunning view of the sea.</p>', '', '<p>Kuæa prvi red uz more, smje&scaron;tena na prostranom zemlji&scaron;tu sa mnogim moguænostima i turistièkim potencijalom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nalazi se na otoku Èiovu koji je povezan mostom sa gradom Trogirom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U izgradnji je jo&scaron; jedan most sa èijim æe zavr&scaron;etkom Èiovo biti jo&scaron; popularnije.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je smje&scaron;tena na zemlji&scaron;tu povr&scaron;ine 792 m2 gdje je moguæa izgradnja bazena i ureðenje prekrasnog vrta.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>More i &scaron;ljunèana pla¾a su udaljeni 30 m od kuæe.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ukupna stambena povr&scaron;ina iznosi 106 m2 (kuæa 66 m2 + 2 terase 24 m2 + 16 m2).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæi je potrebno renoviranje, te postoji moguænost pro&scaron;irenja, ali je i u sada&scaron;njem stanju jako zanimljivog izgleda.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Najveæa prednost je prostrana terasa na 1.katu s koje se pru¾a pogled na more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa se sastoji od prizemlja i 1.kata sa odvojenim vanjskim ulazima.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U dvori&scaron;tu je gara¾a, &scaron;to je jo&scaron; jedna prednost nekretnine.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nekretnine odmah uz more su najtra¾enije i cca. 30 &ndash; 40 % skuplje od ostalih, stoga vjerujemo da æete prepoznati ovu izuzetnu priliku i povoljnu cijenu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Osim blizine Trogira, meðunarodni aerodrom je takoðer svega 10-15 min. vo¾nje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za sve ostale detalje stojimo na raspolaganju.</p>', '<p>We are pleased to offer this sea shore house needing renovation - on a large plot.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>This detached house is situated with the sea at the bottom of the garden on Ciovo island.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>This island is connected to the mainland by a bridge (a second bridge is being built which will reduce congestion in peak periods considerably), but is also on a regular ''foot ferry'' route between Trogir and Split.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The village has shops, bars and family cafes and restaurants, mostly around the historic harbour - walking distance from the house.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The plot measures nearly 800m sq, which is enough space to make substantial extensions to the original house, or incorporate boat storage or a patio and swimming pool - or all of these!&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house has a total area of 106 m2 (house 66 m2 + 2 terraces of 24 m2 + 16 m2).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house needs renovation but we expect Ciovo, with the new access roads/bridge to become more sought after and prices to increase, making this a good choice for investors.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The biggest advantage is the large terrace at the front of the house, on the 1st floor, with a stunning view of the sea.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house consists of ground floor and 1st floor that has a separate outside entrance.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There is a garage, and plenty of space for parking on the plot, which is another benefit of the property.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The village is 10 minutes drive from the World Heritage site of Trogir, the tourist magnet and centre of historic and cultural activities, which can also be reached by using the charming foot ferry.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The airport is 20 minutes drive from the property.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For all other details please contact our Split office.</p>', '', '1530_House-Villa_0.jpg', '1530_House-Villa_1.JPG', '1530_House-Villa_2.JPG', '1530_House-Villa_3.JPG', '1530_House-Villa_4.JPG', '1530_House-Villa_5.jpg', '1530_House-Villa_6.jpg', '1530_House-Villa_7.JPG', '1530_House-Villa_8.JPG'),
(1550, 'Alen', 'Dalmatis', '', '', '', 'Zadar', 'Vi¹njik Zadar', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '0', '0', '55', 2, '122000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 1, 'January 28, 2016', '<p>Jednosoban, namje&scaron;ten stan sa balkonskom terasom s pogledom na stari grad.&nbsp;Komforan stan povr&scaron;ine &nbsp;54,50 m2, orijentacije istok-zapad, udaljen od starog grada svega 10 minuta hoda.&nbsp;Stan se sastoji od kuhinje sa blagavaonicom, dnevnog boravka, velike spavaæe sobe sa balkonom, kupaonice sa wc-om, hodnika, te balkonske terase.&nbsp;Stanu pripada ostava u podrumu i vanjsko parking mjesto.</p>', '<p>We are offering this spacious and stylish one bedroom, furnished apartment with a balcony terrace overlooking the old town. It is situated just 10 minutes walk from the bustling centre of the town, near the historic preserved area and the vibrant harbour area where there are many cafes, bars and restaurants.&nbsp;It is well designed inside, measuring 54,50 m2, and facing east-west, witha fabulous balcony, wide enough for all the family and alfresco dining. It is well appointed with good quality fittings and is well decorated.&nbsp;</p>', '', '<p>Jednosoban, namje&scaron;ten stan sa balkonskom terasom s pogledom na stari grad.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Komforan stan povr&scaron;ine &nbsp;54,50 m2, orijentacije istok-zapad, udaljen od starog grada svega 10 minuta hoda.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Stan se sastoji od kuhinje sa blagavaonicom, dnevnog boravka, velike spavaæe sobe sa balkonom, kupaonice sa wc-om, hodnika, te balkonske terase.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Stanu pripada ostava u podrumu i vanjsko parking mjesto.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za sve dodatne informacije molimo kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured u Splitu.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>We are offering this spacious and stylish one bedroom, furnished apartment with a balcony terrace overlooking the old town.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is situated just 10 minutes walk from the bustling centre of the town, near the historic preserved area and the vibrant harbour area where there are many cafes, bars and restaurants.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is well designed inside, measuring 54,50 m2, and facing east-west, with a fabulous balcony, wide enough for all the family and alfresco dining.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It consists of a kitchen, dining room, living room, all in an open plan design, a large bedroom with balcony, bathroom with toilet, hallway, and terrace.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is well appointed with good quality fittings and is well decorated.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It comes with the furniture, so is ready for immediate habitation.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The apartment has storage in the basement and a private parking place.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Zadar has been Nominated for Best European Destination 2016, and has become very popular with tourists visiting Croatia:</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>http://www.europeanbestdestinations.com/best-of-europe/european-best-destinations-2016/&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For further information please contact our office.&nbsp;</p>', '', '1550_Apartment_0.jpg', '1550_Apartment_1.jpg', '1550_Apartment_2.jpg', '1550_Apartment_3.jpg', '1550_Apartment_4.jpg', '1550_Apartment_5.jpg', '1550_Apartment_6.jpg', '1550_Apartment_7.jpg', '1550_Apartment_8.jpg'),
(1531, 'Ivan ', 'Urliæ', 'Ante Urliæ, 091 264 3770', '', 'aurlic@inet.hr', 'Makarska', 'Podaca, 1600/4, 1600/5 k.o. podaca', 'For sale', 'Land plot', '100', '645', '0', 1, '90000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 0, 0, 'January 7, 2016', '<p>Na prodaju nudimo zemlji&scaron;te (645 m2) smje&scaron;teno unutar izgraðenog graðevinskog poduèja naselja, u malom mjestu ca. 34 km ju¾no od Makarske.&nbsp;Teren je strm, pa to osigurava lijepi pogled na more. Zemlji&scaron;te se nalati neposredno ispod magistralne ceste te na nju ima direktan pristup.&nbsp;<br /><br /></p>', '<p>For sale we have this plot (645m sq) located within the building zone, in a small coastal place ca. 34 km south of Makarska.&nbsp;The land is steep which ensures good sea views. It is located just beneath the main coastal road, with direct access to it.&nbsp;For further information please contact our office in Split.&nbsp;</p>', '', '<p>Na prodaju nudimo zemlji&scaron;te (645 m2) smje&scaron;teno unutar izgraðenog graðevinskog poduèja naselja, u malom mjestu ca. 34 km ju¾no od Makarske.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Teren je strm, pa to osigurava lijepi pogled na more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Zemlji&scaron;te se nalazi neposredno ispod magistralne ceste te na nju ima direktan pristup.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za dodatne informacije molimo kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured u Splitu.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>For sale we have this plot (645m sq) located within the building zone, in a small coastal place ca. 34 km south of Makarska.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The land is steep which ensures good sea views.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is located just beneath the main coastal road, with direct access to it.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For further information please contact our office in Split.&nbsp;</p>', '', '1531_Land-plot_0.jpg', '1531_Land-plot_1.jpg', '1531_Land-plot_2.jpg', '1531_Land-plot_3.jpg', '', '', '', '', ''),
(1532, 'Jan', 'Enqvist', '', '+358 40 7150145', 'jan.enqvist@mobilisti.fi', 'Brac', 'Sutivan, 974 k.o. sutivan', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '100', '0', '58', 1, '115000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 2, 1, 'January 7, 2016', '<p>Croatia Property Sales nudi apartman u malom mjestu na otoku Braèu, smje&scaron;ten u prizemlju stambene zgrade pored gradskog parka.&nbsp;Nekretnina granièi sa negraðevnom (zelenom) zonom, ispred koje se nalazi pla¾a, udaljena svega 100 metara od nekretnine. Kroz park se pru¾a djelomièni pogled na more.</p>', '<p>Croatia Property Sales is offering this lovely ground floor apartment, located next to the beach and communal park in a small town on Brac island.&nbsp;The property faces non-building zone (recreational area) and it''s only 100 meters from the beach, featuring partial sea views through the park.</p>', '', '<p>Croatia Property Sales nudi apartman u malom mjestu na otoku Braèu, smje&scaron;ten u prizemlju stambene zgrade pored gradskog parka.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nekretnina granièi sa negraðevnom (zelenom) zonom, ispred koje se nalazi pla¾a, udaljena svega 100 metara od nekretnine.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kroz park se pru¾a djelomièni pogled na more.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartman je u dobrom stanju i sastoji se od hodnika, otvorenog prostora dnevnog boravka i kuhinje, dvije spavaæe sobe te kupaonice i prostrane terase.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartman je u cijelosti namje&scaron;ten i spreman za uporabu.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Molimo kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured za vi&scaron;e informacija.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>Croatia Property Sales is offering this lovely ground floor apartment, located next to the beach and communal park in a small town on Brac island.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property faces non-building zone (recreational area) and it''s only 100 meters from the beach, featuring partial sea views through the park.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartment itself is in good condition and contains hall, open-plan living area with kitchen, 2 bedrooms, bathroom and large terrace.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property is fully furnished and ready for immediate occupany.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact our office fore more details.&nbsp;</p>', '', '1532_Apartment_0.jpg', '1532_Apartment_1.jpg', '1532_Apartment_2.jpg', '1532_Apartment_3.jpg', '1532_Apartment_4.jpg', '1532_Apartment_5.jpg', '1532_Apartment_6.jpg', '1532_Apartment_7.jpg', '1532_Apartment_8.jpg'),
(1533, 'Kristijana', 'Pavliæ Dinoti d.o.o.', '040 823 004', '099 4242642', 'viledinoti@gmail.com', 'Brac', '©krip, Braè, 434/2 k.o. ¹krip', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '3000', '440', '135', 1, '480000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 1, 3, 3, 'January 7, 2016', '<p>U prodaji imamo ovu lijepu vilu smje&scaron;tenu u &scaron;armatnom malom mjestu u unutra&scaron;njosti otoka Braèa.&nbsp;Kuæa ima 135 m2 unutarnjeg prostora rasporeðenog na 2 eta¾e, kao i 100 m2 terase te bazen povr&scaron;ine 35 m2.&nbsp;Lijepo ureðeni vrt okru¾uje objekt, a u dvori&scaron;tu se nalaze i 2 natkrivena parkirali&scaron;na mjesta.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>We have this lovely villa for sale, located in a charming inland village on Brac island. Although recently built, the house kept traditional appearance for being covered in stone from the outside.&nbsp;The house has 135 sqm spread on two floor, as well as 100 swm of the terraces and 35 sqm pool.&nbsp;Landscaped garden surrounds the property and there are 2 covered parking places.&nbsp;</p>', '', '<p>U prodaji imamo ovu lijepu vilu smje&scaron;tenu u &scaron;armatnom malom mjestu u unutra&scaron;njosti otoka Braèa.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa ima 135 m2 unutarnjeg prostora rasporeðenog na 2 eta¾e, kao i 100 m2 terase te bazen povr&scaron;ine 35 m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U prizemlju se nalazi kuhinja, blagovaonica, dnevna soba, spavaæa soba sa kupaonicom te zaseban wc.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na katu su smje&scaron;tene 2 spavaæe sobe, 2 kupaonice te terasa.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Lijepo ureðeni vrt okru¾uje objekt, a u dvori&scaron;tu se nalaze i 2 natkrivena parkirali&scaron;na mjesta.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za sve dodatne informacije molimo kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured u Splitu.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>We have this lovely villa for sale, located in a charming inland village on Brac island.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Although recently built, the house kept traditional appearance for being covered in stone from the outside.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house has 135 sqm spread on two floor, as well as 100 swm of the terraces and 35 sqm pool.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ground floor contains kitchen, dining room, living room, en-suite bedroom and toilet.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the first floor there are 2 bedrooms, 2 bathrooms and the terrace.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Landscaped garden surrounds the property and there are 2 covered parking places.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For furher information please contact our office in Split.&nbsp;</p>', '', '1533_House-Villa_0.jpg', '1533_House-Villa_1.jpg', '1533_House-Villa_2.jpg', '1533_House-Villa_3.jpg', '1533_House-Villa_4.jpg', '1533_House-Villa_5.jpg', '1533_House-Villa_6.jpg', '1533_House-Villa_7.jpg', ''),
(1535, 'Nik¹a ', 'Sirotkoviæ', '', '091/5239991', 'Niksa.sirotkovic@gmail.com', 'Split', 'Put Sv. Mande 20 Split, Marjan', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '300', '0', '31', 2, '110000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 1, 'January 11, 2016', '<p>Atraktivan jednosoban apartman na izvrsnoj lokaciji.&nbsp;Apartman je smje&scaron;ten u prizemlju samostojeæe zgrade koja se sastoji od 2 kata i potkrovlja.&nbsp;Apartman je kompletno renoviran 2011. god., s novom instalacijom struje i vode te novim namje&scaron;tajem.&nbsp;Trenutno slu¾i za turistièko iznajmljivanje uz godi&scaron;nju zaradu od preko 10 000 eura.&nbsp;Parking moguæ na ulici pokraj objekta.&nbsp;Stan je u vlasni&scaron;tvu 1/1, bez ikakvog tereta.</p>', '<p>We have this attractive one bedroom apartment in an excellent location. The apartment is located on the ground floor of a detached building which consists of two floors. It is situated in one of the most attractive area of town, walking distance to the old town, Riva and Palace and the Marjan hill.&nbsp;The apartment was completely renovated in 2011, with a new electricity, water and sewage connections, and new furniture.&nbsp;It is currently being used to rent to summer tourists with annual sales of more than 10 000 euros.</p>', '', '<p><strong>Atraktivan jednosoban apartman na izvrsnoj lokaciji</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartman je smje&scaron;ten u prizemlju samostojeæe zgrade koja se sastoji od 2 kata i potkrovlja.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ima odvojen ulaz, a sastoji se od dnevnog boravka s kuhinjom i blagavaonicom, jedne spavaæe sobe i kupaonice.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartman je kompletno renoviran 2011. god., s novom instalacijom struje, vode i kanalizacije te novim namje&scaron;tajem.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Trenutno slu¾i za turistièko iznajmljivanje uz godi&scaron;nju zaradu od preko 10 000 eura.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Parking moguæ na ulici pokraj objekta.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Stan je u vlasni&scaron;tvu 1/1, bez ikakvog tereta.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za dodatne informacije molimo kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured u Splitu.</p>', '<p>We have this attractive one bedroom apartment in an excellent location.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The apartment is located on the ground floor of a detached building which consists of two floors.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is situated in one of the most attractive area of town, walking distance to the old town, Riva and Palace and the Marjan hill.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is close to all the historic and cultural attractions of the city as well as the park and swimming beaches adjacent to it.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property has a separate entrance, and consists of a living room with kitchen and dining room, a bedroom and a bathroom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The apartment was completely renovated in 2011, with a new electricity, water and sewage, connections, and new furniture.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is currently being used to rent to summer tourists with annual sales of more than 10 000 euros.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Parking is available on the street above the building.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For further information, please contact our office in Split.</p>', '', '1535_Apartment_0.jpg', '1535_Apartment_1.jpg', '1535_Apartment_2.jpg', '1535_Apartment_3.jpg', '1535_Apartment_4.jpg', '1535_Apartment_5.jpg', '1535_Apartment_6.jpg', '', ''),
(1536, 'Mijo ', 'Èuljak', '', '095 907 3010', '', 'Trogir', 'Liveli/Mavar¹tica Okrug Gornji, 836/1 okrug', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '240', '600', '0', 1, '850000', '', 2, 1, 2, 2, 1, 1, 0, 0, 'January 11, 2016', '<p>Luksuzne vile u izgradnji na otoku Èiovu na ju¾noj strani u uvali idealnoj za odmor i u¾ivanje.&nbsp;S obzirom na uzvi&scaron;eni polo¾aj i kaskadnu gradnju iz svih vila se pru¾a prekrasan pogled na more i uvalu.&nbsp;Ima ukupno 6 vila od kojih je svaka smje&scaron;tena na prostranom zemlji&scaron;tu od cca. 500 &ndash; 600 m2. Ukupna brutto stambena povr&scaron;ina je od 320 m2 &ndash; 345 m2.&nbsp;Osim modernog izgleda i kvalitetne gradnja svaka vila posjeduje gara¾u, bazen, saunu, wellnes, fitness i ostale prostorije. Okuænica je ureðena i kultivirana.</p>', '<p>We are offering a selection of ''off plan'' luxury villas, to be built on the south side of the island of Ciovo in a superb location. Due to the elevated position and the cascade construction of all the villas it offers a breathtaking view of the sea and the bay.&nbsp;There are a total of 6 villas, each situated on a large plot of approx. 500 - 600 m2. The total gross living area of 320 m2 - 345 m2.&nbsp;In addition to stylish looks and high quality materials used in the construction of each villa, they have a private garage, swimming pool, sauna, wellness, fitness and other facilities.</p>', '', '<p>Luksuzne vile u izgradnji na otoku Èiovu na ju¾noj strani u uvali idealnoj za odmor i u¾ivanje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ovo je izuzetna prilika za ulaganje u modernu vilu na popularnom otoku koji se nalazi u blizini aerodroma i povijesnih gradova Trogira i Splita.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Povezan je mostom sa gradom Trogirom, ali je u izgradnji jo&scaron; jedan most koji æe znatno rasteretiti ljetne gu¾ve i osigurati jo&scaron; veæu popularnost otoka.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>S obzirom na uzvi&scaron;eni polo¾aj i kaskadnu gradnju iz svih vila se pru¾a prekrasan pogled na more i uvalu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ima ukupno 6 vila od kojih je svaka smje&scaron;tena na prostranom zemlji&scaron;tu od cca. 500 &ndash; 600 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ukupna brutto stambena povr&scaron;ina je od 320 m2 &ndash; 345 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Osim modernog izgleda i kvalitetne gradnja svaka vila posjeduje gara¾u, bazen, saunu, wellnes, fitness i ostale prostorije.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Okuænica je ureðena i kultivirana.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>***Sve dodatne tlocte i detalje &scaron;aljemo na zahtjev.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Udaljenost od mora i kamenite pla¾e je cca. 240 m, dok se na otoku nalaze i &scaron;ljunèane pla¾e.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Centar mjesta sa svim potrebnim sadr¾ajima je udaljen cca. 3 minute vo¾nje od vila.</p>\r\n<p><strong><br /></strong></p>\r\n<p><strong>VILA &nbsp;4 &ndash; 850.000 &euro;</strong></p>\r\n<p><strong><br /></strong></p>\r\n<p><strong>VILA &nbsp;1, 2, 3, 5 i 6 &ndash; 950.000 &euro;</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Stojimo na usluzi za sve dodatne informacije.</p>', '<p>We are offering a selection of ''off plan'' luxury villas, to be built on the south side of the island of Ciovo in a superb location.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>This is a great opportunity to invest in a modern villa on Croatia''s most popular island, located within easy reach of the international airport and the historic UNESCO cities of Trogir and Split.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It''s connection by bridge to the mainland and the city of Trogir which makes access easier but it retains the ''Island feel''.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Infrastructure improvements, including new access roads and a second bridge will significantly relieve the summer crowds and provide even greater popularity of the island.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Due to the elevated position and the cascade construction of all the villas it offers a breathtaking view of the sea and the bay.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There are a total of 6 villas, each situated on a large plot of approx. 500 - 600 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The total gross living area of 320 m2 - 345 m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>In addition to stylish looks and high quality materials used in the construction of each villa, they have a private garage, swimming pool, sauna, wellness, fitness and other facilities.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The courtyard/garden will be landscaped and cultivated.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Distance from the sea and beach is approx. 240 m.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The beaches are safe and the water completely clear, at this point.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The nearest village centre - with shops, cafes, bars and other services and attractions is located approx. 3 minutes drive from the villa, with the larger town of Trogir just 10 minutes.</p>\r\n<p><strong><br /></strong></p>\r\n<p><strong>VILA 4 &nbsp;- 850.000 &euro;</strong></p>\r\n<p><strong><br /></strong></p>\r\n<p><strong>VILLAS 1, 2, 3, 5, 6 - 950.000 &euro;&nbsp;</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For additional details or blueprints please contact one of our agents.</p>', '', '1536_House-Villa_0.jpg', '1536_House-Villa_1.jpg', '1536_House-Villa_2.jpg', '1536_House-Villa_3.jpg', '1536_House-Villa_4.jpg', '1536_House-Villa_5.jpg', '1536_House-Villa_6.jpg', '1536_House-Villa_7.jpg', '1536_House-Villa_8.jpg'),
(1537, 'Tonèi', 'Marinkoviæ', '01-374 5492 brat 021 635 308', '098 913 2632', 'toncimarinkovic7@gmail.com', 'Brac', 'Uz poljanu 11 Bol, k.c. 618 k.o. Bol', 'For sale', 'Old stone house', '110', '0', '110', 1, '185000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 3, 1, 'January 13, 2016', '<p>Stara kamena dvojna kuæa za potpunu renovaciju. Sastoji se od dvije eta¾e.&nbsp;U prizemlju se nalazi hodnik, kuhinja, kupaonica, jedna soba te odvojeno spremi&scaron;te koje se mo¾e prenamijeniti u stambeni prostor.&nbsp;Unutarnje stepeni&scaron;te vodi na prvi kat na kojem se nalaze tri spavaæe sobe, od kojih se iz jedne pru¾a pogled na more.&nbsp;Stambena povr&scaron;ina kuæe iznosi 110 m2.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>Old stone semi-detached house for complete renovation. The property spreads over two floors.&nbsp;On the ground floor there is a hallway, kitchen, bathroom, one room and separate storage that can be converted into the living area.&nbsp;Inner staris lead onto the first floor, containing 3 large bedrooms, one of which offers nice sea views.&nbsp;House has living area of 110m sq.&nbsp;</p>', '', '<p><strong>Stara kamena dvojna kuæa za potpunu renovaciju</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sastoji se od dvije eta¾e.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U prizemlju se nalazi hodnik, kuhinja, kupaonica, jedna soba te odvojeno spremi&scaron;te koje se mo¾e prenamijeniti u stambeni prostor.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Unutarnje stepeni&scaron;te vodi na prvi kat na kojem se nalaze tri spavaæe sobe, od kojih se iz jedne pru¾a pogled na more.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Stambena povr&scaron;ina kuæe iznosi 110 m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa ima dosta svjetla, ali nema terasu/balkon, veæ zajednièko dvori&scaron;te.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sa susjednim objektom spojena je sa stra¾nje strane.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za dodatne informacije molimo kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured u Splitu.&nbsp;</p>', '<p><strong>Old stone semi-detached house for complete renovation</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property spreads over two floors.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the ground floor there is a hallway, kitchen, bathroom, one room and separate storage that can be converted into the living area.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Inner staris lead onto the first floor, containing 3 large bedrooms, one of which offers nice sea views.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>House has living area of 110m sq.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house has plenty of sunlight, but dosn''t have balcony nor terrace, only a small communal garden.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is connected to the heighbouring property from the back side.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For further information please contact our office in Split.&nbsp;</p>', '', '1537_Old-stone-house_0.jpg', '1537_Old-stone-house_1.jpg', '1537_Old-stone-house_2.jpg', '1537_Old-stone-house_3.jpg', '1537_Old-stone-house_4.jpg', '1537_Old-stone-house_5.jpg', '1537_Old-stone-house_6.jpg', '1537_Old-stone-house_7.jpg', '1537_Old-stone-house_8.jpg'),
(1538, 'Land Overseas', 'Ian Casolani', '+356 9949 6159', 'vi¹e suvlasnika', 'ian.casolani@land-overseas.com', 'Brac', 'predio Dekleva  Sutivan, ZU 3340, 3441, 3442 k.o. Sutivan', 'For sale', 'Land plot', '330', '7555', '0', 1, '717725', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 0, 0, 'January 13, 2016', '<p>Graðevinsko zemlji&scaron;te za 95 EUR po m2.&nbsp;U prodaji imamo veliko graðevinsko zemlji&scaron;te na Braèu sa pogledom na braèki kanal sa sjeverne strane otoka.&nbsp;Nekretnina se nalazi unutar graðevinske zone, sa gotovim urbanistièkim planom ureðenja te je spremna za gradnju.&nbsp;Zemlji&scaron;te je udaljeno 330 metara od mora te manje od 15 minuta hoda do centra mjesta.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>Building land at only 95 EUR per m2.&nbsp;For sale we have this large building plot on Brac, facing the channel on the norther coast of the island.&nbsp;The property is located within the building zone with the urbanistic plan in force, therefore ready for immediate development.&nbsp;The land is only 330 m from the sea and less than 15 min walk from the center of the village.&nbsp;</p>', '', '<p><strong>Graðevinsko zemlji&scaron;te za 95 EUR po m2</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U prodaji imamo veliko graðevinsko zemlji&scaron;te na Braèu sa pogledom na braèki kanal sa sjeverne strane otoka.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nekretnina se nalazi unutar graðevinske zone, sa gotovim urbanistièkim planom ureðenja te je spremna za gradnju.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Tra¾ena cijena iznosi 95 EUR po m2, &scaron;to je dobra prilika za investitore koji tra¾e veæe parcele za gradnju apartmana ili obiteljskih kuæa.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Cijena je otvorena za razumne ponude.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Zemlji&scaron;te je udaljeno 330 metara od mora te manje od 15 minuta hoda do centra mjesta.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za vi&scaron;e informacija kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured.&nbsp;</p>', '<p><strong>Building land at only 95 EUR per m2</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For sale we have this large building plot on Brac, facing the channel on the norther coast of the island.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property is located within the building zone with the urbanistic plan in force, therefore ready for immediate development.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>At the asking price of 95 EUR per m2 this represent a great chance for the developers looking for substantial plots to construct apartments or family houses.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The price is open to reasonable offers.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The land is only 330 m from the sea and less than 15 min walk from the center of the village.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For sale is either the land or shares of the company owning it (no property transfer tax).&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact our office for more information.</p>', '', '1538_Land-plot_0.jpg', '1538_Land-plot_1.jpg', '1538_Land-plot_2.jpg', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(1539, 'Gavin', 'Emerson', '+44 (0) 7768 398444', '', 'gavinemerson1@icloud.com', 'Brac', 'Duboka 59  Milna, k.c. 986/3 k.o. milna', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '35', '2000', '0', 1, '99999999', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 1, 5, 4, 'January 14, 2016', '<p>Izvrsna vila na otoku Braèu.&nbsp;Ukoliko tra¾ite nekretninu daleko iznad tr¾i&scaron;nih standarda, ova nekretnina doista opisuje ugodnosti otoèkog ¾ivotnog stila.&nbsp;Zemlji&scaron;te ima 2.000 m2 a èini ga pa¾ljivo odr¾avani vrt koji se prostire kroz borovu &scaron;umu, dok stepenice sa zemlji&scaron;ta vode do kamene pla¾e.&nbsp;Vila ima 5 spavaæih soba, 4 kupaonice, izvrstan pogled na more, terase od braèkog kamena te bazen povr&scaron;ine 25 m2.</p>', '<p>Superb villa for sale on Brac island.&nbsp;If you are looking for the villa that is well beyond the market standards, this hidden gem trully represent the island retreat in every sence of the word.&nbsp;The property spreads over 2.000 sqm of landscaped gardens among the pine trees and stairs lead from the plot to the sundeck by the crystal clear sea.&nbsp;The property features 5 bedrooms, 4 bathrooms, amazing views, broad terraces, 24 sqm infinity pool.</p>', '', '<p><strong>Izvrsna vila na otoku Braèu</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ukoliko tra¾ite nekretninu daleko iznad tr¾i&scaron;nih standarda, ova nekretnina doista opisuje ugodnosti otoèkog ¾ivotnog stila.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Zemlji&scaron;te ima 2.000 m2 a èini ga pa¾ljivo odr¾avani vrt koji se prostire kroz borovu &scaron;umu, dok stepenice sa zemlji&scaron;ta vode do kamene pla¾e.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Vila ima 5 spavaæih soba, 4 kupaonice, izvrstan pogled na more, terase od braèkog kamena, bazen povr&scaron;ine 25 m2, stolni tenis, teren za badminton, bicikle, vrata od poda do stropa, velike prozore, vanjski ro&scaron;tilj sa prostorom za objedovanje, otvoren koncept dnevnog boravka i glavne spavaæe sobe sa direktnim izlazom na terase.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nekretnina se uspje&scaron;no iznajmljuje, stoga je se ne mo¾e uvijek pogledati, veæ je potrebna prethodna najava.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za vi&scaron;e informacija kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured. &nbsp;</p>', '<p><strong>Superb villa for sale on Brac island</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>If you are looking for the villa that is well beyond the market standards, this hidden gem trully represent the island retreat in every sence of the word.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property spreads over 2.000 sqm of landscaped gardens among the pine trees and stairs lead from the plot to the sundeck by the crystal clear sea.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property features 5 bedrooms, 4 bathrooms, amazing views, broad terraces, 24 sqm infinity pool, table tennis, badminton court and bicycles, floor to ceiling doors, large windows, al-fresco dining with BBQ area, open plan living room and master bedroom with direct access to terraces.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>This ''je ne sais quoi'' is successfully rented out, therefore it can be rarely seen and advanced request is advised.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For more information please contact our office.&nbsp;</p>', '', '1539_House-Villa_0.jpg', '1539_House-Villa_1.jpg', '1539_House-Villa_2.jpg', '1539_House-Villa_3.jpg', '1539_House-Villa_4.jpg', '1539_House-Villa_5.jpg', '1539_House-Villa_6.jpg', '1539_House-Villa_7.jpg', '1539_House-Villa_8.jpg');
INSERT INTO `nekretnina` (`id`, `ime`, `prezime`, `telefon`, `mobitel`, `e_mail`, `lokacija_id`, `adresa`, `status_id`, `vrsta_id`, `udaljenost`, `povrsina`, `stambenapovrsina`, `display`, `cijena`, `cijenatocka`, `ponuda_tjedna`, `new_built`, `must_sell`, `prvi_red_do_mora`, `pogled_na_more`, `bazen`, `broj_soba`, `broj_kupatila`, `datum`, `title_hr`, `title_en`, `title_ge`, `opis_hr`, `opis_en`, `opis_ge`, `PropertyImageURL0`, `PropertyImageURL1`, `PropertyImageURL2`, `PropertyImageURL3`, `PropertyImageURL4`, `PropertyImageURL5`, `PropertyImageURL6`, `PropertyImageURL7`, `PropertyImageURL8`) VALUES
(1540, 'Josip', 'Èaèiæ', '022 662 448', '095 513 7420', 'kninman@hotmail.com', 'Zadar', 'Kri¾anje ul. Podvornica i Put Ravnila, k.c. 8522/1 k.o. suko¹an', 'For sale', 'Land plot', '310', '860', '0', 1, '130000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 0, 0, 'January 14, 2016', '<p>Na prodaju nudimo graðevinsko zemlji&scaron;te povr&scaron;ine 860 m2 sa izlazom na javni put, u malom mjestu 12 km ju¾no od Zadra.&nbsp;Zemlji&scaron;te se nalazi u izgraðenom dijelu naselja. Infrastruktura je u neposrednoj blizini. Teren je ravan i pristupaèan za gradnju obiteljske kuæe ili manje stambene zgrade. Nema pogled na more. Do centra mjesta ima oko 500 metara, a do mora oko 300 metara.</p>', '<p>For sale we have this building plot of 860 sqm with access to public road, in a small village 12 km south of Zadar.&nbsp;The land is located in urbanized area with infrastructure present nearby. The land is flat and convenient for the development of either a family house or low-rise apartment building.&nbsp;There are no sea views, but the property is located only 500 meters from the center and 300 meters from the sea.&nbsp;</p>', '', '<p>Na prodaju nudimo graðevinsko zemlji&scaron;te povr&scaron;ine 860 m2 sa izlazom na javni put, u malom mjestu 12 km ju¾no od Zadra.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Zemlji&scaron;te se nalazi u izgraðenom dijelu naselja.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Infrastruktura je u neposrednoj blizini.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Teren je ravan i pristupaèan za gradnju obiteljske kuæe ili manje stambene zgrade.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nema pogled na more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Do centra mjesta ima oko 500 metara, a do mora oko 300 metara.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za dodatne informacije molimo kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured u Splitu.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>For sale we have this building plot of 860 sqm with access to public road, &nbsp;in a small village 12 km south of Zadar.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The land is located in urbanized area with infrastructure present nearby.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The land is flat and convenient for the development of either a family house or low-rise apartment building.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There are no sea views, but the property is located only 500 meters from the center and 300 meters from the sea.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For further information please contact our office in Split.&nbsp;</p>', '', '1540_Land-plot_0.jpg', '1540_Land-plot_1.jpg', '1540_Land-plot_2.jpg', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(1542, 'Chris', 'Perry', '', '', '', 'Hvar', 'Jelsa', 'For sale', 'Old stone house', '400', '500', '300', 1, '390000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 0, 0, 'January 20, 2016', '<p>Tradicionalna stara kamena kuæa na tri kata u centru grada.&nbsp;Kuæa se nalazi na mirnoj lokaciji, sa pristupom autom i parking mjestom.&nbsp;Od mora je udaljena 400 m.&nbsp;Jugozapadno je orijentirana, te ima pogled na brda i sela.&nbsp;Kuæa ima stambenu povr&scaron;inu 230 m2, dok je povr&scaron;ina zemlji&scaron;ta 500 m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;">CIJENA SNI®ENA SA 400.000 EURO!!</span></p>', '<p>We have this traditional old stone house, on three floors, in the centre of the small &nbsp;village on the north side of Hvar island.&nbsp;The house is situated in a quiet location, with easy access by car and with private parking. The sea is 400 m from the property. It is Southwest oriented and has lovely views of the surrounding steep hills and villages. The house has a living area of 230 m2, while the land measures 500 m2.</p>\r\n<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;">PRICE REDUCED FROM 400.000 EURO!!</span></p>', '', '<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;"><strong>CIJENA SNI®ENA SA 400.000 EURO!!</strong></span></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Tradicionalna stara kamena kuæa na tri kata u centru grada.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa se nalazi na mirnoj lokaciji, sa pristupom autom i parking mjestom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Od mora je udaljena 400 m.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Jugozapadno je orijentirana, te ima pogled na brda i sela.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa ima stambenu povr&scaron;inu 230 m2, dok je povr&scaron;ina zemlji&scaron;ta 500 m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa ima novi krov i betonske podove i stepenice, nove prozore, vrata i &scaron;kure.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U vrtu ima mjesta za izgradnju bazena.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Vrt obiluje mediteranskim biljem.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Centar grada gdje se nalaze restorani, barovi i ostali sadr¾aji udaljen je minutu &scaron;etnje.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za dodatne informacije molimo kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured.&nbsp;</p>', '<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;"><strong>PRICE REDUCED FROM 400.000 EURO!!</strong></span></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>We have this traditional old stone house, on three floors, in the centre of the small village on the north side of Hvar island.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house is situated in a quiet location, with easy access by car and with private parking.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Within walking distance is the old harbour where there are several options of family run bars, coffee shops and cafes, as well as other useful shops and services for both tourists and the residents.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The sea is 400 m from the property.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is Southwest oriented and has lovely views of the surrounding steep hills and villages.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house has a living area of 230 m2, while the land measures 500 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house has had a new roof and was completely restored, with new concrete floors and stairs, new windows, doors and shutters.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The work was done to retain its original character, and good quality fittings and decorations were used to make this a very attractive property.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The garden has enough space to build a swimming pool, and it has been land-scaped and planted with herbs and Mediterranean plants to help create a very attractive private space.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Hvar is well connected with Split by ferry, catamaran or sea plane.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For further information, please contact our office.&nbsp;</p>', '', '1542_Old-stone-house_0.jpg', '1542_Old-stone-house_1.jpg', '1542_Old-stone-house_2.JPG', '1542_Old-stone-house_3.JPG', '1542_Old-stone-house_4.jpg', '1542_Old-stone-house_5.jpg', '1542_Old-stone-house_6.jpg', '1542_Old-stone-house_7.jpg', '1542_Old-stone-house_8.jpg'),
(1544, '', '', 'Vlasnik 091/222 - 2932', '091/764-8307 kljuèevi', '', 'Split', 'Dra¾anac 52 Split', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '100', '0', '102', 2, '380000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 2, 1, 'January 22, 2016', '<p>Luksuzan apartman s pogledom na more i marinu.&nbsp;Apartman se uspje&scaron;no unajmljuje turistima i buduæem vlasniku osigurava znaèajan prihod.&nbsp;Apartman se nalazi na drugom katu stambene zgrade.&nbsp;Ima povr&scaron;inu 102 m2.&nbsp;Dnevni boravak i spavaæa soba su ju¾no orijentirani, a s balkona se pru¾a predivan pogled na more, marinu i otoke.&nbsp;Apartman je luksuzno ureðen te kvalitetno namje&scaron;ten.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>We have this superb apartment with a long balcony that gives views over the sea, the harbour and marina.&nbsp;The apartment is currently rented to tourists and for future owners this can provide significant revenue.&nbsp;It has a living area of 102 m2.&nbsp;Living room and bedroom are towards the sea and the balcony offers a magnificent view of the sea, marina and islands.&nbsp;The apartment is luxuriously furnished and equipped ready to be lived in immediately.</p>', '', '<p><strong>Luksuzan apartman s pogledom na more i marinu</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nalazi se u jednoj od najpopularnijih èetvrti Splita i u¾iva lagan pristup cjelogodi&scaron;njim sadr¾ajima (restoranima, kafiæima, muzejima, javnom prijevozu i pla¾ama) &scaron;to ih èini atraktivnim kako za ¾ivljenje tako i za turistièki najam.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartman se uspje&scaron;no unajmljuje turistima i buduæem vlasniku osigurava znaèajan prihod.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartman se nalazi na drugom katu stambene zgrade.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ima povr&scaron;inu 102 m2, a sastoji se od dvije spavaæe sobe, dvije kupaonice, dnevnog boravka, kuhinje s blagovaonicom te 2 balkona.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Dnevni boravak i spavaæa soba su ju¾no orijentirani, a s balkona se pru¾a predivan pogled na more, marinu i otoke.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartman je luksuzno ureðen te kvalitetno namje&scaron;ten.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nekretnina je jedna od rijetkih u samom centru grada sa pristupom automobilom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za dodatne informacije molimo kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured u Splitu.</p>', '<p>We have this superb apartment with a long balcony that gives views over the sea, the harbour and marina.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is situated on the second floor of a stylish building in one of the most popular residential areas of Split and enjoys easy access on foot to year-round amenities (restaurants, cafes, museums, public transport and beaches) which makes them attractive both for living and for tourist rental.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The apartment is currently rented to tourists and for future owners this can provide significant revenue.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It has a living area of 102 m2 and consists of two bedrooms, two bathrooms, a living room, kitchen, dining room and 2 balconies.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Living room and bedroom are towards the sea and the balcony offers a magnificent view of the sea, marina and islands.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The apartment is luxuriously furnished and equipped ready to be lived in immediately.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property is one of the few in the city centre which has access by car.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For further information, please contact our office in Split.</p>', '', '1544_Apartment_0.jpg', '1544_Apartment_1.jpg', '1544_Apartment_2.jpg', '1544_Apartment_3.jpg', '1544_Apartment_4.jpg', '1544_Apartment_5.jpg', '1544_Apartment_6.jpg', '1544_Apartment_7.jpg', '1544_Apartment_8.jpg'),
(1545, 'Alen ', 'Dalmatis', '', '', '', 'Zadar', 'Kalelarga, Zadar', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '100', '0', '70', 1, '195000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 'January 22, 2016', '<p>Dvosoban stan u centru Zadra, u starom gradu, na 3. katu stambene zgrade.&nbsp;Ukupna povr&scaron;ina stana iznosi 70 m2, sa pripadajuæom drvarnicom.&nbsp;Stan je osunèan, te se sa prozora pru¾a pogled na sam stari grad.&nbsp;Stan je kompletno renoviran 2004.godine, a prodaje se sa namje&scaron;tajem izraðenim po mjeri (osim pokretnog namje&scaron;taja).</p>\r\n<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;">CIJENA SNI®ENA SA 210.000 EUR!!</span></p>', '<p>We have this modern, luxuriously designed two bedroom apartment in a great location in Zadar Old Town. It is situated on the 3rd floor, catching the sun and with views across the old town. The property has a living area of 70m2 and has additional storage areas in the basement. The building was first built in 1963, and completely renovated in 2004.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;">PRICE REDUCED FROM 210.000 EUR!!</span></p>', '', '<p><strong><span style="text-decoration: underline;">CIJENA SNI®ENA SA 210.000 EUR!!</span><br /></strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Dvosoban stan u centru Zadra, u starom gradu, na 3. katu stambene zgrade.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ukupna povr&scaron;ina stana iznosi 70 m2, sa pripadajuæom drvarnicom.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Stan je osunèan, te se sa prozora pru¾a pogled na sam stari grad.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Stan je kompletno renoviran 2004.godine, a prodaje se sa namje&scaron;tajem izraðenim po mjeri (osim pokretnog namje&scaron;taja).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Zgrada je izgraðena 1963.godine, zidana konstrukcija, polumonta¾ne betonske ploèe.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Interijer je izraðen prema arhitektonskom projektu, potpuno nove instalacije vode, odvodnje, struje i grijanja, protuprovalna vrata, plastièna vanjska stolarija s izo-staklima i roletama.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>- Podovi: mramorne ploèe, parket, keramika</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>- dodatna termoizolacija podova, zidova i stropova</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>- dvije kupaonice + izdvojeni wc, dvije kade (jedna tu&scaron; + hidromasa¾na "Jacuzzi", bojler za potro&scaron;nu toplu vodu kapaciteta 200 litara&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>- kuhinja izraðena po mjeri, s granitnom radnom ploèom, keramièkom ploèom za kuhanje, ugraðenom peænicom i mikrovalnom peænicom, perilicom posuða ikuhinjskom napom s odvodom</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>- dimovodni prikljuèak</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>- parlafon</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>- dizajnerska rasvjeta</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>- grijanje i hlaðenje ventilokonvektorima na struju: tri unutarnje i dvijevanjske jedinice pod krovom</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>- programabilna elektrièna podna grijanja sanitarnih prostora, kupaonski radijator i ventilacije s vremenskom odgodom paljenja i ga&scaron;enja.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za dodatne informacije molimo kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured u Splitu.&nbsp;</p>', '<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;"><strong>PRICE REDUCED FROM 210.000 EUR!!</strong></span></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>We have this modern, luxuriously designed two bedroom apartment in a great location in Zadar Old Town.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is situated on the 3rd floor, catching the sun and with views across the old town.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property has a living area of 70 m2 and has additional storage areas in the basement.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The building was first built in 1963, and completely renovated in 2004.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The renovation included new water supply, drains, rewiring, new and modern heating system, new security, new windows and doors and special high insulation window glass and shutters.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The interior was designed by professional interior designers, with great care taken to produce a stylish but practical apartment.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The interior has many high quality fittings, such as the marble tiles, flooring and bathroom ceramics, on top of extra insulated floors and walls.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property has two bedrooms, two bathrooms (both with ''under floor'' heating) one with a shower and the second with a ''whirlpool jakuzzi''.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Other points include a ''flue'' should any occupant in the future wish to enjoy a ''real'' fire or stove.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The lounge and kitchen'' with an attractive lighting system, will be sold with all the furniture remaining, making this an excellent purchase for anyone looking for a modernised apartment ready for immediate living.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>With its great location, lovely views, elevated interiors and proximity to shops, bars and the centre of town and harbour, this is an excellent property.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact our offices for more information.</p>', '', '1545_Apartment_0.jpg', '1545_Apartment_1.jpg', '1545_Apartment_2.jpg', '1545_Apartment_3.jpg', '1545_Apartment_4.jpg', '1545_Apartment_5.jpg', '1545_Apartment_6.jpg', '1545_Apartment_7.jpg', '1545_Apartment_8.jpg'),
(1546, 'Stipe', 'Landiku¹iæ', '', '095/921-6919', '', 'Split', 'Teurtina 1 Split', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '300', '0', '91', 1, '220000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 'January 25, 2016', '<p>Croatia Property Sales vam predstavlja lijepi prostrani stan u centru Splita koji se sastoji od 2 spavaæe sobe i 1 kupaonice.&nbsp;Nekretnina je u odliènom stanju, spremna za useljenje te mo¾e buduæem vlasniku pru¾iti dobar prihod od turistièkog najma. Nekretnina je renovirana 2009.godine, ukljuèujuæi nove PVC zatvore, podne i zidne obloge, vodovodne i elektriène instalacije, kuhinju sa ureðajima itd. Preporuèujemo pogledati svakome tko tra¾i stan strogom centru Splita.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>Croatia Property Sales presents this lovely spacious 2-bedroom 1-bathroom apartment in the center of Split.&nbsp;The property was fully renovated in 2009 including new PVC shutters, flooring and tiling, pumbing and wiring, plaster and paint, kitchen with appliances etc. It also features small but tasteful balcony and storage.&nbsp;The property is ''ready to move in'' and may provide good rental income to the future owner. It''s a must see to anyone looking for downtown apartment.&nbsp;</p>', '', '<p><strong>Izvrsna prilika &ndash; lijepi renovirani apartman u centru Splita</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Croatia Property Sales vam predstavlja lijepi prostrani stan u centru Splita koji se sastoji od 2 spavaæe sobe i 1 kupaonice.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartman se nalazi u stambenoj zgradi svega nekoliko koraka od svih gradskih sadr¾aja i turistièkih odredi&scaron;ta, a pozicioniran je tako da pru¾a nesmetan i miran odmor.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nekretnina je renovirana 2009.godine, ukljuèujuæi nove PVC zatvore, podne i zidne obloge, vodovodne i elektriène instalacije, kuhinju sa ureðajima itd.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartman ima mali, ali lijepo ureðen balkon te ostavu.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nekretnina je u odliènom stanju, spremna za useljenje te mo¾e buduæem vlasniku pru¾iti dobar prihod od turistièkog najma.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Preporuèujemo pogledati svakome tko tra¾i stan strogom centru Splita.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za vi&scaron;e informacija molimo kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured.&nbsp;</p>', '<p><strong>Hot deal &ndash; lovely renovated apartment in the center of Split</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Croatia Property Sales presents this lovely spacious 2-bedroom 1-bathroom apartment in the center of Split.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is located in a building steps away from all amenities and focal tourist points, yet perfectly positioned to provide a good night sleep.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property was fully renovated in 2009 including new PVC shutters, flooring and tiling, pumbing and wiring, plaster and paint, kitchen with appliances etc.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It also features small but tasteful balcony and storage.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property is ''ready to move in'' and may provide good rental income to the future owner.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It''s a must see to anyone looking for downtown apartment.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact our office for more information.</p>', '', '1546_Apartment_0.jpg', '1546_Apartment_1.jpg', '1546_Apartment_2.jpg', '1546_Apartment_3.jpg', '1546_Apartment_4.jpg', '1546_Apartment_5.jpg', '1546_Apartment_6.jpg', '1546_Apartment_7.jpg', '1546_Apartment_8.jpg'),
(1547, 'Sandra ', 'Jak¹iæ Parvum d.o.o.', '', '095 199 6396', 'sandra@propertysales-croatia.com', 'Brac', 'Splitska, k.è. 199/222 k.o. splitska', 'For sale', 'Land plot', '185', '1140', '0', 1, '190000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 0, 0, 'January 25, 2016', '<p>Na prodaju nudimo graðevinsko zemlji&scaron;te u malom mjestu na Braèu, svega 2 minute hoda od mora i sa pogledom na more.&nbsp;Nekretnina se nalazi u izgraðenom dijelu naselja. Pravilnog je oblika i blagog nagiba te pogodna za gradnju koja mo¾e zapoèeti odmah nakon ishodovane dozvole (nije potreban detaljni urbanistièki plan).&nbsp;Dozvoljena visina: podrum + prizemlje + kat + potkrovlje.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>We have this building land for sale in a lovely village on Brac island, only 2 min walking distance from the sea and with sea views.&nbsp;The plot is located in urbanized area and all infrastructure is nearby. It is of rectangular shape and convenient for construction that can start immediately after the project is approved (no further spatial planning required).&nbsp;Maximum height: basement + ground floor + first floor + attick.&nbsp;</p>', '', '<p><strong>Graðevinsko zemlji&scaron;te na Braèu sa pogledom na more</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na prodaju nudimo graðevinsko zemlji&scaron;te u malom mjestu na Braèu, svega 2 minute hoda od mora i sa pogledom na more.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nekretnina se nalazi u izgraðenom dijelu naselja.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Pravilnog je oblika i blagog nagiba te pogodna za gradnju koja mo¾e zapoèeti odmah nakon ishodovane dozvole (nije potreban detaljni urbanistièki plan).&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Dozvoljena visina: podrum + prizemlje + kat + potkrovlje.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za sve dodatne informacije molimo kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured u Splitu.&nbsp;</p>', '<p><strong>Building land for sale on Brac island</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>We have this building land for sale in a lovely village on Brac island, only 2 min walking distance from the sea and with sea views.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The plot is located in urbanized area and all infrastructure is nearby.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is of rectangular shape and convenient for construction that can start immediately after the project is approved (no further spatial planning required).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Maximum height: basement + ground floor + first floor + attick.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For additional information please contact our office in Split.</p>', '', '1547_Land-plot_0.jpg', '1547_Land-plot_1.jpg', '1547_Land-plot_2.jpg', '1547_Land-plot_3.jpg', '', '', '', '', ''),
(1548, 'Sandra ', 'Jak¹iæ Parvum d.o.o.', '', '095 199 6396', 'sandra@propertysales-croatia.com', 'Brac', 'Kralja Zvonimira 25 Supetar, k.è. 967/29 k.o. Supetar, ZU 2227, podul.7', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '600', '0', '73', 1, '169000', '', 1, 1, 2, 2, 1, 1, 2, 1, 'January 25, 2016', '<p>Na prodaju nudimo stan u visokom potkrovlju manje stambene zgrade novije gradnje. Stan se sastoji od hodnika, kuhinje sa blagovaonicom te dnevnog boravka, 2 spavaæe sobe i kupaonice, ukupne povr&scaron;ine 73 m2 te dvije terase od 3 i 6 m2 i parkirali&scaron;nog mjesta 12 m2.&nbsp;U cijenu je ukljuèena kuhinja. Do centra mjesta i trajektne luke ima oko 3 minute vo¾nje ili 15 minuta hoda.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>For sale we have this apartment in the high attick of a low-rise recently built building. It comprises of hall, kitchen with dining room and living room, 2 bedrooms, 1 bathroom, sized 73 sqm in total. In addition, it has 3 and 6 sqm terraces and 12 sqm parking place.&nbsp;The price includes the kitchen. The center of the town and ferry port are 3 min drive or 15 min on foot from the property.</p>', '', '<p><strong>Dvosobni apartman u visokom potkrovlju</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na prodaju nudimo stan u visokom potkrovlju manje stambene zgrade novije gradnje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Stan se sastoji od hodnika, kuhinje sa blagovaonicom te dnevnog boravka, 2 spavaæe sobe i kupaonice, ukupne povr&scaron;ine 73 m2 te dvije terase od 3 i 6 m2 i parkirali&scaron;nog mjesta 12 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U cijenu je ukljuèena kuhinja.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Do centra mjesta i trajektne luke ima oko 3 minute vo¾nje ili 15 minuta hoda.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sa stra¾nje strane objekta nalazi se mali zajednièki dvor sa terasom za sunèanje i bazenom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za dodatne informacije molimo kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured u Splitu.&nbsp;</p>', '<p><strong>Two bedroom attick apartment with sea views</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For sale we have this apartment in the high attick of a low-rise recently built building.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It comprises of hall, kitchen with dining room and living room, 2 bedrooms, 1 bathroom, sized 73 sqm in total.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>In addition, it has 3 and 6 sqm terraces and 12 sqm parking place.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The price includes the kitchen.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The center of the town and ferry port are 3 min drive or 15 min on foot from the property.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>From the back side of the building there is small communal garden with sun deck and pool.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For additional information please contact our office in Split.</p>', '', '1548_Apartment_0.jpg', '1548_Apartment_1.jpg', '1548_Apartment_2.jpg', '1548_Apartment_3.jpg', '1548_Apartment_4.jpg', '1548_Apartment_5.jpg', '1548_Apartment_6.jpg', '1548_Apartment_7.jpg', '1548_Apartment_8.jpg'),
(1549, '', 'Dalmatian Home', '', '', '', 'Sibenik', 'Brodarica', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '250', '0', '64', 1, '98890', '', 2, 1, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 'January 27, 2016', '<p>Novi apartmani u zgradi modernog dizajna smje&scaron;tenoj pokraj &Scaron;ibenika. Zgrada je u zavr&scaron;noj fazi gradnje, te æe apartmani biti spremni za useljenje najkasnije do 31.3.2016.&nbsp;Od ukupno 5 stambenih jedinica u zgradi, apartmani na 1. i 2. katu imaju isti raspored prostorija i cijenu.&nbsp;Prednosti ove nekretnine su visokokvalitetni materijali graðevine, ugodan boravak tijekom cijele godine, suvremeni dizajn interijera, te mirna lokacija. Pla¾a je udaljena 3 min hoda.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>New apartments in the modern building located near Sibenik. The building is in the final stages of construction and apartments will be ready for occupancy no later than 31/03/2016.&nbsp;There are total of 5 residential units in the building and the apartments on the 1st and 2nd floor have the same layout and price.&nbsp;The advantages of this property are high-quality materials of the building, a pleasant stay throughout the year, contemporary interior design and quiet location. The beach is 3 minutes walking distance away.&nbsp;</p>', '', '<p>Novi apartmani u zgradi modernog dizajna smje&scaron;tenoj pokraj &Scaron;ibenika.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Zgrada je u zavr&scaron;noj fazi gradnje, te æe apartmani biti spremni za useljenje najkasnije do 31.3.2016.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Od ukupno 5 stambenih jedinica u zgradi, apartmani na 1. i 2. katu imaju isti raspored prostorija i cijenu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Stambena povr&scaron;ina od 63,80m2 se sastoji od kuhinje, blagovaonice i dnevnog boravka u jednoj cjelini, dvije spavaæe sobe, kupaonice, hodnika i natkrivene terase.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Prednosti ove nekretnine su visokokvalitetni materijali graðevine, ugodan boravak tijekom cijele godine, suvremeni dizajn interijera, te mirna lokacija.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Pla¾a je udaljena 3 minute hoda.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nadoplata za parkirno mjesto je 2.500,00 EUR.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>NAPOMENA: Prikazano stanje je 3D simulacija namje&scaron;tenog prostora, te se stan prodaje bez namje&scaron;taja.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za dodatne informacije molimo kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured u Splitu.</p>', '<p>New apartments in the modern building located near Sibenik.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The building is in the final stages of construction and apartments will be ready for occupancy no later than 31/03/2016.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There are total of 5 residential units in the building and the apartments on the 1st and 2nd floor have the same layout and price.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Living area of 63,80m2 consists of a kitchen, dining and living room in one area, two bedrooms, bathroom, hall and a covered terrace.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The advantages of this property are high-quality materials of the building, a pleasant stay throughout the year, contemporary interior design and quiet location.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The beach is 3 minutes walking distance away.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Parking space is 2.500,00EUR.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>NOTE: The pictures are a 3D simulation of the apartment, and the property is sold without furniture.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For further information please contact our office in Split.&nbsp;</p>', '', '1549_Apartment_0.jpg', '1549_Apartment_1.jpg', '1549_Apartment_2.jpg', '1549_Apartment_3.jpg', '1549_Apartment_4.jpg', '1549_Apartment_5.jpg', '1549_Apartment_6.jpg', '1549_Apartment_7.jpg', '1549_Apartment_8.jpg'),
(1551, 'Pero', 'Bureèiæ', '', '095 906 5781', '', 'Trogir', 'Put Mekoviæa Okrug Gornji, 99/15 k.o. Okrug', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '280', '0', '0', 1, '90000', '', 2, 1, 2, 2, 1, 1, 0, 0, 'January 28, 2016', '<p>Novoizgraðeni apartmani na otoku Èiovu u blizini trgovina, restorana, barova i popularne &scaron;ljunèane pla¾e sa mnogobrojnim sadr¾ajima.&nbsp;Zgrada je smje&scaron;tena u centru mjesta, ali na mirnom dijelu sa svega nekoliko nekretnina u susjedstvu.&nbsp;Najbli¾a pla¾a udaljena je cca. 5 minuta hodanja, dok se na cijelom otoku nalaze mnogobrojne kamenite i &scaron;ljunèane pla¾e i prekrasne uvale.&nbsp;Zgrada se sastoji od prizemlja, 1. i 2. kata sa ukupno 5 apartmana. U dvori&scaron;tu se nalazi zajednièki bazen.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>We are offering this selection of excellent apartments on a new development on Ciovo Island. The nearest beach is approx. 5 minutes'' walk, while elsewhere on the island there are numerous rocky and pebble beaches and beautiful coves.&nbsp;The building consists of ground, first and second floor with a total of 5 apartments. Each apartment has one private parking place, and in the communal area there is a common swimming pool and lounging area.&nbsp;All apartments have sea views, and two of them have a private roof terrace.</p>', '', '<p>Novoizgraðeni apartmani na otoku Èiovu u blizini &nbsp;trgovina, restorana, barova i popularne &scaron;ljunèane pla¾e sa mnogobrojnim sadr¾ajima.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Zgrada je smje&scaron;tena u centru mjesta, ali na mirnom dijelu sa svega nekoliko nekretnina u susjedstvu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Najbli¾a pla¾a udaljena je cca. 5 minuta hodanja, dok se na cijelom otoku nalaze mnogobrojne kamenite i &scaron;ljunèane pla¾e i prekrasne uvale.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Zgrada se sastoji od prizemlja, 1. i 2. kata sa ukupno 5 apartmana.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Svaki apartman ima 1 parking mjesto, a u dvori&scaron;tu se nalazi zajednièki bazen.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Svi apartmani imaju pogled na more, a dva imaju vlastitu krovnu terasu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>APARTMAN 1: PRIZEMLJE ISTOK &ndash; &nbsp;90.000 &euro; - 49 m2 + vrt 25 m2</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sastoji se od predsoblja, 2 spavaæe sobe, kupaonice, dnevnog dijela sa blagovaonicom i kuhinjom. Apartmanu takodjer pripada i vrt.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong style="color: #300203;">APARTMAN 2: PRIZEMLJE ZAPAD &ndash; 110.000 &euro; - 49 m2 + vrt 50 m2 - P R O D A N O !!!</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sastoji se od predsoblja, 2 spavaæe sobe, kupaonice, dnevnog dijela sa blagovaonicom i kuhinjom. Apartmanu takodjer pripada i vrt.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>APARTMAN 3: 1.KAT ISTOK &ndash; 110.000 &euro; - 50 m2</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U apartmanu se nalaze 2 spavaæe sobe, kupaonica, dnevni dio sa kuhinjom i blagovaonicom i terasa.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>APARTMAN 4: 2.KAT ISTOK &ndash; 150.000 &euro; - 50 m2 + krovna terasa 65 m2 - P R O D A N O !!!</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Smjesten na zadnjem katu, a sastoji se od 2 spavaæe sobe, kupaonice, dnevnog dijela sa kuhinjom i blagovaonicom i terasom. Apartmanu pripada i krovna terasa.</p>\r\n<p><strong><br /></strong></p>\r\n<p><strong>APARTMAN 5: 1. I 2.KAT ZAPAD - 230.000 &euro; - DVOETA®NI!!! 90 m2 + krovna terasa 50 m2</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Dvoetazni apartman smjesten na zadnjem i predzadnjem katu, a sastoji se od hodnika, ostave, 3 spavaæe sobe, 3 kupaonice, dnevnog boravka, kuhinje sa blagovaonicom i terase. Pripada mu i krovna terasa.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za dodatne informacije molimo kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured u Splitu.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>We are offering this selection of excellent apartments on a new development on Ciovo Island.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>They are situated in a village location close to shops, restaurants, bars with a popular sandy beach and numerous amenities all within a comfortable walking distance from the house.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The building is located in the centre of village, in a quiet area with only a few properties in the neighbourhood, and elevated to give long views over the sea.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The nearest beach is approx. 5 minutes'' walk, while elsewhere on the island there are numerous rocky and pebble beaches and beautiful coves.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The building consists of ground, first and second floor with a total of 5 apartments.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Each apartment has one private parking place, and in the communal area there is a common swimming pool and lounging area.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>All apartments have sea views, and two of them have a private roof terrace.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong><br /></strong></p>\r\n<p><strong>APARTMENT 1: GROUND floor EAST - &euro;90.000 - 49 m2 + garden 25 m2</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It consists of hallway, 2 bedrooms, bathroom, living area, dining room and kitchen. The apartment also has a garden.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>APARTMENT 2: GROUND floor WEST - &euro;110,000 - 49 m2 + garden 50 m2 - S O L D !!!</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It consists of hallway, 2 bedrooms, bathroom, living area, dining room and kitchen. The apartment also has a garden. &nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>APARTMENT 3: 1st floor EAST - &euro;110,000 - 50 m2</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The apartment has 2 bedrooms, bathroom, living area with kitchen and dining room and terrace.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>APARTMENT 4: 2nd FLOOR EAST - &euro;150.000 - penthouse 50 m2 + roof terrace 65 m2 - S O L D !!!</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Located on the top floor and consists of 2 bedrooms, bathroom, living area with kitchen and a terrace. Apartment has a roof terrace. &nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong><br /></strong></p>\r\n<p><strong>APARTMENT 5: 1st and 2nd floor WEST - &euro;230,000 - it&rsquo;s a two storey penthouse 90 m2 + roof terrace 50 m2</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Two storey apartment consists of a hallway, 3 bedrooms, 3 bathrooms, living room, kitchen, dining room and terrace. It also has a roof terrace.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact our office and speak with one of the agents for more information or arrange to view this property.</p>', '', '1551_Apartment_0.jpg', '1551_Apartment_1.jpg', '1551_Apartment_2.jpg', '1551_Apartment_3.jpg', '1551_Apartment_4.jpg', '1551_Apartment_5.jpg', '', '', ''),
(1552, 'Ira Hrepiæ', 'Proprietas d.o.o.', '', '(095) 52 72 889', '', 'Split', 'Split  Marka Maruliæa 3, Zgr 2493 z.u. 19', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '120', '0', '83', 2, '280000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 'January 29, 2016', '<p>Odlièna prilika &ndash; atraktivan apartman u centru Splita s prostranom terasom.&nbsp;Croatia Property Sales vam predstavlja renoviran i prostran stan u centru grada koji se sastoji od 2 spavaæe sobe, 1 kupaonice, prostranog dnevnog boravka, kuhinje i blagovaonice ukupne povr&scaron;ine 83 m2.&nbsp;Smje&scaron;ten je na drugom katu kuæe, a do ulaznih vrata se nalazi i izlaz za prostranu terasu velièine samog stana, s koje se pru¾a pogled na Palaèu.&nbsp;Apartman se mo¾e pretvoriti u dvije stambene jedinice.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>We are selling this beautifully modernised and attractive apartment in the heart of the old town with the added attraction of having a spacious roof terrace. This apartment consists of 2 bedrooms, 1 bathroom, living room, kitchen and dining room all in an open plan design, with a total area of 83 m2. It is located on the second floor, and by the front door there is access onto a spacious terrace of 80 m2 which catches the sun for most of the day, and offers views of the Palace.&nbsp;</p>', '', '<p><strong>Odlièna prilika &ndash; atraktivan apartman u centru Splita s prostranom terasom</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Croatia Property Sales vam predstavlja renoviran i prostran stan u centru grada koji se sastoji od 2 spavaæe sobe, 1 kupaonice, prostranog dnevnog boravka, kuhinje i blagovaonice ukupne povr&scaron;ine 83 m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Smje&scaron;ten je na drugom katu kuæe, a do ulaznih vrata se nalazi i izlaz za prostranu terasu velièine samog stana, s koje se pru¾a pogled na Palaèu.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartman se mo¾e pretvoriti u dvije stambene jedinice.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nalazi se u samom centru, svega nekoliko koraka od svih gradskih sadr¾aja i turistièkih odredi&scaron;ta, a ujedno udaljen od gradske buke.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nekretnina je u odliènom stanju, spremna za useljenje te mo¾e buduæem vlasniku pru¾iti dobar prihod od turistièkog najma.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za vi&scaron;e informacija molimo kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured u Splitu.&nbsp;</p>', '<p><strong>Great opportunity</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>We are selling this beautifully modernised and attractive apartment in the heart of the old town with the added attraction of having a spacious roof terrace.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>This apartment consists of 2 bedrooms, 1 bathroom, living room, kitchen and dining room all in an open plan design, with a total area of 83 m2.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is located on the second floor, and by the front door there is access onto a spacious terrace of 80 m2 which catches the sun for most of the day, and offers views of the Palace.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The apartment is large enough, and designed so that it can be converted into two residential units.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is located in the centre, just a few steps from the town facilities and tourist destinations, but in an area that is unusually quiet.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property is in excellent condition, ready for use either privately or for the continued use for tourist rental and the future owner can generate a good income from tourism rental - if that is what he wants.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There are very few apartments in such good condition and with so much potential coming onto the market, so in this case we advise early viewing.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For more information or viewing please contact our office in Split.&nbsp;</p>', '', '1552_Apartment_0.jpg', '1552_Apartment_1.jpg', '1552_Apartment_2.jpg', '1552_Apartment_3.jpg', '1552_Apartment_4.jpg', '1552_Apartment_5.jpg', '1552_Apartment_6.jpg', '1552_Apartment_7.jpg', '1552_Apartment_8.jpg'),
(1553, 'Sandra ', 'Jak¹iæ Parvum d.o.o.', '', '095 199 6396', 'sandra@propertysales-croatia.com', 'Brac', 'Kralja Zvonimira 25 Supetar, k.è. 967/29 k.o. Supetar, ZU 2227, podul.2', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '600', '0', '55', 1, '125000', '', 2, 1, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 1, 'February 1, 2016', '<p>Na prodaju nudimo stan u niskom prizemlju manje stambene zgrade novije gradnje. Stan se sastoji od hodnika, kuhinje sa blagovaonicom te dnevnog boravka, dvije spavaæe sobe i kupaonice, ukupne povr&scaron;ine 55 m2 te terase od 12 m2, vrta od 44 m2 i parkirali&scaron;nog mjesta 12 m2.&nbsp;Stan je u cijelost namje&scaron;ten. Do centra mjesta i trajektne luke ima oko 3 minute vo¾nje ili 15 minuta hoda.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>For sale we have this apartment on the ground floor of a low-rise recently built building. It comprises of hall, kitchen with dining room and living room, 2 bedrooms, 1 bathroom, sized 55 sqm in total. In addition, it has 12 sqm terrace, 12 sqm parking place and 44 sqm garden.&nbsp;Apartment is furnished. The center of the town and ferry port are 3 min drive or 15 min on foot from the property.</p>', '', '<p><strong>Dvosobni stan sa vrtom na Bracu</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na prodaju nudimo stan u niskom prizemlju manje stambene zgrade novije gradnje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Stan se sastoji od hodnika, kuhinje sa blagovaonicom te dnevnog boravka, dvije spavaæe sobe i kupaonice, ukupne povr&scaron;ine 55 m2 te terase od 12 m2, vrta od 44 m2 i parkirali&scaron;nog mjesta 12 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Stan je u cijelost namje&scaron;ten.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Do centra mjesta i trajektne luke ima oko 3 minute vo¾nje ili 15 minuta hoda.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sa stra¾nje strane objekta nalazi se mali zajednièki dvor sa terasom za sunèanje i bazenom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za dodatne informacije molimo kontaktirate na&scaron; ured u Splitu.&nbsp;</p>', '<p><strong>Two bedroom apartment on Brac</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For sale we have this apartment on the ground floor of a low-rise recently built building.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It comprises of hall, kitchen with dining room and living room, 2 bedrooms, 1 bathroom, sized 55 sqm in total.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>In addition, it has 12 sqm terrace, 12 sqm parking place and 44 sqm garden.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartment is furnished.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The center of the town and ferry port are 3 min drive or 15 min on foot from the property.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>From the back side of the building there is small communal garden with sun deck and pool.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For additional information plese contact our office in Split.&nbsp;</p>', '', '1553_Apartment_0.jpg', '1553_Apartment_1.jpg', '1553_Apartment_2.jpg', '1553_Apartment_3.jpg', '1553_Apartment_4.jpg', '1553_Apartment_5.jpg', '1553_Apartment_6.jpg', '1553_Apartment_7.jpg', '1553_Apartment_8.jpg'),
(1554, 'Ozren', 'Klindiæ', '098 388863', '098 345098', 'kmelita1012@gmail.com', 'Brac', 'Splitska, k.c. 158 k.o. splitska', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '150', '665', '167', 1, '310000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 4, 3, 'February 1, 2016', '<p>Lijepa kuæa u malom mjestu na otoku Braèu, svega 6 km od grada Supetra. Nalazi se 150 metara od mora i centra te nudi lijepi pogled na more.&nbsp;U prizemlju se nalazi veliki stan sa dnevnim boravkom i kuhinjom, tri spavaæe sobe i dvije kupaonice. Na katu je smje&scaron;tena zasebna stambena jedinica sa velikim dnevnim boravkom i kuhinjom, predsobljem sa &scaron;ankom, spavaæom sobom, kupaonicom te prostranom terasom sa koje se pru¾a pogled na more.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;">CIJENA SNI®ENA SA 450.000 EURO!</span></p>', '<p>Lovely house located in a small village on Brac island, at only 6 km from Supetar town. The property stands 150 meters away from the center and offers nice sea views.&nbsp;On the ground floor there is a large apartment containing open-plan living room and kitchen, three bedrooms and two bathrooms. On the first floor there is another apartment with large living room and kitchen, bathroom, bedroom and spacious terrace featuring great sea views.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;">PRICE REDUCED FROM 450.000 EURO!</span></p>', '', '<p><strong><span style="text-decoration: underline;">CIJENA SNI®ENA SA 450.000 EURO!</span></strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Lijepa kuæa u malom mjestu na otoku Braèu, svega 6 km od grada Supetra.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nalazi se 150 metara od mora i centra te nudi lijepi pogled na more.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U prizemlju se nalazi veliki stan sa dnevnim boravkom i kuhinjom, tri spavaæe sobe i dvije kupaonice.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na katu je smje&scaron;tena zasebna stambena jedinica sa velikim dnevnim boravkom i kuhinjom, predsobljem sa &scaron;ankom, spavaæom sobom, kupaonicom te prostranom terasom sa koje se pru¾a pogled na more.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nekretnina ima podrum i gara¾u, a okru¾uje je veliki vrt s dovoljno mjesta za izgradnju bazena.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U dvori&scaron;u se nalazi vanjski ro&scaron;tilj. &nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za dodatne informacije molimo kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured u Splitu.&nbsp;</p>', '<p><strong><span style="text-decoration: underline;">PRICE REDUCED FROM 450.000 EURO!</span></strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Lovely house located in a small village on Brac island, at only 6 km from Supetar town.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property stands 150 meters away from the center and offers nice sea views.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the ground floor there is a large apartment containing open-plan living room and kitchen, three bedrooms and two bathrooms.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the first floor there is another apartment with large living room and kitchen, bathroom, bedroom and spacious terrace featuring great sea views.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property has basement and garage.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is surrounded by ample garden with plently of space for swimming pool.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There is a BBQ area in the corner of the garden.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For additional information please contact our office in Split.&nbsp;</p>', '', '1554_House-Villa_0.jpg', '1554_House-Villa_1.jpg', '1554_House-Villa_2.jpg', '1554_House-Villa_3.jpg', '1554_House-Villa_4.jpg', '1554_House-Villa_5.jpg', '1554_House-Villa_6.jpg', '1554_House-Villa_7.jpg', '1554_House-Villa_8.jpg'),
(1555, 'Ante', 'Buzov', '', '', '', 'Korcula', 'Racisce, Korcula', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '150', '600', '480', 1, '250000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 7, 4, 'February 3, 2016', '<p>Prilika za investiciju na otoku Korèuli. Kuæa u roh-bau fazi.&nbsp;Sastoji se od velike gara¾e u suterenu, prizemlja, dva kata i galerije.&nbsp;Svaki se kat mo¾e odvojiti te tako prodavati kao zasebna jedinica, meðutim, u ovoj fazi mo¾e se preurediti i u modernu vilu sa velikim i prostranim terasama.&nbsp;U ovoj fazi gradnje moguæe je remodelirati unutra&scaron;njost kuæe.&nbsp;Povr&scaron;ina kuæe je 480 m2 i nalazi se na 600 m2 zemlji&scaron;ta.<br /><br /><br /></p>', '<p>Investment opportunity on the island of Korcula. House in roh-bau phase.&nbsp;This house consists of a big garage on the lower ground floor, ground floor, first, second floor and gallery.&nbsp;Each floor could be separated and that way be sold as separate unit, however, in this phase the house could be done as a nice, modern villa with big and spacious terraces.&nbsp;At this stage it is possible to do inside layout remodeling.&nbsp;The house is 480 sqm and it is on the land lot of 600 sqm.</p>', '', '<p>Prilika za investiciju &nbsp;na otoku Korèuli.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa u roh-bau fazi.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sastoji se od velike gara¾e u suterenu, prizemlja, dva kata i galerije.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Svaki se kat mo¾e odvojiti te tako prodavati kao zasebna jedinica, meðutim, u ovoj fazi mo¾e se preurediti i u modernu vilu sa velikim i prostranim terasama.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U ovoj fazi gradnje moguæe je remodelirati unutra&scaron;njost kuæe.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Povr&scaron;ina kuæe je 480 m2 i nalazi se na 600 m2 zemlji&scaron;ta.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Blizina mora, mjesta i grada Korèule.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Otok Korèula je najzeleniji otok, a nove linije hidroavionima èine ga sve po¾eljnijom destinacijom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za dodatne informacije molimo kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured u Splitu.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>Investment opportunity on the island of Korcula.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>House in roh-bau phase.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>This house consists of a big garage on the lower ground floor, ground floor, first, second floor and gallery.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Each floor could be separated and that way be sold as separate unit, however, in this phase the house could be done as a nice, modern villa with big and spacious terraces.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>At this stage it is possible to do inside layout remodeling.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house is 480 sqm and it is on the land lot of 600 sqm.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is close to the sea, center and town of Korcula.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The island of Korcula is known as &bdquo;the green island&ldquo; and new sea plane connections are making this island more and more desirable location.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For more information please contact our office in Split.&nbsp;</p>', '', '1555_House-Villa_0.jpg', '1555_House-Villa_1.jpg', '1555_House-Villa_2.jpg', '1555_House-Villa_3.jpg', '1555_House-Villa_4.jpg', '1555_House-Villa_5.jpg', '1555_House-Villa_6.jpg', '1555_House-Villa_7.jpg', '1555_House-Villa_8.jpg');
INSERT INTO `nekretnina` (`id`, `ime`, `prezime`, `telefon`, `mobitel`, `e_mail`, `lokacija_id`, `adresa`, `status_id`, `vrsta_id`, `udaljenost`, `povrsina`, `stambenapovrsina`, `display`, `cijena`, `cijenatocka`, `ponuda_tjedna`, `new_built`, `must_sell`, `prvi_red_do_mora`, `pogled_na_more`, `bazen`, `broj_soba`, `broj_kupatila`, `datum`, `title_hr`, `title_en`, `title_ge`, `opis_hr`, `opis_en`, `opis_ge`, `PropertyImageURL0`, `PropertyImageURL1`, `PropertyImageURL2`, `PropertyImageURL3`, `PropertyImageURL4`, `PropertyImageURL5`, `PropertyImageURL6`, `PropertyImageURL7`, `PropertyImageURL8`) VALUES
(1556, 'Vlado', 'Rado¹', '+491715512688', '+49911329331', 'vlado.rados@t-online.de, info@v-rados.co', 'Brac', 'Put Gaja 38 Supetar, k.c. 531/7 k.o. supetar', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '440', '630', '290', 1, '459000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 0, 0, 'February 3, 2016', '<p>U ponudi imamo samostojeæu kuæu na otoku Braèu, nedaleko od centra grada i trajektne luke.&nbsp;Objekt se sastoji od suterena (jednosobni apartman 42 m2), prizemlja (apartman 125 m2 sa 4 spavaæe sobe, 2 kupaonice, terasom od 40 m2 i balkonom od 9 m2) i prvog kata (apartman 123 m2 sa 3 spavaæe sobe, 2 kupaonice te terase od 16 m2).&nbsp;Velika parcela sa dovoljno parkirali&scaron;nih mjesta. Odr¾avani vrt sa vrtnom kuæicom (postrojenje za centralno grijanje).</p>', '<p>For sale we have this detached house on Brac island, not far from the town''s center and the ferry port.&nbsp;The property comprises of a lower ground floor (42 sqm 1-bedroom apartment), ground floor (125 sqm 4-bedroom 2-bathroom apartment with 40 sqm terrace and 9 sqm balcony) and first floor (123 sqm 3-bedroom 2-bathroom apartment with 16 sqm terrace).&nbsp;All the bedrooms and living rooms are air-conditioned.&nbsp;The property comes with the building permit for the 2nd floor (108 sqm).&nbsp;</p>', '', '<p><strong>Samostojeæa kuæa na otoku Braèu</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U ponudi imamo samostojeæu kuæu na otoku Braèu, nedaleko od centra grada i trajektne luke.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Objekt se sastoji od suterena (jednosobni apartman 42 m2), prizemlja (apartman 125 m2 sa 4 spavaæe sobe, 2 kupaonice, terasom od 40 m2 i balkonom od 9 m2) i prvog kata (apartman 123 m2sa 3 spavaæe sobe, 2 kupaonice te terase od 16 m2).&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Velika parcela sa dovoljno parkirali&scaron;nih mjesta.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Odr¾avani vrt sa vrtnom kuæicom (postrojenje za centralno grijanje).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sve kupaonice su renovirane u proljeæe 2015., a na krovu postavljene nove solarne ploèe.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Postoji i pravomoæna graðevinska dozvola sa plaæenim komunalnim doprinosima za podizanje drugog kata (108 m2).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za vi&scaron;e informacija kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured.</p>', '<p><strong>Detached house for sale on Brac</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For sale we have this detached house on Brac island, not far from the town''s center and the ferry port.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property comprises of a lower ground floor (42 sqm 1-bedroom apartment), ground floor (125 sqm 4-bedroom 2-bathroom apartment with 40 sqm terrace and 9 sqm balcony) and first floor (123 sqm 3-bedroom 2-bathroom apartment with 16 sqm terrace).&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ample plot with plenty of parking space.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Lanscaped garen with garden shed (heating system).&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>All the bedrooms and living rooms are air-conditioned.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>All bathrooms were renovated in Spring 2015.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>New solar colletors on the roof were installed.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property comes with the building permit for the 2nd floor (108 sqm).&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Side sea view is currently from the 1st floor terrace.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It would be very nice if the 2nd floor was built.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact our office for more information.</p>', '', '1556_House-Villa_0.jpg', '1556_House-Villa_1.jpg', '1556_House-Villa_2.jpg', '1556_House-Villa_3.jpg', '1556_House-Villa_4.jpg', '1556_House-Villa_5.jpg', '1556_House-Villa_6.jpg', '1556_House-Villa_7.jpg', '1556_House-Villa_8.jpg'),
(1557, 'Marina', 'Pletikosa', '091/ 546 3775 - Mama ', '091 515 6284 ', 'marina.pletikosa@gmail.com', 'Trogir', '®edanska ulica Okrug Gornji, 1589 ZGR, 824/54,  824/56', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '90', '512', '250', 1, '290000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 3, 2, 'February 3, 2016', '<p>Kuæa na atraktivnoj lokaciji u prekrasnoj uvali na Èiovu. Smje&scaron;tena je u 3.redu od mora i prekrasne ureðene kamenite pla¾e.&nbsp;Kuæa ima prizemlje i 1.kat ukupne stambene povr&scaron;ine 120 m2 plus terasa u prizemlju koja iznosi cca. 100 m2.&nbsp;U nastavku kuæe se takoðer nalazi ostava povr&scaron;ine 40 m2 i spremnik za vodu od 19 kubika.&nbsp;Ukupna povr&scaron;ina zemlji&scaron;ta iznosi 512 m2. Ima direktan pristupni put i parking 18 * 5 m dovoljan za cca. 5 automobila.</p>', '<p>We have this house in an attractive location in a beautiful bay near Trogir. It is located in the 3rd row from the sea on beautiful rocky beach known for the clean beach. The house has ground floor and 1st floor with a total floor area of 120 m2 plus a level terrace on the ground floor, which is an extra approx. 100 m2.&nbsp;Below the house is also a storage area of 40 m2 and a water tank of 19 cubic meters.&nbsp;The total land area is 512 m2.&nbsp;</p>', '', '<p>Kuæa na atraktivnoj lokaciji u prekrasnoj uvali na Èiovu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Smje&scaron;tena je u 3.redu od mora i prekrasne ureðene kamenite pla¾e.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa ima prizemlje i 1.kat ukupne stambene povr&scaron;ine 120 m2 plus terasa u prizemlju od cca. 100 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U nastavku kuæe se takoðer nalazi ostava povr&scaron;ine 40 m2 i spremnik za vodu od 19 kubika.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ukupna povr&scaron;ina zemlji&scaron;ta iznosi 512 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ima direktan pristupni put i parking 18 * 5 m dovoljan za cca. 5 automobila.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U prizemlju se nalazi kuhinja, dnevni boravak, kupaonica, manja ostava i prostrana terasa sa pogledom na more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na prvom katu se nalazi dnevni boravak, kuhinja, ostava, 3 spavaæe sobe, kupaonica i balkon sa prekrasnim pogledom na more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæi je potrebno renoviranje, ali se radi o izuzetnoj prilici zbog izvrsnog polo¾aja i blizine pla¾e.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Takoðer postoji moguænost nadogradnje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Udaljenost od centra mjesta je 3 min. vo¾nje gdje se nalaze mnogobrojne trgovine, restorani i ostali sadr¾aji.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Grad Trogir koji je uvr&scaron;ten pod UNESCO-vom za&scaron;titom udaljen je 10 min vo¾nje.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Do meðunarodnog aerodroma je potrebno 15 min. vo¾nje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ostajemo na usluzi za sva dodatna pitanja.</p>', '<p>We have this house in an attractive location in a beautiful bay near Trogir.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It needs refurbishing throughout and this is well reflected in the price, which makes this a superb value property for someone who is prepared to treat this as a renovation project.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is located in the 3rd row from the sea on beautiful rocky beach known for the clean beach.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house has ground floor and 1st floor with a total floor area of 120 m2 plus a level terrace on the ground floor, which is an extra approx. 100 m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Below the house is also a storage area of 40 m2 and a water tank of 19 cubic meters.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The total land area is 512 m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It has direct access road and parking lot 18m x 5 m is sufficient for approx. 5 cars.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the ground floor there is a kitchen, living room, bathroom, small storage room and access to the spacious terrace which has great views overlooking the sea.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The first floor has a living room, kitchen, 3 bedrooms, bathroom and balcony, again with a great sea view.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house needs renovation, but it is a remarkable opportunity for excellent location and proximity to the beach.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The distance from the town centre is about 3 min. driving, where there are many choices of shops, cafes, restaurants and other facilities.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The city of Trogir, which is listed under UNESCO protection is 10 minutes away.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>To the international airport it takes 15 min. driving.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>We remain at your disposal for any additional questions.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact the office in Split.</p>', '', '1557_House-Villa_0.jpg', '1557_House-Villa_1.JPG', '1557_House-Villa_2.JPG', '1557_House-Villa_3.JPG', '1557_House-Villa_4.jpg', '1557_House-Villa_5.JPG', '1557_House-Villa_6.JPG', '1557_House-Villa_7.JPG', '1557_House-Villa_8.JPG'),
(1558, 'Rakela', 'Petriæ', '', '095/882-6366', 'rakelaselca@net.hr', 'Hvar', 'Selca  Hvar', 'For sale', 'Old stone house', '2500', '700', '100', 1, '130000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 0, 0, 'February 3, 2016', '<p>Stara kamena kuæa za renovaciju na otoku Hvaru, s pogledom na more.&nbsp;Sastoji se od prizemlja, prvog i drugog kata, ukupne stambene povr&scaron;ine 100 m2.&nbsp;U prizemlju se nalazi konoba.&nbsp;Zemlji&scaron;te na kojem je polo¾ena kuæa je graðevno te ima povr&scaron;inu 700 m2.&nbsp;Struja i voda se nalaze do kuæe.&nbsp;Mjesto je udaljeno od Starog Grada 2.5 km.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>We are pleased to offer this fabulous renovation project. A large house on alarge plot in a great rural location with sea views. Such projects are becoming increasingly rare on the market and this one, with the walls in apparently good condition, has unusually high potential.&nbsp;It consist of the ground floor, first and second floor, with a total floor area of 100 m2.&nbsp;On the ground floor there is a cellar. The land on which the house is built is building land and has an area of 700 m2.&nbsp;</p>', '', '<p><strong>Stara kamena kuæa za renovaciju na otoku Hvaru, s pogledom na more</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sastoji se od prizemlja, prvog i drugog kata, ukupne stambene povr&scaron;ine 100 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U prizemlju se nalazi konoba.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Zemlji&scaron;te na kojem je polo¾ena kuæa je graðevno te ima povr&scaron;inu 700 m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Struja i voda se nalaze do kuæe.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Mjesto je udaljeno od Starog Grada 2.5 km.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za sve dodatne informacije kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured u Splitu.&nbsp;</p>', '<p><strong>Renovation project</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>We are pleased to offer this fabulous renovation project.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>A large house on a large plot in a great rural location with sea views.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Such projects are becoming increasingly rare on the market and this one, with the walls in apparently good condition, has unusually high potential.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It consist of the ground floor, first and second floor, with a total floor area of 100 m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the ground floor there is a cellar.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The land on which the house is built is building land and has an area of 700 m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Electricity and water are already next to the house.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Stari Grad is &nbsp;2.5 km distant.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For further information contact our office in Split.</p>', '', '1558_Old-stone-house_0.JPG', '1558_Old-stone-house_1.JPG', '1558_Old-stone-house_2.JPG', '1558_Old-stone-house_3.JPG', '1558_Old-stone-house_4.JPG', '1558_Old-stone-house_5.JPG', '1558_Old-stone-house_6.JPG', '1558_Old-stone-house_7.jpg', '1558_Old-stone-house_8.jpg'),
(1560, 'Tramontana Kata', 'Mate Matkovic 1/2  ', '', '091 795 4478', '', 'Hvar', 'Jelsa', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '400', '260', '150', 1, '250000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 3, 3, 'February 3, 2016', '<p>Samostojeæa kuæa blizu grada sa otvorenim pogledom na more.&nbsp;Sastoji se od prizemlja i dva kata ukupne stambene povr&scaron;ine 150 m2, dok povr&scaron;ina zemlji&scaron;ta iznosi 260 m2.&nbsp;Dnevni boravak u prizemlju ima izlaz na veliku terasu s koje se pru¾a pogled na mjesto i more.&nbsp;Na drugom katu su tri sobe, kupaonica te mini kuhinja s posebnim ulazom preko vanjskog stepenista iz vrta.&nbsp;Kuæa ima i malu terasu ispred ulaza te dva balkona sa prednje strane koji takoðer imaju prekrasan pogled na more i cijelo mjesto.&nbsp;Kuæa ima u suterenu gara¾u.</p>', '<p>We have this detached house in a charming and historic village on the north side of Hvar Island. It is a detached house close to the town with sweeping views of the sea from its elevated position.&nbsp;It consists of a ground floor and two floors with a total floor area of 150 m2, and land area is 260 m2. On the second floor are three bedrooms, bathroom and kitchen with a separate entrance via an external staircase from the garden. The house has a small terrace in front and two balconies, which also have a beautiful view of the sea and the town.</p>', '', '<p>Samostojeæa kuæa blizu grada sa otvorenim pogledom na more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sastoji se od prizemlja i dva kata ukupne stambene povr&scaron;ine 150 m2, dok povr&scaron;ina zemlji&scaron;ta iznosi 260 m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U prizemlju se nalazi dnevni boravak, kuhinja, blagovaonica i kupaonica.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Dnevni boravak ima izlaz na veliku terasu s koje se pru¾a pogled na mjesto i more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na drugom katu su tri sobe, kupaonica te mini kuhinja s posebnim ulazom preko vanjskog stepenista iz vrta.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa ima i malu terasu ispred ulaza te dva balkona sa prednje strane koji takoðer imaju prekrasan pogled na more i cijelo mjesto.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa ima u suterenu gara¾u.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Orijentirana je ju¾no.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Potrebna su manja ulaganja te modernizacija kuæe.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je udaljena 400 m od mora, a od samog centra mjesta 500 m.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za sve dodatne informacije molimo kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>We have this detached house in a charming and historic village on the north side of Hvar Island.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is a detached house close to the town with sweeping views of the sea from its elevated position.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It consists of a ground floor and two floors with a total floor area of 150 m2, and land area is 260 m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The ground floor has a living room, kitchen, dining room and bathroom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The living room has windows leading onto a large terrace that offers a view of the town, the harbour and the sea.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the second floor are three bedrooms, bathroom and kitchen with a separate entrance via an external staircase from the garden.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house has a small terrace in front and two balconies, which also have a beautiful view of the sea and the town.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house is ready for immediate use, but some might consider it is due to be redecorated and perhaps modernising.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house has a basement garage.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house is located 400 m from the sea and from the centre of &nbsp;the village is 500 m - a very attractive 5 minute walk.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For further information please contact our office.</p>', '', '1560_House-Villa_0.jpg', '1560_House-Villa_1.jpg', '1560_House-Villa_2.jpg', '1560_House-Villa_3.jpg', '1560_House-Villa_4.jpg', '1560_House-Villa_5.jpg', '1560_House-Villa_6.jpg', '1560_House-Villa_7.jpg', '1560_House-Villa_8.jpg'),
(1562, 'Marija', 'Ramiæ', 'AnthonyKing', '0044 7943 046 203', 'Tonyking287@gmail.com', 'Dubrovnik', 'Marojice Kaboge 6, zgr 1353, 1354, 1357 k.o. dubrovnik ZU 18 pu 1', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '200', '0', '92', 1, '530000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 3, 2, 'February 9, 2016', '<p>Na prodaju nudimo ovu lijepu nekretninu u samom centru Dubrovnika, a koja se sastoji od dvosobnog stana povr&scaron;ine 68 m2 te studio apartmana povr&scaron;ine 24 m2.&nbsp;Obje se jedinice nalaze na prvom katu. Studio ima pristup terasi povr&scaron;ine 30 m2 sa pogledom na fasade okolnih povijesnih kuæa.&nbsp;Nekretnina je namje&scaron;tena i opremljena. Na podovima je postavljen kvalitetan talijanski mramor, a postavljene su i najsuvremenije kuhinje sa ureðajima. &nbsp;<br /><br /></p>', '<p>For sale we have this fantastic property in Dubrovnik Old Town, comprising of a 68 sqm 2-bedroom apartment and 24 sqm studio apartment.&nbsp;Both units are located on the 1st floor, all on the same level. Studio has access to a lovely, rare to find 30 sqm terrace overlooking historical buildings.&nbsp;Both units are furnished with Italian marble throughout and top quality kitchens with appliances.</p>', '', '<p><strong>CIJENA SNI®ENA -&nbsp;</strong><strong>Izvrsna nekretnina u starom dijelu Dubrovnika</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na prodaju nudimo ovu lijepu nekretninu u samom centru Dubrovnika, a koja se sastoji od dvosobnog stana povr&scaron;ine 68 m2 te studio apartmana povr&scaron;ine 24 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Obje se jedinice nalaze na prvom katu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Studio ima pristup terasi povr&scaron;ine 30 m2 sa pogledom na fasade okolnih povijesnih kuæa.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nekretnina je namje&scaron;tena i opremljena.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na podovima je postavljen kvalitetan talijanski mramor, a postavljene su i najsuvremenije kuhinje sa ureðajima. &nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Stan ima dosta svjetla.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U prizemlju objekta vlasnici imaju malu ostavu.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Molimo kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured za vi&scaron;e informacija.</p>', '<p><strong>PRICE REDUCED - Excellent property in the heart of Dubrovnik Old Town</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For sale we have this fantastic property in Dubrovnik Old Town, comprising of a 68 sqm 2-bedroom apartment and 24 sqm studio apartment.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Both units are located on the 1st floor, all on the same level.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Studio has access to a lovely, rare to find 30 sqm terrace overlooking historical buildings.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Both units are furnished with Italian marble throughout and top quality kitchens with appliances.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property is bright and airy.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It also features small storage on the ground floor.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact our office for more information.</p>', '', '1562_Apartment_0.jpg', '1562_Apartment_1.jpg', '1562_Apartment_2.jpg', '1562_Apartment_3.jpg', '1562_Apartment_4.jpg', '1562_Apartment_5.jpg', '1562_Apartment_6.jpg', '1562_Apartment_7.jpg', '1562_Apartment_8.jpg'),
(1563, 'Ian', 'Casolani DBCI doo', '+356 9949 6159', '', 'ian.casolani@land-overseas.com', 'Brac', 'Sutivan, k.c. 1570/2 k.o. sumartin', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '10', '625', '440', 1, '660000', '', 2, 1, 2, 1, 1, 2, 12, 9, 'February 9, 2016', '<p>Croatia Property Sales predstavlja priliku za kupnjom cijele apartmanske zgrade odmah pored mora u malom mjesto na otoku Braèu.&nbsp;Nekretnina se sastoji od 6 apartmana (po 2 na svakom katu), od kojih su svi dvosobni, a polovina ih ima 2 kupaonice. Ukupna stambena povr&scaron;ina je cca. 440 m2, &scaron;to daje izvrsnu prosjeènu cijenu od 1.500 EUR/m2.&nbsp;Ovo je dobra prilika za investitore koji ¾ele kupiti cijeli projekt, izvesti zavr&scaron;ne radove, a zatim prodavati stanove pojedinaèni i ostvariti solidan profit.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>Croatia Property Sales presents this great opportunity to buy the whole apartment building right next to the sea and lovely beach in a small charming village on Brac island.&nbsp;The property comprises of 6 apartments (2 on every floor), all of which have 2 bedrooms and half of which have 2 bathrooms. Approximate internal size of all units is 440 sqm without the outside space, which gives the unbeatable average price of 1.500 EUR per sqm.&nbsp;</p>', '', '<p><strong>Apartmanska zgrada za prodaju u prvom redu do mora</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Croatia Property Sales predstavlja priliku za kupnjom cijele apartmanske zgrade odmah pored mora u malom mjesto na otoku Braèu.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nekretnina se sastoji od 6 apartmana (po 2 na svakom katu), od kojih su svi dvosobni, a polovina ih ima 2 kupaonice (dok preostala tri apartmana imaju po jednu kupaonicu).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ukupna stambena povr&scaron;ina je cca. 440 m2, &scaron;to daje izvrsnu prosjeènu cijenu od 1.500 EUR/m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nekretnina se prodaje u prikazanom stanju &ndash; prodavatelj neæe dovr&scaron;avati objekt.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Svi glavni radovi veæ su izvedeni &ndash; formiranje strukture, renovacija kamene fasade, velikim dijelom keramièki i instalaterski radovi, a sve je jo&scaron; uvijek u solidnom stanju.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ovo je dobra prilika za investitore koji ¾ele kupiti cijeli projekt, izvesti zavr&scaron;ne radove, a zatim prodavati stanove pojedinaèni i ostvariti solidan profit.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za sve informacije molimo kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>', '<p><strong>Seafront apartment house for sale at fantastic location</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Croatia Property Sales presents this great opportunity to buy the whole apartment building right next to the sea and lovely beach in a small charming village on Brac island.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property comprises of 6 apartments (2 on every floor), all of which have 2 bedrooms and half of which have 2 bathrooms (other units have 1 bathroom).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Approximate internal size of all units is 440 sqm without the outside space, which gives the unbeatable average price of 1.500 EUR per sqm.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartments are sold in as-is condition &ndash; near completion, but they will not be finished by the seller.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>All major works are already done &ndash; formation of ther structure, restoration of the stone facade, great part of flooring, tiling, wiring, plumbing, most of which is still in a very good condition.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>This is a great chance for serious investor to buy the whole project, do the final works, sell the apartments separately and gain substantial profit.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact our office for more information.</p>', '', '1563_House-Villa_0.jpg', '1563_House-Villa_1.jpg', '1563_House-Villa_2.jpg', '1563_House-Villa_3.jpg', '1563_House-Villa_4.jpg', '1563_House-Villa_5.jpg', '1563_House-Villa_6.jpg', '1563_House-Villa_7.jpg', '1563_House-Villa_8.jpg'),
(1564, 'Miro', 'Be¹ker', '', '091/902-1225', '', 'Split', 'Kri¾eva 32 Split', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '200', '0', '20', 2, '70000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 1, 'February 9, 2016', '<p>Apartman smje&scaron;ten u starom dijelu grada, na mirnoj lokaciji, svega par minuta &scaron;etnje do stare gradske jezgre i Dioklecijanove palaèe, 200 metara udaljen od mora, trajektne luke i glavne &scaron;etnice Rive.&nbsp;Blizina Park &scaron;ume Marjan na sjeveru i centra grada na jugu sa svim pripadajuæim sadr¾ajima èini ga interesantnim onima koji ¾ele biti dio ¾ivopisne atmosfere ovog prekrasnog mediteranskog grada.&nbsp;Studio apartman je smje&scaron;ten u prizemlju.&nbsp;Ima povr&scaron;inu 23 m2, te je istoèno orijentiran.&nbsp;Pripada mu dvor s kaminom.&nbsp;<br /><br /></p>', '<p>We are offering this studio apartment located in the old town, in a great location for investment buyers - just a few minutes'' walk from the old town and Diocletian''s Palace, 200 meters from the sea, the port and the main promenade Riva.&nbsp;All the main historic attractions and best restaurants are within walking distance which makes this property excellent for anyone looking for aproperty to rent to tourists. This studio apartment is located on the ground floor.&nbsp;It has a surface of 23 m2, and is East oriented.&nbsp;Has a courtyard with bbq/fireplace! &nbsp;</p>', '', '<p><strong>Odlièna prilika za investiciju</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartman smje&scaron;ten u starom dijelu grada, na mirnoj lokaciji, svega par minuta &scaron;etnje do stare gradske jezgre i Dioklecijanove palaèe, 200 metara udaljen od mora, trajektne luke i glavne &scaron;etnice Rive.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Blizina Park &scaron;ume Marjan na sjeveru i centra grada na jugu sa svim pripadajuæim sadr¾ajima èini ga interesantnim onima koji ¾ele biti dio ¾ivopisne atmosfere ovog prekrasnog mediteranskog grada.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Studio apartman je smje&scaron;ten u prizemlju.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ima povr&scaron;inu 23 m2, te je istoèno orijentiran.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Pripada mu dvor s kaminom.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Vlasni&scaron;tvo uredno.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Parking je javni, nedaleko kuæe, a najbli¾i veæi parking udaljen je 300 m od kuæe.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Va¾no je znati da upravo ovaj stari dio grada posljednjih nekoliko godina do¾ivljava procvat u djelatnosti privatnog turistièkog iznajmljivanja, te postoji stalna poveæana potra¾nja za sliènim smje&scaron;tajnim kapacitetima.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Meðunarodni aerodrom udaljen je 40 min. vo¾nje.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za dodatne informacije molimo kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured u Splitu.</p>', '<p>We are offering this studio apartment located in the old town, in a great location for investment buyers - just a few minutes'' walk from the old town and Diocletian''s Palace, 200 meters from the sea, the port and the main promenade Riva.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>All the main historic attractions and best restaurants are within walking distance which makes this property excellent for anyone looking for a property to rent to tourists.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is also close to Marjan Forest Park and clean beaches making it perfect for those who want to be part of the lively atmosphere of a Mediterranean town.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>This studio apartment is located on the ground floor.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It has a surface of 23 m2, and is East oriented.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Has a courtyard with bbq/fireplace!&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The inside needs some minor redecoration. Sorry about the mess on the pictures:(</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Parking is public, not far from the house, and the nearest larger parking is 300 meters from the house.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The international airport is 40 minutes. driving.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For further information, please contact our office in Split.</p>', '', '1564_Apartment_0.jpg', '1564_Apartment_1.jpg', '1564_Apartment_2.jpg', '1564_Apartment_3.jpg', '1564_Apartment_4.jpg', '1564_Apartment_5.jpg', '', '', ''),
(1565, 'Miro', 'Be¹ker', '', '091/902-1225', '', 'Split', 'Kri¾eva 32 Split, z.u. 7519', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '200', '16', '42', 2, '130000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 'February 9, 2016', '<p>Apartman smje&scaron;ten u starom dijelu grada, na mirnoj lokaciji, svega par minuta &scaron;etnje do stare gradske jezgre i Dioklecijanove palaèe, 200 metara udaljen od mora, trajektne luke i glavne &scaron;etnice Rive.&nbsp;Apartman je smje&scaron;ten na prvom katu kuæe.&nbsp;Ima ukupnu stambenu povr&scaron;inu 42 m2, a sastoji se od kuhinje, blagovaonice, dvije spavaæe sobe i kupaonice.&nbsp;Useljiv je, premda zahtijeva manju renovaciju.&nbsp;Pripada mu terasa od 16 m2.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>We are offering this first floor apartment of two bedrooms, well located in a quiet location in the old town, at a price designed to attract a quick sale. This makes the area, and this apartment, perfect for investors looking to rent to the ever increasing numbers of tourists coming to Split to enjoy the lively atmosphere of this Mediterranean town. The apartment is located on the first floor.&nbsp;It has a total surface of 42 m2 and it has a terrace of 16 m2.</p>', '', '<p><strong>Odlièna prilika za investiciju</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartman smje&scaron;ten u starom dijelu grada, na mirnoj lokaciji, svega par minuta &scaron;etnje do stare gradske jezgre i Dioklecijanove palaèe, 200 metara udaljen od mora, trajektne luke i glavne &scaron;etnice Rive.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Blizina Park &scaron;ume Marjan na sjeveru i centra grada na jugu sa svim pripadajuæim sadr¾ajima èini ga interesantnim onima koji ¾ele biti dio ¾ivopisne atmosfere ovog prekrasnog mediteranskog grada.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartman je smje&scaron;ten na prvom katu kuæe.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ima ukupnu stambenu povr&scaron;inu 42 m2, a sastoji se od kuhinje, blagovaonice, dvije spavaæe sobe i kupaonice.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Useljiv je, premda zahtijeva manju renovaciju.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Pripada mu terasa od 16 m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Vlasni&scaron;tvo uredno.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Parking je javni, nedaleko kuæe, a najbli¾i veæi parking udaljen je 300 m od kuæe.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Va¾no je znati da upravo ovaj stari dio grada posljednjih nekoliko godina do¾ivljava procvat u djelatnosti privatnog turistièkog iznajmljivanja, te postoji stalna poveæana potra¾nja za sliènim smje&scaron;tajnim kapacitetima.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Meðunarodni aerodrom udaljen je 40 min. vo¾nje.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za dodatne informacije molimo kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured u Splitu.</p>', '<p>We are offering this first floor apartment of two bedrooms, well located in a quiet location in the old town, at a price designed to attract a quick sale.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is situated between the Riva and the Marjan Forest Park to the north of the town, but only a couple of minutes walk from the Diocletians Palace.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>All the main historic and cultural attractions are close, as well as the ferry terminal and many of the popular restaurants and bars that visitors love.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>This makes the area, and this apartment, perfect for investors looking to rent to the ever increasing numbers of tourists coming to Split to enjoy the lively atmosphere of this Mediterranean town.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The apartment is located on the first floor.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It has a total surface of 42 m2 and consists of a kitchen, dining room, two bedrooms and a bathroom.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is habitable, although requiring some redecoration.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It has a terrace of 16 m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Parking is public, not far from the house, and the nearest larger parking is 300 meters from the house.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The international airport is 40 minutes. driving.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For further information, please contact our office in Split.</p>', '', '1565_Apartment_0.jpg', '1565_Apartment_1.jpg', '1565_Apartment_2.jpg', '1565_Apartment_3.jpg', '1565_Apartment_4.jpg', '1565_Apartment_5.jpg', '', '', ''),
(1566, 'Zorka', 'La¾eta', '0049 163 8736439', 'kæer Zrinka 091 755 5373 ', 'villalazeta@googlemail.com', 'Split', 'Peniæa 8  Split', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '70', '61', '164', 1, '600000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 4, 5, 'February 10, 2016', '<p>Ova &scaron;armantna dalmatinska vila nalazi se u jednoj od najstarijih stambenih èetvrti Splita i u¾iva lagan pristup cjelogodi&scaron;njim sadr¾ajima &scaron;to je èini atraktivnom kako za ¾ivljenje tako i za turistièki najam. Ima stambenu povr&scaron;inu 164 m2, a sastoji se od ukupno 4 odvojena apartmana, svaki povr&scaron;ine 41 m2. Ima sveukupno 4 spavaæe sobe i 5 kupaonica rasporeðenih preko prizemlja, prvog i drugog kata te potkrovlja. Vila je kvalitetno sagraðena te opremljena kvalitetnim materijalima, a ureðena s ukusom.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>We are pleased to offer this charming and traditional style Dalmatian villa completely restored to high Western European standards. It is located in one of the oldest residential areas of the city of Split and enjoys easy access to all the amenities which makes it extremely attractive both as a distinguished private residence and for tourist rental. It has a living area of 164 m2 and consists of 4 separate apartments. The villa is well built and equipped with high quality materials and fittings, and decorated with taste.&nbsp;</p>', '', '<p>Ova &scaron;armantna dalmatinska vila nalazi se u jednoj od najstarijih stambenih èetvrti Splita i u¾iva lagan pristup cjelogodi&scaron;njim sadr¾ajima (restoranima, kafiæima, muzejima, javnom prijevozu, i pla¾ama) &scaron;to je èini atraktivnom kako za ¾ivljenje tako i za turistièki najam.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nekretnina se veæ du¾e vrijeme unajmljuje turistima i buduæem vlasniku osigurava znaèajan prihod.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Blizina Park &scaron;ume Marjan na sjeveru i centra grada na jugu sa svim pripadajuæim sadr¾ajima èie ovu vilu interesantnom onima koji ¾ele biti dio ¾ivopisne atmosfere ovog prekrasnog mediteranskog grada.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Vila je izgraðena 2014. godine te je oblo¾ena kamenom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ima stambenu povr&scaron;inu 164 m2, a sastoji se od ukupno 4 odvojena apartmana, svaki povr&scaron;ine 41 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ima sveukupno 4 spavaæe sobe i 5 kupaonica rasporeðenih preko prizemlja, prvog i drugog kata te potkrovlja.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Vila je kvalitetno sagraðena te opremljena kvalitetnim materijalima, a ureðena s ukusom.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Klimatizirana je, ima video nadzor, masa¾ne stupove u kupaonicama, masa¾nu kadu, ugradbene kuhinje, te solarno zagrijavanje vode &scaron;to èini jako malu potro&scaron;nju struje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ispred se nalazi ograðeni dvor u kojem gosti neometano mogu u¾ivati hladovinu tijekom ljetnih mjeseci.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za dodatne informacije molimo kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured u Splitu.</p>', '<p>We are pleased to offer this charming and traditional style Dalmatian villa completely restored to high Western European standards.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is located in one of the oldest residential areas of the city of Split and enjoys easy access to all the amenities (restaurants, cafes, museums, public transport, and beaches), which makes it extremely attractive both as a distinguished private residence and for tourist rental.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property has, for a long time been rented to tourists and if the new owner followed suite, it would provide significant revenue.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is close to the Marjan Forest Park in the north and on the south is the old town centre with all the city attractions.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>This villa is interesting to all those who want to be part of the lively atmosphere of a Mediterranean town.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The villa was built in 2014 and is lined with stone.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It has a living area of 164 m2 and consists of 4 separate apartments, each measuring 41 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Here are a total of 4 bedrooms and 5 bathrooms distributed over the ground, first and second floors and the top floor/attic.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The villa is well built and equipped with high quality materials and fittings, and decorated with taste.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is Air-conditioned, has video surveillance, has massage shower in the bathrooms, a spa tub, built-in kitchen, and solar water heating accounting for very low power consumption.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>In front is a fenced yard where guests can enjoy the peaceful shade during the summer months.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For further information, please contact our office in Split.</p>', '', '1566_House-Villa_0.jpg', '1566_House-Villa_1.jpg', '1566_House-Villa_2.jpg', '1566_House-Villa_3.jpg', '1566_House-Villa_4.jpg', '1566_House-Villa_5.jpg', '1566_House-Villa_6.jpg', '1566_House-Villa_7.jpg', '1566_House-Villa_8.jpg'),
(1567, 'Ante', 'Buljan', '', '099/768-5232', '', 'Split', 'Nazorov prilaz 6  Split, z.u. 1442', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '500', '0', '83', 2, '100000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 3, 1, 'February 11, 2016', '<p>Apartman na Marjanu, u suterenu kuæe na odliènoj poziciji.&nbsp;Nalazi se samo nekoliko minuta udaljenosti od centra povijesnog grada Splita, dok je park &scaron;uma Marjan gdje se nalaze rekreacijska zona i prekrasne pla¾e udaljena nekoliko minuta &scaron;etnje.&nbsp;Apartman zahtijeva kompletnu renovaciju, te ima povr&scaron;inu 83 m2.&nbsp;Postoji moguænost spajanja s apartmanom povrh (takoðer od 83 m2) u jednu stambenu jedinicu.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>We have this apartment in a great location on Marjan.&nbsp;It is located just a short distance from the centre of the historic city of Split, while the recreational area and beautiful beaches are just a few minutes walk. A perfect location to anyone renting a property for holiday. The distance from the sea 500 m. The apartment requires a complete internal renovation, and has a floor surface of 83 m2.&nbsp;There is the opportunity of connecting this property with apartment above (also 83 m2) in a single housing unit.</p>', '', '<p>Apartman na Marjanu, u suterenu kuæe na odliènoj poziciji.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nalazi se samo nekoliko minuta udaljenosti od centra povijesnog grada Splita, dok je park &scaron;uma Marjan gdje se nalaze rekreacijska zona i prekrasne pla¾e udaljena nekoliko minuta &scaron;etnje.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Udaljen je od mora 500 m.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartman zahtijeva kompletnu renovaciju, te ima povr&scaron;inu 83 m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;"><br /></span></p>\r\n<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;">Postoji moguænost spajanja s apartmanom povrh (takoðer od 83 m2) u jednu stambenu jedinicu.</span></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Drugi apartman mo¾ete pogledati ovdje:</p>\r\n<p><a href="../hr/results/Split/Apartman/prodaja/1568.html">http://www.croatiapropertysales.com/hr/results/Split/Apartman/prodaja/1568.html</a></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>S obzirom na poziciju ovo je izvrsna prilika ukoliko ¾elite nekretninu renovirati u svrhu turistièkog iznajmljivanja ili je jednostavno ¾elite koristiti za vlastiti boravak.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Parking mjesto ispred kuæe, a vlasniku pripada i dio vrta.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Meðunarodni aerodrom udaljen je 40 min. vo¾nje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za sve dodatne informacije slobodno nas kontaktirajte.</p>', '<p>We have this apartment in a great location on Marjan.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is located just a short distance from the centre of the historic city of Split, while the recreational area and beautiful beaches are just a few minutes walk.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>A perfect location to anyone renting a property for holiday.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The distance from the sea 500 m.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The apartment requires a complete internal renovation, and has a floor surface of 83 m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;"><br /></span></p>\r\n<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;">There is the opportunity of connecting this property with apartment above (also 83 m2) in a single housing unit.&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The other apartment you can find here:&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><a href="../results/Split/Apartment/For-sale/1568.html">http://www.croatiapropertysales.com/results/Split/Apartment/For-sale/1568.html</a></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Due to this location, this is a great opportunity if you want to renovate the property for the purposes of tourism renting or simply want to use for your own room.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There is a parking space in front of the house, and part of the garden belongs to this apartment.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The international airport is 40 minutes. driving.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For further information please contact our agents in the Split office.</p>', '', '1567_Apartment_0.jpg', '1567_Apartment_1.jpg', '1567_Apartment_2.jpg', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(1568, 'Ante', 'Buljan', '', '099/768-5232', '', 'Split', 'Nazorov prilaz 6  Split, z.u. 1442', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '500', '25', '83', 2, '220000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 3, 1, 'February 11, 2016', '<p>Atraktivan apartman na Marjanu, u visokom prizemlju kuæe na odliènoj poziciji.&nbsp;Apartman ima stambenu povr&scaron;inu 83 m2, a sastoji se od 3 spavaæe sobe, kupaonice, prostranog dnevnog boravka ju¾ne orijentacije, te kuhinje s blagovaonicom.&nbsp;Postoji moguænost spajanja s apartmanom ispod (takoðer povr&scaron;ine od 83 m2) u jednu stambenu jedinicu.&nbsp;S obzirom na poziciju ovo je izvrsna prilika ukoliko ¾elite nekretninu renovirati u svrhu turistièkog iznajmljivanja ili je jednostavno ¾elite koristiti za vlastiti boravak.</p>', '<p>We are offering this attractive apartment on Marjan, on the high ground floor of the house in a prime position. The apartment has a living area of 83 m2.&nbsp;There is also the possibility of connecting this property with the apartment below in a single housing unit. Due to its position this is a great opportunity if you want to renovate the property for the purposes of tourism renting or simply want to use for your own room. The price includes the garage of 25 m2.&nbsp;</p>', '', '<p>Atraktivan apartman na Marjanu, u visokom prizemlju kuæe na odliènoj poziciji.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartman je vema osunèan, a iz svake prostorije se pru¾a pogled na vrt i zelenilo.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nalazi se samo nekoliko minuta udaljenosti od centra povijesnog grada Splita, dok je park &scaron;uma Marjan gdje se nalaze rekreacijska zona i prekrasne pla¾e udaljena samo nekoliko minuta &scaron;etnje.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je udaljena od mora 500 m.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartman ima stambenu povr&scaron;inu 83 m2, a sastoji se od 3 spavaæe sobe, kupaonice, prostranog dnevnog boravka ju¾ne orijentacije, te kuhinje s blagovaonicom.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;"><br /></span></p>\r\n<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;">Postoji moguænost spajanja s apartmanom ispod (takoðer povr&scaron;ine od 83 m2) u jednu stambenu jedinicu.</span></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Drugi apartman mo¾ete pogledati ovdje:</p>\r\n<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;"><a href="../hr/results/Split/Apartman/prodaja/1567.html">http://www.croatiapropertysales.com/hr/results/Split/Apartman/prodaja/1567.html</a><br /></span></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>S obzirom na poziciju ovo je izvrsna prilika ukoliko ¾elite nekretninu renovirati u svrhu turistièkog iznajmljivanja ili je jednostavno ¾elite koristiti za vlastiti boravak.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Jedno parking mjesto se nalazi ispred kuæe, a vlasniku pripada i veæi dio vrta.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U cijenu ulazi i gara¾a od 25 m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Meðunarodni aerodrom udaljen je 40 min. vo¾nje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za sve dodatne informacije slobodno nas kontaktirajte.</p>', '<p>We are offering this attractive apartment on Marjan, on the high ground floor of the house in a prime position.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The apartment is very sunny, and from every room offers a view of the garden.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is located just a short distance from the historic centre of the city of Split, while the park-forest where there are recreational attractions and beautiful beaches only a few minutes walk.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The distance from the sea is 500 m.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The apartment has a living area of 83 m2 and consists of 3 bedrooms, bathroom, living room and a kitchen with a dining area.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;"><br /></span></p>\r\n<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;">There is also the possibility of connecting this property with the apartment below (also an area of 83 m2) in a single housing unit.</span></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The other apartment see here:</p>\r\n<p><a href="../results/Split/Apartment/For-sale/1567.html">http://www.croatiapropertysales.com/results/Split/Apartment/For-sale/1567.html</a></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Due to its position this is a great opportunity if you want to renovate the property for the purposes of tourism renting or simply want to use for your own room.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There is one parking space in front of the house, and the owner is entitled to enjoy the remainder of the garden.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The price includes the garage of 25 m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The international airport is 40 minutes. driving.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For further information please contact our office and agents in Split.</p>', '', '1568_Apartment_0.jpg', '1568_Apartment_1.jpg', '1568_Apartment_2.jpg', '1568_Apartment_3.jpg', '1568_Apartment_4.jpg', '1568_Apartment_5.jpg', '1568_Apartment_6.jpg', '1568_Apartment_7.jpg', '1568_Apartment_8.jpg');
