(1569, 'Frano', 'Zanki', '091 7230257 ', '091/723-0257 kæer zvat', 'marcella.zanki@gmail.com  ', 'Split', 'TRG HRVATSKE BRATSKE ZAJEDNICE 3B, Globo, z.u. 16362', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '500', '75', '131', 1, '340000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 3, 2, 'February 15, 2016', '<p>Predivan penthouse s pogledom na more u sredi&scaron;tu Splita.&nbsp;Sveukupna stambena povr&scaron;ina stanova iznosi 131 m2, dok sama terasa ima povr&scaron;inu 75 m2.&nbsp;Stan je dvoeta¾an (5. i 6. kat), a nalazi se u zgradi s liftom.&nbsp;U sklopu gornje eta¾e je prostrana terasa s prekrasnim pogledom na grad, koja okru¾uje dnevni boravak i blagovaonicu sa staklenim "zidom" sta cini gornju eta¾u jako osvjetljenom i prozraènom.</p>', '<p>We are pleased to have this beautiful penthouse in the heart of the town with sea views and wide balcony.&nbsp;Property has two floors (5th and 6th floor), located in a building with an elevator (lift).&nbsp;The total floor space amounts to 131 m2, while the roof terrace itself&nbsp;&nbsp;has a surface of 75 m2 which is comfortably wide enough for lounging furniture and family alfresco meals.&nbsp;</p>', '', '<p>Predivan penthouse s pogledom na more u sredi&scaron;tu Splita.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nalazi se samo 5 minuta &scaron;etnje od centra povijesnog grada Splita, dok su u samom kvartu dostupni svi potrebni sadr¾aji.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Stan je dvoeta¾an (5. i 6. kat), a nalazi se u zgradi s liftom.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Donja eta¾a sastoji se od tri spavaæe sobe i kupaonice sa jacuzzijem.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Gornja eta¾a je prostrani dnevni boravak u kojoj se nalazi kamin, spojen sa blagovaonicom, te kuhinja izdvojena &scaron;ankom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na gornjoj eta¾i odmah do ulaza je i odvojen mali WC s tu&scaron;em.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sveukupna stambena povr&scaron;ina stanova iznosi 131 m2, dok sama terasa ima povr&scaron;inu 75 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U sklopu gornje eta¾e je prostrana terasa s prekrasnim pogledom na grad, koja okru¾uje dnevni boravak i blagovaonicu sa staklenim "zidom" sta cini gornju eta¾u jako osvjetljenom i prozraènom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Moguæe kupiti i gara¾u u zgradi, koja je takoðer povezana liftom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>S obzirom na prostranost stana te lokaciju ovo je izvrsna prilika.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Meðunarodni aerodrom udaljen je 40 min. vo¾nje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za sve dodatne informacije slobodno nas kontaktirajte.</p>', '<p>We are pleased to have this beautiful penthouse in the heart of the town with sea views and wide balcony.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is located just 5 minutes walk from the centre of the old historic town of Split, while the neighbourhood is walking distance from all the cultural and historic attractions that tourists enjoy, as well as the best restaurants and bars in the palace.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Property has two floors (5th and 6th floor), located in a building&nbsp;&nbsp;with an elevator (lift).&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The lower floor consists of three bedrooms and a bathroom with a Jacuzzi.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The upper floor has a spacious living room with a beautifully designed&nbsp;&nbsp;fireplace, which is connected to the kitchen and dining room.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the upper floor there is also a separate small bathroom with a shower.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The total floor space amounts to 131 m2, while the roof terrace itself has a surface of 75 m2 which is comfortably wide enough for lounging furniture and family alfresco meals.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>This spacious terrace, overlooking the city, surrounds the living and dining room with a glass "wall" what makes the upper floor very light and airy.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property is well decorated with an interior designer assisting and the fittings appropriate for this well presented property.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is possible to buy a garage in the building.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Given the spaciousness of the apartment and the location, this is a great and unusual opportunity.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The international airport is 40 minutes. driving.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For further information please contact our office in Split.</p>', '', '1569_Apartment_0.jpg', '1569_Apartment_1.jpg', '1569_Apartment_2.jpg', '1569_Apartment_3.jpg', '1569_Apartment_4.jpg', '1569_Apartment_5.jpg', '1569_Apartment_6.jpg', '1569_Apartment_7.jpg', '1569_Apartment_8.jpg'),
(1570, 'Karmela', 'Lukinoviæ', '(021) 34 61 15     ', '098 909 2788', 'igornobilo@yahoo.com 098/411-171', 'Split', 'Rijeèka 12  Split, z.u. 6838', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '200', '0', '140', 1, '350000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 3, 2, 'February 15, 2016', '<p>Prostran apartman s pogledom na centar grada i na Marjan, na treæem katu stambene zgrade u mirnom podruèju.&nbsp;Nalazi se samo nekoliko minuta udaljenosti od centra povijesnog grada Splita i od mora.&nbsp;Orijentacija jug &ndash; sjever &ndash; zapad.&nbsp;Ovo je izvrsna prilika ukoliko ¾elite nekretninu renovirati u svrhu turistièkog iznajmljivanja ili je jednostavno ¾elite koristiti za vlastiti boravak.&nbsp;Apartman ima stambenu povr&scaron;inu 140 m2 i 30 m2 balkona.</p>', '<p>We have this very spacious apartment overlooking the city centre and Marjan park, on the third floor of this stylish ''art deco'' building. The apartment has an area of 140 m2 and consists of three bedrooms, two bathrooms, a living room, kitchen, dining room, and 2 balconies (30 m2) with beautiful views. Orientation south - north - west. This is a great opportunity if you want to redecorate and modernise a property and use it for the purposes of tourism and renting.&nbsp;</p>', '', '<p>Prostran apartman s pogledom na centar grada i na Marjan, na treæem katu stambene zgrade u mirnom podruèju.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nalazi se samo nekoliko minuta udaljenosti od centra povijesnog grada Splita i od mora.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartman ima stambenu povr&scaron;inu 140 m2, a sastoji se od 3 spavaæe sobe, 2 kupaonice, dnevnog boravka, kuhinje, &nbsp;blagovaonice, te 2 balkona (30 m2) s prekrasnim pogledom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Orijentacija jug &ndash; sjever &ndash; zapad.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ovo je izvrsna prilika ukoliko ¾elite nekretninu renovirati u svrhu turistièkog iznajmljivanja ili je jednostavno ¾elite koristiti za vlastiti boravak.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Parking ispred zgrade.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Stanu pripada i ostava u prizemlju.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Meðunarodni aerodrom udaljen je 40 min. vo¾nje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za sve dodatne informacije molimo kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured u Splitu.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>We have this very spacious apartment overlooking the city centre and Marjan park, on the third floor of this stylish ''art deco'' building.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is located within walking distance from the historic city of Split and the sea.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The apartment has a living area of 140 m2 and consists of three bedrooms, two bathrooms, a living room, kitchen, dining room, and 2 balconies (30 m2) with beautiful views.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Orientation south - north - west.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>This is a great opportunity if you want to redecorate and modernise a property and use it for the purposes of tourism and renting.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There is plenty of space inside the flat for visitors wanting more comfort and space, the building is attractive and stylish, and it''s location is perfect.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There is parking in front of the public.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The international airport is 40 minutes. driving.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For further information please contact our office in Split.</p>', '', '1570_Apartment_0.jpg', '1570_Apartment_1.jpg', '1570_Apartment_2.jpg', '1570_Apartment_3.jpg', '1570_Apartment_4.jpg', '1570_Apartment_5.jpg', '1570_Apartment_6.jpg', '', ''),
(1571, 'Stefani', 'Kupre¹anin', '004915 233 673 154', '0921822070', '', 'Trogir', 'Put Rudeja 10 Okrug Donji, 2113/76 k.o. Okrug', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '20', '664', '340', 1, '650000', '', 2, 2, 2, 1, 1, 2, 8, 5, 'February 18, 2016', '<p>Atraktivna nekretnina u 1.redu do mora sa direktnim pristupom na pla¾u koju koriste samo vlasnici nekoliko susjednih kuæa.&nbsp;Ispred kuæe se nalazi kamenita pla¾a, ali je u blizini i &scaron;ljunèana.&nbsp;Zemlij&scaron;te na kojem je smje&scaron;tena kuæa ima povr&scaron;inu 664 m2.&nbsp;Ukupna povr&scaron;ina kuæe iznosi 340 m2 (230 m2 + balkoni 110 m2).&nbsp;U suterenu je smje&scaron;ten studio apartman koji se takoðer mo¾e koristiti kao spremi&scaron;te ili recepcija.&nbsp;U kuæi su trenutno ukupno 4 apartmana koji su u funkciji turistièkog iznajmljivanja.</p>', '<p>We are offering this attractive and well presented apartment property in the 1st row to the sea with direct access to the beach. The land plot on which the house is built has an area of 664 m2. The garden is arranged in terraces, and there is plenty of opportunity and space to improve the property-and its value-by building a swimming pool. The total area inside the property is 340 m2 (230 m2 + balconies 110 m2). The house is split into 4 apartments and it is currently being used to rent to tourists commercially.</p>', '', '<p>Atraktivna nekretnina u 1.redu do mora sa direktnim pristupom na pla¾u koju koriste samo vlasnici nekoliko susjednih kuæa.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ispred kuæe se nalazi kamenita pla¾a, ali je u blizini i &scaron;ljunèana.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je smje&scaron;tena na sve popularnijem otoku Èiovu koji se nalazi u blizini aerodroma i povijesnih gradova Trogira i Splita.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Zemlij&scaron;te na kojem je smje&scaron;tena kuæa ima povr&scaron;inu 664 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Vrt je kaskadno ureðen gdje takoðer postoji moguænost izgradnje bazena.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ispred kuæe se nalazi prostrani parking za cca. 7 automobila.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ukupna povr&scaron;ina kuæe iznosi 340 m2 (230 m2 + balkoni 110 m2).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U suterenu je smje&scaron;ten studio apartman koji se takoðer mo¾e koristiti kao spremi&scaron;te ili recepcija.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U prizemlju je apartman u kojem se nalazi ulazni dio, hodnik, kupaonica, wc, kuhinja sa blagovaonicom i dnevnim boravkom, 2 spavaæe sobe i terasa povr&scaron;ine 75 m2 sa koje se pru¾a pogled na more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na prvom katu je apartman koji ima 3 spavaæe sobe, ulazni dio, hodnik, kupaonicu, kuhinju sa blagovaonicom i 2 balkona sa pogledom na more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na 2.katu je 2-sobni apartman sa ulaznim dijelom, hodnikom, manjom sobom, kupaonicom i kuhinjom sa blagovaonicom i dnevnim boravkom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na istom katu se nalaze 3 balkona.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Potkrovlje trenutno nije u funkciji stambenog dijela.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U kuæi su trenutno 4 apartmana koji su u funkciji turistièkog iznajmljivanja.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nekretninu mo¾ete pro&scaron;iriti kupnjom zemlji&scaron;ta koje se nalazi sa gornje strane na samom ulazu odmah do parkinga:<br /><a href="We are offering this attractive and well presented apartment property in the 1st row to the sea with direct access to the beach.  The house is located with the sea through the gate at the bottom of the garden, where there is clear water and a pebble floor. It is on the island of Ciovo, increasingly popular and which is located near the airport and the historic cities of Trogir and Split.  The land plot on which the house is built has an area of 664 m2. The garden is arranged in terraces, and there is plenty of opportunity and space to improve the property, - and its value- by building a swimming pool.  The house has a spacious parking lot for approx. 7 cars.  The total area inside the property is 340 m2 (230 m2 + balconies 110 m2).  In the basement there is a studio apartment which can also be used as a storage room or reception area.  The ground floor apartment where there is a hallway, bathroom, toilet, kitchen, dining room and living room, two bedrooms and a terrace of 75 m2 with a view of the sea.    On the first floor there is an apartment which has 3 bedrooms, hallway, hallway, bathroom, kitchen, dining room and 2 balconies overlooking the sea.    On the 2nd floor there is a 2 bedroom apartment. Through the front door there is a hall and a smaller room, bathroom and kitchen with dining room and living room. On the same floor there are 3 balconies.  Attic not in use at the residential section.  The house is split into 4 apartments and it is currently being used to rent to tourists commercially. It is in good condition and would need little investment should a new owner wish to continue the business.  There is land for sale adjacent to the building, full details here.  http:/www.croatiapropertysales.com/results/Trogir/Land-plot/For-sale/847.html   We are available for any additional questions. Please contact our office in Split.">http://www.croatiapropertysales.com/results/Trogir/Land-plot/For-sale/847.html</a></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ostajemo na usluzi za sva dodatna pitanja.</p>', '<p>We are offering this attractive and well presented apartment property in the 1st row to the sea with direct access to the beach.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house is located with the sea through the gate at the bottom of the garden, where there is clear water and a pebble floor.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is on the island of Ciovo, increasingly popular and which is located near the airport and the historic cities of Trogir and Split.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The land plot on which the house is built has an area of 664 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The garden is arranged in terraces, and there is plenty of opportunity and space to improve the property - and its value - by building a swimming pool.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house has a spacious parking lot for approx. 7 cars.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The total area inside the property is 340 m2 (230 m2 + balconies 110 m2).&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>In the basement there is a studio apartment which can also be used as a storage room or reception area.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The ground floor apartment where there is a hallway, bathroom, kitchen, dining room and living room, two bedrooms and a terrace of 75 m2 with a view of the sea.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the first floor there is an apartment which has 3 bedrooms, hallway, bathroom, kitchen, dining room and 2 balconies overlooking the sea.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the 2nd floor there is a 2 bedroom apartment.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Through the front door there is a hall and a smaller room, bathroom and kitchen with dining room and living room.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the same floor there are 3 balconies.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Attic not in use at the residential section.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house is split into 4 apartments and it is currently being used to rent to tourists commercially.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is in good condition and would need little investment should a new owner wish to continue the business.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There is land for sale adjacent to the building, full details here:</p>\r\n<p><a href="toilet">http://www.croatiapropertysales.com/results/Trogir/Land-plot/For-sale/847.html</a></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>We are available for any additional questions.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact our office in Split.</p>', '', '1571_House-Villa_0.jpg', '1571_House-Villa_1.jpg', '1571_House-Villa_2.jpg', '1571_House-Villa_3.jpg', '1571_House-Villa_4.jpg', '1571_House-Villa_5.jpg', '1571_House-Villa_6.jpg', '1571_House-Villa_7.jpg', '1571_House-Villa_8.jpg'),
(1572, '', 'Zeleni brijeg d.o.o', '', 'Franz', 'z.brijeg@gmail.com', 'Primosten', 'Primo¹ten odmah kod magistrale', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '200', '0', '67', 1, '142000', '', 2, 1, 2, 2, 1, 2, 2, 1, 'February 18, 2016', '<p>Luksuzni apartmani u izgradnji na svega 5 min hoda do centra mjesta i lijepo ureðene pla¾e. Panoramski pogled na more i Primo&scaron;ten èine ove apartmane izuzetnom prilikom. Zavr&scaron;etak gradnje se oèekuje krajem 5. mjeseca 2016. godine.&nbsp;Unutar zgrade u suterenu nalaze se i gara¾e kao i zajednièke prostorije. Aerodrom je udaljen svega 35 km.</p>', '<p>These are luxury apartments in a new building, just 5 minutes'' walk to the town centre and beautiful beaches on the mainland at Primosten. From the apartments there are panoramic views of the sea and the village of Primo&scaron;ten which give these apartments great value and appeal. It is large enough to have thriving family run cafes and bars, but more of a family destination for quiet holidays, rather than the crowded centres like Split. Completion of the project will be by the end of &nbsp;May 2016!<br /><br /></p>', '', '<p>Luksuzni apartmani u izgradnji na svega 5 min hoda do centra mjesta i lijepo ureðene pla¾e.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Panoramski pogled na more i Primo&scaron;ten èine ove apartmane izuzetnom prilikom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Zavr&scaron;etak gradnje se oèekuje krajem 5. mjeseca 2016. godine.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong><span style="text-decoration: underline;">Suteren</span></strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>A1</strong> &ndash; dvije spavaæe sobe, kuhinja, dnevni boravak i blagovaonica, kupaonica, terasa (netto povr&scaron;ina 10,32 m2)</p>\r\n<p>Ukupna netto povr&scaron;ina 67,21 m2 - CIJENA 2100 eura/m2</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong><span style="text-decoration: underline;">Prizemlje</span></strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>A2 </strong>- dvije spavaæe sobe, kuhinja, dnevni boravak i blagovaonica, kupaonica, terasa (netto povr&scaron;ina 10,32 m2)</p>\r\n<p>Ukupna netto povr&scaron;ina 67,21 m2 - CIJENA 2200 eura/m2</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>A3</strong> - dvije spavaæe sobe, kuhinja, dnevni boravak i blagovaonica, kupaonica, terasa (netto povr&scaron;ina 11,67 m2)</p>\r\n<p>Ukupna netto povr&scaron;ina 67,38 m2 - CIJENA 2200 eura/m2</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong><span style="text-decoration: underline;">Prvi kat</span></strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>A4</strong> - dvije spavaæe sobe, kuhinja, dnevni boravak i blagovaonica, kupaonica, terasa (netto povr&scaron;ina 10,32 m2)</p>\r\n<p>Ukupna netto povr&scaron;ina 67,21 m2 - CIJENA 2300 eura/m2</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>A5</strong> - dvije spavaæe sobe, kuhinja, dnevni boravak i blagovaonica, kupaonica, terasa (netto povr&scaron;ina 11,67 m2)</p>\r\n<p>Ukupna netto povr&scaron;ina 67,38 m2 - CIJENA 2300 eura/m2</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;"><strong>Drugi kat</strong></span></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>A6</strong> - dvije spavaæe sobe, kuhinja, dnevni boravak i blagovaonica, kupaonica, terasa (netto povr&scaron;ina 10,32 m2)</p>\r\n<p>Ukupna netto povr&scaron;ina 67,21 m2 - CIJENA 2300 eura/m2</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>A7 </strong>- dvije spavaæe sobe, kuhinja, dnevni boravak i blagovaonica, kupaonica, terasa (netto povr&scaron;ina 11,67 m2)</p>\r\n<p>Ukupna netto povr&scaron;ina 67,38 m2 - CIJENA 2300 eura/m2</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Unutar zgrade u suterenu nalaze se i gara¾e kao i zajednièke prostorije.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Aerodrom je udaljen svega 35 km.</p>', '<p>These are luxury apartments in a new building - just 5 minutes'' walk to the town centre and beautiful beaches on the mainland at Primosten.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>From the apartments there are panoramic views of the sea and the village of Primo&scaron;ten which give these apartments great value and appeal.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Primosten is a very attractive village.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Off the main tourist route, but popular with many visitors who return every year.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is large enough to have thriving family run cafes and bars, but more of a family destination for quiet holidays, rather than the crowded centres like Split.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Completion of the project will be by the end of May 2016!</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong><span style="text-decoration: underline;">Basement</span></strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>A1</strong> - two bedrooms, kitchen, living room and dining room, bathroom,&nbsp;terrace (net area 10.32 m2)</p>\r\n<p>The total net area of 67.21 m2 - PRICE&nbsp;2100 EUR / m2</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong><span style="text-decoration: underline;">Ground floor</span></strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>A2</strong> - two bedrooms, kitchen, living room and dining room, bathroom,&nbsp;terrace (net area 10.32 m2)</p>\r\n<p>The total net area of 67.21 m2 - PRICE&nbsp;2200 EUR / m2</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>A3</strong> - two bedrooms, kitchen, living room and dining room, bathroom,&nbsp;terrace (net area 11.67 m2)</p>\r\n<p>The total net area of 67.38 m2 - PRICE&nbsp;2200 EUR / m2</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong><span style="text-decoration: underline;">First floor</span></strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>A4</strong> - two bedrooms, kitchen, living room and dining room, bathroom,&nbsp;terrace (net area 10.32 m2)</p>\r\n<p>The total net area of 67.21 m2 - PRICE&nbsp;2300 EUR / m2</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>A5 </strong>- two bedrooms, kitchen, living room and dining room, bathroom,&nbsp;terrace (net area 11.67 m2)</p>\r\n<p>The total net area of 67.38 m2 - PRICE&nbsp;2300 EUR / m2</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong><span style="text-decoration: underline;">Second floor</span></strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>A6</strong> - two bedrooms, kitchen, living room and dining room, bathroom,&nbsp;terrace (net area 10.32 m2)</p>\r\n<p>The total net area of 67.21 m2 - PRICE&nbsp;2300 EUR / m2</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>A7</strong> - two bedrooms, kitchen, living room and dining room, bathroom,&nbsp;terrace (net area 11.67 m2)</p>\r\n<p>The total net area of 67.38 m2 - PRICE&nbsp;2300 EUR / m2</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Inside the building on the ground floor there are garages and common&nbsp;areas.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The airport is only 35 km.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Pls call our office to arrange to visit them and talk with our agents.</p>', '', '1572_Apartment_0.jpg', '1572_Apartment_1.jpg', '1572_Apartment_2.jpg', '1572_Apartment_3.jpg', '1572_Apartment_4.jpg', '1572_Apartment_5.jpg', '1572_Apartment_6.jpg', '1572_Apartment_7.jpg', '1572_Apartment_8.jpg'),
(1573, 'Nerio', 'Koljanin', '', '098859217', 'nerio.koljanin@gmail.com', 'Rogoznica', 'Lozica Rogoznica', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '80', '0', '56', 1, '106000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 'February 18, 2016', '<p>Apartman u prizemlju zgrade s pripadajuæom terasom i izlazom u vrt. Nalazi se u mirnoj uvali nedaleko od centra mjesta i svih potrebnih sadr¾aja (restorana, kafiæa, pijace, trgovina). Povr&scaron;ina apartmana je 56 m2. Lijepo ureðene pla¾e nalaze se na svega 80 m od apartmana. S obzirom da se s terase mo¾e izaæi u vrt zgrade ovaj apartman pru¾a do¾ivljaj kuæe i idelan je za sve koji imaju kuæne ljubimce. Apartman ima svu potrebnu infrastrukturu (voda, struja, kanalizacija).</p>', '<p>This is an apartment on the ground floor with a terrace and garden. The apartment size is 56 m2. There are beautifully kept beaches only 80 m from the property - no more that a two minutes walk. Given that from the terrace there is access to the garden of the building this apartment lends itself to the person who has pets, or those who bring their pets on holiday. The apartment has all the necessary infrastructure (water, electricity, sewage) is well decorated and has been well maintained.</p>', '', '<p>Apartman u prizemlju zgrade s pripadajuæom terasom i izlazom u vrt zgrade, nalazi se u mirnoj uvali nedaleko od centra mjesta i svih potrebnih sadr¾aja (restorana, kafiæa, pijace, trgovina).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Povr&scaron;ina apartmana je 56 m2, a sastoji se od dvije spavaæe sobe, kuhinje s dnevnim boravkom i kupaonice.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Lijepo ureðene pla¾e nalaze se na svega 80 m od apartmana.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>S obzirom da se s terase mo¾e izaæi u vrt zgrade ovaj apartman pru¾a do¾ivljaj kuæe i idelan je za sve koji imaju kuæne ljubimce.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartman ima svu potrebnu infrastrukturu (voda, struja, kanalizacija).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Osigurano je jedno parking mjesto za apartman.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Aerodrom je udaljen 30 km.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za dodatne informacije molimo kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured u Splitu.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>This is an apartment on the ground floor with a terrace and garden.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is located in a quiet cove near the village centre where there are many useful facilities and attractions such as restaurants, cafes, markets, shops etc.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The apartment size is 56 m2 and consists of two large bedrooms, an open plan kitchen, living room and bathroom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There are beautifully kept beaches only 80 m from the property - no more that a two minutes walk.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Given that from the terrace there is access to the garden of the building this apartment lends itself to the person who has pets, or those who bring their pets on holiday.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The apartment has all the necessary infrastructure (water, electricity,sewage) is well decorated and has been well maintained.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There is one parking space per apartment.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The airport is 30 km away.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>BUY ME !</p>', '', '1573_Apartment_0.jpg', '1573_Apartment_1.jpg', '1573_Apartment_2.jpg', '1573_Apartment_3.jpg', '1573_Apartment_4.jpg', '1573_Apartment_5.jpg', '1573_Apartment_6.jpg', '', ''),
(1574, 'Ilija', 'Kasalo', '', '0912227899', 'jelena.kasalo@inet.hr', 'Trogir', 'Ulica Bla¾enong Augustina Ka¾otiæa 15  Mastrinka - ®edno, 759/5, 759/246 ', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '570', '400', '78', 1, '160000', '', 2, 1, 2, 2, 1, 2, 1, 1, 'February 19, 2016', '<p>Samostojeæa kuæa sa prekrasnim panoramskim pogledom!&nbsp;Smje&scaron;tena je na sjevernoj strani Èiova u mirnom okru¾enju idealnom za odmor. Zbog sve veæe popularnosti otoka, nekretnina je idealna i za turistièko iznajmljivanje.&nbsp;Postoji moguænost izgradnje jo&scaron; jedne eta¾e.&nbsp;Dvori&scaron;te je dovoljno prostrano za izgradnju bazena velièine cca. 30 m2.&nbsp;Kuæa se sastoji od suterena/podruma i prizemlja ukupne povr&scaron;ine 78 m2.</p>', '<p>House on a large plot with outstanding views. This is two bedroom property designed with a modern open plan kitchen, lounge and dining area, with windows leading directly onto a terrace and with useful extra storage space in the cellar. The land plot is big enough for a pool of approx. 30 m2. And the property could be expanded later by adding an additional floor. The internal floor area is 78m sq. The sea and the clean and clear water by the beach is approx. 570 m distant.&nbsp;</p>', '', '<p>Samostojeæa kuæa sa prekrasnim panoramskim pogledom!!</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Smje&scaron;tena je na sjevernoj strani Èiova u mirnom okru¾enju idealnom za odmor.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Zbog sve veæe popularnosti otoka, nekretnina je idealna i za turistièko iznajmljivanje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Grad Trogir udaljen je cca. 10 minuta vo¾nje, dok je velika prednost i blizina meðunarodnog aerodroma.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je trenutno u visokom roh bau stanju sa svim prikljuècima.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Postoji moguænost izgradnje jo&scaron; jedne eta¾e.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Dvori&scaron;te je dovoljno prostrano za izgradnju bazena velièine cca. 30 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa se sastoji od suterena/podruma i prizemlja ukupne povr&scaron;ine 78 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U suterenu je jedna prostorija, a u prizemlju se nalazi dnevni dio sa kuhinjom, hodnik, kupaonica i 2 spavaæe sobe.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ispred se takoðer nalazi i terasa.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Udaljenost do mora i ureðene &scaron;ljunèane pla¾e je cca. 570 m.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Iako se ne nalazi direktno uz more ima veliku prednost prekrasnog pogleda i iznimnog mira.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Trgovina i ostali sadr¾aji se nalaze u blizini.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ostajemo na usluzi za sva dodatna pitanja.</p>', '<p>House on a large plot with outstanding views!</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>This is two bedroom property designed with a modern open plan kitchen, lounge and dining area, with windows leading directly onto a terrace and with useful extra storage space in the cellar.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is situated on the northern side of Ciovo Island, in a peaceful and relaxing environment only a few minutes by car from the shore, but utterly silent and with long and interesting views over the sea and mainland.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Due to the increasing popularity of the island, the property would be ideal for tourism rentals.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Trogir centre is approx. 10 minutes away, with the big advantage that the airport is only 15 minutes drive.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house is being offered at a reduced price but much of the interior work needs to be completed.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>All the services are connected, but non of the sanitary fittings, kitchen, flooring or decorating.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The land plot is big enough for a pool of approx. 30 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>And the property could be expanded later by adding an additional floor.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The internal floor area is 78m sq.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The sea and the clean and clear water by the beach is approx. 570 m distant.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There are shops, cafes and other facilities located nearby.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>We remain available for any further questions.</p>', '', '1574_House-Villa_0.jpeg', '1574_House-Villa_1.jpeg', '1574_House-Villa_2.jpeg', '1574_House-Villa_3.jpeg', '1574_House-Villa_4.jpeg', '1574_House-Villa_5.jpeg', '1574_House-Villa_6.jpeg', '1574_House-Villa_7.jpeg', '1574_House-Villa_8.jpeg'),
(1575, 'Bernardica', 'Dragièeviæ', '+387 32 877162', '098 991 6491', '', 'Trogir', 'Put Mavarèice 41 Okrug Gornji, 914/10, zgr 1134', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '10', '881', '637', 1, '520000', '', 2, 2, 2, 1, 1, 2, 0, 0, 'February 19, 2016', '<p style="color: #f10d28;"><strong>EKSKLUZIVNA PRODAJA!</strong></p>\r\n<p style="color: #1d0006;">Samostojeæa kuæa u 1.redu do mora u jednoj od najljep&scaron;ih i najpopularnijih uvala na ju¾noj strani otoka Èiova. Mala pje&scaron;èana pla¾a udaljena je svega 10 m od kuæe dok je cijeli otok prepun prekrasnih pla¾a i uvala. Ukupna povr&scaron;ina zemlji&scaron;ta iznosi 881 m2 dok je brutto povr&scaron;ina kuæe 637 m2. Dvori&scaron;te je dovoljno prostrano za izradnju bazena i za kori&scaron;tenje u svrhu ugostiteljskog objekta. Kuæa se sastoji od prizemlja, 1.kata, 2.kata i potkrovlja.</p>', '<p style="color: #1d0105;"><strong style="color: #f10d2d;">EXCLUSIVE SALE !!!&nbsp;</strong>We have this detached house in the 1st row to the sea in one of the most beautiful and most popular coves on the south side of Ciovo. There is a small pebble beach only 10 meters from the house and the bay is one of the few areas that has a large sandy floor from here out to sea. The total land area is 881 m2 and the gross area of the house 637 m2. The yard/garden is very spacious and there is plenty of space to put a good size pool or make other improvements.&nbsp;The house consists of ground floor, 1st floor, 2nd and attic.</p>', '', '<p><strong style="color: #ed1127;">EKSKLUZIVNA PRODAJA !!!</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Samostojeæa kuæa u 1.redu do mora u jednoj od najljep&scaron;ih i najpopularnijih uvala na ju¾noj strani otoka Èiova.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Mala pje&scaron;èana pla¾a udaljena je svega 10 m od kuæe dok je cijeli otok prepun prekrasnih pla¾a i uvala.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Zbog izuzetnog polo¾aja kuæa je idealna za svrhu turistièkog iznajmljivanja.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Takoðer je u prizemlju pripremljen i prostor za restoran ili slièan ugostiteljski posao.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ukupna povr&scaron;ina zemlji&scaron;ta iznosi 881 m2 dok je brutto povr&scaron;ina kuæe 637 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Dvori&scaron;te je dovoljno prostrano za izradnju bazena i za kori&scaron;tenje u svrhu ugostiteljskog objekta.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa se sastoji od prizemlja, 1.kata, 2.kata i potkrovlja.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U prizemlju &nbsp;se nalazi vi&scaron;e nedovr&scaron;enih prostorija u roh bau stanju koje su predviðene za restoran.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na 1.katu se nalaze dnevni boravak + kuhinja + blagovaonica, 1 soba, kupaonica i terasa sa pogledom na more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Dio kata je ureðen i spreman za kori&scaron;tenje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na 1.katu nalaze se 3 apartmana od koji se svaki sastoji od kuhinje, 1 spavaæe sobe, kupaonice i balkona sa prekrasnim pogledom na more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ova eta¾a je ureðena i moguæe ju je koristiti.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na 3.katu (potkrovlju) nalazi se 1 velika prostorija (roh-bau) i 2 balkona.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Moguæe je preureðenje u 1 veliki ili 2 manja apartmana.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ispred kuæe nalazi se parking za 3 automobila.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Vanjska fasada kuæe je obnovljena 2016. god., dok je unutarnji dio potrebno adaptirati.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Centar mjesta gdje se nalaze svi potrebni sadr¾ani udaljen je 3 min. vo¾nje, dok je meðunarodni aerodrom udaljen 20 min. vo¾nje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ukoliko ¾elite vi&scaron;e informacija za ovu izuzetnu nekretninu, slobodno nas kontaktirajte.</p>', '<p><strong style="color: #f8061e;">EXCLUSIVE SALE !!!&nbsp;</strong></p>\r\n<p>We have this detached house in the 1st row to the sea in one of the most beautiful and most popular coves on the south side of Ciovo.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There is a small pebble beach only 10 meters from the house and the bay is one of the few areas that has a large sandy floor from here out to sea.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is possible to walk along the shore from here to many private bays and secluded beaches.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Within a short walk is also the local diving school and the village water polo team play every week 50 m or so along the coast.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Due to the exceptional location, next to the beach and the miniature harbour, the house is ideal for the purpose of tourist rental.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The ground floor has been designed to consider a future use as a restaurant or similar catering business.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The total land area is 881 m2 and the gross area of the house 637 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The yard/garden is very spacious and there is plenty of space to put a good size pool or make other improvements.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house consists of ground floor, 1st floor, 2nd and attic.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The ground floor has several unfinished rooms which would become the restaurant, or extra residential space.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the 1st floor there is a living room, kitchen, dining room, 1 bedroom, bathroom and terrace overlooking the sea.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Part of this floor is furnished and ready for use.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the 1st floor there are 3 apartments, with each having a kitchen, 1 bedroom, bathroom and balcony with sea view.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>This floor is completely finished and ready to use.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the 3rd floor (attic) there is one large room (unfinished) and 2 balconies.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is possible conversion into 1 big apartment or two smaller apartments.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house has parking for 3 cars.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The facade of the house was renovated 2016., while the interior of the house should be completely renovated.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The village centre where there are several useful shops, bakery, market, Dr''s etc is 3 min. driving, while the international airport is 20 minutes driving.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>If you want more information on this exceptional location property, please contact our offices in Split.</p>', '', '1575_House-Villa_0.JPG', '1575_House-Villa_1.JPG', '1575_House-Villa_2.JPG', '1575_House-Villa_3.jpg', '1575_House-Villa_4.jpg', '1575_House-Villa_5.jpg', '', '', ''),
(1648, 'Miroslav', 'Maro¹eviæ', 'g. Zlatko   -  099 22 99 856', '0911297761  gð.Suzana  - 091 513 6314   g. Zlatko ', 'marosevic.massa@gmail.com ', 'Rogoznica', 'Rg Nova VI odvojak  4, Br. è. 2021 zgr. K.o Rg', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '100', '0', '52', 1, '89000', '', 2, 1, 2, 2, 1, 2, 2, 1, 'April 8, 2016', '<p>U jednom od najljep&scaron;ih mjesta Jadrana, u blizini restorana, kafiæa, trgovina, a na svega 100 m udaljenosti od lijepo ureðene pla¾e nalazi se dvosobni apartman s èije terase se pru¾a prekrasan pogled na more.&nbsp;Apartman je ju¾ne orijentacije.&nbsp;Povr&scaron;ina apartmana je 52 m2, dok terasa ima povr&scaron;inu 11 m2.&nbsp;Apartman je smje&scaron;ten na prvom katu novije graðene zgrade.</p>', '<p>This is a well located apartment in one of the most beautiful places in the Adriatic Sea, close to restaurants, cafes, shops, and only 100 m away from the beach. The property is a two-bedroom apartment with a terrace which offers a breathtaking view of the sea. The apartment is facing south.&nbsp;Apartment size is 52 m2, while the terrace has a surface of 11 m2.&nbsp;It is situated on the first floor of this recently built building, boasting many modern features, such as the security doors, open plan design of the family area, and good sized bathroom.</p>', '', '<p>U jednom od najljep&scaron;ih mjesta Jadrana, u blizini restorana, kafiæa, trgovina, a na svega 100 m udaljenosti od lijepo ureðene pla¾e nalazi se dvosobni apartman s èije terase se pru¾a prekrasan pogled na more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartman je ju¾ne orijentacije.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Povr&scaron;ina apartmana je 52 m2, dok terasa &nbsp;ima povr&scaron;inu 11 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartman je smje&scaron;ten na prvom katu novije graðene zgrade.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sastoji se od dvije spavaæe sobe, kupaonice, dnevnog boravka i kuhinje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartman se prodaje s namje&scaron;tajem.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Okuænica zgrade je poploèana i odr¾avana.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartman ima svoje pripadajuæe parking mjesto.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Prisutna je sva potrebna infrastruktura.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Aerodrom je udaljen 28 km.</p>', '<p>This is a well located apartment in one of the most beautiful places in the Adriatic Sea, close to restaurants, cafes, shops, and only 100 m away from the beach.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property is a two-bedroom apartment with a terrace which offers a breathtaking view of the sea.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The apartment is facing south.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartment size is 52 m2, while the terrace has a surface of 11 m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is situated on the first floor of this recently built building, boasting many modern features, such as the security doors, open plan design of the family area, and good sized bathroom.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It consists of two bedrooms, bathroom, living room and kitchen.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The apartment is furnished.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The area around the building is paved and maintained.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The apartment has its own private parking place.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There are shops, bars, restaurants and other useful services near to the village, which caters well for tourists throughout the long season.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The airport is 28 km.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact our agents to arrange to visit this property.</p>', '', '1648_Apartment_0.JPG', '1648_Apartment_1.JPG', '1648_Apartment_2.JPG', '1648_Apartment_3.jpg', '1648_Apartment_4.jpg', '1648_Apartment_5.jpg', '1648_Apartment_6.jpg', '1648_Apartment_7.png', ''),
(1576, 'Nikola', '®ivkoviæ', 'Sestra Vinka 095515147', '0989678085', '', 'Rogoznica', 'Lozica II 7 Rogoznica, kè 20488/21 Ko Rogoznica', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '5', '342', '180', 1, '750000', '', 2, 1, 2, 1, 1, 2, 6, 4, 'February 22, 2016', '<p>Novoizgraðena vila nalazi se u prvom redu do mora, na svega par metara od pla¾e, u mirnoj uvali, a 15 minuta hoda do centra mjesta i svih potrebnih sadr¾aja.&nbsp;Povr&scaron;ina vile je netto 180 m2, a nalazi se na parceli povr&scaron;ine 342 m2.&nbsp;Dvije prostrane terase na svakom katu pru¾aju nesmetano u¾ivanje u prekrasnom pogledu na more i uvalu. Vila je podijeljena na prizemlje i dva kata.&nbsp;Ono &scaron;to ovu vilu èini jedinstvenom je prekrasan panoramski pogled na more i okolicu.</p>', '<p>This a newly built villa is located in the seafront, beautifully designed with wide terraces and balconies to make full use of its prime position on the sea. It is situated just a few meters from the beach, in a quiet bay, with a 15-minute walk distance to the city centre and to all necessary facilities. The villa area is 180 m2 net and is located on a plot of 342 m2. There are two wide terraces on each floor which provide secluded places to enjoy the sun enjoy the beautiful view of the sea and the bay. The villa is divided into three floors.</p>', '', '<p>Novoizgraðena vila nalazi se u prvom redu do mora, na svega par metara od pla¾e, u mirnoj uvali, a 15 minuta hoda do centra mjesta i svih potrebnih sadr¾aja (trgovina, vrhunskih restorana, pijace).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Povr&scaron;ina vile je netto 180 m2, brutto 304 m2 , a nalazi se na parceli povr&scaron;ine 342 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Dvije prostrane terase na svakom katu pru¾aju nesmetano u¾ivanje u prekrasnom pogledu na more i uvalu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Vila je podijeljena na prizemlje i dva kata.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U prizemlju ispod cijele kuæe su gara¾a i dvije ostave.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Prvi kat se sastoji od tri &nbsp;spavaæe sobe, prostranog dnevnog boravka povezanog s kuhinjom i blagovaonicom te dvije kupaonice.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na II katu se nalaze tri spavaæe sobe, dnevni boravak s kuhinjom i blagovaonicom i dvije kupaonice.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Prvi i drugi kat su povezani unutarnjim stepenicama.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ono &scaron;to ovu vilu èini jedinstvenom je prekrasan panoramski pogled na more i okolicu koji se pru¾a s prostranih terasa kao i iz ju¾no orijentiranih spavaæih soba i dnevnog boravka.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Vila je ju¾ne orijentacije.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Oko kuæe je lijepo ureðena i odr¾avana okuænica.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U sklopu parcele je parking &nbsp;koji vodi u gara¾u u koju se mo¾e smjestiti 5 auta.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U kupaonicama je provedeno podno grijanje, sve sobe su klimatizirane.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Aerodrom je udaljen 30 km.</p>', '<p>This a newly built villa is located in the seafront, beautifully designed with wide terraces and balconies to make full use of its prime position on the sea.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is situated just a few meters from the beach, in a quiet bay, with a 15-minute walk distance to the city centre and to all necessary facilities (shops, cafes, excellent restaurants, markets).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The villa area is 180 m2 net, gross 304 m2 and is located on a plot of 342 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There are two wide terraces on each floor which provide secluded places to enjoy the sun enjoy the beautiful view of the sea and the bay.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The villa is divided into three floors.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The ground floor beneath the entire house is a garage and two storage rooms.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The first floor consists of three bedrooms, a spacious living room with access outside and connected to the kitchen and dining room and two bathrooms.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the second floor there are three bedrooms, living room with kitchen and dining room and two bathrooms.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The first and second floor are connected by internal stairs.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The bathroom has under floor heating, and every room has air conditioning.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>What makes this villa unique is the breathtaking panoramic views of the sea and the countryside which stretches from the spacious terrace as well as from the south oriented bedrooms and living room.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The villa is facing south.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Around the house is beautifully landscaped and maintained garden.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It can accommodate 5 cars on the private area, with two of them in the garage.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Split international airport is 30 km.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact our office and speak with our agents for more information on this and similar properties.</p>', '', '1576_House-Villa_0.jpg', '1576_House-Villa_1.jpg', '1576_House-Villa_2.jpg', '1576_House-Villa_3.jpg', '1576_House-Villa_4.jpg', '1576_House-Villa_5.jpg', '1576_House-Villa_6.jpg', '1576_House-Villa_7.jpg', '1576_House-Villa_8.jpg');
INSERT INTO `nekretnina` (`id`, `ime`, `prezime`, `telefon`, `mobitel`, `e_mail`, `lokacija_id`, `adresa`, `status_id`, `vrsta_id`, `udaljenost`, `povrsina`, `stambenapovrsina`, `display`, `cijena`, `cijenatocka`, `ponuda_tjedna`, `new_built`, `must_sell`, `prvi_red_do_mora`, `pogled_na_more`, `bazen`, `broj_soba`, `broj_kupatila`, `datum`, `title_hr`, `title_en`, `title_ge`, `opis_hr`, `opis_en`, `opis_ge`, `PropertyImageURL0`, `PropertyImageURL1`, `PropertyImageURL2`, `PropertyImageURL3`, `PropertyImageURL4`, `PropertyImageURL5`, `PropertyImageURL6`, `PropertyImageURL7`, `PropertyImageURL8`) VALUES
(1577, 'Kata', 'Beck', '022 350 520', '0995727633', 'Katica.beck@si.t-com.hr', 'Rogoznica', 'Rogoznica', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '200', '510', '447', 1, '1100000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 1, 5, 7, 'February 22, 2016', '<p>U samom centru jednog od najljep&scaron;ih dalmatinskih gradiæa s prekrasnim panoramskim pogledom koji obuhvaæa cijelu okolicu i otoèje nalazi se luksuzna vila. Povr&scaron;ina vile iznosi 447 m2, a nalazi se na parceli povr&scaron;ine 510 m2. S prekrasno ureðenom okuænicom, ova vila pru¾a moguænost potpunog mediteranskog ugoðaja zalaska sunca na &nbsp;bazenu sa zapadne strane kuæe. Lijepo ureðena pla¾a nalazi se samo 200 m od vile. Vila je luksuzno ureðena, a podijeljena je na tri kata.</p>', '<p>This is a luxury villa in the centre of one of the most beautiful Dalmatian towns with panoramic views around the islands in all directions. The Villa area is 447 m2 and is located on a plot of 510 m2. It has a beautifully landscaped garden, which creates the complete Mediterranean atmosphere - with the sunset at the pool on the west side of the house. There is a beautifully kept beach located 200 m from the villa. The villa is luxuriously furnished and is divided into three floors.</p>', '', '<p>U samom centru jednog od najljep&scaron;ih dalmatinskih gradiæa s prekrasnim panoramskim pogledom koji obuhvaæa cijelu okolicu i otoèje nalazi se luksuzna vila.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Povr&scaron;ina vile iznosi 447 m2, a nalazi se na parceli povr&scaron;ine 510 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>S prekrasno ureðenom okuænicom, ova vila pru¾a moguænost potpunog mediteranskog ugoðaja zalaska sunca na bazenu sa zapadne strane kuæe.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Lijepo ureðena pla¾a nalazi se samo 200 m od vile.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Vila je luksuzno ureðena, a podijeljena je na tri kata.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na prvom katu nalazi se dnevni boravak otvorenog tipa s kuhinjom i blagovaonicom, spavaæa soba s pripadajuæom kupaonicom i zaseban WC.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Drugi kat se sastoji od dvije spavaæe sobe s pripadajuæim kupaonicama, dnevnog boravka i kuhinje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na treæem katu se nalaze spavaæa soba s pripadajuæom kupaonicom, dnevni boravak i kuhinja.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Svaki kat ima izlaz na prostrane terase s kojih se pru¾a zadivljujuæi pogled na more i okolicu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Najveæa terasa nalazi se na treæem katu.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U suterenu na nivou vrta i bazena je studio apartman.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Vila je u potpunosti namje&scaron;tena luksuznim i kvalitetnim namje&scaron;tajem, klimatizirana, osigurana blindo vratima i alarmnim sustavom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Uvedeno je i podno grijanje kao i kori&scaron;tenje solarne energije putem solarnih ploèa na kuæi.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Parking je osiguran u sklopu parcele za 4 vozila.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Aerodrom je udaljen 28 km.</p>', '<p>This is a luxury villa in the centre of one of the most beautiful Dalmatian towns with panoramic views around the islands in all directions.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The Villa area is 447 m2 and is located on a plot of 510 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It has a beautifully landscaped garden, which creates the complete Mediterranean atmosphere - with the sunset at the pool on the west side of the house.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There is a beautifully kept beach located 200 m from the villa.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The villa is luxuriously furnished and is divided into three floors.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the first floor is the living room open plan with kitchen and dining room, bedroom with en suite bathroom and separate toilet.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The second floor consists of two bedrooms with en suite, living room and kitchen.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the third floor is a bedroom with en suite bathroom, again with living room and kitchen.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Each floor has a large balcony offering stunning views of the sea and the countryside.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The largest terrace is located on the third floor.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There is a studio apartment in the basement which is the same level as the garden and the swimming pool.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The villa is fully furnished with luxury and high quality furniture, air-conditioned, secured armoured doors with a gate, and alarm system.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It has underfloor heating as well as the use of solar energy through solar panels on the house.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Parking is available within the private plot for 4 cars.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Split airport is 28 km.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For more info or viewing please contact our office in Split.</p>', '', '1577_House-Villa_0.JPG', '1577_House-Villa_1.JPG', '1577_House-Villa_2.JPG', '1577_House-Villa_3.JPG', '1577_House-Villa_4.JPG', '1577_House-Villa_5.JPG', '1577_House-Villa_6.JPG', '1577_House-Villa_7.JPG', '1577_House-Villa_8.JPG'),
(1578, 'Nikola', '®ivkoviæ', 'Sestra Vinka  095551547', '098 9678085', '', 'Rogoznica', 'Lozica II 7 Rogoznica, kè 20488/19 Ko Rogoznica', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '30', '0', '52', 1, '130000', '', 2, 1, 2, 2, 1, 2, 2, 1, 'February 22, 2016', '<p>U vrlo kvalitetno izgraðenoj novoj stambenoj zgradi u drugom redu do mora nalaze se dva apartmana na prodaju (jedan u prizemlju i jedan na II katu), s prekrasnim pogledom. Zgrada je smje&scaron;tena u mirnoj uvali s lijepo ureðenim pla¾ama, a na svega 15 minuta hoda od centra mjesta s vrhunskim restoranima, trgovinama, kafiæima i svim potrebnim sadr¾ajima.</p>', '<p>We have two apartments in this newly built building in the second row from the sea near Rogoznica. The building is located in a quiet bay with beautiful beaches, and only 15 minutes walk from the town centre with excellent restaurants, shops, cafes and all necessary facilities.&nbsp;The airport is 30 km and the nearest main town less than 30 minutes driving.</p>', '', '<p>U vrlo kvalitetno izgraðenoj novoj stambenoj zgradi u drugom redu do mora nalaze se dva apartmana na prodaju (jedan u prizemlju i jedan na II katu), s prekrasnim pogledom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Zgrada je smje&scaron;tena u mirnoj uvali s lijepo ureðenim pla¾ama, a na svega 15 minuta hoda od centra mjesta s vrhunskim restoranima, trgovinama, kafiæima i svim potrebnim sadr¾ajima.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;">PRIZEMLJE: Apartman &nbsp;povr&scaron;ine 52 m2, CIJENA 130.000</span></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartman se sastoji od dvije spavaæe sobe, kupaonice, dnevnog boravka povezanog s kuhinjom i blagovaonicom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Izlaz na prostranu terasu je iz dnevnog boravka.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;">II KAT:&nbsp;Apartman povr&scaron;ine 95 m2, CIJENA 330.000</span></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Prekrasan pogled na more i uvalu koji se pru¾a iz dnevnog boravka kao i sa dvije terase èini ovaj apartman iznimnom prilikom za u¾ivanje u mediteranskom ugoðaju.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartman se sastoji od tri spavaæe sobe, dvije kupaonice, prostranog dnevnog boravka povezanog s kuhinjom i blagovaonicom.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartman ima dvije prostrane terase - na jednu se izlazi iz dnevnog boravka, a na drugu iz spavaæe sobe.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Oba apartmana imaju moderno opremljene kuhinje i kupaonice.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartmani imaju osigurano parking mjesto kao i ostavu u prizemlju povr&scaron;ine 20 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Zgrada ima potrebnu infrastrukturu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Aerodrom je udaljen 30 km.</p>', '<p>We have two apartments in this newly built building in the second row from the sea near Rogoznica.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The building is located in a quiet bay with beautiful beaches, and only 15 minutes walk from the town centre with excellent restaurants, shops, cafes and all necessary facilities.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;">GROUND FLOOR: Apartment of 52 m2, PRICE 130.000</span></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The apartment has two bedrooms, bathroom, living room connected with kitchen and dining room.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Access to a spacious terrace from the living room, with fabulous sea views.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;">SECOND FLOOR: Apartment of 95 m2, PRICE 330.000</span></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The terrace on this apartment has great views overlooking the sea and the bay, and it extends from the living room and bedrooms which makes this apartment an exceptional opportunity to enjoy the Mediterranean atmosphere.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The apartment has three bedrooms, two bathrooms, spacious living room connected to the kitchen and dining room.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There are two balconies in this flat, both large enough to enjoy alfresco meals and to relax on furniture to catch the sun.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Both apartments have modern appliances and fittings in the kitchens and bathrooms.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The apartment has a parking space and storage room in the ground floor area of 20 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The airport is 30 km and the nearest main town less than 30 minutes driving.</p>', '', '1578_Apartment_0.jpg', '1578_Apartment_1.JPG', '1578_Apartment_2.JPG', '1578_Apartment_3.JPG', '1578_Apartment_4.JPG', '1578_Apartment_5.JPG', '1578_Apartment_6.jpg', '1578_Apartment_7.jpg', '1578_Apartment_8.JPG'),
(1579, 'Marinko', 'Domljanoviæ', '', '095 9100 878', '', 'Split', 'Put ®njana 28b Split, Broj èest./land register no. k.è. 10182/1, 2, 3 k.o split', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '50', '1550', '75', 1, '1500000', '', 2, 2, 2, 1, 1, 1, 2, 1, 'February 22, 2016', '<p>Na prodaju nudimo prizemnu kuæu povr&scaron;ine ca. 75 m2 sa pomoænim objektom (teretana sa kupaonicom, ostava i gara¾a), vanjskim kaminom, velikim bazenom 12x5 m sa terasom za sunèanje te natkrivenim parkingom za 2 automobila.&nbsp;Nekretnina je prikljuèena na infrastrukturu. Glavna kuæa je u cijelosti namje&scaron;tena te renovirana 2014. godine. Nekretnina se nalazi oko 3 km od centra Splita, u blizini popularne gradske pla¾e.</p>', '<p>For sale we have this cottage located in the new part of Split, near the popular beach on the south side of the town.&nbsp;Estate comprises of the main house sized 75 sqm auxiliary object (gym with toilet, storage and garage), outdoor BBQ, large 12x5 m swimming pool with sundeck and covered parking for 2 cars.&nbsp;The property is connec ted to utilities and has septic tank. The main house is fully furnished and renovated in 2014.</p>', '', '<p>Na prodaju nudimo prizemnu kuæu povr&scaron;ine ca. 75 m2 (2 spavaæe sobe, 1 kupaonica, dnevni boravak sa kuhinjom, blagovaonicom i kaminom) sa pomoænim objektom (teretana sa kupaonicom, ostava i gara¾a), vanjskim kaminom, velikim bazenom 12x5 m sa terasom za sunèanje te natkrivenim parkingom za 2 automobila.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nekretnina je prikljuèena na infrastrukturu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Glavna kuæa je u cijelosti namje&scaron;tena te renovirana 2014. godine. &nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nekretnina se nalazi oko 3 km od centra Splita, u blizini popularne gradske pla¾e.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za dodatne informacije molimo kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured u Splitu.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>For sale we have this cottage located in the new part of Split, near the popular beach on the south side of the town.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Estate comprises of the main house sized 75 sqm (2 bedrooms, 1 bathroom, open-plan living room with kitchen, dining room and fire place), auxiliary object (gym with toilet, storage and garage), outdoor BBQ, large 12x5 m swimming pool with sundeck and covered parking for 2 cars.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property is connec ted to utilities and has septic tank.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The main house is fully furnished and renovated in 2014.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For further information please contact our office in Split.&nbsp;</p>', '', '1579_House-Villa_0.jpg', '1579_House-Villa_1.jpg', '1579_House-Villa_2.jpg', '1579_House-Villa_3.jpg', '1579_House-Villa_4.jpg', '1579_House-Villa_5.jpg', '1579_House-Villa_6.jpg', '1579_House-Villa_7.jpg', '1579_House-Villa_8.jpg'),
(1580, 'Aleksandriæ', 'Rukija', '+381 11 354 58 62, +381 62 209 329', '+381 11 397 26 23', 'swanbell@eunet.rs, ivana.aleksandric@gma', 'Brac', 'Uvala Vla¹ka Milna, Kc 2407/10 ko milna', 'For sale', 'Land plot', '220', '528', '0', 1, '100000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 0, 0, 'February 22, 2016', '<p>Croatia Property Sales vam predstavlja graðevinsko zemlji&scaron;ite na zapadnoj strani otoka Braèa, oko 200 metara od mora te 500 metara od centra mjesta.&nbsp;Struja i voda su u neposrednoj blizini, a zemlji&scaron;te ima i pristup javnom putu. Prilikom gradnje, ne bi bilo pogleda iz prizemlja, ali bi kat imao parcijalni pogled na more.&nbsp;Mirno susjedstvo, pogodno za gradnju obiteljske kuæe.&nbsp;Izgraðeni graðevinski dio naselja.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>Croatia Property Sales presents this building land for sale, located on the western side of Brac island, approximately 200 meters from the sea and 500 meters from the village center.&nbsp;Electrictity and water are near and there is an access to public road. There would be no sea views from the ground floor, but once built, the first floor would have partial sea views.&nbsp;Peaceful neighbourhood, good for family house.</p>', '', '<p><strong>Graðevinsko zemlji&scaron;te na prodaju</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Croatia Property Sales vam predstavlja graðevinsko zemlji&scaron;ite na zapadnoj strani otoka Braèa, oko 200 metara od mora te 500 metara od centra mjesta.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Struja i voda su u neposrednoj blizini, a zemlji&scaron;te ima i pristup javnom putu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Prilikom gradnje, ne bi bilo pogleda iz prizemlja, ali bi kat imao parcijalni pogled na more.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Mirno susjedstvo, pogodno za gradnju obiteljske kuæe.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Izgraðeni graðevinski dio naselja.&nbsp;</p>', '<p><strong>Building land for sale</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Croatia Property Sales presents this building land for sale, located on the western side of Brac island, approximately 200 meters from the sea and 500 meters from the village center.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Electrictity and water are near and there is an access to public road.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There would be no sea views from the ground floor, but once built, the first floor would have partial sea views.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Peaceful neighbourhood, good for family house.&nbsp;</p>', '', '1580_Land-plot_0.jpg', '1580_Land-plot_1.jpg', '1580_Land-plot_2.jpg', '1580_Land-plot_3.jpg', '1580_Land-plot_4.jpg', '1580_Land-plot_5.jpg', '1580_Land-plot_6.jpg', '', ''),
(1581, 'Vesna ', 'Buljeviæ', '', '098 9176276', 'santa_chiara_cro@yahoo.com', 'Brac', 'Milna 835, uvala Vla¹ka Milna, Kc 2386/9 ko milna', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '150', '470', '125', 1, '199000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 3, 2, 'February 22, 2016', '<p>Lijepa kuæa na mirnoj lokaciji nedaleko od mjesta na zapadnoj strani otoka Braèa.&nbsp;U niskom prizemlju (suterenu) nalazi se studio apartman, a do njega odvojena ostava sa prikljuècima struje i vode.&nbsp;U prizemlju se nalazi prostrani stan sa dvije spavaæe sobe, kupaonicom, dnevnim boravkom, kuhinjom i blagovaonicom.&nbsp;Okuænica je ureðena, a u vrtu se nalazi terasa povr&scaron;ine 70 m2 sa kaminom.&nbsp;Svaka soba je klimatizirana.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>Lovely house located in a peaceful area on the western side of Brac island, only 150 meters from the beach and 500 meters from the center of the village. Lower ground floor contains studio apartment and separate strorage next to it (with electricity and water connections). Higher ground floor consists of a large apartment with 2 bedrooms, 1 bathroom, kitchen, living and dining room.&nbsp;Landscaped garden has BBQ and features 70 sqm patio/terrace. Every room is airconditioned.&nbsp;</p>', '', '<p><strong>ODLIÈNA PONUDA - CIJENA SNI®ENA SA 220.000 EUR</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Lijepa kuæa na mirnoj lokaciji nedaleko od mjesta na zapadnoj strani otoka Braèa.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U niskom prizemlju (suterenu) nalazi se studio apartman, a do njega odvojena ostava sa prikljuècima struje i vode.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U prizemlju se nalazi prostrani stan sa dvije spavaæe sobe, kupaonicom, dnevnim boravkom, kuhinjom i blagovaonicom.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Okuænica je ureðena, a u vrtu se nalazi terasa povr&scaron;ine 70 m2 sa kaminom.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Svaka soba je klimatizirana.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za dodatne informacije molimo kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured u Splitu.&nbsp;</p>', '<p><strong>EXCELLENT OFFER - PRICE REDUCED FROM 220.000 EUR</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Lovely house located in a peaceful area on the western side of Brac island, only 150 meters from the beach and 500 meters from the center of the village.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Lower ground floor contains studio apartment and separate strorage next to it (with electricity and water connections).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Higher ground floor consists of a large apartment with 2 bedrooms, 1 bathroom, kitchen, living and dining room.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Landscaped garden has BBQ and features 70 sqm patio/terrace.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Every room is airconditioned.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For further information please contact our office in Split.</p>', '', '1581_House-Villa_0.jpg', '1581_House-Villa_1.jpg', '1581_House-Villa_2.jpg', '1581_House-Villa_3.jpg', '1581_House-Villa_4.jpg', '1581_House-Villa_5.jpg', '1581_House-Villa_6.jpg', '1581_House-Villa_7.jpg', '1581_House-Villa_8.jpg'),
(1582, 'Radoslav ', 'Glava¹', '031530 495', '091 1877755', 'Darija79os@net.hr', 'Trogir', 'Ulica Bana Petra Berislaviæa 7 Seget Vranjica, 209/21,  1310 ZGR', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '100', '245', '70', 1, '170000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 1, 2, 'February 24, 2016', '<p>Simpatièna dvojna kuæa smje&scaron;tena u malom mjestu udaljenom 10 min. vo¾nje od Trogira i 15 min. od meðunarodnog aerodroma.&nbsp;Orijentacija kuæe je jugozapadna, a sa terase na 1.katu se pru¾a pogled na more. Prirodno kamenita pla¾a je udaljena cca. 80 m, a u samom centru mjesta se nalazi prekrasna &scaron;ljunèana pla¾a. U centru se takoðer nalazi trgovina, restoran i kafiæ.&nbsp;Kuæa se nalazi na zemlji&scaron;tu povr&scaron;ine 245 m2, gdje postoji moguænost izgradnje manjeg bazena.&nbsp;Stambena povr&scaron;ina iznosi 70 m2 + terasa 15 m2.</p>', '<p>We have this cosy semi-detached house in a small village, well located, 10 minutes drive from Trogir and 15 min from the international airport. It is just 80m from the nearest beach and the sea which is mostly rocky but there is a good pebble beach there, too. From the terrace there is a good view which includes the sea. The village centre has a shop, restaurant and cafe, all within walking distance along the shore. The house is situated on a land area of 245 m2, where there is the possibility of building a small swimming pool.&nbsp;Living area is 70 m2 + 15 m2 terrace.</p>', '', '<p>Simpatièna dvojna kuæa smje&scaron;tena u malom mjestu udaljenom 10 min. vo¾nje od Trogira i 15 min. od meðunarodnog aerodroma.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Orijentacija kuæe je jugozapadna, a sa terase na 1.katu se pru¾a pogled na more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Prirodno kamenita pla¾a je udaljena cca. 80 m, a u samom centru mjesta se nalazi prekrasna &scaron;ljunèana pla¾a.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U centru se takoðer nalazi trgovina, restoran i kafiæ.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa se nalazi na zemlji&scaron;tu povr&scaron;ine 245 m2, gdje postoji moguænost izgradnje manjeg bazena.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Stambena povr&scaron;ina iznosi 70 m2 + terasa 15 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U prizemlju se nalazi kuhinja, blagovaonica, dnevni boravak, ostava i kupaonica.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na 1.katu je dnevni boravak koji mo¾e biti i spavaæa soba, kupaonica i terasa.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je graðena 1987. i u dobrom je stanju, ali joj je ipak potrebno dodatno renoviranje i ureðenje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Vrt je kultiviran i ureðen, a ispred se nalazi parking za 3-4 automobila.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa posjeduje Energetski certifikat D razreda.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ukoliko vam je potrebno jo&scaron; informacija, slobodno nas kontaktirajte.</p>', '<p>We have this cosy semi-detached house in a small village, well located, 10 minutes drive from Trogir and 15 min from the international airport.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is just 80m from the nearest beach and the sea which is mostly rocky but there is a good pebble beach there, too.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property faces south-west.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>From the terrace there is a good view which includes the sea.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The village centre has a shop, restaurant and cafe, all within walking distance along the shore.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house is situated on a land area of 245 m2, where there is the possibility of building a small swimming pool.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Living area is 70 m2 + 15 m2 terrace.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the ground floor there is a kitchen, dining room, living room, pantry and bathroom.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the 1st floor is the living room that can be a bedroom, bathroom and access onto the terrace.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house was built in 1987 and is in good condition, but probably she still needs decorating again.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The garden is cultivated and landscaped and in front there is parking for 3-4 cars.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house has energy certificate D grade.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>If you need additional information, please contact our agents in Split.</p>', '', '1582_House-Villa_0.jpg', '1582_House-Villa_1.jpg', '1582_House-Villa_2.jpg', '1582_House-Villa_3.jpg', '1582_House-Villa_4.jpg', '1582_House-Villa_5.jpg', '1582_House-Villa_6.jpg', '1582_House-Villa_7.jpg', '1582_House-Villa_8.jpg'),
(1583, 'Jagoda', 'Pertiæ-Kui¹', '01 4677 186', '091 511 78 27', 'jagodapetrickuis2@gmail.com', 'Brac', 'Put Sv Duha 33 Postira, Kc 881/2 ko postira', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '100', '800', '120', 1, '450000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 4, 2, 'February 24, 2016', '<p>Na prodaju nudimo ovu lijepu kuæu sa pogledom na more, smje&scaron;tenu u blizini mora u mjestu sa sjeverne strane otoka Braèa, svega 100tinjak metara od obale. Kuæa ima oko 120 m2 unutarnjeg prostora i preko 40 m2 terasa. Veliki vrt oku¾uje objekt te ima dovoljno mjesta za gradnju bazena. Uz kuæu se nalazi gara¾a povr&scaron;ine 16 m2.</p>', '<p>For sale we have this lovely house with sea views, set on 2 floors, only 100 meters from coastline. It is located on the outskirts of a village on the northern side of Brac island.&nbsp;The house has 120 sqm of the living area and over 40 sqm in terraces. Large mature garden surrounds the property. There is enough space to build the pool and the property features 16 sqm garage.</p>', '', '<p><strong>Lijepa kuæa sa pogledom na more</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na pridaju nudimo ovu lijepu kuæu sa pogledom na more, smje&scaron;tenu u blizini mora u mjestu sa sjeverne strane otoka Braèa, svega 100tinjak metara od obale.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa ima oko 120 m2 unutarnjeg prostora i preko 40 m2 terasa.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Veliki vrt oku¾uje objekt te ima dovoljno mjesta za gradnju bazena.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Uz kuæu se nalazi gara¾a povr&scaron;ine 16 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Prizemlje: ostava, dvevni boravak, kuhinja, 3 spavaæe sobe, praonica, wc, kupaonica, ugradbeni ormari.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Prvi kat (studio apartman): dnevno-noæni prostor sa kuhinjom, balkon, kupaonica, velika natkrivena terasa.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za dodatne informacije molimo kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured u Splitu.&nbsp;</p>', '<p><strong>Charming house with sea views</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For sale we have this lovely house with sea views, set on 2 floors, only 100 meters from coastline.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is located on the outskirts of a village on the northern side of Brac island.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house has 120 sqm of the living area and over 40 sqm in terraces.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Large mature garden surrounds the property.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There is enough space to build the pool and the property features 16 sqm garage.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ground floor: storage, living room, kitchen, 3 bedrooms, laundry, toilet, bathroom, built-in cupboards.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>First floor (studio apartment): living/sleeping room with kitchen, balcony, bathroom with shower, large covered terrace.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For additional information please contact our office in Split.&nbsp;</p>', '', '1583_House-Villa_0.jpg', '1583_House-Villa_1.jpg', '1583_House-Villa_2.jpg', '1583_House-Villa_3.jpg', '1583_House-Villa_4.jpg', '1583_House-Villa_5.jpg', '1583_House-Villa_6.jpg', '1583_House-Villa_7.jpg', '1583_House-Villa_8.jpg'),
(1584, 'Ivica', 'Spahija', '022410529, 022338968', '0994153004', 'ivicaspahija@yahoo.co.uk', 'Primosten', 'Primo¹ten', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '5', '194', '120', 1, '275000', '', 2, 2, 2, 1, 1, 2, 3, 1, 'February 24, 2016', '<p>Kuæa u prvom redu do mora.&nbsp;S kuæe se pru¾a oèaravajuæi pogled na more i cijelu uvalu. Mirna uvala, prirodna kamenita pla¾a na svega par koraka od kuæe i hlad mediteranskog bilja pru¾it æe svakome tko boravi u ovoj kuæi izuzetan do¾ivljaj netaknute prirode Mediterana.&nbsp;Kuæa je povr&scaron;ine 120 m2, a nalazi se na parceli povr&scaron;ine 194 m2.</p>', '<p>First line house by the sea. Now increasingly rare on the market. The house offers amazing views of the sea and the bay. Walking along the shore there are quiet coves, natural rocky beaches all just a few steps from the house and the gardens are surrounded by mature Mediterranean plants that will give shade to anyone who is staying in this house. The house is 120 m2 and it is located on a plot of 194 m2.</p>', '', '<p><strong>Kuæa u prvom redu do mora</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>S kuæe se pru¾a oèaravajuæi pogled na more i cijelu uvalu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Mirna uvala, prirodna kamenita pla¾a na svega par koraka od kuæe i hlad mediteranskog bilja pru¾it æe svakome tko boravi u ovoj kuæi izuzetan do¾ivljaj netaknute prirode Mediterana.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je povr&scaron;ine 120 m2, a nalazi se na parceli povr&scaron;ine 194 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sastoji se od tri sobe, kuhinje, blagovaonice i kupaonice.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>S obzirom na trenutno stanje potrebno je renoviranje kuæe.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa ima svu potrebnu infrastrukturu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Centar jednog od najljep&scaron;ih turistièkih mjesta udaljen je svega par minuta vo¾nje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Vrhunski restorani, trgovine, &scaron;etnice i svi potrebni turistièki sadr¾aji mogu se naæi u ovom mjestu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Aerodrom je udaljen 45 km.</p>', '<p><strong>First line house by the sea</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Now increasingly rare on the market.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house offers amazing views of the sea and the bay.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Walking along the shore there are quiet coves, natural rocky beaches all just a few steps from the house and the gardens are surrounded by mature Mediterranean plants that will give shade to anyone who is staying in this house.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house is 120 m2 and it is located on a plot of 194 m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It consists of three bedrooms, kitchen, dining room and bathroom.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The state of the property demands it is necessary to renovate the house, but this is reflected in the price, indeed giving this great investment potential.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house has all the necessary infrastructure.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The centre of the Dalmatian village is one of the most beautiful tourist resorts and is only a few minutes from the property.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There are excellent restaurants, shops, a shore side promenade and all necessary tourist facilities can be found close by.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The airport is 45 km.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact one of agents as soon as possible to be escorted around this property.</p>', '', '1584_House-Villa_0.jpg', '1584_House-Villa_1.jpg', '1584_House-Villa_2.jpg', '1584_House-Villa_3.jpg', '1584_House-Villa_4.jpg', '1584_House-Villa_5.jpg', '1584_House-Villa_6.jpg', '1584_House-Villa_7.jpg', '1584_House-Villa_8.jpg'),
(1585, 'Ivanka', 'Mijatoviæ', '', '0915437547', 'ivankamijatovic8@gmail.com', 'Primosten', 'Bilo Strane 32 Primo¹ten', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '10', '200', '180', 1, '420000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 5, 4, 'February 24, 2016', '<p>Na svega 10 m od mora u lijepoj uvali nedaleko od jednog od najljep&scaron;ih dalmatinskih mjesta nalazi se ureðena samostojeæa kuæa, s koje se pru¾a otvoren pogled na more. Ispred kuæe nalazi se prirodna, kamenita pla¾a.&nbsp;Kuæa je povr&scaron;ine 180 m2, a nalazi se na parceli povr&scaron;ine 200 m2.&nbsp;Kuæa je trenutno podijeljena u tri apartmana, ali se lako mo¾e pretvoriti u obiteljsku kuæu jer je pregraðena knauf ploèama.&nbsp;S terasa se pru¾a prekrasan panoramski pogled na more i uvalu.</p>', '<p>This house is only 10 meters from the sea in a beautiful bay not far from one of the centre of one of Dalmatia''s most attractive towns. There is a natural, rocky beach immediately in front of the property and a promenade stretching the entire length of the village. The house has 180 m2 and is located on a plot of 200 m2. The house is currently divided into three apartments but can easily be converted into a house without reapplying for extra planning permission.&nbsp;The terrace offers a breathtaking panoramic view of the sea and the bay.&nbsp;</p>', '', '<p>Na svega 10 m od mora u lijepoj uvali nedaleko od jednog od najljep&scaron;ih dalmatinskih mjesta nalazi se ureðena samostojeæa kuæa, s koje se pru¾a otvoren pogled na more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ispred kuæe nalazi se prirodna, kamenita pla¾a.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je povr&scaron;ine 180 m2, a nalazi se na parceli povr&scaron;ine 200 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa se sastoji od suterena, prizemlja i kata.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U suterenu se nalazi prostrani &nbsp;studio apartman.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Prizemlje se sastoji od dnevnog boravka, blagovaonice, kuhinje, spavaæe sobe i kupaonice.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na katu se nalaze tri spavaæe sobe i dvije kupaonice.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je trenutno podijeljena u tri apartmana, ali se lako mo¾e pretvoriti u obiteljsku kuæu jer je pregraðena knauf ploèama.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>S terasa se pru¾a prekrasan panoramski pogled na more i uvalu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Okuænica je poploèana. U sklopu terase nalazi se vanjski ro&scaron;tilj.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Do kuæe se dolazi asfaltiranom cestom, a u sklopu parcele mogu se parkirati tri auta.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa ima svu potrebnu infrastrukturu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Udaljenost do centra mjesta, trgovina, restorana i svih turistièkih sadr¾aja je 10 km.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Aerodrom je udaljen 45 km.</p>', '<p>This house is only 10 meters from the sea in a beautiful bay not far from one of the centre of one of Dalmatia''s most attractive towns.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There is a natural, rocky beach immediately in front of the property and a promenade stretching the entire length of the village and beyond to where there are quiet and private beaches and bays.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house has 180 m2 and is located on a plot of 200 m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house consists of basement, ground floor and first floor.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>In the basement there is a spacious studio apartment.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The ground floor consists of a living room, dining room, kitchen, bedroom and bathroom.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Upstairs are three bedrooms and two bathrooms.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house is currently divided into three apartments but can easily be converted into a house without reapplying for extra planning permission.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The terrace offers a breathtaking panoramic view of the sea and the bay.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The wide courtyard/garden is paved and on this terrace there is a barbecue.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house is reached by a paved road, and there is private paring for three cars.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house has all the necessary infrastructure drains etc.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Distance to the nearest major town centre with shops, restaurants and all the tourist attractions is 10 km.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The airport is 45 km.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact our agents to arrange to visit this property.</p>', '', '1585_House-Villa_0.jpg', '1585_House-Villa_1.jpg', '1585_House-Villa_2.jpg', '1585_House-Villa_3.jpg', '1585_House-Villa_4.jpg', '1585_House-Villa_5.jpg', '1585_House-Villa_6.jpg', '1585_House-Villa_7.jpg', '1585_House-Villa_8.jpg'),
(1586, '', 'Balog', '', '098774268', 'miro.balog@os.t-com.hr', 'Rogoznica', 'Ulica XII Rogoznica, 2205/9 Rogoznica', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '20', '411', '432', 1, '570000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 11, 6, 'February 24, 2016', '<p>Na odliènoj lokaciji u mirnom dijelu dalmatinskog mjesta nalazi se ova kuæa apartmanskog tipa. More je udaljeno svega 20 m od kuæe. Lijepo ureðena pla¾a, &scaron;etnica, blizina vrhunskih restorana, kafiæa i trgovina èine ovu kuæu izuzetno atraktivnom za sve koji se ¾ele baviti turizmom.&nbsp;Kuæa je povr&scaron;ine 432 m2, a nalazi se parceli povr&scaron;ine 411 m2.&nbsp;Kuæa se sastoji od 5 dvosobnih apartman povr&scaron;ine 54 m2 i jednog jednosobnog apartmana od 30 m2.</p>', '<p>This property is divided into six apartments, on a prime location in a mainland Dalmatian town. The sea is only 20 meters from the house, and here there is a promenade stretching either way along the shore, with occasional cafes and bars. The beach is attractive and safe for children and proudly maintained to a high standard by the town. The house has an area of 432 m2 and is located on a plot of 411 m2. The house consists of 5 two-bedroom apartments of 54 m2 and one-bedroom apartment of 30 m2.&nbsp;</p>', '', '<p>Na odliènoj lokaciji u mirnom dijelu dalmatinskog mjesta nalazi se ova kuæa apartmanskog tipa.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>More je udaljeno svega 20 m od kuæe.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Lijepo ureðena pla¾a, &scaron;etnica, blizina vrhunskih restorana, kafiæa i trgovina èine ovu kuæu izuzetno atraktivnom za sve koji se ¾ele baviti turizmom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je povr&scaron;ine 432 m2, a nalazi se parceli povr&scaron;ine 411 m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa se sastoji od 5 dvosobnih apartman povr&scaron;ine 54 m2 i jednog jednosobnog apartmana od 30 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa se prodaje ili u cijelosti ili pojedinaèno svaki apartman po cijeni 2000 eura/m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Do kuæe je osiguran pristup cestom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U sklopu parcele nalazi se 5 parking mjesta.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa ima svu potrebnu infrastrukturu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Aerodrom je udaljen 28 km.</p>', '<p>This property is divided into six apartments, on a prime location in a mainland Dalmatian town.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The sea is only 20 meters from the house, and here there is a promenade stretching either way along the shore, with occasional cafes and bars and the centre of the village with a wider choice of restaurants and shops all within walking distance.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The beach is attractive and safe for children and proudly maintained to a high standard by the town.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house has an area of 432 m2 and is located on a plot of 411 m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house consists of 5 two-bedroom apartments of 54 m2 and one-bedroom apartment of 30 m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house is being sold as one unite/whole or each separate apartment individually priced at 2,000 euros/m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house can be accessed by road.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Within the plot there are 5 parking places.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house has all the necessary infrastructure - drains, water, etc.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The airport is 28 km, and the nearest larger town in 15 minutes drive, where there are many attractions for tourists.</p>', '', '1586_House-Villa_0.jpg', '1586_House-Villa_1.jpg', '1586_House-Villa_2.jpg', '1586_House-Villa_3.jpg', '1586_House-Villa_4.jpg', '1586_House-Villa_5.jpg', '1586_House-Villa_6.jpg', '1586_House-Villa_7.jpg', '1586_House-Villa_8.jpg'),
(1587, 'Nikola', 'Bojaniæ', '', '091/3610311', 'nikola.bojanic@st.t-com.hr', 'Split', 'Istarska 32 Split, k.è. 5933', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '300', '500', '200', 2, '99999999', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 6, 2, 'February 24, 2016', '<p>Ova &scaron;armantna kuæa nalazi se u centru Splita, u mirnoj ulici okru¾enoj zelenilom, samo 300 m od mora i Dioklecijanove Palaèe.&nbsp;Kuæa zahtijeva kompletnu renovaciju.&nbsp;Sastoji se od prizemlja, kata i potkrovlja. Ima ukupno 6 prostorija + dvije kupaonice, terasu i ostakljenu loðu, ukupne stambene povr&scaron;ine 200 m2, a polo¾ena je na zemlji&scaron;tu od 500 m2.&nbsp;Postoji i moguænost nadogradnje 2 kata i visokog potkrovlja.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>This is a renovation project in the centre of Split, 300m from the Palace walls. Tourism is increasing year on year, and a central base like this is almost everyone''s first priority. There is a total of 6 rooms + two bathrooms, wide terrace and loggia, with a total area of 200 m2 and the property is built on a plot of 500 m2. It is possible to upgrade the existing building and we can arrange potential purchasers to meet an architect.&nbsp;</p>', '', '<p>Ova &scaron;armantna kuæa nalazi se u centru Splita, u mirnoj ulici okru¾enoj zelenilom, samo 300 m od mora i Dioklecijanove Palaèe.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U¾iva lagan pristup cjelogodi&scaron;njim sadr¾ajima (restoranima, kafiæima, muzejima, javnom prijevozu, i pla¾ama) &scaron;to je èini atraktivnom kako za ¾ivljenje tako i za turistièki najam ili pak ureðenje u hostel.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa zahtijeva kompletnu renovaciju.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sastoji se od prizemlja, kata i potkrovlja.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ima ukupno 6 prostorija + dvije kupaonice, terasu i ostakljenu loðu, ukupne stambene povr&scaron;ine 200 m2, a polo¾ena je na zemlji&scaron;tu od 500 m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Postoji i moguænost nadogradnje 2 kata i visokog potkrovlja.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ispred se nalazi prekrasan vrt dovoljno prostran za parking, a u sklopu parcele je i gara¾a.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za dodatne informacije molimo kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured u Splitu.</p>', '<p>This is a renovation project in the centre of Split, 300m from the Palace walls.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is situated in a quiet street, but within walking distance of all the historic attractions, the ferry and bus terminal and most of the most sought-after restaurants and bars used by tourists.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>After restoration, this property would be ideal for use as a small hostel - and the city is definitely short of such properties.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Tourism is increasing year on year, and a central base like this is almost everyone''s first priority.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There is a total of 6 rooms + two bathrooms, wide terrace and loggia, with a total area of 200 m2 and the property is built on a plot of 500 m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is possible to upgrade the existing building and we can arrange potential purchasers to meet an architect.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>We would recommend this, as technical questions about the use and redesign of the building can be discussed.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>In front of the house is a beautiful garden, which could become parking, but also within the plot is a garage.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For further information, please contact our office in Split.</p>', '', '1587_House-Villa_0.jpg', '1587_House-Villa_1.jpg', '1587_House-Villa_2.jpg', '1587_House-Villa_3.jpg', '1587_House-Villa_4.jpg', '1587_House-Villa_5.jpg', '1587_House-Villa_6.jpg', '1587_House-Villa_7.jpg', '1587_House-Villa_8.jpg'),
(1588, '', 'Dalmatian Home', '', '', '', 'Sibenik', 'Vodice', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '500', '151', '71', 1, '120000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 2, 1, 'February 25, 2016', '<p>Obiteljska kuæa u blizini &Scaron;ibenika, podijeljena na dvije eta¾e s ukupno 71 m2 stambene povr&scaron;ine.&nbsp;Ukupna povr&scaron;ina okuænice iznosi 151 m2, dvori&scaron;te je u potpunosti poploèano i ograðeno, te se u sklopu okuænice nalazi ro&scaron;tilj i jedno parkirno mjesto.&nbsp;Kuæa je odmah useljiva, kompletno namje&scaron;tena i opremljena klima ureðajem.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;">CIJENA SNI®ENA SA 149.999 EUR!!</span></p>', '<p>Family house located near &Scaron;ibenik, divided into two floors with a total of 71 m2 living space.&nbsp;The total area of garden is 151 m2, the garden is fully paved and fenced.&nbsp;The house is ready to move in, fully furnished and equipped with air conditioning.&nbsp;All the furniture is included in the selling price.</p>\r\n<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;">PRICE REDUCED FROM 149.999 EUR!!</span></p>', '', '<p><strong><span style="text-decoration: underline;">CIJENA SNI®ENA SA 149.999 EUR!!</span></strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Obiteljska kuæa u blizini &Scaron;ibenika, podijeljena na dvije eta¾e s ukupno 71 m2 stambene povr&scaron;ine.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sastoji se od ulaznog prostora, wc-a i dnevnog boravka s blagovaonicom i kuhinjom, te izlazom na terasu u prizemlju, dok se unutra&scaron;njim stepeni&scaron;tem dolazi na prvi kat gdje se nalaze dvije spavaæe sobe, hodnik, kupaonica, te terasa s pogledom na more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ukupna povr&scaron;ina okuænice iznosi 151 m2, dvori&scaron;te je u potpunosti poploèano i ograðeno, te se u sklopu okuænice nalazi ro&scaron;tilj i jedno parkirno mjesto.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je odmah useljiva, kompletno namje&scaron;tena i opremljena klima ureðajem.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sav namje&scaron;taj ulazi u prodajnu cijenu kuæe.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Udaljenost do mora je 500 m, a do centra mjesta 400 m.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za dodatne informacije molimo kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured u Splitu.&nbsp;</p>', '<p><strong><span style="text-decoration: underline;">PRICE REDUCED FROM 149.999 EUR!!</span></strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Family house located near &Scaron;ibenik, divided into two floors with a total of 71 m2 living space.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It consists of an entrance hall, toilet, living room, dining room, kitchen and access to the terrace on the ground floor, while the internal staircase leads to the first floor where there are two bedrooms, bathroom and terrace with sea views.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The total area of garden is 151 m2, the garden is fully paved and fenced.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house is ready to move in, fully furnished and equipped with air conditioning.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>All the furniture is included in the selling price.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Distance to the beach is 500m and to the city center the distance is 400m.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For further information please contact our office in Split.&nbsp;</p>', '', '1588_House-Villa_0.jpg', '1588_House-Villa_1.jpg', '1588_House-Villa_2.jpg', '1588_House-Villa_3.jpg', '1588_House-Villa_4.jpg', '1588_House-Villa_5.jpg', '1588_House-Villa_6.jpg', '1588_House-Villa_7.jpg', '1588_House-Villa_8.jpg'),
(1589, 'Zara Projekt', 'Robert Sendi', '+38599 30 66 500', '+38591 247 19 78', 'info@zara-projekt.com', 'Zadar', ' k.o. Vinjerac  kat.èestica 678/33 ', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '140', '505', '145', 1, '320000', '', 2, 1, 2, 2, 1, 1, 0, 0, 'February 25, 2016', '<p>Prekrasne kamene vile s bazenom na padini obalnog dijela u blizini Zadra.&nbsp;Iz vile se pru¾a pogled na more te park prirode Velebit.&nbsp;Sastoji se od dvije eta¾e, prizemlja i potkrovlja, a nalazi se na terenu od 505 m2.&nbsp;Ima osiguran privatan pristup sa dva parkirna mjesta.&nbsp;Ville su udaljene svega nekoliko minuta &scaron;etnje do mora, restorana, glavne pla¾e i centra mjesta.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>A beautiful and newly completed stone villa with swimming pool on the hill side of near Zadar. The villa offers views of the sea and the amazing Velebit National Park. The building is designed to make the best use of the geographical advantages of its elevated position, and long views, with large windows and extended terrace at the front which leads to the swimming pool. The internal layout has a spacious and light open plan family and communal area with two floors/ground floor and attic/situated on a plot of 505 m2.&nbsp;</p>', '', '<p><strong>Prekrasne kamene vile s bazenom na padini obalnog dijela u blizini Zadra</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Od ukupno 10 vila samo je jedna ostala na prodaju.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Iz vile se pru¾a pogled na more te park prirode Velebit.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sastoji se od dvije eta¾e, prizemlja i potkrovlja, a nalazi se na terenu od 505 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ima osiguran privatan pristup sa dva parkirna mjesta.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ville su udaljene svega nekoliko minuta &scaron;etnje do mora, restorana, glavne pla¾e i centra mjesta.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kvalitetno su graðene, te sadr¾e podno grijanje, hrastov parket, unutarnje staklene ograde, unutarnji kamin, vanjski ro&scaron;tilj, vanjski bazen s tu&scaron;em, osvjetljenje dvori&scaron;ta, kaskadno zelene povr&scaron;ine te niz tradicionalnih dalmatinksih detalja.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Udaljenost od mora iznosi 140 m.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za sve dodatne informacije molimo kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured u Splitu.&nbsp;</p>', '<p><strong>A beautiful and newly completed stone villa with swimming pool on the hill side of near Zadar</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>From a total of 10 villas only one is still left for sale.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The villa offers views of the sea and the amazing Velebit National Park.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The building is designed to make the best use of the geographical advantages of its elevated position, and long views, with large windows and extended terrace at the front which leads to the swimming pool.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The internal layout has a spacious and light open plan family and communal area with two floors/ground floor and attic/situated on a plot of 505 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There are three bedrooms upstairs.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It has easy access with two private parking spaces adjacent to the house.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The villas are only a few minutes walk from the sea where it is only a short walk along the shore to a choice of family run restaurants, the main beach and the village centre.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property is well built and includes many modern features for private comfort such as under floor heating, oak flooring, interior glass enclosure, indoor fireplace, outdoor bbq/grill, outdoor shower, outdoor lighting, cascading garden terraces and a number of traditional Dalmatian features.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Distance from the sea is 140 m.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For further information please contact our office.</p>', '', '1589_House-Villa_0.JPG', '1589_House-Villa_1.JPG', '1589_House-Villa_2.JPG', '1589_House-Villa_3.JPG', '1589_House-Villa_4.JPG', '1589_House-Villa_5.JPG', '1589_House-Villa_6.JPG', '1589_House-Villa_7.JPG', '1589_House-Villa_8.jpg');
INSERT INTO `nekretnina` (`id`, `ime`, `prezime`, `telefon`, `mobitel`, `e_mail`, `lokacija_id`, `adresa`, `status_id`, `vrsta_id`, `udaljenost`, `povrsina`, `stambenapovrsina`, `display`, `cijena`, `cijenatocka`, `ponuda_tjedna`, `new_built`, `must_sell`, `prvi_red_do_mora`, `pogled_na_more`, `bazen`, `broj_soba`, `broj_kupatila`, `datum`, `title_hr`, `title_en`, `title_ge`, `opis_hr`, `opis_en`, `opis_ge`, `PropertyImageURL0`, `PropertyImageURL1`, `PropertyImageURL2`, `PropertyImageURL3`, `PropertyImageURL4`, `PropertyImageURL5`, `PropertyImageURL6`, `PropertyImageURL7`, `PropertyImageURL8`) VALUES
(1590, 'Zara Projekt', 'Robert Sendi', '+38599 30 66 500 ', '+38591 247 19 78', 'info@zara-projekt.com', 'Zadar', 'k.o.Vinjerac  br.kat.èestice 753/186 ', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '30', '0', '0', 1, '185000', '', 2, 1, 2, 2, 1, 2, 0, 0, 'February 25, 2016', '<p>Moderan apartmanski objekt sa samo 5 stambenih jedinica, na izvrsnoj &nbsp;lokaciji, samo 30m od mora i pla¾e. Apartmani svojim arhitektonskim rje&scaron;enjem garantiraju kvalitetan odmor i visoku razinu privatnosti &scaron;to je ujedno bio i glavni zadatak arhitekta. 2 stana u prizemlju imaju vlastite bazene i vlastite ureðene mediteranske okuænice. 2 stana na prvom katu imaju vlastite terase/balkone.&nbsp;1 stan na drugom katu PENTHOUSE sa vlastitim bazenom i dvije vlastite terase/balkon.</p>', '<p>We are offering this newly completed apartment building of only 5 residential units, in an excellent location, 30m from the beach. The apartments each have been designed to guarantee a good feeling from the large windows creating a bright and airy open plan lounge/kitchen area, and with long views out to the sea.&nbsp;Each apartment has privacy which was also built into the architect''s plan. They are finished with many modern comforts, high quality bathroom and kitchen fittings and a designers decorating finishes.</p>', '', '<p><strong>Moderan apartmanski objekt sa samo 5 stambenih jedinica, na izvrsnoj &nbsp;lokaciji, samo 30m od mora i pla¾e</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartmani svojim arhitektonskim rje&scaron;enjem garantiraju kvalitetan odmor i visoku razinu privatnosti &scaron;to je ujedno bio i glavni zadatak arhitekta.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>2 stana u prizemlju imaju vlastite bazene i vlastite ureðene mediteranske okuænice.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>2 stana na prvom katu imaju vlastite terase/balkone.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>1 stan na drugom katu PENTHOUSE sa vlastitim bazenom i dvije vlastite terase/balkon.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Osigurano 7 vanjskih parkirnih mjesta, 1 parkirno mjesto za svaki stan + 2 zajednièka za goste objekta.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Videonadzor objekta sa 4 vanjske IR kamere, snimanje po pokretu (parking, prilaz zgradi, prolaz na more, dvori&scaron;te).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Cijene stanova:</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>S1 (prizemlje)</strong> &ndash; 185.000,00 eur &ndash; 115.38 m2</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>S2 (prizemlje) </strong>&ndash; 180.000,00 eur &ndash; 115.21 m2</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>S3 (prvi kat)</strong> &ndash; 175.000,00 eur &ndash; 80.83 m2</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>S4 (prvi kat) </strong>&ndash; 165.000,00 eur - 78.20 m2</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>S5 (penthouse)</strong> &ndash; 315.000,00 eur - 125.15 m2</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Objekt je udaljen 30 km od Zadra, 25 km od aerodroma te 11 km od autoceste A1.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za dodatne informacije molimo kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured u Splitu.&nbsp;</p>', '<p><strong>Newly completed apartment building of only 5 residential units, in an excellent location, 30 m from the beach&nbsp;</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The apartments each have been designed to guarantee a good feeling from the large windows creating a bright and airy open plan lounge/kitchen area, and with long views out to the sea.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Each apartment has privacy which was also built into the architect''s plan.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>They are finished with many modern comforts, high quality bathroom and kitchen fittings and a designers decorating finishes.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The 2 apartments on the ground floor have their own swimming pools and its own landscaped garden of Mediterranean plants.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Each of the apartments on the first floor have their own terrace/balcony.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The apartment on the second floor is a PENTHOUSE with an elevated&nbsp;&nbsp;private pool and two private balconies.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There are 7 private and secured outdoor parking spaces: 1 parking space foreach apartment + 2 additional for temporary guests.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There is a sophisticated video surveillance facility with 4 external IR cameras, recording the movement (parking, access to the building, the passage of the sea,&nbsp;courtyard) for extra security, if felt necessary.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Prices of flats:</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>S1 (ground floor)</strong> - 115.38 m2 - 185.000,00 euros &nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>S2 (ground floor)</strong> - 115.21 m2 &nbsp;- 180.000,00 euros&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>S3 (first floor) </strong>- 80.83 m2 - 175.000,00 euros</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>S4 (first floor)</strong> - 78.20 m2 - 165.000,00 euros&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>S5 &nbsp;(penthouse)</strong> - 125.15 m2 - 315.000,00 euros&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property is located 30 km from Zadar, 25 km from the airport and 11 km from the A1 motorway.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The local area has many nearby cafes, bars and restaurants, as well access to the larger town of Zadar where there are many shops and tourism attractions.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Zadar was awarded ''best town for tourism'' by the tourism industry last year.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For further information, please contact our office in Split.</p>', '', '1590_Apartment_0.jpg', '1590_Apartment_1.jpg', '1590_Apartment_2.jpg', '1590_Apartment_3.jpg', '1590_Apartment_4.jpg', '1590_Apartment_5.jpg', '1590_Apartment_6.jpg', '1590_Apartment_7.jpg', '1590_Apartment_8.jpg'),
(1591, 'Robert Sendi', 'zara projekt', '+38599 30 66 500', '+38591 247 19 78', 'info@zara-projekt.com', 'Zadar', 'K.o. Vinjerac  Br.kat.èestice 753/263 ', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '15', '0', '78', 1, '170000', '', 2, 1, 2, 1, 1, 2, 0, 0, 'February 26, 2016', '<p>Atraktivni apartmani u prvom redu do mora na padinama obalnog dijela u blizini Zadra.&nbsp;Zgrada je podijeljena na prizemlje i kat, a sadr¾i 4 apartmana, od kojih je jo&scaron; samo jedan (na prvom katu) ostao na prodaju.&nbsp;Apartman ima vlastitu krovnu terasu te parking.&nbsp;Iz apartmana se pru¾a otvoren pogled na more.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>We are offering these attractive apartments in the first row to the sea on the slopes of the coastal area near Zadar.&nbsp;The building is divided into two floors and comprises of 4 apartments, of which only one (the first floor) is still left for sale.&nbsp;First floor apartment. Measuring 77.66 m2 this flat has its own spacious roof terrace 60 m2, own outside parking 15 m2. The apartment offers a view of the sea.</p>', '', '<p>Atraktivni apartmani u prvom redu do mora na padinama obalnog dijela u blizini Zadra.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Zgrada je podijeljena na prizemlje i kat, a sadr¾i 4 apartmana, od kojih je jo&scaron; samo jedan (na prvom katu) ostao na prodaju.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartman ima vlastitu krovnu terasu te parking.</p>\r\n<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;"><br /></span></p>\r\n<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;">PRIZEMLJE:</span></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>S1 </strong>&ndash; 90,79 m2 &gt; stanu pripada vlastita okuænica 88,50 m2, vlastiti bazen 24 m2, vlastiti vanjski parking 15 m2 - <span style="color: #ff0000;"><strong>PRODAN</strong></span></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>S2</strong> &ndash; 101,28 m2 &gt; stanu pripada vlastita okuænica 128 m2, vlastiti bazen 24 m2, vlastiti vanjski parking 15 m2 - <span style="color: #ff0000;"><strong>PRODAN</strong></span></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;">KAT:</span></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>S3 </strong>&ndash; 76,72 m2 &gt; stanu pripada vlastita krovna terasa 60m2, vlastiti vanjski parking 15 m2 - <span style="color: #ff0000;"><strong>PRODAN</strong></span></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>S4 </strong>&ndash; 77,66 m2 &gt; stanu pripada vlastita krovna terasa 60m2, vlastiti vanjski parking 15 m2 &ndash; 170.000 eura &ndash; <span style="color: #ff0000;"><strong>SLOBODAN</strong></span></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Iz apartmana se pru¾a otvoren pogled na more.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za dodatne informacije molimo kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured u Splitu.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>We are offering these attractive apartments in the first row to the sea on the slopes of the coastal area near Zadar.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The building is divided into two floors and comprises of 4 apartments, of which only one (the first floor) is still left for sale - first floor apartment measuring 77.66 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>This flat has its own spacious roof terrace 60m2, own outside parking 15 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The apartment offers a view of the sea.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property includes many modern features and fittings designed to ensure a comfortable and attractive interior, with access to the wide balcony for alfresco family meals could make this a superb family holiday home.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is situated close to the shore, where there is a path going in each direction and walking distance of cafes and coffee shops.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Inland is unspoilt natural woodland and former olive farms with footpaths through this attractive environment.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For more information, please contact the office.</p>', '', '1591_Apartment_0.JPG', '1591_Apartment_1.JPG', '1591_Apartment_2.JPG', '1591_Apartment_3.JPG', '1591_Apartment_4.JPG', '1591_Apartment_5.JPG', '1591_Apartment_6.JPG', '1591_Apartment_7.JPG', '1591_Apartment_8.jpg'),
(1593, 'Manilo', 'Travaglini', '', '', 'manilo@hotmail.it', 'Brac', 'Kc 2095/1 ko sutivan', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '250', '0', '56', 1, '100000', '', 1, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 2, 1, 'March 2, 2016', '<p>Izvrstan apartman sa 2 spavaæe sobe i 1 kupaonicom, ukupne unutarnje povr&scaron;ine 56,46 m2 plus terasa povr&scaron;ine 5,51 m2 (stvarne bruto povr&scaron;ine oko 30 m2).&nbsp;Nekretnina se nalazi svega 250 metara od &scaron;ljunèane pla¾e te nekoliko minuta hoda od centra lijepog mjesta sa svim potrebnim sadr¾ajima. Sa terase se pru¾a pogled na more. Pored zgrade nalazi se parkirali&scaron;te.</p>\r\n<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;">CIJENA SNI®ENA SA 110.000 EUR!</span></p>', '<p>Lovely 2-bedroom 1-bathroom apartment for sale, sized 56,46 sqm internally plus 5,51 sqm terrace (acctual gross size near 30 sqm).&nbsp;The property is located only 250 meters from a pebble beach and easy walk from the center of a charming village on Brac island, with plenty of amenities for comfortable living.&nbsp;The property features sea vews. There is a parking next to the building.</p>\r\n<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;">PRICE REDUCED FROM 110.000 EUR!</span></p>', '', '<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;"><strong>CIJENA SNI®ENA SA 110.000 EUR!</strong></span></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Izvrstan apartman sa 2 spavaæe sobe i 1 kupaonicom, ukupne unutarnje povr&scaron;ine 56,46 m2 plus terasa povr&scaron;ine 5,51 m2 (stvarne bruto povr&scaron;ine oko 30 m2).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nekretnina se nalazi svega 250 metara od &scaron;ljunèane pla¾e te nekoliko minuta hoda od centra lijepog mjesta sa svim potrebnim sadr¾ajima.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sa terase se pru¾a pogled na more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Pored zgrade nalazi se parkirali&scaron;te.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za dodatne informacije molimo kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured u Splitu.&nbsp;</p>', '<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;"><strong>PRICE REDUCED FROM 110.000 EUR!</strong></span></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Lovely 2-bedroom 1-bathroom apartment for sale, sized 56,46 sqm internally plus 5,51 sqm terrace (acctual gross size near 30 sqm).&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property is located only 250 meters from a pebble beach and easy walk from the center of a charming village on Brac island, with plenty of amenities for comfortable living.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property features sea vews.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There is a parking next to the building.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For further information please contact our office in Split.&nbsp;</p>', '', '1593_Apartment_0.jpg', '1593_Apartment_1.jpg', '1593_Apartment_2.jpg', '1593_Apartment_3.jpg', '1593_Apartment_4.jpg', '1593_Apartment_5.jpg', '1593_Apartment_6.jpg', '1593_Apartment_7.jpg', '1593_Apartment_8.jpg'),
(1594, 'Marija', 'Farkas', '021-745-721', '0053 717591294', 'anton.farkas@live.de', 'Hvar', 'Hvar-Sv.Nedelja, 1219/3,1219/2,1209/21209/3', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '70', '2300', '440', 1, '1260000', '', 2, 2, 2, 1, 1, 2, 6, 5, 'March 2, 2016', '<p>Prekrasna vila prvi red uz more.&nbsp;Vila se nalazi na ju¾noj strani otoka Hvara, na vrhu litice, u mirnom i idiliènom mjestu.&nbsp;Smje&scaron;tena je na parceli povr&scaron;ine 2300 m2, te ima prostranu terasu od 300 m2 s koje se pru¾a oèaravajuæ pogled na more.&nbsp;Sastoji se od prizemlja, kata i potkrovlja ukupne stambene povr&scaron;ine 440 m2 (6 spavaæih soba i 5 kupaonica).&nbsp;U prizemlju su dva zavr&scaron;ena apartmana sa terasama.&nbsp;Vila ima i prostran mediteranski vrt, te ro&scaron;tilj.</p>', '<p>One of the most beautiful villas on Hvar Island. It is situated on the south side of the island, on a cliff top, in a quiet and idyllic location on the edge of a village. It sits on a plot of 2300 m2, and has a spacious terrace of 300 m2 which offers a striking view of the sea. The property consists of a ground floor and three floors with a total floor area of 440 m2 (6 bedrooms and 5 bathrooms).&nbsp;On the ground floor are two guest apartments with terraces.&nbsp;One apartment is facing south and the other to the west.&nbsp;</p>', '', '<p><strong>Prekrasna vila prvi red uz more</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Vila se nalazi na ju¾noj strani otoka Hvara, na vrhu litice, u mirnom i idiliènom mjestu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Smje&scaron;tena je na parceli povr&scaron;ine 2300 m2, te ima prostranu terasu od 300 m2 s koje se pru¾a oèaravajuæ pogled na more.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sastoji se od prizemlja, kata i potkrovlja ukupne stambene povr&scaron;ine 440 m2 (6 spavaæih soba i 5 kupaonica).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U prizemlju su dva zavr&scaron;ena apartmana sa terasama.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Jedan apartman je okrenut prema jugu, a drugi prema prema zapadu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sa sjeverne strane se nalazi gara¾a.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na katu je zavr&scaron;eni robau sa velikom terasom i balkonima zapadno orijentiranim, dok se u potkrovlju nalazi manji apartman takoðer s balkonom i velikom terasom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Vila ima i prostran mediteranski vrt, te ro&scaron;tilj.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ima pristup vozilom i parking.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>More je udaljeno samo nekoliko metara, dok su restorani i trgovina u neposrednoj blizini.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za dodatne informacije molimo kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured u Splitu.&nbsp;</p>', '<p><strong>One of the most beautiful villas on Hvar Island</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is situated on the south side of the island, on a cliff top, in a quiet and idyllic location on the edge of a village.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It sits on a plot of 2300 m2, and has a spacious terrace of 300 m2 which offers a striking view of the sea.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property consists of a ground floor and three floors with a total floor area of 440 m2 (6 bedrooms and 5 bathrooms).&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the ground floor are two guest apartments with terraces.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>One apartment is facing south and the other to the west.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the north side there is a garage with easy access to the village roads.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the first floor is a large terrace and balconies facing, while the top floor there is a small apartment with a balcony and also a large terrace.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The villa has a spacious landscaped Mediterranean style garden and barbecue.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property is beautifully decorated and is designed with features to make the best use of the space.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The fittings are of the highest quality and the owner of this property has a very lovely and comfortable house in an stunning location.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The sea is just a few meters in front of the villa, where it is utterly clear and safe for children to play.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Within walking distance &nbsp;are various shops, cafes and bars in the centre of the village.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For further information, please contact our office in Split.</p>', '', '1594_House-Villa_0.jpg', '1594_House-Villa_1.jpg', '1594_House-Villa_2.jpg', '1594_House-Villa_3.jpg', '1594_House-Villa_4.jpg', '1594_House-Villa_5.jpg', '1594_House-Villa_6.jpg', '1594_House-Villa_7.jpg', '1594_House-Villa_8.jpg'),
(1595, 'Nik¹a', 'Marojeviæ', '', '', '', 'Hvar', 'Stari Grad, 7380/3', 'For sale', 'Land plot', '5', '877', '0', 1, '350800', '', 2, 2, 2, 1, 1, 2, 0, 0, 'March 2, 2016', '<p>Gradjevinsko zemljiste na zapadnoj strani otoka Hvara, u prvom redu do mora.Mogucnost gradnje poslovno-stambenog objekta!!&nbsp;Zemljiste ima povrsinu 877 m2, te je udaljeno samo 5 m od mora.&nbsp;Struju, vodu i telefon je moguce prikljuciti.&nbsp;Blizina trajektne luke.</p>', '<p>We have this building land on the west side of the island, in the first row to the sea. It is enough to give the possibility of building a mixed business and residential building. The plot has a surface of 877 m2, and is right on the shore, only 5 meters from the sea.&nbsp;Electricity, water and telephone are already next to the plot. Near to the port are many other amenities such as shops, restaurants, cafes and bars.</p>', '', '<p>Gradjevinsko zemljiste na zapadnoj strani otoka Hvara, u prvom redu do mora.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Mogucnost gradnje poslovno-stambenog objekta!!</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Zemljiste ima povrsinu 877 m2, te je udaljeno samo 5 m od mora.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Struju, vodu i telefon je moguce prikljuciti.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Blizina trajektne luke.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za dodatne informacije molimo kontaktirajte nas ured.</p>', '<p>We have this building land on the west side of the island, in the first row to the sea.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is enough to give the possibility of building a mixed business and residential building.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The plot has a surface of 877 m2, and is right on the shore, only 5 meters from the sea.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Electricity, water and telephone are already next to the plot.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Near to the port are many other amenities such as shops, restaurants, cafes and bars.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For further information and to tour the village, please contact our office.</p>', '', '1595_Land-plot_0.jpg', '1595_Land-plot_1.jpg', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(1596, 'Melita', 'Marco Polo', '', '', '', 'Korcula', '', 'For sale', 'Land plot', '20', '500', '0', 1, '130000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 0, 0, 'March 2, 2016', '<p>Stambeno poslovni potencijal.&nbsp;Na ju¾noj obali, drugi red od mora prodaje se graðevinska parcela sa svom potrebnom i va¾eæom dokumentacijom za gradnju.&nbsp;Na zemlji&scaron;tu je veæ izveden iskop za kuæu koja se sastoji od tri eta¾e i predviðena je kao kombinacija stambenog i poslovnog prostora.&nbsp;Na katu (vanjske stepenice) nalazi se trosoban stan, dok je najgonja eta¾a (takoðer poseban ulaz) predviðena za dva dvosobna apartmana.&nbsp;Svi apartmani imaju terase prema moru s velièanstvenim pogledom.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>Building plot with all the permissions so is ready to start immediately. It is situated on the south coast of Korcula Island, next to the sea. We are offering this building plot with the planning permission with all the necessary and valid documentation for construction, for a combined residential and commercial building on three floors.&nbsp;All the infrastructure is present (water supply, electric, provision for drains, etc.).</p>', '', '<p><strong>Stambeno poslovni potencijal</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na ju¾noj obali, drugi red od mora prodaje se graðevinska parcela sa svom potrebnom i va¾eæom dokumentacijom za gradnju.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na zemlji&scaron;tu je veæ izveden iskop za kuæu koja se sastoji od tri eta¾e i predviðena je kao kombinacija stambenog i poslovnog prostora.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Prizemlje je zami&scaron;ljeno kao poslovni prostor ukupne povr&scaron;ine 60m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na katu (vanjske stepenice) nalazi se trosoban stan, dok je najgonja eta¾a (takoðer poseban ulaz) predviðena za dva dvosobna apartmana.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Svi apartmani imaju terase prema moru s velièanstvenim pogledom.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sva infrastruktura prisutna.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za dodatne informacije molimo kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured u Splitu.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>Building plot with all the permissions so is ready to start immediately.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is situated on the south coast of Korcula Island, next to the sea.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>We are offering this building plot with the planning permission with all the necessary and valid documentation for construction, for a combined residential and commercial building on three floors.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The ground floor is designed as office space total area of 60m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the first floor (with access through independent outdoor steps), there is a 3 bedroom apartment, while the last floor (that also has a separate entrance) is designed for two - x - one bedroom apartments.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>All the apartments are designed with terraces and balconies facing the sea that guarantee a magnificent view.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>All the infrastructure is present (water supply, electric, provision for drains, etc.)&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For further information, please contact our office in Split.</p>', '', '1596_Land-plot_0.jpg', '1596_Land-plot_1.jpg', '1596_Land-plot_2.jpg', '1596_Land-plot_3.jpg', '', '', '', '', ''),
(1597, 'Mario', 'Caric', '', '', '', 'Hvar', 'Ivan Dolac, 3259/1', 'For sale', 'Land plot', '150', '870', '0', 1, '174000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 0, 0, 'March 2, 2016', '<p>Graðevinsko zemlji&scaron;te na ju¾noj strani otoka Hvara, s predivnim pogledom na more.&nbsp;Zemlji&scaron;te ima povr&scaron;inu 870 m2, te je udaljeno samo 150 m od mora.&nbsp;Struju, vodu i telefon je moguce prikljuèiti.&nbsp;Svega 5 km od veæeg mjesta.&nbsp;Grad Hvar je 35 km udaljen.&nbsp;Za dodatne informacije molimo kontaktirajte nas ured.</p>', '<p>We are offering this building land on the south side of the island of Hvar, with beautiful views of the sea and surrounded by untouched natural woodlandof the island.&nbsp;The plot has a surface of 870 m2 and is located only 150 m from the sea.&nbsp;Electricity and water mains are nearby and phone lines also close. The nearest larger village with shops, cafes etc. is only 5 km from the location.&nbsp;The town of Hvar is 35 km away.&nbsp;</p>', '', '<p>Graðevinsko zemlji&scaron;te na ju¾noj strani otoka Hvara, s predivnim pogledom na more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Zemlji&scaron;te ima povr&scaron;inu 870 m2, te je udaljeno samo 150 m od mora.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Struju, vodu i telefon je moguæe prikljuèiti.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Svega 5 km od veæeg mjesta.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Grad Hvar je 35 km udaljen.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za dodatne informacije molimo kontaktirajte nas ured.</p>', '<p>We are offering this building land on the south side of the island of Hvar, with beautiful views of the sea and surrounded by untouched natural woodland of the island.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The plot has a surface of 870 m2 and is located only 150 m from the sea.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Electricity and water mains are nearby and phone lines also close.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The nearest larger village with shops, cafes etc. is only 5 km from the location.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The town of Hvar is 35 km away.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For further information and to arrange to visit this location, please contact our office.&nbsp;</p>', '', '1597_Land-plot_0.jpg', '1597_Land-plot_1.jpg', '1597_Land-plot_2.jpg', '1597_Land-plot_3.jpg', '', '', '', '', ''),
(1598, 'Juliane ', 'Bauer - Graz', '', '0043316482057', '', 'Hvar', 'Zavala, 2959/5', 'For sale', 'Land plot', '100', '1000', '0', 1, '200000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 0, 0, 'March 3, 2016', '<p>Graðevinsko zemlji&scaron;te s pogledom na more, idealno za izgradnju obiteljske kuæe s bazenom.&nbsp;Zemlji&scaron;te se nalazi na ju¾noj strani otoka Hvara, u stambenoj zoni.&nbsp;Zemlji&scaron;te ima povr&scaron;inu 1000 m2, te je udaljeno samo 100 m od mora.&nbsp;Infrastruktura odmah do parcele.&nbsp;Smje&scaron;teno je nedaleko mora i prekrasnih sljunèanih pla¾a.&nbsp;Restorani i trgovina u blizini.</p>', '<p>We have this building land with fabulous sea views, ideal for a modern family house with a swimming pool.&nbsp;The land is located on the south side of the island, in a residential zone, but is surrounded by the natural and unspoilt woodland of the island, and is only 100 yes from the shore. The land is a large plot of 1000 m2.&nbsp;All infrastructure electric/water etc is next to the plot. The sea at this point is completely clear and safe for playing and swimming, with shallow pebble beaches.&nbsp;</p>', '', '<p>Graðevinsko zemlji&scaron;te s pogledom na more, idealno za izgradnju obiteljske kuæe s bazenom.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Zemlji&scaron;te se nalazi na ju¾noj strani otoka Hvara, u stambenoj zoni.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Zemlji&scaron;te ima povr&scaron;inu 1000 m2, te je udaljeno samo 100 m od mora.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Infrastruktura odmah do parcele.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Smje&scaron;teno je nedaleko mora i prekrasnih sljunèanih pla¾a.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Restorani i trgovina u blizini.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za dodatne informacije molimo kontaktirajte nas ured.</p>', '<p>We have this building land with fabulous sea views, ideal for a modern family house with a swimming pool.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The land is located on the south side of the island, in a residential zone, but is surrounded by the natural and unspoilt woodland of the island, and is only 100 yes from the shore.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The land is a large plot of 1000 m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>All infrastructure electric/water etc is next to the plot.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The sea at this point is completely clear and safe for playing and swimming, with shallow pebble beaches.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Within a walk are restaurants and shops with bars and cafes nearby.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For further information about building your own property on the island, please contact our office.</p>', '', '1598_Land-plot_0.jpg', '1598_Land-plot_1.jpg', '1598_Land-plot_2.jpg', '1598_Land-plot_3.jpg', '', '', '', '', ''),
(1599, 'Nelson', 'Marjan', '', '', '', 'Hvar', 'Zavala, Cest zem 3364,  3363/2', 'For sale', 'Land plot', '100', '900', '0', 1, '220000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 0, 0, 'March 3, 2016', '<p>Graðevinsko zemlji&scaron;te s pogledom na more, idealno za izgradnju obiteljske kuæe s bazenom.&nbsp;Zemlji&scaron;te se nalazi na ju¾noj strani otoka Hvara, u stambenoj zoni.&nbsp;Zemlji&scaron;te ima povr&scaron;inu 900 m2, te je udaljeno samo 100 m od mora.&nbsp;Infrastruktura odmah do parcele.&nbsp;Smje&scaron;teno je nedaleko mora i prekrasnih sljunèanih pla¾a.&nbsp;Restorani i trgovina u blizini.</p>', '<p>We have this building land of 900m sq with sea views, ideal for a large modern family house or villa with a swimming pool. The land is located on the south side of the island, in a residential zone, but close to the natural woods and old farmland of the island.&nbsp;The land has an area of 900 m2 and is located only 100 m from the sea, with direct access.&nbsp;All infrastructure ie electric/water phones etc is next to the plot. There are restaurants, bars, cafes and shops nearby, as well as bus services to larger villages on the island.</p>', '', '<p>Graðevinsko zemlji&scaron;te s pogledom na more, idealno za izgradnju obiteljske kuæe s bazenom.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Zemlji&scaron;te se nalazi na ju¾noj strani otoka Hvara, u stambenoj zoni.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Zemlji&scaron;te ima povr&scaron;inu 900 m2, te je udaljeno samo 100 m od mora.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Infrastruktura odmah do parcele.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Smje&scaron;teno je nedaleko mora i prekrasnih sljunèanih pla¾a.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Restorani i trgovina u blizini.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za dodatne informacije molimo kontaktirajte nas ured.</p>', '<p>We have this building land of 900m sq with sea views, ideal for a large modern family house or villa with a swimming pool.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The land is located on the south side of the island, in a residential zone, but close to the natural woods and old farmland of the island.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The land has an area of 900 m2 and is located only 100 m from the sea, with direct access.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>All infrastructure ie electric/water phones etc is next to the plot.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There are restaurants, bars, cafes and shops nearby, as well as bus services to larger villages on the island.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For further information about building on the island, please contact our office.</p>', '', '1599_Land-plot_0.JPG', '1599_Land-plot_1.JPG', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(1600, '', 'Povi¹e Reinke', '', '', '', 'Hvar', 'Zavala, 3826/1', 'For sale', 'Land plot', '70', '1200', '0', 1, '222000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 0, 0, 'March 3, 2016', '<p>Graðevinsko zemlji&scaron;te na ju¾noj strani otoka Hvara u lijepom mjestu sa prekrasnim pla¾ama.&nbsp;Zemlji&scaron;te od 1200 m2 se nalazi treæi red od mora, ali ima pristup moru sa glavne ceste.&nbsp;Sa zemlji&scaron;ta se pru¾a odlièan pogled na more. Moguæa izgradnja obiteljske kuæe s bazenom. Moguæe takodjer izgraditi i dva objekta, prizemlje plus dva kata. Infrastruktura odmah do parcele. Restorani i trgovina u blizini.</p>', '<p>Large building land plot on the south side of the island in a beautiful village with beautiful beaches.&nbsp;The land is 1200 m2 and it is located in the third row from the sea, but has direct access to the sea from the village road. The land offers a great view of the sea and it is possible to construct a substantial family house/villa with a swimming pool, or two houses, with ground floor plus two floors.&nbsp;The infrastructure is next to the plot.&nbsp;Restaurants and shops nearby.</p>', '', '<p>Graðevinsko zemlji&scaron;te na ju¾noj strani otoka Hvara u lijepom mjestu sa prekrasnim pla¾ama.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Zemlji&scaron;te od 1200 m2 se nalazi treæi red od mora, ali ima pristup moru sa glavne ceste.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sa zemlji&scaron;ta se pru¾a odlièan pogled na more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Moguæa izgradnja obiteljske kuæe s bazenom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Moguæe takodjer izgraditi i dva objekta, prizemlje plus dva kata.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Infrastruktura odmah do parcele.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Restorani i trgovina u blizini.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Trajektna luka udaljena 10 km.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za dodatne informacije molimo kontaktirajte nas ured.</p>', '<p>Large building land plot on the south side of the island in a beautiful village with beautiful beaches.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The land is 1200 m2 and it is located in the third row from the sea, but has direct access to the sea from the village road.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The land offers a great view of the sea and it is possible to construct a substantial family house/villa with a swimming pool, or two houses, with ground floor plus two floors.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The infrastructure is next to the plot.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Restaurants and shops nearby.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The ferry port 10 km away.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For further information, please contact our office and arrange to visit the location.</p>', '', '1600_Land-plot_0.jpg', '1600_Land-plot_1.jpg', '1600_Land-plot_2.jpg', '1600_Land-plot_3.jpg', '1600_Land-plot_4.jpg', '', '', '', ''),
(1601, 'Elisa', 'Sandle', '', '00385 207 13803 Ivo', '00385 915296265 ', 'Peljesac', 'Fiskoviceva 26 Orebiæ', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '300', '0', '56', 1, '84500', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 2, 1, 'March 7, 2016', '<p>Prekrasan apartman s pogledom na more na Pelje&scaron;cu.&nbsp;Apartman se nalazi na drugom katu (ujedno potkrovlju) zgrade izgraðene 2004. godine.&nbsp;Sastoji se od dvije spavaæe sobe, kuhinje s blagovaonicom, dnevnog boravka i kupaonice ukupne stambene povr&scaron;ine 55,78 m2.&nbsp;Spavaæa soba ima izlaz na balkon.&nbsp;Parking mjesto ispred zgrade.&nbsp;Apartman se nalazi u izvrsnom stanju, renoviran prije 6 mjeseci.</p>', '<p>We have this beautiful apartment overlooking the sea on Peljesac peninsula. It is in a private block of just 6 apartments. The apartment is located on the second floor (top floor) of the building constructed in 2004.&nbsp;Inside the apartment the lounge and one bedroom has direct access onto the balcony. The apartment has an open plan kitchen and lounge and two double bedrooms and bathroom. Total floor area of 55.78 m2. The property comes with one secured parking space in front of the building.</p>', '', '<p>Prekrasan apartman s pogledom na more na Pelje&scaron;cu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartman se nalazi na drugom katu (ujedno potkrovlju) zgrade izgraðene 2004. godine.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sastoji se od dvije spavaæe sobe, kuhinje s blagovaonicom, dnevnog boravka i kupaonice ukupne stambene povr&scaron;ine 55,78 m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Spavaæa soba ima izlaz na balkon.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Parking mjesto ispred zgrade.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartman se nalazi u izvrsnom stanju, renoviran prije 6 mjeseci.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Dubrovnik je udaljen 110 km, a centar samog mjesta gdje se nalaze svi potrebni sadr¾aji je na udaljenosti 150 m.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za dodatne informacije molimo kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured u Splitu.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>We have this beautiful apartment overlooking the sea on Peljesac peninsula.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is in a private block of just 6 apartments.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The apartment is located on the second floor (top floor) of the building constructed in 2004.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Inside the apartment the lounge and one bedroom has direct access onto the balcony.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The apartment has an open plan kitchen and lounge and two double bedrooms and bathroom.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Total floor area of 55.78 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property comes with one secured parking space in front of the building.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The apartment is in excellent condition, renovated 6 months ago.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The centre of the village where there are shops, bars and cafes and other facilities is about 150m.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Dubrovnik is 110 km away.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For further information, please contact our office in Split.</p>', '', '1601_Apartment_0.jpeg', '1601_Apartment_1.jpeg', '1601_Apartment_2.jpeg', '1601_Apartment_3.jpeg', '1601_Apartment_4.jpeg', '1601_Apartment_5.jpeg', '1601_Apartment_6.jpeg', '1601_Apartment_7.jpeg', '1601_Apartment_8.jpeg'),
(1602, 'Jo¹ko', 'Puli¹eliæ', '021 632 510', '091 3321 487 ', 'Josko.puliselic@autotrans.hr josko.pulis', 'Brac', 'Mala Lozna III/24 Postira, Kc 1221/182, 183 ko postira', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '170', '430', '150', 1, '420000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 4, 3, 'March 8, 2016', '<p>Na prodaju nudimo obiteljsku kuæu sa sjeverne strane otoka Braèa, svega dvije minute hoda do pla¾e te 10tak minuta od centra mjesta.&nbsp;Kuæa se sastoji od dvije odvojene jedinice &ndash; prizemnog apartmana povr&scaron;ine 40 m2 (2 spavaæe sobe, 1 kupaonica) te prostranog apartmana na katu povr&scaron;ine 110 m2.&nbsp;Parcela trenutno ima 290 m2, no vlasnik je u postpku pripajanja dijela susjedne parcele, èime æe ukupna povr&scaron;ina zemlji&scaron;ta biti 430 m2. &nbsp;&nbsp;</p>', '<p>For sale we have this family house on the north side of Brac island, easy walk from the beach and not far from the center of the village.&nbsp;It comprises of 2 separate units &ndash; 40 sqm ground floor apartment and spacious 110 sqm first floor apartment.&nbsp;Both units feature terrace and the one upstairs offers seas views.&nbsp;Plot is sized 290 sqm at the moment, but the owner is in the process of extension to a nearby plot, which would give the total land size of 430 sqm.</p>', '', '<p>Na prodaju nudimo obiteljsku kuæu sa sjeverne strane otoka Braèa, svega dvije minute hoda do pla¾e te 10tak minuta od centra mjesta.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa se satoji od dvije odvojene jedinice &ndash; prizemnog apartmana povr&scaron;ine 40 m2 (2 spavaæe sobe, 1 kupaonica) te prostranog apartmana na katu povr&scaron;ine 110 m2 (2 spavaæe sobe, 2 kupaonice, 2 dnevna prostora sa kuhinjom).&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Obje jedinice imaju terase, a sa gornje se pru¾a pogled na more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartmani su u cijelosti opremljeni, namje&scaron;teni i klimatizirani.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Uz kuæu se nalazi parking te nedovr&scaron;ena gara¾a èiji krov mo¾e poslu¾iti za izgradnju bazena.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sa stra¾nje strane nalazi se vanjski ro&scaron;tilj.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Parcela trenutno ima 290 m2, no vlasnik je u postpku pripajanja dijela susjedne parcele, èime æe ukupna povr&scaron;ina zemlji&scaron;ta biti 430 m2. &nbsp;&nbsp;</p>', '<p>For sale we have this family house on the north side of Brac island, easy walk from the beach and not far from the center of the village.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It comprises of 2 separate units &ndash; 40 sqm ground floor apartment (2 bedrooms, 1 bathroom) and spacious 110 sqm first floor apartment (2 bedrooms, 2 bathrooms, 2 lounge areas with kitchens).&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Both units feature terrace and the one upstairs offers seas views.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartments are completely furnished, air-conditioned and living-ready.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property comes with the parking space, BBQ area on the back-side terrace as well as the garage (unfinished) designed to fit the pool on the top.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Plot is sized 290 sqm at the moment, but the owner is in the process of extension to a nearby plot, which would give the total land size of 430 sqm.</p>', '', '1602_House-Villa_0.jpg', '1602_House-Villa_1.jpg', '1602_House-Villa_2.jpg', '1602_House-Villa_3.jpg', '1602_House-Villa_4.jpg', '1602_House-Villa_5.jpg', '1602_House-Villa_6.jpg', '1602_House-Villa_7.jpg', '1602_House-Villa_8.jpg'),
(1603, 'Tomislav', 'Miletiæ', '', '099 506 6653', 'ivanamiletic3@gmail.com', 'Brac', 'Radovana Vidoviæa 53, Kc 956/2, 957/2,3, 954/2 ko sutivan', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '200', '1220', '170', 1, '800000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 1, 5, 4, 'March 8, 2016', '<p>Croatia Property Sales u prodaju nudi ovu lijepu kuæu na dvije eta¾e, stambene povr&scaron;ine ca. 180 m2, smje&scaron;tenu nedaleko od centra mjesta na otoku Braèu, 15 minuta vo¾nje od Supetra.&nbsp;U prizemlju kuæe nalazi se veliki apartman sa 3 spavaæe sobe.&nbsp;Vanjsko stepeni&scaron;te vodi na drugi kat gdje se nalaze dva identièna komforna studio apartmana, svaki sa otvorenim prostorom dnevnog boravka i sobe, èajne kuhinje i velike terase sa koje se pru¾a pogled na more. &nbsp;</p>', '<p>We are presenting this lovely house on two floors sized ca. 180 sqm internally, located near the center of the village on Brac island.&nbsp;On the ground floor there is a large 3-bedroom 1-bathroom apartment with living room, kitchen with bar, dining room and exit to a spacious terrace overlooking the pool and the garden. Living room and one of the bedrooms are air-conditioned.&nbsp;External staris are leading onto the first floor, which hosts two studio apartments, each containing open-plan living/sleeping area with kitchenette, bathroom and large terrace with sea views.&nbsp;</p>', '', '<p><strong>Lijepa kuæa sa bazenom</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Croatia Property Sales u prodaju nudi ovu lijepu kuæu na dvije eta¾e, stambene povr&scaron;ine ca. 180 m2, smje&scaron;tenu nedaleko od centra mjesta na otoku Braèu, 15 minuta vo¾nje od Supetra.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa se nalazi na prostranom zemlji&scaron;tu i okru¾ena je odr¾avanim vrtom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Uz objekt se nalaze natkriveni parking, djeèje igrali&scaron;te, bazen te vanjski ro&scaron;tilj.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U prizemlju kuæe nalazi se veliki apartman sa 3 spavaæe sobe, 1 kupaonicom, dnevnim prostorom, kuhinjom sa &scaron;ankom te izlazom na prostranu terasu sa pogledom na vrt i bazen.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Dnevni prostor i jedna spavaæa soba su klimatizirani.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Vanjsko stepeni&scaron;te vodi na drugi kat gdje se nalaze dva identièna komforna studio apartmana, svaki sa otvorenim prostorom dnevnog boravka i sobe, èajne kuhinje i velike terase sa koje se pru¾a pogled na more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za dodatne informacije molimo kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured u Splitu.&nbsp;</p>', '<p><strong>Lovely house with pool</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>We are presenting this lovely house on two floors sized ca. 180 sqm internally, located near the center of the village on Brac island, 15 min car ride from Supetar.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house sits on a large plot and is surrounded by well kept garden.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It features children''s playround, covered parking, swimming pool and BBQ area.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the ground floor there is a large 3-bedroom 1-bathroom apartment with living room, kitchen with bar, dining room and exit to a spacious terrace overlooking the pool and the garden.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Living room and one of the bedrooms are air-conditioned.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>External staris are leading onto the first floor, which hosts two studio apartments, each containing open-plan living/sleeping area with kitchenette, bathroom and large terrace with sea views.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For further information please contact our office in Split.&nbsp;</p>', '', '1603_House-Villa_0.jpg', '1603_House-Villa_1.jpg', '1603_House-Villa_2.jpg', '1603_House-Villa_3.jpg', '1603_House-Villa_4.jpg', '1603_House-Villa_5.jpg', '1603_House-Villa_6.jpg', '1603_House-Villa_7.jpg', '1603_House-Villa_8.jpg');
