(1604, 'Eduard', 'Podrug', 'supruga, 098 951 8821', '', 'silvana.podrug@gmail.com', 'Brac', 'Kralja Zvonimira 2  Sutivan, Kc 1242/18 ko Sutivan', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '80', '800', '610', 1, '1200000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 1, 13, 9, 'March 8, 2016', '<p>Croatia Property Sales predstavlja prostranu i iznimno dobro odr¾avanu vilu na otoku Braèu, svega nekoliko koraka od pla¾e te nekoliko minuta hoda od centra pitoresknog mjesta.&nbsp;Sa stra¾nje strane nalazi se pomoæni objekt &ndash; samostojeæa kuæica koju èini jednosoban apartman sa natkrivenom teraasom, tik do prostora bazena, ljetnog bara, mramornog stola za objedovanje na otvorenom i vanjskog tu&scaron;a.&nbsp;Sve su eta¾e u glavnom objektu vertikalno povezane unutarnjim stepeni&scaron;tem.&nbsp;Buduæem vlasniku nekretnina mo¾e donijeti znaèajan prihod od najma.</p>', '<p>Croatia Property Sales presents this spacious well maintained villa on Brac island, steps away from the beach.&nbsp;The back side of the garden contains auxiliary detached house &ndash; a small 1-bedroom apartment with covered terrace, right next to the pool area, with summer bar, sundeck, table for al-fresco dining and a shower.&nbsp;All the floors in the main buldlding are vertically connected throught by stairs.&nbsp;It may provide substantial rental income to the future owner.</p>', '', '<p>Croatia Property Sales predstavlja prostranu i iznimno dobro odr¾avanu vilu na otoku Braèu, svega nekoliko koraka od pla¾e te nekoliko minuta hoda od centra pitoresknog mjesta.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Prizemlje (suteren): sala za doruèak/objedovanje, vinski bar, kamin, kuhinja, sala za biljar, wc za goste i osoblje, spremi&scaron;te, praonica (pranje, su&scaron;enje i peglanje rublja).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kroz prostorije je ugraðena led rasvjeta, podno grijanje te izvrstan ventilacijski sistem.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na ovoj eta¾i nalazi se i mali studio apartman.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Prvi kat sadr¾i 2 apartmana koja se iznajmljuju turistima, od kojih se svaki sastoji od hodnika, kuhinje sa blagovaonicom, dnevne sobe, kupaonice te 3 spavaæe sobe (1 braèna, 1 dvokreveta i 1 pomoæna sa jednim krevetom).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Dnevni boravci i braène sobe izlaze na velike terase/balkone, od kojih neki imaju pogled na more dok neki gledaju u stra¾nji vrt sa bazenom.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na ovoj eta¾i nalazi se i stan vlasnika, a koji ima 1 spavaæu sobu, 1 kupaonicu te otvoreni koncept dnevnog boravka i kuhinje.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na drugom se katu nalaze takoðer 2 apartmana koja se iznajmljuju turistima.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Jedan od njih veliki je studio apartman sa dva kreveta, kuhinjom i blagovaonicom, kupaonicom te lijepim balkonom sa pogledom na more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Druga jedinica jednosobni je apartman sa otvorenim konceptom dnevnog boravka i kuhinje te kupaonicom. Ovaj apartman nema pogled na more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Preostale dvije jedinice u turistièkom najmu su studio apartmani, smje&scaron;teni u prizemlju objekta te pokraj parkirali&scaron;ta (sa velikom venjskom terasom povr&scaron;ine 30 m2).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sa stra¾nje strane nalazi se pomoæni objekt &ndash; samostojeæa kuæica koju èini jednosoban apartman sa natkrivenom teraasom, tik do prostora bazena, ljetnog bara, mramornog stola za objedovanje na otvorenom i vanjskog tu&scaron;a.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sve su eta¾e u glavnom objektu vertikalno povezane unutarnjim stepeni&scaron;tem.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Svi su apartmani klimatizirani, vrt iznimno dobro odr¾avan te cijela nekretnina ostavlja atraktivan dojam buduæi da se o njoj vodi kontinuirana briga.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Buduæem vlasniku nekretnina mo¾e donijeti znaèajan prihod od najma te je obilazak preporuèamo svakome zainteesiranom za ¾ivljenje na otoku kombinirano sa poslom u turistièkoj djelatnosti.</p>', '<p><strong>Villa with 9 apartments and pool &ndash; fantastic for rental business</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Croatia Property Sales presents this spacious well maintained villa on Brac island, steps away from the beach and easy walk from the center of the very charming village.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Semi-interred (ground) floor: breakfast/dining room, wine bar, fire place, kitchen, billiard room, toilets, storage, laundry (washer, dryer, ironer).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Led lights throughout, underfloor heating and excellent vent system.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On this floor there is also a small studio apartment.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>First floor contains 2 apartments used for rental, each with hallway, kitchen with dining room, living room, bathroom and 3 bedrooms (1 double, 1 twin and 1 auxiliary single room).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Living rooms and master bedrooms have access to beautiful terraces/balconies, some of which are facing the sea, while the others are facing garden/pool area.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>This level hosts the owner''s 1-bedroom 1-bathroom apartment with open-plan kitchen and living room.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Second floor has also 2 apartments used for rental.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>One of them is a large studio with 2 beds, kitchen and dining room, bathroom and lovely balcony with sea views.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The other unit is 1-bedroom apartment with open plan living room/kitchen and bathroom. It does not have sea views.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The remaining two rental units are both studio apartments, accessed from the ground floor and next to the parking (featuring 30 sqm terrace).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The back side of the garden contains auxiliary detached house &ndash; a small 1-bedroom apartment with covered terrace, right next to the pool area, with summer bar, sundeck, table for al-fresco dining and a shower. &nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>All the floors in the main building are vertically connected throught by stairs.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>All units are air-conditioned, garden lanscaped and the property is, overall, in an excellent condition.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It may provide substantial rental income to the future owner and anyone looking to combine relaxed island living with hospitality business should come to see this beautiful property. &nbsp;</p>', '', '1604_House-Villa_0.jpg', '1604_House-Villa_1.jpg', '1604_House-Villa_2.jpg', '1604_House-Villa_3.jpg', '1604_House-Villa_4.jpg', '1604_House-Villa_5.jpg', '1604_House-Villa_6.jpg', '1604_House-Villa_7.jpg', '1604_House-Villa_8.jpg'),
(1605, 'Danijela ', 'Èogelja', '', '091 545 6470', 'danijela.cogeljasanic@gmail.com', 'Sibenik', 'Kc 5854 ko Sibenik', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '25', '0', '79', 1, '150000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 1, 2, 'March 9, 2016', '<p>Na prodaju nudimo ovaj stan sa karakterom i velikim potencijalom u centru &Scaron;ibenika, svega nekoliko koraka od obale i turistièkih atrakcija.&nbsp;Apartman se prote¾e kroz 3 eta¾e i ima 79,50 m2 unutarnje povr&scaron;ine te mali balkon od 1 m2 na zadnjem katu.&nbsp;U stan se ulazi na prvi kat sa uliène strane. Ova eta¾a ima povr&scaron;inu 30 m2 te dva prozora. Drugi kat ima povr&scaron;inu 27 m2, dok je treæi kat povr&scaron;ine 22 m2, a u njemu je predviðen dnevni prostor.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;">CIJENA SNI®ENA SA 170.000 EUR!!</span></p>', '<p>We have this character property offering great potential in the heart of Sibenik, steps away from the city''s main promenade and all tourist attractions.&nbsp;It consists of apartments spreads over 3 floors with a floor area of 79,50 sqm internally, with 1 sqm balcony on the top floor.&nbsp;The entrance into the property is on the first floor (from the street level).&nbsp;Second floor is sized 27,50 sqm and the third floor 22 sqm.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;">PRICE REDUCED FROM 170.000 EUR!!</span></p>', '', '<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;"><strong>CIJENA SNI®ENA SA 170.000 EUR!!</strong></span></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Nekretnina sa karakterom u centru &Scaron;ibenika</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na prodaju nudimo ovaj stan sa karakterom i velikim potencijalom u centru &Scaron;ibenika, svega nekoliko koraka od obale i turistièkih atrakcija.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartman se prote¾e kroz 3 eta¾e i ima 79,50 m2 unutarnje povr&scaron;ine te mali balkon od 1 m2 na zadnjem katu.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U stan se ulazi na prvi kat sa uliène strane.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ova eta¾a ima povr&scaron;inu 30 m2 te dva prozora, a na njoj se nalaze hodnik, spavaæa soba i kupaonica.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na drugom katu, povr&scaron;ine 27 m2, nalazi se otvoreni prostor kuhinje i blagovaonice, takoðer sa dva prozora koja gledaju na uliènu (sjevernu) stranu.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Treæi kat povr&scaron;ine je 22 m2, a u njemu je predviðen dnevni prostor.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ova prostorija ima sedam prozora, od kojih dva gledaju na more.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nekretnini je potrebna renovacija, koja je veæ i zapoèeta ureðenjem kamenih zidova te djelomiènom zamjenom drvenih greda. Postavljene su instalacije za drugu kupaonicu.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Instalacije vode i struje su sprovedene, te postoje mjerila struje i vode.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Buduæem vlasniku ostavljene su brojne moguænosti dovr&scaron;enja prema vlastitim ¾eljama u smislu organizacije koncepta prostora i zavr&scaron;nih radova.&nbsp;</p>', '<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;"><strong>PRICE REDUCED FROM 170.000 EUR!!</strong></span></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Character property in Sibenik Old Town requiring renovation</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>We have this character property offering great potential in the heart of Sibenik, steps away from the city''s main promenade and all tourist attractions.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It consists of apartments spreads over 3 floors with a floor area of 79,50 sq m internally, with 1 sq m balcony on the top floor.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The entrance into the property is on the first floor (from the street level), and here there are two windows, a hallway, bedroom and bathroom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Second floor is sized 27,50 sqm and it consists of open-plan kitchen and dining area, featuring two windows as well, facing the street side on the north.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the third floor, sized 22 sqm, there is a living room.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>This room has seven windows, two of which are looking at the sea.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property needs renovating &ndash; stone walls have already been cleaned and part of the beams changed.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Wiring and plumbing have been put throughout the apartment, leaving many choices to the future owner with regards to the layout and finishing.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The local area is quiet but close to restaurants and the cafes/bars which are attractive and popular to tourists.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact our office in Split for more information.</p>', '', '1605_Apartment_0.jpg', '1605_Apartment_1.jpg', '1605_Apartment_2.jpg', '1605_Apartment_3.jpg', '1605_Apartment_4.jpg', '1605_Apartment_5.jpg', '1605_Apartment_6.jpg', '1605_Apartment_7.jpg', '1605_Apartment_8.jpg'),
(1606, 'Marija', 'Tripalo', '', 'Vjeko Tripalo 091 128 6105', 'vjeko.tripalo@gmail.com, k.c. 193, 429/5', 'Brac', 'Krnji Rat Splitska', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '15', '730', '150', 1, '490000', '', 2, 2, 2, 1, 1, 2, 4, 3, 'March 9, 2016', '<p>Na prodaju nudimo ovu kuæu u prvom redu uz more na otoku Braèu, na lijepoj lokaciji svega nekoliko koraka od mora te minutu hoda do centra mjesta.&nbsp;Kuæa ima dva kata (dvosobni stan na svakoj eta¾i), sveukupno 4 spavaæe sobe i 3 kupaonice. U dvori&scaron;tu se nalazi pomoæni objekt &ndash; ljetna kuhinja sa ro&scaron;tiljem. Na zemlji&scaron;tu se nalazi parkirali&scaron;no mjesto za 3 automobila, a ima dovoljno mjesta za izgradnju bazena.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>For sale we have this seafront house on Brac island, on a lovely location just steps away from the crystal clear sea and easy walk from the center of the village.&nbsp;The house has two floors (a 2-bedroom apartment on each), altogether counting 4 bedrooms and 3 bathrooms. There is fantastic outdoor space with summer kitchen and BBQ area, as well as car park in the front. The garden is landscaped and it has enough space to easily fit the swimming pool.&nbsp;</p>', '', '<p><strong>Kuæa u prvom redu uz more po atraktivnoj cijeni</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na prodaju nudimo ovu kuæu u prvom redu uz more na otoku Braèu, na lijepoj lokaciji svega nekoliko koraka od mora te minutu hoda do centra mjesta.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa ima dva kata (dvosobni stan na svakoj eta¾i), sveukupno 4 spavaæe sobe i 3 kupaonice.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U dvori&scaron;tu se nalazi pomoæni objekt &ndash; ljetna kuhinja sa ro&scaron;tiljem.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na zemlji&scaron;tu se nalazi parkiralipno mjesto za 3 automobila, a ima dovoljno mjesta za izgradnju bazena.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Iako je kuæa useljiva i prikljuèena na infrastrukturu, potrebna joj je renovacija.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Vlasnik je veæ ishodovao graðevinsku dozvolu prema kojoj bi se nekretnina preuredila u predivnu luksuznu vilu sa 5 spavaæih soba i 5 kupaonica, ukupne unutarnje povr&scaron;ine oko 240 m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nekretnina je ogla&scaron;ena po realnoj cijeni te je jedna od malobrojnih preostalih kuæa u prvom redu do mora na Braèu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Molimo kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured za dogovor oko razgledavanja.&nbsp;</p>', '<p><strong>Seafront house on Brac at very realistic price</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For sale we have this seafront house on Brac island, on a lovely location just steps away from the crystal clear sea and easy walk from the center of the village.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house has two floors (a 2-bedroom apartment on each), altogether counting 4 bedrooms and 3 bathrooms.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There is fantastic outdoor space with summer kitchen and BBQ area, as well as car park in the front.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The garden is landscaped and it has enough space to easily fit the swimming pool.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property is habitable and connected to all utilities.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>However, renovation is highly desirable.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The owner has already been given building permit for renovation and extension of the property, which would give a beautiful luxurious 5-bedroom 5-bathroom villa of nearly 240 sqm internally.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>This property is now listed at very realistic price and is one of few remaining seafront properties for sale on Brac.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact our office to arrange the viewing.&nbsp;</p>', '', '1606_House-Villa_0.jpg', '1606_House-Villa_1.jpg', '1606_House-Villa_2.jpg', '1606_House-Villa_3.jpg', '1606_House-Villa_4.jpg', '1606_House-Villa_5.jpg', '1606_House-Villa_6.jpg', '1606_House-Villa_7.jpg', '1606_House-Villa_8.jpg'),
(1607, 'Stefan ', 'Tittel', '', '+ 4915146451506', 'tittel.stefan@googlemail.com', 'Rogoznica', 'Ljoljinica Rogoznica, Kc 7904/9 Sevid', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '5', '460', '290', 1, '1650000', '', 2, 2, 2, 1, 1, 2, 2, 3, 'March 10, 2016', '<p>Na prodaju nudimo luksuznu vilu u prvom redu do mora, svega nekoliko minuta voznje od Rogoznice te 30 min od zracne luke Split.&nbsp;Vila je oblozena prirodnim kamenom, ukljucujuci i dvorisne zidove. Plocice od terakote nalaze se na terasi te se savrseno uklapaju u cjelokupni ugoðaj. Pla¾a se nalazi odmah ispod vile, skupa sa privezom za brod.&nbsp;Vrt je ureðen i odr¾avan, sa stablima palmi, maslina, limuna i naranèi. Sa stra¾nje strane zemlji&scaron;ta nalazi se parking za 2 automobila.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>For sale we have this luxurious seafront villa, a few minutes ride from Rogoznica town and just 30 min away from Split airport.&nbsp;The villa is tiled in natural stone, including the garden walls. Terracota tiles are found on the terrace and they perfectly match the overal decor. The beach lies right in front of the property, along with mooring for the boat.&nbsp;The garden is landscaped and well kept, with palm, olive, orange and lemon trees. The property can be accessed with the car and there are 2 parking places from the back side of the plot.&nbsp;</p>', '', '<p><strong>Luksuzna vila u prvom redu do mora sa vezom za brod</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na prodaju nudimo luksuznu vilu u prvom redu do mora, svega nekoliko minuta voznje od Rogoznice te 30 min od zracne luke Split.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Vila je oblozena prirodnim kamenom, ukljucujuci i dvorisne zidove.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Plocice od terakote nalaze se na terasi te se savrseno uklapaju u cjelokupni ugoðaj.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Pla¾a se nalazi odmah ispod vile, skupa sa privezom za brod.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Vrt je ureðen i odr¾avan, sa stablima palmi, maslina, limuna i naranèi.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sa stra¾nje strane zemlji&scaron;ta nalazi se parking za 2 automobila.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U prizemlju se nalazi veliki dnevni boravak sa kaminom i staklenim stijenkama koje pruzaju mnogo svjetla, kuhinja, ostava i wc.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Unutarsnje stepeniste vodi na kat na kojem se nalaze kupaonica i tri spavace sobe (od kojih jedna sa vlastitom kupaonicom). &nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sve prostorije imaju pogled na more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nekretnina je u cijelosti namjestena, ukljucujuci poseban sustav kontrole svjetla i grijanja, alarm, bezicni internet, video nadzor itd.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za dodatne informacije molimo kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured u Splitu.&nbsp;</p>', '<p><strong>Luxurious seafront villa with mooring</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For sale we have this luxurious seafront villa, a few minutes ride from Rogoznica town and just 30 min away from Split airport.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The villa is tiled in natural stone, including the garden walls.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Terracota tiles are found on the terrace and they perfectly match the overal decor.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The beach lies right in front of the property, along with mooring for the boat.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The garden is landscaped and well kept, with palm, olive, orange and lemon trees.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property can be accessed with the car and there are 2 parking places from the back side of the plot.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the ground floor there is a large living area with fire place and glass doors that allow plenty of sunlight, a kitchen, storage and toilet.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Internal stairs lead onto the first floor, containing master bedroom (en-suite), another two bedrooms and bathroom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>All bathrooms have walk-in showers.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>All rooms feature sea views.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property is fully furnished, including bus lighting and heating control system, alarm, wi-fi, video surveillance etc.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For further information please contact our office in Split.&nbsp;</p>', '', '1607_House-Villa_0.jpg', '1607_House-Villa_1.jpg', '1607_House-Villa_2.jpg', '1607_House-Villa_3.jpg', '1607_House-Villa_4.jpg', '1607_House-Villa_5.jpg', '1607_House-Villa_6.jpg', '1607_House-Villa_7.jpg', '1607_House-Villa_8.jpg'),
(1608, 'Stefan ', 'Tittel', '', '+ 4915146451506', 'tittel.stefan@googlemail.com', 'Rogoznica', 'Kc 10393/5 Sevid, Stiva¹nica Rogoznica', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '10', '400', '235', 1, '1100000', '', 2, 2, 2, 1, 1, 1, 3, 3, 'March 10, 2016', '<p>Croatia Property Sales vam nudi predivnu modernu vilu u prvom redu do mora, smjestenu u maloj uvali svega nekoliko minuta voznje od Rogoznice.&nbsp;Nekretnina ima odlican pogled na more te luksuzna obiljezja kao sto su podno grijanje, centralni sustav kontrole rasvjete, led svjetla, video nadzor, infinity bazen itd.&nbsp;Dvoriste je ureðeno, a sa stra¾nje strane nalaze se parkiralisna mjesta i gara¾a.&nbsp;Interijer prizemlja zasnovan je na konceptu otvorenog prostora.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>Croatia Property Sales offers you this contemporary villa in the first line to the sea located in a small beautiful bay only 10 min drive from Rogoznica town.The property boasts lovely sea views and has some exclusive features such as underfloor heating, bus lighting control system, led lights, video surveillance, infinity pool etc. Garden is lanscaped and there are both parking places and garage. &nbsp;</p>', '', '<p><strong>Moderna vila sa bazenom</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Croatia Property Sales vam nudi predivnu modernu vilu u prvom redu do mora, smjestenu u maloj uvali svega nekoliko minuta voznje od Rogoznice.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nekretnina ima odlican pogled na more te luksuzna obiljezja kao sto su podno grijanje, centralni sustav kontrole rasvjete, led svjetla, video nadzor, infinity bazen itd.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Dvoriste je ureðeno, a sa stra¾nje strane nalaze se parkiralisna mjesta i gara¾a.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Interijer prizemlja zasnovan je na konceptu otvorenog prostora.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U prizemlju se nalaze dnevni boravak sa kaminom, kuhinja i kuaponica.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Unutarnje stepeniste vodi na prvi kat na kojem se nalaze 2 spavace sobe i kupaonica.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Glavna spavaca soba ima kamin i mali balkon sa lijepim pogledom na more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na drugom katu nalazi se ulaz u vilu (sa uliène strane, buduæi da je teren kaskadnog oblika), spavaæa soba, dnevni boravak te kupaonica.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za dodatne informacije molimo kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured u Splitu.&nbsp;</p>', '<p><strong>Luxurious seafront villa with pool</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Croatia Property Sales offers you this contemporary villa in the first line to the sea located in a small beautiful bay only 10 min drive from Rogoznica town.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property boasts lovely sea views and has some exclusive features such as underfloor heating, bus lighting control system, led lights, video surveillance, infinity pool etc.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Garden is lanscaped and there are both parking places and garage. &nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The interior of the ground floor is based on open-plan concept.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the ground floor there are living room with fire place, kitchen and bathroom.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Internal stairs lead on the first floor, containing 2 bedrooms and a bathroom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Master bedroom features fire place and small balcony with superb views.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the second floor there is an entrance into the villa (from the street side, due to sloping ground), another bedroom, open-plan living area and a bathroom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For further information please contact our office in Split.&nbsp;</p>', '', '1608_House-Villa_0.jpg', '1608_House-Villa_1.jpg', '1608_House-Villa_2.jpg', '1608_House-Villa_3.jpg', '1608_House-Villa_4.jpg', '1608_House-Villa_5.jpg', '1608_House-Villa_6.jpg', '1608_House-Villa_7.jpg', '1608_House-Villa_8.jpg'),
(1609, 'Stefan ', 'Tittel', '', '+ 4915146451506', 'tittel.stefan@googlemail.com', 'Rogoznica', 'Stiva¹nica Rogoznica', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '50', '500', '225', 1, '850000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 1, 4, 3, 'March 10, 2016', '<p>Croatia Property Sales vam nudi predivnu modernu vilu u drugom redu do mora, smjestenu u maloj uvali svega nekoliko minuta voznje od Rogoznice.&nbsp;Nekretnina ima odlican pogled na more te luksuzna obiljezja kao sto su podno grijanje, centralni sustav kontrole rasvjete, led svjetla, video nadzor, infinity bazen itd.&nbsp;Dvoriste je ureðeno, a sa stra¾nje strane nalaze se dva parkiralisna mjesta.&nbsp;Interijer prizemlja zasnovan je na konceptu otvorenog prostora.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>Croatia Property Sales offers you this contemporary villa in the second line to the sea located in a small beautiful bay only 10 min drive from Rogoznica town.&nbsp;The property boasts lovely sea views and has some exclusive features such as underfloor heating, bus lighting control system, led lights, video surveillance, infinity pool etc.&nbsp;Garden is lanscaped and there are 2 parking places from the back side of the property.&nbsp;The interior of the ground floor is based on open-plan concept.</p>', '', '<p><strong>Moderna vila sa bazenom</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Croatia Property Sales vam nudi predivnu modernu vilu u drugom redu do mora, smjestenu u maloj uvali svega nekoliko minuta voznje od Rogoznice.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nekretnina ima odlican pogled na more te luksuzna obiljezja kao sto su podno grijanje, centralni sustav kontrole rasvjete, led svjetla, video nadzor, infinity bazen itd.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Dvoriste je ureðeno, a sa stra¾nje strane nalaze se dva parkiralisna mjesta.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Interijer prizemlja zasnovan je na konceptu otvorenog prostora.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U prizemlju se nalaze dnevni boravak sa blagovaonicom, kaminom, kuhinjom i krovnim prozorom, pomocne prostorije i wc.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Unutarnje stepeniste vodi na prvi kat na kojem se nalaze 4 spavace sobe i 3 kupaonice.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Glavna spavaca soba ima vlasititu kupaonicu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za dodatne informacije molimo kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured u Splitu.&nbsp;</p>', '<p><strong>Modern villa with pool</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Croatia Property Sales offers you this contemporary villa in the second line to the sea located in a small beautiful bay only 10 min drive from Rogoznica town.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property boasts lovely sea views and has some exclusive features such as underfloor heating, bus lighting control system, led lights, video surveillance, infinity pool etc.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Garden is lanscaped and there are 2 parking places from the back side of the property.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The interior of the ground floor is based on open-plan concept.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the ground floor there are living and dining room with fire place and skylight, utility rooms and toilet.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Internal stairs lead on the first floor, containing 4 bedrooms and 3 bathrooms.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Master bedroom is en-suite and it has separate dressing room.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For further information please contact our office in Split.&nbsp;</p>', '', '1609_House-Villa_0.jpg', '1609_House-Villa_1.jpg', '1609_House-Villa_2.jpg', '1609_House-Villa_3.jpg', '1609_House-Villa_4.jpg', '1609_House-Villa_5.jpg', '1609_House-Villa_6.jpg', '1609_House-Villa_7.jpg', '1609_House-Villa_8.jpg'),
(1610, 'Nikola', 'Deniæ', 'Tel: 098/173 1721 ', 'Mob: 098/173 1721', 'nikoladenic2@gmail.com', 'Split', ' Bijankinijeva 6 Split, z.u. 5114', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '190', '0', '76', 2, '320000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 3, 1, 'March 11, 2016', '<p>Atraktivan apartman s pogledom na more na Baèvicama.&nbsp;Apartman se nalazi na zadnjem (petom) katu stambene zgrade, te ima povr&scaron;inu 76 m2 i loðu od 10 m2 s koje se pru¾a prekrasan pogled.&nbsp;Stan je kompletno renoviran po najvi&scaron;im standardima, a zbog dobre izolacije krovi&scaron;ta nema temperaturnih skokova.&nbsp;Pri renovaciji stana ugraðeni su samo kvalitetni materijali poput mramora u kupaonici i kuhinji te afrièkog parketa u ostatku stana.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>This is a beautiful apartment with sea views situated in an attractive location in the town.&nbsp;It is situated close to the old town centre and town beaches, on the top (fifth) floor, giving breathtaking views of the harbour and islands further out to sea. The apartment has a surface of 76 m2 and 10 m2 lodge which is wide enough to enjoy alfresco meals whilst enjoying the view. The apartment has been fully renovated and decorated to the highest standards, with many attractive features for comfort and modern living.&nbsp;</p>', '', '<p>Atraktivan apartman s pogledom na more na Baèvicama.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartman se nalazi na zadnjem (petom) katu stambene zgrade, te ima povr&scaron;inu 76 m2 i loðu od 10 m2 s koje se pru¾a prekrasan pogled.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Stan je kompletno renoviran po najvi&scaron;im standardima, a zbog dobre izolacije krovi&scaron;ta nema temperaturnih skokova.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Pri renovaciji stana ugraðeni su samo kvalitetni materijali poput mramora u kupaonici i kuhinji te afrièkog parketa u ostatku stana.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Energetski certifikat razred B.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Orijentacija istok &ndash; zapad.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U cijenu stana uraèunat je i pripadajuæi visokokvalitetan Meblo i Kare namje&scaron;taj te ugradbeni ormari kao i klimatizacija u svim prostorijama.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Postoji i moguænost kupnje stana bez namje&scaron;taja.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Zgrada je izgraðena 2000. godine, dok je zadnja adaptacija apartmana bila 2010 . godine.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartman je smje&scaron;ten svega par minuta hoda od centra grada sa jedne strane te kupali&scaron;ta Baèvice sa druge strane &scaron;to ga èini idealnim za turistièko iznajmljivanje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Unatoè tome nalazi se u mirnom okru¾enju li&scaron;en buke.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Takoðer su u blizini &scaron;kola, vrtiæ i supermarket pa je idealan i za obiteljski ¾ivot.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za dodatne informacije molimo kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured u Splitu.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>This is a beautiful apartment with sea views situated in an attractive location in the town.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is situated close to the old town centre and town beaches, on the top (fifth) floor, giving breathtaking views of the harbour and islands further out to sea.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The apartment has a surface of 76 m2 and 10 m2 lodge which is wide enough to enjoy alfresco meals whilst enjoying the view.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The apartment has been fully renovated and decorated to the highest standards, with many attractive features for comfort and modern living.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The flooring is marble for the kitchen and bathrooms, and wooden parquet in the rest of the property.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The price includes the respective high quality Meblo and Kare furniture and built-in wardrobes as well air conditioning in all rooms.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Energy certificate class B.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Orientation is East - West.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There is also the possibility of buying the apartment without furniture.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The building was built in 2000, while the last renovation of the apartment was the 2010th year.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The block is well maintained and in good condition.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Despite being in a central location it is in a quiet environment and devoid of noise.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is within walking distance of most of the historic attractions of Split, the travel hub, and many shops, bars and restaurants.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>All this makes this an ideal property for renting to tourists and visitors to the city.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For further information, please contact our office in Split.</p>', '', '1610_Apartment_0.jpg', '1610_Apartment_1.jpg', '1610_Apartment_2.jpg', '1610_Apartment_3.jpg', '1610_Apartment_4.jpg', '1610_Apartment_5.jpg', '1610_Apartment_6.jpg', '1610_Apartment_7.jpg', ''),
(1611, '', 'Sitno Holding', '+44 20 8123 0590,', 'Dominika Boledovièova +421 2 3990 0007', 'info@guduce.com, dboledovicova@sitno.sk ', 'Zadar', 'Put Kalje¹ine, Kc 2835/46,45 ko Ugljan', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '250', '520', '130', 1, '285000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 1, 4, 3, 'March 15, 2016', '<p>Croatia Property Sales predstavlja 2 lijepe vile na otoku Ugljanu, svega pola sata vo¾nje trajektom od Zadra.&nbsp;Vile se nalaze unutar malog naselja sa privatnom pla¾om koja je dostupna vlasnicima kuæa i njihovim gostima. Na zemlji&scaron;tu ima dovoljno parkirali&scaron;nih mjesta, a mjesto Ugljan udaljeno je 3 km.&nbsp;Obje kuæe imaju 4 spavaæe sobe i 3 kupaonice, potpuno su namje&scaron;tene i opremljene.&nbsp;Svaka vila se satoji od podruma, prizemlja i galerije.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>Croatia Property Sales presents 2 beautiful homes on Ugljan island, a short ferry ride from Zadar city.&nbsp;Houses are set within the small resort with private beach, accessible to the property owners and their guests. There are parking facilities on the site and the village of Ugljan is only 3 km away.&nbsp;These are both 4-bedroom 3-bathroom fully furnished villas.&nbsp;Each house consists of a basement, ground floor and gallery.</p>', '', '<p>Croatia Property Sales predstavlja 2 lijepe vile na otoku Ugljanu, svega pola sata vo¾nje trajektom od Zadra.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Vile se nalaze unutar malog naselja sa privatnom pla¾om koja je dostupna vlasnicima kuæa i njihovim gostima.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na zemlji&scaron;tu ima dovoljno parkirali&scaron;nih mjesta, a mjesto Ugljan udaljeno je 3 km.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Obje kuæe imaju 4 spavaæe sobe i 3 kupaonice, potpuno su namje&scaron;tene i opremljene.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Svaka vila se satoji od podruma, prizemlja i galerije.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U prizemlju se nalaze prostrani dnevni boravak, blagovaonica, spavaæa soba i kupaonica.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U galeriji su smje&scaron;tene tri spavaæe sobe i dvije kupaonice.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Vile je klimatizirane, a imaju i bazen povr&scaron;ine 24 m2, lijepo odr¾avani vrt i pogled na more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Villa 1: 250 m od mora, 130 m2 stambene povr&scaron;ine, 580 m2 parcela, 285.000 EUR</strong> - <span style="color: #ff0000;"><strong>PRODANO</strong></span></p>\r\n<p><strong><br /></strong></p>\r\n<p><strong>Villa 2: 265 m od mora, 130 m2 stambene povr&scaron;ine, 520 m2 parcela, 285.000 EUR</strong></p>', '<p>Croatia Property Sales presents 2 beautiful homes on Ugljan island, a short ferry ride from Zadar city.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Houses are set within the small resort with private beach, accessible to the property owners and their guests.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There are parking facilities on the site and the village of Ugljan is only 3 km away.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>These are both 4-bedroom 3-bathroom fully furnished villas.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Each house consists of a basement, ground floor and gallery.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the ground floor there is a spacious exquisitely furnished living room, dining room, bedroom and bathroom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Gallery contains 3 bedroms and 2 bathrooms.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Villas are air-conditioned and feature 24 sqm pool, well kept garden and sea views.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Villa 1: 250 m from the sea, 130 sqm living area, 580 sqm plot, 285.000 EUR</strong> - <span style="color: #ff0000;"><strong>SOLD</strong></span></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Villa 2: 265 m from the sea, 130 sqm living area, 520 sqm plot, 285.000 EUR</strong></p>', '', '1611_House-Villa_0.jpg', '1611_House-Villa_1.jpg', '1611_House-Villa_2.jpg', '1611_House-Villa_3.jpg', '1611_House-Villa_4.jpg', '1611_House-Villa_5.jpg', '1611_House-Villa_6.jpg', '1611_House-Villa_7.jpg', '1611_House-Villa_8.jpg'),
(1612, '', 'Sitno Holding', '+44 20 8123 0590', 'Dominika Boledovièova +421 2 3990 0007', 'info@guduce.com, dboledovicova@sitno.sk ', 'Zadar', 'Guduæe, Ugljan, Kc 2835/59 ko Ugljan', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '20', '570', '120', 1, '370000', '', 2, 2, 2, 1, 1, 1, 3, 3, 'March 15, 2016', '<p>Croatia Property Sales predstavlja predivnu vilu na otoku Ugljanu, svega pola sata vo¾nje trajektom od Zadra.&nbsp;Nekretnina se nalazi unutar malog naselja sa privatnom pla¾om koja je dostupna vlasnicima kuæa i njihovim gostima. Na zemlji&scaron;tu ima dovoljno parkirali&scaron;nih mjesta, a mjesto Ugljan udaljeno je 3 km.&nbsp;Ovo je kuæa u prvom redu do mora sa 3 spavaæe sobe i 3 kupaonice, potpuno namje&scaron;tena i opremljena.</p>', '<p>Croatia Property Sales presents this beautiful home on Ugljan island, a short ferry ride from Zadar city.&nbsp;The property is set within the small resort with private beach, accessible to the property owners and their guests. There are parking facilities on the site and the village of Ugljan is only 3 km away.&nbsp;This is a 3-bedroom 3-bathroom fully furnished seafront villa, only 20 meters from the beach.</p>', '', '<p>Croatia Property Sales predstavlja predivnu vilu na otoku Ugljanu, svega pola sata vo¾nje trajektom od Zadra.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nekretnina se nalazi unutar malog naselja sa privatnom pla¾om koja je dostupna vlasnicima kuæa i njihovim gostima.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na zemlji&scaron;tu ima dovoljno parkirali&scaron;nih mjesta, a mjesto Ugljan udaljeno je 3 km.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ovo je kuæa u prvom redu do mora sa 3 spavaæe sobe i 3 kupaonice, potpuno namje&scaron;tena i opremljena.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Vila se satoji od podruma, prizemlja i galerije.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U prizemlju se nalaze prostrani dnevni boravak, blagovaonica, spavaæa soba i kupaonica.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U galeriji su smje&scaron;tene dvije spavaæe sobe, svaka sa svojom kupaonicom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Vila je klimatizirana, a ima i bazen povr&scaron;ine 24 m2, lijepo odr¾avani vrt i pogled na more.</p>', '<p>Croatia Property Sales presents this beautiful home on Ugljan island, a short ferry ride from Zadar city.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property is set within the small resort with private beach, accessible to the property owners and their guests.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There are parking facilities on the site and the village of Ugljan is only 3 km away.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>This is a 3-bedroom 3-bathroom fully furnished seafront villa, only 20 meters from the beach.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house consists of a basement, ground floor and gallery.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the ground floor there is a spacious exquisitely furnished living room, dining room, bedroom and bathroom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Gallery contains two en-suite bedrooms.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Villa is air-conditioned and features 24 sqm pool, well kept garden and sea views.&nbsp;</p>', '', '1612_House-Villa_0.jpg', '1612_House-Villa_1.jpg', '1612_House-Villa_2.jpg', '1612_House-Villa_3.jpg', '1612_House-Villa_4.jpg', '1612_House-Villa_5.jpg', '1612_House-Villa_6.jpg', '1612_House-Villa_7.jpg', '1612_House-Villa_8.jpg'),
