 sobe, svaka sa svojom kupaonicom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Vile je klimatizirane, a imaju i bazen povr&scaron;ine 24 m2, lijepo odr¾avani vrt i pogled na more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Villa 1: 40 m od mora, 120 m2 stambene povr&scaron;ine, 585 m2 parcela, 350.000 EUR - <span style="color: #ff0000;"><strong>PRODANO</strong><strong></strong></span></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Villa 2: 55 m od mora, 120 m2 stambene povr&scaron;ine, 590 m2 parcela, 330.000 EUR.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Villa 3: 70 m od mora, 120 m2 stambene povr&scaron;ine, 625 m2 parcela, 310.000 EUR - <span style="color: #ff0000;"><strong>PRODANO</strong></span></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Villa 4: 90 m od mora, 120 m2 stambene povr&scaron;ine, 600 m2 parcela, 295.000 EUR.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Villa 5: 110 m od mora, 120 m2 stambene povr&scaron;ine, 600 m2 parcela, 285.000 EUR - <span style="color: #ff0000;"><strong>PRODANO</strong></span></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Villa 6: 125 m od mora, 120 m2 stambene povr&scaron;ine, 600 m2 parcela, 290.000 EUR - <span style="color: #ff0000;"><strong>PRODANO</strong></span></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Villa 7: 140 m od mora, 120 m2 stambene povr&scaron;ine, 600 m2 parcela, 290.000 EUR - <span style="color: #ff0000;"><strong>PRODANO</strong><strong></strong></span></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Villa 8: 160 m od mora, 120 m2 stambene povr&scaron;ine, 600 m2 parcela, 320.000 EUR - <span style="color: #ff0000;"><strong>REZERVIRANO</strong></span></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Villa 9: 180 m od mora, 120 m2 stambene povr&scaron;ine, 595 m2 parcela, 320.000 EUR - <span style="color: #ff0000;"><strong>REZERVIRANO</strong></span></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Villa 10: 195 m od mora, 120 m2 stambene povr&scaron;ine, 595 m2 parcela, 320.000 EUR - <span style="color: #ff0000;"><strong>PRODANO</strong></span></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Villa 11: 210 m od mora, 120 m2 stambene povr&scaron;ine, 595 m2 parcela, 300.000 EUR.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Villa 12: 230 m od mora