(1614, 'Hrvoje ', 'Skenderoviæ', '', '098 97 48 309', 'hrvoje@ifs.hr', 'Brac', 'Punta Splitska, k.c. 199/227 k.o. splitska', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '60', '400', '70', 1, '180000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 2, 2, 'March 16, 2016', '<p>Lijepa kuæa u nizu koncipirana kao dvoeta¾ni apartman, u drugom redu od mora u malom mjestu sa sjeverne strane otoka Braèa, svega 8 min vo¾nje od Supetra.&nbsp;U prizemlju se nalaze kuhinja, dnevni boravak, kupaonica, ostava i terasa. Na katu kuæe nalaze se 2 spavaæe sobe, kupaonica i terasa. Kuæa ima oko 70 m2 unutarnjeg prostora, ne raèunajuæi i dvije terase od kojih svaka ima povr&scaron;inu oko 12 m2.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>Lovely semi-detached house, second line to the sea, located in a small charming village on the northern side of Brac island, only 8 min car ride from the main ferry port in Supetar.&nbsp;On the ground floor there is a kitchen, living room, bathroom, storage and terrace. First floor contains 2 bedooms, bathroom and terrace. The house has ca. 70 sqm internally, excluding two terraces sized around 12 sqm each.&nbsp;</p>', '', '<p><strong>Lijepa kuæa u nizu koncipirana kao dvoeta¾ni apartman</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Lijepa kuæa u nizu koncipirana kao dvoeta¾ni apartman, u drugom redu od mora u malom mjestu sa sjeverne strane otoka Braèa, svega 8 min vo¾nje od Supetra.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U prizemlju se nalaze kuhinja, dnevni boravak, kupaonica, ostava i terasa.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na katu kuæe nalaze se 2 spavaæe sobe, kupaonica i terasa.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa ima oko 70 m2 unutarnjeg prostora, ne raèunajuæi i dvije terase od kojih svaka ima povr&scaron;inu oko 12 m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Okuænica je dobro odr¾avana, a u vrtu se nalaze kamin, parkirali&scaron;te i gara¾a.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za dodatne informacije molimo kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured u Splitu.&nbsp;</p>', '<p><strong>Lovely semi-detached house designed as duplex apartment</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Lovely semi-detached house, second line to the sea, located in a small charming village on the northern side of Brac island, only 8 min car ride from the main ferry port in Supetar.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the ground floor there is a kitchen, living room, bathroom, storage and terrace.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>First floor contains 2 bedooms, bathroom and terrace.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house has ca. 70 sqm internally, excluding two terraces sized around 12 sqm each.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Well maintained garden features BBQ area, parking and garage.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For further information please contact our office in Split.&nbsp;</p>', '', '1614_House-Villa_0.jpg', '1614_House-Villa_1.jpg', '1614_House-Villa_2.jpg', '1614_House-Villa_3.jpg', '1614_House-Villa_4.jpg', '1614_House-Villa_5.jpg', '1614_House-Villa_6.jpg', '1614_House-Villa_7.jpg', '1614_House-Villa_8.jpg');
