(1615, 'Mara Sardeliæ', 'Nedjeljko Sardeliæ Z', '', '0911696486', 'msardelic2@gmail.com', 'Korcula', 'Korèula, predio Lozica, 16763/469, KO Bl', 'For sale', 'Land plot', '40', '1000', '0', 1, '170000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 0, 0, 'March 16, 2016', '<p>Prodajemo atraktivno zemlji&scaron;te na otoku Korèuli.&nbsp;Zemlji&scaron;te se nalazi &nbsp;svega 40 m od mora i sa njega se pru¾a pogled na more. U blizini je mirne uvale sa kristalno èistim morem.&nbsp;Zemlji&scaron;te koje je predmet prodaje trenutaèno je istoèni dio veæe parcele te je potrebno napraviti parcelaciju kod ishodovanja lokacijske dozvole.&nbsp;Sva infrastruktura je u blizini.</p>', '<p>We are offering attractive land plot on the island of Korcula.&nbsp;The land plot is only 40 m from the sea and it offers very nice sea views. It is close to the crystal sea bay.&nbsp;The land plot which is for sale is at the moment east part of a bigger land plot and one would need to make dividing the land plots into two during the process of getting the location permit.&nbsp;The entire infrastructure is nearby.</p>', '', '<p><strong>Prodajemo atraktivno zemlji&scaron;te na otoku Korèuli</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Zemlji&scaron;te se nalazi &nbsp;svega 40 m od mora i sa njega se pru¾a pogled na more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U blizini je mirne uvale sa kristalno èistim morem.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Zemlji&scaron;te koje je predmet prodaje trenutaèno je istoèni &nbsp;dio veæe parcele te je potrebno napraviti parcelaciju kod ishodovanja lokacijske dozvole.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sva infrastruktura je u blizini.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Zemlji&scaron;te je udaljeno 5 km od Blata te 7 km od Vela Luke.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za sva dodatna pitanja molimo kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured.</p>', '<p><strong>We are offering attractive land plot on the island of Korcula</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The land plot is only 40 m from the sea and it offers very nice sea views.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is close to the crystal sea bay.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The land plot which is for sale is at the moment east part of a bigger land plot and one would need to make dividing the land plots into two during the process of getting the location permit.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The entire infrastructure is nearby.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The land plot is situated 5 km from Blato and 7 km from Vela Luka.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For all additional information please contact our office.</p>', '', '1615_Land-plot_0.jpg', '1615_Land-plot_1.jpg', '1615_Land-plot_2.jpg', '1615_Land-plot_3.jpg', '', '', '', '', ''),
(1616, 'Emil ©o¹tariæ', 'Albedo, Emil ©o¹tari', '', '098 507 989', 'emil@albedonekretnine.hr ', 'Makarska', 'Makarska', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '200', '0', '78', 1, '185000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 3, 2, 'March 16, 2016', '<p>U prodaji nudimo lijepi dvoeta¾ni stan, svega 200tinjak metara od mora te 10 min hoda od centra grada.&nbsp;Stan se nalazi na 4 (zadnjem) katu zgrade sa liftom i parkirali&scaron;nim mjestom, ispod jadranske magistrale.&nbsp;Na donjoj eta¾i nalaze se kuhinja i blagovaonica, dnevni boravak, hodnik, kupaonica, spavaæa soba i loða sa pogledom na more i grad. Gornju eta¾u zauzimaju predsoblje, dvije spavaæe sobe i kupaonica.&nbsp;Stan je ju¾no orijentiran, rijetko kori&scaron;ten i izvrsno oèuvan te potpuno opremljen i namje&scaron;ten.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>For sale we have this lovely duplex apartment, only 200 meters from the sea and about 10 min walk from the center of the town.&nbsp;Apartment is on the 4th (last) floor of the building, featuring elevator and parking place. The building is located below the main coastal road.&nbsp;The property is south-oriented. It has been rarely used and is in excelletn condition, fully furnished and equipped.</p>', '', '<p><strong>Lijepi dvoeta¾ni stan blizu centra Makarske</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U prodaji nudimo lijepi dvoeta¾ni stan, svega 200tinjak metara od mora te 10 min hoda od centra grada.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Stan se nalazi na 4. (zadnjem) katu zgrade sa liftom i parkirali&scaron;nim mjestom, ispod jadranske magistrale.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na donjoj eta¾i nalaze se kuhinja i blagovaonica, dnevni boravak, hodnik, kupaonica, spavaæa soba i loða sa pogledom na more i grad.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Gornju eta¾u zauzimaju predsoblje, dvije spavaæe sobe i kupaonica.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Stan je ju¾no orijentiran, rijetko kori&scaron;ten i izvrsno oèuvan te potpuno opremljen i namje&scaron;ten.&nbsp;</p>', '<p><strong>Beautiful duplex near the center of Makarska</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For sale we have this lovely duplex apartment, only 200 meters from the sea and about 10 min walk from the center of the town.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartment is on the 4th (last) floor of the building, featuring elevator and parking place.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The building is located below the main coastal road.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Lower level has bedroom, bathroom, hall, kitchen and dining room, living room and balcony with great views.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Upper level (gallery) contains lobby, 2 bedrooms and bathroom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property is south-oriented.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It has been rarely used and is in excelletn condition, fully furnished and equipped.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For further information please contact our office in Split.&nbsp;</p>', '', '1616_Apartment_0.jpg', '1616_Apartment_1.jpg', '1616_Apartment_2.jpg', '1616_Apartment_3.jpg', '1616_Apartment_4.jpg', '1616_Apartment_5.jpg', '1616_Apartment_6.jpg', '1616_Apartment_7.jpg', '1616_Apartment_8.jpg'),
(1617, 'Emil ©o¹tariæ', 'Albedo, Emil ©o¹tari', '098 507 989', '', 'emil@albedonekretnine.hr ', 'Makarska', 'Makarska', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '450', '0', '59', 1, '106200', '', 2, 1, 2, 2, 1, 2, 2, 1, 'March 16, 2016', '<p>U prodaji nudimo stanove u novogradnji u Makarskoj, ispod jadranske magistrale. Zgrada ima ukupno 16 stanova, a slobodni su stanovi u visokom prizemlju (1.800 EUR/m2), na prvom katu (1.900 EUR/m2), drugom katu (2.000 EUR/m2) te trecem katu (2.100 EUR/m2).&nbsp;Stanovi su juzno orijentirani, a pogled na more ovisi o katnosti. Zgrada ima parkirali&scaron;na mjesta, a postoji i moguænost kupnje gara¾e.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>For sale we have this newly built apartments in Makarska, below the main coastal road. The building has 16 units in total. Apartments available for sale are located on the ground floor (1.800 EUR/m2), first floor (1.900 EUR/m2), second floor (2.000 EUR/m2) and third floor (2.100 EUR/m2).&nbsp;Apartments are south-oriented. Sea views are various, depending on the floor. The building features parking places. Optionally, garage places can be bought too at extra cost.&nbsp;</p>', '', '<p><strong>Stanovi u novogradnji sa pogledom na more</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U prodaji nudimo stanove u novogradnji u Makarskoj, ispod jadranske magistrale.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Zgrada ima ukupno 16 stanova, a slobodni su stanovi u visokom prizemlju (1.800 EUR/m2), na prvom katu (1.900 EUR/m2), drugom katu (2.000 EUR/m2) te trecem katu (2.100 EUR/m2).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Stanovi su juzno orijentirani, a pogled na more ovisi o katnosti.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Zgrada ima parkirali&scaron;na mjesta, a postoji i moguænost kupnje gara¾e.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Stanovi se sastoje od kuhinje i blagovaonice, dnevnog boravka, hodnika, dvije spavaæe sobe, kupaonice i dvije loðe.&nbsp;</p>', '<p><strong>Newly built apartments with sea views</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For sale we have this newly built apartments in Makarska, below the main coastal road.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The building has 16 units in total.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartments available for sale are located on the ground floor (1.800 EUR/m2), first floor (1.900 EUR/m2), second floor (2.000 EUR/m2) and third floor (2.100 EUR/m2).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartments are south-oriented.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sea views are various, depending on the floor.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The building features parking places.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Optionally, garage places can be bought too at extra cost.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartments have kitchen and dining room, living room, hall, two bedrooms, bathroom and two balconies.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For further information please contact our office in Split.&nbsp;</p>', '', '1617_Apartment_0.jpg', '1617_Apartment_1.jpg', '1617_Apartment_2.jpg', '1617_Apartment_3.jpg', '1617_Apartment_4.jpg', '1617_Apartment_5.jpg', '1617_Apartment_6.jpg', '1617_Apartment_7.jpg', '1617_Apartment_8.jpg'),
