>\r\n<p>It has 2 bedrooms, living and dining room, kitchen, bathroom and 2 balconies (small on the north and large on the south).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Total internal size is 63,25 sqm and it comes with the garage space in the basement, sized 11,75 sqm.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For further information please contact our office in Split.&nbsp;</p>', '', '1618_Apartment_0.jpg', '1618_Apartment_1.jpg', '1618_Apartment_2.jpg', '1618_Apartment_3.jpg', '1618_Apartment_4.jpg', '1618_Apartment_5.jpg', '1618_Apartment_6.jpg', '1618_Apartment_7.jpg', '1618_Apartment_8.jpg'),
(1619, 'Alan Johnathan ', 'Dianne Clifton', 'Alan 0044 7552 166649 ', '', 'alanjnicholls@hotmail.com', 'Korcula', 'Popov Ratak 168b  Prigradica, Kc 18425/219 ko Blato ZU4648 pu 6', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '20', '0', '71', 1, '205000', '', 2, 2, 2, 1, 1, 2, 2, 1, 'March 17, 2016', '<p>Croatia Property Sales predstavlja izvrstan apartman na rubu malog mjesta na otoku Korèuli sa spektakularnim pogledom na more i otok Hvar.&nbsp;Apartman se sastoji od dvije spavaæe sobe, otvorenog prostora dnevnog boravka i potpuno opremljene kuhinje sa &scaron;ankom i ureðajima, kupaonice te prostranog balkona.&nbsp;Nekretnina je klimatizirana i sa parkirali&scaron;nim mjestom.</p>', '<p>Croatia Property Sales presents this wonderfull apartment for sale, located on the outskirts of a small village on Korcula island, offering spectacular views of the sea and Hvar island.&nbsp;The apartment consists of two double bedrooms, open-plan living area with fully fitted kitchen with breakfast bar and appliances, large bathroom and spacious balcony.&nbsp;The property is air-conditioned and it comes with the parking space.&nbsp;</p>', '', '<p><strong>Izvrstan apartman u prvom redu do mora na Korèuli</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Croatia Property Sales predstavlja izvrstan apartman na rubu malog mjesta na otoku Korèuli sa spektakularnim pogledom na more i otok Hvar.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartman se sastoji od dvije spavaæe sobe, otvorenog prostora dnevnog boravka i potpuno opremljene kuhinje sa &scaron;ankom i ureðajima, kupaonice te prostranog balkona.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nekretnina je klimatizirana i sa parkirali&scaron;nim mjestom. Namje&scaron;taj (osim kuhinje sa ureðajima) nije ukljuèen u cijenu.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Objekt se nalazi na vrlo mirnoj lokaciji, odlièan za kupce koji tra¾e netaknutu prirodu i èisto more, ali i blizini osnovnih sadr¾aja i javnog prijevoza.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Molimo kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured u Splitu za vi&scaron;e informacija.&nbsp;</p>', '<p><strong>Exquisite seafront apartment for sale</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Croatia Property Sales presents this wonderfull apartment for sale, located on the outskirts of a small village on Korcula island, offering spectacular views of the sea and Hvar island.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The apartment consists of two double bedrooms, open-plan living area with fully fitted kitchen with breakfast bar and appliances, large bathroom and spacious balcony.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property is air-conditioned and it comes with the parking space.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>This is a very quiet and private location, perfect for the second home buyers looking for unspoilt nature and crystal clear sea, yet not to far from basic amenities and means of public transport.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact our Split office for more details.&nbsp;</p>', '', '1619_Apartment_0.jpg', '1619_Apartment_1.jpg', '1619_Apartment_2.jpg', '1619_Apartment_3.jpg', '1619_Apartment_4.jpg', '1619_Apartment_5.jpg', '1619_Apartment_6.jpg', '1619_Apartment_7.jpg', '1619_Apartment_8.jpg'),
