(1622, 'Albedo', 'Emil ©o¹tariæ ', '098 507 989', '', 'emil@albedonekretnine.hr ', 'Makarska', 'Makarska', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '25', '0', '59', 1, '248000', '', 2, 2, 2, 1, 1, 2, 2, 1, 'March 18, 2016', '<p>Atraktivan stan sa djelomiènim pogledom na more.&nbsp;U prodaji nudimo atraktivan stan u prvom redu do gradske &scaron;etnice i pla¾e. Stan se nalazi na 3. katu, a sastoji se od dvije spavaæe sobe, hodnika, kupaonice, kuhinje i blagovaonice te dnevnog boravka i loðe.&nbsp;Zgrada ima lift, parkirali&scaron;na i gara¾na mjesta, automatizirane prozorske roletne, ulazna protuprovalna vrata, klimatizaciju u svakoj sobi te podno grijanje u kupaonici.</p>', '<p>Attractive apartment with partial sea views.&nbsp;For sale we have this attractive apartment right next to the city''s main walkway and the beach. It is located on the 3rd floor and comprises of two bedrooms, hall, bathroom, kitchen and dining room, living room and balcony.&nbsp;The building has some quality features, such as elevator, garage and parking places, safety doors, all rooms airconditioned, underfoor heating in the bathrooms. &nbsp; &nbsp;</p>', '', '<p><strong>Atraktivan stan sa djelomiènim pogledom na more</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U prodaji nudimo atraktivan stan u prvom redu do gradske &scaron;etnice i pla¾e.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Stan se nalazi na 3. katu, a sastoji se od dvije spavaæe sobe, hodnika, kupaonice, kuhinje i blagovaonice te dnevnog boravka i loðe.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Zgrada ima lift, parkirali&scaron;na i gara¾na mjesta, automatizirane prozorske roletne, ulazna protuprovalna vrata, klimatizaciju u svakoj sobi te podno grijanje u kupaonici.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za dodatne informacije molimo kontaktirakte na&scaron; ured u Splitu.&nbsp;</p>', '<p><strong>Attractive apartment with partial sea views</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For sale we have this attractive apartment right next to the city''s main walkway and the beach.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is located on the 3rd floor and comprises of two bedrooms, hall, bathroom, kitchen and dining room, living room and balcony.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The building has some quality features, such as elevator, garage and parking places, safety doors, all rooms airconditioned, underfoor heating in the bathrooms. &nbsp; &nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For further information please contact our office in Split.&nbsp;</p>', '', '1622_Apartment_0.jpg', '1622_Apartment_1.jpg', '1622_Apartment_2.jpg', '1622_Apartment_3.jpg', '1622_Apartment_4.jpg', '1622_Apartment_5.jpg', '1622_Apartment_6.jpg', '1622_Apartment_7.jpg', '1622_Apartment_8.jpg'),
