es (water, electricity) are right next to it.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is gently sloped and has regular shape.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is possible to build semi-detached house along the northern border.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Footprint ratio 0,38 and utilization ratio 1,3 on three floors (lower ground floor, higher ground floor, first floor).</p>', '', '1624_Land-plot_0.jpg', '1624_Land-plot_1.jpg', '1624_Land-plot_2.jpg', '1624_Land-plot_3.jpg', '1624_Land-plot_4.jpg', '1624_Land-plot_5.jpg', '', '', ''),
