(1627, 'Dream Croatia', 'Savills', '', 'Nata¹a Elakoviæ 091 185 7237', 'natasa@dreamcroatia.com', 'Dubrovnik', 'Cavtat', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '0', '0', '94', 1, '250000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 'March 22, 2016', '<p>Na prodaju nudimo prostrani apartman na prvom katu kuæe u Cavtatu, oko 20 min vo¾nje ju¾no od Dubrovnika.&nbsp;Sastoji se od 2 spavaæe sobe, kuhinje i blagovaonice, velike dnevne sobe i terase, kupaonice, wc-a i hodnika.&nbsp;Svi sadr¾aji udaljeni su 15 min hoda od nekretnine.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>For sale we have this spacious apartment situated on the first floor of a house in Cavtat, approximately 20 min ride south of Dubrovnik.&nbsp;It consists of 2 bedrooms, kitchen, and dining room, spacious living room with large balcony/terrace, bathroom, guest toilet and hallway.&nbsp;All amenities are within 15 min walking distance.&nbsp;</p>', '', '<p><strong>Apartman na prodaju u Cavtatu</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na prodaju nudimo prostrani apartman na prvom katu kuæe u Cavtatu, oko 20 min vo¾nje ju¾no od Dubrovnika.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sastoji se od 2 spavaæe sobe, kuhinje i blagovaonice, velike dnevne sobe i terase, kupaonice, wc-a i hodnika.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Svi sadr¾aji udaljeni su 15 min hoda od nekretnine.&nbsp;</p>', '<p><strong>Apartment for sale in Cavtat</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For sale we have this spacious apartment situated on the first floor of a house in Cavtat, approximately 20 min ride south of Dubrovnik.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It consists of 2 bedrooms, kitchen, and dining room, spacious living room with large balcony/terrace, bathroom, guest toilet and hallway.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>All amenities are within 15 min walking distance.&nbsp;</p>', '', '1627_Apartment_0.jpg', '1627_Apartment_1.jpg', '1627_Apartment_2.jpg', '1627_Apartment_3.jpg', '1627_Apartment_4.jpg', '1627_Apartment_5.jpg', '1627_Apartment_6.jpg', '1627_Apartment_7.jpg', '1627_Apartment_8.jpg'),
(1628, 'Dream Croatia', 'Savills', '', 'Nata¹a Elakoviæ 091 185 7237', 'natasa@dreamcroatia.com', 'Dubrovnik', 'Dubrovnik', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '0', '0', '86', 1, '99999999', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 3, 3, 'March 22, 2016', '<p>Na prodaju nudimo predivno renoviran apartman u strogom centru Dubrovnika. Lokacija, pogled, velièina i interijer èine ga jednom od najatraktivnijih nekretnina u Dubrovniku.&nbsp;Nalazi se u nekada&scaron;njoj palaèi iz 16. stoljeæa, a obnovljen je po&scaron;tujuæi izvorne graditeljske elemente, kamene zidove i mozaike, u kombinaciji sa modernim komforom.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>For sale we have this amazingly restored apartment in Dubrovnik Old Town. Location, views, size and interior design of this property make it one of the most unique in Dubrovnik.&nbsp;Situated in a 16th century former palace in the heart of the Old Town the apartment has been lovingly restored, combining original features including exposed stone walls and ancient mosaics with modern comforts and amenities.</p>', '', '<p><strong>Luksuzan apartman u strogom centru Dubrovnika</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na prodaju nudimo predivno renoviran apartman u strogom centru Dubrovnika.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Lokacija, pogled, velièina i interijer èine ga jednom od najatraktivnijih nekretnina u Dubrovniku.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nalazi se u nekada&scaron;njoj palaèi iz 16. stoljeæa, a obnovljen je po&scaron;tujuæi izvorne graditeljske elemente, kamene zidove i mozaike, u kombinaciji sa modernim komforom.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nekretnina se sastoji od dva apartmana koji se prodaju kao jedna cjelina.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Jedan od njih je stan sa dvije spavaæe sobe, otvorenim prostorom dnevnog boravka te pomoænim wc-om.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Do njega nalazi se studio apartman.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Pla¾a je nedaleko od nekretnine, kao i sve ostale bitne atrakcije i sadr¾aji.&nbsp;</p>', '<p><strong>Luxurious apartment in Dubrovnik Old Town</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For sale we have this amazingly restored apartment in Dubrovnik Old Town.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Location, views, size and interior design of this property make it one of the most unique in Dubrovnik.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Situated in a 16th century former palace in the heart of the Old Town the apartment has been lovingly restored, combining original features including exposed stone walls and ancient mosaics with modern comforts and amenities.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property consists of 2 units.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>One of them is a 2-bedroom 1-bathroom apartment with guest toilet and open-plan living area.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Second apartment is an adjacent renovated loft-style luxury studio.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Swimming areas just a short walk away.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Both apartments are sold as one property.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Viewing recommended.</p>', '', '1628_Apartment_0.jpg', '1628_Apartment_1.jpg', '1628_Apartment_2.jpg', '1628_Apartment_3.jpg', '1628_Apartment_4.jpg', '1628_Apartment_5.jpg', '1628_Apartment_6.jpg', '1628_Apartment_7.jpg', ''),
