(1630, 'Dream Croatia', 'Savills', '', 'Nata¹a Elakoviæ 091 185 7237', 'natasa@dreamcroatia.com', 'Dubrovnik', 'Dubrovnik', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '0', '0', '71', 1, '175000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 'March 22, 2016', '<p>Na prodaju nudimo namje&scaron;teni dvosobni stan u Dubrovniku.&nbsp;Apartman se nalazi na treæem katu manje zgrade sa ukupno osam stanova. Krov i fasada su nedavno promijenjeni. Idealna nekretnina za stanovanje i turistièki najam.&nbsp;Stan se sastoji od hodnika, kuhinje sa blagovaonicom, natkrivenog balkona, dnevne sobe, kupaonice i dvije spavaæe sobe (pogled na uliènu stranu).</p>', '<p>For sale we have this furnished two bedroom apartment in Dubrovnik.&nbsp;Apartment is located on the third floor of a low rise building with 8 units in total. Roof and facade have been recently renewed. Ideal property for living or rental business.&nbsp;The property consists of a big hallway, kitchen with dining room and covered balcony, living room, bathroom, and two spacious bedrooms (street view).</p>', '', '<p>Na prodaju nudimo namje&scaron;teni dvosobni stan u Dubrovniku.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartman se nalazi na treæem katu manje zgrade sa ukupno osam stanova.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Krov i fasada su nedavno promijenjeni.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Idealna nekretnina za stanovanje i turistièki najam.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Stan se sastoji od hodnika, kuhinje sa blagovaonicom, natkrivenog balkona, dnevne sobe, kupaonice i dvije spavaæe sobe (pogled na uliènu stranu).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nekretnina ima ostavu u podrumu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Automobil je moguæe parkirati na ulici u blizini zgrade (trenutno bez naplate).&nbsp;</p>', '<p>For sale we have this furnished two bedroom apartment in Dubrovnik.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartment is located on the third floor of a low rise building with 8 units in total.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Roof and facade have been recently renewed.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ideal property for living or rental business.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property consists of a big hallway, kitchen with dining room and covered balcony, living room, bathroom, and two spacious bedrooms (street view).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It has storage in the basement.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is possible to park car very close to the building (currently without a charge).&nbsp;</p>', '', '1630_Apartment_0.jpg', '1630_Apartment_1.jpg', '1630_Apartment_2.jpg', '1630_Apartment_3.jpg', '1630_Apartment_4.jpg', '1630_Apartment_5.jpg', '', '', ''),
(1631, 'Dream Croatia', 'Savills', 'Nata¹a Elakoviæ 091 185 7237', '', 'natasa@dreamcroatia.com', 'Dubrovnik', 'Lapad', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '0', '0', '70', 1, '199000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 'March 22, 2016', '<p>Dvosobni apartman u Dubrovniku, smje&scaron;ten u prizemlju zgrade u mirnoj rezidencijalnoj èetvrti. Sastoji se od otvorenog prostora dnevnog boravka, kihunje i blagovaonice, hodnika sa ugradbenim ormarima, kupaonice, dva mala vrta te ostave.&nbsp;Ju¾no orijentirana nekretnina, sunèana i topla. Apartman je dobro odr¾avan, potpuno namje&scaron;ten i spreman za ¾ivljenje. Pripada mu i parkirali&scaron;no mjesto.</p>', '<p>Two bedrooms apartment for sale, situated on the ground floor of a building located in a quiet residential neighbourhood. It consists of open plan living room, dining room and kitchen, hallway with large built in closet, bathroom with shower, two small gardens and storage.&nbsp;The property is south-facing, sunny and warm. It is very well maintained, fully furnished, equipped and ready for occupancy. It comes with a parking space.&nbsp;</p>', '', '<p><strong>Apartman u Dubrovniku</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Dvosobni apartman u Dubrovniku, smje&scaron;ten u prizemlju zgrade u mirnoj rezidencijalnoj èetvrti.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sastoji se od otvorenog prostora dnevnog boravka, kihunje i blagovaonice, hodnika sa ugradbenim ormarima, kupaonice, dva mala vrta te ostave.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ju¾no orijentirana nekretnina, sunèana i topla.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartman je dobro odr¾avan, potpuno namje&scaron;ten i spreman za ¾ivljenje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Pripada mu i parkirali&scaron;no mjesto.</p>', '<p><strong>Apartment in Dubrovnik</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Two bedrooms apartment for sale, situated on the ground floor of a building located in a quiet residential neighbourhood.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It consists of open plan living room, dining room and kitchen, hallway with large built in closet, bathroom with shower, two small gardens and storage.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property is south-facing, sunny and warm.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is very well maintained, fully furnished, equipped and ready for occupancy.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It comes with a parking space.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For further information please contact our office in Split.&nbsp;</p>', '', '1631_Apartment_0.jpg', '1631_Apartment_1.jpg', '1631_Apartment_2.jpg', '1631_Apartment_3.jpg', '1631_Apartment_4.jpg', '1631_Apartment_5.jpg', '1631_Apartment_6.jpg', '1631_Apartment_7.jpg', '1631_Apartment_8.jpg'),
(1632, 'Dream Croatia', 'Savills', 'Nata¹a Elakoviæ 091 185 7237', '', 'natasa@dreamcroatia.com', 'Dubrovnik', 'Dubrovnik', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '0', '0', '71', 1, '209000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 'March 22, 2016', '<p>Apartman na prodaju u Dubrovniku.&nbsp;Na prodaju nudimo apartman u prizemlju stambene zgrade u mirnom dijelu Dubrovnika.&nbsp;Sastoji se od 2 spavaæe sobe, kuhinje i blagovaonice, dnevne sobe sa velikom terasom, kupaonice i hodnika.&nbsp;Ima ostavu i parkirali&scaron;no mjesto.&nbsp;Svi sadr¾aji udaljeni su 15 min hoda od nekretnine.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>For sale we have this 2-bedroom 1-bathroom apartment situated on the ground floor of a building located in a quiet residential area of Dubrovnik.&nbsp;It consists of 2 bedrooms, kitchen and dining room, living room with large balcony/terrace, bathroom and hallway.&nbsp;The property has storage and parking place.&nbsp;All amenities are within 15 min walking distance.&nbsp;</p>', '', '<p><strong>Apartman na prodaju u Dubrovniku</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na prodaju nudimo apartman u prizemlju stambene zgrade u mirnom dijelu Dubrovnika.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sastoji se od 2 spavaæe sobe, kuhinje i blagovaonice, dnevne sobe sa velikom terasom, kupaonice i hodnika.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ima ostavu i parkirali&scaron;no mjesto.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Svi sadr¾aji udaljeni su 15 min hoda od nekretnine.&nbsp;</p>', '<p><strong>Apartment for sale in Dubrovnik</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For sale we have this 2-bedroom 1-bathroom apartment situated on the ground floor of a building located in a quiet residential area of Dubrovnik.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It consists of 2 bedrooms, kitchen and dining room, living room with large balcony/terrace, bathroom and hallway.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property has storage and parking place.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>All amenities are within 15 min walking distance.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For additional information please contact our office in Split.&nbsp;</p>', '', '1632_Apartment_0.jpg', '1632_Apartment_1.jpg', '1632_Apartment_2.jpg', '1632_Apartment_3.jpg', '1632_Apartment_4.jpg', '1632_Apartment_5.jpg', '1632_Apartment_6.jpg', '1632_Apartment_7.jpg', '1632_Apartment_8.jpg'),
(1633, 'Dream Croatia', 'Savills', 'Nata¹a Elakoviæ 091 185 7237', '', 'natasa@dreamcroatia.com', 'Dubrovnik', 'Dubrovnik, Ploèe', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '0', '0', '54', 1, '279000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 2, 1, 'March 22, 2016', '<p>Prodaje se stan u prizemlju stambene zgrade u Dubrovniku, na prekrasnoj lokaciji u predjelu Ploèe.&nbsp;Stan se sastoji od 2 jednokrevetne sobe, dnevnog boravka, kuhinje sa blagovaonicom, radnog prostora, kupaonice, ostave i hodnika. Ispred stana je prostrana terasa od oko 40-50m2, sa koje se pru¾a èaroban pogled na Grad i more.&nbsp;Nekretnini je potrebna renovacija. Stan je idealan i za stanovanje i za turistièki najam.</p>', '<p>Ground floor apartment with sea view and spacious terrace for sale, located in Ploce neighbourhood, near the Old Town.&nbsp;It consists of 2 single bedrooms, living room, kitchen and dining room, study, bathroom, storage and hallway.&nbsp;It features spacious terrace of about 40-50m2, with magnificent views over the Old Town and the sea.&nbsp;The property is in a need of renovation. Ideal for year around living and as an investment for rental.</p>', '', '<p><strong>Dvosobni stan u Dubrovniku</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Prodaje se stan u prizemlju stambene zgrade u Dubrovniku, na prekrasnoj lokaciji u predjelu Ploèe.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Stan se sastoji od 2 jednokrevetne sobe, dnevnog boravka, kuhinje sa blagovaonicom, radnog prostora, kupaonice, ostave i hodnika.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ispred stana je prostrana terasa od oko 40-50m2, sa koje se pru¾a èaroban pogled na Grad i more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nekretnini je potrebna renovacija.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Stan je idealan i za stanovanje i za turistièki najam.</p>', '<p><strong>Two bedroom apartment in Dubrovnik</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ground floor apartment with sea view and spacious terrace for sale, located in Ploce neighbourhood, near the Old Town.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It consists of 2 single bedrooms, living room, kitchen and dining room, study, bathroom, storage and hallway.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It features spacious terrace of about 40-50m2, with magnificent views over the Old Town and the sea.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property is in a need of renovation.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ideal for year around living and as an investment for rental.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For additional information please contact our office in Split.&nbsp;</p>', '', '1633_Apartment_0.jpg', '1633_Apartment_1.jpg', '1633_Apartment_2.jpg', '1633_Apartment_3.jpg', '1633_Apartment_4.jpg', '1633_Apartment_5.jpg', '1633_Apartment_6.jpg', '1633_Apartment_7.jpg', '1633_Apartment_8.jpg');
