(1634, 'Dream Croatia', 'Savills', 'Nata¹a Elakoviæ 091 185 7237', '', 'natasa@dreamcroatia.com', 'Dubrovnik', 'Obod - Cavtat', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '0', '0', '75', 1, '120000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 2, 1, 'March 23, 2016', '<p>Na prodaju nudimo simpatièan dvoeta¾ni stan u malom mjestu nedaleko od Cavtata.&nbsp;Prvi kat sastoji se od spavaæe sobe sa wc-om.&nbsp;Na drugom katu nalaze se kuhinja, dnevni boravak i blagovaonica, kupaonica, spavaæa soba te veliki balkon sa odliènim pogledom na more.&nbsp;Apartman se prodaje namje&scaron;ten i opremljen, a parkirali&scaron;no mjesto ukljuèeno je u cijenu.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>For sale we have this lovely duplex in a small village near Cavtat.&nbsp;First floor consists of bedroom with toilet.&nbsp;Second floor has kitchen, living and dining room, bathroom, bedroom, hallway and &nbsp;spacious balcony with stunning views over the bay and crystal clear sea.&nbsp;Apartment is furnished and easily accessible with parking place included in price.</p>', '', '<p><strong>Apartman na prodaju pokraj Cavtata</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na prodaju nudimo simpatièan dvoeta¾ni stan u malom mjestu nedaleko od Cavtata.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Prvi kat sastoji se od spavaæe sobe sa wc-om.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na drugom katu nalaze se kuhinja, dnevni boravak i blagovaonica, kupaonica, spavaæa soba te veliki balkon sa odliènim pogledom na more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartman se prodaje namje&scaron;ten i opremljen, a parkirali&scaron;no mjesto ukljuèeno je u cijenu.&nbsp;</p>', '<p><strong>Apartment for sale near Cavtat</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For sale we have this lovely duplex in a small village near Cavtat.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>First floor consists of bedroom with toilet.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Second floor has kitchen, living and dining room, bathroom, bedroom, hallway and &nbsp;spacious balcony with stunning views over the bay and crystal clear sea.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartment is furnished and easily accessible with parking place included in price.</p>', '', '1634_Apartment_0.jpg', '1634_Apartment_1.jpg', '1634_Apartment_2.jpg', '1634_Apartment_3.jpg', '1634_Apartment_4.jpg', '1634_Apartment_5.jpg', '1634_Apartment_6.jpg', '', ''),
(1635, 'Dream Croatia', 'Savills', '', 'Nata¹a Elakoviæ 091 185 7237', 'natasa@dreamcroatia.com', 'Dubrovnik', 'Dubrovnik', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '0', '0', '73', 2, '365000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 3, 2, 'March 23, 2016', '<p>Croatia Property Sales predstavlja lijepi stan u centru Dubrovnika, renoviran 2006. godine.&nbsp;Nalazi se na prvom katu srednjovjekovne palaèe sa &scaron;irokim stepeni&scaron;tem, na izvrsnoj lokaciji unutar Grada.&nbsp;Sastoji se od 3 spavaæe sobe, kuhinje sa blagovaonicom, dnevne sobe, 2 kupaonice i hodnika.&nbsp;Prodaje se potpuno namje&scaron;ten, spreman za useljenje. Idealan je kako za ¾ivljenje tako i za turistièki najam.</p>', '<p>Croatia Property Sales present lovely apartment in Dubrovnik Old Town, renovated in 2006.&nbsp;It is set on the first floor of a medieval palace with wide staircases and is in great location.&nbsp;Apartment consists of 3 bedrooms, kitchen with dining and living room, 2 bathrooms and hallway.&nbsp;It is completely furnished, ready to move in and is ideal for both living and for rental.&nbsp;</p>', '', '<p><strong>Trosobni stan u centru Dubrovnika</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Croatia Property Sales predstavlja lijepi stan u centru Dubrovnika, renoviran 2006. godine.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nalazi se na prvom katu srednjovjekovne palaèe sa &scaron;irokim stepeni&scaron;tem, na izvrsnoj lokaciji unutar Grada.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sastoji se od 3 spavaæe sobe, kuhinje sa blagovaonicom, dnevne sobe, 2 kupaonice i hodnika.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Prodaje se potpuno namje&scaron;ten, spreman za useljenje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Idealan je kako za ¾ivljenje tako i za turistièki najam.</p>', '<p><strong>Three bedroom apartment in Dubrovnik Old Town</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Croatia Property Sales present lovely apartment in Dubrovnik Old Town, renovated in 2006.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is set on the first floor of a medieval palace with wide staircases and is in great location.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartment consists of 3 bedrooms, kitchen with dining and living room, 2 bathrooms and hallway.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is completely furnished, ready to move in and is ideal for both living and for rental.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For further information please contact our office in Split.&nbsp;</p>', '', '1635_Apartment_0.jpg', '1635_Apartment_1.jpg', '1635_Apartment_2.jpg', '1635_Apartment_3.jpg', '1635_Apartment_4.jpg', '1635_Apartment_5.jpg', '1635_Apartment_6.jpg', '1635_Apartment_7.jpg', ''),
(1636, 'Dream Croatia', 'Savills', '', 'Nata¹a Elakoviæ 091 185 7237', 'natasa@dreamcroatia.com', 'Dubrovnik', 'Zvekovica - Cavtat', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '0', '505', '235', 1, '299000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 5, 5, 'March 24, 2016', '<p>Na prodaju nudimo kuæu sa dvije neovisne stambene jedinice. Kuæa se nalazi blizu Cavtata.&nbsp;Na vrhu objekta smje&scaron;tena je krovna terasa povr&scaron;ine 150 m2 sa bazenom.&nbsp;Apartman u prizemlju povr&scaron;ine je 125 m2, a sastoji se od 3 spavaæe sobe sa kupaonicama, potpuno opremljene kuhinje sa blagovaonicom i dnevnom sobom te 120 m2 velikom terasom sa pogledom na more.&nbsp;Apartman na prvom katu ima povr&scaron;inu 110 m2.</p>', '<p>For sale we have this house with two independent units. It is located near Cavtat.&nbsp;A covered terrace with beautiful views over islands and Dubrovnik is its prime feature.&nbsp;There is a 150 sqm roof terrace with pool.&nbsp;Apartment on the gound floor is sized 125 sqm and consists of three en-suite bedrooms, fully fitted open plan kitchen with dining and living area as well as 120 sqm terrace with lovely garden and amazing sea view.&nbsp;Apartment of the first floor spreads on 110 sqm.</p>', '', '<p><strong>Apartmanska kuæa na prodaju pored Cavtata</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na prodaju nudimo kuæu sa dvije neovisne stambene jedinice.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa se nalazi blizu Cavtata.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartman u prizemlju povr&scaron;ine je 125 m2, a sastoji se od 3 spavaæe sobe sa kupaonicama, potpuno opremljene kuhinje sa blagovaonicom i dnevnom sobom te 120 m2 velikom terasom sa pogledom na more.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartman na prvom katu ima povr&scaron;inu 110 m2, a sastoji se od 2 spavaæe sobe sa kupaonicama te orvorenog prostora kuhinje i dnevnog boravka.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartmanu pripada i natkrivena terasa sa fantastiènim pogledom na more i otoke dubrovaèkog primorja.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na vrhu objekta smje&scaron;tena je krovna terasa povr&scaron;ine 150 m2 sa bazenom.&nbsp;</p>', '<p><strong>Apartment house for sale near Cavtat</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For sale we have this house with two independent units.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is located near Cavtat.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartment on the gound floor is sized 125 sqm and consists of three en-suite bedrooms, fully fitted open plan kitchen with dining and living area as well as 120 sqm terrace with lovely garden and amazing sea view.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartment of the first floor spreads on 110 sqm, containing two en-suite bedrooms and a large open plan living room and American-style kitchen.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>A covered terrace with beautiful views over islands and Dubrovnik is its prime feature.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There is a 150 sqm roof terrace with pool.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For further information please contact our office in Split.&nbsp;</p>', '', '1636_House-Villa_0.jpg', '1636_House-Villa_1.jpg', '1636_House-Villa_2.jpg', '1636_House-Villa_3.jpg', '1636_House-Villa_4.jpg', '1636_House-Villa_5.jpg', '', '', ''),
(1637, 'Dream Croatia', 'Savills', 'Nata¹a Elakoviæ 091 185 7237', '', 'natasa@dreamcroatia.com', 'Dubrovnik', 'Cavtat', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '0', '0', '83', 1, '180000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 2, 2, 'March 25, 2016', '<p>Ovaj prostrani apartman nalazi se na drugom katu male stambene zgrade u Cavtatu, u malom gradu blizu Dubrovnika.&nbsp;Apartman se sastoji od spavaæe sobe sa kupaonicom, druge spavaæe sobe sa balkonom, zajednièkog prostora dnevnog boravka, kuhinje i blagovaonice, kupaonice, hodnika i terase.&nbsp;Sa balkona se pru¾a odlièan pogled na stari dio Cavtata kao i na obli¾nje uvale.&nbsp;Nekretnina je u cijelosti namje&scaron;tena i opremljena te se kao takva i prodaje.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>This spacious apartment is situated on the second floor of a small residential building in Cavtat, a lovely small town near Dubrovnik.&nbsp;It consists of en-suit bedroom; twin bedroom with balcony, living/dining/kitchen all in one, bathroom, hallway and terrace.&nbsp;There are magnificent views over the bay and Cavtat Old Town from the balcony.&nbsp;The property is sold fully furnished. There is a small parking lot in front of the building.&nbsp;</p>', '', '<p><strong>Apartman na prodaju u Cavtatu</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ovaj prostrani apartman nalazi se na drugom katu male stambene zgrade u Cavtatu, u malom gradu blizu Dubrovnika.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartman se sastoji od spavaæe sobe sa kupaonicom, druge spavaæe sobe sa balkonom, zajednièkog prostora dnevnog boravka, kuhinje i blagovaonice, kupaonice, hodnika i terase.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sa balkona se pru¾a odlièan pogled na stari dio Cavtata kao i na obli¾nje uvale.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nekretnina je u cijelosti namje&scaron;tena i opremljena te se kao takva i prodaje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Parking se nalazi ispred zgrade.&nbsp;</p>', '<p><strong>Apartment for sale in Cavtat</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>This spacious apartment is situated on the second floor of a small residential building in Cavtat, a lovely small town near Dubrovnik.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It consists of en-suit bedroom; twin bedroom with balcony, living/dining/kitchen all in one, bathroom, hallway and terrace.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There are magnificent views over the bay and Cavtat Old Town from the balcony.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property is sold fully furnished.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There is a small parking lot in front of the building.&nbsp;</p>', '', '1637_Apartment_0.jpg', '1637_Apartment_1.jpg', '1637_Apartment_2.jpg', '1637_Apartment_3.jpg', '1637_Apartment_4.jpg', '1637_Apartment_5.jpg', '1637_Apartment_6.jpg', '1637_Apartment_7.jpg', '1637_Apartment_8.jpg'),
(1638, 'Dream Croatia', 'Savills', 'Nata¹a Elakoviæ 091 185 7237', '', 'natasa@dreamcroatia.com', 'Dubrovnik', 'Lapad', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '0', '0', '65', 1, '316900', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 2, 2, 'March 25, 2016', '<p>Izvrstan dvoeta¾ni stan u Dubrovniku, na zadnjem katu manje zgrade izgraðene 2006.&nbsp;Donja eta¾a: otvoreni prostor dnevnog boravka sa kuhinjom, glavna spavaæa soba i kupaonica.&nbsp;Mezanin: druga spavaæa soba i kuopaonica.&nbsp;Dva balkona iz dnevnog boravka okrenuta su uvali i imaju pogled na more.&nbsp;Jedno parkirali&scaron;no mjesto u gara¾i.</p>', '<p>Fabulous top floor apartment with sea views for sale.&nbsp;Lower level: contemporary open-plan living area with kitchen, master bedroom, bathroom.&nbsp;Mezzanine: bedroom and bathroom.&nbsp;Two balconies from the living room enjoy sea views and all-day sunshine.&nbsp;One parking space in the garage.</p>', '', '<p><strong>Moderan dvoeta¾ni stan u Dubrovniku</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Izvrstan dvoeta¾ni stan u Dubrovniku, na zadnjem katu manje zgrade izgraðene 2006.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Donja eta¾a: otvoreni prostor dnevnog boravka sa kuhinjom, glavna spavaæa soba i kupaonica.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Mezanin: druga spavaæa soba i kuopaonica.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Dva balkona iz dnevnog boravka okrenuta su uvali i imaju pogled na more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Jedno parkirali&scaron;no mjesto u gara¾i.</p>', '<p><strong>Modern duplex in Dubrovnik</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Fabulous top floor apartment with sea views for sale.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Lower level: contemporary open-plan living area with kitchen, master bedroom, bathroom.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Mezzanine: bedroom and bathroom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Two balconies from the living room enjoy sea views and all-day sunshine.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>One parking space in the garage.</p>', '', '1638_Apartment_0.jpg', '1638_Apartment_1.jpg', '1638_Apartment_2.jpg', '1638_Apartment_3.jpg', '1638_Apartment_4.jpg', '1638_Apartment_5.jpg', '1638_Apartment_6.jpg', '', ''),
(1639, 'Melita', 'Marco Polo', '', '', '', 'Korcula', 'Pri¾ba', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '0', '0', '45', 1, '135000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 1, 1, 'March 29, 2016', '<p>Na svega nekoliko koraka od mora i najljep&scaron;e pla¾e na Pri¾bi prodaje se jednosoban apartman.&nbsp;Ukupna stambena povr&scaron;ina apartmana iznosi cca 45m2, a sastoji se od kuhinje, dnevnog boravka, spavaæe sobe, kupaonice i hodnika.&nbsp;Ispred je polunatkrivena terasa s malim vrtom, a s druge strane kuæe je parking.&nbsp;Do mora se silazi privatnom stazom.&nbsp;<br /><br /></p>', '<p>We are offering this one bedroom detached bungalow house next to the sea on Korcula. It is situated only a few steps from the sea and the most beautiful beach in Prizba, a very quiet and traditional village some 39 km from Korcula old town. Total living area of the apartment is 45 m2. In front of the property is a half-sheltered terrace with a small garden, and on the other side of the house is parking. The sea is down a private track.</p>', '', '<p>Na svega nekoliko koraka od mora i najljep&scaron;e pla¾e na Pri¾bi prodaje se jednosoban apartman.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ukupna stambena povr&scaron;ina apartmana iznosi cca 45m2, a sastoji se od kuhinje, dnevnog boravka, spavaæe sobe, kupaonice i hodnika.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ispred je polunatkrivena terasa s malim vrtom, a s druge strane kuæe je parking.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Do mora se silazi privatnom stazom.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ako ¾elite intimni kutak za svoje ljetne odmore, ovo je prava prilika za Vas!</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za sve dodatne informacije molimo kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured u Splitu.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>We are offering this one bedroom detached bungalow house next to the sea on Korcula.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is situated only a few steps from the sea and the most beautiful beach in Prizba, a very quiet and traditional village some 39 km from Korcula old town.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Total living area of the apartment is 45m2 and consists of kitchen, living room, bedroom, bathroom and hallway.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>In front of the property is a half-sheltered terrace with a small garden, and on the other side of the house is parking.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The sea is down a private track.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>If you want an intimate corner of the Mediterranean shore with beautiful clear water and a sheltered vote for summer holidays, then this is the right opportunity for you!</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For further information please contact our office in Split.</p>', '', '1639_Apartment_0.jpg', '1639_Apartment_1.jpg', '1639_Apartment_2.jpg', '1639_Apartment_3.jpg', '1639_Apartment_4.jpg', '', '', '', ''),
(1640, '', 'Rakiæ', '', '', '', 'Sibenik', '®aboriæ', 'For sale', 'Land plot', '40', '460', '0', 1, '175000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 0, 0, 'March 29, 2016', '<p>Graðevno zemlji&scaron;te u drugom redu od mora. Izrazito mirna lokacija pogodna za gradnju vile ili apartmana.&nbsp;Zemlji&scaron;te povr&scaron;ine 460 m2 je od pla¾e udaljeno 40 metara, pravokutnog je oblika i zapadne orijentacije s blagim nagibom prema moru.&nbsp;Pokrenut je postupak za ishodovanje graðevne dokumentacije za gradnju vi&scaron;estambenog objekta koji bi se sastojao od 5 stambenih jedinica (BRP 400m2 + galerije na gornjoj eta¾i, tlocrtno 133m2, eta¾e Priz+Kat+Pk).&nbsp;</p>', '<p>We are offering for sale this building plot in the second row from the sea in a small settlement near Sibenik. This is an extremely quiet location suitable for a villa or apartments. The land area of 460 m2 is 40 m from the beach, a rectangular shape and west orientation with a gentle slope towards the sea.&nbsp;The procedure for obtaining construction documents for the building of a residential building has started, which would consist of 5 residential units (BRP 400m2 + gallery on the upper floor, ground floor 133m2, floors Ground + Floor + M).</p>', '', '<p><strong>Graðevno zemlji&scaron;te u drugom redu od mora</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Izrazito mirna lokacija pogodna za gradnju vile ili apartmana.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Zemlji&scaron;te povr&scaron;ine 460 m2 je od pla¾e udaljeno 40 metara, pravokutnog je oblika i zapadne orijentacije s blagim nagibom prema moru.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Pogled na more s nulte toèke terena je djelomièan. &nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nalazi se u izgraðenom ureðenom dijelu naselja, ima asfaltirani pristup i svu infrastrukturu uz teren.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Pokrenut je postupak za ishodovanje graðevne dokumentacije za gradnju vi&scaron;estambenog objekta koji bi se sastojao od 5 stambenih jedinica (BRP 400m2 + galerije na gornjoj eta¾i, tlocrtno 133m2, eta¾e Priz+Kat+Pk).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Jo&scaron; uvijek je moguæa izmjena projekta, na primjer za izgradnju obiteljske vile ili slièno.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Udaljenost od centra &Scaron;ibenika iznosi 12 km, od autoceste 16 km, a od aerodroma 40 km.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za sve dodatne informacije molimo kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured u Splitu.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>We are offering for sale this building plot in the second row from the sea in a small settlement near Sibenik.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>This is an extremely quiet location suitable for a villa or apartments.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The land area of 460 m2 is 40 m from the beach, a rectangular shape and west orientation with a gentle slope towards the sea.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sea view from the zero point field is partial, but will be better on higher floors.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is located in a built landscaped area of the village, close to the centre, with an asphalt road for access and all the infrastructure along the ground ready for construction.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The procedure for obtaining construction documents for the building of a residential building has started, which would consist of 5 residential units (BRP 400m2 + gallery on the upper floor, ground floor 133m2, floors Ground + Floor + M).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is still possible modification to the project, for example for a family villa or similar.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Distance from the center of Sibenik is 12 km from the highway 16 km from the airport 40 km.</p>', '', '1640_Land-plot_0.jpg', '1640_Land-plot_1.jpg', '1640_Land-plot_2.jpg', '1640_Land-plot_3.jpg', '1640_Land-plot_4.jpg', '1640_Land-plot_5.jpg', '', '', ''),
(1641, 'Linda', 'Velèiæ', '', '0044 7795471101', 'Linda.velcic@ntlworld.com', 'Zadar', '23295 Silba bb, 115/3 115/5 (zk.ul.1827)', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '100', '120', '132', 1, '200000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 4, 2, 'March 29, 2016', '<p>Na najsjevernijem dalmatinskom otoku, koji se naziva jo&scaron; i "granica" ili "vrata" Dalmacije, Silbi, prodaje se renovirana kamena kuæa.&nbsp;Kuæa je smje&scaron;tena na mirnom podruèju, samo 100 m od mora, nadomak svih sadr¾aja u centru mjesta.&nbsp;Sastoji se od prizemlja, kata i potkrovlja ukupne stambene povr&scaron;ine 132 m2.&nbsp;Kuæa ima i terasu, te vrt i dvori&scaron;te ukupne povr&scaron;ine 120 m2.<br /><br /></p>', '<p>We are offering this rare opportunity to buy a renovated old stone house on the island of Silba. Silba is a utterly charming island off Zadar, and this house is a restored cottage situated only 100 meters from the sea, and close to all amenities in the town centre.&nbsp;Living/usable area of 132 m2. It consists of a ground floor and three floors with a total floor area of 132 m2. There is an attractive private rear terrace, front courtyard and garden with a total area of 120 m2.</p>', '', '<p>Na najsjevernijem dalmatinskom otoku, koji se naziva jo&scaron; i "granica" ili "vrata" Dalmacije, Silbi, prodaje se renovirana kamena kuæa.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je smje&scaron;tena na mirnom podruèju, samo 100 m od mora, nadomak svih sadr¾aja u centru mjesta.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kompletno je renovirana 2006. godine (novo krovi&scaron;te, instalacije te novi prozori).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sastoji se od prizemlja, kata i potkrovlja ukupne stambene povr&scaron;ine 132 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa ima i terasu, te vrt i dvori&scaron;te ukupne povr&scaron;ine 120 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Orijentacija I-Z.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Otok Silba je dobro povezan sa Zadrom (od kojeg je udaljen 30NM), trajektnom linijom i brzom prugom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Jedan je od naj&scaron;umovitijih otoka na Jadranu i idealno mjesto za one ¾eljne mira, ali i one avanturistièkog duha.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za dodatne informacije molimo kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured u Splitu.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>We are offering this rare opportunity to buy a renovated old stone house on the island of Silba.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Silba is a utterly charming island off Zadar, and this house is a restored cottage situated only 100 meters from the sea, and close to all amenities in the town centre.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The village has a most amazing structure, from 1872, a ''toreta'', also known as ''tower of love''.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Check it out! <a href="https://en.m.wikipedia.org/wiki/Silba">https://en.m.wikipedia.org/wiki/Silba&nbsp;</a></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Living/usable area of 132m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It consists of a ground floor and three floors with a total floor area of 132 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There is an attractive private rear terrace, front courtyard and garden with a total area of 120 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property was renovated completely in 2006 with new roof, windows, new stucco and plumbing, both externally and internally.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It boasts a large open plan family living and kitchen area, 4 bedrooms, 2 Bathrooms.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Orientation East to West.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Silba island is well connected with the mainland and has regular ferry and a fast track boat access.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>This is one of the most densely wooded islands in the Adriatic Sea and a perfect place for those looking for peace, but also those with an adventurous spirit.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>No private cars are allowed on Silba.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For further information, please contact our office in Split.</p>', '', '1641_House-Villa_0.jpg', '1641_House-Villa_1.jpg', '1641_House-Villa_2.jpg', '1641_House-Villa_3.jpg', '1641_House-Villa_4.jpg', '1641_House-Villa_5.jpg', '1641_House-Villa_6.jpg', '1641_House-Villa_7.jpg', '1641_House-Villa_8.jpg'),
(1642, 'Iva', 'Ante Kolak', '', 'Pavao 0917353724', 'pavao.latinac03@gmail.com', 'Trogir', 'Put sv. Kri¾a 7 Mastrinka, 5475/3, 5475/8 k.o. Trogir', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '7', '901', '606', 1, '980000', '', 2, 2, 2, 1, 1, 2, 12, 12, 'March 29, 2016', '<p>Samostojeæa apartmanska kuæa smje&scaron;tena u 1.redu do mora, udaljena svega 7 m od &scaron;ljunèane i prirodno kamenite pla¾e.&nbsp;Nalazi se na otoku Èiovu koji je povezan mostom sa gradom Trogirom. U izgradnji je jo&scaron; jedan most koji æe utjecati na jo&scaron; veæu popularnost otoka.&nbsp;Kuæa se nalazi na prostranom zemlji&scaron;tu povr&scaron;ine 901 m2, dok stambena povr&scaron;ina kuæe iznosi 606 m2.&nbsp;Sastoji se od suterena, prizemlja, 1. i 2. kata.&nbsp;U kuæi je ukupno 9 apartmana razlièitih velièina.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>Great business opportunity. This is a detached house of 9 apartments situated in the 1st row to the sea, only metres from the pebble and rocky beaches. It is situated just 5 minutes from the world heritage site of Trogir, but on the shore adjacent to a safe beach with beautifully clear water. The house is situated on a large land area of 901 m2, while the living area is 606 m2. It consists of a basement, ground, first and second floors. The house has a total of 9 apartments of various sizes.&nbsp;</p>', '', '<p><strong>IZVRSNA PRILIKA!!!</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Samostojeæa apartmanska kuæa smje&scaron;tena u 1.redu do mora, udaljena svega 7 m od &scaron;ljunèane i prirodno kamenite pla¾e.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nalazi se na otoku Èiovu koji je povezan mostom sa gradom Trogirom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U izgradnji je jo&scaron; jedan most koji æe utjecati na jo&scaron; veæu popularnost otoka.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa se nalazi na prostranom zemlji&scaron;tu povr&scaron;ine 901 m2, dok stambena povr&scaron;ina kuæe iznosi 606 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sastoji se od suterena, prizemlja, 1. i 2. kata.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U kuæi je ukupno 9 apartmana razlièitih velièina.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Svakom apartmanu pripada spremi&scaron;te u suterenu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U suterenu se takoðer nalazi posebna prostorija koja slu¾i kao praonica rublja.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ispred kuæe se nalazi 6 gara¾a i jednako toliko vanjskih parking mjesta.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Unutarnji i vanjski dio kuæe su u izvrsnom stanju, ali je potrebno ulaganje u namje&scaron;taj.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U kuæi je takoðer ugraðeno centralno grijanje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Zbog polo¾aja, velièine i blizine mora nekretnina je idealna za posao turistièkog iznajmljivanja.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Grad Trogir udaljen je 5 min., a meðunarodni aerodrom 10 min. automobilom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ukoliko ¾elite dodatne informacije, slobodno nas kontaktirajte.</p>', '<p><strong>Great business opportunity</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>This is a detached house of 9 apartments situated in the 1st row to the sea, only metres from the pebble and rocky beaches.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is situated just 5 minutes from the world heritage site of Trogir, but on the shore adjacent to a safe beach with beautifully clear water.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The location is perfect for family holidays, and will demand high rents for an extended season.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is situated on Ciovo, the most populated of the islands, and which is connected with the city of Trogir, by a bridge.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The construction of another bridge is under way and that will ease traffic pressure as more and more tourists enjoy the island.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house is situated on a large land area of 901 m2, while the living area is 606 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It consists of a basement, ground, first and second floors.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house has a total of 9 apartments of various sizes.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Each apartment has a storeroom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>In the basement there is also a special room that serves as a laundry.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house has 6 garages and as many external parking spaces.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Inside and outside of the home are in excellent condition, just needing furniture.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>In the house is also built-in heating.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Due to the location, size and closeness of the property to Trogir and the sea, this is an ideal opportunity to start a successful rental business.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The town of Trogir is 5 min., and the international airport is only 10 minutes by car.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>If you would like additional information, please contact Croatia Property Sales.</p>', '', '1642_House-Villa_0.JPG', '1642_House-Villa_1.JPG', '1642_House-Villa_2.JPG', '1642_House-Villa_3.JPG', '1642_House-Villa_4.JPG', '1642_House-Villa_5.JPG', '1642_House-Villa_6.JPG', '1642_House-Villa_7.JPG', '1642_House-Villa_8.JPG'),
(1650, 'Ivan ', 'Braovac', '', '0914954271', 'ivan.braovac@yahoo.com', 'Trogir', 'Put Crvenog 1 Seget Vranjica, 570/2  zemljisnik  z.u. 4092', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '110', '233', '120', 1, '230000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 3, 3, 'April 11, 2016', '<p>Simpatièna dvojna kuæa u jako dobrom stanju sa ukupno 3 apartmana, smje&scaron;tena u malom mjestu u blizini Trogira. More i prekrasna prirodno kamenita pla¾a su udaljeni svega 120 m.&nbsp;Kuæa je ju¾ne orijentacije i trenutno je u funkciji turistièkog iznajmljivanja.&nbsp;Ukupna povr&scaron;ina zemlji&scaron;ta iznosi 233 m2. Dvori&scaron;te je dovoljno prostrano za 3-4 automobila, dok je u vrtu moguæe izgraditi bazen.&nbsp;Stambena povr&scaron;ina iznosi 120 m2 + 2 terase od kojih je jedna jako prostrana.</p>', '<p>We are offering this well located modern house in very good condition with 3 apartments. It is situated in a small village near Trogir. It is set back off the sea, and the shore path is just 120m from the property. The sea here is completely clear, with a beautiful natural rocky shore, safe for swimming.&nbsp;The house is south orientation and is currently operational tourist renting. The total land area is 233 m2.&nbsp;The living area is 120 m2 + 2 terraces.</p>', '', '<p>Simpatièna dvojna kuæa u jako dobrom stanju sa ukupno 3 apartmana, smje&scaron;tena u malom mjestu u blizini Trogira.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>More i prekrasna prirodno kamenita pla¾a su udaljeni svega 120 m.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je ju¾ne orijentacije i trenutno je u funkciji turistièkog iznajmljivanja.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ukupna povr&scaron;ina zemlji&scaron;ta iznosi 233 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Dvori&scaron;te je dovoljno prostrano za 3-4 automobila, dok je u vrtu moguæe izgraditi bazen.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Stambena povr&scaron;ina iznosi 120 m2 + 2 terase od kojih je jedna jako prostrana.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U prizemlju i na 1.katu se nalazi po jedan jednosobni apartman.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U posebnom dijelu kuæe u prizemlju se takoðer nalazi jednosobni apartman.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Povi&scaron;e se nalazi prostrana terasa sa kaminom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Iz kuæe se pru¾a djelomièan pogled na more, ali to ne umanjuje kvalitetu nekretnine zbog odliènog polo¾aja i potencijala turistièkog iznajmljivanja.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U centru mjesta se nalazi trgovina, kafiæ i restoran, dok su svi ostali sadr¾aji u mjestu do.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Do meðunarodnog aerodroma je potrebno svega 10 minuta vo¾nje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ukoliko ¾elite jo&scaron; informacija slobodno nas kontaktirajte.</p>', '<p>We are offering this well located modern house in very good condition with 3 apartments.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is situated in a small village near Trogir.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is set back off the sea, and the shore path is just 120m from the property.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The sea here is completely clear, with a beautiful natural rocky shore, safe for swimming.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house is south orientation and is currently operational tourist renting.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The total land area is 233 m2 with a yard big enough for 3-4 cars, while in the spacious garden it would be possible to build a swimming pool.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The living area is 120 m2 + 2 terraces and the top one is very spacious with plenty of room for bbq etc, with the partial sea view in the background.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the ground and on the 1st floor there is a one bedroom apartment on each floor.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>In a separate part of the house on the ground floor there is also a one-bedroom apartment.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Above is a spacious terrace with fireplace.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house has a partial sea view, but it does not detract from the quality of the property due to excellent location and potential tourist renting.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>In the village centre there are shops, cafes and restaurant, and other services and facilities as well.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>To the international airport, it takes only 10 minutes drive.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>If you want more information please contact us and our agents can arrange to visit this property.</p>', '', '1650_House-Villa_0.jpg', '1650_House-Villa_1.jpg', '1650_House-Villa_2.jpg', '1650_House-Villa_3.jpg', '1650_House-Villa_4.jpg', '1650_House-Villa_5.jpg', '1650_House-Villa_6.jpg', '1650_House-Villa_7.jpg', '1650_House-Villa_8.jpg'),
(1643, 'Èuriæ Ante ', 'Èalu¹iæ Dragan', 'Miroslav Maro¹eviæ 00 385 91 12 977 61', '091/68 68 688', 'marosevic.massa@gmail.com ', 'Peljesac', 'Podgorje, Ljube Babiæa bb  Orebiæ, Pelje¹ac', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '150', '0', '63', 1, '118000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 2, 1, 'March 29, 2016', '<p>Atraktivni apartmani s pogledom na more u Orebiæu na Pelje&scaron;cu.&nbsp;Objekt je izgraðen 2012. godine.&nbsp;Nalazi se 150 m od mora, a apartmani su orijentirani sjever &ndash; jug.&nbsp;Apartmani su kompletno opremljeni u proljeæe 2015 g.&nbsp;Apartman A4 - 62,59 m2 &ndash; 118.000 EUR,&nbsp;Apartman A5 &ndash; 68,99 m2 &ndash; 130.000 EUR.</p>', '<p>We are pleased to offer these modestly priced apartments with sea views in Orebic on Peljesac peninsula. The house was built in 2012. It is situated 150 m from the sea, but the land is gently sloping which allows sea views for everyone in the bay. The apartments are oriented north - south. Apartment A4 - 62,59 m2 - &euro; 118,000,&nbsp;Apartment A5 - 68.99 m2 - 130,000 euros.&nbsp;Apartments are fully equipped in spring 2015 g.</p>', '', '<p>Atraktivni apartmani s pogledom na more u Orebiæu na Pelje&scaron;cu.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Objekt je izgraðen 2012. godine.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nalazi se 150 m od mora, a apartmani su orijentirani sjever &ndash; jug.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Apartman A4 - 62,59 m2 &ndash; 118.000 EUR&nbsp;</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nalazi se na prvom katu, a sastoji se od hodnika, kupaonice, dvije spavaæe sobe, kuhinje s blagovaonicom, dnevnog boravka, loðe te mu pripada i parking od 12 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Apartman A5 &ndash; 68,99 m2 &ndash; 130.000 EUR&nbsp;</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nalazi se na prvom katu, a sastoji se od hodnika, kupaonice, dvije spavaæe sobe, kuhinje s blagovaonicom, dnevnog boravka, loðe, a pripada mu i parking od 12 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartmani su kompletno opremljeni u proljeæe 2015 g.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za dodatne informacije molimo kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured u Splitu.</p>', '<p>We are pleased to offer these modestly priced apartments with sea views in Orebic on Peljesac peninsula.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house was built in 2012.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is situated 150 m from the sea, but the land is gently sloping which allows sea views for everyone in the bay.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The apartments are oriented north - south.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Apartment A4 - 62,59 m2 - &euro; 118,000 EUR</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Located on the first floor and consists of hallway, bathroom, two bedrooms, a simple kitchen, dining room, living room, loggia and a garage parking space of 12 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Apartment A5 - 68.99 m2 - 130,000 EUR</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Located on the first floor and consists of hallway, bathroom, two bedrooms, kitchen, dining room, living room, loggia and a garage parking space of 12 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartments are fully equipped in spring 2015 g.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For further information, please contact our office in Split.</p>', '', '1643_Apartment_0.jpg', '1643_Apartment_1.JPG', '1643_Apartment_2.JPG', '1643_Apartment_3.JPG', '1643_Apartment_4.JPG', '1643_Apartment_5.JPG', '1643_Apartment_6.JPG', '1643_Apartment_7.JPG', '1643_Apartment_8.JPG'),
(1644, 'Nikola', 'Lovriæ', '', '091 934 4457', 'sandbrickdoo@yahoo.com', 'Trogir', 'Slatine, z.u. 1849,  katastar 1559/1', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '120', '0', '70', 1, '125000', '', 2, 1, 2, 2, 1, 2, 2, 2, 'April 6, 2016', '<p>Apartmani u izgradnji na prekrasnoj lokaciji na otoku Èiovu u blizini &scaron;ljunèane pla¾e.&nbsp;Nalaze se u malom turistièkom mjestu u blizini grada Trogira i meðunarodnog aerodroma. Mjesto je takoðer povezano brodskom linijom sa gradom Splitom.&nbsp;Zgrada se sastoji od prizemlja, 1. i 2. kata sa ukupno 6 apartmana.</p>', '<p>We are pleased to offer this fabulous opportunity to buy an apartment in a new development on Ciovo Island in a great location for tourism renting.&nbsp;The apartments are currently under construction - close to the beach - with good access to the main town of Split, and the popular historic (under UNESCO protection) town of Trogir. It is ideal for holidays and stays throughout the year because of the excellent connections with the major cities.&nbsp;The building consists of ground, first and second floors with a total of 6 apartments.</p>', '', '<p>Apartmani u izgradnji na prekrasnoj lokaciji na otoku Èiovu u blizini &scaron;ljunèane pla¾e.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nalaze se u malom turistièkom mjestu u blizini grada Trogira i meðunarodnog aerodroma.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Mjesto je takoðer povezano brodskom linijom sa gradom Splitom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U blizini se nalaze restorani, kafiæi, trgovine i ostali sadr¾aji.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Mjesto je idealno za odmor, ali i boravak tijekom cijele godine zbog odliène povezanosti sa veæim gradovima.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Zgrada se sastoji od prizemlja, 1. i 2. kata sa ukupno 6 apartmana.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za navedene cijene æe apartmani biti potpuno zavr&scaron;eni.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Svi su opremljeni klimatizacijskim ureðanjem, a u cijenu je ukljuèeno po jedno parking mjesto i sprema u podrumu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Svaki se sastoji od predprostora, dnevnog boravka sa kuhinjom i blagovaonicom, 2 spavaæe sobe, kupaonice, wc-a i loggie.</p>\r\n<p><strong><br /></strong></p>\r\n<p><strong>APARTMAN 1: 70,46 m2 - 125.000 &euro;</strong></p>\r\n<p><strong><br /></strong></p>\r\n<p><strong>APARTMAN 2: 72,42 m2 - 130.000 &euro;</strong></p>\r\n<p><strong><br /></strong></p>\r\n<p><strong>APARTMAN 3: 74,22 m2 - 145.000 &euro;</strong></p>\r\n<p><strong><br /></strong></p>\r\n<p><strong>APARTMAN 4: 74,22 m2 - 145.000 &euro;</strong></p>\r\n<p><strong><br /></strong></p>\r\n<p><strong>APARTMAN 5: 73,32 m2 - 155.000 &euro;</strong></p>\r\n<p><strong><br /></strong></p>\r\n<p><strong>APARTMAN 6: 71,81 m2 - 155.000 &euro;</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sa zavr&scaron;etkom izgradnje novog mosta koji povezuje Èiovo i Trogir, cijelo podruèje æe biti jo&scaron; popularnije za turistièko ljetovanje i ulaganje u nekretnine.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ostajemo na usluzi za sva dodatna pitanja.</p>', '<p>We are pleased to offer this fabulous opportunity to buy an apartment in a new development on Ciovo Island in a great location for tourism renting.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The apartments are currently under construction - close to the beach - with good access to the main town of Split, and the popular historic (under UNESCO protection) town of Trogir.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ciovo Island is Croatia''s most visited Island by tourists.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nearby - within a comfortable walking distance along the shore - are restaurants, family run cafes and bars, shops and other facilities.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is ideal for holidays and stays throughout the year because of the excellent connections with the major cities.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The building consists of ground, first and second floors with a total of 6 apartments.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The rates quoted will be for fully completed apartments.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>To meet the developer and choose fittings and the interiors, make sure you enquire early.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>All are equipped with air conditioning, and the price includes its own private parking place and a storage room in the basement.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Each consists of an entrance hall, large open plan living room with kitchen, 2 bedrooms, bathroom, toilet and balcony.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong><br /></strong></p>\r\n<p><strong>APARTMENT 1: 70.46 m2 - &euro; 125,000 </strong></p>\r\n<p><strong><br /></strong></p>\r\n<p><strong>APARTMENT 2: 72.42 m2 - &euro; 130,000</strong></p>\r\n<p><strong><br /></strong></p>\r\n<p><strong>APARTMENT 3: 74.22 m2 - &euro; 145,000&nbsp;&nbsp;</strong></p>\r\n<p><strong><br /></strong></p>\r\n<p><strong>APARTMENT 4: 74.22 m2 - &euro; 145,000&nbsp;&nbsp;</strong></p>\r\n<p><strong><br /></strong></p>\r\n<p><strong>APARTMENT 5: 73.32 m2 - &euro; 155,000&nbsp;&nbsp;</strong></p>\r\n<p><strong><br /></strong></p>\r\n<p><strong>APARTMENT 6: 71.81 m2 - &euro; 155,000&nbsp;&nbsp;</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>With the completion of construction of a new bridge that connects Ciovo and Trogir, the entire area will be more attractive for tourist holidays and property investment.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>We are happy to answer questions and arrange for a visit to the property.</p>', '', '1644_Apartment_0.jpg', '1644_Apartment_1.jpg', '1644_Apartment_2.jpg', '1644_Apartment_3.jpg', '1644_Apartment_4.jpg', '1644_Apartment_5.jpg', '1644_Apartment_6.JPG', '1644_Apartment_7.JPG', '1644_Apartment_8.JPG'),
(1645, 'Petar', 'Gluiæ', '', '098854127', 'petar.gluic@gmail.com', 'Trogir', 'Marina', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '20', '391', '247', 1, '900000', '', 2, 1, 2, 1, 1, 1, 5, 3, 'April 6, 2016', '<p>Luksuz, moderan dizajn, ureðen vrt, ju¾no orijentirane terase s panoramskim pogledom na more i &bdquo;infinity&ldquo; &nbsp;bazenom, velike prostrane sobe s puno svjetla, vrhunski ruèno raðeni namje&scaron;taj i pla¾a na svega 20 m udaljenosti èine ovu vilu jedinstvenom na ovom podruèju dalmatinske obale.&nbsp;Stambeni dio vile iznosi 247 m2, a parcela je povr&scaron;ine 391 m2. Vila je podijeljena na tri kata.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>We are keen to offer this beautifully designed luxury modern villa with landscaped garden, giving panoramic sea views and an "infinity" pool. It is a south facing property with large spacious windows and rooms giving plenty of light, superb handmade furniture and the sea is only 20 meters, all of which make this villa almost unique along this stretch of the Dalmatian coast. The residential part of the villa is 247 m2, and the plot has an area of 391 m2.&nbsp;The villa is divided into three floors.</p>', '', '<p>Luksuz, moderan dizajn, ureðen vrt, ju¾no orijentirane terase s panoramskim pogledom na more i &bdquo;infinity&ldquo; &nbsp;bazenom, velike prostrane sobe s puno svjetla, vrhunski ruèno raðeni namje&scaron;taj i pla¾a na svega 20 m udaljenosti èine ovu vilu jedinstvenom na ovom podruèju dalmatinske obale.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Stambeni dio vile iznosi 247 m2, a parcela je povr&scaron;ine 391 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Vila je podijeljena na tri kata.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U prizemlju se nalaze: sauna, wc i povezani dnevni boravak s kuhinjom i blagovaonicom koji su velikim prozorskim otvorima povezani s terasom i bazenom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na prvom katu se nalaze dvije spavaæe sobe, kupaonica i mala teretana.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U potkrovlju su tri spavaæe sobe i dvije kupaonice.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na svakom katu se nalaze ju¾no orijentirane terase koje pru¾aju moguænost cjelodnevnog boravka vani i u¾ivanja u prekrasnom pogledu na more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Uz vilu su osigurana dva parking mjesta.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Vila ima svu potrebnu infrastrukturu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Restorani, kafiæi i trgovine nalaze se na svega par minuta hoda od kuæe.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Aerodrom je udaljen 17 km.</p>', '<p>We are keen to offer this beautifully designed luxury modern villa with landscaped garden, giving panoramic sea views and an "infinity" pool.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is a south facing property with large spacious windows and rooms giving plenty of light, superb handmade furniture and the sea is only 20 meters, all of which make this villa almost unique along this stretch of the Dalmatian coast.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The residential part of the villa is 247 m2, and the plot has an area of 391 m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The villa is divided into three floors.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The ground floor has a sauna, bathroom and living room - connected to the open plan designed kitchen and dining room which have large window openings leading onto the terrace and pool.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the first floor there are two bedrooms, a bathroom and a small gym.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The top floor has three bedrooms and two bathrooms.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On each floor there are wide, south oriented balconies and terraces, which offer the possibility of full-day out and enjoy the beautiful view of the sea.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The villa includes two parking spaces.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The villa has all the necessary infrastructure and modern services.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There are several restaurants, bars and shops only a few minutes walk from the house.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property is situated among low density housing along the shore, so a feeling of peace and tranquility is one that you experience in the area.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The airport is 17 km.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact our office to arrange to visit the property.</p>', '', '1645_House-Villa_0.jpg', '1645_House-Villa_1.jpg', '1645_House-Villa_2.jpg', '1645_House-Villa_3.jpg', '1645_House-Villa_4.jpg', '1645_House-Villa_5.jpg', '1645_House-Villa_6.jpg', '1645_House-Villa_7.jpg', '1645_House-Villa_8.jpg');
INSERT INTO `nekretnina` (`id`, `ime`, `prezime`, `telefon`, `mobitel`, `e_mail`, `lokacija_id`, `adresa`, `status_id`, `vrsta_id`, `udaljenost`, `povrsina`, `stambenapovrsina`, `display`, `cijena`, `cijenatocka`, `ponuda_tjedna`, `new_built`, `must_sell`, `prvi_red_do_mora`, `pogled_na_more`, `bazen`, `broj_soba`, `broj_kupatila`, `datum`, `title_hr`, `title_en`, `title_ge`, `opis_hr`, `opis_en`, `opis_ge`, `PropertyImageURL0`, `PropertyImageURL1`, `PropertyImageURL2`, `PropertyImageURL3`, `PropertyImageURL4`, `PropertyImageURL5`, `PropertyImageURL6`, `PropertyImageURL7`, `PropertyImageURL8`) VALUES
(1646, 'Melita', 'Marco Polo', '', '', '', 'Korcula', 'Vela Luka', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '15', '942', '130', 1, '260000', '', 2, 2, 2, 1, 1, 2, 0, 0, 'April 7, 2016', '<p>Na ju¾noj obali otoka, u prvom redu do mora, nadomak male &scaron;ljunèane pla¾e prodaje se parcela od 942 m2 sa zapoèetom gradnjom.&nbsp;Buduæi da se nalazi se 500 m od prve kuæe tj. izvan graðevinskog podruèja, privatnost je zagarantirana.&nbsp;Na zemlji&scaron;tu postoji manji objekt koji se po va¾eæoj graðevinskoj dozvoli sastoji od dvije eta¾e.&nbsp;Na svakoj eta¾i se nalazi dvosoban stan od 65 m2 + velika natkrivena terasa.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>We have this building plot on the south coast of Korcula island, on the seafront, close to a small pebble beach. The land is 942 m2 and a new development will allow a new building of 130 m2 living area.&nbsp;It is in a wonderfully secluded location - 500 meters from the nearest house - so that complete privacy is guaranteed. On each floor there is one two bedroom apartment of 65 m2 + large covered terrace.&nbsp;</p>', '', '<p>Na ju¾noj obali otoka, u prvom redu do mora, nadomak male &scaron;ljunèane pla¾e prodaje se parcela od 942 m2 sa zapoèetom gradnjom.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Buduæi da se nalazi se 500 m od prve kuæe tj. izvan graðevinskog podruèja, privatnost je zagarantirana.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na zemlji&scaron;tu postoji manji objekt koji se po va¾eæoj graðevinskoj dozvoli sastoji od dvije eta¾e.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na svakoj eta¾i se nalazi dvosoban stan od 65 m2 + velika natkrivena terasa.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Do ove nekretnine se dolazi iskljuèivo morskim putem ili kroz &scaron;umsku stazu, &scaron;to je èini veoma po¾eljnom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Okru¾ena je &scaron;umom, pa sama lokacija odi&scaron;e mirom, spokojem, mirisom mora i aromatiènog bilja &scaron;to èini ovu nekretninu jednom od atraktivnijih na otoku.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>We have this building plot on the south coast of Korcula island, on the seafront, close to a small pebble beach.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The land is 942 m2 and a new development will allow a new building of 130 m2 living area.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is in a wonderfully secluded location - 500 meters from the nearest house - so that complete privacy is guaranteed.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the land plot is an existing small building but in accordance with the current building permit we can build a new property which consists of two floors.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On each floor there is one two bedroom apartment of 65 m2 + large covered terrace.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>This site can be reached only by sea or through a forest path, which makes it very desirable.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is surrounded by woods, but the location itself exudes peace, tranquility, the smell of the sea and aromatic herbs making this one of the most unique locations on the island.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please speak with our agents for more information.</p>', '', '1646_House-Villa_0.jpg', '1646_House-Villa_1.jpg', '1646_House-Villa_2.jpg', '1646_House-Villa_3.jpg', '1646_House-Villa_4.jpg', '1646_House-Villa_5.jpg', '1646_House-Villa_6.jpg', '1646_House-Villa_7.jpg', ''),
(1647, 'Sanda', 'Martinèeviæ', '', '098237246', '', 'Hvar', 'Hvar Vira-Pribinja, 725 zgr i 819/9 zem', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '10', '430', '50', 1, '600000', '', 2, 2, 2, 1, 1, 2, 2, 1, 'April 7, 2016', '<p>Prizemnica s vrtom u prvom redu do mora, u mirnoj i prekrasnoj uvali.&nbsp;Kuæa je okreu¾ena s tri terase s kojih se pru¾a oèaravajuæ pogled na more.&nbsp;Stambena povr&scaron;ina kuæe iznosi 50 m2, a parcela na kojoj je polo¾ena ima povr&scaron;inu 430 m2.&nbsp;Sastoji se od dvije spavaæe sobe, kuhinje s blagovaonicom i kupaonice.&nbsp;Vlasniku pripada mol za brod.</p>', '<p>We have this spacious and beautifully located house next to the sea in a quiet bay.&nbsp;The house is surrounded by a garden which seems to merge into the surrounding natural woodland of the island, but with three terraces it has stunning views of the sea. The living area is 50 m2, and the plot on which it is placed has an area of 430 m2. Enough space for improvements such as a boat store or patio area and a swimming pool. There is also a mooring for the boat.&nbsp;</p>', '', '<p>Prizemnica s vrtom u prvom redu do mora, u mirnoj i prekrasnoj uvali.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je okreu¾ena s tri terase s kojih se pru¾a oèaravajuæ pogled na more.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Stambena povr&scaron;ina kuæe iznosi 50 m2, a parcela na kojoj je polo¾ena ima povr&scaron;inu 430 m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sastoji se od dvije spavaæe sobe, kuhinje s blagovaonicom i kupaonice.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Parking se nalazi ispred kuæe.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Prisutna je kompletna infrastruktura.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Vlasniku pripada mol za brod.</p>', '<p>We have this spacious and beautifully located house next to the sea in a quiet bay.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house is surrounded by a garden which seems to merge into the surrounding natural woodland of the island, but with three terraces it has stunning views of the sea.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The living area is 50 m2, and the plot on which it is placed has an area of 430 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Enough space for improvements such as a boat store or patio area anda swimming pool.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It consists of two bedrooms, kitchen, dining room and bathrooms.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Parking is in front of the house.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There is also a mooring for the boat.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There is complete infrastructure (drains, electric etc).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact our agents to arrange a visit to this property.</p>', '', '1647_House-Villa_0.jpg', '1647_House-Villa_1.jpg', '1647_House-Villa_2.jpg', '1647_House-Villa_3.jpg', '1647_House-Villa_4.jpg', '1647_House-Villa_5.jpg', '1647_House-Villa_6.jpg', '1647_House-Villa_7.jpg', '1647_House-Villa_8.jpg'),
(1649, 'Milan ', 'Braèulj', '', '091 930 2854', 'milan.braculj60@gmail.com', 'Trogir', 'Put Kralja Zvonimra 22 Seget Vranjica, 367 k.o. Seget, z.u. 3591, podulozak 1', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '200', '108', '60', 1, '140000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 1, 1, 'April 11, 2016', '<p>Apartman u prizemlju zgrade smje&scaron;tene u blizini prekrasne pla¾e i uvale. Mjesto se nalazi u blizini grada Trogira, dok je meðunarodni aerodrom udaljen svega 10 min. vo¾nje. Ukupna povr&scaron;ina iznosi 60 m2, dok je velika prednost vrt od 108 m2. U vrtu se nalazi i sprema sa wc-om, a povi&scaron;e spreme se nalazi terasa velièine cca. 10 m2. Postoji moguænost izgradnje bazena u dvori&scaron;tu. Apartman ima povr&scaron;inu 60 m2.</p>', '<p>We have this ground floor apartment located near the beautiful beaches and bays on the shore North of Trogir. The village is located along the coast, near the town of Trogir, a beautiful town full of many historic and cultural treasures.&nbsp;The total area inside is 60 m2, while the great advantage of the property is the large garden of 108 m2. The garden is landscaped but there is plenty of space - even to redesign it to add a swimming pool and patio area.</p>', '', '<p>Apartman u prizemlju zgrade smje&scaron;tene u blizini prekrasne pla¾e i uvale.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Mjesto se nalazi u blizini grada Trogira, dok je meðunarodni aerodrom udaljen svega 10 min. vo¾nje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ukupna povr&scaron;ina iznosi 60 m2, dok je velika prednost vrt od 108 m2. &nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U vrtu se nalazi i sprema sa wc-om, a povi&scaron;e spreme se nalazi terasa velièine cca. 10 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Postoji moguænost izgradnje bazena u dvori&scaron;tu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartman ima povr&scaron;inu 60 m2, a sastoji se od hodnika, kupaonice, spreme i dnevnog dijela sa kuhinjom i blagovaonicom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Do ljeta æe apartman biti potpuno adaptiran, te æe vlasnici spremu preurediti u 2 spavaæe sobe.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Dvori&scaron;te æe takoðer biti kompletno ureðeno.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Iz apartmana se ne pru¾a pogled na more, ali je udaljeno svega nekoliko minuta pje&scaron;ke.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Trgovina, restoran i kafiæ se nalaze u blizini.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ukoliko ¾elite jo&scaron; informacija stojimo Vam na raspolaganju.</p>', '<p>We have this ground floor apartment located near the beautiful beaches and bays on the shore North of Trogir.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The village is located along the coast, near the town of Trogir, a beautiful town full of many historic and cultural treasures.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The total area inside is 60 m2, while the great advantage of the propertyis the large garden of 108 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The garden is landscaped but there is plenty of space - even to redesign it to add a swimming pool and patio area.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The apartment consists of a hallway, bathroom, storage and living area with kitchen and dining room.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>By the summer, this apartment will be completely renovated to the wishes of the owners and converted into two bedrooms.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The yard/garden will also be upgraded.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The suites do not overlook the sea, but is only a few minutes on foot.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There are shops, restaurants and cafe located nearby.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>If you want more information please contact us in Split. &nbsp;&nbsp;</p>', '', '1649_Apartment_0.jpg', '1649_Apartment_1.jpg', '1649_Apartment_2.jpg', '1649_Apartment_3.jpg', '1649_Apartment_4.jpg', '1649_Apartment_5.jpg', '1649_Apartment_6.jpg', '1649_Apartment_7.jpg', ''),
(1651, 'Nina', 'Baressi', '', '0041216243732', '', 'Hvar', 'Stari Grad, 3064/13', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '250', '115', '70', 1, '100000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 'April 11, 2016', '<p>Dvojna kuæa s vrtom, na dvije eta¾e.&nbsp;Kuæa je udaljena samo 250 m od mora.&nbsp;Sastoji se od prizemlja i prvog kata ukupne stambene povr&scaron;ine 70 m2, a nalazi se na zemlji&scaron;tu povr&scaron;ine 115 m2.&nbsp;U prizemlju su kuhinja, dnevni boravak i kupaonica, a na prvom katu dvije spavaæe sobe i wc.&nbsp;Nalazi se na mirnoj lokaciji, u blizini trgovina, kafiæa i restorana, samo nekoliko minuta od pla¾e.</p>', '<p>We are offering this semi-detached house, with a garden and parking, on two floors in a very attractive location. The house is located in the centre of the town, and only 250 m from the sea, within walking distance of the main cafes and bars round the old harbour.&nbsp;It consists of ground and first floor with a total floor area of 70 m2 and is located on a plot of 115 m2. The ferry port and sea plane connection to the island make this an easy location to access and easy to sell to tourists staying on the island for their holiday.</p>', '', '<p>Dvojna kuæa s vrtom, na dvije eta¾e.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je udaljena samo 250 m od mora.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sastoji se od prizemlja i prvog kata ukupne stambene povr&scaron;ine 70 m2, a nalazi se na zemlji&scaron;tu povr&scaron;ine 115 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U prizemlju su kuhinja, dnevni boravak i kupaonica, a na prvom katu dvije spavaæe sobe i wc.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Parking mjesto u dvori&scaron;tu i ispred kuæe.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæi je potrebna adaptacija.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nalazi se na mirnoj lokaciji, u blizini trgovina, kafiæa i restorana, samo nekoliko minuta od pla¾e.</p>', '<p>We are offering this semi-detached house, with a garden and parking, on two floors in a very attractive location.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house is located in the centre of the town, and only 250 m from the sea, within walking distance of the main cafes and bars round the old harbour.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It consists of ground and first floor with a total floor area of 70 m2 and is located on a plot of 115 m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The ground floor is kitchen, living room and bathroom, and on the first floor are two bedrooms and bathroom.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Parking place in the courtyard and in front of the house.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house needs to be modernised and redecorated, especially if a new purchaser wants to be involved in the tourism industry.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The ferry port and sea plane connection to the island make this an easy location to access and easy to sell to tourists staying on the island for their holiday.</p>', '', '1651_House-Villa_0.jpg', '1651_House-Villa_1.jpg', '1651_House-Villa_2.jpg', '1651_House-Villa_3.jpg', '1651_House-Villa_4.jpg', '', '', '', ''),
(1652, 'Jakov', 'Zlodre', '+44 7810 376023', 'Pjeru Reskusicu: 099 7228977', 'jakov.zlodre@gmail.com', 'Split', 'Jobova 18, z.u. 15695', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '550', '0', '78', 1, '165000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 'April 12, 2016', '<p>Atraktivan apartman u Splitu na odliènoj lokaciji, u mirnom podruèju, blizu centra grada te svih potrebnih sadr¾aja. Apartman se nalazi na drugom katu zgrade s liftom. Ukupna stambena povr&scaron;ina iznosi 78,38 m2 m2.&nbsp;Dnevni boravak ima izlaz na balkon okrenut prema jugu.&nbsp;Apartman je veoma osunèan i prozraèan, te se iz kuhinje i dnevnog boravka pru¾a pogled na zelenilo ispred zgrade.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>We have this attractive apartment in Split in a great location. It is in a quiet area, 5 mins walking to the town old centre and the same distance to Marjan hill, beaches and recreation centre.&nbsp;The apartment is located on the second floor of the building, which has a lift. The living room has a balcony facing south, with access through sliding window/doors.&nbsp;The apartment is very sunny and airy, and the kitchen and living room overlook the trees in the park in front of the building.</p>', '', '<p>Atraktivan apartman u Splitu na odliènoj lokaciji, u mirnom podruèju, blizu centra grada te svih potrebnih sadr¾aja.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartman se nalazi na drugom katu zgrade s liftom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sastoji se od predsoblja, kuhinje s blagovaonicom, prostranog dnevnog boravka, wc-a i ostave u jednom dijelu stana, te dvije spavaæe sobe i kupaonice u drugom dijelu stana, ukupne stambene povr&scaron;ine 78,38 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Dnevni boravak ima izlaz na balkon okrenut prema jugu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartman je veoma osunèan i prozraèan, te se iz kuhinje i dnevnog boravka pru¾a pogled na zelenilo ispred zgrade.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Stan je idealan za obitelj buduæi da se u blizini zgrade nalaze mnogobrojna djeèja igrali&scaron;ta i vrtovi.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Centar grada gdje su mnogobrojni restorani, kafiæi, suvenirnice i ostali sadr¾aji je udaljen samo 5 minuta hoda, pa je stan prikladan i za turistièki najam.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Centar Splita je iz godine u godinu sve popularnije turistièko odredi&scaron;te, te je ovaj apartman idealan za iznajmljivanje, ali i za vlastito u¾ivanje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Meðunarodni aerodrom udaljen je 30 min. vo¾nje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za sve dodatne informacije slobodno nas kontaktirajte.</p>', '<p>We have this attractive apartment in Split in a great location.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is in a quiet area, 5 mins walking to the town old centre and the same distance to Marjan hill, beaches and recreation centre.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The apartment is located on the second floor of the building, which has a lift.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The apartment consists of hallway, kitchen, dining room, living room, bathroom and storage in one part of the apartments, and two bedrooms and bathroom in the second part of the apartment.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The living room has a balcony facing south, with access through sliding window/doors.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The apartment is very sunny and airy, and the kitchen and living room overlook the trees in the park in front of the building.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is ideal for families because there are so many options for playgrounds, and the Marjan park the beaches, and other attractions for youngsters.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The town centre, where many restaurants, cafes, souvenir shops and other facilities is just 5 minutes walk, and the flat has great potential for tourist rentals.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The centre of Split sees more and more tourists every year, and this apartment is ideal for rental or for your own enjoyment.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>All the major historic attractions are within walking distance.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The international airport is 30 minutes driving.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For additional information, please contact us.</p>', '', '1652_Apartment_0.jpg', '1652_Apartment_1.jpg', '1652_Apartment_2.jpg', '1652_Apartment_3.jpg', '1652_Apartment_4.jpg', '1652_Apartment_5.jpg', '1652_Apartment_6.jpg', '1652_Apartment_7.jpg', '1652_Apartment_8.jpg'),
(1653, 'Claus', 'Folden', '', '+35699922337', 'clausfolden@yahoo.co.uk', 'Hvar', 'Kc. 226/3, 227/1, 2593/4 ko Dol', 'For sale', 'Old stone house', '3000', '309', '119', 1, '135000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 0, 0, 'April 12, 2016', '<p>Na prodaju nudimo kamenu kuæu za renovaciju, smje&scaron;tenu u malom mjestu u unutra&scaron;njosti otoka Hvara, svega 3 km od mora i glavnog otoèkog pristani&scaron;ta u Starom Gradu.&nbsp;Nekretnina se sastoji od glavne kuæe povr&scaron;ine 76 m2 (preko 3 eta¾e) te pomoænog objekta povr&scaron;ine 43 m2. Obje kuæe trebaju potpunu renovaciju.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>For sale we have this stone house in need of renovation, located in a chaming inland village on Hvar island, only 3 km from the sea and the island''s main ferry port.&nbsp;The property consists of the main house sized 76 sqm (spread over 3 floors) and auxiliary object sized 43 sqm. Both houses need complete renovation.&nbsp;</p>', '', '<p><strong>Kamena kuca na otoku Hvaru</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na prodaju nudimo kamenu kuæu za renovaciju, smje&scaron;tenu u malom mjestu u unutra&scaron;njosti otoka Hvara, svega 3 km od mora i glavnog otoèkog pristani&scaron;ta u Starom Gradu.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nekretnina se sastoji od glavne kuæe povr&scaron;ine 76 m2 (preko 3 eta¾e) te pomoænog objekta povr&scaron;ine 43 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Obje kuæe trebaju potpunu renovaciju.&nbsp;</p>', '<p><strong>Stone house on Hvar island</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For sale we have this stone house in need of renovation, located in a chaming inland village on Hvar island, only 3 km from the sea and the island''s main ferry port.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property consists of the main house sized 76 sqm (spread over 3 floors) and auxiliary object sized 43 sqm.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Both houses need complete renovation.&nbsp;</p>', '', '1653_Old-stone-house_0.jpg', '1653_Old-stone-house_1.jpg', '1653_Old-stone-house_2.jpg', '1653_Old-stone-house_3.jpg', '1653_Old-stone-house_4.jpg', '1653_Old-stone-house_5.jpg', '', '', ''),
(1654, '®eljko', 'Muiæ', 'Marin Muiæ 099 325 5959', '', 'anabrajkov@hotmail.com (Marinova zarucni', 'Zadar', 'Pridraga, Kc 205/144 ko Pridraga', 'For sale', 'Land plot', '190', '457', '0', 2, '45700', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 0, 0, 'April 13, 2016', '<p>Na prodaju nudimo graðevinsko zemlji&scaron;te u malom mjestu 39 km sjeveroistoèno od Zadra.&nbsp;Zemlji&scaron;te je pravilnog oblika, u neposrednoj blizini infrastrukture te svega 190 metara od mora.&nbsp;Dozvoljena je gradnja obiteljske kuæe na 3 eta¾e, uz koeficijent izgraðenosti 0,3 i koeficijent iskoristivosti 1,0.</p>', '<p>For sale we have this building land in a small village 39 km northeast from Zadar.&nbsp;The plot is of regular shape, nearby the infrastructure and only 190 meters from the sea.&nbsp;A family house on 3 floors can be built. Footprint building ratio 0,3 and utilization ratio 1,0.</p>', '', '<p><strong>Graðevinsko zemlji&scaron;te 39 km od Zadra</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na prodaju nudimo graðevinsko zemlji&scaron;te u malom mjestu 39 km sjeveroistoèno od Zadra.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Zemlji&scaron;te je pravilnog oblika, u neposrednoj blizini infrastrukture te svega 190 metara od mora.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Dozvoljena je gradnja obiteljske kuæe na 3 eta¾e, uz koeficijent izgraðenosti 0,3 i koeficijent iskoristivosti 1,0.</p>', '<p><strong>Building land for sale 39 km from Zadar</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For sale we have this building land in a small village 39 km northeast from Zadar.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The plot is of regular shape, nearby the infrastructure and only 190 meters from the sea.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>A family house on 3 floors can be built.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Footprint building ratio 0,3 and utilization ratio 1,0.</p>', '', '1654_Land-plot_0.jpg', '1654_Land-plot_1.jpg', '1654_Land-plot_2.jpg', '1654_Land-plot_3.jpg', '1654_Land-plot_4.jpg', '1654_Land-plot_5.jpg', '1654_Land-plot_6.jpg', '1654_Land-plot_7.jp