(1655, 'FPC', 'SURADNJA', 'Anja Plazonic 091 280 2628', '', 'anja@firstpropertycroatia.com', 'Brac', 'Bol', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '200', '0', '66', 1, '155000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 2, 2, 'April 13, 2016', '<p>Na prodaju nudimo atraktivan dvosobni apartman na prvom katu manje stambene zgrade, svega 200 metara udaljen od mora i centra mjesta.&nbsp;Apartman ima 2 spavaæe sobe i 2 kupaonice, a ukupne je povr&scaron;ine 66 m2. Uz navedeno, ima i balkon povr&scaron;ine 9 m2, spremi&scaron;te u podrumu povr&scaron;ine 11 m2 te gara¾no mjesto. Prodaje se s kuhinjom. Sa balkona se pru¾a predivan pogled na more i mjesto.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>For sale we have this attractive apartment on the first floor, at walking distance to the sea and the center of the village.&nbsp;This is a 2- bedroom 2-bathroom apartment sized 66 sqm, that comes along with 9 sqm balcony, 11 sqm storage/utility room in the basement as well as in posession of the parking place in the garage.&nbsp;It is sold with kitchen and features gorgeous sea views.&nbsp;</p>', '', '<p><strong>Atraktivan dvosoban stan na Braèu, cijena sni¾ena sa 190 na 155 tisuæa EUR</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na prodaju nudimo atraktivan dvosoban apartman na prvom katu manje stambene zgrade, svega 200 metara udaljen od mora i centra mjesta.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartman ima 2 spavaæe sobe i 2 kupaonice, a ukupne je povr&scaron;ine 66 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Uz navedeno, ima i balkon povr&scaron;ine 9 m2, spremi&scaron;te u podrumu povr&scaron;ine 11 m2 te gara¾no mjesto.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuhinja je ukljuèena u cijenu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sa balkona se pru¾a predivan pogled na more i mjesto.&nbsp;</p>', '<p><strong>Attractive 2-bedroom apartment on Brac, price reduced from 190 to 155 thousand EUR</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For sale we have this attractive apartment on the first floor, at walking distance to the sea and the center of the village.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>This is a 2-bedroom 2-bathroom apartment sized 66 sqm, that comes along with 9 sqm balcony, 11 sqm storage/utility room in the basement as well as in posession of the parking place in the garage.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is sold with kitchen and features gorgeous sea views.&nbsp;</p>', '', '1655_Apartment_0.jpg', '1655_Apartment_1.jpg', '1655_Apartment_2.jpg', '1655_Apartment_3.jpg', '1655_Apartment_4.jpg', '1655_Apartment_5.jpg', '1655_Apartment_6.jpg', '1655_Apartment_7.jpg', '1655_Apartment_8.jpg'),
(1656, 'Tonèi', 'Princivali', '0916885310', '', 'tonci.princivali@brodotrogir.hr', 'Trogir', 'Gradska ulica 29  Trogir, z.u. 62   katastar 3955', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '80', '0', '72', 1, '210000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 'April 13, 2016', '<p>Apartman na odliènoj lokaciji, u samom centru grada Trogira sa prekrasnim pogledom na stari dio grada. Trogir je pod UNESCO za&scaron;titom i jedan je od popularnijih gradova srednje Dalmacije. Nalazi se u staroj kamenoj zgradi, a prostire se preko 2 eta¾e, na 3. i 4. katu. Potkrovlje trenutno ima odvojen ulaz, ali je moguæe povezati prvu eta¾u direktno sa potkrovljem. Ukupna povr&scaron;ina je 56 m2 + potkrovlje 16 m2.</p>', '<p>We are offering this 2 bedroom apartment in a prime location in the centre of town with beautiful views of the old town. Trogir is a famous medieval town, under UNESCO protection, and is one of the most popular holiday destinations along the central Dalmatian coast. This property is located in an old stone building and is spread over two floors, the 3rd and 4th floor. The loft now has a separate entrance, but can be connected directly with the first floor. The total area is 56 m2 + loft 16 m2.</p>', '', '<p>Apartman na odliènoj lokaciji, u samom centru grada Trogira sa prekrasnim pogledom na stari dio grada.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Trogir je pod UNESCO za&scaron;titom i jedan je od popularnijih gradova srednje Dalmacije.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nalazi se u staroj kamenoj zgradi, a prostire se preko 2 eta¾e, na 3. i 4. katu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na 3. katu se nalazi hodnik, kuhinja sa blagovaonicom i dnevnim boravkom, 2 spavaæe sobe, sprema i kupaonica.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na 4. katu u potkrovlju se nalazi veliki prostor koje je potrebno kompletno renovirati.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Potkrovlje trenutno ima odvojen ulaz, ali je moguæe povezati prvu eta¾u direktno sa potkrovljem.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ukupna povr&scaron;ina je 56 m2 + potkrovlje 16 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartman je u odliènom stanju, ali je potrebno ureðenje ukoliko se ¾eli luksuzniji nivo.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Lokacija je idealna ukoliko netko ¾eli pretvoriti apartman u uredski prostor ili se baviti turistèkim iznajmljivanjem.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U blizini se nalaze svi potrebni sadr¾aji, a velika prednost je blizina meðunarodnog aerodroma i Splita.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Mnogobrojne pla¾e se nalaze na otoku Èiovu koji je povezan mostom sa gradom Trogirom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ukoliko imate dodatnih pitanja slobodno nas kontaktirajte.</p>', '<p>We are offering this 2 bedroom apartment in a prime location in the centre of town with beautiful views of the old town.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Trogir is a famous medieval town, under UNESCO protection, and is one of the most popular holiday destinations along the central Dalmatian coast.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>This property is located in an old stone building and is spread over two floors, the 3rd and 4th floor.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the third floor is a hallway, kitchen, dining room and living room, 2 bedrooms, with a storage area and a bathroom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the 4th floor in the attic there is a large area which needs complete renovation.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The loft now has a separate entrance, but can be connected directly with the first floor.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The total area is 56 m2 + loft 16 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The apartment is in excellent condition, but needs improvements to achieve a more luxurious level.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The location is ideal if someone wants to convert the apartment into an office space or deal with touristic renting, being close to the centre of the town.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nearby are all necessary facilities such as shops, many restaurants, bars and cafes as well as all the historic and cultural attractions of the town.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There is also a big advantage being so close to the international airport and Split.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Various popular beaches are located on Ciovo which is connected with the city of Trogir by a bridge, making access to this popular island quite easy.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>If you have any questions please contact our office in Split.</p>', '', '1656_Apartment_0.jpg', '1656_Apartment_1.jpg', '1656_Apartment_2.JPG', '1656_Apartment_3.JPG', '1656_Apartment_4.JPG', '1656_Apartment_5.JPG', '1656_Apartment_6.JPG', '1656_Apartment_7.JPG', '1656_Apartment_8.JPG'),
(1658, 'Stanko', 'Kvesiæ', '', ' 098 423 893', 'stanko@adria-bol.hr', 'Brac', 'Bol, 2318/3 KO Bol', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '200', '79', '119', 1, '420000', '', 2, 1, 2, 2, 1, 1, 3, 2, 'April 13, 2016', '<p>Fantastièan penthouse u popularnom turistièkom mjestu s ju¾ne strane otoka Braèa. Ovaj jedinstveni stan smje&scaron;ten na prvoj eta¾i manje zgrade nudi pogled na more i cijelo mjesto.&nbsp;Moderan apartman ima mnogo vrata i prozora &scaron;to mu daje iznimnu kolièinu svjetla i sunca u svim prostorijama. Parking mjesto u gara¾i je ukljuèeno u cijenu.&nbsp;Apartman ima 119 m2 unutarnje povr&scaron;ine, tri terase (3, 4 i 6 m2) te dva vrta (51 i 27 m2) od kojih jedan ima privatan bazen.</p>', '<p>Superb apartment located in a popular tourist town from the south side of Brac island. This is trully outstanding apartment located on the first floor of a low-rise building, overlooking the town and the sea.&nbsp;It''s a modern and bright apartment with many doors and windows, offering plenitude of sunlight thoughout. A garage parking space is included in the price.&nbsp;The property has 119 sqm internal, three terraces (3, 4 and 6 sqm) and two gardens (51 and 27 sqm) out of which one has the private pool.</p>', '', '<p><strong>Fantastièan penthouse u popularnom turistièkom mjestu s ju¾ne strane otoka Braèa</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ovaj jedinstveni stan smje&scaron;ten na prvoj eta¾i manje zgrade nudi pogled na more i cijelo mjesto.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Moderan apartman ima mnogo vrata i prozora &scaron;to mu daje iznimnu kolièinu svjetla i sunca u svim prostorijama.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Parking mjesto u gara¾i je ukljuèeno u cijenu. &nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartman ima 119 m2 unutarnje povr&scaron;ine, tri terase (3, 4 i 6 m2) te dva vrta (51 i 27 m2) od kojih jedan ima privatan bazen.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sastoji se od tri spavaæe sobe, dvije kupaonice, kuhinje, dnevnog boravka te otvorenog koncepta dnevnog boravka.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nekoliko minuta hoda od centra mjesta.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Luksuz u svom najboljem izdanju.</p>', '<p><strong>Superb apartment located in a popular tourist town from the south side of Brac island</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>This is trully outstanding apartment located on the first floor of a low-rise building, overlooking the town and the sea.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It''s a modern and bright apartment with many doors and windows, offering plenitude of sunlight thoughout.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>A garage parking space is included in the price.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property has 119 sqm internal, three terraces (3, 4 and 6 sqm) and two gardens (51 and 27 sqm) out of which one has the private pool.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The apartment consists of three bedrooms, two bathrooms, kitchen, dining and open space living room.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Only couple of minutes walk to the centre.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Luxury at it''s best.</p>', '', '1658_Apartment_0.jpg', '1658_Apartment_1.jpg', '1658_Apartment_2.jpg', '1658_Apartment_3.jpg', '1658_Apartment_4.jpg', '1658_Apartment_5.jpg', '1658_Apartment_6.jpg', '1658_Apartment_7.jpg', '1658_Apartment_8.jpg'),
(1659, 'Stanko', 'Kvesiæ', '', '098 423 893', 'stanko@adria-bol.hr', 'Brac', 'Bol, 2318 / 3 KO Bol', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '200', '0', '111', 1, '540000', '', 2, 1, 2, 2, 1, 2, 3, 2, 'April 13, 2016', '<p>Fantastièan penthouse u popularnom turistièkom mjestu s ju¾ne strane otoka Braèa. Ovaj jedinstveni stan smje&scaron;ten na zadnjoj eta¾i manje zgrade nudi pogled na more i cijelo mjesto.&nbsp;Moderan apartman ima mnogo vrata i prozora &scaron;to mu daje iznimnu kolièinu svjetla i sunca u svim prostorijama. Zatvorena gara¾a sa tri parking mjesta je ukljuèena u cijenu.&nbsp;Apartman ima 111 m2 unutarnje povr&scaron;ine te 100 m2 terase sa jacuzzijem.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>Superb penthouse located in a popular tourist town from the south side of Brac island. This is trully outstanding apartment located on the top floor of a low-rise building, overlooking the town and the sea.&nbsp;It''s a modern and bright apartment with many doors and windows, offering plenitude of sunlight thoughout. A closed garage with three parking spaces is included in the price.&nbsp;The property has 111 sqm internal and 100 sqm of the terrace with jacuzzi.&nbsp;</p>', '', '<p><strong>Fantastièan penthouse u popularnom turistièkom mjestu s ju¾ne strane otoka Braèa</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ovaj jedinstveni stan smje&scaron;ten na zadnjoj eta¾i manje zgrade nudi pogled na more i cijelo mjesto.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Moderan apartman ima mnogo vrata i prozora &scaron;to mu daje iznimnu kolièinu svjetla i sunca u svim prostorijama.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Zatvorena gara¾a sa tri parking mjesta je ukljuèena u cijenu. &nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartman ima 111 m2 unutarnje povr&scaron;ine te 100 m2 terase sa jacuzzijem.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sastoji se od tri spavaæe sobe, dvije kupaonice, kuhinje, te otvorenog koncepta dnevnog boravka.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nekoliko minuta hoda od centra mjesta.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Luksuz u svom najboljem izdanju.</p>', '<p><strong>Superb penthouse located in a popular tourist town from the south side of Brac island</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>This is trully outstanding apartment located on the top floor of a low-rise building, overlooking the town and the sea.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It''s a modern and bright apartment with many doors and windows, offering plenitude of sunlight thoughout.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>A closed garage with three parking spaces is included in the price.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property has 111 sqm internal and 100 sqm of the terrace with jacuzzi.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Consists of three bedrooms, two bathrooms, kitchen, dining and open space living room.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Only couple of minutes walk to the centre.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Luxury at it''s best.</p>', '', '1659_Apartment_0.JPG', '1659_Apartment_1.JPG', '1659_Apartment_2.JPG', '1659_Apartment_3.JPG', '1659_Apartment_4.JPG', '1659_Apartment_5.JPG', '1659_Apartment_6.JPG', '1659_Apartment_7.JPG', '1659_Apartment_8.JPG'),
(1660, 'Damir', 'Lonèariæ', '091/5341142', '', 'dlonac@gmail.com', 'Split', 'Kamenita 34, k.è. 11321 z.u.3766', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '300', '0', '63', 1, '125000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 4, 0, 'April 15, 2016', '<p>Prodaje se dio kuæe za renovaciju, u starom dijelu povijesnog grada Splita. Kuæa je u nizu, te je smje&scaron;tena u mirnom dijelu grada, ali u blizini svih sadr¾aja. Udaljena je od mora samo 300 m, u blizini Dioklecijanove palaèe i Marjana.&nbsp;Na prodaju je drugi kat i stambeno potkrovlje, ukupne stambene povr&scaron;ine 63 m2.&nbsp;Orijentacija je sjever-jug.&nbsp;Prostor je potrebno adaptirati.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>We have this renovation project in the heart of Split. The property is part of an old stone house in the old part of the historic city of Split. For sale is the second floor with residential loft, with total surface area of 63 m2. The house is in a row/terrace, and the building appears in ok condition. It is situated in a quiet area, but close to all amenities. Orientation is north - south. The property needs complete renovation, with new plumbing, electrics, and redesigning the interior space before redecorating.</p>', '', '<p>Prodaje se dio kamene kuæe za renovaciju, u starom dijelu povijesnog grada Splita.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je u nizu, te je smje&scaron;tena u mirnom dijelu grada, ali u blizini svih sadr¾aja.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Udaljena je od mora samo 300 m, u blizini Dioklecijanove palaèe i Marjana.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na prodaju je drugi kat i stambeno potkrovlje, ukupne stambene povr&scaron;ine 63 m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Orijentacija je sjever - jug.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Prostor je potrebno adaptirati.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Vlasni&scaron;tvo uredno.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>S obzirom na poziciju ovo je izvrsna prilika ukoliko ¾elite nekretninu renovirati u svrhu turistièkog iznajmljivanja ili je jednostavno ¾elite koristiti za vlastiti boravak.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Park &scaron;uma Marjan gdje se nalazi rekreacijska zona i prekrasne pla¾e udaljena je 10 min. hodanja.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Meðunarodni aerodrom udaljen je 40 min. vo¾nje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za sve dodatne informacije slobodno nas kontaktirajte.</p>', '<p><strong>Renovation project</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>We have this renovation project in the heart of Split.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property is part of an old stone house in the old part of the historic city of Split.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For sale is the second floor with residential loft, with total surface area of 63 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house is in a row/terrace, and the building appears in ok condition.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is situated in a quiet area, but close to all amenities.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is about 300m from the sea and only 300 m from the Diocletian''s Palace and Marjan park.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Orientation is north - south.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property needs complete renovation, with new plumbing, electrics, and redesigning the interior space before redecorating.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>However, due to its position it is a great opportunity to own a house in the centre of the city whether you are looking to renovate the property for the purposes of tourism renting or private living.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Marjan Forest Park is where there are many recreation opportunities, with beaches, rock climbing, a canoeing centre and a beautiful beach all within 20 minutes walking.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The international airport is 40 minutes driving.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For further information please contact our office.</p>', '', '1660_Apartment_0.jpg', '1660_Apartment_1.jpg', '1660_Apartment_2.jpg', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(1661, 'Melita', 'Marco Polo', '', '', '', 'Korcula', 'Vela Luka', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '300', '0', '175', 1, '195000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 3, 1, 'April 18, 2016', '<p>U mirnom dijelu Vele Luke prodaje se renovirana kamena kuæa u nizu.&nbsp;Sastoji se od tri eta¾e i tavana ukupne stambene povr&scaron;ine 175 m2 plus terase i dvori&scaron;te.&nbsp;Od rive i mora udaljena je 300 metara.&nbsp;Na najgornjem katu su dvije spavaæe sobe od kojih jedna ima izlaz na ljupku kamenu terasu okrenutu prema jugu.&nbsp;Tavan je veæim dijelom iskoristiv i u produ¾etku ima krovnu terasu s panoramskim pogledom na velolu&scaron;ke krovove.</p>', '<p>This house located in a quiet neighborhood has many nice features. The house has three levels. On the top floor are two bedrooms, one with access to a lovely stone terrace facing south. The attic is usable and there is an attic extension to a roof terrace with panoramic views of the residential area.&nbsp;The house is sold fully furnished and ready to move in.</p>', '', '<p><strong>Renovirana kamena kuæa, kompletno namje&scaron;tena i spremna za useljenje</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U mirnom dijelu Vele Luke prodaje se renovirana kamena kuæa u nizu.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sastoji se od tri eta¾e i tavana ukupne stambene povr&scaron;ine 175 m2 plus terase i dvori&scaron;te.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Od rive i mora udaljena je 300 metara.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Prizemlje se sastoji od dnevnog boravka, kupaonice, velike ljetne kuhinje s kaminom te dodatne prostorije koja slu¾i kao spremi&scaron;te.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na katu se nalazi kuhinja s blagovaonicom, prostrani ured s balkonom, te spavaæa soba s wc-om.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na najgornjem katu su dvije spavaæe sobe od kojih jedna ima izlaz na ljupku kamenu terasu okrenutu prema jugu.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Tavan je veæim dijelom iskoristiv i u produ¾etku ima krovnu terasu s panoramskim pogledom na velolu&scaron;ke krovove.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa posjeduje solarni kolektor koji pokriva vi&scaron;e od 80 % potrebne kolièine tople vode za kuæanstvo.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na svakoj eta¾i se nalazi prikljuèak za dimnjak i peæ.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Renoviranje i opremanje je izvedeno s pa¾njom te su kori&scaron;teni kvalitetni i tradicionalni materijali.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Prodaje se kompletno namje&scaron;tena i spremna za useljenje.</p>', '<p><strong>Renovated stone house for sale</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>This house, located in a quiet neighborhood and has many nice features including a solar collector which provides over 80% of the required hot water.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house has three levels.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The ground floor consists of a living room, bathroom, large summer kitchen with fireplace and additional rooms that serve as storage and tool room.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the first floor there is a kitchen/dining room, spacious office with balcony and bedroom with toilet.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the top floor are two bedrooms, one with access to a lovely stone terrace facing south.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The attic is usable and there is an attic extension to a roof terrace with panoramic views of the residential area.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house is sold fully furnished and ready to move in.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Electricity and town water are connected.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Of course, the ownership title is clear.&nbsp;</p>', '', '1661_House-Villa_0.jpg', '1661_House-Villa_1.jpg', '1661_House-Villa_2.jpg', '1661_House-Villa_3.jpg', '1661_House-Villa_4.jpg', '1661_House-Villa_5.jpg', '1661_House-Villa_6.jpg', '1661_House-Villa_7.jpg', ''),
(1662, 'Dream Croatia', 'Savills', 'Nata¹a Elakoviæ 091 185 7237', '', 'natasa@dreamcroatia.com', 'Dubrovnik', 'Cavtat', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '0', '0', '119', 1, '235000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 3, 2, 'April 18, 2016', '<p>Na prodaju nudimo nedavno opremljeni prostrani apartman u Cavtatu nedaleko od Dubrovnika.&nbsp;Apartman ima 2 velike spavaæe sobe, malu sobu, dnevni boravak sa blagovaonicom, kuhinju, kupaonicu, wc, ostavu, hodnik te veliki balkon sa odliènim pogledom na more.&nbsp;Nekretnina je renovirana prije nekoliko godina i jako dobro odr¾avana.&nbsp;Do centra Cavtata i pla¾e ima svega 10 minuta hoda. &nbsp;</p>', '<p>For sale we have this recently furnished spacious apartment with sea views in Cavtat, near Dubrovnik.&nbsp;It has 2 large bedrooms, 1 small room, living and dining room, kitchen, bathroom, toilet, storage and hallway. There is a big balcony with great sea views.&nbsp;Property is well maintained and renovated a few years ago.&nbsp;At walking distance to the Old Town and beaches (10 min).</p>', '', '<p><strong>Apartman na prodaju u Cavtatu</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na prodaju nudimo nedavno opremljeni prostrani apartman u Cavtatu nedaleko od Dubrovnika.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartman ima 2 velike spavaæe sobe, malu sobu, dnevni boravak sa blagovaonicom, kuhinju, kupaonicu, wc, ostavu, hodnik te veliki balkon sa odliènim pogledom na more.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nekretnina je renovirana prije nekoliko godina i jako dobro odr¾avana.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Do centra Cavtata i pla¾e ima svega 10 minuta hoda. &nbsp;</p>', '<p><strong>Apartment for sale in Cavtat</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For sale we have this recently furnished spacious apartment with sea views in Cavtat, near Dubrovnik.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It has 2 large bedrooms, 1 small room, living and dining room, kitchen, bathroom, toilet, storage and hallway.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There is a big balcony with great sea views.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Property is well maintained and renovated a few years ago.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>At walking distance to the Old Town and beaches (10 min).</p>', '', '1662_Apartment_0.jpg', '1662_Apartment_1.jpg', '1662_Apartment_2.jpg', '1662_Apartment_3.jpg', '1662_Apartment_4.jpg', '1662_Apartment_5.jpg', '1662_Apartment_6.jpg', '1662_Apartment_7.jpg', '1662_Apartment_8.jpg'),
(1663, 'Dream Croatia', 'Savills', 'Nata¹a Elakoviæ 091 185 7237', '', 'natasa@dreamcroatia.com', 'Dubrovnik', 'Mlini', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '0', '490', '100', 1, '315000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 4, 2, 'April 18, 2016', '<p>Na prodaju nudimo samostojeæu kuæu na 2 eta¾e, smje&scaron;tenu u malom mjestu 10 min vo¾nje od Dubrovnika.&nbsp;Prizemlje: 2 spavaæe sobe, dnevni boravak, kuhinja sa blagovaonicom, kupaonica i hodnik.&nbsp;Prvi kat: 2 spavaæe sobe, otvoreni prostor dnevnog boravka sa kuhinjom i blagovaonicom, kupaonica.&nbsp;Iz dnevnog boravka izlazi se na balkon koji nudi lijepi pogled na more.</p>', '<p>For sale we have this detached family house spread on 2 floors.&nbsp;Ground floor: 2 bedrooms, living room, kitchen and dining area, bathroom and hallway.&nbsp;First floor: 2 bedrooms, all-in-one living room with kitchen and dining area, bathroom.&nbsp;From the living room there are doors to the balcony featuring splendid sea views.&nbsp;Furtniture and fittings included in the price.&nbsp;</p>', '', '<p><strong>Samostojeæa kuæa na prodaju 10 min vo¾nje od Dubrovnika</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na prodaju nudimo samostojeæu kuæu na 2 eta¾e, smje&scaron;tenu u malom mjestu 10 min vo¾nje od Dubrovnika.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Prizemlje: 2 spavaæe sobe, dnevni boravak, kuhinja sa blagovaonicom, kupaonica i hodnik.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Prvi kat: 2 spavaæe sobe, otvoreni prostor dnevnog boravka sa kuhinjom i blagovaonicom, kupaonica.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Iz dnevnog boravka izlazi se na balkon koji nudi lijepi pogled na more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Namje&scaron;taj i oprema ukljuèeni u cijenu. &nbsp;&nbsp;</p>', '<p><strong>Detached house for sale 10 min car ride from Dubrovnik</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For sale we have this detached family house spread on 2 floors.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ground floor: 2 bedrooms, living room, kitchen and dining area, bathroom and hallway.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>First floor: 2 bedrooms, all-in-one living room with kitchen and dining area, bathroom.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>From the living room there are doors to the balcony featuring splendid sea views.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Furtniture and fittings included in the price.&nbsp;</p>', '', '1663_House-Villa_0.jpg', '1663_House-Villa_1.jpg', '1663_House-Villa_2.jpg', '1663_House-Villa_3.jpg', '1663_House-Villa_4.jpg', '1663_House-Villa_5.jpg', '1663_House-Villa_6.jpg', '1663_House-Villa_7.jpg', '1663_House-Villa_8.jpg');
