(1664, 'Dream Croatia', 'Savills', 'Nata¹a Elakoviæ 091 185 7237', '', 'natasa@dreamcroatia.com', 'Dubrovnik', 'Lapad', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '0', '0', '62', 1, '149000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 2, 1, 'April 18, 2016', '<p>Na prodaju nudimo stan u Dubrovniku, na zadnjem katu zgrade izgraðene 80ih godina, u izvornom stanju.&nbsp;Sastoji se od 2 spavaæe sobe, dnevne sobe, kuhinje sa blagovaonicom, kupaonice, hodnika i dva balkona od kojih jedan ima pogled na more i uvalu Gruz.&nbsp;Stan treba renovaciju. Svi sadr¾aji nalaze se u neposrednoj blizini.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>For sale we have this top floor apartment in Dubrovnik, short ride from the center and in need of renovation.&nbsp;It consists of two bedrooms, living room, kitchen with dining area, bathroom, hallway and two balconies, one of which offers sea views and Gruz bay.&nbsp;All amenities in walking distance.&nbsp;</p>', '', '<p><strong>Dvosobni stan u Dubrovniku</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na prodaju nudimo stan u Dubrovniku, na zadnjem katu zgrade izgraðene 80ih godina, u izvornom stanju.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sastoji se od 2 spavaæe sobe, dnevne sobe, kuhinje sa blagovaonicom, kupaonice, hodnika i dva balkona od kojih jedan ima pogled na more i uvalu Gruz.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Stan treba renovaciju.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Svi sadr¾aji nalaze se u neposrednoj blizini.&nbsp;</p>', '<p><strong>Two bedroom apartment in Dubrovnik</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For sale we have this top floor apartment in Dubrovnik, short ride from the center and in need of renovation.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It consists of two bedrooms, living room, kitchen with dining area, bathroom, hallway and two balconies, one of which offers sea views and Gruz bay.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>All amenities in walking distance.&nbsp;</p>', '', '1664_Apartment_0.jpg', '1664_Apartment_1.jpg', '1664_Apartment_2.jpg', '1664_Apartment_3.jpg', '1664_Apartment_4.jpg', '1664_Apartment_5.jpg', '1664_Apartment_6.jpg', '1664_Apartment_7.jpg', ''),
(1665, 'Dream Croatia', 'Savills', 'Nata¹a Elakoviæ 091 185 7237', '', 'natasa@dreamcroatia.com', 'Dubrovnik', 'Dubrovnik', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '0', '1130', '132', 1, '99999999', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 2, 1, 'April 18, 2016', '<p>Croatia Property Sales predstavlja na prodaju staru kuæu na 3 eta¾e, za potpuno preureðenje. Kuæa se nalazi nedaleko od centra Dubrovnika i ima izvrstan pogled na more i Grad. Prizemlje: dnevni prostor sa kuhinjom. Prvi kat: dvije spavaæe sobe. Potkrovlje je nedovr&scaron;eno i koristi se kao ostava. Dio zemlji&scaron;ta je pod za&scaron;titom kao kulturno dobro i mora se koristiti kao vrt. Drugi dio parcele je u graðevnoj zoni i moguæe je napraviti mali prizemni objekt.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>Croatia Property Sales presents this old house on 3 floors, in need of complete renovation.&nbsp;It is located near the center of Dubrovnik and features splendid views over the sea and the town.&nbsp;Ground floor has living area with the kitchen. First floor contains two bedrooms. Attick is currently unfinished and used as a storage.&nbsp;The other part of the plot is a building land, able to fit small single-level house.&nbsp;</p>', '', '<p><strong>Stara kuæa na prodaju nedaleko od centra Dubrovnika</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Croatia Property Sales predstavlja na prodaju staru kuæu na 3 eta¾e, za potpuno preureðenje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa se nalazi nedaleko od centra Dubrovnika i ima izvrstan pogled na more i Grad.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Prizemlje: dnevni prostor sa kuhinjom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Prvi kat: dvije spavaæe sobe.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Potkrovlje je nedovr&scaron;eno i koristi se kao ostava.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Dio zemlji&scaron;ta je pod za&scaron;titom kao kulturno dobro i mora se koristiti kao vrt.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Drugi dio parcele je u graðevnoj zoni i moguæe je napraviti mali prizemni objekt.&nbsp;</p>', '<p><strong>An old house for sale in Dubrovnik</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Croatia Property Sales presents this old house on 3 floors, in need of complete renovation.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is located near the center of Dubrovnik and features splendid views over the sea and the town.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ground floor has living area with the kitchen.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>First floor contains two bedrooms.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Attick is currently unfinished and used as a storage.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>A part of the plot is a cultural heritage and needs to be kept as a garden, but you can make it a beautiful outside space for relaxation or al-fresco dining.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The other part of the plot is a building land, able to fit small single-level house.&nbsp;</p>', '', '1665_House-Villa_0.jpg', '1665_House-Villa_1.jpg', '1665_House-Villa_2.jpg', '1665_House-Villa_3.jpg', '1665_House-Villa_4.jpg', '1665_House-Villa_5.jpg', '1665_House-Villa_6.jpg', '1665_House-Villa_7.jpg', '1665_House-Villa_8.jpg'),
(1666, 'Zora i', 'Marko Kne¾eviæ', '', 'Zora 091 506 1711', 'knezora@gmail.com', 'Omis', 'Put Porta 88 Pisak, ZU 3160, 2514, 3964', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '180', '160', '170', 1, '239000', '', 1, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 7, 5, 'April 18, 2016', '<p>U ponudi imamo odrzavanu dvoju kucu sa fantasticnim pogledom na more i bracki kanal sa svih etaza.&nbsp;Kuca se nalazi u malom mjestu oko 15 km juzno od Omisa te je prikljucena na infrastrukturu.&nbsp;U prizemlju se nalazi velika garsonijera sa kuhinjom i kupaonicom, terasa te pomoæni prostor. Na prvom katu nalazi se dvosobni stan sa balkonom te soba sa zasebnim ulazom. Na drugom katu i u potkrovlju nalazi se dvoeta¾ni stan sa tri spavaæe sobe i dvije kupaonice te prostranim balkonom povr&scaron;ine 12 m2.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>For sale we have this well maintained semi detached house with superb sea views from all the levels.&nbsp;The property is located in a small village approximately 15 km south of Omis and is connected to all utilities.&nbsp;On the ground floor there is a large studio apartment (with kitchen and bathroom) as well as auxiliary facility. On the first floor there is a 2-bedroom apartment with balcony and a room with separate entrance. Second floor and attic are occupied by a 3-bedroom 2-bathroom duplex apartment with lovely 12 sqm balcony.&nbsp;</p>', '', '<p><strong>Prilika - dvojna kuca sa fantasticnim pogledom na more</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U ponudi imamo odrzavanu dvoju kucu sa fantasticnim pogledom na more i bracki kanal sa svih etaza.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuca se nalazi u malom mjestu oko 15 km juzno od Omisa te je prikljucena na infrastrukturu.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U prizemlju se nalazi velika garsonijera sa kuhinjom i kupaonicom, terasa te pomoæni prostor povr&scaron;ine 12 m2 sa zidanim ro&scaron;tiljem.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na prvom katu nalazi se dvosobni stan sa balkonom te soba sa zasebnim ulazom u kojoj se nalaze mala èajna kuhinja i kupaonica.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na drugom katu i u potkrovlju nalazi se dvoeta¾ni stan sa tri spavaæe sobe i dvije kupaonice te prostranim balkonom povr&scaron;ine 12 m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nekretnina nema direktan pristu automobilom, no moguæe ga je parkirati svega nekoliko stepenica od objekta (1 parkirali&scaron;no mjesto u vlasni&scaron;tvu, a jo&scaron; 1 u suvlasni&scaron;tvu).&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Do mora ima 180 metara zraène udaljenosti, dok se pje&scaron;ice do pla¾e i centra mjesta doðe za 5 minuta hoda.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nekretnina je u najmu te je razgledavanje potrebno ugovoriti unaprijed.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Vi&scaron;e informacija osobno u uredu agencije.&nbsp;</p>', '<p><strong>Great opportunity &ndash; semi detached house with spectacular sea views</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For sale we have this well maintained semi detached house with superb sea views from all the levels.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property is located in a small village approximately 15 km south of Omis and is connected to all utilities.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the ground floor there is a large studio apartment (with kitchen and bathroom) as well as auxiliary facility sized 12 sqm with the BBQ.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the first floor there is a 2-bedroom apartment with balcony and a room with separate entrance (incl. tiny kitchenette and bathroom).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Second floor and attic are occupied by a 3-bedroom 2-bathroom duplex apartment with lovely 12 sqm balcony.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property does not have direct car access, but it is possible to park the car only a few steps away from the house (1 parking place in the ownership and another in coownership).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property is 180 meters away from the sea.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It takes about 5 min walk to get to the center of the village and the beach.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property is rented and viewings must be arranged in advance.</p>', '', '1666_House-Villa_0.jpg', '1666_House-Villa_1.jpg', '1666_House-Villa_2.jpg', '1666_House-Villa_3.jpg', '1666_House-Villa_4.jpg', '1666_House-Villa_5.jpg', '1666_House-Villa_6.jpg', '1666_House-Villa_7.jpg', ''),
(1667, 'Alma doo', 'Damir Ki¹', '', '097 701 9233', 'damir.kis1@zg.t-com.hr, alma@du.t-com.hr', 'Korcula', 'Kne¾e 132 Kne¾e-Raèi¹æe, 2663/13 ko pupnat', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '120', '945', '400', 2, '1200000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 9, 4, 'April 18, 2016', '<p>Na prodaju nudimo lijepu obiteljsku kuæu na 3 eta¾e, smje&scaron;tenu u malom mjestu sa sjeverne strane otoka Korèule.&nbsp;Kuæa se sastoji od 3 stana (dvosobni, trosobni i èetverosobni), po jedan na svakom katu. Uz to, postoji i podrum te teretana.&nbsp;Nekretnina je okru¾ena mediteranskim raslinjem i nalazi se svega minutu hoda od obale te svega nekoliko minuta od restorana i trgovine.&nbsp;Iz stanova se pru¾a zadivljujuæi pogled na more.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>For sale we have this beautiful family house on 3 floors, located in a peaceful village by the sea from the northern side of Korcula island.&nbsp;The house contains 3 apartments (2, 3 and 4-bedroom units), one on each floor.&nbsp;The propery is surrounded by Mediterranean vegetation and easy walk from the coast, where there are a couple of restaurants and a grocery shop.&nbsp;It features breathtaking sea views.&nbsp;</p>', '', '<p>Na prodaju nudimo lijepu obiteljsku kuæu na 3 eta¾e, smje&scaron;tenu u malom mjestu sa sjeverne strane otoka Korèule.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa se sastoji od 3 stana (dvosobni, trosobni i èetverosobni), po jedan na svakom katu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Uz to, postoji i podrum te teretana.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Objekt ima solarno i centralno grijanje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Parcela je velika te ima dovoljno parkirali&scaron;nih mjesta.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Vlasnik ima projekt za izgradnju bazena velièine 9x5 metara.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U gradnji su kori&scaron;teni vrhunski materijali.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nekretnina je okru¾ena mediteranskim raslinjem i nalazi se svega minutu hoda od obale te svega nekoliko minuta od restorana i trgovine.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Iz stanova se pru¾a zadivljujuæi pogled na more.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>For sale we have this beautiful family house on 3 floors, located in a peaceful village by the sea from the northern side of Korcula island.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house contains 3 apartments (2, 3 and 4-bedroom units), one on each floor.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>In addition, there is a basement with utility room and gym.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There is a solar and central heating throughout the house.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The plot is large and has enough of parking place.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The owner has a project for 9x5 meters pool.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>A top quality materials were used in construction.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The propery is surrounded by Mediterranean vegetation and easy walk from the coast, where there are a couple of restaurants and a grocery shop.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It features breathtaking sea views.&nbsp;</p>', '', '1667_House-Villa_0.jpg', '1667_House-Villa_1.jpg', '1667_House-Villa_2.jpg', '1667_House-Villa_3.jpg', '1667_House-Villa_4.jpg', '1667_House-Villa_5.jpg', '1667_House-Villa_6.jpg', '1667_House-Villa_7.jpg', '1667_House-Villa_8.jpg'),
(1668, 'Alma doo', 'Damir Ki¹', '', '097 701 9233', 'damir.kis1@zg.t-com.hr, alma@du.t-com.hr', 'Korcula', 'Kne¾e 132 Kne¾e-Raèi¹æe, 2663/7 ko pupnat', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '120', '1075', '460', 2, '1100000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 12, 7, 'April 19, 2016', '<p>Na prodaju nudimo lijepu apartmansku zgradu na 3 eta¾e, smje&scaron;tenu u malom mjestu sa sjeverne strane otoka Korèule.&nbsp;Zgrada se sastoji od 8 stanova, od kojih je 7 na prodaju (jednosobni i dvosobni). Svi apartmani osim prizemnih imaju balkone.&nbsp;Parcela je velika te ima dovoljno parkirali&scaron;nih mjesta. U gradnji su kori&scaron;teni vrhunski materijali.&nbsp;Nekretnina je okru¾ena mediteranskim raslinjem i nalazi se svega minutu hoda od obale te svega nekoliko minuta od restorana i trgovine.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>For sale we have this beautiful apartment building on 3 floors, located in a peaceful village by the sea from the northern side of Korcula island.&nbsp;The building contains 8 apartments, 7 of which are for sale (1 and 2 bedroom units). All apartments have balconies, except for the ones located on the ground floor.&nbsp;The propery is surrounded by Mediterranean vegetation and easy walk from the coast, where there are a couple of restaurants and a grocery shop.&nbsp;</p>', '', '<p>Na prodaju nudimo lijepu apartmansku zgradu na 3 eta¾e, smje&scaron;tenu u malom mjestu sa sjeverne strane otoka Korèule.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Zgrada se sastoji od 8 stanova, od kojih je 7 na prodaju (jednosobni i dvosobni).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Svi apartmani osim prizemnih imaju balkone.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Parcela je velika te ima dovoljno parkirali&scaron;nih mjesta.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U gradnji su kori&scaron;teni vrhunski materijali.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nisko prizemlje, povr&scaron;ine 173 m2, klasificirano je kao poslovni prostor, no trenutno nije u finkciji.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Vlasnik je zapoceo postupak prenamjene/razdiobe prostora u dvije stambene jedinice.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U potkrovlju se nalazi dodatnih 46,70 m2 prostora (bruto podne povr&scaron;ine 181,67 m2).&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nekretnina je okru¾ena mediteranskim raslinjem i nalazi se svega minutu hoda od obale te svega nekoliko minuta od restorana i trgovine.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Iz stanova se pru¾a zadivljujuæi pogled na more.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>For sale we have this beautiful apartment building on 3 floors, located in a peaceful village by the sea from the northern side of Korcula island.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The building contains 8 apartments, 7 of which are for sale (1 and 2 bedroom units).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>All apartments have balconies, except for the ones located on the ground floor.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The plot is large and has enough of parking place.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>A top quality materials were used in construction.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Lower ground floor sized 173 m2 (classified as a commercial space) has not yet been brought to function.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The owner has initiated a separation into 2 apartments.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>In the attick there is another 46,70 m2 of the space (acctual gross size 181,67 m2).&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The propery is surrounded by Mediterranean vegetation and easy walk from the coast, where there are a couple of restaurants and a grocery shop.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It features breathtaking sea views.&nbsp;</p>', '', '1668_House-Villa_0.jpg', '1668_House-Villa_1.jpg', '1668_House-Villa_2.jpg', '1668_House-Villa_3.jpg', '1668_House-Villa_4.jpg', '1668_House-Villa_5.jpg', '1668_House-Villa_6.jpg', '1668_House-Villa_7.jpg', '1668_House-Villa_8.jpg'),
(1669, 'Zoran', 'Nedoklan', '', '098 266004', 'zoran.nedoklan@gmail.com', 'Sibenik', 'Srima', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '0', '0', '43', 1, '68000', '', 2, 1, 2, 2, 1, 2, 1, 1, 'April 19, 2016', '<p>U potpunosti ureðen apartman u novoizgraðenoj zgradi, nedaleko od mora pru¾it æe Vam izvanrednu moguænost odmora.&nbsp;Apartman je povr&scaron;ine 43 m2, a sastoji se od dnevnog boravka povezanog s kuhinjom i blagovaonicom, spavaæe sobe i kupaonice.&nbsp;S terase se pru¾a pogled na more.&nbsp;S terase se pru¾a pogled na more.&nbsp;Apartman ima svu potrebnu infrastrukturu, kao i pripadajuæe parking mjesto.</p>', '<p>We have this newly built apartment - one bedroom - in an attractive shoreside village by the sea. It is just 5 minutes walk from the sea, situated in a typical Dalmatian village close to Sibernik, and 50km from the airport at Split. The apartment has an area of 43 m2 and consists of a living room connected to the kitchen and dining room, bedroom and bathroom. It is well decorated and lovingly looked after, and comes complete with furniture, ready to move into immediately.</p>', '', '<p>U potpunosti ureðen apartman u novoizgraðenoj zgradi, nedaleko od mora pru¾it æe Vam izvanrednu moguænost odmora.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartman je povr&scaron;ine 43 m2, a sastoji se od dnevnog boravka povezanog s kuhinjom i blagovaonicom, spavaæe sobe i kupaonice.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>S terase se pru¾a pogled na more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartman ima svu potrebnu infrastrukturu, kao i pripadajuæe parking mjesto.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U blizini se nalaze lijepo ureðena pla¾a, trgovine i kafiæi.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Aerodrom je udaljen 50 km.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za dodatne informacije molimo kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured u Splitu.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>We have this newly built apartment - one bedroom - in an attractive shoreside village by the sea.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is just 5 minutes walk from the sea, situated in a typical Dalmatian village close to Sibernik, and 50 km from the airport at Split.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The apartment has an area of 43 m2 and consists of a living room connected to the kitchen and dining room, bedroom and bathroom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is well decorated and lovingly looked after, and comes complete with furniture, ready to move into immediately.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There is a balcony overlooking the sea, wide enough for family ''alfresco'' meals and to enjoy the great view.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The apartment has a private parking place.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Within a short walk are several shops and cafes, and coffee bars, and these cater very well for tourists and the resident population as well.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For further information, please contact our office in Split, and we can arrange a viewing.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>This property is excellent value, so if your looking for a bargain............</p>', '', '1669_Apartment_0.jpg', '1669_Apartment_1.jpg', '1669_Apartment_2.jpg', '1669_Apartment_3.jpg', '1669_Apartment_4.jpg', '1669_Apartment_5.jpg', '1669_Apartment_6.jpg', '1669_Apartment_7.jpg', ''),
(1670, 'Miro', 'Ba¹iæ', '', '098321482', 'm.basic2@yahoo.com', 'Trogir', 'Ribarski put &#8211; Mavar¹tica Okrug Gornji', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '300', '0', '45', 1, '85000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 1, 1, 1, 'April 20, 2016', '<p>Apartman na 3.katu (potkrovlje), kompletno namje&scaron;ten, sa prekrasnim pogledom na more i jednu od popularnijih uvala na otoku Èiovu.&nbsp;Prekrasna prirodno kamenita i mala &scaron;ljunèana pla¾a su udaljeni cca. 5 minuta pje&scaron;ke, dok je centar mjesta sa svim sadr¾ajima udaljen cca. 10 minuta pje&scaron;ke.&nbsp;Apartman je ju¾ne orijentacije, a ukupna stambena povr&scaron;ina iznosi 45,38 m2.&nbsp;Potpuno je namje&scaron;ten i u funkciji turistièkog iznajmljivanja te je kategoriziran sa 4 zvjezdice.</p>', '<p>We have this apartment on the 3rd floor (top floor), fully furnished, with a beautiful view of the sea and one of the most popular bays on Ciovo. The beautiful natural sand and shingle beach is approx. 5 minutes on foot, while the centre of the village with all the facilities located approx. 10 minutes on foot. The apartment is facing the south, and enjoys a fabulous ''sun-catching'' balcony, and the total living area is 45.38 m2.&nbsp;It is fully furnished and in function as a ''tourist apartment'' for rent and has a categorisation of 4 stars.</p>', '', '<p>*** NA ZAHTJEV &Scaron;ALJEMO VI&Scaron;E FOTOGRAFIJA&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartman na 3.katu (potkrovlje), kompletno namje&scaron;ten, sa prekrasnim pogledom na more i jednu od popularnijih uvala na otoku Èiovu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Èiovo je iz godine u godinu sve popularniji otok zbog prekrasnih pla¾a, mnogih sadr¾aja i blizine aerodroma.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Prekrasna prirodno kamenita i mala &scaron;ljunèana pla¾a su udaljeni cca. 5 minuta pje&scaron;ke, dok je centar mjesta sa svim sadr¾ajima udaljen cca. 10 minuta pje&scaron;ke.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartman je ju¾ne orijentacije, a ukupna stambena povr&scaron;ina iznosi 45,38 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sastoji se od predsoblja, dnevnog dijela sa blagovaonicom i kuhinjom, spavaæe sobe, kupaonice, wc-a i loggie sa pogledom na more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Potpuno je namje&scaron;ten i u funkciji turistièkog iznajmljivanja te je kategoriziran sa 4 zvjezdice.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ispred kuæe nalazi se zajednièki parking, dok postoji moguænost kupnje parking mjesta u velikoj gara¾i u suterenu zgrade.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Cijena parking mjesta je 5.000 &euro;.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Veæina zgrada na Èiovu nema gara¾u, stoga je ovo jo&scaron; jedna prednost nekretnine.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Svi sadr¾aji su udaljeni cca. 10 minuta pje&scaron;ke, dok je meðunarodni aerodrom 15 min. vo¾nje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ostajemo na usluzi za sva dodatna pitanja.</p>', '<p>We have this apartment on the 3rd floor (top floor), fully furnished, with a beautiful view of the sea and one of the most popular bays on Ciovo.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Every year more and more people are visiting this popular island because of the beautiful beaches, many amenities and proximity to the airport.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is the busiest of the Dalmatian islands for tourists and the only one accessible over a bridge.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The road network is being improved with a new bridge being built, but the charm of the villages on the island remain.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The beautiful natural sand and shingle beach is approx. 5 minutes on foot, while the centre of the village with all the facilities located approx. 10 minutes on foot.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The apartment is facing the south, and enjoys a fabulous ''sun-catching'' balcony, and the total living area is 45.38 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It consists of a foyer, living area, dining room and kitchen, bedroom, bathroom, toilet and wide balcony overlooking the sea.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is fully furnished and in function as a ''tourist apartment'' for rent and has a categorisation of 4 stars.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>This reflects the condition and great location of the property.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The UNESCO preserved town of Trogir is 10 minutes by car, which is hugely popular with tourists throughout the year, and will allow a good return to be obtained from using this property to rent to visitors.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house has a shared parking, and there is the possibility of purchasing a private parking space in the large garage in the basement for the price of &euro; 5,000.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Most of the buildings on Ciovo have no garage, so this is another benefit of the property.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>All the local services such as shops, bars and coffee shops etc are located approx. 10 minutes on foot, while the international airport 15 min. driving.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>We remain at your disposal for any further questions and to arrange a tour of the property.</p>', '', '1670_Apartment_0.jpg', '1670_Apartment_1.jpg', '1670_Apartment_2.jpg', '1670_Apartment_3.jpg', '', '', '', '', ''),
(1671, 'Miro', 'Ba¹iæ', '', '098321482', 'm.basic2@yahoo.com', 'Trogir', 'Ribarski put &#8211; Mavar¹tica Okrug Gornji', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '300', '0', '79', 1, '135000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 1, 2, 3, 'April 21, 2016', '<p>3-sobni apartman u jednoj od naljep&scaron;ih uvala na sve popularnijem otoku Èiovu koji je povezan mostom sa gradom Trogirom.&nbsp;U izgradnji je jo&scaron; jedna most koji æe znatno utjecati na bolju povezanost tijekom turistièke sezone.&nbsp;Apartman je smje&scaron;ten na 2.katu iz kojeg se pru¾a prekrasan pogled na more i uvalu.&nbsp;Ukupna povr&scaron;ina je 78,78 m2.&nbsp;Ishodovana je licenca za iznajmljivanje sa 4 zvjezdice, &scaron;to je jo&scaron; jedna velika pogodnost apartmana.</p>', '<p>We have this 2 bedroom apartment in one of the most beautiful bays on the increasingly popular island of Ciovo. The island is connected to the mainland by a bridge, so many tourists can enjoy the unique Dalmatian island atmosphere of tranquility and safety, but retain immediate access to the mainland at any time. The apartment is located on the 2nd floor of new building, offering beautiful views of the sea and the bay. The total area is 78,78 m2.</p>', '', '<p>*** NA ZAHTJEV &Scaron;ALJEMO VI&Scaron;E FOTOGRAFIJA</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>3- sobni apartman u jednoj od naljep&scaron;ih uvala na sve popularnijem otoku Èiovu koji je povezan mostom sa gradom Trogirom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U izgradnji je jo&scaron; jedna most koji æe znatno utjecati na bolju povezanost tijekom turistièke sezone.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartman je smje&scaron;ten na 2.katu iz kojeg se pru¾a prekrasan pogled na more i uvalu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ukupna povr&scaron;ina je 78,78 m2, a sastoji se od predsoblja, 2 spavaæe sobe, 2 kupaonice, wc-a, loggie i dnevnog dijela sa kuhinjom i blagovaonicom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Klimatiziran je i kompletno namje&scaron;ten.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Trenutno je u funkciji turistièkog iznajmljivanja, stoga je ovo idealna prilika za ulaganje s obzirom da se mo¾ete odmah nastaviti sa uhodanim poslom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ishodovana je licenca za iznajmljivanje s 4 zvjezdice, &scaron;to je jo&scaron; jedna velika pogodnost apartmana.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Zajednièka parking mjesta se nalaze ispred zgrade, dok postoji moguænost kupnje parking mjesta u gara¾i u suterenu zgrade.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Cijena je 5.000 &euro;.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Do centra mjesta je potrebno cca. 10 minuta pje&scaron;ke, a do grada Trogira 10 minuta vo¾nje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U blizini je i meðunarodni aerodrom &scaron;to ovaj otok èini jo&scaron; boljom destinacijom za kupnju nekretnine.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ostajemo na usluzi za sva dodatna pitanja.</p>', '<p>We have this 2 bedroom apartment in one of the most beautiful bays on the increasingly popular island of Ciovo.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The island is connected to the mainland by a bridge, so many tourists can enjoy the unique Dalmatian island atmosphere of tranquility and safety, but retain immediate access to the mainland at any time.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>A second bridge is being built to ensure this ''anytime convenience'' which will allow Ciovo to continue to be the No 1 of Croatia''s island destinations.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The apartment is located on the 2nd floor of new building, offering beautiful views of the sea and the bay.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The total area is 78,78 m2 and consists of hallway, 2 bedrooms, 2 bathrooms, a toilet, a balcony and a living room with kitchen and dining room.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is air conditioned and fully furnished.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is currently being used for tourist renting, so this is an ideal investment opportunity as it can immediately continue with the established business.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The owners have obtained a license for rent with ''4 stars'', which reflects on its condition and location.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Common parking spaces are located outside the building, while there is a possibility of purchasing private parking spaces in a garage in the basement for the price of &euro; 5,000.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The village centre is around 10 minutes on foot, and the town of Trogir, a 10 minute drive.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The village has many options of shops, cafes, bars and other useful services such as the Dr''s, pharma, a market and bakery.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is mostly open throughout the year, not just in the tourist season.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nearby is the international airport (20 minutes drive) which makes this island even better destination for the purchase of real estate.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>We remain at your disposal for any further questions, and to arrange a tour of the property.</p>', '', '1671_Apartment_0.jpg', '1671_Apartment_1.jpg', '1671_Apartment_2.jpg', '1671_Apartment_3.jpg', '1671_Apartment_4.jpg', '1671_Apartment_5.jpg', '1671_Apartment_6.jpg', '1671_Apartment_7.jpg', '1671_Apartment_8.jpg'),
(1672, 'Ivica', 'Eteroviæ', '', '095 568 8606', 'eterovicpipo@gmail.com', 'Brac', 'Pucisca, 1066/3, 1066/5 ko pucisca', 'For sale', 'Land plot', '1300', '22582', '0', 1, '142492', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 0, 0, 'April 21, 2016', '<p>Na prodaju nudimo poljoprivredno zemlji&scaron;te smje&scaron;teno oko 3 km od Puèi&scaron;æa na otoku Braèu. Na zemlji&scaron;tu se nalazi 70 stabala maslina te gospodarski objekt povr&scaron;ine 96 m2 (u postupku legalizacije).</p>', '<p>For sale we have this agricultural land, located approximately 3 km from Pucisca village on Brac island.&nbsp;There is a commercial facility on the land, sized 96 sqm (in the legalization process) and 70 olive trees.</p>', '', '<p><strong>Poljoprivredno zemlji&scaron;te na prodaju</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na prodaju nudimo poljoprivredno zemlji&scaron;te smje&scaron;teno oko 3 km od Puèi&scaron;æa na otoku Braèu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na zemlji&scaron;tu se nalazi 70 stabala maslina te gospodarski objekt povr&scaron;ine 96 m2 (u postupku legalizacije).</p>', '<p><strong>Agricultural land for sale</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For sale we have this agricultural land, located approximately 3 km from Pucisca village on Brac island.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There is a commercial facility on the land, sized 96 sqm (in the legalization process) and 70 olive trees.</p>', '', '1672_Land-plot_0.jpg', '1672_Land-plot_1.jpg', '1672_Land-plot_2.jpg', '1672_Land-plot_3.jpg', '1672_Land-plot_4.jpg', '1672_Land-plot_5.jpg', '1672_Land-plot_6.jpg', '1672_Land-plot_7.jpg', '1672_Land-plot_8.jpg'),
(1673, 'Dream Croatia', 'Savills', 'Nata¹a Elakoviæ 091 185 7237', '', 'natasa@dreamcroatia.com', 'Peljesac', 'Orebiæ, Pelje¹ac', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '800', '110', '100', 1, '115000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 4, 2, 'April 21, 2016', '<p>Na prodaju nudimo dvojnu kuæu u malom gradu na Pelje&scaron;cu.&nbsp;Kuæa je dovr&scaron;ena sredinom 80ih godina i ima 3 eta¾e.&nbsp;Prizemlje: otovreni prostor dnevnog boravka, blagovaonice i kuhinje te kupaonica.&nbsp;Prvi kat i potkrovlje: 2 spavaæe sobe i kupaonica na svakoj eta¾i.&nbsp;Vanjska terasa sa ro&scaron;tiljem, parking za 2 auta i ostava.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>For sale we have this semi-detached house in a lovely little town on Peljesac peninsula.&nbsp;The house was completed in mid 80s and spreads over 3 floors.&nbsp;Ground floor contains all-in-one living room/dining room/kitchen and bathroom.&nbsp;First floor and attick: 2 bedrooms and bathroom on each floor.&nbsp;Outdoor terrace with BBQ, parking for 2 cars and storage space.&nbsp;</p>', '', '<p><strong>Dvojna kuæa na Pelje&scaron;cu</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na prodaju nudimo dvojnu kuæu u malom gradu na Pelje&scaron;cu.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je dovr&scaron;ena sredinom 80ih godina i ima 3 eta¾e.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Prizemlje: otovreni prostor dnevnog boravka, blagovaonice i kuhinje te kupaonica.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Prvi kat i potkrovlje: 2 spavaæe sobe i kupaonica na svakoj eta¾i.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Vanjska terasa sa ro&scaron;tiljem, parking za 2 auta i ostava.&nbsp;</p>', '<p><strong>Semi-detached house for sale on Peljesac</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For sale we have this semi-detached house in a lovely little town on Peljesac peninsula.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house was completed in mid 80s and spreads over 3 floors.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ground floor contains all-in-one living room/dining room/kitchen and bathroom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>First floor and attick: 2 bedrooms and bathroom on each floor.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Outdoor terrace with BBQ, parking for 2 cars and storage space.&nbsp;</p>', '', '1673_House-Villa_0.jpg', '1673_House-Villa_1.jpg', '1673_House-Villa_2.jpg', '1673_House-Villa_3.jpg', '1673_House-Villa_4.jpg', '1673_House-Villa_5.jpg', '1673_House-Villa_6.jpg', '1673_House-Villa_7.jpg', '1673_House-Villa_8.jpg'),
(1674, 'Raiæ', 'Dragan', '', '095 5251137', 'gugalah123@gmail.com', 'Split', 'Omiska 47 Split, k.è.8360  z.u. 5683', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '500', '0', '73', 1, '155000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 3, 1, 'April 21, 2016', '<p>Osunèan i prozraèan apartman u Splitu na odliènoj lokaciji, nekoliko minuta od Baèvica.&nbsp;Apartman se nalazi u visokom prizemlju kuæe okru¾ene zelenilom.&nbsp;Sastoji se od tri spavaæe sobe, kuhinje s blagovaonicom i kupaonice ukupne stambene povr&scaron;ine 73 m2.&nbsp;Apartman je veoma osunèan, ima visoke stropove, a iz spavaæih soba se pru¾a pogled na zelenilo ispred zgrade.&nbsp;Moguæa je preinaka u dva zasebna apartmana.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>We have this spacious, sunny and airy apartment in Split in a great location, a short walk away from all the tourist attractions in the town centre. The apartment is located on the ground floor of a typical ''art deco'' house built about 100 - 120 years ago and surrounded by established Mediterranean trees and shrubs. It consists of three bedrooms, kitchen, dining room and bathroom with a total floor area of 73 m2. It has the potential to be modified to become two separate dwellings.</p>', '', '<p>Osunèan i prozraèan apartman u Splitu na odliènoj lokaciji, nekoliko minuta od Baèvica.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartman se nalazi u visokom prizemlju kuæe okru¾ene zelenilom.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sastoji se od tri spavaæe sobe, kuhinje s blagovaonicom i kupaonice ukupne stambene povr&scaron;ine 73 m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartmanu pripada i ostava u prizemlju te jo&scaron; jedna dodatna ostava u vrtu.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartman je veoma osunèan, ima visoke stropove, a iz spavaæih soba se pru¾a pogled na zelenilo ispred zgrade.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Moguæa je preinaka u dva zasebna apartmana.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Centar grada i kupali&scaron;te Baèvice gdje su mnogobrojni restorani i kafiæi je udaljen samo 5 minuta hoda, pa je stan prikladan i za turistièki najam.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Centar Splita je iz godine u godinu sve popularnije turistièko odredi&scaron;te, te je ovaj apartman idealan za iznajmljivanje, ali i za vlastito u¾ivanje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Meðunarodni aerodrom udaljen je 30 min. vo¾nje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za sve dodatne informacije slobodno nas kontaktirajte.</p>', '<p>We have this spacious, sunny and airy apartment in Split in a great location, a short walk away from all the tourist attractions in the town centre.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The apartment is located on the ground floor of a typical ''art deco'' house built about 100 - 120 years ago and surrounded by established Mediterranean trees and shrubs.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It consists of three bedrooms, kitchen, dining room and bathroom with a total floor area of 73 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>This apartment has a storage room on the ground floor and another extra storage room in the garden.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>This property is very spacious, and was built with large rooms and high ceilings, and from the bedrooms, it offers views of the countryside outside the building.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It has the potential to be modified to become two separate dwellings.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The Town centre and town beach ''Bacvice'', where thee are many restaurants and bars is just 5 minutes walk, and the flat is in a very suitable location for tourist rentals.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The centre of Split has become a more and more popular tourist destination, and this apartment is ideal for rental or for your own enjoyment.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The international airport is 30 minutes driving.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For further information please contact our office in Split.</p>', '', '1674_Apartment_0.jpg', '1674_Apartment_1.jpg', '1674_Apartment_2.jpg', '1674_Apartment_3.jpg', '1674_Apartment_4.jpg', '1674_Apartment_5.jpg', '1674_Apartment_6.jpg', '1674_Apartment_7.jpg', '1674_Apartment_8.jpg'),
(1675, 'Veronika i Ivic', 'Kalebiæ', 'Richella kæer 091/604-8400', '098/976-5617', '', 'Split', 'Plinarska 81  Split, Z.U. 4754  K.è. 11283/1', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '500', '0', '110', 1, '450000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 4, 4, 'April 21, 2016', '<p>&Scaron;armantni apartmani s pogledom na Varo&scaron; nalaze se u starom dijelu grada Splita i u¾ivaju lagan pristup cjelogodi&scaron;njim sadr¾ajima. Apartmani se veæ du¾e vrijeme unajmljuje turistima i buduæem vlasniku osiguravaju znaèajan prihod. Ova 4 studio apartmana imaju ukupnu stambenu povr&scaron;inu 110 m2, a nalaze se na drugom katu kuæe. Kategorizirani su sa 4*, te kvalitetno opremljeni i ureðeni s ukusom.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>We are offering these charming apartments, overlooking one of the oldest districts in Split, which have easy access to year-round amenities. The apartments have been used for a long time rent to tourists and the future owner is ensured a significant and growing income, as the tourist season is extended longer and longer.&nbsp;The 4 studio apartments have a total surface of 110 m2, and are situated on the second floor. They are categorized with 4 * and well equipped and maintained and have been nicely decorated.</p>', '', '<p>&Scaron;armantni apartmani s pogledom na Varo&scaron; nalaze se u starom dijelu grada Splita i u¾ivaju lagan pristup cjelogodi&scaron;njim sadr¾ajima (restoranima, kafiæima, muzejima, javnom prijevozu, i pla¾ama) &scaron;to ih èini atraktivnim za turistièki najam.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartmani se veæ du¾e vrijeme unajmljuje turistima i buduæem vlasniku osiguravaju znaèajan prihod.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Blizina Park &scaron;ume Marjan s jedne strane i centra grada s druge strane sa svim pripadajuæim sadr¾ajima èine ove apartmane interesantnim onima koji ¾ele biti dio ¾ivopisne atmosfere ovog prekrasnog mediteranskog grada.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ova 4 studio apartmana imaju ukupnu stambenu povr&scaron;inu 110 m2, a nalaze se na drugom katu kuæe.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kategorizirani su sa 4*, te kvalitetno opremljeni i ureðeni s ukusom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Klimatizirani su, imaju odvojena mjerila i opremljene kuhinje, a sav namje&scaron;taj ulazi u cijenu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Orijentacija jug &ndash; sjever.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Postoji moguænost nadogradnje balkona.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Parking u neposrednoj blizini.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za dodatne informacije molimo kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured u Splitu.</p>', '<p>We are offering these charming apartments, overlooking one of the oldest districts in Split, which have easy access to year-round amenities (restaurants, cafes, museums, public transport, and beaches), which makes them an attractive investment for tourist rentals.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The apartments have been used for a long time rent to tourists and the future owner is ensured a significant and growing income, as the tourist season is extended longer and longer.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Being close to Marjan Forest Park on one side, with outdoor activities such as climbing, the beaches, canoeing and the historic Roman city centre on the other side, they are obviously very interesting to tourists who want to be part of the lively atmosphere of this Mediterranean town.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The 4 studio apartments have a total surface of 110 m2, and are situated on the second floor.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>They are categorized with 4 * and well equipped and maintained and have been nicely decorated.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>They have air condition/heating, separate bathrooms and well equipped kitchen.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please note - all the furniture is included in the price.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Orientation south - north.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There are other improvements that could be made, such as the option of upgrading the balcony.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There is ''on road'' parking in the immediate vicinity, and car parks nearby.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For further information, please contact our office in Split.</p>', '', '1675_Apartment_0.jpg', '1675_Apartment_1.jpg', '1675_Apartment_2.jpg', '1675_Apartment_3.jpg', '1675_Apartment_4.jpg', '1675_Apartment_5.jpg', '1675_Apartment_6.jpg', '1675_Apartment_7.jpg', '1675_Apartment_8.jpg'),
(1676, 'Albert', '©alov', '021/396-122 ', '095/111-1444', '', 'Split', 'Sinovèiæa 2 Split, z.u. 9143  k.è. 11005/1', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '120', '0', '160', 1, '380000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 4, 3, 'April 22, 2016', '<p>Prostran dvoeta¾an apartman na izvrsnoj lokaciji s pogledom na Rivu, Marjan i Varo&scaron;!&nbsp;Stan se prostire preko 3. i 4. eta¾e (ujedno potkrovlja).&nbsp;Veoma je osunèan i prozraèan te orijentiran na 3 strane.&nbsp;Sastoji se od dva spojena apartmana koji se mogu vratiti u prvobitno stanje &scaron;to novom vlasniku omoguæuje pretvaranje u dvije ili tri zasebne jedinice.&nbsp;Ukupna stambena povr&scaron;ina apartmana iznosi cca 160 m2.&nbsp;Unatoè svojoj lokaciji, apartman je izoliran od gradske buke, &scaron;to pru¾a osjeæaj mira i opu&scaron;tenosti.</p>', '<p>We have this spacious apartment in an excellent location overlooking the waterfront, just off the Riva in Split. The apartment is spread over 3 and 4 floors with a loft. Total living area of the apartment is approximately 160 m2. It is very sunny and airy, with views on three sides. It consists of two connected apartments that can returned to the original plan, or if the new owner wishes, can be &nbsp;converted into three separate units. Despite central location, the apartment is isolated from the noise, with barely any traffic and this gives a lovely sense of calm and relaxation.</p>', '', '<p><strong>Prostran dvoeta¾an apartman na izvrsnoj lokaciji s pogledom na Rivu, Marjan i Varo&scaron;!</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Stan se prostire preko 3. i 4. eta¾e (ujedno potkrovlja).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Veoma je osunèan i prozraèan te orijentiran na 3 strane.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sastoji se od dva spojena apartmana koji se mogu vratiti u prvobitno stanje &scaron;to novom vlasniku omoguæuje pretvaranje u dvije ili tri zasebne jedinice.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartman na treæem katu sastoji se od dnevnog boravka, kuhinje s blagovaonicom koja ima izlaz na balkon te kupaonice.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Unutarnje stepeni&scaron;te vodi u apartman na gornjoj eta¾i u kojem su smje&scaron;tene dvije spavaæe sobe, kupaonica, kuhinja te prostran i osunèan dnevni boravak koji ima pogled na Marjan i stari dio grada.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Tu se nalazi i stepeni&scaron;te koje vodi u dio stana s dodatne dvije spavaæe sobe, kupaonicom i ostavom.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ukupna stambena povr&scaron;ina apartmana iznosi cca 160 m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Unatoè svojoj lokaciji, apartman je izoliran od gradske buke, &scaron;to pru¾a osjeæaj mira i opu&scaron;tenosti. &nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nekretnina je u odliènom stanju, spremna za useljenje , a uz manju adaptaciju mo¾e buduæem vlasniku pru¾iti dobar prihod od turistièkog najma.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Preporuèujemo pogledati svakome tko tra¾i stan u strogom centru Splita.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Dodatne fotografije &scaron;aljemo na zahtjev.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za sve informacije molimo kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured u Splitu.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>We have this spacious apartment in an excellent location overlooking the waterfront, just off the Riva in Split.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The apartment is spread over 3 and 4 floors with a loft.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Total living area of the apartment is approximately 160 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is very sunny and airy, with views on three sides.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It consists of two connected apartments that can returned to the original plan, or if the new owner wishes, can be &nbsp;converted into three separate units.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The apartment on the third floor consists of a living room, kitchen and dining room which has a balcony and a bathroom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The internal staircase leads to the apartment on the upper floor where there are two bedrooms, bathroom, kitchen and a spacious and sunny living room with a view of Marjan and the old city.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There is also a staircase leading to the loft with two bedrooms, bathroom and storage.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Despite central location, the apartment is isolated from the noise, with barely any traffic, as most roads are ''pedestrian only'' and this gives a lovely sense of calm and relaxation.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property is in excellent condition, ready to move into, and with minor adaptation to the new owner may provide a good income from the tourist rental.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>We recommend an early look by anyone looking for an apartment in the centre of Split.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>We have further photographs by request.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For further information please contact our staff in Split.</p>', '', '1676_Apartment_0.jpg', '1676_Apartment_1.jpg', '1676_Apartment_2.jpg', '1676_Apartment_3.jpg', '1676_Apartment_4.jpg', '1676_Apartment_5.jpg', '1676_Apartment_6.jpg', '1676_Apartment_7.jpg', '1676_Apartment_8.jpg');
INSERT INTO `nekretnina` (`id`, `ime`, `prezime`, `telefon`, `mobitel`, `e_mail`, `lokacija_id`, `adresa`, `status_id`, `vrsta_id`, `udaljenost`, `povrsina`, `stambenapovrsina`, `display`, `cijena`, `cijenatocka`, `ponuda_tjedna`, `new_built`, `must_sell`, `prvi_red_do_mora`, `pogled_na_more`, `bazen`, `broj_soba`, `broj_kupatila`, `datum`, `title_hr`, `title_en`, `title_ge`, `opis_hr`, `opis_en`, `opis_ge`, `PropertyImageURL0`, `PropertyImageURL1`, `PropertyImageURL2`, `PropertyImageURL3`, `PropertyImageURL4`, `PropertyImageURL5`, `PropertyImageURL6`, `PropertyImageURL7`, `PropertyImageURL8`) VALUES
(1677, 'Miro', 'Ba¹iæ', '', '098321482', 'm.basic2@yahoo.com', 'Trogir', 'Ribarski put &#8211; Mavar¹tica Okrug Gornji', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '300', '0', '75', 1, '130000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 1, 2, 3, 'April 22, 2016', '<p>Apartman smje&scaron;ten u jednoj od popularnijih uvala na Èiovu, u blizini prirodno kamenite i &scaron;ljunèane pla¾e.&nbsp;Iako se nalazi u visokom prizemlju iz apartmana se pru¾a pogled na more. U zajednièkom dvori&scaron;tu se nalazi zajednièki bazen, dok se ispred nalazi zajednièki parking.&nbsp;U suterenu zgrade je podzemna gara¾a gdje se mo¾e kupiti parking mjesto po cijeni od 5.000 &euro;.&nbsp;Ukupna stambena povr&scaron;ina iznosi 75,37 m2.</p>', '<p>We have this apartment located in one of the most popular bays on Ciovo, near the natural stone and pebble beaches. Although it is located on the ground floor it has long sea views from a balcony due to the sloping geography of the shore. In front of the building there is a shared swimming pool and sunning area, while the property also has a private car park off the road. In the basement has an underground garage where you can buy a parking space at a cost of &euro; 5,000. Total area is 75.37 m2.</p>', '', '<p>*** NA ZAHTJEV &Scaron;ALJEMO VI&Scaron;E FOTOGRAFIJA</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartman smje&scaron;ten u jednoj od popularnijih uvala na Èiovu, u blizini prirodno kamenite i &scaron;ljunèane pla¾e.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Iako se nalazi u visokom prizemlju iz apartmana se pru¾a pogled na more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U zajednièkom dvori&scaron;tu se nalazi zajednièki bazen, dok se ispred nalazi zajednièki parking.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U suterenu zgrade je podzemna gara¾a gdje se mo¾e kupiti parking mjesto po cijeni od 5.000 &euro;.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ukupna stambena povr&scaron;ina iznosi 75,37 m2, a sastoji se od predsoblja, 2 spavaæe sobe, 2 kupaonice, wc-a, 2 loggie i dnevnog dijela sa kuhinjom i blagovaonicom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Potpuno je namje&scaron;ten i klimatiziran i licenciran za turistièko iznajmljivanje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ishodovana licenca ima 4 zvjezdice.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Centar mjesta udaljen je cca. 10-15 minuta pje&scaron;ke dok je do meðunarodnog aerodroma potrebno 15 minuta vo¾nje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U centru mjesta se nalaze svi potrebni sadr¾aji, dok je u blizini velika &scaron;ljunèana pla¾a sa mnogobrojnim barovima.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Èiovo je povezano mostom sa gradom Trogirom, a u izgradnji jo&scaron; jedan most koji æe znatno utjecati na jo&scaron; bolju povezanost.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>30 minuta od Trogira se nalazi grad Split koji je trentno jedna od popularnijih turistièkih destinacija.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ostajemo na usluzi za sva dodatna pitanja.</p>', '<p>We have this apartment located in one of the most popular bays on Ciovo, near the natural stone and pebble beaches.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Although it is located on the ground floor it has long sea views from a balcony due to the sloping geography of the shore.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>In front of the building there is a shared swimming pool and sunning area, while the property also has a private car park off the road.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>In the basement has an underground garage where you can buy a parking space at a cost of &euro; 5,000.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Total area is 75.37 m2 and consists of hallway, 2 bedrooms, 2 bathrooms, toilets, 2 balconies and a living area with kitchen.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>To enter the apartment you need to pass through the foyer of the building which is spacious, airy and built with luxurious materials.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is fully furnished and air conditioned and has a 4-star licence for tourist rentals.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It has been well cared for and decorated to a high standard.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is ready for immediate living, or renting.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The village centre is approx. 10-15 minutes on foot and has shops, bars, cafes and many other useful services while the international airport takes 15 minutes by car.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ciovo is connected by bridge to the city of Trogir and the construction of a second bridge and extra road infrastructure will significantly improve the connection to the mainland.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property is 30 min from Split, the largest town and transport hub for the region.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact our agents for more information and to arrange to visit the property.</p>', '', '1677_Apartment_0.JPG', '1677_Apartment_1.JPG', '1677_Apartment_2.JPG', '1677_Apartment_3.JPG', '1677_Apartment_4.JPG', '1677_Apartment_5.JPG', '1677_Apartment_6.JPG', '1677_Apartment_7.JPG', '1677_Apartment_8.JPG'),
(1678, 'Anðelka ', 'Biliskov', '', 'Anðelka 091/543-7826', '', 'Split', 'Rooseweltova 18, Split', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '250', '0', '46', 1, '107000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 1, 'April 25, 2016', '<p>Apartman u blizini Baèvica, na mirnoj lokaciji, svega par minuta &scaron;etnje do pla¾e.&nbsp;Apartman je smje&scaron;ten u prizemlju zgrade, samo 250 m od mora, u blizini svih sadr¾aja.&nbsp;Ima povr&scaron;inu 46 m2, a sastoji se od spavaæe sobe, dnevnog boravka, kuhinje s blagovaonicom i kupaonice.&nbsp;U cijenu je ukljuèeno i parking mjesto povr&scaron;ine 14,20 m2, a vlasniku pripada i dio vrta.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>We have this great value apartment close to all the tourist attractions and the old town centre in a quiet location, just a few minutes'' walk to the beach. It is located on the ground floor of a modern and very presentable block only 250 m from the sea, and many shops and services. It has a living area of 46 m2 and consists of a bedroom, living room, kitchen, dining room and bathrooms. The price includes a parking space of 14.20 m2, and the owner has a part of the garden.</p>', '', '<p>Apartman u blizini Baèvica, na mirnoj lokaciji, svega par minuta &scaron;etnje do pla¾e.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartman je smje&scaron;ten u prizemlju zgrade, samo 250 m od mora, u blizini svih sadr¾aja.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ima povr&scaron;inu 46 m2, a sastoji se od spavaæe sobe, dnevnog boravka, kuhinje s blagovaonicom i kupaonice.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U cijenu je ukljuèeno i parking mjesto povr&scaron;ine 14,20 m2, a vlasniku pripada i dio vrta.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Vlasni&scaron;tvo uredno.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Meðunarodni aerodrom udaljen je 40 min. vo¾nje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za dodatne informacije molimo kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured u Splitu.</p>', '<p>We have this great value apartment close to all the tourist attractions and the old town centre in a quiet location, just a few minutes'' walk to the beach.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is located on the ground floor of a modern and very presentable block only 250 m from the sea, and many shops and services.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It has a living area of 46 m2 and consists of a bedroom, living room, kitchen, dining room and bathrooms.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The price includes a parking space of 14.20 m2, and the owner has a part of the garden, which is partially laid to lawn, and an area which is fruit trees and herbs.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The international airport is 40 minutes driving.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For further information, please contact our office in Split and arrange to visit it soon.</p>', '', '1678_Apartment_0.JPG', '1678_Apartment_1.JPG', '1678_Apartment_2.JPG', '1678_Apartment_3.JPG', '1678_Apartment_4.jpg', '1678_Apartment_5.jpg', '1678_Apartment_6.jpg', '1678_Apartment_7.jpg', '1678_Apartment_8.jpg'),
(1679, 'SURADNJA', 'Boris Tomiæ', '', '095 525 0026', 'tomic_boris@hotmail.com', 'Brac', 'Milna, Brac', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '70', '0', '39', 1, '108000', '', 2, 2, 2, 1, 1, 2, 1, 1, 'April 27, 2016', '<p>U ponudi imamo jednosoban apartman povr&scaron;ine 39 m2 na prvom katu stambene zgrade. Stan ima loðu povr&scaron;ine 10 m2 sa otvorenim pogledom na more. U cijelosti je namje&scaron;ten, a ima i parkirali&scaron;no mjesto te moguænost kori&scaron;tenja zajednièkog bazena.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>We have this 1-bedroom apartment in offer, sized 39 sqm, located on the 1st floor.&nbsp;Apartment has 10 sqm loggia with open sea views. The property is fully furnished. It comes with the parking place and the use of communal pool.&nbsp;</p>', '', '<p>U ponudi imamo jednosoban apartman povr&scaron;ine 39 m2 na prvom katu stambene zgrade.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Stan ima loðu povr&scaron;ine 10 m2 sa otvorenim pogledom na more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U cijelosti je namje&scaron;ten, a ima i parkirali&scaron;no mjesto te moguænost kori&scaron;tenja zajednièkog bazena.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za sve dodatne informacije molimo kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured u Splitu.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>We have this 1-bedroom apartment in offer, sized 39 sqm, located on the 1st floor.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartment has 10 sqm loggia with open sea views.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property is fully furnished.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It comes with the parking place and the use of communal pool.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For furher information, please contact our office in Split.&nbsp;</p>', '', '1679_Apartment_0.jpg', '1679_Apartment_1.jpg', '1679_Apartment_2.jpg', '1679_Apartment_3.jpg', '', '', '', '', ''),
(1680, 'Para Lux doo', 'Maya Lindy ', '0035635505171', 'Sabine asf.q@mail.com', 'grafikaccount@gmail.com', 'Hvar', 'Vrisnik', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '3000', '368', '128', 1, '170000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 0, 0, 'April 27, 2016', '<p>Na prodaju nudimo kuæu na dvije eta¾e, smje&scaron;tenu u malom &scaron;armantnom selu u unutra&scaron;njosti otoka Hvara.&nbsp;Kuæa ima 64 m2 tlocrtno, ali su renovacijski radovi veæ zapoèeti te je njima tlocrtna povr&scaron;ina pro&scaron;irena na 105 m2. U konaènici, kuæa bi imala ukupno oko 210 m2 korisne povr&scaron;ine, kao &scaron;to je prikazano na tlocrtima.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>For sale we have this house on two floors located in a charming inland village on Hvar island.&nbsp;The house has 64 sqm in footprint, but the renovation works have already commenced, extending the footprint size to 105 sqm. Once renovated, the house would have about 210 sqm internally in total, as shown in the footprints.&nbsp;</p>', '', '<p>Cijena sni¾ena sa 185.000 EUR na 170.000 EUR</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na prodaju nudimo kuæu na dvije eta¾e, smje&scaron;tenu u malom &scaron;armantnom selu u unutra&scaron;njosti otoka Hvara.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa ima 64 m2 tlocrtno, ali su renovacijski radovi veæ zapoèeti te je njima tlocrtna povr&scaron;ina pro&scaron;irena na 105 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U konaènici, kuæa bi imala ukupno oko 210 m2 korisne povr&scaron;ine, kao &scaron;to je prikazano na tlocrtima.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Èestica dvori&scaron;ta (304 m2) je u suvlasni&scaron;tvu prodavatelja, a ima dovoljno mjesta za gradnju bazena.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sa kuæe se pru¾a lijepi pogled na mjesto i okolna brda.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Cijena se odnosi na trenutno stanje objekta.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Prodavatelj kupcu nudi moguænost zavr&scaron;etka graðevinskih radova.</p>', '<p>Price reduced from 185.000 EUR to 170.000 EUR</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For sale we have this house on two floors located in a charming inland village on Hvar island.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house has 64 sqm in footprint, but the renovation works have already commenced, extending the footprint size to 105 sqm.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Once renovated, the house would have about 210 sqm internally in total, as shown in the footprints.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Garden plot (304 sqm) is co-owned and it has enough space to fit the pool.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property features lovely views over the village and nearby hills.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The price refers to current state.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>However, the seller offers the possibility to perform the renovation works until the end at extra cost.&nbsp;</p>', '', '1680_House-Villa_0.jpg', '1680_House-Villa_1.jpg', '1680_House-Villa_2.jpg', '1680_House-Villa_3.jpg', '1680_House-Villa_4.jpg', '1680_House-Villa_5.jpg', '1680_House-Villa_6.jpg', '1680_House-Villa_7.jpg', '1680_House-Villa_8.jpg'),
(1681, 'Du¹ka', 'Stra¹ek ', '', '0917275050', 'dali@adriaticestates.com', 'Dubrovnik', 'Kremena, Raba', 'For sale', 'Old stone house', '1500', '355', '290', 1, '195000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 3, 3, 'April 27, 2016', '<p>Na prodaju nudimo lijepu kamenu kuæu smje&scaron;tenu u malom mjestu oko 10 km ju¾no od Opuzen i isto toliko udaljenu od Neuma.&nbsp;Nekretnina je udaljena oko 2 km od mora i ima lijepi pogled na Pelje&scaron;ac i more. Renovirana je 2011. godine te je u dobrom stanju i useljiva.&nbsp;Ukupna povr&scaron;ina kuæe je 290 m2 bruto.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>For sale we have this beautiful family home set in a small village 10 km south <span lang="EN-GB"> of Opuzen on route to Ston &ndash; Dubrovnik</span>.&nbsp;The property is 2 km way from the sea and features lovely views on Peljesac and the sea. It was fully renovated in 2011 and in ready-to move condition.&nbsp;The total size of the house is 290 sqm gross.&nbsp;</p>', '', '<p>Na prodaju nudimo lijepu kamenu kuæu smje&scaron;tenu u malom mjestu oko 10 km ju¾no od Ploèa i isto toliko udaljenu od Neuma.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nekretnina je udaljena oko 2 km od mora i ima lijepi pogled na Pelje&scaron;ac i more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Renovirana je 2011. godine te je u dobrom stanju i useljiva.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ukupna povr&scaron;ina kuæe je 290 m2 bruto.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Pored glavne kuæe nalazi se pomoæna zgrada, trenutno u funkciji gostinjskog apartmana.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na parceli se nalazi parking za 3 automobila.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Vrt je odr¾avan, zasaðen sa stablima maslina i smokvi.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Vlasnik ima i privez za brod du¾ine do 9 metara.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Cijena ne ukljuèuje namje&scaron;taj.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>For sale we have this beautiful family home set in a small village 10 km south&nbsp;<span lang="EN-GB">of Opuzen on route to Ston &ndash; Dubrovnik.</span></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property is 2 km way from the sea and features lovely views on Peljesac and the sea.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It was fully renovated in 2011 and in ready-to-move condition.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The total size of the house is 290 sqm gross.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><span lang="EN-GB">The additional outbuilding is currently used as a guest apartment.</span></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The plot features parking for 3 cars.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Garden is well kept and planted with fig and olive trees.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The owner has mooring space for boat up to 9 meters in length.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The price excludes <span lang="EN-GB">some antique furniture and oil paintings.</span>&nbsp;</p>', '', '1681_Old-stone-house_0.jpg', '1681_Old-stone-house_1.JPG', '1681_Old-stone-house_2.jpg', '1681_Old-stone-house_3.jpg', '1681_Old-stone-house_4.JPG', '1681_Old-stone-house_5.JPG', '1681_Old-stone-house_6.jpg', '1681_Old-stone-house_7.JPG', '1681_Old-stone-house_8.jpg'),
(1682, 'Kate Potts ', 'James Harvey', '0044 7976 731775', '', 'katepotts72@gmail.com', 'Hvar', 'Susjeda koja je mater od Benka, managera PBZ-a u Jelsi', 'For sale', 'Old stone house', '3000', '153', '100', 1, '65000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 0, 0, 'April 27, 2016', '<p>Na prodaju nudimo kamenu kuæu u malom selu u unutra&scaron;njosti otoka Hvara, oko 3 km od mora i Jelse.&nbsp;Kuæa se prote¾e kroz dvije eta¾e i potrebna joj je renovacija. Zbog toga je prodavatelj istaknuo vrlo kompetitivnu cijenu nekretnine.&nbsp;Mjesto ima osnovne sadr¾aje, dovoljne za ugodno ljetovanje.&nbsp;Nekretnina ima pogled na more u daljini.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>For sale we have this charming stone house set in a lovely inland village on Hvar island, just 3 km from the sea and the town of Jelsa.&nbsp;The house spreads over 2 floors and is in a need of renovation, hence very competitive price.&nbsp;The village has basic amenities, sufficient for comfortable vacation in the season.&nbsp;There are distant sea views from the property.&nbsp;If you are looking for a bargain stone house, this is a chance to get an excellent deal.&nbsp;</p>', '', '<p>Na prodaju nudimo kamenu kuæu u malom selu u unutra&scaron;njosti otoka Hvara, oko 3 km od mora i Jelse.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa se prote¾e kroz dvije eta¾e i potrebna joj je renovacija.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Zbog toga je prodavatelj istaknuo vrlo kompetitivnu cijenu nekretnine.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Mjesto ima osnovne sadr¾aje, dovoljne za ugodno ljetovanje.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nekretnina ima pogled na more u daljini.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>For sale we have this charming stone house set in a lovely inland village on Hvar island, just 3 km from the sea and the town of Jelsa.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house spreads over 2 floors and is in a need of renovation, hence very competitive price.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The village has basic amenities, sufficient for comfortable vacation in the season.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There are distant sea views from the property.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>If you are looking for a bargain stone house, this is a chance to get an excellent deal.&nbsp;</p>', '', '1682_Old-stone-house_0.jpg', '1682_Old-stone-house_1.jpg', '1682_Old-stone-house_2.jpg', '1682_Old-stone-house_3.jpg', '1682_Old-stone-house_4.jpg', '', '', '', ''),
(1683, '', 'Salvezani', '021/890-902', '091/883-6911   ', 'salvezani@pirouette.hr', 'Split', 'Domninisova 10  Split, k.è. 12644  z.u. 7432', 'For sale', 'Old stone house', '200', '0', '110', 2, '500000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 3, 3, 'May 3, 2016', '<p>&Scaron;armantna stara kamena kuæa u Palaèi koja se sastoji od 3 apartmana.&nbsp;Kuæa je kompletno renovirana i ureðena, a sama lokacija izuzetna.&nbsp;Prvi apartman nalazi se na prvom katu, a preostala dva apartmana se prostiru preko dvije eta¾e (drugog i treæeg kata).&nbsp;Dvoeta¾ni apartmani imaju zajednièki glavni ulaz, orijentirani su prema jugu i istoku, te imaju pogled na Palaèu i katedralu.&nbsp;Apartmani su kategorizirani sa 3*, kvalitetno su ureðeni, opremljeni i klimatizirani.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>We are offering this fully restored, charming old stone house in the Palace, which consists of 3 apartments. The house has been completely renovated - inside and outside - is well decorated, and the location itself is exceptional, especially if one wanted to continue its use in tourism rentals. The first apartment is on the first floor and the other two suites are spread over two floors. These duplex apartments have a common main entrance, oriented towards the south-east, and have views of the ancient Roman Palace and the cathedral.</p>', '', '<p><strong>&Scaron;armantna stara kamena kuæa u Palaèi koja se sastoji od 3 apartmana</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je kompletno renovirana i ureðena, a sama lokacija izuzetna.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ispred kuæe se nalazi dvor koji se dijeli sa susjedom, dok vlasniku pripada i mali balkon ispred samog ulaza u dvoeta¾ni apartman.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Prvi apartman nalazi se na prvom katu, a preostala dva apartmana se prostiru preko dvije eta¾e (drugog i treæeg kata).&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Dvoeta¾ni apartmani imaju zajednièki glavni ulaz, orijentirani su prema jugu i istoku, te imaju pogled na Palaèu i katedralu.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na prvoj eta¾i i jednog i drugog apartmana su dnevni dio i kupaonica, a na drugoj spavaæa soba (eta¾e su povezane drvenim stepenicama).&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartmani su kategorizirani sa 3*, kvalitetno su ureðeni, opremljeni i klimatizirani.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ukupna stambena povr&scaron;ina sva 3 apartmana iznosi 110 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Cijela kuæa i dvor su veoma zanimljivi i ureðeni s ukusom, odvojeni od buke (ulaz je uvuèen), a s obzirom na lokaciju uz male preinake apartmani se mogu kategorizirati i sa 4 zvjezdice.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za dodatne informacije stojimo Vam na usluzi.&nbsp;</p>', '<p><strong>We are offering this fully restored, charming old stone house in the Palace, which consists of 3 apartments</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house has been completely renovated - inside and outside - is well decorated, and the location itself is exceptional, especially if one wanted to continue its use in tourism rentals.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The building is shared with a neighbour, and the property comes with a small balcony by the entrance.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The first apartment is on the first floor and the other two suites are spread over two floors (second and third floors).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>These duplex apartments have a common main entrance, oriented towards the south-east, and have views of the ancient Roman Palace and the cathedral.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the first floor of both apartments they have a living area and bathroom and the second bedroom (floors are connected by wooden stairs).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The apartments are categorized with 3 *; they are well furnished, equipped with modern interiors and air conditioned.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Total living area all 3 apartments of 110 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>All the main attractions of Split, and travel centres (ferry terminal, bus station, taxis etc) are within walking distance, and the area is entirely pedestrian in all directions, ensuring there is no disturbance or danger from traffic.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact our Split office for more information and to arrange to visit the apartments.</p>', '', '1683_Old-stone-house_0.jpg', '1683_Old-stone-house_1.jpg', '1683_Old-stone-house_2.jpg', '1683_Old-stone-house_3.jpg', '1683_Old-stone-house_4.jpg', '1683_Old-stone-house_5.jpg', '1683_Old-stone-house_6.jpg', '1683_Old-stone-house_7.jpg', '1683_Old-stone-house_8.jpg'),
(1684, 'Anita', 'Rubiæ', '', '0994252222', 'lemis07@yahoo.com', 'Rogoznica', 'Sevid Rogoznica', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '100', '2000', '800', 1, '1450000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 1, 8, 4, 'May 9, 2016', '<p>Jedinstvena luksuzna vila, s pogledom na more iz svakog dijela kuce, udaljena od lijepe sljuncane plaze i kristalnog mora svega 100 m. Povrsina vile je 800 m2, a nalazi se na parceli povrsine 2000 m2. Vila je podijeljena na 4 etaze. Svaka etaza pruza izvanredni osjecaj prostranosti i povezanosti s vanjskim prostorom. U suterenu kuce nalazi se garaza tlocrtne povrsine 195 m2.</p>', '<p>We have this unique apartment house with four huge flats each with sea views from every corner of the house, and patio with swimming pool. The property is situated 100 m from the shore, 2 minutes walk from the nearest shops and cafes on the shore and 20 km from the airport. This property is in agreat location. The villa floor area is 800 m2 and it is located on a plot of 2000 m2. The villa is divided into 4 levels. &nbsp;</p>', '', '<p>Jedinstvena luksuzna vila, s pogledom na more iz svakog dijela kuce, udaljena od lijepe sljuncane plaze i kristalnog mora svega 100 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Povrsina vile je 800 m2, a nalazi se na parceli povrsine 2000 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Vila je podijeljena na 4 etaze.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Svaka etaza pruza izvanredni osjecaj prostranosti i povezanosti s vanjskim prostorom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Otvoreni veliki dnevni boravak povezan s kuhinjom, prostrane kupaonice i spavace sobe nalaze se na svakom katu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Svaki kat ima terasu s koje se pruza pogled na more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuca je radjena od vrlo kvalitenih materijala (poplocana je granitnim plocama), ima proveden solarni sustav, klimatizaciju.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U suterenu kuce nalazi se garaza tlocrtne povrsine 195 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Okucnica je poplocana, prostrana s izgradjenim bazenom i sjenicom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuca pruza mogucnost poslovne djelatnosti u prizemlju.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Udaljenost do najblizeg restorana i ducana je svega par stotina metara.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuca ima svu potrebnu infrastrukturu (struja, septicka jama, cisterna za vodu).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Aerodrom je udaljen 20 km.</p>', '<p>We have this unique apartment house with four huge flats each with sea views from every corner of the house, and patio with swimming pool.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property is situated 100 m from the shore, 2 minutes walk from the nearest shops and cafes on the shore and 20 km from the airport.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The nearest larger town is Trogir, with many of the best restaurants along this part of the coast and the centre of the regions tourism attractions and historic artefacts.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is only 10 minutes by car.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>This property is in a great location.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The villa floor area is 800 m2 and it is located on a plot of 2000 m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The villa is divided into 4 levels.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Each floor is designed to be spacious, and to make full use of the spectacular views all round with large windows on all sides.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Each floor hasa modern open plan style family living room connected to the kitchen, spacious bathrooms and bedrooms are located on each floor.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Each floor has a wide terrace facing the sea suitable for ''alfresco''dining.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house is made of high quality materials (paved with granite slabs), and has solar electric energy panels, and air conditioning.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>In the basement of the house is the garage layout area of 195 m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The courtyard/garden area is mostly paved, with a spacious swimming pool and shady gazebo.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house is designed so that there is the possibility of a business on the ground floor.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The distance to the nearest restaurants and shops is just a few hundred meters.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house has all the necessary infrastructure (electricity, septic tank, water tank).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact our office in Split to arrange to visit the property.</p>', '', '1684_House-Villa_0.jpg', '1684_House-Villa_1.jpg', '1684_House-Villa_2.jpg', '1684_House-Villa_3.jpg', '1684_House-Villa_4.jpg', '1684_House-Villa_5.jpg', '1684_House-Villa_6.jpg', '1684_House-Villa_7.jpg', '1684_House-Villa_8.jpg'),
(1685, 'Emil ', 'Hadziomero', '', '099 677 82 14', 'Eminemko1@gmail.com', 'Rogoznica', 'Lozica I Rogoznica', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '70', '482', '240', 1, '850000', '', 2, 1, 2, 2, 1, 1, 7, 7, 'May 9, 2016', '<p>Vilu vrhunskog dizajna, cist zrak, mediteransko bilje, bazen i prekrasan pogled na more naci cete u jednoj od najljepsih uvala. Vila je udaljena svega 70 m od lijepo uredjene plaze i setnice uz more. Povrsina kuce je 240 m2, a nalazi se na parceli povrsine 482 m2. Vila je podijeljena na tri kata. Na svakom katu nalazi se dvosoban apartman, koji se sastoji od: dnevnog boravka povezanog s kuhinjom, dvije spavace sobe, kupaonice i sanitarnog cvora. Svaki kat ima izlaz na terasu i prekrasan pogled na more.</p>', '<p>We are offering this newly built house divided into three apartments. It is nicely situated on the coast, North of Trogir, 70m from the shore. It is only a short walk from the property to shops, cafes and other facilities in the village. There are sea views and the bay is one of the most attractive along the coast. The shore here has a beach along the promenade, and the region is entirely safe for children to swim and play. The building has 240 m2 of living space and is located on a plot of 482 m2.&nbsp;</p>', '', '<p>Vilu vrhunskog dizajna, cist zrak, mediteransko bilje, bazen i prekrasan pogled na more naci cete u jednoj od najljepsih uvala.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Vila je udaljena &nbsp;svega 70 m od lijepo uredjene plaze i setnice uz more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Povrsina kuce je 240 m2, a nalazi se na parceli povrsine 482 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Vila je podijeljena na tri kata.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na svakom katu nalazi se dvosoban apartman, koji se sastoji od: dnevnog boravka povezanog s kuhinjom, dvije spavace sobe, kupaonice i sanitarnog cvora.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Svaki kat ima izlaz na terasu i prekrasan pogled na more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Okucnica je uredjena i kultivirana.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U sklopu vrta nalazi se bazen s poplocanom terasom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Pristup do kuce je asfaltiranom cestom, a na parceli pored kuce nalaze se dva parking mjesta.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Udaljenost do restorana, kafica, ducana, trznice, ljekarne i drugih potrebnih sadrzaja je 15 minuta hoda.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Aerodrom je udaljen 28 km.</p>', '<p>We are offering this newly built house divided into three apartments.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is nicely situated on the coast, North of Trogir, 70m from the shore.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is only a short walk from the property to shops, cafes and other facilitiesin the village.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There are sea views and the bay is one of the most attractive along the coast.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The shore here has a beach along the promenade, and the region is entirely safe for children to swim and play.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The water is wonderfully clear and there is almost zero tide.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The building has 240 m2 of living space and is located on a plot of 482 m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The villa is divided into three floors.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On each floor there is two bedroom apartment, which consists of a modern style open plan living room connected with the kitchen, two bedrooms, a bathroom and separate toilet.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Each floor has a private balcony and a beautiful view of the sea.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The courtyard is decorated with Mediterranean herbs and other plants and attractively landscaped.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>In part of the garden there is a swimming pool surrounded by a paved terrace for sunbathing and relaxing.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Access to the house is along a paved road, and on the land next to the house there are two parking spaces.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Split airport is 28 km.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact our office in Split to arrange to visit this property.</p>', '', '1685_House-Villa_0.JPG', '1685_House-Villa_1.JPG', '1685_House-Villa_2.JPG', '1685_House-Villa_3.JPG', '1685_House-Villa_4.JPG', '1685_House-Villa_5.JPG', '1685_House-Villa_6.JPG', '1685_House-Villa_7.JPG', ''),
(1686, 'Nives Sanader', 'DILVANA PIVÈEVIÆ ', '+385 91 3360 648', '', 'croatia@ibci.hr', 'Split', 'SPLIT, SPINUTSKA 31 SPLIT', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '250', '1080', '214', 1, '1800000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 5, 3, 'May 9, 2016', '<p>Prekrasna kuæa na Marjanu, udaljena od mora samo 250 m, smje&scaron;tena na izuzetnoj lokaciji, u blizini marina, teniskih, malonogometnih terena te velike rekreacijske zone.&nbsp;Kuæa ima ukupnu stambenu povr&scaron;inu 214 m2, a sastoji se od prizemlja i kata&nbsp;te krovnu terasu povr&scaron;ine 147 m2.&nbsp;Moguæa je dogradnja i treæe eta¾e.&nbsp;Lokacija je vrlo atraktivna kako za miran i ugodan ¾ivot, tako i za turizam &scaron;to novom vlasniku mo¾e pru¾iti prihod veæ predstojeæu sezonu.</p>', '<p>We are offering this beautiful house, on the outskirts of Split, with a large garden and access to the sea. It is situated 250 m from the shore on the edge of the Marjan forest reserve. The house sits on a large plot of 1000 m2. Part of this is a more private patio area, while the remainder is landscaped with fruit trees and herb bushes. The house has a living area of 214 m2 and consists of two floors. The house has a roof terrace of 147 m2.&nbsp;</p>', '', '<p>Prekrasna kuæa na Marjanu, udaljena od mora samo 250 m, smje&scaron;tena na izuzetnoj lokaciji, u blizini marina, teniskih, malonogometnih terena te velike rekreacijske zone.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je pogodna za obavljanje turistièko-ugostiteljskih djelatnosti, te je kompletno renovirana 2012. godine iznutra (struja &ndash; svaki stan ima svoje mjerilo snage po 30 kwh, voda, zidovi, podovi) i izvana (nova termo fasada, gromobranska instalacija, ograda, stolarija, vrata, ...).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Oko nje je velika okuænica povr&scaron;ine ca.1000 m2 koja je manjim dijelom dvori&scaron;te, a veæim kultivirani vrt sa rodonosnim stablima mandarina, limuna, naranèe, &scaron;ipka, smokve, te sa ostalim vrstama ukrasne vegetacije.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa ima ukupnu stambenu povr&scaron;inu 214 m2, a sastoji se od prizemlja i kata.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Prizemlje se sastoji od dnevnog boravka, kuhinje, blagovaonice, dvije spavaæe sobe, kupaonice i spreme.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na prvom katu su dnevni boravak, kuhinja, blagovaonica, tri spavaæe sobe, kupaonica, wc, sprema i balkon.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Moguæa je dogradnja i treæe eta¾e.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa ima krovnu terasu povr&scaron;ine 147 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Lokacija je vrlo atraktivna kako za miran i ugodan ¾ivot, tako i za turizam &scaron;to novom vlasniku mo¾e pru¾iti prihod veæ predstojeæu sezonu, buduæi da su sada&scaron;nji vlasnici veæ uhodani u turistièkom iznajmljivanju. &nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Do meðunarodnog aerodroma 40 min. vo¾nje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Molimo za sve informacije kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured u Splitu.</p>', '<p>We are offering this beautiful house, on the outskirts of Split, with a large garden and access to the sea.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is situated 250 m from the shore on the edge of the Marjan forest reserve.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Within walking distance are tennis courts, main yachting Marina, a large and fabulous open recreational area - the finest in the country - and the main historic and cultural attractions of the ancient city.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house was completely renovated in 2012 and included were many modern features and fitting to add comfort at every opportunity.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house sits on a large plot of 1000 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Part of this is a more private patio area, while the remainder is landscaped with fruit trees and herb bushes.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There are tangerine, orange, pomegranate, figs and many other trees often grown locally.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house has a living area of 214 m2 and consists of two floors.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The ground floor consists of a living room, kitchen, dining room, two bedrooms, a bathroom and a pantry.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the first floor are a living room, kitchen, dining room, three bedrooms, bathroom, toilet, storage and balcony.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is possible to ask for planning permission to add a third floor.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house has a roof terrace of 147 m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The location of the property make this a very attractive property for peace and comfort but the new owner can provide a healthy income through the tourist season, which stretches to most months of the year, these days.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The current owners already enjoy such additional use.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>To the international airport is 40 min driving.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please for more information and to arrange to visit this property, please contact our office in Split.</p>', '', '1686_House-Villa_0.jpg', '1686_House-Villa_1.jpg', '1686_House-Villa_2.jpg', '1686_House-Villa_3.jpg', '1686_House-Villa_4.jpg', '1686_House-Villa_5.jpg', '1686_House-Villa_6.jpg', '1686_House-Villa_7.jpg', '1686_House-Villa_8.jpg'),
(1687, 'Stipe', 'Re¾iæ', '', '0977248222', 'stiperezic@gmail.com', 'Trogir', 'Poljica, Marusinac 7 Poljica, kè 4237/4 ZU 2463 ko Marina', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '30', '700', '300', 1, '599000', '', 2, 2, 2, 1, 1, 1, 7, 4, 'May 11, 2016', '<p>Kuca okruzena borovima, skrivena od znatizeljnih pogleda prolaznika, s prekrasnim pogledom na more kako s terase tako i iz bazena pruzit ce Vam jedinstven ugodjaj i odmor. Povrsina kuce je 300 m2, a nalazi se na parceli povrsine 700 m2. Kuca je podijeljena na tri kata. Bazen povrsine 32 m2, uredjena terasa oko bazena kao i zatvoreni prostor pored bazena koji sluzi kao ljetnja kuhinja i mjesto za rostilj su najljepsi dio ove kuce.</p>', '<p>Great property on the mainland North of Trogir.&nbsp;We have this secluded house surrounded by native pine trees, and not overlooked from passers-by. It was built it on the shore and designed so that wide terraces and balconies would have unobstructed views out to sea. It has a good sized swimming pool, surrounded by a wide sun terrace which makes for a uniquely relaxing situation.&nbsp;It comprises of 300 m2 and is located on a plot of 700 m2.&nbsp;The house is divided into three floors.&nbsp;</p>', '', '<p>Kuca okruzena borovima, skrivena od znatizeljnih pogleda prolaznika, s prekrasnim pogledom na more kako s terase tako i iz bazena pruzit ce Vam jedinstven ugodjaj i odmor.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Povrsina kuce je 300 m2, a nalazi se na parceli povrsine 700 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuca je podijeljena na tri kata.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na prvom katu nalaze se dvije spavace sobe, kuhinja i kupaonica.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Drugi kat se sastoji od dvije spavace sobe, kuhinje s blagovaonicom i kupaonice.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Treci kat se sastoji od dvije spavace sobe, kuhinje s blagovaonicom i kupaonice.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Svaki kat ima prostranu terasu idealnu za dnevni boravak tijekom ljetnih vrucih dana s jedinstvenim panoramskim pogledom na more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Okucnica je odrzavana i kultivirana.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Borovi oko kuce pruzaju prirodnu hladovinu za vrijeme ljeta.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Bazen povrsine 32 m2, uredjena terasa oko bazena kao i zatvoreni prostor pored bazena koji sluzi kao ljetnja kuhinja i mjesto za rostilj su najljepsi dio ove kuce.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Plaza je udaljena svega 30 m od kuce.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Svi potrebni sadrzaji (restorani, trgovine, kafici) nalaze se na svega par minuta od kuce.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuca ima svu potrebnu infrastrukturu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U sklopu parcele nalaze se tri parking mjesta.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Aerodrom je udaljen 10 km.</p>', '<p><strong>Great property on the mainland North of Trogir</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>We have this secluded house surrounded by native pine trees, and not overlooked from passers-by.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It was built it on the shore and designed so that wide terraces and balconies would have unobstructed views out to sea.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It has a good sized swimming pool, surrounded by a wide sun terrace which makes for a uniquely relaxing situation.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It comprises of 300 m2 and is located on a plot of 700 m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house is divided into three floors.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the first floor there are two bedrooms, kitchen and bathroom.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The second floor consists of two bedrooms, kitchen, dining room and bathroom.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The third floor consists of two bedrooms, kitchen, dining room and bathroom.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Each floor has a spacious terrace ideal for dining during the hot summer days and with a terrific wide views of the sea.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The surrounding land is landscaped and cultivated with traditional native herbs and shrubs.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There are pine trees around the house which provide a wonderful aroma and natural shade during the summer.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The pool area of 32 m2, is set within a sunbathing terrace and an outdoor bbq/fireplace is set on the terrace as an option for family meals ''alfresco''.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Within the plot there are three parking spaces.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The beach is only 3o meters in front of the house.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>All necessary facilities (restaurants, shops, bars, coffee shops, cafes) are located only a few minutes walk from the house.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house has all the necessary infrastructure (electric, drains, water supply, etc.).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The airport is 10 km.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For detailed information, or to visit this property please call our Split office.</p>', '', '1687_House-Villa_0.JPG', '1687_House-Villa_1.JPG', '1687_House-Villa_2.JPG', '1687_House-Villa_3.JPG', '1687_House-Villa_4.JPG', '1687_House-Villa_5.JPG', '1687_House-Villa_6.JPG', '1687_House-Villa_7.JPG', '1687_House-Villa_8.JPG'),
(1688, 'Tomislav', 'Piliæ', '091 3777588', 'zena 091 3506174', 'tomislav@navigare-yachting.com', 'Trogir', 'Poljica', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '10', '224', '147', 1, '350000', '', 2, 2, 2, 1, 1, 2, 5, 2, 'May 11, 2016', '<p>Na svega par metara od mora, u centru malog dalamatinskog mjesta nalazi se kuca koja pruza istinski dozivljaj mediterana. Povrsina kuce je 147 m2, s okucnicom povrsine 224 m2. Kuca se sastoji od prizemlja i kata. Prizemlje je povrsine 68 m2 i nije namjesteno. Kat je povrsine 78 m2 i u potpunosti je namjesten. Cijela kuca ima 5 spavacih soba, dvije kupaonice i dnevni boravak te kuhinju na svakom katu.</p>', '<p>We are pleased to offer this property, which is just a few meters from thesea, in the centre of a small Dalmatian village. It comprises of 147 m2 of living space and has a garden of 224 m2. The house consists of two floors. The ground floor area is 68 m2 and is not furnished. First floor area is 78 m2 and is fully furnished.&nbsp;The whole house has 5 bedrooms, two bathrooms and a living room and kitchen on each floor.&nbsp;</p>', '', '<p>Na svega par metara od mora, u centru malog dalamatinskog mjesta nalazi se kuca koja pruza istinski dozivljaj mediterana.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Povrsina kuce je 147 m2, s okucnicom povrsine 224 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuca se sastoji od prizemlja i kata.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Prizemlje je povrsine 68 m2 i nije namjesteno.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kat je povrsine 78 m2 i u potpunosti je namjesten.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Cijela kuca ima 5 spavacih soba, dvije kupaonice i dnevni boravak te kuhinju na svakom katu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Okucnica je kultivirana i odrzavana.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>S obzirom da je kuca smjestena u centru mjesta svi potrebni sadrzaji (restorani, kafici, trgovine) nalaze se u neposrednoj blizini.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuca ima svu potrebnu infrastrukturu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U sklopu parcele osigurana su i dva parking mjesta.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Aerodrom je udaljen 10 km.</p>', '<p>We are pleased to offer this property, which is just a few meters from the sea, in the centre of a small Dalmatian village.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It certainly offers a real experience of Mediterranean life, as the current owner loves to walk passed the ancient harbour, chatting with the local boat owners every morning and feeding the fish with a slice of bread.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It comprises of 147 m2 of living space and has a garden of 224 m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house consists of two floors.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The ground floor area is 68 m2 and is not furnished.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>First floor area is 78 m2 and is fully furnished.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The whole house has 5 bedrooms, two bathrooms and a living room and kitchen on each floor.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Garden is cultivated and maintained and provides a lovely shade in high summer.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Since the house is located in the centre of the village, all the necessary facilities (restaurants, bars, shops) are located in the immediate vicinity, and are accessible within a few minutes walk along the sea front.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>As part of the plot there are two parking spaces.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The airport is 10 km, and the nearest larger town is Trogir, 8 km South.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Call our office to arrange to visit this property.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Early viewing is recommended, as this type of sea front property rarely lasts very long on our lists.</p>', '', '1688_House-Villa_0.jpg', '1688_House-Villa_1.JPG', '1688_House-Villa_2.JPG', '', '1688_House-Villa_4.JPG', '1688_House-Villa_5.JPG', '1688_House-Villa_6.JPG', '1688_House-Villa_7.JPG', '1688_House-Villa_8.jpg'),
(1689, 'Paul', 'Connell', 'Frano Matulic, 092 1917 568', '00353871952867', 'connell.paul@gmail.com', 'Brac', 'Bol, Kc 547/5 ko bol', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '530', '0', '39', 1, '149000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 1, 1, 'May 11, 2016', '<p>Na prodaju nudimo ovaj lijepi apartman sa 1 spavaæom sobom i 1 kupaonicom, smje&scaron;ten u popularnom mjestu na otoku Braèu, poznatom po pla¾ama i bogatom noænom ¾ivotu.&nbsp;Apartman ima stambenu povr&scaron;inu 38,54 m2, a pripadaju mu i 2 terase povr&scaron;ine 10,75 m2 i 3,81 m2 te parkirali&scaron;no mjesto od 12 m2 kao i krovna terasa od 70 m2 sa fantastiènim pogledom na more.&nbsp;Apartman je u cijelosti namje&scaron;ten i namje&scaron;taj je ukljuèen u cijenu.</p>', '<p>For sale we have this lovely 1-bedroom 1-bathroom apartment located on the top floor of a low-rise building in Bol, famous for its beaches and thrilling night life.&nbsp;An apartment has 38,54 sqm internally, two covered terraces sized 10,75 and 3,81 sqm, as well as 12 sqm parking place and 70 sqm roof top terrace, offering spectacular sea views.&nbsp;The property is fully furnished and the furniture is included in the price.&nbsp;</p>', '', '<p>Na prodaju nudimo ovaj lijepi apartman sa 1 spavaæom sobom i 1 kupaonicom, smje&scaron;ten u popularnom mjestu na otoku Braèu, poznatom po pla¾ama i bogatom noænom ¾ivotu.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartman ima stambenu povr&scaron;inu 38,54 m2, a pripadaju mu i 2 terase povr&scaron;ine 10,75 i 3,81 m2 te parkirali&scaron;no mjesto od 12 m2 kao i krovna terasa od 70 m2 sa fantastiènim pogledom na more.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartman je u cijelosti namje&scaron;ten i namje&scaron;taj je ukljuèen u cijenu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Molimo kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured za vi&scaron;e informacija.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>For sale we have this lovely 1-bedroom 1-bathroom apartment located on the top floor of a low-rise building in Bol, famous for its beaches and thrilling night life.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>An apartment has 38,54 sqm internally, two covered terraces sized 10,75 and 3,81 sqm, as well as 12 sqm parking place and 70 sqm roof top terrace, offering spectacular sea views.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property is fully furnished and the furniture is included in the price.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please enquire with our office for more information or to arrange the viewing.&nbsp;</p>', '', '1689_Apartment_0.jpg', '1689_Apartment_1.jpg', '1689_Apartment_2.jpg', '1689_Apartment_3.jpg', '1689_Apartment_4.jpg', '1689_Apartment_5.jpg', '1689_Apartment_6.jpg', '1689_Apartment_7.jpg', '1689_Apartment_8.jpg');
INSERT INTO `nekretnina` (`id`, `ime`, `prezime`, `telefon`, `mobitel`, `e_mail`, `lokacija_id`, `adresa`, `status_id`, `vrsta_id`, `udaljenost`, `povrsina`, `stambenapovrsina`, `display`, `cijena`, `cijenatocka`, `ponuda_tjedna`, `new_built`, `must_sell`, `prvi_red_do_mora`, `pogled_na_more`, `bazen`, `broj_soba`, `broj_kupatila`, `datum`, `title_hr`, `title_en`, `title_ge`, `opis_hr`, `opis_en`, `opis_ge`, `PropertyImageURL0`, `PropertyImageURL1`, `PropertyImageURL2`, `PropertyImageURL3`, `PropertyImageURL4`, `PropertyImageURL5`, `PropertyImageURL6`, `PropertyImageURL7`, `PropertyImageURL8`) VALUES
(1690, 'Sonja ', 'Barac Rud', '', '091 566 7000', 'soniarudynski@soniarudynski.com ', 'Dubrovnik', 'Eugena Kumicica 27 Dubrovnik, Kc 946/9, 946/12 ZU 805 i 971 ko Gru¾', 'For sale', 'Land plot', '150', '625', '0', 1, '600000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 0, 0, 'May 11, 2016', '<p>Na prodaju nudimo graðevinsko zemlji&scaron;te u Dubrovniku, smje&scaron;teno u ekskluzivnoj stambenoj èetvrti, u bilizini mora i sa pristupom svim sadr¾ajima.&nbsp;Do starog Grada ima 3 km, a do popularne gradske pla¾e oko 1 km.&nbsp;Buduæi da je ovaj dio grada izgraðen, ovakvu nekretninu na tr¾i&scaron;tu vi&scaron;e nije moguæe lako pronaæi.&nbsp;Koeficijent izgraðenosti je dobar, èime je ova nekretnina potencijalno zanimljiva ozbiljnim investitorima.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>For sale we have this land plot in Dubrovnik, located in an exclusive residential neighbourhood, close to the sea and with easy access to all amenities.&nbsp;There is only 3 km to the Old Town and less than 1 km from a very popular city beach.&nbsp;The area is built-up and it''s hard to find such plots on the market anymore.&nbsp;Good utilization ratio allows substantial construction and this plot could be interesting to serious property developers.&nbsp;</p>', '', '<p>Na prodaju nudimo graðevinsko zemlji&scaron;te u Dubrovniku, smje&scaron;teno u ekskluzivnoj stambenoj èetvrti, u bilizini mora i sa pristupom svim sadr¾ajima.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Do starog Grada ima 3 km, a do popularne gradske pla¾e oko 1 km.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Buduæi da je ovaj dio grada izgraðen, ovakvu nekretninu na tr¾i&scaron;tu vi&scaron;e nije moguæe lako pronaæi.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Koeficijent izgraðenosti je dobar, èime je ova nekretnina potencijalno zanimljiva ozbiljnim investitorima.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Cijela parcela ima povr&scaron;inu 1.250 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na jednoj stani parcele nalazi se stara kuæa kojoj treba renovacija, dok je drugi dio parcele predmet prodaje za cijenu od 600.000 EUR.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Vi&scaron;e informacija u na&scaron;em uredu u Splitu.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>For sale we have this land plot in Dubrovnik, located in an exclusive residential neighbourhood, close to the sea and with easy access to all amenities.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There is only 3 km to the Old Town and less than 1 km from a very popular city beach.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The area is built-up and it''s hard to find such plots on the market anymore.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Good utilization ratio allows substantial construction and this plot could be interesting to serious property developers.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The entire plot is sized 1.250 sqm, hosting an old house on one side, in need of renovation.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The other part of the plot (half of the total size) is for sale, for the asking price of 600.000 EUR.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>We can provide more information in our office in Split.</p>', '', '1690_Land-plot_0.jpg', '1690_Land-plot_1.jpg', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(1691, 'Rus', 'Svjetlana', 'Svjetlana 0993208998', 'Vinko 0958667207', '', 'Rogoznica', 'Rogoznica', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '70', '0', '53', 1, '140000', '', 2, 1, 2, 2, 1, 1, 1, 1, 'May 12, 2016', '<p>Luksuzna zgrada s devet apartmana u najljep&scaron;em dijelu Rogoznice.&nbsp;Okru¾ena borovima, uredjena okuænica, bazen s poploèanom terasom i sjenicom, alarmni sustav, video nadzor cijele zgrade, udaljenost dvije uredjene pla¾e svega 70 metara, blizina centra i svih potrebnih sadr¾aja èine ove apartmane izuzetnom prilikom.&nbsp;U zgradi se nalaze dva tipa apartmana.&nbsp;Apartmani povr&scaron;ine 53 m2 po cijeni od &euro;140.000, te apartmani povr&scaron;ine 72 m2 po cijeni od &euro;185.000.</p>', '<p>Newly completed luxury apartment building containing nine apartments in the most beautiful part of Rogoznica, on the main land near Trogir. They are only 70 meters from the sea, and a direct path leads you down to the safe and quiet shore. There are almost no tidal currents here and the clear water is safe for bathing and other water sports. In the building there are two types of apartments. The apartments of 53 m2 at a cost of &euro;140,000. The apartments of 72 m2 at a cost of &euro;185,000.</p>', '', '<p><strong>Luksuzna zgrada s devet apartmana u najljep&scaron;em dijelu Rogoznice</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Okru¾ena borovima, uredjena okuænica, bazen s poploèanom terasom i sjenicom, alarmni sustav, video nadzor cijele zgrade, udaljenost dvije uredjene pla¾e svega 70 metara, blizina centra i svih potrebnih sadr¾aja èine ove apartmane izuzetnom prilikom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U zgradi se nalaze dva tipa apartmana.</p>\r\n<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;"><br /></span></p>\r\n<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;">Apartmani povr&scaron;ine 53 m2 po cijeni od &euro;140.000</span></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartmani se sastoje od prostarnog dnevnog boravka povezanog s kuhinjom i blagovaonicom, jedne spavaæe sobe i kupaonice.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Terasa s koje se pru¾a pogled na more je jugoistoène orijentacije.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;">Apartmani povr&scaron;ine 72 m2 po cijeni od &euro;185.000</span></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartmani se sastoje od dvije spavaæe sobe, dvije kupaonice i otvorenog dnevnog boravka s kuhinjom , blagovaonicom i izlazom na prostranu terasu koja ima pogled na more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Osigurana su parking mjesta, a u gara¾i koja se nalazi u suterenu &nbsp;zgrade mo¾e se kupiti mjesto za &euro;15.000.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Zgrada ima svu potrebnu infrastrukturu kao i slu¾bu za odr¾avanje zgrade.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Aerodrom je udaljen 28 km.</p>', '<p><strong>Newly completed luxury apartment building containing nine apartments in the most beautiful part of Rogoznica, on the main land near Trogir</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>They are situated among the natural wooded trees along the shore giving seclusion and peace, set in a landscaped garden which contains a swimming pool with paved terrace and gazebo.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The properties are all fitted with video surveillance and many other modern comforts.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>They are only 70 meters from the sea, and a direct path leads you down to the safe and quiet shore.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There are almost no tidal currents here and the clear water is safe for bathing and other water sports.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>These apartments are also situated near the centre of the village so whether you walk or cycle to the shops, bakery, cafes and coffee shops near the old harbour, it is a very short and quick journey.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The building was built to high modern standards with attention given to light and spacious living areas, practical and well equipped kitchens, a high level of insulation to reduce living costs and with an attractive communal areas which add to the good feeling of the building.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>In the building there are two types of apartments.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;">The apartments of 53 m2 at a cost of &euro;140,000</span></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The apartments consist of spacious open plan living room/kitchen/dining room, a one bedroom and a bathroom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>They have a wide balcony, suitable for summer &lsquo;alfresco&rsquo; family dining while enjoying the view of the sea.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>They are oriented south.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;">The apartments of 72 m2 at a cost of &euro;185,000</span></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>These apartments consist of two bedrooms, two bathrooms and a spacious open plan living room/kitchen/dining room and a spacious balcony that overlooks the sea.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Secured parking spaces in a garage place located in the basement can be purchased for an additional &euro;15,000.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The airport is 28 km.</p>', '', '1691_Apartment_0.jpg', '1691_Apartment_1.jpg', '1691_Apartment_2.jpg', '1691_Apartment_3.jpg', '1691_Apartment_4.jpg', '1691_Apartment_5.jpg', '1691_Apartment_6.jpg', '1691_Apartment_7.jpg', '1691_Apartment_8.jpg'),
(1692, 'Ivan ', 'Gale¹iæ', '021-358 505', '0049-176-43394410', 'Ivan.Galesic@osram-os.com', 'Split', 'Drvenièka 23 i ©etali¹te Ivana Me¹troviæa 84', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '140', '0', '114', 1, '513675', '', 2, 1, 2, 2, 1, 2, 3, 2, 'May 13, 2016', '<p>Stanovi u izgradnji s prekrasnim pogledom na more, u blizini park &scaron;ume Marjan i mnogobrojnih pla¾a.&nbsp;Smje&scaron;teni su u zapadnom, ekskluzivnom rezidencijalnom dijelu grada Splita.&nbsp;Zgrada ima lift, a na svakoj eta¾i se nalazi samo 1 stan.&nbsp;Stanovi na ni¾im eta¾ama imaju boèni pogled na more, dok se iz penthouse-a pru¾a lijepi otovreni pogled na braèki kanal i Marjan.&nbsp;Zavr&scaron;etak gradnje i useljenje planirano je na jesen 2016.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>This is a first class opportunity to buy a luxurious newly built apartments (under construction) in a grade ''A'' location, nearby the sea and Marjan park forest, in an exclusive residential neighbourhood of Split town.&nbsp;The building has an elevator and each floor has just one apartment.&nbsp;Views are getting better with every floor and the penthouse has striking view of the open sea and Marjan.&nbsp;The completion and moving in is planned in Autumn 2016.</p>', '', '<p><strong>Stanovi u izgradnji s prekrasnim pogledom na more, u blizini park &scaron;ume Marjan i mnogobrojnih pla¾a</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Smje&scaron;teni su u zapadnom, ekskluzivnom rezidencijalnom dijelu grada Splita.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Zgrada ima lift, a na svakoj eta¾i se nalazi samo 1 stan koji se sastoji od predsoblja, 3 spavaæe sobe, dnevnog boravka, kuhinje, blagovaonice, 2 kupaonice te prostrane ju¾no orijentirane terase.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Stanovi na ni¾im eta¾ama imaju boèni pogled na more, dok se iz penthouse-a pru¾a lijepi otovreni pogled na braèki kanal i Marjan.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Stanovi na drugom katu imaju i balkon sa sjeverne strane.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Svakom stanu pripada i 1 parking mjesto u gara¾i te spremi&scaron;te u podrumu.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;">Stan 1: PRIZEMLJE</span> &ndash; 126,10 m2 - &euro;4.100/m2</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;">Stan 2: I.KAT</span> &ndash; 114,15 m2 - &euro;4.500/m2&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;">Stan 3: II.KAT</span> &ndash; 112,84 m2 - &euro;5.200/m2</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;">Stan 4: III.KAT</span> &ndash; 104,00 m2 &ndash; CIJENA NA UPIT</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Zavr&scaron;etak gradnje i useljenje planirano je na jesen 2016.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ako ¾elite vlastitu oazu u jednom od najpopularnijih gradova u Dalmaciji, ovo je idealna nekretnina za vas.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Takoðer se zbog odliènog potencijala nekretnina mo¾e koristiti i u svrhu turistièkog iznajmljivanja.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Meðunarodni aerodrom udaljen je 45 min. vo¾nje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za sve dodatne informacije stojimo vam na raspolaganju.</p>', '<p><strong>This is a first class opportunity to buy a luxurious newly built apartments (under construction) in a grade ''A'' location, &nbsp;nearby the sea and Marjan park forest, in an exclusive residential neighbourhood of Split town</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>They are located on the west side of Split, the most sought after side of the town, close to the marina, safe swimming beaches, shops, bars, restaurants and all the historic and cultural attractions in the ancient part of the city.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The building has an elevator and each floor has just one apartment.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>They consist of hall, 3 bedrooms, open plan modern style family living room, kitchen, dining room, 2 bathrooms and a large south-facing balcony.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Views are getting better with every floor and the penthouse has striking view of the open sea and Marjan.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartments on the second floor have a balcony on the north side too, facing the forest.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Each apartment has 1 parking space in the garage and storage room in the basement.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;">Apartment 1: ground floor</span> - 126,10 m2 - &euro;4,100/m2</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;">Apartment 2: first floor </span>- 114,15 m2 - &euro;4,500/m2</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;">Apartment 3: second floor</span> - 112,84 m2 - &euro;5,200/m2</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;">Apartment 4: third floor</span> - 104,00 m2 - PRICE ON REQUEST</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The completion and moving in is planned in Autumn 2016.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Whether you are considering owning a property in the city to live, rent out to tourists or for an medium or long term investment, then this is a golden opportunity to buy a superb property which we can only predict will increase in value year after year.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The international airport is 45 minutes. driving.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For additional information, please contact our office and we will arrange a tour for you.</p>', '', '1692_Apartment_0.jpg', '1692_Apartment_1.jpg', '1692_Apartment_2.jpg', '1692_Apartment_3.jpg', '1692_Apartment_4.jpg', '1692_Apartment_5.jpg', '1692_Apartment_6.jpg', '1692_Apartment_7.jpg', '1692_Apartment_8.jpg'),
(1693, 'Judit', 'Gaal', '', '00.36.30.248.6970', 'judit.gaal@gesgkft.hu ', 'Brac', 'Mirca', 'For sale', 'Land plot', '100', '4998', '0', 1, '1600000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 0, 0, 'May 17, 2016', '<p>Prodajemo zemlji&scaron;te u malom mjestu nedaleko od Supetra. Zemlji&scaron;te se nalazi u neizgraðenom graðevinskom podruèju naselja. U neposrednoj je bilzini infrastrukture, a od mora udaljeno 100 m.</p>', '<p>For sale we have this large plot, located in an unbuilt part of the building zone (mixed use, mainly residential). The land is nearby infrastructure and only 100 meters from the sea.&nbsp;</p>', '', '<p>Prodajemo zemlji&scaron;te u malom mjestu nedaleko od Supetra.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Zemlji&scaron;te se nalazi u neizgraðenom graðevinskom podruèju naselja.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U neposrednoj je bilzini infrastrukture, a od mora udaljeno 100 m.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za dodatne informacije molimo kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>For sale we have this large plot, located in an unbuilt part of the building zone (mixed use, mainly residential).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The land is nearby infrastructure and only 100 meters from the sea.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For further information please contact our office in Split.&nbsp;</p>', '', '1693_Land-plot_0.jpg', '1693_Land-plot_1.jpg', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(1694, 'Termo Bukovac ', 'd.o.o.', 'Dejan Gjuras', '091 222 2525', 'termo.bukovac@zg.ht.hr', 'Brac', 'Pavisica Vrtli Postira, Kc 1150 ZU 1786 ko Postira', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '200', '0', '39', 1, '74000', '', 2, 1, 2, 2, 1, 2, 1, 1, 'May 18, 2016', '<p>Na prodaju nudimo lijepe male apartmane u novogradnji, nedaleko od centra malog mjesta na otoku Bracu, oko 12 min voznje od trajektne luke iz Supetra.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>For sale we have this lovely newly built apartment building with 6 units. It is located in a quiet area of a small charming village on Brac island, a 12 min car ride from the main ferry port in Supetar.&nbsp;</p>', '', '<p>Na prodaju nudimo lijepe male apartmane u novogradnji, nedaleko od centra malog mjesta na otoku Bracu, oko 12 min voznje od trajektne luke iz Supetra.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>1. Prizemlje</strong>: 38,62 m2 + parking 13,48 m2 + vrt 60,46 m2 - <strong>PRODANO</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>2. Prizemlje</strong>: 38,69 m2 + parking 11,03 m2 + vrt 68,63 m2 -&nbsp;<strong>81.000 EUR</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>3. Prvi kat</strong>: 43,77 m2 + parking 9,33 m2 - <strong>74.000 EUR</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>4. Prvi kat</strong>: 46,05 m2 + parking 11,97 m2 - <strong>79.400 EUR</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>5. Drugi kat</strong>: 43,57 m2 + galerija 38,60 m2 + parking 12,70 - <strong>107.000 EUR</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>6. Drugi kat</strong>: 46,05 m2 + galerija 20,10 m2 + parking 12,70 m2 - <strong>PRODANO</strong></p>', '<p>For sale we have this lovely newly built apartment building with 6 units.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is located in a quiet area of a small charming village on Brac island, a 12 min car ride from the main ferry port in Supetar.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>1. Ground floor</strong>: 38,62 sqm + parking 13,48 sqm + garden 60,46 m2 -<strong> SOLD</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>2. Ground floor</strong>: 38,69sqm + parking 11,03 sqm + garden 68,63 sqm - <strong>81.000 EUR</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>3. First floor</strong>: 43,77 sqm + parking 9,33 sqm - <strong>74.000 EUR</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>4. First floor</strong>: 46,05 sqm + parking 11,97 sqm - <strong>79.400 EUR</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>5. Second floor</strong>: 43,57 sqm + gallery 38,60 sqm + parking 12,70 - <strong>107.000 EUR</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>6. Second floor</strong>: 46,05 sqm + gallery 20,10 sqm + parking 12,70 sqm - <strong>SOLD</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>This small apartments would make a great holiday home to a buyers on the budget.&nbsp;</p>', '', '1694_Apartment_0.jpg', '1694_Apartment_1.jpg', '1694_Apartment_2.jpg', '1694_Apartment_3.jpg', '1694_Apartment_4.jpg', '1694_Apartment_5.jpg', '1694_Apartment_6.jpg', '1694_Apartment_7.jpg', '1694_Apartment_8.jpg'),
(1695, 'Ru¾ica', 'Èeriæ', 'Ivan Ceric(sin)  091 8833214', '', 'i.ceric.ceka@gmail.com', 'Omis', 'Put starog sela Marusici, Kc 6767, 6773, 6768 ko Rogoznica', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '400', '530', '100', 1, '125000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 3, 1, 'May 18, 2016', '<p>Na prodaju nudimo kucu iznad jadranske magistrale, nedaleko od centra malog mjesta na omiskoj rivijeri, cca. 15 km juzno od Omisa.&nbsp;Kuca ima nedovrseno prizemlje te stan sa terasom na prvom katu. Stan je useljiv, no potrebna mu je renovacija, kao i cijelom objektu.&nbsp;Nekretnina je smjestena na rubu mjesta i uziva mir i tisinu. Sa terase se pruza lijepi pogled na more. Iako je zracna udaljenost od mora mala, pjesackim putem do najblizih plaza ima oko 15-20 minuta hoda.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>For sale we have this house above the main coastal road, not far from the village center, approximatly 15 min car ride south of Omis.&nbsp;The ground floor is not finished. On the first floor there is a habitable apartment. However, the entire property is in a need of renovation, hence affordable price.&nbsp;The property is located on the egde of the village, enjoying privacy and peace. Although the areal distance to the sea is short, it takes around 15-20 min on foot to reach the nearest beaches.&nbsp;</p>', '', '<p>Na prodaju nudimo kucu iznad jadranske magistrale, nedaleko od centra malog mjesta na omiskoj rivijeri, cca. 15 km juzno od Omisa.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuca ima nedovrseno prizemlje te stan sa terasom na prvom katu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Stan je useljiv, no potrebna mu je renovacija, kao i cijelom objektu.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nekretnina je smjestena na rubu mjesta i uziva mir i tisinu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sa terase se pruza lijepi pogled na more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Iako je zracna udaljenost od mora mala, pjesackim putem do najblizih plaza ima oko 15-20 minuta hoda.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>For sale we have this house above the main coastal road, not far from the village center, approximatly 15 min car ride south of Omis.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The ground floor is not finished.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the first floor there is a habitable apartment.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>However, the entire property is in a need of renovation, hence affordable price.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property is located on the egde of the village, enjoying privacy and peace.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Although the areal distance to the sea is short, it takes around 15-20 min on foot to reach the nearest beaches.&nbsp;</p>', '', '1695_House-Villa_0.jpg', '1695_House-Villa_1.jpg', '1695_House-Villa_2.jpg', '1695_House-Villa_3.jpg', '1695_House-Villa_4.jpg', '1695_House-Villa_5.jpg', '1695_House-Villa_6.jpg', '1695_House-Villa_7.jpg', '1695_House-Villa_8.jpg'),
(1696, '', 'Nikoliæ', '', '0915171009', 'Ivan Nikoliæ <ivannikolic005@gmail.com>', 'Rogoznica', 'Stiva¹nica Rogoznica', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '50', '400', '180', 1, '350000', '', 2, 1, 2, 2, 1, 1, 2, 2, 'May 19, 2016', '<p>Nova vila dizajnirana u dalmatinskom stilu, izgraðena od prirodnog kamena, bazen povr&scaron;ine 29 m2, prirodna stjenovita pla¾a na svega par minuta hoda i prekrasan pogled na more i zalazak sunca u veèernjim satima pru¾it æe Vam jedinstven do¾ivljaj Dalmacije.&nbsp;Kuæa je povr&scaron;ine 180 m2 s dodatnim podrumskim dijelom povr&scaron;ine 35 m2.&nbsp;Parcela je povr&scaron;ine 400 m2, a ureðena je mediteranskim biljem, maslinama i palmom.</p>', '<p>We have this newly completed villa designed in a traditional Dalmatian style - with a modern twist - built of natural stone. The property boasts a swimming pool of 29 m2, and is only yards from the natural rocky beach. There are beautiful view of the sea and the sunset. The house is 180 m2 with an additional basement area of 35 m2. The plot has an area of 400 m2, and is landscaped with Mediterranean plants, olive and palm trees.</p>', '', '<p>Nova vila dizajnirana u dalmatinskom stilu, izgraðena od prirodnog kamena, bazen povr&scaron;ine 29 m2, prirodna stjenovita pla¾a na svega par minuta hoda i prekrasan pogled na more i zalazak sunca u veèernjim satima pru¾it æe Vam jedinstven do¾ivljaj Dalmacije.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je povr&scaron;ine 180 m2 s dodatnim podrumskim dijelom povr&scaron;ine 35 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Parcela je povr&scaron;ine 400 m2, a ureðena je mediteranskim biljem, maslinama i palmom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa se sastoji od podruma, prizemlja i kata.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U prizemlju je prostrani dnevni boravak povezan s kuhinjom i blagovaonicom, ali ujedno i sa vanjskom terasom u sklopu koje je bazen i natkriveni dio s ro&scaron;tiljem i velikim stolom i stolicama.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U prizemlju se nalazi jedna spvaæa soba.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na katu su dvije prostrane spavaæe sobe i kupaonice.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Cijela kuæa ima podno grijanje, video nadzor i klimatizaciju, a izgraðena je od visoko kvalitetnih materijala.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa ima svu potrebnu infrastrukturu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Udaljenost do centra mjesta je svega par kilometara i tu se mogu naæi svi potrebni sadr¾aji (trgovina, restorani, kafiæi, pizzeria).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Do kuæe vodi asfaltirana cesta, a u sklopu parcele osigurana su dva parking mjesta.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Aerodrom je udaljen svega 28 km.</p>', '<p>We have this newly completed villa designed in a traditional Dalmatian style - with a modern twist - built of natural stone.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property boasts a swimming pool of 29 m2, and is only yards from the natural rocky beach.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There are beautiful view of the sea and the sunset - facing west - in the evening which will give you a unique and memorable experience of Dalmatia.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house is 180 m2 with an additional basement area of 35 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The plot has an area of 400 m2, and is landscaped with Mediterranean plants, olive and palm trees.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house consists of a basement, ground and first floors.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the ground floor is a spacious living room connected to the kitchen but also with access to an outside terrace by the pool and a covered area with a barbecue and a large table and chairs.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The ground floor has one bedroom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Upstairs are two spacious bedrooms and ensuite bathrooms.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The whole house has underfloor heating, video surveillance, air conditioning, and many other modern design items to increase comfort and is built of high quality materials.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The distance to the city centre is only a few kilometers (just a few minutes on a cycle along the shore path) and there one can find all necessary facilities (shops, restaurants, cafes, pizzerias).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>To house a paved road, and as part of the plot a two parking lots.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The airport is only 28 km.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact our office to arrange to visit this property.</p>', '', '1696_House-Villa_0.jpg', '1696_House-Villa_1.jpg', '1696_House-Villa_2.jpg', '1696_House-Villa_3.jpg', '1696_House-Villa_4.jpg', '1696_House-Villa_5.jpg', '1696_House-Villa_6.jpg', '1696_House-Villa_7.jpg', '1696_House-Villa_8.jpg'),
(1697, 'Vedrana', 'Najev', '', '0989527070', 'ivananajev@yahoo.com', 'Trogir', 'Marina', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '10', '1600', '760', 1, '1200000', '', 2, 2, 2, 1, 1, 2, 0, 0, 'May 19, 2016', '<p>Nedaleko od centra mjesta nalazi se mala turistièka oaza. Za sve koji se ¾ele baviti turistièkom djelatnosti ovaj kompleks je idealna prilika. Kompleks se sastoji od kuæe povr&scaron;ine 240 m2, konobe povr&scaron;ine 60 m2, poslovnog prostora povr&scaron;ine 100 m2 i tri bungalova - svaki povr&scaron;ine 120 m2. Cijeli ovaj kompleks nalazi se na parceli povr&scaron;ine 1600 m2, koja je ureðena mediteranskim biljem i borovima koji èini ovaj kompleks skriven od znati¾eljnih prolaznika. Ureðena pla¾a udaljena je svega 10 m.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>We have this fabulous opportunity to enjoy a substantial tourism business with this complex in the centre of this attractive mainland village.&nbsp;The complex consists of a house of 240 m2, cellar of 60 m2, and with office space of 100 m2 and three chalets, each measuring 120 m2. This whole complex is located on a plot of 1600 m2, which is landscaped with established Mediterranean plants and pine trees which makes this complex hidden away from from curious passers-by.</p>', '', '<p>Nedaleko od centra mjesta nalazi se mala turistièka oaza.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za sve koji se ¾ele baviti turistièkom djelatnosti ovaj kompleks je idealna prilika.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kompleks se sastoji od kuæe povr&scaron;ine 240 m2, konobe povr&scaron;ine 60 m2, poslovnog prostora povr&scaron;ine 100 m2 i tri bungalova svaki povr&scaron;ine 120 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Cijeli ovaj kompleks nalazi se na parceli povr&scaron;ine 1600 m2, koja je ureðena mediteranskim biljem i borovima koji èini ovaj kompleks skriven od znati¾eljnih prolaznika.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ureðena pla¾a udaljena je svega 10 m.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa i apartmani u bungalovima imaju panoramski pogled na more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa se sastoji od 3 spavaæe sobe, kuhinje dnevnog boravka i kupaonice u prizmelju.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na katu su dva apartmana koji se sastoje od dvije spavaæe sobe, kuhinje, dnevnog boravka i kupaonice.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa ima provedeno centralno grijanje na lo¾ ulje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Bungalovi su u naravi dvoeta¾ne kuæe koje se sastoje od prizemlja i kata, odnosno dva apartmana.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U prizemljuje je apartman koji se sastoji od spavaæe sobe, dnevnog boravka, kuhinje i kupaonice.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na katu je drugi apartman koji se sastoji od spavaæe sobe, kuhinje, dnevnog boravka i kupaonice.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Parking mjesta je moguæe osigurati u sklopu parcele.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Prisutna sva potrebna infrastruktura.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Aerodrom je udaljen 20 km.</p>', '<p>We have this fabulous opportunity to enjoy a substantial tourism business with this complex in the centre of this attractive mainland village.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The complex consists of a house of 240 m2, cellar of 60 m2, and with office space of 100 m2 and three chalets, each measuring 120 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>This whole complex is located on a plot of 1600 m2, which is landscaped with established Mediterranean plants and pine trees which makes this complex hidden away from from curious passers-by.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The beach, with clear water and safe pebble shores, is only 10 m with direct access from the property.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house, apartments and chalets offer panoramic views of the sea.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The main house consists of three bedrooms, kitchen, living room and bathroom on the ground floor.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The first floor has two apartments which consist of two bedrooms, kitchen, living room and bathroom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house has central heating on fuel oil.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The chalets consist of two separate suites in each building.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The ground floor is an apartment consisting of a bedroom, living room, kitchen and bathroom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the first floor is the second apartment consisting of a bedroom, kitchen, living room and bathroom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Parking places are within part the plot.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Present all the necessary infrastructure - water, drains etc.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The airport is 20 km away.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact our office to arrange to visit this property.</p>', '', '1697_House-Villa_0.jpg', '1697_House-Villa_1.jpg', '1697_House-Villa_2.jpg', '1697_House-Villa_3.jpg', '1697_House-Villa_4.jpg', '1697_House-Villa_5.jpg', '1697_House-Villa_6.jpg', '1697_House-Villa_7.jpg', '1697_House-Villa_8.jpg'),
(1698, 'Marija', 'Pranèeviæ', '021/322-622', '095/199-5319', '', 'Split', 'Trogirska 6 Split, k.è. 10922/1   z.u. 11202, ZGR 2363', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '215', '0', '118', 1, '290000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 3, 1, 'May 19, 2016', '<p>Apartman u samom centru grada, na idealnoj lokaciji!!&nbsp;Udaljen je od mora samo 200 m, s pogledom na Palaèu.&nbsp;Apartman se nalazi na treæem katu stambene zgrade (u potkrovlju), te ima povr&scaron;inu cca 120 m2.&nbsp;Zahtijeva renovaciju, a ima veliki potencijal za ureðenje u obiteljski stan ili prostrani apartman u svrhu turistièkog iznjamljivanja.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>We are offering this spacious 3 x bedroom apartment in the centre of Split. It is situated 200m from the Riva, in the ''old town'' so within walking distance of all the restaurants, bars and historic and cultural monuments. The apartment has 120 m2 of floor area, and although is habitable, might be considered ready for renovation, or redecorating.</p>', '', '<p><strong>Apartman u samom centru grada, na idealnoj lokaciji!!</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Udaljen je od mora samo 200 m, s pogledom na Palaèu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartman se nalazi na treæem katu stambene zgrade (u potkrovlju), te ima povr&scaron;inu cca 120 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Zahtijeva renovaciju, a ima veliki potencijal za ureðenje u obiteljski stan ili prostrani apartman u svrhu turistièkog iznjamljivanja.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartman se sastoji od 3 spavaæe sobe, kuhinje s blagovaonicom, dnevnog boravka, kupaonice, spreme te posebnog prostranog dijela potkrovlja koje bi se moglo preurediti u dodatnu spavaæu sobu, a trenutno slu¾i kao spremi&scaron;te.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Unatoè svojoj lokaciji stanari ove zgrade li&scaron;eni su gradske buke, dok su svi potrebni sadr¾aji u neposrednoj blizini.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Stanari dijele lijepo ureðen vrt idealan za u¾ivanje u hladovini tijekom ljetnih mjeseci.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za dodatne informacije molimo kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured u Splitu.</p>', '<p>We are offering this spacious 3 x bedroom apartment in the centre of Split.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is situated 200 m from the Riva, in the ''old town'' so within walking distance of all the restaurants, bars and historic and cultural monuments.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The main park on Marjan hill, the ferry terminal and Marina are all within easy reach so it is in an ideal location to have a strong income by renting to tourists while not enjoying the property for private use.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property is on the third floor of a well constructed building and enjoys iconic views of the towns cathedral and roof tops in the Roman palace.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The apartment has 120 m2 of floor area, and although is habitable, might be considered ready for renovation, or redecorating.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The apartment has three bedrooms, kitchen, dining room, living room, bathroom, storage and a separate large part of the attic that could be converted into an extra bedroom, and currently used as storage.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Despite its central location, tenants of the building enjoy peace and quiet, as the surrounding streets are ''pedestrian only''.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Tenants share a beautiful garden ideal for enjoying the shade during the summer months.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For further information, please contact our office in Split.</p>', '', '1698_Apartment_0.jpg', '1698_Apartment_1.jpg', '1698_Apartment_2.jpg', '1698_Apartment_3.jpg', '1698_Apartment_4.jpg', '1698_Apartment_5.jpg', '1698_Apartment_6.jpg', '1698_Apartment_7.jpg', '1698_Apartment_8.jpg'),
(1700, 'Steffi', 'Knapp', '', '', 'steffi.knapp@web.de', 'Rogoznica', 'Razanj, Ljoljinica  Razanj, Kc 8460/1  KO Sevid', 'For sale', 'Land plot', '5', '977', '0', 1, '624000', '', 2, 2, 2, 1, 1, 2, 0, 0, 'May 23, 2016', '<p>Jedinstvena lokacija, rijedak biser Jadrana, zemlji&scaron;te u prvom redu do mora. Direktan pristup kristalno bistrom moru i velièina parcele idealna je za sve koji ¾ele imati vilu s okuænicom koja im mo¾e pru¾iti privatnost i skrivenost od pogleda.&nbsp;Povr&scaron;ina zemlji&scaron;ta je 977 m2.&nbsp;Zemlji&scaron;te se nalazi u gradjevinskoj zoni i ima svu potrebnu infrastrukturu. Do parcele vodi cesta.</p>', '<p>A very rare and golden opportunity. We are offering a large ''first line'' land plot for single unit development.&nbsp;It is situated next to the sea, on the mainland, where there is crystalclear water, a safe shore side, and privacy from neighbours. The plot size is 977 m2. The land is located in a construction zone and it has all the necessary infrastructure (water/electric etc). &nbsp;</p>', '', '<p><strong>Jedinstvena lokacija, rijedak biser Jadrana, zemlji&scaron;te u prvom redu do mora</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Direktan pristup kristalno bistrom moru i velièina parcele idealna je za sve koji ¾ele imati vilu s okuænicom koja im mo¾e pru¾iti privatnost i skrivenost od pogleda.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Povr&scaron;ina zemlji&scaron;ta je 977 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Zemlji&scaron;te se nalazi u gradjevinskoj zoni i ima svu potrebnu infrastrukturu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Do parcele vodi cesta.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Udaljenost centra &nbsp;mjesta (gdje se nalaze svi potrebni sadr¾aji: duæani, restorani, kafiæi) je svega par kilometara.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Aerodrom je udaljen 28 km.</p>', '<p><strong>A very rare and golden opportunity</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>We are offering a large ''first line'' land plot for single unit development.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is situated next to the sea, on the mainland, where there is crystalclear water, a safe shore side, and privacy from neighbours.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The plot size is 977 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The land is located in a construction zone and it has all the necessary infrastructure (water/electric etc).&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Distance from the village centre (where there are all the necessary facilities: shops, restaurants, bars) is only a few kilometres, and a shoreside path allows a safe walking.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The airport is 28 km.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact our Split office for more information about building costs etc. and to arrange a visit to the property.</p>', '', '1700_Land-plot_0.jpg', '1700_Land-plot_1.jpg', '1700_Land-plot_2.jpg', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(1701, 'Mi¹e Vinka', 'Marina Stipèiæ', '', '098584155', 'marina.stipcic@gmail.com', 'Trogir', 'Mastrinka Mastrinka, 759/203   put 759/89', 'For sale', 'Land plot', '90', '578', '0', 1, '115600', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 0, 0, 'May 23, 2016', '<p>Graðevinsko zemlji&scaron;te na otoku Èiovu sa prekrasnim pogledom na more. Udaljenost od mora i &scaron;ljunèane pla¾e je cca. 90 metara.&nbsp;Otok Èiovo je povezan mostom sa gradom Trogirom, a u izgradnji je jo&scaron; jedan most.&nbsp;Zemlji&scaron;te je povr&scaron;ine 578 m2 i pravokutnog oblika. Ima direktni pristupni put, a sva potrebna infrastruktura se nalazi u blizini.&nbsp;Odmah do je veliko zemlji&scaron;te u negraðevinskoj zoni i pogled na more ne mo¾e biti zaklonjen.</p>', '<p>We have this sensibly priced building land on the island Ciovo that is blessed with long sea views.&nbsp;The distance to the nearest beach is approx. 90 meters down a direct track and the beach at this point is pebble and the water clear and safe. The building land area is 578 m2 and has a rectangular shape.&nbsp;It has a direct access road and all necessary infrastructure is nearby.&nbsp;Right up to this plot is another big land which is not buildable area so the sea view from the selling plot can not be obstructed.</p>', '', '<p><strong>Graðevinsko zemlji&scaron;te na otoku Èiovu sa prekrasnim pogledom na more</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Udaljenost od mora i &scaron;ljunèane pla¾e je cca. 90 metara.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Otok Èiovo je povezan mostom sa gradom Trogirom, a u izgradnji je jo&scaron; jedan most.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Jako je popularno odredi&scaron;te zbog prekrasnih pla¾a, kristalno èistog mora i blizine meðunarodnog aerodroma.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Zemlji&scaron;te je povr&scaron;ine 578 m2 i pravokutnog oblika.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ima direktni pristupni put, a sva potrebna infrastruktura se nalazi u blizini.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Odmah do je veliko zemlji&scaron;te u negraðevinskoj zoni i pogled na more ne mo¾e biti zaklonjen.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Prednost zemlj&scaron;ta je i blizina gradova Trogira i Splita koji su meðu najpopularnijim svjetskim destinacijama.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kontaktirajte nas za sve dodatne informacija i moguænosti gradnje.</p>', '<p>We have this sensibly priced building land on the island Ciovo that is blessed with long sea views.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The distance to the nearest beach is approx. 90 meters down a direct track and the beach at this point is pebble and the water clear and safe.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ciovo is connected by a bridge to the city of Trogir and the construction of a second bridge is well under way to ease traffic problems on/off Croatia''s most popular holiday island.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is a popular destination because of the beautiful beaches, crystal clear waters and proximity to the international airport.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The building Land area is 578 m2 and has a rectangular shape.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It has a direct access road and all necessary infrastructure is nearby.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Right up to this plot is another big land which is not buildable area so the sea view from the selling plot can not be obstructed.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The advantage of land is near the towns of Trogir and Split both World Heritage Sites and off of immense to tourists, which are among the most popular destinations in the country.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Contact us for more information and the possibility of building.</p>', '', '1701_Land-plot_0.jpg', '1701_Land-plot_1.jpg', '1701_Land-plot_2.jpg', '1701_Land-plot_3.jpg', '1701_Land-plot_4.jpg', '1701_Land-plot_5.jpg', '1701_Land-plot_6.jpg', '1701_Land-plot_7.jpg', '1701_Land-plot_8.jpg'),
(1702, 'Aleksandar', 'Paulin', '', '00385 95 700 44 33', 'ivana.paulin2@gmail.com', 'Zadar', 'Rivnica 4  Zadar, Poluotok, 10541', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '200', '0', '47', 1, '125000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 1, 'May 30, 2016', '<p>Ovaj jedinstveni stan nalazi se u samom srcu starog dijela Zadra, na Poluotoku. Autobusni i ¾eljeznièki kolodvor su 1,5 km udaljeni od apartmana, a trajektno pristani&scaron;te 100 m. Zadarski aerodrom je udaljen 14 km. Stan je elegantno i &scaron;ik namje&scaron;ten, s ugradbenim ormarima, klima ureðajem, konvektorom.&nbsp;Ima stambenu povr&scaron;inu 47,46 m2, a sastoji se od kuhinje, blagavaonice, dnevnog boravka, jedne spavaæe sobe, kupaonice, lijepe loðe uz kori&scaron;tenje terase ispred stana za ro&scaron;tiljanje i ugodan boravak tokom cijelog dana.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>We are offering this well situated apartment in the heart of the old part of Zadar, on the Peninsula. It has a family living area of 47.46 m2 and consists of kitchen, dining room, living room, bedroom, bathroom, beautiful wide balcony with the use of the terrace in front of the apartment for bbq/grilling and a pleasant patio for enjoying the sun during the day.&nbsp;The apartment is modern and practical in its layout and has been decorated and maintained to a good standard.</p>', '', '<p>Ovaj jedinstveni stan nalazi se u samom srcu starog dijela Zadra, na Poluotoku.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Svi sadr¾aji su vrlo blizu &ndash; svega nekoliko koraka od glavne ulice Kalelarge i glavnog gradskog trga, crkve Sv. Lovre, katedrale, Foruma, jedinstvenih Morskih orgulja i pozdrava Sunca.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Pla¾a Kolovare je udaljena 1 km (10 minuta hoda), dok su ostale pla¾e u bli¾oj okolici &ndash; Borik, Diklo, Petrèane ili Suko&scaron;an.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Autobusni i ¾eljeznièki kolodvor su 1,5 km udaljeni od apartmana, a trajektno pristani&scaron;te 100 m.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Zadarski aerodrom je udaljen 14 km.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Stan je elegantno i &scaron;ik namje&scaron;ten, s ugradbenim ormarima, klima ureðajem, konvektorom.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ima stambenu povr&scaron;inu 47,46 m2, a sastoji se od kuhinje, blagovaonice, dnevnog boravka, jedne spavaæe sobe, kupaonice, lijepe loðe uz kori&scaron;tenje terase ispred stana za ro&scaron;tiljanje i ugodan boravak tokom cijelog dana.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ispred zgrade je park &scaron;to lokaciju èini mirnom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U cijenu ulazi veæi dio namje&scaron;taja, spremi&scaron;te sa zajednièkim dijelovima i ureðajima.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Idealan za stanovanje ali i za najam.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za dodatne informacije molimo kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured u Splitu.</p>', '<p>We are offering this well situated apartment in the heart of the old part of Zadar, on the Peninsula.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is close to all the facilities and attractions of the historic centre of this popular tourist town - just a few steps from the main street Kalelarga and the city''s main square, the church of St. Lawrence, the cathedral, the Forum, and the unique Sea Organ and Sun Salutation.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kolovare Beach is 1 km away (10 minutes), while other beaches in the immediate area - Borik, Diklo, Petrcane or Sukosan.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The bus and train station are 10 minutes'' walk from the apartments, and the ferry port 100 m.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Zadar airport is 14 km.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The apartment is modern and practical in its layout and has been decorated and maintained to a good standard.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It has many built in wardrobes and other features designed for comfort and air conditioning, and a convector heating system.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It has a family living area of 47.46 m2 and consists of kitchen, dining room, living room, bedroom, bathroom, beautiful wide balcony with the use of the terrace in front of the apartment for bbq/grilling and a pleasant patio for enjoying the sun during the day.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The building is situated in front of the park which ensures peace and quiet.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The price includes most of the furniture store with common parts and fittings.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>This property is modestly priced and ideal for immediate living or for rent.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For further information, please contact our office in Split.&nbsp;</p>', '', '1702_Apartment_0.JPG', '1702_Apartment_1.JPG', '1702_Apartment_2.JPG', '1702_Apartment_3.JPG', '1702_Apartment_4.JPG', '1702_Apartment_5.JPG', '1702_Apartment_6.JPG', '1702_Apartment_7.JPG', '1702_Apartment_8.JPG');
INSERT INTO `nekretnina` (`id`, `ime`, `prezime`, `telefon`, `mobitel`, `e_mail`, `lokacija_id`, `adresa`, `status_id`, `vrsta_id`, `udaljenost`, `povrsina`, `stambenapovrsina`, `display`, `cijena`, `cijenatocka`, `ponuda_tjedna`, `new_built`, `must_sell`, `prvi_red_do_mora`, `pogled_na_more`, `bazen`, `broj_soba`, `broj_kupatila`, `datum`, `title_hr`, `title_en`, `title_ge`, `opis_hr`, `opis_en`, `opis_ge`, `PropertyImageURL0`, `PropertyImageURL1`, `PropertyImageURL2`, `PropertyImageURL3`, `PropertyImageURL4`, `PropertyImageURL5`, `PropertyImageURL6`, `PropertyImageURL7`, `PropertyImageURL8`) VALUES
(1703, 'Dalmatian home', '', '', '', '', 'Rogoznica', 'Rogoznica Stiva¹nica', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '30', '420', '170', 1, '390000', '', 2, 1, 2, 2, 1, 1, 4, 5, 'May 30, 2016', '<p>Moderna vila u izgradnji s pogledom na otvoreno more, udaljena od prirodne kamenite pla¾e svega 30 m.&nbsp;Vila je ukupne povr&scaron;ine 270 m2, s tim &nbsp;da je stambeni dio 170 m2, a ukupna povr&scaron;ina svih terasa je 100 m2.&nbsp;Povr&scaron;ina zemlji&scaron;ta je 420 m2.&nbsp;Vila se sastoji od prizemlja i dva kata.&nbsp;Poèetak gradnje vile je 2016. god., a zavr&scaron;etak svih radova oèekuje se krajem 2017. god.&nbsp;U cijenu vile ukljuèeno je kompletno unutarnje uredjenje (bez namje&scaron;taja), ureðenje okuænice i klimatizacija.</p>', '<p>We have this selection of modern villas in a fabulous main land location. These villas are under construction and are designed to be light, airy, spacious, practical, low maintenance and comfortable. They all have open sea views, especially from the wide balconies and are only 30 m from the dramatic rocky shore. The villas have a total area of 270 m2, with the living area of 170 m2, and the total area of the terraces is 100 m2. The land area for each villa is 420 m2. Each villa consists of a ground floor and two floors above.</p>', '', '<p>Moderna vila u izgradnji s pogledom na otvoreno more, udaljena od prirodne kamenite pla¾e svega 30 m.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Vila je ukupne povr&scaron;ine 270 m2, s tim &nbsp;da je stambeni dio 170 m2, a ukupna povr&scaron;ina svih terasa je 100 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Povr&scaron;ina zemlji&scaron;ta je 420 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Vila se sastoji od prizemlja i dva kata.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U prizemlju se nalazi dnevni boravak s kuhinjom i blagovaonicom, kao i kupatilo i ostava.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na prvom katu se nalaze èetiri spavaæe sobe i tri kupaonice.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Drugi kat se sastoji od dnevnog boravka povezanog s kuhinjom i blagovaonicom i kupaonice.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U sklopu vrta nalazi se prostrana terasa s bazenom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Poèetak gradnje vile je 2016. godina, a zavr&scaron;etak svih radova oèekuje se krajem 2017. godine.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U cijenu vile ukljuèeno je kompletno unutarnje uredjenje (bez namje&scaron;taja), ureðenje okuænice i klimatizacija.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U fazi gradnje moguæe je odabrati sanitarije, keramiku i tip parketa po ¾elji kupca.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Udaljenost do centra mjesta, duæana, restorana, kafiæa je 15 mminuta hoda.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Do kuæe je osiguran pristup asfaltiranom cestom, a u sklopu parcele osigurana su dva parking mjesta.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Aerodrom je udaljen 28 km.</p>', '<p>We have this selection of modern villas in a fabulous main land location.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>These villas are under construction and are designed to be light, airy, spacious, practical, low maintenance and comfortable.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>They all have open sea views, especially from the wide balconies and are only 30 m from the dramatic rocky shore, but a short walk to safe swimming areas.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The villas have a total area of 270 m2, with the living area of 170 m2, and the total area of the terraces is 100 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The land area for each villa is 420 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Each villa consists of a ground floor and two floors above.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The ground floor has an open plan style family-living room with kitchen and dining room, as well as a bathroom and pantry.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the first floor there are four bedrooms and three bathrooms.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The second floor consists of a living room connected to the kitchen and bathrooms.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>In the garden there is a spacious sun terrace and patio with a swimming pool.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Start of construction of the villa is 2016. and the completion of all works is towards the end of 2017.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The price of the villa includes a complete interior decoration (no furniture), garden landscaping and integrated comforts such as air conditioning.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>During the construction phase it is possible to choose the bathroom fittings, ceramic style and flooring type if an early deposit is received.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The distance to the village centre with the old harbour, shops, restaurants, cafes is 15 minutes walk.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house is provided with access to a paved road, and as part of the plot a two parking lots.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The airport is 28 km.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>This type of modern property at such a realistic price on the mainland is rare on the Dalmatian coast, so contact our agents quickly to arrange a visit to the location.</p>', '', '1703_House-Villa_0.jpg', '1703_House-Villa_1.jpg', '1703_House-Villa_2.jpg', '1703_House-Villa_3.jpg', '1703_House-Villa_4.jpg', '1703_House-Villa_5.jpg', '1703_House-Villa_6.jpg', '', ''),
(1704, 'Antun ', '®anetiæ', 'Sini¹a ®anetiæ, 098 367 543', '', 'Sinisa.zanetic@lolaribar.hr', 'Korcula', 'Pri¾ba, k.c. 28362/63 ko Blato', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '5', '0', '51', 1, '127500', '', 2, 1, 2, 1, 1, 1, 1, 1, 'May 30, 2016', '<p>U ponudi imamo apartmane u prvom redu do mora sa ju¾ne strane Korèule. Zgrada je pred dovr&scaron;etkom gradnje.&nbsp;Radi se o ekskluzivnom objektu sa samo 4 stambene jedinice.&nbsp;Apartmani imaju svoja parkirna mjesta, skladi&scaron;ni prostor, i pravo kori&scaron;tenja praonice i vanjskog bazena.</p>', '<p>For sale we have this lovely seafront apartments from the south side of Korcula island. The building is near completion.&nbsp;This is an exclusive property with only 4 units.&nbsp;Every apartment has its own parking place, storage and the right to use the laundry and outdoor pool.&nbsp;</p>', '', '<p>U ponudi imamo apartmane u prvom redu do mora sa ju¾ne strane Korèule.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Zgrada je pred dovr&scaron;etkom gradnje.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Radi se o ekskluzivnom objektu sa samo 4 stambene jedinice.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U prizemlju se nalaze dva apartmana:&nbsp;S1 (2 spavaæe sobe, 1 kupaonica, bruto povr&scaron;ina 66 m2, neto 50 m2) za cijenu od 165.000 EUR i S2 (1 spavaæa soba, 1 kupaonica, bruto povr&scaron;ina 51 m2, neto 35 m2) za cijenu od 127.500 EUR.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na prvom katu nalazi se apartman S3 bruto povr&scaron;ine 162 m2, a neto 107 m2 (3 spavaæe sobe i 1 kupaonica) za cijenu od 405.000 EUR.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na drugom katu nalazi se apartman S4 bruto povr&scaron;ine 87 m2, a neto 68 m2 (2 spavaæe sobe i 1 kupaonica) za cijenu od 217.500 EUR.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartmani imaju svoja parkirna mjesta, skladi&scaron;ni prostor, i pravo kori&scaron;tenja praonice i vanjskog bazena.</p>', '<p>For sale we have this lovely seafront apartments from the south side of Korcula island.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The building is near completion.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>This is an exclusive property with only 4 units.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the ground floor there are 2 apartments:&nbsp;S1 (2 bedrooms, 1 bathroom, 66 m2 gross, 50 m2 net) for the price of 165.000 EUR and S2 (1 bedroom, 1 bathroom, 51 m2 gross, 35 m2 net) for the price of 127.500 EUR.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>First floor is occupied by one apartment S3 sized 162 m2 gross, 107 m2 net (3 bedrooms and 1 bathroom for the price of 405.000 EUR.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the second floor there is one apartments S4 sized 87 m2 gross, 68 m2 net (2 bedrooms, 1 bathroom for the price of 217.500 EUR.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Every apartment has its own parking place, storage and the right to use the laundry and outdoor pool.&nbsp;</p>', '', '1704_Apartment_0.jpg', '1704_Apartment_1.jpg', '1704_Apartment_2.jpg', '1704_Apartment_3.jpg', '1704_Apartment_4.jpg', '1704_Apartment_5.jpg', '', '', ''),
(1706, 'Branka ', 'Bostock', 'Michael Hardy +44 7747621455', '+385 917559475', 'michaelhardyhfh@tiscali.co.uk', 'Brac', 'Punta 14 br 1, Kc 199/260, 261, 211 ko Splitska', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '200', '96', '106', 1, '275000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 3, 2, 'June 3, 2016', '<p>Croatia Property Sales predstavlja ovu zanimljivu nekretninu u prodaji, smje&scaron;tenu na atraktivnoj lokaciji na otoku Braèu.&nbsp;Nekretnina se sastoji od 2 potpuno namje&scaron;tena apartmana te dvori&scaron;ta povr&scaron;ine 96 m2 sa gara¾om i vanjskim ro&scaron;tiljem.&nbsp;Obje se jedinice prodaju zajedno.&nbsp;Sa terase se pru¾a pogled na more.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>Croatia Property Sales presents this lovely property on Brac island, suitable both for private use and as a buy-to-let investment.&nbsp;It comprises of 2 fully furnished apartments and 96 sqm plot with garage, garden and BBQ.&nbsp;It features lovely sea views.&nbsp;Both units are sold together.&nbsp;</p>', '', '<p>Croatia Property Sales predstavlja ovu zanimljivu nekretninu u prodaji, smje&scaron;tenu na atraktivnoj lokaciji na otoku Braèu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nekretnina se sastoji od 2 potpuno namje&scaron;tena apartmana te dvori&scaron;ta povr&scaron;ine 96 m2 sa gara¾om i vanjskim ro&scaron;tiljem.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U prizemlju zgrade nalazi se jednosobni apartman povr&scaron;ine 37,20 m2 skupa sa terasom od 13 m2 i dvije ostave povr&scaron;ina 30 i 7,80 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U potkrovlju zgrade nalati se dvosobni apartman povr&scaron;ine 68,80 m2 sa terasom povr&scaron;ine 17 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sa terase se pru¾a pogled na more.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Obje se jedinice prodaju zajedno.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Molimo kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured u Splitu za vi&scaron;e informacija.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>Croatia Property Sales presents this lovely property on Brac island, suitable both for private use and as a buy-to-let investment.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It comprises of 2 fully furnished apartments and 96 sqm plot with garage, garden and BBQ.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the ground floor there is a 1-bedroom apartment sized 37,20 sqm internally along with 13 sqm terrace and two storages sized 30 sqm and 7,80 sqm.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>In the attick there is a 2-bedroom apartment sized 68,80 sqm internally, along with 17 sqm terrace.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It features lovely sea views.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Both units are sold together.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact our Split office for more information.</p>', '', '1706_Apartment_0.jpg', '1706_Apartment_1.JPG', '1706_Apartment_2.JPG', '1706_Apartment_3.JPG', '1706_Apartment_4.JPG', '1706_Apartment_5.JPG', '1706_Apartment_6.JPG', '1706_Apartment_7.JPG', ''),
(1707, 'Boris', 'Tomiæ', '', '095 525 0026', 'tomic_boris@hotmail.com', 'Brac', 'Supetar', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '300', '0', '53', 1, '86000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 2, 1, 'June 3, 2016', '<p>U ponudi imamo dvosoban apartman povr&scaron;ine 53,50 m2 na prvom katu vi&scaron;estambene zgrade. Stan ima balkon sa djelomiènim pogledom na more te parkirali&scaron;no mjesto. Klimatiziran je i namje&scaron;ten.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>We have this 2-bedroom apartment in offer, sized 53,50 sqm, located on the first floor of a residential building near the center of Supetar.&nbsp;Apartment has balcony with partial sea views and parking place. The property is fully furnished and air-conditioned.&nbsp;</p>', '', '<p>U ponudi imamo dvosoban apartman povr&scaron;ine 53,50 m2 na prvom katu vi&scaron;estambene zgrade.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Stan ima balkon sa djelomiènim pogledom na more te parkirali&scaron;no mjesto.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Klimatiziran je i namje&scaron;ten.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za sve dodatne informacije molimo kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured u Splitu.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>We have this 2-bedroom apartment in offer, sized 53,50 sqm, located on the first floor of a residential building near the center of Supetar.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartment has balcony with partial sea views and parking place.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property is fully furnished and air-conditioned.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For furher information, please contact our office in Split.&nbsp;</p>', '', '1707_Apartment_0.jpg', '1707_Apartment_1.jpg', '1707_Apartment_2.jpg', '1707_Apartment_3.jpg', '1707_Apartment_4.jpg', '1707_Apartment_5.jpg', '', '', ''),
(1708, 'Milena Vujiæ', 'Vuèiæ Dragi¹a', '+386 40 977 128', '', 'uros.peterc@gmail.com  milena.peterc@out', 'Korcula', 'Uvala Dobrin Dolac Vela Luka, Kc 2428/373 ko Vela Luka', 'For sale', 'Land plot', '260', '384', '0', 1, '60000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 0, 0, 'June 3, 2016', '<p>U prodaji nudimo graðevinsko zemlji&scaron;te smje&scaron;teno u maloj uvali 5 km od Vela Luke. Zemlji&scaron;te je prete¾no pravokutnog oblika, a nalazi se unutar izgraðenog dijela graðevinskog podruèja naselja i to osobito vrijednog kulturnog krajobraza. Urbanistièki plan ureðenja nije donesen.</p>', '<p>For sale we have this plot located in a small bay 5 km from Vela Luka town on Korcula island. The plot is within the building zone, under special regulation for being located in the area of culture and nature importance. Detail urbanistic plan has not been brought yet. &nbsp;</p>', '', '<p>U prodaji nudimo graðevinsko zemlji&scaron;te smje&scaron;teno u maloj uvali 5 km od Vela Luke.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Zemlji&scaron;te je prete¾no pravokutnog oblika, a nalazi se unutar izgraðenog dijela graðevinskog podruèja naselja i to osobito vrijednog kulturnog krajobraza.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Urbanistièki plan ureðenja nije donesen.</p>', '<p>For sale we have this plot located in a small bay 5 km from Vela Luka town on Korcula island.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The plot is within the building zone, under special regulation for being located in the area of culture and nature importance.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Detail urbanistic plan has not been brought yet. &nbsp;</p>', '', '1708_Land-plot_0.jpg', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(1709, 'Vladislav Bodri', 'Srboljub Obrenoviæ', 'Ivana Bodri +381 63 8428926', '', 'office@parfemania.com', 'Hvar', 'Sv. Nedjelja, 41/1 zgr, 1079/1, 1079/2 (ZU 1481); 41/2zgr, 1079/3 (ZU 1087); 1080 (ZU 1091) ko Svirè', 'For sale', 'Old stone house', '340', '220', '120', 1, '170000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 0, 0, 'June 3, 2016', '<p>Croatia Property Sales u prodaji nudi kamenu kuæu na dvije eta¾e u malom mjestu sa ju¾ne strane otoka Hvara.&nbsp;Kuæa ima oko 120 m2 korisne povr&scaron;ine, gustirnu od 12 m2 te dvori&scaron;te povr&scaron;ine 220 m2.&nbsp;Iz dvori&scaron;ta i kuæe pru¾a se lijepi pogled na more, koje je od nekretnine udaljeno oko 340 m zraène linije.&nbsp;Kuæa je ju¾no orijentirana, a potrebna joj je potpuna renovacija. Moguæe je izvrsti dvije neovisne stambene jedinice.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>Croatia Property Sales presents this charming stone house located in the center of a small village on the south side of Hvar island.&nbsp;The house has around 120 sqm of the net living area and 220 sqm of the garden.&nbsp;It features lovely sea views from all the floors. The property needs complete renovation. It would be possbile to make two separate living units.&nbsp;</p>', '', '<p>Croatia Property Sales u prodaji nudi kamenu kuæu na dvije eta¾e u malom mjestu sa ju¾ne strane otoka Hvara.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa ima oko 120 m2 korisne povr&scaron;ine, gustirnu od 12 m2 te dvori&scaron;te povr&scaron;ine 220 m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Iz dvori&scaron;ta i kuæe pru¾a se lijepi pogled na more, koje je od nekretnine udaljeno oko 340 m zraène linije.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je ju¾no orijentirana, a potrebna joj je potpuna renovacija.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Moguæe je izvrsti dvije neovisne stambene jedinice.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>Croatia Property Sales presents this charming stone house located in the center of a small village on the south side of Hvar island.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house has around 120 sqm of the net living area and 220 sqm of the garden.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It features lovely sea views from all the floors.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property needs complete renovation.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It would be possbile to make two separate living units.&nbsp;</p>', '', '1709_Old-stone-house_0.jpg', '1709_Old-stone-house_1.jpg', '1709_Old-stone-house_2.jpg', '1709_Old-stone-house_3.jpg', '1709_Old-stone-house_4.jpg', '1709_Old-stone-house_5.jpg', '1709_Old-stone-house_6.jpg', '', ''),
(1710, 'MC CARTHY CLAIR', '', '00353876450032', 'Dalmatian Property Management kljuè', 'clairetrag@yahoo.co.uk', 'Brac', 'Sutivan, Kc 1256/9 ko sutivan ZU3533 pu 4', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '140', '0', '51', 1, '75000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 2, 1, 'June 6, 2016', '<p>Na prodaju nudimo lijepi apartman sa 2 spavaæe sobe i 1 kupaonicom smje&scaron;ten na prvom katu niskogradnje u popularnom mjestu na otoku Braèu.&nbsp;Apartman ima povr&scaron;inu 51,43 m2 te balkon povr&scaron;ine 10,32 m2.&nbsp;U cijelosti je namje&scaron;ten i ima izvrstan pogled na more.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>PRICED TO SELL.&nbsp;For sale we have this lovely 2-bedroom 1-bathroom apartment on the first floor of a low-rise building in a very popular village on Brac island.&nbsp;The property is sized 51,43 sqm internally and it has 10,32 sqm balcony.&nbsp;Apartment is fully furnished and features great sea views.&nbsp;</p>', '', '<p>Na prodaju nudimo lijepi apartman sa 2 spavaæe sobe i 1 kupaonicom smje&scaron;ten na prvom katu niskogradnje u popularnom mjestu na otoku Braèu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartman ima povr&scaron;inu 51,43 m2 te balkon povr&scaron;ine 10,32 m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U cijelosti je namje&scaron;ten i ima izvrstan pogled na more.&nbsp;</p>', '<p><strong>PRICED TO SELL</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For sale we have this lovely 2-bedroom 1-bathroom apartment on the first floor of a low-rise building in a very popular village on Brac island.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property is sized 51,43 sqm internally and it has 10,32 sqm balcony.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartment is fully furnished and features great sea views.&nbsp;</p>', '', '1710_Apartment_0.jpg', '1710_Apartment_1.jpg', '1710_Apartment_2.jpg', '1710_Apartment_3.jpg', '1710_Apartment_4.jpg', '1710_Apartment_5.jpg', '1710_Apartment_6.jpg', '', ''),
(1711, 'Boris', 'Tomiæ', '', '095 525 0026', 'tomic_boris@hotmail.com', 'Brac', 'Supetar', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '400', '0', '55', 1, '95000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 2, 1, 'June 9, 2016', '<p>U ponudi imamo dvosoban apartman povr&scaron;ine 55 m2 na zadnjem katu stambene zgrade. Stan ima balkon povr&scaron;ine 9,50 m2 sa pogledom na more te spremi&scaron;te u podrumu povr&scaron;ine 6,50 m2. U cijelosti je namje&scaron;ten, a ima i parkirali&scaron;no mjesto.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>We have this 2-bedroom apartment in offer, sized 55 sqm, located on the top floor of a residential building near the center of Supetar.&nbsp;Apartment has 9,50 sqm balcony with sea views and 6,50 sqm storage in the basement. The property is fully furnished. It comes with the parking place.&nbsp;</p>', '', '<p>U ponudi imamo dvosoban apartman povr&scaron;ine 55 m2 na zadnjem katu stambene zgrade.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Stan ima balkon povr&scaron;ine 9,50 m2 sa pogledom na more te spremi&scaron;te u podrumu povr&scaron;ine 6,50 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U cijelosti je namje&scaron;ten, a ima i parkirali&scaron;no mjesto.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za sve dodatne informacije molimo kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured u Splitu.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>We have this 2-bedroom apartment in offer, sized 55 sqm, located on the top floor of a residential building near the center of Supetar.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartment has 9,50 sqm balcony with sea views and 6,50 sqm storage in the basement.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property is fully furnished.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It comes with the parking place.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For furher information, please contact our office in Split.&nbsp;</p>', '', '1711_Apartment_0.jpg', '1711_Apartment_1.jpg', '1711_Apartment_2.jpg', '1711_Apartment_3.jpg', '1711_Apartment_4.jpg', '1711_Apartment_5.jpg', '', '', ''),
(1712, 'Marin', 'Kuzmaniæ', '', '0915612984', '', 'Kastela', 'Ispod aerodroma Divulje &#8211; Ka¹tel ©tafiliæ', 'For sale', 'Land plot', '10', '1800', '0', 1, '360000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 0, 0, 'June 9, 2016', '<p>Zemlji&scaron;te u 2. redu od mora i pje&scaron;èane pla¾e. Ukupne je povr&scaron;ine 1800 m2, a postoji moguænost gradnje podruma, prizemlja i 2. kata ukupne visine 10 m.&nbsp;Koeficijent iskoristivosti je 0.8, a izgradivosti 30% tlocrtno.***POSTOJI MOGUÆNOST KUPNJE MANJEG ZEMLJI&Scaron;TA SA KOJIM BI IMALI DIREKTAN PRISTUP NA PLA®U.</p>', '<p>We have this land plot in the 2nd row from the sea with safe pebble beaches. The total area is 1800 m2, and there is the possibility of building a basement and second floor with total height of 10 m. The coefficient of efficiency is 0.8, while construction on 30% of the footprint. Adjacent to this plot is more land, also available for sale, which would allow direct private access to the beach.</p>', '', '<p>Zemlji&scaron;te u 2. redu od mora i pje&scaron;èane pla¾e.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nalazi se u malom mjestu u blizini Trogira, dok je Split udaljen cca. 20 min. vo¾nje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Meðunarodni aerodrom se takoðer nalazi u blizini.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ukupne je povr&scaron;ine 1800 m2, a postoji moguænost gradnje podruma, prizemlja i 2. kata ukupne visine 10 m.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Koeficijent iskoristivosti je 0.8, a izgradivosti 30% tlocrtno.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Prikljuèak za vodu se nalazi odmah na zemlji&scaron;tu, a elektrièna energija u blizini.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Zbog velièine zemlji&scaron;ta moguæa je izgradnja bazena i ureðene lijepo kultiviranog vrta.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>S obzirom da se zemlji&scaron;te nalazi u turistièkoj zoni, izgraðena kuæa mora biti u funkciji turistièkog iznajmljivanja.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>***POSTOJI MOGUÆNOST KUPNJE MANJEG ZEMLJI&Scaron;TA SA KOJIM BI IMALI DIREKTAN PRISTUP NA PLA®U.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ostajemo na usluzi za sva dodatna pitanja.</p>', '<p>We have this land plot in the 2nd row from the sea with safe pebble beaches.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is located in a small village near Trogir with Split approx. 20 min. driving.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The international airport is less than 15 driving.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The total area is 1800 m2, and there is the possibility of building a basement and second floor with total height of 10 m.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The coefficient of efficiency is 0.8, while construction on 30% of the footprint.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Water connection is located next to the land and electricity nearby, making the connections relatively easy.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Due to the size of the land there is space to have a swimming pool and landscape the garden to have a patio and other outdoor recreational space.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Since the land is located in the tourist zone, built houses must be in the function of tourism, not residential.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Adjacent to this plot is more land, also available for sale, which would allow direct private access to the beach.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>We are available for questions and to arrange a visit to this location.</p>', '', '1712_Land-plot_0.jpg', '1712_Land-plot_1.jpg', '1712_Land-plot_2.jpg', '1712_Land-plot_3.jpg', '1712_Land-plot_4.jpg', '1712_Land-plot_5.jpg', '1712_Land-plot_6.jpg', '1712_Land-plot_7.jpg', '1712_Land-plot_8.jpg'),
(1713, 'Josip', 'Krniæ', '', '098712920', '', 'Trogir', 'Rastiæa XI/14 Okrug Gornji, z.u. 2282', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '40', '447', '215', 1, '325000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 8, 6, 'June 9, 2016', '<p><span style="color: #ff0000;">IZVRSNA PRILIKA!!&nbsp;</span>Samostojeæa kuæa u 2. redu od mora i ureðene kamenite pla¾e. Nalazi se na otoku Èiovu koji je povezan mostom sa gradom Trogirom. U izgradnji je jo&scaron; jedan most koji æe cijelom otoku osigurati jo&scaron; veæu popularnost.&nbsp;Ukupna povr&scaron;ina zemlji&scaron;te je 447 m2, a stambena povr&scaron;ina 215 m2. Kuæa se sastoji od prizemlja, polueta¾e prizemlja, kata i polueta¾e kata. Zanimljivog je izgleda i sa terasa se pru¾a prekrasan pogled na more.</p>', '<p><span style="color: #ff0000;">GREAT OPPORTUNITY&nbsp;</span>to buy this house of 4 apartments on Ciovo.&nbsp;It is situated on the 2nd row from the sea where there is clear, safe water and a beautiful rocky shore. The total area of land is 447 m2, with a residential area of 215 m2. The house consists of a ground floor, split-level ground floor, first floor and mezzanine first floor, each with an apartment, making it a gold mine for an owner looking to enjoy an income through tourism.&nbsp;From the first floor terrace there is a beautiful view of the sea.&nbsp;</p>', '', '<p><span style="color: #ff0000;"><strong>IZVRSNA PRILIKA!!</strong></span></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Samostojeæa kuæa u 2. redu od mora i ureðene kamenite pla¾e.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nalazi se na otoku Èiovu koji je povezan mostom sa gradom Trogirom. U izgradnji je jo&scaron; jedan most koji æe cijelom otoku osigurati jo&scaron; veæu popularnost.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Do meðunarodnog aerodroma je 20 min. vo¾nje &scaron;to je jo&scaron; jedna prednost nekretnine.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ukupna povr&scaron;ina zemlji&scaron;te je 447 m2, a stambena povr&scaron;ina 215 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa se sastoji od prizemlja, polueta¾e prizemlja, kata i polueta¾e kata.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Zanimljivog je izgleda i sa terasa se pru¾a prekrasan pogled na more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U prizemlju se nalaze 2 ulazna prostora, hodnik, kuhinja, dnevni boravak, 2 kupaonice i 3 spavaæe sobe.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na polueta¾i prizemlja je hodnik, kuhinja, dnevni boravak, kupaonica, spavaæa soba i sprema.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na katu je smje&scaron;ten dnevni boravak, kuhinja, kupaonica, spavaæa soba i 2 terase.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na polueta¾i kata se nalazi ulazni prostor, 2 kupaonice, 3 spavaæe sobe i terasa.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Trenutno je podijeljena na 4 apartmana od kojih svaki ima posebni ulaz, terasu i ro&scaron;tilj.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sve eta¾e su potpuno namje&scaron;tene i klimatizirane.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa posjeduje parking mjesto za 4-5 automobila, spremnik za vodu koji slu¾i za vrt, satelitsku antenu i vanjski tu&scaron; sa toplom vodom grijanom suncem.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Vlasnik takoðer posjeduje i energetski certifikat ''''C'''' razreda.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Centar mjesta gdje se nalaze trgovine, restorani i ostali sadr¾aji je udaljen cca. 3 min. vo¾nje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ostajemo na usluzi za sva dodatna pitanja.</p>', '<p><span style="color: #ff0000;"><strong>GREAT OPPORTUNITY!!</strong></span></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Great opportunity&nbsp;to buy this house of 4 apartments on Ciovo.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is situated on the 2nd row from the sea where there is clear, safe water and a beautiful rocky shore.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The nearest larger town is only 5 minutes by car, Trogir, which is the historic and cultural centre of this part of the coast.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It has many great restaurants, bars and nightlife, as well as being a magnet for tourists.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Closer, and only a short walk from the house, are shops, coffee bars and other attractions for tourists.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The construction of another bridge from the mainland to the island of Ciovo near Trogir will increase the popularity of island property.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The international airport is only 20 minutes driving which is another benefit of the property on Croatia''s most popular tourist island.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The total area of land is 447 m2, with a residential area of 215 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house consists of a ground floor, split-level ground floor, first floor and mezzanine first floor, each with an apartment, making it a gold mine for an owner looking to enjoy an income through tourism.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>From the first floor terrace there is a beautiful view of the sea.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The ground floor has 2 entrances, hallway, kitchen, living room, two bathrooms and three bedrooms.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the split-level ground floor is a hall, kitchen, living room, bathroom, bedroom and stores.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the first floor is located a living room, kitchen, bathroom, bedroom and two terraces.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the split-level first floor there is an entrance hall, 2 bathrooms, 3 bedrooms and a terrace.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Currently divided into 4 apartments each with separate entrance, terrace and outdoor barbecue area.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>All the apartments are fully furnished and air-conditioned, and ready for immediate use to continue for rental purposes.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house has parking for 4-5 cars, water tank, which is used for the garden, a satellite dish and an outdoor shower with water heated by solar energy.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The owner also owns a document energy certificate '''' C '''' class.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Town centre with shops, restaurants and other facilities is approx. 3 min. driving.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact the office to arrange to visit this property.</p>', '', '1713_House-Villa_0.jpg', '1713_House-Villa_1.jpg', '1713_House-Villa_2.jpg', '1713_House-Villa_3.jpg', '1713_House-Villa_4.jpg', '1713_House-Villa_5.jpg', '1713_House-Villa_6.jpg', '1713_House-Villa_7.jpg', '1713_House-Villa_8.jpg'),
(1716, 'Boris', 'Tomiæ', '', '095 525 0026', 'tomic_boris@hotmail.com', 'Brac', 'Postira (formalno ko Dol)', 'For sale', 'Land plot', '400', '486', '0', 1, '58000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 0, 0, 'June 14, 2016', '<p>Prodajemo graðevinsko zemlji&scaron;te u Postirama na otoku Braèu. Parcela je pravilnog oblika u zoni mje&scaron;ovite, prete¾no stambene izgradnje. Ima pristup javnom putu, a sva infrastruktura je u neposrednoj blizini. Nema pogled na more. Od centra mjesta i mora udaljena je oko 400 m zraène linije.</p>', '<p>Croatia Property Sales presents building plot in Postira on Brac island. The plot is of regular shape in mixed-use (mostly residential) zone. All infrastructure nearby. No sea views. Only 400 meters to the sea and center of the village. &nbsp;&nbsp;</p>', '', '<p>Prodajemo graðevinsko zemlji&scaron;te u Postirama na otoku Braèu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Parcela je pravilnog oblika u zoni mje&scaron;ovite, prete¾no stambene izgradnje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ima pristup javnom putu, a sva infrastruktura je u neposrednoj blizini.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nema pogled na more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Od centra mjesta i mora udaljena je oko 400 m zraène linije.</p>', '<p>Croatia Property Sales presents building plot in Postira on Brac island.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The plot is of regular shape in mixed-use (mostly residential) zone.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>All infrastructure nearby.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>No sea views.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Only 400 meters to the sea and center of the village. &nbsp;&nbsp;</p>', '', '1716_Land-plot_0.jpg', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(1717, 'Boris', 'Tomiæ', '', '095 525 0026', 'tomic_boris@hotmail.com ', 'Brac', 'Postira', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '200', '0', '97', 1, '125000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 2, 2, 'June 14, 2016', '<p>U ponudi imamo lijepi apartman smje&scaron;ten na zadnjem katu manjeg objekta u mirnom dijelu malog mjesta na otoku Braèu.&nbsp;Apartman se sastoji od terase, loðe, dnevnog boravka, kuhinje, spavaæe sobe s kupaonicom, druge spavaæe sobe, kupaonice te ulaznog hodnika.&nbsp;Sa terase se pru¾a izvrstan otvoreni pogled na more, a do pla¾e i centra mjesta ima svega nekoliko minuta hoda.</p>\r\n<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;">Cijena sni¾ena sa 148.000 EUR</span></p>', '<p>For sale we have this lovely 2-bedroom 2-bathroom apartment located on the top floor of a small building on Brac island.&nbsp;It comprises of terrace, loggia, living room, kitchen, en-suite master bedroom, second bedroom, bathroom and hallway.&nbsp;The property features amazing sea views and is at walking distance to the beach and all amenities.</p>\r\n<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;">Price reduced from 148.000 EUR</span></p>', '', '<p><strong><span style="text-decoration: underline;">Cijena sni¾ena sa 148.000 EUR</span></strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U ponudi imamo lijepi apartman smje&scaron;ten na zadnjem katu manjeg objekta u mirnom dijelu malog mjesta na otoku Braèu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartman se sastoji od terase, loðe, dnevnog boravka, kuhinje, spavaæe sobe s kupaonicom, druge spavaæe sobe, kupaonice te ulaznog hodnika.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sa terase se pru¾a izvrstan otvoreni pogled na more, a do pla¾e i centra mjesta ima svega nekoliko minuta hoda.</p>', '<p><strong><span style="text-decoration: underline;">Price reduced from 148.000 EUR</span></strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For sale we have this lovely 2-bedroom 2-bathroom apartment located on the top floor of a small building on Brac island.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It comprises of terrace, loggia, living room, kitchen, en-suite master bedroom, second bedroom, bathroom and hallway.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property features amazing sea views and is at walking distance to the beach and all amenities.&nbsp;</p>', '', '1717_Apartment_0.jpg', '1717_Apartment_1.jpg', '1717_Apartment_2.jpg', '1717_Apartment_3.jpg', '1717_Apartment_4.jpg', '1717_Apartment_5.jpg', '1717_Apartment_6.jpg', '1717_Apartment_7.jpg', '1717_Apartment_8.jpg'),
(1718, 'Boris', 'Tomiæ', '', '095 525 0026', 'tomic_boris@hotmail.com', 'Brac', 'Mirca', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '700', '1800', '300', 1, '395000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 4, 4, 'June 14, 2016', '<p>U ponudi imamo kuæu u malom mjestu na otoku Braèu, koja se sastoji od 3 apartmana, sa ukupno 4 spavaæe sobe i 4 kupaonice. U prizemlju se nalaze gara¾a, konoba, soba, kupaonica, kuhinja sa kaminom, ostava i natkrivena terasa.&nbsp;Na katu se nalaze dvije spavaæe sobe, 2 kupaonice, 2 kuhinje i terasa.&nbsp;Posjed ima ureðeni vrt sa nasadima maslina, naranèi i drugih agruma. Sa parcele se pru¾a pogled na more.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>For sale we have this house located in a small village on Brac island, made of 3 apartments with 4 bedrooms and 4 bathrooms in total.&nbsp;On the ground floor there is the garage, bedroom, bathroom, kitchen with fire place, storage and covered terrace.&nbsp;First floor contains 2 bedrooms, 2 bathrooms, 2 kitchens and terrace.&nbsp;Large garden surrounds the property, planted with olive trees and oranges. There is a sea view from the plot.&nbsp;</p>', '', '<p>U ponudi imamo kuæu u malom mjestu na otoku Braèu, koja se sastoji od 3 apartmana, sa ukupno 4 spavaæe sobe i 4 kupaonice.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U prizemlju se nalaze gara¾a, konoba, soba, kupaonica, kuhinja sa kaminom, ostava i natkrivena terasa.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na katu se nalaze dvije spavaæe sobe, 2 kupaonice, 2 kuhinje i terasa.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Posjed ima ureðeni vrt sa nasadima maslina, naranèi i drugih agruma.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sa parcele se pru¾a pogled na more.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>For sale we have this house located in a small village on Brac island, made of 3 apartments with 4 bedrooms and 4 bathrooms in total.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the ground floor there is the garage, bedroom, bathroom, kitchen with fire place, storage and covered terrace.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>First floor contains 2 bedrooms, 2 bathrooms, 2 kitchens and terrace.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Large garden surrounds the property, planted with olive trees and oranges.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There is a sea view from the plot.&nbsp;</p>', '', '1718_House-Villa_0.jpg', '1718_House-Villa_1.jpg', '1718_House-Villa_2.jpg', '1718_House-Villa_3.jpg', '1718_House-Villa_4.jpg', '1718_House-Villa_5.jpg', '1718_House-Villa_6.jpg', '1718_House-Villa_7.jpg', '1718_House-Villa_8.jpg'),
(1721, 'Danielle ', 'Hruby', '', '+971 50 566 3116', 'daniellehruby@yahoo.com', 'Brac', ' Puntinak (Sumartin), Kc 1028/82 ko Selca', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '300', '0', '61', 1, '110000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 2, 1, 'June 21, 2016', '<p>Croatia Property Sales u prodaji nudi ovaj simpatièan apartman smje&scaron;ten u malom mjestu na otoku Braèu.&nbsp;Apartman se sastoji od predsoblja, kupaonice, dnevne sobe, kuhinje, 2 spavaæe sobe i terase, ukupne povr&scaron;ine 61,47 m2.&nbsp;U cijelosti je opremljen i namje&scaron;ten, spreman za useljenje. Iz apartmana se pru¾a pogled na more, a do mora i pla¾a ima oko 300 metara.&nbsp;Moguæe je dodatno kupiti i gara¾u.</p>', '<p>Croatia Property Sales is offering this lovely apartment for sale, located in a charming village on Brac island.&nbsp;It consists of a lobby, bathroom, living room, kitchen, 2 bedrooms and terrace, sized 61,47 sqm in total.&nbsp;The property is fully furnished and ready to move in. It features lovely sea views and there are only 300 meters to the sea and beaches.&nbsp;It is possible to buy garage at extra cost.&nbsp;</p>', '', '<p>Croatia Property Sales u prodaji nudi ovaj simpatièan apartman smje&scaron;ten u malom mjestu na otoku Braèu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartman se sastoji od predsoblja, kupaonice, dnevne sobe, kuhinje, 2 spavaæe sobe i terase, ukupne povr&scaron;ine 61,47 m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U cijelosti je opremljen i namje&scaron;ten, spreman za useljenje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Iz apartmana se pru¾a pogled na more, a do mora i pla¾a ima oko 300 metara.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Moguæe je dodatno kupiti i gara¾u.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Molimo kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured u Splitu za vi&scaron;e informacija.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>Croatia Property Sales is offering this lovely apartment for sale, located in a charming village on Brac island.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It consists of a lobby, bathroom, living room, kitchen, 2 bedrooms and terrace, sized 61,47 sqm in total.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property is fully furnished and ready to move in.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It features lovely sea views and there are only 300 meters to the sea and beaches.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is possible to buy garage at extra cost.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact our Split office for more information.&nbsp;</p>', '', '1721_Apartment_0.jpg', '1721_Apartment_1.jpg', '1721_Apartment_2.jpg', '1721_Apartment_3.jpg', '1721_Apartment_4.jpg', '1721_Apartment_5.jpg', '1721_Apartment_6.jpg', '1721_Apartment_7.jpg', ''),
(1722, 'Dalibor', 'Goviæ', '', '098 726 676', 'dado.govic@gmail.com', 'Rogoznica', 'Razanj, 9128/3 KO Sevid', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '100', '402', '229', 1, '495000', '', 2, 1, 2, 2, 1, 2, 6, 6, 'June 23, 2016', '<p>U &scaron;armantnom dalmatinskom ribarskom mjestu nalazi se kuca, trenutno u izgradnji s koje se pruza prekrasan panoramski pogled na more i uvalu. Kuæa je istoène orijentacije, a udaljena je od mora 100 m.&nbsp;Povr&scaron;ina kuæe iznosi 229 m2. Povr&scaron;ina parcele je 402 m2.&nbsp;Kuæa je podijeljena na tri eta¾e: prizemlje, I. i II. kat.&nbsp;Kompletan zavr&scaron;etak kuæe oèekuje se krajem 2017. godine.</p>', '<p>We have this modern house in the charming Dalmatian fishing village of Rogoznica. The property is currently under construction and is designed to make the best use of its elevated position on the shore with breathtakingly panoramic views of the sea and the bay. The living area is 229 m2 and the property sits on a plot area of 402 m2.&nbsp;The house is divided into three levels: ground floor, first floor and second. The full completion of the house is expected at the end of 2017 years.</p>', '', '<p>U &scaron;armantnom dalmatinskom ribarskom mjestu nalazi se kuca, trenutno u izgradnji s koje se pruza prekrasan panoramski pogled na more i uvalu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je istoène orijentacije, a udaljena je od mora 100 m.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Povr&scaron;ina kuæe iznosi 229 m2, a povr&scaron;ina parcele je 402 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je podijeljena na tri eta¾e: prizemlje, I. i II. kat.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U prizemlju se nalazi studio apartman koji ima izlaz na natkrivenu terasu povr&scaron;ine 17 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U prizemlju je i gara¾a od 29 m2 (u koju se mogu parkirati dva auta).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na prvom katu je trosoban apartman, s tim da jedna soba ima vlastitu kupaonicu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Prvi kat ima dvije loðe: jednu od 15 m2 i drugu od 11 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Drugi kat se sastoji od dva jednosobna apartmana.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Jedan apartman je povr&scaron;ine 42 m2 i ima loðu povr&scaron;ine 11 m2, a drugi apartman je povr&scaron;ine 47 m2 s loðom od 15 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kompletan zavr&scaron;etak kuæe oèekuje se krajem 2017 godine.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Aerodrom je udaljen 28 km.</p>', '<p>We have this modern house in the charming Dalmatian fishing village of Rogoznica.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property is currently under construction and is designed to make the best use of its elevated position on the shore with breathtakingly panoramic views of the sea and the bay.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house is oriented East and is 100 m away from the sea shore.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The living area is 229 m2 and the property sits on a plot area of 402 m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house is divided into three levels: ground floor, first floor and second.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The ground floor is a studio apartment with access to a generous and wide covered terrace of 17 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the ground floor is also a garage of 29 m2 (fits two cars).&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the first floor is a three bedroom apartment, from which one bedroom is en-suite (has its own bathroom).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The first floor has two balconies: one of 15 m2 and another of 11 m2.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The second floor consists of two one-bedroom apartments.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>One apartment is 42 m2 and has a balcony of 11 m2 and the other apartment has an area of 47 m2 with balcony of 15 m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The full completion of the house is expected at the end of 2017 years.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The airport is 28 km from here and the UNESCO town of Trogir even closer.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is well situated to enjoy interest from tourists or owners looking for a modern holiday villa in a great location.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact our office to arrange to visit the location of the site, and see all pictures of the designs and plans.</p>', '', '1722_House-Villa_0.jpg', '1722_House-Villa_1.jpg', '1722_House-Villa_2.jpg', '1722_House-Villa_3.jpg', '', '', '', '', ''),
(1723, 'Pavel ', 'Ehrlich', '00420608242001', 'Zvati vlasnike', 'erl@post.cz', 'Trogir', 'Osoje vii/11  Okrug Donji, 1924/128', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '70', '340', '172', 1, '320000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 4, 3, 'June 23, 2016', '<p>Kuæa udaljena svega 70 m od prirodno kamenite pla¾e, smje&scaron;tena u &scaron;umi u mirnom dijelu mjesta na otoku Èiovu.&nbsp;10&ndash;ak minuta vo¾nje je potrebno do Trogira i 15 min. do meðunarodnog aerodroma.&nbsp;Smje&scaron;tena je na zemlj&scaron;tu povr&scaron;ine 340 m2, a stambena povr&scaron;ina je 172 m2. Prostire se preko prizemlja, 1. i 2. kata.&nbsp;S obzirom da ima 3 odvojena apartmana idealna je za turistièko iznajmljivanje jednako kao i za odmor vi&scaron;e obitelji.</p>', '<p>We are offering this house which is only 70 meters from the natural rocky beaches, located in the natural woods in a quiet place on the popular island of Ciovo.&nbsp;It is a 10-minute drive need to Trogir and 15 min. to the international airport.&nbsp;The property is situated on a land plot of 340 m2, with an internal floor area of 172 m2.&nbsp;It covers the ground, 1st and 2nd floor. Given that there are 3 separate apartments, it is an ideal property for tourist rentals as well as larger families.&nbsp;</p>', '', '<p>Kuæa udaljena svega 70 m od prirodno kamenite pla¾e, smje&scaron;tena u &scaron;umi u mirnom dijelu mjesta na otoku Èiovu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>10&ndash;ak minuta vo¾nje je potrebno do Trogira i 15 min. do meðunarodnog aerodroma.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Smje&scaron;tena je na zemlj&scaron;tu povr&scaron;ine 340 m2, a stambena povr&scaron;ina je 172 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Prostire se preko prizemlja, 1. i 2. kata.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U prizemlju se nalazi studio apartman.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na. 1.katu se nalazi dnevni dio sa kuhinjom i blagovaonicom, 2 spavaæe sobe, kupaonica i velika terasa s pogledom na more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na 2.katu je dnevni dio sa kuhinjom, blagovaonicom, 1 spavaæom sobom, kupaonicom i balkonom s prekrasnim pogledom na more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U sklopu kuæe se jo&scaron; nalazi ljetna prostorija sa kaminom i spremi&scaron;tem.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Potpuno je renovirana prije cca. 7 godina i potpuno je namje&scaron;tena.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Iz kuæe se pru¾a prekrasan pogled na more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na pla¾i se nalazi manji drveni mul na koji je moguæe privezati manji brod.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>S obzirom da ima 3 odvojena apartmana idealna je za turistièko iznajmljivanje jednako kao i za odmor vi&scaron;e obitelji.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Slu¾beno parking mjesto se nalazi u blizini na vrhu ulice.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ostajemo na usluzi za sva dodatna pitanja i fotografije.</p>', '<p>We are offering this house which is only 70 meters from the natural rocky beaches, located in the natural woods in a quiet place on the popular island of Ciovo.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is a 10-minute drive need to Trogir and 15 min. to the international airport.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property is situated on a land plot of 340 m2, with an internal floor area of 172 m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It covers the ground, 1st and 2nd floor.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The ground floor is a studio&nbsp;&nbsp;apartment.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the 1st floor is a living area with kitchen and dining room, 2 bedrooms, bathroom and large terrace overlooking the sea.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the 2nd floor is the living area with kitchen, dining room, 1 bedroom, bathroom and balcony with sea view.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Outside the house is an open area with a bbq/fireplace to enjoy family meals on the patio.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It was completely renovated 7 years ago and has been well looked after since then.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house has beautiful views of the sea.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the beach there is a small wooden pier on which it is possible to moor a small boat.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Given that there are 3 separate apartments, it is an ideal property for tourist rentals as well as larger families.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There is an adjacent designated parking in the street.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact us to arrange to visit the property.</p>', '', '1723_House-Villa_0.jpg', '1723_House-Villa_1.jpg', '1723_House-Villa_2.jpg', '1723_House-Villa_3.jpg', '1723_House-Villa_4.jpg', '1723_House-Villa_5.jpg', '1723_House-Villa_6.jpg', '1723_House-Villa_7.jpg', '1723_House-Villa_8.jpg');
INSERT INTO `nekretnina` (`id`, `ime`, `prezime`, `telefon`, `mobitel`, `e_mail`, `lokacija_id`, `adresa`, `status_id`, `vrsta_id`, `udaljenost`, `povrsina`, `stambenapovrsina`, `display`, `cijena`, `cijenatocka`, `ponuda_tjedna`, `new_built`, `must_sell`, `prvi_red_do_mora`, `pogled_na_more`, `bazen`, `broj_soba`, `broj_kupatila`, `datum`, `title_hr`, `title_en`, `title_ge`, `opis_hr`, `opis_en`, `opis_ge`, `PropertyImageURL0`, `PropertyImageURL1`, `PropertyImageURL2`, `PropertyImageURL3`, `PropertyImageURL4`, `PropertyImageURL5`, `PropertyImageURL6`, `PropertyImageURL7`, `PropertyImageURL8`) VALUES
(1724, 'Radek', 'Ehrlich', '00420608242001', 'Zvati vlasnike', 'erl@post.cz', 'Trogir', 'Osoje II/5 Okrug Donji, 2113/70', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '75', '376', '115', 1, '220000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 2, 2, 'June 23, 2016', '<p>Kuæa smje&scaron;tena u 4. redu od mora i kamenite pla¾e sa moguæno&scaron;æu veza za manji brod.&nbsp;Nalazi se na otoku Èiovu, a do povijesnog grada Trogira je potrebno cca. 10 minuta vo¾nje. Meðunarodni aerodrom je 15 minuta vo¾nje.&nbsp;Zemlji&scaron;te je povr&scaron;ine 376 m2, a stambena povr&scaron;ina 115 m2 + manji podrum. U kvadraturu su ukljuèene 2 prostrane terase.&nbsp;Parking mjesto se nalazi odmah do kuæe, &scaron;to je velika prednost s obzirom da nekoliko kuæa na istom podruèju nemaju vlastiti parking odmah uz kuæu.</p>', '<p>This house is located in the 4th row from the sea and the rocky beach where it is clean and safe for swimming. You can also moor a small boat.&nbsp;It is located on the island of Ciovo, 10 minutes drive from the historic town of Trogir. The international airport is 15 minutes away. The land area with the property is 376 m2, with a residential area of 115 m2 + a small cellar. In the m2 are included 2 spacious terraces - plenty large enough for comfortable ''alfresco'' dining.</p>', '', '<p>Kuæa smje&scaron;tena u 4. redu od mora i kamenite pla¾e sa moguæno&scaron;æu veza za manji brod.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nalazi se na otoku Èiovu, a do povijesnog grada Trogira je potrebno cca. 10 minuta vo¾nje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Meðunarodni aerodrom je 15 minuta vo¾nje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U blizini se nalaze trgovina i kafiæ, dok su svi ostali sadr¾aji udaljeni 5 minuta vo¾nje.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Zemlji&scaron;te je povr&scaron;ine 376 m2, a stambena povr&scaron;ina 115 m2 + manji podrum.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U kvadraturu su ukljuèene 2 prostrane terase.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U prizemlju se nalazi dnevni dio sa kuhinjom i blagovaonicom, kupaonica i terasa.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na 1.katu su 2 spavaæe sobe, kupaonica i terasa sa lijepim pogledom na more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Eta¾e su spojene unutarnjim stepenicama, ali imaju i 2 vanjska ulaza, stoga je moguæe odvojiti ih u 2 apartmana.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je renovirana prije 8 godina i prodaje se potpuno namje&scaron;tena.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Parking mjesto se nalazi odmah do kuæe, &scaron;to je velika prednost s obzirom da nekoliko kuæa na istom podruèju nemaju vlastiti parking odmah uz kuæu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Dodatne fotografije i informacije &scaron;aljemo na zahtjev.</p>', '<p>This house is located in the 4th row from the sea and the rocky beach where it is clean and safe for swimming.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>You can also moor a small boat.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is located on the island of Ciovo, 10 minutes drive from the historic town of Trogir.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The international airport is 15 minutes away.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Close to the property are shops, cafes and other facilities, especially useful for tourists who don''t want to go far for basic foods or a drink.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The land area with the property is 376 m2, with a residential area of 115 m2 + a small cellar.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>In the m2 are included 2 spacious terraces - plenty large enough for comfortable ''alfresco'' dining.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The ground floor living area has a kitchen, bathroom and terrace.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the 1st floor there are 2 bedrooms, bathroom and terrace with a beautiful views of the sea.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The floors are connected with internal stairs, but there are 2 outdoor entrances on each floor, so it is possible to separate into 2 apartments.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house was renovated 8 years ago and it has been well looked after.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is being sold fully furnished.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There is parking located adjacent to the house, which is always a great advantage, especially for tourists.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact our office for more information and to arrange to visit this property.&nbsp;</p>', '', '1724_House-Villa_0.jpg', '1724_House-Villa_1.jpg', '1724_House-Villa_2.jpg', '1724_House-Villa_3.jpg', '1724_House-Villa_4.jpg', '1724_House-Villa_5.jpg', '1724_House-Villa_6.jpg', '1724_House-Villa_7.jpg', '1724_House-Villa_8.jpg'),
(1725, 'Zrinka', 'Æurkoviæ', '', '', '', 'Trogir', 'Drvenik Veli', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '3', '70', '80', 1, '199000', '', 2, 2, 2, 1, 1, 2, 3, 2, 'June 24, 2016', '<p>Prekrasna &scaron;armantna kuæa za sve koji ¾ele do¾ivjeti istinski Mediteran nalazi se na mirnom i idiliènom otoku Drveniku, na svega par metara od kristalno èistog mora.&nbsp;Kuæa je povr&scaron;ine 80 m2, a nalazi se na parceli povr&scaron;ine 70 m2.&nbsp;Kuæa se sastoji od prizemlja i dva kata.&nbsp;Na otoku se nalazi par restorana, kafiæ i trgovina.&nbsp;Otok je s kopnom dobro povezan trajektnim linijama iz Trogira, Splita i Segeta Donjeg.</p>', '<p>We are offering this beautiful and charming seafront house, just perfect for anyone looking to experience the true historic Mediterranean, unchanged for decades. It is located in a quiet and idyllic island close to Trogir, only few meters from the crystal clear waters near the harbour of this ancient village. The house is 80 m2 living area and is located on a plot of 70 m2.&nbsp;The house consists of a ground floor and two floors. The island is well connected to the mainland by ferry from Trogir and Split.&nbsp;</p>', '', '<p>Prekrasna &scaron;armantna kuæa za sve koji ¾ele do¾ivjeti istinski Mediteran nalazi se na mirnom i idiliènom otoku Drveniku, na svega par metara od kristalno èistog mora.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je povr&scaron;ine 80 m2, a nalazi se na parceli povr&scaron;ine 70 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa se sastoji od prizemlja i dva kata.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U prizemlju se nalazi studio apartman.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na I. katu se nalaze kuhinja, blagovaonica, kupaonica i dnevni boravak s izlazom na prostranu natkrivenu terasu povr&scaron;ine 20 m2 koja u ljetnim danima slu¾i kao dnevni boravak okru¾en ¾ardinjerama ispunjenim mediteranskim uktrasnim biljem.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na II. katu se nalaze dvije spavaæe sobe.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa ima struju i ugraðen desalinizator za vodu s obzirom da tekuæe vode nema veæ se u sklopu kuæe nalazi cisterna za vodu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na otoku se nalazi par restorana, kafiæ i trgovina.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Otok je s kopnom dobro povezan trajektnim linijama iz Trogira, Splita i Segeta Donjeg.</p>', '<p><strong>Rare property on a small island of Trogir</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>We are offering this beautiful and charming seafront house, just perfect for anyone looking to experience the true historic Mediterranean, unchanged for decades.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is located in a quiet and idyllic island close to Trogir, only few meters from the crystal clear waters near the harbour of this ancient village.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house is 80 m2 living area and is located on a plot of 70 m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house consists of a ground floor and two floors.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The ground floor is a studio apartment.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the first floor there is a kitchen, dining room, bathroom and living room with access to a large terrace of 20 m2, which in the summer serves as a living room surrounded by flower pots filled with Mediterranean plants.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the second floor there are two bedrooms.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house has public electricity and water desalination system installed since connection to the public water system is not yet present on the island. &nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house has an own water tank with a system throughout the house, which enables normal usage.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The island has a couple of restaurants, coffees and shop.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The island is well connected to the mainland by ferry from Trogir and Split.&nbsp;</p>', '', '1725_House-Villa_0.jpg', '1725_House-Villa_1.jpg', '1725_House-Villa_2.jpg', '1725_House-Villa_3.jpg', '1725_House-Villa_4.jpg', '1725_House-Villa_5.jpg', '1725_House-Villa_6.jpg', '1725_House-Villa_7.jpg', '1725_House-Villa_8.jpg'),
(1726, 'Danci', 'Grgicevic', '', '0918815830', '', 'Hvar', 'Stari  Grad  Malo Selo', 'For sale', 'Old stone house', '200', '0', '70', 1, '80000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 3, 1, 'June 24, 2016', '<p>Stara kamena kuæa na tri kata u starome dijelu grada, samo nekoliko minuta &scaron;etnje od mora i centra mjesta.&nbsp;Kuæa zahtijeva kompletnu renovaciju.&nbsp;Sastoji se od prizemlja, prvog kata i potkrovlja ukupne stambene povr&scaron;ine 70 m2.&nbsp;U prizemlju se nalazi konoba.&nbsp;Kuæa je prikljuèena na vodu i struju. &nbsp;</p>', '<p>We are offering this old stone house, needing complete internal renovation, in the old part of the village.&nbsp;It is situated on Hvar Island in Stari Grad, with cafes, bars and restaurants all within a few minutes walk, and of course the port, with regular ferries to the mainland, is conveniently close.&nbsp;The house requires complete renovation.&nbsp;The building appears sound and is on three floors. The ground floor, first floor and second floor have a total surface area of 70 m2.&nbsp;</p>', '', '<p>Stara kamena kuæa na tri kata u starome dijelu grada, samo nekoliko minuta &scaron;etnje od mora i centra mjesta.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa zahtijeva kompletnu renovaciju.Sastoji se od prizemlja, prvog kata i potkrovlja ukupne stambene povr&scaron;ine 70 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U prizemlju se nalazi konoba.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Vanjske stepenice vode na prvi kat gdje se nalaze hodnik, jedna soba, dnevni boravak, kuhinja, blagovaonica, kupaonica, sprema i mali balkon.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Unutarnje drvene stepenice vode u potkrovlje gdje su jo&scaron; dvije sobe.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je prikljuèena na vodu i struju. &nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za sve informacije molimo kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>We are offering this old stone house, needing complete internal renovation, in the old part of the village.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is situated on Hvar Island in Stari Grad, with cafes, bars and restaurants all within a few minutes walk, and of course the port, with regular ferries to the mainland, is conveniently close.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house requires complete renovation.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The building appears sound and is on three floors.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The ground floor, first floor and second floor have a total surface area of 70 m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the ground floor there is a cellar, currently used for private storage.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Outside stairs lead to the first floor where the hall, one bedroom, living room, kitchen, dining room, bathroom, storage room and a small balcony.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Internal wooden staircase leads to the attic where there are two bedrooms.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house is connected to water and electricity.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For further information and to arrange to visit the property, please contact our office.</p>', '', '1726_Old-stone-house_0.jpg', '1726_Old-stone-house_1.jpg', '1726_Old-stone-house_2.jpg', '1726_Old-stone-house_3.jpg', '1726_Old-stone-house_4.jpg', '1726_Old-stone-house_5.jpg', '1726_Old-stone-house_6.jpg', '1726_Old-stone-house_7.jpg', '1726_Old-stone-house_8.jpg'),
(1728, 'Dobroslav', 'Bojaniæ', '091 361 33 96', '', 'Dobrinko50@gmail.com', 'Hvar', 'Vrboska, 357 kuca, 1355 zem  ', 'For sale', 'Old stone house', '250', '300', '118', 1, '250000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 0, 0, 'June 27, 2016', '<p>Stara kamena kuæa smje&scaron;tena na mirnoj lokaciji, okru¾ena zelenilom i prirodom.&nbsp;Kuæa je udaljena od mora ca 250 m, a od centra mjesta samo nekoliko minuta &scaron;etnje.&nbsp;Zahtijeva kompletnu renovaciju.&nbsp;Sastoji se od prizemlja, prvog kata i potkrovlja ukupne stambene povr&scaron;ine 118 m2, na parceli od 300 m2.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>This is an old stone house, full of character and entirely in keeping with its charming village setting, needing a caring new owner needing a complete renovation. The property consists of a ground floor, first floor and attic with a total residential area of 118 m2, on a spacious plot of 300 m2.&nbsp;</p>', '', '<p>Stara kamena kuæa smje&scaron;tena na mirnoj lokaciji, okru¾ena zelenilom i prirodom.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je udaljena od mora ca 250 m, a od centra mjesta samo nekoliko minuta &scaron;etnje.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Zahtijeva kompletnu renovaciju.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sastoji se od prizemlja, prvog kata i potkrovlja ukupne stambene povr&scaron;ine 118 m2, na parceli od 300 m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U prizemlju se nalazi velika konoba koja ima izlaz na stra¾nji dio kuæe, sa prednje stane ima prekrasan vrt, dosta velik za izgradnju bazena.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je ju¾no orijentirana.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Struja i voda u kuæi (septièka jama).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za sve informacije molimo kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured u Splitu.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>This is an old stone house, full of character and entirely in keeping with its charming village setting, needing a caring new owner needing a complete renovation.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is situated two minutes walk from the shore - 250m - and is situated in the sort of quiet location, surrounded by greenery and nature, that makes you want to stay there for ever.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is a short walk to the village centre where there are cafes, coffee shops and bars where locals meet with tourists.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property consists of a ground floor, first floor and attic with a total residential area of 118 m2, on a spacious plot of 300 m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The ground floor has a large cellar, which has access to the rear of the house, and, at the front is a nice garden, big enough for a pool.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house is south oriented.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Electricity and water in the home with a septic tank for drainage.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For further information, and to arrange to visit this property, please contact our office in Split.</p>', '', '1728_Old-stone-house_0.jpg', '1728_Old-stone-house_1.jpg', '1728_Old-stone-house_2.jpg', '1728_Old-stone-house_3.jpg', '1728_Old-stone-house_4.jpg', '1728_Old-stone-house_5.jpg', '1728_Old-stone-house_6.jpg', '', ''),
(1729, 'Jan Dirk sinke', '', '', '', 'dirkjansinke@gmail.com', 'Brac', 'Dujma Hrankoviæa 11  Supetar, Kc 956/13 ko Supetar  ', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '550', '320', '130', 1, '200000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 3, 2, 'July 1, 2016', '<p>Croatia Property Sales predstavlja izvrsno odrzavanu samostojecu kucu, udaljenu nekoliko minuta hoda od centra Supetra na otoku Bracu.&nbsp;Nekretnina je vrlo dobro odrzavana i u useljivom stanju.&nbsp;Kuca im 3 klima jedinice te centralni elektricni sustav grijanja vode. Odlicna prilika za kupnju.</p>', '<p>Croatia Property Sales presents this lovely detached house for sale, located at walking distance to the center of Supetar town on Brac island.&nbsp;The property is well maintained and in &bdquo;ready to move&ldquo; condition.&nbsp;The property has 3 air-con units and central water heating system. A very good buying oportunity to enjoy island retreat.&nbsp;</p>', '', '<p>Croatia Property Sales predstavlja izvrsno odrzavanu samostojecu kucu, udaljenu nekoliko minuta hoda od centra Supetra na otoku Bracu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nekretnina je vrlo dobro odrzavana i u useljivom stanju.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U prizemlju se nalazi spavaæa soba, kupaonica, wc, ostava, kuhinja sa dnevnim boravkom i trijem.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ova etaza moze posluziti kao gostinjski apartman.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na prvom katu smjestene su 2 spavace sobe, kupaonica, wc, dnevni boravak, kuhinja te velika teresa sa zimskim vrtom.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuca im 3 klima jedinice te centralni elektricni sustav grijanja vode.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Odlicna prilika za kupnju.</p>', '<p>Croatia Property Sales presents this lovely detached house for sale, located at walking distance to the center of Supetar town on Brac island.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property is well maintained and in &bdquo;ready to move&ldquo; condition.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the ground floor there is a bedroom, batroom, toilet, storage, living and kitchen area and patio.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>This floor is suitable as a guest room/apartment.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the first floor there are 2 bedrooms, a bathroom, toilet, living room, kitchen, large terrace and winter garden.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The property has 3 air-con units and central water heating system.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>A very good buying oportunity to enjoy island retreat.&nbsp;</p>', '', '1729_House-Villa_0.jpg', '1729_House-Villa_1.jpg', '1729_House-Villa_2.jpg', '1729_House-Villa_3.jpg', '1729_House-Villa_4.jpg', '1729_House-Villa_5.jpg', '1729_House-Villa_6.jpg', '1729_House-Villa_7.jpg', '1729_House-Villa_8.jpg'),
(1730, 'Du¹ka', 'Stra¹ek ', '', '0917275050', 'dali@adriaticestates.com', 'Peljesac', 'Tomislavovac (Pelje¹ac)', 'For sale', 'Old stone house', '2000', '0', '0', 1, '800000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 0, 0, 'July 1, 2016', '<p>Na prodaju nudimo set starih kamenih kuæa koncentriranih u centru malog sela sa ju¾ne strane Pelje&scaron;ca.&nbsp;Ovih 20-tak kuæa dolaze sa graðevinskim zemlji&scaron;tem i potrebna im je temeljita renovacija. Sva infrastruktura nalazi se u neposrednoj blizini.&nbsp;Nekoliko kuæa u selu veæ je obnovljeno, kako je i prikazano na slikama.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>For sale we have a set of (around 20) old stone houses from the south side of Peljesac peninsula, in a small inland village.&nbsp;The houses come along with building land and are in a need of complete renovation. All infrastructure is on site.&nbsp;Several houses in the village have already been restored, as shown in the pictures.&nbsp;</p>', '', '<p>Na prodaju nudimo set starih kamenih kuæa koncentriranih u centru malog sela sa ju¾ne strane Pelje&scaron;ca.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ovih 20-tak kuæa dolaze sa graðevinskim zemlji&scaron;tem i potrebna im je temeljita renovacija.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sva infrastruktura nalazi se u neposrednoj blizini.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nekoliko kuæa u selu veæ je obnovljeno, kako je i prikazano na slikama.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>For sale we have a set of (around 20) old stone houses from the south side of Peljesac peninsula, in a small inland village.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The houses come along with building land and are in a need of complete renovation.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>All infrastructure is on site.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Several houses in the village have already been restored, as shown in the pictures.&nbsp;</p>', '', '1730_Old-stone-house_0.jpg', '1730_Old-stone-house_1.jpg', '1730_Old-stone-house_2.jpg', '1730_Old-stone-house_3.jpg', '1730_Old-stone-house_4.jpg', '1730_Old-stone-house_5.JPG', '1730_Old-stone-house_6.jpg', '1730_Old-stone-house_7.jpg', ''),
(1731, 'Goran', '®uvela', '', '0915288274', 'goran.zuvela@vard.com', 'Korcula', 'Vela Luka 20270 UL. 42 br.29  Vela Luka, k.è. 4538', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '500', '225', '117', 1, '160000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 3, 1, 'July 6, 2016', '<p>Na prodaju nudimo dva stana na prvom katu kuæe na zapadnoj strani otoka Korèule.&nbsp;Kuæa je udaljena od mora 500 m, a nalazi se na parceli povr&scaron;ine 225 m2.&nbsp;Stanovi su renovirani 2008. godine (postavljene su nove instalacije), 2014. su izvedeni radovi na studio apartmanu, dok je 2015. postavljena vanjska fasada. Centar mjesta gdje se nalaze svi potrebni sadr¾aji udaljen je 500 m.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>We are offering these two apartments on the first floor on the west side of the island of Korcula. They are set back at the back of the village, adjacent to the natural woods and olive groves that have been farmed on the island for many centuries. The distance from the sea is 500 m, which is a 10 minute walk even for the youngest and oldest visitors!&nbsp;In 2015 the exterior of the building was renovated again.</p>', '', '<p>Na prodaju nudimo dva stana na prvom katu kuæe na zapadnoj strani otoka Korèule.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je udaljena od mora 500 m, a nalazi se na parceli povr&scaron;ine 225 m2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Stanovi su renovirani 2008. godine (postavljene su nove instalacije), 2014. su izvedeni radovi na studio apartmanu, dok je 2015. postavljena vanjska fasada.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Stan od 93 m2 je renoviran i sastoji se od 3 spavaæe sobe, kupaonice, kuhinje, blagovaonice i dnevnog boravka, dok studio apartman povr&scaron;ine 24 m2 na istom katu nije ureðen.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Stanovi imaju izlaz na balkone (30 m2 te manji od 4 m2).&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Vlasniku pripadaju vrt i parking za 3 automobila.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Centar mjesta gdje se nalaze svi potrebni sadr¾aji udaljen je 500 m.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za dodatne informacije molimo kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured u Splitu.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>We are offering these two apartments on the first floor on the west side of the island of Korcula.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>They are set back at the back of the village, adjacent to the natural woods and olive groves that have been farmed on the island for many centuries. &nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The distance from the sea is 500 m, which is a 10 minute walk even for the youngest and oldest visitors!</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The apartments were completely renovated in 2008, with new electric, water and drainage installations, redecorated, and they have been well maintained since then.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>In 2015 the exterior of the building was renovated again.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The first apartment is a spacious 93 m2 and consists of 3 bedrooms, bathroom, kitchen, dining room and living room.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>A second apartment of 24 m2 is on the same floor and is due to be redecorated.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartments have balconies (30 m2 and less than 4 m2).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There is a garden and parking for 3 cars.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The village centre, where there are shops, cafes and restaurants are near the old harbour which is 10 minutes walk - or two minutes on a bike.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The ferry journey to Split is 3 hours, the catamaran 2 hours, and it is 16 minutes by seaplane from Split.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact our agency to arrange to visit this property.</p>', '', '1731_Apartment_0.jpg', '1731_Apartment_1.jpg', '1731_Apartment_2.jpg', '1731_Apartment_3.jpg', '1731_Apartment_4.jpg', '1731_Apartment_5.jpg', '1731_Apartment_6.jpg', '1731_Apartment_7.jpg', '1731_Apartment_8.jpg'),
(1732, 'Goran', '®uvela', '', '0915288274', 'goran.zuvela@vard.com', 'Korcula', 'Vela Luka / uvala Gradina, K.È. 2430/196', 'For sale', 'Land plot', '500', '1602', '0', 1, '130000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 0, 0, 'July 6, 2016', '<p>Prodaje se zemlji&scaron;te povr&scaron;ine 1600 m2 na zapadnoj strani otoka Korèule, u uvali Gradina, s prekrasnim pogledom na more.&nbsp;Prikljuèak za struju je na zemlji&scaron;tu, dok je vodovod u izgradnji.&nbsp;Zemlji&scaron;te ima pristup sa asfaltnog puta.&nbsp;Postoji moguænost prodaje samo jednog dijela zemlji&scaron;ta (800 m2) po cijeni od 80 EUR po m2.&nbsp;Udaljeno je od mora 500 m.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>Our agency is offering this building plot of 1600 m2 on the west side of the island of Korcula, in one of the nicest bays. The electricity connection is already on the land, while the water supply system is still being built.&nbsp;The land has access from the asphalt road. There is a possibility of splitting the plot and selling only one part of land (800 m2)-to build a smaller property. The distance to the sea is 500 m.</p>', '', '<p>Prodaje se zemlji&scaron;te povr&scaron;ine 1600 m2 na zapadnoj strani otoka Korèule, u uvali Gradina, s prekrasnim pogledom na more.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Prikljuèak za struju je na zemlji&scaron;tu, dok je vodovod u izgradnji.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Zemlji&scaron;te ima pristup sa asfaltnog puta. &nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Postoji moguænost prodaje samo jednog dijela zemlji&scaron;ta (800 m2) po cijeni od 80 EUR po m2 .&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Udaljeno je od mora 500 m.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kompletni idejni nacrt je ukljucen u cijenu zemlji&scaron;ta.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Za dodatne informacije molimo kontaktirajte na&scaron; ured u Splitu.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>Our agency is offering this building plot of 1600 m2 on the west side of the island of Korcula, in one of the nicest bays.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The electricity connection is already on the land, while the water supply system is still being built.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The land has access from the asphalt road.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There is a possibility of splitting the plot and selling only one part of land (800 m2) - to build a smaller property - at a price of 80 EUR per m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The distance to the sea is 500 m.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Notional project is included in the price of land.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For further information, please contact our office in Split, and speak to one of our agents.</p>', '', '1732_Land-plot_0.jpg', '1732_Land-plot_1.jpg', '1732_Land-plot_2.jpg', '1732_Land-plot_3.jpg', '', '', '', '', ''),
(1733, 'Miro', 'Ba¹iæ', '', '098321482', 'm.basic2@yahoo.com', 'Trogir', 'Ribarski put &#8211; Mavar¹tica Okrug Gornji', 'For sale', 'Apartment', '300', '0', '79', 1, '130000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 1, 2, 3, 'July 6, 2016', '<p>3- sobni apartmana u jednoj od naljep&scaron;ih uvala na sve popularnijem otoku Èiovu koji je povezan mostom sa gradom Trogirom.&nbsp;Apartman je smje&scaron;ten na 2.katu iz kojeg se pru¾a prekrasan pogled na more i uvalu.&nbsp;Ukupna povr&scaron;ina je 79 m2, a sastoji se od predsoblja, 2 spavaæe sobe, 2 kupaonice, wc-a, loggie i dnevnog dijela sa kuhinjom i blagovaonicom.</p>', '<p>We are offering this 3- bedroom apartment in one of the most beautiful bays on the island of Ciovo. This increasingly popular island is connected by a bridge with the old town of Trogir, and the mainland near the airport. The apartment is located on the 2nd floor with beautiful views of the sea and the bay. The total area is 79 m2.</p>', '', '<p>*** NA ZAHTJEV &Scaron;ALJEMO VI&Scaron;E FOTOGRAFIJA</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>3- sobni apartmana u jednoj od naljep&scaron;ih uvala na sve popularnijem otoku Èiovu koji je povezan mostom sa gradom Trogirom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apartman je smje&scaron;ten na 2.katu iz kojeg se pru¾a prekrasan pogled na more i uvalu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ukupna povr&scaron;ina je 79 m2, a sastoji se od predsoblja, 2 spavaæe sobe, 2 kupaonice, wc-a, loggie i dnevnog dijela sa kuhinjom i blagovaonicom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Klimatiziran je i kompletno namje&scaron;ten.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Trenutno je u funkciji turistièkog iznajmljivanja, stoga je ovo idealna prilika za ulaganje s obzirom da se mo¾ete odmah nastaviti sa uhodanim poslom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ishoðena licenca za iznajmljivanje ima 4 zvjezdice, &scaron;to je jo&scaron; jedna velika pogodnost apartmana.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Zajednièka parking mjesta se nalaze ispred zgrade, dok postoji moguænost kupnje parking mjesta u gara¾i u suterenu zgrade.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Cijena je 5.000 &euro;.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Do centra mjesta je potrebno cca. 10 minuta pje&scaron;ke, a do grada Trogira 10 minuta vo¾nje.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U blizini je i meðunarodni aerodrom &scaron;to ovaj otok èini jo&scaron; boljom destinacijom za kupnju nekretnine.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U izgradnji je jo&scaron; jedna most koji povezuje otok i Trogir, a koji æe znatno utjecati na bolju povezanost tijekom turistièke sezone.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ostajemo na usluzi za sva dodatna pitanja.</p>', '<p>We are offering this 3- bedroom apartment in one of the most beautiful bays on the island of Ciovo.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>This increasingly popular island is connected by a bridge with the old town of Trogir, and the mainland near the airport.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The apartment is located on the 2nd floor with beautiful views of the sea and the bay.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The total area is 79 m2 and it consists of a hallway, 2 bedrooms, 2 bathrooms, a toilet, a balcony leading from the large living room with kitchen and dining room.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is air conditioned and fully furnished.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Currently this property is being used for renting to tourists, so anyone wanting to continue this established business can immediately proceed with confidence.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The apartment has a 4 stars letting licence, which is another great benefit of apartments.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There are common parking spaces located outside the building, and there is the possibility of purchasing a private parking space in the garage in the basement.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Price is &euro; 5,000.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Village centre is around. 10 minutes walking, where there are shops, pharmacies, bakery and other useful amenities and the town of Trogir is a 10 minute drive.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nearby is the international airport which makes this island more and more inviting for international clients to come for holidays.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The construction of a second bridge which will connect the island of Ciovo to the mainland, will make things easier.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>We are happy to arrange visits to the property.</p>', '', '1733_Apartment_0.jpg', '1733_Apartment_1.jpg', '1733_Apartment_2.jpg', '1733_Apartment_3.jpg', '1733_Apartment_4.jpg', '1733_Apartment_5.jpg', '1733_Apartment_6.jpg', '1733_Apartment_7.jpg', '1733_Apartment_8.jpg'),
(1734, 'Ivan ', 'Zorièiæ', '', '', 'mate.zoricic7@gmail.com', 'Rogoznica', 'Nova IX RG', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '200', '170', '79', 1, '118000', '', 2, 1, 2, 2, 1, 2, 2, 2, 'July 6, 2016', '<p>Mala, novoizgraðena, &scaron;armantna kuæa s moguæno&scaron;æu nadogradnje jo&scaron; jednog kata nalazi se na 200 m udaljenosti od mora i 10 minuta hoda do centra Rogoznice.&nbsp;Kuæa je stambene povr&scaron;ine 79 m2, a nalazi se na parceli povr&scaron;ine 200 m2.&nbsp;Kuæa se sastoji od prizemlja i kata.&nbsp;U prizemlju je studio apartman s izlazom na terasu i ureðenu okuænicu. Na katu se nalazi dvosobni apartman s terasom s koje se pru¾a djelomièan pogled na more.</p>', '<p>We have this newly built, small and charming house, located 200 meters from the sea and 10 minutes'' walk from the town centre. The house has a residential area of 79 m2 and is located on a plot of 200 m2. This property consists of two floors. The ground floor is a studio apartment with direct access onto a terrace and garden area. On the first floor is a separate two bedroom apartment with a balcony that offers long views, including a partial view of the sea.</p>', '', '<p>Mala, novoizgraðena, &scaron;armantna kuæa s moguæno&scaron;æu nadogradnje jo&scaron; jednog kata nalazi se na 200 m udaljenosti od mora i 10 minuta hoda do centra Rogoznice.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je stambene povr&scaron;ine 79 m2, a nalazi se na parceli povr&scaron;ine 200 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa se sastoji od prizemlja i kata.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U prizemlju je studio apartman s izlazom na terasu i ureðenu okuænicu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na katu se nalazi dvosobni apartman s terasom s koje se pru¾a djelomièan pogled na more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je u potpunosti namje&scaron;tena.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Do kuæe je pristup asfaltiranom cestom i osigurana su dva parking mjesta.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa ima svu potrebnu infrastrukturu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Aerodrom je udaljen 28 km.</p>', '<p>We have this newly built, small and charming house, located 200 meters from the sea and 10 minutes'' walk from the town centre.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house has a residential area of 79 m2 and is located on a plot of 200 m2.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>This property consists of two floors.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The ground floor is a studio apartment with direct access onto a terrace and garden area.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On the first floor is a separate two bedroom apartment with a balcony that offers long views, including a partial view of the sea.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house is being sold fully furnished.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>This property has direct access from the paved road.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There are two private parking spaces.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house has all the necessary infrastructure (water/electric etc.).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The airport is 28 km.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact our agency to arrange to visit this property.</p>', '', '1734_House-Villa_0.jpg', '1734_House-Villa_1.jpg', '1734_House-Villa_2.jpg', '1734_House-Villa_3.jpg', '1734_House-Villa_4.jpg', '1734_House-Villa_5.jpg', '1734_House-Villa_6.jpg', '1734_House-Villa_7.jpg', '1734_House-Villa_8.jpg'),
(1735, 'Kemal ', 'Ale¹iæ', '016783805175', '0921697338', 'kemomila6@gmail.com', 'Rogoznica', 'Lozica V RG', 'For sale', 'House-Villa', '100', '480', '350', 1, '395000', '', 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 6, 4, 'July 6, 2016', '<p>U jednoj od najljep&scaron;ih uvala Rogoznice nalazi se kuæa povr&scaron;ine 350 m2, na parceli povr&scaron;ine 480 m2, a na svega 100 m udaljenosti od lijepo ureðene prirodne pla¾e.&nbsp;Kuæa je ju¾ne orijentacije.&nbsp;Kuæa se sastoji od prizemlja i kata. U prizemlju se nalazi spavaæa soba, kuhinja, dnevni boravak i kupaonica. Velika terasa u prizemlju idealna je za odmor u hladu. Na katu se nalaze dva dvosobna apartmana, svaki sa prostranom terasom s kojih se pru¾a panoramski pogled na more.</p>', '<p>We are offering this great property in one of the most beautiful bays of Rogoznica. The house is 380 m2 and it sits on a plot of 480 m2, and is only 100m away from the beautiful natural beaches in the bay. The house is facing south. There are cafes, restaurants, shops, markets and other facilities just with a 20-minute walk from the house along the sea shore. The house consists of two floors.</p>', '', '<p>U jednoj od najljep&scaron;ih uvala Rogoznice nalazi se kuæa povr&scaron;ine 350 m2, na parceli povr&scaron;ine 480 m2, a na svega 100 m udaljenosti od lijepo ureðene prirodne pla¾e.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa je ju¾ne orijentacije.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kafiæi, restorani, duæani, pijaca i drugi potrebni sadr¾aji nalaze se na 20 minuta hoda od kuæe.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa se sastoji od prizemlja i kata.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>U prizemlju se nalazi spavaæa soba, kuhinja, dnevni boravak i kupaonica.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Velika terasa u prizemlju idealna je za odmor u hladu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Na katu se nalaze dva dvosobna apartmana, svaki sa prostranom terasom s kojih se pru¾a panoramski pogled na more.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa ima dva parking mjesta u sklopu parcele, a u prizemlju je i gara¾a koja trenutno slu¾i kao jednosobni apartman.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Okuænica je lijepo ureðena i odr¾avana.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Kuæa ima svu potrebnu infrastrukturu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Aerodrom je udaljen 28 km.</p>', '<p>We are offering this great property in one of the most beautiful bays of Rogoznica.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house is 380 m2 and it sits on a plot of 480 m2, and is only 100m away from the beautiful natural beaches in the bay.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house is facing south.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There are cafes, restaurants, shops, markets and other facilities just with a 20-minute walk from the house along the sea shore.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house consists of two floors.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The ground floor has a bedroom, kitchen, living room and bathroom.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>There is a large terrace on the ground floor which is ideal for relaxing in the shade or in the sun.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Upstairs are two x one bedroom suites, each with a spacious balcony which offers a wide view of the sea.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house has two private parking spaces within the plot, and the ground floor was a garage that now serves as a one-bedroom apartment.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The courtyard outside is beautifully decorated and maintained.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The house has all the necessary infrastructure.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The airport is 28 km.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please contact our agency to arrange to visit this property.</p>', '', '1735_House-Villa_0.jpg', '1735_House-Villa_1.jpg', '1735_House-Villa_2.jpg', '1735_House-Villa_3.jpg', '1735_House-Villa_4.jpg', '1735_House-Villa_5.jpg', '1735_House-Villa_6.jpg', '1735_House-Villa_7.jpg', '1735_House-Villa_8.jpg');
